अगुरुसारः|अगुरुसार
अगुरु + -सारः a sort of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0013-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगुल्मकम्
अगुल्मकम् Disjointed (army); गुल्मीभूतमगुल्मकम् Śukra. 4. 870.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0013-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगूढ
अगूढ <i>a.</i> Not hidden, or concealed, manifest, clear:<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अगूढगन्ध, अगूढभाव<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0013-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगूढसद्भावम्
अगूढ + ˚सद्भावम् Real state unconcealed, अगूढसद्भावमितीङ्गितज्ञया निवेदितो नैष्ठिकसुन्दरस्तया Ku. 5. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0013-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगूढगन्ध|अगूढगन्धं|अगूढगन्धः
अगूढ + -गन्ध <i>a.</i> having an unconcealed smell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0013-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगूढगन्धः|अगूढगन्ध|अगूढगन्धं
अगूढ + -गन्ध + .({@-न्धः@}) Asafoetida (the smell of which is not easily concealed).<BR> [Mar. हिंग].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0013-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगूढभाव
अगूढ + -भाव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having an open or unreserved disposition.<BR>—2 having an obvious meaning or import.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0013-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगृभीत
अगृभीत <i>a.</i> [न˚ त˚] Ved.<BR>—1 Not seized or overcome; unsubdued; Rv. 8. 79. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगृभीतशोचिस्
अगृभीत + ˚शोचिस् <i>a.</i> of unsubdued<BR> splendour. एता न यामे अगृभीतशोचिषः Rv. 5. 54. 5, 8. 23. 1.<BR>—2 Inconceivable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगृहः|अगृह
अगृहः [न˚ ब˚] A houseless wanderer, a hermit (वानप्रस्थ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगोचर|अगोचरः
अगोचर <i>a.</i> Imperceptible by the senses, not obvious. See गोचर;<BR> वाचामगोचरां हर्षावस्थामस्पृशत् Dk. 169, beyond the power of words, indescribable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगोचरम्
अगोचर + .{@-रम@}<BR>—1 Anything beyond the cognizance of the senses.<BR>—2 Not being seen or observed, or known; कथं देवपादानामगोचरेणैवं<BR> क्रियते H. 2; without the knowledge of; ˚तां गतान् Pt. 2.<BR>—3 Brahma; अगोचरे वागिव चोपरेमे Ki. 17. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0014-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अगोचरेण
