अग्निक्रीडा
अग्निः + -क्रीडा [तृ˚ त˚] fire-works, illuminations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निगर्भ|अग्निगर्भः
अग्निः + -गर्भ <i>a.</i> [अग्निर्गर्भे यस्य] pregnant with or containing<BR> fire, having fire in the interior; ˚र्भां शमीमिव Ś. 4. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निगर्भः|अग्निगर्भ
अग्निः + -गर्भ + ({@-र्भः@})<BR> [अग्निरिव जारको गर्भो यस्य]<BR>—1 N. of the plant Agnijāra.<BR>—2 the sun stone, name of a crystal supposed to contain and give out fire<BR> when touched by the rays of the sun; cf. Ś. 2. 7.<BR>—3 the sacrificial stick अरणि which when churned, gives out fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निगर्भा
अग्निः + -गर्भ + .({@-र्भा@})<BR>—1 N. of the Śamī plant as containing fire (the story of how Agni was<BR> discovered to exist in the interior of the Śamī plant is told in chap. 35<BR> of अनुशासनपर्व in Mb.).<BR>—2 N. of the earth (अग्नेः सकाशात् गर्भो यस्यां सा; when the Ganges<BR> threw the semen of Śiva out on the Meru mountain, whatever on earth &c.<BR> was irradiated by its lustre, became gold and the earth was thence called वसुमती)<BR>—3 N. of the plant महाज्योतिष्मती लता (अग्निरिव गर्भो मध्यभागो<BR> यस्याः सा) [Mar. मालकांगोणी]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निग्रन्थः|अग्निग्रन्थ
अग्निः + -ग्रन्थः [अग्निप्रतिपादको ग्रन्थः शाक˚ त˚] the work<BR> that treats of the worship of Agni &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निघृतम्
अग्निः + -घृतम् [अग्न्युद्दीपनं घृतं शाक˚ त˚] a kind of medicinal<BR> preparation of ghee used to stimulate the digestive power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचित्
अग्निः + -चित् <i>m.</i> [अग्निं चितवान्; चि-भूतार्थे क्विप् P. III. 2. 91]<BR> one who has kept the sacred fire; यतिभिः सार्धमनग्निमग्निचित् R. 8. 25;<BR> अध्वरेष्वग्निचित्वत्सु Bk. 5. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचयः|अग्निचय
अग्निः + -चयः, -चयनम्, -चित्या<BR>—1 arranging or keeping the sacred fire (अग्न्याधान); चित्याग्निचित्ये<BR> च P. III. 1. 132.<BR>—2<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचयनम्
अग्निः + -चयः, -चयनम्, -चित्या<BR>—1 arranging or keeping the sacred fire (अग्न्याधान); चित्याग्निचित्ये<BR> च P. III. 1. 132.<BR>—2<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचित्या
अग्निः + -चयः, -चयनम्, -चित्या<BR>—1 arranging or keeping the sacred fire (अग्न्याधान); चित्याग्निचित्ये<BR> च P. III. 1. 132.<BR>—2<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचयः|अग्निचय
अग्निः + -चयः, -चयनम्, -चित्या + ({@-यः, -यनः@})<BR> the Mantra used in this operation.<BR>—3 a heap of fire<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचयनः|अग्निचयन
अग्निः + -चयः, -चयनम्, -चित्या + ({@-यः, -यनः@})<BR> the Mantra used in this operation.<BR>—3 a heap of fire<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचित्वत्|अग्निचित्वन्त्
अग्निः + -चित्वत् [अग्निचयनम् अस्त्यस्मिन् मतुप्; मस्य वः । तान्तत्वान्न<BR> पदत्वम् Tv.] having अग्निचयन or अग्निचित्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचूडः
अग्निः + -चूडः A bird having a red tuft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निचूर्णम्
अग्निः + -चूर्णम् gunpowder. कार्यासमर्थः कत्यस्ति शस्त्रगोलाग्निचूर्णयुक्<BR> Śukra. 2. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निज|अग्निजः
अग्निः + -ज, -जात <i>a.</i> produced by or from fire, born from fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निजात|अग्निजातः
अग्निः + -ज, -जात <i>a.</i> produced by or from fire, born from fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निजः|अग्निज
अग्निः + -ज, -जात + .({@-जः, -जातः@})<BR>—1 N. of the plant अग्निजार (अग्नये अग्न्युद्दीपनाय जायते सेवनात् प्रभवति).<BR>—2 N. of Kārttikeya पराभिनत्क्रौञ्चमिवाद्रिमग्निजः Mb. 8. 90. 68. —3 Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निजातः|अग्निजात
अग्निः + -ज, -जात + .({@-जः, -जातः@})<BR>—1 N. of the plant अग्निजार (अग्नये अग्न्युद्दीपनाय जायते सेवनात् प्रभवति).<BR>—2 N. of Kārttikeya पराभिनत्क्रौञ्चमिवाद्रिमग्निजः Mb. 8. 90. 68. —3 Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निजम्
अग्निः + -ज, -जात + .({@-जम्, -जातम्@}) gold; so ˚जन्मन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निजातम्
अग्निः + -ज, -जात + .({@-जम्, -जातम्@}) gold; so ˚जन्मन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निजन्मन्
अग्निः + -ज, -जात + .({@-जम्, -जातम्@}) gold; so ˚जन्मन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निजित्
अग्निः + -जित् <i>m.</i> God; Bhāg. 8. 14. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निजिह्व
अग्निः + -जिह्व <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having a fiery tongue.<BR>—2 one having fire for the tongue, epithet of a God or of Visṇu in the<BR> boar incarnation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निजिह्वा
अग्निः + -जिह्व + .({@-ह्वा@})<BR>—1 a tongue or flame of fire.<BR>—2 one of the 7 tongues of Agni (कराली धूमिनी श्वेता लोहिता नीललोहिता ।<BR> सुवर्णा पद्मरागा च जिह्वाः सप्त विभावसोः).<BR>—3 N. of a plant लाङ्गली (अग्नेर्जिह्वेव शिखा यस्याः सा); of another<BR> plant (जलपिप्पली) or गजपिप्पली (विषलाङ्गला) (Mar. जल-गज पिंपळी)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निज्वाला
अग्निः + -ज्वाला<BR>—1 the flame or glow of fire.<BR>—2 [अग्नेर्ज्वालेव शिखा यस्याः सा] N. of a plant with red blossoms,<BR> chiefly used by dyers, Grislea Tomentosa (Mar. धायफूल, धायटी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नितप्
अग्निः + -तप् <i>a.</i> [अग्निना तप्यते; तप्-क्विप्] having<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">Page0016-1</a>]<BR> the warmth of fire; practising austerities by means of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0015-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नितपस्
अग्निः + -तपस् <i>a.</i> [अग्निभिः तप्यते]<BR>—1 practising very austere penance, standing in the midst of the five fires.<BR>—2 glowing, shining or burning like fire (तपतीति तपाः अग्निरिव तपाः) hot as fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नितेजस्
अग्निः + -तेजस् <i>a.</i> having the lustre or power of fire (अग्नेरिव तेजो यस्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नितेजस्
अग्निः + -तेजस् + .({@-स्@} <i>n.</i>) the lustre of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नितेजस्
अग्निः + -तेजस् + .({@-स्@} <i>m.</i>) N. of one of the 7 Ṛṣis of the 11th Manvantara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नित्रयम्
अग्निः + -त्रयम् the three fires. See under अग्नि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निद
अग्निः + -द <i>a.</i> [अग्निं दाहार्थं गृहादौ ददाति; दा-क.]<BR>—1 giving or supplying with fire.<BR>—2 tonic, stomachic, producing appetite, stimulating digestion.<BR>—3 incendiary; अग्निदान् भक्तदांश्चैव Ms. 9. 278; अग्निदानां च ये<BR> लोकाः Y. 2. 74; so ˚दायक, ˚दायिन्. यदग्निदायके पापं यत्पापं<BR> गुरुतल्पगे Rām. 2. 75. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदायक
अग्निः + -द <i>a.</i> [अग्निं दाहार्थं गृहादौ ददाति; दा-क.]<BR>—1 giving or supplying with fire.<BR>—2 tonic, stomachic, producing appetite, stimulating digestion.<BR>—3 incendiary; अग्निदान् भक्तदांश्चैव Ms. 9. 278; अग्निदानां च ये<BR> लोकाः Y. 2. 74; so ˚दायक, ˚दायिन्. यदग्निदायके पापं यत्पापं<BR> गुरुतल्पगे Rām. 2. 75. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदायिन्
अग्निः + -द <i>a.</i> [अग्निं दाहार्थं गृहादौ ददाति; दा-क.]<BR>—1 giving or supplying with fire.<BR>—2 tonic, stomachic, producing appetite, stimulating digestion.<BR>—3 incendiary; अग्निदान् भक्तदांश्चैव Ms. 9. 278; अग्निदानां च ये<BR> लोकाः Y. 2. 74; so ˚दायक, ˚दायिन्. यदग्निदायके पापं यत्पापं<BR> गुरुतल्पगे Rām. 2. 75. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदग्ध
अग्निः + -दग्ध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 burnt on the funeral pile; अग्निदग्धाश्च ये जीवा येऽप्यदग्धाः कुले<BR> मम Vāyu P.<BR>—2 burnt with fire.<BR>—3 burnt at once without having fire put into the mouth, being destitute<BR> of issue (?); (pl.) a class of Manes or Pitṛs who, when alive, kept<BR> up the household flame and presented oblations of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदमनी
अग्निः + -दमनी [अग्निर्दम्यतेऽनया; दम्-णिच् करणे ल्युट्] a narcotic<BR> plant, Solanum Jacquini. [Mar. रिंगणी]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदातृ
अग्निः + -दातृ [अग्निं विधानेन ददाति] one who performs the last (funeral)<BR> ceremonies of a man; यश्चाग्निदाता प्रेतस्य पिण्डं दद्यात्स एव हि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदीपन|अग्निदीपनः
अग्निः + -दीपन <i>a.</i> [अग्निं दीपयति] stimulating digestion, stomachic, tonic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदीप्त
अग्निः + -दीप्त <i>a.</i> [तृ˚ त˚] glowing, set on fire, blazing<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदीप्ता
अग्निः + -दीप्त + .({@-प्ता@}) [अग्निर्जठरानलो दीप्तः सेवनात् यस्याः सा] N. of a<BR> plant ज्योतिष्मती लता (Mar. मालकांगोणी), which is said to stimulate digestion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदीप्तिः|अग्निदीप्ति
अग्निः + -दीप्तिः <i>f.</i> active state of digestion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदूत
अग्निः + -दूत <i>a.</i> [अग्निर्दूत इव यस्मिन् यस्य वा] having Agni for<BR> a messenger, said of the sacrifice or the deity invoked; यमं ह यज्ञो<BR> गच्छत्यग्निदूतो अरंकृतः Rv. 10. 14. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदूषित
अग्निः + -दूषित^1 <i>a.</i> branded.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदेवः|अग्निदेव
अग्निः + -देवः [अग्निरेव देवः] Agni; a worshipper of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निदेवा
अग्निः + -देवा [अग्निर्देवो यस्याः] the third lunar mansion, the Pleiades (कृत्तिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निद्वारम्
अग्निः + -द्वारम् the door on the south-east of a building; पूर्वद्वारमथैशाने<BR> चाग्निद्वारं तु दक्षिणे । Māna. 9. 294-95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निधानम्
अग्निः + -धानम् [अग्निर्धीयतेऽस्मिन्] the place or receptacle for keeping<BR> the sacred fire, the house of अग्निहोतृ; पदं कृणुते अग्निधाने Rv. 10. 165. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निधारणम्
अग्निः + -धारणम् maintaining the sacred fire; व्रतिनां ˚णम् K. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निनयनम्
अग्निः + -नयनम् = ˚प्रणयनम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निप्रणयनम्
अग्निः + -नयनम् = ˚प्रणयनम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निनिर्यासः|अग्निनिर्यास|अग्निनिर्य्यास|अग्निनिर्य्यासः
अग्निः + -निर्यासः [अग्नेर्जठरानलस्येव दीपको निर्यासो यस्य]<BR> N. of the plant अग्निजार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निनेत्र
अग्निः + -नेत्र <i>a.</i> [अग्निर्नेता यस्य] having Agni for the leader<BR> or conveyer of oblations, an epithet of a god in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निपदम्
अग्निः + -पदम्<BR>—1 the word Agni.<BR>—2 fire-place.<BR>—3 N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निपरिक्रिया
अग्निः + -परिक्रिया, -परिष्क्रिया care of the sacred fire, worship of fire, offering<BR> oblations; गृहार्थोऽग्निपरिष्क्रिया Ms. 2. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निपरिष्क्रिया
अग्निः + -परिक्रिया, -परिष्क्रिया care of the sacred fire, worship of fire, offering<BR> oblations; गृहार्थोऽग्निपरिष्क्रिया Ms. 2. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निपरिच्छदः|अग्निपरिच्छद
अग्निः + -परिच्छदः the whole sacrificial apparatus; गृह्यं चाग्निपरिच्छदम् Ms. 6. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निपरिधानम्
अग्निः + -परिधानम् enclosing the sacrificial fire with a kind of screen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निपरीक्षा
अग्निः + -परीक्षा [तृ˚ त˚] ordeal by fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निपर्वतः|अग्निपर्वत|अग्निपर्व्वत
अग्निः + -पर्वतः [अग्निसाधनं पर्वतः] a volcano; महता ज्वलता<BR> नित्यमग्निमेवाग्निपर्वतः Rām. 5. 35. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निपुच्छः|अग्निपुच्छ
अग्निः + -पुच्छः [अग्नेः अग्न्याधानस्थानस्य पुच्छ इव] tail or back part<BR> of the sacrificial place; the extinction of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निपुराणम्
अग्निः + -पुराणम् [अग्निना प्रोक्तं पुराणम्] one of the 18 Purāṇas<BR> ascribed to Vyāsa. It derives its name from its having been communicated<BR> originally by Agni<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">Page0016-2</a>]<BR> to the sage Vasiṣṭha for the purpose of instructing him in the two-fold<BR> knowledge of Brahman. Its stanzas are said to be 14500. Its contents are<BR> varied. It has portions on ritual and mystic worship, cosmical descriptions,<BR> chapters on the duties of Kings and the art of war, a chapter on law,<BR> some chapters on Medicine and some treatises on Rhetoric, Prosody, Grammar,<BR> Yoga, Brahmavidyā &c. &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निप्रणयनम्
अग्निः + -प्रणयनम् bringing out the sacrificial fire and consecrating<BR> it according to the proper ritual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निप्रणिधिः|अग्निप्रणिधि
अग्निः + -प्रणिधिः Incendiary. Dk. 2. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निप्रतिष्ठा
अग्निः + -प्रतिष्ठा consecration of fire, especially the nuptial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निप्रवेशः|अग्निप्रवेश
अग्निः + -प्रवेशः, -प्रवेशनम् [स˚ त˚] entering the fire, self-immolation<BR> of a widow on the funeral pile of her husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निप्रवेशनम्
अग्निः + -प्रवेशः, -प्रवेशनम् [स˚ त˚] entering the fire, self-immolation<BR> of a widow on the funeral pile of her husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निप्रस्कन्दनम्
अग्निः + -प्रस्कन्दनम् violation of the duties of a sacrificer (अग्निहोमाकरण);<BR> ˚परस्त्वं चाप्येवं भविष्यसि Mb. 1. 84. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निप्रस्तरः|अग्निप्रस्तर
अग्निः + -प्रस्तरः [अग्निं प्रस्तृणाति अग्नेः प्रस्तरो वा] a flint, a<BR> stone producing fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निबाहुः|अग्निबाहु
अग्निः + -बाहुः [अग्नेर्बाहुरिव दीर्घाशिखत्वात्]<BR>—1 smoke.<BR>—2 N. of a son of the first Manu; Hariv. N. of a son of Priyavrata and Kāmyā. V. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निबीजम्
अग्निः + -बीजम्<BR>—1 the seed of Agni; (fig.) gold (रुद्रतेजः समुद्भूतंहेमबीजं विभावसोः)<BR>—2 N. of the letter र्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निभम्
अग्निः + -भम् [अग्निरिव भाति; भा-क.]<BR>—1 ‘shining like fire’, gold.<BR>—2 N. of the constellation कृत्तिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निभु
अग्निः + -भु <i>n.</i> [अग्नेर्भवति; भू-क्विप् ह्रस्वान्तः]<BR>—1 water.<BR>—2 gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निभू
अग्निः + -भू <i>a.</i> [अग्नेर्भवतिः भू-क्विप्] produced from fire. ({@भूः@})<BR>—1 ‘fire-born’, N. of Kārttikeya.<BR>—2 N. of a teacher (काश्यप) who was taught by Agni.<BR>—3 (arith.) six.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निभूति|अग्निभूतिः
अग्निः + -भूति <i>a.</i> produced from fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निभूतिः|अग्निभूति
अग्निः + -भूति + .({@-तिः@}) [अग्निरिव भूतिरैश्वर्यं यस्य] N. of a pupil of the<BR> last Tīrthaṅkara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निभूतिः|अग्निभूति
अग्निः + -भूति + .({@-तिः@}) + ({@-तिः@}) <i>f.</i> the lustre or might of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निभ्राजस्
अग्निः + -भ्राजस् <i>a.</i> Ved. [अग्निरिव भ्राजते; भ्राज्-असुन्] shining<BR> like fire. अग्निभ्राजसो विद्युतः Rv. 5. 54. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमणिः|अग्निमणि
अग्निः + -मणिः [अग्नेरुत्थापको मणिः शाक˚ त˚] the sun-stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमथ्
अग्निः + -मथ् <i>m.</i> [अग्निं मथ्नाति निष्पादयति; मन्थ्-क्विप्नलोपः]<BR>—1 the sacrificer who churns the fuel-stick.<BR>—2 the Mantra used in this operation, on the अरणि itself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमन्थः|अग्निमन्थ
अग्निः + -मन्थः, -मन्थनम्, producing fire by friction; or the Mantra used<BR> in this operation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमन्थः|अग्निमन्थ
अग्निः + -मन्थः, -मन्थनम् + .({@-न्थः@}) [अग्निर्मथ्यते अनेन मन्थ्-करणे घञ्] N. of a tree<BR> गणिकारिका (Mar. नरवेल) Premna Spinosa (तत्काष्ठयोर्घर्षणे<BR> हि आशु वह्निरुत्पद्यते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमन्थनम्
अग्निः + -मन्थः, -मन्थनम्, producing fire by friction; or the Mantra used<BR> in this operation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमान्द्यम्
अग्निः + -मान्द्यम् slowness of digestion, loss of appetite, dyspepsia.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमारुतिः|अग्निमारुति
अग्निः + -मारुतिः [अग्निश्च मरुच्च तयोरपत्यम् इञ् ततो वृद्धिः इत् च;<BR> द्विपदवृद्धौ पृषो. पूर्वपदस्य ह्रस्वः Tv.] N. of the sage Agastya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमित्रः|अग्निमित्र
अग्निः + -मित्रः N. of a king of the Śunga dynasty, son of Puṣypamitra<BR> who must have flourished before 150 B. C. −the usually accepted date<BR> of Patañjali-as the latter mentions पुष्यमित्र by name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमुख|अग्निमुखः
अग्निः + -मुख^1 <i>a.</i> having Agni at the head.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमुखः|अग्निमुख
अग्निः + -मुखः + .({@-खः@}) [अग्निर्मुखमिव यस्य]<BR>—1 a deity, god, (for the gods receive oblations through Agni who is,<BR> therefore, said to be their mouth; अग्निमुखा वै देवाः; अग्निर्मुखं प्रथमं<BR> देवतानाम् &c.; or अग्निर्मुखे अग्रे येषाम्, for fire is said to have<BR> been created before all other gods.)<BR>—2 [अग्निर्मुखं प्रधानमुपास्यो यस्य] one who maintains the sacred<BR> fire (अग्निहोतृद्विज)<BR>—3 a Brāhmaṇa in general (अग्निर्दहकत्वात् शापाग्निर्मुखे यस्य, for<BR> Brāhmaṇas are said to be वाग्वज्राः).<BR>—4 N. of two plants चित्रक Plumbago Zeylanica and भल्लातक Semicarpus<BR> Anacardium (अग्निरिव स्पर्शात् दुःखदायकं मुखमग्रम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">Page0017-1</a>]<BR> यस्य, तन्निर्यासस्पर्शेन हि देहे क्षतोत्पत्तेस्थयोस्तथात्वम्).<BR>—5 a sort of powder or चूर्ण prescribed as a tonic by चक्रदत्त.<BR>—6 ‘fire-mouthed’, sharp-biting, an epithet of a bug. Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमुखी
अग्निः + -मुखः + .({@-खी@}) [अग्निरिव मुखमग्रं यस्याः; गौरादि-ङीष्]<BR>—1 N. of a plant भल्लातक (Mar. बिबवा, भिलावा) and लाङ्गलिका<BR> (विषलाङ्गला).<BR>—2 N. of the Gāyatri Mantra (अग्निरेव मुखं मुखत्वेन कल्पितं यस्याः<BR> सा, or अग्नेरिव मुखं प्रजापतिमुखम् उत्पत्तिद्वारं यस्याः, अग्निना<BR> समं प्रजापतिमुखजातत्वात्; कदाचिदपि नो विद्वान् गायत्रीमुदके जपेत् ।<BR> गायत्र्याग्निमुखी यस्मात्तस्मादुत्थाय तां जपेत् ॥ गोभिल).<BR>—3 a kitchen [पाकशाला अग्निरिव उत्तप्तं मुखं यस्याः सा].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0016-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निमूढ
अग्निः + -मूढ <i>a.</i> [तृ˚ त˚] Ved. made insane or stupefied by<BR> lightning or fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नियन्त्रम्
अग्निः + -यन्त्रम् A gun अग्नियन्त्रधरैश्चक्रधरैश्च पुरुषैर्वृतः Śiva B. 12. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नियानम्
अग्निः + -यानम् An aeroplane. व्योमयानं विमानं स्यात् अग्नियानं तदेव<BR> हि । अगस्त्यसंहिता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नियोगः|अग्नियोग
अग्निः + -योगः See पञ्चाग्निसाधन. अग्नियोगवहो ग्रीष्मे विधिदृष्टेन<BR> कर्मणा । चीर्त्वा द्वादशवर्षाणि राजा भवति पार्थिवः ॥ Mb. 13. 14, 2. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्नियोजनम्
अग्निः + -योजनम् causing the sacrificial fire to blaze up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निरक्षणम्
अग्निः + -रक्षणम्<BR>—1 consecrating or preserving the sacred (domestic) fire or अग्निहोत्र.<BR>—2 [अग्निः रक्ष्यते अनेन अत्र वा] a Mantra securing for Agni protection<BR> from evil spirits &c.<BR>—3 the house of an अग्निहोतृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निरजः|अग्निरज
अग्निः + -रजः, -रजस् <i>m.</i> [अग्निरिव रज्यते दीप्यते; रञ्ज्-असुन् नलोपः]<BR>—1 a scarlet insect by name इन्द्रगोप.<BR>—2 (अग्नेः रजः) the might or power of Agni.<BR>—3 gold. Mb. 3. 16. 86, 7<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निरजस्
अग्निः + -रजः, -रजस् <i>m.</i> [अग्निरिव रज्यते दीप्यते; रञ्ज्-असुन् नलोपः]<BR>—1 a scarlet insect by name इन्द्रगोप.<BR>—2 (अग्नेः रजः) the might or power of Agni.<BR>—3 gold. Mb. 3. 16. 86, 7<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निरहस्यम्
अग्निः + -रहस्यम् mystery of (worshipping &c.) Agni; N. of the tenth book<BR> of Śatapatha Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निराशिः|अग्निराशि
अग्निः + -राशिः a heap of fire, burning pile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निरुहा
अग्निः + -रुहा [अग्निरिव रोहति रुह्-क] N. of the plant मांसादनी<BR> or मांसरोहिणी (तदङ्कुरस्य वह्नितुल्यवर्णतया उत्पन्नत्वात्तथात्वं तस्याः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निरूप
अग्निः + -रूप <i>a.</i> [अग्निरिव रूपं वर्णो यस्य] fire-shaped; of<BR> the nature of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निरूपम्
अग्निः + -रूपम् the nature of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निरेतस्
अग्निः + -रेतस् <i>n.</i> the seed of Agni; (hence) gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निरोहिणी
अग्निः + -रोहिणी [अग्निरिव रोहति; रुह्-णिनि] a hard inflammatory swelling in the armpit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निलोकः|अग्निलोक
अग्निः + -लोकः the world of Agni, which is situated below the summit of<BR> Meru; in the Purāṇas it is said to be in the अन्तरिक्ष, while in<BR> the Kāśī Khaṇḍa it is said to be to the south of इन्द्रपुरी; एतस्या<BR> दक्षिणे भागे येयं पूर्दृश्यते शुभा । इमामर्चिष्मतीं पश्य वीतिहोत्रपुरीं शुभाम् ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवधूः
अग्निः + -वधूः Svāhā, the daughter of Dakṣa and wife of Agni<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवर्चस्
अग्निः + -वर्चस् <i>a.</i> [अग्नेर्वर्च इव वर्चो यस्य] glowing or bright<BR> like fire. (<i>n.</i>) the lustre of Agni. ━(<i>m.</i>) N. of a teacher of the Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवर्ण|अग्निवर्ण्ण
अग्निः + -वर्ण <i>a.</i> [अग्नेरिव वर्णो यस्य] of the colour of fire;<BR> hot; fiery; सुरां पीत्वा द्विजो मोहादग्निवर्णां सुरां पिबेत् Ms. 11. 90;<BR> गोमूत्रमग्निवर्णं वा पिबेदुदकमेव वा 91. ({@र्णः@})<BR>—1 N. of a prince, son of Sudarśana.<BR>—2 N. of a King of the solar race. See R. 19. 1 the colour of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवर्णा
अग्निः + -वर्ण + .({@-र्णा@}) a strong liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवर्धक|अग्निवर्द्धकः|अग्निवर्धकः
अग्निः + -वर्धक <i>a.</i> stimulating digestion, tonic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवर्धकः|अग्निवर्धक|अग्निवर्द्धकः
अग्निः + -वर्धक + .({@-कः@})<BR>—1 a tonic.<BR>—2 regimen, diet (पथ्याहार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवल्लभः|अग्निवल्लभ
अग्निः + -वल्लभः [अग्नेर्वल्लभः सुखेन दाह्यत्वात्]<BR>—1 the Śāla tree, Shorea Robusta.<BR>—2 the resinous juice of it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवासस्
अग्निः + -वासस् <i>a.</i> [अग्निरिव शुद्धं वासो यस्य] having a red (pure<BR> like Agni) garment. (<i>n.</i>) a pure garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवाह|अग्निवाहः
अग्निः + -वाह <i>a.</i> [अग्निं वाहयति अनुमापयति वा]<BR>—1 smoke.<BR>—2 a goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवाहनम्
अग्निः + -वाहनम् a goat (छाग).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निविद्
अग्निः + -विद् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 one who knows the mystery about Agni.<BR>—2 an अग्निहोत्रिन् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निविमोचनम्
अग्निः + -विमोचनम् ceremony of lowering the sacrificial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निविसर्पः|अग्निविसर्प
अग्निः + -विसर्पः pain from an<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">Page0017-2</a>]<BR> inflamed tumour, inflammation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निविहरणम्
अग्निः + -विहरणम्, -विहारः<BR>—1 taking the sacrificial fire from आग्नीध्र to the उत्तरवेदि.<BR>—2 offering oblations to fire; प्रत्यासन्ना ˚वेला K. 348.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निविहारः
अग्निः + -विहरणम्, -विहारः<BR>—1 taking the sacrificial fire from आग्नीध्र to the उत्तरवेदि.<BR>—2 offering oblations to fire; प्रत्यासन्ना ˚वेला K. 348.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवीर्यम्
अग्निः + -वीर्यम्<BR>—1 power or might of Agni.<BR>—2 gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवेतालः|अग्निवेताल
अग्निः + -वेतालः Name of Vetāla (connected with the story of Vikramāditya).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवेशः|अग्निवेश
अग्निः + -वेशः [अग्नेर्वेश इव] N. of an ancient medical authority (चरक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवेश्मन्
अग्निः + -वेश्मन् <i>m.</i> the fourteenth day of the karma-māsa; Sūryaprajñapti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निवेश्यः|अग्निवेश्य
अग्निः + -वेश्यः<BR>—1 N. of a teacher, Mbh.<BR>—2 Name of the 22nd muhūrta; Sūryaprajñapti. धौम्य cf. Mb. 14. 64. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निशरणम्
अग्निः + -शरणम्, -शाला, -शालम् —1 a fire-sanctuary; ˚मार्गमादेशय Ś. 5;<BR>—2 a house or place for keeping the sacred fire; ˚रक्षणाय स्थापितोऽहम् V. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निशाला
