अग्निशालम्
अग्निः + -शरणम्, -शाला, -शालम् —1 a fire-sanctuary; ˚मार्गमादेशय Ś. 5;<BR>—2 a house or place for keeping the sacred fire; ˚रक्षणाय स्थापितोऽहम् V. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निशर्मन्|अग्निशर्म्मन्
अग्निः + -शर्मन् <i>a.</i> [अग्निरिव शृणाति तीव्रकोपत्वात् शॄ-मनिन्] very<BR> passionate. ━(<i>m.</i>) N. of a sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निशिख|अग्निशिखं|अग्निशिखः
अग्निः + -शिख <i>a.</i> [अग्नेरिव अग्निरिव वा शिखा यस्य] fiery, fire-crested;<BR> दहतु ˚खैः सायकैः Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निशिखः|अग्निशिख|अग्निशिखं
अग्निः + -शिख + .({@-खः@})<BR>—1 a lamp.<BR>—2 a rocket, fiery arrow.<BR>—3 an arrow in general.<BR>—4 safflower plant.<BR>—5 saffron.<BR>—6 जाङ्गलीबृक्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निशिखम्
अग्निः + -शिख + .({@-खम्@})<BR>—1 saffron.<BR>—2 gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निशिखा
अग्निः + -शिख + .({@-खा@})<BR>—1 a flame; शरैरग्निशिखोपमैः Mb.<BR>—2 N. of two plants लाङ्गली (Mar. वागचबका or कळलावी)<BR> Gloriosa Superba; of other plants (also Mar. कळलावी) Menispermum Cordifolium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निशुश्रूषा
अग्निः + -शुश्रूषा careful service or worship of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निशेखर|अग्निशेखरं|अग्निशेखरः
अग्निः + -शेखर <i>a.</i> fire-crested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्निशेखरः|अग्निशेखर|अग्निशेखरं
