अग्रहस्तः|अग्रहस्त
अग्र + -पाणिः = ˚हस्तः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रपूजा
अग्र + -पूजा the highest or first mark of reverence or respect; ˚जामिह<BR> स्थित्वा गृहाणेदं विषं प्रभो Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

