अग्रबीज|अग्रबीजः
अग्र + -बीज <i>a.</i> [अग्रं शाखाग्रं बीजमुत्पादकं यस्य] growing<BR> by means of the tip or end of branches, growing on the stock or stem of<BR> another tree, such as ‘कलम’ in Mar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रबीजः|अग्रबीज
अग्र + -बीज + .({@-जः@}) a viviparous plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रभागः|अग्रभाग
अग्र + -भागः [कर्म˚]<BR>—1 the first or best part (श्राद्धादौ प्रथममुद्धृत्य देयं द्रव्यम्)<BR>—2 remnant, remainder (शेषभाग).<BR>—3 fore-part, tip, point.<BR>—4 (astr.) a degree of amplitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रभागिन्
अग्र + -भागिन् <i>a.</i> [अग्रभागोऽस्यास्ति; अस्त्यर्थे इनि] first to take<BR> or claim (the remnant); अलङ्क्रियमाणस्य तस्य अनुलेपनमाल्ये ˚गी भवामि<BR> V. 5, claiming the first share of the remnant etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रभावः
अग्र + -भावः precedence. उदारसंख्यैः सचिवैरसंख्यैः कृताग्रभावः<BR> स उदाग्रभावः Bu. C. 1. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रभुज्
अग्र + -भुज् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having precedence in eating. स तानग्रभुजस्तात धान्येन च धनेन च Mb. 1. 178. 12.<BR>—2 gluttonous, voracious (औदरिक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रभूः
अग्र + -भूः [अग्रे भवति भू-क्विप्] = ˚ज.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रज|अग्रजः
अग्र + -भूः [अग्रे भवति भू-क्विप्] = ˚ज.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रभूमिः|अग्रभूमि
अग्र + -भूमिः <i>f.</i> —1 goal of ambition or object aimed at; ततोऽग्रभूमिं<BR> व्यवसायसिद्धेः Ki. 17. 55; त्वमग्रभूमिर्निरपायसंश्रया Śi. 1. 32<BR> (प्राप्यस्थानम्).<BR>—2 the topmost part, pinnacle; विमान˚ Me. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रमहिषी
अग्र + -महिषी the principal queen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रमांसम्
अग्र + -मांसम् [अग्रं भक्ष्यत्वेन प्रधानं मांसम्] flesh in the heart,<BR> the heart itself; ˚सं चानीतं Ve. 3. 2 morbid protuberance of the liver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रयणम्
अग्र + -यणम् [अग्रम् अयनात् उत्तरायणात् णत्वं शकं˚ तद्विधानकालोऽस्य<BR> अच् (?) Tv.] a kind of sacrificial ceremony. See आग्रयण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रयान|अग्रयानं
अग्र + -यान <i>a.</i> [अग्रे यानं यस्य, या-ल्युट्] taking the lead, foremost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रयानम्
अग्र + -यान + .({@-नम्@}) an army that stops in front to defy the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0020-1" target="_blank">Page0020-1</a>]<BR> enemy. मनोऽग्रयानं वचसा निरुक्तं नमामहे Bhāg. 8. 5. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रयायिन्
अग्र + -यायिन् <i>a.</i> [अग्रे यास्यति या-णिनि] taking the lead, leading<BR> the van; पुत्रस्य ते रणशिरस्ययमग्रयायी Ś. 7. 26. मानधनाग्रयायी<BR> R. 5. 3, 5. 62, 18. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अग्रयोधिन्
