अङ्गीकारः, -कृतिः, -करणम्<BR>—1 Acceptance.<BR>—2 Agreement, promise, undertaking &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0027-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

