अचापल, -ल्य <i>a.</i> [बहु˚] Devoid of fickleness, steady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0028-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचापलम्
अचापल, -ल्य + .{@-लम्, -ल्यम्@} [न˚ त˚] Steadiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0028-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचापल्यम्
अचापल, -ल्य + .{@-लम्, -ल्यम्@} [न˚ त˚] Steadiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0028-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचित्
अचित् <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Devoid of understanding.<BR>—2 Irreligious, unrighteous.<BR>—3 Material (opp. चित्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0028-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचित
अचित <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Gone.<BR>—2 [न˚ त˚] Not thought of.<BR>—3 Not collected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0028-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचित्त
अचित्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Inconceivable.<BR>—2 [नास्ति चित्तं यस्य] Destitute of intellect, senseless, stupid.<BR>—3 Unnoticed, unexpected, not thought of.<BR>—4 Without consciousness, inanimate, non-sentient. P. IV. 2. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0028-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचित्तिः|अचित्ति
अचित्तिः <i>f.</i> Want of sense, infatuation, ignorance. चित्तिमचित्तिं<BR> चिनवद् वि विद्वान् Rv. 4. 2. 11; सुरा मन्युर्विभीदको अचित्तिः Rv. 7. 86. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिन्त्य|अचिंत्य|अचिन्त्यः
अचिन्त्य, -न्तनीय <i>a.</i><BR> [न˚ त˚] Inconceivable, incomprehensible,<BR> unexpected; ˚यस्तु तव प्रभावः R. 5. 33; ˚न्त्यरूप, ˚कर्मन्<BR> of inconceivable form or action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिन्तनीय
अचिन्त्य, -न्तनीय <i>a.</i><BR> [न˚ त˚] Inconceivable, incomprehensible,<BR> unexpected; ˚यस्तु तव प्रभावः R. 5. 33; ˚न्त्यरूप, ˚कर्मन्<BR> of inconceivable form or action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिन्त्यः|अचिन्त्य|अचिंत्य
अचिन्त्य, -न्तनीय + .{@-न्त्यः@}<BR>—1 Śiva.<BR>—2 Quick-silver (Nigh.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिन्तित|अचिंतित
अचिन्तित <i>a.</i> Not thought of, unexpected, sudden;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिन्तितोपनतम्
अचिन्तित + ˚उपनतम् occurring unexpectedly; ˚तो वधोऽज्ञानां मीनानामिव जायते Pt. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिकित्वस्
अचिकित्वस्^1 <i>a.</i> Ved. Ignorant of, not knowing. अचिकित्वाञ् चिकितुषश्चिदत्र Rv. 1. 164. 6.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/ap90/issues/issue26 readme_althw_2.txt. note: headword change.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिर
अचिर <i>a.</i> [न˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Brief, transitory, of short duration; ˚द्युति, ˚भास्, ˚प्रभा &c. q. v.<BR>—2 Recent, late, new; अकरोदचिरेश्वरः क्षितौ R. 8. 20 the new lord.<BR> In compounds अचिर may be rendered by ‘recently’, ‘just’, ‘not long ago’<BR>; ˚प्रवृत्तं ग्रीष्मसमयमधिकृत्य Ś. 1, just set in. ˚प्रसूता;<BR> अचिरप्रसूतया जनन्या विना विवर्धित एव Ś. 4; having recently brought<BR> forth (who died not long after delivery, said of a doe) or a cow that<BR> has recently calved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिरम्
अचिर + .{@-रम@} <i>adv.</i> (also अचिरेण, अचिराय, अचिरात्, अचिरस्य in<BR> the same senses)<BR>—1 Not long since, not long ago.<BR>—2 Recently, lately.<BR>—3 Soon, quickly, not long hence.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अचिरांशु, अचिराभा, अचिरद्युतिः, अचिरप्रभा, अचिरभास्, अचिररोचिस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिरांशु|अचिरांशुः
अचिर + -अंशु, -आभा, -द्युतिः, -प्रभा, -भास्, -रोचिस् <i>f.</i> [अचिराः अंशवः, अचिरा आभा-प्रभा &c. यस्याः सा]<BR>—1 lightning; ˚शुविलासचञ्चला लक्ष्मीः<BR> Ki. 2. 19; ˚भासां तेजसा चानुलिप्तैः Ś. 7. 7.; Ki. 4. 24, अचिरद्युतितेजसा 5. 6.<BR> समुत्पफाल गगने मेघादचिरभा इव Parṇāl. 5. 98.<BR>—2 (कर्म˚) transitory lustre, short gleam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिराभा
अचिर + -अंशु, -आभा, -द्युतिः, -प्रभा, -भास्, -रोचिस् <i>f.</i> [अचिराः अंशवः, अचिरा आभा-प्रभा &c. यस्याः सा]<BR>—1 lightning; ˚शुविलासचञ्चला लक्ष्मीः<BR> Ki. 2. 19; ˚भासां तेजसा चानुलिप्तैः Ś. 7. 7.; Ki. 4. 24, अचिरद्युतितेजसा 5. 6.<BR> समुत्पफाल गगने मेघादचिरभा इव Parṇāl. 5. 98.<BR>—2 (कर्म˚) transitory lustre, short gleam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिरद्युतिः|अचिरद्युति
अचिर + -अंशु, -आभा, -द्युतिः, -प्रभा, -भास्, -रोचिस् <i>f.</i> [अचिराः अंशवः, अचिरा आभा-प्रभा &c. यस्याः सा]<BR>—1 lightning; ˚शुविलासचञ्चला लक्ष्मीः<BR> Ki. 2. 19; ˚भासां तेजसा चानुलिप्तैः Ś. 7. 7.; Ki. 4. 24, अचिरद्युतितेजसा 5. 6.<BR> समुत्पफाल गगने मेघादचिरभा इव Parṇāl. 5. 98.<BR>—2 (कर्म˚) transitory lustre, short gleam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिरप्रभा
अचिर + -अंशु, -आभा, -द्युतिः, -प्रभा, -भास्, -रोचिस् <i>f.</i> [अचिराः अंशवः, अचिरा आभा-प्रभा &c. यस्याः सा]<BR>—1 lightning; ˚शुविलासचञ्चला लक्ष्मीः<BR> Ki. 2. 19; ˚भासां तेजसा चानुलिप्तैः Ś. 7. 7.; Ki. 4. 24, अचिरद्युतितेजसा 5. 6.<BR> समुत्पफाल गगने मेघादचिरभा इव Parṇāl. 5. 98.<BR>—2 (कर्म˚) transitory lustre, short gleam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिरभास्
अचिर + -अंशु, -आभा, -द्युतिः, -प्रभा, -भास्, -रोचिस् <i>f.</i> [अचिराः अंशवः, अचिरा आभा-प्रभा &c. यस्याः सा]<BR>—1 lightning; ˚शुविलासचञ्चला लक्ष्मीः<BR> Ki. 2. 19; ˚भासां तेजसा चानुलिप्तैः Ś. 7. 7.; Ki. 4. 24, अचिरद्युतितेजसा 5. 6.<BR> समुत्पफाल गगने मेघादचिरभा इव Parṇāl. 5. 98.<BR>—2 (कर्म˚) transitory lustre, short gleam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिररोचिस्
अचिर + -अंशु, -आभा, -द्युतिः, -प्रभा, -भास्, -रोचिस् <i>f.</i> [अचिराः अंशवः, अचिरा आभा-प्रभा &c. यस्याः सा]<BR>—1 lightning; ˚शुविलासचञ्चला लक्ष्मीः<BR> Ki. 2. 19; ˚भासां तेजसा चानुलिप्तैः Ś. 7. 7.; Ki. 4. 24, अचिरद्युतितेजसा 5. 6.<BR> समुत्पफाल गगने मेघादचिरभा इव Parṇāl. 5. 98.<BR>—2 (कर्म˚) transitory lustre, short gleam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिष्णु
अचिष्णु, -ष्टु <i>a.</i> Ved. [अच् गतौ बा˚ इष्णु-ष्टु-च्] Going every where, all-pervading.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचिष्टु
अचिष्णु, -ष्टु <i>a.</i> Ved. [अच् गतौ बा˚ इष्णु-ष्टु-च्] Going every where, all-pervading.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचेतन|अचेतनः
अचेतन <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚]<BR>—1 Inanimate, not sentient, irrational; चेतन ˚नेषु Me. 5; ˚नं<BR> ब्रह्म inanimate Brahman; ˚नं नाम गुणं न लक्षयेत् Ś. 6. 13<BR> destitute of life, lifeless (object &c.); ˚नेष्वपि चेतनावदुपचारः Mbh.<BR>—2 Not conscious, insensible; senseless; निराशा निहते पुत्रे दत्ता श्राद्धमचेतना<BR> Rām. 6. 92. 55. बुद्धिशतमचेतने नष्टम् H. 2. 140.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचेतस्
अचेतस् <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚] Destitute of consciousness; insensible,<BR> inanimate, lifeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचेतान
अचेतान <i>a.</i> [चित् शानच्, न˚ त˚] Ved. Void of consciousness,<BR> ignorant; silly, infatuated. अचेतानस्य मा पथो वि दुक्षः । Rv. 7. 4. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचेष्ट
अचेष्ट <i>a.</i> [नास्ति चेष्टा यस्य]<BR>—1 Effortless, motionless.<BR>—2 Not requiring direct effort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचैतन्यम्
अचैतन्यम् [न˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Unconsciousness, insensibility; ignorance in spiritual matters.<BR>—2 The material world, matter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचोदनम्
अचोदनम् Non-injunction, a mere statement (of something already known);<BR> देशकालानामचोदनं प्रयोगे नित्यसमवायात् MS. 4. 2. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचोविनः
अचोविनः (?) Probably a special messenger to report among other things,<BR> impending attacks from enemies; Sircar, SI. 239 n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अचोदस्
अचोदस् <i>a.</i> Ved. [नास्ति चोदना यस्य] Spontaneous, not influenced<BR> by external force or compulsion. अचोदसो न धन्वन्त्विन्दवः Rv. 9. 79. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छ|अच्छं|अच्छः|अछ
अच्छ <i>a.</i> [न छपति दृष्टिम्; छे-क. न˚ त˚, निर्मले<BR> हि वस्तुनि दृष्टिः प्रसरति न तु समले आभ्यन्तरपर्यन्तं धावति Tv.]<BR> Clear pellucid, transparent, pure; मुक्ताच्छदन्तच्छविदन्तुरेयम् U. 6. 27;<BR> ˚स्फटिकविशदम् Me. 51; ˚श्रमजलकणिका K. 57; किं रत्नमच्छा<BR> मतिः Bv. 1. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छः|अच्छ|अच्छं|अछ
अच्छ + .{@-च्छः@}<BR>—1 A crystal.<BR>—2 [न छाति भक्षयति नाशितसत्त्वं; छा भक्षणे-क. न˚ त˚<BR> Tv.] A bear; cf. also ˚भल्ल.<BR>—3 N. of a plant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अच्छोदन्, अच्छभल्लः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छोदन्
अच्छ + -उदन् <i>a.</i> (i. e. अच्छोद) [अच्छम् उदकं यस्य] having clear water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छोदा
अच्छ + -उदन् + .({@-दा@}) N. of a river; एतेषां (अग्निष्वात्तानां) मानसी कन्या<BR> अच्छोदा नाम निम्नगा Harivaṃśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छोदं|अच्छोद
अच्छ + -उदन् + .({@-दं@}) N. of a lake on the Himālaya (mentioned in Kādambarī<BR> अतिमनोहरम् आह्लादनं दृष्टेः अच्छोदं नाम सरो दृष्टवान् ।).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छभल्लः|अच्छभल्ल
अच्छ + -भल्लः a bear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छ|अच्छं|अच्छः|अछ
अच्छ, -च्छा <i>ind.</i> Ved. To, towards (with acc.). It is a kind of separable<BR> preposition or prefix to verbs and verbal derivatives, especially to such<BR> as imply some kind of motion, or speaking; (अच्छ गत्यर्थवदेषु P. I. 4. 69);<BR> ˚इ or गम् to go to, attain, as अच्छ गत्य; ˚नश्-क्ष्<BR> to go near, approach; ˚नी to lead towards; ˚नु to call out to;<BR> ˚पत् to fly towards रघुः श्येनः पतयत् अन्धः अच्छ Rv. 5. 45. 9.<BR> ˚वन्द् to salute; ˚वच् to invite Śabara interprets the word<BR> अच्छ in the text यूपमच्छेष्यता होतव्यम् to mean, ‘in order to have’<BR>; अच्छशब्दो हि आप्तुमित्यर्थे वर्तते । ŚB. on MS. 10. 1. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छा|अछा
अच्छ, -च्छा <i>ind.</i> Ved. To, towards (with acc.). It is a kind of separable<BR> preposition or prefix to verbs and verbal derivatives, especially to such<BR> as imply some kind of motion, or speaking; (अच्छ गत्यर्थवदेषु P. I. 4. 69);<BR> ˚इ or गम् to go to, attain, as अच्छ गत्य; ˚नश्-क्ष्<BR> to go near, approach; ˚नी to lead towards; ˚नु to call out to;<BR> ˚पत् to fly towards रघुः श्येनः पतयत् अन्धः अच्छ Rv. 5. 45. 9.<BR> ˚वन्द् to salute; ˚वच् to invite Śabara interprets the word<BR> अच्छ in the text यूपमच्छेष्यता होतव्यम् to mean, ‘in order to have’<BR>; अच्छशब्दो हि आप्तुमित्यर्थे वर्तते । ŚB. on MS. 10. 1. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छावाकः|अच्छावाक
अच्छावाकः [अच्छं निर्मलम् अच्छ आभिमुख्येन वा वक्ति शंसति; वच्<BR> कर्तरि संज्ञायां घञ् निपातस्य चेति दीर्घः Tv.] The invoker or inviter,<BR> a priest or Ṛtvij who is employed at Soma sacrifices, and is a co-adjutor<BR> of होतृ. Each of the four principal priests, होतृ, अध्वर्यु, उद्गातृ<BR> and ब्रह्मन् has three assistants, the total number of priests employed<BR> at Soma sacrifices being therefore 16;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छावाकसामन्
अच्छावाकः + ˚सामन् <i>a.</i> N. of the Sāman<BR> to be chanted by an अच्छावाक, also called उद्वंशीय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छावाकीय
अच्छावाकीय <i>a.</i> [अच्छावाकशब्दोऽस्त्यत्र-छ] Containing the word<BR> अच्छावाक P. V. 2. 59. Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छावाकीयम्
अच्छावाकीय + .{@-यम्@} [˚वाकस्य कर्म भावो वा] The duty of an अच्छावाक,<BR> being one P. V. 1. 135. Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छावाक्य
अच्छावाक्य <i>a.</i> [अच्छावाकस्य इदं-यत्] Pertaining to, to be<BR> repeated by, an अच्छावाक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छन्दस्
अच्छन्दस् <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚]<BR>—1 Not studying the Vedas (as a boy before the मुञ्ज ceremony), or<BR> not entitled to that study (as a Śūdra).<BR>—2 Not metrical, not of the nature of metres, i. e. prose.<BR>—3 Without fancy or whim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छिद्र|अच्छिद्रं|अछिद्र
अच्छिद्र <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚] Unbroken, uninjured, complete, unimpaired,<BR> without holes or weak points, faultless, without defect; अच्छिद्रैः सुस्तम्भैर्मन्त्रिभिः<BR> Pt. 1. 126; जपच्छिद्रं<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0030-1" target="_blank">Page0030-1</a>]<BR> तपच्छिद्रं यच्छिद्रं श्राद्धकर्मणि । सर्वं भवतु मेऽच्छिद्रं ब्राह्मणानां<BR> प्रसादतः ॥; तत्तथा क्रियतां राजन्यथाऽच्छिद्रः कतुर्भवेत् Rām.,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छिद्रोति|अछिद्रोति
अच्छिद्र + ˚ऊति<BR> giving perfect protection Rv. 1. 245. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छिद्रम्
अच्छिद्र + .{@-द्रम्@} A faultless action or condition, absence of defect;<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अच्छिद्रोधन्, अच्छिद्रकाण्डम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छिद्रेण
अच्छिद्र + .{@-द्रम्@} + ˚द्रेण<BR> uninterruptedly, from first to last.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0029-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छिद्रोधन्|अछिद्रोधन्
अच्छिद्र + -ऊधन् [{@-ऊध्नी@}] having a faultless udder. अच्छिद्रोध्नी पीपयद्यथा<BR> नः सहस्रधारा पयसा मही गौः ॥ Rv. 10. 133. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0030-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छिद्रकाण्डम्
अच्छिद्र + -काण्डम् N. of a chapter of the तैत्तिरीय ब्राह्मण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0030-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छिन्न|अच्छिन्नं
अच्छिन्न [न˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Uninterrupted, continuous, constant; ˚शिवसंकल्पमन्तःकरणमस्तु<BR> ते Mv. 4. 36 undisturbed in its holy thoughts, ever cherishing holy<BR> thoughts; ˚अमलसन्तानाः सरितः कीर्तयश्च ते Ku. 6. 69.<BR>—2 Not cut or divided, undivided, uninjured; inseparable.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अच्छिन्नपर्णः, अच्छिन्नपत्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0030-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छिन्नपर्णः|अच्छिन्नपर्ण
अच्छिन्न + -पर्णः, -पत्रः [अच्छिन्नानि सततानि पर्णानि पत्राणि वा यस्य]<BR> N. of trees having constant leaves; particularly of the tree called शाखोटक;<BR> (of birds) having uncut or uninjured wings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0030-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छिन्नपत्रः|अच्छिन्नपत्र|अछिन्नपत्र
अच्छिन्न + -पर्णः, -पत्रः [अच्छिन्नानि सततानि पर्णानि पत्राणि वा यस्य]<BR> N. of trees having constant leaves; particularly of the tree called शाखोटक;<BR> (of birds) having uncut or uninjured wings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0030-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अच्छेदिक
