अच्युतवासः|अच्युतवास
अच्युत + -आवासः, -वासः the sacred fig-tree. (Mar. पिंपळ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0030-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

