अजलोमी
अज + -लोमन्, -लोमी, -लोमा [अजस्य लोमेव लोममञ्जरी यस्य -स्याः वा]<BR> cowage, Carpopogon Pruriens (Mar. कुहिली).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजलोमा
अज + -लोमन्, -लोमी, -लोमा [अजस्य लोमेव लोममञ्जरी यस्य -स्याः वा]<BR> cowage, Carpopogon Pruriens (Mar. कुहिली).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजवस्तिः|अजवस्ति
अज + -वस्तिः [अजस्य वस्तिरिव वस्तिर्यस्य] N. of a sage, or of<BR> a tribe sprung from him.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजवीथिः|अजवीथि
अज + -वीथिः, -वीथी <i>f.</i> [अजेन ब्रह्मणा निर्मिता वीथिः शाक˚ त˚]<BR>—1 one of the three divisions of the southern path comprehending the three<BR> asterisms मूल, पूर्वाषाढा and उत्तराषाढा; a sort of heavenly passage<BR> (गगनसेतु, यमनाला); पितृयानोऽजवीथ्याश्च यदगस्त्यस्य चान्तरम् Y. 3. 184.<BR>—2 goatʼs path.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजवीथी
अज + -वीथिः, -वीथी <i>f.</i> [अजेन ब्रह्मणा निर्मिता वीथिः शाक˚ त˚]<BR>—1 one of the three divisions of the southern path comprehending the three<BR> asterisms मूल, पूर्वाषाढा and उत्तराषाढा; a sort of heavenly passage<BR> (गगनसेतु, यमनाला); पितृयानोऽजवीथ्याश्च यदगस्त्यस्य चान्तरम् Y. 3. 184.<BR>—2 goatʼs path.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजशृङ्गी
अज + -शृङ्गी [अजस्य मेषस्य शृङ्गमिव फलं यस्याः सा] N. of a<BR> plant, विषाणी or Odina Wodier, highly medicinal, (Mar. मेंढशिंगी),<BR> See मेषशृङ्गी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजका
अजका = अजिका below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजनम्
अजनम् [अज् भावे ल्युट्] Moving, driving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजनः|अजन|अजनं
अजनम् + .{@-नः@} Brahmā;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजनयोनिजः|अजनयोनिज
अजनम् + .{@-नः@} + ˚योनिजः born from Brahmā; i. e. Dakṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजनिः|अजनि
अजनिः [अज्-अनि] A path, road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजा
अजा [न जायते इत्यजा]<BR>—1 (According to Sāṅkhya Philosophy) Prakṛti or Māyā, the verse which<BR> refers to अजा, (अजामेकां लोहितशुक्लकृष्णाम् &c.) is interpreted<BR> by the Vedāntins as referring to the प्रकृति consisting of तेजस्,<BR> अप् and अन्न. See Ś. B.<BR>—2 A she-goat.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अजागलस्तनः, अजाजीवः, अजापालकः, अजातौल्वलिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजागलस्तनः|अजागलस्तन
अजा + -गलस्तनः the fleshy protuberance or nipple hanging down from<BR> the neck of goats; (fig.) an emblem of anything worthless or useless;<BR> धर्मार्थकाममोक्षाणां यस्यैकोऽपि न विद्यते । ˚स्तनस्येव तस्य जन्म<BR> निरर्थकम् ॥ स्तनवदवलम्बते यः कण्ठे ऽजानां मणिः स विज्ञेयः Bṛ. S. 65. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजाजीवः|अजाजीव
अजा + -जीवः, -पालकः a goat-herd. See अजजीव &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजापालकः|अजापालक
अजा + -जीवः, -पालकः a goat-herd. See अजजीव &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजातौल्वलिः|अजातौल्वलि
अजा + -तौल्वलिः [शाक˚ गण] N. of a sage who lived on the milk<BR> of goats (अजादुग्धेन वर्तमानः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजका
अजका, अजिका (स्वार्थे कन् टाप्)<BR>—1 A young she-goat.<BR>—2 [अजस्य विकारः अवयवः गलस्तनः पुरीषं वा] The fleshy protuberance<BR> on the neck, or its excrement.<BR>—3 A disease of the pupil of the eye.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अजकाजातः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजिका
अजका, अजिका (स्वार्थे कन् टाप्)<BR>—1 A young she-goat.<BR>—2 [अजस्य विकारः अवयवः गलस्तनः पुरीषं वा] The fleshy protuberance<BR> on the neck, or its excrement.<BR>—3 A disease of the pupil of the eye.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अजकाजातः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजकाजातः|अजकाजात
अजका + -जातः [अजकेव जातः] the above disease, (अजापुरीषप्रतिमो<BR> रुजावान् सलोहितो लोहितपिच्छिलास्रः । विदार्य कृष्णं प्रचयोऽभ्युपैति तं<BR> चाजकाजातमिति व्यवस्येत् ॥)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजकवः|अजकव|अजकवं
अजकवः, -वम्<BR> The bow of Śiva (शिवो हि अनेनैव धनुषा त्रिपुरासुरस्य<BR> वधेन अजं विष्णुं कं ब्रह्माणं च अवात् प्रीणयामास इति तस्य धनुषोऽजकवत्वम्,<BR> अजकौ वातीति Tv.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजकवम्
अजकवः, -वम्<BR> The bow of Śiva (शिवो हि अनेनैव धनुषा त्रिपुरासुरस्य<BR> वधेन अजं विष्णुं कं ब्रह्माणं च अवात् प्रीणयामास इति तस्य धनुषोऽजकवत्वम्,<BR> अजकौ वातीति Tv.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजकावः|अजकाव|अजकावं
अजकावः, -वम्<BR>—1 Śivaʼs bow.<BR>—2 [अजकं छागं वाति प्रीणाति; वा-क] N. of the tree वर्वरी (Mar.<BR> तिळवण) of which goats are said to be very fond.<BR>—3 [अजका अजागलस्तन इव वाति प्रकाशते वा-क] A sacrificial vessel<BR> of wood (of the form of अजागल) dedicated to Mitra and Varuṇa<BR>.(-वम् in this sense) मैत्रावरुणपात्रम्<BR>—4 A disease of the pupil of the eye = अजकाजात q. v.<BR>—5 A venomous kind of vermin Cantipede or scorpion (अजका रोगविशेषः, तद्विषम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजकावम्
अजकावः, -वम्<BR>—1 Śivaʼs bow.<BR>—2 [अजकं छागं वाति प्रीणाति; वा-क] N. of the tree वर्वरी (Mar.<BR> तिळवण) of which goats are said to be very fond.<BR>—3 [अजका अजागलस्तन इव वाति प्रकाशते वा-क] A sacrificial vessel<BR> of wood (of the form of अजागल) dedicated to Mitra and Varuṇa<BR>.(-वम् in this sense) मैत्रावरुणपात्रम्<BR>—4 A disease of the pupil of the eye = अजकाजात q. v.<BR>—5 A venomous kind of vermin Cantipede or scorpion (अजका रोगविशेषः, तद्विषम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजगम्
अजगम् [अजं विष्णुं गच्छति शरत्वेन गम्-ड] Śivaʼs bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजगः|अजग|अजगं
अजगम् + .{@-गः@}<BR>—1 [अजेन ब्रह्मणा गम्यते गीयते वा, कर्मणि गम्-ड, गै-क] N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 [अजेन गच्छति अजं छागं यज्ञाङ्गत्वेन गच्छति वा] Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0031-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अजगर|अजगरः
