अट्
अट् €1 P. (rarely Ā.) (अटति, आट, अटितुम्, अटित). To wander or<BR> roam about (with loc.); roam over (sometimes with acc.); भो वटो भिक्षामट<BR> Sk. go to beg alms; आट नैकटिकाश्रमान् Bk. 4. 12; महीमटन् Dk. 38<BR>━<i>desid.</i> अटिटिषति. ━<i>freq.</i> अटाट्यते to wander about<BR> habitually, as a religious mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट
