अट्टनम्
अट्टनम् + .{@-नम्@} [भावे ल्युट्] Disregard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अट्टाट्टः|अट्टाट्ट
अट्टाट्टः [अट्टट्टवत् न पररूपम्]<BR>—1 Overbearing conduct, contempt, disdain.<BR>—2 Excess, superiority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

