अडुकः
अडुकः A deer; (Nigh.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अड्ड्
अड्ड् €1 P.<BR>—1 To join.<BR>—2 To attack.<BR>—3 To argue, infer, discern, meditate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अड्डनम्
