अणी
अणिः <i>m.</i>, -णी<BR> [अणति शब्दायते अण्-इन्]<BR>—1 The point of a needle.<BR>—2 A linch-pin, the pin or bolt at the end of a pole of carriage. अणीकृत्वैलपत्रं<BR> च Mb. 7. 202. 73.<BR>—3 A limit.<BR>—4 The corner of a house (used for killing animals &c.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अणिमाण्डव्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणिमाण्डव्यः|अणिमाण्डव्य
अणिः + -माण्डव्यः [अण्या चिह्नितो माण्डव्यः] N. of a sage said to have<BR> been impaled on an अणी or linch-pin. स तथान्तर्गतेनैव शूलेन<BR> व्यचरन् मुनिः । … अणीमाण्डव्य इति च ततो लोकेषु गीयते ॥ Mb. 1. 108. 7-8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणु|अणुः
अणु <i>a.</i> (णु-ण्वी <i>f.</i>) [अण्-उन्] Minute, small, little,<BR> atomic (opp. स्थूल, महत्); अणोरणीयान् Bg. 8. 9; सर्वोप्ययं<BR> नन्वणुः Bh. 3. 26 insignificantly small; अण्वपि भयम् Ms. 6. 40;<BR> अण्वपि याच्यमानः Pt. 4. 26 asked but an atom, a very small quantity,<BR> न कन्यायाः पिता विद्वान् गृह्णीयात् शुल्कमण्वपि Ms. 3. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुः|अणु
अणु + .{@-णुः@}<BR>—1 An atom, a very small particle (an exceedingly small measure); the<BR> mote in a sunbeam, the smallest perceptible quantity; अस्थूलमनण्वह्नण्वमदीर्घं<BR> ब्रह्म; अणुं पर्वतीकृ Bh. 2. 78 to magnify; cf. also ‘To make mountains of mole-hills’<BR>.<BR>—2 An atom of time (व्यञ्जनमर्धमात्रा तदर्धम् अणु); it is said<BR> to be 54,675,000th part of a Muhūrta (48 minutes).<BR>—3 N. of Śiva. —4 N. of very small grain such as सर्षप, चीनक &c.,<BR> अनणुषु दशमांशोऽणुष्वथैकादशांशः Līlā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणु|अणुः
अणु + .{@-णु@} <i>n.</i> the fourth part of a Mātrā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अण्वन्तः, अणुतैलम्, अणुभा, अणुमात्र, अणुरेणुः, अणुरेवती, अणुवादः, अणुवीक्षणम्, अणुव्रतानि, अणुव्रीहिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अण्वन्तः|अण्वन्त
अणु + -अन्तः [अणुः अन्तो यस्य] a hair-splitting question; (अण्वन्तः<BR> सूक्ष्मान्तः सुक्ष्मवस्तुनिर्णयान्तः प्रश्नः Śaṅkara.). किमर्थमचारीः<BR> पशूनिच्छन्नण्वन्तानिति Bṛ. Up. 4. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुतैलम्
अणु + -तैलम् N. of a medicinal oil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुभा
अणु + -भा [अण्वी सूक्ष्मा भा प्रभा यस्याः सा] lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुमात्र
अणु + -मात्र <i>a.</i> [अणुः परिमाणं यस्य अणु-मात्रच्] of the size of an atom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुरेणुः|अणुरेणु
अणु + -रेणुः [कर्म˚] atomic dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुरेवती
अणु + -रेवती [अणुः सूक्ष्मा रेवतीतारेव] N. of a plant<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">Page0037-2</a>]<BR> (दन्तीवृक्ष) Croton Polyandrum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुवादः|अणुवाद
अणु + -वादः the doctrine of atoms, atomic theory, the theory that all<BR> material substances are primarily atoms and secondarily aggregates, and<BR> that all atoms are eternal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुवीक्षणम्
अणु + -वीक्षणम् [ष˚ त˚]<BR>—1 minute observation, observation of very minute parts.<BR>—2 [अणुः सूक्ष्मो वीक्ष्यते अनेन करणे ल्युट्] an instrument, like the<BR> microscope, enabling one to discern the smallest objects.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुव्रतानि
अणु + -व्रतानि N. of the twelve smaller vows of laymen adhering to the Jain faith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुव्रीहिः|अणुव्रीहि
अणु + -व्रीहिः [कर्म˚] a fine sort of grain, rice &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणिमन्
अणिमन् <i>m.</i> [अणु-इमनिच्], अणुता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Minuteness, smallness, thinness, leanness, fineness.<BR>—2 Atomic nature.<BR>—3 The superhuman power of becoming as small as an atom, one of the 8<BR> powers or Siddhis of Śiva; (अणिमा लघिमा प्राप्तिः प्राकाम्यं महिमा तथा ।<BR> ईशित्वं च वशित्वं च तथा कामावसायिता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

