अणिमन् <i>m.</i> [अणु-इमनिच्], अणुता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Minuteness, smallness, thinness, leanness, fineness.<BR>—2 Atomic nature.<BR>—3 The superhuman power of becoming as small as an atom, one of the 8<BR> powers or Siddhis of Śiva; (अणिमा लघिमा प्राप्तिः प्राकाम्यं महिमा तथा ।<BR> ईशित्वं च वशित्वं च तथा कामावसायिता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुक|अणुकः
अणुक <i>a.</i> [स्वार्थे कन्]<BR>—1 Very small, atomic.<BR>—2 Subtle, too fine.<BR>—3 Acute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणुकः|अणुक
अणुक + .{@-कः@} A small kind of grain. See अणु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अण्यम्
अण्यम् A kind of head of an arrow; Dhanur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अण्वम्
अण्वम् Ved. A fine hole in the strainer for the Soma juice (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अण्वी
अण्वी Ved. A finger (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अणीयस्
