अठ्
अण्ठ् €1 Ā. (also अठ्) अण्ठते अटते To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

