अण्डजः|अण्डज
अण्डः + -ज + .({@-जः@})<BR>—1 a bird, oviparous being; मूकाण्डजम् (काननम्) Ku. 3. 42.<BR>—2 a fish.<BR>—3 a snake.<BR>—4 a lizard.<BR>—5 Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

