अतिद्वय
अतिद्वय <i>a.</i> [द्वयमतिक्रान्तः; नास्ति द्वयं यस्य वा] Surpassing<BR> the two (बृहत्कथा and वासवदत्ता), or having no second or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">Page0042-2</a>]<BR> equal, incomparable, matchless; धिया निबद्धेयमतिद्वयी कथा K. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिधन्वन्
अतिधन्वन् <i>m.</i> [अत्युत्कृष्टं धनुर्यस्य]<BR>—1 An unrivalled archer or warrior.<BR>—2 That which surpasses a मरु or desert [धन्वानमतिक्रान्तः].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिधर्मः|अतिधर्म
अतिधर्मः The highest type of Dharma; Rām. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिधृतिः|अतिधृति
अतिधृतिः <i>f.</i> [अतिक्रान्ता धृतिम् अष्टादशाक्षरपादां वृत्तिम् एकाक्षराधिक्यात्]<BR>—1 N. of a class of metres belonging to the अतिच्छन्दस् group, consisting<BR> of 4 lines with 19 syllables in each (षट्सप्ततिस्त्वतिधृतिः).<BR>—2 Nineteen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिधेनु
अतिधेनु <i>a.</i> Distinguished for his cows (P. I. 4. 3. comm.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनामन्
अतिनामन् N. of a ṛṣi of the Saptarṣi group of the sixth Manvantara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनाष्ट्र
अतिनाष्ट्र <i>a.</i> Ved. Out of danger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनिचृत्
अतिनिचृ(वृ)त् <i>f.</i> N. of a Vedic metre of 3 Pādas, the number<BR> of syllables in each being respectively 7, 6 and 7; (षट्कः सप्तकयोर्मध्ये<BR> स्तोतॄणां विवाचीति । यस्याः सातिनिवृन्नाम गायत्री द्विदशाक्षरा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनिवृत्
अतिनिचृ(वृ)त् <i>f.</i> N. of a Vedic metre of 3 Pādas, the number<BR> of syllables in each being respectively 7, 6 and 7; (षट्कः सप्तकयोर्मध्ये<BR> स्तोतॄणां विवाचीति । यस्याः सातिनिवृन्नाम गायत्री द्विदशाक्षरा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनिद्रा
अतिनिद्रा Excessive sleeping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनिद्द्र
अतिनिद्रा + .{@-द्र@} <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Given to excessive sleep.<BR>—2 Without sleep, sleepless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनिद्द्रम्
अतिनिद्रा + .{@-द्रम्@} <i>ind.</i> Past sleeping time (निद्रा सम्प्रति न युज्यते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनिर्हारिन्
अतिनिर्हारिन् <i>a.</i> Very attractive (as an attributive of smell);<BR> आमोदः सोऽतिनिर्हारी Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनौ
अतिनौ, -नु <i>a.</i><BR> [अतिक्रान्तो नावम्] Disembarked, landed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिनु
अतिनौ, -नु <i>a.</i><BR> [अतिक्रान्तो नावम्] Disembarked, landed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपञ्चा|अतिपंचा
अतिपञ्चा [पञ्चवर्षमतिक्रान्ता] A girl past five.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपत्
अतिपत् €1 P.<BR>—1 To pass over; neglect, omit, transgress.<BR>—2 To fly by, beyond or over; to cross. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To delay, neglect; see अतिपात्य below.<BR>—2 To disrespect, offend; ये सत्यमेव हि गुरूनतिपातयन्ति Mu. 3. 33.<BR> transgress, violate; अतिपातितकालसाधना Ki. 2. 42.<BR>—3 To cause to fly past or by.<BR>—4 To make ineffectual; संशमनमेवं संशोधनमतिपातयति Suśr.<BR>—5 To snatch away, drag away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपतनम्
अतिपतनम् Flying past or beyond; omission, neglect, missing, transgressing;<BR> exceeding, going beyond due bounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपातः|अतिपात
अतिपातः<BR>—1 Passing away, lapse (of time); अहो काल˚ तः Māl. 2.<BR>—2 Neglect, omission; transgression; न चेदन्यकार्यातिपातः Ś. 1<BR> if no other duty be neglected thereby, if it should not interfere with<BR> (the discharge of) any other duty; deviation from established laws or customs.<BR>—3 Befalling, occurrence; दुःखातिपातेन कलुषीक्रियन्ते. K. 289; जलधारातिपातः 302 falling.<BR>—4 Ill-treatment, or usage.<BR>—5 Opposition, contrariety.<BR>—6 Destruction; प्राणातिपातनिरतो निरनुकोशतां गतः Rām. 1. 59. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपातित
अतिपातित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Put off, delayed &c.<BR>—2 Quite or entirely broken; अस्थि निःशेषतच्छिन्नमतिपातितम् Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपातितम्
अतिपातित + .{@-तम्@} Complete fracture of a bone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपातिन्
अतिपातिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Acute, running a rapid course.<BR>—2 Surpassing in speed, swifter than (in comp.); ततार विद्याः पवनातिपातिभिर्दिशो<BR> हरिद्भिर्हरिताभिवेश्वरः R. 3. 30. अतिपाति कार्यमिदम् । पञ्चरात्रम् 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपात्य
अतिपात्य <i>pot. p.</i> To be delayed or put off; काममनतिपात्यं<BR> धर्मकार्यं देवस्य Ś. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपत्रः|अतिपत्र
अतिपत्रः [अतिरिक्तं बृहत् पत्रं यस्य] The teak tree, or the<BR> हस्तिकन्दवृक्ष. (Mar. साग).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपथिन्
अतिपथिन् <i>m.</i> A better road than common, a good road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपद्
अतिपद् €4 Ā.<BR>—1 To go beyond; spring over.<BR>—2 To neglect, omit, transgress. ━<i>Caus.</i> To allow to pass by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपद
अतिपद <i>a.</i> [अतिक्रान्तः पदम्]<BR>—1 Having no feet.<BR>—2 Too long by one foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपत्तिः|अतिपत्ति
अतिपत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Going beyond, passing, lapse; देशकालातिपत्तौ च गृहीत्वा स्वयमर्पयेत् Y. 2. 169.<BR>—2 Non-performance, failure; लिङ्निमित्ते ऌङ् क्रियातिपत्तौ P. III. 3. 139.<BR> (the conditional is used instead of the potential, when the non-performance<BR> of an action is implied).<BR>—3 [पत्तिम् अतिक्रान्तः] One surpassing a foot-soldier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपन्न
अतिपन्न <i>p. p.</i> Gone beyond, transgressed, missed, past &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपर|अतिपरः
अतिपर <i>a.</i> One who has vanquished his enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपरः|अतिपर
अतिपर + .{@-रः@} A great or superior enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपरिचयः|अतिपरिचय
अतिपरिचयः Excessive familiarity or intimacy; Prov अतिपरिचयादवज्ञा<BR> ‘Familiarity breeds contempt’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपरोक्ष
अतिपरोक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Far out of sight, not discernible; ˚वृत्ति obsolete (words).<BR>—2 Not hidden, visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपातकम्
अतिपातकम् A very heinous sin, incest, (मातृगमनं दुहितृगमनं<BR> स्नुषागमनं पुंसां; पुत्रपितृश्वशुरगमनं च स्त्रीणां, अतिपातकानि उच्यन्ते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपादनिचृत्
अतिपादनिचृ(वृ)त् <i>f.</i> N. of a Vedic Metre of 3 pādas, the number<BR> of syllables in each being respectively 6, 8 and 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिपादनिवृत्
अतिपादनिचृ(वृ)त् <i>f.</i> N. of a Vedic Metre of 3 pādas, the number<BR> of syllables in each being respectively 6, 8 and 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रबन्धः|अतिप्रबन्ध|अतिप्रबंधः
अतिप्रबन्धः Great continuity; ˚प्रहितास्त्रवृष्टिभिः R. 3. 58.<BR> very rapidly or in rapid succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रगे
अतिप्रगे <i>ind.</i> Very early in the morning, in the early dawn. नातिप्रगे<BR> नातिसायं न सायं प्रातराशितः (भुञ्जीत). Ms. 4. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रवृद्ध
अतिप्रवृद्ध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Overbearing क्षत्रस्यातिप्रवृद्धस्य Ms. 6. 320.<BR>—2 Grown very much.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रश्नः|अतिप्रश्न
अतिप्रश्नः [अतिक्रम्य मर्यादां प्रश्नः] A question about transcendental<BR> truths; a vexatious or extravagant question that is asked, though a satisfactory<BR> reply has already been given; <i>e. g.</i> Vālākiʼs question to Yājñavalkya<BR> about Brahman in बृहदारण्यकोपनिषद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रसङ्गः|अतिप्रसङ्ग|अतिप्रसंग|अतिप्रसंगः
अतिप्रसङ्गः, -प्रसक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Excessive attachment; नातिप्रसङ्गः प्रमदासु कार्यः Pt. 1. 187;<BR> स्त्रीष्वतिप्रसङ्गात् Dk. 101.<BR>—2 Over-rudeness, impertinence; तद्विरमातिप्रसङ्गात् U. 5; मा भूत्पुनर्वत<BR> कथंचिदतिप्रसङ्गः Mv. 3. 16 indiscretion or imprudence; यदेतावतः<BR> परिभवातिप्रसङ्गस्य तुल्यं स्यात् Mv. 5 an insult.<BR>—3 Extraordinary or unwarrantable stretch of a (grammatical) rule, or<BR> principle; also = अतिव्याप्ति q. v.<BR>—4 A very close contact; अतिप्रसङ्गाद्विहितागसो मुहुः Ki. 8. 33 (अविच्छेदसङ्ग).<BR>—5 Prolixity; अलमतिप्रसङ्गेन Mu. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रसक्तिः|अतिप्रसक्ति
अतिप्रसङ्गः, -प्रसक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Excessive attachment; नातिप्रसङ्गः प्रमदासु कार्यः Pt. 1. 187;<BR> स्त्रीष्वतिप्रसङ्गात् Dk. 101.<BR>—2 Over-rudeness, impertinence; तद्विरमातिप्रसङ्गात् U. 5; मा भूत्पुनर्वत<BR> कथंचिदतिप्रसङ्गः Mv. 3. 16 indiscretion or imprudence; यदेतावतः<BR> परिभवातिप्रसङ्गस्य तुल्यं स्यात् Mv. 5 an insult.<BR>—3 Extraordinary or unwarrantable stretch of a (grammatical) rule, or<BR> principle; also = अतिव्याप्ति q. v.<BR>—4 A very close contact; अतिप्रसङ्गाद्विहितागसो मुहुः Ki. 8. 33 (अविच्छेदसङ्ग).<BR>—5 Prolixity; अलमतिप्रसङ्गेन Mu. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रेषितम्
अतिप्रेषितम् The time after the ceremony in which the प्रैष Mantras are used.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिप्रौढा
अतिप्रौढा A girl who has attained a marriageable age, a grown up girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिबल|अतिबलः
अतिबल <i>a.</i> Very stronger or powerful; जयत्यतिबलो रामो लक्ष्मणश्च<BR> महाबलः Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिबलः|अतिबल
अतिबल + .{@-लः@} An eminent or matchless warrior (अतिरथ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिबलम्
अतिबल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 Great strength or power.<BR>—2 A powerful army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिबला
अतिबल + .{@-ला@}<BR>—1 N. of a medicinal plant, Sidonia Cordifolia and Rhombifolia (Mar. चिकणा, चिकणी)<BR>—2 N. of a powerful charm or lore taught by Viśvāmitra to Rāma:− गृहाण<BR> द्वे इमे विद्ये बलामतिबलां तथा । न ते श्रमो जराऽऽवाभ्यां भविता नाङ्गवैकृतम्<BR> ॥ न च सुप्तं प्रमत्तं वा धर्षयिष्यन्ति नैरृताः । न च ते सदृशो राम<BR> वीर्येणान्यो भविष्यति ॥ सदेवनरनागेषु लोकेष्विह पुमांस्त्रिषु । न सौभाग्ये<BR> न दाक्षिण्ये न बुद्धिश्रुतिपौरुषे ॥ नोत्तरे प्रतिपत्तव्ये त्वत्तुल्यो वा<BR> भविष्यति । एतद्विद्याद्वयं प्राप्य यशश्चाव्ययमाप्स्यसि ॥ बलामतिबलां<BR> चैव ज्ञानविज्ञानमातरौ । क्षुत्पिपासे च ते राम नात्यर्थं पीडयिष्यतः<BR> ॥ जयश्च दुर्गकान्तारप्रदेशेष्वटवीषु च । सारतां त्रिषु लोकेषु गमिष्यसि<BR> च राघव ॥ पितामहसुते ह्येते विद्ये चायुर्बलावहे । Rām. 1. 22.<BR> See तौ बलातिबलयोः प्रभावतो R. 11. 9 also.<BR>—3 N. of one of Dakṣaʼs daughters.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिबालक|अतिबालकः
अतिबालक <i>a.</i> Childish puerile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिबालकः|अतिबालक
अतिबालक + .{@-कः@} An infant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिबाला
अतिबाला [अतिक्रान्ता बाल्यावस्थाम्] A cow two years old; वर्षमात्रा<BR> तु बाला स्यादतिबाला द्विवार्षिकी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिबाहुः|अतिबाहु
अतिबाहुः Having extraordinary arms. N. of a ऋषि of the fourteenth<BR> Manvantara. Hariv.; N. of a Gandharva; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिब्रह्मचर्यम्
अतिब्रह्मचर्यम् Over continence, or abstinence (opp. अतिमैथुनम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिब्रह्मचर्यः|अतिब्रह्मचर्य|अतिब्रह्मचर्यं|अतिब्रह्मचर्य्य
अतिब्रह्मचर्यम् + .{@-र्यः@} [अतिक्रान्तो ब्रह्मचर्यम्] One who has violated the studentʼs<BR> life, who cohabits with women.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभङ्गम्
अतिभङ्गम् A pose in which the idol is bent in more than two or three<BR> places; आभङ्गं समभङ्गं च अतिभङ्गं त्रिधा भवेत् । Māna. 67. 95-96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभरः|अतिभर
अतिभ(भा)रः<BR>—1 Excessive burden, great load; कोऽतिभारः समर्थानाम् Pt. 1. 22;<BR> इति मनसि न्यस्तचिन्तातिभारः Ratn. 3. 5; सा मुक्तकण्ठं व्यसनातिभारात्<BR> चकन्द R. 14. 62 through excessive grief; दुःखातिभारोऽपि लघुः स<BR> मेने Ki. 3. 33.<BR>—2 Speed.<BR>—3 Excessive obscurity (of a sentence).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अतिभरग<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभारः|अतिभार
अतिभ(भा)रः<BR>—1 Excessive burden, great load; कोऽतिभारः समर्थानाम् Pt. 1. 22;<BR> इति मनसि न्यस्तचिन्तातिभारः Ratn. 3. 5; सा मुक्तकण्ठं व्यसनातिभारात्<BR> चकन्द R. 14. 62 through excessive grief; दुःखातिभारोऽपि लघुः स<BR> मेने Ki. 3. 33.<BR>—2 Speed.<BR>—3 Excessive obscurity (of a sentence).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अतिभरग<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभरग
अतिभरः + -ग [अतिभारं गृहीत्वापि गच्छति] a mule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभारिक
अतिभारिक <i>a.</i> Very heavy (burdensome) राक्षसः -यदि न गुह्यं<BR> नातिभारिकं वा ततः श्रोतुमिच्छामि । after Mu. 6. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभीः
अतिभीः <i>f.</i> [अति बिभेति अस्याः दर्शनात्; भी-क्विप्] Lightning<BR> flash of Indraʼs thunderbolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभू
अतिभू €1 P.<BR>—1 To spring forth, arise; शब्दश्च घोरोऽतिबभूव Mb.<BR>—2 To surpass, excel; to overcome, subdue, overpower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभवः|अतिभव
अतिभवः Surpassing, defeating, conquering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभू
अतिभू <i>a.</i> Surpassing all, epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभूमिः|अतिभूमि
अतिभूमिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Excess, culmination, highest pitch; ˚मिं गम्-या to go to excess,<BR> to reach the climax; ˚मिं तस्या अभिनिवेशो गमिष्यति Māl. 2; ˚मिं<BR> गतोनुरागः 7; तत्र सर्वलोकस्य ˚मिं गतः प्रवादः <i>ibid.</i><BR> widely known, become notorious, noised abroad; ˚मिमयं गतो न शक्यते<BR> निवर्तयितुम K. 156; सर्वोत्सवानामतिभूमिमिवाधिशयाना 158; सर्वपौरुषातिभूमिः<BR> Dk. 30; ˚मिं गतेन रणरणकेन U. 1, प्रणयातिभूमिमगमन् Śi. 9. 78, 10. 80.<BR>—2 Boldness, impropriety, violation of due limits (अमर्यादा); विपदि<BR> न दूषितातिभूमिः Śi. 3. 20.<BR>—3 Eminence, superiority.<BR>—4 Extensive land.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिभोजनम्
अतिभोजनम् Voracity, surfeiting oneself, excess in eating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमङ्गल्य|अतिमंगल्य|अतिमङ्गल्यः
अतिमङ्गल्य <i>a.</i> Very auspicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमङ्गल्यः|अतिमङ्गल्य|अतिमंगल्य
अतिमङ्गल्य + .{@-ल्यः@} N. of a tree (बिल्ववृक्ष).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमतिः|अतिमति
अतिमतिः <i>f.</i>, -मानः<BR>—1 Haughtiness, too great pride; अतिमानश्च बालश्च दुर्विनीतश्च Rām. 6. 87. 27.<BR> अतिमाने च कौरवाः Cāṇ. 50.<BR>—2 extent तरुणगणिकागणजेगीयमानयातिमानया Dk. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमानः|अतिमान
अतिमतिः <i>f.</i>, -मानः<BR>—1 Haughtiness, too great pride; अतिमानश्च बालश्च दुर्विनीतश्च Rām. 6. 87. 27.<BR> अतिमाने च कौरवाः Cāṇ. 50.<BR>—2 extent तरुणगणिकागणजेगीयमानयातिमानया Dk. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमान|अतिमानः
अतिमान <i>a.</i> [मानमतिक्रान्तः] Immeasurable, very great or wide<BR> (as fame); ˚नया कीर्त्या Dk. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमर्त्य
अतिमर्त्य, -मानुष <i>a.</i><BR> Superhuman. कृतवान्किल वीर्याणि सह रामेण केशवः ।<BR> अतिमर्त्यानि … Bhāg. 1. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमानुष
अतिमर्त्य, -मानुष <i>a.</i><BR> Superhuman. कृतवान्किल वीर्याणि सह रामेण केशवः ।<BR> अतिमर्त्यानि … Bhāg. 1. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमर्याद|अतिमर्य्याद|अतिमर्य्यादः
अतिमर्याद <i>a.</i> Exceeding due limits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमर्शः|अतिमर्श
अतिमर्शः Close contact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमांस
अतिमांस <i>a.</i> [अतिशयितं मांसं यत्र] Fleshy, plump, fat,<BR> as जड्वा, अधरोष्ठ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमात्र|अतिमात्रं
अतिमात्र <i>a.</i> [अतिक्रान्तो मात्राम्, अतिशयिता मात्रा प्रमाणं यस्य<BR> वा] Exceeding the proper measure, inordinate, excessive; ˚भास्वरत्वम्<BR> M. 1. 13; (in comp.) very much, beyond measure; ˚सुदुःसहानि Ś. 4. 3<BR> quite insupportable; ˚लोहिततलौ 1. 29; मुनिव्रतैस्त्वामतिमात्रकर्शिता Ku. 5. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमात्रम्
अतिमात्र + .{@-त्रम्, -मात्रशः@} <i>ind.</i> Beyond measure, inordinately, excessively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमात्रशः
अतिमात्र + .{@-त्रम्, -मात्रशः@} <i>ind.</i> Beyond measure, inordinately, excessively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमाय
अतिमाय <i>a.</i> [मायामतिक्रान्तः] Finally liberated, emancipated<BR> from the Māyā or illusion of the world. अद्भुताकृतिमिमामतिमायस्त्वं<BR> बिभर्षि करुणामय मायाम् Ki. 18. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमारुत|अतिमारुतः
अतिमारुत <i>a.</i> Very windy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमारुतः|अतिमारुत
अतिमारुत + .{@-तः, -वातः@} A strong hurricane, storm, violent gust of wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवातः|अतिवात
अतिमारुत + .{@-तः, -वातः@} A strong hurricane, storm, violent gust of wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमित
अतिमित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Over-measured, excessive.<BR>—2 [अ-तिमित] Not wet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमित्रम्
अतिमित्रम् A great friend, epithet of a very friendly constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमुक्त|अतिमुक्तः
अतिमुक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Entirely free from worldly desires, finally emancipated.<BR>—2 Barren, seedless.<BR>—3 Surpassing, (a necklace of) pearls; अतिमुक्तमद्ग्रथितकेसरावली Māl. 5. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमुक्तः|अतिमुक्त
अतिमुक्त + .{@-क्तः, -क्तकः@}<BR>—1 A kind of creeper (माधवी, Mar. कुसरी or कस्तुरमोगरा)<BR> represented as twisting itself round the mango tree and as the beloved<BR> of that tree; cf. क इदानीं सहकारमन्तरेणातिमुक्तलतां पल्लवितां<BR> सहते Ś. 3; परिगृहाण गते सहकारतां त्वमतिमुक्तलताचरितं<BR> मयि M. 4. 13.<BR>—2 N. of a tree, Dalbergia Oujeinensis (तिनिश).<BR>—3 (˚क्तकः) Mountain ebony; N. of a tree called हरिमन्थ (तिन्दुकवृक्ष,<BR> तालवृक्ष also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमुक्तकः|अतिमुक्तक
अतिमुक्त + .{@-क्तः, -क्तकः@}<BR>—1 A kind of creeper (माधवी, Mar. कुसरी or कस्तुरमोगरा)<BR> represented as twisting itself round the mango tree and as the beloved<BR> of that tree; cf. क इदानीं सहकारमन्तरेणातिमुक्तलतां पल्लवितां<BR> सहते Ś. 3; परिगृहाण गते सहकारतां त्वमतिमुक्तलताचरितं<BR> मयि M. 4. 13.<BR>—2 N. of a tree, Dalbergia Oujeinensis (तिनिश).<BR>—3 (˚क्तकः) Mountain ebony; N. of a tree called हरिमन्थ (तिन्दुकवृक्ष,<BR> तालवृक्ष also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमुक्तिः|अतिमुक्ति
अतिमुक्तिः <i>f.</i>, -मोक्षः<BR> Final liberation (from death). तद्येयं वाक् सोऽयमग्निः<BR> स होता स मुक्तिः सातिमुक्तिः । Bṛ. Up. 3. 1. 3. तद्यदिदं मनः<BR> सोऽसौ चन्द्रः स ब्रह्मा स मुक्तिः सातिमुक्तिरित्यतिमोक्षा अय संपदः ।<BR> Bṛ. Up. 3. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमोक्षः|अतिमोक्ष
अतिमुक्तिः <i>f.</i>, -मोक्षः<BR> Final liberation (from death). तद्येयं वाक् सोऽयमग्निः<BR> स होता स मुक्तिः सातिमुक्तिः । Bṛ. Up. 3. 1. 3. तद्यदिदं मनः<BR> सोऽसौ चन्द्रः स ब्रह्मा स मुक्तिः सातिमुक्तिरित्यतिमोक्षा अय संपदः ।<BR> Bṛ. Up. 3. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमृत्यु|अतिमृत्युः
अतिमृत्यु <i>a.</i> Overcoming death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमृत्युः|अतिमृत्यु
अतिमृत्यु + .{@-त्युः@} Final liberation from death (मोक्ष); तमेव विदित्वाऽतिमृत्युमेति<BR> नान्यः पन्था विद्यते Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिमोदा
अतिमोदा<BR>—1 Very great fragrance.<BR>—2 N. of a plant नवमल्लिका, Jasminum Heterophyllum or Arboreum.<BR> (Mar. मोगरी)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतियवः|अतियव
अतियवः A kind of barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतियशस्
अतियशस् <i>a.</i> Very famous; इति तेनातियशसा राक्षसेनाभिचोदिता<BR> Rām. 6. 89. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतियात
अतियात <i>a.</i> Very speedy, Mb. 3. 201. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतियोगः|अतियोग
अतियोगः Over-flow, excess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरंहस्
अतिरंहस् <i>a.</i> Very fleet or swift; सारङ्गेणातिरंहसा Ś. 1. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरक्त
अतिरक्त <i>a.</i> Very red or very much attached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरक्ता
अतिरक्त + .{@-क्ता@} N. of one of the 7 tongues of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरथः|अतिरथ
अतिरथः [अतिक्रान्तो रथं रथिनम्] An unrivalled warrior, fighting<BR> from his car (अमितान् योधयेद्यस्तु संप्रोक्तोऽतिरथस्तु सः); दत्त्वाऽभयं<BR> सोऽतिरथः Ve. 3. 28. Several Atirathas are mentioned in Bhārata Udyogaparvan<BR> (रथातिरथसंख्यानपर्व ९) मद्रराजो महेष्वासः शल्यो मेऽतिरथो<BR> मतः Mb. 5. 165. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरभसः|अतिरभस
अतिरभसः Great speed, precipitateness, head-long speed, rashness;<BR> ˚कृतानां कर्मणाम् Bh. 2. 99; दर्शन˚ प्रधावितेन K. 192; great hurry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरसा
अतिरसा (Very juicy) N. of various plants, मूर्वा, रास्ना and क्लीतनक.<BR> (Mar. मोरवेल, रास्ना, ज्येष्ठमध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरागः|अतिराग
अतिरागः Enthusiasm; शिरोऽतिरागाद्दशमं चिकर्तिषुः Śi. 1. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिराजन्
अतिराजन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 An extraordinary or excellent king.<BR>—2 One who surpasses a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरात्र|अतिरात्रः
अतिरात्र <i>a.</i> Ved. [अतिक्रान्तो रात्रिम्] Prepared over night. ब्राह्मणासो<BR> अतिरात्रे न सोमे सरो न पूर्णमभितो वदन्तः Rv. 7. 103. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरात्रः|अतिरात्र
अतिरात्र + .{@-त्रः@} [अतिशायिता रात्रिः, ततः अस्त्यर्थे अच्]<BR>—1 An optional part of the Jyotiṣṭoma sacrifice (एकरात्रसाध्यगवामयने<BR> प्रथमसंस्थः यागभेदः).<BR>—2 Dead of night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरिच्
अतिरिच् (Gen. used in pass.)<BR>—1 To surpass, excel, be superior to (with abl.); अश्वमेधसहस्रेभ्यः<BR> सत्यमेवातिरिच्यते<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">Page0045-1</a>]<BR> H. 4. 131; गृहं तु गृहिणीहीनं कान्तारादतिरिच्यते Pt. 4. 81; वाचः<BR> कर्मातिरिच्यते ‘example is better than precept’; sometimes with acc.;<BR> न च नारायणोऽत्रभवन्तमतिरिच्यते K. 203; or used by itself in<BR> the sense of ‘to be supreme’, ‘prevail’, ‘triumph’, ‘predominate’, ‘be mightier’<BR>; अन्योन्यगुणवैशेष्यान्न किञ्चिदतिरिच्यते Ms. 9. 296 none is<BR> supreme or higher than another; 12. 25; so दैवमत्रातिरिच्यते, स्वभावोऽतिरिच्यते<BR> H. 1. 16; स्वल्पमप्यतिरिच्यते H. 2 is of great importance.<BR>—2 To be left with a surplus, be redundant or superfluous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरिक्त|अतिरिक्तः
अतिरिक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Surpassed, excelled; सर्वातिरिक्तसारेण R. 1. 14 strength exceeding<BR> that of all creatures; सुतजन्मातिरिक्तेन महोत्सवेन K. 137 surpassing<BR> the birth of a son.<BR>—2 Redundant, superfluous, remaining over and above; परिपूरितहृदयातिरिक्तहर्षमिव<BR> K. 66 not contained in the heart.<BR>—3 Excessive, exuberant.<BR>—4 Unequalled, unsurpassed; supreme, elevated समश्नुवानाः सहसा ऽतिरिक्तताम्<BR> Ki. 14. 33 being raised up or elevated.<BR>—5 Different (generally व्यतिरिक्त in this sense, q. v.).<BR>—6 Quite empty.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अतिरिक्ताङ्ग<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरिक्ताङ्ग
अतिरिक्त + -अङ्ग <i>a.</i> having a redundant limb (a finger, toe &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरिक्ताङ्गम्
अतिरिक्त + -अङ्ग + .({@-गम्@}) a redundant limb or member.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरेक|अतिरेकः
अति(ती)रेक [रिच्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Excess, exuberance, excellence, eminence; पौरुषातिरेकः U. 6; so<BR> मद˚, वीर्य˚, गुण˚ &c.<BR>—2 Redundancy, surplus, superfluity.<BR>—3 Difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतीरेक|अतीरेकः
अति(ती)रेक [रिच्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Excess, exuberance, excellence, eminence; पौरुषातिरेकः U. 6; so<BR> मद˚, वीर्य˚, गुण˚ &c.<BR>—2 Redundancy, surplus, superfluity.<BR>—3 Difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरुच्
अतिरुच् <i>m.</i> [रोचते इति रुक् स्त्रीणाम् ऊरुदेशः; अतिक्रान्तो रुचम् Tv.] The knee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरुक्
अतिरुच् + .{@-क्@} <i>f.</i> A very beautiful woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरुचिर
अतिरुचिर <i>a.</i> Very lovely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिरुचिरा
