अतिरूपः|अतिरूप
अतिरूप + .{@-पः@} [अतिक्रान्तो रूपम्] the Supreme Being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

