अतिरोमश|अतिरोमशः
अति(रो)लोमश <i>a.</i> Very hairy, shaggy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

