अतिलङ्घनम्
अतिलङ्घनम्<BR>—1 Excessive fasting.<BR>—2 Transgression; न युक्तमत्रार्यजनातिलङ्घनम् Ki. 14. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

