अतिवक्तृ
अतिवक्तृ <i>a.</i> Very talkative, garrulous; आक्रोष्टा चातिवक्ता च<BR> ब्राह्मणानाम् Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवक्र|अतिवक्रः
अतिवक्र <i>a.</i> Very crooked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवक्रः|अतिवक्र
अतिवक्र + .{@-क्रः@} N. of the five planets (भौम and others); अतिवक्रा नगाष्टके<BR> इति ज्योतिषोक्तं सूर्यस्य सप्तमाष्टमस्थितिवशात् पूर्वगतिविपरीतपश्चाद्गतिशालिभौमादिपञ्चकम् Tv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवयस्
अतिवयस् <i>a.</i> Very old, aged, advanced in years.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवर्णाश्रमिन्|अतिवर्ण्णाश्रमिन्
अतिवर्णाश्रमिन् <i>m.</i> One who is beyond castes and orders (यो वेदान्तमहावाक्यश्रवणेनैव<BR> केवलम् । आत्मानमीश्वरं वेद सो ऽतिवर्णाश्रमी भवेत्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवर्तनम्
अतिवर्तनम् <i>n.</i> Pardonable offence; दशातिवर्तनान्याहुः Ms. 8. 290.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवर्तुल|अतिवर्तुलः|अतिवर्त्तुल|अतिवर्त्तुलः
अतिवर्तुल <i>a.</i> Very round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवर्तुलः|अतिवर्तुल|अतिवर्त्तुल|अतिवर्त्तुलः
अतिवर्तुल + .{@-लः@} N. of a grain or pot-herb (कलायविशेष.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवह्
अतिवह् €1 P. To carry over or across.<BR>.━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To spend, pass (as time); किं वा मयापि न दिनान्यतिवाहितानि Māl. 6. 13;<BR> अतिवाहयां बभूवत्रियामाम् R. 9. 70; ऋतून् 19. 47.<BR>—2 To let pass over, get through successfully; गुहाविसारीण्यतिवाहितानि<BR> मया कथंचिद् घनगर्जितानि R. 13. 28 allowed to pass over my head,<BR> endured; स शापस्तेनातिवाहितः Ks. 33. 91.<BR>—3 To rid oneself of, elude, avoid; अस्मिंस्तमालविटपान्धकारे प्रविश्य<BR> एनमतिवाहयावः Ratn. 2; get out of his way, elude his pursuit (and<BR> thus cheat him).<BR>—4 To transplant, remove (to another place), bring or carry over; अलकामतिवाह्यैव<BR> वसतिं वसुसंपदाम् Ku. 6. 37.<BR>—5 To follow, tread (as a path); लोकातिवाहिते मार्गे Sarva. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवाहः|अतिवाह
अतिवाहः [अतीत्य देहम् अन्यदेहे वाहः प्रापणम् स˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Passing or conveying of the सूक्ष्मशरीर, the subtle principle<BR> of life, to the bodies at the expiry of good actions (अदृष्ट) contributing<BR> to the enjoyment of worldly pleasures.<BR>—2 Carrying over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवाहकः|अतिवाहक
अतिवाहकः [अतीत्य एतं देहं वाहयति देहान्तरं प्रापयति; वह्-ण्वुल्]<BR> The deity or spirit appointed by God to help in the conveying of the जीव<BR> or सूक्ष्मशरीर in the above manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवाहनम्
अतिवाहनम्<BR>—1 Passing, spending.<BR>—2 Excessive toiling or enduring, bearing too much load; too heavy burden; H. 3.<BR>—3 Despatching, sending away, ridding oneself of; कथमस्य˚ न भविष्यति<BR> Pt. 5 how shall I rid myself of him?<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवाहिक
अतिवाहिक <i>a.</i> [अतिवाहोऽस्त्यस्य-ठन्] Able to convey to other<BR> bodies. See अतिवाह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवाहित|अतिवाहितः
अतिवाहित <i>p. p.</i> Spent, passed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवाहितः|अतिवाहित
अतिवाहित + .{@-तः@} An inhabitant of the lower world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवाहितम्
अतिवाहित + .{@-तम्@} (सूक्ष्मशरीरम्) = अतिवाह. q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवादः|अतिवाद
अतिवादः<BR>—1 Very harsh, abusive or insulting language, reproof; यः परेषां नरो<BR> नित्यमतिवादांस्तितिक्षते । देवयानि विजानीहि तेन सर्वमिदं जितम् ॥<BR> Mb. 1. 79. 1. अतिवादांस्तितिक्षेत Ms. 6. 47; reprimand, correction;<BR> अतिवादाद्वदाम्येष मा धर्ममभिशङ्किथाः Mb.<BR>—2 Exaggerated talk, hyperbole (अत्युक्ति); अतिवादं शंसति अतिवादेन<BR> वै देवा असुरान् अत्युद्य अथैनानत्यायन् Ait. Br.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवादिन्
अतिवादिन् <i>a.</i> Talkative, very eloquent; exclusively establishing<BR> oneʼs own assertion; प्राणो ह्येष यः सर्वभूतैर्विभाति विजानन्विद्वान्भवते<BR> नातिवादी Muṇḍ. 3. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवासः|अतिवास
अतिवासः Fast on the day preceding a Śrāddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिविकट|अतिविकटः
अतिविकट <i>a.</i> Very fierce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिविकटः|अतिविकट
अतिविकट + .{@-टः@} A vicious elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिविष
अतिविष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Very poisonous.<BR>—2 Counteracting poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिविषा
अतिविष + .{@-षा@} N. of a poisonous yet highly medicinal plant (Mar. अतिविष<BR> or अतिविख) Aconitum Ferox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिविस्तरः|अतिविस्तर
अतिविस्तरः Prolixity, diffuseness; U. 1; Māl. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवृत्
अतिवृत् €1 Ā. (P. in epic poetry)<BR>—1 To pass over or by, cross (as a place &c.). उपासते पुरुषं ये ह्यकामास्ते<BR> शुकमेतदतिवर्तन्ति धीराः Muṇḍ. 3. 2. 1.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To go beyond, exceed (fig. also); वाग्विभवातिवृत्तमाचार्यकम्<BR> Māl. 1. 26 exceeding or transcending the powers of speech, indescribable;<BR> मुकुलावस्थामतिवृत्तेषु तण्डुलेषु Dk. 132; का ते स्तुतिः स्तुतिपथादतिवृत्तधाम्रः<BR> Mv. 4. 29 transcending praise.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To offend, overstep, transgress, violate; योऽस्याः शासनमतिवर्तेत<BR> Dk. 167; कोऽतिवर्तते दैवम् 51 who can transgress the decrees of Fate?<BR> कोऽन्यो जीवितुकामो देवस्य शासनमतिवर्तेत Mu. 3. न खलु दूरगतोऽतिवर्तते Śi. 6. 19.<BR>——(<i>c</i>) To neglect, omit, let slip.<BR>——(<i>d</i>) To have no regard to, disregard, slight; offend (especially by<BR> unfaithfulness), injure; शपथशतातिवर्ती Dk. 62 disregarding; ऋतुस्नातां<BR> सतीं भार्यां … अतिवर्तेत दुष्टात्मा; यथाहं कर्मणा वाचा शरीरेण<BR> च राघवम् । सततं नातिवर्तेय Rām. अपत्यलोभाद् या तु स्त्री भर्तारमतिवर्तते Ms. 5. 161.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To surpass, excel; मनुष्यसंख्यामतिवर्तितुं वा Ki. 3. 40,<BR> एष जनतातिवर्तिनो Śi. 14. 59; बान्धवस्रेहं राज्यलोभोऽतिवर्तते<BR> Ks. 41. 40; to outweigh, preponderate.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To overcome, subdue, vanquish, get the better of; get over, escape<BR> or get loose from; असाध्यानतिवर्तन्ते प्रमेहा रजनीं यथा Suśr.;<BR> किमाचारः कथं चैतांस्त्रीन् गुणानतिवर्तते Bg. 14. 21 transcend these<BR> three qualities; दैवं पौरुषेण˚ Mb.; Dk. 73; Ks. 121. 67.<BR>—4 (Intrans.) To pass away, glide away, elapse (as time); to be late or<BR> delay; एवं तयोः प्रत्यहमन्योन्याहारादि दानेन कालोऽतिवर्तते H. 1;<BR> महता स्नेहेन कालोऽतिवर्तते H. 2; समयो नातिवर्तते Mv. 6;<BR> आषोडशाद् ब्राह्मणस्य सावित्री नातिवर्तते Ms. 2. 38 is not late (नातिक्रान्तकाला भवति).<BR>—5 To go away from, leave, abandon (abl.); यथा मे हृदयं नित्यं नातिवर्तति<BR> राघवात् Rām.<BR>.━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To slight, not to heed, disregard सुहृदश्चातिवर्तिताः Dk. 136.<BR>—2 To let out, discharge (as excrement).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवर्तनम्
अतिवर्तनम् A pardonable offence or misdemeanour; exemption from<BR> punishment; ten cases are mentioned<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">Page0046-2</a>]<BR> in Ms. 8. 290 (यानस्य चैव यातुश्च यानस्वामिन एव च । दशातिःवर्तनान्याहुः<BR> शेषे दण्डो विधीयते ॥)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवर्तिन्|अतिवर्त्तिन्
अतिवर्तिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Crossing, surpassing, excelling; भुवनातिवर्तिना ओजसा Ki. 12. 21;<BR> passing, overstepping, transgressing, violating &c. Bhāg. 6. 17. 12.<BR>—2 Excessive.<BR>—3 Foremost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवृत्तिः|अतिवृत्ति
अतिवृत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Surpassing, violation, transgression.<BR>—2 Exaggeration, hyperbole.<BR>—3 Violent effusion (as of blood); excessive action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवर्धनम्
अतिवर्धनम् Excessive growth, increase, adding to, increasing; एतत्खलु<BR> व्यजनानिलैरति(भि)वर्धनं प्रभञ्जनस्य यदस्मद्विधैः परिबोधनमार्यस्य<BR> K. 289; cf. "Carrying coals to New Castle", or "To gild refined gold,<BR> to paint the lily,<BR> … or with taper-light the eye of Heaven to garnish is wasteful and ridiculous excess".<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवृद्ध|अतिवृद्धः
अतिवृद्ध <i>a.</i> Very old; very much grown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवृद्धः|अतिवृद्ध
अतिवृद्ध + .{@-द्धः@} N. of a Mantra in Tantras; चतुःशतं समारभ्य यावद्वर्णसहस्रकम् ।<BR> अतिवृद्धः स मन्त्रस्तु सर्वशास्त्रेषु वर्जितः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवृद्धा
अतिवृद्ध + .{@-द्धा@} A very old cow (unable to chew grass &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिविष्ठित
अतिविष्ठित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 One who fights bravely; विस्रब्धानतिविष्ठितान् Rām. 4. 18. 38.<BR>—2 One who transgresses the limits, Mb. 3. 215. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवृष्टिः|अतिवृष्टि
अतिवृष्टिः <i>f.</i> Excessive or heavy rain, one of the six calamities<BR> of the season. See ईति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवेगित
अतिवेगित <i>a.</i> Moving or moved with great velocity, quick in motion;<BR> भौमादयोल्पमूर्तित्वाच्छीघ्रमन्दोच्चसंज्ञकैः । दैवतैरपकृष्यन्ते सुदूरमतिवेगिताः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवेधः|अतिवेध
अतिवेधः ‘Close contact’, N. of the contact of दशमी and एकादशी<BR> (अरुणोदयवेधः स्यात् सार्धं तु घटिकादूयम् । अतिवेधो द्विघटिका प्रभासंदर्शनाद्रवेः<BR> ॥ इति स्मृत्युक्तः एकादश्याः दशमीसंपर्कभेदः Tv.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवेल|अतिवेलं
अतिवेल <i>a.</i> [अतिक्रान्तो वेलां मर्यादां कूलं वा]<BR>—1 Exceeding the due limits or boundary (as the water of the sea).<BR>—2 Excessive, extravagant; boundless, किं मामिदानीमतिवेलमात्थ Mb. 3. 34. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवेलम्
अतिवेल + .{@-लम्@} <i>adv.</i><BR>—1 Excessively.<BR>—2 Out of season, unseasonably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिवैशस
अतिवैशस <i>a.</i> Very intense; आततायिभिरुत्सृष्टा हिंस्रा वाचोऽतिवैशसाः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 19. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिव्यथनम्
अतिव्यथनम्, -था<BR> Infliction of great pain; cf. सपत्रनिष्पत्रादतिव्यथने P. V. 4. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिव्यथा
अतिव्यथनम्, -था<BR> Infliction of great pain; cf. सपत्रनिष्पत्रादतिव्यथने P. V. 4. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिव्याप्तिः|अतिव्याप्ति
अतिव्याप्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An unwarrantable stretch of a rule or principle.<BR>—2 Including what is not intended to be included in a proposition; (in<BR> Nyāya) including or covering too much, unwarranted extension of a definition<BR> to things not intended to be defined by it, so that it includes such things<BR> as ought not to fall under it; one of the three faults to which a definition<BR> is open; अलक्ष्ये लक्षणगमनम् अतिव्याप्तिः; यथा मनुष्यो ब्राह्मणः इति<BR> लक्षणस्य शूद्रेऽतिव्याप्तिः, तस्यापि मनुष्यत्वात्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशक्करी
अतिशक्क(क्व)री A class of metres containing 4 lines, with 15 syllables<BR> in each. It has 18 varieties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशक्वरी
अतिशक्क(क्व)री A class of metres containing 4 lines, with 15 syllables<BR> in each. It has 18 varieties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशक्तिः|अतिशक्ति
अतिशक्तिः over-work, द्रव्याणामतिशक्त्याऽपि देयमेषां कृतादपि<BR> Mb. 12. 234. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशर्वरम्
अतिशर्वरम् Ved. The dead of night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशस्त्र
अतिशस्त्र <i>a.</i> Surpassing weapons;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशस्त्र
अतिशस्त्र + ˚नखन्यासः R. 12. 73 the<BR> nail-wounds surpassed the wounds of swords.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशी
अतिशी €2 Ā.<BR>—1 To surpass, excel; पूर्वान्महाभाग तयाऽतिशेषे R. 5. 14; चरितेन<BR> चातिशयिता मुनयः Ki. 6. 32; Bk. 7. 46, 8. 1; न शक्नुमो वयमार्यस्य<BR> मतिमतिशयितुम् Mu. 3.<BR>—2 To precede in sleeping; अहं पतीन्नातिशये Mb.<BR>—3 To annoy, act as an incubus.<BR>.━<i>Caus.</i> (-शाययति)<BR> To excel; धाम्नातिशाययति धाम सहस्रधाम्नः Mu. 3. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयः|अतिशय
अतिशयः [शी-अच्]<BR>—1 Excess, pre-eminence, excellence; वीर्य˚ R. 3. 62; महिम्नां … अतिशयः<BR> U. 4. 21; तस्मिन् विधानातिशये विधातुः R. 6. 11 excellence, highest<BR> perfection of art.<BR>—2 Superiority (in quality, rank, quantity &c.); महार्घस्तीर्थानामिव<BR> हि महतां कोऽप्यतिशयः U. 6. 11; often in comp. with adjectives, in<BR> the sense of ‘exceedingly’; ˚रमणीयः Mu. 3; आसीदतिशयप्रेक्ष्यः<BR> R. 17. 25; मुक्ता गुणातिशयसंभृतमण्डनश्रीः V. 5. 19; or with nouns,<BR> meaning ‘excellent’; ‘excessive’; ‘very great’; ˚रयः, अश्वातिशयम<BR> K. 80 the best of horses; ˚दारिद्र्योपहताः.<BR>—3 Advantageous result, one of the superhuman qualities attributed to<BR> Jain saints. ━<i>a.</i> [अतिशयः अस्त्यर्थे अच्] Superior, pre-eminent,<BR> excessive, very great, abundant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अतिशयोक्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयोक्तिः|अतिशयोक्ति
अतिशयः + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 exaggerated or hyperbolical language, extreme assertion.<BR>—2 a figure of speech, (corr. to hyperbole) said to be of 5 kinds in S. D.,<BR> but of 4 in K. P.; निगीर्याध्यवसानं तु प्रकृतस्य परेण यत् ।<BR> प्रस्तुतस्य यदन्यत्वं यद्यर्थोक्तौ च कल्पनम् ॥ कार्यकारणयोर्यश्च<BR> पौर्वापर्यविपययः । विज्ञेयातिशयोक्तिः सा; Ex. of the first kind: कमलमनम्भसि<BR> कमले च कुवलये तानि कनकलतिकायाम् । सा च सुकुमारसुभगेत्युत्पातपरम्परा केयम् ॥<BR>—3 verbosity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयन|अतिशयनं
अतिशयन <i>a.</i> [शी-भावे-ल्युट] Surpassing, (in comp.); great,<BR> eminent, abundant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयनम्
अतिशयन + .{@-नम्@} Excess, abundance, superfluity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयनी
अतिशयन + .{@-नी@} N. of a metre of four lines, also called चित्रलेखा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयालु
अतिशयालु <i>a.</i> Tending to excel or surpass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयित
अतिशयित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Excelled, surpassed &c.; ˚सुरासुरप्रभावम् U. 5. 4.<BR>—2 Excessive, exceeding, going beyond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशयिन्
अतिशयिन् <i>a.</i> [शी-इनि]<BR>—1 Superior, excellent; preeminent; श्रियमतिशयिनीं समेत्य जग्मुः<BR> Ki. 10. 25; इदमुत्तममतिशयिनि व्यङ्ग्ये वाच्याद् ध्वनिर्बुधैः कथितः<BR> K. P. 1; ˚यिनि समाप्ता वंश एवाशिषस्ते V. 5. 21.<BR>—2 Excessive, abundant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशायनम्
अतिशायनम् [शी-ल्युट्] Excellence, superiority, पर्यायात्परमतिशायनस्य<BR> वा यत् Mv. 4. 15; अतिशायने तमविष्टनौ (superlative affixes) P. V. 3. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशायिन्
अतिशायिन् <i>a.</i> [शी-णिनि]<BR>—1 Excelling, surpassing; अर्थकाम˚ &c.<BR>—2 Excessive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशायिनी
अतिशायिन् + .{@-नी@} N. of a metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिशेषः|अतिशेष
अतिशेषः Remainder; remnant (as of time); a small remainder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिश्रेयसिः|अतिश्रेयसि
अतिश्रेयसिः [श्रेयसीमतिक्रान्तः] A man superior to the most excellent woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिश्व|अतिश्वः
अतिश्व <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Surpassing in strength a dog (such as a boar &c.).<BR>—2 Worse than a dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिश्वा
अतिश्व + .{@-श्वा@} Service; cf. सेवां लाघवकारिणीं कृतधियः स्थाने श्ववृत्तिं<BR> विदुः Mu. 3. 14<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिश्वः|अतिश्व
अतिश्व + .{@-श्वः@} N. of a tribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिश्वन्
अतिश्वन् <i>m.</i> An excellent dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिष्कद्वरी
अतिष्कद्वरी [fr. स्कन्द्] A transgressor; a very dissolute woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिष्ठा
अतिष्ठा €1 P. To excel; be over (Ved.); स भूमिं विश्वतो वृत्वात्यतिष्ठद्दशाङ्गुलम्<BR> Rv. 10. 90. 1 was over and above by 10 Aṅgulas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिष्ठा
अतिष्ठा + .{@-ष्टा@} [स्था-क्विप् षत्वम्] Superiority, precedence. मैतस्मिन्संवदिष्टा<BR> अतिष्ठाः Bṛ. Up. 2. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिष्ठावत्|अतिष्ठावन्त्
अतिष्ठा + .{@-ष्टा@} + ˚वत्, -वन् ━<i>a.</i> Surpassing, standing<BR> at the head of all.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिष्ठावन्
अतिष्ठा + .{@-ष्टा@} + ˚वत्, -वन् ━<i>a.</i> Surpassing, standing<BR> at the head of all.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसक्तिः|अतिसक्ति
अतिसक्तिः <i>f.</i> Close contact or proximity; great attachment; अतिसक्तिमेत्य<BR> वरुणस्य दिशा Śi. 9. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसन्धा|अतिसंधा
अतिसन्धा €3 U.<BR>—1 To deceive, over-reach, cheat; त्वया चन्द्रमसा च विश्वसनीयाभ्यामतिसन्धीयते<BR> कामिजनसार्थः Ś. 3; कथं मया ब्रह्मबन्धुरतिसन्धेयः V. 2.<BR>—2 To prejudice, wrong, injure, encroach upon; मूलद्वारं नान्यैर्द्वारैरतिसन्दधीत<BR> रूपद्धर्पा Bṛ. S. 53. 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसन्धानम्
अतिसन्धानम्<BR>—1 Cheating, deception; परातिसन्धान˚ Ś. 5. 25; trick, fraud.<BR>—2 Capture. -दण्डा˚ = Capture by means of the army. Kau. A. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसन्ध्या
अतिसन्ध्या The time about the twilights, the time just before and<BR> after the morning and evening twilight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसर्पणम्
अतिसर्पणम् Violent motion or movement (of the child in the womb).<BR> गर्भसंकमणे वाचि मर्मणामतिसर्पणे Mb. 14. 17. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसर्व|अतिसर्वः|अतिसर्व्व
