अतिसर्वः|अतिसर्व|अतिसर्व्व
अतिसर्व + .{@-र्वः@} The Supreme Being; अतिसर्वाय शर्वाय Mugdha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसान्तपनम्
अतिसान्तपनम् A kind of very austere penance; (गोमूत्रगोमयक्षीरदधिसर्पिःकुशोदकान्येकाहं<BR> द्वितीयमुपवसेत्तत्सान्तपनम्; त्र्यहाभ्यस्तैश्चातिसान्तपनम् Viṣṇu Smṛti).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसांवत्सर
अतिसांवत्सर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>) Extending over more than<BR> a year; नातिसांवत्सरीं वृद्धिं न चादृष्टां विनिर्हरेत् Ms. 8 153.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसाम्या
अतिसाम्या [अत्यन्तं साम्यं मधुना अस्याः] N. of the plant मधुयष्टि,<BR> sweet juice of the Bengal Madder, Rubiat Manjith. (Mar. ज्येष्ठमध)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसृ
अतिसृ €1 P. Ved. To extend.<BR>.━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To extend.<BR>—2 To exert oneself to drive out (as a fluid).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसर|अतिसरः
