अतीसारः|अतीसार
अति(ती)सारः [अतिसारयति मलं द्रवीकृत्य, वा अतेर्दीर्घः] Dysentery,<BR> violent straining at stool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अतिसारिन्
