अनन्य + -चित्त, -चिन्त, -चेतस्, -मनस्, -मानस, -हृदय <i>a.</i> giving<BR> oneʼs undivided thought or attention to, with undivided mind; विचिन्तयन्ती<BR> यमनन्यमानसा Ś. 4. 1; K. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

