अनन्य + -चित्त, -चिन्त, -चेतस्, -मनस्, -मानस, -हृदय <i>a.</i> giving<BR> oneʼs undivided thought or attention to, with undivided mind; विचिन्तयन्ती<BR> यमनन्यमानसा Ś. 4. 1; K. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यमानस
अनन्य + -चित्त, -चिन्त, -चेतस्, -मनस्, -मानस, -हृदय <i>a.</i> giving<BR> oneʼs undivided thought or attention to, with undivided mind; विचिन्तयन्ती<BR> यमनन्यमानसा Ś. 4. 1; K. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यहृदय
अनन्य + -चित्त, -चिन्त, -चेतस्, -मनस्, -मानस, -हृदय <i>a.</i> giving<BR> oneʼs undivided thought or attention to, with undivided mind; विचिन्तयन्ती<BR> यमनन्यमानसा Ś. 4. 1; K. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यजः|अनन्यज
अनन्य + -जः, -जन्मन् <i>m.</i> [नान्यस्मात् जन्म यस्य; आत्मभूचित्तभू<BR> इत्यादि तस्य व्यपदेशत्वात् or नास्ति अन्यद्यस्मात्सोऽनन्यः, विष्णुः; तस्माज्जातः]<BR> Cupid, the god of love; मा मूमुहत्खलु भवन्तमनन्यजन्मा Māl. 1. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यजन्मन्
अनन्य + -जः, -जन्मन् <i>m.</i> [नान्यस्मात् जन्म यस्य; आत्मभूचित्तभू<BR> इत्यादि तस्य व्यपदेशत्वात् or नास्ति अन्यद्यस्मात्सोऽनन्यः, विष्णुः; तस्माज्जातः]<BR> Cupid, the god of love; मा मूमुहत्खलु भवन्तमनन्यजन्मा Māl. 1. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यदृष्टि
अनन्य + -दृष्टि <i>a.</i> gazing intently or steadfastly at; ˚ष्टिः सवितारमैक्षत Ku. 5. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यदेव
अनन्य + -देव <i>a.</i> having no other (superior) God, epithet of the Supreme Being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यपरता
अनन्य + -परता exclusive devotion or attachment; पुरश्चक्षूरागस्तदनु<BR> मनसोऽनन्यपरता Māl. 6. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यपरायण
अनन्य + -परायण <i>a.</i> devoted to no other (woman); Ś. 3. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यपूर्वः|अनन्यपूर्व|अनन्यपूर्व्व
अनन्य + -पूर्वः [नान्या पूर्वा यस्य] having no other wife; वरस्यानन्यपूर्वस्य<BR> विशोकामकरोद्गुणैः Ku. 6. 92.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यपूर्वा|अनन्यपूर्व्वा
अनन्य + -पूर्वः + .({@-र्वा@}) [न अन्यः पूर्वो यस्याः सा] a virgin (who never before<BR> belonged to another), a woman having no other husband; मनुप्रभृतिभिर्मान्यैर्भुक्ता<BR> यद्यपि राजभिः । तथाप्यनन्यपूर्वेव तस्मिन्नासीद्वसुन्धरा ॥ R. 4. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यभाज्
अनन्य + -भाज् <i>a.</i> [न अन्यम् अन्यां वा भजते] not devoted to any<BR> other person; अनन्यभाजं पतिमाप्नुहि Ku. 3. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यविषय
अनन्य + -विषय <i>a.</i> not applicable or belonging to any one else, exclusively<BR> applicable; यस्मिन्नीश्वर इत्यनन्यविषयः शब्दः V. 1. 1; Mv. 1. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यवृत्ति|अनन्यवृत्तिः
अनन्य + -वृत्ति <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of the same nature.<BR>—2 having. no other means of livelihood.<BR>—3 closely attentive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यशासन
अनन्य + -शासन <i>a.</i> not ruled over by any one else; अनन्यशासनामुर्वी<BR> शशासैकपुरीमिव R. 1. 30; Dk. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यसामान्य
अनन्य + -सामान्य, -साधारण <i>a.</i> not common to any one else, uncommon,<BR> exclusively devoted, applicable or belonging to one; अनन्यनारीसामान्यो<BR> दासस्त्वस्याः पुरूरवाः V. 3. 18; ˚राजशब्दः R. 6. 38; M. 5, 4. 10;<BR> not capable of being performed by any one else, Ku. 3. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यसाधारण
अनन्य + -सामान्य, -साधारण <i>a.</i> not common to any one else, uncommon,<BR> exclusively devoted, applicable or belonging to one; अनन्यनारीसामान्यो<BR> दासस्त्वस्याः पुरूरवाः V. 3. 18; ˚राजशब्दः R. 6. 38; M. 5, 4. 10;<BR> not capable of being performed by any one else, Ku. 3. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यसद्द्श
अनन्य + -सद्द्श <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR> having no equal, matchless, peerless यथैताननन्यसदृशान्<BR> विदधासि Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यता
अनन्यता, -त्वम्<BR> Identity, sameness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यत्वम्
अनन्यता, -त्वम्<BR> Identity, sameness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्यादृश
अनन्यादृश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Not like others, singular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्वयः|अनन्वय
अनन्वयः [न˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Want of connection.<BR>—2 (Rhet.) A figure of speech in which a thing is compared to itself,<BR> the object being to show that it is matchless and can have no other उपमान;<BR> उपमानोपमेयत्वं यदेकस्यैव वस्तुनः । इन्दुरिन्दुरिव श्रीमानित्यादौ तदनन्वयः<BR> ॥ गगनं गगनाकारं सागरः सागरोपमः । रामरावणयोर्युद्धं रामरावणयोरिव ॥.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनन्वित
अनन्वित <i>a.</i> [न˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Unconnected.<BR>—2 Irregular, desultory; irrelevant, incoherent.<BR>—3 Not attended with, devoid of; as पुत्र˚, भार्या˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनप
अनप <i>a.</i> [न सन्ति आधिक्येन आपो यत्र] Destitute of much<BR> water (as a puddle)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपकरणम्
अनपकरणम्, -कर्मन्, -क्रिया<BR>—1 Not injuring.<BR>—2 Non-delivery.<BR>—3 (In law) Non-payment; दत्तस्यानपकर्म च Ms. 8. 4; दत्तस्य<BR> or वेतनस्य ˚क्रिया 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपकरणम्
अनपकरणम्, -कर्मन्, -क्रिया<BR>—1 Not injuring.<BR>—2 Non-delivery.<BR>—3 (In law) Non-payment; दत्तस्यानपकर्म च Ms. 8. 4; दत्तस्य<BR> or वेतनस्य ˚क्रिया 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

