अनपकरणम्, -कर्मन्, -क्रिया<BR>—1 Not injuring.<BR>—2 Non-delivery.<BR>—3 (In law) Non-payment; दत्तस्यानपकर्म च Ms. 8. 4; दत्तस्य<BR> or वेतनस्य ˚क्रिया 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0075-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

