अनपकारकारिन्
अनपकारः + .{@-कारिन्@} <i>a.</i> Harmless, innocent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपग
अनपग <i>a.</i> Firm भवत्यनपगान्सर्वांस्तान्गुणान् Mb. 12. 287. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपजय्य
अनपजय्य <i>a.</i> Ved. Whose victorious character cannot be reversed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपत्य
अनपत्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Without issue, childless, without heir; ˚त्यश्च किल तपस्वी Ś. 6; K. 59, 63.<BR>—2 Not propitious or favourable to children; causing fall (पतनकारण)<BR> युयोत नो अनपत्यानि गन्तोः Rv. 3. 54. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपत्यता
अनपत्य + ˚ता, ˚त्वम् childlessness;<BR> नूनमनपत्यता मां वत्सलयति Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपत्यत्वम्
अनपत्य + ˚ता, ˚त्वम् childlessness;<BR> नूनमनपत्यता मां वत्सलयति Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपत्रप
अनपत्रप <i>a.</i> Impudent, shameless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपनिहित
अनपनिहित <i>a.</i> Ved. Not mutilated or curtailed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपभ्रंशः|अनपभ्रंश
अनपभ्रंशः Not a corrupt word; a properly formed word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपयति
अनपयति <i>ind.</i> Very early (before the sun starts on his journey).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपर
अनपर <i>a.</i> Having no other or second, having no follower, sole;<BR> तदेतद् ब्रह्मापूर्वमनपरम् Bṛ. Up. 2. 5. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपराध|अनपराधः
