अनपराधिन्
अनपराध, -धिन् <i>a.</i><BR> Innocent, guiltless, harmless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपराधः|अनपराध
अनपराध, -धिन् + .{@-धः@} Innocence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपवाचन
अनपवाचन <i>a.</i> Ved. Impossible to be talked away or wished away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपवृक्त
अनपवृक्त <i>a.</i> Not relinquished or abandoned; न ह्युपेतमनपवृक्तं<BR> सच्छक्यमुपेतुम् । ŚB. on MS. 12. 1. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपव्ययत्|अनपव्ययन्त्
अनपव्ययत् <i>a.</i> Ved. Not letting go; able.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपसर|अनपसरः
अनपसर <i>a.</i> Having no egress or passage to creep out of, unjustifiable,<BR> inexcusable; निरन्वयोऽनपसरः Ms. 8. 198 (अपसरः प्रतिग्रहकयादिः)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपसरः|अनपसर
अनपसर + .{@-रः@} -An usurper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपस्पृश्
अनपस्पृश् <i>a.</i> Not obstinate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपस्फुर्
अनपस्फुर्, -र, -रत् <i>a.</i><BR> (of a cow) Not refusing to be milked. सृजध्वमनपस्फुराम्<BR> Rv. 6. 48. 11; तां धेनुम् … अनपस्फुरन्तीम् Rv. 4. 42. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपस्फुर
अनपस्फुर्, -र, -रत् <i>a.</i><BR> (of a cow) Not refusing to be milked. सृजध्वमनपस्फुराम्<BR> Rv. 6. 48. 11; तां धेनुम् … अनपस्फुरन्तीम् Rv. 4. 42. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपस्फुरत्|अनपस्फुरन्त्
अनपस्फुर्, -र, -रत् <i>a.</i><BR> (of a cow) Not refusing to be milked. सृजध्वमनपस्फुराम्<BR> Rv. 6. 48. 11; तां धेनुम् … अनपस्फुरन्तीम् Rv. 4. 42. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपाय|अनपायः
अनपाय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Free from loss or decay.<BR>—2 Imperishable, undiminished, undecaying; प्रणमन्त्यनपायमुत्थितम्<BR> (चन्द्रम्) Ki. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपायः|अनपाय
अनपाय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 Imperishable nature, freedom from decay or wear and tear; permanence.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपायिन्
अनपायिन् <i>a.</i> Imperishable, firm, steady, unfailing, constant,<BR> durable, not transient; प्रसादाभिमुखे तस्मिञ् श्रीरासीदनपायिनी R. 8. 17, 17. 46;<BR> अनपायिनि संश्रयद्रुमे गजभग्ने पतनाय वल्लरी Ku. 4. 31;<BR> चलेष्वर्थेषु लुब्धेन न यशःस्वनपायिषु Mu. 5. 14; Ki. 14. 37, 2. 43;<BR> Śi. 8. 50, 14. 65, 17. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपार्थ
अनपार्थ <i>a.</i> With a genuine cause, rightly; सुखप्रिये धर्महीनेऽनपार्थे Mb. 5. 32. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपावृत्
अनपावृत् [न˚ ब˚] Not returning or coming back, non-recurrent<BR> (पुनरावृत्तिशून्य); unremitting (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपेक्ष|अनपेक्षं
अनपेक्ष, -क्षिन् <i>a.</i><BR> [न˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Regardless.<BR>—2 Careless, not minding or heeding, indifferent.<BR>—3 Independent or irrespective (of another), not requiring any other thing.<BR>—4 Impartial.<BR>—5 Irrelevant, unconnected, unconcerned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपेक्षिन्
अनपेक्ष, -क्षिन् <i>a.</i><BR> [न˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Regardless.<BR>—2 Careless, not minding or heeding, indifferent.<BR>—3 Independent or irrespective (of another), not requiring any other thing.<BR>—4 Impartial.<BR>—5 Irrelevant, unconnected, unconcerned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपेक्षा
अनपेक्ष, -क्षिन् + .{@-क्षा@} Disregard, indifference, carelessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपेक्षम्
अनपेक्ष, -क्षिन् + .{@-क्षम्@} <i>adv.</i> Without regard to, independently or irrespectively<BR> of; carelessly, accidentally;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपेक्षत्वात्
अनपेक्ष, -क्षिन् + .{@-क्षम्@} + ˚त्वात् since it has no reference to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनपेत
अनपेत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not gone off, not past; अनपेतकालं कथयांबभूवुः Ki. 6. 30<BR> without loss of time, without delay.<BR>—2 Not deviating from, faithful to, not leaving (with abl.); अर्थादनपेतम्<BR> अर्थ्यम् Sk.; धर्मपथ्यर्थन्यायादनपेते P. IV. 4. 92. See अपेत also.<BR>—3 Not devoid of, possessed of; ऐश्वर्यादनपेतमीश्वरमयं लोकोऽर्थतः<BR> सेवते Mu. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनप्त
अनप्त <i>a.</i> Ved. [न आप्तः, वेदे पृषो˚ ह्रस्वः]<BR>—1 Not seized or overcome by the enemy (शत्रुभिरनाप्त);<BR>—2 not watery (?) अनप्तमप्सु दुष्टरं सोमं पवित्रे आ सृज Rv. 9. 16. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनप्नस्
अनप्नस् <i>a.</i> [नास्ति अप्नः रूपं यस्य] Ved. Destitute of form<BR> or shape, shapeless, actionless (कर्महीन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनप्सरस्
अनप्सरस्, -रा <i>f.</i><BR> Not an Apsaras, unworthy of a celestial nymph; अनप्सरेव<BR> प्रतिभासि V. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनप्सरा
अनप्सरस्, -रा <i>f.</i><BR> Not an Apsaras, unworthy of a celestial nymph; अनप्सरेव<BR> प्रतिभासि V. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनफा
अनफा (Astrol.) A particular configuration of planets; रविवर्जं<BR> द्वादशगैरनफा; सच्छीलं सुखान्वितं प्रभुं ख्यातियुक्तमनफायाम् Dīpikā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिज्ञ|अनभिज्ञः
अनभिज्ञ <i>a.</i> Ignorant of, unacquainted with, unused to, (usually<BR> with gen.); ˚ज्ञः कैतवस्य Ś. 5; वृत्तान्तानामनभिज्ञास्मि K. 236;<BR> ˚ज्ञः परमेश्वरगृहाचारस्य Mv. 2; अनभिज्ञास्तमिस्त्राणां दुर्दिनेष्वभिसारिकाः Ku. 6. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिधानम्
अनभिधानम्<BR>—1 Absence of the expression of the desired meaning (वार्त्तिक 2. 2. 24. 16).<BR>—2 A word not in standard use though grammatically correct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिम्लात
अनभिम्लात <i>a.</i> [न˚ त˚] Not faded.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अनभिम्लातवर्ण<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिम्लातवर्ण|अनभिम्लातवर्ण्ण
अनभिम्लात + -वर्ण <i>a.</i> Ved. of unfaded or undiminished lustre, resplendent.<BR> सो अपां नपादनभिम्लातवर्णः Rv. 2. 35. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिलक्षितः|अनभिलक्षित
अनभिलक्षितः An impostor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिलाष|अनभिलाषः
अनभिलाष <i>a.</i> Free from desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिलाषः|अनभिलाष
अनभिलाष + .{@-षः@}<BR>—1 Want of appetite or desire.<BR>—2 Non-relish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिवादक
अनभिवादक <i>a.</i> Opposed, not agreeing with, न खलु भवान् अस्मत्संकल्पानभिवादकः ।<BR> Avimārakam 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिशस्त
अनभिशस्त, -स्ति, -स्त्य <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR> Blameless, faultless;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिशस्ति
अनभिशस्त, -स्ति, -स्त्य <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR> Blameless, faultless;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिशस्त्य
अनभिशस्त, -स्ति, -स्त्य <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR> Blameless, faultless;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिशस्त्येन
अनभिशस्त, -स्ति, -स्त्य + ˚शस्तेन्य Yv. 5. 5<BR> leading to perfection or to heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिसन्धानम्
अनभिसन्धानम् Absence of design or purpose; so अनभिसन्धिः;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिसन्धानम्
अनभिसन्धानम् Absence of design or purpose; so अनभिसन्धिः;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिसन्धानकृत
अनभिसन्धानम् + ˚कृत<BR> done undesignedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिहित|अनभिहितः
अनभिहित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not named or asserted; see अभिहित under अभिधा.<BR>—2 Not fastened (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभिहितः|अनभिहित
अनभिहित + .{@-तः@} N. of the chief of a Gotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभ्यन्तर
अनभ्यन्तर <i>a.</i> Unacquainted, ignorant; अनभ्यन्तरे खल्वावां<BR> मदनगतस्य वृत्तान्तस्य Ś. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0076-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभ्यावृत्तिः|अनभ्यावृत्ति
अनभ्यावृत्तिः <i>f.</i> Non-repetition; मनागनभ्यावृत्त्या वा कामं<BR> क्षाम्यतु यः क्षमी Śi. 2. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभ्याश
अनभ्याश, -स <i>a.</i><BR> Not near, distant &c.;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभ्यास
अनभ्याश, -स <i>a.</i><BR> Not near, distant &c.;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभ्यासमित्य
अनभ्याश, -स + ˚समित्य <i>a.</i> to be shunned from afar, Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभ्र
अनभ्र <i>a.</i> Cloudless; इयमनभ्रा वृष्टिः this is (like) a shower<BR> from a cloudless sky, <i>i. e.</i> something quite unexpected or sudden.<BR> कथमनभ्रा वृष्टिः Nāg. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनभ्रि
अनभ्रि <i>a.</i> Ved. Epithet of rainwater; requiring no shovel (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनमः|अनम
अनमः [न नमति अन्यान्] A Brāhmaṇa (one who does not bow down<BR> to others and returns salutations made to him by others with a blessing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनमितंपच|अनमितम्पच|अनमितम्पचः
अनमितंपच (= मितंपच) <i>a.</i> ‘Not cooking what has not been first measured’<BR>. Miserly, niggardly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनमित्र
अनमित्र <i>a.</i> Having no enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनमित्रम्
अनमित्र + .{@-त्रम्@} A state of having no enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनमीव
अनमीव <i>a.</i> Ved. [नास्ति अमीवो रोगो यस्य न˚ ब˚] Well,<BR> happy, free from disease; comfortable, salubrious, sinless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनमीवम्
अनमीव + .{@-वम्@} Good or comfortable state, happiness, prosperity. स्वति<BR> चास्मा अनमीवं च धेहि Rv. 10. 14. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनम्बर|अनंबर|अनम्बरः
अनम्बर <i>a.</i> Wearing no garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनम्बरः|अनम्बर|अनंबर
अनम्बर + .{@-रः@} A Buddhist mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनम्र
अनम्र <i>a.</i> Not humble, haughty, proud; अनम्राणां समुद्धर्तुः R. 4. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनयः|अनय
अनयः [अप्रशस्तो नयः]<BR>—1 Bad management or conduct; injustice; unfairness; समृद्धिरनयाद्विनश्यति<BR> Pt. 1. 169; Bh. 2. 42.<BR>—2 Bad policy or course of conduct, evil course; अनयो नयसंकाशो हृदयान्नापसर्पति Pt. 3. 184.<BR>—3 Adversity, calamity, distress; जीवेदेतेन राजन्यः सर्वेष्वप्यनयं<BR> गतः Ms. 10. 95 reduced to straits; 102.<BR>—4 [अयः शुभावहो विधिस्तदन्यः अनयः] Misfortune, adversity; ill-luck.<BR> cf. अनयो व्यसने दैवे चाशुभे चापदि स्मृतः । Nm.<BR>—5 A variety of dice-play, gambling पतञ्जलि on P. V. 2. 9. शाराणां<BR> वामावर्तेन अभीष्टस्थाननयनम्<BR>—6 A deceit, fraud; एवं चेदुपसर्पेतामनयं रामलक्ष्मणौ Rām. 6. 8. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनरण्यः|अनरण्य
अनरण्यः N. of a king of the solar race, a descendant of Ikṣvāku<BR> and king of Ayodhyā, who was overthrown by Rāvaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनराल
अनराल <i>a.</i> straight; यत्स्नेहादनरालनालनलिनीपत्रातपत्रं<BR> घृतम् U. 3. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनरुस्
अनरुस् <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚] Ved. Not wounded, healthy, sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्गल|अनर्गलं
अनर्गल <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚]<BR>—1 Free from bar or obstruction, free to move, unrestrained, unhampered;<BR> तुरङ्गमुत्सृष्टमनर्लम् R. 3. 39.<BR>—2 Unlocked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्घ|अनर्घः
अनर्घ <i>a.</i> [नास्ति अर्घो मूल्यं यस्य न˚ ब˚] Invaluable,<BR> priceless, inestimable; अनर्घशीलः R. 5. 2; दत्तेऽर्घे महति महीभृतां<BR> पुरोऽपि त्रैलोक्ये मधुभिदभूदनर्घ एव ॥ Śi. 14. 88.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">Page0077-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्घः|अनर्घ
अनर्घ + .{@-र्घः@} [न˚ त˚] Wrong or improper value.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अनर्घराघवम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्घराघवम्
अनर्घ + -राघवम् N. of a drama in 7 acts by Murāri Miśra; also called<BR> Murāri Nāṭaka after its author and supposed to have been written between<BR> the 12th and the 14th century.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्घत्वम्
अनर्घत्वम्, -ता<BR> Pricelessness, invaluable nature; H. Pr. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्घता
अनर्घत्वम्, -ता<BR> Pricelessness, invaluable nature; H. Pr. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्घ्य
अनर्घ्य <i>a.</i> Invaluable; unsurpassed in reverence due from others,<BR> highly respected; अनर्घ्यमर्घेण तमद्रिनाथः Ku. 1. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्घ्येय
अनर्घ्येय <i>a.</i> see अनर्घ; अनर्ध्येया महाराज द्विजा वर्णेषु चोत्तमाः<BR> Mb. 13. 51. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थ|अनर्थः
अनर्थ <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚]<BR>—1 Useless, worthless; शुनः पुच्छमिवानर्थं पाण्डित्यं धर्मवर्जितम् Pt. 3. 97.<BR>—2 Unfortunate, unhappy.<BR>—3 Harmful, disastrous, bad; चित्तज्ञानानुवर्तिनोऽनर्था अपि प्रियाः स्युः<BR> Dk. 160; wicked (opp. दक्षिण).<BR>—4 Not having that meaning (but another); having no meaning, nonsensical, meaningless.<BR>—5 Poor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थः|अनर्थ
अनर्थ + .{@-र्थः@} [न˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Non-use or value.<BR>—2 A worthless or useless object.<BR>—3 A reverse, evil, calamity, misfortune; R. 18. 14; रन्ध्रोपनिपातिनोऽनर्थाः<BR> Ś. 6; एकैकमप्यनर्थाय किमु यत्र चतुष्टयम् H. 1; cf. छिद्रेष्वनर्था<BR> बहुलीभवन्ति &c.; Ms. 4. 193; H. 4. 92; harmful object, danger; अर्थमनर्थं<BR> भावय नित्यम् Moha M. 2.<BR>—4 Nonsense, want of sense.<BR>—5 N. of Viṣṇu (आप्तसर्वकामत्वात्तस्य तथात्वम्).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अनर्थान्तरम्, अनर्थकर, अनर्थनाशिन्, अनर्थभाव, अनर्थलुप्त, अनर्थसंशयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थान्तरम्
अनर्थ + -अन्तरम् [न अर्थान्तरम्] sameness or identity. cf. आरम्भो<BR> व्यापारः कियेत्यनर्थान्तरम् ŚB. on MS. 11. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थकर
अनर्थ + -कर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 doing useless or unprofitable things.<BR>—2 mischievous, harmful; unprofitable, productive of evil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थनाशिन्
अनर्थ + -नाशिन् <i>m.</i> N. of Śiva (destroyer of calamities).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थभाव
अनर्थ + -भाव <i>a.</i> malicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थलुप्त
अनर्थ + -लुप्त <i>a.</i> [दृष्टार्थेन अलुप्तः] not devoid of the apparent<BR> meaning; free from all that is worthless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थसंशयः|अनर्थसंशय
अनर्थ + -संशयः [अनर्थकारी संशयः -शाक˚ त˚] —1 a great evil,<BR> hazardous adventure; प्रतिनिवर्ततामस्मादनर्थसंशयात् Māl. 5. 2.<BR> [न˚ त˚] not a risk of oneʼs money; safety of oneʼs wealth,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थ्य
अनर्थ्य, अनर्थक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Useless; meaningless; सर्वमप्येतदनर्थकम् Ve. 1; ˚आयास<BR> K. 108; not significant, as a particle used expletively.<BR>—2 Nonsensical.<BR>—3 Unprofitable.<BR>—4 Unfortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थक|अनर्थकं
अनर्थ्य, अनर्थक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Useless; meaningless; सर्वमप्येतदनर्थकम् Ve. 1; ˚आयास<BR> K. 108; not significant, as a particle used expletively.<BR>—2 Nonsensical.<BR>—3 Unprofitable.<BR>—4 Unfortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्थ्यकम्
अनर्थ्य, अनर्थक + .{@-कम्@} Nonsensical or incoherent talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्व
अनर्व <i>a.</i> Ved. Not lax or loose (अशिथिल) त्रिनाभिचकमजरमनर्वम्<BR> Rv. 1. 164. 2; free, unobstructed, permanent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्वन्
अनर्वन् <i>a.</i> [अर्व्-हिंसायां कनिन्, अर्वा सपत्नः, न˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Not inimical, not hostile or to be hated (अद्वेष्य); यो मित्राय<BR> वरुणायाविधज्जनोऽनर्वाणं तं परिपातो अंहसः Rv. 1. 136. 5.<BR>—2 Having no horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्विश्
अनर्विश् <i>m.</i> [अनसा शकटेन विशति प्राप्नोति; विश्-क्विप्, अहरा˚ रुः]<BR>—1 One who sits in a cart to fetch fuel &c.<BR>—2 [ऋ-कर्मणि विच्, अरं गन्तव्यं प्रति विशति, विश्-क्विप्, न˚ त˚]<BR> One who is not able to reach the destination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0077-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्शराति
अनर्शराति <i>a.</i> [अनर्शाय अपापिष्टाय रातिर्दानं यस्य] One<BR> who does not give to sinful persons, a sinless donor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनर्ह
अनर्ह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not deserving, not fit, not worthy of (with gen. or in comp.); अनर्हा<BR> गृहवासस्य Pt. 4; तान् हव्यकव्ययोर्विप्राननर्हान् मनुरब्रवीत् Ms. 3. 150.<BR>—2 Inadequate, unsuitable.<BR>—3 Undeserving of reward or punishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलः|अनल|अनलं
अनलः [नास्ति अलः पर्याप्तिर्यस्य, बहुदाह्यदहनेऽपि तृप्तेरभावात्<BR> Tv.; cf. नाग्निस्तृप्यति काष्टानाम्; said by some to be from अन् to breathe].<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 Agni or the god of fire. See अग्नि.<BR>—3 Digestive power, gastric juice; मन्दः संजायतेऽनलः Suśr.<BR>—4 Wind.<BR>—5 Bile.<BR>—6 One of the 8 Vasus, the fifth.<BR>—7 N. of Vāsudeva.<BR>—8 Names of various plants; चित्रक, रक्तचित्रक Plumbago Zeylanica<BR> and Rosea, भल्लातक the marking-nut tree.<BR>—9 The letter र्.<BR>—10 The number three.<BR>—11 (Astr.) The 50th year of Brhaspatiʼs cycle.<BR>—12 The third lunar mansion कृत्तिका.<BR>—13 A variety of Pitṛdeva or manes (कव्यवाहोऽनलः सोमः).<BR>—14 [अनान् प्राणान् लाति आत्मत्वेन] The soul (जीव).<BR>—15 N. of Viṣṇu (न नलति गन्धं प्रकटयति न बध्यते वा नल्-अच्).<BR>—16 The Supreme Being. cf. अनलो राज्ञि नाले च पुंस्यग्न्यौषधिभेदयोः Nm.<BR>—17 Anger; करिणां मुदे सनलदानलदाः Ki. 5. 25.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अनलात्मजः, अनलानन्दः, अनलद, अनलदीपन, अनलप्रभा, अनलप्रिया, अनलवाटः, अनलसादः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलात्मजः|अनलात्मज
अनलः + -आत्मजः N. of Kārtikeya; Mb. 9. 44. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलानन्दः|अनलानन्द
अनलः + -आनन्दः N. of a Vedāntic writer, author of Vedānta-Kalpataru.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलद
अनलः + -द <i>a.</i> [अनलं द्यति]<BR>—1 removing or destroying heat or fire;<BR>—2 = अग्निद q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलदीपन
अनलः + -दीपन <i>a.</i> [अनलं दीपयति] promoting digestion, stomachic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलप्रभा
अनलः + -प्रभा [अनलस्य प्रभेव प्रभा यस्य] N. of a plant (ज्योतिष्मती)<BR> Helicacabum Cardiospermum. (Mar. लघुमालकांगोणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलप्रिया
अनलः + -प्रिया N. of Agniʼs wife स्वाहा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलवाटः|अनलवाट
अनलः + -वाटः N. of ancient Paṭṭaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलसादः|अनलसाद
अनलः + -सादः loss of appetite, dyspepsia.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलस
अनलस <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not lazy, active, diligent, watchful, अनलसोऽनलसोमसमद्युतिः R. 9. 15.<BR>—2 Unable, incompetent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनलिः|अनलि
अनलिः [अनिति-अच् अनः अलिर्यत्र ब˚ शकन्ध्वा˚] N. of a tree<BR> (बकवृक्ष) Sesbana Grandiflora (तत्पुष्पाणां मधुपूर्णतया तन्मधुभिर्भ्रमराणां<BR> जीवनधारणात्तथात्वम् Tv.) (Mar. अगस्ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनल्प
अनल्प <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Numerous.<BR>—2 Not a little; not small, liberal, noble (as mind &c.); इति क्षमं<BR> नैतदनल्पचेतसाम् Ki. 14. 18; much; जल्पन्त्यनल्पाक्षरम् Pt. 1. 136<BR> profusely, in many words; विकसितवदनामनल्पजल्पेऽपि Bv. 1. 100, 2. 138.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अनल्पघोष, अनल्पमन्यु<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनल्पघोष
अनल्प + -घोष <i>a.</i> very clamorous or noisy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनल्पमन्यु
अनल्प + -मन्यु <i>a.</i> greatly enraged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवकाश|अनवकाशः
अनवकाश <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚]<BR>—1 Having no scope or occasion, uncalled for.<BR>—2 Inapplicable.<BR>—3 Having no opportunity or space.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवकाशः|अनवकाश
अनवकाश + .{@-शः@} [न˚ त˚] Absence of room or scope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवकाशिकः|अनवकाशिक
अनवकाशिकः Practising penance of standing on one leg; गात्रशय्या<BR> अशग्याश्च तथैवानवकाशिका Rām. 3. 6. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवकॢप्तिः|अनवकॢप्ति
अनवकॢप्तिः <i>f.</i> Impossibility, improbability, incredibility (P. III. 3. 145);<BR> अनवकॢप्त्यमर्षयोरकिवृत्तेऽपि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवगीत
अनवगीत <i>a.</i> Faultless प्रकृत्या कल्याणी मतिरनवगीतः परिचयः U. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवग्रह
अनवग्रह <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚] Irresistible, uncontrolled, impetuous,<BR> resistless; सुकुमारकायमनवग्रहः स्मरः (अभिहन्ति) Māl. 1. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवच्छिन्न
अनवच्छिन्न <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not bounded or marked off, not separated or cut.<BR>—2 Unlimited, immoderate, excessive.<BR>—3 Undefined; दिक्कालादि˚ Bh. 2. 1, 3. 1; undiscriminated, unmodified.<BR>—4 Uninterrupted, continuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवद्य
अनवद्य <i>a.</i> [न अवद्यः निन्द्यः] Faultless, blameless, unobjectionable,<BR> irreproachable; किमु धनैर्विद्यानवद्या यदि Bh. 2. 17; उदवहदनवद्यां<BR> तामवद्यादपेतः R. 7. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवद्या
अनवद्य + .{@-द्या@} N. of a damsel.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अनवद्याङ्ग, अनवद्यरूप, अनवद्यरागः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवद्याङ्ग
अनवद्य + -अङ्ग, -रूप <i>a.</i> having faultless limbs or from, exquisitely<BR> handsome; रूपस्य अनवद्यता M. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवद्याङ्गी|अनवद्यांगी
अनवद्य + -अङ्ग, -रूप + .({@-अङ्गी@}) a woman with a faultless form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवद्यरूप
अनवद्य + -अङ्ग, -रूप <i>a.</i> having faultless limbs or from, exquisitely<BR> handsome; रूपस्य अनवद्यता M. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवद्यरागः|अनवद्यराग
अनवद्य + -रागः a^1 variety of gems. Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवद्राण
अनवद्राण <i>a.</i> Not sleepy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवधान|अनवधानं
अनवधान <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚] Careless, inattentive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवधानम्
अनवधान + .{@-नम्@} Inadvertence, inattention;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवधानता
अनवधान + .{@-नम्@} + ˚ता carelessness, remissness<BR> in duty (प्रमाद); कर्तव्याकरणं यत्राकर्तव्यस्याथवा क्रिया । उच्यते<BR> द्वितयं तत्र प्रमादोऽनवधानता ॥.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवधि
अनवधि <i>a.</i> Unlimited, infinite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवन
अनवन <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚] Affording no help or protection.<BR> अनवनी नवनीपवनावलिः Śi. 6. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवनामित
अनवनामित <i>a.</i> Not lowered or bent down;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवनामितवैजयन्तः|अनवनामितवैजयन्त
अनवनामित + ˚वैजयन्तः a Buddhist<BR> term for a future universe (lit. having banners unlowered).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवपृग्ण
अनवपृग्ण <i>a.</i> Ved. Spreading all around, not closely united;<BR> अनवपृग्णा वितता वसानम् Rv. 1. 152. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवब्रव
अनवब्रव <i>a.</i> [अवब्रू-अच् न वचादेशः, न˚ त˚] Irreproachable,<BR> not open to censure (अपवादवर्जित); speaking authoritatively; विजेषकृदिन्द्र<BR> इवानवब्रवः Rv. 10. 84. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवभ्र
अनवभ्र <i>a.</i> [न भ्रंशते वा. ड. Tv.] Undiminished, undecaying,<BR> durable, lasting (अवभ्रंशशून्य); ˚राधस् प्रस्कम्भदेष्णा अनवभ्रराधसो<BR> Rv. 1. 166. 7 having undiminished wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवम
अनवम <i>a.</i> Not low or inferior; high, exalted, superior; सुधर्मानवमां<BR> सभाम् R. 17. 27, 9. 14,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवर|अनवरः
अनवर <i>a.</i> Not inferior; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवरत|अनवरतं
अनवरत <i>a.</i> Incessant, continuous, uninterrupted; ˚धनुर्ज्यास्फालनक्रूरपूर्वम् Ś. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवरतम्
अनवरत + .{@-तम्@} <i>adv.</i> Incessantly, continuously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवरार्ध्य
अनवरार्ध्य <i>a.</i> [अवरस्मिन् अर्धे भवः, यत्, न˚ त˚] Chief,<BR> best, excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवलम्ब|अनवलंब|अनवलम्बः
अनवलम्ब, -म्बन <i>a.</i><BR> [न˚ ब˚] Having no prop or support; not dependent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवलम्बन|अनवलंबन
अनवलम्ब, -म्बन <i>a.</i><BR> [न˚ ब˚] Having no prop or support; not dependent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवलम्बः|अनवलम्ब|अनवलंब
अनवलम्ब, -म्बन + .{@-म्बः, -म्बनम्@} Independence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवलम्बनम्
अनवलम्ब, -म्बन + .{@-म्बः, -म्बनम्@} Independence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवलोभनम्
अनवलोभनम् [न अवलुप्यते पुमानन्येन, अवलुप्-ल्युट् पृषो ˚पस्य<BR> भः Tv.] A sort of purificatory ceremony to be performed in the case<BR> of a pregnant woman in the third month after conception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0078-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस
अनवस <i>a.</i> [अव्-असच् अवसः भोजनं प्रीतिकरत्वात् न˚ ब˚]<BR> Ved. Having no (wholesome) food to eat (पथ्याशनरहित); अनवसो<BR> अनभीशू रजस्तूर्वि … Rv. 6. 66. 7; not stopping to eat by the way (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवसर|अनवसरः
अनवसर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Busy, having no leisure or interval for repose.<BR>—2 Ill-timed, inopportune.<BR>—3 Out of place, baseless; ˚रोयं घण्टानादः H. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवसरः|अनवसर
अनवसर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 Absence of leisure.<BR>—2 Ill-timedness, unseasonableness; कं याचे यत्र तत्र ध्रुवमनवसरग्रस्त<BR> एवार्थिभावः Māl. 9. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवसान
अनवसान <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚] Endless, having no setting; free from death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवसित
अनवसित <i>a.</i> [न˚ त˚] Not ended or finished; not determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवसिता
अनवसित + .{@-ता@} N. of a kind of Triṣṭubh metre, consisting of four lines<BR> with 11 feet in each.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस्कर|अनवस्करं
अनवस्कर <i>a.</i> Free from dirt, pure, clear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस्थ
अनवस्थ <i>a.</i> [नास्ति अवस्था यत्र] Unsteady; ˚स्थो निष्करुणश्च<BR> Dk. 135; unsettled, not fixed; अनवस्थौ हि दृश्येते युद्धे जयपराजयौ<BR> Rām. 5. 37. 55; ˚स्थो वायुः Śi. 11. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस्था
अनवस्थ + .{@-स्था@} [न˚ त˚]<BR>—1 Instability, unsettled condition, disorder, confusion.<BR>—2 Loose or unsteady conduct, incontinence.<BR>—3 (In phil.) Absence of finality or conclusion, an endless series of<BR> statements or causes and effects, one of the faults of reasoning (उपपाद्योपपादकयोरविश्रान्तिः);<BR> एवमप्यनवस्था स्याद्या मूलक्षतिकारिणी K. P. 2; एवं त्व ˚प्रसङ्गः Ś. B.<BR>—4 Not being 10 days old (दशाहाभावः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस्थान|अनवस्थानः
अनवस्थान <i>a.</i> Unstable, unsteady, fickle. विस्रम्भमनवस्थानस्य<BR> Bhāg. 5. 6. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस्थानः|अनवस्थान
अनवस्थान + .{@-नः@} Wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस्थानम्
अनवस्थान + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Instability, uncertainty, unsettled nature; जयपराजयानवस्थानात् Dk. 161.<BR>—2 Looseness of conduct, incontinence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस्थित
अनवस्थित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unsteady, fickle, unsettled; न कुर्यात्कर्हिचित्सख्यं मनसि ह्यनवास्थिते<BR> Bhāg. 5. 6. 3. ˚स्तिमितमूढघूर्णन्नयनः U. 3 with unsteady eyes;<BR> दयितास्वनवस्थितं नृणां न खलु प्रेम चलं सुहृज्जने Ku. 4. 28.<BR>—2 Changed, altered; अहो ˚तो भूमिसंनिवेशः U. 2.<BR>—3 Faithless, loose in morals or moral conduct, dissolute (व्यभिचारिन्);<BR> नारीर्हत्वाऽनवस्थिताः Ms. 11. 138.<BR>—4 Unable to stay or remain; प्रस्थितं तमनवस्थितं प्रियाः R. 19. 31;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस्थितत्वम्
अनवस्थित + ˚त्वम्, ˚स्थितिः instability, looseness of conduct. Bhāg. 5. 14. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस्थितिः|अनवस्थिति
अनवस्थित + ˚त्वम्, ˚स्थितिः instability, looseness of conduct. Bhāg. 5. 14. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवस्थितम्
अनवस्थित + .{@-तम्@} Unmethodical, not in order; प्रथितं त्रिषु लोकेषु कपित्वमनवस्थितम्<BR> Rām. 5. 55. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवह्वर
अनवह्वर <i>a.</i> [अवहृ-कौटिल्ये-अच्, न˚ त˚] Not crooked,<BR> straightforward. ता सम्राजा घृतासुती आदित्या दानुनस्पती । सचेते अनवह्वरम् ॥<BR> Rv. 9. 41. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवाञ्च्|अनवांच्
अनवाञ्च् <i>a.</i> Not tending downwards, looking up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवानम्
अनवानम् <i>ind.</i> [अवानः श्वासोच्छ्वासः स यथा न स्यात्तथा] Without<BR> breathing between; in one breath, without a pause, <i>uno tenore</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवाय
अनवाय <i>a.</i> [अव-इ-घञ् अवायः अवयवः, न˚ ब˚] Without<BR> parts (निरवयव); uninterrupted, unyielding. ब्रह्मद्विषे क्रव्यादे<BR> घोरचक्षसे द्वेषो धत्तमनवायं किमीदिने ॥ Rv. 7. 104. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवेक्षक
अनवेक्षक <i>a.</i> Regardless of; careless, indifferent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0079-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनवेक्ष
