अनुपेत
अनुपेत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not endowed with.<BR>—2 Not invested with the sacred thread (अनुपनीत). यं प्रव्रजन्तमनुपेतमपेतकृत्यम्<BR> Bhāg. 1. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0099-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्त
