अनुप्तशस्य
अनुप्त + ˚शस्य fallow, meadow, (ground &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0099-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्त्रिम
अनुप्त्रिम <i>a.</i> (अ वप् कित्र मप्) Grown without being sown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0099-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

