अनुप्रदानम्
अनुप्रदानम्<BR>—1 A gift, donation.<BR>—2 A sort of external effort of the vocal organs giving rise to particular<BR> letters (बाह्यप्रयत्न); एते श्वासानुप्रदाना अघोषाश्च विवृण्वते Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0099-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रपातम्
अनुप्रपातम्, -दम् <i>ind.</i><BR> Going in succession; गेह ˚तम्, -दम्<BR> आस्ते गेहं गेहम् अनुप्रपातं-दम् P. III. 4. 56. Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0099-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रपादम्
अनुप्रपातम्, -दम् <i>ind.</i><BR> Going in succession; गेह ˚तम्, -दम्<BR> आस्ते गेहं गेहम् अनुप्रपातं-दम् P. III. 4. 56. Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0099-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रभवः|अनुप्रभव
अनुप्रभवः Cycle of births and deaths.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0099-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रयुज्
अनुप्रयुज् €7 Ā. To employ, apply, employ in addition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0099-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुप्रयोगः|अनुप्रयोग
