अनुसर्गः|अनुसर्ग
अनुसर्गः A separate creation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0113-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसवनम्
अनुसवनम् (also अनुसवम्) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 After a sacrifice.<BR>—2 At every sacrifice, after ablutions.<BR>—3 Every moment. cf. Bhāg. 1. 15. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0113-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसवम्
