अनुसृ
अनुसृ €1 P.<BR>—1 To follow (in all senses); go after, attend, pursue; to practise, observe;<BR> betake oneself to; पूर्वोद्दिष्टामनुसर पुरीम् Me. 30 go to; उदीचीं<BR> दिशम् अनुसरेस्तिर्यगायामशोभी 59.<BR>—2 To go over or through. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To lead forward; वायुरनुसारयतीव माम् Rām.<BR>—2 To cause to pursue, follow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0113-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

