अनुसरणम्
अनुसरणम्<BR>—1 following, pursuing, going after, seeking after; अनुसारभयाद्भीताः<BR> प्राङ्मुखाः प्राद्रवन्पुनः Mb. 10. 1. 4. कन्दनानुसरणं क्रियताम्<BR> H. 3; कनकसूत्र˚ प्रवृत्तै राजपुरुषैः Pt. 1.<BR>—2 Conformity to, accordance with, consequence of (in instr. or abl.)<BR> इन्दोस्त्वदनुसरणक्लिष्टकान्तेः Me. 86. Custom, usage, habit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0113-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारः|अनुसार
अनुसारः<BR>—1 Going after, following (fig. also); pursuit; व्याधानुसारचकिता हरिणीव<BR> यासि Mk. 1. 17; शब्दानुसारेण अवलोक्य Ś. 7 looking in the direction<BR> of the sound; कपटानुसारकुशलः Mk. 9. 5 following up or tracing fraud.<BR>—2 Conformity to, accordance with, suitability, conformity to usage; किरणानुसारगलितेन<BR> K. 137, 194, 204; धर्मशास्त्रानुसारेण Y. 2. 1.<BR>—3 Custom, usage, established practice; अनुसारादधिका (वृद्धिः) Ms. 8. 152.<BR>—4 Received or established authority, especially of codes of law.<BR>—5 Nature, natural condition of anything.<BR>—6 Currency, prevalence.<BR>—7 Consequence, result.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0113-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

