अनुसारक
अनुसारक, -सारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Following, pursuing, going after, attendant on; तामभ्यगच्छद्रुदितानुसारी<BR> R. 14. 70; मृगानुसारिणं पिनाकिनम् Ś. 1. 6; परिमलः पवनानुसारी<BR> Dk. 91; कृपणानुसारि च धनम् Pt. 1. 278 going after, falling to the lot of.<BR>—2 According or conformable to, following; यथाशास्त्र˚ Ms. 7. 31.<BR>—3 Seeking, looking out for, investigating, scrutinizing; नित्यं छिद्रानुसार्यरेः Ms. 7. 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0113-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अनुसारिन्
