अन्तःकोटरपुष्पी
अन्तर् + -कोटरपुष्पी = अण्डकोटरपुष्पी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःकोपः|अन्तःकोप
अन्तर् + -कोपः<BR>—1 internal disturbance; H. 3.<BR>—2 inward wrath, secret anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तःकोशम्
अन्तर् + -कोशम् the interior of a storeroom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गङ्गा
अन्तर् + -गङ्गा the secret or hidden Ganges (supposed to communicate underground<BR> with a secret stream in Mysore).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गडु
