अन्तर्गर्भ
अन्तर् + -गर्भ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 bearing young, pregnant.<BR>—2 having a गर्भ or inside; so ˚गर्भिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गर्भिन्
अन्तर् + -गर्भ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 bearing young, pregnant.<BR>—2 having a गर्भ or inside; so ˚गर्भिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गिरम्
अन्तर् + -गिरम्, -गिरि <i>ind.</i> in mountains. अध्यास्तेन्तर्गिरं यस्मात् कस्तन्नावैति<BR> कारणम् Bk. 5. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गिरि
अन्तर् + -गिरम्, -गिरि <i>ind.</i> in mountains. अध्यास्तेन्तर्गिरं यस्मात् कस्तन्नावैति<BR> कारणम् Bk. 5. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गुदवलयः|अन्तर्गुदवलय
अन्तर् + -गुदवलयः^1 the sphincter muscle.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251204. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गूढ
अन्तर् + -गूढ <i>a.</i> concealed inside, being inward; ˚घनव्यथः U. 3. 1;<BR> R. 19. 57;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अन्तर्गूढविषः|अन्तर्गूढविष
अन्तर् + -गूढ + ˚विषः with poison concealed in the heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

