अन्तर् + -गृहम्, -गेहम्, -भवनम् [अन्तःस्थं गृहम् &c.]<BR>—1 the inner apartment of a house, the interior of a house.<BR>—2 N. of a holy place in Benares; पञ्चक्रोश्यां कृतं पापमन्तर्गेहे विनश्यति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0119-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

