अन्तर्ज्योतिस्
अन्तर् + -ज्योतिस् <i>a.</i> enlightened inwardly, with an enlightened soul.<BR> योऽन्तःसुखोऽन्तरारामस्तथान्तर्ज्योतिरेव यः Bg. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0120-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

