अब्जः|अब्ज
अब्ज + .{@-ब्जः@}<BR>—1 The conch; गाण्डीवं व्याक्षिपत्पार्थः कृष्णोऽप्यब्जमवादयत् Mb. 7. 129. 38.<BR> (<i>n.</i> also).<BR>—2 The moon.<BR>—3 Camphor.<BR>—4 N. of a tree, Barringtonia Acutangula (निचुल).<BR>—5 Dhanvantari,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0166-2" target="_blank">Page0166-2</a>]<BR> physician of the gods, said to be produced at the churning of the ocean<BR> along with other jewels. cf. अब्जस्तु निचुले शङ्खे पद्मे धन्वन्तरावपि ।<BR> वैद्येन्दोरपि … Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0166-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

