अब्धिः + -जम् + .({@-जौ@}) (dual) N. of the Aśvins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0166-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिजा
अब्धिः + -जम् + .({@-जा@})<BR>—1 spirituous liquor (produced from<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">Page0167-1</a>]<BR> the ocean).<BR>—2 the Goddess Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0166-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिझषः|अब्धिझष
अब्धिः + -झषः a sea-fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिडिण्डिरः
अब्धिः + -डिण्डिरः froth, foam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिद्वीपा
अब्धिः + -द्वीपा —1 the earth. —2 a portion of land surrounded by the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिनगरी
अब्धिः + -नगरी N. of Dwārakā, the capital of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिनवनीतकः|अब्धिनवनीतक
अब्धिः + -नवनीतकः —1 the moon (the butter of the ocean).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिमण्डूकी
अब्धिः + -मण्डूकी the pearl-oyster.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिशयनः|अब्धिशयन
अब्धिः + -शयनः N. of Viṣṇu (so called from his resting in the ocean<BR> at the destruction and renovation of the world).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्धिसारः|अब्धिसार
अब्धिः + -सारः a gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्बिन्दुः|अब्बिन्दु
अब्बिन्दुः A tear; Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्भक्ष|अब्भक्षः
अब्भक्ष <i>a.</i> Living upon water. अब्भक्षो मासमासीत स जापी नियतेन्द्रियः Y. 3. 285.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्भक्षः|अब्भक्ष
अब्भक्ष + .{@-क्षः@} A serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्भक्षणम्
अब्भक्षणम् Living upon water, a kind of fasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्भ्र|अब्भ्रं
अब्भ्र &c. = अभ्र q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रह्मचर्य|अब्रह्मचर्य्य
अब्रह्मचर्य <i>a.</i> Unchaste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रह्मचर्यम्
अब्रह्मचर्य + .{@-र्यम्, -र्यकम्@}<BR>—1 Unchastity.<BR>—2 Sexual union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रह्मचर्यकम्
अब्रह्मचर्य + .{@-र्यम्, -र्यकम्@}<BR>—1 Unchastity.<BR>—2 Sexual union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रह्मण्य|अब्रह्मण्यं
अब्रह्मण्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not fit for a Brāhmaṇa; अब्रह्मण्यमवर्णं स्यात् ब्रह्मण्यं ब्रह्मणो<BR> हितम् Halāy.<BR>—2 Inimical to Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रह्मण्यम्
अब्रह्मण्य + .{@-ण्यम्@} An act not befitting a Brāhmaṇa; an un-Brahmanical act.<BR> In dramas usually found as an exclamation uttered by a Brāhmaṇa in the<BR> sense of ‘to the rescue’, ‘help’, ‘help’, ‘a horrible or disgraceful deed has been committed’<BR>; अहो ˚ण्यं ˚ण्यम् Pt. 1; Ś. 6; U. 1; अत्रान्तरे<BR> ब्राह्मणेन मृतपुत्रमारोप्य राजद्वारि सोरस्ताडनमब्रह्मण्यमुद्घोषितम्<BR> U. 2 a cry of help, or distress; अथैत्य योगनन्दस्य व्याडिना क्रन्दितं<BR> पुरः । अब्रह्मण्यमनुत्क्रान्तजीवो योगस्थितो द्विजः Bṛ. Kath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रह्मन्
अब्रह्मन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not accompanied by devotion; wanting in sacred or divine knowledge.<BR>—2 Separated from or devoid of Brāhmaṇas; नाब्रह्म क्षत्रमृध्नोति Ms. 9. 322.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अब्रह्मविद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रह्मविद्
अब्रह्मन् + -विद् <i>a.</i> not knowing Brahman or the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रह्मता
अब्रह्मता Want of devotion; अब्रह्मता यदसन् Rv. 5. 33. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्राह्मण|अब्राह्मणः
अब्राह्मण <i>a.</i> Devoid of or without Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्राह्मणः|अब्राह्मण
अब्राह्मण + .{@-णः@} Not a Brāhmaṇa; अब्राह्मणादध्ययनमापत्काले विधीयते । …<BR> नाब्राह्मणे गुरौ शिष्ये । वासमात्यन्तिकं वसेत् Ms. 2. 241-2;<BR> (= शूद्र) six kinds are usually mentioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्राह्मण्यम्
अब्राह्मण्यम्<BR>—1 Violation of the duties of a Brāhmaṇa; breach of vows or sanctity.<BR>—2 = अब्रह्मण्यम् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्रूकृतम्
अब्रूकृतम् Making a growling (or <i>Abrū</i>) sound, an indistinct speech<BR> uttered by shutting the lips.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अब्लिङ्गम्
अब्लिङ्गम् [अपां लिङ्गं ज्ञापनसामर्थ्यं यत्र] A hymn or verse<BR> [Rv. 10. 9. 1-3 addressed to the waters]; अब्लिङ्गानि जपेच्चैव गायत्रीं<BR> मनसा सकृत् Y. 3. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्त
अभक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not devoted or attached.<BR>—2 Not connected with, detached.<BR>—3 Not worshipping.<BR>—4 Unaccepted.<BR>—5 Not eaten.<BR>—6 Not received as a share; यस्मै धायुरदधा मर्त्यायाभक्तम् Rv. 3. 30. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्तम्
अभक्त + .{@-क्तम्@} Not food; ˚छन्दस्, ˚रुच् want of appetite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्तिः|अभक्ति
अभक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Want of devotion or attachment.<BR>—2 Unbelief, incredulity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्षः|अभक्ष
अभक्षः, -भक्षणम्<BR> Not eating anything; fasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्षणम्
अभक्षः, -भक्षणम्<BR> Not eating anything; fasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्ष्य|अभक्ष्यं
अभक्ष्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not to be eaten.<BR>—2 Prohibited from eating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभक्ष्यम्
अभक्ष्य + .{@-क्ष्यम्@} A prohibited article of food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभग
अभग <i>a.</i> Unfortunate, ill-fated; Av. 5. 31. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभङ्ग|अभङ्गः
अभङ्ग <i>a.</i> Not broken &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभङ्गः|अभङ्ग
अभङ्ग + .{@-ङ्गः@}<BR>—1 Absence of fracture or defeat.<BR>—2 (In Rhet.) A variety of श्लेष where another meaning is obtained<BR> without dividing the words (this corresponds to अर्थश्लेष); S. D. 644.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभङ्गुर|अभंगुर
अभङ्गुर <i>a.</i> Undisturbed, firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभद्र
अभद्र <i>a.</i> Inauspicious, bad, evil, ill, wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभद्रम्
अभद्र + .{@-द्रम्@}<BR>—1 Evil, sin, wickedness.<BR>—2 Sorrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभय|अभयं|अभयः
अभय <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚] Free from fear or danger, secure,<BR> safe; वैराग्यमेवाभयम् Bh. 3. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयः|अभय|अभयं
अभय + .{@-यः@} [न भयं यस्मात्]<BR>—1 An epithet of the Supreme Being, or knowledge concerning that being.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR>—3 One devoid of all worldly possessions.<BR>—4 One who fearlessly executes scriptural commandments.<BR>—5 N. of a Yoga (conjuncture or time) favourable to a march or expedition.<BR>—6 A refuge-offering pose of the hand of an image; Māna. 12. 120-21.<BR> See अभयमुद्रा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभया
अभय + .{@-या@}<BR>—1 N. of a plant (हरीतकी, Mar. हिरडा).<BR>—2 A form of the goddess Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयम्
अभय + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 Absence or removal of fear.<BR>—2 Security, safety, protection from fear or danger. मया तस्याभयं<BR> दत्तम् Pt. 1; अभयस्य हि यो दाता Ms. 8. 303; Ś. 2. 17.<BR>—3 N. of a sacrificial hymn.<BR>—4 The root of a fragrant grass (वीरणमूलम्, उशीरम्).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अभयकृत्, अभयगिरिवासिन्, अभयगिरिविहारः, अभयडिण्डिमः, अभयद, अभयदायिन्, अभयप्रद, अभयदक्षिणा, अभयदानम्, अभयप्रदानम्, अभयपत्रम्, अभयमुद्रा, अभययाचना, अभयवचनम्, अभयवाच्, अभयसनि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयकृत्
अभय + -कृत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not terrific, mild.<BR>—2 giving safety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयगिरिवासिन्
अभय + -गिरिवासिन् <i>m.</i> ‘one dwelling on the mountain of safety’, N. of<BR> a class of Kātyāyanaʼs pupils.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयगिरिविहारः|अभयगिरिविहार
अभय + -गिरिविहारः Buddhist monastery on the Abhayagiri.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयडिण्डिमः|अभयडिण्डिम|अभयडिंडिम
अभय + -डिण्डिमः<BR>—1 proclamation of assurance of safety.<BR>—2 a military or war-drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयद|अभयदः
अभय + -द, -दायिन्, -प्रद <i>a.</i> giving a guarantee or promise of safety;<BR> भयेष्वभयदः Rām.; ˚प्रद; ऐश्वर्यमभयप्रदः Ms. 4. 232.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयदः|अभयद
अभय + -द, -दायिन्, -प्रद + .({@-दः@}) an Arhat of the Jainas; N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयदायिन्
अभय + -द, -दायिन्, -प्रद <i>a.</i> giving a guarantee or promise of safety;<BR> भयेष्वभयदः Rām.; ˚प्रद; ऐश्वर्यमभयप्रदः Ms. 4. 232.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयप्रद
अभय + -द, -दायिन्, -प्रद <i>a.</i> giving a guarantee or promise of safety;<BR> भयेष्वभयदः Rām.; ˚प्रद; ऐश्वर्यमभयप्रदः Ms. 4. 232.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयदक्षिणा
अभय + -दक्षिणा, -दानम्, -प्रदानम् giving a promise, assurance, or guarantee<BR> of safety or protection (from danger); सर्वप्रदानेष्वभयप्रदानम्<BR> (प्रधानम्) Pt. 1. 290; सर्वतः प्रतिगृह्णीयान्मध्वथाभयदक्षिणाम् Ms. 4. 247.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयदानम्
अभय + -दक्षिणा, -दानम्, -प्रदानम् giving a promise, assurance, or guarantee<BR> of safety or protection (from danger); सर्वप्रदानेष्वभयप्रदानम्<BR> (प्रधानम्) Pt. 1. 290; सर्वतः प्रतिगृह्णीयान्मध्वथाभयदक्षिणाम् Ms. 4. 247.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयप्रदानम्
अभय + -दक्षिणा, -दानम्, -प्रदानम् giving a promise, assurance, or guarantee<BR> of safety or protection (from danger); सर्वप्रदानेष्वभयप्रदानम्<BR> (प्रधानम्) Pt. 1. 290; सर्वतः प्रतिगृह्णीयान्मध्वथाभयदक्षिणाम् Ms. 4. 247.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयपत्रम्
अभय + -पत्रम् a written document or paper granting assurance of safety;<BR> cf. the modern ‘safe-conduct’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभयमुद्रा
अभय + -मुद्रा a variety of mudrā in Tantra literature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभययाचना
