अभिकम्
अभिकम् €10 Ā. To love, desire; कः स्त्रियमभिकामयमानां नाभिनन्दति<BR> Dk. 88; न च कामसंपदभिकामयते Ki. 18. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0169-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिकाम
अभिकाम <i>a.</i> [कम्-अच् or अभिवृद्धः कामो यस्य] Affectionate,<BR> loving, desirous, wishing for, हृष्टमस्माकमत्यन्तमभिकामं च नः<BR> सदा (प्रह्वम्) Mb. 6. 76. 2 lustful, with the object of love in<BR> acc. or in comp.; याचे त्वामभिकामाहम् Mb. कामाभिकाममनु यः प्रपतन्नसङ्गात्<BR> Bhāg. 7. 9. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0169-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिकाम
अभिकाम + .{@-म@}<BR>—1 Affection, love.<BR>—2 Wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0169-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिकामम्
अभिकाम + .{@-मम्@} <i>ind.</i> Longingly, with desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0169-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिकामिक
अभिकामिक <i>a.</i> Voluntary; गतिं जिगीषतः पादौ रुरुहातेऽभिकामिकाम्<BR> Bhāg. 2. 10. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0169-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

