अभिकम्प् €1 Ā. To shake or tremble violently.<BR>.━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To stir, shake.<BR>—2 To allure, entice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0169-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिकम्पनम्
