अभिकाङ्क्ष्|अभिकांक्ष्
अभिकाङ्क्ष् €1 U. —1 To ask, request; long for, wish or desire for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0169-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

