अभिक्रम्
अभिक्रम् €1 U., €4 P.<BR>—1 To step or go near to approach; तमभिक्रम्य सर्वेऽद्य वयं चार्थामहे वसु Mb.<BR>—2 To roam over, wander, pass or walk over.<BR>—3 To attack, assail, fall upon.<BR>—4 To undertake, begin; to set about, prepare; गमनायाभिचक्राम Rām.<BR>━<i>Caus.</i> To bring near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0169-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभिक्रमः|अभिक्रम
