अभिलिखितम्
अभिलिखित + .{@-तम्, अभिलेखितम्, -नम्@}<BR>—1 Writing, inscribing.<BR>—2 A writing; ज्ञातिबन्धुसाक्ष्यभिलेखितैः Y. 2. 149. A written document.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0183-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

