अभिसंस्कारः|अभिसंस्कार
अभिसंस्कारः<BR>—1 Idea, thought, imagination.<BR>—2 Vain or profitless performance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0187-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

