अभ्यर्थ्
अभ्यर्थ् €10 Ā.<BR>—1 To request, beg, solicit, ask, entreat (with two acc.); इमं सारगं<BR> प्रियाप्रवृत्तिनिमित्तम् अभ्यर्थये V. 4; माम् अनभ्यर्थनीयमभ्यर्थयते<BR> Māl. 7; अवकाशं किलोदन्वान् रामायाभ्यर्थितो ददौ R. 4. 58.<BR>—2 To long for, desire, woo, court; यदि सा तापसकन्यका अनभ्यर्थनीया Ś. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्थनम्
अभ्यर्थनम्, -ना<BR> A request, an entreaty, petition, suit; ˚नाभङ्गभयेन Ku. 1. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्थना
अभ्यर्थनम्, -ना<BR> A request, an entreaty, petition, suit; ˚नाभङ्गभयेन Ku. 1. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्थनीय
अभ्यर्थनीय, -र्थ्य <i>pot. p.</i><BR> To be asked, requested or desired^1, कार्येषु<BR> चैककार्यत्वादभ्यर्थ्योऽस्मि न वज्रिणा R. 10. 40.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251204. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्थ्य
अभ्यर्थनीय, -र्थ्य <i>pot. p.</i><BR> To be asked, requested or desired^1, कार्येषु<BR> चैककार्यत्वादभ्यर्थ्योऽस्मि न वज्रिणा R. 10. 40.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251204. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्थित
अभ्यर्थित <i>a.</i> Asked, insisted; काममभ्यर्थितोऽश्नीयात् Ms. 2. 189.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्थितम्
अभ्यर्थित + .{@-तम्@} A request; उभयाभ्यर्थितेनैतन्मया Y. 2. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्थिन्
अभ्यर्थिन् <i>a.</i> One who begs, asks &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्दनम्
अभ्यर्दनम् Torturing, distressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्ध
अभ्यर्ध <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Being on this side.<BR>—2 Near.<BR>—3 Increasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्धम्
अभ्यर्ध + .{@-र्धम्@} Nearness.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अभ्यर्धयज्वन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्धयज्वन्
अभ्यर्ध + -यज्वन् <i>m.</i> granting gifts, increasing the sacrificerʼs prosperity;<BR> सिषक्ति पूषा अभ्यर्धयज्वा Rv. 6. 50. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्ह्
अभ्यर्ह् €1. €10 P. To salute. honour, worship, pay oneʼs respects or<BR> compliments; परशुरामो माल्यवन्तमभ्यर्हयति Mv. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्हणा
अभ्यर्हणा<BR>—1 Worship.<BR>—2 Respect, honour, reverence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0193-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अभ्यर्हणीय
