अमर + -प्रख्य, -प्रभ <i>a.</i><BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0201-1" target="_blank">Page0201-1</a>]<BR> like an immortal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0200-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

