अम्बु + -क्रिया libation of water; Bk.; presentation of water to the Manes<BR> of the deceased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुकुक्कुटी
अम्बु + -कुक्कुटी An acquatic hen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुग
अम्बु + -ग, -चर, -चारिन् <i>a.</i> moving or living in water, aquatic (as<BR> fish &c.); अद्रिं दधाराम्बुचरात्मना Bhāg. 8. 5. 11; Ms. 12. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुचर
अम्बु + -ग, -चर, -चारिन् <i>a.</i> moving or living in water, aquatic (as<BR> fish &c.); अद्रिं दधाराम्बुचरात्मना Bhāg. 8. 5. 11; Ms. 12. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुचारिन्
अम्बु + -ग, -चर, -चारिन् <i>a.</i> moving or living in water, aquatic (as<BR> fish &c.); अद्रिं दधाराम्बुचरात्मना Bhāg. 8. 5. 11; Ms. 12. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

