अम्बु + -घनः hail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुचत्वरम्
अम्बु + -चत्वरम् a lake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुचामरम्
अम्बु + -चामरम् an aquatic plant (शैवाल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुज|अम्बुजं|अम्बुजः
अम्बु + -ज <i>a.</i> produced in water, aquatic (opp. स्थलज); सुगन्धीनि<BR> च माल्यानि स्थलजान्यम्बुजानि च Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुजः|अम्बुज|अम्बुजं
अम्बु + -ज + .({@-जः@})<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 camphor.<BR>—3 the Sārasa bird.<BR>—4 the conch; दध्मौ तारेण चाम्बुजम् Mb. 7. 173. 9, 5 N. of a tree (हिज्जल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुजम्
अम्बु + -ज + .({@-जम्@})<BR>—1 a lotus; इन्दीवरेण नयनं मुखमम्बुजेन Ś. Til. 3; A. Rām. 4. 1. 2.<BR>—2 the thunderbolt of Indra. ˚भूः, ˚आसनः ‘the lotus-born god’ Brahmā;<BR> A. Rām. ˚आसना the goddess Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुजन्मन्
अम्बु + -जन्मन् <i>n.</i> a lotus; ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 the conch.<BR>—3 Sārasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुतस्करः|अम्बुतस्कर
अम्बु + -तस्करः ‘water-thief’, the sun (whose heat drinks up water).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

