अम्बुद|अम्बुदः
अम्बु + -द <i>a.</i> giving or yielding water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुदः|अम्बुद
