अम्बुधिस्रवा
अम्बु + -धिस्रवा Aloe perfoliata (Mar. कोरफड).<BR>—2 the ocean; क्षार˚ Bh. 2. 6.<BR>—3 the number four (in Math.). ˚प्रसवा N. of a plant (घृतकुमारी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुनाथः|अम्बुनाथ
अम्बु + -नाथः The ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुनामन्
