अम्बुप|अम्बुपः
अम्बु + -प <i>a.</i> drinking water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुपः|अम्बुप
अम्बु + -प + .({@-पः@})<BR>—1 the ocean.<BR>—2 Varuṇa, the regent of waters; रक्षोऽम्बुपानिलशशीशपुराणि चाष्टौ<BR> Sid. Śir.; शक्राम्बुपयमानां च चतुर्थस्त्वं भविष्यसि Rām. 7. 4. 17.<BR>—3 N. of a plant (चक्रमर्दक; Mar. टाकळा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0207-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

