अम्बुराजः|अम्बुराज
अम्बु + -राजः<BR>—1 the ocean.<BR>—2 Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुराशिः|अम्बुराशि
