अम्बुरुहम्
अम्बु + -रुहः, -रुहम्, a lotus; विपुलिनाम्बुरुहा न सरिद्वधूः Ki. 5. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुरोहिणी
अम्बु + -रोहिणी a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुवाची
अम्बु + -वाची [अम्बु तद्वर्षणं वाचयति सूचयति] an epithet applied<BR> to the earth during four days from the 10th to the 13th in the dark half<BR> of the month of Āṣāḍha when it is supposed to be unclean (रजस्वला<BR> इव) and agriculture is prohibited; Brav. P. 2. 77. ˚प्रदः the 10th<BR> day; ˚त्यागः 13th day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

