अम्बुवासी
अम्बु + -वासिनी, -वासी N. of a plant (पाटला), the trumpet flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

