अम्बुवेतसः|अम्बुवेतस
अम्बु + -वेतसः a kind of cane or reed growing in water. (Mar. लव्हाळा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुशिरीषिका
