अम्बुमत्|अंबुमत्|अम्बुमन्त्
अम्बुमत् <i>a.</i> Watery, containing water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुमती
अम्बुमत् + .{@-ती@} N. of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बुरः|अम्बुर
अम्बुरः, (-म्बरः)<BR> A threshold of a door.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बरः|अम्बर|अंबर|अंबरं|अम्बरं
