अम्बूकृत|अंबूकृत|अम्बूकृतं
अम्बूकृत <i>a.</i> Sputtered, pronounced indistinctly in shutting the<BR> lips, the sound thus remaining as it were in the mouth; uttered while<BR> emitting saliva from the mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्बूकृतम्
अम्बूकृत + .{@-तम्@} A sputtering noise, the growling of a bear; दधति कुहरभाजामत्र<BR> भल्लूकयूनामनुरसितगुरूणि स्त्यानम्बूकृतानि U. 2. 21; Māl. 9. 6; Mv. 5. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्ब्यः|अम्ब्य|अंब्यः
अम्ब्यः Ved. A chanter. वेति स्तोतव अम्ब्यम् Rv. 8. 72. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भ्|अंभ्
अम्भ् €1 Ā. [अम्भते, अम्भित] To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भस्|अंभस्
अम्भस् [By Uṇ. 4. 209 आप्-असुन्; or अम्भ् शब्दे असुन्]<BR>—1 water; कथमप्यम्भसामन्तरानिष्पत्तेः प्रतीक्षते Ku. 2. 37; स्वेद्यमामज्वरं<BR> प्राज्ञः कोऽम्भसा परिषिञ्चति Śi. 2. 54; अम्भसाकृतम् done by water P. VI. 3. 3.<BR>—2 The sky.<BR>—3 The fourth sign of the zodiac.<BR>—4 Mystical name of the letter व्.<BR>—5 A God.<BR>—6 A man.<BR>—7 The world of the Manes.<BR>—8 A Rākṣasa or Asura.<BR>—9 (In Phil.) तुष्टि or acquiescence of the soul.<BR>—10 Power; splendour; fruitfulness. ━(<i>dual</i>) अम्भसी Heaven and<BR> earth. ━(pl.) Collective name for Gods, men, Manes, and demons. [cf.<BR> L. <i>imber</i>; Gr. <i>ombpos</i>.]<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अम्भोज, अम्भोजन्मन्, अम्भोदः, अम्भोधर, अम्भोधिः, अम्भोनिधिः, अम्भोराशिः, अम्भोरुह्, अम्भःसारम्, अम्भःसूः, अम्भःस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोज|अम्भोजं|अम्भोजः
अम्भस् + -ज <i>a.</i> produced in water,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-2" target="_blank">Page0208-2</a>]<BR> aquatic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोजः|अम्भोज|अम्भोजं
अम्भस् + -ज + .({@-जः@})<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 the (Indian) crane or Sārasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोजम्
अम्भस् + -ज + .({@-जम्@}) a lotus^1; बाले तव मुखाम्भोजे कथमिन्दीवरद्वयम् Ś. Til. 17;<BR> so पाद˚, नेत्र˚; ˚खण्डः a group of lotus^2 flowers; कुमुदवनमपश्रि<BR> श्रीमदम्भोजखण्डम् Śi. 9. 11, 64; ˚जन्मन् <i>m.</i>, -जनिः, -योनिः<BR> the lotus^3-born God, epithet of Brahmā. सदनमुपगतोऽहं<BR> पूर्वमम्भोजयोनेः Prab.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251204. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251204. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR>[3] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251204. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोजा
अम्भस् + -ज + .({@-जा@}) Glycirrhiza glabra (Mar. ज्येष्ठमध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अम्भोजन्मन्
अम्भस् + -जन्मन् <i>n.</i> a lotus; अम्भोजन्मजनिस्तदन्तरगतो Bhāg. 10. 13. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

