अम्लः|अम्ल|अम्लं
अम्ल + .{@-म्लः@}<BR>—1 Sourness, acidity, one of the six kinds of tastes or <i>rasas</i> q. v.<BR> यो दन्तहर्षमुत्पादयति मुखास्रावं जनयति श्रद्धां चोत्पादयति सोऽम्लः<BR> (रसः) Suśr.<BR>—2 Vinegar.<BR>—3 Wood-sorrel.<BR>—4 = अम्लवेतस q. v.<BR>—5 The common citron tree.<BR>—6 Belch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0208-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

