अय्
अय् €1 Ā. (sometimes P. also, especially with उद्) (अयते, अयाञ्चक्रे,<BR> अयितुम्, अयित.) To go. उदयति यदि भानुः पश्चिमे दिग्विभागे Bh. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

