अय + -शोभिन् <i>a.</i> bright with good fortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयन|अयनं
अयन <i>a.</i> [अय्-ल्युट्] Going (at the end of comp.); यथेमा<BR> नद्यः स्यन्दमानाः समुद्रायणाः Praśna. Up.<BR>—1 Going, moving, walking; as in रामायणम्.<BR>—2 A walk, path,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">Page0209-2</a>]<BR> way, road; आयन्नापोऽयनमिच्छमानाः Rv. 3. 33. 7. अगस्त्यचिह्नादयनात् R. 16. 44.<BR>—3 A place, site, abode, place of resort; Bṛ. Up. 2. 4. 11. ता यदस्यायनं<BR> पूर्वम् Ms. 1. 10 (occurring in the derivation of the word नारायण).<BR>—4 A way of entrance, an entrance (to an array of troops or व्यूह);<BR> अयनेषु च सर्वेषु यथाभागमवस्थिताः Bg. 1. 11.<BR>—5 Rotation, circulation period; आङ्गिरसाम् अयनम्; इष्टि˚, पशु˚.<BR>—6 A particular period in the year for the performance of particular sacrificial<BR> or other religious works; N. of certain sacrificial performances; as गवामयनम्.<BR>—7 The sunʼs passage, north and south of the equator.<BR>—8 (Hence) The period of this passage, half year, the time from one solstice<BR> to another; see उत्तरायण and दक्षिणायन; cf. also सायन<BR> and निरयण.<BR>—9 the equinoctial and solstitial points; दक्षिणम् अयनम् winter solstice;<BR> उत्तरम् अयनम् summer solstice;<BR>—10 Method, manner, way.<BR>—11 A Śāstra, scripture or inspired writing.<BR>—12 Final emancipation; नान्यः पन्था विद्यतेऽयनाय Śvet. Up.<BR>—13 A commentary; treatise.<BR>—14 The deities presiding over the <i>ayanas</i>.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयनांशः, अयनभागः, अयनकलाः, अयनकालः, अयनग्रहः, अयनजः, अयनपरिवृत्तिः, अयनसंक्रमः, अयनसंक्रान्तिः, अयनवृत्तम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनांशः|अयनांश
अयन + -अंशः, -भागः the arc between the vernal equinoctial point and<BR> beginning of the fixed zodiac or first point of Aries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनभागः|अयनभाग
अयन + -अंशः, -भागः the arc between the vernal equinoctial point and<BR> beginning of the fixed zodiac or first point of Aries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनकलाः
अयन + -कलाः The correction (in minutes) for ecliptic deviation. Sūrya S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनकालः|अयनकाल
अयन + -कालः the interval between the solstices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनग्रहः|अयनग्रह
अयन + -ग्रहः A planetʼs longitude as corrected for ecliptic deviation; <i>ibid.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनजः|अयनज
अयन + -जः a month caused by <i>ayanāṃśa</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनपरिवृत्तिः
अयन + -परिवृत्तिः Change of the अयन; sunʼs passage from one side<BR> of the equator to the other; अयनपरिवृत्तिर्व्यस्तशब्देनोच्यते ।<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 5. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनसंक्रमः|अयनसङ्क्रम
अयन + -संक्रमः, -संक्रान्तिः <i>f.</i> passage through the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनसंक्रान्तिः|अयनसङ्क्रान्ति
अयन + -संक्रमः, -संक्रान्तिः <i>f.</i> passage through the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयनवृत्तम्
अयन + -वृत्तम् the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयक्ष्म
अयक्ष्म <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Not consumptive, healthy.<BR>—2 Causing health; अयक्ष्मा वृहतीरिषः Rv. 9. 49. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयक्ष्मम्
अयक्ष्म + .{@-क्ष्मम्@} Healthiness, freedom from disease.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयक्ष्मकरण, अयक्ष्मतातिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयक्ष्मकरण
अयक्ष्म + -करण <i>a.</i> causing health, making healthy and sound; Av. 19. 2. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयक्ष्मतातिः|अयक्ष्मताति
अयक्ष्म + -तातिः <i>f.</i> health; अयक्ष्मतातिं मह इह धत्तम् Av. 4. 25. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयजुष्क
अयजुष्क <i>a.</i> Without a sacrificial formula or verse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्ञ|अयज्ञः
अयज्ञ <i>a.</i> Not offering sacrifice. नायं लोकोऽस्त्ययज्ञस्य Bg. 4. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्ञः|अयज्ञ
अयज्ञ + .{@-ज्ञः@} No sacrifice; a bad sacrifice; Ms. 3. 120.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयज्ञसाच्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्ञसाच्
अयज्ञ + -साच् <i>a.</i> not performing a sacrifice; अयज्ञसाचो अप्यो न पुत्राः Rv. 6. 67. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्ञक
अयज्ञक <i>a.</i> Unfit for sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्ञिय
अयज्ञिय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not fit for sacrifice (as माष).<BR>—2 Not fit to perform a sacrifice (as a boy not invested with the sacred thread).<BR>—3 Profane, vulgar, common; अयज्ञियो हतवर्चा भवति Av. 12. 2. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्यु
अयज्यु <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Profane, impious.<BR>—2 Obstructor or destroyer of sacrifices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयज्वन्
अयज्वन् <i>a.</i> Not sacrificing according to the rites; godless, impious;<BR> अयज्वा च सहस्रगुः Ms. 11. 14. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्
अयत् <i>a.</i> Not attempting. Bk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत
अयत <i>a.</i> Uncontrolled, unchecked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयति
अयति <i>a.</i> Not attempting; अयतिः श्रद्धयोपेतः Bg. 6. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयतिन्
अयतिन् <i>a.</i> Of unsubdued desires or passions, incontinent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्न|अयत्नः
अयत्न <i>a.</i> Not requiring any effort; तद्योधवारणानामयत्नपटवासताम्<BR> R. 4. 55. cf. also अयत्नशीतलं वारि सुखं च स्वेदवर्जितम् Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्नः|अयत्न
अयत्न + .{@-त्नः@} Absence of effort or exertion; {@अयत्नेन, -त्नात्, -त्नतः@}<BR> without effort or exertion, easily, readily.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयत्नकारिन्, अयत्नकृत, अयत्नज, अयत्नलभ्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्नकारिन्
अयत्न + -कारिन् <i>a.</i> making no effort or exertion, indifferent; idle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्नकृत
अयत्न + -कृत, -ज <i>a.</i> easily produced, spontaneous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्नज
अयत्न + -कृत, -ज <i>a.</i> easily produced, spontaneous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयत्नलभ्य
अयत्न + -लभ्य <i>a.</i> easily obtainable; हिंसाशून्यमयत्नलभ्यमशनम् Bh. 3. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथम्
अयथम् Ved. A foot, leg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथा
अयथा <i>ind.</i> Not as it should be or is intended to be, unfitly,<BR> improperly, wrongly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथम्
अयथा + .{@-थम्@} Ved. Without effort; गोधा तस्मा अयथं कर्षदेतत् Rv. 10. 28. 10.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयथार्थ, अयथाभिप्रेताख्यानम्, अयथेष्ट, अयथोचित, अयथातथ, अयथातथ्यम्, अयथाद्योतनम्, अयथापुर, अयथापूर्व, अयथामुखीन, अयथावृत्त, अयथाशास्त्रकारिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथार्थ
अयथा + -अर्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not true to the sense, unmeaning, nonsensical; परित्यक्तस्वार्थो नियतमयथार्थः<BR> क्षितिपतिः Mu. 3. 4.<BR>—2 incongruous, unfit, false, द्वयमिदमयथार्थं दृश्यते मद्विधेषु<BR> Ś. 3. 2; incorrect, wrong; अनुभवो द्विविधो यथार्थोऽयथार्थश्च T. S.;<BR> ˚अनुभवः incorrect or untrue knowledge, wrong notion; तदभाववति<BR> तत्प्रकारकोऽनुभवोऽयथार्थानुभवः । यथा शुक्तौ रजतमिदमिति ज्ञानं<BR> सैव अप्रमेत्युच्यते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथाभिप्रेताख्यानम्
अयथा + -अभिप्रेताख्यानम् Communicating a news in an undesired manner, <i>i. e.</i><BR> to tell a good news in a whispering tone, and to declare a bad news<BR> loudly. P. III. 4. 59. अयथाभिप्रेताख्यानं नामाप्रियस्योच्चैः, प्रियस्य<BR> च नीचैः कथनम् Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथेष्ट
अयथा + -इष्ट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not as wished or desired, disliked.<BR>—2 not enough or sufficient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथोचित
अयथा + -उचित <i>a.</i> unfit, unworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथोचितम्
अयथा + -उचित + .({@-तम्@}) unfitly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथातथ
अयथा + -तथ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not as it should be, unfit, unsuitable, unworthy; इदमयथातथं<BR> स्वामिनश्चेष्टितम् Ve. 2.<BR>—2 vain, useless, profitless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथातथम्
अयथा + -तथ + .({@-थम्@})<BR>—1 unfitly, unsuitably.<BR>—2 in vain, uselessly; तद् गच्छति अ˚ Ms. 3. 240<BR>—3 wrongly; Ve. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथातथ्यम्
अयथा + -तथ्यम् unsuitableness, incongruity, uselessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथाद्योतनम्
अयथा + -द्योतनम् intimation or occurrence of something or act which is not expected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथापुर
अयथा + -पुर, -पूर्व <i>a.</i> unprecedented, unparalleled, unusual; ददृशे<BR> सोऽयथापूर्वो R. 12. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथापूर्व|अयथापूर्व्व
अयथा + -पुर, -पूर्व <i>a.</i> unprecedented, unparalleled, unusual; ददृशे<BR> सोऽयथापूर्वो R. 12. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथामुखीन
अयथा + -मुखीन <i>a.</i> having the face turned away<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथावृत्त
अयथा + -वृत्त <i>a.</i> acting wrongly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथाशास्त्रकारिन्
अयथा + -शास्त्रकारिन् <i>a.</i> not acting according to the Sāstras, irreligious;<BR> अयथाशास्त्रकारी च न विभागे पिता प्रभुः Nārada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयथावत्
अयथावत् <i>ind.</i> Wrongly, erroneously, improperly; अयथावत्प्रजानाति<BR> बुद्धिः सा पार्थ राजसी Bg. 18. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयदीक्षितः|अयदीक्षित
अयदीक्षितः Name of an author (nephew of Appaya Dīkṣita).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयन्त्रम्
अयन्त्रम्<BR>—1 Non-restraint; having no restraint; विधर्मणायन्त्रैरीयते नॄन् Rv. 10. 46. 6.<BR>—2 A powerful weapon for restraining enemies. नायान्त्रितस्त्रिवेदोऽपि<BR> सर्वाशी सर्वविक्रयी Ms. 2. 118.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयन्त्रित|अयंत्रित|अयन्त्रितः
अयन्त्रित <i>a.</i> Unrestrained, unchecked, self-willed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयमित
अयमित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unrestrained, unchecked.<BR>—2 Untrimmed, undecorated (as nails &c.); स्पर्शक्लिष्टामयमितनखेनासकृत्सारयन्तीम् Me. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयव|अयवः
अयव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Deficient.<BR>—2 Having worthless or no barley, such as a religious ceremony (also अयवक<BR> in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयवः|अयव
अयव + .{@-वः@}<BR>—1 Name of a worm bred in excrement<BR>—2 (अयवन् <i>m.</i>, अयवस् <i>n.</i> also). The dark half of the month;<BR> पूर्वपक्षा वै यवा अपरपक्षा वा अयवास्ते वा अयवास्ते हीदं सर्वं युवते<BR> चायुवते च Śat. Br.<BR>—3 An incongruous enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयव्य
अयव्य <i>a.</i> Unfit for barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयशस्
अयशस् <i>a.</i> Disreputable, infamous, disgraceful; also अयशस्क<BR> in this sense. <i>n.</i> ({@शः@}) Infamy, disgrace, ignominy, ill-repute,<BR> stain, dishonour, scandal; तपो दानं यशोऽयशः Bg. 10. 5. अयशो<BR> महदाप्नोति Ms. 8. 128; किमयशो ननु घोरमतः परम् U. 3. 27;<BR> स्वभावलोलेत्ययशः प्रमृष्टम् R. 6. 41.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयशःकर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयशःकर
अयशस् + -कर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>) disgraceful, ignominious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयशस्य
अयशस्य <i>a.</i> Infamous, ignominious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्
अयस् <i>a.</i> [इ-गतौ-असुन्] Going, moving; nimble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाः
अयस् + .({@-यः@}) <i>n.</i><BR>—1 Iron (एति चलति अयस्कान्तसंनिकर्षम् इति तथात्वम्; नायसोल्लिख्यते<BR> रत्नम् Śukra. 4. 169. अभितप्तमयोऽपि मार्दवं भजते कैव कथा शरीरिषु R. 8. 43.)<BR>—2 Steel.<BR>—3 Gold.<BR>—4 A metal in general.<BR>—5 Aloe wood.<BR>—6 An iron instrument; यदयोनिधनं याति सोऽस्य धर्मः सनातनः Mb. 6. 17. 11.<BR>—7 Going. ━<i>m.</i> Fire. [cf. L. <i>aes, aeris</i>; Goth. <i>ais, eisarn</i>;<BR> Ger. <i>eisin</i>].<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयोग्रम्, अयोग्रकम्, अयोपाष्टि, अयःकंसः, अयःकंसम्, अयःकणपम्, अयःकाण्डः, अयःकान्तः, अयःकारः, अयःकिट्टम्, अयःकीटम्, अयःकुम्भः, अयस्कुशा, अयःकृतिः, अयोगः, अयोगुडः, अयोघनः, अयश्चूर्णम्, अयोजाल, अयस्ताप, अयोदत्, अयोदंष्ट्र, अयोदती, अयोदण्डः, अयोधातुः, अयःपानम्, अयःपिण्डः, अयःप्रतिमा, अयोबाहुः, अयोमलम्, अयोमुख, अयःशङ्कुः, अयःशय, अयःशूलम्, अयःस्थूण, अयोहत, अयोहृदय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोग्रम्
अयस् + -अग्रम्, -अग्रकम् a hammer, a mace or club tipped with iron; a<BR> pestle for cleaning grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोग्रकम्
अयस् + -अग्रम्, -अग्रकम् a hammer, a mace or club tipped with iron; a<BR> pestle for cleaning grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोपाष्टि
अयस् + -अपाष्टि <i>a.</i> Ved. furnished with iron claws or heels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःकंसः
अयस् + -कंसः, -कंसम् an iron goblet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःकंसम्
अयस् + -कंसः, -कंसम् an iron goblet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःकणपम्
अयस् + -कणपम् A kind of weapon, which throws out iron-balls; अयःकणपचक्राश्मभुशुण्डयुद्यतबाहवः<BR> Mb. 1. 227. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःकाण्डः
अयस् + -काण्डः<BR>—1 an iron-arrow.<BR>—2 excellent iron. —3 a large quantity of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःकान्तः
अयस् + -कान्तः (अयस्कान्तः)<BR>—1 ‘beloved of iron’, a magnet, load-stone; शम्भोर्यतध्वमाक्रष्टुमयस्कान्तेन<BR> लोहवत् Ku. 2. 59; स चकर्ष परस्मात्तदयस्क्रान्त इवायसम् R. 17. 63;<BR> U. 4. 21. अयस्कान्तमयः संकामति Mbh. on P. III. 1. 7.<BR>—2 a precious stone; ˚मणिः a loadstone; अयस्कान्तमणिशलाकेव लोहधातुमन्तःकरणमाकृष्टवती Māl. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःकारः
अयस् + -कारः<BR>—1 an iron-smith, blacksmith.<BR>—2 the upper part of the thigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःकिट्टम्
अयस् + -किट्टम्, -कीटम् rust of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःकीटम्
अयस् + -किट्टम्, -कीटम् rust of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःकुम्भः
अयस् + -कुम्भः an iron vessel, boiler &c.; so ˚पात्रम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्कुशा
अयस् + -कुशा a rope partly consisting of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःकृतिः
अयस् + -कृतिः <i>f.</i> a preparation of iron; one of the way of curing<BR> leprosy (महाकुष्ठचिकित्साभेदः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोगः|अयोग
अयस् + -गः an iron hammer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोगुडः|अयोगुड
अयस् + -गुडः<BR>—1 a pill; one made of some preparation of iron.<BR>—2 an iron ball; दीप्तशूलष्टर्पयोगुडान् Ms. 3. 133.<BR>—3 A kind of weapon consisting of iron balls; लगुडायोगुडाश्मानः Mb. 7. 30. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोघनः|अयोघन
अयस् + -घनः [अयो हन्यते अनेन इति P. III. 3. 82] an iron hammer,<BR> forge hammer; गदापरिघनिस्त्रिंशपट्टिशायोघनोपलैः Mb. 7. 25. 58.<BR> अयोघनेनाय इवाभितप्तम् R. 14. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयश्चूर्णम्
अयस् + -चूर्णम् iron filings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोजाल
अयस् + -जाल <i>a.</i> having iron nets; of impenetrable guiles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोजालम्
अयस् + -जाल + .({@-लम्@}) an iron net-work; अयोजालानि निर्मथ्य भित्त्वा रत्नगृहं<BR> वरम् Rām. 3. 35. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्ताप
अयस् + -ताप <i>a.</i> making iron red-hot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोदत्
अयस् + -दत्, -दंष्ट्र <i>a.</i> Ved. iron-toothed, having iron rims<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">Page0211-1</a>]<BR> (as chariots); having iron weapons; पश्यन् हिरण्यचक्रानयोदंष्ट्रान्<BR> विधोवतो वराहून् Rv. 1. 88. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोदंष्ट्र
अयस् + -दत्, -दंष्ट्र <i>a.</i> Ved. iron-toothed, having iron rims<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">Page0211-1</a>]<BR> (as chariots); having iron weapons; पश्यन् हिरण्यचक्रानयोदंष्ट्रान्<BR> विधोवतो वराहून् Rv. 1. 88. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोदती
अयस् + -दती a proper name; (स्त्रियां संज्ञायाम् P. V. 4. 143).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोदण्डः
अयस् + -दण्डः an iron club, K. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोधातुः
अयस् + -धातुः iron metal; अयोधातुं यद्वत्परिलघुरयस्कान्तशकलः U. 4. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःपानम्
अयस् + -पानम् (अयःपानम्) N. of a hell (where redhot iron is forced<BR> down the throats of those who are condemned to it).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःपिण्डः|अयःपिण्ड
अयस् + -पिण्डः A canon-ball.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःप्रतिमा
अयस् + -प्रतिमा (अयःप्रतिमा) an iron image.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोबाहुः|अयोबाहु
अयस् + -बाहुः Name of a son of Dhṛtarāṣṭra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोमलम्
अयस् + -मलम् rust of iron; so ˚रजः, ˚रसः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोमुख|अयोमुखः
अयस् + -मुख <i>a.</i> (-खी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 having an iron mouth, face, or beak.<BR>—2 tipped or pointed with iron; भूमिं भूमिशयांश्चैव हन्ति काष्ठमयोमुखम् Ms. 10. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोमुखः|अयोमुख
अयस् + -मुख + .({@-खः@}) an arrow (iron-pointed); भेत्स्यत्यजः कुम्भमयोमुखेन R. 5. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःशङ्कुः|अयःशङ्कु|अयःशंकु
अयस् + -शङ्कुः<BR>—1 an iron spear;<BR>—2 an iron nail, pointed iron spike, अयःशङ्कुचितां रक्षः शतघ्नीमथ<BR> शत्रवे R. 12. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःशय
अयस् + -शय <i>a.</i> lying in, made of iron, (said of fire).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःशूलम्
अयस् + -शूलम्<BR>—1 an iron lance.<BR>—2 a forcible means, a violent proceeding (तीक्ष्णः उपायः Sk.); (cf.<BR> आयःशूलिक; also K. P. 10; अयःशूलेन अन्विच्छतीत्यायःशूलिकः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयःस्थूण
अयस् + -स्थूण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 (अय˚ or यः˚) having iron pillars or stakes. हिरण्यरूपमुषसो<BR> व्युष्टावयःस्थूणमुदिता सूर्यस्य Rv. 5. 62. 8.<BR>—2 Name of a Ṛṣi Śat. Br.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोहत
अयस् + -हत <i>a.</i> Ved. embossed in iron-work, made by a priest who<BR> wears a golden ring on his finger (B. and R.); रक्षोहा विश्वचर्षणिरभि<BR> योनिमयोहतम् Rv. 9. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोहृदय
अयस् + -हृदय <i>a.</i> iron-hearted, stern, cruel, unrelenting; सुहृदयोहृदयः<BR> प्रतिगर्जताम् R. 9. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्मय
अयस्मय, (अयोमय) <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>) Ved.<BR> Made of iron or of any metal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोमय
अयस्मय, (अयोमय) <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>) Ved.<BR> Made of iron or of any metal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस्मयी
अयस्मय, (अयोमय) + .{@-यी@} N. of one of the three habitations of Asuras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयोच्छिष्टम्
अयोच्छिष्टम् Rust of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयस
अयस (At the end of comp.) See कार्ष्णायस, कालायस &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अया
अया <i>ind.</i> Ved. Thus, in this manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचक|अयाचकः
अयाचक <i>a.</i> One who does not ask or solicit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचित|अयाचितं|अयाचितः
अयाचित <i>a.</i> Unasked, unsolicited (as alms, food &c.); अमृतं<BR> स्यादयाचितम् Ms. 4. 5, 11. 212.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचितः|अयाचित|अयाचितं
अयाचित + .{@-तः@} N. of the sage Upavarṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचितम्
अयाचित + .{@-तम्@} Unsolicited alms.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयाचितोपनत, अयाचितोपस्थित, अयाचितवृत्तिः, अयाचितव्रतम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचितोपनत
अयाचित + -उपनत, -उपस्थित <i>a.</i> got unasked or without solicitation;<BR> अयाचितोपस्थितमम्बु केवलम् Ku. 5. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचितोपस्थित
अयाचित + -उपनत, -उपस्थित <i>a.</i> got unasked or without solicitation;<BR> अयाचितोपस्थितमम्बु केवलम् Ku. 5. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचितवृत्तिः|अयाचितवृत्ति
अयाचित + -वृत्तिः, -व्रतम् subsisting on alms got without begging or solicitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाचितव्रतम्
अयाचित + -वृत्तिः, -व्रतम् subsisting on alms got without begging or solicitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाज्य
अयाज्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 (A person) for whom one must not perform sacrifices, not competent<BR> to offer sacrifices (as a Śūdra &c.).<BR>—2 (Hence), Out-cast; degraded, not admissible to or incapable of religious ceremonies.<BR>—3 Not fit for sacrificial offerings.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयाज्ययाजनम्, अयाज्यसंयाज्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाज्ययाजनम्
अयाज्य + -याजनम्, -संयाज्यम् sacrificing for a person for whom one must<BR> not perform sacrifices; अयाज्ययाजनैश्चैव नास्तिक्येन च कर्मणाम् Ms. 3. 65;<BR> गोवधोऽयाज्यसंयाज्यपारदार्यात्मविक्रयाः Ms. 11. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाज्यसंयाज्यम्
अयाज्य + -याजनम्, -संयाज्यम् sacrificing for a person for whom one must<BR> not perform sacrifices; अयाज्ययाजनैश्चैव नास्तिक्येन च कर्मणाम् Ms. 3. 65;<BR> गोवधोऽयाज्यसंयाज्यपारदार्यात्मविक्रयाः Ms. 11. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयात
अयात <i>a.</i> Not gone. अयातमस्य ददृशे न यातम् Av. 10. 8. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयातपूर्व, अयातयाम, अयातयामन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयातपूर्व|अयातपूर्व्व
अयात + -पूर्व <i>a.</i> following, succeeding, subsequent to.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">Page0211-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयातयाम
अयात + -याम <i>a.</i> not old or weakened, not stale, fresh, not worn out<BR> by use; अयातयामं सर्वेभ्यो भागेभ्यो भागमुत्तमम् Mb. 3. 114. 11. ˚मं<BR> च यौवनम् Dk. 123 fresh, blooming; ˚मं वयः 158; छन्दांस्ययातयामानि<BR> Bhāg. 10. 80. 42. (where Śrīdhara says अ˚ = विगतदोषाणि free from<BR> faults, faultless, pure.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयातयामम्
अयात + -याम + .({@-मम्@}) N. of certain texts of the Yajurveda revealed to YājYavalkya.<BR> -˚यामता freshness, unimpaired nature, strength, or vigour, purity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयातयामन्
अयात + -यामन् <i>a.</i> Ved. not weak, fresh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयातु|अयातुः
अयातु <i>a.</i> Ved. Not demoniacal; free from evil spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयातुः|अयातु
अयातु + .{@-तुः@} Not a demon, not an evil spirit, not destructive. ह्वयामि<BR> देवाँ अयातुरग्ने Rv. 7. 34. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयात्रा
अयात्रा The state of not being passable; Rām. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाथार्थिक
अयाथार्थिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Not true, wrong, unjust, improper.<BR>—2 Not real or genuine, incongruous, absurd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाथार्थ्यम्
अयाथार्थ्यम्<BR>—1 Unfitness, incorrectness.<BR>—2 Absurdity, incongruity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयानम्
अयानम्<BR>—1 Not going or moving, stopping, halt.<BR>—2 Natural disposition, nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयानयम्
अयानयम् [अयश्च अनयश्च तयोः समाहारः] Good or bad luck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयानयः|अयानय|अयानयं
अयानयम् + .{@-यः@} A particular position of the pieces on a chess-board. A place<BR> on a chess-board, which the pieces of the opponents cannot occupy. (आनीयन्ते<BR> शारा अस्मिन् इत्यानयः; अयेन दक्षिणावर्तेन अपसव्यगमनेन आनयः अयानयः<BR> शीर्षस्थानम् Saralā).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयानयीनः|अयानयीन
अयानयीनः [अयानय-ख] A piece at chess or backgammon; अयानयः<BR> स्थलविशेषः तं नेयोऽयानयीनः शारः (Mar. पिकलेली सोंगटी) P. V. 2. 9. Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयान्वित|अयान्वितः
अयान्वित <i>a.</i> Fortunate, lucky; R. 4. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयान्वितः|अयान्वित
अयान्वित + .{@-तः@} N. of Śaṅkarācārya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयावक
अयावक <i>a.</i> Naturally red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयावनम्
अयावनम् Not causing to unite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाशु
अयाशु <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Unfit for copulation. कुम्भमुष्का अयाशवः Av. 8. 6. 15.<BR>—2 Destructive of good things.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयास्
अयास् <i>a.</i> [fr. इ ‘to go’ Nir.] Ved. Agile, nimble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयाः
अयास् + .{@-याः@} <i>ind.</i> [इ-आसिः Uṇ. 4. 221] Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयास्य|अयास्यः
अयास्य <i>a.</i> Ved. Indefatigable, inexhaustible. valiant, invincible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयास्यः|अयास्य
अयास्य + .{@-स्यः@}<BR>—1 A mystical name for the chief life-wind; सोऽयास्य आङ्गिरसोऽङ्गानाँहि रसः<BR> Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 8.<BR>—2 N. of Aṅgirasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयासोमीयम्
अयासोमीयम् N. of some verses of the Sāmaveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयि
अयि <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 As a gentle address in the sense of ‘friend’, ‘oh’, ‘ah’ (कोमलामन्त्रणे);<BR> or simply as a vocative particle; अयि विवेकविश्रान्तमभिहितम् M. 1;<BR> अयि कठोर U. 3. 27 Oh you ruthless one; अयि भो महार्षिपुत्र Ś. 7;<BR> अयि विद्युत्प्रमदानां त्वमपि च दुखं न जानासि Mk. 5. 32; अयि<BR> मातर्देवयजनसंभवे देवि सीते U. 4; see also Bv. 1. 5, 11, 44.<BR>—2 As a particle<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">Page0212-1</a>]<BR> of entreaty or solicitation (अनुनय), ‘I pray’, ‘prithee^1’; अयि<BR> संप्रति हि दर्शनम् Ku. 4. 28; also of encouragement or persuasion;<BR> अयि मन्दस्मितमधुरं वदनं तन्वङ्गि यदि मनाक्कुरुषे Bv. 2. 150.<BR>—3 As a particle of gentle or kind inquiry (प्रश्न); अयि जीवितनाथ<BR> जीवसि Ku. 4. 3; अयीदमेवं परिहासः 5. 62; अयि जानीषे रेभिलस्य<BR> सार्थवाहस्य गृहम् Mk. 3. cf. अयि प्रश्नानुनययोः … Nm.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251204. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101. note: prythee archaic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0211-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुक्त|अयुक्तं
अयुक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not yoked or harnessed; अरश्मानो येऽरथा अयुक्ता Rv. 9. 97. 20.<BR>—2 Not joined, united or connected.<BR>—3 Not devout or pious, inattentive, negligent. नास्तिबुद्धिरयुक्तस्य<BR> Bg. 2. 66; अयुक्तासो अब्रह्मता यदसन् Rv. 5. 33. 3.<BR>—4 Unpractised, unused, unemployed; ˚बुद्धि, ˚चार.<BR>—5 Unfit, improper, unsuitable; अयुक्तोऽयं निर्देशः P. IV. 2. 64. Mbh.<BR>—6 Untrue, wrong.<BR>—7 Unmarried.<BR>—8 Opening externally.<BR>—9 Reduced to straits, miserable.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयुक्तकर्मन्, अयुक्तकृत्, अयुक्तपदार्थः, अयुक्तरूप<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुक्तकर्मन्
अयुक्त + -कर्मन् <i>m.</i> an official (perhaps for आयुक्त˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुक्तकृत्
अयुक्त + -कृत् <i>a.</i> doing improper or wrong acts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुक्तपदार्थः|अयुक्तपदार्थ
अयुक्त + -पदार्थः the sense of a word to be supplied, as the sense of अपि q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुक्तरूप
अयुक्त + -रूप <i>a.</i> incongruous, unsuitable; ˚पं किमतःपरं वद Ku. 5. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुक्तिः|अयुक्ति
अयुक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Disunion, separation.<BR>—2 Unreasonableness, want of conformity to correct principles.<BR>—3 Unfitness, impropriety, incongruity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुग
अयुग, -गल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Separate, single.<BR>—2 Odd, uneven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगल
अयुग, -गल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Separate, single.<BR>—2 Odd, uneven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगम्
अयुग, -गल + .{@-गम्@} Pre-yuga period, before cosmogonic time; आदौ कृतयुगेऽयुगे<BR> Bhāg. 11. 24. 2.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयुगार्चिस्, अयुगनेत्रः, अयुगनयनः, अयुगशरः, अयुगसप्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगार्चिस्|अयुगार्च्चिस्
अयुग + -अर्चिस् <i>m.</i> Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगनेत्रः|अयुगनेत्र
अयुग + -नेत्रः, -नयनः, -शरः See under अयुग्म.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगनयनः
अयुग + -नेत्रः, -नयनः, -शरः See under अयुग्म.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगशरः|अयुगशर
अयुग + -नेत्रः, -नयनः, -शरः See under अयुग्म.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगसप्तिः|अयुगसप्ति
अयुग + -सप्तिः having seven horses; युगपदयुगसप्तिस्तुल्यसंख्यैर्मयूखैः Śi. 11. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगपद्
अयुगपद् <i>ind.</i> Not all together, gradually, <i>seriatim</i>;<BR> अयुगपदुन्नमितभ्रु वीक्षितम् Ki. 10. 61.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयुगपद्ग्रहणम्, अयुगपद्भावः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगपद्ग्रहणम्
अयुगपद् + -ग्रहणम् apprehending gradually.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगपद्भावः|अयुगपद्भाव
अयुगपद् + -भावः successive order, successiveness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुगूः
अयुगूः <i>f.</i> A woman that bears only one child. (= काकवन्ध्या q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुग्म
अयुग्म <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not in pairs or couples; single, separate.<BR>—2 Odd, uneven (as a number) अयुग्मासु रात्रिषु Ms. 3. 48 कमनीयविग्रहमयुग्मलोचनम्<BR> (पुरुषं) ददृशुः Ki. 12. 19.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयुग्मच्छदः, अयुग्मपत्रः, अयुग्मनयनः, अयुग्मनेत्रः, अयुग्मलोचनः, अयुग्मबाणः, अयुग्मशरः, अयुग्मवाहः, अयुग्मसप्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुग्मच्छदः|अयुग्मच्छद|अयुग्मछद
अयुग्म + -छदः, -पत्रः having an odd (<i>i. e.</i> 7) number of leaves;<BR> the सप्तपर्ण tree; (Mar. सातवीण); नयत्ययुग्मच्छदगन्धिरार्द्रताम् Ki. 1. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुग्मपत्रः|अयुग्मपत्र
अयुग्म + -छदः, -पत्रः having an odd (<i>i. e.</i> 7) number of leaves;<BR> the सप्तपर्ण tree; (Mar. सातवीण); नयत्ययुग्मच्छदगन्धिरार्द्रताम् Ki. 1. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुग्मनयनः
अयुग्म + -नयनः, -नेत्रः, -लोचनः ‘having odd (3) eyes’, N. of Śiva; अर्धेन्द्रियक्षोभमयुग्मनेत्रः Ku. 3. 51, 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुग्मनेत्रः|अयुग्मनेत्र
