अयुग्मलोचनः|अयुग्मलोचन
अयुग्म + -नयनः, -नेत्रः, -लोचनः ‘having odd (3) eyes’, N. of Śiva; अर्धेन्द्रियक्षोभमयुग्मनेत्रः Ku. 3. 51, 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुग्मबाणः|अयुग्मबाण
अयुग्म + -बाणः, -शरः &c. having odd (5) arrows; N. of Cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुग्मशरः|अयुग्मशर
अयुग्म + -बाणः, -शरः &c. having odd (5) arrows; N. of Cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुग्मवाहः|अयुग्मवाह
अयुग्म + -वाहः, -सप्तिः having seven horses, the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुग्मसप्तिः
अयुग्म + -वाहः, -सप्तिः having seven horses, the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुङ्ग|अयुंग
अयुङ्ग <i>a.</i> Ved. Not existing in couples, odd, uneven. See अयुग्म.<BR> Śat. Br. 3. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुज्
अयुज् <i>a.</i> Not being in couples, odd, uneven (opp. युज् even);<BR> अयुजि नयुगरेफतो यकारो युजि तु नजौ जरगाश्च पुष्पिताग्रा V. Ratn.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अयुगिषुः, अयुग्बाणः, अयुक्छरः, अयुक्छदः, अयुक्पलाशः, अयुक्पादयमकम्, अयुङ्नेत्र, अयुग्लोचन, अयुगक्ष, अयुक्छक्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

