अयुक्छरः
अयुज् + -इषुः, -बाणः, -शरः N. of Cupid (having 5 arrows).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुक्छदः|अयुक्छद
