अयुक्पादयमकम्
अयुज् + -पादयमकम् a kind of alliteration having the same syllables<BR> (in a different sense) in the first and third pādas<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

