अयुगक्ष
अयुज् + -नेत्र, -लोचन, -अक्ष, -शक्तिः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0212-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अयुक्छक्तिः
