अरण्ययानम्
अरण्यम् + -यानम् retiring to the woods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0214-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरण्यरक्षकः|अरण्यरक्षक
अरण्यम् + -रक्षकः conservator of forests, forest-keeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0214-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरण्यराज्यम्
