अरुणीकृत
अरुणित, अरुणीकृत <i>a.</i> Reddened, dyed red, impurpled;<BR> स्तनाङ्गरागारुणिताच्च कन्दुकात् Ku. 5. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0218-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुणिमन्
