अरुणता
अरुणिमन् <i>m.</i>, अरुणता Redness, red colour; अरुणिम्ना<BR> पिहितोऽपि शुक्लभावः Bv. 2. 180.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0218-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

