अरुणीयः, -˚योगः<BR> The 25th Upaniṣad of the Atharvaveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0218-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुणीययोगः
अरुणीयः, -˚योगः<BR> The 25th Upaniṣad of the Atharvaveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0218-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

