अरुष्ट
अरुष्, -ष्ट <i>a.</i><BR> Not angry, calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुष|अरुषं|अरुषः
अरुष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not angry.<BR>—2 Shining, bright; reddish.<BR>—3 Unhurt.<BR>—4 Moving, going about (as a horse).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुषः|अरुष|अरुषं
अरुष + .{@-षः@}<BR>—1 The red horse of Agni; a flame.<BR>—2 The Sun; the day as presided over by the Sun. अरुषस्य दुहितरा विरूपे Rv. 6. 49. 3.<BR>—3 The red storm-cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुषी
