अरुः|अरु
अरुस् + .({@-रुः@})<BR>—1 The Arka tree.<BR>—2 Red <i>Khadira</i>. <i>n.</i><BR>—1 A vital part.<BR>—2 A wound, sore (<i>m.</i> also).<BR>—3 An eye.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अरुष्कर, अरुष्कृत<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरुष्कर|अरुष्करं|अरुष्करः
