अरूक्षित
अरूक्षित, अरूक्ष्ण <i>a.</i> Ved. Soft, tender, supple; अरूक्षितं<BR> द्दृश आ रूपे अन्नम् Rv. 4. 11. 1; संस्पर्शेद्रूक्ष्णमस्तु ते Av. 8. 2. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरूक्ष्ण
अरूक्षित, अरूक्ष्ण <i>a.</i> Ved. Soft, tender, supple; अरूक्षितं<BR> द्दृश आ रूपे अन्नम् Rv. 4. 11. 1; संस्पर्शेद्रूक्ष्णमस्तु ते Av. 8. 2. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरूप|अरूपः
अरूप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Formless, shapeless.<BR>—2 Ugly, deformed.<BR>—3 Dissimilar, unlike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरूपम्
अरूप + .{@-पम्@}<BR>—1 A bad or ugly figure. तामरूपामसतीं भक्षयिष्यामि मानुषीम् Rām.<BR>—2 The Pradhāna<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">Page0219-2</a>]<BR> of the Sāṅkhyas and Brahman of the Vedāntins.<BR>—4 Not possessed of द्रव्य and देवता; अरूपः शब्दः श्रूयमाणः<BR> &c. ŚB. on MS. 4. 4. 1. (It may be observed that द्रव्य and देवता<BR> form the रूप or form of a sacrifice).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अरूपहार्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरूपहार्य|अरूपहार्य्य
अरूप + -हार्य <i>a.</i> not to be attracted or won over by beauty; अरूपहार्यं<BR> मदनस्य निग्रहात् Ku. 5. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरूपक
अरूपक <i>a.</i> Without any figure or metaphor, not figurative, literal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरूपता
अरूपता, -त्वम्<BR> Shapelessness, deformity, dissimilarity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरूपत्वम्
अरूपता, -त्वम्<BR> Shapelessness, deformity, dissimilarity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरूपिन्
अरूपिन् <i>a.</i> Shapeless, formless; वाधायासुरसैन्यानामप्रमेयानरूपिणः<BR> Rām. 1. 21. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरूषः|अरूष
अरूषः [ऋ-ऊषन् Uṇ. 4. 73]<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 A kind of serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरे
अरे <i>ind.</i> An interjection of<BR>——(<i>a</i>) calling to inferiors; आत्मा वा अरे द्रष्टव्यः श्रोतव्यः, न<BR> वा अरे पत्युः कामायास्याः पतिः प्रियो भवति Śat. Br. (said by Yājñavalkya<BR> to his wife Maitreyī); Bṛ. Up. 2. 4. 4.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) of anger; अरे महाराजं प्रति कुतः क्षत्रियाः U. 4;<BR>——(<i>c</i>) of envy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरेणु|अरेणुः
अरेणु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not dusty; not soiled with dust, not touching the dust (of the earth).<BR>—2 Not earthly, celestial; स तुर्वर्णिर्महाँ अरेणु पास्ये Rv. 1. 56. 3.<BR> <i>n.</i> ({@णु@}) What is not dust, the ether.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरेणुः|अरेणु
अरेणु + .{@-णुः@} (pl.) The gods; त्यं चिदश्वं न वाजिनमरेणवो यमत्नत<BR> Rv. 10. 143. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरेपस्
अरेपस् <i>a.</i> [नास्ति रेपः पापं यस्य]<BR>—1 Sinless, spoiless.<BR>—2 Clear, pure, bright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरेरे
अरेरे <i>ind.</i> An interjection of<BR>——(<i>a</i>) calling out angrily; अरेरे दुर्योधनप्रमुखाः कुरुबलसेनाप्रभवः<BR> Ve. 3; अरेरे वाचाट <i>ibid.</i>; or of<BR>——(<i>b</i>) addressing inferiors or by way of contempt; अरेरे राधागर्भभारभूत<BR> सूतापसद <i>ibid.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोक|अरोकः
अरोक <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚]<BR>—1 Without holes (अच्छिद्र).<BR>—2 Without splendour, obscured, dim.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अरोकदत्, अरोकदन्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोकदत्|अरोकदन्त्
अरोक + -दत्, -दन्त <i>a.</i> [विभाषाश्यावारोकाभ्याम् P. V. 4. 144]<BR>—1 having black teeth.<BR>—2 having thickset teeth (निबिडदन्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोकदन्त|अरोकदंत
अरोक + -दत्, -दन्त <i>a.</i> [विभाषाश्यावारोकाभ्याम् P. V. 4. 144]<BR>—1 having black teeth.<BR>—2 having thickset teeth (निबिडदन्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोग|अरोगः
अरोग <i>a.</i> Free from disease, healthy, sound, well; अरोगाः सर्वसिद्धार्थाश्चतुर्वर्षशतायुषः Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोगः|अरोग
अरोग + .{@-गः@} Sound health; न नाममात्रेण करोत्यरोगम् H. 1. 146.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोगण
अरोगण <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Freeing from disease; तेषामसि त्वमुत्तममनास्रावमरोगणम् Av. 2. 3. 2.<BR>—2 Free from disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोगत्वम्
अरोगत्वम् Healthiness; यमो दण्डादवध्यत्वमरोगत्वं च दत्तवान्<BR> Rām. 7. 36. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोगिन्
अरोगिन्, अरोग्य <i>a.</i> Healthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोग्य
अरोगिन्, अरोग्य <i>a.</i> Healthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोचक|अरोचकः
अरोचक <i>a.</i> (-चिका <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Not shining or bright.<BR>—2 Causing loss of appetite, producing loathing or disgust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोचकः|अरोचक
अरोचक + .{@-कः@} Loss of appetite; disgust, loathing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोचकिन्
अरोचकिन् <i>a.</i> Suffering from loss of appetite or indigestion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोचमान
अरोचमान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not shining.<BR>—2 Not attached; तस्यां त्वरोचमानायां सर्वमेव न रोचते Ms. 3. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोचिष्णु
अरोचिष्णु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not shining, dark.<BR>—2 Disagreeable, ugly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरोषः|अरोष
अरोषः Absence of anger, calmness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अरौद्र
अरौद्र <i>a.</i> Not terrible or fierce; an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्क्
अर्क् €10 P. [अर्कयति, अर्कयितुम्, अर्कित]<BR>—1 To heat or warm.<BR>—2 To praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्क|अर्कः|अर्क्क
अर्क <i>a.</i> [अर्च्-घञ्-कुत्वम् Uṇ. 3. 40.]. Fit to be worshipped<BR> (अर्चनीय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कः|अर्क|अर्क्क
अर्क + .{@-र्कः@}<BR>—1 A ray of light, a flash of lightning (Ved.).<BR>—2 The sun; आविष्कृतारुणपुरःसर एकतोऽर्कः Ś. 4. 2.<BR>—3 Fire. य एवमेतदर्कस्यार्कत्वं वेद Bṛ. Up. 1. 2. 1.<BR>—4 A crystal; पुष्पार्ककेतकाभाश्च Rām. 2. 94. 6.<BR>—5 Copper.<BR>—6 Sunday.<BR>—7 Membrum virile. एवा ते शेपः सहसायमर्कोऽङ्गेनाङ्गं संसमकं कृणोतु Av. 6. 72. 1.<BR>—8 N. of the sun-plant, Calatropis Gigantea (Mar. रुई), a small tree<BR> with medicinal sap and rind; अर्कस्योपरि शिथिलं च्युतमिव नवमल्लिकाकुसुमम्<BR> Ś. 2. 9; यमाश्रित्य न विश्रामं क्षुधार्ता यान्ति सेवकाः । सोऽर्कवन्नृपतिस्त्याज्यः<BR> सदापुष्पफलोऽपि सन् Pt. 1. 51. अर्के चेन्मधु विन्देत ŚB. on MS.<BR>—9 N. of Indra.<BR>—10 A sort of religious ceremony.<BR>—11 Praise, hymn; praising, extolling, song of praise.<BR>—12 A singer (Ved. in these two senses).<BR>—13 A learned man.<BR>—14 An elder brother.<BR>—15 Food (अर्कम् also).<BR>—16 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—17 A kind of decoction.<BR>—18 The seventh day of a month.<BR>—19 The उत्तराफल्गुनी asterism.<BR>—20 The number 12.<BR>—21 The sun-stone (सूर्यकान्त); मसारगल्वर्कमयैर्विभङ्गैर्विभूषितं<BR> हेमनिबद्धचक्रम् Mb. 12. 46. 33. cf. अर्कोऽर्कपर्णे स्फटिके ताम्रे सूर्ये<BR> दिवस्पतौ । ज्येष्ठभ्रातरि शुक्लेऽर्कपादपे च पुमान् भवेत् ॥ Nm.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अर्कांशः, अर्ककला, अर्काश्मन्, अर्काह्वः, अर्केन्दुसंगमः, अर्ककान्तः, अर्ककान्ता, अर्ककुण्डतीर्थम्, अर्कक्षेत्रम्, अर्कग्रहः, अर्कग्रीवः, अर्कचन्दनः, अर्कचिकित्सा, अर्कजः, अर्कतनयः, अर्कत्विष्, अर्कदिनम्, अर्कवासरः, अर्कदुग्धम्, अर्कनन्दनः, अर्कपुत्रः, अर्कसुतः, अर्कसूनुः, अर्कनयन, अर्कनामन्, अर्कपत्रः, अर्कपर्णः, अर्कपादपः, अर्कपुष्पम्, अर्कपुष्पाद्यम्, अर्कपुष्पोत्तरम्, अर्कप्रकाश, अर्कप्रिया, अर्कबन्धुः, अर्कबान्धवः, अर्कभम्, अर्कभक्ता, अर्कमण्डलम्, अर्कमूलः, अर्कमूला, अर्करेतोजः, अर्कलवणम्, अर्कवर्षः, अर्कवल्लभः, अर्कविवाहः, अर्कवेधः, अर्कव्रतः, अर्कव्रतम्, अर्कशोकः, अर्कसातिः, अर्कसोदरः, अर्कहिता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कांशः|अर्कांश
अर्क + -अंशः, -कला a digit or 12th part of the sunʼs disc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ककला
अर्क + -अंशः, -कला a digit or 12th part of the sunʼs disc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्काश्मन्
अर्क + -अश्मन् <i>m.</i>, {@-उपलः@}<BR>—1 the sun-stone, heliotrope, girasol.<BR>—2 a sort of crystal or ruby.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्काह्वः|अर्काह्व
अर्क + -आह्वः the swallow wort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्केन्दुसंगमः|अर्केन्दुसङ्गम|अर्केन्दुसंगम
अर्क + -इन्दुसंगमः the time of conjunction of the sun and moon (दर्श<BR> or अमावास्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ककान्तः|अर्ककान्त
अर्क + -कान्तः A class of eleven storeyed buildings; Māna. 29. 25-34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ककान्ता
अर्क + -कान्ता<BR>—1 N. of a plant commonly called हुढुडिया.<BR>—2 sunʼs wife.<BR>—3 sunʼs shadow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ककुण्डतीर्थम्
अर्क + -कुण्डतीर्थम् N. of a Tīrtha; Skanda P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कक्षेत्रम्
अर्क + -क्षेत्रम्<BR>—1 the field of the sun; the sign <i>Leo</i>, presided over by the sun.<BR>—2 N. of a holy place in Orissa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कग्रहः|अर्कग्रह
अर्क + -ग्रहः The eclipse of the sun; Bṛ. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कग्रीवः|अर्कग्रीव
अर्क + -ग्रीवः N. of the Sāman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कचन्दनः|अर्कचन्दन|अर्कचन्दनं
अर्क + -चन्दनः a kind of red sandal (रक्तचन्दन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कचिकित्सा
अर्क + -चिकित्सा Arkaʼs work on medical science.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कजः|अर्कज
अर्क + -जः epithet of Karṇa, Yama, Sugrīva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कजौ
अर्क + -जः + .({@-जौ@}) the two Aśvins regarded as the physicians of Heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कतनयः|अर्कतनय
अर्क + -तनयः ‘a son of the sun’, an epithet of Karṇa, Yama, Manu<BR> Vaivasvata, Manu Sāvarṇi and Saturn; see अरुणात्मज.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कतनया
अर्क + -तनयः + .({@-या@}) N. of the rivers Yamunā and Tāpti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कत्विष्
अर्क + -त्विष् <i>f.</i> light of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कदिनम्
अर्क + -दिनम्, -वासरः Sunday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कवासरः
अर्क + -दिनम्, -वासरः Sunday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कदुग्धम्
अर्क + -दुग्धम् milky sap or exudation of <i>Arka</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कनन्दनः|अर्कनन्दन
अर्क + -नन्दनः, -पुत्रः, -सुतः, -सूनुः N. of Saturn, Karṇa or Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपुत्रः|अर्कपुत्र
अर्क + -नन्दनः, -पुत्रः, -सुतः, -सूनुः N. of Saturn, Karṇa or Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कसुतः|अर्कसुत
अर्क + -नन्दनः, -पुत्रः, -सुतः, -सूनुः N. of Saturn, Karṇa or Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कसूनुः|अर्कसूनु
अर्क + -नन्दनः, -पुत्रः, -सुतः, -सूनुः N. of Saturn, Karṇa or Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कनयन|अर्कनयनः
अर्क + -नयन<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">Page0220-2</a>]<BR> <i>a.</i> one whose eyes are difficult to be gazed at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कनयनः|अर्कनयन
अर्क + -नयन + .({@-नः@}) an epithet of Virat Puruṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कनामन्
अर्क + -नामन् <i>m.</i> the red <i>arka</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपत्रः|अर्कपत्र
अर्क + -पत्रः, -पर्णः N. of the plant अर्क.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपर्णः|अर्कपर्ण|अर्क्कपर्ण
अर्क + -पत्रः, -पर्णः N. of the plant अर्क.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपत्रा
अर्क + -पत्रः, -पर्णः + .({@-त्रा@}) a kind of birthwort (सुनन्दा, अर्कमूला) with wedge-shaped leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपत्रम्
अर्क + -पत्रः, -पर्णः + .({@-त्रम्, -र्णम्@}) the leaf of the अर्क plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपर्णम्
अर्क + -पत्रः, -पर्णः + .({@-त्रम्, -र्णम्@}) the leaf of the अर्क plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपादपः|अर्कपादप
अर्क + -पादपः N. of a plant (निम्ब); another tree (आकन्द).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपुष्पम्
अर्क + -पुष्पम् a flower of <i>arka</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपुष्पाद्यम्
अर्क + -पुष्पाद्यम् N. of a Sāman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपुष्पी
अर्क + -पुष्पाद्यम् + .({@-ष्पी@}), {@-पुष्पिका@}<BR> N. of a plant (कुटुम्बिनी)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कपुष्पोत्तरम्
अर्क + -पुष्पोत्तरम् N. of a Sāman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कप्रकाश
अर्क + -प्रकाश <i>a.</i> Bright like the sun; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कप्रिया
अर्क + -प्रिया N. of a plant (ज व).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कबन्धुः|अर्कबन्धु
अर्क + -बन्धुः, -बान्धवः<BR>—1 N. of Buddha Śākyamuni, meaning सूर्यवंश्यः, cf. शुद्धोदनो<BR> नाम नृपोऽर्कबन्धुः Bu. C. 9. 9.<BR>—2 a lotus (the sun-lotus).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कबान्धवः|अर्कबान्धव
अर्क + -बन्धुः, -बान्धवः<BR>—1 N. of Buddha Śākyamuni, meaning सूर्यवंश्यः, cf. शुद्धोदनो<BR> नाम नृपोऽर्कबन्धुः Bu. C. 9. 9.<BR>—2 a lotus (the sun-lotus).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कभम्
अर्क + -भम्<BR>—1 an asterism influenced by the sun.<BR>—2 the sign <i>Leo</i>.<BR>—3 उत्तराफल्गुनीनक्षत्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कभक्ता
अर्क + -भक्ता = ˚कान्ता q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कमण्डलम्
अर्क + -मण्डलम् disc of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कमूलः|अर्कमूल
अर्क + -मूलः, -मूला = ˚पत्रा; विलिखति वसुधामर्कमूलस्य हेतोः Bh. 2. 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कमूला
अर्क + -मूलः, -मूला = ˚पत्रा; विलिखति वसुधामर्कमूलस्य हेतोः Bh. 2. 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्करेतोजः|अर्करेतोज
अर्क + -रेतोजः Revanta, the son of Sūrya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कलवणम्
अर्क + -लवणम् Saltpetre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कवर्षः|अर्कवर्ष
अर्क + -वर्षः a solar year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कवल्लभः|अर्कवल्लभ
अर्क + -वल्लभः<BR>—1 N. of a plant (बन्धूक; Mar. दुपारी).<BR>—2 a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कविवाहः|अर्कविवाह
अर्क + -विवाहः marriage with the <i>arka</i> plant (enjoined to be performed<BR> before a man marries a <i>third</i> wife, who thus becomes his fourth); चतुर्थादिविवाहार्थं<BR> तृतीयोऽर्कं समुद्वहेत् Kāśyapa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कवेधः|अर्कवेध|अर्कवेधं
अर्क + -वेधः N. of a tree (तालीशपत्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कव्रतः|अर्कव्रत|अर्कव्रतं
अर्क + -व्रतः, -व्रतम्<BR>—1 a vow performed on माघशुक्लसप्तमी.<BR>—2 the law or manner of the sun; when a king exacts taxes from his subjects<BR> only to add to their material comforts and happiness, just as the sun<BR> draws up water during 8 months of the year, only to give it back increased<BR> a thousandfold, he is said to follow अर्कव्रत; अष्टौ मासान् यथादित्यस्तोयं<BR> हरति रश्मिभिः । तथा हरेत्करं राष्ट्रान्नित्यमर्कव्रतं हि तत् ॥<BR> Ms. 9. 305; cf. R. 1. 18 (the point of comparison may also be the imperceptible<BR> way in which the sun absorbs water, see Pt. 1. 221).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कव्रतम्
अर्क + -व्रतः, -व्रतम्<BR>—1 a vow performed on माघशुक्लसप्तमी.<BR>—2 the law or manner of the sun; when a king exacts taxes from his subjects<BR> only to add to their material comforts and happiness, just as the sun<BR> draws up water during 8 months of the year, only to give it back increased<BR> a thousandfold, he is said to follow अर्कव्रत; अष्टौ मासान् यथादित्यस्तोयं<BR> हरति रश्मिभिः । तथा हरेत्करं राष्ट्रान्नित्यमर्कव्रतं हि तत् ॥<BR> Ms. 9. 305; cf. R. 1. 18 (the point of comparison may also be the imperceptible<BR> way in which the sun absorbs water, see Pt. 1. 221).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कशोकः|अर्कशोक
अर्क + -शोकः Ved. brilliancy of rays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कसातिः|अर्कसाति
अर्क + -सातिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 finding of rays.<BR>—2 poetical inspiration; finding out hymns; रपत् कविरिन्द्रार्कसातौ Rv. 1. 174. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कसोदरः|अर्कसोदर
अर्क + -सोदरः ‘brother of the sun’, an epithet of Airāvata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कहिता
अर्क + -हिता = ˚कान्ता q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कवत्|अर्कवन्त्
अर्कवत् <i>a.</i> Containing flashes of lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्किन्
अर्किन् <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Shining, bright; इयं या नीच्यर्किणी Rv. 8. 101. 13.<BR>—2 Praising; बृहदिन्द्रमर्केभिरर्किणः Rv. 1. 7. 1.<BR>—3 Praised or worshipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्कीय
अर्कीय, अर्क्य <i>a.</i> [अर्क-छ; अर्च्-ण्यत् कुत्वम्]<BR>—1 Belonging to <i>arka</i>.<BR>—2 To be praised or worshipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्क्य
अर्कीय, अर्क्य <i>a.</i> [अर्क-छ; अर्च्-ण्यत् कुत्वम्]<BR>—1 Belonging to <i>arka</i>.<BR>—2 To be praised or worshipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्गडः|अर्गड
अर्गडः = अर्गल below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्गलः|अर्गल|अर्गलं
अर्गलः, -ला, -ली, -लम्<BR> [अर्ज् कलच् न्यङ्क्वादि˚ कुत्वम् Tv.]<BR>—1 A wooden bolt, pin, bar &c. (for fastening a door or the cover of a<BR> vessel), a bolt, latch, bar; पुरार्गलादीर्घभुजो बुभोज R. 18. 4, 16. 6;<BR> अनायतार्गलम् Mk. 2; ससंभ्रमेन्द्रद्रुतपातितार्गला निमीलिताक्षीव<BR> भियाऽमरावती K. P. 1; दत्तं च बहिरर्गलम् Ks. 4. 62 bolted from<BR> without; oft. used figuratively in the sense of a bar, impediment, something<BR> intervening as an obstruction; वाक्यार्गलया निवारिताः Pt. 2; Śi. 2. 118;<BR> ईप्सितं तदवज्ञानाद्विद्धि सार्गलमात्मनः R. 1. 79 obstructed;<BR> वार्यर्गलाभङ्ग इव प्रवृत्तः 5. 45; कण्ठे केवलमर्गलेव<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0221-1" target="_blank">Page0221-1</a>]<BR> निहिता जीवस्य निर्गच्छतः K. P. 8; see अनर्गल also.<BR>—2 A wave or billow.<BR>—3 The leaf of a door (कपाटम्).<BR>—4 A kind of ‘stotra’ or hymn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्गला
