अर्धाक्षि
अर्ध + -अक्षि <i>n.</i> side-look, wink. नगरस्त्रीशाङ्कितार्धाक्षिदृष्टम् Mk. 8. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धाङ्गम्
अर्ध + -अङ्गम् half the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धान्तरम्
अर्ध + -अन्तरम् half the distance; ˚एकपदता a fault in composition; see S. D. 575.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धांशः|अर्धांश
अर्ध + -अंशः a half, the half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धांशिन्
अर्ध + -अंशिन् <i>a.</i> sharing a half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धार्धः|अर्धार्ध
अर्ध + -अर्धः, -अर्धम् —1 half of a half, quarter; चरोरर्धार्धभागाभ्यां<BR> तामयोजयतामुभे R. 10. 56.<BR>—3 half and half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धार्धम्
अर्ध + -अर्धः, -अर्धम् —1 half of a half, quarter; चरोरर्धार्धभागाभ्यां<BR> तामयोजयतामुभे R. 10. 56.<BR>—3 half and half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धावभेदकः|अर्धावभेदक
अर्ध + -अवभेदकः pain in half the head, hemicrania (Mar. अर्धशिशी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धावभेदकम्
अर्ध + -अवभेदकः + .({@-कम्@}) dividing in equal parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धावशेष
अर्ध + -अवशेष <i>a.</i> having only a half left.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धाकारः|अर्धाकार
अर्ध + -अकारः<BR>—1 half the letter अ.<BR>—2 N. of अवग्रह q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धासिः|अर्धासि
अर्ध + -असिः A sword with one edge, a small sword; अर्धासिभिस्तथा खड्गैः<BR> Mb. 7. 137. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धासनम्
अर्ध + -आसनम्<BR>—1 half a seat; अर्धासनं गोत्रभिदोऽधितष्ठौ R. 6. 73; मम हि दिवौकसां<BR> समक्षमर्धासनोपवेशितस्य Ś. 7 (it being considered a mark of a very<BR> great respect to make room for a guest<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">Page0228-2</a>]<BR> &c. on the same seat with oneself).<BR>—2 greeting kindly or with great respect.<BR>—3 exemption from censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धेन्दुः|अर्धेन्दु|अर्द्धेन्दुः
अर्ध + -इन्दुः<BR>—1 the half or crescent moon.<BR>—2 semicircular impression of a finger-nail, crescent-shaped nail-print;<BR> कुचयोर्नखाङ्कैरर्धेन्दुलीलैः N. 6. 25.<BR>—3 an arrow with a crescent-shaped head (= अर्धचन्द्र below.); ˚मौलि<BR> N. of Śiva तत्र व्यक्तं दृषदि चरणन्यासमर्धेन्दुमौलेः Me. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धेन्द्र
अर्ध + -इन्द्र <i>a.</i> that of which a half belongs to Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धोक्त
अर्ध + -उक्त <i>a.</i> half said or uttered; रामभद्र इति अर्धोक्ते महाराज U. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धोक्तिः|अर्धोक्ति
अर्ध + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i> a broken speech; an interrupted speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धोदकम्
अर्ध + -उदकम् water reaching half the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धोदयः|अर्धोदय|अर्द्धोदयः
अर्ध + -उदयः<BR>—1 the rising of the half moon.<BR>—2 partial rise.<BR>—3 a kind of <i>parvan</i>; ˚आसनम् a sort of posture in meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धोदित
अर्ध + -उदित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 half risen.<BR>—2 half uttered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धोरुक|अर्द्धोरुकं
अर्ध + -ऊरुक <i>a.</i> [अर्धमूरोः अर्धोरु तत्र काशते] reaching to<BR> the middle of the thighs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धोरुकम्
अर्ध + -ऊरुक + .({@-कम्@})<BR>—1 a short petticoat (Mar. परकर); see चण्डातक.<BR>—2 mantle, veil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धकर्णः|अर्धकर्ण
अर्ध + -कर्णः Radius, half the diameter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धकृत
अर्ध + -कृत <i>a.</i> half done, incomplete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धकेतुः|अर्धकेतु
अर्ध + -केतुः N. of Rudra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धकोशः
अर्ध + -कोशः a moiety of oneʼs treasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धकौडविक
अर्ध + -कौडविक <i>a.</i> measuring half a kuḍava.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धखारम्
अर्ध + -खारम्, -खारी a kind of measure, half a Khāri; P. V. 4. 101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धखारी
अर्ध + -खारम्, -खारी a kind of measure, half a Khāri; P. V. 4. 101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धगङ्गा|अर्धगंगा
अर्ध + -गङ्गा N. of the river Kāverī; (स्नानादौ गङ्गास्नानार्धफलदायिनी);<BR> so ˚जाह्नवी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धगर्भ
अर्ध + -गर्भ <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 in the middle of the womb; सप्तार्धगर्भा भुवनस्य रेतो Rv. 1. 164. 36.<BR>—2 N. of the rays of the Sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धगुच्छः|अर्धगुच्छ|अर्द्धगुच्छः
अर्ध + -गुच्छः a necklace of 24 strings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धगुञ्जा
अर्ध + -गुञ्जा half a guñjā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धगोलः|अर्धगोल
अर्ध + -गोलः a hemisphere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचक्रवर्तिन्
अर्ध + -चक्रवर्तिन्, -चक्रिन् <i>m.</i> N. of the nine black Vasudevas and<BR> the nine enemies of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचक्रिन्
अर्ध + -चक्रवर्तिन्, -चक्रिन् <i>m.</i> N. of the nine black Vasudevas and<BR> the nine enemies of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचन्द्र|अर्द्धचन्द्रः|अर्धचन्द्रः
अर्ध + -चन्द्र <i>a.</i> crescent-shaped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचन्द्रः|अर्धचन्द्र|अर्द्धचन्द्रः
अर्ध + -चन्द्र + .({@-न्द्रः@})<BR>—1 the half moon, crescent moon; सार्धचन्द्रं बिभर्ति यः Ku. 6. 75.<BR>—2 the semicircular marks on a peacockʼs tail.<BR>—3 an arrow with a crescent-shaped head; अर्धचन्द्रमुखैर्बाणैश्चिच्छेद<BR> कदलीसुखम् R. 12. 96. cf. अर्धचन्द्रस्तदाकारे बाणे बर्हे शिखण्डिनः Nm.<BR>—4 crescent-shaped nail-print.<BR>—5 the hand bent into a semicircle, as for the purpose of seizing or clutching<BR> anything; ˚न्द्र दा to seize by the neck and turn out; दीयतामेतस्यार्धचन्द्रः Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचन्द्रा
अर्ध + -चन्द्र + .({@-द्रा@}) N. of a plant (कर्णस्फोट).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचन्द्राकार|अर्धचन्द्राकारः
अर्ध + -चन्द्राकार, -चन्द्राकृति <i>a.</i> half-moonshaped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचन्द्राकृति
अर्ध + -चन्द्राकार, -चन्द्राकृति <i>a.</i> half-moonshaped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचन्द्रकम्
अर्ध + -चन्द्रकम् A semi-circular pearl. Kau. A.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचन्द्राकारः|अर्धचन्द्राकार
अर्ध + -चन्द्रकम् + .({@-रः, -ति@} <i>f.</i>) meniscus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचक्द्राकृतिः
अर्ध + -चन्द्रकम् + .({@-रः, -ति@} <i>f.</i>) meniscus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचन्द्रिका
अर्ध + -चन्द्रिका N. of a climbing plant. (Mar. तिळवण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचित्र
अर्ध + -चित्र <i>a.</i> Half-transparent; A kind of marble; अर्धाङ्गदृश्यमानं<BR> च तदर्धचित्रमिति स्मृतम् Māna. 51. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धचोलकः|अर्धचोलक|अर्द्धचोलकः
अर्ध + -चोलकः a short bodice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धजरतीयन्यायः
अर्ध + -जरतीयन्यायः a kind of न्याय, न चेदानीमर्धजरतीयं लभ्यं<BR> वृद्धिर्मे भविष्यति स्वरो नेति Mbh. 4. 1. 78. See under न्याय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धजीविका
अर्ध + -जीविका, -ज्या The sine of an arc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धज्या
अर्ध + -जीविका, -ज्या The sine of an arc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धतनुः|अर्धतनु
अर्ध + -तनुः <i>f.</i> half the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धतिक्तः|अर्धतिक्त|अर्द्धतिक्तः
अर्ध + -तिक्तः N. of a plant (नेपालनिम्ब Mar. चिराईत).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धतूरः|अर्धतूर
अर्ध + -तूरः a kind of musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धदिनम्
अर्ध + -दिनम्, -दिवसः<BR>—1 half a day, mid-day.<BR>—2 a day of 12 hours.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धदिवसः|अर्धदिवस
अर्ध + -दिनम्, -दिवसः<BR>—1 half a day, mid-day.<BR>—2 a day of 12 hours.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धदेवः|अर्धदेव
अर्ध + -देवः<BR>—1 demi-god. इन्द्रं न वृत्रतुरमर्धदेवम् Rv. 4. 42. 8-9.<BR>—2 Ved. being near the gods; (देवानां समीपे वर्तमानः Sāy.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धद्रौणिक
अर्ध + -द्रौणिक <i>a.</i> measuring a half <i>droṇa</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धधारः|अर्धधार
अर्ध + -धारः a knife or lancet with a single edge (one of the 20 surgical<BR> instruments mentioned by Suśruta).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धनाराचः|अर्धनाराच
अर्ध + -नाराचः a crescent-shaped iron-pointed arrow; नाराचानर्धनाराचाञ्शस्त्राणि<BR> विविधानि च Mbh. 2. 51. 35; गृध्र-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">Page0229-1</a>]<BR> लक्षवेधी अर्धनाराचः V. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0228-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धनारायणः|अर्धनारायण
अर्ध + -नारायणः a form of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धनारीशः|अर्धनारीश|अर्द्धनारीशः
अर्ध + -नारीशः, -नारीश्वरः, -नारी, -नटेश्वरः a form of Śiva, (half<BR> male and half female) cf. … पतिरपि जगतामर्धनारीश्वरोऽभूत् Sūkti. 5. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धनारीश्वरः|अर्धनारीश्वर|अर्द्धनारीश्वरः
अर्ध + -नारीशः, -नारीश्वरः, -नारी, -नटेश्वरः a form of Śiva, (half<BR> male and half female) cf. … पतिरपि जगतामर्धनारीश्वरोऽभूत् Sūkti. 5. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धनारी
अर्ध + -नारीशः, -नारीश्वरः, -नारी, -नटेश्वरः a form of Śiva, (half<BR> male and half female) cf. … पतिरपि जगतामर्धनारीश्वरोऽभूत् Sūkti. 5. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धनटेश्वरः
अर्ध + -नारीशः, -नारीश्वरः, -नारी, -नटेश्वरः a form of Śiva, (half<BR> male and half female) cf. … पतिरपि जगतामर्धनारीश्वरोऽभूत् Sūkti. 5. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धनावम्
अर्ध + -नावम् half a boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धनिशा
अर्ध + -निशा midnight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपञ्चम
अर्ध + -पञ्चम <i>a.</i> Four and half; युक्तश्छन्दांस्यधीयीत मासान्विप्रोऽर्धपञ्चमान् Ms. 4. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपञ्चाशत्
अर्ध + -पञ्चाशत् <i>f.</i> twenty-five Ms. 8. 268.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपणः|अर्धपण
अर्ध + -पणः a measure containing half paṇa Ms. 8. 404.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपथम्
अर्ध + -पथम् half way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपथे
अर्ध + -पथम् + .({@-पथे@}) midway भृतिमर्धपथे सर्वान्प्रदाप्य Y. 2. 198.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपादः|अर्धपाद
अर्ध + -पादः half a pāda or foot; अर्धपादं किष्कुविष्कम्भमुद्धृत्य Dk. 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपादा
अर्ध + -पादा The plant भूम्यामलकी (Mar. भुईआवळी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपादिक
अर्ध + -पादिक <i>a.</i> having half a foot; सद्यः कार्योऽर्धपादिकः Ms. 8. 325.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपाञ्चालिक
अर्ध + -पाञ्चालिक <i>a.</i> born or produced in the <i>ardhapañcāla</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपारावतः|अर्धपारावत|अर्द्धपारावतः
अर्ध + -पारावतः a kind of pigeon (अर्धेनाङ्गेन पारावत इव). The<BR> francolin partridge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धपुलायितः|अर्धपुलायित
अर्ध + -पुलायितः a half gallop, canter; चित्रं चकार पदमर्धपुलायितेन Śi. 5. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धप्रहर
अर्ध + -प्रहर half a watch, one hour and a half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धप्राणम्
अर्ध + -प्राणम् A kind of joinery resembling the shape of a bisected heart;<BR> मूलाग्रे कीलकं युक्तमर्धप्राणमिति स्मृतम् । Māna. 17. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धभागः|अर्धभाग
अर्ध + -भागः a half, half a share or part; तदर्धभागेन लभस्व काङ्क्षितम्<BR> Ku. 5. 50; R. 7. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धभागिक
अर्ध + -भागिक <i>a.</i> sharing a half; मृते पितरि कुर्युस्तं भ्रातरस्त्वर्धभागिकम् Y. 2. 134.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धभाज्
अर्ध + -भाज् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 sharing entitled to a half; अर्धभाग्रक्षणाद्राजा Ms. 8. 39.<BR>—2 a companion, sharer; देवानामर्धभागासि Av. 6. 86. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धभास्करः|अर्धभास्कर
अर्ध + -भास्करः mid-day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धभेदः|अर्धभेद
अर्ध + -भेदः Hemiplegia (अर्धाङ्गवायुः); Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धभोटिका
अर्ध + -भोटिका a kind of cake. {@भ्रमः, -मकः@} a kind of artificial<BR> composition; for instances see Ki. 15. 27; Śi. 19. 72. The Sar. K. describes<BR> it as a figure of speech thus:− आहुरर्धभ्रमं नाम श्लोकार्धभ्रमणं यदि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धमागधी
अर्ध + -मागधी N. of a dialect in which many of Jaina Canonical books<BR> are written. It is so named perhaps because many of the characteristics<BR> of Māgadhi are found in it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धमाणवकः|अर्धमाणवक
अर्ध + -माणवकः, -माणवः a necklace of 12 strings (माणवक consisting of 24).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धमाणवः|अर्धमाणव|अर्द्धमाणवः
अर्ध + -माणवकः, -माणवः a necklace of 12 strings (माणवक consisting of 24).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धमात्रा
अर्ध + -मात्रा<BR>—1 half a (short) syllable. अर्धमात्रालाघवेन पुत्रोत्सवं मन्यन्ते वैयाकरणाः Pari. Śekh.<BR>—2 a term for a consonant (व्यञ्जनं चार्धमात्रकम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धमार्गे
अर्ध + -मार्गे <i>ind.</i> mid-way; बन्दीकृता विबुधशत्रुभिरर्धमार्गे V. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धमासः|अर्धमास
अर्ध + -मासः half a month, a fortnight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धमासतम
अर्ध + -मासतम = ˚मासिक see P. V. 2. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धमासिक
अर्ध + -मासिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 happening every fortnight.<BR>—2 lasting for a fortnight; येऽर्धमासाश्च च मासाश्च Mahānār. Up. 25; Y. 2. 177.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धमुष्टिः|अर्धमुष्टि
अर्ध + -मुष्टिः <i>f.</i> a half-clenched hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धयामः|अर्धयाम
अर्ध + -यामः half a watch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धरथः|अर्धरथ
अर्ध + -रथः [अर्धः असंपूर्णः रथः रथी] a warrior who fights<BR> on a car with another (who is not so skilled as a रथी); रणे रणेऽभिमानी<BR> च विमुखश्चापि दृश्यते । घृणी कर्णः प्रमादी च तेन मेऽर्धरथो मतः Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धरात्रः|अर्धरात्र|अर्द्धरात्रः
अर्ध + -रात्रः [अर्ध रात्रेः]<BR>—1 midnight; अथार्धरात्रे स्तिमितप्रदीपे R. 16. 4; स्थितेऽर्धरात्रे Dk. 109.<BR>—2 a night containing half a whole day of 24 hours.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धरात्रार्धदिवसः|अर्धरात्रार्धदिवस
अर्ध + -रात्रार्धदिवसः equinox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धलक्ष्मीहरिः|अर्धलक्ष्मीहरि|अर्द्धलक्ष्मीहरिः
अर्ध + -लक्ष्मीहरिः Hari having a form half like Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धविसर्गः|अर्धविसर्ग
अर्ध + -विसर्गः, -विसर्जनीयः the Visarga sound before क्, ख्, प्,<BR> and फ्, so called because its sign Z is the half of a Visarga (ः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धविसर्जनीयः|अर्धविसर्जनीय
अर्ध + -विसर्गः, -विसर्जनीयः the Visarga sound before क्, ख्, प्,<BR> and फ्, so called because its sign Z is the half of a Visarga (ः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धवीक्षणम्
अर्ध + -वीक्षणम् a side-look, glance, leer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धवृद्ध
अर्ध + -वृद्ध <i>a.</i> middle-aged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धवृद्धिः|अर्धवृद्धि
अर्ध + -वृद्धिः The half of the interest or rent; Ms. 8. 150.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धवैनाशिकः|अर्धवैनाशिक
अर्ध + -वैनाशिकः N. of the followers of Kaṇāda (arguing half perishableness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धवैशसम्
अर्ध + -वैशसम् half or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">Page0229-2</a>]<BR> incomplete murder; विधिना कृतमर्धवैशसं ननु मां कामवधे विमुञ्चता Ku. 4. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धव्यासः|अर्धव्यास
अर्ध + -व्यासः the radius of a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धशतम्
अर्ध + -शतम्<BR>—1 fifty.<BR>—2 One hundred and fifty; Ms. 8. 267.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धशनम्
अर्ध + -शनम् [अर्धमशनस्य शकन्ध्वा˚] half a meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धशफरः|अर्धशफर
अर्ध + -शफरः a kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धशब्द
अर्ध + -शब्द <i>a.</i> having a low voice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धशेष
अर्ध + -शेष <i>a.</i> having only a half left.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धश्याम
अर्ध + -श्याम <i>a.</i> half clouded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धश्लोकः|अर्धश्लोक
अर्ध + -श्लोकः half a <i>śloka</i> or verse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धसम
अर्ध + -सम <i>a.</i> equal to a half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धसमम्
अर्ध + -सम + .({@-मम्@}) N. of a class of metres in which the 1st and 3rd and 2nd<BR> and 4th lines have the same syllables and Gaṇas; such as पुष्पिताग्रा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धसस्य
अर्ध + -सस्य <i>a.</i> half the crops, half grown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धसहः|अर्धसह
अर्ध + -सहः An owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धसीरिन्
अर्ध + -सीरिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a cultivator, ploughman who takes half the crop for his labour; शूद्रेषु<BR> दासगोपालकुलमित्रार्धसीरिणः Y. 1. 166.<BR>—2 = अर्धिक q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धहर
अर्ध + -हर, -हारिन् <i>a.</i> occupying the half (of the body); Ku. 1. 50;<BR> एको रागिषु राजते प्रियतमादेहार्धहारी हरः Bh. 3. 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धहारिन्
अर्ध + -हर, -हारिन् <i>a.</i> occupying the half (of the body); Ku. 1. 50;<BR> एको रागिषु राजते प्रियतमादेहार्धहारी हरः Bh. 3. 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धहारः|अर्धहार|अर्द्धहारः
अर्ध + -हारः a necklace of 64 strings. A half chain, a kind of ornament;<BR> नक्षत्रमालामपि चार्धहारं सुवर्णसूत्रं परितः स्तनाभ्याम् Māna. 50. 297-98.<BR> cf. also Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धह्रस्वः|अर्धह्रस्व
अर्ध + -ह्रस्वः half a (short) syllable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धक
अर्धक <i>a.</i> Half; see अर्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धर्चः|अर्धर्च|अर्द्धर्चः|अर्द्धर्च्च|अर्धर्चं
अर्धर्चः, -चम्<BR> Half a verse, hemistich; अर्धर्चेन चाकॢपुर्विश्वमेजत्<BR> Av. 9. 10. 19; अर्धर्चाः पुंसि च P. II. 4. 31. ˚आदिगणः a class<BR> of words either <i>m.</i> or <i>n.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धर्चम्
अर्धर्चः, -चम्<BR> Half a verse, hemistich; अर्धर्चेन चाकॢपुर्विश्वमेजत्<BR> Av. 9. 10. 19; अर्धर्चाः पुंसि च P. II. 4. 31. ˚आदिगणः a class<BR> of words either <i>m.</i> or <i>n.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धिक|अर्धिकः
अर्धिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [अर्धमर्हति ठन्]<BR>—1 Measuring a half; तदर्धिक Ms. 3. 1.<BR>—2 Entitled to half a share; Y. 2. 296.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धिकः|अर्धिक
अर्धिक + .{@-कः@} A half-caste man; वैश्यकन्यासमुत्पन्नो ब्राह्मणेन तु संस्कृतः ।<BR> अर्धिकः स तु विज्ञेयो भोज्यो विप्रैर्न संशयः Parāśara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धिन्
अर्धिन्^1 <i>a.</i> [अर्ध-अस्त्यर्थे इनि] Sharing or entitled to a half;<BR> सर्वेषामर्धिनो मुख्याः Ms. 8. 210. cf. also येषामर्धं ते अर्धिनः ।<BR> ŚB. on MS. 10. 3. 55.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170209. note: related to arDa..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्धुक
अर्धुक <i>a.</i> Prospering, succeeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ध्य
अर्ध्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Belonging to the half (of anything).<BR>—2 Fit to be increased.<BR>—3 To be accomplished; अधा ते विष्णो विदुषा चिदर्ध्यः Rv. 1. 156. 1.<BR>—4 To be obtained; शविष्ठं वाजं विदुषा चिदर्ध्यम् Rv. 5. 44. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्पणम्
अर्पणम् [ऋ-णिच्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Placing or putting upon, setting upon; स तस्य दृष्ट्यर्पणसंप्रचोदितः<BR> Rām. 5. 47. 2; पादार्पणानुग्रहपूतपृष्ठम् R. 2. 35.<BR>—2 Inserting, placing or putting in.<BR>—3 Giving, offering, resigning; स्वदेहार्पणनिष्क्रयेण R. 2. 55; मुखार्पणेषु<BR> प्रकृतिप्रगल्भाः 13. 9; तत्कुरुष्व मदर्पणम् Bg. 9. 27.<BR>—4 Restoration, delivery, giving back; न्यास˚ Ak.<BR>—5 Piercing, perforating; यद्यद् द्युत्तं लिखितमर्पणेन Av. 12. 3. 22;<BR> तीक्ष्णतुण्डार्पणैर्ग्रीवां नखैः सर्वां व्यदारयत् Rām. (Said to<BR> mean also fire, god, an oblation, a Mantra and the tongue of fire. Tv.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्पित
अर्पित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Inserted, fixed, full of; द्रुमाणां विविधै पुष्पैः परिस्तोमैरिवार्पितम्<BR> Rām. 4. 1. 8; Kaṭh. 4. 9<BR>—2 Placed in or upon; हस्तार्पितैर्नयनवारिभिरेव (शशाप) R. 9. 78.<BR> मय्यर्पितमनोबुद्धिः Bg. 8. 7, 12. 14.<BR>—3 Thrown, cast into; हृदि शल्यमर्पितम् R. 8. 88.<BR>—4 Transferred to, engraved;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">Page0230-1</a>]<BR> painted; दूरापवर्जितच्छत्रैस्तस्याज्ञां शासनार्पिताम् R. 17. 79; चित्रार्पितारम्भमिवावतस्थे Ku. 3. 42.<BR>—5 Offered, delivered, entrusted; यथार्पितान्पशून्गोपः सायंप्रत्यर्पयेत्तथा Y. 2. 164.<BR>—6 Given back; अर्पितप्रकृतिक्रान्तिभिर्मुखैः R. 19. 10.<BR>—7 Ceased, gone; स तेन राजा दुःखेनभृशमर्पितचेतनः Rām. 2. 59. 27.<BR>—8 Pierced; स शरैरर्पितः क्रुद्धः सर्वगात्रेषु राघवः Rām. 3. 28. 19. See ऋ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0229-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्पिसः|अर्पिस
अर्पिसः [ऋ-णिच्-इसुन् Uṇ. 4. 2] The heart; flesh in the heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ब्
अर्ब् €1 P. (अर्बति, आनर्ब, अर्बितुम्)<BR>—1 To go towards.<BR>—2 To kill, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्बुकाः
अर्बुकाः N. of a people; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्बुदः|अर्बुद|अर्बुदं|अर्ब्बुद|अर्ब्बुदः
अर्बु(र्ब)दः, -दम्<BR>—1 A swelling, tumour, (of various kind); मांस˚, नासा˚, शोणित˚ &c.<BR>—2 One hundred millions. बहूनीह सहस्राणि प्रयुतान्यर्बुदानि च । अशक्यान्येव<BR> संख्यातुं पन्नगानां तपोधन ॥ Mb. 1. 35. 19.<BR>—3 N. of a mountain in the West of India (Abu).<BR>—4 A serpent-like demon killed by Indra; Rv. 1. 51. 6.<BR>—5 A serpent.<BR>—6 A cloud.<BR>—7 A place of pilgrimage (of the Jainas).<BR>—8 A long round mass, lump of flesh; यदि पिण्डः पुमान् स्त्री चेत् पेशी<BR> नपुंसकं चेदर्बुदम् Suśr.; Y. 3. 75, 89 (मांसपिण्ड).<BR>—9 N. of a people.<BR>—10 N. of a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्बदः
अर्बु(र्ब)दः, -दम्<BR>—1 A swelling, tumour, (of various kind); मांस˚, नासा˚, शोणित˚ &c.<BR>—2 One hundred millions. बहूनीह सहस्राणि प्रयुतान्यर्बुदानि च । अशक्यान्येव<BR> संख्यातुं पन्नगानां तपोधन ॥ Mb. 1. 35. 19.<BR>—3 N. of a mountain in the West of India (Abu).<BR>—4 A serpent-like demon killed by Indra; Rv. 1. 51. 6.<BR>—5 A serpent.<BR>—6 A cloud.<BR>—7 A place of pilgrimage (of the Jainas).<BR>—8 A long round mass, lump of flesh; यदि पिण्डः पुमान् स्त्री चेत् पेशी<BR> नपुंसकं चेदर्बुदम् Suśr.; Y. 3. 75, 89 (मांसपिण्ड).<BR>—9 N. of a people.<BR>—10 N. of a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्बुदम्
अर्बु(र्ब)दः, -दम्<BR>—1 A swelling, tumour, (of various kind); मांस˚, नासा˚, शोणित˚ &c.<BR>—2 One hundred millions. बहूनीह सहस्राणि प्रयुतान्यर्बुदानि च । अशक्यान्येव<BR> संख्यातुं पन्नगानां तपोधन ॥ Mb. 1. 35. 19.<BR>—3 N. of a mountain in the West of India (Abu).<BR>—4 A serpent-like demon killed by Indra; Rv. 1. 51. 6.<BR>—5 A serpent.<BR>—6 A cloud.<BR>—7 A place of pilgrimage (of the Jainas).<BR>—8 A long round mass, lump of flesh; यदि पिण्डः पुमान् स्त्री चेत् पेशी<BR> नपुंसकं चेदर्बुदम् Suśr.; Y. 3. 75, 89 (मांसपिण्ड).<BR>—9 N. of a people.<BR>—10 N. of a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्बुदाकारः|अर्बुदाकार
अर्बु(र्ब)दः, -दम् + .{@-आकारः@} N. of the plant Cordia myxa^1 (Mar. गोंदणी, भोंकर).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्बुदिः|अर्बुदि
अर्बुदिः<BR>—1 A serpent-like demon conquered by Indra; Av. 11. 9 and 10 (in almost every verse).<BR>—2 All-pervading lord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्बुदिन्
अर्बुदिन् <i>a.</i> Afflicted with swelling or tumour,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्भ|अर्भः
अर्भ <i>a.</i> [ऋ-भन् Uṇ. 3. 152] Ved. Little, small, unimportant;<BR> Av. 7. 56. 3; दैत्यायित्वा जहारान्यामेका कृष्णार्भभावनाम् Bhāg. 10. 30. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्भः|अर्भ
अर्भ + .{@-र्भः@} A child, pupil; पञ्चषड्ढायनार्भाभाः पूर्वेषामपि पूर्वजाः<BR> Bhāg. 7. 1. 37. [cf. L. <i>orbus</i>.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्भक|अर्भकः
अर्भक <i>a.</i> [According to Nir. अवहृतं भवति ह्रस्वं तस्मादर्भकः]<BR>—1 Small, minute, short; नमो महद्भ्यो नमो अर्भकेभ्यः Rv. 1. 27. 13.<BR>—2 Weak, emaciated, lean. परिच्छिन्ना भरता अर्भकासः Rv. 7. 33. 6.<BR>—3 Foolish.<BR>—4 Young, childish; न हि वो अस्त्यर्भको देवासो न कुमारकः Rv. 8. 30. 1.<BR>—5 Like, similar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्भकः|अर्भक
अर्भक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A boy, child; श्रुतस्य यायादयमन्तमर्भकः R. 3. 21, 25, 7. 67.<BR>—2 The young of an animal.<BR>—3 A fool, idiot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्भग
अर्भग <i>a.</i> Ved. Youthful, young; यावर्भगाय विमदाय जायाम् Rv. 1. 116. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्मः|अर्म|अर्मं|अर्म्म|अर्म्मं
अर्मः, -र्मम्<BR> [ऋ-मन् Uṇ. 1. 137]<BR>—1 A disease of the eye.<BR>—2 A country to which one should go (गन्तव्यदेशः or चिरन्तनग्रामनिवासः).<BR>—3 A cemetery.<BR>—4 (pl.) Ruins, rubbish; Vāj. 30. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्मम्
अर्मः, -र्मम्<BR> [ऋ-मन् Uṇ. 1. 137]<BR>—1 A disease of the eye.<BR>—2 A country to which one should go (गन्तव्यदेशः or चिरन्तनग्रामनिवासः).<BR>—3 A cemetery.<BR>—4 (pl.) Ruins, rubbish; Vāj. 30. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्मक
अर्मक <i>a.</i> Narrow, thin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्मकम्
अर्मक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Narrowness.<BR>—2 Rubbish, ruins; महावैलस्थे अर्मके Rv. 1. 133. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्मणम्
अर्मणम् A measure of one droṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्मन्|अर्म्मन्
अर्मन् <i>n.</i> [ऋ-मनिन्] A disease of the eye (said to be of 5 kinds).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्य|अर्यः|अर्य्य|अर्य्यः
अर्य <i>a.</i> [ऋ-यत्]<BR>—1 Excellent, best.<BR>—2 Respectable.<BR>—3 Attached, true, devoted.<BR>—4 Dear, kind; Rv. 1. 123. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यः|अर्य|अर्य्य|अर्य्यः
अर्य + .{@-र्यः@}<BR>—1 A master, lord; अर्यः प्रेम्णा नो तथा वल्लभस्य Śi. 18. 52; Śānti. 1. 18;<BR> तेन वह्येन हन्तासि त्वमर्यं पुरुषाशिनम् Bk. 6. 51.<BR>—2 A man of the third tribe, Vaiśya. cf. अर्यः स्वामिवैश्ययोः P. III. 1. 103.<BR> cf. also … अर्यस्तु बाहुजे, and स्यादर्यः स्वामिवणिजोः Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्या|अर्य्या
अर्य + .{@-र्या@}<BR>—1 A mistress.<BR>—2 A woman of the Vaiśya tribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यी|अर्य्यी
अर्य + .{@-र्यी@} The wife of a Vaiśya.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अर्यजारा, अर्यपत्नी, अर्यवर्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यजारा
अर्य + -जारा the mistress of an Ārya. शूद्रा यदर्यजारा न पोषाय<BR> धनायति Vāj. 23. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यपत्नी
अर्य + -पत्नी the wife of a true or legitimate husband; अर्यपत्नीरुषसश्चकार<BR> Rv. 7. 6. 5, 10. 43. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यवर्यः|अर्यवर्य
अर्य + -वर्यः a Vaiśya of rank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्याणी|अर्य्याणी
अर्याणी [अर्य-आनुक्-ङीप् च] A woman of the Vaiśya tribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यमन्|अर्य्यमन्
अर्यमन् <i>m.</i> [अर्यं श्रेष्ठं मिमीते; मा-कनिन् निपातोयम् Uṇ. 1. 156]<BR>—1 The Sun; अहं हि पृष्टोऽर्यमणो भवद्भिः Bhāg. 1. 18. 23; प्रोषितार्यमणं<BR> मेरोरन्धकारस्तटीमिव Śi. 2. 39; तिमिरमिवार्यमरश्मिभिः समग्रम्<BR> Śiva B. 30. 50.<BR>—2 The head of the Pitṛs or Manes; पितॄणामर्यमा चास्मि Bg. 10. 20.<BR>—3 The constellation उत्तराफल्गुनी.<BR>—4 N. of the <i>arka</i> plant.<BR>—5 One of the Ādityas; शं नो भवत्वर्यमा T. Up. 1. 1. 1.<BR>—6 A bosom-friend, play-fellow.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अर्यमदेवा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यमदेवा
अर्यमन् + -देवा N. of the 12th lunar mansion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यमिक|अर्य्यमिक
अर्यमिक (अर्यमिय and अर्यमिल also) <i>a.</i> Compassionate;<BR> (diminutive of अर्यमदत्त P. V. 3. 84).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यमिय
अर्यमिक (अर्यमिय and अर्यमिल also) <i>a.</i> Compassionate;<BR> (diminutive of अर्यमदत्त P. V. 3. 84).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यमिल
अर्यमिक (अर्यमिय and अर्यमिल also) <i>a.</i> Compassionate;<BR> (diminutive of अर्यमदत्त P. V. 3. 84).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्यम्यः|अर्यम्य|अर्य्यम्य
अर्यम्यः<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 A bosom-friend; अर्यम्यं वरुण मित्र्यं वा Rv. 5. 85. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्व्
अर्व् €1 P. To kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वटम्
अर्वटम् Ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वन्|अर्व्वन्
अर्वन् <i>a.</i> [ऋ-वनिप्]<BR>—1 Going, moving, running.<BR>—2 Mean, unworthy, censurable (गर्ह्य Uṇ. 4. 112; कुत्सित 5. 54).<BR> ━<i>m.</i> (अर्वा, अर्वन्तौ, अर्वन्तः &c.)<BR>—1 A horse; चित्रध्वजपताकाग्रैरभेन्द्रस्यन्दनार्वभिः Bhāg. 10. 75. 11;<BR> अर्वासुरान् Bṛ. Up. 1. 1. 2. श्लथीकृतप्रग्रहमर्वतां व्रजाः Śi. 12. 31.<BR>—2 An epithet of a horse or its driver.<BR>—3 One of the ten horses of the moon.<BR>—4 Indra.<BR>—5 A short span (गोकर्णपरिमाण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वती|अर्व्वती
अर्वन् + .{@-ती@}<BR>—1 A mare.<BR>—2 A bawd, procuress.<BR>—3 A nymph.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अर्ववसुः, अर्ववाहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ववसुः|अर्ववसु
अर्वन् + -वसुः one of the principal seven rays of the Sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ववाहः
अर्वन् + -वाहः A horseman; आगच्छन् गुरुतरगर्वमर्ववाहैः Śiva B. 24. 64 and 25. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वश
अर्वश <i>a.</i> Possessed of coursers, quick. इन्द्रो देवेभिरर्वशेभिरर्वशः Rv. 10. 22. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाञ्च्|अर्वांच्
अर्वाञ्च्^1 <i>a.</i> [अवरे काले देशे वा अञ्चति पृषो˚ अर्वादेशः]<BR>—1 Coming hitherward (opp. पराञ्च्).<BR>—2 Turned towards, coming to meet anyone.<BR>—3 Being on this side (as the bank of a river); (opp. पर).<BR>—4 Being below or behind (in time or place).<BR>—5 Following, subsequent.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">Page0231-1</a>]<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170209. note: opp. parAYc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाक्|अर्व्वाक्
अर्वाच् + .{@-क्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Hitherward, on this side.<BR>—2 From a certain point.<BR>—3 Before (in time or place); यत्सृष्टेरर्वाक् सलिलमयं ब्रह्माण्डमभूत्<BR> K. 125; अर्वाक् संवत्सरात्स्वामी हरेत परतो नृपः Y. 2. 173, 113, 1. 254;<BR> Ms. 8. 30, 5. 59.<BR>—4 On the lower side, behind, downwards (opp. ऊर्ध्वम्).<BR>—5 Afterwards, subsequently.<BR>—6 (With loc.) Within, near; एते चार्वागुपवनभुवि छिन्नदर्भाङ्कुरायाम् Ś. 1. 15.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अर्वाक्कालः, अर्वाक्कालिक, अर्वाक्कूलम्, अर्वाक्तन, अर्वाग्बिल, अर्वाग्वसु, अर्वाक्सामन्, अर्वाक्स्रोतस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0230-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाक्कालः|अर्वाक्काल
अर्वाच् + -कालः posterior time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाक्कालिक
अर्वाच् + -कालिक <i>a.</i> belonging to proximate time, modern; ˚ता modernness,<BR> posterity of time; तान्यर्वाक्कालिकतया निष्फलान्यनृतानि च Ms. 12. 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाक्कूलम्
अर्वाच् + -कूलम् the near bank of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाक्तन
अर्वाच् + -तन <i>a.</i> Being on this side of, not reaching up to, posterior;<BR> प्रकृतिपुरुषयोरर्वाक्तनाभिर्नामरूपाकृतिभी रूपनिरूपणम् Bhāg. 5. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाग्बिल
अर्वाच् + -बिल <i>a.</i> Ved. having the hole or mouth hitherward; अर्वाग्बिलश्चमस<BR> ऊध्वर्बुध्नः Bṛ. Up. 2. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाग्वसु|अर्वाग्वसुः
अर्वाच् + -वसु <i>a.</i> offering riches. Vāj. 15. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाग्वसुः|अर्वाग्वसु
अर्वाच् + -वसु + .({@-सुः@})<BR>—1 rain.<BR>—2 a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाक्सामन्
अर्वाच् + -सामन् <i>n.</i> Ved. epithet of three days during which the Soma<BR> sacrifice is performed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाक्स्रोतस्
अर्वाच् + -स्रोतस् <i>m.</i> N. of a creation of beings in which the current<BR> of nutriment tends downwards, or where the men are addicted to sensual enjoyments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाके
अर्वाके <i>ind.</i> In the proximity of, near. अर्वाके अस्ति भेषजम् Rv. 8. 9. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाचीन|अर्व्वाचीन|अर्व्वाचीनः
अर्वाचीन <i>a.</i> [अर्वाच्-ख]<BR>—1 Turned towards; favouring; turned towards unfavourbly; अर्वाचीनासो<BR> वनुषे युयुज्रे Rv. 6. 25. 3.<BR>—2 Being on this side, below.<BR>—3 Born afterwards, posterior.<BR>—4 Modern, recent.<BR>—5 Reverse, contrary; ˚ता state of being posterior or recent; state<BR> of being contrary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वाचीनम्
अर्वाचीन + .{@-नम्@} <i>ind.</i> (With abl.)<BR>—1 On this side of.<BR>—2 Thenceforward.<BR>—3 Less than.<BR>—4 Later than; यदूर्ध्वं पृथिव्या अर्वाचीनमन्तरीक्षात् Śat. Br.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वावत्|अर्व्वावत्
अर्वावत् <i>a.</i> [अवरकालोऽस्त्यस्य मतुप् पृषो˚] Later, modern.<BR>━<i>f.</i> Proximity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वावसु|अर्व्वावसु
अर्वावसु N. of the Hotṛ of the Gods (देवानां होता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्वुक|अर्व्वुक
अर्वुक [अर्व्-हिंसने बाहु˚ उकञ्] N. of a tribe or people in the<BR> south mentioned in the Mahābhārata and conquered by Sahadeva; N. of<BR> kings living in the southern forest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्श|अर्शं|अर्शः
अर्श <i>a.</i> Bringing misfortune, sinful; indecent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शः|अर्श|अर्शं
अर्श + .{@-र्शः@}<BR>—1 Damage, hurt.<BR>—2 = अर्शस् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शस्
अर्शस् <i>n.</i> [ऋ-असुन् व्याधौ शुट् च Uṇ. 4. 195] Piles; नाशयित्री<BR> बलासस्यार्शसऽउपचितामसि Vāj. 12. 97.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अर्शोघ्न, अर्शोयुज्, अर्शोहित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोघ्न|अर्शोघ्नः
अर्शस् + -घ्न <i>a.</i> destroying piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोघ्नः|अर्शोघ्न
अर्शस् + -घ्न + .({@-घ्नः@})<BR>—1 N. of the plant शूरण^1 (Mar. सुरण), so called because it<BR> is said to cure piles.<BR>—2 one part of butter-milk with three parts of water.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोघ्नी
अर्शस् + -घ्न + .({@-घ्नी@})<BR>—1 N. of the plant Curculigo Archioides Lin. (Mar. देवडंगरी).<BR>—2 the marking nut plant (भल्लातक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोयुज्
अर्शस् + -युज् <i>a.</i> afflicted with piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोहित|अर्शोहितः
अर्शस् + -हित <i>a.</i> curing piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शोहितः|अर्शोहित
अर्शस् + -हित + .({@-तः@}) the marking nut plant; (Mar. बिब्बा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शस|अर्शसः
अर्शस <i>a.</i> [अर्शस्-मस्त्वर्थे-अच् by अर्श आदिभ्योऽच् P. V. 2. 127.]<BR> Afflicted with piles; Ms. 3. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शिन्
अर्शिन् <i>a.</i> [अर्शमस्त्यस्य इनि] Afflicted with piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शसान|अर्शसानः
अर्शसान <i>a.</i> [ऋश्-असानुच् सुट् च] Striving to hurt, malicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्शसानः|अर्शसान
अर्शसान + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 N. of a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्षण
अर्षण <i>a.</i> [ऋष् गतौ ल्युट्] Flowing, movable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्षणम्
अर्षण + .{@-णम्@} Going, moving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्षणी
अर्षण + .{@-णी@}<BR>—1 Means of moving, conveyance.<BR>—2 A piercing or pricking pain; मूर्धानं प्रत्यर्षणीः Av. 9. 8. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह्
अर्ह् €1 P. [अर्हति, अर्हितुम्, आनर्ह, अर्हित] (epic. Ā. as रावणो<BR> नार्हते पूजाम् Rām.)<BR>—1 To deserve, merit, be worthy of (with acc. or inf.); किमिव नायुष्मानमरेश्वरान्नार्हति<BR> Ś. 7; so दण्डम्, प्रायश्चित्तम्, वधम् &c.<BR>—2 To have a right to, be entitled to, be allowed to do anything (with<BR> acc.); ननु गर्भः पित्र्यं रिक्थमर्हति Ś. 6; न स्त्री स्वातन्त्र्यमर्हति<BR> Ms. 9. 3; also with inf. न स तल्लब्धुमर्हति Ms. 8. 147, 11. 7, 18.<BR>—3 To be obliged or required to do a thing, oft. implying duty or obligation;<BR> नान्यत्स्त्री दातुमर्हति Y. 2. 49; इमां प्रसादयितुमर्हसि R. 1. 88.<BR>—4 To be fit or deserve to be done; अर्थना मयि भवद्भिः कर्तुमर्हति<BR> N. 5. 112; Dk. 137.<BR>—5 To be equal to, be worth, न ते गात्राण्युपचारमर्हन्ति Ś. 3. 17<BR> are not equal to; सर्वे ते जपयज्ञस्य कलां नार्हन्ति षोडशीम् Ms. 2. 86, 3. 131.<BR>—6 To be able, translatable by, ‘can’; न मे वचनमन्यथा भवितुमर्हति<BR> Ś. 4; विनाशमव्ययस्यास्य न कश्चित्कर्तुमर्हति Bg. 2. 17; अनुद्योगेन<BR> तैलानि तिलेभ्यो नाप्तुमर्हति H. Pr. 30 cannot get.<BR>—7 To worship, honour; see <i>caus.</i> below.<BR>—8 (Used with inf. in the second pers. and sometimes in the third) अर्ह्<BR> represents a mild form of command, advice or courteous request, and may<BR> be translated by ‘pray’, ‘deign’, ‘be pleased to’, ‘will be pleased to’;<BR> द्वित्राण्यहान्यर्हसि सोढुमर्हन् R. 5. 25 pray wait &c. नार्हसि मे<BR> प्रणयं विहन्तुम् 2. 58; तं सन्तः श्रोतुमर्हन्ति 1. 10 will be<BR> pleased or be good enough to listen to it; Ku. 6. 32; Ms. 1. 2; Bg. 10. 16, 2. 17;<BR> R. 1. 72, 1. 88, 3. 46. ━<i>Caus.</i> or €10 P. To honour,<BR> worship. राजार्जिहत्तं मधुपर्कपाणिः Bk. 1. 17; Ms. 3. 3. 119.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह|अर्हः
अर्ह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Respectable, worthy of respect, deserving; अर्हावभोजयन् विप्रो दण्डमर्हति<BR> माषकम् Ms. 8. 392.<BR>—2 Worthy of, having a claim to, entitled to, with acc., inf., or in comp.;<BR> नैवार्हः पैतृकं रिक्थं पतितोत्पादितो हि सः Ms. 9. 144; संस्कारमर्हस्त्वं<BR> न च लप्स्यसे Rām.; तस्मान्नार्हा वयं हन्तुं धार्तराष्ट्रान् स्वबान्धवान्<BR> Bg. 1. 37. प्रदक्षिणक्रियार्हायाम् R. 1. 76; so मान˚, वध˚, दण्ड˚ &c.<BR>—3 Being required, obliged, or allowed (with inf.).<BR>—4 Becoming, proper, fit; केवलं यानमर्हं स्यात् Pt. 3; with gen.<BR> also; स भृत्योऽर्हो महीभुजाम् Pt. 1. 87-92; or in comp.; तदर्हेण<BR> प्रायश्चित्तेन 1. 275; so नृप˚, यज्ञ˚ Ak.<BR>—5 Worth (in money), costing; see below.<BR>—6 Capable, powerful; न त्वां कुर्मि दशग्रीव भस्म भस्मार्हतेजसा<BR> Rām. 5. 22. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हः|अर्ह
अर्ह + .{@-र्हः@} [अर्ह्-घञ्]<BR>—1 N. of Indra.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 Price (as in महार्ह); महार्हशय्यापरिवर्तनच्युतैः Ku. 5. 12;<BR> (महानर्हो यस्याः Malli.). रत्नैर्महार्हैस्तुतुषुर्न देवाः Subhāṣ.<BR>—4 Fitness, propriety.<BR>—5 Motion, course (गति).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">Page0232-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हा
अर्ह + .{@-र्हा@} Worship, adoration; Ki. 2. 58; प्रदक्षिणक्रियार्हायां तस्यां<BR> त्वं साधु नाचरः R. 1. 76.<BR>—6 Gold; Nigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0231-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हणम्
अर्हणम्, -णा<BR> [अर्ह्-भावे-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Worship, adoration, honour, treating with respect or veneration; अर्हणामर्हते<BR> चक्रुर्मुनयो नयचक्षुषे R. 1. 55; Śi. 15. 22, 14. 58; R. 11. 23; Ms. 3. 54.<BR>—2 A present of honour, requisites for worship; तमुपेयुस्तत्र तत्र<BR> पौरा अर्हणपाणयः Bhāg. 9. 11. 29.<BR>—3 A precious jewel; मलिनं यथार्हणमसंस्कृतम् Bhāg. 3. 21. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हणा
अर्हणम्, -णा<BR> [अर्ह्-भावे-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Worship, adoration, honour, treating with respect or veneration; अर्हणामर्हते<BR> चक्रुर्मुनयो नयचक्षुषे R. 1. 55; Śi. 15. 22, 14. 58; R. 11. 23; Ms. 3. 54.<BR>—2 A present of honour, requisites for worship; तमुपेयुस्तत्र तत्र<BR> पौरा अर्हणपाणयः Bhāg. 9. 11. 29.<BR>—3 A precious jewel; मलिनं यथार्हणमसंस्कृतम् Bhāg. 3. 21. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हणा
अर्हणा <i>ind.</i> Ved. According to what is due; according to oneʼs<BR> means; केतुरर्हणा Rv. 1. 127; नृचक्षसो अनिमिषन्तो अर्हणाः Rv. 10. 63. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हणीय
अर्हणीय <i>pot. p.</i> Fit to be worshipped, adored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हत्|अर्हन्त्
अर्हत् <i>a.</i> [अर्ह-शतृ]<BR>—1 Worthy, deserving, deserving respect, respectable, adorable; त्वमर्हतां<BR> प्राग्रसरः स्मृतोऽसि नः Ś. 5. 15; R. 5. 25, 1. 55; Ku. 6. 56; Ms. 3. 128.<BR>—2 Praised, celebrated (स्तुत, ख्यात).<BR>—3 Worthy of, deserving, entitled to (mostly Ved.). ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A Buddha; the highest rank in Buddhist hierarchy.<BR>—2 A superior divinity with the Jainas; सर्वज्ञो जितरागादिदोषस्त्रैलोक्यपूजितः ।<BR> यथास्थितार्थवादी च देवोऽर्हन् परमेश्वरः ॥; see the word जैन also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हत्तम
अर्हत् + .{@-त्तम@} <i>a.</i> most worthy or venerable; अर्हत्तमाय विप्राय<BR> तस्मै दत्तं महाफलम् Ms. 3. 128.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हन्त|अर्हंत|अर्हन्तः
अर्हन्त <i>a.</i> (अर्ह्-बा˚ झ) Worthy, deserving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हन्तः|अर्हन्त|अर्हंत
अर्हन्त + .{@-न्तः@}<BR>—1 A Buddha.<BR>—2 A Buddhist mendicant.<BR>—3 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हन्तिका
अर्हन्तिका N. of a Buddhist nun. Dk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हन्ती
अर्हन्ती The quality of being fit to be worshipped, veneration, adoration;<BR> श्रौत्रार्हन्तीचणैगुर्ण्यैः Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्ह्य
अर्ह्य <i>pot. p.</i> [अर्ह्-ण्यत्]<BR>—1 Worthy, respectable.<BR>—2 Fit to be praised.<BR>—3 Right, fit, proper.<BR>—4 Fit to be obtained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अर्हरिष्वणि
अर्हरिष्वणि <i>a.</i> Ved. Making enemies cry aloud; exultant. न<BR> इयर्ति रेणुं बृहदर्हरिष्वणिः Rv. 1. 56. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्
अल् €1 U. (अलति-ते अलितुम्, अलित)<BR>—1 To adorn.<BR>—2 To be competent or able.<BR>—3 To prevent, ward off; see अलम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकः|अलक|अलकं
अलकः [अल-क्वुन्, अलति भूषयति मुखम्]<BR>—1 A curl, lock of hair, hair in general; ललाटिकाचन्दनधूसरालका<BR> Ku. 5. 55; अस्पृष्टालकवेष्टनौ R. 1. 42, 4. 54; अलकभङ्गतां गतः<BR> K. 4; अलके बालकुन्दानुविद्धम् Me. 67 (the word is <i>n.</i> also, as<BR> appears from a quotation of Malli.: स्वभाववक्राण्यलकानि तासाम्).<BR>—2 Curls on the fore-head; … अलकः पुरोलम्बनकुन्तले Nm.<BR>—3 Saffron besmeared on the body.<BR>—4 mad dog (for अलर्क).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलका
अलकः + .{@-का@}<BR>—1 A girl from eight to ten years of age.<BR>—2 N. of the capital of Kubera (situated on a peak of the Himālaya above<BR> the peak of Meru, inhabited also by Śiva), and of the lord of the Yakṣas;<BR> अलकामतिवाह्यैव Ku. 6. 37; विभाति यस्यां ललितालकायां मनोहरा<BR> वैश्रवणस्य लक्ष्मीः Bv. 2. 10; गन्तव्या ते<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">Page0232-2</a>]<BR> वसतिरलका नाम यक्षेश्वराणाम् Me. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलकाधिपः, अलकाधिपतिः, अलकेश्वरः, अलकान्तः, अलकाह्वयः, अलकनन्दा, अलकप्रभा, अलकप्रियः, अलकसंहतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकाधिपः|अलकाधिप
अलकः + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः, -ईश्वरः ‘lord of Alakā’, N. of Kubera; अत्यजीवदमरालकेश्वरौ R. 19. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकाधिपतिः|अलकाधिपति
अलकः + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः, -ईश्वरः ‘lord of Alakā’, N. of Kubera; अत्यजीवदमरालकेश्वरौ R. 19. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकेश्वरः|अलकेश्वर
अलकः + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः, -ईश्वरः ‘lord of Alakā’, N. of Kubera; अत्यजीवदमरालकेश्वरौ R. 19. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकान्तः|अलकान्त
अलकः + -अन्तः the end of a curl or ringlet; Śi. 4. 9; उद्गृहीतालकान्ताः<BR> प्रेक्षिष्यन्ते पथिकवनिताः Me. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकाह्वयः|अलकाह्वय
अलकः + -आह्वयः Bergera Koenigii^1 (Mar. कढीनिंब).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकनन्दा
अलकः + -नन्दा<BR>—1 N. of the Gaṅgā, or a river falling into it. ईक्षयालकनन्दाया<BR> विधूताशेषकल्मषः Bhāg. 11. 29. 42.<BR>—2 a girl from eight to ten years of age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकप्रभा
अलकः + -प्रभा N. of the capital of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकप्रियः|अलकप्रिय
अलकः + -प्रियः N. of a tree (पीतसाल; Mar. आसणा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकसंहतिः|अलकसंहति
अलकः + -संहतिः <i>f.</i> rows of curls; विलुलितालकसंहतिरामृशन्मृगदृशां<BR> श्रमवारि ललाटजम् Śi. 6. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलकम्
अलकम् <i>ind.</i> In vain, for nothing; Rv. 10. 71. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्तः|अलक्त
अलक्तः, -क्तकः<BR> [न रक्तोऽस्मात्, रस्य लत्वम्, स्वार्थे कन् Tv.] The<BR> red resin of certain trees, red lac or sap (formerly used by women to dye<BR> certain parts of their body, particularly the soles of the feet and lip)<BR> (Mar. अळिता); (दन्तवाससा) चिरोज्झितालक्तकपाटलेन Ku. 5. 34, 68, 7. 58;<BR> बिम्बाधरालक्तकः M. 3. 5; अलक्तकाङ्कां पदवीं ततान<BR> R. 7. 7; स्त्रियो हृतार्थाः पुरुषं निरर्थं निष्पीडितालक्तकवत्त्यजन्ति Mk. 4. 15.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलक्तरसः, अलक्तरागः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्तकः|अलक्तक
अलक्तः, -क्तकः<BR> [न रक्तोऽस्मात्, रस्य लत्वम्, स्वार्थे कन् Tv.] The<BR> red resin of certain trees, red lac or sap (formerly used by women to dye<BR> certain parts of their body, particularly the soles of the feet and lip)<BR> (Mar. अळिता); (दन्तवाससा) चिरोज्झितालक्तकपाटलेन Ku. 5. 34, 68, 7. 58;<BR> बिम्बाधरालक्तकः M. 3. 5; अलक्तकाङ्कां पदवीं ततान<BR> R. 7. 7; स्त्रियो हृतार्थाः पुरुषं निरर्थं निष्पीडितालक्तकवत्त्यजन्ति Mk. 4. 15.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलक्तरसः, अलक्तरागः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्तरसः|अलक्तरस
अलक्तः + -रसः red lac juice^1; अलक्तरसरक्ताभावलक्तरसवर्जितौ ।<BR> अद्यापि चरणौ तस्याः पद्मकोशसमप्रभौ Rām. 2. 60. 18.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्तरागः|अलक्तराग
अलक्तः + -रागः the red colour of <i>alakta</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्षण|अलक्षणं
अलक्षण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having no signs or marks.<BR>—2 Having no characteristic or distinguishing marks, undefined, undistinguished;<BR> आसीदिदं तमोभूतमप्रज्ञातमलक्षणम् Ms. 1. 5.<BR>—3 Having no good marks, inauspicious, unfortunate, ill-omened; क्लेशावहा<BR> भर्तुरलक्षणाहम् R. 14. 5.<BR>—4 Incomprehensible; सैषा विष्णोर्महामायाऽबाधयाऽलक्षणा यया Bhāg. 12. 6. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्षणम्
अलक्षण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 A bad or inauspicious sign; आचारो हन्त्यलक्षणम् Ms. 4. 156.<BR>—2 That which is no definition, a bad definition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्षित
अलक्षित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unseen, unperceived, unobserved; अलक्षितोपस्थित H. 1; अलक्षिताभ्युत्पतनो<BR> नृपेण R. 2. 27.<BR>—2 Uncharacterized; not marked.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलक्षितान्तक, अलक्षितोपस्थित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्षितान्तक
अलक्षित + -अन्तक <i>a.</i> suddenly dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्षितोपस्थित
अलक्षित + -उपस्थित <i>a.</i> one who has approached unobserved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्य
अलक्ष्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Invisible, unknown, unobserved.<BR>—2 Unmarked.<BR>—3 Having no particular marks.<BR>—4 Insignificant in appearance.<BR>—5 Having no pretence, free from fraud.<BR>—6 Not लक्ष्य or secondary (as meaning).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलक्ष्यगति, अलक्ष्यजन्मता, अलक्ष्यलिङ्ग, अलक्ष्यवाच्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्यगति
अलक्ष्य + -गति <i>a.</i> moving invisibly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्यजन्मता
अलक्ष्य + -जन्मता unknown birth, obscure origin; वपुर्विरूपाक्षमलक्ष्यजन्मता Ku. 5. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्यलिङ्ग|अलक्ष्यलिंग
अलक्ष्य + -लिङ्ग <i>a.</i> disguised, <i>incognito</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्यवाच्
अलक्ष्य + -वाच् <i>a.</i> addressing words to no visible object; नीलकण्ठ<BR> व्रजसीत्यलक्ष्यवाच् Ku. 5. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्मन्
अलक्ष्मन् <i>a.</i> With inauspicious signs; अपसव्यं ग्रहाश्चक्रुरलक्ष्माणं<BR> दिवाकरम् Mb. 6. 102. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलक्ष्मीः
अलक्ष्मीः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Evil fortune, bad luck, distress, poverty; कामान् दुग्धे विप्रकर्षत्यलक्ष्मीम् U. 5. 30.<BR>—2 The goddess of misfortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0232-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलगर्दः|अलगर्द|अलगर्द्द
अलगर्दः [Ety. ?] A water-serpent, the black variety of the Cobra<BR> de Capello (also written अलगर्थ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलगर्दा
अलगर्दः + .{@-र्दा@} A large poisonous leech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलग्न
अलग्न <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not joined or connected.<BR>—2 Not devoted to; हरेरङ्घ्रियुग्मे मनश्चेदलग्नम् Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलग्ल
अलग्ल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Speaking unconnectedly.<BR>—2 Stammering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलघु
अलघु (-घु, -घ्वी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Not light, heavy, big, weighty (as breasts, hips &c.); आयासादलघुतरस्तनैः<BR> Śi. 8. 1, 7. 5.<BR>—2 Not short, long (in prosody).<BR>—3 Serious, solemn.<BR>—4 Intense, violent, very great.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलघूपलः, अलघूष्मन्, अलघुप्रतिज्ञ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलघूपलः|अलघूपल
अलघु + -उपलः a rock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलघूष्मन्
अलघु + -ऊष्मन् <i>m.</i> intense heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलघुप्रतिज्ञ
अलघु + -प्रतिज्ञ <i>a.</i> solemnly pledged or promised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाघवम्
अलाघवम् Absence of meanness or niggardliness; R. 9. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्घनम्
अलङ्घनम् Not surmounting, not transgressing, not passing over or beyond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्घनीय|अलंघनीय
अलङ्घनीय <i>a.</i> Insurmountable, impassable, inaccessible, beyond<BR> the reach of; त्रिदशपरिपक्षस्यालङ्घनीये कृते स्वः V. 2 proof against<BR> injury; V. 4; Ki. 14. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्घनीयता|अलंघनीयता
अलङ्घनीयता<BR>—1 Impassableness, insurmountableness, inaccessibility; अलङ्घनीयताहेतुरुभयं<BR> तन्मनस्विनि Śi. 2. 48.<BR>—2 Inviolability; respectability.<BR>—3 Authoritative or absolute rule, superiority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्घ्य|अलंघ्य
अलङ्घ्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not to be transgressed, overcome &c.; या देवसेनेव परैरलङ्घ्या Śi. 3. 64.<BR>—2 Beyond the reach of, impossible to be done; किमिव ह्यस्ति दुरात्मनामलङ्घ्यम् Ki. 13. 7.<BR>—3 Difficult to secure or attain. unattainable; न हि जयिनां तपसामलङ्घ्यमस्ति<BR> Ki. 10. 6. 13; Śi. 8. 57; ˚ता state of being proof against an attack<BR> or injury; न जहाति महौजस्कं मानप्रांशुमलङ्घ्यता Ki. 11. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलजः|अलज
अलजः A kind of bird; Vāj. 24. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलजी
अलजी Inflammation of the eye; a sort of disease of the joints; Av. 9. 8. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलज्ज
अलज्ज <i>a.</i> Shameless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलज्जा
अलज्ज + .{@-ज्जा@}<BR>—1 Boldness.<BR>—2 Impudence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलञ्जरः|अलञ्जर|अलंजरः
अलञ्जरः, -ञ्जुरः<BR> [अलं सामर्थ्यं जृणाति, जॄ-अच्, पृषो˚ उत् Tv.] An earthen jar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलञ्जुरः|अलञ्जुर|अलंजुरः
अलञ्जरः, -ञ्जुरः<BR> [अलं सामर्थ्यं जृणाति, जॄ-अच्, पृषो˚ उत् Tv.] An earthen jar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलतिः|अलति
अलतिः [अल्-बा˚ अतिच्] Commencement of the notes of a song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलब्ध
अलब्ध <i>a.</i> Unobtained,<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलब्धाभीप्सित, अलब्धनाथ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलब्धाभीप्सित
अलब्ध + -अभीप्सित <i>a.</i> disappointed in oneʼs desired object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलब्धनाथ
अलब्ध + -नाथ <i>a.</i> friendless, without a patron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलभ्य
अलभ्य <i>a.</i> Unobtainable, unattainable; अलभ्यशोकाभिभवेयमाकृतिः Ku. 5. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्
अलम् [अल्-अच्]<BR>—1 The sting in the tail of a scorpion.<BR>—2 Yellow orpiment; cf. आल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्
अलम् <i>ind.</i> [अल्-बाहु˚ अम्]<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Enough, sufficient for, adequate to (with dative or inf.); तस्यालमेषा<BR> क्षुधितस्य तृप्त्यै R. 2. 39; Ku. 6. 82; अन्यथा प्रातराशाय कुर्याम<BR> त्वामलं वयम् Bk. 8. 98; Śi. 2. 40, 106, 110; K. 133; Bh. 3. 22; Ms. 11. 76;<BR> R. 2. 39, 9. 32, 15. 64; Me. 6, 90.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) A match for, equal to (with dat.); दैत्येभ्यो हरिरलम् Sk.;<BR> अलं मल्लो मल्लाय Mbh.<BR>—2 Able, competent (with inf.); अलं भोक्तुम् Sk.; वरेण शमितं<BR> लोकानलं दग्धुं हि तत्तपः Ku. 2. 56; V. 3. 10; with loc. also: त्रयाणामपि<BR> लोकानामलमस्मि निवारणे Rām.<BR>—3 Away with, enough of, no need of, no use of (having a prohibitive force),<BR> with instr. or gerund; अलमन्यथा गृहीत्वा M. 1. 20; अलमलं बहु<BR> विकत्थ्य M. 1; आलप्यालमिदं बभ्रोर्यत्स दारानपाहरत् Śi. 2. 40;<BR> अलं महीपाल तव श्रमेण R. 2. 34; Ku. 5. 82; अलमियद्भिः कुसुमैः<BR> Ś. 4 so many flowers will do; Śi. 10. 75; sometimes used, though less<BR> correctly, with the inf. in the same sense; अलमात्मानं खेदयितुम्<BR> Ve. 2. 3; अलं सुप्तजनं प्रबोधयितुम् Mk. 3.<BR>—4<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Completely, thoroughly; अर्हस्येनं शमयितुमलं वारिधारासहस्रैः<BR> Me. 55; त्वमपि विततयज्ञः स्वर्गिणः प्रीणयाऽलम् Ś. 7. 34; R. 10. 80;<BR> K. 169; Śi. 3. 58, 4. 39.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Greatly, excessively, to a high degree; तुदन्ति अलम् K. 2;<BR> यो गच्छत्यलं विद्विषतः प्रति Ak.; Mv. 6. 40; इत्यलमन्वशान् मुनिर्माम्<BR> Ki. 13. 13 again and again, pressingly.<BR>—5 In vain.<BR>—6 Surely, verily.<BR>—7 In the sense of अस्ति and भूषण also. अलं भूषणपर्याप्तिशक्तिवारणवाचके Nm.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलङ्कर्मीण, अलङ्कामता, अलङ्कुमारि, अलङ्कृ, अलङ्कार, अलङ्गामिन्, अलञ्जीविक, अलञ्जुष, अलन्तम, अलन्तराम्, अलन्धन, अलन्धूम, अलम्पशुः, अलम्पुरुषीण, अलम्बल, अलम्बुद्धिः, अलम्भूष्णु<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्कर्मीण|अलंकर्मीण|अलङ्कर्म्मीण|अलङ्कर्म्मीणः
अलम् + -कर्मीण <i>a.</i> [अलं समर्थः कर्मणि ख] competent to do<BR> any act; skilful, clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्कामता
अलम् + -कामता The state of complete satiation; समिद्ध-शरणाऽऽदीप्ता<BR> देहेऽलंकामतेश्वरा Bk. 10. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्कुमारि
अलम् + -कुमारि <i>a.</i> [अलं कुमार्यै] sufficient to support a maiden<BR> (धनम्); P. I. 2. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्कृ|अलंकृ
अलम् + -कृ, -कार &c. see separately below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्कार|अलंकार|अलंकारः|अलङ्कारः
अलम् + -कृ, -कार &c. see separately below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलङ्गामिन्|अलंगामिन्
अलम् + -गामिन् <i>a.</i> [अलं पर्याप्तं गच्छति, णिनि] going after,<BR> following in due or proper manner; अनुग्वलंगामी P. V. 2. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलञ्जीविक|अलंजीविक
अलम् + -जीविक <i>a.</i> [अलं जीविकायै चतु] sufficient for livelihood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलञ्जुष|अलंजुष
अलम् + -जुष <i>a.</i> [अलं जुष्यते कर्मणि बाहु˚ क] sufficient, adequate to eating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलन्तम|अलंतम
अलम् + -तम <i>a.</i> able, sufficient, having power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलन्तराम्|अलंतराम्
अलम् + -तराम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Exceedingly; मुहुर्गलद्भिस्तरलैरलंतरामरोदि Ku. 15. 28.<BR>—2 Very much better or easier; इष्टं कर्तुमलंतराम् Śi. 2. 106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलन्धन|अलंधन
अलम् + -धन <i>a.</i> [अलं प्रभूतं धनमस्त्यस्य अच्] possessing sufficient<BR> wealth, rich; निरादिष्टधनश्चेत्तु प्रतिभूः स्यादलंधनः Ms. 8. 162.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलन्धूमः|अलन्धूम|अलंधूम
अलम् + -धूमः^1 <i>m.</i>^2 [अलमत्यर्थो धूमः] thick smoke, volume of smoke.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्पशुः|अलम्पशु|अलंपशु
अलम् + -पशुः [अलं यज्ञे निरर्थः पशुः] a bad or useless animal<BR> (for sacrifice). ━(<i>a.</i>) able to keep cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्पुरुषीण|अलंपुरुषीण|अलम्पुरुषीणः
अलम् + -पुरुषीण <i>a.</i> [अलं समर्थं पुरुषाय; स्वार्थे ख]<BR>—1 fit for a man, becoming a man.<BR>—2 sufficient for a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्पुरुषीणः|अलम्पुरुषीण|अलंपुरुषीण
अलम् + -पुरुषीण + .({@-णः@}) a man who is chief of the opposite warriors in a battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्बल|अलंबल
अलम् + -बल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 strong enough, having sufficient power.<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्बुद्धिः|अलम्बुद्धि
अलम् + -बुद्धिः<BR>—1 sufficient sense.<BR>—2 false notion (मिथ्याबुद्धि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्भूष्णु|अलंभूष्णु
अलम् + -भूष्णु <i>a.</i> [अलं सामर्थ्ये भू-ग्स्नु] able, competent; विनाप्यस्मदलंभूष्णुरिज्यायै<BR> तपसः सुतः Śi. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकृ|अलङ्कृ
अलंकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To prepare, make ready [Ved.].<BR>—2 To ornament, decorate, grace; तत्र च शयनीयमलंचकार<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">Page0234-1</a>]<BR> K. 207; कतमो वंशोऽलंकृतः Ś. 1.<BR>—3 To prevent from, impede (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0233-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकरणम्
अलंकरणम्<BR>—1 Decoration, ornamenting; तस्मिन्हरिः स्पृहां चक्रे वक्षोऽलङ्करणे<BR> मणौ Bhāg. 8. 8. 5.<BR>—2 An ornament (lit. and fig.); सृजति तावदशेषगुणाकरं पुरुषरत्नमलंकरणं<BR> भुवः Bh. 2. 92.<BR>—3 Preparation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकरिष्णु|अलङ्करिष्णु|अलंकरिष्णुः|अलङ्करिष्णुः
अलंकरिष्णु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Fond of ornaments.<BR>—2 Decorating, skilled in decorating.<BR>—3 Ornamented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकरिष्णुः|अलङ्करिष्णु|अलंकरिष्णु|अलङ्करिष्णुः
अलंकरिष्णु + .{@-ष्णुः@} An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकर्तृ|अलङ्कर्तृ|अलङ्कर्त्तृ
अलंकर्तृ <i>a.</i> A decorator, skilled in decoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारः|अलङ्कार|अलंकार|अलङ्कारः
अलंकारः<BR>—1 Decoration, act of decorating or ornamenting.<BR>—2 An ornament (fig. also); अलंकारः स्वर्गस्य V. 1; अनुत्सेकः<BR> खलु विकमालंकारः <i>ibid.</i><BR>—3 A figure of speech of which there are three kinds:− शब्द˚, अर्थ˚,<BR> and शब्दार्थ˚; शब्दार्थयोरस्थिरा ये धर्माः शोभातिशायिनः । रसादीनुपकुर्वन्तोऽलंकारास्तेऽङ्गदादिवत् ॥<BR> S. D. 631; उपकुर्वन्ति तं सन्तं येऽङ्गद्वारेण जातु चित् । हारादिवदलंकारास्तेनुप्रासोपमादयः ॥<BR> K. P. 8. cf. also काव्यशोभाकरान् धर्मानलंकारान् प्रचक्षते । अलंकरिष्णवस्ते<BR> च शब्दमर्थमुभौ त्रिधा ॥.<BR>—4 The whole science of Rhetoric. अलंकारः शास्त्रभेदे मण्डने … । Nm.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलंकारचन्द्रिका, अलंकारमण्डपः, अलंकारशास्त्रम्, अलंकारसुवर्णम्, अलंकारसूरः, अलंकारहीन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारचन्द्रिका
अलंकारः + -चन्द्रिका a commentary on Kuvalayānanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारमण्डपः
अलंकारः + -मण्डपः The dressing room of idols.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारशास्त्रम्
अलंकारः + -शास्त्रम् the science and art of rhetoric, poetics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारसुवर्णम्
अलंकारः + -सुवर्णम् gold used for ornaments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारसूरः|अलङ्कारसूर
अलंकारः + -सूरः N. of a kind of meditation in Buddhism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारहीन|अलङ्कारहीन
अलंकारः + -हीन <i>a.</i> unadorned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकारकः|अलङ्कारक
अलंकारकः Ornament, decoration; एवं प्रयत्नं कुर्वीत …<BR> सर्वालंकारकेषु च Ms. 7. 220.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंकृतिः|अलङ्कृति|अलंकृति
अलंकृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Decoration.<BR>—2 An ornament; कर्णालंकृति Amaru. 13.<BR>—3 A rhetorical ornament, a figure of speech; तददौषौ शब्दार्थौ सगुणावनलंकृती<BR> पुनः क्वापि K. P. 1; यो विद्वान् मन्यते काव्यं शब्दार्थावनलंकृती ।<BR> असौ न मन्यते कस्मादनुष्णमनलं कृती ॥; Candr. 1; सालंकृतिः<BR> श्रवणकोमलवर्णराजिः Bv. 3. 6 (where अ˚ has senses 2 and 3.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलंक्रिया|अलङ्क्रिया
अलंक्रिया Adorning, ornamenting, decoration (fig. also); प्रशमस्तस्य<BR> भवत्यलंक्रिया Ki. 2. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलमकः|अलमक
अलमकः A frog (see अनिमकः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्पट|अलंपट|अलम्पटः
अलम्पट <i>a.</i> Not libidinous, chaste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्पटः|अलम्पट|अलंपट
अलम्पट + .{@-टः@} Womenʼs apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्बुषः|अलम्बुष|अलंबुष|अलंबुषः
अलम्बुषः<BR>—1 Vomiting.<BR>—2 The palm of the hand with the fingers extended.<BR>—3 Prahasta, the minister of Rāvaṇa.<BR>—4 A demon killed by Ghaṭotkaca.<BR>—5 A gourd (Mar. भोपळा); रिपुं निहत्याभिननन्द वै तदा ह्यलम्बुषं<BR> पक्वमलम्बुषं यथा Mb. 7. 109. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्बुषा
अलम्बुषः + .{@-षा@}<BR>—1 N. of a nymph or of a class of nymphs.<BR>—2 A kind of plant (लज्जालु; Mar. लाजाळू).<BR>—3 A barrier, a line of water drawn to prevent entrance (अन्याप्रवेशार्थं<BR> दत्ता जलरेखा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलम्बुसा
अलम्बुसा N. of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलय|अलयः
अलय <i>a.</i> [नास्ति लयः अवस्थानं यस्य]<BR>—1 Houseless, vagrant, moving about; Śi. 4. 57.<BR>—2 Without destruction<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">Page0234-2</a>]<BR> or loss, imperishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलयः|अलय
अलय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 Non-destruction, permanence.<BR>—2 Birth, production.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलर्कः|अलर्क
अलर्कः<BR>—1 A mad dog or one rendered furious.<BR>—2 A fabulous animal like a hog with eight legs. अष्टपादं तीक्ष्णदंष्ट्रं<BR> सूचीभिरिव संवृतम् । रोमभिः सन्निरुद्धाङ्गमलर्कं नाम नामतः Mb. 12. 3. 13.<BR>—3 A kind of worm.<BR>—4 N. of a plant (श्वेतार्क; Mar. पांढरी रुई).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलपस्
अलपस् <i>n.</i> Merit. (अरपस् ?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलले
अलले <i>ind.</i> A word of no import, occurring in the dialect of the<BR> Piśācas (mostly used in dramas).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलवण
अलवण <i>a.</i> Saltless, not salty; (P. V. 1. 121.). संस्कृतासंस्कृताः<BR> पक्वा लवणालवणास्तथा । प्रजायन्ते यथा भावास्तथा चित्तं निरुध्यते ॥<BR> Mb. 13. 114. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलवालम्
अलवालम् A basin for water at the root of a tree; see आलवाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलस्
अलस् <i>a.</i> Not shining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलस|अलसः
अलस <i>a.</i> [न लसति व्याप्रियते, लस्-अच्]<BR>—1 Inactive, without energy, lazy, idle, indolent. शठो नैष्कृतिकोऽलसः Bg. 18. 28.<BR>—2 Tired, fatigued, languid; मार्गश्रमादलसशरीरे दारिके M. 5;<BR> Amaru. 4, 88; खेदालसेव K. 143, 197, 211, 62, 98; Śi. 8. 7; V. 3. 2;<BR> Dk. 20; Śi. 13. 48, 9. 39; U. 1. 24; Ki. 10. 60; V. 5; गमनमलसम् Māl. 1. 17.<BR>—3 Soft, gentle.<BR>—4 Slow, dull (as in gait or motion); श्रोणीभारादलसगमना Me. 84;<BR> तस्याः परिस्फुरितगर्भभरालसायाः U. 3. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसः|अलस
अलस + .{@-सः@}<BR>—1 A sore or ulcer between the toes. (Mar. चिखली).<BR>—2 A kind of tree.<BR>—3 N. of a sage.<BR>—4 N. of a small poisonous animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसा
अलस + .{@-सा@} N. of a plant (हंसपदा).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलसेक्षणा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसेक्षणा
अलस + -ईक्षणा a woman with languishing looks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसक|अलसकः
अलसक <i>a.</i> Indolent, idle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसकः|अलसक
अलसक + .{@-कः@} Flatulence, intumescence of the abdomen, with constipation<BR> and wind; प्रयाति नोर्ध्वं नाधस्तादाहारो न च पच्यते । आमाशयोऽलसीभूतस्तेन<BR> सोऽलसकः स्मृतः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलस्य
अलस्य <i>a.</i> Idle, lazy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसिका
अलसिका Feeling of exhaustion due to Cholera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलसेलुका
अलसेलुका N. of a plant (Mar. तांबडी लाजाळू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाञ्छन
अलाञ्छन <i>a.</i> Spotless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाण्डुः|अलाण्डु|अलांडुः
अलाण्डुः N. of a small noxious insect or other animal; Av. 2. 31. 2, 3.<BR> (v. l. अल्गण्डु) Satawalekar ed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलातः|अलात|अलातं
अलातः, -तम्<BR> [ला-क्त, न˚ त˚] A firebrand, half-burnt wood; निवार्णालातलाघवम्<BR> Ku. 2. 23 coal; ˚सदृशेक्षणा Rām.; ˚चक्रप्रतिमम् V. 5. 2.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलातशान्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलातम्
अलातः, -तम्<BR> [ला-क्त, न˚ त˚] A firebrand, half-burnt wood; निवार्णालातलाघवम्<BR> Ku. 2. 23 coal; ˚सदृशेक्षणा Rām.; ˚चक्रप्रतिमम् V. 5. 2.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलातशान्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलातशान्तिः|अलातशान्ति
अलातः + -शान्तिः <i>f.</i> N. of the fourth chapter of Gauḍapādaʼs Commentary<BR> on the Māṇḍūkyopaniṣad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलातृण|अलातृणः
अलातृण <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Disposed to afflict or injure very much.<BR>—2 Not granting anything; miserly; अलातृणासो विदथेषु सुष्टुताः Rv. 1. 166. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलातृणः|अलातृण
अलातृण + .{@-णः@} A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0234-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाबुः|अलाबु
अलाबुः, -बूः <i>f.</i><BR> [न-लम्बते; न-लम्ब्-उ-णित् नलोपश्च वृद्धिः Tv.]<BR> The bottle-gourd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाबूः
अलाबुः, -बूः <i>f.</i><BR> [न-लम्बते; न-लम्ब्-उ-णित् नलोपश्च वृद्धिः Tv.]<BR> The bottle-gourd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाबु|अलाबुः
अलाबुः, -बूः + .{@-बु@} (<i>n.</i>)<BR>—1 A vessel made of gourd.<BR>—2 A fruit of the gourd which is very light and floats in water; किं<BR> हि नामैतत् अम्बुनि मज्जन्त्यलाबूनि ग्रावाणः प्लवन्त इति Mv. 1; Ms. 6. 54.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलाबुकटम्, अलाबुपात्रम्, अलाबुवीणा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाबुकटम्
अलाबुः + -कटम् the dust or down (रजः) of the bottle-gourd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाबुपात्रम्
अलाबुः + -पात्रम् a jar made of the bottle-gourd; Av. 8. 10. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाबुवीणा
अलाबुः + -वीणा A lute of the shape of a gourd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाबुमय
अलाबुमय <i>a.</i> Made of a bottle-gourd^1; यतिपात्राणि मृद्वेणुदार्वलाबुमयानि च Y. 3. 60.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाभ|अलाभः
अलाभ <i>a.</i> [न˚ ब˚] Without gain or profit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाभः|अलाभ
अलाभ + .{@-भः@}<BR>—1 Non-acquirement; मुञ्जालाभे तु कर्तव्याः कुशाश्मन्तकबल्वजैः Ms. 2. 43, 2. 184, 6. 57;<BR>—2 Loss; Ms. 9. 331, 11. 80; सुखदुःखे समे कृत्वा लाभालाभौ जयाजयौ Bg. 2. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलाय्य
अलाय्य Ved.<BR>—1 Going forward (to meet).<BR>—2 An assailing enemy, an assailant.<BR>—3 Epithet of Indra; अलाय्यस्य परशुर्ननाश Rv. 9. 67. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलारम्
अलारम् A door.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलासः|अलास
अलासः Inflammation and abscess at the root of the tongue. Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलास्य
अलास्य <i>a.</i> Devoid of dancing, idle, unengaged; मृदङ्गशब्दापगमादलास्याः R. 16. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिः|अलि
अलिः [अल्-इन् Uṇ. 4. 138]<BR>—1 A black bee.<BR>—2 A scorpion.<BR>—3 A crow.<BR>—4 The (Indian) cuckoo.<BR>—5 The sign of the zodiac called वृश्चिक.<BR>—6 Spirituous liquor. cf. … अलिः पङ्क्तौ च वृश्चिके । भृङ्गे वयस्यां<BR> भूमौ स्यात् … । Nm.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलिकुलम्, अलिजिह्वा, अलिजिह्विका, अलिदूर्वा, अलिपत्रिका, अलिपर्णी, अलिप्रिय, अलिमाला, अलिमोदा, अलिविरावः, अलिविरुतम्, अलिवल्लभः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिकुलम्
अलिः + -कुलम् a flight or number of bees; ˚सङ्कुल full of a swarm<BR> of bees; अलिकुलसङ्कुलकुसुमनिराकुलनवदलमालतमाले Gīt. 1;<BR> ˚सङ्कुलः the <i>kubja</i> plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिजिह्वा
अलिः + -जिह्वा, -जिह्विका [अलिरिव क्षुद्रा जिह्वा] the uvula, soft palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिजिह्विका
अलिः + -जिह्वा, -जिह्विका [अलिरिव क्षुद्रा जिह्वा] the uvula, soft palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

