अलिः + -दूर्वा N. of a plant (मालादूर्वा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

