अलिः + -पत्रिका, -पर्णी N. of a tree (वृश्चिकपत्राख्यवृक्षः; Mar.<BR> खाजकुयली).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिपर्णी
अलिः + -पत्रिका, -पर्णी N. of a tree (वृश्चिकपत्राख्यवृक्षः; Mar.<BR> खाजकुयली).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिप्रिय|अलिप्रियं|अलिप्रियः
अलिः + -प्रिय <i>a.</i> pleasing to the bees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिप्रियः|अलिप्रिय|अलिप्रियं
अलिः + -प्रिय + .({@-यः@}) the red lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिप्रिया
अलिः + -प्रिय + .({@-या@}) the trumpet flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिमाला
अलिः + -माला a flight of bees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिमोदा
अलिः + -मोदा N. of a plant (गणिकारी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिविरावः|अलिविराव
अलिः + -विरावः, -विरुतम् song or hum of a bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिविरुतम्
अलिः + -विरावः, -विरुतम् song or hum of a bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिवल्लभः|अलिवल्लभ
अलिः + -वल्लभः = ˚प्रिय q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिन्
अलिन् <i>m.</i> [अल्-इनि]<BR>—1 A scorpion.<BR>—2 A bee; मलिनिमाऽलिनि माधवयोषिताम् Śi. 6. 4. अभिषिषेच मरन्दरसामृतैर्नवलता<BR> बलतापनरत्नभम् (अलिनम्) Rām. Ch. 4. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिनी
अलिन् + .{@-नी@} —1 A swarm of bees; अरमतालिनी शिलीन्ध्रे Śi. 6. 72; अलिनीजिष्णुः<BR> कवानां चयः Bh. 1. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिंशः|अलिंश
अलिंशः Ved. A kind of demon; मा गृधदलिंश Av. 8. 6. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिकम्
अलिकम् [अल्यते भूष्यते अल्-कर्मणि इकन्] The forehead; (ललाटमलिकं<BR> गोधिः AR.) किमत्र जातं तव चुम्बितेऽलिके कपोलयोर्वा कलवाणि भण्यताम् ।<BR> U. 2. 33. अलिकेन च हेमकान्तिना Bv. 2. 171; Vb. 3. 6.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलिकलेखा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिकलेखा
अलिकम् + -लेखा An impression or mark upon the forehead; K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिक्लवः|अलिक्लव
अलिक्लवः A kind of carrion bird; मा शरीराणि कर्तमलिक्लवेभ्यो Av. 11. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिगर्दः|अलिगर्द
अलिगर्दः A kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिङ्ग|अलिंग|अलिङ्गः
अलिङ्ग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having no characteristic marks, having no marks; said of the Supreme<BR> Being; एतावदुक्त्वोपरराम तन्महद्भूतं नभोलिङ्गमलिङ्गमीश्वरम्<BR> Bhāg. 1. 6. 26. अव्यक्तात्तु परः पुरुषो व्यापकोऽलिङ्ग एव च Kaṭh. 6. 8.<BR>—2 Having bad marks.<BR>—3 (In gram.) Having no gender;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिङ्गः|अलिङ्ग|अलिंग
अलिङ्ग + .{@-ङ्गः@} An epithet of the Supreme Being; अलिङ्गात्प्रकृतिर्लिङ्गैरुपालभ्यति<BR> सात्मजैः Mb. 12. 305. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिङ्गम्
अलिङ्ग + .{@-ङ्गम्@} Absence of marks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिङ्गिन्|अलिंगिन्
अलिङ्गिन् <i>m.</i> An impostor, a pretended ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिञ्जरः|अलिञ्जर|अलिंजर|अलिंजरः
अलिञ्जरः A water-jar; see अलञ्जर Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिन|अलिनः
अलिन <i>a.</i> [अल्-बाहु˚ इनन्] Greatly advanced in penance (तपोभिरतिवृद्ध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिनः|अलिन
अलिन + .{@-नः@} N. of a tribe; Rv. 7. 18. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिन्दः|अलिन्द|अलिंदः
अलिन्दः, -अलिन्दकः<BR> [अल्यते भूष्यते, अल्-कर्मणि-किंदच्]<BR>—1 A terrace before a house-door; मुखालिन्दतोरणम् M. 5; Dk. 74.<BR>—2 A place (like a square) at the door.<BR>—3 (pl.) N. of a country or its inhabitants; or its ruler also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिन्दकः|अलिन्दक
अलिन्दः, -अलिन्दकः<BR> [अल्यते भूष्यते, अल्-कर्मणि-किंदच्]<BR>—1 A terrace before a house-door; मुखालिन्दतोरणम् M. 5; Dk. 74.<BR>—2 A place (like a square) at the door.<BR>—3 (pl.) N. of a country or its inhabitants; or its ruler also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिपकः|अलिपक
अलिपकः<BR>—1 A cuckoo.<BR>—2 A bee.<BR>—3 A dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिप्सा
अलिप्सा Freedom from desire or cupidity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिमकः|अलिमक
अलिमकः = अनिमक q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिम्पक|अलिंपक
अलिम्पक, -बक<BR> see अनिमक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलिम्बक|अलिंबक|अलिम्बकः
अलिम्पक, -बक<BR> see अनिमक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीक|अलीकं
अलीक <i>a.</i> [अल्-बीकन् Uṇ. 4. 25 निपातः]<BR>—1 Unpleasing, disagreeable; आ मे शृणुतासिता अलीकाः Av. 5. 13. 5.<BR>—2 Untrue, false, pretended; ˚मुग्धः K. 84; अलीककोपकान्तेन K. 147;<BR> ˚वचन Amaru. 27, 37, 48. —3 Little, not much, few.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीकम्
अलीक + .{@-कम्@} The forehead; दिशामलीकालकभङ्गतां गतः K. 4.<BR>—2 Anything displeasing; यद्यथा स महाराजो नालीकमधिगच्छति Rām. 2. 52. 26.<BR> falsehood, untruth. गुरोश्चालीकनिर्बन्धः समानि ब्रह्महत्यया<BR> Ms. 11. 55. सज्जनस्य हृदयं नवनीतं यद् वदन्ति कवयस्तदलीकम् ।<BR> अन्यदेहविलसत्परितापात् सज्जनो द्रवति नो नवनीतम् ॥ Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 Heaven.<BR>—4 Sorrow; अलीकं मानसं त्वेकं हृदयं मम Rām. 2. 19. 6. अलीकं<BR> त्वप्रिये स्वर्गे सङ्घेऽनृतललाटयोः<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलीकमत्स्य, अलीकसुप्त, अलीकसुप्तक<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीकमत्स्य|अलीकमत्स्यः
अलीक + -मत्स्य a kind of dish resembling the taste of fish (‘mock-fish’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीकसुप्त
अलीक + -सुप्त, -सुप्तक <i>a.</i> pretended sleep; Ks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीकसुप्तक
अलीक + -सुप्त, -सुप्तक <i>a.</i> pretended sleep; Ks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीकायते
अलीकायते Den. Ā. to be deceived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीकिन्
अलीकिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Disagreeable, unpleasant.<BR>—2 False, deceiving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीक्य
अलीक्य <i>a.</i> False.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलीगर्दः|अलीगर्द
अलीगर्दः A snake; see अलिगर्द.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलुः|अलु
अलुः [अल्-उन्] A small water pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलुक्
अलुक् [नास्ति विभक्तेः लुक् लोपो यत्र] A compound in which the<BR> case terminations are not dropped but retained; <i>e. g.</i> सरसिजम् आत्मनेपदम्<BR> जनुषान्धः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलुप्त
अलुप्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not cut off, undiminished.<BR>—2 Not destroyed, preserved; भवेदलुप्तश्च मुनेः क्रियार्थः R. 2. 25.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलुप्तमहिमन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलुप्तमहिमन्
अलुप्त + -महिमन् <i>a.</i> Of undimished glory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0235-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलुब्ध|अलुब्धः
अलुब्ध <i>a.</i> Moderate, content, not covetous; ˚त्वं contentment;<BR> non-covetousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलूक्ष
अलूक्ष <i>a.</i> Soft (Ved. for अरूक्ष). अलूक्षा धर्मकामाः स्युः<BR> T. Up. 1. 11. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अले
अले, अलेले <i>ind.</i> Unmeaning words in the dialect of the<BR> Piśācas chiefly introduced in plays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलेले
अले, अलेले <i>ind.</i> Unmeaning words in the dialect of the<BR> Piśācas chiefly introduced in plays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलेपक|अलेपकः
अलेपक <i>a.</i> Stainless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलेपकः|अलेपक
अलेपक + .{@-कः@} An epithet of the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलेश
अलेश <i>a.</i> Not little, much, large.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलेशम्
अलेश + .{@-शम्@} <i>ind.</i> Not at all.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलेशैज
अलेशैज <i>a.</i> Firm, steady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोक|अलोकः
अलोक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not having space (Ved.).<BR>—2 That which cannot be seen, as in लोकालोक इवाचलः R. 1. 68 (न<BR> लोक्यत इत्यलोकः Malli.); see लोकालोक also.<BR>—3 Having no people.<BR>—4 One who does not go to any other world after death (not having performed<BR> meritorious deeds).<BR>—5 Beyond space (लोकातीत परब्रह्म); पश्यतां सर्वलोकानामलोकं<BR> समपद्यत Bhāg. 6. 12. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोकः|अलोक
अलोक + .{@-कः, -कम्@}<BR>—1 Not the world.<BR>—2 End of, destruction of the world; absence of people; रक्ष सर्वानिमाँल्लोकान्<BR> नालोकं कर्तुमर्हसि Rām.<BR>—3 The immaterial or spiritual world.<BR>—4 The nether world (पाताल).<BR>—5 A <i>Ṛtvij</i> or any such priest.<BR>—6 One who is not a seer or observer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोकम्
अलोक + .{@-कः, -कम्@}<BR>—1 Not the world.<BR>—2 End of, destruction of the world; absence of people; रक्ष सर्वानिमाँल्लोकान्<BR> नालोकं कर्तुमर्हसि Rām.<BR>—3 The immaterial or spiritual world.<BR>—4 The nether world (पाताल).<BR>—5 A <i>Ṛtvij</i> or any such priest.<BR>—6 One who is not a seer or observer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोका
अलोक + .{@-का@} A kind of bird.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलोकव्रतम्, अलोकसामान्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोकव्रतम्
अलोक + -व्रतम् Religious practice like ब्रह्मचर्य; चरन्त्यलोकव्रतमव्रणं<BR> वने Bhāg. 8. 3. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोकसामान्य
अलोक + -सामान्य <i>a.</i> extraordinary, uncommon; ˚गुणस्तनूजः Māl. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोकनम्
अलोकनम् Invisibility, disappearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोकनीय
अलोकनीय <i>a.</i> Invisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोकित
अलोकित <i>a.</i> Unseen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोक्य
अलोक्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not securing the other world or heaven; unusual, unallowed; न हैवालोक्यताया<BR> आशास्ति Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 28; यथास्योद्विजते वाचा नालोक्यां तामुदीरयेत् Ms. 2. 161.<BR>—2 Of dark nature; राजधर्मास्तथाऽलोक्यां निक्षिपन्त्यशुभां गतिम् Ms. 12. 65. 7.<BR> ˚ता unfitness for heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोपाङ्ग|अलोपांग
अलोपाङ्ग <i>a.</i> Not defective in a single limb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोभः|अलोभ
अलोभः<BR>—1 Freedom from covetousness, moderation.<BR>—2 Non-confusion; right process.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोभिन्
अलोभिन् <i>a.</i> Not wanting or desiring anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोमक
अलोमक, -अलोमिक <i>a.</i><BR> Hairless; नालोमिकाम् (उद्वहेत्) Ms. 3. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोमिक
अलोमक, -अलोमिक <i>a.</i><BR> Hairless; नालोमिकाम् (उद्वहेत्) Ms. 3. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोल
अलोल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tranquil, unagitated.<BR>—2 Firm, steady.<BR>—3 Not fickle.<BR>—4 Not thirsty, free from desire.<BR>—5 N. of a metre of 14 syllables.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोलु
अलोलु <i>a.</i> Indifferent to sensual objects; ˚त्वम् indifference<BR> to sensual objects; दया भूतेष्वलोलुप्त्वम् Bg. 16. 2. (v. l. अलोलत्वम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोलुप
अलोलुप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Free from desire; भ्रष्टा संवर्तको वह्निः सर्वस्यादिरलोलुपः Mb. 3. 3. 23.<BR>—2 Not greedy or covetous, apathetic, indifferent to sensual objects.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोहित|अलोहितं
अलोहित <i>a.</i> Bloodless, not red; अलोहितमस्नेहम् Bṛ. Up. 3. 8. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलोहितम्
अलोहित + .{@-तम्@} Nymphaea Rubra, a red lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलौकिक|अलौकिकः
अलौकिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Not current in the world, not relating to this world, uncommon, supernatural.<BR>—2 Unusual, rare.<BR>—3 Not current in the usual language, peculiar to the sacred writings,<BR> not used in classics, Vedic; अधिहरि हरि ङि इत्यलौकिकम्.<BR>—4 Theoretical; ˚त्वम् rare occurrence of a word; अलौकिकत्वादमरः<BR> स्वकोषे न यानि नामानि समुल्लिलेख । विलोक्य तैरप्यधुना प्रचारमयं<BR> प्रयत्नः पुरुषोत्तमस्य Trik. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अलौकिकसंनिकर्षः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अलौकिकसंनिकर्षः|अलौकिकसन्निकर्ष
अलौकिक + -संनिकर्षः proximity not common to the world (of three kinds).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्कः|अल्क
अल्कः<BR>—1 A tree.<BR>—2 A member of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्प|अल्पं|अल्पः
अल्प <i>a.</i> [अल्-प]<BR>—1 Trifling, unimportant, insignificant (opp. महत् or गुरु);<BR> अल्पविद्यः Ms. 11. 36.<BR>—2 Small, little, minute, scanty (opp. बहु); अल्पस्य हेतोर्बहु<BR> हातुमिच्छन् R. 2. 47, 1. 2; अल्पकुचान्तरा V. 4. 49.<BR>—3 Mortal, of short existence; अथ यदल्पं तन्मर्त्यम् Ch. Up.<BR>—4 Young.<BR>—5 Seldom, rare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पः|अल्प|अल्पं
अल्प + .{@-ल्पः@} A class of buildings; Kāmikāgama 45. 53-54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पम्
अल्प + .{@-ल्पम्@} Very little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पम्
अल्प + .{@-ल्पम्, -ल्पेन, -ल्पात्@} <i>adv.</i><BR>—1 A little.<BR>—2 For a slight reason; प्रीतिरल्पेन भिद्यते Rām. 4. 32. 7.<BR>—3 Easily, without much trouble or difficulty.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अल्पाच्तर, अल्पाल्प, अल्पासु, अल्पाकाङ्क्षिन्, अल्पायुस्, अल्पारम्भः, अल्पाहार, अल्पाहारिन्, अल्पेच्छु, अल्पेतर, अल्पेशाख्य, अल्पोन, अल्पोपायः, अल्पकार्यम्, अल्पकेशी, अल्पक्रीत, अल्पगोधूमः, अल्पगन्ध, अल्पचेष्टित, अल्पच्छद, अल्पच्छाद, अल्पज्ञ, अल्पतनु, अल्पदक्षिण, अल्पदृष्टि, अल्पधन, अल्पधी, अल्पनासिकः, अल्पपत्रः, अल्पपद्मम्, अल्पपशु, अल्पपुण्य, अल्पपुष्पिका, अल्पप्रजस्, अल्पप्रभाव, अल्पप्रमाण, अल्पप्रमाणक, अल्पप्रयोग, अल्पप्राण, अल्पासु, अल्पबल, अल्पबाध, अल्पबुद्धि, अल्पमति, अल्पभाग्य, अल्पभाषिन्, अल्पमध्यम, अल्पमात्रम्, अल्पमारिषः, अल्पमूर्ति, अल्पमूल्य, अल्पमेधस्, अल्पवयस्, अल्पवर्तिका, अल्पवादिन्, अल्पविद्य, अल्पविषय, अल्पशक्ति, अल्पशमी, अल्पसत्त्व, अल्पसरस्, अल्पसार<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

