अल्पाच्तर
अल्प + -अच्तर (comparative) A word consisting of a smaller number of<BR> syllables (than another) अल्पाच्तरम् P. II. 2. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पाल्प
अल्प + -अल्प <i>a.</i> very little or minute, little by little; तथाल्पाल्पो<BR> ग्रहीतव्यो राष्ट्रादाज्ञाऽऽब्दिकः करः Ms. 7. 129; ˚भासम् Me. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पासु
अल्प + -असु = ˚प्राण q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पाकाङ्क्षिन्|अल्पाकांक्षिन्
अल्प + -आकाङ्क्षिन् <i>a.</i> desiring little, contented or satisfied with little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पायुस्
अल्प + -आयुस् <i>a.</i> shortlived; Ms. 4. 157.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पायुः
अल्प + -आयुस् + .({@-युः@}) <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a young one, cub.<BR>—2 a goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पारम्भः|अल्पारम्भ
अल्प + -आरम्भः a small or gradual beginning; अल्पारम्भः क्षेमकरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पाहार|अल्पाहारः
अल्प + -आहार, -आहारिन् <i>a.</i> eating little, moderate in diet, abstemious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पाहारः|अल्पाहार
अल्प + -आहार, -आहारिन् + .({@-रः@}) taking little food, moderation, abstinence in food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पाहारिन्
अल्प + -आहार, -आहारिन् <i>a.</i> eating little, moderate in diet, abstemious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पेच्छु
अल्प + -इच्छु <i>a.</i> moderate in wishes, seeking little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पेतर
अल्प + -इतर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 other than small, large.<BR>—2 other than few, many; as ˚राः कल्पनाः many or various ideas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पेशाख्य
अल्प + -ईशाख्य <i>a.</i> Named after an insignificant chief or master, of low origin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पोन
अल्प + -ऊन <i>a.</i> slightly defective, not quite complete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पोपायः|अल्पोपाय
अल्प + -उपायः small means.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पकार्यम्
अल्प + -कार्यम् a small matter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पकेशी
अल्प + -केशी<BR>—1 N. of a plant (भूतकेशी; Mar. जटामांसी, निर्गुडी).<BR>—2 the root of a sweet flag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पक्रीत
अल्प + -क्रीत <i>a.</i> bought for a small sum, cheap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पगोधूमः
अल्प + -गोधूमः A kind of wheat (Mar. जोडगहू or खपल्या गहू)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पगन्ध|अल्पगन्धं
अल्प + -गन्ध <i>a.</i> having little scent or odour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पगन्धम्
अल्प + -गन्ध + .({@-न्धम्@}) a red lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पचेष्टित
अल्प + -चेष्टित <i>a.</i> inert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पच्छद
अल्प + -च्छद, -च्छाद <i>a.</i> scantily clad; दूरादेव महाजनस्य विहरत्यल्पच्छदो<BR> लज्जया Mk. 1. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पच्छाद
अल्प + -च्छद, -च्छाद <i>a.</i> scantily clad; दूरादेव महाजनस्य विहरत्यल्पच्छदो<BR> लज्जया Mk. 1. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पज्ञ
अल्प + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> knowing little, shallow, superficial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पतनु|अल्पतनुः
अल्प + -तनु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of short stature, dwarfish, short.<BR>—2 weak, thin.<BR>—3 having small bones.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पतनुः|अल्पतनु
अल्प + -तनु + .({@-नुः@}) a kind of tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पदक्षिण
अल्प + -दक्षिण <i>a.</i> defective in presents (as a ceremony), not liberal<BR> in sacrificial gifts; न त्वल्पदक्षिणैर्यज्ञैर्यजेतेह कथंचन;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">Page0237-1</a>]<BR> हन्त्यल्पदक्षिणो यज्ञः Ms. 11. 39. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0236-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पदृष्टि
अल्प + -दृष्टि <i>a.</i> narrow-minded, short-sighted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पधन
अल्प + -धन <i>a.</i> of little wealth, not affluent or rich, poor; Ms. 3. 66;<BR> नाल्पधनो यजेत् 11. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पधी
अल्प + -धी <i>n.</i> weak-minded, having little, sense, foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पनासिकः
अल्प + -नासिकः A small vestibule; Māna. 34. 106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पपत्रः|अल्पपत्र
अल्प + -पत्रः<BR>—1 N. of a plant (a species of the Tulsi).<BR>—2 a tree having a few leaves. (Mar. शोपा, मुसळी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पपद्मम्
अल्प + -पद्मम् a red lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पपशु
अल्प + -पशु <i>a.</i> Ved. having a small number of cattle. अनपत्यमल्पपशुं<BR> वशा कृणोति पुरुषम् Av. 12. 4. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पपुण्य
अल्प + -पुण्य <i>a.</i> Whose religious merit is small; Rām.; Mbh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पपुष्पिका
अल्प + -पुष्पिका N. of a flower-plant (Mar. पिवळी कण्हेर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पप्रजस्
अल्प + -प्रजस् <i>a.</i> having few descendants or subjects. नित्यमसिच्<BR> प्रजामेधयोः P. V. 4. 122.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पप्रभाव
अल्प + -प्रभाव <i>a.</i> of small weight or consequence, insignificant,<BR> unimportant; ˚त्वम् insignificance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

