अल्प + -प्रमाण, -प्रमाणक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of little weight or measure.<BR>—2 of little authority, resting on little evidence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पप्रमाणक|अल्पप्रमाणकः
