अल्प + -प्रमाण, -प्रमाणक + .({@-णः, -णकः@}) common cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पप्रमाणकः|अल्पप्रमाणक
अल्प + -प्रमाण, -प्रमाणक + .({@-णः, -णकः@}) common cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पप्रयोग
अल्प + -प्रयोग <i>a.</i> of rare application or use, rarely used.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पप्राण|अल्पप्राणः
अल्प + -प्राण, -असु <i>a.</i> having little power or strength, having short<BR> breath, asthmatic; ˚णश्च क्रियासु भवति Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पप्राणः|अल्पप्राण
अल्प + -प्राण, -असु + .({@-णः@})<BR>—1 slight breathing or weak aspiration.<BR>—2 (in gram.) a name given to the unaspirated letters of the alphabet<BR> (in pronouncing which little effort is required); अयुग्मा वर्गयमगा<BR> यणश्चाल्पासवः स्मृताः Sk. <i>i. e.</i> the vowels, semivowels, nasals and<BR> the letters क् च् ट् त् प् ग् ज् ड् द् ब्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पासु
अल्प + -प्राण, -असु <i>a.</i> having little power or strength, having short<BR> breath, asthmatic; ˚णश्च क्रियासु भवति Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पबल
अल्प + -बल <i>a.</i> weak, feeble, having little strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पबाध
अल्प + -बाध <i>a.</i> causing little annoyance or inconvenience, not very<BR> harmful; न निषेध्योऽल्पबाधस्तु Y. 2. 156.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

