अल्प + -बुद्धि, -मति <i>a.</i> weak-minded, unwise, silly, ignorant; Ms. 12. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पमति
