अल्पमध्यम
अल्प + -मध्यम <i>a.</i> slender-waisted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अल्पमात्रम्
अल्प + -मात्रम्<BR>—1 a little, a little merely. —2 a short time, a few moments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

