अल्प + -मूल्य <i>a.</i> of small value, cheap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

