अवखादः [अवज्ञातः निन्दितः खादः खाद्यम्] Bad or contemptible<BR> meal; an unworthy oblation. <i>a.</i> Devouring, destroying; नात्रावखादो<BR> अस्ति वः Rv. 1. 41. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0240-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवगण्
अवगण् €10 P. To disregard, not to heed, disrespect, despise, slight;<BR> पर्वतीय इति मावजीगणः Ki. 13. 67; अवगणितखलीनाकर्षणः Pt. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0240-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवगणनम्
अवगणनम्<BR>—1 Disobedience, disrespect, contempt, disregard.<BR>—2 Censure, blame.<BR>—3 Insult, mortification.<BR>—4 Defeat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0240-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अवगण
अवगण <i>a.</i> Separated from oneʼs companions, isolated, solitary, alone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0240-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

