अवनिष्ठीव्
अवनिष्ठीव् To spit upon; अवनिष्ठीवतो दर्पाद् द्वावोष्ठौ छेदयेन्नृपः Ms. 8. 282.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0249-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

