अवनी
अवनी €1 P.<BR>—1 To lead or bring down, to push into; अश्वानपोऽवनीयमानान् Kāty.<BR>—2 To cause to descend or flow.<BR>—3 To lead away.<BR>—4 To pour down or over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0249-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

