अवि + -गन्धा, -गन्धिका N. of a plant (= अजगन्धा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0264-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविदुग्धम्
अवि + -दुग्धम्, -दूसम्, -मरीसम्, -सोढम् the milk of an ewe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0264-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविदूसम्
अवि + -दुग्धम्, -दूसम्, -मरीसम्, -सोढम् the milk of an ewe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0264-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविमरीसम्
अवि + -दुग्धम्, -दूसम्, -मरीसम्, -सोढम् the milk of an ewe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0264-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविसोढम्
अवि + -दुग्धम्, -दूसम्, -मरीसम्, -सोढम् the milk of an ewe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0264-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविपटः|अविपट
अवि + -पटः sheepʼs skin, a woollen cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0264-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविपालः|अविपाल
अवि + -पालः [अवीन् पालयति उप˚ स˚] a shepherd; Vāj. 30. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0264-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविप्रियः|अविप्रिय
