अविप्रिया
अवि + -प्रियः + .({@-या@}) N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0264-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अविस्थलम्
