अशोकनगः|अशोकनग
अशोक + -तरुः, -नगः, -वृक्षः the Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोकवृक्षः|अशोकवृक्ष
अशोक + -तरुः, -नगः, -वृक्षः the Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोकतीर्थम्
अशोक + -तीर्थम् a holy place named Aśoka near Benares.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

