अशोक + -पूर्णिमा N. of a certain holiday, a ceremony to be observed on<BR> the 15th day of the month of Phālguna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोकमञ्जरी
