अशोक + -षष्ठी N. of a certain holiday; चैत्रे मास्यसिते पक्षे षष्ठ्यां<BR> षष्ठीं प्रपूजयेत् । सुखाय पुत्रलाभाय शुक्लपक्षे तथैव च ॥.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोचः|अशोच
अशोचः<BR>—1 Absence of care or anxiety.<BR>—2 Tranquility, calmness.<BR>—3 Modesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशोच्य|अशोच्यं
