अशोभनम्
अशोभनम् Offence, mistake, fault रामेण यदि ते पापे किंचित्कृतमशोभनम्<BR> Rām. 2. 38. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशौचम्
अशौचम्<BR>—1 Impurity, dirtiness, foulness; Pt. 1. 195.<BR>—2 Legal impurity or contamination; defilement caused either by child-birth<BR> (called जननाशौच) or by the death of some relation (called मृताशौच);<BR> it lasts for 10 days; during the मृताशौच a person defiled by it is<BR> not to touch anybody else, or to eat with others in the same row or to<BR> do any sacred action; अहोरात्रमुपासीरन्नशौचं बान्धवैः सह Ms. 11. 183.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अशौचान्तः, अशौचसंकरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशौचान्तः|अशौचान्त
अशौचम् + -अन्तः end of defilement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशौचसंकरः|अशौचसङ्कर
अशौचम् + -संकरः blending or coming together of two or more defilements.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशौटीर्यम्
अशौटीर्यम् Want of self-confidence; Mbh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अशौण्डीर्यम्
अशौण्डीर्यम् Illiberality अशौण्डीर्यस्वभावेन वेशभावेन मन्यते Mk. 8. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्न|अश्नः
अश्न <i>a.</i> [अश्नुते व्याप्नोति अश्नाति वा, अश्-नन्]<BR>—1 Pervading.<BR>—2 Eating voracious; तस्य भ्राता मध्यमो अस्त्यश्नः Rv. 1. 164. 1.<BR>—3 Pervaded, filled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्नः|अश्न
अश्न + .{@-श्नः@}<BR>—1 N. of a demon; अश्नस्य चिच्छिश्नथत् पूर्व्याणि Rv. 6. 4. 3.<BR>—2 A cloud (Nir.).<BR>—3 A stone to grind Soma on. Rv. 8. 2. 2. नृभिर्धूतः सुतो अश्नैरव्यो<BR> वारैः परिपूतः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्नया
अश्नया Hunger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्नीतपिबता
अश्नीतपिबता [अश्नीत पिबत इत्युच्यते यस्यां निदेशक्रियायाम्, मयू˚<BR> स˚ P. II. 1. 72] Invitation to eat and drink, a feast where people<BR> are called to eat and drink; अश्नीतपिबतीयन्ती प्रसृता स्मरकर्मणि Bk. 5. 92.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मः|अश्म
अश्मः<BR>—1 A mountain, a rock (at the end of comp.)<BR>—2 (Ved.) A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मकः|अश्मक
अश्मकः [अश्मेव स्थिरः, इवार्थे कन्]<BR>—1 N. of a sage.<BR>—2 N. of a country in the south; तथाश्मकाः पुलिन्दाश्च कलिङ्गाश्च विशेषतः<BR> Rām. (probably an old name of Travancore); according to Bṛ. S. 14. 22<BR> it is in the north-west (दिशि पश्चिमोत्तरस्यां … अश्मककुलूतलहडस्त्रीराज्यनृसिंहवनखस्थाः)<BR>—3 The inhabitants of the country (pl.).<BR>—4 A part of the साल्व country or its inhabitants; or its king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मन्
अश्मन् <i>a.</i> Ved. Eating or pervading; अश्मान्नानामाधिपत्यं जगाम<BR> Av. 18. 4. 54. ━<i>m.</i> [अश्नुते व्याप्नोति संहन्त्यनेन बा˚ मनिन् Uṇ. 4. 146]<BR>—1 A stone; नाराचक्षेपणीयाश्मनिष्पेषोत्पतितानलम् R. 4. 77.<BR>—2 A hard stone, rock.<BR>—3 Flint. ततोऽश्मसहिता धाराः संवृण्वन्त्यः समन्ततः Mb. 3. 143. 19.<BR>—4 A cloud.<BR>—5 A thunderbolt.<BR>—6 A mountain.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अश्मास्य, अश्मोत्थम्, अश्मकदली, अश्मकुट्ट, अश्मकुट्टक, अश्मकेतुः, अश्मगन्धा, अश्मगर्भः, अश्मगर्भम्, अश्मगर्भजः, अश्मजम्, अश्मयोनिः, अश्मगर्भजः, अश्मगुडः, अश्मगुडा, अश्मघ्नः, अश्मचक्र, अश्मजः, अश्मजम्, अश्मजतु, अश्मजातिः, अश्मदारणः, अश्मदिद्यु, अश्मनगरम्, अश्मपुष्पम्, अश्मभालम्, अश्मभिद्, अश्मभेदः, अश्मभेदकः, अश्मयोनिः, अश्मरथः, अश्मवर्षः, अश्मव्रज, अश्मसार, अश्महन्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

