अश्मरी + -भेदनम् a lithontriptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मरीहरः|अश्मरीहर
अश्मरी + -हरः N. of the tree Pentaptera Arjuna, used as a lithontriptic<BR> (Mar. वायवरणा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मीरः|अश्मीर|अश्मीरं
अश्मीरः, -रम्<BR> Stone or gravel (the disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मीरम्
अश्मीरः, -रम्<BR> Stone or gravel (the disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मन्त|अश्मंत|अश्मन्तं|अश्मन्तः
अश्मन्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Inauspicious, unlucky (अशुभ).<BR>—2 Unlimited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मन्तः|अश्मन्त|अश्मंत|अश्मन्तं
अश्मन्त + .{@-न्तः@} N. of a Marut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मन्तम्
अश्मन्त + .{@-न्तम्@} [अश्मनोऽन्तोऽत्र शकं˚ पररूपम्]<BR>—1 A fire-place.<BR>—2 A field, plain.<BR>—3 Death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मन्तकः|अश्मन्तक|अश्मंतकं|अश्मन्तकं|अश्मंतकः
अश्मन्तकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A fire-place.<BR>—2 The shade for a lamp (दीपाधार).<BR>—3 A kind of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मन्तकम्
अश्मन्तकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A fire-place.<BR>—2 The shade for a lamp (दीपाधार).<BR>—3 A kind of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्मन्तकः|अश्मन्तक|अश्मंतकं|अश्मन्तकं|अश्मंतकः
अश्मन्तकः, -कम् + .{@-कः@} N. of several trees: -<BR>——(<i>a</i>) अम्लोटक; its leaf; तीराश्मन्तकशिम्बिचुम्बितमुखाः Māl. 9. 7<BR> (Mar. आपटा);<BR>——(<i>b</i>) N. of a tree कोविदारकाः (Mar. कोरळ);<BR>——(<i>c</i>) N. of a plant from the fibres of which a Brāhmaṇaʼs girdle<BR> may be made; मुञ्जालाभे तु कर्तव्या कुशाश्मन्तकबल्वजैः । Ms. 2. 43.<BR> (Monier Williams gives the word wrongly as अश्मान्तक.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्यानम्
अश्यानम् A moist variety of अगुरु, Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रः|अश्र|अश्रं
अश्रः A corner, mostly at the end of comp.; चतुरश्र, त्र्यश्र &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रम्
अश्रः + .{@-श्रम्@} [अश्नुते नेत्रम्, अश्-रक्]<BR>—1 A tear.<BR>—2 Blood (usually written अस्र q. v.) कबन्धानां श्रेणी कथमथ<BR> तताराश्रसरितम् Śiva B. 24. 77.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अश्रपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रपः|अश्रप
अश्रः + -पः a blood drinker, a fiend, cannibal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रिन्
अश्रिन् <i>a.</i> Having tears, in tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रद्ध
अश्रद्ध <i>a.</i> Without faith, unbelieving, diffident; येऽश्रद्धा<BR> धनकाम्या क्रव्यादा समासते Av. 12. 2. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रद्धा
अश्रद्ध + .{@-द्धा@} Unbelief, diffidence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रद्दधान|अश्रद्दधानः
अश्रद्दधान <i>a.</i> Unbelieving, incredulous; अश्रद्दधानाः पुरुषा<BR> धर्मस्यास्य परंतप । अप्राप्य मां निवर्तन्ते मृत्युसंसारवर्त्मनि<BR> Bg. 9. 3. अज्ञश्चाश्रद्दधानश्च संशयात्मा विनश्यति Bg. 4. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रद्धेय|अश्रद्धेयं
अश्रद्धेय <i>a.</i> Not to be believed, incredible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रम|अश्रमः
अश्रम <i>a.</i> Ved. Indefatigable, untiring. Rv. 7. 69. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रमः|अश्रम
अश्रम + .{@-मः@}<BR>—1 Freedom from fatigue, freshness, vigour.<BR>—2 Absence of toil, laziness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रमण|अश्रमणः
अश्रमण <i>a.</i> Indefatigable; Rv. 10. 94. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रमणः|अश्रमण
अश्रमण + .{@-णः@} One who is not an ascetic or Buddhist mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रान्त|अश्रांत|अश्रान्तं|अश्रान्तः
अश्रान्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unwearied, not fatigued, untired.<BR>—2 Incessant, continual; अश्रान्तपुण्यकर्माणः Mv. 1. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रान्तम्
अश्रान्त + .{@-न्तम्@}<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">Page0278-1</a>]<BR> Absence of rest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रान्तम्
अश्रान्त + .{@-न्तम्@} <i>ind.</i> Incessantly, continually; मयूखैरश्रान्तं तपति<BR> यदि देवो दिनकरः U. 6. 14; अश्रान्तश्रुतिपाठपूतरसनाविर्भूतभूरिस्तवा N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0277-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रवण|अश्रवणः
अश्रवण <i>a.</i> Deaf, having no ears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रवणः|अश्रवण
अश्रवण + .{@-णः@} A snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रवणम्
अश्रवण + .{@-णम्@} Loss of hearing, deafness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्राव्य
अश्राव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not to be heard.<BR>—2 Unfit to be heard, not to be spoken of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रातस्
अश्रातस् <i>ind.</i> Ved. In an uncooked manner, raw. यदि श्रातो जुहोतन<BR> यद्यश्रातो ममत्तन Rv. 10. 179. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्राद्ध|अश्राद्धः
अश्राद्ध <i>a.</i> —1 Not performing the Srāddha ceremony, not entitled<BR> to it, not belonging or relating to it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्राद्धः|अश्राद्ध
अश्राद्ध + .{@-द्धः@} Non-performance of a Srāddha q. v.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अश्राद्धभोजिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्राद्धभोजिन्
अश्राद्ध + -भोजिन् <i>a.</i> one who has vowed not to eat during the performance<BR> of a Srāddha ceremony. व्रते P. III. 2. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रिः|अश्रि
अश्रिः, -श्री <i>f.</i><BR> [अश्यते संहन्यते अनया अश् वङ्क्र्यादि˚ कि; cf. Uṇ. 4. 137]<BR>—1 A corner, angle (of a room, house &c. changed to अश्र at the end<BR> of comp. with चतुर्, त्रि, षट् and a few other words; see चतुरस्र);<BR> अष्टाश्रिर्वै वज्रः Ait. Br.<BR>—2 The sharp side or edge (of a weapon &c.); वृत्रस्य हन्तुः कुलिशं<BR> कुण्ठिताश्रीव लक्ष्यते Ku. 2. 20.<BR>—3 The sharp side of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्री
अश्रिः, -श्री <i>f.</i><BR> [अश्यते संहन्यते अनया अश् वङ्क्र्यादि˚ कि; cf. Uṇ. 4. 137]<BR>—1 A corner, angle (of a room, house &c. changed to अश्र at the end<BR> of comp. with चतुर्, त्रि, षट् and a few other words; see चतुरस्र);<BR> अष्टाश्रिर्वै वज्रः Ait. Br.<BR>—2 The sharp side or edge (of a weapon &c.); वृत्रस्य हन्तुः कुलिशं<BR> कुण्ठिताश्रीव लक्ष्यते Ku. 2. 20.<BR>—3 The sharp side of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रिमत्|अश्रिमन्त्
अश्रिमत् <i>a.</i> Cornered, angular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रित
अश्रित <i>a.</i> Ved. Difficult of access.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्री
अश्री Ill-luck (personified as a goddess).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रीक
अश्रीक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having no splendour, without beauty, pale; अश्रीकाः काश्चिदन्तर्दिशम्<BR> इव दधिरे दाहमुद्भ्रान्तसत्त्वाः Śi. 15. 96.<BR>—2 Unlucky, unpropitious, not prosperous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रीमत्|अश्रीमन्त्
अश्रीमत् <i>a.</i> Unfortunate, unlucky, Rām. 1. 6. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रीर
अश्रीर [न श्रीः अश्रीः अस्त्यर्थे˚ र] Ved.<BR>—1 Ugly, ill-looking; अश्रीर इव जामाता Rv. 8. 2. 20.<BR>—2 Inauspicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रील
अश्रील = अश्रीक q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रु
अश्रु <i>n.</i> [अश्नुते व्याप्नोति नेत्रमदर्शनाय, अश्-कुन् Uṇ. 5. 29, 2. 13, 4. 102]<BR> A tear; पपात भूमौ सह सैनिकाश्रुभिः R. 3. 61.<BR> [cf. Zend. <i>asru</i>; Pers. <i>ars</i>].<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अश्रूपहत, अश्रुकला, अश्रुनाली, अश्रुपरिपूर्ण, अश्रुपरिप्लुत, अश्रुपातः, अश्रुपूर्ण, अश्रुमुख, अश्रुलोचन, अश्रुनेत्र, अश्रुशालिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रूपहत
अश्रु + -उपहत <i>a.</i> affected by tears, covered with tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुकला
अश्रु + -कला a tear-drop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुनाली
अश्रु + -नाली Fistula Lachrymalis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुपरिपूर्ण
अश्रु + -परिपूर्ण <i>a.</i> filled with tears; ˚अक्ष having eyes filled with tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुपरिप्लुत
अश्रु + -परिप्लुत <i>a.</i> suffused or filled with tears, bathed in tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुपातः|अश्रुपात
अश्रु + -पातः flow of tears, shedding tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुपूर्ण
अश्रु + -पूर्ण <i>a.</i> filled with tears; ˚आकुल troubled and filled<BR> with tears तं तथा कृपयाविष्टमश्रुपूर्णाकुलेक्षणम् Bg. 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुमुख
अश्रु + -मुख <i>a.</i> suffused with tears, (suddenly) bursting into tears;<BR> एकपदेऽश्रुमुखी संवृत्ता V. 5; संसदश्रुमुखी बभौ R. 15. 66; Ku. 6. 92.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुलोचन
अश्रु + -लोचन, -नेत्र <i>a.</i> with tears in the eyes, with tearful eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुनेत्र
अश्रु + -लोचन, -नेत्र <i>a.</i> with tears in the eyes, with tearful eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुशालिन्
अश्रु + -शालिन् <i>a.</i> having tears, tearful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुत|अश्रुतं
अश्रुत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unheard, inaudible.<BR>—2 Contrary to the Vedas.<BR>—3 Not acquainted with the Śāstras,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">Page0278-2</a>]<BR> foolish, uneducated; भागं विद्याधनात्तस्मात् स लभेताश्रुतोऽपि सन् Dāy. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रौत
अश्रौत <i>a.</i> Not sanctioned by the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुति|अश्रुतिः
अश्रुति <i>a.</i> Without ears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुतिः|अश्रुति
अश्रुति + .{@-तिः@} <i>m.</i> (archaic) A serpent; देववंशान्पितृवंशान् ब्रह्मवंशांश्च<BR> शाश्वतान् । सन्त्यज्य मूढा वर्तन्ते ततो यान्त्यश्रुतीपथम् ॥ Mb. 12. 11. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुतिः|अश्रुति
अश्रुति + .{@-तिः@} <i>f.</i> Not hearing, forgetfulness; अश्रुतिमभिनीय U. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अश्रुतिधर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रुतिधर
अश्रुति + -धर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not striking the ear or attention.<BR>—2 not knowing the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रेयस्
अश्रेयस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Not better, inferior, worse; अश्रेयान् श्रेयसीं जातिं गच्छत्यासप्तमाद्युगात् Ms. 10. 62.<BR>—2 Worthless, useless. <i>n.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रेयस्
अश्रेयस् + .({@-स्@}) Mischief, unhappiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्रेष्ठ
अश्रेष्ठ <i>a.</i> Not the best, inferior, worse; bad, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लाघा
अश्लाघा <i>f.</i> Absence of self-praise, modesty; Nir. 4. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लाघ्य
अश्लाघ्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Undeserving of praise or honour, worthless.<BR>—2 Base, mean, censurable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लीक
अश्लीक <i>a.</i> Unlucky, unpropitious; अश्लीकमेतत्साधूनां यत्र जुह्वत्यव्ही<BR> हविः Ms. 4. 206.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लील
अश्लील <i>a.</i> [न श्रियं लाति ला-क]<BR>—1 Unpleasant, ugly.<BR>—2 Vulgar, obscene, coarse; अश्लीलप्रायान् कलकलान् Dk. 49; ˚परिवाद<BR> Ill report; भास्करालोकनाश्लीलपरिवादादि वर्जयेत् Y. 1. 33.<BR>—3 Abusive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लीलम्
अश्लील + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 Rustic or coarse language, low abuse.<BR>—2 (In Rhet.) A fault of composition; using such words as produce in the<BR> mind of the hearer a feeling of shame, disgust or inauspiciousness; त्रिधा<BR> अश्लीलम्; त्रिधेति-व्रीडाजुगुप्सामङ्गलव्यञ्जकत्वात् K. P. 7; <i>e. g.</i><BR> in साधनं सुमहद्यस्य; मुग्धा कुड्मलिताननेन दधती वायुं स्थिता तत्र<BR> सा, and मृदुपवनविभिन्नो मत्प्रियाया विनाशात्, the words साधन,<BR> वायु and विनाश are अश्लील, and produce respectively a sense<BR> of shame, disgust and inauspiciousness, साधन suggesting the sense<BR> of लिङ्ग (male organ of generation), वायु of the अपान wind<BR> (that escaping at the anus), and विनाश, of मृत्यु (death); cf.<BR> the instances under S. D. 574; दृप्तारिविजये राजन् साधनं सुमहत्तव ।<BR> प्रससार शनैर्वायुर्विनाशे तन्वि ते तदा ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लेषा
अश्लेषा [न श्लिष्यति यत्रोत्पन्नेन शिशुना, श्लिष्-घञ् Tv.]<BR>—1 The 9th Nakṣatra of lunar mansion containing five stars.<BR>—2 Disunion, disjunction.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अश्लेषाजः, अश्लेषाभवः, अश्लेषाभूः, अश्लेषाशान्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लेषाजः|अश्लेषाज
अश्लेषा + -जः, -भवः, -भूः N. of Ketu, <i>i. e.</i> the descending node.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लेषाभवः|अश्लेषाभव
अश्लेषा + -जः, -भवः, -भूः N. of Ketu, <i>i. e.</i> the descending node.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लेषाभूः
अश्लेषा + -जः, -भवः, -भूः N. of Ketu, <i>i. e.</i> the descending node.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लेषाशान्तिः|अश्लेषाशान्ति
अश्लेषा + -शान्तिः <i>f.</i> an expiatory ceremony performed on account of the<BR> birth of a child under the Aśleṣā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्लोण
अश्लोण^1 <i>a.</i> Ved. Not lame.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वः|अश्व
अश्वः [अश्नुते अध्वानं व्याप्नोति, महाशनो वा भवति Nir.; अश्-क्वन् Uṇ. 1. 149]<BR>—1 A horse; the horses are said to have 7 breeds:− अमृताद् बाष्पतो वह्नेर्वेदेभ्योऽण्डाच्च<BR> गर्भतः । साम्नो हयानामुत्पत्तिः सप्तधा परिकीर्तिता ॥<BR>—2 A symbolical expression for the number ‘seven’ (that being the number<BR> of the horses of the Sun) सूर्याश्वैर्मसजस्तताः सगुरवः शार्दूलविक्रीडितम् V. Ratn.<BR>—3 A race of men<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0279-1" target="_blank">Page0279-1</a>]<BR> (horse-like in strength); काष्ठतुल्यवपुर्धृष्यो मिथ्याचारश्च निर्भयः ।<BR> द्वादशाङ्गुलमेढ्रश्च दरिद्रस्तु हयो मतः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वौ
अश्वः + .{@-श्वौ@} (du.) A horse and a mare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0278-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

