अश्वः + -बला N. of a vegetable (Mar. मेथी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0279-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वबालः|अश्वबाल
अश्वः + -बालः<BR>—1 a kind of reed, Saccharum Spontaneum Lin. (Mar. बोरू).<BR>—2 the tail or hair of a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0279-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वबुध्न
अश्वः + -बुध्न <i>a.</i> Ved. based on horses, standing on horses, <i>i. e.</i><BR> on a carriage drawn by horses; अस्य पत्मन्नरुषीरश्वबुध्ना Rv. 10. 8. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0279-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वबुध्य
अश्वः + -बुध्य <i>a.</i> Ved. based on horses, having its origin in horses<BR> (wealth); distinguished by horses Rv. 1. 121. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0279-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

