अश्वमहिषिका
अश्वः + -महिषिका [अश्वमहिषयोर्वैरं वुन्] the natural enmity between<BR> a horse and a buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0279-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वमारः|अश्वमार
अश्वः + -मारः, -मारकः, -हन्तृ <i>m.</i> ‘horse-destroying’, a kind of<BR> Oleander, Nerium Odorum Ait. (Mar. पांढरी कण्हेर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0279-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वमारकः|अश्वमारक
अश्वः + -मारः, -मारकः, -हन्तृ <i>m.</i> ‘horse-destroying’, a kind of<BR> Oleander, Nerium Odorum Ait. (Mar. पांढरी कण्हेर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0279-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वहन्तृ
अश्वः + -मारः, -मारकः, -हन्तृ <i>m.</i> ‘horse-destroying’, a kind of<BR> Oleander, Nerium Odorum Ait. (Mar. पांढरी कण्हेर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0279-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वमालः|अश्वमाल
अश्वः + -मालः a kind of serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0279-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वमुख|अश्वमुखः
