अश्वः + -वारः, -वालः, -वारकः<BR> [अश्वं वारयति उप˚ स˚] a horseman,<BR> groom; दुःखेन निश्चर्कमुरश्ववाराः Śi. 3. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

