अश्वशास्त्रम्
अश्वः + -शास्त्रम्<BR>—1 manual or text-book of veterinary science;<BR>—2 N. of the work of Nakula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वशिरस्
अश्वः + -शिरस् <i>a.</i> having the head of a horse, an epithet of Nārāyaṇa. (<i>n.</i>)<BR>—1 a horseʼs head.<BR>—2 N. of a Dānava.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वशृगालिका
अश्वः + -शृगालिका [अश्वशृगालयोर्वैरं द्वन्द्वाद् वैरे वुन्] the natural<BR> enmity between a horse and a jackal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वषड्गवम्
अश्वः + -षड्गवम् a set or team of six horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वसधर्मन्
अश्वः + -सधर्मन् <i>a.</i> Resembling horses in work; अश्वसधर्माणो हि<BR> भनुष्याः नियुक्ताः कर्मसु विकुर्वते । Kau. A. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

