अश्वषा
अश्वः + -सनि, -षा, -सा <i>a.</i> Ved. (P. VIII. 3. 110 and Mbh.) gaining<BR> or procuring horses, giving horses; यस्तेऽअश्वसनिर्भक्षो Vāj. 8. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वसा
अश्वः + -सनि, -षा, -सा <i>a.</i> Ved. (P. VIII. 3. 110 and Mbh.) gaining<BR> or procuring horses, giving horses; यस्तेऽअश्वसनिर्भक्षो Vāj. 8. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

