अश्वसूत्रम्
अश्वः + -सूत्रम् A text book of the management of horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वसूनृत
अश्वः + -सूनृत <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 praised sincerely for (the gift of) horses; cf. Rv. 5. 79. 1-10.<BR>—2 whose praise for (giving) horses is agreeable and true.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वसेनः|अश्वसेन
अश्वः + -सेनः<BR>—1 N. of a king.<BR>—2 N. of a Nāga.<BR>—3 N. of the father of the twenty-third Arhat of the present Avasarpiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वस्तोमीय
