अश्वस्थान
अश्वः + -स्थान <i>a.</i> born in a stable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वस्थानम्
