अश्वहन्तृ
अश्वः + -हन्तृ <i>a.</i> killing a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वहन्तृता
