अश्वहय
अश्वः + -हय <i>a.</i> [अश्वेन हिनोति गच्छति हि कर्तरि अच्]<BR>—1 driving or spurring a horse, riding a horse; प्रत्यर्धिर्यज्ञानामश्वहयो<BR> रथानाम् Rv. 10. 26. 5.<BR>—2 to be traversed by a horse; समस्य हरिं हरयो मृजन्त्यश्वहयैरनिशितं<BR> नमोभिः Rv. 9. 96. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वहारकः|अश्वहारक
अश्वः + -हारकः a horse-stealer; पङ्गुतामश्वहारकः Ms. 11. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वहृदयम्
अश्वः + -हृदयम् [अश्वस्य हृदयमनोगतभावादि]<BR>—1 the desire or intention of a horse.<BR>—2 a kind of veterinary science.<BR>—3 horsemanship; अश्वहृदये निवेश्यात्मानम् K. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वया
