अश्वा
अश्वा A mare.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: अश्वामघ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वामघ
अश्वा + -मघ <i>a.</i> rich in horses; अश्वामघा गोमघा वां हुवेम Rv. 7. 71. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अश्वक|अश्वकः
