अहि + -नकुलिका [अहिनकुलयोर्वैरम् वुन् P. II. 4. 9; P. IV. 3. 125]<BR> the natural antipathy between a serpent and an ichneumon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

