अहिपतिः|अहिपति
अहि + -पतिः<BR>—1 ‘the lord of snakes’, Vāsuki; सज्जं धनुर्वहति योऽहिपतिस्थवीयः Ki. 14. 71.<BR>—2 any large serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

