अहिफेनम्
अहि + -फेनः, -फेनम् ‘the saliva or venom of a snake’, opium. जातीफलं<BR> मातुलानीमहिफेनं च पत्रकम् Śiva B. 30. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

