अहिद्विष्
अहि + -द्विष् N. of a plant (Mar. मुंगुसवेल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

