अहि + -बीजम् (Mar. खसखस).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहिभयम्
अहि + -भयम्<BR>—1 the fear of a lurking snake.<BR>—2 apprehension of treachery, danger arising from oneʼs own allies; ˚दा<BR> [अहिं भयं द्यति खण्डयति दो क] N. of the plant भूम्यामलकी<BR> (Mar. भुयआंवळी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहिभानु
अहि + -भानु <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 shining like serpents.<BR>—2 causing the motion of the sun (सूर्यगतिहेतु) as the wind; an epithet<BR> of the Maruts; मरुतो अहिभानवः Rv. 1. 175. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहिभुज्
