अहिमन्यु|अहिमन्युः
अहि + -मन्यु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having destructive anger; with unimpaired knowledge.<BR>—2 enraged like serpents; epithet of the Maruts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहिमन्युः|अहिमन्यु
अहि + -मन्यु + .({@-न्युः@}) the anger of a serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

अहिमर्दनी|अहिमर्द्दनी
