अहितमनस्
अहित + -मनस् <i>a.</i> not friendly minded, hating, inimical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

