आखुः + -कर्णपर्णिका, -पर्णिका, -कर्णी, -पर्णी the plant Salvinia Cucullata<BR> Roxb (Mar. उंदीरकानी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

