आखुवाहनः|आखुवाहन
आखुः + -गः, -पत्रः, -रथः, -वाहनः epithets of Gaṇeśa (whose vehicle<BR> is rat); तमाखुपत्रं राजेन्द्र भज मा ज्ञानदायकन् Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखुघातः|आखुघात
