आखुपाषाणः|आखुपाषाण
आखुः + -पाषाणः<BR>—1 a kind of mineral.<BR>—2 a loadstone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखुफला
आखुः + -फला The plant लघुदन्ती.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखुभुज्
आखुः + -भुज्, -भुजः a cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखुभुजः
आखुः + -भुज्, -भुजः a cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखुविषहा
आखुः + -विषहा a kind of grass (देवताडवृक्ष, देवतालीलता) considered<BR> as a remedy for a ratʼs bite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखेटः|आखेट
आखेटः [आखिट्यन्ते त्रास्यन्ते प्राणिनोऽत्र, आ-खिट्-घञ् Tv.] Hunting, chase.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: आखेटशीर्षकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आखेटशीर्षकम्
