आजगर
आजगर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [अजगर-अण्] Relating to <i>ajagara</i> or the boa;<BR> a chapter in the Mahābhārata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजगवम्
आजगवम्<BR>—1 The bow of Śiva.<BR>—2 A strong bow like that of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजन्
