आजन्मम्
आजन्म, -न्मम् <i>ind.</i> From or ever since birth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: आजन्मसुरभिपत्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजन्मसुरभिपत्रः|आजन्मसुरभिपत्र
आजन्म + -सुरभिपत्रः N. of a plant (the leaves of which are fragrant<BR> from their first appearance) (Mar. काळा मरवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजात
आजात <i>a.</i> Of high birth, noble birth; यो वैकश्चिदिहाजातः क्षत्रियः<BR> क्षत्रकर्मवित् Mb. 5. 134. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजातिः|आजाति
आजातिः <i>f.</i> Birth, origin; एकविंशतिमाजातीः पापयोनिषु जायते Ms. 4. 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानः|आजान
आजानः [आ-जन्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Birth, origin.<BR>—2 Generating cause (said to be <i>n.</i> also in these two senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानम्
आजानः + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Birth-place.<BR>—2 Birth, descent, species (Ved.). ━<i>ind.</i> From the time of the creation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: आजानज, आजानदेवः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानज
आजानः + -ज <i>a.</i> born since the creation (as gods &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानदेवः|आजानदेव
आजानः + -देवः a god from the very creation; ये शतं कर्मदेवानामानन्दाः<BR> स एक आजानदेवानामानन्दः Bṛ. Up. 4. 3. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानिः|आजानि
आजानिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 One giving birth, parent, especially a mother (Sāy.).<BR>—2 Birth, descent; आजानीरुषसस्ते अग्ने Rv. 3. 17. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानेय|आजानेयः
आजानेय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Of good breed (as a horse); आजानेयो दन्तिनस्त्रस्यति स्म Śi. 18. 23.<BR>—2 Of noble birth, fearless, undaunted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानेयः|आजानेय
आजानेय + .{@-यः@} A well-bred horse; शक्तिभिर्भिन्नहृदयाः स्खलन्तोऽपि पदे<BR> पदे । आजानन्ति यतः संज्ञामाजानेयास्ततः स्मृताः ॥ Śabdak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानेय्य
आजानेय्य <i>a.</i> Ved. Of good breed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजपादम्
आजपादम् The lunar mansion पूर्वाभाद्रपदा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजमीढ
आजमीढ <i>a.</i> Belonging to or produced in the country of अजमीढ<BR> (or अजमीर); a descendant of अजमीढ; Rv. 4. 44. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजमीढाः
आजमीढ + .{@-ढाः@} (pl.) The kings of that country. Addressed to युधिष्ठिर;<BR> Bhāg. 1. 15. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजवनम्
आजवनम् Rushing upon, fighting, attacking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजानु
आजानु <i>ind.</i> Up to the knees; ˚विलम्बिबाहुम् R. 18. 26, 16. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजिः|आजि
आजिः <i>m. f.</i> [अजन्त्यस्यां, अज्-इण् P. III. 3. 108. Vārt. इणजादिभ्यः]<BR>—1 A battle, fight, combat; ते तु यावन्त एवाजौ तावांश्च ददृशे स<BR> तैः R. 12. 45.<BR>—2 A fighting or running match; आजिं धाव् or इ, -अज् or सृ to<BR> run with or against any one for prize.<BR>—3 Battle-field, place for running; race-course, level ground; दीर्घं<BR> यदाजिमभ्यख्यदर्यः Rv. 4. 24. 8. शस्त्राण्याजौ नयनसलिलं चापि<BR> तुल्यं मुमोच Ve. 3. 11.<BR>—4 Limit, boundary; यथाग्नेर्मन्थनमाजेः सरणम् Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 5.<BR>—5 A road, way (<i>m.</i>).<BR>—6 An instant (<i>m.</i>).<BR>—7 Abuse, invective.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: आज्यन्तः, आजिकृत्, आजिक्रिया, आजितुर्, आजिमुखम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आज्यन्तः|आज्यन्त
आजिः + -अन्तः the goal in a race-course.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजिकृत्
आजिः + -कृत् <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 running for a prize; यदाजिं यात्याजिकृदिन्द्रः स्वश्वयुरुप Rv. 8. 45. 7.<BR>—2 making a war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजिक्रिया
आजिः + -क्रिया fighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजितुर्
आजिः + -तुर् <i>a.</i> Ved. victorious in battles; आजितुरं सत्पतिं विश्वचर्षाणिम् Rv. 8. 53. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजिमुखम्
आजिः + -मुखम् The front line in a battle; Ratn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजि|आजिः
आजि €1 P. To conquer, win, acquire; उभा क्षयावाजयन् याति Rv. 2. 27. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजयनम्
आजयनम्<BR>—1 Conquering.<BR>—2 A battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजिगीषु
आजिगीषु <i>a.</i> Ambitious, wishing to excel or surpass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजिग्रह
आजिग्रह <i>a.</i> One who takes or seizes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजिज्ञासेन्य
आजिज्ञासेन्य <i>a.</i> Liable to be investigated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजिज्ञासेन्न्याः
आजिज्ञासेन्य + .{@-न्याः@} (pl.) N. of a short section of the Kuntāpa hymns in the<BR> Aitareya Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजिरि
आजिरि <i>a.</i> [अजिर-इञ्] Situated in the court-yard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजिरेय
आजिरेय <i>a.</i> Belonging to or produced in a court-yard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीव्
आजीव् €1 P. To live by or maintain oneself with; to have the use or<BR> enjoyment of; to subsist; आजीवन्स्वेच्छया दण्डयो Y. 2. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीवः|आजीव
आजीवः, -वनम्<BR>—1 Livelihood, subsistence, maintenance, भवत्याजीवनं तस्मात् Pt. 1. 48;<BR> cf. words like रूपाजीव, अजाजीव, शस्त्राजीव, स्त्र्याजीव &c.;<BR> आजीवनार्थः Ms. 10. 79, 11. 63 means of livelihood; बहुमूलफलो<BR> रम्यः स्वाजीवः प्रतिभाति मे Rām. 2. 56. 14.<BR>—2 Profession, the means of maintaining oneself; विशुद्ध इदानीमाजीवः Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीवनम्
आजीवः, -वनम्<BR>—1 Livelihood, subsistence, maintenance, भवत्याजीवनं तस्मात् Pt. 1. 48;<BR> cf. words like रूपाजीव, अजाजीव, शस्त्राजीव, स्त्र्याजीव &c.;<BR> आजीवनार्थः Ms. 10. 79, 11. 63 means of livelihood; बहुमूलफलो<BR> रम्यः स्वाजीवः प्रतिभाति मे Rām. 2. 56. 14.<BR>—2 Profession, the means of maintaining oneself; विशुद्ध इदानीमाजीवः Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीवः|आजीव
आजीवः, -वनम् + .{@-वः@} A Jaina beggar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीवकः|आजीवक
आजीवकः<BR>—1 A beggar, one who earns his livelihood every where.<BR>—2 See आजीविकः below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीविकः|आजीविक
आजीविकः A religious mendicant of the sect founded by Gosāla Maṅkhaliputra,<BR> following special rules with regard to livelihood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीविका
आजीविका Profession, means of subsistence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीवितान्तम्
आजीवितान्तम् <i>ind.</i> For life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीविन्
आजीविन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having a livelihood.<BR>—2 A particular kind of beggar (एकदण्डिन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीव्य
आजीव्य <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 To be practised (as a profession).<BR>—2 Fit for or affording a livelihood; आजीव्यांश्चिच्छिदुर्वृक्षान् Bhāg. 7. 2. 15.<BR>—3 Habitable, fertile; रम्यं पशव्यमाजीव्यम् Y. 1. 321; Ms. 7. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजीव्यम्
आजीव्य + .{@-व्यम्@} A means of subsistence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजुर्
आजुर् <i>f.</i>, आजू <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Working without wages.<BR>—2 A servant working without wages.<BR>—3 Doomed residence in a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आजू
आजुर् <i>f.</i>, आजू <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Working without wages.<BR>—2 A servant working without wages.<BR>—3 Doomed residence in a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आज्ञा
आज्ञा €9 P. To know, understand, learn, obtain information, ascertain,<BR> notice, perceive. ━<i>Caus.</i> (ज्ञापयति)<BR>—1 To order, command, direct.<BR>—2 To assure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आज्ञप्त|आज्ञप्तः
आज्ञप्त <i>a.</i> Ordered, commanded; भौमाश्चैवान्तरिक्षाश्च कालाज्ञप्ता<BR> भयावहाः Rām. 7. 6. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आज्ञप्तिः|आज्ञप्ति
आज्ञप्तिः <i>f.</i> An order, injunction, command; ˚हर <i>a.</i> bearing<BR> a message, messenger; Ś. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

आज्ञा
आज्ञा [आ-ज्ञा-अड्] P. आतश्चोपसर्गे P. III. 3. 106.<BR>—1 An order, command; तथेति शेषामिव भर्तुराज्ञाम् Ku. 3. 22.<BR>—2 Permission, allowance.<BR>—3 Power of arrangement; नैवार्थेन च कामेन विक्रमेण न चाज्ञया । शक्या<BR> दैवगतिर्लोके निवर्तयितुमुद्यता ॥ Rām. 6. 110. 25.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: आज्ञानुग, आज्ञानुगामिन्, आज्ञानुयायिन्, आज्ञानुवर्तिन्, आज्ञानुसारिन्, आज्ञासंपादक, आज्ञावह, आज्ञाकर, आज्ञाकारिन्, आज्ञाकरणम्, आज्ञापालनम्, आज्ञाचक्रम्, आज्ञापत्रम्, आज्ञाप्रतिघातः, आज्ञाभङ्गः, आज्ञाविधेय, आज्ञाशतंप्रापयिता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

