इक्कटः|इक्कट
इक्कटः A kind of reed or grass for mats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0379-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

