इक्ष्वारि(लि)कः A kind of reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इख्
इख्, इङ्ख् €1 P. (एखति इङ्गति) To go, move; usually with प्र, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्ख्|इंख्
इख्, इङ्ख् €1 P. (एखति इङ्गति) To go, move; usually with प्र, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्ग्|इंग्
इङ्ग् €1 U. (इङ्गति-ते, इङ्गितुम्, इङ्गित)<BR>—1 To move, shake, be agitated; यथा दीपो निवातस्थो नेङ्गते Bg. 6. 19, 14. 23;<BR> त्वया सृष्टमिदं विश्वं यच्चेङ्गं यच्च नेङ्गति Mb. 3. 102. 20.<BR>—2 To go, move. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To move, agitate, shake.<BR>—2 (In gram.) to separate the members of a compound; cf. इङ्ग्य below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्ग|इंग|इङ्गं|इङ्गः
इङ्ग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Movable; त्वया सृष्टमिदं विश्वं यच्चेङ्गं यच्च नेङ्गति Mb. 3. 102. 20.<BR>—2 Wonderful, surprising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गः|इङ्ग|इंग|इङ्गं
इङ्ग + .{@-गः@}<BR>—1 A hint or sign.<BR>—2 An indication of a sentiment by gesture.<BR>—3 Knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गा|इंगा
इङ्ग + .{@-ङ्गा@} A kind of counting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गम्
इङ्ग + .{@-ङ्गम्@} the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गनम्
इङ्गनम् [इङ्ग्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Moving, shaking, causing to move.<BR>—2 Knowledge.<BR>—3 The operation of separating one member of a compound from another,<BR> as by an <i>Avagraha</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गित|इंगित|इङ्गितं
इङ्गित <i>p. p.</i> Moved, shaken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गितम्
इङ्गित + .{@-तम्@} [भावे-क्त]<BR>—1 Palpitation, shaking.<BR>—2 Internal thought, inward thought or secret aim, intention, purpose;<BR> ˚आकारवेदिभिः K. 7; Pt. 1. 43; अगूढसद्भावमितीङ्गितज्ञया Ku. 5. 62;<BR> तस्य संवृतमन्त्रस्य गूढाकारेङ्गितस्य च R. 1. 20; Śi. 9. 69.<BR>—3 A hint, sign, gesture; आकारैरिङ्गितैर्गत्या Pt. 1. 44.<BR>—4 Particularly, the gesture or motion of the various limbs of the body<BR> indicating oneʼs intentions; gesture suited to betray internal feelings;<BR> आकारैरिङ्गितैर्गत्या गृह्यतेऽन्तर्गतं मनः Ms. 8. 26. cf. इङ्गितं<BR> हृद्गतो भावो बहिराकार आकृतिः । सज्जनः<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: इङ्गितकोविद, इङ्गितज्ञ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गितकोविद|इंगितकोविद
इङ्गित + -कोविद, -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> skilled in the interpretation of internal<BR> sentiments by external gestures, understanding signs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गितज्ञ|इंगितज्ञ
इङ्गित + -कोविद, -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> skilled in the interpretation of internal<BR> sentiments by external gestures, understanding signs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्ग्य|इंग्य
इङ्ग्य <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 Movable from its place.<BR>—2 (In the Prātiśākhyas) A term for those words or parts of a compound<BR> which in certain grammatical operations may be separated from the preceding<BR> parts; a word which in the Pada-Pāṭha is divided by the <i>Avagraha</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गुः|इङ्गु|इंगुः
इङ्गुः A disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गुदः|इङ्गुद|इंगुद|इंगुदः
इङ्गुदः, -दी, इङ्गुलः<BR> N. of a medicinal tree, Terminalia Catappa (Mar.<BR> हिंगणबेट); इङ्गुदीपादपः सोऽयम् U. 1. 21; प्रस्निग्धाः क्वचिदिङ्गुदीफलभिदः<BR> सूच्यन्त एवोपलाः Ś. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इङ्गुदी|इंगुदी
इङ्गुदः, -दी, इङ्गुलः<BR> N. of a medicinal tree, Terminalia Catappa (Mar.<BR> हिंगणबेट); इङ्गुदीपादपः सोऽयम् U. 1. 21; प्रस्निग्धाः क्वचिदिङ्गुदीफलभिदः<BR> सूच्यन्त एवोपलाः Ś. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

