इट्
इट् €1 P. [एटति, इटित]<BR>—1 To go, go to or towards; त्वं त्यमिटतो रथमिन्द्र<BR> प्रावः सुतावतः Rv. 10. 171. 1.<BR>—2 To err.<BR>—3 To make haste (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इटः|इट
इटः Ved.<BR>—1 Cane or grass; अथो इट इव हायनोप द्राह्यवीरहा Av. 6. 14. 3.<BR>—2 A mat, a web made of cane or grass,<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: इटसूनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इटसूनम्
इटः + -सूनम् a mat (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इट्चरः|इट्चर
इट्चरः [इषा कामेन चरति] A bull or steer allowed to go at liberty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इठिमिका
इठिमिका <i>f.</i> N. of a section of the Kāṭhaka recension of the Yajurveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इड्
इड् <i>f.</i> (also written इल् in Veda) [इल्-क्विप् वा लस्य डः]<BR>—1 An offering or oblation, libation offered to the gods.<BR>—2 Prayer, flow of speech.<BR>—3 The earth.<BR>—4 Food.<BR>—5 The rainy season.<BR>—6 The third of the five <i>prayājas</i> (इडो यजति).<BR>—7 People or subjects. (pl.) The object of devotion.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: इड्देवता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इल्
इड् <i>f.</i> (also written इल् in Veda) [इल्-क्विप् वा लस्य डः]<BR>—1 An offering or oblation, libation offered to the gods.<BR>—2 Prayer, flow of speech.<BR>—3 The earth.<BR>—4 Food.<BR>—5 The rainy season.<BR>—6 The third of the five <i>prayājas</i> (इडो यजति).<BR>—7 People or subjects. (pl.) The object of devotion.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: इड्देवता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

