इन्दुलौहम्
इन्दुः + -लोहकम्, -लौहम् silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुवदना
इन्दुः + -वदना A moon-faced lady. N. of a metre; see Appendix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुवल्ली
इन्दुः + -वल्ली The Soma plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुवारः|इन्दुवार
इन्दुः + -वारः a kind of yoga in Astrology.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुवासरः
इन्दुः + -वासरः Monday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुव्रतम्
इन्दुः + -व्रतम् a religious observance depending on the age of the moon.<BR> It consists in diminishing the quantity of food by a certain portion daily,<BR> for a fortnight or a month; cf. चान्द्रायण. इन्दुव्रतसहस्रं तु<BR> यश्चरेत्कायशोधनम् Mb. 13. 26. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुशफरी
