इन्दुसुतः|इन्दुसुत
इन्दुः + -सुतः or {@-सूनुः@}<BR> N. of the planet Mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुसूनुः|इन्दुसूनु
इन्दुः + -सुतः or {@-सूनुः@}<BR> N. of the planet Mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्दुकः|इन्दुक
