इन्द्रायुधः|इन्द्रायुध|इन्द्रायुधं
इन्द्रः + -आयुधम् + .({@-धः@})<BR>—1 N. of the horse in Kādambarī (<i>i. e.</i> Kapiñjala changed into a horse).<BR>—2 a horse marked with black about the eyes.<BR>—3 a diamond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

इन्द्रायुधा
