इन्द्रर्षभ
इन्द्रः + -ऋषभ <i>a.</i> having Indra as a bull, or impregnated by Indra,<BR> an epithet of the earth. इन्द्रऋषभा द्रविणे नो दधातु Av. 12. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

