इन्द्रकूटः|इन्द्रकूट
इन्द्रः + -कूटः N. of a mountain<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

