उच्छिष्ट|उच्छिष्टं
उच्छिष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Left as a remainder<BR>—2 Rejected, abandoned; अन्˚ R. 12. 15.<BR>—3 Stale; ˚कल्पना stale idea or invention.<BR>—4 Unholy, impure; उच्छिष्टं तु यवकीतमपकृष्टकमण्डलुम् Mb. 3. 136. 14.<BR>—5 (Used actively). One who has not washed his mouth and hands after meals,<BR> and hence considered impure; न चोच्छिष्टः क्वचिद् व्रजेत् Ms. 2. 56;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उच्छिष्टम्
उच्छिष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@}<BR>—1 Leaving, fragments remainder, (especially of food or sacrifice); उच्छिष्टमपि<BR> चामेध्यम् Bg. 17. 10; नोच्छिष्टं कस्यचिद्दद्यात् Ms. 2. 56; so द्विज˚, गृध्र˚.<BR>—2 Honey.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उच्छिष्टान्नम्, उच्छिष्टगणपतिः, उच्छिष्टचाण्डालिनी, उच्छिष्टभोजन, उच्छिष्टभोजिन्, उच्छिष्टभोक्तृ, उच्छिष्टभोजनम्, उच्छिष्टमोदनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

