उडुः + -चक्रम् zodiacal circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0401-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुपः|उडुप
उडुः + -पः, -पम्, [उडुनि जले पाति] —1 raft, boat; तितीर्षुर्दुस्तरं<BR> मोहादुडुपेनास्मि<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">Page0402-1</a>]<BR> सागरम् R. 1. 2; केनोडुपेन परलोकनदीं तरिष्ये Mk. 8. 23.<BR>—2 A kind of drinking vessel covered with leather; comm. on R. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0401-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुपः|उडुप
उडुः + -पः, -पम् + .({@-पः@}) the moon; गुणप्रकर्षादुडुपेन शम्भोरलङ्घ्यमुल्लङ्घितमुत्तमाङ्गम् Mk. 4. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0401-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुपम्
उडुः + -पः, -पम्, [उडुनि जले पाति] —1 raft, boat; तितीर्षुर्दुस्तरं<BR> मोहादुडुपेनास्मि<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">Page0402-1</a>]<BR> सागरम् R. 1. 2; केनोडुपेन परलोकनदीं तरिष्ये Mk. 8. 23.<BR>—2 A kind of drinking vessel covered with leather; comm. on R. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0401-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुपतिः|उडुपति
उडुः + -पतिः, -राज्<BR>—1 the moon; जितमुडुपतिना Ratn. 1. 5; रसात्मकस्योडुपतेश्च रश्मयः Ku. 5. 22.<BR>—2 Varuṇa, regent of waters.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुराज्
उडुः + -पतिः, -राज्<BR>—1 the moon; जितमुडुपतिना Ratn. 1. 5; रसात्मकस्योडुपतेश्च रश्मयः Ku. 5. 22.<BR>—2 Varuṇa, regent of waters.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुपथः|उडुपथ
उडुः + -पथः the sky, the firmament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुम्बरः|उडुम्बर|उडुंबर|उडुम्बरं|उडुंबरः
उडुम्बरः<BR>—1 N. of a tree; Ficus Glomerata (Mar. औदुम्बर).<BR>—2 The threshold of a house. उच्छ्रायात् पादविस्तीर्णा शाखा तद्वदुदुम्बरः<BR> Bṛ. S. 53. 26.<BR>—3 A eunuch.<BR>—4 A part of a sacrifice.<BR>—5 A kind of leprosy with copper spots<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुम्बरम्
उडुम्बरः + .({@-रम्@} also).<BR>—6 A kind of worm said to be produced in the blood and to cause leprosy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुम्बरम्
उडुम्बरः + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 The fruit of the उदुम्बर tree.<BR>—2 Copper.<BR>—3 A <i>Karṣa</i>, a measure of two tolās.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उडुम्बरदला, उडुम्बरपर्णी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुम्बरदला
उडुम्बरः + -दला, -पर्णी the plant Croton Polyandra (दन्ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उडुम्बरपर्णी
उडुम्बरः + -दला, -पर्णी the plant Croton Polyandra (दन्ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

