उडूपप्रिया
उडूपः + .{@-प्रिया@} A lotus-creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डामर|उड्डामरं
उड्डामर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Agreeable, excellent, respectable.<BR>—2 Formidable, terrific; उड्डामरव्यस्तविस्तारिदोःखण्डपर्यासितक्ष्माधरम् Māl. 2. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डामरतन्त्र
उड्डामर + .{@-तन्त्र@} N. of a Tantra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डामरिन्
उड्डामरिन् <i>a.</i> One who makes an extraordinary noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डियानम्
उड्डियानम् A particular position of the fingers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डी
उड्डी €1. €4. Ā. To fly up, soar. ━<i>Caus.</i> To scare away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डयनम्
उड्डयनम् Flying up, soaring; गतो विरुत्योड्डयने निराशताम् N. 1. 125.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डीन|उड्डीनं
उड्डीन <i>p. p.</i> Flown up, flying up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डीनम्
उड्डीन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Flying up, soaring; उड्डीनमूर्ध्वगमनमवडीनमधोगतिः Mb. 8. 41. 26.<BR>—2 A particular flight of birds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डीयनम्
उड्डीयनम् Flying up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्डीशः|उड्डीश
उड्डीशः<BR>—1 N. of a Tantra work containing charms and incantations; उड्डीशो ग्रन्थभेदे<BR> स्यात् Med.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उड्रः|उड्र
उड्रः N. of a country; the modern Orissa; see ओड्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उणक
उणक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Removing, driving out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उणादिः|उणादि
उणादिः A class of terminations beginning with उण्. ━<i>m.</i> pl.<BR> The class of कृत् affixes which begin with उण्.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उणादिसूत्राणि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उणादिसूत्राणि
उणादिः + -सूत्राणि The सूत्रs (Pāṇini III. 3, I. 4. 75) treating of<BR> the उणादि affixes. ˚वृत्ति <i>f.</i> a commentary on the उणादि Sūtras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उण्डुकः|उण्डुक|उंडुकः
उण्डुकः<BR>—1 A species of leprosy.<BR>—2 A texture, net.<BR>—3 A part of the body (stomach).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उण्डेरकः|उण्डेरक|उंडेरक|उंडेरकः
उण्डेरकः A ball of flour, roll, loaf^1; तथैवोण्डेरकस्रजः Y. 1. 288.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उण्ड्रपुष्पम्
उण्ड्रपुष्पम् The shoe-flower, Hibiscus Rosa Sinensis (Mar. जास्वंदी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उढ्रम्
उढ्रम्<BR>—1 The shoe-flower.<BR>—2 Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्
उत् <i>ind.</i> A particle of<BR>——(<i>a</i>) doubt;<BR>——(<i>b</i>) interrogation;<BR>——(<i>c</i>) deliberation;<BR>——(<i>d</i>) intensity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत|उतं
उत <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 A particle expressing<BR>——(<i>a</i>) doubt, uncertainty, guess (<i>or</i>); तत्किमयमातपदोषः स्यादुत<BR> यथा मे मनसि वर्तते Ś. 3; स्थाणुरयमुत पुरुषः G. M. वीरो<BR> रसः किमयमित्युत दर्प एषः Veeracharitam.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) alternative; usually a correlative of किं (whether, or);<BR> किमिदं गुरुभिरुपदिष्टमुत धर्मशास्त्रेषु पठितमुत मोक्षप्राप्तियुक्तिरियम्<BR> K. 155; किं येन सृजसि व्यक्तमुत येन बिभर्षि तत् Ku. 6. 23; the<BR> place of उत is also taken by आहो or आहोस्वित्; sometimes आहो,<BR> आहोस्वित् or स्वित् are joined to उत.<BR>——(<i>c</i>) association, connection, (having a cumulative force, ‘and’, ‘also’);<BR> उत बलवानुतावलः;<BR>——(<i>d</i>) interrogation; उत दण्डः पतिष्यति;<BR>——(<i>e</i>) deliberation;<BR>——(<i>f</i>) intensity;<BR>——(<i>g</i>) wishing (especially at the beginning of a sentence followed by<BR> a potential ‘would that’);<BR>——(<i>h</i>) sometimes used as an expletive;<BR>——(<i>i</i>) oft. used for the sake of emphasis especially at the end of a<BR> line after इति or a verb; तदा विद्याद्विवृद्धं सत्त्वमित्युत Bg. 14. 11;<BR> धर्मे नष्टे कुलं कृत्स्नमधर्मोऽभिभवत्युत 1. 40.<BR>—2 With a preceding प्रति = on the contrary, on the other hand; but;<BR> साववादाः सकोपस्य तस्य प्रत्युत दीपकाः Śi. 2. 55; न केवलं<BR> ध्रियते प्रत्युत पर्युपास्यमानस्तिष्ठति Nāg. 5.<BR>—3 With a preceding; किं = how much more or how much less; see किम्.<BR> उत━उत Either━or; एकमेव वरं पुंसामुत राज्यमुताश्रमः<BR> G. M. उत वा or else, and; वा━उतवा, उताहोवा पि━वा either━or;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उताहो
उत + .{@-आहो, -आहोस्वित्@} Used for the sake of emphasis; उताहो हतवीर्यास्ते<BR> बभूवुः पृथिवीक्षितः Rām. 7. 31. 4. शालिहोत्रः किं नु स्याद् उताहोस्विद् राजा नलः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उताहोस्वित्
उत + .{@-आहो, -आहोस्वित्@} Used for the sake of emphasis; उताहो हतवीर्यास्ते<BR> बभूवुः पृथिवीक्षितः Rām. 7. 31. 4. शालिहोत्रः किं नु स्याद् उताहोस्विद् राजा नलः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत|उतं
उत (<i>p. p.</i> of वे) Woven, sewn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उतथ्यः|उतथ्य
उतथ्यः N. of a son of Aṅgiras and elder brother of Bṛhaspati.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उतथ्यानुजः, उतथ्यानुजन्मन्, उतथ्यतनयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उतथ्यानुजः|उतथ्यानुज
उतथ्यः + -अनुजः, -अनुजन्मन् <i>m.</i> Bṛhaspati, teacher of the gods; तथ्यमुतथ्यानुजवज्जगादाग्रे<BR> गदाग्रजम् Śi. 2. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उतथ्यानुजन्मन्
उतथ्यः + -अनुजः, -अनुजन्मन् <i>m.</i> Bṛhaspati, teacher of the gods; तथ्यमुतथ्यानुजवज्जगादाग्रे<BR> गदाग्रजम् Śi. 2. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उतथ्यतनयः|उतथ्यतनय
उतथ्यः + -तनयः N. of Gautama. शूद्रावेदी पतत्यत्रेरुतथ्यतनयस्य<BR> च । Ms. 3. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उतूलाः
उतूलाः N. of a people; Mb.; Vāyu P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्क|उत्कः
उत्क <i>a.</i> [उद्-स्वार्थे कन्; उत्कः = उत्कण्ठितः; उत्क उन्मनाः<BR> P. V. 2. 80. Sk.]<BR>—1 Desirous of, longing for, anxiously wishing for (in comp.); अद्रिसुतासमागमोत्कः<BR> Ku. 6. 95; मानसोत्काः Me. 11; sometimes with an inf.; उत्कन्धरं<BR> द्रष्टुमवेक्ष्य शौरिम् Śi. 4. 18.<BR>—2 Regretting, sad, sorrowful.<BR>—3 Absentminded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कः|उत्क
उत्क + .{@-त्कः@}<BR>—1 Desire.<BR>—2 Opportunity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कता
उत्कता<BR>—1 A state of longing or regret, anxiety.<BR>—2 N. of a plant having aromatic seeds (गजपिप्पली).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कायते
उत्कायते Den. Ā. To long for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कयति
उत्कयति Den. P. To make uneasy; मनस्विनीरुत्कयितुं पटीयसा Śi. 1. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कच
उत्कच <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having the hair erect; as in घटोत्कच.<BR>—2 Having no hair.<BR>—3 Full blown; बभ्राज उत्कचकुमुद्गणवानपीच्यः Bhāg. 3. 23. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कचय्
उत्कचय् To coil the hair upwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0402-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कच्छा
उत्कच्छा A metre of six lines, each line containing eleven syllabic instants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कञ्चुक|उत्कंचुक
उत्कञ्चुक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Without bodice, or jacket.<BR>—2 Without a coat of mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कट्
उत्कट् P.<BR>—1 To start or burst out; टङ्कारोत्कटमुच्चरन्ति नलकाः Mv. 5. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कट|उत्कटं|उत्कटः
उत्कट <i>a.</i> Large, spacious; ज्याजिह्वया वलयितोत्कटकोटिदंष्ट्रम् U. 4. 29.<BR>—2 Powerful, mighty, extraordinary, fierce; अत्युत्कटे च रौद्रे च शत्रौ<BR> यस्य न हीयते Pt. 1. 103; Mv. 1. 39, 5. 33.<BR>—3 Excessive, much; अत्युत्कटैः पापपुण्यैरिहैव फलमश्नुते H. 1. 85.<BR>—4 Prominently visible, conspicuous; ˚लाञ्छनस्य U. 35.<BR>—5 Abounding in, richly endowed with; पादपान् कुसुमोत्कटान् Rām.<BR>—6 Drunk, mad, furious; मदोत्कटः.<BR>—7 Superior, high.<BR>—8 Proud, haughty.<BR>—9 Uneven.<BR>—10 Difficult.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कटः|उत्कट|उत्कटं
उत्कट + .{@-टः@}<BR>—1 A fluid (ichor) dropping from the temples of an elephant in rut.<BR>—2 An elephant in rut.<BR>—3 The plant Saccharum Sara (इक्षुतृण).<BR>—4 Pride, intoxication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कटाः
उत्कट + .{@-टाः@} The plant Laurus Cassia (सैहीलता; Mar. उट्कटारी, सिंहपिंपळी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कटम्
उत्कट + .{@-टम्@} The fragrant bark of Laurus Cassia (Mar. दालचिनी)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कटिका
उत्कटिका, उत्कटुकासनम् Sitting on the hams, squatting, the<BR> manner of sitting of yogis (the legs being outstretched and forming a right angle).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कटुकासनम्
उत्कटिका, उत्कटुकासनम् Sitting on the hams, squatting, the<BR> manner of sitting of yogis (the legs being outstretched and forming a right angle).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कणिका
उत्कणिका<BR>—1 A raised particle.<BR>—2 Desire, longing; Mārk. P. (v. l. for उत्कलिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कण्ठ|उत्कंठ|उत्कण्ठः
उत्कण्ठ <i>a.</i> [उन्नतः कण्ठो यस्य]<BR>—1 Having the neck uplifted, ready, on the point of (doing anything),<BR> in comp.; आज्ञावचनोत्कण्ठः Ś. 2; रथस्वनोत्कण्ठमृगे वाल्मीकीये<BR> तपोवने R. 15. 11.<BR>—2 (Hence) Anxious, eager.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कण्ठः|उत्कण्ठ|उत्कंठ
उत्कण्ठ + .{@-ण्ठः, -ण्ठा@} A mode of sexual enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कण्ठा|उत्कंठा
उत्कण्ठ + .{@-ण्ठः, -ण्ठा@} A mode of sexual enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कण्ठते
उत्कण्ठते Den. Ā.<BR>—1 To be anxious, pine or be sorry for; Ś. 4; Śi. 9. 54.<BR>—2 To yearn, be eagerly desirous of (with gen. or dat.); स्वर्गाय नोत्कण्ठते<BR> V. 3, 4; Mv. 6; उत्कण्ठते च युष्मत्सन्निकर्षस्य U. 6, 6. 21; Māl. 4;<BR> Bk. 5. 75. ━<i>Caus.</i> (उत्कण्ठयति) To create anxiety or<BR> longing, inspire with tender emotions; Bh. 1. 35; Ghaṭ. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कण्ठा|उत्कंठा
उत्कण्ठा<BR>—1 Anxiety, uneasiness (in general); यास्यत्यद्य शकुन्तलेति हृदयं<BR> संस्पृष्टमुत्कण्ठया Ś. 4. 5; अवाप्त˚ Māl. 2. 12 seized with fright,<BR> suddenly startled.<BR>—2 Longing for a beloved person or thing; दृष्टिरधिकं सोत्कण्ठ मुद्वीक्षते Amaru. 28.<BR>—3 Regret, sorrow, missing any thing or person; गाढोत्कण्ठा Māl. 1. 15; Me. 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कण्ठित|उत्कंठित|उत्कण्ठितं
उत्कण्ठित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Anxious, uneasy.<BR>—2 Regretting, grieving for, sorrowful.<BR>—3 Longing for a beloved person or thing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कण्ठिता|उत्कंठिता
उत्कण्ठित + .{@-ता@} A mistress longing for her absent lover or husband, one of<BR> the eight heroines; she is thus defined -आगन्तुं कृतचित्तोऽपि दैवान्नायाति<BR> यत्प्रियः । तदनागमदुःखार्ता विरहोत्कण्ठिता तु सा ॥ S. D. 121. उत्कण्ठितासि<BR> तरले, न हि न हि सखि पिच्छिलः पन्थाः ।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कन्धर|उत्कंधर|उत्कन्धरं
उत्कन्धर <i>a.</i> [उन्नतः कन्धरोऽस्य] Having the neck uplifted;<BR> उत्कन्धरं दारुकमित्युवाच Śi. 4. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कन्धरम्
उत्कन्धर + .{@-रम्@} Bending back the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कम्प्|उत्कंप्
उत्कम्प् €1 Ā. To tremble, quiver, shake. ━<i>Caus.</i> To cause to<BR> tremble, shake, agitate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कम्प|उत्कंप|उत्कम्पः
उत्कम्प <i>a.</i> Trembling; इमां हरिणशावाक्षीं त्रासोत्कम्पपयोधराम्<BR> Rām. 5. 24. 37. श्वास˚ कुचम् Amaru. 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कम्पः|उत्कम्प|उत्कंप
उत्कम्प + .{@-म्पः, -म्पनम्@} Trembling, tremor, agitation; किमधिकत्रासोत्कम्पं<BR> दिशः समुदीक्षसे Amaru. 31; Me. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कम्पनम्
उत्कम्प + .{@-म्पः, -म्पनम्@} Trembling, tremor, agitation; किमधिकत्रासोत्कम्पं<BR> दिशः समुदीक्षसे Amaru. 31; Me. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कम्पिन्|उत्कंपिन्
उत्कम्पिन्<BR>—1 Trembling.<BR>—2 Agitating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्करः|उत्कर
उत्करः See under उत्कॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कर्करः|उत्कर्कर
उत्कर्करः A kind of musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कर्ण|उत्कर्णः|उत्कर्ण्ण
उत्कर्ण <i>a.</i> Having the ears erect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कर्णः|उत्कर्ण|उत्कर्ण्ण
उत्कर्ण + .{@-र्णः@} An erect ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कल|उत्कलं|उत्कलः
उत्कल <i>a.</i> Excessive, piteous; K. 306.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कलः|उत्कल|उत्कलं
उत्कल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 N. of a country, the modern Orissa, or the inhabitants of that country<BR> (pl.); जगन्नाथप्रान्तदेश उत्कलः परिकीर्तितः; see ओड्र; उत्कलादर्शितपथः R. 4. 38.<BR>—2 A fowler, bird-catcher.<BR>—3 A porter (carrying a load with him).<BR>—4 A subdivision of Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कलित|उत्कलितः
उत्कलित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unbound, loosened; स तस्य हस्तोत्कलितस्तदाऽसुरः Bhāg. 7. 8. 26.<BR>—2 Regretting, sorry for.<BR>—3 Opened, blossomed (as flowers); प्रहर्षवेगोत्कलितेक्षणाननाः Bhāg. 10. 43. 20.<BR>—4 Rising, prosperous; पास्यन्त्यपाङ्गोत्कलितस्मितासवम् Bhāg. 10. 39. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कलाप
उत्कलाप <i>a.</i> Having the tail erect and expanded; तीरस्थलीबर्हिभिरुत्कलापैः<BR> प्रस्निग्धकेकैरभिनन्द्यमानम् R. 16. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कलापयति
उत्कलापयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To ask (one) permission to go, take leave of; Pt. 5.<BR>—2 To cause the peacock to spread its plumage.<BR>—3 To cause (one) to be proud, produce conceit by an acknowledgment of merit.<BR>—4 To bring oneʼs wife home from her fatherʼs house; to marry; Ved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कलिका
उत्कलिका<BR>—1 Anxiety in general, uneasiness; जाता नोत्कलिका Amaru. 84; K. 138, 205, 210, 234;<BR> Dk. 17, 20.<BR>—2 Longing for, regretting, missing anything or person.<BR>—3 Wanton sport, dalliance (हेला).<BR>—4 A bud.<BR>—5 A wave; वनावलीरुत्कलिकासहस्र˚ Śi. 3. 70; क्षुभितमुत्कलिकातरलं<BR> मनः ruffled by waves. Māl. 3. 10 (where उत्कलिका also means anxiety);<BR> K. 161; cf. also जलयन्त्रजलाकारकीलालोत्कलिकाकुलाः Śiva B. 14. 33.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उत्कलिकाप्रायम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कलिकाप्रायम्
उत्कलिका + -प्रायम् a variety of prose-composition abounding in compound words<BR> and hard letters; भवेदुत्कलिकाप्रायं समासाढ्यं दृढाक्षरम् Chand. M. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कषणम्
उत्कषणम्<BR>—1 Tearing, pulling up.<BR>—2 Ploughing, drawing through (as a plough); सद्यः सीरोत्कषणसुरभि<BR> क्षेत्रमारुह्य मालम् Me. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्काका
उत्काका A cow calving every year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्काशनम्
उत्काशनम् Ordering, commanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कासः|उत्कास
उत्कासः, -सनम्, उत्कासिका<BR> Hemming, clearing the throat of muscus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कासनम्
उत्कासः, -सनम्, उत्कासिका<BR> Hemming, clearing the throat of muscus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कासिका
उत्कासः, -सनम्, उत्कासिका<BR> Hemming, clearing the throat of muscus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कीलित
उत्कीलित <i>a.</i> Nailed up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कुञ्चिता|उत्कुंचिता
उत्कुञ्चिता, -का<BR> The plant Nigella Indica (Mar. कोळिंजन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

