उत्कुञ्चिता, -का<BR> The plant Nigella Indica (Mar. कोळिंजन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कुटम्
उत्कुटम् [उन्नतः कुटो यत्र] Lying down or sleeping with the<BR> face (or head) upwards, stretching out on the back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कुटक
उत्कुटक <i>a.</i> Stretched on the back with the face upwards.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उत्कुटकासनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

