उत्कूल
उत्कूल <i>a.</i> [उत्क्रान्तः कूलात्]<BR>—1 Going up-hill (as rivers) (Ved.).<BR>—2 Reaching the bank.<BR>—3 Overflowing the bank; K. 303.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कूलम्
उत्कूल + .{@-लम्@} into up-hill; Av. 19. 25. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उत्कूलनिकूल<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कूलनिकूल
