उत्कृष्टभूमः|उत्कृष्टभूम
उत्कृष्ट + -भूमः a good soil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उत्कृष्टवेदनम्
