उत्तर + -अधिकारः, -अधिकारिता, -अधिकारित्वम् right to property, heirship, inheritance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0408-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

