उदकदः|उदकद
उदकम् + -द, -दातृ, -दायिन्, -दानिक + .({@-दः@})<BR>—1 a giver of water to the manes.<BR>—2 an heir, near kinsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकदातृ
