उदकमन्थः|उदकमन्थ
उदकम् + -मन्थः a kind of peeled grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकमेहः|उदकमेह
