उदकमेहिन्
उदकम् + -मेहिन् <i>a.</i> suffering from this disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकवज्रः|उदकवज्र
उदकम् + -वज्रः<BR>—1 a thunder-shower.<BR>—2 thunderbolt in the form of shower; see उदवज्रः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकवाद्यम्
उदकम् + -वाद्यम् ‘water music’ (performed by striking cups filled with<BR> water; cf. जलतरङ्ग), one of the 64 Kalās; Vātsyāyana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकशाकम्
उदकम् + -शाकम् any aquatic herb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकशान्तिः|उदकशान्ति|उदकशांति
उदकम् + -शान्तिः <i>f.</i> sprinkling holy or consecrated water over a sick<BR> person to allay fever; cf. शान्त्युदकम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकशील
उदकम् + -शील <i>a.</i> Practising the उदक ceremony; जपेदुदकशीलः<BR> स्यात् Mb. 12. 123. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकशुद्ध
उदकम् + -शुद्ध <i>a.</i> bathed, purified by ablutions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकसक्तुः|उदकसक्तु
उदकम् + -सक्तुः ground rice moistened with water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकस्पर्शः|उदकस्पर्श
उदकम् + -स्पर्शः<BR>—1 touching different parts of the body with water.<BR>—2 touching water preparatory to or in confirmation of an oath, gift, or promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकहारः|उदकहार
उदकम् + -हारः a water-carrier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकीर्यः|उदकीर्य|उदकीर्य्य|उदकीर्य्यः
उदकीर्यः N. of a tree, करंज; Galedupa arborea, and its fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकेचरः|उदकेचर
उदकेचरः An aquatic animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकेविशीर्ण
उदकेविशीर्ण <i>a.</i> Dried in water; figuratively used for anything<BR> unheard of or impossible; उदकेविशीर्णं त एतत् Mbh. on P. I. 4. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकल
उदक(कि)ल <i>a.</i> [cf. P. V. 2. 97] Watery, containing water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदकिल
उदक(कि)ल <i>a.</i> [cf. P. V. 2. 97] Watery, containing water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदक्य
उदक्य <i>a.</i> [उदकमर्हति दण्डा˚ यत्]<BR>—1 Requiring water.<BR>—2 Being in water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदक्या
उदक्य + .{@-क्या@} A woman in her courses (requiring water for purification).<BR> नोदक्ययाभिभाषेत यज्ञं गच्छेन्न चावृतः Ms. 4. 57, 5. 85. (न)<BR> भुञ्जीतोदक्यया दृष्टम् Bhāg. 6. 18. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदग्र|उदग्रं
उदग्र <i>a.</i> [उद्गतमग्रं यस्य]<BR>—1 With elevated top, projecting, pointing upwards; as in ˚दन्त.<BR> आवर्तनाभिरोजस्वी काञ्चनोरुरुदग्रपात् Bhāg. 4. 21. 16.<BR>—2 Tall, lofty, high, elevated, exalted (fig. also); स वृक्षशिखरोदग्रः<BR> प्रविवेश रसाजलम् Rām. 5. 56. 49 उदग्रदशनांशुभिः Śi. 2. 21, 4. 19;<BR> उदग्रः क्षत्रस्य शब्दः R. 2. 53; उदग्रप्लुतत्वात् Ś. 1. 7<BR> high leaps; Śi. 12. 65; ˚ग्रावन् Dk. 6; विक्रमोदग्रं शिरः<BR> R. 15. 27 exalted; गन्धोदग्रं पुष्पम् 16. 87 rich in odour.<BR>—3 Large, broad, vast, big; अवन्तिनाथोयमुदग्रबाहुः R. 6. 32; Mu. 6. 12.<BR>—4 Noble, good-looking (उदार); हरिन्मणिश्याममुदग्रविग्रहम् Ki. 14. 41.<BR>—5 Advanced in age.<BR>—6 Conspicuous, distinguished, exalted, magnified, increased; स मङ्गलोदग्रतरप्रभावः<BR> R. 2. 71, 9. 64, 13. 50.<BR>—7 Intense, unbearable (as heat); अखिद्यतासन्नमुदग्रतापम् (रविम्) Śi. 4. 12.<BR>—8 Fierce, fearful; संदधे दृशमुदग्रतारकाम् R. 11. 69.<BR>—9 Excited, furious, enraptured; मदोदग्राः ककुद्मन्तः R. 4. 22.<BR>—10 Mighty, strong; तत उदग्र इव द्विरदे Ki. 18. 1; वेगोदग्रं<BR> विषम् V. 5. 18 strong or sharp (deadly).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उदग्रदत्, उदग्रप्लुतत्वम्, उदग्रनखः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदग्रदत्|उदग्रदन्त्
उदग्र + -दत् <i>a.</i> having projecting teeth, large toothed.<BR>(<i>m.</i>) A tusked elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदग्रप्लुतत्वम्
उदग्र + -प्लुतत्वम् A lofty bounding. पश्योदग्रप्लुतत्वाद् वियति बहुतरं<BR> स्तोकमुर्व्यां प्रयाति । Ś. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदग्रनखः
उदग्र + -नखः Folded hand (अञ्जलि); कायेन विनयोपेता मूर्ध्नोदग्रनखेन<BR> च Mb. 7. 54. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदग्रयति
उदग्रयति Den. P. To display prominently; अन्तः शरीरपरिशोषमुदग्रयन्तः<BR> (वृक्षाः) Mu. 6. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदज्
उदज् €1 U. [उद्-अज्]<BR>—1 To drive out, expel, pull off.<BR>—2 To take away; ब्राह्मणा भगवन्तो यो वो ब्रह्मिष्ठः स एता गा उदजताम्<BR> Bṛ. Up. 3. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदजः|उदज
उदजः Driving out or forth (of cattle &c.); P. III. 3. 69. समुदोरजः पशुषु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदाजः|उदाज
उदाजः उदजः पशूनाम । उदाजः क्षत्रियाणाम् Sk. Leading out (soldiers<BR> to war); marching out; Maitrā. S. 1. 10. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदञ्च्|उदंच्
उदञ्च् €1 U. [उद्-अञ्च्]<BR>—1 To raise, elevate, lift or throw up, draw up (as water); एकैकमेव<BR> पादमुदच्य तिष्ठति अश्वः Śat. Br.; उदञ्चिताक्षः Bk. 2. 31; उदञ्चय<BR> मुखं मनाक् Vb. 3. 27.<BR>—2 To utter, send forth, cause to sound; हरिमनुगायति काचिदुदञ्चितपञ्चमरागम् Gīt. 1.<BR>—3 (Intrans.)<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To go up;<BR>——(<i>b</i>) to rise, rise forth; उदञ्चन्मात्सर्यं G. L. 6; Bv. 2. 76;<BR> K. 221; welter up; मूर्धच्छेदादुदञ्चत् Mv. 3. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदक्त
उदक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Raised or lifted up (as water from a well); उदक्तमुदकं कूपात् Sk.<BR>—2 Risen, ascended.<BR>—3 Sent forth, uttered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदङ्कः|उदङ्क|उदंक|उदंकः
उदङ्कः [अञ्च्-घञ् P. III. 3. 123.] —1 A leathern vessel (for oil &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0418-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदच्
उदच्, -उदञ्च् <i>a.</i><BR> (<i>m.</i> उदङ्, <i>n.</i> उदक्, <i>f.</i> उदीची)<BR>—1 Turned or going upwards.<BR>—2 Upper, higher; ˚कूलः; ˚तीरः &c.<BR>—3 Northern, turned towards the north.<BR>—4 Subsequent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदञ्च्|उदंच्
उदच्, -उदञ्च् <i>a.</i><BR> (<i>m.</i> उदङ्, <i>n.</i> उदक्, <i>f.</i> उदीची)<BR>—1 Turned or going upwards.<BR>—2 Upper, higher; ˚कूलः; ˚तीरः &c.<BR>—3 Northern, turned towards the north.<BR>—4 Subsequent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदक्
उदच्, -उदञ्च् + .{@-क्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Above.<BR>—2 Northward, to the north of (with abl.); आचम्योदक् परावृत्य Ms. 3. 217.<BR>—3 Subsequently.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उदगद्रिः, उदगयनम्, उदगावृत्तिः, उदग्दश, उदक्पथः, उदक्प्रवण, उदग्भूमः, उदग्भूमिः, उदङ्मुख<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदगद्रिः|उदगद्रि
उदच् + -अद्रिः the northen mountain, Himālaya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदगयनम्
उदच् + -अयनम् the sunʼs progress north of the equator (= उत्तरायणम् q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदगावृत्तिः|उदगावृत्ति
उदच् + -आवृत्तिः <i>f.</i> return from the north; उदगावृत्तिपथेन नारदः R. 8. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदग्दश
उदच् + -दश <i>a.</i> having its skirts or border turned upwards or towards<BR> the north (as a garment)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदक्पथः|उदक्पथ
