उदक्प्रवण
उदच् + -प्रवण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 inclining or sloping towards the north.<BR>—2 proceeding well (as a sacrifice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदग्भूमः|उदग्भूम
उदच् + -भूमः, -भूमिः<BR>—1 good or fertile soil.<BR>—2 a land sloping towards the north.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदग्भूमिः|उदग्भूमि
उदच् + -भूमः, -भूमिः<BR>—1 good or fertile soil.<BR>—2 a land sloping towards the north.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदङ्मुख
उदच् + -मुख <i>a.</i> facing the north; उत्पतोदङ्मुखः खम् Me. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

