उदीचीन|उदीचीनं
उदीचीन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Turned towards the north.<BR>—2 Northern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदीच्य|उदीच्यं|उदीच्यः
