उदण्ड
उदण्ड <i>a.</i> Breeding many eggs (fish, snake &c.); Gīrvāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदण्डपालः|उदण्डपाल|उदंडपाल|उदंडपालः
उदण्डपालः<BR>—1 a fish.<BR>—2 A kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदधिः|उदधि
