उदकोष्ठः|उदकोष्ठ
उदन् + -कोष्ठः A water-jar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदज|उदजः
