उदपात्री
उदन् + -पात्रम्, -पात्री a water-jug, vessel; Ms. 3. 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदपानः|उदपान|उदपानं
उदन् + -पानः, -पानम् a small pool or pond near a well, or the well itself;<BR> K. 50. यावानर्थ उदपाने सर्वतः संप्लुतोदके Bg. 2. 46. ˚मण्डूकः<BR> (lit.) a frog in a well; (fig.) one who has had no experience of the world<BR> at large, a man of limited ideas who knows only his own neighbourhood;<BR> cf. कूपमण्डूक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदपानम्
उदन् + -पानः, -पानम् a small pool or pond near a well, or the well itself;<BR> K. 50. यावानर्थ उदपाने सर्वतः संप्लुतोदके Bg. 2. 46. ˚मण्डूकः<BR> (lit.) a frog in a well; (fig.) one who has had no experience of the world<BR> at large, a man of limited ideas who knows only his own neighbourhood;<BR> cf. कूपमण्डूक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदपीतिः|उदपीति
