उदन् + -मेहिन् <i>a.</i> Having watery urine or diabetes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदलावणिक|उदलावणिकः
उदन् + -लावणिक <i>a.</i> salted, prepared with brine, briny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदवज्रः|उदवज्र
उदन् + -वज्रः<BR>—1 a thunder shower; water-spout.<BR>—2 thunderbolt in the form of water; भिन्दानो हृदयमसाहि नोदवज्रः Śi. 8. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदवापः|उदवाप
उदन् + -वापः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">Page0420-1</a>]<BR> one who offers waters to the manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदवासः|उदवास
उदन् + -वासः standing or residence in water; सहस्यरात्रीरुदवासतत्परा Ku. 5. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदवासम्
उदन् + -वासः + .({@-सम्@}) a house on the borders of a stream or pond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदवासिन्
उदन् + -वासिन् <i>a.</i> standing in water; K. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदवाह|उदवाहः
उदन् + -वाह <i>a.</i> bringing water; दिवा चित् तमः कृण्वन्ति पर्जन्येनोदवाहेन Rv. 1. 38. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदवाहः|उदवाह
उदन् + -वाह + .({@-हः@}) a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदवाहनम्
उदन् + -वाहनम्<BR>—1 a water-vessel.<BR>—2 A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदवीवधः|उदवीवध
उदन् + -वीवधः^1 a yoke for carrying water.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदशरावः|उदशराव
उदन् + -शरावः a jar filled with water; उदशराव आत्मानवेक्ष्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदशुद्धः|उदशुद्ध
उदन् + -शुद्धः a water-jar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदश्वित्
उदन् + -श्वित् <i>n.</i> [उदकन जलेन श्वयति] butter-milk containing<BR> fifty per cent water (<i>i. e.</i> 2 parts of butter-milk and 1 part of water);<BR> श्रेयस्तैलं हि पिण्याकाद् घृतं श्रेय उदश्वितः Mb. 12. 167. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदस्थानम्
उदन् + -स्थानम् —1 a place full of water.<BR>—2 residence in water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदस्थाली
उदन् + -स्थाली a kettle, vessel for holding water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदहरणः|उदहरण
उदन् + -हरणः a vessel for drawing water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदहार|उदहारः
उदन् + -हार <i>a.</i> fetching or carrying water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदहारः|उदहार
उदन् + -हार + .({@-रः@}) a cloud (water-carrier).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्वत्|उदन्वन्त्
उदन्वत् <i>a.</i> Wavy, watery, abounding in water (Ved.); उदन्वता<BR> परिदीया रथेन Rv. 5. 83. 7; Av. 18. 2. 48. ━<i>m.</i> The ocean; P. VIII. 2. 13.<BR> उदन्वानुदधौ च उदन्वच्छन्ना भूः B. R. 1. 8; R. 4. 52, 58, 10. 6;<BR> नवैरुदन्वानिव चन्द्रपादैः Ku. 7. 73. उदन्वदम्भः परिवीतमूर्तिः<BR> Śi. समाजो नागानां विहरतु महोदन्वति सुखम् Nāg. 5. 26; ते च<BR> प्रापुरुदन्वतं बुबुधे चादिपूरुषः R. 10. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्य
उदन्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Thirsty.<BR>—2 Watery. धारा उदन्या इव Rv. 2. 7. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्या
उदन्य + .{@-न्या@} Thirst; निर्वर्त्यतामुदन्याप्रतीकारः Ve. 6; व्यस्यन्नुदन्यां<BR> शिशिरैः पयोभिः Bk. 3. 40.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उदन्यज<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्यज
उदन्य + -ज <i>a.</i> Ved. born or living in water. उदन्यजेव जेमना मदेरू<BR> Rv. 10. 106. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्यति
उदन्यति Den. P. P. VII. 4. 34.<BR>—1 To be thirsty.<BR>—2 To irrigate. दिशमिव दाहवतीं मरावुदन्यन् Bk. 4. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्यु
उदन्यु <i>a.</i> P. III. 2. 170.<BR>—1 Thirsty, seeking water; न दिव उत्सा उदन्यवे Rv. 5. 57. 1.<BR>—2 Walking in water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदक्
उदक् See under उदञ्च्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्त|उदंत|उदन्तः
उदन्त <i>a.</i> [उद्गतोऽन्तो यस्य] Reaching to the end or border of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्तः|उदन्त|उदंत
उदन्त + .{@-न्तः@} [उद्गतोऽन्तो निर्णयो यस्मात्]<BR>—1 News, intelligence, report, full tidings, account, history; श्रुत्वा<BR> रामः प्रियोदन्तनम् R. 12. 66; आत्मोदन्तं कथयिष्यति K. 132; कान्तोदन्तः<BR> सुहृदुपगतः संगमात्किंचिदूनः Me. 102.<BR>—2 A pure and virtuous man (साधु).<BR>—3 Supporting oneself by sacrificing for others (वृत्तियाजनम्).<BR>—4 One who gets a livelihood by a trade, agriculture (वृत्तियोजने);<BR> see also (Wilson).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्तकः|उदन्तक|उदंतक|उदंतकः
उदन्तकः News, intelligence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्तिका|उदंतिका
उदन्तिका Satisfaction, satiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्त्य|उदंत्य
उदन्त्य <i>a.</i> Living beyond a limit or boundary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदन्य
उदन्य See under उदन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदपास्
उदपास् €4 P. [उद्-अप-अस्] To throw away, give up entirely;<BR> ज्ञाने प्रयासमुदपास्य नमन्त एव Bhāg. 10. 14. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदम्भस्|उदंभस्
उदम्भस् <i>a.</i> Full of water; R. 4. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उदयः|उदय
