उद्बन्ध्|उद्बंध्
उद्बन्ध् €9 P. To hang, tie up; कण्ठमुद्बध्नाति Mu. 6; पादपे<BR> आत्मानमुद्बध्य व्यापादयामि Ratn. 3; Pt. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बद्ध
उद्बद्ध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tied up, hung up.<BR>—2 Checked, interrupted; केचनोद्बद्धवैरेण Bhāg. 10. 85. 43.<BR>—3 Compact, firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बन्ध|उद्बंध|उद्बन्धः
उद्बन्ध <i>a.</i> Loosened; उद्बन्धकेशः R. 16. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बन्धः|उद्बन्ध|उद्बंध
उद्बन्ध + .{@-न्धः, -न्धनम्@}<BR>—1 Tying up, hanging; Rām. 5. 13. 34.<BR>—2 Hanging oneself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बन्धनम्
उद्बन्ध + .{@-न्धः, -न्धनम्@}<BR>—1 Tying up, hanging; Rām. 5. 13. 34.<BR>—2 Hanging oneself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बन्धनी
उद्बन्ध + .{@-न्धनी@} A hook, or a hanging rope; अज्ञानादुपसंपन्ना रज्जुरुद्बन्धनी<BR> यथा Rām. 2. 12. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बन्धकः|उद्बन्धक|उद्बंधकः
उद्बन्धकः N. of a mixed tribe (doing the duty of washermen); cf.<BR> Uśanas:− आयोगवेन विप्रायां जातास्ताम्रोपजीविनः । तस्यैव नृपकन्यायां<BR> जातः सूनिक उच्यते ॥ सूनिकस्य नृपायां तु जाता उद्बन्धकाः स्मृताः । निर्णेजयेयुर्वस्त्राणि<BR> अस्पृशाश्च भवन्त्यतः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बन्धुकः|उद्बन्धुक|उद्बंधुकः
