उद्बाहु
उद्बाहु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having the arms raised, stretching or extending the arms; प्रांशुलभ्ये<BR> फले लोभादुद्बाहुरिव^1 वामनः R. 1. 3.<BR>—2 Having the trunk upraised (as an elephant).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124. note: cf. AP90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बिल
उद्बिल <i>a.</i> Out of the hole (an animal).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बुध्
उद्बुध् €1 P.<BR>—1 To awaken, remind; उद्बुध्यध्वं समनसः सखायः Rv. 10. 101. 1.<BR>—2 To arouse, animate, excite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बुद्ध|उद्बुद्धः
उद्बुद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Awakened, aroused, excited; मनसि उद्बुद्धमात्रो विकारो भावः S. D.<BR>—2 Opened, expanded, full-blown;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-2" target="_blank">Page0430-2</a>]<BR> ˚कनकाब्ज Māl. 1. 40.<BR>—3 Reminded, made to think of.<BR>—4 Recalled to memory (as an object seen before).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उद्बुद्धसंस्कारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

