उद्बुद्ध + -संस्कारः association of ideas, calling anything to mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बोधः|उद्बोध
उद्बोधः, -धनम्<BR>—1 Awakening, reminding.<BR>—2 Recalling to memory, rousing up; ननु कथं रामादिरत्याद्युद्बोधकारणैः<BR> सीतादिभिः सामाजिकानां रत्युद्बोधः S. D. 3; so रस˚.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बोधनम्
उद्बोधः, -धनम्<BR>—1 Awakening, reminding.<BR>—2 Recalling to memory, rousing up; ननु कथं रामादिरत्याद्युद्बोधकारणैः<BR> सीतादिभिः सामाजिकानां रत्युद्बोधः S. D. 3; so रस˚.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्बोधक|उद्बोधकः
