उद्भास्
उद्भास् €1 Ā. To shine. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To light up, illuminate, render beautiful, decorate; ornament; उद्भासितं<BR> मङ्गलसंविधाभिः R. 7. 16; काले घनोद्भासिते Mk. 5. 35.<BR>—2 (fig.) To bring into prominence, elevate, exalt; उद्भासिताखिलखलस्य Bh. 2. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

