उद्भासः Radiance, splendour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्भासिन्
उद्भासिन्, उद्भासुर <i>a.</i> Shining, radiant, splendid; विभूषणोद्भासि<BR> पिनद्धभोगि वा Ku. 5. 78; क्रीडारसोद्भासिनि Mk. 8. 38; Bh. 1. 80; Amaru. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्भासुर
