उद्भिद् + -ज <i>a.</i> (उद्भिज्ज) sprouting, germinating (as a plant).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्भिज्जः|उद्भिज्ज|उद्भिज्जं
