उद्यानम् + -पालः, -पालकः, -रक्षकः a gardener, superintendent or keeper<BR> of a garden; उद्यानपालसामान्यमृतवस्तमुपासते Ku. 2. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0432-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

