उद्युज्
उद्युज् €7 U. (Usually Ā. only)<BR>—1 To excite, make active or quick, stimulate to exertion.<BR>—2 (intrans.) To exert, attempt, strive (with inf.); भवन्तमभियोक्तुमुद्युङ्क्ते Dk. 3.<BR>—3 To prepare.<BR>—4 To join, be in contact with; यथा हस्ती हस्तिन्याः पदेन पदमुद्युजे Av. 6. 70. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0432-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्युक्त|उद्युक्तः
