उद्वाहन|उद्वाहनं
उद्वाहन <i>a.</i> That which raises or draws up (in comp.) घटीयन्त्रं<BR> सलिलोद्वाहनं प्रहेः Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0433-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उद्वाहनम्
उद्वाहन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Lifting up.<BR>—2 Ploughing a field twice.<BR>—3 Marriage.<BR>—4 Anxiety, anxious regret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0433-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

