उद्वाहिन्
उद्वाहिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Raising, drawing up.<BR>—2 Marrying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0433-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

