उद्वाष्प <i>a.</i> Shedding tears; MW.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0433-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

