उद्वेदि
उद्वेदि <i>a.</i> [उन्नता वेदिर्यत्र] Having a raised seat or throne<BR> in it; विमानं नवमुद्वेदि चतुःस्तम्भप्रतिष्ठितम् R. 17. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0435-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

