उद्व्युदस्
उद्व्युदस् €1 P. [उद्-वि-उद्-अस्] To give up wholly or completely;<BR> युष्मत्कथामृतानिषेवक उद्व्युदस्येत् Bhāg. 4. 7. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0435-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

