उन्न|उन्नः
उन्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Wet, wetted, moist.<BR>—2 (fig.) Kind, moved to pity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0435-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

