उपक्रमितव्य
उपक्रमितव्य, उपक्रम्य <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 To be commenced or undertaken.<BR>—2 Curable; अनुपक्रम्य आतङ्कः V. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0441-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

