उपक्षि
उपक्षि €1 P. or <i>pass.</i><BR>—1 To waste away, decay, be exhausted, disappear.<BR>—2 (€2. €6. P.) To dwell near (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0441-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

