उपक्षयः|उपक्षय
उपक्षय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 Waste, decay, loss.<BR>—2 Expenditure.<BR>—3 N. of Śiva; Mb. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0441-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपक्षयम्
