उपसाध्
उपसाध् <i>Caus.</i> P.<BR>—1 To subdue.<BR>—2 To prepare, dress, cook; कलशं प्रोक्षणीयं च यथावदुपसाधयेत्<BR> Bhāg. 11. 27. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0465-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसान्त्व्|उपसांत्व्
