उपसान्त्वनम्
उपसान्त्वनम् Appeasing, pacifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0465-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उपसि
उपसि <i>ind.</i> Ved. In the lap, on the hip; near, at hand; पितुर्न<BR> पुत्र उपसि प्रेष्ठः Rv. 5. 4. 3, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0465-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

