उरस्
उरस् <i>a.</i> Best, excellent.<BR>━<i>n.</i> ({@उरः@}) The breast, bosom; व्यूढोरस्को वृषस्कन्धः R. 1. 13; Ku. 6. 51; उरसि कृ to clasp to the bosom.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उरःकटः, उरःकपाटः, उरःक्षतम्, उरःक्षयः, उरोगामिन्, उरोग्रहः, उरोघातः, उरश्छदः, उरस्त्राणम्, उरोजः, उरोभूः, उरसिजः, उरसिरुहः, उरोभूषणम्, उरःसूत्रिका, उरःस्तम्भः, उरःस्थलम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरःकटः
उरस् + -कटः<BR>—1 the sacrificial thread hung round the neck and upon the breast.<BR>—2 an upper garment (for boys).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

