उरुशर्मन्
उरु + -शर्मन् <i>a.</i> Ved. widely pervading; Vāj. 10. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरुषा
उरु + -षा <i>a.</i> granting much, or granting wide or free scope; महीमस्मभ्यमुरुषामुरु<BR> ज्रयो Rv. 5. 44. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

