उरुवुः, -वुकः, -वूकः<BR> The plant Ricinus Communis. (Mar. एरण्ड).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उरुवूकः|उरुवूक
उरुवुः, -वुकः, -वूकः<BR> The plant Ricinus Communis. (Mar. एरण्ड).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

