उर्वीभृत्
उर्वी + -भृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a king.<BR>—2 a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उर्वीरुहः|उर्वीरुह|उर्व्वीरुह
