उर्व्या
उर्व्या<BR>—1 Greatness.<BR>—2 Protection, security.<BR>—3 Amplitude, vastness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उर्व्यूति
उर्व्यूति <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Yielding great protection. श्रोता हवं गृणत् उर्व्यूतिः Rv. 6. 24. 2.<BR>—2 Able to help far and near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

