उर्वशी + -रमणः, -सहायः, -वल्लभः N. of Purūravas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उर्वशीवल्लभः|उर्वशीवल्लभ|उर्व्वशीवल्लभ|उर्व्वशीवल्लभः
उर्वशी + -रमणः, -सहायः, -वल्लभः N. of Purūravas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उर्वारुः|उर्वारु|उर्व्वारु|उर्व्वारुः
उर्वारुः A kind of cucumber; see इर्वारु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उर्वारुकम्
उर्वारुकम् The fruit of the above. उर्वारुकमिव बन्धनान् मृत्योर्मुक्षीय<BR> माऽमृतात् Rv. 7. 59. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्
उल् (A Sautra root) To burn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलः|उल
उलः<BR>—1 A kind of wild animal; Av. 12. 1. 49.<BR>—2 Half ripe pulses fried over a slight fire; Nigh. (Mar. हुळा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलड्
उलड् €10 P. (उलण्डयति) To throw out, to eject; Dhātupāṭha..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलपः|उलप
उलपः<BR>—1 A creeping plant, a spreading creeper.<BR>—2 Soft grass (कोमलतृणम्), the grass or reed Saccharum Cylindricum;<BR> गोगार्भिणीप्रियनवोलपमालभारिसव्योपकण्ठविपिनावलयो भवन्ति Māl. 9. 2;<BR> Ki. 10. 3; Śi. 4. 8.<BR>—3 A shrub or bush; a wick (Ved.); Rv. 10. 142. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलप्य|उलप्यः
उलप्य <i>a.</i> Belonging to this grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलप्यः|उलप्य
उलप्य + .{@-प्यः@} N. of Rudra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलिः
उलिः, उल्ली <i>f.</i>//pwk gives UlI.<BR>—1 A species of Arurn.<BR>—2 White onion; Nigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्ली
उलिः, उल्ली <i>f.</i>//pwk gives UlI.<BR>—1 A species of Arurn.<BR>—2 White onion; Nigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलिन्दः|उलिन्द|उलिंदः
उलिन्दः<BR>—1 N. of a country.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलुप|उलुपः
उलुप = उलप q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलुपिन्
उलुपिन् <i>m.</i> A guinea pig, porpoise; so उल(लू)पिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलुलिः|उलुलि
उलुलिः Ved. Howling, a howl; an outcry indicative of prosperity;<BR> पृथग् घोषा उलुलयः केतुमन्त उदीरताम् Av. 3. 19. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूकः|उलूक|उलूकं
उलूकः<BR>—1 An owl; नोलूकोप्यवलोकते यदि दिवा सूर्यस्य किं दूषणम् Bh. 2. 93;<BR> त्यजति मुदमुलूकः प्रीतिमांश्चकवाकः Śi. 11. 64. cf. also कथमुलूकशब्द<BR> उलूकवचनः । रलयोः समानवृत्तित्वात् । ŚB. on MS. 9. 4. 22.<BR>—2 N. of Indra.<BR>—3 N. of a Muni (perhaps identical with कणाद, whose वैशेषिकदर्शन<BR> is called औलूक्य-दर्शन).<BR>—4 (pl.) N. of a country and its king who was an ally of the Kurus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूकम्
उलूकः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 N. of the reed Saccharum Cylindricum; see उलप.<BR>—2 Fat; वनिष्टुसन्निधानादुरूकेण वपाभिधानम् । (v. l.) MS. 9. 4. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूकजित्
उलूकः + .{@-जित्@} A crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूकयातुः|उलूकयातु
उलूकः + .{@-यातुः@} A demon in the shape of an owl; उलूकयातुं शुशुलूकयातुम्<BR> Rv. 7. 104. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूखलः|उलूखल|उलूखलं
उलूखलः A staff of Udumbara wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूखलम्
उलूखलः + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 A wooden mortar used for cleansing rice (from the husk &c.); Rv. 1. 28. 6.<BR> अवहननायोलूखलम् Mbh.; वनस्पतिभ्य इत्येवं मुषलोलूखले<BR> हरेत् Ms. 3. 88, 5. 117.<BR>—2 A kind of weapon; Mb. 7. 178. 23.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उलूखलसुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूखलसुतः|उलूखलसुत
उलूखलः + -सुतः the Soma juice pressed out in a (wooden) mortar; Rv. 1. 28. 1-4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूखलकम्
उलूखलकम्<BR>—1 A mortar; Rv. 1. 28. 5.<BR>—2 Bdellium, a gummy substance or the plant which yields it. (Mar. गुग्गुळ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूखलिक
उलूखलिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Pounded in a mortar.<BR>—2 (At the end of comp.) Using as a mortar; दन्त˚ using the teeth<BR> as a mortar; Ms. 6. 17; Y. 3. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0478-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूतः|उलूत
उलूतः A large snake, the Boa (अजगर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूप
उलूप, -पिन्<BR> See उलप, उलुपिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूपिन्
उलूप, -पिन्<BR> See उलप, उलुपिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूपी
उलूपी A Nāga princess. [She was the daughter of the serpent Kauravya.<BR> While one day she was bathing in the Ganges, she happened to see Arjuna,<BR> and being enamoured of his handsome form, she managed to have him conveyed<BR> to her home, the Pātāla, and there induced him to take her as his wife,<BR> which he, after considerable hesitation, consented to do. She bore him<BR> a son named Irāvat. When Arjunaʼs head was cut off by Babhruvāhanaʼs<BR> arrow, it was with her assistance that he was restored to life; see Arjuna.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूलि
उलूलि, -उलूलु <i>a.</i><BR> Crying aloud, noisy (while joyous); तं जायमानं<BR> घोषा उलूलवोऽनूदतिष्ठन् Ch. Up. 3. 19. 3; Lāṭyāyana 4. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूलु
उलूलि, -उलूलु <i>a.</i><BR> Crying aloud, noisy (while joyous); तं जायमानं<BR> घोषा उलूलवोऽनूदतिष्ठन् Ch. Up. 3. 19. 3; Lāṭyāyana 4. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उलूलुध्वनिः
उलूलुध्वनिः The noise of melodious chorus, especially of women, on<BR> happy occasions like the marriage festival; cf. उच्चैरुलूलुध्वनिमुच्चचार<BR> N. See उलुलिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्का
उल्का [Uṇ. 3. 42]<BR>—1 A fiery phenomenon in the sky, a meteor; विरराज काचन समं महोल्कया<BR> Śi. 15. 92; Ms. 1. 38, 4. 103; Y. 1. 145.<BR>—2 A fire-brand, torch; न हि तापयितुं शक्यं सागराम्भस्तृणोल्कया H. 1. 83.<BR>—3 Fire, flame; बाधेतोल्काक्षपितचमरीबालभारो दवाग्निः Me. 55.<BR>—4 N. of a grammar.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उल्काधारिन्, उल्कानवमी, उल्कापातः, उल्कामालिन्, उल्कामुखः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्काधारिन्
उल्का + -धारिन् <i>a.</i> a torch-bearer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्कानवमी
उल्का + -नवमी <i>f.</i> The ninth day of the light half of the month of<BR> Āśvina; (a व्रत is observed on this day.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्कापातः|उल्कापात
उल्का + -पातः the fall of a meteor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्कामालिन्
उल्का + -मालिन् <i>m.</i> N. of one of Śivaʼs attendants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्कामुखः|उल्कामुख
उल्का + -मुखः a demon or goblin (having a mouth of fire); वान्ताश्युल्कामुखः<BR> प्रेतो विप्रो धर्मात्स्वकाच्च्युतात् Ms. 12. 71; Māl. 5. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्कुषी
उल्कुषी<BR>—1 A meteor.<BR>—2 A firebrand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्बम्
उल्बम्, उल्वम्<BR>—1 The bag which surrounds the embryo, यथोल्बेनावृतो गर्भस्तथा तेनेदमावृतम्<BR> Bg. 3. 38; foetus.<BR>—2 The vulva<BR>—3 The womb; Vāj. 19. 76.<BR>—4 A cave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्वम्
उल्बम्, उल्वम्<BR>—1 The bag which surrounds the embryo, यथोल्बेनावृतो गर्भस्तथा तेनेदमावृतम्<BR> Bg. 3. 38; foetus.<BR>—2 The vulva<BR>—3 The womb; Vāj. 19. 76.<BR>—4 A cave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्ब्यम्
उल्ब्यम्<BR>—1 Excess and vitiation of any one of the three humours of the body; <i>i. e.</i><BR> phlegm, bile, or wind (त्रिदोष).<BR>—2 Any calamity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्मुकः|उल्मुक|उल्मुकं
उल्मुकः A firebrand, torch. प्रकाशिताग्राः पार्थेन ज्वलदुल्मुकपाणिना Bm. 1. 890.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्बण|उल्बणः
उल्ब(ल्व)ण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Thick, clotted, copious, abundant (blood &c.); स्यन्नस्वेदकणोल्बणः<BR> Bk. 5. 83. ˚रुधिरम् Mv. 6. 33.<BR>—2 Much, excessive, intense; प्रववर्ष च तत्रैव सहसा तोयमुल्बणम्<BR> Mb. 3. 9. 18. केनचिन्मधुरमुल्बणरागम् Śi. 10. 54, 68, 12. 37; Ku. 7. 84.<BR>—3 Strong, powerful, great; आम्लादिभिरुल्बणैः Bhāg. 3. 31. 7. रिपुरुल्बणभीमभोगभाजां<BR> भुजगानां जननीं जजाप विद्याम् Śi. 20. 41; ˚रसः U. 5. 26 the<BR> heroic sentiment; Dk. 23, 25; K. 299, 302. तेनैवाल्युल्बणं तेषां कटकं<BR> घटिकात्रयम् (विहितम्) Parṇāl. 5. 71.<BR>—4 Manifest, clear; तस्यासीदुल्बणो मार्गः पादपैरिव दन्तिनः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">Page0479-2</a>]<BR> R. 4. 33. विनिशश्वसुरुल्बणं शयाना विकृताक्षिप्तभुजा जजृम्भिरे च Bu. C. 5. 59.<BR>—5 Gaudy, showy; मृगैर्मयूरैश्च समाकुलोल्बणम् Rām. 2. 15. 41; अनुल्बणवेषेण K. 66.<BR>—6 Dreadful; मया सह दहन्तीभिर्दिशश्चक्षुर्भिरुल्बणैः Bhāg. 3. 12. 17.<BR>—7 Sinful; भवत्यल्पफलं कर्म सेवितं नित्यमुल्बणम् । अबुद्धिपूर्वं<BR> धर्मज्ञ कृतमुग्रेण कर्मणा ॥ Mb. 12. 291. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्वण|उल्वणं
उल्ब(ल्व)ण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Thick, clotted, copious, abundant (blood &c.); स्यन्नस्वेदकणोल्बणः<BR> Bk. 5. 83. ˚रुधिरम् Mv. 6. 33.<BR>—2 Much, excessive, intense; प्रववर्ष च तत्रैव सहसा तोयमुल्बणम्<BR> Mb. 3. 9. 18. केनचिन्मधुरमुल्बणरागम् Śi. 10. 54, 68, 12. 37; Ku. 7. 84.<BR>—3 Strong, powerful, great; आम्लादिभिरुल्बणैः Bhāg. 3. 31. 7. रिपुरुल्बणभीमभोगभाजां<BR> भुजगानां जननीं जजाप विद्याम् Śi. 20. 41; ˚रसः U. 5. 26 the<BR> heroic sentiment; Dk. 23, 25; K. 299, 302. तेनैवाल्युल्बणं तेषां कटकं<BR> घटिकात्रयम् (विहितम्) Parṇāl. 5. 71.<BR>—4 Manifest, clear; तस्यासीदुल्बणो मार्गः पादपैरिव दन्तिनः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">Page0479-2</a>]<BR> R. 4. 33. विनिशश्वसुरुल्बणं शयाना विकृताक्षिप्तभुजा जजृम्भिरे च Bu. C. 5. 59.<BR>—5 Gaudy, showy; मृगैर्मयूरैश्च समाकुलोल्बणम् Rām. 2. 15. 41; अनुल्बणवेषेण K. 66.<BR>—6 Dreadful; मया सह दहन्तीभिर्दिशश्चक्षुर्भिरुल्बणैः Bhāg. 3. 12. 17.<BR>—7 Sinful; भवत्यल्पफलं कर्म सेवितं नित्यमुल्बणम् । अबुद्धिपूर्वं<BR> धर्मज्ञ कृतमुग्रेण कर्मणा ॥ Mb. 12. 291. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्बणः|उल्बण
उल्ब(ल्व)ण + .{@-णः@} A particular position of hands in dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्बणम्
उल्ब(ल्व)ण + .{@-णम्@} <i>ind.</i> Much, heavily (as sighing).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उल्बणरसः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्बणरसः
उल्बण + -रसः Valour (वीररस); विकच विकरालोल्बणरसः U. 5. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लः|उल्ल
उल्लः An esculent root, Arum Campanulatum (Mar. श्वेतसुरण). cf. उल्लिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लकः|उल्लक
उल्लकः A particular kind of liquor (Hc. 7).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लकसनम्
उल्ल(लु)कसनम् Horripilation, erection of the hair of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लुकसनम्
उल्ल(लु)कसनम् Horripilation, erection of the hair of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लङ्घ्|उल्लंघ्
उल्लङ्घ् €1 Ā., €10 P.<BR>—1 To leap over, pass over or beyond; उल्लङ्घ्योच्चैःकुचतटभुवम्<BR> Śi. 7. 74, 12. 77.<BR>—2 To transgress, violate, disregard, exceed; Śi. 12. 57; Mu. 1. 10;<BR> गौरवमुल्लङ्घयिष्यति Mu. 4; K. 160; Śi. 3. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लङ्घनम्
उल्लङ्घनम्<BR>—1 Leaping or passing over.<BR>—2 Transgression, violation.<BR>—3 Offence, sin; Ks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लङ्घित|उल्लंघित
उल्लङ्घित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Jumped over or across, passed over or beyond; ˚अध्वन्.<BR>—2 Transgressed, violated; ˚शासन disobedient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लम्बित|उल्लंबित
उल्लम्बित <i>a.</i> Erected, elevated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लल|उल्ललः
उल्लल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shaking, tremulous.<BR>—2 Covered with thick hair, shaggy.<BR>—3 Affected by many diseases.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्ललत्
उल्ललत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shaking, trembling.<BR>—2 Moving irregularly or convulsively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्ललित|उल्ललितः
उल्ललित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Shaken, trembling, agitated.<BR>—2 Raised up, elevated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्ललयति
उल्ललयति Den. P. To jump; spring (shake the body up); तावत्खरः<BR> प्रखरमुल्ललयाञ्चकार Śi. 5. 7; Pt. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लस्
उल्लस् €1 P.<BR>—1 To jump up, sport, play, wave, flutter; उल्लसितासितपताकासहस्रम्<BR> K. 96; Śi. 5. 47, 53.<BR>—2 To flash, shine, glitter, sparkle; उल्लसत्काञ्चनकुण्डलाग्रम् Śi. 3. 5, 33, 5. 55, 16. 61, 20. 56;<BR> (fig.) to brighten or cheer up; K. 189.<BR>—3 To rise, appear forth; अर्कोपलोल्लसितवह्निभिरह्नि तप्ताः Śi. 4. 58, 6. 51, 16. 51;<BR> यदुल्लसितविस्मयाः Māl. 9. 38.<BR>—4 To be reflected;<BR> … उल्लसन्त्यः विदधति दशनानां सीत्कृताविष्कृतानामभिनवरविभासः<BR> पद्मरागानुकारम् Śi. 11. 54.<BR>—5 To blow, open, be expanded. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to jump up or play.<BR>—2 To brighten, illuminate, grace; क्रोधोल्लासितशोणितारुणगदस्योच्छिन्दतः<BR> कौरवानद्यैकं दिवसं ममासि न गुरुर्नाहं विधेयस्तवः ॥ Ve. 1. 12; U. 4.<BR>—3 To divert, delight;<BR>—4 To shake, move K. 22; जिह्वाशतान्युल्लसयन्त्यजस्रम् Ki. 16. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लस
उल्लस <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bright, shining.<BR>—2 Merry, happy,<BR>—3 Going out, issuing, appearing; ˚ता splendour, brilliancy; mirth,<BR> happiness, issuing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0479-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लसत्
उल्लसत् <i>a.</i> Shining forth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उल्लसत्फलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लसत्फलः|उल्लसत्फल
उल्लसत् + -फलः poppy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लसनम्
उल्लसनम्<BR>—1 Happiness, joy.<BR>—2 Horripilation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लसित
उल्लसित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Shining, brilliant, splendid.<BR>—2 Happy, delighted.<BR>—3 Drawn up, uplifted, brandishing (as a sword.) ददृशुरुल्लसितासिलतासिताः Śi. 6. 51.<BR>—4 Gleaming, fluttering: ˚हरिणकेतनः रथः V. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लासः|उल्लास
उल्लासः<BR>—1 Joy, delight; सोल्लासम् U. 6; सकौतुकोल्लासम् U. 2; उल्लासः<BR> फुल्लपङ्केरुहपटलपतन्मत्तपुष्पंधयानाम् S. D.<BR>—2 Light, splendour.<BR>—3 (In Rhet.) A figure of speech in which a reference is made to the merits<BR> or demerits of one thing by comparing or contrasting the merits or demerits<BR> of another; अन्यदीयगुणदोषप्रयुक्तमन्यस्य गुणदोषयोराधानमुल्लासः<BR> R. G. for example see R. G. <i>ad loc.</i>; cf. Candr. 5. 131, 133.<BR>—4 A division of a book, such as chapter, section &c.; as the ten Ullāsas<BR> of the Kāvyaprakāśa.<BR>—5 Beginning, commencement.<BR>—6 Growth, increase; न तेषां युगपद्राजन् ह्रास उल्लास एव वा Bhāg. 7. 1. 7.<BR>━<i>a.</i> Pleasing, delightful; मुक्ताफलैश्चिदुल्लासैः Bhāg. 9. 11. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लासन
उल्लासन <i>a.</i> Causing to leap or dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लासनम्
उल्लासन + .{@-नम्@} Splendour<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लासना
उल्लासन + .{@-ना@} Causing to come forth or appear; B. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लासित
उल्लासित <i>a.</i> Delighted, rejoicing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लासिन्
उल्लासिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Delighted सुमनसामुल्लासिनि मानसे Candr.<BR>—2 Bright, splendid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लाघ|उल्लाघः
उल्लाघ <i>a.</i> [P. V. III. 2. 55]<BR>—1 Recovered from sickness, convalescent.<BR>—2 Dexterous, clever, skilful.<BR>—3 Pure.<BR>—4 Happy, delighted.<BR>—5 Wicked.<BR>—6 Black.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लाघः|उल्लाघ
उल्लाघ + .{@-घः@} Black pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लाघता
उल्लाघता Wholesomeness, health.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लप्
उल्लप् €1 P. To remove, allay; दीर्घंदारुणमपि संतापं झटित्युल्लपता U. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लापः|उल्लाप
उल्लापः<BR>—1 Speech, words; श्रुता मयार्यपुत्रस्योल्लापाः U. 3. जीवितनिरपेक्ष<BR> इव अस्या उल्लापः Nāg. 2.<BR>—2 Insulting words, taunting speech, taunt; खलोल्लापाः सोढाः Bh. 3. 6.<BR>—3 Calling out in a loud voice.<BR>—4 Change of voice by emotion, sickness &c.<BR>—5 A hint, suggestion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लापिक|उल्लापिकः
उल्लापिक <i>a.</i> Betraying, indicating; लाजोल्लापिकधूमाढ्यं Mb. 5. 191. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लापिकः|उल्लापिक
उल्लापिक + .{@-कः@} An upper layer; लाजोल्लापिकभूषिताः Mb. 13. 98. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लापिन्
उल्लापिन् <i>a.</i> Calling out; indicating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लाप्यम्
उल्लाप्यम् A kind of drama; see S. D. 545.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लिख्
उल्लिख् €6 P.<BR>—1 To scratch, cut up, scrape, tear or rip up, scarify; जलदसंहतिमुल्लिखन्त्यः<BR> Śi. 5. 20: K. 30; to furrow (as ground); Mv. 1. 20.<BR>—2 To rub or grind against; विषाणोल्लिखितस्कन्धम् H. 3. 139; K. 14.<BR>—3 To grind down; polish; संस्कारोल्लिखितो महामणिः Ś. 6. 5; R. 6. 32;<BR> त्वष्टा विवस्वन्तमिवोल्लिलेख Ki. 17. 48.<BR>—4 To carve.<BR>—5 To paint, write, draw in a picture; इति स्वहस्तोल्लिखितश्च मुग्धया<BR> रहस्युपालभ्यत चन्द्रशेखरः Ku. 5. 58.<BR>—6 To bear, raise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लिखित|उल्लिखितः
उल्लिखित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Scratched, scraped &c.<BR>—2 Thrown up, tossed.<BR>—3 Written over or above.<BR>—4 Pared, made thin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लेखः|उल्लेख
उल्लेखः<BR>—1 Allusion, mention.<BR>—2 Description, utterance, pronunciation.<BR>—3 Boring or digging out.<BR>—4 (In Rhetoric) A figure of speech in which an object is described according<BR> to the different impressions caused by its appearance; बहुभिर्बहुधोल्लेखादेकस्योल्लेख<BR> इष्यते । स्त्रीभिः कामोऽर्थिभिः स्वर्द्रुः कालः शत्रुभिरैक्षि सः Candr. 5. 19;<BR> cf. S. D. 682.<BR>—5 Rubbing, scratching, tearing up; खुरमुखोल्लेख K. 191; कुट्टिम˚ 232.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लेखनम्
उल्लेखनम्<BR>—1 Rubbing, scratching, scraping &c.<BR>—2 Digging up; Y. 1. 188; उल्लेखनेन भूमिः शुध्यति Ms. 5. 124.<BR>—3 Vomiting.<BR>—4 Mention, allusion, utterance.<BR>—5 Raising up, elevating.<BR>—6 Writing, painting.<BR>—7 Marking out by lines (the स्थण्डिल &c. in a sacrifice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लेखिन्
उल्लेखिन् <i>a.</i> Tearing; K. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लिङ्गित|उल्लिंगित
उल्लिङ्गित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Famous, known.<BR>—2 Made manifest (by marks or characteristics); सलेशमुल्लिङ्गितशात्र<BR> वोङ्गितः Ki. 14. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्ली
उल्ली An onion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लीढ
उल्लीढ <i>a.</i> Rubbed, polished; मणिः शाणोल्लीढः Bh. 2. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लुञ्चनम्
उल्लुञ्चनम्<BR>—1 Plucking out, cutting; पादकेशांशुककरोल्लुञ्चनेषु पणान् दश<BR> (दमः); Y. 2. 217.<BR>—2 Plucking or pulling out the hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लुण्ठनम्
उल्लुण्ठनम्, उल्लुण्ठा<BR>—1 Rolling, wallowing.<BR>—2 Irony; धीराधीरा तु सोल्लुण्ठभाषणैः खेदयेदमुम् S. D. 105; सोल्लुण्ठम्<BR> ironically, often occurring as a stage-direction in plays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लुण्ठा|उल्लुंठा
उल्लुण्ठनम्, उल्लुण्ठा<BR>—1 Rolling, wallowing.<BR>—2 Irony; धीराधीरा तु सोल्लुण्ठभाषणैः खेदयेदमुम् S. D. 105; सोल्लुण्ठम्<BR> ironically, often occurring as a stage-direction in plays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लुण्ठित
उल्लुण्ठित <i>a.</i> Rubbed against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लू
उल्लू^1 <i>a.</i> Cutting up.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170131. note: ud + lU..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लोचः|उल्लोच
उल्लोचः A canopy, an awning. न मञ्चको न चोल्लोचो न पताका न<BR> च ध्वजः Śiva B. 12. 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लोल|उल्लोलः
उल्लोल^1 <i>a.</i> Violently moving, excessively tremulous; ˚स्खलित<BR> Māl. 5. 3; ˚कल्लोल K. 302 high or surging; Mv. 5. 2; लोल˚ violently<BR> agitated or exercised; U. 3. 36.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170209. note: as adj. it should be without masc. ending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्लोलः|उल्लोल
उल्लोल + .{@-लः@} A large wave or surge. उल्लोलसंक्रान्तविलोलमूर्तिरुद्याति<BR> सिन्धोरुडुचक्रवर्ती Rām. Ch. 6. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्व|उल्वं
उल्व, उल्वण See उल्ब, उल्बण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उल्वण|उल्वणं
उल्व, उल्वण See उल्ब, उल्बण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उवटः|उवट
उवटः N. of a commentator on ऋग्वेद प्रातिशाख्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उवरकः
उवरकः A kind of dwelling for the ascetics, a kind of store-room;<BR> (cf. Pāli ओवरक, Mar. ओवरी ?). (Ind. Ant. Vol. VII, Kuḍā inscriptions No. 8.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशत्|उशन्त्
उशत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Beautiful; तेनायं स उशत्तमः Bhāg. 1. 3. 14. जायेव पत्य<BR> उशती सुवासाः Mbh. 1. 1. 1.<BR>—2 Dear, beloved; बद्धः स्वकर्मभिरुशत्तम तेऽड्घ्रिमूलम् Bhāg. 7. 9. 16.<BR>—3 Pure, sinless; विवेकेनोशतात्मना Bhāg. 7. 7. 24; उशतीं गिरम् 4. 2. 13.<BR>—4 Impure, obscene; वर्जयेदुशतीं वाचम् Mb. 12. 235. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशनस्
उशनस् <i>m.</i> [वश्-कनसि संप्र˚ Uṇ. 4. 238] (Nom. sing. उशना;<BR> Voc. sing. उशनन्, उशन, उशनः) N. of Śukra, regent of the planet<BR> Venus, son of Bhṛgu and preceptor of the Asuras. In the Vedas he has<BR> the epithet (or patronymic name) <i>Kāvya</i> given to him, probably because<BR> he was noted for his wisdom; मित्रावरुणावुशनां काव्यम् (अवथः)<BR> Av. 4. 29. 6. cf. कवीनामुशना कविः Bg. 10. 37; He is also known<BR> as a writer on civil and religious law (Y. 1. 4). and as an authority on<BR> civil polity; शास्त्रमुशनसा प्रणीतम् Pt. 5; अध्यापितस्योशनसापि<BR> नीतिम् Ku. 3. 6.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उशनःप्रियम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशनःप्रियम्
उशनस् + -प्रियम् A kind of gem Called गोमेद (वैडूर्य ?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशना
उशना <i>ind.</i> Ved. Joyfully, willingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशाना
उशाना Ved.<BR>—1 Wish, desire,<BR>—2 The plant from which Soma juice is produced.<BR>—3 N. of a wife of Rudra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशिज्
उशिज् Ved.<BR>—1 Desiring, striving earnestly.<BR>—2 Devoted to, willing. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 Ghee or clarified butter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशिजः|उशिज
उशिजः N. of the father of Kakṣīvat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशी
उशी Wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशेन्य
उशेन्य Ved. To be wished for or desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशती
उशती<BR>—1 Injurious talk.<BR>—2 Cutting speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशीनराः
उशीनराः (pl.) N. of a country (Central India ? MW.) and its inhabitants.<BR> सोवसदुशीनरेषु Kauṣ. Up. 4. 1. ━<i>f.</i> A queen of that people;<BR> य आवहदुशीनराण्या अनः Av. 10. 59. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशीरः|उशीर|उशीरं
उशी(षी)रः, -रम्, उशी(षी)रकम् The fragrant root<BR> of the plant Andropogon Muricatus (वरिणमूल, Mar. काळावाळा);<BR> स्तनन्यस्तोशीरम् Ś. 3. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषीरः|उषीर|उषीरं
उशी(षी)रः, -रम्, उशी(षी)रकम् The fragrant root<BR> of the plant Andropogon Muricatus (वरिणमूल, Mar. काळावाळा);<BR> स्तनन्यस्तोशीरम् Ś. 3. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशीरम्
उशी(षी)रः, -रम्, उशी(षी)रकम् The fragrant root<BR> of the plant Andropogon Muricatus (वरिणमूल, Mar. काळावाळा);<BR> स्तनन्यस्तोशीरम् Ś. 3. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशीरकम्
उशी(षी)रः, -रम्, उशी(षी)रकम् The fragrant root<BR> of the plant Andropogon Muricatus (वरिणमूल, Mar. काळावाळा);<BR> स्तनन्यस्तोशीरम् Ś. 3. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषीरकम्
उशी(षी)रः, -रम्, उशी(षी)रकम् The fragrant root<BR> of the plant Andropogon Muricatus (वरिणमूल, Mar. काळावाळा);<BR> स्तनन्यस्तोशीरम् Ś. 3. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशीरी
उशी(षी)रः, -रम्, उशी(षी)रकम् + .{@-री@} A sort of grass, a small sort of Saccharum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उशीरिक
उशीरिक <i>a.</i> Trading in or selling Uśīra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्
उष् €1 P. (ओषति, उवोष, ओषाञ्चकार, ओषित-उषित-उष्ट)<BR>—1 To burn, consume; ओषाञ्चकार कामाग्निर्दशवक्त्रमहर्निशम् Bk. 6. 1, 14. 62;<BR> Ms. 4. 189.<BR>—2 To punish, chastise; दण्डेनैव तमप्योषेत् Ms. 9. 273.<BR>—3 To kill, injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष|उषं|उषः
उष <i>a.</i> Burning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषः|उष|उषं
उष + .{@-षः@}<BR>—1 Early morning, dawn, day-break.<BR>—2 A libidinous man,<BR>—3 Saline earth.<BR>—4 Bdellium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषणम्
उषणम्<BR>—1 Black pepper.<BR>—2 Ginger.<BR>—3 The root Piper Longum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषणा
उषणम् + .{@-णा@}<BR>—1 Piper Longum.<BR>—2 Piper Chaba (चविक).<BR>—3 Dried ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषपः|उषप
उषपः<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषित|उषितः
उषित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Burnt, consumed.<BR>—2 (fr. वस्) Dwelt, fixed, remaining in or on; stale.<BR>—3 Quick, expeditious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषितम्
उषित + .{@-तम्@} Habitation. ˚गवीन (= आशितंगवीन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ण|उष्णः
उष्ण <i>a.</i> [उष्-नक् Uṇ. 3. 2.]<BR>—1 Hot, warm; ˚अंशुः, ˚करः &c.<BR>—2 Sharp, strict, active; आददे नातिशीतोष्णो नभस्वानिव दक्षिणः;<BR> R. 4. 8 (where उष्ण has sense 1 also).<BR>—3 Pungent, acrid (as a रस).<BR>—4 Clever, sharp.<BR>—5 Choleric, warm, passionate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णः|उष्ण
उष्ण + .{@-ष्णः, -ष्णम्@}<BR>—1 Heat, warmth.<BR>—2 The hot season (ग्रीष्म); उष्णे वर्षति शीते वा मारुते वाति वा<BR> भृशम् । न कुर्वीतात्मनस्त्राणं गोरकृत्वा तु शक्तितः ॥ Ms. 11. 113.<BR>—3 Sunshine.<BR>—4 A deep or feverish sigh. तप्यमानामिवोष्णेन मृणालीमचिरोद्धृताम्<BR> Rām. 5. 19. 17.<BR>—5 Sorrow, distress (of separation, bereavement &c.); उष्णार्दितां (नीलकण्ठीमिव)<BR> Rām. 5. 5. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णम्
उष्ण + .{@-ष्णः, -ष्णम्@}<BR>—1 Heat, warmth.<BR>—2 The hot season (ग्रीष्म); उष्णे वर्षति शीते वा मारुते वाति वा<BR> भृशम् । न कुर्वीतात्मनस्त्राणं गोरकृत्वा तु शक्तितः ॥ Ms. 11. 113.<BR>—3 Sunshine.<BR>—4 A deep or feverish sigh. तप्यमानामिवोष्णेन मृणालीमचिरोद्धृताम्<BR> Rām. 5. 19. 17.<BR>—5 Sorrow, distress (of separation, bereavement &c.); उष्णार्दितां (नीलकण्ठीमिव)<BR> Rām. 5. 5. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णः|उष्ण
उष्ण + .{@-ष्णः@} An onion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णा
