उषोबुधः|उषोबुध
उषस् + -बुध + .({@-धः@})<BR>—1 fire; U. 6.<BR>—2 a child.<BR>—3 N. of a tree (चित्रक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषासानक्तम्
उषासानक्तम् Ved. Dawn and night; उषासानक्ता पुरुधा विदाने Rv. 1. 122. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषस्य
उषस्य <i>a.</i> Sacred to the dawn. Vāj. 24. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषा
उषा [ओषत्यन्धकारम् उष्-क]<BR>—1 Early morning, dawn; उषामुषां श्रेयसीं धेह्यस्मै Av. 12. 2. 45.<BR>—2 Morning light.<BR>—3 Twilight.<BR>—4 Saline earth.<BR>—5 A cow.<BR>—6 Night.<BR>—7 A boiler, cooking vessel (स्थाली); cf. उखा.<BR>—8 N. of a wife of Bhava (who was a manifestation of Rudra). —9 N. of a<BR> daughter of the demon Bāṇa and wife of Aniruddha. [She beheld Aniruddha<BR> in a dream and became passionately enamoured of him. She sought the assistance<BR> of her friend Chitralekhā, who advised her to have with her the portraits<BR> of all young princes living round about her. When this was done, she recognized<BR> Aniruddha and had him carried to her city, where she was married to him;<BR> see अनिरुद्ध also]. ━<i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Early in the morning.<BR>—2 At night.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उषाकलः, उषापतिः, उषारमणः, उषेशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषाकलः|उषाकल
उषा + -कलः a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषापतिः|उषापति
उषा + -पतिः, -रमणः, -ईशः N. of Aniruddha, husband of Uṣā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषारमणः|उषारमण
उषा + -पतिः, -रमणः, -ईशः N. of Aniruddha, husband of Uṣā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषेशः|उषेश
उषा + -पतिः, -रमणः, -ईशः N. of Aniruddha, husband of Uṣā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषङ्गुः|उषङ्गु|उषंगु|उषंगुः
उषङ्गुः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषती
उषती = उशती q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उषीर|उषीरं|उषीरः
उषीर = उशीर q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रः|उष्ट्र
उष्ट्रः [उष्-ट्रन्-किच्च Uṇ. 4. 161.]<BR>—1 Camel; अथोष्ट्रवामीशतवाहितार्थम् R. 5. 32; Ms. 3. 162, 4. 120, 11. 202.<BR>—2 A buffalo.<BR>—3 A bull with a hump.<BR>—4 A cart or carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्री
उष्ट्रः + .{@-ष्ट्री@}<BR>—1 A she-camel.<BR>—2 An earthen vessel in the shape of a camel.<BR>—3 Bignonia Spathacea (Mar. मेडशिंगी). [cf. Pers. <i>ushtar</i>; Zend. <i>ustra</i>.]<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उष्ट्राक्षः, उष्ट्रकर्णिका, उष्ट्रकाण्डी, उष्ट्रक्रोशिन्, उष्ट्रगोयुगम्, उष्ट्रग्रीवः, उष्ट्रशिरोधरः, उष्ट्रनिषदनम्, उष्ट्रपादिका, उष्ट्रप्रमाणः, उष्ट्रयानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्राक्षः|उष्ट्राक्ष
उष्ट्रः + -अक्षः A camel-eyed (horse) उष्ट्राक्षाः प्रियदर्शनाश्च सुभगाः<BR> श्वासैः सुगन्धैश्च ये; Bhojaʼs Śālihotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रकर्णिका
उष्ट्रः + -कर्णिका (pl.) N. of a country or its inhabitants, in the south.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रकाण्डी
उष्ट्रः + -काण्डी A<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">Page0482-2</a>]<BR> thistle dear to camels, Echinops echinatus (Mar. उंटकटारी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रक्रोशिन्
उष्ट्रः + -क्रोशिन् <i>a.</i> making a noise like a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रगोयुगम्
उष्ट्रः + -गोयुगम् a couple of camels; यथा गोस्तद्वदुष्ट्रस्य युगम् उष्ट्रगोयुगम्<BR> Mbh. on P. V. 2. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रग्रीवः|उष्ट्रग्रीव
उष्ट्रः + -ग्रीवः, -शिरोधरः piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रशिरोधरः|उष्ट्रशिरोधर|उष्ट्रशिरोधरं
उष्ट्रः + -ग्रीवः, -शिरोधरः piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रनिषदनम्
उष्ट्रः + -निषदनम् A particular posture among Yogins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रपादिका
उष्ट्रः + -पादिका Jasminum Zambac (Mar. मोगरा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रप्रमाणः|उष्ट्रप्रमाण
उष्ट्रः + -प्रमाणः A kind of fabulous eight-footed animal शरभ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रयानम्
उष्ट्रः + -यानम् camel-litter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ट्रिका
उष्ट्रिका<BR>—1 A she-camel.<BR>—2 An earthen wine-vessel of the shape of a camel; पञ्चानामुष्ट्रिकाणां<BR> पूरणो घटः Mbh. on P. V. 2. 48. धूर्भङ्गसंक्षोभविदारितोष्ट्रिका Śi. 12. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्ण|उष्णः
