उष्णक|उष्णकः
उष्ण, उष्णक, उष्मन् see under उष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्मन्
उष्ण, उष्णक, उष्मन् see under उष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णिह्
उष्णिह् <i>f.</i> also उष्णिहा [Mbh. on P. IV. 1. 1.] (Nom. उष्णिक् P. III. 2. 59.)<BR>—1 A Vedic metre of 3 Pādas, the first two containing 8 syllables each,<BR> and the third 12.<BR>—2 A classical metre of 4 Pādas with 7 syllables in each.<BR>—3 A brick sacred to उष्णिह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णिहा
उष्णिह् <i>f.</i> also उष्णिहा [Mbh. on P. IV. 1. 1.] (Nom. उष्णिक् P. III. 2. 59.)<BR>—1 A Vedic metre of 3 Pādas, the first two containing 8 syllables each,<BR> and the third 12.<BR>—2 A classical metre of 4 Pādas with 7 syllables in each.<BR>—3 A brick sacred to उष्णिह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णीषः|उष्णीष|उष्णीषं
उष्णीषः, -षम्<BR> [उष्णमीषते हिनस्ति ईष् क Tv.]<BR>—1 Anything wound round the head. रक्तोष्णीषधराः स्त्रियः Rām. 6. 80. 6.<BR> उष्णीषबन्धस्थाने ललाटोपरि पट्टबन्धरेखा.<BR>—2 Hence, a turban, diadem, crownet; बलाकापाण्डुरोष्णीषम् Mk. 5. 19.<BR> हेमासने कृतोष्णीषमभिषिच्य नृपं व्यधात् Bm. 1. 678. उष्णीषेणैव<BR> शुचिना व्यभादुत्तंसधारिणा Śiva B. 21. 29 and 22. 8. ˚पट्ट K. 106;<BR> Ratn. 1. 4.<BR>—3 A distinguishing mark.<BR>—4 A characteristic mark (of hair) on the head of a Buddha which indicates<BR> his future sanctity उष्णीषः स्फुट एष मूर्धनि विभात्यूर्णेयमन्तर्भुवोः Nāg. 1. 17.<BR>—5 The top of a building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णीषम्
उष्णीषः, -षम्<BR> [उष्णमीषते हिनस्ति ईष् क Tv.]<BR>—1 Anything wound round the head. रक्तोष्णीषधराः स्त्रियः Rām. 6. 80. 6.<BR> उष्णीषबन्धस्थाने ललाटोपरि पट्टबन्धरेखा.<BR>—2 Hence, a turban, diadem, crownet; बलाकापाण्डुरोष्णीषम् Mk. 5. 19.<BR> हेमासने कृतोष्णीषमभिषिच्य नृपं व्यधात् Bm. 1. 678. उष्णीषेणैव<BR> शुचिना व्यभादुत्तंसधारिणा Śiva B. 21. 29 and 22. 8. ˚पट्ट K. 106;<BR> Ratn. 1. 4.<BR>—3 A distinguishing mark.<BR>—4 A characteristic mark (of hair) on the head of a Buddha which indicates<BR> his future sanctity उष्णीषः स्फुट एष मूर्धनि विभात्यूर्णेयमन्तर्भुवोः Nāg. 1. 17.<BR>—5 The top of a building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्णीषिन्
उष्णीषिन् <i>a.</i> [उष्णीष-इनि] Wearing a diadem; नमउष्णीषिणे<BR> गिरिचराय Vāj. 16. 22; K. 229. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 A type of round building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्मम्
उष्मम्, उष्प &c. See under उष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उष्प
उष्मम्, उष्प &c. See under उष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्र|उस्रः
उस्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Relating to, or seen in, the morning.<BR>—2 Bright, shining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रः|उस्र
उस्र + .{@-स्रः@}<BR>—1 A ray (of light), beam; सर्वैरुस्रैः समग्रैस्त्वमिव नृपगुणैर्दीप्यते<BR> सप्तसप्तिः M. 2. 13; R. 4. 66; Ki. 5. 31, 34. शीर्षपुष्पोच्छ्रितैरुस्रैरुत्तंसितशिरोरुहाम्;<BR> Parṇāl. 4. 36.<BR>—2 A bull; Rv. 6. 12. 4.<BR>—3 A god.<BR>—4 The sun.<BR>—5 A day.<BR>—6 The two Aśvinīkumāras; Rv. 2. 39. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रा
उस्र + .{@-स्रा@}<BR>—1 Morning, dawn.<BR>—2 Light; bright sky.<BR>—3 A cow; स्वयमुस्राश्च दुह्यन्ते Mb. 12. 263. 31.<BR>—4 The earth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उस्रधन्वन्, उस्रयामन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रधन्वन्
उस्र + -धन्वन् <i>a.</i> having a bright bow. ━<i>m.</i> N. of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रयामन्
उस्र + -यामन् <i>a.</i> going out early in the morning (as the Aśvins); Rv. 7. 74. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रि
उस्रि <i>a.</i> Going (Ved.); Rv. 9. 65. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रिकः|उस्रिक
उस्रिकः [अल्पार्थे कन्]<BR>—1 A small ox; Rv. 1. 190. 5.<BR>—2 An old ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रिका
उस्रिकः + .{@-का@} A cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रिय|उस्रियः
उस्रिय <i>a.</i> Belonging to or coming from, an ox or cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रियः|उस्रिय
उस्रिय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 An ox.<BR>—2 A god;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्रिया
उस्रिय + .{@-या@}<BR>—1 A cow.<BR>—2 Brightness, light.<BR>—3 A calf.<BR>—4 Milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उस्वित्
उस्वित् <i>ind.</i> Or तत्रेमं क उपासीरन् क उस्विदनुशेरते Bhāg. 3. 7. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उह्
उह् P.<BR>—1 (ओहति, उवोह, उहित) To hurt or give pain.<BR>—2 To kill, destroy; see ऊह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उह
उह, उहह <i>ind.</i> An interjection of calling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उहह
उह, उहह <i>ind.</i> An interjection of calling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उहापोहः
उ(ऊ)हापोहः An additional moulding; तस्मात्तु शिल्पिभिः प्राज्ञैरूहापोहान्<BR> न योजयेत् (Māna. 7. 268-9)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहापोहः|ऊहापोह
उ(ऊ)हापोहः An additional moulding; तस्मात्तु शिल्पिभिः प्राज्ञैरूहापोहान्<BR> न योजयेत् (Māna. 7. 268-9)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उहारः|उहार
उहारः A tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उहूः
उहूः <i>f.</i> [ऊह्-कू] A word expressive of sorrow or dejection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उह्रः|उह्र
उह्रः A bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊः
ऊः [अवतीति, अव-क्विप् ऊठ्]<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 The moon.<BR>—3 A protector; cf. ऊः परेतोऽण्डजस्त्वष्टा विवस्वानग्निसारथिः । वह्निर्निशाकरः<BR> पूर्णो दरिद्री सरमाधिपः ॥ Enm. ━<i>ind.</i><BR>—1 A particle used to introduce a subject.<BR>—2 An interjection of<BR>——(<i>a</i>) calling;<BR>——(<i>b</i>) of compassion;<BR>——(<i>c</i>) protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊखरः|ऊखर
ऊखरः (pl.) N. of a Śaiva sect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊखरजम्
ऊखरजम्<BR>—1 Salt prepared from saline earth.<BR>—2 Nitre or saltpetre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढ|ऊढः
ऊढ See under वह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊत|ऊतं
ऊत See under अव्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊतिः|ऊति
ऊतिः <i>f.</i> [अव्-क्तिन् P. III. 3. 97]<BR>—1 Weaving, sewing (fr. वे).<BR>—2 Protection; मघवञ्छग्धि तव तन्न ऊतिभिः Mahānār. Up. 20. 4.<BR>—3 Enjoyment.<BR>—4 Sport, play अवैति जन्तुः कुमनीष ऊतीः Bhāg. 1. 3. 37, 8. 5. 44.<BR>—5 Favour, kindness.<BR>—6 Aid, assistance, help.<BR>—7 The money given to a tailor for sewing.<BR>—8 Wish, desire; मन्वन्तराणि सद्धर्मऊतयः कर्मवासनाः Bhāg. 2. 10. 4.<BR>—9 Red texture; tissue; अत्र सर्गो विसर्गश्च स्थानं पोषणमूतयः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 10. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊधस्
ऊधस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 An udder (changed to ऊधन् in Bah. comp. ऊधसोऽनड् P. V. 4. 131.)<BR> भुवं कोष्णेन कुण्डोध्नी मेध्येनावभृथादपि R. 1. 84.<BR>—2 A covered secret place to which only friends are admitted.<BR>—3 The bosom.<BR>—4 The breast of a cattle.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऊधोवती<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊधोवती
ऊधस् + -वती (a female, female animal) with full udders; Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊधन्यम्
ऊधन्यम् or ऊधस्यम् Milk (produced from the udder); ऊधस्यमिच्छामि<BR> तवोपभोक्तुम् R. 2. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊधस्यम्
ऊधन्यम् or ऊधस्यम् Milk (produced from the udder); ऊधस्यमिच्छामि<BR> तवोपभोक्तुम् R. 2. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊन्
ऊन् €10 P. To decrease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊन|ऊनं
ऊन <i>a.</i> [ऊन्-हानौ अच् Uṇ. 3. 2]<BR>—1 Wanting, deficient, defective; किंचिदूनमनूनर्धेः शरदामयुतं<BR> ययौ R. 10. 1; incomplete, insufficient.<BR>—2 Less than (in number, size or degree); ऊनद्विवर्षं निखनत् Y. 3. 1<BR> less than two years old; ऊनं वाभ्यधिकं वापि Y. 2. 295.<BR>—3 Fewer, smaller.<BR>—4 Weaker, inferior; ऊनं न सत्त्वेष्वधिको ववाधे R. 2. 14;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">Page0483-a2</a>]<BR> Ms. 9. 123.<BR>—5 Minus (in this sense used with numerals); एकोन less by one; ˚विंशतिः<BR> 20 minus 1 = 19; so ˚त्रिंशत् 29; ˚पञ्चाशत् 49; अष्टोनं शतम्<BR> 100 minus 8 = 92.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऊनातिरिक्त, ऊनाब्दिकम्, ऊनरात्रः, ऊनरात्रिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊनातिरिक्त
ऊन + -अतिरिक्त <i>a.</i> Too little or too much.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊनाब्दिकम्
ऊन + -अब्दिकम् The श्राद्ध ceremony on the previous day before the<BR> anniversary ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊनरात्रः|ऊनरात्र
ऊन + -रात्रः, -रात्रिः N. applied to a particular lunar day (which is<BR> omitted if two lunar days end in one solar day); Sūrya S. 1. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊनरात्रिः|ऊनरात्रि
ऊन + -रात्रः, -रात्रिः N. applied to a particular lunar day (which is<BR> omitted if two lunar days end in one solar day); Sūrya S. 1. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊनक
ऊनक <i>a.</i> Less, inferior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊनयति
ऊनयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To leave deficient or unfinished; मा त्वायतो जरितुः काममूनयीः Rv. 1. 53. 3.<BR>—2 To deduct, lessen, diminish.<BR>—3 To measure.<BR>—4 To deal out in small quantities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊनित
ऊनित <i>p. p.</i> Lessened by subtraction, less, fewer &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊम्
ऊम् <i>ind.</i> An interjection of<BR>——(<i>a</i>) interrogation;<BR>——(<i>b</i>) anger;<BR>——(<i>c</i>) reproach, abuse;<BR>——(<i>d</i>) arrogance;<BR>——(<i>e</i>) envy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊम|ऊमं|ऊमः
ऊम <i>a.</i> Protecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊमः|ऊम|ऊमं
ऊम + .{@-मः@} Ved. A good friend, an affectionate companion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊय्
ऊय् €1 Ā. [ऊयते, ऊत] To weave, sew.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊररी
ऊररी = उररी q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरव्यः|ऊरव्य
ऊरव्यः Born from the thighs, hence a वैश्य, a merchant; विप्राश्च<BR> बाहुजास्तद्वदूरव्याश्च जघन्यजाः Śiva B. 31. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरी
ऊरी = उररी q. v.; तदूरीकृत्य कृतिभिर्वाचस्पत्यं प्रतप्यते Śi. 2. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुः|ऊरु
ऊरुः <i>m.</i> [ऊर्णु-कर्मणि कु नुलोपश्च Uṇ. 1. 30] —1 The thigh;<BR> ऊरू तदस्य यद्वैश्यः Rv. 10. 90. 12; Ms. 1. 31, 87; R. 12. 88; (at<BR> the end of <i>fem.</i> compounds the form is ˚रुः or ˚रूः, but more<BR> usually the latter; रम्भोरूः, वामोरूः करभोरु Voc.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऊर्वङ्गम्, ऊर्वष्ठीवम्, ऊरूद्भव, ऊरुग्लानिः, ऊरुग्रहः, ऊरुग्राहः, ऊरुज, ऊरुजन्मन्, ऊरुसंभव, ऊरुदघ्न, ऊरुद्वयस, ऊरुमात्र, ऊरुपर्वन्, ऊरुफलकम्, ऊरुभिन्न, ऊरुस्कम्भः, ऊरुस्तम्भः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्वङ्गम्
ऊरुः + -अङ्गम् Fungus, mushroom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्वष्ठीवम्
ऊरुः + -अष्ठीवम् [ऊरू च अष्ठीवन्तौ च P. V. 4. 77] thigh and knee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरूद्भव
ऊरुः + -उद्भव <i>a.</i> born or sprung from the thigh; ऊरूद्भवा नरसखस्य<BR> मुनेः सुरस्त्री V. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुग्लानिः|ऊरुग्लानि
ऊरुः + -ग्लानिः <i>f.</i> weakness of the thigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुग्रहः|ऊरुग्रह
ऊरुः + -ग्रहः, -ग्राहः = ˚स्तम्भः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुग्राहः|ऊरुग्राह
ऊरुः + -ग्रहः, -ग्राहः = ˚स्तम्भः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुज|ऊरुजः
ऊरुः + -ज, -जन्मन्, -संभव <i>a.</i> sprung from the thigh. ━<i>m.</i> a Vaiśya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुजन्मन्
ऊरुः + -ज, -जन्मन्, -संभव <i>a.</i> sprung from the thigh. ━<i>m.</i> a Vaiśya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुसंभव
ऊरुः + -ज, -जन्मन्, -संभव <i>a.</i> sprung from the thigh. ━<i>m.</i> a Vaiśya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुदघ्न
ऊरुः + -दघ्न, -द्वयस, -मात्र <i>a.</i> as high as or reaching the thighs,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">Page0484-1</a>]<BR> knee-deep; P. V. 2. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुद्वयस
ऊरुः + -दघ्न, -द्वयस, -मात्र <i>a.</i> as high as or reaching the thighs,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">Page0484-1</a>]<BR> knee-deep; P. V. 2. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुमात्र
ऊरुः + -दघ्न, -द्वयस, -मात्र <i>a.</i> as high as or reaching the thighs,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">Page0484-1</a>]<BR> knee-deep; P. V. 2. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0483-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुपर्वन्|ऊरुपर्व्वन्
ऊरुः + -पर्वन् <i>m., n.</i> the knee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुफलकम्
ऊरुः + -फलकम् the thigh-bone, hip-bone; Y. 3. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुभिन्न
ऊरुः + -भिन्न <i>a.</i> having a rent in the thigh; see -न्नी <i>f.</i> P. IV. 1. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुस्कम्भः|ऊरुस्कम्भ
ऊरुः + -स्कम्भः, -स्तम्भः paralysis of the lower extremities, rheumatism<BR> of the thigh. करिणीवोरुस्तम्भविधृता K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुस्कम्भा
ऊरुः + -स्कम्भः, -स्तम्भः + .({@-म्भा@}) the plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुस्तम्भः|ऊरुस्तम्भ
ऊरुः + -स्कम्भः, -स्तम्भः paralysis of the lower extremities, rheumatism<BR> of the thigh. करिणीवोरुस्तम्भविधृता K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरव्यः|ऊरव्य
ऊरव्यः (-व्या <i>f.</i>)<BR> [ऊरु-यत्] A Vaiśya, a man of the third tribe<BR> (as born from the thighs of Brahmā or Puruṣa); cf. Ms. 1. 31, 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊरुरी
ऊरुरी = उररी q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ज्
ऊर्ज् €10 P., Ā. To be strong; powerful, be happy; अदत् पिबदूर्जयमानमाशितम्<BR> Rv. 10. 37. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ज्
ऊर्ज् <i>f.</i> [P. III. 2. 177]<BR>—1 Strength, vigour.<BR>—2 Sap, juice.<BR>—3 Water.<BR>—4 Food; स देवानपि गच्छति स ऊर्जमुपजीवति Bṛ. Up. 1. 5. 1.<BR> oft. with इष्; इषे त्वा ऊर्जे त्वा Ts. 1. 1. 1. 1^1; इषमूर्जं सुक्षितिम्<BR> &c. नम ऊर्ज इषे Bhāg. 4. 24. 38.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/44aba84e.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जः|ऊर्ज|ऊर्ज्ज|ऊर्ज्जं|ऊर्ज्जः
ऊर्जः<BR>—1 N. of the month Kārtika (as giving vigour and energy); ‘बाहुलोर्जौ कार्तिकिकः’ इत्यमरः;<BR> ऊर्जमतङ्गजम् Śi. 6. 50.<BR>—2 Energy.<BR>—3 Power, strength.<BR>—4 Procreative power.<BR>—5 Life, breath.<BR>—6 N. of the sons of हिरण्यगर्भ (reckoned among the seven Ṛṣis<BR> of the third Manvantara).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जा|ऊर्ज्जा
ऊर्जः + .{@-र्जा@}<BR>—1 Food ऊर्जावती (गङ्गा) Mb. 13. 26. 84.<BR>—2 Energy.<BR>—3 Strength, sap. नाप्यूर्जां बिभरामास वैदेह्यां प्रसितो भृशम् Bk. 6. 3.<BR>—4 Growth.<BR>—5 N. of a daughter of Dakṣa and wife of Vasiṣṭha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जम्
ऊर्जः + .{@-र्जम्@} Water.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऊर्जमासः, ऊर्जमेध<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जमासः
ऊर्जः + -मासः The month कार्तिक; Bhāg. 12. 11. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जमेध
ऊर्जः + -मेध <i>a.</i> Of eminent intelligence, very wise; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जयति
ऊर्जयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To feed, strengthen, nourish.<BR>—2 (Ā.) To become strong or powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जव्य|ऊर्ज्जव्य
ऊर्जव्य <i>a.</i> Ved. Abounding in food or strength. सिषक्तु न ऊर्जव्यस्य<BR> पुष्टेः Rv. 5. 41. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्|ऊर्ज्जस्
ऊर्जस् <i>n.</i> [ऊर्ज्-असुन्]<BR>—1 Vigour, energy.<BR>—2 Food<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्वत्|ऊर्जस्वन्त्|ऊर्ज्जस्वत्
ऊर्जस्वत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Rich in food; juicy, succulent; ऊर्जस्वतीः पयस्वतीः प्रजावतीः Ts. 1. 1. 1. 1^1.<BR>—2 Powerful, strong, vigorous.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/44aba84e.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्वल|ऊर्ज्जस्वलः
ऊर्जस्वल <i>a.</i> [ऊर्जस्-वलच्]<BR>—1 Great, powerful, strong mighty; तद्रक्ष … ऊर्जस्वलमात्मदेहम्<BR> R. 2. 50; Bk. 3. 55; Mv. 4. 35; Māl. 2. 9.<BR>—2 Excellent, pre-eminent; U. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्विन्
ऊर्जस्विन् <i>a.</i> Mighty, strong, great; U. 5. 27, v. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जस्विनी
ऊर्जस्विन् + .{@-नी@} A figure of Rhetoric, speaking of anything with contempt,<BR> description of violence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जित|ऊर्ज्जित
ऊर्जित <i>a.</i><BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Powerful, strong, mighty; श्रीमदूर्जितमेव वा Bg. 10. 41;<BR> मातृकं च धनुरूर्जितं दधत् R. 11. 64; cf. also बाणाक्षरैरेव<BR> परस्परस्य नामोर्जितं चापभृतः शशंसुः vigorous, strong (speech);<BR> Śi. 16. 38; ऊर्जितं क्षात्रं तेजः Ve. 1. 13.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Great, large, exceeding, much; धनुर्विस्फारयामास तडिदूर्जितनिःस्वनम्<BR> Rām. 5. 48. 25; Mv. 2. 13.<BR>—2 Distinguished, glorious, superior; excellent, beautiful; ˚श्रीः<BR> Śi. 16. 85; मकरोर्जितकेतनम् R. 9. 39, 1. 93; Māl. 7. 4.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">Page0484-2</a>]<BR>—3 High, noble, spirited; ऊर्जितः खलु ते कामः Rām. 2. 85. 2. ˚आश्रयं<BR> वचः Ki. 2. 1 spirited or noble.<BR>—4 Increased; deep, grave; अलङ्घ्यत्वाज्जनैरन्यैः क्षुभितोदन्वदूर्जितम् Ki. 11. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जितम्
ऊर्जित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Strength, might.<BR>—2 Energy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्जिन्
ऊर्जिन् <i>a.</i> Abounding in food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णम्
ऊर्णम् [ऊर्णु-ड Uṇ. 5. 47]<BR>—1 Wool.<BR>—2 A woollen cloth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऊर्णनाभः, ऊर्णनाभिः, ऊर्णनाभी, ऊर्णपटः, ऊर्णवाभिः, ऊर्णम्रद, ऊर्णम्रदस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णनाभः|ऊर्णनाभ|ऊर्ण्णनाभ
ऊर्णम् + -नाभः, -नाभिः, -नाभी, -पटः, -वाभिः a spider; यस्तूर्णनाभ इव<BR> तन्तुभिः Śvet. Up. 6. 10; यथोर्णनाभिः सृजते गृह्णते च Muṇḍ. 1. 1. 7.<BR> विश्वं सृजसि पास्यत्सि क्रीडन्नूर्णपटो यथा Bhāg. 4. 6. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णनाभिः|ऊर्णनाभि
ऊर्णम् + -नाभः, -नाभिः, -नाभी, -पटः, -वाभिः a spider; यस्तूर्णनाभ इव<BR> तन्तुभिः Śvet. Up. 6. 10; यथोर्णनाभिः सृजते गृह्णते च Muṇḍ. 1. 1. 7.<BR> विश्वं सृजसि पास्यत्सि क्रीडन्नूर्णपटो यथा Bhāg. 4. 6. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णनाभी
ऊर्णम् + -नाभः, -नाभिः, -नाभी, -पटः, -वाभिः a spider; यस्तूर्णनाभ इव<BR> तन्तुभिः Śvet. Up. 6. 10; यथोर्णनाभिः सृजते गृह्णते च Muṇḍ. 1. 1. 7.<BR> विश्वं सृजसि पास्यत्सि क्रीडन्नूर्णपटो यथा Bhāg. 4. 6. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णपटः|ऊर्णपट
ऊर्णम् + -नाभः, -नाभिः, -नाभी, -पटः, -वाभिः a spider; यस्तूर्णनाभ इव<BR> तन्तुभिः Śvet. Up. 6. 10; यथोर्णनाभिः सृजते गृह्णते च Muṇḍ. 1. 1. 7.<BR> विश्वं सृजसि पास्यत्सि क्रीडन्नूर्णपटो यथा Bhāg. 4. 6. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णवाभिः|ऊर्णवाभि|ऊर्ण्णवाभि
ऊर्णम् + -नाभः, -नाभिः, -नाभी, -पटः, -वाभिः a spider; यस्तूर्णनाभ इव<BR> तन्तुभिः Śvet. Up. 6. 10; यथोर्णनाभिः सृजते गृह्णते च Muṇḍ. 1. 1. 7.<BR> विश्वं सृजसि पास्यत्सि क्रीडन्नूर्णपटो यथा Bhāg. 4. 6. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णम्रद
ऊर्णम् + -म्रद, -म्रदस् <i>a.</i> soft as wool. ऊर्णम्रदाः पृथिवी दक्षिणावते Av. 18. 3. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्णम्रदस्|ऊर्ण्णम्रदस्
