ऊर्णावल
ऊर्णा + -वल, -वत् <i>a.</i> woollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

