ऊर्द् = उर्द् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्दरम्
ऊर्दरम् A vessel for measuring corn (such as a bushel); a granery<BR> तमूर्दरं न पृणता यवेन Rv. 2. 14. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्दरः|ऊर्दर|ऊर्दरं|ऊर्द्दर|ऊर्द्दरः
ऊर्दरम् + .{@-रः@} A hero. —2 A Rākṣasa or goblin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्ध्व|ऊर्द्ध्वः
ऊर्ध्व <i>a.</i> Erect, upright, above; ˚केश &c.; rising or tending upwards.<BR>—2 Raised, elevated, erected; ˚हस्तः, ˚पादः &c.<BR>—3 High, superior, upper.<BR>—4 Not sitting (opp. आसीन).<BR>—5 Torn (as hair). —6 Thrown up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0484-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

