ऊर्म्य + .{@-र्म्या@} Night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्व|ऊर्वः
ऊर्व <i>a.</i> Extensive, great.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्वः|ऊर्व
ऊर्व + .{@-र्वः@}<BR>—1 Submarine fire.<BR>—2 A receptacle of water; the ocean.<BR>—3 A cloud.<BR>—4 A stable for cattle.<BR>—5 An epithet of a class of the manes or Pitṛs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्व्य|ऊर्व्यः
ऊर्व्य <i>a.</i> Ved. Being in lakes, reservoirs &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्व्यः|ऊर्व्य
ऊर्व्य + .{@-र्व्यः@} N. of Rudra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्वरा|ऊर्व्वरा
ऊर्वरा Fertile soil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊर्षा
ऊर्षा A kind of grass (देवताड).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊलुपिन्
ऊलुपिन् A porpoise; see उलुपिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊलूक|ऊलूकः
ऊलूक = उलूक q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊवध्यम्
ऊवध्यम् Half digested food; Bṛ. Up. 1. 1. 1. उवध्यगोहं पार्थिवं<BR> रवनतात् T. Br.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्
ऊष् €1 P. (ऊषति, ऊषित) To be diseased or disordered; be ill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषः|ऊष|ऊषं
ऊषः [ऊष्-रुजायाम्-क]<BR>—1 Salt ground; saline earth; कौशेयाविकयोरूषैः (शौचं विधीयते) Ms. 5. 120.<BR>—2 An acid.<BR>—3 A cleft, fissure.<BR>—4 The cavity of the ear.<BR>—5 The Malaya mountain.<BR>—6 Dawn, day-break<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषम्
ऊषः + .({@-षम्@} according to some).<BR>—7 Semen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषी
ऊषः + .{@-षी@} Saline earth; भस्मन्हुतं कुहकराद्धमिवोप्तमूष्याम् Bhāg. 1. 15. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषकम्
ऊषकम्<BR>—1 Dawn, day-break.<BR>—2 Salt; pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषणः|ऊषण|ऊषणं
ऊषणः The plant Plumbago Zeylanica (चित्रक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषणम्
ऊषणः + .{@-णम्, -णा@}<BR>—1 Black pepper.<BR>—2 Ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषणा
ऊषणः + .{@-णम्, -णा@}<BR>—1 Black pepper.<BR>—2 Ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषर|ऊषरः
ऊषर <i>a.</i> [ऊष-मत्वर्थीयो रः P. V. 2. 107] Impregnated with<BR> salt or saline particles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषरः|ऊषर
ऊषर + .{@-रः, -रम्@} A barren spot with saline soil; न हि तस्मात्फलं<BR> तस्य सुकृष्टादूषरादिव Pt. 1. 47; Śi. 14. 46.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऊषरजम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषरम्
ऊषर + .{@-रः, -रम्@} A barren spot with saline soil; न हि तस्मात्फलं<BR> तस्य सुकृष्टादूषरादिव Pt. 1. 47; Śi. 14. 46.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऊषरजम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषरजम्
ऊषर + -जम्<BR>—1 Salt produced from salt soil.<BR>—2 a kind of magnet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषरायते
ऊषरायते Den. Ā. To act like a salt desert (to allow no scope for<BR> the production of desires &c.); आजन्मनः स्मरोत्पत्तौ मानसेनोषरायितम् Pt. 5. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषवत्|ऊषवन्त्
ऊषवत् = ऊषर <i>a.</i> q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊषा
ऊषा = उषा q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्म|ऊष्मः
ऊष्म <i>a.</i> Hot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मः|ऊष्म
ऊष्म + .{@-ष्मः@}<BR>—1 Heat.<BR>—2 Summer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मन्
ऊष्मन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 Heat, warmth.<BR>—2 The hot season, summer.<BR>—3 Steam, vapour, exhalation.<BR>—4 Ardour, passion, violence.<BR>—5 (In gram.) The sounds श्, ष्, स् and ह्; applied also to ष्क्,<BR> ष्प्, अं and अः.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऊष्मान्त, ऊष्मान्तस्थाः, ऊष्मोपगमः, ऊष्मप^1<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मान्त
ऊष्मन् + -अन्त ending in an Ūṣman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मान्तस्थाः
ऊष्मन् + -अन्तस्थाः (<i>m.</i> pl.) the sounds called Ūṣman and semivowels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मोपगमः|ऊष्मोपगम
ऊष्मन् + -उपगमः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">Page0486-2</a>]<BR> approach of summer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मप|ऊष्मपः
ऊष्मन् + -प^1 <i>a.</i> drinking the steam of hot food; Mb. 12. 284. 8.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मपः|ऊष्मप
ऊष्मन् + -पः + .({@-पः@})<BR>—1 fire; गुणारणिच्छन्नचिदुष्मपाय Bhāg. 8. 3. 16.<BR>—2 a class of manes (pl.). Bg. 11. 22; अत्रोष्मपाणां देवानां निवासः<BR> श्रूयते द्विज Mb. 5. 109. 2. (‘ऊष्मपाणाम् उष्णान्नभोजिनाम्’ इति भाष्यकारः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मण
ऊष्मण, -ण्य <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR> Hot, steaming; Rv. 1. 162. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मण्य
ऊष्मण, -ण्य <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR> Hot, steaming; Rv. 1. 162. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्माणम्
ऊष्माणम् Steam, vapour; ‘ग्रीष्मोष्मबाष्पमूष्माणम्’ इति यादवः; भुवा<BR> सहोष्माणममुञ्चदूर्ध्वगम् Śi. 5. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मायणम्
ऊष्मायणम् The hot season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊष्मायते
ऊष्मायते Den. Ā. To emit heat or steam; perspire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊह्
ऊह् I. €1 U. [ऊहति-ते, ऊहाञ्चकार-चक्रे, ऊहितुम्, ऊहित]<BR>—1 To note, mark, observe; Av. 20. 131. 10.<BR>—2 To guess, conjecture, infer; अनुक्तमप्यूहति पण्डितो जनः Pt. 1. 43.<BR> द्रुतधृतलिपिविद्यं वीक्ष्य वैलक्ष्यमूहे Śiva B. 9. 74.<BR>—3 To comprehend, conceive, perceive, expect; ऊहांचके जयं न च<BR> Bk. 14. 72, 3. 48, 15. 123.<BR>—4 To reason, deliberate about.<BR>—5 To reckon upon (with loc.)<BR>—6 To wait for.<BR>—7 To be regarded as. ━II. €1 P.<BR>—1 To change or modify.<BR>—2 To push, thrust, remove (with a prep.). ━<i>Caus.</i> To cause to<BR> reason, think, infer, conjecture; प्रच्छन्नमप्यूहयते हि चेष्टा Ki. 16. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊह|ऊहः
ऊह <i>a.</i> Observed, perceived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहः|ऊह
ऊह + .{@-हः@} [ऊह्-घञ्]<BR>—1 A change, modification. ऊहदर्शनं च विवक्षितार्थानामेव भवति<BR> ŚB. on MS. 1. 2. 52. ऊह forms the subject-matter of जैमिनिʼs<BR> मीमांसासूत्र, अध्याय IX. It is said to be of three varieties; cf.<BR> त्रिविधश्च ऊहः मन्त्रसामसंस्कारविषयः ŚB. on MS. 9. 1. 1.<BR>—2 A guess, conjecture; Mb. 5. 33. 28.<BR>—3 Examination and determination.<BR>—4 Understanding.<BR>—5 Reasoning, arguing.<BR>—6 Supplying an ellipsis.<BR>—7 Attributing, ascribing.<BR>—8 Collection.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऊहापोहः, ऊहगानम्, ऊहच्छला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहापोहः|ऊहापोह
ऊह + -अपोहः full discussion, consideration of the <i>pros</i> and <i>cons</i>;<BR> इमे मनुष्या दृश्यन्ते ऊहापोहविशारदाः Mb. 13. 145. 43; ऊहापोहमिमं<BR> सरोजनयना यावद्विधत्तेतराम् Bv. 2. 74; see अपोह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहगानम्
ऊह + -गानम् N. of the third Gāna or hymn-book of the Samaveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहच्छला
ऊह + -च्छला <i>f.</i> N. of a chapter of the Sāmaveda Cchalā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहनम्
ऊहनम् Inferring, guessing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहनी
ऊहनी A broom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहा
ऊहा Supplying an ellipsis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहिन्
ऊहिन् <i>a.</i> Who or what reasons; inferring; Conjecturing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊहिनी
ऊहिन् + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 An assemblage, collection.<BR>—2 Arrangement, a multitude reduced to order (cf. अक्षौहिणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊह्य
ऊह्य <i>Pot. p.</i><BR>—1 Inferable, to be investigated.<BR>—2 To be supplied, elliptical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0486-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋ
ऋ <i>ind.</i> An interjection of (1) calling; (2) ridicule; (3) censure<BR> or abuse; (4) used at the beginning of a sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋः
ऋ + .{@-ऋः@} cf. ऋनिरृतिर्नलो नाकः खगराडथ वासुकिः । शालः पितृस्वसुः<BR> पुत्रोऽदितिर्दितिरुमा रमा ॥ Enm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋ
ऋ I. €1 P. [ऋच्छति, आर, आर्षीत्, अरिष्यति, ऋत; <i>caus.</i> अर्पयति;<BR> <i>desid.</i> अरिरिषति; अरार्यते reduplicative (अत्यर्थमृच्छति)<BR> cf. किमभीरुररार्यसे Bk. 4. 21.]<BR>—1 To go, move; अम्भच्छायामच्छामृच्छति Śi. 4. 44. यथाश्मानमृत्वा<BR> लोष्ठो विध्वंसेत Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 7.<BR>—2 To rise, tend towards. ━II. €3 P. (इयर्ति, आरत्, ऋत Mostly used in the Veda.)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To move, shake.<BR>—3 To obtain, gain, acquire, reach, meet with.<BR>—4 To move, excite, raise (as voice, words &c.) वाचमियर्ति.<BR>—5 To display. ━III. €5 P. (ऋणोति, ऋण)<BR>—1 To injure, hurt.<BR>—2 To attack. ━<i>Caus.</i> (अर्पयति, आर्पिपत्, अर्पित)<BR>—1 To throw, cast, fling; fix or implant in; हृदि शल्यमर्पितम् R. 8. 87.<BR>—2 To put or place on, fix upon, direct or cast towards (as the eye &c.);<BR> वामप्रकोष्ठार्पितहेमवेत्रः Ku. 3. 41; Ś. 6. 5, 17, 3. 26; R. 17. 79;<BR> Ś. 6. 8; Bk. 5. 90; Ku. 6. 11; R. 15. 77; Bg. 8. 7, 12. 14; करपल्लवार्पित Śi. 9. 54.<BR>—3 To place in, insert, give, set or place; अपथे पदमर्पयन्ति हि<BR> R. 9. 74, 78; चित्रार्पिताम् Ś. 6. 15 drawn in a picture; R. 2. 31;<BR> द्वारदेशे Amaru. 62; V. 4. 35; Mu. 7. 6; Bh. 3. 18; लोकोत्तरं चरितमर्पयति<BR> प्रतिष्ठाम् R. G.<BR>—4 To hand or make over; give to, give in charge of, consign, deliver;<BR> इति सूतस्याभरणान्यर्पयति Ś. 1, 4. 19; Bk. 8. 118; Y. 2. 65.<BR>—5 To give up, sacrifice (as the inherent sense); अत्र कलिङ्गगङ्गाशब्दौ<BR> आत्मानमर्पयतः S. D. 2.<BR>—6 To give back, restore; अर्पितप्रकृतिकान्तिभिर्मुखैः R. 19. 10; Bk. 15. 16;<BR> Amaru. 94; Ms. 8. 191; Y. 2. 169.<BR>—7 To pierce through, perforate, penetrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्ण
ऋक्ण <i>a.</i> Wounded, injured, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्थम्
ऋक्थम् [ऋच्-थक्]<BR>—1 Wealth.<BR>—2 (Especially) property, possessions, effects (left at death); see रिक्थ.<BR>—3 Gold.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऋक्थादानः, ऋक्थग्रहणम्, ऋक्थग्राहः, ऋक्थभागः, ऋक्थभागिन्, ऋक्थहर, ऋक्थहारिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्थादानः|ऋक्थादान
ऋक्थम् + -आदानः an inheritor, heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्थग्रहणम्
ऋक्थम् + -ग्रहणम् receiving or inheriting property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्थग्राहः|ऋक्थग्राह
ऋक्थम् + -ग्राहः an inheritor or receiver of property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्थभागः|ऋक्थभाग
ऋक्थम् + -भागः<BR>—1 division of property, partition.<BR>—2 a share, inheritance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्थभागिन्
ऋक्थम् + -भागिन्, -हर, -हारिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an heir.<BR>—2 a co-heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्थहर
ऋक्थम् + -भागिन्, -हर, -हारिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an heir.<BR>—2 a co-heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्थहारिन्
ऋक्थम् + -भागिन्, -हर, -हारिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an heir.<BR>—2 a co-heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्व
ऋक्व, ऋक्वन् <i>a.</i> Ved. Praising, rejoicing; बृहस्पतिः<BR> सामभिरृक्वो अर्चतु Rv. 10. 36. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्वन्
ऋक्व, ऋक्वन् <i>a.</i> Ved. Praising, rejoicing; बृहस्पतिः<BR> सामभिरृक्वो अर्चतु Rv. 10. 36. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्ष्
ऋक्ष् €5 P. To kill (ऋक्ष्णोति according to some).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षः|ऋक्ष|ऋक्षं
ऋक्षः [ऋष्-स किच्च Uṇ. 3. 66]<BR>—1 A bear; स्त्रीं (हृत्वा) ऋक्षः (भवति) Ms. 12. 67.<BR>—2 A species of ape; A. Rām. 7. 3. 6<BR>—3 A kind of deer; प्रजापतिः स्वां दुहितरं दृष्ट्वा तद्रूपधर्षितः ।<BR> रोहिद्भूतां सोऽन्वधावदृक्षरूपी हतत्रपः ॥ Bhāg. 3. 31. 36.<BR>—4 N. of a mountain.<BR>—5 N. of a plant (भल्लक Mar.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">Page0487-2</a>]<BR> दिंडा)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षः|ऋक्ष|ऋक्षं
ऋक्षः + .{@-क्षः, -क्षम्@}<BR>—1 A star, constellation, lunar mansion; पश्चिमां तु समासीनः सम्यगृक्षविभावनात्<BR> Ms. 2. 101, 3. 9, 6. 10.<BR>—2 A sign of the zodiac.<BR>—3 A star under which a man happens to be born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षम्
ऋक्षः + .{@-क्षः, -क्षम्@}<BR>—1 A star, constellation, lunar mansion; पश्चिमां तु समासीनः सम्यगृक्षविभावनात्<BR> Ms. 2. 101, 3. 9, 6. 10.<BR>—2 A sign of the zodiac.<BR>—3 A star under which a man happens to be born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्क्षाः
ऋक्षः + .{@-क्षाः@} (<i>m.</i> pl.) The seven stars called Pleiades; afterwards<BR> the seven Ṛṣis; दक्षिणां दिशमृक्षेषु वार्षिकेष्विव भास्करः (प्रययौ) R. 12. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षा
ऋक्षः + .{@-क्षा@} The north.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षी
ऋक्षः + .{@-क्षी@} A female bear. [cf. Gr. <i>arkos</i>, L. <i>ursus</i>].<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऋक्षेष्टिः, ऋक्षगन्धा, ऋक्षगन्धिका, ऋक्षचक्रम्, ऋक्षजिह्वम्, ऋक्षनाथः, ऋक्षेशः, ऋक्षनायकः, ऋक्षनेमिः, ऋक्षप्रियः, ऋक्षराज्, ऋक्षराजः, ऋक्षविडम्बिन्, ऋक्षहरीश्वरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षेष्टिः|ऋक्षेष्टि
ऋक्षः + -इष्टिः Offering to the stars (ग्रहमख); ऋक्षेष्ट्याग्रयणं<BR> चैव चातुर्मास्यानि चाहरेत् Ms. 6. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षगन्धा
ऋक्षः + -गन्धा the plant Argyreia Argentea (जांगली, महाश्वेता, क्षीरविदारी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षगन्धिका
ऋक्षः + -गन्धिका the plant Batatas Paniculata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षचक्रम्
ऋक्षः + -चक्रम् the circle of stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षजिह्वम्
ऋक्षः + -जिह्वम् A kind of leprosy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षनाथः|ऋक्षनाथ
ऋक्षः + -नाथः, -ईशः ‘lord of stars’ the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षेशः|ऋक्षेश
ऋक्षः + -नाथः, -ईशः ‘lord of stars’ the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षनायकः
ऋक्षः + -नायकः A kind of round building. (Agnipurāṇa ch. 104; v. 19-20).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षनेमिः|ऋक्षनेमि
ऋक्षः + -नेमिः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षप्रियः
ऋक्षः + -प्रियः An ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षराज्
ऋक्षः + -राज्, -राजः<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 Jāmbuvat, the king of bears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षराजः|ऋक्षराज
ऋक्षः + -राज्, -राजः<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 Jāmbuvat, the king of bears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षविडम्बिन्
ऋक्षः + -विडम्बिन् <i>m.</i> A fraudulent astrologer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षहरीश्वरः|ऋक्षहरीश्वर
ऋक्षः + -हरीश्वरः the lord of bears and apes; an epithet of Sugrīva;<BR> दुर्जातबन्धुरयमृक्षहरीश्वरो मे R. 13. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षवत्|ऋक्षवन्त्
ऋक्षवत् <i>m.</i> N. of a mountain near the Narmadā; वप्रक्रियामृक्षवतस्तटेषु<BR> R. 5. 44; ऋक्षवन्तं गिरिश्रेष्ठमध्यास्ते नर्मदां पिबन् Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षीक
ऋक्षीक <i>a.</i> Carnivorous like a bear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षीका
ऋक्षीक + .{@-का@} N. of evil deity; ऋक्षीकां रक्षो अप बाधयास्मत् Av. 12. 1. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षरः|ऋक्षर|ऋक्षरं
ऋक्षरः [ऋष्-क्सरन् Uṇ. 3. 75.]<BR>—1 A priest (ऋत्विज्).<BR>—2 A thorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षरा
ऋक्षरः + .{@-रा, -रम्@} shower of rain; stream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षरम्
ऋक्षरः + .{@-रा, -रम्@} shower of rain; stream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्षला
ऋक्षला Ved.<BR>—1 A fetter.<BR>—2 The part of an animalʼs leg between the fetlock joint and the hoof; Vāj. 25. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋघायति
ऋघायति Den. U.<BR>—1 To tremble; सिन्धुर्न क्षोदः शिमीवाँ ऋघायतः Rv. 2. 25. 3.<BR>—2 To tremble with anger, rage, rave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋघावत्|ऋघावन्त्
ऋघावत् <i>a.</i> Ved. Raging, Violent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच्
ऋच् €6 P. (ऋचति, आनर्च, आचींत्, अर्चितुम्)<BR>—1 To praise, extol, celebrate; याभ्यां गायत्रमृच्यते Rv. 8. 38. 10.<BR>—2 To cover, screen<BR>—3 To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच्
ऋच् <i>f.</i> [ऋच्यते स्तूयतेऽनया, ऋच् करणे क्विप्]<BR>—1 A hymn (in general).<BR>—2 A single verse, stanza, or text; a verse of the Ṛgveda (opp. यजुस्<BR> and सामन्); त्रेधा विहिता वागृचो यजूंषि सामानि Śat. Br.<BR>—3 The collective body of the Ṛgveda (pl.), ऋचः सामानि जज्ञिरे<BR> Rv. 10. 90. 9. ऋक्साम यजुरेव च Bg. 9. 17.<BR>—4 Splendour (for रुच्).<BR>—5 Praise.<BR>—6 worship.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऋगयनम्, ऋगावानम्, ऋग्गाथा, ऋक्तन्त्रम्, ऋग्व्याकरणम्, ऋग्ब्राह्मणम्, ऋग्भाज्, ऋग्विधानम्, ऋग्वेदः, ऋक्संहिता, ऋक्साम<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋगयनम्
ऋच् + -अयनम् [ऋचामयनम्] N. of a book; ऋक्पारायण, ˚आदि<BR> N. of a collection of words in Pāṇini.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋगावानम्
ऋच् + -आवानम् the time for reciting the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्गाथा
ऋच् + -गाथा N. of a certain song consisting of <i>fk</i>-like stanzas;<BR> ऋग्गाथा पाणिका दक्षविहिता ब्रह्मगीतिका Y. 3. 114.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्तन्त्रम्
ऋच् + -तन्त्रम्, -व्याकरणम्,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">Page0488-1</a>]<BR> N. of the Pariśiṣtas of the Sāma Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्व्याकरणम्
ऋच् + -तन्त्रम्, -व्याकरणम्,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">Page0488-1</a>]<BR> N. of the Pariśiṣtas of the Sāma Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0487-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्ब्राह्मणम्
ऋच् + -ब्राह्मणम् The Aitareya Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्भाज्
ऋच् + -भाज् <i>a.</i> partaking of a Ṛk. (as a deity who is addressed with it).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्विधानम्
ऋच् + -विधानम् the performance of certain rites, by reciting verses<BR> of the Ṛgveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्वेदः|ऋग्वेद
ऋच् + -वेदः the oldest of the four Vedas, and the most ancient sacred<BR> book of the Hindus. [The Ṛgveda is said to have been produced from fire;<BR> cf. Ms. 1. 23. This Veda is divided, according to one arrangement, into 8<BR> Aṣṭakas, each of which is divided into as many Adhyāyas; according<BR> to another arrangement into 10 Maṇḍalas, which are again subdivided<BR> into 1000 Anuvākas, and comprises 1000 sūktas. The total number of verses<BR> or <i>Ṛks</i> is above 10000].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्संहिता
ऋच् + -संहिता the arranged collection of the hymns of Ṛgveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋक्साम
ऋच् + -साम ({@˚मे@} dual) the verses Ṛk and Sāman. ˚शृङ्गः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्म
ऋग्म <i>a.</i> Having the character of a Ṛk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्मत्|ऋग्मन्त्
ऋग्मत्, ऋग्मिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Praising, jubilant with praise; ऋग्मिभिरृग्मी गातुभिर्ज्येष्ठो Rv. 1. 100. 4,<BR>—2 Worshipping, honouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्मिन्
ऋग्मत्, ऋग्मिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Praising, jubilant with praise; ऋग्मिभिरृग्मी गातुभिर्ज्येष्ठो Rv. 1. 100. 4,<BR>—2 Worshipping, honouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋग्मिय
ऋग्मिय <i>a.</i> Praiseworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋचस्
ऋचस् <i>a.</i> Praising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋचीकः|ऋचीक
ऋचीकः [ऋच्-ईकक्]<BR>—1 The father of Jamadagni.<BR>—2 N. of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋचीषः|ऋचीष|ऋचीषं
ऋचीषः A particular hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋचीषम्
ऋचीषः + .{@-षम्@} A frying pan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच्छ्|ऋछ्
ऋच्छ् €6 P. (ऋच्छति, आर्च्छीत्, आनर्च्छ, अर्च्छितुम्).<BR>—1 To become hard or stiff.<BR>—2 To go, move;<BR>—3 To fail in faculties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच्छका
ऋच्छका Wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋच्छरा
ऋच्छरा Ved.<BR>—1 A fetter.<BR>—2 The part of an animalʼs leg between the fetlock joint and the hoof; Av. 10. 9. 23.<BR>—3 A harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋज्
ऋज् I. €1 Ā. (अर्जते, आर्जिष्ट, अर्जितुम्, ऋजित)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To obtain, acquire.<BR>—3 To stand or be firm.<BR>—4 To be healthy or strong. ━II. €1 P. To acquire, earn; cf. अर्ज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजिप्य
ऋजिप्य <i>a.</i> Ved. Going quick, striving upwards. Rv. 4. 27. 4, 38. 7<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजिश्वन्
ऋजिश्वन् <i>m.</i> N. of a king protected by Indra; Rv. 5. 29. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीक|ऋजीकः
ऋजीक <i>a.</i> [ऋज्-गतौ ईकन् किच्च Uṇ. 4. 22] Ved.<BR>—1 Coloured, variegated.<BR>—2 Mixed with.<BR>—3 Polluted, defiled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीकः|ऋजीक
ऋजीक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 Smoke.<BR>—2 N. of Indra.<BR>—3 N. of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीकम्
ऋजीक + .{@-कम्@} A means, expedient; आविरृजीको विदथा निचिक्यत् Rv. 4. 38. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीतिः|ऋजीति
ऋजीतिः <i>f.</i> Ved. Burning, sparkling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीष|ऋजीषं
ऋजीष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Ved. Seizing, driving away, hastening towards (epithet of Indra).<BR>—2 Wet; शश्वत्तच्छ्रीकरार्जीष-द्रुममण्डलमण्डितम् Bhāg. 10. 18. 4. (Gīrvāṇa).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीषम्
ऋजीष + .{@-षम्@}<BR>—1 A frying pan.<BR>—2 A particular hell. Ms. 4. 90.<BR>—3 The residue of Soma.<BR>—4 Water (Sāy.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजीषिन्
ऋजीषिन् <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Hastening towards, seizing.<BR>—2 Consisting of or receiving the sediment of Soma. अस्मै प्रयन्धि मघवन्नृजीषिन्<BR> Kauṣ. Up. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजु
ऋजु, -ऋजुक <i>a.</i><BR> [अर्जयति गुणान्, अर्ज्-उ Tv.] (जु or ज्वी<BR> <i>f.</i>) (compar. ऋजीयस्, superl. ऋजिष्ठ)<BR>—1 Straight (fig. also); उमां स पश्यन् ऋजुनैव चक्षुषा Ku. 5. 32;<BR> Śi. 10. 13, 12. 18, 20. 77; ˚प्रणाम R. 6. 25.<BR>—2 Upright, honest, straight-forward; ऋजूननृजवः Pt. 1. 415.<BR>—3 Simpleminded, plain; Mk. 5; Ratn. 2, 3. 4 Favourable, beneficial, good.<BR>━<i>ind.</i> In the right manner, Correctly; Rv. 2. 3. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऋज्वायत, ऋजुकायः, ऋजुक्रतु, ऋजुगः, ऋजुगाथ, ऋजुनीतिः, ऋजुमिताक्षरा, ऋजुरोहितम्, ऋजुलेख, ऋजुखा, ऋजुवनि, ऋजुहस्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुक
ऋजु, -ऋजुक <i>a.</i><BR> [अर्जयति गुणान्, अर्ज्-उ Tv.] (जु or ज्वी<BR> <i>f.</i>) (compar. ऋजीयस्, superl. ऋजिष्ठ)<BR>—1 Straight (fig. also); उमां स पश्यन् ऋजुनैव चक्षुषा Ku. 5. 32;<BR> Śi. 10. 13, 12. 18, 20. 77; ˚प्रणाम R. 6. 25.<BR>—2 Upright, honest, straight-forward; ऋजूननृजवः Pt. 1. 415.<BR>—3 Simpleminded, plain; Mk. 5; Ratn. 2, 3. 4 Favourable, beneficial, good.<BR>━<i>ind.</i> In the right manner, Correctly; Rv. 2. 3. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऋज्वायत, ऋजुकायः, ऋजुक्रतु, ऋजुगः, ऋजुगाथ, ऋजुनीतिः, ऋजुमिताक्षरा, ऋजुरोहितम्, ऋजुलेख, ऋजुखा, ऋजुवनि, ऋजुहस्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋज्वायत
ऋजु + -आयत <i>a.</i> sitting or being upright and stretched up or distended;<BR> ऋज्वायतं संनमितोभयांसम् Ku. 3. 45; M. 2. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुकायः|ऋजुकाय
ऋजु + -कायः The sage कश्यप.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुक्रतु
ऋजु + -क्रतु <i>a.</i> acting righteously; N. of Indra; यूथा गवामृजुक्रतुः Rv. 1. 81. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुगः|ऋजुग
ऋजु + -गः<BR>—1 one who is honest in his dealings; स नो मृडाति तन्व ऋजुगः Av. 1. 12. 1.<BR>—2 an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुगाथ
ऋजु + -गाथ <i>a.</i> Ved. singing correctly; धारवाकेष्वृजुगाथ शोभसे Rv. 5. 44. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुनीतिः|ऋजुनीति
ऋजु + -नीतिः <i>f.</i> Ved. right conduct; guidance; ऋजुनीती नो वरुणो Rv. 1. 90. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुमिताक्षरा
ऋजु + -मिताक्षरा N. of a commentary on Yājñavalkyaʼs law-book, generally<BR> called Mitākṣarā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुरोहितम्
ऋजु + -रोहितम् the straight red bow of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुलेख
ऋजु + -लेख <i>a.</i> Rectilinear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुखा
ऋजु + -खा Straight line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुवनि
ऋजु + -वनि, -हस्त <i>a.</i> granting auspicious gifts; स्मत् सूरिभिरृजुहस्त<BR> ऋजुवनिः Rv. 5. 41. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुहस्त
ऋजु + -वनि, -हस्त <i>a.</i> granting auspicious gifts; स्मत् सूरिभिरृजुहस्त<BR> ऋजुवनिः Rv. 5. 41. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुता
ऋजुता, -त्वम्<BR> Straight direction, straightness, honesty, sincerity; ऋजुताफलशुद्धियोगभाजाम्<BR> Śi. 20. 9; Ku. 4. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुत्वम्
ऋजुता, -त्वम्<BR> Straight direction, straightness, honesty, sincerity; ऋजुताफलशुद्धियोगभाजाम्<BR> Śi. 20. 9; Ku. 4. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजुधा
ऋजुधा <i>ind.</i> Straight, right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजूकृ
ऋजूकृ €8 U. To straighten, rectify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजूयति
ऋजूयति Den. P. To be on the right way, walk straight-forward; ऋजूयमानो<BR> अतपन्महित्वा Rv. 10. 88. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजूया
ऋजूया <i>ind.</i> In a straight line; दिशं न दिष्टामृजूयेव यन्ता Rv. 1. 183. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋजूयु
ऋजूयु <i>a.</i> Honest, upright; सत्यमन्त्रा ऋजूयवः Rv. 1. 20. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋज्रः|ऋज्र
ऋज्रः A leader. दिवा हरिर्ददृशे नक्तमृज्रः Rv. 9. 97. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋज्वच्
ऋज्वच् <i>a.</i> Going straight-forward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋज्वी
ऋज्वी<BR>—1 A straight-forward or plain woman.<BR>—2 A particular gait (of the planets).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋञ्ज्|ऋंज्
ऋञ्ज् I. €6 U.<BR>—1 To spring forward, run.<BR>—2 To strive or long for.<BR>—3 To decorate. ━II. €1 Ā. To fry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋञ्जसान|ऋंजसान|ऋञ्जसानः
ऋञ्जसान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Running towards.<BR>—2 Striving after.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋञ्जसानः|ऋञ्जसान|ऋंजसान
ऋञ्जसान + .{@-नः@} A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋण्
ऋण् €8 P. To go (ऋणोति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0489-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋण|ऋणं
ऋण <i>a.</i> [ऋ-क्त]<BR>—1 Going.<BR>—2 Guilty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0489-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणम्
ऋण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Debt [as to the three kinds of debt, see अनृण; cf. जायमानो<BR> ह वै ब्राह्मणस्त्रिभिरृणवान् जायते, यज्ञेन देवेभ्यः ब्रह्मचर्येण ऋषिभ्यः<BR> प्रजया पितृभ्यः इति । स वै तर्हि अनृणो भवति यदा यज्वा, ब्रह्मचारी,<BR> प्रजावानिति । ŚB. on MS. 6. 2. 31. ऋणानि त्रीण्यपाकृत्य मनो मोक्षे<BR> निवेशयेत् Ms. 6. 35. (देवानां च पितृणां च ऋषीणां च तथा नरः ।<BR> ऋणवाञ् जायते यस्मात्तन्मोक्षे प्रयतेत् (त ?) सदा ॥ देवानामनृणो<BR> जन्तुर्यज्ञैर्भवति मानवः । अल्पवित्तश्च पूजाभिरुपवासव्रतैस्तथा ॥<BR> श्राद्धेन प्रजया चैव पितॄणामनृणो भवेत् । ऋषीणां ब्रह्मचर्येण श्रुतेन<BR> तपसा तथा ॥ विष्णुधर्मोत्तरम्); ऋणं कृ to incur debt; ऋणं<BR> दा to pay off or discharge debt; अन्त्यम् ऋणं (पितॄणम्) the last<BR> debt to be paid to the manes, <i>i. e.</i> creation of a son].<BR>—2 An obligation in general. cf. ऋणसंस्तवो हि अवश्यकर्तव्यानां भवति ।<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 2. 31.<BR>—3 (In alg.) The negative sign or quantity, minus (opp. धन).<BR>—4 A fort, strong-hold.<BR>—5 Water.<BR>—6 Land.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऋणान्तकः, ऋणापनयनम्, ऋणापनोदनम्, ऋणापाकरणम्, ऋणदानम्, ऋणमुक्तिः, ऋणमोक्षः, ऋणशोधनम्, ऋणादानम्, ऋणोद्ग्रहणम्, ऋणर्णम, ऋणकर्तृ, ऋणकाति, ऋणग्रस्त, ऋणग्रहः, ऋणग्राहिन्, ऋणचित्, ऋणच्छेदः, ऋणदातृ, ऋणदायिन्, ऋणदासः, ऋणनिर्णयपत्रकम्, ऋणपत्रम्, ऋणनिर्मोक्षः, ऋणप्रदातृ, ऋणमत्कुणः, ऋणमार्गणः, ऋणमुक्तः, ऋणमुक्तिः, ऋणलेख्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0489-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणान्तकः|ऋणान्तक
ऋण + -अन्तकः the planet Mars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0489-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऋणापनयनम्
