एकांशः|एकांश
एक + -अंशः a separate part, part in general. विष्टभ्याहमिदं कृत्स्नमेकांशेन<BR> स्थितो जगत् Bg. 10. 42. एकांशश्च प्रधानतः Ms. 9. 150.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाक्ष|एकाक्षः
एक + -अक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having only one axle. द्विचकमेकाक्षम् (रथम्) Bhāg. 4. 26. 1.<BR>—2 having one eye.<BR>—3 having an excellent eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाक्षः|एकाक्ष
एक + -अक्ष + .({@-क्षः@})<BR>—1 a crow.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाक्षर
एक + -अक्षर <i>a.</i> monosyllabic. ओमित्येकाक्षरं ब्रह्म Bg. 8. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाक्षरम्
एक + -अक्षर + .({@-रम्@})<BR>—1 a monosyllable.<BR>—2 the sacred syllable; ओम्; एकाक्षरं परं ब्रह्म Ms. 2. 83.<BR>—3 The sole imperishable thing; एकाक्षरमभिसंभूय Av. 5. 28. 8.<BR>—4 N. of an Upaniṣad. ˚कोशः a vocabulary of monosyllabic words by<BR> Puruṣottamadeva. ˚रीभावः the production of only one syllable, contraction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाग्नि
एक + -अग्नि <i>a.</i> Keeping only one fire; Āpastamba Dharma Sūtra 2. 21. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाग्निकः|एकाग्निक
एक + -अग्नि + .({@-कः@}) one and the same fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाग्र|एकाग्रः
एक + -अग्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fixed on one object or point only.<BR>—2 closely attentive, concentrated, intent; तद्गीतश्रवणैकाग्रा R. 15. 66;<BR> K. 49; कच्चिदेतच्छ्रुतं पार्थ त्वयैकाग्रेण चेतसा Bg. 18. 72;<BR> मनुमेकाग्रमासीनम् Ms. 1. 1.<BR>—3 unperplexed.<BR>—4 known, celebrated.<BR>—5 single-pointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाग्रः|एकाग्र
एक + -अग्र + .({@-ग्रः@}) (in Math.) the whole of the long side of a figure which<BR> is subdivided. ˚चित्त, ˚मनस् <i>a.</i> with a concentrated mind, with<BR> undivided attention. ˚चित्तम्, ˚चित्तता intentness of purpose, concentration<BR> of mind; तत्रैकाग्रं सनःकृत्वा Bg. 6. 12, 18. 72. ˚दृष्टि <i>a.</i><BR> fixing oneʼs eye on one spot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाग्र्य|एकाग्र्यः
एक + -अग्र्य = ˚अग्र ({@-ग्र्यम्@}) concentration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाग्र्यम्
एक + -अग्र्य = ˚अग्र ({@-ग्र्यम्@}) concentration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाङ्गः|एकाङ्ग|एकांग|एकाङ्गं
एक + -अङ्गः<BR>—1 a body-guard.<BR>—2 the planet Mercury or Mars.<BR>—3 N. of Viṣṇu. {@˚वधः@} Mutilation of a limb; Kau. A. 4.<BR>—4 Having a unique or beautiful shape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाङ्गम्
एक + -अङ्गः + .({@-अङ्गम्@})<BR>—1 a single member or part.<BR>—2 sandalwood.<BR>—3 the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाङ्गौ
एक + -अङ्गः + .({@-अङ्गम्@}) + ({@-ङ्गौ@}) a married couple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाङ्गी
एक + -अङ्गः + .({@-ङ्गी@}) Incomplete; ˚रूपक incomplete simile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाञ्जलिः|एकाञ्जलि
एक + -अञ्जलिः A handful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाङ्गिका
एक + -अङ्गिका preparation made with sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाण्डः|एकाण्ड
एक + -अण्डः a kind of horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाधिपतिः|एकाधिपति
एक + -अधिपतिः a sole monarch or sovereign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकानंशा
एक + -अनंशा the only (day) receiving no part of the moon, an epithet<BR> of Kuhū or day of new moon (born together with Kṛṣṇa^1 and worshipped<BR> with Kṛṣṇa^2 and Baladeva and identified with Durgā).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170116.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by  on 20170116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकानुदिष्ट
एक + -अनुदिष्ट <i>a.</i> —1 left as a funeral feast or one who has recently<BR> partaken in it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकानुदिष्टम्
एक + -अनुदिष्ट + ({@-ष्टम्@}) a funeral ceremony performed for only<BR> one ancestor (recently dead); see एकोद्दिष्ट; यावदेकानुदिष्टस्य गन्धो<BR> लेपश्च तिष्ठति Ms. 4. 111.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्त|एकान्तं|एकान्तः
एक + -अन्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 solitary, retired.<BR>—2 aside, apart.<BR>—3 directed towards one point or object only.<BR>—4 excessive, great; ˚शैत्यात्कदलीविशेषाः Ku. 1. 36.<BR>—5 worshipping only one; devoted to only one (एकनिष्ठ); एकान्तजनप्रियः Bhāg. 8. 24. 31.<BR>—6 absolute, invariable, perpetual; स्वायत्तमेकान्तगुणम् Bh. 2. 7; कस्यैकान्तं सुखमुपगतम् Me. 111.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तः|एकान्त|एकान्तं
एक + -अन्त + .({@-तः@})<BR>—1 a lonely or retired place, solitude; तासामेकान्तविन्यस्ते शयानां<BR> शयने शुभे Rām. 5. 10. 50. व्योम˚ विहारिणः Pt. 2. 20; H. 1. 49.<BR>—2 exclusiveness.<BR>—3 an invariable rule or course of conduct or action; तस्मादेकान्तमासाद्य Pt. 3. 7.<BR>—4 exclusive<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">Page0494-2</a>]<BR> aim or boundary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तम्
एक + -अन्त + .({@-तम्@}) an exclusive recourse, a settled rule or principle; तेजः<BR> क्षमा वा नैकान्तं कालज्ञस्य महीपतेः Śi. 2. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तम्
एक + -अन्त + .({@-तम्, -तेन, -ततः, -ते@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 solely, exclusively, invariably, always, absolutely, युद्धे नैकान्तेन<BR> भवेज्जयः Mb. 5. 64. 27.<BR>—2 exceeding, quite, wholly, very much; वयमप्येकान्ततो निःस्पृहाः<BR> Bh. 3. 24; दुःखमेकान्ततो वा Me. 111; oft. in comp.; ˚विध्वंसिन्<BR> sure or destined to perish; R. 2. 57; ˚भीरु Mu. 3. 5 always timid;<BR> so एकान्तकरुण very weak &c.<BR>—3 alone, apart, privately. ˚भूत being alone or solitary; विलेक्यैकान्तभूतानि<BR> भूतान्यादौ प्रजापतिः Bhāg. 6. 18. 3. ˚मति <i>a.</i> devoted to one<BR> object only. ˚विहारिन् <i>a.</i> a solitary wanderer. ˚सुषमा ‘containing exclusively good years’<BR>, a division of time with Jainas. ˚स्थित <i>a.</i><BR> staying or remaining apart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तेन
एक + -अन्त + .({@-तम्, -तेन, -ततः, -ते@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 solely, exclusively, invariably, always, absolutely, युद्धे नैकान्तेन<BR> भवेज्जयः Mb. 5. 64. 27.<BR>—2 exceeding, quite, wholly, very much; वयमप्येकान्ततो निःस्पृहाः<BR> Bh. 3. 24; दुःखमेकान्ततो वा Me. 111; oft. in comp.; ˚विध्वंसिन्<BR> sure or destined to perish; R. 2. 57; ˚भीरु Mu. 3. 5 always timid;<BR> so एकान्तकरुण very weak &c.<BR>—3 alone, apart, privately. ˚भूत being alone or solitary; विलेक्यैकान्तभूतानि<BR> भूतान्यादौ प्रजापतिः Bhāg. 6. 18. 3. ˚मति <i>a.</i> devoted to one<BR> object only. ˚विहारिन् <i>a.</i> a solitary wanderer. ˚सुषमा ‘containing exclusively good years’<BR>, a division of time with Jainas. ˚स्थित <i>a.</i><BR> staying or remaining apart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्ततः
एक + -अन्त + .({@-तम्, -तेन, -ततः, -ते@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 solely, exclusively, invariably, always, absolutely, युद्धे नैकान्तेन<BR> भवेज्जयः Mb. 5. 64. 27.<BR>—2 exceeding, quite, wholly, very much; वयमप्येकान्ततो निःस्पृहाः<BR> Bh. 3. 24; दुःखमेकान्ततो वा Me. 111; oft. in comp.; ˚विध्वंसिन्<BR> sure or destined to perish; R. 2. 57; ˚भीरु Mu. 3. 5 always timid;<BR> so एकान्तकरुण very weak &c.<BR>—3 alone, apart, privately. ˚भूत being alone or solitary; विलेक्यैकान्तभूतानि<BR> भूतान्यादौ प्रजापतिः Bhāg. 6. 18. 3. ˚मति <i>a.</i> devoted to one<BR> object only. ˚विहारिन् <i>a.</i> a solitary wanderer. ˚सुषमा ‘containing exclusively good years’<BR>, a division of time with Jainas. ˚स्थित <i>a.</i><BR> staying or remaining apart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्ते
एक + -अन्त + .({@-तम्, -तेन, -ततः, -ते@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 solely, exclusively, invariably, always, absolutely, युद्धे नैकान्तेन<BR> भवेज्जयः Mb. 5. 64. 27.<BR>—2 exceeding, quite, wholly, very much; वयमप्येकान्ततो निःस्पृहाः<BR> Bh. 3. 24; दुःखमेकान्ततो वा Me. 111; oft. in comp.; ˚विध्वंसिन्<BR> sure or destined to perish; R. 2. 57; ˚भीरु Mu. 3. 5 always timid;<BR> so एकान्तकरुण very weak &c.<BR>—3 alone, apart, privately. ˚भूत being alone or solitary; विलेक्यैकान्तभूतानि<BR> भूतान्यादौ प्रजापतिः Bhāg. 6. 18. 3. ˚मति <i>a.</i> devoted to one<BR> object only. ˚विहारिन् <i>a.</i> a solitary wanderer. ˚सुषमा ‘containing exclusively good years’<BR>, a division of time with Jainas. ˚स्थित <i>a.</i><BR> staying or remaining apart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तर|एकान्तरः
एक + -अन्तर <i>a.</i> next but one, separated by one remove; द्वन्द्वं<BR> दक्षमरीचिसंभवमिदं तत्स्रष्टुरेकान्तरम् Ś. 7. 27; V. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तरः|एकान्तर
एक + -अन्तर + ({@-रः@})<BR> a kind of fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तिक
एक + -अन्तिक <i>a.</i> final, conclusive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तित्वम्
एक + -अन्तित्वम् devotion to one object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्तिन्
एक + -अन्तिन् <i>a.</i> devoted to one object only; अहो अत्यद्भुतं ह्येतद्<BR> दुर्लभैकान्तिनामपि Bhāg. 7. 1. 15. ━<i>m.</i> a worshipper of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्नम्
एक + -अन्नम् one and the same food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकान्नः|एकान्न
एक + -अन्नम् + .({@-न्नः@}), {@-˚आदिन्@}<BR>—1 a mess-mate.<BR>—2 One who lives on the alms from only one house; नैकान्नादी भवेद् व्रती Ms. 2. 188.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकापचयः|एकापचय
एक + -अपचयः, -अपायः Diminution by one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकापायः|एकापाय
एक + -अन्नम् + .({@-न्नः@}), {@-˚आदिन्@}<BR>—1 a mess-mate.<BR>—2 One who lives on the alms from only one house; नैकान्नादी भवेद् व्रती Ms. 2. 188.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाब्दा
एक + -अब्दा a heifer one year old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकायन|एकायनः
एक + -अयन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 passable for only one (as a foot-path) Mb. 3.<BR>—2 fixing oneʼs thoughts on one object, closely attentive, intent; see एकाग्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकायनम्
एक + -अयन + .({@-नम्@})<BR>—1 a lonely or retired place; एकायनगतः पथि Mb. 1. 176. 5; Rām. 3. 67. 23.<BR>—2 a meeting-place, rendezvous. सर्वासामपां समुद्र एकायनम् Bṛ. Up. 2. 4. 11.<BR>—3 union of thoughts.<BR>—4 monotheism.<BR>—5 the sole object; सा स्नेहस्य एकायनीभूता M. 2. 14; एकायनीभूय<BR> Mv. 4 with one accord, unanimously.<BR>—6 One and the same way, similarity; एकमेवायनगताः प्लवमाना गिरेर्गिरम् Rām. 4. 2. 9.<BR>—7 Worldly wisdom (नीतिशास्त्र); नाम वै एकायनम् Ch. Up. 7. 1. 2.<BR> ˚गत = एकायन q. v. तरुणः सुकृतैर्युक्त एकायनगतश्च ह<BR> Mb. 7. 12. 22. ˚स्थः With only one resource open, driven to extremity;<BR> शूरश्चैकायनस्थश्च किमन्यत्प्रतिपद्यते Pratijñā. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकार्णवः|एकार्णव
एक + -अर्णवः general flood, universal deluge; अयं ह्युत्सहते क्रुद्धः<BR> कर्तुमेकार्णवं जगत् Rām. 5. 49. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकार्थ|एकार्थः
एक + -अर्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having one and the same meaning, having the same object in view; राजन्यकान्युपायज्ञैरेकार्थानि<BR> चरैस्तव Śi. 2. 114.<BR>—2 (Rhet.) Tautological (as a sentence); Kāvyālaṅkāravṛtti 2. 1. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकार्थः|एकार्थ
एक + -अर्थ + .({@-र्थः@})<BR>—1 the same thing, object, or intention.<BR>—2 the same meaning.<BR>—3 N. of a glossary (of synonymous words); cf. एकार्थनाममाला.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकावम
एक + -अवम <i>a.</i> inferior or less by one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकावयव
एक + -अवयव <i>a.</i> made up of the same components.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाशीत
एक + -अशीत or ˚तितम <i>a.</i> eighty-first.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाशीतिः|एकाशीति
एक + -अशीतिः <i>f.</i> eighty-one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाष्टका
एक + -अष्टका<BR>—1 the first or chief Aṣṭakā after the full moon; एकाष्टके सुप्रजसः<BR> सुवीरा Av. 3. 10. 5.<BR>—2 the eighth day of the dark fortnight in the month of Māgha (on which<BR> a श्राद्ध is to be performed).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाष्ठीका
एक + -अष्ठीका + ({@-ला@}) The root of the trumpet-flower (Mar. पहाडमूळ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाष्ठीला
एक + -अष्ठीका + ({@-ला@}) The root of the trumpet-flower (Mar. पहाडमूळ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाष्ठील|एकाष्ठीलः
एक + -अष्ठील <i>a.</i> having one kernel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाष्ठीलः|एकाष्ठील
एक + -अष्ठील + .({@-लः@}) N. of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">Page0495-1</a>]<BR> a plant (बकवृक्ष); A white variety of Gigantic swallow-wort (Mar.<BR> रुईमांदार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0494-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाहन्
एक + -अहन् + ({@-हः@})<BR>—1 the period of one day.<BR>—2 a sacrifice lasting for one day. ˚गमः, ˚अध्वा a dayʼs journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाहः|एकाह
एक + -अहन् + ({@-हः@})<BR>—1 the period of one day.<BR>—2 a sacrifice lasting for one day. ˚गमः, ˚अध्वा a dayʼs journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकातपत्र
एक + -आतपत्र <i>a.</i> characterized by only one umbrella (showing universal<BR> sovereignty); एकातपत्रं जगतः प्रभुत्वम् R. 2. 47. ˚त्रां भुवम् 18. 4;<BR> K. 206; Śi. 12. 33; V. 3. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकात्मन्
एक + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> depending solely on one-self, solitary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादेशः|एकादेश
एक + -आदेशः cf. Sk. on P. VI. 1. 101 one substitute for two or more<BR> letters (got by either dropping one vowel, or by the blending of both);<BR> as the आ in एकायन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकायु
एक + -आयु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 providing the most excellent food. —2 the first living being. एकायुरग्रे<BR> विश आविवाससि Rv. 1. 31. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकावलिः|एकावलि
एक + -आवलिः, -आवली <i>f.</i> —1 a single string of pearls, beads &c.; सूत्रमेकावली<BR> शुद्धा Kau. A. 2. 11. एकावली कण्ठविभूषणं वः Vikr. 1. 30; लताविटपे<BR> एकावली लग्ना V. 1.<BR>—2 (in Rhetoric) Necklace━ a series of statements in which there is<BR> a regular transition from a predicate to a subject, or from a subject to<BR> a predicate; स्थाप्यतेऽपोह्यते वापि यथापूर्वं परस्परम् । विशेषनतया<BR> यत्र वस्तु सैकावली द्विधा ॥ K. P. 10; cf. Candr. 5. 103-4; नेत्रे<BR> कर्णान्तविश्रान्ते कर्णौ दोःस्तम्भदोलितौ &c. and Bk. 2. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकावली
एक + -आवलिः, -आवली <i>f.</i> —1 a single string of pearls, beads &c.; सूत्रमेकावली<BR> शुद्धा Kau. A. 2. 11. एकावली कण्ठविभूषणं वः Vikr. 1. 30; लताविटपे<BR> एकावली लग्ना V. 1.<BR>—2 (in Rhetoric) Necklace━ a series of statements in which there is<BR> a regular transition from a predicate to a subject, or from a subject to<BR> a predicate; स्थाप्यतेऽपोह्यते वापि यथापूर्वं परस्परम् । विशेषनतया<BR> यत्र वस्तु सैकावली द्विधा ॥ K. P. 10; cf. Candr. 5. 103-4; नेत्रे<BR> कर्णान्तविश्रान्ते कर्णौ दोःस्तम्भदोलितौ &c. and Bk. 2. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाहार्य
एक + -आहार्य <i>a.</i> having the same food; making no difference between<BR> allowed and forbidden food; एकाहार्यं युगं सर्वम् Mb. 3. 190. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोक्तिः|एकोक्ति
एक + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i> a single expression or word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोत्तर
एक + -उत्तर <i>a.</i> greater or increasing by one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोदकः|एकोदक
एक + -उदकः (a relative) connected by the offering of funeral libations<BR> of water to the same deceased ancestor; जन्मन्येकोदकानां तु त्रिरात्राच्छुद्धिरिष्यते Ms. 5. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोदरः|एकोदर
एक + -उदरः, -उदरा uterine, (brother or sister).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोदरा
एक + -उदरः, -उदरा uterine, (brother or sister).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोदात्त
एक + -उदात्त <i>a.</i> having one Udātta accent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोद्दिष्टम्
एक + -उद्दिष्टम् a Śrāddha or funeral rite performed for one definite<BR> individual deceased, not including other ancestors; see एकानुदिष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकोन
एक + -ऊन <i>a.</i> less by one, minus one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकर्च्
एक + -ऋच् <i>a.</i> consisting of one verse (ऋच्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकर्चम्
एक + -ऋच् + .({@-चम्@}) A Sūkta of one verse only; Av. 19. 23. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैक
एक + -एक <i>a.</i> one by one, one taken singly, a single one; एकैकमप्यनर्थाय<BR> किमु यत्र चतुष्टयम् H. Pr. 11; R. 17. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैकम्
एक + -एक + .({@-कम्@}), {@एकैकशः@}, <i>ind.</i><BR> one by one, singly, severally; एकैकमत्र<BR> दिवसे दिवसे Ś. 6. 11; ˚कं निर्दिशन् Ś. 7 pointing to each severally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैकश्यम्
एक + -एकश्यम् (एकैकश्यम्) Single state, severally एकैकश्येनानुपूर्वं<BR> भूत्वा भूत्वेह जायते Bhāg. 7. 15. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकैकश्येन
एक + -एकश्येन (instrumental used as an adv.) individually, singly, one<BR> by one. ते यदि एकैकश्येनपि कुर्वन्ति तथापि सत्रक्रियामभिसमीक्ष्य बहव<BR> एव कुर्वन्तीति बहुवचनं भविष्यति । ŚB. on MS. 10. 6. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकौघः|एकौघ
एक + -ओघः<BR>—1 a continuous current.<BR>—2 A single flight (of arrows); एकौघेन स्वणपुङ्खैर्द्विषन्तः (आकिरन्ति<BR> स्म) Śi. 18. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककपाल
एक + -कपाल <i>a.</i> consisting of or contained in one cup.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककर
एक + -कर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 doing only one thing.<BR>—2 (-रा) one-handed.<BR>—3 one-rayed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककार्य|एककार्य्य
एक + -कार्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 acting in concert with, co-operating, having made common cause with;<BR> co-worker; अस्माभिः सहैककार्याणाम् Mu. 2; R. 10. 40.<BR>—2 answering the same end.<BR>—3 having the same occupation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककार्यम्
एक + -कार्य + .({@-र्यम्@}) sole or same business.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककालः|एककाल
एक + -कालः<BR>—1 one time.<BR>—2 the same time,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककालम्
एक + -कालः + ({@-लम्, -ले@}) <i>ind.</i> at one time, at one and<BR> the same time; एककालं चरेद्भैक्षम् Ms. 6. 55. ˚भोजनम् eating<BR> but one meal in any given time.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">Page0495-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककाले
एक + -कालः + ({@-लम्, -ले@}) <i>ind.</i> at one time, at one and<BR> the same time; एककालं चरेद्भैक्षम् Ms. 6. 55. ˚भोजनम् eating<BR> but one meal in any given time.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">Page0495-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककालिकम्
एक + -कालिकम् Once a day; तेभ्यो लब्धेन भैक्ष्येण वर्तयन्नेककालिकम् Ms. 11. 123.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककालीन
एक + -कालीन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 happening once only;<BR>—2 Contemporary, coeval.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककुण्डलः|एककुण्डल
एक + -कुण्डलः, -कुण्डलिन्, N. of Kubera; of Balabhadra and Śeṣa;<BR> गर्गस्रोतो महातीर्थमाजगामैककुण्डली Mb. 9. 37. 14. cf. एककुण्डल<BR> आख्यातो बलरामे धनाधिपे Med.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककुण्डलिन्
एक + -कुण्डलः, -कुण्डलिन्, N. of Kubera; of Balabhadra and Śeṣa;<BR> गर्गस्रोतो महातीर्थमाजगामैककुण्डली Mb. 9. 37. 14. cf. एककुण्डल<BR> आख्यातो बलरामे धनाधिपे Med.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककुष्ठम्
एक + -कुष्ठम् a kind of leprosy; कृष्णारुणं येन भवेच्छरीरं तदेककुष्ठं<BR> प्रवदन्त्यसाध्यम् Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकक्षीरम्
एक + -क्षीरम् the milk of one (nurse &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकगम्यः|एकगम्य
एक + -गम्यः the supreme spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकगुरु|एकगुरुः
एक + -गुरु, -गुरुक <i>a.</i> having the same preceptor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकगुरुक|एकगुरुकः
एक + -गुरु, -गुरुक <i>a.</i> having the same preceptor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकगुरुः|एकगुरु
एक + -गुरु, -गुरुक + .({@-रुः, -रुकः@}) a spiritual brother (pupil of the same preceptor).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकगुरुकः|एकगुरुक
एक + -गुरु, -गुरुक + .({@-रुः, -रुकः@}) a spiritual brother (pupil of the same preceptor).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकग्राम|एकग्रामः
एक + -ग्राम <i>a.</i> living in the same village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकग्रामः|एकग्राम
एक + -ग्राम + ({@-मः@}) the same village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकग्रामीण
एक + -ग्रामीण <i>a.</i> Inhabiting the same village; नैकग्रामीणमतिथिम् Ms. 3. 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचक्र|एकचक्रं|एकचक्रः
एक + -चक्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having only one wheel. (said of the sunʼs chariot); सप्त युञ्जन्ति<BR> रथमेकचक्रम् Rv. 1. 164. 2.<BR>—2 governed by one king only.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचक्रः|एकचक्र|एकचक्रं
एक + -चक्र + ({@-क्रः@}) the chariot of the sun.<BR> ˚वर्तिन् <i>m.</i> sole master of the whole universe, universal monarch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचक्रा
एक + -चक्र + .({@-क्रा@}) N. of the town of Kīchakas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचत्वारिंशत्
एक + -चत्वारिंशत् <i>f.</i> forty-one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचर|एकचरः
एक + -चर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 wandering or living alone, alone; अयमेकचरो ऽभिवर्तते माम् Ki. 13. 3, 3. 53.<BR> Kau. A. 1. 18. स्वच्छन्दमेकचरं Mu.<BR>—2 having one attendant.<BR>—3 living unassisted.<BR>—4 going together or at the same time.<BR>—5 gregarious.<BR>—6 (Said of certain animals); न भक्षयेदेकचरान् Ms. 5. 17; Bhāg. 5. 8. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचरः|एकचर
एक + -चर + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a rhinoceros.<BR>—2 An ascetic (यति); नाराजके जनपदे चरत्येकचरो वशी Rām. 2. 67. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचरण
एक + -चरण <i>a.</i> having only one foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचारिन्
एक + -चारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 living alone, solitary.<BR>—2 going alone or with one follower only.<BR>—3 An attendant of Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचारिणी
एक + -चारिन् + ({@-णी@}) a loyal wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचित्त
एक + -चित्त <i>a.</i> thinking of one thing only, absorbed in one object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचित्तम्
एक + -चित्त + .({@-त्तम्@})<BR>—1 fixedness of thought upon one object.<BR>—2 unanimity एकचित्तीभूय H. 1 unanimously; ˚ता fixedness of mind,<BR> agreement, unanimity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचिन्तनम्
एक + -चिन्तनम् thinking of only one object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचिन्मय
एक + -चिन्मय <i>a.</i> Consisting of intelligence; Rāmatāpanīya Upaniṣad<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचेतस्
एक + -चेतस्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> unanimous; see ˚चित्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकमनस्
एक + -चेतस्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> unanimous; see ˚चित्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचोदन
एक + -चोदन <i>a.</i> Resting upon one rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकचोदनम्
एक + -चोदन + ({@-नम्@}) referring<BR> to in the singular number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकच्छत्र|एकछत्त्र|एकछत्र
एक + -च्छत्र <i>a.</i> Ruled by one king solely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकच्छायाश्रित
एक + -च्छायाश्रित <i>a.</i> Involved in similarity (of debt) with one debtor<BR> (said of a surety); Y. 2. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकज|एकजः
एक + -ज <i>a.</i><BR>—1 born alone or single.<BR>—2 growing alone (a tree); महानप्येकजो वृक्षो बलवान्सुप्रतिष्ठितः Pt. 3. 54.<BR>—3 alone of its kind.<BR>—4 uniform, unchanging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजः|एकज
एक + -जः, -जा a brother or sister of the same parents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजा
एक + -जः, -जा a brother or sister of the same parents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजटा
एक + -जटा N. of a goddess उग्रतारा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजन्मन्
एक + -जन्मन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a king.<BR>—2 a Śūdra; see ˚जाति below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजात
एक + -जात <i>a.</i> born of the same parents; Ms. 9. 148.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजाति|एकजातिः
एक + -जाति <i>a.</i><BR>—1 once born.<BR>—2 belonging to the same family or caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजातिः|एकजाति
एक + -जाति + .({@-तिः@}) a Śūdra (opp. द्विजन्मन्); ब्राह्मणः क्षत्रियो वैश्यस्त्रयो<BR> वर्णा द्विजात्तयः । चतुर्थ एकजातिस्तु शूद्रो नास्ति तु पञ्चमः ॥ Ms. 10. 4, 8. 270.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजातीय
एक + -जातीय <i>a.</i> of the same kind, species or family. {@˚अनुसमयः@}<BR> performance of one detail with reference to all things or persons, then<BR> doing the second, then the third and so on (see पदार्थानुसमय) Ms. 5. 2. 1-2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकजीववादः|एकजीववाद
एक + -जीववादः (in phil.) the assertion of a living soul only.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकज्या
एक + -ज्या the chord of an<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">Page0496-1</a>]<BR> arc; sine of 30°.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकज्योतिस्
एक + -ज्योतिस् <i>m.</i> N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतान|एकतानः
एक + -तान <i>a.</i> concentrated or fixed on one object only, closely<BR> attentive; ब्रह्मैकतानमनसो हि वसिष्ठमिश्राः Mv. 3. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतानः|एकतान
एक + -तान + .({@-नः@})<BR>—1 attention fixed on one object only; A. Rām. 6. 2. 20.<BR>—2 musical harmony, = ˚तालः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकताल|एकतालः
एक + -ताल <i>a.</i> Having a single palm tree; एकताल इवोत्पातपवनप्रेरितो<BR> गिरिः R. 15. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतालः|एकताल
एक + -तालः harmony, accurate adjustment of song, dance, and instrumental<BR> music (cf. तौर्यत्रिकम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतालम्
एक + -तालः + -लम् A kind of sculptural measurement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकताली
एक + -तालः + -लम् + ({@-ली@}) an instrument<BR> for beating time, any instrument having but one note.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतीर्थिन्
एक + -तीर्थिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 bathing in the same holy water.<BR>—2 belonging to the same religious order; क्रमेणाचार्यसच्छिष्यधर्मभ्रात्रेकतीर्थिनः<BR> Y. 2. 137. ━<i>m.</i> a fellow student, spiritual brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतेजन
एक + -तेजन <i>a.</i> Ved. having only one shaft (an arrow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकत्रिंशत्
एक + -त्रिंशत् <i>f.</i> thirty-one; ˚त्रिंश 31st.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकत्रिकः|एकत्रिक
एक + -त्रिकः a kind of sacrifice performed in or lasting for a day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदंष्ट्रः|एकदंष्ट्र
एक + -दंष्ट्रः, -दन्तः “one-tusked”, epithets of Gaṇeśa (एकदंष्ट्रः)<BR> A kind of fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदन्तः|एकदन्त|एकदंत
एक + -दंष्ट्रः, -दन्तः “one-tusked”, epithets of Gaṇeśa (एकदंष्ट्रः)<BR> A kind of fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदण्डिन्|एकदंडिन्
एक + -दण्डिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 N. of a class of Sannyāsins or beggars (otherwise called हंस).<BR> They are divided into four orders:− कुटीचको बहूदको हंसश्चैव तृतीयकः ।<BR> चतुर्थः परहंसश्च यो यः पश्चात्स उत्तमः ॥ Hārīta.<BR>—2 N. of a Vedantic school.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदलः|एकदल
एक + -दलः, -पत्रः N. of a plant (चन्डालकन्द).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपत्रः|एकपत्र
एक + -दलः, -पत्रः N. of a plant (चन्डालकन्द).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदिश्
एक + -दिश् <i>a.</i> living in the same region or quarter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदुःखसुख
एक + -दुःखसुख <i>a.</i> sympathising, having the same joys and sorrows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदृश्
एक + -दृश्, -दृष्टि <i>a.</i> one-eyed. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 a crow.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR>—3 a philosopher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदृष्टि|एकदृष्टिः
एक + -दृश्, -दृष्टि <i>a.</i> one-eyed. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 a crow.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR>—3 a philosopher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदृश्य
एक + -दृश्य <i>a.</i> the sole object of vision, alone being worthy of<BR> being seen. तमेकदृश्यं नयनैः पिबन्त्यो Ku. 7. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदृष्टिः|एकदृष्टि
एक + -दृष्टिः <i>f.</i> fixed or steady look.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेवः|एकदेव
एक + -देवः the Supreme god.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेवत
एक + -देवत, -देवत्य, -दैवत्य <i>a.</i> devoted, directed<BR> or offered to one deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेवत्य
एक + -देवत, -देवत्य, -दैवत्य <i>a.</i> devoted, directed<BR> or offered to one deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदैवत्य
एक + -देवत, -देवत्य, -दैवत्य <i>a.</i> devoted, directed<BR> or offered to one deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेश|एकदेशः
एक + -देश <i>a.</i> occupying the same place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेशः|एकदेश
एक + -देश + ({@-शः@})<BR>—1 one spot or place.<BR>—2 a part or portion (of the whole), one side; ˚अवतीर्णा K. 22; तस्यैकदेशः<BR> U. 4; Mv. 2; विभावितैकदेशेन देयं यदभियुज्यते V. 4. 33 ‘what is claimed should be given by one who is proved to have got a part of it’<BR>;<BR> (this is sometimes called एकदेशविभावितन्याय) ˚क्षाण <i>a.</i><BR> partly burnt. एकदेशक्षाणमपि क्षाणमेव । ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेशिन्
एक + -देशिन् <i>a.</i> consisting of parts or portions divided into parts.<BR>━<i>m.</i> A disputant knowing only part of the true state of the case.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेह|एकदेहः
एक + -देह, -देहिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having only one body.<BR>—2 elegantly formed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेहिन्
एक + -देह, -देहिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having only one body.<BR>—2 elegantly formed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदेहः|एकदेह
एक + -देह, -देहिन् + ({@-हः@})<BR>—1 the planet Mercury.<BR>—2 (du.) Husband and wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधनः|एकधन
एक + -धनः a kind of jug with which water is taken up at certain religious<BR> ceremonies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधनम्
एक + -धनः + ({@-नम्@})<BR>—1 an excellent gift.<BR>—2 honorific offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधनिन्
एक + -धनिन् <i>a.</i> obtaining an honorific offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधर्मन्|एकधर्म्मन्
एक + -धर्मन्, -धर्मिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 possessing the same properties of the same kind.<BR>—2 professing the same religion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधर्मिन्
एक + -धर्मन्, -धर्मिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 possessing the same properties of the same kind.<BR>—2 professing the same religion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधुर|एकधुरः
एक + -धुर, -धुरावह, -धुरीण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fit for but one kind of labour.<BR>—2 fit for but one yoke (as cattle for special burden; P. IV. 4. 79).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधुरावह|एकधुरावहः
एक + -धुर, -धुरावह, -धुरीण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fit for but one kind of labour.<BR>—2 fit for but one yoke (as cattle for special burden; P. IV. 4. 79).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधुरीण|एकधुरीणः
एक + -धुर, -धुरावह, -धुरीण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fit for but one kind of labour.<BR>—2 fit for but one yoke (as cattle for special burden; P. IV. 4. 79).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधुरा
एक + -धुरा a particular load or conveyance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनक्षत्रम्
एक + -नक्षत्रम् a lunar mansion consisting of only one star.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनटः|एकनट
एक + -नटः the principal actor in a drama, the manager (सूत्रधार)<BR> who recites the prologue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनयनः|एकनयन
एक + -नयनः The planet Venus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनवतः|एकनवत
एक + -नवतः ninety-first.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनवतिः|एकनवति
एक + -नवतिः <i>f.</i> ninety-one.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">Page0496-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनाथ|एकनाथः
एक + -नाथ <i>a.</i> having one master.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनाथः|एकनाथ
एक + -नाथ + .({@-थः@})<BR>—1 sole master or lord.<BR>—2 N. of an author.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनायकः|एकनायक
एक + -नायकः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनिश्चय|एकनिश्चयः
एक + -निश्चय <i>a.</i> come to the same conclusion or resolution, having the same aim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनिश्चयः|एकनिश्चय
एक + -निश्चय + .({@-यः@}) general agreement or conclusion, unanimity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनिपातः|एकनिपात
एक + -निपातः A particle which is a single word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनिष्ठ
एक + -निष्ठ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 intently devoted or loyal (to one thing).<BR>—2 intently fixed on one object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकनेत्रः|एकनेत्र
एक + -नेत्रः<BR>—1 N. of Śiva; (one-eyed).<BR>—2 (With Śaivas) One of the eight forms of Vidyeśvara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपक्ष|एकपक्षः
एक + -पक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of the same side or party, an associate.<BR>—2 partial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपक्षः|एकपक्ष
एक + -पक्ष + ({@-क्षः@}) one side or party; ˚आश्रयविक्लवत्वात्<BR> R. 14. 34; ˚क्षे in one point of view, in one case.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपक्षीभावः|एकपक्षीभाव
एक + -पक्षीभावः The state of being the one alternative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपञ्चाशत्
एक + -पञ्चाशत् <i>f.</i> fifty-one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपतिक
एक + -पतिक <i>a.</i> having the same husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपत्नी
एक + -पत्नी<BR>—1 a faithful wife (perfectly chaste); तां चावश्यं दिवसगणनातत्परामेकपत्नीम् Me. 10.<BR>—2 the wife of a man who has no other wives; यो धर्म एकपत्नीनां काङ्क्षन्ती<BR> तमनुत्तमम् Ms. 5. 158.<BR>—3 the wife of the same man; a co-wife; सर्वासामेकपलीनामेका चेत्पुत्रिणी<BR> भवेत् Ms. 9. 183. ˚व्रतम् a vow of perfect chastity; कामेकपत्नीव्रतदुःखशीलाम् Ku. 3. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपत्रिका
एक + -पत्रिका the plant Ocimum Gratissimum (गन्धपत्रा; Mar. नागदवणी)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपद्
एक + -पद्, -पाद् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one-footed, limping, lame.<BR>—2 incomplete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपाद्
एक + -पद्, -पाद् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one-footed, limping, lame.<BR>—2 incomplete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपाद्
एक + -पद्, -पाद् + .({@-पाद्@}) <i>m.</i> N. of Śiva or Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपदी
एक + -पद्, -पाद् + .({@-पदी@}) a foot-path (for a single man to walk on). एकपद्या<BR> तया यान्ती नलिकायन्त्रतुल्यया Śiva B. 28. 66<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपद|एकपदं|एकपदः
एक + -पद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one-footed.<BR>—2 consisting of or named in one word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपदम्
एक + -पद + ({@-दम्@})<BR>—1 a single step.<BR>—2 single or simple word.<BR>—3 the time required to pronounce a single word.<BR>—4 present time, same time;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपदः|एकपद|एकपदं
एक + -पद + ({@-दः@})<BR>—1 a man having one foot.<BR>—2 a kind of coitus (रतिबन्ध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपदे
एक + -पद + .({@-दे@}) <i>ind.</i> suddenly, all at once, abruptly; निहन्त्यरीनेकपदे<BR> य उदात्तः स्वरानिव Śi. 2. 95; R. 8. 48; K. 45; V. 4. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपदा
एक + -पद + .({@-दे@}) + ({@-दा@})<BR> a verse consisting of only one Pāda or quarter stanza.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपदी
एक + -पद + .({@-दी@})<BR>—1 a woman having one foot.<BR>—2 a Gāyatrī consisting of one Pāda. गायत्र्यस्येकपदी Bṛ. Up. 5. 14. 7.<BR>—3 Foot-path (Mar. पाऊलवाट); इयमेकपदी राजन्यतो मे पितुराश्रमः<BR> Rām. 2. 63. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपर
एक + -पर <i>a.</i> Ved. an epithet of the dice in which one is decisive<BR> or of pre-eminent importance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपरि
एक + -परि <i>ind.</i> one over or under, (a term at dice; cf. अक्षपरि).<BR> अक्षस्याहमेकहरस्य हेतोः Rv. 10. 34. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपर्णा|एकपर्ण्णा
एक + -पर्णा<BR>—1 N. of a younger sister of Durgā.<BR>—2 N. of Durgā.<BR>—3 a plant having one leaf only.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपलाशः|एकपलाश
एक + -पलाशः a single Butea Frondosa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपाटला
एक + -पाटला N. of a younger sister of Durgā; N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपाणः|एकपाण
एक + -पाणः a single wager.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपात
एक + -पात <i>a.</i> happening at once, sudden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतः|एकत
एक + -तः The first word of a Mantra (प्रतीक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपातिन्
एक + -पातिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 sudden.<BR>—2 standing alone or solitary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपातिनी
एक + -पातिन् + .({@-नी@}) <i>i. e.</i> ऋक् a verse to be taken by itself or independently<BR> of the hymn to which it belongs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपाद|एकपादः
एक + -पाद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having only one foot; तत्र शिश्रियेऽज एकपादः Av. 13. 1. 6.<BR>—2 using only one foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपादः|एकपाद
एक + -पाद + .({@-दः@})<BR>—1 one or single foot.<BR>—2 one and the same Pāda.<BR>—3 N. of Viṣṇu and Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपादिका
एक + -पादिका a kind of posture of birds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपार्थिवः|एकपार्थिव
एक + -पार्थिवः Sole ruler or king; न केवलं तद्गुरुरेकपार्थिवः R. 3. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपिङ्गः|एकपिङ्ग|एकपिंग
एक + -पिङ्गः, -पिङ्गलः N. of Kubera; having a yellow mark in place<BR> of one eye; (his eye was so made on account of a curse uttered by Pārvatī when<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">Page0497-1</a>]<BR> he cast an evil eye at her); Dk. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपिङ्गलः|एकपिङ्गल|एकपिंगल
एक + -पिङ्गः, -पिङ्गलः N. of Kubera; having a yellow mark in place<BR> of one eye; (his eye was so made on account of a curse uttered by Pārvatī when<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">Page0497-1</a>]<BR> he cast an evil eye at her); Dk. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0496-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपिण्ड|एकपिंड
एक + -पिण्ड <i>a.</i> united by the offering of the funeral rice-ball;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपिण्डता
एक + -पिण्डता, -पिण्डत्वम् consanguinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपिण्डत्वम्
एक + -पिण्डता, -पिण्डत्वम् consanguinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपुत्र
एक + -पुत्र <i>a.</i> having only one son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपुरुषः|एकपुरुष
एक + -पुरुषः<BR>—1 the Supreme Being; वेदान्तेषु यमाहुरेकपुरुषम् V. 1. 1;<BR>—2 the chief person. ━<i>a.</i> Consisting of only one man. तथैकपुरुषं<BR> राष्ट्रम् Bhāg. 6. 5. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपुष्कलः|एकपुष्कल
एक + -पुष्कलः + ({@-रः@}) N. of a musical instrument (Mar. काहल);<BR> ततः प्रयाते दाशार्हे प्रावाद्यन्तैकपुष्कराः Mb. 5. 94. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकपुष्करः|एकपुष्कर
एक + -पुष्कलः + ({@-रः@}) N. of a musical instrument (Mar. काहल);<BR> ततः प्रयाते दाशार्हे प्रावाद्यन्तैकपुष्कराः Mb. 5. 94. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकप्रकार
एक + -प्रकार <i>a.</i> of the same kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकप्रख्य
एक + -प्रख्य <i>a.</i> singularly like.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकप्रभुत्वम्
एक + -प्रभुत्वम् sole sovereignty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकप्रयत्नः|एकप्रयत्न
एक + -प्रयत्नः one effort (of the voice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकप्रस्थः|एकप्रस्थ
एक + -प्रस्थः a measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकप्रहारिक
एक + -प्रहारिक <i>a.</i> killed by one blow. Mk. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकप्राणयोगः|एकप्राणयोग
एक + -प्राणयोगः union in one breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकबुद्धि
एक + -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> having only one thought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभक्त
एक + -भक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 serving one master only.<BR>—2 worshipping one deity.<BR>—3 eating together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभुक्तम्
एक + -भक्त + .({@-भुक्तम्@}) N. of a religious ceremony; eating but one meal (a day)<BR> Mb. 3; Y. 3. 318. ˚व्रतम् eating but once a day as a religious observance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभक्ति
एक + -भक्ति <i>a.</i><BR>—1 believing in one deity.<BR>—2 firmly devoted; तेषां ज्ञानी नित्ययुक्त एकभक्तिर्विशिष्यते Bg. 7. 17.<BR>━<i>f.</i> eating but one meal a day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभार्या|एकभार्य्या
एक + -भार्या a faithful or chaste wife. तामेकभार्यां परिवादभीरोः R. 14. 86<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभार्र्यः
एक + -भार्या + .({@-र्यः@}) one having one wife only.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभाव|एकभावः
एक + -भाव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of the same or one nature.<BR>—2 sincerely devoted. —3 honest, sincerely disposed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभावः|एकभाव
एक + -भाव + ({@-वः@})<BR>—1 one feeling, the same or unchanged devotion; दुर्ग्राह्यत्वान्नृपतिमनसां<BR> नैकभावाश्रयाणां सेवाधर्मः परमगहनः Pt. 1. 285, 3. 65. स्वतेजसा<BR> सत्त्वगुणप्रवाहमात्मैकभावेन भजध्वमद्धा Bhāg.<BR>—2 oneness, agreement. cf. एको भावः सदा शस्तो यतीनां भवितात्मनाम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभूत
एक + -भूत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 being one, undivided<BR>—2 concentrated, closely attentive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभूमः|एकभूम
एक + -भूमः a palace having one floor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभोजन
एक + -भोजन, -भुक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 eating but one meal.<BR>—2 eating in common.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकभुक्त
एक + -भोजन, -भुक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 eating but one meal.<BR>—2 eating in common.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकमति
एक + -मति <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fixed on one object.<BR>—2 unanimous, thinking in the same way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकमनस्
एक + -मनस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 thinking with another, of one thought; ते निर्यान्तु मया सहैकमनसो<BR> येषामभीष्टं यशः Mu. 2. 13.<BR>—2 fixing the mind upon one object, closely attentive; गच्छन्तमेकमनसम्<BR> Mb. 1. 42. 36. एकमनाः श्रोतुमर्हति देवः M. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकमात्र
एक + -मात्र <i>a.</i> of one syllable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकमुख
एक + -मुख <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having the face directed towards one place, direction or object; सहस्रं<BR> स एकमुखो ददाति Av. 9. 4. 9.<BR>—2 having the same aim.<BR>—3 having one chief or head; द्यूतमेकमुखं कार्यम् Y. 2. 203.<BR>—4 having one door or entrance (as a मण्डप).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकमुखम्
एक + -मुख + .({@-खम्@})<BR>—1 gambling.<BR>—2 a kind of fruit (रुद्राक्षफल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकमूर्धन्
एक + -मूर्धन् = ˚मुख q. v. Av. 8. 9. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकमूला
एक + -मूला = अतसी q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकयष्टिः|एकयष्टि
एक + -यष्टिः, -यष्टिका a single string of pearls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकयष्टिका
एक + -यष्टिः, -यष्टिका a single string of pearls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकयोनि
एक + -योनि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 uterine.<BR>—2 of the same family or caste; एतद्विधानं विज्ञेयं विभागस्यैकयोनिषु Ms. 9. 148.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरजः|एकरज
एक + -रजः the plant भृङ्गराज (Mar. माका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरथः|एकरथ
एक + -रथः An eminent warrior; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरश्मि
एक + -रश्मि <i>a.</i> Lustrous Mb. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरस|एकरसः
एक + -रस <i>a.</i><BR>—1 finding pleasure only in one thing, of one flavour; रसान्तराण्येकरसं<BR> यथा दिव्यं पयोऽश्नुते R. 10. 17.<BR>—2 of one feeling or sentiment only; साहस˚ U. 5. 21 influenced only<BR> by rashness; विक्रम˚ K. 7; भावैकरसं मनः Ku. 5. 82; M. 3. 10;<BR> Bv. 2. 155; Śi. 6. 26; V. 1. 9.<BR>—3 of one tenor, stable, equable; Māl. 4. 7; U. 4. 15.<BR>—4 solely or exclusively devoted<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">Page0497-2</a>]<BR> (to one); अबलैकरसाः R. 9. 43, 8. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरसः|एकरस
एक + -रस + .({@-सः@})<BR>—1 oneness of aim or feeling.<BR>—2 the only flavour or pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरसम्
एक + -रस + .({@-सः@}) + ({@-सम्@}) a drama of one sentiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकराज्
एक + -राज्, -राजः <i>m.</i> an absolute king; प्राङ् विशाम्पतिरेकराट्<BR> त्वं वि राज Av. 3. 4. 1. ━<i>a.</i> Shining alone, alone visible; स<BR> वा एष तदा द्रष्टा नापश्यद् दृश्यमेकराट् Bhāg. 3. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकराजः|एकराज
एक + -रस + .({@-सः@}) + ({@-सम्@}) a drama of one sentiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरात्रः|एकरात्र
एक + -रात्रः a ceremony lasting one night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरात्रम्
एक + -रात्रः + ({@-त्रम्@}) one night;<BR> एकरात्रं तु निवसन्नतिथिर्ब्राह्मणः स्मृतः Ms. 3. 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरात्रिक
एक + -रात्रिक <i>a.</i> lasting or sufficient for one night only.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकराशिः|एकराशि
एक + -राशिः<BR>—1 a heap, crowd.<BR>—2 a sign of the zodiac. ˚भूत <i>a.</i> collected or heaped together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरिक्थिन्
एक + -रिक्थिन् <i>m.</i> a co-heir; यद्येकरिक्थिनौ स्यातामौरसक्षेत्रजौ<BR> सुतौ Ms. 9. 162.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरूप
एक + -रूप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of one form or kind, like, similar; आसवः प्रतिपदं प्रमदानां<BR> नैकरूपरसतामिव भेजे Ki. 9. 55.<BR>—2 uniform, one-coloured; Rv. 10. 169. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरूपम्
एक + -रूप + ({@-पम्@})<BR>—1 one form or kind;<BR>—2 The knowledge of reality. विमोचयत्येकरूपेण Sāṅ. K. 63. ˚ता<BR> uniformity, invariableness; क्षणद्युतीनां दधुरेकरूपताम् Ki. 8. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकरूप्य
एक + -रूप्य <i>a.</i> formed or arising from one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकलिङ्गः|एकलिङ्ग|एकलिंग|एकलिङ्गं
एक + -लिङ्गः<BR>—1 a word having one gender only.<BR>—2 N. of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकलिङ्गम्
एक + -लिङ्गः + ({@-ङ्गम्@}) a place in which for five krośas there<BR> is but one लिङ्ग (Phallus); पञ्चक्रोशान्तरे यत्र न लिङ्गान्तरमीक्ष्यते ।<BR> तदेकलिङ्गमाख्यातं तत्र सिद्धिरनुत्तमा ॥ Śabdak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवचनम्
एक + -वचनम् the singular number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवर्ण|एकवर्णः
एक + -वर्ण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of one colour.<BR>—2 identical, same.<BR>—3 of one tribe or caste.<BR>—4 involving the use of one letter (˚समीकरण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवर्णः|एकवर्ण
एक + -वर्ण + ({@-र्णः@})<BR>—1 one form.<BR>—2 a Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—3 a word of one syllable.<BR>—4 a superior caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवर्णी|एकवर्ण्णी
एक + -वर्ण + ({@-र्णी@}) beating time, the instrument (castanet);<BR> ˚समीकरणम् an equation involving one unknown quantity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवर्णिक
एक + -वर्णिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of one colour.<BR>—2 of one caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवर्षिका
एक + -वर्षिका a heifer one year old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवस्त्र
एक + -वस्त्र, -वसन <i>a.</i> having only one garment, in one dress<BR> (without उत्तरीय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवस्त्रम्
एक + -वस्त्र, -वसन + .({@-स्त्रम्@}) a single garment.//<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवसन
एक + -वस्त्र, -वसन <i>a.</i> having only one garment, in one dress<BR> (without उत्तरीय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवाक्यम्
एक + -वाक्यम् one or unanimous opinion; एकवाक्यं विवव्रुः R. 6. 85<BR> raised a unanimous cry; ˚ता consistency in meaning, unanimity,<BR> reconciling different statements, syntactical unity; प्रकरणाच्च ज्योतिष्टोमेनैकवाक्यता<BR> स्यात् । ŚB. on MS. 10. 5. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवाक्यकृ
एक + -वाक्यकृ €8 U. To effect syntactical unity, to construe as one<BR> sentence. तस्मात् प्रकृतानां … देवतानामन्यतमया देवतया प्रकृतत्वादेकवाक्यतां<BR> कृत्वा देवतामवगमिष्यामः । ŚB. on MS. 10. 8. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवाक्यया
एक + -वाक्यया €2 P. (with instrumental) To form one sentence with, to<BR> be syntactically connected with; न वै कृतं कर्म प्राकृतैरङ्गपदार्थैः<BR> सहैकवाक्यतां याति । ŚB. on MS. 10. 1. 2. {@˚त्वम्@} syntactical<BR> unity. The state of forming or being one sentence; एकवाक्यत्वाच्च । Ms. 10. 1. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवाचक
एक + -वाचक <i>a.</i> Synonymous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवादः|एकवाद
एक + -वादः<BR>—1 a kind of drum or tabor (Mar. डफ).<BR>—2 the unitarian doctrine, monotheism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवारम्
एक + -वारम्, -वारे <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 only once.<BR>—2 at once, suddenly.<BR>—3 at one time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवारे
एक + -वारम्, -वारे <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 only once.<BR>—2 at once, suddenly.<BR>—3 at one time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवासस्
एक + -वासस् <i>a.</i> Clothed in only one garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवासा
एक + -वासा A woman; Nigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविंश|एकविंशः
एक + -विंश <i>a.</i> twenty-first; consisting of twenty-one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविंशः|एकविंश
एक + -विंश + .({@-शः@}) the Ekaviṃśaṣṭoma; Av. 8. 9. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविंशक
एक + -विंशक <i>a.</i> The twenty-first; दश पूर्वान्परान् वंश्यानात्मानं<BR> चैकविंशकम् । ब्राह्मीपुत्रः सुकृतकृन्मोचयेदेनसः पितॄन् ॥ Ms. 3. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककम्
एक + -कम् The number twenty-one; Y. 3. 224.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविंशतिः|एकविंशति
एक + -विंशतिः <i>f.</i> twenty-one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविजयः
एक + -विजयः Complete victory; Kau. A. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविध
एक + -विध <i>a.</i> of one kind; simple.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">Page0498-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0497-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविलोचन
एक + -विलोचन <i>a.</i> one-eyed; see एकदृष्टि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकविषयिन्
एक + -विषयिन् <i>m.</i> a rival (having a common object or end in view).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवीरः|एकवीर
एक + -वीरः a pre-eminent warrior or hero; धर्म˚ Mv. 5. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवीरा
एक + -वीरा N. of a daughter of Śiva, a deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवृक्षः|एकवृक्ष
एक + -वृक्षः<BR>—1 one tree.<BR>—2 a district in which but one tree is seen for 4 Krośas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवृत्
एक + -वृत् <i>f.</i> heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवृन्दम्
एक + -वृन्दम्<BR>—1 a peculiar disease of the throat.<BR>—2 one heap or collection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवृषः|एकवृष
एक + -वृषः Ved. the chief bull; the best or most excellent of a number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवेणिः|एकवेणि
एक + -वेणिः, -वेणी <i>f.</i> a single braid of hair (worn by a woman as<BR> a mark of her separation from her husband &c.); गण्डाभोगात्कठिनविषमामेकवेणीं<BR> करेण Me. 93; ˚धरा Ś. 7; धृत˚ Ś. 7. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवेणी
एक + -वेणिः, -वेणी <i>f.</i> a single braid of hair (worn by a woman as<BR> a mark of her separation from her husband &c.); गण्डाभोगात्कठिनविषमामेकवेणीं<BR> करेण Me. 93; ˚धरा Ś. 7; धृत˚ Ś. 7. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकवेश्मन्
एक + -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i> a solitary house or room; विप्रदुष्टां स्त्रियं<BR> भर्ता निरुन्ध्यादेकवेश्मनि Ms. 11. 176.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकव्यवसायिन्
एक + -व्यवसायिन् <i>a.</i> following the same profession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकव्यावहारिकाः
एक + -व्यावहारिकाः N. of a Buddhist school.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशत
एक + -शत <i>a.</i> 101st.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशतम्
एक + -शत + ({@-तम्@}) 101; अत्रैतदेकशतं नाडीनां<BR> Praśna. Up. 3. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशफ|एकशफः
एक + -शफ <i>a.</i> whole-hoofed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशफः|एकशफ
एक + -शफ + .({@-फः@}) an animal whose hoof is not cloven (as a horse, ass &c.);<BR> अजाविकं सैकशफं न जातु विषमं भजेत् Ms. 9. 119.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशरणम्
एक + -शरणम् the sole recourse or refuge (especially applied to a deity).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशरीर
एक + -शरीर <i>a.</i> of one body or blood, consanguineous.<BR> ˚अन्वयः consanguineous descent. ˚अवयवः a descendant in a right line, blood-kinsman.<BR> ˚आरम्भः commencement of consanguinity by the union of father and mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशल्यः
एक + -शल्यः A kind of fish; Rām. 5. 11. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशाख|एकशाखः
एक + -शाख <i>a.</i> having one branch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशाखः|एकशाख
एक + -शाख + ({@-खः@}) a Brāhmaṇa of<BR> the same branch or school.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशायिन्
एक + -शायिन् <i>a.</i> Sleeping alone, chaste; Mb. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशाला
एक + -शाला A single hall or room;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशालम्
एक + -शाला + .({@-लम्@}) A house consisting of one hall; Matsya P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशीर्षन्
एक + -शीर्षन् = ˚मुख q. v. Av. 13. 4. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशुङ्ग
एक + -शुङ्ग <i>a.</i> having one sheath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशुङ्गा
एक + -शुङ्ग + ({@-ङ्गा@}) N. of a medicinal plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशुल्कम्
एक + -शुल्कम् One and the same purchase money (given to the parents<BR> of a bride); अन्यां चेद्दर्शयित्वाऽन्या वोदुः कन्या प्रदीयते । उभे ते एकशुल्केन<BR> वहेदित्यब्रवीन्मनुः ॥ Ms. 8. 204.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशृङ्ग|एकशृंग|एकशृङ्गः
एक + -शृङ्ग <i>a.</i> having only one horn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशृङ्गः|एकशृङ्ग|एकशृंग
एक + -शृङ्ग + ({@-ङ्गः@})<BR>—1 a unicorn; rhinoceros.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 a class of Pitṛs.<BR>—4 a mountain having one top.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशेपः|एकशेप
एक + -शेपः a tree having one root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशेषः|एकशेष
एक + -शेषः ‘the remainder of one’, a species of Dvandva compound in<BR> which one of two or more words only is retained; <i>e. g.</i> पितरौ<BR> father and mother, parents, (= मातापितरौ); so श्वशुरौः, भ्रातरः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकश्रुत
एक + -श्रुत <i>a.</i> once heard. ˚धर <i>a.</i> keeping in mind what<BR> one has heard once.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकश्रुतिः|एकश्रुति
एक + -श्रुतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 monotony.<BR>—2 the neutral accentless tone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकश्रुति|एकश्रुतिः
एक + -श्रुतिः + .({@-ति@}) <i>ind.</i> in a monotonous manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकश्रुष्टि
एक + -श्रुष्टि <i>a.</i> Ved. obedient to one command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकषष्ट
एक + -षष्ट <i>a.</i> sixty-first.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकषष्टिः|एकषष्टि
एक + -षष्टिः <i>f.</i> sixty-one. ˚तम <i>a.</i> sixty first.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकसंस्थ
एक + -संस्थ <i>a.</i> dwelling in one place; R. 6. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकसप्तत
एक + -सप्तत, ˚तितम् <i>a.</i> seventy-first.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकसप्ततिः|एकसप्तति
एक + -सप्ततिः <i>f.</i> seventy-one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकसभम्
एक + -सभम् a common place of meeting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकसर्ग|एकसर्गः
एक + -सर्ग <i>a.</i> closely attentive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकसर्गः|एकसर्ग
एक + -सर्ग + ({@-र्गः@}) concentration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकसहस्रम
एक + -सहस्रम 1001 or one thousand; वृषभैकसहस्रा गा दद्यात्सुचरितव्रतः Ms. 11. 127.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकसाक्षिक
एक + -साक्षिक <i>a.</i> witnessed by one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकसार्थम्
एक + -सार्थम् <i>ind.</i> together, in one company.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकसूत्रम्
एक + -सूत्रम् N. of a small double drum played by a string and ball<BR> attached to the body of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">Page0498-2</a>]<BR> it (Mar. डमरू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकस्तोमः|एकस्तोम
एक + -स्तोमः N. of Soma ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकस्थ
एक + -स्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 being or centred in one place; in one man; ज्ञानमेकस्थमाचार्ये … शौर्यमेकस्थमाचार्ये<BR> Mb. 7. 188. 45; Ku. 1. 49; हन्तैकस्थं क्वचिदपि न ते चण्डि सादृश्यमस्ति Me. 106.<BR>—2 close-standing, standing side by side.<BR>—3 collected, combined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकस्थानम्
एक + -स्थानम्<BR>—1 one or the same place; एकस्थाने प्रसूते वाक् Pt. 4. 5.<BR>—2 Standing closely; विपक्षेणापि मरुता यथैकस्थानवीरुधः Pt. 3. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकहंसः|एकहंस
एक + -हंसः the chief or highest Haṃsa (an allegorical designation<BR> of the soul). हिरण्मयः पुरुष एकहंसः Bṛ. Up. 4. 3. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकहायन
एक + -हायन <i>a.</i> one year old; त्रस्तैकहायनकुरङ्गविलोलदृष्टिः<BR> Māl. 4. 8; U. 3. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकहायनी
एक + -हायन + ({@-नी@}) a heifer one year old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकहायनम्
एक + -हायन + .({@-नम्@}) the period of one year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकक|एककः
एकक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Single, alone, solitary, without a coadjutor; अयं हि शिशुरेकको<BR> U. 5. 5; Dk. 111.<BR>—2 Same, identical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एककशतम्
एकक + .{@-शतम्@} one percent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतम|एकतमः
एकतम <i>a.</i> (<i>n.</i> ˚मत् <i>f.</i> ˚मा)<BR>—1 One of many.<BR>—2 One (used as an indefinite article).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतर|एकतरः
एकतर (<i>n.</i> ˚तरम्)<BR>—1 One of two, either; P. VII. 1. 26; Vārt.<BR>—2 Other, different.<BR>—3 One of many.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतस्
एकतस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 From one side, on one side.<BR>—2 Singly, one by one; एकतः−<BR> अन्यतः on one side-on the other side; प्रमुदितवरपक्षमेकतस्तत्क्षितिपतिमण्डलमन्यतो<BR> वितानम् R. 6. 85; Ki. 5. 2.<BR>एकतः━एकतः on the one side━on the other side; यात्येकतोऽस्तशिखरं<BR> पतिरोषधीनामाविष्कृतोऽरुणपुरःसर एकतोऽर्कः Ś. 4. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकतोदत्|एकतोदन्त्
एकतस् + .{@-दत्@} (एकतोदत्) Having teeth in only one jaw; Ms. 5. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकता
एकता, -त्वम्<BR> Oneness, unity, union, identity. व्रजतोरपि प्रणयपूर्वमेकताम् Śi. 13. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकत्वम्
एकता, -त्वम्<BR> Oneness, unity, union, identity. व्रजतोरपि प्रणयपूर्वमेकताम् Śi. 13. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकत्र
एकत्र <i>ind.</i> [एक-त्रल्]<BR>—1 In one place, in close connection.<BR>—2 Together, all taken together; एवमेतान्येकत्र चतुर्दश कुलानि<BR> K. 136; एकत्र-अपरत्र or एकत्र on one side-on the other, here-there.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकदा
एकदा <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Once, once upon a time, at one time.<BR>—2 At the same time, all at once, simultaneously; एकदा न विगृह्णीयाद्<BR> बहून्राजाभिघातिनः H. 4. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकधा
एकधा <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 In one way.<BR>—2 Singly.<BR>—3 At once, at the same time.<BR>—4 Together.<BR>—5 Once, sometimes; cf. यः सकृद् गाः प्रापयति स एकधा प्रापयतीत्युच्यते ।<BR> योऽपि सह प्रापयति सोऽप्येकधा प्रापयतीति ŚB. on MS. 10. 2. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकल|एकलः
एकल <i>a.</i> Alone, solitary; एकल एव मध्येस्थाता Ch. Up. 3. 11. 1;<BR> U. 4; (in music) a solo singer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकशस्
एकशस् <i>a.</i> <i>ind.</i> One by one, singly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाकिन्
एकाकिन् <i>a.</i> Alone, solitary. एकाकी यतचित्तात्मा धुरमेकाकिना<BR> न्यस्तां वृषभेण बलीयसा Rām. 6. 128. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशन्
एकादशन् <i>num. a.</i> Eleven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादश
एकादश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Eleventh. आत्मैकादशः Bṛ. Up. 3. 9. 4.<BR>—2 Consisting of eleven.<BR>—3 Lasting for eleven<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">Page0499-1</a>]<BR> months.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशी
एकादश + .{@-शी@}<BR>—1 The eleventh day of every fortnight of a lunar month, sacred to Viṣṇu;<BR> (when fasting is enjoined and is considered to be productive of great<BR> religious merit).<BR>—2 Presentations of offerings to deceased ancestors or Pitṛs on the eleventh<BR> day after decease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशम्
एकादश + .{@-शम्@} The number eleven.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: एकादशाहः, एकादशोत्तमः, एकादशद्वारम्, एकादशरुद्राः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशाहः|एकादशाह
एकादश + -अहः<BR>—1 a collection of 11 days.<BR>—2 a sacrifice lasting for eleven days.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशोत्तमः|एकादशोत्तम
एकादश + -उत्तमः N. of Śiva (the chief of the 11 Rudras).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशद्वारम्
एकादश + -द्वारम् the eleven holes of the body; पुरमेकादशद्वारम् Kaṭh. 5. 1;<BR> see ख.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशरुद्राः
एकादश + -रुद्राः (pl.) the eleven Rudras; see रुद्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशक
एकादशक <i>a.</i> Consisting of 11 parts; <i>viz.</i> eleven sense-organs;<BR> एकादशकश्च गणः Sāṅ. K. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशिन्
एकादशिन् <i>a.</i> Consisting of eleven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकादशिनी
एकादशिनी<BR>—1 Eleven repetitions of a Mantra.<BR>—2 A kind of sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाष्टका
एकाष्टका <i>f.</i> The eighth day of माघ; तस्मान्माध्यष्टमी एकाष्टका<BR> इति ŚB. on MS. 6. 5. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकाष्ठी
एकाष्ठी A seed of the cotton tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकिक
एकिक <i>a.</i> Alone; सीतां सौमित्रिणा त्यक्तां सध्रीचीं त्रस्नुमेकिकाम् Bk. 6. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकीकृ
एकीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To collect.<BR>—2 To unite, join together, combine. एकीकृतस्त्वचि निषिक्तः U.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकीभू
एकीभू €1 P. —1 To become one, blend, combine, bemingled. परेव्यये<BR> सर्व एकीभवन्ति Muṇḍ. 3. 2. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकीभावः|एकीभाव
एकीभावः<BR>—1 Combination, association.<BR>—2 Common nature or property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एकीय|एकीयः
एकीय <i>a.</i> Belonging to, or proceeding from, one.<BR> {@यः@} A partisan, an associate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एज्
एज् €1 Ā. (epic. P.) (एजते, एजाञ्चक्रे, ऐजिष्ट, एजितुम्, एजित)<BR>—1 To tremble, shake.<BR>—2 To move, stir; धृतराष्ट्रोऽयमेजति Mb.<BR>—3 To shine (P.). ━<i>With</i> {@अप@} to drive away.<BR>━{@उद्@} to rise, go upwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजक
एजक <i>a.</i> Shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजत्|एजन्त्
एजत् <i>a.</i> Trembling, shaking; movable (thing); Bhāg. 7. 3. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजत्क
एजत्क <i>a.</i> Trembling. वलीपलित एजत्कः Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजथुः|एजथु
एजथुः <i>m.</i> Ved. Trembling, shaking (of the earth.) महान्वेग<BR> एजथुर्वेपथुष्टे Av. 12. 1. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजनम्
एजनम् Trembling, shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजित
एजित <i>p. p.</i> Shaken, agitated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एजि
एजि <i>a.</i> Affected by wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एठ्
एठ् €1 Ā. (एठते, एठितुम्, एठित) To annoy, resist, oppose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एड|एडः
एड <i>a.</i> Deaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडः|एड
एड + .{@-डः@} A kind of sheep.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: एडगजः, एडमूक<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडगजः|एडगज
एड + -गजः the medicinal plant Cassia Tora or Alata (उरण) used<BR> for curing ring-worms (Mar. टाकळा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडमूक|एडमूकः
एड + -मूक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 deaf and dumb; cf. अनेडमूक.<BR>—2 wicked, perverse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडकः|एडक
एडकः<BR>—1 A ram; वर्धन्ते पक्षिसंघाश्च तथा पशुगवेडकम् Mb. 3. 142. 37.<BR>—2 A wild goat.<BR>—3 A kind of medicinal plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडका
एडकः + .{@-का@} A ewe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडुकः|एडुक|एडुकं
एडु(डू, डो)कः, -कम्<BR>—1 A building constructed of rubbish, bones &c., or of hard substances<BR> resembling bones.<BR>—2 A tomb, a wall round bones. ‘भित्तिः स्त्री कुड्यमेडूकं यदन्तर्न्यस्तकीकसम्’<BR> इत्यमरः; एडूकान् पूजयिष्यन्ति वर्जयिष्यन्ति देवताः Mb. 3. 190. 65.<BR>—3 (With Buddhists) A sanctuary filled with relics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडूकः|एडूक|एडूकं
एडु(डू, डो)कः, -कम्<BR>—1 A building constructed of rubbish, bones &c., or of hard substances<BR> resembling bones.<BR>—2 A tomb, a wall round bones. ‘भित्तिः स्त्री कुड्यमेडूकं यदन्तर्न्यस्तकीकसम्’<BR> इत्यमरः; एडूकान् पूजयिष्यन्ति वर्जयिष्यन्ति देवताः Mb. 3. 190. 65.<BR>—3 (With Buddhists) A sanctuary filled with relics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडोकः|एडोक|एडोकं
एडु(डू, डो)कः, -कम्<BR>—1 A building constructed of rubbish, bones &c., or of hard substances<BR> resembling bones.<BR>—2 A tomb, a wall round bones. ‘भित्तिः स्त्री कुड्यमेडूकं यदन्तर्न्यस्तकीकसम्’<BR> इत्यमरः; एडूकान् पूजयिष्यन्ति वर्जयिष्यन्ति देवताः Mb. 3. 190. 65.<BR>—3 (With Buddhists) A sanctuary filled with relics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडुकम्
एडु(डू, डो)कः, -कम्<BR>—1 A building constructed of rubbish, bones &c., or of hard substances<BR> resembling bones.<BR>—2 A tomb, a wall round bones. ‘भित्तिः स्त्री कुड्यमेडूकं यदन्तर्न्यस्तकीकसम्’<BR> इत्यमरः; एडूकान् पूजयिष्यन्ति वर्जयिष्यन्ति देवताः Mb. 3. 190. 65.<BR>—3 (With Buddhists) A sanctuary filled with relics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडूकम्
एडु(डू, डो)कः, -कम्<BR>—1 A building constructed of rubbish, bones &c., or of hard substances<BR> resembling bones.<BR>—2 A tomb, a wall round bones. ‘भित्तिः स्त्री कुड्यमेडूकं यदन्तर्न्यस्तकीकसम्’<BR> इत्यमरः; एडूकान् पूजयिष्यन्ति वर्जयिष्यन्ति देवताः Mb. 3. 190. 65.<BR>—3 (With Buddhists) A sanctuary filled with relics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एडोकम्
एडु(डू, डो)कः, -कम्<BR>—1 A building constructed of rubbish, bones &c., or of hard substances<BR> resembling bones.<BR>—2 A tomb, a wall round bones. ‘भित्तिः स्त्री कुड्यमेडूकं यदन्तर्न्यस्तकीकसम्’<BR> इत्यमरः; एडूकान् पूजयिष्यन्ति वर्जयिष्यन्ति देवताः Mb. 3. 190. 65.<BR>—3 (With Buddhists) A sanctuary filled with relics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणः|एण
एणः, एणकः<BR>—1 A kind of black antelope; कांश्चिदेणान्समाजध्ने शक्त्या शक्तिमतां<BR> वरः Mb. 1. 69. 22; तस्य स्तनप्रणयिभिर्मुहुरेणशावैः the several<BR> kinds of deer are given in this verse:− अनृचो माणवो ज्ञेय एणः कृष्णमृगः<BR> स्मृतः । रुरुर्गौरमुखप्रोक्तः शम्बरः शोण उच्यते ॥.<BR>—2 (In Astr.) Capricorn.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: एणाजिनम्, एणतिलकः, एणभृत्, एणैणाङ्क, एणचूडः, एणदृश्, एणनाभिः, एणमदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणकः|एणक
एणः, एणकः<BR>—1 A kind of black antelope; कांश्चिदेणान्समाजध्ने शक्त्या शक्तिमतां<BR> वरः Mb. 1. 69. 22; तस्य स्तनप्रणयिभिर्मुहुरेणशावैः the several<BR> kinds of deer are given in this verse:− अनृचो माणवो ज्ञेय एणः कृष्णमृगः<BR> स्मृतः । रुरुर्गौरमुखप्रोक्तः शम्बरः शोण उच्यते ॥.<BR>—2 (In Astr.) Capricorn.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: एणाजिनम्, एणतिलकः, एणभृत्, एणैणाङ्क, एणचूडः, एणदृश्, एणनाभिः, एणमदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणाजिनम्
एणः + -अजिनम् deer-skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणतिलकः|एणतिलक
एणः + -तिलकः, -भृत् the moon; so ˚अङ्कः, -˚लाञ्छनः &c. व्यरोचतैणाङ्क<BR> इवोडुभिर्वृतः Bhāg. 10. 29. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणभृत्
एणः + -तिलकः, -भृत् the moon; so ˚अङ्कः, -˚लाञ्छनः &c. व्यरोचतैणाङ्क<BR> इवोडुभिर्वृतः Bhāg. 10. 29. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणैणाङ्क
एणः + -एणाङ्क, -चूडः The god Śiva; एणाङ्कचूडस्य ततः प्रसादात्<BR> Śāhendra. 1. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणचूडः
एणः + -एणाङ्क, -चूडः The god Śiva; एणाङ्कचूडस्य ततः प्रसादात्<BR> Śāhendra. 1. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणदृश्
एणः + -दृश् <i>a.</i> one having eyes like those of a deer. ━<i>m.</i> Capricorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणनाभिः|एणनाभि
एणः + -नाभिः, -मदः Musk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणमदः|एणमद
एणः + -नाभिः, -मदः Musk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणी
एणी<BR>—1 A female black deer. —2 A kind of poisonous insect.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: एणीपद<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणीपद|एणीपदः
एणी + -पद <i>a.</i> having feet like those of a deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एणीपदः|एणीपद
एणी + -पद + ({@-दः@})<BR> a kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एत|एतं|एतः
एत <i>a.</i> (एता, एनी <i>f.</i> P. IV. 1. 39.) Of a variegated<BR> colour; shining.<BR>—2 Come, arrived.<BR>—3 Going, flowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतः|एत|एतं
एत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 A deer or antelope;<BR>—2 The hide of a deer.<BR>—3 A variegated colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एता
एत + .{@-ता@} A hind; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एनी
एनी A river, flowing stream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतग्व|एतग्वः
एतग्व <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Going on their way (said of the horses of gods).<BR>—2 Variegated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतग्वः|एतग्व
एतग्व + .{@-ग्वः@} A horse of a variegated colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतश|एतशः
एतश <i>a.</i> Ved. Of a variegated colour, shining; येन वृश्चादेतशो<BR> ब्रह्मणस्पतिः Rv. 10. 53. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतशः|एतश
एतश + .{@-शः@} A dappled horse (particularly the horses of the sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतशस्
एतशस् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—2 A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतिः|एति
एतिः <i>f.</i> Ved. Arrival, approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतद्
एतद् <i>pron. a.</i> (<i>m.</i> एषः, <i>f.</i> एषा, <i>n.</i> एतद्)<BR>—1 This, this here, yonder [referring to what is nearest to the speaker,<BR> (समीपतरवर्ति चैतदो रूपम); एते वयममी दाराः कन्येयं कुलजीवितम्<BR> K.; the Nom. forms are used like those of इदम् the sense of ‘here’;<BR> एष पृच्छामि, एष कथयामि Mu. 3 here I ask &c.; कदा गमिष्यसि-एष<BR> गच्छामि Sk.; एषोऽस्मि कामन्दकी संवृत्तः Māl. 1; एते नवीकृताः<BR> स्मः Ś. 5. In this sense एतद् is sometimes used to give emphasis<BR> to the personal pronouns; एषोऽहं कार्यवशादायोध्यिकस्तदानींतनश्च<BR> संवृत्तः U. 1.]<BR>—2 As the subject of a sentence it agrees in gender and number with the<BR> predicate without reference to the noun to which it refers; एतद् (शवला)<BR> मे धनम्; but may sometimes remain in the neuter; एतदेव गुरुषु<BR> वृत्तिः Ms. 2. 206.<BR>—3 It often refers to what<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">Page0500-1</a>]<BR> precedes, especially when it is joined with इदम् or any other pronoun;<BR> एष वै प्रथमः कल्पः Ms. 3. 147; इति यदुक्तं तदेतच्चिन्त्यम्;<BR> एतानीमानि, एते ते &c.<BR>—4 It is used in connection with a relative clause, in which case the<BR> relative generally follows; प्रच्छन्नवञ्चकास्त्वेते ये स्तेनाटविकादयः<BR> Ms. 9. 257. ━<i>ind.</i> In this manner, thus, so, here, at this time, now.<BR> <i>Note</i>:− एतद् appears as the first member of compounds which<BR> are mostly self-explaining; <i>e. g.</i> ˚अतिरिक्त Besides this. ˚अनन्तर<BR> immediately after this; ˚अन्त ending thus; ˚अर्थः this matter;<BR> ˚अर्थे on this account, therefore; ˚अवधि to this limit, so far;<BR> ˚अवस्थ <i>a.</i> of such a state or condition.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: एतत्कालः, एतत्कालीन, एतत्क्षणात्, एतद्द्वितीय, एतत्पर, एतत्प्रथम, एतद्योनिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतत्कालः|एतत्काल
एतद् + -कालः the present time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतत्कालीन
एतद् + -कालीन <i>a.</i> belonging to the present time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतत्क्षणात्
एतद् + -क्षणात् <i>ind.</i> henceforth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतद्द्वितीय
एतद् + -द्वितीय <i>a.</i> one who does anything for the second time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतत्पर
एतद् + -पर <i>a.</i> Intent on or absorbed in this.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतत्प्रथम
एतद् + -प्रथम <i>a.</i> one who does anything for the first time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतद्योनिन्
एतद् + -योनिन् <i>a.</i> having oneʼs origin in that. एतद्योनीनि भूतानि Bg. 7. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतदीय
एतदीय <i>a.</i> Belonging to this.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतनः|एतन
एतनः<BR>—1 Breath.<BR>—2 A species of fish. (Silurus Pebrius)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतर्हि
एतर्हि <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Now, at this time, at present, now-a-days; Bṛ. Up. 1. 4. 1; Ki. 1. 32.<BR> एतर्हि द्युमणिमणीमयीं हसन्तीम् । सेवन्ते किमु ककुभः … …<BR> Rām. Ch. 7. 53.<BR>—2 Then (correlative to यर्हि).<BR>—3 A certain measure of time = 15 idānims or one-fifteenth of a <i>Kṣipra</i>;<BR> cf. इदानीम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृश्
एतादृश्, -दृक्ष, -दृश् (-शी, -क्षी) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Such, such like; सर्वेऽपि नैतादृशाः Bh. 2. 51. अस्थाने पततामतीव<BR> महतामेतादृशी स्याद् गतिः । Udb.<BR>—2 Of this kind, similar to this.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृक्ष
एतादृश्, -दृक्ष, -दृश् (-शी, -क्षी) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Such, such like; सर्वेऽपि नैतादृशाः Bh. 2. 51. अस्थाने पततामतीव<BR> महतामेतादृशी स्याद् गतिः । Udb.<BR>—2 Of this kind, similar to this.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतादृश्
एतादृश्, -दृक्ष, -दृश् (-शी, -क्षी) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Such, such like; सर्वेऽपि नैतादृशाः Bh. 2. 51. अस्थाने पततामतीव<BR> महतामेतादृशी स्याद् गतिः । Udb.<BR>—2 Of this kind, similar to this.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतावत्|एतावन्त्
एतावत् <i>a.</i> So much, so great, so many, of such extent, so far,<BR> of such quality or kind; एतावदुक्त्वा विरते मृगेन्द्रे R. 2. 51; Ku. 6. 89;<BR> एतावान्मे विभवो भवन्तं सेवितुम् M. 2 so far; oft. used in<BR> connection with a relative pronoun which generally follows; एतावता नन्वनुमेयशोभि …<BR> आरोपितं यद् गिरिशेन पश्चादङ्कम् Ku. 1. 37. ━<i>ind.</i> So far,<BR> so much, in such a degree, thus; नैतावदन्ये मरुतो यथेमे Rv. 7. 57. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतावत्त्वम्
एतावत्त्वम्<BR>—1 Quantity or number.<BR>—2 Greatness; such a state or condition; such extent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतावन्मात्र
एतावन्मात्र <i>a.</i> Of this measure, so great, such; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एतृ
एतृ <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Going.<BR>—2 Asking, requesting; गृणीते अग्निरेतरी न शूषैः Rv. 5. 41. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एदिधिषुःपतिः|एदिधिषुःपति
एदिधिषुःपतिः The husband of a younger sister whose elder<BR> sister has not been married; cf. अग्रेदिधिषुः Vāj. 30. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एध्
एध् €1 Ā.<BR> (एधते, एधाञ्चक्रे, ऐधिष्ट, एधितुम्, एधित) —1 To grow, increase;<BR> विनापि संगमं स्त्रीणां कवीनां सुखमेधते Pt. 2. 164.<BR>—2 To prosper, become happy, live in comfort; द्वावेतौ सुखमेधेते Pt. 1. 318.<BR>—3 To grow strong, become<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">Page0500-2</a>]<BR> great.<BR>—4 To extend.<BR>—5 To swell, rise.<BR>.━<i>Caus.</i> To cause to grow or increase; to greet, celebrate, honour;<BR> नैदिधः स्वपराक्रम् Bk. 15. 19; (तां) आशीर्भिरेधयामासुः Ku. 6. 90.<BR>━<i>Desid.</i> एदिधिषते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधः|एध
एधः Fuel; स्फुलिङ्गावस्थया वह्निरेधापेक्ष इव स्थितः Ś. 7. 15;<BR> Śi. 2. 99; R. 9. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधतु|एधतुः
एधतु <i>a.</i> Increased, grown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधतुः|एधतु
एधतु + .{@-तुः@}<BR>—1 A man.<BR>—2 Fire.<BR>—3 Prosperity, happiness (Ved.). युवं हि ष्मा पुरुभुजेममेधतुम् Rv. 8. 86. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधमान
एधमान <i>a.</i> Prospering, increasing; ˚दृश् hating the impious<BR> who prosper (Sāy.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधस्
एधस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 Fuel; यथैधांसि समिद्धोऽग्निर्भस्मसात् कुरुतेऽर्जुन Bg. 4. 37; अनलायागुरुचन्दनैधसे<BR> R. 8. 71; Ms. 11. 71; Y. 2. 166.<BR>—2 Prosperity (in comp.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधा
एधा Prosperity, happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एधित|एधितः
एधित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Grown, increased; उद्धतानधिकमेधितौजसो Śi. 14. 31.<BR>—2 Brought up; मृगशावैः सममेधितो जनः Ś. 2. 19.<BR>—3 Filled; बन्दीभिरेधिताः काराः Mv. 7. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एनस्
एनस् <i>n.</i> [इ-असुन् नुट् Uṇ. 4. 197]<BR>—1 Sin, offence, fault; मुच्यन्ते ह्येनसोऽखिलात् Bhāg. 8. 4. 24. आत्मघातिन<BR> एनसा संयुज्यते K. 174; Śi. 14. 35, 16. 8.<BR>—2 Mischief, crime.<BR>—3 Unhappiness.<BR>—4 Censure, blame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एनस्य
एनस्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Caused by crime.<BR>—2 Sinful, wicked, wrong; यदि जाग्रद् यदि स्वपन्नेन एनस्योकरम् Rv. 6. 115. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एनस्वत्|एनस्वन्त्
एनस्वत्, एनस्विन् <i>a.</i> Wicked, sinful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एनस्विन्
