एरका
एरका A kind of grass (said to have turned to clubs when plucked<BR> by Kṛṣṇa^1 and his family; cf. Mb. मौसलपर्वन्), ददार करजैर्वक्षस्येरकां<BR> कटकृद्यथा Bhāg. 1. 3. 18.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरकम्
एरका + .{@-कम्@} A woollen carpet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरङ्गः|एरङ्ग|एरंगः
