एलङ्गः|एलङ्ग|एलंगः
एर(ल)ङ्गः A kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्डः|एरण्ड|एरंडः
एरण्डः The castor-oil plant; (a small tree with a scanty number<BR> of leaves); and hence the proverb: निरस्तपादपे देशे एरण्डोऽपि द्रुमायते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्डा
एरण्डः + .{@-ण्डा@} Long pepper.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: एरण्डपत्रिका, एरण्डफला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्डपत्रिका
एरण्डः + -पत्रिका, -फला the plant Croton Polyandrum (दन्तीवृक्ष).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

एरण्डफला
एरण्डः + -पत्रिका, -फला the plant Croton Polyandrum (दन्तीवृक्ष).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

