ओषधिजः|ओषधिज
ओषधिः + -ज + .({@-जः@}) fire; ज्वलयतौषधिजेन कृशानना Ki. 5. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओषधिधरः
ओषधिः + -धरः, -पतिः<BR>—1 a dealer in medicinal drugs.<BR>—2 a physician.<BR>—3 the moon; अमृतद्रवैर्विदधदब्जदृशामपमार्गमोषधिपतिः स्म करैः<BR> Śi. 9. 36 (where it means ‘physician’ also).<BR>—4 The Soma plant.<BR>—5 Camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओषधिपतिः|ओषधिपति
ओषधिः + -धरः, -पतिः<BR>—1 a dealer in medicinal drugs.<BR>—2 a physician.<BR>—3 the moon; अमृतद्रवैर्विदधदब्जदृशामपमार्गमोषधिपतिः स्म करैः<BR> Śi. 9. 36 (where it means ‘physician’ also).<BR>—4 The Soma plant.<BR>—5 Camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

