ओष्ण
ओष्ण <i>a.</i> [आ-उष्ण] A little warm, tepid (ईषदुष्ण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओहः|ओह
ओहः Ved.<BR>—1 Bringing, performing; ऋध्यामा त ओहैः Rv. 4. 10. 1.<BR>—2 Reaching.<BR>—3 Meditation.<BR>—4 A vehicle, means; गोरोहेण तौग्र्यो न जिव्रिः Rv. 1. 180. 5.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ओहब्रह्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ओहब्रह्मन्
