औचित्यम्
औचित्यम्, औचिती [उचित-ष्यञ् यलोपे ङीष्]<BR>—1 Aptness, fitness, propriety, suitableness.<BR>—2 Congruity or fitness, as one of the several circumstances which determine<BR> the exact meaning of a word in a sentence (such as संयोग, वियोग<BR> &c.); सामर्थ्यमौचिती देशः कालो व्यक्तिः स्वरादयः S. D. 2; in the<BR> example पातु वो दयितामुखम् there is औचिती or fitness in taking<BR> मुख to mean सांमुख्यम् (meeting) instead of आननम्.<BR>—3 Habituation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: औचित्यालङ्कारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औचिती
