औजसिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [ओजसा वर्तते ठक्] Energetic,<BR> vigorous, acting with strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

