औत्कर्ष्यम्
औत्कर्ष्यम् [उत्कर्ष-ष्यञ्] Excellence; superiority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औत्तङ्क
