औत्तर + -अह <i>a.</i> belonging to the following day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

