औत्तरपदिक
औत्तर + -पदिक <i>a.</i> comprehended in the last word or term.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औत्तरभक्तिक
औत्तर + -भक्तिक <i>a.</i> Taken after meal; Caraka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

