औत्पाद
औत्पाद <i>a.</i> (-दी <i>f.</i>) [उत्पाद-अण्] Relating to or<BR> treating of birth (उत्पाद q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औत्पुटिक
औत्पुटिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उत्पुट-ठक्] Receiving anything<BR> with उत्पुट (the mouth or beak turned upwards).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औत्र
औत्र <i>a.</i> Gross, rough, inexact (in Math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औत्स
औत्स <i>a.</i> (-त्सी <i>f.</i>) [उत्स-अञ्] P. IV. 1. 86. Born<BR> or produced in a fountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औत्सङ्गिक|औत्संगिक
औत्सङ्गिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उत्सङ्ग-ठक्] Born or placed upon the hip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औत्सर्गिक|औत्सर्गिकः
औत्सर्गिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उत्सर्ग-ष्ठञ्]<BR>—1 That which is liable to be abolished in exceptional cases, though generally<BR> valid (as a rule of grammar).<BR>—2 General (opp. to particular), not restricted<BR>—3 Terminating, concluding.<BR>—4 Leaving, quitting.<BR>—5 Natural, inherent.<BR>—6 Produced naturally or directly.<BR>—7 Derivative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औत्सुक्यम्
औत्सुक्यम् [उत्सुक-ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Anxiety, uneasiness; हृदयं चैव सौमित्रे अस्वस्थमिव लक्षये । औत्सुक्यं<BR> परमं चापि Rām. 7. 46. 15.<BR>—2 Ardent desire, eagerness, zeal; औत्सुक्यमात्रमवसादयति प्रतिष्ठा<BR> Ś. 5. 6; अवसाययति v. l. औत्सुक्येन कृतत्वरा सहभुवा व्यावर्तमाना<BR> ह्रिया Ratn. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदक
औदक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उदक-अण्] Aquatic, watery,<BR> referring to water; औदकानीव सत्त्वानि ग्रीष्मे सलिलसंक्षयात् Rām. 2. 33. 13;<BR> Ms. 1. 44. ˚ज produced by aquatic plants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदका
औदक + .{@-का@} A town surrounded by water; Hariv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदञ्चन|औदंचन
औदञ्चन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) [उदञ्चन-अण्] Contained<BR> in a bucket or pitcher; स एनां तत आदाय न्यधादौदञ्चनोदके Bhāg. 8. 24. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदनिकः|औदनिक
औदनिकः [ओदनाय प्रभवति ठञ्]<BR>—1 A cook, (one who knows how to cook).<BR>—2 One to whom rice or mashed grain is given at regular times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदपान
औदपान <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) [उदपानादागतः अण्] Raised<BR> from wells or drinking fountains (as a tax).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदयकाः
औदयकाः (pl.) A school of astronomers who reckoned the first motion<BR> of the planets from sunrise (उदय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदयिक
औदयिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उदय-ठञ्] One of the five different states<BR> of the soul (with Jainas), when actions arise and exert an inherent influence on the future.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदरिक|औदरिकः
औदरिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उदरे एव प्रसितः ठक्]<BR>—1 Voracious, gluttonous, glutton; सर्वत्रौदरिकस्याभ्यवहार्यमेव विषयः<BR> V. 3; M. 4; also Mb. 7. 139. 95.<BR>—2 Dropsical; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदर्य|औदर्यः|औदर्य्य
औदर्य <i>a.</i> [उदरे भवः यत्]<BR>—1 Being in the womb; अल्पाहारतया त्वग्निं शमयौदर्यमुत्थितम् Mb. 12. 17. 5.<BR>—2 Entered into the womb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदर्यः|औदर्य|औदर्य्य
औदर्य + .{@-र्यः@} A son; Bhāg. 3. 24. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदश्वित|औदश्वितं
औदश्वित, -शिवत्क <i>a.</i><BR>.(-ती, -की <i>f.</i>) [उदश्वित् अण् ठक् वा] P. IV. 2. 19; and VII. 3. 51.<BR> Made of, or seasoned with, butter-milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदशिवत्क
औदश्वित, -शिवत्क <i>a.</i><BR>.(-ती, -की <i>f.</i>) [उदश्वित् अण् ठक् वा] P. IV. 2. 19; and VII. 3. 51.<BR> Made of, or seasoned with, butter-milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदश्वितम्
औदश्वित, -शिवत्क + .{@-तम्@} Butter-milk with an equal proportion of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदस्थान
औदस्थान <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) [उदस्थान-ण] Accustomed<BR> to stand in water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदारिकम्
औदारिकम् (With Jainas) The gross body which envelopes the soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदार्यम्
औदार्यम् [उदार-ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Generosity, nobility, magnanimity अग्राम्यशब्दाभिधानमौदार्यम् Kau. A. 2. 10.<BR>—2 Greatness, excellence; sublimity, elevation; औदार्येणावगच्छामि निधानं<BR> तपसामिदम् Rām. 3. 12. 23.<BR>—3 Depth of meaning (अर्थसंपत्ति); स सौष्ठवौदार्यविशेषशालिनीं<BR> विनिश्चितार्थामिति वाचमाददे Ki. 1. 3; see Malli. on Ki. 11. 40; and<BR> उदारता also under उदार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदासीन्यम्
औदासीन्यम्, औदास्यम् [उदासीन or उदास-ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Indifference, apathy; पर्याप्तोऽसि प्रजाः पातुमौदासीन्येन वार्तितुम्<BR> R. 10. 25; इदानीमौदास्यं यदि भजसि भागीरथि G. L. 4.<BR>—2 Solitariness, loneliness.<BR>—3 Perfect indifference (to worldly affairs), stoicism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदास्यम्
औदासीन्यम्, औदास्यम् [उदासीन or उदास-ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Indifference, apathy; पर्याप्तोऽसि प्रजाः पातुमौदासीन्येन वार्तितुम्<BR> R. 10. 25; इदानीमौदास्यं यदि भजसि भागीरथि G. L. 4.<BR>—2 Solitariness, loneliness.<BR>—3 Perfect indifference (to worldly affairs), stoicism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदीच्य
औदीच्य <i>a.</i> Coming from or relating to the northern country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदुम्बर|औदुंबर|औदुम्बरः
औदुम्बर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उदुम्बर-अञ्]<BR>—1 Made of, or coming from, the Udumbara tree.<BR>—2 Made of copper; पात्रमौदुम्बरं गृह्य Mb. 13. 125. 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदुम्बरः|औदुम्बर|औदुंबर
औदुम्बर + .{@-रः@} [P. IV. 2. 67.]<BR>—1 N. of a region abounding in Udumbara trees.<BR>—2 A form of Yama, the god of death.<BR>—3 Made of copper.<BR>—4 A class of ascetics solely living on whatever fruits they see first<BR> early in the morning; Bhāg. 3. 12. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदुम्बरी
औदुम्बर + .{@-री@} A branch of the Udumbara tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदुम्बरम्
औदुम्बर + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 The wood of the Udumbara tree.<BR>—2 The Udumbara fruit.<BR>—3 A kind of leprosy.<BR>—4 Copper or a copper-vessel; Mb. 5. 40. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदुम्बरकः|औदुम्बरक|औदुंबरकः
औदुम्बरकः A place full of Udumbara trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औदुम्बरायणः|औदुम्बरायण
औदुम्बरायणः N. of a grammarian. इन्द्रियनित्यं वचनमौदुम्बराणः Nir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्गात्रम्
औद्गात्रम् [उद्गातृ-अञ् अण् वा] The office of the Udgātṛ priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्दालकम्
औद्दालकम् [उद्दालेन निर्वृत्तम् अण् संज्ञायां कन्] A bitter and acrid<BR> substance like honey; प्रायो वल्मीकमध्यस्थाः कपिलाः स्वल्पकीटकाः ।<BR> कुर्वन्ति कपिलं स्वल्पं तत्स्यादौद्दालकं मधु ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्देशिक
औद्देशिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उद्देश-ठक्]<BR>—1 Showing, indicative of.<BR>—2 Enumerating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्धत्यम्
औद्धत्यम् [उद्धत-ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Arrogance, insolence.<BR>—2 Boldness, bold or adventurous deeds; औद्धत्यमायोजितकामसूत्रम् Māl. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्धारिक
औद्धारिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उद्धार-ठञ्] Deducted from<BR> patrimony, portionable, heritable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्धारिकम्
औद्धारिक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A portion or inheritance (deducted from patrimony).<BR>—2 A part to be set aside; Ms. 9. 150.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्बिल्यम्
औद्बिल्यम् Excessive joy; Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्भिज्ज|औद्भिज्जं
औद्भिज्ज <i>a.</i> Coming forth from the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्भिज्जम्
औद्भिज्ज + .{@-ज्जम्@} [उद्भिज्ज अण्] Fossil salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्भिद|औद्भिदं
औद्भिद <i>a.</i> (-दी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उद्भिद-अण्]<BR>—1 Issuing (as from a well).<BR>—2 Victorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्भिदम्
औद्भिद + .{@-दम्@}<BR>—1 Spring water.<BR>—2 Fossil salt, rock salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्भिद्यम्
औद्भिद्यम्<BR>—1 Victoriousness; Vāj. 18. 9.<BR>—2 Production of plants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्रङ्गिकः|औद्रङ्गिक
औद्रङ्गिकः Collector of the tax called उद्रङ्ग which is probably<BR> a tax on permanent tenants; Ghoṣalʼs Revenue System, p. 210; EI. XXIII, p. 159.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्वाहिक|औद्वाहिकं
औद्वाहिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उद्वाह-ठञ्]<BR>—1 Relating to marriage.<BR>—2 Obtained in marriage; मैत्रमौद्वाहिकं चैव दायादानां न तद् भवेत्<BR> Y. 2. 118; Ms. 9. 206.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औद्वाहिकम्
औद्वाहिक + .{@-कम्@} A gift made to a woman at her marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औधस
औधस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>) [ऊधसः इदम् अण्] Being or contained<BR> in the udder (as milk); यवसं जग्ध्यनुदिनं नैवं दोग्ध्यौधसं पयः<BR> Bhāg. 4. 17. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औधस्यम्
औधस्यम् Milk (produced from the udder); R. 2. 66, v. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औन्नत्यम्
औन्नत्यम् [उन्नत-ष्यञ्] Height, elevation (moral also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औन्नेत्रम्
औन्नेत्रम् The office of the Unnetṛ, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औन्मुख्यम्
-औन्मुख्यम् Expectancy; Rāj. T.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपकर्णिक|औपकर्ण्णिक
औपकर्णिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [P. IV. 3. 40, IV. 1. 15.<BR> उपकर्ण-ठक्] Being near the ears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपकार्यम्
औपकार्यम्, -र्या<BR> [उपकार्य-अण्] A residence, a tent; औपकार्यां स गत्वा<BR> तु रघूणां कुलवर्धनम् Rām. 1. 70. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपकार्या|औपकार्य्या
औपकार्यम्, -र्या<BR> [उपकार्य-अण्] A residence, a tent; औपकार्यां स गत्वा<BR> तु रघूणां कुलवर्धनम् Rām. 1. 70. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपकुर्वाणक
औपकुर्वाणक <i>a.</i> Pertaining to a ब्रह्मचारी of a stipulated<BR> period; Bhāg. 5. 9. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपगविः|औपगवि
औपगविः Uddhava; Bhāg. 3. 4. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपग्रस्तिकः|औपग्रस्तिक
औपग्रस्तिकः, -ग्रहिकः<BR> [उपग्रस्त-ग्रह-ठञ्]<BR>—1 An eclipse.<BR>—2 The sun or moon in eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपग्रहिकः|औपग्रहिक
औपग्रस्तिकः, -ग्रहिकः<BR> [उपग्रस्त-ग्रह-ठञ्]<BR>—1 An eclipse.<BR>—2 The sun or moon in eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपचारिक
औपचारिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपचार-ठक्^1]<BR>—1 Metaphorical, figurative; secondary (opp. मुख्य).<BR>—2 Honorific, complimentary.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260402. note: hyphen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपचारिकम्
औपचारिक + .{@-कम्@} Figurative application.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपच्छन्दसिकम्
औपच्छन्दसिकम् N. of a metre; see App.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपजानुक
औपजानुक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [P. IV. 3. 40, IV. 1. 15. उपजानु-ठक्]<BR> Being near the knees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपदेशिक
औपदेशिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपदेश-ठक्]<BR>—1 Living by उपदेश or teaching.<BR>—2 Got by instruction (as wealth).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपद्रविक
औपद्रविक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपद्रव-ठक्^1] Relating<BR> to, or treating of, symptoms (of diseases).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260402. note: hyphen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपद्रष्ट्र्यम्
औपद्रष्ट्र्यम् [उपद्रष्टृ-ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Superintendence.<BR>—2 The state of being an eye-witness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपधर्म्यम्
औपधर्म्यम् [उपधर्म-ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 A false doctrine, heresy वेशं विधाय बहुभाष्यत औपधर्म्यम् Bhāg. 2. 7. 37.<BR>—2 Inferior virtue, or a degraded principle of virtue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपधिक|औपधिकः
औपधिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) Deceitful, deceptive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपधिकः|औपधिक
औपधिक + .{@-कः@} An extortioner of money; Ms. 9. 258.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपधेय
औपधेय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>) [उपधि-ठञ्] Serving for the<BR> part of the wheel of a carriage called उपधि, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपधेयम्
औपधेय + .{@-यम्@} The wheel of a carriage (रथाङ्गम्). यद्धि तद्रथाङ्गं<BR> तदौपधेयमित्युच्यते Mbh. V. 1. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनायिक
औपनायिक <i>a.</i> Belonging to, or serving for an offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनायनिक
औपनायनिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपनयन-ठक्] Relating<BR> to or serving for उपनयन (the rite of investiture with the sacred<BR> thread); एष प्रोक्तो द्विजातीनामौपनायनिको विधिः Ms. 2. 68; Y. 1. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनासिक
औपनासिक (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपनास-ठञ्] Being near the nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनिधिक|औपनिधिकं
औपनिधिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उपनिधि-ठक्] Forming or relating to, a deposit; Kau. A. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनिधिकम्
औपनिधिक + .{@-कम्@} A deposit or pledge; anything pledged or deposited; वासनस्थमनाख्याय<BR> हस्तेऽन्यस्य यदर्प्यते । द्रव्यं तदौपनिधिकं प्रतिदेयं तथैव तत् ।<BR> Y. 2. 65; Śukra. 2. 316.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनिध्य
औपनिध्य <i>a.</i> See औपनिधिक; Śukra. 2. 316.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनिषत्क
औपनिषत्क <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपनिषदा जीवति ठक्]<BR> Living by (teaching) the Upaniṣads.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनिषद|औपनिषदः
औपनिषद <i>a.</i> (-दी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उपनिषद्-अण्]<BR>—1 Contained or taught in an Upaniṣad; scriptural, theological. तं<BR> त्वौपनिषदं पुरुषं पृच्छामि Bṛ. Up. 3. 9. 26.<BR>—2 Based or founded on, derived from, the Upaniṣads; धनुर्गृहीत्वौपनिषदं<BR> महास्त्रम् Muṇḍ. 2. 2. 3. औपनिषदं दर्शनम् (another name<BR> for Vedānta Phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनिषदः|औपनिषद
औपनिषद + .{@-दः@}<BR>—1 The supreme soul, Brahman.<BR>—2 A follower of the doctrines of the Upaniṣads.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपनीविक
औपनीविक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [P. IV. 3. 40, IV. 1. 15. उपनीवि-ठक्] Being<BR> or placed near नीवि (the knot of the wearing garment of males or females);<BR> बद्धो दुर्बलरक्षार्थमसिर्येनौपनीविकः Bk. 4. 26; औपनीविकमरुन्द्ध<BR> किल स्त्री (करम्) Śi. 10. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपपक्ष्य
औपपक्ष्य [उपपक्ष-ष्यञ्] Being in the arm pit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपपत्तिक
औपपत्तिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपपत्ति-ठक्]<BR>—1 Ready at hand, within reach^1.<BR>—2 Fit, proper; औपपत्तिकमाहारं प्रयच्छस्वेति भारत Mb. 13. 52. 27.<BR>—3 Theoretical.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260402. note: comma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपपत्यम्
औपपत्यम् Happiness occurring from a paramour; adultery; जुगुप्सितं<BR> च सर्वत्र औपपत्यं कुलास्त्रियाः Bhāg. 10. 29. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपपातिक
औपपातिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उपपात-ठक्] One who has committed an Upapātaka, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपपातिकम्
औपपातिक + .{@-कम्@} N. of the first Jaina Upāṅga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपपादिकः|औपपादिक
औपपादिकः An upstart (?) Kau. A. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपभृत
औपभृत <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>) [उपभृत्-अल्] Being in the<BR> ladle (as an offering).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपमिक
औपमिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उपमा-ठक्]<BR>—1 Serving for a simile or comparison.<BR>—2 Shown by a simile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपम्यम्
औपम्यम् [उपमा-ष्यञ्] Comparison, resemblance, analogy; आत्मौपम्येन<BR> भूतेषु दयां कुर्वन्ति साधवः H. 1. 12; करका ˚सुभगः U. 3. 40, v. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपयज
औपयज <i>a.</i> (-जी <i>f.</i>) [उपयज्-अण्] Belonging to<BR> the sentences called उपयज्, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपयिक|औपयिकः
औपयिक, -औपायिक <i>a.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपयिकी
औपयिक, -औपायिक + .({@-की@} <i>f.</i>) [उपाय-ठक्]<BR>—1 Proper, fit, right; नैतदौपयिकं राम यदिदं परितप्यसे Rām. 2. 53. 30;<BR> Bhāg. 3. 2. 12. न वैश्यशूद्रौपयिकीः कथाः Mb. 1. 193. 11.<BR>—2 Obtained by efforts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपायिक
औपयिक, -औपायिक <i>a.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपयिकः|औपयिक
औपयिक, -औपायिक + .{@-कः, -कम्@} A means, an expedient, remedy; शिवमौपयिकं गरीयसीम् Ki. 2. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपयिकम्
औपयिक, -औपायिक + .{@-कः, -कम्@} A means, an expedient, remedy; शिवमौपयिकं गरीयसीम् Ki. 2. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपयौगिक
औपयौगिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपयोग-ठञ्] Relating<BR> to the employment or application (of anything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपराजिक
औपराजिक <i>a.</i> [उपराज-ठक्] Relating or belonging to a viceroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपरिष्ट
औपरिष्ट <i>a.</i> (-ष्टी <i>f.</i>) [उपरिष्ट-अण्] Being or produced above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपरिष्टकम्
औपरिष्ट + .{@-कम्@} A kind of coitus; Vātsy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपरैधिकः|औपरैधिक
औपरैधिकः A staff made of the wood of the Pilu tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपरोधिक|औपरोधिकः
औपरो(रौ)धिक (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उपरोध-ठक्]<BR>—1 Proceeding from or relating to favour or kindness.<BR>—2 Opposing, impending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपरौधिक
औपरो(रौ)धिक (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [उपरोध-ठक्]<BR>—1 Proceeding from or relating to favour or kindness.<BR>—2 Opposing, impending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपरोधिकः|औपरोधिक
औपरो(रौ)धिक + .{@-कः@} A staff of the wood of the Pilu tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपल
औपल <i>a.</i> (-ला, -ली <i>f.</i>) [उपल-अण्]<BR>—1 Stony, of stone; यथा प्लवेनौपलेन निमज्जत्युदके तरन् Ms. 4. 194, v. l.<BR>—2 Raised from stones (as a tax). पाहि औपलामम्बिकाम् Nṛ. P. Up. 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवस्तम्
औपवस्तम् Fasting, a fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवस्त्रम्
औपवस्त्रम् [उपवस्त्र-अण्]<BR>—1 Food suitable for a fast.<BR>—2 Fasting. उपवस्ता प्राप्तोस्यौपवस्त्रम् Mbh. V. 1. 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवास
औपवास <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>) [उपवास-अण्] Given during<BR> fasting (money); to be done during fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवासिक
औपवासिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपवास-ठञ्] Fit for fasting, able to fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवास्यम्
औपवास्यम् Fasting. औपवास्यं तदाकार्षीद्राघवः सह सीतया Rām. 2. 87. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवाह्य|औपवाह्यः
औपवाह्य <i>a.</i> [उपवाह्य स्वार्थे अण्]<BR>—1 Serving for riding on; औपवाह्यं रथं युक्त्वा त्वमायाहि हयोत्तमैः<BR> Rām. 2. 39. 10.<BR>—2 Drawn for pleasure (as a carriage).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवाह्यः|औपवाह्य
औपवाह्य + .{@-ह्यः@}<BR>—1 A kingʼs elephant.<BR>—2 Any royal vehicle. औपवाह्यः कुबेरस्य सार्वभौम इति स्मृतः Rām. 4. 43. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवीतिकम्
औपवीतिकम् Investiture with the sacred thread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपवेषिक
औपवेषिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपवेष-ठञ्] Getting livelihood<BR> by entire devotion to any employment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपशिविः|औपशिवि
औपशिविः N. of a grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपश्लेषिक
औपश्लेषिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपश्लेष-ठक्] Relating<BR> to close or immediate contact; अधिकरणं नाम त्रिप्रकारं व्यापकमौपश्लेषिकं<BR> वैषयिकमिति Mbh. on VI. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसंक्रमण|औपसङ्क्रमण
औपसंक्रमण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> (Anything) proper to be done at the Upasaṅkramaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसंख्यानिक|औपसङ्ख्यानिक
औपसंख्यानिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपसंख्यान-ठक्]<BR>—1 Mentioned in a supplementary addition.<BR>—2 Supplementary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसदः|औपसद
औपसदः [उपसद्-अण्]<BR>—1 An अध्याय or अनुवाक containing the word उपसद्.<BR>—2 N. of a ceremony lasting for one day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसंध्य
औपसंध्य <i>a.</i> Relating to dawn; N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसर्गिक|औपसर्गिकः
औपसर्गिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपसर्ग-ठञ्]<BR>—1 Able to cope with adversity.<BR>—2 Portentous.<BR>—3 Relating to change &c.<BR>—4 Super-induced (as a disease).<BR>—5 Connected with a preposition, prepositive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपसर्गिकः|औपसर्गिक
औपसर्गिक + .{@-कः@} Irregular action of the humours of the body, producing cold<BR> sweats &c. (वातादिसंनिपात).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपस्थान
औपस्थान (-नी <i>f.</i>) [उपस्थान-ण] One whose business<BR> is to serve, wait on, or worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपस्थानिक
औपस्थानिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [उपस्थान-ठक्] Living<BR> by waiting on or worshipping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

औपस्थ्यम्
