कटः + -व्रणः N. of Bhīmasena.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटशर्करा
कटः + -शर्करा<BR>—1 a fragment of a mat broken off or of straw.<BR>—2 N. of a plant, (गाङ्गेष्टी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटस्थलम्
कटः + -स्थलम्<BR>—1 the hips and loins.<BR>—2 an elephantʼs temples.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटस्थालम्
कटः + -स्थालम् A corpse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटंभर
कटंभर N. of the कटभी tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटंभरा|कटम्भरा
कटंभर + .{@-रा@}<BR>—1 N. of several plants: 1 नागबला; 2 प्रसारिणी; 3 रोहिणी;<BR> 4 हस्तिनी; 5 कलम्बिका; 6 मूर्वा.<BR>—2 A female elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटकः|कटक|कटकं
कटकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A bracelet of gold; कटकाकृतिमुपमृद्य स्वास्तिकः क्रियन्ते Mbh.<BR> on I. 1. 1. आबद्धहेमकटकां रहसि स्मरामि C. P. 15; Śi. 16. 77;<BR> कटकान्यूर्मिकाश्चापि चित्ररत्नचयाङ्किताः Śiva B. 17. 44.<BR>—2 A zone or girdle.<BR>—3 A string.<BR>—4 The link of a chain.<BR>—5 A mat.<BR>—6 sea-salt.<BR>—7 The side or ridge of a mountain; प्रफुल्लवृक्षैः कटकैरिव स्वैः<BR> Ku. 7. 52; R. 16. 31.<BR>—8 Table-land; स्फटिककटकभूमिर्नाटयत्येष शैलः Śi. 4. 65.<BR>—9 An army, a camp; आकुल्यकारि कटकस्तुरगेण तूर्णम् Śi. 5. 59; Mu. 5.<BR>—10 A royal capital or metropolis (राजधानी).<BR>—11 A house or dwelling.<BR>—12 A circle or wheel.<BR>—13 A ring placed as an ornament upon an elephantʼs tusk.<BR>—14 N. of the capital of Orissa.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कटकगृहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटकम्
कटकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A bracelet of gold; कटकाकृतिमुपमृद्य स्वास्तिकः क्रियन्ते Mbh.<BR> on I. 1. 1. आबद्धहेमकटकां रहसि स्मरामि C. P. 15; Śi. 16. 77;<BR> कटकान्यूर्मिकाश्चापि चित्ररत्नचयाङ्किताः Śiva B. 17. 44.<BR>—2 A zone or girdle.<BR>—3 A string.<BR>—4 The link of a chain.<BR>—5 A mat.<BR>—6 sea-salt.<BR>—7 The side or ridge of a mountain; प्रफुल्लवृक्षैः कटकैरिव स्वैः<BR> Ku. 7. 52; R. 16. 31.<BR>—8 Table-land; स्फटिककटकभूमिर्नाटयत्येष शैलः Śi. 4. 65.<BR>—9 An army, a camp; आकुल्यकारि कटकस्तुरगेण तूर्णम् Śi. 5. 59; Mu. 5.<BR>—10 A royal capital or metropolis (राजधानी).<BR>—11 A house or dwelling.<BR>—12 A circle or wheel.<BR>—13 A ring placed as an ornament upon an elephantʼs tusk.<BR>—14 N. of the capital of Orissa.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कटकगृहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटकगृहः|कटकगृह
कटकः + -गृहः A lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटकिन्
कटकिन् <i>m.</i> A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटजकः|कटजक
कटजकः^1 <i>m.</i> N. of a man or a class of men; लोके गोपालकमानय<BR> कटजकमानयेति यस्यैषा संज्ञा भवति स आनीयते Mbh. on I. 1. 23.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटसी
कटसी A cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटायनम्
कटायनम् The plant Andropogon Muricatus (वीरणमूल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटिन्
कटिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Matted, screened.<BR>—2 Having handsome loins &c. ━<i>m.</i> An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटकट|कटकटः
कटकट <i>a.</i> Excellent, best.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटकटः|कटकट
कटकट + .{@-टः@} N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

