कठाकुः|कठाकु
कटा(ठा)कुः A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटाटङ्कः|कटाटङ्क|कटाटंकः
कटाटङ्कः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

