कटिशीर्षकः|कटिशीर्षक
कटिः + -शीर्षकः the loins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कटिशूलः|कटिशूल
