कठल्यः, -कठल्लः<BR> Gravel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठल्लः|कठल्ल
कठल्यः, -कठल्लः<BR> Gravel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठाकुः|कठाकु
कठाकुः A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठाहकः|कठाहक
कठाहकः A gallinule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिका
कठिका Chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिञ्जरः|कठिञ्जर|कठिंजरः
कठिञ्जरः N. of a tree commonly called तुलसी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिन|कठिनं|कठिनः
कठिन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Hard, stiff; कठिनविषमामेकवेणीं सारयन्तीम् Me. 93; Amaru. 72;<BR> Mu. 2. 20; so ˚स्तनौ.<BR>—2 Hard-hearted, cruel, ruthless; न विदीर्ये कठिनाः खलु स्त्रियः<BR> Ku. 4. 5; Pt. 1. 64; विसृज कठिने मानमधुना Amaru. 7; so ˚हृदय; {@˚चित्त@}<BR>—3 Inexorable, inflexible.<BR>—4 Sharp, violent, intense (as pain &c.). नितान्तकठिनां रुजं मम<BR> न वेद सा मानसीम् V. 2. 11.<BR>—5 Giving pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिनः|कठिन|कठिनं
कठिन + .{@-नः@} A thicket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिना
कठिन + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 A sweetmeat made with refined sugar.<BR>—2 An earthen vessel for cooking; (<i>n.</i> also in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिनी
कठिन + .{@-नी@} Chalk. See कठिनिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिनम्
कठिन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 A Shovel, scoop; प्लवे कठिनकाजं च रामश्चके समाहितः Rām. 2. 55. 17.<BR>—2 An earthern vessel for cooking (स्थाली); कठिनं पूरयामास Mb. 3. 297. 1.<BR>—3 A strap or pole for carrying burden; P. IV. 4. 72.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कठिनपृष्ठः, कठिनकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिनपृष्ठः|कठिनपृष्ठ
कठिन + -पृष्ठः, -कः a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिनकः|कठिनक
कठिन + -पृष्ठः, -कः a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिनता
कठिनता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Hardness, firmness.<BR>—2 Severity.<BR>—3 Cruelty, hard-heartedness; जहिहि कठिनतां प्रयच्छ वाचम् Ki. 10. 51.<BR>—4 Difficulty, obscurity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिनत्वम्
कठिनता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Hardness, firmness.<BR>—2 Severity.<BR>—3 Cruelty, hard-heartedness; जहिहि कठिनतां प्रयच्छ वाचम् Ki. 10. 51.<BR>—4 Difficulty, obscurity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिनिका
कठिनिका, -कठिनी<BR>—1 Chalk.<BR>—2 The little finger. गुणिगुणगणनारम्भे न पतति कठिनी सुसंभ्रमाद्यस्य H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिनी
कठिनिका, -कठिनी<BR>—1 Chalk.<BR>—2 The little finger. गुणिगुणगणनारम्भे न पतति कठिनी सुसंभ्रमाद्यस्य H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिल्लः|कठिल्ल
कठिल्लः The Balsam apple (Mar. कारलें).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठिल्लकः|कठिल्लक
कठिल्लकः^1<BR>—1 The Balsam apple.<BR>—2 The hog-weed.<BR>—3 N. of a plant.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260402.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठुर
कठुर <i>a.</i> Hard, cruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठेर|कठेरः
कठेर <i>a.</i> Living in distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठेरः|कठेर
कठेर + .{@-रः@} A needy or distressed man, a pauper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठोर|कठोरः
कठोर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Hard (fig. also); solid, stiff, कठोरास्थिग्रन्थि Māl. 5. 34.<BR>—2 Cruel, hard-hearted, ruthless; अयि कठोर यशः किल ते प्रियम्<BR> U. 3. 27; so ˚हृदय, ˚चित्त.<BR>—3 Sharp, piercing; ˚अङ्कुश Śānti. 1. 22.<BR>—4 Full, developed, complete, full-grown, of mature age; कठोरगर्भां<BR> जानकीं विमुच्य U. 1, 1. 49, 6. 25; Māl. 6. 19; so कठोरताराधिपलाञ्छनच्छविः<BR> Śi. 1. 20; so अ˚ new, young; Māl. 1. 2.<BR>—5 (Fig.) Matured, refined; कलाकलापालोचनकठोरमतिभिः K. 7; ˚रीभूतः<BR> दिवसः U. 2 it is noon-time.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कठोरगर्भ, कठोरगिरिमाहात्म्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठोरगर्भ
कठोर + -गर्भ <i>a.</i> far advanced in pregnancy; आतङ्कस्फुरितकठोरगर्भगुवीम् U. 1. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठोरगिरिमाहात्म्यम्
कठोर + -गिरिमाहात्म्यम् a portion of the Brahmāṇḍa Purāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठोरता
कठोरता, -त्वम्<BR> Hardness, firmness, severity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठोरत्वम्
कठोरता, -त्वम्<BR> Hardness, firmness, severity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठोरयति
कठोरयति Den. P. To furnish with buds, expand the blossoms of;<BR> कठोरय केतकान् Māl. 9. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठोरित
कठोरित <i>a.</i> made to strive, strengthened; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कठोल|कठोलः
कठोल <i>a.</i> Hard, resisting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कड्
कड् I. €1 U. (कडति-ते, कडित)<BR>—1 To be proud.<BR>—2 To unhusk; cf. कण्ड्.<BR>—3 To be disturbed or confused. ━II. €6 P. To eat, consume. ━III. €10 U.<BR>—1 To protect.<BR>—2 To remove the chaff or husk of grain.<BR>—3 To break off a part, separate or detach, tear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कड|कडः
कड <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Dumb.<BR>—2 Hoarse.<BR>—3 Ignorant, foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कडकम्
कडकम् (कडकञ्चि <i>n.</i> ?) Sea-salt obtained by evaporation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कडकञ्चि
कडकम् (कडकञ्चि <i>n.</i> ?) Sea-salt obtained by evaporation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कडङ्गः|कडङ्ग|कडंगः
कडङ्गः A spirituous liquor, a kind of rum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कडङ्गरः|कडङ्गर|कडंगर|कडंगरः
कडङ्ग(-क)रः<BR>—1 Straw, the stalks of various sorts of pulse &c.<BR>—2 A kind of weapon (club); Mb. 7. 25. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कडङ्करः|कडङ्कर|कडंकर|कडंकरः
