कडार|कडारः
कडार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tawny; कडार इवायम् G. M.; मीलन्मेघतडित्कडारकुहरैः U. 5. 14; U. 6.<BR>—2 Proud, haughty, impudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

