कणिशम्
कणिशः, -शम्<BR> An ear or spike of corn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कणिष्ठ
कणिष्ठ <i>a.</i> The smallest, the most minute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कणीक|कणीकं|कणीकः
कणीक <i>a.</i> Small, diminutive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कणपः|कणप
कणपः<BR>—1 A kind of iron lance or bar; लोहस्तम्भस्तु कणपः Vaijayantī;<BR> चापचककणपकर्षण &c. Dk. 35.<BR>—2 A weapon (like bomb). ‘अयःकणान् लोहगुलिकाः पिबतीति तथाविधम् आग्नेयौषधबलेन गर्भसंभृता लोहगुलिकास्तारका इव विकीर्यन्ते येन तद्यन्त्रमयः कणपं लोहमयम्’ इति नीलकण्ठः. Mb. 1. 227. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कणभः|कणभ
