कणे
कणे <i>ind.</i> A particle expressing the satisfaction of a desire<BR> (श्रद्धाप्रतीघात); कणेहत्य पयः पिबति Sk. P. I. 4. 66 ‘he drinks milk to his heartʼs content or till he is satisfied’<BR>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कणेरः|कणेर
कणेरः^1, -रुः<BR> The कर्णिकार tree (Mar. कण्हेर).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124. note: follows after कणे ; corrected after AP90 and others.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कणेरुः|कणेरु
कणेरः^1, -रुः<BR> The कर्णिकार tree (Mar. कण्हेर).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124. note: follows after कणे ; corrected after AP90 and others.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कणेरा
कणेरः, -रुः + .{@-रा, -रुः@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A she-elephant.<BR>—2 A courtezan, harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कणेरुः|कणेरु
कणेरः, -रुः + .{@-रा, -रुः@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A she-elephant.<BR>—2 A courtezan, harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्ट्|कंट्
कण्ट् €1 P. (कण्टति, कण्टित) To go or move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्ट|कंट
कण्ट <i>a.</i> Thorny.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कण्टपत्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टपत्रः|कण्टपत्र
कण्ट + -पत्रः N. of a plant (स्थलशृङ्गाटक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकः|कण्टक|कंटक|कंटकं|कंटकः
कण्टकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A thorn; पादलग्नं करस्थेन कण्टकेनैव कण्टकं (उद्धरेत्)<BR> Cāṇ. 22; कण्टकेनैव कण्टकम् (उन्मूलयेत्) Pt. 4. 18<BR>—2 A prickle, a sting; यः कण्टकैर्वितुदति Y. 3. 53.<BR>—3 The point of anything.<BR>—4 (Fig.) Any troublesome fellow who is, as it were, a thorn to the state<BR> and an enemy of order and good government; उत्खातलोकत्रयकण्टकेऽपि<BR> R. 14. 73; त्रिदिवमुद्धृतदानवकण्टकम् Ś. 7. 3; Ms. 9. 260; Mv. 7. 8.<BR>—5 (Hence) Any source of vexation or annoyance, nuisance; कण्टकानां<BR> च शोधनात् Ms. 9. 253.<BR>—6 Horripilation, erection of hair, thrill.<BR>—7 A fingernail.<BR>—8 A vexing speech.<BR>—9 A fish-bone; अन्धो मत्स्यानिवाश्नाति स नरः कण्टकैः सह Ms. 8. 95.<BR>—10 A sharp stinging pain, symptom of a disease.<BR>—11 (In Nyāya philosophy) Refutation of arguments, detection of error.<BR>—12 Impediment, obstacle.<BR>—13 The first, fourth, seventh, and tenth lunar mansions.<BR>—14 A vexing or injurious speech; Mb. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकम्
कण्टकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A thorn; पादलग्नं करस्थेन कण्टकेनैव कण्टकं (उद्धरेत्)<BR> Cāṇ. 22; कण्टकेनैव कण्टकम् (उन्मूलयेत्) Pt. 4. 18<BR>—2 A prickle, a sting; यः कण्टकैर्वितुदति Y. 3. 53.<BR>—3 The point of anything.<BR>—4 (Fig.) Any troublesome fellow who is, as it were, a thorn to the state<BR> and an enemy of order and good government; उत्खातलोकत्रयकण्टकेऽपि<BR> R. 14. 73; त्रिदिवमुद्धृतदानवकण्टकम् Ś. 7. 3; Ms. 9. 260; Mv. 7. 8.<BR>—5 (Hence) Any source of vexation or annoyance, nuisance; कण्टकानां<BR> च शोधनात् Ms. 9. 253.<BR>—6 Horripilation, erection of hair, thrill.<BR>—7 A fingernail.<BR>—8 A vexing speech.<BR>—9 A fish-bone; अन्धो मत्स्यानिवाश्नाति स नरः कण्टकैः सह Ms. 8. 95.<BR>—10 A sharp stinging pain, symptom of a disease.<BR>—11 (In Nyāya philosophy) Refutation of arguments, detection of error.<BR>—12 Impediment, obstacle.<BR>—13 The first, fourth, seventh, and tenth lunar mansions.<BR>—14 A vexing or injurious speech; Mb. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकः|कण्टक|कंटक|कंटकं|कंटकः
कण्टकः, -कम् + .{@-कः@} A bamboo; some other tree (Mar. बेल, बाभळ, हिंगणबेट)<BR> फलकं परिधानश्च तथा कण्टकवस्त्रधृक् Mb. 12. 303. 14; see कण्टकद्रुम.<BR>—2 A work-shop, manufactory.<BR>—3 Fault, defect; निर्धूतवाक्यकण्टकाम् Mb. 12. 167. 50.<BR>—4 N. of Makara or the marine monster, the symbol of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकी
कण्टकः, -कम् + .{@-की@} A kind of वार्ताकी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकफलः|कण्टकफल|कंटकफल
कण्टकः, -कम् + .{@-फलः@} See कण्टकफल.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कण्टकाग्रः, कण्टकाशनः, कण्टकभक्षकः, कण्टकभुज्, कण्टकाष्ठीलः, कण्टकागारः, कण्टकाढ्य्ः, कण्टकोद्धरणम्, कण्टकद्रुमः, कण्टकप्रावृता, कण्टकफलः, कण्टकमर्दनम्, कण्टकयुक्त, कण्टकविशोधनम्, कण्टकवृन्ताकी, कण्टकश्रेणिः, कण्टकश्रेणी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकाग्रः
कण्टकः + -अग्रः a kind of lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

