कण्टकः + -अशनः, -भक्षकः, -भुज् <i>m.</i> a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकाष्ठीलः|कण्टकाष्ठील
कण्टकः + -अष्ठीलः a kind of fish (having many bones).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकागारः|कण्टकागार
कण्टकः + -आगारः a kind of worm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकाढ्यः|कण्टकाढ्य
कण्टकः + -आढ्यः a kind of tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकोद्धरणम्
कण्टकः + -उद्धरणम्<BR>—1 (lit.) extracting thorns, weeding.<BR>—2 (fig.) removing annoyances, extirpating thieves and all such sources<BR> of public annoyance; कण्टकोद्धरणे नित्यमातिष्ठेद्यत्नमुत्तमम् Ms. 9. 252.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकद्रुमः|कण्टकद्रुम|कंटकद्रुम
कण्टकः + -द्रुमः<BR>—1 a tree with thorns, a thorny bush; भवन्ति नितरां स्फीताः सुक्षेत्रे<BR> कण्टकद्रुमाः Mk. 9. 7.<BR>—2 the Śālmali tree or silk-cotton-tree (Mar. सांवरी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकप्रावृता
