कण्टकफलः|कण्टकफल|कंटकफल
कण्टकः + -फलः<BR>—1 the bread-fruit tree, Panasa tree.<BR>—2 the गोक्षुर plant.<BR>—3 the castor-oil tree.<BR>—4 the Dhattūra tree.<BR>—5 a term applicable to any plant the fruit of which is invested with<BR> a hairy or thorny coat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकमर्दनम्
कण्टकः + -मर्दनम् suppressing disturbance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकयुक्त
कण्टकः + -युक्त <i>a.</i> having thorns, thorny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकविशोधनम्
कण्टकः + -विशोधनम् extirpating every source of disturbance or trouble;<BR> राज्यकण्टकविशोधनोद्यतः Vikr. 5. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकवृन्ताकी
कण्टकः + -वृन्ताकी a species of nightshade with thorny leaves (वार्ताकी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकश्रेणिः|कण्टकश्रेणि
कण्टकः + -श्रेणिः, -श्रेणी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 the Solanum Jacquini.<BR>—2 a porcupine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकश्रेणी
कण्टकः + -श्रेणिः, -श्रेणी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 the Solanum Jacquini.<BR>—2 a porcupine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकारः|कण्टकार|कंटकारः
कण्टकारः N. of a tree (शाल्मली); also विकङ्कत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकारी
कण्टकारः + .{@-री@} N. of several plants:− Solanum Jacquini, the silk-cotton tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकारिका|कंटकारिका
