कण्टकित|कंटकित
कण्टकित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Thorny.<BR>—2 Covered with erect hair, thrilled; horripilated; प्रीति ˚त्वचः<BR> Ku. 6. 15; R. 7. 22; कण्टकितेन प्रथयति मग्यनुरागं कपोलेन Ś. 3. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकिन्|कंटकिन्
कण्टकिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Thorny, prickly; कण्टकिनो वनान्ताः Vikr. 1. 116.<BR>—2 Vexatious, troublesome. ━<i>m.</i> A fish. ━<i>m., f.</i> N. of several plants:−<BR> खदिर, मदन, गोक्षुर, वंश, बदर.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कण्टकिज, कण्टकिफलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकिज
कण्टकिन् + -ज <i>a.</i><BR>—1 produced from a fish.<BR>—2 produced by the Mimosa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टकिफलः|कण्टकिफल|कंटकिफल
कण्टकिन् + -फलः the bread-fruit tree (पनस).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

