कण्टकिलः|कण्टकिल|कंटकिल|कंटकिलः
कण्टकिलः A thorny kind of bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टलः|कण्टल|कंटलः
कण्टलः<BR>—1 N. of a plant (वर्वुर; Mar. बाभूळ).<BR>—2 A tree yielding a species of Gum Arabic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0523-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कण्टाफलः|कण्टाफल
