कनकालुका
कनकम् + -आलुका a golden jar or vase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकाह्वयः|कनकाह्वय
कनकम् + -आह्वयः the Dhattūra tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकाह्वयम्
कनकम् + -आह्वयः + .({@-यम्@}) a flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनककदली
कनकम् + -कदली A species of plantain; कीडाशैलः कनककदलीवेष्टनप्रेक्षणीयः Me. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनककारः|कनककार
कनकम् + -कारः A goldsmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकक्षारः|कनकक्षार
कनकम् + -क्षारः borax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकटङ्कः|कनकटङ्क|कनकटंक
कनकम् + -टङ्कः a golden hatchet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकदण्डम्
कनकम् + -दण्डम्, -दण्डकम् (golden-sticked) the royal parasol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकदण्डकम्
कनकम् + -दण्डम्, -दण्डकम् (golden-sticked) the royal parasol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकदण्डिका
कनकम् + -दण्डिका a golden sheath for a sword &c.; Mu. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकनिकषः
कनकम् + -निकषः a streak of gold (rubbed on a touch-stone).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकपट्टम्
कनकम् + -पट्टम् Gold brocade cloth; पीतं कनकपट्टाभं स्रस्तं तद्वसनं<BR> शुभम् Rām. 5. 15. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकपत्रम्
कनकम् + -पत्रम् an ear-ornament made of gold; जीवेति मङ्गलवचः परिहृत्य<BR> कोपात् कर्णे कृतं कनकपत्रमनालपन्त्या C. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकपरागः|कनकपराग
कनकम् + -परागः gold-dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकपर्वतः|कनकपर्वत
कनकम् + -पर्वतः The mountain Meru; Mb. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकपलः|कनकपल
कनकम् + -पलः a kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकपलम्
कनकम् + -पलः + ({@-लम्@}) a weight of gold (equal<BR> to 16 Maṣakas or about 280 grains).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकप्रभ
कनकम् + -प्रभ <i>a.</i> bright as gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकप्रभा
कनकम् + -प्रभ + .({@-भा@}) the महाज्योतिष्मती plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकप्रसवा
कनकम् + -प्रसवा the स्वर्णकेतकी plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकभङ्गः|कनकभङ्ग
कनकम् + -भङ्गः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">Page0528-2</a>]<BR> a piece of gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकरम्भा
कनकम् + -रम्भा the स्वर्णकदली plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकरसः|कनकरस
कनकम् + -रसः<BR>—1 a yellow orpiment.<BR>—2 fluid gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकशक्तिः|कनकशक्ति
कनकम् + -शक्तिः N. of Kārttikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकसूत्रम्
कनकम् + -सूत्रम् a gold necklace; काक्या कनकसूत्रेण कृष्णसर्पो विनाशितः Pt. 1. 207.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकस्थली
कनकम् + -स्थली ‘a land of gold’, gold mine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनकमय
कनकमय <i>a.</i> Made of gold, golden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनखलम्
कनखलम् N. of a Tīrtha or sacred place and the hills adjoining<BR> it; (तीर्थं कनखलं नाम गङ्गाद्वारेऽस्ति पावनम्); तस्माद्गच्छेरनुकनखलं<BR> शैलराजावतीर्णां जह्नोः कन्याम् Me. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनटी
