कनन|कननः
कनन <i>a.</i> One-eyed; cf. काण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनपः|कनप
कनपः (कनो दीप्तिर्गतिः शोभा वा पाति सः) A kind of missile<BR> (शक्ति); असयः शक्तिकुलिशपाशर्ष्टिकनपाः शराः Mb. 3. 20. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनयति
