कना
कना Ved. A girl; the youngest girl; पुनस्तदा वृहति यत् कनाया Rv. 10. 61. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनिक्रद
कनिक्रद <i>a.</i> Ved. Neighing, crying very much; कनिक्रदं वाजिनं<BR> वाजिनेषु Vāj. 13. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनिष्कः|कनिष्क
कनिष्कः N. of a celebrated ancient king in India in the first century A. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनिष्ठ|कनिष्ठः
कनिष्ठ^1 <i>a.</i> (Superl. of अल्प or युवन्)<BR>—1 The smallest, least.<BR>—2 The youngest; पुत्र एषामुतैषां ज्येष्ठ उत वा कनिष्ठः Rv. 10. 8. 28.<BR>—3 Lower.<BR>—4 Having the feet downwards.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20160315. note: (no comment).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनिष्ठः|कनिष्ठ
कनिष्ठ + .{@-ष्ठः@} N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनिष्ठा
कनिष्ठ + .{@-ष्ठा@}<BR>—1 The little finger.<BR>—2 A kind of heroine.<BR>—3 The wife of a younger brother.<BR>—4 A younger wife, one married later (than another); पुत्रः कनिष्ठो<BR> ज्येष्टायां कनिष्टायां च पूर्वजः Ms. 9. 122.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कनिष्ठपदम्, कनिष्ठमूलम्, कनिष्ठप्रथम<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनिष्ठपदम्
कनिष्ठ + -पदम्, -मूलम् the least or first root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनिष्ठमूलम्
कनिष्ठ + -पदम्, -मूलम् the least or first root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

