कनीनकः|कनीनक
कनीनकः<BR>—1 A boy, youth; जनिष्ट योषा पतयत् कनीनको Rv. 10. 40. 9.<BR>—2 The pupil of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कनीनका
कनीनकः + .{@-का@}<BR>—1 maiden, girl; कनीनकेन विद्रधे Rv. 4. 32. 23.<BR>—2 The pupil of the eye; या कनीनका तयादित्यो Bṛ. Up. 2. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

