कन्दर्पः + -शृङ्खलः<BR>—1 membrum virile.<BR>—2 a particular mode of sexual enjoyment or coitus (रतिबन्ध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दलः|कन्दल|कंदल|कंदलं|कन्दलं|कंदलः
कन्दलः, -लम्<BR>—1 A new shoot or sprout; मयालब्धः पाणिर्ललितलवलीकन्दलनिभः U. 3. 40.<BR>—2 Reproach, censure.<BR>—3 The cheek, or the cheek and temple.<BR>—4 A portent.<BR>—5 Sweet sound.<BR>—6 The plantain tree; कन्दलदलोल्लासाः पयोबिन्दवः Amaru. 48.<BR>—7 Collection; U. 3. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दलम्
कन्दलः, -लम्<BR>—1 A new shoot or sprout; मयालब्धः पाणिर्ललितलवलीकन्दलनिभः U. 3. 40.<BR>—2 Reproach, censure.<BR>—3 The cheek, or the cheek and temple.<BR>—4 A portent.<BR>—5 Sweet sound.<BR>—6 The plantain tree; कन्दलदलोल्लासाः पयोबिन्दवः Amaru. 48.<BR>—7 Collection; U. 3. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दलः|कन्दल|कंदल|कंदलं|कन्दलं|कंदलः
कन्दलः, -लम् + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 Gold.<BR>—2 War, battle.<BR>—3 (Hence) War of words, controversy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दलम्
कन्दलः, -लम् + .{@-लम्@} A Kandala flower; विदलकन्दलकम्पनलालितः Śi. 6. 30; R. 13. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दली|कंदली
कन्दली<BR>—1 The plantain (or the Banana) tree; आरक्तराजिभिरियं कुसुमैर्नवकन्दलीसलिलगर्भैः ।<BR> कोपादन्तर्बाष्पे स्मरयति मां लोचने तस्याः ॥ V. 4. 5; Me. 21; Ṛs. 2. 5.<BR>—2 A kind of deer.<BR>—3 A flag.<BR>—4 Lotus-seed.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कन्दलीकुसुमम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दलीकुसुमम्
कन्दली + -कुसुमम्<BR>—1 a mushroom.<BR>—2 the flower of the plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दलित|कंदलित
कन्दलित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Budded, blown.<BR>—2 Put forth, emitted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दिरी|कंदिरी
कन्दिरी N. of a plant (Mar. लाजाळू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दुः|कन्दु|कंदुः
कन्दुः <i>m., f.</i> [Uṇ. 1. 14] A boiler, oven.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कन्दुपक्व<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दुपक्व|कन्दुपक्वं
कन्दुः + -पक्व <i>a.</i> parched, roasted (as grain).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दुकः|कन्दुक|कंदुक|कंदुकं|कंदुकः
कन्दुकः, -कम्<BR> A ball for playing with; पातितोऽपि कराघातैरुत्पतत्येव<BR> कन्दुकः Bh. 2. 83; Ku. 1. 29, 5. 11, 19; R. 16. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दुकम्
कन्दुकः, -कम्<BR> A ball for playing with; पातितोऽपि कराघातैरुत्पतत्येव<BR> कन्दुकः Bh. 2. 83; Ku. 1. 29, 5. 11, 19; R. 16. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दुकम्
कन्दुकः, -कम् + .{@-कम्@} A pillow; भूः पर्यङ्को निजभुजलता कन्दुकं खं वितानम् Bh. 3. 145.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कन्दुकलीला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दुकलीला|कंदुकलीला
कन्दुकः + -लीला any game with a ball.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दोटः|कन्दोट|कंदोट|कन्दोटं|कंदोटः
कन्दोटः (-ट्टः)<BR>—1 The white lotus.<BR>—2 The blue lotus (a provincial form for नीलोत्पल); मोहमुकुलायमाननेत्रकन्दोटयुगुलः Māl. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दोट्टः|कन्दोट्ट|कंदोट्टः
कन्दोटः (-ट्टः)<BR>—1 The white lotus.<BR>—2 The blue lotus (a provincial form for नीलोत्पल); मोहमुकुलायमाननेत्रकन्दोटयुगुलः Māl. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दोटम्
कन्दोटः (-ट्टः) + .{@-टम्@} A blue lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्दोतः|कन्दोत|कंदोतः
कन्दोतः The white lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्धः|कन्ध|कंध|कंधः
कन्धः<BR>—1 A cloud.<BR>—2 A kind of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्धरः|कन्धर|कंधर|कंधरः
कन्धरः [कं शिरो जलं वा धारयति]<BR>—1 The neck.<BR>—2 ‘The holder of water’, a cloud.<BR>—3 A kind of grass.<BR>—4 N. of a vegetable (मारिष).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्धरा|कंधरा
कन्धरः + .{@-रा@} The neck; कन्धरां समपहाय कं धरां प्राप्य संयति जहास<BR> कस्यचित्; Y. 2. 220; Amaru. 16; see उत्कन्धर also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्धिः|कन्धि|कंधि|कंधिः
कन्धिः [कं शिरो जलं वा धीयतेऽत्र] The ocean. ━<i>f.</i> The neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्नतु
कन्नतु N. of a town; कन्नतु कान्नतवम् Mbh. on P. IV. 2. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्नम्
कन्नम् [कन-क्त]<BR>—1 Sin.<BR>—2 A swoon, a fainting fit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यका
कन्यका<BR>—1 A girl; संबद्धवैखानसकन्यकानि R. 14. 28, 11. 53.<BR>—2 An unmarried girl, virgin, maiden; गृहे गृहे पुरुषाः कुलकन्यकाः<BR> समुद्वहन्ति Māl. 7; Y. 1. 105.<BR>—3 A technical name for a girl ten years old; (अष्टवर्षा भवेद्गौरी नववर्षा<BR> च रोहिणी । दशमे कन्यका प्रोक्ता अत ऊर्ध्वं रजस्वला Śabdak.)<BR>—4 (In Rhet.) One of the several kinds of heroines; an unmarried girl<BR> serving as a chief character in a poetical composition; see under अन्यस्त्री.<BR>—5 The sign <i>Virgo</i>.<BR>—6 N. of Durgā; Bhāg. 10. 2. 12.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कन्यकाच्छलः, कन्यकाजनः, कन्यकाजातः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यकाच्छलः|कन्यकाच्छल|कन्यकाछल
कन्यका + -च्छलः seduction; पैशाचः कन्यकाच्छलात् Y. 1. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यकाजनः|कन्यकाजन
कन्यका + -जनः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">Page0530-1</a>]<BR> a maiden; विशुद्धमुग्धः कुलकन्यकाजनः Māl. 7. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यकाजातः|कन्यकाजात
कन्यका + -जातः the son of an unmarried girl; कानीनः कन्यकाजातः<BR> Y. 2. 129 (= कानीन); for instance व्यास, कर्ण &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यना
कन्यना Ved. Calling a girl (कन्याह्वान); a girl (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यला
कन्यला Ved. A girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यस्
कन्यस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Younger, smaller; कन्यसी स्वसा Mb. 3. 230. 8.<BR>—2 Lower; कन्यसीं वृत्तिमास्थितः Mb. 12. 214. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यसः|कन्यस
कन्यसः The youngest brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यसा
कन्यसः + .{@-सा@} The little finger<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यसी
कन्यसः + .{@-सी@} The youngest sister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्या
कन्या [Uṇ. 4. 111]<BR>—1 An unmarried girl or daughter; R. 1. 51, 2. 10, 3. 33; Ms. 10. 8.<BR>—2 A girl ten years old.<BR>—3 A virgin, maiden; Ms. 8. 367, 3. 33.<BR>—4 A woman in general.<BR>—5 The sixth sign of the zodiac, <i>i. e.</i> Virgo.<BR>—6 N. of Durgā; Mb. 3.<BR>—7 Large cardamoms.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कन्यान्तःपुरम्, कन्याट, कन्याकुब्जः, कन्याकुमारि, कन्याकुमारी, कन्यागतम्, कन्याग्रहणम्, कन्यादानम्, कन्यादूषकः, कन्यादूषणम्, कन्यादोषः, कन्याधनम्, कन्यापतिः, कन्यापालः, कन्यापुत्रः, कन्यागर्भः, कन्यापुरम्, कन्याप्रदानम्, कन्याभर्तृ, कन्याभैक्ष्यम्, कन्यारत्नम्, कन्याराशिः, कन्यावेदिन्, कन्याव्रतस्था, कन्याशुल्कम्, कन्यासमुद्भव, कन्यास्वयंवरः, कन्याहरणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यान्तःपुरम्
कन्या + -अन्तःपुरम् the womenʼs apartments; सुरक्षितेऽपि कन्यान्तःपुरे<BR> कश्चित्प्रविशति Pt. 1; Mv. 2. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याट|कन्याटः
कन्या + -आट <i>a.</i> following after or hunting young girls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याटः|कन्याट
कन्या + -आट + ({@-टः@})<BR>—1 the inner apartments of a house. —2 a man who hunts or goes after young girls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याकुब्जः|कन्याकुब्ज
कन्या + -कुब्जः N. of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याकुब्जम्
कन्या + -कुब्जः + ({@-ब्जम्@}) N. of an ancient city<BR> in the north of India, situated on a tributary of the Ganges, now called Kanoja.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याकुमारि
कन्या + -कुमारि <i>f.</i>, {@-री@} also कन्यकुमारी<BR> N. of Durgā; कन्यकुमारि धीमहि<BR> Mahānār. Up. 3. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याकुमारी
कन्या + -कुमारि <i>f.</i>, {@-री@} also कन्यकुमारी<BR> N. of Durgā; कन्यकुमारि धीमहि<BR> Mahānār. Up. 3. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यागतम्
कन्या + -गतम् the position of a planet in the sign Virgo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याग्रहणम्
कन्या + -ग्रहणम् taking a girl in marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यादानम्
कन्या + -दानम् giving away a girl in marriage; अद्भिरेव द्विजाग्र्याणां<BR> कन्यादानं विशिष्यते Ms. 3. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यादूषकः|कन्यादूषक
कन्या + -दूषकः The violator of a virgin; Ms. 3. 164.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यादूषणम्
कन्या + -दूषणम् defilement of a virgin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यादोषः|कन्यादोष
कन्या + -दोषः a defect or blemish in a girl, bad repute (such as a disease &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याधनम्
कन्या + -धनम् dowry; a girlʼs property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यापतिः|कन्यापति
कन्या + -पतिः ‘daughterʼs husband’, a son-in-law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यापालः|कन्यापाल
कन्या + -पालः a dealer in slave girls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यापुत्रः|कन्यापुत्र
कन्या + -पुत्रः, -गर्भः the son of an unmarried daughter (called कानीन);<BR> संघर्षजननस्तस्मात्कन्यागर्भो विनिर्मितः Mb. 12. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यागर्भः|कन्यागर्भ
कन्या + -पुत्रः, -गर्भः the son of an unmarried daughter (called कानीन);<BR> संघर्षजननस्तस्मात्कन्यागर्भो विनिर्मितः Mb. 12. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यापुरम्
कन्या + -पुरम् the womenʼs apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याप्रदानम्
कन्या + -प्रदानम् Giving a daughter in marriage; Ms. 3. 29-31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याभर्तृ|कन्याभर्त्तृ
कन्या + -भर्तृ ━<i>m.</i> —1 a son-in-law.<BR>—2 N. of Kārttikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याभैक्ष्यम्
कन्या + -भैक्ष्यम् Begging for a girl; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यारत्नम्
कन्या + -रत्नम् a very fine girl; कन्यारत्नमयोनिजन्म भवतामास्ते Mv. 1. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याराशिः|कन्याराशि
कन्या + -राशिः the sign <i>Virgo</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यावेदिन्
कन्या + -वेदिन् ━<i>m.</i> a son-in-law (marrying oneʼs girl); Y. 1. 262.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याव्रतस्था
कन्या + -व्रतस्था A woman in her monthly state; मयि कन्याव्रतस्थायां<BR> जग्मुर्मन्दाकिनीतटम् Ks. 26. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याशुल्कम्
कन्या + -शुल्कम् money given to the brideʼs father as her price, purchase-money of a girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यासमुद्भव
कन्या + -समुद्भव <i>a.</i> Born from an unmarried woman; Ms. 9. 172.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यास्वयंवरः|कन्यास्वयंवर
कन्या + -स्वयंवरः the choice of a husband by a maiden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याहरणम्
कन्या + -हरणम् ravishment or seduction of a maiden; प्रसह्य कन्याहरणं<BR> राक्षसो विधिरुच्यते Ms. 3. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यका
कन्यका, कन्यिका<BR>—1 Young girl.<BR>—2 A virgin. According to पराशरसंहिता, a कन्यका is a ten<BR> years old girl दशमे कन्यका प्रोक्ता; कन्यका हि निर्दोषदर्शना भवन्ति Nāg. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यिका
कन्यका, कन्यिका<BR>—1 Young girl.<BR>—2 A virgin. According to पराशरसंहिता, a कन्यका is a ten<BR> years old girl दशमे कन्यका प्रोक्ता; कन्यका हि निर्दोषदर्शना भवन्ति Nāg. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्याका
कन्याका (= कन्यका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यामय
कन्यामय <i>a.</i> Consisting of, or in the form of, a young girl;<BR> कन्यामये नेत्रशतैकलक्ष्ये R. 6. 11, 16. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्यामयम्
कन्यामय + .{@-यम्@} The harem (consisting mostly of girls).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कन्युषम्
कन्युषम् The hand below the wrist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कप्
कप् €1 P. To move; see कम्प्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कप
कप<BR>—1 N. of वरुण.<BR>—2 A class of demons; च्यवनेनं हृता भूमिः कपैश्चैव दिनं प्रभो Mb. 13. 157. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटः|कपट|कपटं
कपटः, -टम्<BR> Fraud, deceit, trick, cheating; कपंटंशतमयं क्षेत्रमप्रत्ययानाम्<BR> Pt. 1. 191; कपटानुसारकुशला Mk. 9. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटम्
कपटः, -टम्<BR> Fraud, deceit, trick, cheating; कपंटंशतमयं क्षेत्रमप्रत्ययानाम्<BR> Pt. 1. 191; कपटानुसारकुशला Mk. 9. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटी
कपटः, -टम् + .{@-टी@} A measure equal to the capacity of the hollows of the two<BR> hands joined together.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कपटतापसः, कपटपटु, कपटप्रबन्धः, कपटलेख्यम्, कपटवचनम्, कपटवेश<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटतापसः|कपटतापस
कपटः + -तापसः one who pretends to be an ascetic, pseudo ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटपटु
कपटः + -पटु <i>a.</i> a dept in deceit, deceitful, crafty; छलयन् प्रजास्त्वमनृतेन<BR> कपटपटुरैन्द्रजालिकः Śi. 15. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटप्रबन्धः|कपटप्रबन्ध|कपटप्रबंध
कपटः + -प्रबन्धः a fraudulent contrivance. H. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटलेख्यम्
कपटः + -लेख्यम् a forged document.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटवचनम्
कपटः + -वचनम् deceitful talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटवेश|कपटवेशः
कपटः + -वेश <i>a.</i> disguised, masked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटवेशः|कपटवेश
कपटः + -वेश + ({@-शः@}) disguise, false dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटिकः|कपटिक
कपटिकः A rogue, cheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपटिन्
कपटिन् <i>a.</i> Fraudulent, dishonest. ━<i>f.</i> A kind of perfume (चिडा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपनः|कपन
कपनः Shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपनः|कपन
कपनः + .{@-नः, -ना@} Ved. A worm, caterpillar (घुण); मोषथा वृक्षं<BR> कपनेव वेधसः Rv. 5. 54. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपना
कपनः + .{@-नः, -ना@} Ved. A worm, caterpillar (घुण); मोषथा वृक्षं<BR> कपनेव वेधसः Rv. 5. 54. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपर्दः|कपर्द|कपर्द्द|कपर्द्दः
कपर्दः, कपर्दकः<BR>—1 A small shell or cowrie (used as a coin).<BR>—2 Braided or matted hair especially of Śiva; G. L. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपर्दकः|कपर्दक|कपर्द्दक|कपर्द्दकः
कपर्दः, कपर्दकः<BR>—1 A small shell or cowrie (used as a coin).<BR>—2 Braided or matted hair especially of Śiva; G. L. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपर्दिका
कपर्दिका A small shell or cowrie (used as a coin); मित्राण्यमित्रतां<BR> यान्ति यस्य न स्युः कपर्दि (र्द) काः Pt. 2. 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपर्दिन्|कपर्द्दिन्
कपर्दिन् <i>a.</i> [कपर्द-इनि]<BR>—1 Shaggy.<BR>—2 Wearing braided and matted hair. ━<i>m.</i> N. of Śiva; पुष्पोपहारं<BR> शनकैः करिष्यामि कपर्दिनः Rām. 7. 31. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपलम्
कपलम् Ved. A half, a part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटः|कपाट|कपाटं
कपाटः, -टम्<BR> [कं वातं पाटयति तद्गतिं रुणद्धि Tv.]<BR>—1 Leaf or panel of a door; कपाटवक्षाः परिणद्धकन्धरः R. 3. 34;<BR> स्वर्गद्वारकपाटपाटनपटुर्थर्मोऽपि नोपार्जितः Bh. 3. 11.<BR>—2 A door; दलितदलकपाटः षट्पदानां सरोजे Śi. 11. 60.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कपाटोद्घाटनम्, कपाटघ्न,^1 कपाटवक्षस्, कपाटसंधिः, कपाटसंधिकः<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटम्
कपाटः, -टम्<BR> [कं वातं पाटयति तद्गतिं रुणद्धि Tv.]<BR>—1 Leaf or panel of a door; कपाटवक्षाः परिणद्धकन्धरः R. 3. 34;<BR> स्वर्गद्वारकपाटपाटनपटुर्थर्मोऽपि नोपार्जितः Bh. 3. 11.<BR>—2 A door; दलितदलकपाटः षट्पदानां सरोजे Śi. 11. 60.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कपाटोद्घाटनम्, कपाटघ्न,^1 कपाटवक्षस्, कपाटसंधिः, कपाटसंधिकः<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटोद्घाटनम्
कपाटः + -उद्घाटनम्<BR>—1 the opening of a door.<BR>—2 A door key.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटघ्न
कपाटः + -घ्न^1 <i>a.</i> house-breaker, thief.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटवक्षस्
कपाटः + -वक्षस् <i>a.</i> broad chested; कपाटवक्षाः परिणद्धकन्धरः R. 3. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटसंधिः|कपाटसन्धि|कपाटसंधि
कपाटः + -संधिः<BR>—1 The junction of the leaves of a door.<BR>—2 A manner of multiplying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटसंधिकः|कपाटसन्धिक
कपाटः + -संधिकः a disease of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाटिका
कपाटिका A door (कपाट); हठाद्विदधते मरुत्पुरकपाटिकोद्घाटनम्<BR> Viś. Guṇā. 164.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालः|कपाल|कपालं
कपालः, -लम्<BR> [कं शिरो जलं वा पालयति]<BR>—1 The skull, skull bone; चूडापीडकपालसंकुलगलन्मन्दाकिनीवारयः<BR> Māl. 1. 2; रुद्रो येन कपालपाणिपुटके भिक्षाटनं कारितः Bh. 2. 95.<BR>—2 A piece of a broken jar; potsherd; कपालेन भिक्षार्थी Ms. 8. 93.<BR>—3 A multitude, collection.<BR>—4 A beggarʼs<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">Page0531-1</a>]<BR> bowl; Ms. 6. 44.<BR>—5 A cup, jar in general; पञ्चकपाल.<BR>—6 A cover or lid.<BR>—7 A treaty of peace on equal terms; H. 4. 107; Kām. 9. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालम्
कपालः, -लम्<BR> [कं शिरो जलं वा पालयति]<BR>—1 The skull, skull bone; चूडापीडकपालसंकुलगलन्मन्दाकिनीवारयः<BR> Māl. 1. 2; रुद्रो येन कपालपाणिपुटके भिक्षाटनं कारितः Bh. 2. 95.<BR>—2 A piece of a broken jar; potsherd; कपालेन भिक्षार्थी Ms. 8. 93.<BR>—3 A multitude, collection.<BR>—4 A beggarʼs<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">Page0531-1</a>]<BR> bowl; Ms. 6. 44.<BR>—5 A cup, jar in general; पञ्चकपाल.<BR>—6 A cover or lid.<BR>—7 A treaty of peace on equal terms; H. 4. 107; Kām. 9. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालम्
कपालः, -लम् + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 The shell of an egg.<BR>—2 The cotyla of the leg of a man, any flat bone.<BR>—3 A kind of Leprosy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपाली
कपालः, -लम् + .{@-ली@} A beggarʼs bowl [cf. L. <i>caput</i>; Gr. <i>Kephale</i>].<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कपालनालिका, कपालपाणिः, कपालभृत्, कपालमालिन्, कपालशिरस्, कपालमालिनी, कपालसंधिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालनालिका
कपालः + -नालिका A sort of pin or spindle for winding cotton &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालपाणिः|कपालपाणि
कपालः + -पाणिः, -भृत्, -मालिन्, -शिरस् <i>m.</i> epithet of Śiva; तपसा<BR> दिवमारूढाः कपालशिरसा सह Rām. 2. 54. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालभृत्
कपालः + -पाणिः, -भृत्, -मालिन्, -शिरस् <i>m.</i> epithet of Śiva; तपसा<BR> दिवमारूढाः कपालशिरसा सह Rām. 2. 54. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालमालिन्
कपालः + -पाणिः, -भृत्, -मालिन्, -शिरस् <i>m.</i> epithet of Śiva; तपसा<BR> दिवमारूढाः कपालशिरसा सह Rām. 2. 54. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालशिरस्
कपालः + -पाणिः, -भृत्, -मालिन्, -शिरस् <i>m.</i> epithet of Śiva; तपसा<BR> दिवमारूढाः कपालशिरसा सह Rām. 2. 54. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालमालिनी
कपालः + -मालिनी N. of Durgā<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालसंधिः|कपालसन्धि|कपालसंधि
कपालः + -संधिः a peace on equal terms. कपालसंधिर्विज्ञेयः केवलं<BR> समसंधितः H. 4. 110.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालिः|कपालि
कपालिः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालिका
कपालिका<BR>—1 A potsherd; मही घटत्वं घटतः कपालिका कपालिका चूर्णरजस्ततोणवः<BR> Subhāṣ. 4. 76, 8. 250.<BR>—2 The tartar of the teeth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालिन्
कपालिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Furnished with or having a skull; Y. 3. 243.<BR>—2 Wearing skulls. कपालि वा स्यादथवेन्दुशेखरम् (वपुः) Ku. 5. 78. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 An epithet of Śiva; करं कर्णे कुर्वन्त्यपि किल कपालिप्रभृतयः G. L. 28.<BR>—2 A man of low caste (offspring of a Brāhmaṇa mother to fisherman father.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपालिनी
कपालिन् + .{@-नी@} N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिः|कपि
कपिः [कप्-इन् नलोपः; Uṇ. 4. 143.]<BR>—1 An ape, a monkey; कपेरत्रासिषुर्नादात् Bk. 9. 11.<BR>—2 An elephant.<BR>—3 A species of Karañja.<BR>—4 Incense, storax or impure benzoin (शिलारस).<BR>—5 The sun.<BR>—6 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिः|कपि
कपिः + .{@-पिः@} <i>f.</i>,<BR> {@-पी@} A female monkey.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कप्याख्यः, कपीज्यः, कप्यासम्, कपीन्द्रः, कपिकच्छुः, कपिकन्दुकम्, कपिकेतन, कपिध्वजः, कपिचूडा, कपिचूतः, कपिजः, कपितैलम्, कपिनामन्, कपिप्रभुः, कपिरथः, कपिलोमन्, कपिलोहम्, कपिवक्त्रः, कपिशाकः, कपिशाकम्, कपिशीर्षम्, कपिशीर्षकम्, कपिशीर्ष्णी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कप्याख्यः|कप्याख्य
कपिः + -आख्यः Incense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपीज्यः|कपीज्य
कपिः + -इज्यः an epithet of (1) Rāma; (2) Sugrīva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कप्यासम्
कपिः + -आसम् The buttocks of an ape; यथा कप्यासं पुण्डरीकमेव<BR> Ch. Up. 1. 6. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपीन्द्रः|कपीन्द्र|कपींद्र
कपिः + -इन्द्रः (the chief of monkeys) an epithet of (1) Hanūmat; नश्यन्ति<BR> ददर्श वृन्दानि कपीन्द्रः Bk. 10. 12; (2) of Sugrīva; व्यर्थं यत्र<BR> कपीन्द्रसख्यमपि मे U. 3. 45; (3) of Jāmbuvat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिकच्छुः|कपिकच्छु
कपिः + -कच्छुः <i>f.</i> N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिकन्दुकम्
कपिः + -कन्दुकम् the skull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिकेतन
कपिः + -केतन, -ध्वजः N. of Arjuna; Bg. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिध्वजः|कपिध्वज
कपिः + -केतन, -ध्वजः N. of Arjuna; Bg. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिचूडा
कपिः + -चूडा, -चूतः the hog plum tree (Mar. अंबाडा)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिचूतः|कपिचूत
कपिः + -चूडा, -चूतः the hog plum tree (Mar. अंबाडा)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिजः|कपिज
कपिः + -जः, -तैलम्, -नामन् <i>n.</i> storax or benzoin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपितैलम्
कपिः + -जः, -तैलम्, -नामन् <i>n.</i> storax or benzoin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिनामन्
कपिः + -जः, -तैलम्, -नामन् <i>n.</i> storax or benzoin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिप्रभुः|कपिप्रभु
कपिः + -प्रभुः<BR>—1 An epithet of Rāma.<BR>—2 of Sugrīva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिरथः|कपिरथ
कपिः + -रथः an epithet of (1) Rāma; (2) Arjuna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिलोमन्
कपिः + -लोमन् <i>f.</i> a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिलोहम्
कपिः + -लोहम् Brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिवक्त्रः|कपिवक्त्र
कपिः + -वक्त्रः N. of Nārada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिशाकः|कपिशाक
कपिः + -शाकः, -शाकम् a cabbage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिशाकम्
कपिः + -शाकः, -शाकम् a cabbage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिशीर्षम्
कपिः + -शीर्षम् the upper part (coping) of a wall. having a sphere like<BR> the head of a monkey; Kau. A. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिशीर्षकम्
कपिः + -शीर्षकम् vermilion (Mar. हिंगूळ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिशीर्ष्णी
कपिः + -शीर्ष्णी a kind of musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिञ्जलः|कपिञ्जल|कपिंजल|कपिंजलः
कपिञ्जलः<BR>—1 The Chātaka bird; सोमपीथं तु यत्तस्य शिर आसीत्कपिञ्जलः Bhāg. 6. 9. 5.<BR>—2 The Tittiri bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपित्थः|कपित्थ
कपित्थः The wood apple tree; Bhāg. 8. 2. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपित्थम्
कपित्थः + .{@-त्थम्@}<BR>—1 The fruit of the above tree.<BR>—2 A particular position of hands and fingers.<BR>—3 Butter-milk (तक्र) यौवनस्थस्य गौरस्य कपित्थस्य सुगन्धिनः<BR> Rām. 2. 91. 72.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कपित्थास्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपित्थास्यः|कपित्थास्य
कपित्थः + -आस्यः a kind of monkey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिल|कपिलः
कपिल <i>a.</i> [कपि-लच्]<BR>—1 Tawny, reddish; वाताय कपिला विद्युत् Mbh. on P. II. 3. 13.<BR>—2 Having tawny hairs;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-2" target="_blank">Page0531-2</a>]<BR> नोद्वहेत्कपिलां कन्याम् Ms. 3. 8. (Kull. = कपिलकेशा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिलः|कपिल
कपिल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 N. of a great sage. [He reduced to ashes 60000 sons of Sagara, who<BR> while searching for the sacrificial horse of their father taken away by<BR> Indra, fell in with him and accused him of having stolen it (see U. 1. 23).<BR> He is also said to have been the founder of the Sāṅkhya system<BR> of philosophy.] ऋषि प्रसूतं कपिलं यस्तमग्रे ज्ञानैर्बिभर्ति Śāṅk. Bhāṣ. on Bād. Sūtras 2. 1;<BR> सिद्धानां कपिलो मुनिः Bg. 10. 26.<BR>—2 A dog.<BR>—3 Benzoin.<BR>—4 Incense.<BR>—5 A form of fire^1.<BR>—6 The tawny colour.<BR>—7 Impure benzoin.<BR>—8 N. of the sun.<BR>—9 N. of a country. —10 One of the incarnation of Viṣṇu.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260402.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिला
कपिल + .{@-ला@}<BR>—1 A brown cow; कपिला चेत्तारयति भूयश्चासप्तमं कुलम् Y. 1. 205.<BR>—2 A kind of perfume.<BR>—3 A kind of timber.<BR>—4 The common leech. —5 N. of the female elephant of the south east.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कपिलाक्षी, कपिलाञ्जनः, कपिलाश्वः, कपिलाचार्यः, कपिलद्युतिः, कपिलद्राक्षा, कपिलद्रुमः, कपिलधारा, कपिलवस्तु, कपिलसंहिता, कपिलस्मृतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिलाक्षी
कपिल + -अक्षी a kind of deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिलाञ्जनः|कपिलाञ्जन
कपिल + -अञ्जनः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिलाश्वः|कपिलाश्व
कपिल + -अश्वः an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिलाचार्यः|कपिलाचार्य|कपिलाचार्य्य
कपिल + -आचार्यः Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिलद्युतिः|कपिलद्युति
कपिल + -द्युतिः the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिलद्राक्षा
कपिल + -द्राक्षा A vine with brown grapes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0531-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कपिलद्रुमः|कपिलद्रुम
