कफल <i>a.</i> Phlegmatic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0532-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कफिन्
कफिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) [कफ-इनि] Affected with excess<BR> of phlegm, phlegmatic. ━<i>m.</i> An elephant (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0532-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

