कबिल|कबिलः
कबिल <i>a.</i> Tawny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0532-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कबिलः|कबिल
कबिल + .{@-लः@} The tawny colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0532-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कबुलिः|कबुलि
कबुलिः <i>f.</i> The hinder part of an animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0532-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्
कम् <i>ind.</i> Ved. A particle used as an expletive or enclitic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0532-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्
कम् €1. €10. Ā. (कामयते, कामित, चकमे-कामयाञ्चक्रे, कान्त)<BR>—1 To love, be enamoured of, be in love with; कन्ये कामयमानं मां<BR> न त्वं कामयसे कथम् Kāv. 1. 63 (an instance of ग्राम्यता); कलहंसको<BR> मन्दारिकां कामयते Māl. 1.<BR>—2 To long for, wish, desire; न वीरसूशब्दमकामयेताम् R. 14. 4;<BR> निष्कष्टुमर्थं चकमे कुबेरात् 5. 26, 4. 48, 10. 53; Bk. 14. 82.<BR>—3 To have intercourse with; त्वं च मा वरुण कामयासे Rv. 10 124. 5.<BR>—4 To value highly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0532-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमन|कमनं|कमनः
कमन <i>a.</i> [कम्-युच्; <i>f.</i> कमना]<BR>—1 Lustful, libidinous.<BR>—2 Wishing for, desirous; Śi. 6. 74.<BR>—3 Lovely, beautiful. त्रिभुवनकमनं तमालवर्णं रविकरगौरवराम्बरं<BR> दधानम् Bhāg. 1. 9. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0532-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमनः|कमन|कमनं
कमन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 Cupid, the god of love.<BR>—2 The Aśoka tree.<BR>—3 N. of Brahmā.<BR>—4 A Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—5 A lover, a lord, a husband. उदयाचलशृङ्गसंगतं कमलिन्याः कमनं<BR> व्यभावयत् Śāhendra. 2. 101.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कमनच्छदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0532-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमनच्छदः|कमनच्छद|कमनछद
