कमितृ
कमितृ <i>a.</i> (-त्री <i>f.</i>) Lustful, libidinous, desirous,<BR> cupidinous. ━<i>m.</i> The male, husband; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्र|कम्रः
कम्र <i>a.</i> [कम्-र; नमिकम्पिस्म्यजसकमहिंसदीपो रः P. III. 2. 167]<BR>—1 Desirous.<BR>—2 Beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमठः|कमठ|कमठं
