कमल|कमलं|कमलः
कमल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Desirous.<BR>—2 Palered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलः|कमल|कमलं
कमल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 The Sārasa bird.<BR>—2 A kind of deer.<BR>—3 N. of Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमली
कमल + .{@-ली@} A collection of lotuses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलम्
कमल + .{@-लम्@} [कम्-कलच्]<BR>—1 A lotus; कमलमनम्भसि कमले च कुवलये तानि कनकलतिकायाम्<BR> K. P. 10; so हस्त˚, नेत्र˚, चरण˚, &c.<BR>—2 Water; N. 1. 130; सकमलं कमलम् Ki. 5. 25. कमलासन-कमलेक्षण-कमलारिकिरीट-कमलभृद्वाहैः<BR> Subhāṣ. (लक्ष्मीप्रशंसा).<BR>—3 Copper.<BR>—4 A medicament, drug.<BR>—5 The Sārasa bird.<BR>—6 The bladder, the right lobe of the lungs.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कमलाक्षः, कमलाक्षी, कमलाकरः, कमलालया, कमलासनः, कमलेक्षणः, कमलेक्षणा, कमलोत्तरम्, कमलखण्डम्, कमलजम्, कमलजन्मन्, कमलभवः, कमलयोनिः, कमलसंभवः, कमलभृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलाक्षः|कमलाक्ष
