कमलाक्षी
कमल + -अक्षी a lotus-eyed lady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलाकरः|कमलाकर
कमल + -आकरः<BR>—1 an assemblage of lotuses. हरिदश्वः कमलाकरान्.<BR>—2 a lake full of lotuses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलालया
कमल + -आलया an epithet of Lakṣmī; Mu. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलासनः|कमलासन
कमल + -आसनः ‘lotus-seated’ N. of Brahmā; कान्तानि पूर्वं कमलासनेन Ku. 7. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलेक्षणः|कमलेक्षण
कमल + -ईक्षणः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलेक्षणा
कमल + -ईक्षणा a lotus-eyed lady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलोत्तरम्
कमल + -उत्तरम् safflower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलखण्डम्
कमल + -खण्डम् an assemblage of lotuses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलजम्
कमल + -जम्<BR>—1 an epithet of Brahmā.<BR>—2 the lunar asterism called Rohiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलजन्मन्
कमल + -जन्मन् <i>m.</i>, {@-पत्त्राक्ष@}<BR> N. of Kṛṣṇa त्वत्तः कमलपत्त्राक्ष Bg. 11. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलभवः|कमलभव
कमल + -भवः, -योनिः, -संभवः ‘lotus-born’, epithets of Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलयोनिः|कमलयोनि
कमल + -भवः, -योनिः, -संभवः ‘lotus-born’, epithets of Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलसंभवः|कमलसम्भव
कमल + -भवः, -योनिः, -संभवः ‘lotus-born’, epithets of Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलभृत्
कमल + -भृत् A cloud. Hence कमलभृद्वाहः (= मेघवाहनः = इन्द्रः)<BR> cf. कमलासन-कमलेक्षण-कमलारिकिरीट-कमलभृद्वाहैः । नुतपदकमला<BR> कमला करधृतकमला करोतु मे कमलम् ॥ Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलकम्
कमलकम् A small lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमला
कमला<BR>—1 An epithet of Lakṣmī.<BR>—2 An excellent woman.<BR>—3 An orange.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कमलापतिः, कमलासखिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलापतिः|कमलापति
कमला + -पतिः, -सखिः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलासखिः
कमला + -पतिः, -सखिः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलिनी
कमलिनी<BR>—1 A lotus-plant; साभ्रेऽह्नीव स्थलकमलिनीं न प्रबुद्धां न सुप्ताम्<BR> Me. 94; रम्यान्तरः कमलिनीहरितैः सरोभिः Ś. 4. 11; R. 9. 30, 19. 11.<BR>—2 An assemblage of lotuses.<BR>—3 A place abounding with lotuses.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कमलिनीकान्तः, कमलिनीबन्धुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलिनीकान्तः|कमलिनीकान्त
कमलिनी + -कान्तः, -बन्धुः N. of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलिनीबन्धुः|कमलिनीबन्धु
कमलिनी + -कान्तः, -बन्धुः N. of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कमलीका
कमलीका A small lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्प्|कंप्
कम्प् €1 Ā. (कम्पते, चकम्पे, कम्पित) To shake, tremble, move<BR> about; (fig. also); चकम्पे तीर्णलौहित्ये तस्मिन् प्राग्ज्योविषेश्वरः<BR> R. 4. 81; Mk. 4. 8; Bk. 14. 31, 15. 70. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To shake, cause to tremble.<BR>—2 To utter with a thrill or shake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पः|कम्प|कंप|कंपः
कम्पः [कम्प्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Shaking, tremor; कम्पेन किंचित्प्रतिगृह्य मूर्ध्नः R. 13. 44 with<BR> a gentle nod or bend of the head; 13. 28; Ku. 7. 46; भयकम्पः, विद्युत्कम्पः &c.<BR>—2 A modification of the Svarita accent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पा|कंपा
कम्पः + .{@-पा@} Shaking, moving, tremor.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कम्पान्वित, कम्पद्वारम्, कम्पलक्ष्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पान्वित
कम्पः + -अन्वित <i>a.</i> tremulous, agitated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पद्वारम्
कम्पः + -द्वारम् a side-door, a private entrance. कम्पद्वारं तु वा कुर्यान्मध्यपार्श्वद्वयोस्तथा<BR> Kāmikāgama 35. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पलक्ष्मन्|कंपलक्ष्मन्
कम्पः + -लक्ष्मन् ━<i>m.</i> wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पन|कंपन|कम्पनं|कम्पनः
कम्पन <i>a.</i> [कम्प्-युच्] Trembling, shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पनः|कम्पन|कंपन|कम्पनं
कम्पन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 Śiśira season (November-December).<BR>—2 A kind of missile.<BR>—3 A kind of fever (सान्निपातिक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पनम्
कम्पन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Shaking, tremor.<BR>—2 Quivering pronunciation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पाकः|कम्पाक|कंपाक|कंपाकः
कम्पाकः Wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पिल्ल
कम्पिल्ल = काम्पिल्ल q. v. (also कम्पिलः कम्पीलः and काम्पीलः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पित|कंपित|कम्पितं
कम्पित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Trembling, shaking.<BR>—2 Shaken, swung.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्पितम्
कम्पित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Trembling, tremor.<BR>—2 Causing to shake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्प्र|कंप्र
कम्प्र <i>a.</i> [कम्प्-र नमिकम्पिस्म्य जसकमहिंसदापो रः P. III. 2. 167]<BR>—1 Shaking, tremulous, moving, agitating; विधाय कम्प्राणि मुखानि कं<BR> प्रति N. 1. 142; कम्प्रा शाखा Sk.<BR>—2 Agile, quick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्ब्|कंब्
कम्ब् €1 P. (कम्बति, कम्बित) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बर|कंबर|कम्बरः
कम्बर <i>a.</i> Variegated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बरः|कम्बर|कंबर
कम्बर + .{@-रः@} Variegated colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलः|कम्बल|कंबल|कम्बलं|कंबलः
कम्बलः [Uṇ. 1. 106]<BR>—1 A blanket (of wool); कम्बलवन्तं न बाधते शीतम् Subhāṣ.; कम्बलावृतेन<BR> तेन H. 3; Rām. 7. 100. 3.<BR>—2 A dew-lap.<BR>—3 A sort of deer.<BR>—4 An upper garment of wool.<BR>—5 A wall.<BR>—6 A small worm.<BR>—7 N. of a serpent-king.<BR>—8 Covering of an elephant. cf. कम्बलो नागराजे च सास्नायां मृगरोमजे ।<BR> गजप्रावरणे चैव … … Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलम्
कम्बलः + .{@-लम्@} Water.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कम्बलवाह्यकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलवाह्यकम्
कम्बलः + -वाह्यकम् a kind of carriage covered with a coarse blanket, and drawn by oxen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलकः|कम्बलक|कंबलकं|कंबलकः
कम्बलकः, -कम्<BR> A woollen cloth, blanket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलकम्
कम्बलकः, -कम्<BR> A woollen cloth, blanket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलिका
कम्बलिका<BR>—1 A small blanket.<BR>—2 A kind of female deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलिन्|कंबलिन्
कम्बलिन् <i>a.</i> Covered with a blanket. ━<i>m.</i> A bullock, ox.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कम्बलिवाह्यक<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बलिवाह्यक|कंबलिवाह्यक|कम्बलिवाह्यकं
कम्बलिन् + -वाह्यक a carriage covered with blankets and drawn by oxen, a bullock-cart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बिः|कम्बि|कंबिः
कम्बिः, -म्बी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A ladle or spoon.<BR>—2 A shoot.<BR>—3 A branch or joint of a bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बी
कम्बिः, -म्बी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A ladle or spoon.<BR>—2 A shoot.<BR>—3 A branch or joint of a bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0533-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बु|कंबु|कम्बुः
कम्बु <i>a.</i> (-म्बु or -म्बू^1 <i>f.</i>)<BR> Spotted, variegated.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260402.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बुः|कम्बु|कंबु
कम्बु + .{@-म्बुः, -म्बु@} (<i>m., n.</i>) A conch-shell; स्मरस्य कम्बुः किमयं<BR> चकास्ति दिवि त्रिलोकीजयवादनीयः N. 22. 22; Śi. 18. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बु|कंबु|कम्बुः
कम्बु + .{@-म्बुः, -म्बु@} (<i>m., n.</i>) A conch-shell; स्मरस्य कम्बुः किमयं<BR> चकास्ति दिवि त्रिलोकीजयवादनीयः N. 22. 22; Śi. 18. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बुः|कम्बु|कंबु
कम्बु + .{@-म्बुः@}<BR>—1 An elephant.<BR>—2 The neck.<BR>—3 The variegated colour.<BR>—4 A vein of the body.<BR>—5 A bracelet; कम्बुकेयूरधारिण्यः Mb. 3. 233. 46.<BR>—6 A tube-shaped bone.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कम्ब्वातायिन्, कम्बुकण्ठी, कम्बुग्रीवा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्ब्वातायिन्
कम्बु + -आतायिन् <i>m.</i> a kind of kite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बुकण्ठी|कंबुकंठी
कम्बु + -कण्ठी a lady having the neck like a conch-shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बुग्रीवा|कंबुग्रीवा
कम्बु + -ग्रीवा<BR>—1 a conch-shaped neck, (<i>i. e.</i> a neck marked with three lines like<BR> a shell and considered as a sign of great fortune).<BR>—2 a lady having the neck like the conch-shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बुकः|कम्बुक|कंबुकः
कम्बुकः<BR>—1 A conch-shell.<BR>—2 A mean or contemptible person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बू|कंबू
कम्बू <i>a.</i> Stealing. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A thief, plunderer.<BR>—2 A bracelet; cf. Uṇ. 1. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्बोजः|कम्बोज|कंबोज|कंबोजः
कम्बोजः<BR>—1 A shell.<BR>—2 A kind of elephant.<BR>—3 (pl) N. of a country and its inhabitants; शवतिर्गतिकर्मा कम्बोजेष्वेव<BR> भाष्यते Mbh. on P. I. 1. 1. कम्बोजाः समरे सोढुं तस्य वीर्यमनीश्वराः<BR> R. 4. 69, v. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्भ
कम्भ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Watery.<BR>—2 Happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्भारी
कम्भारी (= कट्फला).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कम्भु|कंभु
कम्भु <i>n.</i> The fragrant root (उशीर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कयाधुः|कयाधु
कयाधुः, -धूः <i>f.</i><BR> The wife of Hiraṇyakaśipu and mother of Prahlāda;<BR> हिरण्यकशिपोर्भार्या कयाधुर्नाम दानवी Bhāg. 6. 18. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कयाधूः
कयाधुः, -धूः <i>f.</i><BR> The wife of Hiraṇyakaśipu and mother of Prahlāda;<BR> हिरण्यकशिपोर्भार्या कयाधुर्नाम दानवी Bhāg. 6. 18. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर|करः
कर <i>a.</i> (-रा or -री)<BR> [करोति, कीर्यते अनेन इति, कृ-कॄ-अप्] (Mostly at the<BR> end of comp.) Who or what does, makes or causes &c.; दुःख˚, सुख˚, भय˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करः|कर
कर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A hand; करं व्याधुन्वत्याः पिबसि रतिसर्वस्वमधरम् Ś. 1. 24.<BR>—2 A ray of light, beam; यमुद्धर्तुं पूषा व्यवसित इवालम्बितकरः<BR> V. 4. 34; also प्रतिकूलतामुपगते हि विधौ विफलत्वमेति बहुसाधनता ।<BR> अवलम्बनाय दिनभर्तुरभून्न पतिष्यतः करसहस्रमपि Śi. 9. 6<BR> (where the word is used in sense 1 also).<BR>—3 The trunk of an elephant; सेकः सीकरिणा करेण विहितः U. 3. 16; Bh. 3. 20.<BR>—4 A tax, toll, tribute; युवा कराक्रान्तमहीभृदुच्चकैरसंशयं संप्रति<BR> तेजसा रविः Śi. 1. 70; (where कर means ‘ray’ also) (ददौ)<BR> perhaps in this sense the word is used in neuter gender also. निर्ल्लज्जो<BR> मम च करः कराणि भुङ्क्ते Pañc. 2. 3. अपरान्तमहीपालव्याजेन<BR> रघवे करम् R. 4. 58; Ms. 7. 128.<BR>—5 Hail.<BR>—6 A particular measure of length equal to 24 thumbs.<BR>—7 The asterism called हस्त.<BR>—8 A means or expedient.<BR>—9 A doer.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कराग्रम्, कराघातः, करामर्दः, करामलकः, करारोटः, करालम्बः, करास्फोटः, करर्द्धिः, करकच्छपिका, करकण्टकः, करकम्, करकमलम्, करपङ्कजम्, करपद्मम्, करकलशः, करकलशम्, करकिसलयः, करकिसलयम्, करकुड्मलम्, करकृतात्मन्, करकोषः, करग्रहः, करग्रहणम्, करग्राहः, करघर्षणः, करघर्षिन्, करच्छदः, करच्छदा, करजः, करजालम्, करतलः, करतलीकृ, करतालः, करतालकम्, करतालिका, करताली, करतोया, करद, करदक्ष, करपत्रम्, करपत्रकम्, करपत्रिका, करपल्लवः, करपालः, करपालिका, करपात्रम्, करपात्री, करपीडनम्, करपुटः, करपृष्ठम्, करबालः, करवालः, करभारः, करभूः, करभूषणम्, करमर्दः, करमर्दी, करमर्दकः, करमालः, करमुक्तम्, कररुहः, करवालिका, करवीरः, करवीरकः, करशाखा, करशीकरः, करशूकः, करशोथः, करसादः, करसूत्रम्, करस्थालिन्, करस्वनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराग्रम्
कर + -अग्रम्<BR>—1 the forepart of the hand; कराग्रे वसते लक्ष्मीः.<BR>—2 the tip of an elephantʼs trunk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराघातः|कराघात
कर + -आघातः a stroke or blow with the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करामर्दः|करामर्द|करामर्द्द|करामर्द्दः
कर + -आमर्दः, -आमलकः Myrobalan (Mar. करवंद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करामलकः|करामलक
कर + -आमर्दः, -आमलकः Myrobalan (Mar. करवंद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करारोटः|करारोट
कर + -आरोटः a finger-ring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालम्बः|करालम्ब|करालंब
कर + -आलम्बः supporting with the hand, giving a helping hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करास्फोटः|करास्फोट
कर + -आस्फोटः<BR>—1 the chest.<BR>—2 a blow with the hand.<BR>—3 slapping the hands together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करर्द्धिः|करर्द्धि
कर + -ऋद्धिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a cymbal.<BR>—2 a small musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकच्छपिका
कर + -कच्छपिका <i>f.</i> कूर्ममुद्रा in yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकण्टकः|करकण्टक|करकंटक
कर + -कण्टकः, -कम् a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">Page0534-2</a>]<BR> finger-nail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकम्
कर + -कण्टकः, -कम् a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">Page0534-2</a>]<BR> finger-nail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकमलम्
कर + -कमलम्, -पङ्कजम्, -पद्मम् a lotus-like hand, beautiful hand;<BR> करकमलवितीर्णैरम्बुनीवारशष्पैः U. 3. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपङ्कजम्
कर + -कमलम्, -पङ्कजम्, -पद्मम् a lotus-like hand, beautiful hand;<BR> करकमलवितीर्णैरम्बुनीवारशष्पैः U. 3. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपद्मम्
कर + -कमलम्, -पङ्कजम्, -पद्मम् a lotus-like hand, beautiful hand;<BR> करकमलवितीर्णैरम्बुनीवारशष्पैः U. 3. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकलशः|करकलश
कर + -कलशः, -कलशम् the hollow of the hand (to receive water).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकलशम्
कर + -कलशः, -कलशम् the hollow of the hand (to receive water).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकिसलयः|करकिसलय
कर + -किसलयः, -किसलयम्<BR>—1 ‘sprout-like hand’, a tender hand; करकिसलयतालैर्मुग्धया नर्त्यमानम्<BR> U. 3. 19; Ṛs. 6. 30.<BR>—2 a finger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकिसलयम्
कर + -किसलयः, -किसलयम्<BR>—1 ‘sprout-like hand’, a tender hand; करकिसलयतालैर्मुग्धया नर्त्यमानम्<BR> U. 3. 19; Ṛs. 6. 30.<BR>—2 a finger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकुड्मलम्
कर + -कुड्मलम् the finger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकृतात्मन्
कर + -कृतात्मन् (Living from hand to mouth) destitute; Mb. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करकोषः|करकोष
कर + -कोषः the cavity of the palms, hands hollowed to receive water;<BR> ˚पेयमम्बु Ghaṭ. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करग्रहः|करग्रह
कर + -ग्रहः, -ग्रहणम्<BR>—1 levying a tax.<BR>—2 taking the hand in marriage.<BR>—3 marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करग्रहणम्
कर + -ग्रहः, -ग्रहणम्<BR>—1 levying a tax.<BR>—2 taking the hand in marriage.<BR>—3 marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करग्राहः|करग्राह
कर + -ग्राहः<BR>—1 a husband.<BR>—2 a tax-collector.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करघर्षणः|करघर्षण
कर + -घर्षणः, -घर्षिन् <i>m.</i> the churning-stick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करघर्षिन्
कर + -घर्षणः, -घर्षिन् <i>m.</i> the churning-stick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करच्छदः|करच्छद
कर + -च्छदः the teak tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करच्छदा
कर + -च्छदा N. of a tree (सिन्दूरपुष्पी; Mar. शेंद्री).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करजः|करज|करजं
कर + -जः a fingernail; तीक्ष्णकरजक्षुण्णात् Ve. 4. 1; Śi. 11. 37;<BR> Bv. 1. 105; Amaru. 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करजम्
कर + -जः + ({@-जम्@}) a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करजालम्
कर + -जालम् a stream of light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतलः|करतल
कर + -तलः the palm of the hand; वनदेवताकरतलैः Ś. 4. 5;<BR> करतलगतमपि नश्यति यस्य तु भवितव्यता नास्ति Pt. 2. 128. ˚आमलकम्<BR> (lit.) an <i>āmalaka</i> fruit (fruit of the Myrobalan) placed on the<BR> palm of the hand; (fig.) ease and clearness of perception, such as is<BR> natural in the case of a fruit placed on the palm of the hand; करतलामलकफलवदखिलं<BR> जगदालोकयताम् K. 43. ˚स्थ <i>a.</i> resting on the palm of the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतलीकृ
कर + -तलीकृ To take in the palm of the hand; ततः करतलीकृत्य<BR> व्यापि हालाहलं विषम् Bhāg. 8. 7. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतालः|करताल|करतालं
कर + -तालः, -तालकम्<BR>—1 clapping the hands; स जहास दत्तकरतालमुच्चकैः Śi. 15. 39.<BR>—2 a kind of musical instrument, perhaps a cymbal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतालकम्
कर + -तालः, -तालकम्<BR>—1 clapping the hands; स जहास दत्तकरतालमुच्चकैः Śi. 15. 39.<BR>—2 a kind of musical instrument, perhaps a cymbal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतालिका
कर + -तालिका, -ताली<BR>—1 clapping the hands; उच्चाटनीयः करतालिकानां दानादिदानीं भवतीभिरेषः N. 3. 7.<BR>—2 beating time by clapping the hands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करताली
कर + -तालिका, -ताली<BR>—1 clapping the hands; उच्चाटनीयः करतालिकानां दानादिदानीं भवतीभिरेषः N. 3. 7.<BR>—2 beating time by clapping the hands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतोया
कर + -तोया N. of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करद
कर + -द <i>a.</i><BR>—1 paying taxes.<BR>—2 tributary; करदीकृताखिलनृपां मेदिनीम् Ve. 6. 18.<BR>—3 giving the hand to help &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करदक्ष
कर + -दक्ष <i>a.</i> handy, dexterous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपत्रम्
कर + -पत्रम्<BR>—1 a saw; तत्कूरदन्तकरपत्रनिकृत्तसत्त्वम् Mv. 5. 29.<BR>—2 playing in water. ˚वत् <i>m.</i> the palm tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपत्रकम्
कर + -पत्रकम् a saw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपत्रिका
कर + -पत्रिका splashing water about while bathing or sporting in it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपल्लवः|करपल्लव
कर + -पल्लवः<BR>—1 a tender hand.<BR>—2 a finger. cf. ˚किसलय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपालः|करपाल
कर + -पालः, -पालिका<BR>—1 a sword.<BR>—2 a cudgel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपालिका
कर + -पालः, -पालिका<BR>—1 a sword.<BR>—2 a cudgel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपात्रम्
कर + -पात्रम्<BR>—1 splashing water about while bathing.<BR>—2 the hand hollowed to hold anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करपात्री
