करपृष्ठम्
कर + -पृष्ठम् the back of the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0534-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

