करटकः|करटक
करटकः<BR>—1 a crow; Mk. 7.<BR>—2 N. of कर्णीरथ the propounder of the science and art of theft.<BR>—3 N. of a jackal in H. and Pt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करटिन्
करटिन् <i>m.</i> An elephant; दिगन्ते श्रूयन्ते मदमलिनगण्डाः करटिनः<BR> Bv. 1. 2. तिष्ठन्तं करटिकदम्बदुर्गदेशे Śiva B. 24. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करटुः|करटु
कर(रे)टुः A kind of bird (crane).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेटुः|करेटु
कर(रे)टुः A kind of bird (crane).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करण|करणं|करणः
करण <i>a.</i> [कृ-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Making, doing, effecting, producing.<BR>—2 (Ved.) Clever, skilled; रथं न दस्रा करणा समिन्वथः Rv. 1. 119. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणः|करण|करणं
करण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 (Ved.) An assistant. यमस्य करणः Av. 6. 46. 2.<BR>—2 A man of a mixed tribe.<BR>—3 A writer, जज्ञे धीमांस्ततस्तस्यां युयुत्सुः करणो नृप Mb. 1. 115. 43;<BR> Ms. 10. 22.<BR>—4 A child. cf.<BR> … … करणः शिशौ । शूद्राविशोः सुतेऽपि स्यात् Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणम्
करण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Doing, performing, accomplishing, effecting; परहित˚, संध्या˚, प्रिय˚ &c.<BR>—2 Act, action.<BR>—3 Religious action; Y. 1. 251.<BR>—4 Business, trade.<BR>—5 An organ of sense; वपुषा करणोज्झितेन सा निपतन्ती पतिमप्यपातयत्<BR> R. 8. 38, 42; पटुकरणैः प्राणिभिः Me. 5; R. 14. 50.<BR>—6 The body; उपमानमभूद्विलासिनां करणं यत्तव कान्तिमत्तया Ku. 4. 5.<BR>—7 An instrument or means of an action, न तस्य कार्यं करणं न विद्यते<BR> Śvet. Up. 6. 8; करणं च पृथग्विधम् Bg. 18. 14, 18. उपमितिकरणमुपमानम्<BR> T. S.; तस्य भोगाधिकरणे करणानि निबोध मे Mb. 3. 181. 19.<BR>—8 (In Logic) The instrumental cause which is thus defined:− व्यापारवदसाधारणं<BR> कारणं करणम्.<BR>—9 A cause or motive (in general).<BR>—10 The sense expressed by the instrumental case (in gram.); साधकतमं<BR> करणम् P. I. 4. 42; or क्रियायाः परिनिष्पत्तिर्यद्व्यापारादनन्तरम् ।<BR> विवक्ष्यते यदा यत्र करणं तत्तदा स्मृतम् ॥<BR>—11 (In law) A document, a bond, documentary proof; Ms. 8. 51, 52, 154.<BR>—12 A kind of rhythmical pause, beat of the hand to keep time; अनुगर्जितसंदिग्धाः<BR> करणैर्मुरजस्वनाः Ku. 6. 40.<BR>—13 (In Astrol.) A Division of the day; (these Karaṇas are eleven:−<BR> बव, बालव, कौलव, तैतिल, गर, वणिज, विष्टि, शकुनि, चतुष्पाद,<BR> नाग and किंस्तुघ्न.)<BR>—14 The Supreme Being.<BR>—15 Pronunciation.<BR>—16 The posture of an ascetic.<BR>—17 A posture in sexual enjoyment. बोभुज्यते स्म करणेन नरेन्द्रपुत्री<BR> Bil. C. 42. वात्स्यायनोक्तकरणैर्निखिलैर्मनोज्ञैः । संभुज्यते कविवरेण<BR> नरेन्द्रपुत्री ॥ Ibid. 45.<BR>—18 A field.<BR>—19 Plastering with the hand.<BR>—20 The usage of the writer caste.<BR>—21 The Principle of intelligence, दृष्टाः करणाश्रयिणः Sāṅ. K. 43.<BR>—22 (In Astron.) N. of a treatise of Varāhamihira on the motion of planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणी
करण + .{@-णी@}<BR>—1 A woman of a mixed caste. माहिष्येण करण्यां तु रथकारः प्रजायते Y. 1. 95.<BR>—2 Absurd or irrational number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणसुता
करण + .{@-सुता@} <i>f.</i> An adopted daughter.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: करणाधिपः, करणकुतूहलम्, करणग्रामः, करणत्राणम्, करणविभक्तिः, करणविन्ययः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणाधिपः|करणाधिप
करण + -अधिपः the soul, स कारणं करणाधिपाधिपः Śvet. Up. 6. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणकुतूहलम्
करण + -कुतूहलम् N. of a work on practical astronomy by Bhāskara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणग्रामः|करणग्राम
करण + -ग्रामः the organs of sense taken collectively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणत्राणम्
करण + -त्राणम् the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणविभक्तिः
करण + -विभक्तिः <i>f.</i> The instrumental case; सूक्तवाकेनेति करणविभक्तिसंयोगात् ।<BR> ŚB. on MS. 3. 2. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करणविन्ययः|करणविन्यय
करण + -विन्ययः manner of pronunciation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करण्डः|करण्ड|करंड|करंडः
करण्डः [कृ-अण्डन् Uṇ. 1. 126]<BR>—1 A small box or basket (of bamboo); करण्डपीडिततनोः भोगिनः Bh. 2. 84;<BR> सर्वमायाकरण्डम् 1. 77.<BR>—2 A bee-hive.<BR>—3 A sword.<BR>—4 A sort of duck (कारण्डव).<BR>—5 Liver.<BR>—6 A crest; cf. करण्डो मुकुटे पात्रे Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करण्डकः|करण्डक|करंडकः
करण्डकः, करण्डिका, करण्डी <i>f.</i><BR> A small box made of bamboo, एतां<BR> दोषकरण्डिकाम् Mk. 8. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करण्डिका
करण्डकः, करण्डिका, करण्डी <i>f.</i><BR> A small box made of bamboo, एतां<BR> दोषकरण्डिकाम् Mk. 8. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करण्डी
करण्डकः, करण्डिका, करण्डी <i>f.</i><BR> A small box made of bamboo, एतां<BR> दोषकरण्डिकाम् Mk. 8. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करण्डिन्|करंडिन्
करण्डिन् <i>m.</i> A fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करतोया
करतोया <i>f.</i> A river in Bengal (called सदानीरा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करन्धय
करन्धय <i>a.</i> Kissing the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभः|करभ
करभः [कॄ-अभच् Uṇ. 3. 122; करे-भाति भा-क Tv.]<BR>—1 The back of the hand from the wrist to the root of the fingers; metacarpus,<BR> as in करभोपमोरूः R. 6. 83; see करभोरू below.<BR>—2 The trunk of an elephant.<BR>—3 A young elephant.<BR>—4 A young camel; उष्ट्री च करभश्चेति Mbh. on P. I. 2. 66. पृथ्वीरजः<BR> करभकण्ठकडारमाशाः (संविव्युः) Śi. 5. 3.<BR>—5 A camel in general.<BR>—6 A kind of perfume.<BR>—7 The hip<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभी
करभः + .{@-भी@} A she camel.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: करभोरूः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभोरूः
करभः + -ऊरूः <i>f.</i> a lady whose thighs resemble the back of the fore-arm;<BR> अङ्के निधाय करभोरु यथासुखं ते Ś. 3. 20; Śi. 10. 69; Amaru. 71;<BR> or (according to another explanation), whose thighs resemble the trunk<BR> of an elephant; cf. Ku. 1. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभकः|करभक
करभकः A camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभिन्
करभिन् <i>m.</i> An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करभीरः|करभीर
करभीरः A lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करमट्टः|करमट्ट
करमट्टः The betel-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करमरिन्
करमरिन् <i>m.</i> A prisoner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्ब|करंब|करंबः|करम्बः
करम्ब, करम्बित <i>a.</i> [कृ-अम्बच्; Uṇ. 4. 82.]<BR>—1 Mixed, intermingled, variegated; प्रकाममादित्यमवाप्य कण्टकैः करम्बितामोदभरं<BR> विवृण्वती N. 1. 115, 85; स्फुटतरफेनकदम्बकरम्बितमिव यमुनाजलपूरम्<BR> Gīt. 11. करम्बितं चन्द्रिकया हिमाम्भः Rām. Ch. 6. 9.<BR>—2 Set, inlaid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्बित|करंबित|करम्बितः
करम्ब, करम्बित <i>a.</i> [कृ-अम्बच्; Uṇ. 4. 82.]<BR>—1 Mixed, intermingled, variegated; प्रकाममादित्यमवाप्य कण्टकैः करम्बितामोदभरं<BR> विवृण्वती N. 1. 115, 85; स्फुटतरफेनकदम्बकरम्बितमिव यमुनाजलपूरम्<BR> Gīt. 11. करम्बितं चन्द्रिकया हिमाम्भः Rām. Ch. 6. 9.<BR>—2 Set, inlaid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्भ|करंभ|करंभः|करम्भः
करम्भ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 mixed as an odour; करम्भपूतिसौरभ्य Bhāg. 3. 26. 45.<BR>—2 Roasted; कामधियस्त्वयि रचिता न परम रोहन्ति यथा करम्भबीजानि<BR> Bhāg. 6. 16. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्भः|करम्भ|करंभ|करंभः
करम्भः(म्बः)<BR>—1 Flour or meal mixed with curds. सक्तुधानाकरम्भाणां नोपभोग्याश्चिरस्थिताः<BR> Mb. 12. 36. 33, 7. 64. 7.<BR>—2 Mud; करम्भवालुकातापान् Ms. 12. 76 (where the word is variously<BR> interpreted; but Medhātithi takes it to mean ‘mud’).<BR>—3 Groats or coarsely ground oats.<BR>—4 A mixed odour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्बः|करम्ब|करंब|करंबः
करम्भः(म्बः)<BR>—1 Flour or meal mixed with curds. सक्तुधानाकरम्भाणां नोपभोग्याश्चिरस्थिताः<BR> Mb. 12. 36. 33, 7. 64. 7.<BR>—2 Mud; करम्भवालुकातापान् Ms. 12. 76 (where the word is variously<BR> interpreted; but Medhātithi takes it to mean ‘mud’).<BR>—3 Groats or coarsely ground oats.<BR>—4 A mixed odour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्भा
करम्भः(म्बः) + .{@-म्भा@}<BR>—1 N. of a plant (Asparagus Racemosus; Mar शतावरी ? वाघांटी)<BR>—2 A vessal for churning curds; Rām. 2. 91. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्भवालुका
करम्भः(म्बः) + .{@-वालुका@} Hot sand (punishment in hell); करम्भवालुकास्तप्ता Mb. 18. 2. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करम्भकम्
करम्भकम्^1<BR>—1 Groats.<BR>—2 Flour mixed with curds.<BR>—3 A document drawn up in different dialects; S. D.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170203. note: Presume Am is error as AP90 MW and other dictionaries have 'am'.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करहाटः|करहाट
करहाटः<BR>—1 N. of a country; (perhaps the modern Karad in Satara district); करहाटपतेः<BR> पुत्री त्रिजगन्नेत्रकार्मणम् Vikr. 8. 2.<BR>—2 The fibrous root or stem of a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करहाटकः|करहाटक
करहाटः + .{@-कः@} (= करहाटः) अचिरशैशिरविक्लमशेषिता कमलिनी करहाटकशेषिता<BR> Rām. Ch. 4. 6.<BR>—3 A group of lotuses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराङ्गणः|कराङ्गण|करांगणः
कराङ्गणः<BR>—1 A market or fare.<BR>—2 A place where revenue is collected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करायिका
करायिका A bird (a small kind of crane).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराल|करालं|करालः
कराल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Dreadful, formidable, frightful, terrible; U. 5. 5, 6. 1; Māl. 3;<BR> Bg. 11. 23, 25, 27; वपुर्महोरगस्येव करालफणमण्डलम् R. 12. 98; Mv. 3. 48.<BR>—2 Gaping, opening wide; करालवक्त्र U. 5. 6.<BR>—3 Great, large, high, lofty.<BR>—4 Uneven, jagged; pointed; प्रालेयमिश्रमकरन्दकरालकोशैः (पुष्पैः)<BR> Ve. 2. 6; Māl. 1. 38.<BR>—5 Harsh; क्वणितकरालकिंकिणीकः Māl. 5. 3.<BR>—6 Wide, spacious; सन्धिः करालो भवेत् Mk. 3. 12.<BR>—7 Deformed.<BR>—8 Having projecting teeth; करालो दन्तुरे तुङ्गे विकृतोज्ज्वलयोरपि ।<BR> विग्रहे भीषणे … ॥ Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालः|कराल|करालं
कराल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 Resin, pitch.<BR>—2 A disease of the teeth.<BR>—3 Black Tulasī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराला
कराल + .{@-ला@} A terrific form of Durgā; ˚आयतनम्; न करालोपहाराच्च<BR> फलमन्यद्विभाव्यते Māl. 5. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कराली
कराल + .{@-ली@} One of the seven tongues of fire. काली कराली च मनोजवा<BR> च Muṇḍ. 1. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालम्
कराल + .{@-लम्@} A particular condiment.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: करालदंष्ट्र, करालवदना<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालदंष्ट्र
कराल + -दंष्ट्र <i>a.</i> having terrific teeth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालवदना
कराल + -वदना an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालिकः|करालिक
करालिकः<BR>—1 A tree.<BR>—2 A sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालिका
करालिकः + .{@-का@} N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालित
करालित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tormented; एकस्यास्तपनकरैः करालितायाः Śi. 8. 4.<BR>—2 Magnified, intensified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करालिन्
करालिन् <i>m.</i> A kind of horse having a gaping mouth and projecting<BR> teeth; हीनदन्तोऽधिकश्चैव कराली कृष्णतालुकः । मुशली च तथा शृङ्गी<BR> षडेते स्वामिघातकाः ॥ Śālihotra of भोज.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिका
करिका Scratching, a wound caused by a fingernail. ‘दिग्दष्टे वर्तुलाकारे करिका नखरेखिका’ इति वैजयन्ती; Śi. 4. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिन्
करिन् <i>m.</i> [कर-इनि]<BR>—1 An elephant.<BR>—2 The number ‘8’ (in Math.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: करीन्द्रः, करीश्वरः, करिवरः, करिकुम्भः, करिकुसुम्भः, करिकृष्णा, करिगर्जितम्, करिदन्तः, करिदारकः, करिमाचलः, करिनासिका, करिपः, करिपोतः, करिशावः, करिशावकः, करिबन्धः, करिमुक्ता, करिमुखः, करियादस्, करिरतम्, करिवर, करिवैजयन्ती, करिसुन्दरिका, करिस्कन्धः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करीन्द्रः|करीन्द्र|करींद्र
करिन् + -इन्द्रः, -ईश्वरः, -वरः a large elephant, a war or state elephant,<BR> lordly elephant; सदादानः परिक्षीणः शस्त एव करीश्वरः Pt. 2. 75;<BR> दूरीकृताः करिवरेण मदान्धबुद्धपा Nītipr. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

