करिदन्तः|करिदन्त|करिदंत
करिन् + -दन्तः ivory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिदारकः|करिदारक
करिन् + -दारकः, -माचलः a lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिमाचलः|करिमाचल
करिन् + -दारकः, -माचलः a lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिनासिका
