करिशावकः|करिशावक
करिन् + -पोतः, -शावः, -शावकः a cub, young elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिबन्धः|करिबन्ध|करिबंध
करिन् + -बन्धः A column to which an elephant is tied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करिमुक्ता
