करुण|करुणः
करुण <i>a.</i> [करोति मनः आनुकूल्याय, कृ-उनन् Tv.] Tender,<BR> pathetic, pitiable, exciting pity, mournful; करुणध्वनिः V. 1; Śi. 9. 67;<BR> विकलकरुणैरार्यचरितैः U. 1. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणः|करुण
करुण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 Pity, compassion, tenderness.<BR>—2 Pathetic sentiment, grief, sorrow (as one of the 8 or 9 sentiments);<BR> पुटपाकप्रतीकाशो रामस्य करुणो रसः U. 3. 1, 13, 7. 12;<BR> विलपन् … करुणार्थग्रथितं प्रियां प्रति R. 8. 70.<BR>—3 The Supreme Being.<BR>—4 A Jaina saint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणम्
करुण + .{@-णम्@} Ved. An action, a holy or sacred rite. स विश्वस्य करुणस्येश<BR> एको Rv. 1. 100. 7; ममेदुकर्मन् करुणेऽधि जाया Av. 12. 3. 47. ━<i>ind.</i><BR> mournfully, woefully; अधस्ताच्छिंशपामूले साध्वी करुणमास्थिता Rām. 5. 59. 21.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: करुणमल्ली, करुणविप्रलम्भः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणमल्ली
करुण + -मल्ली the Mallikā plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणविप्रलम्भः|करुणविप्रलम्भ
करुण + -विप्रलम्भः (in Rhet.) the feeling of love in separation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणा
करुणा Compassion, pity, tenderness; प्रायः सर्वो भवति करुणावृत्तिरार्द्रान्तरात्मा<BR> Me. 93; so सकरुण kind; अकरुण unkind.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: करुणात्मन्, करुणार्द्र, करुणानिधिः, करुणापर, करुणामय, करुणाविमुख, करुणास्वनः, करुणाध्वनिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणात्मन्
करुणा + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> tender-hearted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणार्द्र
करुणा + -आर्द्र <i>a.</i> tenderhearted, moved with pity, sensitive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणानिधिः|करुणानिधि
करुणा + -निधिः store of mercy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणापर|करुणापरः
करुणा + -पर, -मय <i>a.</i> very kind. काकुत्स्थं करुणामयं गुणनिधिं<BR> विप्रप्रियं धार्मिकम् Mahānār. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणामय
करुणा + -पर, -मय <i>a.</i> very kind. काकुत्स्थं करुणामयं गुणनिधिं<BR> विप्रप्रियं धार्मिकम् Mahānār. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणाविमुख
करुणा + -विमुख <i>a.</i> merciless, cruel; करुणाविमुखेन मृत्युना हरता<BR> त्वां वद किं न मे हृतम् R. 8. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणास्वनः
करुणा + -स्वनः, -ध्वनिः a cry of distress, a piteous tone, wail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणाध्वनिः
करुणा + -स्वनः, -ध्वनिः a cry of distress, a piteous tone, wail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करुणिन्
करुणिन् <i>a.</i> Pitiable, distressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करूषः|करूष
करूषः Dryness (?). निर्मलो निष्करूषश्च शुद्ध इन्द्रो यथाभवत्<BR> Rām. 1. 24. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

