करेणुः|करेणु
करेणुः [कृ-एणु Uṇ. 2. 1; के मस्तके रेणुरस्य Tv.] An elephant<BR> in general; करेणुरारोहयते निषादिनम् Śi. 12. 5, 5. 48.<BR>—2 The Karṇikāra tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

करेणुः|करेणु
करेणुः + .{@-णुः, -णूः@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A female elephant; स घर्मतप्तः करिभिः करेणुभिः Bhāg. 8. 2. 23;<BR> ददौ रसात्पङ्कजरेणुगन्धि गजाय गण्डूषजलं करेणुः Ku. 3. 37; R. 16, 16.<BR>—2 N. of the mother of Pālakāpya.<BR>—3 N. of a medicinal<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-2" target="_blank">Page0537-2</a>]<BR> plant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: करेणुभूः, करेणुसुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

