कर्क्
कर्क् €1 P. To laugh (a Sautra root).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्क|कर्कः
कर्क <i>a.</i> [कृ-क Uṇ. 3. 40]<BR>—1 White; गौः श्वेत इति भवति, अश्वः कर्क इति Mbh. on P. I. 2. 71.<BR> कर्कीं वत्सामिह रक्ष वाजिन् Av. 4. 38. 6.<BR>—2 Good, excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कः|कर्क
कर्क + .{@-र्कः@}<BR>—1 A crab.<BR>—2 Cancer, the fourth sign of the zodiac.<BR>—3 Fire.<BR>—4 A water-jar.<BR>—5 A mirror.<BR>—6 A white horse. Mb. 7. 132. 30.<BR>—7 A kind of gem.<BR>—8 A vessel made out of a cocoa-nut shell.<BR>—9 A niggard. cf. … कर्कस्तु मल्लके । घटभेदाग्निमुकुरसिताश्वकृपणेष्वपि । Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

