कर्करी
कर्करी (-रिः)<BR>—1 A water-jar with small holes at the bottom, as in a sieve.<BR>—2 A kind of lute; यदुत्पतन् वदसि कर्करिर्यथा Rv. 2. 43. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्करिः|कर्करि
कर्करी (-रिः)<BR>—1 A water-jar with small holes at the bottom, as in a sieve.<BR>—2 A kind of lute; यदुत्पतन् वदसि कर्करिर्यथा Rv. 2. 43. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

