कर्केतनः|कर्केतन|कर्केतनं
कर्केतनः, -नम्<BR> A kind of gem or precious stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्केतनम्
कर्केतनः, -नम्<BR> A kind of gem or precious stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कोटः|कर्कोट
कर्कोटः, -टकः<BR>—1 One of the eight principal cobras. [When king Nala, being persecuted<BR> by Kali, was made to undergo many hardships, Karkoṭa, who was once saved<BR> by him from fire, so deformed him that none might recognise him during<BR> his days of adversity.]<BR>—2 The sugar-cane.<BR>—3 The बिल्व tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्कोटकः|कर्कोटक
कर्कोटः, -टकः<BR>—1 One of the eight principal cobras. [When king Nala, being persecuted<BR> by Kali, was made to undergo many hardships, Karkoṭa, who was once saved<BR> by him from fire, so deformed him that none might recognise him during<BR> his days of adversity.]<BR>—2 The sugar-cane.<BR>—3 The बिल्व tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्चरिका|कर्च्चरिका
कर्चरिका A sort of wheat cake stuffed with pulse-paste. (a sanskritisation<BR> of कचोरी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्चूरः|कर्चूर|कर्च्चूरं|कर्च्चूरः
कर्चूरः A kind of fragrant tree. (Mar. कापूरकाचरी). कालागुरुं<BR> च कर्चूरं कङ्कोलं रक्तचन्दनम् Śiva B. 30. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्चूरम्
कर्चूरः + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Gold; रराज कर्चूरपिशङ्गवासाः Śi. 3. 11.<BR>—2 Orpiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्चूरकः|कर्चूरक|कर्च्चूरकः
