कर्णान्तिक|कर्णांतिक
कर्ण + -अन्तिक <i>a.</i> close to the ear; स्वनसि मृदु कर्णान्तिकचरः Ś. 1. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णान्दुः|कर्णान्दु|कर्णांदु
कर्ण + -अन्दुः, -अन्दू <i>f.</i> an ornament for the ear, ear-ring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णान्दू|कर्णांदू
कर्ण + -अन्दुः, -अन्दू <i>f.</i> an ornament for the ear, ear-ring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णार्पणम्
कर्ण + -अर्पणम् giving ear, listening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णारा
कर्ण + -आरा (= -वेधनी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णास्फालः|कर्णास्फाल
कर्ण + -आस्फालः the flapping of the elephantʼs ears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णेन्दुः|कर्णेन्दु|कर्ण्णेन्दु
कर्ण + -इन्दुः <i>f.</i> a semicircular ear-ring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णोत्तंसः
कर्ण + -उत्तंसः an ear-ornament or merely an ornament (according to<BR> some authorities). (Mammaṭa says that here कर्ण means कर्णंस्थितत्व;<BR> cf. also his remark <i>ad hoc</i>:− कर्णावतंसादिपदे कर्णादिध्वनिनिर्मितः ।<BR> सन्निधानार्थबोधार्थं स्थितेष्वेतत्समर्थनम् ॥ K. P. 7). {@उपकर्णिका@}<BR> rumour; (lit. ‘from ear to ear’). प्रागेव कर्णोपकर्णिकया श्रुतापवादक्षुभितहृदयः Pt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णोर्णः|कर्णोर्ण|कर्ण्णोर्ण्ण
कर्ण + -ऊर्णः a kind of deer; कर्णोणैंकपदं चास्मै निर्जुष्टं वृकनाभिभिः Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णकषायः|कर्णकषाय
कर्ण + -कषायः Dirt in the ears; आपीयतां कर्णकषायशोषाननुकमिष्ये<BR> न इमान्सुपेशान् Bhāg. 2. 6. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णकीटा
कर्ण + -कीटा, -कीटी<BR>—1 a worm with many feet and of a reddish colour,<BR>—2 a small centipede.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णकीटी
कर्ण + -कीटा, -कीटी<BR>—1 a worm with many feet and of a reddish colour,<BR>—2 a small centipede.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णकुमारी
कर्ण + -कुमारी N. of Bhavānī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णकूटः
कर्ण + -कूटः The tower at the corner of the roof; Māna. 19. 54-55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णक्ष्वेडः|कर्णक्ष्वेड|कर्ण्णक्ष्वेड
कर्ण + -क्ष्वेडः (in Medic.) a constant noise in the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णगूथम्
कर्ण + -गूथम् ear-wax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णगूथः|कर्णगूथ|कर्णगूथं
कर्ण + -गूथम् + .({@-थः@}), {@-गूथकः@} hardening of the wax of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णगोचर
कर्ण + -गोचर <i>a.</i> audible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णग्राहः|कर्णग्राह
कर्ण + -ग्राहः a helmsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णचूलिका
कर्ण + -चूलिका <i>f.</i> An ear-ring; उत्कृत्तकर्णचूलिकेन मुखेन … … Svapna. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णजप|कर्णजपः
कर्ण + -जप <i>a.</i> (also कर्णेजप) a secret traducer, talebearer,<BR> informer. कर्णेजपः सूचकः Mbh. on P. III. 2. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णजपः|कर्णजप
कर्ण + -जपः, -जापः slandering, tale-bearing, calumniating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णजापः|कर्णजाप
कर्ण + -जपः, -जापः slandering, tale-bearing, calumniating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णजलूका
कर्ण + -जलूका a small centipede. (also -जलौकस्, -जलौका)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णजाहम्
कर्ण + -जाहम् the root of the ear; cf. तस्य पाकमूले पील्वादिकर्णादिभ्यः<BR> कुणब्जाह चौ P. V. 2. 24. अपि कर्णजाहविनिवेशिताननः Māl. 5. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णजित्
कर्ण + -जित् <i>m.</i> ‘conqueror of Karṇa’, epithet of Arjuna, the third<BR> Pāṇḍava prince.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णज्वरः|कर्णज्वर
कर्ण + -ज्वरः pain to the ear; U. 5. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णतालः|कर्णताल|कर्ण्णताल
कर्ण + -तालः the flapping of the elephantʼs ears, the noise made by<BR> it; विस्तारितः कुञ्जरकर्णतालैः R. 7. 39, 9. 71; Śi. 17. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णदर्पणः|कर्णदर्पण|कर्ण्णदर्पण
कर्ण + -दर्पणः an ear-ring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णदुन्दुभिः|कर्णदुन्दुभि|कर्ण्णदुन्दुभि
