कर्णधारः|कर्णधार|कर्ण्णधार
कर्ण + -धारः a helmsman, a pilot; अकर्णधारा जलधौ विप्लवेतेह नौरिव<BR> H. 3. 2; अविनयनदीकर्णधारकर्ण Ve. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णधारिणी
कर्ण + -धारिणी a female elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपत्रकः|कर्णपत्रक|कर्ण्णपत्रक
कर्ण + -पत्रकः The lobe of the ear; Y. 3. 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपथः|कर्णपथ|कर्ण्णपथ
कर्ण + -पथः the range of hearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपरम्परा|कर्ण्णपरम्परा
कर्ण + -परम्परा from ear to ear, hearsay; इति कर्णपरंपरया श्रुतम् Ratn. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपर्वन्|कर्ण्णपर्वन्
कर्ण + -पर्वन् <i>n.</i> the eighth (<i>i. e.</i> Karṇa) section of the Mahābhārata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपाकः|कर्णपाक|कर्ण्णपाक
कर्ण + -पाकः inflammation of the outer ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपालिः|कर्णपालि|कर्ण्णपालि
कर्ण + -पालिः, -पाली <i>f.</i><BR>—1 the lobe of the ear.<BR>—2 the outer edge of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपाली|कर्ण्णपाली
कर्ण + -पालिः, -पाली + .({@-ली@}) an ornament of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपाली|कर्ण्णपाली
कर्ण + -पालिः, -पाली <i>f.</i><BR>—1 the lobe of the ear.<BR>—2 the outer edge of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपाशः|कर्णपाश
कर्ण + -पाशः a beautiful ear; U. 6. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपिशाची|कर्ण्णपिशाची
कर्ण + -पिशाची <i>f.</i> a type of goddess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपुटम्
कर्ण + -पुटम् the auditory passage of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपूरः|कर्णपूर|कर्ण्णपूर
कर्ण + -पूरः<BR>—1 an ornament (of flowers &c.)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">Page0539-2</a>]<BR> worn round the ear, an ear-ring; इदं च करतलं किमिति कर्णपूरतामारोपितम्<BR> K. 60. प्रचुरसमरशोभासुभ्रुवः कर्णपूरः Śiva B. 30. 46.<BR>—2 the Aśoka tree.<BR>—3 the Śirīṣa tree.<BR>—4 the blue lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णपूरकः|कर्णपूरक|कर्ण्णपूरक
कर्ण + -पूरकः<BR>—1 an ear-ring.<BR>—2 the Kadamba tree.<BR>—3 the Aśoka tree.<BR>—4 the blue lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णप्रणादः|कर्णप्रणाद
कर्ण + -प्रणादः, -प्रतिनाहः a disease of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णप्रतिनाहः|कर्णप्रतिनाह|कर्ण्णप्रतिनाह
कर्ण + -प्रणादः, -प्रतिनाहः a disease of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णप्रान्तः|कर्णप्रान्त|कर्णप्रांत
