कर्णफलः|कर्णफल|कर्ण्णफल
कर्ण + -फलः a kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णभूषणम्
कर्ण + -भूषणम्, -भूषा an ear-ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णभूषा
कर्ण + -भूषणम्, -भूषा an ear-ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णमुकुरः|कर्णमुकुर
कर्ण + -मुकुरः an ear-ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णमूलम्
कर्ण + -मूलम् the root of the ear; तं कर्णमूलमागत्य रामे श्रीर्न्यस्यतामिति R. 12. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णमोटी|कर्ण्णमोटी
कर्ण + -मोटी a form of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णयोनि|कर्ण्णयोनि
कर्ण + -योनि <i>a.</i> having the ear as a source. तस्य साध्वीरिषवो याभिरस्यति<BR> नृचक्षसो दृशये कर्णयोनयः Rv. 2. 24. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्णलता|कर्ण्णलता
