कर्तृ|कर्त्तृ
कर्तृ <i>a.</i> or <i>s.</i> [कृ-तृच्] कर्ताहमिति मन्यते Bg. 3. 27.<BR>—1 A doer, one who does, makes, performs &c., an agent; वंशस्य˚<BR> R. 2. 64; व्याकरणस्य कर्ता author of Grammar ऋणस्य कर्ता one<BR> who incurs debt; हितकर्ता a benefactor; सुवर्णकर्ता a goldsmith &c.<BR>—2 (In gram.) An agent (the meaning of the instrumental case).<BR>—3 The Supreme Spirit.<BR>—4 An epithet of Brahmā.<BR>—5 N. of Viṣṇu and Śiva also.<BR>—6 A priest.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कर्त्रभिप्राय, कर्तृवाच्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0540-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कर्त्रभिप्राय
