कलशी, -शिः (-सी, -सिः <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 A pitcher, a jar.<BR>—2 A churn; कलशिमुदधिगुर्वीं बल्लवा लोडयन्ति; Śi. 11. 8<BR>—3 Hemionitis Cordifolia (Mar. रिंगणी);<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कलशीसुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलशिः|कलशि
कलशी, -शिः (-सी, -सिः <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 A pitcher, a jar.<BR>—2 A churn; कलशिमुदधिगुर्वीं बल्लवा लोडयन्ति; Śi. 11. 8<BR>—3 Hemionitis Cordifolia (Mar. रिंगणी);<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कलशीसुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलशीसुतः|कलशीसुत
कलशी + -सुतः N. of Agastya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहः|कलह|कलहं
कलहः, -हम्<BR> [कलं कामं हन्ति हन्-ड Tv.]<BR>—1 Strife, quarrel; ईर्ष्याकलहः Bh. 1. 2; लीला˚ Ś. Til. 8;<BR> so शुष्ककलहः, प्रणयकलहः &c.<BR>—2 War, battle.<BR>—3 Trick, deceit, falsehood.<BR>—4 Violence, kicking, beating &c. Ms. 4. 121; (where Medhātithi and Kullūka<BR> explain कलह by दण्डादिनेतरेतरताडनम् and दण्डादण्डयादि respectively).<BR>—5 A road, way.<BR>—6 The sheath of a sword.<BR>—7 A cry, sound; मदकलनीलकण्ठकलहैर्मुखराः ककुभः Māl. 9. 18.<BR>—8 A part of west Bengal named Rāḍha.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कलहान्तरिता, कलहापहृत, कलहकारः, कलहकारिन्, कलहनाशनः, कलहनाशनः, कलहप्रिय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहम्
कलहः, -हम्<BR> [कलं कामं हन्ति हन्-ड Tv.]<BR>—1 Strife, quarrel; ईर्ष्याकलहः Bh. 1. 2; लीला˚ Ś. Til. 8;<BR> so शुष्ककलहः, प्रणयकलहः &c.<BR>—2 War, battle.<BR>—3 Trick, deceit, falsehood.<BR>—4 Violence, kicking, beating &c. Ms. 4. 121; (where Medhātithi and Kullūka<BR> explain कलह by दण्डादिनेतरेतरताडनम् and दण्डादण्डयादि respectively).<BR>—5 A road, way.<BR>—6 The sheath of a sword.<BR>—7 A cry, sound; मदकलनीलकण्ठकलहैर्मुखराः ककुभः Māl. 9. 18.<BR>—8 A part of west Bengal named Rāḍha.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कलहान्तरिता, कलहापहृत, कलहकारः, कलहकारिन्, कलहनाशनः, कलहनाशनः, कलहप्रिय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहान्तरिता|कलहांतरिता
कलहः + -अन्तरिता a woman separated from her lover in consequence of a<BR> quarrel with him (one who is angry and yet sorry for it); she is thus<BR> defined in S. D. 117. चाटुकारमपि प्राणनाथं रोषादपास्य या । पश्चात्तापमवाप्नोति<BR> कलहान्तरिता तु सा ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहापहृत
कलहः + -अपहृत <i>a.</i> taken by main force or violence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहकारः|कलहकार
कलहः + -कारः, -कारिन् <i>a.</i> quarrelsome, turbulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहकारिन्
कलहः + -कारः, -कारिन् <i>a.</i> quarrelsome, turbulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहनाशनः|कलहनाशन
कलहः + -नाशनः Guilandina Bondue (Mar. कुडा, करंज).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहनाशनः|कलहनाशन
कलहः + -नाशनः A kind of करंज tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहप्रिय|कलहप्रियः
कलहः + -प्रिय <i>a.</i> fond of (promoting) quarrels; ननु कलहप्रियोऽसि<BR> M. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहप्रियः|कलहप्रिय
कलहः + -प्रिय + ({@-यः@}) an epithet of Nārada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलहप्रिया
कलहः + -प्रिय + .({@-या@}) a bird (सारिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कला
कला [कल्-कच्] A small part of anything; स एष संवत्सरः<BR> प्रजापतिः षोडशकलास्तस्य Bṛ. Up. 1. 5. 14; विन्देम देवतां वाचममृतामात्मनः<BR> कलाम् U. 1. 1; a bit, jot; कलामप्यकृतपरिलम्बः K. 304; सर्वे<BR> ते मित्रगात्रस्य कलां नार्हन्ति षोडशीम् Pt. 2. 59; Ms. 2. 86, 8. 36;<BR> a sixteenth part; यथा कलं यथा शफं यथा ऋणं संनयामसि Rv. 8. 47, 17;<BR> a symbolic expression of the number sixteen; Hc.<BR>—2 A digit of the moon (these are sixteen); जगति जयिनस्ते ते भावा<BR> नवेन्दुकलादयः Māl. 1. 36; Ku. 5. 71; Me. 91.<BR>—3 Interest on capital (consideration paid for the use of money); घनवीथिवीथिमवतीर्णवतो<BR> निधिरम्भसामुपचयाय कलाः Śi. 9. 32. (where कला means ‘digits’ also).<BR>—4 A division of time variously computed; one minute, 48 seconds, or 8<BR> seconds. Mb. 1. 25. 14, 12. 137. 21.<BR>—5 The 60th part of one thirtieth part of a zodiacal sign, a minute of a degree.<BR>—6 Any practical art (mechanical or fine); there are 64 such arts, as<BR> music, dancing &c. मातृवदस्याः कलाः Mbh. on P. IV. 1. 90. (See कामधेनु<BR> टीका on काव्यालङ्कारसूत्र 7.)<BR>—7 Skill, ingenuity.<BR>—8 Fraud, deceit.<BR>—9 (In Prosody) A syllabic instant.<BR>—10 A boat.<BR>—11 The menstrual discharge.<BR>—12 A term for the seven substrata of the elements of the human body;<BR> (they are:− आद्या मांसधरा प्रोक्ता द्वितीया रक्तधारिणी । मेदोधरा तृतीया<BR> तु चतुर्थी श्लेष्मधारिणी ॥ पञ्चमी च मलं धत्ते षष्टी पित्तधरा मता ।<BR> रेतोधरा सप्तमी स्यात् इति सप्त कलाः स्मृताः ॥)<BR>—13 An atom.<BR>—14 A term<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">Page0546-1</a>]<BR> for the embryo.<BR>—15 A fleshy part near the tail of the elephant (also कलाभागः);<BR> Mātaṅga L. 3. 2.<BR>—16 Enumeration.<BR>—17 A form (स्वरूप); लीलया दधतः कलाः Bhāg. 1. 1. 17.<BR>—18 Prowess (शक्ति); संहृत्य कालकलया कल्पान्त इदमीश्वरः<BR> Bhāg. 11. 9. 16.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कलान्तरम्, कलायनः, कलाकुलम्, कलाकेलि, कलाक्षयः, कलाधरः, कलानिधिः, कलापूर्णः, कलान्यासः, कलाभृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0545-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलान्तरम्
कला + -अन्तरम्<BR>—1 another digit.<BR>—2 interest, profit; मासे शतस्य यदि पञ्च कलान्तरं स्यात् Līlā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलायनः|कलायन
कला + -अयनः a tumbler, a dancer (as on the sharp edge of a sword).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाकुलम्
कला + -आकुलम् deadly poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाकेलि|कलाकेलिः
कला + -केलि <i>a.</i> gay, wanton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाकेलिः|कलाकेलि
कला + -केलि + ({@-लिः@}) an epithet of Kāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाक्षयः
कला + -क्षयः waning (of the moon); R. 5. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाधरः|कलाधर
कला + -धरः, -निधिः, -पूर्णः the moon; अहो महत्त्वं महतामपूर्वं<BR> विपत्तिकालेऽपि परोपकारः । यथास्यमध्ये पतितोऽपि राहोः कलानिधिः पुण्यचयं<BR> ददाति ॥ Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलानिधिः|कलानिधि
कला + -धरः, -निधिः, -पूर्णः the moon; अहो महत्त्वं महतामपूर्वं<BR> विपत्तिकालेऽपि परोपकारः । यथास्यमध्ये पतितोऽपि राहोः कलानिधिः पुण्यचयं<BR> ददाति ॥ Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलापूर्णः|कलापूर्ण|कलापूर्ण्ण
कला + -धरः, -निधिः, -पूर्णः the moon; अहो महत्त्वं महतामपूर्वं<BR> विपत्तिकालेऽपि परोपकारः । यथास्यमध्ये पतितोऽपि राहोः कलानिधिः पुण्यचयं<BR> ददाति ॥ Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलान्यासः|कलान्यास
कला + -न्यासः a tattooing personʼs body with particular mystical marks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाभृत्
कला + -भृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 the moon. कला च सा कान्तिमती कलाभृतः Ku. 5. 71.<BR>—2 an artist &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलावत्|कलावन्त्
कलावत् <i>a.</i> Versed in the (64) arts; स्फुरितगुणद्युतिसुन्दरः<BR> कलावान् Māl. 2. 10. ━<i>m.</i> the moon (having digits); कला च सा<BR> कान्तिमती कलावतः Ku. 5. 71; Māl. 2. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिका
कलिका<BR>—1 A digit of the moon.<BR>—2 A division of time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाङ्कुरः|कलाङ्कुर|कलांकुर|कलांकुरः
कलाङ्कुरः<BR>—1 The Sārasa bird, crane.<BR>—2 N. of Kaṃsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाचिक
कलाचिक, -कलाची<BR>—1 A ladle or a kind of pot; दधत्कलाचीमितरः परोऽनिलम् । Śāhendra. 3. 11.<BR>—2 The fore-arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाची
कलाचिक, -कलाची<BR>—1 A ladle or a kind of pot; दधत्कलाचीमितरः परोऽनिलम् । Śāhendra. 3. 11.<BR>—2 The fore-arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाटीनः|कलाटीन
कलाटीनः The white water wag-tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलादः|कलाद
कलादः, -दकः<BR> A goldsmith. कांस्यकाराः कलादाश्च … … Śiva B. 31. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलादकः|कलादक
कलादः, -दकः<BR> A goldsmith. कांस्यकाराः कलादाश्च … … Śiva B. 31. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाधिकः|कलाधिक
कलाधिकः A cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलापः|कलाप
कलापः<BR>—1 A band, bundle; समित्कलापमादाय प्रविवेश स्वमाश्रमम् Mb. 3. 137. 1.<BR> मुक्ताकलापस्य च निस्तलस्य Ku. 1. 42 a round necklace of<BR> pearls; रशनाकलापः a zone of several strings.<BR>—2 A group or whole collection of things; अखिलकलाकलापालोचन K. 7.<BR>—3 A peacockʼs tail; तं मे जातकलापं प्रेषय मणिकण्ठकं शिखिनम्<BR> V. 5. 13; Pt. 2. 80; Ṛs. 1. 16, 2. 14.<BR>—4 A womanʼs zone or girdle; (oft. with काञ्ची or रशना &c.) जघनमरुणरत्नग्रन्थिकाञ्चीकलापं<BR> कुवलयनयनानां को विहातुं समर्थः Bh. 1. 11. श्रोणीतटं सुविपुलं<BR> रशनाकलापैः Ṛs. 3. 20; Mk. 1. 27.<BR>—5 An ornament in general; Mb. 8. 19. 29. ‘कलापः संहते बर्हे तूणीरे भूषणे हरे’ इति विश्वः<BR>—6 The rope round an elephantʼs neck.<BR>—7 A quiver.<BR>—8 An arrow.<BR>—9 The moon.<BR>—10 A shrewed and intelligent man.<BR>—11 A poem written in one metre.<BR>—12 A tuft (जटा˚) or knot of braided hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलापी
कलापः + .{@-पी@} A bundle of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलापकम्
कलापकम्<BR>—1 A series of four stanzas on the same subject and forming one grammatical<BR> sentence (चतुर्भिस्तु कलापकम्); for an illustration see Ki. 3. 41, 42, 43, 44.<BR>—2 A debt to be paid when the peacocks spread<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">Page0546-2</a>]<BR> their tails.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलापकः|कलापक|कलापकं
कलापकम् + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A band or bundle in general.<BR>—2 A string of pearls; a kind of ornament; कलापकावक्षमाला यथेयम् Mb. 3. 112. 5.<BR>—3 The rope round an elephantʼs neck.<BR>—4 A zone or girdle (= कलाप); रशनाकलापकगुणेन वधूर्मकरध्वजद्विरदमाकलयत् Śi. 9. 45.<BR>—5 A sectarian mark on the forehead (विशेषक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलापिन्
कलापिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having a quiver; कलापिनौ धनुष्पाणी शोभमानौ दिशो दश Rām. 1. 22. 7.<BR>—2 Spreading its tail (as a peacock). ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A peacock; कलविलापि कलापिकदम्बकम् Śi. 6. 31; Pt. 2. 80; R. 6. 9.<BR>—2 The (Indian) cuckoo.<BR>—3 The Indian fig-tree (प्लक्ष).<BR>—4 The time (when peacocks spread their tails).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलापिनी
कलापिनी The night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाम्बिः|कलाम्बि|कलांबिः
कलाम्बिः, -का <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Lending, loan.<BR>—2 Usury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाम्बिका
कलाम्बिः, -का <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Lending, loan.<BR>—2 Usury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलामकः|कलामक
कलामकः A kind of rice ripening in the cold season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलायः|कलाय
कलायः N. of a leguminous seed (Mar. वाटाणा); कलायपुष्पवर्णास्तु<BR> श्वेतलोहितराजयः (हयश्रेष्ठाः) Mb. 7. 23. 62. विकसितकलायकुसुमासितद्युतेः<BR> Śi. 13. 21. कलायं शाकेषु … … Pratimā 5.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कलायपुष्पकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलायपुष्पकः|कलायपुष्पक
कलायः + -पुष्पकः A variety of gems; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलावती
कलावती A kind of lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाविकः|कलाविक
कलाविकः A cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाविकलः|कलाविकल
कलाविकलः The sparrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलाहकः|कलाहक
कलाहकः A kind of musical instrument (काहल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिः|कलि
कलिः [कल्-इनि]<BR>—1 Strife, quarrel, dissension, contention; शठ कलिरेष महांस्त्वयाद्य<BR> दत्तः Śi. 7. 55; कलिकामजित् R. 9. 33; Amaru. 23.<BR>—2 War, battle. अविषह्यैस्तमाक्षेपैः क्षिपन्संजनयन् कलिम् । Bhāg. 10. 55. 17.<BR>—3 The fourth age of the world, the iron age (consisting of 432,000 years<BR> of men and beginning from the 13th of February 3102 B. C.); दानमेकं<BR> कलौ युगे Ms. 1. 86, 9. 301; कलिवर्ज्यानि इमानि &c.<BR>—4 Kali age personified (this Kali persecuted Nala).<BR>—5 The worst of any class.<BR>—6 The Bibhītaka tree.<BR>—7 The side of a die which is marked with one point. घृतेन कलिं शिक्षामि Av. 7. 109. 1.<BR>—8 A hero.<BR>—9 An arrow. ━<i>f.</i> A bud.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कलिकारः, कलिकारकः, कलिक्रियः, कलिद्रुमः, कलिवृक्षः, कलिप्रिय, कलिमारकः, कलियुगम्, कलिसंतरणम्, कलिहारी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिकारः|कलिकार
कलिः + -कारः, -कारकः, -क्रियः<BR>—1 an epithet of Nārada.<BR>—2 the Karañja^1 tree.<BR>—3 a kind of bird.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260403.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिकारकः|कलिकारक
कलिः + -कारः, -कारकः, -क्रियः<BR>—1 an epithet of Nārada.<BR>—2 the Karañja^1 tree.<BR>—3 a kind of bird.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260403.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिक्रियः|कलिक्रिय
कलिः + -कारः, -कारकः, -क्रियः<BR>—1 an epithet of Nārada.<BR>—2 the Karañja^1 tree.<BR>—3 a kind of bird.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260403.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिद्रुमः|कलिद्रुम
कलिः + -द्रुमः, -वृक्षः the Bibhītaka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिवृक्षः|कलिवृक्ष
कलिः + -द्रुमः, -वृक्षः the Bibhītaka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिप्रिय|कलिप्रियः
कलिः + -प्रिय <i>a.</i> quarrelsome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिप्रियः|कलिप्रिय
कलिः + -प्रिय + .({@-यः@})<BR>—1 N. of Nārada.<BR>—2 a monkey, ape; Ms. 1. 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिमारकः|कलिमारक
कलिः + -मारकः a kind of Karañja tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलियुगम्
कलिः + -युगम् the Kali age; Ms. 1. 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिसंतरणम्
कलिः + -संतरणम् N. of an Upaniṣad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिहारी
कलिः + -हारी <i>f.</i> a kind of medicine (विषलाङ्गली).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिकः|कलिक
कलिकः Curlew.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिका
कलिका, -कलिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An unblown flower; a bud; चूतानां चिरनिर्गताऽपि कलिका बध्नाति न<BR> स्वं रजः Ś. 6. 4; किमाम्रकलिकाभङ्गमारभसे Ś. 6; Ṛs. 6. 17; R. 9. 33.<BR>—2 A digit. streak.<BR>—3 The bottom or peg of the Indian lute.<BR>—4 A kind^1 of poetic composition (akin to बिरुद).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260402.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिः|कलि
कलिका, -कलिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An unblown flower; a bud; चूतानां चिरनिर्गताऽपि कलिका बध्नाति न<BR> स्वं रजः Ś. 6. 4; किमाम्रकलिकाभङ्गमारभसे Ś. 6; Ṛs. 6. 17; R. 9. 33.<BR>—2 A digit. streak.<BR>—3 The bottom or peg of the Indian lute.<BR>—4 A kind^1 of poetic composition (akin to बिरुद).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260403. Reference: Scott batch 20260402.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिङ्ग|कलिंग|कलिङ्गं|कलिङ्गः
कलिङ्ग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Clever.<BR>—2 Cunning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिङ्गाः
कलिङ्ग + .{@-गाः@} (pl.) N. of a country and its inhabitants; (a district on<BR> the northern Coromandel coast); नो खण्डिकाञ्जगाम नो कलिङ्गाञ्जगाम<BR> Mbh. on P. III. 2. 115. उत्कलादर्शितपथः कलिङ्गाभिमुखो ययौ R. 4. 38;<BR> (its position is thus described in Tantras:− जगन्नाथात्समारभ्य<BR> कृष्णातीरान्तगः प्रिये । कलिङ्गदेशः संप्रोक्तो वाममार्गपरायणः ॥).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिङ्गः|कलिङ्ग|कलिंग|कलिङ्गं
कलिङ्ग + .{@-ङ्गः@}<BR>—1 The fork-tailed shrike.<BR>—2 N. of several plants; (as शिरीष, प्लक्ष &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिङ्गा
कलिङ्ग + .{@-ङ्गा@} A beautiful woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिङ्गम्
कलिङ्ग + .{@-ङ्गम्@} Indra grain (इन्द्रयव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिञ्जः|कलिञ्ज|कलिंज|कलिंजः
कलिञ्जः A mat, a screen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिञ्जम्
कलिञ्जः + .{@-ञ्जम्@} Wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलित|कलितं
कलित see under कल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिन्दः|कलिन्द|कलिंद|कलिंदः
कलिन्दः<BR>—1 N. of the mountain on which the Yamunā rises.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR>—3 The Bibhītaka plant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कलिन्दकन्या, कलिन्दजा, कलिन्दतनया, कलिन्दनन्दिनी, कलिन्दसुता, कलिन्दगिरिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिन्दकन्या|कलिंदकन्या
कलिन्दः + -कन्या, -जा, -तनया, -नन्दिनी, -सुता epithets of the river Yamunā;<BR> कलिन्दकन्या मथुरां गतापि R. 6. 48; कलिन्दजानीर Bv. 2. 120; Gīt. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिन्दजा|कलिंदजा
कलिन्दः + -कन्या, -जा, -तनया, -नन्दिनी, -सुता epithets of the river Yamunā;<BR> कलिन्दकन्या मथुरां गतापि R. 6. 48; कलिन्दजानीर Bv. 2. 120; Gīt. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिन्दतनया|कलिंदतनया
कलिन्दः + -कन्या, -जा, -तनया, -नन्दिनी, -सुता epithets of the river Yamunā;<BR> कलिन्दकन्या मथुरां गतापि R. 6. 48; कलिन्दजानीर Bv. 2. 120; Gīt. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिन्दनन्दिनी|कलिंदनंदिनी
कलिन्दः + -कन्या, -जा, -तनया, -नन्दिनी, -सुता epithets of the river Yamunā;<BR> कलिन्दकन्या मथुरां गतापि R. 6. 48; कलिन्दजानीर Bv. 2. 120; Gīt. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिन्दसुता
कलिन्दः + -कन्या, -जा, -तनया, -नन्दिनी, -सुता epithets of the river Yamunā;<BR> कलिन्दकन्या मथुरां गतापि R. 6. 48; कलिन्दजानीर Bv. 2. 120; Gīt. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिन्दगिरिः|कलिन्दगिरि
कलिन्दः + -गिरिः the Kalinda mountain. ˚जा, ˚तनया, ˚नन्दिनी epithets<BR> of the river Yamunā; Bv. 4. 3, 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिल|कलिलः
कलिल <i>a.</i> [कल-इलच् Uṇ. 1. 54]<BR>—1 Covered with, full of. वराङ्गनागणकलिलं नृपात्मजः ततो बलाद्<BR> वनमभिनीयते स्म तत् Bu. C. 3. 65.<BR>—2 Mixed, blended with; तत एवाकन्दकलिलः कलकलः Mv. 1.<BR>—3 Affected by, subject to; अकल्ककलिलः Śi. 19. 98.<BR>—4 Impervious, impenetrable.<BR>—5 Contaminated, defiled; तदा वृषध्वजद्वेषकलिलात्मा प्रजापतिः<BR> Bhāg. 4. 7. 10; Śi. 19. 98.<BR>—6 Doubtful, suspicious; एतस्मात्कारणाच्छ्रेयः कलिलं प्रतिभाति मे<BR> Mb. 12. 287. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलिलम्
कलिल + .{@-लम्@} A large heap, confused mass; विशसि हृदय क्लेशकलिलम्<BR> Bh. 3. 34; confusion; यदा ते मोहकलिलं बुद्धिर्व्यतितरिष्यति Bg. 2. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलुक्कः|कलुक्क
कलुक्कः A cymbal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलुक्का
कलुक्कः + .{@-क्का@}<BR>—1 A tavern.<BR>—2 A meteor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलुष|कलुषं|कलुषः
कलुष <i>a.</i> [कल्-उषच् Uṇ. 4. 75]<BR>—1 Turbid, dirty, muddy, foul; गङ्गारोधःपतनकलुषा गृह्णतीव प्रसादम्<BR> V. 1. 9; Ki. 8. 32; Ghaṭ. 13;<BR>—2 Choked, hoarse, husky; कण्ठः स्तम्भितबाष्पवृत्तिकलुषः Ś. 4. 6.<BR>—3 Bedimmed; full of; Ś. 6. 9.<BR>—4 Angry, displeased, excited; U. 3. 13; भावावबोधकलुषा दयितेव रात्रौ<BR> R. 5. 64 (Malli. takes कलुष to mean ‘unable’, ‘incompetent’).<BR>—5 Wicked, sinful, bad.<BR>—6 Cruel, censurable; त्वां प्रत्यकस्मात्कलुषप्रवृत्तौ R. 14. 73.<BR>—7 Dark, opaque.<BR>—8 Idle, lazy.<BR>—9 Perverted; ˚भूतायां बुद्धौ Pt. 3. 185; कालुष्यमुपयाति बुद्धिः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलुषः|कलुष|कलुषं
कलुष + .{@-षः@} A buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलुषम्
कलुष + .{@-षम्@}<BR>—1 Dirt filth, mud; विगतकलुषमम्भः Ṛs. 3. 22.<BR>—2 Sin; कलुषेणाद्य महता मेदिनी परिमुच्यताम् Rām. 2. 96. 27<BR>—3 Wrath.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कलुषमानस, कलुषयोनिज<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलुषमानस
कलुष + -मानस <i>a.</i> evil-minded; अथाब्रवीत्सुतान् कद्रूर्नागान् कलुषमानसा Bm. 1. 110<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलुषयोनिज
कलुष + -योनिज <i>a.</i> illegitimate, of impure origin; Ms. 10. 57, 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलुषित
कलुषित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Turbid or muddy.<BR>—2 Offended, displeased; भर्तुस्तथा कलुषितां बहुवल्लभस्य Mu. 3. 9.<BR>—3 wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलुषीकृ
कलुषीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To make turbid or unclean.<BR>—2 To obscure, taint, sully; विपदामाश्रयः शश्वद्दौर्गत्यकलुषीकृतः Pt. 2. 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलेवरः|कलेवर|कलेवरं
कलेवरः, -रम्<BR> The body; यावत्स्वस्थमिदं कलेवरगृहम् Bh. 3. 88; H. 1. 44;<BR> अन्तकाले च मामेव स्मरन्मुक्त्वा कलेवरम् Bg. 8. 5; Bv. 1. 103, 2. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कलेवरम्
कलेवरः, -रम्<BR> The body; यावत्स्वस्थमिदं कलेवरगृहम् Bh. 3. 88; H. 1. 44;<BR> अन्तकाले च मामेव स्मरन्मुक्त्वा कलेवरम् Bg. 8. 5; Bv. 1. 103, 2. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्क|कल्कः
कल्क <i>a.</i> [कल्-क Uṇ. 3. 40] Sinful, wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्कः|कल्क
कल्क + .{@-ल्कः, -ल्कम्@}<BR>—1 The viscous sediment deposited by oily substances when ground.<BR>—2 A kind of tenacious paste; गौरसर्षपकल्केन (स्नपनम्) Y. 1. 277.<BR> An unguent paste; कल्कांश्चूर्णकषायांश्च स्नानानि विविधानि च<BR> Rām. 2. 91. 74; a paste used as plaster or cement also called Yoga (mixture).<BR>—3 (Hence) Dirt, filth (in general).<BR>—4 Ordure, faeces.<BR>—5 Meanness, deceit, hypocrisy; Śi. 19. 98.<BR>—6 Sin. तपो न कल्कोऽध्ययनं न कल्कः स्वाभाविको वेदविधिर्न कल्कः ।<BR> प्रसह्य वित्ताहरणं न कल्कस्तान्येव भावोपहतानि कल्कः (दीनदण्डरेषा) Mb. 1. 1. 275.<BR>—7 Levigated powder; तां लोभ्रकल्केन हृताङ्गतैलाम् Ku. 7. 9.<BR>—8 Incense.<BR>—9 The wax of the ear.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कल्कफलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्कम्
कल्क + .{@-ल्कः, -ल्कम्@}<BR>—1 The viscous sediment deposited by oily substances when ground.<BR>—2 A kind of tenacious paste; गौरसर्षपकल्केन (स्नपनम्) Y. 1. 277.<BR> An unguent paste; कल्कांश्चूर्णकषायांश्च स्नानानि विविधानि च<BR> Rām. 2. 91. 74; a paste used as plaster or cement also called Yoga (mixture).<BR>—3 (Hence) Dirt, filth (in general).<BR>—4 Ordure, faeces.<BR>—5 Meanness, deceit, hypocrisy; Śi. 19. 98.<BR>—6 Sin. तपो न कल्कोऽध्ययनं न कल्कः स्वाभाविको वेदविधिर्न कल्कः ।<BR> प्रसह्य वित्ताहरणं न कल्कस्तान्येव भावोपहतानि कल्कः (दीनदण्डरेषा) Mb. 1. 1. 275.<BR>—7 Levigated powder; तां लोभ्रकल्केन हृताङ्गतैलाम् Ku. 7. 9.<BR>—8 Incense.<BR>—9 The wax of the ear.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कल्कफलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्कफलः|कल्कफल
कल्क + -फलः the pomegranate plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्कनम्
कल्कनम्<BR>—1 Deceiving, over-reaching, falsehood.<BR>—2 Meanness, wickedness; Bhāg. 1. 14. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्किः|कल्कि
कल्किः The tenth and last incarnation of Viṣṇu in his capacity<BR> of the destroyer of the wicked and liberator of the world from its enemies;<BR> (Jayadeva, while referring to the several <i>avatāras</i> of Viṣṇu, thus<BR> refers to the last or <i>Kalki</i> avatāra:− म्लेच्छनिवहनिधने कलयसि<BR> करवालं धूमकेतुमिव किमपि करालम् । केशवधृतकल्किशरीरं जय जगदीश<BR> हरे ॥ Gīt. 1. 10.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्किपुराणम्
कल्किः + -पुराणम् N. of a Purāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्किन्
कल्किन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Foul, turbid, dirty.<BR>—2 Wicked. ━<i>m.</i> see कल्कि above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्प|कल्पः
कल्प <i>a.</i> [कॢप्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Practicable, feasible, possible,<BR>—2 Proper, fit, right.<BR>—3 Strong, vigorous; चरन्तं ब्राह्मणं कञ्चित्कल्पचित्तमनामयम् Mb. 12. 179. 3.<BR>—4 Able, competent (with a gen., loc.; inf. or at the end of comp.); धर्मस्य,<BR> यशसः, कल्पः Bhāg. able to do his duty &c.; स्वक्रियायामकल्पः<BR> <i>ibid.</i> not competent to do oneʼs duty; अकल्प एषामधिरोढुमञ्जसा<BR> पदम् <i>ibid.</i>, so स्वभरणाकल्प &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पः|कल्प
कल्प + .{@-ल्पः@}<BR>—1 A sacred precept or rule, law, ordinance.<BR>—2 A prescribed rule, a prescribed alternative, optional rule; प्रभुः<BR> प्रथमकल्पस्य योऽनुकल्पेन वर्तते Ms. 11. 30 ‘able to follow the prescribed rule to be observed in preference to all others’<BR>; प्रथमः<BR> कल्पः M. 1; cf. also Pratimā 4, and Abhiṣeka. 6 and Ś. 4.<BR> a very good (or best) alternative; एष वै प्रथमः कल्पः प्रदाने हव्यकव्ययोः Ms. 3. 147.<BR>—3 (Hence) A proposal, suggestion, resolve, determination; एष मे प्रथमः<BR> कल्पः Rām. 2. 52. 63; उदारः कल्पः Ś. 7.<BR>—4 Manner of acting, procedure, form, way, method (in religious rites);<BR> श्रूयते हि पुराकल्पे Mb. 6. 43. 23; क्षात्रेण कल्पेनोपनीय U. 2;<BR> कल्पवित्कल्पयामास वन्यामेवास्य संविधाम् R. 1. 94; Ms. 7. 185.<BR>—5 End of the world, universal destruction.<BR>—6 A day of Brahmā or 1,000 Yugas, being a period of 432 million years<BR> of mortals and measuring the duration of the world; cf. Bhāg. 3. 11;<BR> श्रीश्वेतवाराहकल्पे [the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">Page0548-1</a>]<BR> one in which we now live]; कल्पं स्थितं तनुभृतां तनुभिस्ततः किम्<BR> Śānti. 4. 2. Hence काल्पिक means ‘born in the primeval age’ Bu. C. 2. 48.<BR>—7 Medical treatment of the sick.<BR>—8 One of the six Vedāṅgas, <i>i. e.</i> that which lays down the ritual<BR> and prescribes rules for ceremonial and sacrificial acts; शिक्षा कल्पो<BR> व्याकरणम् Muṇḍ. 1. 1. 5 see under वेदाङ्ग.<BR>—9 A termination added to nouns and adjectives in the sense of ‘a little less than’<BR>, ‘almost like’, ‘nearly equal to’, P. V. 3. 67 [denoting similarity<BR> with a degree of inferiority]; कुमारकल्पं सुषुवे कुमारम् R. 5. 36;<BR> उपपन्नमेतदस्मिन्नृषिकल्पे राजनि Ś. 2; प्रभातकल्पा शशिनेव<BR> शर्वरी R. 3. 2; so मृतकल्पः, प्रतिपन्नकल्पः &c.<BR>—10 The doctrine of poisons and antidotes.<BR>—11 One of the trees of paradise; cf. कल्पद्रुम.<BR>—12 Vigour, strength; लौकिके समयाचारे कृतकल्पो विशारदः Rām. 2. 1. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पा
कल्प + .{@-ल्पा, -ल्पम्@} A kind of intoxicating liquor.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कल्पान्तः, कल्पादिः, कल्पोपनिषद्, कल्पकारः, कल्पक्षयः, कल्पतरुः, कल्पद्रुमः, कल्पपादपः, कल्पवृक्षः, कल्पनृत्यम्, कल्पपालः, कल्पलता, कल्पलतिका, कल्पवल्ली, कल्पविद्, कल्पस्थानम्, कल्पसूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पम्
कल्प + .{@-ल्पा, -ल्पम्@} A kind of intoxicating liquor.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कल्पान्तः, कल्पादिः, कल्पोपनिषद्, कल्पकारः, कल्पक्षयः, कल्पतरुः, कल्पद्रुमः, कल्पपादपः, कल्पवृक्षः, कल्पनृत्यम्, कल्पपालः, कल्पलता, कल्पलतिका, कल्पवल्ली, कल्पविद्, कल्पस्थानम्, कल्पसूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0547-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पान्तः|कल्पान्त|कल्पांत
कल्प + -अन्तः end of the world, universal destruction; कल्पान्तेष्वपि<BR> न प्रयाति निधनं विद्याख्यमन्तर्धनम् Bh. 2. 16. कल्पान्तकूरकेलिः<BR> क्रतुकदनकरः कुन्दकर्पूरकान्तिः Udb. ˚स्थायिन् <i>a.</i> lasting<BR> to the end of a कल्प; शरीरं क्षणविध्वंसि कल्पान्तस्थायिनो गुणाः H. 1. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पादिः|कल्पादि
कल्प + -आदिः renovation of all things in the creation; कल्पक्षये पुनस्तानि<BR> कल्पादौ विसृजाम्यहम् Bg. 9. 7;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पोपनिषद्
कल्प + -उपनिषद् pharmacology; Caraka. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पकारः|कल्पकार
कल्प + -कारः<BR>—1 author of Kalpasūtra, q. v.<BR>—2 a barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पक्षयः|कल्पक्षय
कल्प + -क्षयः end of the world, universal destruction; <i>e. g.</i> कल्पक्षये<BR> पुनस्तानि Bg. 9. 7. पुरा कल्पक्षये वृत्ते जातं जलमयं जगत् Ks. 2. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पतरुः|कल्पतरु
कल्प + -तरुः, -द्रुमः, -पादपः, -वृक्षः<BR>—1 one of the trees of heaven or Indraʼs paradise, fabled to fulfill all<BR> desires; आसीत्कल्पतरुच्छायामाश्रिता सुरभिः पथि R. 1. 75, 17. 26;<BR> Ku. 2. 39, 6. 41.<BR>—2 a tree supposed to grant all desires; ‘wish-yielding tree’; नाबुद्ध<BR> कल्पद्रुमतां विहाय जातं तमात्मन्यसिपत्रवृक्षम् R. 14. 48; मृषा<BR> न चक्रेऽल्पितकल्पपादपः N. 1. 15.<BR>—3 any productive or bountiful source; निगमकल्पतरोर्गलितं फलम्<BR> Bhāg. 1. 1. 3.<BR>—4 (fig.) a very generous person; सकलार्थिसार्थकल्पद्रुमः Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पद्रुमः|कल्पद्रुम
कल्प + -तरुः, -द्रुमः, -पादपः, -वृक्षः<BR>—1 one of the trees of heaven or Indraʼs paradise, fabled to fulfill all<BR> desires; आसीत्कल्पतरुच्छायामाश्रिता सुरभिः पथि R. 1. 75, 17. 26;<BR> Ku. 2. 39, 6. 41.<BR>—2 a tree supposed to grant all desires; ‘wish-yielding tree’; नाबुद्ध<BR> कल्पद्रुमतां विहाय जातं तमात्मन्यसिपत्रवृक्षम् R. 14. 48; मृषा<BR> न चक्रेऽल्पितकल्पपादपः N. 1. 15.<BR>—3 any productive or bountiful source; निगमकल्पतरोर्गलितं फलम्<BR> Bhāg. 1. 1. 3.<BR>—4 (fig.) a very generous person; सकलार्थिसार्थकल्पद्रुमः Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पपादपः|कल्पपादप
कल्प + -तरुः, -द्रुमः, -पादपः, -वृक्षः<BR>—1 one of the trees of heaven or Indraʼs paradise, fabled to fulfill all<BR> desires; आसीत्कल्पतरुच्छायामाश्रिता सुरभिः पथि R. 1. 75, 17. 26;<BR> Ku. 2. 39, 6. 41.<BR>—2 a tree supposed to grant all desires; ‘wish-yielding tree’; नाबुद्ध<BR> कल्पद्रुमतां विहाय जातं तमात्मन्यसिपत्रवृक्षम् R. 14. 48; मृषा<BR> न चक्रेऽल्पितकल्पपादपः N. 1. 15.<BR>—3 any productive or bountiful source; निगमकल्पतरोर्गलितं फलम्<BR> Bhāg. 1. 1. 3.<BR>—4 (fig.) a very generous person; सकलार्थिसार्थकल्पद्रुमः Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पवृक्षः|कल्पवृक्ष
कल्प + -तरुः, -द्रुमः, -पादपः, -वृक्षः<BR>—1 one of the trees of heaven or Indraʼs paradise, fabled to fulfill all<BR> desires; आसीत्कल्पतरुच्छायामाश्रिता सुरभिः पथि R. 1. 75, 17. 26;<BR> Ku. 2. 39, 6. 41.<BR>—2 a tree supposed to grant all desires; ‘wish-yielding tree’; नाबुद्ध<BR> कल्पद्रुमतां विहाय जातं तमात्मन्यसिपत्रवृक्षम् R. 14. 48; मृषा<BR> न चक्रेऽल्पितकल्पपादपः N. 1. 15.<BR>—3 any productive or bountiful source; निगमकल्पतरोर्गलितं फलम्<BR> Bhāg. 1. 1. 3.<BR>—4 (fig.) a very generous person; सकलार्थिसार्थकल्पद्रुमः Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पनृत्यम्
कल्प + -नृत्यम् a particular kind of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पपालः|कल्पपाल
कल्प + -पालः<BR>—1 a protector of order. —2 a seller of spirituous liquors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पलता
कल्प + -लता, -लतिका —1 a creeper of Indraʼs paradise; Bh. 1. 90.<BR>—2 a creeper supposed to grant all desires; नानाफलैः फलति कल्पलतेव<BR> भूमिः Bh. 2. 46; cf. कल्पतरु above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पलतिका
कल्प + -लता, -लतिका —1 a creeper of Indraʼs paradise; Bh. 1. 90.<BR>—2 a creeper supposed to grant all desires; नानाफलैः फलति कल्पलतेव<BR> भूमिः Bh. 2. 46; cf. कल्पतरु above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पवल्ली
कल्प + -वल्ली see कल्पलता; Ks. 1. 66; कल्पवल्लीगृहेषु 52, 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पविद्
कल्प + -विद् <i>a.</i> conversant with sacred precepts; कल्पवित्कल्पयामास<BR> वन्यामेवास्य संविधाम् R. 1. 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पस्थानम्
कल्प + -स्थानम्<BR>—1 the art of preparing drugs; Caraka. 7.<BR>—2 the science of poisons and antidotes; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पसूत्रम्
कल्प + -सूत्रम् a manual of ritual in the form of Sūtras. Mb. 14. 54. 9.<BR> N. of a sacred Jaina book written by भद्रबाहु sketching the life<BR> of महावीर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पकः|कल्पक
कल्पकः [कॣप्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A rite.<BR>—2 A barber, Kau. A. 1. 12.<BR>—3 See कल्पवृक्षः; कल्पकप्रसवोदयः Viś. Guṇā. 50.<BR>—4 A kind of tree, Curcuma (Mar. कचोरा). ━<i>a.</i> conforming to a<BR> settled rule or standard; याजयित्वाश्वमेधैस्तं त्रिभिरुत्तमकल्पकैः<BR> Bhāg. 1. 8. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पनम्
कल्पनम् [कॢप्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Forming, fashioning, arranging.<BR>—2 Performing, doing, effecting.<BR>—3 Clipping, cutting.<BR>—4 Fixing.<BR>—5 Anything placed upon another for decoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पना
कल्पनम् + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 Fixing, settlement; अनेकपितृकाणां तु पितृतो भागकल्पना Y. 2. 120, 247;<BR> Ms. 9. 116.<BR>—2 Making, performing, doing.<BR>—3 Forming, arranging; विषमासु च कल्पनासु Mk. 3. 14; केश˚ Mk. 4.<BR>—4 Decorating, ornamenting.<BR>—5 Composition.<BR>—6 Invention.<BR>—7 Imagination, thought; कल्पनापोढः Sk. P. II. 1. 38 = कल्पनाया अपोढः.<BR>—8 An idea, fancy or image (conceived in the mind); Śānti. 2. 8.<BR>—9 Fabrication.<BR>—10 Forgery.<BR>—11 A contrivance, device.<BR>—12 (In Mīm. phil.) = अर्थापत्ति q. v.<BR>—13 Decorating an elephant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कल्पनशक्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पनशक्तिः
कल्पनम् + -शक्तिः <i>f.</i> the power of forming ideas; MW.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पनी
कल्पनी Scissors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पनीय
कल्पनीय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be made, fashioned or contrived.<BR>—2 Feasible.<BR>—3 To be substituted or supplied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पिक
कल्पिक <i>a.</i> Fit, proper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पित|कल्पितः
कल्पित <i>a.</i> Arranged, made, fashioned, formed; उत्सृज्य कुसुमशयनं<BR> नलिनीदलकल्पितस्तनावरणम् Ś. 3. 21; see कॢप् caus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्पितः|कल्पित
कल्पित + .{@-तः@} An elephant armed or caparisoned for war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्मन्
कल्मन् = कर्मन् q. v. विपरीतं तु यत्कर्म तत्कल्म कवयो<BR> विदुः Mbh. on P. I. 4. 51; also अपरिसमाप्तं कर्म कल्म Mbh. on P. I. 4. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्मलिः|कल्मलि
कल्मलिः Ved. Splendour; Av. 15. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्मलीकम्
कल्मलीकम् Brightness, lustre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्मष|कल्मषं|कल्मषः
कल्मष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sinful, wicked.<BR>—2 Foul, dirty; व्यरोचत तदा तोयं निर्मलं गतकल्मषम् Rām. 1. 43. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्मषः|कल्मष|कल्मषं
कल्मष + .{@-षः, -षम्@}<BR>—1 Stain, dirt, dregs.<BR>—2 The hand below the wrist. —3 Sin; स हि गगनविहारी कल्मषध्वंसकारी<BR> H. 1. 19; Bg. 4. 30, 5. 16; Ms. 4. 260, 12. 18, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्मषम्
कल्मष + .{@-षः, -षम्@}<BR>—1 Stain, dirt, dregs.<BR>—2 The hand below the wrist. —3 Sin; स हि गगनविहारी कल्मषध्वंसकारी<BR> H. 1. 19; Bg. 4. 30, 5. 16; Ms. 4. 260, 12. 18, 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्मषः|कल्मष|कल्मषं
कल्मष + .{@-षः@} Hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्माष|कल्माषः
कल्माष <i>a.</i> (-षी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Variegated, spotted; आजुहाव ततः प्रीतः कल्माषीं धूतकल्मषाम्<BR> Rām. 1. 52. 20.<BR>—2 Black and white; अश्वांस्तित्तिरकल्माषान् Mb. 12. 124. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्माषः|कल्माष
कल्माष + .{@-षः@}<BR>—1 The variegated colour.<BR>—2 A mixture of black and white. शुक्लगुणः शुक्लः । कृष्णगुणः कृष्णः ।<BR> य इदानीमुभयगुणः स तृतीयामाख्यां लभते कल्माष इति वा सारङ्ग इति<BR> वा Mbh. on P. I. 2. 31.<BR>—3 A demon, goblin.<BR>—4 The black colour.<BR>—5 A form of Agni.<BR>—6 A kind of fragrant rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्माषी
कल्माष + .{@-षी@}<BR>—1 N. of the river Yamunā; अभितः सोऽथ कल्माषीं गङ्गाकूले परिभ्रमन् Mb. 1. 167. 5.<BR>—2 The spotted cow of Jamadagni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्माषम्
कल्माष + .{@-षम्@} Stain.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कल्माषकण्ठः, कल्माषपादः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्माषकण्ठः|कल्माषकण्ठ|कल्माषकंठ
कल्माष + -कण्ठः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्माषपादः|कल्माषपाद
कल्माष + -पादः N. of a king (सौदास), belonging to the solar dynasty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्माषता
कल्माषता Spottedness; राक्षसं भावमापन्नः पादे कल्माषतां गतः<BR> Bhāg. 9. 9. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्य|कल्यं|कल्यः
कल्य <i>a.</i> [कलयति चेष्टामत्र, कल्-यक्; कल् कर्मणि यत्, कलासु<BR> साधु कला-यत् वा Tv.]<BR>—1 Sound, free from sickness, healthy; सर्वः कल्ये वयसि यतते लब्धुमर्थान्कुटुम्बी V. 3. 1;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">Page0549-1</a>]<BR> Y. 1. 28; यावदेव भवेत्कल्यस्तावच्छ्रेयः समाचरेत् Mb.<BR>—2 Ready, prepared; कथयस्व कथामेतां कल्याः स्मः श्रवणे तव Mb. 1. 5. 3.<BR>—3 Clever.<BR>—4 Agreeable, auspicious (as a discourse); स स्नुषामब्रवीत्काले कल्यवादी<BR> महातपाः Mb. 11. 14. 6.<BR>—5 Deaf and dumb.<BR>—6 Instructive.<BR>—7 Perfect in arts; कल्यो निरामये सज्जे दक्षे साधौ कलासु च Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्यम्
कल्य + .{@-ल्यम्@}<BR>—1 Dawn, day-break; य इदं कल्य उत्थाय महापुरुषलक्षणम् Bhāg. 12. 11. 26.<BR>—2 To-morrow.<BR>—3 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—4 Congratulation, good wishes.<BR>—5 Good news.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्यः|कल्य|कल्यं
कल्य + .{@-ल्यः@}<BR>—1 means; सामदानादिभिः कल्यैः (आनय) Rām. 4. 37. 9.<BR>—2 Hurling, casting (of missiles); Mb. 7. 195. 30.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कल्याशः, कल्यजग्धिः, कल्यपालः, कल्यपालकः, कल्यवर्तः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0548-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याशः|कल्याश
कल्य + -आशः, -जग्धिः <i>f.</i> the morning meal, breakfast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्यजग्धिः|कल्यजग्धि
कल्य + -आशः, -जग्धिः <i>f.</i> the morning meal, breakfast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्यपालः|कल्यपाल
कल्य + -पालः, -पालकः a distiller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्यपालकः|कल्यपालक
कल्य + -पालः, -पालकः a distiller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्यवर्तः|कल्यवर्त|कल्यवर्त्त|कल्यवर्त्तः
कल्य + -वर्तः morning meal, breakfast. भोः सुखं न आमयपरिभूतमकल्यवर्तं<BR> च Ś. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्यवर्तम्
कल्य + -वर्तः + ({@-तम्@}) (hence) anything light, trivial, or unimportant;<BR> a trifle; ननु कल्यवर्तमेतत् Mk. 2 but a trifle; स्त्रीकल्यवर्तस्य<BR> कारणेन 4; स इदानीमर्थकल्यवर्तस्य कारणादिदमकार्यं करोति 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्या
कल्या<BR>—1 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—2 N. of a plant (हरीतकी).<BR>—3 Congratulation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कल्यापालः, कल्यापालकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्यापालः|कल्यापाल
कल्या + -पालः, -पालकः a distiller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्यापालकः|कल्यापालक
कल्या + -पालः, -पालकः a distiller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याण|कल्याणं|कल्याणः
कल्याण <i>a.</i> (-णा or -णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [कल्ये प्रातः अण्यते शब्द्यते, अण्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Blessed, happy, lucky, fortunate; त्वमेव कल्याणि तयोस्तृतीया R. 6. 29;<BR> Me. 111.<BR>—2 Beautiful, agreeable, lovely.<BR>—3 Excellent, illustrious; यत् कल्याणं जिघ्रति तदात्माने Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 3;<BR> Mu. 4. 4.<BR>—4 Auspicious, salutary, propitious, good; U. 2. 2; कल्याणानां त्वमसि<BR> महतां भाजनं विश्वमूर्ते Māl. 1. 3.<BR>—5 True, authentic; कल्याणी बत गाथेयम् Rām. 5. 34. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणम्
कल्याण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Good fortune, happiness, good, prosperity; कल्याणं कुरुतां जनस्य<BR> भगवांश्चन्द्रार्धचूडामणिः H. 1. 185; तद्रक्ष कल्याणपरंपराणां<BR> भोक्तारमूर्जस्वलमात्मदेहम् R. 2. 50, 17. 11; Ms. 3. 60; so ˚अभिनिवेशी K. 104.<BR>—2 Virtue.<BR>—3 Festival.<BR>—4 Gold.<BR>—5 Heaven.<BR>—6 A class of five-storeyed buildings; Māna. 23. 30. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणः|कल्याण|कल्याणं
कल्याण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 An elephant in the fourth decade. Mātaṅga L. 5. 14, 6. 6, 9. 26.<BR>—2 A particular Rāga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणी
कल्याण + .{@-णी@}<BR>—1 A cow.<BR>—2 Holy or sacred cow; उपस्थितेयं कल्याणी नाम्नि कीर्तित एव यत् R. 1. 87.<BR>—3 A young cow, heifer; U. 4.<BR>—4 A Particular Rāgiṇī.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कल्याणकृत्, कल्याणधर्मन्, कल्याणपञ्चकः, कल्याणबीजः, कल्याणमल्लः, कल्याणयोगः, कल्याणवचनम्, कल्याणवाचनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणकृत्
कल्याण + -कृत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 doing good, beneficial, good; न हि कल्याणकृत्कश्चिद् दुर्गतिं तात<BR> गच्छति Bg. 6. 40.<BR>—2 propitious, lucky (also कल्याणचारः).<BR>—3 virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणधर्मन्|कल्याणधर्म्मन्
कल्याण + -धर्मन् <i>a.</i> virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणपञ्चकः
कल्याण + -पञ्चकः a horse^1 with white feet and white mouth, a kind<BR> of horse; यस्य पादाः सिताः सर्वे तथा वक्त्रे च मध्यमः । कल्याणपञ्चकः<BR> प्रोक्तः सर्वकल्याणकारकः ॥ Śālihotra of भोज. 7.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260408. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/140. note: Not adjective, masculine noun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणबीजः|कल्याणबीज
कल्याण + -बीजः^1 a kind of pulse (Mar. मसुरा).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260408. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/140. note: Gender correction, masculine per MW,PW,SKD.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणमल्लः|कल्याणमल्ल
कल्याण + -मल्लः N. of the author of Anaṅgaraṅga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणयोगः|कल्याणयोग
कल्याण + -योगः a kind^1 of astrological योग.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260408. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/140. note: Not adjective, masculine noun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणवचनम्
कल्याण + -वचनम् a friendly speech, good wishes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणवाचनम्
कल्याण + -वाचनम् Giving of blessings after the completion of an auspicious कर्म.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणक
कल्याणक <i>a.</i> (-णिका <i>f.</i>) Auspicious, prosperous, blessed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणिका
कल्याणक + .{@-णिका@} Red arsenic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणिन्
कल्याणिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Happy, prosperous.<BR>—2 Lucky, fortunate, blessed.<BR>—3 Propitious, auspicious.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-2" target="_blank">Page0549-2</a>]<BR> कल्याणिनी भवतु मौक्तिकशुक्तिमाला Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्याणिनी
कल्याणिन् + .({@-नी@}) A kind of plant (Mar. रानौडीद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्ल्
कल्ल् €1 Ā. (कल्लते, कल्लित)<BR>—1 To sound indistinctly.<BR>—2 To sound.<BR>—3 To be mute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

