कल्लता
कल्ल + {@˚ता, -त्वम्@}<BR>—1 Deafness.<BR>—2 Indistinctness of articulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्लता
