कल्लोल|कल्लोलः
कल्लोल <i>a.</i> Inimical, hostile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्लोलः|कल्लोल
कल्लोल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A large wave, billow; आयुः कल्लोललोलम् Bh. 3. 82; कल्लोलमालाकुलम् Bv. 1. 59.<BR>—2 An enemy.<BR>—3 Joy, happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कल्लोलिनी
कल्लोलिनी A river; स्वर्लोककल्लोलिनि त्वं पापं तिरयाधुना मम<BR> भवव्यालावलीढात्मनः G. L. 50; so विपुलपुलिनाः कल्लोलिन्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कह्लणः|कह्लण
