कह्लारम्
कह्लारम्^1 A white water-lily.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170203. note: By alph. order; although kalhAram is a variant spelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0549-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कव्
