कषाय|कषायः
कषाय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Astringent, Ś. 2.<BR>—2 Fragrant, स्फुटितकमलामोदमैत्रीकषायः Me. 31; U. 2. 21; Mv. 5. 41.<BR>—3 Red, dark-red; चूताङ्कुरास्वादकषायकण्ठः Ku. 3. 32.<BR>—4 (Hence) Sweet-sounding, Māl. 7; cf. also सगद्गदं बाष्पकषायकण्ठः Bu. C. 1. 68.<BR>—5 Brown.<BR>—6 Improper, dirty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषायः|कषाय
कषाय + .{@-यः, -यम्@}<BR>—1 Astringent flavour or taste (one of the six <i>rasas</i>): see कटु;<BR> यो वक्त्रं परिशोषयति जिह्वां स्तम्भयति कण्ठं बध्नाति हृदयं कषति<BR> पीडयति च स कषायः Suśr. cf. also ‘बध्नातीव च यः कण्ठं कषायः स विकास्यपि’ । <i>Ibid.</i><BR>—2 The red colour.<BR>—3 A decoction with one part of a drug mixed with four, eight, or sixteen<BR> parts of water (the whole being boiled down until one quarter is left); Ms. 11. 153.<BR>—4 Plastering, smearing; कर्णार्पितो लोध्रकषायरूक्षे Ku. 7. 17; anointing.<BR>—5 Perfuming the body with unguents; शिरोरुहैः स्नानकषायवासितैः Ṛs. 1. 4.<BR>—6 Gum, resin, extract or exudation from a tree.<BR>—7 Dirt, uncleanness.<BR>—8 Dulness, stupidity; विगतभयकषायलोभमोहः Mb. 12. 179. 26.<BR>—9 Attachment to worldly objects; Ch. Up. 7. 26. 2;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">Page0551-2</a>]<BR> भक्त्या निर्मथिताशेषकषायधिषणोऽर्जुनः Bhāg. 1. 15. 29.<BR>—10 Decay, ruin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषायम्
कषाय + .{@-यः, -यम्@}<BR>—1 Astringent flavour or taste (one of the six <i>rasas</i>): see कटु;<BR> यो वक्त्रं परिशोषयति जिह्वां स्तम्भयति कण्ठं बध्नाति हृदयं कषति<BR> पीडयति च स कषायः Suśr. cf. also ‘बध्नातीव च यः कण्ठं कषायः स विकास्यपि’ । <i>Ibid.</i><BR>—2 The red colour.<BR>—3 A decoction with one part of a drug mixed with four, eight, or sixteen<BR> parts of water (the whole being boiled down until one quarter is left); Ms. 11. 153.<BR>—4 Plastering, smearing; कर्णार्पितो लोध्रकषायरूक्षे Ku. 7. 17; anointing.<BR>—5 Perfuming the body with unguents; शिरोरुहैः स्नानकषायवासितैः Ṛs. 1. 4.<BR>—6 Gum, resin, extract or exudation from a tree.<BR>—7 Dirt, uncleanness.<BR>—8 Dulness, stupidity; विगतभयकषायलोभमोहः Mb. 12. 179. 26.<BR>—9 Attachment to worldly objects; Ch. Up. 7. 26. 2;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">Page0551-2</a>]<BR> भक्त्या निर्मथिताशेषकषायधिषणोऽर्जुनः Bhāg. 1. 15. 29.<BR>—10 Decay, ruin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषायः|कषाय
कषाय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 Passion, emotion.<BR>—2 Kaliyuga.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कषायकृत्, कषायवसनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषायकृत्
कषाय + -कृत् <i>m.</i> the लोध्र tree (Symplocos racemosa)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषायवसनम्
कषाय + -वसनम् The yellowish-red garment of monks, mendicants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषायित
कषायित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tinged, reddened, coloured; अमुनैव कषायितस्तनी Ku. 4. 34; Śi. 7. 11.<BR>—2 Affected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषायिन्
कषायिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Yielding a resinous exudation, astringent<BR>—2 Dyed of a red colour.<BR>—3 Worldly-minded. ━<i>m.</i> N. of several plants:− खर्जूर, शाल &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषिका
कषिका A bird in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कषीका
कषीका A kind of bird; Uṇ. 4. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

