कसेरुका
कषे(से)रुका The back-bone, the spine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कष्कषः|कष्कष
कष्कषः A kind of poisonous insect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कष्ट|कष्टं|कष्टः
कष्ट <i>a.</i> [कष्-क्त]<BR>—1 Bad, evil, ill, wrong; रामहस्तमनुप्राप्य कष्टात् कष्टतरं गता<BR> R. 15. 43 ‘gone from bad to worse’, (reduced to a wretched condition).<BR>—2 Painful, grievous; मोहादभूत्कष्टतरः प्रबोधः R. 14. 56; कष्टोऽयं<BR> खलु भृत्यभावः Ratn. 1 full of cares; Ms. 7. 50; Māl. 9. 37; Y. 3. 29;<BR> कष्टा वृत्तिः पराधीना कष्टो वासो निराश्रयः । निर्धनो व्यवसायश्च<BR> सर्वकष्टा दरिद्रता ॥ Cāṇ. 59<BR>—3 Difficult; स्त्रीषु कष्टोऽधिकारः V. 3. 1; U. 7.<BR>—4 Hard to subdue (as an enemy); स हि कष्टतरो रिपुः Ms. 7. 186;<BR> कष्टमाहुररिं बुधाः 210.<BR>—5 Mischievous, hurtful, injurious; कष्टोऽनिलो हरति लम्पट एष नीवीम्<BR> Bhāg. 5. 2. 14.<BR>—6 Boding evil.<BR>—7 Sorrowful, miserable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कष्टम्
कष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@}<BR>—1 Evil, difficulty, misery, suffering, hardship, pain; कष्टं खल्वनपत्यता<BR> Ś. 6; धिगर्थाः कष्टसंश्रयाः Pt. 1. 163 v. l.<BR>—2 Sin, wickedness.<BR>—3 Difficulty, effort; कष्टेन somehow or other.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कष्टम्
कष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@} <i>ind.</i> Alas! Ah! हा धिक् कष्टम्; हा कष्टं जरयाभिभूतपुरुषः<BR> पुत्रैरवज्ञायते Pt. 4. 78.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कष्टागत, कष्टकर, कष्टकारः, कष्टकारकः, कष्टतपस्, कष्टभागिनेयः, कष्टमातुलः, कष्टसंश्रय, कष्टसाध्य, कष्टस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

