कष्टकारकः|कष्टकारक
कष्ट + -कारः, -कारकः the world (as the scene of miseries).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

