काचः + -मलम्, -लवणम्, -संभवम्, -सौवर्चलम् black salt or soda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काचलवणम्
काचः + -मलम्, -लवणम्, -संभवम्, -सौवर्चलम् black salt or soda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

