काचस्थाली
काचः + -स्थाली N. of a tree (Mar. सागरगोटी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काचकः|काचक
काचकः<BR>—1 A glass, stone.<BR>—2 Alkaline ashes &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काचित|काचितं
काचित <i>a.</i> Suspended in a loop or by a swing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काचन|काचनं
काचन, काचनकम् A string or tape which ties a parcel or<BR> bundle of papers or the leaves of a manuscript; cf. कचेल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काचनकम्
काचन, काचनकम् A string or tape which ties a parcel or<BR> bundle of papers or the leaves of a manuscript; cf. कचेल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काचनकिन्
