काचा
काचा A condition of having crystalline colour (especially of the<BR> teeth of the horses) दन्तेषु व्यञ्जनं यद्यत् तेन ज्ञेयो व्यःकमः ।<BR> कालिका हरिणी शुक्ला काचा मक्षिकया सह ॥ Śālihotra of Bhoja, Appendix II, 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काचिघः|काचिघ
काचिघः<BR>—1 A rat, mouse.<BR>—2 Gold.<BR>—3 A vegetable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काचिमः|काचिम
काचिमः A sacred tree (growing near a temple.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काचूकः|काचूक
काचूकः<BR>—1 A cock.<BR>—2 The Cakravāka bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काच्छप
काच्छप <i>a.</i> Relating or belonging to a tortoise; कृत्वा वपुः<BR> काच्छपमद्भुतं महत् Bhāg. 8. 7. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काच्छिक
काच्छिक <i>a.</i> A preparer of perfumes; Bṛ. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काजम्
काजम् A wooden hammer; प्लवे कठिनकाजं च रामश्चक्रे समाहितः<BR> Rām. 2. 55. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काजलम्
काजलम्<BR>—1 A little water.<BR>—2 Bad water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काञ्च्|कांच्
काञ्च् €1 Ā. (काञ्चते, काञ्चित)<BR>—1 To shine.<BR>—2 To bind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काञ्चन|कांचन|काञ्चनं|काञ्चनः
काञ्चन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) [काञ्च्-ल्युट्] Golden, made<BR> of gold; तन्मध्ये च स्फटिकफलका काञ्चनी वासयष्टिः Me. 81; काञ्चनं<BR> वलयम् Ś. 6. 8; Ms. 5. 112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काञ्चनम्
काञ्चन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Gold; समलोष्टाश्मकाञ्चनः Bg. 14. 24. (ग्राह्यम्) अमेध्यादपि<BR> काञ्चनम् Ms. 2. 239.<BR>—2 Lustre, brilliancy.<BR>—3 Property, wealth, money.<BR>—4 The filament of a lotus.<BR>—5 Yellow orpiment.<BR>—6 A binding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

काञ्चनः|काञ्चन|कांचन|काञ्चनं
