काञ्चनभूः
काञ्चन + -भूः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 golden (yellow) soil.<BR>—2 gold-dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

