कार्तिकः|कार्तिक|कार्त्तिक|कार्त्तिकः
कार्तिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 N. of the month in which the full moon is near the कृत्तिका or Pleiades<BR> (corresponding to October-November).<BR>—2 An epithet of Skanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0563-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कार्तिकी|कार्त्तिकी
कार्तिक + .{@-की@} The full moon day in the month of Kārtika (Mar. त्रिपुरी पौर्णिमा).<BR> कार्तिक्याः प्रभृति आग्रहायणी मासे Mbh. on P. II. 3. 28.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कार्तिकोत्सवः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0563-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कार्तिकोत्सवः
