कार्पटः [कर्पट-अण्]<BR>—1 A petitioner, a suitor, a candidate.<BR>—2 A rag.<BR>—3 Lac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0563-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

