कार्पण्यम्
कार्पण्यम्<BR>—1 Poverty, indigence, wretchedness; व्यक्तकार्पण्या Dk.<BR>—2 Compassion; pity; कार्पण्यात्स्कन्धेनोद्वहति Bhāg. 5. 8. 13.<BR>—3 Niggardliness, imbecility; कार्पण्यदोषोपहतस्वभावः Bg. 2. 7.<BR>—4 Levity, lightness of spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0563-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कार्पाणम्
