काल + -अनुसारिः, -अनुसारिन्, -अनुसारिवा, -अनुसार्यः, -अनुसार्यकः + .({@-र्यम्@})<BR>—1 a yellow fragrant wood (पीतचन्दन).<BR>—2 Sissoo wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

