काल + -अनुसारिः, -अनुसारिन्, -अनुसारिवा, -अनुसार्यः, -अनुसार्यकः benzoin or benjamin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

