कालान्तकः|कालान्तक|कालांतक
काल + -अन्तकः time, regarded as the god of death, and the destroyer<BR> of every thing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालान्तरम्
काल + -अन्तरम्<BR>—1 an interval.<BR>—2 a period of time.<BR>—3 another time or opportunity. ˚आवृत <i>a.</i> hidden or concealed<BR> in the womb of time. ˚क्षम <i>a.</i> able to bear delay; अकालक्षमा<BR> देव्याः शरीरावस्था K. 263; Ś. 4. ˚प्रेक्षिन् Pt. 3. 172. ˚विषः<BR> an animal venomous only when enraged, as a rat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालाभ्रः|कालाभ्र
काल + -अभ्रः a dark watery cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालायनम्
काल + -अयनम् See कालचक्र Bhāg. 5. 22. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालावधिः|कालावधि
काल + -अवधिः appointed time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालावबोधः
काल + -अवबोधः knowledge of time and circumstances; Māl. 3. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालाशुद्धिः|कालाशुद्धि
काल + -अशुद्धिः <i>f.</i><BR> {@-अशौचम्@} period of mourning, ceremonial impurity caused by the<BR> birth of a child or death of a relation in the family; see अशौच.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालाष्टकम्
काल + -अष्टकम्<BR>—1 first to eighth days of the dark half of the month आषाढ (festival<BR> period of कालभैरव)<BR>—2 a stotra of कालभैरव by Śaṅkarācārya.^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260506. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/209.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालाकृष्ट
काल + -आकृष्ट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 led to death.<BR>—2 produced or brought by time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालात्मक
काल + -आत्मक <i>a.</i> depending on time or destiny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालात्मन्
काल + -आत्मन् <i>m.</i> the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालादिकः|कालादिक
काल + -आदिकः The month चैत्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालाम्रः|कालाम्र
काल + -आम्रः<BR>—1 a mango-kind; कालाम्ररसपीतास्ते नित्यं संस्थितयौवनाः Mb. 6. 7. 18.<BR>—2 N. of a Dvīpa; Hariv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालायसम्
