काल + -कुष्ठः a myrrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालकूटः|कालकूट|कालकूटं
काल + -कूटः, -कूटम्<BR>——(<i>a</i>) a deadly poison; अहो बकी यं स्तनकालकूटम् अपाययत् Bhāg. 3. 2. 23;<BR> Ś. 6.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) the poison churned out of the ocean and drunk by Śiva; अद्यापि<BR> नोज्झति हरः किल कालकूटम् C. P. 50. कालकूटस्य जननीं तां स्तुवे<BR> वामलोचनाम् Vb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालकूटम्
काल + -कूटः, -कूटम्<BR>——(<i>a</i>) a deadly poison; अहो बकी यं स्तनकालकूटम् अपाययत् Bhāg. 3. 2. 23;<BR> Ś. 6.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) the poison churned out of the ocean and drunk by Śiva; अद्यापि<BR> नोज्झति हरः किल कालकूटम् C. P. 50. कालकूटस्य जननीं तां स्तुवे<BR> वामलोचनाम् Vb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालकूटकः|कालकूटक
काल + -कूटकः a poison; Mb. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालकृत्
काल + -कृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 the sun.<BR>—2 a peacock.<BR>—3 Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालकृत|कालकृतः
काल + -कृत<BR>—1 produced by time.<BR>—2 fixed, appointed.<BR>—3 lent or deposited,<BR>—4 done for a long time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालकृतः|कालकृत
काल + -कृत + ({@-तः@}) the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालक्रमः|कालक्रम
काल + -क्रमः lapse<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">Page0566-2</a>]<BR> of time, course of time; कालकमेण in course or process of time; Ku. 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालक्रिया
काल + -क्रिया<BR>—1 fixing a time. —2 death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालक्षेपः|कालक्षेप
काल + -क्षेपः —1 delay, loss of time; कालक्षेपं ककुभसुरभौ पर्वते<BR> पर्वते ते (उत्पश्यामि) Me. 22; मरणे कालक्षेपं मा कुरु Pt. 1.<BR>—2 passing the time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालखञ्जम्
