कालगङ्गा|कालगंगा
काल + -गङ्गा the river Yamunā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालग्रन्थिः|कालग्रन्थि|कालग्रंथि
काल + -ग्रन्थिः a year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालघातिन्
काल + -घातिन् <i>a.</i> killing by degrees or slowly (as a poison).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालचक्रम्
काल + -चक्रम्<BR>—1 the wheel of time (time being represented as a wheel always moving).<BR>—2 a cycle.<BR>—3 (hence fig.) the wheel of fortune, the vicissitudes of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालचक्रः|कालचक्र|कालचक्रं
काल + -चक्रम् + ({@-क्रः@})<BR> an epithet of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालचिह्नम्
काल + -चिह्नम् a symptom of approaching death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालचोदित
काल + -चोदित <i>a.</i> summoned by the angel of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालजोषकः|कालजोषक
काल + -जोषकः One who is satisfied with sparse food at the proper time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालज्येष्ठ
काल + -ज्येष्ठ^1 <i>a.</i> senior in years, grown up; U. 5. 12.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0566-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कालज्ञ|कालज्ञः
