कीदृश्, कीदृश (-शी <i>f.</i>), कीदृक्ष (-क्षी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Of what kind or sort, of what nature; तद्भोः कीदृगसौ<BR> विवेकविभवः कीदृक् प्रबोधोदयः Prab. 1; N. 1. 137.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

