कीरवर्णकः|कीरवर्णक|कीरवर्णकं|कीरवर्ण्णक
कीरः + -वर्णकः a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीरकः|कीरक
