कीरिः|कीरि
कीरिः Ved. Praise, hymn. कीरिश्चिद्धित्वा हवते Rv. 6. 37. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कीरिचोदन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीरिचोदन
कीरिः + -चोदन <i>a.</i> exciting the praiser; सखायं कीरिचोदनम् Rv. 6. 45. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीरिभारा
