कीर्ण|कीर्णः|कीर्ण्ण
कीर्ण <i>p. p.</i> [कॄ-क्त]<BR>—1 Strewn, spread, cast, scattered.<BR>—2 Covered, filled.<BR>—3 Placed, put.<BR>—4 Injured, hurt.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कीर्णवर्त्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्णवर्त्मन्
कीर्ण + -वर्त्मन् <i>a.</i> strewing the way; दर्भैरर्धावलीढैः श्रमविवृतमुखभ्रंशिभिः<BR> कीर्णवर्त्मा Ś. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्णिः|कीर्णि|कीर्ण्णि
