कीर्तिः|कीर्ति|कीर्त्ति|कीर्त्तिः
कीर्तिः <i>f.</i> [कॄत्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Fame, renown, glory; इह कीर्तिमवाप्नोति Ms. 2. 9; वंशस्य कर्तारमनन्तकीर्तिम्<BR> R. 2. 64; स्रोतोमूर्त्या भुवि परिणतां रन्तिदेवस्य कीर्तिम् Me. 47. For<BR> an interesting distinction between कीर्तिः and यशस् cf. खड्गादिप्रभवा<BR> कीर्तिर्विद्यादिप्रभवं यशः<BR>—2 Favour, approbation.<BR>—3 Dirt, mud.<BR>—4 Extension, expansion.<BR>—5 Light, lustre, splendour.<BR>—6 Sound.<BR>—7 Mention, speech, report.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कीर्तिभाज्, कीर्तिशेषः, कीर्तिस्तम्भः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्तिभाज्|कीर्त्तिभाज्
कीर्तिः + -भाज् <i>a.</i> famous, celebrated, renowned. ━(<i>m.</i>) an epithet<BR> of Droṇa, the military preceptor of the Kauravas and Pāṇḍavas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्तिशेषः|कीर्तिशेष|कीर्त्तिशेष|कीर्त्तिशेषः
कीर्तिः + -शेषः survival or remaining behind only in fame, leaving nothing<BR> behind but fame <i>i. e.</i> death; cf. नामशेष, आलेख्यशेष; सरसीव<BR> कीर्तिशेषं गतवति भुवि विक्रमादित्ये Vās.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्तिस्तम्भः|कीर्तिस्तम्भ
कीर्तिः + -स्तम्भः a column of fame; B. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्तित|कीर्त्तित|कीर्त्तितः
कीर्तित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Said, asserted.<BR>—2 Mentioned, told.<BR>—3 Known; notorious.<BR>—4 Praised, celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्तितव्य
कीर्तितव्य <i>a.</i> To be praised; श्रोतव्यः कीर्तितव्यश्च.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कील्
कील् €1 P.<BR>—1 To bind.<BR>—2 To pin. —3 To stake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलः|कील
कीलः [कील्-घञ्]<BR>—1 A wedge, a pin; कीलोत्पाटीव वानरः Pt. 1. 21.<BR>—2 A lance; कीलैः सुनिचिताः कृताः Mb. 3. 15. 15.<BR>—3 A post, pillar.<BR>—4 A weapon; सकीलकवचाः सर्वे वासीवृक्षादनान्विताः Mb. 5. 155. 8.<BR>—5 The elbow.<BR>—6 A blow with the elbow.<BR>—7 A flame, a lambent flame, halo; बाणवदनमुददीपि भिये जगतः सकीलमिव<BR> सूर्यमण्डलम् Śi. 15. 48.<BR>—8 A minute particle.<BR>—9 N. of Śiva.<BR>—10 A gnomon.<BR>—11 A position of the foetus just before the time of delivery.<BR>—12 a gambler; कीलो धूर्ते रथाक्षे च शङ्कौ ज्वालामहीध्रयोः Nm.<BR>—13 handle, brace; Suśr.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कीलप्रतिकीलकन्यायः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलप्रतिकीलकन्यायः
कीलः + -प्रतिकीलकन्यायः This maxim is explained in the Mahābhāṣya<BR> in the passage कीलप्रतिकीलकवत् । तद्यथा कील आहन्यमानः प्रतिकीलं<BR> निर्हन्ति Mbh. on P. II. 2. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलकः|कीलक
कीलकः<BR>—1 A wedge or pin.<BR>—2 A fence.<BR>—3 A pillar, column; see कील.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलकम्
कीलकः + .{@-कम्@} N. of the inner syllables of a mantra. सोऽहमिति कीलकम् Haṃsa Up. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलिका
कीलिका The pin of an axle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलित|कीलितः
कीलित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tied, bound.<BR>—2 Fixed, nailed, pinned down; तेन मम हृदयमिदमसमशरकीलितम्<BR> Gīt. 7; सा नश्चेतसि कीलितेव Māl. 5. 10.<BR>—3 Staked, impaled.<BR>—4 Pierced, transfixed.<BR>—5 Set (as a stake or pole).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलितम्
कीलित + .{@-तम्@} A tie.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलालः|कीलाल|कीलालं
कीलालः<BR>—1 A heavenly drink similar to Amṛta, beverage of the gods.<BR>—2 Honey.<BR>—3 A beast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलालम्
कीलालः + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 Blood. जलयन्त्रजलाकारकीलालोत्कलिकाकुलाः Śiva B. 14. 33. बद्धः<BR> सत्यमपां निधिर्जलनिधिः कीलालधिस्तोयधिः Udb.<BR>—2 water<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कीलालजम्, कीलालधिः, कीलालपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलालजम्
कीलालः + -जम् flesh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलालधिः|कीलालधि
कीलालः + -धिः the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलालपः|कीलालप
कीलालः + -पः a demon, goblin; न धर्मनिरतः कीलालपो नासुरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीलालिन्
कीलालिन् A lizard, chameleon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीश|कीशः
कीश <i>a.</i> Naked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीशः|कीश
कीश + .{@-शः@}<BR>—1 An ape, monkey; विकर्षन्तः कीशबालानारोहन्तश्च तैर्द्रुमान् Bhāg. 10. 12. 9.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR>—3 A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीशपर्णः|कीशपर्ण|कीशपर्ण्ण
कीशपर्णः, -पर्णिन्<BR> The plant अपामार्ग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीशपर्णिन्
कीशपर्णः, -पर्णिन्<BR> The plant अपामार्ग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुः|कु
कुः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The earth; Śi. 19. 17.<BR>—2 The base of a triangle or any plane figure; कुः पृथ्वी, कुः कुचः<BR> कूलम् … । Enm.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुचर, कुदिनम्, कुधरः, कुनाभिः, कुपप, कुपुत्रः, कुभृत्, कुवलयम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचर|कुचरः
कुः + -चर <i>a.</i> One who travels; कुचरः पञ्चवर्षाणि चरेद्भैक्ष्यं<BR> मुनिव्रतः Mb. 12. 165. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुदिनम्
कुः + -दिनम् a civil day Āryabhaṭṭa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुधरः|कुधर
कुः + -धरः a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनाभिः|कुनाभि
कुः + -नाभिः air, atmosphere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपप
कुः + -पप + ({@-पि, -पी@})<BR> <i>m.</i> the sun; also<BR> -वमः Mb. 13. 93. 90. (see टीका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपपि
कुः + -पप + ({@-पि, -पी@})<BR> <i>m.</i> the sun; also<BR> -वमः Mb. 13. 93. 90. (see टीका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपपी
कुः + -पप + ({@-पि, -पी@})<BR> <i>m.</i> the sun; also<BR> -वमः Mb. 13. 93. 90. (see टीका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपुत्रः|कुपुत्र
कुः + -पुत्रः Mars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुभृत्
कुः + -भृत् <i>m.</i> the number seven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवलयम्
कुः + -वलयम् the orb; कुवलयकमलकोशाभ्यन्तरकोशः Bhāg. 5. 16. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कु|कुः
कु <i>ind.</i> A prefix implying ‘badness’, ‘deterioration’, ‘depreciation’,<BR> ‘sin’, ‘reproach’, ‘littleness’, ‘want’, ‘deficiency’, &c. Its various<BR> substitutes are कद् (कदश्व), कव (कवोष्ण), का<BR> (कोष्ण), किं (किंप्रभुः); cf. Pt. 5. 17.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुकर्मन्, कुकुवाच्, कुकूलम्, कुग्रहः, कुग्रामः, कुचन्दनम्, कुचर, कुचरित्रम्, कुचर्या, कुचेल, कुचोद्यम्, कुजन्मन्, कुतनु, कुतन्त्री, कुतपः, कुतर्कः, कुतीर्थम्, कुदिनम्, कुदृष्टिः, कुदेशः, कुदेह, कुद्वारम्, कुधी, कुनखम्, कुनटः, कुनदिका, कुनाथः, कुनामन्, कुनीतः, कुपटः, कुपटम्, कुपथः, कुपथ्य, कुपरीक्षक, कुपात्रम्, कुपुत्रः, कुपुरुषः, कुपूय, कुप्रिय, कुप्लवः, कुबन्धः, कुब्रह्मः, कुब्रह्मन्, कुमन्त्रः, कुमुद्विन्, कुमेरुः, कुयोगः, कुयोगिन्, कुरस, कुरूप, कुरूप्यम्, कुलक्षण, कुवङ्गः, कुवचस्, कुवाच्, कुवाक्य, कुवज्रकम्, कुवर्षः, कुविक्रमः, कुविवाहः, कुवृत्तिः, कुवेधस्, कुवैद्यः, कुशील, कुष्ठलम्, कुसरित्, कुसृतिः, कुस्त्री<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकर्मन्|कुकर्म्मन्
कु + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> a bad deed, a mean act. ━<i>a.</i> wicked, Bhāg. 1. 16. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुवाच्
कु + -कु-वाच् <i>m.</i> jackal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकूलम्
कु + -कूलम् A hole filled with stakes. ˚लः A fire made of chaff;<BR> कुकूलं शङ्कुभिः कीर्णे श्वभ्रे ना तु तुषानले Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुग्रहः|कुग्रह
कु + -ग्रहः an unpropitious planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुग्रामः|कुग्राम
कु + -ग्रामः a petty village or hamlet (without a kingʼs officer, an<BR> <i>agnihotrin</i>, a physician, or a river.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचन्दनम्
कु + -चन्दनम् Red sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचर|कुचरः
कु + -चर <i>a.</i> of bad conduct, a thief; दृष्ट्वा त्वादित्यमुद्यन्तं<BR> कुचराणां भयं भवेत् Mb. 14. 39. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचरित्रम्
कु + -चरित्रम्, -चर्या wickedness, evil conduct, impropriety; Ms. 9. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचर्या|कुचर्य्या
कु + -चरित्रम्, -चर्या wickedness, evil conduct, impropriety; Ms. 9. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचेल|कुचेलः
कु + -चेल <i>a.</i> wearing bad or ragged garments; कपालं वृक्षमूलानि<BR> कुचेलमसहायता । समता चैव सर्वस्मिन्नेतन्मुक्तस्य लक्षणम् ॥ Ms. 6. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचोद्यम्
कु + -चोद्यम् an unsuitable question.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुजन्मन्
कु + -जन्मन् <i>a.</i> low born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतनु|कुतनुः
कु + -तनु <i>a.</i> deformed, ugly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतनुः|कुतनु
कु + -तनु + ({@-नुः@}) an epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतन्त्री|कुतंत्री
कु + -तन्त्री a bad lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतपः|कुतप
कु + -तपः<BR>—1 a sort of blanket (made of the hair of the mountain goat).<BR>—2 the eighth Muhūrta or portion of the day.<BR>—3 a daughterʼs or sisterʼs son.<BR>—4 the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतर्कः|कुतर्क
कु + -तर्कः<BR>—1 sophistical or fallacious argument.<BR>—2 a heterodox doctrine, free thinking; कुतर्केष्वभ्यासः सततपरपैशुन्यमननम्<BR> G. L. 31. ˚पथः a sophistical mode of arguing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतीर्थम्
कु + -तीर्थम् a bad teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुदिनम्
कु + -दिनम् an evil or unpropitious day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुदृष्टिः|कुदृष्टि
कु + -दृष्टिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 weak sight.<BR>—2 an evil eye, sinister eye (fig.).<BR>—3 an opinion or doctrine opposed to the Vedas, heterodox doctrines; या<BR> वेदबाह्याः स्मृतयो याश्च काश्च कुदृष्टयः Ms. 12. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुदेशः|कुदेश
कु + -देशः<BR>—1 a bad place or country.<BR>—2 a country where the necessaries of life are not available or which<BR> is subject to oppression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुदेह|कुदेहः
कु + -देह <i>a.</i> ugly, deformed; कुदेहमानाहिविदष्टदृष्टेर्ब्रह्मन्वचस्तेऽमृतमौषधं<BR> मे Bhāg. 5. 12. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुदेहः|कुदेह
कु + -देह + ({@-हः@}) an epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्वारम्
कु + -द्वारम् back door.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुधी
कु + -धी <i>a.</i><BR>—1 foolish, silly, stupid.<BR>—2 wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनखम्
कु + -नखम् a disease of the nails; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनटः|कुनट
कु + -नटः<BR>—1 a bad actor.<BR>—2 a sort of trumpet flower.<BR>—3 red arsenic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनदिका
कु + -नदिका a small river, rill; सुपूरा स्यात्कुनदिका Pt. 1. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनाथः|कुनाथ
कु + -नाथः a bad master; हतास्म्यहं कुनाथेन न पुंसा वीरमानिना<BR> Bhāg. 9. 14. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनामन्
कु + -नामन् <i>m.</i> a miser.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुनीतः|कुनीत
कु + -नीतः bad counsel, leading;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">Page0576-2</a>]<BR> तृणैश्छन्ना भूमिर्मतिरिव कुनीतैव विदुषः Mu. 6. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपटः|कुपट
कु + -पटः, -पटम् a miserable garment; कुपटावृतकटिः Bhāg. 5. 9. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपटम्
कु + -पटः, -पटम् a miserable garment; कुपटावृतकटिः Bhāg. 5. 9. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपथः|कुपथ
कु + -पथः<BR>—1 a wrong road, bad way (fig. also).<BR>—2 a heterodox doctrine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपथ्य
कु + -पथ्य <i>a.</i> unwholesome, improper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपरीक्षक
कु + -परीक्षक <i>a.</i> examining badly, not valuing rightly; कुत्स्याः<BR> स्युः कुपरीक्षका न मणयो यैरर्घतः पातिताः Bh. 2. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपात्रम्
कु + -पात्रम् an unfit recipient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपुत्रः|कुपुत्र
कु + -पुत्रः a bad or wicked son: यादृशं फलमाप्नोति कुप्लवैः संतरन्<BR> जलम् । तादृशं फलमाप्नोति कुपुत्रैः संतरंस्तमः ॥ Ms. 9. 161. कुपुत्रो<BR> जायेत क्वचिदपि कुमाता न भवति, देव्यपराधक्षमापनस्तोत्रम् (ascribed<BR> to a later शङ्कराचार्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपुरुषः|कुपुरुष
कु + -पुरुषः<BR>—1 a low or wicked man.<BR>—2 a spiritless coward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपूय|कुपूयः
कु + -पूय <i>a.</i> low, vile, contemptible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुप्रिय|कुप्रियः
कु + -प्रिय <i>a.</i> disagreeable, contemptible, low, mean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुप्लवः|कुप्लव
कु + -प्लवः a bad boat; कुप्लवैः संतरन् जलम् Ms. 9. 161.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुबन्धः|कुबन्ध
कु + -बन्धः a disgraceful stigma; अन्त्याभिगमने त्वङ्कयः कुबन्धेन<BR> प्रवासयेत् Y. 2. 294.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुब्रह्मः|कुब्रह्म
कु + -ब्रह्मः, -ब्रह्मन् <i>m.</i> a bad or degraded Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुब्रह्मन्
कु + -ब्रह्मः, -ब्रह्मन् <i>m.</i> a bad or degraded Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमन्त्रः|कुमन्त्र|कुमंत्र
कु + -मन्त्रः<BR>—1 bad advice.<BR>—2 a charm used to secure success in a bad cause.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमुद्विन्
कु + -मुद्विन् <i>a.</i> Unfriendly; उदहृष्यन्वारिजानि सूर्योत्थाने कुमुद्विना ।<BR> राज्ञा तु निर्भया लोकाः Bhāg. 10. 21. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमेरुः|कुमेरु
कु + -मेरुः The southern hemisphere or pole.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुयोगः|कुयोग
कु + -योगः an inauspicious conjunction (of planets).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुयोगिन्
कु + -योगिन् <i>m.</i> a false devotee, impostor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरस|कुरसः
कु + -रस <i>a.</i> having bad juice or flavour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरसः|कुरस
कु + -रस + ({@-सः@}) a kind<BR> of spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरूप
कु + -रूप <i>a.</i> ugly, deformed; कुपुत्रोऽपि भवेत्पुंसां हृदयानन्दकारकः ।<BR> दुर्विनीतः कुरूपोऽपि मूर्खोऽपि व्यसनी खलः ॥ Pt. 5. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरूप्यम्
कु + -रूप्यम् tin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलक्षण
कु + -लक्षण <i>a.</i> having fatal marks on the body. कुलक्षणेत्यहं<BR> राज्ञा त्यक्तेत्यात्तविमानना Ks. 91. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवङ्गः|कुवङ्ग|कुवंग|कुवङ्गं
कु + -वङ्गः lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवचस्
कु + -वचस्, -वाच्, -वाक्य <i>a.</i> abusive, bad, scurrilous; using abusive<BR> or foul language; संस्मारितो मर्मभिदः कुवागिषून्^1 Bhāg. 4. 3. 15.<BR>━(<i>n.</i>) abuse, bad language.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260605. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/250.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवाच्
कु + -वचस्, -वाच्, -वाक्य <i>a.</i> abusive, bad, scurrilous; using abusive<BR> or foul language; संस्मारितो मर्मभिदः कुवागिषून्^1 Bhāg. 4. 3. 15.<BR>━(<i>n.</i>) abuse, bad language.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260605. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/250.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवाक्य
कु + -वचस्, -वाच्, -वाक्य <i>a.</i> abusive, bad, scurrilous; using abusive<BR> or foul language; संस्मारितो मर्मभिदः कुवागिषून्^1 Bhāg. 4. 3. 15.<BR>━(<i>n.</i>) abuse, bad language.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260605. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/250.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवज्रकम्
कु + -वज्रकम् crystal; a stone resembling a diamond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवर्षः|कुवर्ष
कु + -वर्षः a sudden or violent shower; Rām. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुविक्रमः|कुविक्रम
कु + -विक्रमः bravery exhibited in a wrong place; धिगीदृशं ते नृपते<BR> कुविक्रमं कृपाश्रये यः कृपणे पतत्त्रिणि N. 1. 132.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुविवाहः|कुविवाह
कु + -विवाहः a degraded or improper form of marriage; Ms. 3. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवृत्तिः|कुवृत्ति
कु + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> bad behaviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवेधस्
कु + -वेधस् <i>m.</i> bad fate; हृतरत्नेन मुषितो दत्त्वा काचं कुवेधसा Ks. 71. 232.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवैद्यः|कुवैद्य
कु + -वैद्यः a bad physician, quack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशील
कु + -शील <i>a.</i> rude, wicked, unmannerly, ill tempered, of bad character;<BR> कुतो गम्यमगम्यं वा कुशीलोन्मादिनः प्रभोः Ks. 32. 152.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठलम्
कु + -ष्ठलम्<BR>—1 a bad place.<BR>—2 the earth; शयानां कुष्ठले Bk. 9. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसरित्
कु + -सरित् <i>f.</i> a small river, rill; उच्छिद्यन्ते क्रियाः सर्वा ग्रीष्मे<BR> कुसरितो यथा Pt. 2. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसृतिः|कुसृति
कु + -सृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 evil conduct, wickedness; कस्माद्वयं कुसृतयः खलयोनयस्ते Bhāg. 8. 23. 7.<BR>—2 conjuring, magic.<BR>—3 roguery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुस्त्री
कु + -स्त्री a bad woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कु|कुः
कु I. €1 P. (कवते) To sound. ━II. €6 Ā. (कुवते)<BR>—1 To moan, groan.<BR>—2 To cry. ━III. €2 P. (कौति) To hum, coo (as a bee.) … कुवत्पक्षिकुलाकुलाः Bk. 9. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंश्
कुंश्(स्) €1. €10. P.<BR>—1 To shine.<BR>—2 To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुंस्
कुंश्(स्) €1. €10. P.<BR>—1 To shine.<BR>—2 To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्
कुक् €1 Ā. (कोकते) To take, accept, seize; वेत्रशाककुजे शैलेऽलेशैजेऽकुकशात्रवे Ki. 15. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकभम्
कुकभम् A kind of spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकीलः|कुकील
कुकीलः A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0576-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुदः|कुकुद
कुकु(कू)दः One who gives away a girl in marriage with suitable<BR> decorations and in accordance with prescribed ceremonies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकूदः|कुकूद
कुकु(कू)दः One who gives away a girl in marriage with suitable<BR> decorations and in accordance with prescribed ceremonies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुभा
कुकुभा N. of a Rāgiṇi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुन्दरः|कुकुन्दर|कुकुंदर|कुकुन्दरं|कुकुंदरः
