कुकुन्दुरः|कुकुन्दुर|कुकुंदुर|कुकुंदुरः
कुकुन्द(दु)रः The cavity of the loins just above the hips (जघनकूप)<BR> see ककुन्दर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुरः|कुकुर
कुकुरः<BR>—1 A dog (also कूकुरः)<BR>—2 N. of a fragrant tree and perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकुराः
कुकुराः (pl.)<BR>—1 N. of a country; also called दशार्ह.<BR>—2 N. of a people, a tribe of the Yādavas; Śi. 6. 15, 13. 6, 16. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकूलः|कुकूल|कुकूलं
कुकूलः, -लम्<BR>—1 Chaff; कुकूलानां राशौ तदनु हृदयं पच्यत इव U. 5. 38.<BR>—2 A fire made of chaff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकूलम्
कुकूलः, -लम्<BR>—1 Chaff; कुकूलानां राशौ तदनु हृदयं पच्यत इव U. 5. 38.<BR>—2 A fire made of chaff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकूलम्
कुकूलः, -लम् + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 A hole, ditch (filled with stakes).<BR>—2 An armour, mail.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुकूलाग्निः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुकूलाग्निः|कुकूलाग्नि
कुकूलः + -अग्निः a fire made of chaff; अङ्गारास्तुहिने न्यस्ताः कुकूलाग्निश्च<BR> चन्दने Ks. 117. 92.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटः|कुक्कुट
कुक्कुटः<BR>—1 A cock, wild cock.<BR>—2 A wisp of lighted straw, a firebrand.<BR>—3 A spark of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटी
कुक्कुटः + .{@-टी@}<BR>—1 A hen.<BR>—2 A small house-lizard.<BR>—3 The silk-cotton tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुक्कुटाण्डम्, कुक्कुटाभः, कुक्कुटाहिः, कुक्कुटासनम्, कुक्कुटमण्डपः, कुक्कुटमस्तकः, कुक्कुटव्रतम्, कुक्कुटशिखः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटाण्डम्
कुक्कुटः + -अण्डम् <i>n.</i> a fowlʼs egg; कुक्कुट्या अण्ड कुक्कुटाण्डम् Mbh. on<BR> P. VI. 3. 42; Vārt. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटाभः|कुक्कुटाभ
कुक्कुटः + -आभः, -अहिः a kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटाहिः|कुक्कुटाहि
कुक्कुटः + -आभः, -अहिः a kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटासनम्
कुक्कुटः + -आसनम् <i>n.</i> a particular posture of an ascetic in religious meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

