कुक्कुटः + -मण्डपः<BR>—1 a place where one gets liberation (Jaina).<BR>—2 N. of a sanctuary in Benares; cf. मुक्तिमण्डप Skanda P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

