कुक्कुटव्रतम्
कुक्कुटः + -व्रतम् <i>n.</i> a vow observed on the seventh day of the bright half<BR> of भाद्रपद in honour of Śiva, by ladies for progeny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटशिखः|कुक्कुटशिख
