कुक्कुटकः|कुक्कुटक
कुक्कुटकः<BR>—1 A cock, wild cock. कूजत्क्लान्तकपोतकुक्कुटकुलाः U. 2. 9.<BR>—2 A man of a mixed caste, born from a शूद्र man to a निषाद woman;<BR> शूद्राज्जातो निषाद्यां तु स वै कुक्कुटकः स्मृतः Ms. 10. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटिः|कुक्कुटि
कुक्कुटिः^1, -टी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Hypocrisy, interested observance of religious rites.<BR>—2 The small house-lizard. The Śālmali tree.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124. note: Missing k considered error since neighboring headwords have two k's..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुटी
कुक्कुटिः^1, -टी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Hypocrisy, interested observance of religious rites.<BR>—2 The small house-lizard. The Śālmali tree.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124. note: Missing k considered error since neighboring headwords have two k's..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुक्कुभः|कुक्कुभ
