कुच्
कुच् I. €6 P. (कुचति, कुचित)<BR>—1 To utter a shrill cry (as a bird).<BR>—2 To go.<BR>—3 To polish.<BR>—4 To contract, bend.<BR>—5 To be contracted.<BR>—6 To stop, impede.<BR>—7 To write or delineate.<BR>—8 To mix, connect. ━II. €1 P. कुञ्च् also (कोचति, कुञ्चति कुञ्चित)<BR>—1 To make crooked, bend or curve.<BR>—2 To move or go crookedly.<BR>—3 To make small, lessen.<BR>—4 To shrink, contract.<BR>—5 To go to or towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुचः|कुच
