कुजः<BR>—1 A tree; Pt. 3. 92.<BR>—2 The planet Mars. (कौ पृथ्व्यां जायते इति) Bhāg. 2. 7. 34; ‘न शनि-रवि-कुजानां वासरे नोग्रतारे ।’ शालिहोत्र of भोज.<BR>—3 N. of a demon killed by Kṛṣṇa (also called नरक q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

