कुज्झटिः, कुज्झटिका, कुज्झटी <i>f.</i> A fog or mist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0577-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

