कुटिल + -मति, -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> evil-minded, malevolent; कुटिलमतिः स<BR> एष येन क्रोधाग्नौ प्रसभमदाहि नन्दवंशः Mu. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटिलबुद्धि
कुटिल + -मति, -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> evil-minded, malevolent; कुटिलमतिः स<BR> एष येन क्रोधाग्नौ प्रसभमदाहि नन्दवंशः Mu. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटिलस्वभाव
कुटिल + -स्वभाव <i>a.</i> crooked by nature, dishonest, malevolent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटिलक
कुटिलक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Curved, bent, crooked.<BR>—2 Crouching, coming stealthily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटिलिका
कुटिलिका<BR>—1 Coming stealthily as a hunter on his prey, crouching.<BR>—2 A blacksmithʼs forge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटी
कुटी<BR>—1 A curve.<BR>—2 A cottage, hut; प्रासादीयति कुट्याम् Sk.; Ms. 11. 73; पर्ण˚, अश्व˚ &c.<BR>—3 A vessel with openings used for fumigation.<BR>—4 A nosegay<BR>—5 A kind of perfume (मुरा).<BR>—6 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—7 A bawd, procuress.<BR>—8 A bower (लतागृह); कुटीषु गोपीरुचिरासु योऽर्कभूतटीषु गोपाल<BR> इति श्रुतोऽचरत् Viś. Guṇā. 461.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुटीचकः, कुटीचरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटीचकः|कुटीचक
कुटी + -चकः a religious mendicant of a particular order; चतुर्विधा भिक्षवस्ते<BR> कुटीचकबहूदकौ । हंसः परमहंसश्च यो यः पश्चात् स उत्तमः ॥<BR> Mb.; Bhāg. 3. 12. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटीचरः|कुटीचर
कुटी + -चरः a kind of ascetic who entrusts the care of his family to<BR> his son and devotes himself solely to religious penance and austerities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटीरः|कुटीर|कुटीरं
कुटीरः, -रम्, कुटीरकः<BR> [कुटीशमीशुप्डाभ्यो रः P. V. 3. 88] A hut,<BR> cottage; U. 2. 29; Amaru. 56 (प्रक्षिप्तश्लोक in the note).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटीरम्
कुटीरः, -रम्, कुटीरकः<BR> [कुटीशमीशुप्डाभ्यो रः P. V. 3. 88] A hut,<BR> cottage; U. 2. 29; Amaru. 56 (प्रक्षिप्तश्लोक in the note).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटीरकः|कुटीरक
कुटीरः, -रम्, कुटीरकः<BR> [कुटीशमीशुप्डाभ्यो रः P. V. 3. 88] A hut,<BR> cottage; U. 2. 29; Amaru. 56 (प्रक्षिप्तश्लोक in the note).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटीरम्
कुटीरः, -रम्, कुटीरकः + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Sexual intercourse.<BR>—2 Exclusiveness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0578-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटीका
कुटीका A small house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुङ्गकः|कुटुङ्गक|कुटुंगकः
कुटुङ्गकः<BR>—1 An arbour formed by creeping plants.<BR>—2 creeper winding round a tree.<BR>—3 A thatch, roof.<BR>—4 A hut.<BR>—5 A granary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुनी
कुटुनी A bawd, procuress; see कुट्टनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बम्
कुटुम्बम्^1, कुटुम्बकम् A household, a family; परमियं ब्राह्मणी<BR> अस्मिन् कुटुम्बे Mbh. on P. I. 4. 2. उदारचरितानां तु वसुधैव कुटुम्बम्^2कम्<BR> H. 1. 68; Y. 2. 45; Ms. 11. 12, 22, 8. 166.<BR>—2 The duties and cares of a family; तदुपहितकुटुम्बम्^3ः R. 7. 71.<BR>—3 N. of the second astrological mansion (अर्थ).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170203. note: neuter noun.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by  on 20170203. note: neuter noun.<BR>[3] Correction submitted by  on 20170203. note: neuter noun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बकम्
कुटुम्बम्^1, कुटुम्बकम् A household, a family; परमियं ब्राह्मणी<BR> अस्मिन् कुटुम्बे Mbh. on P. I. 4. 2. उदारचरितानां तु वसुधैव कुटुम्बम्^2कम्<BR> H. 1. 68; Y. 2. 45; Ms. 11. 12, 22, 8. 166.<BR>—2 The duties and cares of a family; तदुपहितकुटुम्बम्^3ः R. 7. 71.<BR>—3 N. of the second astrological mansion (अर्थ).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170203. note: neuter noun.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by  on 20170203. note: neuter noun.<BR>[3] Correction submitted by  on 20170203. note: neuter noun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बः|कुटुम्ब|कुटुंब|कुटुंबं
कुटुम्बम्, कुटुम्बकम् + .{@-बः, -बम्@}<BR>—1 A kinsman, a relation by descent or marriage.<BR>—2 Offspring, progeny.<BR>—3 A name.<BR>—4 Race.<BR>—5 A group, collection; Vikr. 1. 92.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुटुम्बकलहः, कुटुम्बकलहम्, कुटुम्बभरः, कुटुम्बभूमिः, कुटुम्बव्यापृत<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बम्
कुटुम्बम्, कुटुम्बकम् + .{@-बः, -बम्@}<BR>—1 A kinsman, a relation by descent or marriage.<BR>—2 Offspring, progeny.<BR>—3 A name.<BR>—4 Race.<BR>—5 A group, collection; Vikr. 1. 92.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुटुम्बकलहः, कुटुम्बकलहम्, कुटुम्बभरः, कुटुम्बभूमिः, कुटुम्बव्यापृत<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बकलहः|कुटुम्बकलह|कुटुंबकलह
कुटुम्बम् + -कलहः, -कलहम् internal or domestic quarrels. कुटुम्बकलहादीशोऽपि<BR> हालाहलं पपौ Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बकलहम्
कुटुम्बम् + -कलहः, -कलहम् internal or domestic quarrels. कुटुम्बकलहादीशोऽपि<BR> हालाहलं पपौ Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बभरः|कुटुम्बभर
कुटुम्बम् + -भरः the burden of the family; भर्त्रा तदर्पितकुटुम्बभरेण<BR> सार्धम् Ś. 4. 20; ˚चिन्तया Pt. 5. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बभूमिः
कुटुम्बम् + -भूमिः the site where a house is built; कुटुम्बभूमिमानं तु<BR> वाटक्षेत्रविवर्जितम् Kāmikāgama 21. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बव्यापृत|कुटुंबव्यापृत|कुटुम्बव्यापृतः
कुटुम्बम् + -व्यापृत <i>a.</i> (a father) who is provident and attentive to the<BR> good of the family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बिकः|कुटुम्बिक|कुटुंबिक|कुटुंबिकः
कुटुम्बिकः, -कुटुम्बिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A householder, married man, (a <i>pater familias</i>), one who has<BR> a family to support or take care of; प्रायेण गृहिणीनेत्राः कन्यार्थेषु<BR> कुटुम्बिनः Ku. 6. 85; V. 3. 1; Ms. 3. 80; Y. 2. 45.<BR>—2 (fig.) One who takes care of anything.<BR>—3 A peasant.<BR>—4 A member of a family; Śānti. 4. 9.<BR>—5 (<i>m.</i>) A home-slave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बिन्|कुटुंबिन्
कुटुम्बिकः, -कुटुम्बिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A householder, married man, (a <i>pater familias</i>), one who has<BR> a family to support or take care of; प्रायेण गृहिणीनेत्राः कन्यार्थेषु<BR> कुटुम्बिनः Ku. 6. 85; V. 3. 1; Ms. 3. 80; Y. 2. 45.<BR>—2 (fig.) One who takes care of anything.<BR>—3 A peasant.<BR>—4 A member of a family; Śānti. 4. 9.<BR>—5 (<i>m.</i>) A home-slave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बिनी|कुटुंबिनी
कुटुम्बिकः, -कुटुम्बिन् + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 The wife of a householder, a house-wife (in charge of the house); द्रव्योपकरणं<BR> सर्वं नान्ववैक्षत्कुटुम्बिनी Mb. 12. 228. 60. भवतु कुटुम्बिनीमाहूय<BR> पृच्छामि Mu. 1; प्रभवन्त्योऽपि हि भर्तृषु कारणकोपाः कुटुम्बिन्यः<BR> M. 1. 17; R. 8. 86; Amaru. 56.<BR>—2 A large household or family.<BR>—3 A woman in general.<BR>—4 A sharer; यावदिदानीमीदृशशोकविनोदनार्थमवस्थाकुटुम्बिनीं मैथिलीं पश्यामि ।<BR>—5 A female servant of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बिता
कुटुम्बिता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 The state of being a householder.<BR>—2 Family connection or union.<BR>—3 Living as one family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुटुम्बित्वम्
कुटुम्बिता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 The state of being a householder.<BR>—2 Family connection or union.<BR>—3 Living as one family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्ट्
कुट्ट् €10 U. (कुट्टयति, कुट्टित)<BR>—1 To cut, divide.<BR>—2 To grind, pound.<BR>—3 To blame, censure.<BR>—4 To multiply.<BR>—5 To burn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्ट|कुट्टः
कुट्ट <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Dividing, cutting; grinding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टः|कुट्ट
कुट्ट + .{@-ट्टः@} (in Math.) A multiplier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टकः|कुट्टक
कुट्टकः<BR>—1 A grinder.<BR>—2 A kingfisher.<BR>—3 A multiplier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टनम्
कुट्टनम्<BR>—1 Cutting.<BR>—2 Pounding; नैसर्गिकी सुरभिणः कुसुमस्य सिद्धा मूर्ध्नि स्थितिर्न मुसलैर्बत<BR> कुट्टनानि Māl. 9. 50. (v. l.).<BR>—3 Abusing, censuring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टनी
कुट्ट(ट्टि)नी<BR>—1 A bawd, procuress, a go-between. … पार्श्वे तथैव प्रतिवसति महाकुट्टनी<BR> खड्गयष्टिः Sūkti. 5. 84.<BR>—2 A kind of spear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिनी
कुट्ट(ट्टि)नी<BR>—1 A bawd, procuress, a go-between. … पार्श्वे तथैव प्रतिवसति महाकुट्टनी<BR> खड्गयष्टिः Sūkti. 5. 84.<BR>—2 A kind of spear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टाक
कुट्टाक <i>a.</i> (-की^1 <i>f.</i>) Who or what divides or cuts;<BR> सारङ्गसंगरविधाविभकुम्भकूटकुट्टाकपाणिकुलिशस्य^2 हरेः प्रमादः Māl. 5. 32.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260615. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/261.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260615. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/261.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टित
कुट्टित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Cut.<BR>—2 Pounded &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिता
कुट्टित + .{@-ता@} Unskilful opening of a vein.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टमितम्
कुट्टमितम् The affected repulse of a loverʼs endearments or caresses<BR> (one of the 28 graces or blandishments of the heroine). The S. D. thus<BR> defines it:− केशस्तनाधरादीनां ग्रहे हर्षेऽपि संभ्रमात् । प्राहुः कुट्टमितं<BR> नाम शिरःकरविधूननम् 142.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टारः|कुट्टार|कुट्टारं
कुट्टारः A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टारम्
कुट्टारः + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Sexual intercourse.<BR>—2 A woollen blanket.<BR>—3 Exclusion or oneness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिम|कुट्टिमः
कुट्टिम <i>a.</i> Paved with small stones, decorated with mosaic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिमः|कुट्टिम
कुट्टिम + .{@-मः, -मम्@}<BR>—1 An inlaid or paved floor, ground paved with small stones, pavement;<BR> कान्तेन्दुकान्तोपलकुट्टिमेषु Śi. 3. 44; R. 11. 9. ‘निबद्धा भूः’<BR> Ak. निष्यन्दश्चन्दनानां शिशिरयति लतामण्डपे कुट्टिमान्तान् Nāg. 3. 7.<BR>—2 Ground prepared for the site of a mansion.<BR>—3 A jewel-mine.<BR>—4 The pomegranate.<BR>—5 A hut, cottage, small house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिमम्
कुट्टिम + .{@-मः, -मम्@}<BR>—1 An inlaid or paved floor, ground paved with small stones, pavement;<BR> कान्तेन्दुकान्तोपलकुट्टिमेषु Śi. 3. 44; R. 11. 9. ‘निबद्धा भूः’<BR> Ak. निष्यन्दश्चन्दनानां शिशिरयति लतामण्डपे कुट्टिमान्तान् Nāg. 3. 7.<BR>—2 Ground prepared for the site of a mansion.<BR>—3 A jewel-mine.<BR>—4 The pomegranate.<BR>—5 A hut, cottage, small house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिमित
कुट्टिमित = कुट्टमित q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टिहारिका
कुट्टिहारिका A maid-servant, slave; cf. कुटहारिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टीरः|कुट्टीर
कुट्टीरः A small mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्टीरकम्
कुट्टीरकम् A small house, hut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्मल
कुट्मल = कुड्मल q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठः|कुठ
कुठः A tree; cf. कुट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठर|कुठरः
कुठर See कुटर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठाकुः|कुठाकु
कुठाकुः A bird, the wood-pecker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठाटङ्कः|कुठाटङ्क|कुठाटंकः
कुठाटङ्कः, -का<BR> An axe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठाटङ्का
कुठाटङ्कः, -का<BR> An axe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठारः|कुठार
कुठारः, -री<BR>—1 An axe, or hatchet; मातुः केवलमेव यौवनवनच्छेदे कुठारा वयम् Bh. 3. 11.<BR>—2 A sort of hoe or spade; Kau. A. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठारी
कुठारः, -री<BR>—1 An axe, or hatchet; मातुः केवलमेव यौवनवनच्छेदे कुठारा वयम् Bh. 3. 11.<BR>—2 A sort of hoe or spade; Kau. A. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठारः|कुठार
कुठारः, -री + .{@-रः@} A tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठारकः|कुठारक
कुठारकः A small axe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठारिकः|कुठारिक
कुठारिकः A wood-cutter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठारिका
कुठारिका A small axe; विपुलविलसल्लज्जावल्लीविदारकुठारिका Bh. 3. 116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठारुः|कुठारु
कुठारुः<BR>—1 A tree.<BR>—2 An ape, a monkey.<BR>—3 An armourer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठिः|कुठि
कुठिः<BR>—1 A tree.<BR>—2 mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठेरः|कुठेर
कुठेरः Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुठेरुः|कुठेरु
कुठेरुः The wind produced by a fan or chowri.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्
कुड् €6 P. (कुडति) To play or act as a child, trifle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडङ्गः|कुडङ्ग|कुडंग|कुडंगः
कुडङ्गः A bower, an arbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडवः|कुडव
कुडवः(पः) A measure of grain equal to ¼ of a Prastha<BR> or ¹⁄₁₆ of an Āḍhaka and containing 12 handfuls; कुडवं कुडवं<BR> सर्वे व्यभजन्त तपस्विनः Mb. 14. 90. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडपः|कुडप
कुडवः(पः) A measure of grain equal to ¼ of a Prastha<BR> or ¹⁄₁₆ of an Āḍhaka and containing 12 handfuls; कुडवं कुडवं<BR> सर्वे व्यभजन्त तपस्विनः Mb. 14. 90. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0579-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडिः|कुडि
कुडिः The body; cf. Uṇ. 4. 143.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडिका
कुडिका An earthen or wooden water-pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडी
कुडी A hut; cf. कुटी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडुपः|कुडुप
कुडुपः The clasp of a necklace or bracelet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुडुवः
कुडुवः (See कुडव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्डाल
कुड्डाल A spade (Mar. कुदळ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्मल|कुड्मलः
कुड्(ट्)मल <i>a.</i> [Uṇ. 1. 106] Opening, full-blown, expanding,<BR> (as the blossom of a flower); R. 18. 37; विस्तारिस्तनकुम्भकुड्मलभरोत्सङ्गेन<BR> संभाविता Māl. 8. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुट्मल
कुड्(ट्)मल <i>a.</i> [Uṇ. 1. 106] Opening, full-blown, expanding,<BR> (as the blossom of a flower); R. 18. 37; विस्तारिस्तनकुम्भकुड्मलभरोत्सङ्गेन<BR> संभाविता Māl. 8. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्मलः|कुड्मल
कुड्(ट्)मल + .{@-लः@} An opening bud; विजृम्भणोद्गन्धिषु कुड्मलेषु R. 16. 47;<BR> U. 6. 17; द्योतिताग्रः समैः कुन्दकुड्मलाग्रदतः स्मितैः Śi. 2. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्मलम्
कुड्(ट्)मल + .{@-म्@}<BR>—1 A particular hell; Ms. 4. 89; Y. 3. 222.<BR>—2 The arrow-head (point); कुड्मलश्चाभवद्विष्णुस्तस्मिन्निषुवरे तदा Mb. 8. 34. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्मलित
कुड्मलित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Budded, blossomed.<BR>—2 Cheerful, smiling.<BR>—3 Half-closed; कण्डूकुड्मलितेक्षणां सहचरीं दन्तस्य कोट्या लिखन् Māl. 9. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्यम्
कुड्यम्<BR>—1 A wall; भेदे कुड्यावपातने Y. 2. 223; Śi. 3. 45 विनमितपटलान्तं<BR> दृश्यते जीर्णकुड्यम् Mu. 3. 15.<BR>—2 Plastering (a wall).<BR>—3 Eagerness, curiosity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्या
कुड्यम् + .{@-ड्या@} A wall; कीटः पेशस्कृतारुद्धः कुड्यायां तमनुस्मरन् Bhāg. 7. 1. 28.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुड्यच्छेदिन्, कुड्यच्छेद्यः, कुड्यमत्सी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्यच्छेदिन्
कुड्यम् + -च्छेदिन् <i>m.</i> a house-breaker, a thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्यच्छेद्यः|कुड्यच्छेद्य|कुड्यच्छेद्यं
कुड्यम् + -च्छेद्यः a digger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्यच्छेद्यम्
कुड्यम् + -च्छेद्यः + ({@-द्यम्@}) a ditch, pit, breach or opening (in a wall).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुड्यमत्सी
कुड्यम् + -मत्सी The house-lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्
कुण् I. €6 P. (कुणति, कुणित)<BR>—1 To support, aid.<BR>—2 To sound. ━II. €10 P. (कुणयति)<BR>—1 To counsel, advise.<BR>—2 To converse or speak with.<BR>—3 To invite.<BR>—4 To salute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणकः|कुणक
कुणकः A young animal just born; Bhāg. 5. 8. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणप|कुणपः
कुणप <i>a.</i> (-पी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [cf. Uṇ. 3. 143] Smelling like a dead body, stinking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणपः|कुणप
कुणप + .{@-पः, -पम्@} A dead body, corpse; शासनीयः कुणपभोजनः V. 5.<BR> (a vulture); अमेध्यकुणपाशी च Ms. 12. 71; often used as a term<BR> of contempt with living beings; व्युत्स्रक्ष्य^1 एतत्कुणपं त्वदङ्गजम्<BR> Bhāg. 4. 4. 23; Mb. 12. 214. 15.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260619. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/268.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणपम्
कुणप + .{@-पः, -पम्@} A dead body, corpse; शासनीयः कुणपभोजनः V. 5.<BR> (a vulture); अमेध्यकुणपाशी च Ms. 12. 71; often used as a term<BR> of contempt with living beings; व्युत्स्रक्ष्य^1 एतत्कुणपं त्वदङ्गजम्<BR> Bhāg. 4. 4. 23; Mb. 12. 214. 15.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260619. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/268.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणपः|कुणप
कुणप + .{@-पः@}<BR>—1 A spear; Mb. 7. 148. 46.<BR>—2 A foul smell, stench.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणपी
कुणप + .{@-पी@} A small bird (Mainā).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुणपाशन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणपाशन
कुणप + -अशन <i>a.</i> eating dead bodies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणारु
कुणारु <i>a.</i> Ved. Crying out, (क्वणनशील); अहस्तमिन्द्र<BR> सं पिणक् कुणारुम् Rv. 3. 30. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणालः|कुणाल
कुणालः<BR>—1 A kind of bird.<BR>—2 N. of a son of Aśoka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुणिः|कुणि
कुणिः<BR>—1 A cripple with a withered or crooked arm.<BR>—2 A whitlow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्टक|कुंटक|कुण्टकः
कुण्टक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) Fat, corpulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ठ्|कुंठ्
कुण्ठ् €1 P. (कुण्ठति, कुण्ठित)<BR>—1 To be blunted or dulled.<BR>—2 To be lame or mutilated.<BR>—3 To be dull or stupid, be idle.<BR>—4 To loosen. ━<i>Caus.</i> or €10 P. To hide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ठ|कुंठ|कुण्ठः
कुण्ठ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Blunt, dulled; वज्रं तपोवीर्यमहत्सु कुण्ठम् Ku. 3. 12, has no<BR> effect on &c.; कुण्ठत्वमायाति गुणः कवीनां साहित्यविद्याश्रमवर्जितेषु<BR> Vikr. 1. 14; Śi. 12. 12; कुण्ठीभवन्त्युपलादिषु क्षुराः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">Page0580-2</a>]<BR> Ś. B.<BR>—2 Dull, foolish, stupid.<BR>—3 Indolent, lazy.<BR>—4 Weak.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुण्ठधी, कुण्ठमनस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ठधी
कुण्ठ + -धी, -मनस् <i>a.</i> foolish, weak-minded; Bhāg. 3. 32. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ठमनस्
कुण्ठ + -धी, -मनस् <i>a.</i> foolish, weak-minded; Bhāg. 3. 32. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ठकः|कुण्ठक|कुंठक|कुंठकः
कुण्ठकः A fool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ठित|कुंठित|कुण्ठितः
कुण्ठित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Blunted, dulled; (fig. also); बिभ्रताऽस्त्रमचलेऽप्यकुण्ठितम् R. 11. 74;<BR> Bv. 2. 78; Ku. 2. 20; शास्त्रेष्वकुण्ठिता बुद्धिः R. 1. 19 not<BR> hampered or impeded; cf. also दशवदनभुजानां कुण्ठिता यत्र शक्तिः Mahān.<BR>—2 Stupid.<BR>—3 Mutilated.<BR>—4 Grasped, held.<BR>—5 Encircled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्ड्|कुंड्
कुण्ड् I. €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To burn.<BR>—2 To eat.<BR>—3 To heap. ━II. €1 P. To maim or mutilate. ━III. €10 U. To protect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डः|कुण्ड|कुंड|कुंडं|कुण्डं|कुंडः
कुण्डः, -डी, -डम्<BR> [cf. Uṇ. 1. 112]<BR>—1 A bowl-shaped vessel, a basin, bowl.<BR>—2 A round hole in the ground for receiving and preserving water. बलं<BR> नागसहस्रस्य यस्मिन्कुण्डे प्रतिष्ठितम् Mb. 1. 128. 68.<BR>—3 A hole in general; अग्निकुण्डम्.<BR>—4 A pool, well; especially one consecrated to some deity or holy purpose.<BR>—5 The bowl of a mendicant. —6 A water-jar (कमण्डलु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डी
कुण्डः, -डी, -डम्<BR> [cf. Uṇ. 1. 112]<BR>—1 A bowl-shaped vessel, a basin, bowl.<BR>—2 A round hole in the ground for receiving and preserving water. बलं<BR> नागसहस्रस्य यस्मिन्कुण्डे प्रतिष्ठितम् Mb. 1. 128. 68.<BR>—3 A hole in general; अग्निकुण्डम्.<BR>—4 A pool, well; especially one consecrated to some deity or holy purpose.<BR>—5 The bowl of a mendicant. —6 A water-jar (कमण्डलु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डम्
कुण्डः, -डी, -डम्<BR> [cf. Uṇ. 1. 112]<BR>—1 A bowl-shaped vessel, a basin, bowl.<BR>—2 A round hole in the ground for receiving and preserving water. बलं<BR> नागसहस्रस्य यस्मिन्कुण्डे प्रतिष्ठितम् Mb. 1. 128. 68.<BR>—3 A hole in general; अग्निकुण्डम्.<BR>—4 A pool, well; especially one consecrated to some deity or holy purpose.<BR>—5 The bowl of a mendicant. —6 A water-jar (कमण्डलु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डः|कुण्ड|कुंड|कुंडं|कुण्डं|कुंडः
कुण्डः, -डी, -डम् + .{@-डः@} (-डा <i>f.</i>)<BR> A son born in adultery, the son of a woman by a man<BR> other than her husband while the husband is alive; पत्यौ जीवति कुण्डः<BR> स्यात् Ms. 3. 174; Y. 1. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डा
कुण्डः, -डी, -डम् + .{@-ण्डा@} An epithet of Durgā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुण्डाशिन्, कुण्डोधस्, कुण्डकीटः, कुण्डकीलः, कुण्डगोलम्, कुण्डगोलकम्, कुण्डधारः, कुण्डपाय्यः, कुण्डभेदिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डाशिन्|कुंडाशिन्
कुण्डः + -आशिन् <i>m.</i> a pander, pimp, one who depends for his livelihood<BR> on a कुण्ड <i>i. e.</i> a bastard, or adulterine; अमृते जारजः कुण्डो<BR> मृते भर्तरि गोलकः । यस्तयोरन्नमश्नाति स कुण्डाशीति कथ्यते ॥<BR> Deval Smṛti; Ms. 3. 158; Y. 1. 224.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डोधस्
कुण्डः + -ऊधस् (कुण्डोध्नी P. V. 4. 131)<BR>—1 ऊधसोऽनङ् a cow with a full udder भुवं कोष्णेन कुण्डोध्नी; R. 1. 84.<BR>—2 a woman with a full bosom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डकीटः|कुण्डकीट|कुंडकीट
कुण्डः + -कीटः<BR>—1 a keeper of concubines.<BR>—2 a follower of the Cārvāka doctrine, an atheist.<BR>—3 a Brāhmaṇa born in adultery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डकीलः|कुण्डकील|कुंडकील
कुण्डः + -कीलः a low or vile man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डगोलम्
कुण्डः + -गोलम्, -गोलकम्<BR>—1 gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डगोल|कुंडगोल
—2 a group of कुण्ड and गोलक (taken together); cf. परदारेषु<BR> जायेते द्वौ पुत्रौ कुण्डगोलकौ । पत्यौ जीवति कुण्डः स्यात् मृते भर्तरि गोलकः ॥<BR> Ms. 3. 174.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डगोलकम्
कुण्डः + -गोलम्, -गोलकम्<BR>—1 gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डधारः|कुण्डधार
कुण्डः + -धारः<BR>—1 N. of a cloud; Mb. 12. 271. 2.<BR>—2 N. of a Nāga; Mb. 2. 9. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डपाय्यः|कुण्डपाय्य
कुण्डः + -पाय्यः (कुण्डेन पीयते अत्र क्रतौ) क्रतौ कुण्डपाय्यसञ्चाय्यौ<BR> P. III. 1. 130; a sacrifice; कुण्डपाय्यवतां कच्चिदग्निचित्यावतां तथा Bk. 4. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डभेदिन्
कुण्डः + -भेदिन् <i>a.</i> Clumsy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डकः|कुण्डक
कुण्डकः, -कम्<BR> A pot; कुण्डकस्थितम् (कज्जलम्) Ks. 4. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डकम्
कुण्डकः, -कम्<BR> A pot; कुण्डकस्थितम् (कज्जलम्) Ks. 4. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डलः|कुण्डल|कुंडल|कुंडलं|कुण्डलं|कुंडलः
कुण्डलः, -लम्<BR> [कुण्ड-मत्वर्थे ल]<BR>—1 An ear-ring; श्रोत्रं श्रुतेनैव न कुण्डलेन Bh. 2. 71; C. P. 11;<BR> Ṛs. 2. 20, 3. 19; R. 11. 15.<BR>—2 A bracelet; Śi. 6. 27.<BR>—3 The coil of a rope.<BR>—4 A fetter, tie, collar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डलम्
कुण्डलः, -लम्<BR> [कुण्ड-मत्वर्थे ल]<BR>—1 An ear-ring; श्रोत्रं श्रुतेनैव न कुण्डलेन Bh. 2. 71; C. P. 11;<BR> Ṛs. 2. 20, 3. 19; R. 11. 15.<BR>—2 A bracelet; Śi. 6. 27.<BR>—3 The coil of a rope.<BR>—4 A fetter, tie, collar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डलना|कुंडलना
कुण्डलना Encircling (as a word) to denote that it is to be left<BR> out or not considered; तदोजसस्तद्यशसः स्थिताविमौ वृथेति चित्ते कुरुते<BR> यदा यदा । तनोति भानोः परिवेषकैतवात्तदा विधिः कुण्डलनां विधोरपि ॥<BR> N. 1. 14; cf. 2. 95 also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डलिका
कुण्डलिका A circle; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डलिन्|कुंडलिन्
कुण्डलिन् (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Decorated with ear-rings.<BR>—2 Circular, spiral.<BR>—3 Winding, coiling (as a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">Page0581-1</a>]<BR> serpent). ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A snake. वामाङ्गीकृतवामाङ्गि कुण्डलीकृतकुण्डलि Udb.<BR>—2 A peacock.<BR>—3 An epithet of Varuṇa, and of Śiva.<BR>—4 The spotted or painted deer. —5 The golden mountain; काञ्चनाद्रौ सर्पे<BR> पुंसि तु कुण्डली Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डलिनी|कुंडलिनी
कुण्डलिन् + .{@-नी@} A form of Durgā or Śakti.<BR>—2 N. of a नाडी in Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0580-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डली
कुण्डली, -कुण्डलिका<BR> A kind of sweetmeat (Mar. जिलेबी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डलिका
कुण्डली, -कुण्डलिका<BR> A kind of sweetmeat (Mar. जिलेबी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डलीकृत|कुंडलीकृत
कुण्डलीकृत <i>a.</i> Forming a ring, coiled. कुण्डलीकृतकुण्डलि<BR> Udb. {@कुण्डलीकरणम्@} Bending a bow so as to form a circle; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डिका|कुंडिका
कुण्डिका<BR>—1 A pitcher.<BR>—2 A studentʼs water-pot (कमण्डलु). कुण्डिकां वामहस्ते च धारयेत्तु<BR> सरस्वती Māna. 54. 22; Mb. 12. 18. 19.<BR>—3 A small pool; नवा कुण्डिका Mbh. on P. I. 1. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डिन्|कुंडिन्
कुण्डिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 A bastard.<BR>—3 A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डिनम्
कुण्डिनम्, -पुरम्<BR> N. of a city, the capital of the Vidarbhas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डिनपुरम्
कुण्डिनम्, -पुरम्<BR> N. of a city, the capital of the Vidarbhas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डिनाः
कुण्डिनाः Descendants of कौण्डिन्य P. IV. 1. 105, II. 4. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डिर|कुण्डिरः
कुण्डि(ण्डी)र <i>a.</i> Strong, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डीर|कुंडीर|कुण्डीरः
कुण्डि(ण्डी)र <i>a.</i> Strong, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डिरः|कुण्डिर
कुण्डि(ण्डी)र + .{@-रः@} A man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुण्डीरः|कुण्डीर|कुंडीर
कुण्डि(ण्डी)र + .{@-रः@} A man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतपः|कुतप
कुतपः<BR>—1 A Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—2 A twice-born man (द्विजन्मन्).<BR>—3 The sun.<BR>—4 Fire.<BR>—5 A guest.<BR>—6 An ox, a bull.<BR>—7 A daughterʼs son.<BR>—8 A sisterʼs son.<BR>—9 Grain.<BR>—10 The eighth Muhūrta of the day; Mb. 13. 126. 36; cf. अह्नो मुहूर्ता<BR> विख्याता दश पञ्च च सर्वदा । तत्राष्टमो मुहूर्तो यः स कालः कुतपः स्मृतः ॥<BR>—11 A musical instrument.<BR>—12 A time suitable for the performance of sacrifices to the manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतपम्
कुतपः + .{@-पम्@} The Kuśa grass.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुतपाष्टकम्, कुतपसप्तकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतपाष्टकम्
कुतपः + -अष्टकम् eight कुतपs namely, मध्याह्न, शृङ्गपात्र, ऊर्णावस्त्र,<BR> रौप्य, दर्भ, वत्स, धेनु, दौहित्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतपसप्तकम्
कुतपः + -सप्तकम् seven things to be given in honour of the dead at the<BR> श्राद्ध ceremony, namely, शृङ्गपात्र, ऊर्णावस्त्र, रौप्यधातु, कुशतृण,<BR> सवत्सा धेनुः, अपराह्णकाल, कृष्णतिल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतस्
कुतस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 From where, whence; कस्य त्वं वा कुत आयातः Moha M. 3.<BR>—2 Where, where else, in what (other) place &c.; तार्तीयस्य कुतो गतिः<BR> Bhāg. 8. 19. 34; ईदृग्विनोदः कुतः Ś. 2. 5.<BR>—3 Why, wherefore, from what cause or motive; कुत इदमुच्यते Ś. 5.<BR>—4 How, in what manner; स्फुरति च बाहुः कुतः फलमिहास्य Ś. 1. 16.<BR>—5 Much more, much less; न त्वत्समोस्त्यभ्यधिकः कुतोऽन्यः Bg. 11. 43, 4. 31;<BR> न मे स्तेनो जनपदे न कदर्यो … न स्वैरी न स्वैरिणी<BR> कुतः Ch. Up.<BR>—6 Because, for; Ś. 1. कुतस् is sometimes used merely for the abl.<BR> of किम्; कुतः कालात्समुत्पन्नम् V. P. (= कस्मात् कालात् &c.). कुतः<BR> becomes indefinite when connected with the particles चिद्, चन, or अपि.<BR> भयं कच्चिन्न चास्मासु कुतश्चिद्विद्यते महत् Rām. 2. 74. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतस्त्य
कुतस्त्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Whence come; अपरिस्फुटनिस्वाने कुतस्त्येऽपि त्वमीदृशी (स्थिता) U. 3. 7.<BR>—2 How happened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतोनिमित्त
कुतोनिमित्त <i>a.</i> Having what cause or reason; कुतोनिमित्तः शोकस्ते<BR> Rām. 2. 74. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतुकम्
कुतुकम्<BR>—1 Desire, inclination.<BR>—2 Curiosity (= कौतुकम्) ततोऽतिकुतुकोद्वृ^1त्य Bhāg. 10. 13. 56.<BR>—3 Eagerness, ardour, vehemence; केलिकलाकुतुकेन च काचिदमुं यमुनाजलकूले ।<BR> मञ्जुलवञ्जुलकुञ्जगतं विचकर्ष करेण दुकूले Gīt. 1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260625. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/275.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतुकित
कुतुकित, -न् <i>a.</i><BR> Curious, inquisitive; उदरं परिमाति मुष्टिना कुतुकी<BR> कोऽपि दमस्वसुः किमु N. 2. 35^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260626. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/276.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतुकिन्
कुतुकित, -न् <i>a.</i><BR> Curious, inquisitive; उदरं परिमाति मुष्टिना कुतुकी<BR> कोऽपि दमस्वसुः किमु N. 2. 35^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260626. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/276.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतुपः|कुतुप|कुतुपं
कुतुपः, -कुतूः <i>f.</i><BR> A small leathern bottle for oil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतूः
कुतुपः, -कुतूः <i>f.</i><BR> A small leathern bottle for oil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतुपः|कुतुप|कुतुपं
कुतुपः, -कुतूः + .{@-पः@}<BR>—1 The eighth Muhūrta of the day.<BR>—2 = कुतप 12 q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतूहल|कुतूहलं|कुतूहलः
कुतूहल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wonderful.<BR>—2 Excellent, best.<BR>—3 Praised, celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतूहलम्
कुतूहल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 Desire, curiosity; उज्झितशब्देन जनितं नः कुतूहलम् Ś. 1;<BR> यदि विलासकुलासु कुतूहलम् Gīt. 1. (पपौ) कुतूहलेनेव मनुष्यशोणितम्<BR> R. 3. 54, 13. 21, 15. 65.<BR>—2 Eagerness.<BR>—3 What excites curiosity, anything pleasing or interesting, a curiosity.<BR>—4 Delight, pleasure अकृत मधुरैरम्बानां मे कुतूहलमङ्गकैः U. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतूहलिन्
कुतूहलिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Desirous, struck with curiosity; Māl. 1.<BR>—2 Eager, impatient; न जातु स्यात्कुतूहली Ms. 4. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुतृणम्
कुतृणम् An acquatic plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्थ
कुत्थ (in Astr.) The fifteenth Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्र
कुत्र <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Where, in which place; कुत्र मे शिशुः Pt. 1. प्रवृत्तिः कुत्र<BR> कर्तव्या H. 1.<BR>—2 In which case; तेजसा सह जातानां वयः कुत्रोपयुज्यते Pt. 1. 328.<BR>—3 How little consistent with, or different from; कुत्राशिषः श्रुतिसुखा<BR> मृगतृष्णिरूपाः Bhāg. 7. 9. 25. (कुत्र is sometimes used for the loc.<BR> sing. किम्). When connected with the particles चिद्, चन or अपि,<BR> कुत्र becomes indefinite in sense. कुत्रापि, कुत्रचित् कुत्रचन somewhere,<BR> anywhere; न कुत्रापि nowhere; कुत्रचित् कुत्रचित् in one place-in<BR> another place, here-here; विशिष्टं कुत्रचिद्वीजम् Ms. 9. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्रत्य
कुत्रत्य <i>a.</i> Where living or residing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्स्
कुत्स् €10 Ā. (कुत्सयते, कुत्सित) To abuse, revile, censure, condemn;<BR> पूजयेदशनं नित्यमद्याच्चैतदकुत्सयन् Ms. 2. 54; Y. 1. 31; Śānti. 2. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्सनम्
कुत्सनम्, कुत्सा Abuse, contempt, reproach, abusive language;<BR> देवतानां च कुत्सनम् Ms. 4. 163; Ks. 61. 298.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्सा
कुत्सनम्, कुत्सा Abuse, contempt, reproach, abusive language;<BR> देवतानां च कुत्सनम् Ms. 4. 163; Ks. 61. 298.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्सना
कुत्सनम्, कुत्सा + .{@-ना@} Expression of contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्सित|कुत्सितं|कुत्सितः
कुत्सित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Despised, contemptible; अस्य क्रूरैर्नृशंसैश्च कर्मभिर्लोककुत्सितैः<BR> Rām. 5. 49. 19.<BR>—2 Low, mean, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्सितम्
कुत्सित + .{@-तम्@} Censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुत्सला
कुत्सला The indigo plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुथ्
कुथ्^1 €4 P. (कुथ्यति, कुथित) To stink, become putrid, or foul.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170214. note: verb missing virAma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुथः|कुथ|कुथं
कुथः The Kuśa grass. अथ स वल्क-दुकूल-कुथादिभिः Bk. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुथः|कुथ|कुथं
कुथः, -थम्, -था<BR>—1 A painted cloth serving as an elephantʼs housings (Mar. झूल);<BR> उत्सृष्टध्वजकुथकङ्कटा धरित्रीमानीता विदितनयैः श्रमं विनेतुम् Ki. 7. 30.<BR>—2 A carpet<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0582-1" target="_blank">Page0582-1</a>]<BR> (in general); महत्या कुथयास्तीर्णां पृथिवीलक्षणाङ्कया Rām. 5. 9. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुथम्
कुथः, -थम्, -था<BR>—1 A painted cloth serving as an elephantʼs housings (Mar. झूल);<BR> उत्सृष्टध्वजकुथकङ्कटा धरित्रीमानीता विदितनयैः श्रमं विनेतुम् Ki. 7. 30.<BR>—2 A carpet<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0582-1" target="_blank">Page0582-1</a>]<BR> (in general); महत्या कुथयास्तीर्णां पृथिवीलक्षणाङ्कया Rām. 5. 9. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुथा
कुथः, -थम्, -था<BR>—1 A painted cloth serving as an elephantʼs housings (Mar. झूल);<BR> उत्सृष्टध्वजकुथकङ्कटा धरित्रीमानीता विदितनयैः श्रमं विनेतुम् Ki. 7. 30.<BR>—2 A carpet<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0582-1" target="_blank">Page0582-1</a>]<BR> (in general); महत्या कुथयास्तीर्णां पृथिवीलक्षणाङ्कया Rām. 5. 9. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुथकः|कुथक
कुथकः A variegated cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0582-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुदाल|कुदालः
कुदाल = कुद्दारः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0582-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्दारः|कुद्दार
कुद्दारः, -लः, -लकः<BR>—1 A spade, hoe; समासाद्य बिलं^1 तच्चाप्यखनन्सगरात्मजाः कुद्दालैः<BR> Mb. 3. 107. 23.<BR>—2 The Kāñcana tree.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260627. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/278.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0582-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्दालः|कुद्दाल
कुद्दारः, -लः, -लकः<BR>—1 A spade, hoe; समासाद्य बिलं^1 तच्चाप्यखनन्सगरात्मजाः कुद्दालैः<BR> Mb. 3. 107. 23.<BR>—2 The Kāñcana tree.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260627. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/278.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0582-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्दालकः|कुद्दालक
कुद्दारः, -लः, -लकः<BR>—1 A spade, hoe; समासाद्य बिलं^1 तच्चाप्यखनन्सगरात्मजाः कुद्दालैः<BR> Mb. 3. 107. 23.<BR>—2 The Kāñcana tree.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260627. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/278.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0582-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुद्दालकम्
कुद्दारः, -लः, -लकः + .{@-लकम्@}<BR>—1 A copper pitcher.<BR>—2 A measure; एकेन कुद्दालकेन खारीसहस्रम् Mbh. on P. II. 1. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0582-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

