कुद्रङ्कः|कुद्रङ्क|कुद्रंक|कुद्रंकः
कुद्रङ्कः, -ङ्गः<BR>—1 A watch-house.<BR>—2 A dwelling raised on a scaffold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0582-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

