कुब्जकः N. of a tree; Ms. 8. 247, 5. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुब्जिका
कुब्जिका An unmarried girl of eight years old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुब्र|कुब्रं
कुब्र<BR>—1 A forest.<BR>—2 A hole for sacrificial fire.<BR>—3 A ring; an ear-ring.<BR>—4 A thread.<BR>—5 A cart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुभा
कुभा The Kābul river (falling into the Indus); मा वो रसानितभा<BR> कुभा Rv. 5. 53. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

