कुभ्रामि
कुभ्रामि <i>a.</i> Refractive of light; Kau. A. 2. 11. Probably an error in parsing. Should be tarkuBrAmi.^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260704. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/286.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमार्
कुमार्(ल्) €10 P. To sport, to play (like a child)^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260704. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/286.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमाल्
कुमार्(ल्) €10 P. To sport, to play (like a child)^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260704. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/286.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमारः|कुमार|कुमारं
कुमारः [cf. Uṇ. 3. 138]<BR>—1 A son, boy; a youth; यदात्थ राजन्यकुमार तत्तथा यशस्तु रक्ष्यं<BR> परतो यशोधनैः R. 3. 48.<BR>—2 A boy below five.<BR>—3 A prince, an heir-apparent (especially in dramas); विप्रोषितकुमारं<BR> तद्राज्यमस्तमितेश्वरम् R. 12. 11; कुमारस्यायुषो बाणः V. 5; उपवेष्टुमर्हति<BR> कुमारः Mu. 4 (said by Rākṣasa to Malayaketu).<BR>—4 N. of Kārtikeya, the god of war; कुमारकल्पं सुषुवे कुमारम् R. 5. 36;<BR> कुमारोऽपि कुमारविक्रमः 3. 55.<BR>—5 N. of Agni.<BR>—6 A parrot.<BR>—7 N. of the author of a Dharmaśāstra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमारम्
कुमारः + .{@-रम्@} pure gold.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुमारजीवः, कुमारपालनः, कुमारभृत्या, कुमारललिता, कुमारलीढः, कुमारवाहिन्, कुमारवाहनः, कुमारव्रतम्, कुमारसूः, कुमारसंभवम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमारजीवः|कुमारजीव
कुमारः + -जीवः N. of the plant पुत्रंजीव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमारपालनः|कुमारपालन
कुमारः + -पालनः<BR>—1 one who takes care of children.<BR>—2 N. of king Śālivāhana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमारभृत्या
कुमारः + -भृत्या<BR>—1 care of young children.<BR>—2 care of a woman in pregnancy or confinement, midwifery; कुमारभृत्याकुशलैरनुष्ठिते<BR> भिषग्भिराप्तैरथ गर्भभर्मणि R. 3. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमारललिता
कुमारः + -ललिता <i>f.</i><BR>—1 delicate love-dalliance.<BR>—2 N. of a metre consisting of seven syllables in a quarter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमारलीढः
कुमारः + -लीढः also कुब्जालीढः N. of the founder of a sect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमारवाहिन्
कुमारः + -वाहिन्, -वाहनम्^1 a peacock.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260704. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/286.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

