कुमारः + -वाहिन्, -वाहनम्^1 a peacock.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260704. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/286.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमारव्रतम्
कुमारः + -व्रतम् a vow of eternal celibacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुमारसूः
कुमारः + -सूः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 an epithet of Pārvati.<BR>—2 N. of the Ganges. ━(<i>m.</i>) an epithet of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0583-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

