कुम्बः|कुम्ब|कुंबः
कुम्बः Ved.<BR>—1 A kind of head-dress for women (?) कुरीरमस्य शीर्षणि कुम्बं चाधिनिदध्मसि Av. 6. 138. 3.<BR>—2 The upper part of a club.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्बा|कुंबा
