कुम्भम्
कुम्भः + .{@-भम्@} A fragrant resin (गुग्गुल).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुम्भोदरः, कुम्भोलूकः, कुम्भोलूखलकम्, कुम्भकर्णः, कुम्भकामला, कुम्भकारः, कुम्भघोणः, कुम्भजः, कुम्भजन्मन्, कुम्भयोनिः, कुम्भसंभवः, कुम्भदासी, कुम्भधरः, कुम्भपञ्जरः, कुम्भराशिः, कुम्भरेतस्, कुम्भलग्नम्, कुम्भमण्डूकः, कुम्भशाला, कुम्भसन्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भोदरः|कुम्भोदर
कुम्भः + -उदरः one of the attendants of Śiva; अवेहि मां किङ्करमष्टमूर्तेः<BR> कुम्भोदरं नाम निकुम्भमित्रम् R. 2. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भोलूकः|कुम्भोलूक
कुम्भः + -उलूकः a kind of owl; हृत्वा पिष्टमयं पूपं कुम्भोलूकः प्रजायते<BR> Mb. 13. 111. 101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भोलूखलकम्
कुम्भः + -उलूखलकम् a medicinal plant (Mar. गुग्गुळ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भकर्णः|कुम्भकर्ण
कुम्भः + -कर्णः ‘pitcher-eared’, N. of a gigantic Rākṣasa, a brother<BR> of Rāvaṇa and slain by Rāma. [He is said to have devoured thousands<BR> of beings including sages and heavenly nymphs, and the gods were anxiously<BR> waiting for an opportunity to retaliate upon the powerful demon. After<BR> Brahmā had inflicted on him a curse for the humiliation to which he subjected<BR> Indra and his elephant Airāvata, Kumbhakarṇa began to practise the most<BR> rigid austerities. Brahmā was pleased and was about to grant him a boon,<BR> when the gods requested Sarasvatī to sit on his tongue and to pervert<BR> it. Accordingly when he went to the god, instead of asking <i>Indrapada</i><BR> he asked <i>Nidrāpada</i> which was readily granted. It is said that<BR> he slept for six months at a time, and, when roused, was awake for only<BR> one day. When Lankā was besieged by the monkey-troops of Rāma, Ravāṇa<BR> with great difficulty roused Kumbhakarṇa, desirous of availing himself<BR> of his gigantic strength. After having drunk 2000 jars of liquor, he took<BR> Sugrīva prisoner, besides devouring thousands of monkeys. He was ultimately<BR> slain by Rāma.] Rām. 6; R. 12. 80.<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva; Mb. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भकामला
कुम्भः + -कामला a bilious affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भकारः|कुम्भकार|कुंभकार
कुम्भः + -कारः<BR>—1 a potter; मृद्दण्डचक्रसंयोगात्कुम्भकारो यथा घटम् (करोति) Y. 3. 146.<BR>—2 a mixed tribe (वेश्यायां विप्रतश्चौर्यात् कुम्भकारः स उच्यते Uśanas;<BR> or मालाकारात्कर्मकर्यां कुम्भकारो व्यजायत Parāśara).<BR>—3 a serpent.<BR>—4 a kind of wild fowl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भकारी
कुम्भः + -कारः + .({@-री@}), {@-कारिका@}<BR>—1 the wife of a potter.<BR>—2 a kind of collyrium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भघोणः|कुम्भघोण
कुम्भः + -घोणः N. of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भजः|कुम्भज
कुम्भः + -जः, -जन्मन् <i>m.</i>,<BR> {@-योनिः@}, <i>m.</i>, {@-संभवः@}<BR>—1 epithets of Agastya; एतदाख्याय रामाय महर्षिः कुम्भसंभवः Rām. 7. 80. 1;<BR> प्रससादोदयादम्भः कुम्भयोनेर्महौजसः R. 4. 21, 15. 55.<BR>—2 an epithet of Droṇa, the military preceptor of the Kauravas and Pāṇḍavas.<BR>—3 an epithet of Vasiṣṭha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भयोनिः|कुम्भयोनि|कुंभयोनि
कुम्भः + -जः, -जन्मन् <i>m.</i>,<BR> {@-योनिः@}, <i>m.</i>, {@-संभवः@}<BR>—1 epithets of Agastya; एतदाख्याय रामाय महर्षिः कुम्भसंभवः Rām. 7. 80. 1;<BR> प्रससादोदयादम्भः कुम्भयोनेर्महौजसः R. 4. 21, 15. 55.<BR>—2 an epithet of Droṇa, the military preceptor of the Kauravas and Pāṇḍavas.<BR>—3 an epithet of Vasiṣṭha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भसंभवः|कुम्भसम्भव|कुम्भसंभव|कुंभसंभव|कुम्भसम्भवः
कुम्भः + -जः, -जन्मन् <i>m.</i>,<BR> {@-योनिः@}, <i>m.</i>, {@-संभवः@}<BR>—1 epithets of Agastya; एतदाख्याय रामाय महर्षिः कुम्भसंभवः Rām. 7. 80. 1;<BR> प्रससादोदयादम्भः कुम्भयोनेर्महौजसः R. 4. 21, 15. 55.<BR>—2 an epithet of Droṇa, the military preceptor of the Kauravas and Pāṇḍavas.<BR>—3 an epithet of Vasiṣṭha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भजन्मन्|कुंभजन्मन्
कुम्भः + -जः, -जन्मन् <i>m.</i>,<BR> {@-योनिः@}, <i>m.</i>, {@-संभवः@}<BR>—1 epithets of Agastya; एतदाख्याय रामाय महर्षिः कुम्भसंभवः Rām. 7. 80. 1;<BR> प्रससादोदयादम्भः कुम्भयोनेर्महौजसः R. 4. 21, 15. 55.<BR>—2 an epithet of Droṇa, the military preceptor of the Kauravas and Pāṇḍavas.<BR>—3 an epithet of Vasiṣṭha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भदासी|कुंभदासी
कुम्भः + -दासी a bawd, procuress; sometimes used as a term of reproach or abuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भधरः|कुम्भधर
कुम्भः + -धरः the sign ef the zodiac called Aquarius.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भपञ्जरः
कुम्भः + -पञ्जरः a niche in the wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भराशिः|कुम्भराशि
कुम्भः + -राशिः the sign Aquarius.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भरेतस्
कुम्भः + -रेतस् <i>m.</i> a form of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भलग्नम्
कुम्भः + -लग्नम् that time of the day in which Aquarius rises above the horizon.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">Page0585-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0584-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भमण्डूकः|कुम्भमण्डूक|कुंभमंडूक
कुम्भः + -मण्डूकः<BR>—1 (lit.) a frog in a pitcher.<BR>—2 (fig.) an inexperienced man; cf. कूपमण्डूक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भशाला
कुम्भः + -शाला pottery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भसन्धिः|कुम्भसन्धि|कुम्भसंधि|कुंभसंधि
कुम्भः + -सन्धिः the hollow on the top of an elephantʼs head between the<BR> frontal globes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भकः|कुम्भक|कुंभक|कुंभकः
कुम्भकः<BR>—1 The base of a column (used especially in this sense frequently in inscriptions).<BR>—2 A religious exercise (in Yoga phil.), stopping the breath by closing<BR> the mouth and both nostrils with the fingers of the right hand; प्राणापानौ<BR> संनिरुन्ध्यात्पूरकुम्भकरेचकैः Bhāg. 7. 15. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भिका|कुंभिका
कुम्भिका<BR>—1 A small pot; गृहीत्वा जलकुम्भिकाम् Ks. 6. 41.<BR>—2 A harlot.<BR>—3 A disease of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भिन्|कुंभिन्
कुम्भिन्<BR>—1 An elephant; असौ कुम्भिभ्रान्त्या खरनखरविद्रावितमहागुरुग्रावग्रामः<BR> स्वपिति गिरिगर्भे हरिपतिः Bv. 1. 52.<BR>—2 A crocodile.<BR>—3 A fish.<BR>—4 A kind of poisonous insect.<BR>—5 A sort of fragrant resin (गुग्गुल).<BR>—6 The number eight.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुम्भिनरकः, कुम्भिमदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भिनरकः|कुम्भिनरक|कुंभिनरक
कुम्भिन् + -नरकः a particular hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भिमदः|कुम्भिमद|कुंभिमद
कुम्भिन् + -मदः rut, ichor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भिनी
कुम्भिनी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The earth.<BR>—2 N. of a plant Croton Tiglium (Mar. जेपाळ, जमालगोटा)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुम्भिनीफलम्, कुम्भिनीबीजम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भिनीफलम्
कुम्भिनी + -फलम् the fruit of the tree used as a strong purgative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भिनीबीजम्
कुम्भिनी + -बीजम् (see फलम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भिलः|कुम्भिल|कुंभिल|कुंभिलः
कुम्भिलः<BR>—1 A thief who breaks into a house.<BR>—2 A plagiarist.<BR>—3 A wifeʼs brother.<BR>—4 A child of an imperfect impregnation or born at undue seasons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भी
कुम्भी<BR>—1 A small water-jar; Rām. 2. 91. 72.<BR>—2 An earthen cooking vessel; आविष्कुर्वन्त्यखिलवचनेष्वत्र कुम्भीपुलाकन्यायाज्ज्योतिर्नयगतिविदां<BR> निश्चलं मानभावम् Viś. Guṇā. 534.<BR>—3 A measure of grain.<BR>—4 N. of several plants. like इभपाटला, वारिपर्णी, लघुदन्ती, जेपाळ, कायफळ &c.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुम्भीधान्यम्, कुम्भीधान्यकः, कुम्भीनसः, कुम्भीनसी, कुम्भीपाकः, कुम्भीमुखम्, कुम्भीवल्कम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीधान्यम्
कुम्भी + -धान्यम् grain stored in jars sufficient for six days.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीधान्यकः|कुम्भीधान्यक
कुम्भी + -धान्यकः a householder who stores grain; Ms. 4. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीनसः|कुम्भीनस|कुंभीनस
कुम्भी + -नसः a kind of venomous serpent; उद्वेल्लन्ति पुराणरोहिणतरुस्कन्धेषु<BR> कुम्भीनसाः U. 2. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीनसी
कुम्भी + -नसी mother of Lavaṇa and sister of Rāvaṇa; स च प्राप<BR> मधूपघ्नं कुम्भीनस्याश्च कुक्षिजः R. 15. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीपाकः|कुम्भीपाक|कुंभीपाक
कुम्भी + -पाकः<BR>—1 the contents of a cooking-vessel.<BR>—2 (sing. or pl.) a particular hell in which the wicked are baked like<BR> potterʼs vessels; Y. 3. 224; Ms. 12. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीमुखम्
कुम्भी + -मुखम् N. of a particular wound; Caraka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीवल्कम्
कुम्भी + -वल्कम् (Mar. कायफळ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीकः|कुम्भीक|कुंभीक|कुंभीकः
कुम्भीकः<BR>—1 The Punnāga tree.<BR>—2 A catamite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीका
कुम्भीकः + .{@-का@} Swelling of the eye-lids. see कुम्भिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीरः|कुम्भीर|कुंभीर|कुंभीरः
कुम्भीरः<BR>—1 A shark.<BR>—2 Crocodile; संवत्सरं तु कुम्भीरस्ततो जायेत मानवः Mb. 13. 111. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीरकः|कुम्भीरक|कुंभीरक|कुंभीरकः
कुम्भीरकः, कुम्भीलः, कुम्भीलकः A thief; लोप्त्रेण गृहीतस्य<BR> कुम्भीरकस्यास्ति वा प्रतिवचनम् V. 2; कुम्भीलकैः कामुकैश्च परिहर्तव्या<BR> चन्द्रिका M. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुम्भीरकमक्षिका, कुम्भीरकलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीलः|कुम्भील|कुंभील|कुंभीलः
कुम्भीरकः, कुम्भीलः, कुम्भीलकः A thief; लोप्त्रेण गृहीतस्य<BR> कुम्भीरकस्यास्ति वा प्रतिवचनम् V. 2; कुम्भीलकैः कामुकैश्च परिहर्तव्या<BR> चन्द्रिका M. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुम्भीरकमक्षिका, कुम्भीरकलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीलकः|कुम्भीलक|कुंभीलक|कुंभीलकः
कुम्भीरकः, कुम्भीलः, कुम्भीलकः A thief; लोप्त्रेण गृहीतस्य<BR> कुम्भीरकस्यास्ति वा प्रतिवचनम् V. 2; कुम्भीलकैः कामुकैश्च परिहर्तव्या<BR> चन्द्रिका M. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुम्भीरकमक्षिका, कुम्भीरकलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीरकमक्षिका
कुम्भीरकः + -मक्षिका N. of an acquatic creature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुम्भीलः|कुम्भील|कुंभील|कुंभीलः
कुम्भीरकः + -लः A crocodile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुर्
कुर् €6 P. (कुरति, कुरित) To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरङ्करः|कुरङ्कर|कुरंकर|कुरंकरः
कुरङ्करः, कुरङ्कुरः The (Indian) crane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरङ्कुरः|कुरङ्कुर|कुरंकुर|कुरंकुरः
कुरङ्करः, कुरङ्कुरः The (Indian) crane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरङ्गः|कुरङ्ग|कुरंग|कुरंगः
कुरङ्गः (-ङ्गी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 A deer in general; तन्मे ब्रूहि कुरङ्ग कुत्र भवता किं नाम तप्तं<BR> तपः Śānti. 1. 14, 4. 6; लवङ्गी कुरङ्गीदृगङ्गीकरोतु Jag.<BR>—2 A species of deer (कुरङ्ग ईषत्ताम्रः स्याद्धरिणाकृतिको महान्).<BR>—3 The spot in the moon.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुरङ्गाक्षी, कुरङ्गनयना, कुरङ्गनेत्रा, कुरङ्गनाभिः, कुरङ्गलाञ्छनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरङ्गाक्षी|कुरंगाक्षी
कुरङ्गः + -अक्षी, -नयना, -नेत्रा a deer-eyed woman; क्वासि प्रेयसि हा कुरङ्गनयने<BR> चन्द्रानने जानकि Pras. Rāgh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरङ्गनयना|कुरंगनयना
कुरङ्गः + -अक्षी, -नयना, -नेत्रा a deer-eyed woman; क्वासि प्रेयसि हा कुरङ्गनयने<BR> चन्द्रानने जानकि Pras. Rāgh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

