कुरवः|कुरव
कुरवः(बः), कुरव(ब)कः A species of amaranth; [Barlaria Prionitis<BR> Linn] It is a handsome shrub. Kālidāsa describes the plant as कान्तामुखद्युति<BR> (cf. Ṛs. 6. 18). Modern scientists describe it as a lipped flower referring<BR> to the form of its petals. कुरवका रवकारणतां ययुः R. 9. 29; Me. 80; Ṛs. 6. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

