कुरुः (pl.)<BR>—1 N. of a country situated in the north of India about the site of the<BR> modern Delhi; श्रियः कुरूणामधिपस्य पालनीम् Ki. 1. 1; चिराय तस्मिन्<BR> कुरवश्चकासति 1. 17.<BR>—2 The kings of this country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

