कुरुक्षेत्रियोगः
कुरुः + -क्षेत्रियोगः a solar day in the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">Page0586-1</a>]<BR> course of which three lunar days, three asterisms and three yogas occur.<BR> The yoga is indicative of death; पञ्चग्रहयुते मृत्यौ लग्नसंस्थे बृहस्पतौ ।<BR> सौम्यक्षेत्रगते लग्ने कुरुक्षेत्रे मृतिर्भवेत् ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

