कुरुविन्दः, -न्दम् (also कुरुविल्लः)<BR> A ruby; Śi. 9. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरुविल्लः|कुरुविल्ल
कुरुविन्दः, -न्दम् (also कुरुविल्लः)<BR> A ruby; Śi. 9. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुरुविन्दम्
कुरुविन्दः, -न्दम् (also कुरुविल्लः) + .{@-न्दम्@}<BR>—1 Black salt.<BR>—2 A mirror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुर्कुटः|कुर्कुट
कुर्कुटः<BR>—1 A cock.<BR>—2 Rubbish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुर्कुरः|कुर्कुर|कुर्क्कुर
कुर्कुरः A dog (Mbh. on P. VIII. 2. 78); उपकर्तुमपि प्राप्तं निःस्वं<BR> मन्यन्ति कुर्कुरम् Pt. 2. 94. (v. l.) denominative कुर्कुरायति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुर्चिका
कुर्चिका = कूर्चिका q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुर्द्
कुर्द्, कुर्दन See कूर्द, कूर्दन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुर्दन|कुर्द्दन|कुर्द्दनं
कुर्द्, कुर्दन See कूर्द, कूर्दन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुर्परः|कुर्पर
कु(कू)र्परः<BR>—1 The knee.<BR>—2 The elbow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्परः|कूर्पर|कूर्प्पर
कु(कू)र्परः<BR>—1 The knee.<BR>—2 The elbow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुर्पासः|कुर्पास
कु(कू)र्पासः, कु(कू)र्पासकः A sort of bodice<BR> worn by women; मनोज्ञकूर्पासकपीडितस्तनाः Ṛs. 5. 8, 4. 16, v. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्पासः|कूर्पास|कूर्प्पास
कु(कू)र्पासः, कु(कू)र्पासकः A sort of bodice<BR> worn by women; मनोज्ञकूर्पासकपीडितस्तनाः Ṛs. 5. 8, 4. 16, v. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुर्पासकः|कुर्पासक
कु(कू)र्पासः, कु(कू)र्पासकः A sort of bodice<BR> worn by women; मनोज्ञकूर्पासकपीडितस्तनाः Ṛs. 5. 8, 4. 16, v. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्पासकः|कूर्पासक|कूर्प्पासक
कु(कू)र्पासः, कु(कू)र्पासकः A sort of bodice<BR> worn by women; मनोज्ञकूर्पासकपीडितस्तनाः Ṛs. 5. 8, 4. 16, v. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुर्वत्|कुर्वन्त्|कुर्व्वत्
कुर्वत् <i>pres. p.</i> Doing &c.; ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A servant.<BR>—2 A shoemaker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुल्
कुल् €1 P. (कोलति, कुलित)<BR>—1 To accumulate, collect.<BR>—2 To be related; behave as a kinsman.<BR>—3 To proceed or go uninterruptedly. —4 To count, reckon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलम्
कुलम् —1 A race, family; निदानमिक्ष्वाकुकुलस्य संततेः R. 3. 1.<BR>—2 The residence of a family, a seat, house, an abode; ददर्श धीमान्स<BR> कपिः कुलानि Rām. 5. 5. 10; वसन्नृषिकुलेषु सः R. 12. 25.<BR>—3 A high or noble family, noble descent; कुले जन्म Pt. 5. 2; कुलशीलसमन्वितः<BR> Ms. 7. 54, 62; so कुलजा, कुलकन्यका &c.<BR>—4 A herd, troop, flock; collection, multitude; मृगकुलं रोमन्थमभ्यस्यतु<BR> Ś. 2. 6; U. 2. 9;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">Page0586-2</a>]<BR> अलिकुलसंकुल Gīt. 1; Śi. 9. 71; so गो˚, कृमि˚, महिषी˚ &c.<BR>—5 A lot, gang, band (in a bad sense).<BR>—6 A country.<BR>—7 The body.<BR>—8 The front or fore part.<BR>—9 A tribe, caste, community.<BR>—10 A blue stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलः|कुल|कुलं
कुलम् + .{@-लः@} The head of a guild or corporation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुला
कुलम् + .{@-ला@} See कुलतिथि.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुलाकुल, कुलाकुलतिथिः, कुलाकुलनक्षत्रम्, कुलाकुलवारः, कुलाङ्कुरः, कुलाङ्गना, कुलाङ्गारः, कुलाचलः, कुलाद्रिः, कुलपर्वतः, कुलशैलः, कुलान्वित, कुलाभिमानः, कुलाभिमानिन्, कुलाख्या, कुलाचारः, कुलकर्मन्, कुलधर्मः, कुलाचार्यः, कुलगुरुः, कुलाधारकः, कुलापीडः, कुलशेखरः, कुलालम्बिन्, कुलेश्वरः, कुलोत्कट, कुलोत्पन्न, कुलोद्गत, कुलोद्भव, कुलोद्वहः, कुलोपदेशः, कुलकज्जलः, कुलकण्टकः, कुलकन्यका, कुलकन्या, कुलकरः, कुलकर्तृ, कुलकरणिः, कुलकलङ्कः, कुलकलङ्कित, कुलक्षयः, कुलगरिमा, कुलगिरिः, कुलभूभृत्, कुलगृहम्, कुलघ्न, कुलज, कुलजात, कुलजनः, कुलजाया, कुलतन्तुः, कुलतिथिः, कुलतिलकः, कुलदीपः, कुलदीपकः, कुलदुहितृ, कुलदूषण, कुलदेवता, कुलधन, कुलधर्मः, कुलधारकः, कुलधुर्यः, कुलनन्दन, कुलनायिका, कुलनारी, कुलनाशः, कुलनाशनम्, कुलपरंपरा, कुलपतिः, कुलपांसन, कुलपांसुका, कुलपालकम्, कुलपालिः, कुलपालिका, कुलपाली, कुलपुत्रः, कुलपुत्री, कुलपुरुषः, कुलपूर्वगः, कुलपूर्वकः, कुलभरः, कुलबीजः, कुलभार्या, कुलभृत्या, कुलमर्यादा, कुलमार्गः, कुलयोषित्, कुलवधू, कुललक्षणम्, कुलवारः, कुलविद्या, कुलविप्रः, कुलवृद्धः, कुलव्रतः, कुलव्रतम्, कुलशीलम्, कुलश्रेष्ठिन्, कुलसंख्या, कुलसंततिः, कुलसन्निधिः, कुलसंभव,^1 कुलसेवकः, कुलस्त्री, कुलस्थितिः<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाकुल
कुलम् + -अकुल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of a mixed character or origin.<BR>—2 middling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाकुलतिथिः
कुलम् + -अकुल + ˚तिथिः <i>m., f.</i> the second, sixth, and the tenth lunar<BR> days of a fort-night in a mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाकुलनक्षत्रम्
कुलम् + -अकुल + ˚नक्षत्रम् N. of the lunar mansions<BR> आर्द्रा, मूला, अभिजित् and शतभिषा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाकुलवारः
कुलम् + -अकुल + ˚वारः Wednesday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाङ्कुरः|कुलाङ्कुर
कुलम् + -अङ्कुरः the scion of a family; अनेन कस्यापि कुलाङ्कुरेण स्पृष्टस्य<BR> गात्रेषु सुखं ममैवम् Ś. 7. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाङ्गना|कुलांगना
कुलम् + -अङ्गना a respectable or high born (chaste) woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाङ्गारः|कुलाङ्गार|कुलांगार
कुलम् + -अङ्गारः a man who ruins his family; Pt. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाचलः|कुलाचल
कुलम् + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -पर्वतः, -शैलः a principal mountain, one of<BR> a class of seven mountains which are supposed to exist in each division<BR> of the continent; their names are:− महेन्द्रो मलयः सह्यः शुक्तिमान्<BR> ऋक्षपर्वतः । विन्ध्यश्च पारियात्रश्च सप्तैते कुलपर्वताः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाद्रिः|कुलाद्रि
कुलम् + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -पर्वतः, -शैलः a principal mountain, one of<BR> a class of seven mountains which are supposed to exist in each division<BR> of the continent; their names are:− महेन्द्रो मलयः सह्यः शुक्तिमान्<BR> ऋक्षपर्वतः । विन्ध्यश्च पारियात्रश्च सप्तैते कुलपर्वताः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपर्वतः|कुलपर्वत|कुलपर्व्वत
कुलम् + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -पर्वतः, -शैलः a principal mountain, one of<BR> a class of seven mountains which are supposed to exist in each division<BR> of the continent; their names are:− महेन्द्रो मलयः सह्यः शुक्तिमान्<BR> ऋक्षपर्वतः । विन्ध्यश्च पारियात्रश्च सप्तैते कुलपर्वताः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलशैलः|कुलशैल
कुलम् + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -पर्वतः, -शैलः a principal mountain, one of<BR> a class of seven mountains which are supposed to exist in each division<BR> of the continent; their names are:− महेन्द्रो मलयः सह्यः शुक्तिमान्<BR> ऋक्षपर्वतः । विन्ध्यश्च पारियात्रश्च सप्तैते कुलपर्वताः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलान्वित
कुलम् + -अन्वित <i>a.</i> born in a noble family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाभिमानः|कुलाभिमान
कुलम् + -अभिमानः family pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाभिमानिन्
कुलम् + -अभिमानिन् <i>a.</i> proud of birth or family descent; कुलाभिमानी<BR> कुलजां नराधिपः Ki. 1. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाख्या
कुलम् + -आख्या family-name, surname; कुलाख्या लोके गोत्रावयवा इत्युच्यन्ते<BR> Mbh. on P. IV. 1. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाचारः|कुलाचार
कुलम् + -आचारः, -कर्मन् <i>n.</i>, {@-धर्मः@}<BR>. a duty or custom peculiar to a family or caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकर्मन्|कुलकर्म्मन्
कुलम् + -आचारः, -कर्मन् <i>n.</i>, {@-धर्मः@}<BR>. a duty or custom peculiar to a family or caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलधर्मः|कुलधर्म|कुलधर्म्म|कुलधर्म्मः
कुलम् + -आचारः, -कर्मन् <i>n.</i>, {@-धर्मः@}<BR>. a duty or custom peculiar to a family or caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाचार्यः|कुलाचार्य|कुलाचार्य्य|कुलाचार्य्यः
कुलम् + -आचार्यः, -गुरुः<BR>—1 a family priest or teacher.<BR>—2 a genealogist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलगुरुः|कुलगुरु
कुलम् + -आचार्यः, -गुरुः<BR>—1 a family priest or teacher.<BR>—2 a genealogist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलाधारकः|कुलाधारक
कुलम् + -आधारकः a son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलापीडः|कुलापीड
कुलम् + -आपीडः, -शेखरः the glory of a family; तस्मिन्कुलापीडनिभे<BR> विपीडं सम्यग्महीं शासति शासनाङ्काम् R. 18. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलशेखरः|कुलशेखर
कुलम् + -आपीडः, -शेखरः the glory of a family; तस्मिन्कुलापीडनिभे<BR> विपीडं सम्यग्महीं शासति शासनाङ्काम् R. 18. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलालम्बिन्|कुलालंबिन्
कुलम् + -आलम्बिन् <i>a.</i> maintaining a family. वरमेकः कुलालम्बी यत्र<BR> विश्रूयते पिता H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलेश्वरः|कुलेश्वर
कुलम् + -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 the chief of a family.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलेश्वरा
कुलम् + -ईश्वरः + .({@-रा@}) N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलोत्कट|कुलोत्कटः
कुलम् + -उत्कट, <i>a.</i> high born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलोत्कटः|कुलोत्कट
कुलम् + -उत्कट + ({@-टः@}) a horse of a good breed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलोत्पन्न
कुलम् + -उत्पन्न, -उद्गत, -उद्भव <i>a.</i> sprung from a noble family,<BR> highborn; अमात्यमुख्यं धर्मज्ञं प्राज्ञं दान्तं कुलोद्भवम् Ms. 7. 141.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलोद्गत
कुलम् + -उत्पन्न, -उद्गत, -उद्भव <i>a.</i> sprung from a noble family,<BR> highborn; अमात्यमुख्यं धर्मज्ञं प्राज्ञं दान्तं कुलोद्भवम् Ms. 7. 141.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलोद्भव
कुलम् + -उत्पन्न, -उद्गत, -उद्भव <i>a.</i> sprung from a noble family,<BR> highborn; अमात्यमुख्यं धर्मज्ञं प्राज्ञं दान्तं कुलोद्भवम् Ms. 7. 141.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलोद्वहः|कुलोद्वह
कुलम् + -उद्वहः the head or perpetuator of a family; see उद्वह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलोपदेशः|कुलोपदेश
कुलम् + -उपदेशः a family name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकज्जलः|कुलकज्जल
कुलम् + -कज्जलः one who is a disgrace to his family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकण्टकः|कुलकण्टक|कुलकंटक
कुलम् + -कण्टकः one who is a thorn or trouble to his family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकन्यका
कुलम् + -कन्यका, -कन्या a girl of high birth; विशुद्धमुग्धः कुलकन्यकाजनः<BR> Māl. 7. 1; गृहे गृहे पुरुषाः कुलकन्यकाः समुद्वहन्ति Māl. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकन्या
कुलम् + -कन्यका, -कन्या a girl of high birth; विशुद्धमुग्धः कुलकन्यकाजनः<BR> Māl. 7. 1; गृहे गृहे पुरुषाः कुलकन्यकाः समुद्वहन्ति Māl. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकरः|कुलकर
कुलम् + -करः, -कर्तृ <i>m.</i> the founder of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकर्तृ
कुलम् + -करः, -कर्तृ <i>m.</i> the founder of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकरणिः|कुलकरणि
कुलम् + -करणिः A hereditary clerk or officer; EI. XV. 91.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकलङ्कः|कुलकलङ्क|कुलकलंक
कुलम् + -कलङ्कः one who is a disgrace to his family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकलङ्कित
कुलम् + -कलङ्कित <i>a.</i> causing disgrace to a family; न चाप्यहं<BR> गमिष्यामि कथां कुलकलङ्किताम् Ks. 22. 216.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलक्षयः|कुलक्षय
कुलम् + -क्षयः<BR>—1 ruin of a family.<BR>—2 extinction of a family; कुलक्षयकृतं दोषं मित्रद्रोहे च पातकम् Bg. 1. 39, 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलगरिमा
कुलम् + -गरिमा <i>m.</i> family pride or dignity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलगिरिः|कुलगिरि
कुलम् + -गिरिः, -भूभृत् <i>m.</i>, {@-पर्वतः, -शैलः@}<BR> see कुलाचल above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलभूभृत्
कुलम् + -गिरिः, -भूभृत् <i>m.</i>, {@-पर्वतः, -शैलः@}<BR> see कुलाचल above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलगृहम्
कुलम् + -गृहम् a noble house; पर्याकुलं कुलगृहेऽपि कृतं वधूनाम् Ṛs. 6. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलघ्न
कुलम् + -घ्न <i>a.</i> ruining a family; दोषैरेतैः कुलघ्नानाम् Bg. 1. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलज|कुलजः
कुलम् + -ज, -जात <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-born, of high birth; प्रदाने हि मुनिश्रेष्ठ कुलं निरवशेषतः ।<BR> वक्तव्यं कुलजातेन तन्निबोध महामते ॥ Rām. 1. 71. 2.<BR>—2 ancestral, hereditary; Ki. 1. 31 (used in both senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलजात
कुलम् + -ज, -जात <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-born, of high birth; प्रदाने हि मुनिश्रेष्ठ कुलं निरवशेषतः ।<BR> वक्तव्यं कुलजातेन तन्निबोध महामते ॥ Rām. 1. 71. 2.<BR>—2 ancestral, hereditary; Ki. 1. 31 (used in both senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलजनः|कुलजन
कुलम् + -जनः a high-born or distinguished person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलजाया
कुलम् + -जाया <i>f.</i> a^1 high-born lady; कुलजाया सा जाया केवलजाया तु<BR> केवलं माया Udb.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by . Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/6b5cd78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलतन्तुः|कुलतन्तु|कुलतंतु
कुलम् + -तन्तुः one who continues or perpetuates a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलतिथिः|कुलतिथि
कुलम् + -तिथिः <i>m., f.</i> an<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">Page0587-1</a>]<BR> important lunar day, <i>viz.</i>:− the 4th, 8th, 12th or 14th of a lunar fort-night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलतिलकः|कुलतिलक
कुलम् + -तिलकः the glory of a family, one who does honour to his family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलदीपः|कुलदीप
कुलम् + -दीपः, -दीपकः the glory of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलदीपकः|कुलदीपक
कुलम् + -दीपः, -दीपकः the glory of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलदुहितृ
कुलम् + -दुहितृ <i>f.</i> also कुलपुत्री; cf. P. VI. 3. 70; Vārt. 9;<BR> see कुलकन्या.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलदूषण
कुलम् + -दूषण <i>a.</i> disgracing oneʼs family; Mk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलदेवता
कुलम् + -देवता a tutelary deity; the guardian deity of a family; तामर्चिताभ्यः<BR> कुलदेवताभ्यः कुलप्रतिष्ठां प्रणमय्य माता Ku. 7. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलधन
कुलम् + -धन <i>a.</i> one whose wealth is the preservation of the good<BR> name of the family; कष्टो जनः कुलधनैरनुरञ्जनीयः U. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलधनम्
कुलम् + -धन + .({@-नम्@}) the dearest and most valued treasure of the family; इक्ष्वाकूणां<BR> कुलधनमिदं यत्समाराधनीयः U. 7. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलधर्मः|कुलधर्म|कुलधर्म्म|कुलधर्म्मः
कुलम् + -धर्मः a family custom, a duty or custom peculiar to a family;<BR> उत्सन्नकुलधर्माणां मनुष्याणां जनार्दन Bg. 1. 44; Ms. 1. 118, 8. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलधारकः|कुलधारक
कुलम् + -धारकः a son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलधुर्यः|कुलधुर्य|कुलधुर्य्य
कुलम् + -धुर्यः (a son) able to support a family, a grown-up son; न<BR> हि सति कुलधुर्ये सूर्यवंश्या गृहाय R. 7. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलनन्दन|कुलनंदन
कुलम् + -नन्दन <i>a.</i> gladdening or doing honour to a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलनायिका
कुलम् + -नायिका a girl worshipped at the celebration of the orgies of<BR> the left-hand Śāktas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलनारी
कुलम् + -नारी a high bred and virtuous woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलनाशः|कुलनाश
कुलम् + -नाशः<BR>—1 ruin or extinction of a family.<BR>—2 an apostate, reprobate, outcast.<BR>—3 a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलनाशनम्
कुलम् + -नाशनम् conducive to the extinction of the family; मुसलं<BR> कुलनाशनम् Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपरंपरा|कुलपरम्परा
कुलम् + -परंपरा the series of generations comprising a race.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपतिः|कुलपति
कुलम् + -पतिः<BR>—1 the head or chief of a family.<BR>—2 a sage who feeds and teaches 10,000 pupils; thus defined:− मुनीनां<BR> दशसाहस्रं योऽन्नदानादिपोषणात् । अध्यापयति विप्रर्षिरसौ कुलपतिः स्मृतः<BR> ॥ अपि नाम कुलपतेरियमसवर्णक्षेत्रसंभवा स्यात् Ś. 1; R. 1. 95; U. 3. 48.<BR>—3 The head-servant (Gīrvāṇa.); Bhāg. 5. 18. 1.<BR>—4 N. of Kṛṣṇa; कुन्दस्रजः कुलपतेरिह वाति गन्धः Bhāg. 10. 30. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपांसन
कुलम् + -पांसन <i>a.</i> one who disgraces oneʼs family; इत्युक्तः स<BR> खलः पापो भोजानां कुलपांसनः Bhāg. 10. 1. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपांसुका
कुलम् + -पांसुका a woman disgracing her family, an unchaste woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपालकम्
कुलम् + -पालकम् an orange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपालिः|कुलपालि
कुलम् + -पालिः, -पालिका, -पाली <i>f.</i> a chaste or high-born woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपालिका
कुलम् + -पालिः, -पालिका, -पाली <i>f.</i> a chaste or high-born woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपाली
कुलम् + -पालिः, -पालिका, -पाली <i>f.</i> a chaste or high-born woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपुत्रः|कुलपुत्र
कुलम् + -पुत्रः a nobly-born youth; इह सर्वस्वफलिनः कुलपुत्रमहाद्रुमाः Mk. 4. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपुत्री
कुलम् + -पुत्री (See -दुहितृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपुरुषः|कुलपुरुष
कुलम् + -पुरुषः<BR>—1 a respectable or high-born man; कश्चुम्बति कुलपुरुषो वेश्याधरपल्लवं<BR> मनोज्ञमपि Bh. 1. 59.<BR>—2 an ancestor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपूर्वगः|कुलपूर्वग
कुलम् + -पूर्वगः, -पूर्वकः an ancestor. तवापि सुमहाभागे जनेन्द्रकुलपूर्वकम्<BR> (v. l. जनेन्द्राः कुलपूर्वगाः) Rām. 2. 73. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलपूर्वकः|कुलपूर्वक
कुलम् + -पूर्वगः, -पूर्वकः an ancestor. तवापि सुमहाभागे जनेन्द्रकुलपूर्वकम्<BR> (v. l. जनेन्द्राः कुलपूर्वगाः) Rām. 2. 73. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलभरः
कुलम् + -भरः (कुलंभरः) One who maintains the family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलबीजः|कुलबीज
कुलम् + -बीजः the head or chief of a guild.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलभार्या
कुलम् + -भार्या a virtuous wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलभृत्या
कुलम् + -भृत्या the nursing of a pregnant woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलमर्यादा|कुलमर्य्यादा
कुलम् + -मर्यादा family honour or respectability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलमार्गः|कुलमार्ग
कुलम् + -मार्गः<BR>—1 a family custom, the best way or the way of honesty.<BR>—2 the doctrine of the Kaulas (कौलमार्ग).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलयोषित्
कुलम् + -योषित्, -वधू <i>f.</i> a woman of good family and character. त्यागिनां<BR> कुलयोषिताम् Ms. 3. 245; ब्रूते ब्रूते व्रजकुलवधूः कापि साध्वी ममाग्रे Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलवधू
कुलम् + -योषित्, -वधू <i>f.</i> a woman of good family and character. त्यागिनां<BR> कुलयोषिताम् Ms. 3. 245; ब्रूते ब्रूते व्रजकुलवधूः कापि साध्वी ममाग्रे Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुललक्षणम्
कुलम् + -लक्षणम् The characteristics of a noble family; आचारो विनयो<BR> विद्या प्रतिष्ठा तीर्थदर्शनम् । निष्ठा वृत्तिस्तपो दानं नवधा कुललक्षणम् ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलवारः|कुलवार
कुलम् + -वारः a principal day; (<i>i. e.</i> Tuesday and Friday).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलविद्या
कुलम् + -विद्या<BR>—1 knowledge handed down in a family, traditional knowledge.<BR>—2 one of the three आन्वीक्षिकी lores.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलविप्रः|कुलविप्र
कुलम् + -विप्रः a family-priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलवृद्धः|कुलवृद्ध
कुलम् + -वृद्धः an old and experienced member of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलव्रतः|कुलव्रत
कुलम् + -व्रतः, -व्रतम् a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">Page0587-2</a>]<BR> family vow; गलितवयसामिक्ष्वाकूणामिदं हि कुलव्रतम् R. 3. 70; विश्वस्मिन्नधुनाऽन्यः<BR> कुलव्रतं पालयिष्यति कः Bv. 1. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलव्रतम्
कुलम् + -व्रतः, -व्रतम् a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">Page0587-2</a>]<BR> family vow; गलितवयसामिक्ष्वाकूणामिदं हि कुलव्रतम् R. 3. 70; विश्वस्मिन्नधुनाऽन्यः<BR> कुलव्रतं पालयिष्यति कः Bv. 1. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलशीलम्
कुलम् + -शीलम् character or conduct honourable to a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलश्रेष्ठिन्
कुलम् + -श्रेष्ठिन् <i>a.</i> well-born, of a good family. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 the chief of a family or a guild.<BR>—2 an artisan of noble birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलसंख्या|कुलसङ्ख्या
कुलम् + -संख्या<BR>—1 family-respectability.<BR>—2 inclusion among respectable families; कुलसंख्यां च गच्छन्ति कर्षन्ति<BR> च महायशः Ms. 3. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलसंततिः|कुलसन्तति|कुलसंतति
कुलम् + -संततिः <i>f.</i> posterity, descendants, continuation of a lineage;<BR> दिवं गतानि विप्राणामकृत्वा कुलसंततिम् Ms. 5. 159.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलसन्निधिः|कुलसन्निधि|कुलसंनिधि
कुलम् + -सन्निधिः <i>m.</i> the presence of witnesses; Ms. 8. 194, 201.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलसंभव|कुलसम्भव|कुलसम्भवः
कुलम् + -संभव^1 <i>a.</i> of a respectable family.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलसेवकः|कुलसेवक
कुलम् + -सेवकः an excellent servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलस्त्री
कुलम् + -स्त्री a woman of good family, a noble woman; अधर्माभिभवात् कृष्ण<BR> प्रदुष्यन्ति कुलस्त्रियः Bg. 1. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलस्थितिः|कुलस्थिति
कुलम् + -स्थितिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 antiquity or prosperity of a family<BR>—2 family observance or custom; U. 5. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलक|कुलकं|कुलकः
कुलक <i>a.</i> Of good family, of good birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकः|कुलक|कुलकं
कुलक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 The chief of a guild.<BR>—2 Any artisan of eminent birth.<BR>—3 An ant-hill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलकम्
कुलक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A collection, multitude. रोमपुलककुलकः Bhāg. 5. 7. 12.<BR>—2 A number of verses in grammatical connection; (the number of verses<BR> ranging from 5 to 15 and the whole forming one sentence); <i>e. g.</i> see<BR> Śi. 1. 4-10; R. 1. 5-9; so Ku. 1. 1-16.<BR>—3 A kind of prose composition with few compounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलतः
कुलतः <i>ind.</i> By birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलंधर
कुलंधर <i>a.</i> One who continues or perpetuates a family; युधिष्ठिरो<BR> लब्धराज्यो दृष्ट्वा पौत्रं कुलंधरम् Bhāg. 1. 13. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलंभरः|कुलम्भर|कुलंभर|कुलम्भरः
कुलंभरः, -लः<BR> A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलंभलः|कुलम्भल
कुलंभरः, -लः<BR> A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलमितिका
कुलमितिका A variety of carpets; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलवत्|कुलवन्त्
कुलवत् <i>a.</i> Of respectable birth or origin; nobly born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलिक|कुलिकः
कुलिक <i>a.</i> Of a good family, well-born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलिकः|कुलिक
कुलिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A kinsman; Y. 2. 233.<BR>—2 The chief or head of a guild.<BR>—3 An artist of high birth.<BR>—4 A hunter; कुलिकरुतमिवाज्ञाः कृष्णवध्वो हरिण्यः Bhāg. 10. 47. 19.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुलिकवेला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलिकवेला
कुलिक + -वेला certain portions of time on each day on which it is improper<BR> to begin any good business.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलिन्
कुलिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) Of good family, high-born. ━<i>m.</i> A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुली
कुली <i>f.</i> A group of families; दशकुलीं वा गोपः Kau. A.;<BR> दशकुलीवाटं कूपस्थानम् Kau. A. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलीन|कुलीनः
कुलीन <i>a.</i> [कुले जातः ख]<BR>—1 Of high descent, of a good family, well-born; दिव्ययोषितमिवाकुलीनाम्<BR> K. 11; न वै सोम्यास्मत्कुलीनः Ch. Up. 6. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलीनः|कुलीन
कुलीन + .{@-नः@} A horse of good breed.<BR>—2 A worshipper of Śakti according to the left-hand ritual.<BR>—3 A Brāhmaṇa of the highest class in Bengal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलीनम्
कुलीन + .{@-नम्@} A disease of the nails, Bhāg. 7. 6. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुल्य|कुल्यं|कुल्यः
कुल्य <i>a.</i> [कुल-यत्]<BR>—1 Relating to a family, race, or corporation.<BR>—2 Well-born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुल्यः|कुल्य|कुल्यं
कुल्य + .{@-ल्यः@} A respectable man. ˚मातृबन्धुकुल्यगुणवत् सामन्तानामन्यतमेन˚ Kau. A. 1. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुल्यम्
कुल्य + .{@-ल्यम्@}<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-1" target="_blank">Page0588-1</a>]<BR>—1 Friendly inquiry after family affairs (condolence, congratulation &c.).<BR>—2 A bone; ‘अस्थि कुल्यं स्यात्’ Ratnamālā; Mv. 2. 16.<BR>—3 Flesh.<BR>—4 A winnowing basket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुल्या
कुल्य + .{@-ल्या@}<BR>—1 A virtuous woman.<BR>—2 A small river, canal, stream; कुल्याम्भोभिः पवनचपलैः शाखिनो धौतमूलाः<BR> Ś. 1. 15; कुल्येवोद्यानपादपान् R. 12. 3, 7. 49; U. 3. 23, शाल्यर्थं<BR> कुल्याः प्रणीयन्ते Mbh. on P. VI. 1. 50.<BR>—3 A dike, trench.<BR>—4 A measure of grain equal to 8 droṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलक्कः|कुलक्क
कुलक्कः<BR>—1 A cymbal.<BR>—2 Beating time in music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलटः|कुलट
कुलटः Any son except own, an adopted son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलटा
कुलटः + .{@-टा@} [कुलात्कुलान्तरम् अटति शकन्ध्वादि P. VI. 1. 94. Vārt.]<BR> An unchaste woman; उच्छिन्नाश्रयकातरेव कुलटा गोत्रान्तरं श्रीर्गता<BR> Mu. 6. 5; Y. 1. 215. यथेष्टं चेष्टन्ते स्फुटकुचतटाः पश्य कुलटाः Udb.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुलटापतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलटापतिः
कुलटा + -पतिः a cuckold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलत्थः|कुलत्थ
कुलत्थः A kind of pulse; Mb. 13. 111. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलत्थिका
कुलत्थः + .{@-त्थिका@} A blue stone used as a collyrium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलहण्डकः|कुलहण्डक|कुलहंडकः
