कुलाहकः|कुलाहक
कुलाहकः A lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुलिः|कुलि
