कुवलयम्<BR>—1 The blue water-lily; कुवलयदलस्निग्धैरङ्गैर्ददौ नयनोत्सवम् U. 3. 22.<BR>—2 A water-lily in general.<BR>—3 The earth. ━(<i>m.</i> also).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुवलयानन्द, कुवलयेशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवलयानन्द
कुवलयम् + -आनन्द N. of a work on rhetoric by अप्पय्या दीक्षित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवलयेशः|कुवलयेश
कुवलयम् + -ईशः a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवलयिन्
कुवलयिन् <i>a.</i> Having blue lotuses. संदृष्टाः कुवलयिनो भुवो<BR> विभागाः U. 1. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवलयित
कुवलयित <i>a.</i> Furnished with blue lotuses; कटाक्षैर्नारीणां<BR> कुवलयितवातायनमिव Māl. 2. 11; R. 11. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवलयिनी
कुवलयिनी<BR>—1 The blue water-lily; plant.<BR>—2 An assemblage of lotuses.<BR>—3 A place abounding in lotuses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवली
कुवली (= कोली; see बदरी); कुवली कुवलम् । बदरी बादरम्<BR> Mbh. on P. IV. 3. 130.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवाटः|कुवाट
कुवाटः The fold of a door.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवाद|कुवादः
कुवाद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Detracting, undervaluing, censorious.<BR>—2 Low, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवाहुलः|कुवाहुल
कुवाहुलः A camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुविन्दः|कुविन्द|कुविंद|कुविंदः
कुवि(पि)न्दः<BR>—1 A weaver; कुविन्दस्त्वं तावत्पटयसि गुणग्राममभितः K. P. 7.<BR>—2 N. of the weaver caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुपिन्दः|कुपिन्द|कुपिंद|कुपिंदः
कुवि(पि)न्दः<BR>—1 A weaver; कुविन्दस्त्वं तावत्पटयसि गुणग्राममभितः K. P. 7.<BR>—2 N. of the weaver caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवेणी
कुवे(णा)णी (णिः)<BR>—1 A basket to hold fish (when caught), fish-basket.<BR>—2 A badly arranged tress of hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवेणा
कुवे(णा)णी (णिः)<BR>—1 A basket to hold fish (when caught), fish-basket.<BR>—2 A badly arranged tress of hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवेणिः|कुवेणि
कुवे(णा)णी (णिः)<BR>—1 A basket to hold fish (when caught), fish-basket.<BR>—2 A badly arranged tress of hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवेर|कुवेरः
कुवे(बे)र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bad.<BR>—2 Bad-limbed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुबेर|कुबेरः
कुवे(बे)र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bad.<BR>—2 Bad-limbed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुवेलम्
कुवेलम् A lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुश|कुशं|कुशः
कुश^1 <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wicked, vile, depraved.<BR>—2 Mad.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशः|कुश|कुशं
कुशः + .{@-शः@}<BR>—1 A kind of grass considered holy and forming an essential requisite<BR> of several religious ceremonies; पवित्रार्थे इमे कुशाः Śrāddha Mantra;<BR> कुशपूतं प्रवयास्तु विष्टरम् R. 8. 18, 1. 49, 95.<BR>—2 N. of the elder son of Rāma. [He was one of the twin sons of Rāma,<BR> born after Sītā had been ruthlessly abandoned in the forest; yet he<BR> was the elder of the two in point of first seeing the light of this world.<BR> He, with Lava was brought up by the sage Vālmīki, and the two boys were<BR> taught to repeat the Rāmāyaṇa, the epic of the poet. Kuśa was made<BR> by Rāma king of Kuśāvatī, and he lived there for some time after his<BR> fatherʼs death. But the presiding deity of the old capital Ayodhyā presented<BR> herself to him in his dream and besought him not to slight her. Kuśa<BR> then returned to Ayodhya; see R. 16. 3-42.]<BR>—3 A rope of Kuśa grass for connecting the yoke of a plough with the pole.<BR>—4 One of the great Dvīpas; Bhāg. 5. 1. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशा
कुशः + .{@-शा@}<BR>—1 A plank for covering anything.<BR>—2 A piece of wood. —3 A horseʼs bridle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशी
कुशः + .{@-शी@} A sort of ladle.<BR>—2 Wrought iron.<BR>—3 Ploughshare.<BR>—4 A pod of cotton.<BR>—5 A piece of Udumbara wood used for counting the number of Sāmans in<BR> a Stotra; औदुम्बरे स्त्रियाम् । छन्दोगस्तोत्रगणनाशङ्कासु … … Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशम्
कुशः + .{@-शम्@} Water; as in कुशेशय q. v. ह्रदश्च कुशवानेष यत्र<BR> पद्मं कुशेशयम् Mb. 3. 130. 18.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुशाक्षः, कुशाग्रम्, कुशाग्रीय, कुशाङ्गुली, कुशाङ्गुरीयम्, कुशारणिः, कुशाकरः, कुशासनम्, कुशोदकम्, कुशकण्डिका, कुशचीरम्, कुशध्वजः, कुशमुष्टिः, कुशस्थलम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाक्षः|कुशाक्ष
कुशः + -अक्षः a monkey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाग्रम्
कुशः + -अग्रम् the sharp point of a blade of the Kuśa grass; hence often<BR> used in comp. in the sense of ‘sharp’, ‘shrewd’, ‘penetrating’ as intellect.<BR> ˚बुद्धि <i>a.</i> having a penetrating intellect,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">Page0589-2</a>]<BR> sharp, shrewd; (अपि) कुशाग्रबुद्धे कशली गुरुस्ते R. 5. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाग्रीय
कुशः + -अग्रीय <i>a.</i> penetrating, sharp; करु बुद्धिं कुशाग्रीयां … …<BR> Bk. 5. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाङ्गुली
कुशः + -अङ्गुली, -अङ्गुरीयम् a ring of Kuśa grass worn at religious ceremonies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाङ्गुरीयम्
कुशः + -अङ्गुली, -अङ्गुरीयम् a ring of Kuśa grass worn at religious ceremonies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशारणिः|कुशारणि
कुशः + -अरणिः N. of Durvāsas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशाकरः|कुशाकर
कुशः + -आकरः the sacrificial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशासनम्
कुशः + -आसनम् a seat or mat of Kuśa grass; अक्षमालापवृत्तिज्ञा कुशासनपरिग्रहा ।<BR> शांभवीव तनुः कस्य न वन्द्या दौर्जनी सभा ॥ Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशोदकम्
कुशः + -उदकम् water in which Kuśa grass has been infused; Ms. 11. 212.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशकण्डिका
कुशः + -कण्डिका <i>f.</i> a type of संस्कार of the Vedic sacrificial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशचीरम्
कुशः + -चीरम् a garment of Kuśa grass; (प्रगृह्य) कैकेय्याः कुशचीरे<BR> ते जानकी शुभलक्षणा Rām. 2. 37. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशध्वजः|कुशध्वज
कुशः + -ध्वजः the younger brother of Janaka; तौ कुशध्वजसुते सुमध्यमे R. 11. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशमुष्टिः|कुशमुष्टि
कुशः + -मुष्टिः <i>f.</i> a handful of Kuśa grass कुशमुष्टिमुपादाय लवं<BR> चैव तु स द्विजः Rām. 7. 66. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशस्थलम्
कुशः + -स्थलम् N. of a place in the North of India; perhaps Kanoj; Ve. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशस्थली
कुशः + -स्थलम् + .({@-ली@}) N. of the town Dvārakā. रथं समारोप्य ययुः कुशस्थलीम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 61. 41.<BR>—2 N. of the town उज्जयिनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशयः|कुशय
कुशयः, कुशपः A drinking vessel, cup, goblet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशपः|कुशप
कुशयः, कुशपः A drinking vessel, cup, goblet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशिन्
कुशिन् <i>a.</i> Mixed or combined with water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशिन्
कुशिन् <i>a.</i> Furnished with Kuśa grass. ━<i>m.</i> An epithet of Vālmīki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशेशयम्
कुशेशयम् A water-lily, a lotus in general; भूयात्कुशेशयरजोमृदुरेणुरस्याः<BR> (पन्थाः) Ś. 4. 10; R. 6. 18. कुशेशयैरत्र जलाशयोषिता Śi. 4. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशेशयः|कुशेशय|कुशेशयं
कुशेशयम् + .{@-यः@} The (Indian) crane or Sārasa bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशल|कुशलं|कुशलः
कुशल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Right, proper, good, auspicious; कुशलं खलु तुभ्यमेव तद्वचनं<BR> कृष्ण यदभ्यधामहम् Śi. 16. 41; न द्वेष्टपकुशलं कर्म कुशले<BR> नानुषज्यते Bg. 18. 10.<BR>—2 Happy, prosperous.<BR>—3 Able, skilful, clever, proficient, well-versed; कृतान्तः कुशलः<BR> पुत्र येनास्मि व्यसनीकृतः Rām. 7. 54. 16 with loc. or in comp.; दण्डनीत्यां<BR> च कुशलम् Y. 1. 313, 2. 181; Ms. 7. 190; R. 3. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलम्
कुशल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 Welfare, a happy or prosperous condition, happiness; पप्रच्छ कुशलं<BR> राज्ये राज्याश्रममुनिं मुनिः R. 1. 58; अव्यापन्नः कुशलमबले पृच्छति<BR> त्वाम् Me. 103; अपि कुशलं भवतः ‘are you doing well’ (how do you do?).<BR>—2 Virtue.<BR>—3 Cleverness, ability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलः|कुशल|कुशलं
कुशल + .{@-लः@} An epithet of Śiva.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुशलकाम, कुशलप्रश्नः, कुशलबुद्धि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलकाम
कुशल + -काम <i>a.</i> desirous of happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलप्रश्नः|कुशलप्रश्न
कुशल + -प्रश्नः friendly inquiry after a personʼs health or welfare;<BR> cf. ब्राह्मणं कुशलं पृच्छेत् क्षत्रबन्धुमनामयम् । वैश्यं क्षेमं समागम्य<BR> शूद्रमारोग्यमेव च ॥ Ms. 2. 127; cf. also मयाप्तं रामत्वं कुशलवसुता<BR> न त्वधिगता । S. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलबुद्धि
कुशल + -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> wise, intelligent, shrewd, sharp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलता
कुशलता<BR>—1 Cleverness, ability, conversancy with (loc.).<BR>—2 Acuteness of sensation; यथा यथा निषेवन्ते विषयान्विषयात्मकाः ।<BR> तथा तथा कुशलता तेषां तेषूपजायते ॥ Ms. 12. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशलिन्
कुशलिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Happy, doing well, prosperous; अथ भगवांल्लोकानुग्रहाय कुशली काश्यपः<BR> Ś. 5; R. 5; Me. 114. कुशलिनी वत्सस्य वार्तापि नो । S. D.<BR>—2 Of lower caste; ‘कुशलिनं कारुकं चण्डालविशेषमित्यर्थः’ Nīlakaṇṭhaʼs<BR> commentary on Mb. 12. 291. 7. [पापानुबन्धं यत्कर्म यद्यपि स्यान्महाफलम् ।<BR> तन्न सेवेत मेधावी शुचिः कुशलिनं यथा ॥]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशा
कुशा<BR>—1 A rope.<BR>—2 A bridle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशावती
कुशावती N. of a city; The Capital of Kuśa, Rāmaʼs son; see कुश;<BR> cf. कुशावतीं श्रोत्रियसात् स कृत्वा R. 16. 25, 15. 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशिक|कुशिकः
कुशिक <i>a.</i> Squint-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशिकः|कुशिक
कुशिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 N. of the father or the grand-father of विश्वामित्र.<BR>—2 A plough-share.<BR>—3 (pl.) Descendants of Kuśika; Bhāg. 9. 15. 6.<BR>—4 Sediment of oil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशीदम्
कुशीदम् Usury; see कुसी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशीलवः|कुशीलव
कुशीलवः<BR>—1 A bard, singer; Ms. 8. 65, 102; cf. also … कारूकाश्च कुशीलवाः ।<BR> Śiva B. 31. 18; also Kau. A. 1. 12.<BR>—2 An actor; तत्सर्वे कुशीलवाः संगीतप्रयोगेण मत्समीहितसंपादनाय<BR> प्रवर्तन्ताम् Māl. 1; तत्किमिति नारम्भयसि कुशीलवैः सह संगीतकम् Ve. 1.<BR>—3 A news-monger.<BR>—4 An epithet of Vālmīki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशीलवौ
कुशीलवः + .{@-वौ@} (du.) The two sons of Rāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशुम्भः|कुशुम्भ|कुशुंभ|कुशुंभः
कुशुम्भः The water-pot of an ascetic; or a jar in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशूलः|कुशूल
कुशूलः<BR>—1 A granary, cupboard, store-room; को धन्यो बहुभिः पुत्रैः कूशूलापूरणाढकैः H. Pr. 20.<BR>—2 A fire made of chaff.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुशूलधान्यकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुशूलधान्यकः|कुशूलधान्यक
कुशूलः + -धान्यकः a householder who has three yearsʼ grain in stock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुश्रिः|कुश्रि
कुश्रिः N. of a sage; उपवेशिः कुश्रेः Bṛ. Up. 6. 5. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्
कुष् €9 P. (कुष्णाति, कुषित)<BR>—1 To tear, extract, pull or draw out; शिवाः कुष्णन्ति मांसानि Bk. 18. 12, 17. 80;<BR> कुषित्वा जगतां सारं सैका शङ्के कृता भुवि 7. 95.<BR>—2 To test, examine.<BR>—3 To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषल|कुषलः
कुषल <i>a.</i> Clever, expert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषाकु|कुषाकुः
कुषाकु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Burning, scorching.<BR>—2 Vile, wicked, detestable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषाकुः|कुषाकु
कुषाकु + .{@-कुः@}<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 Fire.<BR>—3 An ape, monkey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषित|कुषितः
कुषित <i>a.</i> Mixed with water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषीद|कुषीदं
कुषीद <i>a.</i> Indifferent, inert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषीदम्
कुषीद + .{@-दम्@} Usury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुषुभ्यति
कुषुभ्यति Den. P.<BR>—1 To throw.<BR>—2 To abuse. —3 To despise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठः|कुष्ठ|कुष्ठं
कुष्ठः, -ष्ठम्<BR> [Uṇ. 2. 2]<BR>—1 Leprosy (of which there are 18 varieties); गलत्कुष्ठाभिभूताय च Bh. 1. 90.<BR>—2 A sort of poison.<BR>—3 A kind of tree; Costus specious, see कोष्ठ; Rām. 2. 94. 24.<BR>—4 (<i>m.</i>) cavity of the loin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठम्
कुष्ठः, -ष्ठम्<BR> [Uṇ. 2. 2]<BR>—1 Leprosy (of which there are 18 varieties); गलत्कुष्ठाभिभूताय च Bh. 1. 90.<BR>—2 A sort of poison.<BR>—3 A kind of tree; Costus specious, see कोष्ठ; Rām. 2. 94. 24.<BR>—4 (<i>m.</i>) cavity of the loin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठा
कुष्ठः, -ष्ठम् + .{@-ष्ठा@} The mouth or opening of a basket.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुष्ठारिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठारिः|कुष्ठारि
कुष्ठः + -अरिः<BR>—1 sulphur.<BR>—2 N. of several plants (Mar. भोवरी, रुई, कडू पडवळ इ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठिन्
कुष्ठिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>), कुष्ठित <i>a.</i> Affected<BR> with leprosy, a leper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठिनी
कुष्ठिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>), कुष्ठित <i>a.</i> Affected<BR> with leprosy, a leper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठित
कुष्ठिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>), कुष्ठित <i>a.</i> Affected<BR> with leprosy, a leper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्ठिका
कुष्ठिका Contents of bowels. Ait. Br. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्मलम्
कुष्मलम्<BR>—1 Cutting.<BR>—2 A leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्माण्डः|कुष्माण्ड|कुष्मांड|कुष्मांडः
कुष्माण्डः<BR>—1 A kind of pumpkin gourd.<BR>—2 A false conception.<BR>—3 A particular religious formula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्माण्डी
कुष्माण्डः + .{@-डी@}<BR>—1 A religious ceremony.<BR>—2 An epithet of the wife of Śiva.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुष्माण्डनवमी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्माण्डनवमी
कुष्माण्डः + -नवमी <i>f.</i> The ninth day of the bright half of the month of<BR> Kārtika when a golden idol &c. is to be given as a religious gift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुष्माण्डकः|कुष्माण्डक|कुष्मांडक|कुष्मांडकः
कुष्माण्डकः A kind of pumpkin gourd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुस्
कुस् €4 P. (कुस्यति, कुसित)<BR>—1 To embrace.<BR>—2 To surround.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसितः|कुसित
कुसितः<BR>—1 An inhabited country.<BR>—2 One who lives on usury; see कुसीद below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसितायी
कुसितायी (= कुसीदायी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसीद|कुसीदं|कुसीदः
कुसी(सि)द <i>a.</i> Lazy, slothful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसिद
कुसी(सि)द <i>a.</i> Lazy, slothful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसीदः|कुसीद|कुसीदं
कुसी(सि)द + .{@-दः@} (also written as कुशी(षी)द) A money-lender, usurer; Mbh. 4. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसीदम्
कुसी(सि)द + .{@-दम्@}<BR>—1 Any loan or thing lent to be repaid with interest.<BR>—2 Lending money, usury, the profession of usury; कुसीदाद् दारिद्र्यं<BR> परकरगतग्रन्थिशमनात् Pt. 1. 11; Ms. 1. 90, 8. 410; Y. 1. 119.<BR>—3 Red sandalwood.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुसीदपथः, कुसीदवृद्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसीदपथः|कुसीदपथ
कुसीद + -पथः usury, usurious interest; any interest exceeding 5 per<BR> cent; कृतानुसारादधिका व्यतिरिक्ता न सिध्यति कुसीदपथमाहुस्तम् (पञ्चकं<BR> शतमर्हति) Ms. 8. 152.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसीदवृद्धिः|कुसीदवृद्धि
कुसीद + -वृद्धिः <i>f.</i> interest on money; कुसीदवृद्धिर्द्वैगुण्यं नात्येति<BR> सकृदाहृता Ms. 8. 151.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसीदा
कुसीदा A female usurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसीदायी
कुसीदायी The wife of a usurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसीदिकः|कुसीदिक
कुसीदिकः, कुसीदिन् <i>m.</i> A usurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसीदिन्
कुसीदिकः, कुसीदिन् <i>m.</i> A usurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुमम्
कुसुमम्<BR>—1 A flower; उदेति पूर्वं कुसुमं ततः फलम् Ś. 7. 30.<BR>—2 Menstrual discharge.<BR>—3 A fruit.<BR>—4 A disease of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुमः|कुसुम|कुसुमं
कुसुमम् + .{@-मः@} A form of fire.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुसुमाञ्जनम्, कुसुमाञ्जलिः, कुसुमाधिपः, कुसुमाधिराजः, कुसुमावचायः, कुसुमावतंसकम्, कुसुमास्त्रः, कुसुमायुधः, कुसुमेषुः, कुसुमबाणः, कुसुमशरः, कुसुमाकरः, कुसुमात्मकम्, कुसुमापीडः, कुसुमासवम्, कुसुमोज्ज्वल, कुसुमकार्मुकः, कुसुमचापः, कुसुमधन्वन्, कुसुमचित, कुसुमद्रुमः, कुसुमपुरम्, कुसुमप्रवृत्तिः, कुसुमप्रसूतिः, कुसुमलता, कुसुमशयनम्, कुसुमस्तवकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुमाञ्जनम्
कुसुमम् + -अञ्जनम् the calx of brass used as a collyrium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुमाञ्जलिः|कुसुमाञ्जलि|कुसुमांजलि
कुसुमम् + -अञ्जलिः a handful of flowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुमाधिपः|कुसुमाधिप
कुसुमम् + -अधिपः, -अधिराजः <i>m.</i> the Champaka tree (bearing yellow fragrant flowers).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुमाधिराजः
कुसुमम् + -अधिपः, -अधिराजः <i>m.</i> the Champaka tree (bearing yellow fragrant flowers).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुमावचायः|कुसुमावचाय
कुसुमम् + -अवचायः gathering flowers; अन्यत्र यूयं कुसुमावचायं कुरुध्वमत्रास्मि<BR> करोमि सख्यः K. P. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुसुमावतंसकम्
