कुस्तुभः|कुस्तुभ
कुस्तुभः<BR>—1 An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 The ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुस्मयते
कुस्मयते Den. Ā.<BR>—1 To smile improperly.<BR>—2 To guess, perceive, imagine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुह्
कुह् €10 Ā. (कुहयते, कुहित)<BR>—1 To surprise, astonish.<BR>—2 To cheat, deceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहः|कुह
कुहः<BR>—1 Kubera, the god of riches.<BR>—2 A rogue, cheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकः|कुहक|कुहकं
कुहकः [Uṇ. 2. 37] A cheat, rogue, juggler; यथा दारुमयी योषिन्नृत्यते<BR> कुहकेच्छया Bhāg. 10. 54. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकम्
कुहकः + .{@-कम्, -का@} Jugglery, deception; इन्द्रजालं च मायां वै कुहका<BR> वाऽपि भीषणा Mb. 5. 160. 55. धाम्ना स्वेन सदा निरस्तकुहकं सत्यं<BR> परं धीमहि Bhāg. 1. 1. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुहककार, कुहकचकित, कुहकस्वनः, कुहकस्वरः, कुहकवृत्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहका
कुहकः + .{@-कम्, -का@} Jugglery, deception; इन्द्रजालं च मायां वै कुहका<BR> वाऽपि भीषणा Mb. 5. 160. 55. धाम्ना स्वेन सदा निरस्तकुहकं सत्यं<BR> परं धीमहि Bhāg. 1. 1. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुहककार, कुहकचकित, कुहकस्वनः, कुहकस्वरः, कुहकवृत्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहककार
कुहकः + -कार <i>a.</i> conjuring, cheating.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">Page0591-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकचकित
कुहकः + -चकित <i>a.</i> afraid of a trick, suspicious, cautious, wary;<BR> कुहकचकितो लोकः सत्येप्यपायमपेक्षते H. 4. 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकस्वनः|कुहकस्वन
कुहकः + -स्वनः, -स्वरः a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकस्वरः|कुहकस्वर
कुहकः + -स्वनः, -स्वरः a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहकवृत्तिः|कुहकवृत्ति
कुहकः + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Juggling.<BR>—2 hypocrisy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहन|कुहनं|कुहनः
कुहन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Envious.<BR>—2 Hypocritical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहनः|कुहन|कुहनं
कुहन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 A mouse<BR>—2 A snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहना
कुहन + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 Hypocrisy; ‘कुहना दम्भचर्यायामीर्ष्यालौ कुहनस्त्रिषु’ Med.; Viś. Guṇā. 388.<BR>—2 Assumed and false sanctity.<BR>—3 The interested performance of religious austerities, hypocrisy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहनम्
कुहन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 A small earthen vessel; ‘कुहनं मृत्तिकाभाण्डविशेषे काचभाजने’ Med.<BR>—2 A glass vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहनिका
कुहनिका Interested performance of religious austerities, hypocrisy (दम्भ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहरम्
कुहरम्<BR>—1 A cavity, hollow; as in नाभिकुहर, आस्य˚ &c. दधति कुहरभाजामत्र<BR> भल्लूकयूनामनुरसितगुरूणि स्त्यानमम्बूकृतानि Māl. 9. 6; Ve. 1. 22.<BR>—2 The ear.<BR>—3 The throat.<BR>—4 Proximity.<BR>—5 Copulation; प्रवृत्तकुहरपारावत … &c. Dk. 2. 2.<BR>—6 A hole, rent.<BR>—7 A guttural sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहरः|कुहर|कुहरं
कुहरम् + .{@-रः@} A window, the interior window; कुहरा अभ्यन्तरगवाक्षाः<BR> Bṛ. S. 56. 20; B. P. 130. 5. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहरितम्
कुहरितम्<BR>—1 Sound in general.<BR>—2 The cry of the (Indian) cuckoo.<BR>—3 A sound uttered in copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहलिः|कुहलि
कुहलिः The leaf of the Piper Betel; Mv. 7. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहुः|कुहु
कुहुः, कुहूः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 New moon day <i>i. e.</i> the last day of a lunar month when the moon<BR> is invisible; Mb. 8. 34. 32; करगतैव गता यदियं कुहूः N. 4. 57.<BR>—2 The deity that presides over this day; Ms. 3. 86.<BR>—3 The cry of the (Indian) cuckoo; पिकेन रोषारुणचक्षुषा मुहुःकुहूरुताहूयत<BR> चन्द्रवैरिणी N. 1. 100; उन्मीलन्ति कुहूः कुहूरिति कलोत्तालाः पिकानां<BR> गिरः Gīt. 1; पिकविधुस्तव हन्ति समन्तमस्त्वमपि चन्द्रविरोधि-कुहूरवः Udb.<BR>—4 The first day of the first quarter on which the moon rises.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुहुकण्ठः, कुहुमुखः, कुहुरवः, कुहुशब्दः, कुहुकालः, कुहुपालः, कुहुमुखः, कुहुमुखम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहूः
कुहुः, कुहूः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 New moon day <i>i. e.</i> the last day of a lunar month when the moon<BR> is invisible; Mb. 8. 34. 32; करगतैव गता यदियं कुहूः N. 4. 57.<BR>—2 The deity that presides over this day; Ms. 3. 86.<BR>—3 The cry of the (Indian) cuckoo; पिकेन रोषारुणचक्षुषा मुहुःकुहूरुताहूयत<BR> चन्द्रवैरिणी N. 1. 100; उन्मीलन्ति कुहूः कुहूरिति कलोत्तालाः पिकानां<BR> गिरः Gīt. 1; पिकविधुस्तव हन्ति समन्तमस्त्वमपि चन्द्रविरोधि-कुहूरवः Udb.<BR>—4 The first day of the first quarter on which the moon rises.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कुहुकण्ठः, कुहुमुखः, कुहुरवः, कुहुशब्दः, कुहुकालः, कुहुपालः, कुहुमुखः, कुहुमुखम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहुकण्ठः
कुहुः + -कण्ठः, -मुखः, -रवः, -शब्दः the (Indian) cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहुमुखः
कुहुः + -कण्ठः, -मुखः, -रवः, -शब्दः the (Indian) cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहुरवः|कुहुरव
कुहुः + -कण्ठः, -मुखः, -रवः, -शब्दः the (Indian) cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहुशब्दः
कुहुः + -कण्ठः, -मुखः, -रवः, -शब्दः the (Indian) cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहुकालः
कुहुः + -कालः The last day of the lunar month when the moon is invisible;<BR> न च कुहूकालेऽपि संक्षीयते … … त्वत्कीर्तिचन्द्रः सदा Sūkti. 5. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहुपालः
कुहुः + -पालः the king of turtles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहुमुखः
कुहुः + -मुखः<BR>—1 The Indian cuckoo.<BR>—2 a calamity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहुमुखम्
कुहुः + -मुखम् new moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहूलम्
कुहूलम् A pit filled with stakes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहेडिका
कुहेडिका, कुहेडी, कुहेलिका A fog, mist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहेडी
कुहेडिका, कुहेडी, कुहेलिका A fog, mist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुहेलिका
कुहेडिका, कुहेडी, कुहेलिका A fog, mist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कुह्वानम्
कुह्वानम् A disagreeable noise; प्रत्युलूकश्च कुह्वानैरनिद्रौ शून्यमिच्छतः<BR> Bhāg. 1. 14. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कू
कू €1. €6 Ā. (कुवते, कुवते); also कु €9 U. (कु(कू)नाति, कु(कू)नीते)<BR> To sound, make noise, cry out in distress, खगाश्चुकुविरेऽशुभम्<BR> Bk. 14. 20, 1. 20, 14. 5, 15. 26, 16. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कु|कुः
कू €1. €6 Ā. (कुवते, कुवते); also कु €9 U. (कु(कू)नाति, कु(कू)नीते)<BR> To sound, make noise, cry out in distress, खगाश्चुकुविरेऽशुभम्<BR> Bk. 14. 20, 1. 20, 14. 5, 15. 26, 16. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूः
कूः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A female imp.<BR>—2 The earth; कूः कृत्या भूरपि स्मृता Enm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूकुदः|कूकुद
कूकुदः One who gives his daughter in marriage with due ceremony;<BR> सत्कृतालङ्कृतां कन्यां यो ददाति स कूकुदः Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूचः|कूच
कूचः The female breast, especially that of a young or unmarried<BR> woman; see कुच.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूचिका
कूचिका, कूची<BR>—1 A small brush of hair, a pencil.<BR>—2 A key.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूची
कूचिका, कूची<BR>—1 A small brush of hair, a pencil.<BR>—2 A key.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूज्
कूज् €1 P. (कूजति, कूजित)<BR>—1 To make any inarticulate sound, hum, coo, warble; कूजन्तं राम रामेति<BR> मधुरं मधुराक्षरम् Rām.; पुंस्कोकिलो यन्मधुरं चुकूज Ku. 3. 32;<BR> Ṛs. 6. 22; R. 2. 12; N. 1. 127; कूजत्क्लान्तकपोतकुक्कुटकुलाः V. 2.<BR>—2 To moan, groan.<BR>—3 To fill with sounds, to blow or breathe (the flute); सहपशुपालबलश्चुकूज<BR> वेणुम् Bhāg. 10. 21. 2. ━<i>With</i> {@नि, परि@} or {@वि@} to coo, to make<BR> an indistinct noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूजः|कूज
कूजः, कूजनम्, कूजितम्<BR>—1 Cooing, warbling; मधुकरनिकरकरम्बितकोकिलकूजितकुञ्जकुटीरे Gīt.<BR>—2 The rattling of wheels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूजनम्
कूजः, कूजनम्, कूजितम्<BR>—1 Cooing, warbling; मधुकरनिकरकरम्बितकोकिलकूजितकुञ्जकुटीरे Gīt.<BR>—2 The rattling of wheels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूजितम्
कूजः, कूजनम्, कूजितम्<BR>—1 Cooing, warbling; मधुकरनिकरकरम्बितकोकिलकूजितकुञ्जकुटीरे Gīt.<BR>—2 The rattling of wheels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूट्
कूट् I. €10 Ā. (कूटयते, कूटित)<BR>—1 To abstain from giving; not to give.<BR>—2 To censure. ━II. €10 U.<BR>—1 To burn.<BR>—2 To call, invite.<BR>—3 To render confused, to muddle.<BR>—4 To be distressed.<BR>—5 To despair.<BR>—6 To counsel, advise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूट|कूटः
कूट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 False; as in कूटाः स्युः पूर्वसाक्षिणः Y. 2. 80; दुस्तोषः कूटयोगिनाम्<BR> Bhāg. 2. 9. 19.<BR>—2 Immovable, steady.<BR>—3 Despised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटः|कूट
कूट + .{@-टः, -टम्@}<BR>—1 Fraud, illusion, deception.<BR>—2 A trick, fraudulent or roguish scheme; अक्षकूटमधिष्ठाय हृतं दुर्योधनेन<BR> वै Mb. 3. 33. 3.<BR>—3 A puzzling question, knotty or intricate point, as in कूटश्लोक,<BR> कूटान्योक्ति; वाचः कूटं तु देवर्षेः स्वयं विममृशुर्धिया Bhāg. 6. 5. 10.<BR>—4 Falsehood, untruth; oft. used in comp. with the force of an adjective;<BR> ˚वचनम् false or deceitful words; ˚तुला, ˚मानम् &c.<BR>—5 A summit or peak of a mountain; वर्धयन्निव तत्कूटानुद्धतैर्धातुरेणुभिः<BR> R. 4. 71; Me. 115; Māl. 5. 32.<BR>—6 Any projection or prominence.<BR>—7 The bone of the forehead with its projections, the crown of the head.<BR>—8 A horn; सम्परेतमयःकूटैश्छिन्दन्त्युत्थितमन्यवः Bhāg. 4. 25. 8.<BR>—9 End, corner; Y. 3. 96.<BR>—10 Head, chief.<BR>—11 A heap, mass, multitude; अभ्रकूटम् ‘a heap of clouds’; so अन्नकूटम्<BR> ‘a heap of food’; Mv. 6. 32.<BR>—12 A hammer, an iron mallet.<BR>—13 A plough-share, the body of a plough.<BR>—14 A trap for catching deer; नश्येदभिमृशन्सद्यो मृगः कूटमिव स्पृशन्<BR> Mb. 12. 68. 52.<BR>—15 A concealed weapon, as a dagger in a woollen case or a sword in a stick.<BR>—16 A water-jar.<BR>—17 The door of a city; निर्ययुर्भवनात्तस्मात्कूटमुद्गरपाणयः Rām. 5. 42. 25.<BR>—18 A false coin; कूटं हि निषादानामेवोपकारकं न आर्याणाम् ŚB. on MS. 6. 1. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटम्
कूट + .{@-टः, -टम्@}<BR>—1 Fraud, illusion, deception.<BR>—2 A trick, fraudulent or roguish scheme; अक्षकूटमधिष्ठाय हृतं दुर्योधनेन<BR> वै Mb. 3. 33. 3.<BR>—3 A puzzling question, knotty or intricate point, as in कूटश्लोक,<BR> कूटान्योक्ति; वाचः कूटं तु देवर्षेः स्वयं विममृशुर्धिया Bhāg. 6. 5. 10.<BR>—4 Falsehood, untruth; oft. used in comp. with the force of an adjective;<BR> ˚वचनम् false or deceitful words; ˚तुला, ˚मानम् &c.<BR>—5 A summit or peak of a mountain; वर्धयन्निव तत्कूटानुद्धतैर्धातुरेणुभिः<BR> R. 4. 71; Me. 115; Māl. 5. 32.<BR>—6 Any projection or prominence.<BR>—7 The bone of the forehead with its projections, the crown of the head.<BR>—8 A horn; सम्परेतमयःकूटैश्छिन्दन्त्युत्थितमन्यवः Bhāg. 4. 25. 8.<BR>—9 End, corner; Y. 3. 96.<BR>—10 Head, chief.<BR>—11 A heap, mass, multitude; अभ्रकूटम् ‘a heap of clouds’; so अन्नकूटम्<BR> ‘a heap of food’; Mv. 6. 32.<BR>—12 A hammer, an iron mallet.<BR>—13 A plough-share, the body of a plough.<BR>—14 A trap for catching deer; नश्येदभिमृशन्सद्यो मृगः कूटमिव स्पृशन्<BR> Mb. 12. 68. 52.<BR>—15 A concealed weapon, as a dagger in a woollen case or a sword in a stick.<BR>—16 A water-jar.<BR>—17 The door of a city; निर्ययुर्भवनात्तस्मात्कूटमुद्गरपाणयः Rām. 5. 42. 25.<BR>—18 A false coin; कूटं हि निषादानामेवोपकारकं न आर्याणाम् ŚB. on MS. 6. 1. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटः|कूट
कूट + .{@-टः@}<BR>—1 A house, dwelling.<BR>—2 An ox whose horns are broken.<BR>—3 An epithet of Agastya.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कूटाक्षः, कूटागारम्, कूटार्थः, कूटोपायः, कूटकारः, कूटकारकः, कूटकृत्, कूटकार्षापणः, कूटकोष्ठम्, कूटखड्गः, कूटच्छद्मन्, कूटतुला, कूटधर्म, कूटपाकलः, कूटपर्वः, कूटपूर्वः, कूटपालकः, कूटपाशः, कूटबन्धः, कूटमानम्, कूटमोहनः, कूटयन्त्रम्, कूटयुद्धम्, कूटरचना, कूटलेखः, कूटशाल्मलिः, कूटशासनम्, कूटसंक्रान्तिः, कूटसाक्षिन्, कूटस्थ, कूटस्वर्णम्, कूटहेमन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटाक्षः|कूटाक्ष
कूट + -अक्षः a false or loaded die; कूटाक्षोपधिदेविनः Y. 2. 202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटागारम्
कूट + -अगारम् an apartment on the top of a house; कूटागारैश्च संपूर्णामिन्द्रस्येवामरावतीम्<BR> Rām. 1. 5. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटार्थः|कूटार्थ
कूट + -अर्थः ambiguity of meaning. ˚भाषिता a tale, fiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटोपायः|कूटोपाय
कूट + -उपायः a fraudulent plan, trick, stratagem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकारः|कूटकार
कूट + -कारः, -कारकः a rogue, a false witness; Ms. 3. 158.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकारकः|कूटकारक
कूट + -कारः, -कारकः a rogue, a false witness; Ms. 3. 158.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकृत्
कूट + -कृत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 cheating, deceiving.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">Page0592-2</a>]<BR>—2 forging a document; Y. 2. 70.<BR>—3 bribing. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a man of the writer caste (कायस्थ).<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकार्षापणः|कूटकार्षापण
कूट + -कार्षापणः a false कार्षापण q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकोष्ठम्
कूट + -कोष्ठम् <i>n.</i> a compartment on the top of a building (Kāmikāgama 55. 123━30);<BR> (कूटशाला and कूटागार are synonyms).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटखड्गः|कूटखड्ग
कूट + -खड्गः a sword-stick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटच्छद्मन्
कूट + -च्छद्मन् <i>m.</i> a cheat; पीड्यमानाः प्रजा रक्ष्याः कूटच्छद्मादिभिस्तथा Pt. 1. 343.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटतुला
कूट + -तुला a false pair of scales.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटधर्म
कूट + -धर्म <i>a.</i> where falsehood is considered a duty (as a place,<BR> house, country, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटपाकलः|कूटपाकल
कूट + -पाकलः, -पर्वः, -पूर्वः bilious fever to which elephants are<BR> subject (हस्तिवातज्वर); अचिरेण वैकृतविवर्तदारुणः कलभं कठोर<BR> इव कूटपाकलः (अभिहन्ति Māl. 1. 39); (also sometimes written<BR> as कूटपालक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटपर्वः|कूटपर्व|कूटपर्व्व
कूट + -पाकलः, -पर्वः, -पूर्वः bilious fever to which elephants are<BR> subject (हस्तिवातज्वर); अचिरेण वैकृतविवर्तदारुणः कलभं कठोर<BR> इव कूटपाकलः (अभिहन्ति Māl. 1. 39); (also sometimes written<BR> as कूटपालक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटपूर्वः|कूटपूर्व|कूटपूर्व्व|कूटपूर्व्वं
कूट + -पाकलः, -पर्वः, -पूर्वः bilious fever to which elephants are<BR> subject (हस्तिवातज्वर); अचिरेण वैकृतविवर्तदारुणः कलभं कठोर<BR> इव कूटपाकलः (अभिहन्ति Māl. 1. 39); (also sometimes written<BR> as कूटपालक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटपालकः|कूटपालक
कूट + -पालकः a potter; a potterʼs kiln.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटपाशः|कूटपाश
कूट + -पाशः, -बन्धः a trap, snare; समाधिभीतेन किलोपनीतः पञ्चाप्सरोयौवनकूटबन्धम् R. 13. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटबन्धः|कूटबन्ध|कूटबंध
कूट + -पाशः, -बन्धः a trap, snare; समाधिभीतेन किलोपनीतः पञ्चाप्सरोयौवनकूटबन्धम् R. 13. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटमानम्
कूट + -मानम् false measure or weight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटमोहनः|कूटमोहन
कूट + -मोहनः an epithet of Skanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटयन्त्रम्
कूट + -यन्त्रम् a trap, a snare for deer, birds &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटयुद्धम्
कूट + -युद्धम् treacherous or unfair warfare; कूटयुद्धविधिज्ञेऽपि तस्मिन्सन्मार्गयोधिनि R. 17. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटरचना
कूट + -रचना<BR>—1 a trap laid; Pt. 2. 85.<BR>—2 artifice, trick; अतर्क्या कुट्टनीकूटरचना हि विधेरपि Ks. 57. 115.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटलेखः|कूटलेख
कूट + -लेखः a falsified document; कृत्वाथ कूटलेखं सा विदग्धा मह्यमर्पयत् Ks. 124. 197.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटशाल्मलिः|कूटशाल्मलि
कूट + -शाल्मलिः <i>f., m.</i><BR>—1 a species of the Śālmali tree.<BR>—2 a kind of tree with sharp thorns (regarded as one of the several instruments<BR> −perhaps a club− with which the wicked are tortured in the world of<BR> Yama); see R. 12. 95 and Malli. thereon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटशासनम्
कूट + -शासनम् a forged grant or decree; Ms. 9. 232.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटसंक्रान्तिः|कूटसङ्क्रान्ति
कूट + -संक्रान्तिः the passing of the sun into another zodiac when half<BR> the night is over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटसाक्षिन्
कूट + -साक्षिन् <i>m.</i> a false witness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटस्थ|कूटस्थं|कूटस्थः
कूट + -स्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 standing at the top, occupying the highest place (said of a person<BR> who stands at the head in a genealogical table).<BR>—2 silent; not at all moving or working; Mb. 12. 179. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटस्थः|कूटस्थ|कूटस्थं
कूट + -स्थ + ({@-स्थः@})<BR> the Supreme Soul (immovable, unchangeable, and perpetually the same);<BR> क्षरः सर्वाणि भूतानि कूटस्थोऽक्षर उच्यते Bg. 6. 8, 12. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटस्थः|कूटस्थ|कूटस्थं
कूट + -स्थ + .({@-स्थः, -स्थम्@}) a kind of perfume (Mar. नखला).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटस्थम्
कूट + -स्थ + .({@-स्थः, -स्थम्@}) a kind of perfume (Mar. नखला).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटस्वर्णम्
कूट + -स्वर्णम् counterfeit gold; Y. 2. 297.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटहेमन्
कूट + -हेमन् (as above); रज्यत्तुषारद्युतिकूटहेम तत्पाण्डु जातं<BR> रजतं क्षणेन N. 22. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटक|कूटकं|कूटकः
कूटक <i>a.</i> Fraudulent, false, base (as a coin); Y. 2. 241.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकम्
कूटक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Fraud, deceit, trick.<BR>—2 Elevation, prominence.<BR>—3 The body of a plough, a plough-share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकः|कूटक|कूटकं
कूटक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A braid or tress of hair.<BR>—2 A perfume.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कूटकाख्यानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटकाख्यानम्
कूटक + -आख्यानम् an invented tale; a tale containing passages of ambiguous meanings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूटशः
कूटशः <i>ind.</i> In heaps or multitudes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूड्
कूड् €6 P. (कूडति, कूडित)<BR>—1 To graze.<BR>—2 To become firm or solid.<BR>—3 To become fat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूड्यम्
कूड्यम् = कुड्य q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूण्
कूण् €10 U. (कूणयति-ते, कूणित)<BR>—1 To speak, converse.<BR>—2 To contract, close (said to be Ātm. in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूणि|कूणिः
कूणि <i>a.</i> Having a crooked arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूणित
कूणित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shut, closed.<BR>—2 Contracted; Māl. 4. 2.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कूणितेक्षणः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूणितेक्षणः|कूणितेक्षण
कूणित + -ईक्षणः a hawk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूणिका
कूणिका<BR>—1 The horn of any animal.<BR>—2 The peg of a lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूदरः|कूदर
