कूदी
कूदी A fetter for the foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूद्दालः|कूद्दाल
कूद्दालः Mountain ebony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूप्
कूप् €10 U. (कूपयति-ते, कूपित)<BR>—1 To be weak.<BR>—2 To weaken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपः|कूप
कूपः [कुवन्ति मण्डूका अस्मिन्, कु-पक् दीर्घश्च Uṇ. 3. 27]<BR>—1 A well; कूपे पश्य पयोनिधावपि घटो गृह्णाति तुल्यं जलम् Bh. 2. 49;<BR> so नितरां नीचोऽस्मीति त्वं खेदं कूप मा कदापि कृथाः । अत्यन्तसरसहृदयो<BR> यतः परेषां गुणग्रहीतासि Bv. 1. 9; प्रोद्दीप्ते भवने तु कूपखननं<BR> प्रत्युद्यमः कीदृशः Bh. 3. 88.<BR>—2 A hole, cave, hollow, cavity; as in रोमकूप; Śi. 7. 74.<BR>—3 A leather oil-vessel.<BR>—4 A post to which a ship is moored.<BR>—5 A tree or rock in the midst of a river.<BR>—6 A mast.<BR>—7 A pore, root; हृष्यन्ति रोमकूपाणि Mb. 6. 112. 16; Śi. 13. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपी
कूपः + .{@-पी@}<BR>—1 A small well.<BR>—2 A flask, bottle.<BR>—3 The navel.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कूपाङ्कः, कूपाङ्गः, कूपकच्छपः, कूपकारः, कूपखानकः, कूपदण्डः, कूपयन्त्रम्, कूपस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपाङ्कः|कूपाङ्क|कूपांक
कूपः + -अङ्कः, -अङ्गः horripilation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपाङ्गः|कूपाङ्ग|कूपांग
कूपः + -अङ्कः, -अङ्गः horripilation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपकच्छपः|कूपकच्छप
कूपः + -कच्छपः, म(मा)ण्डूकः, -की (lit.) a tortoise or<BR> frog in a well; (fig.) an inexperienced person, one who has had no experience<BR> of the world at large, a man of limited ideas who knows only his own neighbourhood;<BR> oft. used as a term of reproach; यद्यसौ कूपमाण्डूकि तवैतावति कः<BR> स्मयः Bk. 5. 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपकारः|कूपकार
कूपः + -कारः, -खानकः a well-digger; कूपखानकवदेतद् भविष्यति<BR> Mbh. on P. I. 1. 1; Rām. 2; कूपखानकवत्प्राप्ते फले दोषं निहन्ति<BR> च Ks. 66. 134. {@चक्रम्@} A water weel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपखानकः|कूपखानक
कूपः + -कारः, -खानकः a well-digger; कूपखानकवदेतद् भविष्यति<BR> Mbh. on P. I. 1. 1; Rām. 2; कूपखानकवत्प्राप्ते फले दोषं निहन्ति<BR> च Ks. 66. 134. {@चक्रम्@} A water weel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपदण्डः
कूपः + -दण्डः a mast; क्षोणीनौ कूपदण्डः Dk. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपयन्त्रम्
कूपः + -यन्त्रम् a water-wheel, a contrivance for raising water from a<BR> well. {@यन्त्रघटी, -घटिका@} a bucket or pot attached to the water-wheel<BR> to draw up water. ˚यन्त्रघटिकान्याय see under न्याय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपस्थानम्
कूपः + -स्थानम् A well; दशकुली वाटं कूपस्थानम् Kau. A. 2. 4; एष<BR> क्रीडति कूपयन्त्रघटिकान्यायप्रसक्तो विधिः Mk. 10. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपकः|कूपक
कूपकः<BR>—1 A well (temporary).<BR>—2 A hole, cave, cavity.<BR>—3 The hollow below the loins.<BR>—4 A stake to which a boat is moored.<BR>—5 The mast of a ship.<BR>—6 A funeral pile.<BR>—7 A hole under a funeral pile.<BR>—8 A leather oil-vessel.<BR>—9 A rock or tree in the midst of a river.<BR>—10 A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपिका
कूपकः + .{@-पिका@} A stone or rock in the midst of a stream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूप्य
कूप्य <i>a.</i> Being in a well or hole.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपारः|कूपार
कूपा(वा)रः The ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूवारः|कूवार
कूपा(वा)रः The ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूपुषम्
कूपुषम् The bladder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूबर|कूबरः
कूब(व)र <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Beautiful, agreeable.<BR>—2 Hump-backed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूवर|कूवरः
कूब(व)र <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Beautiful, agreeable.<BR>—2 Hump-backed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूबरः|कूबर
कूब(व)र + .{@-रः, -रम्@} The pole of a carriage to which the yoke is fixed;<BR> ततः स मथिताष्टाश्वं रथं भग्नाक्षकूबरम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-2" target="_blank">Page0593-2</a>]<BR> Rām. 5. 46. 28. (द्विकूबरम्) Bhāg. 4. 26. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

