कूबरी
कूब(व)र + .{@-री@}<BR>—1 A carriage covered with a cloth or blanket.<BR>—2 The pole of a carriage to which the yoke is fixed; Ve. 4; अंसेन<BR> संश्लिष्य च कूबराग्रम् Bu. C. 3. 60.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कूबरस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

