कूरः|कूर|कूरं
कूरः, -रम्<BR> Food, boiled rice; इतश्च कूरच्युततैलमिश्रं पिण्डं हस्ती<BR> प्रतिग्राह्यते मात्रपुरुषैः Mk. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूरम्
कूरः, -रम्<BR> Food, boiled rice; इतश्च कूरच्युततैलमिश्रं पिण्डं हस्ती<BR> प्रतिग्राह्यते मात्रपुरुषैः Mk. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्चः|कूर्च|कूर्चं|कूर्च्च|कूर्च्चं|कूर्च्चः
कूर्चः, -र्चम्<BR>—1 A bunch of any thing, a bundle.<BR>—2 A handful of Kuśa grass; Mb. 14. 72. 10.<BR>—3 A peacockʼs feather.<BR>—4 The beard; आगतमनध्यायकारणं सविशेषभूतमद्य जीर्णकूर्चानाम्<BR> U. 4; or पूरयितव्यमनेन चित्रफलकं लम्बकूर्चानां तापसानां कदम्बैः Ś. 6.<BR>—5 The tip of the thumb and the middle finger brought in contact so as to pinch &c.<BR>—6 The upper part of the rose, the part (or hair) between the eye-brows.<BR>—7 A brush.<BR>—8 Deceit, fraud.<BR>—9 Boasting, bragging.<BR>—10 Hypocrisy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्चम्
कूर्चः, -र्चम्<BR>—1 A bunch of any thing, a bundle.<BR>—2 A handful of Kuśa grass; Mb. 14. 72. 10.<BR>—3 A peacockʼs feather.<BR>—4 The beard; आगतमनध्यायकारणं सविशेषभूतमद्य जीर्णकूर्चानाम्<BR> U. 4; or पूरयितव्यमनेन चित्रफलकं लम्बकूर्चानां तापसानां कदम्बैः Ś. 6.<BR>—5 The tip of the thumb and the middle finger brought in contact so as to pinch &c.<BR>—6 The upper part of the rose, the part (or hair) between the eye-brows.<BR>—7 A brush.<BR>—8 Deceit, fraud.<BR>—9 Boasting, bragging.<BR>—10 Hypocrisy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्चः|कूर्च|कूर्चं|कूर्च्च|कूर्च्चं|कूर्च्चः
कूर्चः, -र्चम् + .{@-र्चः@}<BR>—1 The head.<BR>—2 A store-room.<BR>—3 A seat of Kuśa grass (कुशासन); जनको ह वैदेहः कूर्चादुपावसर्पन्नुवाच<BR> Bṛ. Up. 4. 2. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कूर्चशिरस्, कूर्चशीर्षः, कूर्चशेखरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

