कूर्चः + -शिरस् <i>n.</i> the upper part of the palm of the hand and foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

