कूर्चः + -शीर्षः, -शेखरः the cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्चशेखरः|कूर्चशेखर|कूर्च्चशेखर|कूर्च्चशेखरः
कूर्चः + -शीर्षः, -शेखरः the cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्चकः|कूर्चक|कूर्च्चक
कूर्चकः<BR>—1 A bushel.<BR>—2 A brush for cleaning the teeth.<BR>—3 A painterʼs brush.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कूर्चिका|कूर्च्चिका
