कृपीटम्
कृपीटम् [कृप्-कीटन्; Uṇ. 4. 184]<BR>—1 Underwood; यत्रा कृपीटमनु तद्दहन्ति Rv. 10. 28. 8; forest, wood.<BR>—2 Wood, fire-wood.<BR>—3 Water.<BR>—4 The belly.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कृपीटपालः, कृपीटयोनिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

