कॄ
कॄ I. €6 P. (किरति, चकार, अकारीत्, अकरि(री)ष्ट, अकीर्ष्ट, करि(री)तुम्, कीर्ण)<BR>—1 To scatter, throw about, pour, cast, disperse; समरशिरसि चञ्चत्पञ्चचूडश्चमूनामुपरि<BR> शरतुषारं कोऽप्ययं वीरपोतः । किरति U. 5. 2, 6. 1; दिशि दिशि<BR> किरति सजलकणजालम् Gīt. 4; Ś. 1. 7; Amaru. 11.<BR>—2 To strew, cover or fill with; उक्षान्प्रचक्रुर्नगरस्य मार्गान् Bk. 3. 5;<BR> सौमित्रिमकिरद् बाणैः परितो रावणिस्ततः 17. 42. ━II. €9 U. (कृणाति,<BR> कृणीते) To injure, hurt, kill. ━III. €10 Ā. (कारयते) To know, inform.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॄत्
कॄत् €10 U. (कीर्तयति-ते, कीर्तित)<BR>—1 To mention, repeat, utter; नाम्नि कीर्तित एव R. 1. 87; Ms. 7. 167, 2. 124.<BR>—2 To tell, recite, declare, communicate; सर्वं शृणुत तं विप्राः सम्यक्<BR> कीर्तयतो मम Ms. 3. 36, 9. 42.<BR>—3 To name, call.<BR>—4 To praise, glorify, commemorate; अपप्रथद्गुणान् भ्रातुरचिकीर्तच्च<BR> विक्रमम् Bk. 15. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्तनीय
कीर्तनीय, कीर्तन्य <i>a.</i> Fit to be praised; अपांसुलानां<BR> धुरि कीर्तनीया R. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कीर्तन्य|कीर्त्तन्य
कीर्तनीय, कीर्तन्य <i>a.</i> Fit to be praised; अपांसुलानां<BR> धुरि कीर्तनीया R. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॢप्
कॢप् €1 Ā.<BR> (कल्पते, चकॢपे, अकॢपत्, अकॢप्त, अकल्पिष्ट; कल्पिष्यते; कल्प्स्यति-ते,<BR> कल्पितुम्, कल्प्तुम्, कॢप्त) —1 To be fit or adequate for result in, bring<BR> about, accomplish, produce, tend to; (with dat.) कल्पसे रक्षणाय<BR> Ś. 5. 8; पश्चात्पुत्रैरपहृतभरः कल्पते विश्रमाय V. 3. 1; विभावरी<BR> यद्यरुणाय कल्पते Ku. 5. 44, 6. 29, 5. 79; Me. 57; R. 5. 13, 8. 40;<BR> Ś. 6. 23; Bk. 22. 21.<BR>—2 To be well-managed or regulated, to succeed.<BR>—3 To become, happen, occur; कल्पिष्यते हरेः प्रीतिः Bk. 16. 12, 9. 44, 45.<BR> गजेन्द्राः कल्प्यन्ते तुरगपतयो वर्मरचिताः Pañc. 2. 7;<BR> Bhāg. 3. 16. 12.<BR>—4 To be prepared, be ready; चकॢपे चाश्वकुञ्जरम् Bk. 14. 89.<BR>—5 To be favourable to, subserve.<BR>—6 To partake of.<BR>—7 To prepare, arrange.<BR>—8 To produce, cause, effect, create (with acc.); प्रजापतीनां स पतिश्चकॢपे<BR> कान्प्रजापतीन् Bhāg. 3. 7. 25.<BR>—9 To accommodate oneʼs self to.<BR>—10 To fall to the share of. ━<i>Caus.</i> (कल्पयति-ते)<BR>—1 To prepare, arrange, make ready, fit out; शयनमस्याकल्पयम् K. 156, 157.<BR>—2 To settle, fix upon, intend, design; ध्रुवं मां प्रातराशार्थं राक्षसः<BR> कल्पयिष्यति Rām. 5. 26. 33; कल्पिता मूल्यमेतेषां क्रूरेण भवता<BR> वयम् Mu. 5. 17.<BR>—3 To make, offer; Mu. 6. 21; R. 5. 28, 11. 51, 93.<BR>—4 To provide or furnish with; Bh. 3. 95; R. 1. 94, 5. 9.<BR>—5 To believe, consider, imagine, think; मत्सरस्तु मे विपरीतं कल्पयति<BR> Mu. 7; Śi. 11. 6.<BR>—6 To cut, divide; Ś. 6.<BR>—7 To execute, bring about, do, perform; Śi. 11. 27, 14. 21.<BR>—8 To form, frame;<BR>—9 To invent, compose (as a poem); स्वायंभुवो मनुर्धीमानिदं शास्त्रमकल्पयत् Ms. 1. 102;<BR>—10 To receive, accept; नातो ह्यन्यमकल्पयन् Rām. 2. 91. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॢप्त|कॢप्तः
कॢप्त <i>p. p.</i> [कॢप्-क्त]<BR>—1 Arranged, prepared, done, got ready, at hand; जातस्य मृत्युर्ध्रुव<BR> एष सर्वतः प्रतिक्रिया यस्य न चेह कॢप्ता Bhāg. 6. 10. 32; equipped;<BR> कॢप्तविवाहवेषा R. 6. 10; decked in her nuptial attire.<BR>—2 Cut, pared; कॢप्तकेशनखश्मश्रु Ms. 4. 35.<BR>—3 Caused, produced.<BR>—4 Fixed, settled; पञ्च कॢप्ता महायज्ञाः प्रत्यहं गृहमेधिनाम् Ms. 3. 69, 11. 27.<BR>—5 Thought of, invented.<BR>—6 Formed, framed.<BR>—7 Ascertained, determined; न तस्याश्चित्तमन्यादृक्कॢप्तोऽत्र प्रत्ययस्तथा Ks. 123. 147.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कॢप्तकीला, कॢप्तधूपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॢप्तकीला
कॢप्त + -कीला a title-deed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॢप्तधूपः|कॢप्तधूप
कॢप्त + -धूपः frankincense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॢप्तिः|कॢप्ति
कॢप्तिः <i>f.</i> [कॢप्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Accomplishment, success; Vāj. 18. 11.<BR>—2 Invention, contrivance; Rāj. T. 5. 463.<BR>—3 Arranging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कॢप्तिक|कॢप्तिकः
कॢप्तिक <i>a.</i> Bought, purchased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकयः|केकय
केकयः (Pl.) N. of a country and its people; मगधकोसलकेकयशासिनां<BR> दुहितरः R. 9. 17; केकयमित्रयुप्रलयानां यादेरियः P. VII. 3. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकयी
केकयः + .{@-यी@} (also केकेयी) N. of the wife of Daśaratha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकर|केकरः
केकर <i>a.</i> (री <i>f.</i>) [के मूर्ध्नि करीतुं नेत्रतारां<BR> शीलमस्य, कॄ-अच् अलुक् Tv.] Squint-eyed; Māl. 2. 5, 4. 2; शठ! बान्धवनिःस्नेह<BR> काक! केकर! पिङ्गल! Dūtavākyam 1. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकरम्
केकर + .{@-रम्@} A squint eye; cf. आकेकर.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: केकराक्ष, केकरनेत्र, केकरलोचन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकराक्ष
केकर + -अक्ष, -नेत्र, -लोचन <i>a.</i> squint-eyed; Bṛ. Up. 5. 68. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकरनेत्र
केकर + -अक्ष, -नेत्र, -लोचन <i>a.</i> squint-eyed; Bṛ. Up. 5. 68. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकरलोचन
केकर + -अक्ष, -नेत्र, -लोचन <i>a.</i> squint-eyed; Bṛ. Up. 5. 68. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केका
केका The cry of a peacock; केकाभिर्नीलकण्ठस्तिरयति वचनं ताण्डवादुच्छिखण्डः<BR> Māl. 9. 30; षड्जसंवादिनीः केकाः R. 1. 39, 7. 69, 13. 27, 16. 64; Me. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकावलः|केकावल
केकावलः, केकिकः, केकिन् <i>m.</i><BR> A peacock; इतः केकिक्रीडाकलकलरवः<BR> पक्ष्मलदृशाम् Bh. 1. 93; अकेकी किं केकी किमु कलरवोऽसौ क्षतरवः Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकिकः|केकिक
केकावलः, केकिकः, केकिन् <i>m.</i><BR> A peacock; इतः केकिक्रीडाकलकलरवः<BR> पक्ष्मलदृशाम् Bh. 1. 93; अकेकी किं केकी किमु कलरवोऽसौ क्षतरवः Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकिन्
केकावलः, केकिकः, केकिन् <i>m.</i><BR> A peacock; इतः केकिक्रीडाकलकलरवः<BR> पक्ष्मलदृशाम् Bh. 1. 93; अकेकी किं केकी किमु कलरवोऽसौ क्षतरवः Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केकाणः|केकाण
केकाणः A horse belonging to Kekāṇa locality; गोजिकाणाश्च केकाणाः<BR> प्रौढाहाराश्च मध्यमाः Śālihotra of भोज, Appendix II. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केणिका
केणिका A tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केत|केतः
केत <i>a.</i> [कित्-आधारे घञ्] Knowing, learned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतः|केत
केत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 A house, abode; अनन्यमेकं जगदात्मकेतं भवापवर्गाय भजाम देवम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 63. 44.<BR>—2 Living, habitation.<BR>—3 A banner.<BR>—4 Will, intention, desire.<BR>—5 Summons, invitation.<BR>—6 Apparition, form, shape.<BR>—7 Wealth.<BR>—8 Atmosphere, sky.<BR>—9 Intellect, judgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतकः|केतक
केतकः [कित् निवासे ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 N. of a plant; प्रतिभान्त्यद्य वनानि केतकानाम् Ghaṭ. 15.<BR>—2 A banner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतकम्
केतकः + .{@-कम्@} A flower of the Ketaka plant; केतकैः सूचिभिन्नैः Me. 23;<BR> R. 6. 17, 13. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतकी
केतकः + .{@-की@}<BR>—1 N. of a plant (= केतक); हसितमिव विधत्ते सूचिभिः केतकीनाम् Ṛs. 2. 23.<BR>—2 A flower of that plant; मालाः कदम्बनवकेसरकेतकीभिरायोजिताः<BR> शिरसि बिभ्रति योषितोऽद्य Ṛs. 2. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतनम्
केतनम् [कित्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 A house, an abode; अकलितमहिमानः केतनं मङ्गलानाम् Māl. 2. 9;<BR> मम मरणमेव वरमतिवितथकेतना Gīt. 7.<BR>—2 An invitation, summons; Mb. 13. 23. 12-16.<BR>—3 Place, site; सौवर्णभित्ति संकेतकेतनं संपदामिव Ks. 26. 44.<BR>—4 A flag, banner; भग्नं भीमेन मरुता भवतो रथकेतनम् Ve. 2. 23;<BR> Śi. 14. 28; R. 9. 39.<BR>—5 A sign, symbol; as in मकरकेतन.<BR>—6 An indispensable act (also religious); निवापाञ्जलिदानेन केतनैः<BR> श्राद्धकर्मभिः । तस्योपकारे शक्तस्त्वं किं जीवन् किमुतान्यथा Ve. 3. 16.<BR>—7 A spot, mark.<BR>—8 The body; तस्यां तु वानरो दिव्यः सिंहशार्दूलकेतनः Mb. 1. 225. 15;<BR> Bhāg. 4. 24. 68; Gīt. 7. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतयति
केतयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To summon, call, invite.<BR>—2 To advise, counsel.<BR>—3 To fix or appoint a time.<BR>—4 To hear,<BR>—5 To show, indicate; U. 6. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतित
केतित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Called, summoned; केतितस्तु यथान्यायं हव्यकव्ये द्विजोत्तमः Ms. 3. 190.<BR>—2 Dwelt, inhabited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुः|केतु
केतुः [चाय्-तु की आदेशः Uṇ. 1. 73]<BR>—1 A flag, banner; चीनांशुकमिव केतोः प्रतिवातं नीयमानस्य Ś. 1. 33.<BR>—2 A chief, head, leader, foremost, any eminent person (oft. at the end<BR> of comp.); मनुष्यवाचा मनुवंशकेतुम् R. 2. 33, 14. 7; कुलस्य केतुः<BR> स्फीतस्य (राघवः) Rām.<BR>—3 A comet, meteor; Bhāg. 2. 6. 15; Ms. 1. 38.<BR>—4 A sign, mark.<BR>—5 Brightness, clearness.<BR>—6 A ray of light; प्रययौ कान्तिमिव द्रुमाब्जकेतुम् Bu. C. 5. 3; Bhāg. 8. 6. 15.<BR> cf. also ‘केतुर्द्युतौ पताकायाम्’ इति विश्वः.<BR>—7 The descending node considered as the ninth planet, and the body or<BR> trunk of the demon सैहिकेय (the head being regarded as Rāhu); क्रूरग्रहः<BR> स केतुश्चन्द्रं संपूर्णमण्डलमिदानीम् Mu. 1. 6.<BR>—8 Day-time.<BR>—9 Apparition, form, shape.<BR>—10 Intellect, judgment; नि केतुना जनानां चिकेथे पूतदक्षसा Rv. 5. 66. 4.<BR>—11 A pigmy race.<BR>—12 A disease.<BR>—13 An enemy.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: केतुग्रहः, केतुचक्रम्, केतुतारा, केतुभः, केतुमालः, केतुमालम्, केतुयष्टिः, केतुरत्नम्, केतुवसनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुग्रहः|केतुग्रह
केतुः + -ग्रहः the descending node.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुचक्रम्
केतुः + -चक्रम् a kind of diagram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुतारा
केतुः + -तारा a comet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुभः|केतुभ
केतुः + -भः a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुमालः|केतुमाल|केतुमालं
केतुः + -मालः, -मालम् one of the nine great divisions of the known world<BR> (the western portion of जम्बुद्वीप.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुमालम्
केतुः + -मालः, -मालम् one of the nine great divisions of the known world<BR> (the western portion of जम्बुद्वीप.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुयष्टिः|केतुयष्टि
केतुः + -यष्टिः <i>f.</i> a flag-staff; नामाङ्करावणशराङ्कितकेतुयष्टिमूर्ध्वं<BR> रथं हरिसहस्रयुजं निनाय R. 12. 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुरत्नम्
केतुः + -रत्नम् lapis lazuli, (also called वैडूर्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केतुवसनम्
केतुः + -वसनम् a flag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केदर|केदरः
केदर <i>a.</i> Squint-eyed; cf. केकर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केदारः|केदार
केदारः<BR>—1 A field under water; meadow; केदारेभ्यस्त्वपोऽगृह्णन्कर्षका दृढसेतुभिः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 20. 41; Ms. 9. 38, 44; cf. the play on words in the Subhāṣ.<BR> के दारपोषणरताः? and the reply is केदारपोषणरताः.<BR>—2 A basin for water round the root of a tree.<BR>—3 A mountain.<BR>—4 A particular mountain forming part of the Himālayas (modern Kedār).<BR>—5 A form of Śiva.<BR>—6 N. of a Rāga (in music).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: केदारखण्डम्, केदारनाथः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केदारखण्डम्
केदारः + -खण्डम् a small dyke, earth raised to keep out water; गच्छ<BR> केदारखण्डं बधान Mb. 1. 3. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केदारनाथः|केदारनाथ
केदारः + -नाथः a particular form of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केदारकः|केदारक
केदारकः A kind of rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केन
केन <i>ind.</i> By what? whence, how, why; वत्सोपमन्यो केन वृत्तिं<BR> कल्पयसि Mb. 1. 3. 36. {@केनेशितोपनिषद्, केनोपनिषद्@} N. of one<BR> of the old principal Upaniṣads.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केनती
केनती The amorous sports of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केनारः|केनार
केनारः<BR>—1 The head.<BR>—2 The skull.<BR>—3 A cheek.<BR>—4 A joint.<BR>—5 The temples.<BR>—6 A kind of hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केनिप
केनिप <i>a.</i> Ved. Wise, learned (मेधाविन्); यथा केनिपानामिनो<BR> वृधे Rv. 10. 44. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केनिपातः|केनिपात
केनिपातः A rudder, helm, a large oar used as a rudder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केन्दुः|केन्दु
केन्दुः, -न्दुकः<BR> N. of a tree (Mangosteen), a variety of ebony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केन्दुकः|केन्दुक
केन्दुः, -न्दुकः<BR> N. of a tree (Mangosteen), a variety of ebony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केन्द्रम्
केन्द्रम्<BR>—1 The centre of a circle.<BR>—2 The argument of a circle.<BR>—3 The argument of an equation.<BR>—4 Distance of a planet from the first point of its orbit in the 4th,<BR> 7th or 10th degree.<BR>—5 The first, fourth, seventh and tenth lunar mansion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केप्
केप् €1 Ā. (केपते) To shake or tremble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केपि
केपि Ved. <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Trembling, shaking; ते न्यविशन्त केपयः Rv. 10. 44. 6.<BR>—2 Unclean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केयूरः|केयूर|केयूरं
केयूरः, -रम्<BR> [के बाहुशिरसि याति, या-ऊर किच्च अलुक् समा˚ Tv.] A bracelet<BR> worn on the upper arm, an armlet; केयूरा न विभूषयन्ति पुरुषं हारा<BR> न चन्द्रोज्ज्वलाः Bh. 2. 19; R. 6. 68; Ku. 7. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केयूरम्
केयूरः, -रम्<BR> [के बाहुशिरसि याति, या-ऊर किच्च अलुक् समा˚ Tv.] A bracelet<BR> worn on the upper arm, an armlet; केयूरा न विभूषयन्ति पुरुषं हारा<BR> न चन्द्रोज्ज्वलाः Bh. 2. 19; R. 6. 68; Ku. 7. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केयूरः|केयूर|केयूरं
