केयूरिन्
केयूरिन् <i>a.</i> Decorated with a bracelet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केरलः|केरल
केरलः (pl.) N. of a country (in the south of India, the modern<BR> Malabar) and its inhabitants; Māl. 6. 19; भयोत्सृष्टविभूषाणां तेन केरलयोषिताम् R. 4. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केरली
केरलः + .{@-ली@}<BR>—1 A woman of the Kerala country; कर्णाटीनां मुषितमुरलीकेरलीहारलीलः<BR> (राजेन्द्रकर्णपूरः).<BR>—2 Astronomical science.<BR>—3 A Hora or period of time equal to one hour.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: केरलजातकम्, केरलतन्त्रम्, केरलसिद्धान्तः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

