केली + -कलितम् amusement, jest, play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलीपिकः|केलीपिक
केली + -पिकः a cuckoo kept for pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलीवनी
केली + -वनी a pleasure-park, pleasure-grove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केलीशुकः|केलीशुक
केली + -शुकः a parrot kept for pleasure; दूराद् दाडिमबीजशङ्कितधियः<BR> कर्षन्ति केलीशुकाः Kuval.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केव्
केव् Ā. (केवते)<BR>—1 To serve, attend to, wait upon.<BR>—2 To enjoy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवटः|केवट
केवटः Ved. A hollow, cave; माकीं सं शारि केवटे Rv. 6. 54. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवर्तः|केवर्त|केवर्त्त|केवर्त्तः
केवर्तः Ved. A fisherman; Vāj. 30. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवल|केवलं|केवलः
केवल <i>a.</i> [केव् सेवने वृषा˚ कल]<BR>—1 Peculiar, exclusive, uncommon; किं तया क्रियते लक्ष्म्या या वधूरिव<BR> केवला Pt. 2. 134.<BR>—2 Alone, mere, sole, only, isolated; स हि तस्य न केवलां श्रियं<BR> प्रतिपेदे सकलान् गुणानपि R. 8. 5; न केवलानां पयसां प्रसूतिमवेहि<BR> मां कामदुघां प्रसन्नाम् 2. 63, 15. 1; Ku. 2. 34.<BR>—3 Whole, entire, absolute, perfect.<BR>—4 Bare, uncovered (as ground); निषेदुषी स्थण्डिल एव केवले Ku. 5. 12.<BR>—5 Pure, simple, unmingled, unattended (by anything else); कातर्यं<BR> केवला नीतिः R. 17. 47.<BR>—6 Selfish, envious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवली
केवल + .{@-ली, -लम्@}<BR>—1 The doctrine of absolute unity of spirit and matter.<BR>—2 One of the five types of knowledge according to the Jainas; (श्रुतज्ञान,<BR> मतिज्ञान, अवधिज्ञान, मनःपर्ययज्ञान, and केवलज्ञान).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलम्
केवल + .{@-ली, -लम्@}<BR>—1 The doctrine of absolute unity of spirit and matter.<BR>—2 One of the five types of knowledge according to the Jainas; (श्रुतज्ञान,<BR> मतिज्ञान, अवधिज्ञान, मनःपर्ययज्ञान, and केवलज्ञान).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवली
केवल + .{@-ली@} Astronomical science.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलम्
केवल + .{@-लम्@} <i>ind.</i> Only, merely, solely, entirely, absolutely, wholly;<BR> केवलमिदमेव पृच्छामि K. 155; न केवलं━अपि not only━but;<BR> वसु तस्य विभोर्न केवलं गुणवत्तापि परप्रयोजना R. 8. 31; cf.<BR> also 3. 19, 20, 31.<BR>—2 Silently, quietly; न हि मेऽव्याहृतं कुर्यात्सर्वलोकोऽपि केवलम् Mb. 12. 2. 28.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: केवलाद्वैतम्, केवलान्वयिन्, केवलात्मन्, केवलज्ञानम्, केवलज्ञानिन्, केवलद्रव्यम्, केवलज्ञानम्, केवलनैयायिकः, केवलव्यतिरेकिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलाद्वैतम्
केवल + -अद्वैतम् a particular doctrine of अद्वैत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलान्वयिन्
केवल + -अन्वयिन् see under अन्वय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलात्मन्
केवल + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> one whose essence is absolute unity; नमस्त्रिमूर्तये<BR> तुभ्यं प्राक्सृष्टेः केवलात्मने Ku. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलज्ञानम्
केवल + -ज्ञानम् the highest possible knowledge, (Jaina Phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलज्ञानिन्
केवल + -ज्ञानिन् <i>m.</i> one who has obtained the highest possible knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलद्रव्यम्
केवल + -द्रव्यम्<BR>—1 black pepper.<BR>—2 mere mattar or substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलज्ञानम्
केवल + -ज्ञानम् highest Knowledge; जयन्ति ते जिना येषां केवलज्ञानशालिनाम् Pt. 5. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलनैयायिकः|केवलनैयायिक
केवल + -नैयायिकः a mere logician (not proficient in any other branch<BR> of learning); so ˚वैयाकरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलव्यतिरेकिन्
केवल + -व्यतिरेकिन् <i>m.</i> pertaining to only one of the varieties of<BR> inference according to न्यायशास्त्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलतस्
केवलतस् <i>ind.</i> Simply, solely, wholly, purely, merely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलता
केवलता The absolute unity of spirit and matter; सांख्याः केवलतां<BR> गताः Mb. 12. 315. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केवलिन्
केवलिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Alone, only.<BR>—2 Devoted to the doctrine of absolute unity of the spirit; Bhāg. 4. 25. 39.<BR>—3 one who has obtained the highest knowledge (Jaina Phil.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशः|केश
केशः [क्लिश्यते क्लिश्नाति वा क्लिश्-अन् लो लोपश्च Uṇ. 5. 33]<BR>—1 Hair in general; विकीर्णकेशासु परेतभूमिषु Ku. 5. 68.<BR>—2 Especially, the hair of the head; केशेषु गृहीत्वा or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">Page0604-2</a>]<BR> केशग्राहं युध्यन्ते Sk.; मुक्तकेशा Ms. 7. 91; केशव्यपरोपणादिव<BR> R. 3. 56, 2. 8.<BR>—3 The mane of a horse or lion.<BR>—4 A ray of light.<BR>—5 An epithet of Varuṇa.<BR>—6 A kind of perfume.<BR>—7 An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशी
केशः + .{@-शी@}<BR>—1 A lock of hair (on the crown of the head.)<BR>—2 An epithet of Durgā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: केशान्तः, केशान्तिक, केशारिः, केशार्हा, केशोच्चयः, केशकर्मन्, केशकलापः, केशकारम्, केशकारिन्, केशकीटः, केशगर्भः, केशगृहीत, केशग्रन्थिः, केशग्रहः, केशग्रहणम्, केशघ्न, केशच्छिद्, केशजाहम्, केशधारणम्, केशप्रसारः, केशपक्षः, केशपाशः, केशहस्तः, केशबन्धः, केशभूः, केशभूमिः, केशप्रसाधनी, केशमार्जकम्, केशमार्जनम्, केशरचना, केशलुञ्चकः, केशवपनम्, केशवेशः, केशवेष्टः, केशव्यपरोपणम्, केशशूला, केशशूलम्, केशसंवाहनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशान्तः|केशान्त|केशांत
केशः + -अन्तः<BR>—1 the tip of the hair.<BR>—2 long hair hanging down, a lock or tuft of hair.<BR>—3 cutting of the hair as a religious ceremony; केशान्तः षोडशे वर्षे<BR> ब्राह्मणस्य विधीयते । राजन्यबन्धोर्द्वाविंशे वैश्यस्य द्वपधिके ततः ॥ Ms. 2. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशान्तिक
केशः + -अन्तिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 extending to the end of the hair as far as the forehead.<BR>—2 relating to the ceremony of final tonsure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशारिः|केशारि
केशः + -अरिः <i>m.</i> N. of a plant (Mar. नागकेशर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशार्हा
केशः + -अर्हा <i>f.</i> N. of a plant (Mar. थोरनीली).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशोच्चयः|केशोच्चय
केशः + -उच्चयः much or handsome hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशकर्मन्|केशकर्म्मन्
केशः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> dressing or arranging the hair (of the head)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशकलापः|केशकलाप
केशः + -कलापः a mass or quantity of hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशकारम्
केशः + -कारम् a sort of sugar-cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशकारिन्
केशः + -कारिन् <i>a.</i> dressing or arranging the hair of the head; निहीनवर्णां<BR> सैरन्ध्रीं बीभत्सां केशकारिणीम् Mb. 4. 14. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशकीटः|केशकीट
केशः + -कीटः a louse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशगर्भः|केशगर्भ
केशः + -गर्भः<BR>—1 a braid of hair.<BR>—2 an epithet of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशगृहीत
केशः + -गृहीत <i>a.</i> seized by the hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशग्रन्थिः|केशग्रन्थि
केशः + -ग्रन्थिः <i>m.</i> a tie of hair; Bhāg. 10. 39. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशग्रहः|केशग्रह
केशः + -ग्रहः, -ग्रहणम् pulling the hair, seizing (one) by the hair<BR> (both in amorous sports and in fighting); केशग्रहः खलु तदा द्रुपदात्मजायाः<BR> Ve. 3. 11, 29; Me. 52; so यत्र रतेषु केशग्रहाः K. 8 (that is, not in battles).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशग्रहणम्
केशः + -ग्रहः, -ग्रहणम् pulling the hair, seizing (one) by the hair<BR> (both in amorous sports and in fighting); केशग्रहः खलु तदा द्रुपदात्मजायाः<BR> Ve. 3. 11, 29; Me. 52; so यत्र रतेषु केशग्रहाः K. 8 (that is, not in battles).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशघ्न|केशघ्नं
केशः + -घ्न morbid baldness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशच्छिद्
केशः + -छिद् <i>m.</i> a hair-dresser, barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशजाहम्
केशः + -जाहम् the root of the hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशधारणम्
केशः + -धारणम् keeping (not cutting) the hair; दूरेवार्ययनं तीर्थं<BR> लावण्यं केशधारणम् Bhāg. 12. 2. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशप्रसारः|केशप्रसार
केशः + -प्रसारः cleaning the hair; Bhāg. 10. 59. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशपक्षः|केशपक्ष
केशः + -पक्षः, -पाशः, -हस्तः much (or ornamented) तं केशपाशं<BR> प्रसमीक्ष्य कुर्युर्बालप्रियत्वं शिथिलं चमर्यः Ku. 1. 48, 7. 57; Śi. 8. 27.<BR> ‘the hair for a hand’ (केशहस्तः) is another interpretation;<BR> cf. कचपक्ष, कचहस्त &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशपाशः|केशपाश
केशः + -पक्षः, -पाशः, -हस्तः much (or ornamented) तं केशपाशं<BR> प्रसमीक्ष्य कुर्युर्बालप्रियत्वं शिथिलं चमर्यः Ku. 1. 48, 7. 57; Śi. 8. 27.<BR> ‘the hair for a hand’ (केशहस्तः) is another interpretation;<BR> cf. कचपक्ष, कचहस्त &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशहस्तः|केशहस्त
केशः + -पक्षः, -पाशः, -हस्तः much (or ornamented) तं केशपाशं<BR> प्रसमीक्ष्य कुर्युर्बालप्रियत्वं शिथिलं चमर्यः Ku. 1. 48, 7. 57; Śi. 8. 27.<BR> ‘the hair for a hand’ (केशहस्तः) is another interpretation;<BR> cf. कचपक्ष, कचहस्त &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशबन्धः|केशबन्ध|केशबंध
केशः + -बन्धः<BR>—1 a hair-band; (विराजसे) मुकुटेन विचित्रेण केशबन्धेन शोभिना Mb. 4. 6. 12.<BR>—2 a particular position of hands in dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशभूः
केशः + -भूः, -भूमिः <i>f.</i> the head or any other part of the body on<BR> which hair grows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशभूमिः|केशभूमि
केशः + -भूः, -भूमिः <i>f.</i> the head or any other part of the body on<BR> which hair grows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशप्रसाधनी
केशः + -प्रसाधनी, -मार्जकम्, -मार्जनम् a comb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशमार्जकम्
केशः + -प्रसाधनी, -मार्जकम्, -मार्जनम् a comb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशमार्जनम्
केशः + -प्रसाधनी, -मार्जकम्, -मार्जनम् a comb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशरचना
केशः + -रचना dressing the hair; कुर्वन्ति केशरचनामपरास्तरुण्यः Ṛs. 4. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशलुञ्चकः|केशलुञ्चक
केशः + -लुञ्चकः a Jaina ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवपनम्
केशः + -वपनम् shaving or cutting the hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवेशः|केशवेश
केशः + -वेशः a tress of fillet of hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवेष्टः|केशवेष्ट
केशः + -वेष्टः the parting of the hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशव्यपरोपणम्
केशः + -व्यपरोपणम् putting the hair; चुकोप तस्मै स भृशं सुरश्रियः<BR> प्रसह्य केशव्यपरोपणादिव R. 3. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशशूला
केशः + -शूला a harlot (वेश्या); केशशूलाः स्त्रियश्चापि भविष्यन्ति<BR> युगक्षये Mb. 3. 190. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशशूलम्
केशः + -शूलम् disease of the hair; Mb. 3; hair on the head and face केशश्मश्रु<BR> वपति Mbh. on I. 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशसंवाहनम्
केशः + -संवाहनम् dressing of hair; cf. पादसंवाहने वज्री केशसंवाहने<BR> फणी । अहो भाग्यं पुरन्ध्रीणां दधिसंमथने रविः ॥ Subh. Ratn. (स्त्रीप्रशंसा 17).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशक|केशकः
केशक^1 <i>a.</i> Skilful in dressing the hair; P. V. 2. 66; Kāśi.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशटः|केशट
केशटः<BR>—1 A goat.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 A bug.<BR>—4 A brother.<BR>—5 A louse.<BR>—6 An arrow of Cupid (शोषण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशव|केशवः
केशव <i>a.</i> [केशाः प्रशस्ताः सन्त्यस्य; केश-व P. V. 2. 109]<BR> Having much, fine or luxuriant hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवः|केशव
केशव + .{@-वः@}<BR>—1 An epithet<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">Page0605-1</a>]<BR> of Viṣṇu; केशव जय जगदीश हरे Gīt. 1; केशवं पतितं दृष्ट्वा<BR> पाण्डवा हर्षनिर्भराः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 The Supreme Being.<BR>—3 The month of मार्गशीर्ष.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: केशवायुधः, केशवालयः, केशवावासः, केशवदैवज्ञः, केशवस्वामिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवायुधः|केशवायुध
केशव + -आयुधः the mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवायुधम्
केशव + -आयुधः + ({@-धम्@}) a weapon of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवालयः|केशवालय
केशव + -आलयः, -आवासः the Aśvattha tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवावासः|केशवावास
केशव + -आलयः, -आवासः the Aśvattha tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवदैवज्ञः|केशवदैवज्ञ
केशव + -दैवज्ञः N. of an astronomer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशवस्वामिन्
केशव + -स्वामिन् N. of a grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशाकेशि
केशाकेशि [P. II. 2. 27; Vārt. 3] <i>ind.</i> ‘Hair to hair’, (fighting)<BR> by pulling each otherʼs hair; केशाकेश्यभवेद्युद्धं रक्षसां वानरैः<BR> सह Mb.; Y. 2. 283.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशिक|केशिकः
केशिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [केश-ठन्] Having fine or<BR> luxuriant hair; P. V. 2. 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशिन्
केशिन् <i>m.</i> [केश-इनि]<BR>—1 A lion.<BR>—2 N. of a Rākṣasa slain by Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—3 N. of another Rākṣasa who carried Devasenā and who was slain by Indra.<BR>—4 An epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—5 One having fine hair.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: केशिनिषूदनः, केशिमथनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशिनिषूदनः|केशिनिषूदन
केशिन् + -निषूदनः, -मथनः epithets of Kṛṣṇa; Bg. 18. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशिमथनः|केशिमथन
केशिन् + -निषूदनः, -मथनः epithets of Kṛṣṇa; Bg. 18. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशिनी
केशिनी<BR>—1 A woman with a beautiful braid of hair.<BR>—2 N. of the wife of Viśravas and mother of Rāvaṇa and Kumbhakarṇa;<BR> ततस्तौ राक्षसौ जातौ केशिन्यां विश्रवःसुतौ । रावणः कुम्भकर्णश्च सर्वलोकोपतापनौ ॥<BR> Bhāg. 7. 1. 44.<BR>—3 An epithet of Durgā.<BR>—4 N. of a plant (जटामांसी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केश्य|केश्यं|केश्यः
केश्य <i>a.</i> Conducive to the growth of hair; being in the hair;<BR> अपास्याः केश्यं मलमप शीर्षण्यं लिखात् Av. 14. 2. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केश्यः|केश्य|केश्यं
केश्य + .{@-श्यः@} N. of a plant (महाबला), Eclipta Prostata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केश्यम्
केश्य + .{@-श्यम्@} Black sandal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसरः|केसर|केसरं
केस(श)रः, -रम्<BR>—1 The mane (as of a lion); न हन्त्यदूरेऽपि गजान्मृगेश्वरो विलोलजिह्वश्चलिताग्रकेसरः<BR> Ṛs. 1. 14; Ś. 7. 14.<BR>—2 The filament of a flower; नीपं दृष्ट्वा हरितकपिशं केसरैरर्धरूढैः<BR> Me. 21; Ś. 6. 18; M. 2. 11; R. 4. 67; Śi. 9. 47.<BR>—3 The Bakula tree; रक्ताशोकश्चलकिसलयः केसरश्चात्र कान्तः Me. 80; Ku. 3. 55.<BR>—4 The Punnāga tree.<BR>—5 The fibre (as of a mango fruit).<BR>—6 Saffron.<BR>—7 The hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशरः|केशर|केशरं
केस(श)रः, -रम्<BR>—1 The mane (as of a lion); न हन्त्यदूरेऽपि गजान्मृगेश्वरो विलोलजिह्वश्चलिताग्रकेसरः<BR> Ṛs. 1. 14; Ś. 7. 14.<BR>—2 The filament of a flower; नीपं दृष्ट्वा हरितकपिशं केसरैरर्धरूढैः<BR> Me. 21; Ś. 6. 18; M. 2. 11; R. 4. 67; Śi. 9. 47.<BR>—3 The Bakula tree; रक्ताशोकश्चलकिसलयः केसरश्चात्र कान्तः Me. 80; Ku. 3. 55.<BR>—4 The Punnāga tree.<BR>—5 The fibre (as of a mango fruit).<BR>—6 Saffron.<BR>—7 The hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसरम्
केस(श)रः, -रम्<BR>—1 The mane (as of a lion); न हन्त्यदूरेऽपि गजान्मृगेश्वरो विलोलजिह्वश्चलिताग्रकेसरः<BR> Ṛs. 1. 14; Ś. 7. 14.<BR>—2 The filament of a flower; नीपं दृष्ट्वा हरितकपिशं केसरैरर्धरूढैः<BR> Me. 21; Ś. 6. 18; M. 2. 11; R. 4. 67; Śi. 9. 47.<BR>—3 The Bakula tree; रक्ताशोकश्चलकिसलयः केसरश्चात्र कान्तः Me. 80; Ku. 3. 55.<BR>—4 The Punnāga tree.<BR>—5 The fibre (as of a mango fruit).<BR>—6 Saffron.<BR>—7 The hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसरम्
केस(श)रः, -रम् + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 A flower of the Bakula tree; सुरभिगन्धपराजितकेसरम् R. 9. 36.<BR>—2 Gold.<BR>—3 Sulphate of iron.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: केसराचलः, केसराम्लः, केसरवरम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसराचलः|केसराचल
केसरः + -अचलः an epithet of the mountain Meru; Bhāg. 5. 17. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसराम्लः|केसराम्ल
केसरः + -अम्लः the citron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसरवरम्
केसरः + -वरम् saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसराल
केसराल <i>a.</i> Rich in filaments; Kāvyāl. 5. 2. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसरिः|केसरि
केसरिः N. of the father of Hanūmat; Rām. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसरिका
केसरिका A clout for cleaning vessels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसरिन्
केस(श)रिन् <i>m.</i> [केस(श)र-इनि]<BR>—1 A lion; अनुहुंकुरुते घनध्वनिं न हि गोमायुरुतानि केसरी Śi. 16. 25;<BR> धनुर्धरः केसरिणं ददर्श R. 2. 29; Ś. 7. 3.<BR>—2 The best, excellent, or most prominent of a class (at the end of comp.);<BR> cf. कुञ्जर, सिंह &c.<BR>—3 A horse; Mb. 12. 78. 4.<BR>—4 The citron plant.<BR>—5 The Punnāga tree.<BR>—6 N. of the father of Hanūmat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केशरिन्
केस(श)रिन् <i>m.</i> [केस(श)र-इनि]<BR>—1 A lion; अनुहुंकुरुते घनध्वनिं न हि गोमायुरुतानि केसरी Śi. 16. 25;<BR> धनुर्धरः केसरिणं ददर्श R. 2. 29; Ś. 7. 3.<BR>—2 The best, excellent, or most prominent of a class (at the end of comp.);<BR> cf. कुञ्जर, सिंह &c.<BR>—3 A horse; Mb. 12. 78. 4.<BR>—4 The citron plant.<BR>—5 The Punnāga tree.<BR>—6 N. of the father of Hanūmat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसरिणी
केस(श)रिन् + .{@-रिणी@} A lioness; Ks. 70. 102.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: केसरिसुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

केसरिसुतः|केसरिसुत
केसरिन् + -सुतः an epithet of Hanūmat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कै
कै €1 P. (कायति) To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

