कैटभी
कैटभः + .{@-भा, -भी@} An epithet of Durgā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: कैटभारिः, कैटभार्दनः, कैटभजित्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

कैटभारिः|कैटभारि
