कैमर्थक्यम्
कैमर्थक्यम्^1 <i>n.</i> Want of purpose; कैमर्थक्यान्नियमो भवति । विधेयं<BR> नास्तीति कृत्वा Mbh. on I. 4. 3, VII. 2. 26, VIII. 4. 32.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174. note: headword change.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

