क्रमणम्
क्रमणः + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 A step, Y. 1. 188.<BR>—2 Walking; यो वामृजवे क्रमणाय रोदसी Rv. 6. 70. 3.<BR>—3 Proceeding.<BR>—4 Transgressing.<BR>—5 Treatment of words or letters according to the Krama arrangement; Rv. Pr. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0614-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

