क्रान्तिमण्डलम्
क्रान्तिः + -कक्षः, -मण्डलम्, -वलयः, -वृत्तम् the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रान्तिवलयः|क्रान्तिवलय|क्रांतिवलय
क्रान्तिः + -कक्षः, -मण्डलम्, -वलयः, -वृत्तम् the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रान्तिवृत्तम्
क्रान्तिः + -कक्षः, -मण्डलम्, -वलयः, -वृत्तम् the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रान्तिक्षेत्रम्
क्रान्तिः + -क्षेत्रम् a figure described by the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रान्तिजीवा
क्रान्तिः + -जीवा, -ज्यका, -ज्या the sine of the declination or of the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रान्तिज्यका
क्रान्तिः + -जीवा, -ज्यका, -ज्या the sine of the declination or of the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रान्तिज्या
क्रान्तिः + -जीवा, -ज्यका, -ज्या the sine of the declination or of the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रान्तिपातः|क्रान्तिपात|क्रांतिपात
क्रान्तिः + -पातः the equinoctial points or nodes of the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रान्तिभागः|क्रान्तिभाग
क्रान्तिः + -भागः the declination of a point of the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रान्तिवलयः|क्रान्तिवलय|क्रांतिवलय
क्रान्तिः + -वलयः<BR>—1 the ecliptic.<BR>—2 the tropical zone, space within the tropics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रान्तुः|क्रान्तु|क्रांतुः
क्रान्तुः A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रवण
क्रवण <i>a.</i> Ved. Worshipping, praising; अत्रा न हार्दि कवणस्य<BR> रेषते Rv. 5. 44. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रविस्
क्रविस् <i>n.</i> Ved. Raw flesh, carrion; पौरुषेयं च ये क्रविः Av. 8. 6. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रव्यम्
क्रव्यम् Raw flesh, carrion, स्थपुटगतमपि क्रव्यमव्यग्रमत्ति<BR> Māl. 5. 16. [cf. Gr. <i>kreas</i>; L. <i>caro</i>]<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रव्याद्, क्रव्याद, क्रव्यभुज्, क्रव्यघातनः, क्रव्यवाहनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रव्याद्
क्रव्यम् + -अद्, -अद, -भुज् <i>m.</i> eating raw flesh; Rv. 10. 16. 9; Ms. 5. 131. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a carnivorous animal, such as a tiger &c.; क्रव्याद्भ्यो बलिमिव निर्घृणः<BR> क्षिपामि U. 1. 49.<BR>—2 a demon, goblin; R. 15. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रव्याद|क्रव्यादः
क्रव्यम् + -अद्, -अद, -भुज् <i>m.</i> eating raw flesh; Rv. 10. 16. 9; Ms. 5. 131. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a carnivorous animal, such as a tiger &c.; क्रव्याद्भ्यो बलिमिव निर्घृणः<BR> क्षिपामि U. 1. 49.<BR>—2 a demon, goblin; R. 15. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रव्यभुज्
क्रव्यम् + -अद्, -अद, -भुज् <i>m.</i> eating raw flesh; Rv. 10. 16. 9; Ms. 5. 131. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a carnivorous animal, such as a tiger &c.; क्रव्याद्भ्यो बलिमिव निर्घृणः<BR> क्षिपामि U. 1. 49.<BR>—2 a demon, goblin; R. 15. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रव्यघातनः|क्रव्यघातन
क्रव्यम् + -घातनः a deer (killed for its flesh) cf. Bhāg. 5. 26. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रव्यवाहनः|क्रव्यवाहन
क्रव्यम् + -वाहनः Ved. an epithet of Agni; Rv. 10. 16. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रशयति
क्रशयति Den. P. To emaciate, make thin or lean; क्रशितं शरीरमशरीरशरैः Śi. 9. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रशित
क्रशित <i>a.</i> Made lean, emaciated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रशिमन्
क्रशिमन् <i>m.</i> Thinness, emaciation, leanness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्राकचिकः|क्राकचिक
क्राकचिकः A sawyer; मायूरकाः क्राकचिका वेधका रोचकास्तथा<BR> Rām. 2. 83. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्राथः|क्राथ
क्राथः Killing, murder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिमिः|क्रिमि
क्रिमिः, -का <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A worm; क्रिमिकाण्डजन्तुकीर्णाम् (रसाम्) Bu. C. 5. 5.<BR>—2 An insect; see कृमि.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रिमिजम्, क्रिमिशैलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिमिका
क्रिमिः, -का <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A worm; क्रिमिकाण्डजन्तुकीर्णाम् (रसाम्) Bu. C. 5. 5.<BR>—2 An insect; see कृमि.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रिमिजम्, क्रिमिशैलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिमिजम्
क्रिमिः + -जम् aloe-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिमिशैलः|क्रिमिशैल
क्रिमिः + -शैलः an ant-hill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियः|क्रिय
क्रियः The sign of the Zodiac called Aries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियमाणकम्
क्रियमाणकम् A literary essay; Bṛ. S. 1. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिया
क्रिया [कृ भावे करणादौ वा श cf. P. III]<BR>—1 Doing, execution, performance, accomplishment; उपचार˚, धर्म˚;<BR> प्रत्युक्तं हि प्रणयिषु सतामीप्सितार्थक्रियैव Me. 116.<BR>—2 An action, act, business, undertaking; प्रणयिक्रिया V. 4. 15; Ms. 2. 4.<BR>—3 Activity, bodily action, labour.<BR>—4 Teaching, instruction; क्रिया हि वस्तूपहिता प्रसीदति R. 3. 29.<BR> क्रिया हि द्रव्यं विनयति नाद्रव्यम् Kau. A. 1. 5.<BR>—5 Possession of some act (as of singing, dancing &c.), knowledge; शिष्टा<BR> क्रिया कस्यचिदात्मसंस्था M. 1. 16.<BR>—6 Practice (opp. शास्त्र theory).<BR>—7 A literary work, composition; शृणुत मनोभिरवहितैः क्रियामिमां<BR> कालिदासस्य V. 1. 2; कालिदासस्य क्रियायां कथं परिषदो बहुमानः M. 1.<BR>—8 A purificatory rite, a religious rite or ceremony; Ms. 10. 43.<BR>—9 An expiatory rite, expiation.<BR>—10<BR>——(<i>a</i>) The ceremony of offering oblations to the deceased ancestors (श्राद्ध).<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Obsequies.<BR>—11 Worship; त्रैतादिषु हरेरर्चा क्रियायै कविभिः ऽकृता Bhāg. 7. 14. 39.<BR>—12 Medical treatment, application of remedies, cure; शीतक्रिया M. 4<BR> cold remedies.<BR>—13 (In gram.) Action, the general idea expressed by a verb.<BR>—14 Motion.<BR>—15 Especially, motion as one of the seven categories of the Vaiśeṣikas;<BR> see कर्मन्.<BR>—16 (In law) Judicial investigation by human means (witnesses &c.) or by ordeals.<BR>—17 Burden of proof; क्रिया स्याद्वादिनोर्द्वयोः; द्वयोरपि वादिनोः क्रिया<BR> प्राप्नोति V. May.<BR>—18 A verb.<BR>—19 A noun of action.<BR>—20 Disquisition.<BR>—21 Study.<BR>—22 Means, expedients.<BR>—23 Instrument, implement.<BR>—24 A construction; कूपप्रपापुष्करिणीवनानां चक्रुः क्रियास्तत्र च<BR> धर्मकामाः Bu. C. 2. 12.<BR>—25 Spirit (अध्यात्म) ?; द्रव्यक्रियाकारकाख्यं धूत्वा यान्त्यपुनर्भवम्<BR> Bhāg. 12. 6. 38.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रियान्वित, क्रियापवर्गः, क्रियाभ्युपगमः, क्रियार्थ, क्रियावसन्न, क्रियारम्भः, क्रियेन्द्रियम्, क्रियाकलापः, क्रियाकल्पः, क्रियाकाण्डम्, क्रियाकारः, क्रियातन्त्रम्, क्रियाद्वेषिन्, क्रियाद्वैतम्, क्रियानिर्देशः, क्रियापटु, क्रियापथः, क्रियापदम्, क्रियापर, क्रियापादः, क्रियामाधुर्यम्, क्रियायज्ञः, क्रियायोगः, क्रियालोपः, क्रियावशः, क्रियावाचक, क्रियावाचिन्, क्रियावादिन्, क्रियाविधिः, क्रियाविशेषणम्, क्रियाशक्तिः, क्रियासंक्रान्तिः, क्रियासमभिहारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियान्वित
क्रिया + -अन्वित <i>a.</i> practising ritual observances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापवर्गः|क्रियापवर्ग
क्रिया + -अपवर्गः<BR>—1 completion or termination of an affair, execution of a task; क्रियापवर्गेष्वनुजीविसात्<BR> कृताः Ki. 1. 14.<BR>—2 liberation from ceremonial acts, absolution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाभ्युपगमः|क्रियाभ्युपगम
क्रिया + -अभ्युपगमः a special agreement; क्रियाभ्युपगमात्त्वेतत् बीजार्थं<BR> यत्प्रदीयते Ms. 9. 53;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियार्थ
क्रिया + -अर्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 (a Vedic injunction) enjoining some duty.<BR>—2 useful for some purpose; अपि क्रियार्थं सुलभं समित्कुशम् Ku. 5. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावसन्न|क्रियावसन्नः
क्रिया + -अवसन्न <i>a.</i> one who loses a law-suit through the statements<BR> of the witnesses &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियारम्भः|क्रियारम्भ
क्रिया + -आरम्भः Cooking; आत्मर्थिं च क्रियारम्भः Ms. 11. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियेन्द्रियम्
क्रिया + -इन्द्रियम् see कर्मेंद्रिय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाकलापः|क्रियाकलाप
क्रिया + -कलापः<BR>—1 the whole body of ceremonies enjoined in the Hindu religious law.<BR>—2 all the particulars or points of any business.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाकल्पः|क्रियाकल्प
क्रिया + -कल्पः a particular mode of diagnosis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाकाण्डम्
क्रिया + -काण्डम् The portion of a श्रुति text treating of the sacrifices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाकारः|क्रियाकार
क्रिया + -कारः<BR>—1 an agent, worker.<BR>—2 a beginner, tyro, a fresh student.<BR>—3 an agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियातन्त्रम्
क्रिया + -तन्त्रम् one of the four classes of Tantras; Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाद्वेषिन्
क्रिया + -द्वेषिन् <i>m.</i> a witness whose<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">Page0616-1</a>]<BR> testimony is prejudicial to the cause (one of the five kinds of witnesses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0615-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाद्वैतम्
क्रिया + -द्वैतम् efficient cause.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियानिर्देशः|क्रियानिर्देश|क्रियानिर्द्देश
क्रिया + -निर्देशः evidence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापटु
क्रिया + -पटु <i>a.</i> dexterous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापथः|क्रियापथ
क्रिया + -पथः mode of medical treatment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापदम्
क्रिया + -पदम् a verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापर
क्रिया + -पर <i>a.</i> diligent in the performance of oneʼs duty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियापादः|क्रियापाद
क्रिया + -पादः the third division of a legal plaint; that is, witnesses,<BR> documents and other proofs adduced by the plaintiff or complainant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियामाधुर्यम्
क्रिया + -माधुर्यम् beauty of art and architecture; अहो क्रियामाधुर्यं<BR> पाषाणानाम् Pratimā 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियायज्ञः
क्रिया + -यज्ञः religious rites (such as गर्भाधानसंस्कार); Mb. 10. 18. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियायोगः|क्रियायोग
क्रिया + -योगः<BR>—1 connection with the verb.<BR>—2 the employment of expedients or means; तदा तत्प्रतिकाराच्च सततं<BR> वा विचिन्तनात् । आधिव्याधिप्रशमनं क्रियायोगद्वये न तु ॥ Mb. 3. 2. 23.<BR>—3 the practical form of Yoga philosophy <i>i. e.</i> active devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियालोपः|क्रियालोप
क्रिया + -लोपः omission or discontinuance of any of the essential ceremonies<BR> of the Hindu religion; क्रियालोपाद् वृषलत्वं गताः Ms. 10. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावशः|क्रियावश
क्रिया + -वशः necessary influence of acts done.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावाचक
क्रिया + -वाचक, -वाचिन् <i>a.</i> expressing any action, as a verbal noun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावाचिन्
क्रिया + -वाचक, -वाचिन् <i>a.</i> expressing any action, as a verbal noun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावादिन्
क्रिया + -वादिन् <i>m.</i> a plaintiff, complainant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाविधिः|क्रियाविधि
क्रिया + -विधिः a rule of action, manner of any rite; अयमुक्तो विभागो<BR> वः पुत्राणां च क्रियाविधिः Ms. 9. 220.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाविशेषणम्
क्रिया + -विशेषणम्,<BR>—1 an adverb.<BR>—2 a predicative adjective.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियाशक्तिः|क्रियाशक्ति
क्रिया + -शक्तिः <i>f.</i> the power of god (in creating this world).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियासंक्रान्तिः|क्रियासङ्क्रान्ति
क्रिया + -संक्रान्तिः <i>f.</i> imparting (to others) oneʼs knowledge; teaching;<BR> विवादे दर्शयिष्यन्तं क्रियासंक्रान्तिमात्मनः M. 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियासमभिहारः|क्रियासमभिहार
क्रिया + -समभिहारः [cf. P. III. 1. 22] the repetition of any act; क्रियासमभिहारेण<BR> विराध्यन्तं क्षमेत कः Śi. 2. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रियावत्|क्रियावन्त्
क्रियावत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Engaged in any actual work, versed in the practice of a thing; यस्तु<BR> क्रियावान्पुरुषः स विद्वान् H. 1. 167. यः क्रियावान् स पण्डितः.<BR>—2 Performing ceremonies in the right manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिवि|क्रिविः
क्रिवि <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Doing, performing.<BR>—2 Killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रिविः|क्रिवि
क्रिवि + .{@-विः@} —1 A cistern, well.<BR>—3 A leather bag; a cloud (?).<BR>—4 N. of the country of पाञ्चाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्री
क्री €9 U. (क्रीणाति, क्रीणीते, क्रीत)<BR>—1 To buy, purchase; महता पुण्यपण्येन क्रीतेयं कायनौस्त्वया Śānti. 3. 1;<BR> क्रीणीष्व मज्जीवितमेव पण्यमन्यत्र चेदस्ति तदस्तु पुण्यम्<BR> N. 3. 87, 88; क्रीणन्ति स्म प्राणमूल्यैर्यशांसि Śi. 18. 15; Pt. 1. 13; Ms. 9. 174.<BR>—2 To barter, exchange; कच्चित्सहस्रैर्मूर्खाणामेकं क्रीणासि पण्डितम् Mb.<BR>—3 To win. [cf. Pers. <i>kharidan</i>].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्री
क्री <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Buying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयः|क्रय
क्रयः [क्री भावे अच्] Buying, purchasing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रयारोहः, क्रयक्रीत, क्रयलेख्यम्, क्रयविक्रयौ, क्रयविक्रयिकः, क्रयविक्रयिन्, क्रयशीर्षम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयारोहः|क्रयारोह
क्रयः + -आरोहः a market, fair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयक्रीत
क्रयः + -क्रीत <i>a.</i> bought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयलेख्यम्
क्रयः + -लेख्यम् a deed of sale, conveyance &c. (गृहं क्षेत्रादिकं क्रीत्वा<BR> तुल्यमूल्याक्षरान्वितम् । पत्रं कारयते यत्तु क्रयलेख्यं तदुच्यते Bṛhaspati).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयविक्रयौ
क्रयः + -विक्रयौ (du.) trade, traffic, buying and selling; Ms. 8. 5, 7. 127.<BR> cf. also क्रयविक्रयवेलायां काचः काचो मणिर्मणिः Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयविक्रयिकः|क्रयविक्रयिक
क्रयः + -विक्रयिकः a trader, merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयविक्रयिन्
क्रयः + -विक्रयिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 buying or selling, striking a bargain; Ms. 5. 41, 8. 400; Y. 2. 262.<BR>—2 One who buys an article at a lower rate and sells it at a higher rate;<BR> दानसागर, Bibliotheca Indica 274. Face. I, p. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयशीर्षम्
क्रयः + -शीर्षम् the coping of a wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयणम्
क्रयणम् [क्री भावे ल्युट्] Buying, purchasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रयिकः|क्रयिक
क्रयिकः <i>m.^1</i> [क्रय-ठन्]<BR>—1 A trader, dealer.<BR>—2 A purchaser.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रय्य|क्रय्यं
क्रय्य <i>a.</i> [क्री-यत्] A thing exhibited for sale in the market;<BR> केयं नो धान्यं न चास्ति क्रय्यम् Mbh. on P. VI. 1. 82. (opp. क्रेय<BR> which only means ‘fit to be purchased’; cf. Sk. on P. VI. 1. 82).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रायकः|क्रायक
क्राय(यि)कः<BR>—1 A purchaser.<BR>—2 A trader, merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रायिकः|क्रायिक
क्राय(यि)कः<BR>—1 A purchaser.<BR>—2 A trader, merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीत|क्रीतः
क्रीत <i>p. p.</i> Bought; see क्री.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीतः|क्रीत
क्रीत + .{@-तः@} One of the twelve kinds of sons recognised in Hindu Law;<BR> a son purchased from his natural parents; Ms. 9. 160; क्रीतश्च ताभ्यां<BR> विक्रीतः Y. 2. 131; तव क्रीतसुतोऽस्मीति वाचिकेन व्यजिज्ञपत् Śiva B. 31. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीतम्
क्रीत + .{@-तम्@} A bargain.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रीतानुशयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीतानुशयः|क्रीतानुशय
क्रीत + -अनुशयः ‘repenting a purchase’, rescission, returning a thing<BR> purchased, to the seller (admissible in some cases by law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीतक|क्रीतकः
क्रीतक <i>a.</i> Got by purchase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीतकः|क्रीतक
क्रीतक + .{@-कः@} A son bought from his parents and adopted; क्रीणीयाद्यस्त्वपत्यार्थं<BR> मातापित्रोर्यमन्तिकात् । स क्रीतकः सुतस्तस्य सदृशोऽसदृशोऽपि वा ॥<BR> Ms. 9. 174; cf. क्रीत above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रेणिः|क्रेणि
क्रेणिः^1, -णी <i>f.</i> Buying, purchase.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170203. note: '-' unneeded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रेणी
क्रेणिः^1, -णी <i>f.</i> Buying, purchase.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170203. note: '-' unneeded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रेतृ
क्रेतृ <i>m.</i> A buyer, purchaser; Y. 2. 168.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रेय|क्रेयं
क्रेय <i>a.</i> Purchasable, fit to be bought; खार्यां सहस्रक्रेयायां<BR> दुर्लभे भोजनेऽभवत् Rāj. T. 5. 271.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रेयदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रेयदः|क्रेयद
क्रेय + -दः One who exhibits anything for sale, seller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीड्
क्रीड् €1 P. (क्रीडति, क्रीडित)<BR>—1 To play, amuse oneself; वानराः क्रीडितुमारब्धाः Pt. 1; एष क्रीडति<BR> कूपयन्त्रघटिकान्यायप्रसक्तो विधिः Mk. 10. 59; जक्षन् क्रीडन् रममाणः<BR> Ch. Up. 8. 12. 3.<BR>—2 To gamble, play at dice; बहुविधं द्यूतं क्रीडतः Mk. 2; नाक्षैः<BR> क्रीडेत्कदाचिद्धि Ms. 4. 74; Y. 1. 138.<BR>—3 To jest, joke or trifle with; सद्वृत्तस्तनमण्डलस्तव कथं प्राणैर्मम<BR> क्रीडति Gīt. 3; क्रीडिष्यामि तावदेनया V. 3; एवमाशाग्रहग्रस्तैः<BR> क्रीडन्ति धनिनोऽर्थिभिः H. 2. 23; Pt. 1. 187; Mk. 3.━<i>With</i> {@अनु@} (Ātm.)<BR> to play, sport, amuse oneself; साध्वनुक्रीडमानानि पश्य वृन्दानि पक्षिणाम् Bk. 8. 10.<BR>━{@आ, परि, सम्@} [Ā. क्रीडोऽनुसंपरिभ्यश्च P. I. 3. 21] to<BR> play &c.; संक्रीडन्ते मणिभिर्यत्र कन्याः Me. 69; but क्रीड् with<BR> {@सं@} is Paras. in the sense of ‘making a noise’; त्वन्नामवर्णा इव<BR> कर्णपीता मयास्य संक्रीडति चक्रचक्रे N. 3. 50; संक्रीडन्ति शकटानि<BR> Mbh. ‘the carts creak’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीड|क्रीडः
क्रीड <i>a.</i> [क्रीड्-घञ्] Playing, sporting; क्रीडं(ळं)बः<BR> शर्धो मारुतम् Rv. 1. 37. 1, 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडः|क्रीड
क्रीड + .{@-डः@}<BR>—1 Sport, pastime, play, pleasure.<BR>—2 Jest, joke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडकः|क्रीडक
क्रीडकः<BR>—1 A player.<BR>—2 A porter, door-keeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनम्
क्रीडनम् [क्रीड् भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Playing, sporting; बालक्रीडनमिन्दुशेखरधनुर्भङ्गावधि प्रह्वता Mahān.<BR>—2 A play-thing, toy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनकः|क्रीडनक|क्रीडनकं
क्रीडनकः, -कम्, क्रीडनीयम्, -यकम्<BR> A play-thing, toy. लीलया व्यनुदत्तांस्तान्बालः<BR> क्रीडनकनिव Bhāg. 3. 2. 30; Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनकम्
क्रीडनकः, -कम्, क्रीडनीयम्, -यकम्<BR> A play-thing, toy. लीलया व्यनुदत्तांस्तान्बालः<BR> क्रीडनकनिव Bhāg. 3. 2. 30; Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनीयम्
क्रीडनकः, -कम्, क्रीडनीयम्, -यकम्<BR> A play-thing, toy. लीलया व्यनुदत्तांस्तान्बालः<BR> क्रीडनकनिव Bhāg. 3. 2. 30; Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनीयकम्
क्रीडनकः, -कम्, क्रीडनीयम्, -यकम्<BR> A play-thing, toy. लीलया व्यनुदत्तांस्तान्बालः<BR> क्रीडनकनिव Bhāg. 3. 2. 30; Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडनकतया
क्रीडनकः, -कम्, क्रीडनीयम्, -यकम् + .{@-क्रीडनकतया@} <i>ind.</i> After the manner of a play-thing; Bhāg. 5. 26. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0616-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडा
क्रीडा [क्रीड्-भावे अ]<BR>—1 Sport, pastime, play, pleasure; तोयक्रीडानिरतयुवतिस्नानतिक्तैर्मरुद्भिः<BR> Me. 35, 63; क्रीडामुदो यातनाः Gīt. 9. 9.<BR>—2 Jest, joke.<BR>—3 (in music) A kind of measure.<BR>—4 A play-ground; Mb. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रीडाकूतम्, क्रीडोद्देशः, क्रीडाकाननम्, क्रीडावनम्, क्रीडाकोपः, क्रीडाकौतुकम्, क्रीडागृहम्, क्रीडामन्दिरम्, क्रीडानारी, क्रीडापरिच्छदः, क्रीडामयूरः, क्रीडामृगः, क्रीडारत्नम्, क्रीडावेश्मन्, क्रीडाशैलः, क्रीडापर्वतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडाकूतम्
क्रीडा + -आकूतम् a sportive purpose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडोद्देशः|क्रीडोद्देश
क्रीडा + -उद्देशः play-ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडाकाननम्
क्रीडा + -काननम्, -वनम् a pleasure grove, park; क्रीडाकाननकेलिकौतुकजुषामायुः<BR> परिक्षीयते Bh. 3. 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडावनम्
क्रीडा + -काननम्, -वनम् a pleasure grove, park; क्रीडाकाननकेलिकौतुकजुषामायुः<BR> परिक्षीयते Bh. 3. 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडाकोपः|क्रीडाकोप
क्रीडा + -कोपः false or feigned anger; कथमपि सखि क्रीडाकोपाद्द्रजेति<BR> मयोदिते Amaru. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडाकौतुकम्
क्रीडा + -कौतुकम्<BR>—1 wanton curiosity; Ks. 18. 153.<BR>—2 sport, play.<BR>—3 sexual intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडागृहम्
क्रीडा + -गृहम्, -मन्दिरम् a pleasure-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडामन्दिरम्
क्रीडा + -गृहम्, -मन्दिरम् a pleasure-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडानारी
क्रीडा + -नारी a prostitute, harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडापरिच्छदः|क्रीडापरिच्छद
क्रीडा + -परिच्छदः a play-thing, toy ते तु तद्गौरवात्सर्वे त्यक्तक्रीडापरिच्छदाः<BR> Bhāg. 7. 5. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडामयूरः|क्रीडामयूर
क्रीडा + -मयूरः a peacock kept for pleasure; क्रीडामयूरा वनबर्हिणत्वम्<BR> (प्राप्ताः) R. 16. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडामृगः|क्रीडामृग
क्रीडा + -मृगः a toy-deer; विक्रीडितो यथैवाहं क्रीडामृग इवाधमः<BR> Bhāg. 6. 2. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडारत्नम्
क्रीडा + -रत्नम् ‘the gem of sports’, copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडावेश्मन्
क्रीडा + -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i> a pleasure-house; क्रीडावेश्मनि चैष पञ्जरशुकः<BR> क्लान्तो जलं याचते V. 2. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडाशैलः|क्रीडाशैल
क्रीडा + -शैलः, -पर्वतः an artificial hill serving as a pleasure abode,<BR> a pleasure mountain; क्रीडाशैलः कनककदलीवेष्टनप्रेक्षणीयः Me. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडापर्वतः|क्रीडापर्वत
क्रीडा + -शैलः, -पर्वतः an artificial hill serving as a pleasure abode,<BR> a pleasure mountain; क्रीडाशैलः कनककदलीवेष्टनप्रेक्षणीयः Me. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडि
क्रीडि <i>a.</i> Ved. Playing, sporting (epithet of the wind); ते क्रीड<BR> (ळ) यो धुनयो भ्राजदृष्टयः Rv. 1. 87. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडितम्
क्रीडितम् Sport, play; Rām. 5; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रीडु
क्रीडु <i>a.</i> Ved. Playing, moving up (as the Soma); क्रीडु (ळु)<BR> र्मखो न मंहयुः Rv. 9. 20. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुञ्च्|क्रुंच्
क्रुञ्च् €1 P. (क्रुञ्चति, क्रुञ्चित)<BR>—1 To curve or make crooked.<BR>—2 To become or be crooked.<BR>—3 To be or become small, shrink.<BR>—4 To make small, lessen.<BR>—5 To approach, arrive at, go up to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुञ्च्|क्रुंच्
क्रुञ्च् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A curlew, heron; अद्भयः क्षीरं व्यपिबत्क्रुङ्ङाङ्गिरसो धिया Vāj. 19. 73.<BR>—2 A swan. भृङ्गाली-कोकिल-क्रुङ्भिर्वाशनैः पश्य लक्ष्मण Bk. 6. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुञ्चः|क्रुञ्च|क्रुंच|क्रुंचः
क्रुञ्चः (<i>f.</i> क्रुञ्चा)<BR>—1 A curlew, heron; Vāj. 24. 22, 31.<BR>—2 A kind of lute.<BR>—3 N. of the mountain क्रौञ्च.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुड्
क्रुड् €6 P. (क्रुडति, क्रुडित)<BR>—1 To sink, dive.<BR>—2 To be or become thick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुथ्
क्रुथ् €9 P. (क्रुथ्नाति) To kill, slay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोथः|क्रोथ
क्रोथः Murder, killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुध्
क्रुध् €4 P. (क्रुध्यति, क्रुद्ध) To be angry (with the dat. of the<BR> person who is the object of anger); हरये क्रुध्यति; but sometimes<BR> with words like उपरि, प्रति &c. also; ते ह ब्राह्मणाश्चुक्रुधुः<BR> Bṛ. Up. 3. 1. 2; ममोपरि स क्रुद्धः, न मां प्रति क्रुद्धो गुरुः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुध्
क्रुध् <i>f.</i> Anger; कुधा संधिं भीमो विघटयति यूयं घटयत<BR> Ve. 1. 10; Ks. 76. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुद्ध|क्रुद्धः
क्रुद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Angry, provoked.<BR>—2 Fierce; cruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुद्धम्
क्रुद्ध + .{@-द्धम्@} Anger.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रुद्धवर्गः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुद्धवर्गः
क्रुद्ध + -वर्गः a group of provoked persons; Kau. A. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुध्मिन्
क्रुध्मिन् <i>a.</i> Ved. Angry, wrathful, irritable; शुभ्रो वः शुष्मः<BR> क्रुध्मी मनांसि Rv. 7. 56. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधः|क्रोध
क्रोधः [क्रुध्-भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Anger, wrath; कामात्क्रोधोऽभिजायते Bg. 2. 62; so क्रोधान्धः, क्रोधानलः &c.<BR>—2 (In Rhet.) Anger considered as the feeling which gives rise to the<BR> <i>raudra</i> sentiment.<BR>—3 N. of the mystic syllable हुम् or ह्रुम्.<BR>—4 (also क्रोधन) N. of the 59th year of the संवत्सर cycle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधा
क्रोधः + .{@-धा@} N. of a daughter of Dakṣa.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रोधेद्ध, क्रोधोज्झित, क्रोधकृत्, क्रोधज, क्रोधमूर्च्छित, क्रोधतः, क्रोधवश, क्रोधहन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधेद्ध
क्रोधः + -इद्ध <i>a.</i> inflamed with anger, darting out fire; क्रोधेद्धैर्दृष्टिपातैर्मुहुरुपशमिता<BR> वह्नयोऽमी त्रयोऽपि Ratn. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधोज्झित
क्रोधः + -उज्झित <i>a.</i> free from anger, composed, cool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधकृत्
क्रोधः + -कृत् <i>a.</i> angry. ━(<i>m.</i>) the Supreme Being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधज|क्रोधजः
क्रोधः + -ज <i>a.</i> proceeding from wrath (as the eight vices; पैशुन्यं<BR> साहसं द्रोह ईर्ष्यासूयार्थदूषणम् । वाग्दण्डजं च पारुष्यं क्रोधजोऽपि<BR> गणोष्टकः ॥ Ms. 7. 48).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधमूर्च्छित
क्रोधः + -मूर्च्छित <i>a.</i> overcome or infatuated with anger; ततो ज्ञातिवधं<BR> श्रुत्वा रावणः क्रोधमूर्च्छितः Rām. 1. 1. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधतः
क्रोधः + -तः a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधवश
क्रोधः + -वश <i>a.</i> passionate, violent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधहन्
क्रोधः + -हन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधन|क्रोधनः
क्रोधन <i>a.</i> [क्रुध-युच्] Wrathful, passionate, angry, irascible;<BR> यद्रामेण कृतं तदेव कुरुते द्रौणायनिः क्रोधनः Ve. 3. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधनः|क्रोधन
क्रोधन + .{@-नः@} N. of a son of Kauśika.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधना
क्रोधन + .{@-ना@} A passionate woman, vixen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधनम्
क्रोधन + .{@-नम्@} Being angry, anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधनीय
क्रोधनीय <i>a.</i> Provocative; न क्रुद्धपत्यभिशप्तोऽपि क्रोधनीयानि<BR> वर्जयन् Rām. 2. 20. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधनीयम्
क्रोधनीय + .{@-यम्@} Injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधालु
क्रोधालु <i>a.</i> [क्रुध्-आलुच्] Wrathful, irascible, angry, passionate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधिन्
क्रोधिन् <i>a.</i> [क्रुध्-णिनि] Passionate, angry. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A buffalo.<BR>—2 A dog.<BR>—3 The 38th year of the संवत्सर cycle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुन्थ्|क्रुंथ्
क्रुन्थ् €9 P. (क्रुथ्नाति)<BR>—1 To embrace.<BR>—2 To be distressed, suffer pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुमुः|क्रुमु
क्रुमुः <i>f.</i> N. of a river (tributory of the Indus); मा वो रसानितभा<BR> कुभा क्रुमुर्मा वः सिन्धुर्निरीरमत् Rv. 5. 53. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुमुकः|क्रुमुक
क्रुमुकः Ved. A piece of wood to catch the sacrificial fire; स<BR> क्रुमुकं प्राविशत् कुमुकमव दधाति Yv. 5. 1. 9. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुश्
क्रुश् €1 P. (क्रोशति, क्रुष्ट)<BR>—1 To cry, weep, lament, mourn (for); क्रोशन्त्यस्तं कपिस्त्रियः Bk. 6. 124.<BR>—2 To cry out, yell, scream, bawl, call out; अतीव चुक्रोश जीवनाशं<BR> ननाश च Bk. 14. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुश्वन्
क्रुश्वन् <i>m.</i> A jackal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुष्ट|क्रुष्टं
क्रुष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Cried out.<BR>—2 Called out to.<BR>—3 Called at, abused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रुष्टम्
क्रुष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@}<BR>—1 Crying, a cry, yell.<BR>—2 Weeping.<BR>—3 A noise, sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोशः|क्रोश
क्रोशः [क्रुश्-घञ्]<BR>—1 A cry, yell, shout, scream, noise.<BR>—2 A measure of distance equal to ¼th of a Yojana, a <i>Kośa</i> क्रोशार्धं<BR> प्रकृतिपुरःसरेण गत्वा R. 13. 79; समुद्रात्पुरी क्रोशौ (nom.) or<BR> क्रोशयोः (loc.)<BR>—3 A measure of time equal<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">Page0618-1</a>]<BR> to 48 minutes; क्रोशमास्ते । क्रोशं स्वपिति Mbh. on P. I. 4. 51.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रोशतालः, क्रोशध्वनिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0617-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोशतालः|क्रोशताल
क्रोशः + -तालः, -ध्वनिः a large drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोशध्वनिः|क्रोशध्वनि
क्रोशः + -तालः, -ध्वनिः a large drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोशन
क्रोशन <i>a.</i> Crying; वि क्रोशनासो विल्वञ्च आयन् Rv. 10. 27. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोशनम्
क्रोशन + .{@-नम्@} A cry; Suśr. 3. 9. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूर|क्रूरः
क्रूर <i>a.</i> [कृत-रक् धातोः क्रूः; cf. Uṇ. 2. 21]<BR>—1 Cruel, wicked, hard-hearted, pitiless; तस्याभिषेकसंभारं कल्पितं<BR> क्रूरनिश्चया R. 12. 4; Me. 107; Ms. 10. 9; तानहं द्विषतः क्रूरान् Bg. 16. 19.<BR>—2 Hard, rough.<BR>—3 Formidable, terrible, fierce, ferocious, savage.<BR>—4 Destructive, mischievous.<BR>—5 Wounded, hurt.<BR>—6 Bloody.<BR>—7 Raw.<BR>—8 Strong.<BR>—9 Inauspicious (as opposed to सौम्य and अक्रूर; said of 1st,<BR> 3rd, 5th, 7th, 9th and 11th signs of the zodiac which are supposed to have<BR> a malignant influence.)<BR>—10 Hard, solid, hardened; Ś. 2. 4.<BR>—11 Hot; disagreeable, sharp; Ms. 2. 33.<BR>—12 Harsh; jarring; क्रूरक्वणत्कङ्कणानि Mv. 1. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरः|क्रूर
क्रूर + .{@-रः, -रम्@} Boiled rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरम्
क्रूर + .{@-रः, -रम्@} Boiled rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरः|क्रूर
क्रूर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A hawk.<BR>—2 heron.<BR>—3 An uneven sign of the zodiac.<BR>—4 N. of a planet (Rāhu or Saturn).<BR>—5 A kind of horse; तद्वद्वामाश्रयः क्रूरः प्रकरोति धनक्षयम् Śālihotra 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरम्
क्रूर + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 A wound.<BR>—2 Slaughter, cruelty.<BR>—8 Any horrible deed.<BR>—4 Any frightful appearance. ━<i>ind.</i> In a formidable manner; Mb. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रूराकृति, क्रूराचार,^1 क्रूरात्मन्, क्रूराशय, क्रूरकर्मन्, क्रूरकर्मकृत्, क्रूरकृत्, क्रूरकाष्ठे, क्रूरगन्ध, क्रूरचरित, क्रूरचेष्टित, क्रूरदृश्, क्रूरराविन्, क्रूरलोचनः<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूराकृति|क्रूराकृतिः
क्रूर + -आकृति <i>a.</i> terrible in form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूराकृतिः|क्रूराकृति
क्रूर + -आकृति + .({@-तिः@}) epithet of Rāvaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूराचार
क्रूर + -आचार^1 <i>a.</i> following cruel or savage practices; Ms. 4. 246.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरात्मन्
क्रूर + -आत्मन् the planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूराशय
क्रूर + -आशय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 containing fierce animals (as a river).<BR>—2 of a cruel disposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरकर्मन्|क्रूरकर्म्मन्
क्रूर + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 a bloody act.<BR>—2 any hard labour. ━<i>a.</i> doing a bloody act; अहं क्रूरकर्मा जात्या चाण्डालः K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरकर्मकृत्
क्रूर + -कर्मकृत् <i>m.</i> a rapacious animal; Ms. 12. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरकृत्
क्रूर + -कृत् <i>a.</i> fierce, cruel, unrelenting;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरकाष्ठे
क्रूर + -काष्ठे <i>a.</i> having costive bowels (unaffected by strong purgatives).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरगन्ध|क्रूरगंध|क्रूरगन्धः
क्रूर + -गन्ध sulphur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरचरित
क्रूर + -चरित, -चेष्टित <i>a.</i> cruel, ferocious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरचेष्टित
क्रूर + -चरित, -चेष्टित <i>a.</i> cruel, ferocious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरदृश्
क्रूर + -दृश् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 evil-eyed, having a malignant look; Ks. 62. 27.<BR>—2 mischievous, villainous. ━(<i>m.</i>) N. of Saturn; also of Mars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरराविन्
क्रूर + -राविन् <i>m.</i> a raven<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रूरलोचनः|क्रूरलोचन
क्रूर + -लोचनः an epithet of the planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोञ्चः|क्रोञ्च|क्रोंच|क्रोंचः
क्रोञ्चः N. of a mountain; see क्रौञ्च.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडः|क्रोड|क्रोडं
क्रोडः [क्रुङ् घनीभावे संज्ञायां घञ्]<BR>—1 A hog; भ्रातर्येवं विनिहते हरिणा क्रोडमूर्तिना Bhāg. 7. 2. 1.<BR>—2 The hollow of a tree, cavity; हा हा हन्त तथापि जन्मविटपिक्रोडे<BR> मनो धावति Udb.<BR>—3 The chest, bosom, breast; क्रोडीकृ to clasp to the bosom; क्रोडीकरोति<BR> प्रथमं यथा जातमनित्यता । धात्रीव जननी पश्चात्तथा शोकस्य कः क्रमः ॥<BR> Nāg. 4; Bh. 2. 35.<BR>—4 The middle part of anything; Vikr. 11. 75; see क्रोड (<i>n.</i>)<BR>—5 An epithet of the planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडम्
क्रोडः + .{@-डम्, -डा@}<BR>—1 The breast, chest, the part between the shoulders; Rām. 5. 24. 40.<BR>—2 The interior of anything, a cavity, hollow; उदयास्ताचलावेतौ यत्क्रोडे<BR> बाल्यवार्धके Mv. 7. 23.<BR>—3 The breast of a horse.<BR>—4 The lap; U. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडा
क्रोडः + .{@-डम्, -डा@}<BR>—1 The breast, chest, the part between the shoulders; Rām. 5. 24. 40.<BR>—2 The interior of anything, a cavity, hollow; उदयास्ताचलावेतौ यत्क्रोडे<BR> बाल्यवार्धके Mv. 7. 23.<BR>—3 The breast of a horse.<BR>—4 The lap; U. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडी
क्रोडः + .{@-डी@} A sow; हा वत्स्यामि कथं क्रोडीगर्भे Ks. 53. 120.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रोडाङ्कः, क्रोडाङ्घ्रिः, क्रोडपादः, क्रोडकान्ता, क्रोडपत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडाङ्कः|क्रोडाङ्क|क्रोडांक
क्रोडः + -अङ्कः, -अङ्घ्रिः, -पादः a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडाङ्घ्रिः|क्रोडाङ्घ्रि|क्रोडांघ्रि
क्रोडः + -अङ्कः, -अङ्घ्रिः, -पादः a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडपादः|क्रोडपाद
क्रोडः + -अङ्कः, -अङ्घ्रिः, -पादः a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडकान्ता
क्रोडः + -कान्ता the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडपत्रम्
क्रोडः + -पत्रम्<BR>—1 marginal writing.<BR>—2 a postscript^1 to a letter.<BR>—3 a supplement.<BR>—4 a codicil to a will.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251204. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/101. note: cf. ap90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडीकृ
क्रोडीकृ To clasp, to embrace; क्रोडीकरोति प्रथमं यदा जात मनित्यता Nāg. 4. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडीकरणम्
क्रोडीकरणम् Embracing, clasping to the bosom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोडीमुखः|क्रोडीमुख
क्रोडीमुखः A rhinoceros.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोधनिन्
क्रोधनिन् <i>m.</i> Designation of an elephant in the fifth stage; Mātaṅga L. 9. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टु
क्रोष्टु, -ष्टृ <i>m.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्ट्री
क्रोष्टु, -ष्टृ + .({@-ष्ट्री@} <i>f.</i>) [क्रुश्-तुन् Uṇ. 1. 69] A jackal (the strong<BR> cases of this word are necessarily formed from क्रोष्टृ and the weak<BR> ones optionally); so क्रोष्टुक Y. 1. 148. कोष्टारोऽभ्यद्रवन्सर्वे संरब्धा<BR> हतबान्धवाः Bhāg. 10. 15. 36. … त्रस्यत् क्रोष्ट्रुकुलाकुला Śiva B. 22. 68.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रोष्टुशीर्षम्, क्रोष्टुकशिरस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टृ
क्रोष्टु, -ष्टृ <i>m.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टुशीर्षम्
क्रोष्टु + -शीर्षम्, क्रोष्टुकशिरस् a disease of the knee; Suśr. 2. 1. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्टुकशिरस्
क्रोष्टु + -शीर्षम्, क्रोष्टुकशिरस् a disease of the knee; Suśr. 2. 1. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रोष्ट्रीयाः
क्रोष्ट्रीयाः Followers of the school of grammar started by क्रोष्टुः;<BR> क्रोष्ट्रीयाः पठन्ति Mbh. on P. I. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चः|क्रौञ्च|क्रौंच|क्रौंचः
क्रौञ्चः [क्रुञ्च् प्रज्ञा˚ अण्]<BR>—1 A curlew, heron; मनोहरक्रौञ्चनिनादितानि सीमान्तराण्युत्सुकयन्ति<BR> चेतः Ṛs. 4. 8; Ms. 12. 64. क्रौञ्चो विषाभ्याशे माद्यति Kau. A. 1. 20. 17.<BR>—2 N. of a mountain (said to be the grandson of Himālaya and said to<BR> have been pierced by Kārtikeya and Paraśurāma); हंसद्वारं भृगुपतियशोवर्त्म<BR> यत् क्रौञ्चरन्ध्रम् Me. 59. भिन्नो मद्बाणवेगेन क्रौञ्चत्वं वा गमिष्यति<BR> Pratimā 5. 12; क्रौञ्चं यथा गिरिवरं युधि कर्तिकेयम् Abhiṣeka. 6. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्रौञ्चादनम्, क्रौञ्चारातिः, क्रौञ्चारिः, क्रौञ्चरिपुः, क्रौञ्चदारणः, क्रौञ्चसूदनः, क्रौञ्चवर्णः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चादनम्
क्रौञ्चः + -अदनम् the fibres of the stalk of a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चादनी
क्रौञ्चः + -अदनम् + .({@-नी@}) the seed of lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चारातिः|क्रौञ्चाराति|क्रौंचाराति
क्रौञ्चः + -अरातिः, -अरिः, -रिपुः<BR>—1 an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR>—2 of Paraśurāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चारिः|क्रौञ्चारि|क्रौंचारि
क्रौञ्चः + -अरातिः, -अरिः, -रिपुः<BR>—1 an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR>—2 of Paraśurāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चरिपुः|क्रौञ्चरिपु
क्रौञ्चः + -अरातिः, -अरिः, -रिपुः<BR>—1 an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR>—2 of Paraśurāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चदारणः|क्रौञ्चदारण|क्रौंचदारण
क्रौञ्चः + -दारणः, -सूदनः an epithet (1) of Kārtikeya, (2) of Paraśurāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चसूदनः|क्रौञ्चसूदन|क्रौंचसूदन
क्रौञ्चः + -दारणः, -सूदनः an epithet (1) of Kārtikeya, (2) of Paraśurāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौञ्चवर्णः
क्रौञ्चः + -वर्णः a kind of horse. Mb. 7. 23. 26; cf. com. as━ ‘सितलोमकेसराढ्याः कृष्णत्वग्गुह्यलोचनोष्ठखुराः । ये स्युर्मुनिभिर्वाहा निर्दिष्टाः कौञ्चवर्णास्ते ॥’<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौड
क्रौड <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Belonging to a hog; क्रौडीं तनुम् Bhāg. 2. 7. 1.<BR>—2 Relating to Viṣṇuʼs Avatāra as a hog; क्रौडे हतो दितिज उद्धरताऽम्भसः<BR> क्ष्माम् Bhāg. 11. 4. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौर्यम्
क्रौर्यम्<BR>—1 Cruelty, hard-heartedness; Ms. 12. 33.<BR>—2 Terribleness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौशशतिकः|क्रौशशतिक
क्रौशशतिकः<BR>—1 A mendicant who walks a hundred Krośas.<BR>—2 One who deserves to be approached from distance of 100 Krośas (as a teacher).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्रौष्टुकिः|क्रौष्टुकि
क्रौष्टुकिः N. of a grammarian; of an astrologer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लथ्
क्लथ् €1. €9 P.<BR>—1 To kill, hurt.<BR>—2 To turn round, revolve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लन्द्|क्लंद्
क्लन्द् I. €1 P. (क्लन्दति, क्लन्दित)<BR>—1 To call out.<BR>—2 To cry, lament, weep. ━II ▪∙<BR>—1 Ā. (क्लन्दते or क्लदते) To be confused.<BR>—2 To grieve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लम्
क्लम् €1. €4. P. (क्लामति, क्लाम्यति, क्लान्त)<BR>—1 To be fatigued or tired, be exhausted or depressed; न चक्लाम न<BR> विव्यथे Bk. 5. 102, 14. 101.<BR>—2 To feel sorry, pine for; Ś. 6.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">Page0619-1</a>]<BR>━<i>Caus.</i> (क्लमयति-ते) To fatigue, exhaust, depress, wither;<BR> प्रियाशोको जीवं कुसुममिव घर्मो क्लमयति U. 3. 30. (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0618-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लमः|क्लम
क्लमः, क्लमथः, क्लमथुः Fatigue, languor, exhaustion;<BR> विनोदितदिनक्लमाः कृतरुचश्च जाम्बूनदैः Śi. 4. 66; Ms. 7. 151; Ś. 3. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लमथः|क्लमथ
क्लमः, क्लमथः, क्लमथुः Fatigue, languor, exhaustion;<BR> विनोदितदिनक्लमाः कृतरुचश्च जाम्बूनदैः Śi. 4. 66; Ms. 7. 151; Ś. 3. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लमथुः|क्लमथु
क्लमः, क्लमथः, क्लमथुः Fatigue, languor, exhaustion;<BR> विनोदितदिनक्लमाः कृतरुचश्च जाम्बूनदैः Śi. 4. 66; Ms. 7. 151; Ś. 3. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लान्त|क्लांत|क्लान्तः
क्लान्त <i>p. p.</i> [क्लम्-क्त]<BR>—1 Fatigued, tired out; तमातपक्लान्तम् R. 2. 13; Me. 37; V. 2. 23.<BR>—2 Withered, faded: क्लान्तो मन्मथलेख एष नलिनीपत्रे नखैरर्पितः<BR> Ś. 3. 25; R. 10. 48.<BR>—3 Lean, thin, emaciated.<BR>—4 Depressed in spirits, exhausted.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्लान्तमनस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लान्तमनस्
क्लान्त + -मनस् <i>a.</i> languid, low spirited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लान्तिः|क्लान्ति|क्लांति|क्लांतिः
क्लान्तिः <i>f.</i> [क्लम्-क्तिन्] Fatigue.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्लान्तिच्छिद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लान्तिच्छिद्|क्लांतिच्छिद्
क्लान्तिः + -च्छिद् <i>a.</i> refreshing, invigorating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लव्
क्लव् €4 Ā. (क्लव्यते) To fear, be afraid (according to some €1 Ā. also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिद्
क्लिद् €4 P. (क्लिद्यति, क्लिन्न) To become wet, be damp, be moist.<BR>━<i>Caus.</i> To moisten, wet; न चैनं क्लेदयन्त्यापः Bg. 2. 23; Bk. 18. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिन्न|क्लिन्नं
क्लिन्न <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wet, moistened; running (as an eye).<BR>—2 Rotted, putrified; Caraka. 1. 11, 27.<BR>—3 Soft, moved (as heart); क्लिन्नधियं च मातरम् Bhāg. 4. 3. 10, 9. 11. 5.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्लिन्नाक्ष, क्लिन्नवर्त्मन्, क्लिन्नहृद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिन्नाक्ष|क्लिन्नाक्षः
क्लिन्न + -अक्ष <i>a.</i> blear-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिन्नवर्त्मन्
क्लिन्न + -वर्त्मन् <i>n.</i> watering of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिन्नहृद्
क्लिन्न + -हृद् <i>a.</i> tender-hearted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदः|क्लेद
क्लेदः [क्लिद्-भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Wetness, moisture, dampness; Śānti. 1. 29; तदञ्जनक्लेदसमाकुलाक्षम् R. 7. 27.<BR>—2 Running, discharge from a sore; Ms. 7. 55. 23.<BR>—3 Distress, suffering; कुशलवोन्मृष्टगर्भक्लेदः R. 15. 32 (= उपद्रव Malli.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदक|क्लेदकः
क्लेदक <i>a.</i> Wetting, moistening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदकः|क्लेदक
क्लेदक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 Phlegm.<BR>—2 One of the fires in the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदन्
क्लेदन् <i>m.</i> The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदन|क्लेदनः
क्लेदन <i>a.</i> [क्लिद् णिच्-ल्युट्] Wetting, making wet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदनः|क्लेदन
क्लेदन + .{@-नः@} Phlegm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदनम्
क्लेदन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Wetting, moistening.<BR>—2 Trickling, oozing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदित
क्लेदित <i>a.</i> Soiled; Subh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेदुः|क्लेदु
क्लेदुः<BR>—1 The moon.<BR>—2 Morbid combination of the three humors of the body (संनिपात).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिन्द्|क्लिंद्
क्लिन्द् €1 U. (क्लिन्दति-ते) To lament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिब्
क्लिब् <i>f.</i> Ved. The created world; क्लिबे स्मर कृतं स्मर Vāj. 40. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिश्
क्लिश् €4 Ā. (also P. according to some authorities) (क्लिश्यते, क्लिष्ट<BR> or क्लिशित)<BR>—1 To be tormented, be afflicted, suffer; अप्युपदेशग्रहणे नातिक्लिश्यते<BR> वः शिष्या M. 1; त्रयः परार्थे क्लिश्यन्ति साक्षिणः प्रतिभूः कुलम् Ms. 8. 169.<BR>—2 To torment, molest; भक्तं मां मातिचिक्लिशः Bk. 6. 17. ━II. €9 P.<BR> (क्लिश्नाति, क्लिष्ट, क्लिशित)<BR>—1 To torment, afflict, molest, distress; क्लिश्नाति लब्धपरिपालनवृत्तिरेव<BR> Ś. 5. 6; एवमाराध्यमानोऽपि क्लिश्नाति भुवनत्रयम् Ku. 2. 40; R. 11. 58.<BR>—2 To suffer, feel pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिश्नत्
क्लिश्नत् <i>a.</i> Dispelling, removing; शीतांशोरंशुजालैर्जलधरमलिनां<BR> क्लिश्नती कृत्तिभैमीम् Mu. 3. 20. (v. l. क्लिन्दत्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिशित|क्लिशितः
क्लिशित, -क्लिष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Distressed, suffering pain or misery.<BR>—2 Afflicted, tormented.<BR>—3 Faded.<BR>—4 Inconsistent, contradictory; <i>e. g.</i> माता मे वन्ध्या.<BR>—5 Elaborate, artificial (as a composition.).<BR>—6 Put to shame.<BR>—7 Wearied; hurt, injured.<BR>—8 Being in a bad condition, worn; पीतेनैकेन संवीतां क्लिष्टतोत्तमवाससा<BR> Rām. 5. 15. 21.<BR>—9 Marred, impaired; Ś. 5. 19; Pt. 1. 11; Ś. 6. 10; disordered, Ś. 7. 14.<BR>—10 Dimmed, made faint; हिमक्लिष्टप्रकाशानि ज्योतींषीव मुखानि वः Ku. 2. 19.<BR>—11 Injured, hurt; Ś. 6. 19.<BR>—12 Bothersome, tedious; यथा शरीरो बालस्य गुप्तः सन्क्लिष्टकर्मणः<BR> Rām. 7. 75. 4. (the commentator Rāma Tilaka gives क्लिष्टकर्मणः =<BR> शुभाचारस्य, which seems doubtful).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिष्ट|क्लिष्टः
क्लिशित, -क्लिष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Distressed, suffering pain or misery.<BR>—2 Afflicted, tormented.<BR>—3 Faded.<BR>—4 Inconsistent, contradictory; <i>e. g.</i> माता मे वन्ध्या.<BR>—5 Elaborate, artificial (as a composition.).<BR>—6 Put to shame.<BR>—7 Wearied; hurt, injured.<BR>—8 Being in a bad condition, worn; पीतेनैकेन संवीतां क्लिष्टतोत्तमवाससा<BR> Rām. 5. 15. 21.<BR>—9 Marred, impaired; Ś. 5. 19; Pt. 1. 11; Ś. 6. 10; disordered, Ś. 7. 14.<BR>—10 Dimmed, made faint; हिमक्लिष्टप्रकाशानि ज्योतींषीव मुखानि वः Ku. 2. 19.<BR>—11 Injured, hurt; Ś. 6. 19.<BR>—12 Bothersome, tedious; यथा शरीरो बालस्य गुप्तः सन्क्लिष्टकर्मणः<BR> Rām. 7. 75. 4. (the commentator Rāma Tilaka gives क्लिष्टकर्मणः =<BR> शुभाचारस्य, which seems doubtful).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिष्टम्
क्लिशित, -क्लिष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@} A contradictory statement.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्लिशितवर्त्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिशितवर्त्मन्
क्लिशित + -वर्त्मन् <i>n.</i> a disease of the eyelids.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिष्टा
क्लिष्टा <i>f.</i> A kind of चित्तवृत्ति as laid down in the पातञ्जलयोगशास्त्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लिष्टिः|क्लिष्टि
क्लिष्टिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Affliction, anguish, distress, pain.<BR>—2 Service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेशः|क्लेश
क्लेशः [क्लिश्-भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Pain, anguish, suffering, distress, trouble; किमात्मा क्लेशस्य पदमुपनीतः<BR> Ś. 1; क्लेशः फलेन हि पुनर्नवतां विधत्ते Ku. 5. 86; Bg. 12. 5.<BR>—2 Wrath, anger.<BR>—3 Care, trouble.<BR>—4 Worldly occupation.<BR>—5 Sin (in the Buddhist sense); अविद्याऽस्मितारागद्वेषाभिनिवेशाः क्लेशाः<BR> Yoga S. 2. 3. अपि च क्लेशान् विहाय मम शत्रुबुद्धिरेव नान्यत्र<BR> Nāg. 3; अनुकम्प्यतामसौ राज्यस्य कृते क्लेशदासीकृतो तपस्वी <i>ibid.</i><BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्लेशापह, क्लेशकर, क्लेशक्षम<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेशापह|क्लेशापहः
क्लेशः + -अपह <i>a.</i> allaying pain, consoling, palliative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेशापहः|क्लेशापह
क्लेशः + -अपह + ({@-हः@}) a son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेशकर
क्लेशः + -कर <i>a.</i> causing pain or trouble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेशक्षम
क्लेशः + -क्षम <i>a.</i> capable of enduring trouble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेशक
क्लेशक <i>a.</i> [क्लिश्-वुञ्] Giving pain, troublesome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेशलः|क्लेशल
क्लेशलः Pain; तेषामसौ क्लेशल एव शिष्यते Bhāg. 10. 14. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेशित|क्लेशितः
क्लेशित <i>a.</i> Pained, distressed; Mb. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेशिन्
क्लेशिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Causing pain or suffering<BR>—2 Hurting, injuring. निःश्वासेनाधरकिसलयक्लेशिना विक्षिपन्तीम् Śi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लीतकिका
क्लीतकिका, क्लीतनी The Indigo plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लीतनी
क्लीतकिका, क्लीतनी The Indigo plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लीतनिका
क्लीतनिका <i>f.</i> N. of a plant (Mar. ज्येष्ठमध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0575-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लीब्
क्लीब् €1 Ā. (क्लीबते)<BR>—1 To be impotent, to behave like a eunuch.<BR>—2 (€10 Ā.) To be timorous, to be modest or unassuming; प्राप्तौ पुरुषकारादि<BR> मुक्त्वा क्लीबयसे कथम् Ks. 104. 125.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लीब|क्लीबः
क्लीब(व) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Impotent, neuter, emasculated; Ms. 3. 150, 4. 205; Y. 1. 223.<BR>—2 Unmanly, timid, weak, weak-minded; R. 8. 84; क्लीबान् पालयिता Mk. 9. 5.<BR>—3 Cowardly.<BR>—4 Mean, base.<BR>—5 Idle.<BR>—6 Of the neuter gender.<BR>—7 Desireless (कामहीन); विद्वान्क्लीबः पश्यति प्रीतियोगात् Mb. 12. 292. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लीव|क्लीवः
क्लीब(व) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Impotent, neuter, emasculated; Ms. 3. 150, 4. 205; Y. 1. 223.<BR>—2 Unmanly, timid, weak, weak-minded; R. 8. 84; क्लीबान् पालयिता Mk. 9. 5.<BR>—3 Cowardly.<BR>—4 Mean, base.<BR>—5 Idle.<BR>—6 Of the neuter gender.<BR>—7 Desireless (कामहीन); विद्वान्क्लीबः पश्यति प्रीतियोगात् Mb. 12. 292. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लीबः|क्लीब
क्लीब(व) + .{@-बः, -बम्@} + ({@-वः, -वम्@})<BR>—1 An impotent man, a eunuch; न मूत्रं फेनिलं यस्य विष्टा चाप्सु निमज्जति ।<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0620-1" target="_blank">Page0620-1</a>]<BR> मेढ्रं चोन्मादशुक्राभ्यां हीनं क्लीबः स उच्यते ॥ Kāty. quoted<BR> in Dāyabhāga.<BR>—2 The neuter gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

