क्लु
क्लु €1 Ā. (क्लबते) To move, go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्लेश्
क्लेश् €1 Ā. (क्लेशते)<BR>—1 To speak articulately.<BR>—2 To impede, hinder.<BR>—3 To strike, kill.<BR>—4 To distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

