क्षितिः + -धरः a mountain; क्षितिधरपतिकन्यामाददानः करेण Ku. 7. 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

