क्षितिः + -संक्रन्दनः (= क्षितीन्द्रः, a king); Śāhendra. 2. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षितिस्पृश्
क्षितिः + -स्पृश् an inhabitant of the earth (मानुष); इति चोपनतां<BR> क्षितिस्पृशं कृतवानासुरपुष्पदर्शनात् R. 8. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षित्वन्
क्षित्वन् <i>m.</i> Wind, air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीण|क्षीणः
क्षीण <i>p. p.</i> [क्षि-क्त]<BR>—1 Thin, emaciated, waned, become lean, diminished, worn away, expended;<BR> भार्यां क्षीणेषु वित्तेषु (जानीयात्) H. 1. 70; so क्षीणः, क्षीणोऽपि<BR> शशी; K. P. क्षीणे पुण्ये मर्त्यलोकं विशन्ति Bg. 9. 21.<BR>—2 Slender, delicate; क्षीणेन मध्येऽपि सतोदरेण N. 7. 81.<BR>—3 Small, little.<BR>—4 Poor, miserable; यो वै प्रियसुखे क्षीणः Mb. 12. 295. 13.<BR>—5 Powerless, weak.<BR>—6 Wasted away, decreased, lost, diminished.<BR>—7 Dead, destroyed; अक्षीणभक्तिः क्षीणेऽपि नन्दे Mu. 2. 21.<BR>—8 Injured, broken, torn;<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्षीणकोश, क्षीणचन्द्रः, क्षीणधन, क्षीणपाप, क्षीणपुण्य, क्षीणमध्य, क्षीणवासिन्, क्षीणविक्रान्त, क्षीणवृत्ति, क्षीणशक्ति, क्षीणबल<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणकोश
क्षीण + -कोश <i>a.</i> One whose wealth is exhausted; आरब्धैर्व्यसनैर्भूम्ना<BR> क्षीणकोशः क्षणे क्षणे Rāj. T. 5. 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणचन्द्रः|क्षीणचन्द्र
क्षीण + -चन्द्रः the moon on the wane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणधन
क्षीण + -धन <i>a.</i> reduced to poverty, impoverished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणपाप
क्षीण + -पाप <i>a.</i> one who is purified after having suffered the consequence of sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणपुण्य
क्षीण + -पुण्य <i>a.</i> one who has enjoyed all his stock of merit, and<BR> must work to acquire more in another birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणमध्य
क्षीण + -मध्य <i>a.</i> slender-waisted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणवासिन्
क्षीण + -वासिन् <i>a.</i> inhabiting a dilapidated house. ━(<i>m.</i>) a dove or pigeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणविक्रान्त|क्षीणविक्रांत
क्षीण + -विक्रान्त <i>a.</i> destitute of courage or prowess<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणवृत्ति
क्षीण + -वृत्ति <i>a.</i> deprived of the means of support, out of employ; Ms. 8. 341.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणशक्ति
क्षीण + -शक्ति, -बल <i>a.</i> weakened in strength, subsided (as a disease);<BR> उपेक्षितः क्षीणबलोऽपि शत्रुः Pt. 1. 235.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणबल
क्षीण + -शक्ति, -बल <i>a.</i> weakened in strength, subsided (as a disease);<BR> उपेक्षितः क्षीणबलोऽपि शत्रुः Pt. 1. 235.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीणता
क्षीणता<BR>—1 The state of wasting away, diminution, decay; emaciation.<BR>—2 The state of being injured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिण्
क्षिण् €5 U. (क्षिणोति-क्षिणुते, क्षित) To kill, hurt, injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिद्रः|क्षिद्र
क्षिद्रः [क्षिद्-रक्]<BR>—1 A disease.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR>—3 A horn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्
क्षिप् €6 U. (but only P. when preceded by अधि, प्रति and अति),<BR> €4 P. (क्षिपति-ते, क्षिप्यति, क्षिप्त)<BR>—1 To throw, cast, send, dispatch, discharge, let go (with loc. or sometimes<BR> dat.); मरुद्भय इति तु द्वारि क्षिपेदप्स्वद्भय इत्यपि Ms. 3. 88; शिलां<BR> वा क्षेप्स्यते मयि Mb.; R. 12. 95; with प्रति also; Bh. 3. 67; Śi. 15. 86.<BR>—2 To place, put on or upon, throw into; स्रजमपि शिरस्यन्धः क्षिप्तां<BR> धुनोत्यहिशङ्कया Ś. 7. 24; Y. 1. 230; Bg. 16. 19.<BR>—3 To fix on, attach to (as a blame); भृत्ये दोषान् क्षिपति H. 2.<BR>—4 To cast or throw off, cast away, rid oneself of; किं कूर्मस्य भरव्यथा<BR> न वपुषि क्ष्मां न क्षिपत्येष यत् Mu. 2. 18.<BR>—5<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To take away, destroy; ललितमधुरास्ते ते भावाः क्षिपन्ति च<BR> धीरताम् Māl. 4. 8.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To kill or slay; केसरी निष्ठुरक्षिप्तमृगयूथो मृगाधिपः Śi. 2. 53.<BR>—6 To reject, disdain.<BR>—7 To insult, revile, abuse, scold; Ms. 8. 312, 270; Śānti. 3. 10. ननु<BR> क्षिपसि माम् Dūtavākyam 1.<BR>—8 To pour on, scatter, strew.<BR>—9 To strike, hit.<BR>—10 To distract, afflict; तन्मे मनः क्षिपति Māl. 4. 8.<BR>—11 To move hastily (arms or legs); क्षिपंश्च पादान् Bhāg. 10. 36. 14.<BR>—12 To pass away (time); राजा हृष्टोऽक्षिपत्क्षपाम् Ks. 55. 154.<BR>—13 (in math.) To add; Golādh. ━<i>With</i> {@पर्या@} to bind or tie up,<BR> collect (as hair); (केशान्तं) पर्याक्षिपत् काचिदुदारबन्धम् Ku. 7. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्
क्षिप् <i>f.</i> Ved. A finger; दश क्षिपः पूर्व्यं सीमजीजनन् Rv. 3. 23. 3, 9. 97. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप|क्षिपः
क्षिप <i>a.</i> [क्षिप्-क] Throwing, striking, hitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपः|क्षिप
क्षिप + .{@-पः@}<BR>—1 Throwing, casting.<BR>—2 Reviling, insulting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपा
क्षिप + .{@-पा@}<BR>—1 Sending.<BR>—2 Throwing.<BR>—3 Night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपकः|क्षिपक
क्षिपकः (<i>f.</i> क्षिपिका) [P. VIII. 3. 45; Vārt. 6] An archer, a warrior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपणम्
क्षिपणम् [क्षिप्-भावे बा˚ क्युन्]<BR>—1 Sending, throwing, casting.<BR>—2 Reviling, abusing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपणिः|क्षिपणि
क्षिपणिः, -णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An oar.<BR>—2 A priest.<BR>—3 A net.<BR>—4 A weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपणी
क्षिपणिः, -णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An oar.<BR>—2 A priest.<BR>—3 A net.<BR>—4 A weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपणिः|क्षिपणि
क्षिपणिः, -णी + .{@-णिः@} A stroke with a whip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपणुः|क्षिपणु
क्षिपणुः [क्षिप्-अनुङ्]<BR>—1 An archer,<BR>—2 A weapon, मृगा इव क्षिपणोरीषमाणाः Rv. 4. 58. 6.<BR>—3 Air, wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपण्यु|क्षिपण्युः
क्षिपण्यु <i>a.</i> [क्षिप्-कन्युच्]<BR>—1 Fragrant, sweet-smelling.<BR>—2 Diffusive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपण्युः|क्षिपण्यु
क्षिपण्यु + .{@-ण्युः@}<BR>—1 The body.<BR>—2 The spring season.<BR>—3 A fragrant smell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपतिः|क्षिपति
क्षिपतिः(स्तिः) Ved. The arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिपस्तिः|क्षिपस्ति
क्षिपतिः(स्तिः) Ved. The arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्त|क्षिप्तः
क्षिप्त <i>p. p.</i> [क्षिप्-क्त]<BR>—1 Thrown, scattered, hurled, cast; क्षिप्ता जूर्णिर्न वक्षति Rv. 1. 129. 8.<BR>—2 Abandoned.<BR>—3 Disregarded, neglected, disrespected.<BR>—4 Placed.<BR>—5 Distracted, mad (see क्षिप्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्ता
क्षिप्त + .{@-प्ता@} Night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्तम्
क्षिप्त + .{@-प्तम्@} A wound caused by shooting; अथो क्षिप्तस्य भेषजीम् Av. 6. 109. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्षिप्तोत्तरम्, क्षिप्तकुक्करः, क्षिप्तचित्त, क्षिप्तदेह, क्षिप्तयोनि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्तोत्तरम्
क्षिप्त + -उत्तरम् unanswerable speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्तकुक्करः
क्षिप्त + -कुक्करः a mad dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्तचित्त
क्षिप्त + -चित्त <i>a.</i> distracted in mind, absent-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्तदेह
क्षिप्त + -देह <i>a.</i> prostrating the body, lying down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्तयोनि
क्षिप्त + -योनि <i>a.</i> of despicable descent (not fit to act as ऋत्विज्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्तिः|क्षिप्ति
क्षिप्तिः <i>f.</i> [क्षिप्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Throwing, sending forth.<BR>—2 Explaining a hidden meaning (such as solving riddles).<BR>—3 (in drama) The exposure of a secret.<BR>—4 also {@क्षिप्तिका@} (in Alg.) The quantity to be added to the square<BR> of the least root multiplied by the multiplicator (to render it capable<BR> of yielding an exact square root).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्नु|क्षिप्नुः
क्षिप्नु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Throwing, casting.<BR>—2 Killing; रक्षोगणं क्षिप्नुम् Bk. 2. 21; Śi. 16. 50.<BR>—3 Obstructive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्र|क्षिप्रं
क्षिप्र <i>a.</i> [क्षिप्-रक्] (compar. क्षेपीयस्; superl. क्षेपिष्ठ)<BR>—1 Elastic (as a bow); ऋतज्येन क्षिप्रेण ब्रह्मणस्पतिः Rv. 2. 24. 8.<BR>—2 Quick, speedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्रम्
क्षिप्र + .{@-प्रम्@}<BR>—1 A measure of time = ¹⁄₁₅ of a Muhūrta.<BR>—2 The part of the hand between the thumb and the forefinger and the corresponding<BR> part of the foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्रम्
क्षिप्र + .{@-प्रम्@} <i>ind.</i> Quickly, speedily, immediately; विनाशं व्रजति<BR> क्षिप्रमामपात्रमिवाम्भसि Ms. 3. 179; Śānti. 3. 6; Bk. 2. 44.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्षिप्रकारिन्, क्षिप्रनिश्चय, क्षिप्रसन्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्रकारिन्
क्षिप्र + -कारिन् <i>a.</i> acting quickly, prompt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्रनिश्चय
क्षिप्र + -निश्चय <i>a.</i> one who decides or resolves quickly; आयत्यां<BR> गुणदोषज्ञस्तदात्वे क्षिप्रनिश्चयः Ms. 7. 179.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिप्रसन्धिः|क्षिप्रसन्धि
क्षिप्र + -सन्धिः <i>m.</i> a kind of सन्धि produced by changing the first<BR> of two concurrent vowels to its semi-vowel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपः|क्षेप
क्षेपः [क्षिप्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Throwing, tossing, casting, moving about, movement (of limbs); कुन्दक्षेपानुगम<BR> Me. 49; भ्रूक्षेपमात्रानुमतप्रवेशाम् Ku. 3. 60.<BR>—2 A throw, cast.<BR>—3 Sending, dispatching.<BR>—4 Depression; striking down.<BR>—5 Transgressing.<BR>—6 Passing away (time); कालक्षेपः.<BR>—7 Delay, dilatoriness.<BR>—8 Insult, abuse; क्षेपं संप्राप्तवांस्तत्र Rām. 12. 49. 56; क्षेपं<BR> करोति चेद्दण्डयः Y. 2. 204; किं क्षेपे. P. II. 1. 64.<BR>—9 Disrespect, contempt.<BR>—10 Pride, haughtiness.<BR>—11 A nosegay.<BR>—12 A stroke (of an oar &c.).<BR>—13 Laying on (as a paint &c.), besmearing.<BR>—14 (in arith.) Addendum.<BR>—15 The astronomical latitude; Golādh.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्षेपदिनम्, क्षेपपातः, क्षेपवृत्तम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपदिनम्
क्षेपः + -दिनम् See क्षयतिथि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपपातः|क्षेपपात
क्षेपः + -पातः the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">Page0626-2</a>]<BR> point where the planets and the moon pass the ecliptic; Golādh. 6. 14, 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपवृत्तम्
क्षेपः + -वृत्तम् the course of the planets and of the moon; <i>ibid.</i> 5. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपक|क्षेपकः
क्षेपक <i>a.</i> [क्षिप्-ण्वुल्] A thrower, sender; जलेऽग्निक्षेपकं<BR> शृणु Ks. 61. 9.<BR>—2 Interpolated, inserted (as a passage); cf. N. 22. 48.<BR>—3 Abusive, disrespectful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपकः|क्षेपक
क्षेपक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A spurious or interpolated passage.<BR>—2 An additive quantity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपणम्
क्षेपणम् [क्षिप्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Throwing, casting, sending, directing &c.<BR>—2 Spending (as time).<BR>—3 Omitting.<BR>—4 Abusing.<BR>—5 A sling; दिग्भ्यो निपेतुर्ग्रावाणः क्षेपणैर्महिता इव Bhāg. 3. 19. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपणिः|क्षेपणि
क्षेपणम् + .{@-णिः, -णी@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An oar.<BR>—2 A net for fishing.<BR>—3 A sling or any instrument with which missiles are thrown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपणी
क्षेपणम् + .{@-णिः, -णी@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An oar.<BR>—2 A net for fishing.<BR>—3 A sling or any instrument with which missiles are thrown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपणिकः|क्षेपणिक
क्षेपणिकः A boatman, navigator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपणीय|क्षेपणीयं
क्षेपणीय <i>a.</i> [क्षिप्-अनीयर्] To be thrown or cast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपणीयम्
क्षेपणीय + .{@-यम्@} A sling, any instrument for casting missiles, stones &c.; R. 4. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेपिमन्
क्षेपिमन् <i>m.</i> Great velocity, speed; P. VI. 4. 156.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेप्तृ
क्षेप्तृ <i>a.</i> A thrower, caster, sender; Rām. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेप्य
क्षेप्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be thrown or cast &c.<BR>—2 To be placed into; मुखक्षेप्यां चकार च Ks. 89. 26.<BR>—3 To be added; Golādh. 6. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिया
क्षिया<BR>—1 Loss, destruction, waste, decay.<BR>—2 An impropriety, offence against established customs (आचारभेद);<BR> the following is an instance; स्वयमह रथेन याति उपाध्यायं पदातिं गमयति Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षिव्
क्षिव् €1. €4 P. (क्षेवति or क्षीव्यति) To eject from the mouth,<BR> vomit, spit out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षी
क्षी €1 U. (क्षयति-ते) To kill, injure, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीज्
क्षीज् €1 P. (क्षीजति) To sound indistinctly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीजनम्
क्षीजनम् [क्षीज् भावे ल्युट्] The whistling of hollow reeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीण|क्षीणः
क्षीण See under क्षि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीब्
क्षीब्, क्षीब See क्षीव्, क्षीव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीब|क्षीबः
क्षीब्, क्षीब See क्षीव्, क्षीव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरः|क्षीर
क्षीरः, -रम्<BR>—1 Milk; हंसो हि क्षीरमादत्ते तन्मिश्रा वर्जयत्यपः Ś. 6. 28.<BR>—2 The milky juice or sap of trees, exudation; resin; ये तत्क्षीरस्रुतिसुरभयो<BR> दक्षिणेन प्रवृत्ताः Me. 109; Ku. 1. 9.<BR>—3 Water; तिर्यग्वाहाश्च क्षीरिणः Rām. 2. 15. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरम्
क्षीरः, -रम्<BR>—1 Milk; हंसो हि क्षीरमादत्ते तन्मिश्रा वर्जयत्यपः Ś. 6. 28.<BR>—2 The milky juice or sap of trees, exudation; resin; ये तत्क्षीरस्रुतिसुरभयो<BR> दक्षिणेन प्रवृत्ताः Me. 109; Ku. 1. 9.<BR>—3 Water; तिर्यग्वाहाश्च क्षीरिणः Rām. 2. 15. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरः|क्षीर
क्षीरः, -रम् + .{@-रः@} See क्षीरस्वामिन्; क्षीराभिधाच्छब्दविद्योपाध्यायात्संभृतश्रुतः<BR> Rāj. T. 4. 489.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरा
क्षीरः, -रम् + .{@-रा, -री@} N. of several plants containing a milky sap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरी
क्षीरः, -रम् + .{@-रा, -री@} N. of several plants containing a milky sap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरी
क्षीरः, -रम् + .{@-री@} A dish prepared with milk (Mar. खीर).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्षीरादः, क्षीराब्धिः, क्षीराब्धिजः, क्षीराह्वः, क्षीरोदः, क्षीरोत्तरा, क्षीरोत्थम्, क्षीरोदधि, क्षीरोर्मिः, क्षीरौदनः, क्षीरकण्ठः, क्षीरकण्ठकः, क्षीरकुण्डम्, क्षीरजम्, क्षीरदात्री, क्षीरद्रुमः, क्षीरधात्री, क्षीरधिः, क्षीरनिधिः, क्षीरधेनुः, क्षीरनीरम्, क्षीरपः, क्षीरपाक, क्षीरपाणः, क्षीरभृत, क्षीरवारिः, क्षीरवारिधिः, क्षीरविकृतिः, क्षीरवृक्षः, क्षीरव्रतम्, क्षीरशरः, क्षीरसमुद्रः, क्षीरसागरः, क्षीरसर्पिस्, क्षीरसारः, क्षीरस्निग्ध, क्षीरस्फटिकः, क्षीरस्वामिन्, क्षीरहिण्डीरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरादः|क्षीराद
क्षीरः + -अदः an infant, a sucking child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीराब्धिः|क्षीराब्धि
क्षीरः + -अब्धिः<BR>—1 the sea of milk.<BR>—2 the अमृत; भो वैनतेय क्षीराब्धिः प्रारब्धो मथितुं सुरैः Ks. 22. 186.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीराब्धिजः|क्षीराब्धिज|क्षीराब्धिजं
क्षीरः + -अब्धिजः<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 the Amṛta or nectar produced at the churning of the sea.<BR>—3 an<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">Page0627-1</a>]<BR> epithet of Śeṣa.<BR>—4 a pearl. {@˚जम्@} sea-salt. {@˚जा, ˚तनया@} an epithet of Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीराह्वः|क्षीराह्व
क्षीरः + -आह्वः the pine tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरोदः|क्षीरोद
क्षीरः + -उदः cf. [P. VI. 3. 57. Vārt.] the sea of milk; क्षीरोदवेलव<BR> सफेनपुञ्जा Ku. 7. 26. ˚तनयः, ˚नन्दनः, ˚तनया, ˚सुता an epithet of Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरोत्तरा
क्षीरः + -उत्तरा inspissated milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरोत्थम्
क्षीरः + -उत्थम् fresh butter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरोदधि
क्षीरः + -उदधि = क्षीरोद q. v. above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरोर्मिः|क्षीरोर्मि
क्षीरः + -ऊर्मिः a wave of the sea of milk; R. 4. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरौदनः|क्षीरौदन
क्षीरः + -ओदनः rice boiled with milk; क्षीरौदनं पाचयित्वा Bṛ. Up. 6. 4. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरकण्ठः|क्षीरकण्ठ|क्षीरकंठ
क्षीरः + -कण्ठः, -कण्ठकः a young child (having milk in the throat); त्वया<BR> तत्क्षीरण्कठेन प्राप्तमारण्यकं व्रतम् Mv. 4. 52, 5. 11. क्षीरकण्ठाविमौ<BR> वत्सौ बत त्वन्मयजीवितौ Śiva B. 2. 24 and 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरकण्ठकः|क्षीरकण्ठक
क्षीरः + -कण्ठः, -कण्ठकः a young child (having milk in the throat); त्वया<BR> तत्क्षीरण्कठेन प्राप्तमारण्यकं व्रतम् Mv. 4. 52, 5. 11. क्षीरकण्ठाविमौ<BR> वत्सौ बत त्वन्मयजीवितौ Śiva B. 2. 24 and 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरकुण्डम्
क्षीरः + -कुण्डम् a milk-pot; कश्चिद्दुदोह कश्चिच्च क्षीरकुण्डमधारयत् Ks. 63. 188.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरजम्
क्षीरः + -जम् coagulated milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरदात्री
क्षीरः + -दात्री yielding milk (as a cow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरद्रुमः|क्षीरद्रुम
क्षीरः + -द्रुमः the Aśvattha tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरधात्री
क्षीरः + -धात्री a wet-nurse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरधिः|क्षीरधि
क्षीरः + -धिः, -निधिः the sea of milk; इन्दुः क्षीरनिधाविव R. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरनिधिः|क्षीरनिधि
क्षीरः + -धिः, -निधिः the sea of milk; इन्दुः क्षीरनिधाविव R. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरधेनुः|क्षीरधेनु
क्षीरः + -धेनुः <i>f.</i> a milch cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरनीरम्
क्षीरः + -नीरम्<BR>—1 water and milk.<BR>—2 milk-like water.<BR>—3 a fast embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरपः|क्षीरप
क्षीरः + -पः a child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरपाक
क्षीरः + -पाक <i>a.</i> cooked in milk; शतं महिषान् क्षीरपाकमोदनम् Rv. 8. 77. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरपाणः|क्षीरपाण|क्षीरपाणं
क्षीरः + -पाणः an inhabitant of Uśīnara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरपाणम्
क्षीरः + -पाणः + ({@-णम्, -नम्@}) drinking<BR> milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरपानम्
क्षीरः + -पाणः + ({@-णम्, -नम्@}) drinking<BR> milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरपाणी
क्षीरः + -पाणः + ({@-णी@}) any vessel out of which milk is drunk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरभृत
क्षीरः + -भृत <i>a.</i> supported by milk (as a Gopāla); receiving wages<BR> in the form of milk; गोपः क्षीरभृतो यस्तु Ms. 8. 231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

