क्षीरः + -वारिः, -वारिधिः the sea of milk; गत्वा च क्षीरवारिधिम् Ks. 22. 188.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरवारिधिः|क्षीरवारिधि
क्षीरः + -वारिः, -वारिधिः the sea of milk; गत्वा च क्षीरवारिधिम् Ks. 22. 188.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरविकृतिः|क्षीरविकृति
क्षीरः + -विकृतिः <i>f.</i> inspissated milk; any product made from milk (as cheese &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरवृक्षः|क्षीरवृक्ष
क्षीरः + -वृक्षः<BR>—1 N. of the four trees न्यग्रोध, उदुम्बर, अश्वत्थ and मधूक.<BR>—2 the glomerous figtree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

