क्षीरः + -व्रतम् living upon milk in consequence of a vow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

