क्षीरसर्पिस्
क्षीरः + -सर्पिस् <i>n.</i> ghee (घृत).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरसारः|क्षीरसार
क्षीरः + -सारः butter; क्षीरसारमपनीय शङ्कया स्वीकृतं यदि पलायनं त्वया Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरस्निग्ध
क्षीरः + -स्निग्ध <i>a.</i> unctuous with milky juice or sap; Ś. 3. 6. (v. l.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरस्फटिकः|क्षीरस्फटिक
क्षीरः + -स्फटिकः a precious stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरस्वामिन्
क्षीरः + -स्वामिन् <i>m.</i> a commentator on the Amarakośa and a grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरहिण्डीरः|क्षीरहिण्डीर
क्षीरः + -हिण्डीरः the foam of milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरपकः|क्षीरपक
