क्षीरिका
क्षीरिका<BR>—1 A dish prepared with milk.<BR>—2 N. of plant (Mar. दुधी, रांजणी, खिरणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षीरिन्
