क्षुतकः|क्षुतक
क्षुतः, क्षुतकः Black mustard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुः|क्षु
क्षुः Ved.<BR>—1 Food; विश्वं विवेष्टि द्रविणमुप क्षु Rv. 10. 61. 12.<BR>—2 A lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

