क्षुधालु <i>a.</i> Hungry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुधित|क्षुधितः
क्षुधित <i>a.</i> Hungry; तस्यालमेषा क्षुधितस्य तृप्त्यै R. 2. 30<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुधुनः|क्षुधुन
क्षुधुनः N. of a savage race, the Mlecchas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुन्द्
क्षुन्द् €1 Ā. To jump; क्षुणाति च क्षुणीते च क्षुणोत्याप्लवनेऽपि च ।<BR> क्षन्दते क्षुन्दते चापि षडाप्लवनवाचिनः ॥ इति भट्टमल्लः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुपः|क्षुप
क्षुपः A tree with small roots and branches, a shrub, bush, Rām. 2. 25. 7;<BR> क्षुपेषु मुक्तमूलेषु केचित्पेतुरवाङ्मुखाः Śiva B. 20. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुभ्
क्षुभ् €1 Ā., €4. €9 P. (क्षोभते, क्षुभ्यति, क्षुभ्नाति, क्षुभित-क्षुब्ध)<BR>—1 To shake, tremble, to be agitated or disturbed; महाह्रद इव क्षुभ्यन्<BR> Bk. 9. 118; R. 4. 21; Śi. 8. 24.<BR>—2 To be unsteady.<BR>—3 To stumble (fig. also). ━<i>Caus.</i> (क्षोभयति) To agitate,<BR> stir up, excite, perturb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुभ्
क्षुभ् <i>f.</i> Ved. A blow, push; क्षुभा मर्तमनुयतं वधस्नेः Rv. 5. 41. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुभ|क्षुभः
क्षुभ <i>a.</i> [क्षुभ्-क] Exciting, agitating &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुभित|क्षुभितः
क्षुभित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shaken, agitated &c.; महाप्रलयग्रारुतक्षुभितपुष्करावर्तक &c.; Ve. 3. 2.<BR>—2 Afraid.<BR>—3 Enraged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुब्ध|क्षुब्धः
क्षुब्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Agitated, shaken, unsteady.<BR>—2 Disturbed.<BR>—3 Afraid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुब्धः|क्षुब्ध
क्षुब्ध + .{@-ब्धः@} A churning stick; शोभैव मन्दरः क्षुब्धक्षुभिताम्भोधिवर्णना Śi. 2. 107.<BR>—2 A particular mode of sexual enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोभः|क्षोभ
क्षोभः [क्षुभ-घञ्]<BR>—1 Shaking, moving, tossing; Me. 28, 97; so काननक्षोभः &c.<BR>—2 Jolting; R. 1. 58; अयं तस्या रथक्षोभादंसेनांसो निपीडितः V. 3. 11.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Agitation, disturbance, excitement, emotion; क्षोभक˚ U. 3. 3. 29;<BR> स्वयंवरक्षोभकृतामभावः R. 7. 3; अथेन्द्रियक्षोभमयुग्मनेत्रः<BR> पुनर्वशित्वाद्बलवन्निगृह्य Ku. 3. 69.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Provocation, irritation; प्रायः स्वं महिमानं क्षोभात्प्रतिपद्यते<BR> जन्तुः Ś. 6. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोभणम्
क्षोभणम् [क्षुभ्-णिच् ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Agitating, disturbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षोभणः|क्षोभण|क्षोभणं
क्षोभणम् + .{@-णः@} One of the five arrows of Kāmadeva.<BR>—2 An epithet of<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Viṣṇu,<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुमा
क्षुमा<BR>—1 Linseed, a kind of flax.<BR>—2 The Indigo plant.<BR>—3 A goddess bestowing favour or distress. L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुर्
क्षुर् €6 P. (क्षुरति, क्षुरित)<BR>—1 To cut, scratch.<BR>—2 To make lines or furrows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरः|क्षुर
क्षुरः [क्षुर्-क]<BR>—1 A razor; क्षुराग्रैः चक्रैः (हृतानि) R. 7. 46. प्रवर्तमानमन्याये<BR> छेदयेल्लवशः क्षुरैः Ms. 9. 292.<BR>—2 A razor-like barb attached to an arrow.<BR>—3 The hoof of a cow or horse.<BR>—4 An arrow; क्षुरैश्चिच्छेद लघ्वस्त्रम् Mb. 3. 287. 17.<BR>—5 The foot of a bed-stead.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्षुरकर्मन्, क्षुरचतुष्टयम्, क्षुरधानम्, क्षुरभाण्डम्, क्षुरधार, क्षुरनक्षत्रम्, क्षुरप्रः, क्षुरप्रमाला, क्षुरमर्दिन्, क्षुरमुण्डिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरकर्मन्|क्षुरकर्म्मन्
क्षुरः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i><BR> {@-क्रिया@} the act of shaving; नाश्मनि स्यात्क्षुरक्रिया Pt. 1. 386.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरचतुष्टयम्
क्षुरः + -चतुष्टयम् the four things necessary for shaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरधानम्
क्षुरः + -धानम्, -भाण्डम् a razor-case. यथा क्षुरः क्षुरधानेऽवोपहितः<BR> Kauṣ. Up. 4. 20; भद्रे शीघ्रमानीयतां क्षुरभाण्डं येन क्षौरकर्मकरणाय गच्छामि Pt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरभाण्डम्
क्षुरः + -धानम्, -भाण्डम् a razor-case. यथा क्षुरः क्षुरधानेऽवोपहितः<BR> Kauṣ. Up. 4. 20; भद्रे शीघ्रमानीयतां क्षुरभाण्डं येन क्षौरकर्मकरणाय गच्छामि Pt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरधार|क्षुरधारः
क्षुरः + -धार <i>a.</i> as sharp as a razor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरनक्षत्रम्
क्षुरः + -नक्षत्रम् Any lunar mansion that is inauspicious for shaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरप्रः|क्षुरप्र
क्षुरः + -प्रः<BR>—1 an arrow with a sharp horse-shoe shaped head; तं क्षुरप्रशकलीकृतं<BR> कृती R. 11. 29, 9. 62. क्षुरप्रचक्र-निस्त्रिंश-कुन्त-पट्टिश-पाणिभिः<BR> Śiva B. 4. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरप्रमाला
क्षुरः + -प्रमाला a chain of crescent necklets; अहो मया भद्रवत्याः क्षुरप्रमालाहिता Pratijñā. 4.<BR>—2 a sort of hoe, a weeding-spade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरमर्दिन्|क्षुरमर्द्दिन्
क्षुरः + -मर्दिन्, -मुण्डिन् <i>m.</i> a barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरमुण्डिन्|क्षुरमुंडिन्
क्षुरः + -मर्दिन्, -मुण्डिन् <i>m.</i> a barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरिका
क्षुरिका, क्षुरी<BR>—1 A knife, dagger; पार्थस्य निहतस्याङ्गे सोक्षिपत्क्षुरिकां ततः Rāj. T. 5. 438.<BR>—2 A small razor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरी
क्षुरिका, क्षुरी<BR>—1 A knife, dagger; पार्थस्य निहतस्याङ्गे सोक्षिपत्क्षुरिकां ततः Rāj. T. 5. 438.<BR>—2 A small razor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरिकोपनिषद्
क्षुरिकोपनिषद् N. of a Up. belonging to Av.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरिणी
क्षुरिणी The wife of a barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुरिन्
क्षुरिन् <i>m.</i> A barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्ल|क्षुल्लः
क्षुल्ल <i>a.</i> Small, little; अतृप्नुम क्षुल्लसुखावहानां तेषामृते<BR> कृष्णकथामृतौघात् Bhāg. 3. 5. 10.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्षुल्लतातः, क्षुल्लपिता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्लतातः|क्षुल्लतात
क्षुल्ल + -तातः, -पिता the younger brother of oneʼs father; cf. खुल्ल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्लपिता
क्षुल्ल + -तातः, -पिता the younger brother of oneʼs father; cf. खुल्ल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्लक|क्षुल्लकः
क्षुल्लक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Little, minute; अथो ये क्षुल्लका इव सर्वे ते क्रिमयो हताः Av. 2. 32. 5.<BR>—2 Low, vile.<BR>—3 Insignificant.<BR>—4 Wicked, malicious.<BR>—5 Poor.<BR>—6 Pained, distressed.<BR>—7 Hard. —8 Young.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षुल्लकः|क्षुल्लक
क्षुल्लक + .{@-कः@} small shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रम्
क्षेत्रम् [क्षि-ष्ट्रन्] A field, ground, soil; चीयते बालिशस्यापि<BR> सत्क्षेत्रपतिता कृषिः Mu. 1. 3.<BR>—2 Landed property, land.<BR>—3 Place, abode, region, repository; कपटशतमयं क्षेत्रमप्रत्ययानाम्<BR> Pt. 1. 191; Bh. 1. 77; Me. 16.<BR>—4 A sacred spot, a place of pilgrimage; क्षेत्रं क्षत्रप्रधनपिशुनं<BR> कौरवं तद्भजेथाः Me. 50; Bg. 1. 1.<BR>—5 An enclosed spot of ground, portion or space, superficies, circuit.<BR>—6 Fertile soil.<BR>—7 Place of origin; Bhāg. 2. 6. 1.<BR>—8 A wife; अपि नाम कुलपतेरिंयमसवर्णक्षेत्रसंभवा स्यात् Ś. 1;<BR> Ms. 3. 175; वृद्धस्तु व्याधितो वा राजा … क्षेत्रे बीजमुत्पादयेत् Kau. A. 1. 17.<BR>—9 The sphere of action, the body (regarded as the field of the working<BR> of the soul); योगिनो यं विचिन्वन्ति क्षेत्राभ्यन्तरवर्तिनम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">Page0629-2</a>]<BR> Ku. 6. 77; Bg. 13. 1, 2, 3.<BR>—10 The mind.<BR>—11 A house; a town.<BR>—12 A plane figure, as a triangle.<BR>—13 A diagram.<BR>—14 A sign of the zodiac.<BR>—15 (in chiromancy) A certain portion marked out on the palm; क्षेत्रं<BR> मृजां च विधिवत्कुशलोऽवलोक्य सामुद्रविद्वदति यातमनागतं च Bṛ. S. 68. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्षेत्रांशः, क्षेत्राधिदेवता, क्षेत्राजीवः, क्षेत्रकरः, क्षेत्रकृत, क्षेत्रेक्षुः, क्षेत्रगणितम्, क्षेत्रगत, क्षेत्रज, क्षेत्रजात, क्षेत्रज्ञ, क्षेत्रदेवता, क्षेत्रपतिः, क्षेत्रपदम्, क्षेत्रपालः, क्षेत्रफलम्, क्षेत्रभक्तिः, क्षेत्रभूमिः, क्षेत्रराशिः, क्षेत्रलिप्ता, क्षेत्रविद्, क्षेत्रव्यवहारः, क्षेत्रस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रांशः|क्षेत्रांश
क्षेत्रम् + -अंशः a degree of the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्राधिदेवता
क्षेत्रम् + -अधिदेवता the tutelary deity of any sacred piece of ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्राजीवः|क्षेत्राजीव
क्षेत्रम् + -आजीवः, -करः, -कृतः^1 <i>m.</i> a cultivator, peasant.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रकरः|क्षेत्रकर
क्षेत्रम् + -आजीवः, -करः, -कृतः^1 <i>m.</i> a cultivator, peasant.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रकृतः
क्षेत्रम् + -आजीवः, -करः, -कृतः^1 <i>m.</i> a cultivator, peasant.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रेक्षुः|क्षेत्रेक्षु
क्षेत्रम् + -इक्षुः N. of a corn (यवनाल- Mar. जोंधळा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रगणितम्
क्षेत्रम् + -गणितम् geometry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रगत
क्षेत्रम् + -गत <i>a.</i> geometrical. ˚उपपत्तिः <i>f.</i> geometrical proof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रज|क्षेत्रजः
क्षेत्रम् + -ज <i>a.</i><BR>—1 produced in a field.<BR>—2 born from the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रजः|क्षेत्रज
क्षेत्रम् + -ज + ({@-जः@}) —1 one of the 12 kinds of sons allowed<BR> by the old Hindu Law, the offspring of a wife by a kinsman duly appointed<BR> to raise up issue to the husband; Ms. 9. 167, 180; Y. 1. 69, 2. 128.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रजात
क्षेत्रम् + -जात <i>a.</i> begotten on the wife of another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रज्ञ|क्षेत्रज्ञः
क्षेत्रम् + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 knowing places.<BR>—2 clever, dexterous; क्षेत्रज्ञवद्भाषसे त्वं हि धर्मान् Mb. 1. 89. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रज्ञः|क्षेत्रज्ञ
क्षेत्रम् + -ज्ञ + .({@-ज्ञः@})<BR>—1 the soul; cf. क्षेत्रज्ञं चापि मां विद्धि सर्वक्षेत्रेषु भारत Bg. 13. 1, 3;<BR> Ms. 12. 12.<BR>—2 the Supreme Soul.<BR>—3 a libertine.<BR>—4 a husbandman.<BR>—5 a form of Śiva.<BR>—6 a witness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रज्ञा
क्षेत्रम् + -ज्ञ + .({@-ज्ञः@}) + ({@-ज्ञा@}) a girl fifteen years old personating Durgā at a festival.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रदेवता
क्षेत्रम् + -देवता the deity of the fields; N. of a serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रपतिः|क्षेत्रपति
क्षेत्रम् + -पतिः a land-owner, a landlord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रपदम्
क्षेत्रम् + -पदम् a place sacred to a deity; पादौ हरेः क्षेत्रपदानुसर्पणे<BR> Bhāg. 9. 4. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रपालः|क्षेत्रपाल
क्षेत्रम् + -पालः<BR>—1 a man employed to guard a field.<BR>—2 a deity protecting fields.<BR>—3 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रफलम्
क्षेत्रम् + -फलम् the area or superficial contents of a figure (in math.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रभक्तिः|क्षेत्रभक्ति
क्षेत्रम् + -भक्तिः <i>f.</i> the division of a field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रभूमिः|क्षेत्रभूमि
क्षेत्रम् + -भूमिः <i>f.</i> cultivated land.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रराशिः|क्षेत्रराशि
क्षेत्रम् + -राशिः quantity represented by geometrical figures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रलिप्ता
क्षेत्रम् + -लिप्ता a minute of the ecliptic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रविद्
क्षेत्रम् + -विद् <i>a.</i> = क्षेत्रज्ञ q. v. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a husbandman.<BR>—2 a sage, one who has spiritual knowledge; यमक्षरं क्षेत्रविदो विदुः Ku. 3. 50.<BR>—3 the soul; यः क्षेत्रवित्तपतया हृदि विष्वगाविः Bhāg. 4. 22. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रव्यवहारः|क्षेत्रव्यवहार
क्षेत्रम् + -व्यवहारः<BR>—1 drawing a figure in geometry.<BR>—2 geometrical demonstration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रस्थ
क्षेत्रम् + -स्थ <i>a.</i> residing at a sacred place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिक|क्षेत्रिकः
क्षेत्रिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [क्षेत्रमस्त्यस्य ठन्] Relating to a field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिकः|क्षेत्रिक
क्षेत्रिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A farmer; Ms. 8. 241, 9. 53.<BR>—2 A husband; हरेत्तत्र नियुक्तायां जातः पुत्रो यथौरसः । क्षेत्रिकस्य<BR> तु तद्बीजं धर्मतः प्रसवश्च सः Ms. 9. 145.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिन्
क्षेत्रिन् <i>a.</i> [क्षेत्र-इनि]<BR>—1 Owing a field; cultivating land.<BR>—2 Agricultural. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 An agriculturist, a cultivator; यावत्सस्यं विनश्येत्तु तावत्स्यात्क्षेत्रिणः<BR> फलम् Y. 2. 161.<BR>—2 A (nominal) husband; आहुरुत्पादकं केचिदपरे क्षेत्रिणं विदुः Ms. 9. 32; Ś. 5.<BR>—3 The soul.<BR>—4 The Supreme Soul; क्षेत्रं क्षेत्री तथा कृत्स्नं प्रकाशयति भारत Bg. 13. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रिय|क्षेत्रियं|क्षेत्रियः
क्षेत्रिय <i>a.</i> [क्षेत्र-घ cf. P. V. 2. 92. Vārt. 1, 2.]<BR>—1 Relating to a field.<BR>—2 Curable in a future body, or incurable in the present life, irremediable;<BR> दण्डोऽयं क्षेत्रियो येन मय्यपातीति साऽब्रवीत् Bk. 4. 32 क्षेत्रियरोगं<BR> सखि हृदन्तः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रियम्
क्षेत्रिय + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 An organic disease.<BR>—2 Meadow grass, pasturage.<BR>—3 (pl.) The surrounding parts of any place; यदि स्थ क्षेत्रियाणाम् Av. 2. 14. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रियः|क्षेत्रिय|क्षेत्रियं
क्षेत्रिय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 A medicament.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">Page0630-1</a>]<BR>—2 An incurable disease.<BR>—3 An adulterer.<BR>—4 Physicking, operating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रीयति
क्षेत्रीयति Den. P. To desire anotherʼs wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेत्रीकृ
क्षेत्रीकृ €8 U. To expose to, to subject to; Mu. 7. 4; K. 135.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेप|क्षेपः
क्षेप &c. See under क्षिप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेम|क्षेमं|क्षेमः
क्षेम <i>a.</i> [क्षि-मन् Uṇ. 1. 138]<BR>—1 Conferring happiness, ease or comfort, good, beneficial, well; धार्तराष्ट्रा<BR> रणे हन्युस्तन्मे क्षेमतरं भवेत् Bg. 1. 46.<BR>—2 Prosperous, at ease, comfortable; विविशुस्ते वनं वीराः क्षेमं निहतकण्टकम् Mb. 3. 11. 72.<BR>—3 Secure, happy; विविक्तक्षेमसेवनम् Bhāg. 3. 28. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमः|क्षेम|क्षेमं
क्षेम + .{@-मः, -मम्@}<BR>—1 Peace, happiness, ease, welfare, well-being; वितन्वति क्षेममदेवमातृकाश्चिराय<BR> तस्मिन् कुरवश्चकासति Ki. 1. 17; वैश्यं क्षेमं समागम्य (पृच्छेत्)<BR> Ms. 2. 127; अधुना सर्वजलचराणां क्षेमं भविष्यति Pt. 1.<BR>—2 Safety, security; क्षेमेण व्रज बान्धवान् Mk. 7. 7 safely; Pt. 1. 146.<BR>—3 Preserving, protection; आदिदेशाथ शत्रुध्नं तेषां क्षेमाय राघवः R. 15. 6.<BR>—4 Keeping what is acquired; cf. योगक्षेम; तेषां नित्याभियुक्तानां योगक्षेमं<BR> वहाम्यहम् Bg. 9. 22.<BR>—5 Final beatitude, eternal happiness.<BR>—6 Basis, foundation; क्षेमे तिष्ठाति घृतमुक्षमाणा Av. 3. 12. 1.<BR>—7 Residence, resting-place; Av. 13. 1. 27.<BR>—8 A star, asterism (नक्षत्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमम्
क्षेम + .{@-मः, -मम्@}<BR>—1 Peace, happiness, ease, welfare, well-being; वितन्वति क्षेममदेवमातृकाश्चिराय<BR> तस्मिन् कुरवश्चकासति Ki. 1. 17; वैश्यं क्षेमं समागम्य (पृच्छेत्)<BR> Ms. 2. 127; अधुना सर्वजलचराणां क्षेमं भविष्यति Pt. 1.<BR>—2 Safety, security; क्षेमेण व्रज बान्धवान् Mk. 7. 7 safely; Pt. 1. 146.<BR>—3 Preserving, protection; आदिदेशाथ शत्रुध्नं तेषां क्षेमाय राघवः R. 15. 6.<BR>—4 Keeping what is acquired; cf. योगक्षेम; तेषां नित्याभियुक्तानां योगक्षेमं<BR> वहाम्यहम् Bg. 9. 22.<BR>—5 Final beatitude, eternal happiness.<BR>—6 Basis, foundation; क्षेमे तिष्ठाति घृतमुक्षमाणा Av. 3. 12. 1.<BR>—7 Residence, resting-place; Av. 13. 1. 27.<BR>—8 A star, asterism (नक्षत्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमः|क्षेम|क्षेमं
क्षेम + .{@-मः, -मा@} A kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमा
क्षेम + .{@-मः, -मा@} A kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमा
क्षेम + .{@-मा@} An epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमम्
क्षेम + .{@-मम्@} N. of one of the seven वर्षाs in Jambu-dvīpa. शिवं<BR> यवसं सुभद्रं शान्तं क्षेमममृतमभयमिति वर्षाणि Bhāg. 5. 20. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: क्षेमाश्रमः, क्षेमेन्द्रः, क्षेमकर, क्षेमकार, क्षेमशूरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमाश्रमः
क्षेम + -आश्रमः the order of a householder (गार्हस्थ्य); वेत्ति ज्ञानविसर्गं<BR> च निग्रहानुग्रहं यथा । यथोक्तवृत्तेर्धीरस्य क्षेमाश्रमपदं भवेत् ॥ Mb. 12. 66. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमेन्द्रः|क्षेमेन्द्र
क्षेम + -इन्द्रः N. of a celebrated poet of Kashmir (author of बृहत्कथा,<BR> भारतमञ्जरी &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमकर|क्षेमकरः
क्षेम + -कर, -कार (also क्षेमंकर) <i>a.</i> propitious, causing<BR> peace or security.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमकार|क्षेमकारः
क्षेम + -कर, -कार (also क्षेमंकर) <i>a.</i> propitious, causing<BR> peace or security.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमशूरः|क्षेमशूर
क्षेम + -शूरः ‘A hero in safe-places’, a carpet-knight, a boaster; किं<BR> क्षेमशूरैर्विबुधैरसंयुगविकत्थनैः Bhāg. 10. 4. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेमिन्
क्षेमिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>) Safe, secure, happy; क्षेमी स्यात्किमु<BR> विश्वेशे Bhāg. 10. 88. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेम्य|क्षेम्यं|क्षेम्यः
क्षेम्य <i>a.</i> [क्षेमाय साधु यत्]<BR>—1 Resting, at ease; यमर्धं ते मघवन् क्षेम्या धूः Rv. 10. 28. 5.<BR>—2 Habitable, comfortable.<BR>—3 Healthy, salubrious. क्षेम्यस्तिष्ठन्प्रतरणः सुवीरः Mbh. on P. V. 4. 36.<BR>—4 Lucky, prosperous.<BR>—5 Giving peace; न चैवैषा गतिः क्षेम्या Mb. 14. 58. 2<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

क्षेम्यः|क्षेम्य|क्षेम्यं
