खः|ख|खं
खः The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खम्
खः + .{@-खम्@}<BR>—1 The sky; खं केशवोऽपर इवाक्रमितुं प्रवृत्तः Mk. 5. 2; यावद्गिरः<BR> खे मरुतां चरन्ति Ku. 3. 72; Me. 9.<BR>—2 Heaven.<BR>—3 Organ of sense; पराञ्चि खानि व्यतृणत्स्वयंभूस्तमात्पराङ् पश्यति<BR> नान्तरात्मन् Kaṭh. 2. 1. 1.<BR>—4 A city.<BR>—5 A field.<BR>—6 A cypher.<BR>—7 A dot, an anusvāra.<BR>—8 A cavity, an aperture, hollow, hole; नश्यतीषुर्यथा विद्धः खे विद्धमनुविध्यतः Ms. 9. 43.<BR>—9 An aperture of the human body; (of which there are 9, <i>i. e.</i> the<BR> mouth, the two ears, the two eyes, the two nostrils, and the organs of<BR> excretion and generation); खानि चैव स्पृशेदद्भिः Ms. 2. 60, 53, 4. 144;<BR> Y. 1. 20; cf. Ku. 3. 50.<BR>—10 A wound.<BR>—11 Happiness, pleasure.<BR>—12 Tale.<BR>—13 Action.<BR>—14 Knowledge.<BR>—15 Brahman.<BR>—16 The glottis (in anatomy).<BR>—17 The tenth mansion from any given constellation or the sunʼs entrance into it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खा
खः + .{@-खा@}<BR>—1 A well, fountain.<BR>—2 A river.<BR>—3 Pārvatī.<BR>—4 The earth.<BR>—5 Lakṣmi.<BR>—6 The speech; cf. खोमा क्ष्मा कमला च गीः Enm.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: खाटः, खापगा, खोल्कः, खखोल्कः, खोल्मुकः, खकामिनी, खकुन्तलः, खग, खगङ्गा, खगतिः, खगम, खगुण, खगोलः, खचमसः, खचर, खचारिन्, खजलम्, खज्योतिस्, खतमालः, खतिलकः, खद्योतः, खद्योतनः, खधूपः, खपरागः, खपुष्पम्, खबाष्पः, खभ्रमः, खभ्रान्तिः, खमणिः, खमीलनम्, खमूर्तिः, खवारि, खबाष्पः, खशय, खशरीरम्, खश्वासः, खसमुत्थ, खसंभव, खसिन्धुः, खसूचि, खस्तनी, खस्फटिकम्, खहर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खाटः|खाट
खः + -अटः (खेऽटः)<BR>—1 a planet.<BR>—2 Rāhu, the ascending node.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खापगा
खः + -आपगा an epithet of the Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोल्कः|खोल्क
खः + -उल्कः, -खोल्कः<BR>—1 a meteor.<BR>—2 a planet.<BR>—3 N. of the sun. ˚आदित्यः a form of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खखोल्कः|खखोल्क
खः + -उल्कः, -खोल्कः<BR>—1 a meteor.<BR>—2 a planet.<BR>—3 N. of the sun. ˚आदित्यः a form of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोल्मुकः|खोल्मुक
खः + -उल्मुकः the planet Mars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खकामिनी
खः + -कामिनी N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खकुन्तलः|खकुन्तल|खकुंतल
खः + -कुन्तलः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खग|खगः
खः + -ग <i>a.</i> [खे आकाशे गच्छति गम्-ड] moving in the air; आरुह्यतामयं<BR> शीघ्रं खगो रत्नविभूषितः Rām. 3. 42. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खगः|खग
खः + -ग + .({@-गः@})<BR>—1 a bird; अधुनीत खगः स नैकधा तनुम् N. 2. 2; Ms. 12. 63.<BR>—2 air, wind; तमांसीव यथा सूर्यो वृक्षानग्निर्घनान्खगः Mb.<BR>—3 the sun.<BR>—4 a planet; <i>e. g.</i> आपोक्लिमे यदि खगाः स किलेन्दुवारः Tv.<BR>—5 a grass-hopper.<BR>—6 a deity.<BR>—7 an arrow; आशीविषाभान् खगमान् प्रमुञ्चन् Mb. 8. 67. 2. ˚अधिपः<BR> an epithet of Garuḍa; हर्षयन्विबुधानीकमारुरोह खगाधिपम् Bhāg. 8. 4. 26.<BR> ˚अन्तकः a hawk, falcon. ˚अभिरामः an epithet of Śiva. ˚आसनः<BR>—1 the eastern mountain on which the sun rises.<BR>—2 an epithet of Viṣṇu. ˚इन्द्रः, ˚ईश्वरः, ˚पतिः epithets of Garuḍa<BR> ज्ञानेन वैयासकिशद्वितेन भेजे खगेन्द्रध्वजपादमूलम् Bhāg. ˚वती<BR> <i>f.</i> the earth. ˚स्थानम्<BR>—1 the hollow of a tree.<BR>—2 a birdʼs nest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खगङ्गा|खगंगा
खः + -गङ्गा celestial Gaṅgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खगतिः|खगति
खः + -गतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 flight in the air.<BR>—2 the motion of a planet.<BR>—3 a metre of 4 x 16 syllables.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खगम|खगमः
खः + -गम <i>a.</i> moving in the air, flying (as the Gandharvas or missile<BR> weapons).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खगमः|खगम
खः + -गम + ({@-मः@}) a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेगमनः|खेगमन
खः + -गम + ({@-खे@}) {@गमनः@} a kind of gallinule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खगुण
खः + -गुण <i>a.</i> having a cypher as a multiplier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खगोलः|खगोल
खः + -गोलः the celestial sphere. ˚विद्या astronomy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खचमसः|खचमस
खः + -चमसः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खचर|खचरः
खः + -चर <i>a.</i> flying, moving in the air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खचरः|खचर
खः + -चर + ({@-रः@}) or {@खेचरः@}<BR>—1 a bird.<BR>—2 a cloud.<BR>—3 the sun.<BR>—4 the wind.<BR>—5 a demon.<BR>—6 an aerial spirit.<BR>—7 a Gandharva or Vidyādhara खचरनगरकल्पं कल्पितं शास्त्रदृष्टया<BR> Mb. 7. 7. 54; दिव्यस्रग्वस्त्रसन्नाहाः कलत्रैः खेचरा इव Bhāg. 10. 82. 9.<BR>—8 a planet. (hence the number ‘nine’).<BR>—9 mercury or quicksilver.<BR>—10 a sign of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खेचरः|खेचर
खः + -चर + ({@-रः@}) or {@खेचरः@}<BR>—1 a bird.<BR>—2 a cloud.<BR>—3 the sun.<BR>—4 the wind.<BR>—5 a demon.<BR>—6 an aerial spirit.<BR>—7 a Gandharva or Vidyādhara खचरनगरकल्पं कल्पितं शास्त्रदृष्टया<BR> Mb. 7. 7. 54; दिव्यस्रग्वस्त्रसन्नाहाः कलत्रैः खेचरा इव Bhāg. 10. 82. 9.<BR>—8 a planet. (hence the number ‘nine’).<BR>—9 mercury or quicksilver.<BR>—10 a sign of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खचरी
खः + -चर + ({@-री@} <i>i. e.</i> {@खेचरी@})<BR>—1 a semi-divine female able to fly.<BR>—2 an epithet of Durgā.<BR>—3 The<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-2" target="_blank">Page0633-2</a>]<BR> magical power of flying (सिद्धि); एवं सखीभिरुक्ताहं खेचरीसिद्धिलोलुभा Ks. 20. 105.<BR>—4 a particular मुद्रा or position of fingers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खचारिन्
खः + -चारिन् <i>a.</i> moving in the air. ━(<i>m.</i>) an epithet of Skanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खजलम्
खः + -जलम् ‘sky-water’, dew, rain, frost &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

