खच्
खच् I. €1. €9 P. (खचति, खच्नाति, खचित)<BR>—1 To come forth, appear.<BR>—2 To be born again.<BR>—3 To purify. ━II. €10 U. (खचयति, खचित)<BR>—1 To fasten, bind.<BR>—2 To set, inlay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0633-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खचित|खचितं
