खड्गः + -बन्धः a kind of artificial composition, the words being arranged<BR> in the form of a sword; see K. P. 9 <i>ad loc.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

