खड्गः + -विद्या swordsmanship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गारीटः|खड्गारीट
खड्गारीटः<BR>—1 A shield.<BR>—2 One who observes a particular religious penance peculiar to Buddhists<BR> by walking on swords; cf. असिधारा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गवत्|खड्गवन्त्
खड्गवत् <i>a.</i> Armed with a sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गिकः|खड्गिक
खड्गिकः<BR>—1 A swordsman.<BR>—2 A butcher.<BR>—3 The cream of buffaloʼs milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गिन्
खड्गिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) Armed with a sword. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A rhinoceros; शार्दूलानां वृकाणां च खड्गिनां वनदंष्ट्रिणाम् Śiva B. 22. 29.<BR>—2 An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खड्गीकम्
खड्गीकम् A sickle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खणखणायते
खणखणायते Den. Ā. To tick, tinkle, crack, clank; Bhāg. 5. 2. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्ड्|खंड्
खण्ड् €10 P. (खण्डयति, खण्डित)<BR>—1 To break, cut, tear, break to pieces, crush; Bk. 15. 54; सौहार्दं<BR> शकटेन खण्डितम् Mu. 5. 18; Śi. 7. 31, 20. 24, 6. 16, 12. 3.<BR>—2 To defeat completely, destroy, dispel; रजनीचरनाथेन खण्डिते तिमिरे<BR> निशि H. 2. 111.<BR>—3 To disappoint; frustrate, cross in love; स्त्रीभिः कस्य न खण्डितं<BR> भुवि मनः Pt. 1. 146.<BR>—4 To disturb.<BR>—5 To cheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्ड|खंड|खण्डं|खण्डः
खण्ड <i>a.</i> [खण्ड्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Broken, divided, torn asunder; ˚देवकुलम् Pt. 2 a temple in ruins.<BR>—2 Having chasms, gaps or breaks.<BR>—3 Defective, deficient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डः|खण्ड|खंड|खण्डं
खण्ड + .{@-ण्डः, -ण्डम्@}<BR>—1 A break, chasm, gap, fissure, fracture.<BR>—2 A piece, part, fragment, portion; दिवः कान्तिमत्खण्डमेकम् Me. 30;<BR> काष्ठ˚, मांस˚ &c.<BR>—3 A section of a work, chapter.<BR>—4 A multitude, an assemblage, group; छित्त्वा कर्पूरखण्डान्वृतिमिह कुरुते<BR> कोद्रवाणां समन्तात् Bh. 2. 100; तरुखण्डस्य K. 23; Māl. 5. 23, 8. 10.<BR>—5 A term in an equation.<BR>—6 A continent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डम्
खण्ड + .{@-ण्डः, -ण्डम्@}<BR>—1 A break, chasm, gap, fissure, fracture.<BR>—2 A piece, part, fragment, portion; दिवः कान्तिमत्खण्डमेकम् Me. 30;<BR> काष्ठ˚, मांस˚ &c.<BR>—3 A section of a work, chapter.<BR>—4 A multitude, an assemblage, group; छित्त्वा कर्पूरखण्डान्वृतिमिह कुरुते<BR> कोद्रवाणां समन्तात् Bh. 2. 100; तरुखण्डस्य K. 23; Māl. 5. 23, 8. 10.<BR>—5 A term in an equation.<BR>—6 A continent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डः|खण्ड|खंड|खण्डं
खण्ड + .{@-ण्डः@}<BR>—1 Candied sugar.<BR>—2 A flaw in a jewel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डम्
खण्ड + .{@-ण्डम्@}<BR>—1 A kind of salt.<BR>—2 A sort of sugar-cane. (In comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्ड|खंड|खण्डं|खण्डः
खण्ड + .{@-खण्ड@} means ‘partial’, ‘incomplete’).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: खण्डाभ्रम्, खण्डालिः, खण्डेन्दुः, खण्डकथा, खण्डकर्णः, खण्डकाव्यम्, खण्डजः, खण्डतालः, खण्डधारा, खण्डपरशुः, खण्डपर्शुः, खण्डपालः, खण्डप्रलयः, खण्डफलम्, खण्डमण्डल, खण्डमोदकः, खण्डलवणम्, खण्डविकारः, खण्डशर्करा, खण्डशीला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डाभ्रम्
खण्ड + -अभ्रम्<BR>—1 scattered clouds.<BR>—2 the impression of the teeth in amorous sports; खण्डाभ्रमभ्रवेशे<BR> स्यात् तथा दन्तक्षतान्तरे Med.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डालिः
खण्ड + -आलिः<BR>—1 a measure of oil.<BR>—2 a pond or lake.<BR>—3 a woman whose husband has been guilty of infidelity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डेन्दुः|खण्डेन्दु
खण्ड + -इन्दुः the crescent moon. ˚मण्डनः the god Śiva; खण्डेन्दुमण्डनाचार्यां<BR> मण्डनत्वमखण्डितम् Rāj. T. 1. 280.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डकथा|खंडकथा
खण्ड + -कथा a short tale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डकर्णः|खण्डकर्ण
खण्ड + -कर्णः<BR>—1 a kind of bulbous plant.<BR>—2 sweet potato.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

