खण्डजः|खण्डज|खंडज
खण्ड + -जः a kind of sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डतालः|खण्डताल
