खण्डपरशुः|खण्डपरशु|खंडपरशु
खण्ड + -परशुः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva; महंश्वर्यं लीलाजनितजगतः खण्डपरशोः<BR> G. L. 1; येनानेन जगत्सु खण्डपरशुर्देवो हरः ख्याप्यते Mv. 2. 33.<BR>—2 an epithet of Paraśurāma, son of Jamadagni.<BR>—3 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डपर्शुः|खण्डपर्शु|खंडपर्शु
खण्ड + -पर्शुः<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 of Paraśurāma.<BR>—3 of Rāhu.<BR>—4 an elephant with a broken tusk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डपालः|खण्डपाल|खंडपाल
खण्ड + -पालः a confectioner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

