खण्ड + -प्रलयः<BR>—1 a partial destruction of the universe in which all the spheres beneath<BR> Svarga are dissolved in one common ruin.<BR>—2 a quarrel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डफलम्
खण्ड + -फलम् canned fruit; Gaṇeśa P. 1. 147-57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डमण्डल|खंडमंडल
खण्ड + -मण्डल <i>a.</i> gibbous, not full or round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

