खण्डलम्
खण्डलः, -लम्<BR> A piece.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

