खण्डशस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 To pieces, into fragments; ˚कृ to cut into pieces.<BR>—2 Bit by bit, piece by piece, piece-meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डिकः|खण्डिक|खंडिकः
खण्डिकः [खण्ड्-अस्त्यर्थे ठन्]<BR>—1 A sugar-boiler.<BR>—2 Pease.<BR>—3 The armpit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डिका
खण्डिकः + .{@-का@}<BR>—1 The food of pease.<BR>—2 A kind of air or tune (in music).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: खण्डिकोपाध्यायः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डिकोपाध्यायः|खण्डिकोपाध्याय
खण्डिकः + -उपाध्यायः an angry teacher; खण्डिकोपाध्यायः शिष्याय चपेटिकां<BR> ददाति Mbh. on P. I. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डित|खंडित|खण्डितं
खण्डित <i>p. p.</i> [खण्ड्-क्त]<BR>—1 Cut, broken in pieces.<BR>—2 Destroyed, annihilated, lost, decayed; खण्डिते च वसुनि Bh. 3. 33.<BR>—3 Refuted (in argument), controverted.<BR>—4 Rebelled.<BR>—5 Disappointed, betrayed, abandoned; खण्डितयुवतिविलापम् Gīt. 8.<BR>—6 Disregarded (in order); मण्डले खण्डिताज्ञत्वं दिद्दायाः समजृम्भत<BR> Rāj. T. 6. 229.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डिता|खंडिता
खण्डित + .{@-ता@} A woman whose husband or lover has been guilty of infidelity,<BR> and who is therefore angry with him; one of the 8 principal Nāyikas in<BR> Sanskrit; निद्रावशेन भवताप्यनवेक्षमाणा पर्युत्सुकत्वमबला निशि<BR> खण्डितेव R. 5. 67; Me. 41. She is thus described:− पार्श्वमेति प्रियो<BR> यस्या अन्यसंभोगचिह्नितः । सा खण्डितेति कथिता धीरैरीर्ष्याकषायिता ॥ S. D. 114.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: खण्डितविग्रह, खण्डितवृत्त, खण्डितव्रत<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डितविग्रह|खंडितविग्रह
खण्डित + -विग्रह <i>a.</i> maimed, mutilated; खण्डितविग्रहं बलभिदो<BR> धनुरिह विविधाः पूरयितुं भवन्ति विभवः शिखरमणिरुचः Ki. 5. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डितवृत्त|खंडितवृत्त
खण्डित + -वृत्त <i>a.</i> immoral, dissolute, abandoned; Mk. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डितव्रत
खण्डित + -व्रत <i>a.</i> One who has violated his vow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डिन्|खंडिन्
खण्डिन् <i>a.</i> [खण्ड-इनि]<BR>—1 Consisting of parts, in pieces or parts.<BR>—2 Divided.<BR>—3 A kind of pulse; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डिनी|खंडिनी
खण्डिन् + .{@-नी@} The earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डीकृ|खंडीकृ
खण्डीकृ €8 U. To divide, tear to pieces, cut up; खण्डीकृता ज्येव<BR> मनोभवस्य R. 16. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्डीरः|खण्डीर
खण्डीरः A kind of yellow pulse (Mar. पिवळा मूग).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खण्ड्य|खंड्य
खण्ड्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be broken or divided, fragile.<BR>—2 Destructible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खतमालः|खतमाल
खतमालः<BR>—1 Smoke.<BR>—2 A cloud; खतमालस्तु पुंल्लिङ्गो धूमेऽपि जलवाहकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खद्
