खन्
खन् €1 U. (खनति-ते, खात; <i>pass.</i> खन्यते or खायते)<BR>—1 To dig up, delve, excavate; खनन्नाखुबिलं सिंहः Pt. 3. 17; Ms. 2. 218;<BR> Ṛs. 1. 17.<BR>—2 To dig into the earth, bury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

