खनित्रकम्
खनित्रकम्, -त्रिका<BR> A small shovel; Ks. 61. 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

