खर <i>a.</i> (opp. मृदु, श्लक्ष्ण, द्रव)<BR>—1 Hard, rough, solid.<BR>—2 Severe, sharp, strict, R. 8. 9; स्मरः खरः खलः कान्तः Kāv. 1. 59.<BR>—3 Pungent, acid.<BR>—4 Dense, thick.<BR>—5 Hurtful, injurious, cutting, smart (words).<BR>—6 Sharpedged; देहि खरनयनशरघातम् Gīt. 10.<BR>—7 Hot; खरांशुः &c.<BR>—8 Cruel; Rām. 6. 59. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खरः|खर|खरं
खर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 An ass, Ms. 2. 201, 4. 115, 120, 8. 370; Y. 2. 160.<BR>—2 A mule.<BR>—3 A heron.<BR>—4 A crow.<BR>—5 A kind of prickly nightshade.<BR>—6 A quadrangular mound of earth for receiving the sacrificial vessels.<BR>—7 A Daitya or demon in general<BR>—8 An attendant of<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Sūrya,<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Śiva.<BR>—9 N. of a demon, half-brother of Rāvaṇa and slain by Rāma; R. 12. 42.<BR>—10 N. of the 25th year of the sixty years cycle; खरो बालेयवर्षयोः Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खरम्
खर + .{@-रम्@} <i>ind.</i> In a sharp way; Rām. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: खरांशुः, खरकरः, खररश्मिः, खराब्दाङ्कुरकः, खरोष्ट्रम्, खरकण्डूयनम्, खरकुटी, खरकोणः, खरक्वाणः, खरकोमलः, खरगृहम्, खरगेहम्, खरचर्मा, खरणस्, खरणस, खरदण्डम्, खरदला, खरदूषणः, खरध्वंसिन्, खरनादः, खरनालः, खरपात्रम्, खरपादाढ्यः, खरपालः, खरप्रियः, खरयानम्, खरलोमन्, खरवृषभः, खरशब्दः, खरशाला, खरसारम्, खरस्पर्श, खरस्वरा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

