खलसंसर्गः|खलसंसर्ग
खलः + -संसर्गः keeping company with a wicked man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खलिन्
