खलूरिका(रकम्) A place for military exercise, a parlour,<BR> a reception hall, a drawing room round a house; Māna. XXXIV. 434-39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

