खुरः|खुर
खुरः [खुर्-क]<BR>—1 A hoof; रजःकणैः खुरोद्धूतैः R. 1. 85, 2. 2; Ms. 4. 67.<BR>—2 A kind of perfume.<BR>—3 A razor.<BR>—4 The foot of a bed-stead.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: खुराघातः, खुरक्षेपः, खुरणस्, खुरणस, खुरत्राणम्, खुरपदवी, खुरप्रः, खुरन्यासः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0640-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

