खोलकः<BR>—1 A helmet.<BR>—2 An ant-hill.<BR>—3 The shell of a betel-nut.<BR>—4 Sauce-pan, pot.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: खोलकशीर्षम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोलकशीर्षम्
खोलकः + -शीर्षम् a house with a roof decorated with arches.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

खोलिः|खोलि
खोलिः A quiver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्या
ख्या €2 P. (<i>m.</i> also in non-conjugational tenses) (ख्याति, ख्यात)<BR> To tell, declare, communicate with dat. of person. ━<i>Pass.</i> (ख्यायते)<BR>—1 To be named or called; आवयोः पितरं विद्धि ख्यातं दशरथं भुवि Bk. 6. 97.<BR>—2 To be known or famous. ━<i>Caus.</i> (ख्यापयति-ते)<BR>—1 To make<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-1" target="_blank">Page0641-1</a>]<BR> known, proclaim; ख्यापयेदभयानि च Ms. 7. 201.<BR>—2 To tell, declare, relate; परगुणकथनैः स्वान्गुणान्ख्यापयन्तः<BR> Bh. 2. 69; Ms. 11. 99.<BR>—3 To extol, make renowned, praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यात|ख्यातः
ख्यात <i>p. p.</i> [ख्या-क्त]<BR>—1 Known; ख्यातं नभःशब्दमयेन नाम्ना R. 18. 6.<BR>—2 Named, called.<BR>—3 Told.<BR>—4 Celebrated, famous, well-known.<BR>—5 Notorious; ख्यातः शक्रो भगाङ्गो विधुरपि मलिनो माधवो गोपजातः Udb.<BR>—6 Made known, betrayed, discovered; (ख्यापित <i>p. p.</i> <i>Caus.</i>) प्रमादालस्यजाड्यानि<BR> ख्यापितानि Pt. 1. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातम्
ख्यात + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Communication, mention.<BR>—2 Proclamation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ख्यातगर्हण<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातगर्हण|ख्यातगर्हणः
ख्यात + -गर्हण <i>a.</i> notoriously vile, infamous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातव्य
ख्यातव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be styled or called.<BR>—2 To be told.<BR>—3 To be celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातिः|ख्याति
ख्यातिः <i>f.</i> [ख्या-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Renown, fame, reputation, glory, celebrity; ख्यातियुक्तौ भविष्यतः<BR> Rām. 7. 66. 9; Ms. 12. 36;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-2" target="_blank">Page0641-2</a>]<BR> लोके ख्यातिमुपागतात्र सकले लोकोक्तिरेषा Pt. 1. 371.<BR>—2 A name, title, appellation.<BR>—3 Narration.<BR>—4 Praise.<BR>—5 (In phil.) Knowledge, the faculty of discriminating objects by appropriate<BR> designation; ख्यातिं च सत्त्वपुरुषान्यतयाधिगम्य Śi. 4. 55.<BR>—6 Praise.<BR>—7 Opinion, view, assertion; आन्वीक्षिकी कौशलानां विकल्पः ख्यातिवादिनाम्<BR> Bhāg. 11. 16. 24.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ख्यातिकर, ख्यातिजनक, ख्यातिबोधः, ख्यातिविरुद्धता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातिकर
ख्यातिः + -कर, -जनक <i>a.</i> glorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातिजनक
ख्यातिः + -कर, -जनक <i>a.</i> glorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातिबोधः|ख्यातिबोध
ख्यातिः + -बोधः sense of honour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यातिविरुद्धता
ख्यातिः + -विरुद्धता the state of being contradictory to general opinion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यापक
ख्यापक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Making known, declaring.<BR>—2 One who confesses.<BR>—3 Indicative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ख्यापनम्
ख्यापनम्<BR>—1 Declaring, divulging; जानता हि नरेन्द्रेण ख्यापनार्थं परस्य वै<BR> Mb. 5. 190. 22.<BR>—2 Confessing, avowing, publicly declaring; Ms. 11. 227.<BR>—3 Making renowned, celebrating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग|गं|गः
ग <i>a.</i> (Used only at the end of comp.) Who or what goes, going,<BR> moving, being, staying, remaining, having sexual intercourse with &c.;<BR> cf. Ms. 4. 120; Y. 3. 290; R. 3. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गः|ग|गं
ग + .{@-गः@}<BR>—1 A Gandharva.<BR>—2 An epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—3 A long syllable (used as an abbreviation of गुरु, in prosody).<BR>—4 Śiva.<BR>—5 Viṣṇu; cf. गः प्रीतो भवः श्रीपतिरुत्तमः Enm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गा
ग + .{@-गा, -गम्@} A song; गं वादित्रं शरणं वरम् । <i>ibid.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गम्
ग + .{@-गा, -गम्@} A song; गं वादित्रं शरणं वरम् । <i>ibid.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनम्
गगनम्(णम्) (Some suppose गगण to be an incorrect<BR> form, as is observed by a writer:− फाल्गुने गगने फेने णत्वमिच्छन्ति बर्बराः)<BR>—1 The sky, atmosphere; अवोचदेनं गगनस्पृशा रघुः स्वरेण R. 3. 43;<BR> गगनमिव नष्टतारम् Pt. 5. 6; सोऽयं सोमः पतति गगनात्<BR> Ś. 4. (v. l.); Śi. 9. 27.<BR>—2 (In math.) A cypher.<BR>—3 Firmament.<BR>—4 Heaven.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गगनाग्रम्, गगनाङ्गना, गगनाध्वगः, गगनाम्बु, गगनोल्मुकः, गगनकुसुमम्, गगनपुष्पम्, गगनगतिः, गगनचर, गगनध्वजः, गगनरोमन्थः, गगनलिह्, गगनविहारिन्, गगनसद्, गगनसिन्धुः, गगनस्थ, गगनस्थित, गगनस्पर्शनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगणम्
गगनम्(णम्) (Some suppose गगण to be an incorrect<BR> form, as is observed by a writer:− फाल्गुने गगने फेने णत्वमिच्छन्ति बर्बराः)<BR>—1 The sky, atmosphere; अवोचदेनं गगनस्पृशा रघुः स्वरेण R. 3. 43;<BR> गगनमिव नष्टतारम् Pt. 5. 6; सोऽयं सोमः पतति गगनात्<BR> Ś. 4. (v. l.); Śi. 9. 27.<BR>—2 (In math.) A cypher.<BR>—3 Firmament.<BR>—4 Heaven.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गगनाग्रम्, गगनाङ्गना, गगनाध्वगः, गगनाम्बु, गगनोल्मुकः, गगनकुसुमम्, गगनपुष्पम्, गगनगतिः, गगनचर, गगनध्वजः, गगनरोमन्थः, गगनलिह्, गगनविहारिन्, गगनसद्, गगनसिन्धुः, गगनस्थ, गगनस्थित, गगनस्पर्शनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनाग्रम्
गगनम् + -अग्रम् the highest heavens.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनाङ्गना|गगनांगना
गगनम् + -अङ्गना a heavenly nymph, an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनाध्वगः|गगनाध्वग
गगनम् + -अध्वगः<BR>—1 the sun.<BR>—2 a planet.<BR>—3 a celestial being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनाम्बु|गगनांबु
गगनम् + -अम्बु <i>n.</i> rain-water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनोल्मुकः|गगनोल्मुक
गगनम् + -उल्मुकः the planet Mars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनकुसुमम्
गगनम् + -कुसुमम्, -पुष्पम् ‘sky-flower’; <i>i. e.</i> any unreal thing, an<BR> impossibility; see खपुष्प.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनपुष्पम्
गगनम् + -कुसुमम्, -पुष्पम् ‘sky-flower’; <i>i. e.</i> any unreal thing, an<BR> impossibility; see खपुष्प.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनगतिः|गगनगति
गगनम् + -गतिः<BR>—1 a deity.<BR>—2 a celestial being; Me. 48.<BR>—3 a planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनचर|गगनचरः
गगनम् + -चर (also {@गगनेचर@}) <i>a.</i> moving in the air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनेचर|गगनेचरः
गगनम् + -चर (also {@गगनेचर@}) <i>a.</i> moving in the air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनचरः|गगनचर
गगनम् + -चर + ({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a bird.<BR>—2 a planet.<BR>—3 a heavenly spirit.<BR>—4 a lunar mansion.<BR>—5 the zodiac (राशिचक्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनध्वजः|गगनध्वज
गगनम् + -ध्वजः<BR>—1 the sun.<BR>—2 a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनरोमन्थः|गगनरोमन्थ
गगनम् + -रोमन्थः nonsense, absurdity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनलिह्
गगनम् + -लिह् <i>a.</i> reaching upto heaven; ततस्ततो गगनलिहश्च केतवः Śi. 17. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनविहारिन्
गगनम् + -विहारिन् <i>a.</i> moving or ranging in the sky; H. 1. 19; स हि<BR> गगनविहारी कल्मषध्वंसकारी Udb. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a luminary.<BR>—2 the sun.<BR>—3 a celestial being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनसद्
गगनम् + -सद् <i>a.</i> dwelling in the air. ━(<i>m.</i>) a celestial being;<BR> विस्मेरान्गगनसदः करोत्यमुष्मिन् Śi. 4. 53.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a2" target="_blank">Page0641-a2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनसिन्धुः|गगनसिन्धु|गगनसिंधु
गगनम् + -सिन्धुः <i>f.</i> an epithet of the Ganges; गगनसिन्धुफेनधवलान्तरस्य K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनस्थ
गगनम् + -स्थ, -स्थित <i>a.</i> situated in the sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनस्थित
गगनम् + -स्थ, -स्थित <i>a.</i> situated in the sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गगनस्पर्शनः|गगनस्पर्शन
गगनम् + -स्पर्शनः<BR>—1 air, wind.<BR>—2 N. of one of the eight Maruts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गग्घ्
गग्घ् €1 P. To laugh, deride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गा|गंगा
गङ्गा [गम्-गन्; Uṇ. 1. 120]<BR>—1 The river Ganges, the most sacred river in India; अधोधो गङ्गेयं<BR> पदमुपगता स्तोकमथवा Bh. 2. 10; R. 2. 26, 13. 57; (mentioned in Rv. 10. 75. 5,<BR> along with other rivers considered sacred in India).<BR>—2 The Ganges personified as a goddess. [Gaṅgā is the eldest daughter<BR> of Himavat. It is said that a curse of Brahmā made her come down upon<BR> earth, where she became the first wife of King Śantanu. She bore him<BR> eight sons, of whom Bhīṣma, the youngest, became a well-known personage,<BR> renowned for his valour and life-long celibacy. According to another account<BR> she came down on earth being propitiated by Bhagīratha; see भगीरथ<BR> and जह्नु also; and cf. Bh. 2. 10]. इमं मे गङ्गे यमुने सरस्वति<BR> Mahānār. Up. 5. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गङ्गाम्बु, गङ्गाम्भस्, गङ्गावतारः, गङ्गाष्टकम्, गङ्गोद्भेदः, गङ्गाक्षेत्रम्, गङ्गाचिल्ली, गङ्गाजः, गङ्गासुतः, गङ्गाजलम्, गङ्गादत्तः, गङ्गाद्वारम्, गङ्गाधरः, गङ्गापुत्रः, गङ्गाभृत्, गङ्गामध्यम्, गङ्गायात्रा, गङ्गालहरी, गङ्गासप्तमी, गङ्गासागरः, गङ्गासुप्तः, गङ्गाह्रदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाम्बु|गंगांबु
गङ्गा + -अम्बु, -अम्भस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 water of the Ganges.<BR>—2 pure rain-water (such as falls in the month of आश्विन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गाम्भस्|गंगांभस्
गङ्गा + -अम्बु, -अम्भस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 water of the Ganges.<BR>—2 pure rain-water (such as falls in the month of आश्विन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गङ्गावतारः|गङ्गावतार
गङ्गा + -अवतारः<BR>—1 the descent of the Ganges on the earth; भगीरथ इव दृष्टगङ्गावतारः<BR> K. 32 (where गङ्गा˚ also means ‘descent into the Ganges’ for ablution).<BR>—2 N. of a sacred place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0641-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

