गडुः|गडु
गडु + .{@-डुः@}<BR>—1 A hump on the back.<BR>—2 A javelin.<BR>—3 A water-pot.<BR>—4 An earth-worm.<BR>—5 Any superfluous excrescence or addition, a useless object; see अन्तर्गडु.<BR>—6 A goitre, excrescence on the neck.<BR>—7 A hump-backed person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0643-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

