गड्डरिका
गड्डरिका [गड्डरं मेषमनुधावति ठन्]<BR>—1 A line of sheep.<BR>—2 A continuous line, stream, current; ˚प्रवाहः a stream of sheep,<BR> used to signify ‘blindly following other people like a flock of sheep’;<BR> cf. इति गड्डरिकाप्रवाहेनैषां भेदः K. P. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0643-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

