गणाचलः|गणाचल
गणः + -अचलः N. of the mountain Kailāsa, as the residence of the Gaṇas of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0643-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणाधिपः|गणाधिप
गणः + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः<BR>—1 N. of Śiva; Śi. 9. 27.<BR>—2 N. of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—3 the chief of a troop of soldiers or of a class of disciples, of a body<BR> of men or animals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0643-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणाधिपतिः|गणाधिपति
गणः + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः<BR>—1 N. of Śiva; Śi. 9. 27.<BR>—2 N. of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—3 the chief of a troop of soldiers or of a class of disciples, of a body<BR> of men or animals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0643-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणान्नम्
गणः + -अन्नम् a mess, food prepared for number of persons in common;<BR> Ms. 4. 209, 219.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0643-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

