गणः + -अभ्यन्तर <i>a.</i> one of a troop or number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0643-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

