गणोत्साहः|गणोत्साह
गणः + -उत्साहः the rhinoceros.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणकारः|गणकार
गणः + -कारः<BR>—1 a classifier.<BR>—2 an epithet of Bhīmasena.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणकृत्वस्
गणः + -कृत्वस् <i>ind.</i> for a whole series of times, for a number of times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणगतिः|गणगति
गणः + -गतिः a particular high number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

