गणः + -चक्रकम् a dinner eaten in common by a party of virtuous men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणच्छन्दस्|गणच्छंदस्
