गणधरः|गणधर
गणः + -धरः<BR>—1 the head of a class or number.<BR>—2 the teacher of a school.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणनाथः|गणनाथ
गणः + -नाथः, -नायकः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—3 the leader of the attendants of any god; Bhāg. 5. 17. 13.<BR>—4 the head of an assemblage or corporation; Bṛ. S. 15. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणनायकः|गणनायक
गणः + -नाथः, -नायकः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—3 the leader of the attendants of any god; Bhāg. 5. 17. 13.<BR>—4 the head of an assemblage or corporation; Bṛ. S. 15. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणनायिका
गणः + -नायिका an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणपः|गणप
गणः + -पः, -पतिः<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 N. of Gaṇeśa. [He is the son of Śiva and Pārvatī, or of Pārvatī<BR> only; for according to one legend, he sprang from the scurf of her body.<BR> He is the god of wisdom and remover of obstacles; hence he is invoked<BR> and worshipped at the commencement of every important undertaking. He is<BR> usually represented in a sitting posture, short and fat, with a protuberant<BR> belly, and four bands; riding a mouse; and with the head of an elephant.<BR> This head has only one tusk, the other having been lost in a scuffle between<BR> him and Paraśurāma when he opposed the latterʼs entrance to Śivaʼs<BR> inner apartments; (whence he is called Ekadanta, Ekadaṃṣṭra &c.). There<BR> are several legends accounting for his elephant head. It is said that<BR> he wrote the Mahābhārata at the dictation of Vyāsa who secured his services<BR> as a scribe from the god Brahman].<BR>—3 also an epithet of Bṛhaspati and Indra.<BR>—4 the leader of a class or troop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणपतिः|गणपति
गणः + -पः, -पतिः<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 N. of Gaṇeśa. [He is the son of Śiva and Pārvatī, or of Pārvatī<BR> only; for according to one legend, he sprang from the scurf of her body.<BR> He is the god of wisdom and remover of obstacles; hence he is invoked<BR> and worshipped at the commencement of every important undertaking. He is<BR> usually represented in a sitting posture, short and fat, with a protuberant<BR> belly, and four bands; riding a mouse; and with the head of an elephant.<BR> This head has only one tusk, the other having been lost in a scuffle between<BR> him and Paraśurāma when he opposed the latterʼs entrance to Śivaʼs<BR> inner apartments; (whence he is called Ekadanta, Ekadaṃṣṭra &c.). There<BR> are several legends accounting for his elephant head. It is said that<BR> he wrote the Mahābhārata at the dictation of Vyāsa who secured his services<BR> as a scribe from the god Brahman].<BR>—3 also an epithet of Bṛhaspati and Indra.<BR>—4 the leader of a class or troop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणपर्वत|गणपर्व्वत|गणपर्व्वतः
गणः + -पर्वत see गणाचल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणपाठः|गणपाठ
गणः + -पाठः a collection of gaṇas or series of words falling under<BR> the same grammatical rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणपीठकम्
गणः + -पीठकम् the breast, bosom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणपुङ्गवः|गणपुङ्गव
गणः + -पुङ्गवः the head of a tribe or class. (pl.) N. of a country<BR> and its people; Bṛ. S. 4. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणपूर्वः|गणपूर्व
गणः + -पूर्वः the leader of a tribe or class; (ग्रामणी); Mb. 13. 23. 20.<BR> ˚तापनी N. of a Upaniṣad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणभर्तृ|गणभर्त्तृ
गणः + -भर्तृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva; गणभर्तृरुक्षा Ki. 5. 42.<BR>—2 N. of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—3 the leader of a class.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणभोजनम्
गणः + -भोजनम् mess, eating in common.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणयज्ञः|गणयज्ञ
गणः + -यज्ञः a rite common to all.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणरत्नमहोदधिः|गणरत्नमहोदधि
गणः + -रत्नमहोदधिः a collection of grammatical gaṇas by Vardhamāna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणराज्यम्
गणः + -राज्यम् N. of an empire in the Deccan; Bṛ. S. 14. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणरात्रम्
गणः + -रात्रम् a series of nights.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणवल्लभः
गणः + -वल्लभः a general of the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">Page0644-2</a>]<BR> army (सेनानायक); Rām. 2. 81. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणवृत्तम्
गणः + -वृत्तम् see गणच्छन्दस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणहासः|गणहास
गणः + -हासः, -हासकः a species of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणहासकः|गणहासक
गणः + -हासः, -हासकः a species of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणक|गणकः
गणक <i>a.</i> [गण्-ण्वुल्]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणिका
गणक + .({@-णिका@}) <i>f.</i> Bought for a large sum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणकः|गणक
गणक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 An arithmetician.<BR>—2 An astrologer; Vāj. 30. 20; रे पान्थ पुस्तकधर क्षणमत्र तिष्ठ<BR> वैद्योसि किं गणकशास्त्रविशारदोसि । केनौषधेन मम पश्यति भर्तुरम्बा<BR> किं वा गमिष्यति पतिः सुचिरप्रवासी ॥ Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 An assemblage of eight stars; तारापुञ्जनिकाशा गणका नाम प्रजापतेरष्टौ<BR> Bṛ. S. 11. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणकी
गणक + .{@-की@} The wife of an astrologer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणता
गणता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Forming a class or multitude, belonging to a party or faction.<BR>—2 A cabal.<BR>—3 Collusion.<BR>—4 Classification.<BR>—5 Arithmetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणत्वम्
गणता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Forming a class or multitude, belonging to a party or faction.<BR>—2 A cabal.<BR>—3 Collusion.<BR>—4 Classification.<BR>—5 Arithmetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणनम्
गणनम् [गण्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Counting, calculation.<BR>—2 Adding, enumerating.<BR>—3 Considering, supposing, regarding.<BR>—4 Believing, thinking.<BR>—5 Account.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणना
गणनम् + .{@-ना@} Calculation, consideration, regard, account; का वा गणना<BR> सचेतनेषु अपगतचेतनान्यपि संघट्टयितुमलम् (मदनः) K. 157<BR> (what need we say of &c.; cf. कथा.); तन्त्रिणां वा तृणानां वा राजन्का<BR> गणना रणे Rāj. T. 5. 309; Me. 10, 89; R. 11. 66; Śi. 16. 59; Amaru. 67.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गणनगतिः, गणनपतिः, गणनपत्रिका, गणनमहामात्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणनगतिः
गणनम् + -गतिः <i>f.</i> = गणगति q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणनपतिः
गणनम् + -पतिः<BR>—1 an arithmetician,<BR>—2 an epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणनपत्रिका
गणनम् + -पत्रिका reckoning book; Rāj. T. 6. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणनमहामात्रः
गणनम् + -महामात्रः a minister of finance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणनीय|गणनीयं
गणनीय <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 Calculable, to be counted or reckoned.<BR>—2 To be classed.<BR>—3 Numerable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणशस्
गणशस् <i>ind.</i> In troops or flocks, by classes; यान्येतानि देवजातानि<BR> गणश आख्यायन्ते Bṛ. Up. 1. 4. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणिः|गणि
गणिः <i>f.</i> [गण्-इन्] Counting. ━<i>m.</i> One who is well-versed<BR> in the sacred writings and the auxiliary sciences; Jain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणिका
गणिका [गणः समूहोऽस्त्यस्याः भर्तृत्वेन गण्-ठञ्]<BR>—1 A harlot, courtezan; गुणानुरक्ता गणिका च यस्य वसन्तशोभेव वसन्तसेना<BR> Mk. 1. 6; गणिका नाम पादुकान्तरप्रविष्टेव लेष्टुका दुःखेन पुनर्निराक्रियते<BR> Mk. 5; निरकाशयद्रविमपेतवसुं वियदालयादपरदिग्गाणिका Śi. 9. 10.<BR>—2 A female elephant; कच्चिन्न गणिकाश्वानां कुञ्जराणां च तृप्यसि<BR> Rām. 2. 100. 50.<BR>—3 A kind of flower.<BR>—4 A kind of jasmine.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गणिकान्नम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणिकान्नम्
गणिका + -अन्नम् food coming from a courtezan; गणान्नं गणिकान्नं च<BR> जुगुप्सितम् Ms. 4. 209, 219; Y. 1. 160-61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणिकारिका
गणिकारिका, गणेरुका N. of a plant (Mar. नरवेल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणेरुका
गणिकारिका, गणेरुका N. of a plant (Mar. नरवेल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणित|गणितं
गणित <i>p. p.</i> [गण्-क्त]<BR>—1 Counted, numbered, calculated.<BR>—2 Regarded, cared for &c.; see गण्.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गणितदिवसक, गणिततम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणितदिवसक
गणित + -दिवसक <i>a.</i> Consisting of a definite number of days; विचाली<BR> हि संवत्सरशब्दः सावनोऽपि गणितदिवसकः ŚB. on MS. 6. 7. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणिततम्
गणित + -तम्<BR>—1 Reckoning, calculating.<BR>—2 The science of computation, mathematics; (it comprises पाटीगणित<BR> or व्यक्तगणित ‘arithmetic’, बीजगणित, ‘algebra’, and रेखागणित<BR> ‘geometry’); गणितमथ कलां वैशिकीं हस्तिशिक्षां ज्ञात्वा Mk. 1. 4.<BR>—3 The sum of a progression.<BR>—4 A sum (in general).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">Page0645-1</a>]<BR>—5 Study, practice; वेत्तुमर्हसि राजेन्द्र स्वाध्यायगणितं महत् Mb. 12. 62. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0644-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणितिन्
गणितिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 One who has made a calculation.<BR>—2 A mathematician.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणिन्
गणिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) Having a flock or troop (of anything);<BR> श्वगणिन् ‘having a pack of hounds’; R. 9. 53. ━<i>m.</i> A teacher (having<BR> a class of pupils).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणीभूत
गणीभूत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Included in any group or class.<BR>—2 Calculated, counted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणेय|गणेयः
गणेय <i>a.</i> Numerable, what may be counted; गणेयनिःशेषगुणोऽपि<BR> स स्यात् N. 3. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्य|गण्यं
गण्य <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 Calculable, to be counted.<BR>—2 (At the end of comp.) Belonging to a multitude or class or troop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्यमानम्
गण्यमानम् The comparative height of the component members of an<BR> architectural structure. In the sculptural measurement the similar height<BR> is called the तालमान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणेरुः|गणेरु
गणेरुः The Karṇikāra tree. ━<i>f.</i><BR>—1 A harlot.<BR>—2 A female elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गणेरुका
गणेरुका<BR>—1 A bawd, procuress.<BR>—2 A female servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्ड्|गंड्
गण्ड् €1 P. To be rough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डः|गण्ड|गंड|गंडः
गण्डः<BR>—1 The cheek, the whole side of the face including the temples; गण्डाभोगे<BR> पुलकपटलम् Māl. 2. 5; तदीषदार्द्रारुणगण्डलेखम् Ku. 7. 82;<BR> Me. 26, 93; Amaru. 83; Ṛs. 4. 6, 6. 10; Ś. 6. 18; Śi. 12. 54.<BR>—2 An elephantʼs temple; गण्डोड्डीनालिमाला˚ Māl. 1. 1.<BR>—3 A bubble.<BR>—4 A boil, tumour, swelling, pimple; अयमपरो गण्डस्योपरि विस्फोटः<BR> Mu. 5; तदा गण्डस्योपरि पिटिका संवृत्ता Ś. 2.<BR>—5 Goitre and other excrescences of the neck.<BR>—6 A joint, knot.<BR>—7 A mark, spot; गण्डोज्ज्वलामुज्ज्वलनाभिचक्रया Śi. 12. 8.<BR>—8 A rhinoceros.<BR>—9 The bladder.<BR>—10 A hero, warrior.<BR>—11 Part of a horseʼs trappings, a stud or button fixed as an ornament<BR> upon the harness.<BR>—12 An unexpected combination of words consisting in putting one speech<BR> immediately after another, so as to be syntactically connected; see वीथि;<BR> <i>e. g.</i> राक्षसः-अपि नाम दुरात्मा चाणक्यवटुः । दौवारिकः-जयतु ।<BR> -रा˚ -अतिसंधातुं शक्यः स्यात् । -दौ˚ -अमात्यः । Mu. 4; so किमस्या<BR> न प्रेयो यदि पुनरसह्यस्तु विरहः. -दौ˚ -देव उपस्थितः U. 1<BR>—13 The tenth yoga or one of the twenty-seven portions of a circle on<BR> the plane of the ecliptic.<BR>—14 An astronomical period.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गण्डाङ्गः, गण्डोपधानम्, गण्डकुसुमम्, गण्डकूपः, गण्डग्रामः, गण्डदेशः, गण्डप्रदेशः, गण्डस्थलम्, गण्डपाली, गण्डपिण्डः, गण्डफलकम्, गण्डभित्तिः, गण्डभेदः, गण्डमालः, गण्डमाला, गण्डमूर्ख, गण्डशिला, गण्डशौलः, गण्डसाह्वया, गण्डस्थलम्, गण्डस्थली<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डाङ्गः|गण्डाङ्ग|गंडांग
गण्डः + -अङ्गः a rhinoceros.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डोपधानम्
गण्डः + -उपधानम् a pillow; मृदुगण्डोपधानानि शयनानि सुखानि च Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डकुसुमम्
गण्डः + -कुसुमम् the juice that exudes from the elephantʼs temples during rut, ichor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डकूपः|गण्डकूप|गंडकूप
गण्डः + -कूपः<BR>—1 a well on the peak or summit of a mountain.<BR>—2 Upper region or table-land of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डग्रामः|गण्डग्राम|गंडग्राम
गण्डः + -ग्रामः any large or considerable village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डदेशः|गण्डदेश|गंडदेश
गण्डः + -देशः, -प्रदेशः, -स्थलम्, -पाली, -पिण्डः<BR>—1 the cheek, the temples of an elephant.<BR>—2 temple-region (in general);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">Page0645-2</a>]<BR> कण्डूलद्विपगण्डपिण्डकषणम् U. 2. 9; Māl. 9. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

