गण्डः + -देशः, -प्रदेशः, -स्थलम्, -पाली, -पिण्डः<BR>—1 the cheek, the temples of an elephant.<BR>—2 temple-region (in general);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">Page0645-2</a>]<BR> कण्डूलद्विपगण्डपिण्डकषणम् U. 2. 9; Māl. 9. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डस्थलम्
गण्डः + -देशः, -प्रदेशः, -स्थलम्, -पाली, -पिण्डः<BR>—1 the cheek, the temples of an elephant.<BR>—2 temple-region (in general);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">Page0645-2</a>]<BR> कण्डूलद्विपगण्डपिण्डकषणम् U. 2. 9; Māl. 9. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डपाली
गण्डः + -देशः, -प्रदेशः, -स्थलम्, -पाली, -पिण्डः<BR>—1 the cheek, the temples of an elephant.<BR>—2 temple-region (in general);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">Page0645-2</a>]<BR> कण्डूलद्विपगण्डपिण्डकषणम् U. 2. 9; Māl. 9. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डपिण्डः
गण्डः + -देशः, -प्रदेशः, -स्थलम्, -पाली, -पिण्डः<BR>—1 the cheek, the temples of an elephant.<BR>—2 temple-region (in general);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">Page0645-2</a>]<BR> कण्डूलद्विपगण्डपिण्डकषणम् U. 2. 9; Māl. 9. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डफलकम्
गण्डः + -फलकम् a broad cheek; धृतमुग्धगण्डफलकैर्विबभुर्विकसद्भिरास्यकमलैः<BR> प्रमदाः Śi. 9. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डभित्तिः|गण्डभित्ति|गंडभित्ति
गण्डः + -भित्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 the opening in the temples of an elephant from which ichor exudes during rut.<BR>—2 ‘a wall-like cheek’, an excellent <i>i. e.</i> broad and expansive cheek;<BR> निर्धौतदानामलगण्डभित्तिः (गजः) R. 5. 43 (where Malli. says<BR> प्रशस्तौ गण्डौ गण्डभित्ति, see <i>et seq.</i>); 12. 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डभेदः
गण्डः + -भेदः a thief; गण्डभेददास्याः शीलं जानन्नापि आत्मनो भोजनविस्रम्भेण<BR> छलितोऽस्मि Avimāraka 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डमालः|गण्डमाल|गंडमाल
गण्डः + -मालः, -माला inflammation of the glands of the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डमाला|गंडमाला
गण्डः + -मालः, -माला inflammation of the glands of the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डमूर्ख|गंडमूर्ख
गण्डः + -मूर्ख <i>a.</i> exceedingly foolish, very stupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डशिला|गंडशिला
गण्डः + -शिला any large rock; दृष्टोऽङ्गुष्ठशिरोमात्रः क्षणाद्गण्डशिलासमः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 13. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डशौलः
गण्डः + -शौलः<BR>—1 a huge rock thrown down by an earthquake or storm; Ki. 7. 37; cf. also<BR> गण्डशैलैः कारवेल्लैर्लोहकण्टकवेष्टितैः । (अचलः परिपूर्णोऽयम् …)<BR> Parṇāl. 4. 75.<BR>—2 the forehead; गण्डशैलः कपोले च द्रोणपाषाणभेदयोः । Nm.; किं<BR> पुत्रि गण्डशैलभ्रमेण नवनीरदेषु निद्रासि । Āryā. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डसाह्वया|गंडसाह्वया
गण्डः + -साह्वया N. of a river, also called गण्डकी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डस्थलम्
गण्डः + -स्थलम्, -स्थली<BR>—1 the cheek; गण्डस्थलेषु मदवारिषु Pt. 1. 123; Ś. Til. 7; गण्डस्थलीः<BR> प्रोषितपत्रलेखाः R. 6. 72; Amaru. 82.<BR>—2 temples of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डस्थली|गंडस्थली
