गण्डकः|गण्डक|गंडक|गंडकः
गण्डकः [गण्ड स्वार्थे क]<BR>—1 A rhinoceros.<BR>—2 An impediment, obstacle.<BR>—3 A joint, knot.<BR>—4 A mark, spot.<BR>—5 A boil, tumour, pimple.<BR>—6 Disjunction, separation.<BR>—7 A coin of the value of four cowries.<BR>—8 A mode of reckoning by fours.<BR>—9 Astrological science.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गण्डकवती<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

