गण्डका
गण्डका A lump, a ball.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डकी
