गण्डूषः, -षा<BR>—1 A mouthful, handful (of water); गजाय गण्डूषजलं करेणुः (ददौ)<BR> Ku. 3. 37; U. 3. 16; Māl. 9. 34; गण्डूषजलमात्रेण शफरी फर्फरायते Udb.<BR>—2 The tip of an elephantʼs trunk; Mātaṅga L.<BR>—3 A mouthful,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">Page0646-1</a>]<BR> handful in general.<BR>—4 A kind of liquor (मद्य); पलाण्डुगण्डूषयुतान् खादन्ती चैडकान्बहून Mb. 8. 44. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डूषा
गण्डूषः, -षा<BR>—1 A mouthful, handful (of water); गजाय गण्डूषजलं करेणुः (ददौ)<BR> Ku. 3. 37; U. 3. 16; Māl. 9. 34; गण्डूषजलमात्रेण शफरी फर्फरायते Udb.<BR>—2 The tip of an elephantʼs trunk; Mātaṅga L.<BR>—3 A mouthful,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">Page0646-1</a>]<BR> handful in general.<BR>—4 A kind of liquor (मद्य); पलाण्डुगण्डूषयुतान् खादन्ती चैडकान्बहून Mb. 8. 44. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डूषीकृ
गण्डूषः, -षा + .{@-गण्डूषीकृ@} To swallow in one draught; तस्य जह्नुः सुतो गङ्गां<BR> गण्डूषीकृत्य योऽपिबत् Bhāg. 9. 15. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गण्डोलः|गण्डोल|गंडोल|गंडोलः
गण्डोलः<BR>—1 Raw sugar.<BR>—2 A mouthful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गत|गतं
गत, गति, &c. see under गम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गति|गतिः
गत, गति, &c. see under गम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्
गद् I. €1 P. (गदति, गदित)<BR>—1 To speak articulately, speak, say, relate; जगादाग्रे गदाग्रजम्<BR> Śi. 2. 69; बहु जगद पुरस्तात्तस्य मत्ता किलाहम् 11. 39; शुद्धान्तरक्ष्या<BR> जगदे कुमारी R. 6. 45.<BR>—2 To enumerate. ━II. €10 U. (गदयति-ते &c.) To thunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदः|गद|गदं
गदः [गद्-अच्]<BR>—1 Speaking, speech.<BR>—2 A sentence.<BR>—3 Disease, sickness; असाध्यः कुरुते कोपं प्राप्ते काले गदो यथा Śi. 2. 84;<BR> जनपदे न गदः पदमादधौ R. 9. 4, 17. 81.<BR>—4 Thunder.<BR>—5 The younger brother of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—6 N. of Kubera.<BR>—7 A weapon. … गदोऽस्त्रियाम् । आयुधे धनदे रोगे पुंसि कृष्णानुजेऽपि च Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदम्
गदः + .{@-दम्@} A kind of poison.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गदागदौ, गदाग्रजः, गदाग्रणीः, गदाम्बरः, गदारातिः, गदगदम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदागदौ
गदः + -अगदौ (du.) the two Aṣvins, physicians of gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदाग्रजः|गदाग्रज
गदः + -अग्रजः an epithet of Kṛṣṇa; जगादाग्रे गदाग्रजम् । Śi. 2. 69;<BR> यावद्गदाग्रजकथासु रतिं न कुर्यात् । Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदाग्रणीः
गदः + -अग्रणीः the chief of all diseases. <i>i. e.</i> consumption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदाम्बरः|गदाम्बर|गदांबर
गदः + -अम्बरः a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदारातिः|गदाराति
गदः + -अरातिः a drug, medicament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदगदम्
गदः + -गदम् indistinct utterance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदयित्नु|गदयित्नुः
गदयित्नु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Loquacious, garrulous, talkative.<BR>—2 Libidinous, lustful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदयित्नुः|गदयित्नु
गदयित्नु + .{@-त्नुः@} N. of Kāma, the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदा
गदा [गद्-अच् टाप्] A mace, club; संचूर्णयामि गदया न सुयोधनोरू Ve. 1. 15.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गदाग्रपाणि, गदाधरः, गदाभृत्, गदायुद्धम्, गदाहस्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदाग्रपाणि
गदा + -अग्रपाणि <i>a.</i> having a mace in the right hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदाधरः|गदाधर
गदा + -धरः an epithet of Viṣṇu; Bhāg. 1. 8. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदाभृत्
गदा + -भृत् <i>a.</i> a club-bearer, one who fights with a mace. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदायुद्धम्
गदा + -युद्धम् a fight with clubs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदाहस्त
गदा + -हस्त <i>a.</i> armed with a club.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदिः|गदि
गदिः <i>f.</i> Speaking, speech; एवं गदिः कर्मगतिर्विसर्गः<BR> Bhāg. II. 12. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदितः|गदित
गदितः <i>p. p.</i> [गद्-क्त] Spoken, said, related; गदितस्तेन<BR> सिंहेन स ययौ यमुनातटम् Ks. 60. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदिन्
गदिन् <i>a.</i> (नी <i>f.</i>) [गद-इनि]<BR>—1 Armed with a club; किरीटिनं गदिनं चक्रिणं च Bg. 11. 17.<BR>—2 Affected with sickness, diseased. ━<i>m.</i> [गदा अस्त्यस्य इनि] An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गदिसिंहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गदिसिंहः|गदिसिंह
गदिन् + गदिसिंहः N. of a grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गद|गद्गदः
गद्गद <i>a.</i> Stammering, stuttering, faltering; तत्किं रोदिषि<BR> गद्गदेन वचसा Amaru. 57; गद्गदगलत्त्र्युट्यद्विलीनाक्षरं को देहीति<BR> वदेत् Bh. 3. 8; सानन्दगद्गदपदं हरिरित्युवाच Gīt. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गदम्
गद्गद + .{@-दम्@} <i>ind.</i> In a faltering or stammering tone; विललाप स<BR> बाष्पगद्गदम् R. 8. 43; ˚नदत् U. 2. 30 producing a gurgling sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गदः|गद्गद
गद्गद + .{@-दः, -दम्@}<BR>—1 Stammering.<BR>—2 Indistinct or convulsive speech; सगद्गदं भीतभीतः प्रणम्य Bg. 11. 35.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गद्गदध्वानिः, गद्गदपदम्, गद्गदवाच्, गद्गदस्वर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गदम्
गद्गद + .{@-दः, -दम्@}<BR>—1 Stammering.<BR>—2 Indistinct or convulsive speech; सगद्गदं भीतभीतः प्रणम्य Bg. 11. 35.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गद्गदध्वानिः, गद्गदपदम्, गद्गदवाच्, गद्गदस्वर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गदध्वानिः
गद्गद + -ध्वानिः a low, inarticulate sound expressive of joy or grief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गदपदम्
गद्गद + -पदम् inarticulate speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गदवाच्
गद्गद + -वाच् <i>f.</i> inarticulate or convulsive speech, interrupted<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">Page0646-2</a>]<BR> by sobbing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गदस्वर|गद्गदस्वरः
गद्गद + -स्वर <i>a.</i> uttering stammering sounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गदस्वरः|गद्गदस्वर
गद्गद + -स्वर + ({@-रः@})<BR>—1 indistinct or stammering utterance.<BR>—2 a buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गदित
गद्गदित <i>a.</i> Stammered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्गदयति
गद्गदयति Den. P. To stammer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्य|गद्यं
गद्य <i>pot. p.</i> [गद्-यत्] To be spoken or uttered; गद्यमेतत्त्वया<BR> मम Bk. 6. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्यम्
गद्य + .{@-द्यम्@} Prose, elaborate prose composition, composition not metrical<BR> yet framed with due regard to harmony; one of the three classes into which<BR> all compositions may be divided; see Kāv. 1. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्याणकः|गद्याणक
गद्याण(न, ल)कः A weight equal to 48 <i>Guñjās</i>; cf. Y. 3. 258 com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्यानकः|गद्यानक|गद्यानकं
गद्याण(न, ल)कः A weight equal to 48 <i>Guñjās</i>; cf. Y. 3. 258 com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गद्यालकः|गद्यालक
गद्याण(न, ल)कः A weight equal to 48 <i>Guñjās</i>; cf. Y. 3. 258 com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गध्
गध् €4 P. (गध्यति) To be mixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गध्य
गध्य <i>a.</i> Ved. To be seized (as booty); ऋज्रा वाजं न गध्यं<BR> युयूषन् Rv. 4. 16. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्ध्|गंध्
गन्ध् €10 Ā. (गन्धयते)<BR>—1 To injure, hurt.<BR>—2 To ask, beg.<BR>—3 To move, go.<BR>—4 To adorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धः|गन्ध|गंध|गन्धं|गंधः
गन्धः [गन्ध्-पचाद्यच्]<BR>—1 Smell, odour; गन्धमाघ्राय चोर्व्याः Me. 21; अपघ्नन्तो दुरितं<BR> हव्यगन्धैः Ś. 4. 8; R. 12. 27. (गन्ध is changed to गन्धि when<BR> as the last member of a Bah. comp. it is preceded by उद्, पूति, सु, सुरभि,<BR> or when the compound implies comparison; सुगन्धि, सुरभिगन्धि, कमलगन्धि<BR> मुखम्; शालिनिर्यासगन्धिभिः R. 1. 38; आहुति˚ 1. 53; also when गन्ध<BR> is used in the sense of ‘a little’).<BR>—2 Smell considered as one of the 24 properties or guṇas of the Vaiśeṣikas;<BR> it is a property characteristic of पृथिवी or earth which is defined<BR> as गन्धवती पृथ्वी T. S.<BR>—3 The mere smell of anything, a little, a very small quantity; घृतगन्धि भोजनम् Sk.<BR>—4 A perfume, any fragrant substance; एषा मया सेविता गन्धयुक्तिः<BR> Mk. 8; Y. 1. 231; Mu. 1. 4.<BR>—5 Sulphur.<BR>—6 Pounded sandalwood.<BR>—7 Connection, relationship.<BR>—8 A neighbour.<BR>—9 Pride, arrogance; as in आत्तगन्ध humbled or mortified.<BR>—10 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—11 A sectarial mark on the forehead.<BR>—12 Similarity (सादृश्य); डुण्डुभानहिगन्धेन न त्वं हिंसितुमर्हसि Mb. 1. 10. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धम्
गन्धः + .{@-न्धम्@}<BR>—1 Smell.<BR>—2 Black aloe-wood.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गन्धाधिकम्, गन्धापकर्षणम्, गन्धाम्बु, गन्धाम्ला, गन्धाश्मन्, गन्धाष्टकम्, गन्धाखुः, गन्धाजीवः, गन्धाढ्य, गन्धेन्द्रियम्, गन्धेभः, गन्धगजः, गन्धद्विपः, गन्धहस्तिन्, गन्धोत्तमा, गन्धोदम्, गन्धोपजीविन्, गन्धौतुः, गन्धकारिका, गन्धकालिका, गन्धकाली, गन्धकाष्ठम्, गन्धकुटी, गन्धकेलिका, गन्धचेलिका, गन्धग, गन्धगजः, गन्धगुण, गन्धघ्राणम्, गन्धचरा, गन्धजलम्, गन्धज्ञा, गन्धतूर्यम्, गन्धतैलम्, गन्धदारु, गन्धद्रव्यम्, गन्धद्वार, गन्धधारिन्, गन्धधूलिः, गन्धनकुलः, गन्धनालिका, गन्धनाली, गन्धनिलया, गन्धपः, गन्धपत्रा, गन्धपलाशी, गन्धपलाशिका, गन्धपालिन्, गन्धपाषाणः, गन्धपिशाचिका, गन्धपुष्पः, गन्धपुष्पा, गन्धपूतना, गन्धफली, गन्धबन्धुः, गन्धमातृ, गन्धमादन, गन्धमादनी, गन्धमादिनी, गन्धमार्जारः, गन्धमुखा, गन्धमूषिकः, गन्धमूषी, गन्धमृगः, गन्धमैथुनः, गन्धमोदनः, गन्धमोहिनी, गन्धयुक्तिः, गन्धरसः, गन्धराजः, गन्धलता, गन्धलोलुपा, गन्धवहः, गन्धवहा, गन्धवाहः, गन्धवाही, गन्धविह्वलः, गन्धवृक्षकः, गन्धवृक्षः, गन्धव्याकुलम्, गन्धशुण्डिनी, गन्धशेखरः, गन्धसारः, गन्धसुखी, गन्धसूयी, गन्धसोमम्, गन्धहस्तिन्, गन्धहारिका<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

