गन्धकः + -पेषिका <i>f.</i> a^1 female servant who grinds or prepares perfumes.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by . Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/6b5cd78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धनम्
गन्धनम् [गन्ध्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Continued effort, perseverance.<BR>—2 Hurting, injury, killing.<BR>—3 Manifestation.<BR>—4 Intimation, information, hint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धवत्|गंधवत्|गन्धवन्त्
गन्धवत् <i>a.</i> Scented, fragrant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धवती|गंधवती
गन्धवत् + .{@-ती@}<BR>—1 The earth.<BR>—2 Wine.<BR>—3 N. of Satyavati, mother of Vyāsa.<BR>—4 A variety of jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धालु|गंधालु
गन्धालु <i>a.</i> Fragrant, perfumed, scented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धि|गंधि
गन्धि <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.)<BR>—1 Having the smell of, smelling of; see गन्ध.<BR>—2 Having only the smell of; containing only a small quantity, bearing<BR> only name of; सोऽपि त्वया हतस्तात रिपुणा भ्रातृगन्धिना Rām. 7. 24. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धि|गंधि
गन्धि + .{@-न्धि@} <i>n.</i> A kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धिक|गंधिक|गन्धिकः
गन्धिक <i>a.</i> (Used only at the end of comp.)<BR>—1 Having the smell of; as in उत्पलगन्धिक.<BR>—2 Having a very small quantity of, having only the smell of; भ्रातृगन्धिकः<BR> a brother only in name; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धिकः|गन्धिक|गंधिक
गन्धिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A seller of perfumes.<BR>—2 Sulphur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धिन्|गंधिन्
गन्धिन् <i>a.</i> Having a smell, smelling. ━<i>m.</i> A bug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धर्वः|गन्धर्व|गंधर्व|गंधर्वः|गन्धर्व्व|गन्धर्व्वः
गन्धर्वः<BR>—1 A celestial musician, a class of demi-gods regarded as the singers<BR> or musicians of gods, and said to give good and agreeable voice to girls;<BR> पतङ्गो वाचं मनसा बिभर्ति तां गन्धर्वोऽवदद्गर्भे अन्तः Rv. 10. 177. 2;<BR> Av. 11. 5. 2; सोमं शौचं ददावासां गन्धर्वश्च शुभां गिरम् Y. 1. 71.<BR>—2 A singer in general; Mb. 7. 57. 4.<BR>—3 A horse; Mb. 3.<BR>—4 The musk-deer.<BR>—5 The soul after death and previous to its being born again; तस्यासीद्दुहिता<BR> गन्धर्वगृहीता Bṛ. Up. 3. 3. 1.<BR>—6 The black cuckoo.<BR>—7 The sun.<BR>—8 A sage, pious man; Vāj. 32. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गन्धर्वतैलम्, गन्धर्वनगरम्, गन्धर्वपुरम्, गन्धर्वराजः, गन्धर्वविद्या, गन्धर्वविवाहः, गन्धर्ववेदः, गन्धर्वहस्तः, गन्धर्वहस्तकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धर्वतैलम्
गन्धर्वः + -तैलम् Castor-oil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धर्वनगरम्
गन्धर्वः + -नगरम्, -पुरम् the city of the Gandharvas, an imaginary city<BR> in the sky, probably the result of some natural phenomenon, such as mirage;<BR> गन्धर्वनगराकारं तथैवान्तर्हितं पुनः Mb. 1. 126. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धर्वपुरम्
गन्धर्वः + -नगरम्, -पुरम् the city of the Gandharvas, an imaginary city<BR> in the sky, probably the result of some natural phenomenon, such as mirage;<BR> गन्धर्वनगराकारं तथैवान्तर्हितं पुनः Mb. 1. 126. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धर्वराजः|गन्धर्वराज|गंधर्वराज
गन्धर्वः + -राजः Citraratha, the chief of the Gandharvas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धर्वविद्या|गंधर्वविद्या|गन्धर्व्वविद्या
गन्धर्वः + -विद्या the science of music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धर्वविवाहः|गन्धर्वविवाह|गंधर्वविवाह|गन्धर्व्वविवाह
गन्धर्वः + -विवाहः one of the eight forms of marriage described in Ms. 3. 27<BR> &c.; in this form marriage proceeds entirely from love or the mutual<BR> inclination of a youth and maiden without ceremonies<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0648-1" target="_blank">Page0648-1</a>]<BR> and without consulting relatives; it is, as Kālidāsa observes, कथमप्यबान्धवकृता<BR> स्नेहप्रवृत्तिः Ś. 4. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0647-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धर्ववेदः|गन्धर्ववेद|गंधर्ववेद|गन्धर्व्ववेद|गन्धर्व्ववेदः
गन्धर्वः + -वेदः one of the four subordinate Vedas or <i>Upavedas</i>, which<BR> treats of music; see उपवेद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धर्वहस्तः|गन्धर्वहस्त|गंधर्वहस्त|गन्धर्व्वहस्त|गन्धर्व्वहस्तः
गन्धर्वः + -हस्तः, -हस्तकः the castor-oil plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धर्वहस्तकः|गन्धर्वहस्तक|गंधर्वहस्तक|गन्धर्व्वहस्तकः
गन्धर्वः + -हस्तः, -हस्तकः the castor-oil plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गन्धारः|गन्धार|गंधार|गंधारः
