गरव्रतः|गरव्रत
गर + -व्रतः a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

