गरलारिः|गरलारि
गरलः + -अरिः an emerald.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरलिन्
गरलिन् <i>a.</i> Poisonous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरित
गरित <i>a.</i> Poisoned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरल्लिः|गरल्लि
