गरिमन्
गरिमन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 Weight, heaviness; Śi. 9. 49.<BR>—2 Importance, greatness, dignity; निरतिशयं गरिमाणं तेन जनन्याः<BR> स्मरन्ति विद्वांसः Pt. 1. 30.<BR>—3 Worth, excellence.<BR>—4 One of the eight <i>siddhis</i> or faculties of Śiva, by which he can<BR> make himself heavy or great at will; see सिद्धि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरिष्ठ|गरिष्ठः
