गरुडध्वजः|गरुडध्वज
गरुडः + -ध्वजः an epithet of Viṣṇu; समाहितमतिश्चैव तुष्टाव गरुडद्वजम् V. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरुडव्यूहः|गरुडव्यूह
गरुडः + -व्यूहः a particular military array.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरुत्
गरुत् <i>m.</i> [गृ- गॄ- वा उति Uṇ. 1. 94]<BR>—1 The wing of a bird.<BR>—2 Eating, swallowing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गरुद्योधिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गरुद्योधिन्
