गर्गः|गर्ग
गर्गः<BR>—1 N. of an old sage, one of the sons of Brahmā.<BR>—2 A bull.<BR>—3 An earth-worm. ━(pl.) The descendants of Garga.<BR>—4 A kind of musical pause or time.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गर्गसंहिता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्गसंहिता
