गर्जा
गर्जा, गर्जिः The thundering of clouds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्जिः|गर्जि|गर्ज्जिः
गर्जा, गर्जिः The thundering of clouds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्जित|गर्जितः|गर्ज्जितं
गर्जित <i>a.</i> [गर्ज्-क्त]<BR>—1 Sounded, roared.<BR>—2 Boasted, swaggered, vaunted; Ratn. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्जितम्
गर्जित + .{@-तम्@} The thunder of clouds; Y. 1. 145.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्जितः|गर्जित|गर्ज्जितं
गर्जित + .{@-तः@} A roaring elephant in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्जकः|गर्जक|गर्ज्जक|गर्ज्जकः
गर्जकः A kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्जरम्
गर्जरम् A kind of grass; carrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्तः|गर्त|गर्तं|गर्त्त|गर्त्तः
गर्तः, -र्ता, -र्तम्<BR> [गॄ-तन् Uṇ. 3. 86]<BR>—1 A hollow, hole, cave; ससत्त्वेषु गर्तेषु Ms. 4. 47, 203.<BR>—2 A grave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्ता
गर्तः, -र्ता, -र्तम्<BR> [गॄ-तन् Uṇ. 3. 86]<BR>—1 A hollow, hole, cave; ससत्त्वेषु गर्तेषु Ms. 4. 47, 203.<BR>—2 A grave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्तम्
गर्तः, -र्ता, -र्तम्<BR> [गॄ-तन् Uṇ. 3. 86]<BR>—1 A hollow, hole, cave; ससत्त्वेषु गर्तेषु Ms. 4. 47, 203.<BR>—2 A grave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्तः|गर्त|गर्तं|गर्त्त|गर्त्तः
गर्तः, -र्ता, -र्तम् + .{@-र्तः@}<BR>—1 The hollow of the loins.<BR>—2 A kind of disease.<BR>—3 N. of a country, a part the <i>Trigartas</i> q. v.<BR>—4 Ved. A throne.<BR>—5 A chariot; the seat of a chariot; तिष्ठद्धरी अध्यस्तेव गर्ते Rv. 6. 20. 9.<BR>—6 A table for playing at dice.<BR>—7 A house.<BR>—8 The post of an assembly room.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गर्ताश्रयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्ताश्रयः|गर्ताश्रय
गर्तः + -आश्रयः an animal living in holes or under ground, as a mouse<BR> or rat; Ms. 7. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्तिका|गर्त्तिका
गर्तिका [गर्तः अस्त्यस्याः ठन्] A weaverʼs work-shop (so called<BR> because the weaver sits at his loom with feet in a hole below the level of the floor).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्द्
गर्द् €1 P., €10 U. (गर्दति, गर्दयति-ते) To sound, roar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्दभः|गर्दभ|गर्द्दभ|गर्द्दभं|गर्द्दभः
गर्दभः (-भी <i>f.</i>) [गर्द्-अभच् Uṇ. 3. 122]<BR>—1 An ass; न गर्दभा वाजिधुरं वहन्ति Mk. 4. 17; प्राप्ते तु षोडशे<BR> वर्षे गर्दभी ह्यप्सरा भवेत् Subhāṣ. The ass is noted for three remarkable<BR> qualities:− अविश्रान्तं वहेद्भारं शीतोष्णं च न विन्दति । ससंतोषस्तथा<BR> नित्यं त्रीणि शिक्षेत गर्दभात् ॥ Cāṇ. 70.<BR>—2 Smell, odour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्दभम्
गर्दभः + .{@-भम्@} The white water-lily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्दभी|गर्द्दभी
गर्दभः + .{@-भी@}<BR>—1 A she-ass.<BR>—2 An insect generated in cow-dung.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गर्दभाण्डः, गर्दभाण्डकः, गर्दभाह्वयम्, गर्दभगदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्दभाण्डः|गर्दभाण्ड|गर्दभांड|गर्द्दभाण्ड|गर्द्दभाण्डः
गर्दभः + -अण्डः, -अण्डकः N. of two trees प्लक्ष & पिप्पली.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्दभाण्डकः|गर्दभाण्डक|गर्दभांडक
गर्दभः + -अण्डः, -अण्डकः N. of two trees प्लक्ष & पिप्पली.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्दभाह्वयम्
गर्दभः + -आह्वयम् a white lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्दभगदः|गर्दभगद|गर्द्दभगद|गर्द्दभगदः
