गर्दभकः + .{@-भिका@} A cutaneous disease, a blotch, eruption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्ध्
गर्ध् = गृध् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्धः|गर्ध|गर्द्धः
गर्धः [गृध्-घ्ञ् अच् वा]<BR>—1 Desire, eagerness.<BR>—2 Greediness; चञ्चच्चञ्चूधृतार्धच्युतपिशितलवग्राससंबद्धगर्धैः Nāg. 4. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्धन|गर्द्धनः
गर्धन, गर्धित <i>a.</i> Covetous, greedy; कपिश्चङ्क्रमणोऽद्यापि<BR> नाऽसौ भवति गर्धनः Bk. 7. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्धित
गर्धन, गर्धित <i>a.</i> Covetous, greedy; कपिश्चङ्क्रमणोऽद्यापि<BR> नाऽसौ भवति गर्धनः Bk. 7. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्धनम्
गर्धन, गर्धित + .{@-म्@} Desire; अस्याः करस्पर्धनगर्धनर्द्धिः N. 7. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्धिन्
गर्धिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Desirous, greedy, covetous; नवान्नामिषगर्धिनः Ms. 4. 28.<BR>—2 Following or pursuing (anything) with eagerness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भः|गर्भ
गर्भः [गॄ-भन् Uṇ. 3. 152]<BR>—1 The womb, the belly; गर्भेषु वसतिः Pt. 1; पुनर्गर्भं च संभवम् Ms. 6. 63.<BR>—2 A foetus, embryo; act of conception, pregnancy; conception; नरपतिकुलभूत्यै<BR> गर्भमाधत्त राज्ञी R. 2. 75; गर्भोऽभवद्भूधरराज-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">Page0652-1</a>]<BR> -पत्न्याः Ku. 1. 19; गर्भं वहति Pt. 1. 30 bears a child in the womb.<BR>—3 The time of conception; गर्भाष्टमेऽब्दे कुर्वीत ब्राह्मणस्योपनायनम् Ms. 2. 36.<BR>—4 The child (in the womb); Ś. 6; ततः कुमारं सुरंगर्भक्ल्पम् Bu. C. 2. 19;<BR> cf. ‘गर्भो भ्रूणेऽर्भके कुक्षौ’ Med.<BR>—5 A child, brood or offspring of birds.<BR>—6 The inside, middle, or interior of anything (in comp. in this sense<BR> and translated by ‘full of’, ‘filled with’, ‘containing’ &c.); हिमगर्भैर्मयूखैः<BR> Ś. 3. 4; शुक˚ कोटर 1. 14, 7. 7; ˚पत्रम् U. 3. 5 inwardly<BR> situated; अग्निगर्भां शमीमिव Ś. 4. 4; R. 3. 9, 5. 17, 9. 55; Śi. 9. 62;<BR> Māl. 3. 12; Mu. 1. 12.<BR>—7 The offspring of the sky, <i>i. e.</i> the vapours and fogs drawn upwards<BR> by the rays of the sun during 8 months and sent down again in the rainy<BR> season; cf. Ms. 9. 305; नवमासधृतं गर्भं भास्करस्य गभस्तिभिः<BR> Rām. 4. 28. 3.<BR>—8 An inner apartment, a lying-in-chamber.<BR>—9 Any interior chamber.<BR>—10 A hole.<BR>—11 Fire.<BR>—12 Food.<BR>—13 The rough coat of the jack-fruit (पनसकण्टक).<BR>—14 The bed of a river, especially of the Ganges on the fourteenth day<BR> of the dark half of Bhādrapada or in the very height of the rains when<BR> the river is fullest.<BR>—15 The fruit (of plants).<BR>—16 Joining, union.<BR>—17 The calyx of a lotus.<BR>—18 (In dramas) One of the <i>Sandhis</i> q. v.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गर्भाङ्कः, गर्भावकान्तिः, गर्भावटः, गर्भाष्टमः, गर्भास्पन्दनम्, गर्भागारम्, गर्भाधानम्, गर्भाशयः, गर्भास्रावः, गर्भेश्वरः, गर्भोत्पत्तिः, गर्भोपघातः, गर्भोपघातिनी, गर्भोपपत्तिः, गर्भकर, गर्भकार, गर्भकालः, गर्भकोशः, गर्भकोषः, गर्भक्लेशः, गर्भक्षयः, गर्भगृहम्, गर्भभवनम्, गर्भवेश्मन्, गर्भग्रहणम्, गर्भग्राहिका, गर्भघातिन्, गर्भचलनम्, गर्भचेटः, गर्भच्युत, गर्भच्युतिः, गर्भदासः, गर्भदासी, गर्भदिवसाः, गर्भद्रुह्, गर्भधम्, गर्भधरा, गर्भधारणम्, गर्भधारणा, गर्भधिः, गर्भध्वंसः, गर्भनाडी, गर्भनुद्, गर्भन्यासः, गर्भपरिस्रवः, गर्भपाकिन्, गर्भपातः, गर्भपोषणम्, गर्भभर्मन्, गर्भभाजनम्, गर्भमण्डपः, गर्भमासः, गर्भमोचनम्, गर्भयोषा, गर्भरक्षणम्, गर्भरन्धिः, गर्भरूप, गर्भरूपः, गर्भरूपकः, गर्भलक्षण, गर्भलम्भनम्, गर्भवसतिः, गर्भविच्युतिः, गर्भविपत्तिः, गर्भवेदना, गर्भव्याकरणम्, गर्भशङ्कुः, गर्भशय्या, गर्भसंभवः, गर्भसंभूतिः, गर्भसंभवा, गर्भस्थ, गर्भस्रावः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भाङ्कः|गर्भाङ्क|गर्भांक
गर्भः + -अङ्कः (also गर्भेऽङ्कः) an interlude during an act, as the<BR> scene of the birth of Kuśa and Lava in U. 7, or the सीतास्वयंवर<BR> in Bālarāmāyaṇa. The S. D. thus defines it:− अङ्कोदरप्रविष्टो<BR> यो रङ्गद्वारामुखादिमान् । अङ्कोऽपरः स गर्भाङ्कः सबीजः फलवानपि ॥ 279.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भावकान्तिः
गर्भः + -अवकान्तिः <i>f.</i> descent of the soul into the womb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भावटः
गर्भः + -अवटः see गर्भभाजनम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भाष्टमः|गर्भाष्टम
गर्भः + -अष्टमः<BR>—1 the eighth month from conception.<BR>—2 the eighth year from conception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भास्पन्दनम्
गर्भः + -अस्पन्दनम् non-quickening of the foetus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भागारम्
गर्भः + -आगारम्<BR>—1 uterus.<BR>—2 an inner and private room, the female apartments.<BR>—3 a lying-in-chamber.<BR>—4 the body or sanctuary of a temple, the chamber where the image of a<BR> deity is placed; एकैव देवं द्रष्टुं च गर्भागारमथाविशत् Ks. 7. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भाधानम्
गर्भः + -आधानम्<BR>—1 impregnation; गर्भाधानक्षणपरिचयान्नूनमाबद्धमालाः (बलाकाः) Me. 9.<BR>—2 one of the Saṃskāras or purificatory ceremonies performed after menstruation<BR> to ensure or facilitate conception; (this ceremony legalizes in a religious<BR> sense the <i>consummation</i> of marriage); Y. 1. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भाशयः|गर्भाशय
गर्भः + -आशयः the uterus, the womb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भास्रावः|गर्भास्राव
गर्भः + -आस्रावः mis-carriage, abortion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भेश्वरः|गर्भेश्वर
गर्भः + -ईश्वरः one born rich (cf. ‘born in the purple’); a sovereign<BR> or rich man by birth. ˚ता sovereignty attained by inheritance; प्राप्तैश्वर्यो<BR> भवेन्मूढो गर्भेश्वरतयान्यथा Rāj. T. 5. 199.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भोत्पत्तिः|गर्भोत्पत्ति
गर्भः + -उत्पत्तिः <i>f.</i> the formation of the embryo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भोपघातः|गर्भोपघात
गर्भः + -उपघातः miscarriage of the embryo (applied to the sky); Bṛ. S. 21. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भोपघातिनी
गर्भः + -उपघातिनी a cow or female miscarrying from unseasonable gestation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भोपपत्तिः
गर्भः + -उपपत्तिः <i>f.</i> formation of the embryo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भकर|गर्भकरः
गर्भः + -कर, -कार <i>a.</i> impregnating, procreative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भकार
गर्भः + -कर, -कार <i>a.</i> impregnating, procreative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भकालः|गर्भकाल
गर्भः + -कालः<BR>—1 time of impregnation.<BR>—2 the time when the vapour collected in the air shows the first signs of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भकोशः|गर्भकोश
गर्भः + -कोशः, -कोषः uterus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भकोषः|गर्भकोष
गर्भः + -कोशः, -कोषः uterus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भक्लेशः|गर्भक्लेश
गर्भः + -क्लेशः pains caused by the embryo, the throes of parturition or childbirth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भक्षयः|गर्भक्षय
गर्भः + -क्षयः miscarriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गर्भगृहम्
गर्भः + -गृहम्, -भवनम्, -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i><BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-2" target="_blank">Page0652-2</a>]<BR>—1 an inner apartment, the body of a house; Mb. 5. 118. 19; R. 19. 42.<BR>—2 a lying-in-chamber.<BR>—3 the sanctuary or body of a temple; निर्गत्य गर्भभवनात् Māl. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0652-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

