गवाकृति
गव + -आकृति <i>a.</i> cow-shaped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवालम्भः|गवालम्भ
गव + -आलम्भः the cow-killing in मधुपर्क rite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवाह्निकम्
गव + -आह्निकम् the daily measure of food given to a cow; a kind of व्रत;<BR> निरुद्विग्नस्तु यो दद्यान्मासमेकं गवाह्निकम् Mb. 13. 133. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवेन्द्रः|गवेन्द्र
गव + -इन्द्रः<BR>—1 an owner of kine.<BR>—2 an excellent bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

