गवेश्वरः|गवेश्वर
गव + -ईशः, -ईश्वरः an owner of cows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवोद्धः|गवोद्ध
