गवराजः|गवराज
गव + -राजः a bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवयः|गवय
गवयः A species of ox; गोसदृशो गवयः T. S.; दृष्टः कथंचिद्गवयैर्विविग्नैः<BR> Ku. 1. 56; Ṛs. 1. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

