गवामयः|गवामय
गवामयः A kind of sacrifice (सत्र) lasting for a year; गवामयस्य<BR> यज्ञस्य फलं प्राप्नोति मानवः Mb. 13. 106. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवांपतिः|गवाम्पति|गवांपति
गवांपतिः<BR>—1 The chief cattle, a bull.<BR>—2 A cowherd.<BR>—3 An epithet of the sun; also of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवालूकः|गवालूक
