गविष्
गविष्, -गविष <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Wishing for cows.<BR>—2 Eager (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गविष
गविष्, -गविष <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Wishing for cows.<BR>—2 Eager (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गविष्ठि|गविष्ठिः
