गविष्ठिः|गविष्ठि
गविष्ठि + .{@-ष्ठिः@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Desire, eagerness.<BR>—2 Desire for fighting, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0654-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गविष्ठ|गविष्ठः
