गवेधुका
गवेडुः, -धुः, -धुका<BR> A kind of grass eaten by cattle; Ki. 12. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवेडुः|गवेडु
गवेडुः, -धुः, -धुका + .{@-डुः@} A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

