गवेष्
गवेष् €1 Ā., €10 P. (गवेषते, गवेषयति, गवेषित)<BR>—1 To seek, hunt for, search or inquire for; तस्मादेष यतः प्राप्तस्तत्रैवान्यो<BR> गवेष्यताम् Ks. 25. 176.<BR>—2 To strive after, desire ardently or fervently, make efforts for; गवेषमाणं<BR> महिषीकुलं जलम् Ṛs. 1. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवेष|गवेषः
गवेष <i>a.</i> Searching for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवेषः|गवेष
गवेष + .{@-षः@} Search, inquiry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवेषण|गवेषणं
गवेषण^1 <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Desiring ardently.<BR>—2 Desirous of combat; अभिमातिषाहो गवेषणः Av. 5. 20. 11.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260429. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/187.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवेषणम्
गवेषणम् + .{@-णम्, -णा@} Search or inquiry after anything; सखि किमर्थगवेषणया<BR> गिरम् (किरति) N. 4. 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गवेषणा
गवेषणम् + .{@-णम्, -णा@} Search or inquiry after anything; सखि किमर्थगवेषणया<BR> गिरम् (किरति) N. 4. 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

