गह्वम्
गह्वम्<BR>—1 Depth.<BR>—2 An inaccessible place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गह्वर|गह्वरं|गह्वरः
