गह्वरम्
गह्वर + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 An abyss, a depth.<BR>—2 A thicket, forest; गुल्मतृणवीरुद्भिर्गह्वरमिव भवत्येवमेव गृहाश्रमः<BR> Bhāg. 5. 14. 4.<BR>—3 A cave, cavern; गौरीगुरोर्गह्वरमाविवेश R. 2. 26, 46; Ṛs. 1. 21.<BR>—4 An inaccessible place.<BR>—5 A hiding-place.<BR>—6 A riddle.<BR>—7 Hypocrisy.<BR>—8 Weeping, crying.<BR>—9 Water.<BR>—10 A deep sigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गह्वरः|गह्वर|गह्वरं
गह्वर + .{@-रः@} An arbour, bower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गह्वरी
