गह्वरित
गह्वरित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Being in a hiding-place, concealed.<BR>—2 Absorbed (in oneʼs thought); याज्ञसेन्या वचः श्रुत्वा कृष्णो गह्वरितोभवत्<BR> Mb. 2. 68. 45 (here commentator Nīlakaṇṭha says गह्वरितः करुणातिशयाद्गद्गदकण्ठः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0655-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गा
