गाध्
गाध् €1 Ā. (गाधते, गाधित)<BR>—1 To stand, stay, remain.<BR>—2 To set out for; dive or plunge into; गाधितासे नभो भूयः Bk. 22. 2, 8. 1.<BR>—3 To seek, search or inquire for.<BR>—4 To compile, string or weave together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0656-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

