गार्ग|गार्गः|गार्ग्ग
गार्ग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Coming from or connected with Gārgya.<BR>—2 Composed by Garga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0658-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गार्गः|गार्ग|गार्ग्ग
