गार्गी
गार्ग + .{@-र्गी@} N. of the learned woman वाचक्नवी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0658-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गार्ग्य|गार्ग्यः
