गार्ध्र|गार्ध्रः
गार्ध्र <i>a.</i> (-र्ध्री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [गृध्रस्यायम् अण्] Derived from a vulture; Mb. 6. 73. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0658-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गार्ध्रः|गार्ध्र
