गिरिज|गिरिजं|गिरिजः
गिरि + -ज <i>a.</i> mountain-born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0659-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

