गुणनिन्दा
गुणः + -अपवादः, -निन्दा disparagement, detraction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणाभिधानम्
गुणः + -अभिधानम् A subsidiary injunction; द्रव्योपदेशाद्वा गुणाभिधानं<BR> स्यात् M. 8. 4. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणाकरः|गुणाकर
गुणः + -आकरः<BR>—1 ‘a mine of merits’, one endowed with all virtues; सृजति तावदशेषगुणाकरं<BR> पुरुषरत्नमलङ्करणं भुवः Bh. 2. 92.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणाढ्य
गुणः + -आढ्य <i>a.</i> rich in virtues.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणात्मन्
गुणः + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> having qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणाधारः|गुणाधार
गुणः + -आधारः ‘a receptacle of virtues’, a virtuous or meritorious person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणाश्रय
गुणः + -आश्रय <i>a.</i> virtuous, excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणेश्वरः|गुणेश्वर
गुणः + -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 the Supreme Being.<BR>—2 the Chitrakūṭa mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणोत्कर्षः|गुणोत्कर्ष
गुणः + -उत्कर्षः excellence of merit, possession of superior qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणोत्कीर्तनम्
गुणः + -उत्कीर्तनम् panegyric, eulogium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणोत्कृष्ट
गुणः + -उत्कृष्ट <i>a.</i> superior in merit; Ms. 8. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणोपेत
गुणः + -उपेत <i>a.</i> endowed with good qualities; पुत्रमेवङ्गुणोपेतं<BR> चक्रवर्तिनमाप्नुहि Ś. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणौघः|गुणौघ
गुणः + -ओघः, -ओघम् superior or abundant merits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणौघम्
गुणः + -ओघः, -ओघम् superior or abundant merits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकथनम्
गुणः + -कथनम् extolling, praising.<BR>—2 a condition or state of mind of the hero of a drama to which he is<BR> reduced by Cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकर्तृत्वम्
गुणः + -कर्तृत्वम् the state of an agent of properties; गुणकर्तृत्वेऽपि<BR> तथा कर्तेव भवत्युदासीनः Sāṅ. K. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकर्मन्
गुणः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 an unessential or secondary action.<BR>—2 (in gram.) the secondary or less immediate<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">Page0662-2</a>]<BR> (<i>i. e.</i> indirect) object of an action; <i>e. g.</i> in the example नेताऽश्वस्य<BR> स्रुघ्नं स्रुघ्नस्य वा, स्रुघ्नम् is a गुणकर्मन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकर्मविभाग
गुणः + -कर्मविभाग <i>a.</i> distinguishing an action and an attribute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकल्पना
गुणः + -कल्पना <i>f.</i> imputing a figurative meaning, one of the modes<BR> of interpreting a sentence. According to it an expression may be understood<BR> as conveying not what is actually expressed by it but the quality or qualities<BR> thereof. <i>e. g.</i> सिंहो देवदत्तः means प्रसह्यकरी देवदत्तः;<BR> ŚB. on MS. 1. 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकाण्डः
गुणः + -काण्डः a series of subsidiary (details); एवमेक उत्कृष्यमाणः<BR> सर्वं गुणकाण्डमुत्कर्षति ŚB. on MS. 5. 1. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकार|गुणकारः
गुणः + -कार <i>a.</i> productive of good qualities, profitable, salutary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकारः|गुणकार
गुणः + -कार + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a cook who prepares side-dishes or any secondary articles of food.<BR>—2 an epithet of Bhīma.<BR>—3 (in math.) the multiplier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकीर्तनम्
गुणः + -कीर्तनम्, -श्लाघा, -स्तुतिः <i>f.</i> praise, extolling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणश्लाघा
गुणः + -कीर्तनम्, -श्लाघा, -स्तुतिः <i>f.</i> praise, extolling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणस्तुतिः|गुणस्तुति
गुणः + -कीर्तनम्, -श्लाघा, -स्तुतिः <i>f.</i> praise, extolling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकृत्यम्
गुणः + -कृत्यम् the function of a bow-string; गुणकृत्ये धनुषो नियोजिता Ku. 4. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणगणः|गुणगण
गुणः + -गणः a number or series of good qualities; Bhāg. 5. 3. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणगानम्
गुणः + -गानम् singing of merits, panegyric, praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणगृध्नु
गुणः + -गृध्नु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 desiring good qualities; ये चान्ये गुणगृध्नवः Bhāg. 3. 14. 20.<BR>—2 possessing enviable or good qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणगृह्य
गुणः + -गृह्य <i>a.</i> appreciating or admiring merits (wherever they may<BR> be), attached to merits; appreciative; ननु वक्तृविशेषनिःस्पृहा गुणगृह्या<BR> वचने विपश्चितः Ki. 2. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणगौरी
गुणः + -गौरी a woman chaste by virtuous conduct; अनृतगिरं गुणगौरि<BR> मा कृथा माम् Śi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणग्रहणम्
गुणः + -ग्रहणम् appreciating merits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणग्रहीतृ
गुणः + -ग्रहीतृ, -ग्राहक, -ग्राहिन् <i>a.</i> appreciating the merits (of<BR> others); श्रीहर्षो निपुणः कविः परिषदप्येषा गुणग्राहिणी Ratn. 1. 4;<BR> Śi. 20. 82; Bv. 1. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणग्राहक
गुणः + -ग्रहीतृ, -ग्राहक, -ग्राहिन् <i>a.</i> appreciating the merits (of<BR> others); श्रीहर्षो निपुणः कविः परिषदप्येषा गुणग्राहिणी Ratn. 1. 4;<BR> Śi. 20. 82; Bv. 1. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणग्राहिन्
गुणः + -ग्रहीतृ, -ग्राहक, -ग्राहिन् <i>a.</i> appreciating the merits (of<BR> others); श्रीहर्षो निपुणः कविः परिषदप्येषा गुणग्राहिणी Ratn. 1. 4;<BR> Śi. 20. 82; Bv. 1. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणग्रामः|गुणग्राम
गुणः + -ग्रामः a collection of virtues or merits; गुरुतरगुणग्रामांभोजस्फुटोज्ज्वलचन्द्रिका<BR> Bh. 3. 116; गणयति गुणग्रामम् Gīt. 2; Bv. 1. 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणघातिन्
गुणः + -घातिन् <i>a.</i> detractor, envious, censorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणज्ञ|गुणज्ञः
गुणः + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> knowing how to admire or appreciate merits, appreciative;<BR> भगवति कमलालये भृशमगुणज्ञासि Mu. 2; गुणा गुणज्ञेषु गुणा भवन्ति H. Pr. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणत्रयम्
गुणः + -त्रयम्, -त्रितयम् the three constituent properties of nature;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> सत्त्व, रजस् and तमस्. ˚आभासः life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणत्रितयम्
गुणः + -त्रयम्, -त्रितयम् the three constituent properties of nature;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> सत्त्व, रजस् and तमस्. ˚आभासः life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणदोषौ
गुणः + -दोषौ (du.) virtue and vice; ˚कथा; Pt. 2. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणधर्मः|गुणधर्म|गुणधर्म्म
गुणः + -धर्मः the virtue or duty incidental to the possession of certain qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणनिधिः|गुणनिधि
गुणः + -निधिः a store of virtues.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणपदी
गुणः + -पदी a woman having feet as thin as cords.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणपूगम्
गुणः + -पूगम् great merits; भवद्गुणपूगपूरितम् (श्रवणम्) Śi. 9. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणप्रकर्षः|गुणप्रकर्ष
गुणः + -प्रकर्षः excellence of merits, great merit; गुणप्रकर्षादुडुपेन<BR> शम्भोरलङ्घ्यमुल्लङ्घितमुत्तमाङ्गम् Mk. 4. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणभावः
गुणः + -भावः being subsidiary to something else; परार्थता हि गुणभावः ।<BR> ŚB. on MS. 4. 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणभोक्तृ
गुणः + -भोक्तृ <i>a.</i> perceiving the properties of things; निर्गुणं<BR> गुणभोक्तृ च Bg. 13. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणमहत्
गुणः + -महत् a superior quality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणमुष्टिः
गुणः + -मुष्टिः <i>f.</i> a particular method of stringing the bow; cf. पताका<BR> वज्रमुष्टिश्च सिंहकर्णस्तथैव च । मत्सरी काकतुण्डी च योजनीया यथाक्रमम् ॥<BR> Dhanur. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणरागः|गुणराग
गुणः + -रागः delighting in the merits of others; गुणरागगतां तस्य<BR> रूपिणीमिव दुर्गतिम् Ks. 2. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणराशिः|गुणराशि
गुणः + -राशिः an epithet of Śiva<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणलक्षणम्
गुणः + -लक्षणम् mark or indication of an internal property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणलयनिका
गुणः + -लयनिका, -लयनी a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणलयनी
गुणः + -लयनिका, -लयनी a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणलुब्ध
गुणः + -लुब्ध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 desirous of merits.<BR>—2 attached to merits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवचनम्
गुणः + -वचनम्, -वाचकः a word which connotes an attribute or quality,<BR> an adjective, or substantive used attributively;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">Page0663-1</a>]<BR> as श्वते in श्वेतोऽश्वः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवाचकः|गुणवाचक
गुणः + -वचनम्, -वाचकः a word which connotes an attribute or quality,<BR> an adjective, or substantive used attributively;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">Page0663-1</a>]<BR> as श्वते in श्वेतोऽश्वः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0662-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवादः|गुणवाद
गुणः + -वादः<BR>—1 pointing out good merits.<BR>—2 a statement in a secondary sense; गुणवादस्तु MS. 1. 2. 10 (Śabara<BR> explains this as: गौण एष वादो भवति यत् सम्बन्धिनि स्तोतव्ये सम्बन्ध्यन्तरं<BR> स्तूयते । ŚB. on MS. on ibid.).<BR>—3 a statement contradictory to other arguments; Madhusūdana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणविवेचना
गुणः + -विवेचना discrimination in appreciating the merits of others,<BR> a just sense of merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणाः
गुणः + -आः external organs, mind and spiritual ignorance; परस्परविलक्षणा<BR> गुणविशेषाः (बाह्येन्द्रियमनोऽहङ्काराश्च) Sāṅ. K. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणविशेषः|गुणविशेष
गुणः + -विशेषः a different property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवृक्षः|गुणवृक्ष
गुणः + -वृक्षः, -वृक्षकः a mast or a post to which a ship or boat is fastened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवृक्षकः|गुणवृक्षक
गुणः + -वृक्षः, -वृक्षकः a mast or a post to which a ship or boat is fastened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवृत्तिः|गुणवृत्ति
गुणः + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a secondary or unessential condition or relation (opp. मुख्यवृत्ति).<BR>—2 the character or style of merits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवैशेष्यम्
गुणः + -वैशेष्यम् pre-eminence of merit; अन्योन्यगुणवैशेष्यान्न किंचिदतिरिच्यते Ms. 9. 296.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणशब्दः|गुणशब्द
गुणः + -शब्दः an adjective.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणसंख्यानम्
गुणः + -संख्यानम् ‘enumeration of the three essential qualities’, a term<BR> applied to the Sāṅkhya (including the Yoga) system of philosophy; ज्ञानं<BR> कर्म च कर्ता च त्रिधैव गुणभेदतः प्रोच्यते गुणसंख्याने Bg. 18. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणसंगः|गुणसङ्ग|गुणसंग
गुणः + -संगः<BR>—1 association with qualities or merits.<BR>—2 attachment to objects of sense or worldly pleasures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणसंग्रहः|गुणसङ्ग्रह|गुणसंग्रह
गुणः + -संग्रहः a collection of merits or properties; कथं गुणज्ञो<BR> विरमेद्विना पशुं श्रीर्यत्प्रवव्रे गुणसंग्रहेच्छया Bhāg. 4. 20. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणसंपद्|गुणसम्पद्
गुणः + -संपद् <i>f.</i> excellence or richness of merits, great merit,<BR> perfection; गुणसंपदा समधिगम्य Ki. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणसागरः|गुणसागर
गुणः + -सागरः<BR>—1 ‘an ocean of merit’, a very meritorious man.<BR>—2 an epithet of Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणहीन
गुणः + -हीन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 ‘void of merit’, meritless; काममामरणात्तिष्ठेद्गृहे कन्यर्तुमत्यपि ।<BR> न चैवैनां प्रयच्छेत्तु गुणहीनाय कर्हिचित् Ms. 9. 89.<BR>—2 poor (as food).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणकः|गुणक
गुणकः [गुण्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A calculator.<BR>—2 A multiplier (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणतः
गुणतः <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 According to the three chief qualities (of all existing things); Ms. 11. 185.<BR>—2 According to property.<BR>—3 According to merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणता
गुणता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Subordination, dependence.<BR>—2 Virtue, excellence, good qualities.<BR>—3 Being endowed with or possession of, qualities in general.<BR>—4 Multiplication.<BR>—5 The state of a rope or cord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणत्वम्
गुणता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Subordination, dependence.<BR>—2 Virtue, excellence, good qualities.<BR>—3 Being endowed with or possession of, qualities in general.<BR>—4 Multiplication.<BR>—5 The state of a rope or cord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणनम्
गुणनम् [गुण्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Multiplication.<BR>—2 Enumeration.<BR>—3 Describing merits or qualities, pointing out or enumerating merits;<BR> इह रसभणने कृतहरिगुणने मधुरिपुपदसेवके Gīt. 7.<BR>—4 Reiterated study, repetition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणनी
गुणनम् + .{@-नी@} Examining books, studying; collating and correcting copies<BR> to determine the value of variants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणनिका
गुणनिका [गुण् भावे युच् स्वार्थे क]<BR>—1 Study, repeated reading, repetition; विशेषविदुषः शास्त्रं यत्तवोद्ग्राह्यते<BR> पुरः । हेतुः परिचयस्थैर्ये वक्तुर्गुणनिकैव सा ॥ Śi. 2. 75 (आम्रेडितम्<BR> Malli.); श्रुतेर्गुणनिकानिकामपरिपूतवक्त्राम्बुजान् Viś. Guṇā. 159.<BR>—2 Dancing, the science or profession of dancing.<BR>—3 The prologue or introduction to a drama.<BR>—4 A garland, necklace; दरिद्राणां चिन्तामणिगुणनिका Ā. L. 3.<BR>—5 Determining the value of the various readings of a manuscript.<BR>—6 A cipher, the character in arithmetic which expresses nothing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणनीय|गुणनीयः
गुणनीय <i>a.</i> [गुण् करणे अनीयर्]<BR>—1 To be multiplied.<BR>—2 To be enumerated.<BR>—3 To be advised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणनीयः|गुणनीय
गुणनीय + .{@-यः@} Study, practice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणनीयम्
गुणनीय + .{@-यम्@} The multiplicand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणमय
गुणमय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Consisting of single threads.<BR>—2 Consisting of the three constituent properties of nature.<BR>—3 Possessed of merits, meritorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवत्|गुणवन्त्
गुणवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Endowed with good qualities, virtuous, meritorious, good, excellent;<BR> गुणवति भृत्ये (निवेद्य दुःखं सुखी भवति) Pt. 1. 101.<BR>—2 Endowed with qualities.<BR>—3 Delicious; भोजयेत्तान्गुणवता सदन्नेन शुचिस्मिते Bhāg. 8. 16. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवत्ता
गुणवत्ता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 The possession of good qualities; गुणवत्तापि परप्रयोजना R. 8. 31.<BR>—2 Excellence, superiority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणवत्त्वम्
गुणवत्ता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 The possession of good qualities; गुणवत्तापि परप्रयोजना R. 8. 31.<BR>—2 Excellence, superiority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणिका
गुणिका A tumour, a swelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणित|गुणितः
गुणित <i>p. p.</i> [गुण् कर्मणि क्त]<BR>—1 Multiplied.<BR>—2 Heaped together, collected; कपोतौ स्नेहगुणितहृदयौ गृहधर्मिणौ<BR> Bhāg. 11. 7. 54.<BR>—3 Enumerated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणिन्
गुणिन् <i>a.</i> [गुण-इन्]<BR>—1 Possessed of or endowed with merits, meritorious; गुणी गुणं वेत्ति<BR> न वेत्ति निर्गुणः; Ms. 8. 73; Y. 2. 78.<BR>—2 Good, auspicious; गुणिन्यहनि Dk. 61.<BR>—3 Familiar with the merits of anything.<BR>—4 Possessing qualities (as an object); गुणानां गुणिनां चैव परिणाममभीप्सताम्<BR> Bhāg. 2. 8. 14.<BR>—5 Possessed of the three qualities; Ve. 6. 43.<BR>—6 Having (subordinate) parts, principal (Opp. गुण); गुणगुणिनोरेव सम्बन्धः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणिनी
गुणिन् + .{@-नी@} A bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणीभूत|गुणीभूतः
गुणीभूत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Deprived of the original meaning or importance.<BR>—2 Made secondary or subordinate; गुणीभूताः स्म ते राजन् Mb. 14. 71. 24.<BR>—3 Invested with attributes.<BR>—4 Made or having become a merit or ornament.<BR>—5 Varied according to qualities.<BR>—6 Having a certain force or application (as a word &c.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गुणीभूतव्यङ्गथम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुणीभूतव्यङ्गथम्
गुणीभूत + -व्यङ्गथम् (in Rhet.) the second of the three divisions of Kāvya<BR> (poetry), in which the charm of the <i>suggested</i> sense is not more<BR> striking than that of the <i>expressed</i> one. S. D. thus defines it:− अपरं<BR> तु गुणीभूतव्यङ्ग्यं वाच्यादनुत्तमे व्यङ्गये । 265. This division of<BR> Kāvya is further subdivided into 8 classes; see S. D. 266 and K. P. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्य
गुण्य <i>a.</i> [गुण्-यत्]<BR>—1 Endowed with merits or virtues; गुण्यगुण्य इति न व्यजीगणत् Śi. 14. 47.<BR>—2 To be enumerated.<BR>—3 To be described or praised.<BR>—4 To be multiplied, the multiplicand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्ठ्|गुंठ्
गुण्ठ् €10 U. (गुण्ठयति-ते, गुण्ठित)<BR>—1 To encircle, surround, envelop, enclose.<BR>—2 To hide, conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्ठनम्
गुण्ठनम्<BR>—1 Concealing, covering, hiding.<BR>—2 Smearing, as in भस्मगुण्ठनम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्ठित|गुंठित|गुण्ठितः
गुण्ठित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Surrounded, covered; धरणी रेणुगुण्ठितः Mb. 1. 74. 53.<BR>—2 Pounded, ground, reduced to dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्ड्|गुंड्
गुण्ड् €10 P. (गुण्डयति, गुण्डित)<BR>—1 To cover, hide.<BR>—2 To pound, reduce to powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0663-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्डः|गुण्ड|गुंडः
गुण्डः [गुण्ड्-अच्]<BR>—1 A kind of fragrant grass.<BR>—2 Pounding, grinding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्डकः|गुण्डक|गुंडक|गुंडकः
गुण्डकः<BR>—1 Dust, power.<BR>—2 An oil-vessel.<BR>—3 A soft or low pleasing tone.<BR>—4 Dirty flour or meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्डनम्
गुण्डनम् Concealing, covering, hiding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्डिकः|गुण्डिक|गुंडिक|गुंडिकः
गुण्डिकः Flour, meal, powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्डिचा
गुण्डिचा <i>f.</i><BR>—1 One of the twelve festivals of God Puruṣottama.<BR>—2 N. of this place of festival; Utkalakhaṇḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुण्डित|गुंडित|गुण्डितः
गुण्डित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Pounded, ground.<BR>—2 Covered with dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुत्सः|गुत्स
गुत्सः = गुच्छ q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुत्सकः|गुत्सक
गुत्सकः [गुच्छ-स्वार्थादौ कन्]<BR>—1 A bundle, bunch.<BR>—2 A nosegay.<BR>—3 A cow-tail, chowrie.<BR>—4 The section or chapter of a book.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुद्
गुद् €1 Ā. (गोदते, गुदित) To play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुदम्
गुदम् The anus; intestine; rectum; आन्त्रेभ्यस्ते गुदाभ्यो वनिष्ठोर्हृदयादधि<BR> Rv. 10. 163. 3; Y. 3. 93; Ms. 5. 136, 8. 262.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुदा
गुदम् + .{@-दा@} The anus; vein (नाडी); सिन्धवो द्रुगुदा Bṛ. Up. 1. 1. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गुदाङ्कुरः, गुदावर्तः, गुदोद्भवः, गुदौष्ठः, गुदकीलः, गुदकीलकः, गुदग्रहः, गुदनिर्गमः, गुदपाकः, गुदभ्रंशः, गुदवर्त्मन्, गुदस्तम्भः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

