गुदम् + -पाकः inflammation of the anus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुदभ्रंशः|गुदभ्रंश
गुदम् + -भ्रंशः <i>prolapsus ani</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

