गुध्
गुध् I. €4 P. (गुध्यति, गुधित) To wrap up, cover, envelop, clothe.<BR>━II. €9 P. (गुध्नाति) To be angry. ━III. €1 Ā. (गोधते) To play, sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0664-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

