गुरुभम्
गुरु + -भम्<BR>—1 the constellation पुष्य.<BR>—2 a bow.<BR>—3 the sign <i>Pisces</i> of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

