गुरुमर्दलः|गुरुमर्दल|गुरुमर्द्दल
गुरु + -मर्दलः a kind of drum or tabor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुरत्नम्
गुरु + -रत्नम्<BR>—1 topaz; (Mar. पुष्पराग, गोमेद).<BR>—2 a gem brought from the Himālaya and the Indus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुलाघवम्
