गुरुक
गुरुक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 A little heavy.<BR>—2 Long (in prosody).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

