गुरुता
गुरुता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Weight, heaviness.<BR>—2 Burden, trouble.<BR>—3 Dignity, greatness; U. 6. 19; लोके गुरुत्वं विपरीततां वा स्वचेष्टितान्येव<BR> नरं नयन्ति H. 2. 46; Śi. 16. 27.<BR>—4 Respectability, venerableness.<BR>—5 The office of a teacher; Ks. 19.<BR>—6 Importance.<BR>—7 Universal gravitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुरुत्वम्
