गु(गू)र्जरः<BR>—1 The district of Gujarath.<BR>—2 An inhabitant of Gujarath; तेषां मार्गे परिचयवशादर्जितं गुर्जराणां<BR> यः संतापं शिथिलमकरोत् सोमनाथं विलोक्य Vikr. 18. 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

