गुलः|गुल
गुलः<BR>—1 Molasses; cf. गुड.<BR>—2 the glans penis.<BR>—3 Clitoris.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुली
