गुल्मः, -ल्मम्<BR> [गुड् मक् डस्य लः Tv.]<BR>—1 A clump or cluster of trees, a thicket, wood, bush; विशालगुल्मं<BR> प्ररुजन्वनस्पतीन् Bhāg. 8. 2. 20; Ms. 1. 48, 7. 192, 12. 58; Y. 2. 229.<BR>—2 A troop of soldiers; <i>i. e.</i> three सेनामुखs; cf. Mb. 1. 2. 20;<BR> a division of an army, consisting of 45 foot, 27 horse, 9 chariots and 9<BR> elephants (according to राजघर्मकाण्ड of कृत्यकल्पतरु of<BR> लक्ष्मीधर; cf. also दण्डविवेक, G. O. S. 52, p. 31).<BR>—3 A fort, entrenchment; मध्यमेन च गुल्मेन रक्षिभिः सा सुरक्षिता, Mb. 3. 15. 11.<BR>—4 The spleen.<BR>—5 A chronic enlargement of the spleen.<BR>—6 A village police-station.<BR>—7 A wharf of stairs (Mar. घाट).<BR>—8 Disciplining an army, keeping it in a posture of defence.<BR>—9 War-camp; तथैव गुल्मे संप्रेक्ष्य शयानान्मध्यगौल्मिकान् Mb. 10. 8. 41.<BR>—10 A tent; Mb. 6. 86. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुल्मी
गुल्मः, -ल्मम् + .{@-ल्मी@}<BR>—1 A cluster or clump of trees.<BR>—2 Jujube.<BR>—3 Small cardamoms.<BR>—4 A tent.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गुल्मकुष्ठम्, गुल्मकेतुः, गुल्मकेश, गुल्ममूलम्, गुल्मवातः, गुल्मोदरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुल्मकुष्ठम्
गुल्मः + -कुष्ठम् <i>n.</i> a kind of leprosy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुल्मकेतुः|गुल्मकेतु
गुल्मः + -केतुः a small sort of cane, sorrel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुल्मकेश
गुल्मः + -केश <i>a.</i> having bushy hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुल्ममूलम्
गुल्मः + -मूलम् fresh ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुल्मवातः|गुल्मवात
गुल्मः + -वातः, -उदरः a disease of the spleen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुल्मोदरः|गुल्मोदर
गुल्मः + -वातः, -उदरः a disease of the spleen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0666-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुल्मिन्
गुल्मिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Growing in a clump or cluster; विरोप्यन्तां बहुविधाश्छायावन्तश्च<BR> गुल्मिनः Rām. 7. 54. 11.<BR>—2 Having a diseased spleen, or a spleen affected by गुल्म.<BR>—3 Composed of different divisions (as a force &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुवाकः|गुवाक
गु(गू)वाकः The betel-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूवाकः|गूवाक
गु(गू)वाकः The betel-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुष्पित
गुष्पित <i>a.</i> Ved. Interlaced, intwined, accumulation; अपि वृश्च<BR> पुराणवद् व्रततेरिव गुष्पितम् Rv. 8. 40. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुह्
गुह् €1 U. (गूहति-ते, जुगूह, जुगुहे, अगूहीत्, अगूहिष्ठ, अगूढ, अघुक्षत्-त,<BR> गूहिष्यति-ते, घोक्ष्यति-ते, गूहितुम्, गोढुम्, गूढ)<BR>—1 To cover, hide, conceal, keep secret; गुह्यं च गूहति गुणान् प्रकटीकरोति<BR> Bh. 2. 72; गूहेत्कूर्म इवाङ्गानि Ms. 7. 105; R. 14. 49; Bk. 16. 41.<BR>—2 To cover with clothes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुहः|गुह
गुहः [गुह्-क]<BR>—1 An epithet of Kārtikeya; गुह इवाप्रतिहतशक्तिः K. 8; Ku. 5. 14.<BR>—2 A horse.<BR>—3 N. of a Cāṇḍāla or <i>Niṣāda</i>, king of Śṛṅgavera and a friend of Rāma.<BR>—4 An epithet of Viṣṇu; also of Śiva.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गुहकम्, गुहराजः, गुहषष्ठी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

