गुहाशयः|गुहाशय
गुहा + -शयः<BR>—1 a mouse.<BR>—2 a tiger or lion.<BR>—3 the Supreme soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुहिनम्
