गुह्यमयः|गुह्यमय
गुह्य + -मयः an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुह्यरुज्
गुह्य + -रुज् <i>f.</i> a disease of the pudenda; Bṛ. S. 5. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुह्यविद्या
गुह्य + -विद्या knowledge of Mantras or mystical incantations; V. P. 1. 9. 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुह्यकः|गुह्यक
गुह्यकः<BR>—1 N. of a class of demigods, who, like the Yakṣas, are attendants of<BR> Kubera and guardians of his treasures; गुह्यकस्तं ययाचे Me. 5; Ms. 12. 47.<BR>—2 The number ‘eleven’.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गुह्यकाधिपतिः, गुह्यकेश्वरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गुह्यकाधिपतिः|गुह्यकाधिपति
