गुह्यकेश्वरः|गुह्यकेश्वर
गुह्यकः + -अधिपतिः, -ईश्वरः an epithet of Kuber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूढ|गूढं|गूढः
गूढ <i>p. p.</i> [गुह्-क्त]<BR>—1 Hidden, concealed, kept secret.<BR>—2 Covered.<BR>—3 Invisible, latent.<BR>—4 Secret, private.<BR>—5 Disguised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूढम्
गूढ + .{@-ढम्@}<BR>—1 A solitary or private place.<BR>—2 A private part.<BR>—3 A mystery.<BR>—4 One of the शब्दालङ्कारs. <i>ind.</i> Secretly; संवत्सरं तत्र<BR> विहृत्य गूढम् Mb. 3. 176. 10.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गूढाङ्गः, गूढाङ्घ्रिः, गूढार्थ, गूढार्थः, गूढात्मन्, गूढालेख्यम्, गूढोत्पन्नः, गूढजः, गूढचार, गूढचारिन्, गूढनीडः, गूढपथः, गूढपाद्, गूढपादः, गूढपुरुषः, गूढपुष्पकः, गूढभाषितम्, गूढमार्गः, गूढमैथुनः, गूढवर्चस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूढाङ्गः|गूढाङ्ग|गूढांग
