गूढार्थ|गूढार्थः
गूढ + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> having a hidden meaning (cf. ˚चन्द्रिका, -तत्त्वदीपिका, -दीपिका<BR> &c. N. of different commentaries).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूढार्थः|गूढार्थ
गूढ + -अर्थः the hidden or mystic sense; Ā. L.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूढात्मन्
गूढ + -आत्मन् (the compound word being गूढोत्मन् thus accounted for<BR> in Sk.; भवेद् वर्णागमाद् हंसः सिंहो वर्णविपर्ययात् । गूढोत्मा वर्णविकृतेर्वर्णलोपात्पृषोदरः)<BR> the Supreme soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

