गूढोत्पन्नः|गूढोत्पन्न
गूढ + -उत्पन्नः, -जः one of the 12 kinds of sons in Hindu law; he is<BR> a son born secretly of a woman, when her husband is absent, the real father<BR> being unknown; गृहे प्रच्छन्न उत्पन्नो गूढजस्तु सुतः स्मृतः Y. 2. 129;<BR> Ms. 9. 159, 170.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गूढजः|गूढज
गूढ + -उत्पन्नः, -जः one of the 12 kinds of sons in Hindu law; he is<BR> a son born secretly of a woman, when her husband is absent, the real father<BR> being unknown; गृहे प्रच्छन्न उत्पन्नो गूढजस्तु सुतः स्मृतः Y. 2. 129;<BR> Ms. 9. 159, 170.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0667-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

