गृहावग्रहणी
गृहम् + -अवग्रहणी the threshold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0668-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहाश्मन्
गृहम् + -अश्मन् <i>m.</i> a flat oblong stone upon which condiments are<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">Page0669-1</a>]<BR> ground (Mar. पाटा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0668-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहागत|गृहागतः
गृहम् + -आगत <i>a.</i> one who has come to a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहागतः|गृहागत
गृहम् + -आगत + ({@-तः@}) a guest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहाचारः|गृहाचार
गृहम् + -आचारः household or domestic business; U. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहारम्भः|गृहारम्भ
गृहम् + -आरम्भः building a house; गृहारम्भातिदुःखाय Bhāg. 11. 9. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहारामः|गृहाराम
गृहम् + -आरामः, -वाटी, -वाटिका a garden attached to a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहाशया
गृहम् + -आशया, -आश्रया the betel-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहाश्रया
गृहम् + -आशया, -आश्रया the betel-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहाश्रमः|गृहाश्रम
गृहम् + -आश्रमः the order of a householder, the second stage in the religious<BR> life of a Bāhmaṇa; see आश्रम; Ms. 6. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहाश्रमिन्
गृहम् + -आश्रमिन् <i>m.</i> a householder; Bhāg. 10. 80. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहेश्वरी
गृहम् + -ईश्वरी a housewife; दिष्टया गृहेश्वर्यसकृन्मयि त्वया कृतानुवृत्तिर्भवमोचनी<BR> खलैः Bhāg. 10. 60. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहोत्पातः|गृहोत्पात
गृहम् + -उत्पातः any domestic nuisance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहोपकरणम्
गृहम् + -उपकरणम् a domestic utensil, anything required for household<BR> use; एकदा निर्गता क्रेतुं गृहोपकरणानि सा Ks. 20. 150.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकच्छपः|गृहकच्छप
गृहम् + -कच्छपः = गृहाश्मन् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकन्या
