गृहकर्तृ|गृहकर्त्तृ
गृहम् + -कर्तृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 ‘a house-builder’, a kind of sparrow.<BR>—2 a carpenter; गृहकर्ता भवानेव देवानां हृदयेप्सितम् Rām. 7. 5. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकर्मन्
गृहम् + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 household affairs.<BR>—2 a domestic rite. ˚करः, ˚कारः, ˚दासः a menial, domestic servant;<BR> शंभुस्वयंभुहरयो हरिणेक्षणानां येनाक्रियन्त सततं गृहकर्मदासाः Bh. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकलहः|गृहकलह
गृहम् + -कलहः domestic feuds, intestine broils.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकारकः|गृहकारक
गृहम् + -कारकः a house-builder, mason; करोति तृणमृत्काष्ठैर्गृहं वा<BR> गृहकारकः Y. 3. 146.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकारिन्
गृहम् + -कारिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a house-builder.<BR>—2 a kind of wasp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकुक्कुटः|गृहकुक्कुट
गृहम् + -कुक्कुटः a domestic cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकार्यम्
गृहम् + -कार्यम्, -कृत्यम् household affairs; सदा प्रहृष्टया भाव्यं गृहकार्येषु<BR> दक्षया Ms. 5. 150.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकृत्यम्
गृहम् + -कार्यम्, -कृत्यम् household affairs; सदा प्रहृष्टया भाव्यं गृहकार्येषु<BR> दक्षया Ms. 5. 150.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहगोधा
गृहम् + -गोधा, -गोधिका the small house-lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहगोधिका
गृहम् + -गोधा, -गोधिका the small house-lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहचुल्ली
गृहम् + -चुल्ली a house with two rooms contiguous to each other, but one<BR> facing west, the other east; Bṛ. S. 53. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहचेतस्
गृहम् + -चेतस् <i>a.</i> thinking only of oneʼs house; Bhāg. 9. 11. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहच्छिद्रम्
गृहम् + -छिद्रम्<BR>—1 a family-secret or scandal.<BR>—2 family dissensions; आयुर्वित्तं गृहच्छिद्रं मन्त्रमैथुनभेषजम् H. 1. 123.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहज
गृहम् + -ज, -जात <i>a.</i> born in the house (a slave &c.); Bṛ. S. 61. 7; Ms. 8. 415.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहजात
गृहम् + -ज, -जात <i>a.</i> born in the house (a slave &c.); Bṛ. S. 61. 7; Ms. 8. 415.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहजनः|गृहजन
गृहम् + -जनः family, members of a family, especially the wife; Mu. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहजालिका
गृहम् + -जालिका deceit, disguise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहज्ञानिन्
गृहम् + -ज्ञानिन् (also गृहेज्ञानिन्) ‘wise only in the inside of the house’<BR>, inexperienced, stupid, foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहतटी
गृहम् + -तटी a terrace in front of the house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहदारु
गृहम् + -दारु <i>n.</i> a house-post; नरपतिबले पार्श्वायाते स्थितं गृहदारुवत् Mk. 4. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहदाहः|गृहदाह
गृहम् + -दाहः setting a house on fire, incendiarism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहदासः|गृहदास
गृहम् + -दासः a domestic slave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहदासी
गृहम् + -दासी a female domestic slave; एकदा गृहदासीषु यशोदा नन्दगेहिनी ।<BR> कर्मान्तरनियुक्तासु निर्ममन्थ स्वयं दधि ॥ Bhāg. 10. 9. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहदीप्तिः|गृहदीप्ति
गृहम् + -दीप्तिः <i>f.</i> the splendour or ornament of a house, a virtuous<BR> woman; प्रजनार्थं महाभागाः पूजार्हा गृहदीप्तयः Ms. 9. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहदेवता
गृहम् + -देवता the goddess of a house; (pl.) a class of household deities; Ks. 4. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहदेहली
गृहम् + -देहली the threshold of a house; यासां बलिः सपदि मद्गृहदेहलीनाम् Mk. 1. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहनमनम्
गृहम् + -नमनम् wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहनाशनः|गृहनाशन
गृहम् + -नाशनः a wild pigeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहनीडः|गृहनीड
गृहम् + -नीडः a sparrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहपतिः|गृहपति
गृहम् + -पतिः<BR>—1 a householder; वामं गृहपतिं नय Rv. 6. 53. 2; a man who has<BR> entered on the second stage of life, one who, after having completed his<BR> studies, is married and settled.<BR>—2 a sacrificer.<BR>—3 the virtue of a householder; <i>i. e.</i> hospitality.<BR>—4 Ved. an epithet of Agni.<BR>—5 the maintenance of the sacred and perpetual fire.<BR>—6 the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">Page0669-2</a>]<BR> head or judge of a village; Mk. 2; Dk. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहपत्नी
गृहम् + -पत्नी Ved. ‘the mistress of a house’, the wife of the householder;<BR> गृहान् गच्छ गृहपत्नी यथासः Rv. 10. 85. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहपालः|गृहपाल
गृहम् + -पालः<BR>—1 the guardian of a house.<BR>—2 a house-dog; आस्तेऽवमत्योपन्यस्तं गृहपाल इवाहरन् Bhāg. 3. 30. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहपिण्डी
गृहम् + -पिण्डी <i>f.</i> the basement of a building; Kāmikāgama 55. 200-201.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहपोतकः|गृहपोतक
गृहम् + -पोतकः the site of a house, the ground on which it stands and<BR> which surrounds it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहपोषणम्
गृहम् + -पोषणम् maintenance of a household; तेन चास्य नियुक्ताभूत्स्वभार्या<BR> गृहपोषणे Ks. 2. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहप्रवेशः|गृहप्रवेश
गृहम् + -प्रवेशः a solemn entrance into a house according to prescribed rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहबभ्रुः|गृहबभ्रु
गृहम् + -बभ्रुः a domestic ichneumon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहबलिः|गृहबलि
गृहम् + -बलिः a domestic oblation, offering of the remnants of a meal<BR> to all creatures, such as animals, supernatural beings, and particularly<BR> household deities; Ms. 3. 265. ˚प्रियः a crane. ˚भुज् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a crow.<BR>—2 a sparrow; नीडारम्भैर्गृहबलिभुजामाकुलग्रामचैत्याः Me. 23. ˚देवता<BR> a deity to whom a domestic oblation is offered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहभङ्गः|गृहभङ्ग|गृहभंग
गृहम् + -भङ्गः<BR>—1 one who is driven from his house, an exile.<BR>—2 destroying a house.<BR>—3 breaking into a house.<BR>—4 failure, ruin or destruction of a house, firm &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहभञ्जनम्
गृहम् + -भञ्जनम्<BR>—1 breaking down or destroying a house.<BR>—2 causing the decay or ruin of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहभद्रकम्
गृहम् + -भद्रकम् an audience-hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहभर्तृ
गृहम् + -भर्तृ <i>m.</i> the master of a house; Bṛ. S. 53. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहभूमिः|गृहभूमि
गृहम् + -भूमिः <i>f.</i> the site of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहभेदिन्
गृहम् + -भेदिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 prying into domestic affairs.<BR>—2 causing domestic quarrels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहभोजिन्
गृहम् + -भोजिन् <i>m.</i> an inmate of the same house, tenant; तस्मादप्यग्रहारान्ये<BR> जगृहुर्गृहभोजिनः Rāj. T. 5. 403.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहमणिः|गृहमणि
गृहम् + -मणिः a lamp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहमाचिका
गृहम् + -माचिका a bat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहमार्जनी
गृहम् + -मार्जनी a female servant of the house; सख्योपेत्याग्रहीत्पाणिं<BR> योऽहं तद्गृहमार्जनी Bhāg. 10. 83. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहमृगः|गृहमृग
गृहम् + -मृगः a dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहमेघः|गृहमेघ
गृहम् + -मेघः a multitude of houses; Rām. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहमेध|गृहमेधः
गृहम् + -मेध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one who performs the domestic rites or sacrifices; गृहमेधास आ<BR> गत मरुतो माप भूतन Rv. 7. 59. 10.<BR>—2 connected with the duties of a householder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहमेधः|गृहमेध
गृहम् + -मेध + ({@-धः@})<BR>—1 a householder.<BR>—2 a domestic sacrifice; Bhāg. 2. 6. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहमेधिन्
गृहम् + -मेधिन् <i>m.</i> a householder, a married Brāhmaṇa who has a household;<BR> (गृहैर्दारैर्मेधन्ते संगच्छन्ते Malli.); प्रजायै गृहमेधिनाम् R. 1. 7;<BR> see गृहपति above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहमेधिनी
गृहम् + -मेधिन् + ({@-नी@})<BR>—1 the wife of a householder, a house-wife; न व्यचष्ट वरारोहां गृहिणीं<BR> गृहमेधिनीम् Bhāg. 4. 26. 13.<BR>—2 the intellect based on the Sattva quality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहयज्ञः|गृहयज्ञ
गृहम् + -यज्ञः see गृहमेधः; Mb. 10. 18. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहयन्त्रम्
गृहम् + -यन्त्रम् a stick or other instrument to which, on solemn occasions,<BR> flags are fastened; गृहयन्त्रपताकाश्रीरपौरादरनिर्मिता Ku. 6. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहरन्ध्रम्
गृहम् + -रन्ध्रम् family-dissensions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहवाटिका
गृहम् + -वाटिका, -वाटी a garden attached to a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहवाटी
गृहम् + -वाटिका, -वाटी a garden attached to a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहवित्तः|गृहवित्त
गृहम् + -वित्तः the owner of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहव्रत
गृहम् + -व्रत <i>a.</i> devoted to home; मतिर्न कृष्णे परतः स्वतो वा<BR> मिथोऽभिपद्येत गृहव्रतानाम् Bhāg. 7. 5. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहशायिन्
गृहम् + -शायिन् <i>m.</i> a pigeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहशुकः|गृहशुक
गृहम् + -शुकः<BR>—1 a domestic parrot, one kept for pleasure; Amaru. 16.<BR>—2 a domestic poet; आयातेन शुकैः सार्धं दत्ता गृहशुकेन यः । मुक्ताः<BR> प्राप्य प्रतिष्ठायां चक्रे ख्यातां शुकावलीम् ॥ Rāj. T. 5. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहसंवेशकः|गृहसंवेशक
गृहम् + -संवेशकः a house-builder by profession; Ms. 3. 163.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहसार
गृहम् + -सार property; गृहीतसारमेनं सपुत्रकलत्रं संयम्य Mu. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहस्थः|गृहस्थ
गृहम् + -स्थः a householder, one who has entered on the stage of a house-holder;<BR> संकटा ह्याहिताग्नीनां प्रत्यवायैर्गृहस्थता U. 1. 9; see गृहपति<BR> above and Ms. 3. 68, 6. 90. ˚आश्रमः the life of a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">Page0670-1</a>]<BR> householder; see गृहाश्रम. ˚धर्मः the duty of a householder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0669-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहस्थूणा
गृहम् + -स्थूणा the pillar of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहकम्
गृहकम् A garden (वाटिका); कदलीगृहकं गत्वा Rām. 3. 42. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहयाय्यः|गृहयाय्य
गृहयाय्यः A householder; (according to Tv. the form गृहयाप्य<BR> given in शब्दकल्पद्रुम is not correct).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहवत्|गृहवन्त्
गृहवत् <i>m.</i> The possessor of a house, house-holder; तथान्यासामपि<BR> विभुर्गृहेषु गृहवानिव Bhāg. 10. 60. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहयालु|गृहयालुः
गृहयालु <i>a.</i> Disposed to catch hold of or seize.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहालिका
गृहा(हो)लिका A small house-lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहोलिका
गृहा(हो)लिका A small house-lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहिणी
गृहिणी ‘The mistress of a house’, a wife, house-wife; (the lady in<BR> charge of the house); न गृहं गृहमित्याहुर्गृहिणी गृहमुच्यते । गृहं<BR> तु गृहिणीहीनं कान्तारादतिरिच्यते Pt. 4. 81.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गृहिणीपदम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहिणीपदम्
गृहिणी + -पदम् the position or dignity of the mistress of the house; यान्त्येवं<BR> गृहिणीपदं युवतयो वामाः कुलस्याधयः Ś. 4. 18; स्थिता गृहिणीपदे 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहिन्
गृहिन् <i>a.</i> [गृह-इनि] Possessing a house. ━<i>m.</i> The master<BR> of a house, a householder; पीड्यन्ते गृहिणः कथं नु तनयाविश्लेषदुःखैर्नवैः<BR> Ś. 4. 6; U. 2. 22; Śānti. 2. 24; Pt. 2. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहीभू
गृहीभू To serve as a house; तरुमूलानि गृहीभवन्ति तेषाम् Ś. 7. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृह्य|गृह्यं|गृह्यः
गृह्य <i>a.</i> [गृह् क्यप्]<BR>—1 To be attracted or pleased, as in गुणगृह्य q. v.<BR>—2 Domestic; गृह्याणां चैव देवानां नित्यपुष्पबलिक्रिया Mb. 13. 141. 43.<BR>—3 Not master of oneself, dependent.<BR>—4 Tame, domesticated.<BR>—5 Situated out-side of; ग्रामगृह्या सेना ‘an army out-side a village’.<BR>—6 Adhering to the party of, being in close relation to; तमार्यगृह्यम् R. 2. 33.<BR>—7 Perceptible; Śvet. Up. 1. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृह्यः|गृह्य|गृह्यं
गृह्य + .{@-ह्यः@}<BR>—1 The inmate of a house.<BR>—2 A tame animal or bird.<BR>—3 The domestic fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृह्यम्
गृह्य + .{@-ह्यम्@}<BR>—1 The anus.<BR>—2 A suburb; L. D. B.<BR>—3 A domestic affair; गृह्याणि कर्तुमपि Bhāg. 10. 8. 25.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गृह्याग्निः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृह्याग्निः|गृह्याग्नि
गृह्य + -अग्निः a sacred fire which every Brāhmaṇa is enjoined to maintain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृह्यक|गृह्यकः
गृह्यक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tame, domestic.<BR>—2 Dependent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृह्यकः|गृह्यक
गृह्यक + .{@-कः@} A tame animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहणी
गृहणी Sour gruel made from the fermentations of rice water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृहीत|गृहीतं
गृहीत See under ग्रह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गृह्या
गृह्या A village adjoining to a city; a suburb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गॄ
गॄ I. €9 P. (गृणाति, गूर्ण)<BR>—1 To utter a sound, call out, invoke; नामापि नाम गृणताममृतत्वाय<BR> कल्पताम् Mv. 7. 15.<BR>—2 To announce, speak, utter, proclaim; ब्रह्मर्षिभिः परं ब्रह्म गृणद्भिरुपतस्थिरे R. 10. 63.<BR>—3 To relate, promulgate.<BR>—4 To praise, extol; केचिद्भीताः प्राञ्जलयो गृणन्ति Bg. 11. 21; Bk. 8. 77.<BR> ━<i>With</i> {@अनु@} to encourage; गृणद्भ्योऽनुगृणन्त्यन्ये Bk. 8. 77.<BR>━II. €6 P. (गिरति or गिलति)<BR>—1 To swallow,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">Page0670-2</a>]<BR> devour, eat up.<BR>—2 To send forth, pour out, spit out, or eject, from the mouth. ━<i>With</i> {@अव@}<BR> (Ātm.) to eat, devour; तथावगिरमाणैश्च पिशाचैर्मांसशोणितम् Bk. 8. 30.<BR>━III. €10 Ā. (गारयते)<BR>—1 To make known, relate.<BR>—2 To teach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गीर्ण|गीर्णः|गीर्ण्ण
गीर्ण <i>a.</i> [गॄ कर्मणि-क्त]<BR>—1 Swallowed, eaten up.<BR>—2 Described, praised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गीर्णिः|गीर्णि|गीर्ण्णि
गीर्णिः <i>f.</i> [गॄ भावे क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Praise.<BR>—2 Fame.<BR>—3 Eating up, swallowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेण्डुकः|गेण्डुक|गेंडुक|गेंडुकः
गेण्डु(दु)कः<BR>—1 A ball for playing with (also गेण्डूक).<BR>—2 A cushion; Śi. 2. 77. com. ‘उपधानं विशेषे स्याद्गेन्दुके प्रणयेऽपि च’ इति विश्वः ।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेण्दुकः
गेण्डु(दु)कः<BR>—1 A ball for playing with (also गेण्डूक).<BR>—2 A cushion; Śi. 2. 77. com. ‘उपधानं विशेषे स्याद्गेन्दुके प्रणयेऽपि च’ इति विश्वः ।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेप्
गेप् €1 Ā. (गेपते) To shake, tremble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेव्
गेव् €1 Ā. (गेवते) To serve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेष्
गेष् €1 Ā. (गेषते, गेष्ण) To seek, search, investigate; cf. गवेष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेहम्
गेहम् [गो गणेशो गन्धर्वो वा ईहः ईप्सितो यत्र Tv.] A house,<BR> habitation; सा नारी विधवा जाता गेहे रोदिति तत्पतिः Subhāṣ.<BR> <i>N. B.</i> The loc. of this word is used with several words to form <i>aluk</i><BR> Tat. compounds; <i>e. g.</i> गेहेक्ष्वेडिन् <i>a.</i> ‘bellowing at home only’,<BR> <i>i. e.</i> a coward, poltroon. गेहेदाहिन् <i>a.</i> ‘sharp at home only’<BR> <i>i. e.</i> a coward. गेहेनर्दिन् <i>a.</i> ‘shouting defiance at home only’;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> a coward, dunghill-cock; यद् गेहेनर्दिनमसौ शरैर्भीरुमभाययत्<BR> Bk. 5. 41. गेहेमेहिन् <i>a.</i> ‘making water at home’; <i>i. e.</i> indolent.<BR> गेहेव्याडः a braggadocio, braggart, boaster. गेहेशूरः ‘a house-hero’,<BR> a carpet-knight, boasting coward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेहिन्
गेहिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) = गृहिन् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेहिनी
गेहिनी A wife, the mistress of the house; यशोदा नन्दगेहिनी<BR> Bhāg. 10. 9. 1; धैर्यं यस्य पिता क्षमा च जननी शान्तिश्चिरं गेहिनी<BR> Śānti. 4. 9; मद्गेहिन्याः प्रिय इति सखे चेतसा कातरेण Me. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेह्य
गेह्य <i>a.</i> Domestic, being in a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेह्यम्
गेह्य + .{@-ह्यम्@}<BR>—1 Domestic affair.<BR>—2 Wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गै
गै €1 P. (गायति, जगौ, अगासीत्, गास्यति, गातुम्, गीत)<BR>—1 To sing, sing a song; अहो साधु रेभिलेन गीतम् Mk. 3; ग्रीष्मसमयमधिकृत्य<BR> गीयताम् Ś. 1; Ms. 4. 64, 9. 42.<BR>—2 To speak or recite in a singing tone.<BR>—3 To relate, declare, tell (especially in metrical language); गीतश्चायमर्थोङ्गिरसा Māl. 2.<BR>—4 To describe, relate or celebrate in song; चारणद्वन्द्वगीतः Ś. 2. 15;<BR> प्रभवस्तस्य गीयते Ku. 2. 5. ━<i>Caus.</i> (गापयति-ते)<BR> To cause to sing or praise in song; जयोदाहरणं बाह्वोर्गापयामास किन्नरान्<BR> R. 4. 78, 15. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गातव्य
गातव्य <i>a.</i> To be sung; what may be sung.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गातुः|गातु
गातुः<BR>—1 A song.<BR>—2 A singer.<BR>—3 A bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गातृ
गातृ <i>a.</i> (-त्री <i>f.</i>) [गै-गाने तृच्]<BR>—1 Singer.<BR>—2 Angry. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A singer; एतान्सर्वान्समानीय गातारौ समवेशयत् Rām. 7. 94. 9;<BR> Ch. Up. 1. 6. 8.<BR>—2 A Gandharva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0670-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाथः|गाथ
गाथः A song, singing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाथकः|गाथक
गाथकः, -थिकः<BR> [गै-थकन्]<BR>—1 A musician, singer; समस्ता गाथकगणाः पार्थिवस्पर्धितां ययुः<BR> Rāj. T. 7. 933.<BR>—2 A chanter of sacred poems or Purāṇas; क्वणद्भिरलिगाथकैः Bk. 6. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाथिकः|गाथिक
गाथकः, -थिकः<BR> [गै-थकन्]<BR>—1 A musician, singer; समस्ता गाथकगणाः पार्थिवस्पर्धितां ययुः<BR> Rāj. T. 7. 933.<BR>—2 A chanter of sacred poems or Purāṇas; क्वणद्भिरलिगाथकैः Bk. 6. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाथा
गाथा<BR>—1 Verse.<BR>—2 A religious verse, but not belonging to any one of the Vedas.<BR>—3 A stanza.<BR>—4 A song; कदा वाहेयिका गाथाः पुनर्गास्यामि शाकले Mb. 8. 44. 26.<BR>—5 A Prākṛta dialect.<BR>—6 N. of the Aryā metre.<BR>—7 Legend, history (आख्यान); द्विजोपसृष्टः कुहकस्तक्षको वा दशत्वलं<BR> गायत विष्णुगाथाः Bhāg. 1. 19. 15.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गाथाकारः, गाथानाराशंसी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाथाकारः|गाथाकार
गाथा + -कारः a writer of Prākṛta verses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाथानाराशंसी
गाथा + -नाराशंसी epic songs and particularly those in praise of men or heroes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गाथिका
गाथिका A song, verse; Y. 1. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गानम्
गानम् [गै भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Singing, a song.<BR>—2 A sound.<BR>—3 Going.<BR>—4 Praise.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गानविद्या<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गानविद्या
गानम् + -विद्या the science of vocal music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गानिन्
गानिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Going, moving.<BR>—2 Singing, praising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गानिनी
गानिन् + .{@-नी@} A plant used in clearing the voice (Mar. वेखण्ड).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गानीय
गानीय <i>a.</i> Musical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गानीयम्
गानीय + .{@-यम्@} A song; Rām. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गायः|गाय
गायः A song; यथाविधानेन पठन् सामगायमविच्युतम् Y. 3. 112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेय|गेयं|गेयः
गेय <i>pot. p.</i> [गै कर्तरि नि˚ यत्]<BR>—1 A singer, one who sings; गेयो माणवकः साम्नाम् P. III. 4. 68. Sk.<BR>—2 To be sung.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेयम्
गेय + .{@-यम्@} A song, singing, also the art of singing; गेये केन विनीतौ<BR> वाम् R. 15. 69; Me. 88; अनन्ता वाङ्मयस्याहो गेयस्येव विचित्रता Śi. 2. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेष्णः|गेष्ण
गेष्णः<BR>—1 A singer, a professional singer; Ch. Up. 1. 6.<BR>—2 An actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गेष्णुः|गेष्णु
गेष्णुः [गै इष्णुच्] A singer, an actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गैर
गैर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>) [गिरौ भवः अण्] Coming from<BR> a mountain, mountain born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गैरिक|गैरिकं|गैरिकः
गैरिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [गिरौ भवः ठञ्] Mountain-born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गैरिकः|गैरिक|गैरिकं
गैरिक + .{@-कः, -कम्@} Red chalk; संसर्पिभिः पयसि गैरिकरेणुरागैः Śi. 5. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गैरिकम्
गैरिक + .{@-कः, -कम्@} Red chalk; संसर्पिभिः पयसि गैरिकरेणुरागैः Śi. 5. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गैरिकम्
गैरिक + .{@-कम्@} Gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गैरेय|गैरेयं
गैरेय <i>a.</i> [गिरौ भवः ढक्] Mountain-born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

