गोकृतम्
गो + -कृतम् cow-dung.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोक्षीरम्
गो + -क्षीरम् cowʼs milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोक्षुरम्
गो + -क्षुरम्, -क्षुरकम् a cowʼs hoof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोक्षुरकम्
गो + -क्षुरम्, -क्षुरकम् a cowʼs hoof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोखरः
गो + -खरः a beast (पशु); यत्तीर्थबुद्धिः सलिले न कर्हिचिज्जनेष्वभिज्ञेषु<BR> स एव गोखरः Bhāg. 10. 84. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोखा
गो + -खा a nail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोगृष्टिः|गोगृष्टि
गो + -गृष्टिः a young cow which has had only one calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोगोयुगम्
गो + -गोयुगम् a pair of oxen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोगोष्ठम्
गो + -गोष्ठम् a cow-pen, cattle-shed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोग्रन्थिः|गोग्रन्थि|गोग्रंथि
गो + -ग्रन्थिः<BR>—1 dried cowdung.<BR>—2 a cow-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोग्रहः|गोग्रह
गो + -ग्रहः capture of cattle (गवालम्भ); Mb. 12. 265. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोग्रासः|गोग्रास
गो + -ग्रासः the ceremony of offering a morsel (of grass) to a cow<BR> when performing an expiatory rite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोघातः|गोघात
गो + -घातः, -घातकः, -घातिन् <i>m.</i> a cow-killer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोघातकः|गोघातक
गो + -घातः, -घातकः, -घातिन् <i>m.</i> a cow-killer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोघातिन्
गो + -घातः, -घातकः, -घातिन् <i>m.</i> a cow-killer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोघृतम्
गो + -घृतम्<BR>—1 rain-water.<BR>—2 clarified butter coming from a cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोघ्न|गोघ्नः
गो + -घ्न <i>a.</i><BR>—1 destructive to cows.<BR>—2 one who has killed a cow.<BR>—3 one for whom a cow is killed, a guest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोचन्दनम्
गो + -चन्दनम् a kind of sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोचर|गोचरः
गो + -चर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 grazed over by cattle.<BR>—2 frequenting, dwelling, resorting to, haunting पितृसद्मगोचरः Ku. 5. 77.<BR>—3 within the scope, power, or range of; अवाङ्मनसगोचरम् R. 10. 15;<BR> so बुद्धि˚, दृष्टि˚, श्रवण˚ स्वगोचरे दीप्ततरा बभूव Bu. C. 1. 13.<BR>—4 moving on earth.<BR>—5 accessible to, attainable; त्यागसूक्ष्मानुगः क्षेम्यः शौचगो ध्यानगोचरः<BR> Mb. 12. 236. 12.<BR>—6 circulating, having a particular meaning, prevalent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोचरः|गोचर
गो + -चर + ({@-रः@})<BR>—1 the range of cattle, pasturage; उपारताः पश्चिम-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">Page0672-1</a>]<BR> -रात्रिगोचरात् Ki. 4. 10.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) a district, department, province, sphere.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) an abode, dwelling-place, a place of resort; Śi. 1. 21; Ms. 10. 39.<BR>—3 range of the organs of sense, an object of sense; श्रवणगोचरे तिष्ठ<BR> be within ear-shot; नयनगोचरं या to become visible.<BR>—4 scope, range, in general; हर्तुर्याति न गोचरम् Bh. 2. 16.<BR>—5 (fig.) grip, hold, power, influence, control; कः कालस्य न गोचरान्तरगतः<BR> Pt. 1. 146; गोचरीभूतमक्ष्णोः U. 6. 26; Māl. 5. 24; अपि नाम मनागवतीर्णोऽसि<BR> रतिरमणबाणगोचरम् Māl. 1.<BR>—6 horizon.<BR>—7 field for action, scope; इन्द्रियाणि हयानाहुर्विषयांस्तेषु गोचरान् Kaṭh. 3. 4.<BR>—8 the range of the planets from the Lagna or from each other. {@˚पीडा@}<BR> inauspicious position of stars within the ecliptic; गोचरपीडायामपि<BR> राशिर्बलिभिः शुभग्रहैर्दृष्टः (पीडां न करोति) Bṛ. S. 41. 13.<BR> (गोचरीकृ to place within the range (of sight), make current).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0671-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोचर्मन्|गोचर्म्मन्
गो + -चर्मन् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 a cowʼs hide.<BR>—2 a particular measure of surface thus defined by Vasiṣṭha:− दशहस्तेन<BR> वंशेन दशवंशान् समन्ततः । पञ्च चाभ्यधिकान् दद्यादेतद्गोचर्म चोच्यते<BR> ॥ ˚वसनः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोचर्या
गो + -चर्या seeking food like a cow; गोचर्यां नैगमश्चरेत् Bhāg. 11. 18. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोचारकः|गोचारक
गो + -चारकः cowherd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोचरणम्
गो + -चरणम् the tending or feeding of cows; Bhāg. 10. 38. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोज
गो + -ज <i>a.</i><BR>—1 born in the earth (rice &c.).<BR>—2 produced by milk; अब्जा गोजा … … Kaṭh. 5. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोजरः|गोजर
गो + -जरः an old ox or bull; नाद्रियन्ते यथापूर्वं कीनाशा इव गोजरम्<BR> Bhāg. 3. 30. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोजलम्
गो + -जलम् the urine of a bull or cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोजागरिकम्
गो + -जागरिकम् auspiciousness, happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोजागरिकः|गोजागरिक|गोजागरिकं
गो + -जागरिकम् + .({@-कः@}) a preparer of food, baker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोजात
गो + -जात <i>a.</i> born in the heaven (gods); गोजाता अप्या मृळता च<BR> देवाः Rv. 6. 50. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

