गो + -जिह्वा N. of a plant (Mar. पाथरी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोजिह्विका
गो + -जिह्विका the uvula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोजीव
गो + -जीव <i>a.</i> living on cattle (milk-man); Hc. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोतल्लजः|गोतल्लज
गो + -तल्लजः an excellent bull or cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोतीर्थम्
गो + -तीर्थम् a cow-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोत्रम्
गो + -त्रम् [गां भूमिं त्रायते त्रै-क]<BR>—1 a cow-pen.<BR>—2 a stable in general.<BR>—3 a family, race, lineage; गोत्रेण माठरोऽस्मि Sk.; so कौशिकगोत्राः,<BR> वसिष्ठगोत्राः &c.; Ms. 3. 109, 9. 141.<BR>—4 a name, appellation; जगाद गोत्रस्खलिते च का न तम् N. 1. 30;<BR> Ś. 6. 5; see ˚स्खलित below; मद्गोत्राङ्कं विरचितपदं गेयमुद्गातुकामा Me. 88.<BR>—5 a multitude.<BR>—6 increase.<BR>—7 a forest.<BR>—8 a field.<BR>—9 a road.<BR>—10 possessions, wealth.<BR>—11 an umbrella, a parasol.<BR>—12 knowledge of futurity.<BR>—13 a genus, class, species.<BR>—14 a caste, tribe, caste according to families.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोत्रः|गोत्र|गोत्रं
गो + -त्रम् + .({@-त्रः@}) a mountain; ‘गोत्रं नाम्नि कुलेऽप्यद्रौ’ इति यादवः;<BR> Śi. 9. 80. Hence गोत्रोद्दलनः means Indra; cf. इन्द्रे तु गोत्रोद्दलनः<BR> कुलघ्ने गिरिदारणे Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोत्रा
गो + -त्रम् + .({@-त्रः@}) + ({@-त्रा@})<BR>—1 a multitude of cows.<BR>—2 the earth. {@˚उच्चारः@} recitation of family pedigree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोत्रकर्तृ
गो + -त्रकर्तृ, -त्रकारिन् <i>m.</i> the founder of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोत्रकारिन्
गो + -त्रकर्तृ, -त्रकारिन् <i>m.</i> the founder of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोत्रकीला
गो + -त्रकीला the earth. {@˚ज@}<i>a.</i> born in the same family, gentile, a relation; Bhāg. 3. 7. 24;<BR> Y. 2. 135. {@˚पटः@} a genealogical table, pedigree. {@˚प्रवरः@}<BR> the oldest member or founder of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोत्रभिद्
गो + -त्रभिद् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Indra; हृदि क्षतो गोत्रभिदप्यमर्षणः<BR> R. 3. 53, 6. 73; Ku. 2. 52. {@˚स्खलनम्, ˚स्खलितम्@} blundering or<BR> mistaking in calling (one) by his name, calling by a wrong name; स्मरसि<BR> स्मर मेखलागुणैरुत गोत्रस्खलितेषु बन्धनम् Ku. 4. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोद|गोदः
गो + -द <i>a.</i> giving cows; Ms. 4. 231.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदः|गोद
गो + -द + .({@-दः@}) brain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदा
गो + -द + .({@-दा@}) N. of the river Godāvarī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदत्र|गोदत्रः
गो + -दत्र <i>a.</i> Ved. giving cows.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">Page0672-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदत्रः|गोदत्र
गो + -दत्र + .({@-त्रः@}) an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदत्रम्
गो + -दत्र + .({@-त्रम्@}) a crown (protecting the head).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदन्त|गोदंत|गोदन्तं
गो + -दन्त <i>a.</i> armed with a coat of mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदन्तम्
गो + -दन्त + ({@-तम्@})<BR>—1 yellow orpiment.<BR>—2 a white fossil substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदानम्
गो + -दानम्<BR>—1 the gift of a cow.<BR>—2 the ceremony of tonsure or cutting the hair; रामलक्ष्मणयो राजन्<BR> गोदानं कारयस्व ह Rām. 1. 71. 23; अथास्य गोदानविधेरनन्तरम्<BR> R. 3. 33; (see Mallināthaʼs explanation of the word); कृतगोदानमङ्गलाः<BR> U. 1; अतोनं गोदानं दारकर्म च Kau. A. 1. 5; (Rām. explains the<BR> word differently).<BR>—3 the part of the head close to the right ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदाय
गो + -दाय <i>a.</i> intending to give cows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदारणम्
गो + -दारणम्<BR>—1 a plough.<BR>—2 a spade, hoe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदा
गो + -दा, -दावरी N. of a river in the south.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदावरी
