गोदुह्
गो + -दुह् <i>m.</i>, {@-दुहः@}<BR> ‘cow-milker’, a cowherd; सुदुघामिव गोदुहे R. 1. 4. 1;<BR> चिरं निदध्यौ दुहतः स गोदुहः Śi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदोहः|गोदोह
गो + -दोहः<BR>—1 the milking of cows.<BR>—2 the milk of cows.<BR>—3 the time of milking cows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदोहनम्
गो + -दोहनम्<BR>—1 the time of milking cows.<BR>—2 the milking of cows; न लक्ष्यते ह्यवस्थानमपि गोदोहनं क्वचित्<BR> Bhāg. 1. 19. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोदोहनी
गो + -दोहनी a milk-pail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोद्रवः|गोद्रव
गो + -द्रवः the urine of a bull or cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधनम्
गो + -धनम्<BR>—1 a herd or multitude of cows, cattle.<BR>—2 possession of cows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधनः|गोधन|गोधनं
गो + -धनम् + .({@-नः@}) a broad-pointed arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधरः|गोधर
गो + -धरः a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधर्मः|गोधर्म|गोधर्म्म
गो + -धर्मः the law of cattle, rules relating to cattle; (open and<BR> unconcealed intercourse of the sexes); गोधर्मं सौरभेयाच्च सोऽधीत्य<BR> निखिलं मुनिः । प्रावर्तत तदा कर्तुं श्रद्धावांस्तमशङ्कया ॥ Mb. 1. 104. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधुमः|गोधुम
गो + -धुमः, -धूमः<BR>—1 wheat; Bṛ. Up. 6. 3. 13.<BR>—2 the orange. ˚चूर्णम् wheat flour;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधूमः|गोधूम
गो + -धुमः, -धूमः<BR>—1 wheat; Bṛ. Up. 6. 3. 13.<BR>—2 the orange. ˚चूर्णम् wheat flour;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोसम्भवम्
गो + -सम्भवम् a sour paste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधूलिः|गोधूलि
गो + -धूलिः ‘dust of the cows’, the time of sunset or evening twilight<BR> (so called because cows, which generally return home at about sunset,<BR> raise up clouds of dust by their treading on the earth).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधेनुः|गोधेनु
गो + -धेनुः a milch-cow with a calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोध्रः|गोध्र
गो + -ध्रः a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनन्दा
गो + -नन्दा an epithet of the wife of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनन्दी|गोनंदी
गो + -नन्दी the female of the Sārasa bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनर्दः|गोनर्द|गोनर्द्द|गोनर्द्दं|गोनर्द्दः
गो + -नर्दः<BR>—1 the (Indian) crane.<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva (bellowing like a bull).<BR>—3 N. of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनर्दीयः|गोनर्दीय|गोनर्द्दीय|गोनर्द्दीयः
गो + -नर्दीयः an epithet of Patañjali, author of the Mahābhāṣya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनसः|गोनस
गो + -नसः, -नासः<BR>—1 a kind of snake.<BR>—2 a kind of gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनासः|गोनास|गोनासं
गो + -नसः, -नासः<BR>—1 a kind of snake.<BR>—2 a kind of gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनसा
गो + -नसा the mouth of a cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनाथः|गोनाथ
गो + -नाथः<BR>—1 a bull.<BR>—2 an owner of land.<BR>—3 a herdsman.<BR>—4 an owner of kine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनायः|गोनाय
गो + -नायः a cowherd; तद्यथा गोनायोऽश्वनायः पुरुषनाय इत्येवं<BR> तदप आचक्षतेऽशनायेति Ch. Up. 6. 8. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनाशनः|गोनाशन
गो + -नाशनः a wolf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनासा
गो + -नासा the projecting snout of a cow or ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनासम्
गो + -नासम् a kind of gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोनिष्यन्दः|गोनिष्यन्द|गोनिष्यंद
गो + -निष्यन्दः cowʼs urine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपः|गोप
गो + -पः<BR>—1 a cowherd (considered as belonging to a mixed tribe); गोपवेशस्य<BR> विष्णोः Me. 15.<BR>—2 the chief of a cow-pen.<BR>—3 the superintendent of a village.<BR>—4 a king.<BR>—5 a protector, guardian; Rv. 10. 61. 10. {@˚अनसी@} the wood of a<BR> thatch; गोपानसीषु क्षणमास्थितानाम् Śi. 3. 49. {@˚अष्टमी@} the<BR> eighth day of the bright fortnight of Kārttika when Kṛṣṇa is said<BR> to have worn the dress of a cowherd. {@˚आटविका@} a cowherd. {@˚कन्या@}<BR>—1 the daughter of a cowherd.<BR>—2 a nymph of Vṛndāvana. {@˚अध्यक्षः, ˚इन्द्रः, ˚ईशः@} the chief<BR> of herdsmen, an epithet of Kṛṣṇa. {@˚चापः@} the rainbow. {@˚दलः@}<BR> the betel-nut tree. {@˚भद्रम्@} the fibrous root of a water-lily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपरसः|गोपरस
गो + -परसः gum myrrh. {@˚राष्ट्राः@} (pl.) N. of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">Page0673-1</a>]<BR> a people. ˚वधूः <i>f.</i> a cowherdʼs wife; Bhāg. 1. 9. 40. ˚वधूटी<BR> a young cowherdess, a young wife of a cowherd; गोपवधूटीदुकूलचौराय Bhāṣā P. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपकः|गोपक
गो + -परसः + .({@-पकः@})<BR>—1 the superintendent of a district.<BR>—2 myrrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपिका
गो + -परसः + .({@-पिका@})<BR>—1 a cowherdess; Bhāg. 10. 9. 14-15.<BR>—2 protectress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपी
गो + -परसः + .({@-पी@}) a cowherdʼs wife (especially applied to the cowherdesses<BR> of Vṛndāvana, the companions of Kṛṣṇa in his juvenile sports).<BR>—2 a milk-maid.<BR>—3 a protectress.<BR>—4 Nature, elementary nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0672-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपतिः|गोपति
गो + -पतिः<BR>—1 an owner of cows.<BR>—2 a bull.<BR>—3 a leader, chief.<BR>—4 the sun; नीहारमिव गोपतिः Bhāg. 1. 12. 10; Mb. 1. 173. 32.<BR>—5 Indra; सुराङ्गना गोपतिचापगोपुरं पुरम् (जहुः) Ki. 8. 1.<BR>—6 N. of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—7 N. of Śiva.<BR>—8 N. of Varuṇa; एष पुत्रो महाप्रज्ञो वरुणस्येह गोपतेः Mb. 5. 98. 11.<BR>—9 a king; नासतो विद्यते राजन् स ह्यरण्येषु गोपतिः Mb. 12. 135. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपथः|गोपथ
गो + -पथः N. of a Brāhmaṇa of Av.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपर्वतम्
गो + -पर्वतम् the name of the place where Pāṇini is said to have<BR> performed penance and propitiated Śiva; गोपर्वतमिति स्थानं शम्भोः<BR> प्रख्यापितं मया । यत्र पाणिनिना लेभे वैयाकरणिकाग्र्यता ॥ अरुणाचलमाहात्म्यमुत्तरार्धः २ अ॰ ६८ श्लो॰<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपशुः|गोपशु
गो + -पशुः a sacrificial cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपाः
गो + -पाः <i>m.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 a herdsman.<BR>—2 protector, or guardian; मन्द्राग्रेत्वरी भुवनस्य गोपा Av. 12. 1. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपानसी
गो + -पानसी a curved beam which supports a thatch; गोपानसी तु वलभिच्छादने<BR> वक्रदारुणि Ak. 2. 2. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपालः|गोपाल
गो + -पालः<BR>—1 a cowherd; Ms. 4. 253.<BR>—2 a king.<BR>—3 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—4 an epithet of Kṛṣṇa. ˚धानी a cow-pen, cow-shed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपालकः|गोपालक
गो + -पालकः<BR>—1 a cowherd.<BR>—2 a king. —3 an epithet of Śiva; also of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपालिः|गोपालि
गो + -पालिः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपालिका
गो + -पालिका, -पाली the wife of a cowherd; पार्थः प्रस्थापयामासकृत्वा<BR> गोपालिकावपुः Mb. 1. 221. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपाली
गो + -पालिका, -पाली the wife of a cowherd; पार्थः प्रस्थापयामासकृत्वा<BR> गोपालिकावपुः Mb. 1. 221. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपालितः|गोपालित
गो + -पालितः N. of a lexicographer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपित्तम्
गो + -पित्तम् bile of cows, ox-bile (from which the yellow pigment गोरोचना<BR> is prepared; गोपित्ततो रोचना Pt. 1. 94.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपीतः|गोपीत
गो + -पीतः a species of wagtail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपीथः|गोपीथ|गोपीथं
