गोपीथम्
गो + -पीथः + .({@-थम्@}) a holy place, a place of pilgrimage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोपुच्छम्
