गोप्रवेशः|गोप्रवेश
गो + -प्रवेशः the time when cows return home, sunset or evening-twilight;<BR> गोप्रवेशसमये Bṛ. S. 24. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोफणा
गो + -फणा<BR>—1 a bandage hollowed out so as to fit the chin or nose &c.<BR>—2 a sling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

