गोमक्षिका
गो + -मक्षिका a gadfly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोमघ
गो + -मघ <i>a.</i> granting cattle or cows कदा गोमघा हवनानि गच्छाः Rv. 6. 35. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोमंडलम्
गो + -मंडलम्<BR>—1 the globe.<BR>—2 a multitude of cows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोमण्डीरः
