गोमथः|गोमथ
गो + -मथः a cowherd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोमध्यमध्य
