गोयज्ञः|गोयज्ञ
गो + -मेधः, -यज्ञः a cow-sacrifice; Rām. 7. 25. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0673-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

