गोणः|गोण
गोणः An ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोणी
गोणः + .{@-णी@} a cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोणी
गोणी<BR>—1 A sack. गोणीं जनेन स्म निधातुमुधृतामनुक्षणं नोक्षतरः प्रतीच्छति Śi. 12. 10.<BR>—2 A measure of capacity equal to a Droṇa.<BR>—3 Ragged garment, torn clothes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोण्डः|गोण्ड|गोंड|गोंडः
गोण्डः<BR>—1 A fleshy navel.<BR>—2 A person with a fleshy navel.<BR>—3 A man of a low tribe, a mountaineer, especially one inhabiting the<BR> eastern portion of the Vindhya range between the Narmadā and Kṛṣṇā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गोण्डकिरी, गोण्डवनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोण्डकिरी
गोण्डः + -किरी N. of a Rāgiṇi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोण्डवनम्
गोण्डः + -वनम् N. of a country in Berar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोतमः|गोतम
गोतमः<BR>—1 N. of a sage belonging to the family of Aṅgiras, father of Śatānanda<BR> and husband of Ahalyā.<BR>—2 N. of a sage, the founder of Nyāya philosophy; मुक्तये यः शिलात्वाय<BR> शास्त्रमूचे सचेतसाम् । गोतमं तमवेक्ष्यैव N. 17. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोतमी
गोतमी Ahalyā, wife of गोतम.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गोतमीपुत्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोतमीपुत्रः|गोतमीपुत्र
गोतमी + -पुत्रः an epithet of Śatānanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधा
गोधा [गुध्यते, वेष्टपते बाहुरनया करणे घञ]<BR>—1 A leathern fence fastened round the left arm to prevent injury from<BR> the bow-string; गोधाश्लिष्टभुजाशाखैरभूद्भीमा रणाटवी Śi. 19. 39.<BR>—2 The alligator (Mar. सुसर); गोधाधरान् कीलधरान् वलीमुखशिलीमुखान्<BR> Parṇāl. 3. 25; त्रिभागागोधामुखं गोपुरं कारयेत् Kau. A. 2. 3.<BR>—3 A sinew; गोधा तस्मा अयथं कर्षदेतत् Rv. 10. 28. 10-11.<BR>—4 A chord; गोधा परि सनिष्वणत् Rv. 8. 69. 9.<BR>—5 An iguana (Mar. घोरपड).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधिः|गोधि
गोधिः [गौर्नेत्रं धीयते यस्मिन् आधारे इन्]<BR>—1 The forehead.<BR>—2 The Gangetic alligator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधिका
गोधिका A kind of lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोधेरः|गोधेर
गोधेरः A protector, guardian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

