गोपः, -गोपनम्<BR> See under गुप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोरणम्
गोरणम् Energy, continued effort, perseverance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोर्दः|गोर्द|गोर्द्द|गोर्द्दं
गोर्दः Brain; (also गोद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलः|गोल|गोलं
गोलः, -ला, -लम्<BR> [गुड् अच् डस्य लः]<BR>—1 A ball, globe; कदम्बगोलाकृतिमाश्रितः कथम् Māl. 7. 1.<BR>—2 The celestial or terrestrial globe.<BR>—3 A circle. —4 A sphere, anything round or globular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोला
गोलः, -ला, -लम्<BR> [गुड् अच् डस्य लः]<BR>—1 A ball, globe; कदम्बगोलाकृतिमाश्रितः कथम् Māl. 7. 1.<BR>—2 The celestial or terrestrial globe.<BR>—3 A circle. —4 A sphere, anything round or globular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलम्
गोलः, -ला, -लम्<BR> [गुड् अच् डस्य लः]<BR>—1 A ball, globe; कदम्बगोलाकृतिमाश्रितः कथम् Māl. 7. 1.<BR>—2 The celestial or terrestrial globe.<BR>—3 A circle. —4 A sphere, anything round or globular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलः|गोल|गोलं
गोलः, -ला, -लम् + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A widowʼs bastard; cf. कुण्ड; Y. 1. 222.<BR>—2 The conjunction of several planets or the presence of several in one sign.<BR>—3 Myrrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोला
गोलः, -ला, -लम् + .{@-ला@}<BR>—1 A wooden ball with which children play.<BR>—2 A large globular water-jar.<BR>—3 Red arsenic.<BR>—4 Ink.<BR>—5 A womanʼs female friend.<BR>—6 N. of Durgā.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">Page0675-2</a>]<BR>—7 N. of the river Godāvari.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गोलाध्यायः, गोलासनम्, गोलक्रीडा, गोलयन्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलाध्यायः|गोलाध्याय
गोलः + -अध्यायः N. of an astronomical work by Bhāskarācārya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलासनम्
गोलः + -आसनम् ‘ball thrower’, a kind of gun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलक्रीडा
गोलः + -क्रीडा playing with balls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलयन्त्रम्
गोलः + -यन्त्रम् a kind of astronomical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलकः|गोलक|गोलकं
गोलकः [गुड् ण्वुल डस्य लः]<BR>—1 A ball, globe; भूगोलकविशेषं नामरूपमानलक्षणतो व्याख्यास्यामः<BR> Bhāg. 5. 16. 4.<BR>—2 A wooden ball for playing with.<BR>—3 A globular water-jar.<BR>—4 A widowʼs bastard; परदारेषु जायेते द्वौ सुतौ कुण्डगोलकौ । पत्यौ<BR> जीवति कुण्डः स्यान्मृते भर्तरि गोलकः ॥ Ms. 3. 174.<BR>—5 A conjunction of six or more planets in one sign.<BR>—6 Glans penis.<BR>—7 Molasses. —8 Gum myrrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोलासः|गोलास
गोलासः A mushroom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोल्हाट
गोल्हाट A kind of mystical diagram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोष्ठ्
गोष्ठ् €1 Ā. (गोष्ठते) To assemble, collect, heap together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोष्ठिः|गोष्ठि
गोष्ठिः, -ष्ठी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An assembly, meeting; मध्ये विरेजतुरलं पशुपालगोष्ठन्यां रङ्गे<BR> यथा नटवरौ क्व च गायमानौ Bhāg. 10. 21. 8; Ve. 1. 27.<BR>—2 Society, association.<BR>—3 Conversation, chitchat, discourse; क्वचिद्विद्वद्गोष्ठी क्वचिदपि सुरामत्तकलहः<BR> Bh. 3. 125; गोष्ठी सत्कविभिः समम् Bh. 1. 28; Māl. 10. 25; तेनैव<BR> सह सर्वदा गोष्ठीमनुभवति Pt. 2.<BR>—4 A multitude or collection; मोदन्तां सततं च बान्धवसुहृद्गोष्ठीप्रमोदाः<BR> प्रजाः Nāg. 5. 39.<BR>—5 Family connections, relatives, especially such as require to be maintained.<BR>—6 A kind of dramatic composition in one act. ˚पतिः<BR>—1 the chief of an assembly, president.<BR>—2 the master of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोष्ठी
गोष्ठिः, -ष्ठी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An assembly, meeting; मध्ये विरेजतुरलं पशुपालगोष्ठन्यां रङ्गे<BR> यथा नटवरौ क्व च गायमानौ Bhāg. 10. 21. 8; Ve. 1. 27.<BR>—2 Society, association.<BR>—3 Conversation, chitchat, discourse; क्वचिद्विद्वद्गोष्ठी क्वचिदपि सुरामत्तकलहः<BR> Bh. 3. 125; गोष्ठी सत्कविभिः समम् Bh. 1. 28; Māl. 10. 25; तेनैव<BR> सह सर्वदा गोष्ठीमनुभवति Pt. 2.<BR>—4 A multitude or collection; मोदन्तां सततं च बान्धवसुहृद्गोष्ठीप्रमोदाः<BR> प्रजाः Nāg. 5. 39.<BR>—5 Family connections, relatives, especially such as require to be maintained.<BR>—6 A kind of dramatic composition in one act. ˚पतिः<BR>—1 the chief of an assembly, president.<BR>—2 the master of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोसः|गोस
गोसः [गां जलं स्यति सो-क]<BR>—1 Gum myrrh.<BR>—2 Early morning, day-break.<BR>—3 Hot season.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गोसगृहम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोसगृहम्
गोसः + -गृहम् an inner apartment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोहः|गोह
गोहः Ved.<BR>—1 A house.<BR>—2 A hiding-place, a lair; Rv. 4. 21. 6-8; तस्योऽवध्यगोहं खनन्ति<BR> Ait. Br. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0675-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गोहनम्
