गौडिक|गौडिकं|गौडिकः
गौडिक <i>a.</i> Relating to molasses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0676-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गौडिकः|गौडिक|गौडिकं
गौडिक + .{@-कः@} Sugar-cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0676-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गौडिकम्
गौडिक + .{@-कम्@} Rum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0676-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गौण|गौणः
गौण <i>a.</i> (णी <i>f.</i>) [गुणमधिकृत्य प्रवृत्ता गौणी, तत आगतः अण्]<BR>—1 Subordinate, secondary, unessential; गुणवचनत्वाद् गौणः शब्दः<BR> ŚB. on MS. 1. 2. 15.<BR>—2 (In gram.) Indirect or less immediate (opp. मुख्य or प्रधान);<BR> गौणे कर्मणि दुह्यादेः प्रधाने नीहृकृष्वहाम् Sk.<BR>—3 Figurative, metaphorical, used in a secondary sense (as a word or sense);<BR> तदा गौणमनन्तस्य नामानन्तेति विश्रुतम् Mb. 12. 182. 33.<BR>—4 Founded on some resemblance between the primary and secondary sense<BR> of a word; as in गौणीलक्षणा.<BR>—5 Relating to enumeration or multiplication.<BR>—6 Attributive.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गौणपक्षः, गौणसाध्य, गौणसाध्यवसान, गौणसाध्यवसाना, गौणसारोपा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0676-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

