गौधेयः|गौधेय
गौधारः, -धेयः, -धेरः (= गोधिकात्मजः P. IV. 1. 129-30)<BR> A lizard<BR> living in the hollows of trees (Bengali तोक्के) L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0676-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

