गौरिका
गौरिका A virgin, a young girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0676-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गौरिलः|गौरिल
गौरिलः<BR>—1 White mustard.<BR>—2 Dust of iron or steel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0676-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

गौरी
गौरी<BR>—1 N. of Pārvatī; as in गौरीनाथ.<BR>—2 A young girl eight years old; अष्टवर्षा भवेद्गौरी.<BR>—3 A young girl prior to menstruation, virgin, maid; स्त्रीणां सहस्रं<BR> गौरीणाम् Mb. 1. 221. 49.<BR>—4 A woman with a white or yellowish complexion.<BR>—5 The earth; गौर्यां गच्छति सुश्रोणि लोकेष्वेषा गतिः सदा Mb. 13. 146. 10.<BR>—6 Turmeric.<BR>—7 A yellow pigment or dye; (called गोरोचना).<BR>—8 The wife of Varuṇa; वरुणस्य तथा गौरी Mb. 13. 146. 5.<BR>—9 The Mallikā creeper.<BR>—10 The Tulasī plant<BR>—11 The Manjiṣṭhā plant.<BR>—12 Speech.<BR>—13 N. of a Nāgakanyā. cf. … … गौरी तु नागकन्योमयोर्मता Nm.<BR>—14 N. of a river; L. D. B.<BR>—15 Night; L. D. B.<BR>—16 N. of a Rāgiṇi.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: गौरीकान्तः, गौरीनाथः, गौरीगुरुः, गौरीचतुर्थी, गौरीपूजा, गौरीजः, गौरीनाथः, गौरीपट्टः, गौरीपुत्रः, गौरीललितम्, गौरीसुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0676-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

