गौरीपूजा
गौरी + -चतुर्थी, -पूजा the 4th day of the bright half of माध; a<BR> festival on this day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0676-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

