ग्रथ्
ग्रथ् or ग्रन्थ् €1 Ā. (also €9. €10 P. L. D. B.) (ग्रथते, ग्रन्थते)<BR>—1 To be crooked.<BR>—2 To be wicked.<BR>—3 To bend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0677-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

