ग्रथित|ग्रथितं
ग्रथित <i>p. p.</i> [ग्रन्थ् संदर्भे क्त नलोपः]<BR>—1 Strung or tied together.<BR>—2 Composed; कालिदासग्रथितवस्तुना नाटकेन Ś. 1; वर्णैः कतिपयैरेव<BR> ग्रथितस्य स्वरैरिव Śi. 2. 72.<BR>—3 Arranged, classed.<BR>—4 Thickened, coagulated.<BR>—5 Knotty.<BR>—6 Hardened.<BR>—7 Hurt, injured.<BR>—8 Seized, taken possession of.<BR>—9 Overcome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0677-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रथितम्
ग्रथित + .{@-तम्@} A tumor with hard knots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0677-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रन्थ्|ग्रंथ्
ग्रन्थ् €1. €9 P., €10 U., €1 Ā.<BR> (ग्रन्थति, ग्रथ्नाति, ग्रन्थयतिते, also ग्रथति, ग्रथते)<BR>—1 To fasten, tie or string together; ग्रन्थित्वेव स्थितं रुचः Bk. 7. 105;<BR> स्रजो ग्रथयते &c.<BR>—2 To arrange, class together, connect in a regular series.<BR>—3 To wind round.<BR>—4 To write, compose; ग्रथ्नामि काव्यशशिनं विततार्थरश्मिम् K. P. 10.<BR>—5 To form, make, produce; ग्रथ्नन्ति बाष्पविन्दुनिकरं पक्ष्मपङ्क्तयः<BR> K. 60; Bk. 17. 69.<BR>—6 To set or strew with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0677-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रन्थः|ग्रन्थ|ग्रंथ|ग्रंथः
ग्रन्थः [ग्रन्थ् संदर्भे भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Binding, stringing together (fig. also).<BR>—2 A work, treatise, composition, literary production, book; ग्रन्थारम्भे,<BR> ग्रन्थकृत्, ग्रन्थसमाप्ति &c.<BR>—3 Wealth, property.<BR>—4 A verse consisting of 32 syllables, written in the Anuṣṭubh metre.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ग्रन्थकर्तृ, ग्रन्थकुटी, ग्रन्थकूटी, ग्रन्थविस्तरः, ग्रन्थविस्तारः, ग्रन्थसंधिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0677-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रन्थकर्तृ|ग्रन्थकर्त्तृ
ग्रन्थः + -कर्तृ, <i>m.</i><BR> {@-कारः, -कृत्@} <i>m.</i> a writer, an author; ग्रन्थारम्भे समुचितेष्टदेवतां<BR> ग्रन्थकृत्परामृशति K. P. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0677-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

