ग्रहाश्रयः|ग्रहाश्रय
ग्रहः + -आधारः, -आश्रयः polar star (as the fixed centre of the planets).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

