ग्रहः + -आमयः<BR>—1 epilepsy.<BR>—2 demoniacal possession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहालुञ्चनम्
ग्रहः + -आलुञ्चनम् pouncing on oneʼs prey, tearing it to pieces; श्येनो<BR> ग्रहालुञ्चने Mk. 3. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

