ग्रहैकत्वन्यायः
ग्रहः + -एकत्वन्यायः the rule according to which the gender and number<BR> of उद्देशपद is not necessarily combined along with the action laid<BR> down in the विधेयपद. This is discussed by जैमिनि and शबर<BR> at MS. III. 1. 13-15 (opp. of अरुणान्याय or पश्वेकत्वन्याय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

