ग्रहग्रामणी
ग्रहः + -ग्रामणी the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहचिन्तकः|ग्रहचिन्तक|ग्रहचिंतक
ग्रहः + -चिन्तकः an astrologer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहदशा
