ग्रहपीडनम्
ग्रहः + -पीडनम्, -पीडा<BR>—1 oppression caused by a planet.<BR>—2 an eclipse; शशिदिवाकरयोर्ग्रहपीडनम् Bh. 2. 91; H. 1. 51; Pt. 2. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहपीडा
ग्रहः + -पीडनम्, -पीडा<BR>—1 oppression caused by a planet.<BR>—2 an eclipse; शशिदिवाकरयोर्ग्रहपीडनम् Bh. 2. 91; H. 1. 51; Pt. 2. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहपुषः|ग्रहपुष
ग्रहः + -पुषः the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहभक्तिः|ग्रहभक्ति
ग्रहः + -भक्तिः <i>f.</i> division of countries &c. with respect to the presiding planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहभोजनः|ग्रहभोजन
ग्रहः + -भोजनः<BR>—1 oblation offered to the planets.<BR>—2 a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहमण्डलम्
ग्रहः + -मण्डलम्, -मण्डली the circle of the planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहमण्डली|ग्रहमंडली
ग्रहः + -मण्डलम्, -मण्डली the circle of the planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहयज्ञः|ग्रहयज्ञ
ग्रहः + -यज्ञः, -योगः worship or sacrifice planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहयोगः|ग्रहयोग
ग्रहः + -यज्ञः, -योगः worship or sacrifice planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहयुद्ध
ग्रहः + -युद्ध opposition of planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहराजः|ग्रहराज
ग्रहः + -राजः<BR>—1 the sun.<BR>—2 the moon.<BR>—3 Jupiter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहलाघवम्
ग्रहः + -लाघवम् N. of an astronomical work of the 16th century.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहवर्षः|ग्रहवर्ष
ग्रहः + -वर्षः the planetary year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहविप्रः|ग्रहविप्र
ग्रहः + -विप्रः an astrologer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहशान्तिः|ग्रहशान्ति|ग्रहशांति
ग्रहः + -शान्तिः <i>f.</i> propitiation of planets by sacrifices &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहशृङ्गाटकम्
ग्रहः + -शृङ्गाटकम् triangular position of the planets with reference to one another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहसङ्गमः|ग्रहसङ्गम
