ग्रहस्वरः|ग्रहस्वर
ग्रहः + -स्वरः the 1st note of a musical piece.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहकः|ग्रहक
ग्रहकः A prisoner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहणम्
ग्रहणम् [ग्रह् भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Seizing, catching, seizure; श्वा मृगग्रहणेऽशुचिः Ms. 5. 130.<BR>—2 Receiving, accepting, taking; आचारधूमग्रहणात् R. 7. 27.<BR>—3 Mentioning, uttering; नामग्रहणम्.<BR>—4 Wearing putting on; सोत्तरच्छदमध्यास्त नेपथ्यग्रहणाय सः R. 17. 21.<BR>—5 An eclipse; ग्रहणं चन्द्रसूर्ययोः Y. 1. 218.<BR>—6 Understanding, comprehension, knowledge; यस्य नु ग्रहणं किंचित्कर्मणोऽन्यन्न<BR> दृश्यते Rām. 2. 22. 21; न परेषां ग्रहणस्य गोचराम् N. 2. 95.<BR>—7 Learning, acquiring, grasping mentally, mastering; लिपेर्यथावद्ग्रहणेन<BR> वाङ्मयं नदीमुखेनेव समुद्रमाविशत् R. 3. 28.<BR>—8 Taking up of sound, echo; अद्रिग्रहणगुरुभिर्गर्जितैर्नर्तयेथाः Me. 46.<BR>—9 The hand.<BR>—10 An organ of sense.<BR>—11 A prisoner, captive.<BR>—12 Taking by the hand, marrying; तद्दारग्रहणे यत्नं सन्तत्यां च<BR> मनः कुरु Mb. 1. 13. 26.<BR>—13 Taking captive, imprisonment; न दोषो ग्रहणे तस्याः Ks. 91. 37.<BR>—14 Gaining, obtaining, purchasing.<BR>—15 Choosing.<BR>—16 Taking or drawing up.<BR>—17 Attraction.<BR>—18 Containing, enclosing.<BR>—19 Undertaking, undergoing.<BR>—20 Service; अजस्य जन्मोत्पथनाशनाय कर्माण्यकर्तुर्ग्रहणाय पुंसाम्<BR> Bhāg. 3. 1. 44.<BR>—21 Mentioning with praise, respecting; प्रमाणं सर्वभूतेषु गत्वा च<BR> ग्रहणं महत् Mb. 12. 105. 10.<BR>—22 Acceptation, meaning.<BR>—23 Assent, agreement.<BR>—24 Inviting, calling, addressing; name; अलसग्रहणं प्राप्तो दुर्मेधावी<BR> तथोच्यते Mb. 12. 266. 6.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ग्रहणान्तः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहणान्तः|ग्रहणान्त
ग्रहणम् + -अन्तः close of study.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहणक
ग्रहणक <i>a.</i> Containing, involving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहणिः|ग्रहणि
ग्रहणिः, -णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An imaginary organ supposed to lie between the stomach and the intestines.<BR>—2 The small intestines or that part of the alimentary canal where the<BR> bile assists digestion and from which vital warmth is diffused.<BR>—3 Diarrhoea, dysentery.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">Page0680-1</a>]<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ग्रहणिकपाटः, ग्रहणिहरम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहणी
ग्रहणिः, -णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An imaginary organ supposed to lie between the stomach and the intestines.<BR>—2 The small intestines or that part of the alimentary canal where the<BR> bile assists digestion and from which vital warmth is diffused.<BR>—3 Diarrhoea, dysentery.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">Page0680-1</a>]<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ग्रहणिकपाटः, ग्रहणिहरम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहणिकपाटः
ग्रहणिः + -कपाटः a kind of mixture (for curing diarrhoea &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहणिहरम्
ग्रहणिः + -हरम् cloves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहणीय
ग्रहणीय <i>a.</i> Acceptable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहिल
ग्रहिल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Taking, accepting.<BR>—2 Unyielding, relentless, obstinate; न निशाखिलयापि वापिका प्रससाद<BR> ग्रहिलेव मानिनी N. 2. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहीतव्य
ग्रहीतव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be taken, seized or received, acceptable.<BR>—2 To be taken up or drawn (as a fluid).<BR>—3 To be apprehended or perceived, to be learnt or acquired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रहीतृ
ग्रहीतृ <i>a.</i> (त्री <i>f.</i>) [ग्रह्-तृच् इटो दीर्घः]<BR>—1 A taker, an accepter; as in गुणग्रहीतृ q. v.<BR>—2 Perceiver, observant; Ms. 1. 15.<BR>—3 Debtor; ग्रहीता यदि वै नष्टः कुटुम्बार्थे कृतो व्ययः Ms. 8. 166.<BR>—4 Purchaser.<BR>—5 One who seizes; Śvet. Up. 3. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राह|ग्राहं|ग्राहः
ग्राह <i>a.</i> (ही <i>f.</i>) [ग्रह् भावे घञ्] Seizing, clutching;<BR> taking, holding, receiving &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहः|ग्राह|ग्राहं
ग्राह + .{@-हः@}<BR>—1 Seizing, grasping; हस्तग्राहं तु तं मत्वा Rām. 7. 34. 20.<BR>—2 A crocodile, shark; रागग्राहवती Bh. 3. 45.<BR>—3 A prisoner.<BR>—4 Accepting.<BR>—5 Understanding, knowledge.<BR>—6 Persistence, importunity; तव मातुरसद्ग्राहं विद्म पूर्वं यथा<BR> श्रुतम् Rām. 2. 35. 18.<BR>—7 Determination, resolve; मूढग्राहेणात्मनो यत्पीडया क्रियते तपः Bg. 17. 19.<BR>—8 A disease.<BR>—9 Any large fish or marine animal; जग्राहाजगरो ग्राहो भुजयोरुभयोर्बलात्<BR> Mb. 3. 178. 28; Ki. 13. 24.<BR>—10 Morbid affection, disease.<BR>—11 Beginning, undertaking.<BR>—12 The handle (of a sword &c.).<BR>—13 Paralysis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राही
ग्राह + .{@-ही@} A female crocodile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहम्
ग्राहम् <i>ind.</i> (At the end of comp.) Taking, seizing; बन्दिग्राहं गृहीता V. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहक|ग्राहकः
ग्राहक <i>a.</i> (हिका <i>f.</i>) [ग्रह् ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 One who receives, takes &c.<BR>—2 Captivating, persuading; हेतुमद्ग्राहकम् (वाक्यम्) Mb. 12. 113. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहकः|ग्राहक
ग्राहक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A hawk, falcon.<BR>—2 A curer of poison.<BR>—3 A purchaser.<BR>—4 A police-officer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहकत्वम्
ग्राहकत्वम् Sensibility, power of feeling; Māl. 1. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहिः|ग्राहि
ग्राहिः<BR>—1 A female evil spirit; ग्राहिर्जग्राह यदि वैतदेनम् Rv. 10. 161. 1.<BR>—2 A swoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहित
ग्राहित <i>a.</i> Made to take or seize; made to accept or take (a seat<BR> &c.); तेनर्षिणा समाश्वास्य तत्रैव ग्राहिता स्थितिम् Ks. 51. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहिन्
ग्राहिन् <i>a.</i> [ग्रह् णिनि]<BR>—1 Seizing, taking, holding.<BR>—2 Picking, gathering.<BR>—3 Containing.<BR>—4 Drawing, attracting, alluring.<BR>—5 Obtaining, gaining.<BR>—6 Searching through, scrutinizing.<BR>—7 Choosing, selecting.<BR>—8 Perceiving, observing.<BR>—9 Accepting.<BR>—10 Astringent.<BR>—11 Obstructing.<BR>—12 Purchasing; मूल्येन रत्नग्रही च Ks. 57. 20. ━<i>m.</i> The wood-apple tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहिणी
ग्राहिन् + .{@-णी@} Adverse fate (प्रतिकूला).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राहुक
ग्राहुक <i>a.</i> Seizing, laying hold of; उदावर्तः प्रजा ग्राहुकः<BR> स्यात् Ts. 6. 4. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राह्य|ग्राह्यः
ग्राह्य <i>a.</i> [ग्रह् ण्यत्]<BR>—1 To be taken or seized &c., see ग्रह्.<BR>—2 To be understood; इन्द्रियग्राह्यः Ms. 1. 7.<BR>—3 Acceptable; सा सेवा या प्रभुहिता ग्राह्या वाक्यविशेषतः Pt. 1. 46.<BR>—4 To be received in a hospitable manner.<BR>—5 To be admitted in evidence; स्वभावेनैव यद्ब्रूयुस्तद् ग्राह्यं व्यावहारिकम् Ms. 8. 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राह्यम्
ग्राह्य + .{@-ह्यम्@}<BR>—1 A present.<BR>—2 The object of sensual perception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्राह्यः|ग्राह्य
ग्राह्य + .{@-ह्यः@} An eclipsed globe (sun or moon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामः|ग्राम
ग्रामः [ग्रस्-मन् आदन्तादेशः]<BR>—1 A village, hamlet; पत्तने विद्यमानेऽपि ग्रामे रत्नपरीक्षा M. 1;<BR> त्यजेदेकं कुलस्यार्थे ग्रामस्यार्थे कुलं त्यजेत् । ग्रामं जनपदस्यार्थे<BR> स्वात्मार्थे पृथिवीं त्यजेत् ॥ H. 1. 129; R. 1. 44; Me. 30.<BR>—2 A race, community; कथा ग्रामं न पृच्छसि Rv. 10. 146. 1.<BR>—3 A multitude, collection (of anything); <i>e. g.</i> गुणग्राम, इन्द्रियग्राम;<BR> Bg. 8. 19, 9. 8. शस्त्रास्त्रग्रामकोविदः Bm. 1. 611, 613.<BR>—4 A gamut, scale in music; स्फुटीभवद्ग्रामविशेषमूर्च्छनाम् Śi. 1. 10.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ग्रामाक्षपटलिकः, ग्रामाधिकृतः, ग्रामाधिपः, ग्रामाधिपतिः, ग्रामाध्यक्षः, ग्रामेशः, ग्रामेश्वरः, ग्रामान्तः, ग्रामान्तरम्, ग्रामान्तिकम्, ग्रामान्तीय, ग्रामयम्, ग्रामाचारः, ग्रामाधानम्, ग्रामोपाध्यायः, ग्रामकण्टकः, ग्रामकाम, ग्रामकायस्थ, ग्रामकुक्कुटः, ग्रामकुमारः, ग्रामकूटः, ग्रामगृह्य, ग्रामगृह्यकः, ग्रामगोदुहः, ग्रामघातः, ग्रामघोषिन्, ग्रामचर्या, ग्रामचैत्यः, ग्रामज, ग्रामजात, ग्रामजालम्, ग्रामणीः, ग्रामतक्षः, ग्रामदेवता, ग्रामद्रुमः, ग्रामधर्मः, ग्रामधान्यम्, ग्रामपालः, ग्रामपुरुषः, ग्रामप्रेष्यः, ग्राममद्गुरिका, ग्राममुखम्, ग्राममृगः, ग्रामयाजकः, ग्रामयाजिन्, ग्रामयुद्धम्, ग्रामलुण्ठनम्, ग्रामवासः, ग्रामविशेषः, ग्रामवृद्धः, ग्रामषण्डः, ग्रामसंकरः, ग्रामसंघः, ग्रामसिंहः, ग्रामस्थ, ग्रामहासकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

