ग्रामः + -अक्षपटलिकः a village archivist; Hc. 7. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

