ग्रामोपाध्यायः|ग्रामोपाध्याय
ग्रामः + -उपाध्यायः the village priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामकण्टकः|ग्रामकण्टक|ग्रामकंटक
ग्रामः + -कण्टकः<BR>—1 ‘the village-pest’, one who is a source of trouble to the village.<BR>—2 a tale-bearer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामकाम
ग्रामः + -काम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one wishing to take possession of a village.<BR>—2 fond of living in villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामकायस्थ
ग्रामः + -कायस्थ a village scribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामकुक्कुटः|ग्रामकुक्कुट
ग्रामः + -कुक्कुटः a domestic cock; Ms. 5. 12, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामकुमारः|ग्रामकुमार
ग्रामः + -कुमारः<BR>—1 one beautiful in a village.<BR>—2 a village-boy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामकूटः|ग्रामकूट
ग्रामः + -कूटः<BR>—1 the noblest man in a village.<BR>—2 a Śūdra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामगृह्य
ग्रामः + -गृह्य <i>a.</i> being outside a village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामगृह्यकः|ग्रामगृह्यक
ग्रामः + -गृह्यकः a village-carpenter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0680-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ग्रामगोदुहः
