घर्घटः A kind of fish (गर्गर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्घर|घर्घरः
घर्घर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Indistinct, purring, gurgling (as a sound); घर्घररवा पारश्मशानं<BR> सरित् Māl. 5. 19; U. 4. 29; Mk. 6. 20; Ks. 25. 66; Rāj. T. 2. 99.<BR>—2 Murmuring, muttering (as clouds).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्घरः|घर्घर
घर्घर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 An indistinct or low murmur, a low, murmuring or gurgling sound.<BR>—2 Noise in general.<BR>—3 A door, gate.<BR>—4 Creaking, crackling, rattling &c.<BR>—5 The pass of a mountain.<BR>—6 A sliding door, curtain.<BR>—7 Mirth, laughter.<BR>—8 An owl or a duck.<BR>—9 A fire of chaff.<BR>—10 A particular form of a temple; Hc. 2.<BR>—11 The river Gogra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्घरा
घर्घरा, -री<BR>—1 A bell used as an ornament.<BR>—2 A girdle of small bells.<BR>—3 The Ganges.<BR>—4 A kind of lute.<BR>—5 A bell hanging on the neck of a horse.<BR>—6 One of the notes in music (<i>n.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्घरी
घर्घरा, -री<BR>—1 A bell used as an ornament.<BR>—2 A girdle of small bells.<BR>—3 The Ganges.<BR>—4 A kind of lute.<BR>—5 A bell hanging on the neck of a horse.<BR>—6 One of the notes in music (<i>n.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्घरिका
घर्घरिका<BR>—1 A bell used as an ornament.<BR>—2 A kind of musical instrument. —3 Fried grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्घरितम्
घर्घरितम् The grunting of a hog; निशम्य ते घर्घरितं स्वखेदक्षयिष्णु<BR> मायामयसूकरस्य Bhāg. 3. 13. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्ब्
घर्ब् €1 P. (घर्बति) To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्म|घर्मः|घर्म्म|घर्म्मः
घर्म <i>a.</i> [घरति अङ्गात्; घृ-सेके कर्तरि मक् नि˚ गुणः Uṇ. 1. 146] Hot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मः|घर्म|घर्म्म|घर्म्मः
घर्म + .{@-र्मः@}<BR>—1 Heat, warmth; घर्मार्तं न तथा सुशीतलजलैः स्नानम् H. 1. 93; U. 3. 5.<BR>—2 The hot season, summer; निःश्वासहार्यांशुकमाजगाम घर्मः प्रियावेशमिवोपदेष्टुम्<BR> R. 16. 49; U. 2. 9.<BR>—3 Sweat, perspiration; अघर्मघर्मोदकबिन्दुमौक्तिकैरलंचकारास्य वधूरहस्करः Śi. 1. 58.<BR>—4 A cauldron, boiler.<BR>—5 Sunshine;<BR>—6 A cavity in the earth shaped like a boiler.<BR>—7 A hot day.<BR>—8 Ved. A sacrifice.<BR>—9 Juice.<BR>—10 Milk (of cows).<BR>—11 The प्रवर्ग्य ceremony.<BR>—12 A kind of deity; घर्मः स्यादातपे ग्रीष्मे प्रवर्ग्ये देवतान्तरे ।<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: घर्मांशुः, घर्मान्तः, घर्माम्बु, घर्माम्भस्, घर्मचर्चिका, घर्मजातिः, घर्मच्छेदः, घर्मदीधितिः, घर्मदुघा, घर्मदुह्, घर्मद्युतिः, घर्मपयस्, घर्मश्मिः, घर्मस्वेद<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मांशुः|घर्मांशु
घर्म + -अंशुः the sun; तमस्तपति घर्मांशौ कथमाविर्भविर्भविष्यति Ś. 5. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मान्तः|घर्मान्त|घर्मांत|घर्म्मान्त|घर्म्मान्तः
घर्म + -अन्तः the rainy season; घर्मान्तक्षुभितजलेव जह्नुकन्या Ki. 7. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्माम्बु|घर्मांबु|घर्म्माम्बु
घर्म + -अम्बु, -अम्भस् <i>n.</i>, {@-उदकम्, -जलम्@}<BR> sweat, perspiration; वदने घर्माम्भसां जालकम्<BR> Ś. 1. 29; Māl. 9. 17, 1. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्माम्भस्|घर्मांभस्
घर्म + -अम्बु, -अम्भस् <i>n.</i>, {@-उदकम्, -जलम्@}<BR> sweat, perspiration; वदने घर्माम्भसां जालकम्<BR> Ś. 1. 29; Māl. 9. 17, 1. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मचर्चिका|घर्म्मचर्चिका|घर्म्मचर्च्चिका
घर्म + -चर्चिका eruptions caused by heat and suppressed perspiration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मजातिः
घर्म + -जातिः sweat-produced being; अहं भवो यूयमथोऽसुरादयो मनुष्यतिर्यग्द्रुमघर्मजातयः<BR> Bhāg. 8. 5. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मच्छेदः|घर्मच्छेद
घर्म + -छेदः cessation of heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मदीधितिः|घर्मदीधिति|घर्म्मदीधिति
घर्म + -दीधितिः the sun; यः ससोम इव घर्मदीधितिः R. 11. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मदुघा
घर्म + -दुघा, -दुह् <i>f.</i> a cow giving warm milk for offerings; घर्मदुघे<BR> इव धेनू Av. 4. 22. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मदुह्|घर्म्मदुह्
घर्म + -दुघा, -दुह् <i>f.</i> a cow giving warm milk for offerings; घर्मदुघे<BR> इव धेनू Av. 4. 22. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मद्युतिः|घर्मद्युति|घर्म्मद्युति
घर्म + -द्युतिः the sun; Ki. 5. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मपयस्|घर्म्मपयस्
घर्म + -पयस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 sweat, perspiration; प्रतिकामिनीति ददृशुश्चकिताः स्मरजन्मघर्मपयसोपचिताम् Śi. 9. 35.<BR>—2 warm water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मश्मिः
घर्म + -श्मिः<BR>—1 the sun.<BR>—2 heat, radiance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घर्मस्वेद|घर्म्मस्वेद
घर्म + -स्वेद <i>a.</i> Ved. coming with<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">Page0686-1</a>]<BR> splendour, or showering down water, or coming to the oblation (Sāy.);<BR> perspiring with heat; घर्मस्वेदेभिर्द्रविणं व्यानट् Rv. 10. 67. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस्
घस् €1. €2 P. (घसति, घस्ति, घस्त) To eat, devour (a defective<BR> root used only to form certain tenses of अद्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घसः|घस
घसः<BR>—1 The eater, devourer.<BR>—2 Flesh, meat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घसिः|घसि
घसिः Ved. Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस्मर|घस्मरः
घस्मर <i>a.</i> [घस् -क्मरच्]<BR>—1 Voracious, gluttonous; घस्मरा नष्टशौचाश्च प्राय इत्यनुशुश्रुम<BR> Mb. 8. 40. 41; दावानलो घस्मरः Bv. 1. 34.<BR>—2 Devourer, destroyer; द्रुपदसुतचमूघस्मरो द्रौणिरस्मि Ve. 5. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस्र|घस्रं|घस्रः
घस्र <i>a.</i> [घस्-रक्] Hurtful, injurious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस्रः|घस्र|घस्रं
घस्र + .{@-स्रः@}<BR>—1 A day; घस्रो गमिष्यति भविष्यति सुप्रदोषम् Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 The sun; heat; Mv. 6. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घस्रम्
घस्र + .{@-स्रम्@} Saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घासः|घास
घासः [घस् कर्मणि घञ्]<BR>—1 Food.<BR>—2 Meadow or pasture grass; घासाभावात् Pt. 5; घासमुष्टिं परगवे<BR> दद्यात् संवत्सरं तु यः Mb.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: घासकुन्दम्, घासस्थानम्, घासकूटम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घासकुन्दम्
घासः + -कुन्दम्, -स्थानम् a pasture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घासस्थानम्
घासः + -कुन्दम्, -स्थानम् a pasture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घासकूटम्
घासः + -कूटम् hay-rick; गत्वाश्वघासकूटानि तेदहन्वातुलानके Rāj. T. 4. 312.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घासिः|घासि
घासिः [घस् बा˚ इण्]<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 Grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाटः|घाट
घाटः, -टा, -टिका<BR> [घट्-अच्] The back of the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाटा
घाटः, -टा, -टिका<BR> [घट्-अच्] The back of the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाटिका
घाटः, -टा, -टिका<BR> [घट्-अच्] The back of the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाटः|घाट
घाटः, -टा, -टिका + .{@-टः@}<BR>—1 A pitcher.<BR>—2 A landing place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाटणम्
घाटणम् A bolt; अन्तर्वापि बहिर्वापि घाटणं कीलसंयुतम् Māna. 19. 152-53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाण्टिकः|घाण्टिक|घांटिक|घांटिकः
घाण्टिकः<BR>—1 A bell-ringer; Mb. 13. 126. 24; Bṛ. S. 10. 6, 12.<BR>—2 A bard who sings in chorus, especially in honour of gods or kings.<BR>—3 The Dhattūra plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातः|घात
घातः [हन्-णिच् घञ्]<BR>—1 A blow, stroke, bruise, hit; ज्याघात Ś. 3. 13; नयनशरघात<BR> Gīt. 10; so पार्ष्णिघातः शिरोघात &c.<BR>—2 Killing, hurting, destruction, slaughter, death-sentence; वियोगो<BR> मुग्धाक्ष्याः स खलु रिपुघातावधिरभूत् U. 3. 44; पशुघातः Gīt. 1;<BR> Y. 2. 159, 3. 252; तत्र रत्नोपभोगे घातः Kau. A. 2. 8.<BR>—3 An arrow.<BR>—4 Power.<BR>—5 The product of a sum in multiplication.<BR>—6 Whipping; कोशाधिष्ठितस्य कोशावच्छेदे घातः Kau. A. 2. 5.<BR>—7 (in Astr.) Entrance. (In comp. translated by ‘inauspicious’; ˚दिवसः)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: घातकृच्छ्रम्, घातचन्द्रः, घाततिथिः, घातनक्षत्रम्, घातवारः, घातस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातकृच्छ्रम्
घातः + -कृच्छ्रम् a kind of urinary disease; Śāraṅg. S. 7. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातचन्द्रः|घातचन्द्र|घातचंद्र
घातः + -चन्द्रः the moon when in an inauspicious mansion determined by<BR> oneʼs natal zodiacal sign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घाततिथिः|घाततिथि
घातः + -तिथिः an inauspicious lunar day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातनक्षत्रम्
घातः + -नक्षत्रम् an inauspicious constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातवारः|घातवार
घातः + -वारः an inauspicious day of the week.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातस्थानम्
घातः + -स्थानम् a slaughter-house, place for execution; कदाचिदियमालोक्यैव<BR> संनिकृष्टं घातस्थानम् Nāg. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातक|घातकः
घातक <i>a.</i> [हन्-णिच् ण्वुल्] Killing, destroying, a killer, destroyer,<BR> murderer &c. Ms. 5. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातन|घातनं|घातनः
घातन [हन् णिच् भावे ल्युट्] A killer, murderer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातनम्
घातन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Striking, killing, slaughter.<BR>—2 Killing (as an animal at a sacrifice), immolatting; स्वपुत्रघातनं<BR> कृत्वा प्राप्तं तन्मांसभक्षणम् Ks. 20. 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातिः|घाति
घातिः [हन् णिच् इण्]<BR>—1 Striking, killing.<BR>—2 Catching or killing birds. ━<i>f.</i> A bird-net.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातिन्
घातिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) [हन् णिच् णिनि]<BR>—1 Striking, killing ये च स्त्रीबालघातिनः Ms. 8. 89.<BR>—2 Catching or killing (birds &c.)<BR>—3 Destructive.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: घातिपक्षिन्, घातिविहगः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातिपक्षिन्
घातिन् + -पक्षिन्, -विहगः a hawk falcon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातिविहगः|घातिविहग
घातिन् + -पक्षिन्, -विहगः a hawk falcon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घातुक|घातुकः
घातुक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [हन् णिच् उकञ्]<BR>—1 Killing, destructive, mischievous, hurting; वत्सांश्च घातुको वृकः Av. 12. 4. 7.<BR>—2 Cruel, savage, ferocious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घात्य|घात्यं
घात्य <i>a.</i> [हन्-णिच् ण्यत्] Proper or fit to be killed; ततस्तदेव<BR> मे घात्यम् Ks. 72. 273.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घान्यम्
घान्यम् Compactness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घारः|घार
घारः See under घ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घार्तिकः|घार्तिक|घार्त्तिक|घार्त्तिकः
घार्तिकः [घृतेन निर्वृतः ठञ्] A kind of dish or cake prepared<BR> with clarified butter which is full of small holes. (Mar. अनरसा);<BR> and hence one of the learned fools in the Pañcatantra says on seeing<BR> the cake served to him; “छिद्रेष्वनर्था बहुलीभवन्ति”.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घासः|घास
