घिण्ण्
घिण्ण्, घुण्ण्, घृण्ण् €1 Ā. To seize, take, grasp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

