घुः|घु
घुः The indistinct sound of a pigeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुट्
घुट् I. €6 P. (घुटति, घुटित)<BR>—1 To strike again, retaliate, resist.<BR>—2 To protect, preserve. ━II. €1 Ā. (घोटते)<BR>—1 To come back, return.<BR>—2 To barter, exchange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

