घुटिका
घुटः, घुटिः, -टी <i>f.</i>, घुटिकः, -का The ankle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुड्
घुड् €6 P. (घुडति) To prevent, defend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुण्
