घुणः|घुण
घुणः [घुण्-क] A particular kind of insect found in timber.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: घुणाक्षरम्, घुणलिपिः, घुणाक्षरन्यायः, घुणक्षत, घुणजग्ध<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुणाक्षरम्
घुणः + -अक्षरम्, -लिपिः <i>f.</i> an incision in wood or in the leaf of<BR> a book made by an insect or worm and resembling somewhat the form of a<BR> letter; सकृज्जयमरेर्वीरा मन्यन्ते हि घुणाक्षरम् Rāj. T. 4. 167.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुणलिपिः
घुणः + -अक्षरम्, -लिपिः <i>f.</i> an incision in wood or in the leaf of<BR> a book made by an insect or worm and resembling somewhat the form of a<BR> letter; सकृज्जयमरेर्वीरा मन्यन्ते हि घुणाक्षरम् Rāj. T. 4. 167.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

