घुमघुमित
घुमघुमित <i>a.</i> Scented, sweet smelling; घुमघुमितदेहाः Viś. Guṇā. 115.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुर्
घुर् €6 P. (घुरति, घुरित)<BR>—1 To sound, make a noise, snore, snort; grunt (as a pig, dog &c.); कः<BR> कः कुत्र न घुर्घुरायितघुरीघोरो घुरेच्छूकरः K. P. 7.<BR>—2 To be frightful or terrible.<BR>—3 To cry in distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुरणः|घुरण
