घुरी
घुरी The nostrils, especially of a hog; घुर्घुरायितघुरीघोरो घुरेच्छूकरः K. P. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुर्घुरः|घुर्घुर
