घुर्घुरिका
घुर्घुरकः, -रिका<BR> A gurgling sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुर्घुरायते
घुर्घुरायते Den. Ā. To murmur, hum, whisper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुर्घुरी
घुर्घुरी<BR>—1 The grunting of a hog.<BR>—2 The mole-cricket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुलघुलारवः|घुलघुलारव
