घुष्
घुष् I. €1 P., €10 U. (घोषति, घोषयति-ते, घोषित, घुष्ट or घोषित)<BR>—1 To sound, make any sound or noise.<BR>—2 To cry or proclaim aloud, announce or declare publicly; स स पापादृते<BR> तासां दुष्यन्त इति घुष्यताम् Ś. 6. 22; घोषयतु मन्मथनिर्देशम्<BR> Gīt. 10; इति घोषयतीव डिण्डिमः करिणो हस्तिपकाहतः क्वणन् H. 2. 84;<BR> R. 9. 10; Mk. 10. 12.<BR>—3 To praise.<BR>—4 To fill with cries, make resonant. ━II. €1 Ā. (घुषते) To be beautiful or brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुष
घुष <i>a.</i> Sounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुषित|घुषितं
घुषित <i>a.</i> [घुष् क्त] Proclaimed, sounded, declared; also घुष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुष्टान्नम्
घुष्टान्नम् Food given away by proclamation; Ms. 4. 209.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घुष्ट्रम्
घुष्ट्रम् A cart, carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषः|घोष|घोषं
घोषः [घुष्-भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Noise, tumult, cry or sound in general; स घोषो घार्तराष्ट्राणां हृदयानि<BR> व्यदारयत् Bg. 1. 19; so रथ˚, तूर्य˚, शङ्ख˚ &c.<BR>—2 The thundering of clouds; स्निग्ध गम्भीरघोषम् Me. 64 (v. l.).<BR>—3 Proclamation.<BR>—4 Rumour, report; दुःशासुरागादिति घोष आसीत् Rv. 10. 33. 1.<BR>—5 A herdsman; see घोषवृद्ध below.<BR>—6 A hamlet, station of cowherds; Bhāg. 5. 5. 30; विहारभूमेरभिघोषमुत्सुकाः<BR> Ki. 4. 31; गङ्गायां घोषः K. P. 2; घोषादानीय Mk. 7.<BR>—7 (In gram.) The soft sound heard in the articulation of the soft consonants; Rv. Pr. 13. 5.<BR>—8 A Kāyastha (one of the writer class).<BR>—9 A vowel.<BR>—10 A gnat, mosquito.<BR>—11 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—12 Recitation, the sound of prayers; सदसि निबिडचैत्यब्रह्मघोषैः<BR> पुरस्तात् Mk. 10. 12.<BR>—13 An ornament that makes a tinkling sound; घोषप्रघोषरुचिरम् Bhāg. 10. 8. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषम्
घोषः + .{@-षम्@} Bell-metal.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: घोषयात्रा, घोषवर्णः, घोषवृद्धः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषयात्रा
घोषः + -यात्रा walk or procession to the stations of the herdsmen. ˚पर्वन्<BR> N. of chapters 236-257 of the वनपर्व in Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषवर्णः|घोषवर्ण
घोषः + -वर्णः a sonant letter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषवृद्धः|घोषवृद्ध
घोषः + -वृद्धः an elder at a station of herdsmen; हैयङ्गवीनमादाय<BR> घोषवृद्धानुपस्थितान् R. 1. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषकः|घोषक
