घोषवत्|घोषवन्त्
घोषवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Making a sound, sounding.<BR>—2 Sonant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषवती
घोषवत् + .{@-ती@} A lute; Ks. 11. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषणम्
घोषणम्, -णा<BR> [घुष् भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Proclamation, declaring or speaking aloud, public announcement; व्याघातो<BR> जयघोषणादिषु बलादस्मद्बलानां कृतः Mu. 3. 26; R. 12. 72.<BR>—2 Speaking aloud, making a great noise. ━<i>a.</i> Sounding; स प्राद्रवद्धोषणभूषणाङ्घ्रिः<BR> Bhāg. 4. 5. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषणा
घोषणम्, -णा<BR> [घुष् भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Proclamation, declaring or speaking aloud, public announcement; व्याघातो<BR> जयघोषणादिषु बलादस्मद्बलानां कृतः Mu. 3. 26; R. 12. 72.<BR>—2 Speaking aloud, making a great noise. ━<i>a.</i> Sounding; स प्राद्रवद्धोषणभूषणाङ्घ्रिः<BR> Bhāg. 4. 5. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घोषयित्नु|घोषयित्नुः
