घूर्
घूर् €4 Ā. (घूर्यते) To kill, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्ण्
घूर्ण् €1 Ā., €6 P. [घूर्णते, घूर्णति, घूर्णित] To roll about,<BR> move to and fro, whirl, turn round, shake, reel, stagger; योषितामतिमदेन<BR> जुघूर्णुर्विभ्रमातिशयपूंषि वपूंषि Śi. 10. 32; भयात्केचिदघूणिषुः<BR> Bk. 15. 32, 118; Śi. 11. 18; अद्यापि तां सुरतजागरघूर्णमानाम् C. P. 5;<BR> भूपालाः कमलाविलासमदिरोन्मीलन्मदाघूर्णिताः Bv. 4. 42. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> (घूर्णयति-ते) To cause to shake, reel or roll about; नयनान्यरुणानि<BR> घूर्णयन् Ku. 4. 12; Śi. 2. 16; Bh. 1. 89 (with prepositions like आ,<BR> वि the root retains the same meaning).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्ण|घूर्णः|घूर्ण्ण
घूर्ण (also घूर्णायमान) <i>a.</i> Shaking, moving to and fro; तस्य<BR> हृदे विहरतो भुजदण्डघूर्णवार्घोषमङ्ग वरवारणविक्रमस्य Bhāg. 10. 16. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घूर्णायमान|घूर्णायमानः|घूर्ण्णायमान
