घृ
घृ I. €1 P. (घरति, घृत) To sprinkle. ━II. €10 U. (घारयति-ते,<BR> घारित) To sprinkle over, wet, moisten; जिघर्म्यग्निं हविषा घृतेन<BR> Rv. 2. 10. 4. ━III. €3 P. (जिघर्ति)<BR>—1 To sprinkle.<BR>—2 To shine. ━IV. €5 U. (घृणोति, घृणुते)<BR>—1 To sprinkle.<BR>—2 To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

