घृतपदी
घृत + -पदी an epithet of the goddess Ilā; (whose foot drops with ghee);<BR> इळा देवी घृतपदी जुषन्त Rv. 10. 70. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतपशुः|घृतपशु
