घृतपूरः|घृतपूर
घृत + -पूरः, -वरः a kind of sweetmeat; also ˚पूर्वकः. {@-पृच्@}<BR> <i>a.</i> accompanied with ghee; घृतेन द्यावापृथिवी अभीवृते घृतश्रिया घृतपृचा<BR> घृतावृधा Rv. 6. 70. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतवरः|घृतवर
घृत + -पूरः, -वरः a kind of sweetmeat; also ˚पूर्वकः. {@-पृच्@}<BR> <i>a.</i> accompanied with ghee; घृतेन द्यावापृथिवी अभीवृते घृतश्रिया घृतपृचा<BR> घृतावृधा Rv. 6. 70. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

