घृतमण्डः|घृतमण्ड
घृत + -मण्डः the scum of melted butter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतयोनिः|घृतयोनि
घृत + -योनिः fire; तनूनपाद् घृतयोनिं विधन्तम् Rv. 3. 4. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृतलेखनी
