घृण्
घृण् I. €8 P. (घृणोति, घृण्ण) To shine, burn. ━II. €1 Ā. (घृणते) To seize.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणः|घृण
घृणः<BR>—1 Heat, ardour.<BR>—2 Sunshine; आ यो घृणे न ततृषाणो अजरः Rv. 6. 15. 5.<BR>—3 A Day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणा
घृणा [घृ-नक्]<BR>—1 Compassion, pity, tenderness; तां विलोक्य वनितावधे घृणां पत्रिणा<BR> सह मुमोच राघवः R. 11. 17, 9. 81; Ki. 15. 13.<BR>—2 Disgust, aversion, contempt; तत्याज तोषं परपुष्टघुष्टे घृणां च<BR> वीणाक्वणिते वितेने N. 3. 60, 1. 20; R. 11. 65.<BR>—3 Reproach, censure.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: घृणार्चिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणार्चिः
घृणा + -अर्चिः <i>m.</i> fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणालु
घृणालु <i>a.</i> Compassionate, merciful, tender-hearted; निष्पादितश्च<BR> कार्त्स्न्येन भगवद्भिर्घृणालुभिः Bhāg. 4. 22. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणि|घृणिः
घृणि <i>a.</i> [घृ-निनि˚ गुणाभावः]<BR>—1 Displeasing.<BR>—2 Shining; तस्य त्यक्तस्वभावस्य घृणेर्मायावनौकसः Bhāg. 7. 2. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणिः|घृणि
घृणि + .{@-णिः@}<BR>—1 Heat, sunshine.<BR>—2 A ray of light.<BR>—3 The sun.<BR>—4 A wave. ━<i>n.</i> Water.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: घृणिनिधिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणिनिधिः|घृणिनिधि
घृणि + -निधिः the sun. (<i>f.</i>) the Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृणिन्
घृणिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Merciful, tender-hearted, kind; राजा घृणी ब्राह्मणः सर्वभक्षी स्त्री<BR> चावशा दृष्टमतिः सहायः (त्याज्या) Pt. 1. 424.<BR>—2 Censorious, abusive.<BR>—3 Bashful, shameful; कीर्तय-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-2" target="_blank">Page0688-2</a>]<BR> -न्गुणमन्नानामघृणी च पुनः पुनः Mb. 1. 167. 19. (Com. अघृणी = लज्जाहीनः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृताची
घृताची <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Greasy, abounding in ghee.<BR>—2 Containing water.<BR>—3 Shining. ━<i>f.</i><BR>—1 Night.<BR>—2 N. of Sarasvatī.<BR>—3 N. of an <i>apsaras</i>; N. 2. 109 (the following are the principal<BR> nymphs of Indraʼs heaven; घृताची मेनका रम्भा उर्वशी च तिलोत्तमा ।<BR> सुकेशी मञ्जुघोषाद्याः कथ्यन्तेऽप्सरसो बुधैः).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: घृताचीगर्भसंभवा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृताचीगर्भसंभवा|घृताचीगर्भसम्भवा|घृताचीगर्भ्भसम्भवा
घृताची + -गर्भसंभवा large cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

घृष्
घृष् €1 P. (घर्षति, घृष्ट)<BR>—1 To rub, strike against; अद्यापि तत्कनककुण्डलघृष्टमास्यम् C. P. 11;<BR> Pt. 1. 144.<BR>—2 To brush, furbish, polish.<BR>—3 To crush, grind, pound; द्रौपद्या ननु मत्स्यराजभवने घृष्टं न<BR> किं चन्दनम् Pt. 3. 175.<BR>—4 To compete, rival (as in संघर्ष q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

