चक्ररदः|चक्ररद
चक्रम् + -रदः a hog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवर्तिन्|चक्रवर्त्तिन्
चक्रम् + -वर्तिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an emperor, universal monarch, sovereign of the world, a ruler whose<BR> dominions extend as far as the ocean (आसमुद्रक्षितीश Ak.); पुत्रमेवंगुणोपेतं<BR> चक्रवर्तिनमाप्नुहि Ś. 1. 12; तव तन्वि कुचावेतौ नियतं चक्रवर्तिनौ ।<BR> आसमुद्रक्षितीशोऽपि भवान् यत्र करप्रदः ॥ Udb. (where there is<BR> a pun on the word चक्रवर्तिन्, the other meaning being ‘resembling in shape the ruddy goose’<BR>, ‘round’);<BR>—2 (hence) head, foremost; आपद्गतः किल महाशयचक्रवतीं विस्तारयत्यकृतपूर्वमुदारभावम्<BR> Bv. 1. 70; कवयस्तर्कयाञ्चकुरित्थं ते चक्रवर्तिनः Parṇāl. 5. 38.<BR>—3 a kind of horse having one or three curls on the shoulder; स्क्रन्धपार्श्वे<BR> यदावर्त एको वा यदि वा त्रयः । चक्रवतीं स विज्ञेयो वाजी भूपालमन्दिरे ॥<BR> Śālihotra of Bhoj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवर्मन्
चक्रम् + -वर्मन् <i>m.</i> N. of a king of Kashmir; चक्रवर्माभिधं राज्ये<BR> क्षीणपुण्यो व्यपद्यत Rāj. T. 5. 287.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवाकः|चक्रवाक
चक्रम् + -वाकः<BR>—1 (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> the ruddy goose;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">Page0691-2</a>]<BR> दूरीभूते मयि सहचरे चक्रवाकीमिवैकाम् Me. 83. ˚बन्धुः the sun.<BR>—2 a kind of horse, having white feet and white eyes; श्वेताभः श्वेतपादश्च<BR> तथा स्यात् श्वेतलोचनः । चक्रवाकः स विज्ञेयो राजार्हो वाजिसत्तमः ॥<BR> Śālihotra of Bhoj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवाटः|चक्रवाट
चक्रम् + -वाटः<BR>—1 a limit, boundary.<BR>—2 a lamp-stand.<BR>—3 engaging in an action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवातः|चक्रवात
चक्रम् + -वातः a whirlwind, hurricane; चक्रवातस्वरूपेण जहारासीनमर्भकम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 7. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवृद्धिः|चक्रवृद्धि
चक्रम् + -वृद्धिः <i>f.</i> —1 interest upon interest, compound interest; Ms. 8. 153, 156.<BR>—2 wages for transporting goods in a carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रव्यूहः|चक्रव्यूह
चक्रम् + -व्यूहः a circular array of troops.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रसंज्ञम्
चक्रम् + -संज्ञम् tin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रसंज्ञः|चक्रसञ्ज्ञ|चक्रसंज्ञं
चक्रम् + -संज्ञम् + .({@-ज्ञः@}) the ruddy goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रसाह्वयः|चक्रसाह्वय
चक्रम् + -साह्वयः the ruddy goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रहस्तः|चक्रहस्त
चक्रम् + -हस्तः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रक|चक्रकः
चक्रक <i>a.</i> [चक्रमिव कायति कै-क] Wheel-shaped, circular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रकः|चक्रक
चक्रक + .{@-कः@} Arguing in circle (in logic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रवत्|चक्रवन्त्
चक्रवत् <i>a.</i> [चक्रमस्त्यस्य मतुप् मस्य वः]<BR>—1 Wheeled.<BR>—2 Circular.<BR>—3 Armed with a discus. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 An oilman.<BR>—2 A sovereign emperor.<BR>—3 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रिः|चक्रि
चक्रिः, -क्रुः <i>m.</i><BR> A doer; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रुः|चक्रु
चक्रिः, -क्रुः <i>m.</i><BR> A doer; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्राकी
चक्राकी, चक्राङ्की A goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्राङ्की|चक्रांकी
चक्राकी, चक्राङ्की A goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रिकः|चक्रिक
चक्रिकः A discus-bearer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रिका
चक्रिकः + .{@-का@}<BR>—1 A heap, troop.<BR>—2 A fraudulent device.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रिन्
चक्रिन् <i>a.</i> [चक्रमस्त्यस्य इनि]<BR>—1 Having a wheel, wheeled.<BR>—2 Bearing a discus.<BR>—3 Driving in a carriage.<BR>—4 circular, round. —5 Indicative (सूचक). ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 An epithet of Viṣṇu or Kṛṣṇa, Śi. 13. 22; प्रणेमुः पाण्डवा<BR> भीष्मं सानुगाः सह चक्रिणा Bhāg. 1. 9. 4.<BR>—2 A potter.<BR>—3 An oilman.<BR>—4 An emperor, a universal monarch, absolute ruler.<BR>—5 The governor of a province.<BR>—6 An ass.<BR>—7 The ruddy goose.<BR>—8 An informer.<BR>—9 A snake.<BR>—10 A crow.<BR>—11 A kind of tumbler or juggler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रिय
चक्रिय <i>a.</i> Going in a carriage, being on a journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रीकृ
चक्रीकृ €8 U. To form into a circle, to curve or bend as a bow; Ku. 3. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्रीवत्|चक्रीवन्त्
चक्रीवत् <i>m.</i> An ass; Śi. 5. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्ष्
चक्ष् €2 Ā. (चष्टे) (Defective in non-conjugational tenses).<BR>—1 To see, observe, perceive.<BR>—2 To speak, say, tell (with dat. of the person).<BR>—3 To abandon, leave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षणम्
चक्षणम् [चक्ष्-ल्युट् न ख्यादेशः]<BR>—1 Ved. —1 Appearance, new aspect; यत्रामृतस्य चक्षणम् Rv. 1. 13. 5.<BR>—2 Speaking, saying.<BR>—3 Eating a relish to promote appetite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षणि
चक्षणि <i>a.</i> Ved. Illuminating, irradiating, brightening; स<BR> नो विभावा चक्षणिर्न वस्तोः Rv. 6. 4. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षन्
चक्षन् <i>n.</i> Ved. The eye; शतं चक्षाणो अक्षभिः Rv. 1. 128. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षस्
चक्षस् <i>m.</i> [चक्ष् असि न ख्यादेशः]<BR>—1 A teacher, an instructor in sacred science, a spiritual teacher.<BR>—2 An epithet of Bṛhaspati. ━<i>n.</i><BR>—1 Radiance, clearness.<BR>—2 The act of seeing, being seen. —3 Look, sight, the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षु|चक्षुः
चक्षु <i>m.</i> or <i>n.</i> Ved. The eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुस्
चक्षुस् <i>a.</i> [चक्ष् करणे उसि Uṇ. 2. 118] Seeing. ━<i>n.</i><BR>—1 The eye; दृश्यं तमसि न पश्यति दीपेन विना सचक्षुरपि M. 1. 9;<BR> कृष्णसारे ददच्चक्षुः Ś. 1. 6; cf. words like घ्राणचक्षुस्,<BR> ज्ञानचक्षुस्, नयचक्षुस्, चारचक्षुस् &c.<BR>—2 Sight, look, vision, the faculty of sight; चक्षुरायुश्चैव प्रहीयते Ms. 4. 41, 42.<BR>—3 Light, clearness.<BR>—4 Lustre, splendour.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चक्षुर्गोचर, चक्षुर्ग्रहणम्, चक्षुर्दानम्, चक्षुष्पथः, चक्षुर्बन्धः, चक्षुर्मलम्, चक्षूरागः, चक्षूरोगः, चक्षुर्विषयः, चक्षुःश्रवस्, चक्षुःश्रुति, चक्षुर्हन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुर्गोचर
चक्षुस् + -गोचर <i>a.</i> visible, being within the range of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुर्ग्रहणम्
चक्षुस् + -ग्रहणम् morbid affection of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुर्दानम्
चक्षुस् + -दानम् the ceremony of anointing the eyes of an image at the time<BR> of consecrating it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्पथः|चक्षुष्पथ
चक्षुस् + -पथः the range of sight, the horizon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुर्बन्धः
चक्षुस् + -बन्धः blinding the sight; Vās. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुर्मलम्
चक्षुस् + -मलम् the excretion of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षूरागः|चक्षूराग
चक्षुस् + -रागः (चक्षूरागः)<BR>—1 redness in the eyes.<BR>—2 ‘eye-love’, love or liking as expressed by an exchange of glances;<BR> पुरश्चक्षूरागस्तदनु मनसोऽनन्यपरता Māl. 6. 15; चक्षूरागः<BR> कोकिलेषु न परकलत्रेषु K. 41 (where the word has sense 1 also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षूरोगः|चक्षूरोग
चक्षुस् + -रोगः (चक्षूरोग) a disease of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुर्विषयः|चक्षुर्विषय
चक्षुस् + -विषयः<BR>—1 the range of sight, ken, presence, visibility; चक्षुर्विषयातिक्रान्तेषु<BR> कपोतेषु H. 1; Ms. 2. 198.<BR>—2 an object of sight, any visible object.<BR>—3 the horizon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुःश्रवस्
चक्षुस् + -श्रवस् <i>m.</i> a serpent; तमाशु चक्षुःश्रवसां समूहं मन्त्रेण<BR> तार्क्ष्योदयकारणेन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुःश्रुति
चक्षुस् + -श्रुति <i>m.</i> (= -श्रवस्)<BR> गोभिः कण्ठतटस्य हृष्यति पुरो दृक्पश्य चक्षुःश्रुतेः<BR> Rāj. T. 5. 1; Ki. 16. 42; इति स्म चक्षुःश्रवसां प्रियानले स्तुवन्ति<BR> निन्दन्ति हृदा तदात्मनः N. 1. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुर्हन्
चक्षुस् + -हन् <i>a.</i> who kills the enemy by the mere glance; सेवे चक्षुर्हणः<BR> पार्थानुग्रवीर्यप्रतापिनः Mb. 3. 233. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्मत्|चक्षुष्मन्त्
चक्षुष्मत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Seeing, furnished with eyes, endowed with the faculty of sight; तदा<BR> चक्षुष्मतां प्रीतिरासीत्समरसा द्वयोः R. 4. 18; ˚ता 4. 13.<BR>—2 Having a clear sight or good eyes.<BR>—3 Possessed of foresight; Kau. A. 1. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्य|चक्षुष्यं|चक्षुष्यः
चक्षुष्य <i>a.</i> [चक्षुते हितः यत्]<BR>—1 Good looking, agreeable to the sight, pleasing, beautiful; Śi. 8. 57.<BR>—2 Good for the eyes.<BR>—3 Produced from the eye; देवतानां पितॄणां च चक्षुष्यं चात्मनां विभो<BR> Mb. 13. 68. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्यः|चक्षुष्य|चक्षुष्यं
चक्षुष्य + .{@-ष्यः, -ष्या@} A collyrium or application to the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्या
चक्षुष्य + .{@-ष्यः, -ष्या@} A collyrium or application to the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्या
चक्षुष्य + .{@-ष्या@} A pleasing or agreeable woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चक्षुष्यम्
चक्षुष्य + .{@-ष्यम्@} An ointment for the eyes (Mar. सुरमा ?); तार्क्ष्यशैलं<BR> शिखिग्रीवं चक्षुष्यं यामुनं पुनः Śiva B. 30. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

