चङ्कुणः, -रः<BR>—1 A tree.<BR>—2 A carriage.<BR>—3 A vehicle in general (<i>n.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चङ्कुरः|चङ्कुर|चंकुर|चङ्कुरं|चंकुरः
