चङ्क्रमण|चंक्रमण|चंक्रमणं|चङ्क्रमणं
चङ्क्रमण^1 <i>a.</i> [क्रम् यङ् ल्युट् यञो लुक् Tv.]<BR>—1 Moving about, taking exercise.<BR>—2 Going slowly or crookedly.<BR>—3 Moving or going about, walking; विष चङ्क्रमणं रात्रौ Cāṇ. 97;<BR> चक्रे स चक्रेनिभचङ्क्रमणच्छलेन N. 1. 144; स्वजन्मना चङ्क्रमणेन<BR> चाञ्चति Bhāg. 1. 10. 26.<BR>—4 Going slowly or tortuously.<BR>—5 Leap, jump, spring; Pt. 4.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260429. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/187.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चङ्क्रमा|चंक्रमा
चङ्क्रमा Going or moving about, walking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

