चञ्च्|चंच्
चञ्च् €1 P. (चञ्चति, चञ्चित)<BR>—1 To move, wave, shake; समरशिरसि चञ्चत्पञ्चचूडश्चमूनाम् U. 5. 3;<BR> Māl. 5. 23; चञ्चञ्चञ्चू Nāg. 4; चञ्चत्पराग Gīt. 1.<BR>—2 To dangle about; विलपति हसति विषीदति रोदिति चञ्चति मुञ्चति<BR> तापम् Gīt. 4.<BR>—3 To leap, jump.<BR>—4 To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चञ्चः|चञ्च|चंच|चंचः
चञ्चः [चञ्च्-अच्]<BR>—1 A basket.<BR>—2 A measure of length equal to 5 fingers पञ्चाङ्गुलं मानम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चञ्चा|चंचा
चञ्चः + .{@-ञ्चा@}<BR>—1 Anything made of cane (as mat &c.).<BR>—2 A straw-man, doll.<BR>—3 puppet of grass or reed.<BR>—4 A contemptuous epithet of man; चञ्चापुरुषः Śārṅg. P. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0692-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चञ्चत्क|चंचत्क
