चतुर् + -अश्र, -अस्र <i>a.</i> (for अश्रि-स्रि)<BR>—1 four cornered, quadrangular; R. 6. 10. A quality of gems; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR>—2 symmetrical, regular or handsome in all parts; बभूव तस्याश्चतुरस्रशोभि<BR> वपुः Ku. 1. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0694-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

