चतुष्पद्
चतुर् + -पद or {@-पद्@} <i>a.</i> (चतुष्पद)<BR>—1 having four feet; यथा चतुष्पत्सु च केसरी वरः Rām. 4. 11. 93.<BR>—2 consisting of four limbs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0694-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

