चतुष्पाठी
चतुर् + -पाठी (चतुष्पाठी) a school for Brāhmaṇas in which the four<BR> Vedas are taught and repeated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्पाणिः|चतुष्पाणि
