चतुर्थ <i>a.</i> (र्थी <i>f.</i>) [चतुर्णां पूरणः डट् युक् च] The fourth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थः|चतुर्थ
चतुर्थ + .{@-र्थः@} The fourth letter of any class.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थम्
चतुर्थ + .{@-र्थम्@} A quarter, a fourth part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थांश|चतुर्थांशः
चतुर्थ + .{@-अंश@} <i>a.</i> receiving a fourth part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थांशः|चतुर्थांश
चतुर्थ + .{@-अंश@} + .({@-शः@}) a quarter or fourth part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थाश्रमः|चतुर्थाश्रम
चतुर्थ + .{@-आश्रमः@} the fourth stage of a Brāhmaṇaʼs religious life, <i>Saṃnyāsa</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थफलम्
चतुर्थ + .{@-फलम्@} the second inequality or equation of a planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थभक्त
चतुर्थ + .{@-भक्त@} <i>a.</i> eating the fourth meal. {@भाज्@} <i>a.</i> receiving<BR> a fourth part of every source of income from the subjects, as a king;<BR> (this is allowed only in times of financial embarrassments, the usual share<BR> being a sixth.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थक|चतुर्थकः
चतुर्थक <i>a.</i> The fourth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थकः|चतुर्थक
चतुर्थक + .{@-कः@} A fever that returns or is repeated every four days, a quartan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थिका
चतुर्थक + .{@-र्थिका@} A weight equal to four Karṣas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थी
चतुर्थी<BR>—1 The fourth day of a lunar fortnight.<BR>—2 The dative case (in gram.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चतुर्थीकर्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्थीकर्मन्
चतुर्थी + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> the ceremonies to be performed on the fourth night<BR> of the marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर्धा
चतुर्धा <i>ibid.</i> In four ways, fourfold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्क|चतुष्कं
चतुष्क <i>a.</i> [चतुरवयवं चत्वारोऽवयवा यस्य वा कन्]<BR>—1 Consisting of four.<BR>—2 Increased by four; द्विकं त्रिकं चतुष्कं च पञ्चकं च शतं समम्<BR> Ms. 8. 142 (<i>i. e.</i> 102, 103, 104, or 105, or interest at the rate of 2<BR> to 5 percent).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्कम्
चतुष्क + .{@-ष्कम्@}<BR>—1 The number ‘four’.<BR>—2 A collection of four.<BR>—3 cross-way<BR>—4 A quadrangular courtyard.<BR>—5 A hall resting on (four) pillars, a hall or saloon in general; Ku. 5. 68, 7. 9.<BR>—6 A necklace of four strings.<BR>—7 A stand or a seat with four feet (Mar. चौरंग); चतुष्कैर्मञ्चकैश्चापि …<BR> Śiva B. 22. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्की
चतुष्क + .{@-ष्की@}<BR>—1 A large four sided pond.<BR>—2 A mosquito curtain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्किका
चतुष्किका The number ‘four’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्टय|चतुष्टयं
चतुष्टय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>) [चत्वारोऽवयवा विधा अस्य<BR> तयप्] Four-fold, consisting of four; पुराणस्य कवेस्तस्य चतुर्मुखसमीरिता ।<BR> प्रवृत्तिरासीच्छब्दानां चरितार्था चतुष्टयी ॥ Ku. 2. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुष्टयम्
चतुष्टय + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 A group or collection of four; एकैकमप्यनर्थाय किमु यत्र चतुष्टयम्<BR> H. Pr. 11; Ku. 7. 62; मासचतुष्टयस्य भोजनम् H. 1.<BR>—2 A square.<BR>—3 The first, fourth, seventh, and tenth signs of the zodiac.<BR>—4 The centre of a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चत्वारिंशत्
चत्वारिंशत् <i>f.</i> Forty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुर|चतुरः
चतुर <i>a.</i> [चत्-उरच्]<BR>—1 Clever, skilful, ingenious, sharp-witted; सर्वात्मना रतिकथाचतुरेव<BR> दूती Mu. 3. 9; Amaru. 15. 44; मृगया जहार चतुरेव कामिनी R. 9. 69, 18. 15.<BR>—2 Quick, swift.<BR>—3 Charming, beautiful, lovely,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">Page0695-2</a>]<BR> agreeable; न पुनरेति गतं चतुरं वयः R. 9. 47; Ku. 1. 47, 3. 5, 5. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुरः|चतुर
चतुर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A round pillow.<BR>—2 Crooked gait.<BR>—3 An elephantʼs stable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुरम्
चतुर + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Cleverness, ingenuity.<BR>—2 An elephantʼs stable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चतुल|चतुलः
चतुल <i>a.</i> Depositing, placing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चत्वरम्
चत्वरम् [चत्-ष्वरच् Uṇ. 2. 121]<BR>—1 A quadrangular place or courtyard.<BR>—2 A place where many roads meet; स खलु श्रेष्ठिचत्वरे निवसति Mk. 2.<BR>—3 A levelled spot of ground prepared for a sacrifice.<BR>—4 A collection of four chariots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चत्वालः|चत्वाल
चत्वालः<BR>—1 A hole in the ground prepared for an oblation or for the sacrificial fire.<BR>—2 Kuśa grass.<BR>—3 Womb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चद्
चद् €1 U. [चदति-ते] To ask, beg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चदिरः|चदिर
चदिरः [चद्-किरच्]<BR>—1 The moon.<BR>—2 Camphor.<BR>—3 An elephant.<BR>—4 A snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्
चन् €1. €6. P. [चनति]<BR>—1 To sound.<BR>—2 To hurt, injure, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चनस्
चनस् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Food.<BR>—2 Delight, satisfaction, pleasure; सुते दधिष्व नश्चनः Rv. 1. 3. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चनसित
चनसित <i>a.</i> Ved. Delighted, satisfied, pleased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चनस्यति
चनस्यति Den. P.<BR>—1 To like.<BR>—2 To eat.<BR>—3 To delight in; पुरुभुजा चनस्यतम् Rv. 1. 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चनिष्ठ
चनिष्ठ <i>a.</i>^1 Containing or granting much food; चनिष्ठं पित्वो<BR> ररते विभागे Rv. 5. 77. 4.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन
चन <i>ind.</i> Not, not also, even not; आपश्चन प्र मिनाति व्रतं<BR> वाम् Rv. 2. 24. 12; (not used by itself, but found used in combination<BR> with the pronoun किम् or its derivatives, such as कद्, कथं, क्व,<BR> कदा, कुतः to which it imparts an indefinite sense; see under किम्).<BR> <i>Note</i>:− Some regard चन to be not a separate word, but a combination<BR> of च and न.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्|चंद्
चन्द् €1 P. [चन्दति, चन्दित]<BR>—1 To shine.<BR>—2 To be glad or rejoiced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द|चंद|चंदः|चन्दः
चन्द<BR>—1 The moon; L. D. B.<BR>—2 Camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्दकः|चन्दक|चंदकः
चन्दकः<BR>—1 The moon. —2 A kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्दनः|चन्दन|चंदन|चंदनं|चन्दनं|चंदनः
चन्दनः, -नम्<BR> [चन्द ण्यन्तात् ल्यु] Sandal, (the tree, the wood, or any<BR> unctuous preparation of the wood, held in high estimation as a perfume<BR> and refrigerant application); अनलायागुरुचन्दनैधसे R. 8. 71; मणिप्रकाराः<BR> सरसं च चन्दनं शुचौ प्रिये यान्ति जनस्य सेव्यताम् Ṛs. 1. 2; एवं<BR> च भाषते लोकश्चन्दनं किल शीतलम् । पुत्रगात्रस्य संस्पर्शश्चन्दनादतिरिच्यते<BR> Pt. 5. 20; विना मलयमन्यत्र चन्दनं न प्ररोहति 1. 41.<BR>—2 Anything most excellent of its kind.<BR>—3 A kind of monkey; L. D. B.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चन्दनाचलः, चन्दनाद्रिः, चन्दनगिरिः, चन्दनोदकम्, चन्दनदासः, चन्दनपुष्पम्, चन्दनसारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्दनम्
चन्दनः, -नम्<BR> [चन्द ण्यन्तात् ल्यु] Sandal, (the tree, the wood, or any<BR> unctuous preparation of the wood, held in high estimation as a perfume<BR> and refrigerant application); अनलायागुरुचन्दनैधसे R. 8. 71; मणिप्रकाराः<BR> सरसं च चन्दनं शुचौ प्रिये यान्ति जनस्य सेव्यताम् Ṛs. 1. 2; एवं<BR> च भाषते लोकश्चन्दनं किल शीतलम् । पुत्रगात्रस्य संस्पर्शश्चन्दनादतिरिच्यते<BR> Pt. 5. 20; विना मलयमन्यत्र चन्दनं न प्ररोहति 1. 41.<BR>—2 Anything most excellent of its kind.<BR>—3 A kind of monkey; L. D. B.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चन्दनाचलः, चन्दनाद्रिः, चन्दनगिरिः, चन्दनोदकम्, चन्दनदासः, चन्दनपुष्पम्, चन्दनसारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

