चन्दनगिरिः|चन्दनगिरि|चंदनगिरि
चन्दनः + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -गिरिः the Malaya mountain; चन्दनाद्रेस्तदास्कन्दत्रासभ्रश्यदहिच्छलात्<BR> Rāj. T. 4. 156.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्दनोदकम्
चन्दनः + -उदकम् sandal-water;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्दनदासः|चन्दनदास
चन्दनः + -दासः N. of a Character<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0696-1" target="_blank">Page0696-1</a>]<BR> in the Mu. {@पङ्कः@} Sandal-unguent. पयोधराश्चन्दनपङ्कचर्चिताः Ṛs. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्दनपुष्पम्
चन्दनः + -पुष्पम् cloves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्दनसारः|चन्दनसार|चंदनसार
चन्दनः + -सारः<BR>—1 the most excellent sandal-wood; प्राज्ञः सुहृच्चन्दनसारलिप्तः<BR> Mb. 12. 167. 41.<BR>—2 a kind of alkali (वज्रक्षार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्दनिन्|चंदनिन्
