चन्दनी
चन्दनी <i>f.</i> N. of a river; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

