चन्द्रिन्|चंद्रिन्
चन्द्रिन् <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Golden, possessing gold.<BR>—2 Having the moon. ━<i>m.</i> The planet Mercury (son of the moon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्रिमा|चंद्रिमा
चन्द्रिमा Moonlight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्रिलः|चन्द्रिल|चंद्रिल|चंद्रिलः
चन्द्रिलः<BR>—1 A barber.<BR>—2 An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चन्द्रमहः|चन्द्रमह|चंद्रमहः
