चप्
चप् I. €1 P. (चपति) To console, soothe. ━II. €10 U. (चपयति-ते)<BR>—1 To grind, pound, knead.<BR>—2 To cheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चपटः|चपट
चपटः = चपेट q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चपल|चपलं|चपलः
चपल <i>a.</i> [चप्-मन्दायां गतौ कल उपधोकारस्याकारः Tv.;<BR> cf. Uṇ. 1. 108]<BR>—1 Shaking, trembling, tremulous; कुल्याम्भोभिः पवनचपलैः शाखिनो धौतमूलाः<BR> Ś. 1. 15; चपलायताक्षी C. P. 8.<BR>—2 Unsteady, fickle, inconstant, wavering; Śānti. 2. 12; चपलमति &c.<BR>—3 Frail, transient, momentary; नलिनीदलगतजलमतितरलं तद्वज्जीवितमतिशयचपलम् Moha M. 5.<BR>—4 Quick, nimble, agile; (गतम्) शैशवाच्चपलमप्यशोभत R. 11. 8.<BR>—5 Inconsiderate, rash; cf. चापल.<BR>—6 off the mark; निमित्तचपलेषुणा Mb. 13. 5. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चपलः|चपल|चपलं
चपल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A fish.<BR>—2 Quicksilver.<BR>—3 The Chātaka bird.<BR>—4 Consumption.<BR>—5 A sort of perfume.<BR>—6 Black mustard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चपला
चपला<BR>—1 Lightning; कुरबककुसुमं चपलासुषमं रतिपतिमृगकानने Gīt. 7.<BR>—2 An unchaste or disloyal wife.<BR>—3 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—4 Lakṣmī, the goddess of wealth.<BR>—5 The tongue.<BR>—6 Long pepper.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चपलाजनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

