चपलत्वम्
चपलता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Trembling.<BR>—2 Fickleness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

