चपेटः|चपेट
चपेटः<BR>—1 The palm of the hand with the fingers extended.<BR>—2 A blow with the open hand; तत्तस्याः स पिता राजा चपेटं कुपितो<BR> ददौ Ks. 66. 139.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चपेटा
