चमूरुः A kind of deer; चकासतं चारुचमूरुचर्मणा Śi. 1. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्प्|चंप्
चम्प् €10 U. (चम्पयति-ते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पः|चम्प|चंपः
चम्पः [चम्प्-अच्] The Kovidāra tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पम्
चम्पः + .{@-म्पम्@} The flower of this tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पकः|चम्पक|चंपक|चम्पकं|चंपकः
चम्पकः [चम्प-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A tree bearing yellow, fragrant flowers. —2 A kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पकम्
चम्पकः + .{@-कम्@} —1 A flower of this tree; अद्यापि तां कनकचम्पकदामगौरीम् C. P. 1.<BR>—2 The fruit of a variety of plantain.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चम्पकचतुर्दशी, चम्पकमाला, चम्पकरम्भा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पकचतुर्दशी|चम्पकचतुर्द्दशी
चम्पकः + -चतुर्दशी <i>f.</i> The fourteenth day of the bright half of Jyeṣṭha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पकमाला|चंपकमाला
चम्पकः + -माला<BR>—1 N. of a neck-garment worn by women.<BR>—2 a garland of Champaka flowers.<BR>—3 a kind of metre (see App.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पकरम्भा|चंपकरंभा
चम्पकः + -रम्भा a species of plantain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पकालुः|चम्पकालु|चंपकालु|चंपकालुः
चम्पकालुः The jack or bread-fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पकावती
चम्पकावती, चम्पा, चम्पावती N. of an ancient city on the<BR> Ganges, capital of the Aṅgas and identified with the modern Bhagalapur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पा|चंपा
चम्पकावती, चम्पा, चम्पावती N. of an ancient city on the<BR> Ganges, capital of the Aṅgas and identified with the modern Bhagalapur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पावती|चंपावती
चम्पकावती, चम्पा, चम्पावती N. of an ancient city on the<BR> Ganges, capital of the Aṅgas and identified with the modern Bhagalapur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पा|चंपा
चम्पा <i>f.</i> The capital of the country of Aṅga <i>i. e.</i> Bhagalapur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पालुः|चम्पालु|चंपालु|चंपालुः
चम्पालुः = चम्पकालु q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पूः
चम्पूः <i>f.</i> A kind of elaborate and highly artificial composition<BR> in which the same subject is continued through alterations in prose and<BR> verse; गद्यपद्यमयं काव्यं चम्पूरित्यभिधीयते S. D. 569; for instance<BR> भोजचम्पू, नलचम्पू, भारतचम्पू &c.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चम्पूभारतम्, चम्पूरामायणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पूभारतम्
चम्पूः + -भारतम् N. of a reproduction in prose and verse of the contents<BR> of the Mb. by Anantabhaṭṭa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्पूरामायणम्
चम्पूः + -रामायणम् N. of a reproduction in prose and verse of the contents<BR> of the Rām. by Lakṣmaṇakavi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्ब्|चंब्
चम्ब् €1 P. (चम्बति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चम्रिष्
चम्रिष् <i>a.</i> Ved. Contained in the sacrificial vessel (as libations)<BR> (चमसस्थ) एष प्र पूर्वीरव तस्य चम्रिष; Rv. 1. 56. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चय्
चय् €1 Ā. (चयते) To go to or towards, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चयाट्टः
चयाट्टः A bastion (Mar. बुरुज) चयाट्टमस्तकन्यस्तनालायन्त्रसुदुर्गमे<BR> Śiva B. 9. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्
चर् €1 P. (चरति, चचार, अचारीत्, चरितुम्, चरित or sometimes चीर्णं)<BR>—1 To walk, move, go about, roam, wander; नष्टाशङ्का हरिणशिशवो मन्दमन्दं<BR> चरन्ति Ś. 1. 15 (चर् may mean here━ ‘to graze’ also); इन्द्रियाणां<BR> हि चरताम् Bg. 2. 67; कपयश्चेरुरार्तस्य रामस्येव मनोरथाः R. 12. 59;<BR> Ms. 2. 23, 6. 68, 8. 236, 9. 306, 10. 55.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">Page0698-2</a>]<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To perform, do, act; रचयति रेखाः सलिले यस्तु खले चरति<BR> सत्कारम् Bv. 1. 98.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To practise, perform, observe; चरतः किल दुश्चरं तपः<BR> R. 8. 79; Y. 1. 60; Ms. 3. 30.<BR>—3 To act, behave towards, conduct oneself (oft. with loc. of the person);<BR> चरतीनां च कामतः Ms. 5. 90, 9. 287; आत्मवत्सर्वभूतेषु यश्चरेत्<BR> Mb.; तस्यां त्वं साधु नाचरः R. 1. 76 (where the root may be also आचर्).<BR>—4 To graze; सुचिरं हि चरन् शस्यम् H. 3. 9.<BR>—5 To eat, consume.<BR>—6 To be engaged in, be busy with.<BR>—7 To live, continue to be, continue in any state.<BR>—8 To spread, be diffused.<BR>—9 To live, be, exist.<BR>—10 To move, travel through, pervade, go along, follow. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> (चारयति)<BR>—1 To cause to move or go.<BR>—2 To send, direct, move.<BR>—3 To drive away.<BR>—4 To cause to perform or practise.<BR>—5 To cause to copulate.<BR>—6 To cause to graze, pasture.<BR>—7 To obtain knowledge of, acquaint oneself with.<BR>—8 To doubt. [cf. L. <i>curro</i>.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर|चरः
चर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>) [चर्-अच्]<BR>—1 Moving, going, walking, grazing &c.; धर्मारण्यचरेषु प्राणिषु Ś. 5. 9.<BR>—2 Following, practising (at the end of comp.).<BR>—3 Trembling, shaking.<BR>—4 Movable; see चराचर below; Ms. 3. 201; Bg. 13. 15.<BR>—5 Animate; Ms. 5. 29, 7. 15.<BR>—6 (Used as an affix) formerly, late; आढ्यचर ‘one who was formerly rich’<BR> so देवदत्तचर, अध्यापकचर late teacher &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरः|चर
चर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A spy.<BR>—2 A wagtail.<BR>—3 A game played with dice and men.<BR>—4 A cowrie.<BR>—5 The planet Mars.<BR>—6 (Hence) Tuesday.<BR>—7 The seventh Karaṇa in astrology.<BR>—8 The Karaṇas taken collectively.<BR>—9 The difference of time between two meridians.<BR>—10 The first, fourth, seventh, and tenth signs of the zodiac.<BR>—11 The wind; क्वाहं तमोमहदहंखचराग्निवार्भूसंवेष्टिताण्डघटसप्तवितस्तिकायः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 14. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चराचर, चररम्, चरगृहम्, चरद्रव्यम्, चरपुष्टः, चरभम्, चरभवनम्, चरमूर्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चराचर|चराचरं|चराचरः
चर + -अचर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 movable and immovable; चराचराणां भूतानां कुक्षिराधारतां गतः<BR> Ku. 6. 67, 2. 5; Bg. 11. 43.<BR>—2 wished, desired.<BR>—3 shaking, trembling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चररम्
चर + -रम्<BR>—1 the aggregate of all created things, the world; Ms. 1. 57, 63, 3. 75;<BR> Bg. 11. 7, 9. 10.<BR>—2 the sky, the atmosphere.<BR>—3 heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चररी
चर + -रम् + .({@-री@}) a young woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरगृहम्
चर + -गृहम् the zodiacs of मेष, कर्क, तुला and मकर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरद्रव्यम्
चर + -द्रव्यम् movables, goods and chattels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरपुष्टः|चरपुष्ट
चर + -पुष्टः a mediator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरभम्
चर + -भम्, -भवनम् a varying sign of the zodiac; <i>i. e.</i> the first,<BR> fourth, seventh and tenth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरभवनम्
चर + -भम्, -भवनम् a varying sign of the zodiac; <i>i. e.</i> the first,<BR> fourth, seventh and tenth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरमूर्तिः|चरमूर्ति
चर + -मूर्तिः <i>f.</i> an idol which is carried about in procession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरकः|चरक
चरकः<BR>—1 A spy.<BR>—2 A wandering mendicant, a vagrant.<BR>—3 N. of a sage and physician supposed to be serpent-king Śeṣa come<BR> to the earth. [He composed a new book on medicine, based on other works<BR> of Agniveśa and other pupils of Ātreya].<BR>—4 N. of a lexicographer <i>m.</i> (<i>pl.</i>); cf. P. IV. 3. 107.<BR>—5 N. of a branch of the black Yajurveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरटः|चरट
चरटः The wag-tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणः|चरण|चरणं
चरणः, -णम्<BR> [चर्-करणे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 A foot; शिरसि चरण एष न्यस्यते वारयैनम् Ve. 3. 38; जात्या<BR> काममवध्योऽसि चरणं त्विदमुद्धृतम् 39.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">Page0699-1</a>]<BR>—2 A support, pillar, prop.<BR>—3 The root of a tree.<BR>—4 The single line of a stanza.<BR>—5 A quarter.<BR>—6 A school or branch of any of the Vedas; <i>e. g.</i> चरणगुरवः Mv. 1; Māl. 1;<BR> Pt. 4. 3.<BR>—7 A race. —8 (In prosody) A dactyl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणम्
चरणः, -णम्<BR> [चर्-करणे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 A foot; शिरसि चरण एष न्यस्यते वारयैनम् Ve. 3. 38; जात्या<BR> काममवध्योऽसि चरणं त्विदमुद्धृतम् 39.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">Page0699-1</a>]<BR>—2 A support, pillar, prop.<BR>—3 The root of a tree.<BR>—4 The single line of a stanza.<BR>—5 A quarter.<BR>—6 A school or branch of any of the Vedas; <i>e. g.</i> चरणगुरवः Mv. 1; Māl. 1;<BR> Pt. 4. 3.<BR>—7 A race. —8 (In prosody) A dactyl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणः|चरण|चरणं
चरणः, -णम् + .{@-णः@} A foot-soldier.<BR>—2 A ray of light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणम्
चरणः, -णम् + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Moving, roaming, wandering.<BR>—2 Performance, practising; Ms. 6. 75.<BR>—3 Conduct of life, behaviour (moral).<BR>—4 Accomplishment.<BR>—5 Eating, consuming.<BR>—6 Course.<BR>—7 Acting, dealing, managing, conduct.<BR>—8 Fixed observance of any class, age (as priesthood &c.);<BR>—9 studying under strict rules of ब्रह्मचर्य; विशुद्धवीर्याश्चरणोपपन्नाः Mb. 5. 30. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चरणाचलः, चरणामृतम्, चरणोदकम्, चरणारविन्दम्, चरणकमलम्, चरणपद्मम्, चरणायुधः, चरणास्कन्दनम्, चरणोपधानम्, चरणगत, चरणग्रन्थिः, चरणन्यासः, चरणपः, चरणपतनम्, चरणपतित, चरणपातः, चरणयोधिन्, चरणव्यूहः, चरणशुश्रूषा, चरणसेवा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणाचलः
चरणः + -अचलः The setting mountain; यातोऽस्तमेष चरमाचलचूडचुम्बी Murārināṭakam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणामृतम्
चरणः + -अमृतम्, -उदकम् water in which the feet of a (revered) Brāhmaṇa<BR> or spiritual guide have been washed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणोदकम्
चरणः + -अमृतम्, -उदकम् water in which the feet of a (revered) Brāhmaṇa<BR> or spiritual guide have been washed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणारविन्दम्
चरणः + -अरविन्दम्, -कमलम्, -पद्मम् a lotus-like foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणकमलम्
चरणः + -अरविन्दम्, -कमलम्, -पद्मम् a lotus-like foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणपद्मम्
चरणः + -अरविन्दम्, -कमलम्, -पद्मम् a lotus-like foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणायुधः|चरणायुध
चरणः + -आयुधः a cock; आकर्ण्य संप्रति रुतं चरणायुधानाम् S. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणास्कन्दनम्
चरणः + -आस्कन्दनम् trampling, treading under foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणोपधानम्
चरणः + -उपधानम् A foot-rest; कृष्णा च तेषां चरणोपधाने Mb. 1. 193. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणगत
चरणः + -गत <i>a.</i> fallen at the feet, prostrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणग्रन्थिः|चरणग्रन्थि|चरणग्रंथि
चरणः + -ग्रन्थिः <i>m.</i>, {@-पर्वन्@} <i>n.</i><BR> the ankle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणन्यासः|चरणन्यास
चरणः + -न्यासः a footstep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणपः|चरणप
चरणः + -पः a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणपतनम्
चरणः + -पतनम् falling down or prostration (at the feet of another); Amaru. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणपतित
चरणः + -पतित <i>a.</i> prostrate at the feet; Me. 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणपातः|चरणपात
चरणः + -पातः<BR>—1 tread, trampling.<BR>—2 footfall.<BR>—3 prostration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणयोधिन्
चरणः + -योधिन् <i>m.</i> (= -आयुधः)<BR> विहिता वृक्षमूले तु वृत्तिश्चरणयोधिनाम् Rām. 4. 58. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणव्यूहः|चरणव्यूह|चरणव्यूहं
चरणः + -व्यूहः A book dealing with the <i>śākhās</i> of the vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणशुश्रूषा
चरणः + -शुश्रूषा, -सेवा<BR>—1 prostration.<BR>—2 service, devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणसेवा
चरणः + -शुश्रूषा, -सेवा<BR>—1 prostration.<BR>—2 service, devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरणिः|चरणि
चरणिः A man (मनुष्य); सुविद्वांसं चर्कृत्यं चरणीनाम् Rv. 8. 24. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरण्यु
चरण्यु <i>a.</i> Ved. moving, movable (चरणशील); हृदेचक्षुर्न<BR> ग्रन्थिनी चरण्युः Rv. 10. 95. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरथ|चरथः
चरथ <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Moving, living.<BR>—2 Movable; कृधी न ऊर्ध्वाञ्चरथाय जीवसे Rv. 1. 36. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरथः|चरथ
चरथ + .{@-थः, -थम्@}<BR>—1 Going, moving.<BR>—2 Movableness.<BR>—3 Life.<BR>—4 A way; स्थातुश्चरथं भयते पतत्रिणः Rv. 1. 58. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरथम्
चरथ + .{@-थः, -थम्@}<BR>—1 Going, moving.<BR>—2 Movableness.<BR>—3 Life.<BR>—4 A way; स्थातुश्चरथं भयते पतत्रिणः Rv. 1. 58. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरम|चरमः
चरम <i>a.</i> [चर्-अमच् Uṇ. 5. 69]<BR>—1 Last, ultimate, final; चरमा क्रिया ‘the final or funeral ceremony’.<BR>—2 Posterior, back; पृष्ठं तु चरमं तनोः Ak.<BR>—3 Old (as age).<BR>—4 Outermost.<BR>—5 Western, west.<BR>—6 Lowest, least.<BR>—7 Western; बृसीं चरमशैर्षिकीम् Rām. 13. 10. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरमम्
चरम + .{@-मम्@} <i>ind.</i> At last; at the end.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चरमाचलः, चरमाद्रिः, चरमक्ष्माभृत्, चरमावस्था, चरमकालः, चरमवयस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरमाचलः|चरमाचल
चरम + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -क्ष्माभृत् <i>m.</i> the western mountain behind which<BR> the sun and moon are supposed to set.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरमाद्रिः|चरमाद्रि
चरम + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -क्ष्माभृत् <i>m.</i> the western mountain behind which<BR> the sun and moon are supposed to set.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरमक्ष्माभृत्
चरम + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -क्ष्माभृत् <i>m.</i> the western mountain behind which<BR> the sun and moon are supposed to set.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरमावस्था
चरम + -अवस्था the last state (old age).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरमकालः|चरमकाल
चरम + -कालः the hour of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरमवयस्
चरम + -वयस् <i>a.</i> new, aged; Māl. 6. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरिः|चरि
चरिः [चर्-इन्] An animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरित|चरितं
चरित <i>p. p.</i> [चर् कर्मणि क्त]<BR>—1 Wandered or roamed over, gone.<BR>—2 Performed, practised.<BR>—3 Attained.<BR>—4 Known.<BR>—5 Offered; Ś. 4. 21.<BR>—6 Acted, behaved; Ś. 5. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरितम्
चरित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Going, moving, course.<BR>—2 Acting,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">Page0699-2</a>]<BR> doing, practice, behaviour, acts, deeds; उदारचरितानाम् H. 1. 70;<BR> सर्वं खलस्य चरितं मशकः करोति 1. 81.<BR>—3 Life, biography, adventures, history उत्तरं रामचरितं तत्प्रणीतं<BR> प्रयुज्यते U. 1. 2; दिवौकसस्त्वच्चरितं लिखन्ति Ś. 7. 5; so दशकुमारचरितम् &c.<BR>—4 Nature.<BR>—5 Fixed law, due or proper observance.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चरितार्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरितार्थ|चरितार्थः
चरित + -अर्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 that has accomplished its end or desired object, successful; रामरावणयोर्युद्धं<BR> चरितार्थमिवाभवत् R. 12. 87; चरितार्थैव भारती 10. 36; Ki. 13. 62.<BR> राज्ञां तु चरितार्थता दुःखोत्तरा एव Ś. 5; चरितार्थत्वात् प्रधानविनिवृत्तेः Sāṅ. K. 68.<BR>—2 satisfied, contented.<BR>—3 effected, accomplished.<BR>—4 significant, true to its sense; Ku. 2. 17.<BR>—5 appropriate, fit; Ku. 4. 45. ˚ता the attainment of the desired object; Ś. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरितव्य
चरितव्य <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 To be gone.<BR>—2 To be followed, practised or performed &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरित्रम्
चरित्रम् [चर् इत्र]<BR>—1 Behaviour, habit, conduct, practice, acts, deeds.<BR>—2 Performance, observance.<BR>—3 History, life, biography, account, adventures.<BR>—4 Nature, disposition.<BR>—5 Duty, established or instituted observance; Ms. 2. 20, 9. 7.<BR>—6 A foot, leg.<BR>—7 Going.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरित्रा
चरित्रम् + .{@-त्रा@} The tamarind tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चरित्रबन्धकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरित्रबन्धकः|चरित्रबन्धक
चरित्रम् + -बन्धकः a friendly pledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरिष्णु|चरिष्णुः
चरिष्णु <i>a.</i> [चर्-इष्णुच्] Movable, active, wandering about; Ms. 1. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरीत्रम्
चरीत्रम् Behaviour, conduct, practice &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्य|चर्य्य
चर्य <i>a.</i> [चर्-कर्मणि यत्] To be gone; to be practised &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्या|चर्य्या
चर्य + .{@-र्या@}<BR>—1 Going about, moving, walking about; driving or going in a carriage;<BR> रथ˚ U. 5.<BR>—2 Course, motion; as in सहचर्या.<BR>—3 Behaviour, conduct, deportment.<BR>—4 Practice, performance, observance; Ms. 1. 111; व्रतचर्या, तपश्चर्या.<BR>—5 Regular performance of all rites or customs.<BR>—6 Eating.<BR>—7 A custom, usage; Ms. 6. 32.<BR>—8 Pervading; visiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्यम्
चर्य + .{@-र्यम्@}<BR>—1 Going about.<BR>—2 Behaviour, conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरुः|चरु
चरुः [चर् उन्]<BR>—1 An oblation of rice or barley boiled for presentation to the gods and<BR> the manes; अनवस्रावी निरुष्मपक्व ओदनश्चरुरिति याज्ञिकाः ओदनेऽपि<BR> चरुशब्दः प्रयुज्यते । ŚB. on MS. 10. 1. 36. (It is often boiled in<BR> milk and is called पयश्चरु; cf. R. 10. 51, 54, 56; or sprinkled<BR> over with butter or ghee); वन्यैश्चरुपुरोडाशैः Bhāg. 11. 18. 7.<BR>—2 A kind of vessel in which an oblation is prepared. प्रसिद्धश्च स्थाल्यां<BR> चरुशब्दः आ च हिमवतः आ च कुमारीभ्यः प्रयुज्यमानो दृष्टः । ŚB. on MS.<BR> on MS. 10. 1. 35.<BR>—3 A cloud.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चरुचेलिन्, चरुव्रणः, चरुस्थाली<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरुचेलिन्
चरुः + -चेलिन् <i>m.</i> N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरुव्रणः|चरुव्रण
चरुः + -व्रणः A kind of cake; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चरुस्थाली
चरुः + -स्थाली a vessel for boiling rice &c. for presentation to the gods and the manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्कृतिः|चर्कृति
चर्कृतिः <i>f.</i> Ved. Mention, praise, glory; अस्माकमस्तु चर्कृतिः<BR> Rv. 5. 74. 9, 6. 48. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्घ्
चर्घ् €1 P. (चर्घति) To go or move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्च्
चर्च् I. €10 U. (चर्चयति-ते चर्चित). To read, read carefully,<BR> peruse, study. ━II. €6 P. (चर्चति, चर्चित)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0700-1" target="_blank">Page0700-1</a>]<BR>—1 To abuse, condemn, censure, menace.<BR>—2 To discuss, consider, investigate.<BR>—3 To injure, hurt.<BR>—4 To anoint, smear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चः|चर्च|चर्च्च
चर्चः [चर्च्-अच्] Considering, deliberation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चक
चर्चक <i>a.</i> [चर्च्-ण्वुल्] Repeating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चनम्
चर्चनम् [चर्च्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Studying, repetition, reading repeatedly.<BR>—2 Smearing the body with unguents; ज्योत्स्नाचन्दनचर्चनैः … Sūkti. 5. 91.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चरिका
चर्चरिका, चर्चरी<BR> [चर्च्-बा˚ अरन् गौराङीष्]<BR>—1 A kind of song.<BR>—2 Striking the hands to beat time (in music).<BR>—3 The recitation of scholars.<BR>—4 Festive sport, festive cries or merriment.<BR>—5 A festival<BR>—6 Flattery.<BR>—7 Curled hair.<BR>—8 Triple symphony.<BR>—9 Alternate recitation of a poem by two persons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्चरी|चर्च्चरी
