चर्व्
चर्व् €1 P., €10 U. (चर्वति, चर्वयति-ते, चर्वित)<BR>—1 To chew, chop, eat, browse, bit; लाङ्गूलं गाढतरं चर्वितुमारब्धवान्<BR> Pt. 4; यस्यैतत्त्च न कुक्कुरैरहरहर्जङ्घान्तरं चर्व्यते Mk. 2. 11.<BR>—2 To suck up.<BR>—3 To relish, taste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्वणम्
चर्वणम्, -णा<BR> [चर्व् भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Chewing, eating.<BR>—2 Sipping, tasting.<BR>—3 Food which must be chewed, solid food.<BR>—4 (Fig.) Tasting, relishing, enjoying; प्रमाणं चर्वणैवात्र स्वाभिन्ने<BR> विदुषां मतम् S. D. 57; (com. = चर्वणा आस्वादनं तच्च स्वादः काव्यार्थसंभेदादात्मानन्दसमुद्भव<BR> इत्युक्तप्रकारम्); so also; निष्पत्त्या चर्वणस्यास्य निष्पत्तिरुपचारतः 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्वणा
चर्वणम्, -णा<BR> [चर्व् भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Chewing, eating.<BR>—2 Sipping, tasting.<BR>—3 Food which must be chewed, solid food.<BR>—4 (Fig.) Tasting, relishing, enjoying; प्रमाणं चर्वणैवात्र स्वाभिन्ने<BR> विदुषां मतम् S. D. 57; (com. = चर्वणा आस्वादनं तच्च स्वादः काव्यार्थसंभेदादात्मानन्दसमुद्भव<BR> इत्युक्तप्रकारम्); so also; निष्पत्त्या चर्वणस्यास्य निष्पत्तिरुपचारतः 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्वा|चर्व्वा
चर्वा [चर्व्-अङ्]<BR>—1 A blow with the flat of the hand (said to be also चर्वन् <i>m.</i>).<BR>—2 Chewing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्वित|चर्व्वित|चर्व्वितं
चर्वित <i>p. p.</i> [चर्व् कर्मणि क्त]<BR>—1 Chewed, bitten, eaten.<BR>—2 Tasted.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चर्वितचर्वणम्, चर्वितपात्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्वितचर्वणम्
चर्वित + -चर्वणम् (lit.) chewing the chewed; (fig.) tautology, useless<BR> repetition, profitless reiteration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्वितपात्रम्
चर्वित + -पात्रम् a spitting pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्व्य|चर्व्व्य|चर्व्व्यं
चर्व्य <i>p. p.</i> [चर्व् कर्मणि ण्यत् यत् वा] To be chewed, chewable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्व्यम्
चर्व्य + .{@-र्व्यम्@} Solid food, such as requires mastication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्षणि|चर्षणिः
चर्षणि <i>a.</i> [कृष् अनि आदेश्च चः Tv.] Ved.<BR>—1 Seeing, observing.<BR>—2 Moving, movable.<BR>—3 Swift active, पिता कुटस्य चर्षणिः Rv. 1. 46. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चर्षणिः|चर्षणि
चर्षणि + .{@-णिः@} A man; सुवीर्याय चर्षणयो मदन्ति Rv. 1. 184. 4; मायाऽश्विनौ<BR> समनक्ति चर्षणी Mb. 1. 3. 61. ━<i>f.</i> A disloyal woman (बन्धकी);<BR> स चर्षणीनामुदगाच्छुचो मृजन् Bhāg. 10. 29. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चल्
चल् I. €1 P. (चलति, rarely चलते, चचाल, अचालीत्, चलितुम्, चलित)<BR>—1 To shake, tremble, move, throb, palpitate, stir; छिन्नाश्चेलुः क्षणं<BR> भुजाः Bk. 14. 40; सपक्षोद्रिरिवाचालीत् 15. 24, 6. 84.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To go, move on, walk, stir or move (from oneʼs place); पदात्पदमपि<BR> चलितुं न शक्नोति Pt. 4; चलत्येकेन पादेन तिष्ठत्येकेन बुद्धिमान्<BR> Cāṇ. 32; चचाल बाला स्तनभिन्नवल्कला Ku. 5. 84; Mk. 1. 56.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To proceed (on oneʼs way), depart, set out, start off; चेलुश्चीरपरिग्रहाः<BR> Ku. 6. 92 v. l.<BR>—3 To be affected, to be disturbed, confused or disordered (as mind),<BR> be agitated or perturbed; मुनेरपि यतस्तस्य दर्शनाच्चलते मनः<BR> Pt. 1. 400; लोभेन बुद्धिश्चलति H. 1. 140.<BR>—4 To deviate or swerve (with abl.); चलति नयान्न जिगीषतां हि चेतः<BR> Ki. 10. 29; to fall off, leave; Ms. 7. 15; Y. 1. 361. ━<i>Caus.</i> (चचा-लयति,<BR> चलित, चालित)<BR>—1 To cause to move, shake, stir; R. 8. 53.<BR>—2 To drive away, dismiss, remove or expel from; चाणक्ये चलिताधिकारविमुखे Mu. 4. 15.<BR>—3 To lead away from.<BR>—4 To cherish, foster (चालयति only).<BR>—5 To disturb, agitate; सुजनं जनाश्चलयितुं क ईशते Śi. 15. 40.<BR>━II. €6 P. (चलति, चलित) To sport, play, frolic about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चल|चलं|चलः
चल <i>a.</i> [चल्-अच्]<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Moving trembling, shaking, tremulous, rolling (as eyes &c.);<BR> चलापाङ्गां दृष्टिं स्पृशसि Ś. 1. 24; चलकाकपक्षकैरमात्यपुत्रैः<BR> R. 3. 28 waving; Bh. 1. 16.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Movable (opp. स्थिर), moving; चले लक्ष्ये Ś. 2. 5; परिचयं<BR> चललक्ष्यनिपातने R. 9. 49.<BR>—2 Unsteady, fickle, inconstant, loose, unfixed; दयिताखनवस्थितं<BR> नृणां न खलु प्रेम चलं सुहृज्जने Ku. 4. 28; प्रायश्चलं गौरवमाश्रितेषु 3. 1.<BR>—3 Frail, transitory, perishable; चला लक्ष्मीश्चलाः प्राणाश्चलं जीवितयौवनम् Bh. 3. 128.<BR>—4 Confused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलः|चल|चलं
चल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 Trembling, shaking, agitation.<BR>—2 Wind.<BR>—3 Quicksilver.<BR>—4 The supreme being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चला
चल + .{@-ला@}<BR>—1 Lakṣmī, the goddess of wealth.<BR>—2 Lightning.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">Page0701-2</a>]<BR>—3 A kind of perfume.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चलाचल, चलातङ्कः, चलात्मन्, चलेन्द्रिय, चलेषुः, चलकर्णः, चलचञ्चुः, चलचित्त, चलदलः, चलपत्रः, चलसन्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलाचल|चलाचलः
चल + -अचल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 movable and immovable.<BR>—2 fickle, unsteady, very transitory (= अतिचल); चलाचले च संसारे<BR> धर्म एको हि निश्चलः Bh. 3. 128; लक्ष्मीमिव चलाचलाम् Ki. 11. 30<BR> (चलाचला = चञ्चला Malli.); कस्य न भवति चलाचलं धनम् Mk. 2. 14;<BR> N. 1. 60; चलाचलैरनुपदमाहताः खुरैः Śi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलाचलः|चलाचल
चल + -अचल + ({@-लः@}) a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलातङ्कः|चलातङ्क
चल + -आतङ्कः rheumatism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलात्मन्
चल + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> inconstant, fickle-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलेन्द्रिय|चलेंद्रिय
चल + -इन्द्रिय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 sensitive.<BR>—2 sensual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलेषुः|चलेषु
चल + -इषुः one whose arrow flies unsteadily or misses the mark, a bad archer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलकर्णः|चलकर्ण
चल + -कर्णः the true distance of a planet from the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलचञ्चुः|चलचञ्चु|चलचंचु
चल + -चञ्चुः the Chakora bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलचित्त
चल + -चित्त <i>a.</i> fickle-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलदलः|चलदल
चल + -दलः, -पत्रः the Aśvattha tree; बिल्वैश्चलदलैरपि Parṇāl. 4. 62;<BR> लीलाचलाचलं भाले हैमं चलदलच्छदम् (Mar. पिंपळपान)<BR> Śiva B. 6. 83. ˚च्छदः An ornament worn on the forehead, having<BR> the shape of the leaf of the Aśvattha tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलपत्रः|चलपत्र|चलपत्त्रः
चल + -दलः, -पत्रः the Aśvattha tree; बिल्वैश्चलदलैरपि Parṇāl. 4. 62;<BR> लीलाचलाचलं भाले हैमं चलदलच्छदम् (Mar. पिंपळपान)<BR> Śiva B. 6. 83. ˚च्छदः An ornament worn on the forehead, having<BR> the shape of the leaf of the Aśvattha tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलसन्धिः|चलसन्धि|चलसंधि
चल + -सन्धिः movable articulation of the bones.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलत्पूर्णिमा|चलत्पूर्ण्णिमा
चलत्पूर्णिमा <i>f.</i> A kind of fish (L. D. B.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलदङ्गः|चलदङ्ग
चलदङ्गः (चलत् + अङ्ग) A kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलद्विषः|चलद्विष
चलद्विषः The Kokila or Indian cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलन|चलनं|चलनः
चलन <i>a.</i> [चल् भावे ल्युट्] Moving, tremulous, trembling, shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलनः|चलन|चलनं
चलन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 A foot.<BR>—2 A deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलनम्
चलन + .{@-नम्@} Trembling, shaking or shaking motion; चलनात्मकं कर्म<BR> T. S.; हस्त˚, जानु˚ &c.; तरलदृगञ्चलचलनमनोहरवदनजनितरतिरागम् Gīt. 11.<BR>—2 Turning or leaving off.<BR>—3 Roaming, wandering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलनी
चलन + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 A short petticoat worn by common women.<BR>—2 The rope for tying an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलनकम्
चलनकम् [चलनं संज्ञायां कन्] A short petticoat worn by low women.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलनिका
चलनकम् + .{@-निका@} Silken fringes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलित|चलितं
चलित <i>p. p.</i> [चल्-क्त]<BR>—1 Shaken, moved, stirred agitated.<BR>—2 Gone, departed; एवमुक्त्वा स चलितः<BR>—3 attained.<BR>—4 known, understood.<BR>—5 Removed, displaced (see चल्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलितम्
चलित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Shaking, moving.<BR>—2 Going, walking.<BR>—3 A kind of dance; चलितं नाम नाट्यमन्तरेण M. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलुः|चलु
चलुः [चल्-उन्] A mouthful (of water).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलुकः|चलुक
चलुकः [चलुना मीयते कन् Tv.]<BR>—1 Water taken up in the hollowed palm for rinsing the mouth.<BR>—2 A handful or mouthful (of water); cf. चुलुक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चलिः|चलि
चलिः A cover, wrapper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चविः|चवि
चविः, -कम्, -का, -वी, -व्यकम्, -व्या<BR> A kind of pepper. L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चविकम्
चविः, -कम्, -का, -वी, -व्यकम्, -व्या<BR> A kind of pepper. L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चविका
चविः, -कम्, -का, -वी, -व्यकम्, -व्या<BR> A kind of pepper. L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चवी
चविः, -कम्, -का, -वी, -व्यकम्, -व्या<BR> A kind of pepper. L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चव्यकम्
चविः, -कम्, -का, -वी, -व्यकम्, -व्या<BR> A kind of pepper. L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चव्या
चविः, -कम्, -का, -वी, -व्यकम्, -व्या<BR> A kind of pepper. L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चव्यम्
चव्यम् A kind of vegetable, pepper (Mar. चवक); ग्रन्थिकं<BR> च पलां चव्यम् … Śiva B. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चष्
चष् I. €1 U. (चषति-ते) To eat. ━II. €1 P. (चषति) To kill, injure, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चषकः|चषक|चषकं
चषकः, -कम्<BR> [चष्-करणे क्वुन्] A vessel used for drinking spirits,<BR> a goblet, a wine-glass; च्युतैः शिरस्त्रैश्चषकोत्तरेव R. 7. 49; मुखं<BR> लालाक्लिन्नं पिबति चषकं सासवमिव Śānti. 1. 29;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">Page0702-1</a>]<BR> Ki. 9. 56, 57; Māl. 5. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चषकम्
चषकः, -कम्<BR> [चष्-करणे क्वुन्] A vessel used for drinking spirits,<BR> a goblet, a wine-glass; च्युतैः शिरस्त्रैश्चषकोत्तरेव R. 7. 49; मुखं<BR> लालाक्लिन्नं पिबति चषकं सासवमिव Śānti. 1. 29;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">Page0702-1</a>]<BR> Ki. 9. 56, 57; Māl. 5. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चषकम्
चषकः, -कम् + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A kind of spirituous liquor.<BR>—2 Honey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चषतिः|चषति
चषतिः [चष्-भावे अति]<BR>—1 Eating.<BR>—2 Killing.<BR>—3 Decay, infirmity, decline.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चषालः|चषाल
चषालः<BR>—1 A wooden ring on the top of a sacrificial post; चषालं ये अश्वयूपाय<BR> तक्षति Rv. 1. 162. 6; चषालयूपतच्छन्नो हिरण्यरशनं विभुः<BR> Bhāg. 4. 19. 19.<BR>—2 An iron ring at the base of the post.<BR>—3 A hive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चह्
चह् €1 P., €10 U. (चहति, चहयति-ते)<BR>—1 To be wicked.<BR>—2 To cheat, deceive.<BR>—3 To be proud or haughty.<BR>—4 To grind, pound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाकचक्यम्
चाकचक्यम् Brilliancy, lustre; Vedānta P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्र
चाक्र <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [चकेण निर्वृत्तम् अण्]<BR>—1 Carried on with the discus (as a battle).<BR>—2 Circular.<BR>—3 Relating to a wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्रिक|चाक्रिकः
चाक्रिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [चक्रेण चरति ठक्]<BR>—1 See चाक above.<BR>—2 Relating to a company or circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्रिकः|चाक्रिक
चाक्रिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A potter.<BR>—2 An oil-maker; Y. 1. 165 (= तैलिक according to Mit.; शाकटिक<BR> or cartman according to others); चाक्रिकैरतिरूक्षत्वं तिलपिण्याकयोरिव<BR> Rāj. T. 6. 272; ताम्बूलिकाश्चाक्रिकाश्च … Śiva B. 31. 19.<BR>—3 A proclaimer.<BR>—4 A bard, chorister.<BR>—5 A coachman, driver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्रिणः|चाक्रिण
चाक्रिणः The son of a potter or oil-maker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्रेय
चाक्रेय <i>a.</i> [चक्र-ढञ्] Relating to a wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्रायणः|चाक्रायण
चाक्रायणः Patronym of Uṣasta; Śat. Br. 14. 6; Ch. Up. 1. 10. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्षुष|चाक्षुषं|चाक्षुषः
चाक्षुष <i>a.</i> (-षी <i>f.</i>) [चक्षुषा गृह्यते, चक्षुस्-अण्]<BR>—1 Depending on, or produced from, sight.<BR>—2 Belonging to the eye, visual, optical; M. 1. 4.<BR>—3 Visible, to be seen;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्षुषः|चाक्षुष|चाक्षुषं
चाक्षुष + .{@-षः@} N. of the sixth Manu; चाक्षुषश्च महातेजा विवस्वत्सुत<BR> एव च Ms. 1. 62; रूपं स जगृहे मात्स्यं चाक्षुषोदधिसंप्लवे Bhāg. 1. 3. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्षुषम्
चाक्षुष + .{@-षम्@} Knowledge dependent on vision.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चाक्षुषज्ञानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्षुषज्ञानम्
चाक्षुष + -ज्ञानम् ocular evidence or proof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्षुष्यम्
चाक्षुष्यम् A kind of collyrium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाक्ष्म
चाक्ष्म <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Seeing, a seer.<BR>—2 Forbearing, gracious, kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाङ्गः|चाङ्ग|चांग|चांगः
चाङ्गः<BR>—1 Wood-sorrel.<BR>—2 Whiteness or beauty of the teeth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाङ्गेरिका
चाङ्गेरिका <i>f.</i> A medicinal herb used as an antidote against bile<BR> and wind; चाङ्गेरी वातपित्तहरा काचिदौषधिः (Mar. चुका ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाचरिः|चाचरि
चाचरिः N. of a wrestler; अक्षोटमल्लः समरे तत्र मल्लश्च चाचरिः<BR> Rāj. T. 7. 1501.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाञ्चल्यम्
चाञ्चल्यम् [चञ्चल-ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Unsteadiness, quick motion, rolling, tremour (as of the eyes &c.); Bv. 2. 60.<BR>—2 Fickleness.<BR>—3 Transitoriness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटः|चाट
चाटः [चट्-भेदे अच्] A rogue or cheat, swindler, one who wins<BR> the confidence of the person he wishes to deceive; Y. 1. 336; (चाटा =<BR> प्रतारकाः विश्वास्य ये परधनमपहरन्ति Mit.); Pt. 1. 343.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटकैरः|चाटकैर
चाटकैरः A young sparrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटलिका
चाटलिका <i>f.</i> N. of a locality; Rāj. T. 8. 766.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुः|चाटु
चाटुः, -टु <i>n.</i><BR>—1 [चट्-उण्] Pleasing or agreeable words, sweet or coaxing speech,<BR> flattery (especially of a lover to his sweet-heart); प्रियः प्रियायाः<BR> प्रकरोति चाटुम् Ṛs. 6. 14; विरचितचाटुवचनरचनं चरणरचितप्रणिपातम्<BR> Gīt. 11; Amaru. 83; Pt. 1. 175; Śānti. 3. 14; C. P. 20; (the greater<BR> part of the 10th canto of गीतगोविन्द consists of such coaxing)<BR>—2 Distinct or clear speech.<BR>—3 Endearing words or acts; Māl. 10. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चाटूक्तिः, चाटूल्लोल, चाटुकार, चाटुपटु, चाटुबटुः, चाटुलोल, चाटुशतम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटु|चाटुः
चाटुः, -टु <i>n.</i><BR>—1 [चट्-उण्] Pleasing or agreeable words, sweet or coaxing speech,<BR> flattery (especially of a lover to his sweet-heart); प्रियः प्रियायाः<BR> प्रकरोति चाटुम् Ṛs. 6. 14; विरचितचाटुवचनरचनं चरणरचितप्रणिपातम्<BR> Gīt. 11; Amaru. 83; Pt. 1. 175; Śānti. 3. 14; C. P. 20; (the greater<BR> part of the 10th canto of गीतगोविन्द consists of such coaxing)<BR>—2 Distinct or clear speech.<BR>—3 Endearing words or acts; Māl. 10. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चाटूक्तिः, चाटूल्लोल, चाटुकार, चाटुपटु, चाटुबटुः, चाटुलोल, चाटुशतम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटूक्तिः|चाटूक्ति
चाटुः + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 flattering or coaxing language.<BR>—2 service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटूल्लोल
चाटुः + -उल्लोल, -कार <i>a.</i> speaking agreeably or sweetly, flatterer;<BR> शिप्रावातः प्रियतम इव प्रार्थनाचाटुकारः Me. 31; सोऽभवद्विटवन्द्यादिचाटुकारविधेयधीः<BR> Rāj. T. 5. 352.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुकार
चाटुः + -उल्लोल, -कार <i>a.</i> speaking agreeably or sweetly, flatterer;<BR> शिप्रावातः प्रियतम इव प्रार्थनाचाटुकारः Me. 31; सोऽभवद्विटवन्द्यादिचाटुकारविधेयधीः<BR> Rāj. T. 5. 352.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुपटु|चाटुपटुः
चाटुः + -पटु <i>a.</i> skilful in using flattering or coaxing language,<BR> an accomplished flatterer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुबटुः
चाटुः + -बटुः a jester, buffoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुलोल|चाटुलोलः
चाटुः + -लोल <i>a.</i> elegantly tremulous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुशतम्
चाटुः + -शतम् a hundred entreaties, repeated coaxing; पटुचाटुशतैरनुकूलम्<BR> Gīt. 2; गजपुङ्गवस्तु धीरं विलोकयति चाटुशतैश्च भुङ्क्ते Bh. 2. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुकः|चाटुक
चाटुकः, -कम्<BR> Pleasing or grateful discourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाटुकम्
चाटुकः, -कम्<BR> Pleasing or grateful discourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाणकीन|चाणकीनं
चाणकीन <i>a.</i> [चणकस्य भवनं क्षेत्रम्, खञ्] Fit for, or<BR> sown with, the chick-pea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाणक्यः|चाणक्य
चाणक्यः N. of a celebrated writer on civil polity; also known as<BR> विष्णुगुप्त, कौटिल्य; see कौटिल्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाणूरः|चाणूर
चाणूरः A celebrated wrestler in the service of Kaṃsa. When Kṛṣṇa<BR> was taken by Akrūra to Mathurā, Kaṃsa sent this redoubtable wrestler<BR> to fight with him; but in the duel which ensued, Kṛṣṇa whirled him<BR> round and round several times and smashed his head.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चाणूरमर्दनः, चाणूरसूदनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाणूरमर्दनः|चाणूरमर्दन
चाणूरः + -मर्दनः, -सूदनः N. of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाणूरसूदनः|चाणूरसूदन
चाणूरः + -मर्दनः, -सूदनः N. of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाण्डम्
चाण्डम् Violence, force.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाण्डालः|चाण्डाल|चांडाल|चांडालः
चाण्डालः (-ली <i>f.</i>) [चण्डाल एव स्वार्थे अण्] An out-caste;<BR> see चण्डाल; चण्डालः किमयं द्विजातिरथवा Bh. 3. 56; Ms. 3. 239, 4. 79;<BR> Y. 1. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाण्डालिका|चांडालिका
चाण्डालिका<BR>—1 = चण्डालिका q. v.<BR>—2 N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातकः|चातक
चातकः (-की <i>f.</i>) [चत् याचने कर्तरि ण्वुल्] N. of<BR> a bird which is supposed to live only on rain-drops; सूक्ष्मा एव पतन्ति<BR> चातकमुखे द्वित्राः पयोबिन्दवः Bh. 2. 121; see also 2. 51 and R. 5. 17.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चातकानन्दनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातकानन्दनः|चातकानन्दन|चातकानंदन
चातकः + -आनन्दनः<BR>—1 the rainy season.<BR>—2 a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर|चातुरः
चातुर^1 <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>) [चतुर एव स्वार्थे अण्]<BR>—1 Relating to four.<BR>—2 Clever, able, shrewd.<BR>—3 Speaking well, flattering.<BR>—4 Drawn by four (as a carriage).<BR>—5 Governing, ruling.<BR>—6 Visible, perceptible.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124. note: missing 'u'.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरः|चातुर
चातुर + .{@-रः@} A small round pillow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरम्
चातुर + .{@-रम्@} A four-wheeled carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरी
चातुर + .{@-री@} Skill, dexterity, ability; तद्भटचातुरीतुरी N. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0702-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरक|चातुरकः
चातुरक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Flattering.<BR>—2 Perceptible, visible.<BR>—3 Governing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरकः|चातुरक
चातुरक + .{@-कः@} A small round pillow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरक्षम्
चातुरक्षम् [चतुर्भिरक्षैर्निष्पाद्यते अण्] Four casts in playing at dice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरक्षः|चातुरक्ष|चातुरक्षं
चातुरक्षम् + .{@-क्षः@} A small round pillow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरन्त
चातुरन्त <i>a.</i> Possessing the whole earth bounded by four oceans;<BR> चातुरन्तोऽपि राजा सद्यो विनश्यति Kau. A. 1. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरर्थिकः|चातुरर्थिक
चातुरर्थिकः [चतुर्षु अर्थेषु विहितः ठक्] (In gram.) A suffix<BR> added to words in four different senses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुराश्रमिक
चातुराश्रमिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [चतुर्षु आश्रमेषु विहितः ठक्], चातुराश्रमिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Being in one of the four periods of the religious<BR> life of a Brāhmaṇa; see आश्रम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुराश्रम्यम्
चातुराश्रम्यम् The four periods of the religious life of a Brāhmaṇa;<BR> see आश्रम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरिकः|चातुरिक
चातुरिकः [चातुरीं रथचर्यां वेत्ति ठक्] A coachman, driver, charioteer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुरीकः
चातुरीकः<BR>—1 A swan.<BR>—2 A sort of duck; कलहंसे च कारण्डे चातुरीकः पुमानयम् Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्थक|चातुर्थकः
चातुर्थक, -चातुर्थिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [चतुर्थे अह्नि भवः ठक्<BR> वुञ् वा] —1 Quartan, occurring every fourth day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्थिक
चातुर्थक, -चातुर्थिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [चतुर्थे अह्नि भवः ठक्<BR> वुञ् वा] —1 Quartan, occurring every fourth day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्थकः|चातुर्थक
चातुर्थक, -चातुर्थिक + .{@-कः@} A quartan ague.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्थाह्निक
चातुर्थाह्निक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Belonging to the fourth day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्दश|चातुर्द्दश
चातुर्दश <i>a.</i> Appearing on the fourteenth day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्दशम्
चातुर्दश + .{@-शम्@} A demon (चतुर्दश्यां दृश्यते इति) (Sk.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्दशिकः|चातुर्दशिक|चातुर्द्दशिक
चातुर्दशिकः One who studies on the fourteenth day of a lunar fortnight<BR> (that being a day of अनध्याय q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्भौतिक
चातुर्भौतिक <i>a.</i> Consisting of four elements.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्मास|चातुर्म्मास
चातुर्मास <i>a.</i> [चतुर्षु मासेषु भवः अण्] Produced in four months.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्मासी
चातुर्मास + .{@-सी@}<BR>—1 N. of a sacrifice (इष्टि).<BR>—2 The day of full moon at this sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्मासक
चातुर्मासक <i>a.</i> (-सिका <i>f.</i>) One who performs the Chāturmāsya sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्मास्यम्
चातुर्मास्यम् [चतुर्षु मासेषु भवो यज्ञः, ण्य] N. of a sacrifice<BR> performed every four months; <i>i. e.</i> at the beginning of कार्तिक,<BR> फाल्गुन and आषाढ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्यम्
चातुर्यम् [चतुरस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Skill, cleverness, dexterity, shrewdness.<BR>—2 Loveliness, amiableness, beauty; भ्रूचातुर्य Bh. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्वर्ण्य|चातुर्व्वर्ण्यं
चातुर्वर्ण्य <i>a.</i> [चतुर्वर्ण-ष्यञ्] Suited to the four tribes,<BR> or belonging to them.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्वर्ण्यम्
चातुर्वर्ण्य + .{@-र्ण्यम्@}<BR>—1 The aggregate of the four original castes of the Hindus; एवं सामासिकं<BR> धर्मं चातुर्वर्ण्येऽब्रवीन्मनुः Ms. 10. 63; चातुर्वर्ण्यं मया सृष्टं<BR> गुणकर्मविभागशः Bg. 4. 13.<BR>—2 The duties of these four castes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्विद्य
चातुर्विद्य <i>a.</i> (-द्यी) Knowing the four Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्विद्यम्
चातुर्विद्य + .{@-द्यम्@} The four Vedas; also चातुर्वैद्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्विध्यम्
चातुर्विध्यम् Four kinds (collectively), a four-fold division.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्होत्र
चातुर्होत्र <i>a.</i> Conducted by the four priests.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्होत्रम्
चातुर्होत्र + .{@-त्रम्@}<BR>—1 A sacrifice performed by four priests.<BR>—2 The office or duties of these priests.<BR>—3 The four priests taken collectively; चातुर्होत्रं च धुर्या मे शरा<BR> दर्भा हविर्यशः Mb. 5. 58. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुर्होत्रियः|चातुर्होत्रिय
चातुर्होत्रियः A sacrifice performed by four priests.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुष्काण्डिक|चातुष्कांडिक
चातुष्काण्डिक <i>a.</i> Divided into four parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चातुष्टय
चातुष्टय <i>a.</i> [चतुष्टयं वेत्ति, अण्] Knowing or familiar with<BR> the चतुष्टय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चात्रम्
चात्रम् [चाय् करणे ष्ट्रन्] A cylinder of catechu-wood used in<BR> producing the sacred fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चात्वालः|चात्वाल|चात्वालं
चात्वालः [cf. Uṇ. 1. 113]<BR>—1 A hole in the ground to receive an oblation or the sacred fire.<BR>—2 Kuśa grass (दर्भ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्दनिक|चांदनिक
चान्दनिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [चन्दनेन संपद्यते ठक्]<BR>—1 Made of or derived from sandal.<BR>—2 Perfumed with sandal juice &c. वपुश्चान्दनिकं यस्य Śiva B. 4. 25;<BR> वपुश्चान्दनिकं यस्य कर्णवेष्टनिकं मुखम् Bk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्र|चांद्र|चान्द्रं|चान्द्रः
चान्द्र <i>a.</i> (-न्द्री <i>f.</i>) [चन्द्रस्येदम् अण्] Relating<BR> to the moon, lunar; गुरुकाव्यानुगां बिभ्रच्चान्द्रीमभिनभः श्रियम् Śi. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रः|चान्द्र|चांद्र|चान्द्रं
चान्द्र + .{@-द्रः@}<BR>—1 A lunar month.<BR>—2 The bright fortnight (शुक्लपक्ष).<BR>—3 The moon-stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रम्
चान्द्र + .{@-द्रम्@}<BR>—1 The vow called चान्द्रायण q. v.<BR>—2 Fresh ginger.<BR>—3 The lunar mansion called मृगशीर्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्री|चांद्री
चान्द्र + .{@-द्री@} Moonlight; cf. Śi. 2. 2.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चान्द्राख्यम्, चान्द्रभागा, चान्द्रमासः, चान्द्रव्रतिकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्राख्यम्
चान्द्र + -आख्यम् fresh ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रभागा|चांद्रभागा
चान्द्र + -भागा the river Chandrabhāgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रमासः|चान्द्रमास|चांद्रमास
चान्द्र + -मासः a lunar month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रव्रतिकः|चान्द्रव्रतिक|चांद्रव्रतिक
चान्द्र + -व्रतिकः one who observes the चान्द्रायण vow. q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रकम्
चान्द्रकम् Dried ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रमस|चांद्रमस|चान्द्रमसं|चान्द्रमसः
चान्द्रमस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>) [चन्द्रमस इदम् अण्] Relating<BR> to the moon, lunar; लब्धोदया चान्द्रमसीव लेखा Ku. 1. 25; चन्द्रं<BR> गता पद्मगुणान्न भुङ्क्ते पद्माश्रिता चान्द्रमसीमभिख्याम् 1. 43; R. 2. 39; Bg. 8. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रमसः|चान्द्रमस|चांद्रमस|चान्द्रमसं
चान्द्रमस + .{@-सः@} The lunar year; विचाली हि संवत्सरशब्दः सावनोऽपि गणितदिवसकः … चान्द्रमसोऽपि<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 7. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रमसी|चांद्रमसी
चान्द्रमस + .{@-सी@} N. of the wife of Bṛhaspati.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रमसम्
चान्द्रमस + .{@-सम्@}<BR>—1 The constellation मृगशिरस्.<BR>—2 The stars in Orion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रमसायनः|चान्द्रमसायन|चांद्रमसायनः
चान्द्रमसायनः, -निः<BR> [चन्द्रमसोऽपत्यं फिञ्] The planet Mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रमसायनिः|चान्द्रमसायनि|चांद्रमसायनि|चांद्रमसायनिः
चान्द्रमसायनः, -निः<BR> [चन्द्रमसोऽपत्यं फिञ्] The planet Mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रायणम्
चान्द्रायणम् [चन्द्रस्यायनमिवायनमत्र पूर्वपदात् संज्ञायां णत्वम्<BR> संज्ञायां दीर्घः स्वार्थे अण् वा Tv.] A religious observance or expiatory<BR> penance regulated by the moonʼs age (the period of its waxing and waning);<BR> (in it the daily quantity of food, which consists of fifteen mouthfuls<BR> at the full moon, is diminished by one mouthful every day during the dark<BR> fortnight till it is reduced to zero at the new moon, and is increased<BR> in like manner<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">Page0704-1</a>]<BR> during the bright fortnight); cf. Y. 3. 324 <i>et seq.</i> and Ms. 11. 217.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0703-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चान्द्रायणिक|चांद्रायणिक
चान्द्रायणिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) —1 One who performs the चान्द्रायण vow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चापः|चाप|चापं
चापः [चपस्य वंशभेदस्य विकारः अण् Tv.]<BR>—1 A bow; ताते चापद्वितीये वहति रणधुरां को भयस्यावकाशः Ve. 3. 5;<BR> so चापपाणिः ‘with a bow in hand’.<BR>—2 The rain-bow.<BR>—3 (In geom.) An arc of a circle.<BR>—4 The sign of the zodiac called <i>Sagittarius</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चापिन्
चापिन् <i>a.</i> [चापोऽस्त्यस्य इनि] Armed with a bow. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 The sign of the zodiac <i>Sagittarius</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चापलम्
चापलम्, -ल्यम्<BR> [चपलस्य भावः कर्म वा अण् पक्षे ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Quick motion, swiftness.<BR>—2 Fickleness, unsteadiness, transitoriness; Ki. 2. 41.<BR>—3 Inconsiderate or rash conduct, rashness, rash act; यत्तु केवलचापल्याद्बलदर्पोत्थितः<BR> स्वयम् Mb. 3. 36. 8; धिक् चापलम् U. 4; तद्गुणैः कर्णमागत्य चापलाय<BR> प्रचोदितः R. 1. 9; स्वचित्तवृत्तिरिव चापलेभ्यो निवारणीया K. 101; Ku. 3. 41.<BR>—4 Restiveness (as of a horse); पुनः पुनः सूतनिषिद्धचापलम् R. 3. 42.<BR>—5 Boldness; Ku. 5. 40.<BR>—6 Agitation, tremour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चापल्यम्
चापलम्, -ल्यम्<BR> [चपलस्य भावः कर्म वा अण् पक्षे ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Quick motion, swiftness.<BR>—2 Fickleness, unsteadiness, transitoriness; Ki. 2. 41.<BR>—3 Inconsiderate or rash conduct, rashness, rash act; यत्तु केवलचापल्याद्बलदर्पोत्थितः<BR> स्वयम् Mb. 3. 36. 8; धिक् चापलम् U. 4; तद्गुणैः कर्णमागत्य चापलाय<BR> प्रचोदितः R. 1. 9; स्वचित्तवृत्तिरिव चापलेभ्यो निवारणीया K. 101; Ku. 3. 41.<BR>—4 Restiveness (as of a horse); पुनः पुनः सूतनिषिद्धचापलम् R. 3. 42.<BR>—5 Boldness; Ku. 5. 40.<BR>—6 Agitation, tremour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामरः|चामर|चामरं
चामरः, -रम्<BR> [चमर्याः विकारः तत्पुच्छनिर्मितत्वात्] also -रा, -री sometimes.<BR>—1 A <i>chowrie</i> or bushy tail of the Chamara<BR> (Bos Grunniens) used as a fly-flap or fan, and reckoned as one of the<BR> insignia of royalty (and sometimes used as a sort of streamer on the heads<BR> of horses); व्याधूयन्ते निचुलतरुभिर्मञ्जरीचामराणि V. 4. 4; अदेयमासीत्<BR> त्रयमेव भूपतेः शशिप्रभं छत्रमुभे च चामरे R. 3. 16; Ku. 7. 42;<BR> H. 2. 29; Me. 35; चित्रन्यस्तमिवाचलं हयशिरस्यायामवच्चामरम्<BR> V. 1. 4; Ś. 1. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चामरग्राहः, चामरग्राहिन्, चामरग्राहिणी, चामरपुष्पः, चामरपुष्पकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामरम्
चामरः, -रम्<BR> [चमर्याः विकारः तत्पुच्छनिर्मितत्वात्] also -रा, -री sometimes.<BR>—1 A <i>chowrie</i> or bushy tail of the Chamara<BR> (Bos Grunniens) used as a fly-flap or fan, and reckoned as one of the<BR> insignia of royalty (and sometimes used as a sort of streamer on the heads<BR> of horses); व्याधूयन्ते निचुलतरुभिर्मञ्जरीचामराणि V. 4. 4; अदेयमासीत्<BR> त्रयमेव भूपतेः शशिप्रभं छत्रमुभे च चामरे R. 3. 16; Ku. 7. 42;<BR> H. 2. 29; Me. 35; चित्रन्यस्तमिवाचलं हयशिरस्यायामवच्चामरम्<BR> V. 1. 4; Ś. 1. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चामरग्राहः, चामरग्राहिन्, चामरग्राहिणी, चामरपुष्पः, चामरपुष्पकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामरग्राहः|चामरग्राह
चामरः + -ग्राहः, -ग्राहिन् <i>m.</i> a person who carries a <i>chowrie</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामरग्राहिन्
चामरः + -ग्राहः, -ग्राहिन् <i>m.</i> a person who carries a <i>chowrie</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामरग्राहिणी
चामरः + -ग्राहिणी a waiting girl who carries in her hand a <i>chowrie</i><BR> and waves it over the head of a king &c.; पृष्ठे लीलावलयरणितं चामरग्राहिणीनाम् Bh. 3. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामरपुष्पः|चामरपुष्प
चामरः + -पुष्पः, -पुष्पकः<BR>—1 the betel-nut tree.<BR>—2 the Ketaka plant.<BR>—3 the mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामरपुष्पकः|चामरपुष्पक
चामरः + -पुष्पः, -पुष्पकः<BR>—1 the betel-nut tree.<BR>—2 the Ketaka plant.<BR>—3 the mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामरिकः|चामरिक
चामरिकः A person who carries a <i>chowrie</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामरिन्
चामरिन् <i>m.</i> [चामर-इनि] A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामीकरम्
चामीकरम् [चमीकरे स्वर्णाकरभेदे भवम् अण् Tv.]<BR>—1 Gold; तेप्तचामीकराङ्गदः V. 1. 14; R. 7. 5; Śi. 4. 24; Ku. 7. 49.<BR>—2 The Dhattūra plant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चामीकरप्रख्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामीकरप्रख्य
चामीकरम् + -प्रख्य <i>a.</i> like gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चामुण्डा|चामुंडा
चामुण्डा A terrific form of Durgā; Māl. 5. 25; (the word is thus<BR> derived; यस्माच्चण्डं च मुण्डं च गृहीत्वा त्वमुपागता । चामुण्डेति<BR> ततो लोके ख्याता देवी भविष्यसि ॥).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाम्पिला|चांपिला
चाम्पिला The river Champā; (perhaps the modern Chambal).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाम्पेयः|चाम्पेय|चांपेय|चांपेयः
चाम्पेयः<BR>—1 The Champaka tree.<BR>—2 The Nāgakesara tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाम्पेयम्
चाम्पेयः + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 Filament, especially of a lotus flower.<BR>—2 Gold.<BR>—3 The Dhattūra plant; <i>m.</i> (also in the last two senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाम्पेयकम्
चाम्पेयकम् A stamen or filament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाम्यम्
चाम्यम् Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाय्
चाय् €1 U. (चायति-ते)<BR>—1 To observe, discern, see; तं पार्वतीयप्रमदाश्चचायिरे विकाशविस्फारितविभ्रमेक्षणाः Śi. 12. 51.<BR>—2 To worship, honour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चायनीय
चायनीय <i>a.</i> To be worshipped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चायितृ
चायितृ <i>a.</i> Ved. Observing, seeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चायु
चायु <i>a.</i> [चाय्-उण्] Worshipping, adoring, honouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारः|चार|चारं
चारः [चर एव अण्]<BR>—1 Going, walking, gait, wandering about; मण्डलचारशीघ्रः V. 5. 2;<BR> क्रीडाशैले यदि च विचरेत् पादचारेण गौरी Me. 60; निवृत्तचारः<BR> सहसा गतो रविः प्रवृत्तचारा रजनी ह्युपस्थिता Rām. 2. 66. 26 walk on foot.<BR>—2 Motion, course, progression; मङ्गलचार, शनिचार, राहु˚ &c.<BR>—3 A spy, scout, secret emissary; Ms. 7. 184, 9. 261; see चारचक्षुस् below.<BR>—4 Performing, practising.<BR>—5 A prison.<BR>—6 A bond, fetter.<BR>—7 The Pippalī tree or the Priyāla tree.<BR>—8 A platform, Māna. 62. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारम्
चारः + .{@-रम्@} An artificial poison.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चारान्तरितः, चारेक्षणः, चारचक्षुस्, चारचण, चारचञ्चु, चारज्या, चारपथः, चारभटः, चारभटी, चारवायुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारान्तरितः|चारान्तरित|चारांतरित
चारः + -अन्तरितः a spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारेक्षणः|चारेक्षण
चारः + -ईक्षणः, -चक्षुस् <i>m.</i> ‘using spies as eyes’, a king (or a statesman)<BR> who employs spies and sees through their medium; चारचक्षुर्महीपतिः<BR> Ms. 9. 256; cf. Kām.:− गावः पश्यन्ति गन्धेन वेदैः पश्यन्ति च<BR> द्विजाः । चारैः पश्यन्ति राजानश्चक्षुर्भ्यामितरे जनाः ॥ also Rām.:− यस्मात्पश्यन्ति<BR> दूरस्थाः सर्वानर्थान्नराधिपाः । चारेण तस्मादुच्यन्ते राजानश्चारचक्षुषः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारचक्षुस्
चारः + -ईक्षणः, -चक्षुस् <i>m.</i> ‘using spies as eyes’, a king (or a statesman)<BR> who employs spies and sees through their medium; चारचक्षुर्महीपतिः<BR> Ms. 9. 256; cf. Kām.:− गावः पश्यन्ति गन्धेन वेदैः पश्यन्ति च<BR> द्विजाः । चारैः पश्यन्ति राजानश्चक्षुर्भ्यामितरे जनाः ॥ also Rām.:− यस्मात्पश्यन्ति<BR> दूरस्थाः सर्वानर्थान्नराधिपाः । चारेण तस्मादुच्यन्ते राजानश्चारचक्षुषः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारचण
चारः + -चण, -चञ्चु <i>a.</i> graceful in gait, of graceful carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारचञ्चु|चारचंचु
चारः + -चण, -चञ्चु <i>a.</i> graceful in gait, of graceful carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारज्या
चारः + -ज्या the sine of the ascensional difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारपथः|चारपथ
चारः + -पथः a place where two roads meet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारभटः|चारभट
चारः + -भटः a valorous man, warrior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारभटी
चारः + -भटी courage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारवायुः|चारवायु
चारः + -वायुः summer-air, zephyr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारक|चारकः
चारक <i>a.</i> [चारयति चर्-णिच्-ण्वुल्] —1 Acting, doing, proceeding;<BR> अपूर्वचारकः सौम्यो अनिकेतः समाहितः Mb. 3. 278. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारकः|चारक
चारक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A spy.<BR>—2 A herdsman.<BR>—3 A leader, driver.<BR>—4 An associate.<BR>—5 A groom, cavalier.<BR>—6 A prison; निगडितचरणा चारके निरोद्धव्या Dk. 32.<BR>—7 A bond, fetter.<BR>—8 Going, motion.<BR>—9 A wandering Brahmanical student.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारणः|चारण
चारणः [चारयति कीर्तिं चर्-णिच् ल्यु]<BR>—1 A wanderer, a pilgrim.<BR>—2 A wandering actor or singer, a dancer, mimic, bard; Ms. 12. 44.<BR>—3 A celestial singer, heavenly chorister; सिद्धचारणविद्याध्रानृषीन्<BR> पितृपतीन् मनून् Bhāg. 7. 4. 6; Ś. 2. 14.<BR>—4 A reader of scriptures.<BR>—5 A spy. अन्तर्बहिश्च भूतानां पश्यन् कर्माणि चारणैः Bhāg. 4. 16. 12.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चारणदाराः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारणदाराः
चारणः + -दाराः female dancers, actresses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारणत्वम्
चारणत्वम् The art of dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारथ
चारथ <i>a.</i> Ved. Wandering, going.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारिका
चारिका A female attendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारित
चारित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Caused to go.<BR>—2 Distilled &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारितार्थ्यम्
चारितार्थ्यम् Attainment of an object, successfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारित्रम्
चारित्रम् [चर्-णित्रन् Uṇ. 4. 171; चरित्रमेव स्वार्थे अण् वा]<BR> (also written चारित्र्यम्)<BR>—1 Conduct, behaviour, manner of acting; कुलाक्रोशकरं लोके धिक् ते<BR> चारित्रमीदृशम् Rām. 3. 53. 9.<BR>—2 Good manner or character, reputation, probity, uprightness, good conduct;<BR> अनृतं नाभिधास्यामि चारित्रभ्रंशकारणम् Mk. 3. 26, 25; चारित्र्यविहीन<BR> आढ्योऽपि च दुर्गतो भवति 1. 43.<BR>—3 Chastity, purity of life (of women).<BR>—4 Disposition, temperament.<BR>—5 Peculiar observance or practice.<BR>—6 Hereditary observance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारित्रा
चारित्रम् + .{@-त्रा@} The tamarind tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चारित्रकवच, चारित्रदेवता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारित्रकवच
चारित्रम् + -कवच <i>a.</i> clad in the armour of chastity<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारित्रदेवता
चारित्रम् + -देवता the presiding deity of virtue or chastity; U. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारिन्
चारिन् <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.)<BR>—1 Walking, going, moving, being, living; पाद˚, मृग˚; संभ्रमाय निशि<BR> गूढचारिणम् R.; परद्रव्यगृहाणां च प्रच्छका गूढचारिणः Y. 2. 268.<BR>—2 Acting proceeding, doing; पतिमन्यं वृतवती किमर्थं दुष्टचारिणी<BR> Rām. 7. 56. 23.<BR>—3 Living or feeding on. ━<i>m.</i> A foot-soldier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारी
चारी <i>f.</i> Wandering; जातपक्षा यदा ते च गताश्चारीमितस्ततः<BR> Mb. 12. 262. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारु|चारुः
चारु <i>a.</i> (-रु or -र्वी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [चरति चित्ते चर् उण् cf. Uṇ. 1. 3.]<BR>—1 Agreeable, welcome, beloved, esteemed, dear (with dat. or loc.); वरुणाय<BR> or वरुणे चारुः.<BR>—2 Pleasing, lovely, beautiful, elegant, pretty; प्रिये चारुशीले मुञ्च<BR> मयि मानमनिदानम् Gīt. 10; सर्वं प्रिये चारुतरं वसन्ते Ṛs. 6. 2;<BR> चकासतं चारु चमूरुचर्मणा Śi. 1. 8, 4. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुः|चारु
चारु + .{@-रुः@} An epithet of Bṛhaspati.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारु|चारुः
चारु + .{@-रु@} <i>n.</i> Saffron.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चार्वङ्गी, चारुघोण, चारुदर्शन, चारुधामा, चारुधारा, चारुरावा, चारुनेत्र, चारुलोचन, चारुपुटः, चारुफला, चारुलोचना, चारुवक्त्र, चारुवर्धना, चारुव्रता, चारुशिला, चारुशील, चारुहासिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्वङ्गी|चार्वंगी|चार्व्वङ्गी
चारु + -अङ्गी a beautifully formed woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुघोण
चारु + -घोण <i>a.</i> handsome-nosed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुदर्शन
चारु + -दर्शन <i>a.</i> good-looking, lovely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुधामा
चारु + -धामा, -धारा, -रावा Śachī, Indraʼs wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुधारा
चारु + -धामा, -धारा, -रावा Śachī, Indraʼs wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुरावा
चारु + -धामा, -धारा, -रावा Śachī, Indraʼs wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुनेत्र|चारुनेत्रः
चारु + -नेत्र, -लोचन <i>a.</i> having beautiful eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुलोचन|चारुलोचनः
चारु + -नेत्र, -लोचन <i>a.</i> having beautiful eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुनेत्रः|चारुनेत्र
चारु + -नेत्र, -लोचन + .({@-नेत्रः, -नः@}) a deer; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुलोचनः|चारुलोचन
चारु + -नेत्र, -लोचन + .({@-नेत्रः, -नः@}) a deer; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुपुटः|चारुपुट
चारु + -पुटः a particular time in music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुफला
चारु + -फला a vine, grape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुलोचना
चारु + -लोचना a woman with lovely eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुवक्त्र
चारु + -वक्त्र <i>a.</i> having a beautiful face.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुवर्धना
चारु + -वर्धना a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुव्रता
चारु + -व्रता a female who fasts for a whole month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुशिला
चारु + -शिला<BR>—1 a jewel, gem.<BR>—2 a beautiful slab of stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुशील
चारु + -शील <i>a.</i> of a lovely disposition or character.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चारुहासिन्
चारु + -हासिन् <i>a.</i> sweet-smiling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्चिक
चार्चिक <i>a.</i> Conversant with the repetition (of the Veda).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्चिक्यम्
चार्चिक्यम्<BR>—1 Perfuming the person, smearing with sandal &c.<BR>—2 An unguent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्म|चार्म्म|चार्म्मः
चार्म <i>a.</i> (-र्मी <i>f.</i>) [चर्मणा परिवृतः अण्]<BR>—1 Leathern.<BR>—2 Covered with leather (as a car).<BR>—3 Shielded, provided with a shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्मण|चार्म्मण|चार्म्मणं
चार्मण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>) Covered with skin or leather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्मणम्
चार्मण + .{@-णम्@} [चर्मणां समूहः अण्] A multitude of hides or shields.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्मिक|चार्म्मिक
चार्मिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) [चर्मणा निर्वृत्तः ठक्] Made<BR> of leather; Ms. 8. 289.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्मिणम्
चार्मिणम् [चर्मिणां समूहः अण्] A number of men armed with shields.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्या
चार्या <i>f.</i> —1 A path, A road which is eight cubits broad दण्डान्तरा<BR> द्विदण्डान्तरा वा चार्याः कारयेत् Kau. A. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्वाकः|चार्वाक|चार्व्वाक|चार्व्वाकः
चार्वाकः [चारुः लोकसंमतो वाकोवाक्यं यस्य, पृषो˚ Tv.]<BR>—1 N. of a sophistical philosopher (said to have been a pupil of Bṛhaspati),<BR> who propounded the grossest form of atheism or materialism (for a summary<BR> of the doctrines of Cārvāka, see Sarva. S.).<BR>—2 A follower of the philosophy of Cārvāka; चार्वाकाणामिवैषां हि भयं<BR> न परलोकतः Rāj. T. 4. 345.<BR>—3 N. of a Rākṣasa described in the Mahābhārata, as a friend of Duryodhana<BR> and an enemy of the Pāṇḍavas. [When Yudhiṣṭhira entered Hastināpura<BR> in triumph, he assumed the form of a Brāhmaṇa and reviled him and the<BR> assembled Brāhmaṇas, but he was soon detected, and the real Brāhmaṇas,<BR> filled with fury, are said to have killed him on the spot. He also tried<BR> to deceive Yudhiṣṭhira at the end of the great war by telling him that<BR> Bhīma was slain by Duryodhana; see Ve. 6].<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चार्वाकमतम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्वाकमतम्
चार्वाकः + -मतम् <i>n.</i> the doctrine of Cārvāka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चार्वी|चार्व्वी
चार्वी<BR>—1 A beautiful woman.<BR>—2 Moonlight.<BR>—3 Intelligence.<BR>—4 Splendour, lustre, brilliancy.<BR>—5 N. of the wife of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चालः|चाल
चालः [चल्-ण]<BR>—1 The thatch or roof of a house.<BR>—2 The blue jay.<BR>—3 Being movable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चालकः|चालक
चालकः A restive elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चालनम्
चालनम् [चल्-णिच् भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Causing to move, shaking, wagging (as a tail);<BR>—2 Loosening.<BR>—3 Muscular action.<BR>—4 Causing to pass through a sieve, sifting.<BR>—5 A sieve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चालनी
चालनम् + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 A sieve, strainer; छिद्रं भद्रे हन्त पुच्छे तवेति, सूचीं ब्रूते चालनी<BR> दूषयन्ती Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 A harlot; चालनी तु शतच्छिद्रे पुंश्चल्यामपि च स्त्रियाम् Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चालनीय
चालनीय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be moved.<BR>—2 To be loosened or shaken; also चाल्य in the same sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चालिक्यः|चालिक्य
चालिक्यः^1 <i>m.</i> (= Chālukya) N. of a dynasty; Inscr. (489 A. D.).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चाषः|चाष
चाषः, -सः<BR> [चष् भक्षणे स्वार्थे णिच्-अच्]<BR>—1 The blue jay; Māl. 6. 5; Y. 1. 175.<BR>—2 Sugar-cane. 10. 10; केयूरमण्डलीनां प्रभासंतानेन क्वचिद्विकीर्यमाणचाषः K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चासः|चास
चाषः, -सः<BR> [चष् भक्षणे स्वार्थे णिच्-अच्]<BR>—1 The blue jay; Māl. 6. 5; Y. 1. 175.<BR>—2 Sugar-cane. 10. 10; केयूरमण्डलीनां प्रभासंतानेन क्वचिद्विकीर्यमाणचाषः K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चि
चि I. €5 U. (चिनोति, चिनुते, चिका-चा-य, चिच्ये-क्ये, अचैषीतचेष्ट,<BR> चेतुम्, -चित; <i>caus.</i> चाययति, चापयति, also चययति,<BR> चपयति <i>desid.</i> चिचीषति, -चिकीषति)<BR>—1 To collect, gather, accumulate (said to govern two accusatives being<BR> a द्विकर्मक root, but this use is very rare in classical literature),<BR> वृक्षं पुष्पाणि चिन्वती.<BR>—2 To gather for oneself, acquire, gain; चिचीषतां जन्मवतामलघ्वीं<BR> भूतिम् Ki. 3. 11, 2. 19; Mv. 3. 4.<BR>—3 To search, look out for; Bh. 3. 46.<BR>—4 To pile or heap up, place in a line; पर्वतानिव ते भूमावचैषुर्वानरोत्तमान् Bk. 15. 76.<BR>—5 To set, inlay, cover or fill with, see चित. ━<i>pass.</i> To<BR> bear fruit, grow, increase,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">Page0706-1</a>]<BR> thrive, prosper; सिच्यते चीयते चैव लता पुष्पफलप्रदा Pt. 1. 222<BR> bears fruit; चीयते बालिशस्यापि सत्क्षेत्रपतिता कृषिः Mu. 1. 3; गजहंस<BR> तव सैव शुभ्रता चीयते न च न चापचीयते K. P. 10. ━II. €3 P. (चिकेति) Ved.<BR>—1 To observe, see, perceive.<BR>—2 To look steadfastly upon.<BR>—3 To be intent upon.<BR>—4 To seek for, search, investigate, make inquiries, search through. ━III. €1 Ā.<BR> (चयते)<BR>—1 To detest, hate.<BR>—2 To revenge, take vengeance on. ━IV. €1 U. (चायति-ते)<BR>—1 To fear, dread, be afraid of (with acc.)<BR>—2 To respect, honour. —3 To observe; cf. चाय्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0705-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चयः|चय
चयः [चि-अच्]<BR>—1 An assemblage; collection, multitude, heap, mass; चयस्त्विषामित्यवधारितं<BR> पुरा Śi. 1. 3; मृदां चयः U. 2. 7 a lump of clay; कचानां चयः<BR> Bh. 1. 5 a braid of hair; so चमरीचयः Śi. 4. 60; कुसुमचय,<BR> तुषारचय &c.<BR>—2 A mound of earth raised to form the foundation of a building.<BR>—3 A mound of earth raised from the ditch of a fort.<BR>—4 A rampart.<BR>—5 The gate of a fort.<BR>—6 A seat, stool.<BR>—7 A pile of buildings, any edifice.<BR>—8 Stacked wood.<BR>—9 A cover or covering.<BR>—10 Arranging or keeping the sacred fire; cf. अग्निचय.<BR>—11 The amount by which each term increases, the common increase or difference<BR> of the terms (in a progression).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चयनम्
चयनम् [चि भावे-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 The act of collecting (especially flowers &c.).<BR>—2 Piling, heaping.<BR>—3 Keeping the sacred fire.<BR>—4 Stacking wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित|चितः
चित <i>p. p.</i> [चि-क्त]<BR>—1 Collected, piled up, heaped, gathered.<BR>—2 Hoarded, accumulated; चितचैत्यो महातेजाः Mb. 3. 126. 38.<BR>—3 Got, acquired.<BR>—4 Covered with, full of; कृमिकुलचितम् Bh. 2. 9.<BR>—5 Set or inlaid with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चितम्
चित + .{@-तम्@} A building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिता
चिता<BR>—1 A funeral pile, pyre; कुरु संप्रति तावदाशु मे प्रणिपाताञ्जलियाचितश्चिताम्<BR> Ku. 4. 35; चिताधिरोहणम् R. 8. 57; चिताभस्मन् Ku. 5. 69.<BR>—2 A heap, assemblage, multitude<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चिताग्निः, चिताचूडकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिताग्निः|चिताग्नि
चिता + -अग्निः the funeral fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिताचूडकम्
चिता + -चूडकम् a pyre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चितिः|चिति
चितिः <i>f.</i> [चि-आधारे क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Collecting, gathering.<BR>—2 A heap, multitude, quantity.<BR>—3 A layer, pile, stack; सभ्यावसथ्यं चितयोऽसवो हि ते Bhāg. 3. 13. 37.<BR>—4 A funeral pile.<BR>—5 An oblong with quadrangular sides.<BR>—6 The understanding. ━<i>m.</i> The thinking mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चितिका
चितिका<BR>—1 A pile, stack.<BR>—2 A funeral pile.<BR>—3 A small chain (or girdle) worn as an ornament round the loins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्य|चित्यं|चित्यः
चित्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be arranged in order or built up.<BR>—2 Constructed upon a foundation (as fire).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्यम्
चित्य + .{@-त्यम्@}<BR>—1 The place at which a corpse is burnt.<BR>—2 A monument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चित्या
चित्य + .{@-त्या@}<BR>—1 A funeral pile.<BR>—2 Piling up, building (as an altar).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेय
चेय <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 To be piled up.<BR>—2 To be gathered or collected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिकित
चिकित <i>a.</i>^1 [चि ज्ञाने कर्मणि क्त] Known, understood.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिकितान
चिकितान <i>a.</i> [कित् ज्ञाने कानच्] Knowing, perceiving, understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिकितु
चिकितु <i>a.</i> [कित् उन् वेदे द्वित्वम्] Ved. Knowing, experienced;<BR> अचेत्यग्निश्चिकितुर्हव्यवाट् स सुमद्रथः Rv. 8. 56. 5. ━<i>f.</i> Understanding, intellect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिकित्वन्
चिकित्वन् <i>m.</i> Ved. Intellect, wisdom; अग्ने तुभ्यं चिकित्वना Rv. 8. 60. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिकित्वस्
चिकित्वस् <i>a.</i> Ved. Knowing, conversant or familiar with, experienced;<BR> सुविज्ञानं चिकितुषे जनाय Rv. 7. 104. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिकित्वित्
