चिर + -कालिक, -कालीन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of long standing, old, long-continued.<BR>—2 chronic (as a disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0710-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

