चिरसूता
चिर + -सूता, -सूतिका a cow that has borne many calves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0711-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरसूतिका
चिर + -सूता, -सूतिका a cow that has borne many calves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0711-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

