चिरंजीव
चिरंजीव <i>a.</i> Long lived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0711-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरंजीवः|चिरञ्जीव
चिरंजीव + .{@-वः@} An epithet of Kāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0711-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरण्टी|चिरंटी
चिरण्टी, चिरिण्टी [चिरेण अटति पितृगृहात् भर्तृगेहम् अट् अच् पृषो˚ Tv.]<BR>—1 A woman married or single who continues to reside after maturity in<BR> her fatherʼs house.<BR>—2 A young woman (in general); देव न प्रत्ययः स्त्रीषु चपलास्वखिलास्वपि ।<BR> चिरण्टीष्वपि न ग्राह्यो वेशस्त्रीष्विव सर्वदा ॥ Ks. 58. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0711-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चिरिण्टी|चिरिंटी
