चीरि(रु)का A cricket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0712-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरुका
चीरि(रु)का A cricket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0712-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरी
चीरी <i>f.</i>, चीरीवाकः A cricket; चीरीवाकस्तु लवणं बलाका<BR> शकुनिर्दधि Ms. 12. 63; चीरी लवणहारकः Y. 3. 215.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0712-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीरीवाकः|चीरीवाक
चीरी <i>f.</i>, चीरीवाकः A cricket; चीरीवाकस्तु लवणं बलाका<BR> शकुनिर्दधि Ms. 12. 63; चीरी लवणहारकः Y. 3. 215.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0712-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चीर्ण|चीर्णं|चीर्ण्ण
चीर्ण <i>a.</i> (चर्-नक् पृषो˚ अत ईन्वम्)<BR>—1 Done, performed, observed; चीर्णव्रतो बाल एव बुद्धिसत्त्वगुणान्वितः Mb. 1. 48. 19.<BR>—2 Studied, repeated.<BR>—3 Split, divided.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चीर्णपर्णः, चीर्णव्रत<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0712-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

