चीर्णव्रत
चीर्ण + -व्रत <i>a.</i> Who has practised a vow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0712-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

