चुड्ड्
चुड्ड् €1 P. (चुड्डति)<BR>—1 To dally, sport.<BR>—2 To hint oneʼs meaning. —3 To act or do.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0712-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुण्
