चुण्ट् I. €1. €10. P. (चुण्टति, चुण्टयति) To cut off. ━II. €1 P.<BR> To become small.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0712-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

