चुण्डा
चुण्टा, -ण्टी, -ण्डा<BR> A small well or reservoir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0712-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुत्
