चुद्
चुद् I. €10 U. (चोदयति-ते, चोदित)<BR>—1 To send, direct, throw forward, urge or drive on, push on; चोदयाश्वान Ś. 1.<BR>—2 To prompt, inspire, impel, animate, excite; R. 4. 24.<BR>—3 To hasten, accelerate.<BR>—4 To question, ask.<BR>—5 To press with a request.<BR>—6 To put forward, adduce, as an argument or objection.<BR>—7 To enjoin, lay down; Ms. 2. 165.<BR>—8 To request, solicit.<BR>—9 To help on.<BR>—10 To bring or offer quickly.<BR>—11 To fix,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">Page0713-1</a>]<BR> settle, direct.<BR>—12 To be quick. ━II. €1 U. Ved. (चोदतिते)<BR>—1 To impel, incite.<BR>—2 To offer quickly (Soma).<BR>—3 To hasten, be quick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0712-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोद|चोदः
चोद <i>a.</i> [चोदयतीति चुद्-अच्] Animating, inspiring, promoting &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदः|चोद
चोद + .{@-दः@} A whip or goad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदक|चोदकः
चोदक <i>a.</i> [चुद्-ण्वुल्] Driving, urging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदकः|चोदक
चोदक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 Directing, invitation.<BR>—2 (in gram.) परिग्रह q. v.<BR>—3 The injunctive text or the general rule which lays down that a विकृति<BR> shall be performed like its प्रकृति. चोदको हि प्रयोगवचनाद् बलवत्तरः ।<BR> स हि उत्पादयति प्रापयति च । प्रापितानभिसमीक्ष्य प्रयोगवचन उपसंहरति ।<BR> ŚB. on MS. 5. 1. 18; विकृतिः प्राकृतान् धर्मांश्चोदकेन गृह्णाति ।<BR> ŚB. on MS. 5. 4. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदन
चोदन <i>a.</i> [चुद्-भावे ल्युट्] Driving, impelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदनम्
चोदन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 The act of driving.<BR>—2 Invitation.<BR>—3 Order, rule, precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदना
चोदना<BR>—1 Sending, directing, throwing.<BR>—2 Urging or driving onward; ज्ञानं ज्ञेयं परिज्ञाता त्रिविधा कर्मचोदना Bg.<BR>—3 Prompting, inciting, encouraging, inspiration.<BR>—4 A precept, sacred commandment, scriptural injunction.<BR>—5 The category called अपूर्व (in पूर्वमीमांसा); चोदनेत्यपूर्वं<BR> ब्रूमः ŚB. on MS. 7. 1. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चोदनागुडः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदनागुडः|चोदनागुड
चोदना + -गुडः a ball for playing with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोदित
चोदित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Sent, directed.<BR>—2 Urged on, driven.<BR>—3 Incited, prompted, inspired.<BR>—4 Put forward as an argument.<BR>—5 Thrown, cast.<BR>—6 Appointed.<BR>—7 Ordered, directed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोद्य|चोद्यं|चोद्यः
चोद्य <i>a.</i> [चुद्-ण्यत्]<BR>—1 To be driven or impelled.<BR>—2 To be sent, thrown, or directed.<BR>—3 To be mentioned; नीवारमूलेङ्गुदशाकवृत्तिः सुसंयता चाग्निकार्येषु चोद्यः Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोद्यम्
चोद्य + .{@-द्यम्@}<BR>—1 Objecting, asking a question.<BR>—2 An objection.<BR>—3 Wonder, surprise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुन्दी|चुंदी
चुन्दी A procuress, bawd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुप्
चुप् €1 P. (चोपति) To move slowly, creep or steal along.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोपन|चोपनं
चोपन <i>a.</i> Moving, stirring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोपनम्
चोपन + .{@-नम्@} Moving slowly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुबुकः|चुबुक
चुबुकः The chin; प्रगृह्य चुबुकेऽध्यात्ममुदनीनमदच्युतः Bhāg. 10. 42. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुब्रम्
चुब्रम् The mouth, face.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुमुचुमायनम्
चुमुचुमायनम् Itching of a wound; Suśr. 1. 42. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुमुरिः|चुमुरि
चुमुरिः N. of a demon whom Indra killed to favour Dabhīti; स्वप्नेनाभ्युप्या<BR> चुमुरिं धुनिं च जघन्थ दस्युं प्र दभीतिमावः Rv. 2. 15. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्ब्|चुंब्
चुम्ब् I. €1. €10. U. (चुम्बति-ते, चुम्बयति-ते, चुम्बित)<BR>—1 To kiss (fig. also); श्लिष्यति चुम्बति जलधरकल्पं हरिरुपगत<BR> इति तिमिरमनल्पम् Gīt. 6; प्रियामुखं किंपुरुषश्चुचुम्बे Ku. 3. 38;<BR> Amaru. 16; H. 4. 132.<BR>—2 To touch softly, or graze; with<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">Page0713-2</a>]<BR> परि to kiss; Ṛs. 6. 18; Amaru. 77. ━II. €10 P. To hurt, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बः|चुम्ब|चुंब|चुंबः
चुम्बः, -म्बा [चुम्ब्-भावे घञ् अच् वा] A kiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बा
चुम्बः, -म्बा [चुम्ब्-भावे घञ् अच् वा] A kiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बकः|चुम्बक|चुंबक|चुंबकः
चुम्बकः [चुम्ब्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A kisser.<BR>—2 A lecher, a lustful man, libertine.<BR>—3 A rogue, cheat.<BR>—4 One who has kissed or dipped in a variety of subjects, a superficial scholar.<BR>—5 A loadstone.<BR>—6 The upper part or middle of a balance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बनम्
चुम्बनम् [चुम्ब् भावे ल्युट्] Kissing, a kiss; चुम्बनं देहि मे<BR> भार्ये कामचाण्डालतृप्तये R. G.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बित|चुंबित
चुम्बित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Kissed.<BR>—2 Touched softly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुम्बिन्|चुंबिन्
चुम्बिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Kissing, sipping; Māl. 9. 7.<BR>—2 Touching, grazing; Bh. 3. 95.<BR>—3 Affected with; इत्यर्धचन्द्राभनखाङ्कचुम्बिकुचा सखी यत्र सखीभिरूचे N. 6. 66.<BR>—4 Relating to; त्वच्चुम्बिनैव स्वमनोरथेन N. 8. 87.<BR>—5 Busy with; कार्यान्तरचुम्बिचित्ते N. 3. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुर्
चुर् €10 U. (चोरयति-ते, चोरित)<BR>—1 To rob, steal; Ms. 8. 333; V. 3. 17.<BR>—2 (Fig.) To bear, have, possess, take, assume; अचूचुरच्चन्द्रमसोऽभिरामताम् Śi. 1. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुर
चुर <i>a.</i> Stealing, robbing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुरणम्
चुरणम् Robbing, theft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुरा
चुरा Theft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरः|चोर
चो(चौ)रः<BR>—1 A thief, robber; सकलं चोर गतं त्वया गृहीतम् V. 4. 16; इन्दीवरदलप्रभाचोरं<BR> चक्षुः Bh. 3. 67.<BR>—2 Any dishonest dealer.<BR>—3 One that steals or captivates the heart.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चोरकर्मन्, चोरगत, चोररूपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौरः|चौर
चो(चौ)रः<BR>—1 A thief, robber; सकलं चोर गतं त्वया गृहीतम् V. 4. 16; इन्दीवरदलप्रभाचोरं<BR> चक्षुः Bh. 3. 67.<BR>—2 Any dishonest dealer.<BR>—3 One that steals or captivates the heart.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चोरकर्मन्, चोरगत, चोररूपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरकर्मन्
चोरः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> theft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरगत
चोरः + -गत <i>a.</i> robbed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोररूपः
चोरः + -रूपः a clever thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरिका
चो(चौ)रिका Theft, robbery; ˚विवाह Māl. 1, secret marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चौरिका
चो(चौ)रिका Theft, robbery; ˚विवाह Māl. 1, secret marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरित
चोरित <i>a.</i> Stolen, robbed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरितम्
चोरित + .{@-तम्@} Theft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोरितकम्
चोरितकम्<BR>—1 Petty theft, larceny.<BR>—2 Anything stolen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुरिः|चुरि
चुरिः, -री <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A small well.<BR>—2 Theft; ततो दैवयोगेन राजभवने चौराश्चुरीं कृत्वा … Vet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुरी
चुरिः, -री <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A small well.<BR>—2 Theft; ततो दैवयोगेन राजभवने चौराश्चुरीं कृत्वा … Vet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्
चुल् €10 P. (चोलयति)<BR>—1 To raise or elevate.<BR>—2 To rise, increase.<BR>—3 To dip, dive or plunge into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुकः|चुलुक|चुलुकं
चुलुकः [चुल्-उकञ्]<BR>—1 Deep mud.<BR>—2 A mouthful of water or the hand hollowed to hold water or anything;<BR> ममौ स भद्रं चुलुके समुद्रः N. 8. 45; ज्ञात्वा विधातुश्चुलुकात् प्रसूतिम् Vikr. 1. 37.<BR>—3 A small vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुक|चुलुकं|चुलुकः
चुलुकः + .{@-क@} Water in which pulse has been steeped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुकिन्
चुलुकिन् <i>m.</i> A porpoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुम्प्|चुलुंप्
चुलुम्प् €1 P. (चुलुम्पति) To swing, rock, move to and fro, agitate.<BR>━<i>With</i> {@उद्@}<BR>—1 to swing.<BR>—2 to agitate; अम्भोधेर्नालिकेलीरसमिव चुलुकैरुच्चुलुम्पन्त्यपो ये Mv. 5. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0713-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुम्पः|चुलुम्प|चुलुंप|चुलुंपः
चुलुम्पः Fondling children.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुम्पा
चुलुम्पा A she-goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुलुम्पिन्
चुलुम्पिन् A kind of fish; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्ल्
चुल्ल् €1 P. (चुल्लति)<BR>—1 To play, sport, to make amorous gestures.<BR>—2 To conjecture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्ल|चुल्लः
चुल्ल <i>a.</i> Blear-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्लः|चुल्ल
चुल्ल + .{@-ल्लः@} A blear eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्लकः|चुल्लक
चुल्लकः The palm of the hand hollowed as in the act of holding water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्लकी
चुल्लकः + .{@-की@}<BR>—1 A kind of water-pot.<BR>—2 A porpoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्लिः|चुल्लि
चुल्लिः A fire-place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुल्ली
चुल्ली<BR>—1 A fire-place; पञ्च सूना गृहस्थस्य चुल्ली पेषण्युपस्करः Ms. 3. 68.<BR>—2 A funeral pile.<BR>—3 A large apartment or hall composed of three divisions, one looking<BR> north, another east, and the third west; याम्याहीनं चुल्ली त्रिशालाकं<BR> वित्तनाशकरमेतत् Bṛ. S. 53. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुस्त्
चुस्त् €10 P.<BR>—1 To honour.<BR>—2 To condemn; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुस्तः|चुस्त|चुस्तं
चुस्तः, -स्तम्<BR> [चु क्त बा˚ सुट्]<BR>—1 The burnt exterior of roast meat.<BR>—2 Fried meat.<BR>—3 Chaff.<BR>—4 Rind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चुस्तम्
चुस्तः, -स्तम्<BR> [चु क्त बा˚ सुट्]<BR>—1 The burnt exterior of roast meat.<BR>—2 Fried meat.<BR>—3 Chaff.<BR>—4 Rind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूचुकम्
चूचुकम्, चूचूकम् The nipple of a breast; Śi. 7. 19. ━<i>a.</i><BR> staggering in speech; मूकचूचुकाः Mb. 14. 36. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूचूकम्
चूचुकम्, चूचूकम् The nipple of a breast; Śi. 7. 19. ━<i>a.</i><BR> staggering in speech; मूकचूचुकाः Mb. 14. 36. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडः|चूड
चूडः Ved.<BR>—1 A protuberance.<BR>—2 The ceremony of tonsure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडकः|चूडक
