चूडा
चूडा —1 The hair on the top of the head, a single lock on the crown<BR> of the head (left after the ceremony of tonsure); R. 18. 51; U. 5. 36, 5. 3, 4. 20.<BR>—2 The ceremony of tonsure.<BR>—3 The crest of a cock or peacock; Pt. 2. 73.<BR>—4 Any crest, plume or diadem.<BR>—5 The head.<BR>—6 Top, summit.<BR>—7 A room on the top of a house.<BR>—8 A well.<BR>—9 An ornament (like a bracelet worn on the wrist).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चूडाकरणम्, चूडाकर्मन्, चूडापाशः, चूडामणिः, चूडारत्नम्, चूडालक्षणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडाकरणम्
चूडा + -करणम्, -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> the ceremony of tonsure; Ms. 2. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडाकर्मन्|चूडाकर्म्मन्
चूडा + -करणम्, -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> the ceremony of tonsure; Ms. 2. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडापाशः|चूडापाश
चूडा + -पाशः a mass of hair; चूडापाशे नवकुरबकम् Me. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडामणिः|चूडामणि
चूडा + -मणिः, -रत्नम्<BR>—1 a jewel worn on the top of the head, a crest-jewel (fig. also).<BR>—2 best, excellent (usually at the end of comp.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडारत्नम्
चूडा + -मणिः, -रत्नम्<BR>—1 a jewel worn on the top of the head, a crest-jewel (fig. also).<BR>—2 best, excellent (usually at the end of comp.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडालक्षणम्
चूडा + -लक्षणम् tonsure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडार
चूडार, -ल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having a single lock of hair on the crown of the head.<BR>—2 Crested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडाल|चूडालं
चूडार, -ल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having a single lock of hair on the crown of the head.<BR>—2 Crested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडालम्
चूडार, -ल + .{@-लम्@} The head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडिक
चूडिक, चूडिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having a lock of hair on the head.<BR>—2 Crested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूडिन्
