चूडाम्लम्
चूडाम्लम् Vinegar prepared from fruits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूण्
चूण् €10 P. (चूणयति)<BR>—1 To contract.<BR>—2 To close, shrink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूतः|चूत
चूतः [चूष्-क्त, चोतति रसं चुत्-अच् वा पृषो˚ Tv.]<BR>—1 The mango tree; ईषद्बद्धरजः कणाग्रकपिशा चूते नवा मञ्जरी<BR> V. 2. 7; चूताङ्कुरास्वादकषायकण्ठः Ku. 3. 32<BR>—2 one of the 5 arrows of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">Page0714-2</a>]<BR> Cupid; see पञ्चबाण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूतम्
