चूतयष्टिः
चूतः + -यष्टिः The mango branch. चूतयष्टया समाश्लिष्टो दृश्यतां तिलकद्रुमः ।<BR> Bu. C. 4. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूतकः|चूतक
चूतकः<BR>—1 The mango tree.<BR>—2 A small well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

