चूरी
चूरी, -चूरिका<BR> A small well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूरिका
चूरी, -चूरिका<BR> A small well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्ण्
चूर्ण् €10 U. (चूर्णयति-ते, चूर्णित)<BR>—1 To reduce to powder, pulverize, pound.<BR>—2 To bruise, crush.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

