चूर्णः, -र्णम्<BR> [चूर्ण् कर्मणि अच्]<BR>—1 Powder.<BR>—2 Flour.<BR>—3 Dust; तत्राश्मचूर्णान्यपतन् पावकप्रकरा इव Rām. 1. 171. 3.<BR>—4 Aromatic powder, pounded sandal, camphor &c.; भवति विफलप्रेरणा<BR> चूर्णमुष्टिः Me. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णम्
चूर्णः, -र्णम्<BR> [चूर्ण् कर्मणि अच्]<BR>—1 Powder.<BR>—2 Flour.<BR>—3 Dust; तत्राश्मचूर्णान्यपतन् पावकप्रकरा इव Rām. 1. 171. 3.<BR>—4 Aromatic powder, pounded sandal, camphor &c.; भवति विफलप्रेरणा<BR> चूर्णमुष्टिः Me. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णः|चूर्ण|चूर्णं|चूर्ण्ण
चूर्णः, -र्णम् + .{@-र्णः@}<BR>—1 Chalk.<BR>—2 Lime.<BR>—3 Pounding.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चूर्णकारः, चूर्णकुन्तलः, चूर्णखण्डः, चूर्णखण्डम्, चूर्णपदम्, चूर्णपारदः, चूर्णमुष्टिः, चूर्णयोगः, चूर्णराजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णकारः|चूर्णकार
चूर्णः + -कारः a lime-burner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णकुन्तलः|चूर्णकुन्तल|चूर्णकुंतल
चूर्णः + -कुन्तलः a curl, curly hair; समं केरलकान्तानां चूर्णकुन्तलवल्लिभिः Vikr. 4. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णखण्डः|चूर्णखण्ड|चूर्णखंड|चूर्णखण्डं
चूर्णः + -खण्डः, -खण्डम्<BR>—1 gravel, pebble.<BR>—2 lime-stone nodule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णखण्डम्
चूर्णः + -खण्डः, -खण्डम्<BR>—1 gravel, pebble.<BR>—2 lime-stone nodule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णपदम्
चूर्णः + -पदम् a peculiar exercise, walking backwards and forwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णपारदः|चूर्णपारद
चूर्णः + -पारदः vermilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णमुष्टिः|चूर्णमुष्टि
चूर्णः + -मुष्टिः <i>f.</i> a handful of perfume or powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णयोगः|चूर्णयोग
चूर्णः + -योगः perfumed powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णराजः
चूर्णः + -राजः It is the king of powders containing eight parts of ‘asa-foetida’<BR> and twenty-seven parts ‘bdellium’; Mātaṅga L. 11. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णकः|चूर्णक|चूर्णकं
चूर्णकः [चूर्ण स्वार्थे क]<BR>—1 Grain fried and pounded.<BR>—2 A species of silk-cotton tree (शाल्मलीविशेष); अङ्कोलाश्च कुरण्टाश्च<BR> चूर्णकाः पारिभद्रकाः Rām. 4. 1. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णकम्
चूर्णकः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A fragrant powder.<BR>—2 A style of prose-composition which is easy, does not contain hard letters,<BR> and has very few compounds; अकठोराक्षरं स्वल्पसमासं चूर्णकं विदुः Chand. M. 6.<BR>—3 Explaining in prose the purport of a foregoing verse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णनम्
चूर्णनम् Crushing, pounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णिः|चूर्णि
चूर्णिः, -र्णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Pounding, powder.<BR>—2 A sum of hundred cowries.<BR>—3 N. of Patañjaliʼs Mahābhāṣya on the Sūtras of Pāṇini.<BR>—4 A selection of an unanswerable argument.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चूर्णिकृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णी
चूर्णिः, -र्णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Pounding, powder.<BR>—2 A sum of hundred cowries.<BR>—3 N. of Patañjaliʼs Mahābhāṣya on the Sūtras of Pāṇini.<BR>—4 A selection of an unanswerable argument.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चूर्णिकृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णिकृत्
चूर्णिः + -कृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an epithet of Patañjali.<BR>—2 an annotator, commentator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णिका
चूर्णिका<BR>—1 Grain fried and powdered.<BR>—2 A style of prose composition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णित
चूर्णित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Pounded, pulverized.<BR>—2 Crushed, bruised, smashed, shattered to pieces; Ku. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णिन्
चूर्णिन् <i>a.</i> Made or mixed up with anything powdered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णीकृ
चूर्णीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To reduce to powder, pound, grind.<BR>—2 To bruise, smash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्णीभू
चूर्णीभू €1 P. To become dust, fly off into minute particles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूर्तिः|चूर्ति|चूर्त्ति
चूर्तिः <i>f.</i> Going.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0714-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूलः|चूल
चूलः Hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूला
चूलः + .{@-ला@}<BR>—1 An upper room.<BR>—2 A crest.<BR>—3 The crest of a comet; cf. चूडा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूलिकम्
चूलिकम् A cake of flour fried with ghee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूलिन्
चूलिन् <i>a.</i> Having a crest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूलिका
चूलिका [चुल् समुच्चये ण्वुल् पृषो˚ दीर्घः]<BR>—1 The crest or comb of a cock.<BR>—2 The root of an elephantʼs ear. Mātaṅga L. 6. 9.<BR>—3 (In dramas) The hinting or indication of the occurrence of any event<BR> by characters behind the stage; अन्तर्जवनिकासंस्थैः सूचनार्थस्य चूलिका<BR> S. D. 310; <i>e. g.</i> in the beginning of the 4th Act of Mv.<BR>—4 The crest (?) of a bow; प्रथमं चापमारोप्य चूलिकां बन्धयेत्ततः ।<BR> स्थानकं तु ततः कृत्वा बाणोपरि करं न्यसेत् ॥ Dhanur. 118.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूष्
चूष् €1 P. (चूषति, चूषित) To drink, suck up or out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूषा
चूषा<BR>—1 A leathern girth (for an elephant).<BR>—2 Sucking.<BR>—3 A girdle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चूष्यम्
चूष्यम् [चूष् कर्मणि ण्यत्] Any article of food to be sucked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोष|चोषः
चोष<BR>—1 Sucking.<BR>—2 Inflammation (in medicine).<BR>—3 Drying up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोषणम्
चोषणम् Sucking, suction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चोष्यम्
चोष्यम् = चूष्य q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चृत्
चृत् I. €6 P. (चृतति)<BR>—1 To hurt, kill.<BR>—2 To tie, bind or connect together. ━II. €1 P., €10 P. (चर्तति, चर्तयति)<BR> To light, kindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेकितानः|चेकितान
चेकितानः<BR>—1 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 N. of a Yādava prince, who fought on the side of the Pāṇḍavas in<BR> the great war. ━<i>a.</i> One who sees; यं चेकितानमनु चित्तय उच्चकन्ति<BR> Bhāg. 6. 16. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेटः|चेट
चेटः(डः) [चिट् अच्, वा टस्य डः] A servant; एतत्तस्य<BR> मुखाच्छ्रुत्वा राजचेटस्य दुर्मनाः Ks. 6. 127.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेडः|चेड
चेटः(डः) [चिट् अच्, वा टस्य डः] A servant; एतत्तस्य<BR> मुखाच्छ्रुत्वा राजचेटस्य दुर्मनाः Ks. 6. 127.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेटकः|चेटक
चेटकः<BR>—1 A servant, slave; any one who does a set task.<BR>—2 A paramour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेटिका
चेटि(डि)का, चेटिः (-टी) (-डी) <i>f.</i> A female slave or servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेडिका
चेटि(डि)का, चेटिः (-टी) (-डी) <i>f.</i> A female slave or servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेटिः
चेटि(डि)का, चेटिः (-टी) (-डी) <i>f.</i> A female slave or servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेद्
चेद् <i>ind.</i> If, provided that, although (never used at the beginning<BR> of a sentence); अयि रोषमुरीकरोषि नो चेत्किमपि त्वां प्रति वारिधे वदामः<BR> Bv. 1. 44; Ku. 4. 9; इति चेद्<BR> -न ‘if it be urged that … … (we reply) not so’<BR> (frequently used in controversial works); सन्निधानमात्रेण<BR> राजप्रभृतीनां दृष्टं कर्तृत्वमिति चेन्न Ś. B.; अथ चेद् but if.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेदिः|चेदि
चेदिः <i>m.</i> (<i>pl.</i>) N. of a country; तदीशितारं चेदीनां भवांस्तमवमंस्त<BR> मा Śi. 2. 95, 63.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चेदिपतिः, चेदिभूभृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेदिपतिः|चेदिपति
चेदिः + -पतिः, -भूभृत् <i>m.</i>, {@-राज्@} <i>m.</i>, {@-राजः@}<BR> N. of Śiśupāla, son of Damaghośa and king of the Chedis;<BR> Śi. 2. 96; see शिशुपाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेदिभूभृत्
चेदिः + -पतिः, -भूभृत् <i>m.</i>, {@-राज्@} <i>m.</i>, {@-राजः@}<BR> N. of Śiśupāla, son of Damaghośa and king of the Chedis;<BR> Śi. 2. 96; see शिशुपाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेदिकः|चेदिक
चेदिकः^1 <i>m.</i> (<i>pl.</i>) The Chedis; शौलिकविदर्भवत्सान्ध्रचेदिकाश्चौर्ध्वकण्ठाश्च<BR> Bṛ. S. 14. 8.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेरिका
चेरिका<BR>—1 A village, town.<BR>—2 A suburb town inhabited by weavers; तदेव चेरिका प्रोक्ता नागरी तन्तुवायभूः<BR> Kāmikāgama 20. 15. 16; also Māna. 10. 85-88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेल्
चेल् €1 P. (चेलति)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To shake, be disturbed, tremble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेलम्
चेलम्<BR>—1 A garment; कुसुम्भारुणं चारु चेलं वसाना Jag.<BR>—2 (At the end of comp.) Bad, wicked, vile; भार्याचेलम् ‘a bad wife’.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चेलाशकः, चेलक्नोपम्, चेलगङ्गा, चेलचीरा, चेलनिर्णेजकः, चेलप्रक्षालकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेलाशकः|चेलाशक
चेलम् + -आशकः a moth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेलक्नोपम्
चेलम् + -क्नोपम् <i>ind.</i> So as to wet the clothes (rain) P. III. 4. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेलगङ्गा
चेलम् + -गङ्गा N. of a river near Gokarṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेलचीरा
चेलम् + -चीरा a piece torn off from a garment; विपन्नं गलमुद्बध्य<BR> दृढया चेलचीरया Rāj. T. 4. 574.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेलनिर्णेजकः|चेलनिर्णेजक
चेलम् + -निर्णेजकः, -प्रक्षालकः a washerman; श्ववतां शौण्डिकानां च<BR> चेलनिर्णेजकस्य च Ms. 4. 216.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेलप्रक्षालकः|चेलप्रक्षालक
चेलम् + -निर्णेजकः, -प्रक्षालकः a washerman; श्ववतां शौण्डिकानां च<BR> चेलनिर्णेजकस्य च Ms. 4. 216.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेलिका
चेलिका<BR>—1 A bodice.<BR>—2 Silk-cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेलुकः|चेलुक
चेलुकः A Buddhist novice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेल्ल्
चेल्ल् €1 P. (चेल्लति)<BR>—1 To go or move.<BR>—2 To shake, tremble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्ट्
चेष्ट् €1 Ā. (चेष्टते, चेष्टित)<BR>—1 To move about, stir, be active, show signs of life; यदा स देवो<BR> जागर्ति तदेदं चेष्टते जगत् Ms. 1. 52; Māl. 8. 8; Ś. 6. 27.<BR>—2 To make effort, endeavour, exert oneself, struggle.<BR>—3 To perform, do (anything).<BR>—4 To frequent.<BR>—5 To behave, act. ━<i>With</i> {@वि@}<BR>—1 to stir, move, be in motion, move about.<BR>—2 to act, behave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्टम्
चेष्टम्<BR>—1 Moving the limbs, gesture;<BR>—2 Acting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्टक|चेष्टकः
चेष्टक <i>a.</i> [चेष्ट्-ण्वुल्] Making efforts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्टकः|चेष्टक
चेष्टक + .{@-कः@} A particular mode of sexual enjoyment or coitus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्टनम्
चेष्टनम्<BR>—1 Motion.<BR>—2 Effort, exertion.<BR>—3 Performing, doing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्टा
चेष्टा [चेष्ट्-अङ्]<BR>—1 Motion, movement; संरुद्धचेष्टस्य R. 2. 43; किमस्माकं खामिचेष्टानिरूपणेन<BR> H. 3; Māl. 5. 7.<BR>—2 Gesture, action; चेष्टया भाषणेन च नेत्रवक्त्रविकारैश्च लक्ष्यते<BR> ऽन्तर्गतं मनः Ms. 8. 26.<BR>—3 Effort, exertion.<BR>—4 Behaviour Pt. 1. 150.<BR>—5 Action, deed, performing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्टानाशः|चेष्टानाश
चेष्टा + .{@-नाशः@} destruction of the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्टानिरूपणम्
चेष्टा + .{@-निरूपणम्@} observing a personʼs movements.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्टित|चेष्टितं
चेष्टित <i>p. p.</i> [चेष्ट्-कर्तरि क्त] Moved, stirred &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चेष्टितम्
चेष्टित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Motion, gesture, act.<BR>—2 Doing, action, behaviour; कपोलपाटलादेशि बभूव रघुचेष्टितम्<BR> R. 4. 68; तत्तत्कामस्य चेष्टितम् Ms. 2. 4 doing or work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चैतन्यम्
चैतन्यम् [चेतनस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Spirit, life, intelligence, vitality, sensation.<BR>—2 Soul, spirit, mind; U. 1. 36.<BR>—3 Consciousness, feeling, sensation, sense; U. 1. 48.<BR>—4 (In Vedānta phil.) The Supreme Spirit considered as the essence of<BR> all being and source of all sensation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: चैतन्यभरवी, चैतन्यन्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चैतन्यभरवी
चैतन्यम् + -भरवी <i>f.</i> N. of a Rāgiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चैतन्यन्यः
चैतन्यम् + -न्यः N. of a modern reformer of the Vaiṣṇava faith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चैत्तसिक
चैत्तसिक <i>a.</i> Relating to the mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0715-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चैत्त
चैत्त <i>a.</i> [चित्तस्येदम् अण्] Belonging to the mind, mental.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0716-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

चैत्तम्
