चैत्रः|चैत्र|चैत्रं
चैत्रः [चि ष्ट्रण्; चित्रमेव स्वार्थे अण्; चित्रायां भवः अण् वा]<BR>—1 N. of a lunar month in which the full moon stands in the constellation<BR> Chitrā (corresponding to March-April).<BR>—2 A Buddhist mendicant.<BR>—3 One of the seven ranges of mountains dividing the continent into Varṣas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0716-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

