छम्प्|छंप्
छम्प् €1. €10 P. (छम्पति, छम्पयति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0718-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छम्बङ्कारम्
छम्बङ्कारम् <i>ind.</i> So as to fail; Ks. 12. 4, 23. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0718-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छम्बट्कर
