छम्बट्कारः|छम्बट्कार
छम्बट्कारः Ruin, destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0718-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छम्बट्कारम्
छम्बट्कारः + .{@-रम्@} <i>ind.</i> (only neg.) as अच्छम्बट्कारम् so as not to make<BR> a failure; Ts. 5. 4. 7. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0718-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छर्द्
