छर्दिः|छर्दि|छर्द्दि|छर्द्दिः
छर्दः, छर्दनम्, छर्दिः <i>f.</i>, छर्दिका Vomiting, sickness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0718-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छर्दिका|छर्द्दिका
