छेदनम्
छेदन + .{@-नम्@} Cutting, tearing, cutting off, splitting, dividing; Ms. 8. 280, 292, 322.<BR>—2 A section, portion, bit, part.<BR>—3 Destruction, removal.<BR>—4 Division.<BR>—5 A medicine for removing the humours of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छेदि|छेदिः
छेदि <i>a.</i> [छिद्-इन्]<BR>—1 Cutting.<BR>—2 Breaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छेदिः|छेदि
छेदि + .{@-दिः@}<BR>—1 A carpenter.<BR>—2 Indraʼs thunderbolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छेदित|छेदितं
छेदित <i>a.</i> Cut, divided, split &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छेदिन्
छेदिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Cutting or tearing off, dividing; लोष्ठमदीं तृणच्छेदी Ms. 4. 71.<BR>—2 Destroying, removing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छेद्य
छेद्य <i>p. p.</i> [छिद्-ण्यत्] To be cut or divided, divisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छेद्यम्
