छुद्रम्
छुद्रम् [छुद्-रक् पृषो˚]<BR>—1 Retaliation, counter-action.<BR>—2 A ray (of light).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुप्
