छुप|छुपः
छुप^1 <i>a.</i> [छुप् कर्तरि क, घञर्थे क वा] Active, zealous, swift.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुपः|छुप
