छुबुकम्
छुबुकम् Ved. The chin; कर्णाभ्यां छुबुकादधि Rv. 10. 163. 1. See चिबुक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुर्
छुर् I. €1 P. (छोरति, छुरित)<BR>—1 To cut, divide.<BR>—2 To engrave. ━II. €6 P. (छुरति, छुरित)<BR>—1 To cover, smear, daub, inlay, coat, envelop.<BR>—2 To intermix. ━<i>Caus.</i> (छोरयति, छुरयति)<BR>—1 To inlay, set with mosaic ornaments.<BR>—2 To overspread.<BR>—3 To besmear; Māl. 9. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुरितम्
