छुरणम्
छुरणम्<BR>—1 Smearing, anointing; ज्योत्स्नाभस्मच्छुरणधवला रात्रिकापालिकीयम् K. P. 10.<BR>—2 Overspreading; U. 6. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुरा
छुरा [छुर्-क] Lime.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुरिका
छुरिका A knife; {sic} तान् दृष्ट्वा नृपतिः कोपादकृष्टछुरिकोऽथ<BR> सः Ks. 12. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुरित|छुरितं
छुरित <i>p. p.</i> [छुर्-क्त]<BR>—1 Set, inlaid.<BR>—2 Overspread, coated, covered over with; अनेकधातुच्छुरिताश्मराशेः<BR> Śi. 3. 4, 7; इन्दुकिरणच्छुरितमुखीम् K. 10.<BR>—3 Blended, intermixed; परस्परेणच्छुरितामलच्छवी Śi. 1. 22.<BR>—4 Besmeared, anointed; Ve. 1. 1.<BR>—5 Cut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छुरी
छुरी, छूरिका, छूरी A knife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छूरिका
छुरी, छूरिका, छूरी A knife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छूरी
छुरी, छूरिका, छूरी A knife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छूरिका
