छेलकः|छेलक
छेलकः A goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छेला
छेला (फेला) The vault of the foundation-pit; Kāmikāgama 31. 74-75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फेला
