छैदिकः|छैदिक
छैदिकः A cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छो
छो €4 P. (छपति, अच्छात्-अच्छासीत्, छात, or छित, <i>caus.</i><BR> छाययति) To cut, cut asunder, mow, reap; Bk. 14. 101, 15. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0721-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

छात|छातः
