जगन्नाथः|जगन्नाथ
जगत् + -नाथः<BR>—1 the lord of the universe.<BR>—2 Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 Dattātreya.<BR>—4 N. of a country.<BR>—5 N. of an idol at Jagannātha.<BR>—6 N. of a poet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0722-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगन्नाथौ
जगत् + -नाथः + .({@-थौ@}) Viṣṇu and Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0722-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगन्नाथा
जगत् + -नाथः + .({@-था@}) N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0722-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगन्निवासः|जगन्निवास
जगत् + -निवासः<BR>—1 the Supreme Being.<BR>—2 an epithet of Viṣṇu; जगन्निवासो वसुदेवसद्मनि Śi. 1. 1.<BR>—3 wordly existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0722-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगत्पतिः|जगत्पति
जगत् + -पतिः God, Lord of the universe; यदा च तस्याधिगमे जगत्पतेः Ku.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0722-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगत्प्रभुः|जगत्प्रभु
