जगद्बलः|जगद्बल
जगत् + -प्राणः, -बलः wind. {@बीजम्@} N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0722-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगन्मातृ
