जगनुः|जगनु
जगनुः(न्नुः)<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 An insect.<BR>—3 An animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0722-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगन्नुः|जगन्नु
जगनुः(न्नुः)<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 An insect.<BR>—3 An animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0722-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगरः|जगर
जगरः [जागर्ति युद्धेऽनेन जागृ-अच् पृषो˚ Tv.] An armour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0722-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगल|जगलः
जगल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Rough, tricky, knavish.<BR>—2 Dark, black.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0722-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जगलम्
