जघनम्
जघनम् [वक्रं हन्ति हन् यड् अच् पृषो˚; Uṇ. 5. 32]<BR>—1 The hip and the lions, the buttocks; घटय जघने काञ्चीमञ्च स्रजा<BR> कबरीभरम् Gīt. 12.<BR>—2 The pudenda.<BR>—3 Rear-guard, the reserve of an army.<BR>—4 A fault. जघनं स्यात् कटेः पूर्वे श्रोणिभागापराधयोः Nm.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: जघनार्धः, जघनकूपकौ, जघनगौरवम्, जघनचपला, जघनविपुला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघनार्धः|जघनार्ध
जघनम् + -अर्धः<BR>—1 the hinder part.<BR>—2 rear-guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघनकूपकौ
जघनम् + -कूपकौ (dual) the hollows of the lions of a handsome woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघनगौरवम्
जघनम् + -गौरवम् weight of the hips; Ś. 8. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघनचपला
जघनम् + -चपला<BR>—1 an unchaste or libidinous woman; पत्यौ विदेशयाते परमसुखं जघनचपलायाः<BR> Pt. 1. 173; प्रिया यथा स्याज्जघनचपला Bṛ. S. 104. 3.<BR>—2 a woman active in dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघनविपुला
जघनम् + -विपुला<BR>—1 a woman having stout hips.<BR>—2 N. of a metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघनिन्
जघनिन् <i>a.</i> Having large buttocks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघन्य|जघन्यः
जघन्य <i>a.</i> [जघने भवः यत्]<BR>—1 Hindmost, last; Bg. 14. 18; Ms. 8. 270. मन्ये जघन्यस्य महीधरस्य<BR> शृङ्गाणि कालायसनिर्मितानि । Rām. Ch. 4. 16.<BR>—2 Worst, vilest, base, lowest, censurable; जघन्यगुणः Bhāg. 14. 18.<BR>—3 Of low origin or rank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघन्यः|जघन्य
जघन्य + .{@-न्यः@} A Śudra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघन्यम्
जघन्य + .{@-न्यम्@} The penis.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: जघन्यावसायिन्, जघन्यजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघन्यावसायिन्
