जघन्यजः|जघन्यज
जघन्य + -जः<BR>—1 a younger brother; जघन्यजस्तक्षकश्च श्रुतसेनेति यः सुतः Mb. 1. 3. 141;<BR> श्रुत्वा वचो वालिजघन्यजस्य Rām. 4. 24. 24.<BR>—2 a Śūdra. विप्राश्च बाहुजास्तद्वद्दूरव्याश्च जघन्यजाः Śiva B. 31. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघ्निः|जघ्नि
जघ्निः [हन्-किन् द्वित्वं च] A weapon (offensive).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जघ्नु|जघ्नुः
जघ्नु <i>a.</i> [हन्-कु द्वित्वं च] Striking, Killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्गः|जङ्ग
