जङ्घाकारः|जङ्घाकार
जङ्घा + -करः, -करिकः, -कारः, -कारिकः a runner, courier, an express. Kau. A. 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घाकारिकः|जङ्घाकारिक|जंघाकारिक
जङ्घा + -करः, -करिकः, -कारः, -कारिकः a runner, courier, an express. Kau. A. 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घात्राणम्
जङ्घा + -त्राणम् an armour for the legs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घापथः
जङ्घा + -पथः A foot-path. जङ्घापथश्चतुष्पादस्त्रिपादं च गृहान्तरम्<BR> Brahmāṇḍa P. part 1, second अनुषङ्गपाद. Ch. 7. 5. 115.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घाबलम्
जङ्घा + -बलम् ‘Strength of the shanks’, running away किमन्यत् । जङ्घाबलमेव<BR> M. 3 (between 19th and 20th verses.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घाल|जंघाल|जङ्घालः
जङ्घाल <i>a.</i> [जङ्घा वेगवती अस्त्यस्य लच्] Running swiftly,<BR> rapid. जङ्घालजनसङ्कुलम् Śiva B. 22. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घालः|जङ्घाल|जंघाल
जङ्घाल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A courier<BR>—2 A deer, an antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जङ्घिल|जंघिल
जङ्घिल <i>a.</i> [जङ्घा-इलच्] Running swiftly, rapid, quick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जज्
जज्, जञ्ज् €1 P. (जजति or जञ्जति) To fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जञ्ज्|जंज्
जज्, जञ्ज् €1 P. (जजति or जञ्जति) To fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जजः|जज|जजं
ज(जञ्)जः A warrior, soldier; जजौजोजाजिजिज्जाजी Śi. 19. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जञ्जः|जञ्ज
ज(जञ्)जः A warrior, soldier; जजौजोजाजिजिज्जाजी Śi. 19. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जज्झ्
जज्झ् (जज्झति) To make a dashing sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जञ्जन
जञ्जन <i>a.</i> [जन्-यङ्-लुक्-अच् पृषो˚]<BR>—1 Being born again.<BR>—2 Burning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जञ्जपूक|जंजपूक|जञ्जपूकः
जञ्जपूक <i>a.</i> Muttering prayers repeatedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जञ्जपूकः|जञ्जपूक|जंजपूक
जञ्जपूक + .{@-कः@} An ascetic, or devotee (who mutters prayers); cf. P. III. 2. 166; जञ्जपूकोऽक्षमालावान् … … Bk. 5. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जञ्झानिलः
जञ्झानिलः The wind with rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जट्
जट् €1 P. (जटति) To clot, become twisted or matted together (as hair).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जट
जट <i>a.</i> [जट्-अच्; जन् उणा˚ टन् अन्त्यलोपश्च] Wearing twisted locks of hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटा
जटा [Uṇ. 5. 30]<BR>—1 The hair matted and twisted together, matted or clotted hair; जटाधरणसंस्कारं<BR> द्विजातित्वमवाप्य च Mb. 12. 61. 3. अंसव्यापि शकुन्तनीडनिचितं बिभ्रज्जटामण्डलम्<BR> Ś. 7. 11; जटाश्च बिभृयान्नित्यम् Ms. 6. 6; Māl. 1. 2.<BR>—2 A fibrous root; यत्र मुञ्जावटे रामो जटाहरणमादिशत् Mb. 12. 122. 3.<BR>—3 A particular manuer of reciting Vedic texts; thus the words नभः<BR> रुद्रेभ्यः repeated in this manner would stand thus:− नमो रुद्रेभ्यो<BR> रुद्रेभ्यो नमो नमो रुद्रेभ्यः<BR>—4 A root in general; ज्ञानविज्ञानयोगेन कर्मणामुद्धरन् जटाः Bhāg. 3. 24. 17.<BR>—5 A branch.<BR>—6 The शतावरी plant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: जटाचीरः, जटाटङ्कः, जटाटीरः, जटाधरः, जटाजटः, जटाज्वालः, जटाधर, जटापाठः, जटाभारः, जटामण्डलम्, जटामौलिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाचीरः|जटाचीर
जटा + -चीरः, -टङ्कः, -टीरः, -धरः, epithets of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाटङ्कः|जटाटङ्क|जटाटंक
जटा + -चीरः, -टङ्कः, -टीरः, -धरः, epithets of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाटीरः|जटाटीर
जटा + -चीरः, -टङ्कः, -टीरः, -धरः, epithets of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाधरः|जटाधर
जटा + -चीरः, -टङ्कः, -टीरः, -धरः, epithets of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाजटः
जटा + -जटः<BR>—1 a mass of twisted hair (in general).<BR>—2 the twisted hair of Śiva; जटाजूटग्रन्थौ यदसि विनिबद्धा पुरभिदा<BR> G. L. 14; पिङ्गोत्तुङ्गजटाजूटगतो यस्याश्नुते नवः Ks. 1. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाज्वालः|जटाज्वाल
जटा + -ज्वालः a lamp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाधर|जटाधरः
जटा + -धर <i>a.</i> wearing matted hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाधरः|जटाधर
जटा + -धर + ({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a mendicant or ascetic<BR>—2 N. of a lexicographer.<BR>—3 N. of a people in the south of India, Bṛ. S. 14. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटापाठः|जटापाठ
जटा + -पाठः the Jaṭā arrangement of a Vedic text.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाभारः|जटाभार
जटा + -भारः mass of braided hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटामण्डलम्
जटा + -मण्डलम् braided hair forming a coil on the top of the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटामौलिः
जटा + -मौलिः crest of (formed by) clotted hair; Ku. 2. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0723-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटायुः|जटायु
जटायुः, जटायुस् <i>m.</i> A son of Śyeni and Aruṇa, a semi<BR> divine bird [He was a great friend of Daśaratha. He once saved his life<BR> while he was thrown down along with his car by Saturn against whom he<BR> had proceeded when a drought, said to be caused by the planet, well-nigh<BR> devastated the earth. While Rāvaṇa was carrying away Sītā, Jaṭāyu<BR> heard her cries in the chariot and fought most desperately with the formidable<BR> giant to rescue her from his grasp. But he was mortally wounded, and remained<BR> in that state till Rāma passed by that place in the course of his search<BR> after Sītā. The kind-hearted bird told Rāma that his wife had been<BR> carried away by Rāvaṇa and then breathed his last. His funeral rites<BR> were duly performed by Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटायुस्
जटायुः, जटायुस् <i>m.</i> A son of Śyeni and Aruṇa, a semi<BR> divine bird [He was a great friend of Daśaratha. He once saved his life<BR> while he was thrown down along with his car by Saturn against whom he<BR> had proceeded when a drought, said to be caused by the planet, well-nigh<BR> devastated the earth. While Rāvaṇa was carrying away Sītā, Jaṭāyu<BR> heard her cries in the chariot and fought most desperately with the formidable<BR> giant to rescue her from his grasp. But he was mortally wounded, and remained<BR> in that state till Rāma passed by that place in the course of his search<BR> after Sītā. The kind-hearted bird told Rāma that his wife had been<BR> carried away by Rāvaṇa and then breathed his last. His funeral rites<BR> were duly performed by Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटाल|जटालः
जटाल <i>a.</i> [जटा अस्यर्थे सिध्मा˚ लच्]<BR>—1 Wearing a coil of twisted hair; चर्मखण्डैकवसनो जटालः कृशधूसरः Ks. 53. 2.<BR>—2 Collected together (like matted hair); दवदहनजटालज्वालजालाहतानाम् Bv. 1. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटालः|जटाल
जटाल + .{@-लः@} —1 The (Indian) fig-tree.<BR>—2 Bdellium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटालक
जटालक, जटिक <i>a.</i> Wearing twisted or braided hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटिक
जटालक, जटिक <i>a.</i> Wearing twisted or braided hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटिः|जटि
जटिः (-टी) <i>f.</i><BR> [जट्-इन्]<BR>—1 The (Indian) fig-tree.<BR>—2 Clotted hair.<BR>—3 An assemblage, multitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटी
जटिः (-टी) <i>f.</i><BR> [जट्-इन्]<BR>—1 The (Indian) fig-tree.<BR>—2 Clotted hair.<BR>—3 An assemblage, multitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटिन्
जटिन् (-नी <i>f.</i>) <i>a.</i><BR> [जटा अस्त्यस्य इनि] Having twisted hair. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 The waved-leaf fig-tree (प्लक्ष)<BR>—3 An elephant sixty years old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटिल|जटिलः
जटिल <i>a.</i> [जटा अस्त्यर्थे इलच्]<BR>—1 Wearing matted or twisted hair (as an ascetic); विवेश कश्चिज्जटिलस्तपोवनम्<BR> Ku. 5. 30; (जटिल may be here a noun meaning ‘an ascetic’); ज्येष्ठानुवृत्तिजटिलं<BR> च शिरोऽस्य साधोः R. 13. 78.<BR>—2 Complicated, confused, intermixed, intermingled; विजानन्तो ऽप्येते<BR> वयमिह विपज्जालजटिलान् । न मुञ्चामः कामानहह गहनो मोहमहिमा<BR> Bh. 3. 21; शिखाकलाप˚ Pt. 2. 81; Ve. 2. 18.<BR>—3 Dense, impervious; Bv. 1. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटिलः|जटिल
जटिल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A lion.<BR>—2 A goat.<BR>—3 An ascetic.<BR>—4 A Brāhmaṇa in the first period of his life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटिला
जटिल + .{@-ला@} Long pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटिलय
जटिलय (Denom.) To crest or fill with; जगज्जालं ज्योस्त्नामयनवसुधाभिर्जटिलयन् Bv. 4. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जटिलीकृ
जटिलीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To twist together, form into a braid<BR>—2 To complicate, interweave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

