जटुलः|जटुल
जटु(डु)लः [जट्-उलच् पृषो˚ टस्य डो वा] A freckle, mark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जडुलः|जडुल
जटु(डु)लः [जट्-उलच् पृषो˚ टस्य डो वा] A freckle, mark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जठर|जठरं|जठरः
जठर <i>a.</i> [जायते जन्तुर्गर्भो वास्मिन् जन्-अर ठान्त देशः Tv.]<BR>—1 Hard, stiff, firm.<BR>—2 Old. —3 Bound, tied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जठरः|जठर|जठरं
जठर + .{@-रः, -रम्@}<BR>—1 The stomach, belly, abdomen; जठरं को न बिभर्ति केवलम् Pt. 1. 22.<BR>—2 The womb.<BR>—3 A hole, cavity.<BR>—4 The interior of anything.<BR>—5 The bosom.<BR>—6 Morbid affection of the bowels.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: जठराग्निः, जठरामयः, जठरज्वलनम्, जठरज्वाला, जठरव्यथा, जठरयन्त्रणा, जठरयातना<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जठरम्
जठर + .{@-रः, -रम्@}<BR>—1 The stomach, belly, abdomen; जठरं को न बिभर्ति केवलम् Pt. 1. 22.<BR>—2 The womb.<BR>—3 A hole, cavity.<BR>—4 The interior of anything.<BR>—5 The bosom.<BR>—6 Morbid affection of the bowels.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: जठराग्निः, जठरामयः, जठरज्वलनम्, जठरज्वाला, जठरव्यथा, जठरयन्त्रणा, जठरयातना<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जठराग्निः|जठराग्नि
जठर + -अग्निः the digestive fire of the stomach, the gastric fluid; पञ्चाग्नेस्तस्य<BR> चान्यौ द्वावधिकं ज्वलतः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-2" target="_blank">Page0724-2</a>]<BR> क्षुधा । जठराग्नी सभार्यस्य दरिद्रस्य प्रजाधनैः Ks. 73. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

