जठरज्वलनम्
जठर + -ज्वलनम् ‘stomach heat’, hunger; जठरज्वलनज्वलता … करिणामरिणा Bv. 1. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

