जठरयातना
जठर + -यन्त्रणा, -यातना pain endured by the child in the womb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

