जडभरतः|जडभरत
जड + -भरतः<BR>—1 an idiot.<BR>—2 N. of a man simulating stupidity; Jābāla Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जडता
जडता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Dulness, aversion to work, slothfulness.<BR>—2 Ignorance, stupidity; Pt. 1.<BR>—3 (In Rhet.) Dulness, regarded as one of the 33 subordinate feelings; S. D. 175.<BR>—4 Stupefaction, numbness, stupor; U. 3. 12.<BR>—5 Dulness, timidity; Māl. 6. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जडत्वम्
जडता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Dulness, aversion to work, slothfulness.<BR>—2 Ignorance, stupidity; Pt. 1.<BR>—3 (In Rhet.) Dulness, regarded as one of the 33 subordinate feelings; S. D. 175.<BR>—4 Stupefaction, numbness, stupor; U. 3. 12.<BR>—5 Dulness, timidity; Māl. 6. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जडयति
जडयति Den. P. To stupefy, benumb; Māl. 1. 30; Ratn. 4. 13; Mu. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जडिमन्
जडिमन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 Frigidity.<BR>—2 Stupidity.<BR>—3 Dulness, apathy; पशुभ्य इव संक्रान्तजडिमा पशुपालकः Ks. 61. 23.<BR>—4 Stupor, stupefaction; Māl. 1. 35; निबिडं जडिमा जाने व्यधत्त घियि<BR> संनिधिम् Rāj. T. 4. 110.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

