जलाञ्चलम्
जल + -अञ्चलम्<BR>—1 a spring.<BR>—2 a natural water-course.<BR>—3 moss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0730-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जलाञ्जलिः|जलाञ्जलि|जलांजलि
जल + -अञ्जलिः<BR>—1 a handful of water.<BR>—2 a libation of water presented to the manes of a deceased person; कुपुत्रमासाद्य<BR> कुतो जलाञ्जलिः Cāṇ. 69; मानस्यापि जलाञ्जलिः सरभसं लोके न<BR> दत्तो यथा Amaru. 97 (where, जलाञ्जलिं दा means ‘to leave or give up’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0730-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

