जल्प्
जल्प् €1 P.<BR> (जल्पति, जल्पित) —1 To speak, talk, speak or converse (with<BR> another); अविरलितकपोलं जल्पतोरक्रमेण U. 1. 27; एकेन जल्पन्त्यनल्पाक्षरम्<BR> Pt. 1. 136; Bh. 1. 82.<BR>—2 To murmur, speak inarticulately.<BR>—3 To chatter, prattle, babble.<BR>—4 To praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0731-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

