जवस् <i>n.</i> Ved. Quickness, speed; पयोभिर्जिन्वे अपां जवांसि Rv. 4. 21. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0731-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जविन्
जविन् <i>a.</i> Quick, fleet. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A horse.<BR>—2 A camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0731-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जविन
जविन <i>a.</i> Rapid, quick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0731-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जवनिका
जवनिका, जवनी [जु करणे ल्युट् संज्ञायां कन्]<BR>—1 A screen of cloth surrounding a tent.<BR>—2 A curtain in general; नरः संसारान्ते विशति यमधानीजवनिकाम्<BR> Bh. 3. 112; मायाजवनिकाच्छन्नम् Bhāg. 1. 8. 19; सतां जवनिका<BR> निकामसुखिनाम् Śi. 4. 54.<BR>—3 The sail of a boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0731-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जवनी
जवनिका, जवनी [जु करणे ल्युट् संज्ञायां कन्]<BR>—1 A screen of cloth surrounding a tent.<BR>—2 A curtain in general; नरः संसारान्ते विशति यमधानीजवनिकाम्<BR> Bh. 3. 112; मायाजवनिकाच्छन्नम् Bhāg. 1. 8. 19; सतां जवनिका<BR> निकामसुखिनाम् Śi. 4. 54.<BR>—3 The sail of a boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0731-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

