जागुडम् Saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागुडः|जागुड|जागुडं
जागुडम् + .{@-डः@} N. of a country famous for its saffron; अगाद्रथो अवनिं<BR> जागुडकुङ्कुमाभिताम्राम् Śi. 20. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागृ
जागृ €2 P. (जागर्ति, जागरित)<BR>—1 To be awake, be watchful or attentive (fig. also); सोऽपसर्पैर्जजागार<BR> यथाकालं स्वपन्नपि R. 17. 51; गुरौ षाड्गुण्यचिन्तायामार्ये चार्ये च<BR> जाग्रति Mu. 7. 13; to sit up during the night; या निशा सर्वभूतानां<BR> तस्यां जागर्ति संयमी Bg. 2. 69.<BR>—2 To be roused from sleep, awake.<BR>—3 To foresee, be provident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरा
जागरा See जागरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागर|जागरः
जागर <i>a.</i> [जागृ भावे घञ् गुणः] Awake, watchful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरः|जागर
जागर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 Wakefulness, waking, keeping awake; रात्रिजागरपरो दिवाशयः R. 19. 34.<BR>—2 A vision in a waking state.<BR>—3 An armour, mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरक
जागरक <i>a.</i> [जागृ-ण्वुल्-गुणः] Waking, awake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरणम्
जागरणम् [जागृ भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Waking, wakefulness.<BR>—2 Watchfulness, vigilance.<BR>—3 Sitting up at night as a part of a religious ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरित
जागरित <i>a.</i> One who has been long awake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरितम्
जागरित + .{@-तम्@} Waking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरितृ
जागरितृ <i>a.</i>,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरित्री
जागरितृ + .({@-त्री@} <i>f.</i>), {@जागरूक@} <i>a.</i> [जागृ-तृच् ऊक् वा]<BR>—1 Wakeful, waking, sleepless; स्वपतो जागरूकस्य याथार्थ्यं वेद कस्तव R. 10. 24.<BR>—2 Watchful, vigilant; वर्णाश्रमावेक्षणजागरूकः R. 14. 85; Śi. 20. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागरिन्
जागरिन् <i>a.</i> Wakeful, awake, vigilant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागृवि|जागृविः
जागृवि <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Watchful, attentive, vigilant.<BR>—2 Awake.<BR>—3 Clear, bright (as fire); येन ज्योतिरजनयन्नृतावृधो देवं देवाय<BR> जागृवि Rv. 8. 89. 1.<BR>—4 Active, animating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागृविः|जागृवि
जागृवि + .{@-विः@}<BR>—1 A king.<BR>—2 Agni or fire; देवो देवेष्वनवद्य जागृविः Rv. 1. 31. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागर्तिः|जागर्ति|जागर्त्ति|जागर्त्तिः
जागर्तिः, जागर्या, जाग्रिया Wakefulness, keeping awake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जागर्या|जागर्य्या
जागर्तिः, जागर्या, जाग्रिया Wakefulness, keeping awake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाग्रिया
जागर्तिः, जागर्या, जाग्रिया Wakefulness, keeping awake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाग्रत्
जाग्रत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Watching, being awake.<BR>—2 Attentive, careful, watchful.<BR>—3 Clear, bright. ━<i>m.</i> Ved. Dreaming in a waking state, day-dream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0732-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जाघनी
