जित + -कोप, -क्रोध, -मन्यु + .({@-धः@}) an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितक्रोध|जितक्रोधः
जित + -कोप, -क्रोध, -मन्यु <i>a.</i> imperturbable, not excitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितमन्यु
जित + -कोप, -क्रोध, -मन्यु <i>a.</i> imperturbable, not excitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितनेमिः|जितनेमि
जित + -नेमिः a staff made of the Aśvattha tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितलोक
जित + -लोक <i>a.</i> ‘one who has won heaven’ (epithet of a class of manes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितशत्रु|जितशत्रुः
जित + -शत्रु <i>a.</i> victorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितशिश्नोदर
जित + -शिश्नोदर <i>a.</i> One who has overcome lust and appetite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितश्रम
जित + -श्रम <i>a.</i> inured to fatigue, hardy; कृतहस्तो जितश्रमः Mb. 7. 16. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितस्वर्ग
जित + -स्वर्ग <i>a.</i>^1 one who has won heaven.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितहस्त
जित + -हस्त <i>a.</i> one who has exercised his hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जित्
जित् <i>a.</i> [जि-क्विप्] (At the end of comp.) Conquering, defeating,<BR> winning &c.; तारकजित्, कंसजित्, सहस्रजित् &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जितिः|जिति
