जित्य|जित्यः
जित्य <i>a.</i> Conquerable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जित्या
जित्य + .{@-त्या@}<BR>—1 Victory.<BR>—2 Acquisition, gain.<BR>—3 A ploughshare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जित्यः|जित्य
जित्य + .{@-त्यः@} A harrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जित्वन्
जित्वन् <i>a.</i> Victorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जित्वर|जित्वरः
