जित्वरी
जित्वर + .({@-री@} <i>f.</i>) Victorious, conquering, triumphant; शस्त्राण्युपायंसत<BR> जित्वराणि Bk. 1. 16; करदीकृतभूपालो भ्रातृभिर्जित्वरैर्दिशाम् Śi. 2. 9;<BR> अपि विष्टपजित्वरेषुणा तनुनाहारि शिवस्य नो मनः Śiva B. 32. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जित्वरी
जित्वर + .{@-री@} N. of the Benares city.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिष्णु|जिष्णुः
जिष्णु <i>a.</i> [जि-गृत्स्नु]<BR>—1 Victorious, triumphant, R. 4. 85, 10. 18.<BR>—2 Winning, gaining.<BR>—3 (At the end of comp.) Conquering, excelling; अलिनीजिष्णुः कचानां<BR> चयः Bh. 1. 5; Śi. 13. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिष्णुः|जिष्णु
जिष्णु + .{@-ष्णुः@}<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 N. of Indra; असौ जिष्णुरभवत् तत्र स म्लेच्छोऽभून्महीधरः Śiva B. 21. 52.<BR>—3 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—4 N. of Arjuna; जातस्पृहः पुष्यजनः स जिष्णौ Ki. 3. 31; … … द्युतिजिष्णु<BR> जिष्णुरभृतोष्णवारणम् Śi. 13. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जेतृ
जेतृ <i>a.</i> [जि-तृच्]<BR>—1 Victorious, triumphant.<BR>—2 Surpassing, excelling. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A conqueror, victor.<BR>—2 An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिः|जि
जिः A demon (पिशाच).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0737-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिगत्नु|जिगत्नुः
