जिघत्सा
जिघत्सा [अद् सन् घसादेशः भावे अ]<BR>—1 Desire of eating, hunger.<BR>—2 Striving for.<BR>—3 Contending with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिघत्सु|जिघत्सुः
