जिघांसा
जिघांसा<BR>—1 Desire of killing; R. 15. 19.<BR>—2 Malice, revenge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिघांसु|जिघांसुः
जिघांसु <i>a.</i> [हन् सन् उ] Desirous of killing, murderous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिघांसुः|जिघांसु
