जिघृक्षा
जिघृक्षा [ग्रह् सन् भावे अ] Desire of taking or seizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिघ्र|जिघ्रः
जिघ्र <i>a.</i> [घ्रा कर्तरि श जिघ्रादेशः]<BR>—1 Suspecting.<BR>—2 Conjecturing, guessing; observing; <i>e. g.</i> मनोजिघ्रः सपत्नीजनः S. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिज्ञासा
