जिज्ञासित|जिज्ञासितः
जिज्ञासित <i>a.</i> Investigated, asked, inquired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिज्ञासु|जिज्ञासुः
जिज्ञासु <i>a.</i> [ज्ञा सन् उ]<BR>—1 Desirous of knowing, inquisitive, curious; Bg. 6. 44.<BR>—2 Desirous of getting absolution (मुमुक्षु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

