जितुमः|जितुम
जित्तमः, जितुमः, जित्मः Gemini, the third sign of the zodiac<BR> (a word of Greek origin); Bṛhajjātaka 1. 8, 24. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जित्मः|जित्म
जित्तमः, जितुमः, जित्मः Gemini, the third sign of the zodiac<BR> (a word of Greek origin); Bṛhajjātaka 1. 8, 24. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जित्यः|जित्य
