जिन|जिनः
जिन <i>a.</i> [जि-नक्]<BR>—1 Victorious, triumphant.<BR>—2 Very old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जिनः|जिन
जिन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 A generic term applied to a chief Bauddha or Jaina saint.<BR>—2 N. applied to the Arhats of the Jainas.<BR>—3 A very old man.<BR>—4 An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: जिनेन्द्रः, जिनेश्वरः, जिनयोनिः, जिनसद्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0738-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

