जैमिनिभारतम्
जैमिनिः + -भारतम् N. of a modern revision Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0743-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जैमिनिसूत्रम्
जैमिनिः + -सूत्रम् N. of a work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0743-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जैमिनीय
जैमिनीय <i>a.</i> Relating to or composed by Jaimini. ━<i>m.</i> an adherent<BR> of Jaimini. ━<i>m.</i> (<i>pl.</i>) N. of a school of the Sv. ━<i>n.</i> Jaiminiʼs work.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: जैमिनीयन्यायमालाविस्तरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0743-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

