जैमिनीय + -न्यायमालाविस्तरः N. of a compendium of the Mīmāṃsā philosophy of Mādhava.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0743-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

जैयटः|जैयट
जैयटः N. of Kaiyaṭaʼs father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0743-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

