ज्योत्स्नावृक्षः|ज्योत्स्नावृक्ष
ज्योत्स्ना + -वृक्षः a lamp-stand, a candle-stick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्योत्स्नी
ज्योत्स्नी A moonlight-night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यौत्स्न|ज्यौत्स्नः
ज्यौत्स्न <i>a.</i> Bright or lit with moonlight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यौत्स्नः|ज्यौत्स्न
ज्यौत्स्न + .{@-त्स्नः@} The bright half of a month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यौत्स्नी
ज्यौत्स्न + .{@-त्स्नी, -त्स्निका@} A full-moon night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यौत्स्निका
ज्यौत्स्न + .{@-त्स्नी, -त्स्निका@} A full-moon night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यौः
ज्यौः The planet Jupiter (a word connected with Greek Zeus).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्यौतिषिकः|ज्यौतिषिक
ज्यौतिषिकः an astronomer or astrologer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्रि
ज्रि I. €1 P. (ज्रयति)<BR>—1 To overpower, conquer.<BR>—2 To go. ━II. €9. €10 P. (ज्रिणाति, ज्राययति) To grow old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वर्
ज्वर् €1 P. (ज्वरति, जूर्ण)<BR>—1 To be hot with fever or passion, be feverish.<BR>—2 To be diseased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वर|ज्वरः
ज्वर <i>a.</i> [ज्वर् भावे थ]<BR>—1 Heated, feverish.<BR>—2 Excited, inflamed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरः|ज्वर
ज्वर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 Fever, feverish heat (in medicine); स्वेद्यमानज्वरं प्राज्ञः कोऽम्भसा<BR> परिषिञ्चति Śi. 2. 54; also used fig.; दर्पज्वरः, मदनज्वरः,<BR> मदज्वरः &c.<BR>—2 Fever of the soul, mental pain, affliction, distress, grief, sorrow;<BR> व्येतु ते मनसो ज्वरः Rām.; मनसस्तदुपस्थिते ज्वरे R. 8. 84; Bg. 3. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरा
ज्वर + .{@-रा@} Fever.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ज्वराग्निः, ज्वराङ्कुशः, ज्वरान्तकः, ज्वरारिः, ज्वरक्षयः, ज्वरगण्डः, ज्वरप्रतीकारः, ज्वरहन्त्री, ज्वरहर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वराग्निः|ज्वराग्नि
ज्वर + -अग्निः the paroxysm of fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वराङ्कुशः|ज्वराङ्कुश|ज्वरांकुश
ज्वर + -अङ्कुशः a febrifuge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरान्तकः|ज्वरान्तक
ज्वर + -अन्तकः Cathartocarpus fistula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरारिः|ज्वरारि
ज्वर + -अरिः ‘febrifuge’, cocculus cordifolius.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरक्षयः|ज्वरक्षय
ज्वर + -क्षयः antifebrile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरगण्डः
ज्वर + -गण्डः N. of a disease; जलोदरे तृषारोगे ज्वरगण्डे विषूचके<BR> Mb. 12. 303. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरप्रतीकारः|ज्वरप्रतीकार
