ज्वरहन्त्री
ज्वर + -हन्त्री ‘febrifuge’, Rubia Munjsta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरहर
ज्वर + -हर <i>a.</i> febrifuge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरित|ज्वरितः
ज्वरित, ज्वरिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Attacked with fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वरिन्
ज्वरित, ज्वरिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Attacked with fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वल्
ज्वल् €1 P. (ज्वलति, ज्वलित)<BR>—1 To burn brightly, blaze, glow, shine; ज्वलति चलितेन्धनोऽग्निः<BR> Ś. 6. 30; Ku. 5. 30.<BR>—2 To be burnt up, be consumed or afflicted (as by fire) अमृतमधुरमृदुतरवचनेन<BR> ज्वलति न सा मलयजपवनेन Gīt. 7.<BR>—3 To be ardent; जज्वाल लोकस्थितये स राजा Bk. 1. 4.<BR>—4 To burn (as a wound). ━<i>Caus.</i> (ज्वलयति-ते, ज्वालयति-ते,<BR> but प्रज्वलयति)<BR>—1 To set on fire, light, kindle.<BR>—2 To irradiate, illuminate, brighten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वल|ज्वलः
ज्वल <i>a.</i> [ज्वल्-अच्]<BR>—1 Flaming, blazing.<BR>—2 Bright, brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलः|ज्वल
ज्वल + .{@-लः@} Flame, blaze, light; लिम्पैरिव तनोर्वातैश्चेतयः स्याज्ज्वलो<BR> न कः Bk. 6. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलका
ज्वलका A large flame of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलन|ज्वलनः
ज्वलन <i>a.</i> [ज्वल्-युच्]<BR>—1 Flaming, shining.<BR>—2 Combustible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलनः|ज्वलन
ज्वलन + .{@-नः@} Fire; तदनु ज्वलनं मदर्पितं त्वरयेर्दक्षिणवातबीजनैः<BR> Ku. 4. 36, 32; Bg. 11. 29.<BR>—2 Corrosive alkali.<BR>—3 The number ‘three’.<BR>—4 Plumbago Zeylanica or its root; Mātaṅga L. 11. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलनम्
ज्वलन + .{@-नम्@} Burning, blazing, shining.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ज्वलनाश्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलनाश्मन्
ज्वलन + -अश्मन् <i>m.</i> the sun-stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वलित|ज्वलितः
ज्वलित <i>a.</i> [ज्वल्-क्त]<BR>—1 Burnt, kindled, illuminated.<BR>—2 Flaming, blazing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वाल|ज्वालः
ज्वाल <i>a.</i> [ज्वल्-ण] Burning, blazing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्वालः|ज्वाल
ज्वाल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A flame, light; स ज्वालैः पवनोद्भूतैर्विस्फुलिङ्गैः समन्ततः Rām. 15. 149. 10;<BR> दवदहनजटालज्वालजालाहतानाम् Bv. 1. 36.<BR>—2 A torch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

