ञः|ञ
ञः<BR>—1 Singer.<BR>—2 Gurgling sound.<BR>—3 Bull.<BR>—4 N. of Śukra.<BR>—5 Perversity.<BR>—6 Number<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0749-2" target="_blank">Page0749-2</a>]<BR> ‘ten’; ञ्श्चाग्निर्ञा जरा राशिरेव च and ञं सर्पिः परं ब्रह्म निगद्यते । Enm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0749-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टः|ट|टं
