टिक्किका The white mark (on the forehead of a horse &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0749-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिटिभः|टिटिभ
टिटि(ट्टि)भः (-भी <i>f.</i>)<BR> A kind of bird; उत्क्षिप्य टिट्टिभः पादावास्ते भङ्गभयाद्दिवः<BR> Pt. 1. 314; Ms. 5. 11; Y. 1. 172; also टिट्टिभक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0749-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिट्टिभः|टिट्टिभ
टिटि(ट्टि)भः (-भी <i>f.</i>)<BR> A kind of bird; उत्क्षिप्य टिट्टिभः पादावास्ते भङ्गभयाद्दिवः<BR> Pt. 1. 314; Ms. 5. 11; Y. 1. 172; also टिट्टिभक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0749-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिप्
टिप् €10 P. (टेपयति) To direct, throw, cast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0749-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टेपनम्
टेपनम् Sending, throwing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0749-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिप्पणी
टिप्पणी (-नी)<BR> A gloss, a comment; sometimes used in the sense of ‘a gloss on a gloss’<BR>; as Kaiyaṭaʼs commentary on the Mahābhāṣya, or Nāgojībhaṭṭaʼs<BR> gloss on Kaiyaṭaʼs gloss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0749-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टिप्पनी
टिप्पणी (-नी)<BR> A gloss, a comment; sometimes used in the sense of ‘a gloss on a gloss’<BR>; as Kaiyaṭaʼs commentary on the Mahābhāṣya, or Nāgojībhaṭṭaʼs<BR> gloss on Kaiyaṭaʼs gloss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0749-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टीक्
टीक् €1 Ā. (टीकते) To move, go, resort to; काश्मर्याः कृतमालमुद्गतदलं<BR> कोयष्टिकष्टीकते Māl. 9. 7. ━<i>With</i> {@आ@} to go, move, go about; आटीकसेऽङ्ग<BR> करिघोटीपदातिजुषि वाटीभुवि क्षितिभुजाम् Aśvad. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टीका
टीका [टीक्यते गम्यते ग्रन्थार्थोऽनया] A commentary, gloss; काव्यप्रकाशस्य<BR> कृता गृहे गृहे टीका तथाप्येष तथैव दुर्गमः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टुः|टु
टुः<BR>—1 Gold.<BR>—2 One who can change his shape at will.<BR>—3 N. of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टुण्टुक|टुंटुक|टुण्टुकः
टुण्टुक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Small, little.<BR>—2 Vile, cruel.<BR>—3 Harsh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टेर
टेर, -टेरक <i>a.</i><BR> Squint-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टेरक|टेरकः
टेर, -टेरक <i>a.</i><BR> Squint-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टोट
टोट <i>a.</i> Small, little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

टोपरः|टोपर
टोपरः A small bag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ट्वल्
ट्वल् €1 P. To become disturbed or confused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ठः|ठ
ठः<BR>—1 An imitative sound, as of a metallic jar rolling down steps; रामाभिषेके<BR> मदविह्वलायाः कक्षाच्च्युतो हेमघटस्तरुण्याः । सोपानमार्गे प्रकरोति<BR> शब्दं ठठं ठठं ठं ठठठं ठठं ठः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 A loud noise.<BR>—3 The disc of the sun or moon.<BR>—4 A circle, globe.<BR>—5 A cypher.<BR>—6 A place resorted to or held sacred by all.<BR>—7 An object of sense.<BR>—8 An idol, deity.<BR>—9 An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ठक्कः|ठक्क
ठक्कः A merchant; Inscription, 1st cen. A. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ठक्कुरः|ठक्कुर
ठक्कुरः<BR>—1 An idol, a deity.<BR>—2 An honorific title added to the name of a distinguished person; (<i>e. g.</i><BR> गोविन्दठक्कुर the author of the Kāvyapradīpa the modern ठाकूर,<BR> टागोर etc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ठारः|ठार
ठारः Hoar-frost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ठालिनी
ठालिनी A girdle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ठिण्ठा
ठिण्ठा A gaming house; क्रुद्धः स सभ्यष्ठिण्ठायां कितवान् स्वानभाषत Ks. 92. 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डः|ड
डः<BR>—1 A sound.<BR>—2 A kind of drum or tabor.<BR>—3 Submarine fire.<BR>—4 Fear.<BR>—5 An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डा
डः + .{@-डा@}<BR>—1 A kind of female imp (डाकिनी).<BR>—2 A basket carried by means of a sling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डक्कारी
डक्कारी The lute of the Cāṇḍālas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डप्
डप् €10 Ā. (डापयते) To collect, amass, heap together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्
डम् €1 P. (डमति) To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डमः|डम
डमः A despised and mixed caste (Mar. Ḍoma).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डमरः|डमर|डमरं
डमरः<BR>—1 Riot, tumult, affray.<BR>—2 Petty warfare between villages.<BR>—3 Terrifying an enemy by shouts and gestures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डमरम्
डमरः + .{@-रम्@} Running away through fear, rout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डमरिन्
डमरिन् A sort of drum; Bhāg. 8. 10. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डमरुः|डमरु
डमरुः A sort of small drum shaped like an hour-glass and generally<BR> used by Kāpālikas; (sometime regarded as <i>n.</i> also); चण्डैर्डमरुनिर्घोषैर्घर्घरं<BR> श्रुतवान् ध्वनिम् Rāj. T. 2. 99.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: डमरुयन्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डमरुयन्त्रम्
डमरुः + -यन्त्रम् a kind of pan; Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्प्|डंप्
डम्प् = डप् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्ब्|डंब्
डम्ब् €10 U. (डम्बयति-ते)<BR>—1 To throw, send.<BR>—2 To order.<BR>—3 To behold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्बर|डंबर|डम्बरः
डम्बर^1 <i>a.</i> Famous, renowned.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्बरः|डम्बर|डंबर
डम्बरः + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 An assemblage, collection, mass; Māl. 9. 16.<BR>—2 Show, pomp.<BR>—3 Resemblance, likeness, appearance; U. 6. 17; Māl. 3. 7.<BR>—4 Pride, arrogance.<BR>—5 A great noise, loud assertion, verbosity; आविर्भावडम्बरं कृत्वा Ks. 107. 5.<BR>—6 Beauty.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: डम्बरनामन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्बरनामन्
डम्बरः + -नामन् Having a high-sounding name; Māl. 1. 4-5. (v. l.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डम्भ्|डंभ्
डम्भ् €10 U. (डम्भयति-ते) To collect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डलकम्
डलकम्, डल्लकम् A sling, basket (Mar. डोली, काबड).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डल्लकम्
डलकम्, डल्लकम् A sling, basket (Mar. डोली, काबड).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डवित्थः|डवित्थ
डवित्थः A wooden antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डाकः|डाक
डाकः An imp (attending Kālī).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डाकिनी
डाकिनी A kind of female imp, a female goblin; Bhāg. 10. 63. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डांकृतिः|डाङ्कृति
डांकृतिः, डात्कृतिः <i>f.</i> The clang of a bell, ding-dong<BR> &c.; howling; Māl. 5. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डात्कृतिः|डात्कृति
डांकृतिः, डात्कृतिः <i>f.</i> The clang of a bell, ding-dong<BR> &c.; howling; Māl. 5. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डामर|डामरः
डामर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Terrific, dreadful, awful; पर्याप्तं मयि रमणीयडामरत्वं संधत्ते<BR> गगनतलप्रयाणवेगः Māl. 5. 3.<BR>—2 Riotous, tumultuous.<BR>—3 Resembling, having the appearance (<i>i. e.</i> lovely, beautiful); रतिगलिते<BR> ललिते कुसुमानि शिखण्डक-<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">Page0751-1</a>]<BR> -डामरे (चिकुरे) Gīt. 12. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डामरः|डामर
डामर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 An uproar, rout, affray, riot.<BR>—2 The bustle and confusion of festivity or strife.<BR>—3 Any surprising sight.<BR>—4 N. of a mixed caste; Rāj. T.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0750-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डालिमः|डालिम
डालिमः = दाडिमः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डाहलः|डाहल
डाहलः (pl.) N. of a people and their country; कीर्तिः समाश्लिष्यति<BR> डाहलोर्वीम् Vikr. 1. 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डाहुकः|डाहुक
डाहुकः A gallinule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिका
डिका A very small winged insect (such as gnat); Mb. 14. 9. 29, com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिक्करी
डिक्करी A young woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिङ्गरः|डिङ्गर|डिंगर|डिंगरः
डिङ्गरः<BR>—1 A servant.<BR>—2 A knave, cheat, rogue.<BR>—3 A depraved or low man.<BR>—4 A fat man.<BR>—5 Throwing, casting forth.<BR>—6 An insult.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिण्डिकः|डिण्डिक|डिंडिक
डिण्डिकः A jesting beggar; ततः प्रविशति डिण्डिकवेषो विदूषकः Pratijñā. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिण्डिभः|डिण्डिभ
डिण्डिभः A water-snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिण्डिमः|डिण्डिम|डिंडिम|डिंडिमः
डिण्डिमः A kind of small drum (fig. also); इति घोषयतीव डिण्डिमः<BR> H. 2. 84; मुखरयस्व यशोनवडिण्डिमम् N. 4. 53; Amaru. 31; चण्डि<BR> रणितरसनारवडिण्डिममभिसर सरसमलज्जम् Gīt. 11; आर्यबालचरितप्रस्तावनाडिण्डिमः Mv. 1. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिण्डीरः|डिण्डीर|डिंडीर|डिंडीरः
डिण्डी(ण्डि)रः<BR>—1 Cuttle-fish-bone considered as the foam of the sea.<BR>—2 Foam (in general); उद्दण्डानेन डिण्डीरे पिण्डपङ्क्तिरदृश्यत Vikr. 4. 64.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: डिण्डीरमोदकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिण्डिरः|डिण्डिर|डिंडिर|डिंडिरः
डिण्डी(ण्डि)रः<BR>—1 Cuttle-fish-bone considered as the foam of the sea.<BR>—2 Foam (in general); उद्दण्डानेन डिण्डीरे पिण्डपङ्क्तिरदृश्यत Vikr. 4. 64.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: डिण्डीरमोदकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिण्डीरमोदकम्
डिण्डीरः + -मोदकम् garlic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डित्थः|डित्थ
डित्थः<BR>—1 A wooden elephant.<BR>—2 A good-looking, dark-coloured young man proficient in every science.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिप्
डिप्, -डिम्प् I. €10 Ā.<BR> To collect, heap together. ━II. €4. €6. €10. P.<BR> (डिप्यति, डिपति, डेपयति)<BR>—1 To throw, cast, send.<BR>—2 To direct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्प्
डिप्, -डिम्प् I. €10 Ā.<BR> To collect, heap together. ━II. €4. €6. €10. P.<BR> (डिप्यति, डिपति, डेपयति)<BR>—1 To throw, cast, send.<BR>—2 To direct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्
डिम् (डेमति) To hurt, injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिमः|डिम
डिमः One of the ten kinds of dramas; मायेन्द्रजालसंप्रामक्रोधोद्भ्रान्तादिचेष्टितैः ।<BR> उपरागैश्च भूयिष्ठो डिमः ख्यातोऽतिवृत्तकः ॥ S. D. 517.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्बः|डिम्ब|डिंब|डिम्बं|डिंबः
डिम्बः<BR>—1 Affray, riot; क्षणदाचारिजनप्रयुक्तडिम्बः Rām. Ch. 2. 14.<BR>—2 sound or noise occasioned by terror.<BR>—3 A young child or animal.<BR>—4 An egg.<BR>—5 A globe or ball.<BR>—6 Globular or round blossom; Māl. 9. 26.<BR>—7 A chrysalis.<BR>—8 The embryo in the first stage of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">Page0751-2</a>]<BR> its existence.<BR>—9 The spleen.<BR>—10 The uterus.<BR>—11 A humming top; N. 22. 53.<BR>—12 The body; क्रोष्टा डिम्बं व्यष्वणद्व्यस्वनच्च Śi. 18. 77.<BR>—13 An idiot; Rāj. T. 7. 1072. See डिम्भ.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: डिम्बाहवः, डिम्बयुद्धम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्बाहवः|डिम्बाहव|डिंबाहव
डिम्बः + -आहवः, -युद्धम् petty warfare, an affray without weapons, skirmish,<BR> sham-fight; Ms. 5. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्बयुद्धम्
डिम्बः + -आहवः, -युद्धम् petty warfare, an affray without weapons, skirmish,<BR> sham-fight; Ms. 5. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्बिका|डिंबिका
डिम्बिका<BR>—1 A libidinous woman.<BR>—2 A bubble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्भ्
डिम्भ् €10 Ā. see डिप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्भः|डिम्भ|डिंभ|डिंभः
डिम्भः<BR>—1 A young child; रे रे ब्राह्मणडिम्भ Māl. 5. 28/29.<BR>—2 Any young animal such as a cub; जृम्भस्व रे डिम्भ दन्तांस्ते गणयिष्यामि Ś. 7.<BR>—3 A fool, a block-head.<BR>—4 A young shoot; पलालजालैः पिहितः स्वयं हि प्रकाशमासादयतीक्षुडिम्भः N. 8. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्भा
डिम्भः + .{@-भा@} An infant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डिम्भकः|डिम्भक|डिंभक|डिंभकः
डिम्भकः (-म्भिका <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 A young child.<BR>—2 Any young animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डी
डी €1. €4. Ā. (डयते, डीयते, डिड्ये, अडयिष्ट, डयितुम्, डीन)<BR>—1 To fly, pass through the air.<BR>—2 To go. ━<i>With</i> {@प्र@} to fly up; हंसैः प्रडीनैरिव Mk. 5. 5.<BR>━{@प्रोद्@} to fly up; प्रोड्डीयेव बलाकया सरभसं सोत्कण्ठमालिङ्गितः 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डयनम्
डयनम्<BR>—1 Flight.<BR>—2 A litter carried upon menʼs shoulders, palanquin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डीन|डीनं
डीन <i>p. p.</i> [डी-क्त] Flown up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डीनम्
डीन + .{@-नम्@} The flight of a bird. The varieties of the flight of birds<BR> are said to be 101, the word prefixed to डीन showing the particular<BR> mode of flight; <i>e. g.</i> अवडीनम्, उड्डीनम्, प्रडीनम्, अभिडीनम्, विडीनम्,<BR> परिडीनम्, पराडीनम् &c. See Mb. 8. 41. 26-28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डुण्डुभः|डुण्डुभ|डुंडुभ|डुंडुभः
डुण्डुभः, -मः<BR> A kind of snake not poisonous (निर्विषा डुण्डुभाः स्मृताः);<BR> शयानं तत्र चापश्यत् डुण्डुभं वयसान्वितम् Mb. 1. 9. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डुण्डुमः|डुण्डुम
डुण्डुभः, -मः<BR> A kind of snake not poisonous (निर्विषा डुण्डुभाः स्मृताः);<BR> शयानं तत्र चापश्यत् डुण्डुभं वयसान्वितम् Mb. 1. 9. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डुण्डुलः|डुण्डुल|डुंडुलः
डुण्डुलः A small owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डुन्दुकः|डुन्दुक|डुंदुकः
डुन्दुकः A gallinule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डुलिः|डुलि
डुलिः A small turtle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डेरिका
डेरिका A musk rat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डोमः|डोम
डोमः A man of a very low caste; also डोम्ब; Ks. 13. 96 ff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

डोरः|डोर|डोरं
डोरः<BR>—1 A fillet of thread (tied round the arm).<BR>—2 The string with which a packet or parcel is tied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ड्वल्
ड्वल् €10 U. (ड्वालयति-ते) To mix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढः|ढ
ढः<BR>—1 An imitative sound.<BR>—2 A large drum.<BR>—3 A dogʼs tail.<BR>—4 A dog.<BR>—5 A serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढक्कः|ढक्क
ढक्कः A large sacred building; Rāj. T.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढक्कनम्
ढक्कनम् Shutting of a door.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढक्का
ढक्का<BR>—1 A large or double drum; न ते हुडुक्केन न सोऽपि ढक्कया न मर्दलैः<BR> सापि न तेऽपि ढक्कया N. 15. 17; ढक्कारवेण मधुरेण<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-1" target="_blank">Page0752-1</a>]<BR> दिगङ्गनानाम् Śiva B. 24. 78; नृत्यावसाने नटराजराजो ननाद ढक्कां<BR> नवपञ्चवारम् Śabdenduśekhara.<BR>—2 Coveting.<BR>—3 Disappearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0751-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढक्कारी
ढक्कारी <i>f.</i> An idol of Durgā (Tārā, Tāriṇī) in the Tāntric worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढामरा
ढामरा A goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढालम्
ढालम् A shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढालिन्
ढालिन् <i>m.</i> A warrior armed with a shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढुण्ढनम्
ढुण्ढनम् Seeking, investigating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढुण्ढिः|ढुण्ढि|ढुंढि|ढुंढिः
ढुण्ढिः An epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढोल्लरी
ढोल्लरी A kind of composition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढौलः
ढौलः A large drum or tabor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढौक्
ढौक् €1 Ā. (ढौकते, ढौकित) To go, approach; यान्तं वने रात्रिचरी<BR> डुढौके Bk. 2. 23, 14. 71, 15. 49. ━<i>Caus.</i> (ढौकयतिते)<BR>—1 To bring near, cause to approach; तन्मांसं चैव गोमायोस्तैः क्षणादाशु<BR> ढौकितम् Mb.; Bk. 17. 103.<BR>—2 To present, offer. ━<i>With</i> {@उप@} to present, offer; एकैकं पशुमुपढौकयामः Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढौकनम्
ढौकनम्<BR>—1 Offering.<BR>—2 A present, bribe; तस्य ललितकेष्वास्तां मूढौ संभोगढौकने Rāj. T. 6. 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ढौकित
ढौकित <i>a.</i> Brought near; Mb. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ण|णः
ण [There are hardly any words in real use in Sanskrit beginning<BR> with ण. Many roots which, in the Dhātupāṭha., are written with an<BR> initial ण really begin with न. They are so written to show that<BR> the न is liable to be changed to ण when preceded by prepositions,<BR> like प्र, परि, अन्तर् &c.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

णः|ण
णः<BR>—1 Knowledge.<BR>—2 Certainty, ascertainment.<BR>—3 An ornament.<BR>—4 A water or summer-house.<BR>—5 A bad man.<BR>—6 Śiva.<BR>—7 The sound of negation.<BR>—8 Gift, giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ण्यः|ण्य
ण्यः N. of an ocean in the ब्रह्मलोक; तत्तदरश्च ह वै ण्यश्चार्णवौ<BR> ब्रह्मलोके Ch. Up. 8. 5. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तः|त|तं
तः<BR>—1 A tail.<BR>—2 The tail of a jackal.<BR>—3 The breast.<BR>—4 The womb.<BR>—5 The hip or flank.<BR>—6 A warrior.<BR>—7 A thief.<BR>—8 A wicked man.<BR>—9 An outcaste, a barbarian.<BR>—10 A Buddha.<BR>—11 A jewel.<BR>—12 Nectar.<BR>—13 (In prosody) One of the eight syllabic feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ता
तः + .{@-ता, -तम्@}<BR>—1 Passing, crossing.<BR>—2 Virtue, religious merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तम्
तः + .{@-ता, -तम्@}<BR>—1 Passing, crossing.<BR>—2 Virtue, religious merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ता
तः + .{@-ता@} N. of Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तकारविपुला
तकारविपुला N. of a metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तंस्
तंस् I. €1 Ā. Ved. (तंसते)<BR>—1 To shake.<BR>—2 To pour out; ये अस्मिन् कामं सुयुजं ततस्रे Rv. 4. 23. 5.<BR>—3 To beg, request. ━II. €1 P., €10 U. (तंसति, तंसयति-ते) To decorate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्
तक् €1. €2. P. Ved. (तकति, तक्ति)<BR>—1 To fly (as an arrow or bird), rush at or upon; सर्गो न तक्त्येतशः Rv. 9. 16. 1.<BR>—2 To laugh at, deride, scoff.<BR>—3 To bear, endure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक
तक <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Censured.<BR>—2 Enduring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तकु
तकु <i>a.</i> Ved. Approaching (गामुक), rushing along; पुरुमेधश्चित्<BR> तकवे नरं दात् Rv. 9. 97. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्वन्
तक्वन् <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Rushing, darting along; श्रुतं गायत्रं तकवानस्याहम् Rv. 1. 120. 6.<BR>━<i>m.</i> A bird (especially a bird of prey); तक्वा न भूर्णिर्वना सिषक्ति Rv. 1. 66. 1.<BR>—2 A fleet horse.<BR>—3 A thief, rogue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तकिल|तकिलः
तकिल <i>a.</i> Fraudulent, crafty, rogue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तकिला
तकिल + .{@-ला@} A medicament, drug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्कन्
तक्कन् <i>n.</i> child, offspring. (तक्मन् ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्मन्
तक्मन् <i>m.</i> N. of a disease; Av. (various Kāṇḍas).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्रम्
तक्रम् Butter-milk; Ms. 8. 326; Y. 3. 37, 321; तक्रं शक्रस्य<BR> दुर्लभम् Subhāṣ.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तक्राटः, तक्रकूर्चिका, तक्रपिण्डः, तक्रसारम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्राटः|तक्राट
तक्रम् + -अटः a churning. stick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्रकूर्चिका|तक्रकूर्च्चिका
तक्रम् + -कूर्चिका Curds from milk boiled with whey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्रपिण्डः|तक्रपिण्ड
तक्रम् + -पिण्डः The substance of butter-milk mixed with ¼th of water remaining<BR> after making it pass through a piece of cloth; curds; Bhāva P. 5. 13. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्रसारम्
तक्रम् + -सारम् fresh butter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्ष्
तक्ष् €1. €5. P. (तक्षति, तक्ष्णोति, तष्ट)<BR>—1 To chop, cut off, pare, chisel, slice, split; आत्मानं तक्षति ह्येष<BR> वनं परशुना यथा Mb; निधाय तक्ष्यते यत्र काष्टे काष्टं स उद्घनः Ak.<BR>—2 To<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">Page0753-1</a>]<BR> fashion, shape, form (out of wood &c.).<BR>—3 To make, create in general.<BR>—4 To wound, hurt; अन्योन्यं च शरैः क्रुद्धौ ततक्षाते परस्परम् Mb. 6. 45. 18.<BR>—5 To invent, form in the mind.<BR>—6 To make oneʼs own, appropriate.<BR>—7 To cover.<BR>—8 To peel.<BR>—9 To make thin. ━<i>With</i> {@निस्@}<BR>—1 to slice out of.<BR>—2 to form, create.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0752-b2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्ष्
तक्ष् <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Paring, cutting &c.; also तक्ष;<BR> Bṛ. S. 87. 20, 24; also तक्षक q. v.; R. 15. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षकः|तक्षक
तक्षकः [तक्ष् ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A carpenter, wood-cutter (whether by caste or profession).<BR>—2 The chief actor in the prelude of a drama (<i>i. e.</i> the सूत्रधार).<BR>—3 N. of the architect of the gods.<BR>—4 N. of one of the principal Nāgas or serpents of the Pātāla, son<BR> of Kaśyapa and Kadru (saved at the intercession of the sage Āstika from<BR> being burnt down in the serpent-sacrifice performed by king Janamejaya,<BR> in which many others of his race were burnt down to ashes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षणम्
तक्षणम् [तक्ष् भावे-ल्युट्] Paring, cutting; दारवाणां च तक्षणम्<BR> Ms. 5. 115; Y. 1. 185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षणी
तक्षणम् + .{@-णी@} A carpenterʼs adze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तक्षन्
तक्षन् <i>m.</i> [तक्ष्-कनिन्]<BR>—1 A carpenter, wood-cutter (whether by caste or profession); तक्षा<BR> रिष्टं रुतं भिषग् Rv. 9. 112. 1; तक्षाणः पलगण्डाश्च … Śiva B. 31. 18;<BR> अताक्षा तक्षा K. P. one not a तक्षन् by caste is called<BR> तक्षन् when he acts like or follows the profession of a तक्षन<BR> (carpenter); Śi. 12. 25.<BR>—2 N. of the architect of the gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तगरः|तगर|तगरं
तगरः A kind of plant; Mb. 13. 104. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तगरम्
तगरः + .{@-रम्, तगरकम्@} A kind of perfume (Tabernaemontana coronaria)<BR> and a fragrant powder prepared from it; Nm. {@तगरिकः, -की@} A seller<BR> of Tagara powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तगरकम्
तगरः + .{@-रम्, तगरकम्@} A kind of perfume (Tabernaemontana coronaria)<BR> and a fragrant powder prepared from it; Nm. {@तगरिकः, -की@} A seller<BR> of Tagara powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तङ्क्|तंक्
तङ्क् €1 P. (तङ्कति, तङ्कित)<BR>—1 To endure, bear.<BR>—2 To laugh.<BR>—3 To live in distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तङ्कः|तङ्क|तंक|तंकः
तङ्कः [तङ्क् भावे अच्]<BR>—1 Living in distress, a miserable life.<BR>—2 Grief produced by separation from a beloved object.<BR>—3 Fear, terror.<BR>—4 A stone-cutterʼs chisel.<BR>—5 A garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तङ्कनम्
तङ्कनम् Living in distress, miserable living.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तङ्ग्|तंग्
तङ्ग् €1 P. (तङ्गति, तङ्गित)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To shake, tremble.<BR>—3 To stumble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तञ्च्|तंच्
तञ्च् I. €7 P. (तनक्ति, तञ्चित) To contract, shrink; तनच्मि<BR> व्योम विस्तृतम् Bk. 6. 38. ━II. €1 P. (तञ्चति) To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तञ्ज्|तंज्
तञ्ज् €7 P. See तञ्च्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट्
तट् I. €1 P. (तटति)<BR>—1 To groan.<BR>—2 To rise, be raised or elevated. ━II. €10 U. (ताटयति-ते) To beat, strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटः|तट|तटं
तटः [तट्-अच्]<BR>—1 A slope, declivity, precipice.<BR>—2 The sky or horizon.<BR>—3 An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटः|तट|तटं
तटः + .{@-टः, -टा, -टी, -टम्@}<BR>—1 The shore or bank, declivity, slope; शीलं शैलतटात् पततु Bh. 2. 39;<BR> प्रोत्तुङ्गाचिन्तातटी Bh. 3. 45; सिन्धोस्तटावोघ इव प्रवृद्धः<BR> Ku. 3. 6; U. 3. 8; उच्चारणात् पक्षिगणास्तटीस्तम् Śi. 4. 18.<BR>—2 A term applied to certain parts of the body which have, as it were,<BR> sloping sides; पद्मापयोधरतटीपरिरम्भलग्न Gīt. 1; नो लुप्तं<BR> सखि चन्दनं स्तनतटे Ś. Til. 7; so जघनतट, कटितट, श्रोणीतट,<BR> कुचतट, कण्ठतट, ललाटतट &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटा
तटः + .{@-टः, -टा, -टी, -टम्@}<BR>—1 The shore or bank, declivity, slope; शीलं शैलतटात् पततु Bh. 2. 39;<BR> प्रोत्तुङ्गाचिन्तातटी Bh. 3. 45; सिन्धोस्तटावोघ इव प्रवृद्धः<BR> Ku. 3. 6; U. 3. 8; उच्चारणात् पक्षिगणास्तटीस्तम् Śi. 4. 18.<BR>—2 A term applied to certain parts of the body which have, as it were,<BR> sloping sides; पद्मापयोधरतटीपरिरम्भलग्न Gīt. 1; नो लुप्तं<BR> सखि चन्दनं स्तनतटे Ś. Til. 7; so जघनतट, कटितट, श्रोणीतट,<BR> कुचतट, कण्ठतट, ललाटतट &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटी
तटः + .{@-टः, -टा, -टी, -टम्@}<BR>—1 The shore or bank, declivity, slope; शीलं शैलतटात् पततु Bh. 2. 39;<BR> प्रोत्तुङ्गाचिन्तातटी Bh. 3. 45; सिन्धोस्तटावोघ इव प्रवृद्धः<BR> Ku. 3. 6; U. 3. 8; उच्चारणात् पक्षिगणास्तटीस्तम् Śi. 4. 18.<BR>—2 A term applied to certain parts of the body which have, as it were,<BR> sloping sides; पद्मापयोधरतटीपरिरम्भलग्न Gīt. 1; नो लुप्तं<BR> सखि चन्दनं स्तनतटे Ś. Til. 7; so जघनतट, कटितट, श्रोणीतट,<BR> कुचतट, कण्ठतट, ललाटतट &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटम्
तटः + .{@-टः, -टा, -टी, -टम्@}<BR>—1 The shore or bank, declivity, slope; शीलं शैलतटात् पततु Bh. 2. 39;<BR> प्रोत्तुङ्गाचिन्तातटी Bh. 3. 45; सिन्धोस्तटावोघ इव प्रवृद्धः<BR> Ku. 3. 6; U. 3. 8; उच्चारणात् पक्षिगणास्तटीस्तम् Śi. 4. 18.<BR>—2 A term applied to certain parts of the body which have, as it were,<BR> sloping sides; पद्मापयोधरतटीपरिरम्भलग्न Gīt. 1; नो लुप्तं<BR> सखि चन्दनं स्तनतटे Ś. Til. 7; so जघनतट, कटितट, श्रोणीतट,<BR> कुचतट, कण्ठतट, ललाटतट &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटम्
तटः + .{@-टम्@} A field.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तटाघातः, तटद्रुमः, तटभू, तटस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटाघातः|तटाघात
तटः + -आघातः butting, striking against a bank or declivity; अभ्यस्यन्ति<BR> तटाघातं निर्जितैरावता गजाः Ku. 2. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटद्रुमः|तटद्रुम
तटः + -द्रुमः a tree standing on the shore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटभू
तटः + -भू the shore; आसीना तटभुवि सस्मितेन भर्त्रा Śi. 8. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटस्थ|तटस्थं|तटस्थः
तटः + -स्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 (lit.) situated on a bank or declivity.<BR>—2 (fig.) standing aloof, neutral, indifferent, alien, passive; तटस्थः<BR> स्वानर्थान् घटयति च मौनं च भजते Māl. 1. 14; तटस्थं नैराश्यात्<BR> U. 3. 13; मया तटस्थस्त्वमुपद्रुतोसि N. 3. 55. (where तटस्थ<BR> has sense 1 also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटस्थः|तटस्थ|तटस्थं
तटः + -स्थ + .({@-स्थः@}) an indifferent person, one neither a friend nor a foe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटस्थम्
तटः + -स्थ + .({@-स्थम्@}) that property or लक्षण of a thing which is distinct<BR> from its nature, and yet is the property by which it is known; <i>e. g.</i><BR> गन्धवत्त्व in the case of पृथ्वी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटकम्
तटकम् A shore or bank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटगः|तटग
तटगः = तडाग q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटाकः|तटाक|तटाकं
तटाकः, -कम्<BR> A pond (deep enough for the lotus and other aquatic plants);<BR> See तडाग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटाकम्
तटाकः, -कम्<BR> A pond (deep enough for the lotus and other aquatic plants);<BR> See तडाग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटाकिनी
तटाकिनी A large pond; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटिनी
तटिनी [तटमस्त्यस्या इनि ङीप्] A river; कदा बाराणस्याममरतटिनीरोधसि<BR> वसन् Bh. 3. 123; तटिनि चिराय विचारय विन्ध्यभुवस्तव पवित्रायाः<BR> Bv. 1. 23; तटिनि तटद्रुमपातनपातकमेकं चिरस्थायि Udb.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तटिनीपतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तटिनीपतिः|तटिनीपति
तटिनी + -पतिः the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तट्यः|तट्य
तट्यः An epithet of Śiva; Mb. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तड्
तड् €10 U. (ताडयति-ते, ताडित)<BR>—1 To beat, strike (in general), dash against; गाहन्तां महिषा निपानसलिलं<BR> शृङ्गैर्मुहुस्ताडितम् Ś. 2. 6; (नौः) ताडिता मारुतैर्यथा Rām.;<BR> R. 3. 61; Ku. 5. 24; Bh. 1. 50.<BR>—2 To beat, strike, punish by beating, hit; लालयेत्पञ्च वर्षाणि दश<BR> वर्षाणि ताडयेत् Cāṇ. 11, 12; न ताडयेत्तृणेनापि Ms. 4. 169; पादेन<BR> यस्ताड्यते Amaru. 52.<BR>—3 To strike, beat (as a drum); ताड्यमानासु भेरीषु Mb.; अताडयन्<BR> मृदङ्गांश्च Bk. 17. 7; Ve. 1. 22.<BR>—4 To play on, strike the wires of (a musical instrument); श्रोतुर्बितन्त्रीरिव<BR> ताड्यमाना Ku. 1. 45.<BR>—5 To shine.<BR>—6 To speak.<BR>—7 (In astr.) To strike against, touch, obscure or eclipse partially;<BR> Bṛ. S. 24. 34.<BR>—8 (In Math.) To multiply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडि|तडिः
तडि <i>a.</i> Beating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिः|तडि
तडि + .{@-डिः@} Striking, a stroke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताड|ताडः
ताड <i>a.</i> [तड् भावे अच्] Beating, striking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडः|ताड
ताड + .{@-डः@}<BR>—1 A blow, knock, thumb, whipping, chastisement; विपाटयिष्यत्ययमुत्तमेन<BR> सद्धर्मताडेन दुरासदेन Bu. C. 1. 80.<BR>—2 Noise, sound.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">Page0754-1</a>]<BR>—3 A sheaf.<BR>—4 A mountain.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ताडघ, ताडघः, ताडघातः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडघ|ताडघः
ताड + -घ <i>a.</i> beating with a whip or strokes of any kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडघः|ताडघ
ताड + -घः, -घातः an artificer who beats or hammers, a smith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडघातः|ताडघात
ताड + -घः, -घातः an artificer who beats or hammers, a smith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडन|ताडनं
ताडन <i>a.</i> [तड् भावे ल्युट्] Beating, whipping, striking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडनम्
ताडन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Beating, whipping, flogging; लालने बहवो दोषास्ताडने बहवो गुणाः<BR> Cāṇ. 12; अवतंसोत्पलताडनानि वा Ku. 4. 8; Ś. Til. 9.<BR>—2 (In astr.) Touching, partial eclipse; Bṛ. S. 24. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडना
ताडन + .{@-ना@} Striking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडनी
ताडन + .{@-नी@} A whip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडित
ताडित <i>p. p.</i> Struck, beaten, chastised; स्थिताः क्षणं पक्ष्मसु<BR> ताडिताधराः Ku. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताडुल|ताडुलः
ताडुल <i>a.</i> Beating, striking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताड्यमान|ताड्यमानः
ताड्यमान <i>a.</i> Being beaten or struck; श्रोतुर्वितन्त्रीरिव ताड्यमाना<BR> Ku. 1. 45; ताड्यमानः किं न ब्रूयात् Mu. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताड्यमानः|ताड्यमान
ताड्यमान + .{@-नः@} A musical instrument struck with a stick &c. (as a drum).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडगः|तडग
तडगः See तडाग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाकः|तडाक
तडाकः A pond, pool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाका
तडाकः + .{@-का@}<BR>—1 A blow.<BR>—2 A bank, shore.<BR>—3 Splendour, lustre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडागः|तडाग|तडागं
तडागः, -गम्<BR>—1 A pond, deep pool, tank; स्फुटकमलोदरखेलितखञ्जनयुगमिव शरदि<BR> तडागम् Gīt. 11; Ms. 4. 203; Y. 3. 237.<BR>—2 A tank.<BR>—3 A trap for catching deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडागम्
तडागः, -गम्<BR>—1 A pond, deep pool, tank; स्फुटकमलोदरखेलितखञ्जनयुगमिव शरदि<BR> तडागम् Gīt. 11; Ms. 4. 203; Y. 3. 237.<BR>—2 A tank.<BR>—3 A trap for catching deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडाघातः|तडाघात
