तडित्
तडित् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Lightning; घनं घनान्ते तडितां गुणैरिव Śi. 1. 7; Me. 77; R. 6. 65;<BR> तडितो मानुषतां गता इव Śāhendra. 2. 71.<BR>—2 Killing, injury. ━<i>ind.</i> Closely, near.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तडिद्गर्भः, तडिल्लता, तडिल्लेखा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिद्गर्भः|तडिद्गर्भ
तडित् + -गर्भः a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिल्लता
तडित् + -लता forked lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिल्लेखा
तडित् + -लेखा a streak of lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडित्वत्|तडित्वन्त्
तडित्वत् <i>a.</i> Containing or having lightning; अवरोहति शैलाग्रं<BR> तडित्वानिव तोयदः V. 1. 14; समुदितं निचयेन तडित्वतीम् Ki. 5. 4.<BR>━<i>m.</i> A cloud; Śi. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तडिन्मय
तडिन्मय <i>a.</i> Consisting of lightning; Ku. 5. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्ड्|तंड्
तण्ड् €1 Ā. (तण्डते, तण्डित) To strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डकः|तण्डक|तंडक|तंडकः
तण्डकः [तण्ड्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A juggler, a cheat.<BR>—2 Froth, foam.<BR>—3 A wag-tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डकः|तण्डक|तंडक|तंडकः
तण्डकः + .{@-कः, -कम्@}<BR>—1 Complete performance or preparation.<BR>—2 Decoration.<BR>—3 The upright post of a house.<BR>—4 A composition abounding in compounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डकम्
तण्डकः + .{@-कः, -कम्@}<BR>—1 Complete performance or preparation.<BR>—2 Decoration.<BR>—3 The upright post of a house.<BR>—4 A composition abounding in compounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डा
तण्डा Killing, striking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुरीणः|तण्डुरीण|तंडुरीणः
तण्डुरीणः<BR>—1 A barbarian.<BR>—2 A fool, blockhead.<BR>—3 Water in which rice has been soaked.<BR>—4 A worm, insect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलः|तण्डुल|तंडुल|तंडुलः
तण्डुलः [तण्ड् उलच्] Grain after threshing, unhusking and winnowing;<BR> (especially rice); (शस्य, धान्य, तण्डुल and अन्न are thus distinguished<BR> from one another━ शस्यं क्षेत्रगतं प्रोक्तं सतुषं धान्यमुच्यते ।<BR> निस्तुषस्तण्डुलः प्रोक्तः स्विन्नमन्नमुदाहृतम् ॥).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तण्डुलाम्बु, तण्डुलोत्थम्, तण्डुलोदकम्, तण्डुलौघः, तण्डुलकणः, तण्डुलकण्डनम्, तण्डुलफला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलाम्बु
तण्डुलः + -अम्बु <i>n.</i> gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तण्डुलोत्थम्
