तर, तरण, तरणि, तरण्ड, तरि-री, तरीष &c. See under तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरि|तरिः
तर, तरण, तरणि, तरण्ड, तरि-री, तरीष &c. See under तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरी
तर, तरण, तरणि, तरण्ड, तरि-री, तरीष &c. See under तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरीष|तरीषः
तर, तरण, तरणि, तरण्ड, तरि-री, तरीष &c. See under तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरक्षः|तरक्ष
तरक्षः, -क्षुः<BR>—1 A hyena; तरक्षुस्तु मृगादनः … … तरक्षुकुलसेवितान् Śiva B. 20. 44.<BR>—2 A tiger; Mb. 13. 131. 10. (See com. of Nīlakaṇṭha.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरक्षुः|तरक्षु
तरक्षः, -क्षुः<BR>—1 A hyena; तरक्षुस्तु मृगादनः … … तरक्षुकुलसेवितान् Śiva B. 20. 44.<BR>—2 A tiger; Mb. 13. 131. 10. (See com. of Nīlakaṇṭha.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरङ्गः|तरङ्ग|तरंग|तरंगः
तरङ्गः [तॄ-अङ्गच्]<BR>—1 A wave; U. 3. 47; Bh. 1. 81; R. 13. 63; Ś. 3. 6.<BR>—2 A section or part of a work (as of the कथासरित्सागर).<BR>—3 A leap, jump, gallop, jumping motion (as of a horse).<BR>—4 Cloth or clothes.<BR>—5 Waving, moving to and fro.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरङ्गमालिन्, तरङ्गवती<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरङ्गमालिन्
तरङ्गः + -मालिन् <i>m.</i> the sea; P. R. 7. 9-10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरङ्गवती
तरङ्गः + -वती a river; कथमपि विनिपत्य संचरन्तः क्षतजतरङ्गवतीषु<BR> चिह्नमत्स्याः Vikr. 6. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरङ्गित|तरंगित
तरङ्गित <i>a.</i> [तरङ्गः संजातोऽस्य, तार˚ इतच्]<BR>—1 Wavy, tossing with waves; पीडा˚ Māl. 9. 11,<BR>—2 Overflowing.<BR>—3 Tremulous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरङ्गितम्
तरङ्गित + .{@-तम्@} Waving; अपाङ्गतरङ्गितानि बाणाः Gīt. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरङ्गिन्|तरंगिन्
तरङ्गिन् <i>a.</i> Wavy, undulating, unsteady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरङ्गिणी|तरंगिणी
तरङ्गिन् + .{@-णी@} A river; as in राजतरङ्गिणी; तरङ्गिणी वेणिरिवायता भुवः<BR> Śi. ˚नाथः, भर्ता the sea; Vikr. 13. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरन्तः|तरन्त|तरंत|तरंतः
तरन्तः [तॄ-झच्]<BR>—1 The ocean.<BR>—2 A hard shower.<BR>—3 A frog.<BR>—4 A demon or Rākṣasa. —5 A devotee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरन्ती
तरन्तः + .{@-ती@} A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरल|तरलः
तरल <i>a.</i> [तॄ-अलच्]<BR>—1 Trembling, waving, shaking, tremulous; तारापतिस्तरलविद्युदिवाभ्रवृन्दम्<BR> R. 13. 76; घन इव तरलबलाके Gīt. 5; Śi. 10. 40; U. 5. 11; Ś. 1. 25.<BR>—2 Fickle, unsteady, transient; वैरायितारस्तरलाः स्वयं मत्सरिणः<BR> परम् Śi. 2. 115; Amaru. 30.<BR>—3 Splendid, sparkling, glittering; तारावितानतरला इव यामवत्यः Ki. 8. 56.<BR>—4 Liquid.<BR>—5 Libidinous, wanton.<BR>—6 Hollow.<BR>—7 Extensive, wide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलः|तरल
तरल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 The central gem of a necklace; मुक्तामयोऽप्यतरलमध्यः Vās. 35;<BR> or हारांस्तारांस्तरलगुटिकान् (Malli. considers this as an interpolation<BR> in Meghadūta).<BR>—2 A necklace.<BR>—3 A level surface.<BR>—4 Bottom, depth.<BR>—5 A diamond.<BR>—6 Iron.<BR>—7 Thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरला
तरल + .{@-ला@}<BR>—1 Rice-gruel.<BR>—2 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—3 A bee.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरलनयना, तरललोचना, तरलप्रतिबन्धम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलनयना
तरल + -नयना, -लोचना a woman with rolling or tremulous eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरललोचना
तरल + -नयना, -लोचना a woman with rolling or tremulous eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलप्रतिबन्धम्
तरल + -प्रतिबन्धम् a variety of necklace with a brilliant pearl<BR> in the centre; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलता
तरलता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 unsteady activity; tremulousness.<BR>—2 Sparkle, glitter; कार्कश्यं स्तनयोर्दृशोस्तरलता Pt. 1. 190.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलत्वम्
तरलता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 unsteady activity; tremulousness.<BR>—2 Sparkle, glitter; कार्कश्यं स्तनयोर्दृशोस्तरलता Pt. 1. 190.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलयति
तरलयति Den. P. To cause to shake, to wave, move to and fro; Amaru. 87;<BR> चूडामण्डलबन्धनं तरलयत्याकूतजो वेपथुः U. 5. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलायते
तरलायते Den. Ā. To tremble, shake, move to and fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलायितः|तरलायित
तरलायितः A large wave, surf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलायितः|तरलायित
तरलायितः + .{@-तः, -तम्@} Fickleness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलायितम्
तरलायितः + .{@-तः, -तम्@} Fickleness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरलित|तरलितं
तरलित <i>a.</i> Shaking, tremulous, undulating; ˚तुङ्गतरङ्ग<BR> Gīt. 11; ˚हारा 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरवारिः|तरवारि
तरवारिः A sword; परितः शिथिलोदग्रतरवारितडिल्लताः Śiva B. 22. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरस्
तरस् <i>a.</i> Ved. [तॄ-करणादौ असुन्] Quick, energetic. ━<i>n.</i><BR>—1 Speed, velocity.<BR>—2 Vigour, strength, energy; कैलासनाथं तरसा जिगीषुः R. 5. 28, 11. 77;<BR> Śi. 9. 72.<BR>—3 A bank, a place of crossing.<BR>—4 A float, raft; बृहस्पतिस्तर आपश्च गृध्रः Rv. 1. 190. 7.<BR>—5 A monkey.<BR>—6 A disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरसम्
तरसम् Meat, flesh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरसानः|तरसान
तरसानः A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरस्वत्|तरस्वन्त्
तरस्वत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Quick, swift.<BR>—2 Sick.<BR>—3 Energetic, strong, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरस्विन्
तरस्विन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Swift, quick.<BR>—2 Strong, powerful, courageous; mighty; ततः सुतुमुलं युद्धं गन्धर्वाणां<BR> तरस्विनाम् (बभूव) Mb. 3. 244. 22; निर्जितेषु तरसा तरस्विनां<BR> शत्रुषु प्रणतिरेव कीर्तये R. 11. 89, 16. 77. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A courier, an express.<BR>—2 A hero.<BR>—3 Air, wind.<BR>—4 An epithet of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरान्धुः|तरान्धु|तरांधु|तरांधुः
तरान्धुः, तरालुः A large flat-bottomed boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरालुः|तरालु
तरान्धुः, तरालुः A large flat-bottomed boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिः|तरि
तरिः, तरीषः &c. See under तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरीषः|तरीष
तरिः, तरीषः &c. See under तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिता
तरिता<BR>—1 The fore-finger.<BR>—2 Garlic, or hemp. —3 A form of Durgā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरिताधरणयन्त्रम्, तरितापूजायन्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिताधरणयन्त्रम्
तरिता + -धरणयन्त्रम्, -पूजायन्त्रम्<BR>. N. of a mystical diagram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरितापूजायन्त्रम्
तरिता + -धरणयन्त्रम्, -पूजायन्त्रम्<BR>. N. of a mystical diagram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरु|तरुः
तरु <i>a.</i> [तॄ-उन् Uṇ. 1. 7] Protecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुः|तरु
तरु + .{@-रुः@}<BR>—1 A tree; नवसंरोहणशिथिलस्तरुरिव सुकरः समुद्धर्तुम् M. 1. 8.<BR>—2 Ved. Velocity.<BR>—3 A wooden ladle for taking up Soma.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरुकूणिः, तरुकोटरम्, तरुखण्डः, तरुखण्डम्, तरुषण्डः, तरुषण्डम्, तरुजीवनम्, तरुतलम्, तरुतूलिका, तरुधूलिका, तरुनखः, तरुमण्डपः, तरुमृगः, तरुराग, तरुराजः, तरुराजन्, तरुरुहा, तरुवल्ली, तरुविलासिनी, तरुशायिन्, तरुसारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुकूणिः|तरुकूणि
