तरुकोटरम्
तरु + -कोटरम् the hollow of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुखण्डः|तरुखण्ड|तरुखंड
तरु + -खण्डः, -खण्डम्, -षण्डः, -षण्डम् an assemblage or clump of trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुखण्डम्
तरु + -खण्डः, -खण्डम्, -षण्डः, -षण्डम् an assemblage or clump of trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुषण्डः|तरुषण्ड|तरुषंड
तरु + -खण्डः, -खण्डम्, -षण्डः, -षण्डम् an assemblage or clump of trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुषण्डम्
तरु + -खण्डः, -खण्डम्, -षण्डः, -षण्डम् an assemblage or clump of trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुजीवनम्
तरु + -जीवनम् the root of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुतलम्
तरु + -तलम् the ground about the foot of a tree, foot of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुतूलिका
तरु + -तूलिका, -धूलिका A bat, flying fox (because it suspends itself<BR> from branches).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुधूलिका
तरु + -तूलिका, -धूलिका A bat, flying fox (because it suspends itself<BR> from branches).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुनखः|तरुनख
तरु + -नखः a thorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुमण्डपः|तरुमण्डप
तरु + -मण्डपः a bower; अस्तीह प्रमदोद्याने तरुमण्डपमध्यगः ।<BR> दृष्टप्रभावो वरदो देवदेवो विनायकः ॥ Ks. 20. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुमृगः|तरुमृग
तरु + -मृगः a monkey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुराग|तरुरागं
तरु + -राग<BR>—1 a bud or blossom.<BR>—2 a young shoot, sprout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुराजः|तरुराज
तरु + -राजः the Tāla tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुराजन्
तरु + -राजन् <i>m.</i> ‘the king of trees’<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">Page0764-1</a>]<BR>, N. of the tree Pārijātaka; also -˚वरः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुरुहा
तरु + -रुहा a parasitical plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुवल्ली
तरु + -वल्ली a creeper; Ks. 53. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुविलासिनी
तरु + -विलासिनी the Navamallikā creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुशायिन्
तरु + -शायिन् <i>m.</i> a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुसारः|तरुसार
तरु + -सारः camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुश
तरुश <i>a.</i> Full of, or abounding in trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुटः|तरुट
तरुटः The root of the lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुण|तरुणं|तरुणः
तरुण <i>a.</i> [तॄ-उनन् Uṇ. 3. 54]<BR>—1 Young, youthful, juvenile (as a man).<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Young, newly-born or produced, tender, soft; वितीर्णे सर्वस्वे<BR> तरुणकरुणापूर्णहृदयाः Bh. 3. 49.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Newly risen, not high in the sky (as the sun); वासो वसाना<BR> तरुणार्करागम् Ku. 3. 54.<BR>—3 New, fresh; तरुणं दधि Cāṇ. 64; तरुणं सर्षपशाकं नवौदनं<BR> पिच्छिलानि च दधीनि । अल्पव्ययेन सुन्दरि ग्राम्यजनो मिष्टमश्नाति ॥ Chand. M. 1.<BR>—4 Lively, vivid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणः|तरुण|तरुणं
तरुण + .{@-णः@} A young man, youth; गतवयसामपि पुंसां येषामर्था भवन्ति<BR> ते तरुणाः Pt. 1. 11; Bv. 2. 62.<BR>—2 The castor-oil plant.<BR>—3 Large cumin-seed (Mar. जिरें).<BR>—4 Newly produced liquor; तरुणस्तु नवे यूनि मद्ये प्रथम उत्कटे Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणी
तरुण + .{@-णी@}<BR>—1 A young or youthful woman; वृद्धस्य तरुणी विषम् Cāṇ. 78.<BR>—2 N. of some plants such as Aloe Perfoliata (Mar. कोरफड), Rosa<BR> Glandulifera (Mar. पांढरा गुलाब) etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणम्
तरुण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Cartilage.<BR>—2 A sprout.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरुणास्थि, तरुणज्वरः, तरुणदधि, तरुणपीतिका<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणास्थि
तरुण + -अस्थि <i>n.</i> cartilage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणज्वरः|तरुणज्वर
तरुण + -ज्वरः fever lasting for a week.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणदधि
तरुण + -दधि <i>n.</i> coagulated milk five days old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणपीतिका
तरुण + -पीतिका red arsenic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणकम्
तरुणकम् A sprout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणयति
तरुणयति Den. P. To heighten, spread; प्रारम्भेऽपि त्रियामा तरुणयति<BR> निजं नीलिमानं वनेषु Māl. 5. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणायते
तरुणायते Den. Ā. To remain young or fresh; तृष्णैका तरुणायते Pt. 5. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुणिमन्
तरुणिमन् <i>m.</i> Youth, juvenility; अपक्रान्ते बाल्ये तरुणिमनि<BR> चागन्तुमनसि P. R. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुता
तरुता Freshness, vigour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुतृ
तरुतृ Ved.<BR>—1 Overcoming, conquering.<BR>—2 Impelling, driving onward.<BR>—3 Protecting (तारक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुत्र
तरुत्र <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Carrying across.<BR>—2 Conquering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुषः|तरुष
तरुषः <i>m.^1</i> A conqueror.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुषा
तरुषः + .{@-षा@} Victory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुष्यति
तरुष्यति Den. P. To attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरुस्
तरुस् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Battle.<BR>—2 Superiority.<BR>—3 Overcoming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्क्
तर्क् €10 U. (तर्कयति-ते, तर्कित)<BR>—1 To suppose, guess, suspect, believe, conjecture, infer; त्वं तावत्कतमां<BR> तर्कयसि Ś. 6; Me. 96.<BR>—2 To reason, speculate about, reflect. दृष्ट्वा तत्सौकरं रूपं तर्कयामास<BR> चित्रधा Bhāg. 3. 13. 20.<BR>—3 To consider or regard as (with two acc.)<BR>—4 To think of, intend, mean, have in view; (पातुं) त्वं चेदच्छस्फटिकविशदं<BR> तर्कयेस्तिर्यगम्भः Me. 53.<BR>—5 To ascertain; Rām. 3.<BR>—6 To shine.<BR>—7 To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कः|तर्क
तर्कः (तर्क्-भावे अच्)<BR>—1 Supposition, conjecture, guess; प्रसन्नस्ते तर्कः V. 2.<BR>—2 Reasoning, speculation, discussion, abstract reasoning; कुतः पुनरस्मिन्नवधारिते<BR> आगमार्थे तर्कनिमित्तस्याक्षेपस्यावकाशः; इदानीं तर्कनिमित्त आक्षेपः परिह्रियते<BR> Ś. B.; तर्कोऽप्रतिष्ठः स्मृतयो विभिन्नाः Mb.; Ms. 12. 106.<BR>—3 Doubt.<BR>—4 Logic, the science of logic; यत्काव्यं मधुवर्षि धर्षितपरास्तर्केषु<BR> यस्योक्तयः N. 22. 155; तर्कशास्त्रम्, तर्कदीपिका<BR>—5 (In logic) Reduction to absurdity, a conclusion opposed to the premises,<BR> a <i>reductio ad absurdum</i>.<BR>—6 A system of doctrine founded on pure reasoning or free thinking, a<BR> philosophical system (particularly one of the six principal Darṣanas q. v.).<BR>—7 A name for the number ‘six’.<BR>—8 Supplying an ellipsis.<BR>—9 Cause, motive.<BR>—10 Wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्का
तर्कः + .{@-र्का@} Speculation, reasoning.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तर्काटः, तर्काभासः, तर्ककौमुदी, तर्कमुद्रा, तर्कविद्या, तर्कशास्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्काटः|तर्काट
तर्कः + -अटः a beggar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्काभासः|तर्काभास
तर्कः + -आभासः fallacious reasoning, fallacy in drawing conclusions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्ककौमुदी
तर्कः + -कौमुदी N. of a Vaiśeṣika-work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कमुद्रा
तर्कः + -मुद्रा a particular position of the hand; कृत्वोरौ दक्षिणे सव्यं<BR> पादपद्मं च जानुनि । बाहुप्रकोष्ठेऽक्षमालामासीनं तर्कमुद्रया ॥ Bhāg. 4. 6. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कविद्या
तर्कः + -विद्या logic; philosophical treatise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कशास्त्रम्
तर्कः + -शास्त्रम्<BR>—1 logic.<BR>—2 a philosophical work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कक|तर्ककः
तर्कक <i>a.</i> [तर्क्-ण्वुल्] Inquiring, inquisitive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्ककः|तर्कक
तर्कक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A suitor, an inquirer, a petitioner.<BR>—2 A logician.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कणम्
तर्कणम् Reasoning, speculation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कित
तर्कित <i>p. p.</i> Doubted, guessed, discussed, investigated, examined<BR> &c.; see तर्क्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कितम्
तर्कित + .{@-तम्@} A supposition, conjecture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्किन्
तर्किन् <i>a.</i> [तर्क्-णिनि]<BR>—1 Guessing.<BR>—2 Reasoning, versed in speculation; Ms. 12. 111. ━<i>m.</i> A logician, reasoner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुकः|तर्कुक
तर्कुकः A suppliant, petitioner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुः|तर्कु
तर्कुः <i>m., f.</i> A spindle, an iron pin upon which cotton is first<BR> drawn out; तर्कुः कर्तनसाधनम्.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तर्कुपिण्डः, तर्कुपीठी, तर्कुपीठः, तर्कुपाठी, तर्कुलासकः, तर्कुशाणः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुपिण्डः|तर्कुपिण्ड|तर्कुपिंड
तर्कुः + -पिण्डः, -पीठी, -पीठः, -पाठी a ball at the lower end of a spindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुपीठी
तर्कुः + -पिण्डः, -पीठी, -पीठः, -पाठी a ball at the lower end of a spindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुपीठः|तर्कुपीठ
तर्कुः + -पिण्डः, -पीठी, -पीठः, -पाठी a ball at the lower end of a spindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुपाठी
तर्कुः + -पिण्डः, -पीठी, -पीठः, -पाठी a ball at the lower end of a spindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुलासकः|तर्कुलासक
तर्कुः + -लासकः a concave shell or saucer serving to hold the lower end of a spindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुशाणः|तर्कुशाण
तर्कुः + -शाणः a Whetstone for sharpening spindles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्कुटम्
तर्कुटम् (-टी)<BR> Cutting; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्क्षुः|तर्क्षु
तर्क्षुः A hyena.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्क्ष्यः|तर्क्ष्य
तर्क्ष्यः Nitre, salt-petre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्ज्
तर्ज् €1 P., €10 Ā. (often P. also) (तर्जति, तर्जयति-ते, तर्जित)<BR>—1 To threaten, menace, terrify; सखीमङ्गुल्या तर्जयति Ś. 1; अहिताननिलोद्धृतैस्तर्जयन्निव<BR> केतुभिः R. 4. 28, 11. 78, 12. 41; Bk. 14. 80.<BR>—2 To scold, revile, censure, blame; न जिह्रयांचकाराऽथ सीतामभ्यर्थ्य<BR> तर्जितः Bk. 6. 3, 8. 101, 17. 103.<BR>—3 To mock, deride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्जनम्
तर्जनम्, -ना<BR> [तर्ज्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Threatening, frightening.<BR>—2 Censuring; अङ्गुलीकिसलयाग्रतर्जनम् R. 19. 17; Ku. 6. 45.<BR>—3 Pointing at (in ridicule or contempt.)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">Page0765-1</a>]<BR>—4 Putting to shame, excelling, surpassing.<BR>—5 Anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्जना
तर्जनम्, -ना<BR> [तर्ज्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Threatening, frightening.<BR>—2 Censuring; अङ्गुलीकिसलयाग्रतर्जनम् R. 19. 17; Ku. 6. 45.<BR>—3 Pointing at (in ridicule or contempt.)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">Page0765-1</a>]<BR>—4 Putting to shame, excelling, surpassing.<BR>—5 Anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्जनी|तर्ज्जनी
तर्जनम्, -ना + .{@-नी@} The fore-finger; विलोक्य भ्रामयामास यमाज्ञामिव तर्जनीम् Ks. 17. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0764-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्जित|तर्ज्जित
तर्जित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Threatened; तर्जितः परशुधारया मम R. 11. 78.<BR>—2 Blamed; scolded; तर्जितः स भयादेव शबरस्तं व्यजिज्ञपत् Rāj. T. 3. 34.<BR>—3 Disgraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्जितम्
तर्जित + .{@-तम्@} Threatening, a menace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्णः|तर्ण
तर्णः, तर्णकः A calf; अभ्याजतोऽभ्यागततूर्णतर्णकान्<BR> Śi. 12. 41; Rāj. T. 5. 432.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्णकः|तर्णक
तर्णः, तर्णकः A calf; अभ्याजतोऽभ्यागततूर्णतर्णकान्<BR> Śi. 12. 41; Rāj. T. 5. 432.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्णिः|तार्णि
तार्णिः<BR>—1 A raft.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्द्
तर्द् €1 P. (तर्दति)<BR>—1 To injure, hurt.<BR>—2 To kill, cut through; see तृद् also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्दु
तर्दु, -र्दू <i>f.</i><BR> A wooden ladle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्दू
तर्दु, -र्दू <i>f.</i><BR> A wooden ladle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्दन
तर्दन, तर्द्मन् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 A hole, an opening; शं युगस्य तर्द्म Av. 14. 1. 40.<BR>—2 Sewing with stitches.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्द्मन्
तर्दन, तर्द्मन् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 A hole, an opening; शं युगस्य तर्द्म Av. 14. 1. 40.<BR>—2 Sewing with stitches.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पणम्
तर्पणम् See under तृप्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्फितृ
तर्फितृ <i>a.</i> A killer, an injurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्ब्
तर्ब् €1 P. (तर्बति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्बटः|तर्बट|तर्ब्बट
तर्बटः A year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्मन्|तर्म्मन्
तर्मन् <i>n.</i> The top of the sacrificial post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षः|तर्ष
तर्षः, तर्षणम् &c. See under तृष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षणम्
तर्षः, तर्षणम् &c. See under तृष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्ह्
तर्ह् see तर्द्; रथाऽश्वांश्च रिपोस्ततर्ह शाखिना Bk. 14. 108.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्हणम्
तर्हणम् Ved. Injuring, crushing; सं पृथिव्या अघशंसाय तर्हणम् Rv. 7. 104. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्हि
तर्हि <i>ind.</i> [तद्-र्हिल्]<BR>—1 At that time, then.<BR>—2 In that case; यदा━तर्हि ‘when━then’; यदि━तर्हि ‘if━ ▪ then’<BR>; कथं तर्हि ‘how then’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तल्
तल् €1 P., €10 U. (तलति, तालयति-ते)<BR>—1 To be full or complete.<BR>—2 To fix, found, establish.<BR>—3 To be fixed.<BR>—4 To accomplish a vow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलः|तल|तलं
तलः, -लम्<BR> [तल्-अच्]<BR>—1 A surface; भुवस्तलमिव व्योम कुर्वन् व्योमेव भूतलम् R. 4. 29;<BR> sometimes used at the end of comp. without much alteration of meaning;<BR> महीतलम् ‘surface of the earth’ <i>i. e.</i> earth itself; शुद्धे तु<BR> दर्पणतले सुलभावकाशा Ś. 7. 32; नभस्तलम् &c.<BR>—2 The palm of the hand; R. 6. 18.<BR>—3 The sole of the foot; Bhāg. 10. 36. 8.<BR>—4 The fore-arm.<BR>—5 A slap with the hand.<BR>—6 Lowness, inferiority of position.<BR>—7 A lower part, part underneath, base, foot, bottom; रेवारोधसि वेतसीतरुतले<BR> चेतः समुत्कण्ठते K. P. 1.<BR>—8 (Hence) The ground under a tree or any other object, shelter afforded<BR> by anything; फणी मयूरस्य तले निषीदति Ṛs. 1. 13.<BR>—9 A hole, pit.<BR>—10 A span.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलम्
तलः, -लम्<BR> [तल्-अच्]<BR>—1 A surface; भुवस्तलमिव व्योम कुर्वन् व्योमेव भूतलम् R. 4. 29;<BR> sometimes used at the end of comp. without much alteration of meaning;<BR> महीतलम् ‘surface of the earth’ <i>i. e.</i> earth itself; शुद्धे तु<BR> दर्पणतले सुलभावकाशा Ś. 7. 32; नभस्तलम् &c.<BR>—2 The palm of the hand; R. 6. 18.<BR>—3 The sole of the foot; Bhāg. 10. 36. 8.<BR>—4 The fore-arm.<BR>—5 A slap with the hand.<BR>—6 Lowness, inferiority of position.<BR>—7 A lower part, part underneath, base, foot, bottom; रेवारोधसि वेतसीतरुतले<BR> चेतः समुत्कण्ठते K. P. 1.<BR>—8 (Hence) The ground under a tree or any other object, shelter afforded<BR> by anything; फणी मयूरस्य तले निषीदति Ṛs. 1. 13.<BR>—9 A hole, pit.<BR>—10 A span.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलः|तल|तलं
तलः, -लम् + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 The hilt of a sword.<BR>—2 The palmyra tree.<BR>—3 N. of Śiva.<BR>—4 Pressing the strings of a lute with the left hand; तत्र तत्र महानादैरुत्कृष्टतलनादितैः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">Page0765-2</a>]<BR> Mb. 1. 221. 60.<BR>—5 A division of hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलम्
तलः, -लम् + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 A pond.<BR>—2 A forest, wood; भस्मप्रस्तरशायी च भूमिशय्या च तलेषु च Mb. 12. 303. 11.<BR>—3 Cause, origin, motive.<BR>—4 A leathern fence worn round the left arm (तला also in this sense);<BR> उद्यतैरायुधैश्चित्रास्तलबद्धाः कलापिनः Mb. 6. 16. 14.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तलाङ्गुलिः, तलातलम्, तलेक्षणः, तलोदर, तलोदरी, तलोदा, तलघातः, तलतालः, तलत्रम्, तलत्राणम्, तलवारणम्, तलप्रहारः, तलबद्ध, तलयुद्धम्, तललोकः, तलसारकम्, तलसारणम्, तलसारिका, तलहृदयम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलाङ्गुलिः|तलाङ्गुलि
तलः + -अङ्गुलिः <i>f.</i> a toe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलातलम्
तलः + -अतलम् the fourth of the seven divisions of hell; Bhāg. 2. 5. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलेक्षणः|तलेक्षण
तलः + -ईक्षणः a hog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलोदर
तलः + -उदर <i>a.</i> having a protuberant belly, pot-bellied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलोदरी
तलः + -उदरी <i>f.</i> A wife; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलोदा
तलः + -उदा a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलघातः|तलघात
तलः + -घातः a slap with the palm of the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलतालः|तलताल
तलः + -तालः<BR>—1 a kind of musical instrument.<BR>—2 clapping of the hands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलत्रम्
तलः + -त्रम्, -त्राणम्, -वारणम् a leathern glove of an archer; शरासनज्यातलवारणध्वनिः<BR> Ki. 14. 29; पाणयः सतलत्राश्च … Śiva B. 12. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तलत्राणम्
तलः + -त्रम्, -त्राणम्, -वारणम् a leathern glove of an archer; शरासनज्यातलवारणध्वनिः<BR> Ki. 14. 29; पाणयः सतलत्राश्च … Śiva B. 12. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

