ताम्र + -आभम् red sandal (रक्तचन्दन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रोपजीविन्
ताम्र + -उपजीविन् <i>m.</i> a coppersmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रौष्ठः|ताम्रौष्ठ
ताम्र + -ओष्ठः (forming ताम्रोष्ठ or ताम्रौष्ठ) a red or cherry lip; Ku. 1. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रकारः|ताम्रकार
ताम्र + -कारः, -कुट्टः a brazier, coppersmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रकुट्टः|ताम्रकुट्ट
ताम्र + -कारः, -कुट्टः a brazier, coppersmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रकृमिः|ताम्रकृमि
ताम्र + -कृमिः<BR>—1 a kind of red insect (इन्द्रगोप).<BR>—2 the lady bird.<BR>—3 cochineal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रगर्भम्
ताम्र + -गर्भम् sulphate of copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रचूडः|ताम्रचूड
ताम्र + -चूडः a cock; संध्याचूडैरनिबिडतमस्ताम्रचूडैरुडूनि । प्रासूयन्त<BR> स्फुटमधिवियद्भाण्डमण्डानि यानि ॥ Rām. Ch. 6. 96, 7. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रचूडकः|ताम्रचूडक
