ताम्रधातुः|ताम्रधातु
ताम्र + -धातुः<BR>—1 red chalk.<BR>—2 Copper; Rām. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रपट्टः|ताम्रपट्ट|ताम्रपट्टं
ताम्र + -पट्टः, -पत्रम् a copper-plate on which grants of land were frequently<BR> inscribed; पटे वा ताम्रपट्टे वा स्वमुद्रोपरिचिह्नितम् । अभिलेख्यात्मनो<BR> वंश्यानात्मानं च महीपतिः ॥ Y. 1. 319.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रपत्रम्
ताम्र + -पट्टः, -पत्रम् a copper-plate on which grants of land were frequently<BR> inscribed; पटे वा ताम्रपट्टे वा स्वमुद्रोपरिचिह्नितम् । अभिलेख्यात्मनो<BR> वंश्यानात्मानं च महीपतिः ॥ Y. 1. 319.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रपर्णी
ताम्र + -पर्णी N. of a river rising in Malaya, celebrated for its pearls;<BR> R. 4. 50. Hence ताम्रपर्णिक (= obtained in the same river); Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रपलः
ताम्र + -पलः Alangium Hexapetalum; दद्यात्ताम्रपलं वापि अभावे सर्वकर्मणः<BR> Yuktikalpataru.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रपल्लवः|ताम्रपल्लव
ताम्र + -पल्लवः the Aśoka<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">Page0769-1</a>]<BR> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रपाकिन्
ताम्र + -पाकिन् Thespesia Populneoides (Mar. लाखी-पारासा पिंपळ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रपुष्पः|ताम्रपुष्प
ताम्र + -पुष्पः Kaempferia Rotunda (Mar. बाहवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रपुष्पी
ताम्र + -पुष्पी Bignonia Suaveolens (Mar. धायरी, भुईपाडळ) {@-फलकम्@}<BR> a copper-plate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रमुख|ताम्रमुखः
ताम्र + -मुख <i>a.</i> copper-faced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रमुखः|ताम्रमुख
ताम्र + -मुख + .({@-खः@})<BR>—1 a Frank or European;<BR>—2 the Moghals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रवदनः
