ताम्रवर्णी
ताम्र + -वर्णी the blossom of sesamum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रलिप्तः|ताम्रलिप्त
ताम्र + -लिप्तः N. of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रलिप्ताः
ताम्र + -लिप्ताः (pl.) its people or rulers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रवृक्षः|ताम्रवृक्ष
ताम्र + -वृक्षः a species of sandal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रशिखिन्
ताम्र + -शिखिन् <i>m.</i> a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रसारकः|ताम्रसारक|ताम्रसारकं
ताम्र + -सारकः a sort of Khadira.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रसारकम्
ताम्र + -सारकः + .({@-कम्@}) red sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रकम्
ताम्रकम् Copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रता
ताम्रता A coppery red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रिक|ताम्रिकः
ताम्रिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Made of copper, coppery; Ms. 8. 136; Y. 1. 365.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रिकः|ताम्रिक
ताम्रिक + .{@-कः@} A brazier coppersmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रिमन्
ताम्रिमन् <i>m.</i> Redness, the colour of copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताम्रयम्
ताम्रयम् Redness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताय्
ताय् €1 Ā. (तायते, तायित)<BR>—1 To spread, extend, proceed in a continuous line.<BR>—2 To protect, preserve. ━<i>With</i> {@वि@} to spread, create; उभौ मायां व्यतायेताम् Bk. 17. 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तायनम्
तायनम्<BR>—1 Proceeding well, succeeding.<BR>—2 Increase, growth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तायिकः|तायिक
तायिकः See ताजिकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तायिन्
तायिन् <i>m.</i> N. of Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तायुः|तायु
तायुः Ved. A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार|तारं|तारः
तार <i>a.</i> [तॄ-णिच् भावे अच्]<BR>—1 High (as a note.)<BR>—2 Loud, shrill (as a sound); नादस्तावद्विकलकुररीकूजितस्निग्धतारः Māl. 5. 20.<BR>—3 Shining, radiant, clear; हारांस्तारांस्तरलगुटिकान् (regarded as<BR> an interpolation in Me. by Malli.); उरसि निहितस्तारो हारः Amaru. 31; R. 5. 52.<BR>—4 Good, excellent, well-flavoured.<BR>—5 Clear, clean; ‘तारो मुक्तादिसंशुद्धौ’ इति विश्वः; Śi. 18. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारः|तार|तारं
तार + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 The bank of a river.<BR>—2 The clearness of a pearl.<BR>—3 A beautiful or big pearl; हारममलतरतारमुरसि दधतम् Gīt. 11.<BR>—4 An epithet of (1) Viṣṇu, (2) Śiva.<BR>—5 The mystical syllable ओम् (प्रणव).<BR>—6 Protection.<BR>—7 A high tone or note; दध्मौ शङ्खं च तारेण सिंहनादं ननाद च Mb. 7. 156. 9.<BR>—8 Crossing, passing over.<BR>—9 A thread, wire (तन्तु); यदा गतोद्वाहमकूजनाक्षं सुवर्णतारं<BR> रथमाततायी Mb. 5. 48. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारः|तार|तारं
तार + .{@-रः, -रम्@}<BR>—1 A star or planet; (said to be <i>f.</i> also).<BR>—2 The pupil of the eye; (said to be <i>m.</i> also).<BR>—3 A pearl (said to be <i>f.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारम्
तार + .{@-रः, -रम्@}<BR>—1 A star or planet; (said to be <i>f.</i> also).<BR>—2 The pupil of the eye; (said to be <i>m.</i> also).<BR>—3 A pearl (said to be <i>f.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारम्
तार + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Silver; तारहेममहारत्नविमानशतसङ्कुलम् Bhāg. 4. 6. 27.<BR>—2 A seed-vessel (esp. of the lotus); शुक्लैः सतारैर्मुकुलीकृतैः स्थुलैः<BR> कुमुद्वतीनां कुमुदाकरैरिव Śi. 12. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ताराभ्रः, तारारिः, तारपतनम्, तारपुष्पः, तारमाक्षिकम्, तारवायुः, तारविमला, तारशुद्धिकरम्, तारस्वर, तारहारः, तारहेमाभम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताराभ्रः|ताराभ्र
तार + -अभ्रः camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारारिः|तारारि
तार + -अरिः a pyritic ore of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारपतनम्
तार + -पतनम् the falling of a star or meteor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारपुष्पः|तारपुष्प
तार + -पुष्पः the Kunda or jasmine creeper<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारमाक्षिकम्
तार + -माक्षिकम् a kind of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">Page0769-2</a>]<BR> inferior metal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारवायुः|तारवायु
तार + -वायुः loud-sounding wind, a whistling breeze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारविमला
तार + -विमला a kind of mineral substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारशुद्धिकरम्
तार + -शुद्धिकरम् lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारस्वर
तार + -स्वर <i>a.</i> having a loud or shrill sound; तारस्वरं तथा<BR> साम गायति स्म जडाशयः Ks. 6. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारहारः|तारहार
तार + -हारः<BR>—1 a necklace of big or beautiful pearls.<BR>—2 a shining necklace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारहेमाभम्
तार + -हेमाभम् N. of a metal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकः|तारक|तारकं
तारकः N. of a demon killed by Kārtikeya. [He was the son of Vajrāṅga<BR> and Varāṅgī. He propitiated the god Brahmadeva by means of his penance<BR> on the Pāriyātra mountain, and asked as a boon that he should not be<BR> killed by any one except a child seven days old. On the strength of this<BR> boon he began to oppress the gods who were obliged to go to Brahmā and<BR> ask his assistance in the destruction of the demon (see Ku. 2). But they<BR> were told that the offspring of Śiva could alone vanquish him. Afterwards<BR> Kārtikeya was born, and he slew the demon on the seventh day of his birth].<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तारकारिः, तारकजित्, तारकरिपुः, तारकवैरिन्, तारकसूदनः^1<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकारिः|तारकारि
तारकः + -अरिः, -जित्, -रिपुः, -वैरिन्, -सूदनः^1 <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kārtikeya;<BR> जेयस्तारकसूदनो युधि करक्रीडत्कुठारस्य च P. R. 4. 16. (For other<BR> senses, see under तॄ).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकजित्
तारकः + -अरिः, -जित्, -रिपुः, -वैरिन्, -सूदनः^1 <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kārtikeya;<BR> जेयस्तारकसूदनो युधि करक्रीडत्कुठारस्य च P. R. 4. 16. (For other<BR> senses, see under तॄ).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकरिपुः|तारकरिपु
तारकः + -अरिः, -जित्, -रिपुः, -वैरिन्, -सूदनः^1 <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kārtikeya;<BR> जेयस्तारकसूदनो युधि करक्रीडत्कुठारस्य च P. R. 4. 16. (For other<BR> senses, see under तॄ).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकवैरिन्
तारकः + -अरिः, -जित्, -रिपुः, -वैरिन्, -सूदनः^1 <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kārtikeya;<BR> जेयस्तारकसूदनो युधि करक्रीडत्कुठारस्य च P. R. 4. 16. (For other<BR> senses, see under तॄ).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकसूदनः|तारकसूदन
तारकः + -अरिः, -जित्, -रिपुः, -वैरिन्, -सूदनः^1 <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kārtikeya;<BR> जेयस्तारकसूदनो युधि करक्रीडत्कुठारस्य च P. R. 4. 16. (For other<BR> senses, see under तॄ).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारका
तारका<BR>—1 A star; यर्ह्येवाजनजन्मर्क्षं शान्तर्क्षग्रहतारकम् Bhāg. 10. 3. 1.<BR>—2 A meteor, falling star.<BR>—3 The pupil of the eye; संदधे दृशमुदग्रतारकाम् R. 11. 69; C. P. 5;<BR> Bh. 1. 11.<BR>—4 N. of the wife of Bṛhaspati; सुरासुरविनाशो ऽभूत्समरस्तारकामयः<BR> Bhāg. 9. 14. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तारकामानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकामानम्
तारका + -मानम् sidereal measure-time; Bṛ. S. 98. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकिणी
तारकिणी A starry night, night during which stars are visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकित|तारकितं
तारकित <i>a.</i> [तारकाः अस्य संजाताः इतच्] Starry, star-spangled,<BR> studded with stars; कणगणाधिकतारकिताम्बरः N. 4. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारण|तारणः
तारण, तारित, तारिक &c. See under तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारित
तारण, तारित, तारिक &c. See under तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारिक|तारिकं
तारण, तारित, तारिक &c. See under तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारणेयः|तारणेय
तारणेयः<BR>—1 One born of a virgin (कानीन),<BR>—2 A devotee of the sun; Mb. 1. 167. 8 (com.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारतम्यम्
तारतम्यम् [तरतमयोर्भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Gradation, proportion, relative importance, comparative value.<BR>—2 Difference, distinction; निर्धनं निधनमेतयोर्द्वयोस्तारतम्यविधिमुक्तचेतसाम् ।<BR> बोधनाय विधिना विनिर्मिता रेफ एव जयवैजयन्तिका ॥ Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारल|तारलः
तारल <i>a.</i> Unsteady.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारलः|तारल
तारल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 libidinous man, lecher, libertine.<BR>—2 The companion of a dissolute man (विट).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारल्यम्
तारल्यम्<BR>—1 Tremulousness.<BR>—2 Libidinousness, dissoluteness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारा
तारा —1 A star or planet in general; हंसश्रेणीषु तारासु R. 4. 19; Bh. 1. 15.<BR>—2 A fixed star; Y. 3. 172; R. 6. 22.<BR>—3 The pupil of the eye, the eye-ball; कान्तामन्तःप्रमोदादभिसरति<BR> मदभ्रान्ततारश्चकोरः Māl. 9. 30; विस्मयस्मेरतारैः 1. 28; Ku. 3. 47.<BR>—4 A pearl.<BR>—5 (in Sāṅkhya Phil.) One of the 8 Siddhis.<BR>—6 (in music) N. of a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">Page0770-1</a>]<BR> Rāga of six notes.<BR>—7 A kind of perfume. —8<BR>——(<i>a</i>) N. of the wife of Vāli, king of the monkeys, and mother of Aṅgada.<BR> She in vain tried to dissuade her husband Vāli from fighting with Rāma<BR> and Sugrīva, and married Sugrīva after Vāli had been killed by Rāma.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) N. of the wife of Bṛhaspati, the preceptor of the gods. She<BR> was on one occasion carried off by Soma (the moon) who refused to deliver<BR> her up to her husband when demanded. A fierce contest then ensued, and<BR> Brahmā had at last to compel Soma to restore her to her husband. Tārā<BR> gave birth to a son named Budha who became the ancestor of the Lunar race<BR> of kings (see Bhāg. 9. 14).<BR>——(<i>c</i>) N. of the wife of Hariśchandra and mother of Rohidāsa (also<BR> called Tārāmatī).<BR>——(<i>d</i>) N. of a Buddha goddess.<BR>——(<i>e</i>) N. of a Śakti; Jaina.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ताराधिपः, तारापीडः, ताराभः, ताराग्रहः, तारापतिः, तारापथः, ताराप्रमाणम्, ताराभूषा, तारामण्डलम्, तारामृगः, तारामैत्रकम्, तारावर्षम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0769-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताराधिपः|ताराधिप
तारा + -अधिपः<BR>—1 the moon; Ku. 7. 48; Bh. 1. 71.<BR>—2 Śiva.<BR>—3 Bṛhaspati.<BR>—4 Vāli.<BR>—5 Sugrīva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारापीडः|तारापीड
तारा + -आपीडः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताराभः|ताराभ
तारा + -आभः quicksilver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताराग्रहः|ताराग्रह
तारा + -ग्रहः one of the 5 lesser planets exclusive of the sun and moon;<BR> Bṛ. S. 69. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारापतिः|तारापति
तारा + -पतिः<BR>—1 the moon R. 13. 76.<BR>—2 Vāli.<BR>—3 Bṛhaspati.<BR>—4 Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारापथः|तारापथ
तारा + -पथः the atmosphere, firmament, sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताराप्रमाणम्
तारा + -प्रमाणम् sidereal measure, sidereal time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताराभूषा
तारा + -भूषा the night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारामण्डलम्
तारा + -मण्डलम्<BR>—1 the starry region, the zodiac.<BR>—2 the pupil of the eye.<BR>—3 ({@लः@}) A kind of Śiva temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारामृगः|तारामृग
तारा + -मृगः the constellation मृगशिरस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारामैत्रकम्
तारा + -मैत्रकम् ‘the friendship of the stars’, spontaneous or unaccountable<BR> love; Māl. 7. 4; U. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारावर्षम्
तारा + -वर्षम् falling stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारायणः|तारायण
तारायणः The holy fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारिका
तारिका <i>f.</i> Toddy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारुण
तारुण <i>a.</i> Youthful, young.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारुण्यम्
तारुण्यम्<BR>—1 Youth, youthfulness; तारुण्यं गतमेव निष्फलमहा शून्यालये दीपवत्.<BR>—2 Freshness (fig.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारेयः|तारेय
तारेयः<BR>—1 The planet Mercury,<BR>—2 An epithet of Aṅgada, son of Vāli; Rām. 5. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्कव|तार्क्कव
तार्कव <i>a.</i> (-वी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Spun, woven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्किकः|तार्किक|तार्क्किक
तार्किकः [तर्कं वेत्ति तच्छास्त्रमधीते वा ठञ्]<BR>—1 A dialectician, logician.<BR>—2 A philosopher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्किकत्वम्
तार्किकत्वम् Scepticism, philosophy; कवितातार्किकत्वयोरेकाधिकरणतामालोक्य<BR> विस्मितोऽस्मि P. R. 1. 17/18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्क्षः|तार्क्ष
तार्क्षः N. of the sage कश्यप.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्क्ष्यः|तार्क्ष्य|तार्क्ष्यं
तार्क्ष्यः<BR>—1 An epithet of Garuḍa; त्रस्तेन तार्क्ष्यात् किल कालियेन R. 6. 49.<BR>—2 N. of Garuḍaʼs elder brother Aruṇa.<BR>—3 A car; आरुह्य तार्क्ष्यं नभसीव भूतले (ययौ) Śi. 12. 2.<BR>—4 A horse.<BR>—5 A snake;<BR>—6 A bird in general.<BR>—7 N. of Śiva.<BR>—8 Gold.<BR>—9 A kind of antidote.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तार्क्ष्यध्वजः, तार्क्ष्यनायकः, तार्क्ष्यनाशकः, तार्क्ष्यपुत्रः, तार्क्ष्यसुतः, तार्क्ष्यशलैः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्क्ष्यध्वजः|तार्क्ष्यध्वज
तार्क्ष्यः + -ध्वजः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्क्ष्यनायकः|तार्क्ष्यनायक
तार्क्ष्यः + -नायकः an epithet of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्क्ष्यनाशकः|तार्क्ष्यनाशक
तार्क्ष्यः + -नाशकः Peregrine falcon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्क्ष्यपुत्रः|तार्क्ष्यपुत्र
तार्क्ष्यः + -पुत्रः, -सुतः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">Page0770-2</a>]<BR> Garuḍa; Bhāg. 3. 2. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्क्ष्यसुतः|तार्क्ष्यसुत
तार्क्ष्यः + -पुत्रः, -सुतः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">Page0770-2</a>]<BR> Garuḍa; Bhāg. 3. 2. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्क्ष्यशलैः
तार्क्ष्यः + -शलैः A kind of antidote (Mar. रसांजन); तार्क्ष्यशैलं<BR> शिखिग्रीवं चक्षुष्यां यामुनं पुनः Śiva B. 30. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्ण|तार्णः
तार्ण <i>a.</i> (-र्णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [तृणस्येदं शिवा˚ अण्]<BR>—1 made of grass; अहं सहस्रपान्नामा विप्रो मोहात्पुरा मया । खगमो<BR> नाम तार्णेन (सर्पेण) त्रासितस्तेन शापितः ॥ Bm. 1. 87; कौशेयान्यथ<BR> तार्णानि … Śiva B. 30. 21; स मया क्रीडता बाल्ये कृत्वा तार्णं भुजङ्गमम् Mb. 1. 11. 2.<BR>—2 Levied from grass (as a tax)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्णः|तार्ण
तार्ण + .{@-र्णः@} Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्णसम्
तार्णसम् A kind of sandal having the colour of the feather of a parrot<BR> and of sour smell; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्तीय|तार्त्तीय
तार्तीय <i>a.</i> [तृतीय एव, स्वार्थे अण्]<BR>—1 The third; क्रमतो गां पदैकेन द्वितीयेन दिवं विभोः । खं च कायेन<BR> महता तार्तीयस्य कुतो गतिः ॥ Bhāg. 8. 19. 34.<BR>—2 Belonging to the third; तार्तीयेन स्वभावेन भगवन्नाभिमाश्रिता;<BR> Bhāg. 3. 6. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्तीयम्
तार्तीय + .{@-यम्@} A third part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्तीयीक|तार्त्तीयीक
तार्तीयीक <i>a.</i> The third; तार्तीयीकतया मितोऽयमगमत्तस्य प्रबन्धे<BR> N. 3. 136; तार्तीयीकं पुरारेस्तदवतु मदनप्लोषणं लोचनं वः Māl. 1, v. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालः|ताल|तालं
तालः [तल् एव अण्]<BR>—1 The palmyra tree, Bhāg. 8. 2. 12; विधिवशात्तालस्य मूलं गतः<BR> Bh. 2. 90; R. 15. 23.<BR>—2 A banner formed of the palm.<BR>—3 Slapping or clapping the hands together, the noise made by it; तलतालांश्च<BR> वादयन् Mb. 3. 178. 17; Māl. 5. 23.<BR>—4 Flapping in general; विस्तारितः कुञ्जरकर्णतालैः R. 7. 39.<BR>—5 Flapping of the ears of an elephant.<BR>—6 Beating time (in music); करकिसलयतालैर्मुग्धया नर्त्यमानम् U. 3. 10; Me. 81.<BR>—7 A musical instrument made of bell-metal, Bhāg. 8. 15. 21; उषसि<BR> स गजयूथकर्णतालैः पटुपटहध्वनिभिर्विनीतनिद्रः R. 9. 71.<BR>—8 The palm of the hand.<BR>—9 A lock, bolt.<BR>—10 The hilt of a sword.<BR>—11 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—12 (In prosody) A trochee.<BR>—13 A particular measure of height; Rām. 6.<BR>—14 A short span; a span measured by the thumb and the middle finger.<BR>—15 A dance; S. D. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालम्
तालः + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 The nut of the palmyra tree.<BR>—2 Yellow orpiment.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तालाङ्कः, तालावचरः, तालापचरः, तालकेतुः, तालक्षीरकम्, तालगर्भः, तालज्ञ, तालधारकः, तालध्वजः, तालभृत्, तालनवमी, तालपत्रम्, तालपत्री, तालफलम्, तालबद्ध, तालशुद्ध, तालभङ्गः, तालमर्दलः, तालयन्त्रम्, तालरेचनकः, ताललक्षणः, तालवनम्, तालवृन्तम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालाङ्कः|तालाङ्क|तालांक
तालः + -अङ्कः<BR>—1 N. of Balarāma; तालाङ्को मुसली हली Ak. ततः शिवमहीपालस्तालाङ्कानुजबुद्धिमान्<BR> Parṇāl. 5. 47.<BR>—2 the plam-leaf used for writing.<BR>—3 a book.<BR>—4 a saw.<BR>—5 N. of Śiva.<BR>—6 a man endowed with every fortunate mark or sign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालावचरः|तालावचर
तालः + -अवचरः, -अपचरः a dancer, an actor; Rām. 2. 3. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालापचरः|तालापचर
तालः + -अवचरः, -अपचरः a dancer, an actor; Rām. 2. 3. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालकेतुः|तालकेतु
तालः + -केतुः an epithet of Bhīṣma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालक्षीरकम्
तालः + -क्षीरकम्, -गर्भः the exudation of the palm; toddy. {@-जटा, -प्रलम्बः@} the fibres of the palm tree (Mar. काथ्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालगर्भः|तालगर्भ
तालः + -क्षीरकम्, -गर्भः the exudation of the palm; toddy. {@-जटा, -प्रलम्बः@} the fibres of the palm tree (Mar. काथ्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालज्ञ
तालः + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> knowing the measure (in music); Y. 3. 115.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालधारकः|तालधारक
तालः + -धारकः a dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालध्वजः|तालध्वज
तालः + -ध्वजः, -भृत् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालभृत्
तालः + -ध्वजः, -भृत् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालनवमी
तालः + -नवमी The 9th day of the bright half of भाद्रपद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालपत्रम्
तालः + -पत्रम्<BR>—1 the palm-leaf used for writing.<BR>—2 a kind of ear-ornament (hollow cylinder of gold thrust through the<BR> lobe of the ear).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालपत्री
तालः + -पत्री <i>f.</i> A widow; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालफलम्
तालः + -फलम् the fruit of the plam tree; तालफलादपि गुरुमतिसरसम् ।<BR> किं विफलीकुरुषे कुचकलशम् ॥ Gīt. 9. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालबद्ध
तालः + -बद्ध, -शुद्ध <i>a.</i> measured, rhythmical,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">Page0771-1</a>]<BR> regulated by musical time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालशुद्ध
तालः + -बद्ध, -शुद्ध <i>a.</i> measured, rhythmical,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">Page0771-1</a>]<BR> regulated by musical time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0770-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालभङ्गः|तालभङ्ग
तालः + -भङ्गः The loss of the measure (in music).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालमर्दलः|तालमर्दल|तालमर्द्दल
तालः + -मर्दलः a kind of musical instrument, a cymbal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालयन्त्रम्
तालः + -यन्त्रम्<BR>—1 a kind of surgical instrument.<BR>—2 a lock, a lock and key.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालरेचनकः|तालरेचनक
तालः + -रेचनकः a dancer, an actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताललक्षणः|ताललक्षण
तालः + -लक्षणः an epithet of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालवनम्
तालः + -वनम् a grove of trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालवृन्तम्
तालः + -वृन्तम् a fan; Ś. 3. 21; Ku. 2. 35; तालवृन्तेन किं कार्यं<BR> लब्धे मलयमारुते Udb. also तालवृन्तकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताली
ताली<BR>—1 A species of the mountain-palm, palm-tree; प्राप तालीवनश्यामम् R. 4. 34.<BR>—2 The common toddy (<i>Tādi</i>).<BR>—3 Fragrant earth.<BR>—4 A sort of key.<BR>—5 Noise produced by clapping the hands together; स धात्री करतालीभिः<BR> संवर्धितकुतूहलः Śiva B. 7. 17.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तालीपट्टम्, तालीवनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालीपट्टम्
ताली + -पट्टम् a kind of ear-ornament; K. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालीवनम्
ताली + -वनम् a grove of palm trees; R. 4. 34; अनेन सार्धं विहराम्बुराशेस्तीरेषु<BR> तालीवनमर्मरेषु 6. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालकम्
तालकम्<BR>—1 Yellow orpiment.<BR>—2 A fragrant earth.<BR>—3 A bolt, latch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालकी
तालकम् + .{@-की@} The vinous exudation of the palm, <i>toddy</i>.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तालकाभ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालकाभ|तालकाभः
तालकम् + -आभ <i>a.</i> green.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालकाभः|तालकाभ
तालकम् + -आभ + .({@-भः@}) the green colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालङ्कः|तालङ्क|तालंकः
तालङ्कः A kind of ear-ornament, (= ताडङ्क q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालव्य|तालव्यं
तालव्य <i>a.</i> Relating to the palate, palatal.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तालव्यवर्णः, तालव्यस्वरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालव्यवर्णः|तालव्यवर्ण
तालव्य + -वर्णः a palatal letter; <i>i. e.</i> इ, ई, च्, छ्, ज्, झ्, ञ् and थ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालव्यस्वरः|तालव्यस्वर
तालव्य + -स्वरः a palatal vowel; <i>i. e.</i> इ and ई.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालिकः|तालिक
तालिकः [तालेन निर्वृत्तः ठक्]<BR>—1 The open palm of the hand.<BR>—2 Clapping the hands (तालिका also); यथैकेन न हस्तेन तालिका<BR> संप्रपद्यते Pt. 2. 132; उच्चाटनीयः करतालिकानां दानादिदानीं भवतीभिरेषः N. 3. 7.<BR>—3 A tie, seal.<BR>—4 A cover for binding a parcel of papers or a manuscript.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालितम्
तालितम्<BR>—1 Coloured cloth.<BR>—2 Any musical instrument.<BR>—3 A string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालिन्
तालिन् <i>m.</i> N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालिशः|तालिश
तालिशः A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालु
तालु <i>n.</i> [तरन्त्यनेन वर्णाः तॄ-अण् रस्य लः; cf. Uṇ. 1. 5.]<BR> The palate; तृषा महत्या परिशुष्कतालवः Ṛs. 1. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तालुजिह्व, तालुनासः, तालुपाकः, तालुपुप्पुटः, तालुविद्रधी, तालुमूलम्, तालुस्थान<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालुजिह्व|तालुजिह्वः
तालु + -जिह्व,<BR>—1 a crocodile.<BR>—2 the uvula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालुनासः
तालु + -नासः camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालुपाकः|तालुपाक
तालु + -पाकः an abscess in the palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालुपुप्पुटः|तालुपुप्पुट
तालु + -पुप्पुटः, -विद्रधी an indolent swelling of the palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालुविद्रधी
तालु + -पुप्पुटः, -विद्रधी an indolent swelling of the palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालुमूलम्
तालु + -मूलम् the root or back-part of the palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालुस्थान
तालु + -स्थान <i>a.</i> palatal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालुस्थानम्
तालु + -स्थान + .({@-नम्@}) the palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालुकम्
तालुकम्<BR>—1 The palate.<BR>—2 A disease of the palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालूरः|तालूर
तालूरः A whirlpool, an eddy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तालूषकम्
तालूषकम् The palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावक
तावक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>{@तावकीन@} <i>a.</i> Thy, thine; तपः क्व वत्से<BR> क्व च तावकं वपुः Ku. 5. 4; Ki. 3. 12; Bv. 1. 36, 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावकी
तावक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>{@तावकीन@} <i>a.</i> Thy, thine; तपः क्व वत्से<BR> क्व च तावकं वपुः Ku. 5. 4; Ki. 3. 12; Bv. 1. 36, 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावकीन|तावकीनं
तावक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>{@तावकीन@} <i>a.</i> Thy, thine; तपः क्व वत्से<BR> क्व च तावकं वपुः Ku. 5. 4; Ki. 3. 12; Bv. 1. 36, 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावत्|तावन्त्
तावत् <i>a.</i> (Correlative of यावत् q. v.)<BR>—1 So much, that much, so many; ते तु यावन्त एवाजौ तावांश्च ददृशे<BR> स तैः R. 12. 45; H. 4. 72; Ku. 2. 33.<BR>—2 So great, so large,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">Page0771-2</a>]<BR> of this extent; यावती संभवेद् वृत्तिस्तावतीं दातुमर्हसि Ms. 8. 155, 9. 249;<BR> Bg. 2. 46.<BR>—3 All (expressing totality); यावद्दत्तं तावद् भुक्तम् G. M.<BR>—4 Just a little; हतवेगं विनयेन तावता Ki. 2. 48.<BR>—5 (in Alg.) An unknown quantity. ━<i>ind.</i><BR>—1 First (before doing anything else); आर्ये इतस्तावदागम्यताम् Ś. 1;<BR> आह्लादयस्व तावच्चन्द्रकरश्चन्द्रकान्तमिव V. 5. 11; Me. 13.<BR>—2 On oneʼs part, in the meanwhile; सखे स्थिरप्रतिबन्धो भव । अहं<BR> तावत् खामिनश्चित्तवृत्तिमनुवर्तिष्ये Ś. 2; R. 7. 32.<BR>—3 Just, now; गच्छ तावत्.<BR>—4 Indeed. (to emphasize an expression); त्वमेव तावत् प्रथमो राजद्रोही<BR> Mu. 1 ‘thou thyself’; त्वमेव तावत्परिचिन्तय स्वयम् Ku. 5. 67; गता<BR> तावन्निवेद्यैव सा ममोदयपर्वतम् Ks. 18. 241.<BR>—5 Truly, really (to express assent); अल्पोऽप्येवं महान्वापि विक्रयस्तावदेवः<BR> सः Ms. 3. 53; दृढस्तावद्बन्धः H. 1.<BR>—6 As for, with respect to; विग्रहस्तावदुपस्थितः H. 3; एवं कृते<BR> तव तावत्क्लेशं विना प्राणयात्रा भविष्यति Pt. 1.<BR>—7 Completely; तावत्प्रकीर्णाभिनवोपचाराम् R. 7. 4 (तावत्प्रकीर्ण<BR> = साकल्येन प्रसारित Malli.)<BR>—8 Surprise (oh!, what a wonder). (For the senses of तावत् as a correlative<BR> of यावत्, see यावत्).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तावत्कृत्वस्, तावत्फल, तावन्मात्रम्, तावद्वर्ष<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावत्कृत्वस्
तावत् + -कृत्वस् <i>ind.</i> so many times; यावन्ति पशुरोमाणि तावत्कृत्वो<BR> ह मारणम् Ms. 5. 38. तावत्कृ to square (in Math.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावत्फल
तावत् + -फल <i>a.</i> having such results; क्लिष्टं नु तावत्फलमेव पुण्यम् Ś. 6. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावन्मात्रम्
तावत् + -मात्रम् just so much.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावन्मात्रे
तावत् + -मात्रम् + .({@-त्रे@}) <i>ind.</i> in that distance; सदनानि तावन्मात्र एव<BR> Bhāg. 5. 24. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावद्वर्ष
तावत् + -वर्ष <i>a.</i> so many years old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावतिक
तावतिक, तावत्क <i>a.</i> Bought for so much, worth so much,<BR> of so much value.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावत्क
तावतिक, तावत्क <i>a.</i> Bought for so much, worth so much,<BR> of so much value.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावद्धा
तावद्धा <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 In such a number.<BR>—2 So often.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावरम्
तावरम् A bow-string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताविषः|ताविष
ताविषः, -षी<BR>—1 The ocean.<BR>—2 Heaven.<BR>—3 Gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ताविषी
ताविषः, -षी<BR>—1 The ocean.<BR>—2 Heaven.<BR>—3 Gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावीषः|तावीष
तावीषः<BR>—1 The ocean.<BR>—2 Gold.<BR>—3 Heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावीषी
तावीषः + .{@-षी@}<BR>—1 A river.<BR>—2 The earth.<BR>—3 N. of a daughter of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तावुरिः|तावुरि
तावुरिः The sign Taurus of the Zodiac, (a word borrowed from the<BR> Greek <i>Tauros</i>.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तास्कर्यम्
तास्कर्यम् Theft; Ms. 9. 222^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/44aba84e. note: cf. PWG.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्
तिक् I. €1 Ā. (तेकते) To go or move. ━II. €5 P. (तिकोति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To attack, assail.<BR>—3 To wound.<BR>—4 To seek to injure or kill.<BR>—5 To challenge; also written तिग् or तिघ् in this sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्त|तिक्तं|तिक्तः
तिक्त <i>a.</i> [तिज्-बा˚ कर्तरि क्त]<BR>—1 Bitter, pungent (as one of the six flavours or <i>Rasas</i>); तस्यास्तिक्तैर्वनगजमदैर्वासितं<BR> वान्तवृष्टिः Me. 20.<BR>—2 Fragrant; ‘कटुतिक्तकषायास्तु सौरभ्येऽपि प्रकीर्तिताः’ इति केशवः<BR> Śi. 5. 33; तोयक्रीडानिरतयुवतिस्नानतिक्तैर्मरुद्भिः Me. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्तः|तिक्त|तिक्तं
तिक्त + .{@-क्तः@}<BR>—1 Bitter taste; (see under कटु).<BR>—2 The Kuṭaja tree.<BR>—3 Pungency.<BR>—4 Fragrance.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिक्तगन्धा, तिक्ततण्डुला, तिक्तधातुः, तिक्तफलः, तिक्तमरिचः, तिक्तशाकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्तगन्धा
तिक्त + -गन्धा mustard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्ततण्डुला
तिक्त + -तण्डुला long peper (Mar. पिंपळी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्तधातुः|तिक्तधातु
तिक्त + -धातुः bile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्तफलः|तिक्तफल
तिक्त + -फलः, -मरिचः the clearing-nut plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्तमरिचः|तिक्तमरिच
तिक्त + -फलः, -मरिचः the clearing-nut plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्तशाकम्
तिक्त + -शाकम् a bitter (or fragrant) pot-herb (Mar. वायवर्णा); Rāj. T. 5. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0771-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्तक|तिक्तकः
तिक्तक <i>a.</i> Bitter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्तकः|तिक्तक
तिक्तक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 The Khadira tree.<BR>—2 N. of several plants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिक्ताय
तिक्ताय (तिक्तायते) To have a bitter flavour; पित्तेन दूने<BR> रसने सितापि तिक्तायते हंसकुलावतंस N. 3. 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्म|तिग्मं
तिग्म <i>a.</i> [तिज्-मक् जस्य गः Uṇ. 1. 45]<BR>—1 Sharp, pointed (as a weapon); Av. 4. 27. 7.<BR>—2 Violent.<BR>—3 Hot, scorching.<BR>—4 Pungent, acrid.<BR>—5 Fiery, passionate.<BR>—5 Austere; ततस्ते तिग्मतप संकृशं धर्मनिसंततम् Mb. 3. 158. 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मम्
तिग्म + .{@-ग्मम्@}<BR>—1 Heat.<BR>—2 Pungency.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिग्मांशुः, तिग्मकरः, तिग्मदीधितिः, तिग्मद्युतिः, तिग्मभास्, तिग्मरश्मिः, तिग्मरुच्, तिग्मतेजस्, तिग्मनेमि, तिग्मयातना<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मांशुः|तिग्मांशु
तिग्म + -अंशुः<BR>—1 the sun; तिग्मांशुरस्तं गतः Gīt. 5.<BR>—2 fire. —3 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मकरः|तिग्मकर
तिग्म + -करः, -दीधितिः, -द्युतिः, -भास्, -रश्मिः, -रुच् <i>m.</i> the sun;<BR> Śi. 20. 28, 45.<BR>—2 The number ‘12’ (esp. तिग्मकंर-दीधिति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मदीधितिः|तिग्मदीधिति
तिग्म + -करः, -दीधितिः, -द्युतिः, -भास्, -रश्मिः, -रुच् <i>m.</i> the sun;<BR> Śi. 20. 28, 45.<BR>—2 The number ‘12’ (esp. तिग्मकंर-दीधिति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मद्युतिः|तिग्मद्युति
तिग्म + -करः, -दीधितिः, -द्युतिः, -भास्, -रश्मिः, -रुच् <i>m.</i> the sun;<BR> Śi. 20. 28, 45.<BR>—2 The number ‘12’ (esp. तिग्मकंर-दीधिति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मभास्
तिग्म + -करः, -दीधितिः, -द्युतिः, -भास्, -रश्मिः, -रुच् <i>m.</i> the sun;<BR> Śi. 20. 28, 45.<BR>—2 The number ‘12’ (esp. तिग्मकंर-दीधिति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मरश्मिः|तिग्मरश्मि
तिग्म + -करः, -दीधितिः, -द्युतिः, -भास्, -रश्मिः, -रुच् <i>m.</i> the sun;<BR> Śi. 20. 28, 45.<BR>—2 The number ‘12’ (esp. तिग्मकंर-दीधिति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मरुच्
तिग्म + -करः, -दीधितिः, -द्युतिः, -भास्, -रश्मिः, -रुच् <i>m.</i> the sun;<BR> Śi. 20. 28, 45.<BR>—2 The number ‘12’ (esp. तिग्मकंर-दीधिति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मतेजस्
तिग्म + -तेजस् <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 sharp-pointed.<BR>—2 penetrating.<BR>—3 of a violent nature; Vāj. 1. 24.<BR>—4 of resplendent lustre. ━<i>m.</i> the sun; ततो निशायां यातायामुदिते<BR> तिग्मतेजसि Ks. 29. 121.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मनेमि
तिग्म + -नेमि <i>a.</i> having a sharp-edged felly; पदातेर्भगवांस्तस्य<BR> पदास्तिग्मनेमिना । चक्रेण शिर उत्कृत्य … Bhāg. 10. 57. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिग्मयातना
तिग्म + -यातना acute or violent pain; cf. Bhāg. 6. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिज्
तिज् I. €1 Ā. (Strictly <i>desid.</i> of तिज्) (तितिक्षते, तितिक्षित)<BR>—1 To endure, bear.<BR>—2 To put up with, suffer patiently or with courage तितिक्षमाणस्य परेण<BR> निन्दाम् M. 1. 17; तांस्तितिक्षस्व भारत Bg. 2. 14; Mv. 2. 12; Ki. 13. 68;<BR> Ms. 6. 47. ━II. €10 U. or <i>Caus.</i> (तेजयति-ते, तेजित)<BR>—1 To sharpen, whet; कुसुमचापमतेजयदंशुभिः R. 9. 39.<BR>—2 To stir up, excite, instigate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिक्षा
तितिक्षा Endurance, patience, resignation, forbearance; अनपायि<BR> निबर्हणं द्विषां न तितिक्षासममस्ति साधनम् Ki. 2. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिक्षु|तितिक्षुः
तितिक्षु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Patient, forbearing, enduring; Bṛ. Up. 4. 4. 23.<BR>—2 Desiring to give up; अतितिक्षुः पुत्रपौत्रान् Mb. 12. 141. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजः|तेज
तेजः<BR>—1 Pungency.<BR>—2 Sharpness (of a weapon).<BR>—3 Brilliancy.<BR>—4 Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजनम्
तेजनम् [तिज्-णिच्-ल्यु]<BR>—1 A bamboo.<BR>—2 Sharpening, whetting.<BR>—3 Kindling.<BR>—4 Rendering bright.<BR>—5 Polishing.<BR>—6 A reed.<BR>—7 The point of an arrow, the edge of a weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजनी
तेजनम् + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 A mat.<BR>—2 A tuft.<BR>—3 A tuft of hair on the head of a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिजिलः|तिजिल
तिजिलः(नः)<BR>—1 The moon.<BR>—2 A Rākṣasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिजिनः|तिजिन
तिजिलः(नः)<BR>—1 The moon.<BR>—2 A Rākṣasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितौः
तितौः A sieve. ━<i>n.</i> A parasol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिक्षा
तितिक्षा &c. See under तिज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिभः|तितिभ
तितिभः<BR>—1 A fire-fly.<BR>—2 A kind of insect (इन्द्रगोप), cochineal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिरः|तितिर
तितिरः, तित्तिरः The francoline partridge; Bhāg. 3. 15. 18.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तितिराङ्गम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तित्तिरः|तित्तिर
तितिरः, तित्तिरः The francoline partridge; Bhāg. 3. 15. 18.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तितिराङ्गम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिराङ्गम्
तितिरः + -अङ्गम् a kind of steel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तित्तिरिः|तित्तिरि
तित्तिरिः [तित्ति इति शब्दं रौति रु-बा˚ डि Tv.]<BR>—1 The francoline partridge.<BR>—2 N. of a sage said to be the first teacher of the <i>black</i> Yajurveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तित्तिरिकः|तित्तिरिक
तित्तिरिकः The francoline partridge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तित्तिरीक
तित्तिरीक <i>a.</i> Spotted like a partridge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितिलम्
तितिलम्<BR>—1 A pressing stone (?); L. D. B.<BR>—2 N. of a karaṇa. (तैतिलम्).<BR>—3 Flattened sesamum cake.<BR>—4 A bowl or bucket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथः|तिथ
तिथः<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 Love.<BR>—3 Time. —4 The rainy season or autumn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथिः|तिथि
तिथिः <i>m.</i> or <i>f.</i> [अत्-इथिन् पृषो˚ वा ङीप् cf. Uṇ. 4. 2]<BR>—1 A lunar day; तिथिरेव तावन्न शुद्धपति Mu. 5; Ku. 6. 93, 7. 1.<BR>—2 The number ‘15’.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिथ्यर्धः, तिथ्यर्धम्, तिथीशः, तिथिक्षयः, तिथिपत्री, तिथिपालनम्, तिथिप्रणीः, तिथिप्रलयः, तिथिवृद्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथ्यर्धः|तिथ्यर्ध
तिथिः + -अर्धः, -अर्धम् (half the तिथि), a Karaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथ्यर्धम्
तिथिः + -अर्धः, -अर्धम् (half the तिथि), a Karaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथीशः|तिथीश
तिथिः + -ईशः the regent of a lunar day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथिक्षयः|तिथिक्षय
तिथिः + -क्षयः<BR>—1 the day of new moon.<BR>—2 the day on which a <i>tithi</i> begins and ends without one sunrise<BR> or between two sunrises.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथिपत्री
तिथिः + -पत्री an almanac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथिपालनम्
तिथिः + -पालनम् observance of the rites prescribed for the several lunar days.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथिप्रणीः
तिथिः + -प्रणीः + ({@-णिः@})<BR> the moon; सायंतनी तिथिप्रण्यः पङ्कजानां दिवातनीम् Bk. 5. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथिप्रणिः
तिथिः + -प्रणीः + ({@-णिः@})<BR> the moon; सायंतनी तिथिप्रण्यः पङ्कजानां दिवातनीम् Bk. 5. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथिप्रलयः|तिथिप्रलय
तिथिः + -प्रलयः (pl.) difference between solar and lunar days in any<BR> particular period; Āryabhaṭṭa 3. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथिवृद्धिः|तिथिवृद्धि
तिथिः + -वृद्धिः <i>f.</i> the day in which a <i>tithi</i> is completed under<BR> two suns (one which comprises two sunrises).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिथी
तिथी <i>f.</i> (= तिथिः q. v.) Mb. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिनिशः|तिनिश
तिनिशः A particular tree; दात्यूहैस्तिनिशस्य कोटरवति स्कन्धे<BR> निलीय स्थितम् Māl. 9. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्तिडः|तिन्तिड|तिंतिड|तिंतिडः
तिन्तिडः, -डी, तिन्तिडिका, तिन्तिडीकाः<BR>—1 The tamarind tree.<BR>—2 A sour sauce (made of its fruits); Bṛ. S. 55. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्तिडी
तिन्तिडः, -डी, तिन्तिडिका, तिन्तिडीकाः<BR>—1 The tamarind tree.<BR>—2 A sour sauce (made of its fruits); Bṛ. S. 55. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्तिडिका|तिंतिडिका
तिन्तिडः, -डी, तिन्तिडिका, तिन्तिडीकाः<BR>—1 The tamarind tree.<BR>—2 A sour sauce (made of its fruits); Bṛ. S. 55. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्तिडीकाः
तिन्तिडः, -डी, तिन्तिडिका, तिन्तिडीकाः<BR>—1 The tamarind tree.<BR>—2 A sour sauce (made of its fruits); Bṛ. S. 55. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्तिडीकम्
तिन्तिडः, -डी, तिन्तिडिका, तिन्तिडीकाः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 The fruit of the tamarind.<BR>—2 A sour sauce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्तिली|तिंतिली
तिन्तिली, तिन्तिलि(ली)का The tamarind tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्तिलिका
तिन्तिली, तिन्तिलि(ली)का The tamarind tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्तिलीका
तिन्तिली, तिन्तिलि(ली)का The tamarind tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्दुः|तिन्दु|तिंदु|तिंदुः
तिन्दुः, तिन्दुकः, तिन्दुलः N. of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्दुकः|तिन्दुक|तिंदुक|तिंदुकं|तिन्दुकं|तिंदुकः
तिन्दुः, तिन्दुकः, तिन्दुलः N. of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्दुलः|तिन्दुल|तिंदुल|तिंदुलः
तिन्दुः, तिन्दुकः, तिन्दुलः N. of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्दुकम्
तिन्दुकम्, -की<BR> The fruit of the ebony tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्दुकी
तिन्दुकम्, -की<BR> The fruit of the ebony tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिन्दुकम्
तिन्दुकम्, -की + .{@-कम्@} A kind of measure (कर्ष).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिप्
तिप् €1 Ā. (तेपते)<BR>—1 To sprinkle.<BR>—2 To drop, distil, ooze, leak.<BR>—3 To protect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिम्
तिम् I. €1 P. (तेमति, तिमित) To make wet or damp, moisten.<BR>━II. €4 P. (तिम्यति)<BR>—1 To become wet.<BR>—2 To become quiet or tranquil, be calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमित|तिमितः
तिमित <i>a.</i> [तिम्-कर्तरि-क्त]<BR>—1 Moist, wet, damp. —2 Motionless, steady.<BR>—2 Calm, tranquil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिः|तिमि
तिमिः<BR>—1 The ocean.<BR>—2 A kind of whale or fish of an enormous size; (अस्ति मत्स्यस्तिमिर्नाम<BR> शतयोजनमायतः ।); अमी शिरोभिस्तिमयः सरन्ध्रैरूर्ध्वं वितन्वन्ति<BR> जलप्रवाहान् R. 13. 10.<BR>—3 A fish in general; गरीयसेऽपकाराय तिमीनां बडिशं यथा Śiva B. 26. 45.<BR>—4 The figure of a fish produced by drawing two lines, one intersecting<BR> the other at right angles.<BR>—5 The sign of Pisces (मत्स्य, मीन).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिमिकोषः, तिमिघातिन्, तिमिजम्, तिमिध्वजः, तिमिमालिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिकोषः|तिमिकोष
तिमिः + -कोषः the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिघातिन्
तिमिः + -घातिन् <i>m.</i> a fisherman; Ks. 60. 185.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">Page0773-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0772-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिजम्
तिमिः + -जम् a kind of pearl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिध्वजः|तिमिध्वज
तिमिः + -ध्वजः N. of a demon (Śambara) killed by Indra with the assistance<BR> of Daśaratha. (It was in the fight with this demon that Kaikeyī saved<BR> the life of Daśaratha while in a swooning fit and got from him two boons<BR> which she afterwards used to send Rāma into exile); दानवेन्द्रं हतं<BR> दृष्ट्वा तिमिध्वजसुतं रणे Rām. 2. 44. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिमालिन्
तिमिः + -मालिन् the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिङ्गिलः|तिमिङ्गिल|तिमिंगिल|तिमिंगिलः
तिमिङ्गिलः A kind of fish which swallows a <i>timi</i>; सोऽयं<BR> तुङ्गतिमिङ्गिलाङ्गकवलीकारक्रियाकोविदः Bv. 1. 55. ˚अशनः, ˚गिलः<BR> very large fish which swallows even a <i>timiṅgila</i>; तिमिङ्गिलगिलोऽप्यस्ति<BR> तद्गिलोऽप्यस्ति राघवः cf. Bv. 1. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमित|तिमितः
तिमित See under तिम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिर|तिमिरं|तिमिरः
तिमिर <i>a.</i>^1 [तिम्-किरच्] Dark; विन्यस्यन्तीं दृशौ तिमिरे पथि<BR> Gīt. 5; बभूवुस्तिमिरा दिशः Mb.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिरः|तिमिर|तिमिरं
तिमिर + .{@-रः, -रम्@}<BR>—1 Darkness; तन्नैशं तिमिरमपाकरोति चन्द्रः Ś. 6. 30; Ku. 4. 11; Śi. 4. 57.<BR>—2 Blindness; तेजोमयं तिमिरदोषहतं हि चक्षुः Rāj. T. 4. 314.<BR>—3 Iron-rust.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिमिरारिः, तिमिरनुद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिरम्
तिमिर + .{@-रः, -रम्@}<BR>—1 Darkness; तन्नैशं तिमिरमपाकरोति चन्द्रः Ś. 6. 30; Ku. 4. 11; Śi. 4. 57.<BR>—2 Blindness; तेजोमयं तिमिरदोषहतं हि चक्षुः Rāj. T. 4. 314.<BR>—3 Iron-rust.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिमिरारिः, तिमिरनुद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिरारिः|तिमिरारि
तिमिर + -अरिः, -नुद्, <i>m.</i>, {@-रिपुः@}<BR> the sun; तिमिरारिस्तमो हन्ति प्रातः स्ववधभीरवः Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिरनुद्
तिमिर + -अरिः, -नुद्, <i>m.</i>, {@-रिपुः@}<BR> the sun; तिमिरारिस्तमो हन्ति प्रातः स्ववधभीरवः Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिरमयः|तिमिरमय
तिमिरमयः<BR>—1 An epithet of Rāhu.<BR>—2 An eclipse in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिरयति
तिमिरयति Den. P. To obscure, eclipse, darken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिरायते
तिमिरायते Den. Ā. To be or appear dark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिरिन्
तिमिरिन् <i>m.</i> The cochineal insect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमिला
तिमिला N. of a musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिमी
तिमी <i>f.</i> (= तिमिः q. v.); L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरयति
तिरयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To conceal, keep concealed or secret.<BR>—2 To hinder, stop, obstruct, obscure; तिरयति करणानां ग्राहकत्वं<BR> प्रमोहः Māl. 1. 40; वारंवारं तिरयति दृशोरुद्गमं बाष्पपूरः 35;<BR> तिरयति वचनम् 9. 30 ‘drowns’.<BR>—3 To conquer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्
तिरस् <i>ind.</i> [तॄ-असुन् स्वरादि]<BR>—1 Crookedly, obliquely, awry; स तिर्यङ् यस्तिरोऽञ्चाति Ak.<BR>—2 Without, apart from.<BR>—3 Secretly, covertly, invisibly; Bṛ. Up. 1. 4. 4.<BR>—4 Across, beyond, over; यदि वासि तिरोजनम् Av. 7. 38. 5.<BR>—5 Indirectly, badly. [In classical literature तिरस् is rarely used<BR> by itself, but chiefly occurs in composition with<BR>——(<i>a</i>) कृ,<BR>——(<i>b</i>) धा, and<BR>——(<i>c</i>) भू; see below.]<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिरःकुड्य, तिरःप्राकार, तिरोगत, तिरोवर्ष<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरःकुड्य
तिरस् + -कुड्य, -प्राकार <i>a.</i> looking through a wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरःप्राकार
तिरस् + -कुड्य, -प्राकार <i>a.</i> looking through a wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरोगत
तिरस् + -गत <i>a.</i> vanished, disappeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरोवर्ष
तिरस् + -वर्ष <i>a.</i> protected from rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्कृ
तिरस्कृ (तिरः-कृ) €8 U.<BR>—1 To despise, contemn आत्मनश्च पेरषां च यः समीक्ष्य बलाबलम् ।<BR> अन्तरं नैव जानाति स तिरस्क्रियतेऽरिभिः ॥ H. 3. 8; Bk. 9. 62.<BR>—2 To blame, scold, abuse; गीर्भिर्गुरूणां परुषाक्षराभिस्तिरस्कृता यान्ति<BR> नरा महत्त्वम् Bv. 1. 73.<BR>—3 To surpass, excel (स्तनद्वयं) तिरश्चकार भ्रमराभिलीनयोः<BR> सुजातयोः पङ्कजकोशयोः श्रियम् R. 3. 8.<BR>—4 To cover, conceal तिरस्क्रियन्ते कृमितन्तुजालैर्विच्छिन्नधूमप्रसरा<BR> गवाक्षाः R. 16. 20; Ms. 4. 49; Amaru. 81.<BR>—5 To set aside, remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्कर
तिरस्कर <i>a.</i> Surpassing, excelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्करिणी
तिरस्क(स्का)रिणी<BR>—1 A curtain, veil; सोऽत्यासाद्य तु तद्वेश्म तिरस्करणिमन्तरा Rām. 2. 15. 20;<BR> तिरस्करिण्यो जलदा भवन्ति Ku. 1. 14; M. 2. 1.<BR>—2 An outer tent, screen of cloth.<BR>—3 A kind of magical veil (or spell) rendering the wearer invisible, Ś. 6.<BR> and V. 2, <i>inter alia</i>. It is properly the science or art possessed<BR> by celestial beings of rendering themselves invisible by repeating some<BR> <i>Mantras</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्कारिणी
तिरस्क(स्का)रिणी<BR>—1 A curtain, veil; सोऽत्यासाद्य तु तद्वेश्म तिरस्करणिमन्तरा Rām. 2. 15. 20;<BR> तिरस्करिण्यो जलदा भवन्ति Ku. 1. 14; M. 2. 1.<BR>—2 An outer tent, screen of cloth.<BR>—3 A kind of magical veil (or spell) rendering the wearer invisible, Ś. 6.<BR> and V. 2, <i>inter alia</i>. It is properly the science or art possessed<BR> by celestial beings of rendering themselves invisible by repeating some<BR> <i>Mantras</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्कारः|तिरस्कार
तिरस्कारः, तिरस्कृतिः <i>f.</i>, तिरस्क्रिया<BR>—1 Contempt, disrespect.<BR>—2 Censure, abuse, reproach; द्विपद्विषः प्रत्युत सा तिरस्क्रिया Śi.<BR>—3 Concealment, disappearance.<BR>—4 A cuirass; लौहस्तिरस्कार इवात्ममन्युः Ki. 17. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्कृतिः|तिरस्कृति
तिरस्कारः, तिरस्कृतिः <i>f.</i>, तिरस्क्रिया<BR>—1 Contempt, disrespect.<BR>—2 Censure, abuse, reproach; द्विपद्विषः प्रत्युत सा तिरस्क्रिया Śi.<BR>—3 Concealment, disappearance.<BR>—4 A cuirass; लौहस्तिरस्कार इवात्ममन्युः Ki. 17. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्क्रिया
तिरस्कारः, तिरस्कृतिः <i>f.</i>, तिरस्क्रिया<BR>—1 Contempt, disrespect.<BR>—2 Censure, abuse, reproach; द्विपद्विषः प्रत्युत सा तिरस्क्रिया Śi.<BR>—3 Concealment, disappearance.<BR>—4 A cuirass; लौहस्तिरस्कार इवात्ममन्युः Ki. 17. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्कारिन्
तिरस्कारिन् <i>a.</i> Excelling; देवि त्वन्मुखपङ्कजेन शशिनः शोभातिरस्कारिणा Ratn. 1. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्कृत|तिरस्कृतः
तिरस्कृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Disregarded, despised.<BR>—2 Abused, condemned.<BR>—3 Concealed, covered.<BR>—4 Disappeared, vanished.<BR>—5 Surpassed, excelled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरोधा
तिरोधा €3 U.<BR>—1 To disappear, vanish; अभिवृष्य मरुत्सस्यं कृष्णमेघस्तिरोदधे R. 10. 48, 11. 91.<BR>—2 To cover, conceal, hide.<BR>—3 To excel, eclipse.<BR>—4 To overpower, conquer, defeat.<BR>—5 To set aside, remove.<BR>—6 To hide oneʼs self from (with abl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरोधानम्
तिरोधानम्<BR>—1 Disappearance, removal; सिद्धान्विद्याधरांश्चैव तिरोधानेन सोऽसृजत्<BR> Bhāg. 3. 20. 44; अथ खलु तिरोधानमधियाम् G. L. 18.<BR>—2 A covering, veil, sheath, a cloth or cloak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरोहित|तिरोहितः
तिरोहित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Concealed, hidden, removed from sight.<BR>—2 Vanished, disappeared.<BR>—3 Hard to understand, mystic; नात्र तिरोहितमिवास्ति Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरोभू
तिरोभू €1 P. To disappear, vanish; Bk. 6. 71, 14. 44. ━<i>Caus.</i> To dispel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरोभावः|तिरोभाव
तिरोभावः Disappearance; आत्मत आविर्भावतिरोभावौ Ch. Up. 7. 26. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरस्यति
तिरस्यति Den. P. To disappear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरोहयति
तिरोहयति Den. P. To hide, conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यच्|तिर्य्यच्
तिर्यच्, तिर्यञ्च <i>a.</i> (तिरश्ची <i>f.</i>, rarely तिर्यञ्ची)<BR>—1 Oblique, transverse, horizontal, awry; तिर्यगूर्ध्वमधस्ताच्च व्यापको<BR> महिमा हरेः Ku. 6. 71.<BR>—2 Crooked, curved.<BR>—3 Crossing over, traversing.<BR>—4 Winding. —5 Lying in the middle or between. ━<i>m., n.</i><BR>—1 An animal (going horizontally as distinguished from man who walks erect),<BR> a lower or irrational animal; बन्धाय दिव्ये न तिरश्चि कश्चित् पाशादिरासादितपौरुषः<BR> स्यात् N. 3. 20; Ku. 1. 48.<BR>—2 A bird.<BR>—3 (With Jainas) The organic world, or plants.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिर्यगन्तरम्, तिर्यगयनम्, तिर्यगीक्ष, तिर्यगीशः, तिर्यग्गः, तिर्यग्गतिः, तिर्यग्गुणनम्, तिर्यग्ज, तिर्यग्जनः, तिर्यग्जातिः, तिर्यग्ज्या, तिर्यग्दिश्, तिर्यक्प्रमाणम्, तिर्यक्प्रेक्षणम्, तिर्यक्प्रेक्षण, तिर्यक्प्रेक्षिन्, तिर्यग्यानः, तिर्यग्योनः, तिर्यग्योनिः, तिर्यक्सूत्रम्, तिर्यक्स्रोतस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यञ्च
तिर्यच्, तिर्यञ्च <i>a.</i> (तिरश्ची <i>f.</i>, rarely तिर्यञ्ची)<BR>—1 Oblique, transverse, horizontal, awry; तिर्यगूर्ध्वमधस्ताच्च व्यापको<BR> महिमा हरेः Ku. 6. 71.<BR>—2 Crooked, curved.<BR>—3 Crossing over, traversing.<BR>—4 Winding. —5 Lying in the middle or between. ━<i>m., n.</i><BR>—1 An animal (going horizontally as distinguished from man who walks erect),<BR> a lower or irrational animal; बन्धाय दिव्ये न तिरश्चि कश्चित् पाशादिरासादितपौरुषः<BR> स्यात् N. 3. 20; Ku. 1. 48.<BR>—2 A bird.<BR>—3 (With Jainas) The organic world, or plants.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिर्यगन्तरम्, तिर्यगयनम्, तिर्यगीक्ष, तिर्यगीशः, तिर्यग्गः, तिर्यग्गतिः, तिर्यग्गुणनम्, तिर्यग्ज, तिर्यग्जनः, तिर्यग्जातिः, तिर्यग्ज्या, तिर्यग्दिश्, तिर्यक्प्रमाणम्, तिर्यक्प्रेक्षणम्, तिर्यक्प्रेक्षण, तिर्यक्प्रेक्षिन्, तिर्यग्यानः, तिर्यग्योनः, तिर्यग्योनिः, तिर्यक्सूत्रम्, तिर्यक्स्रोतस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यगन्तरम्
तिर्यच् + -अन्तरम् intermediate space measured across, breadth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यगयनम्
तिर्यच् + -अयनम् the annual revolution of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यगीक्ष
