तिर्यगीशः|तिर्यगीश
तिर्यच् + -ईशः an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यग्गः|तिर्यग्ग
तिर्यच् + -गः an animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यग्गतिः|तिर्यग्गति
तिर्यच् + -गतिः transmigration of animals.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">Page0774-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0773-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यग्गुणनम्
तिर्यच् + -गुणनम् oblique multiplication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यग्ज|तिर्य्यग्ज
तिर्यच् + -ज <i>a.</i> born or begotten by an animal; यस्माद्बीजप्रभावेण<BR> तिर्यग्जा ऋषयोऽभवन् Ms. 10. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यग्जनः|तिर्यग्जन
तिर्यच् + -जनः an animal; Bhāg. 2. 7. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यग्जातिः|तिर्यग्जाति|तिर्य्यग्जाति
