तिर्यग्ज्या
तिर्यच् + -ज्या an oblique chord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यग्दिश्
तिर्यच् + -दिश् <i>f.</i> any horizontal region (opposed to nadir and zenith.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यक्प्रमाणम्
तिर्यच् + -प्रमाणम् breadth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यक्प्रेक्षणम्
तिर्यच् + -प्रेक्षणम् a side-look.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यक्प्रेक्षण
तिर्यच् + -प्रेक्षण, -प्रेक्षिन् a looking obliquely; Bhāg. 5. 26. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यक्प्रेक्षिन्
तिर्यच् + -प्रेक्षण, -प्रेक्षिन् a looking obliquely; Bhāg. 5. 26. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

