तिर्यच् + -यानः a crab.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यग्योनः|तिर्यग्योन
तिर्यच् + -योनः an animal; Ms. 7. 149.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यग्योनिः|तिर्यग्योनि|तिर्य्यग्योनि
तिर्यच् + -योनिः <i>f.</i> animal creation or race; तिर्यग्योनौ च जायते Ms. 4. 200.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यक्सूत्रम्
तिर्यच् + -सूत्रम् a cross-line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यक्स्रोतस्|तिर्य्यक्स्रोतस्
