तिर्यक्त्वम्
तिर्यक्ता, -क्त्वम्<BR>—1 Animal nature.<BR>—2 Breadth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

