तिरश्ची, तिर्यञ्ची The female of an animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिर्यञ्ची|तिर्य्यञ्ची
तिरश्ची, तिर्यञ्ची The female of an animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरश्चीन
तिरश्चीन <i>a.</i> [तिर्यगेव स्वार्थे ख]<BR>—1 Oblique, sideways, awry; गतं तिरश्चीनमनूरुसारथेः Śi. 1. 2;<BR> यथा तिरश्चीनमलातशल्यम् U. 3. 35.<BR>—2 Irregular.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिरश्चीनवंशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरश्चीनवंशः|तिरश्चीनवंश
तिरश्चीन + -वंशः a bee-hive; आदित्यो देवमधु तस्य द्यौरेव तिरश्चीनवंशोऽन्तरिक्षम्<BR> Ch. Up. 3. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरीटम्
तिरीटम् A crown; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिरीटः|तिरीट|तिरीटं
तिरीटम् + .{@-टः@} The Lodhra plant; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिल्
तिल् I. €1 P. (तेलति) To go, move. ━II. €6 P., €10 U. (तिलति, तेलयति-ते)<BR>—1 To be unctuous or greasy.<BR>—2 To anoint, smear with oil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलः|तिल
तिलः [तिल्-क्]<BR>—1 The seasamum plant; नासाभ्येति तिलप्रसूनपदवीम् Gīt. 10.<BR>—2 The seed of this plant; नाकस्माच्छाण्डिलीमाता विक्रीणाति तिलैस्तिलान् ।<BR> लुञ्चितानितरैर्येन कार्यमत्र भविष्यति ॥ Pt. 2. 70.<BR>—3 A mole, spot.<BR>—5 A small particle, as much as a sesamum-seed; तिले तालं पश्यति<BR> ‘makes mountains of mole-hills’.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तिलान्नम्, तिलाप्, तिलाम्बु, तिलोदकम्, तिलोत्तमा, तिलौदनः, तिलौदनम्, तिलकठः, तिलकल्कः, तिलकालकः, तिलकिट्टम्, तिलखलिः, तिलचतुर्थी, तिलतण्डुलकम्, तिलतैलम्, तिलद्वादशी, तिलधेनुः, तिलपर्णः, तिलपर्णी, तिलपर्णिका, तिलपर्णिकम्, तिलपर्णकम्, तिलपिच्चटम्, तिलपिञ्जः, तिलपेजः, तिलपीडः, तिलभाविनी, तिलमयूरः, तिलरसः, तिलस्नेहः, तिलहोमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलान्नम्
तिलः + -अन्नम् rice with sesamum seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलाप्
तिलः + -अप्, -अम्बु, -उदकम् water with sesamum seed offered to the dead<BR> as a libation; एते यदा मत्सुहृदोस्तिलापः Bhāg. 10. 12. 15; श्राद्धानि<BR> नोऽधिभुजे प्रसभं तनूजैर्दत्तानि तीर्थसमयेऽप्यपिबत्तिलाम्बु Bhāg. 7. 8. 45;<BR> Ś. 3; तेषां दत्त्वा तु हस्तेषु सपवित्रं तिलोकदम् Ms. 3. 223.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलाम्बु|तिलांबु
तिलः + -अप्, -अम्बु, -उदकम् water with sesamum seed offered to the dead<BR> as a libation; एते यदा मत्सुहृदोस्तिलापः Bhāg. 10. 12. 15; श्राद्धानि<BR> नोऽधिभुजे प्रसभं तनूजैर्दत्तानि तीर्थसमयेऽप्यपिबत्तिलाम्बु Bhāg. 7. 8. 45;<BR> Ś. 3; तेषां दत्त्वा तु हस्तेषु सपवित्रं तिलोकदम् Ms. 3. 223.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलोदकम्
तिलः + -अप्, -अम्बु, -उदकम् water with sesamum seed offered to the dead<BR> as a libation; एते यदा मत्सुहृदोस्तिलापः Bhāg. 10. 12. 15; श्राद्धानि<BR> नोऽधिभुजे प्रसभं तनूजैर्दत्तानि तीर्थसमयेऽप्यपिबत्तिलाम्बु Bhāg. 7. 8. 45;<BR> Ś. 3; तेषां दत्त्वा तु हस्तेषु सपवित्रं तिलोकदम् Ms. 3. 223.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलोत्तमा
तिलः + -उत्तमा N. of an Apsaras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलौदनः|तिलौदन|तिलौदनं
तिलः + -ओदनः, -ओदनम् a dish of milk, rice and sesamum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलौदनम्
तिलः + -ओदनः, -ओदनम् a dish of milk, rice and sesamum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलकठः
तिलः + -कठः sesamum powder (Mar. तिळकूट).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलकल्कः|तिलकल्क
तिलः + -कल्कः dough made of ground sesamum. ˚जः oil-cake made of<BR> the sediment of ground sesamum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलकालकः|तिलकालक
तिलः + -कालकः<BR>—1 a mole, a dark spot under the skin.<BR>—2 a disease of the penis, in which the fleshy parts become black and die off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलकिट्टम्
तिलः + -किट्टम्, -खलिः <i>f.</i>, {@-खली, -चूर्णम्@}<BR> the caky sediment of sesamum after the oil is extracted;<BR> स्थाल्यां वैदूर्यमय्यां पचति तिलखलीमिन्धनैश्चन्दनाद्यैः Bh. 2. 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलखलिः|तिलखलि
तिलः + -किट्टम्, -खलिः <i>f.</i>, {@-खली, -चूर्णम्@}<BR> the caky sediment of sesamum after the oil is extracted;<BR> स्थाल्यां वैदूर्यमय्यां पचति तिलखलीमिन्धनैश्चन्दनाद्यैः Bh. 2. 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलचतुर्थी
तिलः + -चतुर्थी The 4th day of the dark-half of Māgha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलतण्डुलकम्
तिलः + -तण्डुलकम् an embrace (so called because in it the two bodies<BR> are united together like rice mixed up with sesamum-seed).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलतैलम्
तिलः + -तैलम् sesamum-oil;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलद्वादशी
तिलः + -द्वादशी The 12th day of a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-2" target="_blank">Page0774-2</a>]<BR> particular month (kept as a festival); तां रणखामिनं द्रष्टुं तिलद्वादश्यहे<BR> गताम् Rāj. T. 5. 395.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलधेनुः|तिलधेनु
तिलः + -धेनुः <i>f.</i> sesamum made up in the form of a cow and offered<BR> as a present to a Brāhmaṇa. ‘यावता वस्त्रेण कृत्स्ना धेनुराच्छादिता भवति तद्वस्त्रपूरिततिलाः’<BR> is the another meaning given in the com.;<BR> भरणीषु द्विजातिभ्यस्तिलधेनुं प्रदाय वै Mb. 13. 64. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलपर्णः|तिलपर्ण|तिलपर्णं
तिलः + -पर्णः turpentine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तिलपर्णम्
