तिलपर्णी|तिलपर्ण्णी
तिलः + -पर्णी<BR>—1 the sandal tree.<BR>—2 frankincense.<BR>—3 turpentine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0774-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

