तीक्ष्णदंष्ट्रः|तीक्ष्णदंष्ट्र
तीक्ष्ण + -दंष्ट्रः a tiger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0775-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

