तीक्ष्ण + -दंष्ट्रकः a leopard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0775-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीक्ष्णधारः|तीक्ष्णधार
तीक्ष्ण + -धारः a sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0775-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

