तीक्ष्णपुष्पा
तीक्ष्ण + -पुष्पा<BR>—1 the clove tree.<BR>—2 the Ketaka plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0775-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीक्ष्णफलम्
तीक्ष्ण + -फलम्<BR>—1 coriander.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0775-2" target="_blank">Page0775-2</a>]<BR>—2 black mustard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0775-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीक्ष्णबुद्धि
