तीक्ष्णसारः|तीक्ष्णसार
तीक्ष्ण + -सारः iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0775-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीम्
तीम् €4 P. (तीम्यति) To be wet or moist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0775-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीर्
तीर् €10 U. (तीरयति-ते)<BR>—1 To get through, cross over.<BR>—2 To finish, accomplish, settle, adjust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0775-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीरम्
तीरम्<BR>—1 A shore, bank; नदीतीर, सागरतीर &c.<BR>—2 Margin, brim, edge.<BR>—3 The bank of the Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0775-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

