तुज्
तुज्, तुञ्ज् €1 P. (तुञ्जति; also Ā. and €10 P.) Ved.<BR>—1 To reach, extend, convey.<BR>—2 To kill, hurt, injure.<BR>—3 To guard, protect.<BR>—4 To clothe.<BR>—5 To live.<BR>—6 To strike, hit.<BR>—7 To push.<BR>—8 To emit, send forth.<BR>—9 To incite, instigate, urge onwards.<BR>—10 To give.<BR>—11 To press out.<BR>—12 To flow forth; सुरेतसा श्रवसा तुञ्जमाना Rv. 3. 1. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0777-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुञ्ज्
तुज्, तुञ्ज् €1 P. (तुञ्जति; also Ā. and €10 P.) Ved.<BR>—1 To reach, extend, convey.<BR>—2 To kill, hurt, injure.<BR>—3 To guard, protect.<BR>—4 To clothe.<BR>—5 To live.<BR>—6 To strike, hit.<BR>—7 To push.<BR>—8 To emit, send forth.<BR>—9 To incite, instigate, urge onwards.<BR>—10 To give.<BR>—11 To press out.<BR>—12 To flow forth; सुरेतसा श्रवसा तुञ्जमाना Rv. 3. 1. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0777-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुज|तुजः
