तुमुल + .{@-लः, -लम्@}<BR>—1 An uproar, a tumult, clang.<BR>—2 A confused combat, melee; (also तुमुर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0778-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

