तुम्बा|तुंबा
तुम्बः + .{@-तुम्बा@}<BR>—1 A kind of long gourd.<BR>—2 A milch cow.<BR>—3 milk-vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0778-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

