तुम्र
तुम्र <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Destroying, defeating, killing.<BR>—2 Impelling.<BR>—3 Energetic, strong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0778-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्
तुर् I. €6 U. (तुरति-ते)<BR>—1 To hurry, hasten; सहः सहिष्ठ तुरतस्तुरस्य Rv. 6. 18. 4.<BR>—2 To overcome.<BR>—3 To injure.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0778-2" target="_blank">Page0778-2</a>]<BR>━II. €3 P. (तुतोर्ति) To run.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0778-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्
