तुरीयम्
तुरीय + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 A quarter, a fourth part, fourth.<BR>—2 (In Vedānta phil.) The fourth state of the soul in which it becomes<BR> one with Brahman or the Supreme Spirit.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तुरीयवर्णः, तुरीयजातिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरीयवर्णः|तुरीयवर्ण
तुरीय + -वर्णः, -जातिः a man of the fourth caste, a Śūdra; तुरीयजातिं<BR> तिलकयन् कुलोत्तुङ्ग इति यथार्थनामा बभूव शूद्रः । चोलचम्पू p. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरीयजातिः
तुरीय + -वर्णः, -जातिः a man of the fourth caste, a Śūdra; तुरीयजातिं<BR> तिलकयन् कुलोत्तुङ्ग इति यथार्थनामा बभूव शूद्रः । चोलचम्पू p. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरीयक
तुरीयक <i>a.</i> A fourth (part); भगिन्यश्च निजादंशाद्दत्त्वांशं<BR> तु तुरीयकम् Y. 2. 124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्य|तुर्य्य|तुर्य्यः
तुर्य <i>a.</i> Fourth; N. 4. 123.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्यम्
तुर्य + .{@-र्यम्@}<BR>—1 A quarter, a fourth part.<BR>—2 (In Vedānta phil.) The fourth state of the soul in which it becomes<BR> one with Brahman.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तुर्ययन्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्ययन्त्रम्
तुर्य + -यन्त्रम् a quadrant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुरुष्काः
तुरुष्काः <i>m.</i> (pl.) N. of a people, the Turks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्फरी
तुर्फरी, तुर्फरीतु <i>a.</i> Ved. Killing (हन्तृ); सृण्येव<BR> जर्भरी तुर्फरीतू नैतोशेव तुर्फरी पर्फरीका Rv. 10. 106. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्फरीतु
तुर्फरी, तुर्फरीतु <i>a.</i> Ved. Killing (हन्तृ); सृण्येव<BR> जर्भरी तुर्फरीतू नैतोशेव तुर्फरी पर्फरीका Rv. 10. 106. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्व्
तुर्व् €1 P. (तु(तू)र्वति) Ved.<BR>—1 To injure, hurt, kill; वृत्रं यदिन्द्र तूर्वसि Rv. 8. 99. 6.<BR>—2 To excel.<BR>—3 To overpower.<BR>—4 To save.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुर्वणि
तुर्वणि <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Acting or moving quickly.<BR>—2 Injuring or destroying enemies, victorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्
तुल् €1 P., €10 U. [तोलति-तोलयति-ते; also तुलयति-ते which<BR> some suppose to be a denominative from तुला]<BR>—1 To weigh, measure; तुलयामास कौन्तेय कपोतेन समं विभो । Mb. 3. 131. 26.<BR>—2 To weigh in the mind, ponder, consider.<BR>—3 To raise, lift up; कैलासे तुलिते Mv. 5. 37; पौलस्त्यतुलितस्याद्रेरादधान<BR> इव ह्रियम् R. 4. 80, 12. 89; Śi. 15. 30.<BR>—4 To bear up, hold up, support; पृथिवीतले तुलितभूभृदुच्यसे Śi. 15. 30, 61.<BR>—5 To compare, equal, liken (with instr.); तृणमिव तुलयन्ति Pt. 5. 31;<BR> मुखं श्लेष्मागारं तदपि च शशाङ्केन तुलितम् Bh. 3. 20; Śi. 8. 12.<BR>—6 To match, be equal to (with acc.); प्रासादास्त्वां तुलयितुमलं यत्र<BR> तैस्तैर्विशेषैः Me. 66.<BR>—7 To make light of, contemn, despise; अन्तःसारं घन तुलयितुं नानिलः<BR> शक्ष्यति त्वाम् Me. 20 (where तुल् also means ‘to bear up’ or ‘carry away’<BR>); Śi. 15. 30.<BR>—8 To suspect, examine with distrust; कः श्रद्धास्यति भूतार्थं सर्वो<BR> मां तुलयिष्यति Mk. 3. 24, 5. 43 (where some editions read तूलयिष्यति<BR> for तुलयिष्यति).<BR>—9 To try, put to test, reduce to a wretched state; हा अवस्थे तुलयसि<BR> Mk. 1 (तूलयसि v. l.)<BR>—10 To counter-balance, outweigh; तुलयाम लवेनापि न स्वर्गं नापुनर्भवम् ।<BR> भगवत्सङ्गिसङ्गस्य मर्त्यानां किमुताशिषः ॥ Bhāg. 1. 8. 13.<BR>—11 To have in the same degree, attain or reach to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलनम्
तुलनम् [तुल्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Weight.<BR>—2 Lifting, weighing; तुलनं चाद्रिराजस्य Mk. 9. 20.<BR>—3 Comparing, likening &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलना
तुलनम् + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 Comparison, equalness with; कुचौ किंचिन्मीलत्कमलतुलनां कन्दलयतः P. R. 2. 16.<BR>—2 Weighing.<BR>—3 Lifting, raising.<BR>—4 Rating, assessing, estimating.<BR>—5 Examining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुला
तुला [तुल्-भिदा˚ अङ्]<BR>—1 A balance; तस्मात्तेऽद्य प्रदास्यामि स्वमांसं तुलया धृतम् Mb. 3. 131. 25;<BR> the beam of a balance;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">Page0779-2</a>]<BR> तुलया धृ to hold in a balance, to weigh, consider equal; अश्वमेधसहस्राणि<BR> सत्यं च तुलया धृतम् H. 4. 131, v. l.<BR>—2 A measure, weight.<BR>—3 Weighing.<BR>—4 Resemblance, likeness, equality, similarity (with gen., instr. or in<BR> comp.); किं धूर्जटेरिव तुलामुपयाति संख्ये Ve. 3. 8; तुलां यदारोहति<BR> दन्तवाससा Ku. 5. 34; R. 8. 15; सद्यः परस्परतुलामधिरोहतां द्वे<BR> R. 5. 68, 19. 8, 50.<BR>—5 Libra, the seventh sign of the zodiac; जयति तुलामधिरूढो भास्वानपि<BR> जलदपटलानि Pt. 1. 330.<BR>—6 A sloping beam or timber in the roof of a house.<BR>—7 A measure of gold or silver equal to 100 <i>palas</i>.<BR>—8 A kind of beam in the roof of a house (Mar. तुळई); Bṛ. S. 53. 30.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तुलाधिरोहणम्, तुलानुमानम्, तुलाकूटः, तुलाकोटिः, तुलाकोटीः, तुलाकोशः, तुलाकोषः, तुलागुडः, तुलादानम्, तुलाधटः, तुलाधरः, तुलाधारः, तुलाधारणम्, तुलापरीक्षा, तुलापुरुषः, तुलाभारः, तुलाप्रग्रहः, तुलाप्रग्राहः, तुलामानम्, तुलायष्टिः, तुलाबीजम्, तुलासूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाधिरोहणम्
तुला + -अधिरोहणम् resembling; नवदिवाकरातपस्पृष्टपङ्कजतुलाधिरोहणम् R. 19. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलानुमानम्
तुला + -अनुमानम् like inference, analogy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाकूटः|तुलाकूट
तुला + -कूटः a false weight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाकोटिः|तुलाकोटि
तुला + -कोटिः, -कोटीः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 an ornament (an anklet or नूपुर) worn on the feet by women; cf.<BR> तुलाकोटिस्तु मञ्जीरे Nm.; लीलाचलत्स्त्रीचरणारुणोत्पलस्खलत्तुलाकोटिनिनादकोमलः Śi. 12. 44.<BR>—2 a hundred millions (अर्बुद).<BR>—3 the end of the beam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाकोटीः
तुला + -कोटिः, -कोटीः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 an ornament (an anklet or नूपुर) worn on the feet by women; cf.<BR> तुलाकोटिस्तु मञ्जीरे Nm.; लीलाचलत्स्त्रीचरणारुणोत्पलस्खलत्तुलाकोटिनिनादकोमलः Śi. 12. 44.<BR>—2 a hundred millions (अर्बुद).<BR>—3 the end of the beam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाकोशः|तुलाकोश
तुला + -कोशः, -कोषः<BR>—1 ordeal by weighing, weighing on a balance; हीनस्य नाशोऽभ्यधिकस्य<BR> वृद्धिस्तुल्येन तुल्यं तुलितं तुलायाम् । एतत्तुलाकोशरहस्यमुक्तम् …<BR> Bṛ. S. 26. 10.<BR>—2 a place where a balance is kept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाकोषः|तुलाकोष
तुला + -कोशः, -कोषः<BR>—1 ordeal by weighing, weighing on a balance; हीनस्य नाशोऽभ्यधिकस्य<BR> वृद्धिस्तुल्येन तुल्यं तुलितं तुलायाम् । एतत्तुलाकोशरहस्यमुक्तम् …<BR> Bṛ. S. 26. 10.<BR>—2 a place where a balance is kept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलागुडः|तुलागुड
तुला + -गुडः a kind of ball (used as missile); Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलादानम्
तुला + -दानम् the gift to a Brāhmaṇa of as much gold or silver as equals<BR> the weight of oneʼs body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाधटः|तुलाधट
तुला + -धटः<BR>—1 the scale of a balance.<BR>—2 an oar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाधरः|तुलाधर
तुला + -धरः<BR>—1 a trader, merchant.<BR>—2 the sign <i>Libra</i> of the zodiac. —3 The sun; तुलाधरस्तु वणिजि<BR> श्लक्ष्णराशौ दिवाकरे Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाधारः|तुलाधार
तुला + -धारः a dealer, trader, or merchant.<BR>—2 the string of a balance.<BR>—3 the beam.<BR>—4 the sign <i>Libra</i> of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाधारणम्
तुला + -धारणम् weighing; तुलाधारणविद्वद्भिरभियुक्तस्तुलाश्रितः Y. 2. 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलापरीक्षा
तुला + -परीक्षा ordeal by the balance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलापुरुषः|तुलापुरुष
तुला + -पुरुषः, -भारः gold, jewels or other valuable things equal to<BR> a manʼs weight (given to a Brāhmaṇa as a gift); cf. तुलादान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाभारः|तुलाभार
तुला + -पुरुषः, -भारः gold, jewels or other valuable things equal to<BR> a manʼs weight (given to a Brāhmaṇa as a gift); cf. तुलादान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाप्रग्रहः|तुलाप्रग्रह
तुला + -प्रग्रहः, -प्रग्राहः the string or beam of a balance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाप्रग्राहः|तुलाप्रग्राह
तुला + -प्रग्रहः, -प्रग्राहः the string or beam of a balance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलामानम्
तुला + -मानम्, -यष्टिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 the beam of a balance; स्तोकेनोन्नतिमायाति स्तोकेनायात्यधोगतिम् ।<BR> अहो सुसदृशी चेष्टा तुलायष्टेः खलस्य च ॥ Pt. 1. 150.<BR>—2<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलायष्टिः|तुलायष्टि
तुला + -मानम्, -यष्टिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 the beam of a balance; स्तोकेनोन्नतिमायाति स्तोकेनायात्यधोगतिम् ।<BR> अहो सुसदृशी चेष्टा तुलायष्टेः खलस्य च ॥ Pt. 1. 150.<BR>—2<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलामानम्
तुला + -मानम्, -यष्टिः + ({@-मानम्@})<BR> weights and measures; Kau. A. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलाबीजम्
तुला + -बीजम् the berry of the Guñjā plant (used as a weight).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलासूत्रम्
तुला + -सूत्रम् the string of a balance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलित
तुलित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Weighed, counterpoised.<BR>—2 Compared, likened, equalled; Bh. 3. 36; योगीन्द्रपाणितुलितायुधलूनपक्षः<BR> Śi.; see तुल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्य|तुल्यः
तुल्य <i>a.</i> [तुलया संमितं यत्]<BR>—1 Of the same kind or class, well-matched, similar, like, equal, resembling<BR> (with gen., instr. or in comp.); Ms. 4. 86; Y. 2. 77; R. 2. 35 (v. l.); 12. 80;<BR> लोकेन भावी पितुरेव तुल्यः संभावितो मालिपरिग्रहात् सः 18. 38.<BR>—2 Fit for.<BR>—3 Identical, same.<BR>—4 Indifferent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यम्
तुल्य + .{@-ल्यम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Simultaneously; ययोर्मृत्युर्विवासश्च त्वकृते तुल्यमागतौ Rām. 2. 74. 3.<BR>—2 Equally, in a like manner.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तुल्यकक्ष, तुल्यदर्शन, तुल्यनक्तंदिन, तुल्यनिन्दास्तुति, तुल्यन्याय, तुल्यपाक, तुल्यपानम्, तुल्यभावना, तुल्यमूल्य, तुल्ययोगिता, तुल्यरूप, तुल्यशुद्धि, तुल्यशोधनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यकक्ष
तुल्य + -कक्ष <i>a.</i> equal to; यदि तत्तुल्यकक्षोऽत्र भवान् धुरि न<BR> युज्यते Ve. 3. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यदर्शन
तुल्य + -दर्शन <i>a.</i> regarding with the same or indifferent eyes; चक्रुः<BR> कृपां यद्यपि तुल्यदर्शनाः Bhāg. 1. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यनक्तंदिन
तुल्य + -नक्तंदिन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having equal days<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">Page0780-1</a>]<BR> and nights.<BR>—2 not distinguishing between day and night; ताप्यमानः स बभ्राम तुल्यनक्तंदिनश्चिरम् Ks. 101. 280.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0779-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यनिन्दास्तुति
तुल्य + -निन्दास्तुति <i>a.</i> indifferent to blame or praise; Bg. 12. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यन्याय
तुल्य + -न्याय <i>a.</i> that to which the same principle or rule is applicable,<BR> a similar (case); तदेतद् न्यायपूर्वकं लिङ्गमेकत्रापि दृश्यमानं तुल्यन्यायानां<BR> सर्वेषां धर्मवत्तां ज्ञापयति । ŚB. on MS. 7. 4. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यपाक
तुल्य + -पाक <i>a.</i> Having equal heat, being equally heated; यथा स्थाल्यां<BR> तुल्यपाकानामेकमुपमृद्यमन्येषामपि सिद्धतां जानाति । ŚB. on MS. 7. 4. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यपानम्
तुल्य + -पानम् drinking together, compotation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यभावना
तुल्य + -भावना (in arith.) combination of like sets of magnitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यमूल्य
तुल्य + -मूल्य <i>a.</i> of equal value.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्ययोगिता
तुल्य + -योगिता (in Rhet.) Equal Pairing, a figure of speech, a combination<BR> of several objects having the same attribute, the objects being either<BR> all relevant or all irrelevant; नियतानां सकृद्धर्मः सा पुनस्तुल्ययोगिता<BR> K. P. 10; cf. Candr. 5. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यरूप
तुल्य + -रूप <i>a.</i> like, similar, analogous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यशुद्धि
तुल्य + -शुद्धि <i>f.</i> equal substraction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यशोधनम्
तुल्य + -शोधनम् reducing an equation by removing the like terms on both sides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुल्यशः
तुल्यशः <i>ind.</i> In equal parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोलः|तोल|तोलं
तोलः, -लम्<BR> [तुल्-कर्मणि अच्]<BR>—1 Weight or quantity measured by the balance.<BR>—2 A weight of gold or silver equal to 12 māṣas or a tolā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोलम्
तोलः, -लम्<BR> [तुल्-कर्मणि अच्]<BR>—1 Weight or quantity measured by the balance.<BR>—2 A weight of gold or silver equal to 12 māṣas or a tolā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोलनम्
तोलनम् Raising, lifting, weighing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोल्य
तोल्य <i>a.</i> To be weighed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोल्यम्
तोल्य + .{@-ल्यम्@} Weighing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलसारिणी
तुलसारिणी A quiver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलसि
तुलसि (Metrically for तुलसी), तुलसिका<BR> See तुलसी; वाचश्च नस्तुलसिवद्यदि तेऽङ्घ्निशोभाः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 15. 49; तुलसिकादूर्वाङ्कुरैरपि … परितुष्यसि 5. 3. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलसिका
तुलसि (Metrically for तुलसी), तुलसिका<BR> See तुलसी; वाचश्च नस्तुलसिवद्यदि तेऽङ्घ्निशोभाः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 15. 49; तुलसिकादूर्वाङ्कुरैरपि … परितुष्यसि 5. 3. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलसी
तुलसी [तुलां सादृश्यं स्यति, सो-क गौरा˚ ङीष् शंकध्वा. Tv.]<BR> The holy basil held in veneration by the Hindus, especially by the worshippers of Viṣṇu.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तुलसीपत्रम्, तुलसीविवाहः, तुलसीवृन्दावनः, तुलसीवृन्दावनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलसीपत्रम्
तुलसी + -पत्रम् (lit.) a Tulasī leaf; (fig.) a very small gift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलसीविवाहः|तुलसीविवाह
तुलसी + -विवाहः the marriage of an image of Bālakriṣṇa with the holy<BR> basil, performed on the 12th day of the bright half of Kārtika.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलसीवृन्दावनः|तुलसीवृन्दावन
तुलसी + -वृन्दावनः, -वृन्दावनम् a square pedestal in which the sacred basil is planted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलसीवृन्दावनम्
तुलसी + -वृन्दावनः, -वृन्दावनम् a square pedestal in which the sacred basil is planted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलिः|तुलि
तुलिः, -ली <i>f.</i><BR> = तुरी (1) and (2) q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुली
तुलिः, -ली <i>f.</i><BR> = तुरी (1) and (2) q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुलिका
तुलिका A wagtail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुवर|तुवरः
तुवर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Astringent.<BR>—2 Beardless; also तूवर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुवरः|तुवर
तुवर + .{@-रः, -रम्@} An astringent taste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुवरम्
तुवर + .{@-रः, -रम्@} An astringent taste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुवरी
तुवर + .{@-री@}<BR>—1 A fragrant earth<BR>—2 Alum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुवरिका
तुवरिका<BR>—1 kind of earth.<BR>—2 Alum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुवि|तुविः
तुवि <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Much, many; महाव्रातस्तुविकूर्मिरृघावान् Rv. 3. 30. 3.<BR>—2 Strong, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुविः|तुवि
तुवि + .{@-विः@} <i>f.</i> A long gourd (तुम्बी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुविस्
तुविस् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Growth.<BR>—2 Strength.<BR>—3 Intellect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुश्
तुश् Ved. €1 Ā. (तोशते)<BR>—1 To strike, hurt, kill.<BR>—2 To be pressed out or extracted.<BR>—3 To trickle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्
तुष् €4 P. (तुष्यति, तुष्ट)<BR>—1 To be pleased or satisfied, be contented or delighted with anything<BR> (usually with instr.); रत्नैर्महार्हैस्तुतुषुर्न देवाः Bh. 2. 80; Ms. 3. 207;<BR> Bg. 2. 55; Bk. 2. 13, 15. 8; R. 3. 62.<BR>—2 To become calm or quiet.<BR>—3 To satisfy, please (with acc.). ━<i>Caus.</i> (तोषयति-ते) To<BR> please, gratify, satisfy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्ट|तुष्टः
तुष्ट <i>p. p.</i> [तुष् कर्तरि क्त]<BR>—1 Pleased, satisfied, delighted, gratified, contented.<BR>—2 Contented with what one possesses and indifferent to everything else.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्टः|तुष्ट
तुष्ट + .{@-ष्टः@} N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुष्टिः|तुष्टि
तुष्टिः <i>f.</i> [तुष्-भावे-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Satisfaction, gratification, pleasure, contentment.<BR>—2 (In Sāṅ. phil.) Acquiescence, indifference to everything except what is possessed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषः|तोष
तोषः [तुष्-भावे घञ्] Satisfaction, contentment, pleasure, delight.<BR>━<i>a.</i> Pleasing, gratifying; तत्कर्म हरितोषं यत्सा विद्या तन्मतिर्यया<BR> Bhāg. 4. 29. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषण
तोषण <i>a.</i> [तुष्-कर्तरि ल्यु] Satisfying, gratifying, pleasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषणम्
तोषण + .{@-णम्@} [भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Satisfaction, gratification, contentment.<BR>—2 Anything that gives satisfaction, a gratification.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषणी
तोषण + .{@-णी@} An epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषित
तोषित <i>a.</i> Pleased, satisfied &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषिन्
तोषिन् <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.)<BR>—1 Pleased with.<BR>—2 Gladdening, satisfying; अथानुरूपाभिनिवेशतोषिणा Ku. 5. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषः|तुष
तुषः [तुष्-क]<BR>—1 The husk or chaff of grain; अजानतार्थ तत्सर्व (अध्ययनं)<BR> तुषाणां कण्डनं यथा; Ms. 4. 78.<BR>—2 The Bibhītaka tree.<BR>—3 Fault; L. D. B.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तुषाग्निः, तुषानलः, तुषाम्बु, तुषग्रहः, तुषसारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषाग्निः|तुषाग्नि
तुषः + -अग्निः, -अनलः<BR>—1 fire of the chaff or husk of corn.<BR>—2 a mode of capital punishment consisting in twisting straw round the<BR> limbs of a criminal and then setting it on fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषानलः|तुषानल
तुषः + -अग्निः, -अनलः<BR>—1 fire of the chaff or husk of corn.<BR>—2 a mode of capital punishment consisting in twisting straw round the<BR> limbs of a criminal and then setting it on fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषाम्बु|तुषांबु
तुषः + -अम्बु <i>n.</i>, {@-उदकम्, -उत्थम्@}<BR> sour rice-gruel or barley gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषग्रहः|तुषग्रह
तुषः + -ग्रहः, -सारः fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषसारः|तुषसार
तुषः + -ग्रहः, -सारः fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषार|तुषारः
तुषार <i>a.</i> [तुष्-आरन् किच्च Uṇ. 3. 139.] Cold, frigid, frosty<BR> or dewy; अपां हि तृप्ताय न वारिधारा स्वादुः सुगन्धिः स्वदते तुषारा<BR> N. 3. 93; Śi. 9. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तुषारः|तुषार
तुषार + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 Frost, cold; तुषारवृष्टिक्षतपद्मसम्पदाम् Ku. 5. 27.<BR>—2 Ice, snow; पदं तुषारस्रुतिधौतरक्तम् Ku. 1. 6; प्रपतत्तुषारो<BR> हेमन्तकालः Ṛs. 4. 1.<BR>—3 Dew; R. 14. 84; Ś. 5. 19.<BR>—4 Mist, thin rain, spray, especially of cold water; पृक्तस्तुषारैर्गिरिनिझर्राणाम्<BR> R. 2. 13, 9. 68; U. 5. 3.<BR>—5 A kind of camphor.<BR>—6 A kind of horse; ताजिताः खुरशालाश्च तुषाराश्चोत्तमा हयाः Aśvachikitsā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तुषाराद्रिः, तुषारगिरिः, तुषारपर्वतः, तुषारकरः, तुषारकणः, तुषारकालः, तुषारकिरणः, तुषाररश्मिः, तुषारगौर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0780-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

