तृणीकृ
तृणीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To make light of, look down upon, treat with contempt; दृष्टिस्तृणीकृतजगत्रयसत्त्वसारा U. 6. 19.<BR>—2 (Hence) To eclipse, obscure; जगाद वक्त्रेण तृणीकृतेन्दुः N. 3. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणता
तृणता <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The quality of a straw, worthlessness.<BR>—2 A bow; तृणता तृणत्वे कार्मुकेऽपि च । हैमकोषः, कामुकानीव नालीकांस्तृणताः<BR> (v. l. त्रिणताः) सहसामुचन् । Śi. 19. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृणय्
तृणय् Den. (तृणयति) To esteem as lightly as straw; सतीव्रतेऽग्नौ<BR> तृणयामि जीवितम् N. 9. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृण्या
तृण्या A heap of grass or straw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीय|तृतीयः
तृतीय <i>a.</i> The third.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयः|तृतीय
तृतीय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 The 3rd consonant of a Varga.<BR>—2 (in music) N. of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयम्
तृतीय + .{@-यम्@} A third part; वनेषु च विहृत्यैवं तृतीयं भागमायुषः<BR> Ms. 6. 33. ━<i>ind.</i> For the 3rd time, thirdly; तृतीयमप्सु नृमणा अजस्रम् Rv. 10. 45. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तृतीयकरणी, तृतीयप्रकृतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयकरणी
तृतीय + -करणी the side of a square 3 times smaller than another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयप्रकृतिः|तृतीयप्रकृति
तृतीय + -प्रकृतिः <i>m.</i> or <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a eunuch.<BR>—2 the neuter gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयक
तृतीयक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Recurring every third day, tertian (as a fever).<BR>—2 Occurring for the third time.<BR>—3 The third.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तृतीयकज्वरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयकज्वरः|तृतीयकज्वर
तृतीयक + -ज्वरः tertian ague.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीया
तृतीया<BR>—1 The third day of a lunar fortnight.<BR>—2 (In gram.) The instrumental case or its terminations.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तृतीयाकृत, तृतीयातत्पुरुषः, तृतीयाप्रकृतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयाकृत|तृतीयाकृतं
तृतीया + -कृत <i>a.</i> thrice ploughed (as a field).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयातत्पुरुषः
तृतीया + -तत्पुरुषः the instrumental Tatpuruṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयाप्रकृतिः|तृतीयाप्रकृति
तृतीया + -प्रकृतिः <i>m., f.</i><BR>—1 a eunuch.<BR>—2 a hermaphrodite.<BR>—3 the neuter gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृतीयिन्
तृतीयिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Entitled to a third portion (of inheritance &c.); विषमा ह्मेषामाख्या ।<BR> केचिदर्धिनः केचित् तृतीयिनः केचित् पादिनः इति । ŚB. on MS. 10. 3. 55.<BR>—2 Occupying the third rank; Ms. 8. 210.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0782-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृद्
तृद् €1 P., €7 U. (तर्दति, तृणत्ति, तृन्त्ते, तृण्ण)<BR>—1 To cleave, split, pierce.<BR>—2 To kill, destroy, annihilate; भूतिं तृणद्मि यक्षाणाम् Bk. 6. 38, 14. 13, 108, 15. 36, 44.<BR>—3 To set free.<BR>—4 To disregard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृण्ण
तृण्ण <i>a.</i> Cut, split; तस्मात्तदातृण्णात्प्रैति रसो वृक्षादिवाहतात्<BR> Bṛ. Up. 3. 9. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्
तृप् I. €4. €5. €6 P. (तृप्यति, तृप्नोति, तृपति, तृप्त)<BR>—1 To become satisfied, be pleased or contented; अद्य तर्प्स्यन्ति मांसादाः<BR> Bk. 16. 29; प्राशीन्न चातृपत् क्रूरः 15. 29; (usually with instr.,<BR> but sometimes with gen. or loc. also); को न तृप्यति वित्तेन H. 2. 133<BR> (v. l. दृप्यति); तृप्तस्तत्पिशितेन Bh. 2. 84; नाग्निस्तृप्यति<BR> काष्ठानां नापगानां महोदधिः । नान्तकः सर्वभूतानां न पुंसां वामलोचना ॥<BR> Pt. 1. 137; तस्मिन्हि ततृपुर्देवास्तते यज्ञे Mb.<BR>—2 To please, gratify. ━<i>Caus.</i> To gratify, please. ━<i>Desid.</i>.<BR> तितृप्सति; तितर्पिषति. ━II. €1 P., €10 U. (तर्पति, तर्पयति-ते)<BR>—1 To light up, kindle.<BR>—2 (Ātm.) To be satisfied.<BR>—3 To please, satisfy.<BR>—4 To gladden, refresh, reanimate; स्वैरं स्वैरं प्रेरितैस्तर्पयेति U. 3. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पण|तर्पणं
तर्पण <i>a.</i> [तृप्-णिच् वा ल्युट्] Satisfying, pleasing, refreshing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पणम्
तर्पण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Pleasing, satisfying.<BR>—2 Satisfaction, pleasure.<BR>—3 Satiety, fulness.<BR>—4 One of the five daily Yajñas (performed by men), presenting libations<BR> of water to the manes of the deceased ancestors (पितृयज्ञ).<BR>—5 Fuel for the sacred fire.<BR>—6 Food.<BR>—7 Filling the eyes with oil &c.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तर्पणेच्छुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पणेच्छुः|तर्पणेच्छु
तर्पण + -इच्छुः an epithet of Bhīṣma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पित
तर्पित <i>a.</i> Pleased, gratified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्पिन्
तर्पिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Gratifying.<BR>—2 Offering libations to the manes of deceased ancestors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृपत्
तृपत् Ved.<BR>—1 The moon.<BR>—2 A parasol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्त|तृप्तः
तृप्त <i>a.</i> [तृप्-क्त] Satiated, satisfied, contented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्तम्
तृप्त + .{@-प्तम्@} Satisfaction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्तता
तृप्तता<BR>—1 Satisfaction.<BR>—2 Satiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्तिः|तृप्ति
तृप्तिः <i>f.</i> [तृप्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Satisfaction, contentment; R. 2. 39, 73, 3. 3; Ms. 3. 271; भूयः<BR> कथय तृप्तिर्हि शृण्वतो नास्ति मेऽमृतम् Bg. 10. 18.<BR>—2 Satiety, disgust.<BR>—3 Pleasure, gratification.<BR>—4 (Ved.) Water.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तृप्तिकर, तृप्तिकारक, तृप्तियोगः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्तिकर
तृप्तिः + -कर, -कारक <i>a.</i> giving satisfaction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्तिकारक
तृप्तिः + -कर, -कारक <i>a.</i> giving satisfaction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्तियोगः|तृप्तियोग
तृप्तिः + -योगः satisfaction; तृप्तियोगः परेणापि महिम्ना न महात्मनाम् Śi. 2. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्तिमत्|तृप्तिमन्त्
तृप्तिमत् <i>a.</i> satisfied, finding satisfaction in; तृप्तिमान्भवति<BR> Ch. Up. 7. 10. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्र|तृप्रः
तृप्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Restless, anxious.<BR>—2 Pleased, satisfied.<BR>—3 Pleasing, satisfying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्रः|तृप्र
तृप्र + .{@-प्रः@} A sacrificial cake (पुरोडाश).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृप्रम्
तृप्र + .{@-प्रम्@}<BR>—1 Ghee or an oblation thereof.<BR>—2 Suffering, sorrow (दुःख).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृपतः|तृपत
तृपतः<BR>—1 The moon.<BR>—2 A parasol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृपल|तृपलः
तृपल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Pleased.<BR>—2 Restless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृपलः|तृपल
तृपल + .{@-लः@} A stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृपला
तृपल + .{@-ला@}<BR>—1 A creeper.<BR>—2 (= त्रिफला) also तृफला; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृपुः|तृपु
तृपुः Ved. A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृफूः
तृफूः <i>f.</i> The serpent race.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृम्प्|तृंप्
तृम्प् or तृम्फ् = तृप् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृम्फ्
तृम्प् or तृम्फ् = तृप् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्
तृष् €4 P. (तृष्यति, तृषित)<BR>—1 To be thirsty; तृषित्वेवाऽनिशं स्वादु पिबन्तं सरितां पयः Bk. 7. 106, 14. 30, 15. 51.<BR>—2 To wish, wish excessively, be eager or greedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षः|तर्ष
तर्षः [तृष्-भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Thirst; किमु नृपफलतर्षः Pratimā 3. 21.<BR>—2 Desire, wish.<BR>—3 The ocean.<BR>—4 A boat.<BR>—5 The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षणम्
तर्षणम् [तृष्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Thirst.<BR>—2 Desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षित|तर्षितः
तर्षित, तर्षुल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Thirsty.<BR>—2 Wishing, desiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर्षुल
तर्षित, तर्षुल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Thirsty.<BR>—2 Wishing, desiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्
तृष् <i>f.</i> [तृष्-संप˚ क्विप्] (nom. sing. तृट्-ड्)<BR>—1 Thirst; तृषा शुष्यत्यास्ये पिबति सलिलं स्वादु सुरभि Bh. 3. 92; Ṛs. 1. 11.<BR>—2 Strong desire, eagerness.<BR>—3 Desire personified as the daughter of Kāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषा
तृषा See तृष्.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तृषार्त, तृषाभू, तृषाहम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषार्त|तृषार्त्त
तृषा + -आर्त <i>a.</i> suffering from thirst, thirsty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषाभू
तृषा + -भू <i>f.</i> the bladder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषाहम्
तृषा + -हम् water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषित|तृषितः
तृषित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Thirsty; Ghaṭ. 9; उत्प्लुत्य भेकस्तृषितस्य भोगिनः फणातपत्रस्य<BR> तले निषीदति Ṛs. 1. 18.<BR>—2 Greedy, thirsting for, desirous of gain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषितम्
तृषित + .{@-तम्@} Thirst, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृषु
तृषु <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Greed, thirsting for; तृषु यदन्ना तृषुणा ववक्ष Rv. 4. 7. 11.<BR>—2 Quick, speedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्णज्
तृष्णज् <i>a.</i> Covetous, greedy, thirsting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्णा
तृष्णा [तृष् न किच्च]<BR>—1 Thirst (lit. and fig.); तृष्णां चेह परित्यज्य को दरिद्रः क ईश्वरः<BR> H. 1. 164; Ṛs. 1. 15.<BR>—2 Desire, strong desire, greedy, avidity, desire of gain; तृष्णां छिन्द्धि<BR> Bh. 2. 77, 3. 5; R. 8. 2.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तृष्णाक्षयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्णाक्षयः|तृष्णाक्षय
तृष्णा + -क्षयः cessation of desire, tranquility of mind, contentment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्णालु
तृष्णालु <i>a.</i> Very thirsty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्य
तृष्य <i>a.</i> To be wished or desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्यम्
तृष्य + .{@-ष्यम्@} Greediness, thirst.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृष्ट
तृष्ट <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Harsh; तृष्टासि तृष्टिका Av. 7. 113. 2.<BR>—2 Pungent.<BR>—3 Rugged.<BR>—4 Hoarse; अति तृष्टं ववक्षिथाथैव सुमना असि Rv. 3. 9. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तृह्
तृह् €7 P., €10 U., €6 P. (तृणेढि, तर्हयति-ते, तृहति, तृढ; <i>desid.</i><BR> तितृक्षति, तितर्हिषति, तितृंहिषति) To injure, hurt, kill, strike;<BR> न तृणेह्मीति लोकोऽयं मां विन्ते निष्पराक्रमम् Bk. 6. 39; (तानि)<BR> तृणेढु रामः सह लक्ष्मणेन 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तॄ
तॄ €1 P. (तरति, ततार, अतारीत्, तरि(री)ष्यति, तीर्ण)<BR>—1 To cross over, cross; केनोडुपेन परलोकनदीं तरिष्ये Mk. 8. 23;<BR> स तीर्त्वा कपिशाम् R. 4. 38; Ms. 4. 77.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To cross over, traverse (as a way); (अध्वानं) ततार ताराधिपखण्डधारी<BR> Ku. 7. 48; Me. 19.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To sail across, navigate (as a river).<BR>—3 To float, swim; शिला तरिष्यत्युदके न पर्णम् Bk. 12. 77; Bṛ. S. 80. 14.<BR>—4<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To get over, surmount, overcome, overpower; धीरा हि तरन्त्यापदम्<BR> K. 175; कृच्छ्रं महत्तीर्णः R. 14. 6; Pt. 4. 1; Bg. 18. 58; Ms. 11. 34.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To subdue, destroy, become master of.<BR>—5 To go<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">Page0784-1</a>]<BR> to the end of, master completely; ततार विद्याः R. 3. 30.<BR>—6 To fulfil, accomplish, perform (as a promise); दैवात्तीर्णप्रतिज्ञः Mu. 4. 12.<BR>—7 To be saved or rescued, escape from; गावो वर्षभयात्तीर्णा वयं तीर्णा<BR> महाभयात् Hariv.<BR>—8 To acquire, gain; मनोजवा अयमान आयसीमतरत् पुरम् Rv. 8. 100. 8.<BR>—9 To move forward rapidly.<BR>—10 To fill completely, pervade.<BR>—11 To live through (a definite period).<BR>—12 To deliver, liberate from.<BR>—13 To strive together, compete. ━<i>Pass.</i> (तीर्यते) To be crossed<BR> &c. ━<i>Caus.</i> (तारयति-ते)<BR>—1 To carry or lead over; तारयस्व च मां गङ्गाम् Rām. 7. 46. 29.<BR>—2 To cause to arrive at; नः पिता योऽस्माकमविद्यायाः परं पारं तारयसीति<BR> Praśna. Up. 6. 8.<BR>—3 To save, rescue, deliver, liberate. ━<i>Desid.</i> (तितीर्षति, तितरिषति,<BR> तितरीषति) To wish to cross &c.; दोर्भ्यां तितीर्षति तरङ्गवतीभुजङ्गम् K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0783-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तर|तरः
तर <i>a.</i> [तॄ-भावे-अप्]<BR>—1 Crossing.<BR>—2 Surpassing, excelling.<BR>—3 Conquering, overpowering; cf. दुस्तर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरः|तर
तर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 Passing over, crossing, passage; उत्तेऊरतरान् नदान् Bk. 7. 55.<BR>—2 Freight; दीर्घाध्वनि यथादेशं यथाकालं तरो भवेत् Ms. 8. 406.<BR>—3 A road.<BR>—4 A ferry-boat.<BR>—5 Fire.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरपण्यम्, तरपण्यिकः, तरपतिः, तरस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरपण्यम्
तर + -पण्यम् freight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरपण्यिकः|तरपण्यिक
तर + -पण्यिकः one who receives the freight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरपतिः|तरपति
तर + -पतिः superintendent of ferries, EI. 7. 91, 17. 321.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरस्थानम्
तर + -स्थानम् a landing-place, wharf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणः|तरण|तरणं
तरणः [तॄ-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 A boat, raft.<BR>—2 <i>Svarga</i> or heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणम्
तरणः + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Crossing over.<BR>—2 Conquering, overcoming.<BR>—3 An oar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणि|तरणिः
तरणि <i>a.</i> [तॄ-अनि] Ved.<BR>—1 Passing through, pervading (as the sun).<BR>—2 Quick, energetic, unremitting; विपश्चितं तरणिं भ्राजमानम् Av. 13. 2. 4.<BR>—3 Saving, carrying over, benevolent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणिः|तरणि
तरणि + .{@-णिः@}<BR>—1 The sun; ‘तरणिर्द्युमणौ पुंसि कुमारीनौकयोः स्त्रियाम्’ Med.<BR>—2 A ray of light.<BR>—3 The <i>Arka</i> plant.<BR>—4 Copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणिः|तरणि
तरणि + .{@-णिः, -णी@} <i>f.</i> A raft, boat.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरणितनया, तरणिधन्यः, तरणिपेटकः, तरणिरत्नम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्णी
तरणि + .{@-णिः, -णी@} <i>f.</i> A raft, boat.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरणितनया, तरणिधन्यः, तरणिपेटकः, तरणिरत्नम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणितनया
तरणि + -तनया the river Yamunā; परिश्रान्तस्यायं तरणितनयातीरनिलयः Bv. 4. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणिधन्यः|तरणिधन्य
तरणि + -धन्यः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणिपेटकः|तरणिपेटक
तरणि + -पेटकः an oval bowl of wood for baling a boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरणिरत्नम्
तरणि + -रत्नम् a ruby.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्डः|तरण्ड|तरंड|तरंडं|तरंडः
तरण्डः, -ण्डा, -ण्डी, -ण्डम्<BR> [तॄ-अण्डच्] A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्डा
तरण्डः, -ण्डा, -ण्डी, -ण्डम्<BR> [तॄ-अण्डच्] A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्डी
तरण्डः, -ण्डा, -ण्डी, -ण्डम्<BR> [तॄ-अण्डच्] A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्डम्
तरण्डः, -ण्डा, -ण्डी, -ण्डम्<BR> [तॄ-अण्डच्] A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्डः|तरण्ड|तरंड|तरंडं|तरंडः
तरण्डः, -ण्डा, -ण्डी, -ण्डम् + .{@-ण्डः, -ण्डम्@}<BR>—1 A raft or float made of bamboos tied together and floated on jars or<BR> inverted hollow gourds.<BR>—2 The float of a fishing-line.<BR>—3 An oar.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरण्डपादा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्डम्
तरण्डः, -ण्डा, -ण्डी, -ण्डम् + .{@-ण्डः, -ण्डम्@}<BR>—1 A raft or float made of bamboos tied together and floated on jars or<BR> inverted hollow gourds.<BR>—2 The float of a fishing-line.<BR>—3 An oar.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरण्डपादा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्डपादा|तरंडपादा
तरण्डः + -पादा a kind of boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरण्यति
तरण्यति Den. P. To cross over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरद्
तरद् <i>f.</i> [तॄ-करणे अदि]<BR>—1 A boat.<BR>—2 A kind of duck (कारण्डव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरन्ती
तरन्ती A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिः|तरि
तरिः, -रीः<BR> [तॄ-करणे इ]<BR>—1 A boat. धर्मार्थं वाहये तरिम् Mb. 1. 100. 48; जीर्णा तरिः सरिदतीव<BR> गभीरनीरा Udb.; Śi. 3. 76.<BR>—2 A box for clothes.<BR>—3 The end or hem of a garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरीः
तरिः, -रीः<BR> [तॄ-करणे इ]<BR>—1 A boat. धर्मार्थं वाहये तरिम् Mb. 1. 100. 48; जीर्णा तरिः सरिदतीव<BR> गभीरनीरा Udb.; Śi. 3. 76.<BR>—2 A box for clothes.<BR>—3 The end or hem of a garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरी
तरिः, -रीः + .{@-री@}<BR>—1 A small wooden baling-vessel.<BR>—2 A club.<BR>—3 Smoke.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तरिरथः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिरथः|तरिरथ
तरिः + -रथः an oar, a paddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिकः|तरिक
तरिकः [तराय तरणाय हितः बा˚ ठन्]<BR>—1 A ferry-man.<BR>—2 A float, raft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिका
तरिकः + .{@-का@}<BR>—1 A boat.<BR>—2 Cream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिकिन्
तरिकिन् <i>m.</i> A ferry-man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरित्रम्
तरित्रम्, तरित्री, तरिणी<BR> A boat, ship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरित्री
तरित्रम्, तरित्री, तरिणी<BR> A boat, ship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरिणी
तरित्रम्, तरित्री, तरिणी<BR> A boat, ship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरीषः|तरीष
तरीषः [तॄ-ईषन्]<BR>—1 boat, raft.<BR>—2 The ocean.<BR>—3 A fit or competent person.<BR>—4 Heaven.<BR>—5 Work, business, practice, profession.<BR>—6 A fine shape or form.<BR>—7 Decorating, ornamenting.<BR>—8 Dry cow-dung.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तरीषी
तरीषः + .{@-षी@} N. of a daughter of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारक|तारकं|तारकः
तारक <i>a.</i> (-रिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [तॄ-णिच् ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Carrying over.<BR>—2 Protecting, preserving, rescuing.<BR>—3 Helping another through a difficulty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकः|तारक|तारकं
तारक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A pilot, helmsman.<BR>—2 A deliverer, saviour.<BR>—3 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकः|तारक|तारकं
तारक + .{@-कः, -कम्@} A boat, raft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकम्
तारक + .{@-कः, -कम्@} A boat, raft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारकम्
तारक + .{@-कम्@} (also <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 The pupil of the eye; संदधे दृशमुदग्रतारकाम् R. 11. 69.<BR>—2 The eye.<BR>—3 A star; शान्तर्क्षग्रहतारकम् Bhāg. 10. 3. 1; see तारका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारण|तारणः
तारण <i>a.</i> [तारयत्यनेन तॄ-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Enabling to cross.<BR>—2 Saving, delivering, liberating.<BR>—3 Helping one through a difficulty &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारणः|तारण
तारण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 N. of Śiva; also of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 A boat, raft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारणम्
तारण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Crossing.<BR>—2 Conquering.<BR>—3 Carrying or conveying across; यो द्विजः शब्दरहितं सं क्षमस्तारणाय<BR> वै Mb. 3. 200. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारणिः|तारणि
तारणिः, -णी<BR> A float, raft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारणी
तारणिः, -णी<BR> A float, raft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारिकम्
तारिकम् Fare, freight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारित
तारित <i>p. p.</i> Made to cross, conveyed across, saved, rescued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तारिन्
तारिन्^1 <i>a.</i> [तॄ-णिच्-णिनि] Enabling to cross, saving, delivering.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124. note: Since Rini suffix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्य|तार्य्य
तार्य <i>a.</i> [तॄ कर्मणि ण्यत्]<BR>—1 To be crossed, passable.<BR>—2 To be conquered or defeated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तार्यम्
तार्य + .{@-र्यम्@} Fare, freight, toll.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितीर्षा
तितीर्षा<BR>—1 Desire to cross over; स मामचिन्तयद्देवः प्रश्नपारतितीर्षया<BR> Bhāg. 11. 13. 19.<BR>—2 Desire of final emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तितीर्षु
तितीर्षु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Desirous of crossing; तितीर्षुर्दुस्तरं मोहादुडुपेनास्मि सागरम् R. 1. 2.<BR>—2 Wishing to attain.<BR>—3 Desirous of final emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तीर्ण|तीर्णः
तीर्ण <i>p. p.</i> [तॄ-क्त]<BR>—1 Crossed, passed over.<BR>—2 Spread, expanded.<BR>—3 Surpassed, excelled.<BR>—4 Gone down to bathe, bathed.<BR>—5 Defeated, conquered, overeome; see तॄ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेज्
तेज् €1 P. (तेजति) To guard, defend, protect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजः|तेज
तेजः, तेजनम् See under तिज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजनम्
तेजः, तेजनम् See under तिज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजलः|तेजल
तेजलः The francoline partridge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजस्
तेजस् <i>n.</i> [तिज्-भावे करुणादै असुन्]<BR>—1 Sharpness.<BR>—2 The sharp edge (of a knife &c.).<BR>—3 The point or top of a flame.<BR>—4 Heat, glow, glare.<BR>—5 Lustre, light, brilliance, splendour; दिनान्ते निहितं तेजः R. 4. 1;<BR> तेजश्चास्मि<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">Page0785-1</a>]<BR> विभावसौ Bg. 7. 9, 10.<BR>—6 Heat or light considered as the third of the five elements of creation<BR> (the other four being पृथिवी, अप्, वायु and आकाश).<BR>—7 The bright appearance of the human body, beauty; अरिष्टशम्यां परितो<BR> विसारिणा सुजन्मनस्तस्य निजेन तेजसा R. 3. 15.<BR>—8 Fire of energy; शमप्रधानेषु तपोधनेषु गूढं हि दाहात्मकमस्ति<BR> तेजः Ś. 2. 7; U. 6. 14.<BR>—9 Might, prowess, strength, courage, valour, martial or heroic lustre;<BR> तेजस्तेजसि शाम्यतु U. 5. 7; Ś. 7. 15.<BR>—10 One possessed of heroic lustre; तेजसां हि न वयः समीक्ष्यते<BR> R. 11. 1; Pt. 1. 328, 3. 33.<BR>—11 Spirit, energy.<BR>—12 Strength of character, not bearing insult or ill-treatment with impunity.<BR>—13 Majestic lustre, majesty, dignity, authority, consequence; तेजोविशेषानुमितां<BR> (राजलक्ष्मीं) दधानः R. 2. 7.<BR>—14 Semen, seed, semen virile; स्याद्रक्षणीयं यदि मे न तेजः R. 14. 65, 2. 75;<BR> दुष्यन्तेनाहितं तेजो दधानां भूतये भुवः Ś. 4. 3.<BR>—15 The essential nature of anything.<BR>—16 Essence, quintessence.<BR>—17 Spiritual, moral, or magical power.<BR>—18 Fire; यज्ञसेनस्य दुहिता तेज एव तु केवलम् Mb. 3. 239. 9.<BR>—19 Marrow.<BR>—20 Bile.<BR>—21 The speed of a horse.<BR>—22 Fresh butter.<BR>—23 Gold.<BR>—24 Clearness of the eyes.<BR>—25 A shining or luminous body, light; ऋते कृशानोर्न हि मन्त्रपूतमर्हन्ति<BR> तेजांस्यपराणि हव्यम् Ku. 1. 51; Ś. 4. 2.<BR>—26 The heating and strengthening faculty of the human frame seated in<BR> the bile (पित्त).<BR>—27 The brain.<BR>—28 Violence, fierceness.<BR>—29 Impatience.<BR>—30 Anger; मित्रैः सह विरोधं च प्राप्नुते तेजसा वृतः Mb. 3. 28. 18.<BR>—31 The sun; उपप्लवांस्तथा घोरान् शशिनस्तेजसस्तथा Mb. 12. 301. 36.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तेजःकर, तेजःपदम्, तेजोबीजम्, तेजोभङ्गः, तेजोभीरुः, तेजोमण्डलम्, तेजोमात्रा, तेजोमूर्तिः, तेजोरूपम्, तेजोवृत्तम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0784-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजःकर
तेजस् + -कर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 illuminating.<BR>—2 granting vital power or strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजःपदम्
तेजस् + -पदम् a mark of dignity; तेजःपदं मणिमयं च हृतं शिरोभ्यः<BR> Bhāg. 1. 15. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोबीजम्
तेजस् + -बीजम् marrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोभङ्गः|तेजोभङ्ग|तेजोभंग
तेजस् + -भङ्गः<BR>—1 disgrace, destruction of dignity.<BR>—2 depression, discouragement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोभीरुः|तेजोभीरु
तेजस् + -भीरुः <i>f.</i> shadow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोमण्डलम्
तेजस् + -मण्डलम् a halo of light; सर्वा एतस्मिंस्तेजोमण्डल एकीभवन्ति<BR> Praśna. Up. 4. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोमात्रा
तेजस् + -मात्रा sense-organ; स एतास्तेजोमात्राः समभ्याददानो हृदयमेवान्ववक्रामति<BR> Bṛ. Up. 4. 4. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोमूर्तिः|तेजोमूर्ति
तेजस् + -मूर्तिः the sun; Ms. 3. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोरूपम्
तेजस् + -रूपम्<BR>—1 the Supreme Spirit, Brahman.<BR>—2 the nature of light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोवृत्तम्
तेजस् + -वृत्तम्<BR>—1 noble behaviour; Ms. 9. 303.<BR>—2 superior power or lustre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजस्वत्|तेजस्वन्त्
तेजस्वत्, तेजोवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bright, brilliant, splendid.<BR>—2 Sharp, pungent.<BR>—3 Brave, heroic.<BR>—4 Energetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोवत्|तेजोवन्त्
तेजस्वत्, तेजोवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bright, brilliant, splendid.<BR>—2 Sharp, pungent.<BR>—3 Brave, heroic.<BR>—4 Energetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजस्विन्
तेजस्विन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Brilliant, bright.<BR>—2 Powerful, heroic, strong; न तेजस्तेजस्वी प्रसृतमपरेषां विषहते<BR> U. 6. 14; Ki. 16. 16.<BR>—3 Dignified, noble.<BR>—4 Famous, illustrious.<BR>—5 Violent; Bṛ. S. 101. 2.<BR>—6 Haughty.<BR>—7 Lawful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजित|तेजितः
तेजित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sharpened, whetted.<BR>—2 Excited, stimulated, prompted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेजोमय
तेजोमय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Glorious.<BR>—2 Bright, brilliant, luminous; तेजोमयं विश्वमनन्तमाद्यं यन्मे त्वदन्येन<BR> न दृष्टपूर्वम् (रूपम्) Bg. 11. 47.<BR>—3 Full of energy, spirited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेन|तेनः
तेन A note introductory to a song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेप्
तेप् €1 Ā. (तेपते)<BR>—1 To sprinkle.<BR>—2 To ooze, drop.<BR>—3 To shake, tremble.<BR>—4 To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेमः|तेम
तेमः [तिम्-घञ्] Becoming wet or moist, moisture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेमनम्
तेमनम्<BR>—1 Wetting, moistening.<BR>—2 Moisture.<BR>—3 A sauce, condiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेमनी
तेमनम् + .{@-नी@} A fire-place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेव्
तेव् €1 Ā. (तेवते)<BR>—1 To play, sport.<BR>—2 To weep, lament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तेवनम्
तेवनम्<BR>—1 Play, pastime.<BR>—2 A pleasure-garden, play-ground; Ms. 4. 163.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैक्ष्ण्यम्
तैक्ष्ण्यम्<BR>—1 Sharpness (of a knife), acuteness.<BR>—2 Pungency.<BR>—3 Fierceness, severity, cruelty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैजस|तैजसं|तैजसः
तैजस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [तेजसो विकारः अण्]<BR>—1 Bright, splendid, luminous; वैराजा नाम ते लोकास्तैजसाः सन्तु ते<BR> शिवाः U. 2. 12.<BR>—2 Made up or consisting of light; तैजसस्य धनुषः प्रवृत्तये R. 11. 43.<BR>—3 Metallic.<BR>—4 Passionate.<BR>—5 Vigorous, energetic.<BR>—6 Powerful, intense.<BR>—7 A kind of horse; ते तैजसाः पुण्यवतां प्रदेशे भवन्ति पुण्यैरपि<BR> ते मिलन्ति Yuktikalpataru.<BR>—8 Endowed with the राजस quality; वैकारिकस्तैजसश्च तामसश्चेत्यहं<BR> त्रिधा Bhāg. 3. 5. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैजसः|तैजस|तैजसं
तैजस + .{@-सः@} The highly refined or subtle essence (Vedānta Phil.); विश्वश्च<BR> तैजसः प्राज्ञस्तुर्य आत्मा समन्वयात् Bhāg. 7. 15. 54; Muṇḍ. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैजसम्
तैजस + .{@-सम्@}<BR>—1 Any metal; Bhāg. 11. 21. 12.<BR>—2 Ghee.<BR>—3 Intensity, severity.<BR>—4 Vigour, energy, might.<BR>—5 The group of senses; तैजसे निद्रयापन्ने पिण्डस्थो नष्टचेतनः ।<BR> मायां प्राप्नोति मृत्युं वा Bhāg. 11. 28. 3.<BR>—6 The movable (जङ्गम) world; तस्य तत्तेजसस्तस्माज्जज्ञे लोकेषु<BR> तैजसम् Mb. 13. 85. 102.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तैजसावर्तनी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0785-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तैजसावर्तनी|तैजसावर्त्तनी
