तोरणम्
तोरणः, -णम् + .{@-णम्@} The neck, throat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0786-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोरणः|तोरण|तोरणं
तोरणः, -णम् + .{@-णः@} N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0786-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोल|तोलं|तोलः
तोल, तोलनम् &c. See under तुल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोलनम्
तोल, तोलनम् &c. See under तुल्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोष|तोषः
तोष, तोषण &c. See under तुष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषण
तोष, तोषण &c. See under तुष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तोषलम्
तोषलम् A club (मुसल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौक्षिकः|तौक्षिक
तौक्षिकः The sign Sagittarius of the zodiac (a word borrowed from Greek).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौच्छयम्
तौच्छयम्<BR>—1 Emptiness.<BR>—2 meanness, worthlessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौतातिकम्
तौतातिकम्, -तम्<BR> Belonging to Kumarila Bhaṭṭa, who had an epithet तुतात<BR> or तुतातित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौतातितम्
तौतातिकम्, -तम्<BR> Belonging to Kumarila Bhaṭṭa, who had an epithet तुतात<BR> or तुतातित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौतिकः|तौतिक|तौतिकं
तौतिकः The pearl-oyster.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौतिकम्
तौतिकः + .{@-कम्@} A pearl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौरङ्गिकः|तौरङ्गिक|तौरंगिक
तौरङ्गिकः A horseman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौरुष्किक
तौरुष्किक <i>a.</i> Turkish; Kuṭṭanīmata 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौरूपम्
तौरूपम् A variety of sandal-wood being a product of the country of कामरूप.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौर्यम्
तौर्यम् [तूर्ये भवम् अण्] The sound of musical instruments.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: तौर्यत्रिकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौर्यत्रिकम्
तौर्यम् + -त्रिकम् the union of song, dance, and instrumental music, triple<BR> symphony; तौर्यत्रिकं वृथाटया च कामजो दशको गणः Ms. 7. 47; U. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौलम्
तौलम् A balance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौलिकः|तौलिक
तौलिकः, तौलिकिकः A painter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौलिकिकः|तौलिकिक
तौलिकः, तौलिकिकः A painter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौलिन्
तौलिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A weigher.<BR>—2 The sign <i>Libra</i> of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौल्यम्
तौल्यम्<BR>—1 Weight.<BR>—2 Equality, similarity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौषार|तौषारं
तौषार <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR> Snowy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तौषारम्
तौषार + .{@-रम्@} Snow, cold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्मन्
त्मन् <i>m.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 The vital air; त्मनमूर्जं न विश्वध क्षरध्यै Rv. 1. 63. 8.<BR>—2 Oneʼs own person, self; cf. आत्मन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यज्
त्यज् €1 P. (त्यजति, तत्याज, अत्याक्षीत्, त्यक्ष्यति, त्यक्त)<BR>—1 To leave (in all senses), abandon, quit, go away from; वर्त्म भानोस्त्यजाशु<BR> Me. 41; Ms. 6. 77, 9. 177; Ś. 5. 26.<BR>—2 To let go, dismiss, discharge; वालिनो दूरभाग् रामो बाणं प्राणाऽदमत्यजत् Bk. 6. 122.<BR>—3 To give up, renounce, resign, surrender; स्वयं त्यक्ता ह्येते शमसुखमनन्तं<BR> विदधति Bh. 3. 16; Ms. 2. 95, 6. 33; Bg. 6. 24; त्रिविधं नरकस्येदं<BR> द्वारं नाशनमात्मनः । कामः क्रोधस्तथा लोभस्तस्मादेतत्त्रयं त्यजेत् ॥ 16. 21.<BR>—4 To shun, avoid.<BR>—5 To get rid of, free oneself from; क्षुद्रं हृदयदौर्बल्यं त्यक्त्वोत्तिष्ठ<BR> परंतप Bg. 2. 3.<BR>—6 To set aside, disregard; त इमेऽवस्थिता युद्धे प्राणांस्त्यक्त्वा धनानि<BR> च Bg. 1. 33.<BR>—7 To except.<BR>—8 To distribute, give away; कृतं (संचयं) आश्वयुजे त्यजेत्<BR> Y. 3. 47; Ms. 6. 15.<BR>—9 To shoot off. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to give up &c., to deprive (a person) of anything; मौनं<BR> त्याजयति प्रायः कालक्षेपाय मां भवान् Ks. 83. 34; Bk. 15. 120.<BR>—2 To expel, turn out; (तं बहिः) त्याजयामास रथ्यायां निरपेक्षतया<BR> निशि Ks. 20. 126.<BR>—3 To quit. ━<i>Desid.</i> (तित्यक्षति) To wish to leave &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यक्त|त्यक्तं
त्यक्त <i>p. p.</i> [त्यज् कर्मणि-क्त]<BR>—1 Abandoned, forsaken, left, quitted.<BR>—2 Resigned, surrendered.<BR>—3 Shunned,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">Page0787-2</a>]<BR> avoided; see त्यज्.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: त्यक्ताग्निः, त्यक्तात्मन्, त्यक्तजीवित, त्यक्तप्राण, त्यक्तलज्ज, त्यक्तविधि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यक्ताग्निः|त्यक्ताग्नि
त्यक्त + -अग्निः a Brāhmaṇa who has given up household fire; Ms. 3. 153.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यक्तात्मन्
त्यक्त + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> despairing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यक्तजीवित
त्यक्त + -जीवित, -प्राण <i>a.</i> ready to abandon life, willing to run any<BR> risk; मदर्थे त्यक्तजीविताः Bg. 1. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यक्तप्राण
त्यक्त + -जीवित, -प्राण <i>a.</i> ready to abandon life, willing to run any<BR> risk; मदर्थे त्यक्तजीविताः Bg. 1. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यक्तलज्ज
त्यक्त + -लज्ज <i>a.</i> shameless; ये त्विह वै वृषलीपतयो नष्टशौचाचारनियमास्त्यक्तलज्जाः<BR> पशुचर्यां चरन्ति Bhāg. 5. 26. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यक्तविधि
त्यक्त + -विधि <i>a.</i> transgressing rules; देशान्निःसारयामास सुतं त्यक्तविधिं<BR> रुषा Bhāg. 9. 6. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यक्तृ
त्यक्तृ <i>a.</i> Abandoning, leaving &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यजनम्
त्यजनम्<BR>—1 Leaving, quitting.<BR>—2 Giving.<BR>—3 Excepting, exclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यजस्
त्यजस् <i>m.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Abandonment.<BR>—2 Difficulty.<BR>—3 Anger.<BR>—4 Estrangement, dislike, envy.<BR>—5 A weapon causing abandonment. ━<i>m., f., n.</i> Ved. Offspring, descendants;<BR> एतस्य चित् त्यजसं मर्त्यस्य Rv. 10. 10. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यागः|त्याग
त्यागः [त्यज्-भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Leaving, forsaking, abandoning, deserting, separation; न माता न<BR> पिता न स्त्री न पुत्रस्त्यागमर्हति Ms. 8. 389, 9. 79.<BR>—2 Giving up, resigning, renouncing; Ms. 10. 112; सर्वकर्मफलत्यागं<BR> ततः कुरु यतात्मवान् Bg. 12. 11.<BR>—3 Gift, donation, giving away as charity; करे श्लाघ्यस्त्यागः Bh. 2. 65;<BR> वित्तं त्यागनियुक्तम् (दुर्लभम्) H. 1. 139; त्यागाय संमृतार्थानाम्<BR> R. 1. 7; Pt. 1. 169.<BR>—4 Liberality, generosity; Ms. 2. 97; R. 1. 22.<BR>—5 Secretion, excretion.<BR>—6 Dismissing, discharging.<BR>—7 Sacrificing oneself; मिथो यत् त्यागमुभयासो अग्मन् Rv. 4. 24. 3.<BR>—8 A sage.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: त्यागपत्रम्, त्यागयुत, त्यागशील<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यागपत्रम्
त्यागः + -पत्रम् a bill of divorcement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यागयुत
त्यागः + -युत, -शील <i>a.</i> liberal, generous, munificent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यागशील
त्यागः + -युत, -शील <i>a.</i> liberal, generous, munificent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यागिन्
त्यागिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Leaving, abandoning, giving up &c.<BR>—2 Giving away, a donor.<BR>—3 Heroic, brave.<BR>—4 Liberal.<BR>—5 Sacrificing.<BR>—6 One who does not look to any reward or result from the performance<BR> of ceremonial rites; यस्तु कर्मफलत्यागी स त्यागीत्यभिधीयते Bg. 18. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्याजक
त्याजक <i>a.</i> One who abandons or expels; Y. 2. 198.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्याजनम्
त्याजनम् Abandoning worldly attachment; गुणदोषविधानेन सङ्गानां<BR> त्याजनेच्छया Bhāg. 11. 20. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्याजित
त्याजित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Made to leave or abandon; त्याजितः किं न रामोऽपि जनवादेन जानकीम् Ks. 86. 13.<BR>—2 Caused to be disregarded; मन्द्रध्वनित्याजितयामतूर्यः R. 6. 56.<BR>—3 Deprived of (acc.); धूपोष्मणा त्याजितमार्द्रभावम् Ku. 7. 14.<BR>—4 Expelled; Pañcadaśī 3. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्याज्य|त्याज्यः
त्याज्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be left, shunned or expelled; Ms. 9. 83.<BR>—2 To be given up or relinquished.<BR>—3 To be sacrificed.<BR>—4 To be excluded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्याज्यम्
त्याज्य + .{@-ज्यम्@} A part of an asterism or its duration considered to be unlucky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्यद्
त्यद् <i>Pron. a.</i> (Nom. sing. स्यः <i>m.</i>) That; अयं त्यस्य<BR> राजा Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 24. ━<i>n.</i> (त्यत्)<BR>—1 Wind, air.<BR>—2 sky; L. D. B.<BR>—3 Invisible (अमूर्त); यच्च सच्च त्यच्च Bṛ. Up. 2. 3. 1; सच्च<BR> त्यच्चाभवत् T. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रंस्
त्रंस् €1 P., €10 U. (त्रंसति, त्रंसयति-ते) To speak or shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0787-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रङ्क्|त्रंक्
त्रङ्क् €1 Ā. (त्रङ्कते) To go; so also त्रङ्ख् €1 P., त्रङ्ग् €1 P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रन्द्|त्रंद्
त्रन्द् €1 P. (त्रन्दति)<BR>—1 To act, perform some functions.<BR>—2 To try, strive.<BR>—3 To be busy or active.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रप्
त्रप् €1 Ā. (त्रपते, त्रपित) To be ashamed or abashed, be embarrassed;<BR> त्रपन्ते तीर्थानि त्वरितमिह यस्योध्दृतिविधौ G. L. 28; वर्णयन्तस्त्रपामहे<BR> Rāj. T. 3. 94. ━<i>With</i> {@अप@} to turn away or retire through shame;<BR> तस्माद्बलैरपत्रेपे Bk. 14. 84; येनापत्रपति साधुरसाधुस्तेन तुष्यति Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रपा
त्रपा [त्रप्-भावे अड्]<BR>—1 Bashfulness, modesty; मन्दत्रपाभर Gīt. 12.<BR>—2 Shame (in a good or bad sense).<BR>—3 A libidinous or unchaste woman.<BR>—4 Family, race.<BR>—5 Fame, celebrity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: त्रपानिरस्त, त्रपाहीन, त्रपारण्डा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रपानिरस्त
त्रपा + -निरस्त, -हीन <i>a.</i> shameless, impudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रपाहीन
त्रपा + -निरस्त, -हीन <i>a.</i> shameless, impudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रपारण्डा|त्रपारंडा
त्रपा + -रण्डा a harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

