त्रयस् + -त्रिंश <i>a.</i> thirty-third.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयस्त्रिंशत्
त्रयस् + -त्रिंशत् <i>a.</i> or <i>f.</i> thirty-three. ˚पतिः an epithet of<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Indra,<BR>——(<i>b</i>) प्रजापति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

