त्रयोदशकम्
त्रयस् + -दशक + .({@-कम्@}) the number thirteen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोदशम
त्रयस् + -दशम <i>a.</i> thirteenth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रयोदशी
त्रयस् + -दशी the thirteenth day of a lunar fortnight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0788-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

