त्रि + -शोकः the soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0792-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिषष्टिः|त्रिषष्टि
