त्रिष्टुभ्
त्रि + -ष्टुभ् <i>f.</i> a metre of 4×11 syllables.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0792-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिसंध्यम्
त्रि + -संध्यम्, -संध्यी the three periods of the day, <i>i. e.</i> dawn,<BR> noon, and sunset; also -त्रिसवनम्<BR> (-षवणम्); Ms. 11. 216.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0792-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिसंध्यी
त्रि + -संध्यम्, -संध्यी the three periods of the day, <i>i. e.</i> dawn,<BR> noon, and sunset; also -त्रिसवनम्<BR> (-षवणम्); Ms. 11. 216.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0792-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिसंध्यम्
त्रि + -संध्यम् <i>ind.</i> at the time of the three Sandhyas; सान्निध्यं<BR> पुष्करे येषां त्रिसन्ध्यं कुरुनन्दन Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0792-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिसप्तत
