त्रिसप्ततिः|त्रिसप्तति
त्रि + -सप्ततिः <i>f.</i> seventy-three.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0792-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिसप्तन्
त्रि + -सप्तन्, -सप्त <i>a.</i> (pl.) three times 7, <i>i. e.</i> 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0792-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रिसप्त
त्रि + -सप्तन्, -सप्त <i>a.</i> (pl.) three times 7, <i>i. e.</i> 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0792-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

