त्रैविद्यम्
त्रैविद्यम्<BR>—1 The three Vedas.<BR>—2 The study of the three Vedas.<BR>—3 An assembly of Brāhmaṇas familiar with the three Vedas.<BR>—4 The three sciences.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0793-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्रैविद्यः|त्रैविद्य|त्रैविद्यं
