त्वच् + -गन्धः the orange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वक्छेदः|त्वक्छेद
त्वच् + -छेदः<BR>—1 a skin-wound, scratch, bruise.<BR>—2 circumcision.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

