त्वच् + -रोगः leprosy &c., any cutaneous disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

