त्वचम्
त्वचम्<BR>—1 Skin.<BR>—2 Bark.<BR>—3 Cinnamon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

