त्वचयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To cover with a hide.<BR>—2 To peel off the skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

