त्वाच
त्वाच <i>a.</i> (-ची <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to the skin, contagious. ˚प्रत्यक्ष<BR> <i>a.</i> that which is felt directly by the skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

