त्वर्
त्वर् €1 Ā. (त्वरते, त्वरित-तूर्ण) To hurry, make haste, move<BR> with speed, do anything quickly; भवान्सुहृदर्ये त्वरताम् M. 2; नानुनेतुमबलाः<BR> स तत्वरे R. 19. 38.<BR>.━<i>Caus.</i> (त्वरयति)<BR>—1 To cause to hasten, expedite, urge forward, accelerate; त्वरयोर्वशीम्<BR> V. 2; Ku. 4. 36.<BR>—2 To call quickly away; अद्य त्वां त्वरयति दारुणः कृतान्तः Māl. 5. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्ण|तूर्णं|तूर्ण्ण
तूर्ण <i>p. p.</i> [त्वर्-भावे-क्त]<BR>—1 Quick, speedy, rapid.<BR>—2 Fleet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्णम्
तूर्ण + .{@-र्णम्@} Rapidity, quickness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्णम्
तूर्ण + .{@-र्णम्@} <i>ind.</i> Quickly, speedily; चूर्णमानीयतां तूर्णं पूर्णचन्द्रनिभानने Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्णि|तूर्णिः
तूर्णि <i>a.</i> Quick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तूर्णिः|तूर्णि
तूर्णि + .{@-र्णिः@} <i>f.</i> Speed. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 The mind.<BR>—2 A Śloka.<BR>—3 Dirt, excrement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वरणम्
त्वरणम् Making haste, velocity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वरता
त्वरता Haste; त्वरता मे मनसः Pratimā 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वरम्
त्वरम् <i>ind.</i> Hastily (त्वरेण); Mb. 12. 321. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0794-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वरा
त्वरा, त्वरिः <i>f.</i> [त्वर्-अङ्]<BR>—1 Haste, hurry, speed; औत्सुक्येन कृतत्वरा सहभुवा व्यावर्तमाना ह्रिया Ratn. 1. 2.<BR>—2 Urgency or pressing nature; मनसा कार्यसंसिद्धौ त्वरादिगुणरंहसा Ku. 2. 63.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: त्वरारोहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वरिः|त्वरि
त्वरा, त्वरिः <i>f.</i> [त्वर्-अङ्]<BR>—1 Haste, hurry, speed; औत्सुक्येन कृतत्वरा सहभुवा व्यावर्तमाना ह्रिया Ratn. 1. 2.<BR>—2 Urgency or pressing nature; मनसा कार्यसंसिद्धौ त्वरादिगुणरंहसा Ku. 2. 63.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: त्वरारोहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वरारोहः|त्वरारोह
त्वरा + -आरोहः a pigeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वरित|त्वरितं
त्वरित <i>p. p.</i> Quick, swift, speedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वरितम्
त्वरित + .{@-तम्@} Despatch, haste. ━<i>ind.</i> Quickly, fast, speedily, hastily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वरेण
त्वरेण <i>ind.</i> Hastily; दृष्ट्वा त्वरेण निजधोरणतोऽवतीर्य<BR> Bhāg. 10. 13. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वष्टिः|त्वष्टि
त्वष्टिः <i>f.</i> Carpentry; Ms. 10. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वष्टृ
त्वष्टृ <i>m.</i> [त्वक्ष्-तृच्]<BR>—1 A carpenter, builder, workman, त्वष्ट्रेव विहितं यन्त्रम् Mb. 12. 33. 22.<BR>—2 Viśvakarman, the architect of the gods. [Tvaṣtṛ is the Vulcan of<BR> the Hindu mythology. He had a son named Triśiras and a daughter called<BR> संज्ञा, who was given in marriage to the sun. But she was unable to<BR> bear the severe light of her husband, and therefore Tvaṣtṛ mounted<BR> the sun upon his lathe, and carefully trimmed off a part of his bright<BR> disc; cf. आरोप्य चक्रभ्रमिमुष्णतेजास्त्वष्ट्रेव यत्नोल्लिखितो विभाति<BR> R. 6. 32. The part trimmed off is said to have been used by him in forming<BR> the discus of Viṣṇu, the Triśūla of Śiva, and some other weapons<BR> of the gods.] पर्वतं चापि जग्राह क्रुद्धस्त्वष्टा महाबलः Mb. 1. 227. 34.<BR>—3 Prajāpati (the creator); यां चकार स्वयं त्वष्टा रामस्य महिषीं<BR> प्रियाम् Mb. 3. 274. 9.<BR>—4 Āditya, a form of the sun; निर्भिन्ने अक्षिणी त्वष्टा लोकपालोऽविशद्विभोः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 6. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वाष्ट्र|त्वाष्ट्रः
त्वाष्ट्र <i>a.</i> Belonging or coming from त्वष्टृ; त्वाष्ट्रं यद् दस्रावपिकक्ष्यं<BR> वाम्; Rv. 1. 117. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वाष्ट्रः|त्वाष्ट्र
त्वाष्ट्र + .{@-ष्ट्रः@} Vṛtra; येनावृता इमे लोकास्तमसा त्वाष्ट्रमूर्तिना । स<BR> वै वृत्र इति प्रोक्तः पापः परमदारुणः ॥ Bhāg. 6. 9. 18, 11. 12. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वाष्ट्री
त्वाष्ट्र + .{@-ष्ट्री@}<BR>—1 The asterism Chitra.<BR>—2 A small car.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वाष्ट्रम्
त्वाष्ट्र + .{@-ष्ट्रम्@}<BR>—1 Creative power; तपःसारमयं त्वाष्ट्रं वृत्रो येन विपाटितः Bhāg.8. 11. 35.<BR>—2 Copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वादृश्
त्वादृश्, त्वादृश (-शी <i>f.</i>) <i>a.</i><BR> Similar to thee or you, of thy kind; Me. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वादृश
त्वादृश्, त्वादृश (-शी <i>f.</i>) <i>a.</i><BR> Similar to thee or you, of thy kind; Me. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्विष्
त्विष् €1 U. (त्वेषति-ते) To shine, glitter, sparkle, blaze; अधारयत्<BR> तन्वं तित्विषाणः Rv. 8. 96. 15; Bhāg. 10. 46. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्विष्
त्विष् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Light, lustre, splendour, brilliance; चयस्त्विषामित्यवधारितं पुरा<BR> Śi. 1. 3, 9. 13; R. 4. 75; Ratn. 1. 18.<BR>—2 Beauty; Bhāg. 10. 33. 14.<BR>—3 Authority, weight; -तिग्मा अग्ने तव त्विषः Rv. 8. 43. 3.<BR>—4 Wish, desire.<BR>—5 Custom, practice.<BR>—6 Violence, vehemence.<BR>—7 Speech.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: त्विडीशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्विडीशः
त्विष् + -ईशः, the sun; also त्विषांपतिः or त्विषामीशः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्विषा
त्विषा Splendour, lustre, light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्विषिः|त्विषि
त्विषिः<BR>—1 A ray of light.<BR>—2 Beauty, lustre.<BR>—3 Vehemence, impetuosity; त्विषिः सा ते तित्विषाणस्य नाधृषे Rv. 5. 8. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वेष
त्वेष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bright, brilliant.<BR>—2 Vehement, impetuous, causing fear, awful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्सर्
त्सर् €1 P. (त्सरति)<BR>—1 To go or approach gently or stealthily, creep, crawl.<BR>—2 To proceed crookedly or fraudulently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्सरुः|त्सरु
त्सरुः<BR>—1 Any creeping animal, मा मां पद्येन रपसा विदत त्सरुः Rv. 7. 50. 1.<BR>—2 The hilt or handle of a sword or any other weapon; सुप्रप्रहविमलकलधौतत्सरुणा<BR> खड्गेन Ve. 3; त्सरुप्रदेशादपवर्जिताङ्गः Ki. 17. 58; R. 18. 48.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: त्सरुमार्गः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्सरुमार्गः|त्सरुमार्ग
त्सरुः + -मार्गः sword-exercise; त्सरुमार्गान्यथोद्दिष्टांश्चेरुः सर्वासु<BR> भूमिषु Mb. 1. 134. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्सारुक
त्सारुक <i>a.</i> Skilful in handling a sword; Mb. 1. 132. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थः|थ|थं
थः<BR>—1 A mountain.<BR>—2 A protector.<BR>—3 A sign of danger.<BR>—4 A kind of disease.<BR>—5 Eating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थम्
थः + .{@-थम्@}<BR>—1 Protection, preservation.<BR>—2 Terror, fear.<BR>—3 Auspiciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थर्व्
थर्व् €1 P. (थर्वति) To go or move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थुड्
थुड् €6 P. (थुडति)<BR>—1 To cover, screen.<BR>—2 To hide or conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थोडनम्
थोडनम् Covering, wrapping up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थुत्कारः|थुत्कार
थुत्कारः The sound थुत् made in spitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थुर्व्
थुर्व् €1 P. (थु-थूर्वति) To hurt, injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थूत्कारः|थूत्कार
थूत्कारः, थूत्कृतम् The sound थूत् made in spitting; स्वादूचितं<BR> स्वादुतयैव भुङ्क्ते थूत्कृत्य मुञ्चत्यपि थूत्कृतानि Rāj. T. 7. 1114.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थूत्कृतम्
थूत्कारः, थूत्कृतम् The sound थूत् made in spitting; स्वादूचितं<BR> स्वादुतयैव भुङ्क्ते थूत्कृत्य मुञ्चत्यपि थूत्कृतानि Rāj. T. 7. 1114.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थूथू
थूथू <i>ind.</i> Imitative sound of spitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

थैथै
थैथै <i>ind.</i> The imitative sound of a musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0795-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द|दं|दः
द <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Giving, granting, producing, causing,<BR> cutting off, destroying, removing; as धनद, अन्नद, गरद, तोयद, अनलद &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दः|द|दं
द + .{@-दः@}<BR>—1 A gift, donation.<BR>—2 A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दम्
द + .{@-दम्@} A wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दा
द + .{@-दा@}<BR>—1 Heat.<BR>—2 Repentance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंश्
दंश् I. €1 P. (दशति, दष्ट; <i>desid.</i> दिदङ्क्षति) To bite,<BR> sting; नखैरकर्तिषुस्तीक्ष्णैरदाङ्क्षुर्दशनैस्तथा Bk. 15. 4, 16. 19;<BR> मृणालिका अदशत् K. 32 ate, browsed &c. ━II. €1 P. €10 U. (दंशति,<BR> दंशयति-ते) To speak or shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशः|दंश
दंशः [दंश्-अच् भावे घञ् वा]<BR>—1 Biting, stinging; मुग्धे विधेहि मयि निर्दयदन्तदंशम् Gīt. 10.<BR>—2 The sting of a snake.<BR>—3 A bite, the spot bitten; छेदो दंशस्य दाहो वा M. 4. 4; U. 3. 35.<BR>—4 Cutting, tearing.<BR>—5 A gad-fly; R. 2. 5; Ms. 1. 40; Y. 3. 215.<BR>—6 A flaw, fault, defect (in a jewel).<BR>—7 A tooth; प्रत्युप्तमन्तः सविषश्च दंशः<BR>—8 Pungency.<BR>—9 An armour; शितविशिखहतो विशीर्णदंशः Bhāg. 1. 9. 38.<BR>—10 A joint, limb.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दंशभीरुः, दंशभीरुकः, दंशवदनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशभीरुः|दंशभीरु
दंशः + -भीरुः, -भीरुकः a buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशभीरुकः|दंशभीरुक
दंशः + -भीरुः, -भीरुकः a buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशवदनः|दंशवदन
दंशः + -वदनः a heron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशक|दंशकः
दंशक <i>a.</i> [दंश्-ण्वुल्] Biting, stinging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशकः|दंशक
दंशक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A dog.<BR>—2 A gad-fly.<BR>—3 A fly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशनम्
दंशनम् [दंश्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 The act of biting or stinging; <i>e. g.</i> दष्टाश्च दंशनैः कान्तं<BR> दासीकुर्वन्ति योषितः S. D.<BR>—2 An armour, mail; अदंशयन्नरहितशौर्यदंशनास्तनूः Śi. 17. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशित|दंशितः
दंशित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bitten.<BR>—2 Mailed, furnished with an armour; अन्वाद्रवद्दंशित उग्रधन्वा Bhāg. 1. 7. 17;<BR> तिष्ठन्तु दंशिताः शूराः पृष्ठे दश दश स्थिराः Śiva B. 21. 7.<BR>—3 Protected.<BR>—4 Fitting closely (as an armour).<BR>—5 Ready for; त्यक्त्वा सन्तापजं शोकं दंशितो भव कर्मणि Mb. 12. 22. 9.<BR>—6 Alert, attentive; शुश्रूषन्ते च वः शिष्याः कच्चिद्वर्मसु दंशिताः<BR> Rām. 2. 2. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशितम्
दंशित + .{@-तम्@} A bite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशिन्
दंशिन् <i>m.</i> See दंशक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशी
दंशी A small gad-fly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंशेर
दंशेर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Biting.<BR>—2 Noxious, hurtful, injurious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्रा
दंष्ट्रा [दंश्-ष्ट्रन् टाप्] A large tooth, tusk, fang; Rām. 2. 70. 20;<BR> प्रसह्य मणिमुद्धरेन्मकरवक्त्रदंष्ट्राङ्कुरात् Bh. 2. 4; R. 2. 46;<BR> दंष्ट्राभङ्गं मृगाणामधिपतय इव व्यक्तमानावलेपा नाज्ञाभङ्गं<BR> सहन्ते नृवर नृपतयस्त्वादृशाः सार्वभौमाः ॥ Mu. 3. 22.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दंष्ट्रास्त्रः, दंष्ट्रायुधः, दंष्ट्राकराल, दंष्ट्राविषः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्रास्त्रः|दंष्ट्रास्त्र
दंष्ट्रा + -अस्त्रः, -आयुधः a wild boar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्रायुधः|दंष्ट्रायुध
दंष्ट्रा + -अस्त्रः, -आयुधः a wild boar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्राकराल
दंष्ट्रा + -कराल <i>a.</i> having terrible tusks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्राविषः|दंष्ट्राविष
दंष्ट्रा + -विषः a kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्राल
दंष्ट्राल <i>a.</i> Having large tusks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्रिक
दंष्ट्रिक <i>a.</i> Tusked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्रिका
दंष्ट्रिक + .{@-का@} = दंष्ट्रा q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंष्ट्रिन्
दंष्ट्रिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tusked, having large teeth; Ms. 10. 89.<BR>—2 Biting or wounding with the teeth.<BR>—8 Carnivorous. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A wild boar; हन्तुमर्हति शरेण दंष्ट्रिणम् Ki. 13. 50.<BR>—2 A snake.<BR>—3 A hyena.<BR>—4 Any animal with tusks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनः|दशन|दशनं
दशनः, -नम्<BR> [दंश् भावे करणादौ वा ल्युट् नि˚ नलेपः]<BR>—1 A tooth; मुहुर्मुहुर्दशनविखण्डितोष्ठया Śi. 17. 2; शिखरिदशना<BR> Me. 84; Bg. 11. 27.<BR>—2 Biting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनम्
दशनः, -नम्<BR> [दंश् भावे करणादौ वा ल्युट् नि˚ नलेपः]<BR>—1 A tooth; मुहुर्मुहुर्दशनविखण्डितोष्ठया Śi. 17. 2; शिखरिदशना<BR> Me. 84; Bg. 11. 27.<BR>—2 Biting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनः|दशन|दशनं
दशनः, -नम् + .{@-नः@} The peak of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनम्
दशनः, -नम् + .{@-नम्@} An armour (also <i>m.</i>).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दशनांशुः, दशनाङ्कः, दशनोच्छिष्टः, दशनच्छदः, दशनवासस्, दशनपदम्, दशनबीजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनांशुः|दशनांशु
दशनः + -अंशुः brightness of the teeth; अथ मौलिगतस्येन्दोर्विशदैर्दशनांशुभिः<BR> (उपचिन्वन्) Ku. 6. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनाङ्कः|दशनाङ्क|दशनांक
दशनः + -अङ्कः a tooth-mark, bite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनोच्छिष्टः|दशनोच्छिष्ट
दशनः + -उच्छिष्टः<BR>—1 a lip.<BR>—2 a kiss.<BR>—3 a sigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनच्छदः|दशनच्छद
दशनः + -छदः, -वासस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 a lip.<BR>—2 a kiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनवासस्
दशनः + -छदः, -वासस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 a lip.<BR>—2 a kiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनपदम्
दशनः + -पदम् a bite, tooth-mark; दशनपदं भवदधरगतं मम<BR> जनयति चेतसि खेदम् Gīt. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशनबीजः|दशनबीज
