दंसनम्
दंसनम्, -ना, दंसस्, दंसिः Ved.<BR> An act, deed; Marvellous power or skill;<BR> तद्वां नरा सनये दंस उग्रमाविष्कृणोमि Bṛ. Up. 2. 5. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंसना
दंसनम्, -ना, दंसस्, दंसिः Ved.<BR> An act, deed; Marvellous power or skill;<BR> तद्वां नरा सनये दंस उग्रमाविष्कृणोमि Bṛ. Up. 2. 5. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंसस्
दंसनम्, -ना, दंसस्, दंसिः Ved.<BR> An act, deed; Marvellous power or skill;<BR> तद्वां नरा सनये दंस उग्रमाविष्कृणोमि Bṛ. Up. 2. 5. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दंसिः|दंसि
दंसनम्, -ना, दंसस्, दंसिः Ved.<BR> An act, deed; Marvellous power or skill;<BR> तद्वां नरा सनये दंस उग्रमाविष्कृणोमि Bṛ. Up. 2. 5. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0796-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

