—22 The penis.<BR>—23 Pride; या चापि न्यस्तदण्डानां तां गतिं व्रज पुत्रक Mb. 7. 78. 25.<BR>—24 The body.<BR>—25 An epithet of Yama.<BR>—26 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—27 N. of Śiva.<BR>—28 An attendant on the sun.<BR>—29 A horse (said to be <i>m.</i> only in this and the preceding four senses).<BR>—30 A particular appearance in the sky (similar to a stick).<BR>—31 An uninterrupted row or series, a line.<BR>—32 Standing upright or erect.<BR>—33 A corner, an angle.<BR>—34 The Science of Govt. विनयमूलो दण्डः, दण्डमूलास्तिस्रो विद्याः Kau. A. 1. 5.<BR>—35 Harm, injury; न्यासो दण्डस्य भूतेषु मनोवाक्कायजस्य यः Bhāg. 7. 15. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दण्डाजिनम्, दण्डाधिपः, दण्डानीकम्, दण्डापतानकः, दण्डावतानकः, दण्डापूपन्यायः, दण्डार्ह, दण्डालसिका, दण्डाख्यम्, दण्डाघातः, दण्डाज्ञा, दण्डाश्रमः, दण्डाश्रमिन्, दण्डासनम्, दण्डकासनम्, दण्डाहतम्, दण्डोद्यमः, दण्डकर्मन्, दण्डकलितम्, दण्डकल्पः, दण्डकाकः, दण्डकाष्ठम्, दण्डग्रहणम्, दण्डघ्न, दण्डचक्रः, दण्डच्छदनम्, दण्डढक्का, दण्डदासः, दण्डदेवकुलम्, दण्डधर, दण्डधार, दण्डधारणम्, दण्डनायकः, दण्डनिधानम्, दण्डनिपातनम्, दण्डनीतिः, दण्डनेतृ, दण्डपः, दण्डपांशुलः, दण्डपाणिः, दण्डपातः, दण्डपातनम्, दण्डपारुष्यम्, दण्डपालः, दण्डपालकः, दण्डपाशकः, दण्डपाशिकः, दण्डपोणम्, दण्डप्रणामः, दण्डबालधिः, दण्डभङ्गः, दण्डभृत्, दण्डमाणवः, दण्डमानवः, दण्डमाथः, दण्डमुखः, दण्डयात्रा, दण्डयामः, दण्डलेशम्, दण्डवधः, दण्डवाचिक, दण्डवादिन्, दण्डवारित, दण्डवासिकः, दण्डवासिन्, दण्डवाहिन्, दण्डविकल्पः, दण्डविधिः, दण्डविष्कम्भः, दण्डव्यूहः, दण्डशास्त्रम्, दण्डहस्तः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डाजिनम्
दण्डः + -अजिनम्<BR>—1 staff and hide (as outer badges of devotion).<BR>—2 (fig.) hypocrisy, deceit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डाधिपः|दण्डाधिप|दंडाधिप
दण्डः + -अधिपः a chief magistrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डानीकम्
दण्डः + -अनीकम् a detachment or division of an army; तव हृतवतो दण्डानीकैर्विदर्भपतेः<BR> श्रियम् M. 5. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डापतानकः|दण्डापतानक
दण्डः + -अपतानकः, -अवतानकः tetanus, lock-jaw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डावतानकः|दण्डावतानक
दण्डः + -अपतानकः, -अवतानकः tetanus, lock-jaw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डापूपन्यायः|दण्डापूपन्याय|दंडापूपन्याय
दण्डः + -अपूपन्यायः see under न्याय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डार्ह|दंडार्ह
दण्डः + -अर्ह <i>a.</i> fit to be chastised, deserving punishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डालसिका|दंडालसिका
दण्डः + -अलसिका cholera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डाख्यम्
दण्डः + -आख्यम् a house with two wings, one facing the north and the other<BR> the east; Bṛ. S. 53. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डाघातः|दण्डाघात
दण्डः + -आघातः a blow with a stick; पूर्वप्रविष्टान्क्रोधात्तान्दण्डाघातैरताडयन् Ks. 54. 203.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डाज्ञा|दंडाज्ञा
दण्डः + -आज्ञा judicial sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डाश्रमः|दण्डाश्रम
दण्डः + -आश्रमः the condition of a pilgrim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डाश्रमिन्
दण्डः + -आश्रमिन् <i>m.</i> a devotee, an ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डासनम्
दण्डः + -आसनम्, दण्डकासनम् lying prostrate on the ground, a kind of<BR> Āsana; Yoga S. 2. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डकासनम्
दण्डः + -आसनम्, दण्डकासनम् lying prostrate on the ground, a kind of<BR> Āsana; Yoga S. 2. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डाहतम्
दण्डः + -आहतम् butter-milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डोद्यमः|दण्डोद्यम
दण्डः + -उद्यमः<BR>—1 threatening.<BR>—2 (pl.) application of power; निःसाराल्पफलानि ये त्वविधिना वाञ्छन्ति<BR> दण्डोद्यमैः Pt. 1. 376.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डकर्मन्|दंडकर्मन्
दण्डः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> infliction of punishment, chastisement; देशकालवयःशक्ति<BR> संचिन्त्यं दण्डकर्मणि Y. 2. 275.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डकलितम्
दण्डः + -कलितम् repetition like a measuring rod, <i>i. e.</i> doing a matter<BR> after it is done in full first and then repeating it like that a second<BR> time and so on; आवृत्तिन्यायानां दण्डकलितं न्याय्यम् । ŚB. on MS. 10. 5. 83;<BR> ˚वत् <i>ind.</i> in the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">Page0799-1</a>]<BR> manner of a measuring rod.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0798-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डकल्पः
दण्डः + -कल्पः Infliction of punishment; शुद्धचित्रश्च दण्डकल्पः Kau. A. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डकाकः|दण्डकाक|दंडकाक
दण्डः + -काकः a raven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डकाष्ठम्
दण्डः + -काष्ठम् a wooden club or staff; दण्डकाष्ठमवलम्ब्य स्थितः Ś. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डग्रहणम्
दण्डः + -ग्रहणम् assumption of the staff of an ascetic or pilgrim, becoming a mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डघ्न
दण्डः + -घ्न <i>a.</i> striking with a stick, committing an assault; Ms. 8. 386.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डचक्रः|दण्डचक्र
दण्डः + -चक्रः a division of an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डच्छदनम्
दण्डः + -छदनम् a room in which utensils of various kinds are kept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डढक्का|दंडढक्का
दण्डः + -ढक्का a kind of drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डदासः|दण्डदास|दंडदास
दण्डः + -दासः one who has become a slave from non-payment of a debt; Ms. 8. 415.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डदेवकुलम्
दण्डः + -देवकुलम् a court of justice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डधर|दंडधर|दण्डधरः
दण्डः + -धर, -धार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 carrying a staff, staff-bearer.<BR>—2 punishing, chastising; दत्ताभये त्वयि यमादपि दण्डधारे U. 2. 11. 3<BR> exercising judicial authority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डधरः|दण्डधर|दंडधर
दण्डः + -धर, -धार + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a king; श्रमनुदं मनुदण्डधरान्वयम् R. 9. 3; बलीयानाबलं<BR> ग्रसते दण्डधराभावे Kau. A. 1. 4.<BR>—2 N. of Yama; यमो निहन्ता … … दण्डधरश्च कालः<BR>—3 a judge, supreme magistrate.<BR>—4 a mendicant carrying a staff.<BR>—5 a potter.<BR>—6 a general (of an army); Dk. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डधार|दंडधार|दण्डधारः
दण्डः + -धर, -धार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 carrying a staff, staff-bearer.<BR>—2 punishing, chastising; दत्ताभये त्वयि यमादपि दण्डधारे U. 2. 11. 3<BR> exercising judicial authority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डधारणम्
दण्डः + -धारणम्<BR>—1 carrying a staff (as by a Brahmachārin).<BR>—2 following the order of a mendicant.<BR>—3 infliction of punishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डनायकः|दण्डनायक|दंडनायक
दण्डः + -नायकः<BR>—1 a judge, a head police-officer, a magistrate.<BR>—2 the leader of an army, a general.<BR>—3 a king. ˚पुरुषः a policeman, constable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डनिधानम्
दण्डः + -निधानम् pardoning, indulgence; Mb. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डनिपातनम्
दण्डः + -निपातनम् punishing, chastising.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डनीतिः|दण्डनीति|दंडनीति
दण्डः + -नीतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 administration of justice, judicature.<BR>—2 the system of civil and military administration, the science of politics,<BR> polity; Ms. 7. 43; Y. 1. 311; फलान्युपायुङ्क्त स दण्डनीतेः R. 18. 46;<BR> जरातुरः संप्रति दण्डनीत्या सर्वं नृपस्यानुकरोमि वृत्तम् Nāg. 4. 1.<BR>—3 an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डनेतृ|दंडनेतृ
दण्डः + -नेतृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a king.<BR>—2 Yama; गृध्रा रुषा मम कृषन्त्यधिदण्डनेतुः Bhāg. 3. 16. 10.<BR>—3 a judge; Ms. 12. 100; Bhāg. 4. 22. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपः|दण्डप|दंडप
दण्डः + -पः a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपांशुलः|दण्डपांशुल|दंडपांशुल
दण्डः + -पांशुलः a porter, door-keeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपाणिः|दण्डपाणि|दंडपाणि
दण्डः + -पाणिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Yama; करोमि चिकित्सां दण्डपाणिरिव जनतायाः Bhāg. 5. 10. 7.<BR>—2 N. of the god Śiva at Benares.<BR>—3 a policeman; इति पश्चात्प्रविष्टास्ते पुरुषा दण्डपाणयः Ks. 54. 203.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपातः|दण्डपात|दंडपात
दण्डः + -पातः<BR>—1 falling of a stick.<BR>—2 infliction of punishment.<BR>—3 dropping one line in a manuscript.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपातनम्
दण्डः + -पातनम् infliction of punishment, chastisement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपारुष्यम्
दण्डः + -पारुष्यम्<BR>—1 assault, violence.<BR>—2 hard or cruel infliction of punishment; अत ऊर्ध्वं प्रवक्ष्यामि दण्डपारुष्यनिर्णयम् Ms. 8. 278.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपालः|दण्डपाल|दंडपाल
दण्डः + -पालः, -पालकः<BR>—1 a head magistrate.<BR>—2 a door-keeper, porter. Kau. A. 1. 12. —3 Ns. of two kinds of fishes; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपालकः|दण्डपालक|दंडपालक
दण्डः + -पालः, -पालकः<BR>—1 a head magistrate.<BR>—2 a door-keeper, porter. Kau. A. 1. 12. —3 Ns. of two kinds of fishes; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपाशकः|दण्डपाशक
दण्डः + -पाशकः, -पाशिकः<BR>—1 a head police-officer; Pt. 2; उच्यतामस्मद्वचनात्कालपाशिको दण्डपाशिकश्च Mu. 1. 20-21.<BR>—2 a hangman, an executioner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपाशिकः|दण्डपाशिक
दण्डः + -पाशकः, -पाशिकः<BR>—1 a head police-officer; Pt. 2; उच्यतामस्मद्वचनात्कालपाशिको दण्डपाशिकश्च Mu. 1. 20-21.<BR>—2 a hangman, an executioner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डपोणम्
दण्डः + -पोणम् a strainer furnished with a handle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डप्रणामः|दण्डप्रणाम|दंडप्रणाम
दण्डः + -प्रणामः<BR>—1 bowing by prostrating the body at full length (keeping it erect like<BR> a stick). cf. साष्टाङ्गनमस्कार.<BR>—2 falling flat or prostrate on the ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डबालधिः|दण्डबालधि
दण्डः + -बालधिः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डभङ्गः|दण्डभङ्ग|दंडभंग
दण्डः + -भङ्गः non-execution of a sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डभृत्|दंडभृत्
दण्डः + -भृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a potter.<BR>—2 an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डमाणवः|दण्डमाणव
दण्डः + -माणवः, -मानवः<BR>—1 a staff-bearer.<BR>—2 an ascetic bearing a staff; Rām. 2. 32. 18.<BR>—3 a chief or leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डमानवः|दण्डमानव
दण्डः + -माणवः, -मानवः<BR>—1 a staff-bearer.<BR>—2 an ascetic bearing a staff; Rām. 2. 32. 18.<BR>—3 a chief or leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डमाथः|दण्डमाथ|दंडमाथ
दण्डः + -माथः a principal road, highway.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डमुखः|दण्डमुख
दण्डः + -मुखः a leader, general of an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डयात्रा|दंडयात्रा
दण्डः + -यात्रा<BR>—1 a solemn procession (particularly bridal).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">Page0799-2</a>]<BR>—2 warlike expedition, conquest (of a region).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डयामः|दण्डयाम|दंडयाम
दण्डः + -यामः<BR>—1 an epithet of Yama.<BR>—2 of Agastya.<BR>—3 a day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डलेशम्
दण्डः + -लेशम् a small fine; Ms. 8. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डवधः|दण्डवध
दण्डः + -वधः capital punishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डवाचिक
दण्डः + -वाचिक <i>a.</i> actual or verbal (assault); Ms. 8. 6; cf. वाक्-पारुष्यम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डवादिन्|दंडवादिन्
दण्डः + -वादिन् <i>a.</i> reprimanding, censuring, threatening with punishment; (also <i>m.</i>).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डवारित
दण्डः + -वारित <i>a.</i> forbidden by threat of punishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डवासिकः|दण्डवासिक
दण्डः + -वासिकः a door-keeper, warder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डवासिन्|दंडवासिन्
दण्डः + -वासिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a door-keeper.<BR>—2 a magistrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डवाहिन्|दंडवाहिन्
दण्डः + -वाहिन् <i>m.</i> a police-officer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डविकल्पः|दण्डविकल्प
दण्डः + -विकल्पः discretion given to an officer in awarding punishment<BR> or fine; Ms. 9. 228.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0799-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दण्डविधिः|दण्डविधि|दंडविधि
