दन्दशः|दन्दश|दंदश|दंदशः
दन्दशः A tooth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0801-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दन्दशूक|दंदशूक|दन्दशूकः
दन्दशूक^1 <i>a.</i> [दंश्-यङ्-ऊक]<BR>—1 Biting, venomous. उवाचोपायं नितरां दन्दशूकाः प्रमादिनः । सर्पसत्रे<BR> प्रयास्यन्ति तीक्ष्णा विषधराः क्षयम् ॥ Bm. 1. 163-4.<BR>—2 Mischievous, malignant; Mb. 5. 35. 64.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0801-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दन्दशूकः|दन्दशूक|दंदशूक
दन्दशूकः + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A serpent, snake; Bhāg. 5. 26. 33.<BR>—2 A reptile in general.<BR>—3 A demon, Rākṣasa; इषुमति रघुसिंहे दन्दशूकाञ्जिघांसौ Bk. 1. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0801-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दन्द्रम्यमाण
