दर्दुरः [दृणाति कर्णौ शब्देन उरच् नि˚ Tv.]<BR>—1 A frog; पङ्कक्लिन्नमुखाः पिबन्ति सलिलं धाराहता दर्दुराः Mk. 5. 14.<BR>—2 A cloud.<BR>—3 A kind of musical instrument such as a flute.<BR>—4 A mountain; (दर्दुरोमलयसंनिकृष्टश्चन्दनगिरिः Rām. 2. 15. 34. com.).<BR>—5 N. of a mountain in the south (associated with Malaya); स्तनाविव<BR> दिशस्तस्याः शौलौ मलयदर्दुरौ R. 4. 51.<BR>—6 The sound of a drum.<BR>—7 A sort of rice.<BR>—8 A demon; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0803-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

