दल्
दल् €1 P. (दलति, दलित)<BR>—1 To burst open, split, cleave, crack; दलति हृदयं गाढोद्वेगं द्विधा<BR> तु न भिद्यते U. 3. 31; अपि ग्रावा रोदित्यपि दलति वज्रस्य हृदयम् 1. 28;<BR> Māl. 9. 12, 20; दलति न सा हृदि विरहभरेण Gīt. 7; Amaru. 43.<BR>—2 To expand, bloom, open (as a flower); दलन्नवनीलोत्पल U. 1;<BR> स्वच्छन्दं दलदरविन्द ते मरन्दं विन्दन्तो विदधतु गुञ्जितं मिलिन्दाः<BR> Bv. 1. 15; Śi. 6. 23; Ki. 10. 39. ━<i>Caus.</i> (द(दा)लयति)<BR>—1 To cause to burst, tear asunder.<BR>—2 To cut, divide, split.<BR>—3 To dispel, drive or chase away; दलयति परिशुष्यत्प्रौढतालीविपाण्डुः Māl. 8. 1.<BR>—4 To wither. ━<i>With</i> {@उद्@} (<i>caus.</i>) to tear up.<BR>━{@वि@}<BR>—1 To break, split, crack; त्वदिषुभिर्व्यदलिष्यदसावपि N. 4. 88.<BR>—2 to dig up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलः|दल|दलं
दलः, -लम्<BR> [दल्-अच्]<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) A piece, portion, part, fragment; वापीष्वन्तलींनमहानीलदलासु Śi. 4. 44.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) A piece torn or split off.<BR>——(<i>c</i>) Tearing, cutting.<BR>—2 A degree.<BR>—3 A half, the half.<BR>—4 A sheath, scabbard.<BR>—5 A small shoot or blade, a petal, leaf; ताम्बूलीनां दलैस्तत्र रचितापानभूमयः<BR> R. 4. 42; Ś. 3. 20, 21.<BR>—6 The blade of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">Page0804-2</a>]<BR> any weapon.<BR>—7 A clump, heap, quantity.<BR>—8 A detachment, a body of troops.<BR>—9 Alloy or adulteration.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दलाढकः, दलाढ्यम्, दलोदर, दलकपाटः, दलकोमलम्, दलकोषः, दलनिर्मोकः, दलपुष्पा, दलसूचिः, दलसूची, दलस्नसा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलम्
दलः, -लम्<BR> [दल्-अच्]<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) A piece, portion, part, fragment; वापीष्वन्तलींनमहानीलदलासु Śi. 4. 44.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) A piece torn or split off.<BR>——(<i>c</i>) Tearing, cutting.<BR>—2 A degree.<BR>—3 A half, the half.<BR>—4 A sheath, scabbard.<BR>—5 A small shoot or blade, a petal, leaf; ताम्बूलीनां दलैस्तत्र रचितापानभूमयः<BR> R. 4. 42; Ś. 3. 20, 21.<BR>—6 The blade of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">Page0804-2</a>]<BR> any weapon.<BR>—7 A clump, heap, quantity.<BR>—8 A detachment, a body of troops.<BR>—9 Alloy or adulteration.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दलाढकः, दलाढ्यम्, दलोदर, दलकपाटः, दलकोमलम्, दलकोषः, दलनिर्मोकः, दलपुष्पा, दलसूचिः, दलसूची, दलस्नसा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलाढकः|दलाढक
दलः + -आढकः<BR>—1 foam.<BR>—2 a cuttle-fish bone,<BR>—3 a ditch, moat.<BR>—4 a hurricane, high wind.<BR>—5 red chalk.<BR>—6 wild sesamum.<BR>—7 the Kunda creeper.<BR>—8 a Śūdra.<BR>—9 the headman of a village.<BR>—10 an elephantʼs ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलाढ्यम्
दलः + -आढ्यम् mud on the banks of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलोदर
दलः + -उदर <i>a.</i> having a tapering (leaf-like) belly; पूररेचकसंविग्नवलिवल्गुदलोदरम्<BR> Bhāg. 4. 24. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलकपाटः|दलकपाट
दलः + -कपाटः a folded leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलकोमलम्
दलः + -कोमलम् a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलकोषः|दलकोष
दलः + -कोषः the Kunda creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलनिर्मोकः|दलनिर्मोक|दलनिर्म्मोक|दलनिर्म्मोकः
दलः + -निर्मोकः the Bhūrja tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलपुष्पा
दलः + -पुष्पा the Ketaka plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलसूचिः|दलसूचि
दलः + -सूचिः, -सूची <i>f.</i> a thorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलसूची
दलः + -सूचिः, -सूची <i>f.</i> a thorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलस्नसा
दलः + -स्नसा the fibre or vein of a leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलनम्
दलनम् [दल्-करणे ल्युट्] Bursting, breaking, cutting, dividing,<BR> crushing, grinding, splitting; उत्तस्थुर्मेघदलना वैद्युता इव वह्नयः<BR> Bhāg. 7. 10. 60; मत्तेभकुम्भदलने भुवि सन्ति शूराः Bh. 1. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलनी
दलनी, दलिः <i>m., f.</i> A clod of earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलिः|दलि
दलनी, दलिः <i>m., f.</i> A clod of earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलशः
दलशः <i>ind.</i> By pieces, in fragments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलिकम्
दलिकम् Timber, a piece of wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलित|दलितं
दलित <i>p. p.</i> [दल्-क्त]<BR>—1 Broken, torn, rent, burst, split, ground; दलितमौक्तिकचूर्णविपाण्डवः Śi. 6. 35.<BR>—2 Opened, expanded.<BR>—3 Bisected.<BR>—4 Driven asunder, dispelled, scattered.<BR>—5 Trodden down, crushed, destroyed.<BR>—6 Manifested, displayed; Prab. 2. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दलपः|दलप
दलपः<BR>—1 A weapon.<BR>—2 Gold.<BR>—3 Śāstra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दल्भः|दल्भ
दल्भः<BR>—1 A wheel.<BR>—2 Fraud, dishonesty.<BR>—3 Sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दल्मिः|दल्मि
दल्मिः<BR>—1 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 Indraʼs thunderbolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवः|दव
दवः<BR>—1 A wood, forest; नमो नेदिष्ठाय प्रियदव दविष्ठाय च नमः Śivamahimna 29.<BR>—2 Wild fire, forest-conflagration; वितर वारिद वारि दवातुरे Subhāṣ.;<BR> Bhāg. 8. 6. 13.<BR>—3 Fire, heat.<BR>—4 Fever, pain.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दवाग्निः, दवानलः, दवदहनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवाग्निः|दवाग्नि
दवः + -अग्निः, -अनलः, -दहनः a forest-conflagration; शशाम वृष्टपापि<BR> विना दवाग्निः R. 2. 14; क्षुत्तृट्परीतोऽर्कदवानलानिलैः Bhāg. 3. 30. 22;<BR> यस्य न सविधे दयिता दवदहनस्तुहिनदीधितिस्तस्य । यस्य<BR> च सविधे दयिता दवदहनस्तुहिनदीधितिस्तस्य ॥ K. P. 9; P. R. 7. 23;<BR> Bv. 1. 36; Me. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवानलः|दवानल
दवः + -अग्निः, -अनलः, -दहनः a forest-conflagration; शशाम वृष्टपापि<BR> विना दवाग्निः R. 2. 14; क्षुत्तृट्परीतोऽर्कदवानलानिलैः Bhāg. 3. 30. 22;<BR> यस्य न सविधे दयिता दवदहनस्तुहिनदीधितिस्तस्य । यस्य<BR> च सविधे दयिता दवदहनस्तुहिनदीधितिस्तस्य ॥ K. P. 9; P. R. 7. 23;<BR> Bv. 1. 36; Me. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवदहनः|दवदहन
दवः + -अग्निः, -अनलः, -दहनः a forest-conflagration; शशाम वृष्टपापि<BR> विना दवाग्निः R. 2. 14; क्षुत्तृट्परीतोऽर्कदवानलानिलैः Bhāg. 3. 30. 22;<BR> यस्य न सविधे दयिता दवदहनस्तुहिनदीधितिस्तस्य । यस्य<BR> च सविधे दयिता दवदहनस्तुहिनदीधितिस्तस्य ॥ K. P. 9; P. R. 7. 23;<BR> Bv. 1. 36; Me. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवथुः|दवथु
दवथुः<BR>—1 Fire, heat.<BR>—2 Pain, anxiety, distress.<BR>—3 Inflammation of the eye.<BR>—4 Anger. (संताप); विलोलसदवथुवपुः Śi. 15. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवयति
दवयति Den. P. To make distant, remove (to a distance).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दविष्ठ|दविष्ठः
दविष्ठ <i>a.</i> (Superl. of दूर) Most distant &c.; दविष्ठाय<BR> च नमः Śivamahimna 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दविष्ठम्
दविष्ठ + .{@-ष्ठम्@} <i>ind.</i> Very far away; दविष्ठमस्य सत्पते कृधी सुगम् Rv. 6. 51. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दवीयस्
दवीयस् <i>a.</i> (Compar. of दूर)<BR>—1 More distant or remote; केषांचित्तु मते भूभृद्दवीयस्युत्तरापथे<BR> Rāj. T. 4. 369.<BR>—2 Far beyond or removed from; विद्यावतां सकलमेव गिरां दवीयः Bv. 1. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0804-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशन्
दशन् <i>Num. a.</i> (pl.) Ten; स भूमिं विश्वतो वृत्वा अत्यतिष्ठद्दशाङ्गुलम् Rv. 10. 90. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दशाङ्गुल, दशाधिपतिः, दशार्ध, दशार्हः, दशावताराः, दशावर, दशाश्वः, दशाननः, दशास्यः, दशामयः, दशेन्द्रियाणि, दशेशः, दशैकादशिक, दशकण्ठः, दशकन्धरः, दशकर्मन्, दशकुमारचरितम्, दशक्षीर, दशगुण, दशगुणित, दशप्रन्थाः, दशग्रामपतिः, दशग्रामिकः, दशग्रामिन्, दशग्रामी, दशग्रीवः, दशचतुष्कम्, दशधर्मः, दशपारमिताध्वरः, दशपुरम्, दशबन्धः, दशबलः, दशभूमिगः, दशबाहुः, दशभुजा, दशमहाविद्या, दशमालिकाः, दशमास्य, दशमुखः, दशमूत्रकम्, दशमूलम्, दशयोजनम्, दशरथः, दशरशिमशतः, दशरात्रम्, दशरूपकम्, दशरूपभृत्, दशलक्षण, दशणम्, दशलक्षणकः, दशवक्त्रः, दशवदनः, दशवर्गः, दशवाजिन्, दशवार्षिक, दशविध, दशशतम्, दशशती, दशसहस्रम्, दशसाहस्रम्, दशहरा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशाङ्गुल|दशांगुल|दशाङ्गुलं
दशन् + -अङ्गुल <i>a.</i> ten fingers long; Ms. 8. 271.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशाङ्गुलम्
दशन् + -अङ्गुल + .({@-लम्@})<BR>—1 a length of 10 fingers; Rv. 10. 90. 1.<BR>—2 a water-melon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशाधिपतिः|दशाधिपति
दशन् + -अधिपतिः a commander of ten men. Mb. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशार्ध|दशार्धः
दशन् + -अर्ध <i>a.</i> five,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशार्धम्
दशन् + -अर्ध + .({@-र्धम्@}) five; अण्व्यो मात्रा विनाशिन्यो दशार्धानां तु याः स्मृताः Ms. 1. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशार्धः|दशार्ध
दशन् + -अर्ध + .({@-र्धः@}) an epithet of Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशार्हः|दशार्ह
दशन् + -अर्हः<BR>—1 an epithet of Kṛṣṇa or Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशावताराः
दशन् + -अवताराः <i>m.</i> (pl.) the ten incarnations of Viṣṇu; see under अवतार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशावर
दशन् + -अवर <i>a.</i> consisting of at least ten; दशावरा वा परिषद्यं<BR> धर्मं परिकल्पयेत् Ms. 12. 110.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशाश्वः|दशाश्व
दशन् + -अश्वः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशाननः|दशानन
दशन् + -आननः, -आस्यः epithets of Rāvaṇā; दशाननकिरीटेभ्यस्तत्क्षणं<BR> राक्षसप्रियः R. 10. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशास्यः|दशास्य
दशन् + -आननः, -आस्यः epithets of Rāvaṇā; दशाननकिरीटेभ्यस्तत्क्षणं<BR> राक्षसप्रियः R. 10. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशामयः|दशामय
दशन् + -आमयः an epithet of Rudra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशेन्द्रियाणि
दशन् + -इन्द्रियाणि The five कर्मेन्द्रियs and five ज्ञानेन्द्रियs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशेशः|दशेश
दशन् + -ईशः a superintendent of 10 villages; Ms. 7. 116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशैकादशिक
दशन् + -एकादशिक <i>a.</i> who lends 10 and receives 11 in return; <i>i. e.</i><BR> who lends money at ten per cent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशकण्ठः|दशकण्ठ|दशकंठ
दशन् + -कण्ठः, -कन्धरः epithets of Rāvaṇa; सप्तलोकैकवीरस्य<BR> दशकण्ठकुलद्विषः U. 4. 27. ˚अरिः, ˚जित् <i>m.</i>, ˚रिपुः epithets<BR> of Rāma; दशकण्ठारिगुरुं विदुर्बुधाः R. 8. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशकन्धरः|दशकन्धर|दशकंधर
दशन् + -कण्ठः, -कन्धरः epithets of Rāvaṇa; सप्तलोकैकवीरस्य<BR> दशकण्ठकुलद्विषः U. 4. 27. ˚अरिः, ˚जित् <i>m.</i>, ˚रिपुः epithets<BR> of Rāma; दशकण्ठारिगुरुं विदुर्बुधाः R. 8. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशकर्मन्|दशकर्म्मन्
दशन् + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> the ten ceremonies prescribed to the three twice-born classes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशकुमारचरितम्
दशन् + -कुमारचरितम् a prose work by Daṇḍin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशक्षीर
दशन् + -क्षीर <i>a.</i> mixed with 10 parts of milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशगुण
दशन् + -गुण <i>a.</i> ten-fold, ten times larger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशगुणित
दशन् + -गुणित <i>a.</i> multiplied by 10; दशगुणितमिव प्राप्तवान् वीरधर्मम B. R. 9. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशप्रन्थाः
दशन् + -प्रन्थाः (pl.) संहिता, ब्राह्मण, आरण्यक, शिक्षा, कल्प, व्याकरण,<BR> निघण्टु, छन्द and निरुक्त; hence दशग्रन्थिन् = A person<BR> who has learnt by heart all these ten books.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशग्रामपतिः|दशग्रामपति
