दशग्रामिकः|दशग्रामिक
दशन् + -ग्रामपतिः, -ग्रामिकः, -ग्रामिन् <i>m.</i>, {@-पः@}<BR> a superintendent of ten villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशग्रामिन्
दशन् + -ग्रामपतिः, -ग्रामिकः, -ग्रामिन् <i>m.</i>, {@-पः@}<BR> a superintendent of ten villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशग्रामी
दशन् + -ग्रामी a collection or corporation of ten villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0805-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दशग्रीवः|दशग्रीव
