दाति|दातिः
दाक, दाति, दातृ, दानम्, दानु, &c. See under दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0809-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दातृ
दाक, दाति, दातृ, दानम्, दानु, &c. See under दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0809-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानम्
दाक, दाति, दातृ, दानम्, दानु, &c. See under दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0809-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानु|दानुः
दाक, दाति, दातृ, दानम्, दानु, &c. See under दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0809-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दात्यूहः|दात्यूह
दात्यूहः<BR>—1 The gallinule; दात्यूहैस्तिनिशस्य कोटरवति स्कन्धे निलीय स्थितम् Māl. 9. 7.<BR>—2 The Chātaka bird; Bhāg. 3. 15. 18.<BR>—3 A cloud.<BR>—4 A water-crow. (Written also दात्यौह).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0809-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दादः|दाद
दादः [दद्-घञ्] A gift, donation; Śi. 19. 114.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दाददः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाददः|दादद
दादः + -दः a donor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाधिक|दाधिकं
दाधिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Made of or from, or mixed or sprinkled with, coagulated milk.<BR>—2 Carrying about or selling coagulated milk.<BR>—3 Eating anything with coagulated milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाधिकम्
दाधिक + .{@-कम्@} A kind of broth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दान्
दान् €1 U. (दानति-ते) To cut, divide. ━<i>Desid.</i> (दीदांसतिते)<BR> To make straight; (<i>desid.</i> in form, but not in sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानवः|दानव
दानवः [दनोरपत्यम् अण्] A demon, Rākṣasa; त्रिदिवमुद्धृतदानवकण्टकम् Ś. 7. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दानवारिः, दानवगुरुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानवारिः|दानवारि
दानवः + -अरिः<BR>—1 a god.<BR>—2 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानवगुरुः|दानवगुरु
दानवः + -गुरुः an epithet of Śukra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दानवेयः|दानवेय
दानवेयः = दानव q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दान्त|दांत|दान्तः
दान्त, दान्तिः See under दम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दान्तिः|दान्ति|दांति|दांतिः
दान्त, दान्तिः See under दम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दान्तिक|दांतिक
दान्तिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Made of ivory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दापन|दापनं
दापन, दापित See under दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दापित|दापितः
दापन, दापित See under दा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामम्
दामम् (At the end of a compound) Wreath, garland.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामन्
दामन् <i>n.</i> [दो-मनिन्]<BR>—1 A string, thread, fillet, rope.<BR>—2 A chaplet, a garland in general; आद्ये बद्धा विरहदिवसे या शिखा<BR> दाम हित्वा Me. 93; कनकचम्पकदामगौरीम् C. P. 1; Śi. 4. 50.<BR>—3 A line, streak (as of lightning); विद्युद्दाम्ना हेमराजीव विन्ध्यम्<BR> M. 3. 20; Me. 27.<BR>—4 A large bandage.<BR>—5 Ved. A gift.<BR>—6 A portion, share.<BR>—7 A girdle.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दामाञ्चलम्, दामाञ्जनम्, दामोदरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामाञ्चलम्
दामन् + -अञ्चलम्, -अञ्जनम् a foot-rope for horses, &c.; सस्रुः सरोषपरिचारकवार्यमाणा<BR> दामाञ्चलस्खलितलोलपदं तुरङ्गाः Śi. 5. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामाञ्जनम्
दामन् + -अञ्चलम्, -अञ्जनम् a foot-rope for horses, &c.; सस्रुः सरोषपरिचारकवार्यमाणा<BR> दामाञ्चलस्खलितलोलपदं तुरङ्गाः Śi. 5. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामोदरः|दामोदर
दामन् + -उदरः an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामनी
दामनी A foot-rope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामा
दामा A string, cord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दामिनी
दामिनी Lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाम्नी
दाम्नी A garland; ‘यस्या दाम्न्या त्रिधाम्नो जघनकलितया˚’ -विष्णुपादादिकेशान्तवर्णनस्तोत्रम् 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाम्पत्यम्
दाम्पत्यम् Matrimony, the matrimonial relation; ये मां भजन्ति दाम्पत्ये<BR> तपसा व्रतचर्यया Bhāg. 10. 60. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाम्भिक|दांभिक|दाम्भिकः
दाम्भिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [दम्भेन चरति धर्मम्-ठक्]<BR>—1 Deceitful, hypocritical.<BR>—2 Proud, imperious.<BR>—3 Ostentatious, sanctimonious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दाम्भिकः|दाम्भिक|दांभिक
दाम्भिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A cheat.<BR>—2 A hypocrite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायः|दाय
दायः [दा भावे-घञ्]<BR>—1 A gift, present, donation; रहसि रमते प्रीत्या दायं ददात्यनुवर्तते<BR> Māl. 3. 2; प्रीतिदायः Māl. 4; Ms. 8. 199.<BR>—2 A nuptial present (given to the bride or the bridegroom).<BR>—3 Share, portion, inheritance, patrimony; अनपत्यस्य पुत्रस्य माता<BR> दायमवाप्नुयात् Ms. 9. 217, 77, 164, 203.<BR>—4 A part or share in general.<BR>—5 Delivering, handing over.<BR>—6 Dividing, distributing.<BR>—7 Loss, destruction.<BR>—8 Irony.<BR>—9 Site, place.<BR>—10 Alms given to a student at his initiation, &c.<BR>—11 A relative or a kinsman; तेलङ्गदायसहिता निष्पेतुरहिते तदा<BR> Parṇāl. 5. 79.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दायापवर्तनम्, दायार्ह, दायादः, दायादा, दायादी, दायाद्यम्, दायकालः, दायबन्धुः, दायभागः, दायविभागः, दायहरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायापवर्तनम्
दायः + -अपवर्तनम् forfeiture of inheritance;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-2" target="_blank">Page0810-2</a>]<BR> Ms. 9. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायार्ह
दायः + -अर्ह <i>a.</i> claiming inheritance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायादः|दायाद
दायः + -आदः [दायमादत्ते, आदा-क]<BR>—1 one entitled to a share of patrimony; an heir; पुमान् दायादोऽदायादा<BR> स्त्री Nir.; Y. 2. 118; Ms. 8. 160.<BR>—2 a son; दितेर्द्वावेव दायादौ दैत्यदानववन्दितौ Bhāg. 6. 18. 11.<BR>—3 a relative, kinsman, near or remote; स्थितः प्रास्तस्य दायादैर्भ्रातुर्ज्येष्ठस्य<BR> शासने Ki. 11. 45; a distant descendant; अयमिक्ष्वाकुदायादः Rām. 1. 60. 2.<BR>—4 a claimant or pretender in general; गवां गोषु वा दायादः Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायादा
दायः + -आदा, -आदी<BR>—1 an heiress.<BR>—2 a daughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायादी
दायः + -आदा, -आदी<BR>—1 an heiress.<BR>—2 a daughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायाद्यम्
दायः + -आद्यम्<BR>—1 inheritance; Ms. 11. 184.<BR>—2 the state of being an inheritor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायकालः|दायकाल
दायः + -कालः the time of the partition of an inheritance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायबन्धुः|दायबन्धु|दायबंधु
दायः + -बन्धुः<BR>—1 a partner in the inheritance.<BR>—2 a brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायभागः|दायभाग
दायः + -भागः division of property among heirs, partition (of inheritance);<BR> दायभागं निबोधत Ms. 9. 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0810-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दायविभागः|दायविभाग
