दार्ढ्यम्
दार्ढ्यम् [दृढस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Hardness, tightness, firmness.<BR>—2 Confirmation, corroboration.<BR>—3 Strength, energy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0811-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दार्दुरः|दार्दुर|दार्दुरं|दार्द्दुर|दार्द्दुरं
दार्दुरः, -रम्<BR>—1 A conch-shell the valve of which opens to the right.<BR>—2 Water.<BR>—3 Lac. ━<i>a.</i><BR>—1 Relating to the दर्दुर mountain; गन्धान् मनोज्ञान् विसृजद्दार्दुरं<BR> शिखरं यथा Rām. 2. 15. 34.<BR>—2 Relating to a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0811-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दार्दुरम्
दार्दुरः, -रम्<BR>—1 A conch-shell the valve of which opens to the right.<BR>—2 Water.<BR>—3 Lac. ━<i>a.</i><BR>—1 Relating to the दर्दुर mountain; गन्धान् मनोज्ञान् विसृजद्दार्दुरं<BR> शिखरं यथा Rām. 2. 15. 34.<BR>—2 Relating to a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0811-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

