दिधिषुः<BR>—1 The second husband of a woman married again or twice.<BR>—2 A suitor.<BR>—3 A husband; ब्राह्मणी वीक्ष्य दिधिषुं पुरुषादेन भक्षितम् Bhāg. 9. 9. 35.<BR>━<i>f.</i> A virgin widow remarried.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0812-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिधिषूः
दिधि(धी)षूः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A woman twice married.<BR>—2 An unmarried elder sister whose younger sister is married; ज्येष्ठायां<BR> यद्यनूढायां कन्यायामुह्यतेऽनुजा । सा चाग्रेदिधिषूर्ज्ञेया पूर्वा च दिधिषूः स्मृता ॥<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दिधिषूपतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0813-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिधीषूः
दिधि(धी)षूः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A woman twice married.<BR>—2 An unmarried elder sister whose younger sister is married; ज्येष्ठायां<BR> यद्यनूढायां कन्यायामुह्यतेऽनुजा । सा चाग्रेदिधिषूर्ज्ञेया पूर्वा च दिधिषूः स्मृता ॥<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दिधिषूपतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0813-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिधिषूपतिः|दिधिषूपति
दिधिषूः + -पतिः a man who has a sexual intercourse with the widow of his<BR> brother (not as a sacred duty but for carnal gratification); भ्रातुर्मृतस्य<BR> भार्यायां योऽनुरज्येत कामतः । धर्मेणापि नियुक्तायां स ज्ञेयो दिधिषूपतिः Ms. 3. 173.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0813-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिधीर्षा
दिधीर्षा Desire to sustain or support; दिक्कुञ्जराः कुरुत तत्त्रितये<BR> दिधीर्षाम् B. R. 1. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0813-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

