दिवसः + -ईश्वरः, -करः, -नाथः the sun; दिवसकरमयूखैर्बोध्यमानं<BR> प्रभाते Ṛs. 3. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0814-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

