दिक्कामिनी
दिश् + -कन्या, -कान्ता, -कामिनी, -वधू a region of the sky (considered as a virgin).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0815-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिग्वधू
दिश् + -कन्या, -कान्ता, -कामिनी, -वधू a region of the sky (considered as a virgin).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0815-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दिक्करः|दिक्कर
