दीर्घ + -आयुस्, -आयुष्य <i>a.</i> longlived. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a crow.<BR>—2 N. of Mārkaṇḍeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0818-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

