दीर्घ + -कोशा, -कोशी, -कोशिका a cockle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0818-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

