दीर्घतपस्
दीर्घ + -तपस् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Gautama, husband of Ahalyā; येषु<BR> दीर्घतपसः परिग्रहो वासवक्षणकलत्रतां ययौ R. 11. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0818-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

