दीर्घद्रुः|दीर्घद्रु
दीर्घ + -तरुः, -द्रुः the palm tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0818-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दीर्घतुण्डी|दीर्घतुंडी
