दुःख + -त्रयाभिघातः unbearable association of the three sufferings;<BR> दुःखत्रयाभिघाताज्जिज्ञासा Sāṅ. K. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखदुःखम्
दुःख + -दुःखम् (instr.) with great difficulty; (धारयन्ती) शय्योत्सङ्गे<BR> निहितमसकृद्दुःखदुःखेन गात्रम् Me. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखदुःखिन्
दुःख + -दुःखिन् <i>a.</i> having sorrow upon sorrow; मया रक्षति दुःखदुखी<BR> Bhāg. 11. 11. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखदोह्या
दुःख + -दोह्या (a cow) difficult to be milked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखप्राय
दुःख + -प्राय, -बहुल <i>a.</i> full of trouble or grief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखबहुल
दुःख + -प्राय, -बहुल <i>a.</i> full of trouble or grief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखभागिन्
दुःख + -भागिन्, -भाज् <i>a.</i> unhappy. Ms. 4. 157. {@भोगः@} occurrence<BR> of trouble or misery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखभाज्
दुःख + -भागिन्, -भाज् <i>a.</i> unhappy. Ms. 4. 157. {@भोगः@} occurrence<BR> of trouble or misery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखयोगः|दुःखयोग
दुःख + -योगः infliction of pain; Ms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखलव्य
दुःख + -लव्य <i>a.</i> hard to be pierced or cut; B. R. 4. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखलोकः|दुःखलोक
दुःख + -लोकः worldly life, the world as a scene of constant suffering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखशील
दुःख + -शील <i>a.</i><BR>—1 hard to please<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">Page0819-2</a>]<BR> or manage, bad tempered, irritable; उपेत्य सा दोहददुःखशीलताम् R. 3. 6; Ś. 4.<BR>—2 accustomed to the misery of; कामेकपत्नीव्रतदुःखशीलाम् Ku. 3. 7;<BR> who is accustomed to (suffer) the misery (hard lot) of a perfectly chaste life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखसंचार
दुःख + -संचार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 passing (time) unhappily.<BR>—2 impassable<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखसागरः|दुःखसागर
दुःख + -सागरः ‘the sea of troubles’; worldly life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखता
दुःखता uneasiness, pain, discomfort; Ch. Up. 7. 26. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखाकृत
दुःखाकृत [दुःखात् प्रातिलोम्ये इति डाच् P. V. 4. 64] Hurt, oppressed;<BR> N. 22. 138; Śi. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखायते
दुःखायते Den. Ā. To feel pain, be distressed. (Also दुःख्यति Den. P.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखित|दुःखितः
दुःखित <i>a.</i> [दुःख तार˚ इतच्]<BR>—1 Distressed, afflicted, pained; दुःखिता यत्र दृश्येरन् विकृताः पापकारिणः Ms. 9. 288.<BR>—2 Poor, unhappy, miserable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखितम्
दुःखित + .{@-तम्@} Trouble, distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखिन्
दुःखिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Distressed, afflicted, pained.<BR>—2 Difficult, painful.<BR>—3 poor, miserable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुःखीयति
दुःखीयति Den. P. To suffer pain, be distressed; दुःखीयति सुखहेतोः<BR> को मूढः सेवकादन्यः H. 2. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुकूलम्
दुकूलम् Woven silk, silk-garment, a very fine garment in general;<BR> श्यामलमृदुलकलेवरमण्डनमाधिगतगौरदुकूलम् Gīt. 11; Ku. 5. 67, 78;<BR> Bk. 3. 34, 10. 1; R. 17. 25; also दुगूल.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दुकूलपट्टः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0819-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

