दुन्दुमारः|दुन्दुमार|दुंदुमारः
दुन्दुमारः<BR>—1 A sort of red worm.<BR>—2 The smoke of a house.<BR>—3 A cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0820-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

