दुर्मरम्
दुर् + -मरम् a hard or difficult death; Mb. 14. 61. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0822-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

