दुर्मरणम्
दुर् + -मरणम् violent or unnatural death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0822-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्मर्ष
दुर् + -मर्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unbearable; Bhāg. 6. 5. 42.<BR>—2 obstinate,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0823-1" target="_blank">Page0823-1</a>]<BR> hostile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0822-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्मर्षणः|दुर्मर्षण
दुर् + -मर्षणः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0823-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्मर्षित
दुर् + -मर्षित <i>a.</i> provocated, encouraged; एवं दुर्मर्षितो राजा<BR> स मात्रा वभ्रुवाहनः Mb. 14. 79. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0823-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुर्मर्याद
