दुग्ध + -अग्रम्, -अम्रम्, -तालीयम् the skim of milk, cream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

