दुग्ध + -अङ्कः a kind of white stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुग्धदा
दुग्ध + -दा a milch cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

