दुग्ध + -पाचनम्<BR>—1 a vessel for boiling milk;<BR>—2 a kind of salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुग्धपाषाणम्
दुग्ध + -पाषाणम् calcareous spar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुग्धपोष्य
दुग्ध + -पोष्य <i>a.</i> living on the motherʼs milk (as a child), a suckling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

