दुग्ध + -बन्धः, -बन्धकः the post to which a cow is tied before being milked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

