दुग्ध + -बीजा<BR>—1 rice mixed with milk.<BR>—2 a kind of gourd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुग्धसमुद्रः|दुग्धसमुद्र
दुग्ध + -समुद्रः, -अब्धिः the ocean of milk, one of the seven oceans.<BR> ˚तनया <i>f.</i> goddess Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुग्धाब्धिः|दुग्धाब्धि
दुग्ध + -समुद्रः, -अब्धिः the ocean of milk, one of the seven oceans.<BR> ˚तनया <i>f.</i> goddess Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुग्धिका
दुग्धिका A kind of plant, Asclepias (Mar. दुधी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुघ
दुघ <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp). Milking, yielding, granting, as<BR> in कामदुघ q. v. अवेहि मां कामदुघां प्रसन्नाम् R. 2. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुघा
दुघ + .{@-घा@} A milch-cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोग्धृ
दोग्धृ <i>m.</i> [दुह्-तृच्]<BR>—1 A cowherd, a milk-man; मेरौ स्थिते दोग्धरि दोहदक्षे Ku. 1. 2.<BR>—2 A calf.<BR>—3 A panegyrist, one who writes verses for hire or reward.<BR>—4 One who performs anything out of interested motives (with a view to<BR> profit himself).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोग्ध्री
दोग्ध्री<BR>—1 A cow which yields milk.<BR>—2 A wet-nurse (having much milk; Mar. दाइ).<BR>—3 A female who gives anything (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोघ|दोघः
दोघ <i>a.</i> Ved. Milking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोघः|दोघ
दोघ + .{@-घः@} Milking; उरुं दोघं धरुणं देव रायः Rv. 5. 15. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोहः|दोह
दोहः [दुह् भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Milking; आश्चर्यो गवां दोहोऽगोपेन Sk.; Ku. 1. 2; R. 2. 28, 17. 19.<BR>—2 Milk.<BR>—3 A milk-pail; दोहवत्सादिभेदेन क्षीरभेदं कुरूद्वह Bhāg. 4. 18. 27.<BR>—4 Making profit out of anything, satisfaction, success, gain; वाग्दोहं वाचो दोहोऽन्नवानन्नादो भवति Ch. Up. 1. 3. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दोहापनयः, दोहजम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोहापनयः|दोहापनय
दोहः + -अपनयः, -जम् milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोहजम्
दोहः + -अपनयः, -जम् milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोहन|दोहनं
दोहन <i>a.</i> [दुह् भावे ल्यु ल्युट् वा]<BR>—1 Milking.<BR>—2 Yielding or granting (desired objects).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोहनम्
दोहन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Milking.<BR>—2 A milkpail; यां दुदोह पृथुस्तत्र को वत्सो दोहनं च किम् Bhāg. 4. 16. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोहनी
दोहन + .{@-नी@} A milk-pail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोहित
दोहित <i>p. p.</i> Milked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोह्य|दोह्यं
दोह्य <i>a.</i> [दुह् कर्मणि ण्यत्] To be milked, milkable; Y. 2. 177.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोह्यम्
दोह्य + .{@-ह्यम्@} Milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दोह्या
दोह्य + .{@-ह्या@} A cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुहितृ
दुहितृ <i>f.</i> [दुह् दह् वा तृच्] A daughter<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दुहितृपतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुहितृपतिः|दुहितृपति
दुहितृ + -पतिः a son-in-law (also दुहितुः पतिः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दुहिलितिका
दुहिलितिका A hairy variety of skins of animals; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दू
दू €4 Ā. (दूयते, दून)<BR>—1 To be afflicted, suffer pain, be sorry; न दूये सात्वतीसूनुर्यन्मह्यमपराध्यति<BR> Śi. 2. 11; कथमथ वञ्चयते जनमनुगतमसमशरज्वरदूनम् Gīt. 8<BR> ‘afflicted or distressed &c.’ see दु <i>pass.</i><BR>—2 To give or cause pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूडम
दूडम <i>a.</i> Afflicted; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूडाश|दूडाशः
दूडाश <i>a.</i> Sick; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0827-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूढ्य|दूढ्यः
दूढ्य <i>a.</i> Base, low; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूणाश|दूणाशः
दूणाश <i>a.</i> Difficult to destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतः|दूत
दूतः, दूतकः [cf. Uṇ. 3. 90]<BR>—1 A messenger; अर्थानर्थान्तरे बुद्धिर्निश्चितापि न शोभते । घातयन्ति<BR> हि कार्याणि दूताः पण्डितमानिनः ॥ Rām. 5. 30. 38.<BR>—2 An envoy, an ambassador; Cāṇ. 106. {@दूतयति@} <i>Denom.</i> To<BR> send as a messenger; अधिस्त्रि तं दूतयताम् N. 9. 22.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दूतमुख, दूतसंपातः, दूतसंप्रेषणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतकः|दूतक
दूतः, दूतकः [cf. Uṇ. 3. 90]<BR>—1 A messenger; अर्थानर्थान्तरे बुद्धिर्निश्चितापि न शोभते । घातयन्ति<BR> हि कार्याणि दूताः पण्डितमानिनः ॥ Rām. 5. 30. 38.<BR>—2 An envoy, an ambassador; Cāṇ. 106. {@दूतयति@} <i>Denom.</i> To<BR> send as a messenger; अधिस्त्रि तं दूतयताम् N. 9. 22.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दूतमुख, दूतसंपातः, दूतसंप्रेषणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतमुख
दूतः + -मुख <i>a.</i> speaking by an ambassador; Śi. 2. 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतसंपातः
दूतः + -संपातः, -संप्रेषणम् Sending a messenger; स दारकस्य कारणाद्<BR> दूतसंपातं करोति Svapna. 1; Ms. 7. 153.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतसंप्रेषणम्
दूतः + -संपातः, -संप्रेषणम् Sending a messenger; स दारकस्य कारणाद्<BR> दूतसंपातं करोति Svapna. 1; Ms. 7. 153.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूतिका
दूतिका, -दूती<BR>—1 A female messenger, a confidante.<BR>—2 A go-between, procuress.<BR>—3 A gossiping or mischief-making woman. (<i>N. B.</i> The ती of दूती<BR> is sometimes shortened; see R. 18. 53, 19. 18; Ku. 4. 16 and Malli. thereon.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूती
दूतिका, -दूती<BR>—1 A female messenger, a confidante.<BR>—2 A go-between, procuress.<BR>—3 A gossiping or mischief-making woman. (<i>N. B.</i> The ती of दूती<BR> is sometimes shortened; see R. 18. 53, 19. 18; Ku. 4. 16 and Malli. thereon.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूत्यम्
दूत्यम्<BR>—1 Employment of a messenger.<BR>—2 An embassy.<BR>—3 A message.<BR>—4 The state or function of a messenger; प्रेषयामास दौत्येन रावणस्य<BR> ततोऽङ्गदम् Mb. 3. 283. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दून|दूनः
दून See under दु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूप्र
दूप्र <i>a.</i> Strong; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूर|दूरं
दूर <i>a.</i> (<i>compar.</i> दवीयस्, <i>superl.</i> दविष्ठ)<BR>—1 Distant, remote, far off, a long way off, long; किं दूरं व्यवसायिनाम्<BR> Cāṇ. 73; न योजनशतं दूरं वाह्यमानस्य तृष्णया H. 1. 146, 49.<BR>—2 Very high, up; दूरमप्युदितः सूर्यः शशाङ्क इव लक्ष्यते Rām. 3. 16. 18.<BR>—3 Excessive, very much; विचिक्षिपे शूलभृतां सलीलं स पत्रिभिर्दूरमदूरपातैः Ki. 17. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरम्
दूर + .{@-रम्@} Distance, remoteness. [<i>N. B.</i> Some of the oblique cases<BR> of दूर are used adverbially as follows:−<BR>——(<i>a</i>) दूरम् —1 to a distance, far away, far or distant from (with<BR> abl. or gen.); ग्रामात् or ग्रामस्य दूरम् Sk.<BR>—2 high above.<BR>—3 deeply, far below.<BR>—4 highly, in a high degree, very much; नेत्रे दूरमनञ्जने S. D.<BR>—5 entirely, completely; निमग्नां दूरमम्भसि Ks. 10. 29; दूरमुद्धूतपापाः<BR> Me. 57; दूरकृ to surpass, exceed सा तस्य कर्मनिर्वृत्तेर्दूरं पश्चात्कृता<BR> फलैः R. 17. 18. ˚करण <i>a.</i> making far or distant, removing.<BR> ˚गम <i>a.</i> going far away; दूरंगमं ज्योतिषां ज्योतिरेकम् Vāj. 34. 1.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) दूरेण —1 far, from a distant place, from afar; खलः कापट्यदोषेण<BR> दूरेणैव विसृज्यते Bv. 1. 78. —2 by far, in a high degree; दूरेण<BR> ह्यवरं कर्म बुद्धियोगाद्धनञ्जय Bg. 2. 49; R. 10. 30, v. l.<BR>——(<i>c</i>)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरात्
दूर + .{@-दूरात्@}<BR>—1 from a distance, from afar; प्रक्षालनाद्धि पङ्कस्य दूरादस्पर्शनं<BR> वरम्, दूरादागतः ‘come from afar’ (regarded as comp.); नदीयमभितो … … दूरात्परित्यज्यताम्<BR> Bh. 1. 81; R. 1. 6.<BR>—2 in a remote degree.<BR>—3 from a remote period.<BR>——(<i>d</i>) दूरे far, away, in a distant place; न मे दूरे किंचित्क्षणमपि<BR> न पार्श्वे रथजवात् Ś. 1. 9; भोः श्रेष्ठिन् शिरसि भयमतिदूरे तत्प्रतीकारः<BR> Mu. 1; Bh. 3. 88. ˚कृ to discard; ऋजुतां दूरे कुरु प्रेयसि Amaru. 70.<BR> ˚भू, ˚गम् to be far away or gone off; Ks. ˚तिष्ठतु let it<BR> be, never mind; दूरे तिष्ठतु तद्वृद्धिः Ks. 6. 37. दूरीकृ means<BR>—1 to remove<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">Page0828-2</a>]<BR> to a distance, remove, take away; आश्रमे दूरीकृतश्रमे Dk. 5; Bv. 1. 122.<BR>—2 to deprive (one) of, separate; कुपिता न्यायेन दूरीकृताः Mk. 9. 4.<BR>—3 to prevent, ward off.<BR>—4 to surpass, excel, distance; दूरीकृताः खलु गुणैरुद्यानलता वनलताभिः<BR> Ś. 1. 17; so दूरीभू to be away or removed, be separated from, be<BR> at a distance; दूरीभूते मयि सहचरे चक्रवाकीमिवैकाम् Me. 85.]<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: दूरान्तरित, दूरापेत, दूरागत, दूरापातः, दूराप्लाव, दूरारूढ, दूरेरितेक्षण, दूरोत्सारित, दूरग, दूरगत, दूरगामिन्, दूरग्रहणम्, दूरदर्शन, दूरदर्शन, दूरदृश्, दूरदर्शिन्, दूरदृष्टिः, दूरपातः, दूरपात, दूरपातिन्, दूरपातनम्, दूरपात्र, दूरपार, दूरबन्धु, दूरभाज्, दूरभिन्न, दूरवर्तिन्, दूरवस्त्रक, दूरवासिन्, दूरविलम्बिन्, दूरवेधिन्, दूरश्रवणम्, दूरश्रवस्, दूरसंस्थ, दूरस्थ, दूरस्थित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरान्तरित|दूरांतरित
दूर + -अन्तरित <i>a.</i> separated by a long distance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरापेत
दूर + -अपेत <i>a.</i> quite out of question.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरागत
दूर + -आगत <i>a.</i> coming from afar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरापातः|दूरापात
दूर + -आपातः shooting from afar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूराप्लाव
दूर + -आप्लाव <i>a.</i> jumping or leaping far.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरारूढ
दूर + -आरूढ<BR>—1 mounted high.<BR>—2 far-advanced, intense, vehement; दूरारूढः खलु प्रणयोऽसहनः V. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरेरितेक्षण|दूरेरितेक्षणः
दूर + -ईरितेक्षण <i>a.</i> squint-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरोत्सारित
दूर + -उत्सारित <i>a.</i> driven far away, removed, banished; दूरोत्सारितहृदयानन्दः V. 4. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरग
दूर + -ग, -गत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 far removed, distant.<BR>—2 gone far, far advanced, grown intense; न ददाह भूरुहवनानि हरितनयधाम<BR> दूरगम् Ki. 12. 16. दूरगतमन्मथाऽक्षमेयं कालहरणस्य Ś. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरगत
दूर + -ग, -गत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 far removed, distant.<BR>—2 gone far, far advanced, grown intense; न ददाह भूरुहवनानि हरितनयधाम<BR> दूरगम् Ki. 12. 16. दूरगतमन्मथाऽक्षमेयं कालहरणस्य Ś. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरगामिन्
दूर + -गामिन् <i>m.</i> an arrow<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरग्रहणम्
दूर + -ग्रहणम् the supernatural faculty of seeing objects though situated at a distance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदर्शन|दूरदर्शनः
दूर + -दर्शन <i>a.</i> visible only from afar; अहो सनाथा भवतास्म<BR> यद्वयं त्रैविष्टपानामपि दूरदर्शनम् Bhāg. 1. 11. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदर्शन|दूरदर्शनः
दूर + -दर्शन, -दृश् <i>a.</i> far-seeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदृश्
दूर + -दर्शन, -दृश् <i>a.</i> far-seeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदर्शनः|दूरदर्शन
दूर + -दर्शन, -दृश् + .({@-नः@}), <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a vulture.<BR>—2 a learned man, a Pandit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदर्शनम्
दूर + -दर्शन, -दृश् + .({@-नम्@}) prudence, foresight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदर्शिन्
दूर + -दर्शिन् <i>a.</i> far-seeing, foresighted, prudent. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a vulture.<BR>—2 a learned man.<BR>—3 a seer, prophet, sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरदृष्टिः|दूरदृष्टि
दूर + -दृष्टिः<BR>—1 longsightedness.<BR>—2 prudence, foresight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरपातः|दूरपात
दूर + -पातः<BR>—1 a long fall.<BR>—2 a long flight.<BR>—3 falling from a great height.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

