दूरपातिन्
दूर + -पात, -पातिन् <i>a.</i> shooting from afar; शस्त्रविद्भिरनाधृष्यो<BR> दूरपाती दृढायुधः Mb. 5. 165. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दूरपातनम्
दूर + -पातनम् the act of shooting to a distance; Mb. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0828-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

