दृ
दृ I. €6 Ā. (द्रियते, दृत; <i>desid.</i> दिदरिषते) (rarely<BR> used by itself, usually found in combination with आ)<BR>—1 To respect, honour, worship, reverence; द्वितीयाद्रियते सदा H. Pr. 7;<BR> Mv. 7. 3; Bk. 6. 55.<BR>—2 To care for, mind; usually with न.<BR>—3 To apply or devote oneself closely to, have regard for; भूरि श्रुतं<BR> शाश्वतमाद्रियन्ते Māl. 1. 5.<BR>—4 To desire. ━II. €5 P. (दृणोति) To hurt, kill. ━III. €10 P. (दारयति,<BR> दरयति) to fear; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0829-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृत|दृतः
दृत <i>a.</i> Respected, honoured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0829-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृता
