दृंह्
दृंह् I. €1 P. (दृंहति, दृंहित)<BR>—1 To make firm, strengthen.<BR>—2 To make fast, fasten.<BR>—3 To fortify. ━II. €1 Ā. (दृहते)<BR>—1 To be firm.<BR>—2 To grow or increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0829-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दृंहणम्
