देव + -हिंसकः an enemy of gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0835-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवहूः
देव + -हूः the left ear; Bhāg. 4. 25. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0835-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवहूतिः|देवहूति
देव + -हूतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 invocation of the gods.<BR>—2 N. of a daughter of Manu Svāyambhuva and wife of Kardama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0835-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवहेडनम्
देव + -हेडनम् an offence against the gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0835-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवहेतिः|देवहेति
