देवक|देवकः
देवक <i>a.</i> [दिव्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 sporting, playing.<BR>—2 Divine, godlike, celestial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0835-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवकः|देवक
