देवता + -आयतनम्, -आलयः, -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i> a temple or chapel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0835-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवतादर्शनम्
देवता + -दर्शनम् manifestation of a deity; Nṛ. P. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0835-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवताप्रतिमा
देवता + -प्रतिमा the image of a god, an idol; देवताप्रतिमाश्चैव कम्पन्ति<BR> च हसन्ति च Mb. 6. 2. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0835-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

देवतास्नानम्
