दै
दै €1 P. (दायति, दात)<BR>—1 To purify, cleanse.<BR>—2 To be purified.<BR>—3 To protect. ━<i>With</i> {@अव@}<BR>—1 to whiten, brighten.<BR>—2 to purify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0837-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दैक्ष
