दौरुधरी
दौरुधरी <i>f.</i> A conjunction of planets Jupiter and Venus with the<BR> moon regarded as highly auspicious for births; श्रयत्ययं दौरुधरीं<BR> धुरं ध्रुवम् N. 15. 42. (cf. ‘गुरुभार्गवयोर्योगश्चन्द्रेणैव यदा भवेत् । तदा दुरुधरायोगः’ इति ज्योतिःशास्त्रे.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0840-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

