दौहदिकः<BR>—1 A landscape gardener; N. 6. 61; वृक्षादिदोहदे नियुक्तः [‘तत्र नियुक्तः’ इति ठक् P. IV. 4. 69.]<BR>—2 Ardent or morbid desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दौहित्रः|दौहित्र
दौहित्रः [दुहितुरपत्यम् अञ्] A daughterʼs son; Ms. 3. 148, 9. 131.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

दौहित्रम्
