द्यु|द्युः
द्यु €2 P. (द्यौति) To advance towards, encounter, attack, assail;<BR> गुहाया निरगाद् वाली सिंहो मृगमिव द्युवन् Bk. 6. 118, 14. 101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यु|द्युः
द्यु <i>n.</i><BR>—1 A day.<BR>—2 The sky.<BR>—3 Brightness.<BR>—4 Heaven.<BR>—5 Sharpness; cf. अद्यु ━<i>m.</i> Fire. (द्यु is a substitute for<BR> दिव् <i>f.</i> before terminations beginning with consonants and in compounds.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्युगः, द्युचरः, द्युजयः, द्युज्या, द्युदलः, द्युधुनिः, द्युनिवासः, द्युनिवासिन्, द्युपतिः, द्युपथः, द्युमणिः, द्युयोषित्, द्युरत्नम्, द्युलोकः, द्युषद्, द्युसद्, द्युसरित्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

