द्यु + -चरः<BR>—1 a planet.<BR>—2 a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

