द्युज्या
द्यु + -ज्या the diameter of a circle made by an asterism in its daily revolution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युदलः|द्युदल
द्यु + -दलः noon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युधुनिः|द्युधुनि
द्यु + -धुनिः <i>f.</i>, {@-नदी@}<BR> the heavenly Ganges; सिद्धैर्नुतो द्युधुनिपातशिवस्वनासु<BR> रेमे चिरं धनदवल्ललनावरूथी Bhāg. 3. 23. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युनिवासः|द्युनिवास
द्यु + -निवासः a deity, god; शोकाग्निनाऽगाद् द्युनिवासभूयम् Bk. 3. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युनिवासिन्
द्यु + -निवासिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a deity.<BR>—2 a virtuous man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युपतिः|द्युपति
द्यु + -पतिः<BR>—1 the sun.<BR>—2 an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

