द्युमणिः|द्युमणि
द्यु + -मणिः<BR>—1 the sun; कृष्णद्युमणिनिम्लोचे … … Bhāg. 3. 2. 7.<BR>—2 Calcined copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युयोषित्
द्यु + -योषित् <i>f.</i> an <i>apsaras</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युरत्नम्
द्यु + -रत्नम् the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युलोकः|द्युलोक
द्यु + -लोकः heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युषद्
द्यु + -षद्, -सद् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a god, deity; मनःसु येषां द्युसदां न्यधीयत Śi. 1. 43.<BR>—2 a planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युसद्
द्यु + -षद्, -सद् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a god, deity; मनःसु येषां द्युसदां न्यधीयत Śi. 1. 43.<BR>—2 a planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

