द्योतः|द्योत
द्योतः [द्युत् भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Light, lustre, brilliance; as in खद्योत.<BR>—2 Sunshine.<BR>—3 Heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योतक
द्योतक <i>a.</i> [द्युत्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Shining.<BR>—2 Illuminating.<BR>—3 Explaining, making manifest, showing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योतन|द्योतनं|द्योतनः
द्योतन <i>a.</i> [द्युत्-युच्]<BR>—1 Bright, shining; विलोक्य द्योतनं चन्द्रं लक्ष्मणं शोचनोऽवदत् Bk. 7. 15.<BR>—2 Illuminating.<BR>—3 Explaining, elucidating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योतनः|द्योतन|द्योतनं
