द्योतनम्
द्योतन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Shining.<BR>—2 Illuminating.<BR>—3 Explaining.<BR>—4 Sight, seeing.<BR>—5 Light.<BR>—6 Dawn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

