द्योतनिः|द्योतनि
द्योतनि + .{@-निः@} Ved. Splendour, lustre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योतित|द्योतितं
