द्योतिन्
द्योतिन् <i>a.</i> Splendid, bright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योतिस्
