द्युमत्|द्युमन्त्
द्युमत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bright, brilliant; वितानानि द्युमन्ति च Bhāg. 10. 81. 30.<BR>—2 Clear, loud.<BR>—3 Strong, vigorous.<BR>—4 Calm, serene.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्युमद्गानम्, द्युमत्सेनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

