द्युमत्सेनः|द्युमत्सेन
द्युमत् + -सेनः N. of a king of Śālva, and father of Satyavat, husband<BR> of Śāvitrī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0841-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्युम्नम्
