द्युसैन्धवः उच्चैःश्रवस्, the horse of Indra; द्युसैन्धवो वालजितः<BR> कियान् मया Śāhendra. 3. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतः|द्यूत|द्यूतं
द्यूतः, -तम्<BR> [दिव्-भावे-क्त-ऊठ् अर्धर्चा˚]<BR>—1 Play, gambling, playing with dice; द्यूतं हि नाम पुरुषस्यासिंहासनं<BR> राज्यम् Mk. 2; द्रव्यं लब्धं द्यूतेनैव दारा मित्रं द्यूतेनैव । दत्तं<BR> भुक्तं द्यूतेनैव सर्वं नष्टं द्यूतेनैव 2. 7; अप्राणिभिर्यत् क्रियते<BR> तल्लोके द्यूतमुच्यते Ms. 9. 223.<BR>—2 (fig.) A battle, fight; Mb. 3.<BR>—3 The prize won; Mb. 9.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्यूताधिकारिन्, द्यूतकरः, द्यूतकृत्, द्यूतकारः, द्यूतकारकः, द्यूतक्रीडा, द्यूतधर्मः, द्यूतपूर्णिमा, द्यूतपौर्णिमा, द्यूतप्रतिपद्, द्यूतबीजम्, द्यूतमण्डलम्, द्यूतलेखकः, द्यूतलेखकम्, द्यूतवृत्तिः, द्यूतसभा, द्यूतसमाजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतम्
द्यूतः, -तम्<BR> [दिव्-भावे-क्त-ऊठ् अर्धर्चा˚]<BR>—1 Play, gambling, playing with dice; द्यूतं हि नाम पुरुषस्यासिंहासनं<BR> राज्यम् Mk. 2; द्रव्यं लब्धं द्यूतेनैव दारा मित्रं द्यूतेनैव । दत्तं<BR> भुक्तं द्यूतेनैव सर्वं नष्टं द्यूतेनैव 2. 7; अप्राणिभिर्यत् क्रियते<BR> तल्लोके द्यूतमुच्यते Ms. 9. 223.<BR>—2 (fig.) A battle, fight; Mb. 3.<BR>—3 The prize won; Mb. 9.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्यूताधिकारिन्, द्यूतकरः, द्यूतकृत्, द्यूतकारः, द्यूतकारकः, द्यूतक्रीडा, द्यूतधर्मः, द्यूतपूर्णिमा, द्यूतपौर्णिमा, द्यूतप्रतिपद्, द्यूतबीजम्, द्यूतमण्डलम्, द्यूतलेखकः, द्यूतलेखकम्, द्यूतवृत्तिः, द्यूतसभा, द्यूतसमाजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूताधिकारिन्
द्यूतः + -अधिकारिन् <i>m.</i> the keeper of a gambling-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतकरः|द्यूतकर
द्यूतः + -करः, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a gamester, a gambler; अयं द्यूतकरः सभिकेन<BR> खलीक्रियते Mk. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतकृत्
द्यूतः + -करः, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a gamester, a gambler; अयं द्यूतकरः सभिकेन<BR> खलीक्रियते Mk. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतकारः|द्यूतकार
द्यूतः + -कारः, -कारकः<BR>—1 the keeper of a gambling house.<BR>—2 a gambler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतकारकः|द्यूतकारक
द्यूतः + -कारः, -कारकः<BR>—1 the keeper of a gambling house.<BR>—2 a gambler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतक्रीडा
द्यूतः + -क्रीडा playing at dice, gambling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतधर्मः|द्यूतधर्म
द्यूतः + -धर्मः the laws concerning gambling; Ms. 9. 220.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतपूर्णिमा
द्यूतः + -पूर्णिमा, -पौर्णिमा the day of full moon in the month of Aśvina<BR> (also called कोजागर) when people spend their time in games of chance<BR> in honour of Lakṣmī, the goddess of wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतपौर्णिमा
द्यूतः + -पूर्णिमा, -पौर्णिमा the day of full moon in the month of Aśvina<BR> (also called कोजागर) when people spend their time in games of chance<BR> in honour of Lakṣmī, the goddess of wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतप्रतिपद्
द्यूतः + -प्रतिपद् <i>f.</i> the first day of the bright half of Kārtika<BR> (usually spent in gambling).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतबीजम्
द्यूतः + -बीजम् a <i>cowrie</i>, a shell used in playing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतमण्डलम्
द्यूतः + -मण्डलम्<BR>—1 a gambling house; गमनं परिकर्षं च कृष्णाया द्यूतमण्डले Mb. 2. 79. 32.<BR>—2 a circle drawn round a gambler (to make him pay); cf. द्यूतकरमण्डली; Mk. 2. 6-7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतलेखकः|द्यूतलेखक
द्यूतः + -लेखकः, -लेखकम् a gambling bill or one who marks the score at gambling;<BR> cf. Mk. 2. 19-20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतलेखकम्
द्यूतः + -लेखकः, -लेखकम् a gambling bill or one who marks the score at gambling;<BR> cf. Mk. 2. 19-20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतवृत्तिः|द्यूतवृत्ति
द्यूतः + -वृत्तिः<BR>—1 professional gambler; मित्रधृग् द्यूतवृत्तिश्च पुत्राचार्यस्तथैव च Ms. 3. 160.<BR>—2 the keeper of a gambling-house. Ms. 3. 160.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतसभा
द्यूतः + -सभा, -समाजः<BR>—1 a gambling-house.<BR>—2 an assembly of gamblers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूतसमाजः|द्यूतसमाज
द्यूतः + -सभा, -समाजः<BR>—1 a gambling-house.<BR>—2 an assembly of gamblers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यून|द्यूनं
द्यून <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Playing, sporting.<BR>—2 Lamenting, sorry; cf. परिद्यून Mb. 3. 7. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यूनम्
द्यून + .{@-नम्@} The seventh sign of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यै
द्यै €1 P. (द्यायति)<BR>—1 To despise, treat with contempt.<BR>—2 To disfigure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्यो
द्यो <i>f.</i> (Nom. sing. द्यौः) Heaven, paradise, the sky; द्यौर्भूमिरापो<BR> हृदयं यमश्च Pt. 1. 182; Ś. 2. 15. (In Dvandva compounds द्यो<BR> is changed to द्यावा, <i>e. g.</i> द्यावापृथिव्यौ, द्यावाभूमी, द्यावाक्षमे<BR> ‘heaven and earth’).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्योकारः, द्योभूमिः, द्योसद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योकारः|द्योकार
द्यो + -कारः an architect (building very high mansions); द्योकारहेमकारादिजातिं<BR> नित्यं समाश्रिताः Mb. 12. 49. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योभूमिः|द्योभूमि
द्यो + -भूमिः a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्योसद्
द्यो + -सद् <i>m.</i> (द्योषद्) a god.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रकटः|द्रकट
द्रकटः, -द्रगडः<BR> A kettle-drum (used in awakening sleepers).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रगडः|द्रगड
द्रकटः, -द्रगडः<BR> A kettle-drum (used in awakening sleepers).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रङ्क्षणम्
द्रङ्क्षणम् A measure of weight, a <i>tolā</i>. Śāraṅg. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रङ्गः|द्रङ्ग
द्रङ्गः, -ङ्गा<BR> A city, town; Rāj. T.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रङ्गा
द्रङ्गः, -ङ्गा<BR> A city, town; Rāj. T.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रढयति
द्रढयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To make firm, fasten, tighten, (lit.) as in जटाजूटग्रन्थिं द्रढयति.<BR>—2 To strengthen, confirm, corroborate; निवेशः शैलानां तदिदमिति बुद्धिं<BR> द्रढयति U. 2. 27; विशुद्धेरुत्कर्षस्त्वयि तु मम भक्तिं द्रढयति 4. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रढिमन्
द्रढिमन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 Tightness, firmness; वधान द्रागेव द्रढिमरमणीयं परिकरम् G. L. 47.<BR>—2 Confirmation, corroboration; उक्तस्यार्थस्य द्रढिम्ने Śaṅkara.<BR>—3 Assertion, affirmation.<BR>—4 Heaviness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रप्स|द्रप्सः
द्रप्स <i>a.</i> Dripping, tickling down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रप्सः|द्रप्स
द्रप्स + .{@-प्सः@}<BR>—1 A drop; द्रप्सो न श्वेतो मृगस्तुविष्मान् Rv. 7. 87. 6.<BR>—2 A spark (of fire); द्रप्सा यत् ते यवसादो व्यस्थिरन् Rv. 1. 94. 11.<BR>—3 a flag, banner; द्रप्सं दविध्वद् गविषो न स त्वा Rv. 4. 13. 2<BR> (पार्थिवं रजः as Sāyaṇa).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रप्सम्
द्रप्स + .{@-प्सम्@} Diluted sour milk, diluted curds; (also द्रप्स्यम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रबुद्धः|द्रबुद्ध
द्रबुद्धः, -द्धम्<BR> A particular high number; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रबुद्धम्
द्रबुद्धः, -द्धम्<BR> A particular high number; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रम्
द्रम् €1 P. (द्रमति) To go about, run, run about; वानरा दद्रुमुश्चाऽथ Bk. 14. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रमिडः|द्रमिड
द्रमिडः, -लः<BR> See द्रविडः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रमिलः|द्रमिल
द्रमिडः, -लः<BR> See द्रविडः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रम्मम्
द्रम्मम् A drachma; (a word derived from the Greek <i>drachme</i>), sixteenth<BR> part of a Niṣka (= 1280 वराटकs); वराटकानां दशकद्वयं यत्<BR> सा काकिणी ताश्च पाणाश्चतस्रः । ते षोडश द्रम्म इहापि कीर्तितो द्रम्मैस्तथा<BR> षोडशकैश्च निष्कः ॥ Līlā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव|द्रवः
द्रव <i>a.</i> [द्रु गतौ-भावे अप्]<BR>—1 Running (as a horse); सत्यो द्रवो द्रवरः पतङ्गरः Rv. 4. 40. 2.<BR>—2 Dropping, oozing, wet, dripping; आक्षिप्य काचिद् द्रवरागमेव (पादम्) R. 7. 7.<BR>—3 Flowing, fluid.<BR>—4 Liquid (opp. कठिन); द्रवः संघातकठिनः (असि) Ku. 2. 11.<BR>—5 Melted, liquefied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवः|द्रव
द्रव + .{@-वः@}<BR>—1 Going, walking about, motion.<BR>—2 Dropping, trickling, oozing, exudation.<BR>—3 Flight, retreat.<BR>—4 Play, amusement, sport.<BR>—5 Fluidity, liquefaction<BR>—6 A liquid substance, fluid; द्रव इव हृदयस्य प्रस्तरोद्भेदयोग्यः<BR> U. 3. 25, 2. 16.<BR>—7 Juice, essence; पिवत भागवतं रसमालयम् Bhāg. 1. 1. 3.<BR>—8 Decoction.<BR>—9 Speed, velocity.<BR>—10 (in drama) The flying out against oneʼs superior. (द्रवीकृ means<BR> ‘to melt, liquefy’). द्रवीभू to be melted, as with pity &c.; द्रवीभवति<BR> मे मनः Mv. 7. 34; द्रवीभूतं प्रेम्णा तव हृदयमस्मिन् क्षण इव<BR> U. 3. 13; द्रवीभूतं मन्ये पतति जलरूपेण गगनम् Mk. 5. 25.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्रवाधारः, द्रवेतर, द्रवोत्तर, द्रवजः, द्रवद्रव्यम्, द्रवरसा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवाधारः|द्रवाधार
द्रव + -आधारः<BR>—1 a small vessel or receiver.<BR>—2 the hands joined together and hollowed (= चुलुक q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवेतर
द्रव + -इतर <i>a.</i> solid, hard; ससर्ज वृष्टिं परिरुग्णपादपां द्रवेतरेषां<BR> पयसामिवाश्मनाम् Ki. 17. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवोत्तर
द्रव + -उत्तर <i>a.</i> very fluid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवजः|द्रवज
द्रव + -जः treacle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवद्रव्यम्
द्रव + -द्रव्यम् a fluid substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवरसा
द्रव + -रसा<BR>—1 lac.<BR>—2 gum.<BR>—3 extract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवक
द्रवक, -द्रवण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Running.<BR>—2 Oozing, trickling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवण|द्रवणं
द्रवक, -द्रवण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Running.<BR>—2 Oozing, trickling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवत्|द्रवन्त्
द्रवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Running, swift.<BR>—2 Trickling, oozing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवन्ती
द्रवन्ती<BR>—1 A river.<BR>—2 The plant Anthericum Tuberosum (Mar. उंदिरकानी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रवस्यति
द्रवस्यति Den. P.<BR>—1 To trouble or afflict oneself.<BR>—2 To serve or wait upon a person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0842-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविः|द्रवि
द्रविः A smelter, one who melts metal; द्रविर्न द्रावयति दारु<BR> धक्षत् Rv. 6. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविडः|द्रविड
द्रविडः<BR>—1 N. of a country on the east coast of the Deccan (pl.); अस्ति द्रविडेषु<BR> काञ्ची नाम नगरी Dk. 130.<BR>—2 An inhabitant or native of that country; जरद्द्रविडधार्मिकस्येच्छया<BR> निसृष्टैः K. 229.<BR>—3 N. of a degraded tribe; cf. Ms. 10. 22.<BR>—4 A collective name for five peoples (आन्ध्र, कर्नाटक, गुर्जर, तैलङ्ग<BR> and महाराष्ट्र); see द्राविड.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविणम्
द्रविणम् [द्रु-इनन्; Uṇ. 2. 50]<BR>—1 Wealth, money, property, substance; Ve. 3. 22; Pt. 3. 174; निमग्नानां<BR> यासु द्रविणमदिराघूर्णितदृशाम् Bv. 4. 29.<BR>—2 Gold; R. 4. 70; ज्ञातिभ्यो द्रविणं दत्त्वा कन्यार्थे चैव शक्तितः Ms. 3. 31.<BR>—3 Strength, power.<BR>—4 Valour, prowess; श्रोतुमिच्छामि चरितं भूरिद्रविणतेजसाम् Mb. 3. 1. 8.<BR>—5 A thing, matter, material.<BR>—6 That of which anything is made.<BR>—7 A wish, desire.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्रविणाधिपतिः, द्रविणेश्वरः, द्रविणोदयः, द्रविणोदस्, द्रविणनाशनः, द्रविणप्रदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविणाधिपतिः|द्रविणाधिपति
द्रविणम् + -अधिपतिः, -ईश्वरः an epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविणेश्वरः|द्रविणेश्वर
द्रविणम् + -अधिपतिः, -ईश्वरः an epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविणोदयः|द्रविणोदय
द्रविणम् + -उदयः acquirement of wealth; पराङ्मुखे विधौ चेत् स्यात् कथंचिद्<BR> द्रविणोदयः Pt. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविणोदस्
द्रविणम् + -उदस् <i>m.</i> fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविणनाशनः|द्रविणनाशन
द्रविणम् + -नाशनः the plant Hyperanthera Moriaga (Mar. शेवगा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविणप्रदः|द्रविणप्रद
द्रविणम् + -प्रदः an epithet of Viṣṇu. सुधन्वा खण्डपरशुर्दारुणो द्रविणप्रदः V. Sah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रविणस्यु
द्रविणस्यु <i>a.</i> Desiring wealth or sacrificial offerings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यम्
द्रव्यम्<BR>—1 A thing, substance, object, matter; the whole creation (अधिभूत);<BR> द्रव्यक्रियाकारकाख्यं धूत्वा यान्त्यपुनर्भवम् Bhāg. 12. 6. 38.<BR>—2 The ingredient or material of anything.<BR>—3 A material to work upon.<BR>—4 A fit or suitable object (to receive instruction &c.); द्रव्यं जिगीषुमधिगम्य<BR> जडात्मनोऽपि Mu. 7. 14; see अद्रव्य also.<BR>—5 An elementary substance, the substratum of properties; one of the seven<BR> categories of the Vaiśeṣikas; (the <i>dravyas</i> are nine:− पृथिव्यप्तेजोवाग्वाकाशकालदिगात्ममनांसि);<BR> one of the six of the Jainas (जीव, धर्म, अधर्म, पुद्गल, काल and आकाश).<BR>—6 Any possession, wealth, goods, property, money: षड् द्रव्याणि━ ‘मणयः पशवः पृथिवी वासो दास्यादि काञ्चनम्’;<BR> उपार्जनं च द्रव्याणां परिमर्दश्च<BR> तानि षट् Mb. 12. 59. 64; तत् तस्य किमपि द्रव्यं यो हि यस्य प्रियो<BR> जनः U. 2. 19.<BR>—7 A medicinal substance or drug.<BR>—8 Modesty.<BR>—9 Bell-metal, brass or gold; Rām. 7.<BR>—10 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—11 A wager, stake.<BR>—12 Anointing, plastering.<BR>—13 An ointment.<BR>—14 The animal-dye, lac.<BR>—15 Extract, gum.<BR>—16 A cow; L. D. B.<BR>—17 A verse from the Ṛgveda. द्रव्यशब्दश्छन्दोगैरृक्षु आचरितः ।<BR> ŚB. on MS. 7. 2. 14.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्रव्यार्जनम्, द्रव्यवृद्धिः, द्रव्यसिद्धिः, द्रव्यौघः, द्रव्यकल्कम्, द्रव्यगणः, द्रव्यपरिग्रहः, द्रव्यप्रकृतिः, द्रव्यवाचकम्, द्रव्यशुद्धिः, द्रव्यसंस्कारः, द्रव्यहस्त^1<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यार्जनम्
द्रव्यम् + -अर्जनम्, -वृद्धिः, -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i> acquisition of wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यवृद्धिः|द्रव्यवृद्धि
द्रव्यम् + -अर्जनम्, -वृद्धिः, -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i> acquisition of wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यसिद्धिः|द्रव्यसिद्धि
द्रव्यम् + -अर्जनम्, -वृद्धिः, -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i> acquisition of wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यौघः|द्रव्यौघ
द्रव्यम् + -ओघः <i>f.</i> affluence, abundance of wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यकल्कम्
द्रव्यम् + -कल्कम् Viscous sediment given out by oily substances when ground;<BR> द्रव्यकल्कः पञ्चधा स्यात् कल्कं चूर्णं रसस्तथा । तैलं मष्टिः कमाज्ज्ञेयं<BR> यथोत्तरगुणं प्रिये ॥ Āyurveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यगणः|द्रव्यगण
द्रव्यम् + -गणः a class of 37 similar substances (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यपरिग्रहः|द्रव्यपरिग्रह
द्रव्यम् + -परिग्रहः the possession of property or wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यप्रकृतिः|द्रव्यप्रकृति
द्रव्यम् + -प्रकृतिः <i>f.</i> the nature of matter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यवाचकम्
द्रव्यम् + -वाचकम् a substantive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यशुद्धिः|द्रव्यशुद्धि
द्रव्यम् + -शुद्धिः Cleansing of soiled articles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यसंस्कारः|द्रव्यसंस्कार
द्रव्यम् + -संस्कारः the consecration of articles for sacrifice &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यहस्त
द्रव्यम् + -हस्त^1 <i>a.</i> holding anything in the hand; Ms. 5. 143.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यकः|द्रव्यक
द्रव्यकः A carrier of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यमय
द्रव्यमय (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Material.<BR>—2 Having any substance.<BR>—3 Consisting of wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रव्यवत्|द्रव्यवन्त्
द्रव्यवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Rich, wealthy.<BR>—2 Inherent in the substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रष्टव्य
द्रष्टव्य <i>pot. p.</i> [दृश्-तव्य]<BR>—1 To be seen, visible.<BR>—2 Perceptible.<BR>—3 Fit to be seen, investigated, or examined; आत्मा वा अरे द्रष्टव्यः<BR> श्रोतव्यो मन्तव्यो निदिध्यासितव्यः Bṛ. Up. 2. 4. 5.<BR>—4 Lovely, pleasing to the sight, beautiful; त्वया द्रष्टव्यानां परं<BR> न दृष्टम् Ś. 2; Bh. 1. 8.<BR>—5 To be understood.<BR>—6 To be regarded or considered as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रष्टुकाम
द्रष्टुकाम <i>a.</i> Desirous of seeing; ततो भर्तृदारिकां द्रष्टुकामया<BR> भगवत्या … Māl. 2. 0/1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रष्टुमनस्
द्रष्टुमनस् <i>a.</i> Wishing to see; मरुतां द्रष्टुमनाः सलोकपालः V. 2. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रष्टृ
द्रष्टृ <i>m.</i> [दृश्-तृच्]<BR>—1 A seer, one who sees mentally; as in ऋषयो मन्त्रद्रष्टारः, द्रष्टृत्वमकर्तृभावश्च Sāṅ. K. 19.<BR>—2 A judge; संक्षेपादपवाद एव सुलभो द्रष्टुर्गुणो दूरतः Mk. 9. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रहः|द्रह
द्रहः A deep lake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रा
द्रा €2 P. (द्राति, द्राण)<BR>—1 To sleep.<BR>—2 To run, make haste.<BR>—3 To fly, run away.<BR>—4 To be ashamed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राण|द्राणः
द्राण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Flown, run away.<BR>—2 Sleeping, sleepy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राणम्
द्राण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Running away, flight, retreat.<BR>—2 Sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्
द्राक् <i>ind.</i> Quickly, instantly, forthwith, immediately, Mv. 1. 34;<BR> द्राक् पर्यस्तकपालसंपुटमिलत् … Vīracandrodaya.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्राक्केन्द्रम्, द्राग्भृतकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्केन्द्रम्
द्राक् + -केन्द्रम् the distance of a planet from the point of its greatest<BR> velocity, eccentricity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राग्भृतकम्
द्राक् + -भृतकम् water just drawn from a well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्षा
द्राक्षा Vine, grape (the creeper or the fruit); द्राक्षे द्रक्ष्यन्ति<BR> के त्वाम् Gīt. 12; R. 4. 65; Bv. 1. 14, 4. 39. मधुक्षीरद्राक्षामधुमधुरिमा<BR> कैरपि पदैर्विशिष्यावाख्येयो भवति रसनामात्रविषयः Ānandalaharī.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्राक्षासवः, द्राक्षोत्थम्, द्राक्षाघृतम्, द्राक्षारसः, द्राक्षारिष्टः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्षासवः|द्राक्षासव
द्राक्षा + -आसवः, -उत्थम् a spiritious liquor drawn from vine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्षोत्थम्
द्राक्षा + -आसवः, -उत्थम् a spiritious liquor drawn from vine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्षाघृतम्
द्राक्षा + -घृतम् N. of a particular medicinal ghee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्षारसः|द्राक्षारस
द्राक्षा + -रसः grape-juice, wine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राक्षारिष्टः|द्राक्षारिष्ट
द्राक्षा + -रिष्टः a particular beverage (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राख्
द्राख् €1 P. (द्राखति)<BR>—1 To become dry.<BR>—2 To be able, or sufficient.<BR>—3 To prohibit, prevent.<BR>—4 To adorn, grace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघ्
द्राघ् €1 Ā. (द्राघते)<BR>—1 To be able.<BR>—2 To stretch.<BR>—3 To exert oneself.<BR>—4 To be weary or fatigued.<BR>—5 To torment, vex.<BR>—6 To wander about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघयति
द्राघयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To lengthen, stretch, extend.<BR>—2 To increase, intensify; द्राघयन्ति हि मे शोकं स्मर्यमाणा गुणास्तव Bk. 18. 33.<BR>—3 To tarry, delay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघिमन्
द्राघिमन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 Length.<BR>—2 A degree of longitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघिष्ठ|द्राघिष्ठः
द्राघिष्ठ <i>a.</i> Longest, very long (superl. of दीर्घ q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघिष्ठः|द्राघिष्ठ
द्राघिष्ठ + .{@-ष्ठः@} A bear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0843-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राघीयस्
द्राघीयस् <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Longer, very long (compar. of दीर्घ q. v.); Ki. 11. 2;<BR> त्वां ध्यायन् घनवासरान् कथमपि द्राघीयसो नीतवान् Bv. 1. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राङ्क्ष्|द्रांक्ष्
द्राङ्क्ष् €1 P. (द्राङ्क्षति)<BR>—1 To desire, long for.<BR>—2 To croak, sound (as a bird).<BR>—3 To utter a discordant sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राड्
द्राड् €1 Ā. (द्राडते)<BR>—1 To cut, divide, split.<BR>—2 To be pulled to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रापः|द्राप
द्रापः<BR>—1 Mud, mire.<BR>—2 Heaven, sky.<BR>—3 A fool, an idiot.<BR>—4 An epithet of Śiva (his hair being matted).<BR>—5 A small shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रामिलः|द्रामिल
द्रामिलः N. of Cāṇakya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रावः|द्राव
द्रावः [द्रु-भावे-घञ्]<BR>—1 Flight, retreat.<BR>—2 Speed.<BR>—3 Running, flowing.<BR>—4 Heat.<BR>—5 Liquefaction, melting.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्रावकरम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रावकरम्
द्रावः + -करम् a flux.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रावक|द्रावकं|द्रावकः
द्रावक [द्रु-ण्वुल्] <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Attracting, captivating.<BR>—2 Solvent.<BR>—3 Liquefying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रावकः|द्रावक|द्रावकं
द्रावक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 flux used to assist the fusion of metals.<BR>—2 The loadstone.<BR>—3 Moon-stone.<BR>—4 A thief.<BR>—5 A sharp or clever man, wit, wag.<BR>—6 A libertine, lecher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रावकम्
द्रावक + .{@-कम्@} Wax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रावणम्
द्रावणम् [द्रु-णिच्-युच्]<BR>—1 Putting to flight, Mb. 8. 34. 69; त्रैलोक्यद्रावणं क्रूरं दुराचारं<BR> महाबलम् (रावणम्) Hariv.<BR>—2 Melting. fusing,<BR>—3 Distilling.<BR>—4 The clearing-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविका
द्राविका Spittle, saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रावित
द्रावित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Put to flight, driven away.<BR>—2 Fused, melted.<BR>—3 Softened, mollified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राव्य|द्राव्यं
द्राव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be made to run or put to flight.<BR>—2 Fusible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविडः|द्राविड
द्राविडः [द्रविडदेशोऽभिजनोऽस्य-अण्]<BR>—1 A Dravidian, Dravida.<BR>—2 A general name for a Brāhmaṇa of any of the five southern tribes<BR> (the पञ्चद्रविड); द्राविड, कर्णाट, गुर्जर, महाराष्ट्र and तैलङ्ग.<BR> कर्णाटाश्चैव तैलङ्गा गुर्जरा राष्ट्रवासिनः । आन्ध्राश्च द्राविडा पञ्च विन्ध्यदक्षिणवासिनः ॥ Skanda P.<BR>—3 N. of the five chief Dravidian languages (Tamil, Telugu, Kanarese,<BR> Malayalam and Tulu).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविडाः
द्राविडः + .{@-डाः@} (pl.) The Dravida country and its people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविडी
द्राविडः + .{@-डी@} Cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविडकः|द्राविडक|द्राविडकं
द्राविडकः Zedoary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राविडकम्
द्राविडकः + .{@-कम्@} Black salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राह्
द्राह् €1 Ā. (द्राहते) To wake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्राह्यायणः|द्राह्यायण
द्राह्यायणः N. of a sage, the author of the Kalpasūtras dealing<BR> with the singing of the Sāmaveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रु|द्रुः
द्रु I. €1 P. (द्रवति, द्रुत; <i>desid.</i> दुद्रूषति)<BR>—1 To run, flow, run away, retreat, fly (often with acc.); गभस्तिधाराभिरभिद्रुतानि<BR> Bk. 2. 12; यथा नदीनां बहवोऽम्बुवेगाः समुद्रमेवाभिमुखं द्रवन्ति<BR> Bg. 11. 28; रक्षांसि भीतानि दिशो द्रवन्ति 36; द्रुतं द्रवत कौरवाः Mb.<BR>—2 To rush, attack, assault quickly; रक्षस्पाशान् यशस्काम्यंस्तमस्कल्पानदुद्रवत् Bk. 9. 95.<BR>—3 To become fluid, dissolve, melt, ooze (fig. also); द्रवति च हिम<BR> रश्मावुद्गते चन्द्रकान्तः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">Page0844-2</a>]<BR> Māl. 1. 24, 8. 12; U. 6. 12; Pt. 4. 33; द्रवति हृदयमेतत् Ve. 5. 21;<BR> Śi. 9. 9; Bk. 2. 12.<BR>—4 To go, move. ━<i>Caus.</i> (द्रावयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to run away, put to flight.<BR>—2 To melt, fuse. ━II. €5 P. (द्रुणोति)<BR>—1 To hurt, injure; तं दुद्रावाद्रिणा कपिः Bk. 14. 81, 85.<BR>—2 To go.<BR>—3 To repent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुत|द्रुतं|द्रुतः
द्रुत <i>p. p.</i> [द्रु-क्त]<BR>—1 Quick, swift, speedy.<BR>—2 Flown, run away, escaped.<BR>—3 Melted, liquid, dissolved; जातानुरागो द्रुतचित्त उच्चैः Bhāg. 11. 2. 40.<BR>—4 Scattered, diffused.<BR>—5 Indistinct.<BR>—6 Moved, softened; द्रुतं करुणया Māl. 5. 28; see द्रु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुतः|द्रुत|द्रुतं
द्रुत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 A scorpion.<BR>—2 A tree.<BR>—3 A cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुतम्
द्रुत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 the act of running; अलं द्रुतेन वः शूरा इति द्रोणोऽभ्यभाषत Mb. 7. 16. 18.<BR>—2 A particular faulty pronunciation of vowels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुतम्
द्रुत + .{@-तम्@} <i>ind.</i> Quickly, swiftly, speedily, immediately.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्रुतगति, द्रुतपद, द्रुतमध्या, द्रुतविलम्बितम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुतगति
द्रुत + -गति <i>a.</i> going quickly, hastening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुतपद
द्रुत + -पद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 going quickly.<BR>—2 a form of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुतमध्या
द्रुत + -मध्या <i>ibid.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुतविलम्बितम्
द्रुत + -विलम्बितम् N. of a metre; see App. I.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुतिः|द्रुति
द्रुतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Melting, dissolving.<BR>—2 Going, running away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रु|द्रुः
द्रु <i>m., n.</i> [द्रवत्यूर्ध्व द्रु-बा˚ डु]<BR>—1 Wood.<BR>—2 Any instrument made of wood. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A tree; Ms. 7. 131.<BR>—2 A branch. ━<i>f.</i> Motion.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्रुकिलिमम्, द्रुघणः, द्रुघ्नी, द्रुनखः, द्रुणस, द्रुनहः, द्रुणहः, द्रुपदम्, द्रुपदी, द्रुपाद, द्रुसल्लकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुकिलिमम्
द्रु + -किलिमम् the Devadāru tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुघणः|द्रुघण
द्रु + -घणः<BR>—1 a mallet, wooden mace.<BR>—2 an iron weapon made like a carpenterʼs hammer.<BR>—3 an axe, a hatchet.<BR>—4 an epithet of Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुघ्नी
द्रु + -घ्नी a hatchet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुनखः|द्रुनख
द्रु + -नखः a thorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणस|द्रुणसः
द्रु + -णस ({@णस@}) <i>a.</i> large-nosed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुनहः|द्रुनह
द्रु + -नहः, -णहः a scabbard; see द्रुणहः also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणहः|द्रुणह
द्रु + -नहः, -णहः a scabbard; see द्रुणहः also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुपदम्
द्रु + -पदम् Ved. a pillar (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुपदी
द्रु + -पदी<BR>—1 a splay-footed female.<BR>—2 a parasitical plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुपाद
द्रु + -पाद <i>a.</i> large-footed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुसल्लकः|द्रुसल्लक
द्रु + -सल्लकः a kind of tree (पियाल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुत|द्रुतं|द्रुतः
द्रुत, द्रुतिः See under द्रु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुतिः|द्रुति
द्रुत, द्रुतिः See under द्रु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुड्
द्रुड् €1. €6 P. (द्रोडति, द्रुडति) To sink, perish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुण्
द्रुण् €6 P. (द्रुणति)<BR>—1 To make curved or crooked, bend.<BR>—2 To go, move.<BR>—3 To hurt, injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणः|द्रुण|द्रुणं
द्रुणः [द्रुण-क्त]<BR>—1 A scorpion.<BR>—2 A bee.<BR>—3 rogue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणम्
द्रुणः + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 A bow.<BR>—2 A sword.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्रुणहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणहः|द्रुणह
द्रुणः + -हः a sheath, scabbard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणा
द्रुणा A bow-string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणिः|द्रुणि
द्रुणिः, -णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A small or female tortoise.<BR>—2 A bucket.<BR>—3 A centipede.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुणी
द्रुणिः, -णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A small or female tortoise.<BR>—2 A bucket.<BR>—3 A centipede.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुपदः|द्रुपद
द्रुपदः N. of a king of the Pāñcālas. [He was a son of Pṛṣata.<BR> He and Droṇa were school-fellows, as they learnt the science of archery<BR> from Droṇaʼs father, Bharadvāja. After Drupada had succeeded to the<BR> throne, Droṇa, when in pecuniary difficulties, went to him on the strength<BR> of his former friendship; but the proud monarch disrespected and slighted<BR> him. For this Droṇa afterwards got him captured by his pupils the Pāṇḍavas,<BR> but was kind enough to spare his life, and<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">Page0845-1</a>]<BR> allowed him to retain half his kingdom. But the defeat sustained by him<BR> at Droṇaʼs hands rankled in his soul, and with the desire of getting<BR> a son who would avenge the wrong done to him, he performed a sacrifice,<BR> when a son named Dhṛṣtadyumna (and a daughter called Draupudī) sprang<BR> up from the fire. This son afterwards treacherously cut off the head of<BR> Droṇa. See Droṇa also.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0844-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमः|द्रुम
द्रुमः [द्रुः शाखास्त्यस्य-मः, cf. P. V. 2. 108]<BR>—1 A tree; यत्र द्रुमा अपि मृगा अपि बान्धवो मे U. 3. 8.<BR>—2 A tree of Paradise.<BR>—3 An epithet of Kubera.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्रुमाब्जम्, द्रुमारिः, द्रुमामयः, द्रुमाश्रयः, द्रुमेश्वरः, द्रुमोत्पलः, द्रुमखण्डः, द्रुमखण्डम्, द्रुमनखः, द्रुममरः, द्रुमनिर्यासः, द्रुमवासिन्, द्रुमव्याधिः, द्रुमश्रेष्ठः, द्रुमषण्डम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमाब्जम्
द्रुमः + -अब्जम् the Karṇikāra tree; प्रययौ केतुमिव द्रुमाब्जकेतुम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमारिः|द्रुमारि
द्रुमः + -अरिः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमामयः|द्रुमामय
द्रुमः + -आमयः lac, gum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमाश्रयः|द्रुमाश्रय
द्रुमः + -आश्रयः a lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमेश्वरः|द्रुमेश्वर
द्रुमः + -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 the palm tree.<BR>—2 the moon.<BR>—3 the पारिजात tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमोत्पलः|द्रुमोत्पल
द्रुमः + -उत्पलः the Karṇikāra tree. द्रुमोत्पलः कर्णिकारः Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमखण्डः|द्रुमखण्ड
द्रुमः + -खण्डः, -खण्डम् a group of trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमखण्डम्
द्रुमः + -खण्डः, -खण्डम् a group of trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमनखः|द्रुमनख
द्रुमः + -नखः, -मरः a thorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुममरः|द्रुममर
द्रुमः + -नखः, -मरः a thorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमनिर्यासः
द्रुमः + -निर्यासः a kind of frank-incense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमवासिन्
द्रुमः + -वासिन् <i>m.</i> an ape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमव्याधिः|द्रुमव्याधि
द्रुमः + -व्याधिः lac, gum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

