द्रुमषण्डम्
द्रुमः + -षण्डम् a grove of trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुमिणी
द्रुमिणी An assemblage of trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुवयः|द्रुवय|द्रुवयं
द्रुवयः A measure (मानम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुह्
द्रुह् €4 P. (द्रुह्यति, द्रुग्ध)<BR>—1 To bear malice or hatred.<BR>—2 To seek to hurt or injure, plot maliciously or revengefully, meditate<BR> mischief; (generally with the dat. of the object of hatred); यान्वेति<BR> मां द्रुह्यति मह्यमेव सात्रेत्युपालम्भि तयालिवर्गः N. 3. 7; Bk. 4. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुह्
द्रुह् <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) (Nom. sing. ध्रुक्-ग्, ध्रुट्-ड्)<BR> Injuring, hurting, plotting or acting as an enemy against; पुरः क्लिश्नाति<BR> सोमं हि सैहिकेयोऽसुरद्रुहाम् Śi. 2. 35; Ms. 5. 90. ━<i>f.</i> Injury, damage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुग्ध
द्रुग्ध <i>p. p.</i> Injured, plotted against; संबन्धिभ्योऽपि यैर्द्रुग्धं<BR> कन्यां दत्त्वेतरेतरम् Rāj. T. 5. 299.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुग्धम्
द्रुग्ध + .{@-ग्धम्@} An offence, injury, malevolent act; अव द्रुग्धानि पित्र्या<BR> सृजा नः Rv. 7. 86. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोग्धृ
द्रोग्धृ <i>a.</i> Malevolent, hater.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोघः|द्रोघ
द्रोघः Injury, damage.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्रोघवचस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोघवचस्
द्रोघः + -वचस् <i>a.</i> Using injurious or malicious words; cf. Rv. 6. 62. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोहः|द्रोह
द्रोहः [द्रुह् भावे-घञ्]<BR>—1 Plotting against, seeking to hurt or assail, injury, mischief, malice;<BR> अद्रोहशपथं कृत्वा Pt. 2. 35; मित्रद्रोहे च पातकम् Bg. 1. 38;<BR> Ms. 2. 161, 7. 48, 9. 17.<BR>—2 Treachery, perfidy.<BR>—3 Wrong, offence.<BR>—4 Rebellion.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्रोहाटः, द्रोहचिन्तनम्, द्रोहबुद्धि, द्रोहभावः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोहाटः|द्रोहाट
द्रोहः + -अटः<BR>—1 a religious impostor, hypocrite, impostor.<BR>—2 a hunter.<BR>—3 a false man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोहचिन्तनम्
द्रोहः + -चिन्तनम् a malicious thought, malice prepense; a thought or attempt to injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोहबुद्धि|द्रोहबुद्धिः
द्रोहः + -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> bent on mischief or evil design.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोहबुद्धिः|द्रोहबुद्धि
द्रोहः + -बुद्धि + .({@-द्धिः@} <i>f.</i>) a wicked or evil purpose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोहभावः|द्रोहभाव
द्रोहः + -भावः hostile disposition; Ms. 9. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोहित
द्रोहित <i>a.</i> Maliciously inclined, malevolent, hostile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रोहिन्
द्रोहिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Hurting, injuring.<BR>—2 Malevolent, malicious.<BR>—3 Plotting against, rebellious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुहः|द्रुह
द्रुहः<BR>—1 A son.<BR>—2 A lake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुही
द्रुहः + .{@-ही@} A daughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुहणः|द्रुहण
द्रुहणः, द्रुहिणः N. of Brahmā or Śiva or Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुहिणः|द्रुहिण
द्रुहणः, द्रुहिणः N. of Brahmā or Śiva or Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रुह्युः|द्रुह्यु
द्रुह्युः<BR>—1 N. of a Vedic tribe.<BR>—2 N. of the son of Yayāti and Śarmisṭhā; यदुं च तुर्वसुं चैव<BR> देवयानी व्यजायत । द्रुह्युं चानुं च पूरुं च शर्मिंष्ठा वार्षपर्वणी ।<BR> V. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रू
द्रू €5. €9 P. (द्रूणो-णा-ति)<BR>—1 To hurt, injure.<BR>—2 To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रू
द्रू^1 <i>a.</i> Taking any form at will. ━<i>m.</i> Gold.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/41b120c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रूघणः|द्रूघण
द्रूघणः A hammer, an iron club; see दुघण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रूणः|द्रूण
द्रूणः A scorpion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रूणम्
द्रूणः + .{@-णम्@} A bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रेक्
द्रेक् €1 Ā. (द्रेकते)<BR>—1 To sound.<BR>—2 To grow, increase.<BR>—3 To show joy, be exhilarated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्रेक्कणः
द्रेक्क(क्का, ष्का)णः One-third part of the night; स्वपञ्चनवमानां<BR> ये राशिनामधिपाः ग्रहाः । एते द्रेक्काणपाराशौ द्रेक्काणास्त्रय एव हि ॥ Jyotistattvam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0845-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

