द्वन्दः + .{@-दम्@} A pair, couple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0846-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वम्
द्वन्द्वम् [द्वौ द्वौ सहाभिव्यक्तौ; cf. P. VIII. 1. 15. Sk.]<BR>—1 pair, couple.<BR>—2 A couple of animals (including even men) of different sexes, <i>i. e.</i><BR> male and female; द्वन्द्वानि भावं क्रियया विवव्रुः Ku. 3. 35; Me. 45;<BR> न चेदिदं द्वन्द्वमयोजयिष्यत् Ku. 7. 66; R. 1. 40; Ś. 2. 15, 7. 27;<BR> अल्पं तुल्यशीलानि द्वन्द्वानि सृज्यन्ते Pratimā 1.<BR>—3 A couple of opposite conditions or qualities, (such as सुख and<BR> दुःख; शीत and उष्ण); बलवती हि द्वन्द्वानां प्रवृत्तिः K. 135;<BR> द्वन्द्वैरयोजयच्चेमाः सुखदुःखादिभिः प्रजाः Ms. 1. 26, 6. 81;<BR> सर्वर्तुनिर्वृतिकरे निवसन्नुपैति न द्वन्द्वदुःखमिह किंचिदकिंचनोऽपि Śi. 4. 64.<BR>—4 A strife, contention, quarrel, dispute, fight.<BR>—5 A duel; Rām. 6. 43. 15.<BR>—6 Doubt, uncertainty.<BR>—7 A fortress, stronghold.<BR>—8 A secret.<BR>—9 A secret, or lonely place; द्वन्द्वे ह्येतत् प्रवक्तव्यं हितं वै यद्यवेक्षसे<BR> Rām. 7. 103. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0846-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वः|द्वन्द्व|द्वंद्व|द्वंद्वं|द्वन्द्वं
द्वन्द्वम् + .{@-न्द्वः@}<BR>—1 (In gram.) One of the four principal kinds of compounds, in which two<BR> or more words are joined together which, if not compounded, would stand<BR> in the same case and be connected by the copulative conjunction ‘and’;<BR> चार्थे द्वन्द्वः P. II. 2. 29; द्वन्द्वः सामासिकस्य च Bg. 10. 33;<BR> उभयपदप्रधानो द्वन्द्वः Kāśi. 38.<BR>—2 A kind of disease. —3 (in music) A kind of measure.<BR>—4 The sign Gemini of the zodiac.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्वन्द्वालापः, द्वन्द्वगर्भ, द्वन्द्वचर, द्वन्द्वचारिन्, द्वन्द्वज, द्वन्द्वदोषोत्थ, द्वन्द्वदुःखम्, द्वन्द्वभावः, द्वन्द्वभिन्नम्, द्वन्द्वभूत, द्वन्द्वमोहः, द्वन्द्वयुद्धम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0846-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वालापः|द्वन्द्वालाप
द्वन्द्वम् + -आलापः a dialogue between two persons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0846-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वगर्भ
द्वन्द्वम् + -गर्भ <i>a.</i> (A बहुव्रीहि compound) having a द्वन्द्व<BR> compound within it. e. g. बृहद्रथन्तरे सामनी यस्य इति बृहद्रथन्तरसामा,<BR> where बृहद्रथन्तरे is a द्वन्द्व compound; ŚB. on MS. 10. 6. 4.<BR> (opp. अनेकपदबहुव्रीहि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0846-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वचर|द्वंद्वचर|द्वन्द्वचरः
द्वन्द्वम् + -चर, -चारिन् <i>a.</i> living in couples. ━(<i>m.</i>) the ruddy goose;<BR> दयिता द्वन्द्वचरं पतत्त्रिणम् R. 8. 56, 16. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0846-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वचारिन्|द्वंद्वचारिन्
द्वन्द्वम् + -चर, -चारिन् <i>a.</i> living in couples. ━(<i>m.</i>) the ruddy goose;<BR> दयिता द्वन्द्वचरं पतत्त्रिणम् R. 8. 56, 16. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0846-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वज|द्वंद्वज|द्वन्द्वजः
द्वन्द्वम् + -ज, -दोषोत्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 produced from morbid affection of two humours.<BR>—2 arising from a quarrel.<BR>—3 arising from a couple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0846-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वदोषोत्थ
द्वन्द्वम् + -ज, -दोषोत्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 produced from morbid affection of two humours.<BR>—2 arising from a quarrel.<BR>—3 arising from a couple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0846-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वदुःखम्
द्वन्द्वम् + -दुःखम् pain arising from opposite alternations (as heat and cold<BR> &c.); सर्वर्तुनिर्वृतिकरे निवसन्नुपैति न द्वन्द्वदुःखमिह किंचिदकिंचनोऽपि Śi. 4. 64.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">Page0847-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0846-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वभावः|द्वन्द्वभाव|द्वंद्वभाव
द्वन्द्वम् + -भावः antagonism, discord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वभिन्नम्
द्वन्द्वम् + -भिन्नम् separation of the sexes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वभूत
द्वन्द्वम् + -भूत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 forming a couple.<BR>—2 doubtful, uncertain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वमोहः|द्वन्द्वमोह
द्वन्द्वम् + -मोहः trouble caused by doubt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वयुद्धम्
द्वन्द्वम् + -युद्धम् a duel, a single combat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वशः|द्वन्द्वश
द्वन्द्वशः <i>ind.</i> Two by two, in pairs or couples.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्विन्
द्वन्द्विन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Forming a couple.<BR>—2 Opposed to one another (as सुख and दुःख), contradictory.<BR>—3 Quarrelsome, contentious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वन्द्वीभूत
द्वन्द्वीभूत <i>a.</i> Engaged in a single combat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वय|द्वयं
द्वय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Two-fold, double, of two kinds or sorts; अनुपेक्षणे द्वयी गतिः<BR> Mu. 3; कुसुमस्तबकस्येव द्वयी वृत्तिर्मनस्विनः । मूर्ध्नि वा सर्वलोकस्य<BR> विशीर्येत वनेऽथवा ॥ Bh. 2. 104 (v. l.); sometimes used in pl. also;<BR> see Śi. 3. 57.<BR>—2 Relating to द्वैत (q. v.); अविद्यमानोऽप्यवभाति हि द्वयः Bhāg. 11. 2. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वयम्
द्वय + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 Pair, couple, brace (usually at the end of comp.); द्वितयेन द्वयमेव<BR> संगतम् R. 8. 6, 1. 19, 3. 8, 4. 4.<BR>—2 Two-fold nature, duplicity.<BR>—3 Untruthfulness.<BR>—4 (In gram.) The masculine and feminine gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वयी
द्वय + .{@-यी@} A pair, couple.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्वयातिग, द्वयात्मक, द्वयहीन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वयातिग|द्वयातिगः
द्वय + -अतिग <i>a.</i> one whose mind is freed from the influence of the<BR> two bad qualities रजस् and तमस्, a saint or a virtuous man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वयात्मक
द्वय + -आत्मक <i>a.</i> of a two-fold nature. {@वादिन्@} <i>a.</i><BR>—1 double-tongued, insincere.<BR>—2 = द्वैतवादी q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वयहीन
द्वय + -हीन <i>a.</i> of the neuter gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वयस
द्वयस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> A termination added to nouns in the sense of ‘reaching to’<BR>, ‘as high or deep as’, ‘as far as’; गुल्फद्वयसे मदपयसि K. 114;<BR> नारीनितम्बद्वयसं बभूव (अम्भः) R. 16. 46; Śi. 6. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वाज
द्वाज, द्वात्रिंशत्, द्वादश &c. See under द्वि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वात्रिंशत्
द्वाज, द्वात्रिंशत्, द्वादश &c. See under द्वि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वादश|द्वादशः
द्वाज, द्वात्रिंशत्, द्वादश &c. See under द्वि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वापरः|द्वापर|द्वापरं
द्वापरः, -रम्<BR> [द्वाभ्यां सत्यत्रेतायुगाभ्यां परः पृषो˚ Tv.]<BR>—1 N. of the third Yuga of the world; Ms. 9. 301; अष्टौ शतसहस्राणि<BR> वर्षाणां मानुषाणि तु । चतुःषष्टिः सहस्राणि वर्षाणां द्वापरं युगम् ॥ Matsya P.<BR>—2 The side of a die marked with two points.<BR>—3 Doubt, suspense, uncertainty.<BR>—4 A kind of deity; द्वापरं शकुनिः प्राप धृष्टद्युम्नस्तु पावकम्<BR> Mb. 18. 5. 21; N. 13. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वापरम्
द्वापरः, -रम्<BR> [द्वाभ्यां सत्यत्रेतायुगाभ्यां परः पृषो˚ Tv.]<BR>—1 N. of the third Yuga of the world; Ms. 9. 301; अष्टौ शतसहस्राणि<BR> वर्षाणां मानुषाणि तु । चतुःषष्टिः सहस्राणि वर्षाणां द्वापरं युगम् ॥ Matsya P.<BR>—2 The side of a die marked with two points.<BR>—3 Doubt, suspense, uncertainty.<BR>—4 A kind of deity; द्वापरं शकुनिः प्राप धृष्टद्युम्नस्तु पावकम्<BR> Mb. 18. 5. 21; N. 13. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वामुष्यायणः|द्वामुष्यायण
द्वामुष्यायणः = द्वपामुष्यायण q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वार्
द्वार् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A door, gate; विदश्य निम्बपत्राणि नियता द्वारि वेश्मनः Y. 3. 12; Ms. 3. 88.<BR>—2 Access, way.<BR>—3 A means, an expedient. (द्वारा ‘by means of’, ‘through’).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्वार्ग, द्वार्बाहुः, द्वाःस्थः, द्वाःस्थितः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वार्ग
द्वार् + -ग <i>a.</i> coming to the door; विलोक्याजं द्वार्गं कपटलधुकायं<BR> सुररिपुः Viṣṇumahimna 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वार्बाहुः|द्वार्बाहु
द्वार् + -बाहुः a door-post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वाःस्थः|द्वाःस्थ
द्वार् + -स्थः, -स्थितः (द्वाःस्थः, द्वास्थः, द्वाःस्थितः, द्वास्थितः)<BR> a door-keeper, porter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वाःस्थितः|द्वाःस्थित
द्वार् + -स्थः, -स्थितः (द्वाःस्थः, द्वास्थः, द्वाःस्थितः, द्वास्थितः)<BR> a door-keeper, porter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वारम्
द्वारम् [द्वृ-णिच्-अच् Tv.]<BR>—1 A door, gateway, gate.<BR>—2 A passage, entrance, ingress, opening; अथवा कृतवाग्द्वारे वंशेऽस्मिन्<BR> R. 1. 4, 11. 18.<BR>—3 An aperture of the human body (they are nine); see खम् and Ku. 3. 50;<BR> Bg. 8. 12; and Ms. 6. 48 also; द्वारि द्वाराणि शेषाणि Sāṅ. K. 35.<BR>—4 Way, medium, means (द्वारेण ‘through’, ‘by means of’; Pt. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वारी
द्वारम् + .{@-री@} A door.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्वाराधिपः, द्वाराररिः, द्वारकण्टकः, द्वारकपाटः, द्वारकपाटम्, द्वारकोष्टकः, द्वारगोपः, द्वारनायकः, द्वारपः, द्वारपालः, द्वारपालकः, द्वारदर्शिन्, द्वारदारुः, द्वारपक्षः, द्वारपट्टः, द्वारपिण्डी, द्वारपिधानः, द्वारफलकम्, द्वारबलिभुज्, द्वारबाहुः, द्वारयन्त्रम्, द्वारवंशः, द्वारवृत्तम्, द्वारशाखा, द्वारस्तम्भः, द्वारस्थः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वाराधिपः|द्वाराधिप
द्वारम् + -अधिपः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-2" target="_blank">Page0847-2</a>]<BR> a porter, door-keeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वाराररिः|द्वाराररि
द्वारम् + -अररिः the leaf of a door; Rāj. T.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0847-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वारकण्टकः|द्वारकण्टक|द्वारकंटक
