द्वि + -पक्षः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">Page0849-1</a>]<BR>—1 a bird.<BR>—2 a month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0848-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

