द्वि + -पाद्यः, -पाद्यम् a double penalty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

