द्विरात्रम्
द्वि + -रात्रम् two nights.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विरूप|द्विरूपः
द्वि + -रूप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 biform.<BR>—2 written in two ways.<BR>—3 having a different shape.<BR>—4 bi-colour, bipartite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विरूपः|द्विरूप
द्वि + -रूप + .({@-पः@})<BR>—1 a variety of interpretation or reading.<BR>—2 a word correctly written in two ways.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विरेतस्
