द्विवज्रकः|द्विवज्रक
द्वि + -वज्रकः a kind of house or structure with 16 angles (sides).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विवर्गः
द्वि + -वर्गः The pair of प्रकृति and पुरुष, or of काम<BR> and क्रोध; जज्ञे द्विवर्गं प्रजहौ द्विवर्गम् Bu. C. 2. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विवाहिका
द्वि + -वाहिका a wing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विविंश
