द्विश्रुति
द्वि + -श्रुति <i>a.</i> comprehending two intervals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विषष्
द्वि + -षष् <i>a.</i> (pl.) twice six, twelve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विषष्ट
द्वि + -षष्ट (द्विषष्ट, द्वाषष्ट) <i>a.</i> sixty-second.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विषष्टिः|द्विषष्टि
द्वि + -षष्टिः <i>f.</i> (द्विषष्टिः, द्वाषष्टिः) sixty-two.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विसन्ध्य
द्वि + -सन्ध्य <i>a.</i> having a morning and evening twi-light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

