द्विहृदया
द्वि + -हृदया a pregnant woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विहोतृ
द्वि + -होतृ <i>m.</i> an epithet of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विक|द्विकं|द्विकः
द्विक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Two-fold, forming a pair, consisting of two; Bṛ. S. 13. 3.<BR>—2 Second.<BR>—3 Happening the second time.<BR>—4 Increased by two, two percent; द्विक शतं वृद्धिः Ms. 8. 141-42.<BR> See द्विक under द्वि also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विकः|द्विक|द्विकं
द्विक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A crow.<BR>—2 A chakravāka bird; ‘वयं काका वयं काका जल्पन्तीति खगे द्विकाः’ Udb.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्विकपृष्ठः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विकपृष्ठः|द्विकपृष्ठ
द्विक + -पृष्ठः the two-humped camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितय|द्वितयं
द्वितय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Consisting of or divided into two, double, twofold;<BR> द्रुमसानुमतां किमन्तरं यदि वायौ द्वितयेऽपि ते चलाः R. 8. 90;<BR> sometimes used in pl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितयम्
द्वितय + .{@-यम्@} A pair, couple; अधिकं शुशुभे शुभंयुना द्वितयेन द्वयमेव<BR> संगतम् R. 8. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीय|द्वितीयं|द्वितीयः
द्वितीय <i>a.</i> Second; त्वं जीवितं त्वमसि मे हृदयं द्वितीयम्<BR> U. 3. 26; Me. 85; R. 3. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीयः|द्वितीय|द्वितीयं
द्वितीय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 the second in a family, a son.<BR>—2 A companion, partner, friend (usually at the end of comp.); प्रयतपरिग्रहद्वितीयः<BR> R. 1. 95; Ku. 3. 35; so छाया˚, दुःख˚ &c.<BR>—3 The second letter of a class.<BR>—4 The second person (in gram.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीया
द्वितीय + .{@-या@}<BR>—1 The second day of a lunar fortnight. ˚चन्द्र the young moon; द्वितीयाचन्द्र<BR> इवाधिकतरं शोभते प्रियवयस्यः Ratn. 4. 2/3.<BR>—2 A wife, companion, partner; द्वितीयां मदभीष्टाय भार्यार्थे स्वीकरिष्यसि Ks. 98. 33.<BR>—3 (In gram.) The accusative case.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीयम्
द्वितीय + .{@-यम्@} The half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीयम्
द्वितीय + .{@-यम्@} <i>ind.</i> A second time, again.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्वितीयाश्रमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीयाश्रमः|द्वितीयाश्रम
द्वितीय + -आश्रमः the second stage or period of the religious life of a<BR> Brāhmaṇa; <i>i. e.</i> गार्हस्थ्य. {@-वयस्@} <i>a.</i> having arrived<BR> at the second stage of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीयाकृ
द्वितीयाकृ €8 U. To plough twice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीयक
द्वितीयक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Second; also {@द्वितीयिक@}.<BR>—2 Happening the second time.<BR>—3 Returning every second day (as a fever).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीयाकृत|द्वितीयाकृतं
द्वितीयाकृत <i>a.</i> Ploughed twice (as a field).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीयिन्
द्वितीयिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Occupying the second place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वितीयवत्|द्वितीयवन्त्
द्वितीयवत् <i>a.</i> having as a companion; धृत्या द्वितीयवान् भवति<BR> Mb. 3. 313. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्वित्वम्
द्वित्वम्<BR>—1 A pair, couple.<BR>—2 The number ‘two’.<BR>—3 Duality.<BR>—4 The dual.<BR>—5 Reduplication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विध
द्विध <i>a.</i> Divided into two parts, split asunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विधा
द्विधा <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 In two parts; द्विधा भिन्नाः शिखण्डिभिः R. 1. 39; Ms. 1. 12, 32;<BR> द्विधेव हृदयं तस्य दुःखितस्याभवत् तदा<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0850-1" target="_blank">Page0850-1</a>]<BR> Mb.<BR>—2 In two ways.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्विधाकरणम्, द्विधागतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0849-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विधाकरणम्
द्विधा + -करणम् dividing into two parts, splitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0850-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विधागतिः|द्विधागति
द्विधा + -गतिः<BR>—1 an amphibious animal.<BR>—2 a crab.<BR>—3 a crocodile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0850-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विशस्
द्विशस् <i>ind.</i> By twos, two by two, in couples.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0850-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विस्
द्विस् <i>ind.</i> Twice; द्विरिव प्रतिशब्देन व्याजहार हिमालयः<BR> Ku. 6. 64; Ms. 2. 60.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: द्विरागमनम्, द्विरापः, द्विरुक्त, द्विरुक्तिः, द्विरूढा, द्विर्भावः, द्विर्वचनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0850-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विरागमनम्
द्विस् + -आगमनम् (द्विरागमनम्) the ceremony of the second entrance<BR> of the bride into her husbandʼs house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0850-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

