द्विस् + -आपः (द्विरापः) an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0850-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

द्विरुक्त|द्विरुक्तः
द्विस् + -उक्त <i>a.</i> (द्विरुक्त)<BR>—1 spoken twice, repeated.<BR>—2 said in two ways.<BR>—3 redundant, tautologous, superfluous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0850-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

