धरुणः|धरुण
धरुण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 An epithet of Brahman.<BR>—2 Heaven,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0855-1" target="_blank">Page0855-1</a>]<BR> paradise.<BR>—3 Water, (<i>n.</i> also)<BR>—4 Opinion.<BR>—5 A place where anything is preserved.<BR>—6 Fire.<BR>—7 A sucking calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0854-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

