धातुपाठः|धातुपाठ
धातुः + -पाठः a list of roots arranged according to Pāṇiniʼs grammatical<BR> system (the most important of these lists called धातुपाठ being supposed<BR> to be the work of Pāṇini himself, as supplementary to his Sūtras).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0858-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

