धानम्
धानम्, -नी<BR> [धा भावे-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 A receptacle, seat; as in मसीधानी, राजधानी, यमधानी; रविं दधानेऽप्यरविन्दधाने Śi. 4. 12.<BR>—2 Nourishing, nourishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0859-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धानी
