धूश्(ष्, स्) €10 U. (धूशयति-ते) To adorn, decorate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0865-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धूसर|धूसरः
धूसर <i>a.</i> [धू-सर किच्च न षत्वम् Tv.] Of a dusty, greyish<BR> or dusky-white colour, grey; शशी दिवसधूसरः Bh. 2. 56; Ku. 4. 4, 46;<BR> R. 5. 42, 16. 17; Śi. 17. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0865-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

धूसरः|धूसर
