नक्ष्
नक्ष् €1 P. (नक्षति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To come near, approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0872-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

