नगरम् [नगा इव प्रासादाः सन्त्यत्र बा˚ र; cf. P. V. 2. 107<BR> Vārt.] A town, city (opp. ग्राम); नगरगमनाय मतिं न करोति<BR> Ś. 2. पण्यक्रियादिनिपुणैश्चातुर्वर्ण्यजनैर्युतम् । अनेकजातिसंबद्धं<BR> नैकशिल्पिसमाकुलम् । सर्वदैवतसंबद्धं नगरं त्वभिधीयते ॥<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नगराधिकृतः, नगराधिपः, नगराध्यक्षः, नगराभ्याशः, नगराभ्यासः, नगरोपान्तः, नगरौकस्, नगरकाकः, नगरकीर्तनम्, नगरघातः, नगरजनः, नगरप्रदक्षिणा, नगरप्रान्तः, नगरमण्डना, नगरमर्दिन्, नगरमार्गः, नगररक्षा, नगररक्षिन्, नगरस्थः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगराधिकृतः|नगराधिकृत
नगरम् + -अधिकृतः, -अधिपः, -अध्यक्षः<BR>—1 the chief magistrate of a town, head police-officer; निक्षिप्तौ नगराध्यक्षौ<BR> शेषाः सर्वे विनिर्गताः Hariv.<BR>—2 governor or superintendent of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगराधिपः|नगराधिप
नगरम् + -अधिकृतः, -अधिपः, -अध्यक्षः<BR>—1 the chief magistrate of a town, head police-officer; निक्षिप्तौ नगराध्यक्षौ<BR> शेषाः सर्वे विनिर्गताः Hariv.<BR>—2 governor or superintendent of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगराध्यक्षः|नगराध्यक्ष
नगरम् + -अधिकृतः, -अधिपः, -अध्यक्षः<BR>—1 the chief magistrate of a town, head police-officer; निक्षिप्तौ नगराध्यक्षौ<BR> शेषाः सर्वे विनिर्गताः Hariv.<BR>—2 governor or superintendent of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगराभ्याशः|नगराभ्याश
नगरम् + -अभ्याशः, -अभ्यासः the vicinity of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगराभ्यासः
नगरम् + -अभ्याशः, -अभ्यासः the vicinity of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरोपान्तः|नगरोपान्त|नगरोपांत
नगरम् + -उपान्तः a suburb, the skirt of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरौकस्
नगरम् + -ओकस् <i>m.</i> a townsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरकाकः|नगरकाक
नगरम् + -काकः ‘town-crow’, an expression of contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरकीर्तनम्
नगरम् + -कीर्तनम् repeating the name of a god while wandering through a city.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरघातः|नगरघात
नगरम् + -घातः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरजनः|नगरजन
नगरम् + -जनः<BR>—1 townsfolk.<BR>—2 a citizen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरप्रदक्षिणा
नगरम् + -प्रदक्षिणा carrying an idol round a city in procession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरप्रान्तः|नगरप्रान्त|नगरप्रांत
नगरम् + -प्रान्तः a suburb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरमण्डना
नगरम् + -मण्डना a courtezan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरमर्दिन्
नगरम् + -मर्दिन् <i>m.</i> an intoxicated elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरमार्गः|नगरमार्ग
नगरम् + -मार्गः a principal road, high-way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगररक्षा
नगरम् + -रक्षा superintendence or government of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगररक्षिन्
नगरम् + -रक्षिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 the superintendent of a town.<BR>—2 a town-watchman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरस्थः|नगरस्थ
नगरम् + -स्थः a townsman, citizen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0873-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरिन्
नगरिन् <i>m.</i> Lord of a town; Ms. 4. 213.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरी
नगरी = नगर q. v.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नगरीकाकः, नगरीबकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरीकाकः|नगरीकाक
नगरी + -काकः the (Indian) crane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरीबकः|नगरीबक
नगरी + -बकः a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नगरीय
नगरीय <i>a.</i> [नगर-छ] Belonging to a town, urban, civil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्न|नग्नः
नग्न See under नज् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नहु
नग्नहु <i>n.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नहूः
नग्नहु + .({@-हूः@} <i>f.</i>) Ferment for the production of spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नङ्गः|नङ्ग|नंग|नंगः
नङ्गः A lover, paramour (जार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नचिकेतस्
नचिकेतस् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 An epithet of Agni.<BR>—2 N. of the son of Vājaśravas. He secured Brahmavidyā from Yamadharma<BR> (see Kaṭhopaniṣat); उशन् ह वै वाजश्रवसः सर्ववेदसं ददौ । तस्य<BR> ह नचिकेता नाम पुत्र आस । Kaṭh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नचिर
नचिर <i>a.</i> See अचिर; योगयुक्तो मुनिर्ब्रह्म नचिरेणाधिगच्छति<BR> Bg. 5. 6, 12. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नज्
नज् €1 Ā. (नजते) To be ashamed, modest or bashful,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्न|नग्नः
नग्न <i>a.</i> [नज्-न-कर्तरि क्त तस्य नः]<BR>—1 Naked, nude, bare; न नग्नः स्नानमाचरेत् Ms. 4. 45; नग्नक्षपणके<BR> देशे रजकः किं करिष्यति Cāṇ. 110; अवश्यंभाविनो भावा भवन्ति<BR> महतामपि । नग्नत्वं नीलकण्ठस्य महाहिशयनं हरेः ॥ H.<BR>—2 Uncultivated, uninhabited, desolate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नः|नग्न
नग्न + .{@-ग्नः@}<BR>—1 A naked mendicant.<BR>—2 A Buddhist mendicant (क्षपणक); धर्म इत्युपधर्मेषु नग्नरक्तपटादिषु ।<BR> प्रायेण सज्जते भ्रान्त्या पेशलेषु च वाग्मिषु ॥ Bhāg. 4. 19. 25.<BR>—3 A hypocrite.<BR>—4 A bard accompanying an army, or a wandering bard.<BR>—5 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्ना
नग्न + .{@-ग्ना@}<BR>—1 A naked, shameless (or wanton) woman.<BR>—2 A girl before menstruation, or less than 12 or 10 (and therefore may<BR> go about naked).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नग्नाटः, नग्नाटकः, नग्नाचार्यः, नग्नचर्या, नग्नजित्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नाटः|नग्नाट
नग्न + -अटः, -अटकः<BR>—1 one who goes about naked.<BR>—2 especially a Jaina or Buddhist mendicant (of the दिगम्बर class).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नाटकः|नग्नाटक
नग्न + -अटः, -अटकः<BR>—1 one who goes about naked.<BR>—2 especially a Jaina or Buddhist mendicant (of the दिगम्बर class).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नाचार्यः|नग्नाचार्य
नग्न + -आचार्यः a bard, a minstrel, a panegyrist; N. 19. 41; Bṛ. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नचर्या
नग्न + -चर्या a vow to go naked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नजित्
नग्न + -जित् N. of an author on architecture; Bṛ. S. 58. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नक|नग्नकः
नग्नक <i>a.</i> (-ग्निका <i>f.</i>)<BR> Naked, nude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नकः|नग्नक
नग्नक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A naked mendicant.<BR>—2 A Jaina or Buddhist mendicant (of the दिगम्बर class).<BR>—3 A bard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नका
नग्नका, नग्निका<BR>—1 A naked, shameless (or wanton) woman.<BR>—2 A girl before menstruation; नग्निका नागतार्तवा Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्निका
नग्नका, नग्निका<BR>—1 A naked, shameless (or wanton) woman.<BR>—2 A girl before menstruation; नग्निका नागतार्तवा Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नंकरणम्
नग्नंकरणम् Making naked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नंभविष्णु
नग्नंभविष्णु, -भावुक <i>a.</i><BR> Becoming naked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नंभावुक
नग्नंभविष्णु, -भावुक <i>a.</i><BR> Becoming naked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नमुषितप्रख्य
नग्नमुषितप्रख्य <i>a.</i> One who is robbed to nakedness; (कश्चिन्मुषितो<BR> नग्नो भवति तद्वद् भूतम्); को नग्नमुषितप्रख्यं बहु मन्येत राघवम् Bk. 5. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नीकृ
नग्नीकृ €8 U. To make naked, to convert into a naked (Jaina) mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नग्नीकृत
नग्नीकृत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Made naked, undressed.<BR>—2 Converted into a naked mendicant; ते तेनैव निहत्य निर्दयतरं<BR> नग्नीकृता मुण्डिताः Pt. 4. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नञ्
नञ् <i>ind.</i> The technical term for the negative particle; न<BR> hence नञः (= A negative particle); द्वौ नञौ प्रकृतार्थं गमयतः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नट्
नट् I. €1 P. (नटति, the न not changed to ण after प्र<BR> in the sense of ‘hurting’.)<BR>—1 To dance; यदि मनसा नटनीयम् Gīt. 4.<BR>—2 To act. —3 To injure (by a deceptive trick). ━<i>Caus.</i> (नाटयति-ते)<BR>—1 To act, gesticulate, represent dramatically (in dramas); शरसंधानं<BR> नाटयति Ś. 1 &c.<BR>—2 To imitate, copy; स्फटिककटकभूमिर्नाटयत्येष शैलः … अधिगतधवलिम्नः<BR> शूलपाणेरभिख्याम् Śi. 4. 65. (<i>N. B.</i> नट् forms नटयति in<BR> the sense of ‘causing to dance’; नाट्येन केन नटयिष्यति दीर्घमायुः<BR> Bh. 3. 126.). ━II. €10 U. (नाटयति-ते)<BR>—1 To drop or fall.<BR>—2 To shine.<BR>—3 To injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटः|नट
नटः [नट्-अच्]<BR>—1 A dancer; न नटा न विटा न गायकाः Bh. 3. 27.<BR>—2 An actor; कुर्वन्नयं प्रहसनस्य नटः कृतोऽसि Bh. 3. 126, 112;<BR> नटवद् व्यवतिष्ठते लिङ्गम् Sāṅ. K. 42.<BR>—3 The son of a degraded Kṣatriya; Ms. 10. 22.<BR>—4 The Aśoka tree.<BR>—5 A kind of reed.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नटान्तिका, नटेश्वरः, नटचर्या, नटभूषणः, नटमण्डनः, नटरङ्गः, नटवरः, नटसंज्ञकम्, नटसूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटान्तिका|नटांतिका
नटः + -अन्तिका shame, modesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटेश्वरः|नटेश्वर
नटः + -ईश्वरः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटचर्या|नटचर्य्या
नटः + -चर्या the performance of an actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटभूषणः|नटभूषण|नटभूषणं
नटः + -भूषणः, -मण्डनः (yellow) orpiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटमण्डनः|नटमण्डन|नटमंडन|नटमण्डनं
नटः + -भूषणः, -मण्डनः (yellow) orpiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटरङ्गः|नटरङ्ग|नटरंग
नटः + -रङ्गः<BR>—1 a theatrical stage.<BR>—2 anything illusory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटवरः|नटवर
नटः + -वरः ‘the chief actor’, the Sūtradhāra of a drama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटसंज्ञकम्
नटः + -संज्ञकम् yellow orpiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटसंज्ञकः|नटसञ्ज्ञक
नटः + -संज्ञकम् + .({@-कः@}) an actor, dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटसूत्रम्
नटः + -सूत्रम् directions or rules for actors. पाराशर्यशिलालिभ्यां<BR> भिक्षुनटसूत्रयोः P. IV. 3. 110.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटकः|नटक
नटकः An actor.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नटकमेलकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटकमेलकम्
नटकः + -मेलकम् N. of a comedy; a variety of दृश्यकाव्य with laughter<BR> as the main sentiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटनम्
नटनम् [नट्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Dancing, dance.<BR>—2 Acting, gesticulation, dramatic representation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटनारायणः|नटनारायण
नटनारायणः A kind of musical राग being a combination of दीपक and मेघ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटवत्
नटवत् <i>a.</i> Acting as a नट, pretender; नटवन्मूढ मायाभिर्मायेशान्नो<BR> जिगीषसि Bhāg. 8. 11. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटितम्
नटितम् Representation, gesticulation, acting. ━<i>a.</i> (नटित)<BR> Disgusted with, tired; Hem. (परिशिष्टपर्वन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटी
नटी<BR>—1 An actress.<BR>—2 The chief actress (regarded as the wife of the Sūtradhāra).<BR>—3 A courtezan, harlot.<BR>—4 Red arsenic.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नटीसुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नटीसुतः|नटीसुत
नटी + -सुतः the son of a dancing girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नट्या
नट्या A company of actors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडः|नड|नडं
नडः, -डम्<BR> A species of reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडम्
नडः, -डम्<BR> A species of reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडः|नड|नडं
नडः, -डम् + .{@-डः@}<BR>—1 N. of a prince with patronymic Naiṣadha (= नलनैषध); see नल.<BR>—2 N. of a tribe preparing a sort of bracelets.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नडागारम्, नडागारम्, नडनेरिः, नडप्राय, नडभक्तम्, नडमीनः, नडवनम्, नडसंहतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडागारम्
नडः + -अगारम्, -आगारम् a hut of reeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडागारम्
नडः + -अगारम्, -आगारम् a hut of reeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडनेरिः|नडनेरि
नडः + -नेरिः a kind of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडप्राय|नडप्रायः
नडः + -प्राय <i>a.</i> abounding in reeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडभक्तम्
नडः + -भक्तम् a place abounding in reeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडमीनः|नडमीन
नडः + -मीनः a kind of fish (sprat).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडवनम्
नडः + -वनम् a thicket of reeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडसंहतिः|नडसंहति
नडः + -संहतिः <i>f.</i> a collection or quantity of reeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0874-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडकम्
नडकम्<BR>—1 A bone between the shoulders; ‘हृदयं जिह्वा क्रोडं सव्यसक्थि पूर्वनडकम्’,<BR> ‘दक्षिणसक्थि पूर्वनडकम्’ Kāty.<BR>—2 The hollow of a bone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडश
नडश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Covered with reeds; (also नडकीय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडिनी
नडिनी<BR>—1 A quantity of reeds.<BR>—2 A reed-bed, a river abounding in reeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडिल
नडिल <i>a.</i>, नड्वत् <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> Abounding in or covered with reeds, reedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नड्वत्|नड्वन्त्
नडिल <i>a.</i>, नड्वत् <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> Abounding in or covered with reeds, reedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नड्वती
नडिल <i>a.</i>, नड्वत् <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> Abounding in or covered with reeds, reedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नड्या
नड्या A quantity of reeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नड्वल|नड्वलः
नड्वल <i>a.</i> Abounding in reeds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नड्वलम्
नड्वल + .{@-लम्, -ला@}<BR>—1 A quantity or a bed of reeds; बलानि संममर्दाशु नड्वलानीव कुञ्जरः Mb. 6. 63. 14.<BR>—2 A place abounding in reeds or grass; नागः प्रभिन्न इव नड्वलेषु<BR> Mb. 5. 23. 23; यो नड्वलानीव गजः परेषां बलान्यमृद्नान्नलिनाभवक्त्रः R. 18. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नड्वला
नड्वल + .{@-लम्, -ला@}<BR>—1 A quantity or a bed of reeds; बलानि संममर्दाशु नड्वलानीव कुञ्जरः Mb. 6. 63. 14.<BR>—2 A place abounding in reeds or grass; नागः प्रभिन्न इव नड्वलेषु<BR> Mb. 5. 23. 23; यो नड्वलानीव गजः परेषां बलान्यमृद्नान्नलिनाभवक्त्रः R. 18. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नड्वाभूः
नड्वाभूः <i>f.</i> pavement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नडह|नडहः
नडह <i>a.</i> Beautiful, lovely; see लडह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नत|नतं|नतः
नत <i>p. p.</i> [नम्-क्त]<BR>—1 Bent, bowed, stooping, inclined.<BR>—2 Sunk, depressed.<BR>—3 Crooked, curved.<BR>—4 Bowing to, saluting; सुविस्मितं कृत्यमजं नतोऽस्मि तम् Bhāg. 5. 18. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतम्
नत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 The distance of any planet from the meridian.<BR>—2 The zenith distance at a meridian transit.<BR>—3 Inclination.<BR>—4 The buttocks (cf. नततटे); L. D. B.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नतांशः, नताङ्ग, नतोन्नत, नतकालः, नतघटिका, नतज्या, नतनाडी, नतनाडिका, नतनाभि, नतनासिक, नतपर्वन्, नतभ्रूः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतांशः|नतांश
नत + -अंशः zenith distance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नताङ्ग
नत + -अङ्ग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 bending the body.<BR>—2 stooping, bowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नताङ्गी|नतांगी
नत + -अङ्ग + .({@-ङ्गी@})<BR>—1 a woman with stooping limbs; नताङ्गी मातङ्गी रुचिरगतिभङ्गी भगवती ।<BR> सती शम्भोरम्भोरुहचटुलचक्षुर्विजयते ॥ Ā. L. 4.<BR>—2 a woman in general; तामीषत्प्रचलविलोचनां नताङ्गीमालिङ्गन्पवन<BR> मम स्पृशाङ्गमङ्गम् Māl. 1. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतोन्नत
नत + -उन्नत <i>a.</i> high and low; अस्मिन्नलक्षितनतोन्नतभूमिभागे<BR> मार्गे पदानि खलु ते विषमीभवन्ति Ś. 4. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतकालः|नतकाल
नत + -कालः, -घटिका an hour-angle; distance in time from meridian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतघटिका
नत + -कालः, -घटिका an hour-angle; distance in time from meridian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतज्या
नत + -ज्या the sine of the hour-angle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतनाडी
नत + -नाडी, -नाडिका<BR>—1 the distance in time of any planet from the meridian.<BR>—2 any hour of birth after noon or before midnight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतनाडिका
नत + -नाडी, -नाडिका<BR>—1 the distance in time of any planet from the meridian.<BR>—2 any hour of birth after noon or before midnight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतनाभि
नत + -नाभि <i>a.</i> thin, slender; तस्याः प्रविष्टा नतनाभिरन्ध्रं<BR> रराज तन्वी नवलोमराजिः Ku. 1. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतनासिक|नतनासिकः
नत + -नासिक <i>a.</i> flat-nosed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतपर्वन्
नत + -पर्वन् <i>a.</i> flat-jointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतभ्रूः
नत + -भ्रूः a woman with curved eye-brows; यदि हंस गत ऽन ते<BR> नतभ्रूः सरसो रोधसि दृक्पथं प्रिया मे V. 4. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नतिः|नति
नतिः [नम्-भावे-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Bending, stooping, bowing.<BR>—2 Curvature, crookedness.<BR>—3 Bending the body in salutation, a bow, courtesy; त्रिकोणमथ षट्कोणमर्धचन्द्रं<BR> प्रदक्षिणम् । दण्डमष्टाङ्गमुग्रं च सप्तधा नतिलक्षणम् ॥ Kālikā P.<BR>—4 Parallax in latitude (in astronomy). —5 The change of a dental to a lingual letter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नत्यूहः|नत्यूह
नत्यूहः A kind of bird; see दात्यूहः; एष क्रोशति नत्यूहस्तं<BR> शिखी प्रतिकूजति Rām. 2. 56. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नत्रम्
नत्रम् A kind of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नद्
नद् €1 P. (नदति, नदित)<BR>—1 To sound, resound, thunder (as a cloud &c.); वामश्चायं नदति मधुरं<BR> चातकस्ते सगन्धः Me. 9;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">Page0875-2</a>]<BR> नदत्याकाशगङ्गायाः स्रोतस्युद्दामदिग्गजे R. 1. 78; Śi. 5. 63; Bk. 2. 4.<BR>—2 To speak, shout, cry, roar (often with words like शब्द, खन, नाद<BR> &c. as object); ननाद बलवन्नादम्, शब्दं घोरतरं नदन्ति Mb.<BR>—3 To vibrate. ━<i>Caus.</i> (नादयति-ते)<BR>—1 To fill with noise, make noisy or resonant.<BR>—2 To cause to make a sound. ━<i>With</i> {@उद्@} to roar, cry (loudly), bellow<BR> (as a bull); असोढसिंहध्वनिरुन्ननाद Ku. 1. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदः|नद
नदः [नदति शब्दायते-अच्]<BR>—1 A river, great river (such as the Indus); दधद्भिरभितस्तटौ विकचवारिजाम्बू<BR> नदैः Śi. 4. 66 (where Malli. remarks:− प्राक्स्रोतसो नद्यः प्रत्यक्स्रोतसो<BR> नदा नर्मदां विनेत्याहुः).<BR>—2 A stream, flowing stream, rivulet; सुनिनदैर्नदैर्वृतम् Ki. 5. 27.<BR>—3 The ocean.<BR>—4 Ved. A horse.<BR>—5 A cloud.<BR>—6 A praiser (ऋषि).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नदपतिः, नदराजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदपतिः
नदः + -पतिः, -राजः the ocean; प्रथमप्रबुद्धनदराजसुतावदनेन्दुनेव<BR> तुहिनद्युतिना Śi. 9. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदराजः|नदराज
नदः + -पतिः, -राजः the ocean; प्रथमप्रबुद्धनदराजसुतावदनेन्दुनेव<BR> तुहिनद्युतिना Śi. 9. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदथुः|नदथु
नदथुः [नद्-अथुच्]<BR>—1 Noise, roaring; निनदमिव नदथुमिवाग्नेर्ज्वलन उपशृणोति Ch. Up. 3. 13. 7.<BR>—2 The roaring of a bull.<BR>—3 Crying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदनुः|नदनु
नदनुः<BR>—1 A lion.<BR>—2 Sounding, roaring; यदाकृणोषि नदनुं समूहसि Rv. 8. 21. 14.<BR>—3 The sound of praise.<BR>—4 War, battle.<BR>—5 A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदिः|नदि
नदिः Ved. Praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदिका
नदिका A small river, rivulet, rill, brook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदी
नदी A river, any flowing stream; रविपीतजला तपात्यये पुनरोधेन<BR> हि युज्यते नदी Ku. 4. 44; यथा नद्यः स्यन्दमानाः समुद्रे ऽस्तं गच्छन्ति<BR> नामरूपे विहाय Muṇḍ.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नदीनः, नदीशः, नदीकान्तः, नदीकान्ता, नदीकूलम्, नदीतीरम्, नदीकूलप्रियः, नदीज, नदीतर, नदीतरस्थानम्, नदीदोहः, नदीधरः, नदीपङ्कः, नदीपतिः, नदीपूरः, नदीभवम्, नदीमातृक, नदीमार्गः, नदीमुखम्, नदीरयः, नदीवङ्कः, नदीष्णः, नदीसर्जः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीनः|नदीन
नदी + -ईनः, -ईशः, -कान्तः<BR>—1 the ocean; नदीनः पर्यन्ते परमपदवीनः प्रभवति Karpūrastava.<BR>—2 An epithet of Varuṇa; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीशः|नदीश
नदी + -ईनः, -ईशः, -कान्तः<BR>—1 the ocean; नदीनः पर्यन्ते परमपदवीनः प्रभवति Karpūrastava.<BR>—2 An epithet of Varuṇa; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

