नदी + -ईनः, -ईशः, -कान्तः<BR>—1 the ocean; नदीनः पर्यन्ते परमपदवीनः प्रभवति Karpūrastava.<BR>—2 An epithet of Varuṇa; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

