नदी + -पङ्कः the marshy bank of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीपतिः|नदीपति
नदी + -पतिः<BR>—1 the ocean.<BR>—2 an epithet of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीपूरः|नदीपूर
नदी + -पूरः a river which has overflown its banks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीभवम्
नदी + -भवम् river-salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीमातृक|नदीमातृकः
नदी + -मातृक <i>a.</i> watered by rivers, irrigated, supplied with the<BR> water of rivers, canals &c. (as a country &c.); संग्रामभूमीषु भवत्यरीणामस्रैर्नदीमातृकतां<BR> गतासु N. 3. 38; cf. देवमातृक; देशो नद्यम्बुवृष्टपम्बुसंपन्नव्रीहिपालितः ।<BR> स्यान्नदीमातृको देवमातृकश्च यथाक्रमम् ॥ Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीमार्गः|नदीमार्ग
नदी + -मार्गः the course of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीमुखम्
नदी + -मुखम्<BR>—1 the mouth of a river; नदीमुखेनैव समुद्रमाविशत्; वृद्धौ नदीमुखेनैव<BR> प्रस्थानं लवणाम्भसः R.<BR>—2 a kind of grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीरयः|नदीरय
नदी + -रयः the current of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीवङ्कः|नदीवङ्क|नदीवंक
नदी + -वङ्कः the bend or arm of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीष्णः|नदीष्ण
नदी + -ष्णः ({@स्नः@})<BR>—1 bathing in rivers; ततो नदीष्णान् पथिकान् गिरिज्ञान् Bk. 2. 43.<BR>—2 knowing the dangerous spots in rivers, their depth, course &c.; ततः<BR> समाज्ञापयदाशु सर्वानानायिनस्तद्विचये नदीष्णान् R. 16. 75; (hence)<BR>—3 experienced, clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0875-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नदीसर्जः|नदीसर्ज|नदीसर्ज्ज|नदीसर्ज्जः
