नद्ध|नद्धः
नद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Tied, bound, fastened, bound round, put on; खर्जूरीस्कन्धनद्धानाम्<BR> R. 4. 57; Māl. 5. 14.<BR>—2 Covered, inlaid, interwoven.<BR>—3 Joined, connected; see नह्. -द्धम् A tie, band, bond, knot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0876-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

