नभस् + -दृष्टि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 blind.<BR>—2 looking towards the sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0877-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोद्वीपः|नभोद्वीप
नभस् + -द्वीपः, -धूमः a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0877-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोधूमः|नभोधूम
नभस् + -द्वीपः, -धूमः a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0877-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोनदी
नभस् + -नदी the celestial Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0877-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभःप्राणः|नभःप्राण
नभस् + -प्राणः wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0877-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोमणिः|नभोमणि
नभस् + -मणिः the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0877-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोमण्डलम्
नभस् + -मण्डलम् the firmament, the atmosphere; नेदं नभोमण्डलमम्बुराशिः<BR> S. D. 10. ˚दीपः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0877-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नभोयोनिः|नभोयोनि
नभस् + -योनिः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0877-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

