नरभूः
नरः + -भूः <i>f.</i> the Bharatavarṣa, <i>i. e.</i> India.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0879-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरमानिका
नरः + -मानिका, -मानिनी, -मालिनी ‘manlike woman’, a woman with a beard,<BR> masculine woman or an amazon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0879-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरमानिनी
नरः + -मानिका, -मानिनी, -मालिनी ‘manlike woman’, a woman with a beard,<BR> masculine woman or an amazon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0879-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरमालिनी
नरः + -मानिका, -मानिनी, -मालिनी ‘manlike woman’, a woman with a beard,<BR> masculine woman or an amazon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0879-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरमाला
नरः + -माला a girdle of skulls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0879-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरमेधः|नरमेध
नरः + -मेधः a human sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0879-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

