नरः + -यानम्, -रथः, -वाहनम् a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">Page0880-1</a>]<BR> vehicle drawn by men, a palanquin; नरयानादवातीर्य Parṇāl. 4. 17;<BR> Bhāg. 10. 59. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0879-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नररथः|नररथ
नरः + -यानम्, -रथः, -वाहनम् a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">Page0880-1</a>]<BR> vehicle drawn by men, a palanquin; नरयानादवातीर्य Parṇāl. 4. 17;<BR> Bhāg. 10. 59. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0879-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरवाहनम्
नरः + -यानम्, -रथः, -वाहनम् a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">Page0880-1</a>]<BR> vehicle drawn by men, a palanquin; नरयानादवातीर्य Parṇāl. 4. 17;<BR> Bhāg. 10. 59. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0879-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरलोकः|नरलोक
नरः + -लोकः<BR>—1 ‘the world of men’, the earth, terrestrial world.<BR>—2 mankind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरवाहनः|नरवाहन
नरः + -वाहनः an epithet of Kubera; विजयदुन्दुभितां ययुरर्णवा<BR> घनरवा नरवाहनसंपदः R. 9. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरविष्वणः|नरविष्वण
नरः + -विष्वणः a demon, goblin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरवीरः|नरवीर
नरः + -वीरः a brave man, hero.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरव्याघ्रः|नरव्याघ्र
नरः + -व्याघ्रः, -शार्दूलः an eminent man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरशार्दूलः|नरशार्दूल
नरः + -व्याघ्रः, -शार्दूलः an eminent man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरशृङ्गम्
