नरः + -संसर्गः human society.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरसखः|नरसख
नरः + -सखः an epithet of Nārayāṇa; ऊरूद्भवा नरसखस्य मुनेः<BR> सुरस्त्री V. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरसिंहः|नरसिंह
नरः + -सिंहः, -हरिः ‘man-lion’, Viṣṇu in his fourth incarnation;<BR> cf. तव करकमलवरे नखमद्भुतशृङ्गं दलितहिरण्यकशिपुतनुभृङ्गम् ।<BR> केशव धृतनरहरिरूप जय जगदीश हरे ॥ Gīt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरहरिः|नरहरि
नरः + -सिंहः, -हरिः ‘man-lion’, Viṣṇu in his fourth incarnation;<BR> cf. तव करकमलवरे नखमद्भुतशृङ्गं दलितहिरण्यकशिपुतनुभृङ्गम् ।<BR> केशव धृतनरहरिरूप जय जगदीश हरे ॥ Gīt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरसिंहद्वादशी
नरः + -सिंहद्वादशी the 12th day in the light half of फाल्गुन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरस्कन्धः|नरस्कन्ध|नरस्कंध
नरः + -स्कन्धः a multitude or body of men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरहयम्
नरः + -हयम् a fight or enmity between man and horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरंधिः|नरन्धि
नरंधिः Worldly life or existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरंधिषः|नरन्धिष
नरंधिषः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नराशंसः|नराशंस
नराशंसः<BR>—1 A sacrifice.<BR>—2 Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरी
नरी A woman; नम्या नरीभिरमरीव हि सा विरेजे Bv. 3. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्य|नर्यः|नर्य्य
नर्य <i>a.</i> Ved. [नृभ्यो हितं यत्]<BR>—1 Suitable to men (as food &c.).<BR>—2 Manly, strong.<BR>—3 Human.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्यः|नर्य|नर्य्य
नर्य + .{@-र्यः@}<BR>—1 A man.<BR>—2 Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्यौ
नर्य + .{@-र्यौ@} (du.) The two objects of human desire, <i>i. e.</i> Heaven and earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्यम्
नर्य + .{@-र्यम्@}<BR>—1 A manly deed.<BR>—2 A gift for men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकः|नरक|नरकं
नरकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Hell, infernal regions (corresponding to the realm of Pluto; there<BR> are said to be 21 different parts of these regions where different kinds<BR> of tortures are inflicted upon sinners तामिस्र, अन्धतामिस्र, महारौरव,<BR> रौरव, नरक, कालसूत्र, महानरक, संजीवन, महावीचि, तपन, संप्रतापन,<BR> संहात, काकोल, कुड्मल, प्रतिमूर्तिक, लोहशङ्कु, ऋजीष, पन्था, शाल्मली,<BR> असितपत्रवन, लोहदारक are the 21 Narakas; cf. Ms. 4. 88-90).<BR>—2 A liquor-vessel; नरकं मद्यभाजने Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकम्
नरकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Hell, infernal regions (corresponding to the realm of Pluto; there<BR> are said to be 21 different parts of these regions where different kinds<BR> of tortures are inflicted upon sinners तामिस्र, अन्धतामिस्र, महारौरव,<BR> रौरव, नरक, कालसूत्र, महानरक, संजीवन, महावीचि, तपन, संप्रतापन,<BR> संहात, काकोल, कुड्मल, प्रतिमूर्तिक, लोहशङ्कु, ऋजीष, पन्था, शाल्मली,<BR> असितपत्रवन, लोहदारक are the 21 Narakas; cf. Ms. 4. 88-90).<BR>—2 A liquor-vessel; नरकं मद्यभाजने Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकः|नरक|नरकं
नरकः, -कम् + .{@-कः@} N. of a demon, king of Prāgjyotiṣa. [According to one account<BR> he carried off Aditiʼs ear-rings and Kṛṣṇa^1 at the request of the gods<BR> killed him in a single combat and recovered the jewels. According to another<BR> account, Naraka assumed the form of an elephant and carried off the daughter<BR> of Viśvakarman and outraged her. He also seized the daughters of Gandharvas,<BR> gods, men and the nymphs themselves, and collected more than 16000 damsels<BR> in his harem. These, it is related, were transferred by Kṛṣṇa^2 to his<BR> own harem after he had slain Naraka. The demon was born of earth, and<BR> hence called ‘Bhauma’].<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नरकान्तकः, नरकारिः, नरकजित्, नरकरिपुः, नरकामयः, नरकावासः, नरककुण्डम्, नरकदेवता, नरकरूपिन्, नरकवासः, नरकस्था<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170116.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by  on 20170116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकान्तकः|नरकान्तक|नरकांतक
नरकः + -अन्तकः, -अरिः, -जित्, -रिपुः <i>m.</i> epithets of Kṛṣṇa; नरकरिपुणा<BR> सार्धं तेषां सभीमकिरीटिनाम् Ve. 3. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकारिः|नरकारि
नरकः + -अन्तकः, -अरिः, -जित्, -रिपुः <i>m.</i> epithets of Kṛṣṇa; नरकरिपुणा<BR> सार्धं तेषां सभीमकिरीटिनाम् Ve. 3. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकजित्
नरकः + -अन्तकः, -अरिः, -जित्, -रिपुः <i>m.</i> epithets of Kṛṣṇa; नरकरिपुणा<BR> सार्धं तेषां सभीमकिरीटिनाम् Ve. 3. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकरिपुः|नरकरिपु
नरकः + -अन्तकः, -अरिः, -जित्, -रिपुः <i>m.</i> epithets of Kṛṣṇa; नरकरिपुणा<BR> सार्धं तेषां सभीमकिरीटिनाम् Ve. 3. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकामयः|नरकामय
नरकः + -आमयः<BR>—1 the soul after death.<BR>—2 a ghost, spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकावासः|नरकावास
नरकः + -आवासः an inhabitant of hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरककुण्डम्
नरकः + -कुण्डम् a pit in hell where the wicked are tormented (86 such<BR> places are enumerated).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकदेवता
नरकः + -देवता ‘the deity of hell’, Nirṛti (निरृति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकरूपिन्
नरकः + -रूपिन् <i>a.</i> hellish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकवासः|नरकवास
नरकः + -वासः the abode in hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकस्था
नरकः + -स्था the Vaitariṇī river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरकायते
नरकायते Den. Ā. To resemble a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नराचः|नराच
नराचः N. of a metre of sixteen syllables; भुजङ्गराजभाषितं<BR> प्रकीर्णशास्त्रसागरे लघौ गुरौ निरन्तरे सतीह षोडशाक्षरे । प्रतापतापनिर्जितप्रभाकरप्रकाशहे<BR> प्रवृत्तवृत्तराजकं नराचमेव मन्महे ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरिष्यन्तः|नरिष्यन्त
नरिष्यन्तः N. of Vaivasvata Manu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नरिष्ठा
नरिष्ठा Ved.<BR>—1 Sport, pastime.<BR>—2 A human sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्कुटकम्
नर्कुटकम् Nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्त|नर्तः|नर्त्त
नर्त <i>a.</i> [नृत्-अच्] Dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तः|नर्त|नर्त्त
नर्त + .{@-र्तः@} Dancing, a dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तकः|नर्तक|नर्त्तक|नर्त्तकः
नर्तकः [नृत्-कर्तरि ष्वुन्]<BR>—1 A dancer; sometimes a dancing preceptor.<BR>—2 An actor, mime, mummer; नाराजके जनपदे प्रहृष्टनटनर्तकः<BR> Rām. 2. 67. 15.<BR>—3 A bard, herald.<BR>—4 An elephant.<BR>—5 A king.<BR>—6 A peacock.<BR>—7 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—8 N. of a mixed tribe (वेश्यायां रजकाज्जातो नर्तको गायको भवेत्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तकी|नर्त्तकी
नर्तकः + .{@-की@}<BR>—1 A female dancer, a singing girl, an actress; रङ्गस्य दर्शयित्वा<BR> निवर्तते नर्तकी यथा नृत्यात् Sāṅ. K. 59; Ki. 10. 41; R. 19. 14, 19.<BR>—2 A female elephant.<BR>—3 A pea-hen (Mar. लांडोर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तनः|नर्तन|नर्त्तन|नर्त्तनं
नर्तनः [नृत्-ल्युट्] A dancer; Mb. 12. 63. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तनम्
नर्तनः + .{@-नम्@} Gesticulation, dancing, dance.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नर्तनगृहम्, नर्तनशाला, नर्तनप्रियः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तनगृहम्
नर्तनः + -गृहम्, -शाला a dancing hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तनशाला|नर्त्तनशाला
नर्तनः + -गृहम्, -शाला a dancing hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तनप्रियः|नर्तनप्रिय|नर्त्तनप्रिय
नर्तनः + -प्रियः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तयितृ
नर्तयितृ <i>m.</i> A dancing-master; अद्य नर्तयितास्मि M. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तित|नर्त्तित
नर्तित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Danced, made to dance.<BR>—2 Dancing, moving to and fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्तु|नर्त्तु
नर्तु <i>a.</i> Dancing on the edge of a sword. ━<i>f.</i> A female dancer or actress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्द्
नर्द् €1 P. (नर्दति, नर्दित)<BR>—1 To bellow, roar, sound in general; अनर्दिषुः कपिव्याघ्राः Bk. 15. 35, 15. 40, 15. 28, 17. 40.<BR>—2 To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्द|नर्द्द
नर्द <i>a.</i> Bellowing, roaring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्दटकः|नर्दटक|नर्द्दटक|नर्द्दटकं
