नर्दनम्
नर्दनम् [नर्द्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Bellowing, roaring.<BR>—2 Celebrating, praising aloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्दित|नर्दितः|नर्द्दित
नर्दित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sounded, bellowed.<BR>—2 Celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्दितः|नर्दित|नर्द्दित
नर्दित + .{@-तः@} A kind of die or a throw at dice; नर्दितदर्शितमार्गः<BR> कटेन विनिपातितो यामि Mk. 2. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्दितम्
