नर्दिन्|नर्द्दिन्
नर्दिन् <i>a.</i> Sounding, roaring, bellowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0880-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नर्द्धिः
