नवन् + -नवतिः <i>f.</i> ninety-nine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवनिधि
नवन् + -निधि <i>m.</i> (pl.) the nine treasures of Kubera. <i>i. e.</i> महापद्मश्च<BR> पद्मश्च शङ्खो मकरकच्छपौ । मुकुन्दकुन्दनीलाश्च खर्वश्च निधयो नव ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवपञ्चमम्
नवन् + -पञ्चमम् an inauspicious combination of ग्रहs a particular<BR> type of राशिकूट; पाणिग्रहो यदि भवेन्नवपञ्चमर्क्षे सन्तानहानिमतुलां<BR> मुनयो वदन्ति Jyotistattvam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवपञ्चाश|नवपंचाश
नवन् + -पञ्चाश <i>a.</i> fifty-ninth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवपञ्चाशत्|नवपंचाशत्
नवन् + -पञ्चाशत् <i>f.</i> fifty-nine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवरत्नम्
नवन् + -रत्नम्<BR>—1 the nine precious jewels; <i>i. e.</i> मुक्तामाणिक्यवैदूर्यगोमेदा वज्रविद्रुमौ ।<BR> पद्मरागो मरकतं नीलश्चेति यथाक्रमम् ॥<BR>—2 ‘the nine gems’ or poets at the court of king Vikramāditya:− धन्वन्तरिक्षपणकामरसिंहशङ्कुवेतालभट्टघटकर्परकालिदासाः ।<BR> ख्यातो वराहमिहिरो नृपतेः सभायां रत्नानि वै वररुचिर्नव विक्रमस्य ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवरसाः
नवन् + -रसाः <i>m.</i> (pl.) the nine sentiments in poetry; see under अष्टरस<BR> and रस also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवरात्रम्
नवन् + -रात्रम्<BR>—1 a period of nine days.<BR>—2 the first nine days of the month of Āśvina held sacred to Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवविंश
नवन् + -विंश <i>a.</i> twenty-ninth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवविंशतिः|नवविंशति
नवन् + -विंशतिः <i>f.</i> twenty-nine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवविध
नवन् + -विध <i>a.</i> nine-fold, of nine kinds or sorts. ˚अन्नानि <i>n.</i><BR> (pl.) = सूप, शाक, मिष्टान्न, जेमन (ओदनादि), उपदंश (मूलकादि),<BR> वितर्दंश (pickles etc.), सन्धान (मद्यादि), रोचन (pickled<BR> raw fruit, Mar. कोशिंबीर), व्यञ्जन (flower boiled in butter-milk etc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवव्यूहः|नवव्यूह
नवन् + -व्यूहः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवशतम्
नवन् + -शतम्<BR>—1 one hundred and nine.<BR>—2 nine hundred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवशक्तिः|नवशक्ति
नवन् + -शक्तिः <i>m.</i> N. of Viṣṇu or Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवशक्तयः
नवन् + -शक्तयः <i>f.</i> (pl.) nine शक्तिs <i>i. e.</i> प्रभा, माया,<BR> जया, सूक्ष्मा, त्रिशुद्धा, नन्दिनी, सुप्रभा, विजया, सिद्धिदा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवशायकः|नवशायक
नवन् + -शायकः N. given to nine inferior tribes; they are:− गोपो माली<BR> तथा तैली तन्त्री मोदकवारुजी । कुलालः कर्मकारश्च नापितो नवशायकाः ॥<BR> Parāśara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवषष्टिः|नवषष्टि
नवन् + -षष्टिः <i>f.</i> sixty-nine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवसप्ततिः|नवसप्तति
नवन् + -सप्ततिः seventy-nine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवसरः|नवसर
नवन् + -सरः, -रम् a kind of ornament consisting of nine pearls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवरम्
नवन् + -सरः, -रम् a kind of ornament consisting of nine pearls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवक
नवक <i>a.</i> consisting of nine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवकम्
नवक + .{@-कम्@} The aggregate of nine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवत|नवतः
नवत <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> Ninetieth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवतः|नवत
नवत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 An elephantʼs painted housings.<BR>—2 A woollen cloth, blanket.<BR>—3 A cover, wrapper in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवतिः|नवति
नवतिः <i>f.</i> Ninety; नवनवतिशतद्रव्यकोटीश्वरास्ते Mu. 3. 27; R. 3. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नवतिका
नवतिका<BR>—1 Ninety.<BR>—2 A paint-brush (said to contain 90 hairs).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0882-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

