नागपदः|नागपद
नाग + -पदः a mode of sexual enjoyment (रतिबन्ध). पादौ स्कन्धे<BR> तथा हस्ते क्षिपेल्लिङ्गं भगे लघु । कामयेत् कामुको नारीं बन्धो नागपदो<BR> मतः ॥ Ratimañjarī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0884-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागपर्णी
नाग + -पर्णी the betel plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0884-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागपाशः|नागपाश
नाग + -पाशः<BR>—1 a sort of magical noose used in battle to entangle an enemy.<BR>—2 N. of the noose or weapon of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0884-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागपाशकः|नागपाशक
नाग + -पाशकः a kind of coitus (रतिबन्ध). स्वजङ्घाद्वयमध्यस्थां<BR> हस्ताभ्यां धारयन् कुचौ । रमेन्निःशङ्कितो नारीं बन्धोऽयं नागपाशकः ॥ Ratimañjarī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0884-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागपुरम्
नाग + -पुरम्<BR>—1 Hastināpura.<BR>—2 N. of a city in Pātāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0884-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागपुष्पः|नागपुष्प
नाग + -पुष्पः<BR>—1 the Champaka tree.<BR>—2 the Punnāga tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0884-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

