नागबन्धकः|नागबन्धक|नागबंधक
नाग + -बन्धकः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">Page0885-1</a>]<BR> an elephant-catcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0884-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

