नाग + -मल्लः an epithet of Airāvata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागमारः|नागमार
नाग + -मारः a species of pot-herb (Mar. माका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागयष्टिः|नागयष्टि
नाग + -यष्टिः <i>f.</i>, {@-यष्टिका@}<BR>—1 a graduated pole or post for showing the depth of water in a newly-dug pond.<BR>—2 a boring-rod driven into the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

