नाग + -रक्तम्, -रेणुः red lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागरङ्गः|नागरङ्ग|नागरंग
नाग + -रङ्गः the orange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागराजः|नागराज
नाग + -राजः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śeṣa.<BR>—2 a large elephant; अधस्तान्नागराजाय सोमायोर्ध्वं दिशं ददौ Hariv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागरिपुः
