नागवल्ली
नाग + -वल्लरी, -वल्ली piper betel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागवेला
नाग + -वेला the hour when a serpent-like instrument is blown; नागवेलायामागन्तव्य … ।<BR> यस्मिन् ग्रामे न नागाः … … तस्मिन्नपि स एव कालः । तत्र हि आगमनं<BR> क्रियते । ŚB. on MS. 10. 8. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागलोकः|नागलोक
नाग + -लोकः the world of serpents, the race of serpents collectively,<BR> one of the regions below the earth called Pātāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागवारिकः|नागवारिक
नाग + -वारिकः<BR>—1 a royal elephant.<BR>—2 an elephant-driver.<BR>—3 a peacock.<BR>—4 an epithet of Garuḍa.<BR>—5 the chief of a herd of elephants.<BR>—6 the chief person in an assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागवीथी
नाग + -वीथी that part of the moonʼs path which contains the asterisms<BR> अश्विनी, भरणी and कृत्तिका; अश्विनी कृत्तिका याम्या नागवीथीति शब्दिता V. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0885-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नागसंभवम्
