नार्यङ्गः The orange tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाल|नालं|नालः
नाल <i>a.</i> [नलस्येदम् अण्] Consisting or made of reeds; नालं<BR> वनं थूथपतिर्यथोन्मदः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालम्
नाल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 A hollow stalk, especially the stalk of the lotus; विकचकमलैः<BR> दीर्घवैडूर्यनालैः Me. 78; R. 6. 13; Ku. 7. 89. ━(<i>m.</i> also in this sense).<BR>—2 Any tubular vessel of the body.<BR>—3 Yellow orpiment.<BR>—4 A handle.<BR>—5 The neck; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालः|नाल|नालं
नाल + .{@-लः@} A canal, drain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालम्
नाल + .{@-लः@} + .({@-लम्, -लः@}) The navel-string.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नालास्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालः|नाल|नालं
नाल + .{@-लः@} + .({@-लम्, -लः@}) The navel-string.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नालास्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालास्त्रम्
नाल + -अस्त्रम् any tubular weapon as gun, cannon &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालम्बी
नालम्बी The lute of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाला
नाला A hollow stalk, especially that of the lotus; नालां मृणालाग्रभुजो भजामः N.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नालायन्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालायन्त्रम्
नाला + -यन्त्रम् a cannon, a gun; चयाट्टमस्तकन्यस्तनालायन्त्रसुदुर्गमे<BR> Śiva B. 9. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिः|नालि
नालिः, -ली <i>f.</i><BR> [नल्-णिच् इन् वा ङीप्]<BR>—1 Any tubular vessel of the body.<BR>—2 A hollow stalk, especially that of the lotus.<BR>—3 A period of 24 minutes (घटिका).<BR>—4 An<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">Page0890-2</a>]<BR> instrument for boring an elephantʼs ear.<BR>—5 A canal, drain.<BR>—6 A lotus flower.<BR>—7 A piece of metal on which the hours are struck (घटी).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नालिजङ्घः, नालिव्रणः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाली
नालिः, -ली <i>f.</i><BR> [नल्-णिच् इन् वा ङीप्]<BR>—1 Any tubular vessel of the body.<BR>—2 A hollow stalk, especially that of the lotus.<BR>—3 A period of 24 minutes (घटिका).<BR>—4 An<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">Page0890-2</a>]<BR> instrument for boring an elephantʼs ear.<BR>—5 A canal, drain.<BR>—6 A lotus flower.<BR>—7 A piece of metal on which the hours are struck (घटी).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नालिजङ्घः, नालिव्रणः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिजङ्घः|नालिजङ्घ
नालिः + -जङ्घः a crow, raven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिव्रणः
नालिः + -व्रणः Fistula, sinus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिकः|नालिक
नालिकः [नलमेव नालमस्त्यस्य ठन्] A buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिका
नालिकः + .{@-का@}<BR>—1 The stalk of a lotus.<BR>—2 A tube.<BR>—3 An instrument for boring an elephantʼs ear.<BR>—4 A period of 24 minutes; विषण्णालिकमुभयतो रात्रं यामतूर्यम् Kau. A.<BR> (नागरिकप्रणिधिः) or of 1½ hours; नालिकाभिरहरष्टधा रात्रिं<BR> च विभजेत् Kau. A. 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिकम्
नालिकः + .{@-कम्@} A lotus-flower.<BR>—2 A kind of wind-instrument, a flute.<BR>—3 Myrrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिकेर|नालिकेरः
नालिकेर, नालिकेलि, -ली See नारिकेर &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिकेलि
नालिकेर, नालिकेलि, -ली See नारिकेर &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिकेली
नालिकेर, नालिकेलि, -ली See नारिकेर &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालिनी
नालिनी A mystic name of one nostril; Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालीकः|नालीक
नालीकः [नाल्यां कायति कै-क Tv.]<BR>—1 An arrow; N. 2. 28; नालीका लघवो बाणा नलयन्त्रेण नोदिताः Dhanur. 74;<BR> ततो नालीकनाराचैस्तीक्ष्णाग्रैश्च विकीर्णिभिः Rām. 3. 25. 25; Śi. 19. 61.<BR>—2 A dart, javelin; कर्णिनालीकसायकैर्निहत्य Mb. 6. 95. 31.<BR>—3 A lotus.<BR>—4 The fibrous stalk of a lotus; नालीकाक्षस्य नाभीसरसि वसतु नश्चित्तहंसश्चिराय<BR> Viṣṇupāda. S. 23.<BR>—5 A water-pot (कमण्डलु) made of the cocoa-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालीकम्
नालीकः + .{@-कम्@} An assemblage of lotus-flowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालीकिनी
नालीकिनी<BR>—1 A multitude or assemblage of lotus-flowers.<BR>—2 A lotus-pond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालन्दः|नालन्द
नालन्दः A village of great historical importance, near राजगृह,<BR> a place of Buddh. monastery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नालीपः|नालीप
नालीपः = कदम्बक q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाव|नावः
नाव See नौ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाविकः|नाविक
नाविकः [नावा तरति-ठन्]<BR>—1 The helmsman of a vessel, a pilot; अख्यातिरिति ते कृष्ण मग्ना नौर्नाविके<BR> त्वयि नाविकपुरुषे न विश्वासः Mb.<BR>—2 A navigator, sailor.<BR>—3 A passenger on board a ship.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नाविकनायकः, नाविकपतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाविकनायकः|नाविकनायक
नाविकः + -नायकः, -पतिः The captain of a vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाविकपतिः|नाविकपति
नाविकः + -नायकः, -पतिः The captain of a vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाविन्
नाविन् <i>m.</i> A boatman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाव्य|नाव्यं
नाव्य <i>a.</i> [नावा तार्यं नौ-यत्]<BR>—1 Accessible by a boat or ship, navigable (as a river &c.); नाव्याः<BR> सुप्रतरा नदीः R. 4. 31; नाव्यं पयः केचिदतारिषुर्भुजैः Śi. 12. 76.<BR>—2 Praiseworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाव्यम्
नाव्य + .{@-व्यम्@} Newness, novelty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाव्या
नाव्य + .{@-व्या@} Ved. A navigable river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नावनम्
नावनम् A sternutatory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नावनीत
नावनीत (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Coming from butter.<BR>—2 Mild, soft, gentle; नावनीतं हि हृदयं विप्राणां शाम्य भार्गव<BR> Mb. 5. 185. 29. ━<i>n.</i> Ghee recently prepared out of butter; नावनीतेन<BR> भुङ्क्ते इत्यचिरनिर्दग्धेनेति गम्यते । ŚB. on MS. 1. 4. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नावमिक
नावमिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Ninth; ततश्च द्वादशे मासे चैत्रे नावमिके तिथौ<BR> Rām. 1. 18. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशः|नाश
नाशः [नश्-भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Disappearance; गता नाशं तारा उपकृतमसाधाविव जने Mk. 5. 25.<BR>—2 Frustration, destruction,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">Page0891-1</a>]<BR> ruin, loss; नेहाभिक्रमनाशोऽस्ति Bg. 2. 40; R. 8. 88, 12. 67; so वित्त˚, बुद्धि˚ &c.<BR>—3 Death.<BR>—4 Misfortune, calamity.<BR>—5 Abandonment, desertion.<BR>—6 Flight, retreat.<BR>—7 (In arith.) Elimination.<BR>—8 Want of apprehension, non-perception (अनुपलम्भ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0890-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशक
नाशक <i>a.</i> [नश्-णिच्-ण्वुल्] Destructive, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशन
नाशन <i>a.</i> [नश्-णिच्-ल्यु]<BR>.(-नी <i>f.</i>) Destroying, causing to perish, removing (in comp.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशनम्
नाशन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Destruction, ruin.<BR>—2 Removing, removal, expulsion.<BR>—4 Perishing, death.<BR>—5 Forgetting; अधीतस्य च नाशनम् Y. 3. 228.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशित
नाशित <i>p. p.</i> Destroyed, ruined, made to perish, lost.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नाशितसंग्रहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशितसंग्रहः|नाशितसङ्ग्रह
नाशित + -संग्रहः intercourse with an outcast; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाशिन्
नाशिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [नश्-णिनि]<BR>—1 Destructive, destroying, removing.<BR>—2 Perishing, perishable; अन्तवन्त इमे देहा … अनाशिनः Bg. 2. 18;<BR> Ms. 8. 185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाश्य
नाश्य <i>a.</i> Destructible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाष्टिकः|नाष्टिक
नाष्टिकः The owner of anything lost; नाष्टिको लभते धनम् Ms. 8. 202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नाष्ट्रा
नाष्ट्रा Ved.<BR>—1 Danger, destruction.<BR>—2 An evil spirit, a goblin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नास्
नास् €1 Ā. (नासते) To Sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासत्या
नासत्या The constellation अश्विनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासत्यौ
नासत्यौ <i>m.</i> (du.) Aśvins, the twin physicians of gods; तौ नासत्यावश्विनौ<BR> वां महेऽहम् Mb. 1. 3. 66; Bhāg. 9. 3. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नासत्यौयुग<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासत्यौयुग
नासत्यौ + -युग<BR>—1 the Satya yuga<BR>—2 the two Aśvins; N. 10. 45, 17. 146.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासा
नासा [नास्-भावे अ]<BR>—1 The nose; स्फुरदधरनासापुटतया U. 1. 29; प्राणापानौ समौ कृत्वा<BR> नासाभ्यन्तरचारिणौ Bg. 5. 27.<BR>—2 The trunk of an elephant.<BR>—3 The upper timber of a door.<BR>—4 A sound.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नासाग्रम्, नासान्तिक, नासाच्छिद्रम्, नासारन्ध्रम्, नासाविवरम्, नासाविरोकः, नासाच्छिन्नी, नासादक्षिणावर्तः, नासादारुः, नासानाहः, नासापरिस्रावः, नासापुटः, नासापुटम्, नासावंशः, नासावामावर्तः, नासावेधः, नासास्रावः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासाग्रम्
नासा + -अग्रम् the tip of the nose; त्रासान्नासाग्ररन्ध्रं विशति फणिपतौ Māl. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासान्तिक
नासा + -अन्तिक <i>a.</i> reaching to the nose (a stick); स्यात्तु नासान्तिको<BR> विशः (दण्डः) Ms. 2. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

