नासानाहः|नासानाह
नासा + -नाहः the thickening of the membrane of the nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नासापरिस्रावः|नासापरिस्राव
नासा + -परिस्रावः running at the nose, a running cold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

