नासिका
नासिका [नास्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 The nose; see नासा.<BR>—2 Any nose-shaped object.<BR>—3 The trunk of an elephant.<BR>—4 The upper timber of a door.<BR>—5 A projection.<BR>—6 An epithet of the nymph Aśvinī.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नासिकामलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

