नासिक्यकम्
नासिक्यकम् The nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0891-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नास्यम्
