निःक्षिप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Thrown or sent away.<BR>—2 Passed, spent (as time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0892-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

