निःक्षेपः<BR>—1 Throwing, sending away.<BR>—2 Spending (time).<BR>—3 Wiping (tears).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0892-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःशङ्क
