निःशङ्कम्
निःशङ्क + .{@-ङ्कम्@} <i>ind.</i> Fearlessly, easily; निःशङ्कं दीयते लोकैः पश्य<BR> भस्मचये पदम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0892-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःशब्द|निःशब्दः
निःशब्द <i>a.</i> Noiseless, silent, still,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0892-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःशलाक|निःशलाकः
