निःश्रेयसम्
निःश्रेयसम् [निश्चितं श्रेयः नि˚]<BR>—1 Final beatitude, absolution; स स्थाणुः स्थिरभक्तियोगसुलभो निःश्रेयसायास्तु<BR> वः V. 1. 1; समुत्कर्षनिःश्रेयसस्यैकमुग्रं परं साधनं नाम वीरव्रतम्<BR> Subhāṣ.; Ki. 11. 19.<BR>—2 Happiness; Ms. 1. 106.<BR>—3 Faith, belief.<BR>—4 Apprehension, conception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0892-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःश्वस्
निःश्वस् (often written निश्वस्) €2 P.<BR>—1 To sigh, heave a sigh of grief, pant.<BR>—2 To hiss (as a serpent).<BR>—3 To snort (as an elephant).<BR>—4 To breathe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0892-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

