निःसत्त्व
निःसत्त्व <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unsubstantial.<BR>—2 Weak, impotent.<BR>—3 Wretched, miserable.<BR>—4 Insignificant, mean, low.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0892-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

