निःसंबाध
निःसंबाध <i>a.</i> Solitary, lonely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0892-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसह
निःसह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unable to bear, resist or suffer, impatient.<BR>—2 Powerless, unnerved, spiritless, languid, fatigued; अयि विरम निःसहासि<BR> जाता Māl. 3, 2, 7; U. 3.<BR>—3 Intolerable, unbearable, irresistible (in a passive sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0892-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

