निःसारणम्
निःसारणम्<BR>—1 Expelling, driving or turning out.<BR>—2 The outlet from a house, ingress or egress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0892-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निःसारित|निःसारितः
