निमित्तपरीष्टि
निमित्तम् + -परीष्टि <i>f.</i> scrutiny of the means (of knowing); तस्य निमित्तपरीष्टिः MS. 1. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमित्तमात्रम्
निमित्तम् + -मात्रम् the mere efficient cause or instrument; Bg. 11. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमित्तविद्
निमित्तम् + -विद् <i>a.</i> knowing good or bad omens. ━(<i>m.</i>) an astrologer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमित्तकम्
निमित्तकम्<BR>—1 A cause.<BR>—2 Kissing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमित्तिन्
निमित्तिन् <i>a.</i> Having a cause, influenced by (some cause or ground).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमिश्ल
निमिश्ल <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Commingling, mixing with.<BR>—2 Devoted to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमिष्
निमिष् €6 P. To shut the eyes; wink, twinkle; Bg. 5. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमिष्
निमिष् <i>f.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Twinkling of the eye.<BR>—2 Shutting the eyes. ━<i>m.</i> A god.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमिषः|निमिष
निमिषः<BR>—1 winking, shutting the eye, twinkling.<BR>—2 Twinkling of the eye as a measure of time, a moment.<BR>—3 The shutting of flowers.<BR>—4 Morbid twinkling of the eye.<BR>—5 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निमिषान्तरम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमिषान्तरम्
निमिषः + -अन्तरम् the interval of a moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमेषः|निमेष
निमेषः Twinkling of the eye, a moment &c.; see निमिष; हरति<BR> निमेषात् कालः सर्वम् Moha M. 4; अनिमेषेण चक्षुषा ‘with a steadfast or fixed look’<BR>; R. 2. 19, 3. 43, 61; Bṛ. Up. 3. 8. 9.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निमेषान्तरम्, निमेषकृत्, निमेषद्युत्, निमेषरुच्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमेषान्तरम्
निमेषः + -अन्तरम् the interval of a moment. ˚चारिन् going in a moment<BR> anywhere; प्रययौ सहितः सर्वैर्निमेषान्तरचारिभिः Mb. 5. 192. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमेषकृत्
