निमेषद्युत्
निमेषः + -द्युत्, -रुच् <i>m.</i> a fire-fly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमेषरुच्
निमेषः + -द्युत्, -रुच् <i>m.</i> a fire-fly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमेषकः|निमेषक
निमेषकः<BR>—1 Twinkling of the eye.<BR>—2 A fire-fly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमेषणम्
निमेषणम् Shutting the eyes, twinkling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमील्
निमील् €1 P.<BR>—1 To shut the eyes; यदा स्वपिति शान्तात्मा तदा सर्वं निमीलति Ms. 1. 52;<BR> R. 12. 65.<BR>—2 To close the eyes in death, die; निमिमील नरोत्तमप्रिया हृतचन्द्रा<BR> तमसेव कौमुदी R. 8. 37.<BR>—3 To obscure (fig.); प्रजालोपनिमीलितः R. 1. 68.<BR>—4 To be closed or shut, (as eyes, flowers &c.); निमीलितानामिव पङ्कजानाम्.<BR>—5 To disappear, vanish, set (fig. also); नरेशे जीवलोकोऽयं निमीलति<BR> निमीलति H. 3. 138; द्यौर्निमीलितनक्षत्रा Hariv. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To shut, close; उन्मीलितापि दृष्टिर्निमीलितेवान्धकारेण Mk. 1. 33;<BR> न्यमिमीलदब्जनयनं नलिनी Śi. 9. 11; लीलापद्मं न्यमीलयत्<BR> Kāv. 2. 261; Ku. 3. 36, 5. 57; R. 19. 28.<BR>—2 To kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीलनम्
निमीलनम्<BR>—1 Shutting the eyelids, winking; नयननिमीलनखिन्नया यया ते Gīt. 4; Amaru. 33.<BR>—2 Closing the eyes in death, death.<BR>—3 (In astr.) Total eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीला
निमीला, निमीलिका<BR>—1 Shutting the eyes.<BR>—2 Winking, blinking, conniving at anything.<BR>—3 Fraud, pretence, trick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीलिका
निमीला, निमीलिका<BR>—1 Shutting the eyes.<BR>—2 Winking, blinking, conniving at anything.<BR>—3 Fraud, pretence, trick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीलित
निमीलित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Shut, closed.<BR>—2 Obscured, darkened; अपथे पदमर्पयन्ति हि श्रुतवन्तोऽपि रजोनिमीलिताः R. 9. 74.<BR>—3 Benumbed, stupefied.<BR>—4 Disappeared, set.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमीश्वरः|निमीश्वर
निमीश्वरः N. of a Jineśvara born in the last उत्सर्पिणीकाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमूलम्
निमूलम् <i>ind.</i> Down to the root; निमूलकाषं कषति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निमेयः|निमेय
निमेयः Barter, exchange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्न|निम्नं
निम्न <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Deep (lit. and fig.); चकितहरिणीप्रेक्षणा निम्ननाभिः Me. 84;<BR> Ṛs. 5. 12; Śi. 10. 58.<BR>—2 Low, depressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्न|निम्नं
निम्न + .{@-म्नम्^1@}<BR>—1 Depth, low ground, low land; (कः) पयश्च<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">Page0904-1</a>]<BR> निम्नाभिमुखं प्रतीपयेत् Ku. 5. 5; न च निम्नादिव सलिलं निवर्तते<BR> मे ततो हृदयम् Ś. 3. 2 (v. l.); Y. 2. 151; Ṛs. 2. 13.<BR>—2 A slope, declivity.<BR>—3 A gap, chasm in the ground; यो नेमिनिम्नैरकरोच्छायां ध्नन् सप्त वारिधीन्<BR> Bhāg. 5. 1. 39.<BR>—4 A depression, low part; जलनिबिडितवस्त्रव्यक्तनिम्नोन्नताभिः Māl. 4. 10.<BR>—5 A mean act (हीनकर्म); निम्नेष्वीहां करिष्यन्ति हेतुवादविमोहिताः<BR> Mb. 3. 190. 26.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निम्नाभिमुख, निम्नोन्नत, निम्नगतम्, निम्नगा, निम्ननाभि<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260628. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/279.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0903-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्नाभिमुख
निम्न + -अभिमुख <i>a.</i> flowing downwards; क ईप्सितार्थस्थिरनिश्चयं<BR> मनः पयश्च निम्नाभिमुखं प्रतीपयेत् Ku. 5. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्नोन्नत
निम्न + -उन्नत <i>a.</i> low and high, depressed and elevated, uneven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्नगतम्
निम्न + -गतम् a low place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्नगा
निम्न + -गा a river, a mountain-stream; उदघेरिव निम्नगाशतेष्वभवन्नास्य<BR> विमानना क्वचित् R. 8. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्ननाभि
निम्न + -नाभि <i>a.</i> slender, thin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्नित
निम्नित <i>a.</i>^1 Deep, sunk; निम्नितोदरम् Mb. 7. 156. 64.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्ब्
निम्ब् €1 P. (निम्बति) To sprinkle, to water; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्बः|निम्ब|निंब|निंबः
निम्बः<BR>—1 A tree with bitter fruits; आम्रं छित्वा कुठारेण निम्बं परिचरेत्तु<BR> यः यश्चैनं पयसा सिञ्चेन्नैवास्य मधुरो भवेत् ॥ Rām.<BR>—2 N. of a tree, Pāribhadra; निम्बस्तु पिचुमन्दे च पारिभद्रतरावपि<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निम्बार्कः, निम्बादित्यः, निम्बतरुः, निम्बपञ्चकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्बार्कः|निम्बार्क
निम्बः + -अर्कः, -आदित्यः N. of the founder of a Vaiṣṇava sect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निम्बादित्यः|निम्बादित्य
