निम्बतरुः|निम्बतरु
निम्बः + -तरुः<BR>—1 the Mandāra tree.<BR>—2 the Nimba tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0904-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

