page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरंश
निर् + -अंश <i>a.</i><BR>—1 whole, entire.<BR>—2 not entitled to any share of the ancestral property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरक्षः|निरक्ष
निर् + -अक्षः the place of no latitute; <i>i. e.</i> the terrestrial equator<BR> (in astronomy). ˚देशः<BR>—1 a first meridian, as Laṅkā.<BR>—2 a place where the sun is always vertical and the days and nights are equal.<BR>—3 the equatorial region.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरक्षर
निर् + -अक्षर <i>a.</i> Not knowing the letters, illiterate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरग्नि
निर् + -अग्नि <i>a.</i> having lost or neglected the consecrated fire; स<BR> संन्यासी च योगी च न निरग्निर्न चाक्रियः Bg. 6. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरग्र
निर् + -अग्र, -अग्रक <i>a.</i> divisible without remainder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरग्रक
निर् + -अग्र, -अग्रक <i>a.</i> divisible without remainder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरङ्कुश|निरंकुश|निरङ्कुशः
निर् + -अङ्कुश <i>a.</i> ‘not curbed by a hook’, urchecked, uncontrolled,<BR> unruly, independent, completely free, unfettered; निरङ्कुश इव द्विपः<BR> Bhāg.; कामो निकामनिरङ्कुशः Gīt. 7; निरङ्कुशाः कवयः Sk.;<BR> Bh. 3. 105; Mv. 3. 39; विनयरुचयः सदैव निरङ्कुशाः Mu. 3. 6. ˚ता<BR> self-will, independence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरघ
निर् + -अघ <i>a.</i> sinless, blameless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरङ्ग|निरंग
निर् + -अङ्ग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having no parts.<BR>—2 deprived of expedients or resources.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरजिन
निर् + -अजिन <i>a.</i> skinless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरञ्जन|निरंजन|निरञ्जनः
निर् + -अञ्जन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without collyrium; निरञ्जने साचिविलोलिकं दृशौ Ki. 8. 52.<BR>—2 unstained, untinged.<BR>—3 free from falsehood; तदा विद्वान् पुण्यपापे विधूय निरञ्जनं परमं<BR> साम्यमुपैति Muṇḍ. 3. 1. 3.<BR>—4 simple, artless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरञ्जनः|निरञ्जन|निरंजन
निर् + -अञ्जन + .({@-नः@})<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 N. of the Supreme Being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरञ्जना
निर् + -अञ्जन + .({@-ना@})<BR>—1 the day of full moon.<BR>—2 an epithet<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">Page0906-2</a>]<BR> of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरतिशय|निरतिशयः
निर् + -अतिशय <i>a.</i> unsurpassed, matchless, unrivalled; निरतिशयं<BR> गरिमाणं तेन जनन्याः स्मरन्ति विद्वांसः Pt. 1. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरतिशयः|निरतिशय
निर् + -अतिशय + .({@-यः@}) the Supreme Being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरत्यय
निर् + -अत्यय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from danger, secure, safe; तद्भवान् वृत्तसंपन्नः स्थितः पथि<BR> निरत्यये Rām. 4. 29. 12; R. 17. 53.<BR>—2 free from fault, unblamable, faultless, disinterested; Ki. 1. 12, शक्तिरर्थपतिषु<BR> स्वयंग्रहं प्रेम कारयति वा निरत्ययम् 13. 61.<BR>—3 completely successful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरधिष्ठान
निर् + -अधिष्ठान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 supportless.<BR>—2 independent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरध्व
निर् + -अध्व <i>a.</i> one who has lost oneʼs way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरनुक्रोश|निरनुक्रोशः
निर् + -अनुक्रोश <i>a.</i> pitiless, merciless, hard-hearted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरनुक्रोशः|निरनुक्रोश
निर् + -अनुक्रोश + .({@-शः@}) mercilessness, hard-heartedness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरनुग
निर् + -अनुग <i>a.</i> having no followers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरनुग्रह
निर् + -अनुग्रह <i>a.</i> Ungracious, unkind; Bhāg. 5. 12. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरनुनासिक
निर् + -अनुनासिक <i>a.</i> not nasal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरनुमान
निर् + -अनुमान <i>a.</i> not bound to conclusions or consequences.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरनुयोज्य
निर् + -अनुयोज्य <i>a.</i> unblamable, faultless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरनुरोध
निर् + -अनुरोध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unfavourable, unfriendly.<BR>—2 unkind, unamiable; Māl. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरन्तर|निरंतर|निरन्तरं
निर् + -अन्तर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 constant, perpetual, uninterrupted, incessant; निरन्तराधिपटलैः<BR> Bv. 1. 16; निरन्तरास्वन्तरवातवृष्टिषु Ku. 5. 25.<BR>—2 having no intervening or intermediate space, having no interval, close,<BR> closely contiguous, in close contact; मूढे निरन्तरपयोधरया मयैव<BR> Mk. 5. 15; हृदयं निरन्तरबृहत्कठिनस्तनमण्डलावरणमप्यभिदन् Śi. 9. 66.<BR>—3 compact, dense; परितो रुद्धनिरन्तराम्बराः Śi. 16. 76.<BR>—4 coarse, gross.<BR>—5 faithful, true (as a friend).<BR>—6 not hidden from view.<BR>—7 not different, similar, identical.<BR>—8 sincere, sympathetic; सुहृदि निरन्तरचित्ते (निवेद्य दुःखं सुखीभवति) Pt. 1. 341.<BR>—9 abounding in, full of; निपात्यमानैर्ददृशे निरन्तरम् Rām. 7. 7. 54;<BR> गुणैश्च निरन्तराणि Mv. 4. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरन्तरम्|निरंतरम्
निर् + -अन्तर + .({@-रम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 without interruption, constantly, continually, incessantly.<BR>—2 without intervening space or interval.<BR>—3 closely, tightly, firmly; (परिष्वजस्व) कान्तैरिदं मम निरन्तरमङ्गमङ्गैः<BR> Ve. 3. 27; परिष्वजेते शयने निरन्तरम् Ṛs. 2. 11.<BR>—4 immediately. ˚अभ्यासः constant study, diligent exercise or practice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरन्तराल|निरंतराल
निर् + -अन्तराल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without an intervening space, close.<BR>—2 narrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरन्धस्
निर् + -अन्धस् <i>a.</i> foodless, hungry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरन्वय
निर् + -अन्वय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having no progeny, childless.<BR>—2 unconnected, unrelated; Ms. 8. 198.<BR>—3 not agreeing with the context (as a word in a sentence).<BR>—4 without logical connection or regular sequence, unmethodical.<BR>—5 without being seen, out of sight; निरन्वयं भवेत् स्तेयम् Ms. 8. 332.<BR>—6 without retinue, unaccompanied, see अन्वय.<BR>—7 sudden, unexpected; U. 7.<BR>—8 exterminatory, without leaving any species or trace; प्रागाधारनिरन्वयप्रमथनादुच्छेदमेवाकरोः<BR> Mv. 3. 13; (com. नाशो द्विविधः -स्वान्वयविनाशः, निरन्वयविनाशश्चेति … निर्वापणादिना<BR> सजातीयज्वालोदयानर्हविनाशस्तु निरन्वयविनाशः ।).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरपत्रप|निरपत्रपः
निर् + -अपत्रप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 shameless, impudent.<BR>—2 bold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरपराध|निरपराधः
निर् + -अपराध <i>a.</i> guiltless, innocent, faultless, blameless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरपराधः|निरपराध
निर् + -अपराध + .({@-धः@}) innocence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरपवर्त|निरपवर्त्त
निर् + -अपवर्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not turning back.<BR>—2 (in arith.) leaving no common divisor, reduced to the lowest terms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरपवाद
निर् + -अपवाद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 blameless.<BR>—2 not admitting of any exception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरपाय
निर् + -अपाय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from harm or evil.<BR>—2 free from decay, imperishable.<BR>—3 infallible; उपायो निरपायोऽयमस्माभिरभिचिन्तितः Rām. 1. 10. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरपेक्ष|निरपेक्षः
निर् + -अपेक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not depending on, irrespective or independent<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">Page0907-1</a>]<BR> of, having no need of (with loc.); न्यायनिर्णीतसारत्वान्निरपेक्षमिवागमे Ki. 11. 39.<BR>—2 disregarding, taking no notice of.<BR>—3 free from desire, secure; निरपेक्षो न कर्तव्यो भृत्यैः स्वामी कदाचन H. 2. 82.<BR>—4 careless, negligent, indifferent<BR>—5 indifferent to worldly attachments or pursuits; समुपोढेषु कामेषु<BR> निरपेक्षः परिव्रजेत् Ms. 6. 41.<BR>—6 disinterested, not expecting any reward from another; दिशि दिशि निरपेक्षस्तावकीनं<BR> विवृण्वन् Bv. 1. 5.<BR>—7 without purpose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरपेक्षा
निर् + -अपेक्ष + .({@-क्षा@}) indifference, disregard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0906-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरपेक्षित
निर् + -अपेक्षित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 disregarded.<BR>—2 regardless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरपेक्षिन्
निर् + -अपेक्षिन् <i>a.</i> disregarding, indifferent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरभिभव
निर् + -अभिभव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not subject to humiliation or disgrace.<BR>—2 not to be surpassed, unrivalled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरभिमान
निर् + -अभिमान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from self-conceit, devoid of pride or egotism.<BR>—2 void of self-respect.<BR>—3 unconscious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरभिलाष
निर् + -अभिलाष <i>a.</i> not caring for, indifferent to; स्वसुखनिरभिलाषः<BR> खिद्यसे लोकहेतोः Ś. 5. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरभिसंधानम्
निर् + -अभिसंधानम् absence of design.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरभ्र
निर् + -अभ्र <i>a.</i> cloudless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरमर्ष
निर् + -अमर्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 void of anger, patient.<BR>—2 apathetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरम्बर
निर् + -अम्बर <i>a.</i> naked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरम्बु|निरंबु
निर् + -अम्बु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 abstaining from water.<BR>—2 waterless, destitute of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरर्गल|निरर्गलः
निर् + -अर्गल <i>a.</i> without a bolt, unbarred, unobstructed, unrestrained,<BR> unimpeded, completely free; M. 5; मरणसमये त्यक्त्वा शङ्कां प्रलापनिरर्गलम् Māl. 5. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरर्गलम्
निर् + -अर्गल + .({@-लम्@}) <i>ind.</i> freely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरर्थ|निरर्थः
निर् + -अर्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 void of wealth, poor, indigent; स्त्रियः कृतार्थाः पुरुषं निरर्थं<BR> निष्पीडितालक्तकवत्त्यजन्ति Pt. 1. 194.<BR>—2 meaningless, unmeaning (as a word or sentence).<BR>—3 non-sensical.<BR>—4 vain, useless, purposeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरर्थः|निरर्थ
निर् + -अर्थ + .({@-र्थः@})<BR>—1 loss, detriment.<BR>—2 nonsense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरर्थक|निरर्थकं
निर् + -अर्थक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 useless, vain, unprofitable.<BR>—2 unmeaning, nonsensical, conveying no reasonable meaning; इत्थं जन्म<BR> निरर्थकं क्षितितलेऽरण्ये यथा मालती S. D.<BR>—3 (a consonant) not followed by a vowel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरर्थकम्
निर् + -अर्थक + .({@-कम्@}) an expletive; निरर्थकं तु हीत्यादि पूरणैकप्रयोजनम् Candr. 2. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरलंकृतिः|निरलङ्कृति
निर् + -अलंकृतिः (in Rhet.) want of ornament, simplicity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवकाश
निर् + -अवकाश <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without free space.<BR>—2 without leisure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवग्रह|निरवग्रहः
निर् + -अवग्रह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 ‘free from restraint’, unrestrained, unchecked, uncontrolled, irresistible.<BR>—2 free, independent.<BR>—3 self-willed, head-strong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवग्रहम्
निर् + -अवग्रह + .({@-हम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 uninterruptedly.<BR>—2 intensely, strongly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवद्य
निर् + -अवद्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 blameless, faultless, unblameable, unobjectionable; हृद्यनिरवद्यरूपो<BR> भूपो बभूव Dk. 1. 2 an epithet of the Supreme Being (having no passions).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवधि
निर् + -अवधि <i>a.</i> having no end, unlimited; कथं तूष्णीं सह्यो निरवधिरयं<BR> त्वप्रतिविधः U. 3. 44, 6. 30; Māl. 1. 6.<BR>—2 continuous; महानाधिव्याधिर्निरवधिरिदानीं प्रसरतु Māl. 4. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवयव
निर् + -अवयव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without parts.<BR>—2 indivisible.<BR>—3 without limbs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवलम्ब|निरवलंब
निर् + -अवलम्ब <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unsupported, without support; Ś. 6.<BR>—2 not affording support.<BR>—3 not depending or relying on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवशेष
निर् + -अवशेष <i>a.</i> whole, complete, entire, (निरवशेषेण <i>ind.</i><BR> completely, entirely, fully, totally).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवसाद
निर् + -अवसाद <i>a.</i> cheerful; Gīt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरव्यय
निर् + -अव्यय <i>a.</i> eternal, immutable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरशन|निरशनं
निर् + -अशन <i>a.</i> abstaining from food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरशनम्
निर् + -अशन + .({@-नम्@}) fasting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरश्रि
निर् + -अश्रि <i>a.</i> even; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरष्ट|निरष्टः
निर् + -अष्ट <i>a.</i> Ved. driven away, scattered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरष्टः|निरष्ट
निर् + -अष्ट + .({@-ष्टः@}) a horse twenty-four years old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरस्त्र
निर् + -अस्त्र <i>a.</i> weaponless, unarmed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरस्थि
निर् + -अस्थि <i>a.</i> boneless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरहंकार|निरहङ्कार
निर् + -अहंकार, -अहंकृति <i>a.</i> free from egotism or pride, humble,<BR> lowly; Bg. 12. 13.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">Page0907-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरहंकृति|निरहङ्कृति
निर् + -अहंकार, -अहंकृति <i>a.</i> free from egotism or pride, humble,<BR> lowly; Bg. 12. 13.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">Page0907-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरहंकृत
निर् + -अहंकृत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having no egotism or self-consciousness.<BR>—2 without individuality.<BR>—3 unselfish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरहम्
निर् + -अहम् <i>ind.^1</i> free from egotism or self-conceit; ह्यनामरूपं<BR> निरहं प्रपद्ये Bhāg. 5. 19. 4.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/41b120c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकाङ्क्ष|निराकांक्ष
निर् + -आकाङ्क्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 wishing nothing, free from desire.<BR>—2 wanting nothing to fill up or complete (as the sense of a word or sentence).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकार|निराकारः
निर् + -आकार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 devoid of form, formless, without form.<BR>—2 ugly, deformed.<BR>—3 disguised.<BR>—4 unassuming, modest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकारः|निराकार
निर् + -आकार + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 the universal spirit, Almighty.<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—3 of Viṣṇu. ˚ज्ञानवादः the doctrine that the perception of the<BR> outer world does not arise from images impressed on the mind; Sarva. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकृति|निराकृतिः
निर् + -आकृति <i>a.</i><BR>—1 formless, shapeless.<BR>—2 deformed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकृतिः|निराकृति
निर् + -आकृति + .({@-तिः@})<BR>—1 a religious student who has not duly gone through a course of study,<BR> or who has not properly read the Vedas.<BR>—2 especially, a Brāhmaṇa who has neglected the duties of his caste<BR> by not going through a regular course of study; a fool; ग्रामधान्यं यथा<BR> शून्यं यथा कूपश्च निर्जलः । यथा हुतमनग्नौ च तथैव स्यान्निराकृतौ ॥<BR> Mb. 12. 36. 48.<BR>—3 one who neglects the five great religious duties or yajñas; Ms. 3. 154.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकाश
निर् + -आकाश <i>a.</i> leaving no free space, completely filled or occupied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकुल
निर् + -आकुल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unconfused, unperplexed, unbewildered; Ki. 11. 38.<BR>—2 steady, calm; सुपात्रनिक्षेपनिराकुलात्मना (प्रजासृजा) Śi. 1. 28.<BR>—3 clear.<BR>—4 perspicuous; अलिकुलसङ्कुलकुसुमसमूहनिराकुलबकुलकलापे Gīt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकुलम्
निर् + -आकुल + .({@-लम्@})<BR>—1 calmness serenity.<BR>—2 perspicuity, clearness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराक्रन्द|निराक्रन्दः
निर् + -आक्रन्द <i>a.</i> not crying or complaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराक्रन्दः|निराक्रन्द
निर् + -आक्रन्द + .({@-दः@}) a place where no sound can be heard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराक्रोश
निर् + -आक्रोश <i>a.</i> unaccused, unreviled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरागम
निर् + -आगम <i>a.</i> not founded on revelation or scripture, not derived<BR> from the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरागस्
निर् + -आगस् <i>a.</i> faultless, innocent, sinless; कथमेकपदे निरागसं<BR> जनमाभाष्यमिमं न मन्यसे R. 8. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराचार|निराचारः
निर् + -आचार <i>a.</i> without approved customs or usages, lawless, barbarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराडम्बर|निराडंबर
निर् + -आडम्बर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without drums. —2 without show, unostentatious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरातङ्क|निरातंक|निरातङ्कः
निर् + -आतङ्क <i>a.</i> —1 free from fear; R. 1. 63; निरातङ्को रङ्को<BR> विहरति चिरं कोटिकनकैः Śaṅkara. (देव्यपराधक्षमापनस्तोत्रम् 6).<BR>—2 without ailment, comfortable, healthy.<BR>—3 not causing pain.<BR>—4 unchecked, unhampered; निरातङ्कः पङ्केष्विव पिशितपिण्डेषु विलसन् Māl. 5. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरातङ्कः|निरातङ्क|निरातंक
निर् + -आतङ्क + .({@-कः@}) an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरातप
निर् + -आतप <i>a.</i> sheltered from heat, shady, not penetrated by the sunʼs rays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरातपा
निर् + -आतप + .({@-पा@}) the night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरादर
निर् + -आदर <i>a.</i> disrespectful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरादान
निर् + -आदान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 taking or receiving nothing; Mb. 3.<BR>—2 an epithet of Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराधार
निर् + -आधार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without a receptacle.<BR>—2 without support, supportless (fig. also); निराधारो हा रोदिमि कथय<BR> केषामिह पुरः G. L. 4, 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराधि
निर् + -आधि <i>a.</i> secure, free from anxiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरानन्द
निर् + -आनन्द <i>a.</i> cheerless, sad, sorrowful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरान्त्र
निर् + -आन्त्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 disembowelled.<BR>—2 having the entrails hanging out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरापद्
निर् + -आपद् <i>a.</i> free from misfortune or calamity. ━(<i>f.</i>) prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराबाध|निराबाधः
निर् + -आबाध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unvexed, unmolested, undisturbed, free from disturbance.<BR>—2 unobstructed.<BR>—3 not molesting or disturbing.<BR>—4 (in law) frivolously vexatious (as a suit or cause of complaint); <i>e. g.</i><BR> अस्मद्गृहप्रदीपप्रकाशेनायं स्वगृहे व्यवहरति Mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरामय|निरामयः
निर् + -आमय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from disease or illness, sound, healthy, hale.<BR>—2 untainted,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">Page0908-1</a>]<BR> pure.<BR>—3 guileless.<BR>—4 free from defects or blemishes.<BR>—5 full, complete.<BR>—6 infallible.<BR>—7 not liable to failure or miscarriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरामयः|निरामय
निर् + -आमय + .({@-यः, -यम्@}) freedom from disease or illness, health, well-being,<BR> welfare, happiness; कुरूणां पाण्डवानां च प्रतिपत्स्व निरामयम् Mb. 5. 78. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरामयम्
निर् + -आमय + .({@-यः, -यम्@}) freedom from disease or illness, health, well-being,<BR> welfare, happiness; कुरूणां पाण्डवानां च प्रतिपत्स्व निरामयम् Mb. 5. 78. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरामयः|निरामय
निर् + -आमय + .({@-यः@})<BR>—1 a wild goat.<BR>—2 a hog or boar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0907-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरामिष
निर् + -आमिष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fleshless; निरुपमरसप्रीत्या खादन्नरास्थि निरामिषम् Bh.<BR>—2 having no sensual desires or covetousness; Ms. 6. 49.<BR>—3 receiving no wages or remuneration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराय|निरायः
निर् + -आय <i>a.</i> yielding no income or revenue, profitless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरायः|निराय
निर् + -आयः an idler living from hand to mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरायत
निर् + -आयत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 full-stretched or extended; निरायतपूर्वकायाः Ś. 1. 8.<BR>—2 contracted, compact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरायतत्वम्
निर् + -आयतत्वम् shortness, compactness; निरायतत्वादुदरेण ताम्यता Ki. 8. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरायति
निर् + -आयति <i>a.</i> one whose end is at hand; नियता लघुता निरायतेः Ki. 2. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरायास
निर् + -आयास <i>a.</i> not fatiguing, easy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरायुध
निर् + -आयुध <i>a.</i> unarmed, weaponless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरारम्भ
निर् + -आरम्भ <i>a.</i> abstaining from all work (in good sense); Mb. 3. 82. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरालम्ब|निरालंब
निर् + -आलम्ब <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having no prop or support (fig. also); ऊर्ध्वबाहुं निरालम्बं तं<BR> राजा प्रत्यभाषत Rām. 7. 89. 10; निरालम्बो लोकः कुलमयशसा नः<BR> परिवृतम् Mv. 4. 53.<BR>—2 not depending on another, independent.<BR>—3 self-supported, friendless, alone; निरालम्बो लम्बोदरजननि कं<BR> यामि शरणम् Jag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरालम्बा
निर् + -आलम्ब + .({@-म्बा@}) spikenard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरालम्बम्
निर् + -आलम्ब + .({@-म्बम्@}) Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरालोक|निरालोकः
निर् + -आलोक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not looking about or seeing.<BR>—2 deprived of sight.<BR>—3 deprived of light, dark; निरालोकं लोकम् Māl. 5. 30; Bhāg. 8. 24. 35.<BR>—5 invisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरालोकः|निरालोक
निर् + -आलोक + .({@-कः@}) an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरावर्ण
निर् + -आवर्ण <i>a.</i> manifest, evident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराश|निराशः
निर् + -आश <i>a.</i><BR>—1 devoid of hope, despairing or despondent of; मनो बभूवेन्दुमतीनिराशम् R. 6. 2.<BR>—2 depriving (one) of all hope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराशक
निर् + -आशक, -आशिन् <i>a.</i> hopeless; अद्य दुर्योधनो राज्याज्जीविताच्च<BR> निराशकः (भविष्यति) Mb. 8. 74. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराशिन्
निर् + -आशक, -आशिन् <i>a.</i> hopeless; अद्य दुर्योधनो राज्याज्जीविताच्च<BR> निराशकः (भविष्यति) Mb. 8. 74. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराशङ्क|निराशंक
निर् + -आशङ्क <i>a.</i> fearless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराशा
निर् + -आशा hopelessness, despair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराशिस्
निर् + -आशिस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without a boon or blessing, without virtues; आश्रमा विहिताः सर्वे<BR> वर्जयित्वा निराशिषम् Mb. 12. 63. 13.<BR>—2 without any desire, wish or hope, indifferent; निराशीर्यतचित्तात्मा<BR> Bg. 4. 21; जगच्छरण्यस्य निराशिषः सतः Ku. 5. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराश्रय
निर् + -आश्रय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without a prop or support, supportless, unsupported; न तिष्ठति निराश्रयं<BR> लिङ्गम् Sāṅ. K. 41.<BR>—2 friendless, destitute, alone, without shelter or refuge; निराश्रयाधुना वत्सलता.<BR>—3 not deep (as a wound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरास्वाद
निर् + -आस्वाद <i>a.</i> tasteless, insipid, unsavoury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराहार|निराहारः
निर् + -आहार <i>a.</i> ‘foodless’, fasting, abstaining from food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराहारः|निराहार
निर् + -आहार + .({@-रः@}) fasting; कालोऽग्निः कर्म मृद् वायुर्मनो ज्ञानं तपो जलम् ।<BR> पश्चात्तापो निराहारः सर्वेऽमी शुद्धिहेतवः ॥ Y. 3. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरिङ्ग
निर् + -इङ्ग <i>a.</i> immovable, stationary; यथा दीपो निवातस्थो निरिङ्गो<BR> ज्वलते पुनः Mb. 12. 46. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरिच्छ
निर् + -इच्छ <i>a.</i> without wish or desire, indifferent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरिन्द्रिय|निरिंद्रिय|निरिन्द्रियः
निर् + -इन्द्रिय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having lost a limb or the use of it.<BR>—2 mutilated, maimed.<BR>—3 weak, infirm, frail; Kaṭh. 1. 1. 3.<BR>—4 barren.<BR>—5 without प्रमाण or means of certain knowledge; निरिन्द्रिया ह्यमन्त्राश्च<BR> स्त्रियोऽनृतमिति स्थितिः Ms. 9. 18.<BR>—6 destitute of manly vigour, impotent (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरिन्धन|निरिंधन
निर् + -इन्धन <i>a.</i> destitute of fuel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीति
निर् + -ईति <i>a.</i> free from the calamities of the season; निरातङ्का<BR> निरीतयः R. 1. 63; see ईति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीश्वर
निर् + -ईश्वर <i>a.</i> godless, atheistic. -˚वाद atheistic doctrine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीषम्
निर् + -ईषम् the body of a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीह|निरीहः
निर् + -ईह <i>a.</i><BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">Page0908-2</a>]<BR>—1 desireless, indifferent; निरीहाणामीशस्तृणमिव तिरस्कारविषयः Mu. 3. 16.<BR>—2 inactive; निरीहस्य हतद्विषः R. 10. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीहा
निर् + -ईह + .({@-हा@}), {@-निरीहता, -त्वम्@}<BR>—1 inactivity.<BR>—2 indifference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुच्छ्वास|निरुच्छ्वासः
निर् + -उच्छ्वास <i>a.</i><BR>—1 breathless, without breathing; निरुच्छ्वासं हरिं चक्रुः Rām. 7. 7. 6.<BR>—2 narrow, contracted; उपेयुषो वर्त्म निरन्तराभिरसौ निरुच्छ्वासमनीकिनीभिः Śi. 3. 32.<BR>—3 dead; निरुच्छ्वासाः पुनः केचित् पतिता जगतीतले Rām. 6. 58. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुच्छ्वासः|निरुच्छ्वास
निर् + -उच्छ्वास + .({@-सः@}) absence of breath; लोका निरुच्छ्वासनिपीडिता भृशम् Bhāg. 4. 8. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुत्तर
निर् + -उत्तर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 answerless, without a reply.<BR>—2 unable to answer, silenced.<BR>—3 having no superior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुत्थ
निर् + -उत्थ <i>a.</i> irrecoverable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुद्धति
निर् + -उद्धति <i>a.</i> not jolting (a chariot); अभूतलस्पर्शतया निरुद्धतिः<BR> Ś. 7. 10. (v. l.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुत्सव
निर् + -उत्सव <i>a.</i> without festivities; विरतं गेयमृतुर्निरुत्सवः R. 8. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुत्साह|निरुत्साहः
निर् + -उत्साह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 inactive, indolent.<BR>—2 devoid of energy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुत्साहः|निरुत्साह
निर् + -उत्साह + .({@-हः@})<BR>—1 absence of energy.<BR>—2 indolence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुत्सुक
निर् + -उत्सुक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 indifferent.<BR>—2 calm, tranquil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुदक
निर् + -उदक <i>a.</i> waterless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुदर
निर् + -उदर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having no belly or trunk.<BR>—2 thin (अतुन्दिल); श्रीमान्निरुदरो महान् Rām. 3. 16. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुद्यम
निर् + -उद्यम, -उद्योग <i>a.</i> effortless, inactive, lazy, idle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुद्योग|निरुद्योगः
निर् + -उद्यम, -उद्योग <i>a.</i> effortless, inactive, lazy, idle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुद्विग्न
निर् + -उद्विग्न, -उद्वेग <i>a.</i> free from excitement or perturbation, sedate, calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुद्वेग
निर् + -उद्विग्न, -उद्वेग <i>a.</i> free from excitement or perturbation, sedate, calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपक्रम
निर् + -उपक्रम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without a commencement.<BR>—2 incurable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपद्रव|निरुपद्रवः
निर् + -उपद्रव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from calamity or affliction, not visited by danger or adversity,<BR> lucky, happy, undisturbed, unmolested, free from hostile attacks.<BR>—2 free from national distress or tyranny.<BR>—3 causing no affliction.<BR>—4 auspicious (as a star).<BR>—5 secure, peaceful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपधि
निर् + -उपधि <i>a.</i> guileless, honest; U. 2. 2. ˚जीवन <i>a.</i> leading<BR> an honest life. (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपपत्ति
निर् + -उपपत्ति <i>a.</i> unsuitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपपद
निर् + -उपपद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without any title or designation; अरे आर्यचारुदत्तं निरुपपदेन<BR> नाम्नालपसि Mk. 10. 18/19.<BR>—2 unconnected with a subordinate word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपप्लव
निर् + -उपप्लव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from disturbance, obstacle or calamity, unharmed; निरुपप्लवानि<BR> नः कर्माणि संवृत्तानि Ś. 3.<BR>—2 not causing any affliction or misery.<BR>—3 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपभोग
निर् + -उपभोग <i>a.</i> without enjoyment; संसरति निरुपभोगं भावैरधिवासितं<BR> लिङ्गम् Sāṅ. K. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपम|निरुपमः
निर् + -उपम <i>a.</i> peerless, matchless, incomparable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपसर्ग
निर् + -उपसर्ग free from portents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपस्कृत
निर् + -उपस्कृत <i>a.</i> not corrupted, pure; of self-denying temperament;<BR> शमेन तपसा चैव भक्त्या च निरुपस्कृतः । शुद्धात्मा ब्राह्मणो रात्रौ<BR> निदर्शनमपश्यत ॥ Mb. 12. 271. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपहत
निर् + -उपहत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not injured, unhurt.<BR>—2 auspicious, lucky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपाख्य
निर् + -उपाख्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unreal, false, non-existent (as वन्ध्यापुत्र).<BR>—2 immaterial.<BR>—3 invisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपाख्यम्
निर् + -उपाख्य + .({@-ख्यम्@}) the supreme Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपाधि
निर् + -उपाधि, -उपाधिक <i>a.</i> without qualities, absolute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपाधिक
निर् + -उपाधि, -उपाधिक <i>a.</i> without qualities, absolute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपाय
निर् + -उपाय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without expedients, helpless.<BR>—2 unsuccessful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुपेक्ष|निरुपेक्षः
निर् + -उपेक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from trick or fraud.<BR>—2 not neglectful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुष्मन्
निर् + -उष्मन् <i>a.</i> devoid of heat, cold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गन्ध|निर्गंध|निर्गन्धं
निर् + -गन्ध <i>a.</i> void of smell, scentless, unfragrant, inodorous;<BR> निर्गन्धा इव किंशुकाः. ˚पुष्पी <i>f.</i> the Śālmali tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गर्व
निर् + -गर्व <i>a.</i> free from pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गवाक्ष
निर् + -गवाक्ष <i>a.</i> windowless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गुण|निर्गुणः
निर् + -गुण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 stringless (as a bow).<BR>—2 devoid of all properties.<BR>—3 devoid of good qualities, bad, worthless; निर्गुणः शोभते नैव विपुलाडम्बरोऽपि<BR> ना Bv. 1. 115.<BR>—4 without attributes; साकारं च निराकारं सगुणं निर्गुणं विभुम् Brav. P.<BR>—5 having no epithet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गुणः|निर्गुण
निर् + -गुण + .({@-णः@}) the Supreme Spirit. ˚आत्मक <i>a.</i> having<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">Page0909-1</a>]<BR> no qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0908-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गृह
निर् + -गृह^1 <i>a.</i> houseless, homeless; सुगृही निर्गृहीकृता Pt. 390.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गौरव
निर् + -गौरव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without dignity, undignified.<BR>—2 devoid of respect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ग्रन्थ|निर्ग्रंथ|निर्ग्रन्थः
निर् + -ग्रन्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 freed from all ties or hindrances; आत्मारामाश्च मुनयो निर्ग्रन्था अप्युरुक्रमे ।<BR> कुर्वन्त्यहैतुकीं भक्तिम् Bhāg. 1. 7. 10.<BR>—2 poor, possessionless, beggarly.<BR>—3 alone, unassisted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ग्रन्थः|निर्ग्रन्थ|निर्ग्रंथ
निर् + -ग्रन्थ + .({@-न्थः@})<BR>—1 an idiot, a fool.<BR>—2 a gambler.<BR>—3 a saint or devotee who has renounced all worldly attachments and wanders<BR> about naked and lives as a hermit.<BR>—4 A Buddha Muni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ग्रन्थक|निर्ग्रन्थकः
निर् + -ग्रन्थक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 clever, expert.<BR>—2 unaccompanied, alone.<BR>—3 deserted, abandoned.<BR>—4 fruitless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ग्रन्थकः|निर्ग्रन्थक
निर् + -ग्रन्थक + .({@-कः@})<BR>—1 a religious mendicant.<BR>—2 a naked devotee.<BR>—3 a gambler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ग्रन्थिक|निर्ग्रंथिक|निर्ग्रन्थिकः
निर् + -ग्रन्थिक <i>a.</i> clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ग्रन्थिकः|निर्ग्रन्थिक|निर्ग्रंथिक
निर् + -ग्रन्थिक + .({@-कः@}) a naked mendicant, a Jaina mendicant of the Digambara class.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घटम्
निर् + -घटम्<BR>—1 a free market.<BR>—2 a crowded market.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घण्टः|निर्घण्ट|निर्घंट|निर्घंटं|निर्घंटः
निर् + -घण्टः See निघण्टः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घृण
निर् + -घृण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 cruel, merciless, pitiless.<BR>—2 shameless, immodest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घृणा
निर् + -घृणा cruelty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घोष|निर्घोषः
निर् + -घोष <i>a.</i> noiseless, still, calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जन|निर्ज्जन|निर्ज्जनः
निर् + -जन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 tenantless, uninhabited, unfrequented, lonely, desolate.<BR>—2 without any retinue or attendants; भूयश्चैवाभिरक्षन्तु निर्धनान्निर्जना<BR> इव Mb. 12. 151. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जनम्
निर् + -जन + .({@-नम्@}) a desert, solitude, lonely place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जन्तु
निर् + -जन्तु <i>a.</i> free from living germs; H. Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जर|निर्जरं|निर्जरः|निर्ज्जर|निर्ज्जरः
निर् + -जर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 young, fresh.<BR>—2 imperishable, immortal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जरः|निर्जर|निर्जरं|निर्ज्जर|निर्ज्जरः
निर् + -जर + .({@-रः@}) a deity, god; (nom. pl. निर्जराः -निर्जरसः)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जरम्
निर् + -जर + .({@-रम्@}) ambrosia, nectar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जरायु
निर् + -जरायु <i>a.</i> Ved. skinless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जल|निर्जलः|निर्ज्जलः
निर् + -जल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 waterless, desert, destitute of water.<BR>—2 not mixed with water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जलः|निर्जल|निर्ज्जलः
निर् + -जल + .({@-लः@}) a waste, desert. ˚एकादशी N. of the eleventh day in<BR> the bright half of Jyeṣṭha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जाड्य
निर् + -जाड्य free from coldness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जिह्वः|निर्जिह्व
निर् + -जिह्वः a frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जीव|निर्ज्जीवः
निर् + -जीव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 lifeless.<BR>—2 dead; चिता दहति निर्जीवं चिन्ता दहति जीवितम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ज्ञाति
निर् + -ज्ञाति <i>a.</i> having no kinsmen, alone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ज्वर
निर् + -ज्वर <i>a.</i> feverless, healthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दण्डः|निर्दण्ड|निर्दंड
निर् + -दण्डः a Śūdra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दय|निर्द्दयः
निर् + -दय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 merciless, cruel, pitiless, unmerciful, unkind.<BR>—2 passionate.<BR>—3 very close, firm or fast, strong, excessive, violent; मुग्धे विधेहि<BR> मयि निर्दयदन्तदंशम् Gīt. 10; निर्दयरतिश्रमालसाः R. 19. 32;<BR> निर्दयाश्लेषहेतोः Me. 108.<BR>—4 unpitied by any; निर्दया निर्नमस्कारास्तन्मनोरनुशासनम् Ms. 9. 239.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दयम्
निर् + -दयम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 unmercifully, cruelly.<BR>—2 violently, excesssivly; न प्रहर्तुमलमस्मि निर्दयम् R. 11. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दश
निर् + -दश <i>a.</i> more than ten days old; यदा पशुर्निर्दशः स्यादथ<BR> मेध्यो भवेदिति Bhāg. 9. 7. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दशन
निर् + -दशन <i>a.</i> toothless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दाक्षिण्य
निर् + -दाक्षिण्य <i>a.</i> uncourteous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दुःख
निर् + -दुःख <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from pain, painless.<BR>—2 not causing pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दैन्य
निर् + -दैन्य <i>a.</i> happy, comfortable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दोष|निर्द्दोषः
निर् + -दोष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 faultless, defectless; न निर्दोषं न निर्गुणम्.<BR>—2 guiltless, innocent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्द्रव्य
निर् + -द्रव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 immaterial.<BR>—2 without property, poor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्द्रोह
निर् + -द्रोह <i>a.</i> not hostile, friendly, well-disposed, not malicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्द्वन्द्व|निर्द्वंद्व
निर् + -द्वन्द्व <i>a.</i><BR>—1 indifferent in regard to opposite pairs of feelings (pleasure or pain),<BR> neither glad nor sorry; निर्द्वन्द्वो निर्ममो भूत्वा चरिष्यामि मृगैः सह<BR> Mb. 1. 85. 16; निर्द्वन्द्वो नित्यसत्त्वस्थो निर्योगक्षेम आत्मवान् Bg. 2. 45.<BR>—2 not dependent upon another, independent.<BR>—3 free from jealousy or envy.<BR>—4 not double.<BR>—5 not contested, undisputed.<BR>—6 not acknowledging two principles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धन|निर्धनः
निर् + -धन <i>a.</i> without property, poor, indigent; शशिनस्तुल्यवंशोऽपि<BR> निर्धनः परिभूयते Cāṇ. 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धनः|निर्धन
निर् + -धन + .({@-नः@}) an old ox. ˚ता, ˚त्वम् poverty,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">Page0909-2</a>]<BR> indigence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धर्म|निर्धर्म्म|निर्धर्म्मः
निर् + -धर्म <i>a.</i> unrighteous, impious, unholy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धूम
निर् + -धूम <i>a.</i> smokeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धौत|निर्धौतं
निर् + -धौत <i>a.</i> cleansed, rendered clean; निर्धौतदानामलगण्डभित्तिर्वन्यः<BR> सरित्तो गज उन्ममज्ज R. 5. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्नमस्कार
निर् + -नमस्कार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not courteous or civil, not respecting any one.<BR>—2 disrespected, despised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्नर
निर् + -नर <i>a.</i> abandoned by men, deserted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्नाणक
निर् + -नाणक <i>a.</i> coinless, penniless; Mk. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्नाथ
निर् + -नाथ <i>a.</i> without a guardian or master. ˚ता<BR>—1 want of protection.<BR>—2 widowhood.<BR>—3 orphanage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्नाभि
निर् + -नाभि <i>a.</i> going or reaching beyond the navel; निर्नाभि कौशेयमुपात्तबाणम् Ku. 7. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्नायक
निर् + -नायक <i>a.</i> having no leader or ruler, anarchic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्नाशन
निर् + -नाशन, -नाशिन् <i>a.</i> expelling, banishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्नाशिन्
निर् + -नाशन, -नाशिन् <i>a.</i> expelling, banishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्निद्र
निर् + -निद्र <i>a.</i> sleepless, wakeful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्निमित्त
निर् + -निमित्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 causeless.<BR>—2 disinterested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्निमेष
निर् + -निमेष <i>a.</i> not twinkling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बन्धु|निर्बंधु
निर् + -बन्धु <i>a.</i> without kindred or relation, friendless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बल|निर्ब्बल
निर् + -बल <i>a.</i>^1 powerless, weak, feeble.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बाध|निर्बाधः
निर् + -बाध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unobstructed.<BR>—2 unfrequented, lonely, solitary.<BR>—3 unmolested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बाधः|निर्बाध
निर् + -बाध + .({@-धः@})<BR>—1 a part of the marrow.<BR>—2 a knob.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बीज
निर् + -बीज <i>a.</i> seedless, impotent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बीजा
निर् + -बीज + .({@-जा@}) a sort of grape (Mar. बेदाणा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बुद्धि|निर्ब्बुद्धि
निर् + -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> stupid, ignorant, foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बुष
निर् + -बुष, -बुस <i>a.</i> unhusked, freed from chaff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बुस
निर् + -बुष, -बुस <i>a.</i> unhusked, freed from chaff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भक्त
निर् + -भक्त <i>a.</i> taken without eating (as a medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भय|निर्भयः
निर् + -भय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fearless, undaunted.<BR>—2 free from danger, safe, secure; निर्भयं तु भवेद्यस्य राष्ट्रं बाहुबलाश्रितम् Ms. 9. 255.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भर|निर्भरं|निर्भरः
निर् + -भर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 excessive, vehement, violent, much, strong; त्रपाभरनिर्भरस्मरशर<BR> &c. Gīt. 12; तन्व्यास्तिष्ठतु निर्भरप्रणयिता मानोऽपि रम्योदयः Amaru. 47.<BR>—2 ardent<BR>—3 fast, close (as embrace); कुचकुम्भनिर्भरपरीरम्भामृतं वाञ्छति<BR> Gīt.; परिरभ्य निर्भरम् Gīt. 1.<BR>—4 sound, deep (as sleep).<BR>—5 full of, filled with (at the end of comp.); आनन्द˚, गर्व˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भरः|निर्भर|निर्भरं
निर् + -भर + .({@-रः@}) a servant receiving no wages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भरम्
निर् + -भर + .({@-रम्@}) excess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भरम्
निर् + -भर + .({@-रम्@} <i>ind.</i>)<BR>—1 excessively, exceedingly, intensely.<BR>—2 soundly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भाग्य|निर्भाग्यः
निर् + -भाग्य <i>a.</i> unfortunate, unlucky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भाज्य
निर् + -भाज्य <i>a.</i> to be separated; स निर्भाज्यः स्वकादंशात् किंचिद्दत्वोपजीवनम् Ms. 9. 207.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भृति
निर् + -भृति^1 <i>a.</i> without wages, hireless.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8089dd2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भोग
निर् + -भोग^1 <i>a.</i> not fond of pleasures.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मक्षिक
निर् + -मक्षिक <i>a.</i> ‘free from flies’, undisturbed, private, lonely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मक्षिकम्
निर् + -मक्षिक + .({@-कम्@}) <i>ind.</i> without flies, <i>i. e.</i> lonely, private; कृतं<BR> भवतेदानीं निर्मक्षिकम् Ś. 2, 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मज्ज
निर् + -मज्ज <i>a.</i> fatless, meagre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मत्सर
निर् + -मत्सर <i>a.</i> free from envy, unenvious; निर्मत्सरे मत्समे<BR> वत्से … वसुन्धराभारमारोप्य Rāmāyaṇachampū.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मत्स्य
निर् + -मत्स्य <i>a.</i> fishless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मद|निर्म्मद|निर्म्मदः
निर् + -मद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not intoxicated, sober, quiet.<BR>—2 not proud, humble.<BR>—3 sad, sorry.<BR>—4 not in rut (as an elephant).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मनुज
निर् + -मनुज, -मनुष्य <i>a.</i> tenantless, uninhabited, deserted by men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मनुष्य|निर्म्मनुष्य
निर् + -मनुज, -मनुष्य <i>a.</i> tenantless, uninhabited, deserted by men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मन्तु
निर् + -मन्तु <i>a.</i> faultless, innocent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मन्त्र
निर् + -मन्त्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 a ceremony, unaccompanied by holy texts.<BR>—2 not familiar with holy texts; Mb. 12. 36. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मन्यु
निर् + -मन्यु, -मन्युक <i>a.</i> free from anger; Mb. 5. 133. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मन्युक
निर् + -मन्यु, -मन्युक <i>a.</i> free from anger; Mb. 5. 133. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मम|निर्म्मम
निर् + -मम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from all connections with the outer world, who has renounced all<BR> worldly ties; संसारमिव निर्ममः (ततार) R. 12. 60; Bg. 2. 71;<BR> निराशीर्निर्ममो भूत्वा युध्यस्व विगतज्वरः 3. 30.<BR>—2 unselfish, disinterested.<BR>—3 indifferent to (with loc.); निर्ममे निर्ममोऽर्थेषु मथुरां मधुराकृतिः<BR> R. 15. 28; प्राप्तेष्वर्थेषु निर्ममाः Mb.<BR>—4 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मर्याद|निर्मर्य्याद
निर् + -मर्याद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 boundless, immeasurable.<BR>—2 transgressing the limits of right or propriety, unrestrained, unruly,<BR> sinful, criminal; मनुजपशुभिर्निर्मर्यादैर्भवद्भिरूदायुधैः Ve. 3. 22.<BR>—3 confused.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">Page0910-1</a>]<BR>—4 insolent, immodest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मर्यादम्
निर् + -मर्याद + .({@-दम्@}) <i>ind.</i> confusedly, topsy-turvy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मर्यादम्
निर् + -मर्याद + .({@-दम्@}) confusion, disorder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0909-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मल|निर्म्मल|निर्म्मलं
निर् + -मल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from dirt or impurities, clear, pure, stainless, unsullied (fig.<BR> also); नीरान्निर्मलतो जनिः Bv. 1. 63.<BR>—2 resplendent, bright; Bh. 1. 56.<BR>—3 sinless, virtuous; निर्मलाः स्वर्गमायान्ति सन्तः सुकृतिनो यथा Ms. 8. 318.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मलम्
निर् + -मल + .({@-लम्@})<BR>—1 talc.<BR>—2 the remainings of an offering made to a deity. ˚उपलः a crystal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मशक
निर् + -मशक <i>a.</i> free from gnats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मांस
निर् + -मांस <i>a.</i> fleshless; स्वल्पत्नायुवसावशेषमलिनं निर्मांसमप्यस्थिकम् Bh. 2. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मान
निर् + -मान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without self-confidence.<BR>—2 free from pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मानुष
निर् + -मानुष <i>a.</i> uninhabited, desolate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मार्ग
निर् + -मार्ग <i>a.</i> roadless, pathless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मिथ्य
निर् + -मिथ्य <i>a.</i> not false, true; H. Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मुटः|निर्मुट|निर्मुटं|निर्म्मुट
निर् + -मुटः<BR>—1 a tree bearing large blossoms.<BR>—2 the sun.<BR>—3 a rogue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मुटम्
निर् + -मुटः + .({@-टम्@}) a large free market or fair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मूल|निर्म्मूल
निर् + -मूल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 rootless (as a tree).<BR>—2 baseless, unfounded (statement, charge &c.).<BR>—3 eradicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मेघ
निर् + -मेघ <i>a.</i> cloudless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मेध
निर् + -मेध <i>a.</i> without understanding, stupid, foolish, dull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मोह|निर्मोहः
निर् + -मोह <i>a.</i> free from illusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मोहः|निर्मोह
निर् + -मोह + .({@-हः@}) an epithet of Śiva.//<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यत्न
निर् + -यत्न <i>a.</i> inactive, lazy, dull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यन्त्रण|निर्यंत्रण|निर्यन्त्रणं|निर्य्यन्त्रण
निर् + -यन्त्रण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unrestrained, unobstructed, uncontrolled, unrestricted.<BR>—2 unruly, self-willed, independent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यन्त्रणम्
निर् + -यन्त्रण + .({@-णम्@})<BR>—1 squeezing out.<BR>—2 absence of restraint, independence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यशस्क
निर् + -यशस्क <i>a.</i> without fame, discreditable, inglorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्युक्त
निर् + -युक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 constructed, built.<BR>—2 directed.<BR>—3 (in music) limited to metre and measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्युक्ति|निर्य्युक्ति
निर् + -युक्ति <i>f.</i><BR>—1 disunion.<BR>—2 absence of connection or government.<BR>—3 unfitness, impropriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्युक्तिक|निर्युक्तिकं|निर्य्युक्तिक
निर् + -युक्तिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 disjoined, unconnected.<BR>—2 illogical, unmeaning.<BR>—3 unfit, improper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यूथ
निर् + -यूथ <i>a.</i> separated from the herd, strayed from the flock (as an elephant).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यूष|निर्यूषः
निर् + -यूष = निर्यास.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्योगक्षेम|निर्य्योगक्षेम
निर् + -योगक्षेम <i>a.</i> free from care (about acquisition); Bg. 2. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरक्त
निर् + -रक्त <i>a.</i> (नीरक्त) colourless, faded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरज|नीरजं|नीरजः
निर् + -रज, -रजस्क <i>a.</i> (नीरज, नीरजस्क)<BR>—1 free from dust.<BR>—2 devoid of passion or darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरजः|नीरज|नीरजं
निर् + -रज, -रजस्क + .({@-जः@}) an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरजस्क
निर् + -रज, -रजस्क <i>a.</i> (नीरज, नीरजस्क)<BR>—1 free from dust.<BR>—2 devoid of passion or darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरजस्
निर् + -रजस् (नरिजस्) <i>a.</i> see नीरज. ━(<i>f.</i>)<BR> a woman not menstruating. ˚तमसा absence of passion or darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरत|नीरतः
निर् + -रत (नीरत) <i>a.</i> not attached to, indifferent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरन्ध्र|नीरंध्र|नीरन्ध्रं
निर् + -रन्ध्र <i>a.</i> (नीरन्ध्र)<BR>—1 without holes or interstices, very close or contiguous, thickly situated;<BR> नीरन्ध्रनीरनिचुलानि सरित्तटानि U. 2. 23.<BR>—2 thick, dense.<BR>—3 coarse, gross.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरव
निर् + -रव <i>a.</i> (नीरव) not making any noise, noiseless;<BR> गतिविभ्रमसादनीरवा (रसना) R. 8. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरस|नीरसः
निर् + -रस <i>a.</i> (नीरस)<BR>—1 tasteless, unsavoury, flavourless.<BR>—2 (fig.) insipid, without any poetic charm; नीरसानां पद्मानाम् S. D. 1.<BR>—3 sapless, without juice, withered or dried up; Ś. Til. 9.<BR>—4 vain, useless, fruitless; अलब्धफलनीरसान् मम विधाय तस्मिन् जने V. 2. 11.<BR>—5 disagreeable.<BR>—6 cruel, merciless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरसः|नीरस
निर् + -रस + .({@-सः@}) the pomegranate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरसन
निर् + -रसन <i>a.</i> (नीरसन) having no girdle (रसना); Ki. 5. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरुच्
निर् + -रुच् <i>a.</i> (नीरुच्) without lustre, faded, dim; परिमलरुचिराभिर्न्यक्कृतास्तु<BR> प्रभाते युवतिभिरुपभोगान्नीरुचः पुष्पमालाः Śi. 11. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरुज्
निर् + -रुज्, -रुज <i>a.</i> (नीरुज्, नीरुज) free from sickness, healthy,<BR> sound; नीरुजस्य किमौषधैः H. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरुज|नीरुजं|नीरुजः
निर् + -रुज्, -रुज <i>a.</i> (नीरुज्, नीरुज) free from sickness, healthy,<BR> sound; नीरुजस्य किमौषधैः H. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरूप|नीरूपं|नीरूपः
निर् + -रूप <i>a.</i> (नीरूप) formless, shapeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरूपः|नीरूप|नीरूपं
निर् + -रूप + .({@-पः@})<BR>—1 air, wind.<BR>—2 a god.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरूपम्
निर् + -रूप + .({@-पम्@}) ether.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरोग
निर् + -रोग <i>a.</i> (नीरोग) free from sickness or disease, healthy,<BR> sound; यथा<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">Page0910-2</a>]<BR> नेच्छति नीरोगः कदाचित् सुचिकित्सकम् Pt. 1. 118.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लक्षण|निर्लक्षणः
निर् + -लक्षण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having no auspicious marks, ill-featured.<BR>—2 undistinguished.<BR>—3 unimportant, insignificant.<BR>—4 unspotted.<BR>—5 having a white back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लक्ष्य
निर् + -लक्ष्य <i>a.</i> invisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लज्ज
निर् + -लज्ज <i>a.</i> shameless, impudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लाञ्छनम्
निर् + -लाञ्छनम् the marking of domestic animals (by perforating the nose &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लिङ्ग|निर्लिंग
निर् + -लिङ्ग <i>a.</i> having no distinguishing or characteristic marks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लिप्त|निर्लिप्तः
निर् + -लिप्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unanointed.<BR>—2 undefiled, unsullied.<BR>—3 indifferent to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लिप्तः|निर्लिप्त
निर् + -लिप्त + .({@-प्तः@})<BR>—1 N. of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—2 a sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लून
निर् + -लून <i>a.</i> cut through or off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लेप|निर्लेपः
निर् + -लेप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unsmeared, unanointed; निर्लेपं काञ्चनं भाण्डमद्भिरेव विशुध्यति Ms. 5. 112.<BR>—2 stainless, sinless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लेपः|निर्लेप
निर् + -लेप + .({@-पः@}) a sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लोभ
निर् + -लोभ <i>a.</i> free from desire or avarice, unavaricious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लोमन्
निर् + -लोमन् <i>a.</i> devoid of hair, hairless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वंश
निर् + -वंश <i>a.</i> without posterity, childless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वचन|निर्वचनं|निर्व्वचन
निर् + -वचन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not speaking, silent.<BR>—2 unobjectionable, blameless; (for other senses see the word separately).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्नम्
निर् + -नम् <i>ind.</i> silently; माल्येन तां निर्वचनं जघान Ku. 7. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वण|निर्व्वण
निर् + -वण, -वन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 being out of a wood.<BR>—2 free from woods.<BR>—3 bare, open.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वन|निर्व्वन
निर् + -वण, -वन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 being out of a wood.<BR>—2 free from woods.<BR>—3 bare, open.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वत्सल
निर् + -वत्सल <i>a.</i> not loving or fondling (esp. children); निर्वत्सले<BR> सुतशतस्य विपत्तिमेतां त्वं नानुचिन्तयसि Ve. 5. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वर
निर् + -वर = निर्दरम् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वसु
निर् + -वसु <i>a.</i> destitute of wealth, poor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वाच्य|निर्व्वाच्य
निर् + -वाच्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not fit to be said.<BR>—2 blameless, unobjectionable; सखीषु निर्वाच्यमधाष्टर्यदूषितं प्रियाङ्गसंश्लेषमवाप<BR> मानिनी Ki. 8. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वात|निर्वातः|निर्व्वात|निर्व्वातः
निर् + -वात <i>a.</i> free or sheltered from wind, calm, still; हिमनिष्यन्दिनी<BR> प्रातर्निर्वातेव वनस्थली R. 15. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वातः|निर्वात|निर्व्वात|निर्व्वातः
निर् + -वात + .({@-तः@}) a place sheltered from or not exposed to wind; निर्वाते<BR> व्यजनम् H. 2. 124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वानर
निर् + -वानर <i>a.</i> free from monkeys.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वायस
निर् + -वायस <i>a.</i> free from crows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वार्य|निर्वार्य्य|निर्व्वार्य्य|निर्व्वार्य्यः
निर् + -वार्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 irresistible.<BR>—2 acting fearlessly or boldly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विकल्प|निर्व्विकल्प
निर् + -विकल्प, -विकल्पक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not admitting an alternative.<BR>—2 being without determination or resolution.<BR>—3 not capable of mutual relation.<BR>—4 conditioned.<BR>—5 undeliberative.<BR>—6 recognizing no such distinction as that of subject and object, or of<BR> the knower and the known; as applied to समाधि or contemplation, it<BR> is ‘an exclusive concentration upon the one entity without distinct and separate consciousness of the knower, the known, and the knowing, and without even self-consciousness’<BR>; निर्विकल्पकः ज्ञातृज्ञानादिविकल्पभेदलयापेक्षः;<BR> नो चेत् चेतः प्रविश सहसा निर्विकल्पे समाधौ Bh. 3. 61; आत्मारामा<BR> विहितरतयो निर्विकल्पे समाधौ Ve. 1. 23.<BR>—7 (in phil.) not arising from the relation of the qualifier and the qualified,<BR> (विशेषणविशेष्यसंबन्धानवगाहि प्रत्यक्षं ज्ञानम्) said of knowledge<BR> not derived from the senses, as घटत्व.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विकल्पम्
निर् + -विकल्प, -विकल्पक + .({@-ल्पम्@}) <i>ind.</i> without hesitation or wavering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विकल्पक|निर्व्विकल्पक|निर्व्विकल्पकं
निर् + -विकल्प, -विकल्पक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not admitting an alternative.<BR>—2 being without determination or resolution.<BR>—3 not capable of mutual relation.<BR>—4 conditioned.<BR>—5 undeliberative.<BR>—6 recognizing no such distinction as that of subject and object, or of<BR> the knower and the known; as applied to समाधि or contemplation, it<BR> is ‘an exclusive concentration upon the one entity without distinct and separate consciousness of the knower, the known, and the knowing, and without even self-consciousness’<BR>; निर्विकल्पकः ज्ञातृज्ञानादिविकल्पभेदलयापेक्षः;<BR> नो चेत् चेतः प्रविश सहसा निर्विकल्पे समाधौ Bh. 3. 61; आत्मारामा<BR> विहितरतयो निर्विकल्पे समाधौ Ve. 1. 23.<BR>—7 (in phil.) not arising from the relation of the qualifier and the qualified,<BR> (विशेषणविशेष्यसंबन्धानवगाहि प्रत्यक्षं ज्ञानम्) said of knowledge<BR> not derived from the senses, as घटत्व.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विकार|निर्विकारः|निर्व्विकार|निर्व्विकारः
निर् + -विकार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unchanged, unchangeable, immutable.<BR>—2 not disposed; तौ स्थास्यतस्ते नृपती निदेशे परस्परावग्रहनिर्विकारौ M. 5. 14.<BR>—3 disinterested; तरुविटपलतानां बान्धवो निर्विकारः Ṛs. 2. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विकारः|निर्विकार|निर्व्विकार|निर्व्विकारः
निर् + -विकार + .({@-रः@}) the Supreme deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विकास
निर् + -विकास <i>a.</i> unblown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विघ्न|निर्व्विघ्न
निर् + -विघ्न <i>a.</i> uninterrupted, unobstructed, free from impediments;<BR> निर्विघ्नं कुरु मे देव सर्वकार्येषु सर्वदा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विघ्नम्
निर् + -विघ्न + .({@-घ्नम्@}) absence of impediment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विचार
निर् + -विचार <i>a.</i> not reflecting, thoughtless, inconsiderate; रे<BR> रे स्वैरिणि निर्विचारकविते मास्मत्प्रकाशीभव Candr. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विचारम्
निर् + -विचार + .({@-रम्@}) <i>ind.</i> thoughtlessly, unhesitatingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विचिकित्स
निर् + -विचिकित्स <i>a.</i> free from doubt or reflection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विचेष्ट
निर् + -विचेष्ट <i>a.</i><BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">Page0911-1</a>]<BR> motionless, insensible; यो हि दिष्टमुपासीनो निर्विचेष्टः सुखं शयेत् Mb. 3. 32. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0910-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वितर्क
निर् + -वितर्क <i>a.</i> unreflecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विनोद
निर् + -विनोद <i>a.</i> without amusement, void of pastime, diversion or<BR> solace; शङ्के रात्रौ गुरुतरशुचं निर्विनोदां सखीं ते Me. 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विन्ध्या|निर्विंध्या|निर्व्विन्ध्या
निर् + -विन्ध्या N. of a river in the Vindhya hills; निर्विन्ध्यायाः पथि<BR> भव रसाभ्यन्तरः सन्निपत्य Me. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विमर्श
निर् + -विमर्श <i>a.</i><BR>—1 void of reflection, thoughtless.<BR>—2 not having विमर्श Sandhi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विवर|निर्व्विवर
निर् + -विवर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having no opening or cavity.<BR>—2 without interstices or interval, close, compact; घटते हि संहततया<BR> जनितामिदमेव निर्विवरतां दधतोः Śi. 9. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विवाद
निर् + -विवाद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not contending or disagreeing. —2 undisputed, not contradicted or disputed,<BR> universally acknowledged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विवेक|निर्व्विवेक
निर् + -विवेक <i>a.</i> indiscreet, void of judgment, wanting in discrimination, foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विशङ्क|निर्विशंक|निर्व्विशङ्क
निर् + -विशङ्क <i>a.</i> fearless, undaunted, confident; Ms. 7. 176; यस्मिन्कृत्यं<BR> समावेश्य निर्विशङ्केन चेतसा । आस्यते सेवकः स स्यात् कलत्रमिव चापरम् ॥<BR> Pt. 1. 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विशेष|निर्विशेषः|निर्व्विशेष
निर् + -विशेष <i>a.</i> showing or making no difference, indiscriminating,<BR> without distinction; निर्विशेषा वयं त्वयि Mb.; निर्विशेषो विशेषः<BR> Bh. 3. 50 ‘a difference without distinction’.<BR>—2 having no difference, same, like, not differing from (oft. in comp.);<BR> निर्विशेषाकृति ‘having the same form’; प्रवातनीलोत्पलनिर्विशेषम्<BR> Ku. 1. 46; स निर्विशेषप्रतिपत्तिरासीत् R. 14. 22.<BR>—3 indiscriminate, promiscuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विशेषः|निर्विशेष|निर्व्विशेष
निर् + -विशेष + .({@-षः@}) absence of difference. (निर्विशेषम् and निर्विशेषेण<BR> are used adverbially in the sense of ‘without difference’, ‘equally’,<BR> ‘indiscriminately’; क्रुद्धेन विप्रमुक्तोऽयं निर्विशेषं प्रियाप्रिये Rām. 7. 22. 41.<BR> स्वगृहनिर्विशेषमत्र स्थीयताम् H. 1; R. 5. 6.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विशेषण
निर् + -विशेषण <i>a.</i> without attributes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विष
निर् + -विष <i>a.</i> poisonless (as a snake); निर्विषा डुण्डुभाः स्मृताः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विषङ्ग
निर् + -विषङ्ग <i>a.</i> not attached, indifferent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विषय|निर्व्विषय
निर् + -विषय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 expelled or driven away from oneʼs home, residence or proper place;<BR> मनोनिर्विषयार्थकामया Ku. 5. 38; R. 9. 32; also -निर्विषयीकृत;<BR> वने प्राक्कलनं तीर्थं ये ते निर्विषयीकृताः<BR> Rām. 2. 104. 4.<BR>—2 having no scope or sphere of action; किंच एवं काव्यं प्रविरलविषयं<BR> निर्विषयं वा स्यात् S. D. 1.<BR>—3 not attached to sensual objects (as mind).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विषाण
निर् + -विषाण <i>a.</i> destitute of horns.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्विहार
निर् + -विहार <i>a.</i> having no pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वीज|निर्व्वीज
निर् + -वीज, -बीज <i>a.</i><BR>—1 seedless.<BR>—2 impotent. —3 causeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बीज
निर् + -वीज, -बीज <i>a.</i><BR>—1 seedless.<BR>—2 impotent. —3 causeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वीर|निर्व्वीर|निर्व्वीरं
निर् + -वीर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 deprived of heroes; निर्वीरमुर्वीतलम् P. R. 1. 31.<BR>—2 cowardly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वीरा|निर्व्वीरा
निर् + -वीरा a woman whose husband and children are dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वीर्य|निर्वीर्य्य|निर्व्वीर्य्य
निर् + -वीर्य <i>a.</i> powerless, feeble, unmanly, impotent; निर्वीर्यं<BR> गुरुशापभाषितवशात् किं मे तवेवायुधम् Ve. 3. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वीरुध
निर् + -वीरुध, -वृक्ष <i>a.</i> treeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वृक्ष
निर् + -वीरुध, -वृक्ष <i>a.</i> treeless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वृत्ति|निर्वृत्तिः
निर् + -वृत्ति <i>f.</i> accomplishment, achievement; अत आसां निर्वृत्त्या<BR> अपवर्गः स्यात् । आतण्डुलनिर्वृत्तेः आ च पिष्टनिर्वृत्तेरभ्यास इति ॥<BR> ŚB. on MS. 11. 1. 27. ━<i>a.</i> having no occupation, destitute. See निर्वृति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वृष
निर् + -वृष <i>a.</i> deprived of bulls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वेग
निर् + -वेग <i>a.</i> not moving, quiet, calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वेतन
निर् + -वेतन <i>a.</i> honorary, unsalaried.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वेद|निर्वेदः|निर्व्वेदः
निर् + -वेद <i>a.</i> not acknowledging the Vedas, an atheist, infidel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वेष्टनम्
निर् + -वेष्टनम् a weaverʼs shuttle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वैर
निर् + -वैर <i>a.</i> free from enmity, amicable, peaceable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वैरम्
निर् + -वैर + .({@-रम्@}) absence of enmity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वैलक्ष्य
निर् + -वैलक्ष्य <i>a.</i> shameless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यञ्जन|निर्व्यंजन
निर् + -व्यञ्जन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 straight-forward.<BR>—2 without condiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यञ्जनम्
निर् + -व्यञ्जन + .({@-नम्@} <i>ind.</i>) plainly, in a straight-forward or honest manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यथ
निर् + -व्यथ, -न <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from pain.<BR>—2 quiet, calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्न
निर् + -व्यथ, -न <i>a.</i><BR>—1 free from pain.<BR>—2 quiet, calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यथनम्
निर् + -व्यथनम् a hole; छिद्रं निर्व्यथनम् Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यपेक्ष
निर् + -व्यपेक्ष <i>a.</i> indifferent to,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">Page0911-2</a>]<BR> regardless of; मृग्यश्च दर्भाङ्कुरनिर्व्यपेक्षास्तवागतिज्ञं समबोधयन्<BR> माम् R. 13. 25, 14. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यलीक
निर् + -व्यलीक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 not hurting or offending.<BR>—2 without pain.<BR>—3 pleased, doing anything willingly.<BR>—4 sincere, genuine, undissembling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यवघान
निर् + -व्यवघान <i>a.</i> (ground) uncovered, bare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यवस्थ
निर् + -व्यवस्थ <i>a.</i> moving hither and thither.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यसन
निर् + -व्यसन <i>a.</i> free from bad inclination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्याकुल
निर् + -व्याकुल <i>a.</i> calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्याघ्र
निर् + -व्याघ्र <i>a.</i> not haunted or infested by tigers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्याज
निर् + -व्याज <i>a.</i><BR>—1 candid, upright, honest, plain.<BR>—2 without fraud, true, genuine.<BR>—3 got by heroism or daring deeds (not by fraud or cowardly conduct);<BR> अशस्त्रपूतनिर्व्याजम् (महामांसम्) Māl. 5. 12 (v. l.)<BR>—4 not hypocritical; धर्मस्य निर्व्याजता (विभूषणम्) Bh. 2. 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्याजम्
निर् + -व्याज + .({@-जम्@} <i>ind.</i>) plainly, honestly, candidly; निर्व्याजमालिङ्गितः Amaru. 85.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्याजीकृत
निर् + -व्याजीकृत <i>a.</i> made plain, freed from deceit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यापार
निर् + -व्यापार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 without employment or business, free from occupation; तं दधन्मैथिलीकण्ठनिर्व्यापारेण<BR> बाहुना R. 15. 56.<BR>—2 motionless; U. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्यावृत्ति
निर् + -व्यावृत्ति <i>a.</i> not involving any return (to worldly existence).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्रण
निर् + -व्रण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unhurt, without wounds.<BR>—2 without rents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्रत
निर् + -व्रत <i>a.</i> not observing vows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्व्रीड
निर् + -व्रीड <i>a.</i> shameless, impudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्हिमम्
निर् + -हिमम् cessation of winter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्हेति
निर् + -हेति <i>a.</i> weaponless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्हेतु
निर् + -हेतु <i>a.</i> causeless, having no cause or reason.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ह्रीक
निर् + -ह्रीक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 shameless, impudent.<BR>—2 bold, daring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरम्
निरम् €1 Ā. To rest, cease. ━<i>Caus.</i> To gladden, give pleasure<BR> (by sexual union); Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरत|निरतं
निरत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Engaged or interested in; स्वकर्मनिरतः सिद्धिं यथा विन्दति तच्छृणु Bg. 18. 45.<BR>—2 Devoted to, fond of, attached to; वनवासनिरतः K. 157; मृगया˚ &c.<BR>—3 Pleased, delighted.<BR>—4 Rested, ceased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरतिः|निरति
निरतिः <i>f.</i> Strong attachment, fondness, devotion; पापनिरतिरविशङ्कतया<BR> विजयं व्यवस्यति वराहमायया Ki. 12. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरयः|निरय
निरयः<BR>—1 Hell; निरयनगरद्वारमुद्घाटयन्ती Bh. 1. 63; Ms. 6. 61.<BR>—2 Sorrow, unhappiness; सततं निरयं प्राप्तः परपिण्डोपजीविनः<BR> Mb. 1. 141. 37.<BR>—3 Sin; दुर्लभो ह्यस्य निरयः शशाङ्कस्येव कल्मषम् Rām. 2. 36. 27.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निरयवर्त्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरयवर्त्मन्
निरयः + -वर्त्मन् <i>n.</i> active worldly life (प्रवृत्तिमार्ग); येषां<BR> गृहे निरयवर्त्मनि वंर्ततां वः स्वर्गापवर्गविरमः स्वयमास विष्णुः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 82. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवहानिका
निरवहानि(लि)का A fence, an outer wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरवहालिका
निरवहानि(लि)का A fence, an outer wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरस्
निरस् €4 P.<BR>—1 To cast out, throw or drive away, give up, quit, drive or send back;<BR> निरस्तगाम्भीर्यमपास्तपुष्पकम् Śi. 1. 55, 9. 63.<BR>—2 To destroy, ward off, defeat, annihilate, dispel; अह्नाय तावदरुणेन<BR> तमो निरस्तम् R. 5. 70; रक्षांसि वेदीं परितो निरास्थत् Bk. 1. 12, 2. 36.<BR>—3 To turn out, remove, expel, banish; गृहान्निरस्ता न तेन वैदेहसुता<BR> मनस्तः R. 14. 84.<BR>—4 To throw out, discharge (as arrows).<BR>—5 To reject, repudiate, decline.<BR>—6 To refute, confute, controvert (as arguments).<BR>—7 To eclipse, obscure, throw into the back-ground; यशांसि सर्वेषुभृतां<BR> निरास्थत् Bk. 1. 3.<BR>—8 To tear out, strip off.<BR>—9 To stretch out (as a hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0911-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरस्त|निरस्तः
निरस्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Cast off or away, thrown out or away, repudiated, driven, expelled,<BR> banished; कौलीनभीतेन गृहान्निरस्ता R. 14. 84.<BR>—2 Dispelled, destroyed.<BR>—3 Abandoned, deserted.<BR>—4 Removed, deprived or void of; निरस्तपादपे देश एरण्डोपि द्रुमायते H. 1. 67.<BR>—5 Discharged (as an arrow).<BR>—6 Refuted.<BR>—7 Vomited, spit out.<BR>—8 Uttered rapidly; सर्वे ऊष्माणोऽग्रस्ता अनिरस्ता विवृता वक्तव्याः<BR> Ch. Up. 2. 22. 5.<BR>—9 Torn out or destroyed.<BR>—10 Suppressed, checked.<BR>—11 Broken (as an agreement &c.).<BR>—12 Thrown off (as from a horse).<BR>—13 Offered, given; त्वं पुण्डरीकमुख बन्धुतया निरस्तमेको निवापसलिलं<BR> पिबसीत्ययुक्तम् Māl. 9. 40.<BR>—14 Rejected, disallowed.<BR>—15 Sent forth or away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरस्तः|निरस्त
निरस्त + .{@-स्तः@} An arrow discharged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरस्तम्
निरस्त + .{@-स्तम्@}<BR>—1 Rejecting, refusal &c.<BR>—2 Dropping or leaving out, rapid pronunciation.<BR>—3 Spitting out.<BR>—4 Preventing, warding of.<BR>—5 Throwing or casting.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निरस्तभदे, निरस्तराग, निरस्तसंख्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरस्तभदे
निरस्त + -भदे <i>a.</i> having all differences removed, same, identical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरस्तराग
निरस्त + -राग <i>a.</i> one who has renounced all worldly attachments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरस्तसंख्य
निरस्त + -संख्य <i>a.</i> innumerable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरसन|निरसनं
निरसन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Expelling, removing, driving away; निरसनैरसनैरवृथार्थता Śi. 6. 47.<BR>—2 Vomiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरसनम्
निरसन + .{@-नम्@} Expelling, ejecting, expulsion, removal.<BR>—2 Denial, contradiction, rejection, refusal.<BR>—3 Refutation.<BR>—4 Vomiting forth, spitting out.<BR>—5 Checking, suppressing.<BR>—6 Destruction, killing, extirpation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरासः|निरास
निरासः<BR>—1 Ejection, expulsion, throwing out, removal.<BR>—2 Vomiting.<BR>—3 Refutation, contradiction.<BR>—4 Opposition.<BR>—5 Dropping (a sound or letter &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरस|निरसः
निरस <i>a.</i> [निवृत्तो रसो यस्मात् प्रा˚ ब˚] Tasteless, insipid, dry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरसः|निरस
निरस + .{@-सः@}<BR>—1 Want of flavour, insipidity, tastelessness.<BR>—2 Want of juice, dryness.<BR>—3 Want of passion or feeling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकः|निराक
निराकः<BR>—1 Cooking.<BR>—2 Sweat.<BR>—3 The recompense of a bad action (v. l. for निपाक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकुल
निराकुल^1 <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Full of, filled or covered with; अलिकुलसंकुलकुसुमसमूहनिराकुलबकुलकलापे Gīt. 1.<BR>—2 Distressed; see under निर् also.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकृ
निराकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To expel, drive away, repudiate; उग्रंपश्येन सुग्रीवस्तेन भ्राता<BR> निराकृतः Bk. 6. 100; R. 14. 57.<BR>—2 To refute (as an opinion).<BR>—3 To give up, abandon.<BR>—4 To destroy completely, annihilate.<BR>—5 To revile, contemn, slight.<BR>—6 To oppose, obstruct, contradict.<BR>—7 To refuse, decline, reject.<BR>—8 To omit.<BR>—9 To disappoint, frustrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकरणम्
निराकरणम्<BR>—1 Repudiating, expelling, turning away; निराकरणविक्लवा Ś. 6.<BR>—2 Banishing.<BR>—3 Obstruction, contradiction, opposition, rejection.<BR>—4 Refutation, reply.<BR>—5 Contempt.<BR>—6 Neglecting the chief sacrificial duties.<BR>—7 Forgetting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकरिष्णु|निराकरिष्णुः
निराकरिष्णु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Repudiating, turning out, expelling; न चावदद्भर्तुरवर्णमार्या<BR> निराकरिष्णोर्वृजिनादृतेऽपि R. 14. 57; निराकरिष्णू वर्तिष्णू वर्धिष्णू<BR> परतो रणम् Bk. 5. 1.<BR>—2 Hindering from, obstructive.<BR>—3 Spurning, disdaining.<BR>—4 Seeking to deprive one of a thing.<BR>—5 Forgetful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकारः|निराकार
निराकारः Reproach, censure; see under निर् also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकृत|निराकृतः
निराकृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Expelled, banished.<BR>—2 Refuted.<BR>—3 Overtaken, held; भविष्यत्यचिरात् साधो कलिनापि निराकृतः Bhāg. 11. 7. 4.<BR>—4 Despised, &c.; see निराकृ above.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निराकृतान्योत्तर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकृतान्योत्तर
निराकृत + -अन्योत्तर <i>a.</i> irrefutable, unanswerable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराकृतिः|निराकृति
निराकृतिः <i>f.</i>, निराक्रिया<BR>—1 Repudiation, expulsion, rejection.<BR>—2 Refusal.<BR>—3 Obstruction, obstacle, impediment, interruption.<BR>—4 Opposition, also see under निर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराक्रिया
निराकृतिः <i>f.</i>, निराक्रिया<BR>—1 Repudiation, expulsion, rejection.<BR>—2 Refusal.<BR>—3 Obstruction, obstacle, impediment, interruption.<BR>—4 Opposition, also see under निर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निराग
निराग <i>a.</i> Passionless, dispassionate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरादिष्ट
निरादिष्ट <i>a.</i> Paid off as a debt; निरादिष्टधनश्चेत्तु प्रतिभूः<BR> स्यादलङ्घनः । स्वधनादेव तद्दद्यान्निरादिष्ट इति स्थितिः ॥ Ms. 8. 162.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरादेशः|निरादेश
निरादेशः Complete payment of a debt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरासः|निरास
निरासः See under निरस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरामालुः|निरामालु
निरामालुः The wood-apple (कपित्थ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरिङ्गिणी
निरिङ्गिणी, -नी<BR> A veil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरिङ्गिनी|निरिंगिनी
निरिङ्गिणी, -नी<BR> A veil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीक्ष्
निरीक्ष् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To gaze at steadfastly, mark or view completely; (धेन्वा) … निरीक्ष्यमाणः<BR> सुतरां दयालुः R. 2. 52; यावदेतान् निरीक्षेऽहं योद्धुकामानवस्थितान्<BR> Bg. 1. 22; Ms. 4. 38.<BR>—2 To look for, search after; निरीक्षते केलिवनं प्रविश्य क्रमेलकः<BR> कण्टकजालमेव Vikr. 1. 29.<BR>—3 To observe, perceive, contemplate, view.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीक्षक
निरीक्षक <i>a.</i> Looking at, observing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीक्षणम्
निरीक्षणम्, निरीक्षा, निरीक्षितम्<BR>—1 A look.<BR>—2 Looking at, regarding, seeing, beholding; मधुरैरवशानि लम्भयन्नपि<BR> तिर्यञ्चि शमं निरीक्षितैः Ki. 2. 55.<BR>—3 Looking out for, searching.<BR>—4 Consideration, regard; निरीक्षया as to, in respect of.<BR>—5 Hope, expectation.<BR>—6 Aspect of planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीक्षा
निरीक्षणम्, निरीक्षा, निरीक्षितम्<BR>—1 A look.<BR>—2 Looking at, regarding, seeing, beholding; मधुरैरवशानि लम्भयन्नपि<BR> तिर्यञ्चि शमं निरीक्षितैः Ki. 2. 55.<BR>—3 Looking out for, searching.<BR>—4 Consideration, regard; निरीक्षया as to, in respect of.<BR>—5 Hope, expectation.<BR>—6 Aspect of planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीक्षितम्
निरीक्षणम्, निरीक्षा, निरीक्षितम्<BR>—1 A look.<BR>—2 Looking at, regarding, seeing, beholding; मधुरैरवशानि लम्भयन्नपि<BR> तिर्यञ्चि शमं निरीक्षितैः Ki. 2. 55.<BR>—3 Looking out for, searching.<BR>—4 Consideration, regard; निरीक्षया as to, in respect of.<BR>—5 Hope, expectation.<BR>—6 Aspect of planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीशम्
निरीशम् (-षम्)<BR> A plough-share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरीषम्
निरीशम् (-षम्)<BR> A plough-share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुक्त|निरुक्तं
निरुक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Expressed, pronounced, explained, defined<BR>—2 Loud, distinct.<BR>—3 Enjoined, decided; पात्रं त्वत्र निरुक्तं वै कविभिः पात्रवित्तमैः Bhāg. 7. 14. 34.<BR>—4 Interpreted, accomplished (as a word); proved from<BR> शब्दप्रमाण (as शब्दैकगम्य); वेदांश्च वेद्यं तु विधिं च<BR> कृत्स्नमथो निरुक्तं परमार्थतां च Mb. 12. 245. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुक्तम्
निरुक्त + .{@-क्तम्@}<BR>—1 Explanation, derivation, etymological interpretation. स वा एष आत्मा<BR> हृदि तस्यैतदेव निरुक्तं हदयमिति Ch. Up. 8. 3. 3; महत्त्वाद्भारवत्त्वाच्च<BR> महाभारतमुच्यते । निरुक्तमस्य यो वेद सर्वपापैः प्रमुच्यते ॥ Mb. 1. 1. 274.<BR>—2 N. of one of the six Vedāṅgas, that which contains glossarial explanation<BR> of obscure words, especially those occurring in the Vedas; नाम च धातुजमाह निरुक्ते Nir.<BR>—3 N. of a celebrated commentary on the Nighaṇṭus<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">Page0913-1</a>]<BR> by Yāska.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निरुक्तकारः, निरुक्तजः, निरुक्तवृत्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0912-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुक्तकारः|निरुक्तकार
निरुक्त + -कारः N. of the sage Yāska.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुक्तजः|निरुक्तज
निरुक्त + -जः one of the twelve kinds of sons allowed by the old Hindu<BR> law (= क्षेत्रजः q. v.); आत्मा पुत्रश्च विज्ञेयस्तस्यानन्तरजश्च<BR> यः । निरुक्तजश्च विज्ञेयः सुतः प्रसृतजस्तथा ॥ Mb. 13. 49. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुक्तवृत्तिः|निरुक्तवृत्ति
निरुक्त + -वृत्तिः N. of a com. on Yāskaʼs निरुक्त by Durgācārya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुक्तिः|निरुक्ति
निरुक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Derivation, etymological interpretation of words; जरत्कारुनिरुक्तिं<BR> त्वं यथावद्वक्तुमर्हसि Mb. 1. 40. 2.<BR>—2 (In Rhet.) An artificial explanation of the derivation of a word; thus<BR> defined:− निरुक्तिर्योगतो नाम्नामन्यार्थत्वप्रकल्पनम् । ईदृशैश्चरितैर्जाने<BR> सत्यं दोषाकरो भवान् ॥ Candr. 5. 168 (where दोषाकरः is equal<BR> to दोषाणामाकरः).<BR>—3 (In drama.) communication of an event that has taken place.<BR>—4 N. of Yāskaʼs commentary on the Nighaṇṭus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुत्सुक
निरुत्सुक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Exceedingly anxious.<BR>—2 Unconcerned, indifferent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुध्
निरुध् €7 U.<BR>—1 To obstruct, stop, oppose, block up; न्यरुन्धंश्चास्य पन्थानम् Bk. 17. 49, 16. 20;<BR> Mk. 1. 22.<BR>—2 To confine, lock up; विप्रदुष्टां स्त्रियं भर्ता निरुन्ध्यादेकवेश्मनि<BR> Ms. 11. 176; सर्वद्वाराणि संयम्य मनो हृदि निरुध्य च Bg. 8. 12.<BR>—3 To cover, hide; Ms. 10. 16.<BR>—4 To keep off, remove.<BR>—5 To curb, restrain, check; अभूतलस्पर्शतयानिरुद्धतः Ś. 7. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुद्ध|निरुद्धः
निरुद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Obstructed, hindered, checked, restrained, curbed; निरुद्धोऽप्यावेगः<BR> स्फुरदधरनासापुटतया परेषामुन्नेयो भवति च भराध्मातहृदयः U. 1. 29.<BR>—2 Confined, imprisoned; जामातृयज्ञेन वयं निरुद्धाः U. 1. 11.<BR>—3 Covered, veiled.<BR>—4 Filled with, full of.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निरुद्धकण्ठ, निरुद्धगुदः, निरुद्धप्रकशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुद्धकण्ठ|निरुद्धकंठ
निरुद्ध + -कण्ठ <i>a.</i> having oneʼs breath obstructed, choked, suffocated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुद्धगुदः|निरुद्धगुद
निरुद्ध + -गुदः obstruction of the rectum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरुद्धप्रकशः|निरुद्धप्रकश
निरुद्ध + -प्रकशः stricture of the urethra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरोधः|निरोध
निरोधः, निरोधनम्<BR>—1 Confinement, locking up, imprisonment; Bhāg. 10. 58. 58; निरोधनेन<BR> बन्धेन विविधेन वधेन च (निगृह्णीयात्) Ms. 8. 310; वैश्यः सर्वखदण्डः<BR> स्यात् संवत्सरनिरोधतः 375.<BR>—2 Enclosing, covering up; Amaru. 87.<BR>—3 Restraint, check, suppression, control; योगश्चित्तवृत्तिनिरोधः<BR> Yoga S.; अन्तश्चराणां मरुतां निरोधान्निवातनिष्कम्पमिव प्रदीपम् Ku. 3. 48.<BR>—4 Hindrance, obstruction, opposition.<BR>—5 Hurting, punishing, injuring.<BR>—6 Annihilation, complete destruction; जन्मनिरोधं प्रवदन्ति यस्य<BR> Śvet. Up. 3. 21.<BR>—7 Aversion, dislike.<BR>—8 Disappointment, frustration of hopes (in dramatic language).<BR>—9 (With the Buddhists) Suppression of pain.<BR>—10 Extinction (लय), निरोधोऽस्यानुशयनमात्मनः सह शक्तिभिः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 10. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरोधनम्
निरोधः, निरोधनम्<BR>—1 Confinement, locking up, imprisonment; Bhāg. 10. 58. 58; निरोधनेन<BR> बन्धेन विविधेन वधेन च (निगृह्णीयात्) Ms. 8. 310; वैश्यः सर्वखदण्डः<BR> स्यात् संवत्सरनिरोधतः 375.<BR>—2 Enclosing, covering up; Amaru. 87.<BR>—3 Restraint, check, suppression, control; योगश्चित्तवृत्तिनिरोधः<BR> Yoga S.; अन्तश्चराणां मरुतां निरोधान्निवातनिष्कम्पमिव प्रदीपम् Ku. 3. 48.<BR>—4 Hindrance, obstruction, opposition.<BR>—5 Hurting, punishing, injuring.<BR>—6 Annihilation, complete destruction; जन्मनिरोधं प्रवदन्ति यस्य<BR> Śvet. Up. 3. 21.<BR>—7 Aversion, dislike.<BR>—8 Disappointment, frustration of hopes (in dramatic language).<BR>—9 (With the Buddhists) Suppression of pain.<BR>—10 Extinction (लय), निरोधोऽस्यानुशयनमात्मनः सह शक्तिभिः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 10. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूढ|निरूढः
निरूढ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Conventional, become current in popular usage, accepted (as the meaning<BR> of a word, as opposed to its यौगिक or etymological sense); द्यौर्न<BR> काचिदथवास्ति निरूढा सैव सा चलति यत्र हि चित्तम् N. 5. 57.<BR>—2 Unmarried.<BR>—3 Drawn out, purged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूढः|निरूढ
निरूढ + .{@-ढः@}<BR>—1 Inherence (as of ‘redness’ in the word ‘red’).<BR>—2 (In Rhet.) The accepted and popular meaning of a word.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निरूढलक्षणा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूढलक्षणा
निरूढ + -लक्षणा a <i>Lakṣaṇā</i> or secondary use of a word which is<BR> based not on the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">Page0913-2</a>]<BR> <i>Vivakṣā</i> or particular intention of the speaker but on its accepted<BR> and popular sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूढिः|निरूढि
निरूढिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Fame, celebrity.<BR>—2 Familiarity, conversancy, proficiency; नृप विद्यासु निरूढिमागता Ki. 2. 6.<BR>—3 Confirmation.<BR>—4 = निरूढलक्षणा q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूप्
निरूप् €10 U.<BR>—1 To see, perceive, mark or observe carefully; न च महावने पन्था<BR> निरूपितः K. 120.<BR>—2 To investigate, examine, look out for, search.<BR>—3 To fix upon, determine, settle, resolve.<BR>—4 To choose, select, appoint.<BR>—5 To reflect, consider.<BR>—6 To act, represent dramatically, gesticulate.<BR>—7 To perform.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूपक
निरूपक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Observing; observer.<BR>—2 Stating, determining, defining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूपणम्
निरूपणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Form, shape.<BR>—2 Sight, seeing.<BR>—3 Looking for, searching.<BR>—4 Ascertaining, investigation; determination.<BR>—5 Definition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूपणा
निरूपणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Form, shape.<BR>—2 Sight, seeing.<BR>—3 Looking for, searching.<BR>—4 Ascertaining, investigation; determination.<BR>—5 Definition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूपित|निरूपितः
निरूपित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Seen, discovered, marked, beheld.<BR>—2 Appointed, chosen, selected; निरूपितः सर्वसहो गदाभृता Bhāg. 9. 5. 9;<BR> केदारकर्मणि निरूपितः 5. 9. 11.<BR>—3 Weighed, considered.<BR>—4 Ascertained, determined.<BR>—5 Pointed against, shot off; अस्त्राण्यमोघमहिमानि निरूपितानि नो पस्पृशुर्नृहरिदासमिवासुराणि<BR> Bhāg. 1. 15. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूपितिः|निरूपिति
निरूपितिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Definition (of an idea); ascertainment.<BR>—2 Investigation, examination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूप्य
निरूप्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be seen, defined or ascertained.<BR>—2 Not yet certain, questionable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूहः|निरूह
निरूहः<BR>—1 An enema, not of an oily kind.<BR>—2 Logic, disputation.<BR>—3 Certainty, ascertainment.<BR>—4 A purging clyster.<BR>—5 A sentence having no ellipsis, a complete sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरूहणम्
निरूहणम्<BR>—1 Ascertainment.<BR>—2 Administering enemas not of an oily kind.<BR>—3 Causing to purge with a clyster.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरृ
निरृ €3 P. Ved.<BR>—1 To go out from, depart, leave.<BR>—2 To be excluded, become deprived of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरृत
निरृत <i>a.</i> Dissolved, decaying, enervated; weakened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरृतिः|निरृति
निरृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Decay, destruction, dissolution; विद्यादलक्ष्मीकतमं जनानां मुखे<BR> निबद्धां निरृतिं वहन्तम् Mb. 1. 87. 9, 5. 36. 8.<BR>—2 A calamity, evil, bane, adversity; हिंसाया निरृतेर्मृत्योर्निरयस्य<BR> गुदः स्मृतः Bhāg. 2. 6. 9; सा हि लोकस्य निरृतिः U. 5. 30.<BR>—3 An imprecation, a curse.<BR>—4 Death or destruction personified, the goddess of death or destruction,<BR> the regent of the south-western quarter; Bhāg. 1. 19. 4; पाकयज्ञविधानेन<BR> यजेत निरृतिं निशि Ms. 11. 119.<BR>—5 The bottom of the earth.<BR>—6 The asterism Mūla. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 Death or genius of death; राज्यकामो मनून् देवान्निरृतिं त्वभिचरन्<BR> यजेत् Bhāg. 2. 3. 9.<BR>—2 N. of one of the 8 Vasus.<BR>—3 N. of a Rudra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0913-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरृथः|निरृथ
निरृथः<BR>—1 Destruction.<BR>—2 The Sāma Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निरेभ
निरेभ <i>a.</i> Noiseless; दूनास्तेऽरिबलादूना निरेभा बहु मेनिरे Ki. 15. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गन्धनम्
निर्गन्धनम् Killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गम्
निर्गम् €1 P.<BR>—1 To go out or forth, depart; प्रकाशं निर्गतः Ś. 4; हुतवहपरिखेदादाशु<BR> निर्गत्य कक्षात् Ṛs. 1. 27; Ms. 9. 83; Amaru. 61; Ś. 3. 25, 6. 4.<BR>—2 To spring forth, arise; अन्यदर्ककिरणेभ्यो निर्गतम् K. 136.<BR>—3 To remove; as in निर्गतविशङ्कः.<BR>—4 To be cured of a disease.<BR>—5 To come out or appear (as a bud); चूतानां चिरनिर्गतापि कलिका बध्नाति<BR> न स्वं रजः Ś. 6. 3.<BR>—6 To go away, disappear.<BR>—7 To be freed from (with abl.).<BR>—8 To enter into or attain to any state, undergo, suffer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गः|निर्ग
निर्गः Country, region, place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गत|निर्गतः
निर्गत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Come forth or out, appeared.<BR>—2 Gone away, departed.<BR>—3 Disappeared, become extinct.<BR>—4 Freed from.<BR>—5 Removed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गमः|निर्गम
निर्गमः<BR>—1 Going forth or out, going away; यावदादिशति पार्थिवस्तयोर्निर्गमाय<BR> पुरमार्गसत्क्रियाम् R. 11. 3.<BR>—2 Departure, vanishing, passing away; तेन तस्य मधुनिर्गमात् कृशश्चित्तयोनिरभवत्<BR> पुनर्नवः R. 19. 46.<BR>—3 A door, an outlet, egress; कथमप्यवाप्तनिर्गमः प्रययौ K. 159.<BR>—5 Exit, issue.<BR>—6 Exportplace (of goods); आगमं निर्गमं स्थानं तथा वृद्धिक्षयावुभौ ।<BR> विचार्य सर्वपण्यानां कारयेत् कयविक्रयौ ॥ Ms. 8. 401.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गमनम्
निर्गमनम्<BR>—1 Going out or forth.<BR>—2 A door.<BR>—3 A chamberlain, doorkeeper (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गलित
निर्गलित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Flowed out.<BR>—2 Dissolved, melted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ग्राह्य
निर्ग्राह्य <i>a.</i> Perceivable; विदग्धैर्निर्ग्राह्यो न पुनरविदग्धैरतिशयः U. 4. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्गूढः|निर्गूढ
निर्गूढः The hollow of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ग्रन्थनम्
निर्ग्रन्थनम् Killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घण्टः|निर्घण्ट|निर्घंट|निर्घंटं|निर्घंटः
निर्घण्टः, -टम्<BR>—1 A vocabulary, collection of words.<BR>—2 A table of contents (सूचीपत्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घण्टम्
निर्घण्टः, -टम्<BR>—1 A vocabulary, collection of words.<BR>—2 A table of contents (सूचीपत्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घर्षणम्
निर्घर्षणम् Rubbing, friction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घर्षणक
निर्घर्षणक <i>a.</i> Rubbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घर्षणकम्
निर्घर्षणक + .{@-कम्@} A dentifrice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घातः|निर्घात
निर्घातः<BR>—1 Destruction.<BR>—2 A whirlwind, a violent gust of wind, hurricane.<BR>—3 The noise of contending winds (vapours ?) &c. in the sky; कुरुकुलनिधनोत्पातनिर्घातवातः;<BR> Ve. 1. 22; निर्घातोग्रैः कुञ्जलीनाञ् जिघांसुर्ज्यानिर्घोषैः क्षोभयामास सिंहान्<BR> R. 9. 64; Ms. 1. 38, 4. 105, 7; Y. 1. 145; (वायुना निहतो वायुर्गगनाच्च<BR> पतत्यधः । प्रचण्डघोरनिर्घोषो निर्घात इति कथ्यते ॥.)<BR>—4 An earth-quake.<BR>—5 A thunderstroke; निर्घातश्च महानासीत् साकं च स्तनयित्नुभिः Bhāg. 1. 14. 15.<BR>—6 A stroke in general; अहह दारुणो दैवनिर्घातः U. 2.<BR>—7 An unusual event boding calamity (उत्पात); तस्मिन्मुहूर्ते संप्राप्ते<BR> निर्घाताश्चापतन्मुहुः Mb. 3. 40. 23; Ms. 1. 38; Bhāg. 3. 17. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घातनम्
निर्घातनम् Forcing out, bringing out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घूरिणी
निर्घूरिणी A river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्घोषः|निर्घोष
निर्घोषः<BR>—1 A sound in general; Ve. 4; स्निग्धगम्भीरनिर्घोषमेकं स्यन्दनमास्थितौ R. 1. 36.<BR>—2 A loud noise, rattling, twanging &c.; ज्यानिर्घोषैः क्षोभयामास सिंहान्<BR> R. 9. 64; भारतीनिर्घोषः U. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जर्जल्प
निर्जर्जल्प <i>a.</i> Ved. Ragged, tatterd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जात
निर्जात <i>a.</i> Visible, come forth, appeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जि
निर्जि €1 P.<BR>—1 To conquer, defeat; R. 3. 51; अनेकशो निर्जितराजकस्त्वम् Bk. 2. 52, 7. 94;<BR> Y. 3. 292.<BR>—2 To win, acquire by conquest.<BR>—3 To vanquish in a play.<BR>—4 To surpass, excel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जयः|निर्जय
निर्जयः, -निर्जितिः <i>f.</i><BR> Complete victory, subjugation, vanquishing; विपर्यासं<BR> यथा मेरोर्वासवस्येव निर्जयम् Mb. 7. 193. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जितिः|निर्जिति
निर्जयः, -निर्जितिः <i>f.</i><BR> Complete victory, subjugation, vanquishing; विपर्यासं<BR> यथा मेरोर्वासवस्येव निर्जयम् Mb. 7. 193. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जित|निर्ज्जितः
निर्जित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Conquered completely, vanquished.<BR>—2 Acquired, gained, won.<BR>—3 Claimed; स दत्त्वा निर्जितां वृद्धिं करणे परिवर्तयेत् Ms. 8. 154.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्जितेन्द्रियः|निर्जितेन्द्रिय
निर्जित + .{@-इन्द्रियः@} a saint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्झरः|निर्झर|निर्झरं
निर्झरः, -रम्<BR>—1 A spring, waterfall, cataract, cascade, mountain-torrent;<BR> शीतं निर्झरवारि पानम् Nāg. 4; R. 2. 13; Śānti. 2. 17, 21, 4. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्झरम्
निर्झरः, -रम्<BR>—1 A spring, waterfall, cataract, cascade, mountain-torrent;<BR> शीतं निर्झरवारि पानम् Nāg. 4; R. 2. 13; Śānti. 2. 17, 21, 4. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्झरः|निर्झर|निर्झरं
निर्झरः, -रम् + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 Burning chaff.<BR>—2 An elephant.<BR>—3 A horse of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्झरिन्
निर्झरिन् <i>m.</i> A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्झरिणी
निर्झरिणी, निर्झरी A river, mountain-torrent; स्खलनमुखरभूरिस्रोतसो<BR> निर्झरिण्यः U. 2. 20; Mv. 5. 40; जटाकटाहसंभ्रमन्निलिम्पनिर्झरीविलोलवीचिवल्लरीविराजमानमूर्धनि<BR> Śivatāṇḍavastotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्झरी
निर्झरिणी, निर्झरी A river, mountain-torrent; स्खलनमुखरभूरिस्रोतसो<BR> निर्झरिण्यः U. 2. 20; Mv. 5. 40; जटाकटाहसंभ्रमन्निलिम्पनिर्झरीविलोलवीचिवल्लरीविराजमानमूर्धनि<BR> Śivatāṇḍavastotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णयः|निर्णय
निर्णयः, निर्णीत, निर्णेतृ &c. See under निर्णी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णीत|निर्णीतं
निर्णयः, निर्णीत, निर्णेतृ &c. See under निर्णी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णेतृ
निर्णयः, निर्णीत, निर्णेतृ &c. See under निर्णी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णरः|निर्णर
निर्णरः N. of one of the horses of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णामः|निर्णाम|निर्ण्णाम
निर्णामः Ved.<BR>—1 The joint of a wing (?).<BR>—2 Excesive bending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णिज्
निर्णिज् €3 U.<BR>—1 To wash, clean, purify: अम्बुनिर्णिक्तम् Y. 1. 191; Ms. 5. 127.<BR>—2 To dress oneself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णिक्त|निर्णिक्तं
निर्णिक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Washed, purified, cleansed; तोयनिर्णिक्तपाणयः R. 17. 22.<BR>—2 Expiated, atoned. एनस्विभिरनिर्णिक्तैर्नार्थं किंचिसत् माचरेत् Ms. 11. 189.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निर्णिक्तबाहुवलय, निर्णिक्तमनस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णिक्तबाहुवलय
निर्णिक्त + -बाहुवलय <i>a.</i> with polished bracelet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णिक्तमनस्
निर्णिक्त + -मनस् <i>a.</i> pure-hearted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णिक्तिः|निर्णिक्ति
निर्णिक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Washing.<BR>—2 Expiation, atonement; वृद्धातिक्रमसंभृतस्य महतो निर्णिक्तये पाप्मनः<BR> प्रायश्चेतनमादिशन्तु गुरवो रामेण दान्तस्य मे Mv. 4. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णिज्
निर्णिज् <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Clearing, washing.<BR>—2 Well-nourished. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A form, shape.<BR>—2 A bright or shining garment.<BR>—3 Purification, washing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णेकः|निर्णेक
निर्णेकः<BR>—1 Washing, cleaning; purification; तस्मात्तयोः स्वयोन्यैव निर्णेको गुणवत्तरः Ms. 5. 113.<BR>—2 Ablution.<BR>—3 Atonement, expiation; दानेन वधनिर्णेकं सर्पादीनामशक्नुवन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0914-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णेजकः|निर्णेजक
निर्णेजकः A washerman; कारुकान्नं प्रजां हन्ति बलं निर्णेजकस्य<BR> च Ms. 4. 219, 216.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णेजनम्
निर्णेजनम्<BR>—1 Ablution.<BR>—2 Expiation, atonemet (for an offence).<BR>—3 Water for washing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णी
निर्णी €1 P.<BR>—1 To take or carry away or off.<BR>—2 To determine, ascertain, settle, decide, come to a decision, fix, resolve<BR> upon; कथमप्युपायमात्मनैव निर्णीय Dk.; Ki. 11. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णयः|निर्णय
निर्णयः<BR>—1 Removing, removal.<BR>—2 Complete ascertainment, decision, affirmation, determination, settlement;<BR> संदेहनिर्णयो जातः Ś. 1. 27; Ms. 8. 301, 409, 9. 250; Y. 2. 10;<BR> हृदयं निर्णयमेव धावति Ki. 2. 29.<BR>—3 Deduction, inference, conclusion, demonstration (in logic).<BR>—4 Discussion, investigation, consideration<BR>—5 Sentence, verdict, judgment; बाहुवीर्याश्रिते मार्गे वर्तसे दीप्तनिर्णये<BR> Mb. 3. 292. 2; सर्वज्ञस्याप्येकाकिनो निर्णयाभ्युपगमो दोषय M. 1.<BR>—6 Application of a conclusive argument.<BR>—7 (In Rhet.) Narration of events.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निर्णयोपमा, निर्णयपादः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णयोपमा
निर्णयः + -उपमा <i>f.</i> a^1 comparison based upon an inference; Kāv. 2. 27.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by . Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/6b5cd78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णयपादः|निर्णयपाद
निर्णयः + -पादः a sentence, decree, verdict (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णयनम्
निर्णयनम्^1<BR>—1 Ascertainment, determination.<BR>—2 Positive conclusion, settlement.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णायक
निर्णायक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Settling, conclusive;<BR>—2 Determining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णायनम्
निर्णायनम्<BR>—1 Making certain.<BR>—2 The outer angle of the elephantʼs ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णीत|निर्णीतं
निर्णीत <i>p. p.</i> Settled, decided, determined, resolved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णेतृ
निर्णेतृ <i>a.</i> Decisive, conclusive. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A judge.<BR>—2 A voucher.<BR>—3 A guide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णुद्
निर्णुद् €6 U.<BR>—1 To throw back, reject; धाना मत्स्यान् पयो मांसं शाकं चैव न निर्णुदेत् Ms. 4. 250.<BR>—2 To remove, dispel.<BR>—3 To drive away, expel.<BR>—4 To repudiate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्णोदः|निर्णोद
निर्णोदः Removal, banishment; (यवः) निर्णोदः सर्वपापानाम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दट|निर्द्दटः
निर्दट, -ड <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unkind, unfeeling, unmerciful.<BR>—2 Rejoicing over the faults of others.<BR>—3 Envious.<BR>—4 Abusive, slanderous.<BR>—5 Useless, unnecessary.<BR>—6 Violent.<BR>—7 Mad, intoxicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दड
निर्दट, -ड <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unkind, unfeeling, unmerciful.<BR>—2 Rejoicing over the faults of others.<BR>—3 Envious.<BR>—4 Abusive, slanderous.<BR>—5 Useless, unnecessary.<BR>—6 Violent.<BR>—7 Mad, intoxicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दर|निर्दरः|निर्द्दर|निर्द्दरं
निर्दर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Hard.<BR>—2 Pitiless.<BR>—3 Shameless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दरः|निर्दर|निर्द्दर|निर्द्दरं
निर्दर + .{@-रः@},<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दरिः|निर्दरि|निर्द्दरि
निर्दर + .{@-रः@} + .({@-रिः@})<BR>—1 A cave, cavern; सन्तीह गिरिदुर्गणि निर्दराः कन्दराणि च Rām. 3. 67. 5, 4. 13. 6.<BR>—2 waterfall, spring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दरम्
निर्दर + .{@-रम्@} Essence (सार).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निर्दरवासिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दरवासिन्
निर्दर + -वासिन् <i>a.</i> inhabiting a cave; गिरिनिर्दरवासिनाम् Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दलनम्
निर्दलनम् Splitting, breaking, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दह्
निर्दह् €1 P.<BR>—1 To burn, consume.<BR>—2 To torment, distress, pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दग्ध|निर्द्दग्ध
निर्दग्ध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Burnt; तया स्वकाये निर्दग्धे मुच्यते किल्बिषात्ततः Ms. 11. 90.<BR>—2 Unburnt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दहन|निर्द्दहनः
निर्दहन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Burning, consuming.<BR>—2 Without fire or heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दहनम्
निर्दहन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Burning, consuming.<BR>—2 Semecarpus Anacardium (Mar. बिब्बा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दातृ|निर्द्दातृ
निर्दातृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A digger up of weeds, weeder.<BR>—2 A donor.<BR>—3 A husbandman, reaper; ययोद्धरति निर्दाता कक्षं धान्यं च रक्षति Ms. 7. 110.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दारित|निर्द्दारित
निर्दारित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Torn, rent.<BR>—2 Opened, split open; क्रूरनिर्दारिताक्षः Śi. 18. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दिग्ध|निर्द्दिग्धः
निर्दिग्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Anointed, smeared.<BR>—2 Well-fed, corpulent, stout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दिग्धा
निर्दिग्ध + .{@-ग्धा@} Solanum Jacquini (Mar. कांटे रिंगणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दिश्
निर्दिश् €6 P.<BR>—1 To point out, indicate, show; एकैकं निर्दिशन् Ś. 7; अङ्गुल्या निर्दिशति &c.<BR>—2 To assign, give; निर्दिष्टां कुलपतिना स पर्णशालामध्यास्य R. 1. 95.<BR>—3 To allude to, mention, make a reference to.<BR>—4 To foretell, predict.<BR>—5 To advise, recommend.<BR>—6 To tell, communicate.<BR>—7 To enjoin, direct.<BR>—8 To enumerate, specify, name.<BR>—9 To define, determine.<BR>—10 To describe.<BR>—11 To denounce, accuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्दिष्ट|निर्द्दिष्टः
निर्दिष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Pointed out, shown, indicated.<BR>—2 Specified, particularized.<BR>—3 Described.<BR>—4 Assigned, allotted.<BR>—5 Asserted, declared.<BR>—6 Ascertained, determined.<BR>—7 Ordered.<BR>—8 Learned, wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्देशः|निर्देश|निर्द्देशः
निर्देशः<BR>—1 Pointing out, showing, indicating.<BR>—2 Order, command, direction; तमशक्यमपाक्रष्टुं निर्देशात् स्वर्गिणः<BR> पितुः R. 12. 17 (v. l. निदेशात्).<BR>—3 Advice, instruction.<BR>—4 Telling, saying, declaring.<BR>—5 Specifying, particularization, specification, specific mention; अयुक्तोऽयं<BR> निर्देशः Mbh.; ॐ तत्सदिति निर्देशो ब्रह्मणस्त्रिविधः स्मृतः Bg. 17. 23.<BR>—6 Ascertainment.<BR>—7 Vicinity, proximity.<BR>—8 Description, designation.<BR>—9 Agreement, promise; कृताशं कृतनिर्देशं कृतभक्तं कृतश्रमम् ।<BR> भेदैर्ये व्यपकर्षन्ति ते वै निरयगामिनः ॥ Mb. 13. 23. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्देशक
निर्देशक <i>a.</i> Pointing out, showing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्देश्य
निर्देश्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be pointed out.<BR>—2 To be determined or described.<BR>—3 To be proclaimed or foretold.<BR>—4 Expiable (प्रायाश्चित्तार्ह); सुरापानं ब्रह्महत्या गुरुतल्पमथापि<BR> वा । अनिर्देश्यानि मन्यन्ते प्राणान्तमिति धारणा ॥ Mb. 12. 165. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्देष्टृ
निर्देष्टृ <i>m.</i> An authority, a guide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धार|निर्धारः
निर्धार, -रणम् &c.<BR> See under निर्धृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धारणम्
निर्धार, -रणम् &c.<BR> See under निर्धृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धाव्
निर्धाव् €1 P.<BR>—1 To wash off or away, cleanse; निर्धौते सति हरिचन्दने जलौघैः<BR> Śi. 8. 51; निर्धौतदानामलगण्डभित्तिः R. 5. 43.<BR>—2 To stream forth, spring from.<BR>—3 To run out or escape from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धौत|निर्धौतं
निर्धौत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Washed off, cleansed R. 5. 43.<BR>—2 Polished, bright; निर्धौतहारगुलिकाविशदं हिमाम्भः R. 5. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धू
निर्धू €5. €9 U.<BR>—1 To shake or throw off, remove, dispel, expel, destroy; निर्धूतोऽधरशोणिमा Gīt. 12;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">Page0916-1</a>]<BR> ज्ञाननिर्धूतकल्मषाः Bg. 5. 17; R. 12. 57.<BR>—2 To spurn, treat with contempt, disregard; परुषाणि च संश्राव्य निर्धूतोऽस्मि<BR> बलीयसा Rām. 4. 8. 32.<BR>—3 To abandon, forsake, throw away.<BR>—4 To repudiate, disown, reject.<BR>—5 To afflict, torment, distress.<BR>—6 To move about, brandish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0915-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धूत|निर्धूतं|निर्धूतः
निर्धूत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Shaken off, removed; dispelled.<BR>—2 Deserted, rejected.<BR>—3 Deprived of, bereft.<BR>—4 Avoided.<BR>—5 Refuted.<BR>—6 Destroyed; अहं युष्मान् समाश्रित्य तपोनिर्धूतकल्मषान् Rām. 7. 36. 57.<BR>—7 Broken, divided.<BR>—8 Suffered, undergone.<BR>—9 Cast off or away, thrown away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धूतः|निर्धूत|निर्धूतं
निर्धूत + .{@-तः@} A man deserted by his relations and friends.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धूननम्
निर्धूननम् Heaving, fluctuating (of the sea); Ku.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धृ
निर्धृ €1 P., €10 U.<BR>—1 To determine accurately, settle, fix; निर्धारितेऽर्थे लेखेन खलूक्त्वा<BR> खलु वाचिकम् Śi. 2. 70, 9. 20.<BR>—2 To specify, particularize.<BR>—3 To take out from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धारः|निर्धार
निर्धारः, -निर्धारणम्<BR>—1 Specifying or separating one out of many; यतश्च निर्धारणम् P. II. 3. 41, V. 3. 92.<BR>—2 Determining, deciding.<BR>—3 Certainty, ascertainment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धारणम्
निर्धारः, -निर्धारणम्<BR>—1 Specifying or separating one out of many; यतश्च निर्धारणम् P. II. 3. 41, V. 3. 92.<BR>—2 Determining, deciding.<BR>—3 Certainty, ascertainment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धारित|निर्धारितं
निर्धारित <i>p. p.</i> Determined, ascertained, fixed, settled, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्धार्य|निर्धार्य्य|निर्धार्य्यं
निर्धार्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Ascertainable.<BR>—2 Resolute, energetic.<BR>—3 Bold, fearless, actively working.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ध्यात
निर्ध्यात <i>a.</i> thought of, meditated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बन्ध्|निर्बंध्
निर्बन्ध् €9 P.<BR>—1 To press, urge, importune.<BR>—2 To insist upon, persist in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बद्ध
निर्बद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Fixed or fastened upon.<BR>—2 Urged, importuned, pressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बन्धः|निर्बन्ध|निर्बंध|निर्बंधः|निर्ब्बन्ध
निर्बन्धः<BR>—1 Insisting upon, persistence, intentness, pertinacity; निर्बन्धसंजातरुषा<BR> (गुरुणा) R. 5. 21; Ku. 5. 66.<BR>—2 Importunity, a pressing demand or request, urgency; निर्बन्धपृष्टः<BR> स जगाद सर्वम् R. 14. 32; अत एव खलु निर्बन्धः Ś. 3.<BR>—3 Obstinacy; चकार तद्वधोपायान्निर्बन्धेन युधिष्ठिरः Bhāg. 7. 5. 42.<BR>—4 A great effort, perseverance; वयमभ्युद्धृताः कृच्छ्रान्निर्बन्धादार्ययानया Māl. 10. 19.<BR>—4 Accusation.<BR>—5 A contest, dispute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बन्धिन्
निर्बन्धिन् <i>a.</i> Insisting upon; महत्यनर्थे निर्बन्धी बलवांश्च<BR> विशेषतः Mb. 5. 144. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्बर्हण|निर्ब्बर्हण|निर्ब्बर्हणं
निर्बर्हण See निबर्हण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भग्न
निर्भग्न <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shattered, broken in pieces.<BR>—2 Bent, bowed.<BR>—3 Devoid of (हीन); असावत्यन्तनिर्भग्नस्तव पुत्रो भविष्यति ।<BR> अनाथवत्सुखेभ्यश्च राजवंशाच्च वत्सले ॥ Rām. 2. 8. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भट|निर्भटः
निर्भट <i>a.</i> Hard, firm (दृढ.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भर्त्स्
निर्भर्त्स् €10 Ā.<BR>—1 To revile, censure, abuse.<BR>—2 To surpass, eclipse, put to shame; अशोकनिर्भर्त्सितपद्मकारम् Ku. 3. 53.<BR>—3 To menace; उपवनं निरभर्त्सयत प्रियान् वियुवतीर्युवतीः शिशिरानिलः Śi. 6. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भर्त्सनम्
निर्भर्त्सनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Threat, menace; जननीनिर्भर्त्सनविवृद्धमन्युना (शिशुना) Śi. 15. 87.<BR>—2 Abuse, reproach, reviling, blame.<BR>—3 Malignity.<BR>—4 Red paint, lac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भर्त्सना
निर्भर्त्सनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Threat, menace; जननीनिर्भर्त्सनविवृद्धमन्युना (शिशुना) Śi. 15. 87.<BR>—2 Abuse, reproach, reviling, blame.<BR>—3 Malignity.<BR>—4 Red paint, lac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भर्त्सित|निर्भर्त्सितं
निर्भर्त्सित^1 <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Threatened.<BR>—2 Abused, reproached.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20160413. note: rs is not possible. Its meaning also gets along nirBartsita..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भा
निर्भा €2 P.<BR>—1 To shine, forth, shine; अक्षबीजवलयेन निर्बभौ R. 11. 66.<BR>—2 To proceed, arise, start into view; वेदाद्धर्मो हि निर्बभौ Ms. 5. 44, 2. 10.<BR>—3 To look like, seem to be; Mb. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भासः|निर्भास
निर्भासः Appearing or shining forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भिद्
निर्भिद् €7 U.<BR>—1 To tear up, burst or tear asunder, break or pierce through; अनेन<BR> निर्भिन्नतनुः स वध्यः V. 5. 6; Bk. 9. 67; निर्भिद्योपरि कर्णिकारमुकुलान्यालीयते<BR> षट्पदः V. 2. 23.<BR>—2 To disclose, betray, divulge; निर्भिन्नप्रायं रहस्यम् Dk., वृत्तान्तैकदेशं<BR> निर्विभेद <i>ibid.</i>; Śi. 16. 23; U. 3. 1.<BR>—3 To break down, destroy.<BR>—4 To ascertain, find out, discover.<BR>—5 To excavate.<BR>—6 To put out (the eyes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भिन्न
निर्भिन्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Split asunder, broken open, rent.<BR>—2 Pierced through, transfixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भेद|निर्भेदः
निर्भेद<BR>—1 Bursting, dividing, splitting asunder.<BR>—2 A split, rent.<BR>—3 Disclosure, betrayal.<BR>—4 Explicit mention or declaration; निर्भेदादृतेऽपि मालविकायामयमुपन्यासः<BR> शङ्कयति M. 4.<BR>—5 The bed of a river.<BR>—6 Determination of an affair, event.<BR>—7 Destruction; पृथिव्याश्चापि निर्भेदो दृष्ट एव सनातनः Rām. 1. 40. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भेद्य
निर्भेद्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having no rent.<BR>—2 Not to be pierced through.<BR>—3 Disappointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भुग्न
निर्भुग्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Distorted.<BR>—2 straight.<BR>—3 Bent.<BR>—4 Pressing against each other; एकीकृतस्त्वचि निषिक्त इवावपीड्य निर्भुग्नपीनकुचकुड्मलयानया<BR> मे Māl. 6. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्भूति
निर्भूति <i>f.</i> Ved. Disappearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मन्थ्|निर्मंथ्
निर्मन्थ् €1. €9 P.<BR>—1 To churn, shake, stir round; अमृतस्यार्थे निर्मथिष्यामहे जलम् Mb.<BR>—2 To produce or excite fire by rubbing.<BR>—3 To bruise, thresh, beat violently.<BR>—4 To destroy completely, crush down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मथः|निर्मथ
निर्मथः, निर्मथनम्, निर्मन्थः, निर्मन्थनम्, निर्माथः<BR>—1 Rubbing, churning, stirring.<BR>—2 The wood used for producing fire by friction.<BR>—3 Rubbing two pieces of wood together to produce fire.<BR>—4 Destruction, havoc; ब्रह्मच्छद्मा निखिलभुवनस्तोमनिर्माथयोग्यः<BR> Mv. 2. 25; विनिवर्तित एष धीरपोतः पृतनानिर्मथनात्त्वयोपहूतः U. 5. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निर्मथदारु<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मथनम्
निर्मथः, निर्मथनम्, निर्मन्थः, निर्मन्थनम्, निर्माथः<BR>—1 Rubbing, churning, stirring.<BR>—2 The wood used for producing fire by friction.<BR>—3 Rubbing two pieces of wood together to produce fire.<BR>—4 Destruction, havoc; ब्रह्मच्छद्मा निखिलभुवनस्तोमनिर्माथयोग्यः<BR> Mv. 2. 25; विनिवर्तित एष धीरपोतः पृतनानिर्मथनात्त्वयोपहूतः U. 5. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निर्मथदारु<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मन्थः|निर्मन्थ|निर्मंथ|निर्मंथः
निर्मथः, निर्मथनम्, निर्मन्थः, निर्मन्थनम्, निर्माथः<BR>—1 Rubbing, churning, stirring.<BR>—2 The wood used for producing fire by friction.<BR>—3 Rubbing two pieces of wood together to produce fire.<BR>—4 Destruction, havoc; ब्रह्मच्छद्मा निखिलभुवनस्तोमनिर्माथयोग्यः<BR> Mv. 2. 25; विनिवर्तित एष धीरपोतः पृतनानिर्मथनात्त्वयोपहूतः U. 5. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निर्मथदारु<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मन्थनम्
निर्मथः, निर्मथनम्, निर्मन्थः, निर्मन्थनम्, निर्माथः<BR>—1 Rubbing, churning, stirring.<BR>—2 The wood used for producing fire by friction.<BR>—3 Rubbing two pieces of wood together to produce fire.<BR>—4 Destruction, havoc; ब्रह्मच्छद्मा निखिलभुवनस्तोमनिर्माथयोग्यः<BR> Mv. 2. 25; विनिवर्तित एष धीरपोतः पृतनानिर्मथनात्त्वयोपहूतः U. 5. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निर्मथदारु<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्माथः|निर्माथ
निर्मथः, निर्मथनम्, निर्मन्थः, निर्मन्थनम्, निर्माथः<BR>—1 Rubbing, churning, stirring.<BR>—2 The wood used for producing fire by friction.<BR>—3 Rubbing two pieces of wood together to produce fire.<BR>—4 Destruction, havoc; ब्रह्मच्छद्मा निखिलभुवनस्तोमनिर्माथयोग्यः<BR> Mv. 2. 25; विनिवर्तित एष धीरपोतः पृतनानिर्मथनात्त्वयोपहूतः U. 5. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: निर्मथदारु<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मथदारु
निर्मथः + -दारु<BR>—1 = 2 above.<BR>—2 a churning-stick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मन्थ्य|निर्मंथ्य|निर्म्मन्थ्य
निर्मन्थ्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be stirred or churned.<BR>—2 To be produced by friction (as fire).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मन्थ्यम्
निर्मन्थ्य + .{@-थ्यम्@} The wood used for producing fire by friction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्माथिन्
निर्माथिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Grinding down, crushing.<BR>—2 Churning.<BR>—3 Rubbing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0916-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मा|निर्म्मा
निर्मा €3 Ā., €2 P.<BR>—1 To make, create, bring into existence; निर्मातुं प्रभवेन्मनोहरमिदं<BR> रूपं पुराणो मुनिः V. 1. 9; यस्मादेष सुरेन्द्राणां मात्राभ्यो निर्मितो<BR> नृपः Ms. 7. 5, 1. 13.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To build, form, construct; स्नायुनिर्मिता एते पाशाः H. 1.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To cause to be settled, colonize (as a town &c.); निर्ममे निर्ममोऽर्थेषु<BR> मथुरां मधुराकृतिः R. 15. 28.<BR>—3 To cause, produce; शलाकाञ्जननिर्मितेव Ku. 1. 47.<BR>—4 To compose, write; स्वनिर्मितया टीकया समेतं काव्यम्.<BR>—5 To prepare, manufacture in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मा|निर्म्मा
निर्मा Value, measure, equivalent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्माणम्
निर्माणम्<BR>—1 Measuring, meting out; यतश्चाध्वकालनिर्माणम् P. I. 4. 31. Vārt.<BR>—2 Measure, reach, extent; अयमप्राप्तनिर्माणः (बालः) Rām.<BR> ‘not having reached the full measure of growth’.<BR>—3 Producing. forming, making, creation, formation, manufacture; त्रैलोक्यनिर्माणकरं<BR> जनित्रम् Mb. 5. 71. 7; ईदृशो निर्माणभागः परिणतः U. 4.<BR>—4 A creation, created thing or object, form; निर्माणमेव हि तदादरलालनीयम् Māl. 9. 49.<BR>—5 A shape, make, figure; शरीरनिर्माणसदृशो नन्वस्यानुभावः Mv. 1.<BR>—6 Composition, work.<BR>—7 A building.<BR>—8 A part, portion.<BR>—9 Essence, pith, marrow.<BR>—10 (With Buddhists) Transformation.<BR>—11 Happening, birth; पूर्वनिर्माणबद्धा हि कालस्य गतिरीदृशी Rām. 7. 106. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्माणा
निर्माणम् + .{@-णा@} Fitness, propriety, decorum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मित|निर्म्मित|निर्म्मितं
निर्मित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Constructed, built, formed, prepared, made &c.<BR>—2 (in law) Fixed, settled; एवं धर्मं विजानीमः प्राक् प्रजापतिनिर्मितम् Ms. 9. 46.<BR>—3 Artificial.<BR>—4 Performed, celebrated (a ceremony); ज्योतिष्टोमायुषी चैवमतिरात्रौ<BR> च निर्मितौ Rām. 1. 14. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मितिः|निर्मिति|निर्म्मिति|निर्म्मितिः
निर्मितिः <i>f.</i> Production, creation, formation, any artistic production;<BR> नवरसरुचिरां निर्मितिमादधती भारती कवेर्जयति K. P. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्माल्य|निर्म्माल्य|निर्म्माल्यं
निर्माल्य <i>a.</i> Pure, clean, stainless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्माल्यम्
निर्माल्य + .{@-ल्यम्@}<BR>—1 Purity, clearness, stainlessness.<BR>—2 The remains of an offering to a deity, such as flowers; निर्माल्योज्झितपुष्पदामनिकरे<BR> का षट्पदानां रतिः Ś. Til. 10.<BR>—3 Flowers used and cast off, faded or withered flowers; निर्माल्यैरथ<BR> ननृतेऽवधीरितानां Śi. 8. 60.<BR>—4 Remains in general; निर्माल्यं नयनश्रियः कुवलयम् B. R. 1. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मुच्
निर्मुच् €6 P.<BR>—1 To free, liberate, release; हिमनिर्मुक्तयोर्योगे चित्राचन्द्रमसोरिव<BR> R. 1. 46; Bg. 7. 28.<BR>—2 To leave, quit, abandon.<BR>—3 To cast off; निर्मुच्यमान इव जीर्णतनुर्भुजङ्गः Mk. 3. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मुक्त|निर्मुक्तः|निर्म्मुक्त
निर्मुक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Set free, freed, liberated; R. 1. 46.<BR>—2 Freed from worldly attachments.<BR>—3 Separated, disjoined.<BR>—4 Pressed out; फुल्लं कुरबकं पश्य निर्मुक्तालक्तकप्रभम् Bu. C. 4. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मुक्तः|निर्मुक्त|निर्म्मुक्त
निर्मुक्त + .{@-क्तः@} A snake which has lately cast off its skin; आददानाश्च<BR> नाराचान्निर्मुक्ताशीविषोपमान् Mb. 6. 44. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मुक्तिः|निर्मुक्ति
निर्मुक्तिः <i>f.</i> Freedom, liberation; स्वमूर्त्या लोकलावण्यनिर्मुक्त्या<BR> लोचनं नृणाम् Bhāg. 11. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मुमुक्षु
निर्मुमुक्षु^1 <i>a.</i> One who longs for final beatitude; व्यवसायं<BR> तनयस्य निर्मुमुक्षोः (निशम्य) Bu. C. 5. 39.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8089dd2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मोकः|निर्मोक|निर्म्मोक|निर्म्मोकः
निर्मोकः<BR>—1 Setting free, liberating.<BR>—2 A hide, skin; मृगनिर्मोकवसनाश्चीरवल्कलवाससः Mb. 13. 141. 100.<BR>—3 The slough of a serpent; स्तनोत्तरीयाणि भवन्ति सङ्गान्निर्मोकपट्टाः<BR> फणिभिर्विमुक्ताः R. 16. 17; Śi. 20. 47; N. 1; महोरगविनिर्मुक्तानेक<BR> निर्मोकभास्वराम् Śiva B. 31. 62.<BR>—4 Armour, mail.<BR>—5 The sky, heaven.<BR>—6 Atmosphere; निर्मोको मोचने व्योम्नि सन्नाहे सूर्यकञ्चुके Med.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मोक्षः|निर्मोक्ष|निर्म्मोक्षः
निर्मोक्षः Liberation, deliverance; न चोपलेभे पूर्वेषामृणनिर्मोक्षसाधनम् R. 10. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मोचनम्
निर्मोचनम् Liberation, deliverance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मूल्
निर्मूल् €10 U. To eradicate, extirpate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मूलनम्
निर्मूलनम् Eradication, uprooting, extirpating (fig. also); कर्मनिर्मूलनक्षमः Bh. 3. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मृज्
निर्मृज् €2 P. To wipe off, wash out; तेषु दर्भेषु तं हस्तं निर्मृज्याल्लेपभागिनाम् Ms. 3. 216.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मार्जनम्
निर्मार्जनम् Cleaning, washing off, wiping out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्मृष्ट
निर्मृष्ट <i>p. p.</i> Wiped off, washed out, rubbed out; निर्मृष्टरागोऽधरः S. D. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यत्
निर्यत् €10 U.<BR>—1 To return, restore; न्यासभूतमिदं राज्यं तव निर्यातयाम्यहम्<BR> Rām. 4. 10, 9; निर्यातय हस्तन्यासम् V. 5; Ms. 11. 164.<BR>—2 To requite, repay, retaliate; रामलक्ष्मणयोर्वैरं स्वयं निर्यातयामि वै Rām.<BR>—3 To forgive, pardon. ━<i>Caus.</i> To snatch away, give trouble; निर्यात्यमानानि<BR> च सात्त्विकानि (दृष्ट्वा) Mb. 12. 354. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यत्
निर्यत् <i>a.</i> Coming out, issuing; फुल्लत्फणापीठनिर्यद्विषज्योतिः<BR> Māl. 5. 23; उरस्यस्य भ्रश्यत्कबरभरनिर्यत्सुमनसः पतन्ति स्वर्बालाः<BR> Lakṣmīlaharī 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यातित|निर्य्यातित
निर्यातित <i>a.</i> Restored; returned; हस्त्यश्वरथसंपूर्णं राज्यं<BR> निर्यातितं तया Rām. 2. 75. 16<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यातनम्
निर्यातनम्<BR>—1 Returning, restoring, delivering, restitution (as of a deposit).<BR>—2 Payment of a debt.<BR>—3 Gift, donation,<BR>—4 Retaliation, requital, revenge (as in वैरनिर्यातन); न ह्यन्यस्य<BR> भवेच्छक्तिः वैरनिर्यातनं प्रति Hariv.<BR>—5 Killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्या
निर्या €2 P.<BR>—1 To go out, go out of; निर्ययावथ पौलस्त्यः पुनर्युद्धाय मन्दिरात् R. 12. 83.<BR>—2 To pass, elapse (as time). —3 To weed (a field). ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To drive away; तेजसा मणिना हीनं शिबिरान्निरयापयत् Bhāg. 1. 7. 56.<BR>—2 To begin, start performing; प्रजापतेस्ते श्वशुरस्य साम्प्रतं निर्यापितो<BR> यज्ञमहोत्सवः किल Bhāg. 4. 3. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्याणम्
निर्याणम्<BR>—1 Exit, issue, setting out, departure.<BR>—2 Vanishing, disappearing.<BR>—3 Dying, death.<BR>—4 Eternal emancipation, final beatitude.<BR>—5 The outer corner of the eye of an elephant; वारणं निर्याणभागेऽभिघ्नन्<BR> Dk. 97; निर्याणनिर्यदसृजं चलितं निषादी Śi. 5. 41; Mātaṅga L. 6. 9, 12. 19.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">Page0918-1</a>]<BR>—6 A rope for tying cattle or the feet of a calf, a foot-rope in general;<BR> निर्याणहस्तस्य पुरो दुधुक्षतः Śi. 12. 41.<BR>—7 Iron.<BR>—8 Decamping (of an army)<BR>—9 Going out (of cattle to the pasture ground).<BR>—10 A road leading out of a town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0917-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्याणिक
निर्याणिक <i>a.</i> Conducive to emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यात|निर्य्यात
निर्यात <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Gone out, issued &c.<BR>—2 Laid aside (as money).<BR>—3 Conversant with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यातिः|निर्याति
निर्यातिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Exit, departure.<BR>—2 Departure from life, dying, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यापणम्
निर्यापणम् Banishing, expelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यामः|निर्याम|निर्य्याम
निर्यामः A sailor, pilot, boatman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यामकः|निर्यामक
