निर्यासः|निर्यास|निर्यासं|निर्य्यास
निर्यासः, -सम्<BR>—1 Exudation of trees or plants, gum, juice, resin; शालनिर्यासगन्धिभिः<BR> R. 1. 38; Ms. 5. 6.<BR>—2 Extract, infusion, decoction; अवकिरति नितान्तं कान्तिनिर्यासमब्दस्रुतनवजलपाण्डुं<BR> पुण्डरीकोदरेषु Śi. 11. 62.<BR>—3 Any thick fluid substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यासम्
निर्यासः, -सम्<BR>—1 Exudation of trees or plants, gum, juice, resin; शालनिर्यासगन्धिभिः<BR> R. 1. 38; Ms. 5. 6.<BR>—2 Extract, infusion, decoction; अवकिरति नितान्तं कान्तिनिर्यासमब्दस्रुतनवजलपाण्डुं<BR> पुण्डरीकोदरेषु Śi. 11. 62.<BR>—3 Any thick fluid substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्यूहः|निर्यूह|निर्य्यूह
निर्यूहः<BR>—1 A pinnacle, turret, projection (on columns or gates); अनेकविधप्रासादहर्म्यवलभीनिर्यूहशतसंकुलम्<BR> (अपश्यत्) Mb. 1. 3. 133; वितर्दिनिर्यूहविटङ्कनीडः Śi. 3. 55.<BR> (where Mālli. renders निर्यूह by मत्तवारणाख्य अपाश्रयः and<BR> quotes Vaijayantī; perhaps it was so called from its resemblance to the<BR> shape of an elephant in rut); चारुतोरणनिर्यूहा Rām.<BR>—2 A chaplet, crest, head-ornament; बद्धाभरणनिर्यूहाः Mb. 5. 155. 12.<BR>—3 A peg projecting from a wall.<BR>—4 Wood placed in a wall for pigeons to build their nests or to perch<BR> upon; Śi. 3. 55.<BR>—5 A door, gate.<BR>—6 Extract, decoction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्योगः|निर्योग
निर्योगः<BR>—1 Dress, decoration; निर्योगाद् भूषणान्माल्यात् सर्वेभ्योऽर्धं प्रदाय मे<BR> Pratimā 1. 26.<BR>—2 A rope for tying cows; अस्पन्दनं गतिमतां पुलकस्तरूणां निर्योगपाशकृतलक्षणयोर्विचित्रम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 21. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्योलः|निर्योल
