निर्लुञ्चनम्
निर्लुञ्चनम् Pulling out or off, tearing off, peeling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लुण्ठनम्
निर्लुण्ठनम्<BR>—1 Robbing, plundering.<BR>—2 Tearing off; अङ्कानीव परस्परं विदधते निर्लुण्ठनं सुभ्रुवः S. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लेखनम्
निर्लेखनम्<BR>—1 Scraping, scratching.<BR>—2 An instrument for scraping, a scraper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्लोच्य
निर्लोच्य <i>ind.</i> Having meditated, pondered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्ल्वयनी
निर्ल्वयनी The slough of a snake; यद्यथाऽहिनिर्ल्वयनी वल्मीके<BR> मृता प्रत्यस्ता शयीता Bṛ. Up. 4. 4. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वच्
निर्वच् €2 P.<BR>—1 To interpret, explain; वेदा निर्वक्तुमक्षमाः.<BR>—2 To derive, trace to its etymology (as a word).<BR>—3 To relate, tell, declare, announce.<BR>—4 To name, call.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वचनम्
निर्वचनम्<BR>—1 Utterance, pronunciation.<BR>—2 A proverbial expression, proverb; न निर्मन्युः क्षत्रियोऽस्ति लोके<BR> निर्वचनं स्मृतम् Mb. 3. 27. 37.<BR>—3 Etymological interpretation, etymology. नामनिर्वचनं तस्य श्लोकमेनं<BR> सुरा जगुः Mb. 9. 20. 37.<BR>—4 A vocabulary, an index.<BR>—5 Praise (प्रशंसा); प्रनष्टं शान्तनोर्वंशं समीक्ष्य पुनरुद्धृतम् ।<BR> ततो निर्वचनं लोके सर्वराष्ट्रेष्ववर्तत ॥ Mb. 1. 109. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वप्
निर्वप् €1 P.<BR>—1 To pour out, sprinkle; अपसव्येन हस्तेन निर्वपेदुदकं भुवि Ms. 3. 214, 215.<BR>—2 To scatter, strew (as seed).<BR>—3 To offer, present; श्रोत्रियायाभ्यागताय वत्सतरीं वा महोक्षं वा<BR> निर्वपन्ति गृहमेधिनः U. 4.<BR>—4 To offer libations especially to the manes.<BR>—5 To perform.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वपण|निर्व्वपण|निर्व्वपणं
निर्वपण <i>a.</i>, -णी<BR>—1 Relating to oblations.<BR>—2 Pouring out, scattering.<BR>—3 Giving, bestowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वपणी
निर्वपण <i>a.</i>, -णी<BR>—1 Relating to oblations.<BR>—2 Pouring out, scattering.<BR>—3 Giving, bestowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वपणम्
निर्वपण <i>a.</i>, -णी + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Pouring out, offering.<BR>—2 Particularly, the presentation of funeral offerings to the manes, a<BR> libation; अनयैवावृता कार्यं पिण्डनिर्वपणं सुतैः Ms. 3. 248, 260;<BR> Bhāg. 5. 12. 12.<BR>—3 Bestowing presents.<BR>—4 Gift, donation.<BR>—5 A vessel (ladle &c.) for pouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वापः|निर्वाप|निर्व्वाप|निर्व्वापः
निर्वापः See निर्वपणम्. Bestowing, offering; निर्वापार्थं पशूनां<BR> ते ददृशुस्तत्र सर्वशः Rām. 2. 91. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वयनी|निर्व्वयनी
निर्वयनी The slough of a snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वर्ण्
निर्वर्ण् €10 U.<BR>—1 To look at carefully, mark attentively; Māl. 7.<BR>—2 To see, behold, observe, perceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वर्णनम्
निर्वर्णनम्<BR>—1 Looking at, seeing, sight.<BR>—2 Marking, observing carefully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निर्वस्
निर्वस् €1 P.<BR>—1 To live out, <i>i. e.</i> to go to the end of (as a period).<BR>—2 To dwell abroad. ━<i>Caus.</i> To banish, drive away, expel; निर्वासिताप्येवमतस्त्वयाहं<BR> तपस्विसामान्यमवेक्षणीया R. 14. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0918-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

