निशा + -अन्ध + .({@-न्धा@}) the creeper called जतुका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0924-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

