निशाकरः|निशाकर
निशा + -करः<BR>—1 the moon; बहुलेऽपि गते निशाकरस्तनुतां दुःखमनङ्ग मोक्ष्यति<BR> Ku. 4. 13; द्विजावली बालनिशाकरांशुभिः.<BR>—2 a cock.<BR>—3 camphor.<BR>—4 N. of the numeral 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0924-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निशाकेतुः|निशाकेतु
निशा + -केतुः the moon<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0924-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निशागृह
निशा + -गृह a bed-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0924-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

निशाक्षयः|निशाक्षय
निशा + -क्षयः close of night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0924-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

