नीतिः + -कुशल, -ज्ञ, -निपुण, -निष्ण, -विद् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one versed in politics, a statesman, politician.<BR>—2 prudent, wise; किं चित्रं यदि राजनीतिकुशलो राजा भवेद्धार्मिकः Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिनिष्ण
नीतिः + -कुशल, -ज्ञ, -निपुण, -निष्ण, -विद् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one versed in politics, a statesman, politician.<BR>—2 prudent, wise; किं चित्रं यदि राजनीतिकुशलो राजा भवेद्धार्मिकः Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिविद्
नीतिः + -कुशल, -ज्ञ, -निपुण, -निष्ण, -विद् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one versed in politics, a statesman, politician.<BR>—2 prudent, wise; किं चित्रं यदि राजनीतिकुशलो राजा भवेद्धार्मिकः Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिघोषः|नीतिघोष
नीतिः + -घोषः N. of the car of Bṛhaspati.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिदोषः|नीतिदोष
नीतिः + -दोषः error of conduct, mistake in policy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिबीजम्
नीतिः + -बीजम् a germ or source of intrigue; ˚निर्वापणं कृतम् Pt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिविद्या
नीतिः + -विद्या<BR>—1 political science, political economy.<BR>—2 moral science, ethics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिविषयः|नीतिविषय
नीतिः + -विषयः the sphere of morality or prudent conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिव्यतिक्रमः|नीतिव्यतिक्रम
नीतिः + -व्यतिक्रमः<BR>—1 transgression of the rules of moral or political science.<BR>—2 error of conduct, mistake in policy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिशतकम्
नीतिः + -शतकम् the 100 verses on morality by Bhartṛhari.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिशास्त्रम्
नीतिः + -शास्त्रम् the science of ethics or of politics; morality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिसन्धिः|नीतिसन्धि
नीतिः + -सन्धिः method of policy; सुकृत्यं विष्णुगुप्तस्य मित्राप्तिर्भार्गवस्य<BR> च । वृहस्पतेरविश्वासो नीतिसन्धिस्त्रिधा स्थितः ॥ Pt. 2. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीतिमत्|नीतिमन्त्
नीतिमत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Skilled in politics.<BR>—2 Wise, prudent, sagacious.<BR>—3 Moral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीथः|नीथ
नीथः Ved.<BR>—1 Leading, guiding.<BR>—2 A guide, leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीथा
नीथः + .{@-था@} A way, trick, art.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीथा
नीथः + .{@-था, -थम्@} A mode in music, a song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीथम्
नीथः + .{@-था, -थम्@} A mode in music, a song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेय
नेय <i>a.</i> Fit to be carried.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नेयार्थ, नेयार्थक<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेयार्थ
नेय + -अर्थ, -अर्थक <i>a.</i> (a word or sentence) having a sense<BR> that can be only guessed; ग्राम्योऽप्रतीतसन्दिग्धनेयार्थनिहतार्थता S. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेयार्थक
नेय + -अर्थ, -अर्थक <i>a.</i> (a word or sentence) having a sense<BR> that can be only guessed; ग्राम्योऽप्रतीतसन्दिग्धनेयार्थनिहतार्थता S. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीका
नीका A channel for irrigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीकारः|नीकार
नीकारः See निकार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीकाश|नीकाशः
नीकाश <i>a.</i> See निकाश; resembling; आकर्णमुल्लसितमम्बु<BR> विकासिकाशनीकाशमाप समतां सितचामरस्य Śi. 5. 35; Ki. 11. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीक्षणम्
नीक्षणम् Ved. A stick for stirring up and testing boiling rice (पाकपरीक्षासाधन);<BR> यन्नीक्षणं मांस्पचन्याः उखायाः Rv. 1. 162. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीच|नीचः
नीच <i>a.</i> [निकृष्टतमीं शोभां चिनोति, चि-ड Tv.]<BR>—1 Low, short, small, little, dwarfish.<BR>—2 Situated below, being in a low position; नात्युच्छ्रितं नातिनीचं चैलाजिनकुशोत्तरम्<BR> Bg. 6. 11; Ms. 2. 198; Y. 1. 131.<BR>—3 Lowered, deep (as a voice).<BR>—4 Low, mean, base, vile, worst; प्रारभ्यते न खलु विध्नभयेन नीचैः<BR> Bh. 2. 27; नीचस्य गोचरगतैः सुखमास्यते कैः 59; Bv. 1. 48.<BR>—5 Worthless, insignificant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचः|नीच
नीच + .{@-चः@} A kind of perfume (चोरक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचा
नीच + .{@-चा@} An excellent cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचम्
नीच + .{@-चम्@} The lowest point of a planet.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नीचोक्तिः, नीचोच्चवृत्तम्, नीचोपगत, नीचग, नीचगामिन्, नीचगृहम्, नीचभोज्यः, नीचयोनिन्, नीचवज्रः, नीचवज्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचोक्तिः|नीचोक्ति
नीच + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i> a low or vulgar expression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचोच्चवृत्तम्
नीच + -उच्चवृत्तम् an epicycle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचोपगत
नीच + -उपगत <i>a.</i> situated low in the sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचग|नीचगं
नीच + -ग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 going downwards, descending (as a river); संयोजयति विद्यैव नीचगापि<BR> नरं सरित् । समुद्रमिव दुर्धर्षं नृपं भाग्यमतः परम् ॥ H.<BR>—2 low, base, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचगा
नीच + -ग + .({@-गा@}) a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचगम्
नीच + -ग + .({@-गम्@}) water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचगामिन्
नीच + -गामिन् <i>a.</i> following low courses (said of women).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचगृहम्
नीच + -गृहम् (in astr.) the part of the heavens in which a planet stands<BR> at its lower point; <i>e. g.</i> तुला of रवि, वृषभ of सोम,<BR> कर्क of मङ्गल, मीन of बुध, मकर of गुरु, कन्या of<BR> शुक्र, and मेष of शनि; cf. स्वौच्चात्तु यामित्रमुशन्ति नीचम् Yavaneśvara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचभोज्यः|नीचभोज्य
नीच + -भोज्यः onion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचयोनिन्
नीच + -योनिन् <i>a.</i> of low origin, low-born; so नीचजाति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचवज्रः|नीचवज्र|नीचवज्रं
नीच + -वज्रः, -वज्रम् a kind of gem. (वैक्रान्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचवज्रम्
नीच + -वज्रः, -वज्रम् a kind of gem. (वैक्रान्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचक|नीचकः
नीचक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Low, short, dwarfish.<BR>—2 Low, soft (as the voice).<BR>—3 Base, mean, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचका
नीच(चि)का An excellent cow; (also नीचिकी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचिका
नीच(चि)का An excellent cow; (also नीचिकी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचकिन्
नीचकिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 The top of anything.<BR>—2 The head of an ox.<BR>—3 The owner of a good cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचकैस्
नीचकैस् <i>ind.</i> See नीचैस् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचा
नीचा <i>ind.</i> Ved. Low, downward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचीकृ
नीचीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To lower (as the voice).<BR>—2 To utter without an accent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचीन
नीचीन <i>a.</i> Ved. Being low or below, downwards; (वटः) तस्य<BR> स्कन्धेभ्यो नीचीनाः … नदाः Bhāg. 5. 16. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचैस्
नीचैस् <i>ind.</i> (Often used with the force of an adjective)<BR>—1 Low, beneath, below, underneath, down, downward; (opp. उपरि);<BR> नीचैर्गच्छत्युपरि च दशा चक्रनेमिक्रमेण Me. 111.<BR>—2 Bowing down humbly, modestly; प्रवेश्य चैनं पुरमग्रयायी नीचैः R. 5. 62.<BR>—3 Gently, softly; नीचैर्वास्यति Me. 44.<BR>—4 In a low tone, with a low or depressed tone; नीचैः शंस हृदि स्थितो<BR> ननु स मे प्राणेश्वरः श्रोष्यति Amaru. 70; नीचैरनुदात्तः P. I. 2. 30.<BR>—5 Short, small, dwarfish; तथापि नीचैर्विनयाददृश्यत R. 3. 34. ━<i>m.</i><BR> N. of a mountain; नीचैराख्यं गिरिमधिवसेस्तत्र विश्रामहेतोः Me. 25.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नीचैर्गतिः, नीचैर्मुख<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचैर्गतिः|नीचैर्गति
नीचैस् + -गतिः <i>f.</i> slow pace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीचैर्मुख
नीचैस् + -मुख <i>a.</i> with downcast countenance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीडः|नीड|नीडं
नीडः, -डम्<BR> [नितरां मिलन्ति खगा अत्र नि-इल्-क लस्य डः Tv.]<BR>—1 A birdʼs nest; अंसव्यापि शकुन्तनीडनिचितम् Ś. 7. 11; नीडारम्भैर्गृहबलिभुजामाकुलग्रामचैत्याः Me.<BR>—2 A bed, couch.<BR>—3 A lair, den.<BR>—4 The interior or a seat of a carriage; एकरश्म्येकदमनमेकनीडं<BR> द्विकूबरम् Bhāg. 4. 26. 2.<BR>—5 A place in general, abode, resting place.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नीडोद्भवः, नीडजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीडम्
नीडः, -डम्<BR> [नितरां मिलन्ति खगा अत्र नि-इल्-क लस्य डः Tv.]<BR>—1 A birdʼs nest; अंसव्यापि शकुन्तनीडनिचितम् Ś. 7. 11; नीडारम्भैर्गृहबलिभुजामाकुलग्रामचैत्याः Me.<BR>—2 A bed, couch.<BR>—3 A lair, den.<BR>—4 The interior or a seat of a carriage; एकरश्म्येकदमनमेकनीडं<BR> द्विकूबरम् Bhāg. 4. 26. 2.<BR>—5 A place in general, abode, resting place.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नीडोद्भवः, नीडजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीडोद्भवः|नीडोद्भव
नीडः + -उद्भवः, -जः a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीडजः|नीडज
नीडः + -उद्भवः, -जः a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0934-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीडकः|नीडक
नीडकः<BR>—1 A bird.<BR>—2 A nest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीध्रम्
नीध्रम् (-व्रम्)<BR> [नितरां ध्रियते धृ मूलवि˚ क दीर्घः Tv.]<BR>—1 The edge of the thatch or roof; वलीकनीध्रे पटलप्रान्तेऽथ पटलं<BR> छदिः Ak.; गृहाणि नीध्रैरिव यत्र रेजुः Śi. 3. 49.<BR>—2 A wood.<BR>—3 The circumference of a wheel.<BR>—4 The moon.<BR>—5 The asterism रेवति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीव्रम्
नीध्रम् (-व्रम्)<BR> [नितरां ध्रियते धृ मूलवि˚ क दीर्घः Tv.]<BR>—1 The edge of the thatch or roof; वलीकनीध्रे पटलप्रान्तेऽथ पटलं<BR> छदिः Ak.; गृहाणि नीध्रैरिव यत्र रेजुः Śi. 3. 49.<BR>—2 A wood.<BR>—3 The circumference of a wheel.<BR>—4 The moon.<BR>—5 The asterism रेवति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीप|नीपः
नीप <i>a.</i> Situated low, deep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीपः|नीप
नीप + .{@-पः@}<BR>—1 The foot of a mountain.<BR>—2 A kind of कदम्ब (said to blossom in the rainy season; Adina Cordifolia<BR> Hook). The tree is known as हेडु or हेडकदम्ब in Marāthī.<BR> It is the same as हरिद्रकदम्बक or हरिद्रक. The wood of the<BR> tree is yellow and is still found employed in old buildings. नीपः प्रदीपायते<BR> Mk. 5. 14; सीमन्ते च त्वदुपगमजं यत्र नीपं वधूनाम् Me. 67; नवनीपाङ्कुरनन्दनीयशोभा Bhār. C.<BR>—3 A species of Aśoka; a kind of plant (Mar. दुपारी); कदम्बवेतसनलनीपवञ्जुलकैर्वृतम्<BR> (पयः) Bhāg. 8. 2. 17.<BR>—4 N. of a family of kings; नीपान्वयः पार्थिव एष यज्वा R. 6. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीपम्
नीप + .{@-पम्@} The flower of the Kadamba tree; नीपं दृष्ट्वा हरितकपिशं<BR> कैसरैरर्धरूढैः Me. 21; R. 19. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरम्
नीरम् [Uṇ. 2. 13]<BR>—1 Water; नीरान्निर्मलतो जनिः Bv. 1. 63.<BR>—2 Juice, liquor.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नीरचर, नीरज, नीरदः, नीरधरः, नीरधिः, नीरनिधिः, नीरप्रियः, नीररुहम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरचर
नीरम् + -चर <i>a.</i> Loitering in water, aquatic; नीरे नीरचरैः समं<BR> स भगवान्निद्राति नारायणः Bv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरज|नीरजं|नीरजः
नीरम् + -ज <i>a.</i> aquatic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरजः|नीरज|नीरजं
नीरम् + -ज + .({@-जः@})<BR>—1 an otter.<BR>—2 a kind of grass (उशीर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरजम्
नीरम् + -ज + .({@-जम्@})<BR>—1 a lotus; असि यद्यपि सर्वत्र नीरं नीरजमण्डितम् Udb.<BR>—2 a pearl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरदः|नीरद
नीरम् + -दः a cloud; धीरध्वनिभिरलं ते नीरद मे मासिको गर्भः<BR> Bv. 1. 61; Śi. 4. 52. नवीननीरदश्यामं रामं राजीवलोचनम् Rāmakavacha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरधरः
नीरम् + -धरः a cloud; नवनीलनीरधरधीरगर्जितक्षणे U. 6. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरधिः|नीरधि
नीरम् + -धिः, -निधिः the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरनिधिः|नीरनिधि
नीरम् + -धिः, -निधिः the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरप्रियः|नीरप्रिय
नीरम् + -प्रियः a kind of reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीररुहम्
नीरम् + -रुहम् a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीरङ्गी
नीरङ्गी <i>f.</i> Turmeric; नीरङ्गीछन्नवदनो गीयगानोरुमङ्गलः<BR> Gaṇeśa P. 2. 336.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीराज्
नीराज्^1 (निस्-राज्) <i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to shine, illuminate, make brilliant, adorn, irradiate; दिव्यास्त्रस्फुरदुग्रदीधितिशिखानीराजितज्यं<BR> धनुः U. 6. 18; नीराजयन्ति भूपालाः पादपीठान्तभूतलम् Prab. 2;<BR> Śi. 17. 17; N. 11. 96; प्रत्यग्रज्वलितैः पतङ्गमणिभिः नीराजिता भानवः A. R. 2. 10.<BR>—2 To perform the ceremony called नीराजन (q. v. below) over a person<BR> or thing (wave lights before one as a mark of respect or by way of worship);<BR> नानायोधसमाकीर्णो नीराजितहयद्विपः Kām. 4. 66.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170214. note: verb missing virAma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीराजनम्
नीराजनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Lustration of arms, a kind of military and religious ceremony performed<BR> by kings or generals of armies in the month of Āśvina before they took<BR> the field; (it was, so to say, a general purification of the kingʼs Purohita,<BR> the ministers, and all the various component parts of the army, together<BR> with the arms and implements of war, by means of sacred Mantras); तस्मै<BR> सम्यग् हुतो वह्निर्वाजिनीराजनाविधौ R. 4. 25, 17. 12; चक्रे स चक्रनिभचङ्क्रमणच्छलेन<BR> नीराजनां जनयतां निजबान्धवानाम् N. 1. 144.<BR>—2 Waving lights before an idol as an act of adoration; नीराजनाभिः<BR> सुभगाः सुभ्रुवः समभावयन्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">Page0935-2</a>]<BR> Śiva B. 6. 62; तुरङ्गमस्येव रणे निवृत्ते नीराजनाकौतुकमङ्गलानि<BR> Pratijñā. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीराजना
नीराजनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Lustration of arms, a kind of military and religious ceremony performed<BR> by kings or generals of armies in the month of Āśvina before they took<BR> the field; (it was, so to say, a general purification of the kingʼs Purohita,<BR> the ministers, and all the various component parts of the army, together<BR> with the arms and implements of war, by means of sacred Mantras); तस्मै<BR> सम्यग् हुतो वह्निर्वाजिनीराजनाविधौ R. 4. 25, 17. 12; चक्रे स चक्रनिभचङ्क्रमणच्छलेन<BR> नीराजनां जनयतां निजबान्धवानाम् N. 1. 144.<BR>—2 Waving lights before an idol as an act of adoration; नीराजनाभिः<BR> सुभगाः सुभ्रुवः समभावयन्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">Page0935-2</a>]<BR> Śiva B. 6. 62; तुरङ्गमस्येव रणे निवृत्ते नीराजनाकौतुकमङ्गलानि<BR> Pratijñā. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीराजित
नीराजित <i>a.</i> Shone upon, illuminated; समुन्मीलन्नीलाम्बुजनिकरनीराजितरुचाम्<BR> Lakṣmīlaharī 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नील|नीलं|नीलः
नील <i>a.</i> (-ला, -ली <i>f.</i>; the former in relation to clothes<BR> &c., the latter in relation to animals, plants &c.)<BR>—1 Blue, dark-blue; नीलस्निग्धः श्रयति शिखरं नूतनस्तोयवाहः U. 1. 33.<BR>—2 Dyed with indigo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलः|नील|नीलं
नील + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 The dark-blue or black colour.<BR>—2 Sapphire.<BR>—3 The Indian fig-tree.<BR>—4 N. of a monkey-chief in the army of Rāma.<BR>—5 ‘The blue mountain’, N. of one of the principal ranges of mountains.<BR>—6 A kind of bird, the blue Mainā.<BR>—7 An ox of a dark-blue colour.<BR>—8 One of the nine treasures of Kubera; see नवनिधि.<BR>—9 A mark.<BR>—10 An auspicious sound or proclamation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीला
नील + .{@-ला@}<BR>—1 The indigo plant.<BR>—2 A Rāgiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीले
नील + .{@-ले@} <i>f.</i> (du.)<BR>—1 The two arteries in front of the neck.<BR>—2 A black and blue mark on the skin; (for other senses see नीली.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलम्
नील + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 Black-salt.<BR>—2 Blue vitriol.<BR>—3 Antimony.<BR>—4 Poison.<BR>—5 Indigo, indigo dye.<BR>—6 Darkness.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नीलाक्षः, नीलाङ्गः, नीलाञ्जनम्, नीलाञ्जना, नीलाञ्जसा, नीलाब्जम्, नीलाम्बुजम्, नीलाम्बुजन्मन्, नीलाभ्रः, नीलाम्बर, नीलारुणः, नीलाश्मन्, नीलोत्पलम्, नीलोपलः, नीलकण्ठः, नीलकेशी, नीलग्रीवः, नीलच्छदः, नीलजम्, नीलजा, नीलतरुः, नीलतालः, नीलध्वजः, नीलपङ्कः, नीलपङ्कम्, नीलपटलम्, नीलपत्रः, नीलपिच्छः, नीलपिटः, नीलपुष्पिका, नीलफला, नीलभः, नीलमणिः, नीलरत्नम्, नीलमीलिकः, नीलमृत्तिका, नीलराजिः, नीललोहित, नीलवर्ण, नीलवसन, नीलवासस्, नीलवसनः, नीलवृन्तकम्, नीलस्नेहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलाक्षः|नीलाक्ष
नील + -अक्षः a goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलाङ्गः|नीलाङ्ग|नीलांग
नील + -अङ्गः the Sārasa bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलाञ्जनम्
नील + -अञ्जनम्<BR>—1 antimony.<BR>—2 blue vitriol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलाञ्जना|नीलांजना
नील + -अञ्जना, -अञ्जसा lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0935-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीलाञ्जसा|नीलांजसा
