नीलीरागः|नीलीराग
नीली + -राग + .({@-गः@})<BR>—1 affection as unchangeable as the colour of indigo, unalterable or unswerving<BR> attachment; नीलिरागो दृढप्रेमा Yādava (see also नीलस्नेहः);<BR> न चातिशोभते यन्नापैति प्रेम मनोगतम् । तन्नीलीरागमाख्यान्ति यथा श्रीरामसीतयोः ॥ S. D.<BR>—2 a firm and constant friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

