नीली + -संधानम् fermentation of indigo. ˚भाण्डम् an indigo vat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीव्
नीव् €1 P. to grow fat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीवः|नीव
नीवः A species of tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीवरः|नीवर
नीवरः [Uṇ. 3. 1.]<BR>—1 Trade, traffic.<BR>—2 A trader.<BR>—3 A religious mendicant.<BR>—4 A place fit for the site of a house.<BR>—5 A dwelling, residence.<BR>—6 Mud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीवरम्
नीवरः + .{@-रम्@} Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीवाकः|नीवाक
नीवाकः<BR>—1 Increased demand for grain in times of dearth.<BR>—2 Famine, scarcity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीवारः|नीवार
नीवारः Rice growing wild or without cultivation; नीवाराः शुकगर्भकोटरमुखभ्रष्टास्तरूणामधः<BR> Ś. 1. 14; R. 1. 50, 5. 9, 15; (also नीवारक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीविः|नीवि
नीविः, -वी <i>f.</i><BR> [निव्ययति निवीयते वा निव्ये-इन्; cf. Uṇ. 4. 135]:−<BR>—1 A cloth worn round a womanʼs waist, or more properly the ends of the<BR> cloth tied into a knot in front, the knot of the wearing garment; प्रस्थानभिन्नां<BR> न बबन्ध नीविम् R. 7. 9; नीविबन्धोच्छ्वसनम् Māl. 2. 5; Ku. 1. 38;<BR> नीविं प्रति प्रणिहिते तु करे प्रियेण K. P. 4; Me. 70; Śi. 10. 64.<BR>—2 The outer tie of a packet in which the offerings of a Śūdra at funeral<BR> obsequies are presented.<BR>—3 Capital,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">Page0936-2</a>]<BR> principal, stock; नीवीमवलिखतः द्विगुणः (दण्डः) Kau. A. 2. 7;<BR> शेषमायव्ययौ नीवी च Kau. A. 2. 6.<BR>—4 A stake, wager.<BR>—5 Prison; नीवी स्याद्बन्धनागारे धने स्त्रीवस्त्रबन्धने Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीवी
नीविः, -वी <i>f.</i><BR> [निव्ययति निवीयते वा निव्ये-इन्; cf. Uṇ. 4. 135]:−<BR>—1 A cloth worn round a womanʼs waist, or more properly the ends of the<BR> cloth tied into a knot in front, the knot of the wearing garment; प्रस्थानभिन्नां<BR> न बबन्ध नीविम् R. 7. 9; नीविबन्धोच्छ्वसनम् Māl. 2. 5; Ku. 1. 38;<BR> नीविं प्रति प्रणिहिते तु करे प्रियेण K. P. 4; Me. 70; Śi. 10. 64.<BR>—2 The outer tie of a packet in which the offerings of a Śūdra at funeral<BR> obsequies are presented.<BR>—3 Capital,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">Page0936-2</a>]<BR> principal, stock; नीवीमवलिखतः द्विगुणः (दण्डः) Kau. A. 2. 7;<BR> शेषमायव्ययौ नीवी च Kau. A. 2. 6.<BR>—4 A stake, wager.<BR>—5 Prison; नीवी स्याद्बन्धनागारे धने स्त्रीवस्त्रबन्धने Nm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीवृत्
नीवृत् <i>m.</i> Any inhabited country, realm, kingdom; आचक्रमुर्निजामस्य<BR> नीवृतं कृतविक्रमाः Śiva B. 4. 28 … … जेतुं कर्णाटनीवृतम् Śiva B. 9. 33;<BR> N. 2. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीव्र|नीव्रं
नीव्र See नीध्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीशारः|नीशार
नीशारः [नि-शॄ घञ् दीर्घः]<BR>—1 A warm cloth, a blanket.<BR>—2 A mosquito-curtain.<BR>—3 An outer tent or screen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीहारः|नीहार
नीहारः [नि-हृ कर्मणि घञ् दीर्घः]<BR>—1 Fog, mist; नीहारमग्नो दिनपूर्वभागः R. 7. 60; Y. 1. 150; Ms. 4. 113;<BR> नीहारधूमार्कानलानिलानाम् Yogagrantha.<BR>—2 Hoar-frost, heavy dew.<BR>—3 Evacuation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नीहारकरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नीहारकरः|नीहारकर
नीहारः + -करः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नु|नुः
नु <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 A particle having an interrogative force and implying some ‘doubt’,<BR> or ‘uncertainty’; स्वप्नो नु माया नु मतिभ्रमो नु Ś. 6. 10; अस्तशैलगहनं<BR> नु विवस्वानाविवेश जलधिं नु महीं नु Ki. 9. 7, 5. 1, 8 53, 9. 15, 54, 13. 4;<BR> Ku. 1. 46; क्षालितं नु शमितं नु वधूनां द्रावितं नु हृदयं<BR> मधुवारैः Śi. 10. 14; Ś. 2. 10.<BR>—2 It is very often compounded with the interrogative pronoun and its<BR> derivatives in the sense of ‘possibly’, ‘indeed’; किं न्वेतत्स्यात्किमन्यदितो<BR> ऽथवा Māl. 1. 17; एतावन्नू ३ इत्येतावद्धीति Bṛ. Up. 2. 1. 14; कथं<BR> नु गुणवद्विन्देयं कलत्रम् Dk.; see किंनु also.<BR>—3 Ved. Now, even now.<BR>—4 Now therefore, now then, therefore.<BR>—5 Like, as.<BR>—6 Quickly.<BR>—7 From this time forward. also ({@नू@}) Ved. Alone; नू मर्तो दयते<BR> सनिष्यन् Rv. 7. 100. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नु|नुः
नु I. €2 P. (नौति, प्रणौति; नुत; <i>caus.</i> नावयति;<BR> <i>desid.</i> नुनूषति)<BR>—1 To praise, extol, commend; सरस्वती तन्मिथुनं नुनाव Ku. 7. 90;<BR> Bk. 14. 112; see नू.<BR>—2 To roar, cry.<BR>—3 To sound, shout. ━II. €1 Ā. (नवते) To go. ━<i>Caus.</i> To<BR> cause to be drawn into the nose; Caraka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुत|नुतं
नु(नू)त <i>p. p.</i> Praised, extolled &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूत|नूतः
नु(नू)त <i>p. p.</i> Praised, extolled &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुः|नु
नुः <i>f.</i> Praise. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A weapon.<BR>—2 Time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुतिः|नुति
नुतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Praise, eulogium, panegyric; परगुणनुतिभिः (v. l.) स्वान् गुणान्<BR> ख्यापयन्तः Bh. 2. 69.<BR>—2 Worship, reverence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुड्
नुड् €6 P. (नुडति) To hurt, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुद्
नुद् €6 U. (नुदति-ते, नुत्त or नुन्न, प्रणुदति)<BR>—1 To push, push or drive on, impel, propel; मन्दं मन्दं नुदति पवनश्चानुकूलो<BR> यथा त्वाम् Me. 9; U. 5. 1.<BR>—2 To prompt, incite, urge on; रथचरणसमाह्वस्तावदौत्सुक्यनुन्ना<BR> Śi. 11. 26; Ku. 6. 65.<BR>—3 To remove, drive away, cast away, dispel; अदस्त्वया नुन्नमनुत्तमं<BR> तमः Śi. 1. 27; केयूरबन्धोच्छ्वसितैर्नुनोद R. 6. 68, 8. 40, 16. 85;<BR> Ki. 3. 33, 5. 28.<BR>—4 To throw, cast, send.<BR>—5 Ved. To raise, lift up. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To remove, drive away.<BR>—2 To prompt, incite, push on or urge forward. ━<i>With</i> {@उप@} to drive<BR> away, remove; Śi. 4. 61. ━{@प्र˚@} to dispel, drive off, remove; नयनप्रसरप्रणुन्नमिव<BR> वारिरुहम् Śi. 9. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0936-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुत्त|नुत्तः
नुत्त(न्न) <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Pushed, driven onward, propelled &c.<BR>—2 Driven away, dispelled; प्रणुन्नं सर्वतो दिग्भ्यः सिंहनुन्ना मृगा<BR> इव Rām. 7. 27. 34.<BR>—3 Despatched, sent, ordered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुन्न|नुन्नः
नुत्त(न्न) <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Pushed, driven onward, propelled &c.<BR>—2 Driven away, dispelled; प्रणुन्नं सर्वतो दिग्भ्यः सिंहनुन्ना मृगा<BR> इव Rām. 7. 27. 34.<BR>—3 Despatched, sent, ordered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुत्तिः|नुत्ति
नुत्तिः <i>f.</i> Driving away, removing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नुद
नुद <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Pushing, impelling, driving away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नू
नू €6 P. (नुवति) To praise &c.; see नु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूतन|नूतनः
नूतन, नूत्न <i>a.</i> [नव एव स्वार्थे तनप् नुरादेशश्च]<BR>—1 New; नूतनो राजा समाज्ञापयति U. 1; R. 8. 15; नूतनजलधररुचये<BR> Bhāṣā P.; सालावृकाणां स्त्रीणां च स्वैरिणीनां सुरद्विषः । सख्यान्याहुरनित्यानि<BR> नूत्नं नूत्नं विचिन्वताम् ॥ Bhāg. 8. 9. 10.<BR>—2 Fresh, young.<BR>—3 Present.<BR>—4 Instantaneous.<BR>—5 Recent, modern.<BR>—6 Curious, strange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूत्न|नूत्नः
नूतन, नूत्न <i>a.</i> [नव एव स्वार्थे तनप् नुरादेशश्च]<BR>—1 New; नूतनो राजा समाज्ञापयति U. 1; R. 8. 15; नूतनजलधररुचये<BR> Bhāṣā P.; सालावृकाणां स्त्रीणां च स्वैरिणीनां सुरद्विषः । सख्यान्याहुरनित्यानि<BR> नूत्नं नूत्नं विचिन्वताम् ॥ Bhāg. 8. 9. 10.<BR>—2 Fresh, young.<BR>—3 Present.<BR>—4 Instantaneous.<BR>—5 Recent, modern.<BR>—6 Curious, strange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूतनम्
नूतन, नूत्न + .{@-नम्@} Youth, juvenility.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नूतनवयस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूतनवयस्
नूतन + -वयस् (नूत्नवयस्) in the bloom of youth, in the spring of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूतनयति
नूतनयति Den. P. To make new, renew.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूदः|नूद
नूदः A kind of mulberry tree (Mar. पारसा पिंपळ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूनम्
नूनम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Certainly, assuredly, surely, verily, indeed; अद्यापि नूनं हरकोपवह्निस्त्वयि<BR> ज्वलत्यौर्व इवाम्बुराशौ Ś. 3. 3; Me. 9, 18, 46; Bh. 1. 11; Ku. 1. 12, 5. 75;<BR> R. 1. 29.<BR>—2 Most probably, in all probability; नूनं त्वया परिभवं च वनं<BR> च घोरम् (अवाप्य) U. 4. 23.<BR>—3 Ved. Now, just now, just.<BR>—4 Immediately.<BR>—5 In future.<BR>—6 Now then, therefore.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नूनभावः, नूनभावात्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूनभावः|नूनभाव
नूनम् + -भावः probability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूनभावात्
नूनम् + -भावात् <i>ind.</i> probably; नूनभावात्तु पश्यामि प्रत्यादेशमिवात्मनः<BR> Mb. 3. 2. 12 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूपुरः|नूपुर|नूपुरं
नूपुरः, -रम्<BR> An anklet, ornament for the feet; न हि चूडामणिः पादे<BR> नूपुरं मूर्ध्नि धार्यते H. 2. 71; गूढा नूपुरशब्दमात्रमपि मे कान्ता<BR> श्रुतौ पातयेत् V. 3. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नूपुरम्
नूपुरः, -रम्<BR> An anklet, ornament for the feet; न हि चूडामणिः पादे<BR> नूपुरं मूर्ध्नि धार्यते H. 2. 71; गूढा नूपुरशब्दमात्रमपि मे कान्ता<BR> श्रुतौ पातयेत् V. 3. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृ
नृ [नी-ऋन् डिच्च; cf. Uṇ. 2. 101] (Nom. sing. ना, gen. pl.<BR> नृणाम् or नॄणाम्)<BR>—1 A man, a person whether male or female; Ms. 3. 81, 4. 61, 7. 61; नॄन्<BR> प्रशंसत्यजस्रं यो घण्टाताडोरुणोदये 10. 33.<BR>—2 Mankind.<BR>—3 A piece at chess.<BR>—4 The pin of a sun-dial.<BR>—5 A masculine word; संधिर्ना विग्रहो यानम् Ak.<BR>—6 A leader.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: न्रस्थिमालिन्, नृकपालम्, नृकलेवरः, नृकारः, नृकेसरिन्, नृचक्षस्, नृजग्ध, नृजलम्, नृदुर्गः, नृदेवः, नृधर्मन्, नृनमन, नृपः, नृपः, नृपतिः, नृपालः, नृपशुः, नृपाय्यम्, नृपीतिः, नृमिथुनम्, नृमेध, नृयज्ञः, नृयुग्मम्, नृलोकः, नृवराहः, नृवाहनः, नृवाह्यम्, नृवेष्टनः, नृशंस, नृशृङ्गम्, नृसदनम्, नृसद्, नृसिंहः, नृहरिः, नृसेनम्, नृसेना, नृसोमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

न्रस्थिमालिन्
नृ + -अस्थिमालिन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृकपालम्
नृ + -कपालम् manʼs skull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृकलेवरः|नृकलेवर
नृ + -कलेवरः a dead human body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृकारः|नृकार
नृ + -कारः manly deed, heroism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृकेसरिन्
नृ + -केसरिन् <i>m.</i> ‘man-lion’, Viṣṇu in his Narasimha incarnation;<BR> cf. नरसिंह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृचक्षस्
नृ + -चक्षस् <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 seeing or observing men.<BR>—2 leading or guiding men; अस्तभ्नात् सिन्धुमर्णवं नृचक्षाः Rv. 3. 53. 9.<BR>━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a god.<BR>—2 a demon, goblin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृजग्ध
नृ + -जग्ध <i>a.</i> a man-eater; … नृजग्धो माल्यधारयः Bk. 5. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृजलम्
नृ + -जलम् human urine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृदुर्गः|नृदुर्ग
नृ + -दुर्गः a fort protected by army on all sides; Ms. 7. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृदेवः|नृदेव
नृ + -देवः a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृधर्मन्|नृधर्म्मन्
नृ + -धर्मन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृनमन
नृ + -नमन <i>a.</i> to be saluted by men (as gods).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृपः|नृप
नृ + -पः [नॄन् पाति रक्षति, पा-क] a ruler of men, king, sovereign;<BR> चतुर्योजनपर्यन्तमधिकारो नृपस्य च Brav. P. (श्रीकृष्णजन्मखण्डे). ˚अंशः<BR>—1 royal portion of revenue, <i>i. e.</i> a sixth, eighth &c. part of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">Page0937-2</a>]<BR> grain; काले नृपांशं विहितं ददद्भिः Bk. 2. 14.<BR>—2 a prince. ˚अङ्गनम् (णम्) a royal court. ˚अध्वरः N. of<BR> a sacrifice (Rājasūya) performed by an emperor or lord paramount, in<BR> which all the offices are performed by tributary princes. ˚आत्मजः<BR> a prince, crown-prince. ˚आभीरम्, ˚मानम् music played at the royal meals.<BR> ˚आमयः consumption. ˚आसनम् ‘royal-seat’, a throne, the chair<BR> of state. ˚गृहम् a royal palace. ˚द्रुमः N. of some trees (Mar.<BR> बाहवा, रांजणी). ˚नीतिः <i>f.</i> politics, royal policy, state-craft;<BR> वेश्याङ्गनेव नृपनीतिरनेकरूपा Bh. 2. 47. ˚प्रियः the mango tree.<BR> ˚लक्ष्मन् <i>n.</i>, लिङ्गम् a royal symbol, an emblem of royalty,<BR> any one of the royal insignia; particularly, the white umbrella. ˚लिङ्गधर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 assuming the insignia of royalty.<BR>—2 assuming the royal insignia (as a disguise). ˚वल्लभः<BR>—1 the friend or favourite of a king.<BR>—2 a kind of mango.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृपवल्लभा
नृ + -पः + .({@-भा@}) a queen. ˚शासनम् a royal grant or edict. ˚संश्रय<BR> <i>a.</i> seeking the protection of a king. ˚सुता the musk-rat. ˚सभम्,<BR> ˚सभा an assembly of kings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृपः|नृप
नृ + -पः, -पतिः, -पालः<BR>—1 a king; जाताभिषङ्गो नृपतिः R. 2. 30; विद्वत्वं च नृपत्वं च<BR> नैव तुल्यं कदाचन Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 N. of Kubera.<BR>—3 Kṣatriya. ˚पथः a royal or main road. ˚संश्रयः<BR>—1 royal support; नृपसंश्रयमिष्यते जनैः Pt.<BR>—2 service of princes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृपतिः|नृपति
नृ + -पः, -पतिः, -पालः<BR>—1 a king; जाताभिषङ्गो नृपतिः R. 2. 30; विद्वत्वं च नृपत्वं च<BR> नैव तुल्यं कदाचन Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 N. of Kubera.<BR>—3 Kṣatriya. ˚पथः a royal or main road. ˚संश्रयः<BR>—1 royal support; नृपसंश्रयमिष्यते जनैः Pt.<BR>—2 service of princes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृपालः|नृपाल
नृ + -पः, -पतिः, -पालः<BR>—1 a king; जाताभिषङ्गो नृपतिः R. 2. 30; विद्वत्वं च नृपत्वं च<BR> नैव तुल्यं कदाचन Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 N. of Kubera.<BR>—3 Kṣatriya. ˚पथः a royal or main road. ˚संश्रयः<BR>—1 royal support; नृपसंश्रयमिष्यते जनैः Pt.<BR>—2 service of princes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृपशुः|नृपशु
नृ + -पशुः<BR>—1 a beast in the form of a man, a brute of a man; वचस्तस्याकर्ण्य<BR> श्रवणसुभगं पण्डितपतेरधुन्वन् मूर्धानं नृपशुरथवायं पशुपतिः Bv. 4. 38.<BR>—2 a man serving as a sacrificial victim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृपाय्यम्
नृ + -पाय्यम् a large edifice, hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृपीतिः|नृपीति
नृ + -पीतिः <i>f.</i> Ved. protection of men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृमिथुनम्
नृ + -मिथुनम् the sign Gemini (twins) of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृमेध
नृ + -मेध a human sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृयज्ञः|नृयज्ञ
नृ + -यज्ञः ‘the sacrifice to be offered to men’, hospitality, reception<BR> of guests (one of the five daily Yajñas; see पञ्चयज्ञ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृयुग्मम्
नृ + -युग्मम् = नृमिथुन q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृलोकः|नृलोक
नृ + -लोकः the world of mortals, the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृवराहः|नृवराह
नृ + -वराहः Viṣṇu in the boar-incarnation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृवाहनः|नृवाहन
नृ + -वाहनः an epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृवाह्यम्
नृ + -वाह्यम् a palanquin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृवेष्टनः|नृवेष्टन
नृ + -वेष्टनः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृशंस|नृशंसः
नृ + -शंस <i>a.</i> A vile and cruel man; इतरेषु तु शिष्टेषु नृशंसानृतवादिनम् Ms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृशृङ्गम्
नृ + -शृङ्गम् ‘manʼs horn’; <i>i. e.</i> an impossibility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृसदनम्
नृ + -सदनम् (नृषदनम्) the hall of sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृसद्
नृ + -सद् ({@षद्@}) <i>m.</i> the Supreme Being. ━<i>f.</i> intellect<BR> (बुद्धि); सुरेतसादः पुनराविश्य चष्टे हंसं गृध्राणं नृषदिं गिरामिमः<BR> Bhāg. 5. 8. 14. ━<i>a.</i> sitting or dwelling among men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृसिंहः|नृसिंह
नृ + -सिंहः, -हरिः<BR>—1 ‘a lion-like man’ a chief among men, an eminent or distinguished man.<BR>—2 Viṣṇu in his fourth incarnation; अस्त्राण्यमोघमहिमानि निरूपितानि<BR> नो पस्पृशुर्नृहरिदासमिवासुराणि Bhāg. 1. 15. 16; cf. नरसिंह.<BR>—3 a particular mode of sexual enjoyment. ˚चतुर्दशी fourteenth day<BR> of the bright half of Vaiśākha. ˚द्वादशी the twelfth day of the<BR> light half of Phālguna. ˚पुराणम् N. of an उपपुराण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृहरिः|नृहरि
नृ + -सिंहः, -हरिः<BR>—1 ‘a lion-like man’ a chief among men, an eminent or distinguished man.<BR>—2 Viṣṇu in his fourth incarnation; अस्त्राण्यमोघमहिमानि निरूपितानि<BR> नो पस्पृशुर्नृहरिदासमिवासुराणि Bhāg. 1. 15. 16; cf. नरसिंह.<BR>—3 a particular mode of sexual enjoyment. ˚चतुर्दशी fourteenth day<BR> of the bright half of Vaiśākha. ˚द्वादशी the twelfth day of the<BR> light half of Phālguna. ˚पुराणम् N. of an उपपुराण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृसेनम्
नृ + -सेनम्, -सेना an army of men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृसेना
नृ + -सेनम्, -सेना an army of men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृसोमः|नृसोम
नृ + -सोमः an illustrious man, great man; सोमोद्भवाया सरितो नृसोमः R. 5. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृता
नृता, -त्वम्<BR> Manliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृत्वम्
नृता, -त्वम्<BR> Manliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृम्ण|नृम्णः
नृम्ण <i>a.</i> Making happy; Bhāg. 4. 8. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृम्णः|नृम्ण
नृम्ण + .{@-म्णः@} An epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृम्णम्
नृम्ण + .{@-म्णम्@} Ved.<BR>—1 Manhood, strength.<BR>—2 Courage.<BR>—3 Wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0937-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृवत्|नृवन्त्
नृवत् <i>ind.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Manly, powerfully.<BR>—2 Excessively, plentifully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृगः|नृग
नृगः A son of Manu Vaivasvata, who, it is said, was cursed by a<BR> Brāhmaṇa to be a lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृत्
नृत् €4 P. (नृत्यति, प्रणृत्यति, नृत्त)<BR>—1 To dance, move about; नृत्यति युवतिजनेन समं सखि Gīt. 1;<BR> लोलोर्मौ पयसि महोत्पलं ननर्त Śi. 8. 23; Bk. 3. 43.<BR>—2 To act on the stage.<BR>—3 To gesticulate, play. ━<i>Caus.</i> (नर्तयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to dance; त्वमाशे मोघाशे किमपरमतो नर्तयसि माम् Bh. 3. 6;<BR> तालैः शिञ्जावलयसुभगैर्नर्तितः कान्तया मे Me. 81; U. 3. 19.<BR>—2 To cause to move. ━<i>With</i> {@आ@} (<i>caus.</i>)<BR>—1 to cause to dance.<BR>—2 to cause to dance or move quickly, shake; मरुद्भिरानर्तितनक्तमाले<BR> R. 5. 42; मा मा मुञ्च शठेति कोपवचनैरानर्तितभ्रूलता Amaru. 36;<BR> Ṛs. 3. 10. ━{@प्र˚@} to dance &c. ━{@प्रति˚@} to ridicule by dancing in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृतू
नृतू <i>f.</i> Ved. Dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृतिः|नृति
नृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Dancing, dance.<BR>—2 Solemn appearance, show.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृतुः|नृतु
नृतुः Ved.<BR>—1 A dancer, an actor.<BR>—2 The earth.<BR>—3 A worm.<BR>—4 Length.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नृतू
