नेत्रकूटम्
नेत्रम् + -कूटः, -कूटम् a front apartment, a side-hall, a corner tower; प्रधानावासनेत्रस्थनेत्रकूटद्वयं<BR> न्यसेत् Kāmikāgama 35. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

