नेत्रम् + -कोषः<BR>—1 the eye-ball.<BR>—2 the bud of a flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रगोचर
नेत्रम् + -गोचर <i>a.</i> within the range of sight, perceptible, visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रचपल
नेत्रम् + -चपल <i>a.</i> restless with the eyes, winking; न नेत्रचपलोऽनृजुः Ms. 4. 177.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रच्छदः|नेत्रच्छद
नेत्रम् + -छदः the eyelid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रजम्
नेत्रम् + -जम्, -जलम्, -वारि <i>n.</i> tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रजलम्
नेत्रम् + -जम्, -जलम्, -वारि <i>n.</i> tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रवारि
नेत्रम् + -जम्, -जलम्, -वारि <i>n.</i> tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रनिंसिन्
नेत्रम् + -निंसिन् <i>a.</i> kissing or touching the eye (sleep).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रपत्रम्
नेत्रम् + -पत्रम् the eye-brows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रपर्यन्त|नेत्रपर्यंत|नेत्रपर्यन्तः|नेत्रपर्य्यन्त|नेत्रपर्य्यन्तः
नेत्रम् + -पर्यन्त <i>a.</i> as far as the eye, up to the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रपर्यन्तः|नेत्रपर्यन्त|नेत्रपर्यंत|नेत्रपर्य्यन्त|नेत्रपर्य्यन्तः
नेत्रम् + -पर्यन्त + .({@-तः@}) the outer corner of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रपाकः|नेत्रपाक
नेत्रम् + -पाकः inflammation of the eye; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रपिण्डः|नेत्रपिण्ड|नेत्रपिंड
नेत्रम् + -पिण्डः<BR>—1 the eye-ball.<BR>—2 a cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रबन्धः|नेत्रबन्ध
नेत्रम् + -बन्धः hood-winking, playing at hide-and-seek; Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रभवः|नेत्रभव
नेत्रम् + -भवः, -मलम् the mucus of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रमलम्
नेत्रम् + -भवः, -मलम् the mucus of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रमुष्
नेत्रम् + -मुष् <i>a.</i> stealing or captivating the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रयोनिः|नेत्रयोनि
नेत्रम् + -योनिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Indra (who had on his body a thousand marks resembling<BR> the female organ<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">Page0939-1</a>]<BR> inflicted by the curse of Gautama).<BR>—2 the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0938-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्ररञ्जनम्
नेत्रम् + -रञ्जनम् a collyrium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्ररोमन्
नेत्रम् + -रोमन् <i>n.</i> the eyelash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रवस्तिः|नेत्रवस्ति
नेत्रम् + -वस्तिः <i>m., f.</i> a clyster-pipe with a bag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रवस्त्रम्
नेत्रम् + -वस्त्रम् a veil over the eye, the eyelid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रविष्
नेत्रम् + -विष् <i>f.</i> excretion of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रविष
नेत्रम् + -विष <i>a.</i> having poison in the eyes (the Brāhmaṇa); Mb. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रस्तम्भः|नेत्रस्तम्भ|नेत्रस्तंभ
नेत्रम् + -स्तम्भः rigidity of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्रिकम्
नेत्रिकम्<BR>—1 A pipe.<BR>—2 A ladle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्री
नेत्री See under नेतृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेत्र्य
नेत्र्य <i>a.</i> Good or wholesome for the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेद्
नेद् €1 P. (नेदति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To censure.<BR>—3 To bring near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेदिष्ठ|नेदिष्ठं
नेदिष्ठ <i>a.</i> Nearest, next, very near (superl. of अन्तिक q. v.);<BR> नमो नेदिष्ठाय Śivamahimna 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेदीयस्
नेदीयस् <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Nearer, very near (compar. of अन्तिक q. v.);<BR> नेदीयसि प्रियतमे Bv. 2. 6; नेदीयसी भूत्वा Māl. 1 ‘drawing near, approaching’<BR>; Śi. 8. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेदीयोमरण
नेदीयोमरण <i>a.</i> One whose death is imminent; तमथ प्रथितास्वास्थ्यं<BR> नेदीयोमरणं वणिक् Rāj. T. 4. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेदिवस्
नेदिवस् <i>a.</i> Sounding, making noise; ततोऽन्तरिक्षे निनदो महानभूद्दिवौकसामप्सरसां<BR> च नेदुषाम् Mb. 9. 57. 68. (com. नेदुषां नादं कृतवतीनाम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपः|नेप
नेपः A family-priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपम्
नेपः + .{@-पम्@} Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपथ्यम्
नेपथ्यम्<BR>—1 Decoration, an ornament.<BR>—2 Dress, apparel, costume, attire; उदारनेपथ्यभृत् R. 6. 6; राजेन्द्रनेपथ्यविधानशोभा 14. 9;<BR> उज्ज्वलनेपथ्यविरचना Māl. 1; Ku. 7. 7; V. 5; न पथ्यं<BR> नेपथ्यं बहुतरमनङ्गोत्सवविधौ S. D.<BR>—3 Particularly, the costume of an actor; विरलनेपथ्ययोः पात्रयोः<BR> प्रवेशोऽस्तु M. 1.<BR>—4 The tiring-room, the space where the actors attire themselves (which<BR> is always behind the curtain), the postscenium; नेपथ्ये ‘behind the scene’.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नेपथ्यगृहम्, नेपथ्यप्रयोगः, नेपथ्यविधानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपथ्यगृहम्
नेपथ्यम् + -गृहम् a toilet-room.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपथ्यप्रयोगः|नेपथ्यप्रयोग
नेपथ्यम् + -प्रयोगः the art of toilet-making; one of the 64 <i>kalās</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपथ्यविधानम्
नेपथ्यम् + -विधानम् arrangements of the tiring-room; यदि नेपथ्यविधानमवसितम् Ś. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपालः|नेपाल
नेपालः N. of a country in the north of India.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपालाः
नेपालः + .{@-लाः@} (pl.) The people of this country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपालम्
नेपालः + .{@-लम्@} Copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपाली
नेपालः + .{@-ली@}<BR>—1 The wild date tree or its fruit.<BR>—2 Red arsenic.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नेपालजा, नेपालजाता, नेपालमूलकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपालजा
नेपालः + -जा, -जाता red arsenic; नेपालजामरिचशङ्खरसाञ्जनानि Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपालजाता
नेपालः + -जा, -जाता red arsenic; नेपालजामरिचशङ्खरसाञ्जनानि Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपालमूलकम्
नेपालः + -मूलकम् a radish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपालकम्
नेपालकम् Copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेपालिका
नेपालिका Red arsenic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेम|नेमः
नेम <i>a.</i> (Nom. pl. नेमे-नेमाः) Half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेमः|नेम
नेम + .{@-मः@}<BR>—1 A part.<BR>—2 A period, time, season.<BR>—3 A boundary, limit.<BR>—4 An enclosure, fence.<BR>—5 The foundation of a wall.<BR>—6 Fraud, deceit.<BR>—7 Evening.<BR>—8 A hole, ditch.<BR>—9 A root.<BR>—10 Acting, dancing.<BR>—11 Upper part.<BR>—12 Ved. Food.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नेमधित, नेमधितिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेमधित
नेम + -धित <i>a.</i> Ved. divided; विदन्मर्तो नेमधिता चिकित्वान् Rv. 1. 72. 4<BR> (see com.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेमधितिः|नेमधिति
नेम + -धितिः <i>f.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 battle, conflict.<BR>—2 dividing into two.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेमिः|नेमि
नेमिः, -मी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The circumference, ring or felly of a wheel; उपोढशब्दा न रथाङ्गनेमयः<BR> Ś. 7. 10; चक्रनेमिक्रमेण Me. 111; R. 1. 17, 39.<BR>—2 Edge, rim; भुजान् कुठारेण कठोरनेमिना चिच्छेद रामः प्रसभं त्वहेरिव<BR> Bhāg. 9. 15. 34.<BR>—3 A windlass.<BR>—4 A circumference (in general); उदधिनेमि R. 9. 10.<BR>—5 A thunderbolt.<BR>—6 The earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेमी
नेमिः, -मी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The circumference, ring or felly of a wheel; उपोढशब्दा न रथाङ्गनेमयः<BR> Ś. 7. 10; चक्रनेमिक्रमेण Me. 111; R. 1. 17, 39.<BR>—2 Edge, rim; भुजान् कुठारेण कठोरनेमिना चिच्छेद रामः प्रसभं त्वहेरिव<BR> Bhāg. 9. 15. 34.<BR>—3 A windlass.<BR>—4 A circumference (in general); उदधिनेमि R. 9. 10.<BR>—5 A thunderbolt.<BR>—6 The earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेमिः|नेमि
नेमिः, -मी + .{@-मिः@} The tree तिनिश.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: नेमितुम्बारम्, नेमिवृत्ति<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेमितुम्बारम्
नेमिः + -तुम्बारम् The felly and nave; शोभनमस्य चक्रस्य नेमितुम्बारम्<BR> ŚB. on MS. 1. 4. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेमिवृत्ति
नेमिः + -वृत्ति <i>a.</i> following the course of, acting like, the outer<BR> rims of the wheel; न व्यतीयुः प्रजास्तस्य नियन्तुर्नेमिवृत्तयः R. 1. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेय
नेय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be led, managed, guided, governed.<BR>—2 Fit to be taught; Mb. 5. 74. 4 (com. अनेयः शिक्षयितुमयोग्यः).<BR>—3 To be spent or passed (as time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेयधी
नेयधी <i>a.</i> Of manageable or tractable character; Rāj. T.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेष्
नेष् €1 Ā. (नेषते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0939-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

नेष्टुः|नेष्टु
