पक्षिन् + -इन्द्रः, -प्रवरः, -राज् <i>m.</i>, {@-राजः, -सिंहः, -स्वामिन्@} <i>m.</i><BR> epithets of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिराज्
पक्षिन् + -इन्द्रः, -प्रवरः, -राज् <i>m.</i>, {@-राजः, -सिंहः, -स्वामिन्@} <i>m.</i><BR> epithets of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिकीटः|पक्षिकीट
पक्षिन् + -कीटः an insignificant bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षितीर्थम्
पक्षिन् + -तीर्थम् N. of a sacred place in South India.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिपतिः|पक्षिपति
पक्षिन् + -पतिः an epithet of Sampāti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिपानीयशालिका
पक्षिन् + -पानीयशालिका a trough or reservoir for watering birds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिपुङ्गवः|पक्षिपुङ्गव
पक्षिन् + -पुङ्गवः an epithet of Jaṭāyu.<BR>—2 N. of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिबालकः|पक्षिबालक
पक्षिन् + -बालकः, -शावकः a young bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिशावकः|पक्षिशावक
पक्षिन् + -बालकः, -शावकः a young bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिमार्गः|पक्षिमार्ग
पक्षिन् + -मार्गः the air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिशार्दूलः|पक्षिशार्दूल
पक्षिन् + -शार्दूलः (in music) a kind of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिशाला
पक्षिन् + -शाला<BR>—1 a nest.<BR>—2 an aviary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षिलः|पक्षिल
पक्षिलः<BR>—1 N. of the saint Vātsyāyana.<BR>—2 A helper; Gīrvāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षीकृ
पक्षीकृ To appropriate, become master.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्षीय
पक्षीय <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Belonging to a side or party,<BR> siding with, adhering to the side of; as कुरुपक्षीयाः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्ष्मन्
पक्ष्मन् <i>n.</i> [पक्ष्-मनिन्]<BR>—1 An eyelash; सलिलगुरुभिः पक्ष्मभिः Me. 94. 49; R. 2. 19, 11. 36.<BR>—2 The filament of a flower.<BR>—3 The point of a thread, a thin thread.<BR>—4 A wing.<BR>—5 The leaf of a flower.<BR>—6 A whisker (मुखोपरिस्थकेश); बाल्यात् प्रसुप्तस्य महाबलस्य<BR> सिंहस्य पक्ष्माणि मुखाल्लुनासि Mb. 3. 268. 6.<BR>—7 The hair (of a deer); निसर्गचित्रोज्ज्वलसूक्ष्मपक्ष्मणा (लसत्) Śi. 1. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पक्ष्मकोपः, पक्ष्मप्रकोपः, पक्ष्मपातः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्ष्मकोपः|पक्ष्मकोप
पक्ष्मन् + -कोपः, -प्रकोपः irritation produced in the eye by the lashes<BR> turning inwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्ष्मप्रकोपः|पक्ष्मप्रकोप
पक्ष्मन् + -कोपः, -प्रकोपः irritation produced in the eye by the lashes<BR> turning inwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्ष्मपातः|पक्ष्मपात
पक्ष्मन् + -पातः Closing of the eyes; also पक्ष्मसंपातः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्ष्मल
पक्ष्मल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having strong, long or beautiful eyelashes; पक्ष्मलाक्ष्याः Ś. 3. 24.<BR>—2 Hairy, shaggy; मृदितपक्ष्मलरल्लकाङ्गः Śi. 4. 61.<BR>—3 Downy, soft.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पक्ष्मलदृश्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्ष्मलदृश्
पक्ष्मल + -दृश् <i>f.</i> a woman with long eyelashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्ष्य|पक्ष्यः
पक्ष्य <i>a.</i> [पक्षे भवः यत्]<BR>—1 Produced or occuring in a fortnight.<BR>—2 Siding with.<BR>—3 Lateral.<BR>—4 Changing every half month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्ष्यः|पक्ष्य
पक्ष्य + .{@-क्ष्यः@} A partisan, follower, friend, ally; ननु वज्रिण एव<BR> वीर्यमेतद्विजयन्ते द्विषतो यदस्य पक्ष्याः V. 1. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पङ्कः|पङ्क|पंक|पंकं|पंकः
पङ्कः, -कम्<BR> [पञ्च्-विस्तारे कर्मणि करणे वा घञ् कुत्वम्]<BR>—1 Mud, clay, mire; अनीत्वा पङ्कतां धूलिमुदकं नावतिष्ठते Ś. 2. 34;<BR> पङ्कक्लिन्नमुखाः Mk. 5. 14; Ki. 2. 6; R. 16. 30.<BR>—2 Hence a thick mass, large quantity; कृष्णागुरुपङ्कः K. 30.<BR>—3 A slough, quagmire.<BR>—4 Sin.<BR>—5 Ointment, unguent; पङ्कोऽरुणः सुरभिरात्मविषाण ईदृक् Bhāg. 5. 2. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पङ्ककर्वटः, पङ्ककीरः, पङ्कक्रीडः, पङ्कक्रीडनकः, पङ्कग्राहः, पङ्कच्छिद्, पङ्कजम्, पङ्कजन्मन्, पङ्कदिग्ध, पङ्कभाज्, पङ्कभारक, पङ्कमण्डुकः, पङ्करुह्, पङ्कवासः, पङ्कशूरण, पङ्कसूरण<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पङ्कम्
पङ्कः, -कम्<BR> [पञ्च्-विस्तारे कर्मणि करणे वा घञ् कुत्वम्]<BR>—1 Mud, clay, mire; अनीत्वा पङ्कतां धूलिमुदकं नावतिष्ठते Ś. 2. 34;<BR> पङ्कक्लिन्नमुखाः Mk. 5. 14; Ki. 2. 6; R. 16. 30.<BR>—2 Hence a thick mass, large quantity; कृष्णागुरुपङ्कः K. 30.<BR>—3 A slough, quagmire.<BR>—4 Sin.<BR>—5 Ointment, unguent; पङ्कोऽरुणः सुरभिरात्मविषाण ईदृक् Bhāg. 5. 2. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पङ्ककर्वटः, पङ्ककीरः, पङ्कक्रीडः, पङ्कक्रीडनकः, पङ्कग्राहः, पङ्कच्छिद्, पङ्कजम्, पङ्कजन्मन्, पङ्कदिग्ध, पङ्कभाज्, पङ्कभारक, पङ्कमण्डुकः, पङ्करुह्, पङ्कवासः, पङ्कशूरण, पङ्कसूरण<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0946-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

