पङ्क्तिका|पंक्तिका
पङ्क्तिका<BR>—1 A row, line.<BR>—2 Number ten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पङ्क्तिशः
पङ्क्तिशः <i>ind.</i> By rows or numbers; दक्षिणीयमवगम्य पङ्क्तिशः<BR> पङ्क्तिपावनमथ द्विजव्रजम् Śi. 14. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

