पङ्गु <i>a.</i> (-ङ्ग or -ङ्ग्वी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Lame, halt, crippled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पङ्गुः|पङ्गु|पंगु
पङ्गु + .{@-गुः@}<BR>—1 A lame man; मूकं करोति वाचालं पङ्गुं लङ्घयते गिरिम्.<BR>—2 An epithet of Saturn.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पङ्गुग्राहः, पङ्गुवासरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

