पङ्गुल|पंगुल|पङ्गुलः
पङ्गुल <i>a.</i> Lame, crippled; चक्षुषा विप्रहीणस्य पङ्गुलस्य<BR> जडस्य वा । हरेत यो वै सर्वस्वं तं विद्याद् ब्रह्मघातिनम् ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पङ्गुलः|पङ्गुल|पंगुल
पङ्गुल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A horse of silvery white colour.<BR>—2 The planet Śani.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पच्
पच् I. €1 U. (पचति-ते, पपाच-पेचे, आपक्षीत्-अपक्त, पक्ष्यति-ते,<BR> पक्तुम्, पक्व)<BR>—1 To cook, roast, dress (as food &c.) (said to govern two accusatives;<BR> as तण्डुलानोदनं पचति, but this use is very rare in classical Sanskrit);<BR> यः पचत्यात्मकारणात् Ms. 3. 118; शूले मत्स्यानिवापक्ष्यन् दुर्बलान्<BR> बलवत्तराः 7. 20; Bh. 1. 85.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-2" target="_blank">Page0947-2</a>]<BR>—2 To bake, burn (as bricks); see पक्व<BR>—3 To digest (as food); पचाम्यन्नं चतुर्विधम् Bg. 15. 14.<BR>—4 To ripen, mature,<BR>—5 To bring to perfection, develop (as understanding).<BR>—6 To melt (as metals).<BR>—7 cook (for oneself) (Ātm.). ━<i>Pass.</i> (पच्यते)<BR>—1 To be cooked.<BR>—2 To become ripe, matured or developed, ripen; (fig.) to bear fruit,<BR> attain perfection or fulfilment; सद्य एव सुकृतां हि पच्यते कल्पवृक्षफलधर्मि<BR> काङ्क्षितम् R. 11. 50.<BR>—3 To be inflamed. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 (पाचयति -ते) To cause to be cooked, to have cooked or dressed (food &c.).<BR>—2 To cause to ripen or develop, bring to maturity, perfection, or completion.<BR>—3 To cure, heal. ━<i>Desid.</i> (पिपक्षति) To wish to cook &c.<BR>━<i>With</i> {@परि@} to ripen, mature, develop. ━{@वि˚@}<BR>—1 To mature, develop, ripen, bear fruit; गर्भशालिसधर्माणस्तस्य गूढं<BR> विपेचिरे R. 17. 53.<BR>—2 To digest.<BR>—3 To cook thoroughly. ━II. €1 Ā. (पचते) To make clear or evident;<BR> see (पञ्चते) also. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To explain fully, dilate upon, amplify.<BR>—2 To spread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्तिः|पक्ति
पक्तिः <i>f.</i> [पच्-भावे-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Cooking; वैवाहिकेऽग्नौ कुवींत … … पक्तिं चान्वाहिकीं गृही<BR> Ms. 3. 67; The process or act of cooking; विषमा हि पक्तिराजानामाविकानां<BR> च मांसानाम् । यावता कालेनाजानि पच्यन्ते तावताविकानि विलीयन्ते । ŚB. on MS. 11. 4. 37.<BR>—2 Digesting, digestion.<BR>—3 Ripening, becoming ripe, maturity, development; न पपात संनिहितपक्तिसुरभिषु<BR> फलेषु मानसम् Ki. 12. 4.<BR>—4 Fame, dignity.<BR>—5 The place of digestion (जठराग्नि); पक्तिदृष्ट्योः परं तेजः<BR> (सन्निवेशयेत्) Ms. 12. 200.<BR>—6 Purification; शरीरपक्तिः कर्माणि Mb. 12. 270. 38.<BR>—7 Any dish of cooked food (Ved.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पक्तिवैषम्यम्, पक्तिशूलम्, पक्तिस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्तिवैषम्यम्
पक्तिः + -वैषम्यम् difference in the mode of cooking; जात्यन्तरेषु भेदः<BR> स्यात् पक्तिवैषम्यात् MS. 11. 4. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्तिशूलम्
पक्तिः + -शूलम् violent pain of the bowels arising from indigestion, colic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्तिस्थानम्
पक्तिः + -स्थानम् a place of digestion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्तृ
पक्तृ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Who or what cooks.<BR>—2 Cooking.<BR>—3 Stimulating, digesting.<BR>—4 Ripening. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 Fire (especially in the stomach).<BR>—2 A cook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्त्रम्
पक्त्रम्<BR>—1 The state of a house-holder who maintains the sacred fire.<BR>—2 The sacred fire so maintained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्त्रिम|पक्त्रिमं
पक्त्रिम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Ripe, ripened.<BR>—2 Matured.<BR>—3 Cooked.<BR>—4 Obtained by boiling (as salt).<BR>—5 Fructifying; दुःखे जातुचितागते स्वकलिताद् दुष्कर्मणः पक्त्रिमात्<BR> Viś. Guṇā. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्व|पक्वं
पक्व <i>a.</i> [पच्-क्त तस्य वः]<BR>—1 Cooked, roasted, boiled; as in पक्वान्न.<BR>—2 Digested.<BR>—3 Baked, burned, annealed (opp. आम); पक्वेष्टकानामाकर्षणम्, आमेष्टकानां<BR> छेदनम् Mk. 3. 12/13.<BR>—4 Mature, ripe; पक्वबिम्बाधरोष्ठी Me. 82; यथा फलानां पक्वानां<BR> नान्यत्र पतनाद् भयम् Subhāṣ.<BR>—5 Fully developed, come to perfection, perfect, matured as in पक्वधी;<BR> अग्निपक्वाशनो वा स्यात् कालपक्वभुगेव वा Ms. 6. 17.<BR>—6 Experienced, shrewd.<BR>—7 Ripe (as a boil), ready to suppurate.<BR>—8 Grey (as hair).<BR>—9 Perished, decaying, on the eve of destruction, ripe to meet oneʼs doom;<BR> ‘पक्वं परिणतेऽपि स्याद्विनाशाभिमुखे त्रिषु’ Med.; पक्वापक्वेति<BR> सुभृशं वावाश्यन्ते वयांसि<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">Page0948-1</a>]<BR> च Mb. 6. 3. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वम्
पक्व + .{@-क्वम्@}<BR>—1 Cooked food.<BR>—2 Ripe corn.<BR>—3 The ashes of a burnt corpse.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पक्वातिसारः, पक्वान्नम्, पक्वाधानम्, पक्वाशयः, पक्वेष्टका, पक्वेष्टकाचितम्, पक्वकषाय, पक्वकृत्, पक्वकेश, पक्वगात्र, पक्वरसः, पक्ववारि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0947-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वातिसारः|पक्वातिसार
पक्व + -अतिसारः chronic dysentery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वान्नम्
पक्व + -अन्नम् cooked or dressed food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वाधानम्
पक्व + -आधानम्, -आशयः the stomach, abdomen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वाशयः|पक्वाशय
पक्व + -आधानम्, -आशयः the stomach, abdomen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वेष्टका
पक्व + -इष्टका a baked brick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वेष्टकाचितम्
पक्व + -इष्टकाचितम् a building constructed with baked bricks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वकषाय
पक्व + -कषाय <i>a.</i> whose passion has become extinguished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वकृत्
पक्व + -कृत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 cooking;<BR>—2 maturing. ━(<i>m.</i>) the Nimba tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वकेश
पक्व + -केश <i>a.</i> grey-haired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वगात्र
पक्व + -गात्र <i>a.</i> having a decrepit or infirm body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वरसः|पक्वरस
पक्व + -रसः wine or any spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्ववारि
पक्व + -वारि <i>n.</i> the water of boiled rice (काञ्जिक), sour rice-gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्वता
पक्वता Maturity, ripeness, development &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पक्ष्णु|पक्ष्णुः
पक्ष्णु <i>a.</i> Cooking, Maturing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पच्
पच् <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Cooking, baking &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पच|पचः
पच <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Cooking, roasting.<BR>—2 Digesting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचः|पच
पच + .{@-चः, -चा@}<BR>—1 Cooking.<BR>—2 Maturing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पचप्रकुटा, पचलवणा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचा
पच + .{@-चः, -चा@}<BR>—1 Cooking.<BR>—2 Maturing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पचप्रकुटा, पचलवणा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचप्रकुटा
पच + -प्रकुटा continual baking and pounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचलवणा
पच + -लवणा continual boiling of salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचंपचा|पचम्पचा
पचंपचा Curcuma Aromatica; Xanthorrhiza (Mar. दारुहळद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचकः|पचक
पचकः A cook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचत|पचतः
पचत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Cooked, dressed.<BR>—2 Ripe, developed, mature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचतः|पचत
पचत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR>—3 N. of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचतम्
पचत + .{@-तम्@} Cooked food.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पचतभृज्जता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचतभृज्जता
पचत + -भृज्जता continual baking and roasting; cf. खादतमोदता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचन|पचनं|पचनः
पचन <i>a.</i> [पच्-करणे ल्युट्] Cooking, dressing, maturing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचनः|पचन|पचनं
पचन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 Fire; अथ हैनमन्वाहार्यपचनोऽनुशशास Ch. Up. 4. 12. 1; अथान्वाहार्यपचनादुत्थितो<BR> घोरदर्शनः Bhāg. 6. 9. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचना
पचन + .{@-ना@} Becoming ripe, ripening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचनी
पचन + .{@-नी@} The wild citron tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचनम्
पचन + .{@-नम्@} Cooking, dressing, maturing &c.; Bhāg. 3. 26. 40.<BR>—2 A means or instrument for cooking, a vessel, fuel &c.<BR>—3 Ripening, maturing.<BR>—4 Becoming cooked or ripe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचपचः|पचपच
पचपचः An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचमानक
पचमानक <i>a.</i> Accustomed to cook oneʼs food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचा
पचा The act of cooking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचिः|पचि
पचिः<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 Cooking &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचेलिम|पचेलिमः
पचेलिम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Cooking or ripening quickly.<BR>—2 Fit to be matured.<BR>—3 Ripening spontaneously or naturally; ददर्श मालूरफलं पचेलिमम्<BR> N. 1. 94; प्रचुरसस्यपचेलिममञ्जरीकपिशितामचलामवलोकयन् Rām. Ch. 4. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचेलिमः|पचेलिम
पचेलिम + .{@-मः@}<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पचेलुकः|पचेलुक
पचेलुकः A cook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पच्चनिका
पच्चनिका, पच्चनी A particular part of a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पच्चनी
पच्चनिका, पच्चनी A particular part of a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पच्छस्
पच्छस् <i>ind.</i> Foot by foot; अथ खल्वेतयर्चा पच्छ आचामति<BR> Ch. Up. 5. 2. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पज्झटिका
पज्झटिका<BR>—1 A small bell.<BR>—2 N. of a metre; Śabda C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0948-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

