पञ्चम <i>a.</i> (-मी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 The fifth.<BR>—2 Forming a fifth part.<BR>—3 Dexterous, clever.<BR>—4 Beautiful, brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चमः|पञ्चम|पंचम|पञ्चमं
पञ्चम + .{@-मः@}<BR>—1 The fifth (or in later times the seventh) note of the Indian gamut;<BR> it is said to be produced by the cuckoo (कोकिलो रौति पञ्चमम् Nārada.),<BR> and is so called because it is produced from 5 parts of the body:− वायुः<BR> समुद्गतो नभिरुरोहृत्कण्ठमूर्धसु । विचरन् पञ्चमस्थानप्राप्त्या पञ्चम उच्यते ॥.<BR>—2 N. of a Rāga or musical mode (sung in the above note); व्यथयति<BR> वृथा मौनं तन्वि प्रपञ्चय पञ्चमम् Gīt. 10; so उदञ्चितपञ्चमरागम् Gīt. 1.<BR>—3 The fifth consonant of a class; <i>i. e.</i> a nasal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चमम्
पञ्चम + .{@-मम्@}<BR>—1 A fifth.<BR>—2 Sexual intercourse (मैथुन), the fifth मकार of the Tāntrikas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चमम्
पञ्चम + .{@-मम्@} <i>ind.</i> For the fifth time, fifthly; Ms. 8. 125.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चमी|पंचमी
पञ्चम + .{@-मी@}<BR>—1 The fifth day of a lunar fortnight.<BR>—2 The ablative case (in gram.).<BR>—3 An epithet of Draupadī.<BR>—4 A chequered board for playing at draughts.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पञ्चमास्यः, पञ्चमस्वरम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चमास्यः|पञ्चमास्य|पंचमास्य
पञ्चम + -आस्यः the cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चमस्वरम्
पञ्चम + -स्वरम् N. of a metre; P. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चशः|पञ्चश
पञ्चशः <i>ind.</i> Five by five, by fives.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चमिन्|पंचमिन्
पञ्चमिन् <i>a.</i> Being in the fifth year of oneʼs age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चाश|पंचाश
पञ्चाश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Fiftieth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चाशत्|पंचाशत्
पञ्चाशत्, पञ्चाशतिः <i>f.</i> Fifty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चाशतिः|पञ्चाशति|पंचाशति|पंचाशतिः
पञ्चाशत्, पञ्चाशतिः <i>f.</i> Fifty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चाशिका
पञ्चाशिका<BR>—1 A collection of fifty.<BR>—2 A collection of fifty verses; <i>e. g.</i> चौरपञ्चाशिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0951-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चिका|पंचिका
पञ्चिका<BR>—1 N. of each book of the Aitareya Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—2 A game played with five dice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चालम्
पञ्चालम् Scripture; L. D. B.; प्रवृत्तं च निवृत्तं च शास्त्रं<BR> पञ्चालसंज्ञितम् Bhāg. 4. 29. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चालाः
पञ्चालाः <i>m.</i> (pl.) —1 N. of a country and its people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चालः|पञ्चाल|पंचाल
पञ्चालाः + .{@-लः@} A king of the Pañcālas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चालिका
पञ्चालिका A doll, puppet; cf. पाञ्चालिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चाली
पञ्चाली<BR>—1 A doll, puppet.<BR>—2 A kind of song.<BR>—3 Chequered board for playing at draughts, chess-board &c.; (also पञ्चारी<BR> in this sense only).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चावटः|पञ्चावट|पञ्चावटं|पंचावटः
पञ्चावटः The sacrificial cord worn across the shoulder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चिका|पंचिका
पञ्चिका See पञ्जिका. A journal, record; प्रायः पवित्रा लोकानामियं<BR> चारित्रपञ्चिका Mv. 4. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्चीकरणम्
पञ्चीकरणम् A philosophical term meaning the action by which anything<BR> is constituted of the five elements; (¹⁄₂ of one and ¹⁄₈ of other four<BR> elements) द्विधा द्विधा चेकैकं चतुर्धा पञ्चमं पुनः । स्वस्वेतरद्वितीयांशैर्योजनात्<BR> पञ्च पञ्च ते ॥ Vedāntasāra 39. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जरम्
पञ्जरम् A cage, an aviary; पञ्जरशुकः, भुजपञ्जरः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जरः|पञ्जर|पंजर|पंजरं|पञ्जरं
पञ्जरम् + .{@-रः, -रम्@}<BR>—1 Ribs.<BR>—2 A skeleton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जरम्
पञ्जरम् + .{@-रः, -रम्@}<BR>—1 Ribs.<BR>—2 A skeleton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जरः|पञ्जर|पंजर|पंजरं|पञ्जरं
पञ्जरम् + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 The body.<BR>—2 The Kaliyuga.<BR>—3 A purificatory ceremony performed on cows.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पञ्जराखेटः, पञ्जरशुकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जराखेटः|पञ्जराखेट|पंजराखेट
पञ्जरम् + -आखेटः a sort of basket or trap for catching fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जरशुकः|पञ्जरशुक|पंजरशुक
पञ्जरम् + -शुकः a parrot in a cage, caged parrot; क्रीडावेश्मनि चैष पञ्जरशुकः<BR> क्लान्तो जलं याचते V. 2. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जरकः|पञ्जरक|पंजरकं|पंजरकः
पञ्जरकः, -कम्<BR> A cage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जरकम्
पञ्जरकः, -कम्<BR> A cage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जिः|पञ्जि|पंजि|पंजिः
पञ्जिः, -ञ्जी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The ball of cotton from which thread is spun.<BR>—2 A record, journal, register.<BR>—3 A calendar, an almanac.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पञ्जिकारः, पञ्जिकारकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जी
पञ्जिः, -ञ्जी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The ball of cotton from which thread is spun.<BR>—2 A record, journal, register.<BR>—3 A calendar, an almanac.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पञ्जिकारः, पञ्जिकारकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जिकारः
पञ्जिः + -कारः, -कारकः<BR>—1 a writer, scribe.<BR>—2 an almanac-maker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जिकारकः|पञ्जिकारक|पंजिकारक
पञ्जिः + -कारः, -कारकः<BR>—1 a writer, scribe.<BR>—2 an almanac-maker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जिका|पंजिका
पञ्जिका<BR>—1 A perpetual or running commentary which explains and analyses every<BR> word; टीका निरन्तरव्याख्या पञ्जिका पदनक्तिका.<BR>—2 A journal, a book in which accounts of receipts and expenditure are entered.<BR>—3 The record or register of human actions kept by Yama. (For other senses<BR> see पञ्जि above).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पञ्जिकाकारकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पञ्जिकाकारकः|पञ्जिकाकारक
पञ्जिका + -कारकः<BR>—1 a scribe.<BR>—2 a man of the Kāyastha tribe.<BR>—3 an almanac-maker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्
पट् I. €1 P. (पटति) To go or move. ━<i>Caus.</i> or €10 U. (पाटयति-ते)<BR>—1 To split, cleave, tear up, tear asunder, tear open, divide; कंचिन्मध्यात्<BR> पाटयामास दन्ती Śi. 18. 51; दत्त्वर्णं पाटयेल्लेखम् Y. 2. 94; Mk. 9.<BR>—2 To break, break open; अन्यासु भित्तिषु मया निशि पाटितासु Mk. 3. 14.<BR>—3 To pierce, prick, penetrate; दर्भपाटिततलेन पाणिना R. 11. 31.<BR>—4 To remove, eradicate.<BR>—5 To pluck out.<BR>—6 To shine.<BR>—7 To speak. ━II. €10 U. (पटयति-ते)<BR>—1 To string or weave; कुविन्दस्त्वं तावत् पटयसि गुणग्राममभितः K. P. 7.<BR>—2 To clothe, envelop.<BR>—3 To surround, encircle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटः|पट|पटं
पटः, -टम्<BR> [पट् वेष्टने करणे घञर्थे कः]<BR>—1 A garment, raiment, cloth, a piece of cloth; अयं पटः सूत्रदरिद्रतां<BR> गतो ह्ययं पटश्छिद्रशतैरलंकृतः &c. Mk. 2. 9; मेघाः स्रवन्ति<BR> बलदेवपटप्रकाशाः 5. 45.<BR>—2 Fine cloth.<BR>—3 A veil, screen.<BR>—4 A tablet, plate or piece of cloth for writing or painting upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटम्
पटः, -टम्<BR> [पट् वेष्टने करणे घञर्थे कः]<BR>—1 A garment, raiment, cloth, a piece of cloth; अयं पटः सूत्रदरिद्रतां<BR> गतो ह्ययं पटश्छिद्रशतैरलंकृतः &c. Mk. 2. 9; मेघाः स्रवन्ति<BR> बलदेवपटप्रकाशाः 5. 45.<BR>—2 Fine cloth.<BR>—3 A veil, screen.<BR>—4 A tablet, plate or piece of cloth for writing or painting upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटः|पट|पटं
पटः, -टम् + .{@-टः@} Anything well made or polished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटम्
पटः, -टम् + .{@-टम्@} A thatch, roof.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पटाञ्चलः, पटोटजम्, पटोत्तरीयम्, पटकर्मन्, पटकारः, पटकुटी, पटमण्डपः, पटवापः, पटवेश्मन्, पटगत, पटभासः, पटवासः, पटवाद्यम्, पटवासकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटाञ्चलः|पटाञ्चल
पटः + -अञ्चलः the hem of a garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटोटजम्
पटः + -उटजम्<BR>—1 a tent.<BR>—2 a mushroom; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

