पटः + -उत्तरीयम् an upper garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटकर्मन्
पटः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> weaving, business of the loom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटकारः|पटकार
पटः + -कारः<BR>—1 a weaver.<BR>—2 a painter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटकुटी
पटः + -कुटी <i>f.</i>, {@-छिदा@}<BR> a shred of cloth; पटच्छिदाकालिकपुष्पजाः स्रजः N. 15. 14;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

