पटः + -मण्डपः, -वापः, -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i> a tent; प्रभोर्निवासाः पटवेश्मभिर्बभुः<BR> Śi. 12. 63; Hc. Uttarabhāga; उल्लोचैः काण्डपटकैः अनेकैः पट मण्डपैः<BR> Śiva B. 22. 61; नवैरुत्तम्भितस्तम्भैर्मण्डितं पटमण्डपैः Śiva B. 17. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटवापः|पटवाप
पटः + -मण्डपः, -वापः, -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i> a tent; प्रभोर्निवासाः पटवेश्मभिर्बभुः<BR> Śi. 12. 63; Hc. Uttarabhāga; उल्लोचैः काण्डपटकैः अनेकैः पट मण्डपैः<BR> Śiva B. 22. 61; नवैरुत्तम्भितस्तम्भैर्मण्डितं पटमण्डपैः Śiva B. 17. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटवेश्मन्
पटः + -मण्डपः, -वापः, -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i> a tent; प्रभोर्निवासाः पटवेश्मभिर्बभुः<BR> Śi. 12. 63; Hc. Uttarabhāga; उल्लोचैः काण्डपटकैः अनेकैः पट मण्डपैः<BR> Śiva B. 22. 61; नवैरुत्तम्भितस्तम्भैर्मण्डितं पटमण्डपैः Śiva B. 17. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटगत
पटः + -गत <i>a.</i> painted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटभासः
पटः + -भासः the interstices in a lattice-window; पटभाससूक्ष्मच्छिद्रालक्षिता Dk. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटवासः|पटवास
पटः + -वासः<BR>—1 a tent.<BR>—2 a petticoat.<BR>—3 perfumed powder; Ratn. 1; परागैः पुष्पाणां प्रकटपटवासव्यतिकरः Nāg. 3. 7.<BR>—4 a cover (पिधान); निजरजः पटवासमिवाकिरत् Śi. 6. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटवाद्यम्
पटः + -वाद्यम् a kind of cymbal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटवासकः|पटवासक
पटः + -वासकः perfumed powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटकः|पटक
पटकः<BR>—1 A camp, an encampment.<BR>—2 Cotton-cloth.<BR>—3 The half of a village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटमय|पटमयं|पटमयः
पटमय <i>a.</i> Made of cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटमयः|पटमय|पटमयं
पटमय + .{@-यः@} A tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटच्चरः|पटच्चर|पटच्चरं
पटच्चरः A thief; cf. पाटच्चर; तथैवापरमत्स्यांश्च व्यजयत्<BR> स पटच्चरान् Mb. 2. 31. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटच्चरम्
पटच्चरः + .{@-रम्@} Old or ragged clothes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटत्कः|पटत्क
पटत्कः A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटपटा
पटपटा <i>ind.</i> An imitative sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटलम्
पटलम् [पट् वेष्टने कलच्]<BR>—1 A roof, thatch; विनमितपटलान्तं दृश्यते जीर्णकुड्यम् Mu. 3. 15.<BR>—2 A cover, covering, veil, coating (in general); शिरसि मसीपटलं<BR> दधाति दीपः Bv. 1. 74.<BR>—3 A film or coating over the eyes.<BR>—4 A heap, multitude, mass, quantity; रथाङ्गपाणेः पटलेन रोचिषाम्<BR> Śi. 1. 21; जलदपटलानि Pt. 1. 361; क्षौद्रपटलैः R. 4. 63;<BR> मुक्तापटलम् 13. 17; तारकपटल Gīt. 7.<BR>—5 A basket.<BR>—6 Retinue, train.<BR>—7 A mark on the forehead or any other part of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटलः|पटल|पटलं
पटलम् + .{@-लः, -ली@}<BR>—1 A tree.<BR>—2 A stalk.<BR>—3 A collection; आयुर्वायुविघट्टिताभ्रपटलीलीनाम्बुवद् भङ्गुरम् Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटली
पटलम् + .{@-लः, -ली@}<BR>—1 A tree.<BR>—2 A stalk.<BR>—3 A collection; आयुर्वायुविघट्टिताभ्रपटलीलीनाम्बुवद् भङ्गुरम् Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटलः|पटल|पटलं
पटलम् + .{@-लः, -लम्@} A section or chapter of a book.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पटलप्रान्तः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटलम्
पटलम् + .{@-लः, -लम्@} A section or chapter of a book.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पटलप्रान्तः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटलप्रान्तः|पटलप्रान्त|पटलप्रांत|पटलप्रान्तं
पटलम् + -प्रान्तः the edge of a roof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटलकः|पटलक
पटलकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A cover, screen, veil.<BR>—2 A little box or basket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटलकम्
पटलकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A cover, screen, veil.<BR>—2 A little box or basket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटलिका
पटलिका A heap, mass, multitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटहः|पटह|पटहं
पटहः<BR>—1 A kettle-drum, a war-drum, drum, tabor; कुर्वन् संध्यावलिपटहतां<BR> शूलिनः श्लाघनीयाम् Me. 36; पटुपटहध्वनिभिर्विनीतनिद्रः R. 9. 71.<BR>—2 Beginning, undertaking.<BR>—3 Injuring, killing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पटहघोषकः, पटहभ्रमणम्, पटहवेला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटहघोषकः|पटहघोषक
पटहः + -घोषकः a crier (who beats a drum and then makes the proclamation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटहभ्रमणम्
पटहः + -भ्रमणम् going about with a drum to call people together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटहवेला
पटहः + -वेला the hour at which a drum is beaten every day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0952-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटाकः|पटाक
पटाकः A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटाका
पटाका (= पताका q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटालुका
पटालुका A leech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटिः|पटि
पटिः, -टी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The curtain of a stage.<BR>—2 A cloth.<BR>—3 Coarse cloth, canvas.<BR>—4 A screen of cloth surrounding a tent.<BR>—5 A coloured garment.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पटिक्षेपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटी
पटिः, -टी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The curtain of a stage.<BR>—2 A cloth.<BR>—3 Coarse cloth, canvas.<BR>—4 A screen of cloth surrounding a tent.<BR>—5 A coloured garment.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पटिक्षेपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटिक्षेपः|पटिक्षेप
पटिः + -क्षेपः tossing aside the curtain (of the stage); used as a stage-direction<BR> to denote the hurried entrance of a character on the stage; cf. अपटीक्षेप.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटिका
पटिका Woven cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटिमन्
पटिमन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 Dexterity, cleverness.<BR>—2 Sharpness.<BR>—3 Acidity.<BR>—4 Harshness, roughness,<BR>—5 Violence, intensity &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटीर|पटीरं|पटीरः
पटीर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Beautiful, lovely.<BR>—2 High, tall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटीरः|पटीर|पटीरं
पटीर + .{@-रः@} [पट् ईरन्]<BR>—1 A ball for playing with.<BR>—2 Sandal-wood<BR>—3 Cupid, the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटीरम्
पटीर + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Catechu.<BR>—2 A Sieve<BR>—3 The belly.<BR>—4 A field.<BR>—5 A cloud.<BR>—6 Height<BR>—7 A radish.<BR>—8 Rheumatism.<BR>—9 Catarrh.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पटीरजन्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटीरजन्मन्
पटीर + -जन्मन् <i>m.</i> sandal-tree; वहति विषधरान् पटीरजन्मा Bv. 1. 74<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटु|पटुः
पटु <i>a.</i> (टु or ट्वी <i>f.</i>; compar. पटीयस्, superl. पटिष्ठ)<BR>—1 Clever, skilful, dexterous, proficient; पाटीर तव पटीयान् कः परिपाटीमिमामुरीकर्तुम्<BR> Jag.; cf. also अघटितघटनापटीयसी; (usually with a loc.)<BR> वाचि पटुः &c.<BR>—2 Sharp, acrid, pungent.<BR>—3 Sharp, smart (as intellect), intelligent.<BR>—4 Violent, strong, sharp, intense; अयमपि पटुर्धारासारो न बाणपरंपरा<BR> V. 4. 1; U. 4. 3.<BR>—5 Shrill, clear, sharp-sounding; किमिदं पटुपटहशङ्खमिश्रो नान्दीनादः<BR> Mu. 6; पटुपटहध्वनिभिर्विनीतनिद्रः R. 9. 71, 73; Māl. 5. 4.<BR>—6 Apt, disposed; स्मर्तुमधिगतगुणस्मरणाः पटवो न दोषमखिलं खलूत्तमा; Śi. 15. 43.<BR>—7 Harsh, cruel, hard-hearted.<BR>—8 Sly, cunning, crafty, roguish.<BR>—9 Healthy, sound; मृदुसूर्याः सुनीहाराः पटुशीताः समाहिताः (शून्यारण्याः)<BR> Rām. 3. 16. 12.<BR>—10 Active, busy.<BR>—11 Eloquent, talkative,<BR>—12 Blown, expanded.<BR>—13 Hard, rough, fierce.<BR>—14 Contumelious (as a speech).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुः|पटु
पटु + .{@-टुः, -टु@} <i>n.</i> A mushroom (छत्रा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटु|पटुः
पटु + .{@-टुः, -टु@} <i>n.</i> A mushroom (छत्रा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटु|पटुः
पटु + .{@-टु@} <i>n.</i> Salt.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पटुकरण, पटुकल्प, पटुदेशीय, पटुघण्टा, पटुतृणम्, पटुतृणकम्, पटुत्रयम्, पटुमति, पटुरूप<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुकरण
पटु + -करण <i>a.</i> having sound organs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुकल्प|पटुकल्पः
पटु + -कल्प, -देशीय <i>a.</i> Pretty clever, tolerably sharp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुदेशीय
पटु + -कल्प, -देशीय <i>a.</i> Pretty clever, tolerably sharp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुघण्टा
पटु + -घण्टा a shrill bell; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुतृणम्
पटु + -तृणम्, -तृणकम् a kind of pungent grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुतृणकम्
पटु + -तृणम्, -तृणकम् a kind of pungent grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुत्रयम्
पटु + -त्रयम् a collection of three salts (Mar. सैंधव, बिडलोण<BR> व संचळखार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुमति
पटु + -मति <i>a.</i> clever-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुरूप
पटु + -रूप <i>a.</i> very clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटिमन्
पटिमन् <i>m.</i> Sharpness, pungency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुता
पटुता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Cleverness.<BR>—2 Skilfulness, proficiency.<BR>—3 Activity, power of working; अङ्गानि प्रसभं त्यजन्ति पटुताम् Mu. 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटुत्वम्
पटुता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Cleverness.<BR>—2 Skilfulness, proficiency.<BR>—3 Activity, power of working; अङ्गानि प्रसभं त्यजन्ति पटुताम् Mu. 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटोलः|पटोल|पटोलं
पटोलः A species of cucumber (Mar. पडबळ); सामसाध्येषु<BR> कार्येषु यो दण्डं योजयेद् बुधः । स पित्ते शर्कराशाम्ये पटोलं कटुकं<BR> पिबेत् ॥ Pt. 3. 132; also पटुक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटोलम्
पटोलः + .{@-लम्@} A kind of cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पटोलकः|पटोलक
पटोलकः An oyster.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्टः|पट्ट|पट्टं
पट्टः, -ट्टम्<BR>—1 A slab, tablet (for writing upon), plate in general; शिलापट्टमधिशयाना<BR> Ś. 3; so भालपट्ट &c.<BR>—2 A royal grant or edict; पटे वा ताम्रपट्टे वा स्वमुद्रोपरिचिह्नितम् ।<BR> अभिलेख्यात्मनो वंश्यानात्मानं च महीपतिः ॥ Y. 1. 319.<BR>—3 A tiara, diadem; निर्वृत्तजाम्बूनदपट्टबन्धे न्यस्तं ललाटे तिलकं<BR> दधानः R. 18. 44; पट्टः शुभदो राज्ञां मध्येऽष्टावङ्गुलानि विस्तीर्णः ।<BR> सप्त नरेन्द्रमहिष्याः षड् युवराजस्य निर्दिष्टः ॥ चतुरङ्गुलविस्तारः<BR> पट्टः सेनापतेर्भवति मध्ये । द्वे च प्रसादपट्टः पञ्चैते कीर्तिताः पट्टाः ॥ Bṛ. S.<BR>—4 A strip; निर्मोकपट्टाः फणिभिर्विमुक्ताः R. 16. 17;<BR>—5 Silk; पट्टोपधानम्; K. 17; Bh. 3. 74; so पट्टांशुकम्.<BR>—6 Fine or coloured cloth, cloth in general.<BR>—7 An upper garment; गलितमिव भुवो विलोक्य रामं धरणिधरस्तनशुक्लचीनपट्टम् Bk. 10. 61.<BR>—8 A fillet or cloth worn round the head, turban; especially, a coloured<BR> silk turban; भारः परं पट्टकिरीटजुष्टमप्युत्तमाङ्गं न नमेन्मुकुन्दम्<BR> Bhāg. 2. 3. 21; त्रासार्ता ऋत्विजो ऽधश्चपलगणहृतोष्णीषपट्टाः पतन्ति Ratn. 1. 4.<BR>—9 A throne.<BR>—10 A chair or stool.<BR>—11 A shield.<BR>—12 A grinding stone.<BR>—13 A place where four roads meet.<BR>—14 A city, town.<BR>—15 A bandage, ligature; बद्धेषु व्रणपट्टकेषु Ve. 5. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्टम्
पट्टः, -ट्टम्<BR>—1 A slab, tablet (for writing upon), plate in general; शिलापट्टमधिशयाना<BR> Ś. 3; so भालपट्ट &c.<BR>—2 A royal grant or edict; पटे वा ताम्रपट्टे वा स्वमुद्रोपरिचिह्नितम् ।<BR> अभिलेख्यात्मनो वंश्यानात्मानं च महीपतिः ॥ Y. 1. 319.<BR>—3 A tiara, diadem; निर्वृत्तजाम्बूनदपट्टबन्धे न्यस्तं ललाटे तिलकं<BR> दधानः R. 18. 44; पट्टः शुभदो राज्ञां मध्येऽष्टावङ्गुलानि विस्तीर्णः ।<BR> सप्त नरेन्द्रमहिष्याः षड् युवराजस्य निर्दिष्टः ॥ चतुरङ्गुलविस्तारः<BR> पट्टः सेनापतेर्भवति मध्ये । द्वे च प्रसादपट्टः पञ्चैते कीर्तिताः पट्टाः ॥ Bṛ. S.<BR>—4 A strip; निर्मोकपट्टाः फणिभिर्विमुक्ताः R. 16. 17;<BR>—5 Silk; पट्टोपधानम्; K. 17; Bh. 3. 74; so पट्टांशुकम्.<BR>—6 Fine or coloured cloth, cloth in general.<BR>—7 An upper garment; गलितमिव भुवो विलोक्य रामं धरणिधरस्तनशुक्लचीनपट्टम् Bk. 10. 61.<BR>—8 A fillet or cloth worn round the head, turban; especially, a coloured<BR> silk turban; भारः परं पट्टकिरीटजुष्टमप्युत्तमाङ्गं न नमेन्मुकुन्दम्<BR> Bhāg. 2. 3. 21; त्रासार्ता ऋत्विजो ऽधश्चपलगणहृतोष्णीषपट्टाः पतन्ति Ratn. 1. 4.<BR>—9 A throne.<BR>—10 A chair or stool.<BR>—11 A shield.<BR>—12 A grinding stone.<BR>—13 A place where four roads meet.<BR>—14 A city, town.<BR>—15 A bandage, ligature; बद्धेषु व्रणपट्टकेषु Ve. 5. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्टी
पट्टः, -ट्टम् + .{@-ट्टी@}<BR>—1 An ornament for the forehead.<BR>—2 A horseʼs girth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पट्टांशुकः, पट्टाभिषेकः, पट्टार्हा, पट्टोपाध्यायः, पट्टकर्मकरः, पट्टजम्, पट्टदेवी, पट्टमहिषी, पट्टराज्ञी, पट्टबन्धः, पट्टबन्धनम्, पट्टरागः, पट्टवस्त्र, पट्टवासस्, पट्टशाला, पट्टसूत्रकारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्टांशुकः|पट्टांशुक
पट्टः + -अंशुकः<BR>—1 a silk cloth.<BR>—2 an upper or outer garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्टाभिषेकः|पट्टाभिषेक
पट्टः + -अभिषेकः the consecration of the tiara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्टार्हा
पट्टः + -अर्हा the principal queen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्टोपाध्यायः|पट्टोपाध्याय
पट्टः + -उपाध्यायः a writer of royal grants and other documents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्टकर्मकरः|पट्टकर्मकर
पट्टः + -कर्मकरः a weaver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पट्टजम्
पट्टः + -जम् a sort of cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

