पट्टः + -देवी, -महिषी, -राज्ञी the principal queen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0953-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

