पदावली
पदम् + -आवली a series of words, a continued arrangement of words or<BR> lines; (काव्यस्य) शरीरं तावदिष्टार्थव्यवच्छिन्नापदावली Kāv. 1. 10;<BR> मधुरकोमलकान्तपदावलीं शृणु तदा जयदेवसरस्वतीम् Gīt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

