पदकृत्
पदम् + -कारः, -कृत् <i>m.</i> the author of the Padapāṭha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदक्रमः|पदक्रम
पदम् + -क्रमः<BR>—1 walking, a pace; न चित्रमुच्चैः श्रवसः पदक्रमम् (प्रशशंस) Śi. 1. 52.<BR>—2 a particular method of reciting the Veda; cf. क्रम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

