पदम् + -गः a foot-soldier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदगतिः|पदगति
पदम् + -गतिः <i>f.</i> gait, manner of going.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

