पदच्छेदः|पदच्छेद
पदम् + -छेदः, -विच्छेदः, -विग्रहः separation of words, resolution of<BR> a sentence into its constituent parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदविच्छेदः|पदविच्छेद
पदम् + -छेदः, -विच्छेदः, -विग्रहः separation of words, resolution of<BR> a sentence into its constituent parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदविग्रहः|पदविग्रह
पदम् + -छेदः, -विच्छेदः, -विग्रहः separation of words, resolution of<BR> a sentence into its constituent parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदच्युत
पदम् + -च्युत <i>a.</i> dismissed from office, deposed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदजातम्
पदम् + -जातम् class or group of words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पददार्ढ्यम्
पदम् + -दार्ढ्यम् fixedness or security of text.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदन्यासः|पदन्यास
पदम् + -न्यासः<BR>—1 stepping, tread, step.<BR>—2 a foot-mark.<BR>—3 position of the feet in a particular attitude.<BR>—4 the plant गोक्षुर.<BR>—5 writing down verses or quarters of verses; अप्रगल्भाः पदन्यासे जननीरागहेतवः ।<BR> सन्त्येके बहुलालापाः कवयो बालका इव ॥ Trivikramabhaṭṭa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदपङ्क्तिः|पदपङ्क्ति|पदपंक्ति
पदम् + -पङ्क्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a line of foot-steps; द्वारेऽस्य पाण्डुसिकते पदपङ्क्तिर्दृश्यतेऽभिनवा<BR> Ś. 3. 7; V. 4. 6.<BR>—2 a line or arrangement of words, a series of words; कृतपदपङ्क्तिरथर्वणेव<BR> वेदः Ki. 10. 10.<BR>—3 an <i>iṣtakā</i> or sacred brick.<BR>—4 a kind of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदपाठः|पदपाठ
पदम् + -पाठः an arrangement of the Vedic text in which each word is<BR> written and pronounced in its original form and independently of phonetic<BR> changes (opp. संहितापाठ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदपातः|पदपात
पदम् + -पातः, -विक्षेपः a step, pace (of a horse also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदविक्षेपः|पदविक्षेप
पदम् + -पातः, -विक्षेपः a step, pace (of a horse also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदबन्धः|पदबन्ध
पदम् + -बन्धः a foot-step, step.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदभञ्जनम्
पदम् + -भञ्जनम् analysis of words, etymology.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदभञ्जिका|पदभंजिका
पदम् + -भञ्जिका<BR>—1 a commentary which separates the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">Page0960-2</a>]<BR> words and analyses the compounds of a passage.<BR>—2 a register, journal.<BR>—3 a calendar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदभ्रंशः|पदभ्रंश
पदम् + -भ्रंशः dismissal from office.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदमाला
पदम् + -माला a magical formula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदयोपनम्
पदम् + -योपनम् a fetter for the feet (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदरचना
पदम् + -रचना<BR>—1 arrangement of words.<BR>—2 literary composition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदवायः|पदवाय
पदम् + -वायः Ved. a leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदविष्टम्भः|पदविष्टम्भ
पदम् + -विष्टम्भः a step, footstep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदवृत्तिः|पदवृत्ति
पदम् + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> the hiatus between two words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदवेदिन्
पदम् + -वेदिन् a linguist, philologist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदव्याख्यानम्
पदम् + -व्याख्यानम् interpretation of words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदशास्त्रम्
पदम् + -शास्त्रम् the science of separately written words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदसंघातः|पदसङ्घात|पदसंघात
पदम् + -संघातः ({@टः@})<BR>—1 connecting the words which are separated in the संहिता.<BR>—2 a writer, an annotator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदसंधिः|पदसन्धि
पदम् + -संधिः <i>m.</i> the euphonic combination of words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदस्थ
पदम् + -स्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 going on foot.<BR>—2 being in a position of authority or high rank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदस्थानम्
पदम् + -स्थानम् a foot-print.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदकम्
पदकम् A step, position, office; see पद.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदकः|पदक|पदकं
पदकम् + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 An ornament of the neck.<BR>—2 One conversant with the पदपाठ q. v.<BR>—3 A निष्क or weight of gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदनीय
पदनीय <i>a.</i> To be investigated or known (ज्ञातव्य); तदेतत्पदनीयमस्य<BR> सर्वस्य यदयमात्मानेन ह्येतत्सर्वं वेद Bṛ. Up. 1. 4. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदविः|पदवि
पदविः, -वी <i>f.</i><BR> [पद्-अवि वा ङीप]<BR>—1 A way, road, path, course (fig. also); पवनपदवी Me. 8; अनुयाहि<BR> साधुपदवीम् Bh. 2. 77 ‘follow in the footsteps of the good’; Ś. 4. 14;<BR> R. 3. 50, 7. 7, 8. 11, 15. 99; Bh. 3. 46; Ve. 6. 27; so स यौवनपदवीमारूढः<BR> Pt. 1, ‘he attained his majority’ (grew up to manʼs estate).<BR>—2 Position, station, rank, dignity, office, post; एतत् स्तोत्रं प्रपठता<BR> विचार्य गुरुवाक्यतः । प्राप्यते ब्रह्मपदवी सत्यं सत्यं न संशयः ॥<BR> Tattvamasi Stotra. 12.<BR>—3 A place, site.<BR>—4 Good conduct or behaviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदवी
पदविः, -वी <i>f.</i><BR> [पद्-अवि वा ङीप]<BR>—1 A way, road, path, course (fig. also); पवनपदवी Me. 8; अनुयाहि<BR> साधुपदवीम् Bh. 2. 77 ‘follow in the footsteps of the good’; Ś. 4. 14;<BR> R. 3. 50, 7. 7, 8. 11, 15. 99; Bh. 3. 46; Ve. 6. 27; so स यौवनपदवीमारूढः<BR> Pt. 1, ‘he attained his majority’ (grew up to manʼs estate).<BR>—2 Position, station, rank, dignity, office, post; एतत् स्तोत्रं प्रपठता<BR> विचार्य गुरुवाक्यतः । प्राप्यते ब्रह्मपदवी सत्यं सत्यं न संशयः ॥<BR> Tattvamasi Stotra. 12.<BR>—3 A place, site.<BR>—4 Good conduct or behaviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदशः
पदशः <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Step by step, gradually.<BR>—2 Word by word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदाजिः|पदाजि
पदाजिः, पदातः, पदातिः<BR> [पद्भ्यामतति, अत्-अच्]<BR>—1 A foot-soldier; ‘पदातिपत्तिपदगपादातिकपदाजयः’ Ak.; R. 7. 37.<BR>—2 A pedestrian (walking on foot); U. 5. 12.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पदाज्यध्यक्षः, पदाजिलव<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदातः|पदात
पदाजिः, पदातः, पदातिः<BR> [पद्भ्यामतति, अत्-अच्]<BR>—1 A foot-soldier; ‘पदातिपत्तिपदगपादातिकपदाजयः’ Ak.; R. 7. 37.<BR>—2 A pedestrian (walking on foot); U. 5. 12.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पदाज्यध्यक्षः, पदाजिलव<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदातिः|पदाति
पदाजिः, पदातः, पदातिः<BR> [पद्भ्यामतति, अत्-अच्]<BR>—1 A foot-soldier; ‘पदातिपत्तिपदगपादातिकपदाजयः’ Ak.; R. 7. 37.<BR>—2 A pedestrian (walking on foot); U. 5. 12.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पदाज्यध्यक्षः, पदाजिलव<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदाज्यध्यक्षः
पदाजिः + -अध्यक्षः the commander-in-chief of the infantry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदाजिलव
पदाजिः + -लव (पदातिलब) <i>a.</i> most humble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदातिन्
पदातिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having foot-soldiers (as an army).<BR>—2 Being or going on foot. ━<i>m.</i> A foot-soldier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदातिकः|पदातिक
पदातिकः, -पदातीयः<BR>—1 A foot-man.<BR>—2 A peon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदातीयः|पदातीय
पदातिकः, -पदातीयः<BR>—1 A foot-man.<BR>—2 A peon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदारः|पदार
पदारः<BR>—1 The dust of the feet.<BR>—2 A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदिः|पदि
पदिः Ved.<BR>—1 An animal moving with its feet.<BR>—2 A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदिक|पदिकः
पदिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Going on foot, pedestrian.<BR>—2 One <i>Pada</i> long.<BR>—3 Containing only one division.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदिकः|पदिक
पदिक + .{@-कः@} A footman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदिकम्
पदिक + .{@-कम्@} The point of the foot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदीकृ
पदीकृ To raise to the square root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पदेकः|पदेक
पदेकः A falcon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्वन्
पद्वन् <i>m.</i> A road, way; Uṇ. 4. 112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्ग|पद्गः
पद्ग, पद्रथ &c. See under पद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्रथ|पद्रथः
पद्ग, पद्रथ &c. See under पद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0960-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पन्न|पन्नं|पन्नः
पन्न <i>p. p.</i> [पद्-क्त]<BR>—1 Fallen, sunk, gone down, descended.<BR>—2 Gone; see पद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पन्नम्
पन्न + .{@-न्नम्@}<BR>—1 Downward motion; descent, fall.<BR>—2 Creeping on the ground.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पन्नगः, पन्नरूप<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पन्नगः|पन्नग
पन्न + -गः a snake, serpent; विप्रकृतः पन्नगः फणां कुरुते Ś. 6. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पन्नगम्
पन्न + -गः + .({@-गम्@}) lead. ˚अरिः, ˚अशनः, ˚नाशनः epithets of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पन्नरूप
पन्न + -रूप <i>a.</i> pale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्म|पद्मं|पद्मः
पद्म <i>a.</i> [पद्-मन्] Lotus-hued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मम्
पद्म + .{@-द्मम्@}<BR>—1 A lotus (<i>m.</i> also in this sense); Nelumbium Speciosum (variety red);<BR> पद्मपत्रस्थितं तोयं धत्ते मुक्ताफलश्रियम्.<BR>—2 A lotus-like ornament.<BR>—3 The form or figure of a lotus.<BR>—4 The root of a lotus.<BR>—5 The coloured marks on the trunk and face of an elephant; कालः किरातः<BR> स्फुटपद्मकस्य वधं व्यधाद्यस्य दिनाद्विपस्य N. 22. 9;<BR>—6 An army arrayed in the form of a lotus; पद्मेन चैव व्यूहेन निविशेत<BR> सदा स्वयम् Ms. 7. 188.<BR>—7 A particular high number (one thousand trillions).<BR>—8 Lead.<BR>—9 N. given by the Tāntrikas to the six divisions of the upper part of<BR> the body called <i>Cakras</i>.<BR>—10 A mark or mole on the human body.<BR>—11 A spot. 12 N. of a particular part of a column.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मः|पद्म|पद्मं
पद्म + .{@-द्मः@} A kind of temple.<BR>—2 N. of a quarter-elephant. ये पद्मकल्पैरपि च द्विपेन्द्रैः Bu. C. 2. 3.<BR>—3 A species of serpent.<BR>—4 An epithet of Rāma.<BR>—5 One of the nine treasures of Kubera; see नवनिधि.<BR>—6 A kind of coitus or mode of sexual enjoyment.<BR>—7 A particular posture of the body in religious meditation.<BR>—8 One of the eight treasures connected with the magical art called पद्मिनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मा
पद्म + .{@-द्मा@}<BR>—1 N. of Lakṣmī, the goddess of fortune, and wife of Viṣṇu; (तं)<BR> पद्मा पद्मातपत्रेण भेजे साम्राज्यदीक्षितम् R. 4. 5.<BR>—2 Cloves.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पद्माक्ष, पद्माटः, पद्मान्तरम्, पद्मान्तरः, पद्माकरः, पद्मालयः, पद्मासनम्, पद्माह्वम्, पद्मोद्भवः, पद्मकर, पद्महस्त, पद्मकर्णिका, पद्मकलिका, पद्मकाष्ठम्, पद्मकेशरः, पद्मकेशरम्, पद्मकोशः, पद्मकोषः, पद्मखण्डम्, पद्मषण्डम्, पद्मगन्ध, पद्मगन्धि, पद्मगर्भः, पद्मगुणा, पद्मगृहा, पद्मजः, पद्मजातः, पद्मभवः, पद्मभूः, पद्मयोनिः, पद्मसंभवः, पद्मतन्तुः, पद्मनाभः, पद्मनाभिः, पद्मनाभः, पद्मनालम्, पद्मनिधिः, पद्मपाणिः, पद्मपुष्पः, पद्मप्रिया, पद्मबन्धः, पद्मबन्धुः, पद्मबीजम्, पद्मभासः, पद्ममालिनी, पद्ममुद्रा, पद्मरागः, पद्मरागम्, पद्मरूपा, पद्मरेखा, पद्मलाञ्छनः, पद्मवनबान्धवः, पद्मवर्चस्, पद्मवासा, पद्मसमासनः, पद्मस्नुषा, पद्महस्तः, पद्महासः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्माक्ष|पद्माक्षं|पद्माक्षः
पद्म + -अक्ष <i>a.</i> lotus-eyed; रामं दूर्वादलश्यामं पद्माक्षं पीतवाससम्<BR> Rāmarakṣā. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्माक्षः|पद्माक्ष|पद्माक्षं
पद्म + -अक्ष + .({@-क्षः@}) an epithet of Viṣṇu or the sun;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्माक्षम्
पद्म + -अक्ष + .({@-क्षम्@}) the seed of a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्माटः|पद्माट
पद्म + -अटः Cassia Tora (Mar. टाकळा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मान्तरम्
पद्म + -अन्तरम्, -अन्तरः a lotus-leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मान्तरः|पद्मान्तर
पद्म + -अन्तरम्, -अन्तरः a lotus-leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्माकरः|पद्माकर
पद्म + -आकरः<BR>—1 a large tank of pond abounding in lotuses.<BR>—2 a pond or pool or water in general.<BR>—3 a lotus-pool.<BR>—4 an assemblage of lotuses; पद्माकरं दिनकरो विकचीकरोति Bh. 2. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मालयः|पद्मालय
पद्म + -आलयः an epithet of Brahman, the creator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मालया
पद्म + -आलयः + .({@-या@})<BR>—1 an epithet of Lakṣmī.<BR>—2 cloves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मासनम्
पद्म + -आसनम्<BR>—1 a lotus-seat; प्रणेमतुस्तौ पितरौ प्रजानां पद्मासनस्थाय पितामहाय Ku. 7. 86.<BR>—2 a particular posture in religious meditation; ऊरुमूले वामपादं<BR> पुनस्तु दक्षिणं पदम् । वामोरौ स्थापयित्वा तु पद्मासनमिति स्मृतम् ॥;<BR> ध्यायेदाजानुबाहुं धृतशरधनुषं बद्धपद्मासनस्थम् Rāmarakṣā 1.<BR>—3 a kind of coitus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मासनः|पद्मासन|पद्मासनं
पद्म + -आसनम् + .({@-नः@})<BR>—1 an epithet of Brahman, the creator.<BR>—2 of Śiva.<BR>—3 of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्माह्वम्
पद्म + -आह्वम् cloves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मोद्भवः|पद्मोद्भव
पद्म + -उद्भवः an epithet of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकर|पद्मकरः
पद्म + -कर, -हस्त <i>a.</i> holding a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्महस्त|पद्महस्तः
पद्म + -कर, -हस्त <i>a.</i> holding a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकरः|पद्मकर
पद्म + -कर, -हस्त + .({@-रः, -स्तः@})<BR>—1 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 a lotus like hand.<BR>—3 N. of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्महस्तः|पद्महस्त
पद्म + -कर, -हस्त + .({@-रः, -स्तः@})<BR>—1 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 a lotus like hand.<BR>—3 N. of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकरा
पद्म + -कर, -हस्त + .({@-रा, -स्ता@}) N. of Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्महस्ता
पद्म + -कर, -हस्त + .({@-रा, -स्ता@}) N. of Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकर्णिका
पद्म + -कर्णिका<BR>—1 the pericarp of a lotus.<BR>—2 the central part of an army arrayed in the form of a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकलिका
पद्म + -कलिका a lotus-bud, an unblown lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकाष्ठम्
पद्म + -काष्ठम् a fragrant wood used in medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकेशरः|पद्मकेशर
पद्म + -केशरः, -केशरम् the filament of a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकेशरम्
पद्म + -केशरः, -केशरम् the filament of a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकोशः|पद्मकोश
पद्म + -कोशः, -कोषः<BR>—1 the calyx of a lotus.<BR>—2 a position of the fingers resembling the calyx of a lotus.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">Page0961-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मकोषः|पद्मकोष
पद्म + -कोशः, -कोषः<BR>—1 the calyx of a lotus.<BR>—2 a position of the fingers resembling the calyx of a lotus.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">Page0961-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

