पद्म + -खण्डम्, -षण्डम् a multitude of lotuses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मषण्डम्
पद्म + -खण्डम्, -षण्डम् a multitude of lotuses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मगन्ध|पद्मगंध|पद्मगन्धं
पद्म + -गन्ध, -गन्धि <i>a.</i> lotus-scented, or as fragrant as or smelling like a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मगन्धि|पद्मगंधि
पद्म + -गन्ध, -गन्धि <i>a.</i> lotus-scented, or as fragrant as or smelling like a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मगन्धम्
पद्म + -गन्ध, -गन्धि + .({@-न्धम्, -गन्धि@} <i>n.</i>) = पद्मकाष्ठ q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मगन्धि|पद्मगंधि
पद्म + -गन्ध, -गन्धि + .({@-न्धम्, -गन्धि@} <i>n.</i>) = पद्मकाष्ठ q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मगर्भः|पद्मगर्भ
पद्म + -गर्भः<BR>—1 an epithet of Brahman.<BR>—2 of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 of Śiva.<BR>—4 of Buddha.<BR>—5 the sun.<BR>—6 the inside or middle of a lotus; पद्मगर्भादिवोद्धृतम् Kāv. 2. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मगुणा
