पद्मगृहा
पद्म + -गुणा, -गृहा<BR>—1 an epithet of Lakṣmī, the goddess of wealth.<BR>—2 cloves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

