पद्मयोनिः|पद्मयोनि
पद्म + -जः, -जातः, -भवः, -भूः, -योनिः, -संभवः epithets of Brahman,<BR> the lotus-born god.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मसंभवः|पद्मसम्भव
पद्म + -जः, -जातः, -भवः, -भूः, -योनिः, -संभवः epithets of Brahman,<BR> the lotus-born god.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मतन्तुः|पद्मतन्तु|पद्मतंतु
पद्म + -तन्तुः the fibrous stalk of a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पद्मनाभः|पद्मनाभ
