पद्मपाणिः|पद्मपाणि
पद्म + -पाणिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Brahman.<BR>—2 N. of Buddha.<BR>—3 N. of the sun.<BR>—4 of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0961-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

