परिमोक्षः<BR>—1 Removing, relieving; प्रायो विषाणपरिमोक्षलघूत्तमाङ्गान् खड्गांश्चकार<BR> नृपतिर्निशितैः क्षुरप्रैः R. 9. 62 ‘removing the horns’, <i>i. e.</i> breaking them down.<BR>—2 Liberation, setting free, deliverance.<BR>—3 Emptying, evacuation.<BR>—4 Escape.<BR>—5 Final beatitude (निर्वाण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0983-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

