परिवादः + -कथा abusive language, reproof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवादकरः|परिवादकर
परिवादः + -करः a slanderer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवादकः|परिवादक
परिवादकः<BR>—1 A plaintiff, complainant, accuser.<BR>—2 One who plays on the lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवादिन्
परिवादिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Reviling, censuring, abusing, slandering.<BR>—2 Accusing.<BR>—3 Screaming, crying aloud.<BR>—4 Censured, slandered. ━<i>m.</i> An accuser, a plaintiff, complainant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवादिनी
परिवादिन् + .{@-नी@} A lute (वीणा) of seven strings; Śi. 6. 9; R. 8. 35; N. 15. 44;<BR> महतीं परिवादिनीं च कांचिद् भुजपाशैस्तपनीयपारिहार्यैः Bu. C. 5. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्गः|परिवर्ग
परिवर्गः Ved. Avoiding, removing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्जनम्
परिवर्जनम्<BR>—1 Leaving, quitting, abandoning.<BR>—2 Giving up, resigning.<BR>—3 Killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्जित|परिवर्ज्जित
परिवर्जित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Abandoned.<BR>—2 Deprived of.<BR>—3 accomplished (संपादित, अर्जित); स्वं स्वं स्थानमुपागम्य स्वकर्मपरिवर्जितम्<BR> Mb. 12. 264. 21.<BR>—4 Wound round, girt.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: परिवर्जितसंख्या<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

