परिवर्जित + -संख्य^1 <i>a.</i> countless, innumerable.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by . Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/6b5cd78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्त्मन्
परिवर्त्मन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 going round about.<BR>—2 Describing a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्मन्
परिवर्मन् <i>a.</i> Clad in mail; armed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवसथः|परिवसथ
परिवसथः A village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवह्
परिवह् €1 U.<BR>—1 To overflow.<BR>—2 To carry about or round.<BR>—3 To marry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवहः|परिवह
परिवहः<BR>—1 N. of one of the seven courses of wind; it is the sixth course and<BR> bears along the <i>Saptarṣis</i><BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">Page0985-1</a>]<BR> and the celestial Ganges; सप्तर्षिचक्रं स्वर्ङ्गगां षष्ठः परिवहस्तथा;<BR> (for the other courses of wind see under वायु; cf. the description<BR> of परिवह given by Kālidāsa:− त्रिस्रोतसं वहति यो गगनप्रतिष्ठां<BR> ज्योतींषि वर्तयति च प्रविभक्तरश्मिः । तस्य द्वितीयहरिविकमनिस्तमस्कं<BR> वायोरिमं परिवहस्य वदन्ति मार्गम् Ś. 7. 6).<BR>—2 One of the seven tongues of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0984-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाहः|परिवाह
परि(री)वाहः<BR>—1 Overflowing (of a tank &c.), inundation, overflow, natural or artificial;<BR> प्रथमं (कौतूहलं) सपरिवाहमासीत् Ś. 2.<BR>—2 A water-course, drain or channel to carry off excess of water; पूरोत्पीडे<BR> तटागस्य परीवाहः प्रतिक्रिया U. 3. 29; Pt. 2. 150; Śi. 16. 51; R. 8. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवाहः|परीवाह
परि(री)वाहः<BR>—1 Overflowing (of a tank &c.), inundation, overflow, natural or artificial;<BR> प्रथमं (कौतूहलं) सपरिवाहमासीत् Ś. 2.<BR>—2 A water-course, drain or channel to carry off excess of water; पूरोत्पीडे<BR> तटागस्य परीवाहः प्रतिक्रिया U. 3. 29; Pt. 2. 150; Śi. 16. 51; R. 8. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवाहिन्
परिवाहिन् <i>a.</i> Overflowing; as in आनन्दपरिवाहिणा चक्षुषा Ś. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवापः|परिवाप
परि(री)वापः<BR>—1 Shaving, shearing<BR>—2 Sowing<BR>—3 A reservoir, pool, pond, a piece of water.<BR>—4 Furniture.<BR>—5 Train, retinue; सुप्रतिविहितयानवाहनपुरुषपरिवापः Kau. A. 1. 6.<BR>—6 Fried grains of rice.<BR>—7 Coagulated milk.<BR>—8 Stand-point, place; Mb. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

