परिविण्णः|परिविण्ण
परिविण्णः(न्नः), परिवित्तः, परिवित्तिः An unmarried<BR> elder brother whose younger brother is married; दाराग्निहोत्रसंयोगं<BR> कुरुते योऽग्रजे स्थिते । परिवेत्ता स विज्ञेयः परिवित्तिस्तु पूर्वजः ॥<BR> Ms. 3. 171; and see परिवेत्तृ also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविन्नः|परिविन्न
परिविण्णः(न्नः), परिवित्तः, परिवित्तिः An unmarried<BR> elder brother whose younger brother is married; दाराग्निहोत्रसंयोगं<BR> कुरुते योऽग्रजे स्थिते । परिवेत्ता स विज्ञेयः परिवित्तिस्तु पूर्वजः ॥<BR> Ms. 3. 171; and see परिवेत्तृ also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवित्तः|परिवित्त
परिविण्णः(न्नः), परिवित्तः, परिवित्तिः An unmarried<BR> elder brother whose younger brother is married; दाराग्निहोत्रसंयोगं<BR> कुरुते योऽग्रजे स्थिते । परिवेत्ता स विज्ञेयः परिवित्तिस्तु पूर्वजः ॥<BR> Ms. 3. 171; and see परिवेत्तृ also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवित्तिः|परिवित्ति
परिविण्णः(न्नः), परिवित्तः, परिवित्तिः An unmarried<BR> elder brother whose younger brother is married; दाराग्निहोत्रसंयोगं<BR> कुरुते योऽग्रजे स्थिते । परिवेत्ता स विज्ञेयः परिवित्तिस्तु पूर्वजः ॥<BR> Ms. 3. 171; and see परिवेत्तृ also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवितर्कः|परिवितर्क
परिवितर्कः<BR>—1 Any thought.<BR>—2 Examination; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविद्धः|परिविद्ध
परिविद्धः An epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविन्दकः|परिविन्दक|परिविंदक|परिविंदकः
परिविन्दकः, परिविन्दत् <i>m.</i> A younger brother married<BR> before the elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविन्दत्|परिविंदत्
परिविन्दकः, परिविन्दत् <i>m.</i> A younger brother married<BR> before the elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविविदानः|परिविविदान
परिविविदानः Ved. = परिवित्तः above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविश्
परिविश्(ष्) <i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To surround.<BR>—2 To present or offer food.<BR>—3 To attend, wait upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविष्
परिविश्(ष्) <i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To surround.<BR>—2 To present or offer food.<BR>—3 To attend, wait upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविष्ट
परिविष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Surrounded, besieged; परिविष्टं जाहुषं विश्वतः सीम् Rv. 1. 116. 20.<BR>—2 Surrounded by a halo (sun or moon).<BR>—3 Dressed, offered, presented as (food).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिविष्टि
परिविष्टि <i>f.</i> Ved. Service, attendance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेशः|परिवेश
परि(री)वेशः (षः)<BR>—1 Waiting at meals, distributing food, serving up meals.<BR>—2 A circle, circlet, halo (of lustre &c.); स्वकिरणपरिवेषोद्भेदशून्याः<BR> प्रदीपाः R. 5. 74, 6. 13; Śi. 5. 52, 17. 9.<BR>—3 Especially, the halo round the sun or moon; लक्ष्यते स्म तदनन्तरं<BR> रविर्बद्धभीमपरिवेषमण्डलः R. 11. 59;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">Page0985-2</a>]<BR> अद्यापि तत् सपरिवेषशशिप्रकाशमास्यं स्मरामि Bil. C.; U. 46.<BR>—4 The circumference of a circle.<BR>—5 The disc of the sun or moon.<BR>—6 Anything which surrounds or protects. उज्जासानाय परितः परिवेषकृतां<BR> द्विषाम् Śiva B. 26. 64, 28. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवेशः|परीवेश
