परिवेषकः|परिवेषक
परिवेषकः<BR>—1 A waiter at meals.<BR>—2 A servant; अद्राक्षमहमाहूतान् यज्ञे ते परिवेषकान् Mb. 3. 51. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेषणम्
परिवेषणम्, -शनम्<BR>—1 Serving up meals, waiting, distributing food; विप्राणां प्रवराः सर्वे<BR> चक्रुश्च परिवेषणम् Rām. 7. 91. 28.<BR>—2 Enclosing, surrounding निवेशपरिवेशनम् Mb. 14. 45. 1.<BR>—3 A halo round the sun or moon.<BR>—4 Circumference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेशनम्
