परिवेष्टृ
परिवेष्टृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 Waiter at meals, one who serves up meals; मरुतः परिवेष्टारो मरुतस्यावसन्<BR> गृहे Ait. Br.<BR>—2 One who offers an oblation; परिवेष्टाग्निहोत्रस्य भवेन्नासंस्कृतस्तथा<BR> Mb. 12. 165. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

