परिवीत
परिवीत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Surrounded, encompassed.<BR>—2 Pervaded, overspread; उदन्वदम्भःपरिवीतमूर्तिः (पृथ्वी) Śi. 3. 34;<BR> Ki. 5. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवीतम्
परिवीत + .{@-तम्@} The bow of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृढ|परिवृढः
परिवृढ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Firm, thick, dense<BR>—2 Ample, large.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृढः|परिवृढ
परिवृढ + .{@-ढः@} A master, lord, owner, head, chief (used adjectively also);<BR> किं भुवः परिवृढा न विवोढुं तत्र तामुपनता विवदन्ते N. 5. 42;<BR> Ku. 12. 58; Mv. 6. 25, 31, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृ
परिवृ €5. €9. €10 U. Encircle, surround; क्रव्याद्गणेषु परितः परिवारयत्सु U. 4. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारः|परिवार
परि(री)वारः<BR>—1 Train, retinue, attendants or followers collectively; (यानम्) अध्यास्य<BR> कन्या परिवारशोभि R. 6. 10, 12. 16; ग्रहगणपरिवारो राजमार्गप्रदीपः Mk. 1. 57.<BR>—2 A cover, covering; व्याघ्रचर्मपरिवाराः Mb. 5. 155. 8;<BR>—3 A hedge round a village.<BR>—4 A sheath, scabbard; परिवारः परिजने खड्गकोशे परिच्छदे Med.;<BR> परिवारात् पृथक्चके खड्गश्चात्मा च केनचित् Śi. 19. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवारः|परीवार
परि(री)वारः<BR>—1 Train, retinue, attendants or followers collectively; (यानम्) अध्यास्य<BR> कन्या परिवारशोभि R. 6. 10, 12. 16; ग्रहगणपरिवारो राजमार्गप्रदीपः Mk. 1. 57.<BR>—2 A cover, covering; व्याघ्रचर्मपरिवाराः Mb. 5. 155. 8;<BR>—3 A hedge round a village.<BR>—4 A sheath, scabbard; परिवारः परिजने खड्गकोशे परिच्छदे Med.;<BR> परिवारात् पृथक्चके खड्गश्चात्मा च केनचित् Śi. 19. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारण
परिवारण<BR>—1 An envelope, a cover; सपताका रथा रेजुर्वैयाघ्रपरिवारणाः Mb. 6. 72. 13.<BR>—2 Train, retinue; अपि संक्षीणकोशोऽपि लभते परिवारणम् Mb. 5. 38. 37.<BR>—3 Warding off, keeping off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारता
परिवारता Subjection, dependence; विजिगीषोर्नृपतयः प्रयान्ति<BR> परिवारताम् Śi. 2. 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवारित
परिवारित <i>p. p.</i> Surrouded, encircled, encompassed, begirt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत|परिवृतः
परिवृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Surrounded, encompassed, encircled, attended.<BR>—2 Hidden, concealed.<BR>—3 Pervaded, overspread<BR>—4 Known.<BR>—5 Completely gained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृतम्
परिवृत + .{@-तम्@} Ved. An enclosed space for a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0985-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृतिः|परिवृति
परिवृतिः <i>f.</i> Surrounding; standing round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्
परिवृत् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To turn round, revolve; अधो विवस्वान् परिवर्तमानः Ku. 1. 16.<BR>—2 To roam about, move hither and thither.<BR>—3 To change, barter, exchange.<BR>—4 To turn back; गुहाशयानां सिंहानां परिवृत्यावलोकितम् R. 4. 72;<BR> परिवृत्तार्धमुखी मयाऽद्य दृष्टा V. 1. 19.<BR>—5 To be, fall into; Māl. 9. 8.<BR>—6 To decay, perish, disappear; विधातुर्वामत्वाद्विपदि परिवर्तामह इमे Māl. 10. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तः|परिवर्त|परिवर्त्त|परिवर्त्तः
परि(री)वर्तः<BR>—1 Revolving, revolution (as of a planet); न यत्र भूयः परिवर्त<BR> उग्रः Bhāg. 1. 3. 39.<BR>—2 A period, lapse or expiration of time; युगशतपरिवर्तान् Ś. 7. 34.<BR>—3 The expiration of a Yuga; जनैस्तदा युगपरिवर्तवायुभिर्विवर्तिता Śi. 17. 12.<BR>—4 Repetition; recurrence.<BR>—5 Change, alteration; तदीदृशो जीवलोकस्य परिवर्तः U. 3 ‘changed condition of life’<BR>, ‘change in circumstances’; so जीवलोकपरिवर्तमनुभवामि<BR> Māl. 7; स्वरपरिवर्तः Mk. 1.<BR>—6 Retreat, flight, desertion.<BR>—7 A year.<BR>—8 Repeated birth, transmigration.<BR>—9 Barter, exchange; अन्योन्यवस्त्रपरिवर्तमिव व्यधत्ताम् Śi. 5. 39.<BR>—10 Requital, return.<BR>—11 An abode.<BR>—12 A chapter or section of a work.<BR>—13 N. of the Kūrma or second incarnation of Viṣṇu.<BR>—14 A turning round or derangement; अधन्यस्य मम कोकिलानामक्षिपरिवर्त<BR> इव कुक्षिपरिवर्तः संवृत्तः Svapna. 4.<BR>—15 Moving to and fro, stirring; चरितमहामृताब्धिपरिवर्तपरिश्रमणाः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 87. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवर्तः|परीवर्त|परीवर्त्त|परीवर्त्तः
परि(री)वर्तः<BR>—1 Revolving, revolution (as of a planet); न यत्र भूयः परिवर्त<BR> उग्रः Bhāg. 1. 3. 39.<BR>—2 A period, lapse or expiration of time; युगशतपरिवर्तान् Ś. 7. 34.<BR>—3 The expiration of a Yuga; जनैस्तदा युगपरिवर्तवायुभिर्विवर्तिता Śi. 17. 12.<BR>—4 Repetition; recurrence.<BR>—5 Change, alteration; तदीदृशो जीवलोकस्य परिवर्तः U. 3 ‘changed condition of life’<BR>, ‘change in circumstances’; so जीवलोकपरिवर्तमनुभवामि<BR> Māl. 7; स्वरपरिवर्तः Mk. 1.<BR>—6 Retreat, flight, desertion.<BR>—7 A year.<BR>—8 Repeated birth, transmigration.<BR>—9 Barter, exchange; अन्योन्यवस्त्रपरिवर्तमिव व्यधत्ताम् Śi. 5. 39.<BR>—10 Requital, return.<BR>—11 An abode.<BR>—12 A chapter or section of a work.<BR>—13 N. of the Kūrma or second incarnation of Viṣṇu.<BR>—14 A turning round or derangement; अधन्यस्य मम कोकिलानामक्षिपरिवर्त<BR> इव कुक्षिपरिवर्तः संवृत्तः Svapna. 4.<BR>—15 Moving to and fro, stirring; चरितमहामृताब्धिपरिवर्तपरिश्रमणाः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 87. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तक|परिवर्तकं|परिवर्त्तक
परिवर्तक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Causing to turn round or revolve.<BR>—2 Requiting, exchanging.<BR>—3 Turning round.<BR>—4 Concluding, मासर्तुसंज्ञापरिवर्तकेण Mb. 12. 321. 92.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तनम्
परिवर्तनम्<BR>—1 Moving to and fro, turning about, rolling about (as on the lap, bed<BR> &c.); महार्हशय्यापरिवर्तनच्युतैः स्वकेशपुष्पैरपि या स्म दूयते<BR> Ku. 5. 12; R. 9. 13; Śi. 4. 47.<BR>—2 Turning round, revolving, whirling round.<BR>—3 Revolution, end of a period or time.<BR>—4 Change; वेषपरिवर्तनं विधाय Pt. 3.<BR>—5 Exchange, barter … … परिहापणमुपभोगः परिवर्तनमपहारश्चेति<BR> कोशक्षयः Kau. A. 2. 7. 26; also राजद्रव्याणामन्यद्रव्येणादानं परिवर्तनम्<BR>—6 Inverting.<BR>—7 Requital, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तिका|परिवर्त्तिका
परिवर्तिका Phimosis or contraction of the prepuce (in medicine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तित|परिवर्त्तित
परिवर्तित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Revolved.<BR>—2 Exchanged.<BR>—3 Inverted.<BR>—4 Returned, retreated.<BR>—5 Put aside, removed, destroyed; Mk.<BR>—6 Searched thoroughly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तितम्
परिवर्तित + .{@-तम्@} the action of turning; Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्तिन्|परिवर्त्तिन्
परिवर्तिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Moving or turning round, revolving.<BR>—2 Ever-recurring, coming round again and again; परिवर्तिनि संसारे<BR> मृतः को वा न जायते Pt. 1. 27.<BR>—3 Changing.<BR>—4 Being or remaining near, moving round about.<BR>—5 Retreating, flying.<BR>—6 Exchanging.<BR>—7 Recompensing, requiting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्त्य
परिवर्त्य <i>a.</i> Ever recurring, roaming about; परिवर्त्यजनं<BR> त्ववेक्षमाणस्तत एवाभिमतं तु वनं न भेजे Bu. C. 5. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्त
परिवृत्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Revolved, turned round; ˚अर्धमुखी V. 1. 19.<BR>—2 Retreated, turned back.<BR>—3 Exchanged, bartered.<BR>—4 Finished, ended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्तम्
परिवृत्त + .{@-त्तम्@} An embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृत्तिः|परिवृत्ति
परिवृत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Revolution; अभजत परिवृत्तिं साथ पर्यस्तहस्ता Śi. 10. 91.<BR>—2 Return; turning back.<BR>—3 Barter, exchange.<BR>—4 End, termination.<BR>—5 Surrounding.<BR>—6 Staying or dwelling in a place.<BR>—7 Contraction of the prepuce.<BR>—8 (In Rhet.) A figure of speech in which there is an exchange of a thing<BR> for what is equal, less or greater; परिवृत्तिर्विनिमयो योऽर्थानां स्यात्<BR> समासमैः K. P. 10; <i>e. g.</i> दत्त्वा कटाक्षमेणाक्षी जग्राह हृदयं<BR> मम । मया तु हृदयं दत्त्वा गृहीतो मदनज्वरः ॥ S. D. 734.<BR>—9 Substitution of one word for another without affecting the sense; as<BR> in; शब्दपरि वृत्तिसहत्वम् K. P. 10; <i>e. g.</i> in वृषध्वज, ध्वज<BR> may be substituted by लाञ्छन or वाहन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृक्ण
परिवृक्ण <i>a.</i> Mutilated; Ch. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृध्
परिवृध् €1 Ā. To grow up, increase. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To grow, increase, prosper.<BR>—2 To bring up, rear.<BR>—3 To rejoice, delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्धकः|परिवर्धक
परिवर्धकः A groom, hostler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्धनम्
परिवर्धनम्<BR>—1 Increasing, enlarging.<BR>—2 Rearing, breeding; पशूनां परिवर्धनम् Ms. 10. 331.<BR>—3 Growing, growth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवर्धित
परिवर्धित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Increased.<BR>—2 Cut, excavated.<BR>—3 Reared, brought up; श्यामाकमुष्टिपरिवर्धितको जहाति … पदवीं<BR> मृगस्ते Ś. 4. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवृद्धिः|परिवृद्धि
परिवृद्धिः <i>f.</i> Growth, increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवे
परिवे<BR>—1 U. 1 To interweave; परिवीय गिरौ तस्मिन् Bhāg. 8. 7. 1.<BR>—2 To bind, fetter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेत्तृ
परिवेत्तृ <i>m.</i>, परिवेदकः A younger brother married before<BR> the elder; R. 12. 16; ज्येष्ठे अनिर्विष्टे कनीयान् निर्विशन् परिवेत्ता भवति,<BR> परिविण्णो ज्येष्ठः, परिवेदनीया कन्या, परिदायी दाता, परिकर्ता याजकः,<BR> सर्वे ते पतिताः Hārīta; Ms. 3. 171.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदकः|परिवेदक
परिवेत्तृ <i>m.</i>, परिवेदकः A younger brother married before<BR> the elder; R. 12. 16; ज्येष्ठे अनिर्विष्टे कनीयान् निर्विशन् परिवेत्ता भवति,<BR> परिविण्णो ज्येष्ठः, परिवेदनीया कन्या, परिदायी दाता, परिकर्ता याजकः,<BR> सर्वे ते पतिताः Hārīta; Ms. 3. 171.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदनम्
परिवेदनम्<BR>—1 The marriage of a younger brother before the elder; Ms. 11. 60.<BR>—2 Marriage in general.<BR>—3 Complete or accurate knowledge.<BR>—4 Gain, acquisition.<BR>—5 Maintaining the household fire (अग्न्याधान).<BR>—6 Pervasion on all sides, universal pervasion or existence.<BR>—7 Discussion.<BR>—8 Misery, pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदना
परिवेदनम् + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 Shrewdness, wit.<BR>—2 Prudence, foresight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदनीया
परिवेदनीया, परिवेदिनी The wife of a younger brother who<BR> is married before the elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदिनी
परिवेदनीया, परिवेदिनी The wife of a younger brother who<BR> is married before the elder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेदः|परिवेद
परिवेदः Accurate knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेल्लित
परिवेल्लित <i>a.</i> Surrounded; गुरुभिः परिवेल्लिताऽपि Bv. 2. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्ट्
परिवेष्ट् €1 Ā. or <i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To surround, encircle.<BR>—2 To embrace, clasp round; प्रायेण भूमिपतयः प्रमदा लताश्च यत्पार्श्वतो<BR> भवति तत् परिवेष्टयन्ति Pt. 1. 35.<BR>—3 To wrap up, cover;<BR>—4 To cause to shrink up, contract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0986-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिवेष्टनम्
परिवेष्टनम्<BR>—1 Surrounding, enclosing,<BR>—2 Circumference.<BR>—3 A cover, covering.<BR>—4 A bandage; दष्टस्य कीटभुजगैः परिवेष्टनं च Mk. 3. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्यक्त
परिव्यक्त <i>a.</i> Very clear or distinct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्ययः|परिव्यय
परिव्ययः<BR>—1 Cost; क्रयविक्रयमध्वानं भुक्तं च सपरिव्ययम् । योगक्षेमं च<BR> संप्रेक्ष्य वणिजो दापयेत् करान् ॥ Ms. 7. 127.<BR>—2 Condiment, spices; <i>ibid.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्याधः|परिव्याध
परिव्याधः A species of reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्रज्
परिव्रज् €1 P.<BR>—1 To wander about as a religious mendicant.<BR>—2 Turn out a recluse; त्यक्त्वा संगान् परिव्रजेत् Ms. 6. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्रज्या
परिव्रज्या<BR>—1 Strolling, wandering from place to place. परिव्रज्या च नित्यशः Ms. 10. 52.<BR>—2 Turning a recluse, leading the life of a religious mendicant or recluse.<BR>—3 Renunciation of the world, ascetic devotion, religious austerity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्राज्
परिव्राज् <i>m.</i>, परिव्राजः, -जकः A wandering mendicant,<BR> vagrant, recluse, an ascetic (of the fourth religious order) who has renounced<BR> the world; सर्वारम्भपरित्यागो भैक्ष्याश्यं ब्रह्ममूलता । निष्परिग्रहताऽद्रोहः<BR> समता सर्वजन्तुषु ॥ … … … भावसंशुद्धिरित्येषु परिव्राड्वर्य<BR> उच्यते ॥ Śabda C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्राजः|परिव्राज
परिव्राज् <i>m.</i>, परिव्राजः, -जकः A wandering mendicant,<BR> vagrant, recluse, an ascetic (of the fourth religious order) who has renounced<BR> the world; सर्वारम्भपरित्यागो भैक्ष्याश्यं ब्रह्ममूलता । निष्परिग्रहताऽद्रोहः<BR> समता सर्वजन्तुषु ॥ … … … भावसंशुद्धिरित्येषु परिव्राड्वर्य<BR> उच्यते ॥ Śabda C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिव्राजकः|परिव्राजक
परिव्राज् <i>m.</i>, परिव्राजः, -जकः A wandering mendicant,<BR> vagrant, recluse, an ascetic (of the fourth religious order) who has renounced<BR> the world; सर्वारम्भपरित्यागो भैक्ष्याश्यं ब्रह्ममूलता । निष्परिग्रहताऽद्रोहः<BR> समता सर्वजन्तुषु ॥ … … … भावसंशुद्धिरित्येषु परिव्राड्वर्य<BR> उच्यते ॥ Śabda C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशङ्क्|परिशंक्
परिशङ्क् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To suspect, believe, fancy (to be); पत्रेऽपि संचारिणि प्राप्तं त्वां<BR> परिशङ्कते Gīt. 6.<BR>—2 To doubt, have doubts about.<BR>—3 To fear, be afraid of; तृणबिन्दोः परिशङ्कितः पुरा R. 8. 79;<BR> आराधितोऽपि नृपतिः परिशङ्कनीयः Śabda C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशङ्का
परिशङ्का<BR>—1 Suspicion, distrust.<BR>—2 Hope, expectation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशङ्किन्|परिशंकिन्
परिशङ्किन् <i>a.</i> Fearing, apprehensive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशब्दित
परिशब्दित <i>a.</i> Mentioned, communicated; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशाश्वत
परिशाश्वत <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> Perpetually the same.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशिष्
परिशिष् €7 P.<BR>—1 To leave remaining. ━(<i>Caus.</i> also); भविता करेणुपरिशेषिता<BR> मही Bv. 1. 53.<BR>—2 To quit or leave (a place).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशिष्ट|परिशिष्टं
परिशिष्ट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Left, remaining.<BR>—2 Finished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशिष्टम्
परिशिष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@} A supplement, an appendix; as in गृह्यपरिशिष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशेषः|परिशेष
परि(री)शेषः<BR>—1 Remainder, remnant, elimination; परिशेषादत्रैवर्णिको रथकारः<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 1. 44.<BR>—2 Supplement.<BR>—3 Termination, conclusion, completion.<BR>—4 End, destruction (शेषः सङ्कर्षणे वधे Med.); कुलप्रसूनं<BR> परिशेषभागि Bu. C. 1. 72. {@परिशेषेण@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 With the residue.<BR>—2 Completely, in full. {@परिशेषात्@} <i>ind.</i> Consequently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीशेषः|परीशेष
परि(री)शेषः<BR>—1 Remainder, remnant, elimination; परिशेषादत्रैवर्णिको रथकारः<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 1. 44.<BR>—2 Supplement.<BR>—3 Termination, conclusion, completion.<BR>—4 End, destruction (शेषः सङ्कर्षणे वधे Med.); कुलप्रसूनं<BR> परिशेषभागि Bu. C. 1. 72. {@परिशेषेण@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 With the residue.<BR>—2 Completely, in full. {@परिशेषात्@} <i>ind.</i> Consequently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशेषणम्
परिशेषणम् Remainder, residue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशीलनम्
परिशीलनम्<BR>—1 Touch, contact (lit.); ललितलवङ्गलतापरिशीलनकोमलमलयसमीरे<BR> Gīt. 1; so वदनकमलपरिशीलनमिलित &c. 11.<BR>—2 Constant contact, intercourse, or correspondence.<BR>—3 Study, application or attachment (to a thing), steady or fixed pursuit;<BR> काव्यार्थ˚ S. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुध्
परिशुध् <i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To purify completely.<BR>—2 To explain, clear up.<BR>—3 To restore; Y. 2. 146.<BR>—4 To try, examine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुद्ध
परिशुद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Cleaned, purified.<BR>—2 Acquitted, discharged.<BR>—3 Cleared off, paid.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: परिशुद्धपार्ष्णि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुद्धपार्ष्णि
परिशुद्ध + -पार्ष्णि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 One that has refined heels.<BR>—2 secure or free from attack in the rear; यानेन तन्व्या जितदन्तिनाथौ<BR> पादाब्जराजौ परिशुद्धपार्ष्णी N. 7. 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुद्धिः|परिशुद्धि
परिशुद्धिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Complete purification; अग्नि˚ U. 4.<BR>—2 Justification; acquittal.<BR>—3 Rightness, correctness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशोधः|परिशोध
परिशोधः, -नम्<BR>—1 Purifying, cleansing.<BR>—2 Rectifying, correcting.<BR>—3 Quittance, discharging or paying off (a debt or obligation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशोधनम्
परिशोधः, -नम्<BR>—1 Purifying, cleansing.<BR>—2 Rectifying, correcting.<BR>—3 Quittance, discharging or paying off (a debt or obligation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुश्रूषा
परिशुश्रूषा Implicit obedience.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुष्
परिशुष् €4 P.<BR>—1 To be dried up, dry up; परिशुष्यन्नभवन् महाह्रदः Bk. 10. 42;<BR> सीदन्ति मम गात्राणि मुखं च परिशुष्यति Bg. 1. 29.<BR>—2 To pine, decay, wither अस्मत्कृते च परिशुष्यति काचिदन्या Bh. 2. 2.<BR>—3 To be afflicted. ━<i>Caus.</i> To emaciate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुष्क|परिशुष्कं
परिशुष्क <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Thoroughly dried, completely dried or parched up; तृषा महत्या परिशुष्कतालवः Ṛs. 1. 11.<BR>—2 Withered, shrivelled, hollow (as cheeks).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशुष्कम्
परिशुष्क + .{@-ष्कम्@} A kind of fried meat. मांसं बहुघृतैर्भृष्टं सिक्तं चेदम्बुना<BR> मुहुः । जीरकाद्यैः समायुक्तं परिशुष्कं तदुच्यते ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशोषः|परिशोष
परिशोषः Act of being completely dried or parched up, desiccation,<BR> evaporation. Also परिशोषणम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशून्य
परिशून्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Quite empty; परिशून्यं शयनीयमद्य मे R. 8. 66.<BR>—2 Quite free from, completely devoid of; इन्द्रियार्थपरिशून्यमक्षमः<BR> सोढुमेकमपि स क्षणान्तरम् 19. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिशृतः|परिशृत
परिशृतः Ardent spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रम|परिश्रमः
परिश्रम, परिश्रामः<BR>—1 Fatigue, exhaustion, trouble, pain; आत्मा परिश्रमस्य पदमुपनीतः<BR> Ś. 1; R. 1. 58, 11. 12.<BR>—2 Exertion, labour; ब्रह्मञ्छ्रेयः परिश्रामः पुंसो मद्दर्शनावधिः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 9. 20.<BR>—3 (Hence) Close application to or study of, being constantly occupied<BR> with; आर्ये कृतपरिश्रमोऽस्मि चतुःषष्ट्यङ्गे ज्योतिःशास्त्रे Mu. 1.<BR>—4 The result; अस्यैष नीतेः परिश्रमः Pratijñā. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रामः|परिश्राम
परिश्रम, परिश्रामः<BR>—1 Fatigue, exhaustion, trouble, pain; आत्मा परिश्रमस्य पदमुपनीतः<BR> Ś. 1; R. 1. 58, 11. 12.<BR>—2 Exertion, labour; ब्रह्मञ्छ्रेयः परिश्रामः पुंसो मद्दर्शनावधिः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 9. 20.<BR>—3 (Hence) Close application to or study of, being constantly occupied<BR> with; आर्ये कृतपरिश्रमोऽस्मि चतुःषष्ट्यङ्गे ज्योतिःशास्त्रे Mu. 1.<BR>—4 The result; अस्यैष नीतेः परिश्रमः Pratijñā. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रमण
परिश्रमण <i>a.</i> Free from fatigue; चरितमहामृताब्धिपरिवर्तपरिश्रमणाः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 87. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रयः|परिश्रय
परिश्रयः<BR>—1 A meeting, an assembly.<BR>—2 Refuge, asylum; न ह्यविज्ञातशीलस्य प्रदातव्यः परिश्रयः Pt. 1. 252.<BR>—3 Ved. A fence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रयणम्
परिश्रयणम् Encompassing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रान्तिः|परिश्रान्ति|परिश्रांति|परिश्रांतिः
परिश्रान्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Fatigue, weariness, trouble, exhaustion.<BR>—2 Labour, exertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रित्
परिश्रित् <i>f.</i> Ved. Small stones laid round the altar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0987-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रित
परिश्रित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Standing around.<BR>—2 Surrounded by; समागमच्छिष्यगणैः परिश्रितः Bhāg. 8. 4. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्रुत|परिश्रुतः
परिश्रुत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Heard, learnt.<BR>—2 Famous, celebrated. तं भक्तिभावोऽभ्यगृणादसत्वरं परिश्रुतोरुश्रवसं<BR> ध्रुवक्षितिः Bhāg. 4. 9. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिश्लेषः|परिश्लेष
परिश्लेषः An embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषण्डः|परिषण्ड
परिषण्डः, -ण्डम्<BR> A particular part of house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषण्डम्
परिषण्डः, -ण्डम्<BR> A particular part of house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषद्
परिषद् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An assembly, a meeting, council, audience; परिषत् स्याद्दशावरा<BR> Ms. 12. 111; अभिरूपभूयिष्ठा परिषदियम् Ś. 1.<BR>—2 A religious assembly or synod; चातुर्वैद्यः प्रकल्पी च अङ्गविद् धर्मपाठकः ।<BR> त्रयश्चाश्रमिणो वृद्धाः परिषत् स्याद्दशावरा ॥ Aṅgirasasmṛti.<BR>—3 A group, collection, circle; बटुपरिषदं पुण्यश्रीकः श्रियेव सभाजयन्<BR> U. 4. 19; Rām. 2. 111. 5. Also परिषत्त्वम्; सहस्रशः समेतानां परिषत्त्वं<BR> न विद्यते Ms. 12. 114.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषदः|परिषद
परिषदः, परिषद्यः, परिषद्वलः A member of an assembly<BR> (councillor, assessor &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषद्यः|परिषद्य
परिषदः, परिषद्यः, परिषद्वलः A member of an assembly<BR> (councillor, assessor &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषद्वलः|परिषद्वल
परिषदः, परिषद्यः, परिषद्वलः A member of an assembly<BR> (councillor, assessor &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषीवणम्
परिषीवणम्<BR>—1 Tying a knot.<BR>—2 Ved. Sewing round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषूतिः|परिषूति
परिषूतिः <i>f.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Urging, inciting.<BR>—2 Obstruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषेकः|परिषेक
परिषेकः, -परिषेचनम्<BR>—1 Sprinkling or pouring over, moistening.<BR>—2 Water for watering trees (परिषेचनम्).<BR>—3 A vessel for sprinkling or bath (परिषेचनपात्रविशेष); Mb. 13. 53. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिषेचनम्
परिषेकः, -परिषेचनम्<BR>—1 Sprinkling or pouring over, moistening.<BR>—2 Water for watering trees (परिषेचनम्).<BR>—3 A vessel for sprinkling or bath (परिषेचनपात्रविशेष); Mb. 13. 53. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कन्द्|परिष्कंद्
परिष्क(स्क)न्द् €1 P. To leap about; मेघनादः परिस्कन्दन् परिस्कन्दन्तमाश्वरिम् ।<BR> अबध्नादपरिस्कन्दं ब्रह्मपाशेन विस्फुरन् Bk. 9. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्कन्द्|परिस्कंद्
परिष्क(स्क)न्द् €1 P. To leap about; मेघनादः परिस्कन्दन् परिस्कन्दन्तमाश्वरिम् ।<BR> अबध्नादपरिस्कन्दं ब्रह्मपाशेन विस्फुरन् Bk. 9. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कण्ण|परिष्कण्णः
परिष्कण्ण(न्न) <i>a.</i> Fostered by another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कन्न
परिष्कण्ण(न्न) <i>a.</i> Fostered by another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कण्णः|परिष्कण्ण
परिष्कण्ण(न्न) + .{@-ण्णः@} A foster-child, one nourished by a stranger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कन्द|परिष्कंद|परिष्कन्दः
परिष्क(स्क)न्द <i>a.</i> Fostered by another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्कन्द|परिस्कंद|परिस्कन्दः
परिष्क(स्क)न्द <i>a.</i> Fostered by another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कन्दः|परिष्कन्द|परिष्कंद
परिष्क(स्क)न्द + .{@-न्दः@}<BR>—1 A foster-child.<BR>—2 A servant.<BR>—3 A body-guard (पार्श्वगोप); परिस्कन्दा रथस्यासन् Mb. 8. 34. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कन्दत्|परिष्कंदत्
परिष्क(स्क)न्दत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Leaping about, jumping round.<BR>—2 Surrounding, circumambulating.<BR>—3 Wandering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्कन्दत्|परिस्कंदत्
परिष्क(स्क)न्दत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Leaping about, jumping round.<BR>—2 Surrounding, circumambulating.<BR>—3 Wandering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कृ
परिष्कृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To adorn, decorate; रथो हेमपरिष्कृतः Mb.<BR>—2 (fig.) To refine, polish (as words).<BR>—3 To cleanse.<BR>—4 Ved. To prepare, fit out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्करः|परिष्कर
परिष्करः Decoration, ornamentation; रथस्यासीत् परिष्करः Mb. 8. 34. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कारः|परिष्कार
परिष्कारः<BR>—1 Decoration, ornament, embellishment. लोहघण्टापरिष्कारः Mb. 12. 141. 32.<BR>—2 Dressing, cooking.<BR>—3 Initiation, purification by initiatory rites.<BR>—4 Furniture; (also परिस्कार in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कृत|परिष्कृतः
परिष्कृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Adorned, decorated; जज्ञे निवेशनविभागपरिष्कृतानां लक्ष्मीः पुरोपवनजा<BR> वनपादपानाम् Ki. 7. 40.<BR>—2 Cooked, dressed.<BR>—3 Purified by initiatory ceremonies; (see कृ with परि).<BR>—4 Prepared, equipped.<BR>—5 Highly polished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्कृतिः|परिष्कृति
परिष्कृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Polishing.<BR>—2 Cleansing.<BR>—3 A figure of speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्क्रिया
परिष्क्रिया Adorning, decorating, embellishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्टिः|परिष्टि
परिष्टिः <i>f.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Searching all round.<BR>—2 Violence.<BR>—3 Obstruction.<BR>—4 Dilemma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्टोमः|परिष्टोम
परिष्टो(स्तो)मः<BR>—1 The coloured housings of an elephant.<BR>—2 A coverlet in general.<BR>—3 A cushion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्तोमः|परिस्तोम
परिष्टो(स्तो)मः<BR>—1 The coloured housings of an elephant.<BR>—2 A coverlet in general.<BR>—3 A cushion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्ठलम्
परिष्ठलम् A surrounding place; cf. P. VIII. 3. 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्पन्दः|परिष्पन्द|परिष्पंदः
परिष्प(स्प)न्दः<BR>—1 A train, retinue.<BR>—2 Decorating the hair (with flowers &c.).<BR>—3 Ornament or decoration in general.<BR>—4 Throbbing, vibration, palpitation, movement; प्रतिहतपरिस्पन्दः Mv. 1. 51.<BR>—5 Provision, maintenance; अग्निहोत्रपरिस्पन्दः Mb. 13. 141. 49.<BR>—6 Crushing.<BR>—7 Valour.<BR>—8 An exploit; Pratijñā. 2; कर्णपूरस्य परिस्पन्दोऽज्जुकया येन<BR> न दृष्टः Cārudatta 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्पन्दः|परिस्पन्द|परिस्पंद|परिस्पंदः
परिष्प(स्प)न्दः<BR>—1 A train, retinue.<BR>—2 Decorating the hair (with flowers &c.).<BR>—3 Ornament or decoration in general.<BR>—4 Throbbing, vibration, palpitation, movement; प्रतिहतपरिस्पन्दः Mv. 1. 51.<BR>—5 Provision, maintenance; अग्निहोत्रपरिस्पन्दः Mb. 13. 141. 49.<BR>—6 Crushing.<BR>—7 Valour.<BR>—8 An exploit; Pratijñā. 2; कर्णपूरस्य परिस्पन्दोऽज्जुकया येन<BR> न दृष्टः Cārudatta 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्यन्दः|परिष्यन्द|परिष्यंदः
परिष्यन्दः<BR>—1 A stream, river.<BR>—2 Moisture.<BR>—3 Ved. A sand-bank, an island.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वज्
परिष्वज् €1 Ā. To embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वक्त
परिष्वक्त <i>p. p.</i> Clasped, embraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वङ्गः|परिष्वङ्ग|परिष्वंग|परिष्वंगः
परिष्वङ्गः, परिष्व(स्व)ञ्जनम् or परिष्वजनम्<BR>—1 An embrace; Ki. 18. 19; विशन्ति सहसा मूढा येऽविचार्य द्विषद्विलम् ।<BR> खड्गधारापरिष्वङ्गं लभन्ते ते सुनिश्चितम् ॥ H. 3. 60.<BR>—2 Touch, contact, union; परिष्वङ्गे तुङ्गे प्रसरतितरां सा परिणतिः<BR> Bh. 3. 17; Māl. 10. 3; अतिस्नेहपरिष्वङ्गाद्वर्तिरार्द्राऽपि दह्यते<BR> Rām. 4. 1. 116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वञ्जनम्
परिष्वङ्गः, परिष्व(स्व)ञ्जनम् or परिष्वजनम्<BR>—1 An embrace; Ki. 18. 19; विशन्ति सहसा मूढा येऽविचार्य द्विषद्विलम् ।<BR> खड्गधारापरिष्वङ्गं लभन्ते ते सुनिश्चितम् ॥ H. 3. 60.<BR>—2 Touch, contact, union; परिष्वङ्गे तुङ्गे प्रसरतितरां सा परिणतिः<BR> Bh. 3. 17; Māl. 10. 3; अतिस्नेहपरिष्वङ्गाद्वर्तिरार्द्राऽपि दह्यते<BR> Rām. 4. 1. 116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्वञ्जनम्
परिष्वङ्गः, परिष्व(स्व)ञ्जनम् or परिष्वजनम्<BR>—1 An embrace; Ki. 18. 19; विशन्ति सहसा मूढा येऽविचार्य द्विषद्विलम् ।<BR> खड्गधारापरिष्वङ्गं लभन्ते ते सुनिश्चितम् ॥ H. 3. 60.<BR>—2 Touch, contact, union; परिष्वङ्गे तुङ्गे प्रसरतितरां सा परिणतिः<BR> Bh. 3. 17; Māl. 10. 3; अतिस्नेहपरिष्वङ्गाद्वर्तिरार्द्राऽपि दह्यते<BR> Rām. 4. 1. 116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिष्वजनम्
परिष्वङ्गः, परिष्व(स्व)ञ्जनम् or परिष्वजनम्<BR>—1 An embrace; Ki. 18. 19; विशन्ति सहसा मूढा येऽविचार्य द्विषद्विलम् ।<BR> खड्गधारापरिष्वङ्गं लभन्ते ते सुनिश्चितम् ॥ H. 3. 60.<BR>—2 Touch, contact, union; परिष्वङ्गे तुङ्गे प्रसरतितरां सा परिणतिः<BR> Bh. 3. 17; Māl. 10. 3; अतिस्नेहपरिष्वङ्गाद्वर्तिरार्द्राऽपि दह्यते<BR> Rām. 4. 1. 116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंवत्सर|परिसंवत्सरः
परिसंवत्सर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 A whole year old.<BR>—2 Inveterate, chronic (a disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंवत्सरः|परिसंवत्सर
परिसंवत्सर + .{@-रः@} A whole year; परिसंवत्सरात् ‘after the expiration of one whole year’<BR>; राजर्त्विक्स्नातकगुरून् प्रियश्वशुरमातुलान् । अर्हयेन्मधुपर्केण<BR> परिसंवत्सरात् पुनः ॥ Ms. 3. 119.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसख्यम्
परिसख्यम् True friendship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंख्या|परिसङ्ख्या
परिसंख्या €2 P.<BR>—1 To count or reckon up, add together.<BR>—2 To enumerate.<BR>—3 To make good, restore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंख्या|परिसङ्ख्या
परिसंख्या<BR>—1 Enumeration, computation.<BR>—2 Sum, total, number: वित्तस्य विद्यापरिसंख्यया मे R. 5. 21.<BR>—3 (In Mīm. phil.) Exclusion, specification, limitation to that which<BR> is enumerated or expressly mentioned, so that everything else is excluded;<BR> सांख्यदर्शनमेतावत् परिसंख्यानुदर्शनम् Mb. 12. 306. 42. [परिसंख्या<BR> is opposed to विधि which lays down a rule for the first time, and<BR> to नियम which restricts the choice to an alternative which is expressly<BR> stated when several such alternatives are possible]; विधिरत्यन्तमप्राप्तौ<BR> नियमः पाक्षिके सति । तत्र चान्यत्र च प्राप्तौ परिसंख्येति गीयते ॥<BR> <i>e. g.</i> पञ्च पच्चनखा भक्ष्याः usually quoted by the Mīmāṃsakas;<BR> अयं नियमविधिर्न तु परिसंख्या Kull. on Ms. 3. 45. प्राप्तस्य पुनर्वचनं<BR> परिसंख्यार्थं भवति ŚB. on MS. 11. 1. 66. परिसंख्या also means<BR> a text laying down exclusion; cf. (विधिपरिसंख्यासंशये विधिर्ज्यायान्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">Page0989-1</a>]<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 7); also परिसंख्यायां स्वार्थहानिः, परार्थकल्पना,<BR> प्राप्तबाधश्च ।<BR>—4 (In Rhet.) Special mention or exclusive specification, <i>i. e.</i> where<BR> with or without a query something is affirmed for the denial, expressed<BR> or understood, of something else similar to it; (this figure is particluarly<BR> striking when it is based on a श्लेष or pun); यस्मिन् महीं शासति<BR> चित्रकर्मसु वर्णसंकराश्चापेषु गुणच्छेदः &c. or यस्य नूपुरेषु<BR> मुखरता विवाहेषु करग्रहणं तुरङ्गेषु कशाभिघातः &c. K; for other<BR> examples see S. D. 735.<BR>—5 Recapitulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0988-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंख्यात|परिसङ्ख्यात
परिसंख्यात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Enumerated, reckoned up.<BR>—2 Specified exclusively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंख्यानम्
परिसंख्यानम्<BR>—1 Enumeration, total, number.<BR>—2 Exclusive specification; सांख्यज्ञानं प्रवक्ष्यामि परिसंख्यानदर्शनम्<BR> Mb. 12. 306. 26.<BR>—3 Correct judgment, proper estimate; Y. 3. 158.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंचक्ष्|परिसञ्चक्ष्
परिसंचक्ष् €2 Ā.<BR>—1 To exclude, to express exclusion of everything else than what is stated;<BR> परिसंचक्षाणो हि स्वार्थं जह्यात्, पदार्थं च कल्पेत, प्राप्तं च बाधेत<BR> ŚB. on MS. 1. 1. 31.<BR>—2 To enumerate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंचरः|परिसञ्चर|परिसंचर
परिसंचरः Time of universal destruction. ━<i>a.</i> Vagrant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसंतप्त|परिसन्तप्त
परिसंतप्त <i>p. p.</i> Scorched, singed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसभ्यः|परिसभ्य
परिसभ्यः A member of an assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसमाप्त
परिसमाप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Finished, completed.<BR>—2 Centred, comprehended; त्वयि तु परिसमाप्तं बन्धुकृत्यं प्रजानाम् Ś. 5. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसमापनम्
परिसमापनम्, परिसमाप्तिः <i>f.</i> Finishing, completing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसमाप्तिः|परिसमाप्ति
परिसमापनम्, परिसमाप्तिः <i>f.</i> Finishing, completing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसमूहनम्
परिसमूहनम्<BR>—1 Heaping up.<BR>—2 Sprinkling water (in a particular way) round the sacrificial fire (अग्नेः<BR> समन्तात् मार्जनम्); अग्निं परिसमूहनं पर्युक्षणम् Vaiśvadeva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसामन्
परिसामन् <i>n.</i> A Sāma hymn which is occasionally inserted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसृ
परिसृ €1 P.<BR>—1 To flow round; एनं सरस्वती परिससार Ait. Br.; परिसस्रुरापः Mb.<BR>—2 To move round, whirl round; प्रदक्षिणं तं परिसृत्य Bhāg.; परिसरति<BR> (v. l. for परिपतति) शिखी भ्रान्तिमद्वारियन्त्रम् M. 2. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसरः|परिसर
परिसरः<BR>—1 Verge, border, proximity, vicinity, neighbourhood, environs (of a river,<BR> mountain, town &c.); गोदावरीपरिसरस्य गिरेस्तटानि U. 3. 8; परिसरविषयेषु<BR> लीढमुक्ताः Ki. 5. 38.<BR>—2 Position, site.<BR>—3 Width, breadth.<BR>—4 Death.<BR>—5 A rule, precept.<BR>—6 A god.<BR>—7 A vein, artery; परिसरपद्धतिं हृदयमारुणयो दहरम् Bhāg. 10. 87. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसरणम्
परिसरणम् Running about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसर्या|परिसर्य्या
परि(री)सर्या, परि(री)सारः Wandering or moving<BR> about, perambulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीसर्या
परि(री)सर्या, परि(री)सारः Wandering or moving<BR> about, perambulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसारः|परिसार
परि(री)सर्या, परि(री)सारः Wandering or moving<BR> about, perambulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीसारः|परीसार
परि(री)सर्या, परि(री)सारः Wandering or moving<BR> about, perambulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसृतम्
परिसृतम् An enclosed or fenced place; तस्मात् परिसृते दद्यात्तिलांश्चान्ववकीरयेत्<BR> Mb. 13. 90. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसृप्
परिसृप् €1 P.<BR>—1 To move round about, hover.<BR>—2 To move to and fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसर्पः|परिसर्प
परिसर्पः<BR>—1 Going or moving about.<BR>—2 Going in search of, following, pursuing.<BR>—3 Surrounding, encircling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिसर्पणम्
परिसर्पणम्<BR>—1 Walking or creeping about; युधिष्ठिरस्तत् परिसर्पणं बुधः पुरे<BR> च राष्ट्रे च गृहे तदात्मनि.<BR>—2 Running to and fro, flying about, constantly moving; पतगपतेः<BR> परिसर्पणे च तुल्यः Mk. 3. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्कन्धः|परिस्कन्ध
परिस्कन्धः A collection, multitude (स्कन्ध); महाभूतपरिस्कन्धम् Mb. 14. 45. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्तृ
परिस्तृ €5 U., परिस्तॄ €9 U.<BR>—1 To spread, diffuse, extend; कम्बलान् परितस्तरुः Bk. 14. 11.<BR>—2 To cover (fig. also); अथ नागयूथमलिनानि जगत्परितस्तमांसि परितस्तरिरे<BR> Śi. 9. 18; अभितस्तं पृथासूनुः स्नेहेन परितस्तरे Ki. 11. 8.<BR>—3 To place in order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्तॄ
परिस्तृ €5 U., परिस्तॄ €9 U.<BR>—1 To spread, diffuse, extend; कम्बलान् परितस्तरुः Bk. 14. 11.<BR>—2 To cover (fig. also); अथ नागयूथमलिनानि जगत्परितस्तमांसि परितस्तरिरे<BR> Śi. 9. 18; अभितस्तं पृथासूनुः स्नेहेन परितस्तरे Ki. 11. 8.<BR>—3 To place in order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्तरः|परिस्तर
परिस्तरः Strewing round or heaping together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्तरणम्
परिस्तरणम्<BR>—1 Strewing or spreading round, scattering about.<BR>—2 A covering, cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्तरणिका
परिस्तरणिका A cow killed at a funeral ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्तोमः|परिस्तोम
परिस्तोमः<BR>—1 A painted or variegated cloth for a cover on elephantʼs back (कुथ);<BR> द्रुमाणां विविधैः पुष्पैः परिस्तोमैरिवार्पितम् Rām. 4. 1. 8; Mb. 6. 54. 54.<BR>—2 A sacrificial vessel; Mb. 5. 141. 41. (com. परिस्तोमाः सोमचमसादयः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्थानम्
परिस्थानम्<BR>—1 Abode.<BR>—2 Fixedness, solidity.<BR>—3 Firmness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फीत
परिस्फीत <i>a.</i> Swollen, turgid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुट
परिस्फुट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Quite plain, manifest, distinctly visible.<BR>—2 Fully developed, blown or grown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुर्
परिस्फुर् €6 P. To throb, quiver, palpitate; तस्याः परिस्फुरितगर्भभरालसायाः U. 3. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फुरणम्
परिस्फुरणम्<BR>—1 Quivering, shooting.<BR>—2 Budding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्फूर्तिः|परिस्फूर्ति
परिस्फूर्तिः<BR>—1 Shining forth.<BR>—2 Becoming clear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्यन्दः|परिस्यन्द|परिस्यंद|परिस्यंदः
परिस्यन्दः<BR>—1 Oozing, trickling, dropping.<BR>—2 A flow, stream.<BR>—3 A train &c.; see परिष्यन्द.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रवः|परिस्रव
परिस्रवः<BR>—1 Flowing, streaming.<BR>—2 Gliding down.<BR>—3 A river, torrent.<BR>—4 Birth of a child (गर्भपरिस्रव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रावः|परिस्राव
परिस्रावः<BR>—1 Effluxion, efflux.<BR>—2 N. of a morbid disease (overflowing of the moistures of the body).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रावणम्
परिस्रावणम् A filtering vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्राविन्
परिस्राविन् <i>m.</i> A kind of भगंदर q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रुत्
परिस्रुत् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A kind of intoxicating liquor.<BR>—2 Trickling, dropping, flowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिस्रुत|परिस्रुतः
परिस्रुत <i>a.</i> Flowed, trickled; शयानः शरतल्पेऽस्मिन् सशोणितपरिस्रुतः<BR> Rām. 6. 49. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0989-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहत
परिहत <i>a.</i> Loosened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहस्
परिहस् €1 P.<BR>—1 To jest, joke.<BR>—2 To laugh at, ridicule; (hence) to surpass, excel; जनानामानन्दः<BR> परिहसति निर्वाणपदवीम् G. L. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहासः|परिहास
परि(री)हासः<BR>—1 Joking, jesting, jest, mirth; merriment; त्वराप्रस्तावोऽयं न खलु<BR> परिहासस्य विषयः Māl. 9. 44; परिहासपूर्वम् ‘jokingly’ or ‘in jest’<BR> R. 6. 82; परिहासविजल्पितम् Ś. 2. 18 ‘uttered in jest’; परीहासाश्चित्राः<BR> सततमभवन् येन भवतः Ve. 3. 14; Ku. 7. 19; R. 9. 8; Śi. 10. 12.<BR>—2 Ridiculing, deriding.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: परिहासकथा, परिहासवस्तु, परिहासवेदिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीहासः|परीहास
परि(री)हासः<BR>—1 Joking, jesting, jest, mirth; merriment; त्वराप्रस्तावोऽयं न खलु<BR> परिहासस्य विषयः Māl. 9. 44; परिहासपूर्वम् ‘jokingly’ or ‘in jest’<BR> R. 6. 82; परिहासविजल्पितम् Ś. 2. 18 ‘uttered in jest’; परीहासाश्चित्राः<BR> सततमभवन् येन भवतः Ve. 3. 14; Ku. 7. 19; R. 9. 8; Śi. 10. 12.<BR>—2 Ridiculing, deriding.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: परिहासकथा, परिहासवस्तु, परिहासवेदिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहासकथा
परिहासः + -कथा an amusing story.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहासवस्तु
परिहासः + -वस्तु an object of jest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहासवेदिन्
परिहासः + -वेदिन् <i>m.</i> a buffoon, jester, a witty person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहस्तः|परिहस्त
परिहस्तः Ved.<BR>—1 An amulet put round the hand to secure the birth of a child.<BR>—2 A ring for the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहा
परिहा €3 P.<BR>—1 To leave, abandon, quit. —2 To omit, neglect; यथोक्तान्यपि कर्माणि<BR> परिहाय Ms. 12. 92. ━<i>Pass.</i> —1 To be wanting or deficient in; आर्यस्य<BR> सुविहितप्रयोगतया न किमपि परिहास्यते Ś. 1.<BR>—2 To be inferior to; ओजस्वितया न परिहीयते शच्याः V. 3; न प्रतिच्छन्दात्<BR> परिहीयते मधुरता M. 2.<BR>—3 To wane, fail, waste away; अनुदिवसं परिहीयसे अङ्गैः Ś. 3; यत्र<BR> स्वामी निर्विशेषं समं भृत्येषु वर्तते । तत्रोद्यमसमर्थानामुत्साहः परिहीयते ॥<BR> Pt. 1. 78.<BR>—4 To pass away; परिहीयते गमनवेला Ś. 4.<BR>—5 To be deprived of or excluded from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहाणम्
परिहाणम् Ved.<BR>—1 Losing, suffering loss.<BR>—2 Decrease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहाणिः|परिहाणि
परिहाणिः (-निः) <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Decrease, deficiency, loss.<BR>—2 Decay, decline; राजयक्ष्मपरिहानिराययौ कामयानसमवस्थया तुलाम् R. 19. 50.<BR>—3 Neglect, omission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहानिः|परिहानि
परिहाणिः (-निः) <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Decrease, deficiency, loss.<BR>—2 Decay, decline; राजयक्ष्मपरिहानिराययौ कामयानसमवस्थया तुलाम् R. 19. 50.<BR>—3 Neglect, omission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहापणम्
परिहापणम् Causing loss of revenue; प्रतिबन्धः प्रयोगो व्यवहारोऽवस्तारः<BR> परिहापणमुपभोगः … कोशक्षयः Kau. A. 2. 7. 23; also कॢप्तमायं<BR> परिहापयति व्ययं वा विवर्धयति इति परिहापणम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहीण
परिहीण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Waned, wasted.<BR>—2 Deprived or destitute of.<BR>—3 Wanting or deficient in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहाटकम्
परिहाटकम् A golden armlet or anklet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहूत
परिहूत <i>a.</i> Called together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृ
परिहृ €1 P.<BR>—1 To avoid, shun; स्त्रीसंनिकर्षं परिहर्तुमिच्छन्नन्तर्दधे भूतपतिः<BR> सभूतः Ku. 3. 74, 43; Ms. 8. 400;<BR>—2 To forsake, abandon, leave, desert; कति न कथितमिदमनुपदमचिरं<BR> मा परिहर हरिमतिशयरुचिरम् Gīt. 9.<BR>—3 To remove, destroy; answer, refute (as objections, charges &c.); ब्रह्मास्य<BR> जगतो निमित्तं कारणं प्रकृतिश्चेत्यस्य पक्षस्याक्षेपः स्मृतिनिमित्तः<BR> परिहृतः । तर्कनिमित्त इदानीमाक्षेपः परिह्रियते Ś. B.; Me. 14.<BR>—4 To conceal.<BR>—6 To embrace.<BR>—6 To defend, preserve from; Ch. Up.<BR>—7 To answer, refute.<BR>—8 To repeat.<BR>—9 To nourish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहरणम्
परिहरणम्<BR>—1 Leaving, quitting, abandoning.<BR>—2 Avoiding, shunning.<BR>—3 Refuting.<BR>—4 Seizing, taking away.<BR>—5 Ved. Carrying or placing round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहरणीयता
परिहरणीयता<BR>—1 Disdain, rejection.<BR>—2 Disappearance, unattainableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहारः|परिहार
परि(री)हारः<BR>—1 Leaving, quitting, giving up, abandoning.<BR>—2 Removing, taking away; as in विरोधपरिहार; तेषां गुप्तिपरीहारैः<BR> कच्चित्ते भरणं कृतम् Rām. 2. 100. 48.<BR>—3 Shunning, avoiding.<BR>—4 Refuting, repelling.<BR>—5 Omitting to mention, omission, leaving out.<BR>—6 Reserve, concealment.<BR>—7 A tract of common land round a village or town; धनुःशतं परीहारो<BR> ग्रामस्य स्यात् समन्ततः Ms. 8. 237.<BR>—8 A special grant, immunity, privilege, exemption from taxes; प्रदद्यात्<BR> परिहारांश्च Ms. 7. 201; अनुग्रहपरिहारौ चैभ्यः कोशवृद्धिकरौ दद्यात्<BR> Kau. A. 2. 1. 19. Hence ˚लेखः a writ of remission as a favour; तथा<BR> परीहारनिसृष्टिलेखौ Kau. A. 2. 10. 28; cf. जाते विशेषेषु परेषु चैव,<BR> ग्रामेषु देशेषु च तेषु तेषु । अनुग्रहो यो नृपतेर्निदेशात्, तज्ज्ञः परीहार<BR> इति व्यवस्येत् ॥ Kau. A. 2. 10. 28.<BR>—9 Contempt, disrespect<BR>—10 An objection.<BR>—11 Seizing, keeping back.<BR>—12 Bounty.<BR>—13 (In gram.) The repetition of a word before and after इति; cf. परिग्रह.<BR>—14 (In dram.) Atoning for any improper action.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: परिहारविशुद्धिः, परिहारसू<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीहारः|परीहार
परि(री)हारः<BR>—1 Leaving, quitting, giving up, abandoning.<BR>—2 Removing, taking away; as in विरोधपरिहार; तेषां गुप्तिपरीहारैः<BR> कच्चित्ते भरणं कृतम् Rām. 2. 100. 48.<BR>—3 Shunning, avoiding.<BR>—4 Refuting, repelling.<BR>—5 Omitting to mention, omission, leaving out.<BR>—6 Reserve, concealment.<BR>—7 A tract of common land round a village or town; धनुःशतं परीहारो<BR> ग्रामस्य स्यात् समन्ततः Ms. 8. 237.<BR>—8 A special grant, immunity, privilege, exemption from taxes; प्रदद्यात्<BR> परिहारांश्च Ms. 7. 201; अनुग्रहपरिहारौ चैभ्यः कोशवृद्धिकरौ दद्यात्<BR> Kau. A. 2. 1. 19. Hence ˚लेखः a writ of remission as a favour; तथा<BR> परीहारनिसृष्टिलेखौ Kau. A. 2. 10. 28; cf. जाते विशेषेषु परेषु चैव,<BR> ग्रामेषु देशेषु च तेषु तेषु । अनुग्रहो यो नृपतेर्निदेशात्, तज्ज्ञः परीहार<BR> इति व्यवस्येत् ॥ Kau. A. 2. 10. 28.<BR>—9 Contempt, disrespect<BR>—10 An objection.<BR>—11 Seizing, keeping back.<BR>—12 Bounty.<BR>—13 (In gram.) The repetition of a word before and after इति; cf. परिग्रह.<BR>—14 (In dram.) Atoning for any improper action.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: परिहारविशुद्धिः, परिहारसू<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहारविशुद्धिः|परिहारविशुद्धि
परिहारः + -विशुद्धिः (with Jainas) purification by mortification and penance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहारसू
परिहारः + -सू (a cow) bearing a calf only after a long time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहारकः|परिहारक
परिहारकः, -कम्<BR> An armlet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहारकम्
परिहारकः, -कम्<BR> An armlet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहार्य|परिहार्यः|परिहार्य्य|परिहार्य्यः
परिहार्य <i>a.</i> To be shunned or avoided, to be escaped from, to<BR> be taken off or away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहार्यः|परिहार्य|परिहार्य्य|परिहार्य्यः
परिहार्य + .{@-र्यः@} A bracelet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृतः|परिहृत
परिहृतः <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Shunned, avoided.<BR>—2 Left, abandoned.<BR>—3 Refuted, repelled (as a charge, objection &c.).<BR>—4 Taken, seized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिहृतिः|परिहृति
परिहृतिः <i>f.</i> Avoiding, shunning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परिह्वालम्
परिह्वालम् Stammering, faltering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परी
परी (परि-इ) €2 P.<BR>—1 To go round, circumambulate; (चरणन्यासं) भक्तिनम्रः परीयाः<BR> Me. 57; Ms. 2. 48.<BR>—2 To surround, encompass; हुतवहपरीतं गृहमिव Ś. 5. 10; विषवल्लीभिः<BR> परीताभिर्महौषधिः R. 12. 61; so कोपपरीतमानसम् Ki. 2. 25.<BR>—3 To go to, think of (objects &c.).<BR>—4 To be changed or transformed.<BR>—5 To reach to.<BR>—6 To run against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीत|परीतं
परीत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Surrounded, encompassed by.<BR>—2 Expired, elapsed.<BR>—3 Departed, gone forth.<BR>—4 Seized, taken possession of, filled with; प्रणाशान्नन्दानां प्रशममुपयातं<BR> त्वमधुना परीतः कालेन ज्वलयसि मम क्रोधदहनम् Mu. 3. 29. See परी.<BR>—5 = विपरीत inverted; स्वदोषकोपनाद्रोगं लभते मरणान्तिकम् ।<BR> अपि वोद्बन्धनादीनि परीतानि व्यवस्यति ॥ Mb. 14. 17. 13.<BR>—6 Moving round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्ष्
परीक्ष् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To examine, look at or scrutinize carefully; अतः परीक्ष्य<BR> कर्तव्यं विशेषात् संगतं रहः Ś. 5. 24; सन्तः परीक्ष्यान्यतरद्भजन्ते<BR> M. 1. 2; Ms. 9. 14.<BR>—2 To test, try, put to the test; मायां मयोद्भाव्य परीक्षितोऽसि R. 2. 65;<BR> यत्नात्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">Page0991-1</a>]<BR> परीक्षितः पुंस्त्वे Y. 1. 55 ‘carefully tested as to potency’.<BR>—3 To observe, perceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0990-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षकः|परीक्षक
परीक्षकः An examiner, investigator, a judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षणम्
परीक्षणम् Putting to test, testing, examining; गुणदोषपरीक्षणम्<BR> Ms. 1. 117; Y. 2. 177.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षा
परीक्षा<BR>—1 Examination, test, trial; पत्तने विद्यमानेऽपि ग्रामे रत्नपरीक्षा<BR> M. 1; Ms. 9. 19.<BR>—2 Trial by various kinds of ordeals (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षित|परीक्षितः
परीक्षित <i>p. p.</i> Examined, tried, tested; परीक्षितं काव्यसुवर्णमेतत् Vikr. 1. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीक्षित्
परीक्षित् <i>m.</i> N. of a king, son of Abhimanyu and grandson of Arjuna.<BR> He succeeded to the throne of Hastināpura after Yudhiṣṭhira. He died<BR> of a snake-bite. The Kali age is said to have commenced with his reign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीणाहः|परीणाह
परीणाहः<BR>—1 = परिणाह. नल्वमात्रपरीणाहो घनच्छायो वनस्पतिः Mb. 12. 154. 7.<BR>—2 A piece of common land encircling a village.<BR>—3 An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीताप
परीताप, परीपाक, परीवार, -वाह, परीहास &c.<BR> See परिताप &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीपाक|परीपाकः
परीताप, परीपाक, परीवार, -वाह, परीहास &c.<BR> See परिताप &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवार|परीवारः
परीताप, परीपाक, परीवार, -वाह, परीहास &c.<BR> See परिताप &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीवाह|परीवाहः
परीताप, परीपाक, परीवार, -वाह, परीहास &c.<BR> See परिताप &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीहास|परीहासः
परीताप, परीपाक, परीवार, -वाह, परीहास &c.<BR> See परिताप &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीन्दनम्
परीन्दनम् Gratification, present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीप्सा
परीप्सा<BR>—1 Desire of obtaining.<BR>—2 Desire of preserving; आत्मकृतसेतुपरीप्सया यः (रेमे) Bhāg. 3. 9. 19.<BR>—3 Haste, hurry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीप्सु
परीप्सु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wishing to preserve; शेषाः प्रदुद्रुवुर्मल्लाः सर्वे प्राणपरीप्सवः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 44. 27.<BR>—2 Desirous of finding out; हेतुं तदभ्यागमने परीप्सुः Ki. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीरम्
परीरम् A fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीरणम्
परीरणम्<BR>—1 A tortoise.<BR>—2 A stick.<BR>—3 A garment (पट्टशाटक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीष्ट
परीष्ट <i>a.</i> Desirable, superior; सत्सङ्ग्रहाय भवपान्थनिजाश्रमाप्तावन्ते<BR> परीष्टगतये हरये नमस्ते Bhāg. 6. 9. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परीष्टिः|परीष्टि
परीष्टिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Research, inquiry, investigation; तस्य निमित्तपरीष्टिः MS. 1. 1. 3.<BR>—2 Service, attendance; वारसुन्दरीपरीष्टिभिस्तुष्टिमुपेयुषां निशि N. 16. 112.<BR>—3 Respect, worship, homage.<BR>—4 Willingness, readiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुः|परु
परुः<BR>—1 A joint, knot.<BR>—2 A limb, member.<BR>—3 The ocean.<BR>—4 Heaven, paradise.<BR>—5 A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुत्
परुत् <i>ind.</i> Last year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुत्न
परुत्न <i>a.</i> Belonging to the last year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुद्वारः|परुद्वार
परुद्वारः A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुष|परुषं
परुष <i>a.</i> [पॄ-उषन्]<BR>—1 Hard, rough, rugged, stiff (opp. मृदु or श्लक्ष्ण); परुषं<BR> चर्म, परुषा माला &c.<BR>—2 Harsh, abusive, severe, unkind, cruel, stern (as words); (वाक्)<BR> अपरुषा परुषाक्षरमीरिता R. 9. 8; Pt. 1. 50; said also<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">Page0991-2</a>]<BR> of a person; स्निग्धे यत् परुषासि Gīt. 9; Y. 1. 310.<BR>—3 Harsh or disagreeable to the ear (as a sound &c.); तेन वज्रपरुषस्वनं<BR> धनुः R. 11. 46; Me. 63.<BR>—4 Rough, coarse, rough to the touch, shaggy (as hair); शुद्धस्नानात्<BR> परुषमलकम् Me. 92.<BR>—5 Sharp, violent, strong, keen, piercing (wind &c.); निर्गच्छतस्तु<BR> शक्रस्य परुषः पवनो ववौ Rām. 7. 28. 28; परुषपवनवेगोत्क्षिप्तसंशुष्कपर्णः<BR> Ṛs. 1. 22, 2. 28.<BR>—6 Gross.<BR>—7 Dirty.<BR>—8 Spotted, variegated.<BR>—9 Ved. Knotted.<BR>—10 Similar; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषम्
परुष + .{@-षम्@} A harsh or abusive speech, abuse.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: परुषाक्षर, परुषाक्षेपः, परुषेतर, परुषोक्ति<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषाक्षर
परुष + -अक्षर <i>a.</i> using harsh or abusive language; गीर्भिर्गुरूणां<BR> परुषाक्षराभिस्तिरस्कृता यान्ति नरा महत्त्वम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषाक्षेपः|परुषाक्षेप
परुष + -आक्षेपः (In Rhet.) an objection or contradiction containing harsh<BR> words; इत्येष परुषाक्षेपः परुषाक्षरपूर्वकम् Kāv. 2. 144.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषेतर
परुष + -इतर <i>a.</i> other than rough, soft, mild; प्रस्पन्दमानपरुषेतरतारमन्तश्चक्षुः R. 5. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषोक्ति
परुष + -उक्ति <i>f.</i>, {@वचनम्@} abusive or harsh language.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषित
परुषित <i>a.</i> Treated roughly or harshly; तथा परुषितं दृष्ट्वा<BR> सूतपूत्रेण मातुलम् Mb. 7. 159. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुषिमन्
परुषिमन् <i>m.</i> Ved. A shaggy appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परुस्
परुस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 A joint, knot; खुरैः क्षुरप्रैर्दरयंस्तदाप उत्पारपारं त्रिपरू<BR> रसायाम् Bhāg. 3. 13. 30.<BR>—2 A limb or member of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परे
परे (परा-इ) €2 P.<BR>—1 To go or run away, flee, retreat; यः परैति स जीवति Pt. 5. 88<BR> ‘he who runs away saves his life’; cf. ‘to run for oneʼs life’.<BR>—2 To reach, attain to; परैति कार्श्यं यशसा समं वपुः Ki. 1. 39.<BR>—3 To depart from this world, die.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेत|परेतः
परेत <i>p. p.</i> Deceased, departed, dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेतः|परेत
परेत + .{@-तः@} A spirit, a ghost.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: परेतकल्प^1, परेतकालः, परेतभर्तृ, परेतराजः^2, परेतभूमिः<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेतकल्प
परेत + -कल्प^1 <i>a.</i> almost dead.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेतकालः
परेत + -कालः The time of death; परेतकाले पुरुषो यत् कर्म प्रतिपद्यते<BR> Rām. 3. 51. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेतभर्तृ
परेत + -भर्तृ, -राजः^1 <i>m.</i> the god of death, Yama; परेतभर्तुर्महिषः Śi. 1. 57.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेतराजः|परेतराज
परेत + -भर्तृ, -राजः^1 <i>m.</i> the god of death, Yama; परेतभर्तुर्महिषः Śi. 1. 57.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेतभूमिः|परेतभूमि
परेत + -भूमिः <i>f.</i>, {@-वासः@}<BR> a cemetery; विकीर्णकेशासु परेतभूमिषु Ku. 5. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेतिः|परेति
परेतिः <i>f.</i> Ved. Departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेद्यवि
परेद्यवि, परेद्युस् <i>ind.</i> The other day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेद्युस्
परेद्यवि, परेद्युस् <i>ind.</i> The other day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेयिवस्
परेयिवस् <i>a.</i> Dead, departed; कथा इमास्ते कथिता महीयसां विधाय<BR> लोकेषु यशः परेयुषाम् Bhāg. 12. 3. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेष्टः
परेष्टः <i>f.</i>, परेष्टुका A cow that has often calved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परेष्टुका
परेष्टः <i>f.</i>, परेष्टुका A cow that has often calved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्ष|परोक्षं|परोक्षः
परोक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Out of or beyond the range of sight, invisible, escaping observation.<BR>—2 Absent; स्थाने वृता भूपतिभिः परोक्षैः R. 7. 13.<BR>—3 Secret, unknown, stranger; परोक्षमन्मथो जनः Ś. 2. 19; ‘a stranger to the influence of love’<BR>; परोक्षार्थस्य दर्शकम् H. Pr. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षः|परोक्ष|परोक्षं
परोक्ष + .{@-क्षः@} An ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षम्
परोक्ष + .{@-क्षम्@}<BR>—1 Absence, invisibility.<BR>—2 (In gram.) Past time or tense (not witnessed by the speaker); परोक्षे<BR> लिट् P. III. 2. 115. <i>Note</i>:− The acc. and loc. singulars of परोक्ष<BR> (<i>i. e.</i> परोक्षं, परोक्षे) are used adverbially in the sense of<BR> ‘in oneʼs absence’, ‘out of sight’, ‘behind oneʼs back’, with or without<BR> a gen.:− परोक्षे च खलीकर्तुं शक्यते<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">Page0992-1</a>]<BR> न ममाग्रतः Mk. 2; परोक्षे कार्यहन्तारं प्रत्यक्षे प्रियवादिनम्<BR> (त्यजेत्) Cāṇ. 18; नोदाहरेदस्य नाम परोक्षमपि केवलम् Ms. 2. 119.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: परोक्षार्थ, परोक्षकृता, परोक्षजित्, परोक्षबुद्धि, परोक्षभोगः, परोक्षवृत्ति<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0991-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षार्थ
परोक्ष + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> having a secret meaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षकृता
परोक्ष + -कृता a hymn in which a deity is spoken of in the third person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षजित्
परोक्ष + -जित् <i>a.</i> victorious in an imperceptible manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षबुद्धि
परोक्ष + -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> indifferent to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षभोगः|परोक्षभोग
परोक्ष + -भोगः enjoyment of anything in the absence of the owner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षवृत्ति|परोक्षवृत्तिः
परोक्ष + -वृत्ति <i>a.</i> living out of sight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोक्षवृत्तिः|परोक्षवृत्ति
परोक्ष + -वृत्ति + .({@-त्तिः@} <i>f.</i>) an unseen or obscure life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोमात्र
परोमात्र <i>a.</i> Ved. Immense, vast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोजरस्
परोजरस् <i>a.</i> Untouched by passions, pure; U. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोवरम्
परोवरम् <i>ind.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 from top to bottom.<BR>—2 From hand to hand<BR>—3 In succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोवरीण|परोवरीणः
परोवरीण <i>a.</i> Having both superior and inferior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोवरीयस्
परोवरीयस् <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Broader on the outside.<BR>—2 Most excellent of all. ━<i>m.</i> —1 The Supreme Being.<BR>—3 The highest happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोष्टिः|परोष्टि
परोष्टिः <i>f.</i>, परोष्णी A cockroach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

परोष्णी
परोष्णी N. of a river in the Punjab; also परुष्णी. It is now called Rāvī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कटः|पर्कट
पर्कटः A heron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कटम्
पर्कटः + .{@-टम्@} Regret, anxiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कटिः|पर्कटि|पर्क्कटि
पर्कटिः, -टी <i>f.</i>, पर्कटिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 The wave-leaved figtree (प्लक्ष).<BR>—2 A fresh betel-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कटी
पर्कटिः, -टी <i>f.</i>, पर्कटिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 The wave-leaved figtree (प्लक्ष).<BR>—2 A fresh betel-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्कटिन्|पर्क्कटिन्
पर्कटिः, -टी <i>f.</i>, पर्कटिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 The wave-leaved figtree (प्लक्ष).<BR>—2 A fresh betel-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्जनी|पर्ज्जनी
पर्जनी, पर्जन्या A kind of plant (दारु हरिद्रा- Mar.<BR> दारु हळद), Curcuma Aromatica.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्जन्या|पर्ज्जन्या
पर्जनी, पर्जन्या A kind of plant (दारु हरिद्रा- Mar.<BR> दारु हळद), Curcuma Aromatica.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्जन्यः|पर्जन्य|पर्ज्जन्य|पर्ज्जन्यः
पर्जन्यः<BR>—1 A rain cloud, thundering cloud, a cloud in general; प्रवृद्ध इव<BR> पर्जन्यः सारङ्गैरभिनन्दितः R. 17. 15; Mk. 10. 60.<BR>—2 Rain; अन्नाद्भवन्ति भूतानि पर्जन्यादन्नसंभवः Bg. 3. 14.<BR>—3 The god of rain; Bṛ. Up. 1. 4. 11.<BR>—4 The muttering or roaring of clouds.<BR>—5 N. of Indra, Sūrya, Viṣṇu and some other deities; Bhāg. 10. 20. 5<BR> (here पर्जन्य means the sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ण्
पर्ण् €10 U. (पर्णयति-ते) To make green or verdant; वसन्तः<BR> पर्णयति चम्पकम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णम्
पर्णम्<BR>—1 A pinion, wing; as in सुपर्ण.<BR>—2 The feather of an arrow.<BR>—3 A leaf.<BR>—4 The betel-leaf; ततो नृपतिनिदेशात् ते पर्णान्यादाय सैनिकाः (जग्मुः)<BR> Parṇāl. 5. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णः|पर्ण|पर्णं
पर्णम् + .{@-र्णः@} The Palāśa tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्णाशनम्, पर्णासिः, पर्णाहार, पर्णोटजम्, पर्णकारः, पर्णकुटिका, पर्णकुटी, पर्णकूर्चः, पर्णकृच्छ्र, पर्णखण्डः, पर्णचरः, पर्णचीरपटः, पर्णचोरकः, पर्णनरः, पर्णनालः, पर्णभेदिनी, पर्णभोजनः, पर्णमुच्, पर्णमृगः, पर्णरुह्, पर्णलता, पर्णवाटिका, पर्णशय्या, पर्णशाला, पर्णसंस्तरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णाशनम्
पर्णम् + -अशनम् feeding on leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णाशनः|पर्णाशन
पर्णम् + -अशनम् + .({@-नः@}) a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णासिः|पर्णासि
पर्णम् + -असिः a kind of basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णाहार
पर्णम् + -आहार <i>a.</i> feeding upon leaves; cf. Rām. 3. 6. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णोटजम्
पर्णम् + -उटजम् a hut of leaves, a hermitʼs hut, a hermitage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णकारः|पर्णकार
पर्णम् + -कारः a vendor of betel-leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णकुटिका
पर्णम् + -कुटिका, -कुटी a hut made of leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णकुटी
पर्णम् + -कुटिका, -कुटी a hut made of leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णकूर्चः|पर्णकूर्च
पर्णम् + -कूर्चः A kind of religious vow in which one has to drink a decoction<BR> of leaves; एतान्येव समस्तानि त्रिरात्रोपोषितः शुचिः । क्वाथयित्वा पिवेदद्भिः<BR> पर्णकूर्चोऽभिधीयते ॥ Yama Smṛti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णकृच्छ्र|पर्णकृच्छ्रः
पर्णम् + -कृच्छ्र a kind of expiatory penance which consists in living upon<BR> an infusion of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">Page0992-2</a>]<BR> leaves and Kuśa grass only for five days; see पर्णोदुम्बरराजीवबिल्वपत्रकुशोदकैः ।<BR> प्रत्येकं प्रत्यहं पीतैः पर्णकृच्छ्र उदाहृतः ॥ Y. 3. 317 and Mit. thereon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णखण्डः|पर्णखण्ड|पर्णखंड
पर्णम् + -खण्डः a tree without apparent blossoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णखण्डम्
पर्णम् + -खण्डः + .({@-डम्@}) a collection of leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णचरः|पर्णचर
पर्णम् + -चरः a kind of deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णचीरपटः|पर्णचीरपट
पर्णम् + -चीरपटः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णचोरकः|पर्णचोरक
पर्णम् + -चोरकः a kind of perfume (gall-nut).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णनरः|पर्णनर
पर्णम् + -नरः the figure of a man made of leaves and burnt in place of a lost corpse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णनालः|पर्णनाल
पर्णम् + -नालः a leaf-stalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णभेदिनी
पर्णम् + -भेदिनी the Priyaṅgu creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णभोजनः|पर्णभोजन
पर्णम् + -भोजनः a goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णमुच्|पर्ण्णमुच्
पर्णम् + -मुच् <i>m.</i> the winter season (शिशिर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णमृगः|पर्णमृग
पर्णम् + -मृगः any wild animal living in the boughs of trees (as a monkey,<BR> squirrel, &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णरुह्
पर्णम् + -रुह् <i>m.</i> the spring season (वसन्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णलता
पर्णम् + -लता the betel-plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णवाटिका
पर्णम् + -वाटिका pieces of areca-nut mixed with other spices and rolled<BR> up in betel-leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णशय्या
पर्णम् + -शय्या a bed or couch of leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णशाला
पर्णम् + -शाला a hut made of leaves, a hermitage; निर्दिष्टां कुलपतिना<BR> स पर्णशालामध्यास्य R. 1. 95, 12. 40;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णसंस्तरः|पर्णसंस्तर
पर्णम् + -संस्तरः one with a bed of leaves; वनेषु वासतेयेषु निवसन्<BR> पर्णसंस्तरः Bk. 4. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णल
पर्णल <i>a.</i> Full of or abounding in leaves, leafy; पर्णलीभूतसानुम् Bk. 6. 143.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णासः|पर्णास
पर्णासः [Uṇ. 4. 107]<BR>—1 A house standing in the midst of water, a summer-house.<BR>—2 A lotus.<BR>—3 A vegetable.<BR>—4 Decoration, toilet, adorning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णिन्
पर्णिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A tree; यदि तां बुद्धिमास्थाय तिष्ठेयुः पर्णिनो वने Mb. 12. 156. 18.<BR>—2 The पलाश tree; Rām. 1. 14. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णिल
पर्णिल <i>a.</i> See पर्णल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्णालः|पर्णाल
पर्णालः<BR>—1 A boat.<BR>—2 A spade or hoe.<BR>—3 Single combat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्तृ
पर्तृ <i>m.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 A protector.<BR>—2 Means of defence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्द्
पर्द् €1 Ā. (पर्दते) To break wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्दः|पर्द|पर्द्द|पर्द्दः
पर्दः<BR>—1 A quantity of hair, thick hair.<BR>—2 A fart, breaking wind (पर्दनम् also in this sense.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्प्
पर्प् €1 P. (पर्पति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पः|पर्प|पर्पं
पर्पः<BR>—1 Young grass.<BR>—2 A seat for cripples (पङ्गुपीठम्); wheel-carriage in which cripples<BR> are moved about; येन पीठेन पङ्गवश्चरन्ति स पर्पः Sk. on P. IV. 4. 10.<BR>—3 A house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पटः|पर्पट
पर्पटः<BR>—1 A kind of medicinal plant.<BR>—2 A thin crisp cake made of flour (Mar. पापड); Gaṇeśa P.; stuffed<BR> with seasamum; तिलतिलकितपर्पटाभमिन्दुं वितर N. 16. 149.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पटी
पर्पटः + .{@-टी@}<BR>—1 A kind of fragrant earth.<BR>—2 A kind of perfume.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्पटौदनः, पर्पटद्रुमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पटौदनः
पर्पटः + -ओदनः rice mixed with पर्पट (Mar. वडाभात); पर्पटौदनपूजायां<BR> जलहोमेन सिद्धिदा D. Purāṇa. Chap. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पटद्रुमः|पर्पटद्रुम
पर्पटः + -द्रुमः a kind of tree (कुम्भीवृक्ष).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्परी
पर्परी A braid of hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्परीकः|पर्परीक
पर्परीकः<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 Fire.<BR>—3 A reservoir, tank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0992-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्परीणम्
पर्परीणम् A joint; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्परीणः|पर्परीण
पर्परीणम् + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 Juice of the stalks of betel leaves.<BR>—2 A tendon of a betel leaf.<BR>—3 Worship of Śiva with ghee in the Uttarāyaṇa; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पिकः|पर्पिक|पर्प्पिक
पर्पिकः, -की<BR> A cripple who moves about in a chair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्पिकी
पर्पिकः, -की<BR> A cripple who moves about in a chair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ब्
पर्ब् €1 P. (पर्बति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यक्
पर्यक् <i>ind.</i> Round about, in every direction; उत्पेतुरुत् पाततमाः<BR> सहस्रशो भयावहा दिवि भूमौ च पर्यक् Bhāg. 4. 5. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यग्निः|पर्यग्नि
पर्यग्निः Ved.<BR>—1 Circumambient fire.<BR>—2 A torch carried round the sacrificial animal; or the ceremony of carrying<BR> round such fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यङ्कः|पर्यङ्क|पर्यंक|पर्यंकः|पर्य्यङ्क|पर्य्यङ्कः
पर्यङ्कः<BR>—1 A bed, couch, sofa; क्वचिद् भूमौ शायी क्वचिदपि च पर्यङ्कशयनः Bh. 2. 81.<BR>—2 A palanquin.<BR>—3 A cloth girt round the back, loins, and knees (by a person) when sitting<BR> on his hams; cf. अवसक्थिका.<BR>—6 A particular kind of posture practised by ascetics in meditation, sitting<BR> on the hams; it is the same as वीरासन which is thus defined by Vasiṣṭha:−<BR> एकं पादमथैकस्मिन् विन्यस्योरौ तु संस्थितं । इतरस्मिंस्तथैवोरुं वीरासनमुदाहृतम्<BR> ॥ पर्यङ्कग्रन्थिबन्ध &c. Mk. 1. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्यङ्कग्रन्थिः, पर्यङ्कबन्धः, पर्यङ्कबद्ध, पर्यङ्कभोगिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यङ्कग्रन्थिः
पर्यङ्कः + -ग्रन्थिः, -बन्धः sitting on the hams, the posture called पर्यङ्क;<BR> पर्यङ्कबन्धस्थिरपूर्वकायम् Ku. 3. 45, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यङ्कबन्धः|पर्यङ्कबन्ध|पर्यंकबंध|पर्य्यङ्कबन्ध
पर्यङ्कः + -ग्रन्थिः, -बन्धः sitting on the hams, the posture called पर्यङ्क;<BR> पर्यङ्कबन्धस्थिरपूर्वकायम् Ku. 3. 45, 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यङ्कबद्ध
पर्यङ्कः + -बद्ध <i>a.</i> squatting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यङ्कभोगिन्|पर्यंकभोगिन्
पर्यङ्कः + -भोगिन् <i>m.</i> a kind of serpent<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यट्
पर्यट् €1 P. To roam, wander about; कदाचिदपि पर्यटञ्शशविषाणमासादयेत् Bh. 2. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यटकः|पर्यटक
पर्यटकः A tramp, vagabond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यटनम्
पर्यटनम्, पर्यटितम् Wandering or roaming about, travelling over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यटितम्
पर्यटनम्, पर्यटितम् Wandering or roaming about, travelling over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यनुयोगः|पर्यनुयोग|पर्य्यनुयोग|पर्य्यनुयोगः
पर्यनुयोगः<BR>—1 An inquiry with the object of contradicting or refuting a statement<BR> (दूषणार्थं जिज्ञासा Halāy.); पर्यनुयोगो नाम स भवति यः स्वपक्षं<BR> साधयति विपक्षस्य च प्रतीपमाचरति ŚB. on MS. 3. 1. 12; एतेनास्यापि<BR> पर्यनुयोगस्यानवकाशः Dāy. B.<BR>—2 Asking, inquiring.<BR>—3 Censure, reproach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्त|पर्यंत|पर्यन्तः|पर्य्यन्त|पर्य्यन्तः
पर्यन्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bounded by, extending as far as; समुद्रपर्यन्ता पृथ्वी ‘the ocean-bounded earth’.<BR>—2 Adjoining, neighbouring; स वै विषयपर्यन्ते तव राजन् महातपाः<BR> Rām. 7. 74. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्तः|पर्यन्त|पर्यंत|पर्य्यन्त|पर्य्यन्तः
पर्यन्त + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 Circuit, circumference.<BR>—2 Skirt, edge, border, extremity, boundary; क्षुरपर्यन्तं (चक्रम्)<BR> Mb. 1. 33. 2; उटजपर्यन्तचारिणी Ś. 4; पर्यन्तवनम् R. 13. 38; Ṛs. 3. 3.<BR>—3 Side, flank; पर्यन्ताश्रयिभिर्निजस्य सदृशं नाम्नः किरातैः कृतम्<BR> Ratn. 2. 3; R. 18. 43.<BR>—4 End, conclusion, termination; सहस्रयुगपर्यन्तमहर्यद्ब्रह्मणो<BR> विदुः Bg. 8. 17; यदादिमध्यपर्यन्तम् Mb. 14. 44. 1; लभ्यन्ते<BR> भूमिपर्यन्तः Pt. 1. 125.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्यन्तदेशः, पर्यन्तभूः, पर्यन्तभूमिः, पर्यन्तपर्वतः, पर्यन्तस्थित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्तदेशः|पर्यन्तदेश|पर्यंतदेश
पर्यन्त + -देशः, -भूः, -भूमिः <i>f.</i> an adjoining district or region.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्तभूः|पर्य्यन्तभूः
पर्यन्त + -देशः, -भूः, -भूमिः <i>f.</i> an adjoining district or region.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्तभूमिः
पर्यन्त + -देशः, -भूः, -भूमिः <i>f.</i> an adjoining district or region.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्तपर्वतः|पर्यन्तपर्वत|पर्यंतपर्वत
पर्यन्त + -पर्वतः an adjoining hill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्तस्थित|पर्य्यन्तस्थित
पर्यन्त + -स्थित <i>a.</i> limitative, confining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्तिका|पर्यंतिका|पर्य्यन्तिका
पर्यन्तिका Loss of good qualities, depravity, moral turpitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यन्य|पर्य्यन्य|पर्य्यन्यः
पर्यन्य = पर्जन्य q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ययः|पर्यय|पर्य्यय|पर्य्ययः
पर्ययः<BR>—1 Revolution, lapse, expiration; कालपर्ययात् Mb. 3. 179. 19; Y. 3. 217;<BR> Ms. 1. 30, 11. 27; युगसाहस्रपर्ययः (कल्पः) Bhāg. 8. 13. 36.<BR>—2 Waste or loss (of time); मा भूत् कालस्य पर्ययः Rām. 1. 22. 12.<BR>—3 Change, alteration.<BR>—4 Inversion; confusion, irregularity.<BR>—5 Deviation from customary observances, neglect of duty.<BR>—6 Opposition.<BR>—7 Loss, destruction; पक्ष्मणोऽपि निपातेन येषां स्यात् स्कन्धपर्ययः<BR> Mb. 12. 15. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ययणम्
पर्ययणम्<BR>—1 Walking round, circumambulation.<BR>—2 A horseʼs saddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवदात|पर्य्यवदात
पर्यवदात <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Perfectly pure or clean.<BR>—2 Very accomplished, conversant with.<BR>—3 Very familiar, well known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवदानम्
पर्यवदानम् Complete destruction or disappearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवधारणम्
पर्यवधारणम् Precise determination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवपादः|पर्यवपाद
पर्यवपादः Transformation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवरोधः|पर्यवरोध
पर्यवरोधः Obstruction, hindrance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवशेषः|पर्यवशेष
पर्यवशेषः End, termination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवष्टम्भ्|पर्यवष्टंभ्
पर्यवष्टम्भ् €5. €9 P. To besiege, surround; पर्यवष्टभ्यतामेतत्<BR> करालायतनम् Māl. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवष्टम्भनम्
पर्यवष्टम्भनम् Surrounding, investing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसो
पर्यवसो €4 P.<BR>—1 To complete, finish.<BR>—2 To determine, resolve.<BR>—3 To result in, be reduced to, end in; एष एव समुच्चयः सद्योगेऽसद्योगे<BR> सदसद्योगे च पर्यवस्यतीति न पृथग् लक्ष्यते K. P. 10.<BR>—4 To perish, be lost, decline.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसानम्
पर्यवसानम्<BR>—1 End, termination, conclusion.<BR>—2 Determination, ascertainment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसित|पर्य्यवसित
पर्यवसित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Finished, ended, completed.<BR>—2 Perished, lost.<BR>—3 Determined.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्यवसितमति<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवसितमति
पर्यवसित + -मति <i>a.</i> thoroughly acquainted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्कन्दः|पर्यवस्कन्द
पर्यवस्कन्दः The act of jumping down; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्था|पर्य्यवस्था
पर्यवस्था €1 P.<BR>—1 To set out.<BR>—2 To be or exist everywhere.<BR>—3 To rely upon. ━<i>Caus.</i> To compose or collect oneself; न पर्यवस्थापयत्यात्मानम् V. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्था|पर्य्यवस्था
पर्यवस्था, पर्यवस्थानम्<BR>—1 Opposition, resistance, obstruction.<BR>—2 Contradiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्थानम्
पर्यवस्था, पर्यवस्थानम्<BR>—1 Opposition, resistance, obstruction.<BR>—2 Contradiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्थातृ|पर्य्यवस्थातृ
पर्यवस्थातृ <i>m.</i> An adversary, antagonist; अन्तकः पर्यवस्थाता<BR> जन्मिनः सन्ततापदः Ki. 11. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यवस्थित|पर्य्यवस्थित
पर्यवस्थित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Stationed.<BR>—2 contained in, occupied with.<BR>—3 merry, content.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यश्रु|पर्य्यश्रु
पर्यश्रु <i>a.</i> Bathed in or suffused with tears, shedding tears,<BR> tearful; पर्यश्रुणी मङ्गलभङ्गभीरुर्न लोचने मीलयितुं विषेहे Ki. 3. 36;<BR> पर्यश्रुरस्वजत मूर्धनि चोपजघ्रौ R. 13. 70.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्यश्रुनयन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यश्रुनयन
पर्यश्रु + -नयन <i>a.</i> having eyes tearful; निःश्वसन्तं यथा नागं<BR> पर्यश्रुनयनं तथा Mb. 12. 6. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0993-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यस्
पर्यस् €4 P.<BR>—1 To throw or cast round, spread round, diffuse.<BR>—2 To spread over, surround; ताम्रौष्ठपर्यस्तरुचः स्मितस्य Ku. 1. 44.<BR>—3 To turn round; पर्यस्तविलोचनेन Ku. 3. 68.<BR>—4 To shed, throw down (as tears); मणिव्याजेन पर्यस्ताः पृथिव्यामश्रुबिन्दवः<BR> R. 10. 75; Ms. 11. 184.<BR>—5 To overturn, upset.<BR>—6 To throw about; भग्नाक्षपर्यस्तरथं … सेनानिवेशं तुमुलं<BR> चकार R. 5. 49.<BR>—7 To entrap, ensnare.<BR>—8 To enclose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यसनम्
पर्यसनम्<BR>—1 Casting, throwing about.<BR>—2 Sending forth, throwing.<BR>—3 Sending away.<BR>—4 Putting off or away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यस्त|पर्य्यस्त|पर्य्यस्तः
पर्यस्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Thrown round, scattered over or about; पर्यस्तो धनंजयस्योपरि<BR> शिलीमुखासारः Ve. 4; Śi. 10. 91.<BR>—2 Surrounded, encompassed.<BR>—3 Upset, overturned.<BR>—4 Dismissed, laid aside.<BR>—5 Struck, hurt, killed.<BR>—6 Bound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यस्तिः|पर्यस्ति|पर्य्यस्ति
पर्यस्तिः <i>f.</i>, पर्यस्तिका Sitting upon the hams; see पर्यङ्क 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यस्तिका|पर्य्यस्तिका
पर्यस्तिः <i>f.</i>, पर्यस्तिका Sitting upon the hams; see पर्यङ्क 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यासः|पर्यास|पर्य्यास|पर्य्यासः
पर्यासः<BR>—1 End, conclusion, termination; पर्यास इति चान्ताख्या MS. 5. 3. 8.<BR>—2 Rotation, revolution.<BR>—3 Inverted order or position.<BR>—4 Killing.<BR>—5 Falling down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यासनम्
पर्यासनम्<BR>—1 Revolution; see पर्यासः.<BR>—2 Destruction; यदि चैतत्कथञ्चित्स्याल्लोकपर्यासनं भवेत् Mb. 8. 87. 106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यासित
पर्यासित <i>a.</i> Thrown down, annihilated; परैरपर्यासितवीर्यसंपदां<BR> पराभवोऽप्युत्सव एव मानिनाम् Ki. 1. 41; Māl. 5. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याकुल|पर्य्याकुल
पर्याकुल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Turbid, foul (as water).<BR>—2 Confused, confounded, frightened; Ś. 1.<BR>—3 Disordered, dishevelled; पर्याकुला मूर्धजाः Ś. 1. 29.<BR>—4 Excited, agitated, bewildered; पर्याकुलोऽस्मि Ś. 6; लज्जान्वितं<BR> सविनयं हृदयं क्षणेन पर्याकुलं कुलगृहेऽपि कृतं वधूनाम् Ṛs. 6. 22.<BR>—5 Full of, filled with स्नेह˚, क्रोध˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याकुलता
पर्याकुलता, -त्वम्<BR> Confusion; पर्याकुलत्वान्मरुतां वेगभङ्गोऽनुमीयते Ku. 2. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याकुलत्वम्
पर्याकुलता, -त्वम्<BR> Confusion; पर्याकुलत्वान्मरुतां वेगभङ्गोऽनुमीयते Ku. 2. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याक्षिप्
पर्याक्षिप् P. To wind round, bind with; पर्याक्षिपत् काचिदुदारबन्धम् Ku. 7. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यागम्
पर्यागम् €1 P.<BR>—1 To approach.<BR>—2 To be completed or finished.<BR>—3 To conquer, subdue.<BR>—4 To surround, encircle.<BR>—5 To elapse.<BR>—6 To last, live.<BR>—7 To return; प्राप्यसे परमं कामं मयि पर्यागते सति Rām. 2. 24. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यागत
पर्यागत <i>a.</i> One who has finished his worldly career.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याचान्तम्
पर्याचान्तम् Food left by a person after sipping; Ms. 4. 212.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याणम्
पर्याणम् A saddle; दत्तपर्याणम् K. 126 ‘saddled’; पर्याणतः<BR> स्रस्तमुरोविलम्बिनः Śi. 12. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यादानम्
पर्यादानम् End, exhaustion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याप्
पर्याप् €5 P. (used generally in <i>p. p.</i>)<BR>—1 To be competent; पर्याप्तं त्विदमेतेषां बलं भीमाभिरक्षितम् Bg. 1. 10;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-2" target="_blank">Page0994-2</a>]<BR> Ms. 11. 7.<BR>—2 To be able.<BR>—3 To be full; as in पर्याप्तकलः, पर्याप्तदक्षिणः<BR>—4 To save, defend, preserve; इमां परीप्सुर्दुर्जातेः M. 5. 11.<BR>—5 To finish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याप्त|पर्याप्तं|पर्य्याप्त|पर्य्याप्तं
पर्याप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Obtained, got, gained; पर्याप्तसप्तभुवनाभयदक्षिणानि (तातचरितानि) U. 5. 33.<BR>—2 Finished, completed.<BR>—3 Full, whole, entire, complete, all; पर्याप्तचन्द्रेव शरत्रियामा<BR> Ku. 7. 26; R. 6. 44.<BR>—4 Able, competent, adequate; (न) कुद्धस्य समरे स्थातुं पर्याप्ताः<BR> Mb. 7. 150. 5. पर्याप्तोऽसि प्रजाः पातुम् R. 10. 25.<BR>—5 Enough, sufficient; यावतैषां समाप्येरन् यज्ञाः पर्याप्तदक्षिणाः<BR> R. 17. 17; Ms. 11. 7.<BR>—6 Large, extensive, spacious; पर्याप्तपुष्पस्तबकस्तनाभ्यः Ku. 3. 39;<BR>—9 Limited in number; अपर्याप्तं तदस्माकं बलं भीष्माभिरक्षितम् पर्याप्तं<BR> त्विदमेतेषां बलं भीमाभिरक्षितम् ॥ Bg. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याप्तम्
पर्याप्त + .{@-प्तम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Willingly, readily.<BR>—2 To oneʼs satisfaction, enough, sufficiently; पर्याप्तमाचामति U. 4. 1<BR> ‘drinks his fill’.<BR>—3 Fully, adequately, ably, competently.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्याप्तकाम<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याप्तकाम
पर्याप्त + -काम <i>a.</i> one whose desires are accomplished; पर्याप्तकामस्य<BR> कृतात्मनस्तु Muṇḍ. 3. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याप्तिः|पर्याप्ति|पर्य्याप्ति|पर्य्याप्तिः
पर्याप्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Obtaining, acquisition.<BR>—2 End, conclusion, close.<BR>—3 Enough, fulness, sufficiency.<BR>—4 Satiety, satisfaction.<BR>—5 Preserving, guarding, warding off a blow.<BR>—6 Fitness, competency.<BR>—7 Willingness, readiness.<BR>—8 Distinction of objects according to their natural properties; पर्याप्तिश्चायमेको<BR> घट इमौ द्वौवित्यादिप्रतीतिसाक्षिकः स्वरूपसम्बन्धविशेषः । Dīdhiti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यापतत्
पर्यापतत् <i>a.</i> Hurrying or rushing about; पर्यापतत् क्रयिकलोकम् … … विपणीर्विभेजुः Śi. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याप्लावः|पर्याप्लाव|पर्य्याप्लाव
पर्याप्लावः<BR>—1 Revolution<BR>—2 Encircling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याम्नात
पर्याम्नात <i>a.</i> Celebrated, reputed; पर्याम्नातगुणं लोके नाम्ना<BR> त्र्यम्बकभास्करम् Śiva B. 26. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायः|पर्याय|पर्य्याय|पर्य्यायः
पर्यायः<BR>—1 Going or winding round, revolution.<BR>—2 Lapse, course, expiration (of time) कालपर्याययोगेन राजा मित्रसहोऽभवत्<BR> Rām. 7. 65. 17.<BR>—3 Regular recurrence or repetition.<BR>—4 Turn, succession, due or regular order; पर्यायसेवामुत्सृज्य Ku. 2. 36;<BR> Māl. 9. 32; Ms. 4. 87; Mu. 3. 27.<BR>—5 Method, arrangement.<BR>—6 Manner, way, method of proceeding.<BR>—7 A synonym, convertible term; पर्यायो निधनस्यायं निर्धनत्वं शरीरिणाम्<BR> Pt. 2. 99; पर्वतस्य पर्याया इमे &c.<BR>—8 An opportunity, occasion.<BR>—9 Creation, formation, preparation, manufacture; लोकपर्यायवृत्तान्तं<BR> प्राज्ञो जानाति नेतरः Mb. 12. 174. 30.<BR>—10 Comprehensiveness.<BR>—11 A strophe of a hymn.<BR>—12 Property, quality.<BR>—13 A means, stratagem (उपाय); न पर्यायोऽस्ति यत् साम्यं त्वयि कुर्युर्विशांपते Mb. 5. 73. 7.<BR>—14 End (अन्त); पर्यायकाले धर्मस्य प्राप्ते कलिरजायत Mb. 5. 74. 12.<BR>—15 Contrariety, reverse; कालपर्यायमाज्ञाय मा स्म शोके मनः कृथाः Mb. 6. 2. 5.<BR>—16 (In Rhet.) A figure of speech; see K. P. 10; Candr. 5. 108, 109;<BR> S. D. 733. [<i>Note</i>. पर्यायेण is often used adverbially in the sense of:−<BR>—1 in turn or succession, by regular gradation,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">Page0995-1</a>]<BR> (opp. तन्त्रेण); पर्यायेण क्रियायामेवं दोषः । तन्त्रेण तु क्रियायां<BR> भवति क्वचित् संभवः । ŚB. on MS. 6. 2. 2.<BR>—2 Occasionally, now and then; पर्यायेण हि दृश्यन्ते स्वप्नाः कामं शुभाशुभाः Ve. 2. 14].<BR>—3 Alternately; मत्सदृशं किमपि पुंरूपं मां च पर्यायेण निर्वर्णयन्ती Dk. 5.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्यायान्नम्, पर्यायोक्तम्, पर्यायक्रमः, पर्यायच्युत, पर्यायवचनम्, पर्यायशब्दः, पर्यायवाचकः, पर्यायशयनम्, पर्यायसेवा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0994-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायान्नम्
पर्यायः + -अन्नम् food intended for another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायोक्तम्
पर्यायः + -उक्तम् a figure of speech in Rhetoric; it is a circumlocutory<BR> or periphrastic way of speaking, when the fact to be intimated is expressed<BR> by a turn of speech or periphrasis; <i>e. g.</i> see Candr. 5. 66 or S. D. 733.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायक्रमः|पर्यायक्रम
पर्यायः + -क्रमः order of succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायच्युत
पर्यायः + -च्युत <i>a.</i> supplanted, superseded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायवचनम्
पर्यायः + -वचनम्, -शब्दः a synonym.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायशब्दः|पर्यायशब्द
पर्यायः + -वचनम्, -शब्दः a synonym.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायवाचक
पर्यायः + -वाचक^1 <i>a.</i> expressing a corresponding notion.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायशयनम्
पर्यायः + -शयनम् alternate sleeping and watching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायसेवा
पर्यायः + -सेवा service by rotation; पर्यायसेवामुत्सृज्य Ku. 2. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायशः
पर्यायशः <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Periodically.<BR>—2 In succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यायत
पर्यायत <i>a.</i> Extremely long or extended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यारिणी|पर्य्यारिणी
पर्यारिणी A cow afflicted with diseases.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याली|पर्य्याली
पर्याली <i>ind.</i> A particle expressing ‘harm’ or ‘injury’ (हिंसन),<BR> used with कृ, भू or अस्; पर्यालीकृत्य = हिंसित्वा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यालोच्
पर्यालोच् €10 U. To reflect, consider, think about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यालोचनम्
पर्यालोचनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Circumspection, attentive observation, deliberation, mature reflection.<BR>—2 Knowing, recognition.<BR>—3 Plan, design.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यालोचना
पर्यालोचनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Circumspection, attentive observation, deliberation, mature reflection.<BR>—2 Knowing, recognition.<BR>—3 Plan, design.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यावर्तः|पर्यावर्त
पर्यावर्तः, पर्यावर्तनम्<BR>—1 Coming back, return.<BR>—2 Exchange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यावर्तनम्
पर्यावर्तः, पर्यावर्तनम्<BR>—1 Coming back, return.<BR>—2 Exchange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यावर्तित
पर्यावर्तित <i>p. p.</i> Subverted, reversed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याविल|पर्य्याविल
पर्याविल <i>a.</i> Very muddy or turbid, much soiled; पर्याविलानीव<BR> नवोदकानि R. 7. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्यावृत
पर्यावृत <i>a.</i> Veiled, covered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्याहारः|पर्याहार|पर्य्याहार
पर्याहारः<BR>—1 A yoke worn across the shoulders in carrying a load.<BR>—2 Conveying.<BR>—3 A load or burden.<BR>—4 A pitcher.<BR>—5 Storing grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युक्षणम्
पर्युक्षणम् Sprinkling round water silently and without uttering<BR> any ritual formulae or Mantras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युक्षणी
पर्युक्षणम् + .{@-णी@} A vessel for sprinkling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युत्थानम्
पर्युत्थानम् Standing up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युत्सुक|पर्य्युत्सुक
पर्युत्सुक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sorrowful, sorry, regretting, sad; ˚त्वम् sorrow; R. 5. 67; पर्युत्सुकीभवति<BR> यत् सुखितोऽपि जन्तुः Ś. 5. 2 (v. l.).<BR>—2 Eagerly desirous, anxious, anxiously longing for; स्मर पर्युत्सुक<BR> एष माधवः Ku. 4. 28; V. 2. 16.<BR>—3 Agitated, excited; मुहूर्तं पर्युत्सुकमना आसीत् Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदञ्चनम्
पर्युदञ्चनम्<BR>—1 Debt.<BR>—2 Raising up, drawing out (उद्धार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदस्
पर्युदस् €4 P.<BR>—1 To reject, exclude.<BR>—2 To prohibit, object to.<BR>—3 To heap together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदस्त|पर्य्युदस्त|पर्य्युदस्तः
पर्युदस्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Excluded, excepted.<BR>—2 Prohibited, objected to (as a ceremony).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युदासः|पर्युदास|पर्य्युदास|पर्य्युदासः
पर्युदासः<BR>—1 An exception, a prohibitive rule or precept; प्राधान्यं हि विधेर्यत्र<BR> प्रतिषेधेऽप्रधानता । पर्युदासः स विज्ञेयो यत्रोत्तरपदेन नञ् ॥<BR>—2 A negation purporting to state some matter of the exclusion of something<BR> that is actually mentioned. Technically नञ् (the negative particle)<BR> has the sense of पर्युदास when it is connected with any word that<BR> is not a verb. But it conveys प्रतिषेध when it is connected with<BR> a verb. Thus अब्राह्मणम् आनय means ब्राह्मणं वर्जयित्वा यं कमपि<BR> आनय; while कलञ्जं न भक्षयेत् conveys prohibition of कलञ्जभक्षण.<BR> For a discussion on पर्युदास read MS. 10. 8. 1-4 and ŚB. on MS. thereon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपयुक्त
पर्युपयुक्त <i>a.</i> Exhausted, used up (completely); तेनैतस्मिंश्च<BR> क्रियमाणेऽपरिसमाप्त एवायुः पर्युपयुक्तं स्यात् ŚB. on MS. 6. 7. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपस्थानम्
पर्युपस्थानम् Serving, waiting upon, attendance; ततः शुचिसमाचाराः<BR> पर्युपस्थानकोविदाः Rām. 2. 65 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपास्
पर्युपास् €2 Ā.<BR>—1 To attend upon, worship, attend respectfully; पर्युपास्यन्त लक्ष्म्या<BR> R. 10. 62; Ku. 2. 38; Ms. 7. 37.<BR>—2 To go to (for protection), resort to, seek shelter or patronage with;<BR> अशक्ता एव सर्वत्र नरेन्द्रं पर्युपासते Pt. 1. 241.<BR>—3 To enclose, surround.<BR>—4 To share in, partake of.<BR>—5 To sit on.<BR>—6 To live round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासक
पर्युपासक, -सिन्, -सितृ <i>m.</i><BR> A worshipper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासिन्
पर्युपासक, -सिन्, -सितृ <i>m.</i><BR> A worshipper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासितृ
पर्युपासक, -सिन्, -सितृ <i>m.</i><BR> A worshipper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासनम्
पर्युपासनम्<BR>—1 Worship, honour, service.<BR>—2 Friendliness, courtesy.<BR>—3 Sitting round.<BR>—4 Pardon, excuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युपासीन|पर्य्युपासीन
पर्युपासीन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sitting upon; Ms. 2. 75.<BR>—2 Surrounded by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युप्तिः|पर्युप्ति
पर्युप्तिः <i>f.</i> Sowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युषणम्
पर्युषणम् Worship, adoration, service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युषित|पर्य्युषित|पर्य्युषितं
पर्युषित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Stale, not fresh; शुक्तं पर्युषितोच्छिष्टं श्वस्पृष्टं पतितेक्षितम्<BR> Y. 1. 167; Ms. 4. 211; Bg. 17. 10; cf. अपर्युषित.<BR>—2 Insipid.<BR>—3 Stupid.<BR>—4 Vain.<BR>—5 Having passed the night.<BR>—6 Having stood for a time or in some place.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्युषितभोजिन्, पर्युषितवाक्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युषितभोजिन्|पर्य्युषितभोजिन्
पर्युषित + -भोजिन् <i>m.</i> the eater of stale food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युषितवाक्यम्
पर्युषित + -वाक्यम् a word that has not been strictly kept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्युष्ट
पर्युष्ट <i>a.</i> Stale; पर्युष्टया तव विभो वनमालयेयम् Bhāg. 11. 6. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्येषणम्
पर्येषणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Investigation by reasoning.<BR>—2 Search, inquiry in general; श्रूयतां यः प्रयत्नो मे सीतापर्येषणे<BR> कृतः Mb. 3. 282. 17.<BR>—3 Homage, worship.<BR>—4 Spending the rainy season (Buddh.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्येषणा|पर्य्येषणा
पर्येषणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Investigation by reasoning.<BR>—2 Search, inquiry in general; श्रूयतां यः प्रयत्नो मे सीतापर्येषणे<BR> कृतः Mb. 3. 282. 17.<BR>—3 Homage, worship.<BR>—4 Spending the rainy season (Buddh.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्येष्टिः|पर्येष्टि|पर्य्येष्टि
पर्येष्टिः <i>f.</i> Search, inquiry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्व्
पर्व् €1 P. (पर्वति) To fill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वकम्
पर्वकम् The knee-joint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0995-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वणी
पर्वणी [पर्व्-करणे ल्युट् स्त्रियां ङीप्]<BR>—1 The full-moon day or the day of new moon.<BR>—2 A festival.<BR>—3 A particular disease of the juncture or संधि of the eye (in medicine);<BR> also पर्वणिका.<BR>—4 Filling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतः|पर्वत|पर्व्वत|पर्व्वतः
पर्वतः [पर्व्-अतच्; पर्वाणि भागाः सन्त्यस्य वा; cf. P. V. 2. 122. Vārt.]<BR>—1 A mountain, hill; परगुणपरमाणून् पर्वतीकृत्य नित्यम् Bh. 2. 78;<BR> न पर्वताग्रे नलिनी प्ररोहति Mk. 4. 17.<BR>—2 A rock.<BR>—3 An artificial mountain or heap.<BR>—4 The number ‘seven’.<BR>—5 A tree.<BR>—6 A kind of vegetable.<BR>—7 A cloud (mountain-like)<BR>—8 N. of a Ṛṣi (associated with Nārada).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्वतारिः, पर्वतात्मजः, पर्वतात्मजा, पर्वताधारा, पर्वताशयः, पर्वताश्रयः, पर्वताश्रयिन्, पर्वतोपत्यका, पर्वतकन्दरः, पर्वतकाकः, पर्वतकीला, पर्वतजा, पर्वतपतिः, पर्वतमोचा, पर्वतराज्, पर्वतरोधस्, पर्वतवासिन्, पर्वतस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतारिः|पर्वतारि|पर्व्वतारि|पर्व्वतारिः
पर्वतः + -अरिः an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतात्मजः|पर्वतात्मज
पर्वतः + -आत्मजः an epithet of the mountain Maināka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतात्मजा
पर्वतः + -आत्मजा an epithet of Pārvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वताधारा|पर्व्वताधारा
पर्वतः + -आधारा the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

