पर्वतः + -आशयः a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वताश्रयः|पर्वताश्रय|पर्व्वताश्रय|पर्व्वताश्रयः
पर्वतः + -आश्रयः a fabulous animal called Śarabha, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वताश्रयिन्
पर्वतः + -आश्रयिन् <i>m.</i>, {@-आश्रयः@} a mountaineer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतोपत्यका
पर्वतः + -उपत्यका a land at the foot of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतकन्दरः|पर्वतकन्दर
पर्वतः + -कन्दरः a mountain-cave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतकाकः|पर्वतकाक|पर्व्वतकाक|पर्व्वतकाकः
पर्वतः + -काकः a raven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतकीला
पर्वतः + -कीला the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतजा|पर्व्वतजा
पर्वतः + -जा a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतपतिः|पर्वतपति
पर्वतः + -पतिः an epithet of the Himālaya mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतमोचा|पर्व्वतमोचा
पर्वतः + -मोचा a kind of plantain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतराज्
पर्वतः + -राज् <i>m.</i>, {@-राजः@}<BR>—1 a large mountain.<BR>—2 ‘the lord of mountains’, the Himālaya mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतरोधस्
पर्वतः + -रोधस् <i>n.</i> mountain-slope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतवासिन्|पर्व्वतवासिन्
पर्वतः + -वासिन् <i>a.</i> living in mountains. ━(<i>m.</i>) a mountaineer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतवासिनी|पर्व्वतवासिनी
पर्वतः + -वासिन् + .({@-नी@})<BR>—1 N. of Durgā.<BR>—2 of Gāyatrī.<BR>—3 N. of a plant, nard (Mar. आकाशमांसी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतस्थ
पर्वतः + -स्थ <i>a.</i> situated on a hill or mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतिः|पर्वति
पर्वतिः <i>f.</i> (Ved.) A rock, stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतीय|पर्व्वतीय|पर्व्वतीयः
पर्वतीय <i>a.</i> Belonging to a mountain, hilly, mountainous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वतीकृ
पर्वतीकृ €8 U. To make into a mountain, magnify, enhance the value of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वन्|पर्व्वन्
पर्वन् <i>n.</i> [पॄ-वनिप् Uṇ. 4. 112.] ‘पर्व स्यादुत्सवे ग्रन्थौ प्रस्तावे लक्षणान्तरे’ इति विश्वः.<BR>—1 A knot, joint; मासाश्चार्धमासाश्च पर्वाणि; Bṛ. Up. 1. 1. 1. (Sometimes<BR> changed to पर्व at the end of Bah. comp.; as in कर्कशाङ्गुलिपर्वया<BR> R. 12. 41.) सोऽहं दुर्मायिनस्तेऽद्य वज्रेण शतपर्वणा, शिरो हरिष्ये<BR> Bhāg. 8. 11. 6; सतामिवापर्वणि मार्गणानाम् Ki. 17. 29.<BR>—2 A limb, member, joint of the body, knuckle.<BR>—3 A portion, part, division; ससर्ज च्छायया विद्यां पञ्चपर्वाणमग्रतः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 20. 18.<BR>—4 A book, section (as of the Mahābhārata).<BR>—5 The step of a staircase; दिने दिने शैवलवन्त्यधस्तात् सोपानपर्वाणि<BR> विमुञ्चदम्भः R. 16. 46.<BR>—6 A period, fixed time.<BR>—7 Particularly, the days of the four changes of the moon; <i>i. e.</i> the<BR> eighth and fourteenth day of each half month and the days of the full and new moon.<BR>—8 A sacrifice performed on the occasion of a change of the moon; पर्वणि<BR> न विचिन्वेत् (तुलसीम्) Tulasī. Up.<BR>—9 The day of new or full moon, the day of opposition or conjunction;<BR> अपर्वणि ग्रहकलुषेन्दुमण्डला विभावरी कथय कथं भविष्यति M. 4. 15;<BR> R. 7. 33; Ms. 4. 150; Bh. 2. 34.<BR>—10 An eclipse of the sun or moon; भ्रातः पर्वणि पश्य दानवपतिः<BR> शीर्षावशेषी कृतः Bh.<BR>—11 A festival, holiday, an occasion of joy;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">Page0996-2</a>]<BR> स्वलंकृतौ बालगजौ पर्वणीव सितेतरौ (कृष्णरामौ) Bhāg. 10. 41. 41.<BR>—12 An opportunity or occasion in general.<BR>—13 A particular period of the year (as the equinox, solstice).<BR>—14 The moment of the sunʼs entering a new sign.<BR>—15 A moment, instant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्वास्फोटः, पर्वकारः, पर्वकालः, पर्वकारिन्, पर्वगामिन्, पर्वदक्षिणा, पर्वधिः, पर्वनाडी, पर्वपूर्णता, पर्वभागः, पर्वभेदः, पर्वमूलम्, पर्वयोनिः, पर्वरुह्, पर्ववर्ज, पर्वविपद्, पर्वसंधिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वास्फोटः|पर्वास्फोट
पर्वन् + -आस्फोटः cracking the fingers (regarded as indecorus).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वकारः|पर्वकार
पर्वन् + -कारः One wearing different dresses (वेषान्तरधारी); Mb. 13. 90. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वकालः|पर्वकाल
पर्वन् + -कालः<BR>—1 a periodic change of the moon.<BR>—2 the time at which the moon at its conjunction or opposition passes<BR> through the node; ˚राशिः time for festivals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वकारिन्|पर्व्वकारिन्
पर्वन् + -कारिन् <i>m.</i> a Brāhmaṇa who from motives of gain performs on<BR> common days ceremonies which ought to be performed on periodical occasions,<BR> such as अमावास्या &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वगामिन्|पर्व्वगामिन्
पर्वन् + -गामिन् <i>m.</i> one who has sexual intercourse with his wife at<BR> particular times or occasions when such intercourse is prohibited by the Śāstras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वदक्षिणा
पर्वन् + -दक्षिणा the teacherʼs fee for teaching a particular portion of the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वधिः|पर्वधि|पर्व्वधि|पर्व्वधिः
पर्वन् + -धिः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वनाडी
पर्वन् + -नाडी time of opposition or conjunction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वपूर्णता|पर्व्वपूर्णता
पर्वन् + -पूर्णता<BR>—1 preparations for a festival.<BR>—2 completion of a festival.<BR>—3 joining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वभागः|पर्वभाग
पर्वन् + -भागः the wrist; आपर्वभागोत्थितैः Ś. 4. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वभेदः|पर्वभेद
पर्वन् + -भेदः violent pain in the joints; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वमूलम्
पर्वन् + -मूलम् the time at which the fourteenth day passes into the fifteenth<BR> day of a fortnight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वयोनिः|पर्वयोनि|पर्व्वयोनि|पर्व्वयोनिः
पर्वन् + -योनिः a cane or reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वरुह्|पर्व्वरुह्
पर्वन् + -रुह् <i>m.</i> a pomegranate tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ववर्ज
पर्वन् + -वर्ज <i>a.</i> except the forbidden days of a month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वविपद्
पर्वन् + -विपद् The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वसंधिः|पर्वसन्धि|पर्व्वसन्धि|पर्व्वसन्धिः
पर्वन् + -संधिः<BR>—1 the junction of the fifteenth and first of a lunar fortnight, the full<BR> and change of the moon, or the exact moment of the full and change of<BR> the moon; जुषन्ते पर्वतश्रेष्ठमृषयः पर्वसंधिषु Mb. 3. 159. 16.<BR>—2 a finger-joint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वरीण|पर्व्वरीण|पर्व्वरीणं|पर्व्वरीणः
पर्वरीण (= पर्परीण q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्वितः|पर्वित|पर्व्वित|पर्व्वितः
पर्वितः A kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्शुः|पर्शु
पर्शुः<BR>—1 An axe, a hatchet; cf. परशु.<BR>—2 A weapon in general.<BR>—3 A rib; अवान्तरदिशः पर्शवः Bṛ. Up. 1. 1. 1.<BR>—4 Ved. A curved knife. ━<i>f.</i> The supporting or side-wall of a well.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पर्शुपाणिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्शुपाणिः|पर्शुपाणि
पर्शुः + -पाणिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—2 of Paraśurāma; also पर्शुराम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्शुका
पर्शुका A rib.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्श्वधः|पर्श्वध
पर्श्वधः See परश्वध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ष्
पर्ष् €1 Ā. (पर्षते)<BR>—1 To become wet or moist.<BR>—2 Ved. To accept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्ष|पर्षः
पर्ष <i>a.</i> Voilent, rough (as wind); देवे वर्षति यज्ञविप्लवरुषा<BR> वज्राश्मपर्षानिलैः Bhāg. 10. 26. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्षः|पर्ष
पर्षः Ved. A bundle, sheaf; खले न पर्षान् प्रति हन्मि भूरि Rv. 10. 48. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पर्षद्
पर्षद् <i>f.</i> [पृष्-अदि]<BR>—1 An assembly, a meeting, conclave; परीतो भूतपर्षद्भिः Bhāg. 3. 14. 23, 10. 83. 21.<BR>—2 Particularly, a religious synod or assembly; चत्वारो वेदधर्मज्ञाः<BR> पर्षत् Y. 1. 9. ˚वलः A member of an assembly; पर्षद्वलान् महाब्रह्मैराट<BR> नैकटिकाश्रमान् Bk. 4. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0996-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्
पल् I. €1 P. (पलति) To go, move. ━II. €10 P. To protect (पालयति); L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0997-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलः|पल|पलं
पलः [पल्-अच्] Straw, husk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0997-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलम्
पलः + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 Flesh, meat.<BR>—2 A particular weight equal to four <i>karṣas</i>.<BR>—3 A particular measure of fluids.<BR>—4 A particular measure of time.<BR>—5 A small measure; लवणपलमिव क्षिप्तमन्तर्ह्रदस्य Nāg. 5. 24.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पलाग्निः, पलाङ्गः, पलादः, पलाशः, पलाशनः, पलान्नम्, पलक्षारः, पलगण्डः, पलप्रियः, पलभा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0997-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलाग्निः|पलाग्नि
पलः + -अग्निः bile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0997-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलाङ्गः|पलाङ्ग|पलांग
पलः + -अङ्गः a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0997-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलादः|पलाद
पलः + -अदः, -अशः, -अशनः a demon, Rākṣasa; निर्दग्धुं निखिलाः<BR> पलाशसमिधो मेध्यादयोध्यारणेः Rām. champū.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0997-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलाशः|पलाश|पलाशं
