पलितदर्शनम्
पलित + -दर्शनम् the sight or appearance of grey hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0997-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पलितंकरण
