पल्लः A large granary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवः|पल्लव|पल्लवं
पल्लवः, -वम्<BR>—1 A sprout, sprig, twig, करपल्लवः; लतेव संनद्धमनोज्ञपल्लवा<BR> R. 3. 7; Ku. 3. 54.<BR>—2 A bud, blossom.<BR>—3 Expansion, spreading, dilating.<BR>—4 The red dye called Alakta, q. v. पाणियुग्ममपि सह पल्लवेन अलक्तरागेण<BR> वर्तते; cf. Jinarāja com. on N. 10. 83.<BR>—5 Strength, power.<BR>—6 A blade of grass.<BR>—7 A bracelet, an armlet.<BR>—8 Love, amorous sport.<BR>—9 The end of a robe or garment; क्षौममाकुलकरा विचकर्ष क्रान्तपल्लवमभीष्टतमेन Śi. 10. 83.<BR>—10 Unsteadiness (चापलम्).<BR>—11 A story, narrative; सपल्लवं व्यासपराशराभ्यां … यद् ववृते<BR> पुराणम् N. 10. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवम्
पल्लवः, -वम्<BR>—1 A sprout, sprig, twig, करपल्लवः; लतेव संनद्धमनोज्ञपल्लवा<BR> R. 3. 7; Ku. 3. 54.<BR>—2 A bud, blossom.<BR>—3 Expansion, spreading, dilating.<BR>—4 The red dye called Alakta, q. v. पाणियुग्ममपि सह पल्लवेन अलक्तरागेण<BR> वर्तते; cf. Jinarāja com. on N. 10. 83.<BR>—5 Strength, power.<BR>—6 A blade of grass.<BR>—7 A bracelet, an armlet.<BR>—8 Love, amorous sport.<BR>—9 The end of a robe or garment; क्षौममाकुलकरा विचकर्ष क्रान्तपल्लवमभीष्टतमेन Śi. 10. 83.<BR>—10 Unsteadiness (चापलम्).<BR>—11 A story, narrative; सपल्लवं व्यासपराशराभ्यां … यद् ववृते<BR> पुराणम् N. 10. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवः|पल्लव|पल्लवं
पल्लवः, -वम् + .{@-वः@} A libertine; Viś. Guṇā. 425.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पल्लवाङ्कुरः, पल्लवाधारः, पल्लवादः, पल्लवास्त्रः, पल्लवापीडित, पल्लवग्राहिता, पल्लवग्राहिन्, पल्लवद्रुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवाङ्कुरः|पल्लवाङ्कुर|पल्लवांकुर
पल्लवः + -अङ्कुरः a leaf-bud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवाधारः|पल्लवाधार
पल्लवः + -आधारः a branch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवादः|पल्लवाद
पल्लवः + -अदः a deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवास्त्रः|पल्लवास्त्र
पल्लवः + -अस्त्रः an epithet of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवापीडित
पल्लवः + -आपीडित <i>a.</i> full of or laden with buds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवग्राहिता
पल्लवः + -ग्राहिता<BR>—1 dealing with trifles.<BR>—2 superficial knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवग्राहिन्
पल्लवः + -ग्राहिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 putting forth sprouts.<BR>—2 dealing with trifles.<BR>—3 diffusive or superficial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवद्रुः|पल्लवद्रु
पल्लवः + -द्रुः the Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवकः|पल्लवक
पल्लवकः<BR>—1 A libertine.<BR>—2 A catamite.<BR>—3 The paramour of a harlot.<BR>—4 The Aśoka tree.<BR>—5 A kind of fish.<BR>—6 A sprout (<i>n.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवति
पल्लवति, पल्लवयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To put forth sprouts, bud.<BR>—2 To expand, spread, make prolix or diffuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवयति
पल्लवति, पल्लवयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To put forth sprouts, bud.<BR>—2 To expand, spread, make prolix or diffuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवनम्
पल्लवनम् Prolixity; useless speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लविकः|पल्लविक
पल्लविकः<BR>—1 A libertine, a gallant.<BR>—2 A catamite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लविका
पल्लविकः + .{@-का@} A kind of scarf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवित|पल्लवितं|पल्लवितः
पल्लवित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sprouting, having young shoots or sprouts.<BR>—2 Spread, extended; अलं पल्लवितेन ‘enough of further amplification or expatiation’<BR>.<BR>—3 Dyed red with lac; अथ पल्लवितं लाक्षारक्ते Med.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लवितः|पल्लवित|पल्लवितं
पल्लवित + .{@-तः@} Lac-dye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लविन्
पल्लविन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Having young shoots or leaves; पर्याप्तपुष्पस्तबकावनम्रा<BR> संचारिणी पल्लविनी लतेव Ku. 3. 54. ━<i>m.</i> A tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लिः|पल्लि
पल्लिः, -ल्ली <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A small village; पल्लीघोषान् समृद्धांश्च बहुगोकुलसंकुलान् (अपश्यत्)<BR> Mb. 12. 325. 20; also a settlement of wild tribes.<BR>—2 A hut.<BR>—3 A house, station.<BR>—4 A city or town (at the end of names of towns); as त्रिशिरपल्ली<BR> (Trichinopoly).<BR>—5 A house-lizard.<BR>—6 A creeping-plant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पल्लिपतनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्ली
पल्लिः, -ल्ली <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A small village; पल्लीघोषान् समृद्धांश्च बहुगोकुलसंकुलान् (अपश्यत्)<BR> Mb. 12. 325. 20; also a settlement of wild tribes.<BR>—2 A hut.<BR>—3 A house, station.<BR>—4 A city or town (at the end of names of towns); as त्रिशिरपल्ली<BR> (Trichinopoly).<BR>—5 A house-lizard.<BR>—6 A creeping-plant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पल्लिपतनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लिपतनम्
पल्लिः + -पतनम् prognostication by observing the falling of house-lizards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्लिका
पल्लिका<BR>—1 A small village or station.<BR>—2 A house-lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्वलम्
पल्वलम् A small pool or pond, a puddle, tank (अल्पं सरः);<BR> स पल्वलजलेऽधुना … कथं वर्तताम् Bv. 1. 3; R. 2. 17, 3. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पल्वलावासः, पल्वलकर्षक, पल्वलपङ्कः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्वलावासः|पल्वलावास
पल्वलम् + -आवासः a tortoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्वलकर्षक
पल्वलम् + -कर्षक <i>a.</i> ploughing a pool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्वलपङ्कः|पल्वलपङ्क|पल्वलपंक
पल्वलम् + -पङ्कः the mud of a pool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पल्वल्य
पल्वल्य <i>a.</i> Marshy, boggy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवः|पव|पवं
पवः [पू-भावे-अप्] —1 Wind. —2 Purification.<BR>—3 A marsh.<BR>—4 Winnowing corn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवा
पवः + .{@-वा@} Purification.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवम्
पवः + .{@-वम्@} Cowdung.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवत्
पवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 A Purifier.<BR>—2 One going rapidly; पवनः पवतामस्मि Bg. 10. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवन|पवनं|पवनः
पवन <i>a.</i> Clean, pure; महतां पदपद्मजं परागं पवनानां<BR> पवनं ह्युपादिशन्ति Rām. Ch. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनः|पवन|पवनं
पवन + .{@-नः@} [पू-ल्यु]<BR>—1 Air, wind; सर्पाः पिबन्ति पवनं न च दुर्बलास्ते Subhāṣ.; Bg. 10. 31;<BR> पवनपदवी, पवनसुतः &c.; The vital air, breath.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 A householderʼs sacred fire.<BR>—4 A purifier (wind); परितो दुरितानि यः पुनीते शिव तस्मै पवनात्मने<BR> नमस्ते Ki. 18. 37.<BR>—5 N. of the number five (from the 5 vital airs).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनम्
पवन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Purification.<BR>—2 Winnowing.<BR>—3 A sieve, strainer.<BR>—4 Water.<BR>—5 A potterʼs kiln (<i>m.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनी
पवन + .{@-नी@} A broom.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पवनाशनः, पवनभुज्, पवनात्मजः, पवनाशः, पवनचक्रम्, पवनजः, पवनतनयः, पवनभूः, पवनसुतः, पवनपदवी, पवनवाहनः, पवनविजयः, पवनव्याधिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनाशनः|पवनाशन
पवन + -अशनः, -भुज् <i>m.</i> a serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनभुज्
पवन + -अशनः, -भुज् <i>m.</i> a serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनात्मजः|पवनात्मज
पवन + -आत्मजः<BR>—1 an epithet of Hanumat.<BR>—2 of Bhīma.<BR>—3 fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनाशः|पवनाश
पवन + -आशः a serpent, snake. ˚नाशः<BR>—1 an epithet of Garuḍa.<BR>—2 a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनचक्रम्
पवन + -चक्रम् Whirl-wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनजः|पवनज
पवन + -जः, -तनयः, -भूः, -सुतः<BR>—1 epithets of Hanumat; संक्षोभं पवनभुवा जवेन नीताः Śi. 4. 59.<BR>—2 of Bhīma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनतनयः|पवनतनय
पवन + -जः, -तनयः, -भूः, -सुतः<BR>—1 epithets of Hanumat; संक्षोभं पवनभुवा जवेन नीताः Śi. 4. 59.<BR>—2 of Bhīma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनभूः
पवन + -जः, -तनयः, -भूः, -सुतः<BR>—1 epithets of Hanumat; संक्षोभं पवनभुवा जवेन नीताः Śi. 4. 59.<BR>—2 of Bhīma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनसुतः|पवनसुत
पवन + -जः, -तनयः, -भूः, -सुतः<BR>—1 epithets of Hanumat; संक्षोभं पवनभुवा जवेन नीताः Śi. 4. 59.<BR>—2 of Bhīma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनपदवी
पवन + -पदवी The sky, air; त्वामारूढं पवनपदवीम् (प्रेक्षिष्यन्ते<BR> पथिकवनिताः) Me. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनवाहनः|पवनवाहन
पवन + -वाहनः fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनविजयः|पवनविजय
पवन + -विजयः a kind of book dealing with omens relating to breath<BR> exhaled and inhaled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवनव्याधिः|पवनव्याधि
पवन + -व्याधिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Uddhava, a friend and counsellor of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—2 rheumatism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवमानः|पवमान
पवमानः [पू-ताच्छील्ये शानच्]<BR>—1 Air, wind; पवमानः पृथिवीरुहानिव R. 8. 9.<BR>—2 One of the sacred fires, considered to be the same as गार्हपत्य<BR> q. v.; also called पवमानात्मजः.<BR>—3 N. of a particular Stotra sung in the Soma-yāga; अथातः पवमानानामेवाभ्यारोहः<BR> Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 28.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पवमानसखः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवमानसखः|पवमानसख
पवमानः + -सखः fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित|पवितः
पवित <i>a.</i> Purified, cleansed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवितम्
पवित + .{@-तम्@} Black pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवाका
पवाका A whirl-wind, a hurricane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पविः|पवि
पविः<BR>—1 The thunderbolt of Indra.<BR>—2 Ved. The tire of a wheel.<BR>—3 The point of a spear or arrow.<BR>—4 An arrow.<BR>—5 Speech.<BR>—6 Fire.<BR>—7 Thunder; पवित्रालोकनादेष पवित्रासमविन्दत N. 17. 188.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पव्य
पव्य^1 <i>a.</i> Relating to वज्र; क्षौरपव्यम् Bhāg. 6. 5. 8.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्र|पवित्रं|पवित्रः
पवित्र <i>a.</i> [पू-करणे इत्र]<BR>—1 Sacred, holy, sinless, sanctified (persons or things); त्रीणि श्राद्धे<BR> पवित्राणि दौहित्रः कुतपस्तिलाः Ms. 3. 235; पवित्रो नरः, पवित्रं स्थानम् &c.<BR>—2 Purified by the performance of ceremonial acts (such as sacrifices &c.).<BR>—4 Purifying, removing sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रम्
पवित्र + .{@-त्रम्@}<BR>—1 An instrument for cleansing or purifying, such as a sieve or strainer &c.<BR>—2 Two blades of Kuśa grass used at sacrifices in purifying and sprinkling<BR> ghee; N. 17. 188.<BR>—3 A ring of Kuśa grass worn on the fourth finger on certain religious<BR> occasions; धौताङ्घ्रिपाणिराचम्य सपवित्र उदङ्मुखः Bhāg. 6. 8. 4.<BR>—4 The sacred thread worn by members of the first three castes of the Hindus.<BR>—5 Copper.<BR>—6 Rain.<BR>—7 Water.<BR>—8 Rubbing, cleansing.<BR>—9 A vessel in which the <i>arghya</i> is presented.<BR>—10 Clarified butter.<BR>—11 Honey.<BR>—12 A purifying prayer.<BR>—13 A<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">Page0999-1</a>]<BR> means of purifying the mind.<BR>—14 A cloth for straining Soma juice; वायुः पूतः पवित्रेण प्रत्यङ्<BR> सोमोऽतिद्रुतः Ts. 1. 8. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रा
पवित्र + .{@-त्रा@}<BR>—1 The holy basil.<BR>—2 Turmeric (पवित्रीकृ ‘to purify, sanctify’; पवित्रीभू ‘to become pure or holy’<BR>).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पवित्रारोपणम्, पवित्रारोहणम्, पवित्रधान्यम्, पवित्रपाणि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0998-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रारोपणम्
पवित्र + -आरोपणम्, -आरोहणम् investiture with the sacred thread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रारोहणम्
पवित्र + -आरोपणम्, -आरोहणम् investiture with the sacred thread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रधान्यम्
पवित्र + -धान्यम् barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रपाणि
पवित्र + -पाणि <i>a.</i> holding <i>Darbha</i> grass in the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रकम्
पवित्रकम्<BR>—1 A net or rope made of hemp or pack-thread.<BR>—2 N. of several trees like पिप्पली, तिल, दमनक, उदुम्बर etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रता
पवित्रता, -त्वम्<BR> Purity, cleanliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रत्वम्
पवित्रता, -त्वम्<BR> Purity, cleanliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रयति
पवित्रयति Den. P. To purify, cleanse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रवत्|पवित्रवन्त्
पवित्रवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having a strainer or purifying instrument.<BR>—2 Purifying, cleansing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रिन्
पवित्रिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Purifying.<BR>—2 Clean, pure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवित्रीकरणम्
पवित्रीकरणम्<BR>—1 Purification.<BR>—2 Means of purifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पवीरम्
पवीरम् Ved. A spear, lance; Nir. 12. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्
पश्, -ष् -स् €1 U.<BR>—1 To oppress.<BR>—2 To touch; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पष्
पश्, -ष् -स् €1 U.<BR>—1 To oppress.<BR>—2 To touch; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पस्
पश्, -ष् -स् €1 U.<BR>—1 To oppress.<BR>—2 To touch; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्
पश्, -स् €10 P.<BR> To bind (पाशयति); L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पस्
पश्, -स् €10 P.<BR> To bind (पाशयति); L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पष्
पष्, -श् €10 P.<BR> To go, to touch (पषयति, but with उपसर्ग, पषति<BR> <i>e. g.</i> प्रपषति); L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्
पष्, -श् €10 P.<BR> To go, to touch (पषयति, but with उपसर्ग, पषति<BR> <i>e. g.</i> प्रपषति); L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशु|पशुः
पशु <i>ind.</i> Behold! How good!<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुः|पशु
पशुः [सर्वमविशेषेण पश्यति, दृश्-कु पशादेशः]<BR>—1 Cattle (both singly and collectively); प्रजापतिर्हि वैश्याय सृष्ट्वा<BR> परिददे पशून् Ms. 9. 327, 331.<BR>—2 An animal in general; a being; सर्वथा यत् पशून् पाति तैश्च यद् रमते<BR> पुनः तेषामधिपतिर्यच्च तस्मात् पशुपतिः स्मृतः ॥ Mb. 7. 202. 123.<BR>—3 A sacrificial animal, such as a goat; an oblation, a victim.<BR>—4 A brute, beast; often added to words meaning ‘man’ to show contempt;<BR> a fool; भूतानि चात्मन्यपृथग्दिदृक्षतां प्रायेण रोषोऽभिभवेद् यथा पशुम्<BR> Bhāg. 4. 6. 46; पुरुषपशोश्च पशोश्च को विशेषः H. 1; cf. नृपशु, नरपशु &c.<BR>—5 N. of a subordinate deity and one of Śivaʼs followers.<BR>—6 An uninitiated person.<BR>—7 The soul, the Supreme Spirit.<BR>—8 A sacrifice in which an animal is killed.<BR>—9 Fire.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पश्ववदानम्, पश्वेकत्वन्यायः, पशुकर्मन्, पशुक्रिया, पशुगायत्री, पशुघातः, पशुघ्न, पशुचर्या, पशुदेवता, पशुधर्मः, पशुनाथः, पशुपः, पशुपतिः, पशुपालः, पशुपालकः, पशुपालनम्, पशुरक्षणम्, पशुपाशः, पशुपाशकम्, पशुप्रेरणम्, पशुबन्धः, पशुबन्धकः, पशुमतम्, पशुमारम्, पशुयज्ञः, पशुयागः, पशुद्रव्यम्, पशुरज्जुः, पशुराजः, पशुलोहितपः, पशुष, पशुसमाम्नायः, पशुसंभव,^1 पशुहव्यम्<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्ववदानम्
पशुः + -अवदानम् a sacrifice of animals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्वेकत्वन्यायः
पशुः + -एकत्वन्यायः the rule that the number is intended to be expressed<BR> and enjoined when the sense conveyed by the verb forms the principle matter<BR> of a sentence. Thus पशुमालभते means एकत्वपुंस्त्वविशिष्टं पशुमालभते.<BR> This न्याय is established by जैमिनि in MS. 4. 1. 11-16 and 17<BR> and explained by शबर in his भाष्य thereon discussing the text<BR> पशुमालभते. (This न्याय is to be contrasted with ग्रहैकत्वन्याय<BR> where the लिङ्ग and वचन are अविवक्षित q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुकर्मन्
पशुः + -कर्मन्, -क्रिया<BR>—1 the act of animal-sacrifice.<BR>—2 copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुक्रिया
पशुः + -कर्मन्, -क्रिया<BR>—1 the act of animal-sacrifice.<BR>—2 copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुगायत्री
पशुः + -गायत्री a Mantra whispered into the ear of an animal which is<BR> about to be sacrificed; it is a parody of the celebrated Gāyatrī q. v.;<BR> पशुपाशाय विद्महे शिरश्छेदाय (विश्वकर्मणे) धीमहि । तन्नो जीवः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">Page0999-2</a>]<BR> प्रचोदयात्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुघातः|पशुघात
पशुः + -घातः slaughter of animals for sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुघ्न
पशुः + -घ्न <i>a.</i> slaughtering cattle; वृथापशुध्नः प्राप्नोति प्रेत्य<BR> जन्मनि जन्मनि Ms. 5. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुचर्या|पशुचर्य्या
पशुः + -चर्या copulation<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुदेवता
पशुः + -देवता the deity to whom an animal is offered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुधर्मः|पशुधर्म|पशुधर्म्म
पशुः + -धर्मः<BR>—1 the nature or characteristics of cattle.<BR>—2 treatment of cattle.<BR>—3 promiscuous cohabitation; अयं (नियोगः) द्विजैर्हि विद्वद्भिः पशुधर्मो<BR> विगर्हितः Ms. 9. 66.<BR>—4 the marrying of widows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुनाथः|पशुनाथ
पशुः + -नाथः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुपः|पशुप
पशुः + -पः a herdsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुपतिः|पशुपति
पशुः + -पतिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva; Me. 38, 58; पशुपतिरपि तान्यहानि कृच्छ्रादगमयदद्रिसुतासमागमोत्कः<BR> Ku. 6. 95. कस्त्वं ? शूली, … … … पशुपतिर्नैव दृश्ये विषाणे Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 a herdsman, owner of cattle.<BR>—3 N. of a philosopher who taught the philosophical doctrine called पाशुपत;<BR> see Sarva. S. <i>ad loc.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुपालः|पशुपाल
पशुः + -पालः, -पालकः a herdsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुपालकः|पशुपालक
पशुः + -पालः, -पालकः a herdsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुपालनम्
पशुः + -पालनम्, -रक्षणम् the tending or rearing of cattle<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुरक्षणम्
पशुः + -पालनम्, -रक्षणम् the tending or rearing of cattle<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुपाशः|पशुपाश
पशुः + -पाशः<BR>—1 the cord with which the sacrificial animal is bound.<BR>—2 an animal sacrifice. —3 the bonds which enchain the individual soul,<BR> the world of sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुपाशकम्
पशुः + -पाशकम् kind of coitus or mode of sexual enjoyment; स्त्रियमानतपूर्वाङ्गीं<BR> स्वपादान्तःपदद्वयम् । ऊर्ध्वांशेन रमेत् कामी बन्धोऽयं पशुपाशकः ॥ Ratimañjarī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुप्रेरणम्
पशुः + -प्रेरणम् the driving of cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुबन्धः|पशुबन्ध
पशुः + -बन्धः an animal-sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुबन्धकः|पशुबन्धक
पशुः + -बन्धकः a rope for tethering cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुमतम्
पशुः + -मतम् an erroneous or false doctrine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुमारम्
पशुः + -मारम् <i>ind.</i> according to the manner of slaughtering animals;<BR> निष्पिष्यैनं बलाद्भूमौ पशुमारममारयत् Mb. 1. 154. 30; Bhāg. 4. 13. 41;<BR> इष्टिपशुमारं मारितः Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुयज्ञः|पशुयज्ञ
पशुः + -यज्ञः, -यागः, -द्रव्यम् an animal-sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुयागः|पशुयाग
पशुः + -यज्ञः, -यागः, -द्रव्यम् an animal-sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुद्रव्यम्
पशुः + -यज्ञः, -यागः, -द्रव्यम् an animal-sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुरज्जुः|पशुरज्जु
पशुः + -रज्जुः <i>f.</i> a cord for tethering cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुराजः|पशुराज
पशुः + -राजः a lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुलोहितपः
पशुः + -लोहितपः a fly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुष
पशुः + -ष <i>a.</i> Ved. giving cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुसमाम्नायः|पशुसमाम्नाय
पशुः + -समाम्नायः a collection of names for animals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुसंभव|पशुसम्भव
पशुः + -संभव^1 <i>a.</i> produced by animals (as flesh, honey, butter,<BR> etc.); Ms. 8. 328.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुहव्यम्
पशुः + -हव्यम् an animal sacrifice; Ms. 4. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशव्य|पशव्यं
पशव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Fit or suitable for cattle; रम्यं पशव्यमाजीवं जाङ्गलं देशमावसेत् Y. 1. 321.<BR>—2 Relating to cattle, or to a herd or drove.<BR>—3 Possessed of cattle.<BR>—4 Brutish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशव्यम्
पशव्य + .{@-व्यम्@}<BR>—1 A herd of cattle.<BR>—2 A stall for cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुका
पशुका Any small animal; पशुकाभिश्च सर्वाभिर्गवां दशशतेन च<BR> Rām. 2. 32. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पशुता
पशुता<BR>—1 Brutality.<BR>—2 The sacrifice of an animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्च
पश्च <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Being behind.<BR>—2 Posterior, later.<BR>—3 Western.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चा
पश्च + .{@-श्चा@} <i>ind.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Behind, after.<BR>—2 Afterwards<BR>—3 Westward.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पश्चानुतापः, पश्चानुपूर्वी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चानुतापः|पश्चानुताप
पश्च + -अनुतापः repentance, regret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चानुपूर्वी
पश्च + -अनुपूर्वी repeated or recurring series.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चात्
पश्चात् <i>ind.</i> (Used by itself or with gen. or abl.)<BR>—1 From behind; from the back; पश्चाद् बद्धपुरुषमादाय Ś. 6; पश्चादुच्चैर्भवति<BR> हरिणः स्वाङ्गमायच्छमानः Ś. 4. 1/2 (v. l.)<BR>—2 Behind, backwards, towards the back (opp. पुरः); गच्छति पुरः<BR> शरीरं धावति पश्चादसंस्तुतं चेतः Ś. 1. 33, 3. 7.<BR>—3 After (in time or space), then, afterwards, subsequently; लघ्वी पुरा<BR> वृद्धिमती च पश्चात् Bh. 2. 60; तस्य पश्चात् ‘after him’; R. 4. 30, 12. 7, 16. 29;<BR> Me. 38, 46.<BR>—4 At last, lastly, finally.<BR>—5 From the west.<BR>—6 Towards the west, westward.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पश्चादहस्, पश्चादुक्तिः, पश्चात्कृत, पश्चाद्घाटः, पश्चात्तापः, पश्चाद्भाग, पश्चाद्भागः, पश्चाद्वातः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चादहस्
पश्चात् + -अहस् <i>ind.</i> in the afternoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चादुक्तिः|पश्चादुक्ति
पश्चात् + -उक्तिः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">Page1000-1</a>]<BR> repetition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=0999-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चात्कृत
पश्चात् + -कृत <i>a.</i> left behind, surpassed, thrown into the back-ground;<BR> पश्चात् कृताः स्निग्धजनाशिषोऽपि Ku. 7. 28; R. 17. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चाद्घाटः|पश्चाद्घाट
पश्चात् + -घाटः the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चात्तापः|पश्चात्ताप
पश्चात् + -तापः<BR>—1 repentance, contrition; ˚पं कृ to repent.<BR>—2 (In dram.) repentance at something rejected or omitted from want of judgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चाद्भाग|पश्चाद्भागः
पश्चात् + -भाग <i>a.</i> whose conjunction with the moon begins in the afternoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चाद्भागः|पश्चाद्भाग
पश्चात् + -भागः<BR>—1 hind-part.<BR>—2 west side.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चाद्वातः|पश्चाद्वात
पश्चात् + -वातः a west-wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चार्ध|पश्चार्द्धः|पश्चार्धः
पश्चार्ध [अपरश्चासौ अर्धः]<BR>—1 Hinder part or side (of the body); पश्चार्धेन प्रविष्टः शरपतनभयाद्<BR> भूयसा पूर्वकायम् Ś. 1. 7.<BR>—2 The latter half.<BR>—3 The western side.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिम|पश्चिमं
पश्चिम^1 <i>a.</i> [पश्चाद्भवः डिमच्]<BR>—1 Being behind, hindmost; पराभूतेरधर्मस्य तमसश्चापि पश्चिमः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 6. 9.<BR>—2 Last (in time or space); पश्चिमे वयसि वर्तमानस्य K. 25; R. 19. 1, 54;<BR> पश्चिमाद्यामिनीयामात् प्रसादमिव चेतना R. 17. 1; स्मरन्तः<BR> पश्चिमामाज्ञाम् 17. 8; पत पश्चिमयोः पितुः पादयोः Mu. 7; ˚क्रिया<BR> the last <i>i. e.</i> funeral rites; ˚अवस्था last state (verging on death); Pt. 2.<BR>—3 The latter; उपारताः पश्चिमरात्रिगोचरात् Ki. 4. 10.<BR>—4 Western, westerly; आसमुद्रात् तु वै पूर्वादासमुद्रात् तु पश्चिमात् ।<BR> तयोरेवान्तरं गिर्योरार्यावर्तं विदुर्बुधाः ॥ Ms. 2. 22, 5. 92. (पश्चिमेन<BR> is used adverbially in the sense of ‘in the west’) or ‘after, behind’;<BR> with acc. or gen.; so पश्चिमे ‘in the west’. पश्चिमतः from behind.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पश्चिमार्धः, पश्चिमेतर, पश्चिमोत्तर, पश्चिमदक्षिण, पश्चिमदिक्पतिः, पश्चिमरात्रः, पश्चिमसंध्या<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमार्धः|पश्चिमार्ध
पश्चिमः + -अर्धः<BR>—1 the latter half.<BR>—2 the hinder part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमेतर
पश्चिमः + -इतर <i>a.</i> eastern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमोत्तर
पश्चिमः + -उत्तर <i>a.</i> north-western.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमदक्षिण
पश्चिमः + -दक्षिण <i>a.</i> south-westerly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमदिक्पतिः|पश्चिमदिक्पति
पश्चिमः + -दिक्पतिः N. of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमरात्रः|पश्चिमरात्र
पश्चिमः + -रात्रः the latter part of the night; उपारताः पश्चिमरात्रगोचरात्<BR> Ki. 4. 10 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमसंध्या
पश्चिमः + -संध्या the evening twi-light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमा
पश्चिमा The west.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पश्चिमोत्तरा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्चिमोत्तरा
पश्चिमा + -उत्तरा the north-west.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्य
पश्य <i>a.</i> What sees or looks on; पश्याः पुरन्ध्रीः प्रति …<BR> चित्राणि चक्रे N. 6. 39; ददर्श पश्यामिव पुरम् N. 16. 122.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्यत्
पश्यत् <i>a.</i> (-न्ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> Seeing, perceiving, beholding, looking at, observing<BR> &c. ˚पादः Akṣapāda, the propounder of the Nyāyaśāstra; Śāhendra. 1. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्यतोहरः|पश्यतोहर
पश्यतोहरः A thief, robber, highwayman (one who steals before a<BR> personʼs eyes, or in the very sight of the possessor; as, for instance,<BR> a goldsmith); cf. P. VI. 3. 21; Vārt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पश्यन्ती
पश्यन्ती<BR>—1 A harlot, courtezan.<BR>—2 A particular sound; cf. वैखरी शब्दनिष्पत्तिर्मध्यमा श्रुतिगोचरा ।<BR> द्योतितार्था च पश्यन्ती सूक्ष्मा वागनपायिनी ॥ Malli. on Ku. 2. 17;<BR> अविभागा तु पश्यन्ती सर्वतः संहृतक्रमा Mañjūṣā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पष्ठौही
पष्ठौही Any young cow; Mb. 13. 93. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पसस्
पसस् <i>n.</i> Ved. Membrum virile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पस्त्यम्
पस्त्यम्<BR>—1 A house, habitation, abode; पस्त्यं प्रयातुमथ तं प्रभुरापपृच्छे<BR> Kīr. K. 9. 74.<BR>—2 Household, family.<BR>—3 Ved. Divine progeny.<BR>—4 A man.<BR>—5 A priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पस्त्या
पस्त्यम् + .{@-स्त्या@} The goddess presiding over domestic affairs; प्र पस्त्यामदितिं<BR> सिन्धुमर्कैः स्वस्तिमीळे सख्याय देवीम् Rv. 4. 55. 3, 8. 27. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पस्त्यावत्|पस्त्यावन्त्
पस्त्यावत् <i>m.</i> Ved. A householder; उत श्रुतं वृषणा पस्त्यावतः<BR> Rv. 1. 151. 2, 2. 11. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पस्पशः|पस्पश
पस्पशः<BR>—1 N. of the first Āhnika of the first chapter of Patañjaliʼs Mahābhāṣya;<BR> शब्दविद्येव नो भाति राजनीतिरपस्पशा Śi. 2. 112 (where अपस्पश<BR> also means ‘without spies’).<BR>—2 (Fig.) An introductory chapter in general (उपोद्घात).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पस्पशाः
पस्पशः + .{@-शाः@} N. of the introduction of the Mahābhāṣya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पह्नवाः
पह्न(ह्ल)वाः, पह्लिकाः <i>m.</i> (pl.) N. of a people; (the Persians ?); Ms. 10. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पह्लवाः
पह्न(ह्ल)वाः, पह्लिकाः <i>m.</i> (pl.) N. of a people; (the Persians ?); Ms. 10. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पह्लिकाः
पह्न(ह्ल)वाः, पह्लिकाः <i>m.</i> (pl.) N. of a people; (the Persians ?); Ms. 10. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पा
पा I. €1 P. (पिबति, पीत; pass. पीयते)<BR>—1 To drink, quaff; पिब स्तन्यं पोत Bv. 1. 60; दुःशासनस्य रुधिरं<BR> न पिबाम्युरस्तः Ve. 1. 15; R. 3. 54; Ku. 3. 36; Māl. 8. 5; Bk. 14. 92, 15. 6.<BR>—2 To kiss; पिबत्यसौ पाययते च सिन्धूः R. 13. 9; Ś. 1. 23.<BR>—3 To drink in, inhale; पिबन् यशो मूर्तमिवावभासे R. 7. 63.<BR>—4 To drink in (with the eyes or ears); feast on, look at or listen to<BR> intently; समदुःखः पीयते नयनाभ्याम् V. 1; निवातपद्मस्तिमितेन<BR> चक्षुषा नृपस्य कान्तं पिबतः सुताननम् R. 3. 17, 2. 19, 73, 11. 36, 13. 30;<BR> Me. 16; Ku. 7.<BR>—5 To absorb, drink or swallow up; (बाणैः) आयुर्देहातिगैः पीतं रुधिरं<BR> तु पतत्रिभिः R. 12. 48.<BR>—6 To drink intoxicating liquors. ━<i>Caus.</i> (पाययति-ते) —1 To<BR> cause to drink, give to drink; अनन्यसामान्यकलत्रवृत्तिः पिबत्यसौ<BR> पाययते च सिन्धूः R. 13. 9;<BR> Bk. 8. 41, 62. —2 To water. ━<i>Desid.</i> (पिपासति) To wish<BR> to drink &c.; हालाहलं खलु पिपासति कौतुकेन Bv. 1. 95.<BR>━II. €2 P. (पाति, पात) —1 To protect, guard, keep, defend, preserve; (oft.<BR> with abl.); पर्याप्तोऽसि प्रजाः पातुम् R. 10. 25; पान्तु त्वां … भूतेशस्य<BR> भुजङ्गवल्लिवलयस्रङ्नद्धजूटा जटाः Māl. 1. 2; जीवन् पुनः शश्वदुपप्लवेभ्यः<BR> प्रजाः प्रजानाथ पितेव पासि R. 2. 48.<BR>—2 To rule, govern; पान्तु पृथ्वीं … भूपाः Mk. 10. 61.<BR>—3 To beware of.<BR>—4 Ved. To observe, notice.<BR>—5 To keep, observe, tend, take notice of. ━<i>Caus.</i> (पालयतिते)<BR>—1 To protect, guard, keep, preserve; कथं दुष्ठुः स्वयं धर्मे प्रजास्त्वं<BR> पालयिष्यसि Bk. 6. 132; Ms. 9. 108; R. 9. 2.<BR>—2 To rule, govern; तां पुरीं पालयामास Rām.<BR>—3 To observe, keep, adhere to, fulfil (as a vow or promise); पालितसङ्गराय R. 13. 65.<BR>—4 To bring up, nourish, maintain.<BR>—5 To wait for; अत्रोपविश्य मुहूर्तमार्यः पालयतु कृष्णागमनम् Ve. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पा
पा <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.)<BR>—1 Drinking, quaffing; as in सोमपाः, अग्रेपाः &c.<BR>—2 Protecting, guarding, keeping; गोपा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पातव्य
पातव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Drinkable.<BR>—2 To be guarded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांशवः|पांशव
पांशवः <i>m.</i> Fossil salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांसुः|पांसु
पांसुः (-शुः)<BR>—1 Dust, dirt; crumbling soil; तस्याः खुरन्यासपवित्रपांसुम् (मार्गम्)<BR> R. 2. 2; विदह्यमानः पथि तप्तपांसुभिः Ṛs. 1. 13; Y. 1. 150.<BR>—2 A particle of dust.<BR>—3 Dung, manure.<BR>—4 A kind of camphor.<BR>—5 Landed property.<BR>—6 Powder, fragments; ससर्ज रसपांसवः Mb. 3. 284. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पांसुकासीसम्, पांसुकुली, पांसुकूलम्, पांसुकृत, पांसुक्रीडनम्, पांसुक्रीडा, पांसुविकर्षणम्, पांसुक्षारम्, पांसुजम्, पांसुगुण्ठित, पांसुचत्वरम्, पांसुचन्दनः, पांसुचामरः, पांसुजालिकः, पांसुनिपातः, पांसुपटलम्, पांसुपिशाचः, पांसुमर्दनः, पांसुलवणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांॡउः
पांसुः (-शुः)<BR>—1 Dust, dirt; crumbling soil; तस्याः खुरन्यासपवित्रपांसुम् (मार्गम्)<BR> R. 2. 2; विदह्यमानः पथि तप्तपांसुभिः Ṛs. 1. 13; Y. 1. 150.<BR>—2 A particle of dust.<BR>—3 Dung, manure.<BR>—4 A kind of camphor.<BR>—5 Landed property.<BR>—6 Powder, fragments; ससर्ज रसपांसवः Mb. 3. 284. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पांसुकासीसम्, पांसुकुली, पांसुकूलम्, पांसुकृत, पांसुक्रीडनम्, पांसुक्रीडा, पांसुविकर्षणम्, पांसुक्षारम्, पांसुजम्, पांसुगुण्ठित, पांसुचत्वरम्, पांसुचन्दनः, पांसुचामरः, पांसुजालिकः, पांसुनिपातः, पांसुपटलम्, पांसुपिशाचः, पांसुमर्दनः, पांसुलवणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांसुकासीसम्
पांसुः + -कासीसम् sulphate of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांसुकुली
पांसुः + -कुली a highroad,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1001-1" target="_blank">Page1001-1</a>]<BR> highway.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1000-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांसुकूलम्
पांसुः + -कूलम्<BR>—1 a dust-heap.<BR>—2 a legal document not made out in any particular personʼs name (निरुपपदशासनम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1001-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांसुकृत
पांसुः + -कृत <i>a.</i> covered with dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1001-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांसुक्रीडनम्
पांसुः + -क्रीडनम्, -क्रीडा, -विकर्षणम्<BR>—1 Playing in the sand.<BR>—2 Wresting; Mb. 5. 169. 12. (Com. पांसुविकर्षणे पांसुषु विकर्षणे<BR> भूमौ मुष्टियुद्धे इत्यर्थः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1001-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांसुक्रीडा
पांसुः + -क्रीडनम्, -क्रीडा, -विकर्षणम्<BR>—1 Playing in the sand.<BR>—2 Wresting; Mb. 5. 169. 12. (Com. पांसुविकर्षणे पांसुषु विकर्षणे<BR> भूमौ मुष्टियुद्धे इत्यर्थः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1001-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पांसुविकर्षणम्
पांसुः + -क्रीडनम्, -क्रीडा, -विकर्षणम्<BR>—1 Playing in the sand.<BR>—2 Wresting; Mb. 5. 169. 12. (Com. पांसुविकर्षणे पांसुषु विकर्षणे<BR> भूमौ मुष्टियुद्धे इत्यर्थः.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1001-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

