पानगोष्ठिका
पानम् + -गोष्ठिका, -गोष्ठी<BR>—1 a drinking party.<BR>—2 a dramshop, tavern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1008-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पानगोष्ठी
पानम् + -गोष्ठिका, -गोष्ठी<BR>—1 a drinking party.<BR>—2 a dramshop, tavern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1008-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

