पानम् + -पात्रम्, -भाजनम्, -भाण्डम् a drinking vessel, a goblet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1008-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

