पानम् + -विभ्रमः intoxication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1008-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पानशौण्डः|पानशौण्ड|पानशौंड
