पापारम्भ
पाप + -आरम्भ <i>a.</i> wicked, villainous, committing murderous deeds;<BR> पापारम्भवतोर्मृगीव वृकयोर्भीरुर्गता गोचरम् Māl. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापाशय
पाप + -आशय, -चेतस् <i>a.</i> evil-intentioned, wicked-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापचेतस्
पाप + -आशय, -चेतस् <i>a.</i> evil-intentioned, wicked-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापोक्त
पाप + -उक्त addressed in ill-omened words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

