पाप + -कर, -कारिन्, -कृत्, -कर्मन्, -कर्मिन् &c. <i>a.</i><BR> sinful, a sinner, villain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापकर्मिन्
पाप + -कर, -कारिन्, -कृत्, -कर्मन्, -कर्मिन् &c. <i>a.</i><BR> sinful, a sinner, villain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापक्षयः|पापक्षय
पाप + -क्षयः removal or destruction of sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापगतिः|पापगति
पाप + -गतिः ill-fated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापग्रहः|पापग्रह
पाप + -ग्रहः a planet of evil or malignant aspect, such as Mars, Saturn, Rāhu or Ketu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापघ्न|पापघ्नः
पाप + -घ्न <i>a.</i> destroying sin, expiating; मत्समः पातकी नास्ति<BR> पापध्नी त्वत्समा न हि Śaṅkara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापघ्नः|पापघ्न
पाप + -घ्न + .({@-घ्नः@}) the sesamum plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापघ्नी
पाप + -घ्न + .({@-घ्नी@}) the Tulasī plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापचर्यः|पापचर्य|पापचर्य्य
पाप + -चर्यः<BR>—1 a sinner.<BR>—2 demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

