पाप + -पतिः a paramour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापपुरुषः|पापपुरुष
पाप + -पुरुषः a villainous person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापफल
पाप + -फल <i>a.</i> evil, inauspicious; पापफलनरकादिमांस्तु शुभकर्मफलस्वर्गमस्त्विति<BR> काङ्क्षते Maṇḍala Brā. Up. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

