पापभाज्
पाप + -भाज् <i>a.</i> sinful, a sinner; न केवलं यो महतोऽपभाषते<BR> शृणोति तस्मादपि यः स पापभाक् Ku. 5. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापमित्रम्
पाप + -मित्रम् a bad counsellor or friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापमुक्त|पापमुक्तः
पाप + -मुक्त <i>a.</i> freed from sin, purified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

