पाप + -मोचनम्, -विनाशनम् destruction of sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापयोनि|पापयोनिः
पाप + -योनि <i>a.</i> low-born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापयोनिः|पापयोनि
पाप + -योनि + .({@-निः@} <i>f.</i>) vile<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">Page1009-2</a>]<BR> birth, birth in an inferior condition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापरोगः|पापरोग
पाप + -रोगः<BR>—1 any bad disease.<BR>—2 small-pox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापलोक्य
पाप + -लोक्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 infernal.<BR>—2 belonging to the wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापवशीयस्
पाप + -वशीयस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 inverted<BR>—2 confused. ━(<i>m.</i>) inversion, confusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पापवंश
पाप + -वंश <i>a.</i> born in a degraded family; शशाप तान् न राज्यार्हाः<BR> पापवंशा भविष्यथ Bm. 1. 349.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

