पामन् + -घ्नः sulphur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पामन|पामनः
पामन <i>a.</i> Diseased with scab.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पामर|पामरः
पामर <i>a.</i> (-रा, -री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [पामन्-र]<BR>—1 Diseased with scab, scabby.<BR>—2 Vile, wicked.<BR>—3 Low, vulgar, base.<BR>—4 Foolish, stupid. —5 Poor, helpless; Ud. D. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पामरः|पामर
