पायनम्
पायनम् Giving or causing to drink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पायना
पायनम् + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 Causing to drink.<BR>—2 Watering, moistening.<BR>—3 Sharpening, whetting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पायिन्
पायिन् <i>a.</i> Drinking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1009-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पायुः|पायु
