पाय्यम्
पाय्य + .{@-य्यम्@}<BR>—1 Water.<BR>—2 Drinking.<BR>—3 Protection.<BR>—4 A measure (परिमाण); पाय्यसान्नाय्यनिकाय्यधाय्याः मानहविर्निवाससामिधेनेषु<BR> P. III. 1. 29 quoted by ŚB. on MS. 5. 3. 5.<BR>—5 Practice, profession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1010-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पायस|पायसः
पायस^1 <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [पयसो विकारः अण्] Made of water or milk.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124. note: Should be no virAma..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1010-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पायसः|पायस
पायस + .{@-सः, -सम्@}<BR>—1 Rice boiled in milk with sugar; Ms. 3. 271, 5. 7; Y. 1. 173; अतप्ततण्डुलो<BR> धौतः परिमृष्टो घृतेन च । खण्डयुक्तेन दुग्धेन पाचितः पायसो भवेत् ।<BR> Pākarājeśvara.<BR>—2 Turpentine.<BR>—3 An oblation of milk, rice, and sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1010-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पायसम्
पायस + .{@-सः, -सम्@}<BR>—1 Rice boiled in milk with sugar; Ms. 3. 271, 5. 7; Y. 1. 173; अतप्ततण्डुलो<BR> धौतः परिमृष्टो घृतेन च । खण्डयुक्तेन दुग्धेन पाचितः पायसो भवेत् ।<BR> Pākarājeśvara.<BR>—2 Turpentine.<BR>—3 An oblation of milk, rice, and sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1010-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पायसम्
