पायसिक
पायसिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Fond of boiled milk; P. IV. 2. 47; Vārt. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1010-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पायिकः|पायिक
पायिकः A foot-soldier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1010-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पायितम्
पायितम् The gift of water (उदकदान); Bṛ. Up. 4. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1010-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पायुः|पायु
