पाषण्डिन्|पाषंडिन्
पाषण्डकः, पाषण्डिन् <i>m.</i>, पाखण्डिकः A heretic,<BR> a religious hypocrite; Y. 1. 130, 2. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाखण्डिकः
पाषण्डकः, पाषण्डिन् <i>m.</i>, पाखण्डिकः A heretic,<BR> a religious hypocrite; Y. 1. 130, 2. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाषाणः|पाषाण
पाषाणः [पिनष्टि पिष् संचूर्णने आनच् पृषो˚ Tv.] A stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पाषाणी
पाषाणः + .{@-णी@}<BR>—1 A small stone used as a weight.<BR>—2 A spear.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पाषाणगर्दभः, पाषाणचतुर्दशी, पाषाणदारकः, पाषाणदारणः, पाषाणशीला, पाषाणसन्धिः, पाषाणहृदय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1017-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

