पिञ्जली
पिञ्जल + .{@-ली@} Two blades of Kuśa grass used in holding certain articles<BR> at a sacrifice; एतदेव पिञ्जल्या लक्ष्णं समुदाहृतम् Karmapradīpa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1019-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

