पिट्टित
पिट्टित <i>a.</i> Pressed flat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिठ्
