पिठरः, -रम्<BR>—1 A pot, pan, boiler (also पिठरी in this sense); पिठरं क्वथदतिमात्रं<BR> निजपार्श्वानेव दहतितराम् Pt. 1. 324; जठरपिठरी दुष्पूरेयं करोति<BR> विडम्बनाम् Bh. 3. 116.<BR>—2 A book, a manuscript; L. D. B.<BR>—3 Smearing, plastering; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1019-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

