पिण्डान्वाहार्य|पिंडान्वाहार्य
पिण्ड + -अन्वाहार्य <i>a.</i> to be eaten after the funeral rice-ball has<BR> been offered to the manes; पिण्डान्वाहार्यकं श्राद्धं कुर्यान्मासानुमासिकम् Ms. 3. 122.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

