पिण्ड + -अशनः, -आशः, -आशकः, -आशिन् <i>m.</i> a beggar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

