पिण्डतैलम्
पिण्ड + -तैलम्, -तैलकः incense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डतैलकः|पिण्डतैलक|पिंडतैलक
पिण्ड + -तैलम्, -तैलकः incense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डद|पिंडद|पिण्डदः
पिण्ड + -द <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one who gives food, one who supplies with bread or with any other means<BR> of subsistence; श्वा पिण्डदस्य कुरुते गजपुङ्गवस्तु धीरं विलोकयति<BR> चाटुशतैश्च भुङ्क्ते Bh. 2. 31.<BR>—2 one who is qualified to give the funeral rice-balls to deceased ancestors; Y. 2. 132.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डदः|पिण्डद|पिंडद
पिण्ड + -द + .({@-दः@})<BR>—1 the nearest male relation who offers the funeral rice-ball.<BR>—2 a master, patron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डदा
पिण्ड + -दा a mother<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डदानम्
पिण्ड + -दानम्<BR>—1 presentation of the obsequial rice-balls.<BR>—2 the funeral oblation made to deceased ancestors on the day of new-moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डनिर्वपणम्
पिण्ड + -निर्वपणम् presenting obsequial rice-balls to the manes; अनयैवावृता<BR> कार्यं पिण्डनिर्वपणं सुतैः Ms. 3. 248, 261.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डनिवृत्तिः|पिण्डनिवृत्ति
पिण्ड + -निवृत्तिः cessation of relationship (by श्राद्ध oblation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डपदम्
पिण्ड + -पदम् a particular अङ्कभेद in Astronomy; Śabda C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डपातः|पिण्डपात|पिंडपात
