पिण्ड + -पादः, -पाद्यः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डपाद्यः|पिण्डपाद्य|पिंडपाद्य
पिण्ड + -पादः, -पाद्यः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

