पिण्ड + -पितृयज्ञः the oblation to deceased ancestors on the evening of new moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डपुष्पः|पिण्डपुष्प|पिंडपुष्प|पिण्डपुष्पं
पिण्ड + -पुष्पः<BR>—1 the Aśoka tree.<BR>—2 the China rose.<BR>—3 the pomegranate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डपुष्पम्
पिण्ड + -पुष्पः + .({@-पुष्पम्@})<BR>—1 the blossom of the Aśoka tree.<BR>—2 the flower of China-rose.<BR>—3 a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डभाज्|पिंडभाज्
पिण्ड + -भाज् <i>a.</i> receiving or entitled to a share in the funeral rice-ball.<BR>━<i>m.</i> (pl.) the deceased ancestors or manes; अहो दुष्यन्तस्य संशयमारूढाः<BR> पिण्डभाजः Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डभृतिः|पिण्डभृति|पिंडभृति
