पिण्डमूलम्
पिण्ड + -मूलम्, -मूलकम् a carrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डमूलकम्
पिण्ड + -मूलम्, -मूलकम् a carrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डयज्ञः|पिण्डयज्ञ|पिंडयज्ञ
पिण्ड + -यज्ञः the presentation of the obsequial rice-balls to the deceased<BR> ancestors; पिण्डयज्ञावृता देयं प्रेतायान्नं दिनत्रयम् Y. 3. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डलेपः|पिण्डलेप|पिंडलेप
पिण्ड + -लेपः fragments of the obsequial rice-balls which cling to the<BR> hand; (these are presented to the three ancestors immediately preceding<BR> the great-grand father).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डलोपः|पिण्डलोप|पिंडलोप
पिण्ड + -लोपः<BR>—1 interruption in offering the funeral rice-balls (as the failure of issue).<BR>—2 neglect in offering the funeral rice-balls (to the deceased ancestors).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">Page1020-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डविषमः
पिण्ड + -विषमः one of the ways of embezzlement namely inconsistency<BR> in dealing with fixed items; Kau. A. 2. 8. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डशर्करा
पिण्ड + -शर्करा sugar prepared from Yavanāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डसंबन्धः|पिण्डसम्बन्ध|पिंडसंबंध|पिण्डसंबन्ध
पिण्ड + -संबन्धः relationship between a living person and one deceased<BR> such as is sufficiently near to qualify the former to offer the obsequial<BR> rice-ball to the latter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डस्वेदः|पिण्डस्वेद
पिण्ड + -स्वेदः a hot poultice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डकः|पिण्डक|पिंडक|पिंडकं|पिण्डकं|पिंडकः
पिण्डकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A lump, ball, globe.<BR>—2 A round swelling or protuberance.<BR>—3 A lump of food.<BR>—4 The calf of the leg.<BR>—5 Incense.<BR>—6 Carrot.<BR>—7 (In astr.) A sine expressed in numbers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डकम्
पिण्डकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A lump, ball, globe.<BR>—2 A round swelling or protuberance.<BR>—3 A lump of food.<BR>—4 The calf of the leg.<BR>—5 Incense.<BR>—6 Carrot.<BR>—7 (In astr.) A sine expressed in numbers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डकः|पिण्डक|पिंडक|पिंडकं|पिण्डकं|पिंडकः
