पिण्डनः|पिण्डन|पिंडन|पिंडनं
पिण्डनम् + .{@-नः@} A mound or bank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डलः|पिण्डल|पिंडल|पिंडलः
पिण्डलः<BR>—1 A bridge, causeway.<BR>—2 A mound, ridge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डसः|पिण्डस|पिंडस|पिंडसः
पिण्डसः A beggar, a mendicant living on alms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डातः|पिण्डात|पिंडात|पिंडातः
पिण्डातः Incense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डारः|पिण्डार|पिंडार|पिण्डारं|पिंडारः
पिण्डारः<BR>—1 A religious mendicant or beggar.<BR>—2 A cowherd.<BR>—3 A buffalo-herdsman.<BR>—4 The <i>Vikaṅkata</i> tree.<BR>—5 An expression of censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डिः|पिण्डि|पिंडि|पिंडिः
पिण्डिः, -ण्डी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A round mass, ball.<BR>—2 The nave of a wheel.<BR>—3 The calf of the leg.<BR>—4 The Aśoka tree.<BR>—5 The long gourd (अलाबु).<BR>—6 A house.<BR>—7 A species of palm.<BR>—8 A stool or seat.<BR>—9 A pedestal for the image of a deity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पिण्डिपुष्पः, पिण्डिलेपः, पिण्डिशूरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डी
पिण्डिः, -ण्डी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A round mass, ball.<BR>—2 The nave of a wheel.<BR>—3 The calf of the leg.<BR>—4 The Aśoka tree.<BR>—5 The long gourd (अलाबु).<BR>—6 A house.<BR>—7 A species of palm.<BR>—8 A stool or seat.<BR>—9 A pedestal for the image of a deity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पिण्डिपुष्पः, पिण्डिलेपः, पिण्डिशूरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डिपुष्पः
पिण्डिः + -पुष्पः the Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डिलेपः
पिण्डिः + -लेपः a kind of unguent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डिशूरः
पिण्डिः + -शूरः ‘brave in the house’, or ‘a cake-hero’, a braggart, cowardly<BR> boaster, poltroon, coqtuean; राक्षसान् वटुयज्ञेषु पिण्डीशूरान् निरस्तवान्<BR> Bk. 5. 85; cf. गेहेनर्दिन्, गेहेशूर &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डिका|पिंडिका
पिण्डिका<BR>—1 A round or fleshy swelling.<BR>—2 The calf of the leg &c.; विकटोद्बद्धपिण्डिकम् Mb. 1. 155. 33.<BR>—3 The region of the cheeks (गण्डस्थल); भिन्नमस्तकपिण्डिकाः Mb. 7. 116. 25;<BR> see पिण्डि above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डित|पिंडित|पिण्डितं|पिण्डितः
पिण्डित <i>a.</i> [पिण्ड्-क्त]<BR>—1 Pressed or rolled into a ball or lump.<BR>—2 Thick, lumpish.<BR>—3 Heaped together, collected; एष पिण्डितार्थः M. 1 ‘this is the meaning on the whole’.<BR>—4 Mixed with; न समा मम वीर्यस्य शतांशेनापि पिण्डिताः Mb. 10. 12. 17.<BR>—5 Added, multiplied.<BR>—6 Counted, numbered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डितः|पिण्डित|पिंडित|पिण्डितं
पिण्डित + .{@-तः@} Incense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डिन्|पिंडिन्
पिण्डिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Receiving the funeral rice-balls (as ancestors).<BR>—2 Having a body. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A beggar.<BR>—2 One who offers funeral rice-balls to the manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डिल|पिंडिल|पिण्डिलः
पिण्डिल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having large calves.<BR>—2 Skilled in calculations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डिलः|पिण्डिल|पिंडिल
पिण्डिल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A bridge, causeway, mound.<BR>—2 An astronomer, a calculator of nativities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डीकृ|पिंडीकृ
पिण्डीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To make into a lump, press together, unite.<BR>—2 To concentrate.<BR>—3 To identify with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1020-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डीभू|पिंडीभू
पिण्डीभू €1 P. To be made into a ball or lump, become solid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डीर|पिंडीर|पिण्डीरः
पिण्डीर <i>a.</i> Sapless, insipid, arid, dry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डीरः|पिण्डीर|पिंडीर
पिण्डीर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 The pomegranate tree.<BR>—2 Cuttle-fish-bone.<BR>—3 Foam of the sea; cf. डिण्डीर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्डोलिः|पिण्डोलि|पिंडोलि|पिंडोलिः
पिण्डोलिः <i>f.</i> Fragments dropped from the mouth, offal, leavings of a meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्याकः|पिण्याक|पिण्याकं
पिण्याकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Oil-cake; कणान् वा भक्षयेदब्दं पिण्याकं वा सकृन्निशि Ms. 11. 92;<BR> Bhāg. 5. 9. 11.<BR>—2 Incense.<BR>—3 Saffron.<BR>—4 Asafoetida.<BR>—5 Residue of seeds ground for oil; श्रेयस्तैलं च पिण्याकात् Pt. 3. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिण्याकम्
पिण्याकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Oil-cake; कणान् वा भक्षयेदब्दं पिण्याकं वा सकृन्निशि Ms. 11. 92;<BR> Bhāg. 5. 9. 11.<BR>—2 Incense.<BR>—3 Saffron.<BR>—4 Asafoetida.<BR>—5 Residue of seeds ground for oil; श्रेयस्तैलं च पिण्याकात् Pt. 3. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितामहः|पितामह
पितामहः (-ही <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 A paternal grand-father.<BR>—2 An epithet of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितामहाः
पितामहः + .{@-हाः@} (pl.) The Manes; सन्तापयति चैतस्य पूर्वप्रेतान् पितामहान् Mb. 14. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितु|पितुः
पितु (Ved.) Food, sacrificial fee; अन्नं वै पितु दक्षिणा वै पितु<BR> Ait. Br. 1. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितुषणिः|पितुषणि
पितुषणिः Bestower of food (an epithet of Soma).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृ
पितृ <i>m.</i> [पाति रक्षति, पा-तृच् नि˚] A father; तेनास लोकः<BR> पितृमान् विनेत्रा R. 14. 23, 1. 24, 11. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्रौ
पितृ + .{@-रौ@} (dual) Parents, father and mother; जगतः पितरौ वन्दे<BR> पार्वतीपरमेश्वरौ R. 1. 1; Y. 2. 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्रः
पितृ + .{@-रः@} (pl.)<BR>—1 Fore-fathers, ancestors, fathers; नूनं प्रसूतिविकलेन मया प्रसिक्तं<BR> धौताश्रुशेषमुदकं पितरः पिबन्ति Ś. 6. 24.<BR>—2 Paternal ancestors taken collectively; अध्यापयामास पितॄन् शिशुराङ्गिरसः<BR> कविः Ms. 2. 151.<BR>—3 The Manes; R. 2. 16, 3. 20; पितॄणामर्यमा चास्मि Bg. 10. 29; Ms. 3. 81, 192.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पित्रर्जित, पितृकर्मन्, पितृकल्पः, पितृकाननम्, पितृकुल्या, पितृक्षयः, पितृगणः, पितृगणा, पितृगामिन्, पितृगृहम्, पितृघातकः, पितृघातिन्, पितृघ्नः, पितृतर्पणम्, पितृतिथिः, पितृतीर्थम्, पितृत्रयम्, पितृदत्त, पितृदानम्, पितृदायः, पितृदिनम्, पितृदेव, पितृदेवत, पितृदैवत, पितृदेवत्य, पितृदैवत्य, पितृद्रव्यम्, पितृपक्षः, पितृपतिः, पितृपदम्, पितृपितृ, पितृपुत्रौ, पितृपूजनम्, पितृपैतामह, पितृप्रसूः, पितृप्राप्त, पितृबन्धुः, पितृभम्, पितृभक्त, पितृभोजनम्, पितृभ्रातृ, पितृमन्दिरम्, पितृमेधः, पितृयज्ञः, पितृयानम्, पितृराज्, पितृरूपः, पितृलोकः, पितृवंशः, पितृवनम्, पितृवसतिः, पितृवासरपर्वन्, पितृव्रतः, पितृश्राद्धम्, पितृस्वसृ, पितृष्वस्रीयः, पितृसंनिभ,^1 पितृसूः, पितृस्थानः, पितृस्थानीयः, पितृस्थानम्, पितृहत्या, पितृहन्, पितृहू<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्रर्जित
पितृ + -अर्जित <i>a.</i> acquired by a father, paternal (as property).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृकर्मन्|पितृकर्म्मन्
पितृ + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i>, {@-कार्यम्, -कृत्यम्, -क्रिया@}<BR> oblations or sacrifice offered to deceased<BR> ancestors, obsequial rites; स्वधाकारः परा ह्याशीः सर्वेषु पितृकर्मसु Ms. 3. 252.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृकल्पः|पितृकल्प
पितृ + -कल्पः<BR>—1 performance of the Śrāddha ceremony in honour of the Manes.<BR>—2 Brahmaʼs day of new moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृकाननम्
पितृ + -काननम् a cemetery; अभ्यभावि भरताग्रजस्तया वात्ययेव पितृकाननोत्थया R. 11. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृकुल्या
पितृ + -कुल्या N. of a river rising in the Malaya mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृक्षयः
पितृ + -क्षयः the death anniversary; आनन्त्याय भवेद् दत्तं खड्गमांसं<BR> पितृक्षये Mb. 13. 88. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृगणः|पितृगण
पितृ + -गणः<BR>—1 the whole body of ancestors taken collectively.<BR>—2 a class of Manes or deceased progenitors who were sons of the Prajāpati;<BR> मनोर्हैरण्यगर्भस्य ये मरीच्यादयः सुताः । तेषामृषीणां सर्वेषां पुत्राः<BR> पितृगणाः स्मृताः ॥ विराट्सुताः सोमसदः साध्यानां पितरः स्मृताः । अग्निष्वात्ताश्च<BR> देवानां मारीचा लोकविश्रुताः ॥ Ms. 3. 194-195.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृगणा
पितृ + -गणा N. of of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृगामिन्
पितृ + -गामिन् <i>a.</i> devolving on, or belonging to a father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृगृहम्
पितृ + -गृहम्<BR>—1 a paternal mansion.<BR>—2 a cemetery, burial-ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृघातकः|पितृघातक
पितृ + -घातकः, -घातिन्, -घ्नः <i>m.</i> a parricide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृघातिन्
पितृ + -घातकः, -घातिन्, -घ्नः <i>m.</i> a parricide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृघ्नः|पितृघ्न
पितृ + -घातकः, -घातिन्, -घ्नः <i>m.</i> a parricide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृतर्पणम्
पितृ + -तर्पणम्<BR>—1 an oblation to the Manes.<BR>—2 the act of throwing water out of the right hand (as at the time of<BR> ablutions) as an offering to the Manes or deceased ancestors; नित्यं<BR> स्नात्वा शुचिः कुर्याद् देवर्षिपितृतर्पणम् Ms. 2. 176.<BR>—3 sesamum.<BR>—4 gifts given at Srāddhas or funeral rites.<BR>—5 the part of the hand between the thumb and the fore-finger (sacred<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">Page1021-2</a>]<BR> to the Manes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृतिथिः|पितृतिथि
पितृ + -तिथिः <i>f.</i> the day of new-moon (अमावास्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृतीर्थम्
पितृ + -तीर्थम्<BR>—1 N. of the place called Gayā where the performance of funeral rites,<BR> such as Srāddhas in honour of the Manes, is held to be particularly meritorious.<BR>—2 the part of the hand between the fore-finger and the thumb (considered<BR> to be sacred to the Manes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृत्रयम्
पितृ + -त्रयम् father, grand-father and great grand-father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदत्त
पितृ + -दत्त <i>a.</i> given by a father (as a womanʼs peculiar property).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदानम्
पितृ + -दानम् an offering to the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदायः|पितृदाय
पितृ + -दायः patrimony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदिनम्
पितृ + -दिनम् the day of new-moon (अमावास्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदेव
पितृ + -देव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 worshipping a father.<BR>—2 relating to the worship of the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदेवाः
पितृ + -देव + .({@-वाः@}) the divine Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदेवत
पितृ + -देवत, -दैवत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 presided over by the Manes.<BR>—2 relating to the worship of the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदेवतम्
पितृ + -देवत, -दैवत + .({@-तम्@}) N. of the tenth lunar mansion (मघा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदैवत
पितृ + -देवत, -दैवत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 presided over by the Manes.<BR>—2 relating to the worship of the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदेवत्य
पितृ + -देवत्य, -दैवत्य <i>a.</i> belonging to the worship of the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदेवत्यम्
पितृ + -देवत्य, -दैवत्य + .({@-त्यम्@}) a sacrifice offered to the Manes on the day called अष्टका;<BR> अष्टकापितृदेवत्यमित्ययं प्रसृतो जनः Rām. 2. 108. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृदैवत्य
पितृ + -देवत्य, -दैवत्य <i>a.</i> belonging to the worship of the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृद्रव्यम्
पितृ + -द्रव्यम् patrimony; पितृद्रव्याविरोधेन यदन्यत् स्वयमर्जितम् Y. 2. 118.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृपक्षः|पितृपक्ष
पितृ + -पक्षः<BR>—1 the paternal side, paternal relationship.<BR>—2 a relative by the fatherʼs side.<BR>—3 ‘the fortnight of the Manes’; N. of the dark half of Bhādrapada which<BR> is particularly appointed for the celebration of obsequial rites to the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृपतिः|पितृपति
पितृ + -पतिः an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृपदम्
पितृ + -पदम् the world of the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृपितृ
पितृ + -पितृ <i>m.</i> a paternal grandfather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृपुत्रौ
पितृ + -पुत्रौ (पिता-पुत्रौ dual) father and son. (पितुः पुत्रः<BR> means ‘the son of a well-known and renowned father’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृपूजनम्
पितृ + -पूजनम् worship of the Manes; पतिव्रता धर्मपत्नी पितृपूजनतत्परा Ms. 3. 262.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृपैतामह
पितृ + -पैतामह <i>a.</i> (-ही <i>f.</i>)<BR> inherited from ancestors, ancestral, hereditary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृपैतामहाः
पितृ + -पैतामह + .({@-हाः@} pl.) ancestors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृप्रसूः
पितृ + -प्रसूः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a paternal grand-mother.<BR>—2 evening twilight; तारावलीराजतबिन्दुराजत् पितृप्रसूभासुरपत्रपाश्यः,<BR> वियद्द्विपस्तिष्ठति Rām. Ch. 6. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृप्राप्त
पितृ + -प्राप्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 inherited from a father.<BR>—2 inherited patrimonially.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृबन्धुः|पितृबन्धु|पितृबंधु
पितृ + -बन्धुः a kinsman by the fatherʼs side; they are:− पितुः पितुःस्वसुः<BR> पुत्राः पितुर्मातुःस्वसुः सुताः । पितुर्मातुलपुत्राश्च विज्ञेयाः पितृबन्धवः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृबन्धुम्
पितृ + -बन्धुः + .({@-न्धुम्@} <i>n.</i>) relationship by the fatherʼs side.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृभम्
पितृ + -भम् The Maghā star; Śabda C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृभक्त
पितृ + -भक्त <i>a.</i> dutifully attached to a father. {@भक्तिः@} <i>f.</i> filial duty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृभोजनम्
पितृ + -भोजनम् food offered to the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृभ्रातृ
पितृ + -भ्रातृ <i>m.</i> a fatherʼs brother, paternal uncle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृमन्दिरम्
पितृ + -मन्दिरम्<BR>—1 a paternal mansion.<BR>—2 a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृमेधः|पितृमेध
पितृ + -मेधः a sacrifice offered to the Manes, obsequial offerings;<BR> गुरोः प्रेतस्य शिष्यस्तु पितृमेधं समाचरन् Ms. 5. 65; Mb. 16. 7. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृयज्ञः|पितृयज्ञ
पितृ + -यज्ञः<BR>—1 obsequial offerings.<BR>—2 offering libations of water every day to the deceased ancestors, it<BR> is one of the five daily Yajñas enjoined to be performed by a Brāhmaṇa;<BR> पितृयज्ञस्तु तर्पणम् Ms. 3. 10; also 122, 283.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृयानम्
पितृ + -यानम् the way of the Manes (to their world).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृराज्
पितृ + -राज् <i>m.</i>, {@-राजः, -राजन्@} <i>m.</i><BR> an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृरूपः|पितृरूप
पितृ + -रूपः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृलोकः|पितृलोक
पितृ + -लोकः the world of the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृवंशः|पितृवंश
पितृ + -वंशः the paternal family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृवनम्
पितृ + -वनम्<BR>—1 a cemetery; वसन् पितृवने रौद्रे शौचे वर्तितुमिच्छसि Mb. 12. 111. 9.<BR>—2 death, the abode of death; सर्वे पितृवनं प्राप्य स्वपन्ति विगतज्वराः<BR> Mb. 11. 3. 5. (पितृवनेचरः<BR>—1 a demon, goblin.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">Page1022-1</a>]<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1021-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृवसतिः|पितृवसति
पितृ + -वसतिः <i>f.</i>, {@-सद्मन्@} <i>n.</i><BR> a cemetery; त्रिलोकनाथः पितृसद्मगोचरः Ku. 5. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृवासरपर्वन्
पितृ + -वासरपर्वन् the period of performing the obsequious rites for<BR> the Manes; Gaṇeśa P. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृव्रतः|पितृव्रत
पितृ + -व्रतः a worshipper of the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृव्रतम्
पितृ + -व्रतः + .({@-तम्@}) obsequial rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृश्राद्धम्
पितृ + -श्राद्धम् obsequial rites in honour of a father or deceased ancestor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृस्वसृ
पितृ + -स्वसृ <i>f.</i> (also पितृष्वसृ as well as पितुः स्वसृ or पितुःष्वसृ)<BR> a fatherʼs sister; Ms. 2. 131.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृष्वस्रीयः|पितृष्वस्रीय
पितृ + -ष्वस्रीयः a paternal auntʼs son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृसंनिभ|पितृसन्निभ|पितृसन्निभः
पितृ + -संनिभ^1 <i>a.</i> fatherly, paternal.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृसूः
पितृ + -सूः<BR>—1 a paternal grandmother.<BR>—2 evening twilight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृस्थानः|पितृस्थान
पितृ + -स्थानः, -स्थानीयः a guardian (who is in the place of a father).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृस्थानीयः|पितृस्थानीय
पितृ + -स्थानः, -स्थानीयः a guardian (who is in the place of a father).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृस्थानम्
पितृ + -स्थानम् The abode of death; see पितृवन; आनिन्यथुः पितृस्थानाद्<BR> गुरवे गुरुदक्षिणाम् Bhāg. 10. 85. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृहत्या
पितृ + -हत्या parricide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृहन्
पितृ + -हन् <i>m.</i> a parricide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृहू
पितृ + -हू <i>m.</i> the right ear; पितृहूर्नृप पुर्या द्वार्दक्षिणेन पुरञ्जनः<BR> Bhāg. 4. 25. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृक|पितृकं
पितृक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Paternal, ancestral, hereditary.<BR>—2 Obsequial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृमत्|पितृमन्त्
पितृमत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having a father.<BR>—2 Having an illustrious father.<BR>—3 Accompanied by or connected with the Manes.<BR>—4 Mentioning the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृवत्
पितृवत् <i>a.</i> Having a father living. ━<i>ind.</i> Like a father or the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृव्यः|पितृव्य
पितृव्यः<BR>—1 A fatherʼs brother, paternal uncle.<BR>—2 Any elderly male relation; Ms. 2. 130.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पितृव्यपुत्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पितृव्यपुत्रः|पितृव्यपुत्र
पितृव्यः + -पुत्रः a fatherʼs brotherʼs son, cousin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तम्
पित्तम् Bile, one of the three humours of the body (the other two<BR> being वात and कफ) and its chief quality (heat); पित्तं यदि<BR> शर्करया शाम्यति कोऽर्थः पटोलेन Pt. 1. 378; पित्तमुष्णं द्रवं<BR> पीतं नीलं सत्त्वगुणोत्तरम् । सरं कटु लघु स्निग्धं तीक्ष्णमम्ले तु<BR> पाकतः ॥; मध्याह्ने च यथार्धरात्रसमये पित्तप्रकोपो भवेत् Bhāva P.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पित्तातीसारः, पित्ताभिष्यन्दः, पित्तारिः, पित्तोपहत, पित्तकोशः, पित्तकोषः, पित्तक्षोभः, पित्तगदिन्, पित्तज्वरः, पित्तदाहः, पित्तद्राविन्, पित्तधर, पित्तधरा, पित्तप्रकृति, पित्तप्रकोपः, पित्तभेदः, पित्तभेषजम्, पित्तरक्तम्, पित्तवल्लभा, पित्तवायुः, पित्तविदग्ध, पित्तविनाशन, पित्तशमन, पित्तहर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तातीसारः|पित्तातीसार
पित्तम् + -अतीसारः a bilious form of diarrhoea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्ताभिष्यन्दः|पित्ताभिष्यन्द
पित्तम् + -अभिष्यन्दः a bilious form of ophthalmia.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तारिः|पित्तारि
पित्तम् + -अरिः N. of several plants लाक्षा, वर्वर &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तोपहत
पित्तम् + -उपहत <i>a.</i> affected by bile; पश्यति पित्तोपहतः शशिशुभ्रं<BR> शङ्खमपि पीतम् K. P. 10. 478.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तकोशः|पित्तकोश
पित्तम् + -कोशः, -कोषः the gall-bladder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तकोषः|पित्तकोष
पित्तम् + -कोशः, -कोषः the gall-bladder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तक्षोभः|पित्तक्षोभ
पित्तम् + -क्षोभः excess or derangement of the bilious humour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तगदिन्
पित्तम् + -गदिन् <i>a.</i> bilious, affected by bile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तज्वरः|पित्तज्वर
पित्तम् + -ज्वरः, -दाहः a bilious fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तदाहः|पित्तदाह
पित्तम् + -ज्वरः, -दाहः a bilious fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तद्राविन्
पित्तम् + -द्राविन् the sweet citron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तधर
पित्तम् + -धर <i>a.</i> bilious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तधरा
पित्तम् + -धरा <i>f.</i> A kind of <i>kalā</i> (one of the substrata of the<BR> humours) in the body; षष्टी पित्तधरा नाम या कला परिकीर्तिता । पक्कामाशयमध्यस्था<BR> ग्रहणी सा प्रकीर्तिता; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तप्रकृति
पित्तम् + -प्रकृति <i>a.</i> of a bilious or choleric temperament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तप्रकोपः|पित्तप्रकोप
पित्तम् + -प्रकोपः excess and vitiation of the bilious humour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तभेदः
पित्तम् + -भेदः see पित्तक्षोभः; अवीनां पित्तभेदश्च सर्वेषामिति नः<BR> श्रुतम् Mb. 12. 283. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तभेषजम्
पित्तम् + -भेषजम् a sort of pulse (Mar. मसूर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तरक्तम्
पित्तम् + -रक्तम् plethora.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तवल्लभा
पित्तम् + -वल्लभा see अतिविषा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तवायुः|पित्तवायु
पित्तम् + -वायुः flatulence caused by the excess and vitiation of the bilious humour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तविदग्ध
पित्तम् + -विदग्ध <i>a.</i> impaired by bile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तविनाशन
पित्तम् + -विनाशन, -शमन, -हर <i>a.</i> antibilious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तशमन
पित्तम् + -विनाशन, -शमन, -हर <i>a.</i> antibilious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तहर
पित्तम् + -विनाशन, -शमन, -हर <i>a.</i> antibilious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तकः|पित्तक
पित्तकः An inferior variety of gems; Kau. A. 2. 11. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तल|पित्तलं
पित्तल <i>a.</i> Bilious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्तलम्
पित्तल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 Brass.<BR>—2 A species of birch tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्र्य|पित्र्यं|पित्र्यः
पित्र्य <i>a.</i> [पितुरिदं प्रियं वा पितृत आगतं वा यत्]<BR>—1 Paternal, patrimonial, ancestral.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Relating or sacred to the deceased ancestors; Ms. 2. 58.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Obsequial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्र्यः|पित्र्य|पित्र्यं
पित्र्य + .{@-त्र्यः@}<BR>—1 the eldest brother.<BR>—2 The month of Māgha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्र्या
पित्र्य + .{@-त्र्या@}<BR>—1 The constellation called Maghā.<BR>—2 The day of full as well as new moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्र्यम्
पित्र्य + .{@-त्र्यम्@}<BR>—1 The lunar mansion called Maghā.<BR>—2 The part of the hand between the fore-finger and the thumb (sacred to the Manes).<BR>—3 The Śrāddha ritual (श्राद्धकल्प); Ch. Up. 7. 1. 2.<BR>—4 The nature of a father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्सत्|पित्सन्त्
पित्सत् <i>m.</i> A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्सलः|पित्सल|पित्सलं
पित्सलः A road, path.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पित्सु
पित्सु <i>a.</i> Being about to fly or fall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिधा
पिधा €3 U. See under धा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिधातव्य
पिधातव्य <i>a.</i> To be shut, covered or closed; गुरोर्यत्र परीवादो<BR> निन्दा वापि प्रवर्तते । कर्णौ तत्र पिधातव्यौ गन्तव्यं वा ततोऽन्यतः ॥<BR> Ms. 2. 200.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिधानम्
पिधानम्<BR>—1 Covering, concealing.<BR>—2 A sheath.<BR>—3 A wrapper, cloak.<BR>—4 A lid or top.<BR>—5 A particular process to which quicksilver is subjected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिधानी
पिधानम् + .{@-नी@} A cover, lid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिधानकम्
पिधानकम्<BR>—1 A sheath, scabbard.<BR>—2 A lid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिधायक
पिधायक <i>a.</i> Covering, hiding, concealing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिहित|पिहितं
पिहित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Shut, closed, barred.<BR>—2 Covered, concealed, hidden.<BR>—3 Filled or covered with; see अपिहित also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिहितम्
पिहित + .{@-तम्@} A figure of speech which consists in insinuating to a person<BR> that one knows his secrets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनह्
पिनह् €4 U.<BR>—1 To fasten, gird round, bind; अतिपिनद्धेन वल्कलेन Ś. 1; मन्दारमाला<BR> हरिणा पिनद्धा Ś. 7. 2.<BR>—2 To put on, wear; कवचं पिनह्य Bk. 3. 47.<BR>—3 To cover, envelop; कुसुममिव पिनद्धं पाण्डुपत्रोदरेण Ś. 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनद्ध|पिनद्धः
पिनद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Fastened, tied or put on; आलिङ्गन्तु गृहीतधूपसुरभीन् स्तम्भान् पिनद्धस्रजः Mu. 3. 2.<BR>—2 Dressed.<BR>—3 Hid, concealed.<BR>—4 Pierced, penetrated.<BR>—5 Wrapped, covered, enveloped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनह्य
पिनह्य <i>ind.</i> Having dressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनाकः|पिनाक|पिनाकं
पिनाकः, -कम्<BR> [पा रक्षणे आकन् नुट् धातोरात इत्वम् Uṇ. 4. 15.]<BR>—1 The bow of Śiva; निपपात जवादिषुः पिनाकान् महतो ऽभ्रादिव वैद्युतः<BR> कृशानुः Ki. 13. 20.<BR>—2 A trident; ‘पिनाकोऽस्त्री रुद्रचापे पांशुवर्षत्रिशूलयोः’ Med.<BR>—3 A bow in general.<BR>—4 A staff or stick.<BR>—5 A shower of dust.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पिनाकगोप्तृ, पिनाकधृक्, पिनाकधृत्, पिनाकपाणि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनाकम्
पिनाकः, -कम्<BR> [पा रक्षणे आकन् नुट् धातोरात इत्वम् Uṇ. 4. 15.]<BR>—1 The bow of Śiva; निपपात जवादिषुः पिनाकान् महतो ऽभ्रादिव वैद्युतः<BR> कृशानुः Ki. 13. 20.<BR>—2 A trident; ‘पिनाकोऽस्त्री रुद्रचापे पांशुवर्षत्रिशूलयोः’ Med.<BR>—3 A bow in general.<BR>—4 A staff or stick.<BR>—5 A shower of dust.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पिनाकगोप्तृ, पिनाकधृक्, पिनाकधृत्, पिनाकपाणि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनाकगोप्तृ
पिनाकः + -गोप्तृ, -धृक्, -धृत्, -पाणि <i>m.</i> epithets of Śiva; द्वौ वरासिधरौ<BR> राजन्नेकः शक्तिपिनाकधृक् Mb. 5. 155. 17, 3. 167. 5; कुर्यां हरस्यापि<BR> पिनाकपाणेर्धैर्यच्युतिम् Ku. 3. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनाकधृक्
पिनाकः + -गोप्तृ, -धृक्, -धृत्, -पाणि <i>m.</i> epithets of Śiva; द्वौ वरासिधरौ<BR> राजन्नेकः शक्तिपिनाकधृक् Mb. 5. 155. 17, 3. 167. 5; कुर्यां हरस्यापि<BR> पिनाकपाणेर्धैर्यच्युतिम् Ku. 3. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनाकधृत्
पिनाकः + -गोप्तृ, -धृक्, -धृत्, -पाणि <i>m.</i> epithets of Śiva; द्वौ वरासिधरौ<BR> राजन्नेकः शक्तिपिनाकधृक् Mb. 5. 155. 17, 3. 167. 5; कुर्यां हरस्यापि<BR> पिनाकपाणेर्धैर्यच्युतिम् Ku. 3. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनाकपाणि
पिनाकः + -गोप्तृ, -धृक्, -धृत्, -पाणि <i>m.</i> epithets of Śiva; द्वौ वरासिधरौ<BR> राजन्नेकः शक्तिपिनाकधृक् Mb. 5. 155. 17, 3. 167. 5; कुर्यां हरस्यापि<BR> पिनाकपाणेर्धैर्यच्युतिम् Ku. 3. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनाकिन्
पिनाकिन् <i>m.</i> An epithet of Śiva; Ku. 5. 77; मृगानुसारिणं साक्षात्<BR> पश्यामीव पिनाकिनम् Ś. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिनाकी
पिनाकी <i>f.</i> A variety of fiddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1022-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिन्यासः|पिन्यास|पिन्यासं
पिन्यासः Asafoetida (Mar. हिंग).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिन्व्
पिन्व् €1 U. (पिन्वति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to swell or overflow.<BR>—2 To wet, moisten.<BR>—3 To emit, discharge, pour forth.<BR>—4 (Ātm.) To swell, overflow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपतिषत्|पिपतिषन्त्
