पिपासिन्
पिपासित, पिपासिन्, पिपासु <i>a.</i> Thirsty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपासु|पिपासुः
पिपासित, पिपासिन्, पिपासु <i>a.</i> Thirsty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपीतकी
पिपीतकी The twelfth day of the light half of Vaiśākha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपीलः|पिपील
पिपीलः, -पिपीली<BR> An ant; न चाहं कामये पापमपि कीटपिपीलयोः Mb. 5. 163. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपीली
पिपीलः, -पिपीली<BR> An ant; न चाहं कामये पापमपि कीटपिपीलयोः Mb. 5. 163. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपीलकः|पिपीलक
