पिपीलिकः|पिपीलिक
पिपीलिकः An ant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपीलिकम्
पिपीलिकः + .{@-कम्@} A kind of gold (said to be collected by ants); तद् वै पिपीलिकं<BR> नाम उद्धृतं यत् पिपीलकैः । जातरूपं द्रोणमेयमहार्षुः पुञ्जशो नृपाः ॥<BR> Mb. 2. 52. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पिपीलिकपुटम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपीलिकपुटम्
पिपीलिकः + -पुटम् an ant-hill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपीलिका
पिपीलिका A female ant; मणिमयमन्दिरमध्ये पश्यति पिपीलिका छिद्रम्.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पिपीलिकापरिसर्पणम्, पिपीलिकामध्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपीलिकापरिसर्पणम्
पिपीलिका + -परिसर्पणम् the running about of ants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिपीलिकामध्य
पिपीलिका + -मध्य <i>a.</i> N. of a kind of fast; cf. Kull. on Ms. 11. 216.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिप्पटा
पिप्पटा (-डा)<BR>—1 A kind of sweetmeat. —2 Sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिप्पडा
पिप्पटा (-डा)<BR>—1 A kind of sweetmeat. —2 Sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिप्पलः|पिप्पल|पिप्पलं
पिप्पलः —1 The holy fig-tree (Mar. पिंपळ); Y. 1. 302.<BR>—2 A nipple.<BR>—3 The sleeve of a jacket or coat.<BR>—4 A bird kept free (not confined in a cage).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिप्पलम्
पिप्पलः + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 A berry in general.<BR>—2 A berry of the holy fig-tree.<BR>—3 Sensual enjoyment; Bhāg. 3. 4. 8.<BR>—4 Water.<BR>—5 The effect arising from acts (कर्मजन्यफल); Muṇḍ. 3. 1. 1;<BR> एकस्तयोः खादति पिप्पलान्नमन्यो निरन्नोऽपि बलेन भूयान् Bhāg. 11. 11. 6.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पिप्पलाद, पिप्पलाशन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिप्पलाद
पिप्पलः + -अद, -अशन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 eating the fruit of the Pippala tree.<BR>—2 given to sensual pleasures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिप्पलाशन
पिप्पलः + -अद, -अशन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 eating the fruit of the Pippala tree.<BR>—2 given to sensual pleasures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिप्पलिः|पिप्पलि
पिप्पलिः, -ली <i>f.</i><BR> Long pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिप्पली
पिप्पलिः, -ली <i>f.</i><BR> Long pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिप्पिका
पिप्पिका The tartar of the teeth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिप्लुः|पिप्लु
पिप्लुः A mark, mole, freckle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिब
पिब <i>a.</i> What drinks नलच्छायपिबापि; दृष्टिः N. 6. 34, 9. 124, 16. 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पियालः|पियाल
पियालः N. of a tree; मृगाः प्रियालद्रुममञ्जरीणां रजःकणैर्विध्रितदृष्टिपाताः Ku. 3. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पियालम्
