पिल्
पिल् €10 U. (पेलयति-ते)<BR>—1 To throw, cast.<BR>—2 To send, direct.<BR>—3 To incite, prompt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पिलाटम्
पिलाटम् A part of the elephantʼs face. (This is a term used by Vaijayantī<BR> while Mātaṅga L. uses ‘विलागम्’.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1023-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

