पुंस् €10 U. [पुंसयति-ते]<BR>—1 To crush, grind.<BR>—2 To pain, trouble, punish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंस्
पुंस् <i>m.</i> [पाति पा-पालने डुम्सुन् Uṇ. 4. 177] (Nom. पुमान्,<BR> पुमांसौ, पुमांसः; Instr. du. पुंभ्यां; Voc. sing. पुमन्)<BR>—1 A male, male being; पुंसि विश्वसिति कुत्र कुमारी N. 5. 110.<BR>—2 A man, human being; यस्यार्थाः स पुमाँल्लोके H. 1.<BR>—3 Man, mankind, people; वन्द्यैः पुंसां रघुपतिपदैः Me. 12.<BR>—4 A servant, an attendant.<BR>—5 A word in the masculine gender.<BR>—6 The masculine gender; पुंसि वा हरिचन्दनम् Ak.<BR>—7 The soul.<BR>—8 A living being; जन्म त्वात्मतया पुंसः सर्वभावेन भूरिदः Bhāg. 11. 22. 40.<BR>—9 A kind of Naraka; अपत्यमस्मि ते पुंसस्त्राणात् पुत्र इति स्मृतः Mb. 14. 90. 63.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पुमनुज, पुमनुजा, पुमपत्यम्, पुमर्थः, पुमाख्या, पुमाचारः, पुङ्कटिः, पुङ्कामा, पुङ्कोकिलः, पुङ्खेटः, पुङ्गवः, पुञ्चलः, पुञ्चली, पुञ्चलीयः, पुञ्चलू, पुञ्चिह्नम्, पुञ्जन्मन्, पुन्दासः, पुन्ध्वजः, पुन्नक्षत्रम्, पुन्नागः, पुन्नाटः, पुन्नाडः, पुन्नामधेयः, पुन्नामन्, पुम्पुत्रः, पुम्प्रजननम्, पुम्भावः, पुम्भूमन्, पुंयोगः, पुंरत्नम्, पुंराशिः, पुंरूपम्, पुंलक्षणम्, पुंलिङ्ग, पुंवत्सः, पुंवृषः, पुंवेष, पुंसवन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुमनुज
पुंस् + -अनुज <i>a.</i> (पुंसानुज) having an elder brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुमनुजा
पुंस् + -अनुजा (पुमनुजा) a girl born after the male child; <i>i. e.</i><BR> a girl having an elder brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुमपत्यम्
पुंस् + -अपत्यम् (पुमपत्यम्) a male child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुमर्थः|पुमर्थ
पुंस् + -अर्थः (पुमर्थः)<BR>—1 the aim of man.<BR>—2 any one of the four ends of human existence; <i>i. e.</i> धर्म, अर्थ,<BR> काम and मोक्ष; see पुरुषार्थ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुमाख्या
पुंस् + -आख्या (पुमाख्या) a designation of a male being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुमाचारः|पुमाचार
पुंस् + -आचारः (पुमाचारः) a usage of men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुङ्कटिः
पुंस् + -कटिः <i>f.</i> a manʼs hip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुङ्कामा
पुंस् + -कामा a woman wishing for a husband; P. VIII. 3. 6; Kāśi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुङ्कोकिलः
पुंस् + -कोकिलः a male cuckoo; चूताङ्कुरास्वादकषायकण्ठः पुंस्कोकिलो<BR> यन्मधुरं चुकूज Ku. 3. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुङ्खेटः|पुङ्खेट
पुंस् + -खेटः (पुंखेटः) a male plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुङ्गवः|पुङ्गव|पुंगव
पुंस् + -गवः (पुंगवः)<BR>—1 a bull, an ox.<BR>—2 (at the end of comp.) chief, best, most excellent, distinguished or<BR> pre-eminent of any class; वाल्मीकिर्मुनिपुंगवः Rām.; so गजपुंगवः<BR> Bh. 2. 31, नरपुंगवः &c. ˚केतुः an epithet of Śiva; स्विन्नाङ्गुलिः<BR> पुंगवकेतुरासीत् Ku. 7. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुञ्चलः
पुंस् + -चलः (पुंश्चलः) an adulterer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुञ्चली
पुंस् + -चली (पुंश्चली) a harlot, an unchaste woman; Y. 1. 162; Ms. 4. 220;<BR> अहो को वेद भुवने दुर्ज्ञेयं पुंश्चलीमनः । पुंश्चल्यां यो हि विश्वस्तो<BR> विधिना स विडम्बितः ॥ Brav. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुञ्चलीयः
पुंस् + -चलीयः (पुंश्चलीयः) the son of a harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुञ्चलू
पुंस् + -चलू <i>f.</i> (पुंश्चलू) Ved. a harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुञ्चिह्नम्
पुंस् + -चिह्नम् (पुंश्चिह्नम्) the characteristic of a male, the<BR> membrum virile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुञ्जन्मन्|पुंजन्मन्
पुंस् + -जन्मन् (पुंजन्मन्) <i>n.</i> the birth of a male child.<BR> ˚करः, ˚दः, ˚योगः a constellation under which male children are born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुन्दासः|पुन्दास|पुंदास
पुंस् + -दासः (पुंदासः) a male slave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुन्ध्वजः|पुन्ध्वज
पुंस् + -ध्वजः (पुंध्वजः)<BR>—1 the male of any species of animal. —2 a mouse<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुन्नक्षत्रम्
पुंस् + -नक्षत्रम् (पुंनक्षत्रम्) a male asterism.<BR>—2 an asterism under which male children are born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुन्नागः|पुन्नाग|पुंनाग
पुंस् + -नागः (पुंनागः)<BR>—1 ‘an elephant among men’, a distinguished man.<BR>—2 a white elephant.<BR>—3 a white lotus.<BR>—4 nutmeg.<BR>—5 N. of a tree called नागकेशर; R. 4. 57.<BR>—6 N. of a tree (Mar. उंडीण); Mb. 1. 63. 43; Bhāg. 8. 2. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुन्नाटः|पुन्नाट
पुंस् + -नाटः, -नाडः (पुंनाटः, -डः) N. of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुन्नाडः|पुन्नाड
पुंस् + -नाटः, -नाडः (पुंनाटः, -डः) N. of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुन्नामधेयः|पुन्नामधेय
पुंस् + -नामधेयः (पुंनामधेयः) a male.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुन्नामन्|पुंनामन्
पुंस् + -नामन् (पुंनामन्) <i>a.</i> holding a masculine name. (<i>m.</i>) the<BR> tree called पुंनाग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुम्पुत्रः
पुंस् + -पुत्रः a male child; P. VIII. 3. 6; Kāśi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुम्प्रजननम्
पुंस् + -प्रजननम् the male organ of generation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुम्भावः|पुम्भाव
पुंस् + -भावः (पुंभावः) manhood, masculine gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुम्भूमन्|पुंभूमन्
पुंस् + -भूमन् (पुंभूमन्) <i>m.</i> a word of the masculine gender used only<BR> in the plural number; दाराः पुंभूम्नि चाक्षताः Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंयोगः|पुंयोग
पुंस् + -योगः (पुंयोगः)<BR>—1 cohabitation with or relation to a man; P. IV. 1. 48.<BR>—2 reference to a male or husband; पुंयोगे क्षत्रियी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंरत्नम्
पुंस् + -रत्नम् (पुंरत्नम्)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">Page1027-1</a>]<BR> an excellent man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1026-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंराशिः|पुंराशि
पुंस् + -राशिः (पुंराशिः) a male sign of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंरूपम्
पुंस् + -रूपम् (पुंरूपम्) the form of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंलक्षणम्
पुंस् + -लक्षणम् manliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंलिङ्ग|पुंलिङ्गं
पुंस् + -लिङ्ग <i>a.</i> (पुंलिङ्ग) of the masculine gender, masculine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंलिङ्गम्
पुंस् + -लिङ्ग + .({@-ङ्गम्@})<BR>—1 masculine gender.<BR>—2 virility, manhood.<BR>—3 the male organ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंवत्सः|पुंवत्स
पुंस् + -वत्सः (पुंवत्सः) a bull-calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंवृषः|पुंवृष
पुंस् + -वृषः (पुंवृषः) the musk-rat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंवेष
पुंस् + -वेष <i>a.</i> (पुंवेष) dressed like a male, clad in male attire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंसवन|पुंसवनं
पुंस् + -सवन (पुंसवन) <i>a.</i> causing the birth of a male child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंसवनम्
पुंस् + -सवन + .({@-नम्@})<BR>—1 the first of the purificatory Saṃskāras: it is a ceremony performed<BR> on womanʼs perceiving the first signs of a living conception, with a view<BR> to the birth of a son; यथाक्रमं पुंसवनादिकाः क्रियाः (व्यधत्त) R. 3. 10.<BR>—2 foetus; यस्मिन् प्रविष्टेऽसुरवधूनां प्रायः पुंसवनानि भयादेव स्रवन्ति<BR> पतन्ति च Bhāg. 5. 24. 15.<BR>—3 the time after a womanʼs courses; तपस्तप्त्वा व्रतपरा स्नाता पुंसवने<BR> शुचिः, उपचक्राम भर्तारम् Mb. 1. 31. 25.<BR>—4 milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंसी
पुंसी A cow which has a bull-calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंस्त्वम्
पुंस्त्वम्<BR>—1 The characteristic of a male, virility, potency, masculineness; यत्नात्<BR> पुंस्त्वे परीक्षितः Y. 1. 55; कुलालपितृत्वं च कुलालजनकपुंस्त्वम् Tarka K.<BR>—2 Semen virile.<BR>—3 The masculine gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुंवत्
पुंवत् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Like a man; पुंवत् प्रगल्भा R. 6. 20.<BR>—2 In the masculine gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुक्कश|पुक्कशः
पुक्कश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>), पुक्कस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Low, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुक्कशी
पुक्कश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>), पुक्कस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Low, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुक्कस|पुक्कसः
पुक्कश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>), पुक्कस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Low, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुक्कसी
पुक्कश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>), पुक्कस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Low, vile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुक्कशः|पुक्कश
पुक्कश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>), पुक्कस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>) + .{@-शः, -षः, -सः@} N. of a degraded mixed caste, the offspring of<BR> a Niṣāda by a Śūdra woman; जातो निषादाच्छूद्रायां जात्या भवति पुक्कसः Ms. 10. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुक्कषः|पुक्कष
