पुट्
पुट् I. €6 P. (पुटति)<BR>—1 To embrace, clasp.<BR>—2 To intertwine. ━II. €10 U. (पुटयति-ते)<BR>—1 To be in contact with.<BR>—2 To bind together, fasten.<BR>—3 (पोटयति-ते)<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To grind, reduce to powder.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To speak.<BR>——(<i>c</i>) To shine. ━III. €1 P. (पोटति)<BR>—1 To grind.<BR>—2 To rub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुटः|पुट|पुटं
पुटः, -टम्<BR> [पुट्-क]<BR>—1 A fold.<BR>—2 A hollow space, cavity, concavity; भिन्नपल्लवपुटो वनानिलः R. 9. 68, 11. 23, 17. 12;<BR> M. 3. 9; अञ्जलिपुट, नासापुट, कर्णपुट &c.<BR>—3 A cup made of a leaf folded or doubled; a vessel of leaves; दुग्ध्वा<BR> पयः पत्रपुटे मदीयम् R. 2. 65; Ms. 6. 28.<BR>—6 Any shallow receptacle.<BR>—5 The pod or capsule which envelops young shoots.<BR>—6 A sheath, cover, covering<BR>—7 An eye-lid (पुटी also in all these senses).<BR>—8 A horseʼs hoof.<BR>—9 A cloth worn to cover the privities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुटम्
पुटः, -टम्<BR> [पुट्-क]<BR>—1 A fold.<BR>—2 A hollow space, cavity, concavity; भिन्नपल्लवपुटो वनानिलः R. 9. 68, 11. 23, 17. 12;<BR> M. 3. 9; अञ्जलिपुट, नासापुट, कर्णपुट &c.<BR>—3 A cup made of a leaf folded or doubled; a vessel of leaves; दुग्ध्वा<BR> पयः पत्रपुटे मदीयम् R. 2. 65; Ms. 6. 28.<BR>—6 Any shallow receptacle.<BR>—5 The pod or capsule which envelops young shoots.<BR>—6 A sheath, cover, covering<BR>—7 An eye-lid (पुटी also in all these senses).<BR>—8 A horseʼs hoof.<BR>—9 A cloth worn to cover the privities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुटः|पुट|पुटं
