पुटपाकः|पुटपाक
पुटः + -पाकः<BR>—1 a particular method of preparing drugs, in which the various ingredients<BR> are wrapped up in leaves, and being covered with clay are roasted in the<BR> fire; अनिर्भिन्नो गभीरत्वादन्तर्गूढघनव्यथः । पुटपाकप्रतीकाशो रामस्य<BR> करुणो रसः U. 3. 1.<BR>—2 digesting.<BR>—3 subliming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1027-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुटभेदः|पुटभेद
