पुलस्तिः, -स्त्यः<BR> N. of a sage, one of the mind-born sons of Brahmā; Ms. 1. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

