पुला
पुला The soft palate, uvula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलाकः|पुलाक|पुलाकं
पुलाकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Empty, bad or shrivelled grain; पुलाकाश्चैव धान्यानाम् (दातव्यम्)<BR> Ms. 10. 125 (v. l.); पुलाका इव धान्येषु Pt. 3. 98.<BR>—2 A lump of boiled rice.<BR>—3 Abridgment, compendium,<BR>—4 Brevity, conciseness.<BR>—5 Rice-water.<BR>—6 Despatch, celerity.<BR>—7 Smallness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलाकम्
पुलाकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Empty, bad or shrivelled grain; पुलाकाश्चैव धान्यानाम् (दातव्यम्)<BR> Ms. 10. 125 (v. l.); पुलाका इव धान्येषु Pt. 3. 98.<BR>—2 A lump of boiled rice.<BR>—3 Abridgment, compendium,<BR>—4 Brevity, conciseness.<BR>—5 Rice-water.<BR>—6 Despatch, celerity.<BR>—7 Smallness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलाकिन्
पुलाकिन् <i>m.</i> A tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलायितम्
पुलायितम् A horseʼs gallop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलिनः|पुलिन|पुलिनं
पुलिनः, -नम्<BR> [पुल्-इनन् किच्च; Uṇ. 2. 53]<BR>—1 A sandbank, sandy beach; रमते यमुनापुलिनवने विजयी मुरारिरधुना<BR> Gīt. 7; R. 14. 52; sometimes used in pl.; कालिन्द्याः पुलिनेषु केलिकुपितामुत्सृज्य<BR> रासे रसम् Ve. 1. 2.<BR>—2 A small island left in the bank of a river by the passing off of the<BR> water, an islet<BR>—3 The bank of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलिनम्
पुलिनः, -नम्<BR> [पुल्-इनन् किच्च; Uṇ. 2. 53]<BR>—1 A sandbank, sandy beach; रमते यमुनापुलिनवने विजयी मुरारिरधुना<BR> Gīt. 7; R. 14. 52; sometimes used in pl.; कालिन्द्याः पुलिनेषु केलिकुपितामुत्सृज्य<BR> रासे रसम् Ve. 1. 2.<BR>—2 A small island left in the bank of a river by the passing off of the<BR> water, an islet<BR>—3 The bank of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलिनवती
पुलिनवती A river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलिन्दः|पुलिन्द|पुलिंद|पुलिंदः
पुलिन्दः, पुलिन्दकः<BR>—1 N. of a barbarous tribe (usually in pl.).<BR>—2 A man of this tribe, a savage, barbarian, mountaineer; वन्यैः पुलिन्दैरिव<BR> वानरैस्ताः क्लिश्यन्त उद्यानलता मदीयाः R. 16. 19, 32.<BR>—3 A hunter; तेषामन्तराणि वागुरिकशबरपुलिन्दचण्डालारण्यचरा रक्षेयुः<BR> Kau. A. 2. 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलिन्दकः|पुलिन्दक|पुलिंदक|पुलिंदकः
पुलिन्दः, पुलिन्दकः<BR>—1 N. of a barbarous tribe (usually in pl.).<BR>—2 A man of this tribe, a savage, barbarian, mountaineer; वन्यैः पुलिन्दैरिव<BR> वानरैस्ताः क्लिश्यन्त उद्यानलता मदीयाः R. 16. 19, 32.<BR>—3 A hunter; तेषामन्तराणि वागुरिकशबरपुलिन्दचण्डालारण्यचरा रक्षेयुः<BR> Kau. A. 2. 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलिरिकः|पुलिरिक
पुलिरिकः A snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलिशः|पुलिश
पुलिशः N. of a sage, the founder of one of the siddhāntas in Astronomy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलोमन्
पुलोमन् <i>m.</i> N. of a demon, the father-in-law of Indra; पुलोमानं<BR> जघानाजौ जामाता सन् शतक्रतुः Hariv.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पुलोमारिः, पुलोमजित्, पुलोमभिद्, पुलोमद्विष्, पुलोमजा, पुलोमपुत्री<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलोमारिः|पुलोमारि
पुलोमन् + -अरिः, -जित्, -भिद्, -द्विष् <i>m.</i> epithets of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलोमजित्
पुलोमन् + -अरिः, -जित्, -भिद्, -द्विष् <i>m.</i> epithets of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलोमभिद्
पुलोमन् + -अरिः, -जित्, -भिद्, -द्विष् <i>m.</i> epithets of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलोमद्विष्
पुलोमन् + -अरिः, -जित्, -भिद्, -द्विष् <i>m.</i> epithets of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलोमजा
पुलोमन् + -जा, -पुत्री Śachī, daughter of Puloman and wife of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलोमपुत्री
पुलोमन् + -जा, -पुत्री Śachī, daughter of Puloman and wife of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुलोमा
पुलोमा N. of the wife of Bhṛgu and mother of Cyavana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुल्कसः|पुल्कस
पुल्कसः N. of a despised mixed tribe (the progeny born of a Niṣāda<BR> male and Śūdra female, ‘जातो निषादाच्छूद्रायां जात्या भवति पुल्कसः’);<BR> Ms. 4. 79; Bhāg. 9. 21. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1035-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्
पुष् €1. €4. €9 P. (पोषति, पुष्यति, पुष्णाति, पुष्ट or पुषित)<BR>—1 To nourish, foster, rear, bring up, nurture; तेनाद्य वत्समिव लोकममुं<BR> पुषाण Bh. 2. 46; पुष्णामि चौषधीः सर्वाः Bg. 15. 13; Bk. 3. 13, 17. 32.<BR>—2 To support, maintain, bear.<BR>—3 To cause to thrive or grow, unfold, develop, bring into relief; पुपोष<BR> लावण्यमयान् विशेषान् Ku. 1. 25; R. 3. 32; न तिरोधीयते स्थायी तैरसौ<BR> पुष्यते परम् S. D. 3.<BR>—4 To increase, augment further, promote, enhance; पञ्चानामपि भूतानामुत्कर्षं<BR> पुपुषुर्गुणाः R. 4. 11, 9. 5.<BR>—5 To get, possess, have, enjoy; विमुक्तः संकल्पः किमभिलषितं पुष्यति<BR> न ते Bh. 3. 34.<BR>—6 To show, exhibit, bear, display; वपुरभिनवमस्याः पुष्यति स्वां<BR> न शोभाम् Ś. 1. 19; Ku. 7. 18, 78; R. 16. 58, 18. 32; न हीश्वरव्याहृतयः<BR> कदाचित् पुष्णन्ति लोके विपरीतमर्थम् Ku. 3. 63; सूर्यापाये न खलु<BR> कमलं पुष्यति स्वामभिख्याम् Me. 82.<BR>—7 To be increased or nourished, thrive, prosper.<BR>—8 To magnify, extol.<BR>—9 To bud, bloom, blossom; पुष्यत्पुष्करवासितस्य पयसो गण्डूषसंक्रान्तयः<BR> U. 3. 16; Māl. 9. 34.<BR>—10 To share, divide. ━II. To shine, beam, gleam; साधु साध्विति संहृष्टाः<BR> पुष्यमाणैरिवाननैः Mb. 12. 58. 26. ━<i>Caus.</i> or €10 U. (पोषयति-ते)<BR>—1 To nourish, bring up, maintain &c.<BR>—2 To increase, promote.<BR>—3 To take care of, provide for.<BR>—4 To put on, wear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्
पुष् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Nourishing.<BR>—2 Showing, displaying; योषितामतिमदेन जुघूर्णुर्विभ्रमातिशयपुंषि<BR> वपूंषि Śi. 10. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्कम्
पुष्कम् Nourishment, nutrition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्ट|पुष्टं|पुष्टः
पुष्ट <i>p. p.</i> [पुष्-क्त]<BR>—1 Nourished, fed, reared, brought up.<BR>—2 Thriving, growing, strong, fat.<BR>—3 Tended, cared for.<BR>—4 Rich, magnificently provided.<BR>—5 Complete, perfect.<BR>—6 Full-sounding, loud; स्वरेण हृष्टपुष्टेन तुष्टाव मधुसूदनम् Mb. 12. 47. 14.<BR>—7 Eminent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टः|पुष्ट|पुष्टं
पुष्ट + .{@-ष्टः@} N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टम्
पुष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@}<BR>—1 Nourishment.<BR>—2 Acquisition, gain (Ved.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पुष्टाङ्ग, पुष्टार्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टाङ्ग
पुष्ट + -अङ्ग <i>a.</i> fat-limbed, well-fed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टार्थ
पुष्ट + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> fully intelligible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टिः|पुष्टि
पुष्टिः <i>f.</i> [पुष् भावे-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Nourishing, breeding, or rearing.<BR>—2 Nourishment, growth, increase, advance; यत् पिंषतामपि नृणां पिष्टोऽपि<BR> तनोषि परिमलैः पुष्टिम् Bv. 1. 12.<BR>—3 Strength, fatness, fulness, plumpness; अन्धस्य दृष्टिरिव पुष्टिरिवातुरस्य Mk. 1. 49.<BR>—4 Prosperity, thriving.<BR>—5 Maintenance, support.<BR>—6 Wealth, property, means of comfort; तस्मिन्नपुष्यन्नुदिते समग्रां<BR> पुष्टिं जनाः पुष्य इव द्वितीये R. 18. 32.<BR>—7 Richness, magnificence.<BR>—8 Development, perfection.<BR>—9 N. of a ceremony performed for the attainment of welfare; also पुष्टिकर्मन् q. v.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पुष्टिकर, पुष्टिकर्मन्, पुष्टिकान्तः, पुष्टिद, पुष्टिदः, पुष्टिमार्गः, पुष्टिवर्धन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टिकर
पुष्टिः + -कर <i>a.</i> nourishing, nutritive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टिकर्मन्
पुष्टिः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> a religious ceremony performed for the attainment<BR> of worldly prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टिकान्तः|पुष्टिकान्त
पुष्टिः + -कान्तः an epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टिद|पुष्टिदः
पुष्टिः + -द <i>a.</i><BR>—1 nourishing.<BR>—2 causing growth or prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टिदः|पुष्टिद
पुष्टिः + -दः N. of a medicinal plant (Mar. आसंध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टिमार्गः|पुष्टिमार्ग
पुष्टिः + -मार्गः N. of the doctrine of a Vaiṣṇava sect founded by Vallabhācārya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टिवर्धन|पुष्टिवर्धनः
पुष्टिः + -वर्धन <i>a.</i> promoting welfare, causing prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टिवर्धनः|पुष्टिवर्धन
पुष्टिः + -वर्धन + .({@-नः@}) a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करम्
पुष्करम् [पुष्कं पुष्टिं राति, रा-क; cf. Uṇ. 4. 4]<BR>—1 A blue lotus; Nelumbium speciosum;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">Page1036-2</a>]<BR> ताः कान्तैः सह करपुष्करेरिताम्बुव्यात्युक्षीमाभिसरणग्लहामदीव्यन् Śi. 8. 32.<BR>—2 The tip of an elephantʼs trunk; आलोकपुष्करमुखोल्लसितैरभीक्ष्णमुक्षांबभूवुरभितो<BR> वपुरम्बुवर्षैः Śi. 5. 30.<BR>—3 The skin of a drum, <i>i. e.</i> the place where it is struck; पुष्करेष्वाहतेषु<BR> Me. 68; R. 17. 11.<BR>—4 The blade of a sword; क्रोधेनान्धाः प्राविशन् पुष्कराणि Śi. 18. 17.<BR>—5 The sheath of a sword.<BR>—6 An arrow.<BR>—7 Air, sky, atmosphere; पुष्करं पूरयामासुः सिंहनादेन भूयसा<BR> Śiva B. 18. 50.<BR>—8 A cage.<BR>—9 Water.<BR>—10 Intoxication.<BR>—11 The art of dancing.<BR>—12 War, battle.<BR>—13 Union.<BR>—14 N. of a celebrated place of pilgrimage in the district of Ajmere.<BR>—15 The bowl of a spoon.<BR>—16 A part, portion.<BR>—17 The tip of the elephantʼs trunk; Mātaṅga L. 2. 2, 3. 1, 5. 8, 6. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करः|पुष्कर|पुष्करं
पुष्करम् + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A lake, pond; पुष्करे दुष्करं वारि … Jyotistattvam.<BR>—2 A kind of serpent.<BR>—3 A kind of drum, kettle-drum; अवादयन् दुन्दुभींश्च शतशश्चैव पुष्करान्<BR> Mb. 6. 43. 103.<BR>—4 The sun.<BR>—5 An epithet of a class of clouds said to cause dearth or famine; Me. 6.<BR> (v. l. पुष्कल); तदीयास्तोयदेष्वद्य पुष्करावर्तकादिषु । अभ्यस्यन्ति<BR> तटाघातम् Ku. 2. 50.<BR>—6 An epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—7 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—8 The Sārasa bird.<BR>—9 An inauspicious conjunction of planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करः|पुष्कर|पुष्करं
पुष्करम् + .{@-रः, -रम्@} N. of one of the seven great divisions of the universe.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पुष्कराक्षः, पुष्कराख्यः, पुष्कराह्वः, पुष्करावर्तकः, पुष्करतीर्थः, पुष्करनाभः, पुष्करपत्रम्, पुष्करप्रियः, पुष्करबीजम्, पुष्करविष्टरः, पुष्करव्याघ्रः, पुष्करशिखा, पुष्करसारी, पुष्करस्थपतिः, पुष्करस्रज्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करम्
पुष्करम् + .{@-रः, -रम्@} N. of one of the seven great divisions of the universe.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पुष्कराक्षः, पुष्कराख्यः, पुष्कराह्वः, पुष्करावर्तकः, पुष्करतीर्थः, पुष्करनाभः, पुष्करपत्रम्, पुष्करप्रियः, पुष्करबीजम्, पुष्करविष्टरः, पुष्करव्याघ्रः, पुष्करशिखा, पुष्करसारी, पुष्करस्थपतिः, पुष्करस्रज्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्कराक्षः|पुष्कराक्ष
पुष्करम् + -अक्षः an epithet of Viṣṇu; ध्वजाग्रे पुष्कराक्षस्य तार्क्ष्यः<BR> संनिहितोऽभवत् Bm. 2. 108.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्कराख्यः|पुष्कराख्य
पुष्करम् + -आख्यः, -आह्वः the (Indian) crane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्कराह्वः|पुष्कराह्व
पुष्करम् + -आख्यः, -आह्वः the (Indian) crane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करावर्तकः|पुष्करावर्तक|पुष्करावर्त्तक
पुष्करम् + -आवर्तकः an epithet of a class of clouds said to cause dearth<BR> or famine; जातं वंशे भुवनविदिते पुष्करावर्तकानाम् Me. 6; Ku. 2. 50; Ve. 3. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करतीर्थः|पुष्करतीर्थ
पुष्करम् + -तीर्थः N. of a sacred bathing-place; see पुष्कर above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करनाभः|पुष्करनाभ
पुष्करम् + -नाभः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करपत्रम्
पुष्करम् + -पत्रम् a lotus-leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करप्रियः|पुष्करप्रिय
पुष्करम् + -प्रियः wax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करबीजम्
पुष्करम् + -बीजम् lotus-seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करविष्टरः|पुष्करविष्टर
पुष्करम् + -विष्टरः the god Brahmā; जगाम लोकं स्वमखण्डितोत्सवं समीडितः<BR> पुष्करविष्टरादिभिः Bhāg. 3. 19. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करव्याघ्रः|पुष्करव्याघ्र
पुष्करम् + -व्याघ्रः an alligator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करशिखा
पुष्करम् + -शिखा the root of a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करसारी
पुष्करम् + -सारी a kind of writing; L. V.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करस्थपतिः|पुष्करस्थपति
पुष्करम् + -स्थपतिः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करस्रज्
पुष्करम् + -स्रज् <i>f.</i> a garland of lotuses. ━<i>m.</i> (du.) N. of the two<BR> Aśvinīkumāras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करायते
पुष्करायते Den. Ā. To act as a drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करिका
पुष्करिका A kind of disease (abscess on the penis).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करिणी
पुष्करिणी<BR>—1 A female elephant.<BR>—2 A lotus-pool.<BR>—3 A piece of water, lake or pool in general; ततः पुष्करिणीं वीरौ पम्पां नाम गमिष्यथ Rām. 3. 73. 11.<BR>—4 The lotus-plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्करिन्
पुष्करिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Abounding in lotuses. ━<i>m.</i> An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्कल|पुष्कलं|पुष्कलः
पुष्कल <i>a.</i> [पुष्-कलच् किच्च; पुष्कसिध्मा˚लच् वा Tv.]<BR>—1 Much, copious, abundant; भक्षितेनापि भवता नाहारो मम पुष्कलः<BR> H. 1. 81; प्रजां प्राप्नोति पुष्कलाम् Ms. 3. 277; Pt. 1. 63.<BR>—2 Full, complete; स्तुवन्ति त्वां स्तुतिभिः पुष्कलाभिः Bg. 11. 21; आविरासीद्यथा<BR> प्राच्यां दिशीन्दुरिव पुष्कलः Bhāg. 10. 3. 8.<BR>—3 Rich, magnificent, splendid.<BR>—4 Excellent, best, eminent.<BR>—5 Near.<BR>—6 Loud, resonant, resounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्कलः|पुष्कल|पुष्कलं
पुष्कल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A kind of drum.<BR>—2 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—3 Of mount Meru.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">Page1037-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्कलम्
पुष्कल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 A particular measure of capacity = 64 handfuls.<BR>—2 Alms to the extent of four morsels of food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1036-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्कलकः|पुष्कलक
पुष्कलकः<BR>—1 The musk-deer; सीम्नि पुष्कलको हतः Sk.<BR>—2 A bolt, pin, wedge.<BR>—3 A Buddhist mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्टिका
पुष्टिका An oyster (Mar. कालव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्प्
पुष्प् €4 P. (पुष्प्यति) To open, blow, expand, bloom; पुष्प्यत्पुष्करवासितस्य<BR> पयसः U. 3. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पम्
पुष्पम् [पुष्प् विकाशे-अच्]<BR>—1 A flower, blossom; पत्रं पुष्पं फलं तोय यो मे भक्त्या प्रयच्छति Bg. 9. 26.<BR>—2 The menstrual discharge; as in पुष्पवती q. v.<BR>—3 A topaz (पुष्पराग); Rām. 2. 94. 6.<BR>—4 A disease of the eyes (albugo).<BR>—5 The car or vehicle of Kubera; see पुष्पक.<BR>—6 Gallantry, politeness (in love language).<BR>—7 Expanding, blooming, blossoming (said to be <i>m.</i> in this sense).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पुष्पाग्रम्, पुष्पाञ्जनम्, पुष्पाञ्जलिः, पुष्पानुगम्, पुष्पाभिषेक, पुष्पाम्बु, पुष्पाम्बुजम्, पुष्पावचयः, पुष्पावचायिन्, पुष्पास्त्रः, पुष्पाकर, पुष्पागमः, पुष्पाजीवः, पुष्पाननः, पुष्पापीडः, पुष्पायुधः, पुष्पेषुः, पुष्पासवम्, पुष्पासारः, पुष्पास्तरकः, पुष्पास्तरणम्, पुष्पोद्गमः, पुष्पोद्यानम्, पुष्पोपजीविन्, पुष्पकरण्डकम्, पुष्पकरण्डिनी, पुष्पकालः, पुष्पकासीसम्, पुष्पकीटः, पुष्पकेतनः, पुष्पकेतुः, पुष्पगण्डिका, पुष्पगृहम्, पुष्पघातकः, पुष्पचयः, पुष्पचापः, पुष्पचामरः, पुष्पजम्, पुष्पदः, पुष्पदन्तः, पुष्पदामन्, पुष्पद्रवः, पुष्पद्रुमः, पुष्पधः, पुष्पधनुस्, पुष्पधन्वन्, पुष्पधर,^1 पुष्पधारणः, पुष्पध्वजः, पुष्पनिक्षः, पुष्पनिर्यासः, पुष्पनिर्यासकः, पुष्पनेत्रम्, पुष्पपत्रिन्, पुष्पपथः, पुष्पपदवी, पुष्पपुटः, पुष्पपुरम्, पुष्पप्रचयः, पुष्पप्रचायः, पुष्पप्रचायिका, पुष्पप्रस्तारः, पुष्पफलः, पुष्पबटुकः, पुष्पबलिः, पुष्पबाणः, पुष्पवाणः, पुष्पभद्रः, पुष्पभवः, पुष्पमञ्जरिका, पुष्पमाला, पुष्पमासः, पुष्पयमकम्, पुष्परजस्, पुष्परथः, पुष्परसः, पुष्परागः, पुष्पराजः, पुष्परेणुः, पुष्परोचनः, पुष्पलावः, पुष्पलिक्षः, पुष्पलिह्, पुष्पलिपिः, पुष्पवर्षः, पुष्पवर्षणम्, पुष्पवाटिका, पुष्पवाटी, पुष्पवृक्षः, पुष्पवृष्टिः, पुष्पवेणी, पुष्पशकटिका, पुष्पशकटी, पुष्पशय्या, पुष्पशरः, पुष्पशरासनः, पुष्पसायकः, पुष्पसमयः, पुष्पसारः, पुष्पस्वेदः, पुष्पसारा, पुष्पसिता, पुष्पस्नानम्, पुष्पहासः, पुष्पहासा, पुष्पहीना<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पाग्रम्
पुष्पम् + -अग्रम् pistil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पाञ्जनम्
पुष्पम् + -अञ्जनम्<BR>—1 calx of brass used as a collyrium.<BR>—2 A white flower-like substance which appears when zinc is mixed with<BR> copper and heated for preparing brass.<BR>—3 Zinc oxide (Mar. जस्तफूल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पाञ्जलिः|पुष्पाञ्जलि|पुष्पांजलि
पुष्पम् + -अञ्जलिः a handful of flowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पानुगम्
पुष्पम् + -अनुगम् a powder promoting menstruation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पाभिषेक
पुष्पम् + -अभिषेक = ˚स्नान q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पाम्बु
पुष्पम् + -अम्बु the honey of flowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पाम्बुजम्
पुष्पम् + -अम्बुजम् the sap of flowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पावचयः|पुष्पावचय
