पुष्पम् + -सारः, -स्वेदः the nectar or honey of flowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पसारा
पुष्पम् + -सारा the holy basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

