पुष्पस्नानम्
पुष्पम् + -स्नानम् a kind of inauguration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पहासः|पुष्पहास
पुष्पम् + -हासः<BR>—1 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 the blooming of flowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पहासा
पुष्पम् + -हासा a woman in her courses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पहीना
पुष्पम् + -हीना a woman past child-bearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पकम्
पुष्पकम्<BR>—1 Flower.<BR>—2 Calx of brass.<BR>—3 A cup of iron.<BR>—4 The car of Kubera (snatched off from him by Rāvaṇa and from him by<BR> Rāma); वैमानिकाः पुण्यकृतस्त्यजन्तु मरुतां पथि, पुष्पकालोकसंक्षोभम्<BR> R. 10. 46, 13. 40.<BR>—5 A bracelet.<BR>—6 A kind of collyrium.<BR>—7 A particular disease of the eyes.<BR>—8 A bracelet of jewels.<BR>—9 A small earthen fireplace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पधः|पुष्पध
पुष्पधः An outcaste progeny of a Brāhmaṇa; s. v. पुष्प.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1037-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्पंधयः|पुष्पन्धय|पुष्पंधय|पुष्पन्धयः
