पुष्यस्नानम्
पुष्यः + -अभिषेकः, -स्नानम् a ceremony of coronating a king &c., when the<BR> moon stands in the asterism Puṣya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1038-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्यनेत्रा
पुष्यः + -नेत्रा <i>f.</i> The night on which the Puṣya planet is seen for all the time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1038-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पुष्ययोगः
