पूतनहन्
पूतनः + -अरिः, -सूदनः, -हन् <i>m.</i> epithets of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1039-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूति|पूतिः
पूति <i>a.</i> [पूय्-क्तिच्] Putrid, stinking, fetid, foul-smelling;<BR> यातयामं गतरसं पूति पर्युषितं च यत् Bg. 17. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1039-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूतिः|पूति
