पूति + -गन्ध + .({@-न्धः@})<BR>—1 stench, fetid odour.<BR>—2 the Iṅgudi plant.<BR>—3 sulphur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1039-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूतिगन्धि|पूतिगंधि|पूतिगन्धिः
पूति + -गन्धि <i>a.</i> stinking, foul-smelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1039-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूतिगन्धिक|पूतिगन्धिकः
