पूय्
पूय् €1 U. (पूयति-ते)<BR>—1 To stink, putrefy.<BR>—2 To split up, divide.<BR>—3 To be dissolved or destroyed; श्रद्दधानस्य पूयन्ते सर्वपापान्यशेषतः<BR> Mb. 1. 1. 254; (considered by some to be €4 Ā. also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1039-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

