पूयनम् = पूय q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1039-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्
पूर् I. €4 Ā. (पूर्यते, पूर्ण)<BR>—1 To fill, fill out (allied in this sense with pass. of पॄ q. v.).<BR>—2 To please, satisfy. ━II. €10 U. (पूरयति-ते, पूरित; strictly<BR> the <i>Caus.</i> of पॄ q. v.)<BR>—1 To fill; को न याति वशं लोके मुखे पिण्डेन पूरितः Bh. 2. 118;<BR> Śi. 9. 64, 16. 34.<BR>—2 To blow into or fill with wind, blow (as a conchshell).<BR>—3 To cover, surround; पूरयन्तः समाजग्मुर्भयदाया दिशो दश Bk. 7. 30.<BR>—4 To fulfil, satisfy; पूरयतु कुतूहलं वत्सः U. 4; so आशाम्,<BR> मनोरथम् &c.<BR>—5 To intensify, strengthen (as sound).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">Page1040-1</a>]<BR>—6 To make resonant.<BR>—7 To load or enrich with (gifts &c.).<BR>—8 To draw (as a bow).<BR>—9 To spend (time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1039-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरः|पूर|पूरं
पूरः [पूर्-क]<BR>—1 Filling, making full; तमहमुपसृतानां कामपूरं नतोऽस्मि Bhāg. 8. 13. 47.<BR>—2 Satisfying, pleasing, making content.<BR>—3 Pouring in, supplying; अतैलपूराः सुरतप्रदीपाः Ku. 1. 10.<BR>—4 The swelling or rising of a river or of the sea, flood; महोदधेः<BR> पूर इवेन्दुदर्शनात् R. 3. 17.<BR>—5 A stream or flood in general; अम्बु˚, बाष्प˚, शोणित˚ &c.<BR>—6 A piece of water, lake, pond.<BR>—7 The healing or cleansing of wounds.<BR>—8 A kind of cake.<BR>—9 Drawing in breath slowly through the nose; प्राणापानौ संनिरुन्ध्यात्<BR> पूरकुम्भकरेचकैः<BR>—10 The citron tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरम्
पूरः + .{@-रम्@} A kind of incense.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पूराम्लम्, पूरोत्पीडः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूराम्लम्
पूरः + -आम्लम् the fruit of Spondias Magnifera (Mar. आंबाडा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरोत्पीडः|पूरोत्पीड
पूरः + -उत्पीडः a flood or excess of water; पूरोत्पीडे तडागस्य परीवाहः<BR> प्रतिक्रिया U. 3. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरक|पूरकः
पूरक <i>a.</i> [पूर्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Filling up, completing.<BR>—2 Satisfying, making content.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरकः|पूरक
पूरक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 The citron tree.<BR>—2 A ball of meal offered at the conclusion of the oblations to the manes.<BR>—3 (In arith.) The multiplier.<BR>—4 Closing the right nostril and inhaling air through the left (as a religious<BR> ceremony); cf. रेचक.<BR>—5 Flood, stream, effusion (पूर); सिञ्चाङ्ग नस्त्वदधरामृतपूरकेण<BR> (हृच्छयाग्निम्) Bhāg. 10. 29. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरण|पूरणं|पूरणः
पूरण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [पूर्-कर्तरि ल्यु]<BR>—1 Filling up, completing.<BR>—2 Ordinal (as applied to numbers) (द्वितीय, तृतीय &c.); न पूरणी<BR> तं समुपैति संख्या Ki. 3. 51.<BR>—3 Satisfying.<BR>—4 Drawing (as a bow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरणः|पूरण|पूरणं
पूरण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 A bridge, dam, causeway.<BR>—2 The ocean.<BR>—3 The <i>Śālmali</i> tree.<BR>—4 A kind of medicinal oil (विष्णुतैलम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरणी
पूरण + .{@-णी@}<BR>—1 An epithet of Durgā.<BR>—2 The silk-cotton tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरणम्
पूरण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Filling<BR>—2 Filling up, completing; कुम्भपूरणभवः पटुरुच्चैरुच्चचार निनदो<BR> ऽम्भसि तस्याः R. 9. 73.<BR>—3 Puffing or swelling.<BR>—4 Fulfilling, accomplishing.<BR>—5 A sort of cake.<BR>—6 A funeral cake.<BR>—7 Rain, raining.<BR>—8 Warp.<BR>—9 Multiplication (in Math.).<BR>—10 Injection of fluids (in Medic.)<BR>—11 Drawing, bending (as a bow).<BR>—12 Decorating, adorning.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पूरणप्रत्ययः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरणप्रत्ययः|पूरणप्रत्यय
पूरण + -प्रत्ययः an affix forming an ordinal number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरयितृ
पूरयितृ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Filling, filling up.<BR>—2 Satisfying, gratifying. ━<i>m.</i> An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरिकः|पूरिक
पूरिकः, -का<BR> A kind of cake; मोदकान् पूरिकापूपान् Mb. 7. 64. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरिका
पूरिकः, -का<BR> A kind of cake; मोदकान् पूरिकापूपान् Mb. 7. 64. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरित|पूरितं
पूरित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Filled, complete; को न याति वशं लोके मुखे पिण्डेन पूरितः Bh. 1. 118.<BR>—2 Overspread, covered over with<BR>—3 Multiplied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्ण|पूर्णः
पूर्ण <i>p. p.</i> [पुर्-क्त नि˚]<BR>—1 Filled, filled with, full of; oft. in comp.; तं तथा कृपयाविष्टमश्रुपूर्णाकुलेक्षणम्<BR> Bg. 2. 1; so शोक˚, जल˚ &c.<BR>—2 Whole, full, entire, complete; पूर्णमदः पूर्णमिदं पूर्णात् पूर्णमुदच्यते<BR> Īśop. 1; अपूर्णमेकेन शतक्रतूपमः R. 3. 38.<BR>—3 Fulfilled, accomplished.<BR>—4 Ended, completed.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">Page1040-2</a>]<BR>—5 Past, elapsed.<BR>—6 Satisfied, contented.<BR>—7 Full-sounding, sonorous.<BR>—8 Strong, powerful.<BR>—9 Selfish, or self-indulgent.<BR>—10 Drawn, bent (as a bow) आकर्णपूर्णैरहनदाक्षेपैराहतं पुनः<BR> Bhāg. 8. 11. 10.<BR>—11 Allpervading; पूर्णमप्रवर्तीति वा अहमेतमुपास Bṛ. Up. 2. 1. 5;<BR> Mb. 14. 20. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णा
पूर्ण + .{@-र्णा@}<BR>—1 An epithet of the fifteenth digit of the moon.<BR>—2 N. of the fifth, tenth, and fifteenth lunar days or <i>tithis</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णम्
पूर्ण + .{@-र्णम्@} Ved.<BR>—1 Abundance, plenty.<BR>—2 Water.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पूर्णाङ्कः, पूर्णाञ्जलिः, पूर्णाभिलाष, पूर्णाभिषिक्ताः, पूर्णाभिषेकः, पूर्णामृता, पूर्णावतारः, पूर्णानकम्, पूर्णानन्दः, पूर्णाश, पूर्णाहुतिः, पूर्णेन्दुः, पूर्णोत्सङ्ग, पूर्णोपमा, पूर्णककुद, पूर्णकाम, पूर्णकुम्भः, पूर्णपर्वेन्दु, पूर्णपात्रम्, पूर्णप्रज्ञ, पूर्णज्ञः, पूर्णबीजः, पूर्णवीजः, पूर्णमानस, पूर्णमास्, पूर्णमासः, पूर्णमासी, पूर्णरथः, पूर्णवपुस्, पूर्णहोमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णाङ्कः|पूर्णाङ्क|पूर्णांक
पूर्ण + -अङ्कः an integer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णाञ्जलिः|पूर्णाञ्जलि
पूर्ण + -अञ्जलिः two handfuls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णाभिलाष
पूर्ण + -अभिलाष <i>a.</i> satisfied, contented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णाभिषिक्ताः
पूर्ण + -अभिषिक्ताः a particular sect of the Śāktas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णाभिषेकः|पूर्णाभिषेक
पूर्ण + -अभिषेकः a kind of अभिषेकः known in tantraśāstra as belonging<BR> to कौलपन्थ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णामृता
पूर्ण + -अमृता epithet of the sixteenth digit of the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णावतारः|पूर्णावतार
पूर्ण + -अवतारः N. of the fourth, seventh and eighth incarnations of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णानकम्
पूर्ण + -आनकम्<BR>—1 a drum.<BR>—2 the sound of a drum<BR>—3 a vessel.<BR>—4 a moon-beam.<BR>—5 = पूर्णपात्र q. v.; (sometimes read पूर्णालक also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णानन्दः|पूर्णानन्द
पूर्ण + -आनन्दः the Supreme Being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णाश
पूर्ण + -आश <i>a.</i> one whose all desires are fulfilled; पूर्णाशा बहवः<BR> कृता वितरणैर्येन त्वया याचकाः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णाहुतिः|पूर्णाहुति
पूर्ण + -आहुतिः <i>f.</i> an offering made with a full ladle; पूर्णाहुतिभिरापूर्णास्त्रिभिः<BR> पूर्यन्ति तेजसा Mb. 14. 20. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णेन्दुः|पूर्णेन्दु|पूर्णेंदु
पूर्ण + -इन्दुः the full moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णोत्सङ्ग
पूर्ण + -उत्सङ्ग <i>a.</i> far advanced in pregnancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णोपमा
पूर्ण + -उपमा a full or complete simile, <i>i. e.</i> one in which the four<BR> requisites उपमान, उपमेय, साधारणधर्म and उपमाप्रतिपादक<BR> are all expressed; (opp. लुप्तोपमा); <i>e. g.</i> अम्भोरुहमिवाताम्नं<BR> मुग्धे करतलं तव; see K. P. 10 under उपमा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णककुद
पूर्ण + -ककुद <i>a.</i> full-humped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णकाम|पूर्णकामः
पूर्ण + -काम <i>a.</i> one whose desires are fulfilled, satisfied, contented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णकामः|पूर्णकाम
पूर्ण + -काम + .({@-मः@}) N. of the Supreme Being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णकुम्भः|पूर्णकुम्भ|पूर्णकुंभ
पूर्ण + -कुम्भः<BR>—1 a full jar.<BR>—2 a vessel full of water; (placed at the door as an auspicious mark);<BR> पूर्णकुम्भौ चक्रवाकानुकारौ पयोधरौ Dk. 1. 1.<BR>—3 a particular mode of fighting; बाहुपाशादिकं कृत्वा पादाहतशिरावुभौ ।<BR> उरोहस्तं ततश्चक्रे पूर्णकुम्भौ प्रयुज्य तौ ॥ Mb. 2. 23. 14 (com.<BR> ग्रथिताङ्गुलिभ्यां हस्ताभ्यां पदशिरसः पीडनं पूर्णकुम्भः).<BR>—4 a hole (in a wall) of the shape of a water-jar; तदत्र पक्वेष्टके<BR> पूर्णकुम्भ एव शोभते Mk. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णपर्वेन्दु
पूर्ण + -पर्वेन्दु <i>f.</i> the day of full moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णपात्रम्
पूर्ण + -पात्रम्<BR>—1 a full cup or jar.<BR>—2 a cup-ful.<BR>—3 a measure of capacity (equal to 256 handfuls); (अष्टमुष्टि भवेत् किञ्चित्<BR> किञ्चिदष्टौ तु पुष्कलम् । पुष्कलानि तु चत्वारि पूर्णपात्रं प्रचक्षते ॥);<BR> पूर्णपात्रमयीमाहुः पाकयज्ञस्य दक्षिणाम् Mb. 12. 60. 38.<BR>—4 a vessel (or a box or basket) filled with valuable things (such as<BR> clothes, ornaments &c.) and scrambled for by servants or relatives on festive<BR> occasions or distributed as presents; hence, the word is often used to<BR> denote ‘a present made to one who brings a happy news’; कदा मे तनयजन्ममहोत्सवानन्दनिर्भरो<BR> हरिष्यति पूर्णपात्रं परिजनः K. 62, 70, 73, 165; सखीजनेनापह्रियमाणपूर्णपात्रम् 299;<BR> तत् कामं प्रभवति पूर्णपात्रवृत्त्या स्वीकर्तुं मम हृदयं च<BR> जीवितं च Māl. 4. 1; किं पूर्णपात्रस्य न पात्रमासीत् Rām. champū.<BR> (पूर्णपात्र is thus defined:− हर्षादुत्सवकाले च यदलंकारांशुकादिकम् ।<BR> आकृष्य गृह्यते पूर्णपात्रं स्यात् पूर्णकं च तत् ॥ or वर्धापकं<BR> यदानन्दादलंकारादिकं पुनः ॥ आकृष्य गृह्यते पूर्णपात्रं पूर्णानकं<BR> च तत् ॥ Hārāvalī).<BR>—5 a vessel full of rice presented to the priests at the end of the sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णप्रज्ञ
पूर्ण + -प्रज्ञ <i>a.</i> one whose prajñā is fully developed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णज्ञः
पूर्ण + -ज्ञः N. of Madhva, the founder of a kind<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">Page1041-1</a>]<BR> of Vaiṣṇava cult.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1040-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णबीजः|पूर्णबीज
पूर्ण + -बीजः, -वीजः the citron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णवीजः|पूर्णवीज
पूर्ण + -बीजः, -वीजः the citron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णमानस
पूर्ण + -मानस <i>a.</i> contented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णमास्
पूर्ण + -मास् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 the sun.<BR>—2 the moon. ━(<i>f.</i>) the day of full moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णमासः|पूर्णमास
पूर्ण + -मासः<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 a monthly sacrifice performed on the day of full moon; (comprising<BR> the आग्नेय, अग्नीषोमीय and उपांशुयाज sacrifices); कानि पुनर्दर्शपूर्णमासशब्दकानि ।<BR> येषां वचने पौर्णमासीशब्दोऽमावास्यशब्दो वा आग्नेयादीनि तानि ॥ ŚB. on MS. 4. 4. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णमासी
पूर्ण + -मासी the day of full moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णरथः|पूर्णरथ
पूर्ण + -रथः a complete warrior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णवपुस्
पूर्ण + -वपुस् <i>a.</i> full (the moon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णहोमः|पूर्णहोम
पूर्ण + -होमः = पूर्णाहुतिः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णकः|पूर्णक
पूर्णकः<BR>—1 A kind of tree.<BR>—2 A cock.<BR>—3 The blue jay; Mb. 7. 57. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णिका
पूर्णिका A kind of bird (having a cleft beak = नासाचिन्नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णिमा
पूर्णिमा, पूर्णिमासी, पूर्णमा The day of full moon; निखिलान्निशि<BR> पूर्णिमा तिथीनुपतस्थेऽतिथिरेकिका तिथिः N. 2. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णिमासी
पूर्णिमा, पूर्णिमासी, पूर्णमा The day of full moon; निखिलान्निशि<BR> पूर्णिमा तिथीनुपतस्थेऽतिथिरेकिका तिथिः N. 2. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्णमा
पूर्णिमा, पूर्णिमासी, पूर्णमा The day of full moon; निखिलान्निशि<BR> पूर्णिमा तिथीनुपतस्थेऽतिथिरेकिका तिथिः N. 2. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्त|पूर्त्त|पूर्त्तं|पूर्त्तः
पूर्त <i>a.</i> [पूर्-क्त नि˚]<BR>—1 Full, complete; ऐश्वर्यवैराग्ययशोऽवबोधवीर्यश्रियां पूर्तमहं<BR> प्रपद्ये Bhāg. 3. 24. 32.<BR>—2 Concealed, covered.<BR>—3 Nourished, protected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्तम्
पूर्त + .{@-र्तम्@}<BR>—1 Fulfilment.<BR>—2 Cherishing, nourishing.<BR>—3 Granting.<BR>—4 A reward, merit.<BR>—5 An act of pious liberality; it is thus defined:− वापीकूपतडागादि<BR> देवतायतनानि च । अन्नप्रदानमारामः पूर्तमित्यभिधीयते Ms. 4. 226;<BR> Māl. 1. 5 (opp. इष्ट which is thus defined by Atri:− अग्निहोत्रं<BR> तपः सत्यं वेदानां चैव पालनम् । आतिथ्यं वैश्वदेवश्च इष्टमित्यभिधीयते);<BR> cf. इष्टपूर्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्तिः|पूर्ति|पूर्त्ति|पूर्त्तिः
पूर्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Filling.<BR>—2 Completion, fulfilment, accomplishment.<BR>—3 Satiety; satisfaction.<BR>—4 Rewarding, a reward.<BR>—5 Multiplying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्य्य|पूर्य
पूर्य्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be filled or satisfied.<BR>—2 To be nourished or maintained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूरुषः|पूरुष
पूरुषः = पुरुष q. v.; Bv. 1. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्व्
पूर्व् €1 P. To fill. ━(€10 P.)<BR>—1 To invite.<BR>—2 To live.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्व|पूर्वः|पूर्व्व|पूर्व्वः
पूर्व <i>a.</i> (Declined like a pronoun when it implies relative position<BR> in time or space, but optionally so in nom. pl.; and abl. and loc. sing.)<BR>—1 Being in front of, first, foremost.<BR>—2 Eastern, easterly, to the east of; ग्रामात् पर्वतः पूर्वः Sk.;<BR> पूर्वापरौ तोयनिधी वगाह्य Ku. 1. 1.<BR>—3 Previous to, earlier than; ब्राह्मणे साहसः पूर्वः Ms. 8. 276.<BR>—4 Old, ancient; पूर्वसूरिभिः R. 1. 4; इदं कविभ्यः पूर्वेभ्यो नमोवाकं<BR> प्रशास्महे U. 1. 1.<BR>—5 Former, previous, anterior, prior, antecedent (opp. उत्तर); in<BR> this sense often at the end of comp. and translated by ‘formerly’ or ‘before’;<BR> श्रुतपूर्व &c.; व्यतीता या निशा पूर्वा पौराणां हर्षवर्धिनी Rām. 7. 37. 1.<BR>—6 Aforesaid, before-mentioned.<BR>—7 Initial.<BR>—8 Established, customary, of long standing<BR>—9 Early, prime, पूर्वे वयसि Pt. 1. 165 ‘in early age or prime of life’.<BR>—10 Elder (ज्येष्ठ); रामः पूर्वो हि नो भ्राता भविष्यति महीपतिः<BR> Rām. 2. 79. 8.<BR>—11 (At the end of comp.) Preceded by, accompanied by, attended with;<BR> संबन्धमाभाषणपूर्वमाहुः R. 2. 58; पुण्यः शब्दो मुनिरिति मुहुः केवलं<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">Page1041-2</a>]<BR> राजपूर्वः Ś. 2. 17; तान् स्मितपूर्वमाह Ku. 7. 47; बहुमानपूर्वया 5. 31;<BR> दशपूर्वरथं यमाख्यया दशकण्ठारिगुरुं विदुर्बुधाः R. 8. 29;<BR> so मतिपूर्वम् Ms. 11. 147 ‘intentionally’, ‘knowingly’; 12. 89;<BR> अबोधपूर्वम् ‘unconsciously’, Ś. 5. 2 &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वः|पूर्व|पूर्व्व|पूर्व्वः
पूर्व + .{@-र्वः@} An ancestor, a forefather; पूर्वैः किलायं परिवर्धितो<BR> नः R. 13. 3; पयः पूर्वैः सनिश्वासैः कवोष्णमुपभुज्यते 1. 67, 5. 14;<BR> अनुकारिणि पूर्वेषां युक्तरूपमिदं त्वयि Ś. 2. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वम्
पूर्व + .{@-र्वम्@} The forepart; अनवरतधनुर्ज्यास्फालनक्रूरपूर्वम् (गात्रम्) Ś. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वा|पूर्व्वा
पूर्व + .{@-र्वा@}<BR>—1 The east<BR>—2 N. of a country to the east of Madhyadeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वम्
पूर्व + .{@-र्वम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Before (with abl.); मासात् पूर्वम्.<BR>—2 Formerly, previously, at first, antecedently, beforehand; तं पूर्वमभिवादयेत्<BR> Ms. 2. 117, 3. 94, 8. 205; R. 12. 35; प्रणिपातपूर्वम् K.; भूतपूर्वखरालयम्<BR> U. 2. 17 ‘which formerly was the abode’, &c.; समयपूर्वम् Ś. 5 ‘after a formal agreement’<BR>. —3 Immemorially. (पूर्वेण ‘in front’, ‘before’,<BR> ‘to the east of’, with gen. or acc.); अद्य पूर्वम् ‘till-now’, ‘hitherto’;<BR> {@पूर्वः━ततः━पश्चात्━उपरि@} ‘first━then, first━afterwards’,<BR> ‘previously, subsequently’, {@पूर्वम्━अधुना@} or {@━अद्य@}<BR> ‘formerly━now’.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पूर्वाग्निः, पूर्वाङ्गः, पूर्वाचलः, पूर्वाद्रिः, पूर्वाधिकारिन्, पूर्वान्तः, पूर्वापर, पूर्वाभिमुख, पूर्वाभ्यासः, पूर्वाम्बुधिः, पूर्वार्जित, पूर्वार्धः, पूर्वार्धम्, पूर्वावसायिन्, पूर्वाह्णः, पूर्वावेदकः, पूर्वाषाढा, पूर्वेतर, पूर्वोक्त, पूर्वोदित, पूर्वोत्तर, पूर्वकर्मन्, पूर्वकल्पः, पूर्वकायः, पूर्वकाल, पूर्वकालिक, पूर्वकालीन, पूर्वकाष्ठा, पूर्वकृत, पूर्वकोटिः, पूर्वक्रिया, पूर्वगा, पूर्वगङ्गा, पूर्वचोदित, पूर्वज, पूर्वजन्मन्, पूर्वजातिः, पूर्वज्ञानम्, पूर्वतापनीयम्, पूर्वदक्षिण, पूर्वदिक्पतिः, पूर्वदिनम्, पूर्वदिश्, पूर्वदिश्य, पूर्वदिष्टम्, पूर्वदृष्ट, पूर्वदेवः, पूर्वदेवता, पूर्वदेशः, पूर्वद्वार, पूर्वनिपातः, पूर्वनिमित्त, पूर्वनिविष्ट, पूर्वपक्षः, पूर्वपदम्, पूर्वपर्वतः, पूर्वपश्चात्, पूर्वपश्चिम, पूर्वपाञ्चालक, पूर्वपाणिनीयाः, पूर्वपालिन्, पूर्वपितामहः, पूर्वपीठिका, पूर्वपुरुषः, पूर्वपूर्व, पूर्वप्रोष्ठपदा, पूर्वफल्गुनी, पूर्वबन्धुः, पूर्वभवः, पूर्वभागः, पूर्वभाद्रपदा, पूर्वभद्रपदा, पूर्वभावः, पूर्वभाषिन्, पूर्वभुक्तिः, पूर्वभूत, पूर्वमध्याह्नः, पूर्वमारिन्, पूर्वमीमांसा, पूर्वमुख, पूर्वयाम्य, पूर्वरङ्गः, पूर्वरागः, पूर्वरात्रः, पूर्वरूपम्, पूर्वलक्षणम्, पूर्ववयस्, पूर्ववर्तिन्, पूर्ववाक्यम्, पूर्ववादः, पूर्ववादिन्, पूर्वविद्, पूर्वविप्रतिषेधः, पूर्वविहित, पूर्ववृत्तम्, पूर्ववैरिन्, पूर्वशारद, पूर्वशैलः, पूर्वसक्थम्, पूर्वसंचित, पूर्वसन्ध्या, पूर्वसर, पूर्वसागरः, पूर्वसाहसः, पूर्वस्थितिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाग्निः|पूर्वाग्नि
पूर्व + -अग्निः the sacred fire kept in the house (आवसथ्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाङ्गः|पूर्वाङ्ग
पूर्व + -अङ्गः the first day in the civil month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाचलः|पूर्वाचल
पूर्व + -अचलः, -अद्रिः the eastern mountain behind which the sun and<BR> moon are suppossed to rise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाद्रिः|पूर्वाद्रि|पूर्व्वाद्रि|पूर्व्वाद्रिः
पूर्व + -अचलः, -अद्रिः the eastern mountain behind which the sun and<BR> moon are suppossed to rise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाधिकारिन्
पूर्व + -अधिकारिन् <i>m.</i> the first occupant, a prior owner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वान्तः|पूर्वान्त|पूर्वांत
पूर्व + -अन्तः the end of a preceding word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वापर|पूर्व्वापर
पूर्व + -अपर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 eastern and western; कतमोऽयं पूर्वापरसमुद्रावगाढः सानुमानालोक्यते<BR> Ś. 7; पूर्वापरौ तोयनिधी वगाह्य Ku. 1. 1.<BR>—2 first and last.<BR>—3 prior and subsequent, preceding and following.<BR>—4 connected with another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वापरम्
पूर्व + -अपर + .({@-रम्@})<BR>—1 what is before and behind.<BR>—2 connection; न च पूर्वापरं विद्यात् Ms. 8. 56.<BR>—3 the proof and the thing to be proved. ˚विरोधः inconsistency, incongruity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाभिमुख
पूर्व + -अभिमुख <i>a.</i> turned towards or facing the east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाभ्यासः|पूर्वाभ्यास|पूर्व्वाभ्यास
पूर्व + -अभ्यासः former practice or experience.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाम्बुधिः|पूर्वाम्बुधि|पूर्वांबुधि
पूर्व + -अम्बुधिः the eastern ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वार्जित
पूर्व + -अर्जित <i>a.</i> attained by former works.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वार्जितम्
पूर्व + -अर्जित + .({@-तम्@}) ancestral property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वार्धः|पूर्वार्ध|पूर्व्वार्द्ध
पूर्व + -अर्धः, -अर्धम्<BR>—1 the first half; दिनस्य पूर्वार्धपरार्धभिन्ना छायेव मैत्री खलसज्जनानाम्<BR> Bh. 2. 60; समाप्तं पूर्वार्धम् &c.<BR>—2 the upper part (of the body); शकुन्तला पूर्वार्धेन शयनादुत्थाय<BR> Ś. 3; R. 16. 6.<BR>—3 the first half of a hemistich.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वार्धम्
पूर्व + -अर्धः, -अर्धम्<BR>—1 the first half; दिनस्य पूर्वार्धपरार्धभिन्ना छायेव मैत्री खलसज्जनानाम्<BR> Bh. 2. 60; समाप्तं पूर्वार्धम् &c.<BR>—2 the upper part (of the body); शकुन्तला पूर्वार्धेन शयनादुत्थाय<BR> Ś. 3; R. 16. 6.<BR>—3 the first half of a hemistich.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वावसायिन्
पूर्व + -अवसायिन् <i>a.</i> what occurs first or earlier; पूर्वावसायिनश्च<BR> बलीयांसो जघन्यावसायिभ्यः ŚB. on MS. 12. 2. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाह्णः|पूर्वाह्ण|पूर्व्वाह्ण|पूर्व्वाह्णः
पूर्व + -अह्णः the earlier part of the day, forenoon; Ms. 4. 96, 152.<BR> श्वः कार्यमद्य कुर्वीत पूर्वाह्णे चापराह्णिकम् (पूर्वाह्णतन, पूर्वाह्णिकः,<BR> पूर्वाह्णेतन <i>a.</i> relating to the forenoon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वावेदकः|पूर्वावेदक|पूर्व्वावेदक
पूर्व + -आवेदकः a plaintiff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वाषाढा|पूर्व्वाषाढा
पूर्व + -आषाढा N. of the 20th lunar mansion consisting of two stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वेतर
पूर्व + -इतर <i>a.</i> western.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वोक्त|पूर्व्वोक्त
पूर्व + -उक्त, -उदित <i>a.</i> before-mentioned, aforesaid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वोदित|पूर्व्वोदित
पूर्व + -उक्त, -उदित <i>a.</i> before-mentioned, aforesaid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वोत्तर|पूर्व्वोत्तर
पूर्व + -उत्तर <i>a.</i> north-eastern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वोत्तरा|पूर्व्वोत्तरा
पूर्व + -उत्तर + .({@-रा@}) the north-east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वोत्तरे
पूर्व + -उत्तर + .({@-रे@} dual) the preceding and following, antecedent and subsequent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकर्मन्|पूर्वकर्म्मन्
पूर्व + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 a former act or work.<BR>—2 the first thing to be done, a prior work.<BR>—3 actions done in a former life. —4 preparations, preliminary arrangements.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकल्पः|पूर्वकल्प
पूर्व + -कल्पः former times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकायः|पूर्वकाय
पूर्व + -कायः<BR>—1 the fore-part of the body of animals; पश्चार्धेन प्रविष्टः शरपतनभयाद्<BR> भूयसा पूर्वकायम् Ś. 1. 7.<BR>—2 the upper part of the body of men; स्पृशन् करेणानतपूर्वकायम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">Page1042-1</a>]<BR> R. 5. 32; पर्यङ्कबन्धस्थिरपूर्वकायम् Ku. 3. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1041-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकाल|पूर्वकालः|पूर्व्वकाल
पूर्व + -काल <i>a.</i> belonging to ancient times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकालः|पूर्वकाल|पूर्व्वकाल
पूर्व + -काल + .({@-लः@}) former or ancient times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकालिक
पूर्व + -कालिक, -कालीन <i>a.</i> ancient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकालीन|पूर्व्वकालीन
पूर्व + -कालिक, -कालीन <i>a.</i> ancient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकाष्ठा|पूर्व्वकाष्ठा
पूर्व + -काष्ठा the east, eastern quarter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकृत|पूर्व्वकृत
पूर्व + -कृत <i>a.</i> previously done.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकृतम्
पूर्व + -कृत + .({@-तम्@}) an act done in a former life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकोटिः|पूर्वकोटि|पूर्व्वकोटि
पूर्व + -कोटिः <i>f.</i> the starting point of a debate, the first statement<BR> or पूर्वपक्ष q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वक्रिया
पूर्व + -क्रिया preparation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वगा
पूर्व + -गा N. of the river Godāvarī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वगङ्गा|पूर्वगंगा|पूर्व्वगङ्गा
पूर्व + -गङ्गा N. of the river Narmadā; रेवेन्दुजा पूर्वगङ्गा नर्भदा<BR> मेकलाद्रिजा Abh. Cin. 1083.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वचोदित|पूर्व्वचोदित
पूर्व + -चोदित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 aforesaid, above-mentioned.<BR>—2 previously stated or advanced (as an objection.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वज|पूर्वजः|पूर्व्वज|पूर्व्वजः
पूर्व + -ज <i>a.</i><BR>—1 born or produced before or formerly, first-produced, first-born; यमयोः<BR> पूर्वजः पार्थः Mb. 3. 141. 11.<BR>—2 ancient, old.<BR>—3 eastern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वजः|पूर्वज|पूर्व्वज|पूर्व्वजः
पूर्व + -ज + .({@-जः@})<BR>—1 an elder brother; अपहाय महीशमाचिंचत् सदसि त्वां ननु भीमपूर्वजः;<BR> Śi. 16. 44; R. 15. 36.<BR>—2 the son of the elder wife.<BR>—3 an ancestor, a forefather; स पूर्वजानां कपिलेन रोषात् R. 16. 34.<BR>—4 (pl.) the progenitors of mankind.<BR>—5 the manes living in the world of the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वजा|पूर्व्वजा
पूर्व + -ज + .({@-जा@}) an elder sister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वजन्मन्
पूर्व + -जन्मन् <i>n.</i> a former birth. ━(<i>m.</i>) an elder brother; स<BR> लक्ष्मणं लक्ष्मणपूर्वजन्मा (विलोक्य) R. 14. 44, 15. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वजातिः|पूर्वजाति
पूर्व + -जातिः <i>f.</i> a former birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वज्ञानम्
पूर्व + -ज्ञानम् knowledge of a former life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वतापनीयम्
पूर्व + -तापनीयम् N. of the first half of नृसिंहतापनीयोपनिषद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदक्षिण
पूर्व + -दक्षिण <i>a.</i> south-eastern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदक्षिणा
पूर्व + -दक्षिण + .({@-णा@}) the south-east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदिक्पतिः|पूर्वदिक्पति|पूर्व्वदिक्पति|पूर्व्वदिक्पतिः
पूर्व + -दिक्पतिः Indra, the regent of the east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदिनम्
पूर्व + -दिनम् the forenoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदिश्|पूर्व्वदिश्
पूर्व + -दिश् <i>f.</i> the east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदिश्य
पूर्व + -दिश्य <i>a.</i> situated towards the east, eastern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदिष्टम्
पूर्व + -दिष्टम् the award of destiny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदृष्ट|पूर्व्वदृष्ट
पूर्व + -दृष्ट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 primaeval.<BR>—2 declared by the ancients; यथा ब्राह्मणचाण्डालः पूर्वदृष्टस्तथैव<BR> सः Ms. 9. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदेवः|पूर्वदेव|पूर्व्वदेव|पूर्व्वदेवः
पूर्व + -देवः<BR>—1 an ancient deity.<BR>—2 a demon or Asura; भूमिदेवनरदेवसंगमे पूर्वदेवरिपुरर्हणां हरिः Śi. 14. 58.<BR>—3 a progenitor (पितृ).<BR>—4 (du.) an epithet of Nara-Nārāyaṇa; सव्यसाचिन् महाबाहो पूर्वदेव<BR> सनातन Mb. 3. 41. 35 (com. पूर्वदेव नरनारायणसख).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदेवता|पूर्व्वदेवता
पूर्व + -देवता a progenitor (पितृ) of gods or of men; अक्रोधनाः<BR> शौचपराः सततं ब्रह्मचारिणः । न्यस्तशस्त्रा महाभागाः पितरः पूर्वदेवताः ॥<BR> Ms. 3. 192.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वदेशः|पूर्वदेश|पूर्व्वदेश|पूर्व्वदेशः
पूर्व + -देशः the eastern country, or the eastern part of India.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वद्वार
पूर्व + -द्वार <i>a.</i> favourable in the eastern region.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वनिपातः|पूर्वनिपात
पूर्व + -निपातः the irregular priority of a word in a compound; cf. परनिपात.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वनिमित्त
पूर्व + -निमित्त an omen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वनिविष्ट
पूर्व + -निविष्ट <i>a.</i> made formerly, in past; यस्तु पूर्वनिविष्टस्य<BR> तडागस्योदकं हरेत् Ms. 9. 281.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपक्षः|पूर्वपक्ष|पूर्व्वपक्ष|पूर्व्वपक्षः
पूर्व + -पक्षः<BR>—1 the fore-part or side.<BR>—2 the first half of a lunar month; सर्वं पूर्वपक्षापरपक्षाभ्यामभिपन्नम्<BR> Bṛ. Up. 3. 1. 5.<BR>—3 the first part of an argument, the <i>prima facie</i> argument or view<BR> of a question; विषयो विशयश्चैव पूर्वपक्षस्तथोत्तरम्.<BR>—4 the first objection to an argument.<BR>—5 the statement of the plaintiff.<BR>—6 a suit at law.<BR>—7 an assertion, a proposition. ˚पादः the plaint, the first stage<BR> of a legal proceeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपदम्
पूर्व + -पदम् the first member of a compound or sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपर्वतः|पूर्वपर्वत|पूर्व्वपर्व्वत|पूर्व्वपर्व्वतः
पूर्व + -पर्वतः the eastern mountain behind which the sun is supposed to rise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपश्चात्
पूर्व + -पश्चात्, -पश्चिम <i>ind.</i> from the east to the west.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपश्चिम
पूर्व + -पश्चात्, -पश्चिम <i>ind.</i> from the east to the west.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपाञ्चालक|पूर्वपांचालक
पूर्व + -पाञ्चालक <i>a.</i> belonging to the eastern Pañcālas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपाणिनीयाः
पूर्व + -पाणिनीयाः <i>m.</i> (pl.) the disciples of Pāṇini living in the east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपालिन्
पूर्व + -पालिन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपितामहः|पूर्वपितामह
पूर्व + -पितामहः a forefather, an ancestor; अब्रवीद् हि स मां क्रुद्धस्तव<BR> पूर्वपितामहः । मूत्रश्लेष्माशनः पाप निरयं प्रतिपत्स्यसे ॥ Mb. 12. 3. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपीठिका
पूर्व + -पीठिका<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">Page1042-2</a>]<BR> introduction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपुरुषः|पूर्वपुरुष
पूर्व + -पुरुषः<BR>—1 an epithet of Brahmā.<BR>—2 anyone of the first three ancestors, beginning with the father (पितृ,<BR> पितामह, and प्रपितामह); Pt. 1. 89.<BR>—3 an ancestor in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपूर्व
पूर्व + -पूर्व <i>a.</i> each preceding one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वपूर्र्वाः
पूर्व + -पूर्व + .({@-र्वाः@}) <i>m.</i> (pl.) forefathers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वप्रोष्ठपदा
पूर्व + -प्रोष्ठपदा = पूर्वभाद्रपदा; Mb. 13. 89. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वफल्गुनी|पूर्व्वफल्गुनी
पूर्व + -फल्गुनी the eleventh lunar mansion containing two stars. ˚भवः<BR> an epithet of the planet Jupiter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वबन्धुः|पूर्वबन्धु
पूर्व + -बन्धुः first or best friend; Mk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वभवः|पूर्वभव
पूर्व + -भवः a former life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वभागः|पूर्वभाग
पूर्व + -भागः<BR>—1 the forepart.<BR>—2 the upper part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वभाद्रपदा|पूर्व्वभाद्रपदा
पूर्व + -भाद्रपदा, -भद्रपदा the twenty-fifth lunar mansion<BR> containing two stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वभद्रपदा
पूर्व + -भाद्रपदा, -भद्रपदा the twenty-fifth lunar mansion<BR> containing two stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वभावः|पूर्वभाव
पूर्व + -भावः<BR>—1 priority.<BR>—2 prior or antecedent existence; येन सहैव यस्य यं प्रति पूर्वभावोऽवगम्यते Tarka K.<BR>—3 (Rhet.) disclosing an intention.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वभाषिन्|पूर्व्वभाषिन्
पूर्व + -भाषिन् <i>a.</i> willing to speak first; hence polite, courteous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वभुक्तिः|पूर्वभुक्ति|पूर्व्वभुक्ति
पूर्व + -भुक्तिः <i>f.</i> prior occupation or possession; Ms. 8. 252.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वभूत
पूर्व + -भूत <i>a.</i> preceding, previous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वमध्याह्नः|पूर्वमध्याह्न
पूर्व + -मध्याह्नः the forenoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वमारिन्|पूर्व्वमारिन्
पूर्व + -मारिन् <i>a.</i> dying before; एवंवृत्तां सवर्णां स्त्रीं द्विजातिः<BR> पूर्वमारिणीम् (दाहयेत्) Ms. 5. 167.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वमीमांसा|पूर्व्वमीमांसा
पूर्व + -मीमांसा ‘the prior or first Mīmāṃsā’, an inquiry into the<BR> first or ritual portion of the Veda, as opposed to the उत्तरमीमांसा<BR> or वेदान्त; see मीमांसा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वमुख
पूर्व + -मुख <i>a.</i> having the face turned towards the east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वयाम्य
पूर्व + -याम्य <i>a.</i> south-eastern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वरङ्गः|पूर्वरङ्ग|पूर्वरंग|पूर्व्वरङ्ग|पूर्व्वरङ्गः
पूर्व + -रङ्गः the commencement or prelude of a drama, the prologue;<BR> यन्नाट्यवस्तुनः पूर्वं रङ्गविध्नोपशान्तये । कुशीलवाः प्रकुर्वन्ति पूर्वरङ्गः<BR> स उच्यते ॥ D. R.; पूर्वरङ्गं विधायैव सूत्रधारो निवर्तते S. D. 283;<BR> पूर्वरङ्गः प्रसंगाय नाटकीयस्य वस्तुनः Śi. 2. 8 (see Malli. thereon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वरागः|पूर्वराग|पूर्व्वराग|पूर्व्वरागः
पूर्व + -रागः the dawning or incipient love, love between two persons<BR> which springs (from some previous cause) before their meeting; श्रवणाद्<BR> दर्शनाद् वापि मिथः संरूढरागयोः । दशाविशेषोयोऽप्राप्तौ पूर्वरागः स<BR> उच्यते ॥ S. D. 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वरात्रः|पूर्वरात्र|पूर्व्वरात्र|पूर्व्वरात्रः
पूर्व + -रात्रः the first part of the night (from dusk to midnight).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वरूपम्
पूर्व + -रूपम्<BR>—1 indication of an approaching change; an omen.<BR>—2 a symptom of occuring disease.<BR>—3 the first of two concurrent vowels or consonants that is retained.<BR>—4 (in Rhet.) a figure of speech which consists in describing anything<BR> as suddenly resuming its former state.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वलक्षणम्
पूर्व + -लक्षणम् a symptom of coming sickness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्ववयस्
पूर्व + -वयस् <i>a.</i> young. ━(<i>n.</i>) youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्ववर्तिन्|पूर्ववर्त्तिन्
पूर्व + -वर्तिन् <i>a.</i> existing before, prior, previous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्ववाक्यम्
पूर्व + -वाक्यम् (in dram.) an allusion to former utterance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्ववादः|पूर्ववाद|पूर्व्ववाद|पूर्व्ववादः
पूर्व + -वादः the first plea or commencement of an action at law; पूर्ववादं<BR> परित्यज्य योऽन्यमालम्बते पुनः । पदसंक्रमणाद् ज्ञेयो हीनवादी स वै<BR> नरः ॥ Mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्ववादिन्|पूर्व्ववादिन्
पूर्व + -वादिन् <i>m.</i> the complainant or plaintiff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वविद्
पूर्व + -विद् <i>a.</i> knowing the events of the past; historian; पृथोरपीमां<BR> पृथिवीं भार्यां पूर्वविदो विदुः Ms. 9. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वविप्रतिषेधः|पूर्वविप्रतिषेध
पूर्व + -विप्रतिषेधः the conflict of two statements contrary to each other.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वविहित
पूर्व + -विहित <i>a.</i> deposited before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्ववृत्तम्
पूर्व + -वृत्तम्<BR>—1 a former event; पूर्ववृत्तकथितैः पुराविदः सानुजः पितृसखस्य<BR> राघवः (उह्यमानः) R. 11. 10.<BR>—2 previous conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्ववैरिन्
पूर्व + -वैरिन् <i>a.</i> one who first commences hostilities, an aggressor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वशारद
पूर्व + -शारद <i>a.</i> relating to the first half of autumn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वशैलः|पूर्वशैल|पूर्व्वशैल|पूर्व्वशैलः
पूर्व + -शैलः see पूर्वपर्वत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वसक्थम्
पूर्व + -सक्थम् the upper part of the thigh; P. V. 4. 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वसंचित
पूर्व + -संचित <i>a.</i> gathered before (as in former birth); त्यजेदाश्वयुजे<BR> मासि मुन्यन्नं पूर्वसंचितम् Ms. 6. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वसन्ध्या|पूर्व्वसन्ध्या
पूर्व + -सन्ध्या day-break, dawn; रजनिमचिरजाता पूर्वसंध्या सुतैव<BR> (अनुपतति) Śi. 11. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वसर|पूर्व्वसर|पूर्व्वसरः
पूर्व + -सर <i>a.</i> going in front.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वसागरः|पूर्वसागर
पूर्व + -सागरः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">Page1043-1</a>]<BR> the eastern ocean; स सेनां महतीं कर्षन् पूर्वसागरगामिनीम् R. 4. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1042-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वसाहसः|पूर्वसाहस|पूर्व्वसाहस
पूर्व + -साहसः the first of the three fines; स दाप्यः पूर्वसाहसम् Ms. 9. 281.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वस्थितिः|पूर्वस्थिति
पूर्व + -स्थितिः <i>f.</i> former or first state.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वक|पूर्वकः|पूर्व्वक
पूर्वक <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.)<BR>—1 Preceded by, attended with; अनामयप्रश्नपूर्वकमाह Ś. 5.<BR>—2 Preceding, antecedent.<BR>—3 Previous, former, prior.<BR>—4 First.<BR>—5 ever (नित्य); शुचीन् कर्मणि पूर्वके Mb. 12. 85. 8; क एषां पूर्वको<BR> ब्रह्मन् Rām. 7. 4. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वकः|पूर्वक|पूर्व्वक
पूर्वक + .{@-कः@} An ancestor, a forefather; एवं विदेहराजश्च जनकः पूर्वकोऽभवत्<BR> Rām. 7. 57. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वंगम
पूर्वंगम <i>a.</i> Going before, preceding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वतन|पूर्व्वतन
पूर्वतन <i>a.</i> Former, old, ancient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वतस्
पूर्वतस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 In the east, to the east; स पूर्वतः पर्वतपक्षशातनं ददर्श<BR> देवं नरदेवसंभवः R. 3. 42.<BR>—2 Before, in front of.<BR>—3 First, in the first place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वत्र
पूर्वत्र <i>ind.</i> In the preceding part, previously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्ववत्|पूर्ववन्त्|पूर्व्ववत्
पूर्ववत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having something antecedent or a cause.<BR>—2 Relating to something preceding; पूर्ववन्तोऽविधानार्थाः˚ MS. 1. 4. 17.<BR> (cf. ये हि पूर्ववन्तो विदितपूर्वमर्थमभिवदन्ति ते अविधानार्थाः<BR> ŚB. on MS. on ibid.). ━<i>n.</i> One of the three kinds of अनुमान,<BR> inference of the effect from the cause; <i>i. e.</i> inferring from the rising<BR> of clouds that rain will fall. ━<i>ind.</i> As before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्विन्
पूर्विन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>), पूर्वीण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Ancient.<BR>—2 Ancestral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्विणी
पूर्विन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>), पूर्वीण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Ancient.<BR>—2 Ancestral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वीण
पूर्विन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>), पूर्वीण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Ancient.<BR>—2 Ancestral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्वेद्युस्|पूर्व्वेद्युस्
पूर्वेद्युस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 On the former day.<BR>—2 On the day before, yesterday; पूर्वेद्युरपरेद्युर्वा श्राद्धकर्मण्युपस्थिते Ms. 3. 187.<BR>—3 During the first part of the day, in the morning, at dawn.<BR>—4 Early, betimes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूर्व्य
पूर्व्य <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Former, previous.<BR>—2 Ancient, old.<BR>—3 Next, near.<BR>—4 Eastern.<BR>—5 Excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूल्
पूल् €1 P., €10 U. (पूलति, पूलयति-ते) To heap up, collect, gather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूलः|पूल
पूलः, -पूलकः<BR>—1 A bundle, pack; न हि अवद्धे काष्ठपूलके एकस्मिन्नाकृष्यमाणे काष्ठान्तराणि<BR> कृष्यन्ते ŚB. on MS. 9. 1. 26.<BR>—2 A kind of cake; cf. पूलदानम्, Mātaṅga L. 11. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूलकः|पूलक
पूलः, -पूलकः<BR>—1 A bundle, pack; न हि अवद्धे काष्ठपूलके एकस्मिन्नाकृष्यमाणे काष्ठान्तराणि<BR> कृष्यन्ते ŚB. on MS. 9. 1. 26.<BR>—2 A kind of cake; cf. पूलदानम्, Mātaṅga L. 11. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूलाकः|पूलाक
पूलाकः = पुलाक q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूलिका
पूलिका A kind of cake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूल्यम्
पूल्यम् An empty grain of corn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूष्
पूष् €1 P. (पूषति)<BR>—1 To nourish.<BR>—2 To increase, grow; cf. पुष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूषः|पूष
पूषः<BR>—1 The month पौष.<BR>—2 (also पूषकः) The mulberry tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूषा
पूषः + .{@-षा@} N. of the third kalā of the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूषम्
पूषः + .{@-षम्@} The रेवती constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूषन्
पूषन् <i>m.</i> (nom. पूषा, -षणौ, -षणः) [पूष्-कनिन्; Uṇ. 1. 156]<BR>—1 A Vedic deity.<BR>—2 The protector of the universe; Īśop. 16.<BR>—3 The sun; सदापान्थः पूषा गगनपरिमाणं कलयति Bh. 2. 114; इन्धनौघधगप्यग्निस्त्विषा<BR> नात्येति पूषणम् Śi. 2. 23;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">Page1043-2</a>]<BR> नवीनमिव पूषणम् Śiva B. 15. 26.<BR>—4 One of the 12 Ādityas; Mb. 12. 15. 18.<BR>—5 The earth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पूषानुजः, पूषारिः, पूषासुहृद्, पूषात्मजः, पूषदन्तहरः, पूषभासा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूषानुजः|पूषानुज
पूषन् + -अनुजः rain; प्रास्यद् द्रोणसुतो बाणान् वृष्टिं पूषानुजो यथा Mb. 8. 20. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूषारिः
पूषन् + -अरिः, -असुहृद् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूषासुहृद्
पूषन् + -अरिः, -असुहृद् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूषात्मजः|पूषात्मज
पूषन् + -आत्मजः<BR>—1 a cloud.<BR>—2 an epithet of Indra.<BR>—3 an epithet of Karṇa; पूषात्मजो मर्मसु निर्विभेद Mb. 8. 89. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूषदन्तहरः|पूषदन्तहर
पूषन् + -दन्तहरः an epithet of Vīrabhadra; see अदन्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पूषभासा
पूषन् + -भासा the city of Indra (अमरावती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृ
पृ I. €6 Ā. (प्रियते-पृत) To be busy or active (mostly with<BR> व्या); कार्ये व्याप्रियते; see व्यापृत. ━<i>Caus.</i> (पारयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to work, engage upon, entrust, with, appoint to; (usually<BR> with loc.); व्यापारितः शूलमृता विधाय सिंहत्वमङ्कागतसत्त्ववृत्ति R. 2. 38.<BR>—2 To place, set, fix, direct, cast; व्यापारयामास करं किरीटे R. 6. 19;<BR> उमामुखे … व्यापारयामास विलोचनानि Ku. 3. 67; व्यापारितं<BR> शिरसि शस्त्रमशस्त्रपाणेः Ve. 3. 19; R. 13. 25. ━II. €3 P. (पिपर्ति, पूर्ण)<BR>—1 To bring or carry over.<BR>—2 To deliver from, bring out of.<BR>—3 To fill.<BR>—4 To protect, maintain, sustain.<BR>—5 To promote, advance. ━III. €9 P. (पृणाति) To protect.<BR>━IV. €10 U. (पारयति-ते; sometimes पार् is regarded as a separate root.)<BR>—1 To carry over or across, ferry over.<BR>—2 To reach the other side of anything, accomplish, perform, achieve,<BR> bring to a conclusion (a vow &c.).<BR>—3 To be able or capable; न खलु मातापितरौ भर्तृवियोगदुःखितां दुहितरं<BR> द्रष्टुं पारयतः Ś. 6; न पारयामि तातकाश्यपस्य … आपन्नसत्त्वां<BR> शकुन्तलां निवेदयितुम् Ś. 4; अधिकं न हि पारयामि वक्तुम् Bv. 2. 59.<BR>—4 To deliver, save, extricate, rescue.<BR>—5 To withstand, oppose.<BR>—6 To live. ━V. €5 P. (पृणोति)<BR>—1 To please or delight, gratify.<BR>—2 To be pleased or delighted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृच्
पृच् I. €2 Ā. (पृक्ते, पृक्ण) To come in contact with.<BR>━II. €7 P. (पृणक्ति, पृक्त)<BR>—1 To bring into contact with, join, unite; एवं वदन् दाशरथिरपृणग्धनुषा<BR> शरम् Bk. 6. 39.<BR>—2 To mix, mingle.<BR>—3 To be in contact with, touch.<BR>—4 To satisfy, fill, satiate.<BR>—5 To augment, increase,<BR>—6 Ved. To give or grant bountifully. ━III. €1 P., €10 U. (पर्चति, पर्चयति-ते)<BR>—1 To touch, come in contact with.<BR>—2 To hinder, oppose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृक्त|पृक्तं
पृक्त <i>p. p.</i> [पृच्-क्त]<BR>—1 Mixed, mingled: पृक्तस्तुषारैर्गिरिनिर्झराणाम् R. 2. 13.<BR>—2 Touched, brought into contact, touching, united.<BR>—3 Filled, full; पृक्तयेन्दुकरैरह्नः पर्यन्त इव संध्यया Ki. 11. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृक्तम्
पृक्त + .{@-क्तम्@} Property, wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृक्तिः|पृक्ति
पृक्तिः <i>f.</i> Touch, contact, union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृक्थम्
पृक्थम् Property, wealth, possessions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृक्षस्
पृक्षस् <i>m.</i> Ved. Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृच्छकः|पृच्छक
पृच्छकः [प्रच्छ्-ण्वुल् संप्रसारणम्] An inquirer, an investigator;<BR> पृच्छकेन सदा भाव्यं पुरुषेण विजानता Pt. 5. 93; Y. 2. 268.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृच्छनम्
पृच्छनम् Asking, inquiring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1043-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृच्छा
पृच्छा<BR>—1 Questioning, asking, inquiring.<BR>—2 An inquiry into the future.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृञ्ज्
पृञ्ज् €2 Ā. (पृङ्क्ते) To come in contact with, touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृड्
पृड्, पृण् €6 P. (पृड-ण-ति) To delight, please.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृण्
पृड्, पृण् €6 P. (पृड-ण-ति) To delight, please.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृणाका
पृणाका The female young of an animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृत्
पृत् <i>f.</i> An army. (This word has no forms for the first five inflections<BR> and is optionally substituted for पृतना after acc. dual).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृतनम्
पृतनम् Ved.<BR>—1 A hostile encounter.<BR>—2 An army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृतना
पृतना<BR>—1 An army (in general).<BR>—2 A division of an army consisting of 243 elephants, as many chariots, 729<BR> horse, and 1215 foot; see अक्षौहिणी.<BR>—3 Battle, fight, encounter.<BR>—4 A hostile army.<BR>—5 (pl.) Men, mankind (Ved.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पृतनासाहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृतनासाहः
पृतना + -साहः an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृतनाज्यम्
पृतनाज्यम् A close combat or fight; पृतनानामजनाद् वा पृतनाज्यं<BR> जयनाद् वा Nirukta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृतनायु
पृतनायु <i>a.</i> Ved. Hostile, inimical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृतन्यति
पृतन्यति Den. P. To attack, encounter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृतन्या
पृतन्या An army; तां देवधानीं स वरूथिनीपतिर्बहिः समन्ताद् रुरुधे<BR> पृतन्यया Bhāg. 8. 15. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथ्
पृथ् €10 U. (पर्थयति-ते)<BR>—1 To extend.<BR>—2 To throw, cast.<BR>—3 To send, direct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथः|पृथ
पृथः Ved.<BR>—1 The palm of the hand.<BR>—2 A kind of measure (of 13 Aṅgulas).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पृथकरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथकरः
पृथः + -करः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्
पृथक् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Severally, separately, singly; शङ्खान् दध्मुः पृथक् पृथक् Bg. 1. 18;<BR> Ms. 3. 26, 7. 57.<BR>—2 Different, separate, distinct; सांख्ययोगौ पृथग् बालाः प्रवदन्ति<BR> न पण्डिताः Bg. 5. 4, 13. 4; अवतीर्णोऽसि भगवन् स्वेच्छोपात्तपृथग्वपुः<BR> Bhāg. 11. 11. 28; रचिता पृथगर्थता गिराम् Ki. 2. 27.<BR>—3 Apart, aside, alone; इति च भवतो जायास्नेहात् पृथक्स्थितिभीरुता V. 4. 39.<BR>—4 Apart from, except, with the exception of, without; (with acc., instr.,<BR> or abl.); पृथग् रामेण-रामात्रामं वा Sk.; Bk. 8. 109. (पृथक् कृ<BR>—1 to separate, divide, sever, analyse.<BR>—2 to keep off, avert.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पृथगात्मता, पृथगात्मन्, पृथगात्मिका, पृथक्करणम्, पृथक्क्रिया, पृथक्कार्यम्, पृथक्कुल, पृथक्क्षेत्राः, पृथक्चर, पृथग्जनः, पृथग्धर्मिन्, पृथक्पर्णी, पृथक्पिण्डः, पृथग्बीजः, पृथग्भावः, पृथग्योगकरणम्, पृथग्रूप,^1 पृथग्विध, पृथक्छय्या, पृथक्स्थितिः<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथगात्मता
पृथक् + -आत्मता<BR>—1 severalty, separateness.<BR>—2 distinction, difference.<BR>—3 discrimination, judgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथगात्मन्
पृथक् + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> distinct, separate. ━<i>m.</i> the individual spirit<BR> or soul (जीवात्मा); (opp. to universal spirit or soul); Mb. 13. 120. 8;<BR> Bhāg. 8. 24. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथगात्मिका
पृथक् + -आत्मिका individual existence, individuality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्करणम्
पृथक् + -करणम्, -क्रिया<BR>—1 separating, distinguishing. —2 analysing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्क्रिया
पृथक् + -करणम्, -क्रिया<BR>—1 separating, distinguishing. —2 analysing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्कार्यम्
पृथक् + -कार्यम् a separate or private affair; तेषां ग्राम्याणि कार्याणि<BR> पृथक् कार्याणि चैव हि Ms. 7. 120.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्कुल
पृथक् + -कुल <i>a.</i> belonging to a different family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्क्षेत्राः
पृथक् + -क्षेत्राः <i>m.</i> (pl.) children of one father by different wives,<BR> or by wives of different classes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्चर
पृथक् + -चर <i>a.</i> going alone or separately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथग्जनः|पृथग्जन
पृथक् + -जनः —1 a low man, an unenlightened,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">Page1044-2</a>]<BR> vulgar man, the mob, low people; न पृथग्जनवच्छुचो वशं वशिनामुत्तम<BR> गन्तुमर्हसि R. 8. 90; Ki. 1. 4. 24.<BR>—2 a fool, a block-head, an ignorant man; विविनक्ति न बुद्धिदुर्विधः<BR> स्वयमेव स्वहितं पृथग्जनः Śi. 16. 39.<BR>—3 a wicked man, sinner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथग्धर्मिन्
पृथक् + -धर्मिन् <i>a.</i> one holding ‘dual’ (द्वैत) doctrine; Mb. 12. 232. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्पर्णी
पृथक् + -पर्णी N. of a plant, Hemionitis Cordifolia (Mar. पिठवण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्पिण्डः|पृथक्पिण्ड
पृथक् + -पिण्डः a distant relation who offers the funeral rice-ball separately<BR> and not together with other relations; Ms. 5. 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथग्बीजः|पृथग्बीज
पृथक् + -बीजः the marking-nut (Mar. बिब्बा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथग्भावः|पृथग्भाव
पृथक् + -भावः separateness, individuality; (so पृथक्त्वम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथग्योगकरणम्
पृथक् + -योगकरणम् the separation of a grammatical rule into two.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथग्रूप
पृथक् + -रूप^1 <i>a.</i> of different shapes or kinds.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथग्विध|पृथग्विधः
पृथक् + -विध <i>a.</i> of different kinds, diverse, various.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्छय्या
पृथक् + -शय्या sleeping apart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्स्थितिः|पृथक्स्थिति
पृथक् + -स्थितिः <i>f.</i> separate existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्त्वम्
पृथक्त्वम्<BR>—1 Separateness, severalty.<BR>—2 Individuality.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पृथक्त्वनिवेशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथक्त्वनिवेशः
पृथक्त्वम् + -निवेशः Subsistence on separateness; पृथक्त्वनिवेशात् संख्यया<BR> कर्मभेदः स्यात् and also संख्यायाश्च पृथक्त्वनिवेशात् Ms. 10. 5. 17;<BR> यावति संभवति तावति पृथक्त्वनिवेश एव युक्तः ŚB. on MS. 5. 3. 2.<BR> Hence पृथक्त्वनिवेशिन्. It is considered to be a characteristic<BR> feature of संख्या; ŚB. on MS. 5. 3. 2. पृथक्त्वेन (Instr. used<BR> as adv.) Individually, separately; यथा लोके पृथक्त्वेनापि कुर्वाणानां<BR> बहुवचनं दृश्यते, देवश्चेद् वर्षेद् बहवः कृषिं कुर्युः ŚB. on MS. 10. 6. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथवी
पृथवी See पृथिवी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथा
पृथा N. of Kuntī, one of the two wives of Pāṇḍu.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पृथाजः, पृथातनयः, पृथासुतः, पृथासूनुः, पृथापतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथाजः|पृथाज
पृथा + -जः, -तनयः, -सुतः, -सूनुः an epithet of the first three Pāṇḍava<BR> princes, but generally applied only to Arjuna; अश्वत्थामा हत इति पृथासूनुना<BR> स्पष्टमुक्त्वा Ve. 3. 9; अभितस्तं पृथासूनुः स्नेहेन परितस्तरे Ki. 11. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथातनयः|पृथातनय
पृथा + -जः, -तनयः, -सुतः, -सूनुः an epithet of the first three Pāṇḍava<BR> princes, but generally applied only to Arjuna; अश्वत्थामा हत इति पृथासूनुना<BR> स्पष्टमुक्त्वा Ve. 3. 9; अभितस्तं पृथासूनुः स्नेहेन परितस्तरे Ki. 11. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथासुतः|पृथासुत
पृथा + -जः, -तनयः, -सुतः, -सूनुः an epithet of the first three Pāṇḍava<BR> princes, but generally applied only to Arjuna; अश्वत्थामा हत इति पृथासूनुना<BR> स्पष्टमुक्त्वा Ve. 3. 9; अभितस्तं पृथासूनुः स्नेहेन परितस्तरे Ki. 11. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथासूनुः|पृथासूनु
पृथा + -जः, -तनयः, -सुतः, -सूनुः an epithet of the first three Pāṇḍava<BR> princes, but generally applied only to Arjuna; अश्वत्थामा हत इति पृथासूनुना<BR> स्पष्टमुक्त्वा Ve. 3. 9; अभितस्तं पृथासूनुः स्नेहेन परितस्तरे Ki. 11. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथापतिः|पृथापति
पृथा + -पतिः an epithet of Pāṇḍu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथिका
पृथिका A centipede.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथिवी
पृथिवी [cf. Uṇ. 1. 184]<BR>—1 The earth; (sometimes written पृथिवि also). पृथिव्यां त्रीणि रत्नानि<BR> जलमन्नं सुभाषितम्.<BR>—2 Ground, soil.<BR>—3 The earth considered as one of the nine substances or five primary elements.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पृथिवीन्द्रः, पृथिवीशः, पृथिवीक्षित्, पृथिवीकम्पः, पृथिवीतलम्, पृथिवीपतिः, पृथिवीभृत्, पृथिवीमण्डलः, पृथिवीमण्डलम्, पृथिवीरुहः, पृथिवीलोकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथिवीन्द्रः|पृथिवीन्द्र|पृथिवींद्र
पृथिवी + -इन्द्रः, -ईशः, -क्षित् <i>m.</i>, {@-पालः, -पालकः, -भुज्@} <i>m.</i>, {@-भुजः, -शुक्रः@}<BR> a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथिवीशः|पृथिवीश
पृथिवी + -इन्द्रः, -ईशः, -क्षित् <i>m.</i>, {@-पालः, -पालकः, -भुज्@} <i>m.</i>, {@-भुजः, -शुक्रः@}<BR> a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथिवीक्षित्
पृथिवी + -इन्द्रः, -ईशः, -क्षित् <i>m.</i>, {@-पालः, -पालकः, -भुज्@} <i>m.</i>, {@-भुजः, -शुक्रः@}<BR> a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथिवीकम्पः|पृथिवीकम्प
पृथिवी + -कम्पः an earthquake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1044-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृथिवीतलम्
