पृश्नि (-ष्णि) + .{@-श्निः@} A dwarf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृश्नि|पृश्निः
पृश्नि (-ष्णि) + .{@-श्नि@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A ray of light.<BR>—2 The earth.<BR>—3 The starry sky.<BR>—4 N. of Devakī, mother of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—5 A cloud.<BR>—6 Milk.<BR>—7 A dappled cow.<BR>—8 The earth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पृश्निगर्भः, पृश्निधरः, पृश्निभद्रः, पृश्निपर्णिका, पृश्निपर्णी, पृश्निशृङ्गः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

