पृश्निधरः|पृश्निधर
पृश्नि + -गर्भः, -धरः, -भद्रः epithets of Viṣṇu-Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

