पृश्निपर्णी
पृश्नि + -पर्णिका, -पर्णी Hermionitis Cordifolia (Mar. पिठवण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

