पृश्नि + -शृङ्गः<BR>—1 an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—2 of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

