पृश्नि(ष्णि)का, पृश्नी(ष्णी) N. of an aquatic plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्णिका
पृश्नि(ष्णि)का, पृश्नी(ष्णी) N. of an aquatic plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृश्नी
पृश्नि(ष्णि)का, पृश्नी(ष्णी) N. of an aquatic plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्णी
पृश्नि(ष्णि)का, पृश्नी(ष्णी) N. of an aquatic plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्
पृष् €1 Ā. (पर्षते)<BR>—1 To sprinkle.<BR>—2 To hurt, injure.<BR>—3 To give<BR>—4 To vex, pain, weary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषत्|पृषन्त्
पृषत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Spotted, variegated.<BR>—2 Sprinkling. ━<i>m.</i> The spotted antelope; ‘पृषन्मृगे पुमान् बिन्दौ न द्वयोः पृषतोऽपि ना’ इति कोशः; Viś. Guṇā. 192.<BR> ━<i>n.</i> A drop of<BR> water or of any other liquid; (said by some to be used only in pl.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पृषदंशः, पृषदश्वः, पृषदाज्यम्, पृषत्पतिः, पृषद्बलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषदंशः|पृषदंश
पृषत् + -अंशः, -अश्वः<BR>—1 wind, air; पृषदश्वो धनेशश्च महेशश्च दिगीश्वराः Śiva B. 6. 44.<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषदश्वः|पृषदश्व
पृषत् + -अंशः, -अश्वः<BR>—1 wind, air; पृषदश्वो धनेशश्च महेशश्च दिगीश्वराः Śiva B. 6. 44.<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषदाज्यम्
पृषत् + -आज्यम् ghee mixed with coagulated milk; संभृतं पृषदाज्यम् Rv. 10. 90. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषत्पतिः
पृषत् + -पतिः (पृषतांपतिः) wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषद्बलः|पृषद्बल
पृषत् + -बलः N. of the horse of Wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषत|पृषतः
पृषत <i>a.</i> [पृष्-अतच् किच्च] Spotted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषतः|पृषत
पृषत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 The spotted antelope; तौ तत्र हत्वा चतुरो महामृगान् वराहमृश्यं<BR> पृषतं महारुरुम् Rām. 2. 52. 102.<BR>—2 A drop of water; सकृदेव कृतो रावः सरक्तपृषतो धनैः Rām. 7. 32. 22;<BR> पृषतैरपां शमयता च रजः Ki. 6. 27; R. 3. 3, 4. 27, 6. 51.<BR>—3 A spot, mark.<BR>—4 An antelope considered as the vehicle of Vāyu.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पृषताश्वः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषताश्वः|पृषताश्व
पृषत + -अश्वः air, wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषत्कः|पृषत्क
पृषत्कः<BR>—1 An arrow; पृषत्कबाणविशिखाः Ak.; तदुपोढैश्च नभश्चरैः पृषत्कः<BR> Ki. 13. 23; Śi. 20. 18; Vb. 1. 1; धनुर्भृतां हस्तवतां पृषत्काः<BR> R. 7. 45; चकास्ति यल्लोचनयोः पृषत्कता Rām. Ch. 2. 5. पृषत्कोत्कृत्तमस्तकाः<BR> Śiva B. 13. 108.<BR>—2 A round spot.<BR>—3 The versed sine of an arc; Gaṇitādhyāya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषन्तिः|पृषन्ति|पृषंति|पृषंतिः
पृषन्तिः A drop of water; पयःपृषन्तिभिः स्पृष्टा वान्ति वाताः शनैः<BR> शनैः Bharata on Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषभाषा
पृषभाषा = पूषभासा q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषाकरा
पृषाकरा A small stone used as a weight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1045-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषातकम्
पृषातकम् Mixture of ghee and coagulated milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषोदरः|पृषोदर
पृषोदरः Wind, air. (The word is supposed to be compounded of पृषत्<BR> and उदर, the त् of पृषत् being dropped as an irregular case.<BR> The word is thus taken as the type of a whole class of such irregular<BR> compounds.) पूषोदरादित्वात् साधुः, see Gaṇa. to P. VI. 3. 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृषोद्यानम्
पृषोद्यानम् A small garden; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ट
पृष्ट <i>p. p.</i> [पृष्-प्रच्छ्-वा क्त]<BR>—1 Asked, inquired, interrogated, questioned.<BR>—2 Sprinkled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्टम्
पृष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@} A question, an inquiry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्टिः|पृष्टि
पृष्टिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Inquiry, interrogation.<BR>—2 Ved. A rib.<BR>—3 Touch.<BR>—4 A ray of light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्टहायनः|पृष्टहायन
पृष्टहायनः<BR>—1 A species of grain.<BR>—2 An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठम्
पृष्ठम् [पृष् स्पृश्-वा थक् नि˚; Uṇ. 2. 12]<BR>—1 The back, hinder part, rear; धर्मः स्तनोऽधर्मपथोऽस्य पृष्ठः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 1. 32.<BR>—2 The back of an animal; अश्वपृष्ठमारूढः &c.<BR>—3 The surface or upper side; मरुपृष्ठान्युदम्भांसि (चकार) R. 4. 31, 12. 67;<BR> आसन्नभूपृष्ठमियाय देवः Ku. 7. 51; so अवनिपृष्ठचारिणीम् U. 3.<BR>—4 The back or the other side (of a letter, document &c.); लेख्यस्य<BR> पृष्ठेऽभिलिखेद्दत्त्वा दत्त्वर्णिको धनम् Y. 2. 93.<BR>—5 The flat roof of a house.<BR>—6 The page of a book. (पृष्ठेन, पृष्ठे ‘behind, from behind’).<BR>—7 Remainder (शेष); ‘पृष्ठं चरममात्रे स्यात्’ इति विश्वः; एष भारतयुद्धस्य<BR> पृष्ठं संशयमिष्यति Mb. 5. 167. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पृष्ठानुग, पृष्ठगामिन्, पृष्ठयायिन्, पृष्ठाष्ठीलः, पृष्ठाष्ठीलम्, पृष्ठास्थि, पृष्ठाक्षेपः, पृष्ठोदय, पृष्ठग, पृष्ठगामिन्, पृष्ठगोपः, पृष्ठरक्षः, पृष्ठग्रन्थि, पृष्ठचक्षुस्, पृष्ठतल्पनम्, पृष्ठतापः, पृष्ठदृष्टिः, पृष्ठपातिन्, पृष्ठपीठी, पृष्ठफलम्, पृष्ठभङ्गः, पृष्ठभागः, पृष्ठभूमि, पृष्ठमांसम्, पृष्ठयानम्, पृष्ठलग्न, पृष्ठवंशः, पृष्ठवास्तु, पृष्ठवाह्, पृष्ठशय, पृष्ठशृङ्गः, पृष्ठशृङ्गिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठानुग
पृष्ठम् + -अनुग, -गामिन्, -यायिन् <i>a.</i> going behind, following; युद्धकालेऽग्रगो<BR> यः स्यात् सदा पृष्ठानुगः पुरे Pt. 1. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठगामिन्
पृष्ठम् + -अनुग, -गामिन्, -यायिन् <i>a.</i> going behind, following; युद्धकालेऽग्रगो<BR> यः स्यात् सदा पृष्ठानुगः पुरे Pt. 1. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठयायिन्
पृष्ठम् + -अनुग, -गामिन्, -यायिन् <i>a.</i> going behind, following; युद्धकालेऽग्रगो<BR> यः स्यात् सदा पृष्ठानुगः पुरे Pt. 1. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठाष्ठीलः|पृष्ठाष्ठील
पृष्ठम् + -अष्ठीलः, -अष्ठीलम् the back of a tortoise; B. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठाष्ठीलम्
पृष्ठम् + -अष्ठीलः, -अष्ठीलम् the back of a tortoise; B. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठास्थि
पृष्ठम् + -अस्थि <i>n.</i> the back-bone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठाक्षेपः|पृष्ठाक्षेप
पृष्ठम् + -आक्षेपः acute and violent pain in the back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठोदय|पृष्ठोदयः
पृष्ठम् + -उदय <i>a.</i> an epithet of particular signs of the zodiac, <i>i. e.</i><BR> Aries, Taurus, Gemini, Sagittarius and Capricorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठग
पृष्ठम् + -ग <i>a.</i> mounted, riding on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठगामिन्
पृष्ठम् + -गामिन् <i>a.</i> faithful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठगोपः|पृष्ठगोप
पृष्ठम् + -गोपः, -रक्षः a soldier who protects the rear of a warrior while<BR> he is fighting; पृष्ठगोपांश्च तस्याथ हत्वा परमसायकैः Mb. 4. 33. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

