पृष्ठकम्
पृष्ठकम् The back. (पृष्ठके कृ<BR>—1 to put off, postpone.<BR>—2 to resign, give up, discard.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठतस्
पृष्ठतस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Behind, behind the back, from behind; गच्छतः पृष्ठतोऽन्वियात् Ms. 4. 154, 8. 300;<BR> नमः पुरस्तादथ पृष्ठतस्ते Bg. 11. 40.<BR>—2 Towards the back, backwards; गच्छ पृष्ठतः.<BR>—3 On the back.<BR>—4 Behind the back, secretly, covertly. (पृष्ठतः कृ means<BR>—1 to place on the back, leave behind.<BR>—2 to neglect, forsake, abandon.<BR>—3 to renounce, desist from, leave off, resign; येनाशाः पृष्ठतः कृत्वा<BR> नैराश्यमवलम्बितम् H. 1. 124; लज्जां पृष्टतः कृत्वा K.; पृष्ठतो<BR> गम् to follow; पृष्ठतो भू<BR>—1 to stand at the back.<BR>—2 to be disregarded.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पृष्ठ्य|पृष्ठ्यं|पृष्ठ्यः
