पॄ
पॄ €3. €9 P. (पिपर्ति, पृणाति, पपार, अपारीत्, परि(री)ष्यति, परि(री)तुम्,<BR> पूर्ण; <i>pass.</i> पूर्यते; <i>caus.</i> पूरयति-ते; <i>desid.</i><BR> पिपरिरी-षति, पुपूर्षति)<BR>—1 To fill, fill up, complete.<BR>—2 To fulfil, gratify (as hopes &c.).<BR>—3 To fill with wind, blow (as a conch, flute &c.).<BR>—4 To satisfy, refresh, please; पितॄनपारात् Bk. 1. 2.<BR>—5 To rear, bring up, nourish, nurture, cherish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1046-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

