पेय <i>a.</i> [पा-पाने कर्मणि यत्]<BR>—1 Drinkable, fit to be quaffed or drunk; भोज्यं पेयं तथा चूष्यं लेह्यं<BR> खाद्यं च चर्वणम् । निष्पेयं चैव भक्ष्यं स्यादन्नमष्टविधं स्मृतम्<BR> Rājanighaṇṭu.<BR>—2 Sapid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेयम्
पेय + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 Water.<BR>—2 Milk.<BR>—3 A drink, beverage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पेया
