पेयूषः|पेयूष|पेयूषं
पेयूषः, -षम्<BR>—1 Nectar.<BR>—2 The milk of a cow that has calved within seven days; सप्तरात्रप्रसूतायाः<BR> क्षीरं पेयूषमुच्यते Hārāvalī; Ms. 5. 6.<BR>—3 Fresh ghee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1047-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

