पैच्छिल्यम् Sliminess, mucilaginousness; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैञ्जूषः|पैञ्जूष|पैंजूष|पैंजूषः
