पैठर|पैठरं
पैठर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR> Boiled in a पिठर, q. v.; Rām. 2. 91. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1047-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैठीनसिः|पैठीनसि
