पैण्डिक्यम्
पैण्डिक्यम्, पैण्डिन्यम् Living on alms, mendicity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैण्डिन्यम्
पैण्डिक्यम्, पैण्डिन्यम् Living on alms, mendicity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैता
पैता (in comp.) Vṛddhi form of पिता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतापुत्रीय
पैतापुत्रीय <i>a.</i> Relating to father and son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतामह|पैतामहं
पैतामह <i>a.</i> (-ही <i>f.</i>)<BR> [पितामह-अण्]<BR>—1 Relating to a paternal grandfather.<BR>—2 Inherited or derived from a paternal grandfather.<BR>—3 Derived from, presided over by, or relating to, Brahmā; यच्च पैतामहं<BR> स्थानम् Mb. 12. 160. 32; अयोध्या सृष्टलोकेव सद्यः पैतामही तनुः<BR> (बभौ) R. 15. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतामहाः
पैतामह + .{@-हाः@} (pl.) Ancestors, forefathers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतामहम्
पैतामह + .{@-हम्@} The lunar mansion Rohiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतामहिक
पैतामहिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to a paternal grandfather (also पैतामहक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतृ
पैतृ (in comp.) Vṛddhi form of पितृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतृक|पैतृकं
पैतृक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [पितृत आगतं पितुरिदं वा ठञ्]<BR>—1 Relating to a father.<BR>—2 Coming or derived from a father, ancestral, paternal; पदमृद्धमजेन<BR> पैतृकं विनयेनास्य नवं च यौवनम् R. 8. 6, 18. 40; Ms. 9. 104; Y. 2. 47.<BR>—3 Sacred to the Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतृकम्
पैतृक + .{@-कम्@} A Śrāddha performed in honour of the Manes or deceased ancestors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतृमत्यः|पैतृमत्य
पैतृमत्यः<BR>—1 The son of an unmarried woman (पितृमत्याः पुत्रः).<BR>—2 The son of an illustrious person (पितृमतः पुत्रः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतृष्वसेयः|पैतृष्वसेय
पैतृष्वसेयः, पैतृष्वस्रीयः, पैतृष्वस्रेयः The son of a paternal<BR> aunt; पैतृष्वस्रेयप्रीत्यर्थम् Bhāg. 1. 19. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतृष्वस्रीयः|पैतृष्वस्रीय
पैतृष्वसेयः, पैतृष्वस्रीयः, पैतृष्वस्रेयः The son of a paternal<BR> aunt; पैतृष्वस्रेयप्रीत्यर्थम् Bhāg. 1. 19. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतृष्वस्रेयः|पैतृष्वस्रेय
पैतृष्वसेयः, पैतृष्वस्रीयः, पैतृष्वस्रेयः The son of a paternal<BR> aunt; पैतृष्वस्रेयप्रीत्यर्थम् Bhāg. 1. 19. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पैतृष्वसेयी
पैतृष्वसेयः, पैतृष्वस्रीयः, पैतृष्वस्रेयः + .{@-यी@} the daughter of a paternal aunt; पैतृष्वसेयीं भगिनीम् Ms. 11. 171.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1048-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

