पोतः + -प्लवः a mariner, seaman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतभङ्गः|पोतभङ्ग|पोतभंग
पोतः + -भङ्गः a ship-wreck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतरक्षः|पोतरक्ष
पोतः + -रक्षः the rudder of a boat or ship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतवणिज्
पोतः + -वणिज् <i>m.</i> a sea-faring merchant; धत्ते पोतवणिग्जनैर्धनदतां<BR> यस्यान्तिके सागरः Śiva B. 29. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतवाहः|पोतवाह
पोतः + -वाहः a rower, steersman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतकः|पोतक
पोतकः<BR>—1 The young of an animal.<BR>—2 A young plant.<BR>—3 The site of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतायितम्
पोतायितम् <i>p. p.</i> of the denominative of पोत; an elephantʼs<BR> roar produced with the lips and (or) soft palate; तत् पोतायितमोष्ठतालुजनितम्<BR> Mātaṅga L. 2. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतन
पोतन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sacred, holy.<BR>—2 Purifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतासः|पोतास
पोतासः A kind of camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोतृ
पोतृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 One of the sixteen officiating priests at a sacrifice (assistant of<BR> the priest called ब्रह्मन्).<BR>—2 An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोत्या
