पोत्रम्
पोत्रम् [पू-त्र]<BR>—1 The snout of a hog; धृतविधुरधरं महावराहं गिरिगुरुपोत्रमपीहितैर्जयन्तम्<BR> Bk. 10. 60; Ki. 13. 53.<BR>—2 A boat, ship.<BR>—3 A plough share.<BR>—4 The thunderbolt.<BR>—5 A garment.<BR>—6 The office of the Potṛ.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: पोत्रायुधः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

