पोत्रम् + -आयुधः a hog, boar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोत्रिन्
पोत्रिन् <i>m.</i> A hog, boar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोथः|पोथ
पोथः A blow, stroke; तथा तयोर्गदापोथैर्दिशः सर्वाः प्रतिश्रुताः<BR> Rām. 7. 32. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोथकी
पोथकी Red pimples on the eyelids (Mar. रांजणबाडी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोप्लूयमान
पोप्लूयमान <i>a.</i> Floating often and often; (पुष्पसंचयान्)<BR> पोप्लूयमानानपरान् पश्य त्वं तनुमध्यमे Rām. 2. 95. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

