पोलः|पोल
पोलः<BR>—1 A heap.<BR>—2 Bulk, magnitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पोलिका
