पोषः|पोष
पोषः [पुष्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Nourishing, supporting, maintaining.<BR>—2 Nourishment, growth, increase, advance.<BR>—3 Prosperity, plenty, abundance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1049-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

