पौलस्त्यः|पौलस्त्य
पौलस्त्यः<BR>—1 An epithet of Rāvaṇa; पौलस्त्यः कथमन्यदारहरणे दोषं न विज्ञातवान्<BR> Pt. 2. 4; R. 4. 80, 10. 5, 12. 72.<BR>—2 Of Kubera.<BR>—3 Of Bibhīṣaṇa.<BR>—4 The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

