पौलिः|पौलि
पौलिः <i>m., f.</i>, पौली <i>f.</i> A kind of cake (Mar. पोळी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौली
पौलिः <i>m., f.</i>, पौली <i>f.</i> A kind of cake (Mar. पोळी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौलोम|पौलोमः
पौलोम <i>a.</i> (-मी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to or descended from, Puloman or Pulomā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौलोमः|पौलोम
पौलोम + .{@-मः@} N. of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौलोमी
