पौष्कलः|पौष्कल
पौष्कलः A species of grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

