पौष्टिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Promoting growth or welfare; मन्त्रवर्जं न दुष्यन्ति कुर्वाणाः पौष्टिकीः<BR> क्रियाः Mb. 12. 296. 29.<BR>—2 Nourishing, nutritive, nutritious, invigorating.<BR>—3 Preservative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौष्टिकम्
पौष्टिक + .{@-कम्@} A cloth worn during the tonsure ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौष्णम्
पौष्णम् The lunar mansion called Revatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौष्प|पौष्पं
पौष्प <i>a.</i> (-ष्पी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [पुष्प्-अण्] Relating to or coming from flowers,<BR> floral, flowery; धनुः पौष्पं मौर्वी मधुकरमयी पञ्च विशिखाः Ā. L.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौष्पी
पौष्प + .{@-ष्पी@}<BR>—1 N. of the town पाटलिपुत्र q. v.<BR>—2 A kind of spirituous liquor (made from flowers).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

पौष्पकम्
पौष्पकम् Green vitriol; oxide of brass (Mar. जस्ताचें फूल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्याट्
प्याट् <i>ind.</i> A particle of calling (hol, hallo).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1051-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्याय्
प्याय् €1 Ā. (प्यायते, प्यान or पीन) To swell, grow; see प्यै below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्यान
प्यान <i>a.</i> Fat, grown fat; cf. पीन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्यायन
प्यायन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Invigorating.<BR>—2 Promoting strength or growth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्यायनम्
प्यायन + .{@-नम्@} Increase, growth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्यायित
प्यायित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Grown, increased.<BR>—2 Grown fat.<BR>—3 Refreshed, strengthened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्युष्
प्युष् I. €4 P. To divide (also प्युस् and पुष्). ━II. €10 P. To<BR> void (प्योषयति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्यै
प्यै €1 Ā. (प्यायते, पीन)<BR>—1 To grow, increase, swell; अताय्यस्योत्तमं सत्त्वमप्यायि कृतकृत्यवत् Bk. 6. 33.<BR>—2 To become full or exuberant.<BR>—3 To overfill, surcharge. ━<i>Caus.</i> (प्याययति-ते)<BR>—1 To increase, enlarge, make fat or comfortable; यैः कृतः … … क्षयी<BR> चाप्यायितः सोमः Ms. 9. 314.<BR>—2 To gratify, regale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्र
प्र <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 As a prefix to verbs it means ‘forward’, ‘forth’, ‘in front’, ‘onward’,<BR> ‘before’, ‘away’, as in प्रगम्, प्रस्था, प्रचर्, प्रया &c.<BR>—2 With adjectives it means ‘very’, ‘excessively’, ‘very much’ &c.; प्रकृष्ट,<BR> प्रमत्त &c., see further on.<BR>—3 With nouns whether derived from verbs or not, it is used in the following<BR> senses according to G. M.:−<BR>——(<i>a</i>) beginning, commencement; (प्रयाणम्, प्रस्थानम्, प्राह्ण);<BR>——(<i>b</i>) length (प्रबालभूषिक);<BR>——(<i>c</i>) power (प्रभु);<BR>——(<i>d</i>) intensity, excess (प्रवाद, प्रकर्ष, प्रच्छाय प्रगुण);<BR>——(<i>e</i>) source or origin (प्रभव, प्रपौत्र);<BR>——(<i>f</i>) completion, perfectness, satisfaction (प्रभुक्तमन्नम्);<BR>——(<i>g</i>) destitution, separation, being without (प्रोषिता, प्रपर्णवृक्षः);<BR>——(<i>h</i>) apart (प्रज्ञु);<BR>——(<i>i</i>) excellence (प्राचार्यः);<BR>——(<i>j</i>) purity (प्रसन्नं जलम्);<BR>——(<i>k</i>) wish (प्रार्थना);<BR>——(<i>l</i>) cessation (प्रशम);<BR>——(<i>m</i>) adoration, respect (प्राञ्जलिः who respectfully folds his<BR> hands together);<BR>——(<i>n</i>) prominence (प्रणस, प्रवाल). In the Veda it is often used<BR> as a separable adverb; cf. प्र आदिकर्मदीर्घेशभृशसंभवतृप्तिवियोगशुद्धिशक्तीच्छाशान्तिपूजाग्रदर्शनेषु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रौगम्
प्रौगम् A triangle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकच
प्रकच <i>a.</i> Having the hair erect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकट|प्रकटं
प्रकट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Evident, plain, clear, apparent, manifest.<BR>—2 Undisguised, public; अप्रकटीकृतशक्तिः शक्तोऽपि जनस्तिरस्क्रियां<BR> लभते Pt. 1. 31.<BR>—3 Visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकटम्
प्रकट + .{@-टम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Clearly, manifestly, evidently.<BR>—2 Publicly, openly, undisguisedly. (प्रकटीकृ to manifest, unfold,<BR> display; गुह्यं च गूहति गुणान् प्रकटीकरोति Bh. 2. 72; Pt. 1. 31;<BR> प्रकटीभू ‘to become manifest, appear’).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रकटप्रीतिवर्धनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकटप्रीतिवर्धनः|प्रकटप्रीतिवर्धन
प्रकट + -प्रीतिवर्धनः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकटनम्
प्रकटनम् The act of manifesting, disclosing, unfolding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकटति
प्रकटति Den. P. To become manifest or visible, appear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकटयति
प्रकटयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To show, manifest, display, exhibit; औज्ज्वल्यं परभागतः प्रकटयत्याभोगभीमं<BR> तमः Māl. 5. 11;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">Page1052-2</a>]<BR> N. 4. 151; Ratn. 4. 16.<BR>—2 To proclaim, announce publicly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकटित|प्रकटितं
प्रकटित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Manifested, displayed, unfolded.<BR>—2 Publicly exhibited.<BR>—3 Apparent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकथ्
प्रकथ् €10 U. To announce, proclaim, narrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकथनम्
प्रकथनम् Announcing, narration; P. I. 3. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकम्प्|प्रकंप्
प्रकम्प् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To shake, quiver, tremble; प्राकम्पत भुजः सव्यः Rām.; प्राकम्पत<BR> महाशैलः Mb.<BR>—2 To vibrate (as sound).<BR>—3 To become loose, be loosened. ━<i>Caus.</i> To shake, put in motion;<BR> प्राचकम्पदुदन्वन्तम् Bk. 15. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकम्पः|प्रकम्प|प्रकंप|प्रकंपः
प्रकम्पः Trembling, shaking, quivering, violent motion or tremour;<BR> बाला चाहं मनसिजवशात् प्राप्तगाढप्रकम्पा Subhāṣ; सशिरः प्रकम्पम् Śi. 13. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकम्पन|प्रकंपन|प्रकम्पनः
प्रकम्पन <i>a.</i> Causing to shake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकम्पनः|प्रकम्पन|प्रकंपन
प्रकम्पन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 Wind, violent wind or gust; प्रकम्पनेनानुचकम्पिरे सुराः Śi. 1. 61, 14. 43.<BR>—2 N. of a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकम्पनम्
प्रकम्पन + .{@-नम्@} Excessive or violent trembling, violent motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकम्पिन्|प्रकंपिन्
प्रकम्पिन् <i>a.</i> Swinging, shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकल्
प्रकल् €10 U.<BR>—1 To pursue, go after; प्रकाल्यमानस्तेनायं शूलहस्तेन रक्षसा Mb. 3. 137. 7.<BR>—2 To urge on, incite.<BR>—3 To hurt, injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकालन|प्रकालनः
प्रकालन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Killing, hurting; ध्रुवस्य पुत्रो भगवान् कालो लोकप्रकालनः Mb. 1. 66. 21.<BR>—2 Pursuing, chasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकालनः|प्रकालन
प्रकालन + .{@-नः@} N. of a Nāga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकालनम्
प्रकालन + .{@-नम्@} Hurting, killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकला
प्रकला A minute portion.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रकलाविद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकलाविद्
प्रकला + -विद् <i>a.</i> ignorant. ━(<i>m.</i>) a merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाङ्क्षा
प्रकाङ्क्षा Appetite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाण्डः|प्रकाण्ड|प्रकांड|प्रकांडं|प्रकांडः
प्रकाण्डः, -ण्डम्<BR>—1 The trunk of a tree from the root to the branches; कदलीप्रकाण्डरुचिरोरुतरुः Śi. 9. 45.<BR>—2 A branch, shoot.<BR>—3 (At the end of comp.) anything excellent or pre-eminent of its kind;<BR> ऊरुप्रकाण्डद्वितयेन तस्याः N. 7. 93; क्षत्रप्रकाण्डः Mv. 4. 35, 5. 48.<BR>—4 A kind of necklace; Kau. A. 2. 11. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाण्डम्
प्रकाण्डः, -ण्डम्<BR>—1 The trunk of a tree from the root to the branches; कदलीप्रकाण्डरुचिरोरुतरुः Śi. 9. 45.<BR>—2 A branch, shoot.<BR>—3 (At the end of comp.) anything excellent or pre-eminent of its kind;<BR> ऊरुप्रकाण्डद्वितयेन तस्याः N. 7. 93; क्षत्रप्रकाण्डः Mv. 4. 35, 5. 48.<BR>—4 A kind of necklace; Kau. A. 2. 11. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाण्डः|प्रकाण्ड|प्रकांड|प्रकांडं|प्रकांडः
प्रकाण्डः, -ण्डम् + .{@-ण्डः@} The upper part of the arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाण्डकः|प्रकाण्डक|प्रकांडक|प्रकांडकः
प्रकाण्डकः See प्रकाण्ड above; दण्डकानध्यवात्तां यौ वीर<BR> रक्षःप्रकाण्डकौ Bk. 5. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाण्डरः|प्रकाण्डर|प्रकांडर|प्रकांडरः
प्रकाण्डरः A tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाम|प्रकामं|प्रकामः
प्रकाम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Amorous.<BR>—2 Excessive, much, to the heartʼs content, at pleasure; प्रकामविस्तार<BR> R. 2. 11; प्रकामालोकनीयताम् Ku. 2. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकामः|प्रकाम|प्रकामं
प्रकाम + .{@-मः@} Desire, pleasure, satisfaction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकामम्
प्रकाम + .{@-मम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Very much, exceedingly; जातो ममायं विशदः प्रकामम् (अन्तरात्मा)<BR> Ś. 4. 22; R. 6. 44; Mk. 5. 25.<BR>—2 Sufficiently, to the heartʼs content, according to wish or desire.<BR>—3 Voluntarily, willingly; ये तिष्ठन्ति भवन्तु तेऽपि गमने कामं प्रकामोद्यमाः Mu. 1. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकामभुज्
प्रकाम + .{@-भुज्@} <i>a.</i> eating till satisfied or to the heartʼs content; न<BR> प्रकामभुजः श्राद्धे स्वधासंग्रहतत्पराः R. 1. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1052-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकामतः
प्रकामतः <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 At will.<BR>—2 With pleasure, willingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाश्
प्रकाश् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To shine, gleam; look brilliant.<BR>—2 To become visible or manifest, come to light; to be apparent, appear;<BR> एष सर्वेषु भूतेषु गूढात्मा न प्रकाशते Kaṭh. 1. 3. 12.<BR>—3 To look or appear like. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To show, display, manifest, discover; अवसरोऽयमात्मानं प्रकाशयितुम्<BR> Ś. 1; Sāṅ. K. 59.<BR>—2 To disclose, unfold, reveal.<BR>—3 To bring to light, make public, proclaim; कदाचित् कुपितं मित्रं<BR> सर्वदोषं प्रकाशयेत् Cāṇ. 20.<BR>—4 To publish, bring out (as a work); प्रणीतः न तु प्रकाशितः U. 4. 5<BR> To illuminate, lighten, irradiate; यथा प्रकाशयत्येकः कृत्स्नं<BR> लोकमिमं रविः Bg. 13. 33, 5. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाश|प्रकाशं|प्रकाशः
प्रकाश <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bright, shining, brilliant; प्रकाशश्चाप्रकाशश्च लोकालोक इवाचलः<BR> R. 1. 68, 5. 2.<BR>—2 Clear, visible, manifest; Śi. 12. 56; नाहं प्रकाशः सर्वस्य योगमायासमावृतः Bg. 7. 25.<BR>—3 Vivid, perspicuous; नयन्ति तेष्वप्युपपन्ननैपुणा गभीरमर्थं कतिचित्<BR> प्रकाशताम् Ki. 14. 4.<BR>—4 Famous, renowned, celebrated, noted; जगत्प्रकाशं यशः R. 3. 48;<BR> पितुः प्रकाशस्य तव द्वितीयः Pratimā 4. 9.<BR>—5 Open, public.<BR>—6 Cleared of trees, open; विपिनानि प्रकाशानि शक्तिमत्त्वाच्चकार सः R. 4. 31.<BR>—7 Blown, expanded.<BR>—8 (At the end of comp.) Looking like, like, resembling; महावनं चैत्ररथप्रकाशम्<BR> Mb. 3. 177. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशः|प्रकाश|प्रकाशं
प्रकाश + .{@-शः@}<BR>—1 Light, lustre, splendour, brightness; यथा प्रकाशतमसोः सम्बन्धो<BR> नोपपद्यते Smṛti.<BR>—2 (Fig.) Light, elucidation, explanation (mostly at the end of titles<BR> of works); काव्यप्रकाश, भावप्रकाश, तर्कप्रकाश &c.<BR>—3 Sunshine; मेघान्तरे सूर्य इव प्रकाशः Mb. 8. 7. 16.<BR>—4 Display, manifestation; Śi. 9. 5.<BR>—5 Fame, renown, celebrity, glory.<BR>—6 Expansion, diffusion.<BR>—7 Open spot or air; प्रकाशं निर्गतोऽवलोकयामि Ś. 4.<BR>—8 A golden mirror.<BR>—9 A chapter or section (of a book).<BR>—10 The gloss on the upper part of a horseʼs body.<BR>—11 Knowledge (ज्ञान); सर्वद्वारेषु देहेऽस्मिन् प्रकाश उपजायते Bg. 14. 11.<BR>—12 Laughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशम्
प्रकाश + .{@-शम्@} Bell-metal, brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशम्
प्रकाश + .{@-शम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Openly, publicly; प्रतिभूर्दापितो यत् तु प्रकाशं धनिनो धनम्<BR> Y. 2. 56; Ms. 8. 193, 9. 228.<BR>—2 Aloud, audibly (used as a stage-direction in drama; opp. आत्मगतम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशे
प्रकाश + .{@-शे@} <i>ind.</i> Openly, publicly.<BR>—2 Visibly.<BR>—3 In the presence of.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रकाशात्मक, प्रकाशात्मन्, प्रकाशेतर, प्रकाशकर, प्रकाशकर्तृ, प्रकाशकर्मन्, प्रकाशक्रयः, प्रकाशनारी, प्रकाशवञ्चकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशात्मक
प्रकाश + -आत्मक <i>a.</i> shining, brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशात्मन्
प्रकाश + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> bright, shining. ━(<i>m.</i>) an epithet of (1) Viṣṇu;<BR> (2) of Śiva; (3) the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशेतर
प्रकाश + -इतर <i>a.</i> invisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशकर
प्रकाश + -कर <i>a.</i> causing manifestation; करणं त्रयोदशविधं तदाहरणधारणप्रकाशकरम् Sāṅ. K. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशकर्तृ
प्रकाश + -कर्तृ, -कर्मन् N. of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशकर्मन्
प्रकाश + -कर्तृ, -कर्मन् N. of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशक्रयः|प्रकाशक्रय
प्रकाश + -क्रयः an open purchase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशनारी
प्रकाश + -नारी a public woman, prostitute, harlot; अलं चतुःशालमिमं<BR> प्रवेश्य प्रकाशनारीधृत एष यस्मात् Mk. 3. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशवञ्चकः|प्रकाशवञ्चक
प्रकाश + -वञ्चकः an open cheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशक|प्रकाशकः
प्रकाशक <i>a.</i> (-शिका <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Illuminating, giving light.<BR>—2 Making apparent, discovering, disclosing, evincing, betraying, displaying.<BR>—3 Expressing, indicating.<BR>—4 Explaining, making clear, expounding.<BR>—5 Bright; shining, brilliant.<BR>—6 Noted, celebrated, renowned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशकः|प्रकाशक
प्रकाशक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 A discoverer.<BR>—3 An expounder.<BR>—4 A publisher.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रकाशकज्ञातृ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशकज्ञातृ
प्रकाशक + -ज्ञातृ <i>m.</i> a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशता
प्रकाशता, -प्रकाशत्वम्<BR>—1 Brilliance, splendour.<BR>—2 Appearance, manifestation.<BR>—3 Renown, celebrity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशत्वम्
प्रकाशता, -प्रकाशत्वम्<BR>—1 Brilliance, splendour.<BR>—2 Appearance, manifestation.<BR>—3 Renown, celebrity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशन|प्रकाशनः
प्रकाशन <i>a.</i> Illuminating, making known &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशनम्
प्रकाशन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Making known or manifest, bringing to light, disclosing.<BR>—2 Displaying, manifesting.<BR>—3 Illuminating, giving light, irradiating, making bright.<BR>—4 Announcement, declaration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशनः|प्रकाशन
प्रकाशन + .{@-नः@} N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशना
प्रकाशन + .{@-ना@} Explaining, teaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशित|प्रकाशितं
प्रकाशित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Made clear or manifested, displayed, manifested.<BR>—2 Published; brought out (as a book).<BR>—3 Illuminated, irradiated, enlightened.<BR>—4 Visible, evident, apparent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशितम्
प्रकाशित + .{@-तम्@} Light, clearness.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रकाशितविरुद्धता, प्रकाशितविरुद्धत्वम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशितविरुद्धता
प्रकाशित + -विरुद्धता, -विरुद्धत्वम् (in Rhet.) a particular awkwardness in expression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशितविरुद्धत्वम्
प्रकाशित + -विरुद्धता, -विरुद्धत्वम् (in Rhet.) a particular awkwardness in expression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाश्य
प्रकाश्य <i>a.</i> To be illuminated, brought to light &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाश्यम्
प्रकाश्य + .{@-श्यम्@} Light; यथाऽनेकचक्षुःप्रकाशो रविर्न क्रमेण प्रकाशीकरोति<BR> प्रकाश्यम् Hastāmalaka Stotra 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकाशिन्
प्रकाशिन् <i>a.</i> Clear, bright, shining &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकुञ्चः|प्रकुञ्च|प्रकुंच|प्रकुंचः
प्रकुञ्चः A particular measure of capacity; (about a handful); प्रकुञ्चः<BR> षोडशीं विश्यं पलमेवात्र कीर्त्यते Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकुप्
प्रकुप् €4 P.<BR>—1 To be angry, to be enraged or provoked at; निमित्तमुद्दिश्य हि यः<BR> प्रकुप्यति ध्रुवं स तस्यापगमे प्रसीदति Pt. 1. 283.<BR>—2 To be excited, gather strength, increase. ━<i>Caus.</i> To provoke,<BR> irritate, exasperate; साधोः प्रकोपितस्यापि मनो नायाति विक्रियाम् Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकुपित
प्रकुपित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Very angry, enraged, incensed.<BR>—2 Excited.<BR>—3 Disordered, deranged.<BR>—4 Moved, shaken; यः पर्वतान् प्रकुपिताँ अरम्णात् Rv. 2. 12. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकोपः|प्रकोप
प्रकोपः<BR>—1 Wrath, fury, rage, violent anger.<BR>—2 Great excitement; provocation, irritation; उपदेशो हि मूर्खाणां प्रकोपाय<BR> न शान्तये Pt. 1. 389.<BR>—3 Insurrection, rebellion, mutiny; as in प्रकृति˚ popular disturbance.<BR>—4 An attack.<BR>—5 (Medic.) Excess, superabundance; vitiation; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकोपन
प्रकोपन, -ण <i>a.</i><BR> Irritating, exciting, provoking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकोपण
प्रकोपन, -ण <i>a.</i><BR> Irritating, exciting, provoking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकोपनम्
प्रकोपन, -ण + .{@-नम्, -णम्@} Provocation, irritation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकोपणम्
प्रकोपन, -ण + .{@-नम्, -णम्@} Provocation, irritation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकोपित
प्रकोपित <i>p. p.</i> Provoked, enraged, incensed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकुलम्
प्रकुलम् A handsome body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकूष्माण्डी|प्रकूष्मांडी
प्रकूष्माण्डी An epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृ
प्रकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To do, perform, commence (used much in the same sense as कृ); जानन्नपि<BR> नरो दैवात् प्रकरोति विगर्हितम् Pt. 4. 35; Mv. 2. 13; Bk. 2. 36; Ṛs. 1. 6;<BR> Ms. 8. 54, 60, 8. 230; व्रीडार्ता प्रकरोति दाडिमफलव्याजेन वाग्बन्धनम् Amaru. 16.<BR>—2 To accomplish, achieve, effect.<BR>—3 To assault, outrage, insult; कुलभार्या प्रकुर्वाणमहं द्रष्टुं दशाननम्<BR> (यामि) Bk. 8. 19.<BR>—4 To honour, worship.<BR>—5 To express, utter; प्रकुर्वते वारिदरोधनिर्गताः परस्परालापमिवामला<BR> दिशः Ki. 4. 31.<BR>—6 To place in front, mention first.<BR>—7 To appoint<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-1" target="_blank">Page1054-1</a>]<BR> (to a post, office &c.); यत् कार्यं पार्थिवेनादौ पार्थिवप्रकृतेन वा Mb. 12. 69. 3.<BR>—8 Ved. To induce.<BR>—9 To win, conquer.<BR>—10 To destroy.<BR>—11 To make divisions (प्रकार); कामद्वेषसमायुक्तो मोहात् प्रकुरुते<BR> भवान् Mb. 5. 168. 18.<BR>—12 To marry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1053-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरः|प्रकर|प्रकरं
प्रकरः<BR>—1 A heap, multitude, quantity, collection; मुक्ताफलप्रकरभाञ्जि गुहागृहाणि<BR> Śi. 5. 12; बाष्पप्रकरकलुषां दृष्टिम् Ś. 6. 9; R. 9. 56; Ku. 5. 68.<BR>—2 A nosegay, bunch of flowers.<BR>—3 Aid, assistance, friendship.<BR>—4 Usage, practice.<BR>—5 Respect.<BR>—6 Seduction, abduction.<BR>—7 Washing, cleansing (संक्षालन); अत्रामत्रप्रकरकरणे वर्ततेऽसौ<BR> नियुक्तः Viś. Guṇā. 154.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरम्
प्रकरः + .{@-रम्@} Aloe-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरणम्
प्रकरणम्<BR>—1 Treating, explaining, discussing.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) A subject, topic, department, a subject (of representation);<BR> कतमत् प्रकरणमाश्रित्य Ś. 1.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) A head or subject of treatment.<BR>——(<i>c</i>) A province or department.<BR>—3 A section, chapter or any smaller division of a work. तस्यायं प्रकरणाधिकरणसमुद्देशः<BR> Kau. A. 1. 1. 1.<BR>—4 An opportunity, occasion.<BR>—5 An affair, a matter; अस्मिन्नेव प्रकरणे धनंजयमुदारधीः (उवाच) Mb. 12. 26. 1.<BR>—6 An introduction, prologue; वयमपि प्रकरणमारभामहे Pratijñā. 1.<BR>—7 Relation.<BR>—8 Doing much or well.<BR>—9 A species of drama with invented or fictitious plot; as the मृच्छकटिक,<BR> मालतीमाधव, पुष्पभूषित &c. The S. D. thus defines it:− भवेत् प्रकरणे<BR> वृत्तं लौकिकं कविकल्पितं । शृङ्गारोऽङ्गी नायकस्तु विप्रोऽमात्योऽथवा वणिक् ।<BR> सापायधर्मकामार्थपरो धीरप्रशान्तकः ॥ 511.<BR>—10 Context. This is one of the six प्रमाणs helpful in properly construing<BR> a विनियोगविधि. These प्रमाणs and their relative strength is<BR> stated by जैमिनि in श्रुतिलिङ्गवाक्यप्रकरणस्थानसमाख्यानां पारदौर्बल्यमर्थविप्रकर्षात्<BR> प्रकरणाच्च ज्योतिष्टोमेनैकवाक्यता स्यात् ŚB. on MS. 10. 5. 37.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रकरणसमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरणसमः|प्रकरणसम
प्रकरणम् + -समः a kind of sophism; an assertion by two opponents of some<BR> argument which has the same force.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरणिका
प्रकरणिका, -प्रकरणी<BR> A drama of the same character as the प्रकरण.<BR> The S. D. thus defines it:− नाटिकैव प्रकरणिका सार्थवाहादिनायिका ।<BR> समानवंशजा नेतुर्भवेद्यत्र च नायिका ॥ 554.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरणी
प्रकरणिका, -प्रकरणी<BR> A drama of the same character as the प्रकरण.<BR> The S. D. thus defines it:− नाटिकैव प्रकरणिका सार्थवाहादिनायिका ।<BR> समानवंशजा नेतुर्भवेद्यत्र च नायिका ॥ 554.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरिका
प्रकरिका An interlude or episode inserted in a drama to explain<BR> what is to follow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकरी
प्रकरी<BR>—1 An interlude or episode inserted in a drama to explain what is to follow.<BR>—2 Theatrical dress.<BR>—3 An open piece of ground.<BR>—4 A place where four roads meet.<BR>—5 A kind of song.<BR>—6 The proper site of any magical operations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकारः|प्रकार
प्रकारः<BR>—1 Manner, mode, way, fashion; कः प्रकारः किमेतत् Māl. 5. 20.<BR>—2 Sort, kind, variety, species; oft. in comp.; बहुप्रकार manifold;<BR> त्रिप्रकार, नाना˚ &c.<BR>—3 Similitude.<BR>—4 Speciality, special property or quality; तद्वतितत्प्रकारकोऽनुभवः प्रमा T. S.<BR>—5 Difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्मन्
प्रकर्मन् <i>n.</i> Sexual intercourse. कन्याप्रकर्म N. of a<BR> chapter in Kau. A.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृत|प्रकृतः
प्रकृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Accomplished, completed; प्रकृतजपविधीनामास्यमुद्रश्मिदन्तम् Śi. 11. 42.<BR>—2 Commenced, begun.<BR>—3 Appointed, charged.<BR>—4 Genuine, real.<BR>—5 Forming the subject of discussion, that which is under consideration,<BR> the subject in hand (often used in works on Alaṃkāra for उपमेय)<BR> संभावनमथोत्प्रेक्षा प्रकृतस्य समेन यत् K. P. 10.<BR>—6 Important, interesting.<BR>—7 Wished, expected. —8 Original.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतम्
प्रकृत + .{@-तम्@} The original subject, the matter or subject in hand; यातु,<BR> किमनेन, प्रकृतमेव अनुसरामः ‘come to the point’.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रकृतार्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतार्थ|प्रकृतार्थः
प्रकृत + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> having the original sense.<BR>—2 true, real.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतार्थः|प्रकृतार्थ
प्रकृत + -अर्थ + .({@-र्थः@}) the original sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिः|प्रकृति
प्रकृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The natural condition or state of anything, nature, natural form (opp.<BR> विकृति which is a change or effect); तं तं नियममास्थाय प्रकृत्या<BR> नियताः स्वया Bg. 7. 20. प्रकृत्या यद्वक्रम् Ś. 1. 9; उष्णत्वमग्न्यातपसंप्रयोगात्<BR> शैत्यं हि यत् सा प्रकृतिर्जलस्य R. 5. 54; मरणं प्रकृतिः शरीरिणां<BR> विकृतिर्जीवितमुच्यते बुधैः R. 8. 87; U. 7. 19; अपेहि रे अत्रभवान्<BR> प्रकृतिमापन्नः Ś. 2 ‘has resumed his wonted nature’; प्रकृतिम् आपद्<BR> or प्रतिपद् or प्रकृतौ स्था ‘to come to oneʼs senses’, ‘regain oneʼs consciousness’<BR>.<BR>—2 Natural disposition, temper, temperament, nature, constitution; प्रकृतिः<BR> खलु सा महीयसः सहते नान्यसमुन्नतिं यया Ki. 2. 21; कथं गत<BR> एव आत्मनः प्रकृतिम् Ś. 7 ‘natural character’; अपश्यत् पाण्डवश्रेष्ठो<BR> हर्षेण प्रकृतिं गतः Mb. 39. 66 (com. प्रकृतिं स्वास्थ्यम्); so प्रकृतिकृपण,<BR> प्रकृतिसिद्धः see below.<BR>—3 Make, form, figure; महानुभावप्रकृतिः Māl. 1.<BR>—4 Extraction, descent; गोपालप्रकृतिरार्यकोऽस्मि Mk. 7.<BR>—5 Origin, source, original or material cause, the material of which anything<BR> is made; नार्थानां प्रकृतिं वेत्सि Mb. 4. 49. 1; प्रकृतिश्चोपादानकारणं<BR> च ब्रह्माभ्युपगन्तव्यम् Ś. B. (see the full discussion on Br. Sūt. 1. 4. 23);<BR> यामाहुः सर्वभूतप्रकृतिरिति Ś. 1. 1; Bhāg. 4. 28. 24.<BR>—6 (In Sāṅ. phil.) Nature (as distinguished from पुरुष), the original<BR> source of the material world, consisting of the three essential qualities<BR> सत्त्व, रजस् and तमस्. It is also mentioned as one of the four<BR> contentments; प्रकृत्युपादानकालभागाख्याः Sāṅ. K. 50.<BR>—7 (In gram.) The radical or crude form of a word to which case-terminations<BR> and other affixes are applied; प्रकृतिप्रत्यययोरिवानुबन्धः Ki. 13. 19.<BR>—8 A model, pattern, standard, (especially in ritualistic works); Bhāg. 5. 7. 5.<BR>—9 A woman.<BR>—10 The personified will of the Supreme Spirit in the creation (identified<BR> with माया or illusion); मयाध्यक्षेण प्रकृतिः सूयते सचराचरम् Bg. 9. 10.<BR>—11 The male or female organ of generation.<BR>—12 A mother.<BR>—13 (In arith.) A coefficient, or multiplier.<BR>—14 (In anatomy) Temperament of the humours; प्रकृतिं यान्ति भूतानि निग्रहः<BR> किं करिष्यति Bg. 3. 33.<BR>—15 An animal.<BR>—16 An artisan.<BR>—17 The Supreme Being; न ह्यस्ति सर्वभूतेषु दुःखमस्मिन् कुतः सुखम् ।<BR> एवं प्रकृतिभूतानां सर्वसंसर्गयायिनाम् ॥ Mb. 12. 152. 16.<BR>—18 Eight forms of the Supreme Being; भूमिरापोऽनलो वायुः खं मनो<BR> बुद्धिरेव च । अहंकार इतीयं मे भिन्ना प्रकृति-रष्टधा ॥ Bg. 7. 4.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">Page1055-1</a>]<BR>—19 The way of life (जीवन); सतां वै ददतोऽन्नं च लोकेऽस्मिन्<BR> प्रकृतिर्ध्रुवा Mb. 12. 18. 27. (pl.)<BR>—1 A kingʼs ministers, the body of ministers or counsellors, ministry;<BR> अथानाथाः प्रकृतयो मातृबन्धुनिवासिनम् R. 12. 12; Pt. 1. 48; अशुद्धप्रकृतौ<BR> राज्ञि जनता नानुरज्यते 301.<BR>—2 The subjects (of a king); प्रवर्ततां प्रकृतिहिताय पार्थिवः Ś. 7. 35;<BR> नृपतिः प्रकृतीरवेक्षितुम् R. 8. 18, 10.<BR>—3 The constituent elements of the state (सप्ताङ्गानि), <i>i. e.</i><BR>—1 the king;<BR>—2 the minister;<BR>—3 the allies;<BR>—4 treasure;<BR>—5 army;<BR>—6 territory;<BR>—7 fortresses &c.; and the corporations of citizens (which is sometimes<BR> added to the 7); स्वाम्यमात्यसुहृत्कोशराष्ट्रदुर्गबलानि च Ak.<BR>—4 The various sovereigns to be considered in case of war; (for full explanation<BR> see Kull. on Ms. 7. 155 and 157).<BR>—5 The eight primary elements out of which everything else is evolved<BR> according to the Sāṅkhyas; see Sāṅ. K. 3.<BR>—6 The five primary elements of creations (पञ्चमहाभूतानि) <i>i. e.</i><BR> पृथ्वी, अप्, तेजस्, वायु and आकाश; प्रकृतिं ते भजिष्यन्ति नष्टप्रकृतयो<BR> मयि Mb. 5. 73. 17.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रकृत्यमित्रः, प्रकृतीशः, प्रकृतिकल्याण, प्रकृतिकृपण, प्रकृतिगुणः, प्रकृतिज, प्रकृतितरल, प्रकृतिपाठः, प्रकृतिपुरुषः, प्रकृतिपुरुषौ, प्रकृतिभाव, प्रकृतिभोजनम्, प्रकृतिमण्डलम्, प्रकृतिलयः, प्रकृतिविकृतिः, प्रकृतिश्रैष्ठ्यम्, प्रकृतिसिद्ध, प्रकृतिसुभग, प्रकृतिस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1054-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृत्यमित्रः
प्रकृतिः + -अमित्रः an ordinary foe; प्रकृत्यमित्रानुत्थाप्य Dk. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतीशः|प्रकृतीश
प्रकृतिः + -ईशः a king or magistrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिकल्याण
प्रकृतिः + -कल्याण <i>a.</i> beautiful by nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिकृपण
प्रकृतिः + -कृपण <i>a.</i> naturally slow or unable to discern; Me. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिगुणः|प्रकृतिगुण
प्रकृतिः + -गुणः one of the three constituent qualities of nature; see गुण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिज
प्रकृतिः + -ज <i>a.</i> innate, inborn, natural.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतितरल
प्रकृतिः + -तरल <i>a.</i> fickle by nature, naturally inconsistent; प्रकृतितरले<BR> का नः पीडा गते हतजीविते; Amaru. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिपाठः|प्रकृतिपाठ
प्रकृतिः + -पाठः a list of verbal roots (धातुपाठ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिपुरुषः|प्रकृतिपुरुष
प्रकृतिः + -पुरुषः a minister, a functionary (of the state); जानामि त्वां<BR> प्रकृतिपुरुषं कामरूपं मघोनः Me. 6.<BR>—2 a standard or model of a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिपुरुषौ
प्रकृतिः + -पुरुषौ nature and spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिभाव|प्रकृतिभावः
प्रकृतिः + -भाव <i>a.</i> natural, usual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिभावः|प्रकृतिभाव
प्रकृतिः + -भाव + .({@-वः@}) natural or original state.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिभोजनम्
प्रकृतिः + -भोजनम् usual food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिमण्डलम्
प्रकृतिः + -मण्डलम् the whole territory or kingdom; अधिगतं विधिवद्यदपालयत्<BR> प्रकृतिमण्डलमात्मकुलोचितम् R. 9. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिलयः|प्रकृतिलय
प्रकृतिः + -लयः absorption into the Prakṛti, dissolution of the universe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिविकृतिः|प्रकृतिविकृति
प्रकृतिः + -विकृतिः mutation of the original form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिश्रैष्ठ्यम्
प्रकृतिः + -श्रैष्ठ्यम् superiority of origin; Ms. 10. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिसिद्ध
प्रकृतिः + -सिद्ध <i>a.</i> inborn, innate, natural; सुजनबन्धुजनेष्वसहिष्णुता<BR> प्रकृतिसिद्धमिदं हि दुरात्मनाम् Bh. 2. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिसुभग
प्रकृतिः + -सुभग <i>a.</i> naturally lovely or agreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिस्थ
प्रकृतिः + -स्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 being in the natural state or condition, natural, genuine; दृष्ट्वा<BR> चाप्रकृतिस्थां ताम् Rām. 7. 58. 17.<BR>—2 inherent, innate, incidental to nature; रघुरप्यजयद् गुणत्रयं<BR> प्रकृतिस्थं समलोष्टकाञ्चनः R. 8. 21.<BR>—3 healthy, in good health.<BR>—4 recovered.<BR>—5 come to oneself.<BR>—6 stripped of everything, bare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृतिमत्|प्रकृतिमन्त्
प्रकृतिमत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Natural, usual, common.<BR>—2 Having a सात्त्विक frame of mind; ततः प्रकृतिमान् वैद्यः पितुरेषां<BR> पुरोहितः Rām. 2. 77. 21 (com. प्रकृतिमान् सत्त्वप्रकृतिः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रिया
प्रक्रिया<BR>—1 Way, manner, conduct; प्रक्रियेयं न ते युक्ता Mb. 14. 79. 3.<BR>—2 A rite, ceremony.<BR>—3 The bearing of royal insignia.<BR>—4 High position, elevation.<BR>—5 A chapter or section (of a book); as in उणादिप्रक्रिया.<BR>—6 (In gram.) Etymological formation.<BR>—7 A privilege.<BR>—8 An introductory chapter of a work.<BR>—9 Rules for<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">Page1055-2</a>]<BR> the formation of words.<BR>—10 Good conduct, action; प्रक्रिया वैरिकारिका Mb. 12. 111. 59 (com.<BR> प्रक्रिया प्रकृष्टं कर्म)<BR>—11 (In medicine) a prescription.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृष्
प्रकृष् €1 P.<BR>—1 To draw away, pull, attract.<BR>—2 To lead (as an army).<BR>—3 To bend (as a bow).<BR>—4 To increase.<BR>—5 To draw or stretch out, prolong.<BR>—6 To place before or in front.<BR>—7 To harass, disturb, afflict, trouble.<BR>—8 To drag along cruelly; प्रकृष्टाश्च तदा कामं देवमार्गं च दर्शिताः<BR> Rām. 5. 63. 11. ━<i>Pass.</i> To be enhanced or increased; आवयोरपि यत्<BR> सङ्गात् पवित्रत्वं प्रकृष्यते U. 7. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्षः|प्रकर्ष
प्रकर्षः<BR>—1 Excellence, eminence, superiority; वपुःप्रकर्षादजयद् गुरुं रघुः<BR> R. 3. 34; वर्णप्रकर्षे सति Ku. 3. 28.<BR>—2 Intensity, high degree, excess; प्रकर्षगतेन शोकसंतानेन U. 3.<BR>—3 Strength, power.<BR>—4 Absoluteness.<BR>—5 Length, protraction.<BR>—6 Speciality.<BR>—7 Universality. (प्रकर्षेण and प्रकर्षात् are used adverbially<BR> in the sense of ‘exceedingly’, ‘preeminently’, ‘in a high degree’.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्षकः|प्रकर्षक
प्रकर्षकः An epithet of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्षण
प्रकर्षण <i>a.</i> Paining, harassing, troubling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्षणम्
प्रकर्षण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 The act of drawing away; attracting.<BR>—2 Ploughing.<BR>—3 Duration, length, extension.<BR>—4 Excellence, superiority.<BR>—5 Distraction.<BR>—6 Realizing by the use of a pledge more than the interest of the money lent upon it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्षित
प्रकर्षित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Drawn out or forth.<BR>—2 Stretched out.<BR>—3 Exceeded in profit (as the interest of a loan).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्षितम्
प्रकर्षित + .{@-तम्@} Profit on a pledge exceeding the interest of the money lent upon it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकर्षिन्
प्रकर्षिन् <i>a.</i> Excellent, pre-eminent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकृष्ट|प्रकृष्टं
प्रकृष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Drawn forth or out.<BR>—2 Protracted, long, lengthy.<BR>—3 Superior, distinguished, excellent, eminent, exalted.<BR>—4 Chief, principal.<BR>—5 Distracted, disquieted.<BR>—6 Violent, strong, excessive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकॄ
प्रकॄ €6 P.<BR>—1 To scatter, throw, pour out; प्रकीर्णः पुष्पाणां हरिचरणयोरञ्जलिरयम् Ve. 1. 2.<BR>—2 To sow (as seed).<BR>—3 To issue forth, spring up; महीतले स्वर्गमिव प्रकीर्णम् Rām. 5. 7. 6<BR> (com. प्रकीर्णं पातितम्). ━<i>pass.</i> To disappear, vanish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकिरणम्
प्रकिरणम् Scattering about, strewing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्ण|प्रकीर्णं|प्रकीर्णः
प्रकीर्ण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Scattered about, scattered forth, thrown about, dispersed; प्रकीर्णमूर्धजा<BR> राजन् यक्षाधिपतिमब्रुवन् Mb. 3. 161. 17.<BR>—2 Spread, published, promulgated.<BR>—3 Waved, waving; जवात् प्रकीर्णैरभितः प्रकीर्णकैः Śi. 12. 17.<BR>—4 Disordered, loose, dishevelled.<BR>—5 Confused, incoherent; बह्वपि स्वेच्छया कामं प्रकीर्णमभिधीयते Śi. 2. 63.<BR>—6 Agitated, excited.<BR>—7 Miscellaneous, mixed; as the प्रकीर्णकाण्ड of Bhaṭṭikāvya.<BR>—8 Expanded, opened.<BR>—9 Standing alone.<BR>—10 Destroyed, killed; प्रकीर्णमेष भारं हि यद्वद्धार्येत दस्युभिः<BR> Mb. 12. 215. 14.<BR>—11 Thickly covered; प्रकीर्णमलपङ्कः Dk. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्णम्
प्रकीर्ण + .{@-र्णम्@}<BR>—1 A miscellany, any<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">Page1056-1</a>]<BR> miscellaneous collection.<BR>—2 A chapter containing miscellaneous rules.<BR>—3 A chapter or section of a book.<BR>—4 Scattering or throwing about.<BR>—5 Extent.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रकीर्णकेशी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1055-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्णकेशी
प्रकीर्ण + -केशी N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्णक|प्रकीर्णकं|प्रकीर्णकः
प्रकीर्णक <i>a.</i> Scattered or strewn about &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्णकः|प्रकीर्णक|प्रकीर्णकं
प्रकीर्णक + .{@-कः, -कम्@}<BR>—1 A chowrie, fly-flap (चामर); Śi. 12. 17; प्रकीर्णकं पार्श्वंगपाणिकम्पितम्<BR> Śāhendra. 3. 14; विप्रकीर्णं क्वचिच्छस्त्रं प्रकीर्णकमपि क्वचित्<BR> Śiva B. 21. 53, 22. 60.<BR>—2 A tuft of hair used as an ornament for horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्णकम्
प्रकीर्णक + .{@-कः, -कम्@}<BR>—1 A chowrie, fly-flap (चामर); Śi. 12. 17; प्रकीर्णकं पार्श्वंगपाणिकम्पितम्<BR> Śāhendra. 3. 14; विप्रकीर्णं क्वचिच्छस्त्रं प्रकीर्णकमपि क्वचित्<BR> Śiva B. 21. 53, 22. 60.<BR>—2 A tuft of hair used as an ornament for horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्णकः|प्रकीर्णक|प्रकीर्णकं
प्रकीर्णक + .{@-कः@} A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्णकम्
प्रकीर्णक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A miscellany, any collection of miscellaneous things.<BR>—2 A miscellaneous chapter.<BR>—3 A section, chapter or division of a book.<BR>—4 A case not provided by the Śāstras and to be decided by the judge or king.<BR>—5 Extent, length (of a book &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकॄत्
प्रकॄत् €10 U.<BR>—1 To announce, proclaim, mention.<BR>—2 To name, call.<BR>—3 To praise, extol, laud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्तनम्
प्रकीर्तनम्<BR>—1 Proclaiming, announcing.<BR>—2 Praising, extolling, lauding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्तना
प्रकीर्तनम् + .{@-ना@} Mentioning, naming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्तित|प्रकीर्त्तित|प्रकीर्त्तितं
प्रकीर्तित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Proclaimed.<BR>—2 Declared, said to be.<BR>—3 Named, called.<BR>—4 Celebrated.<BR>—5 Explained.<BR>—6 Revealed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्तिः|प्रकीर्ति|प्रकीर्त्ति
प्रकीर्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Celebration, praise.<BR>—2 Fame, celebrity.<BR>—3 Declaration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्यः|प्रकीर्य|प्रकीर्य्य|प्रकीर्य्यः
प्रकीर्यः, -र्या<BR> N. of some medicinal plants (Mar. कांटेकरंज).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकीर्या
प्रकीर्यः, -र्या<BR> N. of some medicinal plants (Mar. कांटेकरंज).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकॢप्
प्रकॢप् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To be fit or suitable for.<BR>—2 To happen, occur.<BR>—3 To be successful. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To invent, devise, plan (schemes &c.).<BR>—2 To prepare, make ready, equip, accoutre.<BR>—3 To treat with respect.<BR>—4 To fix, settle.<BR>—5 To appoint, invest, install.<BR>—6 To fix, fasten, bind.<BR>—7 To further, advance, promote.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकल्पक
प्रकल्पक <i>a.</i> Being in a right place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकल्पना
प्रकल्पना Settlement, fixing, allotment; अनेन विधियोगेन कर्तव्यांशप्रकल्पना Ms. 8. 211.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकल्पित
प्रकल्पित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Made, done, formed.<BR>—2 Settled, allotted.<BR>—3 Formed or shed (as a tear).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकल्पिता
प्रकल्पित + .{@-ता@} A kind of riddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकॢप्त
प्रकॢप्त <i>p. p.</i> Prepared, made ready, arranged; प्रतुष्टुवः<BR> कर्म ततः प्रकॢप्तैस्ते यज्ञियैर्द्रव्यगणैर्यथावत् Bk. 2. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकॢप्तम्
प्रकॢप्त + .{@-म्@} <i>ind.</i> Readily, easily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकेत|प्रकेतः
प्रकेत <i>a.</i> Ved. One who knows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकेतः|प्रकेत
प्रकेत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 Appearance.<BR>—2 Intelligence, knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकोथः|प्रकोथ
प्रकोथः Putrefaction, putridity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकोष्ठः|प्रकोष्ठ
प्रकोष्ठः<BR>—1 The fore-arm, the part above the wrist; वामप्रकोष्ठार्पितहेमवेत्रः<BR> Ku. 3. 41; कनकवलयभ्रंशरिक्तप्रकोष्ठः Me. 2; R. 3. 59; Ś. 6. 6;<BR> कनकवलयभूषितप्रकोष्ठैः Bu. C. 5. 81.<BR>—2 The room near the gate of a palace; Mu. 1.<BR>—3 A<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">Page1056-2</a>]<BR> court in a house, a quadrangle or square (surrounded by buildings); इमं<BR> प्रथमं प्रकोष्ठं प्रविशत्वार्यः &c. Mk. 4.<BR>—4 A part of a door-frame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रकोष्ठकः|प्रकोष्ठक
प्रकोष्ठकः A room near the gate of a palace (= प्रकोष्ठ); तस्थुर्विनम्रक्षितिपालसंकुले<BR> तदङ्गनद्वारबहिः प्रकोष्ठके Ku. 15. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्खर|प्रक्खरः
प्रक्खर <i>a.</i> Very sharp or violent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्खरः|प्रक्खर
प्रक्खर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 An armour for the defence of a horse or elephant.<BR>—2 A dog,<BR>—8 A mule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रम्
प्रक्रम् €1 U.<BR>—1 To go forward, proceed, walk on; प्राक्रंस्त क्षयमेघवत् Bk. 15. 23.<BR>—2 To go, set out, march forth.<BR>—3 To issue forth, depart.<BR>—4 To go across, pass.<BR>—5 To begin, commence (Ātm.) (with inf.); प्रचक्रमे च प्रतिवक्तुमुत्तरम्<BR> R. 3. 47, 2. 15; Ku. 3. 2, 5. 18.<BR>—6 To undertake, apply oneself to.<BR>—7 To behave towards (with loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रन्तृ|प्रक्रंतृ
प्रक्रन्तृ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 A beginner.<BR>—2 Conquering, overcoming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रमः|प्रक्रम
प्रक्रमः<BR>—1 A step, stride.<BR>—2 A pace considered as a measure of distance.<BR>—3 Commencement, beginning.<BR>—4<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Stepping forward, proceeding.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Procedure, course; कोऽयं विधेः प्रकमः Māl. 5. 24.<BR>—5 The case in question.<BR>—6 Leisure, opportunity.<BR>—7 Regularity, order, method.<BR>—8 Degree, proportion, measure.<BR>—9 The reading of the Kramapāṭha.<BR>—10 Discussing any point in question.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रक्रमतृतीयम्, प्रक्रमभङ्गः, प्रक्रमनिरुद्ध<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रमतृतीयम्
प्रक्रमः + -तृतीयम् the third of a square pace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रमभङ्गः|प्रक्रमभङ्ग|प्रक्रमभंग
प्रक्रमः + -भङ्गः want of symmetry or regularity, the breaking of arrangement,<BR> regarded as a fault of composition. (It is the same as भग्नप्रक्रमता<BR> mentioned in K. P. 7), the break of symmetry being either in expression<BR> or construction; नाथे निशाया नियतेर्नियोगादस्तं गते हन्त निशापि याता<BR> is an instance of the former, where गता निशापि would relieve the<BR> irregularity of expression; and विश्रब्धं क्रियतां वराहततिभिर्मुस्ताक्षतिः<BR> पल्वले is an instance of the latter, where the symmetry of the verse<BR> requires the active instead of the passive construction, and the fault<BR> may be removed by reading the line as विश्रब्धा रचयन्तु शूकरवरा<BR> मुस्ताक्षतिं पल्वले; see K. P. 7 under भग्नप्रक्रमता for further details.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रमनिरुद्ध
प्रक्रमः + -निरुद्ध <i>a.</i> stopped in the beginning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रमणम्
प्रक्रमणम्<BR>—1 Stepping forward, proceeding.<BR>—2 Issuing.<BR>—3 Beginning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रान्त|प्रक्रांत|प्रक्रान्तः
प्रक्रान्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Commenced, begun.<BR>—2 Gone, proceeded.<BR>—3 In hand, under discussion.<BR>—4 Surpassed.<BR>—5 Brave.<BR>—6 Previously mentioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रान्तम्
प्रक्रान्त + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 The outset of a journey.<BR>—2 The case or point in question.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्रीडः|प्रक्रीड
प्रक्रीडः Play, pastime, sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्लिन्न|प्रक्लिन्नः
प्रक्लिन्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Moist, humid, wet.<BR>—2 Satisfied (तृप्त).<BR>—3 Moved with pity.<BR>—4 Putrefied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्लेदः|प्रक्लेद
प्रक्लेदः Moistness, wetness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1056-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्लेदन
प्रक्लेदन <i>a.</i> Moistening, wetting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्वणः|प्रक्वण
प्रक्वणः, प्रक्वाणः The sound of a lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्वाणः|प्रक्वाण
प्रक्वणः, प्रक्वाणः The sound of a lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्वाथः|प्रक्वाथ
प्रक्वाथः Seething, boiling; Jātak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षर|प्रक्षरः
प्रक्षर See प्रक्खर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षरणम्
प्रक्षरणम् Trickling out, oozing, flowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षल्
प्रक्षल् €10 U.<BR>—1 To wash, purify, cleanse; पादौ-मुखं-हस्तं &c. प्रक्षालयति.<BR>—2 To wipe away; (अयशः) तेषामनुग्रहेणाद्य राजन् प्रक्षालयात्मनः Mb.<BR>—3 To expiate, atone for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षालनम्
प्रक्षालनम्<BR>—1 Washing, washing off; यस्यावरोधस्तनचन्दनानां प्रक्षालनाद्वारिविहारकाले R. 6. 48.<BR>—2 Cleansing, cleaning, purifying; दुर्जनं प्रथमं वन्दे सज्जनं<BR> तदनन्दरम् । मुखप्रक्षालनात् पूर्वं गुदप्रक्षालनं यथा ॥ Subh. Ratn. 54. 34.<BR>—3 Bathing.<BR>—4 Anything used for purifying.<BR>—5 Water for washing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षालित|प्रक्षालितः
प्रक्षालित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Washed, cleansed.<BR>—2 Purified.<BR>—3 Expiated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षि
प्रक्षि €5. €9 P.<BR>—1 To decay, wane.<BR>—2 To be emaciated or lean.<BR>—3 To injure, destroy, spoil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षपणम्
प्रक्षपणम् Destroying; Rāj. T.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षयः|प्रक्षय
प्रक्षयः Ruin, destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षीण
प्रक्षीण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Decayed, wasting, declining,<BR>—2 Destroyed.<BR>—3 Expiated.<BR>—4 Vanished, disappeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षीणम्
प्रक्षीण + .{@-णम्@} The spot where one has perished.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रक्षीणचन्द्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षीणचन्द्रः|प्रक्षीणचन्द्र
प्रक्षीण + -चन्द्रः the waning moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षिप्
प्रक्षिप् €6 P.<BR>—1 To throw, fling at, hurl.<BR>—2 To put into, throw at or in; नामेध्यं प्रक्षिपेदग्नौ Ms. 4. 53;<BR> क्षारं क्षते प्रक्षिपन् Mk. 5. 18.<BR>—3 To insert, interpolate; इति सूत्रे कैश्चित् प्रक्षिप्तम् Kaiyaṭa.<BR>—4 To put or lay before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षिप्त
प्रक्षिप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Thrown at, cast, hurled.<BR>—2 Thrown into; पातालप्रतिमल्लगल्लविवरप्रक्षिप्तसप्तार्णवम् Māl. 5. 22.<BR>—3 Projected.<BR>—4 Interpolated, spurious; as in प्रक्षिप्तोऽयं श्लोकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षेपः|प्रक्षेप
प्रक्षेपः<BR>—1 Throwing forward, projecting.<BR>—2 A throw, cast.<BR>—3 Scattering upon.<BR>—4 Spurious insertion, interpolation.<BR>—5 The box of a carriage<BR>—6 The sum deposited by each member of a commercial company.<BR>—7 Anything added to drugs in decoction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षेपणम्
प्रक्षेपणम्<BR>—1 Throwing, casting, hurling.<BR>—2 Pouring upon, throwing into.<BR>—3 Settling, fixing (as price &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षीवित
प्रक्षीवित <i>a.</i> Drunken, intoxicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षुद्
प्रक्षुद् €7 U. To crush, bruise, pound; मित्रध्नस्य प्रचुक्षोद गदयाङ्गं<BR> विभीषणः Bk. 14. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षुण्ण
प्रक्षुण्ण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Crushed.<BR>—2 Pierced through.<BR>—3 Incited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षुभ्
प्रक्षुभ् €1 Ā., €4 P.<BR>—1 To be shaken or agitated.<BR>—2 To totter.<BR>—3 To be perplexed or confused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षोभः
प्रक्षोभः, -प्रक्षोभणम्<BR>—1 Exciting, agitating.<BR>—2 Shaking; प्रक्षोभैः सपदि तरङ्गितं तटेषु Ki. 7. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्षोभणम्
प्रक्षोभः, -प्रक्षोभणम्<BR>—1 Exciting, agitating.<BR>—2 Shaking; प्रक्षोभैः सपदि तरङ्गितं तटेषु Ki. 7. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्ष्णु
प्रक्ष्णु €2 P. To sharpen, whet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्ष्वेडनः|प्रक्ष्वेडन
प्रक्ष्वेडनः, -ना<BR>—1 An iron arrow.<BR>—2 Clamour, hubbub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्ष्वेडना
प्रक्ष्वेडनः, -ना<BR>—1 An iron arrow.<BR>—2 Clamour, hubbub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्ष्वेडा
प्रक्ष्वेडा Humming; grumbling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्ष्वेडित
प्रक्ष्वेडित <i>a.</i> Clamorous, shouting, noisy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रक्ष्वेडितम्
प्रक्ष्वेडित + .{@-तम्@} A shout, hum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रखर|प्रखरः
प्रखर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Very hot; as in प्रखरकिरण.<BR>—2 Very acrid or pungent, sharp.<BR>—3 Very hard or rough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रखरः|प्रखर
प्रखर + .{@-रः@} See प्रक्खर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रख्या
प्रख्या €2 P.<BR>—1 To report, announce, declare.<BR>—2 To praise, celebrate. ━<i>Pass.</i> To be well-known or celebrated, be<BR> famous. ━<i>Caus.</i> To celebrate, proclaim, announce, declare publicly, publish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रख्य|प्रख्यः
प्रख्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Clear, visible, distinct.<BR>—2 Looking like, resembling (at the end of comp.); अमृत˚, शशाङ्क˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रख्यः|प्रख्य
प्रख्य + .{@-ख्यः@} the planet Jupiter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रख्या
प्रख्या<BR>—1 Perceptibility, visibility.<BR>—2 Renown, fame, celebrity; न्यवसत् परमप्रख्यः संप्रत्येव पुरीमिमाम् Rām.<BR>—3 Disclosure.<BR>—4 Resemblance, similitude (in comp.); तस्यास्तदद्भुतप्रख्यं श्रुत्वा<BR> हर्षमुपागतः Rām. 7. 89. 7. फेनप्रख्यः कथं नाशं मर्त्यलोको<BR> न यास्यति Y. 3. 10; प्रज्ञाचक्षुरवेक्षमाणतिमिरप्रख्याः किलाकीर्तयः N. 12. 106.<BR>—5 Look, appearance.<BR>—6 Brightness, splendour; शशाङ्ककिरणप्रख्यं कालवालमुभे तदा Mb. 1. 23. 2;<BR> अद्य चामीकरप्रख्यं प्रवेक्ष्यामि हुताशनम् Mb. 3. 73. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रख्यात|प्रख्यातः
प्रख्यात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Famous, celebrated, renowned, noted.<BR>—2 Forestalled, claimed by right of pre-emption.<BR>—3 Happy, pleased.<BR>—4 Recognised, acknowledged.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रख्यातभाण्डम्, प्रख्यातवप्तृक<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रख्यातभाण्डम्
प्रख्यात + -भाण्डम् a commodity the pre-emption of which is claimed by a king;<BR> राज्ञः प्रख्यातभाण्डानि प्रतिषिद्धानि यानि च Ms. 8. 399.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रख्यातवप्तृक|प्रख्यातवप्तृकः
प्रख्यात + -वप्तृक <i>a.</i> having a celebrated father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रख्यातिः|प्रख्याति
प्रख्यातिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Fame, renown, celebrity.<BR>—2 Praise, eulogium.<BR>—3 Perceptibility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रख्यानम्
प्रख्यानम्<BR>—1 Reporting.<BR>—2 A report, information.<BR>—3 Perception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रख्यापनम्
प्रख्यापनम्<BR>—1 Publishing, making public.<BR>—2 Communicating.<BR>—3 Information.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगट
प्रगट Wrong reading for प्रकट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगण्डः|प्रगण्ड|प्रगंड|प्रगंडः
प्रगण्डः The upper part of the arm from the elbow to the shoulder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगण्डी
प्रगण्डी The outer wall (of a city); ‘प्रगण्डीः कारयेत् सम्यक् षाङ्गुण्यं सत्रिवर्गकम् । यो वेत्ति पुरुषव्याघ्न स भुङ्क्ते पृथिवीमिमामे’<BR> इति प्राचां पाठः । तद्व्याख्यानं च तदीयमेव । ‘संचारो यत्र<BR> लोकानां दूरादेवावबुध्यते । प्रगण्डी सा च विज्ञेया बहिःप्राकारसंज्ञिता ॥’ इत्यादि Mb. 12. 69. 43 com.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">Page1058-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1057-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगम्
प्रगम् €1 P.<BR>—1 To advance, proceed.<BR>—2 To set out.<BR>—3 To reach, attain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगत
प्रगत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Gone forth or forward.<BR>—2 Separate, apart.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रगतजानु, प्रगतजानुक<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगतजानु|प्रगतजानुः
प्रगत + -जानु, -जानुक <i>a.</i> bandy-legged, bow-legged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगतजानुक|प्रगतजानुकः
प्रगत + -जानु, -जानुक <i>a.</i> bandy-legged, bow-legged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगमः|प्रगम
प्रगमः The first advance in courtship, first manifestation of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगमनम्
प्रगमनम्<BR>—1 Advance, progress.<BR>—2 The first advance in courtship.<BR>—3 A speech containing an excellent answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगामन्
प्रगामन् <i>n.</i> Walk, gait, step.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगर्जनम्
प्रगर्जनम् Roaring, shouting; also प्रगर्जितम् in this sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगल्भ्
प्रगल्भ् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To be bold or confident; या कथंचन सखीवचने प्रागभिप्रियतमं<BR> प्रजगल्भे Śi. 1. 18; न मौक्तिकच्छिद्रकरी शलाका प्रगल्भते कर्मणि<BR> टङ्किकायाः Vikr. 1. 16 ‘cannot be bold (competent) enough to do the work of a hatchet’<BR>.<BR>—2 To be determined or resolute.<BR>—3 To be proud.<BR>—4 To be ready or able (with inf.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगल्भ|प्रगल्भः
प्रगल्भ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bold, confident.<BR>—2 Daring, brave, intrepid, spirited, courageous; Mb. 12. 318. 64; इति<BR> प्रगल्भं पुरुषाधिराजो मृगाधिराजस्य वचो निशम्य R. 2. 41.<BR>—3 Bold in speech, eloquent; पुंवत् प्रगल्भा प्रतिहाररक्षी R. 6. 20.<BR>—4 Ready-witted, prompt.<BR>—5 Resolute, energetic.<BR>—6 Mature (as age); गुरुः प्रगल्भेऽपि वयस्यतोऽस्यास्तस्थौ निवृत्तान्यवराभिलाषः Ku. 1. 51.<BR>—7 Matured, developed, full-grown, strong; प्रगल्भवाक् Ku. 5. 30 (प्रौढवाक्);<BR> Māl. 9. 29; U. 6. 35.<BR>—8 Skilful; प्रगल्भवनितेव कन्यका प्रणनाम K. 12.<BR>—9 Audacious, arrogant, officious, proud.<BR>—10 Shameless, impudent; मुखार्पणेषु प्रकृतिप्रगल्भाः (सिन्धूः) R. 13. 9.<BR>—11 Illustrious, eminent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगल्भा
प्रगल्भ + .{@-ल्भा@}<BR>—1 A bold woman.<BR>—2 A shrew, scolding woman.<BR>—3 A bold or mature woman, one of the classes of heroines in poetic composition;<BR> she is versed in all kinds of caresses, lofty of demeanour, possessed<BR> of no great modesty, of mature age, and ruling her husband; स्मरान्धा<BR> गाढतारुण्या समस्तरतकोविदा । भावोन्नता दरव्रीडा प्रगल्भाऽऽकान्तनायका ॥<BR> S. D. 101 and examples quoted <i>ad loc.</i><BR>—4 An epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगल्भता
प्रगल्भता<BR>—1 Boldness; प्रायेणैवंविधे कार्ये पुरस्त्रीणां प्रगल्भता Ku.<BR>—2 Resoluteness, energy.<BR>—3 Pride, arrogance.<BR>—4 Eminence.<BR>—5 Perverseness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगल्भित
प्रगल्भित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Arrogant.<BR>—2 Eminent, illustrious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगाढ|प्रगाढं
प्रगाढ <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Dipped into, soaked, steeped.<BR>—2 Much, excessive, intense.<BR>—3 Firm, strong.<BR>—4 Hard, difficult.<BR>—5 Far advanced; त्वं पुनः प्रगाढायां प्रदोषवेलायामालपिष्यसि Dk. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगाढम्
प्रगाढ + .{@-ढम्@}<BR>—1 Privation.<BR>—2 Penance, bodily<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">Page1058-2</a>]<BR> mortification.<BR>—3 Distress, difficulty; प्रगाढे तुमुलं चित्रमिति विद्धि प्रजापतेः Mb. 4. 61. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगाढम्
प्रगाढ + .{@-ढम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Very much, exceedingly.<BR>—2 Firmly.<BR>—3 Forcibly.<BR>—4 Proportionately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगातृ
प्रगातृ <i>m.</i> An excellent singer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगाथः|प्रगाथ
प्रगाथः A strophe, a combination of two verses (ऋच्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगीत
प्रगीत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sung.<BR>—2 Singing.<BR>—3 Resonant with singing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगीतम्
प्रगीत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 A song.<BR>—2 A sing-song mode of reciting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगीति
प्रगीति <i>f.</i> A variety of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगुण|प्रगुणः
प्रगुण <i>a.</i> Straight, honest, upright (lit. and fig.); बहिः<BR> सर्वाकारप्रगुणरमणीयं व्यवहरन् Māl. 1. 14.<BR>—2 Being in the right state or condition, having excellent qualities;<BR> श्रमजयात् प्रगुणां च करोत्यसौ तनुमतोऽनुमतः सचिवैर्ययौ R. 9. 49.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Worthy, suitable, meritorious; वरीयानन्योन्यप्रगुणनिर्माणनिपुणः Māl. 1. 16.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Efficient; प्राणत्राणं प्रगुणमभवन्मत्परिष्वङ्गकल्पः 9. 46.<BR>—4 Skilful, clever. (प्रगुणीकृ means:−<BR> 1 To make straight, put in order, arrange.<BR> 2 To make smooth.<BR> 3 To nourish, bring up.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगुणीभू
प्रगुणीभू To make oneself fit or ready for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगुणनम्
प्रगुणनम् Putting straight, arranging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगुणयति
प्रगुणयति Den. P. = प्रगुणीकृ above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगुणित
प्रगुणित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Made even or straight.<BR>—2 Made smooth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगुण्य
प्रगुण्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 More, exceeding.<BR>—2 Excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगे
प्रगे <i>ind.</i> Early in the morning, at day-break; इत्थं रथाश्वेभनिषादिनां<BR> प्रगे गणो नृपाणामथ तोरणाद् बहिः Śi. 12. 1; सायं स्नायात् प्रगे<BR> तथा Ms. 6. 6, 4. 62; अथ प्रगे प्रजानाथः स आस्थाय हयोत्तमम्<BR> Śiva B. 29. 65.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रगेतन, प्रगेनिश, प्रगेशय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगेतन|प्रगेतनः
प्रगे + -तन <i>a.</i> to be performed in the morning; उत्थाय च धौतवक्त्रौ<BR> प्रगेतनानि मङ्गलान्यनुष्ठाय Dk. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगेनिश
प्रगे + -निश, -शय <i>a.</i> who is asleep at day-break; उत्सूर्यशायिनश्चासन्<BR> सर्वे चासन् प्रगेनिशाः Bm. नैनानभ्युदियात् सूर्यो न चाप्यासन्<BR> प्रगेशयाः Mb. 12. 228. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगेशय
प्रगे + -निश, -शय <i>a.</i> who is asleep at day-break; उत्सूर्यशायिनश्चासन्<BR> सर्वे चासन् प्रगेनिशाः Bm. नैनानभ्युदियात् सूर्यो न चाप्यासन्<BR> प्रगेशयाः Mb. 12. 228. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगोपनम्
प्रगोपनम् Protection, preservation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रथनम्
प्रग्रथनम् Stringing together, weaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रह्
प्रग्रह् €9 U.<BR>—1 To take, hold, seize, grasp.<BR>—2 To receive, accept.<BR>—3 To curb, restrain.<BR>—4 To stretch forth, extend.<BR>—5 To favour, behave friendly with.<BR>—6 To keep separate (as the प्रगृह्य vowels).<BR>—7 To offer.<BR>—8 To unite with. ━<i>Caus.</i> To receive, accept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगृहीत
प्रगृहीत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Held forth or out.<BR>—2 Received, accepted.<BR>—3 Not subject to the rules of euphony (संधि); see प्रगृह्य below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रगृह्यम्
प्रगृह्यम्<BR>—1 A vowel which is not liable to the rules of <i>Sandhi</i> or euphony and<BR> which is allowed to be written and pronounced separately; ईदूदेद्द्विवचनं<BR> प्रगृह्यम् P. I. 1. 11 (<i>i. e.</i> the final ई, ऊ and ए of the dual<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">Page1059-1</a>]<BR> terminations of a word or any grammatical form).<BR>—2 Remembrance.<BR>—3 A sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1058-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रह|प्रग्रहः
प्रग्रह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Holding in front, stretching forth (hands); एवमुक्तस्तु मुनिना प्राञ्जलिः<BR> प्रग्रहो नृपः । अभ्यवादयत प्राज्ञः Rām. 7. 82. 14.<BR>—2 Seizing, taking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रहः|प्रग्रह
प्रग्रह + .{@-हः@}<BR>—1 Holding or stretching forth, holding out.<BR>—2 Laying hold of, taking, grasping, seizing; न हि मे मुच्यते कश्चित्<BR> कथञ्चित् प्रग्रहं गतः Mb. 3. 179. 16.<BR>—3 The commencement of an eclipse.<BR>—4<BR>——(<i>a</i>) A rein, bridle; धृताः प्रग्रहाः अवतरत्वायुष्मान् Ś. 1; Śi. 12. 31.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) A whip, lash, scourge.<BR>—5 A check, restraint; यः प्रग्रहानुग्रहयोर्यथान्यायं विचक्षणः<BR> Rām. 2. 1. 25.<BR>—6 Binding, confinement; सोऽस्माकं वैरपुरुषो दुर्मतिः प्रग्रहं गतः Mb. 12. 7. 33.<BR>—8 A prisoner, captive.<BR>—8 Taming, breaking (as an animal).<BR>—9 A ray of light.<BR>—10 The string of a balance.<BR>—11 A vowel not subject to the rules of <i>Sandhi</i> or euphony; see प्रगृह्य.<BR>—12 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—13 The arm.<BR>—14 A leader, guide.<BR>—15 Kindness, favour, a reward; अपराधं सहेताल्पं तुष्येदल्पेऽपि चोदये ।<BR> महोपकारं चाध्यक्षं प्रग्रहेणाभिपूजयेत् ॥ Kau. A. 2. 7. 25.<BR>—16 The <i>Karṇikāra</i> tree.<BR>—17 The gains in the form of gifts to courtiers; राजोपजीविनां प्रग्रहप्रदेशभोगपरिहारभक्तवेतनलाभम्<BR> Kau. A. 2. 7. 25.<BR>—18 Hoarding, collecting (संग्रह); असाधुनिग्रहरतः साधूनां प्रग्रहे<BR> रतः Mb. 12. 21. 14.<BR>—19 Folding, joining (hands); श्वश्रूणामविशेषेण प्राञ्जलिप्रग्रहेण<BR> च Rām. 7. 48. 10.<BR>—20 Obstinacy, stubbornness.<BR>—21 A companion, satellite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रहणम्
प्रग्रहणम्<BR>—1 Taking, seizing, grasping.<BR>—2 The commencement of an eclipse.<BR>—3 A rein, bridle.<BR>—4 A check, restraint.<BR>—5 Binding, confining.<BR>—6 Offering.<BR>—7 Guiding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रहिन्
प्रग्रहिन् <i>a.</i> One holding the rein; पथि प्रग्रहिणं कंसमाभाष्याहाशरीरवाक्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 1. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्राहः|प्रग्राह
प्रग्राहः<BR>—1 Seizing, taking.<BR>—2 Bearing, carrying; प्रगाहैरिव पात्राणामन्वेष्या मैथिली कृतैः Bk. 7. 44.<BR>—3 The string of a balance. तुलासूत्रेऽश्वादिरश्मौ प्रग्राहः प्रग्रहोऽपि<BR> च Ak. 3. 236; वणिक् प्रग्राहवान् यद्वत् काले चरति सिद्धये Bk. 7. 49.<BR>—4 A rein, bridle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रीवः|प्रग्रीव
प्रग्रीवः, -वम्<BR>—1 A painted turret.<BR>—2 A wooden fence round a building; Rāj. T. 8. 328.<BR>—3 A window.<BR>—4 A stable.<BR>—5 The top of a tree.<BR>—6 A pleasure-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रग्रीवम्
प्रग्रीवः, -वम्<BR>—1 A painted turret.<BR>—2 A wooden fence round a building; Rāj. T. 8. 328.<BR>—3 A window.<BR>—4 A stable.<BR>—5 The top of a tree.<BR>—6 A pleasure-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघट्
प्रघट् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To be busy with, be occupied in; को वा विश्वजनीनेषु कर्मसु<BR> प्राघटिष्यत Bk. 21. 17.<BR>—2 To begin, commence; ततः प्रजघटे युद्धम् Bk. 14. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघटकः|प्रघटक
प्रघटकः, -प्रघट्टकः<BR> A rule, doctrine, precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघट्टकः|प्रघट्टक
प्रघटकः, -प्रघट्टकः<BR> A rule, doctrine, precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघटा
प्रघटा The first elements or rudiments of a science.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रघटाविद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघटाविद्
प्रघटा + -विद् <i>m.</i> a superficial reader, smatterer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघणः|प्रघण
प्रघणः (-नः), प्रघाणः (-नः)<BR>—1 A porch before the door of a house, portico; प्रघाण-प्रघणालिन्दा<BR> बहिर्द्वारप्रकोष्ठके<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">Page1059-2</a>]<BR> Abh. Cin. 1010^1; तस्मिन्नन्तर्घणेऽपश्यन् प्रघाणे सौधसद्मनः Bk. 7. 62.<BR>—2 A copper-pot,<BR>—3 An iron mace, crow-bar.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/44aba84e.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघनः|प्रघन
प्रघणः (-नः), प्रघाणः (-नः)<BR>—1 A porch before the door of a house, portico; प्रघाण-प्रघणालिन्दा<BR> बहिर्द्वारप्रकोष्ठके<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">Page1059-2</a>]<BR> Abh. Cin. 1010^1; तस्मिन्नन्तर्घणेऽपश्यन् प्रघाणे सौधसद्मनः Bk. 7. 62.<BR>—2 A copper-pot,<BR>—3 An iron mace, crow-bar.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/44aba84e.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघाणः|प्रघाण
प्रघणः (-नः), प्रघाणः (-नः)<BR>—1 A porch before the door of a house, portico; प्रघाण-प्रघणालिन्दा<BR> बहिर्द्वारप्रकोष्ठके<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">Page1059-2</a>]<BR> Abh. Cin. 1010^1; तस्मिन्नन्तर्घणेऽपश्यन् प्रघाणे सौधसद्मनः Bk. 7. 62.<BR>—2 A copper-pot,<BR>—3 An iron mace, crow-bar.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/44aba84e.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघानः|प्रघान
प्रघणः (-नः), प्रघाणः (-नः)<BR>—1 A porch before the door of a house, portico; प्रघाण-प्रघणालिन्दा<BR> बहिर्द्वारप्रकोष्ठके<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">Page1059-2</a>]<BR> Abh. Cin. 1010^1; तस्मिन्नन्तर्घणेऽपश्यन् प्रघाणे सौधसद्मनः Bk. 7. 62.<BR>—2 A copper-pot,<BR>—3 An iron mace, crow-bar.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/44aba84e.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघर्षणः|प्रघर्षण
प्रघर्षणः Grinding, crushing, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघर्षणम्
प्रघर्षणः + .{@-णम्@} Rubbing, annointing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघस|प्रघसः
प्रघस <i>a.</i> Voracious, gluttonous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघसः|प्रघस
प्रघस + .{@-सः@}<BR>—1 A demon.<BR>—2 Voracity, gluttony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघातः|प्रघात
प्रघातः<BR>—1 Killing.<BR>—2 A combat, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघुणः|प्रघुण
प्रघुणः A guest (v. l. for प्राधुण or प्राघूर्ण q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघूर्ण|प्रघूर्णः
प्रघूर्ण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wandering, roaming.<BR>—2 Turning round<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघूर्णः|प्रघूर्ण
प्रघूर्ण + .{@-र्णः@} A guest; see प्राघूर्ण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रघोषः|प्रघोष
प्रघोषः<BR>—1 Sound, noise.<BR>—2 Uproar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचकित
प्रचकित <i>a.</i> Trembling, shuddering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचक्रम्
प्रचक्रम्<BR>—1 An army in motion.<BR>—2 A foraging army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचक्ष्
प्रचक्ष् €2 Ā.<BR>—1 To say, speak, lay down; स्वजनाश्रु किलातिसंततं दहति प्रेतमिति<BR> प्रचक्षते R. 8. 86.<BR>—2 To tell, relate.<BR>—3 To consider, regard, deem.<BR>—4 To name, call; योऽस्यात्मनः कारयिता तं क्षेत्रज्ञं प्रचक्षते<BR> Ms. 12. 12, 2. 17, 3. 28, 10. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचक्षस्
प्रचक्षस् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 The planet Jupiter.<BR>—2 An epithet of Bṛhaspati.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्ड|प्रचंड|प्रचण्डः
प्रचण्ड <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Vehement, excessively violent, impetuous.<BR>—2 Strong, powerful, fierce.<BR>—3 Very hot, stifling (as heat).<BR>—4 Furious, wrathful.<BR>—5 Bold, confident.<BR>—6 Terrible, terrific.<BR>—7 Intolerable, unbearable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्डः|प्रचण्ड|प्रचंड
प्रचण्ड + .{@-ण्डः@} A species of oleander.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रचण्डातपः, प्रचण्डघोण, प्रचण्डभैरवः, प्रचण्डसूर्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्डातपः|प्रचण्डातप|प्रचंडातप
प्रचण्ड + -आतपः fierce heat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्डघोण|प्रचंडघोण
प्रचण्ड + -घोण <i>a.</i> large-nosed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्डभैरवः|प्रचण्डभैरव
प्रचण्ड + -भैरवः N. of a व्यायोग (kind of drama).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्डसूर्य
प्रचण्ड + -सूर्य <i>a.</i> having a hot or burning sun; प्रचण्डसूर्यः स्पृहणीयचन्द्रमाः Ṛs. 1. 1, 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्डता|प्रचंडता
प्रचण्डता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Violence, impetuosity.<BR>—2 Boldness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचण्डत्वम्
प्रचण्डता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Violence, impetuosity.<BR>—2 Boldness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचपल
प्रचपल <i>a.</i> Very unsteady or restless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचय|प्रचयः
प्रच(चा)य See under प्रचि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचाय|प्रचायः
प्रच(चा)य See under प्रचि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचर्
प्रचर् €1 P.<BR>—1 To walk about, stalk forth.<BR>—2 To go or issue forth, appear.<BR>—3 To roam, wander over.<BR>—4 To reach, arrive at.<BR>—5 To spread, circulate, be prevalent or current.<BR>—6 To prevail (as a custom).<BR>—7 To undertake, set about (anything), proceed to work; चिकित्सकानां<BR> सर्वेषां मिथ्या प्रचरतां दमः Ms. 9. 284.<BR>—8 To do, perform.<BR>—9 To behave, act towards, treat.<BR>—10 To be engaged in.<BR>—11 To thrive, prosper. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause or allow to roam.<BR>—2 To turn out to graze.<BR>—3 To make public.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचरः|प्रचर
प्रचरः<BR>—1 A road, path, way.<BR>—2 A custom, usage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचरणम्
प्रचरणम्<BR>—1 Going forth, proceeding.<BR>—2 Being current, circulating.<BR>—3 Undertaking, beginning.<BR>—4 Employing, using.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचरणी
प्रचरणम् + .{@-णी@} A wooden-ladle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1059-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचरित
प्रचरित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Gone forth &c.<BR>—2 Practised, followed, pursued (as a profession); यैः कर्मभिः प्रचरितैः<BR> शुश्रूष्यन्ते द्विजातयः Ms. 10. 100.<BR>—3 Current, publicly known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचर्या
प्रचर्या Action, process.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचारः|प्रचार
प्रचारः<BR>—1 Going forth, ranging, walking about, wandering; शान्तमृगप्रचारम्<BR> (काननम्) Ku. 3. 42.<BR>—2 Appearance, coming in, manifestation; U. 1; Mu. 1.<BR>—3 Currency, prevalence, use, being used or applied; विलोक्य तैरप्यधुना<BR> प्रचारम् Trik.<BR>—4 Conduct, behaviour; Mb. 12. 171. 15; cf. अध्यक्षप्रचारः (a title<BR> of the second book of Arthaśāstra.)<BR>—5 Custom, usage.<BR>—6 A playground, place of exercise.<BR>—7 A pasture-ground, pasturage; गवां प्रचारेष्वासीनम् Mb. 1. 40. 17;<BR> ग्राम्येच्छया गोप्रचारो भूमी राजवशेन वा Y. 2. 166.<BR>—8 A passage, path; योगक्षेमं प्रचारं च न विभाज्यं प्रचक्षते Ms. 9. 219.<BR>—9 Proclamation in public; प्रचारे चापघोषयेत … Kau. A. 2. 8. 26.<BR>—10 Movement, activity (संचार); प्रचारं स तु संगृह्य Rām. 7. 35. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचारित
प्रचारित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Allowed to wander.<BR>—2 Made public or known, become current.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचारिन्
प्रचारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wandering.<BR>—2 Showing itself, appearing.<BR>—3 Proceeding with, behaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचल्
प्रचल् €1 P.<BR>—1 To shake, move, tremble; समुद्रमपि संतरेत् प्रचलदूर्मिमालाकुलम् Bh. 2. 4.<BR>—2 To go, walk, move on; set out, start off, depart.<BR>—3 To start up, spring up.<BR>—4 To be affected, disturbed or agitated.<BR>—5 To prevail, be current.<BR>—6 To swerve, deviate from (abl.). ━<i>Caus.</i> (चाल˚)<BR>—1 To shake, stir up. (चल˚)<BR>—2 To move, set in motion.<BR>—3 To remove from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचल|प्रचलः
प्रचल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Trembling, shaking, tremulous; य उत्पलाक्षि प्रचलैर्विलोचनैस्तवाक्षिसादृश्यमिव<BR> प्रयुञ्जते Ku. 5. 35; Māl. 1. 38.<BR>—2 Current, prevailing, customary.<BR>—3 Going well or widely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलः|प्रचल
प्रचल + .{@-लः@} A peacock; Nigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलनम्
प्रचलनम्<BR>—1 Shaking, trembling.<BR>—2 Retreat, flight.<BR>—3 Circulation, currency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलित
प्रचलित (प्रचलत्) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shaken, moved, set in motion.<BR>—2 Moving about; एतस्मिन् प्रचलाकिनां प्रचलतामुद्वेजिताः कूजितैः U. 2. 29.<BR>—3 Wandering, roaming.<BR>—4 Having set out or proceeded.<BR>—5 Customary, recognized or received as authority.<BR>—6 Current, prevalent.<BR>—7 confused, bewildered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलत्
प्रचलित (प्रचलत्) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shaken, moved, set in motion.<BR>—2 Moving about; एतस्मिन् प्रचलाकिनां प्रचलतामुद्वेजिताः कूजितैः U. 2. 29.<BR>—3 Wandering, roaming.<BR>—4 Having set out or proceeded.<BR>—5 Customary, recognized or received as authority.<BR>—6 Current, prevalent.<BR>—7 confused, bewildered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलितम्
प्रचलित (प्रचलत्) + .{@-तम्@} Going away, departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचालनम्
प्रचालनम् Stirring, shaking, a stir; किं वृथार्थप्रचालनेन<BR> Pt. 5 ‘why discuss this matter in vain’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचला
प्रचला <i>f.</i> A chamelion (Mar. सरडा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलाकः|प्रचलाक
प्रचलाकः<BR>—1 Archery.<BR>—2 A peacockʼs tail.<BR>—3 A snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलाका
प्रचलाकः + .{@-का@} Ved. A violent shower of rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलाकिन्
प्रचलाकिन् <i>m.</i> A peacock; U. 2. 29; प्रचलाकिकलापिनौ Trik.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलायित|प्रचलायितं
प्रचलायित <i>a.</i> Rolling about, tossing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचलायितम्
प्रचलायित + .{@-तम्@} Nodding the head (while asleep in a sitting posture).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचषालम्
प्रचषालम् A particular ornament on a sacrificial post; चषालं<BR> प्रचषालं च यस्य यूपे हिरण्मये Mb. 7. 61. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचालः|प्रचाल
प्रचालः The neck of the Indian lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचि
प्रचि €5 U.<BR>—1 To collect, gather.<BR>—2 To add to, increase, develop; to enhance, augment.<BR>—3 To cut down; परेषामुत्तमाङ्गानि प्रचिन्वन्तमथेषुभिः Mb. 6. 14. 12. ━<i>Pass.</i><BR>—1 To grow, be developed; प्रचीयमानावयवा रराज सा R. 3. 7.<BR>—2 To increase, multiply, thrive, prosper; अपि प्रचीयन्ते संव्यवहाराणां<BR> वृद्धिलाभाः Mu. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचयः|प्रचय
प्रच(चा)यः<BR>—1 Collecting, gathering (as flowers); P. III. 3. 40.<BR>—2 A multitude, quantity, collection, number; प्रसन्नः पुण्यानां प्रचय<BR> इव सर्वस्य सुखदः Mv. 2. 15.<BR>—3 Growth, increase.<BR>—4 Slight union.<BR>—5 The neutral accentless tone (एकश्रुति).<BR>—6 (In alg.) The common difference of terms in a progression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचायः|प्रचाय
प्रच(चा)यः<BR>—1 Collecting, gathering (as flowers); P. III. 3. 40.<BR>—2 A multitude, quantity, collection, number; प्रसन्नः पुण्यानां प्रचय<BR> इव सर्वस्य सुखदः Mv. 2. 15.<BR>—3 Growth, increase.<BR>—4 Slight union.<BR>—5 The neutral accentless tone (एकश्रुति).<BR>—6 (In alg.) The common difference of terms in a progression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचयनम्
प्रचयनम् Collecting, gathering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचायिका
प्रचायिका<BR>—1 Gathering (flowers &c.) in turn.<BR>—2 A female who gathers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचित
प्रचित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Gathered, collected, plucked.<BR>—2 Amassed, accumulated.<BR>—3 Covered, filled.<BR>—4 Accentless (अनुदात्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचेय
प्रचेय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be gathered.<BR>—2 To be increased.<BR>—3 Spreading everywhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुद्
प्रचुद् €10 U.<BR>—1 To impel, prompt, urge, incite; धियो यो नः प्रचोदयात् Gāyatrīmantra;<BR> चापलाय प्रचोदितः R. 1. 9.<BR>—2 To drive or urge on, push on.<BR>—3 To excite, inspire, encourage, incite, stimulate.<BR>—4 To enjoin, direct, prescribe.<BR>—5 To request, ask.<BR>—6 To fix, settle, determine.<BR>—7 To proclaim, announce; परिवेषयेत प्रयतो गुणान् सर्वान् प्रचोदयन् Ms. 3. 228.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदः|प्रचोद
प्रचोदः<BR>—1 Driving onward, urging, inciting.<BR>—2 Instigating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदक
प्रचोदक <i>a.</i> Driving onward, urging, inciting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदनम्
प्रचोदनम्<BR>—1 Driving onward, urging, inciting.<BR>—2 Instigating, setting on.<BR>—3 Ordering, enjoining, prescribing.<BR>—4 A rule, precept, order, commandment.<BR>—5 Saying.<BR>—6 Sending, despatching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदित|प्रचोदितः
प्रचोदित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Urged, incited.<BR>—2 Instigated.<BR>—3 Directed, ordered, prescribed; चोदितो गुरुणा नित्यमप्रचोदित एव<BR> वा । कुर्यादध्ययने यत्नमाचार्यस्य हितेषु च ॥ Ms. 2. 191.<BR>—4 Sent, despatched.<BR>—5 Decreed, determined.<BR>—6 Announced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदिन्
प्रचोदिन् <i>a.</i> Driving on, urging &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचोदिनी
प्रचोदिन् + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 A prickly nightshade.<BR>—2 N. of a plant; Solanum Indicum or Solanum Jacquini (Mar. रिंगणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1060-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुर|प्रचुरं|प्रचुरः
प्रचुर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Much, ample, abundant, plentiful; नित्यव्यया प्रचुरनित्यधनागमा<BR> च Bh. 2. 47; Śi. 12. 72; महात्मनां वः प्रचुरः समागमः Bhāg.<BR>—2 Great, large, extensive; प्रचुरपुरन्दरधनुः Gīt. 2.<BR>—3 (At the end of comp.) Abounding in, filled or replete with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1061-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुरः|प्रचुर|प्रचुरं
प्रचुर + .{@-रः@} A thief.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रचुरपरिभवः, प्रचुरपुरुष<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1061-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुरपरिभवः|प्रचुरपरिभव
प्रचुर + -परिभवः frequent humiliation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1061-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुरपुरुष|प्रचुरपुरुषः
प्रचुर + -पुरुष <i>a.</i> populous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1061-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुरपुरुषः|प्रचुरपुरुष
प्रचुर + -पुरुष + .({@-षः@}) a thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1061-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुरता
प्रचुरता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Abundance, plenty, copiousness.<BR>—2 Multitude, quantity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1061-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रचुरत्वम्
प्रचुरता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Abundance, plenty, copiousness.<BR>—2 Multitude, quantity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1061-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

