/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यंशम्
प्रति + -अंशम् <i>ind.</i> on the shoulders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यक्षरम्
प्रति + -अक्षरम् <i>ind.</i> in every syllable or letter; प्रत्यक्षरश्लेषमयप्रबन्ध Vās.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यग्नि
प्रति + -अग्नि <i>ind.</i> towards the fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यग्र|प्रत्यग्रः
प्रति + -अग्र = प्रत्यग्र q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यङ्गम्|प्रत्यंगम्
प्रति + -अङ्गम्<BR>—1 a secondary or minor limb (of the body), as the nose.<BR>—2 a division, chapter, section.<BR>—3 every limb. —4 a weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यङ्गम्|प्रत्यंगम्
प्रति + -अङ्गम् + .({@-ङ्गम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 on or at every limb of the body; as in प्रत्यङ्गमालिङ्गितः Gīt. 1.<BR>—2 for every subdivision.<BR>—3 in each case (in grammar).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यधिदेवता
प्रति + -अधिदेवता a tutelary deity who stays in front or near one; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यधिष्ठानम्
प्रति + -अधिष्ठानम्, -आधानम्<BR>—1 the principal place of residence; Bṛ. Up. 2. 2. 1.<BR>—2 repository.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याधानम्
प्रति + -अधिष्ठानम्, -आधानम्<BR>—1 the principal place of residence; Bṛ. Up. 2. 2. 1.<BR>—2 repository.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनन्तर|प्रत्यनंतर
प्रति + -अनन्तर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 being in immediate neighbourhood; दानमानादिसत्कारैः कुरुष्व प्रत्यनन्तरम्<BR> Rām. 4. 15. 27. (com. प्रत्यनन्तरं स्वाधीनम्).<BR>—2 standing nearest (as an heir).<BR>—3 immediately following, closely connected with; जीवेत् क्षत्रियधर्मेण<BR> स ह्यस्य (ब्राह्मणस्य) प्रत्यनन्तरः Ms. 10. 82, 8. 185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनन्तरम्
प्रति + -अनन्तर + .({@-रम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 immediately after.<BR>—2 next in succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनन्तरीभू
प्रति + -अनन्तरीभू to betake oneself close to; P. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनिलम्
प्रति + -अनिलम् <i>ind.</i> towards or against the wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनीक|प्रत्यनीकः
प्रति + -अनीक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 hostile, opposed, inimical.<BR>—2 resisting, opposing.<BR>—3 opposite.<BR>—4 equal, vying with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनीकः|प्रत्यनीक
प्रति + -अनीक + .({@-कः@}) an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनीकम्
प्रति + -अनीक + .({@-कम्@})<BR>—1 hostility, enmity, hostile attitude or position; न शक्ताः प्रत्यनीकेषु<BR> स्थातुं मम सुरासुराः Rām.<BR>—2 a hostile army; यस्य शूरा महेष्वासाः प्रत्यनीकगता रणे Mb.;<BR> येऽवस्थिताः प्रत्यनीकेषु योधाः Bg. 11. 32. (प्र˚ may have here sense 1 also).<BR>—3 (in Rhet.) a figure of speech in which one tries to injure a person<BR> or thing connected with an enemy who himself cannot be injured; प्रतिपक्षमशक्तेन<BR> प्रतिकर्तुं तिरस्क्रिया । या तदीयस्य तत्स्तुत्यै प्रत्यनीकं तदुच्यते K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनुप्रासः|प्रत्यनुप्रास
प्रति + -अनुप्रासः a kind of alliteration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यनुमानम्
प्रति + -अनुमानम् an opposite conclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यन्त|प्रत्यंत|प्रत्यन्तः
प्रति + -अन्त <i>a.</i> contiguous, lying close to,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">Page1068-1</a>]<BR> adjacent, bordering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यन्तः|प्रत्यन्त|प्रत्यंत
प्रति + -अन्त + .({@-न्तः@})<BR>—1 a border, frontier; स गुप्तमूलप्रत्यन्तः R. 4. 26.<BR>—2 a bordering country; especially, a country occupied by barbarian or<BR> Mlecchas. ˚देशः a bordering country. ˚पर्वतः an adjacent<BR> hill; पादाः प्रत्यन्तपर्वताः Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1067-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यन्धकार
प्रति + -अन्धकार <i>a.</i> spreading shadow; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यपकारः|प्रत्यपकार
प्रति + -अपकारः retaliation, injury in return; शाम्येत् प्रत्यपकारेण<BR> नोपकारेण दुर्जनः Ku. 2. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यब्दम्
प्रति + -अब्दम् <i>ind.</i> every year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यमित्र|प्रत्यमित्रः
प्रति + -अमित्र <i>a.</i> hostile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यमित्रः|प्रत्यमित्र
प्रति + -अमित्र + .({@-त्रः@}) an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यमित्रम्
प्रति + -अमित्र + .({@-त्रम्@}) <i>ind.</i> towards as enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यरिः|प्रत्यरि
प्रति + -अरिः<BR>—1 a well-matched opponent.<BR>—2 the 9th, 14th or 23rd asterism from the जन्मनक्षत्र.<BR>—3 a particular asterism; दारुणेषु च सर्वेषु प्रत्यरिं च विवर्जयेत्<BR> Mb. 13. 104. 28 (com. प्रत्यरिं स्वनक्षत्राद् दिननक्षत्रं यावद् गणयित्वा<BR> नवभिर्भागे हृते पञ्चमी तारा प्रत्यरिः ।).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्कः|प्रत्यर्क
प्रति + -अर्कः a mock sun; parhelion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यर्गलम्
प्रति + -अर्गलम् the rope by which a churning stick is moved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवयवम्
प्रति + -अवयवम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 in every limb.<BR>—2 in every particular, in detail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यवर
प्रति + -अवर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 lower, less honoured; पुरावरान् प्रत्यवरान् गरीयसः Mb. 13. 94. 12.<BR>—2 very low or degrading, very insignificant; Ms. 10. 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यश्मन्
प्रति + -अश्मन् <i>m.</i> red chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यष्ठीला
प्रति + -अष्ठीला a kind of nervous disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यहम्
प्रति + -अहम् <i>ind.</i> every day, daily; day by day; गिरिशमुपचचार<BR> प्रत्यहं सा सुकेशी Ku. 1. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याकारः|प्रत्याकार
प्रति + -आकारः a scabbard, sheath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याघातः|प्रत्याघात
प्रति + -आघातः<BR>—1 a counter-stroke.<BR>—2 reaction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याचारः|प्रत्याचार
प्रति + -आचारः suitable conduct or behaviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यात्मम्
प्रति + -आत्मम् <i>ind.</i> singly, severally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यात्मक
प्रति + -आत्मक <i>a.</i> belonging to oneself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यात्म्यम्
प्रति + -आत्म्यम् similarity with oneself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यात्म्येन
प्रति + -आत्म्येन <i>ind.</i> after oneʼs own image; स किंनरान् किंपुरुषान्<BR> प्रत्यात्म्येनासृजत् प्रभुः Bhāg. 3. 20. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यादित्यः|प्रत्यादित्य
प्रति + -आदित्यः a mock sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यारम्भः|प्रत्यारम्भ|प्रत्यारंभ
प्रति + -आरम्भः<BR>—1 recommencement, second beginning.<BR>—2 prohibition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यार्द्र
प्रति + -आर्द्र <i>a.</i> fresh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याशा
प्रति + -आशा<BR>—1 hope, expectation; न यत्र प्रत्याशामनुपतति नो वा रहयति Māl. 9. 8.<BR>—2 trust, confidence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यासङ्गः|प्रत्यासङ्ग
प्रति + -आसङ्गः Connection, contact; अथ प्रत्यासङ्गः कमपि महिमानं<BR> वितरति Mv. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यास्वर
प्रति + -आस्वर<BR>—1 returning;<BR>—2 reflecting; Ch. Up. 1. 3. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्याह्वयः|प्रत्याह्वय
प्रति + -आह्वयः echo, resonance; छाया प्रत्याह्वयाभासा ह्यसन्तोऽप्यर्थकारिणः<BR> Bhāg. 11. 28. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युत्तरम्
प्रति + -उत्तरम् a reply, rejoinder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्युलूकः|प्रत्युलूक
प्रति + -उलूकः<BR>—1 a crow; मृत्युदूतः कपोतोऽयमुलूकः कम्पयन्मनः । प्रत्युलूकश्च<BR> कुह्वानैरनिद्रौ शून्यमिच्छतः ॥ Bhāg. 1. 14. 14.<BR>—2 a bird resembling an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्यृचम्
प्रति + -ऋचम् <i>ind.</i> in each <i>Ṛk</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येक|प्रत्येकं
प्रति + -एक <i>a.</i> each, each one, every single one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येकम्
प्रति + -एक + .({@-कम्@}) <i>ind.</i> —1 one at a time, severally; singly, in every one,<BR> to every one; oft. with the force of an adjective; विवेश दण्डकारण्यं<BR> प्रत्येकं च सतां मनः R. 12. 9 ‘entered the mind of every good man’; 12. 3, 7. 34;<BR> Ku. 2. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रत्येनस्
प्रति + -एनस् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an officer of justice (who punishes criminals); Bṛ. Up. 4. 3. 7.<BR>—2 a heir responsible for the debts of the deceased; surety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकञ्चुकः|प्रतिकञ्चुक|प्रतिकंचुक
प्रति + -कञ्चुकः<BR>—1 an adversary.<BR>—2 a critic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकण्ठम्|प्रतिकंठम्
प्रति + -कण्ठम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 severally, one by one.<BR>—2 near the throat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकलम्
प्रति + -कलम् <i>ind.</i> constantly, perpetually.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकश
प्रति + -कश <i>a.</i> not obeying the whip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकष्ट
प्रति + -कष्ट <i>a.</i> comparatively bad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकामिनी
प्रति + -कामिनी a female rival; Śi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकायः|प्रतिकाय
प्रति + -कायः<BR>—1 an effigy, image, picture, likeness.<BR>—2 an adversary; स वृषध्वजसायकावभिन्नं जयहेतुः प्रतिकायमेषणीयम् Ki. 13. 28.<BR>—3 a target, butt, mark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकितवः|प्रतिकितव
प्रति + -कितवः an opponent in a game.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकुञ्जरः|प्रतिकुञ्जर|प्रतिकुंजर
प्रति + -कुञ्जरः a hostile elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूपः|प्रतिकूप
प्रति + -कूपः a moat, ditch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूल|प्रतिकूलं
प्रति + -कूल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 unfavourable, adverse,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">Page1068-2</a>]<BR> contrary, hostile, opposite, प्रतिकूलतामुपगते हि विधौ विफलत्वमेति<BR> बहुसाधनता Śi. 9. 6; Ku. 3. 24.<BR>—2 harsh, discordant, unpleasant, disagreeable; अप्यन्नपुष्टा प्रतिकूलशब्दा Ku. 1. 45.<BR>—3 inauspicious.<BR>—4 contradictory.<BR>—5 reverse, inverted.<BR>—6 perverse, cross, peevish, stubborn. ˚आचरणम्, ˚आचरितम् any offensive<BR> or hostile action or conduct; प्रतिकूलाचरितं क्षमख मे R. 8. 81.<BR> ˚उक्तम्, -क्तिः <i>f.</i> a contradiction. ˚कारिन्, -कृत, -चारिन्, -वृत्ति<BR> <i>a.</i> opposing. ˚दर्शन <i>a.</i> having an inauspicious or ungracious<BR> appearance. ˚प्रवर्तिन्, -वर्तिन् <i>a.</i> acting adversely, taking an<BR> adverse course. ˚भाषिन् <i>a.</i> opposing, contradicting. ˚वचनम्<BR> disagreeable or unpleasant speech. ˚वादः contradiction. (प्रतिकूलता,<BR> -त्वम् adverseness, opposition, hostility. प्रतिकूलयति ‘to oppose’.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूल|प्रतिकूलं
प्रति + -कूल <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 adversely, contrarily.<BR>—2 inversely, in inverted order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूलय
प्रति + -कूलय Den. P. to resist, oppose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकूलिक
प्रति + -कूलिक <i>a.</i> hostile, inimical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षणम्
प्रति + -क्षणम् <i>ind.</i> at every moment or instant, constantly; प्रतिक्षणं<BR> संभ्रमलोलदृष्टिर्लीलारबिन्देन निवारयन्ती Ku. 3. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षपम्
प्रति + -क्षपम् <i>ind.</i> every night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगजः|प्रतिगज
प्रति + -गजः a hostile elephant<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगात्रम्
प्रति + -गात्रम् <i>ind.</i> in very limb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगिरिः|प्रतिगिरि
प्रति + -गिरिः<BR>—1 an opposite mountain.<BR>—2 an inferior mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगृहम्
प्रति + -गृहम्, -गेहम् <i>ind.</i> in every house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगेहम्
प्रति + -गृहम्, -गेहम् <i>ind.</i> in every house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रामम्
प्रति + -ग्रामम् <i>ind.</i> in every village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिचक्रम्
प्रति + -चक्रम् a hostile army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिचन्द्रः|प्रतिचन्द्र|प्रतिचंद्र
प्रति + -चन्द्रः a mock moon; paraselene.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिचरणम्
प्रति + -चरणम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 in every (Vedic) school or branch.<BR>—2 at every foot-step.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिच्छाया|प्रतिछाया
प्रति + -छाया, -छायिका<BR>—1 a reflected image, reflection, shadow; रूपं प्रतिच्छायिकयोपनीतम् N. 6. 45.<BR>—2 an image, picture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिच्छायिका
प्रति + -छाया, -छायिका<BR>—1 a reflected image, reflection, shadow; रूपं प्रतिच्छायिकयोपनीतम् N. 6. 45.<BR>—2 an image, picture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजङ्घा|प्रतिजंघा
प्रति + -जङ्घा the forepart of the leg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजिह्वा
प्रति + -जिह्वा, -जिह्विका the soft palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिजिह्विका
प्रति + -जिह्वा, -जिह्विका the soft palate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितन्त्रम्|प्रतितंत्रम्
प्रति + -तन्त्रम् <i>ind.</i> according to each Tantra or opinion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतितन्त्रसिद्धान्तः|प्रतितन्त्रसिद्धान्त|प्रतितंत्रसिद्धांत
प्रति + -तन्त्रसिद्धान्तः a conclusion adopted by one of the disputants<BR> only; (वादिप्रतिवाद्येकतरमात्राभ्युपगतः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतित्र्यहम्
प्रति + -त्र्यहम् <i>ind.</i> for three days at a time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदण्ड
प्रति + -दण्ड <i>a.</i> Ved. disobedient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदिनम्
प्रति + -दिनम् <i>ind.</i> every day; राशीभूतः प्रतिदिनमिव त्र्यम्बकस्याट्टहासः Me. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदिशम्
प्रति + -दिशम् <i>ind.</i> in every direction, all round, everywhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदूतः|प्रतिदूत
प्रति + -दूतः a messenger sent in return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदेवता
प्रति + -देवता a corresponding deity; गताः कलाः पञ्चदश प्रतिष्ठा<BR> देवाश्च सर्वे प्रतिदेवतासु Muṇḍ. 3. 2. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदेशम्
प्रति + -देशम् <i>ind.</i> in every country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदेहम्
प्रति + -देहम् <i>ind.</i> in every body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिदैवतम्
प्रति + -दैवतम् <i>ind.</i> for every deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्वन्द्वः|प्रतिद्वन्द्व|प्रतिद्वंद्व
प्रति + -द्वन्द्वः<BR>—1 an antagonist, opponent, adversary, rival.<BR>—2 an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्वन्द्वम्
प्रति + -द्वन्द्वः + .({@-द्वम्@}) opposition, hostility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्वन्द्विन्|प्रतिद्वंद्विन्
प्रति + -द्वन्द्विन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 hostile, inimical.<BR>—2 adverse (प्रतिकूल); कृतान्तदुर्वृत्त इवापरेषां पुरः प्रतिद्वन्द्विनि<BR> पाण्डवास्त्रे Ki. 16. 29.<BR>—3 rivalling, vying with; किसलयोद्भेदप्रतिद्वन्दिभिः (करतलैः)<BR> Ś. 4. 5. ━(<i>m.</i>) an opponent, adversary, rival; तुल्यप्रतिद्वन्द्वि<BR> बभूव युद्धम् R. 7. 37, 15. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिद्वारम्
प्रति + -द्वारम् <i>ind.</i> at every gate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिधुरः|प्रतिधुर
प्रति + -धुरः a horse harnessed by the side of another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनप्तृ
प्रति + -नप्तृ <i>m.</i> great-grandson, a sonʼs grandson.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनव|प्रतिनवं
प्रति + -नव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 new, young, fresh.<BR>—2 newly blown or budded; सान्ध्यं तेजः प्रतिनवजपापुष्परक्तं दधानः Me. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनाडी
प्रति + -नाडी a branch-vein.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनायकः|प्रतिनायक
प्रति + -नायकः the adversary of the hero of any poetic composition;<BR> धीरोद्धतः पापकारी व्यसनी प्रतिनायकः S. D., as रावण in the<BR> Rāmāyaṇa, शिशुपाल in Māgha-Kāvya &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनारी
प्रति + -नारी, -पत्नी, -युवतिः a female rival; Śi. 7. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपत्नी
प्रति + -नारी, -पत्नी, -युवतिः a female rival; Śi. 7. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियुवतिः|प्रतियुवति
प्रति + -नारी, -पत्नी, -युवतिः a female rival; Śi. 7. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिनिनदः|प्रतिनिनद
प्रति + -निनदः = प्रतिध्वनिः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिन्यायम्
प्रति + -न्यायम् <i>ind.</i> in inverted order; पुनः प्रतिन्यायं प्रतियोन्याद्रवति<BR> स्वप्नायैव Bṛ. Up. 4. 3. 15.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">Page1069-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1068-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपक्ष|प्रतिपक्षः
प्रति + -पक्ष <i>a.</i> like, similar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपक्षः|प्रतिपक्ष
प्रति + -पक्ष + .({@-क्षः@})<BR>—1 the opposite side, party or faction, hostility; विमृश्य पक्षप्रतिपक्षाभ्यामवधारणं<BR> नियमः Gaut. S.<BR>—2 an adversary, enemy, foe, rival; प्रतिपक्षकामिनी, -लक्ष्मी ‘a rival wife’<BR>; Bv. 2. 64; दासीकृतायाः प्रतिपक्षलक्ष्याः Vikr. 1. 73;<BR> प्रतिपक्षमशक्तेन प्रतिकर्तुम् K. P. 10; Vikr. 1. 70; often used<BR> in comp. in the sense of ‘equal’ or ‘similar’.<BR>—3 remedy, expiation; यादवस्य पापस्य प्रतिपक्षमुपदिशामि Nāg. 5.<BR>—4 a defendant or respondent (in law). ˚ता<BR>—1 hostility, opposition.<BR>—2 obstacle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपक्षित
प्रति + -पक्षित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 containing a contradiction.<BR>—2 nullified by a contradictory premise; (as a <i>hetu</i> in न्याय);<BR> cf. सत्प्रतिपक्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपक्षिन्
प्रति + -पक्षिन् <i>m.</i> an opponent, adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपण्यम्
प्रति + -पण्यम् merchandise in exchange; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपथम्
प्रति + -पथम् <i>ind.</i> along the road, towards the way; प्रतिपथगतिरासीद्<BR> वेगदीघींकृताङ्गः Ku. 3. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपदम्
प्रति + -पदम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 at every step.<BR>—2 at every place, everywhere.<BR>—3 expressly.<BR>—4 in every word; प्रतिपदाख्याने तु गौरवं परिहरद्भिर्वृत्तिकारैः सर्वसामान्यः<BR> शब्दः प्रतिगृहीतः प्रकृतिवदिति ŚB. on MS. 8. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपल्लवः|प्रतिपल्लव
प्रति + -पल्लवः an opposite or outstretched branch; R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपाणः|प्रतिपाण
प्रति + -पाणः<BR>—1 a stake.<BR>—2 a counter-pledge.<BR>—3 a counter-stake; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादम्
प्रति + -पादम् <i>ind.</i> in each quarter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपात्रम्
प्रति + -पात्रम् <i>ind.</i> with regard to each part, of each character;<BR> प्रतिपात्रमाधीयतां यत्नः Ś. ‘let care be taken of each character’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपादपम्
प्रति + -पादपम् <i>ind.</i> in every tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपाप
प्रति + -पाप <i>a.</i> returning sin for sin, requiting evil for evil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपुरुषः|प्रतिपुरुष
प्रति + -पुरुषः, -पूरुषः<BR>—1 a like or similar man.<BR>—2 a substitute, deputy.<BR>—3 a companion.<BR>—4 the effigy of a man pushed by thieves into the interior of a house<BR> before entering it themselves (to ascertain if any body is awake).<BR>—5 an effigy in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपुरुषम्
प्रति + -पुरुषः, -पूरुषः + .({@-षम्@}) <i>ind.</i> man by man, for each man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूरुषः|प्रतिपूरुष
प्रति + -पुरुषः, -पूरुषः<BR>—1 a like or similar man.<BR>—2 a substitute, deputy.<BR>—3 a companion.<BR>—4 the effigy of a man pushed by thieves into the interior of a house<BR> before entering it themselves (to ascertain if any body is awake).<BR>—5 an effigy in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपुस्तकम्
प्रति + -पुस्तकम् a copy of an original manuscript.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिपूर्वाह्णम्
प्रति + -पूर्वाह्णम् <i>ind.</i> every forenoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रति
प्रति + -प्रति <i>a.</i> counter-balancing, equal to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रभातम्
प्रति + -प्रभातम् <i>ind.</i> every morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रसवः|प्रतिप्रसव
प्रति + -प्रसवः<BR>—1 (As opposed to अनुप्रसव) tracing causes back to the origin as<BR> −a pot, a lump of mud, mud, clay. Pātañjala Yogadarśana.<BR>—2 Negation of (or exception to) a negation. The force of a प्रतिप्रसव<BR> is positive, limiting as it does the scope of a प्रतिषेध or negation.<BR> Hence it is just the opposite of परिसंख्या whose force is negative<BR> or exclusive since it limits the scope of a positive statement. प्रतिप्रसवोऽयं<BR> न परिसंख्या ŚB. on MS. 10. 7. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्राकारः|प्रतिप्राकार
प्रति + -प्राकारः an outer wall or rampart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिप्रियम्
प्रति + -प्रियम् a kindness or service in return; प्रतिप्रियं चेद् भवतो<BR> न कुर्यां वृथा हि मे स्यात् स्वपदोपलब्धिः R. 5. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबन्धुः|प्रतिबन्धु|प्रतिबंधु
प्रति + -बन्धुः an equal in rank or station; Mb. 5. 121. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबल|प्रतिबलः
प्रति + -बल^1 <i>a.</i><BR>—1 able, powerful.<BR>—2 equal in strength, equally matched or powerful.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबलम्
प्रति + -बलः + .({@-लम्@})<BR>—1 a hostile army; अस्त्रज्वालावलीढप्रतिबलजलधेरन्तरौर्वायमाणे Ve. 3. 7.<BR>—2 strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबाहु
प्रति + -बाहु<BR>—1 the forepart of the arm.<BR>—2 an opposite side (in a square or polygon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबिम्बः|प्रतिबिम्ब|प्रतिबिंब
प्रति + -बिम्बः, -विम्बः, -बिम्बम्, -विम्बम्<BR>—1 a reflection, reflected image; ज्योतिषां प्रतिबिम्बानि प्राप्नुवन्त्युपहारताम्<BR> Ku. 6. 42; Śi. 9. 18.<BR>—2 an image, a picture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविम्बः|प्रतिविम्ब|प्रतिविंब|प्रतिविम्बं
प्रति + -बिम्बः, -विम्बः, -बिम्बम्, -विम्बम्<BR>—1 a reflection, reflected image; ज्योतिषां प्रतिबिम्बानि प्राप्नुवन्त्युपहारताम्<BR> Ku. 6. 42; Śi. 9. 18.<BR>—2 an image, a picture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबिम्बम्
प्रति + -बिम्बः, -विम्बः, -बिम्बम्, -विम्बम्<BR>—1 a reflection, reflected image; ज्योतिषां प्रतिबिम्बानि प्राप्नुवन्त्युपहारताम्<BR> Ku. 6. 42; Śi. 9. 18.<BR>—2 an image, a picture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविम्बम्
प्रति + -बिम्बः, -विम्बः, -बिम्बम्, -विम्बम्<BR>—1 a reflection, reflected image; ज्योतिषां प्रतिबिम्बानि प्राप्नुवन्त्युपहारताम्<BR> Ku. 6. 42; Śi. 9. 18.<BR>—2 an image, a picture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिबीजम्
प्रति + -बीजम् a rotten seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभट|प्रतिभटः
प्रति + -भट <i>a.</i> vying with, rivalling; घटप्रतिभटस्तनि N. 13. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभटः|प्रतिभट
प्रति + -भट + .({@-टः@})<BR>—1 a rival, an opponent; निवासः कन्दर्पप्रतिभटजटाजूटभवने G. L. 21.<BR>—2 a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">Page1069-2</a>]<BR> warrior on the opposite side; समालोक्याजौ त्वां विदधति विकल्पान् प्रतिभटाः K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभय|प्रतिभयं
प्रति + -भय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fearful, formidable, terrible, frightful.<BR>—2 dangerous; स्वगृहोद्यानगतेऽपि स्निग्धैः पापं विशङ्क्यते मोहात् । किमु<BR> दृष्टबह्वपायप्रतिभयकान्तारमध्यस्थे ॥ Pt. 2. 171; Nāg. 5. 1; Bhāg. 1. 6. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभयम्
प्रति + -भय + .({@-यम्@}) a danger; सुनन्द, श्रुतं मया संनिहितगरुडप्रतिभयमुद्देशं<BR> जामाता जीमूतवाहनो गतः Nāg. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिभैरव
प्रति + -भैरव <i>a.</i> dreadful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमञ्चः|प्रतिमञ्च
प्रति + -मञ्चः a kind of measure (in music).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमञ्चाः
प्रति + -मञ्चाः platforms opposite to each other; दशभागिकौ द्वौ प्रतिमञ्चौ<BR> Kau. A. 2. 3. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमण्डलम्
प्रति + -मण्डलम्<BR>—1 a secondary disc (of the sun &c.). —2 an eccentric orbit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमन्दिरम्|प्रतिमंदिरम्
प्रति + -मन्दिरम् <i>ind.</i> in every house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमल्लः|प्रतिमल्ल
प्रति + -मल्लः an antagonist, a rival; उपेयिवांसं प्रतिमल्लतां रयस्मये<BR> जितस्य प्रसभं गरुत्मतः N. 1. 63; पातालप्रतिमल्लगल्ल &c. Māl. 5. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमानना
प्रति + -मानना worship (पूजा); स्पर्शमशुचिवपुरर्हति न प्रतिमाननां<BR> तु नितरां नृपोचिताम् Śi. 15. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमाया
प्रति + -माया a counter-spell or charm; प्रतिमाया कृतं च तत् Mb. 1. 34. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमार्गः|प्रतिमार्ग
प्रति + -मार्गः the way back; Mb. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमार्गम्
प्रति + -मार्गम् <i>ind.</i> back, backwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमाला
प्रति + -माला capping verses (Mar. भंडी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमासम्
प्रति + -मासम् <i>ind.</i> every month, monthly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमित्रम्
प्रति + -मित्रम् an enemy, adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुख
प्रति + -मुख <i>a.</i> standing before the face, facing; प्रतिमुखागत Ms. 8. 291.<BR>—2 near, present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुखम्
प्रति + -मुख + .({@-खम्@}) a secondary plot or incident in a drama which tends either<BR> to hasten or retard the catastrophe; see S. D. 334 and 351-364.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुखम्
प्रति + -मुख + .({@-खम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 towards.<BR>—2 in front, before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुखरी
प्रति + -मुखरी a particular mode of drumming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुद्रा
प्रति + -मुद्रा<BR>—1 a counter-seal.<BR>—2 the impression of a seal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमुहूर्तम्|प्रतिमुहूर्त्तम्
प्रति + -मुहूर्तम् <i>ind.</i> every moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमूर्तिः|प्रतिमूर्ति|प्रतिमूर्त्ति
प्रति + -मूर्तिः <i>f.</i> an image, a likeness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिमूषिका
प्रति + -मूषिका <i>f.</i> a musk-rat (Mar. चिचुंदरी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतियूथपः|प्रतियूथप
प्रति + -यूथपः the leader of a hostile herd of elephants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरथः|प्रतिरथ
प्रति + -रथः an adversary in war (lit. in fighting in a war-chariot);<BR> दौष्यन्तिमप्रतिरथं तनयं निवेश्य Ś. 4. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरथ्यम्
प्रति + -रथ्यम् in every road; अस्मिन् नगरे प्रतिरथ्यं भुजङ्गबद्धसंचारे Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरवः|प्रतिरव
प्रति + -रवः, -ध्वनिः<BR>—1 an echo; प्रतिरवविततो वनानि चक्रे Ki. 10. 4.<BR>—2 quarrel; controversy.<BR>—3 (Ved.) life (प्राण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिध्वनिः|प्रतिध्वनि
प्रति + -रवः, -ध्वनिः<BR>—1 an echo; प्रतिरवविततो वनानि चक्रे Ki. 10. 4.<BR>—2 quarrel; controversy.<BR>—3 (Ved.) life (प्राण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरसितम्
प्रति + -रसितम् an echo; केनास्मत् सिंहनादप्रतिरसितसखो दुन्दुभिस्ताड्यतेऽयम् Ve. 1. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिराजः|प्रतिराज
प्रति + -राजः a hostile king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरात्रम्
प्रति + -रात्रम् <i>ind.</i> every night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरूप|प्रतिरूपं
प्रति + -रूप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 corresponding, similar, having a counter-part in; अग्निर्यथैको भुवनं<BR> प्रविष्टो रूपं रूपं प्रतिरूपो बभूव Kaṭh. 2. 2. 9.<BR>—2 beautiful.<BR>—3 suitable, proper; इदं न प्रतिरूपं ते स्त्रीष्वदाक्षिण्यमीदृशम्<BR> Bu. C. 4. 66; आत्मनः प्रतिरूपं सा बभाषे चारुहासिनी Rām. 4. 19. 17.<BR>—4 facing (अभिमुख); प्रतिरूपं जनं कुर्यान्न चेत् तद् वर्तते<BR> यथा Mb. 12. 97. 16 (com. प्रतिरूपं युद्धाभिमुखम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरूपम्
प्रति + -रूप + .({@-पम्@})<BR>—1 a picture, an image, a likeness.<BR>—2 a mirror-like reflecting object; अदर्शनं स्वशिरसः प्रतिरूपे च<BR> सत्यपि Bhāg. 10. 42. 28.<BR>—4 an object of comparison (उपमान); भवान्मे खलु भक्तानां सर्वेषां<BR> प्रतिरूपधृक् Bhāg. 7. 10. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरूपक|प्रतिरूपकं
प्रति + -रूपक <i>a.</i> resembling, similar (at the end of comp.); जहीमान्<BR> राक्षसान् पापानात्मनः प्रतिरूपकान् Mb. 3. 290. 11; चेष्टाप्रतिरूपिका<BR> मनोवृत्तिः Ś. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिरूपकम्
प्रति + -रूपक + .({@-कम्@})<BR>—1 a picture, an image; अग्निदैर्गरदैश्चैव प्रतिरूपककारकैः Mb. 12. 59. 49.<BR>—2 a forged edict; जर्जरं चास्य विषयं कुर्वन्ति प्रतिरूपकैः Mb. 12. 56. 52.<BR>—3 a reflection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलक्षणम्
प्रति + -लक्षणम् a mark, sign, token.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलिपिः|प्रतिलिपि
प्रति + -लिपिः <i>f.</i> a transcript, a written copy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलेखः|प्रतिलेख
प्रति + -लेखः a writ of reply; प्रावृत्तिकश्च प्रतिलेख एव Kau. A. 2. 10. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलोम|प्रतिलोमः
प्रति + -लोम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 ‘against the hair or grain’<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">Page1070-1</a>]<BR>, contrary to the natural order, inverted, reverse (opp.<BR> अनुलोम); नववर्षसहस्राक्षः प्रतिलोमोऽभवद् गुरुः Bhāg. 12. 14. 15.<BR>—2 contrary to caste (said of the issue of a woman who is of a higher<BR> caste than her husband).<BR>—3 hostile.<BR>—4 low, vile, base.<BR>—5 left (वाम).<BR>—6 obstinate, perverse; अपरिचितस्यापि तेऽप्रतिलोमः संवृत्तः Ś. 7.<BR>—7 disagreeable, unpleasant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलोमम्
प्रति + -लोम + .({@-मम्@}) any injurious or unpleasant act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलोमम्
प्रति + -लोम + .({@-मम्@}) <i>ind.</i> ‘against the hair or grain’, inversely, invertedly.<BR> ˚ज <i>a.</i> born in the inverse order of the castes; <i>i. e.</i> born<BR> of a mother who is of a higher caste than the father; cf. Ms. 10. 16, 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1069-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलोमक
प्रति + -लोमक <i>a.</i> reverse, inverted; राजन्यविप्रयोः कस्माद् विवाहः<BR> प्रतिलोमकः Bhāg. 9. 18. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकम्
प्रति + -कम् inverted order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिलोमतः
प्रति + -लोमतः <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 in consequence of the inverted order or course; Ms. 10. 68.<BR>—2 in an unfriendly manner; यदा बहुविधां वृद्धिं मन्येत प्रतिलोमतः<BR> Mb. 12. 103. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवत्सरम्
प्रति + -वत्सरम् <i>ind.</i> every year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवनम्
प्रति + -वनम् <i>ind.</i> in every forest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवर्णिक
प्रति + -वर्णिक <i>a.</i> similar, corresponding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवर्धिन्
प्रति + -वर्धिन् <i>a.</i> being a match for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवर्षम्
प्रति + -वर्षम् <i>ind.</i> every year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवस्तु
प्रति + -वस्तु <i>n.</i><BR>—1 an equivalent, a counterpart.<BR>—2 anything given in return.<BR>—3 a parallel. ˚उपमा a figure of speech thus defined by Mammaṭa:−<BR> प्रतिवस्तूपमा तु सा ॥ सामान्यस्य द्विरेकस्य यत्र वाक्यद्वये स्थितिः ।<BR> K. P. 10; <i>e. g.</i> तापेन भ्राजते सूर्यः शूरश्चापेन राजते Candr. 5. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवातः|प्रतिवात
प्रति + -वातः a contrary wind; प्रतिवातेऽनुवाते च नासीत गुरुणा सह Ms. 2. 203.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवातम्
प्रति + -वातः + .({@-तम्@}) <i>ind.</i> against the wind; चीनांशुकमिव केतोः प्रतिवातं<BR> नीयमानस्य Ś. 1. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवारणः|प्रतिवारण|प्रतिवारणं
प्रति + -वारणः a hostile elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवासरम्
प्रति + -वासरम् <i>ind.</i> every day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविटपम्
प्रति + -विटपम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 on every branch.<BR>—2 branch by branch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविषम्
प्रति + -विषम् an antidote.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविषा
प्रति + -विषम् + .({@-षा@}) a birch tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिविष्णुकः|प्रतिविष्णुक
प्रति + -विष्णुकः a Muchakunda tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवीरः|प्रतिवीर
प्रति + -वीरः an opponent, antagonist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवीर्यम्
प्रति + -वीर्यम् being equal to or a match for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवृषः|प्रतिवृष
प्रति + -वृषः a hostile bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेलम्
प्रति + -वेलम् <i>ind.</i> at each time, on every occasion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेशः|प्रतिवेश
प्रति + -वेशः<BR>—1 a neighbouring house, neighbourhood.<BR>—2 a neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेशिन्
प्रति + -वेशिन् <i>a.</i> a neighbour; दृष्ट्वा प्रभातसमये प्रतिवेशिवर्गः Mk. 3. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेश्मन्
प्रति + -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i> a neighbourʼs house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवेश्यः|प्रतिवेश्य
प्रति + -वेश्यः a neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिवैरम्
प्रति + -वैरम् requital of hostilities, revenge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशब्दः|प्रतिशब्द
प्रति + -शब्दः<BR>—1 echo, reverberation; वसुधाधरकन्दराभिसर्पी प्रतिशब्दोऽपि हरेर्भिनत्ति<BR> नागान् V. 1. 16; Ku. 6. 64; R. 2. 28.<BR>—2 a roar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशशिन्
प्रति + -शशिन् <i>m.</i> a mock-moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशाखम्
प्रति + -शाखम् <i>ind.</i> for every branch or school (of the Veda).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिशाखा
प्रति + -शाखा a side-branch; महाभूतविशेषश्च विशेषप्रतिशाखवान् Mb. 14. 35. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंवत्सरम्
प्रति + -संवत्सरम् <i>ind.</i> every year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसङ्गक्षिका|प्रतिसंगक्षिका
प्रति + -सङ्गक्षिका a cloak to keep off the dust; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसंदेशः|प्रतिसन्देश|प्रतिसंदेश
प्रति + -संदेशः a reply to the message; दर्पसारस्य प्रतिसंदेशमावेदयत् Dk. 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसम
प्रति + -सम <i>a.</i> equal to, a match for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसव्य|प्रतिसव्यं
प्रति + -सव्य <i>a.</i> in an inverted order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसामन्तः|प्रतिसामन्त
प्रति + -सामन्तः an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसायम्
प्रति + -सायम् <i>ind.</i> every evening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसूर्यः|प्रतिसूर्य|प्रतिसूर्य्य|प्रतिसूर्य्यः
प्रति + -सूर्यः, -सूर्यकः<BR>—1 a mock-sun.<BR>—2 a lizard, chameleon; ‘कृकलासस्तु सरटः प्रतिसूर्यः शयानकः ।’<BR> Hem.; तृष्यद्भिः प्रतिसूर्यकैरजगरस्वेदद्रवः पीयते U. 2. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसूर्यकः|प्रतिसूर्यक|प्रतिसूर्य्यक|प्रतिसूर्य्यकः
प्रति + -सूर्यः, -सूर्यकः<BR>—1 a mock-sun.<BR>—2 a lizard, chameleon; ‘कृकलासस्तु सरटः प्रतिसूर्यः शयानकः ।’<BR> Hem.; तृष्यद्भिः प्रतिसूर्यकैरजगरस्वेदद्रवः पीयते U. 2. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसेना
प्रति + -सेना, -सैन्यम् a hostile army: निहतां प्रतिसैन्येन वडवामिव<BR> पातिताम् Rām. 2. 114. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिसैन्यम्
प्रति + -सेना, -सैन्यम् a hostile army: निहतां प्रतिसैन्येन वडवामिव<BR> पातिताम् Rām. 2. 114. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्थानम्
प्रति + -स्थानम् <i>ind.</i> in every place, everywhere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्मृतिः|प्रतिस्मृति
प्रति + -स्मृतिः N. of particular kind of magic; गृहाणेमां मया प्रोक्तां<BR> सिद्धिं मूर्तिमतीमिव । विद्यां प्रतिस्मृतिं नाम Mb. 3. 36. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिस्रोतस्
प्रति + -स्रोतस् <i>ind.</i> against the stream; सरस्वती प्रतिस्रोतं ययौ<BR> ब्राह्मणसंवृतः Bhāg. 10. 78. 18.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">Page1070-2</a>]<BR>━<i>a.</i> going against the stream; अथासाद्य तु कालिन्दीं प्रतिस्रोतः<BR> समागताम् Rām. 2. 55. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहस्तः|प्रतिहस्त
प्रति + -हस्तः, -हस्तकः a deputy, an agent, substitute, proxy; आश्रितानां<BR> भृतौ स्वामिसेवायां धर्मसेवने । पुत्रस्योत्पादने चैव न सन्ति प्रतिहस्तकाः ॥ H. 2. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहस्तकः|प्रतिहस्तक
प्रति + -हस्तः, -हस्तकः a deputy, an agent, substitute, proxy; आश्रितानां<BR> भृतौ स्वामिसेवायां धर्मसेवने । पुत्रस्योत्पादने चैव न सन्ति प्रतिहस्तकाः ॥ H. 2. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहस्तीकृ
प्रति + -हस्तीकृ to take; Pratijñā. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिहस्तिन्
प्रति + -हस्तिन् the keeper of a brothel; Dk. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक|प्रतिकः
प्रतिक <i>a.</i> Worth or bought for a Kārṣāpaṇa, q. v. P. V. 1. 25. Vārt. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्षः|प्रतिकर्ष
प्रतिकर्षः<BR>—1 Aggregation, drawing together.<BR>—2 Anticipation (of a word) occurring later on. See अपकर्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकषः|प्रतिकष
प्रतिकषः<BR>—1 A leader.<BR>—2 An assistant.<BR>—3 A messenger (वार्ताहर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकाशः|प्रतिकाश
प्रति(ती)काशः<BR>—1 A reflection.<BR>—2 Look, appearance, resemblance; oft. at the end of comp. in this sense<BR> and translated by ‘like’, ‘resembling’; पुटपाकप्रतीकाशः U. 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीकाशः|प्रतीकाश
प्रति(ती)काशः<BR>—1 A reflection.<BR>—2 Look, appearance, resemblance; oft. at the end of comp. in this sense<BR> and translated by ‘like’, ‘resembling’; पुटपाकप्रतीकाशः U. 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकुञ्चित|प्रतिकुंचित
प्रतिकुञ्चित <i>a.</i> Bent, curved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृ
प्रतिकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To requite, pay back, repay, return; पूर्वं कृतार्थो मित्राणां नार्थं<BR> प्रतिकरोति यः Rām.<BR>—2 To remedy, cure; व्याधिमिच्छामि ते ज्ञातुं प्रतिकुर्यां हि तत्र वै Mb.<BR>—3 To give back, restore, replace; प्रतिकुर्याच्च तत् सर्वम् Ms. 9. 285<BR> (com. विनाशितं सर्वं पुनर्नवं कुर्यात्).<BR>—4 To retaliate; R. 12 94.<BR>—5 To counteract.<BR>—6 To repair, mend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकरः|प्रतिकर
प्रतिकरः Requital, compensation; न सुप्रतिकरं तत् तु मात्रा<BR> पित्रा च यत् कृतम् Rām. 2. 111. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्तव्य
प्रतिकर्तव्य, -कार्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be retaliated, returned or paid (as a debt. &c.)<BR>—2 To be counteracted.<BR>—3 To be cured or treated (by a physician).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकार्य
प्रतिकर्तव्य, -कार्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be retaliated, returned or paid (as a debt. &c.)<BR>—2 To be counteracted.<BR>—3 To be cured or treated (by a physician).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकार्यम्
प्रतिकर्तव्य, -कार्य + .{@-र्यम्@} Retribution, retaliation; दिष्टया ते प्रतिकर्तव्ये मतिर्जातेयमच्युत Mb. 10. 4. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्तृ
प्रतिकर्तृ <i>a.</i> (-र्त्री <i>f.</i>)<BR> Requiting, recompensing. ━<i>m.</i> An opponent, adversary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकर्मन्|प्रतिकर्म्मन्
प्रतिकर्मन् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 Requital, retaliation; उषिता स्मो वने वासं प्रतिकर्म चिकीर्षवः Mb. 4. 58. 18.<BR>—2 Redress, remedy, counter-action; पश्येव कृतव्रणप्रतिकर्मा वत्सराजः Pratijñā. 2.<BR>—3 Personal decoration, dress, toilet; (अबलाः) प्रतिकर्म कर्तुमुपचक्रमिरे<BR> समये हि सर्वमुपकारि कृतम् Śi. 9. 43, 5. 27; Ku. 7. 6; आविष्कृताङ्गप्रतिकर्मरम्यं<BR> विभीषणं वाचमुवाच माता Bk. 12. 1; विभूषितेयं प्रतिकर्मनित्या<BR> Rām. 2. 37. 35.<BR>—4 Opposition, hostility.<BR>—5 Bodily suffering; सा कृष्णमाराधय सौहृदेन प्रेम्णा च नित्यं प्रतिकर्मणा<BR> च Mb. 3. 224. 4.<BR>—6 Expiatory and welfare rituals (शान्तिकपौष्टिकादि कर्म); प्रतिकर्म<BR> पराचार ऋत्विजां स्म विधीयते Mb. 12. 79. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकारः|प्रतिकार
प्रति(ती)कारः<BR>—1 Requital, reward, return; उपकारेण वीरस्तु प्रतिकारेण युज्यते<BR> Rām. 4. 27. 45.<BR>—2 Revenge, retaliation, retribution.<BR>—3 Counter-action, obviating, prevention, remedy, application of a remedy;<BR> विकारं खलु परमार्थतोऽज्ञात्वाऽनारम्भः प्रतीकारस्य Ś. 3; प्रतीकारो व्याधे;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">Page1071-1</a>]<BR> सुखमिति विपर्यस्यति जनः Bh. 3. 92.<BR>—4 Opposition, obstruction.<BR>—5 Help.<BR>—6 A kind of treaty where one party requites the services of the other.<BR>—7 Imitating; नैव स्म सीता विनिवृत्तभावा प्रियस्य भर्तुः प्रतिकारकामा<BR> Rām. 2. 37. 37 (com. भर्तुः प्रतिकारकामा वेषादिभिस्तदवस्थासदृशावस्थासंपादनकामा).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रतिकारकर्मन्, प्रतिकारविधानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतीकारः|प्रतीकार
प्रति(ती)कारः<BR>—1 Requital, reward, return; उपकारेण वीरस्तु प्रतिकारेण युज्यते<BR> Rām. 4. 27. 45.<BR>—2 Revenge, retaliation, retribution.<BR>—3 Counter-action, obviating, prevention, remedy, application of a remedy;<BR> विकारं खलु परमार्थतोऽज्ञात्वाऽनारम्भः प्रतीकारस्य Ś. 3; प्रतीकारो व्याधे;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">Page1071-1</a>]<BR> सुखमिति विपर्यस्यति जनः Bh. 3. 92.<BR>—4 Opposition, obstruction.<BR>—5 Help.<BR>—6 A kind of treaty where one party requites the services of the other.<BR>—7 Imitating; नैव स्म सीता विनिवृत्तभावा प्रियस्य भर्तुः प्रतिकारकामा<BR> Rām. 2. 37. 37 (com. भर्तुः प्रतिकारकामा वेषादिभिस्तदवस्थासदृशावस्थासंपादनकामा).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रतिकारकर्मन्, प्रतिकारविधानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1070-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकारकर्मन्
प्रतिकारः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> making reparation or amends.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकारविधानम्
प्रतिकारः + -विधानम् application of a remedy, medical treatment; प्रतिकारविधानमायुषः<BR> सति शेषे हि फलाय कल्पते R. 8. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकारिन्
प्रतिकारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Retaliating, opposing, counteracting.<BR>—2 Applying or using remedies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृत
प्रतिकृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Returned, repaid, requited, retaliated.<BR>—2 Counteracted, remedied.<BR>—3 Obliged (कृतोपकार); तदेवं शक्तियुक्तस्य पूर्वं प्रतिकृतस्तथा ।<BR> रामस्यार्हसि पिङ्गेश कर्तुं सर्वात्मना प्रियम् ॥ Rām. 4. 29. 25; also 4. 29. 20.<BR>—4 Hurt, offended; केन वा ते प्रतिकृतम् Bhāg. 1. 18. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृतम्
प्रतिकृत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Recompense.<BR>—2 Opposition; कृतप्रतिकृतैश्चित्रैर्बाहुभिश्च सुसङ्कटैः Mb. 4. 13. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृतिः|प्रतिकृति
प्रतिकृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Revenge, retaliation; कृते प्रतिकृतिं कुर्याद् हिंसिते प्रतिहिंसितम् Pt. 5. 84.<BR>—2 Return, requital.<BR>—3 A reflection, reflected image; यस्यां दृष्ट्वाऽमलायां प्रतिकृतिममराः<BR> स्वां भवन्त्यानमन्तः Viṣṇupāda. S. 16.<BR>—4 A likeness, picture, statue, an image; सादृश्यप्रतिकृतिदर्शनैः प्रियायाः<BR> R. 8. 92, 14. 87, 18. 53.<BR>—5 A substitute.<BR>—6 Resistance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रिया
प्रतिक्रिया<BR>—1 Recompense, requital.<BR>—2 Retaliation, revenge, retribution.<BR>—3 Counteracting, remedying, removal; पूरोत्पीडे तडागस्य परीवाहः<BR> प्रतिक्रिया U. 3. 29; अहेतुः पक्षपातो यस्तस्य नास्ति प्रतिक्रिया U. 5. 17;<BR> R. 15. 4.<BR>—4 Opposition.<BR>—5 Personal decoration, embellishment, dress.<BR>—6 Protection.<BR>—7 Help, succour.<BR>—8 A fence.<BR>—9 Behaviour (आचरण); नहि युक्ता तवैतस्य रूपस्यैवं प्रतिक्रिया<BR> Rām. 7. 17. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकृष्ट|प्रतिकृष्टं
प्रतिकृष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Twice ploughed.<BR>—2 Repulsed, despised, rejected.<BR>—3 Hidden, concealed.<BR>—4 Low, vile, abject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिकोपः|प्रतिकोप
प्रतिकोपः, प्रतिक्रोधः Anger against any one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रोधः|प्रतिक्रोध
प्रतिकोपः, प्रतिक्रोधः Anger against any one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रमः|प्रतिक्रम
प्रतिक्रमः Inverted order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रमणम्
प्रतिक्रमणम् Ved.<BR>—1 Stepping towards.<BR>—2 (With Buddhists) A confession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्रुष्ट
प्रतिक्रुष्ट <i>a.</i> Miserable, poor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षयः|प्रतिक्षय
प्रतिक्षयः A guard, an attendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षिप्
प्रतिक्षिप् €6 P.<BR>—1 To throw or cast into.<BR>—2 To hurt, injure.<BR>—3 To revile, ridicule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षिप्त|प्रतिक्षिप्तः
प्रतिक्षिप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Turned away, rejected, dismissed.<BR>—2 Repelled, resisted, repulsed, opposed.<BR>—3 Abused, reviled, traduced.<BR>—4 Sent, despatched.<BR>—5 Hurt, injured.<BR>—6 Despised, slighted.<BR>—7 Falsely accused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षिप्तम्
प्रतिक्षिप्त + .{@-प्तम्@} Medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षेपः|प्रतिक्षेप
प्रतिक्षेपः, -प्रतिक्षेपणम्<BR>—1 Not acknowledging, rejection.<BR>—2 Opposing, controverting, contradiction.<BR>—3 Contest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षेपणम्
प्रतिक्षेपः, -प्रतिक्षेपणम्<BR>—1 Not acknowledging, rejection.<BR>—2 Opposing, controverting, contradiction.<BR>—3 Contest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिक्षुतम्
प्रतिक्षुतम् Sneezing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिखुरः|प्रतिखुर
प्रतिखुरः A dead foetus; निःसृतहस्तपादशिरःकायमङ्गी प्रतिखुरः Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिख्यातिः|प्रतिख्याति
प्रतिख्यातिः <i>f.</i> Renown, fame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगद्
प्रतिगद् €1 P. To answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगम्
प्रतिगम् €1 P.<BR>—1 To go towards, advance.<BR>—2 To return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगत|प्रतिगतं
प्रतिगत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Flying backward and forward, wheeling about.<BR>—2 Lost from the memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगमनम्
प्रतिगमनम् Returning, going back, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगरः|प्रतिगर
प्रतिगरः The responsive call (of the अध्वर्यु to होतृ); ओमित्यध्वर्युः<BR> प्रतिगरं प्रतिगृणाति T. Up. 1. 8. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगर्हित
प्रतिगर्हित <i>p. p.</i> Blamed, reviled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगर्ज्
प्रतिगर्ज् €1 P.<BR>—1 To roar at, to roar against.<BR>—2 (fig.) To resist, oppose; अयोहृदयः प्रतिगर्जताम् R. 9. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगर्जना
प्रतिगर्जना Roaring against, answering roar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रह्
प्रतिग्रह् €9 U.<BR>—1 To hold, seize, take, support; वर्षधरप्रतिगृहीतमेनम् M. 4; Ms. 2. 48.<BR>—2 To take, accept, receive; ददाति प्रतिगृह्णाति Pt. 2; अमोघाः प्रतिगृह्णन्तावर्ध्यानुपदमाशिषः<BR> R. 1. 44, 2. 22.<BR>—3 To receive or accept as a present.<BR>—4 To receive inimically, oppose, encounter, resist; to attack, assault;<BR> प्रतिजग्राह कालिङ्गस्तमस्त्रैर्गजसाधनः R. 4. 40, 12. 47.<BR>—5 To take in marriage, marry; विधिवत् प्रतिगृह्यापि त्यजेत् कन्यां विगर्हिताम् Ms. 9. 72.<BR>—6 To obey, conform or listen to.<BR>—7 To resort to, betake oneself to.<BR>—8 To eclipse.<BR>—9 To assent to, admit.<BR>—10 To occupy, take possession of.<BR>—11 To deprive (one) of.<BR>—12 To welcome, receive; प्रत्यगृह्णाद्यथान्यायं विदुरश्च महामनाः Mb. 14. 66. 6.<BR>—13 To eat, drink. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to accept, give, present.<BR>—2 To allow to take or retain; मुष्टं प्रतिग्राहयता स्वमर्थं पात्रीकृतो<BR> दस्युरिवासि येन Ś. 5. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिगृहीत
प्रतिगृहीत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Taken, received, accepted; त्वमम्बया पुत्र इति प्रतिगृहीतः Ś. 2;<BR> प्रतिगृहीतं ब्राह्मणवचनम् V. 2; माता वा प्रतिगृहीता …<BR> अवरुद्धमानयेयुः Kau. A. 1. 18.<BR>—2 Admitted, assented to.<BR>—3 Married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रहः|प्रतिग्रह
प्रतिग्रहः<BR>—1 Receiving, accepting.<BR>—2 Receiving or accepting a donation; अयाचितोपपन्ने तु नास्ति दोषः प्रतिग्रहे<BR>—3 The right of receiving or accepting a donation.<BR>—4 The right of receiving gifts (which is a peculiar prerogative of Brāhmaṇas);<BR> अध्यापनमध्ययनं यजनं याजनं तथा । दानं प्रतिग्रहं चैव ब्राह्मणानामकल्पयत् ॥<BR> Ms. 1. 88, 4. 86; Y. 1. 118.<BR>—5 A gift, present, donation; राज्ञः प्रतिग्रहोऽयम् Ś. 1; Śi. 14. 35.<BR>—6 A receiver (of a gift).<BR>—7 Kind or friendly reception; प्रतिग्रहाय पाण्डूनां प्रेषयामास कौरवान्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1072-1" target="_blank">Page1072-1</a>]<BR> Mb. 1. 207. 12.<BR>—8 Favour, grace.<BR>—9 Marrying; तत्प्रतिग्रहलाभाय जित्वा भूपान् स्वयंवरे Bm. 1. 456.<BR>—10 Listening to.<BR>—11 The rear of an army.<BR>—12 A spitting-pot.<BR>—13 The sun near the moonʼs node.<BR>—14 a chamber-vessel (for sick persons).<BR>—15 a grasper, seizer; केशप्रतिग्रहः = barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1071-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रहणम्
प्रतिग्रहणम्<BR>—1 Receiving presents.<BR>—2 Reception.<BR>—3 Marrying.<BR>—4 A vessel<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1072-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रहिन्
प्रतिग्रहिन् <i>m.</i> A receiver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1072-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रतिग्रहीतृ
प्रतिग्रहीतृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A receiver.<BR>—2 A husband, one who marries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1072-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

