प्रतिग्राहक, -हिन् <i>a.</i><BR> One who receives or accepts gifts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1072-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

