प्रस्थापनम्<BR>—1 Sending away, dismissing, despatching.<BR>—2 Appointment to an embassy.<BR>—3 Proving, demonstrating.<BR>—4 Using, employing.<BR>—5 Carrying off cattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1120-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

