प्रस्नु
प्रस्नु €2 P. To distil, pour forth. (Ā.) To yield milk; P. III. 1. 89 com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1120-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

