प्रस्फिज्
प्रस्फिज् <i>a.</i> Large-hipped; Patañjali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1120-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्फुट्
प्रस्फुट् €10 U.<BR>—1 To pierce through, cleave, split.<BR>—2 To expand, open.<BR>—3 To slap or clap the arms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1120-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

