प्रस्फोटनम्
प्रस्फोटनम्<BR>—1 Expanding, blooming, opening.<BR>—2 Making clear or manifest, disclosing, revealing.<BR>—3 Splitting.<BR>—4 Causing to bloom or blow<BR>—5 Threshing corn.<BR>—6 A winnowing basket.<BR>—7 Striking, beating.<BR>—8 Wiping away, rubbing out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्फुर्
प्रस्फुर् €6 P.<BR>—1 To quiver, tremble.<BR>—2 To expand, be dilated; प्रास्फुरन्नयनम् Mb.<BR>—3 To spread far and wide; संस्थितस्य गुणोत्कर्षः प्रायः प्रस्फुरति<BR> स्फुटम् Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्फुरित
