प्रस्फुरित + -अधर <i>a.</i> one whose lower lip quivers; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

