प्रस्यन्दनम्
प्रस्यन्दः, -न्दनम्<BR> Flowing forth, exudation; trickling out, oozing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

