प्रस्रु
प्रस्रु €1 P.<BR>—1 To flow forth or out, gush forth, ooze out.<BR>—2 To pour out, let flow. ━<i>Caus.</i> Ā. To make water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रवः|प्रस्रव
प्रस्रवः<BR>—1 Trickling forth, gushing, flowing or oozing out.<BR>—2 A flow, stream.<BR>—3 Milk flowing from the breast or udder; प्रस्रवे च शुचिर्वत्सः<BR> Ms. 5. 130; प्रस्रवेण (v. l. for प्रस्नवेन) अभिवर्षन्ती वत्सालोकप्रवर्तिना R. 1. 84.<BR>—4 Urine.<BR>—5 The overflowing scum of boiling rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रवाः
प्रस्रवः + .{@-वाः@} (pl.)<BR>—1 Falling or gushing tears.<BR>—2 morbid matter in the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रवम्
