प्रस्रावः|प्रस्राव
प्रस्रावः<BR>—1 Flowing, oozing.<BR>—2 Urine.<BR>—3 The overflowing scum of boiling rice.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रस्रावकरणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

