प्रस्रुत
प्रस्रुत <i>p. p.</i> Oozed, trickled, dropped, issued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रस्रुतिः|प्रस्रुति
प्रस्रुतिः Flowing forth, oozing out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

