प्रस्वापः|प्रस्वाप
प्रस्वापः<BR>—1 Sleep.<BR>—2 A dream.<BR>—3 A missile which induces sleep; प्राजापत्यं विश्वकृतं प्रस्वापं नाम<BR> भारत Mb. 5. 183. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1121-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

