प्राक्कृतम्
प्राच् + -कृतम् (प्राक्कृतम्) an act done in a former life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1125-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

