प्राग्गामिन्
प्राच् + -गामिन् <i>a.</i> (प्राग्गामिन्)<BR>—1 going before, preceding.<BR>—2 a precursor, forerunner.<BR>—3 going eastward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1125-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राक्चरणा
प्राच् + -चरणा <i>a.</i> (प्राक्चरणा) the female organ of generation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1125-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राक्चिरम्
प्राच् + -चिरम् (प्राक्चिरम्) <i>ind.</i> in due or good time, before too late.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1125-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

