प्राग्देशः|प्राग्देश
प्राच् + -देशः (प्राग्देशः) the eastern country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1125-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

