प्राणेश्वरी
प्राणः + -ईशा, -ईश्वरी a wife, beloved, mistress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणोत्क्रमणम्
प्राणः + -उत्क्रमणम्, -उत्सर्गः departure of the soul, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणोत्सर्गः|प्राणोत्सर्ग
प्राणः + -उत्क्रमणम्, -उत्सर्गः departure of the soul, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणोपहारः|प्राणोपहार
प्राणः + -उपहारः food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणकर
प्राणः + -कर <i>a.</i> refreshing or reviving the spirits; सद्यो मांसं<BR> नवान्नं च बाला स्त्री क्षीरभोजनम् । क्षीरमुष्णोदकं चैव सद्यः प्राणकराणि<BR> षट् ॥ Cāṇ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणकर्मन्|प्राणकर्म्मन्
प्राणः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> Vital function.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणकृच्छ्रम्
