प्राणः + -छेदः murder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणत्यागः|प्राणत्याग
प्राणः + -त्यागः<BR>—1 suicide; वरं प्राणत्यागो न च पिशुनवाक्येष्वभिरुचिः H. 1.<BR>—2 death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणद|प्राणदं|प्राणदः
प्राणः + -द <i>a.</i> life-giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदम्
प्राणः + -द + .({@-दम्@})<BR>—1 water.<BR>—2 blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदः|प्राणद|प्राणदं
प्राणः + -द + .({@-दः@})<BR>—1 Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 Brahmā.<BR>—3 Terminalia Tomentosa (Mar. ऐन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदा
प्राणः + -दा Terminalia Chebula (Mar. हिरडा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदक्षिणा
प्राणः + -दक्षिणा gift of life; प्राणदक्षिणां दा ‘to grant one his life’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदण्डः|प्राणदण्ड|प्राणदंड
प्राणः + -दण्डः capital punishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदयितः|प्राणदयित
प्राणः + -दयितः a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदातृ
प्राणः + -दातृ <i>a.</i> ‘life-giver’, saviour, deliverer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदानम्
प्राणः + -दानम्<BR>—1 resigning life.<BR>—2 the gift of life, saving oneʼs life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदुरोदरम्
प्राणः + -दुरोदरम्, -द्यूतम् fighting for life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणद्यूतम्
प्राणः + -दुरोदरम्, -द्यूतम् fighting for life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदृह्
प्राणः + -दृह् <i>a.</i> Sustaining or prolonging the breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणद्रोहः|प्राणद्रोह
प्राणः + -द्रोहः an attempt upon any bodyʼs life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणधार|प्राणधारः
प्राणः + -धार <i>a.</i> living, animate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणधारः|प्राणधार
प्राणः + -धार + .({@-रः@}) a living being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणधारणम्
प्राणः + -धारणम्<BR>—1 maintenance or support of life.<BR>—2 vitality.<BR>—3 a means of supporting life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणनाथः|प्राणनाथ
प्राणः + -नाथः<BR>—1 a lover, husband.<BR>—2 an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणनिग्रहः|प्राणनिग्रह
प्राणः + -निग्रहः restraint of breath, checking the breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणपतिः|प्राणपति
प्राणः + -पतिः<BR>—1 a lover, husband.<BR>—2 the soul; बुद्धिं समाच्छाद्य च मे समन्युरुद्भूयते प्राणपतिः शरीरे Mb. 3. 269. 4.<BR>—3 a physician.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणपत्नी
प्राणः + -पत्नी the voice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणपरिकयः
प्राणः + -परिकयः staking oneʼs life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणपरिक्षीण
प्राणः + -परिक्षीण <i>a.</i> one whose life is drawing to a close.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणपरिग्रहः|प्राणपरिग्रह
प्राणः + -परिग्रहः possession of life, life, existence.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">Page1128-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1127-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणप्रद
प्राणः + -प्रद, -दायक, -दायिन् <i>a.</i> restoring or saving life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदायक
प्राणः + -प्रद, -दायक, -दायिन् <i>a.</i> restoring or saving life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणदायिन्
प्राणः + -प्रद, -दायक, -दायिन् <i>a.</i> restoring or saving life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणप्रयाणम्
प्राणः + -प्रयाणम् departure of life, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणप्रियः|प्राणप्रिय
प्राणः + -प्रियः ‘as dear as life’, a lover, husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणभक्ष
प्राणः + -भक्ष <i>a.</i> feeding on air only.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणभास्वत्|प्राणभास्वन्त्
प्राणः + -भास्वत् <i>m.</i> the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणभृत्
प्राणः + -भृत् <i>a.</i> possessed of life, living, animate, sentient. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR> a living being; अन्तर्गतं प्राणभृतां हि वेद R. 2. 43.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणमोक्षणम्
प्राणः + -मोक्षणम्<BR>—1 departure of life, death.<BR>—2 suicide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणयमः|प्राणयम
प्राणः + -यमः = प्राणायाम q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणयात्रा
प्राणः + -यात्रा<BR>—1 support of life; maintenance, livelihood; पिण्डपातमात्रप्राणयात्रां<BR> भगवतीम् Māl. 1.<BR>—2 the act of breathing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणयात्रिक
प्राणः + -यात्रिक requisite for subsistence; प्राणयात्रिकमात्रः स्यात् Ms. 6. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणयोनिः|प्राणयोनि
प्राणः + -योनिः<BR>—1 the Supreme Being.<BR>—2 wind. ━(<i>f.</i>) the source of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणरन्ध्रम्
प्राणः + -रन्ध्रम्<BR>—1 the mouth.<BR>—2 a nostril.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणरोधः|प्राणरोध
प्राणः + -रोधः<BR>—1 suppressing the breath. —2 danger to life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणवल्लभा
प्राणः + -वल्लभा a mistress, wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणविद्या
प्राणः + -विद्या the science of breath or vital airs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणविनाशः|प्राणविनाश
प्राणः + -विनाशः, -विप्लवः loss of life, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणविप्लवः|प्राणविप्लव
प्राणः + -विनाशः, -विप्लवः loss of life, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणवियोगः|प्राणवियोग
प्राणः + -वियोगः separation of the soul from the body, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणवृत्तिः|प्राणवृत्ति
प्राणः + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> a vital function.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणव्ययः|प्राणव्यय
प्राणः + -व्ययः cost or sacrifice of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणशरीरः|प्राणशरीर
प्राणः + -शरीरः the Supreme Being: स क्रतुं कुर्वीत मनोमयः प्राणशरीरः Ch. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणसंयमः|प्राणसंयम
प्राणः + -संयमः suspension of breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणसंशयः|प्राणसंशय
प्राणः + -संशयः, -संकटम्, -संदेहः risk or danger to life, peril<BR> of life, a very great peril.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणसंकटम्
प्राणः + -संशयः, -संकटम्, -संदेहः risk or danger to life, peril<BR> of life, a very great peril.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणसंदेहः|प्राणसन्देह
प्राणः + -संशयः, -संकटम्, -संदेहः risk or danger to life, peril<BR> of life, a very great peril.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणसंहिता
प्राणः + -संहिता a manner of reciting the Vedic text.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणसद्मन्
प्राणः + -सद्मन् <i>n.</i> the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणसम|प्राणसमः
प्राणः + -सम <i>a.</i> as dear as life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणसमः|प्राणसम
प्राणः + -सम + ({@-मः@}) a husband, lover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणसमा
प्राणः + -सम + .({@-मा@}) a wife; नूनं प्राणसमावियोगविधुरः स्तम्बेरमस्ताम्यति Māl. 9. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणसार
प्राणः + -सार <i>a.</i> ‘having life as the essence’, full of strength and<BR> vigour, muscular; गिरिचर इव नागः प्राणसारं (गात्रं) बिभर्ति Ś. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणहर
प्राणः + -हर, -हारिन् <i>a.</i> causing death, taking away life, fatal; पुरो<BR> मम प्राणहरो भविष्यसि Gīt. 7.<BR>—2 capital.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणहारिन्
प्राणः + -हर, -हारिन् <i>a.</i> causing death, taking away life, fatal; पुरो<BR> मम प्राणहरो भविष्यसि Gīt. 7.<BR>—2 capital.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणहारक|प्राणहारकं
प्राणः + -हारक <i>a.</i> fatal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणहारकम्
प्राणः + -हारक + .({@-कम्@}) a kind of deadly poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणकः|प्राणक
प्राणकः<BR>—1 A living being, an animate or sentient being.<BR>—2 Myrrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणथ|प्राणथः
प्राणथ <i>a.</i> Strong, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणथः|प्राणथ
प्राणथ + .{@-थः@}<BR>—1 Breathing.<BR>—2 Air, wind.<BR>—3 A sacred bathing place.<BR>—4 The lord of created beings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणनः|प्राणन|प्राणनं
प्राणनः<BR>—1 The throat.<BR>—2 Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणनम्
प्राणनः + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Respiration, breathing.<BR>—2 Life, living.<BR>—3 Producing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणन्तः|प्राणन्त|प्राणंत|प्राणंतः
प्राणन्तः Air, wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणन्ती
प्राणन्ती<BR>—1 Hunger.<BR>—2 Sobbing.<BR>—3 Hic-cough (हिक्का).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणमय
प्राणमय <i>a.</i> Living, breathing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्राणमयकोशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणमयकोशः|प्राणमयकोश
प्राणमय + -कोशः the vesture of the vital airs; कर्मेन्द्रियैः पञ्चभिरञ्चितोऽसौ<BR> प्राणी भवेत् प्राणमयस्तु कोशः Vivekacūḍāmaṇi; see कोश.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणवत्|प्राणवन्त्
प्राणवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Furnished with or having breath, living, animated; यया प्राणिनः<BR> प्राणवन्तः Ś. 1. 1.<BR>—2 Strong, powerful; प्राणवान् विक्रमी चैव शौर्येण महतान्वितः Mb. 1. 128. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणा
प्राणा <i>f.</i> N. of Garuḍaʼs mother-in-law; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणित
प्राणित <i>a.</i> Kept alive, animated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणिन्
प्राणिन् <i>n.</i> Breathing, living, alive. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A living or sentient being, a living creature; यया प्राणिनः प्राणवन्तः<BR> Ś. 1. 1; Me. 5.<BR>—2 A man, power, vigour; देवस्त्रियो रसां<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">Page1128-2</a>]<BR> नातीः प्राणिभिः पुनराहरत् Bhāg. 9. 20. 31.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्राण्यङ्गम्, प्राणिजातम्, प्राणिद्यूतम्, प्राणिपीडा, प्राणिहिंसा, प्राणिहिता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राण्यङ्गम्
प्राणिन् + -अङ्गम् a limb of an animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणिजातम्
प्राणिन् + -जातम् a whole class of animals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणिद्यूतम्
प्राणिन् + -द्यूतम् gambling with fighting-animals, (cock-fighting, ram-fighting &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणिपीडा
प्राणिन् + -पीडा cruelty to animals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणिहिंसा
प्राणिन् + -हिंसा injury to life, doing harm to living creatures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणिहिता
प्राणिन् + -हिता a shoe, boot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणाय्य
प्राणाय्य <i>a.</i> (-य्यी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Proper, fit, suited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राणीत्यम्
प्राणीत्यम् Debt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातर्
प्रातर् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 At day-break, at dawn, early in the morning.<BR>—2 Early on the morrow, the next or tomorrow morning.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रातरनुवाकः, प्रातरह्नः, प्रातराशः, प्रातर्भोजनम्, प्रातराशिन्, प्रातःकर्मन्, प्रातःकालः, प्रातर्गेयः, प्रातश्चन्द्रः, प्रातस्त्रिवर्गा, प्रातर्दिनम्, प्रातर्दोहः, प्रातःप्रहरः, प्रातर्भोक्तृ, प्रातर्भोजनम्, प्रातःसंध्या, प्रातःसमयः, प्रातःसवः, प्रातःसवनम्, प्रातःस्नानम्, प्रातर्होम<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातरनुवाकः|प्रातरनुवाक
प्रातर् + -अनुवाकः the hymn with which the प्रातःसवन begins; one<BR> of the Vedic Anuvākas in the Soma-yāga; प्रातरनुवाकं जाग्रदुपासीत<BR> Kāty.; पुरा प्रातरनुवाकस्योपाकरणाज्जघनेन गार्हपत्यस्योदङ्मुख<BR> उपविश्य स वासवं सामाभिर्गायति Ch. Up. 2. 24. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातरह्नः|प्रातरह्न
प्रातर् + -अह्नः the early part of the day, forenoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातराशः|प्रातराश
प्रातर् + -आशः, -भोजनम् morning meal, breakfast; अन्यथा प्रातराशाय<BR> कुर्याम त्वामलं वयम् Bk. 8. 98; मृगान् पञ्चाशतं चैव प्रातराशं<BR> ददामि ते Mb. 3. 267. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातर्भोजनम्
प्रातर् + -आशः, -भोजनम् morning meal, breakfast; अन्यथा प्रातराशाय<BR> कुर्याम त्वामलं वयम् Bk. 8. 98; मृगान् पञ्चाशतं चैव प्रातराशं<BR> ददामि ते Mb. 3. 267. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातराशिन्
प्रातर् + -आशिन् <i>m.</i> one who has breakfasted or taken his morning meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातःकर्मन्
प्रातर् + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i>, {@-कार्यम्, -कृत्यम्@} (प्रातःकर्म &c.)<BR> a morning ceremony; a morning<BR> duty or rite (worship, prayer &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातःकालः|प्रातःकाल
प्रातर् + -कालः (प्रातःकालः) morning time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातर्गेयः|प्रातर्गेय
प्रातर् + -गेयः a bard whose duty it is to wake the king or any great personage<BR> in the morning with appropriate songs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातश्चन्द्रः|प्रातश्चन्द्र
प्रातर् + -चन्द्रः (प्रातश्चन्द्रः) the moon in the morning. ˚द्यूति <i>a.</i> pale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातस्त्रिवर्गा
प्रातर् + -त्रिवर्गा (प्रातस्त्रिवर्गा) the river Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातर्दिनम्
प्रातर् + -दिनम् forenoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातर्दोहः|प्रातर्दोह
प्रातर् + -दोहः morning milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातःप्रहरः|प्रातःप्रहर
प्रातर् + -प्रहरः (प्रातःप्रहरः) the first watch of the day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातर्भोक्तृ
प्रातर् + -भोक्तृ <i>m.</i> a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातर्भोजनम्
प्रातर् + -भोजनम् morning meal, breakfast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातःसंध्या|प्रातःसन्ध्या
प्रातर् + -संध्या (प्रातःसंध्या)<BR>—1 the morning twilight.<BR>—2 the morning devotions or Sandhyā adoration of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातःसमयः|प्रातःसमय
प्रातर् + -समयः (प्रातःसमयः) morning-time, day-break.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातःसवः|प्रातःसव
प्रातर् + -सवः, -सवनम् (प्रातःसवः &c.) the morning libation of <i>Soma</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातःसवनम्
प्रातर् + -सवः, -सवनम् (प्रातःसवः &c.) the morning libation of <i>Soma</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातःस्नानम्
प्रातर् + -स्नानम् (प्रातःस्नानम्) morning ablution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातर्होम
प्रातर् + -होम morning sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातस्तन
प्रातस्तन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to the morning; matutinal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातस्तनम्
