प्रातिकूलिक
प्रातिकूलिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Opposed, opposing, contrary; आः प्रातिकूलिकः संवृत्तः<BR> Mv. 5. प्रातिकूलिकता Opposition, hostility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1128-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

