प्रातिजनीन
प्रातिजनीन (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Suitable against an adversary.<BR>—2 Suitable for everybody, popular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

