प्रातिदैवसिक
प्रातिदैवसिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Occurring daily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिनिधिकः|प्रातिनिधिक
प्रातिनिधिकः A substitute; Kāty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिपक्ष
प्रातिपक्ष <i>a.</i> (-क्षी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Contrary, adverse.<BR>—2 Hostile, inimical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

