प्रातिपदिक + .{@-कः@} Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिपदिकम्
प्रातिपदिक + .{@-कम्@} The crude form of a substantive, a noun in its uninflected<BR> state (before receiving the case-terminations); अर्थवदधातुरप्रत्ययः<BR> प्रातिपदिकम् P. I. 2. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिपौरुषिक
प्रातिपौरुषिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Common to all men; (सर्वपुरुषसाधारण); मध्ये राज्ञामहं तत्र<BR> प्रातिपौरुषिकान् गुणान् । तव संकीर्तयिष्यामि … Mb. 5. 74. 30.<BR>—2 Relating to manliness or valour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिभ
प्रातिभ <i>a.</i> (-भी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Relating to divination or genius.<BR>—2 Intellectual, mental.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिभम्
प्रातिभ + .{@-भम्@} Genius or vivid imagination, intuition, divination; … प्रभोः<BR> प्रातिभदर्पणः । प्रतिबिम्बितमात्मानं यत्र पश्यति भारती Dharmābhyudayamahākāvya 1. 1;<BR> प्रातिभं त्रिसरकेण गतानां वक्रवाक्यरचनारमणीयः Śi. 10. 12;<BR> Mb. 5. 63. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिभाव्यम्
प्रातिभाव्यम्<BR>—1 Becoming bail or security, suretyship, becoming answerable for the<BR> appearance of a debtor, for his being trustworthy, and for paying his debt;<BR> श्रेणीप्रातिभाव्येनातिष्ठत् Dk.; Ms. 8. 159.<BR>—2 Opposition (विरोध); न दुर्बलः प्रातिभाव्यं करोति Mb. 5. 33. 110.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिभासिक
प्रातिभासिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Existing only in appearance, not real.<BR>—2 Looking like.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिलोमिक
प्रातिलोमिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Against the grain, adverse, hostile, disagreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिलोम्यम्
प्रातिलोम्यम्<BR>—1 Inversion, inverted or reverse order; क्षत्तृवैदेहकौ तद्वत् प्रातिलोम्येऽपि<BR> जन्मनि (स्पर्शादियोग्यौ) Ms. 10. 13.<BR>—2 Hostility, opposition, hostile feeling; दुःशासनः प्रातिलोम्यान्निनाय<BR> सभामध्ये श्वशुराणां च कृष्णाम् Mb. 5. 29. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिवेशिकः|प्रातिवेशिक
प्रातिवेशिकः, प्रातिवेश्मकः, प्रातिवेश्यकः A neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिवेश्मकः|प्रातिवेश्मक
प्रातिवेशिकः, प्रातिवेश्मकः, प्रातिवेश्यकः A neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिवेश्यकः|प्रातिवेश्यक
प्रातिवेशिकः, प्रातिवेश्मकः, प्रातिवेश्यकः A neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिवेश्यः|प्रातिवेश्य
प्रातिवेश्यः<BR>—1 A neighbour (in general).<BR>—2 A next-door neighbour (निरन्तरगृहवासी Kull.); Ms. 8. 392.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिशाख्यम्
प्रातिशाख्यम् A grammatical treatise laying down rules for the phonetic<BR> changes which words in any Śākhā of the Vedas undergo, and teaching the mode<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">Page1129-2</a>]<BR> of pronouncing the accents &c. (There exist four Prātiśākhyas, one<BR> for the Śākala branch of Ṛgveda, one for each of the two branches of<BR> the Yajurveda, and one for the Atharvaveda.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिश्रुत्क
प्रातिश्रुत्क <i>a.</i> Existing in the echo; यश्चायमध्यात्मं श्रौत्रः<BR> प्रातिश्रुत्कः Bṛ. Up. 2. 5. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिस्विक|प्रातिस्विकं
प्रातिस्विक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Peculiar, not common to others, oneʼs own.<BR>—2 Granting to every one what is his due.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिहन्त्रम्
प्रातिहन्त्रम् Vengeance, revenge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिहारः|प्रातिहार
प्रातिहारः, प्रातिहारकः, प्रातिहारिकः A juggler, conjurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिहारकः|प्रातिहारक
प्रातिहारः, प्रातिहारकः, प्रातिहारिकः A juggler, conjurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिहारिकः|प्रातिहारिक
प्रातिहारः, प्रातिहारकः, प्रातिहारिकः A juggler, conjurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातिहार्यम्
प्रातिहार्यम्<BR>—1 Juggling, conjuring, legerdemain.<BR>—2 Working miracles.<BR>—3 A miracle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातीतिक
प्रातीतिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Mental, existing in the mind or imagination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातीपः|प्रातीप
प्रातीपः A patronymic of Śantanu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातीपिक
प्रातीपिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Reverse, contrary, retrograde.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रातीप्यम्
प्रातीप्यम् Hostility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रात्यक्षिक
प्रात्यक्षिक <i>a.</i> Perceptible to the eyes, capable of direct perception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रात्यन्तिकः|प्रात्यन्तिक|प्रात्यंतिक|प्रात्यंतिकः
प्रात्यन्तिकः<BR>—1 A prince of the Pratyantas, q. v.<BR>—2 A neighbouring chief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रात्ययिक
प्रात्ययिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Confidential, trusty.<BR>—2 Standing bail for the trustworthiness of a debtor (as a प्रतिभू or surety).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रात्यहिक
प्रात्यहिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Occurring every day, daily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राथमकल्पिकः|प्राथमकल्पिक
प्राथमकल्पिकः<BR>—1 A student who has just entered on the study of the Vedas (शैक्ष).<BR>—2 A Yogin just commencing his course.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राथमिक|प्राथमिकः
प्राथमिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Primary, first, initial.<BR>—2 Former, previous.<BR>—3 Happening for the first time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राथम्यम्
प्राथम्यम् Being first, precedence, priority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादक्षिण्यम्
प्रादक्षिण्यम् Going round a person or object from left to right keeping<BR> the right side towards the object circumambulated; प्रादक्षिण्यं चिकीर्षन्तः<BR> पृथिव्या योगधर्मिणः Mb. 17. 1. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादुस्
प्रादुस् <i>ind.</i> Visibly, evidently, manifestly, in sight (used chiefly<BR> with भू, कृ and अस्); प्रादुश्चकर्थ यदिदं पुरुहूतरूपम् Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादुरस्
प्रादुरस् €2 P. To appear, spring up; प्रादुरासीत्तमोनुदः Ms. 1. 6;<BR> R. 11. 15; प्रादुःष्यात् क इव जित पुरः परेण Śi. 8. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादुर्भू
प्रादुर्भू^1 €1 P.<BR>—1 To become manifest or visible, show oneself, appear.<BR>—2 To arise, come to light.<BR>—3 To become audible, be heard.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1129-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादुर्भावः|प्रादुर्भाव
प्रादुर्भावः<BR>—1 Coming into existence, arising; वपुः प्रादुर्भावात् K. P. 10.<BR>—2 Becoming visible, evident or manifest, manifestation, appearance.<BR>—3 Becoming audible.<BR>—4 The appearance of a deity on earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादुर्भूत
प्रादुर्भूत <i>a.</i> Appeared, become visible or manifest, manifested, displayed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादुष्करणम्
प्रादुष्करणम् Manifestation, making visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादुष्यम्
प्रादुष्यम् Manifestation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादेशः|प्रादेश
प्रादेशः, -शम्<BR>—1 The span of the thumb and fore finger also a measure of 12 Aṅgulas;<BR> अङ्गुष्ठतर्जनीयुक्तं प्रादेशमिति कीतिंतम् Suprabhedāgama 30. 21;<BR> यस्त्वेतमेवं प्रादेशमात्रमभिविमानमात्मानं वैश्वानरमुपास्ते Ch. Up. 5. 18. 1.<BR>—2 A spot, place, region.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रादेशमात्र<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादेशम्
प्रादेशः, -शम्<BR>—1 The span of the thumb and fore finger also a measure of 12 Aṅgulas;<BR> अङ्गुष्ठतर्जनीयुक्तं प्रादेशमिति कीतिंतम् Suprabhedāgama 30. 21;<BR> यस्त्वेतमेवं प्रादेशमात्रमभिविमानमात्मानं वैश्वानरमुपास्ते Ch. Up. 5. 18. 1.<BR>—2 A spot, place, region.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रादेशमात्र<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादेशमात्र
प्रादेशः + -मात्र <i>a.</i> just a little, for giving an idea; प्रादेशमात्रं<BR> भवतः प्रदार्शितम् Bhāg. 1. 5. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादेशनम्
प्रादेशनम् A gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादेशिक|प्रादेशिकः
प्रादेशिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Having precedents, precedented.<BR>—2 Limited, local.<BR>—3 Significant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादेशिकः|प्रादेशिक
प्रादेशिक + .{@-कः@} The owner of a district.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रादेशिकगुणः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादेशिकगुणः
प्रादेशिक + -गुणः the authorised function or meaning of a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादेशिन्
प्रादेशिन् <i>a.</i> A span long.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रादेशिनी
