प्रादोष <i>a.</i> (-षी <i>f.</i>), प्रादोषिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to the evening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राधनिकम्
प्राधनिकम् A destructive weapon, any war-implement; सूर्येन्दुवाग्वग्न्यगमं<BR> त्रिधामभिः परिक्रमत् प्राधनिकैर्दुरासदम् Bhāg. 3. 8. 31, 7. 10. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राधानिक
प्राधानिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Most eminent or excellent, pre-eminent, supreme, most distinguished.<BR>—2 Relating to or derived from Pradhāna, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राधान्यम्
प्राधान्यम्<BR>—1 Pre-eminence, superiority, predominance, prominence.<BR>—2 Ascendancy, supremacy.<BR>—3 A chief or principal cause. (प्राधान्येन, प्राधान्यात्, प्राधान्यतः<BR> ‘chiefly’, ‘especially’, ‘principally’; हन्त ते कथयिष्यामि दिव्या ह्यात्मविभूतयः ।<BR> प्राधान्यतः कुरुश्रेष्ठ नास्त्यन्तो विस्तरस्य मे ॥ Bg. 10. 19.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राधीत
प्राधीत <i>a.</i> Well-read, highly educated (as a Brāhmaṇa); मारुतापूरितगुहाः<BR> प्राधीता इव पर्वताः Rām. 4. 28. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राध्ययनम्
प्राध्ययनम् Reading, studying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राध्व|प्राध्वं|प्राध्वः
प्राध्व <i>a.</i> [प्रकृष्टोऽध्वा अच् समासः]<BR>—1 Distant, remote, long.<BR>—2 Bent, inclined.<BR>—3 Fastened, bound (बद्ध).<BR>—4 Favourable.<BR>—5 Being on a journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राध्वः|प्राध्व|प्राध्वं
प्राध्व + .{@-ध्वः@}<BR>—1 A carriage.<BR>—2 Start, precedence.<BR>—3 A long way or journey.<BR>—4 Bond, tie.<BR>—5 A joke, sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राध्वम्
प्राध्व + .{@-ध्वम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Favourably, agreeably or conformably, suitably; सभाजने मे भुजमूर्ध्वबाहुः<BR> सव्येतरं प्राध्वमितः प्रयुङ्क्ते R. 13. 43.<BR>—2 Crookedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तः|प्रान्त|प्रांत|प्रांतः
प्रान्तः [प्रकृष्टोऽन्तः]<BR>—1 Edge, margin, border, skirt, verge; प्रान्तसंस्तीर्णदर्भाः Ś. 4. 8.<BR>—2 Corner (as of the lips, eyes &c.); ईषत्तिर्यग्वलनविषमं कूणितप्रान्तमेतत्<BR> Māl. 4. 2; ओष्ठ˚, नयन˚.<BR>—3 Boundary, extremity.<BR>—4 Extreme verge, end; यौवनप्रान्त Pt. 4.<BR>—5 A point, tip.<BR>—6 The back part.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रान्तग, प्रान्तदुर्गम्, प्रान्तनिवासिन्, प्रान्तभूमिः, प्रान्तभूमौ, प्रान्तविरस, प्रान्तवृत्तिः, प्रान्तशून्य, प्रान्तस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तग
प्रान्तः + -ग <i>a.</i> living close by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तदुर्गम्
प्रान्तः + -दुर्गम् a suburb outside the walls of a town, a town near a fort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तनिवासिन्
प्रान्तः + -निवासिन् <i>a.</i> dwelling near the boundaries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तभूमिः|प्रान्तभूमि
प्रान्तः + -भूमिः final place or term.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तभूमौ
प्रान्तः + -भूमौ <i>ind.</i> finally, at last.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तविरस
प्रान्तः + -विरस <i>a.</i> tasteless in the end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तवृत्तिः
प्रान्तः + -वृत्तिः the horizon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तशून्य|प्रांतशून्य|प्रान्तशून्यं
प्रान्तः + -शून्य <i>a.</i> see प्रान्तरशून्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तस्थ|प्रांतस्थ
प्रान्तः + -स्थ <i>a.</i> one who inhabits the borders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्ततः|प्रान्तत
प्रान्ततः <i>ind.</i> Marginally, along the border or edge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तरम्
प्रान्तरम् [प्रकृष्टमन्तरं यत्र]<BR>—1 A long, lonesome or solitary path, desolate road.<BR>—2 A road without shade, dreary tract of land.<BR>—3 A forest, wilderness.<BR>—4 The hollow of a tree. —5 The country intervening between two villages.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रान्तरशून्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रान्तरशून्यः|प्रान्तरशून्य|प्रांतरशून्य
प्रान्तरम् + -शून्यः a long dreary road (without trees, shade &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्
प्राप् €5 P. To get, obtain, gain, acquire; अतिथिं नाम काकुत्स्थात्<BR> पुत्रं प्राप कुमुद्वती R. 17. 1.<BR>—2 To attain to, go to, reach; यथा महाह्रदं प्राप्य क्षिप्तं लोष्टं<BR> विनश्यति Ms. 11. 264; R. 1. 48; Bk. 15. 106; so आश्रमम्, नदीम्, वनम्<BR> &c.; प्राप्यावन्तीन् Me. 30.<BR>—3 To stretch, extend.<BR>—4 To meet with, find, light upon, overtake; जटायुः प्राप पक्षीन्द्रः<BR> परुषं रावणं वदन् Bk. 5. 96.<BR>—5 To result or follow (as a conclusion); परिच्छिन्नस्तावज्जीव इति प्राप्नोति Ś. B.<BR>—6 To incur, bring upon oneself (दोष, दण्ड &c.); स शतं प्राप्नुयाद्दण्डम् Ms. 8. 225.<BR>—7 To suffer, endure; न वधं प्राप्नुयान्नरः Ms. 8. 364.<BR>—8 To be changed into (in gram.).<BR>—9 To be present, be at hand (Ved.). ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To lead or bring to, take to, convey; सपत्नीः प्रापयन्त्यब्धिं सिन्धवो<BR> नगनिम्नगाः Śi. 2. 104; वसतिं प्रिय कामिनां प्रियास्त्वदृते प्रापयितुं<BR> क ईश्वरः Ku. 4. 11, 32; Ve. 3. 7; R. 14. 45, 60.<BR>—2 To cause to obtain, give, provide; अभिमन्युतनयमसून् प्रापितवान्<BR> K. 175 ‘restored to life, revived’.<BR>—3 To promote or advance, appoint to (an office).<BR>—4 To tell, communicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप
प्राप <i>a.</i> Arriving at, reaching, obtaining &c.; as in दुष्प्राप.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रापक|प्रापकः
प्रापक (-पिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [प्राप्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Leading to, conveying.<BR>—2 Procuring, providing with.<BR>—3 Establishing, making valid.<BR>—4 Obtaining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रापकः|प्रापक
प्रापक + .{@-कः@} Bringer, procurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रापणम्
प्रापणम्<BR>—1 Reaching, extending to.<BR>—2 Obtaining, acquisition, attainment.<BR>—3 Bringing to, conveying, leading to.<BR>—4 Procuring.<BR>—5 Reference.<BR>—6 Elucidation, explanation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रापित
प्रापित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Conveyed, conducted.<BR>—2 Led to, promoted or advanced to.<BR>—3 Caused to obtain.<BR>—4 Procured, got.<BR>—4 Brought before (the king); commenced (as a law-suit); न च प्रापितमन्येन<BR> प्रसेदर्थं कथंचन Ms. 8. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1130-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रापिपयिषु
प्रापिपयिषु <i>a.</i> Wishing to cause to reach; प्रतीतस्तत्किं मामतिभरमधः<BR> प्रापिपयिषुः Śi. 5. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्त|प्राप्तः
प्राप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Got, obtained, won, acquired.<BR>—2 Reached, attained to.<BR>—3 Met with, found.<BR>—4 Incurred, suffered, endured; सभार्येण सराष्ट्रेण यत् प्राप्तं तत्र<BR> तत्त्वतः (संप्रपश्यति) Rām. 1. 3. 3.<BR>—5 Arrived, come, present.<BR>—6 Completed.<BR>—7 Proper, right.<BR>—8 Following from a rule.<BR>—9 Described (as a symptom).<BR>—10 Fixed, placed.<BR>—11 (In gram.) Following from a rule, valid.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्राप्तानुज्ञ, प्राप्तापराघ, प्राप्तार्थ, प्राप्तावसर, प्राप्तोदय, प्राप्तकर्मन्, प्राप्तकारिन्, प्राप्तकाल, प्राप्तक्रम, प्राप्तजीवन, प्राप्तदोष, प्राप्तपञ्चत्व, प्राप्तप्रसव, प्राप्तबीज, प्राप्तबुद्धि, प्राप्तभारः, प्राप्तभाव, प्राप्तभावः, प्राप्तमनोरथ, प्राप्तयौवन, प्राप्तरूप, प्राप्तवर, प्राप्तव्यवहार, प्राप्तश्री, प्राप्तसूर्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तानुज्ञ
प्राप्त + -अनुज्ञ <i>a.</i> one who has got permission to go, allowed to depart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तापराघ
प्राप्त + -अपराघ <i>a.</i> guilty of an offence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तार्थ|प्राप्तार्थः
प्राप्त + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> successful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तार्थः|प्राप्तार्थ
प्राप्त + -अर्थ + .({@-र्थः@}) an object gained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तावसर|प्राप्तावसरः
प्राप्त + -अवसर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 finding occasion or opportunity.<BR>—2 timely, seasonable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तावसरः|प्राप्तावसर
प्राप्त + -अवसर + .({@-रः@}) a fit or suitable time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तोदय
प्राप्त + -उदय <i>a.</i> one who has attained rise or exaltation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तकर्मन्
प्राप्त + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> that which results or follows from a preceding rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तकारिन्
प्राप्त + -कारिन् <i>a.</i> doing what is right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तकाल|प्राप्तकालः
प्राप्त + -काल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 opportune, seasonable, suitable; see अप्राप्तकाल.<BR>—2 marriageable.<BR>—3 fated, destined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तकालः|प्राप्तकाल
प्राप्त + -काल + .({@-लः@}) a fit time, suitable or favourable moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तकालम्
प्राप्त + -काल + .({@-लम्@}) <i>ind.</i> seasonably, opportunely, timely; अप्राप्तकालं<BR> वचनं वृहस्पतिरपि ब्रुवन् Pt. 1. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तक्रम
प्राप्त + -क्रम <i>a.</i> fit, proper, suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तजीवन
प्राप्त + -जीवन <i>a.</i> revived, restored to life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तदोष
प्राप्त + -दोष <i>a.</i> guilty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तपञ्चत्व|प्राप्तपंचत्व|प्राप्तपञ्चत्वं
प्राप्त + -पञ्चत्व <i>a.</i> resolved into the five elements, <i>i. e.</i> dead;<BR> cf. पञ्चत्व.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तप्रसव
प्राप्त + -प्रसव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 delivered of a child.<BR>—2 near her confinement; प्राप्तप्रसवमात्मानं गङ्गादेव्यां विमुञ्चति U. 7. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तबीज
प्राप्त + -बीज <i>a.</i> sown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तबुद्धि
प्राप्त + -बुद्धि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 recovering, regaining oneʼs consciousness.<BR>—2 instructed, enlightened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तभारः|प्राप्तभार
प्राप्त + -भारः a beast of burden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तभाव|प्राप्तभावः
प्राप्त + -भाव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 wise.<BR>—2 handsome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तभावः|प्राप्तभाव
प्राप्त + -भावः a young bullock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तमनोरथ
प्राप्त + -मनोरथ <i>a.</i> one who has obtained his desired object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तयौवन
प्राप्त + -यौवन <i>a.</i> being in the bloom of youth, arrived at the age<BR> of puberty, youthful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तरूप|प्राप्तरूपः
प्राप्त + -रूप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 handsome, beautiful.<BR>—2 wise, learned.<BR>—3 charming, attractive.<BR>—4 fit, proper, worthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तवर
प्राप्त + -वर <i>a.</i> fraught with blessings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तव्यवहार
प्राप्त + -व्यवहार <i>a.</i> come of age, being able and legally authorised<BR> to manage his own affairs (opp. ‘minor’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तश्री
प्राप्त + -श्री <i>a.</i> one who owes his rise (to another); इतः स दैत्यः<BR> प्राप्तश्रीर्नेत एवार्हति क्षयम् Ku. 2. 55; Pt. 1. 244.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तसूर्य
प्राप्त + -सूर्य <i>a.</i> having the sun (vertical).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तिः|प्राप्ति
प्राप्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Obtaining, acquisition gain, attainment, profit; द्रव्य˚, यशः˚,<BR> सुख˚ &c.; अप्राप्तस्यैव या प्राप्तिः सैव संयोग उच्यते Bhāṣā P.<BR>—2 Reaching or attaining to.<BR>—3 Arrival, coming to.<BR>—4 Finding, meeting with.<BR>—5 Range, reach.<BR>—6 A guess, conjecture.<BR>—7 Lot, share, portion.<BR>—8 Fortune, luck.<BR>—9 Rise, production.<BR>—10 The power of obtaining anything (one of the eight Siddhis, q. v.).<BR>—11 Union, collection (संहति).<BR>—12 The result of actions done in a former life.<BR>—13 Fate, destiny; पक्षिणां तदपि प्राप्त्या नादत्तमुपतिष्ठति Pt. 2. 127.<BR>—14 Being valid, holding good, application (as of a rule).<BR>—15 The successful termination of a plot (सुखागम).<BR>—16 (In Rhet.) A conjecture based on the observation of a particular thing.<BR>—17 (In astrol.) N. of the 11th lunar mansion.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्राप्त्याशा, प्राप्तिसमम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्त्याशा
प्राप्तिः + -आशा the hope of obtaining anything<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">Page1131-2</a>]<BR> (regarded as part of the development of the plot of a play); उपायापायशङ्काभ्यां<BR> प्राप्त्याशा प्राप्तिसंभवा S. D. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तिसमम्
प्राप्तिः + -समम् a particular Jāti in Nyāya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्य|प्राप्यं
प्राप्य, प्राप्तव्य <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 To be got or obtained.<BR>—2 Attainable, procurable; destined to be got; प्राप्तव्यमर्थं लभते<BR> मनुष्यः Pt. 2. 110.<BR>—3 To be reached, attainable.<BR>—4 To be met with or found.<BR>—5 Proper, fit, suitable.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्राप्यकारिन्, प्राप्यरूप<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्तव्य|प्राप्तव्यं
प्राप्य, प्राप्तव्य <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 To be got or obtained.<BR>—2 Attainable, procurable; destined to be got; प्राप्तव्यमर्थं लभते<BR> मनुष्यः Pt. 2. 110.<BR>—3 To be reached, attainable.<BR>—4 To be met with or found.<BR>—5 Proper, fit, suitable.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्राप्यकारिन्, प्राप्यरूप<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्यकारिन्
प्राप्य + -कारिन् (प्राप्यकारिन्) <i>a.</i> effective (only) when touched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राप्यरूप
प्राप्य + -रूप (प्राप्यरूप) <i>a.</i> rather easy to attain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रापणिकः|प्रापणिक
प्रापणिकः A merchant, trader; आढ्यादिव प्रापणिकादजस्रम् Śi. 4. 11;<BR> Mb. 12. 88. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राबल्यम्
प्राबल्यम्<BR>—1 Ascendancy, superiority, predominance.<BR>—2 Power, force, might.<BR>—3 Validity (of a rule).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राबालिकः|प्राबालिक
प्राबा(वा)लिकः A dealer in coral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावालिकः|प्रावालिक
प्राबा(वा)लिकः A dealer in coral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राबोधकः|प्राबोधक
प्राबोध(धि)कः<BR>—1 Dawn, day-break.<BR>—2 A minstrel whose duty it is to wake the king in the morning by singing<BR> appropriate songs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राबोधिकः|प्राबोधिक
प्राबोध(धि)कः<BR>—1 Dawn, day-break.<BR>—2 A minstrel whose duty it is to wake the king in the morning by singing<BR> appropriate songs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

