प्राभञ्जनिः<BR>—1 An epithet of Hanumat.<BR>—2 Of Bhīma; आयूंषि त्वक्षु निर्भिद्य प्राभञ्जनिरमोचयत् Bk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राभवम्
प्राभवम् Superiority, supremacy, predominance; अकलितमहिमप्राभवौ<BR> युद्धभूमौ Mv. 6. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राभवत्यम्
प्राभवत्यम् Supremacy; authority, power; अनिच्छतः प्राभवत्याद्राज्ञा<BR> दण्ड्यः शतानि षट् Ms. 8. 412.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राभाकरः|प्राभाकर
प्राभाकरः ‘A follower of Prabhākara’, a follower of that school<BR> of Mīmāṃsā philosophy which is known as प्राभाकर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राभातिक
प्राभातिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to the morning, matutinal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राभृतम्
प्राभृतम्, प्राभृतकम्<BR>—1 A present, gift.<BR>—2 An offering to a deity or to a king (<i>Nazarāṇā</i>); अहरहश्च<BR> नवनवानि प्राभृतान्युपहरन्ती Dk. 2. 2, 2. 8.<BR>—3 A bribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राभृतकम्
प्राभृतम्, प्राभृतकम्<BR>—1 A present, gift.<BR>—2 An offering to a deity or to a king (<i>Nazarāṇā</i>); अहरहश्च<BR> नवनवानि प्राभृतान्युपहरन्ती Dk. 2. 2, 2. 8.<BR>—3 A bribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रामाणिक|प्रामाणिकः
प्रामाणिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Established by proof, founded or resting on authority.<BR>—2 Founded on the authority of scriptures (शास्त्रसिद्ध).<BR>—3 Authentic, credible.<BR>—4 Relating to a प्रमाण, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रामाणिकः|प्रामाणिक
प्रामाणिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 One who accepts proof.<BR>—2 One who is conversant with the Pramāṇas of the Naiyāyikas, a logician.<BR>—3 The head of a trade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रामाण्यम्
प्रामाण्यम्<BR>—1 Being a proof or resting on authority. —2 Credibility, authenticity.<BR>—2 Proof, evidence, authority.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रामाण्यवादिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रामाण्यवादिन्
प्रामाण्यम् + -वादिन् <i>a.</i> one who affirms or believes in proof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रामादिक
प्रामादिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Due to carelessness or error, wrong, faulty, incorrect;<BR> इति प्रामादिकः प्रयोगः or पाठः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रामाद्यम्
प्रामाद्यम्<BR>—1 Error, fault, blunder, mistake.<BR>—2 Madness, frenzy.<BR>—3 Intoxication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1131-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रामीत्यम्
प्रामीत्यम्<BR>—1 Debt.<BR>—2 Death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रामोदक
प्रामोद(दि)क <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Charming, enchanting, delightful; अहो प्रामोदिकं<BR> रूपम् U. 6. 20 (v. l.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रामोदिक
प्रामोद(दि)क <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Charming, enchanting, delightful; अहो प्रामोदिकं<BR> रूपम् U. 6. 20 (v. l.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायः|प्राय
प्रायः [प्र-अय् घञ्, इ-अच् वा]<BR>—1 Going away, departure, departure from life.<BR>—2 Seeking death by fasting, fasting, sitting down and abstaining from<BR> food with some object in view (generally with words like आस्, उपविश्<BR> &c.); see प्रायोपवेशन below; प्रायोपविष्टं गङ्गायां परीतं परमर्षिभिः<BR> Bhāg. 1. 3. 43.<BR>—3 The largest portion, majority, plurality; majority of cases.<BR>—4 Excess, abundance, plenty.<BR>—5 A condition of life. [<i>N. B.</i>:− At the end of comp. प्राय may<BR> be translated by<BR>——(<i>a</i>) for the most part, generally, mostly, almost, nearly; पतनप्रायौ<BR> ‘about to fall’; मृतप्रायः ‘almost dead, a little less than dead, nearly dead’<BR>; or<BR>——(<i>b</i>) abounding or rich in, full of, excessive, abundant; कष्टप्रायं<BR> शरीरम् U. 1; शालिप्रायो देशः Pt. 3; कमलामोदप्राया वनानिलाः<BR> U. 3. 24 ‘full of the fragrance’ &c., or<BR>——(<i>c</i>) like, resembling; वर्षशतप्रायं दिनम्, अमृतप्रायं वचनम् &c.]<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रायोपगमनम्, प्रायोपवेशः, प्रायोपवेशनम्, प्रायोपवेशनिका, प्रायोपेत, प्रायोपविष्ट, प्रायोपवेशिन्, प्रायदर्शनम्, प्रायभव<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोपगमनम्
प्रायः + -उपगमनम्, -उपवेशः, -उपवेशनम्, -उपवेशनिका sitting down<BR> and abstaining from food and thus preparing oneself for death, fasting<BR> oneself to death; मया प्रायोपवेशनं कृतं विद्धि Pt. 4; प्रायोपवेशनमतिर्नृपतिर्बभूव<BR> R. 8. 94; प्रायोपवेशसदृशं व्रतमास्थितस्य Ve. 3. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोपवेशः|प्रायोपवेश
प्रायः + -उपगमनम्, -उपवेशः, -उपवेशनम्, -उपवेशनिका sitting down<BR> and abstaining from food and thus preparing oneself for death, fasting<BR> oneself to death; मया प्रायोपवेशनं कृतं विद्धि Pt. 4; प्रायोपवेशनमतिर्नृपतिर्बभूव<BR> R. 8. 94; प्रायोपवेशसदृशं व्रतमास्थितस्य Ve. 3. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोपवेशनम्
प्रायः + -उपगमनम्, -उपवेशः, -उपवेशनम्, -उपवेशनिका sitting down<BR> and abstaining from food and thus preparing oneself for death, fasting<BR> oneself to death; मया प्रायोपवेशनं कृतं विद्धि Pt. 4; प्रायोपवेशनमतिर्नृपतिर्बभूव<BR> R. 8. 94; प्रायोपवेशसदृशं व्रतमास्थितस्य Ve. 3. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोपवेशनिका
प्रायः + -उपगमनम्, -उपवेशः, -उपवेशनम्, -उपवेशनिका sitting down<BR> and abstaining from food and thus preparing oneself for death, fasting<BR> oneself to death; मया प्रायोपवेशनं कृतं विद्धि Pt. 4; प्रायोपवेशनमतिर्नृपतिर्बभूव<BR> R. 8. 94; प्रायोपवेशसदृशं व्रतमास्थितस्य Ve. 3. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोपेत
प्रायः + -उपेत <i>a.</i> abstaining from food and thus awaiting the approach of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोपविष्ट|प्रायोपविष्टः
प्रायः + -उपविष्ट, -उपवेशिन् <i>a.</i> fasting oneself to death, who sits<BR> without food at the door of another to exact compliance with his demands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोपवेशिन्
प्रायः + -उपविष्ट, -उपवेशिन् <i>a.</i> fasting oneself to death, who sits<BR> without food at the door of another to exact compliance with his demands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायदर्शनम्
प्रायः + -दर्शनम् an ordinary phenomenon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायभव
प्रायः + -भव <i>a.</i><BR>—1 common, usually met with.<BR>—2 executing; युगह्रदौघमध्येन ब्रह्मप्रायभवेन च । धात्रा सृष्टानि<BR> भूतानि कृष्यन्ते यमसादनम् ॥ Mb. 12. 235. 17 (com. ब्रह्मप्रायभावेन<BR> ब्रह्मकार्यभूतेन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायणम्
प्रायणम्<BR>—1 Entrance, beginning, commencement<BR>—2 The path of life.<BR>—3 Voluntary death; पुत्रे राज्यं समासृज्य कुर्वीत प्रायणं रणे Ms. 9. 323.<BR>—4 Taking refuge, refuge; प्रायणं हि सतामहम् Bhāg. 11. 11. 48, 6. 5. 31.<BR>—5 Death; मनुष्येषु प्रायणान्तमोङ्कारमभिध्यायीत Praśna. Up. 5. 1.<BR>—6 A kind of food (prepared in milk); प्रायणं भगवत्प्रोक्तं भुञ्जते<BR> वाऽग्रभोजनम् Mb. 12. 335. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायणीय|प्रायणीयः
प्रायणीय <i>a.</i> Introductory, initial, initiatory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायणीयम्
प्रायणीय + .{@-यम्@} The first.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायणीयः|प्रायणीय
प्रायणीय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 An introductory libation at a Soma sacrifice; त्वं प्रायणीयोदयनीयदंष्ट्रः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 13. 37.<BR>—2 The first day of a Soma sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायत्यम्
प्रायत्यम् Purity, cleanliness, piety, pious disposition or preparation<BR> (of any rite); अप्रायत्यादात्मनस्ते दोषान् मौहूर्तिकादुत Bhāg. 3. 14. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायशस्
प्रायशस् <i>ind.</i> Generally, mostly, for the most part, in all probability;<BR> आशाबन्धः कुसुमसदृशं प्रायशो ह्यङ्गनानां सद्यःपाति प्रणयि हृदयं<BR> विप्रयोगे रुणद्धि Me. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायश्चित्तम्
प्रायश्चित्तम्, -प्रायश्चित्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Atonement, expiation, indemnification, a religious act to atone for sin; न<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">Page1132-2</a>]<BR> संसर्गं व्रजेत् सद्भिः प्रायश्चित्तेऽकृते द्विजः Ms. 11. 47; मातुः<BR> पापस्य भरतः प्रायश्चित्तमिवाकरोत् R. 12. 19. (प्रायो नाम तपः<BR> प्रोक्तं चित्तं निश्चय उच्यते । तपोनिश्चयसंयोगात् प्रायश्चित्तमितीर्यते ॥<BR> Hemādri).<BR>—2 Satisfaction, amends (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायश्चित्तिः|प्रायश्चित्ति
प्रायश्चित्तम्, -प्रायश्चित्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Atonement, expiation, indemnification, a religious act to atone for sin; न<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">Page1132-2</a>]<BR> संसर्गं व्रजेत् सद्भिः प्रायश्चित्तेऽकृते द्विजः Ms. 11. 47; मातुः<BR> पापस्य भरतः प्रायश्चित्तमिवाकरोत् R. 12. 19. (प्रायो नाम तपः<BR> प्रोक्तं चित्तं निश्चय उच्यते । तपोनिश्चयसंयोगात् प्रायश्चित्तमितीर्यते ॥<BR> Hemādri).<BR>—2 Satisfaction, amends (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायश्चित्तिक
प्रायश्चित्तिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Expiating, expiatory.<BR>—2 Expiable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायश्चित्तिन्
प्रायश्चित्तिन् <i>a.</i> One who makes an atonement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायश्चितीय
प्रायश्चितीय <i>a.</i> Expiatory; प्रायश्चितीयतां प्राप्य Ms. 11. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायश्चेतनम्
प्रायश्चेतनम् Atonement, expiation; प्रायश्चेतनमादिशन्तु गुरवो<BR> रामेण दान्तस्य मे Mv. 4. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायस्
प्रायस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Mostly, generally, as a general rule, for the most part; प्रायः प्रत्ययमाधत्ते<BR> स्वगुणेषूत्तमादरः Ku. 6. 20; प्रायो भृत्यास्त्यजन्ति प्रचलितविभवं<BR> स्वामिनं सेवमानाः Mu. 4. 21; or प्रायो गच्छति यत्र भाग्यरहितस्तत्रैव<BR> यान्त्यापदः Bh. 2. 90; प्रायः समापन्नविपतिकाले धियोऽपि पुंसां मलिनीभवन्ति H.<BR>—2 In all probability, most likely, probably, perhaps; तव प्राज्ञाप्रसादाद्धि<BR> प्रायः प्राप्स्यामि जीवितम् Mb.<BR>—3 Abundantly, largely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायेण
प्रायेण <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Mostly, as a general rule; प्रायेणैते रमणविरहेष्वङ्गनानां विनोदाः<BR> Me. 89; प्रायेण सत्यपि हितार्थकरे विधौ हि श्रेयांसि लब्धुमसुखानि विनान्तरायैः<BR> Ki. 5. 49; Ku. 3. 28; Ṛs. 6. 24.<BR>—2 Probably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायाणिक
प्रायाणिक, -प्रायात्रिक <i>a.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायाणिकी
प्रायाणिक, -प्रायात्रिक + .({@-की@} <i>f.</i>) Necessary or suitable for a journey; सर्वमाज्ञापयामास<BR> प्रायात्रिकमरिन्दम Mb. 3. 253. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायात्रिक
प्रायाणिक, -प्रायात्रिक <i>a.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायिक|प्रायिकं
प्रायिक <i>ind.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Usual, common.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायुध्
प्रायुध् €4 Ā. To fight; उन्मूर्धानः संनिपत्यापरान्तैः प्रायुध्यन्त<BR> स्पष्टदन्तध्वनीभाः Śi. 18. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायुद्धेषिन्
प्रायुद्धेषिन् <i>m.</i> A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायुस्
प्रायुस् <i>n.</i> Increased vitality, longer life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोक्त्र
प्रायोक्त्र <i>a.</i> Relating to an employer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोगिक
प्रायोगिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Applied, used.<BR>—2 Applicable.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रायोगिकधूमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोगिकधूमः
प्रायोगिक + -धूमः a Kind of sternulatory; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रायोज्य|प्रायोज्यं
प्रायोज्य <i>a.</i> Belonging to necessary things.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रारभ्
प्रारभ् €1 Ā. To begin, commence; प्रारभ्यते न खलु विघ्नभयेन<BR> नीचैः Bh. 2. 27; see आरभ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रारब्ध|प्रारब्धं
प्रारब्ध <i>p. p.</i> Begun, commenced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रारब्धम्
प्रारब्ध + .{@-ब्धम्@}<BR>—1 What is begun, an undertaking; विध्नैः पुनः पुनरपि प्रतिहन्यमानाः<BR> प्रारब्धमुत्तमजना न परित्यजन्ति Bh. 1. 27.<BR>—2 Fate, destiny.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रारब्धकर्मन्, प्रारब्धकार्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रारब्धकर्मन्
प्रारब्ध + -कर्मन्, -कार्य <i>a.</i> one who has commenced a work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रारब्धकार्य
प्रारब्ध + -कर्मन्, -कार्य <i>a.</i> one who has commenced a work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रारब्धिः|प्रारब्धि
प्रारब्धिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Beginning, commencement.<BR>—2 A post to which an elephant is fastened; or a rope for fastening him.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रारम्भः|प्रारम्भ|प्रारंभ|प्रारंभः
प्रारम्भः<BR>—1 Beginning, commencement; प्रारम्भेऽपि त्रियामा तरुणयति निजं नीलिमानं<BR> वनेषु Māl. 5. 6; R. 10. 9, 18. 49.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">Page1133-1</a>]<BR>—2 An undertaking, deed, enterprize; फलानुमेयाः प्रारम्भाः संस्काराः<BR> प्राक्तना इव R. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1132-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रारम्भणम्
प्रारम्भणम् Commencing, beginning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रारोहः|प्रारोह
प्रारोहः A shoot, sprout, new leaf; see प्ररोह. ━<i>a.</i> Accustomed<BR> to rise or ascend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्च्
प्रार्च् €1 P. To sing, praise, commend; Bhāg. ━<i>Caus.</i> To honour, worship; Bk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्जयितृ
प्रार्जयितृ <i>a.</i> One who grants; Nir. 10. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्णम्
प्रार्णम् A chief debt; P. VI. 1. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थ्
प्रार्थ् €10 Ā.<BR>—1 To ask or pray for, beg, request; तेन भवन्तं प्रार्थयन्ते Ś. 2. 16-17.<BR>—2 To demand in marriage.<BR>—3 To wish or long for, desire, want; अहो विध्नवत्यः प्रार्थितार्थसिद्धयः<BR> Ś. 3; स्वर्गतिं प्रार्थयन्ते Bg. 9. 20; Bk. 7. 48; R. 7. 53, 67; Ku. 5. 45.<BR>—4 To look for, search, be in search of; प्रार्थयध्वं तथा सीताम् Bk. 7. 48.<BR>—5 To attack, seize or fall upon; असौ अश्वानीकेन यवनानां प्रार्थितः<BR> M. 5; दुर्जयो लवणः शूली विशूलः प्रार्थ्यतामिति R. 15. 5, 9. 56.<BR>—6 To petition, file a suit against.<BR>—7 To have recourse to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थक|प्रार्थकः
प्रार्थक <i>a.</i> (-र्थिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> Asking, begging, requesting, soliciting, entreating,<BR> desiring, wishing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थकः|प्रार्थक
प्रार्थक + .{@-कः@} A suitor, petitioner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थनम्
प्रार्थनम्, -ना<BR>—1 A request, entreaty, prayer, solicitation; ये वर्धन्ते धनपतिपुरःप्रार्थनादुःखभाजः Bh. 3. 47.<BR>—2 A wish, desire; लब्धावकाशा मे प्रार्थना or न दुरवापेयं खलु<BR> प्रार्थना Ś. 1, 2. 1; उत्सर्पिणी खलु महतां प्रार्थना Ś. 7, 7. 2.<BR>—3 A suit, petition, supplication, a love-suit; कदाचिदस्मत्प्रार्थनामन्तःपुरेभ्यः<BR> कथयेत् Ś. 2 (the object is expressed by the loc.; as in शकुन्तलायां प्रार्थना).<BR>—4 N. of a Mudrā; प्रसृताङ्गुलिकौ हस्तौ मिथः श्लिष्टौ च संमुखे । कुर्यात्<BR> स्वहृदये सेयं मुद्रा स्यात् प्रार्थनाभिधा Tantrasāra.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रार्थनभङ्गः, प्रार्थनसिद्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थना
प्रार्थनम्, -ना<BR>—1 A request, entreaty, prayer, solicitation; ये वर्धन्ते धनपतिपुरःप्रार्थनादुःखभाजः Bh. 3. 47.<BR>—2 A wish, desire; लब्धावकाशा मे प्रार्थना or न दुरवापेयं खलु<BR> प्रार्थना Ś. 1, 2. 1; उत्सर्पिणी खलु महतां प्रार्थना Ś. 7, 7. 2.<BR>—3 A suit, petition, supplication, a love-suit; कदाचिदस्मत्प्रार्थनामन्तःपुरेभ्यः<BR> कथयेत् Ś. 2 (the object is expressed by the loc.; as in शकुन्तलायां प्रार्थना).<BR>—4 N. of a Mudrā; प्रसृताङ्गुलिकौ हस्तौ मिथः श्लिष्टौ च संमुखे । कुर्यात्<BR> स्वहृदये सेयं मुद्रा स्यात् प्रार्थनाभिधा Tantrasāra.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रार्थनभङ्गः, प्रार्थनसिद्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थनभङ्गः
प्रार्थनम् + -भङ्गः refusal of a request.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थनसिद्धिः
प्रार्थनम् + -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i> fulfilment of a desire; प्रार्थनासिद्धिशंसिनः R. 1. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थनीय|प्रार्थनीयं
प्रार्थनीय <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 To be prayed for or solicited.<BR>—2 To be wished or desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थनीयम्
प्रार्थनीय + .{@-यम्@} The third or Dvāpara age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थयितृ
प्रार्थयितृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 One who asks for, a solicitor, beggar.<BR>—2 suitor, wooer, lover (of a lady); लभेत वा प्रार्थयिता न वा श्रियम्<BR> Ś. 3. 13; Pt. 1. 138; एवं प्रार्थयिता विडम्ब्यते Ś. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थित|प्रार्थितः
प्रार्थित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Begged, requested, asked for, solicited.<BR>—2 Wished, desired.<BR>—3 Attacked, opposed by an enemy; तत्प्रार्थितं जवनवाजिगतेन राज्ञा R. 9. 56.<BR>—4 Killed, hurt.<BR>—5 Required, wanted; sought for; न दृश्यते प्रार्थयितव्य एव ते भविष्यति<BR> प्रार्थितदुर्लभः कथम् Ku. 5. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थिन्
प्रार्थिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Begging, requesting.<BR>—2 Wishing, desiring; मन्दः कवियशःप्रार्थी गमिष्याम्युपहास्यताम् R. 1. 3.<BR>—3 Attacking, assailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्थ्य
प्रार्थ्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be desired or wished for.<BR>—2 Desirable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रार्ध्
प्रार्ध् €1 Ā. To attain; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालम्ब|प्रालंब|प्रालम्बं|प्रालम्बः
प्रालम्ब <i>a.</i> Pendent, hanging down; प्रालम्बद्विगुणितचामरप्रहासः Ve. 2. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालम्बः|प्रालम्ब|प्रालंब|प्रालम्बं
प्रालम्ब + .{@-म्बः@}<BR>—1 A kind of pearl-ornament.<BR>—2 A female breast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालम्बम्
प्रालम्ब + .{@-म्बम्@} A garland worn round the neck and reaching to the breast;<BR> प्रालम्बमुत्कृष्य यथावकाशं निनाय साचीकृतचारुवक्त्रः R. 6. 14;<BR> मुक्ताप्रालम्बेषु K. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालम्बकम्
प्रालम्बकम् See प्रालम्बम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालम्बिका|प्रालंबिका
प्रालम्बिका A kind of golden necklace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालेयम्
प्रालेयम् Snow, frost, hoar frost, dew; ईशाचलं प्रालेयप्लवनेच्छया<BR> Gīt. 1; प्रालेयशीतमचलेश्वरमीश्वरोऽपि (अधिशेते) Śi. 4. 64;<BR> Me. 41; Ki. 11. 4; Ve. 2. 7; Bhāg. 10. 65. 22.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रालेयाद्रिः, प्रालेयभूधरः, प्रालेयशैलः, प्रालेयांशुः, प्रालेयकरः, प्रालेयरश्मिः, प्रालेयलेशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालेयाद्रिः|प्रालेयाद्रि
प्रालेयम् + -अद्रिः, -भूधरः, -शैलः ‘the snowy mountain’, the Himālaya; Me. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालेयभूधरः|प्रालेयभूधर
प्रालेयम् + -अद्रिः, -भूधरः, -शैलः ‘the snowy mountain’, the Himālaya; Me. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालेयशैलः|प्रालेयशैल
प्रालेयम् + -अद्रिः, -भूधरः, -शैलः ‘the snowy mountain’, the Himālaya; Me. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालेयांशुः|प्रालेयांशु
प्रालेयम् + -अंशुः, -करः, -रश्मिः<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालेयकरः|प्रालेयकर
प्रालेयम् + -अंशुः, -करः, -रश्मिः<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालेयरश्मिः|प्रालेयरश्मि
प्रालेयम् + -अंशुः, -करः, -रश्मिः<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रालेयलेशः|प्रालेयलेश
प्रालेयम् + -लेशः a hail-stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावटः|प्रावट
प्रावटः Barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावणम्
प्रावणम् A spade, hoe, shovel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावर्तिक
प्रावर्तिक <i>a.</i> (The कम or order) which is followed in the<BR> first round (<i>i. e.</i> while performing the first of a series of acts<BR> to be done with reference to several persons or things). Hence ˚कमन्यायः<BR> is the rule according to which when a series of acts are to be performed<BR> with reference to several persons or things, the first act may be performed<BR> in any order one likes, but the subsequent acts are to be performed in<BR> the very order in which the first act is performed. This is discussed<BR> and established by जैमिनि and शबर in MS. 5. 1. 8-12. For, thus<BR> it is that a uniform अङ्गप्रधानप्रत्यासत्ति is achieved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावादुकः|प्रावादुक
प्रावादुकः An opponent in philosophical discussion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावालिकः|प्रावालिक
प्रावालिकः A vendor of coral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावास
प्रावास^1 <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to a journey, to be done or given in a journey.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170214. note: no anusvara; may be stray smudge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावासिक
प्रावासिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Suitable or fit for a journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावीण्यम्
प्रावीण्यम् Cleverness, skilfulness, proficiency, dexterity; आविष्कृतं<BR> कथाप्रावीण्यं वत्सेन U. 4; R. 15. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृ
प्रावृ €5 U.<BR>—1 To put on, dress or clothe oneself in.<BR>—2 To surround, encompass, enclose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावरः|प्रावर
प्रावरः<BR>—1 A fence, an enclosure.<BR>—2 An upper garment (according to Hemacandra).<BR>—3 N. of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावरणम्
प्रावरणम् A garment, covering; especially an upper garment, cloak, mantle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावरणीयम्
प्रावरणीयम् An upper garment, cloak, mantle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावारः|प्रावार
प्रावारः<BR>—1 An upper garment, a cloak, mantle; (‘द्वौ प्रावारोत्तरासङ्गौ समौ बृहतिका तथा’);<BR> ययुर्विन्ध्यं शरन्मेघैः प्रावारैः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">Page1134-1</a>]<BR> प्रवरैरिव Bk. 7. 53; Mb. 1. 1. 133; also प्रावारक; Mk. 8. 22.<BR>—2 N. of a district.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रावारकीटः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1133-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावारकीटः|प्रावारकीट
प्रावारः + -कीटः a kind of white ant or moth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावारकः|प्रावारक
प्रावारकः An upper garment, mantle; यदीच्छसि लम्बदशाविशालं<BR> प्रावारकं सूत्रशतैर्हि युक्तम् Mk. 8. 22; जातीकुसुमवासितः प्रावारकोऽनुप्रेषितः Mk. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावारिकः|प्रावारिक
प्रावारिकः A maker of upper garments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृत|प्रावृतं|प्रावृतः
प्रावृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Enclosed, surrounded, covered, screened.<BR>—2 Put on (as a garment).<BR>—3 Filled with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृतः|प्रावृत|प्रावृतं
प्रावृत + .{@-तः, -तम्@} A veil, mantle, wrapper. (<i>f.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृतम्
प्रावृत + .{@-तः, -तम्@} A veil, mantle, wrapper. (<i>f.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृतिः|प्रावृति
प्रावृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An enclosure, a hedge, fence.<BR>—2 Spiritual darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृत्तिक|प्रावृत्तिकः
प्रावृत्तिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Secondary.<BR>—2 Well-informed. —3 Corresponding to a former mode of action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृत्तिकः|प्रावृत्तिक
प्रावृत्तिक + .{@-कः@} A messenger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृष्
प्रावृष् <i>f.</i> The rainy season, monsoon, rains (the months आषाढ<BR> and श्रावण); कलापिनां प्रावृषि पश्य नृत्यम् R. 6. 51, 19. 37;<BR> प्रावृट् प्रावृडिति ब्रवीति शठधीः क्षारं क्षते प्रक्षिपन् Mk. 5. 18; Me. 117.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रावृडत्ययः, प्रावृट्कालः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृडत्ययः|प्रावृडत्यय
प्रावृष् + -अत्ययः (प्रावृडत्ययः) end of the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृट्कालः|प्रावृट्काल
प्रावृष् + -कालः (प्रावृट्कालः) the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृषः|प्रावृष
प्रावृषः, -षा<BR> The rainy season, monsoons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृषा
प्रावृषः, -षा<BR> The rainy season, monsoons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

