प्रावृषिक, -प्रावृषीण <i>a.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृषिकी
प्रावृषिक, -प्रावृषीण + ({@-षिकी@} <i>f.</i>) Produced in the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृषिकः|प्रावृषिक
प्रावृषिक, -प्रावृषीण + .{@-कः@} A peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृषिज|प्रावृषिजः
प्रावृषिज <i>a.</i> Produced in the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृषिजः|प्रावृषिज
प्रावृषिज + .{@-जः@} A storm, stormy gale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृषेण्य|प्रावृषेण्यः
प्रावृषेण्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Produced in, relating to, the rainy season; सा किं शक्या जनयितुमिह<BR> प्रावृषेण्येन … वारिदेन Bv. 1. 30, 4. 6; R. 1. 36; प्रावृषेण्यपयोवाहव्यूहस्तनित … Rām. champū.<BR>—2 Abundant, copious, much (lit. coming in showers).<BR>—3 To be paid in the rainy season (as a debt &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रावृषेण्यः|प्रावृषेण्य
प्रावृषेण्य + .{@-ण्यः@}<BR>—1 The Kadamba tree.<BR>—2 The Kuṭaja tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

