प्राशनम्
प्राशनम्<BR>—1 Eating, feeding upon, tasting.<BR>—2 Causing to eat, or taste; मन्त्रवत् प्राशनं चास्य हिरण्यमधुसर्पिषाम् Ms. 2. 29.<BR>—3 Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राशनीय
प्राशनीय <i>a.</i> Eatable, serving as food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राशनीयम्
प्राशनीय + .{@-यम्@} Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राशित|प्राशितं
प्राशित <i>p. p.</i> Eaten, tasted, consumed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राशितम्
प्राशित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 An offering of rice and water to the manes of deceased ancestors, daily<BR> obsequies to the manes; प्राशितं पितृतर्पणम् Ms. 3. 74.<BR>—2 Eating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राशित्रम्
प्राशित्रम्<BR>—1 The portion of oblation partaken by Brahman at a sacrifice.<BR>—2 The vessel in which this oblation is placed. (This vessel is shaped<BR> like cowʼs ear); प्राशित्रमास्ये ग्रसने ग्रहास्तु ते Bhāg. 3. 13. 36.<BR>—3 Anything eatable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राशस्त्यम्
प्राशस्त्यम् Excellence, praiseworthiness, pre-eminence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राशा
प्राशा Ardent desire, longing for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राशास्त्रम्
