प्राशु|प्राशुः
प्राशु <i>a.</i> Ved. Exceedingly quick or swift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राशुः|प्राशु
