प्राश्निकः|प्राश्निक
प्राश्निक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 An examiner.<BR>—2 An umpire, an arbitrator, a judge; विनिर्वत्य रणोत्साहं मुहूर्तं<BR> प्राश्निको भव Rām. 3. 27. 4; Bhāg. 10. 61. 33; अहो प्रयोगाभ्यन्तरः<BR> प्राश्निकः M. 2; तद्भगवत्या प्राश्निकपदमध्यासितव्यम् M. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राश्लिष्ट
प्राश्लिष्ट <i>a.</i> N. of a kind of स्वरित.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रास्
प्रास् €4 P.<BR>—1 To throw, hurl or fling.<BR>—2 To discharge, cast (as a missile).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासः|प्रास
प्रासः<BR>—1 Throwing, casting, discharging.<BR>—2 A dart, a barbed missile; समुल्लसत्प्रासमहोर्मिमालम् Ki. 16. 4.<BR>—3 Insertion.<BR>—5 A particular position of a planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासकः|प्रासक
प्रासकः<BR>—1 A dart, barbed missile.<BR>—2 A die.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासनम्
प्रासनम्<BR>—1 Throwing, hurling, casting.<BR>—2 Throwing down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासिक|प्रासिकः
प्रासिक <i>a.</i> Armed with a dart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासिकः|प्रासिक
प्रासिक + .{@-कः@} A lancer, spearman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रास्त
प्रास्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Thrown, darted, hurled, cast, discharged.<BR>—2 Expelled, turned out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1134-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासंगः|प्रासङ्ग|प्रासंग|प्रासङ्गः
