प्रासंगिक|प्रासङ्गिक
प्रासंगिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Derived from close connection.<BR>—2 Connected with, innate.<BR>—3 Incidental, casual, occasional; प्रासंगिकीनां विषयः कथानाम् U. 2. 6.<BR>—4 Relevant.<BR>—5 Seasonable, opportune.<BR>—6 Episodical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासंग्यः|प्रासङ्ग्य|प्रासंग्य|प्रासङ्ग्यः
प्रासंग्यः A draught-ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासर्पिकम्
प्रासर्पिकम् A gift; स्याद् वा प्रासर्पिकस्य धर्ममात्रत्वात् MS. 10. 2. 37<BR> (where शबर paraphrases प्रासर्पिकस्य by दानस्य).<BR> This is to be distinguished from दक्षिणा (q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासहा
प्रासहा <i>f.</i> N. of Indraʼs wife; इन्द्रस्य प्रिया जाया वावाता प्रासहा<BR> नाम Ait. Br. 3. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादः|प्रासाद
प्रासादः [प्रसीदत्यस्मिन् प्र + सद् आधारे घञ् दीर्घः]<BR>—1 A palace, mansion, any large palatial building; भिक्षुः कुटीयति प्रासादे Sk.; Me. 66.<BR>—2 A royal mansion.<BR>—3 A temple, shrine.<BR>—4 A raised platform for spectators.<BR>—5 Terrace; ततो दुर्योधनगृहं प्रासादैरुपशोभितम् Mb. 12. 44. 6.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रासादाङ्गनम्, प्रासादारोहणम्, प्रासादकुक्कुटः, प्रासादगर्भः, प्रासादतलम्, प्रासादपृष्ठः, प्रासादप्रतिष्टा, प्रासादप्रस्तरः, प्रासादमण्डना, प्रासादशायिन्, प्रासादशिखरः, प्रासादशृङ्गम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादाङ्गनम्
प्रासादः + -अङ्गनम् the court-yard of a palace or temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादारोहणम्
प्रासादः + -आरोहणम् entering or going up into a palace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादकुक्कुटः|प्रासादकुक्कुट
प्रासादः + -कुक्कुटः a tame pigeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादगर्भः|प्रासादगर्भ
प्रासादः + -गर्भः an inner apartment in a palace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादतलम्
प्रासादः + -तलम् the surface or flat roof of a palace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादपृष्ठः|प्रासादपृष्ठ
प्रासादः + -पृष्ठः a balcony on the top of a palace; अथ प्रासादपृष्ठे सुखोपविष्टानां<BR> राजपुत्राणां … H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादप्रतिष्टा
प्रासादः + -प्रतिष्टा the consecration of a temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादप्रस्तरः|प्रासादप्रस्तर
प्रासादः + -प्रस्तरः the flat roof of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादमण्डना
प्रासादः + -मण्डना a kind of orpiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादशायिन्
प्रासादः + -शायिन् <i>a.</i> sleeping in a palace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादशिखरः
प्रासादः + -शिखरः, -शृङ्गम् the spire or pinnacle of a palace or temple,<BR> a turret; प्रासादशिखरस्थोऽपि काकः किं गरुडायते Pt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादशृङ्गम्
प्रासादः + -शिखरः, -शृङ्गम् the spire or pinnacle of a palace or temple,<BR> a turret; प्रासादशिखरस्थोऽपि काकः किं गरुडायते Pt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादीय
प्रासादीय <i>a.</i> Palatial, splendid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादीयति
प्रासादीयति Den. P. To look upon (a hut &c.) as a palace; प्रासादीयति कुट्याम् Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादिक
प्रासादिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Given as a favour.<BR>—2 Kind, friendly, amiable; अहो प्रासादिकं रूपम् U. 6. 20.<BR>—3 Beautiful, lovely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादिका
प्रासादिक + .{@-का@} A chamber on the top of a palace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासादिवारिकः|प्रासादिवारिक
प्रासादिवारिकः A kind of attendant in a monastery; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रासूतिक
प्रासूतिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to delivery or childbirth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रास्ताविक
प्रास्ताविक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Serving as an introduction, introductory, prefatory; as in प्रास्ताविकविलास<BR> (the first or introductory part of Bhāminīvilāsa); प्रास्ताविकं वचनम्<BR> ‘prefatory remarks’.<BR>—2 Seasonable, opportune, timely.<BR>—3 Pertinent, relevant (to the matter in hand); अप्रास्ताविकी महत्येषा<BR> कथा Māl. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रास्तुत्यम्
प्रास्तुत्यम् Being under discussion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रास्थानिक
प्रास्थानिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Relating to or proper at the time of departure; प्रास्थानिकं स्वस्त्ययनं<BR> प्रयुज्य R. 2. 70.<BR>—2 Favourable to a departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रास्थानिकम्
प्रास्थानिक + .{@-कम्@} Preparations for departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रास्थिक|प्रास्थिकः
प्रास्थिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Weighing a <i>Prastha</i>, q. v.<BR>—2 Bought for a <i>Prastha</i>.<BR>—3 Containing a <i>Prastha</i>.<BR>—4 Sown with a <i>Prastha</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रास्रवण
प्रास्रवण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Derived from a spring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राह्
प्राह् (Only in perfect tense as प्राह)<BR>—1 To announce, declare.<BR>—2 To call, name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राहः|प्राह
प्राहः Instruction in the art of dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राहवनीय
प्राहवनीय <i>a.</i> Worthy to be received as a guest; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राहारिकः|प्राहारिक
प्राहारिकः A police officer, watchman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राहुणः|प्राहुण
प्राहुणः A guest,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राह्णः|प्राह्ण
प्राह्णः The forenoon; नारायणः प्राह्ण उदात्तशक्तिः Bhāg. 6. 8. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राह्णेतन|प्राह्णेतनः
प्राह्णेतन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to, or happening in, the forenoon; P. IV. 3. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राह्णेतराम्
प्राह्णेतराम्, -तमाम् <i>ind.</i><BR> Very early in the morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्राह्णेतमाम्
प्राह्णेतराम्, -तमाम् <i>ind.</i><BR> Very early in the morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रिय|प्रियः
प्रिय <i>a.</i> [प्रीणाति प्री-तर्पणे क] (compar. प्रेयस्, superl. प्रेष्ठ)<BR>—1 Dear, beloved, liked, welcome, favourite; बन्धुप्रियाम् Ku. 1. 26;<BR> प्रकृत्यैव प्रिया सीता रामस्यासीन्महात्मनः Rām.; R. 3. 29.<BR>—2 Pleasing, agreeable; तामूचतुस्ते प्रियमप्यमिथ्या R. 14. 6.<BR>—3 Fond of, liking, loving, devoted or attached to; प्रियमण्डना Ś. 4. 9; प्रियारामा वैदेही U. 2.<BR>—4 Dear, expensive.<BR>—5 Ved. Customary, familar, usual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियः|प्रिय
प्रिय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 A lover, husband; स्त्रीणामाद्यं प्रणयवचनं विभ्रमो हि प्रियेषु Me. 28.<BR>—2 A kind of deer.<BR>—3 A son-in-law (जामाता); Ms. 3. 119 (com.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रिया
प्रिय + .{@-या@}<BR>—1 A beloved (wife), wife, mistress; प्रिये चारुशीले प्रिये रम्यशीले<BR> प्रिये Gīt. 10.<BR>—2 A woman in general.<BR>—3 Small cardamoms.<BR>—4 News, information.<BR>—5 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—6 A kind of jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियम्
प्रिय + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 Love.<BR>—2 Kindness, service, favour; प्रियमाचरितं लते त्वया मे V. 1. 16;<BR> मत्प्रियार्थं यियासोः Me. 22; प्रियं मे प्रियं मे ‘a good service done to me’<BR>; प्रियचिकीर्षवः Bg. 1. 23; U. 3. 26; Pt. 1. 193, 365.<BR>—3 Pleasing or gladsome news; विवेश भुवमाख्यातुमुरगेभ्य इव प्रियम्<BR> R. 12. 91; प्रियनिवेदयितारम् Ś. 4.<BR>—4 Pleasure; प्रियं प्राप्तो दशाननः Rām. 7. 23. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियम्
प्रिय + .{@-यम्@} <i>ind.</i> In a pleasing or agreeable manner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियेण
प्रिय + .{@-प्रियेण@} <i>ind.</i> Willingly.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रियातिथि, प्रियान्नम्, प्रियान्नत्वम्, प्रियापायः, प्रियाप्रिय,^1 प्रियाम्बुः, प्रियार्थम्, प्रियार्ह, प्रियासु, प्रियाख्य, प्रियाख्यानम्, प्रियाख्यानिकम्, प्रियात्मन्, प्रियाधानम्, प्रियालापिन्, प्रियासु, प्रियोक्तिः, प्रियोपपत्तिः, प्रियोपभोगः, प्रियैषिन्, प्रियकर, प्रियकर्मन्, प्रियकलत्रः, प्रियकलह, प्रियकाम, प्रियकार, प्रियकारक, प्रियकारिन्, प्रियकृत्, प्रियजनः, प्रियजानिः, प्रियजीव, प्रियजीविता, प्रियतोषणः, प्रियदत्ता, प्रियदर्श, प्रियदर्शन, प्रियदर्शिन्, प्रियदेवन, प्रियधन्वः, प्रियनिवेदनम्, प्रियपुत्रः, प्रियप्रश्नः, प्रियप्रसादनम्, प्रियप्राय, प्रियप्रायस्, प्रियप्रेप्सु, प्रियभावः, प्रियभाषणम्, प्रियभाषिन्, प्रियमण्डन, प्रियमधु, प्रियरण, प्रियवक्तृ, प्रियवचन, प्रियवयस्यः, प्रियवर्णी, प्रियवस्तु, प्रियवाच्, प्रियवादिका, प्रियवादिन्, प्रियश्रवस्, प्रियसंवासः, प्रियसखः, प्रियसत्य, प्रियसंदेशः, प्रियसंप्रहार, प्रियसमागमः, प्रियसहचरी, प्रियसाहस, प्रियसुहृद्, प्रियस्वप्न, प्रियहित<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियातिथि
प्रिय + -अतिथि <i>a.</i> hospitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियान्नम्
प्रिय + -अन्नम् dear food or provisions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियान्नत्वम्
प्रिय + -अन्नत्वम् dearth, scarcity; Bṛ. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियापायः|प्रियापाय
प्रिय + -अपायः absence or loss of a beloved object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियाप्रिय
प्रिय + -अप्रिय^1 <i>a.</i> pleasant and unpleasant, agreeable and disagreeable<BR> (feelings &c.).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियाप्रियम्
प्रिय + -अप्रियः + .({@-यम्@}) service and disservice, favour and injury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियाम्बुः|प्रियाम्बु|प्रियांबु
प्रिय + -अम्बुः the mango tree. ━(<i>a.</i>) fond of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियार्थम्
प्रिय + -अर्थम् <i>ind.</i> as a favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियार्ह|प्रियार्हः
प्रिय + -अर्ह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 deserving love or kindness; U. 3.<BR>—2 amiable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियार्हः|प्रियार्ह
प्रिय + -अर्ह + .({@-र्हः@}) N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियासु
प्रिय + -असु <i>a.</i> fond of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियाख्य
प्रिय + -आख्य <i>a.</i> announcing good news.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियाख्यानम्
प्रिय + -आख्यानम्, -आख्यानिकम् agreeable news; Pratimā 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियाख्यानिकम्
प्रिय + -आख्यानम्, -आख्यानिकम् agreeable news; Pratimā 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियात्मन्
प्रिय + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> amiable, pleasant, agreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियाधानम्
प्रिय + -आधानम् a friendly office; आत्मनीव प्रियाधानमेतन्मैत्रीमहाव्रतम् Mv. 5. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियालापिन्
प्रिय + -आलापिन् <i>a.</i> speaking kindly or agreeably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियासु
प्रिय + -आसु <i>a.</i> fond of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियोक्तिः|प्रियोक्ति
प्रिय + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i>, {@-उदितम्@}<BR> a kind or friendly speech, flattering remarks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियोपपत्तिः|प्रियोपपत्ति
प्रिय + -उपपत्तिः <i>f.</i> a happy or pleasant occurrence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियोपभोगः|प्रियोपभोग
प्रिय + -उपभोगः enjoyment of a lover or mistress;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">Page1136-1</a>]<BR> प्रियोपभोगचिह्नेषु पौरोभाग्यमिवाचरन् R. 12. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1135-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियैषिन्
प्रिय + -एषिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 desirous of pleasing or doing service.<BR>—2 friendly, affectionate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकर
प्रिय + -कर <i>a.</i> giving or causing pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकर्मन्
प्रिय + -कर्मन् <i>a.</i> acting in a kind or friendly manner. ━(<i>n.</i>)<BR> the action of a lover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकलत्रः|प्रियकलत्र
प्रिय + -कलत्रः a husband who is fond of his wife, whe loves her dearly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकलह
प्रिय + -कलह <i>a.</i> quarrelsome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकाम
प्रिय + -काम <i>a.</i> friendly disposed, desirous of rendering service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकार
प्रिय + -कार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 acting kindly, doing good to,<BR>—2 favourable, suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकारक
प्रिय + -कारक, -कारिन् <i>a.</i> acting or treating kindly. ━(<i>m.</i>) a<BR> friend, benefactor; प्रियकारक भद्रं ते Pt. 4. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकारिन्
प्रिय + -कारक, -कारिन् <i>a.</i> acting or treating kindly. ━(<i>m.</i>) a<BR> friend, benefactor; प्रियकारक भद्रं ते Pt. 4. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकृत्
प्रिय + -कृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 one who does good, a friend, benefactor.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियजनः|प्रियजन
प्रिय + -जनः a beloved or dear person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियजानिः|प्रियजानि
प्रिय + -जानिः a husband who dearly loves his wife, a gallant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियजीव|प्रियजीवः
प्रिय + -जीव <i>a.</i> living long, long-lived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियजीवः|प्रियजीव
प्रिय + -जीव + .({@-वः@}) Colasanthes Indica (Mar. टेंटू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियजीविता
प्रिय + -जीविता love of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियतोषणः|प्रियतोषण
प्रिय + -तोषणः a kind of coitus or mode of sexual enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियदत्ता
प्रिय + -दत्ता a mystical name of the earth; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियदर्श
प्रिय + -दर्श <i>a.</i> pleasant to look at; प्रियदर्शो दीर्घभुजः कथं<BR> कृष्ण युधिष्ठिरः Mb. 5. 90. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियदर्शन|प्रियदर्शनः
प्रिय + -दर्शन <i>a.</i> pleasing to look at, of pleasing appearance, good-looking,<BR> lovely, handsome; अहो प्रियदर्शनः कुमारः U. 5; R. 1. 47; Ś. 3. 9;<BR> एवमुत्सुकोऽपि प्रियदर्शनो देवः Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियदर्शनः|प्रियदर्शन
प्रिय + -दर्शन + .({@-नः@})<BR>—1 a parrot.<BR>—2 a kind of date tree.<BR>—3 N. of a prince of the Gandharvas; अवेहि गन्धर्वपतेस्तनूजं प्रियंवदं<BR> मां प्रियदर्शनस्य R. 5. 33.<BR>—4 A plant growing on trees and stones (Mar. दगड्फूल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियदर्शनम्
प्रिय + -दर्शन + .({@-नम्@}) the sight of a beloved object; अमृतं प्रियदर्शनम् Pt. 1. 128.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियदर्शनी
प्रिय + -दर्शन + .({@-नी@}) a bird, Gracula religiosa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियदर्शिन्
प्रिय + -दर्शिन् <i>a.</i> looking kindly upon anything. ━(<i>m.</i>) an epithet<BR> of king Aśoka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियदेवन
प्रिय + -देवन <i>a.</i> fond of gambling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियधन्वः|प्रियधन्व
प्रिय + -धन्वः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियनिवेदनम्
प्रिय + -निवेदनम् good tidings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियपुत्रः|प्रियपुत्र
प्रिय + -पुत्रः a kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियप्रश्नः|प्रियप्रश्न
प्रिय + -प्रश्नः a kind inquiry (about welfare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियप्रसादनम्
प्रिय + -प्रसादनम् propitiation of a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियप्राय|प्रियप्रायं
प्रिय + -प्राय <i>a.</i> exceedingly kind or courteous; प्रियप्राया वृत्तिः U. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियप्रायम्
प्रिय + -प्राय + .({@-यम्@}) eloquence in language.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियप्रायस्
प्रिय + -प्रायस् <i>n.</i> a very agreeable speech, as of a lover to his mistress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियप्रेप्सु|प्रियप्रेप्सुः
प्रिय + -प्रेप्सु <i>a.</i> wishing to secure oneʼs desired object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियभावः|प्रियभाव
प्रिय + -भावः feeling of love; प्रियभावः स तु तया स्वगुणैरेव वर्धितः U. 6. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियभाषणम्
प्रिय + -भाषणम् kind or agreeable words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियभाषिन्
प्रिय + -भाषिन् <i>a.</i> speaking sweet words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियमण्डन|प्रियमंडन
प्रिय + -मण्डन <i>a.</i> fond of ornaments; नादत्ते प्रियमण्डनापि भवतां<BR> स्नेहेन या पल्लवम् Ś. 4. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियमधु|प्रियमधुः
प्रिय + -मधु <i>a.</i> fond of liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियमधुः|प्रियमधु
प्रिय + -मधु + .({@-धुः@}) an epithet of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियरण
प्रिय + -रण <i>a.</i> warlike, heroic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियवक्तृ
प्रिय + -वक्तृ <i>a.</i> flattering, a flatterer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियवचन
प्रिय + -वचन <i>a.</i> speaking kind or agreeable words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियवचनम्
प्रिय + -वचन + .({@-नम्@}) kind, coaxing or endearing words; प्रियवचनकृतोऽपि<BR> योषितां दयितजनानुनयो रसादृते (प्रविशति हृदयं न) V. 2. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियवयस्यः|प्रियवयस्य
प्रिय + -वयस्यः a dear friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियवर्णी
प्रिय + -वर्णी the plant called प्रियङ्गु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियवस्तु
प्रिय + -वस्तु <i>n.</i> a beloved object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियवाच्
प्रिय + -वाच् <i>a.</i> speaking kindly, affable in address. ━(<i>f.</i>) kind<BR> or agreeable words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियवादिका
प्रिय + -वादिका a kind of musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियवादिन्
प्रिय + -वादिन् <i>a.</i> speaking kind or pleasing words, a flatterer; सुलभाः<BR> पुरुषा राजन् सततं प्रियवादिनः Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियवादिनी
प्रिय + -वादिन् + .({@-नी@}) a kind of bird. (Mar. मैना, साळुंखी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियश्रवस्
प्रिय + -श्रवस् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kṛṣṇa; प्रगायतः स्ववीर्याणि<BR> तीर्थपादः प्रियश्रवाः Bhāg. 1. 6. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसंवासः|प्रियसंवास
प्रिय + -संवासः the society of a beloved person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसखः|प्रियसख
प्रिय + -सखः<BR>—1 a dear friend.<BR>—2 the Khadira tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसखी
प्रिय + -सखः + .({@-खी@} <i>f.</i>) a female friend, a ladyʼs<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">Page1136-2</a>]<BR> confidante.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसत्य|प्रियसत्यं
प्रिय + -सत्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 a lover of truth.<BR>—2 pleasant though true.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसंदेशः|प्रियसन्देश|प्रियसंदेश|प्रियसन्देशः
प्रिय + -संदेशः<BR>—1 a friendly message, the message of a lover.<BR>—2 the tree called चम्पक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसंप्रहार|प्रियसम्प्रहार
प्रिय + -संप्रहार <i>a.</i> fond of litigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसमागमः|प्रियसमागम
प्रिय + -समागमः union with a beloved object or person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसहचरी
प्रिय + -सहचरी a beloved wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसाहस
प्रिय + -साहस <i>a.</i> adventurous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियसुहृद्
प्रिय + -सुहृद् <i>m.</i> a dear or bosom friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियस्वप्न
प्रिय + -स्वप्न <i>a.</i> fond of sleep; अकाले बोधितो भ्रात्रा प्रियस्वप्नो<BR> वृथा भवान् R. 12. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियहित
प्रिय + -हित <i>a.</i> at once agreeable and salutary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियंदद
प्रियंदद <i>a.</i> Giving what is pleasant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियंवद|प्रियंवदः
प्रियंवद <i>a.</i> Sweet-speaking, speaking kindly, affable in address,<BR> agreeable; तदप्यपाकीर्णमतः प्रियंवदां वदन्त्यपर्णेति च तां पुराविदः<BR> Ku. 5. 28; R. 3. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियंवदः|प्रियंवद
प्रियंवद + .{@-दः@}<BR>—1 A kind of bird.<BR>—2 N. of a Gandharva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकः|प्रियक
प्रियकः<BR>—1 A kind of deer; ‘प्रियको रोमभिर्युक्तो मृदूञ्चमसृणैर्घनैः’ Vaijayantī;<BR> विचलितैः परितः प्रियकव्रजैः Śi. 4. 32.<BR>—2 The tree called नीप, कदम्ब; उद्यानमुज्जिहानायाः प्रियका यत्र पादपाः<BR> Rām. 2. 71. 12.<BR>—3 The creeper प्रियङ्गु.<BR>—4 A bee.<BR>—5 A kind of bird.<BR>—6 Saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकी
प्रियकः + .{@-की@} The skin of the प्रियक deer; Rām. 3. 43. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियकम्
प्रियकः + .{@-कम्@} A flower of the <i>aśana</i> tree; उन्निद्रप्रियकमनोरमं<BR> रमण्याः संरेजे सरसि वपुः प्रकाशमेव Śi. 8. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियंकर|प्रियङ्कर|प्रियङ्करः
प्रियंकर, प्रियंकरण, प्रियंकार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Showing kindness to, acting kindly or affectionately; प्रियंकरो<BR> मे प्रिय इत्यनन्दत् R. 14. 48.<BR>—2 Agreeable.<BR>—3 Amiable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियंकरण|प्रियङ्करण
प्रियंकर, प्रियंकरण, प्रियंकार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Showing kindness to, acting kindly or affectionately; प्रियंकरो<BR> मे प्रिय इत्यनन्दत् R. 14. 48.<BR>—2 Agreeable.<BR>—3 Amiable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियंकार
प्रियंकर, प्रियंकरण, प्रियंकार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Showing kindness to, acting kindly or affectionately; प्रियंकरो<BR> मे प्रिय इत्यनन्दत् R. 14. 48.<BR>—2 Agreeable.<BR>—3 Amiable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियङ्गुः|प्रियङ्गु|प्रियंगु|प्रियंगुः
प्रियङ्गुः<BR>—1 N. of a creeper (said to put forth blossoms at the touch of women);<BR> प्रियङ्गुश्यामाङ्गप्रकृतिरपि Māl. 3. 9. (For some of the conventions<BR> of poets about the blossoming of trees, see the quotation under अशोक.)<BR>—2 Long pepper.<BR>—3 A plant and its perfume (Mar. गव्हला); Mb. 13. 104. 87.<BR>—4 A kind of millet (राजिका; Mar. राळा); दश ग्राम्याणि धान्यानि<BR> भवन्ति व्रीहियवास्तिलमाषा अणुप्रियङ्गवो गोधूमाश्च खल्वाश्च खलकुलाश्च<BR> Bṛ. Up. 6. 3. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियङ्गु|प्रियंगु|प्रियंगुः|प्रियङ्गुः
प्रियङ्गुः + .{@-गु@} <i>n.</i><BR>—1 Saffron.<BR>—2 mustard seed.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रियङ्गुद्वीपम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियङ्गुद्वीपम्
प्रियङ्गुः + -द्वीपम् N. of a country; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियतम|प्रियतमः
प्रियतम <i>a.</i> Most beloved, dearest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियतमः|प्रियतम
प्रियतम + .{@-मः@} A lover, husband; शिप्रावातः प्रियतम इव प्रार्थनाचाटुकारः Me. 31, 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियतमा
प्रियतम + .{@-मा@} A wife, mistress, beloved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियतर|प्रियतरः
प्रियतर <i>a.</i> Dearer, more beloved &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियता
प्रियता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Being dear, dearness.<BR>—2 Love, affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियत्वम्
प्रियता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Being dear, dearness.<BR>—2 Love, affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियंभविष्णु|प्रियम्भविष्णु
प्रियंभविष्णु, प्रियंभावुक <i>a.</i><BR> Become an object of affection, amiable, dearly loved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियंभावुक|प्रियम्भावुक
प्रियंभविष्णु, प्रियंभावुक <i>a.</i><BR> Become an object of affection, amiable, dearly loved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियालः|प्रियाल
प्रियालः The tree called Piyāl; see पियाल; Bhāg. 8. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियाला
प्रियालः + .{@-ला@} A vine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रियीय
प्रियीय Denom. P. (प्रियीयति) To think a person to be anotherʼs<BR> mistress; H. Yog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्री
प्री I. €9 U. (प्रीणाति, प्रीणीते, प्रीत)<BR>—1 To please, delight, satisfy, gladden; प्रीणाति यः सुचरितैः पितरं<BR> स पुत्रः Bh. 2. 68;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">Page1137-1</a>]<BR> सस्नुः पितॄन् पिप्रियुरापगासु Bk. 3. 38, 5. 104, 7. 64.<BR>—2 To be pleased, take delight in; कच्चिन् मनस्ते प्रीणाति वनवासे Mb.<BR>—3 To act kindly towards, show kindness towards. —4 To be cheerful or gay.<BR>━<i>Caus.</i> (प्रीणयति-ते) To please, satisfy &c. ━II. €4 Ā.<BR> (प्रीयते, strictly a passive voice of the root प्री)<BR>—1 To be satisfied or pleased, be gratified; प्रकाममप्रीयत यज्वनां<BR> प्रियः Śi. 1. 17; R. 15. 30, 19. 30; Y. 1. 245.<BR>—2 To feel affection for, love; स्वभावतस्ते प्रीयन्ते नेतरः प्रीयते<BR> जनः Mb. 12. 138. 54.<BR>—3 To assent, be satisfied. ━III. €1 P. To please, gratify &c. ━IV. €10 U.<BR> (प्राययति-ते) To please; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1136-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्री
प्री <i>a.</i> kind, delighted (as घृतप्री).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीण|प्रीणः
प्रीण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Pleased, satisfied, gratified.<BR>—2 Old, ancient.<BR>—3 Previous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीणन|प्रीणनं
प्रीणन <i>a.</i> Pleasing, gratifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीणनम्
प्रीणन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Pleasing, satisfying.<BR>—2 That which pleases or satisfies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीणित
प्रीणित <i>a.</i> Pleased, delighted; प्रीणितश्चापि भवति महतोऽर्थानवाप्य<BR> हि Mb. 12. 253. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीत|प्रीतः
प्रीत <i>p. p.</i> [प्री-कर्तरि क्त]<BR>—1 Pleased, delighted, rejoiced, gladdened; प्रीतास्मि ते पुत्र वरं<BR> वृणीष्व R. 2. 63, 1. 81, 12. 94.<BR>—2 Glad, happy, joyful; Me. 4.<BR>—3 Content.<BR>—4 Dear, beloved.<BR>—5 Kind, affectionate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतम्
प्रीत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Jest, mirth.<BR>—2 Delight, pleasure.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रीतात्मन्, प्रीतचित्त, प्रीतमनस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतात्मन्
प्रीत + -आत्मन्, -चित्त, -मनस् <i>a.</i> delighted at heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतचित्त
प्रीत + -आत्मन्, -चित्त, -मनस् <i>a.</i> delighted at heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतमनस्
प्रीत + -आत्मन्, -चित्त, -मनस् <i>a.</i> delighted at heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीता
प्रीता A symbolic expression for the sound (ष); Rām. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिः|प्रीति
प्रीतिः [प्री भावे क्तिच्] <i>f.</i> Pleasure, happiness, satisfaction,<BR> delight, gladness, joy, gratification; निहत्य धार्तराष्ट्रान् नः का<BR> प्रीतिः स्याज्जनार्दन Bg. 1. 36; Bhāg. 10. 23. 32. भुवनालोकनप्रीतिः<BR> Ku. 2. 45, 6. 21; R. 2. 51; Me. 64.<BR>—2 Favour, kindness.<BR>—3 Love, affection, regard; प्रीतिप्रमुखवचनं स्वागतं व्याजहार<BR> Me. 4, 16; R. 1. 57, 12. 54.<BR>—4 Liking or fondness for, delight in, addiction to; द्यूत˚, मृगया˚.<BR>—5 Friendliness, amity.<BR>—6 Conciliation.<BR>—7 A symbolical expression for the letter घ.<BR>—9 N. of a wife of Cupid and rival of Rati; (स चानङ्गवती वेश्या कामदेवस्य<BR> सांप्रतम् । पत्नी, सपत्नी संजाता रत्याः प्रीतिरिति श्रुता ॥ Matsya P.).<BR>—10 Longing (अभिलाषा); प्रीतिरेषा कथं रामो राजा स्यान्मयि जीवति<BR> ॥ एषा ह्यस्य परा प्रीतिर्हृदि संपरिवर्तते । Rām. 2. 1. 36-37.<BR>—11 N. of a श्रुति.<BR>—12 The 2nd of the 27 astrological Yogas.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रीतिकर, प्रीतिकर्मन्, प्रीतिच्छेदः, प्रीतिजुषा, प्रीतितृष्, प्रीतिद, प्रीतिदत्त, प्रीतिदानम्, प्रीतिदायः, प्रीतिधनम्, प्रीतिपात्रम्, प्रीतिपुरोग, प्रीतिपूर्वम्, प्रीतिपूर्वकम्, प्रीतिप्रमुख, प्रीतिभाज्, प्रीतिमनस्, प्रीतिमय, प्रीतियुज्, प्रीतिरसायनम्, प्रीतिवचस्, प्रीतिवर्धन, प्रीतिवादः, प्रीतिविवाहः, प्रीतिश्राद्धम्, प्रीतिसंयोगः, प्रीतिसंगतिः, प्रीतिस्निग्ध<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिकर
प्रीतिः + -कर <i>a.</i> producing love, kind, agreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिकर्मन्
प्रीतिः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> an act of friendship or love, a kind action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिच्छेदः|प्रीतिच्छेद
प्रीतिः + -च्छेदः destruction of joy; Mk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिजुषा
प्रीतिः + -जुषा N. of the wife of अनिरुद्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतितृष्
प्रीतिः + -तृष् <i>m.</i> N. of cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिद|प्रीतिदः
प्रीतिः + -द <i>a.</i> inspiring love; giving pleasure, pleasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिदः|प्रीतिद
प्रीतिः + -द + .({@-दः@}) a jester or buffoon in a play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिदत्त|प्रीतिदत्तं
प्रीतिः + -दत्त <i>a.</i> given through affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिदत्तम्
प्रीतिः + -दत्त + .({@-दत्तम्@}) property given to a female by her relatives, particularly<BR> by her father-in-law or mother-in-law at the time of marriage; प्रीत्या<BR> दत्तं तु यत् किंचित् श्वश्र्वा वा श्वशुरेण वा । पादवन्दनिकं चैव प्रीतिदत्तं<BR> तदुच्यते ॥ Kāty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिदानम्
प्रीतिः + -दानम्, -दायः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">Page1137-2</a>]<BR> a gift of love, a friendly present; तदवसरोऽयं प्रीतदीयस्य Māl. 4; R. 15. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिदायः|प्रीतिदाय
प्रीतिः + -दानम्, -दायः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">Page1137-2</a>]<BR> a gift of love, a friendly present; तदवसरोऽयं प्रीतदीयस्य Māl. 4; R. 15. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिधनम्
प्रीतिः + -धनम् money given through love or friendship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिपात्रम्
प्रीतिः + -पात्रम् an object of love, any beloved person or object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिपुरोग
प्रीतिः + -पुरोग <i>a.</i> affectionate, loving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिपूर्वम्
प्रीतिः + -पूर्वम्, -पूर्वकम् <i>ind.</i> kindly, affectionately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिपूर्वकम्
प्रीतिः + -पूर्वम्, -पूर्वकम् <i>ind.</i> kindly, affectionately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिप्रमुख
प्रीतिः + -प्रमुख <i>a.</i> friendly, affectionate, full of love, kind; Me. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिभाज्
प्रीतिः + -भाज् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 enjoying friendship, loved.<BR>—2 Contented; स्तनभरनमिताङ्गीरङ्गनाः प्रीतिभाजः Ki. 6. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिमनस्
प्रीतिः + -मनस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 delighted in mind, pleased, happy.<BR>—2 kind, affectionate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिमय
प्रीतिः + -मय <i>a.</i> arising from love or joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतियुज्
प्रीतिः + -युज् <i>a.</i> dear, affectionate, beloved; सखीनिव प्रीतियुजोऽनुजीविनः Ki. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिरसायनम्
प्रीतिः + -रसायनम्<BR>—1 a collyrium made of love; मित्रं प्रीतिरसायनं नयनयोः H. 183.<BR>—2 Any nectar-like beverage causing joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिवचस्
प्रीतिः + -वचस् <i>n.</i>, {@-वचनम्@}<BR> a friendly or kind speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिवर्धन|प्रीतिवर्धनः
प्रीतिः + -वर्धन <i>a.</i> increasing love or joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिवर्धनः|प्रीतिवर्धन
प्रीतिः + -वर्धन + .({@-नः@}) an epithet of Viṣṇu; प्रियकृत् प्रीतिवर्धनः V. Sah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिवादः|प्रीतिवाद
प्रीतिः + -वादः a friendly discussion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिविवाहः|प्रीतिविवाह
प्रीतिः + -विवाहः a love-marriage, love-match (based purely on love).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिश्राद्धम्
प्रीतिः + -श्राद्धम् a sort of Śrāddha or obsequial ceremony performed in<BR> honour of the manes of both parents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिसंयोगः|प्रीतिसंयोग
प्रीतिः + -संयोगः relation of friendship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिसंगतिः|प्रीतिसङ्गति
प्रीतिः + -संगतिः friendly alliance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिस्निग्ध
प्रीतिः + -स्निग्ध <i>a.</i> moist or wet through love (as the eyes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीतिमत्|प्रीतिमन्त्
प्रीतिमत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Full of love or affection, loving, fond, affectionate.<BR>—2 Pleased, satisfied.<BR>—3 Content, glad.<BR>—4 Favourable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीः
प्रीः <i>f.</i> (= प्रीतिः q. v.); L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रीणसः|प्रीणस
प्रीणसः A rhinoceros.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रु
प्रु €1 Ā. (प्रबते)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To jump, spring. ━<i>Caus.</i> To extend, reach as far as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रुष्
प्रुष् I. €1 P. (प्रोषति, प्रुष्ट)<BR>—1 To burn, consume.<BR>—2 To reduce to ashes. ━II. €9 P. (प्रुष्णाति)<BR>—1 To become wet or moist.<BR>—2 To pour out, sprinkle.<BR>—3 To fill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रुषित
प्रुषित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sprinkled, wetted.<BR>—2 Burning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रुष्ट|प्रुष्टः
प्रुष्ट <i>p. p.</i> Burnt, consumed, reduced to ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रुष्वः|प्रुष्व
प्रुष्वः<BR>—1 The rainy season.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR>—3 A drop of water (Sk.).<BR>—4 Head. ━<i>a.</i> Hot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रे
प्रे (प्र-इ) €2 P.<BR>—1 To go forward.<BR>—2 To arrive at, reach.<BR>—3 To go out of, depart from; धीराः प्रेत्यास्माल्लोकादमृता भवन्ति Ken.<BR>—4 (Hence) to die, depart life; प्रेत्य ‘after death’; see प्रेत्य below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेत|प्रेतः
प्रेत <i>p. p.</i> [प्र.-इ-क्त] Departed from this world, dead,<BR> deceased; स्वजनाश्रु किलातिसंततं दहति प्रेतमिति प्रचक्षते R. 8. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतः|प्रेत
प्रेत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 The departed spirit, the spirit before obsequial rites are performed.<BR>—2 A ghost, evil spirit; प्रेतान् भूतगणांश्चान्ये यजन्ते तामसा जनाः<BR> Bg. 17. 4; Ms. 12. 71.<BR>—3 The inhabitant of hell (नारक); शुश्रुवुर्दारुणा वाचः प्रेतानामिव<BR> भारत Mb. 6. 46. 19.<BR>—4 The manes (पितर); प्रथिता प्रेतकृत्यैषा पित्र्यं नाम विधुक्षये ।<BR> तस्मिन् युक्तस्यैति नित्यं प्रेतकृत्यैव लौकिकी ॥ Ms. 3. 127.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रेताधिपः, प्रेतान्नम्, प्रेतायनः, प्रेतास्थि, प्रेतावासः, प्रेतेशः, प्रेतेश्वरः, प्रेतोद्देशः, प्रेतकर्मन्, प्रेतकायः, प्रेतकार्यम्, प्रेतगत, प्रेतगृहम्, प्रेतगोपः, प्रेतचारिन्, प्रेतदाहः, प्रेतधूमः, प्रेतनदी, प्रेतनरः, प्रेतनिर्यातकः, प्रेतनिर्हारकः, प्रेतपक्षः, प्रेतपटहः, प्रेतपतिः, प्रेतपात्रम्, प्रेतपुरम्, प्रेतभावः, प्रेतभूमिः, प्रेतमेधः, प्रेतराक्षसी, प्रेतराजः, प्रेतलोकः, प्रेतवनम्, प्रेतवाहित, प्रेतशरीरम्, प्रेतशुद्धिः, प्रेतश्राद्धम्, प्रेतहारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेताधिपः|प्रेताधिप
प्रेत + -अधिपः an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतान्नम्
प्रेत + -अन्नम् food offered to the manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतायनः|प्रेतायन
प्रेत + -अयनः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">Page1138-1</a>]<BR> N. of a particular hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1137-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतास्थि
प्रेत + -अस्थि <i>n.</i> the bone of a dead man. {@˚धारिन्@} an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतावासः|प्रेतावास
प्रेत + -आवासः a burial-ground, cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतेशः|प्रेतेश
प्रेत + -ईशः, -ईश्वरः an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतेश्वरः|प्रेतेश्वर
प्रेत + -ईशः, -ईश्वरः an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतोद्देशः|प्रेतोद्देश
प्रेत + -उद्देशः an offering to the manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतकर्मन्|प्रेतकर्म्मन्
प्रेत + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i>, {@-कृत्यम्, -कृत्या@}<BR> obsequial or funeral rites; Ms. 3. 127.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतकायः|प्रेतकाय
प्रेत + -कायः a corpse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतकार्यम्
प्रेत + -कार्यम् see प्रेतकर्मन्; तस्य स प्रेतकार्याणि कृत्वा सर्वाणि<BR> भारत Mb. 3. 138. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतगत
प्रेत + -गत <i>a.</i> dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतगृहम्
प्रेत + -गृहम् a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतगोपः|प्रेतगोप
प्रेत + -गोपः the keeper of the dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतचारिन्
प्रेत + -चारिन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतदाहः|प्रेतदाह
प्रेत + -दाहः the burning of the dead, cremation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतधूमः|प्रेतधूम
प्रेत + -धूमः the smoke issuing from a funeral pile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतनदी
प्रेत + -नदी the river वैतरिणी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतनरः|प्रेतनर
प्रेत + -नरः a goblin, ghost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतनिर्यातकः|प्रेतनिर्यातक
प्रेत + -निर्यातकः, -निर्हारकः a man employed to carry dead bodies;<BR> प्रेतनिर्यातकश्चैव वर्जनीयाः प्रयत्नतः Ms. 3. 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतनिर्हारकः|प्रेतनिर्हारक
प्रेत + -निर्यातकः, -निर्हारकः a man employed to carry dead bodies;<BR> प्रेतनिर्यातकश्चैव वर्जनीयाः प्रयत्नतः Ms. 3. 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतपक्षः|प्रेतपक्ष
प्रेत + -पक्षः ‘the fortnight of the manes’, N. of the dark half of Bhādrapada<BR> when offerings in honour of the manes are usually performed; cf. पितृपक्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतपटहः|प्रेतपटह
प्रेत + -पटहः a drum beaten at a funeral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतपतिः|प्रेतपति
प्रेत + -पतिः Yama (the Indian ‘Pluto’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतपात्रम्
प्रेत + -पात्रम् a vessel used in a Śrāddha ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतपुरम्
प्रेत + -पुरम् the city of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतभावः|प्रेतभाव
प्रेत + -भावः death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतभूमिः|प्रेतभूमि
प्रेत + -भूमिः <i>f.</i> a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतमेधः|प्रेतमेध
प्रेत + -मेधः a funeral sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतराक्षसी
प्रेत + -राक्षसी the holy basil (तुलसी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतराजः|प्रेतराज
प्रेत + -राजः an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतलोकः|प्रेतलोक
प्रेत + -लोकः the world of the dead; प्रेतलोकं परित्यज्य आगता ये<BR> महालये Ulkādānamantra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतवनम्
प्रेत + -वनम् a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतवाहित|प्रेतवाहितः
प्रेत + -वाहित <i>a.</i> possessed by a ghost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतशरीरम्
प्रेत + -शरीरम् the body of the departed spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतशुद्धिः|प्रेतशुद्धि
प्रेत + -शुद्धिः <i>f.</i>, {@-शौचम्@}<BR> purification after the death of a relative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतश्राद्धम्
प्रेत + -श्राद्धम् an obsequial offering made to a departed relative during<BR> the year of his death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतहारः|प्रेतहार
प्रेत + -हारः<BR>—1 one who carries a dead body.<BR>—2 a near relative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतिः|प्रेति
प्रेतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 death, dying.<BR>—2 Departure, flight.<BR>—3 Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेतिकः|प्रेतिक
प्रेतिकः A ghost, spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेत्य
प्रेत्य <i>ind.</i> Having departed (from this world), after death, in<BR> the next world; न च तत् प्रेत्य नो इह Bg. 17. 28; इह कीर्तिमवाप्नोति<BR> प्रेत्य चानुत्तमं सुखम् Ms. 2. 9, 26.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रेत्यजातिः, प्रेत्यभाज्, प्रेत्यभावः, प्रेत्यभाविक<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेत्यजातिः|प्रेत्यजाति
प्रेत्य + -जातिः <i>f.</i> position in the world to come.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेत्यभाज्
प्रेत्य + -भाज् <i>a.</i> enjoying the fruits of actions in the next world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेत्यभावः|प्रेत्यभाव
प्रेत्य + -भावः the condition of soul after death; कथं मे प्रेत्यभावेऽपि<BR> न तैः स्यात् सह संगमः Mb. 1. 36. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेत्यभाविक
प्रेत्य + -भाविक <i>a.</i> relating to प्रेत्यभाव; see पारलौकिक; प्रेत्यभाविकमीहन्ते<BR> ऐहलौकिकमेव च Mb. 14. 37. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्ष्
प्रेक्ष् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To see, behold, look at, perceive; तमायान्तं प्रेक्ष्य Pt. 1; R. 12. 44;<BR> Ku. 6. 47; Ms. 8. 147.<BR>—2 To look on, be a spectator; युष्माकं प्रेक्षमाणानाम् Ve. 3.<BR>—3 To allow, suffer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षकः|प्रेक्षक
प्रेक्षकः A spectator, looker on, beholder, sight-seer; प्रकृतिं<BR> पश्यति पुरुषः प्रेक्षकवदवस्थितः सुस्थः Sāṅ. K. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षणम्
प्रेक्षणम्<BR>—1 Viewing, seeing.<BR>—2 A view, look, appearance.<BR>—3 The eye; चकितहरिणीप्रेक्षणा Me. 84.<BR>—4 Any public show or spectacle, sight, show.<BR>—5 A dramatic representation; प्रेक्षणावसाने V. 3.<BR>—6 A place where public exhibitions are held; Ms. 9. 264.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रेक्षणालम्भम्, प्रेक्षणकूटम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षणालम्भम्
प्रेक्षणम् + -आलम्भम् looking at and touching (women); स्त्रीणां च प्रेक्षणालम्भम् Ms. 2. 179.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षणकूटम्
प्रेक्षणम् + -कूटम् the eye-ball.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षणकम्
प्रेक्षणकम् A show, spectacle (as opp. to reality).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षणिका
प्रेक्षणिका A woman fond of seeing shows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षणीय
प्रेक्षणीय <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 To be seen, viewed, or gazed at; visible, apparent.<BR>—2 Fit to be seen, lovely to the sight, beautiful to look at; <i>a.</i> वप्रकीङापरिणतगजप्रेक्षणीयं<BR> ददर्श Me. 2; R. 14. 9.<BR>—3 To be considered or regarded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षणीयम्
प्रेक्षणीय + .{@-यम्@} A show, spectacle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षणीयकम्
प्रेक्षणीयकम् A show, sight, spectacle; प्रेक्षणीयकमिव क्षणमासन्<BR> ह्रीविभङ्गुरविलोचनपाताः (सुरतान्ताः); Śi. 10. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षा
प्रेक्षा<BR>—1 Viewing, seeing, beholding.<BR>—2 A look, view, sight, appearance.<BR>—3 Being a looker-on.<BR>—4 Any public spectacle or show, sight.<BR>—5 Particularly, a theatrical show, dramatic performance, play.<BR>—6 Intellect, understanding.<BR>—7 Reflection, consideration, deliberation; सा तस्मै सर्वमाचष्ट … … प्रत्युक्तं<BR> च यवकीतं प्रेक्षापूर्वं तथात्मना Mb. 3. 136. 7.<BR>—8 The branch of a tree.<BR>—9 Splendour; प्रेक्षां क्षिपन्तं हरितोपलाद्रेः Bhāg. 3. 8. 24.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रेक्षागारः, प्रेक्षागारः, प्रेक्षागारम्, प्रेक्षागृहम्, प्रेक्षास्थानम्, प्रेक्षाकारिन्, प्रेक्षापूर्वम्, प्रेक्षाप्रपञ्चः, प्रेक्षाविधिः, प्रेक्षासमाजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षागारः|प्रेक्षागार
प्रेक्षा + -अगारः, -आगारः, -गारम्, -गृहम्, -स्थानम्<BR>—1 a theatre, or play-house.<BR>—2 a council-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षागारः|प्रेक्षागार
प्रेक्षा + -अगारः, -आगारः, -गारम्, -गृहम्, -स्थानम्<BR>—1 a theatre, or play-house.<BR>—2 a council-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षागारम्
प्रेक्षा + -अगारः, -आगारः, -गारम्, -गृहम्, -स्थानम्<BR>—1 a theatre, or play-house.<BR>—2 a council-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षागृहम्
प्रेक्षा + -अगारः, -आगारः, -गारम्, -गृहम्, -स्थानम्<BR>—1 a theatre, or play-house.<BR>—2 a council-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षास्थानम्
प्रेक्षा + -अगारः, -आगारः, -गारम्, -गृहम्, -स्थानम्<BR>—1 a theatre, or play-house.<BR>—2 a council-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षाकारिन्
प्रेक्षा + -कारिन् <i>a.</i> wise, prudent, circumspect; प्रेक्षाकारी याति पदं<BR> मुक्तमपायैः Ki. 18. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षापूर्वम्
प्रेक्षा + -पूर्वम् <i>ind.</i> with deliberation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षाप्रपञ्चः|प्रेक्षाप्रपञ्च
प्रेक्षा + -प्रपञ्चः, -विधिः a stage-play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षाविधिः|प्रेक्षाविधि
प्रेक्षा + -प्रपञ्चः, -विधिः a stage-play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षासमाजः|प्रेक्षासमाज
प्रेक्षा + -समाजः an audience, a crowd of spectators, assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षावत्|प्रेक्षावन्त्
प्रेक्षावत् <i>a.</i> Considerate, wise, learned (as a man).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षित
प्रेक्षित <i>p. p.</i> Seen, viewed, beheld, gazed or looked at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षितम्
प्रेक्षित + .{@-तम्@} A look, glance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्षिन्
प्रेक्षिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Looking at, viewing.<BR>—2 Watching narrowly, observing carefully.<BR>—3 Having the eyes or glance of, looking like, as in मृगप्रेक्षणी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेक्ष्य
प्रेक्ष्य = प्रेक्षणीय q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेङ्ख्|प्रेंख्
प्रेङ्ख् €1 P. To vibrate, shake, tremble, swing to and fro, oscillate.<BR>━<i>Caus.</i> To shake, swing, rock to and fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेङ्खः|प्रेङ्ख|प्रेंखं|प्रेंखः
प्रेङ्खः, -ङ्खम्<BR> A swing; also प्रेङ्खेङ्खनम् Swinging; या दोहनेऽवहनने<BR> मथनोपलेपप्रेङ्खेङ्खनार्भरुदितोक्षणमार्जनादौ Bhāg. 10. 44. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेङ्खम्
प्रेङ्खः, -ङ्खम्<BR> A swing; also प्रेङ्खेङ्खनम् Swinging; या दोहनेऽवहनने<BR> मथनोपलेपप्रेङ्खेङ्खनार्भरुदितोक्षणमार्जनादौ Bhāg. 10. 44. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेङ्खण|प्रेंखण
प्रेङ्खण <i>a.</i> Wandering, moving, going towards, entering; वनान्तप्रेङ्खणः<BR> पापः Bk. 9. 106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेङ्खणम्
प्रेङ्खण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Swinging.<BR>—2 A swing<BR>—3 A minor drama in one act, having no Sūtradhāra, hero &c.; S. D. thus<BR> defines it:− गर्भावमर्शरहितं प्रेङ्खणं हीननायकम् । असूत्रधारमेकाङ्कमविष्कम्भप्रवेशकम् ।<BR> नियुद्धसंफेटपुतं सर्ववृत्तिसमाश्रितम् ॥ 547; <i>e. g.</i> वालिवध.<BR> ˚कारिका a female dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेङ्खा|प्रेंखा
प्रेङ्खा<BR>—1 A swing.<BR>—2 Dancing.<BR>—3 Roaming about, wandering, travelling.<BR>—4 A kind of building or house.<BR>—5 A particular pace of a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेङ्खित|प्रेंखित|प्रेङ्खितं
प्रेङ्खित <i>p. p.</i> Swung, shaken, oscillated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1138-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेङ्खोल्|प्रेंखोल्
प्रेङ्खोल् €10 U. (प्रेङ्खोलयति-ते) To swing, shake, oscillate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेङ्खोलः|प्रेङ्खोल|प्रेंखोलः
प्रेङ्खोलः, प्रेङ्खोलनम्<BR>—1 Swinging, shaking, oscillating; पौरस्त्यझञ्झानिलप्रेङ्खोलस्खलितेन्द्रनील … … Māl. 9. 17.<BR>—2 A swing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेङ्खोलनम्
प्रेङ्खोलः, प्रेङ्खोलनम्<BR>—1 Swinging, shaking, oscillating; पौरस्त्यझञ्झानिलप्रेङ्खोलस्खलितेन्द्रनील … … Māl. 9. 17.<BR>—2 A swing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेत|प्रेतः
प्रेत, प्रेति, प्रेत्य &c. See under प्रे.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेति|प्रेतिः
प्रेत, प्रेति, प्रेत्य &c. See under प्रे.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेत्य
प्रेत, प्रेति, प्रेत्य &c. See under प्रे.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेत्वन्
प्रेत्वन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 Wind.<BR>—2 An epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेप्सा
प्रेप्सा<BR>—1 Desire of obtaining; Nir. 7. 17.<BR>—2 Desire (in general).<BR>—3 Supposition, assumption; Nir. 6. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेप्सु
प्रेप्सु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Desirous of obtaining, wishing, seeking, longing for; अफलप्रेप्सुना<BR> कर्म यत् तत् सात्त्विकमुच्यते Bg. 18. 23.<BR>—2 Aiming at.<BR>—3 Supposing, assuming. —4 Anxious to deliver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमन्
प्रेमन् <i>m., n.</i> [प्रियस्य भावः इमनिच् प्रादेशः एकाच्कत्वात् न टिलोपः Tv.]<BR>—1 Love, affection; तत् प्रेम हेमनिकषोपलतां तनोति Gīt. 11; Me. 46;<BR> भद्रं प्रेम सुमानुषस्य कथमप्येकं हि तत् प्राप्यते U. 1.<BR>—2 Favour, kindness, kind or tender regard.<BR>—3 Sport, pastime.<BR>—4 Joy, delight, gladness. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A jest, joke.<BR>—2 Wind, air.<BR>—3 An epithet of Indra.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रेमाश्रु, प्रेमार्द्र, प्रेमर्द्धिः, प्रेमपर, प्रेमपातनम्, प्रेमपावम्, प्रेमबन्धः, प्रेमबन्धनम्, प्रेमभावः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमाश्रु
प्रेमन् + -अश्रु <i>n.</i> a tear of joy or affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमार्द्र
प्रेमन् + -आर्द्र <i>a.</i> overflowing with love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमर्द्धिः|प्रेमर्धि
प्रेमन् + -ऋद्धिः <i>f.</i> increase of affection, ardent love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमपर
प्रेमन् + -पर <i>a.</i> affectionate, loving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमपातनम्
प्रेमन् + -पातनम्<BR>—1 tears (of joy).<BR>—2 the eye (that sheds them).<BR>—3 rheum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमपावम्
प्रेमन् + -पावम् ‘an object of love’, any beloved person or thing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमबन्धः|प्रेमबन्ध|प्रेमबंध
प्रेमन् + -बन्धः, -बन्धनम् a bond or tie of affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमबन्धनम्
प्रेमन् + -बन्धः, -बन्धनम् a bond or tie of affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमभावः|प्रेमभाव
प्रेमन् + -भावः affection, love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमवती
प्रेमवती A mistress or beloved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेमिन्
प्रेमिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Loving, affectionate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेयस्
प्रेयस् <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Dearer, more beloved or agreeable &c. (compar. of<BR> प्रिय q. v.). ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A lover, husband; प्रेयसः परमां प्रीतिमुवाह प्रेयसी रहः Bhāg. 9. 18. 47.<BR>—2 A dear friend; निष्णातश्च समागमोऽपि विहितस्त्वत्प्रेयसः कान्तया,<BR> संप्रीतौ नृपनन्दनौ यदपरं प्रेयस्तदप्युच्यताम् ॥ Māl. 10. 24. ━<i>m., n.</i><BR>—1 Flattery.<BR>—2 The desired fruit of ‘heaven’ etc. but not a means to salvation; श्रेयश्च<BR> प्रेयश्च मनुष्यमेतस्तौ संपरीत्य विविनक्ति धीरः Kaṭh.<BR>—3 Good service, welfare; प्रेयो विधास्यन्ति वाम् Māl. 6. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेयसी
प्रेयस् + .{@-सी@} A wife, mistress; Bhāg. 9. 18. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेयोपत्यः|प्रेयोपत्य
प्रेयोऽपत्यः A heron (fond of offspring).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेर्
प्रेर् <i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To set in motion, move.<BR>—2 To push or urge on, propel, impel, send forth; यात्रायै प्रेरयामास<BR> तं शक्तेः प्रथमं शरत् R. 4. 24 (v. l.).<BR>—3 To incite, instigate, set on.<BR>—4 To cast, direct (as eyes); नयने यत् प्रेरयन्त्या तया Ś. 2. 2.<BR>—5 To throw, hurl.<BR>—6 To send forth, despatch.<BR>—7 To utter.<BR>—8 To ask.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेरक
प्रेरक <i>a.</i> (-रिका <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Impelling, urging, stimulating.<BR>—2 Sending, directing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेरणम्
प्रेरणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Driving or urging on, impelling, inciting, instigation.<BR>—2 Impulse, passion.<BR>—3 Throwing,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">Page1139-2</a>]<BR> casting; ह्रीमूढानां भवति विफलप्रेरणा चूर्णमुष्टिः Me. 70.<BR>—4 Sending, despatching.<BR>—5 Order, direction.<BR>—6 (In gram.) The sense of the causal form.<BR>—7 Activity, exertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेरणा
प्रेरणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Driving or urging on, impelling, inciting, instigation.<BR>—2 Impulse, passion.<BR>—3 Throwing,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">Page1139-2</a>]<BR> casting; ह्रीमूढानां भवति विफलप्रेरणा चूर्णमुष्टिः Me. 70.<BR>—4 Sending, despatching.<BR>—5 Order, direction.<BR>—6 (In gram.) The sense of the causal form.<BR>—7 Activity, exertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेरयितृ
प्रेरयितृ, प्रेरितृ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 One who urges or sends.<BR>—2 A ruler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेरितृ
प्रेरयितृ, प्रेरितृ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 One who urges or sends.<BR>—2 A ruler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेरित|प्रेरितः
प्रेरित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Impelled, urged, instigated.<BR>—2 Excited, stimulated, prompted; अभक्ष्यं मन्यते भक्ष्यं स्त्रीवाक्यप्रेरितो<BR> नरः Pt. 2. 144.<BR>—3 Sent, despatched.<BR>—4 Ordered.<BR>—5 Directed, cast; ततस्ततः प्रेरितलोललोचना Ś. 1. 23.<BR>—6 Touched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेरितः|प्रेरित
प्रेरित + .{@-तः@} An envoy, a messenger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेर्त्वन्
प्रेर्त्वन् <i>m.</i> Ved. The ocean. ━<i>f.</i> (प्रेर्त्वरी) A river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्
प्रेष् I. €4 P.<BR>—1 To drive forward, drive on.<BR>—2 To send forth, utter.<BR>—3 To fling, cast. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To send forth, cast, hurl; प्रैषिषद् राक्षसः प्रासम् Bk. 15. 77.<BR>—2 To send, despatch; किमर्थमृषयः प्रेषिताः स्युः Ś. 5.<BR>—3 To send away, dismiss.<BR>—4 To banish.<BR>—5 To turn or direct (the eyes).<BR>—6 To invite, summon. ━II. €1 U. (प्रेषति-ते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेषः|प्रेष
प्रेषः<BR>—1 Urging on.<BR>—2 Affliction, pain, sorrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेषक
प्रेषक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Despatching, sending.<BR>—2 Ordering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेषणम्
प्रेषणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Sending, despatching.<BR>—2 Sending on a mission, directing, commissioning.<BR>—3 Executing a commission.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रेषणाध्यक्षः, प्रेषणकृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेषणा
प्रेषणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Sending, despatching.<BR>—2 Sending on a mission, directing, commissioning.<BR>—3 Executing a commission.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रेषणाध्यक्षः, प्रेषणकृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेषणाध्यक्षः|प्रेषणाध्यक्ष
प्रेषणम् + -अध्यक्षः a superintendent of the commands, chief of the administration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेषणकृत्
प्रेषणम् + -कृत् <i>a.</i> one who executes a commission; पुष्पाहारः प्रेषणकृत्<BR> कचस्तात न दृश्यते Mb. 1. 76. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेषित|प्रेषितं
प्रेषित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Despatched (on an errand).<BR>—2 Ordered, directed.<BR>—3 Turned, fixed upon, directed towards, cast (as eyes).<BR>—4 Banished. —5 Sent away, dismissed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्य|प्रेष्यः
प्रेष्य <i>a.</i> To be ordered, sent, despatched &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्यः|प्रेष्य
प्रेष्य + .{@-ष्यः@}<BR>—1 A servant, menial, slave; प्रेष्यः प्रतीपोधिकृतः प्रमादी त्याज्या अमी<BR> यश्च कृतं न वेत्ति Pt. 1. 424.<BR>—2 A messenger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्या
प्रेष्य + .{@-ष्या@} A female servant, hand-maid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्यम्
प्रेष्य + .{@-ष्यम्@}<BR>—1 Sending on a mission.<BR>—2 Servitude.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रेष्यजनः, प्रेष्यभावः, प्रेष्यवधूः, प्रेष्यवर्गः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्यजनः|प्रेष्यजन
प्रेष्य + -जनः servants taken collectively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्यभावः|प्रेष्यभाव
प्रेष्य + -भावः capacity of a servant, servitude, bondage; प्रेष्यभावेन<BR> नामेयं देवीशब्दक्षमा सती M. 5. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्यवधूः
प्रेष्य + -वधूः<BR>—1 the wife of a servant.<BR>—2 a female servant, handmaid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्यवर्गः|प्रेष्यवर्ग
प्रेष्य + -वर्गः the body of servants, suite, train.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्ठ|प्रेष्ठः
प्रेष्ठ <i>p. p.</i> Dearest, most beloved &c. (superl. of प्रिय q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्ठः|प्रेष्ठ
प्रेष्ठ + .{@-ष्ठः@} A lover, husband; (उपदेववरस्त्रियः) विमानयानाः<BR> सप्रेष्ठाः Bhāg. 4. 3. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेष्ठा
प्रेष्ठ + .{@-ष्ठा@}<BR>—1 A wife, mistress.<BR>—2 A leg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेहि
प्रेहि (Second person, sing. of the imperative of इ with प्र q. v.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रेहिकटा, प्रेहिकर्दमा, प्रेहिद्वितीया, प्रेहिवाणिजा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेहिकटा
प्रेहि + -कटा a rite in which no mats are allowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेहिकर्दमा
प्रेहि + -कर्दमा a rite in which no impurity is allowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेहिद्वितीया
प्रेहि + -द्वितीया a rite at which no second person is allowed to be present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रेहिवाणिजा
प्रेहि + -वाणिजा a rite at which no merchants are allowed to be present.<BR> (See Gaṇa to P. II. 1. 72).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1139-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रैयम्
प्रैयम् Being kind, kindness, love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रैयकम्
प्रैयकम् A variety of चर्म; Kau. A. 2. 11. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रैयरूपकम्
प्रैयरूपकम् Beauty; प्रैयरूपकविशेषनिवेशैः N. 5. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रैषः|प्रैष
प्रैषः<BR>—1 Sending, directing.<BR>—2 An order, command, invitation.<BR>—3 Affliction, distress.<BR>—4 Madness, frenzy.<BR>—5 Crushing, pressing, squeezing (मर्दन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रैषणिक
प्रैषणिक <i>a.</i> Executing orders or commissions (as a servant).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रैष्यः|प्रैष्य
प्रैष्यः A servant, menial, slave; Ku. 6. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रैष्या
प्रैष्यः + .{@-ष्या@} A female servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रैष्यम्
प्रैष्यः + .{@-ष्यम्@} Servitude, slavery; प्रैष्यं पापीयसां यातु सूर्यं च प्रति<BR> मेहतु Rām. 2. 75. 22.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रैष्यभावः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रैष्यभावः|प्रैष्यभाव
प्रैष्यः + -भावः the capacity of a servant, being used as servant, servitude;<BR> जङ्गमं प्रैष्यभावे वः Ku. 6. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोक्ष्
प्रोक्ष् €6 P.<BR>—1 To sprinkle upon or with.<BR>—2 To consecrate by sprinkling holy water; प्राणात्यये तथा श्राद्धे प्रोक्षितं<BR> द्विजकाम्यया Y. 1. 179; Ms. 5. 27.<BR>—3 To slay, kill. ━<i>Caus.</i> To sprinkle, sprinkle with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोक्षणम्
प्रोक्षणम्<BR>—1 Sprinkling, sprinkling with water; अद्भिस्तु प्रोक्षणं शौचं बहूनां<BR> धान्यवाससाम् Ms. 5. 118; Y. 1. 184.<BR>—2 Consecration by sprinkling.<BR>—3 Immolation (of animals) at a sacrifice.<BR>—4 A text to be repeated at an animal-sacrifice;<BR>—5 A vessel for holy water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोक्षणी
प्रोक्षणम् + .{@-णी, प्रोक्षणिः@} <i>f.</i> Water used for sprinkling or consecrating,<BR> holy water; याभिरद्भिर्हविषः पुरोडाशानां च प्रोक्षणं कृतं ताः प्रोक्षण्यः<BR> Karka. (Used in pl., and sometimes used to denote ‘the vessel containing holy water’<BR>, in which sense the word generally used is ग्रोक्षणीपात्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोक्षणिः|प्रोक्षणि
प्रोक्षणम् + .{@-णी, प्रोक्षणिः@} <i>f.</i> Water used for sprinkling or consecrating,<BR> holy water; याभिरद्भिर्हविषः पुरोडाशानां च प्रोक्षणं कृतं ताः प्रोक्षण्यः<BR> Karka. (Used in pl., and sometimes used to denote ‘the vessel containing holy water’<BR>, in which sense the word generally used is ग्रोक्षणीपात्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोक्षणीयम्
प्रोक्षणीयम् Water for consecrating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोक्षित|प्रोक्षितं
प्रोक्षित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Purified or consecrated by sprinkling.<BR>—2 Immolated at a sacrifice.<BR>—3 Offered in sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोच्चण्ड|प्रोच्चंड
प्रोच्चण्ड <i>a.</i> Exceedingly frightful or terrible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोच्चल्
प्रोच्चल् €1 P. To start, set out on journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोच्चाटना
प्रोच्चाटना<BR>—1 Driving away, removal.<BR>—2 Destruction; P. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोच्चारित
प्रोच्चारित <i>a.</i> Sounding loudly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोच्चैस्
प्रोच्चैस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Very loudly, aloud.<BR>—2 In a very high degree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोच्छल्
प्रोच्छल् €1 P. To spurt out, gush or flow forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोच्छून
प्रोच्छून <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Dilated.<BR>—2 Swollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोच्छ्रित
प्रोच्छ्रित <i>p. p.</i> High, lofty, elevated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोज्जासनम्
प्रोज्जासनम् Killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोज्जासितम्
प्रोज्जासितम् <i>p. p.</i> Killed, slaughtered; प्रोज्जासितारिरनुजेन<BR> समं स रामः Rām. Ch. 2. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोज्झ्
प्रोज्झ् €6 P. = उज्झ् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोज्झनम्
प्रोज्झनम् Abandoning, quitting, leaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोज्झित|प्रोज्झितं
प्रोज्झित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Abandoned, quitted, forsaken, avoided; धर्मः प्रोज्झितकैतवोऽत्र Bhāg.<BR>—2 Free from, wanting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोञ्छनम्
प्रोञ्छनम्<BR>—1 Wiping away, wiping out, effacing; पृच्छयसे तदपि येन विवेकप्रोञ्छनाय<BR> विषये रससेकः N. 5. 36.<BR>—2 Picking up the remnants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोड्डीन
प्रोड्डीन <i>a.</i> Flown up or away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोढ
प्रोढ, प्रोढि See प्रौढ, प्रौढि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोढि|प्रोढिः
प्रोढ, प्रोढि See प्रौढ, प्रौढि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोण्ठः|प्रोण्ठ|प्रोंठः
प्रोण्ठः A spitting-pot, spittoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत|प्रोतं
प्रोत <i>p. p.</i> [प्र-वे-स्यूतौ-क्त संप्रसारणम्]<BR>—1 Sewn, stitched; तटाभिघातादिव लग्नपङ्के धुन्वन् मुहुः प्रोतघने<BR> विषाणे Ku. 7. 49.<BR>—2 Extended lengthwise or perpendicularly (opp. ओत).<BR>—3 Tied, bound, fastened; प्रासप्रोतप्रवोरोल्बणरुधिरपरा … … Mv. 6. 33.<BR>—4 Pierced, transfixed; शूले प्रोतः पुराणर्षिरचौरश्चौरशङ्कया Mb. 1. 63. 92;<BR> शल्यप्रोतं प्रेक्ष्य सकुम्भं मुनिपुत्रं तापादन्तःशल्य<BR> इवासीत् क्षितिपोऽपि ॥ R. 9. 75.<BR>—5 Passed or come through; तरुच्छिद्रप्रोतान् <i>i. e.</i> (चन्द्रकिरणान्)<BR> बिसमिति करी संकलयति K. P. 19.<BR>—6 Set, inlaid; Mv. 1. 35.<BR>—7 Joined, connected; मयि सर्वमिदं प्रोतं सूत्रे मणिगणा इव Bg. 7. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोतम्
प्रोत + .{@-तम्@} A garment, woven cloth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रोतोत्सादनम्, प्रोतघन, प्रोतशूल<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोतोत्सादनम्
प्रोत + -उत्सादनम्<BR>—1 an umbrella.<BR>—2 a cloth house, tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोतघन
प्रोत + -घन <i>a.</i> immersed in clouds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोतशूल
प्रोत + -शूल <i>a.</i> put on a spit, impaled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोतयति
प्रोतयति Den. P. To insert, infix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्कट
प्रोत्कट <i>a.</i> Very great.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्रोत्कटभृत्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्कटभृत्यः|प्रोत्कटभृत्य
प्रोत्कट + -भृत्यः A favourite servant; a high official.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्कण्ठ|प्रोत्कंठ
प्रोत्कण्ठ <i>a.</i> Lifting up or stretching out the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्कर्षः|प्रोत्कर्ष
प्रोत्कर्षः Pre-eminence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्क्रुष्टम्
प्रोत्क्रुष्टम् A loud noise or uproar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्क्षिप्त
प्रोत्क्षिप्त <i>p. p.</i> Winnowed, threshed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्तान
प्रोत्तान <i>a.</i> Stretched out widely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्ताल
प्रोत्ताल <i>a.</i> Very loud; P. R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्तुङ्ग|प्रोत्तुंग
प्रोत्तुङ्ग <i>a.</i> Very high or lofty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्थित
प्रोत्थित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Come forth, sprouted.<BR>—2 Sprung from, issued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्फलः|प्रोत्फल
प्रोत्फलः A species of tree resembling the fan-palm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्फुल्ल|प्रोत्फुल्लं
प्रोत्फुल्ल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Full-blown, expanded.<BR>—2 Fully dilated, wide open (eyes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

