प्रोत्सारित
प्रोत्सारित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Removed, got rid of, expelled.<BR>—2 Urged forward, incited.<BR>—3 Relinquished.<BR>—4 Granted, given.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1140-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोत्साहः|प्रोत्साह
