प्रोद्घुष्
प्रोद्घुष् €1 P.<BR>—1 To sound forth.<BR>—2 To fill with sounds or cries. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to resound.<BR>—2 To proclaim loudly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1141-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोद्घुष्ट
प्रोद्घुष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Resounding, resonant.<BR>—2 Making a loud noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1141-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

