प्रोद्वीचि
प्रोद्वीचि <i>a.</i> Waving, fluctuating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1141-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्रोन्नत
प्रोन्नत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Very high or lofty.<BR>—2 Projecting.<BR>—3 Superior to.<BR>—4 Powerful, strong; यो बलात् प्रोन्नतं याति निहन्तुं सबलोऽप्यरिः ।<BR> विमदः स निवर्तेत शीर्णदन्तो गजो यथा ॥ Pt. 1. 238, 340.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1141-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

