प्लक्षराज्
प्लक्षः + -तीर्थम्, -प्रस्रवणम्, -राज् <i>m.</i> the place where the Sarasvatī rises.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लक्षद्वारम्
प्लक्षः + -द्वारम् a back-door, a side-entrance; Matsya P. 264. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लाक्षम्
प्लाक्षम् The fruit of प्लक्ष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लिह्
प्लिह् €1 Ā. (प्लेहते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्ली
प्ली €9 P. (प्लीनाति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लीहन्
