प्लीहन् + -उदरम् enlargement of the spleen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लीहोदरिन्
प्लीहन् + -उदरिन् <i>a.</i> suffering from enlargement of the spleen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लीहा
प्लीहा The spleen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लु
प्लु €1 Ā. (प्लवते, प्लुत)<BR>—1 To float, swim; किं नामैतत् मज्जन्त्यलाबूनि ग्रावाणः प्लवन्त इति<BR> Mv. 1; क्लेशोत्तरं रागवशात् प्लवन्ते R. 16. 60; प्लवन्ते धर्मलघवो<BR> लोकेऽम्भसि यथा प्लवाः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 To cross in a boat.<BR>—3 To swing to and fro, vibrate.<BR>—4 To leap, jump, spring; यथामुखीनः सीतायाः पुप्लुवे बहु लोभयन्<BR> Bk. 5. 48, 14. 13, 15. 46.<BR>—5 To plunge into, bathe.<BR>—6 To fly or haste away.<BR>—7 To blow (as the wind).<BR>—8 To fade away, disappear.<BR>—9 To soar, hover about.<BR>—10 To skip.<BR>—11 To be prolated or lengthened (as a vowel). ━<i>Caus.</i> (प्लावयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to swim or float.<BR>—2 To remove, wash away.<BR>—3 To bathe.<BR>—4 To inundate, deluge, flood, submerge; यैः प्लावयिष्यन्ति समन्ततोऽमी<BR> Śi. 3. 74, 7. 74.<BR>—5 To cause to reel or fluctuate.<BR>—6 To lengthen, prolate (a vowel). ━<i>With</i> {@अभि@}<BR>—1 to over-flow.<BR>—2 to overwhelm, overcome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लव|प्लवं|प्लवः
प्लव <i>a.</i> [प्लु अच्]<BR>—1 Swimming, floating.<BR>—2 Jumping, leaping. —3 Ved. Superior, excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवः|प्लव|प्लवं
प्लव + .{@-वः@} Swimming, floating.<BR>—2 Flood, swelling of a river.<BR>—3 A jump, leap; going by leaps or jumps; ते रथैर्देवधिष्ण्याभैर्हयैश्च<BR> तरलप्लवैः Bhāg. 10. 82. 7.<BR>—4 A raft, float, canoe, small boat; नावश्चारुरुहुस्त्वन्ये प्लवैस्तेरुस्तथापरे<BR> Rām. 2. 89. 20 (com. प्लवा वेणुतृणादिनिर्मिताः); नाशयेच्च शनैः<BR> पश्चात् प्लवं सलिलपूरवत् Pt. 2. 42; सर्वं ज्ञानप्लवेनैव वृजिनं<BR> संतरिष्यसि Bg. 4. 36; Ms. 4. 194, 11. 19; Ve. 3. 25.<BR>—5 A frog; हंसक्रौञ्चप्लवाकीर्णं सारसैः संप्रसादितम् Rām. 3. 35. 18.<BR>—6 A monkey; दधि हृत्वा बकश्चापि प्लवो मत्स्यानसंस्कृतान् Mb. 13. 111. 99.<BR>—7 A declivity, slope.<BR>—8 An enemy.<BR>—9 A sheep.<BR>—10 A man of a low tribe, a Cāṇḍāla.<BR>—11 A net or snare for catching fish.<BR>—12 The fig-tree.<BR>—13 The Kāraṇḍava bird, a kind of duck.<BR>—14 Five or more stanzas syntactically connected (= कुलक q. v.).<BR>—15 The prolated utterance of a vowel.<BR>—16 Returning, return.<BR>—17 Urging on, inciting.<BR>—18 Sound; L. D. B.<BR>—19 A kind of aquatic bird; Ms. 5. 12.<BR>—20 N. of a संवत्सर.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्लवकुम्भः, प्लवगः, प्लवगतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवकुम्भः
प्लव + -कुम्भः a pitcher used as a support in swimming; स्मरयौवनयोः खलु<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">Page1143-1</a>]<BR> द्वयोः प्लवकुम्भौ भवतः कुचावुभौ N. 2. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1142-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवगः|प्लवग
प्लव + -गः<BR>—1 a monkey; स सेतुं बन्धयामास प्लवगैर्लवणाम्भसि R. 12. 70.<BR>—2 a frog.<BR>—3 an aquatic bird, the diver.<BR>—4 the शिरीष tree.<BR>—5 N. of the sunʼs charioteer. ˚इन्द्रः Hanumat; Bhāg. ˚राजः<BR> The monkey chief Sugrīva; राघवप्लवगराजयोरिव प्रेम युक्तमितरेतराश्रयम् Ki. 13. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवगा
प्लव + -गः + .({@-गा@}) the sign of the zodiac called <i>Virgo</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवगतिः|प्लवगति
प्लव + -गतिः a frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवकः|प्लवक
प्लवकः [प्लु बाहु˚ अक]<BR>—1 A frog.<BR>—2 A jumper, tumbler, rope-dancer.<BR>—3 The holy fig-tree.<BR>—4 A Cāṇḍāla, an outcast.<BR>—5 A monkey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवङ्गः|प्लवङ्ग|प्लवंग|प्लवंगः
प्लवङ्गः<BR>—1 An ape, a monkey.<BR>—2 A deer.<BR>—3 The fig-tree.<BR>—4 N. of a संवत्सर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवत्वम्
प्लवत्वम् (In astrol.) The position of a constellation in the quarter<BR> ruled by its planetary regent; Bṛ. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवङ्गमः|प्लवङ्गम|प्लवंगम|प्लवंगमः
प्लवङ्गमः<BR>—1 A monkey; एवमुक्तस्तु भीमेन स्मितं कृत्वा प्लवङ्गमः Mb. 3. 150. 2;<BR> संचेरुरात्मान इवापरं क्षणात् क्षमारुहं देहमिव प्लवङ्गमाः Śi. 12. 55.<BR>—2 A frog.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्लवङ्गमेन्दुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवङ्गमेन्दुः|प्लवङ्गमेन्दु
प्लवङ्गमः + -इन्दुः an epithet of Hanumat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवन|प्लवनः
प्लवन [प्लु-ल्युट्] <i>a.</i> Inclined, stooping down; प्रागुदक्प्लवनां<BR> भूमिं कारयेत् यत्नतो नरः Matsya P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवनम्
प्लवन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Swimming.<BR>—2 Bathing, plunging into; आनन्दमन्दममृतप्लवनादिवाभूत् Māl. 1. 19.<BR>—3 Flying.<BR>—4 Jumping, leaping.<BR>—5 A great flood, deluge.<BR>—6 A declivity.<BR>—7 One of a horseʼs paces (capering).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लवाका
प्लवाका A float, raft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लविक
प्लविक <i>a.</i> [प्लवेन तरति ठन्] Taking over in a boat, a ferry-man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लावः|प्लाव
प्लावः [प्लु-घञ्]<BR>—1 Flowing over.<BR>—2 Jumping, leaping, क्वचिच्च दर्दुरप्लावैर्विविधैरुपहासकैः Bhāg. 10. 18. 15.<BR>—3 Filling to, overflowing.<BR>—4 Straining a liquid (to remove impurities &c.); भस्माद्भिः कांस्यलोहानां<BR> शुद्धिः प्लावो द्रवस्य तु Y. 1. 190 (see Mit. thereon).<BR>—5 Submersion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लावनम्
प्लावनम् [प्लु णिच् ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Bathing, ablution.<BR>—2 Overflowing, flooding, inundating.<BR>—3 A flood, deluge.<BR>—4 Prolation (of a vowel).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लावयितृ
प्लावयितृ <i>a.</i> One who causes to swim or cross (a boatsman); गुरुः<BR> प्लावयिता तस्य ज्ञानं प्लव इहोच्यते Mb. 12. 326. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लावित|प्लावितं
प्लावित <i>p. p.</i> [प्लु णिच् क्त]<BR>—1 Made to swim, float, or overflow.<BR>—2 Deluged, inundated, overflowed.<BR>—3 Moistened, wetted, sprinkled; गलन्मधुप्लावितदूरवर्त्मनि Śi. 12. 26;<BR> विविक्तेऽस्मिन्नगे भूयः प्लाविते जह्नुकन्यया Ki. 11. 36.<BR>—4 Covered with, smeared.<BR>—5 Lengthened, prolated (as a vowel); प्लावितेन स्वरेणोच्चैराजुहावाकुलेन्द्रियः<BR> Bhāg. 6. 1. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लावितम्
प्लावित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Inundation, flood.<BR>—2 A song in which the vowels are prolated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लाविन्
प्लाविन् <i>a.</i> [प्लु-णिनि]<BR>—1 Spreading over, deluging, overflowing.<BR>—2 Promulgating. ━<i>m.</i> A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुत|प्लुतं|प्लुतः
प्लुत <i>p. p.</i> [प्लु-क्त]<BR>—1 Swimming, floating.<BR>—2 Inundated, submerged, overflowed.<BR>—3 Leaped, jumped.<BR>—4 Lengthened, protracted or prolated (as a vowel); अशूद्रविषये प्रत्यभिवादे<BR> यद्वाक्यं तस्य टेः प्लुतः स्यात् Sk.; यान्तोऽन्यतः प्लुतकृतस्वरमाशु<BR> दूरादुद्वाहुना जुहुविरे मुहुरात्मवर्ग्याः Śi. 5. 15.<BR>—5 Covered with, filled with; मन्थायस्तार्णवाम्भःप्लुतकुहर … Ve. 1. 22.<BR>—6 Bathed in; (see प्लु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुतम्
प्लुत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 A jump, leap, spring; पश्योदग्रप्लुतत्वाद्वियति बहुतरं स्तोकमुर्व्यां<BR> प्रयाति Ś. 1. 7.<BR>—2 Capering, one of the paces of a horse.<BR>—3 Bounding, vaulting.<BR>—4 A flood, deluge.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: प्लुतगतिः, प्लुतमेरुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुतगतिः|प्लुतगति
प्लुत + -गतिः a hare. ━(<i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 going by leaps.<BR>—2 a gallop, bounding motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुतमेरुः|प्लुतमेरु
प्लुत + -मेरुः (in music) a kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुतिः|प्लुति
प्लुतिः <i>f.</i> [प्लु-भावे-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 A flood, overflowing, inundation.<BR>—2 A leap, jump, spring; as in मण्डूकप्लुति.<BR>—3 Capering, one of the paces of a horse.<BR>—4 Prolation or protraction of a vowel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुष्
प्लुष् I. €1. €4. €9 P. (प्लोषति, प्लुष्यति, प्लुष्णाति, प्लुष्ट) To burn,<BR> scorch, singe, sear; Ṛs. 1. 22; रामस्तुष्यतु मे वाऽद्य पापां प्लुष्णातु<BR> वाऽनलः Bk. 20. 34. ━II. €9 P. (प्लुष्णाति)<BR>—1 To sprinkle, wet.<BR>—2 To anoint.<BR>—3 To fill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुक्षिः|प्लुक्षि
प्लुक्षिः<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 The burning of a house.<BR>—3 Oil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुषः|प्लुष
प्लुषः Burning, combustion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुषिः|प्लुषि
प्लुषिः A species of noxious insect; यद्वेव समः प्लुषिणा समो<BR> मशकेन Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुष्ट|प्लुष्टः
प्लुष्ट <i>p. p.</i> Scorched, burnt, singed; पटुतरदवदाहात् प्लुष्ट<BR> सस्यप्ररोहाः Ṛs. 1. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लोषः|प्लोष
प्लोषः Burning, combustion (also प्रोष); स्वपक्षाभ्यां प्लोषादविकलमरक्षत्<BR> करुणया Mv. 5. 5; Viṣṇupāda. S. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लोषण
प्लोषण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [प्लुष्-ल्यु] Burning, scorching, reducing to ashes;<BR> तार्तीयीकं पुरारेस्तदवतु मदनप्लोषणं लोचनं वः Māl. 1 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लोषणम्
प्लोषण + .{@-णम्@} Burning, scorching (प्रोषणम् also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लुस्
प्लुस् €4 P. (प्लुस्यति)<BR>—1 To burn.<BR>—2 To share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लेव्
प्लेव् €1 Ā. (प्लेवते) To serve, attend or wait upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लोतः|प्लोत
प्लोतः<BR>—1 A bandage.<BR>—2 Cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्लोतिः|प्लोति
प्लोतिः Thread, connection; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्सा
प्सा €2 P. (प्साति, प्सात) To eat, devour; बह्विव पापं कुरुते<BR> सर्वमेव तत्संप्साय शुद्धः पूतोऽजरोऽमृतः संभवति Bṛ. Up. 5. 14. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्सा
प्सा<BR>—1 Food.<BR>—2 Hunger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्सात|प्सातं
प्सात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Eaten.<BR>—2 Hungry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्सानम्
प्सानम्<BR>—1 Eating.<BR>—2 Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्सुर
प्सुर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Lovely, beautiful.<BR>—2 Having a shape or form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1143-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फ|फं|फः
फ <i>a.</i> Obvious, evident.<BR> {@फः@}<BR>—1 A high wind, stormy gale.<BR>—2 Yawning with the mouth wide open.<BR>—3 Fruitfulness.<BR>—4 An increaser.<BR>—5 The performance of a mystical rite (to propitiate Kuberaʼs attendants).<BR>—6 Increasing, expanding.<BR>—7 Swelling.<BR>—8 Gain. {@फा@}<BR>—1 Useless or idle speech (<i>n.</i> also).<BR>—2 Heat.<BR>—3 Increase.<BR>—4 An increaser. {@फम्@}<BR>—1 An angry speech.<BR>—2 Blowing into, puffing up.<BR>—3 Bubbling, boiling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फक्क्
फक्क् €1 P. (फक्कति, फक्कित)<BR>—1 To move slowly, go softly, glide, creep.<BR>—2 To act wrongly, behave ill.<BR>—3 To swell.<BR>—4 To have a preconceived opinion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फक्कः|फक्क
फक्कः A cripple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फक्किका
फक्किका<BR>—1 A position, an argument to be proved, a thesis or assertion to be maintained;<BR> a grammatical proposition; फणिभाषितभाष्यफक्किका विषमा कुण्डलनामवापिता N. 2. 95.<BR>—2 A preiudice, preconceived opinion.<BR>—3 A sophistical argument, sophism.<BR>—7 A trick, fraud.<BR>—5 Logical exposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फञ्जिका
फञ्जिका Alhagi Maurorum (Mar. धमासा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फञ्जी
फञ्जी Clerodendrum Siphonantus (Mar. भारंग, धमासा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फट्
फट् <i>ind.</i> An onomatopoetic word used mystically in uttering spells<BR> or incantations; अस्त्राय फट्; सविसर्गं फडन्तं तत्सर्वदिक्षु विनिर्दिशेत्<BR> Bhāg. 6. 8. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फटः|फट
फटः<BR>—1 The expanded hood of a snake (फटा also in this sense); निविंषेणापि<BR> सर्पेण कर्तव्या महती फटा (फणा v. l.); विषं भवतु मा भूद्<BR> वा फटाटोपो भयंकरः Pt. 1. 204.<BR>—2 A tooth.<BR>—3 A rogue, cheat (कितव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फडिङ्गा|फडिंगा
फडिङ्गा A cricket, locust or grasshopper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फण्
फण् €1 P. (फणति, फणित)<BR>—1 To move, move about; रुरुजुर्भेजिरे फेणुर्बहुधा हरिराक्षसाः Bk. 14. 78.<BR>—2 To produce easily or without exertion; (this sense according to some<BR> belongs to the Caus. of फण्). ━<i>Caus.</i> (फाणयति) To skim,<BR> take off (the surface of a fluid.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणः|फण
फणः, -णा<BR> [फण्-अच्]<BR>—1 The expanded hood of a cobra or any serpent; विप्रकृतः पन्नगः<BR> फणं (फणां) कुरुते Ś. 6. 31; मणिभिः फणस्थैः R. 13. 12;<BR> Ku. 6. 68; वहति भुवनश्रेणिं शेषः फणाफलकस्थिताम् Bh. 2. 35.<BR>—2 The expanded side of the nostril, (also फणम् in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणा
फणः, -णा<BR> [फण्-अच्]<BR>—1 The expanded hood of a cobra or any serpent; विप्रकृतः पन्नगः<BR> फणं (फणां) कुरुते Ś. 6. 31; मणिभिः फणस्थैः R. 13. 12;<BR> Ku. 6. 68; वहति भुवनश्रेणिं शेषः फणाफलकस्थिताम् Bh. 2. 35.<BR>—2 The expanded side of the nostril, (also फणम् in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणः|फण
फणः, -णा + .{@-णः@} Ved. Scum.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: फणाटोपः, फणकरः, फणधरः, फणभरः, फणभृत्, फणमणिः, फणमण्डलम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणाटोपः|फणाटोप
फणः + -आटोपः the expanded hood (v. l. for फटाटोप); Pt. 1. 204.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणकरः|फणकर
फणः + -करः a serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणधरः|फणधर
फणः + -धरः<BR>—1 a serpent.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणभरः
फणः + -भरः A serpent; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणभृत्
फणः + -भृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a serpent.<BR>—2 the number ‘nine’ (there being nine chief Nāgas); also eight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणमणिः|फणमणि
फणः + -मणिः a jewel said to be found in the hood of a serpent; वसुधान्तनिःसृतमिवाहिपतेः<BR> पटलं फणामणिसहस्ररुचाम् Śi. 9. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणमण्डलम्
फणः + -मण्डलम् the rounded body of a serpent; करालफणमण्डलम्<BR> R. 12. 98; तत्फणामण्डलोदर्चिर्मणिद्योतितविग्रहम् 10. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणवत्|फणवन्त्
फण(णा)वत् <i>m.</i> A snake in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणावत्|फणावन्त्
फण(णा)वत् <i>m.</i> A snake in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिन्
फणिन् <i>m.</i> [फणा अस्त्यस्य इनि]<BR>—1 A hooded serpent, serpent or snake in general; उद्गिरतो यद्गरलं<BR> फणिनः पुष्णासि परिमलोद्रारैः Bv. 1. 12, 58; फणी मयूरस्य तले<BR> निषीदति Ṛs. 1. 13; R. 16. 17; Ku. 2. 21.<BR>—2 An epithet of Rāhu.<BR>—3 An epithet of Patañjali, the author of the Mahābhāṣya on Pāṇiniʼs<BR> Sūtras; फणिभाषितभाष्यफक्किका N. 2. 95.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: फणीन्द्रः, फणीश्वरः, फणिकेशरः, फणिकेसरः, फणिखेलः, फणितल्पगः, फणिपतिः, फणिप्रियः, फणिफेनः, फणिभाष्यम्, फणिभुज्, फणिमुखम्, फणिलता, फणिवल्ली<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणीन्द्रः|फणीन्द्र|फणींद्र
फणिन् + -इन्द्रः, -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 an epithet of the serpent-demon Śeṣa.<BR>—2 of Ananta, the lord of serpents.<BR>—3 of Patañjali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणीश्वरः|फणीश्वर
फणिन् + -इन्द्रः, -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 an epithet of the serpent-demon Śeṣa.<BR>—2 of Ananta, the lord of serpents.<BR>—3 of Patañjali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिकेशरः|फणिकेशर
फणिन् + -केशरः, -केसरः = नागकेशर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिकेसरः|फणिकेसर|फणिकेसरं
फणिन् + -केशरः, -केसरः = नागकेशर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिखेलः|फणिखेल
फणिन् + -खेलः a quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणितल्पगः|फणितल्पग
फणिन् + -तल्पगः an epithet of Viṣṇu (who uses Śeṣa as his couch).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिपतिः|फणिपति
फणिन् + -पतिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śeṣa or of Vāsuki.<BR>—2 of Patañjali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिप्रियः|फणिप्रिय
फणिन् + -प्रियः wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिफेनः|फणिफेन
फणिन् + -फेनः opium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिभाष्यम्
फणिन् + -भाष्यम् Mahābhāṣya (the commentary of Patañjali on Pāṇiniʼs Sūtras).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिभुज्
फणिन् + -भुज् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a peacock.<BR>—2 an epithet of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिमुखम्
फणिन् + -मुखम् a kind of spade used by house-breakers; Dk. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिलता
फणिन् + -लता, -वल्ली betel-pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिवल्ली
फणिन् + -लता, -वल्ली betel-pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिका
फणिका Ficus Oppositifolia (Mar. काळा उंबर, बोखाडा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिकाराः
फणिकाराः N. of a people; cf. कर्णिकाराः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिज्झकः|फणिज्झक
फणिज्झकः Marjoram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फणिर्जकः
फणिर्जकः A kind of aromatic herb; Mātaṅga L. 8. 8 (according<BR> to the commentator it is तुलसी-भेद, prob. Mar. श्वेतमरवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फण्डः|फण्ड|फंडः
फण्डः The belly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फत्कारिन्
फत्कारिन् <i>m.</i> A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फरम्
फरम् A shield; cf. फलक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फरुण्डः|फरुण्ड
फरुण्डः Green onion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फरुबकम्
फरुबकम्<BR>—1 A betel-box.<BR>—2 Spittoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फर्फरायते
फर्फरायते Den. Ā. To glance about, dart to and fro, sparkle; गण्डूषजलमात्रेण<BR> शफरी फर्फरायते Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फर्फरीकः|फर्फरीक
फर्फरीकः The palm of the hand with the fingers extended; Uṇ. 4. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फर्फरीकम्
फर्फरीकः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A young shoot or branch.<BR>—2 Softness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फर्फरीका
फर्फरीकः + .{@-का@} A shoe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्
फल् I. €1 P. (फलति, पफाल, अफालीत्, फलिष्यति, फलित)<BR>—1 To bear fruit, yield or produce fruit; नानाफलैः फलति कल्पलतेव<BR> भूमिः Bh. 2. 46; परोपकाराय द्रुमाः फलन्तिः Subhāṣ; विधातुर्व्यापारः<BR> फलतु च मनोज्ञश्च भवतु Māl. 1. 16; often used transitively in<BR> this sense; मौर्यस्यैव फलन्ति पश्य विविधश्रेयांसि मन्नीतयः Mu. 2. 16<BR> ‘accomplish or bring about’; Śi. 2. 89.<BR>—2 To be fruitful, to be successful, to be fulfilled or accomplished,<BR> to succeed; कैकेयि कामाः फलितास्तवेति R. 13. 59, 15. 78; यदा न<BR> फेलुः क्षणदाचराणाम् (मनोरथाः) Bk. 14. 113, 12. 66; नैवाकृतिः फलति<BR> नैव कुलं न शीलम् Bh. 2. 96, 116.<BR>—3 To result, produce results or consequences; फलितमस्माकं कपटप्रबन्धेन<BR> H. 1; फलितं नस्तर्हि<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-1" target="_blank">Page1145-1</a>]<BR> भगवतीपादप्रसादेन Māl. 6; Ki. 18, 25; खलः करोति दुर्वृत्तं<BR> नूनं फलति साधुषु H. 3. 21 ‘wicked men commit bad acts, and good men suffer their consequences’<BR>.<BR>—4 To become ripe, ripen.<BR>—5 To fall to the lot of, befall.<BR>—6 To be useful. ━II. €1 P. (फलति, फुल्ल or फुल्त in the first<BR> sense, and फलित in other senses)<BR>—1 To burst open, split or cleave asunder, burst, cleave; तस्य मूर्धानमासाद्य<BR> पफालासिवरो हि सः Mb.<BR>—2 To shine back, be reflected; इह नवशुककोमला मणीनां रविकरसंवलिताः फलन्ति भासः Ki. 5. 38.<BR>—3 To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1144-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलम्
फलम् [फल्-अच्]<BR>—1 Fruit (fig. also) as of a tree; उदेति पूर्वं कुसुमं ततः फलम्<BR> Ś. 7. 30; R. 4. 43, 1. 49.<BR>—2 Crop, produce; कृषिफलम् Me. 16.<BR>—3 A result, fruit, consequence, effect; अत्युत्कटैः पापपुण्यैरिहैव<BR> फलमश्रुते H. 1. 80; फलेन ज्ञास्यसि Pt. 1; न नवः प्रभुराफलोदयात्<BR> स्थिरकर्मा विरराम कर्मणः R. 8. 22, 1. 33; अनिष्टमिष्टं मिश्रं<BR> च त्रिविधं कर्मणः फलम् Bg. 18. 12.<BR>—4 (Hence) Reward, recompense, meed, retribution (good or bad); फलमस्योपहासस्य<BR> सद्यः प्राप्स्यसि पश्य माम् R. 12. 37.<BR>—5 A deed, act (opp. words); ब्रुवते हि फलेन साधवो न तु कण्ठेन<BR> निजोपयोगिताम् N. 2. 48 ‘good men prove their usefulness by deeds, not by words’.<BR>—6 Aim, object, purpose; परेङ्गितज्ञानफला हि बुद्धयः Pt. 1. 43;<BR> किमपेक्ष्य फलम् Ki. 2. 21, ‘with what object in view’; Me. 56.<BR>—7 Use, good, profit, advantage; जगता वा विफलेन किं फलम् Bv. 2. 61.<BR>—8 Profit or interest on capital.<BR>—9 Progeny, offspring; तस्यापनोदाय फलप्रवृत्तावुपस्थितायामपि निर्व्यपेक्षः<BR> (त्यक्षामि) R. 14. 39.<BR>—10 A kernel (of a fruit).<BR>—11 A tablet or board (शारिफल).<BR>—12 A blade (of a sword).<BR>—13 The point or head of an arrow, dart &c.; barb; आरामुखं क्षुरप्रं<BR> च गोपुच्छं चार्धचन्द्रकम् । सूचीमुखं च भल्लं च वत्सदन्तं द्विभल्लकम्<BR> ॥ कर्णिकं काकतुण्डं च तथान्यान्यप्यनेकशः । फलानि देशभेदेन भवन्ति<BR> बहुरूपतः ॥ Dhanur. 64-5; फलयोगमवाप्य सायकानाम् Mu. 7. 10; Ki. 14. 52.<BR>—14 A shield.<BR>—15 A testicle; अकर्तव्यमिदं यस्माद् विफलस्त्वं भविष्यसि Rām. 1. 48. 27.<BR>—16 A gift.<BR>—17 The result of a calculation (in Math.)<BR>—18 Product or quotient.<BR>—19 Menstrual discharge.<BR>—20 Nutmeg.<BR>—21 A ploughshare.<BR>—22 Loss, disadvantage.<BR>—23 The second (or third) term in a rule-of-three sum.<BR>—24 Correlative equation.<BR>—25 The area of a figure.<BR>—26 The three myrobalans (त्रिफला).<BR>—27 A point on a die.<BR>—28 Benefit, enjoyment; ईश्वरा भूरिदानेन यल्लभन्ते फलं किल Pt. 2. 72.<BR>—29 Compensation; यावत् सस्यं विनश्येत् तु तावत् स्यात् क्षेत्रिणः फलम् Y. 2. 161.<BR>—30 A counterpart (प्रतिबिम्ब); तन्मायाफलरूपेण केवलं निर्विकल्पितम्<BR> Bhāg. 11. 24. 3.<BR>—31 Shoulder-blade; तस्यां स फलके खड्गं निजघान ततोऽङ्गदः Rām. 6. 76. 10.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: फलादनः, फलाधिकारः, फलाध्यक्षः, फलानुबन्धः, फलानुमेय, फलानुसरणम्, फलान्तः, फलान्वेषिन्, फलापूर्वम्, फलापेक्षा, फलापेत, फलाम्लः, फलाशनः, फलास्थि, फलाकाङ्क्षा, फलागमः, फलाढ्य, फलारामः, फलासक्त, फलासवः, फलाहारः, फलेन्द्रः, फलोच्चयः, फलोत्तमा, फलोत्पत्तिः, फलोत्प्रेक्षा, फलोदयः, फलोद्गमः, फलोद्देशः, फलोन्मुख, फलोपगम, फलोपजीविन्, फलोपभोगः, फलोपेत, फलकाम, फलकामना, फलकालः, फलकेसरः, फलकोशः, फलकोषः, फलकोशकः, फलखण्डनम्, फलखेला, फलग्रन्थः, फलग्रहः, फलग्रहि, फलग्राहिन्, फलग्रहिष्णु, फलचोरकः, फलच्छदनम्, फलतन्त्र, फलत्रयम्, फलत्रिकम्, फलद, फलदातृ, फलप्रद, फलधर्मन्, फलनिर्वृत्ति, फलनिवृत्तिः, फलनिष्पत्तिः, फलपरिणतिः, फलपाकः, फलपाकान्ता, फलपाकावसाना, फलपातनम्, फलपादपः, फलपूरः, फलपूरकः, फलप्रजननम्, फलप्रदानम्, फलप्राप्तिः, फलप्रिया, फलप्रेप्सु, फलबन्धिन्, फलभागः, फलभागिन्, फलभाज्, फलभावना, फलभुज्, फलभूमन्, फलभूयस्त्वम्, फलभूमिः, फलभृत्, फलभोगः, फलमत्स्या, फलमुख्या, फलमूलम्, फलयोगः, फलराजन्, फलराशिः, फलवन्ध्यः, फलवर्णिका, फलवर्तिः, फलवर्तुलम्, फलवल्ली, फलविक्रयिन्, फलवृक्षः, फलवृक्षकः, फलशाड्वः, फलशालिन्, फलशैशिरः, फलश्रेष्ठः, फलसंस्थ, फलसंपद्, फलसाधनम्, फलसिद्धिः, फलस्थानम्, फलस्थापनम्, फलस्नेहः, फलहारी, फलहानिः, फलहीन, फलहेतु<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलादनः|फलादन
फलम् + -अदनः = फलाशनः q. v.; a parrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलाधिकारः|फलाधिकार
फलम् + -अधिकारः a claim for wages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलाध्यक्षः|फलाध्यक्ष|फलाध्यक्षं
फलम् + -अध्यक्षः Mimusops Kauki (Mar. खिरणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलानुबन्धः|फलानुबन्ध|फलानुबंध
फलम् + -अनुबन्धः succession or sequence of fruits or results.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलानुमेय
फलम् + -अनुमेय <i>a.</i> to be inferred from the results or consequences;<BR> फलानुमेयाः प्रारम्भाः संस्काराः प्राक्तना इव R. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलानुसरणम्
फलम् + -अनुसरणम्<BR>—1 rate of profits.<BR>—2 following or reaping consequences.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलान्तः|फलान्त
फलम् + -अन्तः a bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलान्वेषिन्
फलम् + -अन्वेषिन् <i>a.</i> seeking for reward or recompense<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">Page1145-2</a>]<BR> (of actions).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलापूर्वम्
फलम् + -अपूर्वम् The mystic power which produces the consequences of a<BR> sacrificial act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलापेक्षा
फलम् + -अपेक्षा expectation of the fruits or consequences (of acts), regard to results.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलापेत
फलम् + -अपेत <i>a.</i> useless, unfertile, unproductive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलाम्लः|फलाम्ल|फलाम्लं
फलम् + -अम्लः a kind of sorrel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलाम्लम्
फलम् + -अम्लः + .({@-म्लम्@}) tamarind. ˚पञ्चकम् the five sour fruits; bergumot<BR> (जम्बीर), orange (नारिङ्ग), sorrel (आम्लवेतस), tamarind<BR> (चिञ्चा) and a citron (मातुलुङ्ग, Mar. महाळुंग).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलाशनः|फलाशन
फलम् + -अशनः a parrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलास्थि
फलम् + -अस्थि <i>n.</i> a cocoa-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलाकाङ्क्षा|फलाकांक्षा
फलम् + -आकाङ्क्षा expectation of (good) results; see फलापेक्षा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलागमः|फलागम
फलम् + -आगमः<BR>—1 production of fruits, load of fruits; भवन्ति नम्रास्तरवः फलागमैः Ś. 5. 12.<BR>—2 the fruit season, autumn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलाढ्य
फलम् + -आढ्य <i>a.</i> full of or abounding in fruits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलाढ्या
फलम् + -आढ्य + .({@-ढ्या@}) a kind of plantain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलारामः|फलाराम
फलम् + -आरामः a fruit-garden, orchard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलासक्त
फलम् + -आसक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fond of fuits.<BR>—2 attached to fruits, fond of getting fruit (of actions done).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलासवः|फलासव
फलम् + -आसवः a decoction of fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलाहारः|फलाहार
फलम् + -आहारः feeding or living on fruits, fruit-meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलेन्द्रः|फलेन्द्र
फलम् + -इन्द्रः a species of Jambū (Rājajambū).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोच्चयः|फलोच्चय
फलम् + -उच्चयः a collection of fruits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोत्तमा
फलम् + -उत्तमा<BR>—1 a kind of grapes (having no stones).<BR>—2 = त्रिफला.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोत्पत्तिः|फलोत्पत्ति
फलम् + -उत्पत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 production of fruit.<BR>—2 profit, gain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोत्पत्तिः|फलोत्पत्ति
फलम् + -उत्पत्तिः + .({@-त्तिः@}) the mango tree (sometimes written फलोत्पति in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोत्प्रेक्षा
फलम् + -उत्प्रेक्षा a kind of comparison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोदयः|फलोदय
फलम् + -उदयः<BR>—1 appearance of fruit, production of results or consequences, attainment<BR> of success or desired object; आफलोदयकर्मणाम् R. 1. 5, 8. 22.<BR>—2 profit, gain.<BR>—3 retribution, punishment.<BR>—4 happiness, joy.<BR>—5 heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोद्गमः|फलोद्गम
फलम् + -उद्गमः appearance of fruits; भवन्ति नम्रास्तरवः फलोद्गमैः<BR> Ś. 5. 12 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोद्देशः|फलोद्देश
फलम् + -उद्देशः regard to results; see फलापेक्षा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोन्मुख
फलम् + -उन्मुख <i>a.</i> about to give fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोपगम
फलम् + -उपगम <i>a.</i> bearing fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोपजीविन्
फलम् + -उपजीविन् <i>a.</i> living by cultivating or selling fruits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलोपभोगः|फलोपभोग
