फलकालः|फलकाल
फलम् + -कालः fruit-season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलकेसरः|फलकेसर
फलम् + -केसरः the cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

