फलकोशकः|फलकोशक
फलम् + -कोशः, -कोषः, -कोशकः the scrotum (covering of the testicles).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

