फलतन्त्र
फलम् + -तन्त्र <i>a.</i> aiming only at oneʼs advantage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलत्रयम्
