फलम् + -मुख्या a species of plant (अजमोदा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलमूलम्
फलम् + -मूलम् fruits and roots; फलमूलाशिनौ दान्तौ Rāmarakṣā 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलयोगः|फलयोग
फलम् + -योगः<BR>—1 the attainment of fruit or the desired object; Mu. 7. 10.<BR>—2 wages, remuneration.<BR>—3 a stage in the performance of a drama; सावस्था फलयोगः स्यात् यः<BR> समग्रफलागमः S. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलराजन्
फलम् + -राजन् <i>m.</i> a water-melon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलराशिः|फलराशि
फलम् + -राशिः <i>m.</i> the 3rd term in the rule of three.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलवन्ध्यः|फलवन्ध्य
फलम् + -वन्ध्यः a tree barren of fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलवर्णिका
फलम् + -वर्णिका jelly (?); Gaṇeśa P. 2. 149.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलवर्तिः|फलवर्ति
फलम् + -वर्तिः <i>f.</i> a coarse wick of cloth besmeared with some laxative<BR> and inserted into the anus for discharging the bowels, suppository.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलवर्तुलम्
फलम् + -वर्तुलम् a water-melon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलवल्ली
फलम् + -वल्ली a series of quotients.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलविक्रयिन्
फलम् + -विक्रयिन् <i>a.</i> A fruit-seller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलवृक्षः|फलवृक्ष
फलम् + -वृक्षः a fruittree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलवृक्षकः|फलवृक्षक
फलम् + -वृक्षकः the bread-fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलशाड्वः
फलम् + -शाड्वः the pomegranate tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलशालिन्
फलम् + -शालिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 bearing fruit, fruitful.<BR>—2 sharing in the consequences.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलशैशिरः|फलशैशिर
फलम् + -शैशिरः the Badara tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलश्रेष्ठः|फलश्रेष्ठ
फलम् + -श्रेष्ठः the mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलसंस्थ
फलम् + -संस्थ <i>a.</i> bearing fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलसंपद्|फलसम्पद्
फलम् + -संपद् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 abundance of fruit.<BR>—2 success.<BR>—3 prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलसाधनम्
फलम् + -साधनम् a means of effecting any desired object, realization of an object<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलसिद्धिः|फलसिद्धि
फलम् + -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 reaping fruit, attainment or realization of the desired object.<BR>—2 a prosperous result.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलस्थानम्
फलम् + -स्थानम् the stage in which results are enjoyed; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलस्थापनम्
फलम् + -स्थापनम् the sacrament called सीमन्तोन्नयन; फलस्थापनात्<BR> मातापितृजं पाप्मानमपोहति Hārīta.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">Page1146-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलस्नेहः|फलस्नेह
फलम् + -स्नेहः a walnut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलहारी
फलम् + -हारी an epithet of Kālī or Durgā<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलहानिः|फलहानि
फलम् + -हानिः loss of profit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलहीन
फलम् + -हीन <i>a.</i> yielding no fruit or profit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलहेतु
फलम् + -हेतु <i>a.</i> acting with a view to results.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलकम्
फलकम्<BR>—1 A board, plank, slab, tablet; कालः काल्या भुवनफलके क्रीडति प्राणिशारैः<BR> Bh. 3. 39; द्यूत˚, चित्र˚ &c.<BR>—2 Any flat surface; चुम्ब्यमानकपोलफलकाम् K. 218; धृतमुग्धगण्डफलकैर्विबभुः<BR> Śi. 9. 47, 37; cf. तट.<BR>—3 A shield; Rām. 1.<BR>—4 A slab, tablet, leaf or page for writing upon.<BR>—5 The buttocks, hips.<BR>—6 The palm of the hand.<BR>—7 Fruit, result, consequence.<BR>—8 Profit, gain.<BR>—9 Menstruation.<BR>—10 The head of an arrow.<BR>—11 The pericarp of a lotus.<BR>—12 A broad and flat bone (of the forehead).<BR>—13 A wooden seat; तवार्हते तु फलकं कूर्चं वाऽप्यथवा बृसी Mb. 5. 35. 15.<BR>—14 Bark (as material for clothes).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: फलकपरिधानम्, फलकपुरम्, फलकपाणि, फलकयन्त्रम्, फलकसक्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलकपरिधानम्
फलकम् + -परिधानम् putting on a bark-garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलकपुरम्
फलकम् + -पुरम् N. of a town in the east of India; P. VI. 2. 101; cf. फलपुर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलकपाणि|फलकपाणिः
फलकम् + -पाणि <i>a.</i> armed with a shield (as a warrior).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलकयन्त्रम्
फलकम् + -यन्त्रम् an astronomical instrument invented by Bhāskarācārya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलकसक्थ
फलकम् + -सक्थ <i>a.</i> having a thigh as broad as a board.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलकिन्
फलकिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Boarded.<BR>—2 Armed with a shield. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A wooden bench.<BR>—2 Sandal-wood (<i>n.</i> also).<BR>—3 (also फलिः and फल्लकिन्) A kind of small fish (Mystus Kapirat); L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलतस्
फलतस् <i>ind.</i> As a consequence, consequently, virtually.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलनम्
फलनम् [फल्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Bearing fruit, fructifying.<BR>—2 Producing results or consequences.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलवत्|फलवन्त्
फलवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Fruitful, fruit-bearing; अपुष्पाः फलवन्तो ये ते वनस्पतयः स्मृताः Ms. 1. 47.<BR>—2 Producing or yielding results, successful, profitable.<BR>—3 Containing the result or end of a plot. ━<i>m.</i> A fruit-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलवती
फलवत् + .{@-ती@} The plant called प्रियङ्गु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलसः|फलस
फलसः(शः) The bread-fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलशः|फलश
फलसः(शः) The bread-fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलहकः|फलहक
फलहकः A plank, board.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलही
फलही The cotton tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलायोषित्
फलायोषित् <i>f.</i> A cricket; cf. फडिङ्गा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलिः|फलि
फलिः <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A kind of fish.<BR>—2 A bowl or cup.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलिकः|फलिक
फलिकः A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलित|फलितं|फलितः
फलित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Having borne or reaped fruit, yielding fruit, fruitful.<BR>—2 Fulfilled, accomplished, realized (as a desire).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलितः|फलित|फलितं
फलित + .{@-तः@} A fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलिता
फलित + .{@-ता@} A menstruous woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलितम्
फलित + .{@-तम्@} A sort of perfume (शैलेय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलिन्
फलिन् <i>a.</i> [फल अस्त्यर्थे इनि]<BR>—1 Fruitful, bearing or yielding fruit (fig. also); पुष्पिणः फलिनश्चैव<BR> वृक्षास्तूभयतः स्मृताः Ms. 1. 47; Mk. 4. 10.<BR>—2 Advantageous, profitable. ━<i>m.</i> A tree; यथा प्रसूयमानस्तु फली<BR> दद्यात् फलं बहु Mb. 14. 18. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1146-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलिन|फलिनः
फलिन <i>a.</i> [फल्-इनच्] Fruitful, bearing fruit; ताम्वूलीपटलैः<BR> पिनद्धफलिनव्यानम्रपूगद्रुमाः Māl. 6. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलिनः|फलिन
फलिन + .{@-नः@} The bread-fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलिनी
फलिनी, -फली<BR> The Priyaṅgu creeper; (said by poets to be the ‘wife’ of<BR> the mango tree; cf. मिथुनं परिकल्पितं त्वया सहकारः फलिनी च नन्विमौ R. 8. 61).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फली
फलिनी, -फली<BR> The Priyaṅgu creeper; (said by poets to be the ‘wife’ of<BR> the mango tree; cf. मिथुनं परिकल्पितं त्वया सहकारः फलिनी च नन्विमौ R. 8. 61).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलीकृ
फलीकृ €8 U. To winnow, thresh, separate the grain from the husks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलीकरणम्
फलीकरणम्, -फलीकारः<BR>—1 Winnowing, separating the grain from the husks.<BR>—2 husk, chaff, smallest grain etc; प्रजायामर्थप्रत्ययो धनदमिवाधनः<BR> फलीकरणम् Bhāg. 5. 3. 13; ईश्वरात् क्षीणपुण्येन फलीकारानिवाधनः<BR> Bhāg. 4. 9. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलीकारः|फलीकार
फलीकरणम्, -फलीकारः<BR>—1 Winnowing, separating the grain from the husks.<BR>—2 husk, chaff, smallest grain etc; प्रजायामर्थप्रत्ययो धनदमिवाधनः<BR> फलीकरणम् Bhāg. 5. 3. 13; ईश्वरात् क्षीणपुण्येन फलीकारानिवाधनः<BR> Bhāg. 4. 9. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फलीकृत
फलीकृत <i>p. p.</i> Threshed, winnowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्कः|फल्क
फल्कः A stretched out, expanded body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गु|फल्गुः
फल्गु <i>a.</i> [फल्-उ गुक् च Uṇ. 1. 18]<BR>—1 Pithless, unessential; unsubstantial; सारं ततो ग्राह्यमपास्य फल्गु Pt. 1.<BR>—2 Worthless, useless, unimportant; ‘फल्गु तुच्छमसारं च’ Yādava.;<BR> तरीषु तत्रत्यमफल्गु भाण्डम् Śi. 3. 76.<BR>—3 Small, minute; नामरूपविभेदेन फल्ग्व्या च कलया कृताः Bhāg. 8. 3. 22.<BR>—4 Vain, unmeaning.<BR>—5 Weak, feeble, flimsy; फल्गूनि तत्र महतां जीवो जीवस्य जीवनम्<BR> Bhāg. 1. 13. 47.<BR>—6 Untrue.<BR>—7 Beautiful, lovely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गुः|फल्गु
फल्गु + .{@-ल्गुः@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The spring season.<BR>—2 The opposite-leaved fig-tree (Mar. बोखाडा).<BR>—3 N. of a river at Gayā.<BR>—4 A red powder of wild ginger (Mar. गुलाल) thrown by the Hindus<BR> over one another at the Holi festival.<BR>—5 (du.) (In astrol.) N. of a नक्षत्र.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: फल्गूत्सवः, फल्गुद, फल्गुवाक्, फल्गुवाटिका<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गूत्सवः|फल्गूत्सव
फल्गु + -उत्सवः the vernal festival, commonly called <i>Holi</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गुद
फल्गु + -द <i>a.</i> avaricious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गुवाक्
फल्गु + -वाक् a falsehood, lie.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गुवाटिका
फल्गु + -वाटिका the opposite-leaved fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गुता
फल्गुता, -त्वम्<BR> Worthlessness, vanity, insignificance; न हि गणयति<BR> क्षुद्रो जन्तुः परिग्रहफल्गुताम् Bh. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गुत्वम्
फल्गुता, -त्वम्<BR> Worthlessness, vanity, insignificance; न हि गणयति<BR> क्षुद्रो जन्तुः परिग्रहफल्गुताम् Bh. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गुन|फल्गुनः
फल्गुन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Red.<BR>—2 Born under the constellation फल्गुनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गुनः|फल्गुन
फल्गुन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 The month of Phālguna.<BR>—2 N. of Indra.<BR>—3 Of Arjuna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गुनालः|फल्गुनाल
फल्गुनालः The month of Phālguna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्गुनी
फल्गुनी N. of a constellation (पूर्वा and उत्तरा); मैत्रे<BR> मुहूर्ते शशलाञ्छनेन योगं गतासूत्तरफल्गुनीषु Ku. 7. 6.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: फल्गुनीभवः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

