फाल्गुनिकः|फाल्गुनिक
फाल्गुनिकः The month of Phālguna; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फल्यम्
फल्यम् A flower, bud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फा
फा <i>m.</i> (Nom. फास्)<BR>—1 Heat.<BR>—2 Idle talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

