फालः + -कृष्ट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 tilled.<BR>—2 produced by cultivation; न फालकृष्टमश्रीयात् Ms. 6. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फालकृष्टम्
फालः + -कृष्ट + .({@-ष्टम्@}) a ploughed field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फालगुप्तः|फालगुप्त
फालः + -गुप्तः N. of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फालखेला
फालखेला A quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फालिका
फालिका A slice, piece; मृदुव्यञ्जनमांसफालिकाम् N. 16. 82. ताम्बूल˚<BR> bits of betel; N. 20. 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाल्गुनः|फाल्गुन
फाल्गुनः<BR>—1 N. of a Hindu month (corresponding to February-March).<BR>—2 An epithet of Arjuna; Mb. thus explains the epithet:− उत्तराभ्यां<BR> फल्गुनीभ्यां नक्षत्राभ्यामहं दिवा । जातो हिमवतः पृष्ठे तेन मां फाल्गुनं विदुः ॥<BR>—3 N. of a tree, also called अर्जुन.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: फाल्गुनानुजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाल्गुनानुजः|फाल्गुनानुज
फाल्गुनः + -अनुजः<BR>—1 the month Chaitra.<BR>—2 the vernal season (वसन्तकाल).<BR>—3 an epithet of नकुल and सहदेव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाल्गुनालः|फाल्गुनाल
फाल्गुनालः = फाल्गुन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फाल्गुनी
फाल्गुनी The full-moon day of the month फाल्गुन; ˚भवः an epithet<BR> of the planet Jupiter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फिः|फि
फिः<BR>—1 A wicked man.<BR>—2 Useless or idle talk.<BR>—3 Anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फिट्सूत्रम्
फिट्सूत्रम् N. of a grammatical work by शान्तनवाचार्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फिङ्गकः|फिङ्गक|फिंगकः
फिङ्गकः The fork-tailed shrike; cf. कलिङ्ग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फिरङ्गः|फिरङ्ग|फिरंग|फिरंगः
फिरङ्गः<BR>—1 The country of the Franks (<i>i. e.</i> of Europeans).<BR>—2 A disease of the Franks, syphilis; also फिरङ्गामयः, -व्याधिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1147-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फिरङ्गिन्|फिरंगिन्
फिरङ्गिन् <i>m.</i> A Frank (<i>i. e.</i> a European).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुः|फु
फुः<BR>—1 A magical formula.<BR>—2 An idle talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुकः|फुक
फुकः A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुटः|फुट
फुटः The expanded hood of a snake.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: फुटाटोपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुटाटोपः|फुटाटोप
फुटः + -आटोपः = फटाटोपः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुट्टकम्
फुट्टकम् A kind of cloth; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुट्टिका
फुट्टिका A sort of woven texture; Ks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुडुत्
फुडुत् <i>ind.</i> An interjection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुत्
फु(फू)त् <i>ind.</i> An onomatopoetic word generally used in composition<BR> with कृ, and imitative of the sound made by blowing into liquids &c.;<BR> sometimes it expresses disregard or contempt; फु(फू)त्कृ<BR>—1 To blow into (a liquid); बालः पायसदग्धो दध्यपि फूत्कृत्य भक्षयति H. 4. 103.<BR>—2 To scream aloud, cry, shriek.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: फुत्कारः, फुत्कृतम्, फुत्कृतिः, फुत्कृत, फुत्कृतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फूत्
फु(फू)त् <i>ind.</i> An onomatopoetic word generally used in composition<BR> with कृ, and imitative of the sound made by blowing into liquids &c.;<BR> sometimes it expresses disregard or contempt; फु(फू)त्कृ<BR>—1 To blow into (a liquid); बालः पायसदग्धो दध्यपि फूत्कृत्य भक्षयति H. 4. 103.<BR>—2 To scream aloud, cry, shriek.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: फुत्कारः, फुत्कृतम्, फुत्कृतिः, फुत्कृत, फुत्कृतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

फुत्कारः|फुत्कार
फुत् + -कारः, -कृतम्, -कृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 blowing into.<BR>—2 hissing, whizzing.<BR>—3 the hiss of a serpent.<BR>—4 sobbing.<BR>—5 screaming, a loud shriek, yell. फूत्काररन्ध्रम् the hole of a flute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1148-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

