बर्हिपुष्पम्
बर्हिन् + -कुसुमम्, -पुष्पम् a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1154-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

