बलीयस्
बलीयस् <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Stronger, more powerful.<BR>—2 More effective.<BR>—3 More important (compar. of बलवत् or बलिन् q. v.). ━<i>adv.</i><BR> Powerfully, very much; बलीयः खलु भीतोऽस्मि Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बलूल|बलूलः
