बहल + -वर्त्मन् <i>m., n.</i> a disease of the eyes (as swollen eyelid).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहलित
बहलित <i>a.</i> Grown thick or strong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिस्
बहिस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Out of, outside (with abl.); निवसन्नावसथे पुराद्बहिः R. 8. 14, 11. 29.<BR>—2 On the outside, out of doors (opp. अन्तः); बहिर्गच्छ<BR>—3 Externally, outwardly; अन्तर्बहिः पुरत एव विवर्तमानाम् Māl. 1. 40, 14;<BR> H. 1. 94<BR>—4 Apart, separately.<BR>—5 Beside, except.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: बहिरङ्ग, बहिरर्थः, बहिरिन्द्रियम्, बहिरुपाधिः, बहिष्कुटीचरः, बहिर्गीतम्, बहिर्गेहम्, बहिश्चर, बहिस्तपस्, बहिर्दृश्, बहिर्देशः, बहिर्द्वारम्, बहिर्निःसारणम्, बहिष्पवमानम्, बहिष्प्रज्ञ, बहिष्प्राणः, बहिर्भव, बहिर्भवनम्, बहिर्भूत, बहिर्मनस्, बहिर्मनस्क, बहिर्मुख, बहिर्यात्रा, बहिर्यानम्, बहिर्यूति, बहिर्योगः, बहिर्लम्ब, बहिर्लापिका, बहिर्वर्तिन्, बहिर्वासस्, बहिर्विकारः, बहिर्वृत्तिः, बहिर्व्यसनम्, बहिर्व्यसनिन्, बहिःसंस्थ, बहिःस्थ, बहिःस्थित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिरङ्ग
बहिस् + -अङ्ग <i>a.</i> outer, external.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिरङ्गम्
बहिस् + -अङ्ग + .({@-गम्@})<BR>—1 an external part.<BR>—2 an outer, limb.<BR>—3 property.<BR>—4 a stranger.<BR>—5 the preliminary part of a religious ceremony.<BR>—6 What is remotely related or connected; अन्तरङ्गबहिरङ्गयोरन्तरङ्गं<BR> बलीयः ŚB. on MS. 12. 2. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिरर्थः|बहिरर्थ
बहिस् + -अर्थः an external object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिरिन्द्रियम्
बहिस् + -इन्द्रियम् an external organ or sense, an organ of action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिरुपाधिः|बहिरुपाधि
बहिस् + -उपाधिः an external condition or circumstance; न खलु बहिरुपाधीन्<BR> प्रीतयः संश्रयन्ते Māl. 1. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्कुटीचरः|बहिष्कुटीचर
बहिस् + -कुटीचरः a crab.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्गीतम्
बहिस् + -गीतम् a song accompanied by a stringed instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्गेहम्
बहिस् + -गेहम् <i>ind.</i> out of doors, abroad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिश्चर|बहिश्चरः
बहिस् + -चर <i>a.</i> outer, external, outward; बहिश्चराः प्राणाः Dk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिश्चरः|बहिश्चर
बहिस् + -चर + .({@-रः@}) a crab.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिस्तपस्
बहिस् + -तपस् <i>n.</i> outward penance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्दृश्
बहिस् + -दृश् <i>a.</i> superficial<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">Page1158-1</a>]<BR> (in judgment).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1157-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्देशः|बहिर्देश
बहिस् + -देशः<BR>—1 a foreign country.<BR>—2 the outskirts of a village.<BR>—3 a place without a town or village.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्द्वारम्
बहिस् + -द्वारम् an outer door. ˚प्रकोष्ठकम् a portico.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्निःसारणम्
बहिस् + -निःसारणम् expulsion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्पवमानम्
बहिस् + -पवमानम् a Sāma in the Somayāga; ते ह यथैवेदं बहिष्पवमानेन<BR> स्तोष्यमाणाः संरब्धाः Ch. Up. 1. 12. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्प्रज्ञ
बहिस् + -प्रज्ञ <i>a.</i> One whose knowledge is directed towards external<BR> objects; बहिष्प्रज्ञो विभुर्विश्वो ह्यन्तः प्रज्ञस्तु तैजसः Āgama. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्प्राणः|बहिष्प्राण
बहिस् + -प्राणः<BR>—1 the external or outer breath or life; (hence) anything as dear as life.<BR>—2 money; Bhāg. 5. 14. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्भव
बहिस् + -भव <i>a.</i> external.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्भवनम्
बहिस् + -भवनम् emanation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्भूत|बहिर्भूतः
बहिस् + -भूत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 expelled.<BR>—2 expired (time &c.).<BR>—3 inattentive, careless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्मनस्
बहिस् + -मनस् <i>a.</i> being outside the mind; external.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्मनस्क
बहिस् + -मनस्क <i>a.</i> out of mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्मुख|बहिर्मुखः
बहिस् + -मुख <i>a.</i><BR>—1 turning oneʼs face away from.<BR>—2 averse from, indifferent to.<BR>—3 greatly devoted to external things.<BR>—4 coming out of the mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्मुखः|बहिर्मुख
बहिस् + -मुख + .({@-खः@}) a god or deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्यात्रा
बहिस् + -यात्रा, -यानम् excursion, expedition abroad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्यानम्
बहिस् + -यात्रा, -यानम् excursion, expedition abroad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्यूति
बहिस् + -यूति <i>a.</i> placed or fastened outside.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्योगः|बहिर्योग
बहिस् + -योगः external meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्लम्ब|बहिर्लम्बः
बहिस् + -लम्ब <i>a.</i> obtuse-angled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्लम्बः|बहिर्लम्ब
बहिस् + -लम्ब + .({@-म्बः@}) an obtuse-angled triangle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्लापिका
बहिस् + -लापिका a kind of enigma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्वर्तिन्
बहिस् + -वर्तिन् <i>a.</i> being on the outside.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्वासस्
बहिस् + -वासस् <i>n.</i> an outer or upper garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्विकारः|बहिर्विकार
बहिस् + -विकारः syphilis. ━<i>a.</i> <i>ind.</i> free from change; बहिर्विकारं<BR> प्रकृतेः पृथग् विदुः Śi. 1. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्वृत्तिः|बहिर्वृत्ति
बहिस् + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> an external aspect or appearance; अन्तर्विषमया<BR> ह्येता बहिर्वृत्त्या मनोरमाः । गुञ्जाफलसमाकाराः स्वभावादेव योषितः ॥ Pt. 4. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्व्यसनम्
बहिस् + -व्यसनम् licentiousness, immorality, evil or lewd practices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिर्व्यसनिन्
बहिस् + -व्यसनिन् <i>a.</i> dissolute, lewd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिःसंस्थ
बहिस् + -संस्थ <i>a.</i> lying or situated outside (the town).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिःस्थ
बहिस् + -स्थ, -स्थित <i>a.</i> external, outer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिःस्थित
बहिस् + -स्थ, -स्थित <i>a.</i> external, outer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्क
बहिष्क <i>a.</i> External, outer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्कृ
बहिष्कृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To place outside of, exclude from, drive out of; राष्ट्रादेनं बहिष्कुर्यात्<BR> समग्रधनमक्षतम् Ms. 8. 380; Y. 1. 93.<BR>—2 To excommunicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्करणम्
बहिष्करणम्<BR>—1 An external organ.<BR>—2 Expulsion from.<BR>—3 Excepting, excluding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्कारः|बहिष्कार
बहिष्कारः<BR>—1 Expulsion, exclusion.<BR>—2 Excommunication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्कार्य
बहिष्कार्य <i>a.</i> To be removed or excluded from; स साधुभिर्बहिष्कार्यो<BR> नास्तिको वेदनिन्दकः Ms. 2. 11, 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्कृत
बहिष्कृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Turned out, expelled.<BR>—2 Restraining or free from.<BR>—3 Become apparent, manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहिष्टात्
बहिष्टात् <i>ind.</i> On the outside, abroad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहु
बहु <i>a.</i> (हु or ह्वी <i>f.</i>; compar. भूयस्; superl. भूयिष्ठ)<BR>—1 Much, plentiful, abundant, great; तस्मिन् बहु एतदपि Ś. 4 ‘even this was much for him’<BR> (was too much to be expected of him); बहु प्रष्टव्यमत्र<BR> Mu. 3; अल्पस्य हेतोर्बहु हातुमिच्छन् R. 2. 47.<BR>—2 Many, numerous; as in बह्वक्षर, बहुप्रकार.<BR>—3 Frequented, repeated.<BR>—4 Large, great.<BR>—5 Abounding or rich in (as first member of comp.); बहुकण्टको देशः &c. ━<i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Much, abundantly, very much, exceedingly, greatly, in a high degree.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">Page1158-2</a>]<BR>—2 Somewhat, nearly, almost; as in बहुतृण. (किं बहुना ‘why say much’<BR>, ‘in short’; बहु मन् to think or esteem highly, rate high,<BR> prize, value; त्वत्संभावितमात्मानं बहु मन्यामहे वयम् Ku. 6. 20;<BR> ययातेरिव शर्मिष्ठा भर्तुर्बहुमता भव Ś. 4. 7, 7. 1; R. 12. 89;<BR> येषां च त्वं बहुमतो भूत्वा यास्यसि लाघवम् Bg. 2. 35; Bk. 3. 53, 5. 84, 8. 12.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: बह्वक्षर, बह्वच्, बह्वच्क, बह्वनर्थ, बह्वप्, बह्वप, बह्वपत्य, बह्वपाय, बह्वर्थ, बह्वाशिन्, बहूदकः, बहूपयुक्त, बहूपाय, बह्वृच्, बह्वृच, बह्वेनस्, बहुकर, बहुकारम्, बहुकालम्, बहुकालीन, बहुकूर्चः, बहुक्रमः, बहुक्षम, बहुक्षारम्, बहुक्षीरा, बहुगन्ध, बहुगन्धदा, बहुगन्धा, बहुगुण, बहुगुरुः, बहुगोत्रज, बहुग्रन्थिः, बहुच्छल, बहुच्छिन्ना, बहुजनः, बहुजल्प, बहुज्ञ, बहुतन्त्रीक, बहुतृणम्, बहुत्वक्कः, बहुत्वच्, बहुद, बहुदक्षिण, बहुदर्शक, बहुदर्शिन्, बहुदायिन्, बहुदुग्ध, बहुदृश्वन्, बहुदृष्ट, बहुदोष, बहुदोहना, बहुधन, बहुधारम्, बहुधेनुकम्, बहुनाडिकः, बहुनाडीकः, बहुनादः, बहुपत्नीकता, बहुपत्रः, बहुपद्, बहुपाद्, बहुपादः,^1 बहुपुष्पः, बहुपर्वन्, बहुप्रकार, बहुप्रकृति, बहुप्रज, बहुप्रज्ञ, बहुप्रतिज्ञ, बहुप्रत्यर्थिक, बहुप्रत्यवाय, बहुप्रद, बहुप्रपञ्च, बहुप्रसूः, बहुप्रेयसी, बहुफल, बहुबलः, बहुबीजम्, बहुबोलक, बहुभाग्य, बहुभाषिन्, बहुभाष्यम्, बहुभुजा, बहुभूमिक, बहुभोग्या, बहुभोजिन्, बहुमञ्जरी, बहुमत, बहुमतिः, बहुमध्यग, बहुमलम्, बहुमानः, बहुमान्य, बहुमाय, बहुमार्गः, बहुमार्गगा, बहुमार्गी, बहुमुख, बहुमूत्र, बहुमूर्ति, बहुमूर्धन्, बहुमूला, बहुमूल्य, बहुमृग, बहुरजस्, बहुरत्न, बहुरस, बहुराशि, बहुरूप, बहुरूपक, बहुरेतस्, बहुरोमन्, बहुलवणम्, बहुवचनम्, बहुवर्ण, बहुवादिन्, बहुवारम्, बहुवारः, बहुवारकः, बहुवार्षिक, बहुविक्रम, बहुविघ्न, बहुविध, बहुवीजम्, बहुबीजम्, बहुवीर्य, बहुव्ययिन्, बहुव्यापिन्, बहुव्रीहि, बहुशत्रुः, बहुशल्यः, बहुशस्त, बहुशाख, बहुशिख, बहुशृङ्गः, बहुश्रुत, बहुसंख्याक, बहुसत्त्व, बहुसंतति, बहुसार, बहुसाहस्र, बहुसूः, बहुसूतिः, बहुस्वन, बहुस्वामिक<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वक्षर
बहु + -अक्षर <i>a.</i> having many syllables, polysyllabic (as a word).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वच्
बहु + -अच्, -अच्क <i>a.</i> having many vowels, polysyllabic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वच्क
बहु + -अच्, -अच्क <i>a.</i> having many vowels, polysyllabic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वनर्थ
बहु + -अनर्थ <i>a.</i> fraught with many evils.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वप्
बहु + -अप्, -अप <i>a.</i> watery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वप
बहु + -अप्, -अप <i>a.</i> watery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वपत्य|बह्वपत्यः
बहु + -अपत्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having a numerous progeny.<BR>—2 (in astrol.) promising a numerous progeny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वपत्यः|बह्वपत्य
बहु + -अपत्य + .({@-त्यः@})<BR>—1 a hog.<BR>—2 a mouse, rat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वपत्या
बहु + -अपत्य + .({@-त्या@}) a cow that has often calved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वपाय
बहु + -अपाय <i>a.</i> exposed to many risks; स्वगृहोद्यानगतेऽपि स्निग्धैः<BR> पापं विशङ्क्यते मोहात् । किमु दृष्टबह्वपायप्रतिभयकान्तारमध्यस्थे ।<BR> Pt. 2. 166.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वर्थ
बहु + -अर्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having many senses.<BR>—2 having many objects.<BR>—3 important.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वाशिन्
बहु + -आशिन् <i>a.</i> voracious, gluttonous, बह्वाशी स्वल्पसन्तुष्टः<BR> सुनिद्रो लघुचेतनः । प्रभुभक्तश्च शूरश्च ज्ञातव्याः षट् शुनो गुणाः ॥<BR> Cāṇ. ━<i>m.</i> N. of a son of Dhṛtarāṣṭra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहूदकः|बहूदक
बहु + -उदकः a kind of mendicant who lives in a strange town and maintains<BR> himself with alms got by begging from door to door; cf. कुटीचक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहूपयुक्त
बहु + -उपयुक्त <i>a.</i> made to serve a manifold purpose; बहूपयुक्ता<BR> च बुद्धिः Dk. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहूपाय
बहु + -उपाय <i>a.</i> effective.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वृच्
बहु + -ऋच् <i>a.</i> having many verses. ━(<i>f.</i>) a term applied to the Ṛgveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वृच|बह्वृचः
बहु + -ऋच <i>a.</i> having many verses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वृचः|बह्वृच
बहु + -ऋच + .({@-चः@}) one conversant with the Ṛgveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वृची
बहु + -ऋच + .({@-ची@}) The wife of one who studies the Ṛgveda. Hence ˚ब्राह्मणम्<BR> means the Aitareya Brāhmaṇa which belongs to the Ṛgveda; बह्वृचब्राह्मणे<BR> श्रूयते ŚB. on MS. 6. 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वेनस्
बहु + -एनस् <i>a.</i> very sinful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुकर|बहुकरः
बहु + -कर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 doing much, busy, industrious.<BR>—2 useful in many ways.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुकरः|बहुकर
बहु + -कर + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a sweeper, cleaner.<BR>—2 a camel.<BR>—3 the sun; बहुकरकृतात् प्रातःसंमार्जनात् N. 19. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुकरी
बहु + -कर + .({@-री@}) a broom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुकारम्
बहु + -कारम् abundance; बहुकारं च सस्यानाम् Mb. 12. 193. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुकालम्
बहु + -कालम् <i>ind.</i> for a long time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुकालीन
बहु + -कालीन <i>a.</i> of a long standing, old, ancient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुकूर्चः|बहुकूर्च|बहुकूर्च्चः
बहु + -कूर्चः a kind of cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुक्रमः|बहुक्रम
बहु + -क्रमः a Krama of more than three words; cf. कम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुक्षम|बहुक्षमः
बहु + -क्षम <i>a.</i> patient; अतोऽत्र किंचिद्भवतीं बहुक्षमां द्विजातिभावादुपपन्नचापलः Ku. 5. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुक्षमः|बहुक्षम
बहु + -क्षम + .({@-मः@})<BR>—1 a Buddha.<BR>—2 a Jaina deified saint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुक्षारम्
बहु + -क्षारम् Soap; Nigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुक्षारः|बहुक्षार
बहु + -क्षारम् + .({@-रः@}) a kind of alkali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुक्षीरा
बहु + -क्षीरा a cow giving much milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुगन्ध|बहुगन्धं|बहुगन्धः
बहु + -गन्ध <i>a.</i> strong-scented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुगन्धम्
बहु + -गन्ध + .({@-न्धम्@}) cinnamon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुगन्धदा|बहुगंधदा
बहु + -गन्धदा musk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुगन्धा|बहुगंधा
बहु + -गन्धा<BR>—1 the Yūthikā creeper.<BR>—2 a bud of the Champaka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

