बहुगोत्रज
बहु + -गोत्रज <i>a.</i> having many blood relations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुग्रन्थिः|बहुग्रन्थि
बहु + -ग्रन्थिः Tamarix Indica (Mar. वेळु ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुच्छल
बहु + -च्छल <i>a.</i> deceitful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुच्छिन्ना
बहु + -छिन्ना a species of Cocculus (Mar. गुळवेल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुजनः|बहुजन
बहु + -जनः a great multitude of people. ˚हितम् the common weal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुजल्प
बहु + -जल्प <i>a.</i> garrulous, talkative, loquacious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुज्ञ
बहु + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> knowing much, well informed, possessed of great knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुतन्त्रीक|बहुतंत्रीक|बहुतन्त्रीकः
बहु + -तन्त्रीक <i>a.</i> many-stringed (as a musical instrument).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुतृणम्
बहु + -तृणम् anything much like grass; (hence) what is unimportant or<BR> contemptible; निदर्शनमसाराणां लघुर्बहुतृणं नरः Śi. 2. 50; N. 22. 137.<BR>—2 abounding<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">Page1159-1</a>]<BR> in grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1158-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुत्वक्कः|बहुत्वक्क
बहु + -त्वक्कः, -त्वच् <i>m.</i> a kind of birch tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुत्वच्
बहु + -त्वक्कः, -त्वच् <i>m.</i> a kind of birch tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुद
बहु + -द <i>a.</i> liberal, generous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदक्षिण
बहु + -दक्षिण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 attended with many gifts or donations.<BR>—2 liberal, munificent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदर्शक
बहु + -दर्शक, -दर्शिन् <i>a.</i> prudent, circumspect; कृत्येषु बाली<BR> मेधावी राजानो बहुदर्शिनः Rām. 4. 2. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदर्शिन्
बहु + -दर्शक, -दर्शिन् <i>a.</i> prudent, circumspect; कृत्येषु बाली<BR> मेधावी राजानो बहुदर्शिनः Rām. 4. 2. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदायिन्
बहु + -दायिन् <i>a.</i> liberal, munificent, a liberal donor; Ch. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदुग्ध|बहुदुग्धः
बहु + -दुग्ध <i>a.</i> yielding much milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदुग्धः|बहुदुग्ध
बहु + -दुग्ध + .({@-ग्धः@}) wheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदुग्धा
बहु + -दुग्ध + .({@-ग्धा@}) a cow yielding much milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदृश्वन्
बहु + -दृश्वन् <i>a.</i> greatly experienced, a great observer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदृष्ट
बहु + -दृष्ट <i>a.</i> very experienced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदोष
बहु + -दोष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having many faults or defects, very wicked or sinful.<BR>—2 full of crimes or dangers; बहुदोषा हि शर्वरी Mk. 1. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुदोहना
बहु + -दोहना yielding much milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुधन
बहु + -धन <i>a.</i> very rich, wealthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुधारम्
बहु + -धारम्<BR>—1 the thunderbolt of Indra.<BR>—2 a diamond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुधेनुकम्
बहु + -धेनुकम् a great number of milch-cows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुनाडिकः
बहु + -नाडिकः the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुनाडीकः|बहुनाडीक
बहु + -नाडीकः<BR>—1 day.<BR>—2 pillar; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुनादः|बहुनाद
बहु + -नादः a conch-shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुपत्नीकता
बहु + -पत्नीकता polygamy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुपत्रः|बहुपत्र|बहुपत्रं
बहु + -पत्रः an onion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुपत्रम्
बहु + -पत्रः + .({@-त्रम्@}) talc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुपत्री
बहु + -पत्रः + .({@-त्री@}) the holy basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

