बहु + -पद्, -पाद्, -पादः^1 <i>m.</i> the fig. tree.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुपाद्
बहु + -पत्रः + .({@-त्री@}) the holy basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुपादः|बहुपाद
बहु + -पत्रः + .({@-त्री@}) the holy basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुपुष्पः|बहुपुष्प
बहु + -पुष्पः<BR>—1 the coral tree.<BR>—2 the Nimba tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

