बहुप्रपञ्च
बहु + -प्रपञ्च <i>a.</i> very diffuse or prolix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुप्रसूः
बहु + -प्रसूः the mother of many children.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुप्रेयसी
बहु + -प्रेयसी <i>a.</i> having many loved ones.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुफल|बहुफलः
बहु + -फल <i>a.</i> rich in fruits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

