बहुभूमिक
बहु + -भूमिक <i>a.</i> having many floors or stories.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुभोग्या
बहु + -भोग्या a prostitute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

