बहु + -मञ्जरी the holy basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुमत
बहु + -मत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 highly esteemed or prized, valued, respected; येषां च त्वं बहुमतो भूत्वा यास्यसि लाघवम् Bg. 2. 35.<BR>—2 having many different opinions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

