बहुमानः|बहुमान
बहु + -मानः great respect or regard, high esteem; पुरुषबहुमानो<BR> विगलितः Bh. 3. 9; वर्तमानकवेः कालिदासस्य क्रियायां कथं परिषदो<BR> बहुमानः M. 1; V. 1. 2; Ku. 5. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुमानम्
बहु + -मानः + .({@-नम्@}) a gift given by a superior to an inferior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुमान्य
बहु + -मान्य <i>a.</i> respectable, esteemable; Kull. on Ms. 2. 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुमाय
बहु + -माय <i>a.</i> artful, deceitful, treacherous; परदेशभयाद्भीता<BR> बहुमाया नपुंसकाः । स्वदेशे निधनं<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-2" target="_blank">Page1159-2</a>]<BR> यान्ति Pt. 1. 321.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1159-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

