बहुक <i>a.</i> Dear bought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुकः|बहुक
बहुक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 The sunplant (अर्क).<BR>—3 A crab.<BR>—4 A kind of gallinule.<BR>—5 The digger of a tank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुतर
बहुतर <i>a.</i> More numerous, greater, larger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुतम
बहुतम <i>a.</i> Most abundant, greatest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुतः
बहुतः <i>ind.</i> From many sides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुता
बहुता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Abundance, plenty, numerousness.<BR>—2 Majority or plurality.<BR>—3 (In gram.) The plural number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुत्वम्
बहुता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Abundance, plenty, numerousness.<BR>—2 Majority or plurality.<BR>—3 (In gram.) The plural number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुतिथ|बहुतिथः
बहुतिथ <i>a.</i> Much, long, many; काले गते बहुतिथे Ś. 5. 3;<BR> तस्य भुवि बहुतिथास्तिथयः Ki. 12. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुतिथम्
बहुतिथ + .{@-थम्@} <i>ind.</i> Greatly, in a high degree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुत्र
बहुत्र <i>ind.</i> In many ways or places.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुथा
बहुथा <i>ind.</i> In several ways.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुधा
बहुधा <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 In many ways, variously, diversely, multifariously; बहुधाप्यागमैर्भिन्नाः<BR> R. 10. 26; ऋषिभिर्बहुधा गीतं छन्दोभिर्विविधैः पृथक् Bg. 13. 4.<BR>—2 In different forms or ways.<BR>—3 Frequently, repeatedly.<BR>—4 In various places or directions. (बहुधाकृ<BR>—1 to multiply.<BR>—2 to make public, divulge.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: बहुधात्मक, बहुधागत<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुधात्मक
बहुधा + -आत्मक <i>a.</i> manifold in forms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुधागत
बहुधा + -गत <i>a.</i> scattered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुल|बहुलं|बहुलः
बहुल <i>a.</i> (<i>compar.</i> बंहीयस् <i>superl.</i> बंहिष्ठ)<BR>—1 Thick, dense, compact; वृक्षांश्च बहुलच्छायान् ददृशुर्गिरिमूर्धनि Mb. 3. 143. 3.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Broad, wide, capacious;<BR>——(<i>b</i>) ample, large.<BR>—3 Abundant, copious, plentiful, much, numerous; अविनयबहुलतया K. 143.<BR>—4 Numerous, manifold, many; तरुणतमालनीलबहुलोन्नमदम्बुधराः Māl. 9. 18.<BR>—5 Full of, rich or abounding in; जन्मनि क्लेशबहुले किं नु दुःखमतः<BR> परम् H. 1. 184; क्रियाविशेषबहुलां भोगैश्वर्यगतिं प्रति Bg. 2. 43.<BR>—6 Accompanied or attended by.<BR>—7 Born under the Pleiades; P. IV. 3. 33.<BR>—8 Dark, black.<BR>—9 Comprehensive, variously applicable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलः|बहुल|बहुलं
बहुल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 The dark half of a month (कृष्णपक्ष); प्रादुरास बहुलक्षपाछविः<BR> R. 11. 15; करेण भानोर्बहुलावसाने संधुक्ष्यमाणेव शशाङ्करेखा Ku. 7. 8, 4. 13.<BR>—2 An epithet of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुला
बहुल + .{@-ला@}<BR>—1 A cow; कस्मात् समाने बहुलाप्रदाने सद्भिः प्रशस्तं कपिलाप्रदानम् Mb. 13. 77. 9.<BR>—2 Cardamoms.<BR>—3 The indigo plant.<BR>—4 The Pleiades (pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलम्
बहुल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 The sky.<BR>—2 White-pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलम्
बहुल + .{@-लम्@} <i>ind.</i> Often, frequently; बहुलं छन्दसि.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: बहुलाश्वः, बहुलालाप, बहुलगन्धा, बहुलशितिमन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलाश्वः|बहुलाश्व
बहुल + -अश्वः N. of a king of Maithili<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">Page1160-2</a>]<BR> dynasty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलालाप
बहुल + -आलाप <i>a.</i> talkative, garrulous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलगन्धा|बहुलगंधा
बहुल + -गन्धा cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलशितिमन्
बहुल + -शितिमन् blackness of the dark half of the month; कूजायुजा बहुलपक्षशितिम्रि<BR> सीम्ना N. 21. 124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलिका
बहुलिका (pl.) The Pleiades.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलता
बहुलता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Abundance, copiousness.<BR>—2 Numerousness.<BR>—3 Comprehensiveness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलत्वम्
बहुलता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Abundance, copiousness.<BR>—2 Numerousness.<BR>—3 Comprehensiveness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलित
बहुलित <i>a.</i> Augmented, increased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलीकृ
बहुलीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To make public, disclose, divulge.<BR>—2 To make dense or compact; वलयार्पितासितमहोपलप्रभावहुलीकृतप्रतनुरोमराजिना Śi. 13. 44.<BR>—4 To increase, extend, aggrandize; भूतेषु किं च करुणां बहुलीकरोति Bv. 1. 112.<BR>—4 To thresh (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलीकरणम्
बहुलीकरणम्<BR>—1 Increasing, aggrandizement.<BR>—2 Divulging, promulgation.<BR>—3 Multiplying, magnifying.<BR>—4 Winnowing, threshing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलीकारः|बहुलीकार
बहुलीकारः A great zeal or care for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलीकृत|बहुलीकृतं
बहुलीकृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Increased, augmented.<BR>—2 Made public, promulgated.<BR>—3 Made much or manifold.<BR>—4 Extended.<BR>—5 Winnowed, threshed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलीभू
बहुलीभू €1 P.<BR>—1 To spread, increase, multiply; छिद्रेष्वनर्था बहुलीभवन्ति Pt. 2. 175.<BR>—2 To get abroad, to become public or notorious, be generally known, become<BR> wide-spread; बहुलीभूतमेतत् किं न कथ्यते Ś. 6; पौरेषु सोऽहं<BR> बहुलीभवन्तं … सोढुं न तत्पूर्वमवर्णमीशे R. 14. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुलीभावः|बहुलीभाव
बहुलीभावः Becoming public, general notoriety or publicity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहुशस्
बहुशस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Much, abundantly, plentifully; पश्यन्तीनां न खलु बहुशो न स्थलीदेवतानां … … अश्रुलेशाः<BR> पतन्ति Me. 108.<BR>—2 Frequently, repeatedly, often-times; चलापाङ्गां दृष्टिं स्पृशसि बहुशो<BR> वेपथुमतीम् Ś. 1. 23; Ku. 4. 35.<BR>—3 Generally, commonly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बहूदनम्
बहूदनम् = षड्रस (अन्न) Collection of various kinds of<BR> food; मुख्यानाम पुरस्ताद्द्वास्तयाऽपणबहूदनौ Bhāg. 4. 25. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बह्वोदः|बह्वोद
बह्वोदः = बहूदकः q. v.; Bhāg. 3. 12. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाकुलम्
बाकुलम् The fruit of the Bakula tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाड्
बाड् €1 Ā. (बाडते)<BR>—1 To bathe.<BR>—2 To emerge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाढभीकरः
बाढभीकरः N. of a grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाडवः|बाडव|बाडवं
बाडवः See वाडव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाडवेय
बाडवेय See वाडवेय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाडव्य|बाडव्यं
बाडव्य See वाडव्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाडीरः|बाडीर
बाडीरः A servant, hireling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाढ|बाढं
बाढ <i>a.</i> (<i>compar.</i> साधीयस् <i>superl.</i> साधिष्ठ)<BR>—1 Firm, strong.<BR>—2 Much, excessive.<BR>—3 Loud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाढम्
बाढ + .{@-ढम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Assuredly, certainly, surely, really; oh yes? (in answer<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1161-1" target="_blank">Page1161-1</a>]<BR> to questions); तां बाढमित्युपामन्त्र्य प्रविश्य गजसाह्वयम् Bhāg. 1. 8. 45;<BR> चाणक्यः-चन्दनदास एष ते निश्चयः । चन्दन˚ -बाढम् एष<BR> मे स्थिरो निश्चयः Mu. 1; बाढमेषु दिवसेषु पार्थिवः कर्म साधयति<BR> पुत्रजन्मने R. 19. 52.<BR>—2 Very well, be it so, good; Māl. 1. 15, 16.<BR>—3 Exceedingly, very much; वपुरादरातिशयशंसि पुनः प्रतिपत्तिमूढमपि<BR> बाढमभूत् Śi. 9. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1160-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाणः|बाण
बाणः<BR>—1 An arrow, shaft, reed; Bṛ. Up. 3. 8. 2; धनुष्यमोघं समधत्त<BR> बाणम् Ku. 3. 66.<BR>—2 An aim or mark for arrows.<BR>—3 The feathered end of an arrow.<BR>—4 The udder of a cow.<BR>—5 The body (शरीर); ते प्रकाश्याभिवदन्ति वयमेतद्बाणमवष्टभ्य<BR> विधारयामः Praśna. Up. 2. 2.<BR>—6 N. of a demon, son of Bali; cf. उषा.<BR>—7 N. of a celebrated poet who lived at the court of king Harṣavardhana<BR> and flourished in the first half of the seventh century; (see App. II).<BR> He is the author of कादम्बरी, हर्षचरित and of some other works;<BR> (Govardhana in his Āryā. S. 37 speaks in these terms of Bāṇa:−<BR> जाता शिखण्डिनी प्राग् यथा शिखण्डी तथावगच्छामि । प्रागल्भ्यधिकमाप्तुं<BR> वाणी बाणो बभूवेति ॥; so हृदयवसतिः पञ्चबाणस्तु बाणः P. R. 1. 22).<BR>—8 A symbolical expression for the number ‘five’.<BR>—9 A sound, voice.<BR>—10 Fire.<BR>—11 Lightning.<BR>—12 A form of Śiva.<BR>—13 The versed sine of an arc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1161-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाणः|बाण
बाणः + .{@-णः, -णा@} The hinder part or feathered end of an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1161-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाणा
बाणः + .{@-णः, -णा@} The hinder part or feathered end of an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1161-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाणः|बाण
बाणः + .{@-णः, -णा, -णम्@} a blue flowering Barleria -नीलझिण्टी (Mar.<BR> कोन्हांटी); अनाविलोन्मीलितबाणचक्षुषः Ki. 4. 28; Śi. 6. 46.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: बाणासनम्, बाणावलिः, बाणावली, बाणाश्रयः, बाणगङ्गा, बाणगोचरः, बाणजालम्, बाणजित्, बाणतूणः, बाणधिः, बाणनिकृत, बाणपत्रः, बाणपथः, बाणपाणि, बाणपातः, बाणपुरम्, बाणमुक्ति, बाणयोजनम्, बाणरेखा, बाणलिङ्गम्, बाणवारः, बाणवृष्टिः, बाणसंधानम्, बाणसिद्धिः, बाणसुता, बाणहन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1161-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाणा
