बाणासनम्
बाणः + -असनम् a bow; स पार्थबाणासनवेगमुक्तैर्दृढाहतः पत्रिभिरुग्रवेगैः<BR> Mb. 8. 89. 86. ˚यन्त्रम् a kind of bow with a mechanical contrivance<BR> at one of its ends for tightening the string and letting off the arrow; Dk. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1161-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

