बाणपातः|बाणपात
बाणः + -पातः<BR>—1 an arrowshot (as a measure of distance).<BR>—2 the range of an arrow.<BR>—3 a bed of arrows (बाणशष्या, शरतल्प); बाणपातान्तरे रामं पातितं<BR> पुरुषर्षभम् Rām. 6. 45. 25. ˚वर्तिन् <i>a.</i> being within the range of an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1161-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

