बाणलिङ्गम्
बाणः + -लिङ्गम् a white stone found in the river नर्मदा and worshipped<BR> as the लिङ्ग of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1161-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

