बाणसुता
बाणः + -सुता an epithet of Uṣā, daughter of Bāṇa; see उषा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1161-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाणहन्
