बादर|बादरं|बादरः
बादर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [बदर-अण्]<BR>—1 Belonging to or coming from the jujube tree.<BR>—2 Made of cotton.<BR>—3 Coarse (opp. to सूक्ष्म).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1161-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

