बाल + -अग्रम्<BR>—1 the point of a hair.<BR>—2 A dove-cot; प्रासादबालाग्रकपोतपालिकायामुपविष्टः शृणोमि Mk. 1. 51/52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1162-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

