बाल + -खिल्यः a class of divine personages of the size of a thumb and<BR> produced from the creatorʼs body and said to precede the sunʼs chariot<BR> (their number is said to be sixty thousand); cf. R. 15. 10; कतोश्च<BR> सन्ततिर्भार्या वालखिल्यानसूयत । षष्टिर्यानि सहस्राणि ऋषीणामूर्ध्वरेतसाम् ॥ Mārk. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1163-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

