बालक|बालकं|बालकः
बालक <i>a.</i> (-लिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [बाल स्वार्थे क]<BR>—1 Child-like, young, not yet full-grown.<BR>—2 Ignorant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1163-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बालकः|बालक|बालकं
बालक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A child, boy.<BR>—2 A minor (in law).<BR>—3 A finger-ring.<BR>—4 A fool or blockhead.<BR>—5 A bracelet.<BR>—6 The tail of a horse or elephant<BR>—7 Hair.<BR>—8 A young elephant (five years old); निर्धूतवीतमपि बालकमुल्ललन्तम्<BR> Śi. 5. 47. See बाल (8).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1163-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

