बालकीय
बालकीय <i>a.</i> Childish, infantine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1163-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाला
बाला<BR>—1 A girl, a female child.<BR>—2 A young woman under sixteen years of age.<BR>—3 A young woman (in general); जाने तपसो वीर्यं सा बाला परवतीति<BR> मे विदितम् Ś. 3. 2; इयं बाला मां प्रत्यनवरतमिन्दीवरदलप्रभाचोरं<BR> चक्षुः क्षिपति Bh. 3. 67; Me. 85.<BR>—4 A variety of jasmine.<BR>—5 The cocoa-nut.<BR>—6 The plant घृतकुमारी.<BR>—7 Small cardamoms.<BR>—8 Turmeric.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: बालाहत्या<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1163-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बालाहत्या
बाला + -हत्या female infanticide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1163-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बालिका
बालिका<BR>—1 A girl, young woman.<BR>—2 The knot of an earring.<BR>—3 Small cardamoms.<BR>—4 Sand. —5 The rustling of leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1163-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बालवः|बालव
