बालिः|बालि
बालिः N. of a celebrated monkey-king; see वालि.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: बालिहन्, बालिहन्तृ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1163-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बालिहन्
