बालिमन्
बालिमन् <i>m.</i> Childhood, boyhood, youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1163-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बालिश|बालिशं|बालिशः
बालिश <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Childish, puerile, silly.<BR>—2 Young.<BR>—3 Foolish, ignorant; तावतां न फलं तत्र दाता प्राप्नोति बालिशः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-1" target="_blank">Page1164-1</a>]<BR> Ms. 3. 176; ममापराधात्तैः क्षुद्रैर्हतस्त्वं तात बालिशैः Mb. 3. 117. 1.<BR>—4 Careless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1163-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बालिशः|बालिश|बालिशं
