बालिशीकृ
बालिशीकृ To make fickleminded, inconsiderate; भरतस्नेहसंतप्ता<BR> बालिशीक्रियते पुनः Rām. 3. 16. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

