बाष्पः + -अम्बु <i>n.</i> tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

