बाष्पदुर्दिनम्
बाष्पः + -दुर्दिनम् a flood of tears. ━<i>a.</i> (eyes) clouded by tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

