बाष्पः + -पूरः a gush or flood of tears; वारंवारं तिरयति दृशोरुद्गमं<BR> बाष्पपूरः Māl. 1. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

