बाष्पः + -प्रकरः, -प्रसरः a flow or gush of tears; पुनर्दृष्टिं बाष्पप्रसरकलुषामर्पितवती<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">Page1164-2</a>]<BR> Ś. 6. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

