बाष्पमोचनम्
बाष्पः + -मोक्षः, -मोचनम् shedding tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

