बाष्पविक्लव
बाष्पः + -विक्लव <i>a.</i> overcome with tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाष्पसंदिग्ध
बाष्पः + -संदिग्ध <i>a.</i> indistinct through suppressed tears (as a voice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाष्पकः|बाष्पक
बाष्पकः A kind of vegetable (Mar. माठ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाष्पका
बाष्पकः + .{@-का@} also बाष्पिका<BR>—1 Steam, vapour.<BR>—2 A kind of vegetable, हिंगुपत्री.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाष्पायते
बाष्पायते Den. Ā.<BR>—1 To shed tears, weep; तत् किमिति बाष्पायितं भगवत्या Māl. 6; V. 5. 9.<BR>—2 To emit vapour or steam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बास्त
बास्त <i>a.</i> (-स्ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> Coming or derived from a goat; कार्ष्णरौरवबास्तानि<BR> चर्मार्णि ब्रह्मचारिणः Ms. 2. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बास्तिकम्
