बाहः<BR>—1 The arm.<BR>—2 A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

