बाहिरिकः|बाहिरिक
बाहिरिकः An alien character; न च बाहिरिकान् कुर्यात् पुरराष्ट्रोपघातकान् ।<BR> क्षिपेज्जनपदे चैतान् सर्वान् वा दापयेत् करान् ॥ Kau. A. 2. 4. 22;<BR> also द्वारबाहिरिकादेयम् च दुर्गम् Kau. A. 2. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहीक|बाहीकः
बाहीक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> External, outer; बाहीका विलसति कुट्टिमस्थलीयं<BR> कापोतं सुललितरूपमुद्वहन्ती Rām. Ch. 7. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहीकाः
बाहीक + .{@-काः@} (pl.) The people of the Punjab.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहीकः|बाहीक
बाहीक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 An inhabitant of the Punjab.<BR>—2 An ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुः|बाहु
बाहुः [बाध् कु धस्य हः Tv.]<BR>—1 The arm; शान्तमिदमाश्रमपदं स्फुरति च बाहुः कुतह् फलमिहास्य<BR> Ś. 1. 16; so महाबाहुः &c.<BR>—2 The fore-arm.<BR>—3 The fore-foot of an animal.<BR>—4 A door-post.<BR>—5 The base of a right-angled triangle (in geom.).<BR>—6 (In medic.) The whole upper extremity of the body (opp. सक्थि).<BR>—8 The bar of a chariot-pole.<BR>—9 The shadow of the gnomon on a sun-dial.<BR>—10 The arm as a measure of length (= 12 Aṅgulas).<BR>—11 The limb of a bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहू
बाहुः + .{@-हू@} (du.) The lunar mansion Ārdrā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: बाह्वन्तरम्, बाहूत्क्षेपम्, बाहुकर, बाहुकण्टकम्, बाहुकुण्ठ, बाहुकुब्ज, बाहुकुन्थः, बाहुचापः, बाहुजः, बाहुज्या, बाहुतरणम्, बाहुत्रः, बाहुत्रम्, बाहुत्राण, बाहुदण्डः, बाहुदन्तकम्, बाहुनिःसृतम्, बाहुपाशः, बाहुप्रचालकम्, बाहुप्रतिबाहौ, बाहुप्रसारः, बाहुप्रसारणम्, बाहुप्रहरणः, बाहुफलम्, बाहुबन्धनम्, बाहुबलम्, बाहुभङ्गिः, बाहुभूषण, बाहुभूषा, बाहुभेदिन्, बाहुमूलम्, बाहुयुद्धम्, बाहुयोधः, बाहुयोधिन्, बाहुरक्षा, बाहुलता, बाहुलोहम्, बाहुविक्षेपः, बाहुविघट्टनम्, बाहुविघट्टितम्, बाहुवीर्यम्, बाहुव्यायामः, बाहुशालिन्, बाहुशिखरम्, बाहुसंभवः, बाहुसहस्रभृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाह्वन्तरम्
बाहुः + -अन्तरम् the chest; संवर्त्य मुष्टिं सहसा जघान बाह्वन्तरे<BR> शैलनिकाशरूपः Rām. 6. 70. 154.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहूत्क्षेपम्
बाहुः + -उत्क्षेपम् <i>ind.</i> having raised or tossed up the arms; बाहूत्क्षेपं<BR> क्रन्दितुं च प्रवृत्ता Ś. 5. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुकर
बाहुः + -कर <i>a.</i> active with the arms; P. III. 2. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुकण्टकम्
बाहुः + -कण्टकम् a mode in fighting; ‘एकां जङ्घां पदा ऽऽक्रम्य परामुद्यम्य पाट्यते । केतकीपत्रवच्छत्रुर्युद्धं तद्बाहुकण्टकम् ॥’;<BR> बाहुकण्टकयुद्धेन<BR> तस्य कर्णोऽथ युध्यतः Mb. 12. 5. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुकुण्ठ|बाहुकुण्ठः
बाहुः + -कुण्ठ, -कुब्ज <i>a.</i> crippled in the arms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुकुब्ज
बाहुः + -कुण्ठ, -कुब्ज <i>a.</i> crippled in the arms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुकुन्थः|बाहुकुन्थ|बाहुकुंथ
बाहुः + -कुन्थः a wing (of a bird).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुचापः|बाहुचाप
बाहुः + -चापः the distance measured by the extended arms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुजः|बाहुज
बाहुः + -जः<BR>—1 a man of the Kṣatriya caste; cf. बाहू राजन्यः कृतः Rv. 10. 90. 12;<BR> also Ms. 1. 31; स बाहुजो महाबाहुस्तदुवाह महाबलम् Śiva B.; N. 12. 12.<BR>—2 a parrot.<BR>—3 sesamum growing spontaneously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुज्या
बाहुः + -ज्या a sine (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुतरणम्
बाहुः + -तरणम् crossing a river (with the arms).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुत्रः|बाहुत्र
बाहुः + -त्रः, -त्रम्, -त्राण vantbrass (armour for the arms).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुत्रम्
बाहुः + -त्रः, -त्रम्, -त्राण vantbrass (armour for the arms).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुत्राण|बाहुत्राणं
बाहुः + -त्रः, -त्रम्, -त्राण vantbrass (armour for the arms).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुदण्डः|बाहुदण्ड|बाहुदंड
बाहुः + -दण्डः<BR>—1 a long, staff-like arm. —2 punishment with the arm<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">Page1165-1</a>]<BR> or fist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1164-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुदन्तकम्
बाहुः + -दन्तकम् N. of a Nītiśāstra treatise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुनिःसृतम्
बाहुः + -निःसृतम् a mode of fighting (by which a sword is twisted out<BR> of a personʼs hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुपाशः|बाहुपाश
बाहुः + -पाशः a particular attitude in fighting.<BR>—2 the arm thrown round, as in the act of embracing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुप्रचालकम्
बाहुः + -प्रचालकम् <i>ind.</i> shaking the arms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुप्रतिबाहौ
बाहुः + -प्रतिबाहौ the opposite sides of a figure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुप्रसारः|बाहुप्रसार
बाहुः + -प्रसारः, -प्रसारणम् stretching the arms (for embracing &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुप्रसारणम्
बाहुः + -प्रसारः, -प्रसारणम् stretching the arms (for embracing &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुप्रहरणः|बाहुप्रहरण
बाहुः + -प्रहरणः a boxer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुप्रहरणम्
बाहुः + -प्रहरणः + .({@-णम्@}) boxing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुफलम्
बाहुः + -फलम्<BR>—1 (in geom.) the result for the base sine.<BR>—2 (in astr.) the sine of an arc of a circle of position contained between<BR> the sun and the prime verticle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुबन्धनम्
बाहुः + -बन्धनम् encircling arms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुबन्धनः|बाहुबन्धन
बाहुः + -बन्धनम् + .({@-नः@}) the shoulder-blade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुबलम्
बाहुः + -बलम् strength of arm, muscular strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुभङ्गिः|बाहुभङ्गि
बाहुः + -भङ्गिः <i>f.</i> bending or twisting the arms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुभूषण
बाहुः + -भूषण, -भूषा an ornament worn on the arm, an armlet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुभूषा
बाहुः + -भूषण, -भूषा an ornament worn on the arm, an armlet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुभेदिन्
बाहुः + -भेदिन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुमूलम्
बाहुः + -मूलम्<BR>—1 the armpit.<BR>—2 the shoulderblade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुयुद्धम्
बाहुः + -युद्धम् a hand-to-hand or close fight, personal or pugilistic<BR> encounter, boxing; बाहुयुद्धं हि मल्लानामशास्त्रमृषिभिः स्मृतम् । मृतस्य<BR> तत्र न स्वर्गो यशो नेहापि विद्यते ॥ Mallaśāstram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुयोधः|बाहुयोध
बाहुः + -योधः, -योधिन् <i>m.</i> a pugilist, boxer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुयोधिन्
बाहुः + -योधः, -योधिन् <i>m.</i> a pugilist, boxer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुरक्षा
बाहुः + -रक्षा armour for the upper arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुलता
बाहुः + -लता an arm-like creeper. ˚अन्तरम् the breast, bosom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुलोहम्
बाहुः + -लोहम् bell-metal (कांस्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

