बाहुशालिन्
बाहुः + -शालिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 of Bhīma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

