बाहुक|बाहुकः
बाहुक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Swimming with the arms.<BR>—2 Servile, dependent.<BR>—3 Dwarfish; ममन्थुरूरं तरसा तत्रासीद्बाहुको नरः Bhāg. 4. 14. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुकः|बाहुक
बाहुक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A monkey.<BR>—2 A name assumed by Nala after his transformation into a dwarf by Karkoṭaka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुमत्|बाहुमन्त्
