बाहुगुण्यम्
बाहुगुण्यम्<BR>—1 Possession of many virtues or excellences; एषां हि बाहुगुण्येन गिरिदुर्गं विशिष्यते Ms. 7. 71.<BR>—2 Excess, plenty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

