बाहुलः|बाहुल|बाहुलं
बाहुल + .{@-लः@} Fire; शीतरुजं समये च परस्मिन् बाहुलतो रसिका शमयन्ती<BR> Rām. Ch. 4. 99.<BR>—2 The month Kārtika.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुलम्
बाहुल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 Manifoldness.<BR>—2 An armour for the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">Page1165-2</a>]<BR> arms, vantbrass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुली
बाहुल + .{@-ली@} The day of full moon in the month of Kārtika.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: बाहुलग्रीवः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुलग्रीवः|बाहुलग्रीव
बाहुल + -ग्रीवः a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुलकम्
बाहुलकम्<BR>—1 Manifoldness.<BR>—2 The diverse or interminable applicability of a rule, of meanings or<BR> of forms; a term frequently used in grammar; बाहुलकाच्छन्दसि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुलेयः|बाहुलेय
बाहुलेयः An epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुल्यम्
बाहुल्यम्<BR>—1 Abundance, plenty, copiousness.<BR>—2 Manifoldness, multiplicity, variety.<BR>—3 The usual course or common order of things. ({@बाहुल्यात्, -ल्येन@}<BR>—1 usually, commonly.<BR>—2 in all probability.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहुश्रुत्यम्
बाहुश्रुत्यम् Erudition, great learning; बाहुश्रुत्यं तपस्त्यागः<BR> श्रद्धा यज्ञक्रिया क्षमा Mb. 12. 167. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाहूबाहवि
बाहूबाहवि <i>ind.</i> Arm to arm, hand to hand, in close encounter;<BR> (बाहुभिर्बाहुभिः प्रहृत्येदं युद्धं प्रवृत्तम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाह्य|बाह्यः
बाह्य <i>a.</i> [बहिर्भवः ष्यञ् टिलोपः]<BR>—1 Outer, outward, external, exterior, being or situated without; विरहः<BR> किमिवानुतापयेद् वद बाह्यैर्विषयैर्विपश्चितम् R. 8. 89; बाह्योद्यान<BR> Me. 7; Ku. 6. 46; बाह्यनामन् ‘the outer name’, <i>i. e.</i> the address<BR> or superscription written on the back of a letter; अदत्तबाह्यनामानं<BR> लेखं लेखयित्वा Mu. 1.<BR>—2 Foreign, strange; Pt. 1.<BR>—3 Excluded from, out of the pale of; जातास्तदूर्वोरुपमानबाह्याः Ku. 1. 36.<BR>—4 Expelled from society, outcast; अतोऽपि शिष्टस्त्वधमो गुरुदारप्रधर्षकः ।<BR> बाह्यं वर्णं जनयति चातुर्वर्ण्यविगर्हितम् ॥ Mb. 13. 48. 9.<BR>—5 Public; तेषां बाह्यं चारं छत्रमृङ्गारव्यजनपादुकोपग्राहिणः तीक्ष्णाः विद्युः Kau. A. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाह्यः|बाह्य
बाह्य + .{@-ह्यः@}<BR>—1 A stranger, foreigner; त्यक्ताश्चाभ्यन्तरा येन बाह्याश्चाभ्यन्तरीकृताः<BR> Pt. 1. 259; बाह्यः क्षणेन भवतीति विचित्रमेतत् 5. 26.<BR>—2 One who is excommunicated, an outcast.<BR>—3 A person or community born from प्रतिलोम connection; cf. Ms. 10. 28-31;<BR> प्रतिकूलं वर्तमाना बाह्या बाह्यतरान् पुनः । हीना हीनान् प्रसूयन्ते<BR> वर्णान् पञ्चदशैव च ॥ Ms. 10. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बाह्यम्
