बाह्यकक्षः|बाह्यकक्ष
बाह्य + -कक्षः the outer side (of a house).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

