बाह्यद्रुतिः|बाह्यद्रुति
बाह्य + -द्रुतिः <i>f.</i> a process in the preparation of quicksilver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

