बाह्लकाःकः
बाह्लकाः, बाह्लिकाः, बाह्लीकाः + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A king of the Bālhikas.<BR>—2 A horse of the Balkh breed; काम्बोजविषये जातैर्बाह्लीकैश्च हयोत्तमैः<BR> Rām. 1. 6. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1165-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

