बिन्दुमालिन्
बिन्दुः + -मालिन् <i>m.</i> (in music) a kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1166-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

