बिलशायिन्
बिलम् + -शायिन् <i>m.</i> any animal living in burrows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बिलस्वर्गः|बिलस्वर्ग
बिलम् + -स्वर्गः the lower region, hell; Bhāg. 5. 24. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1167-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

