बीभत्स|बीभत्सः
बीभत्स <i>a.</i> [बध् स्वार्थे सन्]<BR>—1 Disgusting, loathsome, nauseous, hideous, revolting; हन्त बीभत्समेवाग्रे<BR> वर्तते Māl. 5 ‘Oh! it is indeed a loathsome sight’.<BR>—2 Envious, malignant, mischievous.<BR>—3 Savage, cruel, ferocious.<BR>—4 Estranged in mind.<BR>—5 Loathing, detesting; बीभत्सुरतिबीभत्सं कर्मेदमकरोत् कथम् Mb. 11. 24. 13.<BR>—6 Sinful, wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1168-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

