बुधे
बुध + .{@-धे@} <i>ind.</i> On a Wednesday.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: बुधाष्टमी, बुधजनः, बुधतातः, बुधदिनम्, बुधवारः, बुधवासरः, बुधरत्नम्, बुधसानुः, बुधसुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1170-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

