बुभूषु
बुभूषु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wishing to be or become; प्रभुर्बुभूषुर्भुवनत्रयस्य यः Śi. 1. 49.<BR>—2 Wishing to become powerful or prosperous; अथैतानि न सेवेत बुभूषुः<BR> पुरुषः क्वचित् Bhāg. 1. 17. 41.<BR>—3 Wishing the welfare of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1170-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

