बुस्
बुस् €4 P. (बुस्यति)<BR>—1 To discharge, emit, pour forth.<BR>—2 To divide, distribute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1171-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बुसम्
