बृहन्नला
बृहत् + -नटः, -नलः, -नला the name assumed by Arjuna when residing as<BR> dancing and music master at the court of Virāṭa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1171-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

