बृहत्पादः|बृहत्पाद
बृहत् + -पादः the fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1171-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

