बृहद्भास
बृहत् + -भास <i>a.</i> very bright, brightly shining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1171-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बृहद्रथः|बृहद्रथ
बृहत् + -रथः<BR>—1 an epithet of Indra.<BR>—2 N. of a king, father of Jarāsandha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1171-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बृहद्वादिन्
बृहत् + -वादिन् <i>a.</i> talking much, a boaster, swaggerer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1171-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बृहद्राविन्
