बृहच्छल्कः|बृहच्छल्क
बृहत् + -शल्कः a sprawn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1171-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बृहच्छ्रवस्
बृहत् + -श्रवस् <i>a.</i> highly praised, far-famed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1171-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

बृहत्संहिता
