ब्रह्माक्षरम्
ब्रह्मन् + -अक्षरम् the sacred syllable <i>om</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माङ्गभूः
ब्रह्मन् + -अङ्गभूः<BR>—1 a horse.<BR>—2 one who has touched the several parts of his body by the repetition<BR> of Mantras; स च त्वदेकेषुनिपातसाध्यो ब्रह्माङ्गभूर्ब्रह्मणि योजितात्मा<BR> Ku. 3. 15 (see Malli. thereon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माञ्जलिः|ब्रह्माञ्जलि|ब्रह्मांजलि
ब्रह्मन् + -अञ्जलिः<BR>—1 respectful salutation with folded hands while repeating the Veda.<BR>—2 obeisance to a preceptor (at the beginning and conclusion of the repetition<BR> of the Veda); अपश्यद्यावतो वेदविदां ब्रह्माञ्जलीनसौ N. 17. 183;<BR> ब्रह्मारम्भेऽवसाने च पादौ ग्राह्यौ गुरोः सदा । संहत्य हस्तावध्येयं<BR> स हि ब्रह्माञ्जलिः स्मृतः ॥ Ms. 2. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माण्डम्
ब्रह्मन् + -अण्डम् ‘the egg of Brahman’, the primordial egg from which the<BR> universe sprang, the world, universe; ब्रह्माण्डच्छत्रदण्डः Dk. 1.<BR> ˚कपालः the hemisphere of the world. ˚भाण्डोदरम् the hollow of<BR> the universe; ब्रह्मा येन कुलालवन्नियमितो ब्रह्माण्डभाण्डोदरे Bh. 2. 95.<BR> ˚पुराणम् N. of one of the eighteen Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मादिजाता
ब्रह्मन् + -अदिजाता, -अद्रिजाता an epithet of the river Godāvarī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माद्रिजाता
ब्रह्मन् + -अदिजाता, -अद्रिजाता an epithet of the river Godāvarī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माधिगमः|ब्रह्माधिगम
ब्रह्मन् + -अधिगमः, -अधिगमनम् study of the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माधिगमनम्
ब्रह्मन् + -अधिगमः, -अधिगमनम् study of the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माम्भस्|ब्रह्मांभस्
ब्रह्मन् + -अम्भस् <i>n.</i> the urine of a cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माभ्यासः|ब्रह्माभ्यास
ब्रह्मन् + -अभ्यासः the study of the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मायणः|ब्रह्मायण
ब्रह्मन् + -अयणः, -अयनः an epithet of Nārāyaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मायनः|ब्रह्मायन
ब्रह्मन् + -अयणः, -अयनः an epithet of Nārāyaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मारण्यम्
ब्रह्मन् + -अरण्यम्<BR>—1 a place of religious study.<BR>—2 N. of a forest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मार्पणम्
ब्रह्मन् + -अर्पणम्<BR>—1 the offering of sacred knowledge.<BR>—2 devoting oneself to the Supreme Spirit.<BR>—3 N. of a spell.<BR>—4 a mode of performing the Śrāddha in which no Piṇḍas or rice-balls are offered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मास्त्रम्
ब्रह्मन् + -अस्त्रम् a missile presided over by Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मात्मभूः
ब्रह्मन् + -आत्मभूः a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मानन्दः|ब्रह्मानन्द|ब्रह्मानंद
ब्रह्मन् + -आनन्दः bliss or rapture of absorption into Brahma; ब्रह्मानन्दसाक्षात्क्रियां Mv. 7. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मारम्भः|ब्रह्मारम्भ|ब्रह्मारंभ
ब्रह्मन् + -आरम्भः beginning to repeat the Vedas; Ms. 2. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मावर्तः|ब्रह्मावर्त|ब्रह्मावर्त्त|ब्रह्मावर्त्तः
ब्रह्मन् + -आवर्तः N. of the tract between the rivers Sarasvatī and Dṛṣadvatī<BR> (northwest of Hastināpura); सरस्वतीदृषद्वत्योर्देवनद्योर्यदन्तरम् ।<BR> तं देवनिर्मितं देशं ब्रह्मावर्तं प्रचक्षते Ms. 2. 17, 19; Me. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माश्रमः
ब्रह्मन् + -आश्रमः = ब्रह्मचर्याश्रमः; वेदाध्ययननित्यत्वं क्षमाऽथाचार्यपूजनम् ।<BR> अथोपाध्यायशुश्रूषा ब्रह्माश्रमपदं भवेत् ॥ Mb. 12. 66. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मासनम्
ब्रह्मन् + -आसनम् a particular position for profound meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्माहुतिः|ब्रह्माहुति
ब्रह्मन् + -आहुतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 the offering of prayers; see ब्रह्मयज्ञ.<BR>—2 the study of the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मोज्झता
ब्रह्मन् + -उज्झता forgetting or neglecting the Vedas; Ms. 11. 57 (अधीतवेदस्यानभ्यासेन<BR> विस्मरणम् Kull.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मोत्तर|ब्रह्मोत्तरं
ब्रह्मन् + -उत्तर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 treating principally of Brahman.<BR>—2 consisting chiefly of Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मोद्यम्
ब्रह्मन् + -उद्यम् explaining the Veda, treatment or discussion of theological<BR> problems; ब्राह्मणा भगवन्तो हन्ताहमिमं द्वौ प्रश्नौ प्रक्ष्यामि तौ चेन्मे<BR> वक्ष्यति न वै जातु युष्माकमिमं कश्चिद् ब्रह्मोद्यं जेतेति Bṛ. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मोपदेशः|ब्रह्मोपदेश
ब्रह्मन् + -उपदेशः instruction in the Vedas or sacred knowledge. ˚नेतृ<BR> <i>m.</i> the Palāśa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मर्षिः|ब्रह्मर्षि
ब्रह्मन् + -ऋषिः (ब्रह्मर्षिः or ब्रह्मऋषिः) a Brahmanical<BR> sage. ˚देशः N. of a district; (कुरुक्षेत्रं च मत्स्याश्च पञ्चालाः<BR> शूरसेनकाः । एष ब्रह्मर्षिदेशो वै ब्रह्मावर्तादनन्तरः Ms. 2. 19).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मौदनः|ब्रह्मौदन|ब्रह्मौदनं
ब्रह्मन् + -ओदनः, -ओदनम् food given to the priests at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मौदनम्
ब्रह्मन् + -ओदनः, -ओदनम् food given to the priests at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकन्यका
ब्रह्मन् + -कन्यका an epithet of Sarasvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकरः|ब्रह्मकर
ब्रह्मन् + -करः a tax paid to the priestly class.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकर्मन्
ब्रह्मन् + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> the religious duties of a Brāhmaṇa, the office<BR> of Brahman, one of the four principal priests at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकला
ब्रह्मन् + -कला an epithet of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">Page1174-2</a>]<BR> Dākṣāyaṇī (who dwells in the heart of man).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकल्पः|ब्रह्मकल्प
ब्रह्मन् + -कल्पः an age of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकाण्डम्
ब्रह्मन् + -काण्डम् the portion of the Veda relating to spiritual knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकाष्ठः|ब्रह्मकाष्ठ
ब्रह्मन् + -काष्ठः the mulberry tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकिल्बिषम्
ब्रह्मन् + -किल्बिषम् an offence against Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकूटः|ब्रह्मकूट
ब्रह्मन् + -कूटः a thoroughly learned Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकूर्चम्
ब्रह्मन् + -कूर्चम् a kind of penance; अहोरात्रोषितो भूत्वा पौर्णमास्यां विशेषतः ।<BR> पञ्चगव्यं पिबेत् प्रातर्ब्रह्मकूर्चमिति स्मृतम् ॥.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकृत्
ब्रह्मन् + -कृत् one who prays. ━(<i>m.</i>) an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मकोशः|ब्रह्मकोश
ब्रह्मन् + -कोशः the treasure of the Vedas, the entire collection of the<BR> Vedas; क्षात्रो धर्मः श्रित इव तनुं ब्रह्मकोशस्य गुप्त्यै U. 6. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मगायत्री
ब्रह्मन् + -गायत्री N. of a magical mantra composed after the model of गायत्री mantra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मगिरिः|ब्रह्मगिरि
ब्रह्मन् + -गिरिः N. of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मगीता
ब्रह्मन् + -गीता <i>f.</i> The preaching of Brahmā as included in the Anuśāsana<BR> parva of the Mahābhārata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मगुप्तः|ब्रह्मगुप्त
ब्रह्मन् + -गुप्तः N. of an astronomer born in 598 A. D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मगोलः|ब्रह्मगोल
ब्रह्मन् + -गोलः the universe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मगौरवम्
ब्रह्मन् + -गौरवम् respect for the missile presided over by Brahman; विष्कम्भितुं<BR> समर्थोऽपि नाऽचलद् ब्रह्मगौरवात् Bk. 9. 76 (मा भून्मोघो ब्राह्मः पाश इति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मग्रन्थिः|ब्रह्मग्रन्थि|ब्रह्मग्रंथि
ब्रह्मन् + -ग्रन्थिः<BR>—1 N. of a particular joint of the body.<BR>—2 N. of the knot which ties together the 3 threads of the यज्ञोपवीत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मग्रहः|ब्रह्मग्रह
ब्रह्मन् + -ग्रहः, -पिशाचः, -पुरुषः, -रक्षस् <i>n.</i>, {@-राक्षसः@}<BR> a kind of ghost, the ghost of a Brāhmaṇa, who during<BR> his life time indulges in a disdainful spirit and carries away the wives<BR> of others and the property of Brāhmaṇas; (परस्य योषितं हृत्वा ब्रह्मस्वमपहृत्य<BR> च । अरण्ये निर्जले देशे भवति ब्रह्मराक्षसः ॥ Y. 3. 212; cf. Ms. 12. 60 also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपिशाचः|ब्रह्मपिशाच
ब्रह्मन् + -ग्रहः, -पिशाचः, -पुरुषः, -रक्षस् <i>n.</i>, {@-राक्षसः@}<BR> a kind of ghost, the ghost of a Brāhmaṇa, who during<BR> his life time indulges in a disdainful spirit and carries away the wives<BR> of others and the property of Brāhmaṇas; (परस्य योषितं हृत्वा ब्रह्मस्वमपहृत्य<BR> च । अरण्ये निर्जले देशे भवति ब्रह्मराक्षसः ॥ Y. 3. 212; cf. Ms. 12. 60 also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपुरुषः|ब्रह्मपुरुष
ब्रह्मन् + -ग्रहः, -पिशाचः, -पुरुषः, -रक्षस् <i>n.</i>, {@-राक्षसः@}<BR> a kind of ghost, the ghost of a Brāhmaṇa, who during<BR> his life time indulges in a disdainful spirit and carries away the wives<BR> of others and the property of Brāhmaṇas; (परस्य योषितं हृत्वा ब्रह्मस्वमपहृत्य<BR> च । अरण्ये निर्जले देशे भवति ब्रह्मराक्षसः ॥ Y. 3. 212; cf. Ms. 12. 60 also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरक्षस्
ब्रह्मन् + -ग्रहः, -पिशाचः, -पुरुषः, -रक्षस् <i>n.</i>, {@-राक्षसः@}<BR> a kind of ghost, the ghost of a Brāhmaṇa, who during<BR> his life time indulges in a disdainful spirit and carries away the wives<BR> of others and the property of Brāhmaṇas; (परस्य योषितं हृत्वा ब्रह्मस्वमपहृत्य<BR> च । अरण्ये निर्जले देशे भवति ब्रह्मराक्षसः ॥ Y. 3. 212; cf. Ms. 12. 60 also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मग्राहिन्
ब्रह्मन् + -ग्राहिन् <i>a.</i> worthy to receive that which is holy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मघातकः|ब्रह्मघातक
ब्रह्मन् + -घातकः, -घातिन् <i>m.</i> the murderer of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मघातिन्
ब्रह्मन् + -घातकः, -घातिन् <i>m.</i> the murderer of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मघातिनी
ब्रह्मन् + -घातिनी a woman on the second day of her courses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मघोषः|ब्रह्मघोष
ब्रह्मन् + -घोषः<BR>—1 recital of the Veda.<BR>—2 the sacred word, the Vedas collectively; U. 6. 9 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मघ्नः|ब्रह्मघ्न
ब्रह्मन् + -घ्नः the murderer of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मचक्रम्
ब्रह्मन् + -चक्रम्<BR>—1 The circle of the universe; Śvet. Up.<BR>—2 N. of a magical circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मचर्यम्
ब्रह्मन् + -चर्यम्<BR>—1 religious studentship, the life of celibacy passed by a Brāhmaṇa<BR> boy in studying the Vedas, the first stage or order of his life; अविप्लुतब्रह्मचर्यो<BR> गृहस्थाश्रममाचरेत् Ms. 3. 2, 2. 249; Mv. 1. 24; यदिच्छन्तो ब्रह्मचर्यं<BR> चरन्ति तत्ते पदं संग्रहेण ब्रवीम्योमित्येतत् Kaṭh.<BR>—2 religious study, self-restraint.<BR>—3 celibacy, chastity, abstinence, continence; also ब्रह्मचर्याश्रम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मचर्यः|ब्रह्मचर्य|ब्रह्मचर्यं|ब्रह्मचर्य्य|ब्रह्मचर्य्यं
ब्रह्मन् + -चर्यम् + .({@-र्यः@}) a religious student; see ब्रह्मचारिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मचर्या
ब्रह्मन् + -चर्यम् + .({@-र्या@}) chastity, celibacy. ˚व्रतम् a vow of chastity. ˚स्खलनम्<BR> falling off from chastity, incontinence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मचारिकम्
ब्रह्मन् + -चारिकम् the life of a religious student.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मचारिन्
ब्रह्मन् + -चारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 studying the Vedas.<BR>—2 practising continence or chastity. ━(<i>m.</i>) a religious student, a<BR> Brāhmaṇa in the first order of his life, who continues to live with<BR> his spiritual guide from the investiture with sacred thread and performs<BR> the duties pertaining to his order till he settles in life; ब्रह्मचारी<BR> वेदमधीत्य वेदौ वेदान् वा चरेद् ब्रह्मचर्यम् Kaṭhaśrutyupaniṣad 17;<BR> Ms. 2. 41, 175, 6. 87.<BR>—2 one who vows to lead the life of a celibate.<BR>—3 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—4 of Skanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मचारिणी
ब्रह्मन् + -चारिणी<BR>—1 an epithet of Durgā.<BR>—2 a woman who observes the vow of chastity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मजः|ब्रह्मज
ब्रह्मन् + -जः an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मजन्मन्
ब्रह्मन् + -जन्मन् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 spirtual birth.<BR>—2 investiture<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">Page1175-1</a>]<BR> with the sacred thread; ब्रह्मजन्म हि विप्रस्य प्रेत्य चेह च शाश्वतम्<BR> Ms. 2. 146, 170.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1174-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मजारः|ब्रह्मजार
ब्रह्मन् + -जारः the paramour of a Brāhmaṇaʼs wife; Rāmatāpanīya Upaniṣad<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मजिज्ञासा
ब्रह्मन् + -जिज्ञासा desire to know Brahman; अथातो ब्रह्मजिज्ञासा Br. Sūt..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मजीविन्
ब्रह्मन् + -जीविन् <i>a.</i> living by sacred knowledge. ━(<i>m.</i>) a mercenary<BR> Brāhmaṇa (who converts his sacred knowledge into trade), a Brāhmaṇa<BR> who lives by sacred knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मज्ञानम्
ब्रह्मन् + -ज्ञानम् knowledge about Brahman; वेदान्तसाङ्ख्यसिद्धान्तब्रह्मज्ञानं<BR> वदाम्यहम् Garuḍa P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मज्ञ|ब्रह्मज्ञः
ब्रह्मन् + -ज्ञ, -ज्ञानिन् <i>a.</i> one who knows Brahma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मज्ञः|ब्रह्मज्ञ
ब्रह्मन् + -ज्ञ, -ज्ञानिन् + .({@-ज्ञः@})<BR>—1 an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR>—2 of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मज्ञानिन्
ब्रह्मन् + -ज्ञ, -ज्ञानिन् <i>a.</i> one who knows Brahma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मज्ञानम्
ब्रह्मन् + -ज्ञानम् true or divine knowledge, knowledge of the identity of<BR> the universe with Brahma; ब्रह्मज्ञानप्रभासंध्याकालो गच्छति धीमताम्<BR> Pāśupata. Up. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मज्येष्ठः|ब्रह्मज्येष्ठ
ब्रह्मन् + -ज्येष्ठः the elder brother of Brahman; ब्रह्मज्येष्ठमुपासते<BR> T. Up. 2. 5. ━(<i>a.</i>) having Brahmā as first or chief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मज्योतिस्
ब्रह्मन् + -ज्योतिस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 the light of Brahma or the Supreme Being.<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मतत्त्वम्
ब्रह्मन् + -तत्त्वम् the true knowledge of the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मतन्त्रम्
ब्रह्मन् + -तन्त्रम् all that is taught in the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मतालः|ब्रह्मताल
ब्रह्मन् + -तालः (in music) a kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मतेजस्
ब्रह्मन् + -तेजस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 the glory of Brahman.<BR>—2 Brahmanic lustre, the lustre or glory supposed to surround a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदः|ब्रह्मद
ब्रह्मन् + -दः a spiritual preceptor; Ms. 4. 232.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदण्डः|ब्रह्मदण्ड|ब्रह्मदंड
ब्रह्मन् + -दण्डः<BR>—1 the curse of a Brāhmaṇa; एकेन ब्रह्मदण्डेन बहवो नाशिता मम Rām.<BR>—2 a tribute paid to a Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—3 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—4 N. of a mythical weapon (ब्रह्मास्त्र); खरस्य रामो जग्राह ब्रह्मदण्डमिवापरम्<BR> Rām. 3. 30. 24.<BR>—5 magic, spells, incantation (अभिचार); ब्रह्मदण्डमदृष्टेषु दृष्टेषु<BR> चतुरङ्गिणीम् Mb. 12. 103. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदर्भा
ब्रह्मन् + -दर्भा Ptychotis Ajowan (Mar. ओवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदानम्
ब्रह्मन् + -दानम्<BR>—1 the imparting of sacred knowledge.<BR>—2 sacred knowledge, received as an inheritance or hereditary gift; सर्वेषामेव<BR> दानानां ब्रह्मदानं विशिष्यते Ms. 4. 233.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदायः|ब्रह्मदाय
ब्रह्मन् + -दायः<BR>—1 instruction in the Vedas, the imparting of sacred knowledge.<BR>—2 sacred knowledge received as an inheritance; तं प्रतीतं स्वधर्मेण<BR> ब्रह्मदायहरं पितुः Ms. 3. 3.<BR>—3 the earthly possession of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदायादः|ब्रह्मदायाद
ब्रह्मन् + -दायादः<BR>—1 one who receives the Vedas as his hereditary gift, a Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—2 the son of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदारुः|ब्रह्मदारु
ब्रह्मन् + -दारुः the mulberry tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदिनम्
ब्रह्मन् + -दिनम् a day of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदूषक
ब्रह्मन् + -दूषक <i>a.</i> falsifying the vedic texts; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदेय|ब्रह्मदेयः
ब्रह्मन् + -देय <i>a.</i> married according to the Brāhma form of marriage;<BR> ब्रह्मदेयात्मसंतानो ज्येष्ठसामग एव च Ms. 3. 185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदेयः|ब्रह्मदेय
ब्रह्मन् + -देय + .({@-यः@}) the Brāhma form of marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदेयम्
ब्रह्मन् + -देय + .({@-यम्@})<BR>—1 land granted to Brahmaṇas; श्रोत्रियेभ्यो ब्रह्मदेयान्यदण्डकराण्यभिरूपदायकानि<BR> प्रयच्छेत् Kau. A. 2. 1. 19.<BR>—2 instruction in the sacred knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मदैत्यः|ब्रह्मदैत्य
ब्रह्मन् + -दैत्यः a Brāmhaṇa changed into a demon; cf. ब्रह्मग्रह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मद्वारम्
ब्रह्मन् + -द्वारम् entrance into Brahmā; ब्रह्मद्वारमिदमित्येवैतदाह<BR> यस्तपसाहतपाप्मा Maitr. Up. 4. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मद्विष्
ब्रह्मन् + -द्विष्, -द्वेषिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 hating Brāhmaṇas; Ms. 3. 154 (Kull.).<BR>—2 hostile to religious acts or devotion, impious, godless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मद्वेषिन्
ब्रह्मन् + -द्विष्, -द्वेषिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 hating Brāhmaṇas; Ms. 3. 154 (Kull.).<BR>—2 hostile to religious acts or devotion, impious, godless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मद्वेषः|ब्रह्मद्वेष
ब्रह्मन् + -द्वेषः hatred of Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मधर
ब्रह्मन् + -धर <i>a.</i> possessing sacred knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मनदी
ब्रह्मन् + -नदी an epithet of the river Sarasvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मनाभः|ब्रह्मनाभ
ब्रह्मन् + -नाभः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मनिर्वाणम्
ब्रह्मन् + -निर्वाणम् —1 absorption into the Supreme Spirit; स्थित्वास्यामन्तकालेऽपि<BR> ब्रह्मनिर्वाणमृच्छति Bg. 2. 72.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">Page1175-2</a>]<BR>—2 = ब्रह्मानन्द q. v.; तं ब्रह्मनिर्वाणसमाधिमाश्रितम् Bhāg. 4. 6. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मनिष्ठ|ब्रह्मनिष्ठः
ब्रह्मन् + -निष्ठ <i>a.</i> absorbed in or intent on the contemplation of the<BR> Supreme Spirit; ब्रह्मनिष्ठस्तथा योगी पृथग्भावं न विन्दति Aman. Up. 1. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मनिष्ठः|ब्रह्मनिष्ठ
ब्रह्मन् + -निष्ठ + .({@-ष्ठः@}) the mulberry tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मनीडम्
ब्रह्मन् + -नीडम् the resting-place of Brahmana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपदम्
ब्रह्मन् + -पदम्<BR>—1 the rank or position of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—2 the place of the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपवित्रः|ब्रह्मपवित्र
ब्रह्मन् + -पवित्रः the Kuśa grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपरिषद्
ब्रह्मन् + -परिषद् <i>f.</i> an assembly of Brāhmṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपादपः|ब्रह्मपादप
ब्रह्मन् + -पादपः, -पत्रः the Palāśa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपत्रः|ब्रह्मपत्र|ब्रह्मपत्रं
ब्रह्मन् + -पादपः, -पत्रः the Palāśa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपारः|ब्रह्मपार
ब्रह्मन् + -पारः the final object of all sacred knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपारायणम्
ब्रह्मन् + -पारायणम् a complete study of the Vedas, the entire Veda; याज्ञवल्क्यो<BR> मुनिर्यस्मै ब्रह्मपारायणं जगौ U. 4. 9; Mv. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपाशः|ब्रह्मपाश
ब्रह्मन् + -पाशः N. of a missile presided over by Brahman; अबध्नादपरिस्कन्दं<BR> ब्रह्मपाशेन विस्फुरन् Bk. 9. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपितृ
ब्रह्मन् + -पितृ <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपुत्रः|ब्रह्मपुत्र|ब्रह्मपुत्त्रः
ब्रह्मन् + -पुत्रः<BR>—1 a son of Brahman.<BR>—2 N. of a (male) river which rises in the eastern extremity of the Himālaya<BR> and falls with the Ganges into the Bay of Bengal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपुत्रा
ब्रह्मन् + -पुत्रः + .({@-त्रा@})<BR>—1 a kind of vegetable poison. —2 See ब्रह्मपुत्रः (2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपुत्री
ब्रह्मन् + -पुत्रः + .({@-त्री@}) an epithet of the river Sarasvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपुरम्
ब्रह्मन् + -पुरम् the heart; दिव्ये ब्रह्मपुरे ह्येष व्योम्न्यात्मा प्रतिष्ठितः<BR> Muṇḍ. 2. 2. 7.<BR>—2 the body; Ch. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपुरम्
ब्रह्मन् + -पुरम्, -पुरी<BR>—1 the city of Brahman (in heaven).<BR>—2 N. of Benares.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपुरी
ब्रह्मन् + -पुरम्, -पुरी<BR>—1 the city of Brahman (in heaven).<BR>—2 N. of Benares.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपुराणम्
ब्रह्मन् + -पुराणम् N. of one of the eighteen Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मपुरुषः|ब्रह्मपुरुष
ब्रह्मन् + -पुरुषः a minister of Brahman (the five vital airs).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मप्रलयः|ब्रह्मप्रलय
ब्रह्मन् + -प्रलयः the universal destruction at the end of one hundred<BR> years of Brahman in which even the Supreme Being is supposed to be swallowed up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मप्राप्तिः|ब्रह्मप्राप्ति
ब्रह्मन् + -प्राप्तिः <i>f.</i> absorption into the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मबलम्
ब्रह्मन् + -बलम् the Brahmanical power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मबन्धुः|ब्रह्मबन्धु|ब्रह्मबंधु
ब्रह्मन् + -बन्धुः<BR>—1 a contemptuous term for a Brāhmaṇa, an unworthy Brāhmaṇa (cf. Mar.<BR> भटुर्गा); वस ब्रह्मचर्यं न वै सोम्यास्मत्कुलीनोऽननूच्य ब्रह्मबन्धुरिव<BR> भवतीति Ch. Up. 6. 1. 1; ब्रह्मबन्धुरिति स्माहम् Bhāg. 10. 81. 16; M. 4; V. 2.<BR>—2 one who is a Brāhmaṇa only by caste, a nominal Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मबिन्दुः|ब्रह्मबिन्दु
ब्रह्मन् + -बिन्दुः a drop of saliva sputtered while reciting the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मबीजम्
ब्रह्मन् + -बीजम्<BR>—1 the mystic syllable <i>om</i>; मनो यच्छेज्जितश्वासो ब्रह्मबीजमविस्मरन्<BR> Bhāg. 2. 1. 17.<BR>—2 the mulberry tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मब्रुवः|ब्रह्मब्रुव
ब्रह्मन् + -ब्रुवः, -ब्रुवाणः one who pretends to be a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मब्रुवाणः|ब्रह्मब्रुवाण
ब्रह्मन् + -ब्रुवः, -ब्रुवाणः one who pretends to be a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभवनम्
ब्रह्मन् + -भवनम् the abode of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभागः|ब्रह्मभाग
ब्रह्मन् + -भागः<BR>—1 the mulberry tree.<BR>—2 the share of the chief priest; अथास्मै ब्रह्मभागं पर्याहरन्ति Śat. Br.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभावः|ब्रह्मभाव
ब्रह्मन् + -भावः absorption into the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभावनम्
ब्रह्मन् + -भावनम् imparting religious knowledge; छेत्ता ते हृदयग्रन्थिमौदर्यो<BR> ब्रह्मभावनः Bhāg. 3. 24. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभिद्
ब्रह्मन् + -भिद् <i>a.</i> dividing the one Brahma into many.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभुवनम्
ब्रह्मन् + -भुवनम् the world of Brahman; आ ब्रह्मभुवनाल्लोकाः पुनरावर्तिनोऽर्जुन Bg. 8. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभूत
ब्रह्मन् + -भूत <i>a.</i> become one with Brahma, absorbed into the Supreme<BR> Spirit; आयुष्मन्तः सर्व एव ब्रह्मभूता हि मे मताः Mb. 1. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभूतिः|ब्रह्मभूति
ब्रह्मन् + -भूतिः <i>f.</i> twilight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभूमिजा
ब्रह्मन् + -भूमिजा a kind of pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभूयम्
ब्रह्मन् + -भूयम्<BR>—1 identity with Brahma, absorption or dissolution into Brahma, final<BR> emancipation; स ब्रह्मभूयं गतिमागजाम R. 18. 28; ब्रह्मभूयाय<BR> कल्पते Bg. 14. 26; Ms. 1. 98.<BR>—2 Brahmanahood, the state or rank of a Brāhmaṇa. धृष्टाद्धार्ष्टमभूत्<BR> क्षत्रं ब्रह्मभूयं गतं क्षितौ Bhāg. 9. 2. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मभूयस्
ब्रह्मन् + -भूयस् <i>n.</i> absorption into Brahma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्ममङ्गलदेवता|ब्रह्ममंगलदेवता
ब्रह्मन् + -मङ्गलदेवता an epithet of Lakṣmī.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">Page1176-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1175-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्ममहः|ब्रह्ममह
ब्रह्मन् + -महः a festival in honour of Brāhmaṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्ममित्र
ब्रह्मन् + -मित्र <i>a.</i> having Brāhmaṇas for friends.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्ममीमांसा
ब्रह्मन् + -मीमांसा the Vedānta philosophy which inquires into the nature<BR> of Brahma or Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्ममुहूर्तः|ब्रह्ममुहूर्त
ब्रह्मन् + -मुहूर्तः a particular hour of the day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्ममूर्ति
ब्रह्मन् + -मूर्ति <i>a.</i> having the form of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्ममूर्धभृत्
ब्रह्मन् + -मूर्धभृत् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्ममेखलः|ब्रह्ममेखल
ब्रह्मन् + -मेखलः the Munja plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मयज्ञः|ब्रह्मयज्ञ
ब्रह्मन् + -यज्ञः one of the five daily Yajñas or sacrifices (to be performed<BR> by a householder), teaching and reciting the Vedas; अध्यापनं ब्रह्मयज्ञः<BR> Ms. 3. 70 (अध्यापनशब्देन अध्ययनमपि गृह्यते Kull.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मयोगः|ब्रह्मयोग
ब्रह्मन् + -योगः cultivation or acquisition of spiritual knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मयोनि|ब्रह्मयोनिः
ब्रह्मन् + -योनि <i>a.</i> sprung from Brahman; गुरुणा ब्रह्मयोनिना R. 1. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मयोनिः|ब्रह्मयोनि
ब्रह्मन् + -योनि + .({@-निः@}) <i>f.</i><BR>—1 original source in Brahman.<BR>—2 the author of the Vedas or of Brahman; किं पुनर्ब्रह्मयोनेर्यस्तव<BR> चेतसि वर्तते Ku. 6. 18. ˚स्थ <i>a.</i> intent on the means of attaining<BR> sacred knowledge; ब्राह्मणा ब्रह्मयोनिस्था ये स्वकर्मण्यवस्थिताः Ms. 10. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरत्नम्
ब्रह्मन् + -रत्नम् a valuable present made to a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरन्ध्रम्
ब्रह्मन् + -रन्ध्रम् an aperture in the crown of the head through which the<BR> soul is said to escape on its leaving the body; आरोप्य ब्रह्मरन्ध्रेण<BR> ब्रह्म नीत्वोत्सृजेत्तनुम् Bhāg. 11. 15. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मराक्षसः|ब्रह्मराक्षस
ब्रह्मन् + -राक्षसः See ब्रह्मग्रह; छिद्रं हि मृगयन्ते स्म विद्वांसो<BR> ब्रह्मराक्षसाः Rām. 1. 8. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरवः|ब्रह्मरव
ब्रह्मन् + -रवः muttering of prayers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरसः|ब्रह्मरस
ब्रह्मन् + -रसः Brahmaʼs savour. ˚आसवः Brahmaʼs nectar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरातः|ब्रह्मरात
ब्रह्मन् + -रातः an epithet of Śuka; Bhāg. 1. 9. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरात्रः|ब्रह्मरात्र
ब्रह्मन् + -रात्रः early dawn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरात्रिः|ब्रह्मरात्रि
ब्रह्मन् + -रात्रिः an epithet of Yājñavalkya, (wrong for ब्रह्मरातिः)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मराशिः|ब्रह्मराशि
ब्रह्मन् + -राशिः<BR>—1 the whole mass or circle of sacred knowledge.<BR>—2 an epithet of Paraśurāma.<BR>—3 a particular constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरीतिः|ब्रह्मरीति
ब्रह्मन् + -रीतिः <i>f.</i> a kind of brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मरेखा
ब्रह्मन् + -रेखा, -लेखा, -लिखितम्, -लेखः lines written by<BR> the creator on the forehead of a man which indicate his destiny, the predestined<BR> lot of any man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मलेखा
ब्रह्मन् + -रेखा, -लेखा, -लिखितम्, -लेखः lines written by<BR> the creator on the forehead of a man which indicate his destiny, the predestined<BR> lot of any man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मलिखितम्
ब्रह्मन् + -रेखा, -लेखा, -लिखितम्, -लेखः lines written by<BR> the creator on the forehead of a man which indicate his destiny, the predestined<BR> lot of any man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मलेखः|ब्रह्मलेख
ब्रह्मन् + -रेखा, -लेखा, -लिखितम्, -लेखः lines written by<BR> the creator on the forehead of a man which indicate his destiny, the predestined<BR> lot of any man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मलोकः|ब्रह्मलोक
ब्रह्मन् + -लोकः the world of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मलौकिक
ब्रह्मन् + -लौकिक <i>a.</i> inhabiting the ब्रह्मलोक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मवक्तृ
ब्रह्मन् + -वक्तृ <i>m.</i> an expounder of the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मवद्यम्
