ब्रह्मन् + -वधः, -वध्या, -हत्या the murder of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मवर्चस्|ब्रह्मवर्च्चस्
ब्रह्मन् + -वर्चस् <i>n.</i>, {@-वर्चसम्@}<BR>—1 divine glory or splendour, spiritual pre-eminence or holiness resulting<BR> from sacred knowledge; स य एवमेतद्रथन्तरमग्नौ प्रोतं वेद ब्रह्मवर्चस्यन्नादो<BR> भवति Ch. Up. 2. 12. 2; (तस्य) हेतुस्त्वद्ब्रह्मवर्चसम् R. 1. 63;<BR> Ms. 2. 37, 4. 94.<BR>—2 the inherent sanctity or power of a Brāhmaṇa; Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मवर्चसिन्
