ब्रह्मवादिन्
ब्रह्मन् + -वादिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 one who teaches or expounds the Vedas; U. 1; Māl. 1.<BR>—2 a follower of the Vedānta philosophy; तस्याभिषेक आरब्धो ब्राह्मणैर्ब्रह्मवादिभिः<BR> Bhāg. 4. 15. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

