ब्रह्मशाला
ब्रह्मन् + -शाला<BR>—1 the hall of Brahman.<BR>—2 a place for reciting the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ब्रह्मशासनम्
ब्रह्मन् + -शासनम्<BR>—1 a decree addressed to Brāhmaṇas.<BR>—2 a command of Brahman.<BR>—3 the command of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—4 instruction about sacred duty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1176-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

