भक्ततूर्यम्
भक्त + -तूर्यम् a musical instrument played during meals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1179-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

