भट्टिनी
भट्टिनी<BR>—1 A queen (not crowned), a princess; (often used in dramas by maid-servants<BR> in addressing a queen).<BR>—2 A lady of high rank.<BR>—3 The wife of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1183-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

