भण्ड्|भंड्
भण्ड् I. €1 Ā. (भण्डते)<BR>—1 To chide, upbraid.<BR>—2 To mock, deride.<BR>—3 To speak.<BR>—4 To jest, joke. ━II. €10 U. (भण्डयति-ते)<BR>—1 To make fortunate.<BR>—2 To cheat (properly भण्ट्).<BR>—3 To be fortunate.<BR>—4 To do an auspicious act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1183-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

