भद्राकृति
भद्र + -आकार, -आकृति <i>a.</i> of auspicious features.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1184-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

