भस्
भस् <i>n.</i> Ashes; ददर्श तल्पेऽग्निमिवाहितं भसि Bhāg. 10. 6. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1188-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्
भस् I. €3 P. (बभस्ति)<BR>—1 To shine.<BR>—2 To revile, blame, abuse. ━II. €1 P. (भसति) To eat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1188-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस
