भसद्
भसद् <i>m.</i> [Uṇ. 1. 127]<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 Flesh.<BR>—3 A kind of duck.<BR>—4 Time.<BR>—5 A float (प्लव).<BR>—6 The hinder parts (said to be <i>f.</i> and <i>n.</i> also).<BR>—7 Pudendum muliebre.<BR>—8 A month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1188-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

