भस्मगुण्ठनम्
भस्मन् + -उद्धूलनम्, -गुण्ठनम् smearing the body with ashes; भस्मोद्धूलन<BR> भद्रमस्तु भवते K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

