भस्मन् + -गन्धा, -गन्धिका, -गन्धिनी a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

