भस्मन् + -गात्रः N. of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मचयः|भस्मचय
भस्मन् + -चयः a heap of ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मतूलम्
भस्मन् + -तूलम्<BR>—1 frost, snow.<BR>—2 a shower of dust.<BR>—3 a number of villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मप्रियः|भस्मप्रिय
भस्मन् + -प्रियः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मभूत
भस्मन् + -भूत <i>a.</i> dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्ममेहः|भस्ममेह
भस्मन् + -मेहः a sort of gravel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मरोगः|भस्मरोग
भस्मन् + -रोगः a kind of disease; cf. भस्माग्नि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मलेपनम्
भस्मन् + -लेपनम् smearing the body with ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मविधिः|भस्मविधि
भस्मन् + -विधिः any rite performed with ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मवेधकः|भस्मवेधक
भस्मन् + -वेधकः camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मशर्करः
भस्मन् + -शर्करः (probably) potash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मशायिन्
भस्मन् + -शायिन् <i>m.</i> N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मसूतकरणम्
भस्मन् + -सूत-करणम् calcining of quicksilver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मस्नानम्
भस्मन् + -स्नानम् purification by ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मता
भस्मता The state of ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मसात्
भस्मसात् <i>ind.</i> To the state of ashes; ˚कृ ‘to reduce to ashes’.<BR> ˚भू to be reduced to ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्माकृ
भस्मा(स्मी)कृ €8 U. To reduce to ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मीकृ
भस्मा(स्मी)कृ €8 U. To reduce to ashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मीकरणम्
भस्मीकरणम्<BR>—1 Reducing to ashes.<BR>—2 Completely consuming or burning.<BR>—3 Calcining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मीकृत
भस्मीकृत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Reduced to ashes.<BR>—2 Calcined (as a metal).<BR>—3 Powdered (चूर्णीकृत); तेनैव तोरणेनाथ यक्षस्तेनाभिताडितः ।<BR> नादृश्यत तदा यक्षो भस्मीकृततनुस्तदा ॥ Rām. 7. 14. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भस्मीभू
भस्मीभू €1 P.<BR>—1 To be reduced to ashes; भस्मीभूतस्य देहस्य पुनरागमनं कुतः Sarva. S.<BR>—2 To become worthless; भस्मीभूतेषु विप्रेषु मोहाद्दत्तानि दातृभिः (नश्यन्ति)<BR> Ms. 3. 97, 4. 188.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भा
भा €2 P. (भाति, भात; <i>caus.</i> भापयति-ते; <i>desid.</i> विभासति)<BR>—1 To shine, be bright or splendid, be luminous; पङ्कैर्विना सरो भाति<BR> सदः खलजनैर्विना । कटुवर्णैर्विना काव्यं मानसं विषयैर्विना Bv. 1. 116;<BR> समतीत्य भति जगती जगती Ki. 5. 20; R. 3. 18; भाति श्रीरमणावतारदशकं<BR> बाले भवत्याः स्तने Udb.<BR>—2 To seem, appear; बुभुक्षितं न प्रति भाति किंचित् Mbh.<BR>—3 To be, exist.<BR>—4 To be pleased.<BR>—5 To show oneself.<BR>—6 To blow; [the following verse gives different meanings of the verb:<BR> {@-बभौ@} मरुत्वान् विकृतः स-मुद्रो (to shine) {@बभौ@} मरुत्वान्<BR> विकृतः स-मुद्रः । (to be pleased) {@बभौ@} मरुत्वान् विकृतः<BR> समुद्रो (to be)<BR> {@-बभौ@} मरुत्वान् विकृतः स मुद्रः ॥ (to blow). Bk. 10. 19].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भा
भा [भा-अङ् टाप्]<BR>—1 Light, splendour, lustre, beauty; तत्र ताराधिपस्याभा ताराणां भा<BR> तथैव च । तयोराभरणाभा च ज्वलिता<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">Page1189-2</a>]<BR> द्यामभासयत् ॥ Rām. 6. 75. 51; तावद् भा भारवेर्भाति यावन्माघस्य नोदयः Udb.<BR>—2 A shadow, reflection.<BR>—3 Likeness, resemblance.<BR>—4 The shadow of a gnomon.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: भाकुटः, भाकूटः, भाकोशः, भाकोषः, भागणः, भानिकरः, भानेमिः, भामण्डलम्, भारूपः, भावनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाकुटः|भाकुट
भा + -कुटः, -कूटः a species of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाकूटः|भाकूट
भा + -कुटः, -कूटः a species of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाकोशः|भाकोश
भा + -कोशः, -कोषः the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाकोषः|भाकोष
भा + -कोशः, -कोषः the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागणः|भागण
भा + -गणः the whole group of constellations; करालदंष्ट्राभिरुदस्तभागणम्<BR> Bhāg. 4. 5. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भानिकरः|भानिकर
भा + -निकरः a mass of light, collection of rays.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भानेमिः|भानेमि
भा + -नेमिः the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भामण्डलम्
भा + -मण्डलम् a halo of light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भारूपः|भारूप
भा + -रूपः the soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भारूपम्
भा + -रूपः + .({@-पम्@}) Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भावनम्
भा + -वनम् a mass of rays or light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाःकर
भाःकर See भास्कर under भास्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाक्त|भाक्तं
भाक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Regularly fed by another, a dependant, retainer.<BR>—2 Fit for food.<BR>—3 Inferior, secondary (opp. मुख्य), often used in the Ś. B. in this sense.<BR>—4 Used in a secondary sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाक्तिकः|भाक्तिक
भाक्तिकः A retainer, dependant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाक्ष
भाक्ष <i>a.</i> (-क्षी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [भक्षा शीलमस्य अण्] Voracious, gluttonous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागः|भाग
भागः [भज् भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 A part, portion, share, division; as in भागहर, भागशः &c.<BR>—2 Allotment, distribution, partition.<BR>—3 Lot, fate; निर्माणभागः परिणतः U. 4.<BR>—4 A part of any whole, a fraction.<BR>—5 The numerator of a fraction.<BR>—6 A quarter, one-fourth part.<BR>—7 A degree or the 360th part of the circumference of a circle.<BR>—8 The 30th part of a zodiacal sign.<BR>—9 The quotient.<BR>—10 Room, space, spot, region, place; अयनेषु च सर्वेषु यथाभागमवस्थिताः<BR> Bg. 1. 11; R. 18. 47.<BR>—11 A portion payable to Government; सीता, भागो, बलिः, करो … … राष्ट्रम्<BR> Kau. A. 2. 6. 24.<BR>—12 One of the four contentments (Sāṅ. Phil.); आध्यात्मिकाश्चतस्रः<BR> प्रकृत्युपादानकालभागाख्याः (v. l. भाग्याख्याः) Sāṅ. K. 50.<BR>—13 A half-rupee. —14 The number eleven.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: भागानुबन्धजातिः, भागापवाहजातिः, भागापवाहनम्, भागापहारिन्, भागार्थिन्, भागार्ह, भागकल्पना, भागजातिः, भागधानम्, भागधेयम्, भागभाज्, भागभुज्, भागमातृ, भागलक्षणा, भागलेख्यम्, भागहरः, भागहारः, भागहारिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागानुबन्धजातिः|भागानुबन्धजाति
भागः + -अनुबन्धजातिः <i>f.</i> assimilation of quantities by fractional increase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागापवाहजातिः|भागापवाहजाति
भागः + -अपवाहजातिः, -अपवाहनम् <i>f.</i> assimilation of quantities by<BR> fractional decrease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागापवाहनम्
भागः + -अपवाहजातिः, -अपवाहनम् <i>f.</i> assimilation of quantities by<BR> fractional decrease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागापहारिन्
भागः + -अपहारिन् <i>a.</i> receiving a share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागार्थिन्
भागः + -अर्थिन् <i>a.</i> desirous of a share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागार्ह
भागः + -अर्ह <i>a.</i> entitled to a share or inheritance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागकल्पना
भागः + -कल्पना allotment of shares.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागजातिः|भागजाति
भागः + -जातिः <i>f.</i> reduction of fractions to a common denominator (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागधानम्
भागः + -धानम् a treasury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागधेयम्
भागः + -धेयम्<BR>—1 a share, part, portion; उच्छिष्टं भागधेयं स्याद्दर्भेषु विकिरश्च<BR> यः Ms. 3. 245; नीवारभागधेयोचितैर्मृगैः R. 1. 50.<BR>—2 fortune, destiny, luck.<BR>—3 good fortune or luck; तद् भागधेयं परमं पशूनाम् Bh. 2. 12.<BR>—4 property.<BR>—5 happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागधेयः|भागधेय|भागधेयं
भागः + -धेयम् + .({@-यः@})<BR>—1 a tax; अन्यमेव भागधेयमेते तपस्विनो निर्वपन्ति Ś. 2.<BR>—2 an heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागभाज्
भागः + -भाज् <i>a.</i> interested, a sharer or partner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागभुज्
भागः + -भुज् <i>m.</i> a king, sovereign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागमातृ
भागः + -मातृ <i>f.</i> (in alg.) a particular rule of division.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागलक्षणा
भागः + -लक्षणा a kind of लक्षणा or secondary use of a word by which<BR> it partly loses and partly retains its primary meaning; also called जहदजहल्लक्षणा;<BR> <i>e. g.</i> सोऽयं देवदत्तः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागलेख्यम्
भागः + -लेख्यम् a partition-deed; विभागपत्रं कुर्वन्ति भागलेख्यं तदुच्यते<BR> Śukra. 2. 297.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागहरः|भागहर
भागः + -हरः<BR>—1 a co-heir.<BR>—2 division (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागहारः|भागहार
भागः + -हारः division (in math.).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">Page1190-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1189-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागहारिन्
भागः + -हारिन् <i>a.</i> entitled to a share, inheriting. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 an heir.<BR>—2 division.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागकः|भागक
भागकः A divider.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागनम्
भागनम्<BR>—1 The period of the sunʼs passing through the signs of the zodiac.<BR>—2 The circumference of a great circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागशस्
भागशस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 In parts or portions, part by part.<BR>—2 According to the share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागिक|भागिकं
भागिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Relating to a part.<BR>—2 Forming a part.<BR>—3 Fractional.<BR>—4 Bearing interest; (भागिकं शतम् ‘one part in a hundred’, <i>i. e.</i><BR> one per cent; so भागिका विंशतिः &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागिन्
भागिन् <i>a.</i> [भाग-इनि]<BR>—1 Consisting of shares or parts.<BR>—2 Sharing, having a share; रूपस्य भागी भवति दृष्टमेतत्पुरातनैः Mb. 3. 84. 57.<BR>—3 Sharing or participating in, partaking of; as in दुःख˚.<BR>—4 Concerned in, affected by.<BR>—5 A possessor, owner; तस्येह भागिनौ दृष्टौ बीजी क्षेत्रिक एव च Ms. 9. 53.<BR>—6 Entitled to a share; औरसक्षेत्रजौ पुत्रौ पितृरिक्थस्य भागिनौ Ms. 9. 165;<BR> विड्जास्तु द्वपेकभागिनः Y. 2. 125.<BR>—7 Lucky, fortunate; शिवामृद्धां भागिनीं सुप्रसन्नाम् Mb. 13. 26. 86<BR> (com. भागिनीं भगानामैश्वर्यादीनां षण्णां समूहो भागं तद्वतीम्).<BR>—8 Inferior, secondary.<BR>—9 Highly useful. Hence भागित्वम् means ‘high utility’; भागित्वाद्वा<BR> गवां स्यात् MS. 10. 3. 47. [शबर explains भागित्वात् as भागवत्यो<BR> हि महाभागाः । महति उपकारे वर्तन्ते इत्यर्थः ।]. ━<i>m.</i> A co-heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागिनी
भागिन् + .{@-नी@} A co-heiress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागवत|भागवतं|भागवतः
भागवत <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> [भगवतः भगवत्या वा इदं सोऽस्य देवता वा अण्]<BR>—1 Relating to or worshipping Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 Pertaining to a god; कौमारादाचरेत् प्राज्ञो धर्मान् भागवतानिह<BR>—3 Holy, divine, sacred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागवतः|भागवत|भागवतं
भागवत + .{@-तः@} A follower or devotee of Viṣṇu or Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागवतम्
भागवत + .{@-तम्@} N. of one of the 18 Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागिनेयः|भागिनेय
भागिनेयः [भगिन्या अपत्यं ढक्] A sisterʼs son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागिनेयी
भागिनेयः + .{@-यी@} A sisterʼs daughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागीरथी
भागीरथी [भगीरथेन सानीता तेन भागीरथी स्मृता]<BR>—1 N. of the river Ganges; भागीरथीनिर्झरशीकराणाम् Ku. 1. 15.<BR>—2 N. of one of the three main branches of the Ganges; cf. भागीरथी<BR> भोगवती जाह्नवी त्रिजटेश्वरी । विष्णुपादाब्जसंभूता गङ्गा त्रिपथगामिनी ॥ Stotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भागुरिः|भागुरि
भागुरिः N. of a famous author of a Smṛti and Vyākaraṇa; वष्टि<BR> भागुरिरल्लोपमवाप्योरुपसर्गयोः Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्य|भाग्यं
भाग्य^1 <i>a.</i> [भज्-ण्यत् कुत्वम्]<BR>—1 To be divided, divisible.<BR>—2 Entitled to a share.<BR>—3 Forming a part.<BR>—4 Subject to fractional deduction.<BR>—5 Lucky, fortunate.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260429. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/187.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्यम्
भाग्य + .{@-ग्यम्^1@}<BR>—1 Fate, destiny, luck, fortune; स्त्रियाश्चरित्रं पुरुषस्य भाग्यं देवो<BR> न जानाति कुतो मनुष्यः Subhāṣ.; oft. in pl.; सा निन्दन्ती स्वानि भाग्यानि<BR> बाला Ś. 5. 30.<BR>—2 Good fortune or luck; R. 3. 13.<BR>—3 Prosperity, affluence; भाग्येष्वनुत्सेकिनी Ś. 4. 18.<BR>—4 Happiness, welfare. (भाग्येन fortunately, happily).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: भाग्यायत्त, भाग्योदयः, भाग्यर्क्षम्, भाग्यक्रमः, भाग्यपञ्चः, भाग्ययोगः, भाग्यविप्लवः, भाग्यवशात्, भाग्यसंक्षयः, भाग्यसंपद्<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260429. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/187.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्यायत्त
भाग्यम् + -आयत्त <i>a.</i> dependent on fate;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">Page1190-2</a>]<BR> भाग्यायत्तमतः परम् Ś. 4. 17; cf. also भाग्येषु शेषमायत्तं दृष्टपूर्वं<BR> न चान्यथा Pratijñā. 2. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्योदयः|भाग्योदय
भाग्यम् + -उदयः dawn of good fortune, lucky occurrence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्यर्क्षम्
भाग्यम् + -ऋक्षम् (भाग्यर्क्षम्) the asterism पूर्वाफल्गुनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्यक्रमः|भाग्यक्रम
भाग्यम् + -क्रमः course or turn of fortune; भाग्यक्रमेण हि धनानि भवन्ति<BR> यान्ति Mk. 1. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्यपञ्चः|भाग्यपञ्च
भाग्यम् + -पञ्चः a kind of pavilion; Vāstuvidyā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्ययोगः|भाग्ययोग
भाग्यम् + -योगः a lucky or fortunate juncture. {@रहित@} <i>a.</i> deserted<BR> by fortune, miserable; प्रायो गच्छति यत्र भाग्यरहितस्तत्रैव यान्त्यापदः Bh. 2. 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्यविप्लवः|भाग्यविप्लव
भाग्यम् + -विप्लवः ill-luck, adverseness of fate; अथवा मम भाग्यविप्लवादशनिः<BR> कल्पित एष वेधसा R. 8. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्यवशात्
भाग्यम् + -वशात् <i>ind.</i> through the will of fate, luckily, fortunately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्यसंक्षयः|भाग्यसङ्क्षय
भाग्यम् + -संक्षयः bad fortune, calamity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्यसंपद्|भाग्यसम्पद्
भाग्यम् + -संपद् good fortune, prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाग्यवत्|भाग्यवन्त्
भाग्यवत् <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Fortunate, blessed, happy.<BR>—2 Prosperous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाङ्ग|भांग
भाङ्ग <i>a.</i> (-ङ्गी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [भङ्गाया इदम् अण्] Made of hemp, hempen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाङ्गीनम्
भाङ्गीनम् [भङ्गाया भवनं क्षेत्रं घञ्] A field of hemp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाङ्गकः|भाङ्गक|भांगक|भांगकः
भाङ्गकः A tattered cloth, shred, rag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाज्
भाज् €10 U. To divide, distribute; see भज् <i>caus.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाज्
भाज् <i>a.</i> (Usually at the end of comp.)<BR>—1 Sharing or participating in, liable to. पाप˚; cf. न केवलं<BR> यो महतोऽपभाषते शृणोति तस्मादपि यः स पापभाक् Ku. 5. 83; दोष˚ guilty.<BR>—2 Having, enjoying, possessing, obtaining; सुख˚, रिक्थ˚.<BR>—3 Entitled to.<BR>—4 Feeling, experiencing, being sensible of.<BR>—5 Devoting oneself to.<BR>—6 Living in, inhabiting, dwelling in; as in कुहरभाज् (U. 2. 21.);<BR> दरीभाज् &c.<BR>—7 Going or resorting to, seeking.<BR>—8 Worshipping.<BR>—9 Falling to the lot of.<BR>—10 What must be done, a duty (कर्तव्य); (व्यरंसीत्) कृताऽकृतेभ्यः<BR> क्षितिपालभाग्भ्यः Bk. 3. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाजक्
भाजक् <i>ind.</i> Quickly, swiftly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाजकः|भाजक
भाजकः [भाज्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Dividing.<BR>—2 (In arith.) A divisor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाजनम्
भाजनम् [भाज्यतेऽनेन भाज्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Sharing, dividing.<BR>—2 Division (in arith.).<BR>—3 A vessel, pot, cup, plate; पुष्पभाजनम् Ś. 4; R. 5. 22.<BR>—4 (Fig.) A receptacle, recipient, repository; स श्रियो भाजनं नरः<BR> Pt. 1. 243; कल्याणानां त्वमसि महतां भाजनं विश्वमूर्ते Māl. 1. 3;<BR> ऐहिकस्य सुखस्याभाजनमयं जनः Dk.; U. 3. 15; M. 5. 8.<BR>—5 A fit or deserving person, a fit object or person; भवादृशा एव भवन्ति<BR> भाजनान्युपदेशानाम् K. 108; गुरुणा ज्ञानसर्वस्वे सन्तोषाद्भाजनीकृतः Bm. 1. 40.<BR>—6 Representation.<BR>—7 A measure equal to 64 <i>palas</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाजनलेखितम्
भाजनम् + .{@-लेखितम्@} A variety of diamonds capable of scratching on the surface<BR> of vessels; Kau. A. 2. 11. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाजनलोकः|भाजनलोक
भाजनम् + .{@-लोकः@} the world of inanimate things (opp. to सत्त्वलोक); Buddh.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: भाजनविषमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाजनविषमः
भाजनम् + -विषमः One of the ways of embezzlement, namely use of false<BR> cubic measures such as भाजन; Kau. A. 2. 8. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाजित|भाजितं
भाजित <i>a.</i> Shared, divided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाजितम्
भाजित + .{@-तम्@} A share, portion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1190-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाजिन्
भाजिन् <i>m.</i> [भज्-णिनि] A servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाजी
भाजी<BR>—1 Rice, gruel.<BR>—2 A kind of seasoned food; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाज्य|भाज्यं
भाज्य <i>a.</i> [भज्-ण्यत्] Divisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाज्यम्
भाज्य + .{@-ज्यम्@}<BR>—1 A portion, share.<BR>—2 An inheritance.<BR>—3 (In arith.) The dividend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाटम्
भाटम्, भाटकम् Wages, hire, rent; गृहवाप्यापणादीनि गृहीत्वा<BR> भाटकेन यः । स्वामिनो नार्पयेद् यावत् तावद् दाप्यः स भाटकम् ॥ Vṛddhamanu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाटकम्
भाटम्, भाटकम् Wages, hire, rent; गृहवाप्यापणादीनि गृहीत्वा<BR> भाटकेन यः । स्वामिनो नार्पयेद् यावत् तावद् दाप्यः स भाटकम् ॥ Vṛddhamanu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाटिः|भाटि
भाटिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Wages, hire.<BR>—2 The earnings of harlots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाट्टः|भाट्ट
भाट्टः [भट्टस्यानुयायी, अण्] A follower of Bhaṭṭa, a follower<BR> of that school of the Mīmāṃsā philosophy which was founded by Kumārila Bhaṭṭa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाणः|भाण
भाणः, भाणिका A species of dramatic composition; in it only<BR> one character is introduced on the stage which supplies the place of interlocutors<BR> by a copious use of आकाशभाषित q. v.; भाणः स्याद्धूर्तचरितो नानावस्थान्तरात्मकः ।<BR> एकाङ्क एक एवात्र निपुणः पण्डितो विटः ॥ S. D. 513; see the next<BR> stanzas also; <i>e. g.</i> वसन्ततिलक, मुकुन्दानन्द, लीलामधुकर &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाणिका
भाणः, भाणिका A species of dramatic composition; in it only<BR> one character is introduced on the stage which supplies the place of interlocutors<BR> by a copious use of आकाशभाषित q. v.; भाणः स्याद्धूर्तचरितो नानावस्थान्तरात्मकः ।<BR> एकाङ्क एक एवात्र निपुणः पण्डितो विटः ॥ S. D. 513; see the next<BR> stanzas also; <i>e. g.</i> वसन्ततिलक, मुकुन्दानन्द, लीलामधुकर &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाणकः|भाणक
भाणकः A declarer, proclaimer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डम्
भाण्डम् [भाण्ड्-अच् भण्-ड खार्थे अण् वा Tv.]<BR>—1 A vessel, pot, utensil (plate, dish, can &c.); ब्रह्मा येन कुलालवन्नियमितो<BR> ब्रह्माण्डभाण्डोदरे Bh. 2. 95; नीलीभाण्डम् ‘an indigo-vat’; so क्षीरभाण्डम्<BR> ‘milk-pail’; सुरा˚, मद्य˚ &c.<BR>—2 A box, trunk, chest, case; क्षुरभाण्डम् Pt. 1.<BR>—3 Any tool or instrument, an implement.<BR>—4 A musical instrument; वेणानां भाण्डवादनम् Ms. 10. 49.<BR>—5 Goods, wares, merchandise, shop-keeperʼs stock; भाण्डपूर्णानि यानानि<BR> तार्यं दाप्यानि सारतः Ms. 8. 405; मथुरागामीनि भाण्डानि Pt. 1.<BR>—6 A bale of goods.<BR>—7 (Fig.) Any valued possession, treasure; शान्तं वा रघुनन्दने तदुभयं<BR> तत्पुत्रभाण्डं हि मे U. 4. 24.<BR>—8 The bed of a river.<BR>—9 Trappings or harness of a horse; नानाङ्कचिह्नैर्नवहेमभाण्डैः Bu. C. 2. 4.<BR>—10 Buffoonery, mimicry (from भण्ड).<BR>—11 An ornament in general; नानाविकृतसंस्थानं वाजिभाण्डपरिच्छदम् ।<BR> गजग्रैवेयकक्ष्याश्च रथभाण्डांश्च संस्कृतान् ॥ Rām. 6. 75. 10.<BR>—12 Paraphernalia (उपकरणजातम्); आभिषेचनिकं भाण्डं कृत्वा<BR> Rām. 2. 19. 31.<BR>—13 Capital (मूलधन); सोऽपि दृष्ट्वैव तं विप्रमायान्तं भाण्डजीवनः<BR> Mb. 12. 261. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्ण्डाः
भाण्डम् + .{@-ण्डाः@} (<i>m.</i> pl.) Wares, merchandise.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: भाण्डागारः, भाण्डागारः, भाण्डागारम्, भाण्डागारिकः, भाण्डगोपकः, भाण्डपतिः, भाण्डपुटः, भाण्डपुष्पः, भाण्डप्रतिभाण्डकम्, भाण्डभरकः, भाण्डमूल्यम्, भाण्डवादनम्, भाण्डशाला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डागारः|भाण्डागार|भांडागार
भाण्डम् + -अगारः, -आगारः, -आगारम्<BR>—1 a store-house, store-room (lit. where household goods and utensils<BR> &c. are kept); भाण्डागाराण्यकृत विदुषां सा स्वयं भोगभाञ्जि Vikr. 18. 45.<BR>—2 treasury; ज्ञान˚.<BR>—3 a collection, store, magazine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डागारः|भाण्डागार|भांडागार
भाण्डम् + -अगारः, -आगारः, -आगारम्<BR>—1 a store-house, store-room (lit. where household goods and utensils<BR> &c. are kept); भाण्डागाराण्यकृत विदुषां सा स्वयं भोगभाञ्जि Vikr. 18. 45.<BR>—2 treasury; ज्ञान˚.<BR>—3 a collection, store, magazine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डागारम्
भाण्डम् + -अगारः, -आगारः, -आगारम्<BR>—1 a store-house, store-room (lit. where household goods and utensils<BR> &c. are kept); भाण्डागाराण्यकृत विदुषां सा स्वयं भोगभाञ्जि Vikr. 18. 45.<BR>—2 treasury; ज्ञान˚.<BR>—3 a collection, store, magazine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डागारिकः|भाण्डागारिक
भाण्डम् + -आगारिकः<BR>—1 a storekeeper.<BR>—2 a treasurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डगोपकः|भाण्डगोपक
भाण्डम् + -गोपकः the keeper of vessels (in a temple); Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डपतिः|भाण्डपति|भांडपति
भाण्डम् + -पतिः a merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डपुटः|भाण्डपुट|भांडपुट
