भाण्डपुष्पः|भाण्डपुष्प
भाण्डम् + -पुष्पः a sort of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

