भाण्डम् + -प्रतिभाण्डकम् barter, computation of the exchange of goods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डभरकः|भाण्डभरक
भाण्डम् + -भरकः the contents of a vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डमूल्यम्
