भाण्डवादनम्
भाण्डम् + -वादनम् playing on a musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

