भाण्डकम्
भाण्डकः, -कम्<BR> A small vessel, cup.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डकम्
