भाण्डिकः, -लः<BR> A barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डिलः|भाण्डिल|भांडिल|भांडिलः
भाण्डिकः, -लः<BR> A barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डिका
भाण्डिका An implement, a tool, utensil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डिनी|भांडिनी
भाण्डिनी A chest, basket; सन्ति निष्कसहस्रस्य भाण्डिन्यो भरिताः<BR> शुभाः Mb. 2. 61. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाण्डीरः|भाण्डीर|भांडीर|भांडीरः
भाण्डीरः The Indian fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भात|भातं|भातः
भात <i>p. p.</i> [भा-क्त] Shining, brilliant, bright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भातः|भात|भातं
भात + .{@-तः@} Dawn, morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भातिः|भाति
भातिः <i>f.</i> [भा-क्तिच्]<BR>—1 Light, brightness, lustre, splendour.<BR>—2 Perception, knowledge (ज्ञान or प्रतीति); निरूपितेयं त्रिविधा<BR> निर्मूला भातिरात्मनि Bhāg. 11. 28. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भातुः|भातु
भातुः The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाद्रः|भाद्र
भाद्रः, भाद्रपदः [भद्राभिर्युक्ता पौर्णमासी भाद्री सा यस्मिन्<BR> मासे अण्] N. of a lunar month (corresponding to August-September); भाद्रद्वये<BR> सागरे Jyotiṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाद्रपदः|भाद्रपद
भाद्रः, भाद्रपदः [भद्राभिर्युक्ता पौर्णमासी भाद्री सा यस्मिन्<BR> मासे अण्] N. of a lunar month (corresponding to August-September); भाद्रद्वये<BR> सागरे Jyotiṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाद्राः
भाद्रः, भाद्रपदः + .{@-दाः@} (<i>f.</i> pl.) N. of the 25th and 26th lunar mansions (पूर्वाभाद्रपदा<BR> and उत्तराभाद्रपदा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1191-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भाद्रपदी
