भिन्नसंहति
भिन्न + -संहति <i>a.</i> disunited, dissolved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिन्नसंकलनम्
