भिन्नस्वर
भिन्न + -स्वर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having a changed voice, faltering.<BR>—2 discordant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

