भिन्नहृदय
भिन्न + -हृदय <i>a.</i> pierced through the heart; बाणभिन्नहृदया निपेतुषी R. 11. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिन्नकः|भिन्नक
भिन्नकः<BR>—1 A Buddhist.<BR>—2 N. of a musical mode or Rāga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिरिण्टिका|भिरिंटिका
