भिल्लः|भिल्ल
भिल्लः N. of a wild tribe (who lives in the Vindhya hills, in the<BR> forests of Mālawa, Mewar, Khandesha and the Deccan); मलये भिल्लपुरन्ध्री<BR> चन्दनतरुकाष्ठमिन्धनं कुरुते Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिल्ली
भिल्लः + .{@-ल्ली@}<BR>—1 The <i>lodhra</i> tree.<BR>—2 A woman of the Bhil tribe; भिल्ली पल्लवशङ्कया वितनुते सान्द्रद्रुम … Udb.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: भिल्लगवी, भिल्लतरुः, भिल्लभूषणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

