भिषज्
भिषज् <i>m.</i> [बिभेत्यस्मात् रोगः, भी-षुक् ह्रस्वश्च Uṇ. 1. 134]<BR>—1 A physician, doctor; भिषजामसाध्यम् R. 8. 93; गतस्पृहो<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-2" target="_blank">Page1199-2</a>]<BR> धैर्यधरः कृपालुः शुद्धोऽधिकारी भिषगीदृशः स्यात् ।<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 Medicine, a remedy. ━<i>m.</i> <i>dual</i> The two Aśvins (physicians of gods).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: भिषग्जितम्, भिषक्पाशः, भिषक्प्रिया, भिषङ्मातृ, भिषग्वरः, भिषग्वरा, भिषग्विद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषग्जितम्
भिषज् + -जितम् a drug or medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषक्पाशः|भिषक्पाश
भिषज् + -पाशः a quack doctor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषक्प्रिया
भिषज् + -प्रिया <i>f.</i> A species of moon-seed (Mar. गुळवेल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषङ्मातृ
भिषज् + -मातृ <i>f.</i> N. of a plant. (Mar. अडुळसा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषग्वरः|भिषग्वर
भिषज् + -वरः an excellent physician.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषग्वरौ
भिषज् + -वरः + .({@-रौ@}) the two Aśvins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषग्वरा
भिषज् + -वरा N. of a plant (Mar. हिरडा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषग्विद्
भिषज् + -विद् <i>m.</i> a physician.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भिषजावर्तः|भिषजावर्त|भिषजावर्त्त
