भिषज्यम्
भिषज्यम्<BR>—1 Healing, curing.<BR>—2 A remedy, cure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1199-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

