भीमदर्शन
भीम + -दर्शन, -मुख <i>a.</i> frightful in appearance, hideous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1200-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भीममुख
भीम + -दर्शन, -मुख <i>a.</i> frightful in appearance, hideous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1200-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भीमनाद|भीमनादः
