भीमनादः|भीमनाद
भीम + -नाद + .({@-दः@})<BR>—1 a loud or dreadful sound; भीमनादमयमाहतोच्चकैः Śi. 15. 10.<BR>—2 a lion.<BR>—3 N. of one of the seven clouds that will appear at the destruction of the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1200-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भीमपराक्रम|भीमपराक्रमः
भीम + -पराक्रम <i>a.</i> of terrific prowess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1200-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भीमपराक्रमः|भीमपराक्रम
भीम + -पराक्रम + .({@-मः@}) N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1200-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

