भीमरथः|भीमरथ
भीम + -रथः<BR>—1 N. of one of the sons of Dhṛtarāṣṭra.<BR>—2 N. of one of the kings born in the family of Dhanvantarī and in the<BR> family of Daśārha.<BR>—3 N. of one of the sons of Śrīkṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1200-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भीमरथी
भीम + -रथी<BR>—1 N. of the 7th night in the 7th month of the 77th year of a manʼs life<BR> (said to be a very dangerous period); (सप्तसप्ततितमे वर्षे सप्तमे<BR> मासि सप्तमी । रात्रिर्भीमरथी नाम नराणामतिदुस्तरा).<BR>—2 N. of a river in the Himālayas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1200-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भीमरूप
