भीम + -विक्रान्त + .({@-तः@}) a lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1200-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

