भीमा<BR>—1 An epithet of Durgā.<BR>—2 A kind of perfume (रोचना).<BR>—3 A whip.<BR>—4 N. of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1200-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

