भुण्ड् €1 Ā. (भुण्डते)<BR>—1 To support, maintain.<BR>—2 To select.<BR>—3 To take.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1202-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

