भुवनकोशः|भुवनकोश
भुवनम् + -कोशः the receptacle of beings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1202-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भुवनतलम्
भुवनम् + -तलम् the surface of the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1202-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

