भुवनम् + -शासिन् <i>m.</i> a king, ruler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1202-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

