भुवन्युः|भुवन्यु
भुवन्युः [भू-कन्युच्]<BR>—1 A master, lord.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR>—3 Fire.<BR>—4 The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1202-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भुवर्
भुवर्, -भुवस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 The atmosphere, ether (the second of the three worlds, the one immediately<BR> above the earth).<BR>—2 A mystic word, one of the three Vyāhṛtis, (भूर्भुवःस्वः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1202-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भुवस्
भुवर्, -भुवस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 The atmosphere, ether (the second of the three worlds, the one immediately<BR> above the earth).<BR>—2 A mystic word, one of the three Vyāhṛtis, (भूर्भुवःस्वः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1202-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भुविस्
भुविस् <i>m.</i> The ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1202-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भुविस्थ
भुविस्थ(ष्ठ) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Standing on the earth (not in a chariot).<BR>—2 Dwelling on earth (not in heaven).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1202-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

