भूः + -उत्तमम् gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूकदम्बः|भूकदम्ब|भूकदंब
भूः + -कदम्बः a kind of Kadamba tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूकम्पः|भूकम्प|भूकंप
