भूकर्णः|भूकर्ण
भूः + -कर्णः the diameter of the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूकश्यपः|भूकश्यप
