भूकाकः|भूकाक
भूः + -काकः<BR>—1 a kind of heron.<BR>—2 the curlew.<BR>—3 a kind of pigeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूकेशः|भूकेश
