भूगरम्
भूः + -गरम् a particular poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूगर्भः|भूगर्भ
भूः + -गर्भः<BR>—1 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 an epithet of Bhavabhūti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूगृहम्
भूः + -गृहम्, -गेहम् a cellar, a room underground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूगेहम्
भूः + -गृहम्, -गेहम् a cellar, a room underground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूगोलः|भूगोल
भूः + -गोलः the terrestrial globe; दधौ कण्ठे हालाहलमखिलभूगोलकृपया<BR> Ā. L. 17; भूगोलमुद्बिभ्रते Gīt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

