भूचर|भूचरः
भूः + -चर <i>a.</i> moving or living on land.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूचरः|भूचर
भूः + -चर + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 any land-animal (opp. जलचर).<BR>—2 epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूचर्या
भूः + -चर्या, -छाया, -छायम्<BR>—1 earthʼs shadow (vulgarly called Rāhu).<BR>—2 darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

