भूः + -चर्या, -छाया, -छायम्<BR>—1 earthʼs shadow (vulgarly called Rāhu).<BR>—2 darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूच्छायम्
भूः + -चर्या, -छाया, -छायम्<BR>—1 earthʼs shadow (vulgarly called Rāhu).<BR>—2 darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूजन्तुः|भूजन्तु|भूजंतु
भूः + -जन्तुः<BR>—1 a kind of earth-worm.<BR>—2 an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

