भूस्तृणः|भूस्तृण|भूस्तृणं
भूः + -तृणः, भूस्तृणः a kind of fragrant grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूदारः|भूदार
भूः + -दारः a hog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूदेवः|भूदेव
भूः + -देवः, -सुरः a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूसुरः|भूसुर
भूः + -देवः, -सुरः a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूधनः|भूधन
भूः + -धनः a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूधर|भूधरः
भूः + -धर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 holding or supporting the earth; व्यादिश्यते भूधरतामवेक्ष्य कृष्णेन<BR> देहोद्वहनाय<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1204-1" target="_blank">Page1204-1</a>]<BR> शेषः Ku. 3. 13.<BR>—2 dwelling on the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूधरः|भूधर
भूः + -धर + -रः + ({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a mountain; भवभूतेः संबन्धाद् भूधरभूरेव भारती भाति Udb.<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—3 of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—4 the number ‘seven’.<BR>—5 a king; स त्वं भूधर भूतानाम् Bhāg. 10. 37. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

