भूधरराजः|भूधरराज
भूः + -धरः + ˚ईश्वरः, ˚राजः an epithet of the mountain<BR> Himālaya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1203-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भूधरजः|भूधरज
