भृगुवारः|भृगुवार
भृगुः + -वारः, -वासरः Friday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृगुवासरः|भृगुवासर
भृगुः + -वारः, -वासरः Friday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

