भृगुः + -शार्दूलः, -श्रेष्ठः, -सत्तमः epithets of Paraśurāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृगुश्रेष्ठः|भृगुश्रेष्ठ
भृगुः + -शार्दूलः, -श्रेष्ठः, -सत्तमः epithets of Paraśurāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

