भृगुसूनुः|भृगुसूनु
भृगुः + -सुतः, -सूनुः<BR>—1 an epithet of Paraśurāma.<BR>—2 of Venus or Śukra; भृगुसूनुधरापुत्रौ शशिजेन समन्वितौ Mb. 9. 11. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृगुकः|भृगुक
भृगुकः N. of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृङ्गः|भृङ्ग|भृंग|भृङ्गं|भृंगः
भृङ्गः [भृ-गन् कित् नुट् च Uṇ. 1. 122.]<BR>—1 A large black bee; मञ्जु गुञ्जन्तु भृङ्गाः Bv. 1. 5; R. 8. 53.<BR>—2 A kind of wasp.<BR>—3 A kind of bird.<BR>—4 A libertine, dissolute or lecherous man; cf. भ्रमर.<BR>—5 A golden vase or jar.<BR>—6 The fork-tailed shrike.<BR>—7 A kind of measure (in music).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1209-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

