भृशम्
भृश + .{@-शम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Much, very much, exceedingly, intensely, violently, excessively, in<BR> a high degree, greatly; तमवेक्ष्य रुरोद सा भृशम् Ku. 4. 26; रघुर्भृशं<BR> वक्षसि तेन ताडितः R. 3. 61; चुकोप तस्मै स भृशम् 3. 56; Ms. 7. 170;<BR> Ṛs. 1. 11.<BR>—2 Often, repeatedly.<BR>—3 In a better or superior manner.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: भृशकोपन, भृशदण्ड, भृशदुःखित, भृशपीडित, भृशसंहृष्ट<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

