भृशपीडित
भृश + -दुःखित, -पीडित <i>a.</i> exceedingly afflicted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृशसंहृष्ट
