भृशायते
भृशायते Den. Ā. To become powerful or strong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भृष्ट|भृष्टः
