भृष्टान्नम्
भृष्ट + -अन्नम् rice boiled and fried.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

