भॄ €9 P. (भृणाति)<BR>—1 To bear, nourish, support, maintain.<BR>—2 To fry.<BR>—3 To blame, censure.<BR>—4 To bend, be crooked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भेकः|भेक
भेकः [भी कन् कस्य नेत्वम्; Uṇ. 3. 43]<BR>—1 A frog; पङ्के निमग्ने करिणि भेको भवति मूर्धगः.<BR>—2 A timid man.<BR>—3 A cloud; तेजः सद्यो बलकरो भ्रमतृड् दाहमेहनुत् । स्वापकुष्ठच्छर्दिनाशी<BR> भेकस्तु परिकीर्तितः ॥ Rājanighaṇṭu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भेकी
भेकः + .{@-की@}<BR>—1 A small frog.<BR>—2 A female frog.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: भेकभुज्, भेकरवः, भेकशब्दः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

