भेडः [भी-ड तस्य नेत्वम्]<BR>—1 A ram, sheep.<BR>—2 A raft, float.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1210-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

