भेण्डा, -ण्डी<BR> Abelmoschus Esculentus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भेण्डी
भेण्डा, -ण्डी<BR> Abelmoschus Esculentus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1210-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

