भ्रूकुटिः|भ्रूकुटि
भ्रू + -कुटिः, -कुटी <i>f.</i> contraction or knitting of the eyebrows, a<BR> frown. ˚बन्धः, ˚रचना bending or knitting the eyebrows; ˚मुखम्<BR> a frowning face; भ्रूकुटिं बन्ध् or रच् ‘to knit the eyebrows, to frown’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

