भ्रूण्
भ्रूण् €10 Ā. (भ्रूणयते)<BR>—1 To hope.<BR>—2 To trust, confide.<BR>—3 To wish, desire.<BR>—4 To fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूणः|भ्रूण
भ्रूणः [भ्रूण्-घञ्]<BR>—1 An embryo, foetus; सर्वा भ्रूणान्यारुषी Rv. 10. 155. 2.<BR>—2 A child, boy; उद्यम्य शस्त्रमायातं भ्रूणमप्याततायिनम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-2" target="_blank">Page1217-2</a>]<BR> Śukra. 4. 1149.<BR>—3 A very learned Brāhmaṇa; भ्रूणहाऽभ्रूणहा (भवति) Bṛ. Up. 4. 3. 22;<BR> तस्य साधोरपापस्य भ्रूणस्य ब्रह्मवादिनः । कथं वधं यथा<BR> बभ्रोर्मन्यते सन्मतो भवान् ॥ Bhāg. 9. 9. 32.<BR>—4 A pregnant woman (गर्भिणी).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: भ्रूणघ्न, भ्रूणहन्, भ्रूणहतिः, भ्रूणहत्या, भ्रूणहन्तृ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूणघ्न
भ्रूणः + -घ्न, -हन् <i>a.</i> one who procures or causes abortion. —2 one who<BR> kills a learned Brāhmaṇa; अपि भ्रूणहणं मासात् पुनन्त्यहरहः कृताः Ms. 11. 248.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूणहन्
भ्रूणः + -घ्न, -हन् <i>a.</i> one who procures or causes abortion. —2 one who<BR> kills a learned Brāhmaṇa; अपि भ्रूणहणं मासात् पुनन्त्यहरहः कृताः Ms. 11. 248.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूणहतिः|भ्रूणहति
भ्रूणः + -हतिः, -हत्या killing an embryo, causing abortion; भ्रूणहत्यां<BR> वा एते घ्रन्ति; Trisuparṇa 2; Y. 1. 64.<BR>—2 the killing of a learned Brāhmaṇa; भ्रूणहत्यामसि प्राप्ता Rām. 2. 74. 4<BR> (com. शाखाध्येतृब्रह्महत्यां प्राप्तासि); अल्पेन तृषितो द्रुह्यन्<BR> भ्रूणहत्यां न बुध्यते Mb. 12. 26. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूणहत्या
भ्रूणः + -हतिः, -हत्या killing an embryo, causing abortion; भ्रूणहत्यां<BR> वा एते घ्रन्ति; Trisuparṇa 2; Y. 1. 64.<BR>—2 the killing of a learned Brāhmaṇa; भ्रूणहत्यामसि प्राप्ता Rām. 2. 74. 4<BR> (com. शाखाध्येतृब्रह्महत्यां प्राप्तासि); अल्पेन तृषितो द्रुह्यन्<BR> भ्रूणहत्यां न बुध्यते Mb. 12. 26. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रूणहन्तृ
भ्रूणः + -हन्तृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 the killer of an embryo.<BR>—2 any mean murderer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

भ्रेज्
