भ्रेषः|भ्रेष
भ्रेषः<BR>—1 Moving, motion.<BR>—2 Tottering, wavering, slipping.<BR>—3 Deviation, swerving, aberration.<BR>—4 Deviation from rectitude, trespass, sin.<BR>—5 Loss, deprivation; क्रतुभ्रेषस्त्वत्तः क्रतुफलविधानव्यसनिनः<BR> Śivamahimna 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

