मः|म
मः<BR>—1 Time.<BR>—2 Poison.<BR>—3 A magical formula.<BR>—4 The moon.<BR>—5 N. of Brahman; मकारेणोच्यते ब्रह्मा.<BR>—6 Of Viṣṇu.<BR>—7 Of Śiva.<BR>—8 Of Yama.<BR>—9 (In prosody) A syllabic foot (गण) consisting of three long syllables;<BR> मो भूमिस्त्रिगुरु श्रियं दिशति यः V. Ratn.<BR>—10 N. of the fifth (मध्यम) note in music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मम्
