मंह्
मंह् €1 Ā. (मंहते)<BR>—1 To grow, increase.<BR>—2 To give, grant.<BR>—3 To speak.<BR>—4 To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मंहनीय
