मकमकाय
मकमकाय Den. Ā. (मकमकायते) To croak (as a frog); Kāv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरः|मकर
मकरः [मं विषं किरति कॄ-अच् Tv.]<BR>—1 A kind of sea-animal, a crocodile, shark; झषाणां मकरश्चास्मि<BR> Bg. 10. 31; मकरवक्त्र Bh. 2. 4. (Makara is regarded as an emblem<BR> of Cupid; cf. comps. below).<BR>—2 The sign <i>Capricornus</i> of the zodiac.<BR>—3 An array of troops in the form of a Makara; दण्डव्यूहेन तन्मार्गं<BR> यायात्तु शकटेन वा । वराहमकराभ्यां वा … Ms. 7. 187; Śukra. 4. 1100.<BR>—4 An ear-ring in the shape of a Makara.<BR>—5 The hands folded in the form of a Makara.<BR>—6 N. of one of the nine treasures of Kubera.<BR>—7 The tenth arc of thirty degrees in any circle.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मकराङ्कः, मकराश्वः, मकराकरः, मकरावासः, मकरालयः, मकरासनम्, मकरकुण्डलम्, मकरकेतनः, मकरकेतुः, मकरकेतुमत्, मकरध्वजः, मकरराशिः, मकरवाहनः, मकरसंक्रमणम्, मकरसप्तमी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकराङ्कः|मकराङ्क|मकरांक
मकरः + -अङ्कः an epithet of<BR>—1 the god of love.<BR>—2 the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकराश्वः|मकराश्व
मकरः + -अश्वः an epithet of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकराकरः|मकराकर
मकरः + -आकरः, -आवासः the ocean; प्रविश्य मकरावासं यादोगणनिषेवितम् Mb. 7. 11. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरावासः|मकरावास
मकरः + -आकरः, -आवासः the ocean; प्रविश्य मकरावासं यादोगणनिषेवितम् Mb. 7. 11. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरालयः|मकरालय
मकरः + -आलयः<BR>—1 the ocean. —2 a symbolical expression for the number ‘four’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरासनम्
मकरः + -आसनम् a kind of Āsana in yoga; मकरासनमावक्ष्ये वायूनां<BR> स्तम्भकारणात् । पृष्ठे पादद्वयं बद्ध्वा हस्ताभ्यां पृष्ठबन्धनम् ॥ Rudrayāmala.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मकरकुण्डलम्
मकरः + -कुण्डलम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1218-1" target="_blank">Page1218-1</a>]<BR> an ear-ring in the shape of a Makara; हेमाङ्गदलसद्बाहुः स्फुरन्मकरकुण्डलः<BR> (रराज) Bhāg. 8. 15. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1217-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

