मकरकेतुः|मकरकेतु
मकरः + -केतनः, -केतुः, -केतुमत् <i>m.</i> epithets of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1218-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

