मकरध्वजः|मकरध्वज
मकरः + -ध्वजः —1 an epithet of the god of love; संप्राप्तं मकरध्वजेन<BR> मथनं त्वत्तो मदर्थे पुरा Ratn. 1. 3; तत्प्रेमवारि मकरध्वजतापहारि C. P. 41.<BR>—2 a particular array of troops.<BR>—3 the sea.<BR>—4 a particular medical preparation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1218-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

