मकरन्दः|मकरन्द|मकरंदः
मकरन्दः [मकरमपि द्यति कामजनकत्वात् दो-अवखन्डने क पृषो˚ मुम् Tv.]<BR>—1 The honey of flowers, flower-juice; निषिद्धैरप्येभिर्लुलितमकरन्दो<BR> मधुकरैः Ve. 1. 1; मकरन्दतुन्दिलानामरविन्दानामयं महामान्यः Bv. 1. 6, 8.<BR>—2 A kind of jasmine.<BR>—3 The cuckoo.<BR>—4 A bee.<BR>—5 A kind of fragrant mango tree.<BR>—6 (In music) A kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1218-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

