मङ्गली
मङ्गल + .{@-ला, -ली@}<BR>—1 A faithful wife<BR>—2 Dūrvā grass.<BR>—3 N. of Durgā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मङ्गलाक्षताः, मङ्गलागरु, मङ्गलायनम्, मङ्गलालंकृत, मङ्गलाष्टकम्, मङ्गलाह्निकम्, मङ्गलाचरणम्, मङ्गलाचारः, मङ्गलातोद्यम्, मङ्गलादेशवृत्तिः, मङ्गलारम्भः, मङ्गलालम्भनम्, मङ्गलालयः, मङ्गलावासः, मङ्गलावह, मङ्गलेच्छा, मङ्गलेच्छु, मङ्गलकरणम्, मङ्गलकलशः, मङ्गलकारक, मङ्गलकारिन्, मङ्गलकार्यम्, मङ्गलकालः, मङ्गलक्षौमम्, मङ्गलगृहम्, मङ्गलग्रहः, मङ्गलघटः, मङ्गलपात्रम्, मङ्गलचण्डिका, मङ्गलचण्डी, मङ्गलच्छायः, मङ्गलतूर्यम्, मङ्गलदेवता, मङ्गलध्वनिः, मङ्गलपत्रम्, मङ्गलपाठकः, मङ्गलपुष्पम्, मङ्गलपूजित, मङ्गलप्रतिसरः, मङ्गलप्रद, मङ्गलप्रस्थः, मङ्गलभेरी, मङ्गलमात्रभूषण, मङ्गलमालिका, मङ्गलवचस्, मङ्गलवादिन्, मङ्गलवाद्यम्, मङ्गलवारः, मङ्गलवासरः, मङ्गलविधिः, मङ्गलवृषभः, मङ्गलशब्दः, मङ्गलसमालम्भनम्, मङ्गलसूत्रम्, मङ्गलस्नानम्, मङ्गलस्वरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलाक्षताः
मङ्गल + -अक्षताः (<i>m.</i> pl.) rice thrown over persons by Brāhmaṇas<BR> when pronouncing<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">Page1219-2</a>]<BR> blessings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलागरु
मङ्गल + -अगरु <i>n.</i> a variety of sandal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलायनम्
मङ्गल + -अयनम् the way to happiness or prosperity; परममङ्गलायनगुणकथनोऽसि<BR> Bhāg. 5. 3. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलालंकृत
मङ्गल + -अलंकृत <i>a.</i> decorated with auspicious ornaments; आददे<BR> वचसामन्ते मङ्गलालंकृतां सुताम् Ku. 6. 87; M. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलाष्टकम्
मङ्गल + -अष्टकम् a benedictory verse or verses repeated by priests over<BR> a youth and maiden, when being married, to promote their good luck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलाह्निकम्
मङ्गल + -अह्निकम्<BR>—1 any daily religious rite performed for good luck.<BR>—2 a vase full of water carried in front of a procession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलाचरणम्
मङ्गल + -आचरणम्<BR>—1 an auspicious introduction in the form of a prayer (for the attainment<BR> of success) at the beginning of any undertaking or of any work of composition.<BR>—2 pronouncing a blessing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलाचारः|मङ्गलाचार|मंगलाचार
मङ्गल + -आचारः<BR>—1 an auspicious or pious ceremony or usage.<BR>—2 a benediction, pronouncing a blessing.<BR>—3 (in music) a particular composition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलातोद्यम्
मङ्गल + -आतोद्यम् a drum beaten on festive occasions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलादेशवृत्तिः
मङ्गल + -आदेशवृत्तिः a fortune-teller; Ms. 9. 258.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलारम्भः|मङ्गलारम्भ|मंगलारम्भ
मङ्गल + -आरम्भः an epithet of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलालम्भनम्
मङ्गल + -आलम्भनम् touching anything auspicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलालयः|मङ्गलालय
मङ्गल + -आलयः, -आवासः a temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलावासः|मङ्गलावास|मंगलावास
मङ्गल + -आलयः, -आवासः a temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलावह
मङ्गल + -आवह <i>a.</i> auspicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलेच्छा
मङ्गल + -इच्छा benediction, felicitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलेच्छु|मंगलेच्छु
मङ्गल + -इच्छु <i>a.</i> desirous of happiness or prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलकरणम्
मङ्गल + -करणम् repeating a prayer for the success of any undertaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलकलशः|मङ्गलकलश
मङ्गल + -कलशः a vessel used at festivals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलकारक
मङ्गल + -कारक, -कारिन् <i>a.</i> auspicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलकारिन्
मङ्गल + -कारक, -कारिन् <i>a.</i> auspicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलकार्यम्
मङ्गल + -कार्यम् any festive occasion, a religious or auspicious ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलकालः|मङ्गलकाल|मंगलकाल
मङ्गल + -कालः an auspicious occasion; Ś. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलक्षौमम्
मङ्गल + -क्षौमम् a silken cloth worn on occasions of festivity; दधतो<BR> मङ्गलक्षौमे वसानस्य च वल्कले R. 12. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलगृहम्
मङ्गल + -गृहम् an auspicious house or temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलग्रहः|मङ्गलग्रह|मंगलग्रह
मङ्गल + -ग्रहः an auspicious planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलघटः|मङ्गलघट|मंगलघट
मङ्गल + -घटः, -पात्रम् a pot filled with water offered to the gods on<BR> festive occasions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलपात्रम्
मङ्गल + -घटः, -पात्रम् a pot filled with water offered to the gods on<BR> festive occasions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलचण्डिका
मङ्गल + -चण्डिका, -चण्डी N. of Durgā; मङ्गलेषु च या दक्षा सा च मङ्गलचण्डिका Brav. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलचण्डी
मङ्गल + -चण्डिका, -चण्डी N. of Durgā; मङ्गलेषु च या दक्षा सा च मङ्गलचण्डिका Brav. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलच्छायः|मङ्गलच्छाय|मंगलच्छाय
मङ्गल + -छायः the <i>plakṣa</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलतूर्यम्
मङ्गल + -तूर्यम् a musical instrument, such as a trumpet, drum &c., played<BR> on festive or auspicious occasions; सुखश्रवा मङ्गलतूर्यनिस्वनाः R. 3. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलदेवता|मंगलदेवता
मङ्गल + -देवता an auspicious or tutelary deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलध्वनिः|मङ्गलध्वनि
मङ्गल + -ध्वनिः an auspicious music (at the time of some festival).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलपत्रम्
मङ्गल + -पत्रम् a leaf serving as an amulet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलपाठकः|मङ्गलपाठक|मंगलपाठक
मङ्गल + -पाठकः a bard, minstrel, professional panegyrist; आः दुरात्मन्<BR> वृथामङ्गलपाठक शैलूषापसद Ve. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलपुष्पम्
मङ्गल + -पुष्पम् an auspicious flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलपूजित
मङ्गल + -पूजित <i>a.</i> honoured with a sacrificial offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलप्रतिसरः|मङ्गलप्रतिसर|मंगलप्रतिसर
मङ्गल + -प्रतिसरः<BR>—1 an auspicious cord or string, the auspicious thread worn by a married<BR> woman round her neck as long as her husband lives; अन्त्रैः कल्पितमङ्गलप्रतिसराः<BR> (अङ्गनाः) Māl. 5. 18.<BR>—2 the cord of an amulet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलप्रद
मङ्गल + -प्रद <i>a.</i> auspicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलप्रदा
मङ्गल + -प्रद + ({@-दा@}) turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलप्रस्थः|मङ्गलप्रस्थ|मंगलप्रस्थ
मङ्गल + -प्रस्थः N. of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलभेरी
मङ्गल + -भेरी a drum beaten on festive occasions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलमात्रभूषण
मङ्गल + -मात्रभूषण <i>a.</i> decked in auspicious ornaments only, such<BR> as the auspicious thread, saffron-mark &c.; सितांशुका मङ्गलमात्रभूषणा V. 3. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलमालिका
मङ्गल + -मालिका marriage-music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलवचस्
मङ्गल + -वचस् <i>n.</i>, {@-वादः@}<BR> a benedictory or congratulatory expression, benediction, blessing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलवादिन्
मङ्गल + -वादिन् <i>a.</i> expressing blessings or congratulations, wishing joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलवाद्यम्
मङ्गल + -वाद्यम् see मङ्गलतूर्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलवारः|मङ्गलवार|मंगलवार
मङ्गल + -वारः, -वासरः Tuesday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1219-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गलवासरः|मङ्गलवासर
