मङ्गिनीशिरस्
मङ्गिनी + -शिरस् the prow of a vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मङ्गुरः|मङ्गुर
