मङ्घ्|मंघ्
मङ्घ् I. €1 P. (मङ्घति) To adorn, decorate. ━II. €1 Ā. (मङ्घते)<BR>—1 To cheat, deceive.<BR>—2 To begin.<BR>—3 To blame, censure.<BR>—4 To go, move, move quickly.<BR>—5 To start, set out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मच्
मच् €1 Ā. (मचते)<BR>—1 To be wicked.<BR>—2 To cheat, deceive.<BR>—3 To be vain or proud.<BR>—4 To pound, ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मचर्चिका|मचर्च्चिका
मचर्चिका A word used at the end of a noun to denote ‘excellence’<BR> or ‘the best of its kind’; as गोमचर्चिका ‘an excellent cow or bull’;<BR> मतल्लिकादयो नियतलिङ्गा न तु विशिष्यनिघ्नाः Sk.; cf. उद्घः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मच्छः|मच्छ
मच्छः A fish (corrupted from मत्स्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मज्जन्
मज्जन् <i>m.</i> [मस्ज्-कनिन् Uṇ. 1. 156]<BR>—1 The marrow of the bones and flesh; अस्थि यत् स्वाग्निना पक्वं तस्य<BR> सारं द्रवो घनः । यः स्वेदवत् पृथग्भूतः स मज्जेत्यभिधीयते Bhāva P.<BR>—2 The pith of plants.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मज्जकृत्, मज्जसमुद्भवः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

