मज्जा
मज्जा [मस्ज्-अच् टाप्]<BR>—1 The marrow of the bones and flesh.<BR>—2 The pith of plants.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मज्जाजम्, मज्जामेहः, मज्जारजस्, मज्जारसः, मज्जासारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1220-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

