मज्जामेहः|मज्जामेह
मज्जा + -मेहः a disease of urinary organs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मज्जारजस्
