मञ्चिका
मञ्चिका<BR>—1 A chair.<BR>—2 A trough, tray.<BR>—3 (In music) A kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1220-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मञ्ज्|मंज्
