मट्टकम्
मट्टकम्<BR>—1 The ridge of a roof.<BR>—2 Eleusine Coracana (Mar. मटकी, नाचणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मठ्
मठ् €1 P. (मठति)<BR>—1 To dwell, inhabit.<BR>—2 To go.<BR>—3 To grind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मठः|मठ|मठं
मठः, -मठम्<BR> [मठत्यत्र मठ् घञर्थे क]<BR>—1 The hut of an ascetic, a small cell or room.<BR>—2 A monastery, convent.<BR>—3 A seminary, college, place of learning.<BR>—4 A temple.<BR>—5 A cart drawn by oxen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मठम्
मठः, -मठम्<BR> [मठत्यत्र मठ् घञर्थे क]<BR>—1 The hut of an ascetic, a small cell or room.<BR>—2 A monastery, convent.<BR>—3 A seminary, college, place of learning.<BR>—4 A temple.<BR>—5 A cart drawn by oxen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मठी
मठः, -मठम् + .{@-ठी@}<BR>—1 A cell.<BR>—2 A cloister, convent.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मठाधिपतिः, मठाध्यक्षः, मठायतनम्, मठचिन्ता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मठाधिपतिः|मठाधिपति
मठः + -अधिपतिः, -अध्यक्षः the superintendent of a monastery; principal of a college.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मठाध्यक्षः|मठाध्यक्ष
मठः + -अधिपतिः, -अध्यक्षः the superintendent of a monastery; principal of a college.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मठायतनम्
मठः + -आयतनम् a monastery, college.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मठचिन्ता
मठः + -चिन्ता charge of a convent; वर्षं यावत् किमन्येन मठचिन्तां<BR> दिनत्रयम् Pt. 2. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मठर|मठरः
मठर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Intoxicated, drunk.<BR>—2 Hard, harsh (sound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मठिका
मठिका<BR>—1 A small cell.<BR>—2 A hut or college.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मडकः|मडक
मडकः A kind of corn; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मड्डुः|मड्डु
मड्डुः, मड्डुकः A kind of drum; see मङ्कुक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मड्डुकः|मड्डुक
मड्डुः, मड्डुकः A kind of drum; see मङ्कुक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मड्मडायित
मड्मडायित <i>a.</i> Gulped down the throat, swallowed up; वत्सतरी<BR> मड्मडायिता U. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्
मण् €1 P. (मणति) To sound, murmur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिः|मणि
मणिः [मण्-इन् स्त्रीत्वपक्षे वा ङीप्] (Said to be <i>f.</i> also, but rarely used)<BR>—1 A jewel, gem, precious stone; मणिर्लुठति पादेषु काचः शिरसि धार्यते ।<BR> यथैवास्ते तथैवास्तां काचः काचो मणिर्मणिः H. 2. 68; अलब्धशाणोत्कषणा<BR> नृपाणां न जातु मौलौ मणयो वसन्ति Bv. 1. 73; मणौ वज्रसमुत्कीर्णे<BR> सूत्रस्येवास्ति मे गतिः R. 1. 4, 3. 18.<BR>—2 An ornament in general.<BR>—3 Anything best of its kind; cf. रत्न.<BR>—4 A magnet, loadstone.<BR>—5 The wrist.<BR>—6 A water-pot.<BR>—7 Clitoris.<BR>—8 Glans penis.<BR>—9 A crystal; क्वचिन्मणिनिकाशोदाम् (नदीम्) Rām. 2. 95. 9.<BR>—10 The fleshy excrescence on the neck of a goat (also written मणी<BR> in these senses).<BR>—11 An ingot, a lump (of gold); यथा सोम्यैकेन लोहमणिना सर्वं लोहमयं<BR> विज्ञातं स्यात् Ch. Up. 6. 1. 5.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मणीन्द्रः, मणिराजः, मणिकण्ठः, मणिकण्ठकः, मणिकर्णिका, मणिकर्णी, मणिकाचः, मणिकाञ्चनयोगः, मणिकाननम्, मणिकारः, मणिगुणः, मणिग्रीवः, मणितारकः, मणितुण्डः, मणितुलाकोटिः, मणिदण्ड, मणिदर्पणः, मणिदीपः, मणिदोषः, मणिद्वीपः, मणिधनुः, मणिपाली, मणिपुष्पकः, मणिपूरः, मणिप्रवेकः, मणिप्रभा, मणिबन्धः, मणिबन्धनम्, मणिबीजः, मणिवीजः, मणिभावरः, मणिभित्तिः, मणिभूः, मणिभूमिः, मणिमण्डपः, मणिमन्तकम्, मणिमन्थम्, मणिमाला, मणिमेखल, मणियष्टिः, मणिरत्नम्, मणिरागः, मणिविग्रह, मणिविशेषः, मणिशिला, मणिसरः, मणिशृङ्गः, मणिसूत्रम्, मणिसोपानम्, मणिस्तम्भः, मणिहर्म्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणीन्द्रः|मणीन्द्र|मणींद्र
