मणिराजः|मणिराज
मणिः + -इन्द्रः, -राजः a diamond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकण्ठः|मणिकण्ठ
मणिः + -कण्ठः the blue jay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकण्ठकः|मणिकण्ठक
मणिः + -कण्ठकः a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकर्णिका
मणिः + -कर्णिका, -कर्णी N. of a sacred pool in Benares.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकर्णी
मणिः + -कर्णिका, -कर्णी N. of a sacred pool in Benares.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकाचः|मणिकाच
मणिः + -काचः the feathered part of an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकाञ्चनयोगः
मणिः + -काञ्चनयोगः a rare combination of mutually worthy things.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकाननम्
मणिः + -काननम् the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकारः|मणिकार
मणिः + -कारः a lapidary, jeweller; मणिकाराश्च ये केचित् Rām. 2. 83. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिगुणः
मणिः + -गुणः a quality of gems; षडश्रश्चतुरश्रो वृत्तो वा, तीव्ररागसंस्थानवानच्छः<BR> स्निग्धो गुरुरर्चिष्मानन्तर्गतप्रभः प्रभानुलेपी चेति मणिगुणाः Kau. A. 2. 11. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिग्रीवः|मणिग्रीव
मणिः + -ग्रीवः a son of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणितारकः|मणितारक
मणिः + -तारकः the crane or Sārasa bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणितुण्डः
मणिः + -तुण्डः a striped hyena; Nigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणितुलाकोटिः|मणितुलाकोटि
मणिः + -तुलाकोटिः a foot ornament consisting of jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिदण्ड
मणिः + -दण्ड <i>a.</i> having a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">Page1222-1</a>]<BR> handle adorned with jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1221-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिदर्पणः|मणिदर्पण
मणिः + -दर्पणः a jewelled mirror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिदीपः|मणिदीप
मणिः + -दीपः<BR>—1 a lamp having jewels; मणिदीपप्रकाशितं … … पश्येदं रङ्गमन्दिरम्<BR>—2 a jewel serving as a lamp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिदोषः|मणिदोष
मणिः + -दोषः a flaw or defect in a jewel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिद्वीपः|मणिद्वीप
मणिः + -द्वीपः<BR>—1 the hood of the serpent Ananta.<BR>—2 N. of a fabulous island in the ocean of nectar; सुधासिन्धोर्मध्ये सुरविटपिवाटीपरिसरे ।<BR> मणिद्वीपे नीपोपवनवति चिन्तामणिगृहे Saundaryalaharī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिधनुः|मणिधनु
मणिः + -धनुः <i>m.</i>, {@-धनुस्@} <i>n.</i><BR> a rainbow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिपाली
मणिः + -पाली a female keeper of jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिपुष्पकः|मणिपुष्पक
मणिः + -पुष्पकः N. of the conchshell of Sahadeva; नकुलः सहदेवश्च<BR> सुघोषमणिपुष्पकौ Bg. 1. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिपूरः|मणिपूर|मणिपूरं
मणिः + -पूरः<BR>—1 the navel.<BR>—2 a kind of bodice richly adorned with jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिपूरम्
मणिः + -पूरः + ({@-रम्@})<BR>—1 N. of a town in Kaliṅga.<BR>—2 the pit of the stomach, or a mystical circle on the navel (also मणिपूरक);<BR> तदूर्ध्वे नाभिदेशे तु मणिपूरं महाप्रभम् । … … मणिवद् भिन्नं<BR> तत्पद्मं मणिपूरं तथोच्यते Yogagrantha. ˚पतिः an epithet of Babhruvāhana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिप्रवेकः|मणिप्रवेक
मणिः + -प्रवेकः a most excellent jewel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिप्रभा
मणिः + -प्रभा N. of a metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिबन्धः|मणिबन्ध|मणिबंध
मणिः + -बन्धः<BR>—1 the wrist; रक्षाकरण्डकमस्य मणिबन्धे न दृश्यते Ś. 7.<BR>—2 the fastening of jewels; R. 12. 102; मणिबन्धैर्निगूढैश्च सुश्लिष्टशुभसन्धिभिः Garuḍa P.<BR>—3 a kind of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिबन्धनम्
मणिः + -बन्धनम्<BR>—1 fastening on of jewels, a string or ornament of pearls.<BR>—2 that part of a ring or bracelet where the jewels are set; collet; Ś. 6.<BR>—3 the wrist; … … मणिबन्धनात् कनकवलयं स्रस्तं स्रस्तं मया<BR> प्रतिसार्यते Ś. 3. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिबीजः|मणिबीज
मणिः + -बीजः, -वीजः the pomegranate tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिवीजः|मणिवीज
मणिः + -बीजः, -वीजः the pomegranate tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिभावरः
मणिः + -भावरः an Indian crane; Nigh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिभित्तिः|मणिभित्ति
मणिः + -भित्तिः <i>f.</i> N. of the palace of Śeṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिभूः
मणिः + -भूः <i>f.</i> a floor set with jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिभूमिः|मणिभूमि
मणिः + -भूमिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a mine of jewels.<BR>—2 a jewelled floor, floor inlaid with jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिमण्डपः|मणिमण्डप
मणिः + -मण्डपः<BR>—1 N. of the residence of Śeṣa.<BR>—2 a crystal hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिमन्तकम्
मणिः + -मन्तकम् a variety of diamonds; Kau. A. 2. 11. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिमन्थम्
मणिः + -मन्थम् rock-salt; क्वणन्मणिमन्थभूधर भवशिलालेहायेहाचणो<BR> लवणस्यति N. 19. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिमाला
मणिः + -माला<BR>—1 a string or necklace of jewels.<BR>—2 lustre, splendour, beauty.<BR>—3 a circular impression left by a bite (in amorous sports).<BR>—4 N. of Lakṣmī.<BR>—5 N. of a metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिमेखल
मणिः + -मेखल <i>a.</i> girdled with gems.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणियष्टिः|मणियष्टि
मणिः + -यष्टिः <i>m., f.</i> a jewelled stick, a string of jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिरत्नम्
मणिः + -रत्नम् a jewel, gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिरागः|मणिराग|मणिरागं
मणिः + -रागः the colour of jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिरागम्
मणिः + -रागः + ({@-गम्@}) vermilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिविग्रह
मणिः + -विग्रह <i>a.</i> jewelled; काञ्चनीं मणिविग्रहाम् Rām. 6. 128. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिविशेषः|मणिविशेष
मणिः + -विशेषः an excellent jewel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिशिला
मणिः + -शिला a jewelled slab.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिसरः|मणिसर
मणिः + -सरः a necklace; मणिसरममलं तारकपटलं नखदशशशिभूषिते Gīt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिशृङ्गः|मणिशृङ्ग
मणिः + -शृङ्गः the god of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिसूत्रम्
मणिः + -सूत्रम् a string of pearls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिसोपानम्
मणिः + -सोपानम् a jewelled staircase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिस्तम्भः|मणिस्तम्भ|मणिस्तंभ
मणिः + -स्तम्भः a pillar inlaid with jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिहर्म्यम्
मणिः + -हर्म्यम् a jewelled or crystal palace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकः|मणिक|मणिकं
मणिकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A water-jar; विवृद्धमूषिका रथ्या विभिन्नमणिकास्तथा Mb. 16. 2. 5;<BR> तस्माच्च शिल्पान्मणिकादिकारी प्रसिद्धनामाजनि कुम्भकारः N. 7. 75.<BR>—2 = अजागलस्तन q. v.<BR>—3 The front part of the male organ of generation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकम्
मणिकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A water-jar; विवृद्धमूषिका रथ्या विभिन्नमणिकास्तथा Mb. 16. 2. 5;<BR> तस्माच्च शिल्पान्मणिकादिकारी प्रसिद्धनामाजनि कुम्भकारः N. 7. 75.<BR>—2 = अजागलस्तन q. v.<BR>—3 The front part of the male organ of generation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिकः|मणिक|मणिकं
मणिकः, -कम् + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A crystal palace.<BR>—2 A jewel, gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणितम्
मणितम् An inarticulate murmuring sound uttered at cohabitation;<BR> मणितं रतिकूजितम् Abh. Cin. 1408; सीत्कृतानि मणितं करुणोक्तिः<BR> Śi. 10. 75; संभ्रान्ता मणितवतीव पद्मवाटी Rām. Ch. 7. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणिमत्|मणिमन्त्
मणिमत् <i>a.</i> Jewelled; गण्डस्थलोन्नतमुखं मणिमत्किरीटम् Bhāg. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 N. of a mountain.<BR>—3 N. of a place of pilgrimage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणीचम्
मणीचम्<BR>—1 A land.<BR>—2 A flower.<BR>—3 A pearl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणीचकः|मणीचक|मणीचकं
मणीचकः A king-fisher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणीचकम्
मणीचकः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 The moon-stone.<BR>—2 A flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मणीवकम्
मणीवकम् A flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्ठ्|मंठ्
मण्ठ् €1 Ā. (मण्ठते)<BR>—1 To long for.<BR>—2 To remember with regret, think of sorrowfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्ठः|मण्ठ|मंठः
मण्ठः A kind of baked sweetmeat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्ड्|मंड्
मण्ड् I. €1 P., €10 U. (मण्डति, मण्डयति-ते, मण्डित)<BR>—1 To adorn, decorate; प्रभवति मण्डयितुं वधूरनङ्गः Ki. 10. 59; Bk. 10. 23.<BR>—2 To rejoice. ━II. €1 Ā. (मण्डते)<BR>—1 To clothe, dress.<BR>—2 To surround, encompass.<BR>—3 To distribute, divide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डः|मण्ड|मंडं|मण्डं|मंडः
मण्डः, -ण्डम्<BR> [मन्-ड तस्य नेत्वं, मण्ड्-अच् वा]<BR>—1 The thick oily matter or scum forming on the surface of any liquid.<BR>—2 The scum of boiled rice; नीवारौदनमण्डमुष्णमधुरम् U. 4. 1; तण्डुलानां<BR> सुसिद्धानां चतुर्दशगुणे जले । रसः सिक्थैर्विरहितो मण्ड इत्यभिर्धायते Bhāva P.<BR>—3 Cream (of milk).<BR>—4 Foam, froth or scum in general; घृतात्परं मण्डमिवातिसूक्ष्मं ज्ञात्वा<BR> शिवं सर्वभूतेषु गूढम् Śvet. Up. 4. 16; श्रोतुमिच्छामि तज्ज्ञानं घृतं<BR> मण्डमयं यथा Mb. 12. 318. 68.<BR>—5 Ferment.<BR>—6 Gruel.<BR>—7 Pith, essence.<BR>—8 The head.<BR>—9 The spirituous part of wine; राज्यं गतधनं साधो पीतमण्डां सुरामिव<BR> Rām. 2. 36. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डम्
मण्डः, -ण्डम्<BR> [मन्-ड तस्य नेत्वं, मण्ड्-अच् वा]<BR>—1 The thick oily matter or scum forming on the surface of any liquid.<BR>—2 The scum of boiled rice; नीवारौदनमण्डमुष्णमधुरम् U. 4. 1; तण्डुलानां<BR> सुसिद्धानां चतुर्दशगुणे जले । रसः सिक्थैर्विरहितो मण्ड इत्यभिर्धायते Bhāva P.<BR>—3 Cream (of milk).<BR>—4 Foam, froth or scum in general; घृतात्परं मण्डमिवातिसूक्ष्मं ज्ञात्वा<BR> शिवं सर्वभूतेषु गूढम् Śvet. Up. 4. 16; श्रोतुमिच्छामि तज्ज्ञानं घृतं<BR> मण्डमयं यथा Mb. 12. 318. 68.<BR>—5 Ferment.<BR>—6 Gruel.<BR>—7 Pith, essence.<BR>—8 The head.<BR>—9 The spirituous part of wine; राज्यं गतधनं साधो पीतमण्डां सुरामिव<BR> Rām. 2. 36. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डः|मण्ड|मंडं|मण्डं|मंडः
मण्डः, -ण्डम् + .{@-ण्डः@}<BR>—1 An ornament, decoration.<BR>—2 A frog.<BR>—3 The castor-oil tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डा
मण्डः, -ण्डम् + .{@-ण्डा@}<BR>—1 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—2 The emblic myrobalan tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मण्डोदकम्, मण्डजातम्, मण्डप, मण्डपीठिका, मण्डहारकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डोदकम्
मण्डः + -उदकम्<BR>—1 barm, yeast.<BR>—2 decorating walls, floors &c. on festive occasions.<BR>—3 mental agitation or excitement.<BR>—4 variegated colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डजातम्
मण्डः + -जातम् the second change which takes place in sour milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डप|मंडपः|मण्डपः
मण्डः + -प <i>a.</i> drinking scum or cream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डपीठिका
मण्डः + -पीठिका two quarters of the compass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डहारकः|मण्डहारक
मण्डः + -हारकः a distiller of spirits &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डकः|मण्डक|मंडकः
मण्डकः<BR>—1 A kind of baked flour.<BR>—2 A very thin kind of cake (Mar. मांडे); पयःस्मिता मण्डकमण्डनाम्बरा N. 16. 107.<BR>—3 A particular musical air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डन|मंडन|मण्डनं|मण्डनः
मण्डन <i>a.</i> [मण्डयति मण्ड्-ल्यु ल्युट् वा]<BR>—1 Adorning, decorating.<BR>—2 Fond of ornaments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डनम्
मण्डन + .{@-नम्@} The act of decorating or ornamenting, adorning; मामक्षमं<BR> मण्डनकालहानेः R. 13. 16; मण्डनविधिः Ś. 6. 5.<BR>—2 An ornament, decoration, embellishment; सा मण्डनान्मण्डनमन्वभुङ्क्त<BR> Ku. 7. 5; Ki. 8. 40; R. 8. 71; स्वाङ्गैरेव विभूषितासि वहसि क्लेशाय<BR> किं मण्डनम् Nāg. 3. 6. Also मण्डना.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डनः|मण्डन|मंडन|मण्डनं
मण्डन + .{@-नः@} (or {@मण्डनमिश्रः@}) N. of a philosopher who is said<BR> to have been defeated in controversy by Śaṅkarācārya; शिष्यप्रशिष्यैरुपगीयमानमवेहि<BR> तन्मण्डनमिश्रधाम Śāṅkaradigvijaya.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मण्डनकालः, मण्डनप्रिय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डनकालः|मण्डनकाल
मण्डन + -कालः time for adorning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डनप्रिय
मण्डन + -प्रिय <i>a.</i> fond of ornaments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डपः|मण्डप|मंडपः
मण्डपः [मण्डं भूषां पाति पा-क, मण्ड्-कपन् वा]<BR>—1 A temporary hall erected on ceremonial occasions, an open<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">Page1223-1</a>]<BR> hall; विवाहमण्डप.<BR>—2 A tent, pavilion; दीर्घेष्वमी नियमिताः पटमण्डपेषु निद्रां विहाय<BR> वनजाक्ष वनायुदेश्याः R. 5. 73.<BR>—3 An arbour, a bower, as in लतामण्डप; प्रत्यासन्नौ कुरबकवृतेर्माधवीमण्डपस्य Me. 80.<BR>—4 A building consecrated to a deity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मण्डपप्रतिष्ठा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1222-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डपप्रतिष्ठा
मण्डपः + -प्रतिष्ठा the consecration of a temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डपकः|मण्डपक
मण्डपकः, -पिका<BR>—1 A small shed, shop.<BR>—2 A small pavilion or tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डपिका|मंडपिका
मण्डपकः, -पिका<BR>—1 A small shed, shop.<BR>—2 A small pavilion or tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डयन्तः|मण्डयन्त|मंडयंतः
मण्डयन्तः<BR>—1 An ornament, a decoration.<BR>—2 An actor.<BR>—3 Food.<BR>—4 An assembly of women.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डयन्ती
मण्डयन्तः + .{@-न्ती@} A woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डित|मंडित|मण्डितः
मण्डित <i>p. p.</i> Adorned, decorated; मणिमयमकरमनोहरकुण्डलमण्डितगण्डमुदारम्<BR> Gīt.; स्वयं च मण्डिता नित्यं परिमृष्टपरिच्छदा Bhāg. 7. 11. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डित|मंडित|मण्डितः
मण्डित N. of one of the Gaṇādhipas of the Jains.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डरी|मंडरी
मण्डरी A kind of cricket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डल|मंडल|मण्डलं|मण्डलः
मण्डल <i>a.</i> [मण्ड्-कलच्] Round, circular; मण्डलाग्रा बृसीश्चैव<BR> गृहान्याः पृष्ठतो ययुः Rām. 5. 18. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलः|मण्डल|मंडल|मण्डलं
मण्डल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 circular array of troops.<BR>—2 A dog. —3 A kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलम्
मण्डल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 A circular orb, globe, wheel, ring, circumference, anything round or<BR> circular; न्यग्रोधं च सुमण्डलम् Mb. 12. 169. 12; करालफणमण्डलम्<BR> R. 12. 98; आदर्शमण्डलनिभानि समुल्लसन्ति Ki. 5. 41; स्फुरत्प्रभामण्डलया<BR> चकाशे Ku. 1. 24; so रेणुमण्डल, छायामण्डल, चापमण्डल, मुखमण्डल,<BR> स्तनमण्डल &c.<BR>—2 The charmed circle (drawn by a conjurer); मण्डले पन्नगो रुद्धो मन्त्रैरिव<BR> महाविषः Rām. 2. 12. 5; जानन्ति तन्त्रयुक्तिं यथास्थितं मण्डलमभिलिखन्ति Mu. 2. 1.<BR>—3 A disc, especially of the sun or moon; तेनातपत्रामलमण्डलेन<BR> R. 16. 27; अपर्वणि ग्रहकलुषेन्दुमण्डला (विभावरी) M. 4. 15;<BR> दिनमणिमण्डलमण्डन भवखण्डन ए Gīt. 1.<BR>—4 The halo round the sun or moon.<BR>—5 The path or orbit of a heavenly body.<BR>—6 A multitude, group, collection, assemblage, troop, company; एवं<BR> मिलितेन कुमारमण्डलेन Dk.; अखिलं चारिमण्डलम् R. 4. 4.<BR>—7 Society, association.<BR>—8 A great circle.<BR>—9 The visible horizon.<BR>—10 A district or province.<BR>—11 A surrounding district or territory.<BR>—12 (In politics) The circle of a kingʼs near and distant neighbours;<BR> मण्डलचरितम् Kau. A. 1. 1. 1; सततसुकृती भूयाद् भूपः प्रसादितमण्डलः<BR> Ve. 6. 44; उपगतोऽपि च मण्डलनाभिताम् &c. R. 9. 15. (According to<BR> Kāmandaka quoted by Malli. the circle of a kingʼs near and distant neighbours<BR> consists of twelve kings:− विजिगीषु or the central monarch, the five<BR> kings whose dominions are in the front), and the four kings whose dominions<BR> are in the rear of his kingdom, the मध्यम or intermediate, and उदासीन<BR> or indifferent king. The kings in the front as well as in the rear are<BR> designated by particular names; see Malli. <i>ad loc.</i>; cf. also Śi. 2. 81.<BR> and Malli. thereon. According to some the number of such kings is<BR> four, six, eight, twelve or even more; see Mit. on Y. 1. 345. According<BR> to others, the circle consists of three kings only:− the प्राकृतारि<BR> or natural enemy, (the sovereign of an adjacent country),<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">Page1223-2</a>]<BR> the प्राकृतमित्र natural ally, (the sovereign whose dominions are<BR> separated by those of another from the country of the central monarch with<BR> whom he is allied), and प्राकृतोदासीन or the natural neutral, (the<BR> sovereign whose dominions lie beyond those of the natural ally).<BR>—13 A particular position of the feet in shooting.<BR>—14 A kind of mystical diagram used in invoking a divinity.<BR>—15 A division of the Ṛgveda (the whole collection being divided into<BR>—10 Maṇḍalas or eight Aṣṭakas).<BR>—16 A kind of leprosy with round spots.<BR>—17 A kind of perfume.<BR>—18 A circular bandage (in surgery).<BR>—19 A sugar-ball, sweetmeat.<BR>—20 Sexual dalliances; नानाविचित्रकृतमण्डलमावहन्तीम् Bil. C. (उत्तरपीठिका) 38.<BR>—21 A circular gait; हय इव मण्डलमाशु यः करोति Rām. 6. 33. 35; Mb. 3. 19. 8.<BR>—22 A play-board (द्यूते शारीस्थापनपट्टम्); Mb. 8. 74. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डली
मण्डल + .{@-ली@}<BR>—1 A circle, orb &c.<BR>—2 A group, assemblage; तन्मोचनाय तेनाशु प्रेरिता शिष्यमण्डली Bm. 1. 648.<BR>—3 Walking round, circular motion.<BR>—4 Bent grass (दूर्वा).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मण्डलाग्र, मण्डलाधिपः, मण्डलाधीशः, मण्डलेशः, मण्डलेश्वरः, मण्डलावृत्तिः, मण्डलासन, मण्डलोत्तमम्, मण्डलकविः, मण्डलकार्मुक, मण्डलनाभिः, मण्डलनृत्यम्, मण्डलन्यासः, मण्डलपुच्छकः, मण्डलबन्धः, मण्डलभागः, मण्डलमाडः, मण्डलवटः, मण्डलवर्तनम्, मण्डलवर्तिन्, मण्डलवर्षः, मण्डलवाटः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलाग्र|मण्डलाग्रः
मण्डल + -अग्र <i>a.</i> round-pointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलाग्रः|मण्डलाग्र
मण्डल + -अग्र + ({@-ग्रः@}) a bent or crooked<BR> sword, scimitar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलाग्रम्
मण्डल + -अग्र + .({@-ग्रम्@}) a surgeonʼs circular knife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलाधिपः|मण्डलाधिप
मण्डल + -अधिपः, -अधीशः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 the ruler or governor of a district or province.<BR>—2 a king, sovereign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलाधीशः|मण्डलाधीश
मण्डल + -अधिपः, -अधीशः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 the ruler or governor of a district or province.<BR>—2 a king, sovereign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलेशः|मण्डलेश
मण्डल + -अधिपः, -अधीशः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 the ruler or governor of a district or province.<BR>—2 a king, sovereign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलेश्वरः|मण्डलेश्वर
मण्डल + -अधिपः, -अधीशः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 the ruler or governor of a district or province.<BR>—2 a king, sovereign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलावृत्तिः
मण्डल + -आवृत्तिः <i>f.</i> circular movement; भ्रमिषु कृतपुटान्तर्मण्डलावृत्तिचक्षुः U. 3. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलासन
मण्डल + -आसन <i>a.</i> sitting in a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलोत्तमम्
मण्डल + -उत्तमम् a principal kingdom or district.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलकविः|मण्डलकवि
मण्डल + -कविः a bad poet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलकार्मुक
मण्डल + -कार्मुक <i>a.</i> having a circular bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलनाभिः|मण्डलनाभि
मण्डल + -नाभिः the centre of a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलनृत्यम्
मण्डल + -नृत्यम् a circular dance, dance in a ring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलन्यासः|मण्डलन्यास
मण्डल + -न्यासः describing a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलपुच्छकः|मण्डलपुच्छक
मण्डल + -पुच्छकः a kind of insect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलबन्धः|मण्डलबन्ध
मण्डल + -बन्धः the formation of a circle or roundness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलभागः|मण्डलभाग
मण्डल + -भागः an arc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलमाडः|मण्डलमाड
मण्डल + -माडः a pavilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलवटः|मण्डलवट
मण्डल + -वटः the fig-tree forming a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलवर्तनम्
मण्डल + -वर्तनम् drawing figures with some powder (Mar. रांगोळी घालणें);<BR> संमार्जनोपलेपभ्यां गृहमण्डलवर्तनैः Bhāg. 7. 11. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलवर्तिन्|मण्डलवर्त्तिन्
मण्डल + -वर्तिन् <i>m.</i> a ruler of a small province; स तुल्यातिशयध्वंसं<BR> यथा मण्डलवर्तिनाम् Bhāg. 11. 3. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलवर्षः|मण्डलवर्ष
मण्डल + -वर्षः rain over the whole of a kingʼs territory, general rain-fall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलवाटः|मण्डलवाट
मण्डल + -वाटः a garden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलकम्
मण्डलकम्<BR>—1 A circle.<BR>—2 A disc.<BR>—3 A district, province.<BR>—4 A group, collection.<BR>—5 A circular array of troops.<BR>—6 White leprosy with round spots.<BR>—7 A mirror.<BR>—8 A kind of pose of an archer.<BR>—9 A circle with lines drawn for magical incantations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलकः|मण्डलक|मंडलकं|मण्डलकं
मण्डलकम् + .{@-कः@} A dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलयति
मण्डलयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To make round or circular, form into a globe or circle.<BR>—2 To turn or whirl round; नानागतिर्मण्डलयन् जवेन Ki. 16. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलायते
मण्डलायते Den. Ā. To form oneself into a circle, to coil oneself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलायित|मंडलायित|मण्डलायितं
मण्डलायित <i>a.</i> Round, circular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलायितम्
मण्डलायित + .{@-तम्@} A ball, globe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलिका
मण्डलिका a group, troop, band, crowd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलित|मंडलित
मण्डलित <i>a.</i> Rounded, made round or circular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलिन्|मंडलिन्
मण्डलिन् <i>a.</i> [मण्डल-इनि]<BR>—1 Forming a circle, made up into a coil; वाता मण्डलिनस्तीव्रा व्यपसव्यं<BR> प्रचक्रमुः Rām. 6. 107. 21.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">Page1224-1</a>]<BR>—2 Ruling a country. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A particular kind of snake.<BR>—2 A snake in general.<BR>—3 A cat.<BR>—4 The pole-cat.<BR>—5 A dog.<BR>—6 The sun.<BR>—7 The fig-tree.<BR>—8 The ruler of a province.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1223-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलीकः|मण्डलीक|मंडलीकः
मण्डलीकः A tributary king; तेजो निजं मुकुलयन्ति च मण्डलीकाः<BR> Kīr. K. 2. 111.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलीकृ
मण्डलीकृ €8 U. To form into a ring or circle, to coil round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलीकरणम्
मण्डलीकरणम् Rounding, coiling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलीकृत|मंडलीकृत
मण्डलीकृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Rounded, made circular, formed into a globe or circle.<BR>—2 Bent, curved (as a bow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डलीभू
मण्डलीभू €1 P.<BR>—1 To become round.<BR>—2 To form a globe or circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डुकम्
मण्डुकम् The handle of a shield; स्यूते बाहौ मण्डुकश्लिष्टमुष्टेः Śi. 18. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकः|मण्डूक|मंडूकः
मण्डूकः [मण्डयति वर्षासमयं, मण्ड् ऊकण् Uṇ. 4. 42]<BR>—1 A frog; निपानमिव मण्डूकाः सोद्योगं नरमायान्ति विवशाः सर्वसंपदः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 N. of a particular breed of horses.<BR>—3 A machine like a frog.<BR>—4 The sole of a horseʼs hoof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकम्
मण्डूकः + .{@-कम्@} A kind of coitus or mode of sexual enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकी
मण्डूकः + .{@-की@}<BR>—1 A female frog.<BR>—2 A wanton or unchaste woman.<BR>—3 N. of several plants.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मण्डूकानुवृत्तिः, मण्डूकगतिः, मण्डूकप्लुतिः, मण्डूककुलम्, मण्डूकपर्णा, मण्डूकपर्णिका, मण्डूकपर्णी, मण्डूकयोगः, मण्डूकसरस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकानुवृत्तिः|मण्डूकानुवृत्ति
मण्डूकः + -अनुवृत्तिः, -गतिः, -प्लुतिः <i>f.</i> ‘the leap of a frog’, skipping<BR> over or omitting at intervals (in grammar the word is used to denote the<BR> skipping of several Sūtras and supplying from a previous Sūtra); क्रियाग्रहणं<BR> मण्डूकप्लुत्यानुवर्तते Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकगतिः|मण्डूकगति
मण्डूकः + -अनुवृत्तिः, -गतिः, -प्लुतिः <i>f.</i> ‘the leap of a frog’, skipping<BR> over or omitting at intervals (in grammar the word is used to denote the<BR> skipping of several Sūtras and supplying from a previous Sūtra); क्रियाग्रहणं<BR> मण्डूकप्लुत्यानुवर्तते Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकप्लुतिः|मण्डूकप्लुति
मण्डूकः + -अनुवृत्तिः, -गतिः, -प्लुतिः <i>f.</i> ‘the leap of a frog’, skipping<BR> over or omitting at intervals (in grammar the word is used to denote the<BR> skipping of several Sūtras and supplying from a previous Sūtra); क्रियाग्रहणं<BR> मण्डूकप्लुत्यानुवर्तते Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूककुलम्
मण्डूकः + -कुलम् a collection of frogs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकपर्णा
मण्डूकः + -पर्णा, -पर्णिका, -पर्णी N. of several plants like मञ्जिष्ठा, ब्राह्मी etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकपर्णिका
मण्डूकः + -पर्णा, -पर्णिका, -पर्णी N. of several plants like मञ्जिष्ठा, ब्राह्मी etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकपर्णी
मण्डूकः + -पर्णा, -पर्णिका, -पर्णी N. of several plants like मञ्जिष्ठा, ब्राह्मी etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकयोगः|मण्डूकयोग
मण्डूकः + -योगः a kind of abstract meditation in which the person who meditates<BR> sits motionless like a frog; मण्डूकयोगनियतैर्यथान्यायं निषेविभिः<BR> Mb. 13. 142. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूकसरस्
मण्डूकः + -सरस् <i>n.</i> a pond full of frogs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मण्डूरम्
मण्डूरम् Rust of iron, dross (used as a tonic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मत|मतं|मतः
मत <i>p. p.</i> [मन्-क्त]<BR>—1 Thought, believed, supposed; स मे युक्ततमो मतः Bg. 6. 47.<BR>—2 Considered, regarded, deemed, looked upon.<BR>—3 Esteemed, honoured, respected; बभौ च सा तेन सतां मतेन श्रद्धेव<BR> साक्षाद्विधिनोपपन्ना R. 2. 16, 8. 8.<BR>—4 Commended, valued.<BR>—5 Conjectured, guessed.<BR>—6 Meditated upon, thought of, perceived, recognised.<BR>—7 Thought out.<BR>—8 Intended, aimed at.<BR>—9 Approved, sanctioned.<BR>—10 Wished or hoped for.<BR>—11 Perceived, observed, known, understood. (See मन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतम्
मत + .{@-तम्@} —1 A thought, idea, opinion, belief, view; निश्चितं मतमुत्तमम्<BR> Bg. 18. 6; केषांचिन्मतेन &c.<BR>—2 Doctrine, tenet, creed, religious belief; ये मे मतमिदं नित्यमनुतिष्ठन्ति<BR> मानवाः Bg. 3. 31.<BR>—3 Advice, instruction, counsel.<BR>—4 Aim, design, intention, purpose; आत्मप्रभावेण मुने ज्ञातुमर्हसि<BR> मे मतम् Rām. 7. 9. 19.<BR>—5 Approbation, sanction, commendation.<BR>—6 Knowledge.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मताक्ष, मतानुज्ञा, मतान्तरम्, मतावलम्बनम्, मतभेदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मताक्ष
मत + -अक्ष <i>a.</i> well-versed in playing at dice; कङ्को नाम द्विजो<BR> भूत्वा मताक्षः प्रियदेवनः Mb. 4. 1. 24.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">Page1224-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतानुज्ञा
मत + -अनुज्ञा one of the निग्रहस्थानs known in न्यायशास्त्र;<BR> Bhāṣā P.; admission of a fault in oneʼs own reasoning, while insisting<BR> on a similar one in that of the opponent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतान्तरम्
मत + -अन्तरम्<BR>—1 a different view.<BR>—2 a different creed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतावलम्बनम्
मत + -अवलम्बनम् adopting or holding a particular opinion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतभेदः|मतभेद
मत + -भेदः difference of opinion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतङ्गः|मतङ्ग|मतंग|मतंगः
मतङ्गः [माद्यति अनेन, मद्-अङ्गच् दस्य तः Tv.]<BR>—1 An elephant.<BR>—2 A cloud.<BR>—3 N. of a sage; मतङ्गशापादवलेपमूलादवाप्तवानस्मि मतङ्गजत्वम् R. 5. 53.<BR>—4 The king त्रिशङ्कु; मतङ्गो धर्मात्मा राजर्षिर्व्याधतां गतः Mb. 1. 71. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतङ्गजः|मतङ्गज|मतंगज|मतंगजः
मतङ्गजः An elephant; न हि कमलिनीं दृष्ट्वा ग्राहमवेक्षते मतङ्गजः<BR> M. 3; Ki. 5. 47; R. 12. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतङ्गजा
मतङ्गजः + .{@-जा@} A particular मूर्च्छना in music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतल्लिका
मतल्लिका A word used at the end of nouns to denote ‘excellence or anything best of its kind’<BR>; गोमतल्लिका ‘an excellent cow’; परिलसत्तृणशून्यमतल्लिका<BR> Rām. Ch. 4. 32; cf. उद्धः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतल्ली
मतल्ली See मतल्लिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिः|मति
मतिः <i>f.</i> [मन् भावे क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Intellect, understanding, sense, knowledge, judgment; मतिरेव बलाद्गरीयसी<BR> H. 2. 86; अल्पविषया मतिः R. 1. 2.<BR>—2 Mind, heart; मम तु मतिर्न मनागपैतु धर्मात् Bv. 4. 26; so दुर्मति, सुमति.<BR>—3 Thought, idea, belief, opinion, notion, supposition, impression, view;<BR> ध्रुवा नीतिर्मतिर्मम Bg. 18. 78; विधिरहो बलवानिति मे मतिः<BR> Bh. 2. 98; Pt. 2. 19.<BR>—4 Intention, design, purpose; see मत्या.<BR>—5 Resolution, determination.<BR>—6 Esteem, regard, respect; बहुमतिमधिकां ययावशोकः Ki. 10. 9.<BR>—7 Wish, desire, inclination; तस्य तासु मतिं ज्ञात्वा धर्मात्मा वाक्यमब्रवीत्<BR> Rām. 7. 25. 17; प्रायोपवेशनमतिर्नृपतिर्बभूव R. 8. 94.<BR>—8 Counsel, advice.<BR>—9 Remembrance, recollection.<BR>—10 Ved. Devotion, prayer.<BR>—11 An adviser.<BR>—12 = प्राणः q. v.; केन विज्ञानयोगेन मतिश्चित्तं समास्थिता Mb. 14. 21. 11<BR> (com.).<BR>—13 Activity or disposition of the mind; न मतेर्मन्तारं मन्वीथाः<BR> Bṛ. Up. 3. 4. 2.<BR>—14 Blessing. (मतिं कृ, -धा, -आधा ‘to set the heart on’, ‘resolve upon’<BR>, ‘think of’. मत्या is used adverbially in the sense of 1 knowingly,<BR> intentionally, wilfully; मत्या भुक्त्वाचरेत् कृच्छ्रम् Ms. 4. 222, 5. 19.<BR>—2 under the impression that; व्याघ्रमत्या पलायन्ते).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मतीश्वरः, मतिकर्मन्, मतिगतिः, मतिगर्भ, मतिदर्शनम्, मतिद्वैधम्, मतिनिश्चयः, मतिपथः, मतिपूर्व, मतिपूर्वम्, मतिपूर्वकम्, मतिप्रकर्षः, मतिभेदः, मतिभ्रमः, मतिभ्रान्तिः, मतिविपर्यासः, मतिविभ्रमः, मतिविभ्रंशः, मतिशालिन्, मतिहीन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतीश्वरः|मतीश्वर
मतिः + -ईश्वरः an epithet of Viṣvakarman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिकर्मन्
मतिः + -कर्मन् a matter of the intellect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिगतिः|मतिगति
मतिः + -गतिः <i>f.</i> mode of thought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिगर्भ
मतिः + -गर्भ <i>a.</i> full of intelligence, intelligent, clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिदर्शनम्
मतिः + -दर्शनम् the faculty of seeing into the thoughts (of others).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

