मतिभेदः|मतिभेद
मतिः + -भेदः change of views.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिभ्रमः|मतिभ्रम
मतिः + -भ्रमः, -भ्रान्तिः, -विपर्यासः<BR>—1 delusion, mental illusion, confusion of mind; स्वप्नो नु माया नु मतिभ्रमो नु Ś. 6. 9.<BR>—2 an error, a mistake, misapprehension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिभ्रान्तिः|मतिभ्रान्ति|मतिभ्रांति
मतिः + -भ्रमः, -भ्रान्तिः, -विपर्यासः<BR>—1 delusion, mental illusion, confusion of mind; स्वप्नो नु माया नु मतिभ्रमो नु Ś. 6. 9.<BR>—2 an error, a mistake, misapprehension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिविपर्यासः
मतिः + -भ्रमः, -भ्रान्तिः, -विपर्यासः<BR>—1 delusion, mental illusion, confusion of mind; स्वप्नो नु माया नु मतिभ्रमो नु Ś. 6. 9.<BR>—2 an error, a mistake, misapprehension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

