मतिः + -विभ्रमः, -विभ्रंशः confusion or infatuation of mind, madness,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1225-1" target="_blank">Page1225-1</a>]<BR> frenzy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिविभ्रंशः|मतिविभ्रंश
मतिः + -विभ्रमः, -विभ्रंशः confusion or infatuation of mind, madness,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1225-1" target="_blank">Page1225-1</a>]<BR> frenzy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1224-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिशालिन्
मतिः + -शालिन् <i>a.</i> intelligent, clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1225-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिहीन
मतिः + -हीन <i>a.</i> stupid, senseless, foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1225-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मतिमत्|मतिमन्त्
मतिमत् <i>a.</i> Clever, intelligent; मतिमतां च विलोक्य दरिद्रताम् Bh. 1. 91.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1225-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मत्क|मत्कः
मत्क <i>a.</i> My, mine; संशृणुष्व कपे मत्कैः संगच्छस्व वनैः<BR> शुभैः Bk. 8. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1225-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मत्कः|मत्क
मत्क + .{@-त्कः@} A bug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1225-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मत्कुणः|मत्कुण
मत्कुणः<BR>—1 A bug; मत्कुणाविव पुरा परिप्लवौ Śi. 14. 68.<BR>—2 An elephant without tusks.<BR>—3 A small elephant.<BR>—4 A beardless man.<BR>—5 A buffalo.<BR>—6 The cocoa-nut tree.<BR>—7 A flea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1225-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मत्कुणम्
