मदप्रसेकः|मदप्रसेक
मदः + -प्रयोगः, -प्रसेकः, -प्रस्रवणम्, -स्रावः, -स्रुतिः <i>f.</i> the<BR> exudation of ichor or rutting juice from the temple of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदप्रस्रवणम्
मदः + -प्रयोगः, -प्रसेकः, -प्रस्रवणम्, -स्रावः, -स्रुतिः <i>f.</i> the<BR> exudation of ichor or rutting juice from the temple of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदस्रावः
मदः + -प्रयोगः, -प्रसेकः, -प्रस्रवणम्, -स्रावः, -स्रुतिः <i>f.</i> the<BR> exudation of ichor or rutting juice from the temple of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदस्रुतिः
मदः + -प्रयोगः, -प्रसेकः, -प्रस्रवणम्, -स्रावः, -स्रुतिः <i>f.</i> the<BR> exudation of ichor or rutting juice from the temple of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदप्रसेकः|मदप्रसेक
मदः + -प्रसेकः the aphrodisiacal fluid (वीर्यच्युतिः); अन्यत्र<BR> मुञ्चन्ति मदप्रसेकम् Mk. 4. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदभङ्गः|मदभङ्ग
मदः + -भङ्गः humiliation of pride; Bv. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदभञ्जिनी
मदः + -भञ्जिनी Asparagus Racemosus (Mar. शतावरी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदमत्ता
मदः + -मत्ता N. of a metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदमुच्
मदः + -मुच् <i>a.</i> ‘dropping down ichor’, furious, intoxicated; सोऽयं<BR> पुत्रस्तव मदमुचां वारणानां विजेता U. 3. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदमोहित
मदः + -मोहित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 stupefied by drunkenness; अकार्यमन्यत् कुर्याद् वा ब्राह्मणो मदमोहितः Ms. 11. 96.<BR>—2 infatuated by pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदरक्त
मदः + -रक्त <i>a.</i> affected with passion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदरागः|मदराग
मदः + -रागः<BR>—1 Cupid.<BR>—2 a cock.<BR>—3 a drunkard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदलेखा
मदः + -लेखा<BR>—1 a line of rut, a line formed by the juice flowing from an elephantʼs temples.<BR>—2 a kind of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदविक्षिप्त|मदविक्षिप्तः
मदः + -विक्षिप्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 in rut, furious.<BR>—2 agitated by lust or passion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदविह्वल
मदः + -विह्वल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 maddened by lust or pride.<BR>—2 stupefied with intoxication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदवीर्यम्
मदः + -वीर्यम्<BR>—1 strength produced by passion.<BR>—2 the heroism of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदवृन्दः|मदवृन्द|मदवृंद
मदः + -वृन्दः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदशौण्डः|मदशौण्ड
मदः + -शौण्डः, -शौण्डकम् nutmeg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदशौण्डकम्
मदः + -शौण्डः, -शौण्डकम् nutmeg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदसारः|मदसार
मदः + -सारः a cotton shrub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदस्थलम्
मदः + -स्थलम्, -स्थानम् an ale-house, dram-shop, tavern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदस्थानम्
मदः + -स्थलम्, -स्थानम् an ale-house, dram-shop, tavern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदन|मदनः
मदन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>) [माद्यति अनेन, मद्-करणे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Intoxicating, maddening.<BR>—2 Delighting, exhilarating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदनः|मदन
मदन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 The god of love, Cupid; व्यापाररोधि मदनस्य निषेवितव्यम् Ś. 1. 27;<BR> हतमपि निहन्त्येव मदनः Bh. 3. 18.<BR>—2 Love, passion, sexual love, lust; विनयवारितवृत्तिरतस्तया न विवृतो<BR> मदनो न च संवृतः Ś. 2. 11; सतन्त्रिगीतं मदनस्य दीपकम्<BR> Ṛs. 1. 3; R. 5. 63; so मदनातुर, मदनपीडित &c.<BR>—3 The spring season.<BR>—4 A bee.<BR>—5 Beesʼ-wax.<BR>—6 A kind of embrace.<BR>—7 The Dhattūra plant.<BR>—8 The Khadira tree.<BR>—9 The Bakula tree.<BR>—10 N. of the 7th mansion (in astrol.).<BR>—11 A kind of measure (in music).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदना
मदन + .{@-ना, -नी@}<BR>—1 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—2 Musk.<BR>—3 The <i>atimukta</i> creeper. (नी only in these two senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदनी
मदन + .{@-ना, -नी@}<BR>—1 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—2 Musk.<BR>—3 The <i>atimukta</i> creeper. (नी only in these two senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदनम्
मदन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Intoxicating.<BR>—2 Gladdening, delighting.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मदनाग्रकः, मदनाङ्कुशः, मदनात्ययः, मदनान्तकः, मदनारिः, मदनदमनः, मदनदहनः, मदननाशनः, मदनरिपुः, मदनावस्थ, मदनातपत्रम्, मदनातुर, मदनार्त, मदनक्लिष्ट, मदनपीडित, मदनायुधम्, मदनालयः, मदनालयम्, मदनाशयः, मदनेच्छाफलम्, मदनोत्सवः, मदनोत्सुक, मदनोद्यानम्, मदनकण्टकः, मदनकलहः, मदनकाकुरवः, मदनगृहम्, मदनगोपालः, मदनचतुर्दशी, मदनतन्त्रम्, मदनत्रयोदशी, मदनद्वादशी, मदनध्वजा, मदननालिका, मदनपक्षिन्, मदनपाठकः, मदनपीडा, मदनबाधा, मदनमहः, मदनमहोत्सवः, मदनमोहनः, मदनरसः, मदनललितम्, मदनललिता, मदनलेखः, मदनवश, मदनविनोदः, मदनशलाका, मदनसंदेशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदनाग्रकः|मदनाग्रक
मदन + -अग्रकः a species of grain (कोद्रव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मदनाङ्कुशः|मदनाङ्कुश|मदनांकुश
मदन + -अङ्कुशः<BR>—1 the penis.<BR>—2 a finger-nail, or a wound inflicted by it in cohabitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1227-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

