मन्त्रिता, -त्वम्<BR> Ministership, office of a minister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1237-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

