मन्थरविवेक|मंथरविवेक
मन्थर + -विवेक <i>a.</i> slow in judgment, void of discrimination; उन्मथ्य<BR> मन्थरविवेकमकाण्ड एव Māl. 1. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1237-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्थरित
