मन्थरुः|मन्थरु|मंथरु|मंथरुः
मन्थरुः The wind produced by the waving of a <i>chowrie</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1237-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्थानः|मन्थान|मंथान|मंथानः
मन्थानः [मन्थ्-आनच्]<BR>—1 A churning-stick; प्रविवेशाथ पातालं मन्थानः पर्वतोपमः Rām.<BR>—2 An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1237-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्थानकः|मन्थानक|मंथानक|मंथानकः
मन्थानकः A kind of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1237-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्थिन्|मंथिन्
मन्थिन् <i>a.</i> [मन्थ् णिनि]<BR>—1 Churning, stirring.<BR>—2 Afflicting, annoying. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 Semen virile.<BR>—2 Ved. Soma juice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1237-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्थिनी|मंथिनी
