मन्दात्मन्|मंदात्मन्
मन्द + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> dull-witted, silly, ignorant; मन्दात्मानुजिघृक्षया Malli.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1238-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्दादर|मंदादर
मन्द + -आदर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having little respect for, disregarding, caring little for.<BR>—2 neglectful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1238-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

