मन्दोच्चः|मन्दोच्च
मन्द + -उच्चः the upper apsis of the course of a planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1238-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मन्दोत्साह|मंदोत्साह
