मराल|मरालः
मराल <i>a.</i> [मृ-आलच्]<BR>—1 Soft, greasy, unctuous.<BR>—2 Bland, tender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मरालः|मराल
मराल + .{@-लः@}<BR>.(-ली <i>f.</i>) A swan, flamingo, goose; मरालकुलनायकः कथय<BR> रे कथं वर्तताम् Bv. 1. 3; विधेहि मरालविकारम् Gīt. 11; N. 6. 72.<BR>—2 A kind of duck (कारण्डव).<BR>—3 A horse.<BR>—4 A cloud.<BR>—5 Collyrium.<BR>—6 A grove of pomegranate trees.<BR>—7 A rogue, cheat.<BR>—8 A particular mode of joining the hands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मरालकः|मरालक
मरालकः A gander, swan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मरालिका
मरालिका N. of a plant and its pod (Mar. शिककाई); Gīrvāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

