मरीचिः|मरीचि
मरीचिः (Rarely मरीची also) <i>m. f.</i> [मृ-ईचि Uṇ. 4. 70]<BR>—1 A ray of light; न चन्द्रमरीचयः V. 3. 10; सवितुर्मरीचिभिः<BR> Ṛs. 1. 16; R. 9. 13, 13. 4.<BR>—2 A particle of light.<BR>—3 Light.<BR>—4 Mirage.<BR>—5 A spark of fire; मरीच्य इव निष्पेतुरग्नेर्धूमाकुलार्चिषः Rām. 1. 56. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मरीची
मरीचिः (Rarely मरीची also) <i>m. f.</i> [मृ-ईचि Uṇ. 4. 70]<BR>—1 A ray of light; न चन्द्रमरीचयः V. 3. 10; सवितुर्मरीचिभिः<BR> Ṛs. 1. 16; R. 9. 13, 13. 4.<BR>—2 A particle of light.<BR>—3 Light.<BR>—4 Mirage.<BR>—5 A spark of fire; मरीच्य इव निष्पेतुरग्नेर्धूमाकुलार्चिषः Rām. 1. 56. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मरीचिः|मरीचि
मरीचिः (Rarely मरीची also) + .{@-चिः@}<BR>—1 N. of a Prajāpati, one of the ten patriarchs created by the first<BR> Manu, or one of the ten mind-born sons of Brahman; he was father of Kaśyapa.<BR>—2 N. of a lawgiver.<BR>—3 N. of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—4 A miser.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मरीचिगर्भ, मरीचितोयम्, मरीचिप, मरीचिमालिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मरीचिगर्भ
मरीचिः + -गर्भ <i>a.</i> containing particles of light (N. of a world).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मरीचितोयम्
मरीचिः + -तोयम् a mirage; मरीचितोयान्यभिधावति क्वचित् Bhāg. 5. 13. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मरीचिप
