मरीचिमालिन्
मरीचिः + -मालिन् <i>a.</i> encircled by rays, radiant, shining. ━(<i>m.</i>) the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मरीचिका
मरीचिका Mirage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मरीचिन्
मरीचिन्, मरीचिमत् <i>a.</i> Radiant, lustrous. ━<i>m.</i> The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1241-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

