मर्ब्
मर्ब् €1 P. (मर्बति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मन्|मर्म्मन्
मर्मन् <i>n.</i> [मृ-मनिन्]<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) (A vital part of the body, the vitals, weak or tender point of<BR> the body); तथैव तीव्रो हृदि शोकशङ्कुर्मर्माणि कृन्तन्नपि किं न सोढः<BR> U. 3. 35; Y. 1. 153; Bk. 16; स्वहृदयमर्मणि वर्म करोति Gīt. 4.<BR> (b) Any vital member or organ.<BR>—2 Any weak or vulnerable point, a defect, failing; तेऽन्योन्यमभिसंसृत्य<BR> क्षिपन्तो मर्मभिर्मिथः Bhāg. 8. 10. 27.<BR>—3 The core, quick.<BR>—4 Any joint (of a limb).<BR>—5 The secret or hidden meaning, the pith or essence (of anything); काव्यमर्मप्रकाशिका<BR> टीका; नत्वा गङ्गाधरं मर्मप्रकाशं तनुते गुरुम् नागेशभट्ट.<BR>—6 A secret, a mystery.<BR>—7 Truth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मर्मातिग, मर्मान्वेषणम्, मर्मावरणम्, मर्माविध्, मर्मोपघातिन्, मर्मकीलः, मर्मग, मर्मघातः, मर्मघ्न, मर्मचरम्, मर्मच्छिद्, मर्मभिद्, मर्मजम्, मर्मज्ञ, मर्मज्ञानम्, मर्मत्रम्, मर्मपारग, मर्मपीडा, मर्मभेदः, मर्मभेदनः, मर्मभेदिन्, मर्मविद्, मर्मसंधिः, मर्मस्थलम्, मर्मस्थानम्, मर्मस्पृश्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मातिग
मर्मन् + -अतिग <i>a.</i> piercing deeply into the vital parts; तथा मर्मातिगैर्भीष्मो<BR> निजघान महारथान् Mb. 6. 90. 85; मर्मातिगैरनृजुभिर्नितरामशुद्धैर्वाक्सायकैरथ<BR> तुतोद तदा विपक्षः Śi. 20. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मान्वेषणम्
मर्मन् + -अन्वेषणम्<BR>—1 probing the vital parts.<BR>—2 seeking weak or vulnerable points.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मावरणम्
मर्मन् + -आवरणम् an armour, a coat of mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्माविध्|मर्म्माविध्
मर्मन् + -आविध्, -उपघातिन् <i>a.</i> piercing the vitals (of the heart); अपि<BR> मर्माविधो वाचः सत्यं रोमाञ्चयन्ति माम् Mv. 3. 10; चिरं क्लिशित्वा<BR> मर्माविध् (v. l. मर्माविद्) रामो विलुभितप्लवम् Bk. 5. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मोपघातिन्
मर्मन् + -आविध्, -उपघातिन् <i>a.</i> piercing the vitals (of the heart); अपि<BR> मर्माविधो वाचः सत्यं रोमाञ्चयन्ति माम् Mv. 3. 10; चिरं क्लिशित्वा<BR> मर्माविध् (v. l. मर्माविद्) रामो विलुभितप्लवम् Bk. 5. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मकीलः|मर्मकील|मर्म्मकीलः
मर्मन् + -कीलः a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मग
मर्मन् + -ग <i>a.</i> piercing to the quick, very acute, poignant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मघातः|मर्मघात
मर्मन् + -घातः wounding the vitals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मघ्न
मर्मन् + -घ्न <i>a.</i> piercing the vitals, excessively painful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मचरम्
मर्मन् + -चरम् the heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मच्छिद्
मर्मन् + -छिद्, -भिद् (so<BR> {@-छेदिन्, -भेदिन्@}) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 piercing the vitals, cutting to the quick, excessively painful;<BR> प्रहरति विधिर्मर्मच्छेदी न कृन्तति जीवितम् U. 3. 31; Māl. 9. 12.<BR>—2 wounding mortally, mortal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मभिद्|मर्म्मभिद्
मर्मन् + -छिद्, -भिद् (so<BR> {@-छेदिन्, -भेदिन्@}) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 piercing the vitals, cutting to the quick, excessively painful;<BR> प्रहरति विधिर्मर्मच्छेदी न कृन्तति जीवितम् U. 3. 31; Māl. 9. 12.<BR>—2 wounding mortally, mortal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मजम्
मर्मन् + -जम् blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मज्ञ|मर्मज्ञः|मर्म्मज्ञ|मर्म्मज्ञः
मर्मन् + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i>, {@-विद्@} <i>a.</i><BR>—1 knowing the weak or vulnerable points of another; Pt. 1. 248.<BR>—2 knowing the most secret portions of a subject.<BR>—3 knowing secrets or mysteries.<BR>—4 having a deep insight into anything, exceedingly acute or clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मज्ञः|मर्मज्ञ|मर्म्मज्ञ|मर्म्मज्ञः
मर्मन् + -ज्ञ + ({@-ज्ञः@})<BR> any acute or learned man; ते ह्यस्य मर्मज्ञभयात् नापराध्यन्ति Kau. A. 1. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मज्ञानम्
मर्मन् + -ज्ञानम् knowledge of a secret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मत्रम्
मर्मन् + -त्रम् a coat of mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मपारग
मर्मन् + -पारग <i>a.</i> having a deep insight<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">Page1243-1</a>]<BR> into, thoroughly conversant with, one who has entered into the secret<BR> recesses of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1242-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मपीडा
मर्मन् + -पीडा pain in the inmost soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मभेदः|मर्मभेद
मर्मन् + -भेदः<BR>—1 piercing the vitals.<BR>—2 disclosing the secrets or vulnerable points of another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मभेदनः|मर्मभेदन
मर्मन् + -भेदनः, -भेदिन् <i>m.</i> an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मभेदिन्|मर्म्मभेदिन्
मर्मन् + -भेदनः, -भेदिन् <i>m.</i> an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मविद्|मर्म्मविद्
मर्मन् + -विद् see मर्मज्ञ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मसंधिः|मर्मसन्धि
मर्मन् + -संधिः <i>m.</i> (pl.) joints and articulations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मस्थलम्
मर्मन् + -स्थलम्, -स्थानम्<BR>—1 a sensitive or vital part.<BR>—2 a weak or vulnerable point.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मस्थानम्
मर्मन् + -स्थलम्, -स्थानम्<BR>—1 a sensitive or vital part.<BR>—2 a weak or vulnerable point.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मस्पृश्|मर्म्मस्पृश्
मर्मन् + -स्पृश् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 piercing the vitals, stinging to the quick; त एते हृदयमर्मस्पृशः<BR> संसारभावाः U.<BR>—2 very cutting, poignant, sharp or stinging (words &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मिक|मर्म्मिक|मर्म्मिकः
मर्मिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Knowing secrets or weak points.<BR>—2 Very acute, intelligent; see मर्मज्ञ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मर|मर्मरः|मर्म्मर|मर्म्मरः
मर्मर <i>a.</i> [मृ-अरन् मुट् च]<BR>—1 Rustling (leaves, garments &c.); तीरेषु तालीवनमर्मरेषु R. 6. 57, 4. 73, 19. 41;<BR> मदोद्धताः प्रत्यनिलं विचेरुर्वनस्थलीर्मर्मरपत्रमोक्षाः Ku. 3. 31.<BR>—2 Murmuring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मरः|मर्मर|मर्म्मर|मर्म्मरः
मर्मर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A rustling sound.<BR>—2 A murmur.<BR>—3 A kind of garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मरा
मर्मर + .{@-रा@} Coarse ground meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मरायते
मर्मरायते Den. Ā. To rustle, murmur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मरी|मर्म्मरी
मर्मरी<BR>—1 A species of pine tree.<BR>—2 Turmeric.<BR>—3 A particular vein in the external ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्मरीकः|मर्मरीक|मर्म्मरीक|मर्म्मरीकः
मर्मरीकः<BR>—1 A poor man, pauper.<BR>—2 A wicked man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्य|मर्यः
मर्य <i>a.</i> Ved. Mortal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यः|मर्य
मर्य + .{@-र्यः@}<BR>—1 A man.<BR>—2 A young man.<BR>—3 A male.<BR>—4 A lover, suitor.<BR>—5 A stallion, horse.<BR>—6 A camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यकः|मर्यक
मर्यकः Ved.<BR>—1 A little man.<BR>—2 A male in general; के मे मर्यकं वि यवन्त Rv. 5. 2. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्या|मर्य्या
मर्या —1 A limit, boundary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादा|मर्य्यादा
मर्यादा [मर्यायां सीमायां दीयते दा-घञर्थे क]<BR>—1 A limit, boundary (fig. also); bound, border, frontier, verge; मर्यादाव्यतिक्रमः Pt. 1.<BR>—2 End, termination, terminus.<BR>—3 A shore, bank.<BR>—4 A mark, land-mark.<BR>—5 The bounds of morality, any fixed usage or established rule, moral<BR> law; मर्यादानां च लोकस्य कर्ता कारयिता च सः Rām. 5. 35. 11.<BR>—6 A rule of propriety or decorum, bounds or limits of propriety, propriety<BR> of conduct; आस्तातापवादभिन्नमर्याद U. 5; मर्यादायाममर्यादाः<BR> स्त्रियस्तिष्ठन्ति सर्वदा Pt. 1. 142.<BR>—7 A contract, covenant, an agreement; गृह्यतां पाणिना पाणिर्मर्यादा<BR> बध्यतां ध्रुवा Rām. 4. 5. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मर्यादाचलः, मर्यादागिरिः, मर्यादापर्वतः, मर्यादाधावनम्, मर्यादाबन्धः, मर्यादाभेदकः, मर्यादावचनम्, मर्यादाव्यतिक्रमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादाचलः|मर्यादाचल
मर्यादा + -अचलः, -गिरिः, -पर्वतः a frontier-mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादागिरिः|मर्यादागिरि|मर्य्यादागिरिः
मर्यादा + -अचलः, -गिरिः, -पर्वतः a frontier-mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादापर्वतः|मर्यादापर्वत
मर्यादा + -अचलः, -गिरिः, -पर्वतः a frontier-mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादाधावनम्
मर्यादा + -धावनम् running towards a mark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादाबन्धः|मर्यादाबन्ध
मर्यादा + -बन्धः keeping within limits; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादाभेदकः|मर्यादाभेदक
मर्यादा + -भेदकः a destroyer of land-marks; मर्यादाभेदकश्चैव विकृतं<BR> प्राप्नुयाद्वधम् Ms. 9. 291.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादावचनम्
मर्यादा + -वचनम् statement of the limit; P. III. 3. 136.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादाव्यतिक्रमः|मर्यादाव्यतिक्रम
मर्यादा + -व्यतिक्रमः overstepping limits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादिन्
मर्यादिन् <i>a.</i> Keeping within bounds. ━<i>m.</i> A neighbour, borderer; Nir. 4. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्यादीकृ
मर्यादीकृ €8 U. To make anything a limit, to reach, attain to, go<BR> as far as; as in मरणं मर्यादीकृत्य आमरणम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्व्
मर्व् €1 P. (मर्वति)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To fill. ━<i>Caus.</i> To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्शः|मर्श
मर्शः [मृश्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Deliberation.<BR>—2 Advice, counsel.<BR>—3 A sternutatory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्शनम्
मर्शनम्<BR>—1 Rubbing.<BR>—2 Examination, inquiry.<BR>—3 Consideration, deliberation.<BR>—4 A dvising, counselling.<BR>—5 Removing, rubbing off.<BR>—6 Explaining.<BR>—7 Touching (a woman); परस्वहारे परदारमर्शने Mb. 3. 314. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्षः|मर्ष
मर्षः, -मर्षणम्<BR> [मृष्-घञ् ल्युट् वा] Endurance, forbearance, patience;<BR> द्विषतामुदयः सुमेधसा गुरुरस्वन्ततरः सुमर्षणः Ki. 2. 8; A. Rām. 7. 4. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्षणम्
मर्षः, -मर्षणम्<BR> [मृष्-घञ् ल्युट् वा] Endurance, forbearance, patience;<BR> द्विषतामुदयः सुमेधसा गुरुरस्वन्ततरः सुमर्षणः Ki. 2. 8; A. Rām. 7. 4. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1243-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मर्षित|मर्षितः
