मलनम् + .{@-नः@} A tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयः|मलय
मलयः<BR>—1 N. of a mountain range in the south of India, abounding in sandal trees;<BR> (poets usually represent the breeze from the Malaya mountain as wafting<BR> the odour of sandal trees and other plants growing thereon, which peculiarly<BR> affects persons who are smit with love); स्तनाविव दिशस्तस्याः शैलौ<BR> मलयदर्दुरौ R. 4. 51, 9. 25, 13. 2; विना मलयमन्यत्र चन्दनं<BR> न प्ररोहति Pt. 1. 41; मलये भिल्लपुरन्ध्री चन्दनतरुकाष्ठमिन्धनं<BR> कुरुते Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 N. of the country lying to the east of the Malaya range, Malabar.<BR>—3 A garden.<BR>—4 The garden of Indra.<BR>—5 The side of a mountain.<BR>—6 (In music) A kind of measure.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मलयाचलः, मलयाद्रिः, मलयगिरिः, मलयपर्वतः, मलयानिलः, मलयवातः, मलयसमीरः, मलयोद्भवम्, मलयजः, मलयद्रुमः, मलयवासिनी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयाचलः|मलयाचल
मलयः + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -गिरिः, -पर्वतः &c. the Malaya mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयाद्रिः|मलयाद्रि
मलयः + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -गिरिः, -पर्वतः &c. the Malaya mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयगिरिः|मलयगिरि
मलयः + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -गिरिः, -पर्वतः &c. the Malaya mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयपर्वतः|मलयपर्वत
मलयः + -अचलः, -अद्रिः, -गिरिः, -पर्वतः &c. the Malaya mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयानिलः|मलयानिल
मलयः + -अनिलः, -वातः, -समीरः the wind blowing from the Malaya mountain,<BR> south-wind; ललितलवङ्गलतापरिशीलनकोमलमलयसमीरे Gīt. 1;<BR> cf. अपगतदाक्षिण्य दक्षिणानिलहतक पूर्णास्ते मनोरथाः कृतं कर्तव्यं<BR> वहेदानीं यथेष्टम् K.; Dk. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयवातः|मलयवात
मलयः + -अनिलः, -वातः, -समीरः the wind blowing from the Malaya mountain,<BR> south-wind; ललितलवङ्गलतापरिशीलनकोमलमलयसमीरे Gīt. 1;<BR> cf. अपगतदाक्षिण्य दक्षिणानिलहतक पूर्णास्ते मनोरथाः कृतं कर्तव्यं<BR> वहेदानीं यथेष्टम् K.; Dk. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयसमीरः|मलयसमीर
मलयः + -अनिलः, -वातः, -समीरः the wind blowing from the Malaya mountain,<BR> south-wind; ललितलवङ्गलतापरिशीलनकोमलमलयसमीरे Gīt. 1;<BR> cf. अपगतदाक्षिण्य दक्षिणानिलहतक पूर्णास्ते मनोरथाः कृतं कर्तव्यं<BR> वहेदानीं यथेष्टम् K.; Dk. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयोद्भवम्
मलयः + -उद्भवम् sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयजः|मलयज|मलयजं
मलयः + -जः a sandal tree; अयि मलयज महिमायं कस्य गिरामस्तु विषयस्ते Bv. 1. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयजः|मलयज|मलयजं
मलयः + -जः + .({@-जः, -जम्@}) sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयजम्
मलयः + -जः + .({@-जः, -जम्@}) sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयजम्
मलयः + -जः + .({@-जम्@}) an epithet of Rāhu. ˚रजस् <i>n.</i> the dust of sandal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयद्रुमः|मलयद्रुम
मलयः + -द्रुमः a sandal tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलयवासिनी
मलयः + -वासिनी an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलाका
मलाका<BR>—1 An amorous or lustful woman.<BR>—2 A female messenger, confidante.<BR>—3 A female elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिः|मलि
मलिः <i>f.</i> Possession, enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिकः|मलिक
मलिकः A king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिन|मलिनं
मलिन <i>a.</i> [मल अस्त्यर्थे इनन्]<BR>—1 Dirty, foul, filthy, impure, unclean, soiled, stained, sullied (fig.<BR> also); धन्यास्तदङ्गरजसा मलिनीभवन्ति Ś. 7. 17; किमिति मुधा<BR> मलिनं यशः कुरुध्वे Ve. 3. 4.<BR>—2 Black, dark (fig. also); मलिनमपि हिमांशोर्लक्ष्म लक्ष्मीं तनोति<BR> Ś. 1. 20; अतिमलिने कर्तव्ये भवति खलानामतीव निपुणा धीः Vās.; Śi. 9. 18.<BR>—3 Sinful, wicked, depraved; धियो हि पुंसां मलिना भवन्ति H. 1. 26;<BR> मलिनाचरितं कर्म सुरभेर्नन्वसांप्रतम् Kāv. 2. 178.<BR>—4 Low, vile, base; लघवः प्रकटीभवन्ति मलिनाश्रयतः Śi. 9. 23.<BR>—5 Clouded, obscured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनम्
मलिन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Sin, fault, guilt.<BR>—2 Butter-milk.<BR>—3 Borax.<BR>—4 A dirty cloth; ततो मलिनसंवीतां राक्षसीभिः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">Page1244-2</a>]<BR> समावृताम् Rām. 5. 15. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिना
मलिन + .{@-ना, -नी@} A woman during menstruation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मलिनाम्बु, मलिनास्य, मलिनप्रभ, मलिनमुख<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनी
मलिन + .{@-ना, -नी@} A woman during menstruation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मलिनाम्बु, मलिनास्य, मलिनप्रभ, मलिनमुख<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनाम्बु|मलिनांबु
मलिन + -अम्बु <i>n.</i> ‘black water’, ink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनास्य|मलिनास्यः
मलिन + -आस्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having a dirty or black face.<BR>—2 low, vulgar.<BR>—3 savage, cruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनप्रभ
मलिन + -प्रभ <i>a.</i> obscured, soiled, clouded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनमुख|मलिनमुखः
मलिन + -मुख <i>a.</i> = मलिनास्य q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनमुखः|मलिनमुख
मलिन + -मुख + .({@-खः@})<BR>—1 fire.<BR>—2 a ghost, an evil spirt.<BR>—3 a kind of monkey (गोलाङ्गृल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनता
मलिनता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Dirtiness, filthiness.<BR>—2 Sinfulness, wickedness, depravity, corruption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनत्वम्
मलिनता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Dirtiness, filthiness.<BR>—2 Sinfulness, wickedness, depravity, corruption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनयति
मलिनयति Den. P. —1 To make dirty, soil, stain, defile, sully, spoil<BR> (fig. also); वक्त्रोष्मणा मलिनयन्ति पुरोगतानि R. 5. 73; यदा मेधाविनी<BR> शिष्योपदेशं मलिनयति तदाचार्यस्य दोषो ननु M.<BR>—1 ‘stains or brings discredit on’ &c.<BR>—2 To corrupt, deprave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनित
मलिनित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Dirty, soiled.<BR>—2 Corrupt.<BR>—3 Wicked, depraved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनिमन्
मलिनिमन् <i>m.</i> [मलिन-इमनिच्]<BR>—1 Dirtiness, foulness, impurity.<BR>—2 Blackness, darkness; मलिनिमालिनि माधवयोषिताम् Śi. 6. 4.<BR>—3 Moral impurity, sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनीकृ
मलिनीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To soil, stain.<BR>—2 To darken, obscure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिनीभू
मलिनीभू €1 P. To become dirty or impure, be soiled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिम्लुचः|मलिम्लुच
मलिम्लुचः<BR>—1 A robber, thief; न परेषु महौजसश्छलादपकुर्वन्ति मलिम्लुचा इव Śi. 16. 52.<BR>—2 A demon.<BR>—3 A gnat, mosquito.<BR>—4 An intercalary month.<BR>—5 A ir, wind.<BR>—6 Fire.<BR>—7 A Brāhmaṇa who neglects the five daily Yajñas or sacrifices.<BR>—8 The Chitraka tree. —9 Frost, snow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलिष्ठा
मलिष्ठा A woman in her courses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलीमस|मलीमसं|मलीमसः
मलीमस <i>a.</i> [मल-ईमसच्]<BR>—1 Dirty, foul, impure, unclean, stained, soiled; मा ते मलीमसविकारघना<BR> मतिर्भूत् Māl. 1. 32; R. 2. 53.<BR>—2 Dark, black, of a black colour; पणिता न जनारवैरवैदपि कूजन्तमलिं<BR> मलीमसम् N. 2. 92; महामनोमोहमलीमसान्धया K. 5; विसारितामजिहत<BR> कोकिलावलीमलीमसा जलदमदाम्बुराजयः Śi. 17. 57, 1. 38; Māl. 10. 4.<BR>—3 Wicked, sinful, wrong, unrighteous; मलीमसामाददते न पद्धतिम् R. 3. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलीमसः|मलीमस|मलीमसं
मलीमस + .{@-सः@}<BR>—1 Iron.<BR>—2 Green vitriol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मलूकः|मलूक
मलूकः A kind of worm; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्ल्
मल्ल् €1 Ā. (मल्लते) To hold, possess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्ल|मल्लः
मल्ल <i>a.</i> [मल्ल्-अच्]<BR>—1 Strong, athletic, robust; Ki. 18. 8.<BR>—2 Good, excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्लः|मल्ल
मल्ल + .{@-ल्लः@}<BR>—1 A strong man.<BR>—2 An athlete, a boxer, wrestler; प्रभुर्मल्लो मल्लाय Mbh.<BR>—3 A drinking-vessel, cup.<BR>—4 The remnants of an oblation.<BR>—5 The cheek and temple.<BR>—6 N. of a mixed tribe (wrestlers) born of an outcast Kṣatriya by a Kṣatriya<BR> woman; झल्लो मल्लश्च राजन्याद् व्रात्यान्निच्छिविरेव च Ms. 10. 22, 12. 45.<BR>—7 N. of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्ला
मल्ल + .{@-मल्ला@}<BR>—1 A woman.<BR>—2 The Arabian jasmine.<BR>—3 Ornamenting the person with cosmetics or coloured unguents.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मल्लारिः, मल्लक्रीडा, मल्लघटी, मल्लजम्, मल्लतालः, मल्लतूर्यम्, मल्लनागः, मल्लभूः, मल्लभूमिः, मल्लयात्रा, मल्लयुद्धम्, मल्लविद्या, मल्लशाला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्लारिः|मल्लारि
मल्ल + -अरिः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1245-1" target="_blank">Page1245-1</a>]<BR>—1 an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—2 of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1244-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्लक्रीडा
मल्ल + -क्रीडा<BR>—1 boxing or wrestling match.<BR>—2 athletic or gymnastic exercise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1245-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्लघटी
मल्ल + -घटी a kind of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1245-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्लजम्
मल्ल + -जम् black pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1245-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्लतालः|मल्लताल
मल्ल + -तालः (in music) a kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1245-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्लतूर्यम्
मल्ल + -तूर्यम् a kind of drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1245-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्लनागः|मल्लनाग
मल्ल + -नागः<BR>—1 Indraʼs elephant.<BR>—2 a letter-carrier.<BR>—3 N. of वात्स्यायन, the author of कामसूत्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1245-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मल्लभूः
