मसुरः|मसुर
मसु(सू)रः<BR>—1 A kind of pulse.<BR>—2 A pillow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसूरः|मसूर
मसु(सू)रः<BR>—1 A kind of pulse.<BR>—2 A pillow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसुरा
मसु(सू)रः + .{@-रा@}<BR>—1 A lentil.<BR>—2 A harlot.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मसुरविदलः, मसुरविदलम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसुरविदलः
मसुरः + -विदलः, -विदलम् a split lentil; मसूरविदलाकारलूताक्लिन्नकलेवरः<BR> Rāj. T. 6. 187.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसुरविदलम्
मसुरः + -विदलः, -विदलम् a split lentil; मसूरविदलाकारलूताक्लिन्नकलेवरः<BR> Rāj. T. 6. 187.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसूरकः|मसूरक
मसूरकः A pillow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसूरकम्
मसूरकः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A kind of ornament on Indraʼs banner.<BR>—2 A variety of pearls; Kau. A. 2. 11. 29.<BR>—3 A lintel, <i>i. e.</i> the piece of timber or stone that covers an opening<BR> and supports a weight above it; मसूरकमधिष्ठानं वस्त्वाधारं धरातलम्<BR> Kāmikāgama 55. 202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसूरिका
मसूरिका<BR>—1 A kind of small-pox (erection of small pustules).<BR>—2 A mosquito-curtain.<BR>—3 A procuress, bawd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसूरी
मसूरी<BR>—1 A kind of small-pox.<BR>—2 Impomoea Turpethum (Mar. तेंडू, तिधारें).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसृण|मसृणं
मसृण^1 <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unctuous, oily; मसृणचन्दनचर्चिताङ्गीम् C. P. 7; or सरसमसृणमपि<BR> मलयजपङ्कम् Gīt. 4.<BR>—2 Soft, tender, smooth; अयं बाहुः कण्ठे शिशिरमसृणो मौक्तिकसरः U. 1. 38.<BR>—3 Bland, mild, sweet; भण मसृणवाणि करवाणि चरणद्वयं सरसलसदलक्तकरागम् Gīt. 10.<BR>—4 Lovely, charming; विनयमसृणो वाचि नियमः U. 2. 2, 4. 21.<BR>—5 Beaming, glistening; मसृणमुकुलितानां प्रान्तविस्तारभाजाम् (आलोकितानाम्)<BR> Māl. 1. 27, 4. 2.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसृणा
मसृणः + .{@-णा@} Linseed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसृणयति
मसृणयति Den. P. To make soft or smooth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मसृणित
मसृणित <i>a.</i> Softened, polished; एतस्मिन् मसृणितराजपट्टकान्ते U. 5. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्क्
मस्क् €1 P. (मस्कति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्करः|मस्कर
मस्करः [मस्क्-अरच्]<BR>—1 A bamboo.<BR>—2 A hollow bamboo; सुस्तम्भां मस्करैर्दीर्घैः कृतवंशां सुशोभनाम्<BR> Rām. 3. 15. 21.<BR>—3 Going, motion.<BR>—4 Knowledge (ज्ञान).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्करिन्
मस्करिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 An ascetic or religious mendicant, a Brāhmaṇa in the fourth order;<BR> धारयन् मस्करिव्रतम् Bk. 5. 63.<BR>—2 The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्ज्
मस्ज् €6 P. (मज्जति, मग्न; <i>caus.</i> मज्जयति; <i>desid.</i><BR> मिमङ्क्षति)<BR>—1 To bathe, plunge, dip or throw oneself into water; यद्गोप्रतरकल्पोऽभूत्<BR> संमर्दस्तत्र मज्जताम् R. 15. 101; Bv. 2. 95.<BR>—2 To sink, sink into or down, sink under, plunge (with loc. or acc.);<BR> सीदन्नन्धे तमसि विधुरो मज्जतीवान्तरात्मा U. 3. 38; Māl. 9. 20;<BR> सोऽसंवृतं नाम तमः सह तेनैव मज्जति Ms. 4. 81; R. 16. 72.<BR>—3 To be drowned, perish (in water).<BR>—4 To sink into misfortune.<BR>—5 To despond, be discouraged or disheartened. ━<i>Caus.</i> (मज्जयति)<BR>—1 To cause to sink, immerse, dip, drown.<BR>—2 To deluge, inundate, overwhelm.<BR>—3 To thrust, to pass into; ततो मर्मसु मर्मज्ञो मज्जयन् निशितान् शरान्<BR> Rām. 6. 45. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तम्
मस्तम् The head; मस्ते दुःसहवेदनाकवलिते Viś. Guṇā. 539.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मस्तदारुः, मस्तमूलकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तदारुः|मस्तदारु
मस्तम् + -दारुः <i>n.</i> the <i>devadāru</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तमूलकम्
मस्तम् + -मूलकम् the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तकः|मस्तक|मस्तकं
मस्तकः, -कम्<BR> [मस्मति परिमात्यनेन मस्-करणे त स्वार्थे क Tv.]<BR>—1 The head, skull; अतिलोभा (v. l. तृष्णा) भिभूतस्य चक्रं भ्रमति<BR> मस्तके Pt. 5. 22.<BR>—2 The head or top of anything, peak, summit; न च पर्वतमस्तके<BR> Ms. 4. 47; वृक्ष˚, चुल्ली˚ &c.<BR>—3 The tuft of leaves growing at the top of palm trees.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मस्तकाख्यः, मस्तकोद्भवः, मस्तकज्वरः, मस्तकशूलम्, मस्तकपिण्डकः, मस्तकपिण्डकम्, मस्तकमूलकम्, मस्तकलुङ्गः, मस्तकस्नेहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तकम्
मस्तकः, -कम्<BR> [मस्मति परिमात्यनेन मस्-करणे त स्वार्थे क Tv.]<BR>—1 The head, skull; अतिलोभा (v. l. तृष्णा) भिभूतस्य चक्रं भ्रमति<BR> मस्तके Pt. 5. 22.<BR>—2 The head or top of anything, peak, summit; न च पर्वतमस्तके<BR> Ms. 4. 47; वृक्ष˚, चुल्ली˚ &c.<BR>—3 The tuft of leaves growing at the top of palm trees.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मस्तकाख्यः, मस्तकोद्भवः, मस्तकज्वरः, मस्तकशूलम्, मस्तकपिण्डकः, मस्तकपिण्डकम्, मस्तकमूलकम्, मस्तकलुङ्गः, मस्तकस्नेहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तकाख्यः|मस्तकाख्य
मस्तकः + -आख्यः the top of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तकोद्भवः|मस्तकोद्भव
मस्तकः + -उद्भवः the brain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तकज्वरः|मस्तकज्वर
मस्तकः + -ज्वरः, -शूलम् an acute head-ache.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तकशूलम्
मस्तकः + -ज्वरः, -शूलम् an acute head-ache.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

