मस्तकः + -पिण्डकः, -पिण्डकम् a round protuberance on the temples of an elephant in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तकपिण्डकम्
मस्तकः + -पिण्डकः, -पिण्डकम् a round protuberance on the temples of an elephant in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

