मस्तकः + -लुङ्गः the membrane surrounding the brain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तकस्नेहः|मस्तकस्नेह
मस्तकः + -स्नेहः<BR>—1 the brain.<BR>—2 an oily substance appearing on the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

