मस्तिः <i>f.</i> Measuring, weighing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तिष्कम्
मस्तिष्कम्<BR>—1 The brain; महाहिमस्तिष्कविभेदमुक्तरक्तच्छटाचर्चितचण्डचञ्चुः<BR> (गरुत्मान्) Nāg. 4; Ve. 1. 27.<BR>—2 Any medicine acting upon the brain.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मस्तिष्कत्वच्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मस्तिष्कत्वच्
मस्तिष्कम् + -त्वच् <i>f.</i> the membrane which surrounds the brain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1246-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

