महदाश्रयः|महदाश्रय
महत् + -आश्रयः dependence on or seeking protection with the great.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1247-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महदुन्मदः
महत् + -उन्मदः a kind of fish; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1247-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महदौषधिः
महत् + -औषधिः <i>f.</i> a herb of wonderful power. On the Himālaya there<BR> are trees of the Devadāru family which have got resinous stems. These<BR> stems burn like oil-lamps. These sticks of pinewood, therefore, are the<BR> natural lamps of the Himālaya. cf. सरलासक्तमातङ्गग्रैवेयस्फुरितत्विषः ।<BR> आसन्नोषधयो नेतुर्नक्तमस्नेहदीपिकाः ॥ R. 4. 75; ज्वलितमहौषधिदीपिकासनाथाम् R. 9. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1247-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

