महत् + -कथ <i>a.</i> talked of or mentioned by the great, in great menʼs mouths.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1247-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

