महत् + -कूपः a deep well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1247-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महत्क्षेत्र
