महत्त्वम्
महत्त्वम्<BR>—1 Greatness, largeness, magnitude, great extent.<BR>—2 Mightiness, majesty.<BR>—3 Importance.<BR>—4 Exalted position, height, elevation.<BR>—5 Intensity, violence, high degree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1247-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महनीय
