महा + -गल <i>a.</i> long-necked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1249-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

