महा + -गवः <i>Bos gavoeus</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1249-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महागुण|महागुणः
महा + -गुण <i>a.</i> very efficacious, sovereign (as a medicine); त्वया<BR> ममैष संबन्धः कपिमुख्य महागुणः Rām. 5. 1. 120.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1249-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महागुणः|महागुण
महा + -गुण + .({@-णः@}) a chief quality, cardinal virtue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1249-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महागुरुः|महागुरु
महा + -गुरुः a highly respectable or venerable person; (these are three,<BR> the father, mother and preceptor; पिता माता तथाचार्यो महागुरुरिति स्मृतः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1249-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

