महा + -गुल्मा the Soma plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1249-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महागृष्टिः|महागृष्टि
महा + -गृष्टिः <i>f.</i> a cow with a large hump.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1249-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

