महा + -जङ्घः a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाजटः|महाजट
महा + -जटः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाजटा
महा + -जटा<BR>—1 a great braid of hair.<BR>—2 the matted hair of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाजत्रु|महाजत्रुः
महा + -जत्रु <i>a.</i> having a great collar-bone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाजत्रुः|महाजत्रु
महा + -जत्रु + .({@-त्रुः@}) an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाजनः|महाजन
महा + -जनः<BR>—1 a multitude of men, a great many beings, the general populace or public;<BR> महाजनो येन गतः स पन्थाः Mb. 3. 313. 117; आगम्य तु ततो राजा<BR> विसृज्य च महाजनम् 6. 98. 25.<BR>—2 the populace, mob; विलोक्य वृद्धोक्षमधिष्ठितं त्वया महाजनः स्मेरमुखो<BR> भविष्यति Ku. 5. 70.<BR>—3 a great man, a distinguished or eminent man; महाजनस्य संसर्गः<BR> कस्य नोन्नतिकारकः । पद्मपत्रस्थितं तोयं धत्ते मुक्ताफलश्रियम् Pt. 3. 60.<BR>—4 the chief of a caste or trade.<BR>—5 a merchant, tradesman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाजवः|महाजव
महा + -जवः an antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाजातीय|महाजातीयः
महा + -जातीय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 rather large.<BR>—2 of an excellent kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाजालिः
महा + -जालिः, -जाली N. of a plant (Mar. सोनामुखी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाजाली
महा + -जालिः, -जाली N. of a plant (Mar. सोनामुखी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाजिह्वः|महाजिह्व
महा + -जिह्वः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाज्ञानिन्
महा + -ज्ञानिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a very learned man.<BR>—2 a great sage.<BR>—3 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाज्यैष्ठी
महा + -ज्यैष्ठी the day of full-moon in the month of Jyeṣṭha; ताभिर्दृश्यत<BR> एष यान् पथि महाज्यैष्ठीमहे मन्महे N. 15. 89; पूर्णिमा रविवारेण<BR> महाज्यैष्ठी प्रकीर्तिता Agni P. 121. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाज्योतिस्
महा + -ज्योतिस् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाज्वरः|महाज्वर
महा + -ज्वरः great affliction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाज्वाल|महाज्वालः
महा + -ज्वाल <i>a.</i> very brilliant or shining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाज्वालः|महाज्वाल
महा + -ज्वाल + .({@-लः@})<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 a sacrificial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाडीनम्
महा + -डीनम् a kind of flight; ‘यानं महाडीनमाहुः पवित्रामूर्जितां गतिम्’ Mb. 8. 41. 27 (com.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महातपस्
महा + -तपस् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a great ascetic.<BR>—2 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महातलम्
महा + -तलम् N. of one of the seven lower regions; see पाताल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महातारा
महा + -तारा N. of a Buddhist goddess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महातिक्तः|महातिक्त
महा + -तिक्तः the <i>Nimba</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महातिथिः|महातिथि
महा + -तिथिः the 6th day of lunation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महातीक्ष्ण
महा + -तीक्ष्ण <i>a.</i> exceedingly sharp or pungent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महातीक्ष्णा
महा + -तीक्ष्ण + .({@-क्ष्णा@}) the markingnut plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महातेजस्
महा + -तेजस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 possessed of great lustre or splendour.<BR>—2 very vigorous or powerful, heroic. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a hero, warrior.<BR>—2 fire.<BR>—3 an epithet of Kārtikeya. ━(<i>n.</i>) quick-silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महात्याग
महा + -त्याग, -त्यागिन् <i>a.</i> very generous. ━(<i>m.</i>) N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महात्यागिन्
महा + -त्याग, -त्यागिन् <i>a.</i> very generous. ━(<i>m.</i>) N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादंष्ट्रः|महादंष्ट्र
महा + -दंष्ट्रः a species of big tiger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादन्तः|महादन्त|महादंत
महा + -दन्तः<BR>—1 an elephant with large tusks.<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादण्डः|महादण्ड
महा + -दण्डः<BR>—1 a long arm.<BR>—2 a severe punishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादम्भः|महादम्भ
महा + -दम्भः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादशा
महा + -दशा the influence exercised (over a manʼs destiny) by a predominant planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादानम्
महा + -दानम् the gift of gold equal to oneʼs own weight; अथातः संप्रवक्ष्यामि<BR> महादानस्य लक्षणम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादारु
महा + -दारु <i>n.</i> the <i>devadāru</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादुर्गम्
महा + -दुर्गम् a great calamity; Pt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादूषकः|महादूषक
महा + -दूषकः a kind of grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादेवः|महादेव
महा + -देवः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महादेवी
महा + -देवः + .({@-वी@})<BR>—1 N. of Pārvatī.<BR>—2 the chief queen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाद्रुमः|महाद्रुम
महा + -द्रुमः the sacred fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाद्वारम्
महा + -द्वारम् a large gate, the chief or outer gate of a temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाधन|महाधनं
महा + -धन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 rich.<BR>—2 expensive, costly; हेमदण्डैर्महाधनैः Rām. 7. 77. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाधनम्
महा + -धन + .({@-नम्@})<BR>—1 gold.<BR>—2 incense.<BR>—3 a costly or rich dress.<BR>—4 agriculture, husbandry.<BR>—5 anything costly or precious.<BR>—6 great booty.<BR>—7 a great battle (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाधनुस्
महा + -धनुस् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाधातुः|महाधातु
महा + -धातुः<BR>—1 gold.<BR>—2 an<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">Page1250-2</a>]<BR> epithet of Śiva.<BR>—3 lymph.<BR>—4 N. of Meru.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाधी
महा + -धी <i>a.</i> having a great understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाधुर्यः|महाधुर्य
महा + -धुर्यः a full-grown draught ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाध्वजः|महाध्वज
महा + -ध्वजः a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाध्वनिक|महाध्वनिकः
महा + -ध्वनिक <i>a.</i> dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानग्नः|महानग्न
महा + -नग्नः an athlete; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानटः|महानट
महा + -नटः an epithet of Śiva; महानटः किं नु … … तनोति<BR> … … साम्प्रतमङ्गहारम् N. 22. 7; महानटबाहुनेव बद्धभुजाङ्केन Vās.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानदः|महानद
महा + -नदः a great river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानदी
महा + -नदी<BR>—1 a great river, such as Gaṅgā, Kṛṣṇā; मन्दरः पर्वतश्चाक्षो<BR> जङ्घा तस्य महानदी Mb. 8. 34. 20; संभूयाम्भोधिमभ्येति महानद्या<BR> नगापगा Śi. 2. 100.<BR>—2 N. of a river falling into the bay of Bengal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानन्दा|महानंदा
महा + -नन्दा<BR>—1 spirituous liquor.<BR>—2 N. of a river.<BR>—3 ninth day of the bright half of the month of Māgha; माघमासस्य<BR> या शुक्ला नवमी लोकपूजिता । महानन्देति सा प्रोक्ता ….<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानरकः|महानरक
महा + -नरकः N. of one of the 21 hells.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानलः|महानल
महा + -नलः a kind of reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानवमी
महा + -नवमी the ninth day in the bright half of Āśvina, sacred to<BR> the worship of Durgā; ततोऽनु नवमी यस्मात् सा महानवमी स्मृता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानाटकम्
महा + -नाटकम् ‘the great drama’, N. of a drama, also called Hanumannāṭaka,<BR> (being popularly ascribed to Hanumat); thus defined by S. D.:− एतदेव<BR> यदा सर्वैः पताकास्थानकैर्युतम् । अङ्कैश्च दशभिर्धीरा महानाटकमूचिरे ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानाडी
महा + -नाडी sinew, tendon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानादः|महानाद
महा + -नादः<BR>—1 a loud sound, uproar.<BR>—2 a great drum.<BR>—3 a thunder-cloud.<BR>—4 a shell.<BR>—5 an elephant.<BR>—6 a lion.<BR>—7 the ear.<BR>—8 a camel.<BR>—9 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानादम्
महा + -नादः + .({@-दम्@}) a musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानाम्नी
महा + -नाम्नी<BR>—1 N. of a परिशिष्ट of Sāmaveda.<BR>—2 (pl.) N. of 9 verses of Sāmaveda beginning with विदा मघवन् विदा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानायकः|महानायक
महा + -नायकः<BR>—1 a great gem in the centre of a string of pearls.<BR>—2 a great head or chief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानासः|महानास
महा + -नासः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानिद्र
महा + -निद्र <i>a.</i> fast asleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानिद्रा
महा + -निद्र + .({@-द्रा@}) ‘the great sleep’, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानिम्नम्
महा + -निम्नम् intestines, abdomen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानियमः|महानियम
महा + -नियमः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानिर्वाणम्
महा + -निर्वाणम् total extinction of individuality (according to the Buddhists).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानिशा
महा + -निशा<BR>—1 the dead of night, the second and third watches of the night; महानिशा<BR> तु विज्ञेया मध्यमं प्रहरद्वयम्.<BR>—2 an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानीचः|महानीच
महा + -नीचः a washerman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानील|महानीलः
महा + -नील <i>a.</i> dark-blue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानीलः|महानील
महा + -नील + .({@-लः@}) a kind of sapphire or emerald; इन्द्रनीलमहानीलमणिप्रवरवेदिकम्<BR> Rām. 5. 9. 16; महामहानीलशिलारुचः Śi. 1. 16, 4. 44; R. 18. 42;<BR> Kau. A. 2. 11. 29. ˚उपलः a sapphire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानृत्यः|महानृत्य
महा + -नृत्यः, -नेत्रः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानेत्रः|महानेत्र
महा + -नृत्यः, -नेत्रः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महानेमिः|महानेमि
महा + -नेमिः a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महान्यायः|महान्याय
महा + -न्यायः the chief rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापक्ष|महापक्षः
महा + -पक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having many adherents.<BR>—2 having a large family or retinue; महापक्षे धनिन्यार्ये निक्षेपं निक्षिपेद्<BR> बुधः Ms. 8. 179.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापक्षः|महापक्ष
महा + -पक्ष + .({@-क्षः@})<BR>—1 an epithet of Garuḍa.<BR>—2 a kind of duck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापक्षी
महा + -पक्ष + .({@-क्षी@}) an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापङ्क्तिः|महापङ्क्ति
महा + -पङ्क्तिः, -पदपङ्क्तिः a kind of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापदपङ्क्तिः|महापदपङ्क्ति
महा + -पक्ष + .({@-क्षी@}) an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापञ्चमूलम्
महा + -पञ्चमूलम् the five great roots:− बिल्वोऽग्निमन्थः श्योनाकः<BR> काश्मरी पाटला तथा । सर्वैस्तु मिलितैरेतैः स्यान्महापञ्चमूलकम् ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापञ्चविषम्
महा + -पञ्चविषम् the five great or deadly poisons:− शृङ्गी च कालकूटश्च<BR> मुस्तको वत्सनाभकः । शङ्खकर्णीति योगोऽयं महापञ्चविषाभिधः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापटः|महापट
महा + -पटः the skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापथः|महापथ
महा + -पथः<BR>—1 chief road, principal street, high or main road; संतानकाकीर्णमहापथं<BR> तत् Ku. 7. 3.<BR>—2 the passage into the next world, <i>i. e.</i> death.<BR>—3 N. of certain mountain-tops from which devout persons used to throw<BR> themselves down to secure entrance into heaven.<BR>—4 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—5 the long pilgrimage to mount Kedāra.<BR>—6 the way to heaven.<BR>—7 the knowledge of the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">Page1251-1</a>]<BR> essence of Śiva acquired in the pilgrimage to Kedāra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1250-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापथिक
महा + -पथिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 undertaking great journeys.<BR>—2 one receiving Śulka (toll) on the highway; cf. Mb. 12. 76. 6 (com.<BR> महापथिकः समुद्रे नौयानेन गच्छन् यद्वा महापथि शुल्कग्राहकः)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापद्मः|महापद्म
महा + -पद्मः<BR>—1 a particular high number.<BR>—2 N. of Nārada.<BR>—3 N. of one of the nine treasures of Kubera.<BR>—4 N. of the southernmost elephant supporting the world.<BR>—5 an epithet of Nanda.<BR>—6 a Kinnara attendant on Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापद्मम्
महा + -पद्मः + .({@-द्मम्@})<BR>—1 a white lotus.<BR>—2 N. of a city. ˚पतिः N. of Nanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापराकः|महापराक
महा + -पराकः a particular penance; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापराह्णः|महापराह्ण
महा + -पराह्णः a late hour in the afternoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापवित्रः|महापवित्र
महा + -पवित्रः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापशुः|महापशु
महा + -पशुः large cattle; महापशूनां हरणे … दण्डं प्रकल्पयेत् Ms. 8. 324.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापातः|महापात
महा + -पातः a long flight; Pt. 2. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापातकम्
महा + -पातकम्<BR>—1 a great sin, a heinous crime; ब्रह्महत्या सुरापानं स्तेयं गुर्वङ्गनागमः ।<BR> महान्ति पातकान्याहुस्तत्संसर्गश्च पञ्चमम् ॥ Ms. 11. 54.<BR>—2 any great sin or transgression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापात्रः|महापात्र
महा + -पात्रः a prime minister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापादः|महापाद
महा + -पादः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापाप्मन्
महा + -पाप्मन् <i>a.</i> very sinful or wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापुराणम्
महा + -पुराणम् N. of a Purāṇa; महापुराणं विज्ञेयमेकादशकलक्षणम् Brav. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापुंसः|महापुंस
महा + -पुंसः a great man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापुरुषः|महापुरुष
महा + -पुरुषः<BR>—1 a great man, an eminent or distinguished personage; शब्दं महापुरुषसंविहितं<BR> निशम्य U. 6. 7.<BR>—2 the Supreme Spirit.<BR>—3 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापौरुषिकः
महा + -पौरुषिकः a worshipper of Viṣṇu; तदहं तेऽभिधास्यामि महापौरुषिको<BR> भवान् Bhāg. 2. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापुष्पः|महापुष्प
महा + -पुष्पः a kind of worm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापूजा
महा + -पूजा great worship; any solemn worship performed on extraordinary occasions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापृष्ठः|महापृष्ठ
महा + -पृष्ठः a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महापोटगलः|महापोटगल
महा + -पोटगलः a kind of large reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रजापतिः|महाप्रजापति
महा + -प्रजापतिः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रतीहारः|महाप्रतीहार
महा + -प्रतीहारः a chief door-keeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रपञ्चः|महाप्रपञ्च|महाप्रपंच
महा + -प्रपञ्चः the great universe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रभ|महाप्रभः
महा + -प्रभ <i>a.</i> of great lustre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रभः|महाप्रभ
महा + -प्रभ + .({@-भः@}) the light of a lamp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रभुः|महाप्रभु
महा + -प्रभुः<BR>—1 a great lord.<BR>—2 a king, sovereign.<BR>—3 a chief.<BR>—4 an epithet of Indra.<BR>—5 of Śiva<BR>—6 of Viṣṇu.<BR>—7 a great saint or holy man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रलयः|महाप्रलय
महा + -प्रलयः ‘the great dissolution’, the total annihilation of the<BR> universe at the end of the life of Brahman, when all the <i>lokas</i><BR> with their inhabitants, the gods, saints &c. including Brahman himself<BR> are annihilated; महाप्रलयमारुत … … Ve. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रश्नः|महाप्रश्न
महा + -प्रश्नः a knotty question.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रसादः|महाप्रसाद
महा + -प्रसादः<BR>—1 a great favour.<BR>—2 a great present (of food offered to an idol); पादोदकं च निर्माल्यं<BR> नैवेद्यं च विशेषतः । महाप्रसाद इत्युक्त्वा ग्राह्यं विष्णोः प्रयत्नतः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रस्थानम्
महा + -प्रस्थानम्<BR>—1 departing this life, death.<BR>—2 setting out on a great journey for ending life; इहैव निधनं याम<BR> महाप्रस्थानमेव वा Rām. 2. 47. 7 (com. महाप्रस्थानं मरणदीक्षापूर्वकमुत्तराभिमुखगमनम्); Mb. 1. 2. 365.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्राणः|महाप्राण
महा + -प्राणः<BR>—1 the hard breathing or aspirate sound made in the pronunciation of the aspirates.<BR>—2 the aspirated letters themselves (pl.); they are:− ख्, घ्, छ्, झ्, ठ्,<BR> ढ्, थ्, ध्, फ्, भ्, श्, ष्, स्, ह्.<BR>—3 a raven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्राणता
महा + -प्राणता possession of great strength or essence; अन्यांश्च जीवत<BR> एव महाप्राणतया स्फुरतो जग्राह K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्रेतः|महाप्रेत
महा + -प्रेतः a noble departed spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाप्लवः|महाप्लव
महा + -प्लवः a great flood, deluge; … क्षिप्तसागरमहाप्लवामयम् Śi. 14. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाफल|महाफलः
महा + -फल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 bearing much fruit.<BR>—2 bringing much reward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाफला
महा + -फल + .({@-ला@})<BR>—1 a bitter gourd.<BR>—2 a kind of spear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाफलम्
महा + -फल + .({@-लम्@})<BR>—1 a great fruit or reward.<BR>—2 a testicle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाफेना
महा + -फेना the cuttle-fish bone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबन्धः|महाबन्ध
महा + -बन्धः a peculiar position of hands or feet.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">Page1251-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबभ्रुः|महाबभ्रु
महा + -बभ्रुः a kind of animal living in holes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबल|महाबलं|महाबलः
महा + -बल <i>a.</i> very strong; नियुज्यमानो राज्याय नैच्छद्राज्यं महाबलः Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबलः|महाबल|महाबलं
महा + -बल + .({@-लः@})<BR>—1 wind, storm.<BR>—2 a Buddha.<BR>—3 a solid bamboo.<BR>—4 a palm.<BR>—5 a crocodile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबला
महा + -बला N. of a plant; महाबला च पीतपुष्पा सहदेवी च सा स्मृता Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबलम्
महा + -बला + .({@-लम्@}) lead. ˚ईश्वरः N. of a Liṅga of Śiva near the modern<BR> Mahābaleśwara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबाध
महा + -बाध <i>a.</i> causing great pain or damage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबाहु|महाबाहुः
महा + -बाहु <i>a.</i> long-armed, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबाहुः|महाबाहु
महा + -बाहु + .({@-हुः@}) an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबिलम्
महा + -बिलम्, -विलम्<BR>—1 the atmosphere.<BR>—2 the heart.<BR>—3 a water-jar, pitcher.<BR>—4 a hole, cave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाविलम्
महा + -बिलम्, -विलम्<BR>—1 the atmosphere.<BR>—2 the heart.<BR>—3 a water-jar, pitcher.<BR>—4 a hole, cave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबिसी
महा + -बिसी a variety of skin (चर्म), a product of द्वादशग्राम<BR> in the Himālayas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबीजः|महाबीज
महा + -बीजः, -वीजः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावीजः|महावीज
महा + -बीजः, -वीजः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबीज्यम्
महा + -बीज्यम्, -वीज्यम् the perinaeum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावीज्यम्
महा + -बीज्यम्, -वीज्यम् the perinaeum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबुध्न
महा + -बुध्न <i>a.</i> having a great bottom or base (as a mountain).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबुशः|महाबुश
महा + -बुशः barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबृहती
महा + -बृहती a kind of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाबोधिः|महाबोधि
महा + -बोधिः<BR>—1 the great intelligence of a Buddha.<BR>—2 a Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाब्रह्मम्
महा + -ब्रह्मम्, -ब्रह्मन् <i>n.</i> the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाब्रह्मन्
महा + -ब्रह्मम्, -ब्रह्मन् <i>n.</i> the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाब्राह्मणः|महाब्राह्मण
महा + -ब्राह्मणः<BR>—1 a great or learned Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—2 a low or contemptible Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभटः|महाभट
महा + -भटः a great warrior; तदोजसा दैत्यमहाभटार्पितम् Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभद्रा
महा + -भद्रा N. of the river Gaṅgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभाग
महा + -भाग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very fortunate or blessed, very lucky or prosperous.<BR>—2 illustrious, distinguished, glorious; उभौ धर्मौ महाभागौ Mb. 12. 268. 3;<BR> महाभागः कामं नरपतिरभिन्नस्थितिरसौ Ś. 5. 10; Ms. 3. 192.<BR>—3 very pure or holy, highly virtuous; पतिव्रता महाभागा कथं नु विचरिष्यति Mb. 4. 3. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभागता
महा + -भागता, -भागत्वम्, -भाग्यम्<BR>—1 extreme good fortune, great good luck, prosperity.<BR>—2 great excellence or merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभागत्वम्
महा + -भागता, -भागत्वम्, -भाग्यम्<BR>—1 extreme good fortune, great good luck, prosperity.<BR>—2 great excellence or merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभाग्यम्
महा + -भागता, -भागत्वम्, -भाग्यम्<BR>—1 extreme good fortune, great good luck, prosperity.<BR>—2 great excellence or merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभागवतम्
महा + -भागवतम् the great Bhāgavata, one of the 18 Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभागवतः|महाभागवत
महा + -भागवतम् + .({@-तः@}) a great worshipper of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभागिन्
महा + -भागिन् <i>a.</i> very fortunate or prosperous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभाण्डम्
महा + -भाण्डम् a chief treasury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभारतम्
महा + -भारतम् N. of the celebrated epic which describes the rivalries<BR> and contests of the sons of Dhṛtarāṣṭra and Pāṇḍu. (It consists<BR> of 18 <i>Parvans</i> or books, and is said to be the composition of Vyāsa;<BR> cf. the word भारत also); महत्त्वाद्भारतत्वाच्च महाभारतमुच्यते<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभाष्यम्
महा + -भाष्यम्<BR>—1 a great commentary.<BR>—2 particularly, the great commentary of Patañjali on the Sūtras of Pāṇini.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभासुरः|महाभासुर
महा + -भासुरः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभिक्षुः|महाभिक्षु
महा + -भिक्षुः N. of Śākyamuni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभीता
महा + -भीता a kind of sensitive plant (लाजाळू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभीमः|महाभीम
महा + -भीमः an epithet of king Śantanu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभीरुः|महाभीरु
महा + -भीरुः a sort of beetle or fly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभुज
महा + -भुज <i>a.</i> long-armed, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभूतम्
महा + -भूतम् a great or primary element; see भूत; तस्यैतस्य महाभूतस्य<BR> निःश्वसितमेतद्यदृग्वेदः Up.; तं वेधा विदधे नूनं महाभूतसमाधिना<BR> R. 1. 29; Ms. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभूतः|महाभूत|महाभूतं
महा + -भूतम् + .({@-तः@})<BR>—1 the Supreme Being.<BR>—2 a great creature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभोगः|महाभोग
महा + -भोगः<BR>—1 a great enjoyment.<BR>—2 a great coil or hood; great winding.<BR>—3 a serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाभोगा
महा + -भोगः + .({@-गा@}) an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामणिः|महामणि
महा + -मणिः<BR>—1 a costly or precious jewel; संस्कारोल्लिखितो महामणिरिव क्षीणोऽपि<BR> नालक्ष्यते Ś. 6. 5.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.//<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामति|महामतिः
महा + -मति <i>a.</i><BR>—1 high-minded.<BR>—2 clever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामतिः|महामति
महा + -मति + .({@-तिः@}) N. of Bṛhaspati or Jupiter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामत्स्यः|महामत्स्य
महा + -मत्स्यः a large fish, sea-monster.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामद|महामदः
महा + -मद <i>a.</i> greatly intoxicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामदः|महामद
महा + -मद + .({@-दः@}) an elephant in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामनस्
महा + -मनस्, -मनस्क <i>a.</i><BR>—1 high-minded, noble-minded, magnanimous; ततो युधिष्ठिरो राजा धर्मपुत्रो<BR> महामनाः Mb. 4. 1. 7.<BR>—2 liberal.<BR>—3 proud, haughty. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">Page1252-1</a>]<BR> a fabulous animal called शरभ q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामनस्क
महा + -मनस्, -मनस्क <i>a.</i><BR>—1 high-minded, noble-minded, magnanimous; ततो युधिष्ठिरो राजा धर्मपुत्रो<BR> महामनाः Mb. 4. 1. 7.<BR>—2 liberal.<BR>—3 proud, haughty. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">Page1252-1</a>]<BR> a fabulous animal called शरभ q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1251-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामन्त्रः|महामन्त्र
महा + -मन्त्रः<BR>—1 any sacred text of the Vedas.<BR>—2 a great or efficacious charm, a powerful spell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामन्त्रिन्|महामंत्रिन्
महा + -मन्त्रिन् <i>m.</i> the prime-minister, premier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामयूरी
महा + -मयूरी N. of Buddhist goddess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामलहारी
महा + -मलहारी a kind of Rāgiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामहः|महामह
महा + -महः a great festive procession; Sinhās.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामहस्
महा + -महस् <i>n.</i> a great light (seen in the sky).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामहोपाध्यायः|महामहोपाध्याय
महा + -महोपाध्यायः<BR>—1 a very great preceptor.<BR>—2 a title given to learned men and reputed scholars; <i>e. g.</i> महामहोपाध्यायमल्लिनाथसूरि &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामांसम्
महा + -मांसम् ‘costly flesh’, especially human flesh; न खलु महामांसविक्रयादन्यमुपायं<BR> पश्यामि Māl. 4; अशस्त्रपूतं निर्व्याजं पुरुषाङ्गोपकल्पितम् । विक्रीयते<BR> महामांसं गृह्यतां गृह्यतामिदम् 5. 12 (see Jagaddhara <i>ad loc.</i>).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामाघी
महा + -माघी the full-moon day in the month of Māgha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामात्र|महामात्रः
महा + -मात्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 great in measure, very great or large.<BR>—2 most excellent, best; वृष्ण्यन्धकमहामात्रैः सह Mb. 1. 221. 27, 5. 22. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामात्रः|महामात्र
महा + -मात्र + .({@-त्रः@})<BR>—1 a great officer of state, high state-official, a chief minister; (मन्त्रे<BR> कर्मणि भूषायां वित्ते माने परिच्छदे । मात्रा च महती येषां महामात्रास्तु<BR> ते स्मृताः ॥); Ms. 9. 259; गूढपुरुषप्रणिधिः कृतमहामात्रापसर्पः<BR> (v. l. महामात्यापसर्पः) पौरजानपदानपसर्पयेत् Kau. A. 1. 13. 9;<BR> Rām. 2. 37. 1.<BR>—2 an elephant-driver or keeper;<BR> मदोन्मत्तस्य भूपस्य कुञ्जरस्य च गच्छतः । उन्मार्गं वाच्यतां<BR> यान्ति महामात्राः समीपगाः ॥ Pt. 1. 161.<BR>—3 a superintendent of elephants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामात्री
महा + -मात्र + .({@-त्री@})<BR>—1 the wife of a chief minister.<BR>—2 the wife of a spiritual teacher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामानसी
महा + -मानसी N. of a Jain goddess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामान्य
महा + -मान्य <i>a.</i> being in great honour with; मकरन्दतुन्दिलानामरविन्दानामयं<BR> महामान्यः Bv. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामायः|महामाय
महा + -मायः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामाया
महा + -माया<BR>—1 worldly illusion, which makes the material world appear really existent.<BR>—2 N. of Durgā; महामाया हरेश्चैषा यया संमोह्यते जगत् Devīmāhātmya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामायूरम्
महा + -मायूरम् a particular drug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामायूरी
महा + -मायूरम् + .({@-री@}) N. of an amulet and a goddess; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामारी
महा + -मारी<BR>—1 cholera, an epidemic.<BR>—2 an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामार्गः|महामार्ग
महा + -मार्गः high road, main street. ˚पतिः a superintendent of roads.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामालः|महामाल
महा + -मालः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामाहेश्वरः|महामाहेश्वर
महा + -माहेश्वरः a great worshipper of Maheśvara or Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामुखः|महामुख
महा + -मुखः a crocodile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामुद्रा
महा + -मुद्रा a particular position of hands or feet (in practice of yoga).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामुनिः|महामुनि
महा + -मुनिः<BR>—1 a great sage.<BR>—2 N. of Vyāsa.<BR>—3 an epithet of Buddha.<BR>—4 of Agastya.<BR>—5 the coriander plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामुनि|महामुनिः
महा + -मुनिः + .({@-नि@} <i>n.</i>)<BR>—1 coriander seed.<BR>—2 any medicinal herb or drug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामूर्तिः|महामूर्ति
महा + -मूर्तिः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामूर्धन्
महा + -मूर्धन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामूलम्
महा + -मूलम् a large radish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामूलः|महामूल
महा + -मूलम् + .({@-लः@}) a kind of onion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामूल्य|महामूल्यं|महामूल्यः
महा + -मूल्य <i>a.</i> very costly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामूल्यः|महामूल्य|महामूल्यं
महा + -मूल्य + .({@-ल्यः@}) a ruby.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामृगः|महामृग
महा + -मृगः<BR>—1 any large animal.<BR>—2 an elephant,<BR>—3 the fabulous animal called शरभ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामृत्युः|महामृत्यु
महा + -मृत्युः, -मेधः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामेधः|महामेध
महा + -मृत्युः, -मेधः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामृत्युंजयः|महामृत्युञ्जय|महामृत्युञ्जयः
महा + -मृत्युंजयः a kind of drug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामृधम्
महा + -मृधम् a great battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामेदः|महामेद
महा + -मेदः the coral tree; महामेदाभिधो ज्ञेयः Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामेधा
महा + -मेधा an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामोहः|महामोह
महा + -मोहः great infatuation or confusion of mind. (ससर्ज) महामोहं<BR> च मोहं च तमश्चाज्ञानवृत्तयः Bhāg. 3. 12. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महामोहा
महा + -मोहः + .({@-हा@}) an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायज्ञः|महायज्ञ
महा + -यज्ञः ‘a great sacrifice’, a term applied to the five daily<BR> sacrifices or acts of piety to be performed by a house-holder; अध्यापनं<BR> ब्रह्मयज्ञः पितृयज्ञस्तु तर्पणम् । होमो दैवो (or देवयज्ञः) बलिर्भौतो<BR> (or भूतयज्ञः) नृयज्ञोऽतिथिपूजनम् ॥ Ms. 3. 70, 71, (for<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">Page1252-2</a>]<BR> explanation, see the words s. v.).<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायमकम्
महा + -यमकम् ‘a great <i>Yamaka</i>’, <i>i. e.</i> a stanza all the<BR> four lines of which have exactly the same words, though different in sense;<BR> <i>e. g.</i> see Ki. 15. 52, where विकाशमीयुर्जगतीशमार्गणाः has four<BR> different senses; cf. also बभौ मरुत्वान् विकृतः समुद्रः Bk. 10. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायशस्
महा + -यशस् <i>a.</i> very famous, renowned, celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायात्रा
महा + -यात्रा ‘the great pilgrimage’, the pilgrimage to Benares.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायानम्
महा + -यानम् N. of the later system of Buddhist teaching, firstly promulgated<BR> by Nāgārujuna (opp. हीनयान).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायाम्यः|महायाम्य
महा + -याम्यः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायुगम्
महा + -युगम् ‘a great Yuga’, consisting of the four <i>Yugas</i> of<BR> mortals, or comprising 4,320,000 years of men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायोगिन्
महा + -योगिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महायोनिः|महायोनि
महा + -योनिः <i>f.</i> excessive dilation of the female organ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारक्तम्
महा + -रक्तम् coral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारङ्गः|महारङ्ग
महा + -रङ्गः a large stage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारजतम्
महा + -रजतम्<BR>—1 gold; उच्चैर्महारजतराजिविराजितासौ Śi. 4. 28.<BR>—2 the thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारजनम्
महा + -रजनम्<BR>—1 safflower.<BR>—2 gold.<BR>—3 turmeric; तस्य हैतस्य पुरुषस्य रूपं यथा महारजनं वासः<BR> Bṛ. Up. 2. 3. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारत्नम्
महा + -रत्नम् a precious jewel; वज्रं मुक्ता प्रवालं च गोमेदश्चेन्द्रनीलकः<BR> ॥ वैडूर्यः पुष्करागश्च पाचिर्माणिक्यमेव च । महारत्नानि चैतानि नव<BR> प्रोक्तानि सूरिभिः ॥ Śukra. 4. 155-56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारथः|महारथ
महा + -रथः<BR>—1 a great chariot.<BR>—2 a great warrior or hero; द्रुपदश्च महारथः Bg. 1. 4; कुतः<BR> प्रभावो धनंजयस्य महारथजयद्रथस्य विपत्तिमुत्पादयितुम् Ve. 2;<BR> दशरथः प्रशशास महारथः R. 9. 1; Śi. 3. 22; (a महारथ<BR> is thus defined:− एको दशसहस्राणि योधयेद्यस्तु धन्विनाम् ॥ शस्त्रशास्त्रप्रवीणश्च<BR> विज्ञेयः स महारथः ॥).<BR>—3 desire, longing; cf. मनोरथ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारवः|महारव
महा + -रवः a frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारस|महारसं|महारसः
महा + -रस <i>a.</i> very savoury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारसः|महारस|महारसं
महा + -रस + .({@-सः@})<BR>—1 a sugarcane.<BR>—2 quicksilver.<BR>—3 a precious mineral.<BR>—4 the fruit of the date tree.<BR>—5 any one of the eight substances given below:− दरदः पारदं शस्ये<BR> वैक्रान्तं कान्तमभ्रकम् । माक्षिकं विमलश्चेति स्युरेतेऽष्टौ महारसाः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारसम्
महा + -रस + .({@-सम्@}) sour rice-water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाराजः|महाराज
महा + -राजः<BR>—1 a great king, sovereign or supreme ruler; पञ्चाशल्लक्षपर्यन्तो महाराजः<BR> प्रकीर्तितः Śukra. 1. 184.<BR>—2 a respectful mode of addressing kings or other great personages (my<BR> lord, your majesty, your highness); इति सत्यं महाराज बद्धोऽस्म्यर्थेन कौरवैः Mb.<BR>—3 a deified Jaina teacher.<BR>—4 a fingernail. ˚अधिराजः a universal emperor, paramount sovereign.<BR> ˚चूतः a kind of mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाराजिकः|महाराजिक
महा + -राजिकः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाराजिकाः
महा + -राजिकाः (<i>m.</i> pl.) an epithet of a class of gods (said to be 220<BR> or 236 in number.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाराज्यम्
महा + -राज्यम् the rank or title of a reigning sovereign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाराज्ञी
महा + -राज्ञी<BR>—1 the reigning or chief queen, principal wife of a king.<BR>—2 N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारात्रम्
महा + -रात्रम् midnight, dead of night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारात्रिः|महारात्रि
महा + -रात्रिः, -रात्री <i>f.</i><BR>—1 see महाप्रलय; ब्रह्मणश्च निपाते च महाकल्पो भवेन्नृप । प्रकीर्तिता महारात्रिः.<BR>—2 midnight. —3 the eighth night in the bright half of Āśvina.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारात्री
महा + -रात्रिः, -रात्री <i>f.</i><BR>—1 see महाप्रलय; ब्रह्मणश्च निपाते च महाकल्पो भवेन्नृप । प्रकीर्तिता महारात्रिः.<BR>—2 midnight. —3 the eighth night in the bright half of Āśvina.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाराष्ट्रः|महाराष्ट्र
महा + -राष्ट्रः ‘the great kingdom’, N. of a country in the west of India,<BR> the country of the Marāṭhās.<BR>—2 the people of Mahārāṣṭra, the Marāṭhās (pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाराष्ट्री
महा + -राष्ट्रः + .({@-ष्ट्री@}) N. of the principal Prākṛta dialect, the language of<BR> the people of the Mahārāṣṭra; cf. Daṇḍin:− महाराष्ट्राश्रयां भाषां<BR> प्रकृष्टं प्राकृतं विदुः Kāv. 1. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारिष्टः|महारिष्ट
महा + -रिष्टः a kind of Nimba tree growing on mountains.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारुज्
महा + -रुज्, -ज <i>a.</i> very painful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाज|महाजः
महा + -रुज्, -ज <i>a.</i> very painful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारुद्रः|महारुद्र
महा + -रुद्रः a form of Śiva.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">Page1253-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1252-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारुरुः|महारुरु
महा + -रुरुः a species of antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारूप|महारूपः
महा + -रूप <i>a.</i> mighty in form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारूपः|महारूप
महा + -रूप + .({@-पः@})<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 resin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारूपकम्
महा + -रूपकम् a kind of drama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारेतस्
महा + -रेतस् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारोगः|महारोग
महा + -रोगः a dangerous illness, grievous malady; (these are eight:−<BR> उन्मादो राजयक्ष्मा च श्वासस्त्वग्दोष एव च । मधुमेहश्चाश्मरी च तथोदरभगन्दरौ ॥).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारौद्र
महा + -रौद्र <i>a.</i> very dreadful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारौद्री
महा + -रौद्र + .({@-द्री@}) an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महारौरवः|महारौरव
महा + -रौरवः N. of one of the 21 hells; Ms. 4. 88-90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महालक्ष्मी
महा + -लक्ष्मी<BR>—1 the great Lakṣmī, or <i>Śakti</i> of Nārāyaṇa; सेवे सैरिभमर्दिनीमिह<BR> महालक्ष्मीं सरोजस्थिताम्.<BR>—2 a young girl who represents the goddess Durgā at the Durgā festival.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महालयः|महालय
महा + -लयः<BR>—1 a great world destruction.<BR>—2 the Supreme Being (महदादीनां लयो यस्मिन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महालिङ्गम्
महा + -लिङ्गम् the great <i>Liṅga</i> or Phallus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महालिङ्गः|महालिङ्ग|महालिंग
महा + -लिङ्गम् + .({@-ङ्गः@}) an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महालोलः|महालोल
महा + -लोलः a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महालोहम्
महा + -लोहम् a magnet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावंशः|महावंश
महा + -वंशः N. of a well-known work in Pali (of the 5th century).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावक्षस्
महा + -वक्षस् <i>m.</i> epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावनम्
महा + -वनम् a large forest in Vṛndāvana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावरा
महा + -वरा Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावराहः|महावराह
महा + -वराहः ‘the great boar’, an epithet of Viṣṇu in his third<BR> or boar incarnation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावर्तनम्
महा + -वर्तनम् high wages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावल्ली
महा + -वल्ली<BR>—1 the Mādhavī creeper.<BR>—2 a large creeping plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावसः|महावस
महा + -वसः the porpoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावसुः|महावसु
महा + -वसुः silver; Gīrvāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावाक्यम्
महा + -वाक्यम्<BR>—1 a long sentence.<BR>—2 any continuous composition or literary work.<BR>—3 a great proposition, principal sentence; such as तत्त्वमसि, ब्रह्मैवेदं सर्वम् &c.<BR>—4 a complete sentence (opp. अवान्तरवाक्य q. v.); न च महावाक्ये<BR> सति अवान्तरवाक्यं प्रमाणं भवति ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावातः|महावात
महा + -वातः a stormy wind, violent wind; महावाताधातैर्महिषकुलनीलैर्जलधरैः Mk. 5. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावादिन्
महा + -वादिन् <i>m.</i> a great or powerful disputant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावायुः|महावायु
महा + -वायुः<BR>—1 air (as an element).<BR>—2 stormy wind, hurricane, tempest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावार्तिकम्
महा + -वार्तिकम् N. of the Vārtikas of Katyāyana on Pāṇiniʼs Sūtras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाविडम्
महा + -विडम् a kind of factitious salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाविदेहा
महा + -विदेहा N. of a certain वृत्ति or condition of the mind in<BR> the Yoga system of philosophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाविद्या
महा + -विद्या the great lores; काली तारा महाविद्या षोडशी भुवनैश्वरी ।<BR> भैरवी छिन्नमस्ता च विद्या धूमवती तथा । बगला सिद्धविद्या च मातङ्गी<BR> कमलात्मिका । एता दश महाविद्याः … ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाविपुला
महा + -विपुला a kind of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाविभाषा
महा + -विभाषा a rule giving a general option or alternative; इति महाविभाषया साधुः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाविभूतिः|महाविभूति
महा + -विभूतिः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाविषः|महाविष
महा + -विषः a serpent having two mouths.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाविषुवम्
महा + -विषुवम् the vernal equinox. ˚संक्रान्तिः <i>f.</i> the vernal<BR> equinox (the sunʼs entering the sign Aries).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाविस्तर
महा + -विस्तर <i>a.</i> very extensive or copious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावीचिः|महावीचि
महा + -वीचिः N. of a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावीरः|महावीर
महा + -वीरः<BR>—1 a great hero or warrior.<BR>—2 a lion.<BR>—3 the thunderbolt of Indra.<BR>—4 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—5 of Garuḍa.<BR>—6 of Hanumat.<BR>—7 a cuckoo.<BR>—8 a white horse.<BR>—9 a sacrificial fire.<BR>—10 a sacrificial vessel.<BR>—11 a kind of hawk. ˚चरितम् N. of a celebrated drama by Bhavabhūti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावीर्य|महावीर्यः|महावीर्य्य|महावीर्य्यः
महा + -वीर्य <i>a.</i> of great valour, very powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावीर्यः|महावीर्य|महावीर्य्य|महावीर्य्यः
महा + -वीर्य + .({@-र्यः@})<BR>—1 N. of Brahman. —2 the Supreme Being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावीर्या|महावीर्य्या
महा + -वीर्य + .({@-र्या@}) the wild cotton shrub.<BR>—2 an epithet of संज्ञा, the wife of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावृषः|महावृष
महा + -वृषः a great bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावेग|महावेगः
महा + -वेग <i>a.</i> —1 very swift or fleet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावेगः|महावेग
महा + -वेग + .({@-गः@})<BR>—1 great speed, excessive velocity.<BR>—2 an ape.<BR>—3 the bird Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावेधः|महावेध
महा + -वेधः a particular position of hands or feet (in the practice of Yoga).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावेल
महा + -वेल <i>a.</i> billowy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाव्याधिः|महाव्याधि
महा + -व्याधिः <i>f.</i><BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">Page1253-2</a>]<BR>—1 a great disease.<BR>—2 a very bad kind of leprosy (black leprosy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाव्याहृतिः|महाव्याहृति
महा + -व्याहृतिः <i>f.</i> a great mystical word, <i>i. e.</i> भूर्, भुवस् and स्वर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाव्रत|महाव्रतं
महा + -व्रत <i>a.</i> very devotional, rigidly observing vows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाव्रतम्
महा + -व्रत + .({@-तम्@})<BR>—1 a great vow, a great religious observance; a vow for not taking even<BR> water for a month; महाव्रतं चरेद्यस्तु Mb. 12. 35. 22 (com. महाव्रतं<BR> मासमात्रं जलस्यापि त्यागः).<BR>—2 any great or fundamental duty; प्राणैरपि हिता वृत्तिरद्रोहो व्याजवर्जनम् ।<BR> आत्मनीव प्रियाधानमेतन्मैत्रीमहाव्रतम् Mv. 5. 59; क्रतौ महाव्रते<BR> पश्यन् ब्रह्मचारीत्वरीरतम् N. 17. 203.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाव्रतिन्
महा + -व्रतिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a devotee, an ascetic.<BR>—2 an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशक्तिः|महाशक्ति
महा + -शक्तिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशङ्कुः|महाशङ्कु
महा + -शङ्कुः the sine of the sunʼs elevation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशङ्खः|महाशङ्ख|महाशंख
महा + -शङ्खः<BR>—1 a great conch-shell; पौण्ड्रं दध्मौ महाशङ्खं Bg. 1. 15; महाशङ्खमयी<BR> माला ताराविद्याजपे प्रिया Tantra.<BR>—2 the temporal bone, forehead.<BR>—3 a human bone.<BR>—4 a particular high number.<BR>—5 one of Kuberaʼs treasures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशठः|महाशठ
महा + -शठः a kind of thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशब्द
महा + -शब्द <i>a.</i> making a loud sound, very noisy, boisterous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशल्कः|महाशल्क
महा + -शल्कः a kind of sea-crab or prawn; Ms. 3. 272.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशालः|महाशाल
महा + -शालः a great householder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशालिः|महाशालि
महा + -शालिः a kind of large and sweet-smelling rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशाल्वणम्
महा + -शाल्वणम् (‘great fomentation’) N. of a remedy; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशासन
महा + -शासन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 exercising great power.<BR>—2 whose commands are great; त्रैलोक्याधिपतित्वमेव विरसं यस्मिन् महाशासने Bh. 3. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशासनम्
महा + -शासन + .({@-नम्@})<BR>—1 the knowledge of Brahma as expounded in the Upaniṣadas.<BR>—2 great order of government.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशिरस्
महा + -शिरस् <i>m.</i> a kind of serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशिवरात्रिः|महाशिवरात्रि
महा + -शिवरात्रिः N. of a festival on the 14th day of the dark half of Māgha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशुक्तिः|महाशुक्ति
महा + -शुक्तिः <i>f.</i> a pearl-shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशुक्ला
महा + -शुक्ला an epithet of Sarasvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशुभ्रम्
महा + -शुभ्रम् silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशूद्रः|महाशूद्र
महा + -शूद्रः (-द्री <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 a Śūdra in a high position.<BR>—2 a cowherd.<BR>—3 an upper servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशूद्री
महा + -शूद्रः + .({@-द्री@}) a female cow-keeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशूद्रा
महा + -शूद्रः + .({@-द्रा@}) a Śudra woman in a high position.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशून्यम्
महा + -शून्यम् a particular mental condition of a Yogin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाशृङ्गः|महाशृङ्ग
महा + -शृङ्गः<BR>—1 a species of stag.<BR>—2 the शरभ animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाश्मशानम्
महा + -श्मशानम् an epithet of Benares.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाश्यामा
महा + -श्यामा the Sissoo tree (Mar. शिसवी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाश्रमणः|महाश्रमण
महा + -श्रमणः<BR>—1 an epithet of Buddha.<BR>—2 a Jain monk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाश्लक्ष्णा
महा + -श्लक्ष्णा sand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाश्वासः|महाश्वास
महा + -श्वासः a kind of asthma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महाश्वेता
महा + -श्वेता<BR>—1 an epithet of Sarasvatī.<BR>—2 of Durgā.<BR>—3 white sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासंहिता
महा + -संहिता great combination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासंक्रान्तिः|महासङ्क्रान्ति|महासंक्रांति
महा + -संक्रान्तिः <i>f.</i> the winter solstice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासती
महा + -सती a very chaste woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासत्ता
महा + -सत्ता absolute existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासत्यः|महासत्य
महा + -सत्यः an epithet of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासत्त्व|महासत्त्वः
महा + -सत्त्व <i>a.</i><BR>—1 noble.<BR>—2 very strong or powerful.<BR>—3 just, righteous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासत्त्वः|महासत्त्व
महा + -सत्त्व + .({@-त्त्वः@})<BR>—1 a large animal.<BR>—2 N. of Śākyamuni.<BR>—3 an epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासंधिविग्रहः|महासन्धिविग्रह
महा + -संधिविग्रहः the office of the minister of peace and war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासन्नः|महासन्न
महा + -सन्नः an epithet of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासन्निः|महासन्नि
महा + -सन्निः <i>m.</i> (in music) a kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासमुद्रः|महासमुद्र
महा + -समुद्रः the great ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासर्गः|महासर्ग
महा + -सर्गः a great or completely new creation (after a complete destruction of the world).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासर्जः|महासर्ज
महा + -सर्जः the bread-fruit or jack-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासाधनभागः|महासाधनभाग
महा + -साधनभागः a great executive officer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासांतपनः|महासान्तपन|महासांतपन|महासान्तपनं
महा + -सांतपनः a kind of very rigid penance; see Ms. 11. 218.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासांधिविग्रहिकः|महासान्धिविग्रहिक
महा + -सांधिविग्रहिकः a minister of peace and war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासामन्तः|महासामन्त
महा + -सामन्तः a great vassal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासामान्यम्
महा + -सामान्यम् the widest generality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासारः|महासार
महा + -सारः a kind of Khadira tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासारथिः|महासारथि
महा + -सारथिः an epithet<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">Page1254-1</a>]<BR> of Aruṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1253-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासाहसम्
महा + -साहसम् great violence or outrage, great audacity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासाहसिकः|महासाहसिक
महा + -साहसिकः a dacoit, highwayman, a daring robber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासिंहः|महासिंह
महा + -सिंहः the fabulous animal called Śarabha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासिद्धिः|महासिद्धि
महा + -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i> a kind of magical power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासुखम्
महा + -सुखम्<BR>—1 great pleasure. —2 copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासुखः|महासुख|महासुखं
महा + -सुखम् + .({@-खः@}) a Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासुगन्धम्
महा + -सुगन्धम् a fragrant unguent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासुगन्धिः|महासुगन्धि
महा + -सुगन्धिः a kind of antidote.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासुधा
महा + -सुधा silver; Gīrvāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासुभिक्षम्
महा + -सुभिक्षम् good times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासूक्तः|महासूक्त
महा + -सूक्तः the composer of the great Sūktas or hymns of the 10th<BR> Maṇḍala of the Ṛgveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासूक्ष्मा
महा + -सूक्ष्मा sand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासूतः|महासूत
महा + -सूतः a military drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महासेनः|महासेन
