महासेना
महा + -सेनः + .({@-ना@}) a great army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महास्कन्धः|महास्कन्ध|महास्कंध
महा + -स्कन्धः a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महास्थली
महा + -स्थली the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महास्थानम्
महा + -स्थानम् a great position.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

