महिषी
महिषी<BR>—1 A she-buffalo, buffalo-cow; Ms. 9. 55; माषानष्टौ तु महिषी सस्यघातस्य<BR> कारिणी Y. 2. 159.<BR>—2 The principal queen, queen-consort; महिषीसखः R. 1. 48, 2. 25, 3. 9.<BR>—3 A queen in general.<BR>—4 The female of a bird; सासज्जत शिचस्तन्त्यां महिषी कालयन्त्रिता<BR> Bhāg. 7. 2. 52.<BR>—5 A ladyʼs maid, female servant (सैरन्ध्री).<BR>—6 An immoral woman.<BR>—7 Money acquired by the prostitution of oneʼs wife; cf. माहिषिक.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: महिषीपालः, महिषीस्तम्भः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1254-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

