महीप्रकम्पः|महीप्रकम्प|महीप्रकंप
मही + -प्रकम्पः an earthquake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महीप्ररोहः|महीप्ररोह
मही + -प्ररोहः, -रुह् <i>m.</i>, {@-रुहः@}<BR> a tree; अकुसुमान् दधतं न महीरुहः Ki. 5. 10; Śi. 20. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महीरुह्
मही + -प्ररोहः, -रुह् <i>m.</i>, {@-रुहः@}<BR> a tree; अकुसुमान् दधतं न महीरुहः Ki. 5. 10; Śi. 20. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महीप्राचीरम्
