महीभृत्
मही + -भृत् <i>m.</i> —1 a mountain; अथ जयाय नु मेरुमहीभृतः Ki. 5. 1.<BR>—2 a king, sovereign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महीमण्डलम्
मही + -मण्डलम्<BR>—1 the circumference of the earth.<BR>—2 the whole earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महीलता
मही + -लता an earth-worm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महीसुरः|महीसुर
मही + -सुरः a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महीकृ
महीकृ (महीकरोति) To make great, exalt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महीयते
महीयते Den. Ā. (rarely P.)<BR>—1 To be glad, happy or prosperous (Ved.).<BR>—2 To rise to a high position, thrive, prosper.<BR>—3 To be highly respected or honoured; सरस्वती श्रतमहतां महीयताम् Ś. 7. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महीयस्
महीयस् <i>a.</i> Greater, larger, more powerful or weighty or important,<BR> mightier, stronger (compar. of महत् q. v.). ━<i>m.</i> A great or noble-minded<BR> man; अणोरणीयान् महतो महीयान् Kaṭh. 1. 2. 20; प्रकृतिः खलु सा<BR> महीयसः सहते नान्यसमुन्नतिं यया Ki. 2. 21; Śi. 2. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महीला
महीला, महेला, महेलिका A woman, female; चारु चचार सरःसु<BR> विराजत् काकलिका कलहंसमहेला Rām. Ch. 4. 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महेला
महीला, महेला, महेलिका A woman, female; चारु चचार सरःसु<BR> विराजत् काकलिका कलहंसमहेला Rām. Ch. 4. 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महेलिका
महीला, महेला, महेलिका A woman, female; चारु चचार सरःसु<BR> विराजत् काकलिका कलहंसमहेला Rām. Ch. 4. 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मा
1. मा <i>ind.</i> A particle of prohibition (rarely of negation) usually<BR> joined with the Imperative; मद्वाणि मा कुरु विषादमनादरेण Bv. 4. 41; also<BR>——(<i>a</i>) with the Aorist, when the augment अ is dropped; क्लैब्यं<BR> मा स्म गमः पार्थ नैतत्त्वय्युपपद्यते Bg. 2. 3; पापे रतिं मा कृथाः<BR> Bh. 2. 77; मा मूमुहत् खलु भवन्तमनन्यजन्मा मा ते मलीमसविकारघना<BR> मतिर्भूत् Māl. 1. 32; the अ is sometimes retained; मा निषाद प्रतिष्ठां<BR> त्वमगमः शाश्वतीः समाः Rām.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) the Imperfect (the augment being dropped here also); मा चैनमभिभाषथाः<BR> Rām. 1. 2. 15;<BR>——(<i>c</i>) the Future, or Potential mood, in the sense of ‘lest’, ‘that not’<BR>; लघु एनां परित्रायस्व मा कस्यापि तपस्विनो हस्ते पतिष्यति Ś. 2;<BR> मा कश्चिन्ममाप्यनर्थो भवेत् Pt. 5; मा नाम देव्याः किमप्यनिष्टमुत्पन्नं<BR> भवेत् K. 307; the Imperative mood also is sometimes used for the Potential;<BR> त्वरतामार्यपुत्र एतां समाश्वासयितुं मास्या विकारो वर्धताम् M. 4.<BR>——(<i>d</i>) the Present Participle when a curse is implied; मा जीवन् यः<BR> परावज्ञादुःखदग्धोऽपि जीवति Śi. 2. 45; or<BR>——(<i>e</i>) with Potential passive participles; मैवं प्रार्थ्यम्. मा<BR> is sometimes used without any verb; मा तावत् ‘oh! do not (say or do) so’<BR>; मा मैवम्; मा नाम रक्षिणः Mk. 3 ‘may it not be the police’;<BR> see under नम. Sometimes मा is followed by स्म and is used<BR> with the Aorist or Imperfect with the augment dropped, and rarely with<BR> the Potential mood; क्लैब्यं मा स्म गमः पार्थ Bg. 2. 3; मा स्म<BR> प्रतीपं गमः Ś. 4. 17; मा स्म सीमन्तिनी काचिज्जनयेत् पुत्रमीदृशम्.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: माचिरम्, माविलम्बम्, माविलम्बितम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माचिरम्
मा + -चिरम्, -विलम्बम्, -विलम्बितम् <i>ind.</i> without delay, shortly,<BR> quickly; अमात्यान् वृष्णिवीराणां द्रष्टुमिच्छामि माचिरम् Mb. 16. 7. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माविलम्बम्
मा + -चिरम्, -विलम्बम्, -विलम्बितम् <i>ind.</i> without delay, shortly,<BR> quickly; अमात्यान् वृष्णिवीराणां द्रष्टुमिच्छामि माचिरम् Mb. 16. 7. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माविलम्बितम्
मा + -चिरम्, -विलम्बम्, -विलम्बितम् <i>ind.</i> without delay, shortly,<BR> quickly; अमात्यान् वृष्णिवीराणां द्रष्टुमिच्छामि माचिरम् Mb. 16. 7. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मा
2. मा<BR>—1 The goddess of wealth, Lakṣmī; तमाखुपत्रं राजेन्द्र भज माज्ञानदायकम् Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 A mother.<BR>—3 A measure.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मापः, मापतिः, मावरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मापः|माप
मा + -पः, -पतिः, -वरः epithets of Viṣṇu; हाटकनिभपीताम्बर<BR> अभयं कुरु मे मावर Nārāyaṇa. 5. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मापतिः|मापति
मा + -पः, -पतिः, -वरः epithets of Viṣṇu; हाटकनिभपीताम्बर<BR> अभयं कुरु मे मावर Nārāyaṇa. 5. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मावरः
मा + -पः, -पतिः, -वरः epithets of Viṣṇu; हाटकनिभपीताम्बर<BR> अभयं कुरु मे मावर Nārāyaṇa. 5. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मा
3. मा €2 P., €3. €4 Ā. (माति, मिमीते or मीयते, मित)<BR>—1 To measure; न्यधित मिमान इवावनिं पदानि Śi. 7. 13, 9. 2.<BR>—2 To measure or mark off, limit; see मित.<BR>—3 To compare with (in size), measure by any standard; पुरः सखीनाममिमीत<BR> लोचने Ku. 5. 15.<BR>—4 To be in, find room or space in, be contained or comprised in; तनौ<BR> ममुस्तत्र न कैटभद्विषस्तपोधनाभ्यागमसंभवा मुदः Śi. 1. 23; वृद्धिं<BR> गतेऽप्यात्मनि नैव मान्तीः 3. 73, 10. 50, 14. 75, 13. 2, 5. 44; माति<BR> मातुमशक्योऽपि यशोराशिर्यदत्र ते K. P. 10.<BR>—5 To prepare, arrange.<BR>—6 To infer, conclude.<BR>—7 To form, make, build, construct.<BR>—8 To assign, mete out, apportion.<BR>—9 To show, display.<BR>—10 To roar, sound. ━<i>Caus.</i> (मापयति-ते) To cause to be measured,<BR> measure or mete out; एतेन मापयति भित्तिषु कर्ममार्गम् Mk. 3. 16.<BR>━<i>Desid.</i> (मित्सति-ते) To wish to measure &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांस्
मांस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 Flesh. (This word has no forms for the first five inflections, and<BR> is optionally substituted for मांस after acc. dual).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसम्
मांसम् [मन्-स दीर्घश्च Uṇ. 3. 64] Flesh, meat; समांसो मधुपर्कः<BR> U. 4. (The word is thus fancifully derived in Ms. 5. 55:− मां स भक्षयिताऽमुत्र<BR> यस्य मांसमिहाद्मपहम् । एतन्मांसस्य मांसत्वं प्रवदन्ति मनीषिणः ॥).<BR>—2 The flesh of fish.<BR>—3 The fleshy part of a fruit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसः|मांस|मांसं
मांसम् + .{@-सः@}<BR>—1 A worm.<BR>—2 N. of a mixed tribe, selling meat.<BR>—3 Time.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मांसाद्, मांसाद, मांसादिन्, मांसभक्षक, मांसारिः, मांसार्गलः, मांसार्गलम्, मांसार्बुदः, मांसार्बुदम्, मांसाशनम्, मांसाष्टका, मांसाहारः, मांसेष्टा, मांसोपजीविन्, मांसौदनः, मांसकच्छपः, मांसकन्दी, मांसकामः, मांसकारिन्, मांसकीलः, मांसक्षयः, मांसग्रन्थिः, मांसजम्, मांसतेजस्, मांसतानः, मांसदृश्, मांसद्राविन्, मांसनिर्यासः, मांसपः, मांसपचनम्, मांसपरिवर्जनम्, मांसपाकः, मांसपिटकः, मांसपिटकम्, मांसपित्तम्, मांसलिप्तम्, मांसपेशी, मांसप्ररोहः, मांसफला, मांसभेत्तृ, मांसभेदिन्, मांसमासा, मांसयोनिः, मांसरसः, मांसरोहिणी, मांसलता, मांसविक्रयः, मांसशोणित, मांससारः, मांसस्नेहः, मांसहासा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसाद्
मांसम् + -अद्, -अद, -आदिन्, -भक्षक <i>a.</i> flesh-eating, carnivorous (as<BR> an animal); अद्य तर्प्स्यन्ति मांसादाः Bk. 16. 29; Ms. 5. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1255-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

