मांसम् + -हासा skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसल|मांसलं|मांसलः
मांसल <i>a.</i> [मांस-लच्; cf. अंसल]<BR>—1 Fleshy.<BR>—2 Muscular, lusty, brawny; U. 1.<BR>—3 Fat, strong, powerful; शाखाः शतं मांसलाः Bv. 1. 34.<BR>—4 Deep (as sound); ध्वनिश्च माङ्गल्यमृदङ्गमांसलः U. 6. 25; प्रतिभिन्नपुष्करावर्तकस्तनितमांसलो<BR> वाङ्निर्घोषः Mv. 2.<BR>—5 Increased in bulk or quantity; Māl. 9. 13; ह्रदस्य हंसावलिमांसलश्रियः N.<BR>—6 Pulpy (as fruit).<BR>—7 Dense, thick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसिकः|मांसिक
मांसिकः [मांसं पण्यमस्य ठक्] A butcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसिका
मांसिका, मांसिनी, मांसी<BR> Nardostachys Jatāmansi (जटामांसी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसिनी
मांसिका, मांसिनी, मांसी<BR> Nardostachys Jatāmansi (जटामांसी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसी
मांसिका, मांसिनी, मांसी<BR> Nardostachys Jatāmansi (जटामांसी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मांसीयते
मांसीयते Den. P. To hanker after flesh, to be greedy of flesh; शिष्टविगर्हणं<BR> लभेत कृते श्रुत्यर्थे मांसीयन् पशून् हन्तीति ŚB. on MS. 11. 1. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकन्दः|माकन्द|माकंद|माकंदः
माकन्दः The mango tree; माकन्द न प्रपेदे मधुपेन तवोपमा जगति<BR> Bv. 1. 29; माकन्दक्रन्दकान्ताऽधरधरणितलम् Gīt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकन्दी|माकंदी
माकन्दः + .{@-न्दी@}<BR>—1 The myrobalan tree.<BR>—2 Yellow sandal.<BR>—3 N. of a city on the Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकर
माकर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR> Belonging to the sea-monster, Makara q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकरी
माकर + .{@-री@} N. of the seventh day in the bright half of Māgha; तन्मे<BR> रोगं च शोकं च माकरी हन्तु सप्तमी Tithyādi.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: माकराकरः, माकरासनम्, माकरव्यूहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकराकरः
माकर + -आकरः the sea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकरासनम्
माकर + -आसनम् a particular posture in sitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकरव्यूहः
माकर + -व्यूहः a particular form of military array.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकरन्द|माकरंद
माकरन्द <i>a.</i> (-न्दी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Derived from, relating to, the juice of flowers;<BR> full of or mixed with honey; प्रचलित इव सान्द्रो माकरन्दः परागः<BR> Māl. 8. 1 (v. l.); 9. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकलिः|माकलि
माकलिः<BR>—1 N. of Mātali, the charioteer of Indra.<BR>—2 The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकारध्यानम्
माकारध्यानम् A particular method of abstract meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माकुलिः|माकुलि
माकुलिः A kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माक्षिक|माक्षिकं|माक्षिकः
माक्षि(क्षी)क <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Coming or derived from a bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माक्षीक|माक्षीकं
माक्षि(क्षी)क <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Coming or derived from a bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माक्षिकम्
माक्षि(क्षी)क + .{@-कम्@} [मक्षिकाभिः संभृत्य कृतम् अण्]<BR>—1 Honey; धुर्यैरपि माधुर्यैर्द्राक्षाक्षीरेक्षुमाक्षिकसुधानाम् Bv. 4. 43.<BR>—2 A kind of honey-like mineral substance; माक्षीकधातुमधुपारदलोहचूर्ण Rāj. T.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माक्षिकः|माक्षिक|माक्षिकं
माक्षि(क्षी)क + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A spider.<BR>—2 Honey.<BR>—3 Pyrites.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: माक्षिकाश्रयम्, माक्षिकजम्, माक्षिकधातुः, माक्षिकफलः, माक्षिकशर्करा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माक्षिकाश्रयम्
माक्षिक + -आश्रयम्<BR>—1 beesʼ-wax.<BR>—2 honey-comb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माक्षिकजम्
माक्षिक + -जम् beesʼ-wax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माक्षिकधातुः|माक्षिकधातु
माक्षिक + -धातुः pyrites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माक्षिकफलः|माक्षिकफल
माक्षिक + -फलः a kind of cocoa-nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माक्षिकशर्करा
माक्षिक + -शर्करा candied sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माख
माख <i>a.</i> (-खी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Sacrificial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मागध|मागधः
मागध <i>a.</i> (-धी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [मगधदेशे भवः अण्] Relating to or living in<BR> the country of Magadha or the people of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">Page1256-2</a>]<BR> Magadha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मागधः|मागध
मागध + .{@-धः@}<BR>—1 A king of the Magadhas.<BR>—2 N. of a mixed tribe, said to have been the offspring of a Vaiśya father<BR> and a Kṣatriya mother, (the duty of the members of this caste being that<BR> of professional bards); Ms. 10. 11, 17; क्षत्रिया मागधं वैश्यात् Y. 1. 94;<BR> Mb. 13. 49. 10.<BR>—3 A bard or panegyrist in general; सूतमागधवन्दिनः Bhāg. 1. 11. 20;<BR> परिणतिमिति रात्रेर्मागधा माधवाय Śi. 11. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मागधाः
मागध + .{@-धाः@} (pl.) N. of a people, the Magadhas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मागधा
मागध + .{@-धा@}<BR>—1 A princess of the Magadhas. —2 Long pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मागधी
मागध + .{@-धी@} —1 A princess of the Magadhas; तयोर्जगृहतुः पादान् राजा<BR> राज्ञी च मागधी R. 1. 57.<BR>—2 The language of the Magadhas, one of the four principal kinds of Prākṛta.<BR>—3 Long pepper.<BR>—4 White cumin.<BR>—5 Refined sugar.<BR>—6 A kind of jasmine.<BR>—7 A variety of cardamoms.<BR>—8 The daughter of a Kṣatriya mother and a Vaiśya father.<BR>—9 Anise.<BR>—10 N. of a river (शोणा).<BR>—11 A kind of रीति in rhetorics. The अलङ्कारशेखर (7) gives<BR> the following illustration:− पाणौ पद्मधिया मधूककुसुमभ्रान्त्या पुनर्गण्डयोर्नीलेन्दीवरशङ्कया<BR> नयनयोर्बन्धूकबुद्ध्याधरे । लीयन्ते कबरीषु बान्धवजनव्यामोहजातस्पृहा<BR> दुर्वारा मधुपाः क्रियन्ति तरुणि स्थानानि रक्षिष्यसि ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मागधा
मागधा, मागधिका Long pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मागधिका
मागधा, मागधिका Long pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मागधिकः|मागधिक
मागधिकः A king of the Magadhas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माघः|माघ
माघः [मघानक्षत्रयुक्ता पौर्णमासी माघी साऽत्र मास अण्]<BR>—1 N. of a lunar month (corresponding to January-February).<BR>—2 N. of a poet, the author of the Śiśupālavadha or Māgha-kāvya;<BR> (the poet describes his family in Śi. 20. 80-84 and thus concludes:−<BR> श्रीशब्दरम्यकृतसर्गसमाप्तिलक्ष्म लक्ष्मीपतेश्चरितकीर्तनचारु माघः ।<BR> तस्यात्मजः सुकविकीर्तिदुराशयादः काव्यं व्यधत्त शिशुपालवधाभिधानम् ॥);<BR> उपमा कालिदासस्य भारवेरर्थगौरवम् । दण्डिनः पदलालित्यं<BR> माघे सन्ति त्रयो गुणाः ॥; तावद्भा भारवेर्भाति यावन्माघस्य नोदयः Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माघी
माघः + .{@-घी@} The day of full moon in the month of Māgha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माघमा
माघमा A female crab; कुस्त्री खादति मांसानि माघमां सेगवा इव<BR> Mb. 12. 139. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माघवत
माघवत <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> Belonging to Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माघवती
माघवत + .{@-ती@} The east.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: माघवतचापम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माघवतचापम्
माघवत + -चापम् the rainbow; (धत्ते) मेघस्य माघवतचापधरस्य<BR> लक्ष्मीम् U. 5. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माघवन|माघवनं
माघवन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Belonging to or ruled by Indra; ककुभं समस्कुरुत<BR> माघवनीम् Śi. 9. 25; अवनीतलमेव साधु मन्ये न वनी माघवनी विलासहेतुः Jag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माघोनम्
माघोनम्, माघोनी <i>f.</i> The east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माघोनी
माघोनम्, माघोनी <i>f.</i> The east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माघ्यम्
माघ्यम् The flower of the <i>kunda</i> creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माङ्क्ष्|मांक्ष्
माङ्क्ष् €1 P. (माङ्क्षति) To wish or desire, long for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माङ्गलिक|मांगलिक
माङ्गलिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [मङ्गल-ठक्]<BR>—1 Auspicious, tending to good fortune, indicative of auspiciousness;<BR> मुदमस्य माङ्गलिकतूर्यकृतां ध्वनयः प्रतेनुरनुवप्रमपाम् Ki. 6. 4;<BR> Mv. 4. 35; Bv. 2. 57; कथमपि गुरुशोकान्मा रुदन् माङ्गलिक्यः (पुरतरुण्यः) Bk. 1. 26.<BR>—2 Fortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1256-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माङ्गल्य|मांगल्य|माङ्गल्यं
माङ्गल्य <i>a.</i> [मङ्गलाय हितं ष्यञ्] Auspicious, indicative<BR> of good fortune; क्षौमं केनचिदिन्दुपाण्डु तरुणा माङ्गल्यमाविष्कृतम्<BR> Ś. 4. 4; सर्वमङ्गलमाङ्गल्ये शिवे Devīstuti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1257-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माङ्गल्यम्
माङ्गल्य + .{@-ल्यम्@}<BR>—1 Auspiciousness, prosperity, welfare, good fortune.<BR>—2 A blessing or benediction.<BR>—3 A festivity, festival, any auspicious rite.<BR>—4 An auspicious thing, amulet.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: माङ्गल्यमृदङ्गः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1257-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माङ्गल्यमृदङ्गः|माङ्गल्यमृदङ्ग|मांगल्यमृदंग
माङ्गल्य + -मृदङ्गः a drum beaten on auspicious occasions; ध्वनिश्च माङ्गल्यमृदङ्गमांसलम् U. 6. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1257-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

