मातुलकः<BR>—1 A maternal uncle (as a term of endearment).<BR>—2 The thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातुला
मातुला, मातुलानी, मातुली<BR>—1 The wife of a maternal uncle; Ms. 2. 131; Y. 3. 232; Bhāg. 1. 14. 27.<BR>—2 Hemp; जातीफलं मातुलानी महिफेनं च पत्रकम् Śiva B. 30. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातुलानी
मातुला, मातुलानी, मातुली<BR>—1 The wife of a maternal uncle; Ms. 2. 131; Y. 3. 232; Bhāg. 1. 14. 27.<BR>—2 Hemp; जातीफलं मातुलानी महिफेनं च पत्रकम् Śiva B. 30. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातुली
मातुला, मातुलानी, मातुली<BR>—1 The wife of a maternal uncle; Ms. 2. 131; Y. 3. 232; Bhāg. 1. 14. 27.<BR>—2 Hemp; जातीफलं मातुलानी महिफेनं च पत्रकम् Śiva B. 30. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातुलेयः|मातुलेय
मातुलेयः (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR> The son of a maternal uncle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातुलिङ्गः|मातुलिङ्ग|मातुलिंग|मातुलिंगः
मातुलिङ्गः, -मातुलुङ्गः<BR> A kind of citron tree; (भुवो) भागाः प्रेङ्खितमातुलुङ्गवृतयः<BR> प्रेयो विधास्यन्ति वाम् Māl. 6. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातुलुङ्गः|मातुलुङ्ग|मातुलुंग|मातुलुंगः
मातुलिङ्गः, -मातुलुङ्गः<BR> A kind of citron tree; (भुवो) भागाः प्रेङ्खितमातुलुङ्गवृतयः<BR> प्रेयो विधास्यन्ति वाम् Māl. 6. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातुलिङ्गम्
मातुलिङ्गः, -मातुलुङ्गः + .{@-गम्@} The fruit of this tree, a citron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातुल्यम्
मातुल्यम् The house of a maternal uncle; बाल एव तु मातुल्यं भरतो<BR> नायितस्त्वया Rām. 2. 8. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृ
मातृ <i>f.</i> [मान् पूजायां तृच् नलोपः Uṇ. 2. 94]<BR>—1 A mother; मातृवत् परदारेषु यः पश्यति स पश्यति; सहस्रं तु<BR> पितॄन् माता गौरवेणातिरिच्यते Subhāṣ.; माता किल मनुष्याणां देवतानां<BR> च दैवतम् Madhyamavyāyoga 1. 37; माता च परमं दैवतं समा च<BR> पुत्रेषु इत्येतैरुपवध्यमानो जननीवचनोऽवगम्यते ŚB. on MS. 10. 1. 14.<BR>—2 Mother as a term of respect or endearment; मातर्लक्ष्मि भजस्व कंचिदपरम्<BR> Bh. 3. 64, 87; अयि मातर्देवयजनसंभवे देवि सीते U. 4.<BR>—3 A cow.<BR>—4 An epithet of Lakṣmī.<BR>—5 An epithet of Durgā.<BR>—6 Ether, sky.<BR>—7 The earth.<BR>—8 A divine mother; मातृभ्यो बलिमुपहर Mk. 1.<BR>—9 An epithet of Revatī.<BR>—10 N. of several plants; आखुकर्णी, इन्द्रवारुणी and जटामांसी &c. ━pl.<BR>—1 An epithet of the divine mothers, said to attend on Śiva, but usually<BR> on Skanda. (They are usually said to be 8:− ब्राह्मी माहेश्वरी चण्डी<BR> वाराही वैष्णवी तथा । कौमारी चैव चामुण्डा चर्चिकेत्यष्ट मातरः ॥ or,<BR> according to some, only seven:− ब्राह्मी माहेश्वरी चैव कौमारी वैष्णवी<BR> तथा । माहेन्द्री चैव वाराही चामुण्डा सप्त मातरः ॥ Some increase the<BR> number to sixteen).<BR>—2 N. of eight classes of female ancestors or Manes. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A measurer.<BR>—2 Ved. A maker, builder, creator.<BR>—3 A knower, one having true knowledge.<BR>—4 Life or soul (जीव) [cf. L. <i>Mater</i>.]<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मातृकेशटः, मातृगणः, मातृगन्धिनी, मातृगामिन्, मातृगोत्रम्, मातृग्रामः, मातृघातः, मातृघातकः, मातृघातिन्, मातृघातुकः, मातृचक्रम्, मातृज्ञ, मातृदेव, मातृदोषः, मातृनन्दनः, मातृपक्ष, मातृपितृ, मातृपुत्रौ, मातृपूजनम्, मातृबन्धुः, मातृबान्धवः, मातृभक्तिः, मातृभावः, मातृभोगीण, मातृमण्डलम्, मातृमातृ, मातृमुखः, मातृशासितः, मातृयज्ञः, मातृवत्सलः, मातृवधः, मातृवाहिनी, मातृस्वसृ, मातृस्वसेयः, मातृस्वसेया<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृकेशटः|मातृकेशट
मातृ + -केशटः a maternal uncle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृगणः|मातृगण
मातृ + -गणः the collection of the divine mothers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृगन्धिनी|मातृगंधिनी
मातृ + -गन्धिनी an unnatural mother; हनिष्याम्यधुनैवाहं कैकेयीं मातृगन्धिनीम्<BR> A. Rām. 2. 8. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृगामिन्
मातृ + -गामिन् <i>m.</i> one who has committed incest with his mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृगोत्रम्
मातृ + -गोत्रम् a motherʼs family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृग्रामः|मातृग्राम
मातृ + -ग्रामः the female sex, womankind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृघातः|मातृघात
मातृ + -घातः, -घातकः, -घातिन् <i>m.</i>, {@-घ्नः@}<BR> a matricide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृघातकः|मातृघातक
मातृ + -घातः, -घातकः, -घातिन् <i>m.</i>, {@-घ्नः@}<BR> a matricide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृघातिन्
मातृ + -घातः, -घातकः, -घातिन् <i>m.</i>, {@-घ्नः@}<BR> a matricide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृघातुकः|मातृघातुक
मातृ + -घातुकः<BR>—1 a matricide.<BR>—2 an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृचक्रम्
मातृ + -चक्रम्<BR>—1 the group of divine mothers.<BR>—2 a kind of mystical circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृज्ञ
मातृ + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> honouring a mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृदेव
मातृ + -देव <i>a.</i> having a mother for oneʼs god, adoring mother like<BR> a god; मातृदेवो भव T. Up. 1. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृदोषः|मातृदोष
मातृ + -दोषः the defect or inferiority of a mother (being of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">Page1258-2</a>]<BR> a lower caste); ताननन्तरनाम्नस्तु मातृदोषात् प्रचक्षते Ms. 10. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृनन्दनः|मातृनन्दन|मातृनंदन
मातृ + -नन्दनः an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृपक्ष|मातृपक्षः
मातृ + -पक्ष <i>a.</i> belonging to the motherʼs side or line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृपक्षः|मातृपक्ष
मातृ + -पक्ष + .({@-क्षः@}) maternal kinsmen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृपितृ
मातृ + -पितृ <i>m.</i> (dual) forming (मातापितरौ or मातरपितरौ) parents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृपुत्रौ
मातृ + -पुत्रौ (मातापुत्रौ) a mother and son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृपूजनम्
मातृ + -पूजनम् worship of the divine mothers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृबन्धुः|मातृबन्धु|मातृबंधु
मातृ + -बन्धुः, -बान्धवः a maternal kinsman; मातृबन्धुनिवासिनं भरतम्<BR> R. 12. 12. ━(pl.) a class of relatives on the motherʼs side; they are<BR> thus specified:− मातुः पितुः स्वसुः पुत्रा मातुर्मातुः स्वसुः सुताः ।<BR> मातुर्मातुलपुत्राश्च विज्ञेया मातृबन्धवः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृबान्धवः|मातृबान्धव|मातृबांधव
मातृ + -बन्धुः, -बान्धवः a maternal kinsman; मातृबन्धुनिवासिनं भरतम्<BR> R. 12. 12. ━(pl.) a class of relatives on the motherʼs side; they are<BR> thus specified:− मातुः पितुः स्वसुः पुत्रा मातुर्मातुः स्वसुः सुताः ।<BR> मातुर्मातुलपुत्राश्च विज्ञेया मातृबन्धवः ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृभक्तिः|मातृभक्ति
मातृ + -भक्तिः devotion to a mother; इमं लोकं मातृभक्त्या … …<BR> ब्रह्मलोकं समश्नुते Ms. 2. 233.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृभावः|मातृभाव
मातृ + -भावः maternity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृभोगीण
मातृ + -भोगीण <i>a.</i> fit to be enjoyed or possessed by a mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृमण्डलम्
मातृ + -मण्डलम् the collection of the divine mothers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृमातृ
मातृ + -मातृ <i>f.</i> an epithet of Pārvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृमुखः|मातृमुख
मातृ + -मुखः, -शासितः a foolish fellow, simpleton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृशासितः|मातृशासित
मातृ + -मुखः, -शासितः a foolish fellow, simpleton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृयज्ञः|मातृयज्ञ
मातृ + -यज्ञः a sacrifice offered to the divine mothers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृवत्सलः|मातृवत्सल
मातृ + -वत्सलः an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृवधः|मातृवध
मातृ + -वधः the murder of a mother (with Buddhists one of the five<BR> unpardonable sins).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृवाहिनी
मातृ + -वाहिनी <i>f.</i> a kind of bird; bat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृस्वसृ
मातृ + -स्वसृ <i>f.</i> (मातृष्वसृ or मातुःस्वसृ) a motherʼs sister,<BR> a maternal aunt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृस्वसेयः
मातृ + -स्वसेयः (मातृष्वसेयः) a motherʼs sisterʼs son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृस्वसेयी
मातृ + -स्वसेयः + .({@-यी@}) the daughter of a maternal aunt; so मातृष्वस्नीयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृस्वसेया
मातृ + -स्वसेया.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृक|मातृकः
मातृक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Coming or inherited from a mother; मातृकं च धनुरूर्जितं दधत् R. 11. 64, 90.<BR>—2 Maternal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृकः|मातृक
मातृक + .{@-कः@} A maternal uncle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृका
मातृक + .{@-का@}<BR>—1 A mother; शत्रुश्चैव हि मित्रं च न लेख्यं न च मातृका Mb. 2. 55. 10.<BR>—2 A grandmother; -सत्यामपि प्रीतौ न मातुर्मातृकाया वा शासनातिवृत्तिः Dk. 2. 2.<BR>—3 A nurse.<BR>—4 A source, origin.<BR>—5 A divine mother.<BR>—6 N. of certain diagrams written in characters supposed to have a magical<BR> power; मातृकारहितं मन्त्रमादिशन्ते न कुत्रचित् Brahmavidyā Up. 63.<BR>—7 The character or alphabet so used (pl.).<BR>—8 N. of the 8 veins of the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृकम्
मातृक + .{@-कम्@} The nature of a mother.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मातृकच्छिदः, मातृकयन्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृकच्छिदः|मातृकच्छिद|मातृकछिद
मातृक + -च्छिदः N. of Paraśurāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृकयन्त्रम्
मातृक + -यन्त्रम् a kind of mystical diagram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मातृतः
मातृतः <i>ind.</i> On the motherʼs side; in right of the mother; Ms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्र|मात्रं|मात्रः
मात्र <i>a.</i> (-त्रा, -त्री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [मा-त्रन्] An affix added to nouns in the<BR> sense of ‘measuring as much as’, ‘as high or long, or broad as’, ‘reaching as far as’<BR>, as in ऊरुमात्री भित्तिः; पञ्चदशयोजनमात्रमध्वांनमतिचक्राम<BR> K.; (in this sense the word may as well be considered to be मात्रा<BR> at the end of comp. q. v. below).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रः|मात्र|मात्रं
मात्र + .{@-त्रः@} A Brāhmaṇa of the lower order (by birth).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रम्
मात्र + .{@-त्रम्@}<BR>—1 A measure, whether of length, breadth, height, size, space, distance<BR> or number; अग्रे तिष्ठत मात्रं मे Bhāg. 6. 11. 5; usually at the<BR> end of comp, <i>i. e.</i> अङ्गुलिमात्रम् a ‘fingerʼs breadth’; किंचिन्मात्रं<BR> गत्वा ‘to some distance’; क्रोशमात्रे ‘at the distance of a Krośa’,<BR> रेखामात्रमपि ‘even the breadth of a line, as much as a line’; रेखामात्रमपि<BR> क्षुण्णादा मनोर्वर्त्मनः परम् (न व्यतीयुः) R. 1. 17; so क्षणमात्रम्,<BR> निमिषमात्रम् ‘the space of an instant’, शतमात्र ‘a hundred in number’<BR>; so गजमात्र ‘as high or big as an elephant’;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-1" target="_blank">Page1259-1</a>]<BR> तालमात्र, यवमात्र &c.<BR>—2 The full measure of anything, the whole or entire class of things,<BR> totality; जीवमात्रम् or प्राणिमात्रम् ‘the entire class of living beings’<BR>; मनुष्यमात्रो मर्त्यः ‘every man is mortal’; वस्तुमात्रपक्षकोऽनुपसंहारी<BR> (हेतुः) Tarka K.; मानुषमात्रदुष्करं कर्मानुष्ठितम् Dk.<BR>—3 The simple measure of anything, the one thing and no more, often translatable<BR> by ‘mere’, ‘only’, ‘even’; जातिमात्रेण H. 1. 58 ‘by mere caste’, टिट्टिभमात्रेण<BR> समुद्रो व्याकुलीकृतः 2. 149 ‘by a mere wag-tail’, वाचामात्रेण जाप्यसे<BR> Ś. 2 ‘merely by words’; so अर्थमात्रम्, संमानमात्रम् Pt. 1. 83; used<BR> with past participles मात्र may be translated by ‘as soon as’, ‘no sooner than’<BR>, ‘just’; विद्धमात्रः R. 5. 51 ‘as soon as pierced’; ‘when just pierced’<BR>; भुक्तमात्रे ‘just after eating’; प्रविष्टमात्र एव<BR> तत्रभवति Ś. 3 &c.<BR>—4 An element, elementary matter; अहं पयो ज्योतिरथानिलो नभो मात्राणि<BR> देवा मन इन्द्रियाणि Bhāg. 10. 59. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1258-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रा
मात्रा<BR>—1 A measure; see मात्रम् above.<BR>—2 A standard of measure, standard, rule.<BR>—3 The correct measure; तस्य मात्रा न विद्यते Mb. 13. 93. 45.<BR>—4 A unit of measure, a foot.<BR>—5 A moment.<BR>—6 A particle, an atom; पृथिवी च पृथिवीमात्रा &c. Praśna. Up. 4. 8.<BR>—7 A part, portion; लभेमहि धनमात्रान् Ch. Up. 1. 10. 6; सुरेन्द्रमात्राश्रितगर्भगौरवात् R. 3. 11.<BR>—8 A small portion, a little, trifle, a little quantity, a small measure<BR> only; see मात्र (3).<BR>—9 Account, consideration; राजेति क्रियती मात्रा Pt. 1. 40 ‘of what account or consideration is a king’<BR>, <i>i. e.</i> I hold him of no account;<BR> कायस्थ इति लघ्वी मात्रा Mu. 1.<BR>—10 Money, wealth, property; शून्यमठिकायां मात्राः समवतार्य Dk. 2. 8;<BR> नक्तंदिनं कक्षान्तरात्तां मात्रां न मुञ्चति Pt. 1; कथमस्यार्थमात्रा<BR> हर्तव्या <i>ibid.</i><BR>—11 (In prosody) A prosodial or syllabic instant, the time required to<BR> pronounce a short vowel; गच्छेत् षोडशमात्राभिः Śukra. 4. 963; एकमात्रो<BR> भवेद् ह्रस्वः.<BR>—12 An element.<BR>—13 The material world, matter.<BR>—14 The upper part of the Nāgarī characters.<BR>—15 An ear-ring.<BR>—16 An ornament; a jewel.<BR>—17 A measure of time (in music.).<BR>—18 Function of the organs (इन्द्रियवृत्ति).<BR>—19 Change (विकार); सन्निवेश्यात्ममात्रासु सर्वभूतानि निर्ममे Ms. 1. 16.<BR>—20 = बुद्धिः; न मात्रामनुरुध्यन्ते Mb. 12. 270. 12 (com. मीयते<BR> विषया अनयेति मात्रा बुद्धिः).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मात्राङ्गुलम्, मात्रार्धम्, मात्रागुरु, मात्राच्युतकम्, मात्राच्छन्दस्, मात्रावृत्तम्, मात्राभस्त्रा, मात्रालाभ, मात्रावस्तिः, मात्रासंगः, मात्रासमकः, मात्रास्पर्शः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्राङ्गुलम्
मात्रा + -अङ्गुलम् a measure equal to the middle digit of the middle finger<BR> in the right hand of the architect or priest, employed in measuring the<BR> sacrificial objects like the kuśa grass or seat, the spout of a ladle,<BR> and the ladle &c.; Suprabhedāgama 30. 4/5, 7/8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रार्धम्
मात्रा + -अर्धम् half of a prosodial instant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रागुरु
मात्रा + -गुरु <i>a.</i> (food) heavy on account of its ingredients.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्राच्युतकम्
मात्रा + -च्युतकम् a kind of artificial composition, getting out another<BR> meaning by the omission of a Mātrā; <i>e. g.</i> मूलस्थितिमधः कुर्वन्<BR> पात्रैर्जुष्टो गताक्षरैः । विटसेव्यः कुलीनस्य तिष्ठतः पथिकस्य सः ॥<BR> (where the omission of the Mātrā in विट makes the sense applicable<BR> to a वट).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्राच्छन्दस्|मात्राछन्दस्
मात्रा + -छन्दस्, -वृत्तम् a metre regulated by the number of prosodial<BR> instants it contains, <i>e. g.</i> the Āryā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रावृत्तम्
मात्रा + -छन्दस्, -वृत्तम् a metre regulated by the number of prosodial<BR> instants it contains, <i>e. g.</i> the Āryā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्राभस्त्रा
मात्रा + -भस्त्रा a moneybag.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">Page1259-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रालाभ
मात्रा + -लाभ (pl.) acquisition of wealth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रावस्तिः|मात्रावस्ति
मात्रा + -वस्तिः an oily clyster.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रासंगः|मात्रासङ्ग|मात्रासंग
मात्रा + -संगः attachment to or regard for household possessions or property;<BR> प्राणयात्रिकमात्रः स्यान्मात्रासङ्गाद्विनिर्गतः Ms. 6. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रासमकः|मात्रासमक
मात्रा + -समकः N. of a class of metres; see App.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रास्पर्शः|मात्रास्पर्श
मात्रा + -स्पर्शः material contact, contact with material elements; मात्रास्पर्शास्तु<BR> कौन्तेय शीतोष्णसुखदुःखदाः Bg. 2. 14; Bhāg. 1. 6. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्रिका
मात्रिका A syllable or prosodial instant (= मात्रा above).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्सर
मात्सर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>), मात्सरिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Jealous, envious, malicious, spiteful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्सरी
मात्सर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>), मात्सरिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Jealous, envious, malicious, spiteful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्सरिक
मात्सर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>), मात्सरिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Jealous, envious, malicious, spiteful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्सरिकी
मात्सर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>), मात्सरिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Jealous, envious, malicious, spiteful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्सर्यम्
मात्सर्यम्<BR>—1 Envy, jealousy, spite, malice; अहो वस्तुनि मात्सर्यम् Ks. 21. 49;<BR> Ki. 3. 53; मात्सर्यमुत्सार्य विचार्य धूर्याः S. D.<BR>—2 Displeasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्स्य
मात्स्य <i>a.</i> Relating to or coming from fish; यदर्थमदधाद्रूपं<BR> मात्स्यं लोकजुगुप्सितम् Bhāg. 8. 24. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्स्यन्यायः|मात्स्यन्याय
मात्स्यन्यायः The maxim of the bigger fish devouring the smaller ones,<BR> hence anarchy, disorder; अप्रणीतो हि (दण्डः) मात्स्यन्यायमुद्भावयति<BR> Kau. A. 1. 4; मात्स्यन्यायाभिभूताः प्रजाः मनुं वैवस्वतं राजानं चक्रिरे Kau. A. 1. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मात्स्यिकः|मात्स्यिक
मात्स्यिकः A fisherman; P. IV. 4. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माथः|माथ
माथः [मथ्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Stirring, churning, shaking about.<BR>—2 Killing, destruction.<BR>—3 A way, road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माथकः|माथक
माथकः A destroyer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माथुर|माथुरः
माथुर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [मथुरायां भवो मथुराया आगतो वा अण्]<BR>—1 Coming from Mathurā.<BR>—2 Produced in Mathurā.<BR>—3 Dwelling in Mathurā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

माथुरी
माथुर + .{@-री@} A kind of वृत्ति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मादः|माद
मादः [मद्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Intoxication, drunkenness.<BR>—2 Joy, delight.<BR>—3 Pride, arrogance.<BR>—4 War.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मादक|मादकः
मादक <i>a.</i> (-दिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [मद्-णिच् ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Intoxicating, maddening, stupefying.<BR>—2 Gladdening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मादकः|मादक
मादक + .{@-कः@} A gallinule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मादन|मादनं|मादनः
मादन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [मद्-णिच् ल्यु-ल्युट् वा] Intoxicating &c.; see मादक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मादनः|मादन|मादनं
मादन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 The god of love.<BR>—2 The thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मादनम्
मादन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Intoxication.<BR>—2 Delighting, exhilaration.<BR>—3 Cloves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मादनीयम्
मादनीयम् An intoxicating drink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मादिका
मादिका, मादिनी, मादुः Hemp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मादिनी
मादिका, मादिनी, मादुः Hemp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1259-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मादुः
