मार्गायातः|मार्गायात
मार्गः + -आयातः a traveller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गारब्ध
मार्गः + -आरब्ध begun on right lines; मार्गारब्धाः सर्वयत्नाः फलन्ति<BR> Pratijñā. 1. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गाली
मार्गः + -आली a track, streak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गोपदेशकः
मार्गः + -उपदेशकः a guide, leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गतालः|मार्गताल
मार्गः + -तालः (in music) a particular kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गतोरणम्
मार्गः + -तोरणम् a triumphal arch erected on a road; पौरदृष्टिकृतमार्गतोरणौ R. 11. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गदर्शकः|मार्गदर्शक
मार्गः + -दर्शकः a guide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गद्रङ्गः|मार्गद्रङ्ग
मार्गः + -द्रङ्गः a city or town on the road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गद्रुमः|मार्गद्रुम
मार्गः + -द्रुमः a tree growing by the wayside.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गधेनुः|मार्गधेनु
मार्गः + -धेनुः, -धेनुकम् a measure of distance equal to 4 krośas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गधेनुकम्
मार्गः + -धेनुः, -धेनुकम् a measure of distance equal to 4 krośas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गपतिः|मार्गपति
