मार्गबन्धनम्
मार्गः + -बन्धनम् a barricade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गरक्षकः|मार्गरक्षक
मार्गः + -रक्षकः a road-keeper, guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गवटी
मार्गः + -वटी an epithet of the tutelary deity of travellers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गविनोदनम्
मार्गः + -विनोदनम् entertainment on a journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गशोधकः|मार्गशोधक
मार्गः + -शोधकः a pioneer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गसंस्करणम्
मार्गः + -संस्करणम् cleansing the road; ततः संशोधनं नित्यं मार्गसंस्करणार्थकम् Śukra. 4. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गस्थ
मार्गः + -स्थ <i>a.</i> travelling; wayfaring; अनुगन्तुं सतां वर्त्म कृत्स्नं<BR> यदि न शक्यते । स्वल्पमप्यवगन्तव्यं मार्गस्थो नावसीदति ॥ Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गहर्म्यम्
