मार्ग|मार्गः
मार्ग <i>a.</i> Belonging to a deer (मृग); मार्गमायूरकौक्कुटैः<BR> (मांसचयैः) Rām. 2. 91. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1265-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मार्गकः|मार्गक
