मुक्तशैशव
मुक्त + -शैशव <i>a.</i> adult, grown up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तसंग|मुक्तसङ्ग|मुक्तसंगः
मुक्त + -संग <i>a.</i> free from (wordly) ties or attachments, disinterested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तसंगः|मुक्तसङ्ग|मुक्तसंग
