मुक्तकम्
मुक्तकम्<BR>—1 A missile, a missile weapon.<BR>—2 Simple prose (without compound words).<BR>—3 A detached stanza, the meaning of which is complete in itself; see<BR> Kāv. 1. 13; मुक्तकं श्लोक एवैकश्चमत्कारक्षमः सताम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्ता
मुक्ता<BR>—1 A pearl; हारोऽयं हरिणाक्षीणां लुठति स्तनमण्डले । मुक्तानामप्यवस्थेयं<BR> के वयं स्मरकिङ्कराः Amaru. 138 (where मुक्तानां means also ‘of absolved saints’<BR>); Śukra. 4. 157. (Pearls are said to be produced from<BR> various sources, but particularly from oyster-shells:− करीन्द्रजीमूतवराहशङ्खमत्स्याहिशुक्त्युद्भववेणुजानि ।<BR> मुक्ताफलानि प्रथितानि लोके तेषां तु शुक्त्युद्भवमेव भूरि ॥ Malli.).<BR>—2 A harlot, courtezan. —3 N. of a plant (रास्ना).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मुक्तागारः, मुक्तागारः, मुक्ताकारता, मुक्तावलिः, मुक्तावली, मुक्तागुणः, मुक्ताजालम्, मुक्तादामन्, मुक्तादिश्, मुक्तापटलम्, मुक्तापुष्पः, मुक्ताप्रसूः, मुक्ताप्रालम्बः, मुक्ताफलम्, मुक्तामणिः, मुक्तारत्नम्, मुक्तामातृ, मुक्तालता, मुक्तास्रज्, मुक्ताशुक्तिः, मुक्तास्फोटः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तागारः|मुक्तागार|मुक्तागारं
मुक्ता + -अगारः, -आगारः the pearl-oyster; लुठन्मुक्तागारे भवति परलोकं<BR> गतवतो । हरेरद्य द्वारे शिव शिव शिवानां कलकलः Bv. 1. 32 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तागारः|मुक्तागार|मुक्तागारं
मुक्ता + -अगारः, -आगारः the pearl-oyster; लुठन्मुक्तागारे भवति परलोकं<BR> गतवतो । हरेरद्य द्वारे शिव शिव शिवानां कलकलः Bv. 1. 32 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्ताकारता
मुक्ता + -आकारता the state of having the shape of a pearl; मुक्ताकारतया<BR> तदेव नलिनीपत्रस्थितं राजते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तावलिः|मुक्तावलि
मुक्ता + -आवलिः, -आवली <i>f.</i>, {@-कलापः@}<BR> a pearl-necklace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तावली
मुक्ता + -आवलिः, -आवली <i>f.</i>, {@-कलापः@}<BR> a pearl-necklace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तागुणः|मुक्तागुण
मुक्ता + -गुणः a pearl-necklace, string of pearls; एकं मुक्तागुणमिव<BR> भुवः स्थूलमध्येन्द्रनीलम् Me. 48; R. 16. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्ताजालम्
मुक्ता + -जालम् a string or zone of pearls; मुक्ताजालं चिरपरिचितं<BR> त्याजितो दैवगत्या Me. 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तादामन्
मुक्ता + -दामन् <i>n.</i> a string of pearls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तादिश्
मुक्ता + -दिश् the quarter or cardinal point just quitted by the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तापटलम्
मुक्ता + -पटलम् a mass of pearls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुक्तापुष्पः|मुक्तापुष्प
मुक्ता + -पुष्पः a kind of jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1273-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

