मुखाग्निः|मुखाग्नि
मुखम् + -अग्निः<BR>—1 a forest conflagration.<BR>—2 a sort of goblin with a face of fire.<BR>—3 the consecrated or sacrificial fire.<BR>—4 fire put into the mouth of a corpse at the time of lighting the funeral pile.<BR>—5 a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1274-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

