मुखम् + -भङ्गः<BR>—1 a blow on the face.<BR>—2 wry face, grimace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1274-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

