मुखवासनम्
मुखम् + -वासः, -वासनम् a perfume used to scent breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1274-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखविलुण्ठिका|मुखविलुंठिका
