मुखविषमः
मुखम् + -विषमः one of the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">Page1275-1</a>]<BR> ways of embezzlement namely misrepresentation of the source of income; Kau. A. 2. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1274-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

