मुखशाला
मुखम् + -शाला entrance-hall, vestibule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखशुद्धिः|मुखशुद्धि
मुखम् + -शुद्धिः <i>f.</i> washing or purifying the mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखशृङ्गः|मुखशृङ्ग
मुखम् + -शृङ्गः a rhinoceros.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखशेषः|मुखशेष
मुखम् + -शेषः an epithet of Rāhu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखशोधन|मुखशोधनं|मुखशोधनः
