मुखशोधनम्
मुखम् + -शोधन + .({@-नम्@})<BR>—1 cleansing the mouth.<BR>—2 cinnamon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखशोधिन्
मुखम् + -शोधिन् <i>m.</i> the citron tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखशोषः|मुखशोष
मुखम् + -शोषः dryness of the mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखश्रीः
मुखम् + -श्रीः <i>f.</i> ‘beauty of countenance’, a lovely face.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखसंदंशः|मुखसन्दंश
मुखम् + -संदंशः forceps.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखसंधिः|मुखसन्धि
मुखम् + -संधिः <i>m.</i> A kind of fugue; S. D. 6th Pariccheda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखसंभवः|मुखसम्भव|मुखसंभव|मुखसम्भवः
मुखम् + -संभवः a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखसुखम्
मुखम् + -सुखम् facility of pronunciation, phonetic ease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखसुरम्
मुखम् + -सुरम् the nectar of the lips (अधरामृत).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखस्रावः|मुखस्राव
मुखम् + -स्रावः saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखहासः
मुखम् + -हासः cheerfulness or liveliness of countenance; सकमलमुखहासं<BR> वीक्षितः पद्मिनीभिः Śi. 11. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखंपचः|मुखम्पच|मुखंपच
मुखंपचः A beggar, mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखर|मुखरः
मुखर <i>a.</i> [मुखं मुखव्यापारं कथनं राति रा-क Tv. cf.<BR> P. V. 2. 107. Vārt. also]<BR>—1 Talkative, garrulous, loquacious; मुखरा खल्वेषा गर्भदासी Ratn. 2;<BR> मुखरतावसरे हि विराजते Ki. 5. 16; तद्रूपवर्णनामुखर<BR> K. 189; Bk. 2. 54.<BR>—2 Noisy, making a continuous sound, tinkling, jingling (as an anklet<BR> &c.); स्तम्बेरमा मुखरशृङ्खलकर्षिणस्ते R. 5. 72; अन्तःकूजन्मुखरशकुनो<BR> यत्र रम्यो वनान्तः U. 2. 25, 20; Māl. 9. 5; मुखरमधीरं त्यज<BR> मञ्जीरं रिपुमिव केलिषु लोलम् Gīt. 5; Mk. 1. 35; तोयोत्सर्गस्तनितमुखरो<BR> मा स्म भूः Me. 39.<BR>—3 Sounding, resonant or resounding with (usually at the end of comp.);<BR> स्थाने स्थाने मुखरककुभो झाङ्कृतैर्निर्झराणाम् U. 2. 14; मण्डलीमुखरशिखरे<BR> (लताकुञ्जे) Gīt. 2; गोदावरीमुखरकन्दरगिरिः U. 1; R. 13. 40.<BR>—4 Expressive or indicative of.<BR>—5 Foul-mouthed, abusive, scurrilous.<BR>—6 Mocking, ridiculing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखरः|मुखर
मुखर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A crow.<BR>—2 A leader, the chief or principal person; यदि कार्यविपत्तिः स्यान्मुखरस्तत्र<BR> हन्यते H. 1. 27.<BR>—3 A conch-shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखरी
मुखर + .{@-री@} The bit of a bridle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखरता
मुखरता Talkativeness, noisiness; स्तुवञ्जिह्रेमि त्वां न खलु ननु<BR> धृष्टा मुखरता Śivamahimna 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखरयति
मुखरयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To make resonant or noisy, cause to sound or echo.<BR>—2 To make (one) talk or speak; अत एव शुश्रूषा मां मुखरयति Mu. 3.<BR>—3 To notify, declare, announce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखरिका
मुखरिका<BR>—1 The bit of a bridle.<BR>—2 Conversation; सुललितमुखरिकामृतेनाप्यायमानः Bhāg. 5. 25. 7<BR> (v. l. मुखरिता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखरित
मुखरित <i>a.</i> Made noisy or resonant with, ringing or noisy with;<BR> गण्डोड्डीनालिमालामुखरितककुभस्ताण्डवे शूलपाणेः Māl. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखरीकृ
मुखरीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To make resonant or noisy with.<BR>—2 To cause to resound.<BR>—3 To cause to speak or talk; इदानीं विज्ञापनायां मुखरीकरोति Mu. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुखीय
मुखीय <i>a.</i> Being at the top or head, being foremost or in the front.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुख्य|मुख्यः
मुख्य <i>a.</i> [मुखे आदौ भवः यत्]<BR>—1 Relating to the mouth or the face; अथ ह य एवायं मुख्यः प्राणः<BR> Ch. Up. 1. 2. 7; Ms. 5. 141.<BR>—2 Chief, principal, foremost, first, preeminent, prominent; चन्दनस्य<BR> च मुख्यस्य पादपैरुपशोभितम् Mb. 12. 169. 8; द्विजातिमुख्यः, वारमुख्या,<BR> योधमुख्याः &c.<BR>—3 Foremost, recited first; मुख्येन वा नियम्येत MS. 10. 5. 60 (where<BR> explaining मुख्य, शबर writes मुख्यत्वं नाम रथन्तरस्य प्रथमाधीतत्वम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुख्यः|मुख्य
मुख्य + .{@-ख्यः@} A leader, guide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुख्यम्
मुख्य + .{@-ख्यम्@}<BR>—1 A principal rite or ordinance.<BR>—2 Reading or teaching the Vedas.<BR>—3 The month reckoned from new moon to new moon.<BR>—4 The category called अपूर्व (in पूर्व-मीमांसा); मुख्यभेदे<BR> यथाधिकारं भावः स्यात् MS. 7. 1. 1 (where शबर explains मुख्य<BR> by अपूर्व).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मुख्यार्थः, मुख्योपायाः, मुख्यक्रमः, मुख्यचान्द्रः, मुख्यनृपः, मुख्यनृपतिः, मुख्यमन्त्रिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुख्यार्थः|मुख्यार्थ
मुख्य + -अर्थः the primary or original (as opp. गौण) meaning of a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुख्योपायाः
