मुख्यनृपतिः
मुख्य + -नृपः, -नृपतिः a sovereign monarch, paramount sovereign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

