मुख्यत्वम्
मुख्यता, -त्वम्<BR> Pre-eminence, first rank or position.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुख्यशः
मुख्यशः, मुख्यतः <i>ind.</i> Chiefly, principally, above all.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुख्यतः
