मुग्धालोक
मुग्ध + -आलोक <i>a.</i> lovely to look at; दशनमुकुलैर्मुग्धालोकं शिशुर्दधती<BR> मुखम् U. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुग्धदृश्
मुग्ध + -दृश् <i>a.</i> fair-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुग्धधी
मुग्ध + -धी, -बुद्धि, -मति <i>a.</i> silly, foolish, stupid, simple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुग्धबुद्धि
मुग्ध + -धी, -बुद्धि, -मति <i>a.</i> silly, foolish, stupid, simple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुग्धमति
मुग्ध + -धी, -बुद्धि, -मति <i>a.</i> silly, foolish, stupid, simple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1275-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुग्धबोधम्
