मुचिर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A deity.<BR>—2 Virtue.<BR>—3 Wind, air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुचिलिन्दः|मुचिलिन्द|मुचिलिंद|मुचिलिंदः
