मुज्, मुञ्ज् €1 P., €10 U. (मोजति, मुञ्जति, मोजयति-ते, मुञ्जयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cleanse, purify.<BR>—2 To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जः|मुञ्ज|मुंज|मुंजः
मुञ्जः —1 A sort of rush or grass (of which the girdle of a Brāhmaṇa<BR> should be made); Ms. 2. 43; मुञ्जाटव्यां भ्रष्टमार्गं क्रन्दमानं स्वगोधनम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 19. 5; मुञ्जद्वयं तु मधुरं तुवरं शिशिरं तथा । दाहतृष्णाविसर्पास्रमूत्रवस्त्यक्षिरोगजित् ।<BR> दोषत्रयहरं वृष्यं मेखलासूपयुज्यते ॥ Bhāva P.<BR>—2 The sacred cord or girdle itself.<BR>—3 N. of a king of Dhārā (said to be the uncle of the celebrated Bhoja).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मुञ्जकेशः, मुञ्जकेशिन्, मुञ्जबन्धनम्, मुञ्जमेखलिन्, मुञ्जवासस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जकेशः|मुञ्जकेश|मुंजकेश
मुञ्जः + -केशः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जकेशिन्|मुंजकेशिन्
मुञ्जः + -केशिन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जबन्धनम्
मुञ्जः + -बन्धनम् investiture with the sacred thread (or girdle).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जमेखलिन्
मुञ्जः + -मेखलिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जवासस्|मुंजवासस्
मुञ्जः + -वासस् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जवत्|मुञ्जवन्त्
मुञ्जवत् <i>a.</i> Overgrown with rushes, rushy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जाटः|मुञ्जाट
मुञ्जाटः, -टकः<BR> A kind of plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जाटकः|मुञ्जाटक
मुञ्जाटः, -टकः<BR> A kind of plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुञ्जरम्
मुञ्जरम् The fibrous root of the lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुट्
मुट् €1 P., €10 U. (मोटति, मोटयति-ते)<BR>—1 To crush, break, grind, powder.<BR>—2 To kill; अद्यापि ते हृदयगतं त्वां च सममेव मोटयामि Mk. 8.<BR>—3 To blame, rebuke (in this sense €6 P. also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्
मुण् €6 P. (मुणति) To promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्ट्|मुंट्
मुण्ट् €1 P. (मुण्टति) To crush, grind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्ठ्|मुंठ्
मुण्ठ् €1 Ā. (मुण्ठते) To run away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्ड्|मुंड्
मुण्ड् I. €1 P. (मुण्डति)<BR>—1 To shave, shear; श्रावक मुण्डितमुण्डो नक्षत्राणि पृच्छसि Mu. 5; Mk. 8. 3, 11.<BR>—2 To crush, grind. ━II. €1 Ā. (मुण्डते) To sink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्ड|मुंड|मुण्डं|मुण्डः
मुण्ड <i>a.</i> [मुण्ड्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Shaved, bald; रावणश्च मया दृष्टो मुण्डस्तैलसमुक्षितः Rām. 5. 27. 19;<BR> चरन् भैक्ष्यं मुनिर्मुण्डः Mb. 12. 9. 12.<BR>—2 Lopped, stripped of top leaves.<BR>—3 Blunt, pointless.<BR>—4 Ved. Hornless. —5 Low, mean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डः|मुण्ड|मुंड|मुण्डं
मुण्ड + .{@-ण्डः@}<BR>—1 A man with a shaved or bald head; स्वप्नेऽवगाहतेऽत्यर्थं जलं मुण्डांश्च<BR> पश्यति Y. 1. 272.<BR>—2 A bald or shaven head.<BR>—3 The forehead.<BR>—4 A barber.<BR>—5 The trunk of a tree stripped of its top-branches; मुण्डतालवनानीव<BR> चकार स रथव्रजान् Mb. 6. 106. 14.<BR>—6 An epithet of Rāhu.<BR>—7 N. of one of the twelve principal Upaniṣads; मुण्डमाण्डूक्यतित्तिरिः.<BR>━<i>m.</i> pl. N. of a people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डा|मुंडा
मुण्ड + .{@-ण्डा@}<BR>—1 N. of a plant (मुण्डीरिका).<BR>—2 Bengal madder.<BR>—3 A female mendicant of a particular order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डम्
मुण्ड + .{@-ण्डम्@}<BR>—1 The head; अङ्गं गलितं पलितं मुण्डम् Śaṅkara.<BR>—2 Myrrh.<BR>—3 Iron.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मुण्डायसम्, मुण्डासनम्, मुण्डचणकः, मुण्डजम्, मुण्डफलः, मुण्डमण्डली, मुण्डलोहम्, मुण्डशालिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डायसम्
मुण्ड + -अयसम् iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डासनम्
मुण्ड + -आसनम् a particular posture in sitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डचणकः|मुण्डचणक
मुण्ड + -चणकः a kind of pulse (कलाय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डजम्
मुण्ड + -जम् steel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डफलः|मुण्डफल|मुंडफल
मुण्ड + -फलः a cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डमण्डली
मुण्ड + -मण्डली<BR>—1 a number of shaven heads.<BR>—2 a number of troops of an inferior kind, a mere crowd or mob; वरमल्पबलं<BR> सारं न कुर्यान्मुण्डमण्डलीम् H. 3. 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डलोहम्
मुण्ड + -लोहम् iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डशालिः|मुण्डशालि|मुंडशालि
मुण्ड + -शालिः a kind of rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1276-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डकः|मुण्डक|मुंडक|मुण्डकं|मुंडकः
मुण्डकः [मुण्ड्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A barber.<BR>—2 The trunk of a tree stripped of its top-branches, a pollard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डकम्
मुण्डकः + .{@-कम्@} The head.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मुण्डकोपनिषद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डकोपनिषद्|मुंडकोपनिषद्
मुण्डकः + -उपनिषद् <i>f.</i> N. of an Upaniṣad of the Atharvaveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डनम्
मुण्डनम् [मुण्ड्-ल्युट्] Shaving the head, tonsure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1277-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुण्डयति
