मुसलामुसलि <i>ind.</i> Club against club; P. V. 4. 127 com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसलिन्
मुसलिन् <i>m.</i> [मुसल-इनि]<BR>—1 An epithet of Balarāma.<BR>—2 Of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसली
मुसली<BR>—1 Salvinia Cucullata (Mar. उंदीरकानी ?).<BR>—2 A house-lizard.<BR>—3 An alligator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुसलीका
मुसलीका A common lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

