मुहुकम्
मुहुकम् Ved. A moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहुस्
मुहुस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Often, constantly, repeatedly, frequently; ग्रीवाभङ्गाभिरामं मुहुरनुपतति<BR> स्यन्दने दत्तदृष्टिः Ś. 1. 7, 2. 6; generally repeated in this sense;<BR> मुहुर्मुहुः over and over again, often and often; अवेक्षमाणं महतीं<BR> मुहुर्मुहुः Śi. 1. 10; गुरूणां सन्निधानेऽपि कः कूजति मुहुर्मुहुः.<BR>—2 For a time or moment, awhile; अस्रैस्तावन्मुहुरुपचितैर्दृष्टिरालुप्यते<BR> मे Me. 107; generally used with successive clauses in the sense of ‘now now’<BR>, ‘at one time-at another time’; मुहुरुत्पतते बाला मुहुः पतति<BR> विह्वला । मुहुरालीयते भीता मुहुः क्रोशति रोदिति ॥ Subhāṣ.; Mu. 5. 3;<BR> मुहुर्मुहुः ‘again and again, repeatedly’.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मुहुश्चारिन्, मुहुष्प्रोक्त, मुहुर्भाषा, मुहुर्वचस्, मुहुर्भुज्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहुश्चारिन्
मुहुस् + -चारिन् <i>a.</i> recurring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहुष्प्रोक्त
मुहुस् + -प्रोक्त <i>a.</i> Often told.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहुर्भाषा
मुहुस् + -भाषा, -वचस् <i>n.</i> repetition, tautology.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहुर्वचस्
मुहुस् + -भाषा, -वचस् <i>n.</i> repetition, tautology.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहुर्भुज्
मुहुस् + -भुज् <i>m.</i> a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहूर्तः|मुहूर्त|मुहूर्तं|मुहूर्त्त|मुहूर्त्तः
मुहूर्तः, -र्तम्<BR> [हुर्छ्-क्त धातोः पूर्वं मुट् च Tv.]<BR>—1 A moment, any short portion of time, an instant; नवाम्बुदानीकमुहूर्तलाञ्छने<BR> R. 3. 53; संध्याभ्ररेखेव मुहूर्तरागाः Pt. 1. 194; Me. 19; Ku. 7. 50.<BR>—2 A period, time (auspicious or otherwise).<BR>—3 A period of 48 minutes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहूर्तम्
मुहूर्तः, -र्तम्<BR> [हुर्छ्-क्त धातोः पूर्वं मुट् च Tv.]<BR>—1 A moment, any short portion of time, an instant; नवाम्बुदानीकमुहूर्तलाञ्छने<BR> R. 3. 53; संध्याभ्ररेखेव मुहूर्तरागाः Pt. 1. 194; Me. 19; Ku. 7. 50.<BR>—2 A period, time (auspicious or otherwise).<BR>—3 A period of 48 minutes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहूर्तः|मुहूर्त|मुहूर्तं|मुहूर्त्त|मुहूर्त्तः
मुहूर्तः, -र्तम् + .{@-र्तः@} An astrologer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहूर्तकः|मुहूर्तक
मुहूर्तकः<BR>—1 An instant, a moment.<BR>—2 A period of 48 minutes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1280-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मुहेरः|मुहेर
