मूर्खभ्रातृक|मूर्खभ्रातृकः
मूर्ख + -भ्रातृक <i>a.</i> one who has a foolish brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1281-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्खमण्डलम्
मूर्ख + -मण्डलम् an assembly of fools.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1281-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मूर्खशतम्
