मृगी
मृगी<BR>—1 A female deer, doe.<BR>—2 Epilepsy.<BR>—3 N. of a particular class of women.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मृगीदृश्, मृगीपतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1285-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

