मृड्
मृड् €6. €9 P. (मृडति, मृड्नाति)<BR>—1 To be gracious, be pleased.<BR>—2 To forgive, pardon.<BR>—3 To delight, gladden; इन्द्रारिव्याकुलं लोकं मृडयन्ति युगे युगे<BR> Bhāg. 1. 3. 28.<BR>—4 To be delighted or happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1285-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृडः|मृड
मृडः An epithet of Śiva; जनसुखकृते सत्त्वोद्रिक्तौ मृडाय नमो<BR> नमः Śivamahimna 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1285-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृडनम्
मृडनम् Favouring, showing grace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1285-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

