मृणालः, -लम्<BR> [मृण-कालन्] The fibrous root of a lotus, a lotus-fibre;<BR> भङ्गेऽपि हि मृणालानामनुबध्नन्ति तन्तवः H. 1. 91; सूत्रं मृणालादिव<BR> राजहंसी V. 1. 19; Ṛs. 1. 19; V. 3. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1285-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृणालम्
मृणालः, -लम् + .{@-लम्@} The root of a fragrant grass (वीरणमूल).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मृणालकण्ठः, मृणालभङ्गः, मृणालसूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1285-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृणालकण्ठः|मृणालकण्ठ
मृणालः + -कण्ठः a particular aquatic bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1285-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृणालभङ्गः|मृणालभङ्ग|मृणालभंग
मृणालः + -भङ्गः a bit of a lotus-fibre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1285-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृणालसूत्रम्
