मृत्स्नः, -मृत्स्नम्<BR> Powder, dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1286-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृत्स्नम्
मृत्स्नः, -मृत्स्नम्<BR> Powder, dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1286-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृद्
मृद् €9 P. (मृद्नाति, मृदित)<BR>—1 To squeeze, press, rub; मम च मृदितं क्षौमं बाल्ये त्वदङ्गविवर्तनैः Ve. 5. 40.<BR>—2 To trample or tread upon; crush, dash to pieces, kill, destroy, pound,<BR> bruise, pulverize; तानमर्दीदखादीच्च Bk. 15. 35; बलान्यमृद्नान्नलिनाभवक्त्रः R. 18. 5.<BR>—3 To rub, stroke, rub against, touch; अस्मिन्नसौ मृदितपक्ष्मलरल्लकाङ्गः Śi. 4. 61.<BR>—4 To overcome, surpass.<BR>—5 To wipe away, rub off, remove.<BR>—6 (In astr.) To pass through (as a constellation). ━<i>Caus.</i> (मर्दयति)<BR> = मृद् q. v. above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1286-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मृदित|मृदितः
मृदित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Pressed, squeezed; सुरतमृदिता बालवनिता Bh. 2. 44.<BR>—2 Crushed, pounded, ground down,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1287-1" target="_blank">Page1287-1</a>]<BR> trampled upon, killed.<BR>—3 Rubbed off, removed. (See मृद्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1286-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

