मृध् <i>f.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Battle, fight; भक्तिमान् स्वामिनि मृधे शक्तिमानतिकोपनः Śiva B. 22. 13.<BR>—2 An enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1287-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

