मेदुरित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Thickened, made dense; मेघमेदुरितनीलिमा गिरिः U. 1.<BR>—2 Unctuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1289-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेद्य
मेद्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Fat.<BR>—2 Dense, thick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेद्रम्
मेद्रम् = मेढ्रम् q. v.; नाभ्यधश्च भवेन्मेद्रम् Śukra. 4. 414.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेध्
मेध् €1 U. See मेथ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधः|मेध
मेधः<BR>—1 A sacrifice, as in नरमेध, अश्वमेध; एकविंशतिमेधान्ते Mb. 14. 29. 18<BR> (com. मेधो युद्धयज्ञः । ‘यज्ञो वै मेधः’ इति श्रुतेः ।).<BR>—2 A sacrificial animal or victim.<BR>—3 An offering, oblation.<BR>—4 Ved. The juice of meat, broth.<BR>—5 Ved. Sap, pith, essence.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मेधजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधजः|मेधज
मेधः + -जः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधा
मेधा [मेध्-अञ्] (changed to मेधस् in Bah. comp. when preceded<BR> by सु, दुस् and the negative particle अ)<BR>—1 Retentive faculty, retentiveness (of memory); धीर्धारणावती मेधा Ak.<BR>—2 Intellect, intelligence in general; यत् सप्तान्नानि मेधया तपसाजनयत्<BR> पिता Bṛ. Up. 1. 5. 1; Bg. 10. 34; आयुष्मन्तं सुतं सूते यशोमेधासमन्वितम्<BR> Ms. 3. 263; Y. 3. 173.<BR>—3 A form of Sarasvatī.<BR>—4 A sacrifice.<BR>—5 Strength, power (Ved.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मेधातिथिः, मेधाजननम्, मेधाजित्, मेधारुद्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधातिथिः|मेधातिथि
मेधा + -अतिथिः N. of a learned commentator on Manusmṛti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधाजननम्
मेधा + -जननम् N. of a rite for producing mental and bodily strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधाजित्
मेधा + -जित् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kātyāyana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधारुद्रः|मेधारुद्र
मेधा + -रुद्रः an epithet of Kālidāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधावत्|मेधावन्त्
मेधावत् <i>a.</i> Wise, intelligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधाविन्
मेधाविन् <i>a.</i> [मेधा-विनि]<BR>—1 Very intelligent, having a good memory.<BR>—2 Intelligent, wise, endowed with intellect; मेधाविनो नीतिगुणप्रयुक्तां<BR> पुरः स्फुरन्तीमिव दर्शयन्ति Pt. 1. 61; मेधावी छिन्नसंशयः Bg. 18. 10.<BR>━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A learned man, sage, scholar.<BR>—2 A parrot.<BR>—3 An intoxicating drink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधाविनी
मेधाविन् + .{@-नी@} An epithet of the wife of Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधि|मेधिः
मेधि See मेथि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेधिर|मेधिरः
मेधिर <i>a.</i> Intelligent, wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेध्य|मेध्यं|मेध्यः
मेध्य <i>a.</i> [मेघ्-ण्यत्, मेधाय हितं यत् वा]<BR>—1 Fit for a sacrifice; अजाश्वयोर्मुखं मेध्यम् Y. 1. 194; Ms. 5. 54.<BR>—2 Relating to a sacrifice, sacrificial; मेध्येनाश्वेनेजे; R. 13. 3;<BR> उषा वा अश्वस्य मेध्यस्य शिरः Bṛ. Up. 1. 1. 1.<BR>—3 Pure, sacred, holy; भुवं कोष्णेन कुण्डोघ्नी मेध्येनावमृथादपि R. 1. 84, 3. 31, 14. 81.<BR>—4 Ved. Fresh, strong, vigorous.<BR>—5 Wise, intelligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेध्यः|मेध्य|मेध्यं
मेध्य + .{@-ध्यः@}<BR>—1 A goat.<BR>—2 A Khadira tree.<BR>—3 Barley (according to Med.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेध्या
मेध्य + .{@-ध्या@}<BR>—1 N. of several plants (केतकी, शङ्खपुष्पी, रोचना, शमी &c.).<BR>—2 The gall-stone of a cow (रोचना).<BR>—3 A particular vein.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेनका
मेनका<BR>—1 N. of an <i>Apsaras</i> (mother of Śakuntalā).<BR>—2 N. of the wife of Himālaya.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मेनकात्मजा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेनकात्मजा
मेनका + -आत्मजा N. of Pārvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेना
मेना<BR>—1 N. of the wife of Himālaya; मेनां मुनीनामपि माननीयाम् (उपयेमे)<BR> Ku. 1. 18, 5. 5.<BR>—2 N. of a river.<BR>—3 speech (वाच्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेनादः|मेनाद
मेनादः<BR>—1 A peacock.<BR>—2 A cat.<BR>—3 A goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेन्धिका|मेंधिका
मेन्धिका, -मेन्धी<BR> N. of a plant (Mar. मेंदी) (from the leaves of which<BR> a reddish dye is extracted, wherewith to colour the tips and nails of<BR> fingers, the soles of the feet, and the palms of the hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेन्धी|मेंधी
मेन्धिका, -मेन्धी<BR> N. of a plant (Mar. मेंदी) (from the leaves of which<BR> a reddish dye is extracted, wherewith to colour the tips and nails of<BR> fingers, the soles of the feet, and the palms of the hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेप्
मेप् €1 Ā. (मेपते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेय
मेय <i>a.</i> [मा-मि-वा यत्]<BR>—1 Measured.<BR>—2 Capable of being estimated; तथा धरिममेयानां शतादभ्यधिके वधः Ms. 8. 321.<BR>—3 Discernible, capable of being known (ज्ञेय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेरकः|मेरक
मेरकः<BR>—1 A seat covered with bark.<BR>—2 N. of an enemy of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेरुः|मेरु
मेरुः<BR>—1 N. of a fabulous mountain (round which all the planets are said to<BR> revolve and which forms the centre of the several Dvīpas; cf. द्वीप;<BR> it is also said to consist of gold and gems); विभज्य मेरुर्न यदर्थिसात्<BR> कृतः N. 1. 16; स्वात्मन्येव समाप्तहेममहिमा मेरुर्न मे रोचते Bh. 3. 150.<BR>—2 The central bead in a rosary.<BR>—3 The central gem of a necklace.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मेर्वद्रिकर्णिका, मेरुधामन्, मेरुपृष्ठम्, मेरुमन्दरः, मेरुयन्त्रम्, मेरुसावर्णः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेर्वद्रिकर्णिका
मेरुः + -अद्रिकर्णिका the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेरुधामन्
मेरुः + -धामन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेरुपृष्ठम्
मेरुः + -पृष्ठम् heaven, the sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेरुमन्दरः|मेरुमन्दर
मेरुः + -मन्दरः N. of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेरुयन्त्रम्
मेरुः + -यन्त्रम् a figure shaped like a spindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेरुसावर्णः|मेरुसावर्ण
मेरुः + -सावर्णः N. of one of the fourteen Manus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेरुकः|मेरुक
मेरुकः Incense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेलः|मेल
मेलः [मिल्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Meeting, union, intercourse.<BR>—2 A fair.<BR>—3 A company, an assembly.<BR>—4 Conjunction (of planets). (Also मेलक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेलनम्
मेलनम् [मिल्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Union, junction.<BR>—2 Association.<BR>—3 Mixture.<BR>—4 An encounter; a fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेला
मेला [मिल्-णिच् अच् टाप्]<BR>—1 Union, intercourse.<BR>—2 A company, assembly, a society.<BR>—3 Antimony.<BR>—4 The indigo plant.<BR>—5 Ink.<BR>—6 A musical scale.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मेलान्धुकः, मेलानन्दः, मेलानन्दा, मेलामन्दा, मेलाम्बु<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेलान्धुकः|मेलान्धुक|मेलांधुक
मेला + -अन्धुकः, -नन्दः, -नन्दा, -मन्दा an ink-stand, ink-bottle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेलानन्दः|मेलानन्द|मेलानंद
मेला + -अन्धुकः, -नन्दः, -नन्दा, -मन्दा an ink-stand, ink-bottle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेलानन्दा|मेलानंदा
मेला + -अन्धुकः, -नन्दः, -नन्दा, -मन्दा an ink-stand, ink-bottle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेलामन्दा|मेलामंदा
मेला + -अन्धुकः, -नन्दः, -नन्दा, -मन्दा an ink-stand, ink-bottle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेलाम्बु|मेलांबु|मेलाम्बुः
मेला + -अम्बु ink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेलापकः|मेलापक
मेलापकः<BR>—1 Uniting, bringing together, collecting.<BR>—2 Conjunction of planets.<BR>—3 A crowd, assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेलायनम्
मेलायनम् Combination, junction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेव्
मेव् €1 Ā. (मेवते) To worship, serve, attend upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेव
मेव <i>a.</i> Much (पुष्कल); सर्वं मे त्वं ब्रूहि मेवं यथावत् Mb. 6. 20. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषः|मेष
मेषः<BR>—1 A ram, sheep.<BR>—2 The sign <i>Aries</i> of the zodiac.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मेषाण्डः, मेषकम्बलः, मेषकुसुमः, मेषलोचनः, मेषपालः, मेषपालकः, मेषमांसम्, मेषयूथम्, मेषशृङ्गः, मेषशृङ्गी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषाण्डः|मेषाण्ड|मेषांड
मेषः + -अण्डः an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषकम्बलः|मेषकम्बल|मेषकंबल
मेषः + -कम्बलः a woollen blanket or rug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

