मेषः + -कुसुमः, -लोचनः Cassia Thora (Mar. टाकळा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषपालः|मेषपाल
मेषः + -पालः, -पालकः a shepherd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषपालकः|मेषपालक
मेषः + -पालः, -पालकः a shepherd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषमांसम्
मेषः + -मांसम् mutton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषयूथम्
मेषः + -यूथम् a flock of sheep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषशृङ्गः|मेषशृङ्ग
मेषः + -शृङ्गः a species of tree; Mb. 14. 43. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषशृङ्गी
मेषः + -शृङ्गी Odina Pinnata (Mar. मेढशिंगी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषा
मेषा Small cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1290-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषायते
मेषायते Den. Ā. To act like a ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषिका
मेषिका, -मेषी<BR> A ewe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषी
मेषिका, -मेषी<BR> A ewe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेषूरणम्
मेषूरणम् N. of the 10th astrological house. [A Greek word]; Bṛ. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेहः|मेह
मेहः [मिह्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Making water, passing urine.<BR>—2 Urine.<BR>—3 A urinary disease; diabetes.<BR>—4 A ram.<BR>—5 A Goat.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मेहघ्नी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेहघ्नी
मेहः + -घ्नी turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मेहनम्
मेहनम् [मिह्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Passing urine; एवं धाष्टर्पान्युशति कुरुते मेहनादीनि वास्तौ Bhāg. 10. 8. 31.<BR>—2 Urine.<BR>—3 The penis; प्रलम्बोदरमेहनाः Mb. 9. 45. 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्र|मैत्रं|मैत्रः
मैत्र <i>a.</i> (-त्री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [मित्र-अण्]<BR>—1 Belonging to a friend.<BR>—2 Given by a friend.<BR>—3 Friendly, well-disposed, amicable, kind; कुर्यादन्यन्न वा कुर्यान्मैत्रो<BR> ब्राह्मण उच्यते Ms. 2. 87; अद्वेष्टा सर्वभूतानां मैत्रः करुण एव<BR> च Bg. 12. 13.<BR>—4 Relating to the god Mitra (as a Muhūrta); Ku. 7. 6 (com. ‘आर्द्रः सार्द्रस्तथा मैत्रः शुभो वासव एव च’ इति वृहस्पतिस्मरणात्);<BR> मैत्रे मुहूर्ते प्रययौ प्रयागवनमुत्तमम् Rām. 2. 89. 21 (com. उदयात् तृतीयमुहूर्ते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रः|मैत्र|मैत्रं
मैत्र + .{@-त्रः@}<BR>—1 A high or perfect Brāhmaṇa; परिनिष्ठितकार्यस्तु स्वाध्यायेनैव ब्राह्मणः ।<BR> कुर्यादन्यत्र वा कुर्यान्मैत्रो ब्राह्मण उच्यते ॥ Mb. 12. 60. 12.<BR>—2 N. of a particular mixed tribe; Ms. 10. 23.<BR>—3 The anus; Ms. 12. 72 (com.).<BR>—4 A friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्री
मैत्र + .{@-त्री@}<BR>—1 Friendship, good will.<BR>—2 Intimate connection or association, union, contact; प्रत्यूषेषु स्फुटितकमलामोदमैत्रीकषायः Me. 31.<BR>—3 The lunar mansion called अनुराधा; तीर्थयात्रां हलधरः … … मैत्रनक्षत्रयोगे<BR> स्म Mb. 9. 35. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रम्
मैत्र + .{@-त्रम्@}<BR>—1 Friendship.<BR>—2 Voiding or evacuation of excrement; मैत्रं प्रसाधनं स्नानम् (पूर्वाह<BR> एव कुर्वीत) Ms. 4. 152.<BR>—3 A prayer addressed to Mitra; अजातशत्रुः कृतमैत्रो हुताग्निः Bhāg. 1. 13. 30.<BR>—4 The lunar mansion अनुराधा (मैत्रभम् in the same sense).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मैत्रचित्तम्, मैत्रनक्षत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रचित्तम्
मैत्र + -चित्तम् benevolence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रनक्षत्रम्
मैत्र + -नक्षत्रम् the अनुराधा constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रकम्
मैत्रकम् Friendship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रायणम्
मैत्रायणम् Benevolence; समः सर्वेषु भूतेषु मैत्रायणगतिश्चरेत्<BR> Mb. 12. 160. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रायणाः
मैत्रायणम् + .({@-णाः@} <i>m.</i> pl.) N. of a Vedic school; also मैत्रायणी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रावरुणः|मैत्रावरुण
मैत्रावरुणः<BR>—1 An epithet of Vālmīki.<BR>—2 Of Agastya.<BR>—3 N. of one of the officiating priests at a sacrifice.<BR>—4 N. of Vasiṣṭha; त्वां मैत्रावरुणोऽभिनन्दतु गुरुर्यस्ते गुरूणामपि U. 5. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रावरुणिः|मैत्रावरुणि
मैत्रावरुणिः<BR>—1 An epithet of Agastya; यान् मैत्रावरुणिः प्रशास्ति भगवानाम्नायपूते<BR> विधौ Mv. 1. 25.<BR>—2 Of Vasiṣṭha.<BR>—3 Of Vālmīki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रिन्
मैत्रिन् <i>a.</i> Friendly, kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रेय|मैत्रेयः
मैत्रेय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to a friend, friendly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रेयः|मैत्रेय
मैत्रेय + .{@-यः@} N. of a mixed tribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रेयकः|मैत्रेयक
मैत्रेयकः N. of a mixed tribe; मैत्रेयकं तु वैदेहो माधूकं संप्रसूयते Ms. 10. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रेयिका
मैत्रेयिका A contest between friends or allies (मित्रयुद्धम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्रेयी
मैत्रेयी N. of the wife of याज्ञवल्क्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैत्र्यम्
मैत्र्यम् Friendship, alliance; आहुः साप्तपदं मैत्र्यं जनाः शास्त्रविचक्षणाः Pt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथिलः|मैथिल
मैथिलः [मिथिलायां भवः अण्] A king of Mithilā; उत्पन्ना मैथिलकुले<BR> जनकस्य महात्मनः Rām. 7. 17. 37; R. 11. 32, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथिलाः
मैथिलः + .{@-लाः@} (pl.) The people of Mithilā q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथिली
मैथिलः + .{@-ली@} N. of Sītā; स जहार तयोर्मध्ये मैथिलीं लोकशोषणः R. 12. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुन|मैथुनं
मैथुन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [मिथुनेन निर्वृत्तम् अण्]<BR>—1 Paired, coupled; गन्धर्वस्तादृशीरस्य मैथुन्यश्च सितासिताः Bhāg. 4. 27. 14.<BR>—2 United by marriage.<BR>—3 Relating to copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुनम्
मैथुन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Copulation, sexual union; मृतं मैथुनमप्रजम् Pt. 2. 98.<BR>—2 Marriage.<BR>—3 Union, connection.<BR>—4 Consecrating the fire (अग्न्याधान).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मैथुनगत, मैथुनगमनम्, मैथुनज्वरः, मैथुनधर्मिन्, मैथुनवैराग्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुनगत
मैथुन + -गत <i>a.</i> engaged in copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुनगमनम्
मैथुन + -गमनम् sexual intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुनज्वरः|मैथुनज्वर
मैथुन + -ज्वरः the excitement of sexual passion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुनधर्मिन्
मैथुन + -धर्मिन् <i>a.</i> copulating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुनवैराग्यम्
मैथुन + -वैराग्यम् abstinence from sexual intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुनिका
मैथुनिका Union by marriage, matrimonial alliance; P. IV. 3. 125.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुनिन्
मैथुनिन् <i>a.</i> Copulating, sexually united. ━<i>m.</i> One who has had<BR> sexual union with a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुनीभावः|मैथुनीभाव
मैथुनीभावः Copulation, sexual union; नारीषु मैथुनीभावं नाकामास्वभ्यरोचयत्<BR> Rām. 7. 26. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैथुन्य
मैथुन्य <i>a.</i> Relating to copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैधावकम्
मैधावकम् Wisdom, intelligence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैनवी
मैनवी (In music) A kind of gait or movement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैनाकः|मैनाक
मैनाकः [मेनकायां भवः अण्] N. of a mountain, son of Himālaya<BR> and Menā, who alone retained his wings (when Indra clipped those of other<BR> mountains) on account of his friendship with the ocean; cf. Ku. 1. 20;<BR> चिरं जलनिधौ मग्नो मैनाक इव मार्दवम् Bv.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मैनाकस्वसृ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैनाकस्वसृ
मैनाकः + -स्वसृ <i>f.</i> epithet of Pārvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैनालः|मैनाल
मैनालः, -मैनिकः<BR> A fisherman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैनिकः|मैनिक
मैनालः, -मैनिकः<BR> A fisherman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैन्दः|मैन्द|मैंद|मैंदः
मैन्दः N. of a demon killed by Kṛṣṇa.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मैन्दहन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैन्दहन्|मैंदहन्
मैन्दः + -हन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैरेयः|मैरेय|मैरेयं
मैरेयः, -यम्, मैरेयकः, -कम्<BR> A kind of intoxicating drink (a combination<BR> of सुरा and आसव); अधिरजनि वधूभिः पीतमैरेयरिक्तम् Śi. 11. 51;<BR> G. L. 34; पीत्वा च मधुमैरेयम् Bhāg. 6. 1. 59; मैरेयं<BR> सरसिजीमुखाम्बुजस्थं चक्राह्वाः सह गृहिणीभिरापिबन्ति Rām. Ch. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैरेयम्
मैरेयः, -यम्, मैरेयकः, -कम्<BR> A kind of intoxicating drink (a combination<BR> of सुरा and आसव); अधिरजनि वधूभिः पीतमैरेयरिक्तम् Śi. 11. 51;<BR> G. L. 34; पीत्वा च मधुमैरेयम् Bhāg. 6. 1. 59; मैरेयं<BR> सरसिजीमुखाम्बुजस्थं चक्राह्वाः सह गृहिणीभिरापिबन्ति Rām. Ch. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैरेयकः|मैरेयक|मैरेयकं
मैरेयः, -यम्, मैरेयकः, -कम्<BR> A kind of intoxicating drink (a combination<BR> of सुरा and आसव); अधिरजनि वधूभिः पीतमैरेयरिक्तम् Śi. 11. 51;<BR> G. L. 34; पीत्वा च मधुमैरेयम् Bhāg. 6. 1. 59; मैरेयं<BR> सरसिजीमुखाम्बुजस्थं चक्राह्वाः सह गृहिणीभिरापिबन्ति Rām. Ch. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैरेयकम्
मैरेयः, -यम्, मैरेयकः, -कम्<BR> A kind of intoxicating drink (a combination<BR> of सुरा and आसव); अधिरजनि वधूभिः पीतमैरेयरिक्तम् Śi. 11. 51;<BR> G. L. 34; पीत्वा च मधुमैरेयम् Bhāg. 6. 1. 59; मैरेयं<BR> सरसिजीमुखाम्बुजस्थं चक्राह्वाः सह गृहिणीभिरापिबन्ति Rām. Ch. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैलिन्दः|मैलिन्द|मैलिंद|मैलिंदः
मैलिन्दः A bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1291-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मैलेयकः|मैलेयक
मैलेयकः A variety of inferior gems; Kau. A. 2. 11. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोकम्
मोकम्<BR>—1 The cast-off skin of an animal; कदलीमृगमोकानि Mb. 2. 49. 19.<BR>—2 A quadruped.<BR>—3 A pupil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्तव्य
मोक्तव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be set free, liberated.<BR>—2 To be renounced or resigned.<BR>—3 To be hurled or thrown upon or against.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्ष्
मोक्ष् €1 P., €10 U. (मोक्षति, मोक्षयति-ते)<BR>—1 To release, set free, liberate, emancipate.<BR>—2 To loose, untie, undo.<BR>—3 To wrest away.<BR>—4 To cast, hurl, fling.<BR>—5 To shed.<BR>—6 To detach, extract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षः|मोक्ष
मोक्षः [मोक्ष्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Liberation, release, escape, freedom; साऽधुना तव बन्धे मोक्षे च<BR> प्रभवति K.; Me. 63; लब्धमोक्षाः शुकादयः R. 17. 20; धुर्याणां<BR> च धुरो मोक्षम् 17. 19.<BR>—2 Rescue, deliverance, delivery; ते यतध्वं परं शक्त्या सर्वे मोक्षाय<BR> पार्थिवाः Mb. 5. 173. 15.<BR>—3 Final emancipation, deliverance of the soul from recurring births or<BR> transmigration, the last of the four ends of human existence; see अर्थ;<BR> धर्मार्थकाममोक्षाणां यस्यैकोऽपि न विद्यते । अजागलस्तनस्येव तस्य जन्म<BR> निरर्थकम् ॥; Bg. 5. 28, 18. 30; Ms. 6. 35; R. 10. 84.<BR>—4 Death.<BR>—5 Falling down, dropping down, falling off; वनस्थलीर्मर्मरपत्रमोक्षाः Ku. 3. 31.<BR>—6 Loosening, untying, unbinding; वेणिमोक्षोत्सुकानि Me. 101; मदकलयुवतीनां<BR> नीविमोक्षस्तु मोक्षः<BR>—7 Shedding, causing to fall down or flow; बाष्पमोक्ष, अश्रुमोक्ष.<BR>—8 Shooting, casting, discharging; बाणमोक्षः Ś. 3. 5.<BR>—9 Scattering, strewing.<BR>—10 Acquittance or discharge of an obligation (debt &c.).<BR>—11 (In astr.) The liberation of an eclipsed planet, the end of an eclipse.<BR>—12 N. of a tree (पाटलि).<BR>—13 Utterance (of a curse).<BR>—14 Settling (a question).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: मोक्षोपायः, मोक्षज्ञानम्, मोक्षदेवः, मोक्षद्वारम्, मोक्षपतिः, मोक्षपुरी, मोक्षभावः, मोक्षवार्त्तिक<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षोपायः|मोक्षोपाय
मोक्षः + -उपायः a means of obtaining final emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षज्ञानम्
मोक्षः + -ज्ञानम् knowledge of final emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षदेवः|मोक्षदेव
मोक्षः + -देवः an epithet applied to Hiouen Thsang, the celebrated Chinese traveller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षद्वारम्
मोक्षः + -द्वारम् the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षपतिः|मोक्षपति
मोक्षः + -पतिः (in music) a kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षपुरी
मोक्षः + -पुरी an epithet of the town called काञ्ची.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षभावः|मोक्षभाव
मोक्षः + -भावः liberation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षवार्त्तिक
मोक्षः + -वार्त्तिक <i>a.</i> reflecting upon final emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षक|मोक्षकः
मोक्षक <i>a.</i> [मोक्ष-ण्वुल्] Delivering, freeing, releasing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षकः|मोक्षक
मोक्षक + .{@-कः@} A liberator, saviour, deliverer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

मोक्षणम्
मोक्षणम् [मोक्ष्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Releasing, liberating, emancipating, setting at liberty; यावानवध्यस्य<BR> वधे तावान् वध्यस्य मोक्षणे Ms. 9. 249.<BR>—2 Releasing, deliverance.<BR>—3 Loosening, untying.<BR>—4 Giving up, abandoning, resigning.<BR>—5 Shedding.<BR>—6 Squandering.<BR>—7 Discharging, casting; शस्त्र˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1292-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

