यज्ञः + -रसः, -रेतस् <i>n.</i><BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">Page1299-1</a>]<BR> Soma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1298-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

