यज्ञः + -वल्लिः, -वल्ली <i>f.</i> the Soma plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

