यज्ञः + -वाटः a place prepared and enclosed for a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञवाह
