यज्ञः + -वेदिः, -वेदी <i>f.</i> the sacrificial altar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञशरणम्
यज्ञः + -शरणम् a sacrificial shed or hall, a temporary structure under<BR> which a sacrifice is performed; M. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

