यज्ञसंस्तरः|यज्ञसंस्तर
यज्ञः + -संस्तरः the act of setting up the sacrificial bricks; यज्ञसंस्तरविद्भिश्च Mb. 1. 70. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञसदस्
यज्ञः + -सदस् <i>n.</i> a number of people at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञसंभारः|यज्ञसम्भार
