यज्ञसारः|यज्ञसार
यज्ञः + -सारः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञसिद्धिः|यज्ञसिद्धि
यज्ञः + -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i> the completion of a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञसूत्रम्
यज्ञः + -सूत्रम् see यज्ञोपवीत; अन्यः कृष्णाजिनमदाद् यज्ञसूत्रं तथापरः<BR> Rām. 1. 4. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञसेनः|यज्ञसेन
