यज्ञस्थाणुः|यज्ञस्थाणु
यज्ञः + -स्थाणुः a sacrificial post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञहन्
यज्ञः + -हन् <i>m.</i>, {@-हनः@}<BR> epithets of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञहुत्
यज्ञः + -हुत् <i>m.</i> a sacrificial priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञायज्ञीयम्
