यज्ञिन्
यज्ञिन् <i>a.</i> Full of sacrifices. ━<i>m.</i> N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञिय|यज्ञियं|यज्ञियः
यज्ञिय <i>a.</i> [यज्ञाय हितः घ]<BR>—1 Belonging to or fit for a sacrifice, sacrificial; अथर्ववेदप्रवराः<BR> पूगयज्ञियसामगाः Mb. 1. 70. 40.<BR>—2 Sacred, holy, divine.<BR>—3 Adorable, worthy of worship.<BR>—4 Devout, pious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञियः|यज्ञिय|यज्ञियं
यज्ञिय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 A god, deity.<BR>—2 The third or Dvāpara age.<BR>—3 The Udumbara tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञियम्
यज्ञिय + .{@-यम्@} Implements or materials for sacrifice (यज्ञसामग्री);<BR> यज्ञियं च कृतं सर्वं पुरुषैः सुसमाहितैः Rām. 1. 13. 37.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यज्ञियदेशः, यज्ञियशाला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञियदेशः|यज्ञियदेश
यज्ञिय + -देशः the land of sacrifices; कृष्णसारस्तु चरति मृगो यत्र<BR> स्वभावतः । स ज्ञेयो यज्ञियो देशो म्लेच्छदेशस्ततः परः ॥ Ms. 2. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञियशाला
यज्ञिय + -शाला<BR>—1 a sacrificial hall.<BR>—2 a temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञीय|यज्ञीयः
यज्ञीय <i>a.</i> [यज्ञ-छ] Sacrificial; प्रशस्तेऽहनि यज्ञीये Mb. 3. 124. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञीयः|यज्ञीय
यज्ञीय + .{@-यः@} The Udumbara tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यज्ञीयब्रह्मपादपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्ञीयब्रह्मपादपः|यज्ञीयब्रह्मपादप
यज्ञीय + -ब्रह्मपादपः the tree called विकङ्कत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्य
यज्य <i>a.</i> Fit to be worshipped, adorable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्या
यज्य + .{@-ज्या, -ज्यम्@}<BR>—1 Worshipping.<BR>—2 A sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्यम्
यज्य + .{@-ज्या, -ज्यम्@}<BR>—1 Worshipping.<BR>—2 A sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्यु|यज्युः
यज्यु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Pious, devout.<BR>—2 Worshipping, adoring, honouring.<BR>—3 Sacrificing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्युः|यज्यु
यज्यु + .{@-ज्युः@}<BR>—1 A priest familiar with the Yajurveda (अध्वर्यु).<BR>—2 The institutor of a sacrifice (यजमान).<BR>—3 An adherent to the यजुःशाखा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यज्वन्
यज्वन् <i>a.</i> (यज्वरी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [यज्-क्वनिप्] Sacrificing, worshipping, adoring &c. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 One who performs sacrifices in accordance with Vedic precepts, a performer<BR> of sacrifices; नीपान्वयः पार्थिव एष यज्वा R. 6. 46, 1. 4, 3. 39, 11. 12;<BR> Ku. 2. 46; hence यज्वनां पतिः = The moon.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्|यन्त्
यत् €1 Ā. (यतते, यतित)<BR>—1 To attempt, endeavour, strive, try (usually with inf. or dat.); सर्वः<BR> कल्ये वयसि यतते लब्धुमर्थान् कुटुम्बी V. 3. 1.<BR>—2 To strive after, be eager or anxious for, long for; या न ययौ प्रियमन्यवधूभ्यः<BR> सारतरागमना यतमानम् Śi. 4. 45; R. 9. 7.<BR>—3 To exert oneself, persevere, labour.<BR>—4 To observe caution, be watchful; यततो ह्यपि कौन्तेय पुरुषस्य विपश्चितः Bg. 2. 60.<BR>—5 Ved. To excite, stir up, rouse.<BR>—6 To join, associate with.<BR>—7 To go, proceed. ━<i>Caus.</i> (यातयति-ते)<BR> To return, repay, requite, recompense, restore.<BR>—2 To despise, censure.<BR>—3 To encourage, animate.<BR>—4 To torture, distress, annoy.<BR>—5 To prepare, elaborate.<BR>—6 Ved. To join, unite.<BR>—7 To cause to be returned or restored.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्|यन्त्
यत् <i>a.</i> Going, moving; स्थितं च यच्च (ब्रह्मणो रूपे)<BR> Bṛ. Up. 2. 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतनम्
यतनम् Exertion, effort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतित
यतित <i>p. p.</i> Tried, attempted, endeavoured, striven after.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्त
यत्त <i>a.</i> [यत्-क्त]<BR>—1 Exerting, watching.<BR>—2 Taking pains or care.<BR>—3 Prepared, ready; यत्ता भवत संयुगे Rām. 7. 19. 13; यश्चित्तविजग्रे<BR> यत्तः स्यान्निःसङ्गोऽपरिग्रहः Bhāg. 7. 15. 30.<BR>—4 Resolved.<BR>—5 Cared for, attended to; यत्तं सृतेन शिष्टेन बहुशो दृष्टकर्मणा<BR> Mb. 5. 178. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्नः|यत्न
यत्नः [यत्-भावे नङ्]<BR>—1 An effort, exertion, attempt, endeavour, trial; यत्ने कृते यदि न<BR> सिध्यति कोऽत्र दोषः H. Pr. 31; Bh. 2. 5.<BR>—2 Diligence, assiduity, perseverance.<BR>—3 Care, zeal, watchfulness, vigilance; महान् हि यत्नस्तव देवदारौ<BR> R. 2. 56; प्रतिपात्रमाधीयतां यत्नः Ś. 1.<BR>—4 Pains, trouble, labour, difficulty; शेषाङ्गनिर्माणविधौ विधातुर्लावण्य<BR> उत्पाद्य इवास यत्नः Ku. 1. 35, 7. 66; R. 7. 14. (यत्नेन <i>ind.</i><BR> with great effort, diligently, carefully. यत्नतः carefully, zealously,<BR> sedulously; गुणवदगुणवद् वा कुर्वता कार्यमादौ परिणतिरवधार्या<BR> यत्नतः पण्डितेन Bh. 2. 99. यत्नात्<BR>—1 with great effort.<BR>—2 diligently, vigorously, zealously.<BR>—3 in spite of every effort.<BR>—4 necessarily.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यत्नाक्षेपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्नाक्षेपः|यत्नाक्षेप
यत्नः + -आक्षेपः (in Rhet.) an objection raised even though there be an<BR> attempt to stop it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्नवत्|यत्नवन्त्
यत्नवत् <i>a.</i> With care; कोशदासेन यत्नवदत्युदारं स्नानभोजनादिकमनुभावितोऽस्मि Dk. 2. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत|यतः
यत <i>p. p.</i> [यम्-क्त]<BR>—1 Restrained, curbed, controlled, subdued; निराशीर्यतचित्तात्मा Bg. 4. 21.<BR>—2 Striving, diligent; तांश्चानुसंचार्य ततः कृतार्थाः पतन्ति विप्रेषु<BR> यतेषु भूयः Mb. 12. 301. 111.<BR>—3 Limited, moderate; see यम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतम्
यत + .{@-तम्@} The spurring of an elephant by means of the riderʼs feet; Mātaṅga L.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यतात्मन्, यताहार, यतेन्द्रिय, यतगिर्, यतचित्त, यतमनस्, यतमानस, यतमैथुन, यतवाच्, यतव्रत<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतात्मन्
यत + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> governing oneself, self-restrained, curbing the<BR> senses; (तस्मै) यतात्मने रोचयितुं यतस्व Ku. 3. 16, 1. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यताहार
यत + -आहार <i>a.</i> moderate or temperate in eating, abstemious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतेन्द्रिय|यतेंद्रिय
यत + -इन्द्रिय <i>a.</i> one who has restrained his senses or subdued his<BR> passions, pure, chaste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतगिर्
यत + -गिर् <i>a.</i> silent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतचित्त
यत + -चित्त, -मनस्, -मानस <i>a.</i> subdued in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतमनस्
यत + -चित्त, -मनस्, -मानस <i>a.</i> subdued in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतमानस
यत + -चित्त, -मनस्, -मानस <i>a.</i> subdued in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतमैथुन
यत + -मैथुन <i>a.</i> abstaining from<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">Page1300-1</a>]<BR> sexual intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1299-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतवाच्
यत + -वाच् <i>a.</i> restraining oneʼs speech, observing silence, reticent;<BR> see वाग्यत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतव्रत
यत + -व्रत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 observing vows; इन्द्रोऽन्यः सर्वदेवानां भवेदिति यतव्रताः Mb. 1. 31. 13<BR>—2 keeping to oneʼs engagements or promised observances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतम|यतमः
यतम <i>a.</i> (-मत् <i>n.</i>)<BR> [यद्-डतमच्] Who or which of many.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतर|यतरः
यतर <i>a.</i> (-रत् <i>n.</i>) [यद्-डतरच्] Who or which of two.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतस्
यतस् <i>ind.</i> [यद्-तसिल्] (often used merely for the abl. of<BR> the relative pronoun यद्)<BR>—1 From whence (referring to persons or things), from what, from which<BR> place or quarter; यतस्त्वया ज्ञानमशेषमाप्तम् R. 5. 4. (यतः = यस्मात्<BR> from whom); यतश्च भयमाशङ्केत् प्राचीं तां कल्पयेद् दिशम् Ms. 7. 189.<BR>—2 For which reason, wherefore, in consequence of which.<BR>—3 As, since, for, because; उवाच चैनं परमार्थतो हरं न वेत्सि नूनं<BR> यत एवमात्थ माम् Ku. 5. 75; R. 8. 76, 13. 61; oft. with ततः as correlative.<BR>—4 From which time forward, ever since.<BR>—5 That, so that. (यतस्ततः means<BR>—1 from which place soever, from any quarter whatever.<BR>—2 from any person whatever.<BR>—3 anywhere soever, on all sides, in any direction; न विद्यमानेष्वर्थेषु<BR> नार्त्यामपि यतस्ततः Ms. 4. 15. यतो यतः<BR>—1 from whatever place.<BR>—2 from whomsoever, from any person whatever<BR>—3 wherever, in whatever direction; यतो यतः षट्चरणोऽभिवर्तते<BR> Ś. 1. 23; यतो यतो निश्चरति मनश्चञ्चलमस्थिरम् Bg. 6. 26. यतःप्रमृति<BR> from which time forward.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यतोभव, यतोमूल<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतोभव
यतस् + -भव <i>a.</i> arising from which.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतोमूल
यतस् + -मूल <i>a.</i> originating in, or sprung from which.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यति|यतिः
यति <i>pron. a.</i> [यद्-परिमाणेऽति] (declined only in pl.; nom.<BR> acc. यति) As many, as often, how many.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिः|यति
यतिः <i>f.</i> [यम्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Restraint, check, control.<BR>—2 Stopping, ceasing, rest.<BR>—3 Guidance.<BR>—4 A pause in music; स्थानत्रयं यतीनां च षडास्यानि रसा नव Pt. 5. 55.<BR>—5 (In prosody) A caesura; यतिजिह्वेष्टविश्रामस्थानं कविभिरुच्यते ।<BR> सा विच्छेदविरामाद्यैः पदैर्वाच्या निजेच्छया ॥ Chand. M. 1; म्रभ्नैर्यानां<BR> त्रयेण त्रिमुनियतियुता स्रग्धरा कीर्तितेयम्; यतिभङ्गप्रवृत्तस्य यतिभङ्गो<BR> न दोषभाक् Śāṅkaradigvijaya.<BR>—6 A widow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिः|यति
यतिः + .{@-तिः@} <i>m.</i> [यतते मोक्षाय यत्-इन्]<BR>—1 An ascetic, one who has renounced the world and controlled his passions;<BR> यथा दानं विना हस्ती तथा ज्ञानं विना यतिः Bv. 1. 119.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यतिचान्द्रायणम्, यतिपात्रम्, यतिमैथुनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिचान्द्रायणम्
यतिः + -चान्द्रायणम् N. of a particular kind of penance; अष्टावष्टौ समश्नीयात्<BR> पिण्डान् मध्यंदिने स्थिते । नियतात्मा हविष्याशी यतिचान्द्रायणं चरन् ॥ Ms. 11. 218.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिपात्रम्
यतिः + -पात्रम् an ascetic bowl for collecting alms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिमैथुनम्
यतिः + -मैथुनम् the unchaste life of ascetics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिन्
यतिन् <i>m.</i> An ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यतिनी
यतिनी A widow; विधवा … … विश्वस्ता यतिनी यतिः Śabdaratnāvalī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्त
यत्त, -यत्न<BR> See under यत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्न|यत्नः
यत्त, -यत्न<BR> See under यत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्र
यत्र <i>ind.</i> [यद्-त्रल्] Where, in which place, whither; सैव<BR> सा (द्यौः) चलति यत्र हि चित्तम् N. 5. 57; Ku. 1. 7, 10.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-2" target="_blank">Page1300-2</a>]<BR>—2 When; as in यत्र काले.<BR>—3 Whereas, because, since, as. (यत्र यत्र means ‘wherever’; यत्र<BR> यत्र धूमस्तत्र तत्र वह्निः T. S.; यत्र तत्र in whatever place,<BR> everywhere; यत्रकुत्र or यत्रक्वचन-क्वपि<BR>—1 wheresoever, in whatever place.<BR>—2 whensoever, at whatever time.<BR>—3 whenever, as often as. —4 hither and thither.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यत्रकामम्, यत्रकामावसायः, यत्रसायंगृह, यत्रसायंप्रतिश्रय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रकामम्
यत्र + -कामम् <i>ind.</i> wherever one pleases.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रकामावसायः|यत्रकामावसाय
यत्र + -कामावसायः the supernatural power (of yogins) for transporting<BR> oneʼs self anywhere one likes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रसायंगृह
यत्र + -सायंगृह, -सायंप्रतिश्रय <i>a.</i> taking up an abode wherever<BR> evening overtakes one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रसायंप्रतिश्रय|यत्रसायम्प्रतिश्रय
यत्र + -सायंगृह, -सायंप्रतिश्रय <i>a.</i> taking up an abode wherever<BR> evening overtakes one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्रत्य
यत्रत्य <i>a.</i> Of which place, dwelling in which place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथा
यथा <i>ind.</i> [यद् प्रकारे थाल्]<BR>—1 Used by itself यथा has the following senses:−<BR>——(<i>a</i>) as, in the manner mentioned; यथाज्ञापयति महाराजः ‘as Your Majesty orders’<BR>;<BR>——(<i>b</i>) namely, as follows; तद् यथानुश्रूयते Pt. 1; U. 2. 4;<BR>——(<i>c</i>) as, like (showing comparison, and used to express the point of<BR> similarity); आसीदियं दशरथस्य गृहे यथा श्रीः U. 4. 6; Ku. 4. 34;<BR> प्रभावप्रभवं कान्तं स्वाधीनपतिका यथा (न मुञ्चति) K. P. 10;<BR>——(<i>d</i>) as, as for example, for instance; यत्र यत्र धूमस्तत्र तत्र<BR> वह्निर्यथा महानसे T. S.; कुर्युः कृत्यमकृत्यं वा उष्ट्रे काकादयो यथा Pt. 1. 288;<BR>——(<i>e</i>) that (used to introduce direct assertions with or without इति<BR> at the end); अकथितोऽपि ज्ञायत एव यथायमाभोगस्तपोवनस्येति Ś. 1;<BR> विदितं खलु ते यथा स्मरः क्षणमप्युत्सहते न मां विना Ku. 4. 36;<BR>——(<i>f</i>) so that, in order that; दर्शय तं चौरसिंहं यथा व्यापादयामि Pt. 1.<BR>—2 Used correlatively with तथा, यथा has the following senses:−<BR>——(<i>a</i>) as, so (in which case एवम् and तद्वत् often take the<BR> place of तथा); यथा वृक्षस्तथा फलम् or यथा बीजं तथाङ्कुरः;<BR> Bg. 11. 29; in this case एव is frequently added to either यथा<BR> or तथा or to both to make the equality of relation more marked or<BR> striking; वधूचतुष्केऽपि यथैव शान्ता प्रिया तनूजास्य तथैव सीता<BR> U. 4. 16; न तथा बाधते स्कन्धो (or शीतम्) यथा बाधति बाधते;<BR> (as much━as, as━as); Ku. 6. 70; U. 2. 4; V. 4. 33. In this sense<BR> तथा is often omitted, in which case यथा has sense (c) in 1 above.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) so━that, तथा standing for ‘so’, and यथा for ‘that’;<BR> यथा बन्धुजनशोच्या न भवति तथा निर्वाहय Ś. 3; तथा प्रयतेथा<BR> यथा नोपहस्यसे जनैः K. 109; तस्मान्मुच्ये यथा तात संविधातुं तथार्हसि<BR> R. 1. 72, 3. 66, 14. 66, 15. 68.<BR>——(<i>c</i>) since━therefore, as (because)━so; यथा इतोमुखागतैरपि कलकलः<BR> श्रुतस्तथा तर्कयामि &c. Māl. 8; sometimes तथा is omitted; मन्दं<BR> मन्दं नुदति पवनश्चानुकूलो यथा त्वां … सेविष्यन्ते भवन्तं बलाकाः Me. 9.<BR>——(<i>d</i>) if━then, as surely as━so surely (a strong form of assertion<BR> or adjuration); वाङ्मनःकर्मभिः पत्यौ व्यभिचारो यथा न मे । तथा विश्वंभरे<BR> देवि मामन्तर्धातुमर्हसि R. 15. 81; यथा यथातथा तथा the more −the<BR> more, the less−the less; यथा यथा भाषसि धर्मसंमितं तथा<BR> तथा मे त्वयि भक्तिरुत्तमा Mb.; Śi. 17. 43; यथा यथा यौवनमतिचक्राम<BR> तथा तथावर्धतास्य संतापः K. 59; Ms. 8. 286, 12. 73; यथा तथा<BR> in any manner, in whatever way; यथा तथा यापयंस्तु सा ह्यस्य कृतकृत्यता<BR> Ms. 4. 17; यथैव just as; यथा तथा as much as; यथा तथा भवतु whatever<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">Page1301-1</a>]<BR> may be the case; यथा कथंचित् anyhow, somehow or other. <i>N. B.</i><BR> As the first member of Avyayībhāva comp. यथा is usually translated<BR> by ‘according to, according as, in accordance with, in conformity to, in proportion to, not exceeding’<BR>; see compounds below.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यथांशम्, यथांशतस्, यथाधिकारम्, यथाधीत, यथानुपूर्वम्, यथानुपूर्व्यम्, यथानुपूर्व्या, यथानुभूतम्, यथानुरूपम्, यथानूक्तम्, यथाभिप्रेत, यथाभिमत, यथाभिलषित, यथाभीष्ट, यथाभिरुचित, यथार्थ, यथार्ह, यथार्हम्, यथार्हतः, यथार्हणम्, यथावकाशम्, यथावस्थम्, यथाख्यात, यथाख्यानम्, यथागत, यथागमम्, यथाचारम्, यथाम्नातम्, यथाम्नायम्, यथारम्भम्, यथावासम्, यथाशयम्, यथाश्रमम्, यथाश्रयम्, यथेच्छ, यथेष्ट, यथेप्सित, यथेक्षितम्, यथोक्त, यथोदित, यथोचित, यथोत्तरम्, यथोत्साहम्, यथोद्गत, यथोद्गमनम्, यथोद्दिष्ट, यथोपचारम्, यथोपजोषम्, यथोपदिष्ट, यथोपदेशम्, यथोपपत्ति, यथोपपन्न, यथोपमा, यथोपयोगम्, यथोपाधि, यथौचित्यम्, यथर्तु, यथाकथित, यथाकर्तव्यम्, यथाकर्म, यथाकल्पम्, यथाकाम, यथाकामिन्, यथाकारम्, यथाकालः, यथाकृत, यथाकॢप्ति, यथाक्रमम्, यथाक्रमेण, यथाक्षमम्, यथाक्षिप्रम्, यथाक्षेमेण, यथाखेलम्, यथागुणम्, यथाचित्तम्, यथाजात, यथाज्ञानम्, यथाज्येष्ठम्, यथातत्त्वम्, यथातथ, यथातथ्यम्, यथातथ्येन, यथातृप्ति, यथादर्शनम्, यथादिक्, यथादिशम्, यथानिकायम्, यथानिर्दिष्ट, यथान्यायम्, यथान्यासम्, यथान्युप्त, यथापण्यम्, यथापुरम्, यथापूर्व, यथापूर्वक, यथाप्रत्यर्हम्, यथाप्रदिष्टम्, यथाप्रदेशम्, यथाप्रधानम्, यथाप्रधानतः, यथाप्रयोगम्, यथाप्रस्तावम्, यथाप्रस्तुतम्, यथाप्राणम्, यथाप्राप्त, यथाप्रार्थितम्, यथाबलम्, यथाबुद्धि, यथामति, यथाभक्त्या, यथाभागम्, यथाभागशः, यथाभावः, यथाभूतम्, यथाभूयस्, यथामुखीन, यथामूल्य, यथायथम्, यथायुक्तम्, यथायोगम्, यथायोग्य, यथारसम्, यथारुचम्, यथारुचि, यथारूपम्, यथालब्ध, यथावस्तु, यथाविध, यथाविधि, यथाविनियोगम्, यथाविभवम्, यथावीर्य, यथावृत्त, यथावृद्धम्, यथाव्युत्पत्ति, यथाशक्ति, यथाशक्त्या, यथाशब्दार्थम्, यथाशास्त्रम्, यथाशीघ्रम्, यथाशीलम्, यथाश्रुत, यथाश्रुतम्, यथाश्रुति, यथाश्रेष्ठम्, यथाश्लक्ष्ण, यथासंस्थम्, यथासंख्यम्, यथासमयम्, यथासंभव, यथासंभावित, यथासर्वम्, यथासवनम्, यथासारम्, यथासुखम्, यथास्थानम्, यथास्थित, यथास्थिति, यथास्थूलम्, यथास्व, यथास्वम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1300-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथांशम्
यथा + -अंशम्, -अंशतस् <i>ind.</i> in due proportions, proportionately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथांशतस्
यथा + -अंशम्, -अंशतस् <i>ind.</i> in due proportions, proportionately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाधिकारम्
यथा + -अधिकारम् <i>ind.</i> according to authority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाधीत
यथा + -अधीत <i>a.</i> as read or studied, conformable to the text.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाधीतम्
यथा + -अधीत + .({@-तम्@}) <i>ind.</i> according to the text.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानुपूर्वम्
यथा + -अनुपूर्वम्, -अनुपूर्व्यम्, -अनुपूर्व्या <i>ind.</i> in regular order<BR> or succession, successively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानुपूर्व्यम्
यथा + -अनुपूर्वम्, -अनुपूर्व्यम्, -अनुपूर्व्या <i>ind.</i> in regular order<BR> or succession, successively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानुपूर्व्या
यथा + -अनुपूर्वम्, -अनुपूर्व्यम्, -अनुपूर्व्या <i>ind.</i> in regular order<BR> or succession, successively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानुभूतम्
यथा + -अनुभूतम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to experience.<BR>—2 by previous experience.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानुरूपम्
यथा + -अनुरूपम् <i>ind.</i> in exact conformity, properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानूक्तम्
यथा + -अनूक्तम् <i>ind.</i> as said or told; मया यथानूक्तमवादि ते हरेः<BR> कृतावतारस्य सुमित्र चेष्टितम् Bhāg. 3. 19. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिप्रेत
यथा + -अभिप्रेत, -अभिमत, -अभिलषित, -अभीष्ट <i>a.</i> as wished, intended<BR> or desired, agreeably to desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिप्रेतम्
यथा + -अभिप्रेत, -अभिमत, -अभिलषित, -अभीष्ट + .({@-तम्@} &c.) <i>ind.</i> according to oneʼs wish, at pleasure, agreeably<BR> to oneʼs desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिमत
यथा + -अभिप्रेत, -अभिमत, -अभिलषित, -अभीष्ट <i>a.</i> as wished, intended<BR> or desired, agreeably to desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिलषित
यथा + -अभिप्रेत, -अभिमत, -अभिलषित, -अभीष्ट <i>a.</i> as wished, intended<BR> or desired, agreeably to desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभीष्ट
यथा + -अभिप्रेत, -अभिमत, -अभिलषित, -अभीष्ट <i>a.</i> as wished, intended<BR> or desired, agreeably to desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभिरुचित
यथा + -अभिरुचित <i>a.</i> pleasant, agreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्थ|यथार्थं
यथा + -अर्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 conformable to truth, true, real, correct; सौम्येति चाभाष्य यथार्थभाषी<BR> R. 14. 44; so यथार्थानुभवः ‘correct or right perception’; यथार्थवक्ता &c.<BR>—2 conformable to the true meaning, true to the sense, right, appropriate,<BR> significant; करिष्यन्निव नामास्य (<i>i. e.</i> शत्रुघ्न) यथार्थमरिनिग्रहात्<BR> R. 15. 6; (करिष्यते) युधि सद्यः शिशुपालतां यथार्थाम् Śi. 16. 85;<BR> Ki. 8. 48; Ku. 2. 16.<BR>—3 fit, suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्थम्
यथा + -अर्थ + .({@-र्थम्, -अर्थतः@} <i>ind.</i> truly, rightly; fitly, suitably, properly.)<BR> ˚अक्षर <i>a.</i> signficant or true to the syllable; यस्मिन्नीश्वर<BR> इत्यनन्यविषयः शब्दो यथार्थाक्षरः V. 1. 1. ˚नामन् <i>a.</i> one<BR> whose name is true to its meaning or fully significant (whose deeds are<BR> according to his name); ध्रुवसिद्धेरपि यथार्थनाम्नः सिद्धिं न मन्येत<BR> M. 4; परंतपो नाम यथार्थनामा R. 6. 21. ˚वर्णः a spy (see<BR> यथार्हवर्ण). (यथार्थता<BR>—1 suitableness, fitness.<BR>—2 propriety.<BR>—3 accuracy, genuineness, correctness.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्थतः
यथा + -अर्थ + .({@-र्थम्, -अर्थतः@} <i>ind.</i> truly, rightly; fitly, suitably, properly.)<BR> ˚अक्षर <i>a.</i> signficant or true to the syllable; यस्मिन्नीश्वर<BR> इत्यनन्यविषयः शब्दो यथार्थाक्षरः V. 1. 1. ˚नामन् <i>a.</i> one<BR> whose name is true to its meaning or fully significant (whose deeds are<BR> according to his name); ध्रुवसिद्धेरपि यथार्थनाम्नः सिद्धिं न मन्येत<BR> M. 4; परंतपो नाम यथार्थनामा R. 6. 21. ˚वर्णः a spy (see<BR> यथार्हवर्ण). (यथार्थता<BR>—1 suitableness, fitness.<BR>—2 propriety.<BR>—3 accuracy, genuineness, correctness.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्ह|यथार्हं
यथा + -अर्ह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 according to merit, as deserving.<BR>—2 appropriate, suitable, just.<BR>—3 as agreeable; यथार्हजलेन हृद्यगन्धेन स्नातः Dk. 2. 7. ˚वर्णः<BR> a spy, an emissary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्हम्
यथा + -अर्हम्, -अर्हतः <i>ind.</i> according to merit or worth; यथार्हमन्यैरनुजीवलोकं<BR> संभावयामास यथाप्रधानम् R. 16. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्हतः
यथा + -अर्हम्, -अर्हतः <i>ind.</i> according to merit or worth; यथार्हमन्यैरनुजीवलोकं<BR> संभावयामास यथाप्रधानम् R. 16. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथार्हणम्
यथा + -अर्हणम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to propriety.<BR>—2 according to worth or merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावकाशम्
यथा + -अवकाशम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to room or space.<BR>—2 as occasion may occur, according to occasion, leisure or propriety.<BR>—3 in the proper place; प्रालम्बमुत्कृष्य यथावकाशं निनाय R. 6. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावस्थम्
यथा + -अवस्थम् <i>ind.</i> according to the condition or circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाख्यात
यथा + -आख्यात <i>a.</i> as mentioned before, before mentioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाख्यानम्
यथा + -आख्यानम् <i>ind.</i> as before stated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथागत
यथा + -आगत <i>a.</i> foolish, stupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथागतम्
यथा + -आगत + .({@-तम्@}) <i>ind.</i> as one came, by the same way as one came; यथागतं<BR> मातलिसारथिर्ययौ R. 3. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथागमम्
यथा + -आगमम् <i>ind.</i> according to tradition, as handed down from generation to generation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाचारम्
यथा + -आचारम् <i>ind.</i> as customary or usual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाम्नातम्
यथा + -आम्नातम्, -आम्नायम् <i>ind.</i> as laid down in the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाम्नायम्
यथा + -आम्नातम्, -आम्नायम् <i>ind.</i> as laid down in the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथारम्भम्|यथारंभम्
यथा + -आरम्भम् <i>ind.</i> according to the beginning, in regular order or succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावासम्
यथा + -आवासम् <i>ind.</i> according to oneʼs dwelling, each to his own dwelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशयम्
यथा + -आशयम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">Page1301-2</a>]<BR> <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to wish or intention.<BR>—2 according to the agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाश्रमम्
यथा + -आश्रमम् <i>ind.</i> according to the Āśrama or period in oneʼs<BR> religious life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाश्रयम्
यथा + -आश्रयम् <i>ind.</i> according to substratum; चित्रं यथाश्रयमृते<BR> Sāṅ. K. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेच्छ
यथा + -इच्छ, -इष्ट, -ईप्सित <i>a.</i> according to wish or desire, agreeably<BR> to oneʼs desire, as much as desired, as desired or wished for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेष्ट|यथेष्टं
यथा + -इच्छ, -इष्ट, -ईप्सित <i>a.</i> according to wish or desire, agreeably<BR> to oneʼs desire, as much as desired, as desired or wished for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेप्सित|यथेप्सितं
यथा + -इच्छ, -इष्ट, -ईप्सित <i>a.</i> according to wish or desire, agreeably<BR> to oneʼs desire, as much as desired, as desired or wished for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेच्छम्
यथा + -इच्छ, -इष्ट, -ईप्सित + .({@-च्छम्, -ष्टम्, -तम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to wish or desire, at will or pleasure; यथेष्टं चेष्टन्ते<BR> स्फुटकुचतटाः पश्य कुलटाः Udb.<BR>—2 as much as may be wanted, to the heartʼs content; यथेष्टं बुभुजे<BR> मांसम् C. P. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेष्टम्
यथा + -इच्छ, -इष्ट, -ईप्सित + .({@-च्छम्, -ष्टम्, -तम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to wish or desire, at will or pleasure; यथेष्टं चेष्टन्ते<BR> स्फुटकुचतटाः पश्य कुलटाः Udb.<BR>—2 as much as may be wanted, to the heartʼs content; यथेष्टं बुभुजे<BR> मांसम् C. P. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेप्सितम्
यथा + -इच्छ, -इष्ट, -ईप्सित + .({@-च्छम्, -ष्टम्, -तम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to wish or desire, at will or pleasure; यथेष्टं चेष्टन्ते<BR> स्फुटकुचतटाः पश्य कुलटाः Udb.<BR>—2 as much as may be wanted, to the heartʼs content; यथेष्टं बुभुजे<BR> मांसम् C. P. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेक्षितम्
यथा + -ईक्षितम् <i>ind.</i> as personally seen, as actually perceived.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोक्त
यथा + -उक्त, -उदित <i>a.</i> as said or told above, aforesaid, above-mentioned;<BR> यथोक्ताः संवृत्ताः Pt. 1; यथोक्तव्यापारा Ś. 1; R. 2. 70; ततः<BR> स्वगृहमेत्य यथोक्तमर्थत्यागं कृत्वा Dk. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोदित|यथोदितं
यथा + -उक्त, -उदित <i>a.</i> as said or told above, aforesaid, above-mentioned;<BR> यथोक्ताः संवृत्ताः Pt. 1; यथोक्तव्यापारा Ś. 1; R. 2. 70; ततः<BR> स्वगृहमेत्य यथोक्तमर्थत्यागं कृत्वा Dk. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोचित|यथोचितं
यथा + -उचित <i>a.</i> suitable, proper, due, fit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोचितम्
यथा + -उचित + .({@-तम्@}) <i>ind.</i> duly, suitably, properly; आगतं तु भयं वीक्ष्य<BR> नरः कुर्याद् यथोचितम् H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोत्तरम्
यथा + -उत्तरम् <i>ind.</i> in regular order or succession, one after another;<BR> संबन्धोऽत्र यथोत्तरम् S. D. 729; श्रैष्ठ्यमेषां यथोत्तरम् Ms. 12. 38;<BR> यथोत्तरेच्छा हि गुणेषु कामिनः Ki. 8. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोत्साहम्
यथा + -उत्साहम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to oneʼs power or might.<BR>—2 with all oneʼs might.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोद्गत
यथा + -उद्गत <i>a.</i> without sense, stupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोद्गमनम्
यथा + -उद्गमनम् in ascending proportion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोद्दिष्ट
यथा + -उद्दिष्ट <i>a.</i> as indicated or described.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोद्दिष्टम्
यथा + -उद्दिष्ट + .({@-ष्टम्@}) or {@-उद्देशम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR> in the manner indicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोद्देशम्
यथा + -उद्दिष्ट + .({@-ष्टम्@}) or {@-उद्देशम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR> in the manner indicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपचारम्
यथा + -उपचारम् <i>ind.</i> as politeness or courtesy requires.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपजोषम्
यथा + -उपजोषम् <i>ind.</i> according to pleasure or desire; यथोपजोषं<BR> वासांसि परिधायाहतानि ते Bhāg. 8. 9. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपदिष्ट
यथा + -उपदिष्ट <i>a.</i> as indicated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपदेशम्
यथा + -उपदेशम् <i>ind.</i> as advised or instructed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपपत्ति
यथा + -उपपत्ति <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 as may be fit.<BR>—2 as may happen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपपन्न
यथा + -उपपन्न <i>a.</i> just as happened to be at hand, natural; यथोपपन्नरज्जुबद्धः Dk. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपमा
यथा + -उपमा (in Rhet.) a comparison expressed by यथा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपयोगम्
यथा + -उपयोगम् <i>ind.</i> according to use or requirements, according<BR> to circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथोपाधि
यथा + -उपाधि <i>ind.</i> according to the condition or supposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथौचित्यम्
यथा + -औचित्यम् propriety, suitableness, fitness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथर्तु
यथा + -ऋतु <i>ind.</i> according to the right season; यथर्तुवर्षी भगवान्<BR> न तथा पाकशासनः Mb. 3. 188. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकथित
यथा + -कथित <i>a.</i> as already mentioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकर्तव्यम्
यथा + -कर्तव्यम् what is right to be done.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकर्म
यथा + -कर्म <i>ind.</i> according to oneʼs duties or circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकल्पम्
यथा + -कल्पम् <i>ind.</i> according to rule or ritual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकाम
यथा + -काम <i>a.</i> conformable to desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकामम्
यथा + -काम + .({@-मम्@}) <i>ind.</i> agreeably to desire, at will or pleasure, to the<BR> heartʼs content; यथाकामार्चितार्थिनाम् R. 1. 6, 4. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकामिन्
यथा + -कामिन् <i>a.</i> free, unrestrained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकारम्
यथा + -कारम् <i>ind.</i> in whatever way; P. III. 4. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकालः|यथाकाल
यथा + -कालः the right or due time, proper time; यथाकालप्रबोधिनाम् R. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकालम्
यथा + -कालः + .({@-लम्@}) <i>ind.</i> at the right time, opportunely, seasonably; सोपसर्पैर्जजागार<BR> यथाकालं स्वपन्नपि R. 17. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकृत
यथा + -कृत <i>a.</i> as agreed upon, done according to rule or custom,<BR> customary; स यदि प्रतिपद्येत यथान्यस्तं यथाकृतम् Ms. 8. 183.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकृतम्
यथा + -कृत + .({@-तम्@}) <i>ind.</i> according to the usual practice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाकॢप्ति
यथा + -कॢप्ति <i>ind.</i> in a suitable way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाक्रमम्
यथा + -क्रमम्, -क्रमेण <i>ind.</i> in due order or succession, regularly,<BR> in due form, properly; यथाक्रमं पुंसवनादिकाः क्रियाः R. 3. 10, 9. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाक्रमेण
यथा + -क्रमम्, -क्रमेण <i>ind.</i> in due order or succession, regularly,<BR> in due form, properly; यथाक्रमं पुंसवनादिकाः क्रियाः R. 3. 10, 9. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाक्षमम्
यथा + -क्षमम् <i>ind.</i> according to oneʼs power, as much as possible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाक्षिप्रम्
यथा + -क्षिप्रम् <i>ind.</i> as quickly as possible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाक्षेमेण
यथा + -क्षेमेण <i>ind.</i> safely, comfortably.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">Page1302-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1301-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाखेलम्
यथा + -खेलम् <i>ind.</i> playfully; V.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथागुणम्
यथा + -गुणम् <i>ind.</i> according to qualities or endowments; Ch. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाचित्तम्
यथा + -चित्तम् <i>ind.</i> according to will; Māl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाजात|यथाजातः
यथा + -जात <i>a.</i><BR>—1 foolish, senseless, stupid.<BR>—2 barbarous, outcast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाज्ञानम्
यथा + -ज्ञानम् <i>ind.</i> to the best of oneʼs knowledge or judgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाज्येष्ठम्
यथा + -ज्येष्ठम् <i>ind.</i> according to rank, by seniority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातत्त्वम्
यथा + -तत्त्वम् <i>ind.</i> —1 according to actual facts, actually, as the<BR> case really may be.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथ|यथातथं
यथा + -तथ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 true, right.<BR>—2 accurate, exact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथम्
यथा + -तथ + .({@-थम्@}) a narrative of the particulars or details of anything,<BR> a detailed or minute account.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथम्
यथा + -तथ + .({@-थम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 exactly, precisely; विभाव्यन्ते यथातथम् Bhāg.<BR>—2 fitly, properly, as the case really may be; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथ्यम्
यथा + -तथ्यम्, -तथ्येन <i>ind.</i> truly, really.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातथ्येन
यथा + -तथ + .({@-थम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 exactly, precisely; विभाव्यन्ते यथातथम् Bhāg.<BR>—2 fitly, properly, as the case really may be; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथातृप्ति
यथा + -तृप्ति <i>ind.</i> to the heartʼs content.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथादर्शनम्
यथा + -दर्शनम् <i>ind.</i> according to observation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथादिक्
यथा + -दिक्, -दिशम् <i>ind.</i> in all directions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथादिशम्
यथा + -दिक्, -दिशम् <i>ind.</i> in all directions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानिकायम्
यथा + -निकायम् <i>ind.</i> according to body; Śvet. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथानिर्दिष्ट
यथा + -निर्दिष्ट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 as mentioned before, as specified above; यथानिर्दिष्टव्यापारा सखी.<BR>—2 as prescribed or laid down; यथानिर्दिष्टं संपादितं व्रतम् V. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथान्यायम्
यथा + -न्यायम् <i>ind.</i> justly, rightly, properly; प्रतिपूज्य यथान्यायम् Ms. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथान्यासम्
यथा + -न्यासम् <i>ind.</i> according to the text of a Śūtra, as written down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथान्युप्त
यथा + -न्युप्त <i>a.</i> as placed on the ground or offered; अवजिघ्रेच्च<BR> तान् पिण्डान् यथान्युप्तान् समाहितः Ms. 3. 218.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथापण्यम्
यथा + -पण्यम् <i>ind.</i> according to the (value or kind of) commodities;<BR> शुल्कस्थानेषु कुशलाः यथापण्यविचक्षणाः Ms. 8. 398 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथापुरम्
यथा + -पुरम् <i>ind.</i> as before, as on previous occasions; यथापुरमविज्ञाय<BR> स्वार्थलिप्सुमपण्डिताम् Rām. 2. 10. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथापूर्व|यथापूर्व्व|यथापूर्व्वं
यथा + -पूर्व, -पूर्वक <i>a.</i> being as before, former; R. 12. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथापूर्वम्
यथा + -पूर्व, -पूर्वक + .({@-र्वम्@}), {@-पूर्वकम्@}<BR> <i>ind.</i> —1 as before; सर्वाणि ज्ञातिकार्याणि यथापूर्वं<BR> समाचरेत् Ms. 11. 187.<BR>—2 in due order or succession, one after another; एते मान्या यथापूर्वम् Y. 1. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथापूर्वक
यथा + -पूर्व, -पूर्वक <i>a.</i> being as before, former; R. 12. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रत्यर्हम्
यथा + -प्रत्यर्हम् <i>ind.</i> according to merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रदिष्टम्
यथा + -प्रदिष्टम् <i>ind.</i> as suitable or proper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रदेशम्
यथा + -प्रदेशम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 in the proper or suitable place; यथाप्रदेशं विनिवेशितेन Ku. 1. 49;<BR> आसञ्जयामास यथाप्रदेशं कण्ठे गुणम् R. 6. 83; Ku. 7. 34.<BR>—2 according to direction or precept.<BR>—3 on all sides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रधानम्
यथा + -प्रधानम्, -प्रधानतः <i>ind.</i> according to rank or position,<BR> according to precedence; आलोकमात्रेण सुरानशेषान् संभावयामास यथाप्रधानम् Ku. 7. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रधानतः
यथा + -प्रधानम्, -प्रधानतः <i>ind.</i> according to rank or position,<BR> according to precedence; आलोकमात्रेण सुरानशेषान् संभावयामास यथाप्रधानम् Ku. 7. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रयोगम्
यथा + -प्रयोगम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to usage or practice.<BR>—2 as found by experiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रस्तावम्
यथा + -प्रस्तावम् <i>ind.</i> on the first suitable occasion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रस्तुतम्
यथा + -प्रस्तुतम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 at last, at length.<BR>—2 conformably to the circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्राणम्
यथा + -प्राणम् <i>ind.</i> according to strength, with all oneʼs might.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्राप्त
यथा + -प्राप्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 suitable to circumstances.<BR>—2 following from a previous grammatical rule; Kāśi. on P. III. 2. 135.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्राप्तम्
यथा + -प्राप्त + .({@-प्तम्@}) <i>ind.</i> regularly, properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाप्रार्थितम्
यथा + -प्रार्थितम् <i>ind.</i> as requested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाबलम्
यथा + -बलम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 to the best of oneʼs power, with all oneʼs might; यथाबलं च विभज्य<BR> गृह्णीत Dk. 2. 8.<BR>—2 according to the (condition of) army or number of forces; Ms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाबुद्धि
यथा + -बुद्धि, -मति <i>ind.</i> to the best of oneʼs knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथामति
यथा + -बुद्धि, -मति <i>ind.</i> to the best of oneʼs knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभक्त्या
यथा + -भक्त्या with entire devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभागम्
यथा + -भागम्, -भागशः <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to the share of each, proportionately; यथाभागशोऽमी वो गन्धाः<BR>—2 each in his respective place; यथाभागमवस्थिताः Bg. 1. 11.<BR>—3 in the proper place; यथाभागमवस्थितेऽपि R. 6. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभागशः
यथा + -भागम्, -भागशः <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to the share of each, proportionately; यथाभागशोऽमी वो गन्धाः<BR>—2 each in his respective place; यथाभागमवस्थिताः Bg. 1. 11.<BR>—3 in the proper place; यथाभागमवस्थितेऽपि R. 6. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभावः|यथाभाव
यथा + -भावः<BR>—1 destiny.<BR>—2 proper relation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभूतम्
यथा + -भूतम् <i>ind.</i> according<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">Page1302-2</a>]<BR> to what has taken place, according to truth, truly, exactly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाभूयस्
यथा + -भूयस् <i>ind.</i> according to seniority.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथामुखीन|यथामुखीनः
यथा + -मुखीन <i>a.</i> looking straight at (with gen.); (मृगः) यथामुखीनः<BR> सीतायाः पुप्लुवे बहु लोभयन् Bk. 5. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथामूल्य
यथा + -मूल्य <i>a.</i> worth the price, accordant with the price.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथायथम्
यथा + -यथम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 as is fit, fitly, properly; यथायथं ताः सहिता नभश्चरैः Ki. 8. 2.<BR>—2 in regular order, severally, each in its proper place, respectively;<BR> असक्तमाराधयतो यथायथम् Ki. 1. 11; बीजवन्तो मुखाद्यर्था विप्रकीर्णा<BR> यथायथम् S. D. 337.<BR>—3 by degrees, gradually; सर्वे मायामानवा यथायथमन्तर्भावं गताः Dk. 1. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथायुक्तम्
यथा + -युक्तम्, -योगम् <i>ind.</i> according to circumstances, fitly, suitably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथायोगम्
यथा + -युक्तम्, -योगम् <i>ind.</i> according to circumstances, fitly, suitably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथायोग्य
यथा + -योग्य <i>a.</i> suitable, fit, proper, right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथारसम्
यथा + -रसम् <i>ind.</i> according to the sentiments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथारुचम्
यथा + -रुचम्, -रुचि <i>ind.</i> according to oneʼs liking or taste; वदन्ति<BR> चैतत् कवयो यथारुचम् Bhāg. 2. 5. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथारुचि
यथा + -रुचम्, -रुचि <i>ind.</i> according to oneʼs liking or taste; वदन्ति<BR> चैतत् कवयो यथारुचम् Bhāg. 2. 5. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथारूपम्
यथा + -रूपम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to form or appearance.<BR>—2 duly, properly, fitly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथालब्ध
यथा + -लब्ध <i>a.</i> as actually in hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावस्तु
यथा + -वस्तु <i>ind.</i> as the fact stands, exactly, accurately, truly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाविध
यथा + -विध <i>a.</i> of such kind or sort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाविधि
यथा + -विधि <i>ind.</i> according to rule or precept, duly, properly; यथाविधि<BR> हुताग्नीनाम् R. 1. 6; संचस्कारोभयप्रीत्या मैथिलेयौ यथाविधि 15. 31, 3. 70;<BR> Ms. 11. 191.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाविनियोगम्
यथा + -विनियोगम् <i>ind.</i> in the succession or order stated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाविभवम्
यथा + -विभवम् <i>ind.</i> in proportion to oneʼs income, according to means.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावीर्य
यथा + -वीर्य <i>a.</i> of whatever strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावीर्यम्
यथा + -वीर्य + .({@-र्यम्@}) <i>ind.</i> in respect of manliness or courage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावृत्त
यथा + -वृत्त <i>a.</i> as happened, done or acted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावृत्तम्
यथा + -वृत्त + .({@-त्तम्@})<BR>—1 the actual facts, the circumstances or details of an event.<BR>—2 a former event.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावृद्धम्
यथा + -वृद्धम् <i>ind.</i> according to age or seniority; गगनादवतीर्णा<BR> सा यथावृद्धपुरःसरा Ku. 6. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाव्युत्पत्ति
यथा + -व्युत्पत्ति <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 according to the degree of education or culture.<BR>—2 according to the derivation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशक्ति
यथा + -शक्ति, -शक्त्या <i>ind.</i> to the best of oneʼs power, as far as possible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशक्त्या
यथा + -शक्ति, -शक्त्या <i>ind.</i> to the best of oneʼs power, as far as possible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशब्दार्थम्
यथा + -शब्दार्थम् <i>ind.</i> in keeping with or according to the sense<BR> conveyed by the (sacred) text; इह शब्दलक्षणे कर्मणि यथाशब्दार्थं<BR> प्रवृत्तिः ŚB. on MS. 11. 1. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशास्त्रम्
यथा + -शास्त्रम् <i>ind.</i> according to the scriptures, as the law ordains;<BR> सर्वेऽपि क्रमशस्त्वेते यथाशास्त्रं निषेविताः Ms. 6. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशीघ्रम्
यथा + -शीघ्रम् <i>ind.</i> as quickly as possible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाशीलम्
यथा + -शीलम् <i>ind.</i> in accordance with oneʼs temper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाश्रुत
यथा + -श्रुत <i>a.</i> according to the report.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाश्रुतम्
यथा + -श्रुतम्, -श्रुति <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 as heard or reported.<BR>—2 (यथाश्रुति) according to Vedic precepts; अस्मात् परं बत यथाश्रुति<BR> संभृतानि को नः कुले निवपनानि करिष्यतीति Ś. 6. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाश्रुति
यथा + -श्रुतम्, -श्रुति <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 as heard or reported.<BR>—2 (यथाश्रुति) according to Vedic precepts; अस्मात् परं बत यथाश्रुति<BR> संभृतानि को नः कुले निवपनानि करिष्यतीति Ś. 6. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाश्रेष्ठम्
यथा + -श्रेष्ठम् <i>ind.</i> in order of precedence or merit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथाश्लक्ष्ण
यथा + -श्लक्ष्ण <i>a.</i> behaving in such a way that the weaker is placed first.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासंस्थम्
यथा + -संस्थम् <i>ind.</i> according to circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासंख्यम्
यथा + -संख्यम् a figure of speech in Rhetoric; यथासंख्यं क्रमेणैव<BR> क्रमिकाणां समन्वयः K. P. 10; <i>e. g.</i> शत्रुं मित्रं विपत्तिं च<BR> जय रञ्जय भञ्जय Candr. 5. 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासंख्यम्
यथा + -संख्यम् + .({@-ख्यम्@}), {@-संख्येन@}<BR> <i>ind.</i> according to number, respectively, number for<BR> number; हृत्कण्ठतालुगाभिस्तु यथासंख्यं द्विजातयः (शुध्येरन्) Y. 1. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासमयम्
यथा + -समयम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 at the proper time.<BR>—2 according to agreement or established usage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासंभव|यथासम्भव
यथा + -संभव <i>a.</i> possible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासंभावित|यथासम्भावित
यथा + -संभावित <i>a.</i> suitable, appropriate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासर्वम्
यथा + -सर्वम् <i>ind.</i> in all particulars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासवनम्
यथा + -सवनम् <i>ind.</i> according to the time or season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासारम्
यथा + -सारम् <i>ind.</i> according to quality or goodness,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">Page1303-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1302-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथासुखम्
यथा + -सुखम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 at will or pleasure.<BR>—2 at ease, comfortably, pleasantly, so as to give pleasure; अङ्के निधाय<BR> करभोरु यथासुखं ते संवाहयामि चरणावुत पद्मताम्रौ Ś. 3. 20; R. 9. 48;<BR> Ms. 4. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्थानम्
यथा + -स्थानम् the right or proper place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्थानम्
यथा + -स्थानम् + .({@-नम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 in the proper place; duly, properly.<BR>—2 instantly.<BR>—3 according to rank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्थित|यथास्थितं
यथा + -स्थित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 according to circumstances or actual facts, as it stands; रामं यथास्थितं<BR> सर्वं भ्राता ब्रूते स्म विह्वलः Bk. 6. 8.<BR>—2 right, proper, fit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्थितम्
यथा + -स्थित + .({@-तम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 truly, properly,<BR>—2 according to circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्थिति
यथा + -स्थिति <i>ind.</i> as usual, according to state or circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्थूलम्
यथा + -स्थूलम् <i>ind.</i> without details.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्व|यथास्वं
यथा + -स्व <i>a.</i> each according to (his or her) own; यथास्वान् जग्मुरालयान्<BR> Mb. 12. 44. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथास्वम्
यथा + -स्वम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 each his own, respectively; अध्यासते चीरभृतो यथास्वम् R. 13. 22; Ki. 14. 43.<BR>—2 individually; यथास्वमाश्रमैश्चक्रे वर्णैरपि षडंशभाक् R. 17. 65.<BR>—3 duly, properly, rightly; यथास्वं ग्राहकान्येषां शब्दादीनामिमानि तु<BR> Mb. 3. 211. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथावत्
यथावत् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Duly, fitly, properly, rightly; oft. with the force of an adjective;<BR> अध्यापिपद् गाधिसुतो यथावत् Bk. 2. 21; लिपेर्यथावद् ग्रहणेन R. 3. 28.<BR>—2 According to rule or precept, as enjoined by rules; ततो यथावद् विहिताध्वराय R. 5. 19; Ms. 6. 1, 8. 214.<BR>—3 Exactly, truly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्
यद् <i>pron. a.</i> (Nom. sing. <i>m.</i> यः, <i>f.</i> या, <i>n.</i><BR> यत्-द्) The relative pronoun corresponding to ‘who’, ‘which’ or ‘what’ in English.<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Its proper correlative is तद्; यस्य बुद्धिर्बलं तस्य; but<BR> sometimes इदम्, अदस्, एतद्, take the place of तद्; sometimes the<BR> relative is used alone, its antecedent being supplied from the context.<BR> Not unfrequently two relatives are used in the same sentence; या यस्य<BR> युज्यते भूमिका तां खलु भावेन तथैव सर्वे वर्ग्याःपाठिताः Māl. 1;<BR> यदेव रोचते यस्मै भवेत् तत् तस्य सुन्दरम्.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) When repeated, the relative pronoun has the sense of ‘totality’,<BR> and may be translated by ‘whoever’, ‘whatever’, in which case the correlative<BR> pronoun is generally repeated; यो यः शस्त्रं बिभर्ति स्वभुजगुरुबलः<BR> पाण्डवीनां चमूनां … क्रोधान्धस्तस्य तस्य स्वयमिह जगतामन्तकस्यान्तकोऽहम्<BR> Ve. 3. 30; क्रियते यद् यदेषा कथयति U. 1; यं यं पश्यसि तस्य<BR> तस्य पुरतो मा ब्रूहि दीनं वचः Bh. 2. 51. When joined with the interrogative<BR> pronoun or its derivatives with or without the particles चिद्, चन,<BR> वा, or अपि, it expresses the sense of ‘whatever’, ‘any whatsoever’,<BR> ‘any’; सूतो वा सूतपुत्रो वा यो वा को वा भवाम्यहम् Ve. 3. 33; येन<BR> केन प्रकारेण anyhow, somehow or other; यत्र कुत्रापि, यो वा को वा,<BR> यः कश्चन &c.; यत् किंचिदेतद् ‘this is a mere trifle’; यानि<BR> कानि च मित्राणि &c. ━<i>ind.</i> As an indeclinable यद् is frequently used<BR>—1 to introduce a direct or subordinate assertion with or without इति<BR> at the end; सत्योऽयं जनप्रवादो यत् संपत् संपदमनुबध्नातीति<BR> K. 73; तस्य कदाचिच्चिन्ता समुत्पन्ना यदर्थोत्पत्त्युपायाश्चिन्तनीयाः कर्तव्याश्च Pt. 1 or<BR>—2 in the sense of ‘because’, ‘since’; प्रियमाचरितं लते त्वया मे …<BR> यदियं पुनरप्यपाङ्गनेत्रा परिवृत्तार्धमुखी मयाद्य दृष्टा V. 1. 17;<BR> or किं शेषस्य भरव्यथा न वपुषि क्ष्मां न क्षिपत्येष यत्<BR> Mu. 2. 18; R. 1. 27, 87; in this sense यद् is often followed by तद्<BR> or ततः as its correlative; see<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">Page1303-2</a>]<BR> यत् प्रीतिमद्भिर्वदनैः स्वसाम्यात् … … ततस्तदीयाधरयावयोगात् …<BR> N. 22. 46.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यदपि, यदर्थम्, यदर्थे, यदवधि, यदात्मक, यत्कारणम्, यत्कारणात्, यत्कृते, यद्भाविष्यः, यद्वद, यद्वा, यद्वृत्तम्, यत्सत्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदपि
यद् + -अपि <i>ind.</i> although, though; वक्रः पन्था यदपि भवतः Me. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदर्थम्
यद् + -अर्थम्, -अर्थे <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 for which, wherefore, why, on which account; श्रूयतां यदर्थमस्मि<BR> हरिणा भवत्सकाशं प्रेषितः Ś. 6; Ku. 5. 52.<BR>—2 since, because; नूनं दैवं न शक्यं हि पुरुषेणातिवर्तितुम् । यदर्थं<BR> यत्नवानेव न लभे विप्रतां विभो ॥ Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदर्थे
यद् + -अर्थम्, -अर्थे <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 for which, wherefore, why, on which account; श्रूयतां यदर्थमस्मि<BR> हरिणा भवत्सकाशं प्रेषितः Ś. 6; Ku. 5. 52.<BR>—2 since, because; नूनं दैवं न शक्यं हि पुरुषेणातिवर्तितुम् । यदर्थं<BR> यत्नवानेव न लभे विप्रतां विभो ॥ Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदवधि
यद् + -अवधि <i>ind.</i> since which time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदात्मक
यद् + -आत्मक <i>a.</i> having which essence or existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्कारणम्
यद् + -कारणम्, -कारणात् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 wherefore, on which account.<BR>—2 since, because.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्कारणात्
यद् + -कारणम्, -कारणात् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 wherefore, on which account.<BR>—2 since, because.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्कृते
यद् + -कृते <i>ind.</i> wherefore, why, for which person or thing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्भाविष्यः
यद् + -भाविष्यः a fatalist (one who says ‘what will be will be’); यद्भविष्यो<BR> विनष्यति Pt. 1. 318.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्वद
यद् + -वद <i>a.</i> talking anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्वा
यद् + -वा <i>ind.</i> or else, whether; नैतद्विद्मः कतरन्नो गरीयो<BR> यद्वा जयेम यदि वा नो जयेयुः Bg. 2. 6; (often used by commentators<BR> in suggesting an alternative meaning).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्वृत्तम्
यद् + -वृत्तम् an adventure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यत्सत्यम्
यद् + -सत्यम् <i>ind.</i> to be sure, to speak the truth, truly, forsooth;<BR> अमङ्गलाशंसया वो वचनस्य यत् सत्यं कम्पितमिव मे हृदयम् Ve. 1;<BR> Mu. 1; Mk. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदीय|यदीयं
यदीय <i>a.</i> Whose, of whom or what.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदा
यदा <i>ind.</i> [यद् काले दाच]<BR>—1 When, at the time when; यदा यदा whenever; यदैव तदैव at<BR> the very time, as soon as; यद्राप्रभृति-तदाप्रभृति from what time-from<BR> that time forward.<BR>—2 If (= यदि); पत्रं नैव यदा करीरविटपे दोषो वसन्तस्य किम् Bh. 2. 93.<BR>—3 Whereas, since, as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदि
यदि <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 If, in case (showing condition, and in this sense generally used with<BR> the potential mood, but sometimes also with the future or present tense;<BR> it is usually followed by तर्हि and sometimes by ततः, तदा, तद्<BR> or अत्र); प्राणैस्तपोभिरथवाभिमतं मदीयैः कृत्यं घटेत सुहृदो<BR> यदि तत् कृतं स्यात् ॥ Māl. 1. 9; वदसि यदि किंचिदपि दन्तरुचिकौमुदी<BR> हरति दरतिमिरमतिघोरम् Gīt. 10; यत्ने कृते यदि न सिद्धपति<BR> कोत्र (= कस्तर्हि) दोषः H. Pr. 31.<BR>—2 Whether, if; वद प्रदोषे स्फुटचन्द्रतारका विभावरी यद्यरुणाय<BR> कल्पते Ku. 5. 44.<BR>—3 Provided that, when.<BR>—4 If perchance, perhaps; यदि तावदेवं क्रियताम् ‘perhaps you might do so’<BR>; पूर्वं स्पृष्टं यदि किल भवेदङ्गमेभिस्तवेति Me. 107; Y. 3. 104<BR> (यद्यपि means ‘though’, ‘although’; Śi. 16. 82; यद्यप्येते<BR> न पश्यन्ति लोभोपहतचेतसः Bg. 1. 38; Ś. 1. 30. यदि वा or;<BR> यद्वा जयेम यदि वा नो जयेयुः Bg. 2. 6; Bh. 2. 83; or perhaps, or<BR> rather, and if necessary; oft. expressed by the reflexive pronoun; स्नेहं<BR> दयां च सौख्यं च यदि वा जानकीमपि । आराधनाय लोकानां मुञ्चतो नास्ति<BR> मे व्यथा ॥ U. 1. 12, 4. 5.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदीय|यदीयं
यदीय <i>a.</i> relating to whom, whose, वाग्भूगौर्यादिभेदैर्विदुरिह<BR> मुनयो यां यदीयैश्च पुंसाम् Viṣṇupāda. S. 8; यदीयानां वाचाममृतमयमाचामति रसम् Bv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदुः|यदु
यदुः<BR>—1 N. of an ancient king, the eldest son of Yayāti and Devayānī and<BR> ancestor of the Yādavas.<BR>—2 N. of a country near Mathurā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यदुकुलोद्भवः, यदुनन्दनः, यदुश्रेष्ठः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदुकुलोद्भवः|यदुकुलोद्भव
यदुः + -कुलोद्भवः, -नन्दनः, -श्रेष्ठः epithets of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदुनन्दनः|यदुनन्दन|यदुनंदन
यदुः + -कुलोद्भवः, -नन्दनः, -श्रेष्ठः epithets of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदुश्रेष्ठः|यदुश्रेष्ठ
यदुः + -कुलोद्भवः, -नन्दनः, -श्रेष्ठः epithets of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छा
यदृच्छा [यद् ऋच्छ्-अ टाप् Tv.]<BR>—1 Acting as one likes, self-will, independence (of action); यदृच्छयासुयति<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">Page1304-1</a>]<BR> यस्तपस्यते Ki. 14. 21.<BR>—2 Chance, accident; usually used in the instrumental singular in this<BR> sense and translated by ‘accidentally’, ‘by chance’; किन्नरमिथुनं<BR> यदृच्छयाऽद्राक्षीत् K. ‘chanced or happened to see’ &c.; वसिष्ठधेनुश्च<BR> यदृच्छयाऽऽगता श्रुतप्रभावा ददृशेऽथ नन्दिनी R. 3. 40; V. 1. 10; Ku. 1. 14;<BR> U. 5. 16.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यदृच्छाभिज्ञः, यदृच्छाशब्दः, यदृच्छासंवादः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1303-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छाभिज्ञः|यदृच्छाभिज्ञ
यदृच्छा + -अभिज्ञः voluntary or self-offered witness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छाशब्दः|यदृच्छाशब्द
यदृच्छा + -शब्दः a proper name, a word like डित्थ, यज्ञदत्त &c. which<BR> denotes neither a genus nor species, nor any quality, action &c.; असंपादयतः<BR> कंचिदर्थं जातिक्रियागुणैः । यदृच्छाशब्दवत् पुंसः संज्ञायै जन्म केवलम् Śi. 2. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छासंवादः|यदृच्छासंवाद
यदृच्छा + -संवादः<BR>—1 accidental conversation.<BR>—2 spontaneous or incidental intercourse, accidental meeting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छातस्
यदृच्छातस् <i>ind.</i> Accidentally, by chance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छिकः|यदृच्छिक
यदृच्छिकः A son who offers himself for adoption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्तृ|यंतृ
यन्तृ <i>a.</i> [यम्-तृच्]<BR>—1 Restraining, curbing, controlling.<BR>—2 Guiding, directing. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A director, governor, ruler.<BR>—2 A driver (as of an elephant, carriage &c.), coachman, charioteer; यन्ता<BR> गजस्याभ्यपतद् गजस्थम् R. 7. 37; अथ यन्तारमादिश्य धुर्यान् विश्रामयेति<BR> सः 1. 54; Bhāg. 8. 11. 17; Ki. 7. 32; सव्योऽपि सानुनयमाकलनाय यन्त्रा Śi.<BR>—3 An elephant-driver or rider.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्र्|यंत्र्
यन्त्र् €1. €10 U. (यन्त्रति-ते, यन्त्रयति-ते)<BR>—1 To restrain, curb, check; शापयन्त्रितपौलस्त्यबलात्कारकचग्रहैः R. 10. 47.<BR>—2 To bind, fasten.<BR>—3 To force, oblige, compel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रम्
यन्त्रम् [यन्त्र्-अच्]<BR>—1 That which restrains or fastens, any prop or support, a stay; as in<BR> गृहयन्त्र (see the quotation under this word.).<BR>—2 A fetter, band, fastening, tie, thong, rein; छेदने चैव यन्त्राणाम् Ms. 8. 292.<BR>—3 A surgical instrument, especially a blunt instrument (opp. शस्त्र).<BR>—4 Any instrument or machine, an appliance, a contrivance, implement in<BR> general; कूपयन्त्र Mk. 10. 60 ‘a machine for drawing up water from a well’<BR>; so तैल˚ (cf. यन्त्रं तिलपीडनकम् Chandu Paṇdita on<BR> N. 10. 6, 22. 87); जल˚ &c.<BR>—5 A bolt, lock, key; यन्त्रैरुद्घाटयामास सोऽपश्यत् तत्र बालकम् Mb. 3. 309. 6.<BR>—6 Restraint, force.<BR>—7 An amulet, a mystical or astronomical diagram used as an amulet.<BR>—8 A boring machine; दन्तौघयन्त्रोद्भवश्वभ्राली N. 22. 150.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यन्त्रारूढ, यन्त्रालयः, यन्त्रोपलः, यन्त्रकरण्डिका, यन्त्रकर्मकृत्, यन्त्रकोविदः, यन्त्रगृहम्, यन्त्रगोलः, यन्त्रचेष्टितम्, यन्त्रतक्षन्, यन्त्रतोरणम्, यन्त्रदृढ, यन्त्रधारागृहम्, यन्त्रनालम्, यन्त्रपुत्रकः, यन्त्रपुत्रिका, यन्त्रपेषणी, यन्त्रप्रवाहः, यन्त्रबद्ध, यन्त्रमार्गः, यन्त्रमुक्तम्, यन्त्रविधिः, यन्त्रशरः, यन्त्रसद्मन्, यन्त्रसूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रारूढ
यन्त्रम् + -आरूढ <i>a.</i> mounted on the revolving engine; भ्रामयन् सर्वभूतानि<BR> यन्त्रारूढानि मायया Bg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रालयः|यन्त्रालय
यन्त्रम् + -आलयः a printing-press.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रोपलः|यन्त्रोपल|यंत्रोपल
यन्त्रम् + -उपलः a mill, mill-stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रकरण्डिका|यंत्रकरंडिका
यन्त्रम् + -करण्डिका a kind of magical basket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रकर्मकृत्|यंत्रकर्मकृत्
यन्त्रम् + -कर्मकृत् <i>m.</i> an artist, artisan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रकोविदः
यन्त्रम् + -कोविदः a mechanist; Rām. 2. 80. 2 (com. यन्त्रकोविदाः क्षेपणीयादियन्त्रकरणकुशलाः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रगृहम्
यन्त्रम् + -गृहम्<BR>—1 an oil-mill.<BR>—2 a manufactory.<BR>—3 a torture-chamber; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रगोलः|यन्त्रगोल
यन्त्रम् + -गोलः<BR>—1 a kind of pea.<BR>—2 a canon-ball.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रचेष्टितम्
यन्त्रम् + -चेष्टितम् any magical work, an enchantment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रतक्षन्
यन्त्रम् + -तक्षन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a constructor of machines.<BR>—2 a preparer of charms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रतोरणम्
यन्त्रम् + -तोरणम् a mechanical arch (fitted with contrivances to move it).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रदृढ
यन्त्रम् + -दृढ <i>a.</i> secured by a bolt (as a door).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रधारागृहम्
यन्त्रम् + -धारागृहम् a room fitted with<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">Page1304-2</a>]<BR> shower-bath; a bath-room.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रनालम्
यन्त्रम् + -नालम् a mechanical pipe or tube.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रपुत्रकः|यन्त्रपुत्रक|यंत्रपुत्रक
यन्त्रम् + -पुत्रकः, -पुत्रिका a mechanical doll, a puppet furnished with<BR> contrivances, such as strings, for moving the limbs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रपुत्रिका|यंत्रपुत्रिका
यन्त्रम् + -पुत्रकः, -पुत्रिका a mechanical doll, a puppet furnished with<BR> contrivances, such as strings, for moving the limbs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रपेषणी
यन्त्रम् + -पेषणी a hand-mill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रप्रवाहः|यन्त्रप्रवाह|यंत्रप्रवाह
यन्त्रम् + -प्रवाहः an artificial stream of water; यन्त्रप्रवाहैः शिशिरैः<BR> परीतान् R. 16. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रबद्ध
यन्त्रम् + -बद्ध <i>a.</i> having a mechanical contrivance; यन्त्रबद्धतलावपातं<BR> कारयेत् Kau. A. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रमार्गः|यन्त्रमार्ग|यंत्रमार्ग
यन्त्रम् + -मार्गः a canal or an aqueduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रमुक्तम्
यन्त्रम् + -मुक्तम् a kind of weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रविधिः|यन्त्रविधि
यन्त्रम् + -विधिः <i>m.</i> the science of surgical instruments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रशरः|यन्त्रशर|यंत्रशर
यन्त्रम् + -शरः an arrow or any missile shot off by means of machinery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रसद्मन्
यन्त्रम् + -सद्मन् <i>n.</i> an oil-mill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रसूत्रम्
यन्त्रम् + -सूत्रम् the cord attached to the mechanism of a doll or puppet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रकः|यन्त्रक|यंत्रक|यन्त्रकं|यंत्रकः
यन्त्रकः [यन्त्र्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 One well acquainted with machinery.<BR>—2 A mechanist; Rām. 2. 80. 1 (com. यन्त्रका जलप्रवाहादियन्त्रणसमर्थाः).<BR>—3 A restrainer, controller, subduer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रकम्
यन्त्रकः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A bandage (in medic.).<BR>—2 A turnerʼs wheel or lathe.<BR>—3 A hand-mill.<BR>—4 A sack; निधीयमाने भरभाजि यन्त्रके Śi. 12. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रणम्
यन्त्रणम्, -णा<BR> [यन्त्र्-ल्युट् वा टाप्]<BR>—1 Restraining, curbing, stopping; करयन्त्रणदन्तुरान्तरे व्यलिखच्चञ्चुपुटेन<BR> पक्षती N. 2. 2.<BR>—2 A restraint, restriction; check; ह्रीयन्त्रणां तत्क्षणमन्वभूवन्नन्योन्यलोलानि<BR> विलोचनानि Ku. 7. 75; R. 7. 23; गुरुजनयन्त्रणा K. 94.<BR>—3 Fastening, binding (बन्ध); निबिडपीनकुचद्वययन्त्रणा तमपराधमधात्<BR> प्रतिबध्नती N. 4. 10.<BR>—4 Force, compulsion, constraint, trouble, pain or anguish (arising from<BR> compulsion); अलमलमुपचारयन्त्रणया M. 4.<BR>—5 Guarding, protecting.<BR>—6 A bandage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रणा
यन्त्रणम्, -णा<BR> [यन्त्र्-ल्युट् वा टाप्]<BR>—1 Restraining, curbing, stopping; करयन्त्रणदन्तुरान्तरे व्यलिखच्चञ्चुपुटेन<BR> पक्षती N. 2. 2.<BR>—2 A restraint, restriction; check; ह्रीयन्त्रणां तत्क्षणमन्वभूवन्नन्योन्यलोलानि<BR> विलोचनानि Ku. 7. 75; R. 7. 23; गुरुजनयन्त्रणा K. 94.<BR>—3 Fastening, binding (बन्ध); निबिडपीनकुचद्वययन्त्रणा तमपराधमधात्<BR> प्रतिबध्नती N. 4. 10.<BR>—4 Force, compulsion, constraint, trouble, pain or anguish (arising from<BR> compulsion); अलमलमुपचारयन्त्रणया M. 4.<BR>—5 Guarding, protecting.<BR>—6 A bandage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रणी
यन्त्रणी, -यन्त्रिणी<BR> A wifeʼs younger sister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रिणी
यन्त्रणी, -यन्त्रिणी<BR> A wifeʼs younger sister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रिका
यन्त्रिका (= यन्त्रणी above) कनिष्ठा श्यालिका हाली यन्त्रिका केलिकुञ्चिका Hem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रित|यंत्रित|यन्त्रितः
यन्त्रित <i>p. p.</i> [यन्त्र्-क्त]<BR>—1 Restrained, checked, curbed, controlled, confined.<BR>—2 Fastened, bound; धन्या वयं यदस्माकं स्नेहकारुण्ययन्त्रिताः Mb. 3. 1. 33.<BR>—3 Fettered, chained.<BR>—4 Subject to.<BR>—5 Instigated; तेनैव शत्रुं जहि विष्णुयन्त्रितः Bhāg. 6. 11. 20.<BR>—6 Disciplined by rules; ब्राह्मणं यन्त्रिता राजन्नुपस्थास्यामि पूजया Mb. 3. 304. 1.<BR>—7 Drawn well (दृढाकृष्ट); ततः शरैर्दीप्तमुखैर्यन्त्रितैरनुमन्त्रितैः<BR> Mb. 3. 167. 26.<BR>—8 Attracted; अथवा मदभिस्नेहाद् भवत्यो यन्त्रिताशयाः Bhāg. 10. 29. 23.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यन्त्रितकथ, यन्त्रितवाच्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रितकथ
यन्त्रित + -कथ, -वाच् <i>a.</i> ‘tongue-tied’, forced to be silent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रितवाच्
यन्त्रित + -कथ, -वाच् <i>a.</i> ‘tongue-tied’, forced to be silent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्रिन्|यंत्रिन्
यन्त्रिन् <i>a.</i> or <i>s.</i><BR>—1 Furnished with harness or trappings (as a horse).<BR>—2 One who pains, a tormentor.<BR>—3 One who possesses an amulet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यभ्
यभ् €1 P. (यभति) To cohabit, have sexual intercourse with; देवाः<BR> कं जहसुर्वीक्ष्य सुतां यभितुमुद्यतम् Bhāg. 10. 85. 47, 3. 20. 26;<BR> यभस्व नित्यं यदि शक्तिरस्ति चेत् दिने दिने गच्छति नाथ यौवनम् Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यभनम्
यभनम् Sexual intercourse, copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1304-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यम्
यम् €1 P. (यच्छति, ययाम, अयंसीत्, यंस्यति, यन्तुम्, यत; <i>desid.</i> यियंसति)<BR>—1 To check, curb, restrain, control, subdue, stop, suppress; यच्छेद्<BR> वाङ्मनसी प्रज्ञः Kaṭh.; यतचित्तात्मन् Bg. 4. 21; see यत.<BR>—2 To offer, give, bestow.<BR>—3 Ved. To support, sustain.<BR>—4 To raise, lift up.<BR>—5 To extend, stretch.<BR>—6 To go.<BR>—7 To exhibit, show. ━<i>Caus.</i> (यमयति-ते) To restrain, check &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यम|यमः
यम <i>a.</i> [यम्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Twin, twin-born.<BR>—2 Coupled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमः|यम
यम + .{@-मः@}<BR>—1 Restraining, controlling, curbing; यमो राजा धार्मिकाणां मान्धातः<BR> परमेश्वरः Mb. 12. 91. 42.<BR>—2 Control, restraint.<BR>—3 Self-control.<BR>—4 Any great moral or religious duty or observance (opp. नियम);<BR> तप्तं यमेन नियमेन तपोऽमुनैव N. 13. 16; यमनियमकृशीकृतस्थिराङ्गः<BR> Ki. 10. 10. (यम and नियम are thus distinguished:− शरीरसाधनापेक्षं<BR> नित्यं यत् कर्म तद् यमः । नियमस्तु स यत् कर्म नित्यमागन्तुसाधनम् ॥<BR> Ak. 2. 49; see Malli. on Śi. 13. 23 and Ki. 10. 10 also. The <i>yamas</i><BR> are usually said to be ten, but, their names are given differently by<BR> different writers; <i>e. g.</i> ब्रह्मचर्यं दया क्षान्तिर्दानं सत्यमकल्कता ।<BR> अहिंसाऽस्तेयमाधुर्ये दमश्चेति यमाः स्मृताः ॥ Y. 3. 312; or आनृशंस्यं<BR> दया सत्यमहिंसा क्षान्तिरार्जवम् । प्रीतिः प्रसादो माधुर्यं मार्दवं च<BR> यमा दश ॥; sometimes only five <i>yamas</i> are mentioned:− अहिंसा<BR> सत्यवचनं ब्रह्मचर्यमकल्कता । अस्तेयमिति पञ्चैते यमाख्यानि व्रतानि च ॥).<BR>—5 The first of the eight <i>aṅgas</i> or means of attaining Yoga; the<BR> eight <i>aṅgas</i> are:− यमनियमासनप्राणायामप्रत्याहारधारणाध्यानसमाधयोऽष्टाङ्गानि;<BR> Śāṇḍilya Up. 1. 1. 2.<BR>—6 The god of death, death personified, regarded as a son of the sun;<BR> he presides over the पितृs and rules the spirits of the dead; दत्ताभये<BR> त्वयि यमादपि दण्डधारे U. 2. 11.<BR>—7 A twin; धर्मात्मजं प्रति यमौ च (<i>i. e.</i> नकुलसहदेवौ)<BR> कथैव नास्ति Ve. 2. 25; यमयोश्चैव गर्भेषु जन्मतो ज्येष्ठता मता Ms. 9. 126.<BR>—8 One of a pair or couple, a fellow.<BR>—9 N. of Saturn.<BR>—10 A crow.<BR>—11 A symbolical expression for the number ‘two’.<BR>—12 Ved. A rein, bridle; पृष्ठे सदो नसोर्यमः Rv. 5. 61. 2.<BR>—13 Ved. A driver, charioteer; अग्निं रथानां यमम् Rv. 8. 103. 10.<BR>—14 N. of a deity who chastises beings for their misdeeds; यमं कालं<BR> च मृत्युं च स्वर्गं संपूज्य चार्हतः Mb. 12. 200. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमम्
यम + .{@-मम्@}<BR>—1 A pair or couple.<BR>—2 (In gram.) The twin letter of any consonant. —3 Pitch of the voice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमी
यम + .{@-मी@} N. of the river Yamunā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमौ
यम + .{@-मौ@} (<i>m.</i> du.)<BR>—1 Twins; कथं त्वमेतौ धृतिसंयमौ यमौ Ki. 1. 36.<BR>—2 N. of the Aśvins; यमौ यमोपमौ चैव ददौ दानान्यनेकशः Mb. 14. 61. 38.<BR>—3 Nakula and Sahadeva; भीमार्जुनयमाश्चापि तद्युक्तं प्रतिपेदिरे<BR> Mb. 3. 6. 14. ˚मैथुनौ twins of different sex.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यमानुगः, यमानुचरः, यमानुजा, यमान्तकः, यमारिः, यमघ्नः, यमरिपुः, यमेशम्, यमकिङ्करः, यमकीटः, यमकीलः, यमकोटिः, यमकोटी, यमघण्टः, यमज,^1 यमदंष्ट्रा, यमदिश्, यमदूतः, यमदूतकः, यमदूतिका, यमदेवता, यमद्रुमः, यमद्वितीया, यमधानी, यमधारः, यमपटः, यमपट्टिका, यमपदम्, यमपाशः, यमपुरुषः, यमप्रियः, यमभगिनी, यमयातना, यमरथः, यमराज्, यमवाहनः, यमव्रतम्, यमशासनः, यमश्रायम्, यमसभा, यमसूर्यम्, यमस्वसृ<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमानुगः|यमानुग
यम + -अनुगः, -अनुचरः a servant or attendant of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमानुचरः|यमानुचर
यम + -अनुगः, -अनुचरः a servant or attendant of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमानुजा
यम + -अनुजा N. of the river Yamunā; मघोनि वर्षत्यसकृद् यमानुजा<BR> Bhāg. 10. 3. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमान्तकः|यमान्तक
यम + -अन्तकः an epithet of<BR>—1 Śiva.<BR>—2 of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमारिः|यमारि
यम + -अरिः, -घ्नः, -रिपुः &c. N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमघ्नः|यमघ्न
यम + -अरिः, -घ्नः, -रिपुः &c. N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमरिपुः
यम + -अरिः, -घ्नः, -रिपुः &c. N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमेशम्
यम + -ईशम् the Nakṣatra Bharaṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमकिङ्करः|यमकिङ्कर
यम + -किङ्करः a messenger of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमकीटः|यमकीट
यम + -कीटः<BR>—1 a wood-louse.<BR>—2 an earth-worm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमकीलः|यमकील
यम + -कीलः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमकोटिः|यमकोटि
यम + -कोटिः, -कोटी N. of a mythical town to the east of Laṅkā; लङ्का<BR> कुमध्ये यमकोटिरस्याः Sid. Śir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमकोटी
यम + -कोटिः, -कोटी N. of a mythical town to the east of Laṅkā; लङ्का<BR> कुमध्ये यमकोटिरस्याः Sid. Śir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमघण्टः|यमघण्ट
यम + -घण्टः N. of an astrological Yoga<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">Page1305-2</a>]<BR> (this is inauspicious).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमज|यमजः
यम + -ज^1 <i>a.</i> twin-born, twin; यमजौ चापि भद्रं ते नैतदन्यत्र<BR> विद्यते Mb. 3. 140. 19; भ्रातरौ आवां यमजौ U. 6, 4; also यमजात-जातक.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमदंष्ट्रा
यम + -दंष्ट्रा ‘Yamaʼs tooth’, the jaws of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमदंष्ट्राः
यम + -दंष्ट्रा + .({@-ष्ट्राः@} pl.) the last eight days of the month <i>Aśvina</i> and<BR> the whole of Kārtika (regarded as a period of general sickness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमदिश्
यम + -दिश् <i>f.</i> the south.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमदूतः|यमदूत
यम + -दूतः, -दूतकः<BR>—1 a messenger of death.<BR>—2 a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमदूतकः|यमदूतक
यम + -दूतः, -दूतकः<BR>—1 a messenger of death.<BR>—2 a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमदूतिका
यम + -दूतिका tamarind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमदेवता
यम + -देवता the asterism Bharaṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमद्रुमः|यमद्रुम
यम + -द्रुमः Bombax Heptaphyllum (Mar. सांवरी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमद्वितीया
यम + -द्वितीया the second day in the bright half of Kārtika when sisters<BR> entertain their brothers (Mar. भाऊबीज); cf. भ्रातृद्वितीया.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमधानी
यम + -धानी the abode of Yama; नरः संसारान्ते विशति यमधानीजवनिकाम् Bh. 3. 112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमधारः|यमधार
यम + -धारः a kind of double-edged weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमपटः|यमपट
यम + -पटः, -पट्टिका a piece of cloth on which Yama with his attendants<BR> and the punishments of hell are represented (Mar. यमपुरी); यावदेतद्<BR> गृहं प्रविश्य यमपटं दर्शयन् गीतानि गायामि Mu. 1. 18/19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमपट्टिका
यम + -पटः, -पट्टिका a piece of cloth on which Yama with his attendants<BR> and the punishments of hell are represented (Mar. यमपुरी); यावदेतद्<BR> गृहं प्रविश्य यमपटं दर्शयन् गीतानि गायामि Mu. 1. 18/19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमपदम्
यम + -पदम् a repeated word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमपाशः|यमपाश
यम + -पाशः the noose of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमपुरुषः|यमपुरुष
यम + -पुरुषः Yamaʼs servant or minister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमप्रियः|यमप्रिय
यम + -प्रियः the fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमभगिनी
यम + -भगिनी N. of the river Yamunā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमयातना
यम + -यातना the tortures inflicted by Yama upon sinners after death,<BR> (the word is sometimes used to denote ‘horrible tortures’, ‘extreme pain’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमरथः|यमरथ
यम + -रथः a buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमराज्
यम + -राज् <i>m.</i> Yama, the god of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमवाहनः|यमवाहन
यम + -वाहनः = यमरथः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमव्रतम्
यम + -व्रतम्<BR>—1 an observance or vow made to Yama.<BR>—2 an impartial punishment (as given by Yama); यथा यमः प्रियद्वेष्यौ<BR> प्राप्ते काले नियच्छति । तथा राज्ञा नियन्तव्याः प्रजास्तद् हि यमव्रतम् ॥<BR> Ms. 9. 307.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमशासनः
यम + -शासनः the lord Śiva; यशो यदीयं यमशासनालय-क्षमाधर-स्पर्धनमाचचार<BR> सः Rām. Ch. 2. 12; (यमशासनालयः = हिमालयः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमश्रायम्
यम + -श्रायम् the abode of Yama; यात यूयं यमश्रायं दिशं नायेन<BR> दक्षिणाम् Bk. 7. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमसभा
यम + -सभा the tribunal of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमसूर्यम्
यम + -सूर्यम् a building with two halls, one facing the west and the<BR> other facing the north.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमस्वसृ
यम + -स्वसृ <i>f.</i><BR>—1 N. of the river Yamunā; क्षणमिव पुलिने यमस्वसुस्ताम् Bhāg. 3. 4. 27.<BR>—2 N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमक|यमकं|यमकः
यमक <i>a.</i> [यम-स्वार्थे क]<BR>—1 Twin-born, twin.<BR>—2 Two-fold, double.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमकः|यमक|यमकं
यमक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A restraint, check.<BR>—2 A twin; one of a pair, a fellow.<BR>—3 A great moral or religious duty; see यम (4).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमकम्
यमक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A double bandage.<BR>—2 (In Rhet.) Repetition in the same stanza (in any part of it) of words<BR> or syllables similar in sound, but different in meaning, a kind of rhyme,<BR> (of which various kinds are enumerated; see Kāv. 3. 2-52); सभा नलश्रीयमकैर्यमाद्यैर्नलं<BR> विनाभूद् धृतदिव्यरत्नैः N. 10. 24; आवृत्तिं वर्णसंघातगोचरां यमकं<BR> विदुः Kāv. 1. 61, 3. 1; S. D. 640.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यमककाव्यम्, यमकभारतम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमककाव्यम्
यमक + -काव्यम् N. of an artificial poem (ascribed to घटकर्पर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमकभारतम्
यमक + -भारतम् a summary of the Mahā-Bhārata made by आनन्दतीर्थ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमदग्निः|यमदग्नि
यमदग्निः (v. l. for जमदग्निः q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमन|यमनं|यमनः
यमन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [यम् ल्यु ल्युट् वा] Restraining, curbing, governing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमनम्
यमन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 The act of restraining, curbing or binding.<BR>—2 Stopping, ceasing.<BR>—3 Cessation, rest.<BR>—4 Governing, managing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमनः|यमन|यमनं
यमन + .{@-नः@} The god of death, Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1305-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमनिका
यमनिका A curtain, screen; cf. जवनिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमल|यमलं|यमलः
यमल <i>a.</i> Twin, one of a couple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमलः|यमल|यमलं
यमल + .{@-लः@} The number ‘two’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमलौ
यमल + .{@-लौ@} (dual) A pair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमलम्
यमल + .{@-लम्, -ली@} A pair, couple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमली
यमल + .{@-लम्, -ली@} A pair, couple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमला
यमल + .{@-ला@} A kind of hiccough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमली
यमल + .{@-ली@} A dress consisting of two pieces.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यमलार्जुनौ, यमलच्छदः, यमलपत्रः, यमलपत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमलार्जुनौ|यमलार्ज्जुनौ
यमल + -अर्जुनौ two Arjuna trees (uprooted by Kṛṣṇa in childhood);<BR> Bhāg. 10. 10. 23-24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमलच्छदः|यमलच्छद
यमल + -छदः Bauhinia Variegata (Mar. कांचन-आपटा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमलपत्रः|यमलपत्र
यमल + -पत्रः N. of two trees (कोविदार and अश्मन्तक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमलपत्रम्
यमल + -पत्रम् The treaty of alliance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमवत्|यमवन्त्
यमवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 One who has restrained his passions, self-controlled; यमवतामवतां<BR> च धुरि स्थितः R. 9. 1.<BR>—2 Temperate, moderate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमसात्
यमसात् <i>ind.</i> In the hands of Yama, to the power of Yama; यमसात्<BR> कृ ‘to hand over to death’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमानिका
यमानिका, -यमानी<BR> Ptychotis Ajowan (Mar. ओंबा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमानी
यमानिका, -यमानी<BR> Ptychotis Ajowan (Mar. ओंबा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमायते
यमायते Den. Ā. To be like Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमिका
यमिका A kind of hiccough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमित
यमित <i>a.</i> [यम्-णिच्-क्त]<BR>—1 Restrained, curbed, checked.<BR>—2 Tied, held together; स्कन्धे स्रंसिनि चैकहस्तयमिताः पर्याकुला मूर्धजाः Ś. 1. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमिन्
यमिन् <i>a.</i> [यम्-णिनि, यम-इनि वा] Restraining, curbing &c.<BR>━<i>m.</i> One who has restrained his passions; यतिर्वशिष्ठो यमिनां वरिष्ठः<BR> Bk. 1. 15; अहिंसासत्यमस्तेयं ब्रह्मचर्यमकल्मषम् । इति पञ्च यमा<BR> येषां सन्तीति यमिनः स्मृताः ॥ J. N. V.; दधत्यन्तस्तत्त्वं किमपि<BR> यमिनस्तत् किल भवान् Śivamahimna 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमुना
यमुना<BR>—1 N. of a celebrated river (regarded as a sister of Yama).<BR>—2 N. of Durgā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यमुनापतिः, यमुनाभिद्, यमुनाभ्रातृ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमुनापतिः|यमुनापति
यमुना + -पतिः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमुनाभिद्
यमुना + -भिद् <i>m.</i> N. of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमुनाभ्रातृ
यमुना + -भ्रातृ <i>m.</i> Yama, the god of death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यमेरुका
यमेरुका A kind of gong on which the hours are struck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यम्य
यम्य <i>a.</i> Restrainable, to be curbed; P. III. 1. 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यम्या
यम्य + .{@-म्या@} Night; Naigh. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ययातिः|ययाति
ययातिः [यस्य वायोरिव यातिः सर्वत्र रथगतिर्यस्य Tv.] N.<BR> of a celebrated king of the lunar race, son of Nahuṣa; ययातेरिव शर्मिष्ठा<BR> भर्तुर्बहुमता भव Ś. 4. 7. [He married Devayānī, daughter of Śukra,<BR> and Śarmiṣṭhā, daughter of the king of Asuras, was told by her father<BR> to be her servant as a sort of recompense for her insulting conduct towards<BR> her on a previous occasion. (See Devayānī.) But Yayāti fell in love<BR> with this servant and privately married her. Aggrieved at this, Devayānī<BR> went to her father and complained of the conduct of her husband, on whom,<BR> therefore, Śukra inflicted premature infirmity and old age. Yayāti,<BR> however, propitiated him and obtained from him permission to transfer his<BR> decrepitude to any one who would consent to take it. He asked his five sons,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">Page1306-2</a>]<BR> but all refused except Puru, the youngest. Yayāti accordingly transferred<BR> his infirmity to Puru, and being once more in the prime of youth, passed<BR> his time in the enjoyment of sensual pleasures. This he did for 1000 years,<BR> and yet his desire was not satisfied. At last, however, with a vigorous<BR> effort he renounced his sensual life, restored his youth to Puru, and<BR> having made him successor to the throne, repaired to the woods to lead<BR> a pious life and meditate upon the Supreme Spirit.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ययावरः|ययावर
ययावरः = यायावर q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ययिः|ययि
ययिः, -यी <i>m.</i><BR> [cf. Uṇ. 3. 159]<BR>—1 A horse fit for the Aśvamedha (or any) sacrifice.<BR>—2 A horse in general.<BR>—3 A road.<BR>—4 N. of Śiva.<BR>—5 A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ययी
ययिः, -यी <i>m.</i><BR> [cf. Uṇ. 3. 159]<BR>—1 A horse fit for the Aśvamedha (or any) sacrifice.<BR>—2 A horse in general.<BR>—3 A road.<BR>—4 N. of Śiva.<BR>—5 A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ययिन्
ययिन् <i>m.</i> N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ययुः|ययु
ययुः [Uṇ. 1. 21]<BR>—1 A horse fit for a sacrifice; तूर्णमथ ययुमिवानुययुः Śi. 15. 69.<BR>—2 A horse (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यर्हि
यर्हि <i>ind.</i> [यद्-र्हिल्, cf. P. V. 3. 21]<BR>—1 When, while, whenever.<BR>—2 Because, as, since; (its proper correlative is तर्हि or एतर्हि,<BR> but it is seldom used in classical literature); अनुग्रहायास्त्वपि यर्हि<BR> मायया लसत्तुलस्या तनुवा विलक्षितः Bhāg. 3. 21. 20; यर्ह्यम्बुजाक्ष<BR> न लभेय भवत्प्रसादम् 10. 52. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवः|यव
यवः [यु-अच्]<BR>—1 Barley; यवाः प्रकीर्णा न भवन्ति शालयः Mk. 4. 17.<BR>—2 A barley-corn or the weight of a barley-corn; Ms. 8. 134.<BR>—3 A measure of length equal to ¹⁄₆ or ¹⁄₈ of an <i>aṅgula</i>.<BR>—4 A mark on the fingers of the hand resembling a barley-corn and supposed<BR> according to its position to indicate wealth, progeny, good fortune &c.;<BR> समग्रयवमच्छिद्रं पाणिपादं च वर्णवत् Rām. 6. 48. 13.<BR>—5 The first half of a month; also याव.<BR>—6 N. of a particular astronomical Yoga.<BR>—7 Speed, velocity; cf. जव.<BR>—8 A double convex lens.<BR>—9 N. of an island.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यवाङ्कुरः, यवप्ररोहः, यवाग्रजः, यवान्नम्, यवाम्लजम्, यवाग्रयणम्, यवक्षारः, यवाह्वः, यवापत्यम्, यवनालजः, यवजः, यवक्षोदः, यवचूर्णम्, यवपिष्टम्, यवतिक्ता, यवद्वीपः, यवनालः, यवफलः, यवमध्यः, यवलासः, यवशूकः, यवशूकजः, यवसुरम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवाङ्कुरः|यवाङ्कुर
यवः + -अङ्कुरः, -प्ररोहः a shoot or blade of barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवप्ररोहः|यवप्ररोह
यवः + -अङ्कुरः, -प्ररोहः a shoot or blade of barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवाग्रजः|यवाग्रज
यवः + -अग्रजः<BR>—1 = यवक्षार.<BR>—2 N. of a plant (यवानि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवान्नम्
यवः + -अन्नम् boiled barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवाम्लजम्
यवः + -अम्लजम् sour barley-gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवाग्रयणम्
यवः + -आग्रयणम् the first fruits of barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवक्षारः|यवक्षार
यवः + -क्षारः, -आह्वः, -अपत्यम्, -नालजः, -जः salt-petre, nitre, nitrate<BR> of potash; सौवर्चलं यवक्षारं सर्जिकां च हरीतकीम् Śiva B. 30. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवाह्वः|यवाह्व
यवः + -क्षारः, -आह्वः, -अपत्यम्, -नालजः, -जः salt-petre, nitre, nitrate<BR> of potash; सौवर्चलं यवक्षारं सर्जिकां च हरीतकीम् Śiva B. 30. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवापत्यम्
यवः + -क्षारः, -आह्वः, -अपत्यम्, -नालजः, -जः salt-petre, nitre, nitrate<BR> of potash; सौवर्चलं यवक्षारं सर्जिकां च हरीतकीम् Śiva B. 30. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनालजः|यवनालज
यवः + -क्षारः, -आह्वः, -अपत्यम्, -नालजः, -जः salt-petre, nitre, nitrate<BR> of potash; सौवर्चलं यवक्षारं सर्जिकां च हरीतकीम् Śiva B. 30. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवजः|यवज
यवः + -क्षारः, -आह्वः, -अपत्यम्, -नालजः, -जः salt-petre, nitre, nitrate<BR> of potash; सौवर्चलं यवक्षारं सर्जिकां च हरीतकीम् Śiva B. 30. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवक्षोदः|यवक्षोद
यवः + -क्षोदः, -चूर्णम्, -पिष्टम् barley-meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवचूर्णम्
यवः + -क्षोदः, -चूर्णम्, -पिष्टम् barley-meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवपिष्टम्
यवः + -क्षोदः, -चूर्णम्, -पिष्टम् barley-meal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवतिक्ता
यवः + -तिक्ता N. of a plant (शङ्खिनी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवद्वीपः|यवद्वीप
यवः + -द्वीपः the modern Jāvā island.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनालः|यवनाल
यवः + -नालः a kind of cereal plant and its grain (Mar. जोंधळा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवफलः|यवफल
यवः + -फलः<BR>—1 a bamboo.<BR>—2 spikenard.<BR>—3 the Kuṭaja tree.<BR>—4 the Plakṣa tree.<BR>—5 an onion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवमध्यः|यवमध्य|यवमध्यं
यवः + -मध्यः a kind of drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवमध्यम्
यवः + -मध्यः + .({@-ध्यम्, -ध्यमम्@})<BR>—1 a kind of चान्द्रायण or lunar penance; एतमेव विधिं कृत्स्नमाचरेद्<BR> यवमध्यमे । शुक्लपक्षादिनियतश्चरंश्चान्द्रायणं व्रतम् ॥ Ms. 11. 217.<BR>—2 a measure of length.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवमध्यमम्
यवः + -मध्यः + .({@-ध्यम्, -ध्यमम्@})<BR>—1 a kind of चान्द्रायण or lunar penance; एतमेव विधिं कृत्स्नमाचरेद्<BR> यवमध्यमे । शुक्लपक्षादिनियतश्चरंश्चान्द्रायणं व्रतम् ॥ Ms. 11. 217.<BR>—2 a measure of length.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवलासः|यवलास
यवः + -लासः saltpetre, nitre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवशूकः|यवशूक
यवः + -शूकः, -शूकजः an alkaline salt prepared from the ashes of burnt<BR> barley-straw, nitre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवशूकजः|यवशूकज
यवः + -शूकः, -शूकजः an alkaline salt prepared from the ashes of burnt<BR> barley-straw, nitre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवसुरम्
यवः + -सुरम् malt-liquor, beer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवकः|यवक
यवकः Barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1306-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवक्य|यवक्यं
यवक्य <i>a.</i> [यव-यत् कुक् च] Sown with or fit for barley<BR> (as a field); P. V. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवमत्|यवमन्त्
यवमत् <i>a.</i> Containing or mixed with barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनः|यवन
यवनः [यु-युच्]<BR>—1 A Greek, an Ionian.<BR>—2 Any foreigner, or barbarian; Ms. 10. 44; (the word is applied at present<BR> to a Mahomedan or a European also).<BR>—3 A carrot.<BR>—4 Olibanum.<BR>—5 A courser or swift horse.<BR>—6 Speed.<BR>—7 Wheat.<BR>—8 A kind of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनाः
यवनः + .{@-नाः@} (<i>m.</i> pl.)<BR>—1 The Ionians or Greeks.<BR>—2 The Greek astrologers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनम्
यवनः + .{@-नम्@} Mixing, mingling (esp. with water).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यवनारिः, यवनाचार्यः, यवनेष्टः, यवनदेशजम्, यवनद्विष्टः, यवनप्रियम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनारिः|यवनारि
यवनः + -अरिः N. of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनाचार्यः|यवनाचार्य|यवनाचार्य्य|यवनाचार्य्यः
यवनः + -आचार्यः the reputed author of astronomical book called Tājak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनेष्टः|यवनेष्ट|यवनेष्टं
यवनः + -इष्टः<BR>—1 a kind of garlic.<BR>—2 a kind of onion.<BR>—3 the Nimba tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनेष्टा
यवनः + -इष्टः + .({@-ष्टा@}) the wild date-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनेष्टम्
यवनः + -इष्टः + .({@-ष्टम्@})<BR>—1 lead.<BR>—2 an onion or garlic.<BR>—3 pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनदेशजम्
यवनः + -देशजम् benzoin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनद्विष्टः|यवनद्विष्ट
यवनः + -द्विष्टः bdellium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनप्रियम्
यवनः + -प्रियम् pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनानी
यवनानी (यवनानां लिपिः, यवन-आनुक् ङीप् च) The writing of the Yavanas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनिका
यवनिका, -यवनी<BR>—1 A Yavana female, a Greek or Mahomedan woman; यवनी नवनीतकोमलाङ्गी<BR> Jag.; यवनीमुखपद्मानां सेहे मधुमदं न सः R. 4. 61; (from dramas<BR> it appears that Yavana girls were formerly employed as attendants on kings<BR> particularly to be in charge of their bows and quivers; cf. एष बाणासनहस्ताभिर्यवनीभिः<BR> परिवृत इत एवागच्छति प्रियवयस्यः Ś. 2; प्रविश्य शार्ङ्गहस्ता<BR> यवनी Ś. 6; प्रविश्य चापहस्ता यवनी V. 5 &c.).<BR>—2 A curtain; काञ्चुकीयो यवनिकास्तरणं करोति Pratimā 2; cf. जवनिका.<BR>—3 A veil; पश्यामस्तावद् रूपसादृश्यम् । संक्षिप्यतां यवनिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवनी
यवनिका, -यवनी<BR>—1 A Yavana female, a Greek or Mahomedan woman; यवनी नवनीतकोमलाङ्गी<BR> Jag.; यवनीमुखपद्मानां सेहे मधुमदं न सः R. 4. 61; (from dramas<BR> it appears that Yavana girls were formerly employed as attendants on kings<BR> particularly to be in charge of their bows and quivers; cf. एष बाणासनहस्ताभिर्यवनीभिः<BR> परिवृत इत एवागच्छति प्रियवयस्यः Ś. 2; प्रविश्य शार्ङ्गहस्ता<BR> यवनी Ś. 6; प्रविश्य चापहस्ता यवनी V. 5 &c.).<BR>—2 A curtain; काञ्चुकीयो यवनिकास्तरणं करोति Pratimā 2; cf. जवनिका.<BR>—3 A veil; पश्यामस्तावद् रूपसादृश्यम् । संक्षिप्यतां यवनिका.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवसम्
यवसम् Grass, fodder, meadow grass; नागेन्द्रा यवसाभिलाषविमुखाः<BR> Pratimā 2. 2; Kau. A. 1. 4; यवसेन्धनम् Pt. 1; Y. 3. 30; Ms. 7. 75;<BR> (गां) यवसमिच्छतीम् Bhāg. 1. 17. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवागू
यवागू <i>f.</i> [यूयते मिश्र्यते यु-आगू] Rice gruel, sour gruel<BR> made from rice or from any other kind of grain, such as barley; यवागूर्विरलद्रवा<BR> Suśr.; Mb. 12. 193. 22; मूत्राय कल्पते यवागूः Mbh.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यवागूचारकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवागूचारकः|यवागूचारक
यवागू + -चारकः the lay-brother who prepares यवागू.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवानिका
यवानिका, -यवानी<BR>—1 A kind of bad barley; (दुष्टो यवो यवानी).<BR>—2 See यवनिका.<BR>—3 Ptychotic Ajowan (Mar. ओंवा); यवानी पाचनी रुच्या तीक्ष्णोग्रा कटुका<BR> लघुः Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवानी
यवानिका, -यवानी<BR>—1 A kind of bad barley; (दुष्टो यवो यवानी).<BR>—2 See यवनिका.<BR>—3 Ptychotic Ajowan (Mar. ओंवा); यवानी पाचनी रुच्या तीक्ष्णोग्रा कटुका<BR> लघुः Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवासः|यवास
यवासः<BR>—1 A kind of Khadira.<BR>—2 Alhagi Maurorum (Mar. धमासा).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यवासशर्करा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवासशर्करा
यवासः + -शर्करा a kind of sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवासिनी
यवासिनी A district abounding in Yavāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यविष्ठ|यविष्ठः
यविष्ठ <i>a.</i> Youngest, very young, (superl. of युवन् q. v.);<BR> भ्रातुर्यविष्ठस्य सुतान् Bhāg.; त्रिनयन यविष्ठाय च नमः Śivamahimna 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यविष्ठः|यविष्ठ
यविष्ठ + .{@-ष्ठः@}<BR>—1 The youngest brother.<BR>—2 N. of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यवीयस्
यवीयस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Younger, very young (compar. of युवन् q. v.); अवाच्यो दीक्षितो<BR> नाम्ना यवीयानपि यो भवेत् Ms. 2. 128.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">Page1307-2</a>]<BR>—2 Lesser, worse (हीन); पापायैव हि सृष्टोऽसि कर्मणेह यवीयसे<BR> Mb. 12. 150. 13. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A younger brother.<BR>—2 A Śūdra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यव्य|यव्यं|यव्यः
यव्य <i>a.</i> [यवानां क्षेत्रं यव-यत्]<BR>—1 Sown with or consisting of barley.<BR>—2 Suitable or fit for barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यव्यः|यव्य|यव्यं
यव्य + .{@-व्यः@} A month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यव्यम्
यव्य + .{@-व्यम्@} A field of barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशदम्
यशदम् A kind of mineral, zinc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्
यशस् <i>a.</i> [अश् स्तुतौ असुन् धातोः ल्युट् च Uṇ. 4. 190]<BR>—1 Lovely, agreeable, worthy. —2 Honoured. ━<i>n.</i> Fame, reputation, glory,<BR> renown; विस्तीर्यते यशो लोके तैलबिन्दुरिवाम्भसि Ms. 7. 34; यशस्तु<BR> रक्ष्यं परतो यशोधनैः R. 3. 48, 2. 40.<BR>—2 An object of glory or respect, a person of distinction.<BR>—3 Ved. Beauty, splendour.<BR>—4 Favour, partiality.<BR>—5 Wealth.<BR>—6 Food.<BR>—7 Water.<BR>—8 An assemblage of rare merits; यावद् हि प्रथते लोके पुरुषस्य यशो<BR> भुवि । तावत् तस्याक्षया कीर्तिर्भवतीति विनिश्चिता ॥ Mb. 12. 54. 32 (com.<BR> यशः परचित्तचमत्कृतिजनको गुणौघः).<BR>—9 An indirect fame (परोक्षकीर्ति); तपति च कीर्त्या यशसा ब्रह्मवर्चसेन<BR> Ch. Up. 3. 18. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यशःकर, यशस्काम, यशःकायम्, यशःशरीरम्, यशोद, यशोधन, यशोधर, यशोधा, यशःपटहः, यशःप्रख्यापनम्, यशोभृत्, यशःशेष, यशोहर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशःकर
यशस् + -कर <i>a.</i> (यशस्कर) conferring glory, glorious; साम्राज्यकृत्<BR> सजात्येषु लोके चैव यशस्करः Ms. 8. 387.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्काम
यशस् + -काम <i>a.</i> (यशस्काम)<BR>—1 desirous of getting fame.<BR>—2 aspiring, ambitious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशःकायम्
यशस् + -कायम्, -शरीरम् body in the form of fame; यशःशरीरे भव<BR> मे दयालुः R. 2. 24; नास्ति येषां यशःकाये जरामरणजं भयम् Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशःशरीरम्
यशस् + -कायम्, -शरीरम् body in the form of fame; यशःशरीरे भव<BR> मे दयालुः R. 2. 24; नास्ति येषां यशःकाये जरामरणजं भयम् Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशोद|यशोदः
यशस् + -द <i>a.</i> (यशोद)<BR> conferring fame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशोदः|यशोद
यशस् + -द + .({@-दः@}) (येन वायुना शीद्यते शद् अच्) quicksilver; यशदं<BR> रङ्गसदृशं रीतिहेतुश्च तन्मतम् Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशोदा
यशस् + -द + .({@-दा@}) N. of the wife of Nanda and foster-mother of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशोधन
यशस् + -धन <i>a.</i> or <i>s.</i> one whose wealth or valued treasure is<BR> fame, rich in fame, very renowned; अपि स्वदेहात् किमुतेन्द्रियार्थाद् यशोधनानां<BR> हि यशो गरीयः R. 14. 35, 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशोधर
यशस् + -धर <i>a.</i> (यशोधर) keeping up or preserving glory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशोधा
यशस् + -धा <i>a.</i> conferring fame; कच्चिद् यशोधा रथयूथपानां गाण्डीवधन्वोपरतारिरास्ते<BR> Bhāg. 3. 1. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशःपटहः|यशःपटह
यशस् + -पटहः (यशःपटहः) a double drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशःप्रख्यापनम्
यशस् + -प्रख्यापनम् (यशःप्रख्यापनम्) spreading or proclaiming the glory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशोभृत्
यशस् + -भृत् <i>a.</i> (यशोभृत्) famous, renowned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशःशेष|यशःशेषः
यशस् + -शेष <i>a.</i> remaining only in fame, having nothing left behind<BR> except glory <i>i. e.</i> dead; cf. कीर्तिशेष.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशःशेषः|यशःशेष
यशस् + -शेष + .({@-षः@}) death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशोहर
यशस् + -हर <i>a.</i> (यशोहर)<BR> taking away fame, dishonouring, ignominious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्य
यशस्य <i>a.</i> [यशसे हितं यत्]<BR>—1 Leading to glory or distinction; आयुष्यं प्राङ्मुखो भुङ्क्ते यशस्यं<BR> दक्षिणामुखः Ms. 2. 52.<BR>—2 Renowned, famous, glorious; धन्यं यशस्यमायुष्यं स्वर्ग्यं वातिथिपूजनम् Ms. 3. 106.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्या
यशस्य + .{@-स्या@} N. of a plant (जीवन्ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्यति
यशस्यति, यशस्काम्यति Den. P. To long for fame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्काम्यति
यशस्यति, यशस्काम्यति Den. P. To long for fame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्विन्
यशस्विन् <i>a.</i> [यशस्-विनि]<BR>—1 Famous, glorious, renowned; विप्राणां वेदविदुषां गृहस्थानां यशस्विनाम् Ms. 10. 334.<BR>—2 Excellent, best.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यशस्विनी
यशस्विन् + .{@-नी@} The wild cotton tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टिः|यष्टि
यष्टिः, -ष्टी <i>f.</i><BR> [यज्-क्तिन् नि˚ न संप्रसारणम्]<BR>—1 A stick, staff.<BR>—2 A cudgel, mace, club.<BR>—3 A column, pillar, pole; संक्रमध्वजयष्टीनां प्रतिमानां च भेदकः Ms. 9. 285.<BR>—4 A<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">Page1308-1</a>]<BR> perch, as in वासयष्टि.<BR>—5 A stem, support.<BR>—6 A flagstaff; as in ध्वजयष्टि.<BR>—7 A stalk, stem.<BR>—8 A branch, twig; कदम्बयष्टिः स्फुटकोरकेव U. 3. 42; so चूतयष्टिः<BR> Ku. 6. 2; सालस्य यष्टिः Rām. 2. 20. 32; सहकारयष्टिः &c.<BR>—9 A string, thread (as of pearls), a necklace; विमुच्य सा हारमहार्यनिश्चया<BR> विलोलयष्टिप्रविलुप्तचन्दनम् Ku. 5. 8; क्वचित् प्रभालेपिभिरिन्द्रनीलैः<BR> मुक्तामयी यष्टिरिवानुविद्धा R. 13. 54.<BR>—10 Any creeping plant.<BR>—11 Anything thin, slim, or slender (at the end of comp. after words meaning<BR> ‘the body’); तं वीक्ष्य वेपथुमती सरसाङ्गयष्टिः Ku. 5. 85 ‘with her slender or delicate frame perspiring’<BR>.<BR>—12 A reed.<BR>—13 The arm.<BR>—14 Liquorice.<BR>—15 Sugar-cane.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यष्ट्याघातः, यष्ट्युत्थानम्, यष्टिग्रहः, यष्टिनिवासः, यष्टिप्राण, यष्टिमधु, यष्टियन्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टी
यष्टिः, -ष्टी <i>f.</i><BR> [यज्-क्तिन् नि˚ न संप्रसारणम्]<BR>—1 A stick, staff.<BR>—2 A cudgel, mace, club.<BR>—3 A column, pillar, pole; संक्रमध्वजयष्टीनां प्रतिमानां च भेदकः Ms. 9. 285.<BR>—4 A<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">Page1308-1</a>]<BR> perch, as in वासयष्टि.<BR>—5 A stem, support.<BR>—6 A flagstaff; as in ध्वजयष्टि.<BR>—7 A stalk, stem.<BR>—8 A branch, twig; कदम्बयष्टिः स्फुटकोरकेव U. 3. 42; so चूतयष्टिः<BR> Ku. 6. 2; सालस्य यष्टिः Rām. 2. 20. 32; सहकारयष्टिः &c.<BR>—9 A string, thread (as of pearls), a necklace; विमुच्य सा हारमहार्यनिश्चया<BR> विलोलयष्टिप्रविलुप्तचन्दनम् Ku. 5. 8; क्वचित् प्रभालेपिभिरिन्द्रनीलैः<BR> मुक्तामयी यष्टिरिवानुविद्धा R. 13. 54.<BR>—10 Any creeping plant.<BR>—11 Anything thin, slim, or slender (at the end of comp. after words meaning<BR> ‘the body’); तं वीक्ष्य वेपथुमती सरसाङ्गयष्टिः Ku. 5. 85 ‘with her slender or delicate frame perspiring’<BR>.<BR>—12 A reed.<BR>—13 The arm.<BR>—14 Liquorice.<BR>—15 Sugar-cane.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यष्ट्याघातः, यष्ट्युत्थानम्, यष्टिग्रहः, यष्टिनिवासः, यष्टिप्राण, यष्टिमधु, यष्टियन्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1307-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्ट्याघातः|यष्ट्याघात
यष्टिः + -आघातः cudgeling, beating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्ट्युत्थानम्
यष्टिः + -उत्थानम् rising with the help of a staff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टिग्रहः|यष्टिग्रह
यष्टिः + -ग्रहः a club-bearer, staff-bearer; P. III. 2. 9. Vārt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टिनिवासः|यष्टिनिवास
यष्टिः + -निवासः<BR>—1 a stick or rod serving as a perch for peacocks &c.; वृक्षेशया यष्टिनिवासभङ्गात् R. 16. 14.<BR>—2 a pigeon-house resting on upright poles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टिप्राण
यष्टिः + -प्राण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 feeble or powerless.<BR>—2 out of breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टिमधु
यष्टिः + -मधु <i>n.</i>, {@मधुका@} liquorice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टियन्त्रम्
यष्टिः + -यन्त्रम् <i>n.</i> a particular astronomical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टिकः|यष्टिक
यष्टिकः<BR>—1 A lap-wing.<BR>—2 A kind of water fowl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टिका
यष्टिका<BR>—1 A staff, stick, pole, club.<BR>—2 A pearl-necklace (of one string).<BR>—3 An oblong pond or tank.<BR>—4 Liquorice; also यष्टीकम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टी
यष्टी See यष्टि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यष्टृ
यष्टृ <i>m.</i> [यज्-तृच्] A worshipper, sacrificer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यस्
यस् €1. €4 P. (यसति, यस्यति, यस्त) To strive, endeavour, labour.<BR>━<i>Caus.</i> (यासयति-ते) To put to trouble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यस्त
यस्त <i>a.</i> Entrusted, deposited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यस्मात्
यस्मात् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 From which, since, as.<BR>—2 That, in order that.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यहु|यहुः
यहु <i>a.</i> Ved. Great.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यहुः|यहु
यहु + .{@-हुः@} A child, offspring (पुत्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यह्व|यह्वः
यह्व <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Great, powerful.<BR>—2 Active, restless, continually moving. ━<i>m.</i> An employer of priests<BR> for sacrifices; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यह्वी
यह्व + .{@-ह्वी@} A river. ━<i>f.</i> (dual) An epithet of<BR>—1 Heaven and earth.<BR>—2 Of night and day.<BR>—3 Of morning and evening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

या
या €2 P. (याति, ययौ, अयासीत्, यास्यति, यातुम्, यात)<BR>—1 To go, move, walk, proceed; ययौ तदीयामवलम्ब्य चाङ्गुलिम् R. 3. 25;<BR> अन्वग्ययौ मध्यमलोकपालः 2. 16.<BR>—2 To march against, invade; तदा यायाद् विगृह्यैव व्यसने चोत्थिते रिपोः Ms. 7. 183.<BR>—3 To go to, march towards, set out for (with acc., dat. or with प्रति).<BR>—4 To pass away, withdraw, depart; यातु प्रस्तुतमनुसंधीयताम् H. 3<BR> ‘let it go or pass, never mind it’<BR>—5 To vanish, disappear; यातस्तवापि च विवेकः Bv. 1. 66; भाग्यक्रमेण<BR> हि धनानि भवन्ति यान्ति Mk. 1. 13.<BR>—6 To pass away or by, elapse (as time); यौवनमनिवर्ति यार्तं तु K. P. 10.<BR>—7 To last.<BR>—8 To happen, come to pass.<BR>—9 To go or be reduced to any state, be or become (usually with the acc.<BR> of abstract noun).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">Page1308-2</a>]<BR>—10 To undertake; न त्वस्य सिद्धौ यास्यामि सर्गव्यापारमात्मना Ku. 2. 54.<BR>—11 To have carnal intercourse with.<BR>—12 To request, implore.<BR>—13 To find out, discover.<BR>—14 To behave, act. (The meanings of या, like those of गम्, are<BR> variously modified according to the noun with which it is connected; <i>e. g.</i><BR> नीशं या to be destroyed; वाच्यतां या to incur blame or censure;<BR> लघुतां या to be slighted; प्रकृतिं या to regain oneʼs natural<BR> state; निद्रां या to fall asleep; वशं या to submit, go into oneʼs<BR> possession; उदयं या to rise; अस्तं या to set, decline; पारं<BR> या to reach the other side of, to master, surmount, get over; पदं<BR> या to attain to the position of; अग्रे या to go before, take the<BR> lead, lead; अधो या to sink; विपर्यासं या to undergo a change,<BR> to be changed in appearance; शिरसा महीं या to bend the head down<BR> to the ground &c.). ━<i>Caus.</i> (यापयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to go or proceed.<BR>—2 To remove, drive away; प्रमदया मदयापितलज्जया R. 9. 31.<BR>—3 To spend, pass (time); तावत् कोकिल विरसान् यापय दिवसान् Bv. 1. 7; Me. 91.<BR>—4 To live or spend time with; विनयादिव यापयन्ति ते धृतराष्ट्रात्मजमात्मसिद्धये Ki. 2. 45.<BR>—5 To support, nourish.<BR>—6 To give sendoff; स्नेहप्रक्लिन्नहृदयो यापयामास कोशलः Bhāg. 10. 58. 52.<BR>━<i>Desid.</i> (यियासति) To wish to go, to be about<BR> to go &c. ━<i>With</i> {@अति@}<BR>—1 to go beyond, transgress, violate.<BR>—2 to surpass. ━{@अधि@} to go away or forth; escape; कुतो ऽधियास्यसि<BR> क्रूर निहतस्तेन पत्रिभिः Bk. 8. 90.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात|यातं|यातः
यात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Gone, marched, walked.<BR>—2 Passed, departed, gone away.<BR>—3 Passed by, elapsed.<BR>—4 Attained, reduced or gone to (a state &c.). (See या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातम्
यात + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Going, motion; विद्वान् विदामास शनैर्न यातम् Śi. 3. 32; यातं<BR> यच्च नितम्बयोर्गुरुतया Ś. 2. 2.<BR>—2 A march.<BR>—3 The act of driving an elephant with a goad; Mātaṅga L. 8. 22.<BR>—4 The past time.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यातयाम, यातयामन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातयाम|यातयामं
यात + -याम, -यामन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 stale, used, spoiled, rejected, become useless; (हविराज्यं … …)<BR> नैतानि यातयामानि कुर्वन्ति पुनरध्वरे Rām. 2. 61. 17; छन्दांस्ययातयामानि<BR> योजितानि धृतव्रतैः Bhāg. 4. 13. 27; अयातयामं वयः Dk.<BR>—2 raw, half-cooked (as food); यातयामं गतरसं पूति पर्युषितं च<BR> यत् Bg. 17. 10.<BR>—3 aged, exhausted, worn out; यातयामं विजितवान् स रामं यदि किं<BR> ततः Bk. 5. 39; अयातयामास्तस्यासन् यामाः स्वान्तरयापनाः Bhāg. 3. 22. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातयामन्
यात + -याम, -यामन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 stale, used, spoiled, rejected, become useless; (हविराज्यं … …)<BR> नैतानि यातयामानि कुर्वन्ति पुनरध्वरे Rām. 2. 61. 17; छन्दांस्ययातयामानि<BR> योजितानि धृतव्रतैः Bhāg. 4. 13. 27; अयातयामं वयः Dk.<BR>—2 raw, half-cooked (as food); यातयामं गतरसं पूति पर्युषितं च<BR> यत् Bg. 17. 10.<BR>—3 aged, exhausted, worn out; यातयामं विजितवान् स रामं यदि किं<BR> ततः Bk. 5. 39; अयातयामास्तस्यासन् यामाः स्वान्तरयापनाः Bhāg. 3. 22. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यागः|याग
यागः [यज् घञ् कुत्वम्]<BR>—1 An offering, a sacrifice, an oblation; इष्टिर्यागः ŚB. on MS. 6. 8. 7.<BR>—2 Any ceremony in which oblations are presented, with a direct reference<BR> to a deity; प्रत्यक्षदेवतासम्बद्धो हि त्यागो यागः ŚB. on MS. 9. 4. 47;<BR> ऋषिदेवगणस्वधाभुजां श्रुतयागप्रसवैः स पार्थिवः (अनृणत्वमुपेयिवान्) R. 8. 30.<BR>—3 Presentation, grant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यागेश्वरः, यागकण्टकः, यागकरणम्, यागसंतानः, यागसंप्रदानम्, यागसूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यागेश्वरः|यागेश्वर
यागः + -ईश्वरः a certain crystal phallus of Śiva; यस्यासौ जलदेवतास्फटिकभूर्जागर्ति<BR> यागेश्वरः N. 12. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यागकण्टकः|यागकण्टक
यागः + -कण्टकः a bad sacrificer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यागकरणम्
यागः + -करणम् a sacrificial ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यागसंतानः|यागसन्तान
यागः + -संतानः N. of Jayanta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यागसंप्रदानम्
यागः + -संप्रदानम् the recipient of a sacrifice. Kāśi. on P. IV. 2. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यागसूत्रम्
यागः + -सूत्रम् the sacrificial sacred thread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याच्
याच् €1 Ā. (याचते; rarely याचति, याचित)<BR>—1 To beg, ask, solicit, request, entreat, implore (with two acc.);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">Page1309-1</a>]<BR> बलिं याचते वसुधाम् Sk.; पितरं प्रणिपत्य पादयोरपरित्यागमयाचतात्मनः<BR> R. 8. 12; Bk. 14. 105; R. 11. 1.<BR>—2 To demand in marriage; तां याचते नरपतेर्नर्मसुहृन्नन्दनो नृपमुखेन Māl. 1. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1308-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचकः|याचक
याचकः (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [याच्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A mendicant, beggar; तृणादपि लघुस्तूलस्तूलादपि च याचकः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 A petitioner, suppliant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: याचकवृत्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचकवृत्तिः|याचकवृत्ति
याचकः + -वृत्तिः the occupation or profession of a beggar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचनम्
याचनम्, -ना<BR> [याच्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Asking, begging, entreating, soliciting.<BR>—2 A request, an entreaty, a petition; याचना माननाशाय; बध्यतामभययाचनाञ्जलिः R. 11. 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचना
याचनम्, -ना<BR> [याच्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Asking, begging, entreating, soliciting.<BR>—2 A request, an entreaty, a petition; याचना माननाशाय; बध्यतामभययाचनाञ्जलिः R. 11. 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचनकः|याचनक
याचनकः A beggar, suitor, petitioner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचिष्णु
याचिष्णु <i>a.</i> Disposed to beg, habitually begging or soliciting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचिष्णुता
याचिष्णुता the habit of soliciting favours; याचिष्णुता प्रमादश्च<BR> तामसं गुणलक्षणम् Ms. 12. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचित|याचितं
याचित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Asked, solicited, begged, entreated, requested.<BR>—2 Requisite, necessary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचितम्
याचित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 The profession of a beggar.<BR>—2 Begging, asking (याचना); कर्तुमिच्छति न याचितं वृथा Ki. 13. 60.<BR>—3 Alms obtained by begging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचितकम्
याचितकम् A thing got by begging, anything borrowed for use; अभ्यर्थ्य<BR> धत्तः खलु पद्मचन्द्रौ विभूषणं याचितकं कदाचित् N. 7. 56; याचितकमण्डनमिव<BR> छन्दानुवर्ती परिजनः Yaśastilaka chapt. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याचितृ
याचितृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A beggar.<BR>—2 A petitioner.<BR>—3 A suitor (for a girl); अयाचितारं न हि देवदेवमद्रिः सुतां ग्राहयितुं<BR> शशाक Ku. 1. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याच्ञा
याच्ञा [याच्-नङ्]<BR>—1 Begging, asking.<BR>—2 Mendicancy.<BR>—3 Request, solicitation, entreaty; याच्ञा मोघा वरमधिगुणे नाधमे लब्धकामा Me. 6.<BR>—4 Making an offer of marriage.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: याच्ञाजीवनम्, याच्ञाभङ्गः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याच्ञाजीवनम्
याच्ञा + -जीवनम् subsisting by begging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याच्ञाभङ्गः|याच्ञाभङ्ग
याच्ञा + -भङ्गः useless request.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याच्यम्
याच्यम् Making a request; याच्यमाहुरनीशस्य अभिहारं च भारत Mb. 13. 60. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याच्यता
याच्यता To be wooed or honoured (प्रार्थनीयता); यदा यास्यन्ति<BR> पुरुषाः स्त्रियो नार्हन्ति याच्यताम् Mb. 12. 266. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजः|याज
याजः [यज्-घञ्]<BR>—1 A sacrificer.<BR>—2 Boiled rice.<BR>—3 Food in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजकः|याजक
याजकः [यज्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A sacrificer, a sacrificing priest; अयाजयन् महाराजं याजका देववर्चसः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 74. 16.<BR>—2 A royal elephant.<BR>—3 An elephant in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजनम्
याजनम् [यज् णिच्-ल्युट्] The act of performing or conducting a<BR> sacrifice; अध्यापनमध्ययनं यजनं याजनं तथा । दानं प्रतिग्रहं<BR> चैव ब्राह्मणानामकल्पयत् ॥ Ms. 1. 88, 3. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजमानम्
याजमानम् That part of a sacrifice which is performed by the Yajamāna himself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजयितृ
याजयितृ <i>m.</i> The officiating priest at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजिः|याजि
याजिः The institutor of a sacrifice. ━<i>f.</i> A sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजिन्
याजिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 (At the end of comp.) Sacrificing; सोमयाजिन्.<BR>—2 Worshipping, adoring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजुकः|याजुक
याजुकः A sacrificer (as इष्टियाजुक); Bṛ. Up. 1. 5. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजुष|याजुषं|याजुषः
याजुष <i>a.</i> (-षी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [यजुस्-अण्] Relating to the Yajurveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याजुषः|याजुष|याजुषं
याजुष + .{@-षः@}<BR>—1 A follower of the Yajurveda.<BR>—2 A partridge (तित्तिर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञवल्क्यः|याज्ञवल्क्य
याज्ञवल्क्यः N. of a celebrated ancient sage, the first reputed teacher<BR> of वाजसनेयी संहिता (शुक्ल यजुर्वेद) and the author of a well-known<BR> code of laws only next in importance to that of Manu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञसेनः|याज्ञसेन
याज्ञसेनः, -निः<BR> A patronymic of Śikhanḍin; Mb. 7. 14. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञसेनिः|याज्ञसेनि
याज्ञसेनः, -निः<BR> A patronymic of Śikhanḍin; Mb. 7. 14. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञसेनी
याज्ञसेनी A patronymic of Draupadī; याज्ञसेनीं पुरस्कृत्य षडेवाथ<BR> प्रवव्रजुः Mb; वल्गु चित्रपदं श्लक्ष्णं याज्ञसेनि त्वया वचः Mb. 3. 31. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञिक|याज्ञिकः
याज्ञिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [यज्ञाय हितम्, यज्ञः प्रयोजनमस्य वा ठक्]<BR> Belonging to a sacrifice; Bhāg. 4. 31. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञिकः|याज्ञिक
याज्ञिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A sacrificer or a sacrificing priest.<BR>—2 A ritualist.<BR>—3 The Kuśa grass.<BR>—4 N. of several trees अश्वत्थ, खदिर, पलाश, &c.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: याज्ञिकाश्रयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञिकाश्रयः|याज्ञिकाश्रय
याज्ञिक + -आश्रयः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञिय|याज्ञियः
याज्ञिय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sacrificial.<BR>—2 Fit for a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्ञियः|याज्ञिय
याज्ञिय + .{@-यः@} One skilled in sacrificial rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्य|याज्यं|याज्यः
याज्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be sacrificed.<BR>—2 Sacrificial.<BR>—3 One for whom a sacrifice is performed.<BR>—4 One who is allowed by Śāstras to sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्यः|याज्य|याज्यं
याज्य + .{@-ज्यः@}<BR>—1 A sacrificer, the institutor of a sacrifice; याज्यात्मजमथो दृष्ट्वा<BR> Mb. 13. 93. 27.<BR>—2 The performer of a sacrifice for another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्यम्
याज्य + .{@-ज्यम्@} The presents or fee received for officiating at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्या
याज्य + .{@-ज्या@} a sacrificial text or verse, Ṛk (recited at the offering<BR> of an oblation); याज्यया यजनकर्मिणोऽत्यजन् Śi. 14. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याज्वनः|याज्वन
याज्वनः The son of a sacrificer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातनम्
यातनम्<BR>—1 Return, requital, recompense, retaliation; as in वैरयातनम्.<BR>—2 Vengeance, revenge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातना
यातनम् + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 Requital, recompense, return.<BR>—2 Torment, acute pain, anguish.<BR>—3 The torments inflicted by Yama upon sinners, the tortures of hell (pl.)<BR> ˚अर्थीय destined to suffer the torments of hell; शरीरं यातनार्थीयम्<BR> Ms. 12. 16. ˚गृहः torture-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातिकः|यातिक
यातिकः A traveller; cf. यात्रिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातुः|यातु
यातुः<BR>—1 A traveller, a way-farer.<BR>—2 Wind.<BR>—3 Time.<BR>—4 An evil spirit, a demon, Rākṣasa. ━<i>n.</i><BR>—1 An evil spirit, a demon.<BR>—2 A weapon.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यातुघ्नः, यातुधानः, यातुनारी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातुघ्नः|यातुघ्न
यातुः + -घ्नः Bdellium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातुधानः|यातुधान
यातुः + -धानः an evil spirit, a demon; निघातयिष्यन् युधि यातुधानान्<BR> Bk. 2. 21; R. 12. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातुनारी
यातुः + -नारी a female demon; बभ्राम त्रिजगति या तु यातुनारी Rām. Ch. 7. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1309-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातृ
यातृ <i>f.</i> [Uṇ. 2. 96] A husbandʼs brotherʼs wife. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A goer, a traveller.<BR>—2 A driver, coachman.<BR>—3 Ved. A destroyer.<BR>—4 An avenger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यातृकः|यातृक
यातृकः A traveller, way-farer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्यः|यात्य|यात्यं
यात्यः An inhabitant of hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्रा
यात्रा [या-ष्ट्रन्]<BR>—1 Going, motion, journey; यात्रा तौ परिवञ्चितुं किसलयं मारीचमायाविधिः<BR> Mv. 6. 1; R. 18. 16.<BR>—2 The march of an army, expedition, invasion; स्थिता हि यात्रा वसुधाधिपानाम्<BR> Rām. 4. 28. 15; मार्गशीर्षे शुभे मासि यायाद्यात्रां महीपतिः Ms. 7. 182;<BR> Pt. 3. 37; R. 17. 56. ˚कालः time for invasion; Kau. A.<BR>—3 Going on a pilgrimage; as in तीर्थयात्रा.<BR>—4 A company of pilgrims.<BR>—5 A festival, fair, festive or solemn occasion; कालप्रियनाथस्य यात्राप्रसंगेन Māl. 1; U. 1.<BR>—6 A procession, festive train; प्रवृत्ता खलु यात्राभिमुखं मालती Māl. 6, 6. 2.<BR>—7 A road.<BR>—8 Support of life, livelihood, maintenance; यात्रामात्रप्रसिद्धपर्थम्<BR> Ms. 4. 3; शरीरयात्रापि च ते न प्रसिध्येदकर्मणः Bg. 3. 8.<BR>—9 Passing away (time).<BR>—10 Intercourse; यात्रा चैव हि लौकिकी Ms. 11. 185; लोकयात्रा Ve. 3; Ms. 9. 27.<BR>—11 Way, means, expedient.<BR>—12 A custom, usage, practice, way; एषोदिता लोकयात्रा नित्यं स्त्रीपुंसयोः<BR> परा Ms. 9. 25 (लोकाचारः Kull.).<BR>—13 A vehicle in general.<BR>—14 A kind of dramatic entertainment.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यात्रोत्सवः, यात्राकर, यात्राकरणम्, यात्राप्रसंगः, यात्राफलम्, यात्राश्राद्धम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्रोत्सवः|यात्रोत्सव
यात्रा + -उत्सवः a festive procession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्राकर
यात्रा + -कर <i>a.</i> supporting life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्राकरणम्
यात्रा + -करणम् an expedition, a march.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्राप्रसंगः|यात्राप्रसङ्ग
यात्रा + -प्रसंगः going on a pilgrimage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्राफलम्
यात्रा + -फलम् success of a campaign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्राश्राद्धम्
यात्रा + -श्राद्धम् a श्राद्ध performed before setting out on a journey; V. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्रिक|यात्रिकः
यात्रिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Marching.<BR>—2 Relating to a journey or campaign.<BR>—3 Requisite for the support of life; तापसेष्वेव विप्रेषु यात्रिकं भैक्षमाहरेत् Ms. 6. 27.<BR>—4 Usual, customary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्रिकः|यात्रिक
यात्रिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A traveller.<BR>—2 A pilgrim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्रिकम्
यात्रिक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A march, an expedition or campaign; न मार्दवं शत्रुषु यात्रिकं<BR> सदा Mb. 12. 103. 40.<BR>—2 Provisions, supplies (for a march); कृत्वा विधानं मूले तु यात्रिकं<BR> च यथाविधि Ms. 7. 184.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यात्रिन्
यात्रिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Being on a march.<BR>—2 Being in a procession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याथाकथाचम्
याथाकथाचम्<BR>—1 That which happens under any circumstances; P. V. 1. 98.<BR>—2 What happens occasionally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याथाकामी
याथाकामी, -काम्यम्<BR> Acting according to oneʼs own will.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याथाकाम्यम्
याथाकामी, -काम्यम्<BR> Acting according to oneʼs own will.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याथातथ्यम्
याथातथ्यम्<BR>—1 Reality, truth.<BR>—2 Rectitude, propriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याथात्म्यम्
याथात्म्यम् Real nature or essence; भक्तिर्ज्ञानं विरक्तिश्च याथात्म्यं<BR> चास्य वै हरेः Bhāg. 7. 10. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याथार्थिक
याथार्थिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Just, right.<BR>—2 True, real.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याथार्थ्यम्
याथार्थ्यम्<BR>—1 Real or correct nature, truth, true character; न सन्ति याथार्थ्यविदः<BR> पिनाकिनः Ku. 5. 77; याथार्थ्यं वेद कस्तव R. 10. 24.<BR>—2 Justness, suitableness. —3 Accomplishment or attainment of an object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादवः|यादव
यादवः [यदोरपत्यम् अण्] A descendant of Yadu.<BR>—2 N. of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादवी
यादवः + .{@-वी@}<BR>—1 N. of Durgā.<BR>—2 Of Kuntī; भद्रं ते यादवीमातर्वचश्चेदं निबोध मे Mb. 15. 3. 30.<BR>—3 Of Subhadrā; कर्णं द्रक्षति कुन्ती च सौभद्रं चापि यादवी Mb. 15. 31. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादवम्
यादवः + .{@-वम्@} A stock of cattle.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यादवकोशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादवकोशः|यादवकोश
यादवः + -कोशः N. of a dictionary (वैजयन्ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादस्
यादस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 Any (large) aquatic animal, a sea-monster; यादांसि जलजन्तवः<BR> Ak.; वरुणो यादसामहम् Bg. 10. 29; Ki. 5. 29; R. 1. 16.<BR>—2 Water.<BR>—3 A river.<BR>—4 Semen.<BR>—5 Desire.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यादःपतिः, यादोनाथः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादःपतिः|यादःपति
यादस् + -पतिः, -नाथः (also यादसांपतिः and यादसांनाथः)<BR>—1 the ocean.<BR>—2 N. of Varuṇa; यादोनाथः शिवजलपथः कर्मणे नौचराणाम् R. 17. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादोनाथः|यादोनाथ
यादस् + -पतिः, -नाथः (also यादसांपतिः and यादसांनाथः)<BR>—1 the ocean.<BR>—2 N. of Varuṇa; यादोनाथः शिवजलपथः कर्मणे नौचराणाम् R. 17. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादुः|यादु
यादुः A fluid, water; Naigh. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृक्ष|यादृक्षः
यादृक्ष <i>a.</i> (-क्षी <i>f.</i>), यादृश्, यादृश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR> What like, of which sort or nature; येषां तु यादृशं<BR> कर्म Ms. 1. 42; तत् क्षेत्रं यच्च यादृक् च यद् विकारि यतश्च यत् Bg. 13. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यादृक्षगुण<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृक्षी
यादृक्ष <i>a.</i> (-क्षी <i>f.</i>), यादृश्, यादृश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR> What like, of which sort or nature; येषां तु यादृशं<BR> कर्म Ms. 1. 42; तत् क्षेत्रं यच्च यादृक् च यद् विकारि यतश्च यत् Bg. 13. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यादृक्षगुण<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृश्
यादृक्ष <i>a.</i> (-क्षी <i>f.</i>), यादृश्, यादृश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR> What like, of which sort or nature; येषां तु यादृशं<BR> कर्म Ms. 1. 42; तत् क्षेत्रं यच्च यादृक् च यद् विकारि यतश्च यत् Bg. 13. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यादृक्षगुण<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृश|यादृशः
यादृक्ष <i>a.</i> (-क्षी <i>f.</i>), यादृश्, यादृश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR> What like, of which sort or nature; येषां तु यादृशं<BR> कर्म Ms. 1. 42; तत् क्षेत्रं यच्च यादृक् च यद् विकारि यतश्च यत् Bg. 13. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यादृक्षगुण<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृशी
यादृक्ष <i>a.</i> (-क्षी <i>f.</i>), यादृश्, यादृश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR> What like, of which sort or nature; येषां तु यादृशं<BR> कर्म Ms. 1. 42; तत् क्षेत्रं यच्च यादृक् च यद् विकारि यतश्च यत् Bg. 13. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यादृक्षगुण<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृक्षगुण
यादृक्ष + -गुण (यादृग्गुण) <i>a.</i> of whatever qualities; यादृग्गुणेन<BR> भत्री स्त्री संयुज्येत यथाविधि Ms. 9. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृच्छिक|यादृच्छिकः
यादृच्छिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Voluntary, spontaneous, independent.<BR>—2 Accidental, unexpected.<BR>—3 Acting as one likes (स्वेच्छाचारी); (आमन्त्र्य) वीणां रणयन्<BR> ययौ यादृच्छिको मुनिः Bhāg. 1. 7. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यादृच्छिकः|यादृच्छिक
यादृच्छिक + .{@-कः@} An officiating priest who acts as he likes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानम्
यानम् [या भावे-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Going, moving, walking, riding; as गजयानम्, उष्ट्र˚, रथ˚ &c.<BR>—2 A voyage, journey; समुद्रयानकुशलाः Ms. 8. 157; Y. 1. 84.<BR>—3 Marching against, attacking (one of the six Guṇas or expedients in<BR> politics); अहितान् प्रत्यभीतस्य रणे यानम् Ak.; Ms. 7. 160.<BR>—4 A procession, train.<BR>—5 A conveyance, vehicle, carriage, chariot; यानं सस्मार कौबेरम्<BR> R. 15. 45, 13. 69; Ku. 6. 76; Ms. 4. 120.<BR>—6 A litter, palanquin.<BR>—7 A ship, vessel.<BR>—8 (With Buddhists) The method of arriving at knowledge; the means of<BR> release from repeated births; cf. महायान, हीनयान.<BR>—9 An aeroplane (विमान); Bhāg. 4. 3. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानः|यान|यानं
यानम् + .{@-नः@} Ved. A road, way.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यानासनम्, यानास्तरणम्, यानकरः, यानग, यानपात्रम्, यानपात्रकम्, यानपात्रिका, यानभङ्गः, यानमुखम्, यानयात्रा, यानयानम्, यानशाला, यानस्वामिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानासनम्
यानम् + -आसनम् marching and sitting quiet; Ms. 7. 162.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानास्तरणम्
यानम् + -आस्तरणम् a carriage cushion; Mk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानकरः|यानकर
यानम् + -करः a carpenter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानग
यानम् + -ग <i>a.</i> riding in a carriage; न यानगः Ms. 4. 120.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानपात्रम्
यानम् + -पात्रम् a ship, boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानपात्रकम्
यानम् + -पात्रकम्, -पात्रिका a small boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानपात्रिका
यानम् + -पात्रकम्, -पात्रिका a small boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानभङ्गः|यानभङ्ग|यानभंग
यानम् + -भङ्गः shipwreck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानमुखम्
यानम् + -मुखम् the forepart of a carriage, the part where the yoke is fixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानयात्रा
यानम् + -यात्रा a sea-voyage; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानयानम्
यानम् + -यानम् driving or riding in a carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानशाला
यानम् + -शाला a coach-house; यानशालां जगाम ह Rām. 3. 35. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानस्वामिन्
यानम् + -स्वामिन् the owner of a vehicle; यानस्य चैव यातुश्च यानस्वामिन<BR> एव च Ms. 8. 290.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यानकम्
यानकम् A vehicle, conveyance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यान्त्रिक|यांत्रिक
यान्त्रिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Relating to instruments or machines.<BR>—2 Mechanically worked out (as refined sugar).<BR>—3 Artificial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1310-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यापक
यापक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Causing to go.<BR>—2 Giving, bestowing; इदं शुक्लकृतं तीर्थमाशिषां यापकं नृणाम् Bhāg. 3. 23. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यापन|यापनं
यापन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Causing to go or go away.<BR>—2 Curing.<BR>—3 Mitigating.<BR>—4 Supporting (life); ग्राम्यमाहारमादद्यादस्वाद्वपि हि यापनम् Mb. 12. 212. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यापनम्
यापन + .{@-नम्, -ना@}<BR>—1 Causing to go away, driving out, expulsion, removal.<BR>—2 Cure or alleviation (of a disease).<BR>—3 Spending or passing time, as in कालयापनम्.<BR>—4 Delay, procrastination.<BR>—5 Support, maintenance; देवतातिथिशेषेण कुरुते देहयापनम् Mb. 3. 260. 6, 12. 213. 17.<BR>—6 Practice, exercise; तत्र न व्यवधातव्यं परोक्षा धर्मयापना<BR> Mb. 12. 134. 2 (com. धर्मयापना धर्मोपदेशः)<BR>—7 Loitering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यापना
यापन + .{@-नम्, -ना@}<BR>—1 Causing to go away, driving out, expulsion, removal.<BR>—2 Cure or alleviation (of a disease).<BR>—3 Spending or passing time, as in कालयापनम्.<BR>—4 Delay, procrastination.<BR>—5 Support, maintenance; देवतातिथिशेषेण कुरुते देहयापनम् Mb. 3. 260. 6, 12. 213. 17.<BR>—6 Practice, exercise; तत्र न व्यवधातव्यं परोक्षा धर्मयापना<BR> Mb. 12. 134. 2 (com. धर्मयापना धर्मोपदेशः)<BR>—7 Loitering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यापित
यापित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Spent, passed (time).<BR>—2 Expelled, removed &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याप्ता
याप्ता Twisted hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याप्य|याप्यः
याप्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be removed, expelled or rejected.<BR>—2 Low, contemptible, trifling, unimportant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याप्यः|याप्य
याप्य + .{@-प्यः@} The fatherʼs elder brother.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: याप्ययानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याप्ययानम्
याप्य + -यानम् a litter or palanquin; तिरस्कृतविमानानि याप्ययानान्यनेकधा<BR> Śiva B. 17. 43; याप्ययानादिदानेन नानावस्त्रैरलंकृतः Parṇāl. 3. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याभः|याभ
याभः Sexual union, copulation; पीवानं श्मश्रुलं प्रेष्ठं मीढ्वांसं<BR> याभकोविदम् Bhāg. 9. 19. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याम|यामः
याम <i>a.</i> (-मी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to Yama; तेनानुभूयता यामीः शरीरेणेह<BR> यातनाः Ms. 12. 17; मा भैर्मन्द मनो विचिन्त्य बहुधा यामीश्चिरं यातनाः<BR> Mukunda-mālā 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामः|याम
यामः [यम्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Restraint, forbearance, control; लेखाः सुयामास्तुषिता ब्रह्मकायाः<BR> Mb. 13. 18. 74.<BR>—2 A watch, one eighth part of a day, a period of three hours; अविदितगतयामा<BR> रात्रिरेव व्यरंसीत् U. 1. 27; पश्चिमाद् यामिनीयामात् प्रसादमिव चेतना<BR> R. 17. 1; so यामवती, त्रियामा &c.<BR>—3 Going, proceeding.<BR>—4 Motion, course.<BR>—5 Ved. A road.<BR>—6 Progress.<BR>—7 A car, carriage.<BR>—8 A class of gods; यामैः परिवृतो देवैर्हत्वाऽशासत् त्रिविष्टपम् Bhāg. 8. 1. 18.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यामघोषः, यामचेटी, यामतूर्यम्, यामदुन्दुभिः, यामनाली, यामनादिन्, यामपालः, यामभद्रः, यामयमः, यामवृत्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामघोषः|यामघोष
यामः + -घोषः<BR>—1 a cock.<BR>—2 a gong or metal-plate on which night-watches are struck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामचेटी
यामः + -चेटी a female servant on guard; Hc. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामतूर्यम्
यामः + -तूर्यम्, -दुन्दुभिः, -नाली = यामघोष (2); मन्द्रध्वनित्याजितयामतूर्यः<BR> R. 6. 56. सुवर्णकोणाभिहतः प्राणदद् यामदुन्दुभिः Rām. 2. 81. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामदुन्दुभिः|यामदुन्दुभि
यामः + -तूर्यम्, -दुन्दुभिः, -नाली = यामघोष (2); मन्द्रध्वनित्याजितयामतूर्यः<BR> R. 6. 56. सुवर्णकोणाभिहतः प्राणदद् यामदुन्दुभिः Rām. 2. 81. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामनाली
यामः + -तूर्यम्, -दुन्दुभिः, -नाली = यामघोष (2); मन्द्रध्वनित्याजितयामतूर्यः<BR> R. 6. 56. सुवर्णकोणाभिहतः प्राणदद् यामदुन्दुभिः Rām. 2. 81. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामनादिन्
यामः + -नादिन् a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामपालः
यामः + -पालः a watchman; असौ परस्परालापं मन्दुरायामपालयोः Dharmābhyudayamahākāvya 2. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामभद्रः|यामभद्र
यामः + -भद्रः a kind of pavilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामयमः|यामयम
यामः + -यमः a stated occupation for every hour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामवृत्तिः|यामवृत्ति
यामः + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> being on watch or guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामकः|यामक
यामकः^1 <i>m.</i> <i>dual</i> N. of the Nakṣatra पुनर्वसु.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामन्
यामन् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Going, motion.<BR>—2 Flight.<BR>—3 Coming, arrival.<BR>—4 A march, an expedition.<BR>—5 Invocation.<BR>—6 Offering, oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामवती
यामवती Night; तारावितानतरला इव यामवत्यः Ki. 8. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामिकः|यामिक
यामिकः A watchman, one on duty or guard at night; also यामिकभट;<BR> यामिकाननुपमृद्य च मादृक् N. 5. 110.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामिका
यामिका, -यामिनी<BR>—1 Night; सविता विधवति विधुरपि सवितरति दिनन्ति यामिन्यः । यामिनयन्ति<BR> दिनानि च सुखदुःखवशीकृते मनसि ॥ K. P. 10; Ki. 11. 48.<BR>—2 Turmeric.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यामिकाचरः, यामिकापतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामिनी
यामिका, -यामिनी<BR>—1 Night; सविता विधवति विधुरपि सवितरति दिनन्ति यामिन्यः । यामिनयन्ति<BR> दिनानि च सुखदुःखवशीकृते मनसि ॥ K. P. 10; Ki. 11. 48.<BR>—2 Turmeric.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यामिकाचरः, यामिकापतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामिकाचरः
यामिका + -चरः<BR>—1 a demon.<BR>—2 an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामिकापतिः|यामिकापति
यामिका + -पतिः<BR>—1 the moon; यामिनीपतिरिवैष दिनान्ते Bhāg.<BR>—2 camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामिनयति
यामिनयति Den. P. To appear like night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामीरः|यामीर
यामीरः The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामीरा
यामीरः + .{@-रा@} Night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामलम्
यामलम्<BR>—1 A pair, couple.<BR>—2 N. of a class of Tantra works; cf. रुद्रयामल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामातृ
यामातृ <i>m.</i> (See जामातृ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामिः|यामि
यामिः, -मी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A sister (see जामि); यामिहरणजनितानुशयः Śi. 15. 53.<BR>—2 Night.<BR>—3 A daughter-in-law; Ms. 4. 180.<BR>—4 A noble woman.<BR>—5 The south.<BR>—6 Hell-torture (यमयातना).<BR>—7 The Bharaṇī constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामी
यामिः, -मी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A sister (see जामि); यामिहरणजनितानुशयः Śi. 15. 53.<BR>—2 Night.<BR>—3 A daughter-in-law; Ms. 4. 180.<BR>—4 A noble woman.<BR>—5 The south.<BR>—6 Hell-torture (यमयातना).<BR>—7 The Bharaṇī constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामुन|यामुनं
यामुन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [यमुना-अण्] Belonging to or coming from, or growing<BR> in, the Yamunā; गाङ्गमम्बु सितमम्बु यामुनं कज्जलाभमुभयत्र मज्जतः K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामुनम्
यामुन + .{@-नम्@} A kind of collyrium; चक्षुष्यं यामुनं पुनः Śiva B. 30. 18;<BR> also यामुनेयम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामुनेष्टकम्
यामुनेष्टकम् Lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यामेयः|यामेय
यामेयः A sisterʼs son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याम्य|याम्यः
याम्य <i>a.</i> [यमो देवतास्य तस्येदं वा ण्य]<BR>—1 Southern; द्वारं ररङ्घतुर्याम्यम् Bk. 14. 15.<BR>—2 Belonging to or resembling Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याम्यः|याम्य
याम्य + .{@-म्यः@}<BR>—1 A servant of Yama; भगवत्पुरुषै राजन् याम्याः प्रतिहतोद्यमाः Bhāg. 6. 3. 3.<BR>—2 N. of Agastya.<BR>—3 Of Śiva.<BR>—4 Of Viṣṇu.<BR>—5 Sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याम्यम्
याम्य + .{@-म्यम्@} The Bharaṇī Nakṣatra.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: याम्यायनम्, याम्योत्तर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याम्यायनम्
याम्य + -अयनम् the winter solstice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याम्योत्तर
याम्य + -उत्तर <i>a.</i> going from south to north. ˚वृत्तम् the solstitial colure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याम्या
याम्या<BR>—1 The south; दिशं याम्यामभिमुखो रुदन् वचनमब्रवीत् Rām. 2. 103. 26.<BR>—2 Night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यायजूकः|यायजूक
यायजूकः [यज् यङ् ऊक] A performer of frequent sacrifices, one<BR> who constantly performs sacrifices (इज्याशील); तं यायजूकः सह<BR> भिक्षुमुख्यैः Bk. 2. 20; राजा महात्मा तेजस्वी यायजूकः सतां गतिम्<BR> Rām. 2. 72. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यायावर|यायावरः
यायावर <i>a.</i> Frequently going, vagrant, having no fixed abode.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यायावरः|यायावर
यायावर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A vagrant mendicant, saint; यायावराः पुष्पफलेन चान्ये प्रानर्चुरर्च्या<BR> जगदर्चनीयम् Bk. 2. 20; महाभागस्तस्मिन्नयमजनि यायावरकुले<BR> B. R. 1. 13 (where यायावर is the name of a family).<BR>—2 A horse selected for a horse-sacrifice.<BR>—3 N. of the sage जरत्कारु.<BR>—4 N. of a family (to which Rājaśekhara belonged).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यायावरम्
यायावर + .{@-रम्@} The life of a vagrant mendicant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यायिन्
यायिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Going, moving, travelling (at the end of comp.).<BR>—2 Driving in, riding or going in.<BR>—3 Leading to; चित्रकूटयायिनि वर्त्मनि U. 1.<BR>—4 Going to war (applied to planets opposite to each other).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याव|यावः
याव <i>a.</i> Relating to, consisting of or prepared from barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावः|याव
याव + .{@-वः@}<BR>—1 Food prepared from barley.<BR>—2 Lac, red dye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1311-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावकः|यावक|यावकं
यावकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Food prepared from barley; भुञ्जानो यावकं रुक्षं दीर्घकालमरिंदम<BR> Mb. 12. 300. 44; Mb. 12. 215. 22, 12. 321. 49; Ms. 11. 125.<BR>—2 Lac, red lac; लभ्यते स्म परिरक्ततयात्मा यावकेन वियतापि युवत्याः<BR> Śi. 10. 9, 5. 13, 7. 67; Ki. 5. 40; उत्क्षिप्य यावकरसं किरती तथान्या Bil. C. 79.<BR>—3 Half-ripe barley; अपक्व एव यावके पुरा प्रलीयसे त्वरम् Mb. 12. 321. 49.<BR>—4 Awnless barley.<BR>—5 Forced rice.<BR>—6 A kind of kidney-bean.<BR>—7 A kind of observance (व्रत) in which one lives only on the grains<BR> of barley found in cow-dung; गवां निर्हारनिर्मुक्ताद् यावकात् तद्विशिष्यते<BR> Mb. 13. 26. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावकम्
यावकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Food prepared from barley; भुञ्जानो यावकं रुक्षं दीर्घकालमरिंदम<BR> Mb. 12. 300. 44; Mb. 12. 215. 22, 12. 321. 49; Ms. 11. 125.<BR>—2 Lac, red lac; लभ्यते स्म परिरक्ततयात्मा यावकेन वियतापि युवत्याः<BR> Śi. 10. 9, 5. 13, 7. 67; Ki. 5. 40; उत्क्षिप्य यावकरसं किरती तथान्या Bil. C. 79.<BR>—3 Half-ripe barley; अपक्व एव यावके पुरा प्रलीयसे त्वरम् Mb. 12. 321. 49.<BR>—4 Awnless barley.<BR>—5 Forced rice.<BR>—6 A kind of kidney-bean.<BR>—7 A kind of observance (व्रत) in which one lives only on the grains<BR> of barley found in cow-dung; गवां निर्हारनिर्मुक्ताद् यावकात् तद्विशिष्यते<BR> Mb. 13. 26. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावत्|यावन्त्
यावत् <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> (As a correlative of तावत्)<BR>—1 As much as, as many as, (यावत् standing for ‘as’ and तावत्<BR> for ‘as much’ or ‘as many’); पुरे तावन्तमेवास्य तनोति रविरातपम् ।<BR> दीर्घिकाकमलोन्मेषो यावन्मात्रेण साध्यते Ku. 2. 33; ते तु यावन्त एवाजौ<BR> तावांश्च ददृशे स तैः R. 12. 45, 17. 17.<BR>—2 As great, as large, how great or large; यावानर्थ उदपाने सर्वतः<BR> संप्लुतोदके । तावान् सर्वेषु वेदेषु ब्राह्मणस्य विजानतः ॥ Bg. 2. 46, 18. 55.<BR>—3 All, whole (where the two together have the sense of totality or साकल्य);<BR> यावद् दत्तं तावद् भुक्तम् G. M. ━<i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Used by itself यावत् has the following senses:<BR>——(<i>a</i>) as far as, for, up to, till; (with acc.); स्तन्यत्यागं यावत्<BR> पुत्रयोरवेक्षस्व U. 7; कियन्तमवधिं यावदस्मच्चरितं चित्रकारेणालिखितम्<BR> U. 1; सर्पकोटरं यावत् Pt. 1.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) just, then, in the meantime (denoting an action intended to be<BR> done immediately); तद् यावत् गृहिणीमाहूय संगीतकमनुतिष्ठामि Ś. 1;<BR> यावदिमां छायामाश्रित्य प्रतिपालयामि Ś. 3.<BR>——(<i>c</i>) As much as.<BR>——(<i>d</i>) That, in order that<BR>——(<i>e</i>) Even, just.<BR>—2 Used correlatively यावत् and तावत् have these senses:<BR>——(<i>a</i>) as long as, so long as; यावद् वित्तोपार्जनशक्तस्तावन्निजपरिवारो<BR> रक्तः Moha M. 8.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) as soon as, scarcely when, no sooner━than; एकस्य दुःखस्य<BR> न यावदन्तं गच्छामि … तावद् द्वितीयं समुपस्थितं मे H. 1. 177;<BR> Me. 107; Ku. 3. 72.<BR>——(<i>c</i>) while, by the time; आश्रमवासिनो यावदवेक्ष्याहमुपावर्ते तावदार्द्रपृष्ठाः<BR> क्रियन्तां वाजिनः Ś. 1; often with न when यावन्न is translated<BR> by ‘before’; यावदेते सरसो नोत्पतन्ति तावदेतेभ्यः प्रवृत्तिरवगमयितव्या V. 4.<BR>——(<i>d</i>) when, as (= यदा); यावदुत्थाय निरीक्षते तावद् हंसोऽवलोकितः H. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यावदध्ययनम्, यावदन्तम्, यावदन्ताय, यावदन्त्य, यावदभीक्षम्, यावदर्थ, यावदिष्टम्, यावदीप्सितम्, यावदित्थम्, यावत्कालम्, यावद्गमम्, यावज्जन्म, यावज्जीवम्, यावज्जीवने, यावत्प्रमाण, यावद्बलम्, यावद्भाषित, यावन्मात्र, यावच्छक्यम्, यावच्छक्ति, यावत्संपातम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदध्ययनम्
यावत् + -अध्ययनम् <i>ind.</i> during the recitation; अनुव्रज्या च शुश्रूषा<BR> यावदध्ययनं गुरोः Ms. 2. 241.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदन्तम्|यावदंतम्
यावत् + -अन्तम्, -अन्ताय <i>ind.</i> upto the end, to the last.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदन्ताय|यावदंताय
यावत् + -अन्तम्, -अन्ताय <i>ind.</i> upto the end, to the last.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदन्त्य
यावत् + -अन्त्य <i>a.</i> life-long.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदभीक्षम्
यावत् + -अभीक्षम् <i>ind.</i> for a momentʼs duration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदर्थ
यावत् + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> corresponding to requirement, as many as may be required<BR> to convey the meaning (said of words); न प्रीतियुक्ता यावदर्थाश्च लोके<BR> Bhāg. 5. 5. 3; यावदर्थपदां वाचमेवमादाय माधवः विरराम Śi. 2. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदर्थम्
यावत् + -अर्थ + .({@-र्थम्@}) <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 as much as useful.<BR>—2 in all senses; वयमपि च गिरामीश्महे यावदर्थम् Bh. 3. 30 v. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदिष्टम्
यावत् + -इष्टम्, -ईप्सितम् <i>ind.</i> as much as is desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदीप्सितम्
यावत् + -इष्टम्, -ईप्सितम् <i>ind.</i> as much as is desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदित्थम्
यावत् + -इत्थम् <i>ind.</i> as much as is necessary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावत्कालम्
यावत् + -कालम् <i>ind.</i> as long as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावद्गमम्
यावत् + -गमम् <i>ind.</i> as fast as one can go; यावद्गमं रुद्रभयाद्<BR> यथा कः Bhāg. 1. 7. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावज्जन्म
यावत् + -जन्म, -जीवम्, -जीवने <i>ind.</i> for life, throughout life, for<BR> the rest of oneʼs life; यावज्जीवं त्रयो वन्द्या वेदान्तो गुरुरीश्वरः<BR> Subhāṣ.; यावज्जीवं सुखं जीवेत् Subhāṣ.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">Page1312-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावज्जीवम्
यावत् + -जन्म, -जीवम्, -जीवने <i>ind.</i> for life, throughout life, for<BR> the rest of oneʼs life; यावज्जीवं त्रयो वन्द्या वेदान्तो गुरुरीश्वरः<BR> Subhāṣ.; यावज्जीवं सुखं जीवेत् Subhāṣ.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">Page1312-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावज्जीवने
यावत् + -जन्म, -जीवम्, -जीवने <i>ind.</i> for life, throughout life, for<BR> the rest of oneʼs life; यावज्जीवं त्रयो वन्द्या वेदान्तो गुरुरीश्वरः<BR> Subhāṣ.; यावज्जीवं सुखं जीवेत् Subhāṣ.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">Page1312-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावत्प्रमाण
यावत् + -प्रमाण <i>a.</i> as great or big.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावद्बलम्
यावत् + -बलम् <i>ind.</i> to the best of oneʼs power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावद्भाषित
यावत् + -भाषित or {@-उक्त@} <i>a.</i> as much as said.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावदुक्त
यावत् + -भाषित or {@-उक्त@} <i>a.</i> as much as said.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावन्मात्र
यावत् + -मात्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 as large, extending as far, of which size or extent; दीर्धिकाकमलोन्मेषो<BR> यावन्मात्रेण साध्यते Ku. 2. 33.<BR>—2 insignificant, trifling, little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावच्छक्यम्
यावत् + -शक्यम्, -शक्ति <i>ind.</i> as far as possible, to the best of oneʼs<BR> power; so यावत्सत्त्वम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावच्छक्ति
यावत् + -शक्यम्, -शक्ति <i>ind.</i> as far as possible, to the best of oneʼs<BR> power; so यावत्सत्त्वम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावत्संपातम्|यावत्सम्पातम्
यावत् + -संपातम् <i>ind.</i> as long as possible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावतिथ|यावतिथः
यावतिथ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To whatever place or point.<BR>—2 In how many soever (degree advanced); यो यो यावतिथश्चैषां स स<BR> तावद्गुणः स्मृतः Ms. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावन्
यावन् <i>m.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 A rider, horseman.<BR>—2 An invader.<BR>—3 Going, driving &c. (at the end of comp.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावन|यावनः
यावन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [यवन-अण्, युणिच् ल्यु वा] Belonging to the Yavanas;<BR> न वदेद् यावनीं भाषां प्राणैः कण्ठगतैरपि Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावनः|यावन
यावन + .{@-नः@} Incense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावनम्
यावन + .{@-नम्@} Mixing, mingling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावनीप्रिया
यावनीप्रिया The betel-plant; Gīrvāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावनालः|यावनाल
यावनालः A kind of corn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावनाली
यावनालः + .{@-ली@} Sugar extracted for Yavanāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावनीयः
यावनीयः N. of a medical plant (Mar. किरमणी ओंवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावशूकः|यावशूक
यावशूकः Salt-petre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावसः|यावस
यावसः<BR>—1 A heap of grass.<BR>—2 Fodder, provisions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यावसिकः|यावसिक
यावसिकः A mower of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याष्टीक|याष्टीकः
याष्टीक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [यष्टिः प्रहरणमस्य ईकक्] Armed with a club.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

याष्टीकः|याष्टीक
याष्टीक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A warrior armed with a club; तथा कार्णाटयाष्टीकैः Śiva B. 25. 22.<BR>—2 A door-keeper with a cane; मामुपास्त दिदृक्षावान् याष्टीकव्याहतो हरिः Bk. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यासः|यास
यासः<BR>—1 Effort, endeavour.<BR>—2 Alhagi Maurorum (Mar. धमासा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यास्कः|यास्क
यास्कः N. of the author of the Nirukta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यियक्षमाण
यियक्षमाण <i>a.</i> Desirous of performing a sacrifice; यियक्षमाणेनाहूतः<BR> पार्थेनाथ द्विषन्मुरम् Śi. 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यियासा
यियासा Desire of going.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यियासु
यियासु <i>a.</i> Wishing to go, move, ride &c.; जवादहंपूर्विकया<BR> यियासुभिः Ki. 14. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यु
यु I. €2 P. (यौति, युत; <i>caus.</i> यावयति; <i>desid.</i><BR> यियविषति or युयूषति)<BR>—1 To join, unite.<BR>—2 To mix, combine. ━II. €3 P. (युयोति) To detach, separate; as in<BR> युतसिद्ध. ━III. €9 U. (युनाति, युनीते)<BR>—1 To bind, fasten.<BR>—2 To join, unite.<BR>—3 To mix, combine.<BR>—4 Ved. To give, grant.<BR>—5 To acquire.<BR>—6 To worship, respect. ━IV. €10 Ā. (यावयते) To censure. ━<i>With</i><BR> {@व्यति@} to mix; अन्योन्यं स्म व्यतियुतः शब्दाञ् शब्दैस्तु भीषणान् Bk. 8. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्त|युक्तं|युक्तः
युक्त <i>p. p.</i> [युज्-क्त]<BR>—1 Joined, united.<BR>—2 Fastened, yoked, harnessed.<BR>—3 Fitted out, arranged; उदतिष्ठन् महाराज सर्वं युक्तमशेषतः Mb. 6. 16. 4.<BR>—4 Accompanied; युक्तः प्रमाद्यसि Ki. 11. 29.<BR>—5 Furnished or endowed<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">Page1313-1</a>]<BR> with, filled with, having, possessing (with instr. or in comp.).<BR>—6 Fixed or intent on, absorbed or engaged in, devoted to (with loc.);<BR> कौसल्यायां यथा युक्तो जनन्यां वर्तते सदा Rām. 2. 20. 3; युक्तः<BR> प्रजानामनुरञ्जने स्याः U. 1. 11; Pt. 1. 284.<BR>—7 Used, employed.<BR>—8 Adapted, fitted.<BR>—9 Appointed (a government servant); अपि शक्या गतिर्ज्ञातुं पततां खे<BR> पतत्रिणाम् । न तु प्रच्छन्नभावानां युक्तानां चरतां गतिः ॥ मत्स्या यथान्तःसलिले<BR> चरन्तो ज्ञातुं न शक्याः सलिलं पिबन्तः । युक्तास्तथा कार्यविधौ नियुक्ता<BR> ज्ञातुं न शक्या धनमाददानाः ॥ Kau. A. 2. 9.<BR>—10 Connected with.<BR>—11 Proved, inferred.<BR>—12 Active, diligent.<BR>—13 Skilful, experienced, clever; सुग्रीवमन्त्रिते युक्तौ मम चापि हिते<BR> रतौ Rām. 7. 39. 18.<BR>—14 Fit, proper, right, suitable (with gen. or loc.).<BR>—15 Primitive, not derived (from another word).<BR>—16 = योगयुक्त q. v.; अनिःश्वसन्तं युक्तं तम् Rām. 7. 106. 16;<BR> cf. युक्तचेतस्.<BR>—17 = नियमवान्; श्रद्दधानः सदा युक्तः सदा धर्मपरायणः Mb. 1. 1. 261.<BR>—18 (In astr.) Being in conjunction with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तः|युक्त|युक्तं
युक्त + .{@-क्तः@} A saint who has become one with the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तम्
युक्त + .{@-क्तम्@}<BR>—1 A team, yoke.<BR>—2 Money lawfully obtained.<BR>—3 Junction, connection.<BR>—4 Fitness, propriety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तम्
युक्त + .{@-क्तम्@} <i>ind.</i> Fitly, properly, justly, duly, well.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: युक्तार्थ, युक्तकर्मन्, युक्तचेतस्, युक्तचेष्ट, युक्तदण्ड, युक्तमनस्, युक्तयोग, युक्तरथः, युक्तरूप, युक्तवादिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1312-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तार्थ
युक्त + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> sensible, rational, significant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तकर्मन्
युक्त + -कर्मन् <i>a.</i> entrusted with some duty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तचेतस्
युक्त + -चेतस् <i>a.</i> योगयुक्त or योगाभ्यासी q. v.; प्रयाणकालेऽपि<BR> च मां ते विदुर्युक्तचेतसः Bg. 7. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तचेष्ट
युक्त + -चेष्ट <i>a.</i> behaving properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तदण्ड|युक्तदंड
युक्त + -दण्ड <i>a.</i> punishing justly; स हि सर्वस्य लोकस्य युक्तदण्डतया<BR> मनः (आददे) R. 4. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तमनस्
युक्त + -मनस् <i>a.</i> attentive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तयोग
युक्त + -योग <i>a.</i> (in astrol.) being in conjunction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तरथः|युक्तरथ
युक्त + -रथः<BR>—1 a kind of elixir.<BR>—2 N. of a particular enema.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तरूप
युक्त + -रूप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fit, proper, worthy, suitable (with gen. or loc.); जन्म यस्य पुरोर्वंशे<BR> युक्तरूपमिदं तव Ś. 1. 12; अनुकारिणि पूर्वेषां युक्तरूपमिदं त्वयि 2. 17.<BR>—2 Fit for, corresponding to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तवादिन्
युक्त + -वादिन् <i>a.</i> speaking properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तकम्
युक्तकम् A pair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तिः|युक्ति
युक्तिः <i>f.</i> [युज्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Union, junction, combination.<BR>—2 Application, use, employment.<BR>—3 Yoking, harnessing.<BR>—4 A practice, usage.<BR>—5 A means, an expedient, a plan, scheme.<BR>—6 A contrivance, device, trick.<BR>—7 Propriety, fitness, adjustment, aptness, suitableness.<BR>—8 Skill, art.<BR>—9 Reasoning, arguing, an argument.<BR>—10 Inference, deduction.<BR>—11 Reason, ground.<BR>—12 Arrangement (रचना); यत्र खल्वियं वाचोयुक्तिः Māl. 1.<BR>—13 (In law) Probability, enumeration or specification of circumstances,<BR> such as time, place &c.; युक्तिप्राप्तिक्रियाचिह्नसंबन्धाभोगहेतुभिः Y. 2. 92, 212.<BR>—14 (In dramas) The regular chain or connection of events; cf. S. D. 343.<BR>—15 (In Rhet.) Emblematical or covert expression of oneʼs purpose or design.<BR>—16 Sum, total.<BR>—17 Alloying of metal.<BR>—18 Charm, spell.<BR>—19 (In gram.) A sentence.<BR>—20 (In astr.) A conjunction. ({@युक्त्या@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 by means or virtue of.<BR>—2 cleverly, skilfully.<BR>—3 properly, fitly, duly).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: युक्तिकथनम्, युक्तिकर, युक्तिज्ञ, युक्तियुक्त, युक्तिशास्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तिकथनम्
युक्तिः + -कथनम् statement of reasons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तिकर
युक्तिः + -कर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 suitable, fit.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">Page1313-2</a>]<BR>—2 proved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तिज्ञ
युक्तिः + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> skilled in expedients, inventive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तियुक्त
युक्तिः + -युक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 suitable, fit.<BR>—2 expert, skilful.<BR>—3 established, proved.<BR>—4 argumentative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तिशास्त्रम्
युक्तिः + -शास्त्रम् the science of what is suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तितः
युक्तितः <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Cleverly, skilfully, artfully.<BR>—2 Duly, properly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युक्तिमत्|युक्तिमन्त्
युक्तिमत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Clever, ingenious, fertile in using expedients, inventive.<BR>—2 Based on argument, logical.<BR>—3 Joined, united.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगम्
युगम् —1 A yoke (<i>m.</i> also in this sense); युगव्यायवबाहुः<BR> R. 3. 34, 10. 87; Śi. 3. 68.<BR>—2 A pair, couple, brace; कुचयोर्युगेन तरसा कलिता Śi. 9. 72;<BR> स्तनयुग Ś. 1. 19.<BR>—3 A couple of stanzas forming one sentence; see युग्म.<BR>—4 An age of the world; (the Yugas are four:− कृत or सत्य, त्रेता,<BR> द्वापर and कलि; the duration of each is said to be respectively 1,728,000; 1,296,000; 864,000;<BR> and 432,000 years of men, the four together<BR> comprising 4,320,000 years of men which is equal to one Mahāyuga q. v.;<BR> it is also supposed that the regularly descending length of the Yugas<BR> represents a corresponding physical and moral deterioration in the people<BR> who live during each age, <i>Kṛta</i> being called the ‘golden’ and<BR> <i>Kali</i> or the present age the ‘iron’ age); धर्मसंस्थापनार्थाय<BR> संभवामि युगे Bg. 4. 8; युगशतपरिवर्तान् Ś. 7. 34.<BR>—5 (Hence) A long period of years (कालचक्र); युगं वा परिवर्तेत<BR> यद्येवं स्याद् यथाऽऽत्थ माम् Mb. 5. 160. 99.<BR>—6 A generation, life; आ सप्तमाद् युगात् Ms. 10. 64; जात्युत्कर्षो<BR> युगे ज्ञेयः पञ्चमे सप्तमेऽपि वा Y. 1. 96 (युगे = जन्मनि Mit.).<BR>—7 An expression for the number ‘four’, rarely for ‘twelve’.<BR>—8 A period of five years.<BR>—9 A measure of length equal to four <i>Hastas</i>.<BR>—10 A part of a chariot or plough.<BR>—11 N. of a particular configuration of the moon.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: युगांशकः, युगाध्यक्षः, युगान्तः, युगान्तर, युगावधिः, युगाद्या, युगकीलकः, युगक्षयः, युगधरः, युगधुर्, युगपत्रः, युगपत्रकः, युगपार्श्वग, युगबाहु, युगमात्रम्, युगवरत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगांशकः|युगांशक
युगम् + -अंशकः a year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगाध्यक्षः|युगाध्यक्ष
युगम् + -अध्यक्षः<BR>—1 N. of Prajāpati.<BR>—2 of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगान्तः|युगान्त|युगांत
युगम् + -अन्तः<BR>—1 the end of the yoke.<BR>—2 the end of an age, end or destruction of the world; युगान्तकालप्रतिसंहृतात्मनो<BR> जगन्ति यस्यां सविकासमासत Śi. 1. 23; R. 13. 6.<BR>—3 meridian, mid-day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगान्तर
युगम् + -अन्तर<BR>—1 a kind of yoke.<BR>—2 a succeeding generation.<BR>—3 another division of the sky; युगान्तरमारूढः सविता Ś. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगावधिः|युगावधि
युगम् + -अवधिः end or destruction of the world; पयस्यभिद्रवति भुवं<BR> युगावधौ Śi. 17. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगाद्या
युगम् + -आद्या the first day of a Yuga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगकीलकः|युगकीलक
युगम् + -कीलकः the pin of a yoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगक्षयः|युगक्षय
युगम् + -क्षयः destruction of the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगधरः
युगम् + -धरः the pole of a carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगधुर्
युगम् + -धुर् <i>f.</i> the pin of a yoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगपत्रः|युगपत्र
युगम् + -पत्रः, -पत्रकः the mountain ebony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगपत्रकः|युगपत्रक
युगम् + -पत्रः, -पत्रकः the mountain ebony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगपार्श्वग|युगपार्श्वगः
युगम् + -पार्श्वग <i>a.</i> going to the side of the yoke, (said of an ox<BR> while being broken in to the yoke).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगबाहु
युगम् + -बाहु <i>a.</i> long-armed; युगपद्युगबाहुभ्यः प्राप्तेभ्यः प्राज्यविक्रमाः Ku. 2. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगमात्रम्
युगम् + -मात्रम् the length of a yoke (= 4 hands).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगवरत्रम्
युगम् + -वरत्रम् a yoke-strap; युगवरत्रे उपदंशिते ईषाचक्रादिसंनिधाने<BR> चेद् अक्षमानयेत्युच्यते तदा यानाक्षमधिकृत्य ब्रूते इति गम्यते, न तु<BR> विदेवनाक्षमिति ŚB. on MS. 6. 8. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगंधरः|युगन्धर|युगंधर|युगंधरं|युगन्धरः
युगंधरः, -रम्<BR> The pole of a carriage to which the yoke is fixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगंधरम्
युगंधरः, -रम्<BR> The pole of a carriage to which the yoke is fixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगंधरः|युगन्धर|युगंधर|युगंधरं|युगन्धरः
युगंधरः, -रम् + .{@-रः@} a particular magical formula spoken over weapons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1313-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगपद्
युगपद् <i>ind.</i> Simultaneously, all at once, all together, at the<BR> same time; सहस्रमक्ष्णां युगपत् पपात Ku. 3. 1; oft. in comp.; तेजोद्वयस्य<BR> युगपद्व्यसनोदयाभ्याम् Ś. 4. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगलम्
युगलम् A pair, couple; बाहु˚, हस्त˚, चरण˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगलकम्
युगलकम्<BR>—1 A pair.<BR>—2 A couple of verses forming one sentence; cf. युग्म.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगलायते
युगलायते Den. Ā. To be like a pair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युगी
युगी Abundance; अस्त्रेण योधयुग्या च … … सर्वे स्म समजातीयाः<BR> Mb. 5. 63. 3 (com. योधयुग्या शूरसमृद्धपा-युजेरौणादिकः किः-कुत्वमार्षम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्म|युग्मं
युग्म <i>a.</i> Even; युग्मासु पुत्रा जायन्ते स्त्रियोऽयुग्मासु रात्रिषु ।<BR> तस्माद् युग्मासु पुत्राथीं संविशेदार्तवे स्त्रियम् Ms. 3. 48; Y. 1. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्मम्
युग्म + .{@-ग्मम्@}<BR>—1 A pair, couple; see अयुग्म.<BR>—2 Junction, union.<BR>—3 Confluence (of rivers).<BR>—4 Twins.<BR>—5 A couple of stanzas forming one grammatical sentence; द्वाभ्यां युग्ममिति प्रोक्तम्.<BR>—6 The sign <i>Gemini</i> of the zodiac; युग्मान्ते सूर्यमाहत्य महोल्केव<BR> दिवश्च्युता Mb. 10. 6. 14.<BR>—7 Mixing, uniting.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: युग्मचारिन्, युग्मज, युग्मपत्रः, युग्मविपुला, युग्मशुक्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्मचारिन्
युग्म + -चारिन् <i>a.</i> going about in pairs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्मज
युग्म + -ज <i>a.</i> twin, twin-born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्मपत्रः|युग्मपत्र
युग्म + -पत्रः mountain ebony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्मविपुला
युग्म + -विपुला a kind of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्मशुक्रम्
युग्म + -शुक्रम् two white spots in the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्मक
युग्मक = युग्म above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्य|युग्यं|युग्यः
युग्य <i>a.</i> [युगाय हितः यत्]<BR>—1 Fit to be yoked; शकटापणवेशाश्च यानयुग्यं च सर्वशः Mb. 5. 151. 58.<BR>—2 Belonging to a yoke.<BR>—3 Yoked, harnessed.<BR>—4 Drawn by; as in अश्वयुग्यो रथः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्यः|युग्य|युग्यं
युग्य + .{@-ग्यः@} Any yoked or draught animal, especially a chariot-horse;<BR> हरियुग्यं रथं तस्मै प्रजिघाय पुरंदरः R. 12. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्यम्
युग्य + .{@-ग्यम्@} A vehicle, carriage.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: युग्यवाहः, युग्यस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्यवाहः|युग्यवाह
युग्य + -वाहः a coachman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युग्यस्थ
युग्य + -स्थ <i>a.</i> being in a carriage; युग्यस्थाः प्राजकेऽनाप्ते Ms. 8. 294.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युङ्ग्
युङ्ग् €1 P. To give up, desert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युङ्गिन्
युङ्गिन् <i>m.</i> N. of a mixed tribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युछ्|युच्छ्
युछ्, युच्छ् €1 P.<BR>—1 To err, to go astray; L. D. B.<BR>—2 To go away, depart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युच्छ्|युछ्
युछ्, युच्छ् €1 P.<BR>—1 To err, to go astray; L. D. B.<BR>—2 To go away, depart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युज्
युज् I. €7 U. (युनक्ति, युङ्क्ते, युयोज, युयुजे, अयुजत्, अयौक्षीत्,<BR> अयुक्त, योक्ष्यति-ते, योक्तुम्, युक्त)<BR>—1 To join, unite, attach, connect, add; तमर्थमिव भारत्या सुतया<BR> योक्तुमर्हसि Ku. 6. 79; see <i>pass.</i> below.<BR>—2 To yoke, harness, put to; भानुः सकृद्युक्ततुरङ्ग एव Ś. 5. 4;<BR> ततः श्वेतैर्हयैर्युक्ते महति स्यन्दने स्थितौ Bg. 1. 14.<BR>—3 To furnish or endow with; as in गुणयुक्त.<BR>—4 To use, employ, apply; प्रशस्ते कर्मणि तथा सच्छब्दः पार्थ युज्यते<BR> Bg. 17. 26; Ms. 7. 204.<BR>—5 To appoint, set (with loc.); प्रजासु वृत्तिं यमयुङ्क्त वेदितुम् Ki. 1. 1.<BR>—6 To direct, turn or fix upon (as the mind &c.).<BR>—7 To concentrate oneʼs attention upon; मनः संयम्य मच्चित्तो युक्त<BR> आसीत मत्परः Bg. 6. 14; युञ्जन्नेवं सदात्मानम् 15.<BR>—8 To put, place or fix on (with loc.).<BR>—9 To prepare, arrange, make ready, fit.<BR>—10 To give, bestow, confer; दध्यक्षताद्भिर्युयुजुः सदाशिषः Bhāg. 10. 25. 29;<BR> आशिषं युयुजे.<BR>—11 To adhere<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-2" target="_blank">Page1314-2</a>]<BR> or cleave to.<BR>—12 To enjoin, charge; उवाच चैनं मेधावी युङ्क्ष्वात्मानमिति प्रभो Mb. 15. 37. 30.<BR>—13 To put in, insert.<BR>—14 To think or meditate upon. ━<i>Pass.</i> (युज्यते)<BR>—1 To be joined or united with; रविपीतजला तपात्यये पुनरोघेन हि<BR> युज्यते नदी Ku. 4. 44; R. 8. 17.<BR>—2 To get, be possessed of; इष्टैर्युज्येथाम् Mv. 7; इष्टेन युज्यस्व<BR> Ś. 5; R. 3. 65.<BR>—3 To be fit or right, be proper, to suit (with loc. or gen.); या यस्य<BR> युज्यते भूमिका तां खलु भावेन तथैव सर्वे वर्ग्याः पाठिताः Māl. 1;<BR> त्रैलोक्यस्यापि प्रभुत्वं त्वयि युज्यते H. 1.<BR>—4 To be ready for; ततो युद्धाय युज्यस्व Bg. 2. 38, 50.<BR>—5 To be intent on, be absorbed in, be directed towards; दैवकर्मणि<BR> युक्तो हि बिभर्तीदं चराचरम् Ms. 3. 75, 14. 35; Ki. 7. 13<BR>—6 To be fastened or harnessed.<BR>—7 To adhere, to be in close contact.<BR>—8 To attain to, possess, obtain.<BR>—9 To be made ready. ━<i>Caus.</i> (योजयति-ते)<BR>—1 To join, unite, bring together; परस्परेण स्पृहणीयशोभं न चेदिदं<BR> द्वन्द्वमयोजयिष्यत् R. 7. 14.<BR>—2 To present, give, bestow; चरोरर्धार्धभागाभ्यां तामयोजयतामुभे R. 10. 56.<BR>—3 To appoint, employ, use; शत्रुभिर्योजयेच्छत्रुम् Pt. 4. 17.<BR>—4 To turn or direct towards; पापान्निवारयति योजयते हिताय Bh. 2. 72.<BR>—5 To excite, urge, instigate.<BR>—6 To perform, achieve.<BR>—7 To prepare, arrange, equip.<BR>—8 To yoke, harness.<BR>—9 To apply, fix, set, place.<BR>—10 To furnish or endow with.<BR>—11 To surround.<BR>—12 To despise, think lightly of.<BR>—13 To appoint to. ━<i>Desid.</i> (युयुक्षति-ते) To wish to join,<BR> yoke, give &c. ━II. €1 P., €10 U. (योजति, योजयति-ते) To unite, join,<BR> yoke &c.; see युज् above. ━III. €4 Ā. (युज्यते) To concentrate<BR> the mind (identical with the <i>pass.</i> of युज् I). ━IV. €10 Ā.<BR> (योजयते) To censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युज्
युज् <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.)<BR>—1 Joined or united with, yoked, drawn by &c.; रथाः सर्वे चतुर्युजः<BR> Mb. 12. 29. 66.<BR>—2 Furnished or filled with, possessed of.<BR>—3 Exciting, setting on.<BR>—4 Even, not odd; युक्षु कुर्वन् दिनर्क्षेषु सर्वान् कामान् समश्नुते Ms. 3. 277;<BR> कामानुकूलानयुजो युजश्च Mb. 3. 34. 5. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A joiner, one who unites or joins.<BR>—2 A sage, one who devotes himself to abstract meditation.<BR>—3 A pair, couple (<i>n.</i> also in this sense). ━<i>m.</i> dual.<BR>—1 The sign <i>Gemini</i> of the zodiac.<BR>—2 The two Aśvins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युज्य|युज्यः
युज्य <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Connected, united.<BR>—2 Related to.<BR>—3 Proper, fit, suitable.<BR>—4 Of the same class or kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युज्यः|युज्य
युज्य + .{@-ज्यः@} A kinsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युज्यम्
युज्य + .{@-ज्यम्@}<BR>—1 Union, connection.<BR>—2 Relationship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युञ्जान|युंजान|युञ्जानः
युञ्जान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Joining, uniting.<BR>—2 Proper, fit.<BR>—3 Prosperous, successful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युञ्जानः|युञ्जान|युंजान
युञ्जान + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 A driver, charioteer.<BR>—2 A Brāhmaṇa who is engaged in the practice of Yoga to obtain union<BR> with the Supreme Spirit.<BR>—3 A Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युञ्ज्
युञ्ज् €1 P. See युङ्ग्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युञ्जिन्
युञ्जिन् <i>m.</i> See युङ्गिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युत्
युत् €1 Ā. (योतते) To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1314-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युत|युतं|युतः
युत <i>p. p.</i> [यु-क्त]<BR>—1 United, joined or united with.<BR>—2 Provided or endowed with; as in गुणगणयुतो नरः.<BR>—3 Fastened or attached to.<BR>—4 Accompanied or attended by.<BR>—5 Filled or covered with.<BR>—6 Separated.<BR>—7 (‘यु मिश्रणामिश्रणयोः’ क्तः); भव लघु युताकान्तः N. 19. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युतम्
युत + .{@-तम्@} A measure of length (= 4 <i>hastas</i>).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युतक|युतकं
युतक <i>a.</i> Connected, joined, united.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युतकम्
युतक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A pair.<BR>—2 Union, friendship, alliance.<BR>—3 A nuptial gift.<BR>—4 A sort of dress worn by women.<BR>—5 The edge of a womanʼs garment; संजज्ञे युतकमिवान्तरीयमूर्वोः Ki. 7. 14.<BR>—6 Forming friendship.<BR>—7 Refuge.<BR>—8 The edge of a winnowing-basket.<BR>—9 The foremost part of the feet.<BR>—10 Doubt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युतिः|युति
युतिः <i>f.</i> [यु-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Union, junction.<BR>—2 Being endowed with.<BR>—3 Gaining possession of.<BR>—4 Sum, addition.<BR>—5 (In astr.) Conjunction.<BR>—6 The total number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युध्
युध् €4 Ā. (युध्यते, युद्ध)<BR>—1 To fight, struggle, contend with, wage war; योत्स्यमानानवेक्षेऽहं<BR> य एतेऽत्र समागताः Bg. 1. 23; Bk. 5. 101.<BR>—2 To conquer or overcome in fight. ━<i>Caus.</i> (योधयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to fight.<BR>—2 To oppose or encounter in fight with; सा बाणवर्षिणं रामं योधयित्वा<BR> सुरद्विषाम् R. 12. 50.<BR>—3 To vanquish, conquer. ━<i>Desid.</i> (युयुत्सते) To wish to fight.<BR>━<i>With</i> {@नि@} to wrestle, box. ━{@प्रति@} to encounter in fight, oppose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्ध|युद्धं
युद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Fought, encountered.<BR>—2 Conquered, subdued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धम्
युद्ध + .{@-द्धम्@} [युध्-भावादौ क्त]<BR>—1 War, battle, fight, engagement, contest, struggle, combat; वत्स<BR> केयं वार्ता युद्धं युद्धमिति U. 6.<BR>—2 (In astr.) The opposition or conflict of planets.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: युद्धावसानम्, युद्धावहारिकम्, युद्धाचार्यः, युद्धोद्योगः, युद्धोद्यमः, युद्धोपकरणम्, युद्धोन्मत्त, युद्धकारिन्, युद्धगान्धर्वम्, युद्धतन्त्रम्, युद्धद्यूतम्, युद्धध्वानः, युद्धभूः, युद्धभूमिः, युद्धमार्गः, युद्धयोजक, युद्धरङ्गः, युद्धवर्णः, युद्धवस्तु, युद्धविद्या, युद्धशास्त्रम्, युद्धवीरः, युद्धव्यतिक्रमः, युद्धशालिन्, युद्धसारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धावसानम्
युद्ध + -अवसानम् cessation of hostilities, a truce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धावहारिकम्
युद्ध + -अवहारिकम् booty; युद्धावहारिकं यच्च पितुः स्यात् स हरेत्<BR> तु तत् Mb. 13. 47. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धाचार्यः|युद्धाचार्य
युद्ध + -आचार्यः a military preceptor; Ms. 3. 162.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धोद्योगः|युद्धोद्योग
युद्ध + -उद्योगः, -उद्यमः vigorous or warlike preparations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धोद्यमः|युद्धोद्यम
युद्ध + -उद्योगः, -उद्यमः vigorous or warlike preparations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धोपकरणम्
युद्ध + -उपकरणम् a war-implement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धोन्मत्त
युद्ध + -उन्मत्त <i>a.</i> frantic in battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धकारिन्
युद्ध + -कारिन् <i>a.</i> fighting, contending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धगान्धर्वम्
युद्ध + -गान्धर्वम् battle-music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धतन्त्रम्
युद्ध + -तन्त्रम् military science.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धद्यूतम्
युद्ध + -द्यूतम् chance of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धध्वानः|युद्धध्वान
युद्ध + -ध्वानः battle-cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धभूः
युद्ध + -भूः, -भूमिः <i>f.</i> a battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धभूमिः|युद्धभूमि
युद्ध + -भूः, -भूमिः <i>f.</i> a battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धमार्गः|युद्धमार्ग
युद्ध + -मार्गः military stratagems or tactics, manoeuvres.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धयोजक
युद्ध + -योजक <i>a.</i> eager for battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धरङ्गः|युद्धरङ्ग|युद्धरंग
युद्ध + -रङ्गः<BR>—1 a battle-field, battle arena.<BR>—2 N. of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धवर्णः|युद्धवर्ण
युद्ध + -वर्णः a sort of battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धवस्तु
युद्ध + -वस्तु <i>n.</i> an implement of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धविद्या
युद्ध + -विद्या, -शास्त्रम् military science or art, science of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धशास्त्रम्
युद्ध + -विद्या, -शास्त्रम् military science or art, science of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धवीरः|युद्धवीर
युद्ध + -वीरः<BR>—1 a warrior, hero, champion.<BR>—2 (in Rhet.) the sentiment of heroism arising out of military prowess,<BR> the sentiment of chivalrous heroism; see S. D. 234 and R. G. under युद्धवीर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धव्यतिक्रमः|युद्धव्यतिक्रम
युद्ध + -व्यतिक्रमः violation of the rules of combat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धशालिन्
युद्ध + -शालिन् <i>a.</i> heroic, valiant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धसारः|युद्धसार
युद्ध + -सारः a horse. ━<i>a.</i> provoking (as speech).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युद्धकम्
युद्धकम् War, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युध्
युध् <i>f.</i> War, battle, fight, contest; निघातयिष्यन् युधि यातुधानान्<BR> Bk. 2. 21; सदसि वाक्पटुता युधि विक्रमः Bh. 2. 63; Mb. 5. 23. 20.<BR>━<i>m.</i> A hero, soldier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युधाजित्
युधाजित् <i>m.</i> N. of a king of the Kekayas and maternal uncle of<BR> Bharata; मातुलस्य नगरे युधाजितः प्रेषितौ भरतलक्ष्मणानुजौ Rāmāyaṇachampū.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युधानः|युधान
युधानः<BR>—1 A warrior, a man of the warrior caste.<BR>—2 An enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युधिक|युधिकः
युधिक <i>a.</i> Fighting, contending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युधिष्ठिरः|युधिष्ठिर
युधिष्ठिरः ‘Firm in battle’, N. of the eldest Pāṇḍava prince,<BR> also called ‘Dharma’, ‘Dharmarāja’, ‘Ajātaśatru’ &c. [He was begotten<BR> on Kuntī by the god Yama. He is known more for his truthfulness and righteousness<BR> than for any military achievements or feats of arms. He was formally crowned<BR> emperor of Hastināpura at the conclusion of the great Bhāratī war after<BR> eighteen daysʼ severe fighting, and reigned righteously for many years.<BR> For further particulars about his life, see दुर्योधन.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युध्म|युध्मः
युध्म <i>a.</i> Ved. Martial, warlike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युध्मः|युध्म
युध्म + .{@-ध्मः@}<BR>—1 A warrior.<BR>—2 A battle.<BR>—3 An arrow.<BR>—4 A bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युयुत्सा
युयुत्सा Desire of fighting, hostile intention.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युयुत्सु|युयुत्सुः
युयुत्सु <i>a.</i> Wishing to fight, hostile, bellicose; धर्मक्षेत्रे<BR> कुरुक्षेत्रे समवेता युयुत्सवः Bg. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युयुत्सुः|युयुत्सु
युयुत्सु + .{@-त्सुः@} A combatant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युयुधानः|युयुधान
युयुधानः<BR>—1 N. of Indra.<BR>—2 A Kṣatriya, warrior.<BR>—3 N. of Sātyaki; युयुधानो विराटश्च द्रुपदश्च महारथः Bg. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योद्धृ
योद्धृ <i>m.</i> A fighter, soldier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युन्थ्
युन्थ् €1 P. (v. l. for पुन्थ्)<BR>—1 To kill, to injure.<BR>—2 To suffer; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युप्
युप् €4 P. (युप्यति)<BR>—1 To efface, blot out.<BR>—2 To trouble.<BR>—3 To make level or smooth. ━<i>Caus.</i> (योपयति) To destroy,<BR> obliterate, blot out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युयुः|युयु
युयुः A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युयुक्खुरः|युयुक्खुर
युयुक्खुरः A species of a small tiger or wolf; a hyena (क्षुद्रव्याघ्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवन्
युवन् <i>a.</i> [यौतीति युवा, यु-कनिन् Uṇ. 1. 154] (युवतिः -ती<BR> or यूनी <i>f.</i>; compar. यवीयस् or कनीयस्; superl. यविष्ठ<BR> or कनिष्ठ)<BR>—1 Young, youthful, adult, arrived at puberty.<BR>—2 Strong, healthy.<BR>—3 Excellent, good. ━<i>m.</i> (nom. युवा, युवानौ, युवानः, acc. pl.<BR> यूनः, instr. pl. युवभिः &c.)<BR>—1 A young man, a youth; सा यूनि तस्मिन्नभिलाषबन्धं शशाक शालीनतया<BR> न वक्तुम् R. 6. 81.<BR>—2 A younger descendant (the elder being still alive); जीवति तु वंश्ये<BR> युवा P. IV. 1. 163, I. 2. 65, II. 4. 58, IV. 1. 90.<BR>—3 An elephant 60 years old.<BR>—4 N. of a संवत्सर.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: युवखलती, युवगण्डः, युवजरत्, युवजानिः, युवपलित, युवराज्, युवराजः, युवहन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवखलती
युवन् + -खलती <i>a.</i> (-तिः, -ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> bald in youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवगण्डः|युवगण्ड
युवन् + -गण्डः an eruption on the cheeks or face of young men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवजरत्|युवजरन्त्
युवन् + -जरत् <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> appearing old in youth, prematurely old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवजानिः|युवजानि
युवन् + -जानिः one whose wife is young; युवजानिः धनुष्पाणिः Bk. 5. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवपलित
युवन् + -पलित <i>a.</i> grey-haired in youth; P. II. 1. 67 com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवराज्
युवन् + -राज् <i>m.</i>,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">Page1316-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1315-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवराजः|युवराज
युवन् + -राजः an heir-apparent, a prince-royal, crown-prince; (असौ)<BR> नृपेण चक्रे युवराजशब्दभाक् R. 3. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवहन्
युवन् + -हन् infanticide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवकः|युवक
युवकः A youth, young man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवतिः|युवति
युवतिः, -ती <i>f.</i><BR> [युवन्-ति ङीप् वा] A young woman, any young female<BR> (whether of men or animals); सुरयुवतिसंभवं किल मुनेरपत्यम्<BR> Ś. 2. 9; युवतिजनकथामूकभावः परेषाम् Bh.; so इभयुवतिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवती
युवतिः, -ती <i>f.</i><BR> [युवन्-ति ङीप् वा] A young woman, any young female<BR> (whether of men or animals); सुरयुवतिसंभवं किल मुनेरपत्यम्<BR> Ś. 2. 9; युवतिजनकथामूकभावः परेषाम् Bh.; so इभयुवतिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवती
युवतिः, -ती + .{@-ती@}<BR>—1 The sign <i>virgo</i> of the zodiac.<BR>—2 Turmeric (also युवतिः).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: युवतीष्टा, युवतिजनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवतीष्टा
युवतिः + -इष्टा yellow jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवतिजनः|युवतिजन
युवतिः + -जनः a young woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युवानक
युवानक <i>a.</i> Young.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युष्मद्
युष्मद् The base of the second personal pronoun; (nom. त्वम्, युवाम्,<BR> यूयम्) Thou, you; (at the beginning of several compounds).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: युष्मदर्थम्, युष्मदायत्त, युष्मद्वाच्यम्, युष्मद्विध<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युष्मदर्थम्
युष्मद् + -अर्थम् <i>ind.</i> for you.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युष्मदायत्त
युष्मद् + -आयत्त <i>a.</i> at your disposal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युष्मद्वाच्यम्
युष्मद् + -वाच्यम् (in gram.) the second person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युष्मद्विध
युष्मद् + -विध <i>a.</i> like you.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युष्मदीय|युष्मदीयः
युष्मदीय <i>a.</i> Your, yours.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युष्मदीयः|युष्मदीय
युष्मदीय + .{@-यः@} A countryman of yours; Ratn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युष्मादृश्
युष्मादृश्, -श <i>a.</i><BR> Like you.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

युष्मादृश
युष्मादृश्, -श <i>a.</i><BR> Like you.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यू
यू <i>m., f.</i> See यूषः (= soup).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूकः|यूक
यूकः, -का<BR> A louse; स्वेदजं दंशमशकं यूकामक्षिकमत्कुणम् । ऊष्मणश्चोपजायन्ते … Ms. 1. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूका
यूकः, -का<BR> A louse; स्वेदजं दंशमशकं यूकामक्षिकमत्कुणम् । ऊष्मणश्चोपजायन्ते … Ms. 1. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूकालिक्षम्
यूकालिक्षम्<BR>—1 A louse and its egg.<BR>—2 The egg of a louse (as a measure of length).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूतिः|यूति
यूतिः <i>f.</i> Mixing, union, junction, connection; करोमि वो बहिर्यूतीन्<BR> पिधद्ध्वं पाणिभिर्दृशः Bk. 7. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथम्
यूथम् [यु-थक् पृषो˚ दीर्ध] A herd, flock, multitude, a large<BR> number or troop (as of beasts); स्त्रीरत्नेषु ममोर्वशी प्रियतमा यूथे<BR> तवेयं वशा V. 4. 25; Ś. 5. 5.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यूथचारिन्, यूथनाथः, यूथपः, यूथपतिः, यूथपरिभ्रष्ट, यूथबन्धः, यूथमुख्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथचारिन्
यूथम् + -चारिन् <i>a.</i> going about in troops (as monkeys).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथनाथः|यूथनाथ
यूथम् + -नाथः, -पः, -पतिः<BR>—1 the leader of a troop or band.<BR>—2 the head of a flock or herd (usually of elephants), a lordly elephant;<BR> मृगेन्द्रविक्रीडितयूथपा इव Bhāg. 4. 10. 20; गजयूथप यूथिकाशबलकेशी V. 4. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथपः|यूथप
यूथम् + -नाथः, -पः, -पतिः<BR>—1 the leader of a troop or band.<BR>—2 the head of a flock or herd (usually of elephants), a lordly elephant;<BR> मृगेन्द्रविक्रीडितयूथपा इव Bhāg. 4. 10. 20; गजयूथप यूथिकाशबलकेशी V. 4. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथपतिः|यूथपति
यूथम् + -नाथः, -पः, -पतिः<BR>—1 the leader of a troop or band.<BR>—2 the head of a flock or herd (usually of elephants), a lordly elephant;<BR> मृगेन्द्रविक्रीडितयूथपा इव Bhāg. 4. 10. 20; गजयूथप यूथिकाशबलकेशी V. 4. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथपरिभ्रष्ट
यूथम् + -परिभ्रष्ट <i>a.</i> fallen out from a herd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथबन्धः|यूथबन्ध
यूथम् + -बन्धः a flock, herd, troop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथमुख्यः|यूथमुख्य
यूथम् + -मुख्यः the chief of a troop or herd (as of elephants &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथशः
यूथशः <i>ind.</i> In troops; gregariously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथ्य
यूथ्य <i>a.</i> [यूथ-यत्]<BR>—1 Belonging to a troop or herd (at the end of comp.); सिंहेन क्रुद्धेन<BR> यथाश्वयूथ्या महाबला भीमबलेन तद्वत् Mb. 8. 89. 80.<BR>—2 Belonging to a herd or flock, being at the head of a herd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथ्या
यूथ्य + .{@-थ्या@} A herd, flock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथिका
यूथिका, -यूथी<BR> A kind of jasmine or its flower; यूथिकाशबलकेशी V. 4. 46;<BR> Me. 26; Māl. 9. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूथी
यूथिका, -यूथी<BR> A kind of jasmine or its flower; यूथिकाशबलकेशी V. 4. 46;<BR> Me. 26; Māl. 9. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपः|यूप
यूपः [यु-पक् पृषो˚ दीर्घः; cf. Uṇ. 3. 27]<BR>—1 A sacrificial post (usually made of bamboo or Khadira wood) to which<BR> the victim is fastened at the time of immolation;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">Page1316-2</a>]<BR> अपेक्ष्यते साधुजनेन वैदिकी श्मशानशूलस्य न यूपसत्क्रिया Ku. 5. 73;<BR> ग्रामेष्वात्मविसृष्टेषु यूपचिह्नेषु यज्वनाम् R. 1. 44.<BR>—2 A trophy.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यूपाहुतिः, यूपकटकः, यूपकर्णः, यूपकर्मन्यायः, यूपद्रुः, यूपद्रुमः, यूपद्विपः, यूपहस्तिन्, यूपध्वजः, यूपलक्ष्यः, यूपव्रस्कः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपाहुतिः|यूपाहुति
यूपः + -आहुतिः <i>f.</i> an oblation at the erection of the sacrificial post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपकटकः|यूपकटक
यूपः + -कटकः a wooden ring at the top of the Yūpa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपकर्णः|यूपकर्ण
यूपः + -कर्णः that part of the Yūpa which is sprinkled with ghee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपकर्मन्यायः
यूपः + -कर्मन्यायः the rule according to which the उत्कर्ष or अपकर्ष<BR> of some detail belonging solely to the विकृति will be restricted to<BR> that particular detail alone, so that the तदादितदन्तन्याय will<BR> not apply in that case. This is discussed and established by जैमिनि<BR> and शबर in MS. 5. 1. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपद्रुः|यूपद्रु
यूपः + -द्रुः, -द्रुमः the Khadira tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपद्रुमः|यूपद्रुम
यूपः + -द्रुः, -द्रुमः the Khadira tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपद्विपः
यूपः + -द्विपः, -हस्तिन् <i>a.</i> cloth wrapped round the sacrificial post<BR> in certain rites; मीमांसामांसलप्रज्ञास्तां यूपद्विपदापिनीम् N. 17. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपहस्तिन्
यूपः + -द्विपः, -हस्तिन् <i>a.</i> cloth wrapped round the sacrificial post<BR> in certain rites; मीमांसामांसलप्रज्ञास्तां यूपद्विपदापिनीम् N. 17. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपध्वजः|यूपध्वज
यूपः + -ध्वजः the sacrifice personified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपलक्ष्यः|यूपलक्ष्य
यूपः + -लक्ष्यः a bird (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूपव्रस्कः|यूपव्रस्क
यूपः + -व्रस्कः the cutter of the sacrificial post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूष्
यूष् €1 P. (यूषति) To injure, kill, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूषः|यूष|यूषं
यूषः The Indian mulberry tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूषः|यूष|यूषं
यूषः, -षम्, यूषन् <i>m., n.</i><BR> Soup, broth, pease-soup. (यूषन् has<BR> no forms for the first five inflections, and is optionally substituted<BR> for यूष after acc. dual.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूषम्
यूषः, -षम्, यूषन् <i>m., n.</i><BR> Soup, broth, pease-soup. (यूषन् has<BR> no forms for the first five inflections, and is optionally substituted<BR> for यूष after acc. dual.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यूषन्
यूषः, -षम्, यूषन् <i>m., n.</i><BR> Soup, broth, pease-soup. (यूषन् has<BR> no forms for the first five inflections, and is optionally substituted<BR> for यूष after acc. dual.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

येन
येन <i>ind.</i> (Strictly instr. sing. of यद् used adverbially)<BR>—1 Whereby, by which, wherefore, on which account, by means of which;<BR> किं तद् येन मनो हर्तुमलं स्यातां न शृण्वताम् R. 15. 64, 14. 74.<BR>—2 So that; दर्शय तं चौरसिंहं येन व्यापादयामि Pt. 4.<BR>—3 Since, because.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

येष्
येष् I. €1 Ā. (येषते) To try, strive, attempt. ━II. €1 Ā. Ved.<BR>—1 To bubble.<BR>—2 To flow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योक्तृ
योक्तृ <i>m.</i> [युज्-तृच्]<BR>—1 One who yokes, joins, unites &c.<BR>—2 A coachman.<BR>—3 An exciter, instigator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योक्त्रम्
योक्त्रम्<BR>—1 A cord, rope, thong, halter.<BR>—2 The tie of the yoke of a plough.<BR>—3 The rope by which an animal is tied to the pole of a carriage; छेदने<BR> चैव यन्त्राणां योक्त्ररश्म्योस्तथैव च Ms. 8. 292.<BR>—4 A churning cord; ततो निश्चित्य मथनं योक्त्रं कृत्वा च वासुकिम्<BR> Rām. 1. 45. 18, 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगः|योग
योगः [युज् भावादौ घञ् कुत्वम्]<BR>—1 Joining, uniting.<BR>—2 Union, junction, combination; उपरागान्ते शशिनः समुपगता रोहिणी<BR> योगम् Ś. 7. 22; गुणमहतां महते गुणाय योगः Ki. 10. 25; (वां)<BR> योगस्तडित्तोयदयोरिवास्तु R. 6. 65.<BR>—3 Contact, touch, connection; तमङ्कमारोप्य शरीरयोगजैः सुखैर्निषिञ्चन्तमिवामृतं<BR> त्वचि R. 3. 26.<BR>—4 Employment, application, use; एतैरुपाययोगैस्तु शक्यास्ताः परिरक्षितुम्<BR> Ms. 9. 10; R. 10. 86.<BR>—5 Mode, manner, course, means; ज्ञानविज्ञानयोगेन कर्मणामुद्धरन्<BR> जटाः Bhāg. 3. 24. 17; कथायोगेन बुध्यते H. 1 ‘In the course of conversation’.<BR>—6 Consequence, result; (mostly at the end of comp. or in abl.); रक्षायोगादयमपि<BR> तपः प्रत्यहं संचिनोति Ś. 2. 15; Ku. 7. 55.<BR>—7 A yoke.<BR>—8 A conveyance, vehicle, carriage.<BR>—9<BR>——(<i>a</i>) An armour.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Putting on armour.<BR>—10 Fitness, propriety, suitableness.<BR>—11 An occupation, a work, business.<BR>—12 A trick,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-1" target="_blank">Page1317-1</a>]<BR> fraud, device; योगाधमनविक्रीतं योगदानप्रतिग्रहम् Ms. 8. 165.<BR>—13 An expedient, plan, means in general.<BR>—14 Endeavour, zeal, diligence, assiduity; ज्ञानमेकस्थमाचार्ये ज्ञानं<BR> योगश्च पाण्डवे Mb. 7. 188. 45; इन्द्रियाणां जये योगं समातिष्ठेद् दिवानिशम् Ms. 7. 44.<BR>—15 Remedy, cure.<BR>—16 A charm, spell, incantation, magic, magical art; तथाख्यातविधानं<BR> च योगः संचार एव च Mb. 12. 59. 48.<BR>—17 Gaining, acquiring, acquisition; बलस्य योगाय बलप्रधानम् Rām. 2. 82. 30.<BR>—18 The equipment of an army.<BR>—19 Fixing, putting on, practice; सत्येन रक्ष्यते धर्मो विद्या योगेन<BR> रक्ष्यते Mb. 5. 34. 39.<BR>—20 A side; an argument.<BR>—21 An occasion, opportunity.<BR>—22 Possibility, occurrence.<BR>—23 Wealth, substance.<BR>—24 A rule, precept.<BR>—25 Dependence, relation, regular order or connection, dependence of one<BR> word upon another.<BR>—26 Etymology or derivation of the meaning of a word.<BR>—27 The etymological meaning of a word (opp. रूढि); अवयवशक्तिर्योगः.<BR>—28 Deep and abstract meditation, concentration of the mind, contemplation<BR> of the Supreme Spirit, which in <i>Yoga</i> phil. is defined as चित्तवृत्तिनिरोध;<BR> स ब्रह्मयोगयुक्तात्मा सुखमक्षयमश्नुते Bg. 5. 21; सती सती योगविसृष्टदेहा<BR> Ku. 1. 21; V. 1. 1; योगेनान्ते तनुत्यजाम् R. 1. 8.<BR>—29 The system of philosophy established by Patañjali, which is considered<BR> to be the second division of the Sāṃkhya philosophy, but is practically<BR> reckoned as a separate system; एकं सांख्यं च योगं च यः पश्यति<BR> स पश्यति Bg. 5. 5. (The chief aim of the <i>Yoga</i> philosophy is<BR> to teach the means by which the human soul may be completely united with<BR> the Supreme Spirit and thus secure absolution; and deep abstract meditation<BR> is laid down as the chief means of securing this end, elaborate rules<BR> being given for the proper practice of such <i>Yoga</i> or concentration of mind.)<BR>—30 A follower of the Yoga system of philosophy; जापकैस्तुल्यफलता<BR> योगानां नात्र संशयः Mb. 12. 200. 23.<BR>—31 (In arith.) Addition.<BR>—32 (In astr.) Conjunction, lucky conjunction.<BR>—33 A combination of stars.<BR>—34 N. of a particular astronomical division of time (27 such <i>Yogas</i><BR> are usually enumerated).<BR>—35 The principal star in a lunar mansion.<BR>—36 Devotion, pious seeking after god.<BR>—37 A spy, secret agent.<BR>—38 A traitor, a violator of truth or confidence.<BR>—39 An attack; योगमाज्ञापयामास शिवस्य विषयं प्रति Śiva B. 13. 7.<BR>—40 Steady application; श्रुताद् हि प्रज्ञा, प्रज्ञया योगो योगादात्मवत्ता<BR> Kau. A. 1. 5; मयि चानन्ययोगेन भक्तिरव्यभिचारिणी Bg. 13. 10.<BR>—41 Ability, power; एतां विभूतिं योगं च मम यो वेत्ति तत्त्वतः<BR> Bg. 10. 7; पश्य मे योगमैश्वरम् 11. 8.<BR>—42 Equality, sameness; समत्वं योग उच्यते Bg. 2. 48.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: योगाङ्गम्, योगाञ्जनम्, योगानुशासनम्, योगाभ्यासिन्, योगाख्या, योगाचारः, योगाचार्यः, योगाधमनम्, योगापत्तिः, योगारूढ, योगावापः, योगासनम्, योगेन्द्रः, योगेशः, योगेश्वरः, योगेष्टम्, योगकक्षा, योगकन्या, योगक्षेमः, योगक्षेमौ, योगक्षेमे, योगगतिः, योगगामिन्, योगचक्षुस्, योगचरः, योगचूर्णम्, योगजम्, योगतल्पम्, योगतारका, योगतारा, योगदण्डः, योगदानम्, योगधारणा, योगनाथः, योगनाविका, योगनाविकः, योगनिद्रा, योगनिद्रालुः, योगनिलयः, योगपट्टम्, योगपतिः, योगपदम्, योगपादुका, योगपानम्, योगपारगः, योगपीठम्, योगपीडः, योगपीडम्, योगपुरुषः, योगबलम्, योगभावना, योगभ्रष्ट, योगमाया, योगयात्रा, योगयुक्त, योगरङ्गः, योगरत्नम्, योगराजः, योगरूढ, योगरोचना, योगवर्तिका, योगवरः, योगवामनम्, योगवासिष्ठम्, योगवाहः, योगवाहक, योगवाहिन्, योगवाही, योगविक्रयः, योगविद्, योगविद्या, योगविधिः, योगविभागः, योगशब्दः, योगशायिन्, योगशास्त्रम्, योगसंसिद्धिः, योगसमाधिः, योगसारः, योगसिद्धिः, योगसूत्रम्, योगसेवा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1316-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगाङ्गम्
योगः + -अङ्गम् a means of attaining <i>Yoga</i>; (these are eight; for<BR> their names see यम 5.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगाञ्जनम्
योगः + -अञ्जनम् a healing ointment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगानुशासनम्
योगः + -अनुशासनम् the doctrine of the <i>Yoga</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगाभ्यासिन्
योगः + -अभ्यासिन् <i>a.</i> practising the Yoga philosophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगाख्या
योगः + -आख्या a name based on mere casual contact; स्याद् योगाख्या हि माथुरवत्<BR> MS. 1. 3. 21. (cf. एषा योगाख्या योगमात्रापेक्षा न भूतवर्तमानभविष्यत्संबन्धापेक्षा<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">Page1317-2</a>]<BR> ŚB. on MS. on ibid.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगाचारः|योगाचार
योगः + -आचारः<BR>—1 the practice or observance of <i>Yoga</i>.<BR>—2 a follower of that Buddhist school which maintains the eternal existence<BR> of intelligence or विज्ञान alone.<BR>—3 An act of fraud or magic; ततोऽनेन योगाचारन्यायेन दूरमाकृष्य Mv. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगाचार्यः|योगाचार्य
योगः + -आचार्यः<BR>—1 a teacher of magic.<BR>—2 a teacher of the <i>Yoga</i> philosophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगाधमनम्
योगः + -आधमनम् a fraudulent pledge; योगाधमनविक्रीतम् Ms. 8. 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगापत्तिः|योगापत्ति
योगः + -आपत्तिः modification of usage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगारूढ|योगारूढः
योगः + -आरूढ <i>a.</i> engaged in profound and abstract meditation; योगारूढस्य<BR> तस्यैव शमः कारणमुच्यते Bg. 6. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगावापः|योगावाप
योगः + -आवापः the first attitude of an archer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगासनम्
योगः + -आसनम् a posture suited to profound and abstract meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगेन्द्रः|योगेन्द्र|योगेंद्र
योगः + -इन्द्रः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 an adept in or a master of <i>Yoga</i>.<BR>—2 one who has obtained superhuman faculties.<BR>—3 a magician.<BR>—4 a deity.<BR>—5 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—6 A Vetāla.<BR>—7 an epithet of Yājñavalkya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगेशः|योगेश
योगः + -इन्द्रः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 an adept in or a master of <i>Yoga</i>.<BR>—2 one who has obtained superhuman faculties.<BR>—3 a magician.<BR>—4 a deity.<BR>—5 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—6 A Vetāla.<BR>—7 an epithet of Yājñavalkya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगेश्वरः|योगेश्वर
योगः + -इन्द्रः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः<BR>—1 an adept in or a master of <i>Yoga</i>.<BR>—2 one who has obtained superhuman faculties.<BR>—3 a magician.<BR>—4 a deity.<BR>—5 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—6 A Vetāla.<BR>—7 an epithet of Yājñavalkya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगेष्टम्
योगः + -इष्टम्<BR>—1 tin.<BR>—2 lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगकक्षा
योगः + -कक्षा = योगपट्टम् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगकन्या
योगः + -कन्या N. of the infant daughter of Yaśodā (substituted as the<BR> child of Devakī for Kṛṣṇa and killed by Kaṃsa).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगक्षेमः|योगक्षेम|योगक्षेमं
योगः + -क्षेमः<BR>—1 security of possession, keeping safe of property.<BR>—2 the charge for securing property from accidents, insurance; Ms. 7. 127.<BR>—3 welfare, well-being, security, prosperity; तेषां नित्याभियुक्तानां<BR> योगक्षेमं वहाम्यहम् Bg. 9. 22; मुग्धाया मे जनन्या योगक्षेमं वहस्व M. 4.<BR>—4 property, profit, gain.<BR>—5 property designed for pious uses; cf. Ms. 9. 219.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगक्षेमौ
योगः + -क्षेमौ, -क्षेमे or {@-मम्@}<BR> (<i>i. e.</i> <i>m.</i> or <i>n.</i> dual or <i>n.</i> sing.) acquisition<BR> and preservation (of property), gain and security, preserving the old<BR> and acquiring the new (not previously obtained); अलभ्यलाभो योगः स्यात्<BR> क्षेमो लब्धस्य पालनम्; see Y. 1. 100 and Mit. thereon; तेन भृता<BR> राजानः प्रजानां योगक्षेमवहाः Kau. A. 1. 13; आन्वीक्षिकीत्रयीवार्तानां<BR> योगक्षेमसाधनो दण्डः । तस्य नीतिः दण्डनीतिः Kau. A. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगक्षेमे
योगः + -क्षेमौ, -क्षेमे or {@-मम्@}<BR> (<i>i. e.</i> <i>m.</i> or <i>n.</i> dual or <i>n.</i> sing.) acquisition<BR> and preservation (of property), gain and security, preserving the old<BR> and acquiring the new (not previously obtained); अलभ्यलाभो योगः स्यात्<BR> क्षेमो लब्धस्य पालनम्; see Y. 1. 100 and Mit. thereon; तेन भृता<BR> राजानः प्रजानां योगक्षेमवहाः Kau. A. 1. 13; आन्वीक्षिकीत्रयीवार्तानां<BR> योगक्षेमसाधनो दण्डः । तस्य नीतिः दण्डनीतिः Kau. A. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगक्षेमम्
योगः + -क्षेमौ, -क्षेमे or {@-मम्@}<BR> (<i>i. e.</i> <i>m.</i> or <i>n.</i> dual or <i>n.</i> sing.) acquisition<BR> and preservation (of property), gain and security, preserving the old<BR> and acquiring the new (not previously obtained); अलभ्यलाभो योगः स्यात्<BR> क्षेमो लब्धस्य पालनम्; see Y. 1. 100 and Mit. thereon; तेन भृता<BR> राजानः प्रजानां योगक्षेमवहाः Kau. A. 1. 13; आन्वीक्षिकीत्रयीवार्तानां<BR> योगक्षेमसाधनो दण्डः । तस्य नीतिः दण्डनीतिः Kau. A. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगगतिः|योगगति
योगः + -गतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 primitive condition.<BR>—2 the state of union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगगामिन्
योगः + -गामिन् <i>a.</i> going (through the air) by means of magical power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगचक्षुस्
योगः + -चक्षुस् <i>m.</i> a Brāhmaṇa<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगचरः|योगचर
योगः + -चरः N. of Hanumat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगचूर्णम्
योगः + -चूर्णम् a magical powder, a powder having magical virtues; कल्पितमनेन<BR> योगचूर्णमिश्रितमौषधं चन्द्रगुप्ताय Mu. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगजम्
योगः + -जम् agallochum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगतल्पम्
योगः + -तल्पम् = योगनिद्रा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगतारका
योगः + -तारका, -तारा the chief star in a <i>Nakṣatra</i> or constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगतारा
योगः + -तारका, -तारा the chief star in a <i>Nakṣatra</i> or constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगदण्डः|योगदण्ड
योगः + -दण्डः a magic wand; Sinhās.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगदानम्
योगः + -दानम्<BR>—1 communicating the <i>Yoga</i> doctrine.<BR>—2 a fraudulent gift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगधारणा
योगः + -धारणा perseverance or steady continuance in devotion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगनाथः|योगनाथ
योगः + -नाथः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 of Datta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगनाविका
योगः + -नाविका, -नाविकः a kind of fish;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगनाविकः|योगनाविक
योगः + -नाविका, -नाविकः a kind of fish;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगनिद्रा
योगः + -निद्रा<BR>—1 a state of half contemplation and half sleep, a state between sleep<BR> and wakefulness; <i>i. e.</i> light sleep; गर्भे प्रणीते देवक्या रोहिणीं<BR> योगनिद्रया Bhāg. 10. 2. 15; योगनिद्रां गतस्य मम Pt. 1; H. 3. 75;<BR> ब्रह्मज्ञानाभ्यसनविधिना योगनिद्रां गतस्य Bh. 3. 41.<BR>—2 particularly, the sleep of Viṣṇu at the end of a Yuga; R. 10. 14, 13. 6.<BR>—3 N. of Durgā.<BR>—4 the great sleep of Brahmā during the period between प्रलय and<BR> उत्पत्ति of the universe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगनिद्रालुः|योगनिद्रालु
योगः + -निद्रालुः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगनिलयः|योगनिलय
योगः + -निलयः N. of Śiva or Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपट्टम्
योगः + -पट्टम् a cloth thrown over the back and knees of an ascetic during<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">Page1318-1</a>]<BR> abstract meditation; क्षणनीरवया यया निशि श्रितवप्रावलियोगपट्टया<BR> N. 2. 78; एकान्तावलम्बितयोगपट्टिकाम् गुहाम् K. Pūrvabhāga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1317-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपतिः|योगपति
योगः + -पतिः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपदम्
योगः + -पदम् a state of self-concentration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपादुका
योगः + -पादुका a magical shoe (taking the wearer anywhere he wishes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपानम्
योगः + -पानम् a liquor adulterated with narcotics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपारगः
योगः + -पारगः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपीठम्
योगः + -पीठम् a particular posture during Yoga meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपीडः
योगः + -पीडः, -पीडम् a kind of posture of the gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपीडम्
योगः + -पीडः, -पीडम् a kind of posture of the gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगपुरुषः|योगपुरुष
योगः + -पुरुषः a spy; यथा च योगपुरुषैरन्यान् राजाधितिष्ठति Kau. A. 1. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगबलम्
योगः + -बलम्<BR>—1 the power of devotion or abstract meditation, any supernatural power.<BR>—2 power of magic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगभावना
योगः + -भावना (in alg.) composition of numbers by the sum of their products.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगभ्रष्ट
योगः + -भ्रष्ट <i>a.</i> one who has fallen from the practice of Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगमाया
योगः + -माया<BR>—1 the magical power of the <i>Yoga</i>.<BR>—2 the power of God in the creation of the world personified as a deity;<BR> (भगवतः सर्जनार्था शक्तिः); नाहं प्रकाशः सर्वस्य योगमायासमावृतः Bg. 7. 25.<BR>—3 N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगयात्रा
योगः + -यात्रा the way to the union with the Supreme Spirit; the way of<BR> attaining Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगयुक्त
योगः + -युक्त <i>a.</i> immersed in deep meditation, absorbed; योगयुक्तो<BR> भवार्जुन Bg. 8. 27, 5. 6-7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगरङ्गः|योगरङ्ग|योगरंग
योगः + -रङ्गः the orange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगरत्नम्
योगः + -रत्नम् a magical jewel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगराजः|योगराज
योगः + -राजः<BR>—1 a kind of medicinal preparation.<BR>—2 one well-versed in Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगरूढ|योगरूढः
योगः + -रूढ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having an etymological as well as a special or conventional meaning<BR> (said of a word); <i>e. g.</i> the word पङ्कज etymologically means<BR> ‘anything produced in mud’, but in usage or popular convention it is restricted<BR> to some things only produced in mud, such as the lotus; cf. the word आतपत्र or ‘parasol’.<BR>—2 engaged in meditation (s. v. -आरूढ);<BR> ध्यायन्ते … … योगिनो योगरूढाः .. Brav. P.<BR> ब्रह्मखण्ड 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगरोचना
योगः + -रोचना a kind of magical ointment said to have the power of making<BR> one invisible or invulnerable; तेन च परितुष्टेन योगरोचना मे दत्ता Mk. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगवर्तिका|योगवर्त्तिका
योगः + -वर्तिका a magical lamp or wick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगवरः
योगः + -वरः an epithet of Hanumant; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगवामनम्
योगः + -वामनम् secret contrivances; Kau. A.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगवासिष्ठम्
योगः + -वासिष्ठम् N. of a work (treating of the means of obtaining final<BR> beatitude by means of Yoga).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगवाहः|योगवाह
योगः + -वाहः a term for the sounds विसर्जनीय, जिह्वामूलीय, उपध्मानीय<BR> and नासिक्य qq. vv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगवाहक
योगः + -वाहक <i>a.</i> resolving (chemically).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगवाहिन्
योगः + -वाहिन् <i>a.</i> assimilating to oneʼs self. ━<i>m., n.</i> medium for<BR> mixing medicines (such as natron, honey, mercury); नानाद्रव्यात्मकत्वाच्च<BR> योगवाहि परं मधु Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगवाही
योगः + -वाही<BR>—1 an alkali.<BR>—2 honey.<BR>—3 quicksilver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगविक्रयः|योगविक्रय
योगः + -विक्रयः a fraudulent sale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगविद्
योगः + -विद् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 knowing the proper method, skilful, clever.<BR>—2 conversant with <i>Yoga</i>. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 a practiser of <i>Yoga</i>.<BR>—3 a follower of the <i>Yoga</i> doctrines.<BR>—4 a magician.<BR>—5 a compounder of medicines.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगविद्या
योगः + -विद्या the science of Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगविधिः
योगः + -विधिः practice of Yoga or mental abstraction; न च योगविधेर्नवेतरः<BR> स्थिरधीरा परमात्मदर्शनात् (विरराम) R. 8. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगविभागः|योगविभाग
योगः + -विभागः separation of that which is usually combined together<BR> into one; especially, the separation of the words of a Sūtra, the splitting<BR> of one rule into two or more (frequently used by Patañjali in<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">Page1318-2</a>]<BR> his Mahābhāṣya; <i>e. g.</i> see अदसो मात् P. I. 1. 12).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगशब्दः|योगशब्द
योगः + -शब्दः a word the meaning of which is plain from the etymology.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगशायिन्
योगः + -शायिन् <i>a.</i> half asleep and half absorbed in contemplation;<BR> cf. योगनिद्रा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगशास्त्रम्
योगः + -शास्त्रम् the <i>Yoga</i> philosophy, esp. the work of Patañjali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगसंसिद्धिः|योगसंसिद्धि
योगः + -संसिद्धिः perfection in Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगसमाधिः|योगसमाधि
योगः + -समाधिः the absorption of the soul in profound and abstract<BR> contemplation; तमसः परमापदव्ययं पुरुषं योगसमाधिना रघुः R. 8. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगसारः|योगसार
योगः + -सारः a universal remedy; a panacea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगसिद्धिः|योगसिद्धि
योगः + -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i> achievement in succession <i>i. e.</i> by separate<BR> performance; पर्यायो योगसिद्धिः ŚB. on MS. ˚न्यायः the rule according<BR> to which when an act (<i>e. g.</i> दर्शपूर्णमास) is said to yield all<BR> desired objects, what is meant is that it can yield them only one at a<BR> time and not all simultaneously. This is established by जैमिनि and<BR> शबर in MS. 4. 3. 27-28. Thus for the achievement of each separate<BR> काम, a separate performance of the याग is necessary; (see दर्शपूर्णमासन्याय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगसूत्रम्
योगः + -सूत्रम् aphorisms of the <i>Yoga</i> system of philosophy (attributed<BR> to Patañjali).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगसेवा
योगः + -सेवा the practice of abstract meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगतः
योगतः <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 In consequence of, by means of; तपोबलयोगतः &c.<BR>—2 Suitably, properly.<BR>—3 Conjointly.<BR>—4 Conformably to, in accordance with.<BR>—5 In due time, opportunely.<BR>—6 Through devotion.<BR>—7 By the power of magic.<BR>—8 With application of effort, with all oneʼs powers; सर्वान् संसाधयेदर्थानक्षिण्वन्<BR> योगतस्तनुम् Ms. 2. 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगस्
योगस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 Meditation, religious abstraction.<BR>—2 The half of a lunar month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगिक
योगिक <i>a.</i> Used for practice; प्रथमं योगिकं चापं युद्धचापं<BR> द्वितीयकम् Dhanur. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगित
योगित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Charmed, enchanted.<BR>—2 Mad, crazy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगिन्
योगिन् <i>a.</i> [युज्-धिनुण्, योग-इनि वा]<BR>—1 Connected or endowed with.<BR>—2 Possessed of magical powers.<BR>—3 Endowed or provided with, possessing. —4 Practising <i>Yoga</i>. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A contemplative saint, a devotee, an ascetic; आत्मौपम्येन सर्वत्र<BR> समं पश्यति योऽर्जुन । सुखं वा यदि वा दुःखं स योगी परमो मतः ।<BR> Bg. 6. 32; see the sixth adhyāya <i>inter alia</i>; सेवाधर्मः<BR> परमगहनो योगिनामप्यगम्यः Pt. 1. 285; बभूव योगी किल कार्तवीर्यः R. 6. 38.<BR>—2 A magician, sorcerer.<BR>—3 A follower of the <i>Yoga</i> system of philosophy.<BR>—4 N. of Yājñavalkya.<BR>—5 Of Arjuna.<BR>—6 Of Viṣṇu.<BR>—7 Of Śiva.<BR>—8 N. of a mixed caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगिनी
योगिन् + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 A female magician, witch, sorceress, fairy.<BR>—2 A female devotee.<BR>—3 N. of a class of female attendants on Śiva or Durgā; बलीनदात्<BR> योगिनीभ्यो दिक्पालेभ्योऽप्यनेकधा Śiva B. 6. 51; (they are usually said to be eight).<BR>—4 N. of Durgā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: योगीन्द्रः, योगीशः, योगीश्वरी, योगीष्टम्, योगिदण्डः, योगिनिद्रा, योगिमार्गः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगीन्द्रः|योगीन्द्र
योगिन् + -इन्द्रः, -ईशः<BR>—1 the chief of saints.<BR>—2 N. of Yājñavalkya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगीशः|योगीश
योगिन् + -इन्द्रः, -ईशः<BR>—1 the chief of saints.<BR>—2 N. of Yājñavalkya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगीश्वरी
योगिन् + -ईश्वरी the chief of magicians.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगीष्टम्
योगिन् + -इष्टम् lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगिदण्डः|योगिदण्ड
योगिन् + -दण्डः a kind of reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगिनिद्रा
योगिन् + -निद्रा light-sleep, wakefulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योगिमार्गः|योगिमार्ग
योगिन् + -मार्गः the air, atmosphere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1318-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योग्य|योग्यं|योग्यः
योग्य <i>a.</i> [योगमर्हति यत्, युज् ण्यत् वा]<BR>—1 Fit, proper, suitable, appropriate, qualified; योग्योऽय दृश्यते नरः<BR>—2 Fit or suitable for, qualified for, capable of, able to (with loc.,<BR> dat. or even gen. or in comp.).<BR>—3 Useful, serviceable.<BR>—4 Fit for <i>Yoga</i> or abstract meditation.<BR>—5 (In Nyāya phil.) Amenable to the senses, capable of being directly cognized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योग्यः|योग्य|योग्यं
योग्य + .{@-ग्यः@}<BR>—1 A calculator of expedients.<BR>—2 The asterism Puṣya.<BR>—3 A draught animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योग्या
योग्य + .{@-ग्या@}<BR>—1 Exercise or practice in general; तद् यथा भूमिरथिको भूमौ रथमालिख्य<BR> योग्यां करोति । सा तस्य योग्या प्रयोगकाले सौकर्यमुत्पादयति । Ś. B. on MS. 7. 2. 15<BR> योग्यामुपास्ते नु युवां युयुक्षुः N. 3. 117; अपरः<BR> प्रणिधानयोग्यया मरुतः पञ्च शरीरगोचरान् R. 8. 19; so मानयोग्या<BR> Kāv. 2. 243; धनुर्योग्या, अस्त्रयोग्या Rām. 2. 1. 12 &c.<BR>—2 Martial exercise, drill.<BR>—3 The earth.<BR>—4 N. of a wife of Sūrya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योग्यम्
योग्य + .{@-ग्यम्@}<BR>—1 A conveyance, carriage, vehicle.<BR>—2 Sandal-wood.<BR>—3 A cake.<BR>—4 Milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योग्यता
योग्यता<BR>—1 Ability, capability; न युद्धयोग्यतामस्य पश्यामि सह राक्षसैः Rām.<BR>—2 Fitness, propriety.<BR>—3 Appropriateness.<BR>—4 (In Nyāya phil.) Fitness or compatibility of sense, the absence of<BR> absurdity in the mutual connection of the things signified by the words;<BR> <i>e. g.</i> in अग्निना सिञ्चति there is no योग्यता; it is thus defined:−<BR> एकपदार्थेऽपरपदार्थसंसर्गो योग्यता Tarka K.; or पदार्थानां परस्परसंबन्धे<BR> बाधाभावः S. D. 2; पदार्थे तत्र तद्वत्ता योग्यता परिकीर्तिता Bhāṣā P.<BR>—5 Purity (पवित्रता); व्यनक्ति कालत्रितयेऽपि योग्यताम् Śi. 1. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योजक
योजक <i>a.</i> [युज्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 One who yokes or harnesses.<BR>—2 Joining, uniting, providing &c.<BR>—3 A joiner, arranger, contriver; योजकस्तत्र दुर्लभः. Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योजनम्
योजनम् [युज्-भावादौ ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Joining, uniting, yoking.<BR>—2 Applying, fixing.<BR>—3 Preparation, arrangement.<BR>—4 Grammatical construction, construing the sense of a passage.<BR>—5 A measure of distance equal to four <i>Krośas</i> or eight or nine<BR> miles; स्याद् योजनं क्रोशचतुष्टयेन; प्रथममगमदह्ना योजने योजनेशः<BR> Līlā.; न योजनशतं दूरं वाह्यमानस्य तृष्णया H. 1. 146.<BR>—6 Exciting, instigation.<BR>—7 Concentration of the mind, abstraction (= योग q. v.).<BR>—8 Erecting, constructing (also योजना in this sense).<BR>—9 Ved. Effort, exertion.<BR>—10 A road, way.<BR>—11 The Supreme Spirit of the universe.<BR>—12 A finger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योजना
योजनम् + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 Junction, union, connection.<BR>—2 Grammatical construction.<BR>—3 Use, application.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: योजनगन्धा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योजनगन्धा
योजनम् + -गन्धा<BR>—1 musk.<BR>—2 N. of Satyavatī, mother of Vyāsa.<BR>—3 of Sītā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योजनिक
योजनिक <i>a.</i> Measuring so many Yojanas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योजनीय
योजनीय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be joined or united.<BR>—2 To be added.<BR>—3 Useful, serviceable.<BR>—4 To be appointed, commissioned.<BR>—5 To be grammatically corrected or arranged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योजयितृ
योजयितृ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Joining, combining.<BR>—2 An employer, setter; भवति योजयितुर्वचनीयता Pt. 1. 75. ━<i>m.</i><BR> A setter (of precious stones).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योजित|योजितं
योजित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Yoked, harnessed.<BR>—2 Used, employed.<BR>—3 Joined, connected.<BR>—4 Supplied, furnished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योटकः|योटक
योटकः A combination of stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योतुः|योतु
योतुः<BR>—1 A measure (in general)<BR>—2 Cleaning, purifying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योत्रम्
योत्रम् See योक्त्रम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योद्धृ
योद्धृ <i>m.</i> [युध्-तृच्] A warrior, combatant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधः|योध
योधः [युध्-अच्]<BR>—1 A warrior, soldier, combatant; सहास्मदीयैरपि योधमुख्यैः Mb.;<BR> वसन्तयोधः समुपागतः प्रिये Ṛs. 6. 1; Bg. 11. 26.<BR>—2 War, battle.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: योधागारः, योधागारम्, योधधर्मः, योधमुख्यः, योधसंरावः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधागारः|योधागार
योधः + -अगारः, -अगारम् a soldierʼs dwelling, a barrack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधागारम्
योधः + -अगारः, -अगारम् a soldierʼs dwelling, a barrack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधधर्मः|योधधर्म
योधः + -धर्मः the law of soldiers, a military law; योधधर्मः सनातनः Ms. 7. 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधमुख्यः|योधमुख्य
योधः + -मुख्यः a chief warrior, leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधसंरावः|योधसंराव
योधः + -संरावः mutual defiance of combatants, a challenge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधनम्
योधनम् [युध्-भावे-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 War, battle, contest; ते तु शूरा महाराज कृतचित्ताश्च योधने Mb. 9. 18. 4.<BR>—2 A weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधनः|योधन|योधनं
योधनम् + .{@-नः@} A warrior, combatant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधिन्
योधिन् <i>m.</i> [युध्-णिनि] A warrior, soldier, combatant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योधेयः|योधेय
योधेयः<BR>—1 A warrior.<BR>—2 N. of a race (यौधेय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योन
योन <i>a.</i> Regarding race; तैर्यग्योनश्च पञ्चधा भवति Sāṅ. K. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनलः|योनल
योनलः = यवनालः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिः|योनि
योनिः <i>m. f.</i> [यु-नि Uṇ. 4. 51]<BR>—1 Womb, uterus, vulva, the female organ of generation.<BR>—2 Any place of birth or origin, generating cause, spring, fountain; स्वासु<BR> योनिषु शाम्यति Ms. 9. 321; सा योनिः सर्ववैराणां सा हि लोकस्य निरृतिः<BR> U. 5. 30; जगद्योनिरयोनिस्त्वम् Ku. 2. 9, 4. 43; oft. at the end of<BR> comp. in the sense of ‘sprung or produced from’; ये हि संस्पर्शजा भोगा<BR> दुःखयोनय एव ते Bg. 5. 22.<BR>—3 A mine.<BR>—4 An abode, a place, repository, seat, receptacle.<BR>—5 Home, lair.<BR>—6 A family, stock, race, birth, form of existence; as मनुष्ययोनि,<BR> पक्षि˚, पशु˚ &c.<BR>—7 The asterism पूर्वफल्गुनी.<BR>—8 Water.<BR>—9 The base (of a सामन्) <i>i. e.</i> the ऋक् which is set to music<BR> and sung as सामन्; योनिश्चासौ शस्या च योनिशस्या ŚB. on MS. 7. 2. 17.<BR>—10 Copper; L. D. B.<BR>—11 The primary cause; कला पञ्चदशी योनिस्तद्धाम प्रतिबुध्यते Mb. 12. 304. 4.<BR>—12 The source of understanding; एषा धर्मस्य वो योनिः समासेन प्रकीर्तिता<BR> Ms. 2. 25 (com. योनिर्ज्ञप्तिकारणं ‘वेदोऽखिलो धर्ममूलम्’ इत्यादिनोक्तमित्यर्थः).<BR>—13 Longing for, desire (वासना); संसारसागरगमां योनिपातालदुस्तराम्<BR> Mb. 12. 250. 15.<BR>—14 Seed, grain. ˚पोषणम् the growing of seed.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: योनिगुणः, योनिज, योनिदेवता, योनिदोषः, योनिनासा, योनिभ्रंशः, योनिमुक्त, योनिमुखम्, योनिमुद्रा, योनिरञ्जनम्, योनिलिङ्गम्, योनिशस्या, योनिसंवरणम्, योनिसंवृत्तिः, योनिसंकटम्, योनिसंकरः, योनिसम्बन्धः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिगुणः|योनिगुण
योनिः + -गुणः the quality of the womb or place of origin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिज|योनिजं
योनिः + -ज <i>a.</i> born of the womb, viviparous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिदेवता
योनिः + -देवता the asterism पूर्वफल्गुनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिदोषः|योनिदोष
योनिः + -दोषः<BR>—1 Sexual defilement.<BR>—2 A defect of the female organ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिनासा
योनिः + -नासा the upper part of the female organ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिभ्रंशः|योनिभ्रंश
योनिः + -भ्रंशः fall of the womb, <i>prolapsus uteri</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिमुक्त
योनिः + -मुक्त <i>a.</i> released from birth or being born again.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिमुखम्
योनिः + -मुखम् the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">Page1320-1</a>]<BR> orifice of the womb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1319-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिमुद्रा
योनिः + -मुद्रा a particular position of fingers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिरञ्जनम्
योनिः + -रञ्जनम् the menstrual discharge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिलिङ्गम्
योनिः + -लिङ्गम् the clitoris.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिशस्या
योनिः + -शस्या a Ṛgvedic verse which is both a योनि as well as a<BR> शस्या (q. v.); योनिशस्याश्च तुल्यवदितराभिर्विधीयन्ते MS. 7. 2. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिसंवरणम्
योनिः + -संवरणम्, -संवृत्तिः Contraction of the vagina.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिसंवृत्तिः|योनिसंवृत्ति
योनिः + -संवरणम्, -संवृत्तिः Contraction of the vagina.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिसंकटम्
योनिः + -संकटम् rebirth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिसंकरः|योनिसङ्कर|योनिसंकर
योनिः + -संकरः mixture of caste by unlawful intermarriage; कुले मुख्येऽपि<BR> जातस्य यस्य स्याद् योनिसंकरः Ms. 10. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनिसम्बन्धः|योनिसम्बन्ध|योनिसंबन्ध
योनिः + -सम्बन्धः relation by marriage, connection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योनी
योनी See योनि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योपनम्
योपनम्<BR>—1 Effacing, blotting out.<BR>—2 Anything used for effacing.<BR>—3 Confusing, preplexing.<BR>—4 Molesting, oppressing, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योषणा
योषणा A young girl, maiden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योषा
योषा, योषित् <i>f.</i>, योषिता<BR> [Uṇ. 1. 97] A woman, a girl, young woman in general;<BR> गच्छन्तीनां रमणवसतिं योषितां तत्र नक्तम् Me. 39; Śi. 4. 42, 8. 25;<BR> योषा योषित् योषिता च जोषा जोषिञ्च जोषिता Śabdaratnāvalī.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: योषाग्राहः, योषाप्रिया, योषारत्नम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योषित्
योषा, योषित् <i>f.</i>, योषिता<BR> [Uṇ. 1. 97] A woman, a girl, young woman in general;<BR> गच्छन्तीनां रमणवसतिं योषितां तत्र नक्तम् Me. 39; Śi. 4. 42, 8. 25;<BR> योषा योषित् योषिता च जोषा जोषिञ्च जोषिता Śabdaratnāvalī.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: योषाग्राहः, योषाप्रिया, योषारत्नम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योषिता
योषा, योषित् <i>f.</i>, योषिता<BR> [Uṇ. 1. 97] A woman, a girl, young woman in general;<BR> गच्छन्तीनां रमणवसतिं योषितां तत्र नक्तम् Me. 39; Śi. 4. 42, 8. 25;<BR> योषा योषित् योषिता च जोषा जोषिञ्च जोषिता Śabdaratnāvalī.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: योषाग्राहः, योषाप्रिया, योषारत्नम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योषाग्राहः
योषा + -ग्राहः (योषिद्ग्राहः) one who takes the wife of deceased man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योषाप्रिया
योषा + -प्रिया turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

योषारत्नम्
योषा + -रत्नम् an excellent woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौक्तिक|यौक्तिकः
यौक्तिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [युक्तित आगत ठक्]<BR>—1 Suitable, fit, proper.<BR>—2 Logical, based on argument or reasoning.<BR>—3 Deducible.<BR>—4 Usual, customary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौक्तिकः|यौक्तिक
यौक्तिक + .{@-कः@} A kingʼs companion; cf. नर्मसचिव.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौगः|यौग
यौगः A follower of the <i>Yoga</i> system of philosophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौगपदम्
यौगपदम्, -द्यम्<BR>—1 Simultaneity; तुल्यानां तु यौगपद्यम् etc. MS. 11. 1. 54; Bhāg. 4. 4. 20.<BR>—2 Simultaneous perception of one and the same thing in many more places<BR> than one; आदित्यवद् यौगपद्यम् MS. 1. 1. 5. ˚द्येन <i>ind.</i> simultaneously;<BR> न हि यौगपद्येन विधातुं शक्यते लक्षणत्वेन चोच्चारयितुम् ŚB. on MS. 3. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौगपद्यम्
यौगपदम्, -द्यम्<BR>—1 Simultaneity; तुल्यानां तु यौगपद्यम् etc. MS. 11. 1. 54; Bhāg. 4. 4. 20.<BR>—2 Simultaneous perception of one and the same thing in many more places<BR> than one; आदित्यवद् यौगपद्यम् MS. 1. 1. 5. ˚द्येन <i>ind.</i> simultaneously;<BR> न हि यौगपद्येन विधातुं शक्यते लक्षणत्वेन चोच्चारयितुम् ŚB. on MS. 3. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौगिक|यौगिकः
यौगिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [योग ठक्]<BR>—1 Useful, serviceable, proper.<BR>—2 Usual.<BR>—3 Derivative, etymological, agreeing with the derivation of the word<BR> (opp. रूढ or ‘conventional’).<BR>—4 Remedial.<BR>—5 Relating to or derived from <i>Yoga</i>.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यौगिकरूढ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौगिकरूढ
यौगिक + -रूढ <i>a.</i> etymological and conventional; as उद्भिद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौट्
यौट् (-ड्) €1 P.<BR> (यौट(ड)ति) To join together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौड्
यौट् (-ड्) €1 P.<BR> (यौट(ड)ति) To join together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौतक|यौतकं
यौतक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [युते विवाहकाले अधिगतं वुण्] Forming the rightful<BR> or exclusive property of any one, rightfully belonging to any one; विभागभावना<BR> ज्ञेया ग्रहक्षेत्रैश्च यौतकैः Y. 2. 149.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौतकम्
यौतक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Private property in general; मातुश्च यौतकं यत् स्यात् कुमारीभाग<BR> एव सः Mb. 13. 45. 12.<BR>—2 A womanʼs dowry, a womanʼs private property (given to her at marriage);<BR> मातुस्तु यौतकं यत् स्यात् कुमारीभाग एव सः Ms. 9. 131; यु मिश्रणे<BR> इति धात्वनुसाराद् विवाहकाले एकासनोपविष्टयोर्वधूवरयोर्यद् बन्धुभिर्दीयते<BR> तत् युतयोरिदं यौतकमिति व्युत्पत्त्या यौतकमित्युच्यते । Vīramitrodaya;<BR> also यौतुक in this sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौतवम्
यौतवम् A measure in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौथिक|यौथिकः
यौथिक <i>a.</i> Belonging to a flock or troop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौथिकः|यौथिक
यौथिक + .{@-कः@} A companion, comrade; मातापितरौ भ्रातृबन्धुज्ञातीन् यौथिकांश्चैवोपेयाय<BR> Bhāg. 5. 8. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौध|यौधः
यौध <i>a.</i> (-धी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Warlike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौधः|यौध
यौध + .{@-धः@} An elephant in the fifth decade of his age; Mātaṅga L. 5. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौन|यौनं
यौन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [योनितः योनिसंबन्धात् आगतम् अण्]<BR>—1 Uterine.<BR>—2 Resulting from marriage, matrimonial; नैतैः … ब्राह्मान् यौनांश्च<BR> संबन्धानाचरेद् ब्राह्मणः सह Ms. 2. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौनम्
यौन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Marriage, matrimonial alliance; Ms. 11. 180.<BR>—2 The origin (योनि); यत्राग्नियौनाश्च वसन्ति लोकाः Mb. 13. 102. 25.<BR>—3 The ceremony on conception.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यौनानुबन्धः, यौनसंबन्धः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौनानुबन्धः
यौन + -अनुबन्धः blood-relationship; यौनानुबन्धं च समीक्ष्य कार्ये<BR> लेखं विदध्यात् पुरुषानुरूपम् Kau. A. 2. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौनसंबन्धः|यौनसम्बन्ध
यौन + -संबन्धः relationship by marriage, affinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौनिकः|यौनिक
यौनिकः Moderate wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवतम्
यौवतम् [युवतीनां समूहः अण्]<BR>—1 An assemblage of young women; अवधृत्य दिवोऽपि यौवतैर्नसहाधीतवतीमिमामहम्<BR> N. 2. 41, 11. 90; मनुष्यनारीजनतोऽपि यौवतं दिवौकसां श्रेष्ठतमं<BR> वदन्ति Rām. Ch. 2. 3.<BR>—2 The quality of a young woman (beauty &c.); the state of being a young<BR> woman; अहो विबुधयौवतं वहसि तन्वि पृथ्वीगता Gīt. 10 (सुरसुन्दरीरूपम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवतेयः|यौवतेय
यौवतेयः The son of a young woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवन|यौवनं
यौवन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [यूनो भावः अण्] Young, juvenile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनम्
यौवन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Youth (fig. also), youthfulness, prime or bloom of youth, puberty;<BR> मुग्धत्वस्य च यौवनस्य च सखे मध्ये मधुश्रीः स्थिता V. 2. 7; यौवनेऽभ्यस्तविद्यानाम्<BR> R. 1. 8, 6. 50; दिनयौवनोत्थान् 13. 20.<BR>—2 Any youthful or juvenile act.<BR>—3 A number of young persons, especially women.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: यौवनान्त, यौवनावस्था, यौवनदशा, यौवनारम्भः, यौवनारूढ, यौवनोद्भेदः, यौवनकण्टकः, यौवनकम्, यौवनपिडका, यौवनदर्पः, यौवनदशा, यौवनप्रान्तः, यौवनलक्षणम्, यौवनश्री, यौवनस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनान्त
यौवन + -अन्त <i>a.</i> ending in youth, being a prolonged youth; यौवनान्तं<BR> वयो यस्मिन् नान्तकः कुसुमायुधात् Ku. 6. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनावस्था
यौवन + -अवस्था, -दशा youthfulness, puberty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनदशा
यौवन + -अवस्था, -दशा youthfulness, puberty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनारम्भः|यौवनारम्भ
यौवन + -आरम्भः prime of youth, budding youth; Māl. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनारूढ
यौवन + -आरूढ <i>a.</i> one who has arrived at adolescence or puberty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनोद्भेदः|यौवनोद्भेद
यौवन + -उद्भेदः<BR>—1 ardour of youthful passions.<BR>—2 sexual love.<BR>—3 N. of Cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनकण्टकः|यौवनकण्टक|यौवनकण्टकं
यौवन + -कण्टकः, -कम्, -पिडका an erruption or pimples on the face indicative of youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनकम्
यौवन + -कण्टकः, -कम्, -पिडका an erruption or pimples on the face indicative of youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनपिडका
यौवन + -कण्टकः, -कम्, -पिडका an erruption or pimples on the face indicative of youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनदर्पः|यौवनदर्प
यौवन + -दर्पः<BR>—1 youthful pride.<BR>—2 indiscretion natural to youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनदशा
यौवन + -दशा the period of youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनप्रान्तः|यौवनप्रान्त
यौवन + -प्रान्तः the verge of youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनलक्षणम्
यौवन + -लक्षणम्<BR>—1 a sign of youth.<BR>—2 charm, loveliness.<BR>—3 the female breast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनश्री
यौवन + -श्री the beauty of youthfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनस्थ
यौवन + -स्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 youthful.<BR>—2 marriageable.<BR>—3 fresh; यौवनस्थस्य गौरस्य कपित्थस्य सुगन्धिनः Rām. 2. 91. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनकम्
यौवनकम् Youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनीय
यौवनीय <i>a.</i> Youthful, juvenile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवनाश्वः|यौवनाश्व
यौवनाश्वः N. of Māndhātṛ, son of Yuvanāśva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौवराज्यम्
यौवराज्यम् The rank or rights of an heir-apparent; यौवराज्येऽभिषिक्तः<BR> ‘crowned heir-apparent’; निश्चित्य सचिवैः सार्धं यौवराज्यममन्यत<BR> Rām. 2. 1. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1320-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौषिण्यम्
यौषिण्यम्<BR>—1 Womanhood.<BR>—2 Action, gesture of women; Bhāg. 5. 1. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौष्माक|यौष्माकं
यौष्माक (-की <i>f.</i>), यौष्माकीण (णा <i>f.</i>) <i>a.</i><BR> Your,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-2" target="_blank">Page1321-2</a>]<BR> yours; यौष्माकीणे समन्तात् प्रसरति नितरां दिक्षु कीर्तेर्विताने Sūkti. 5. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौष्माकी
यौष्माक (-की <i>f.</i>), यौष्माकीण (णा <i>f.</i>) <i>a.</i><BR> Your,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-2" target="_blank">Page1321-2</a>]<BR> yours; यौष्माकीणे समन्तात् प्रसरति नितरां दिक्षु कीर्तेर्विताने Sūkti. 5. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौष्माकीण
यौष्माक (-की <i>f.</i>), यौष्माकीण (णा <i>f.</i>) <i>a.</i><BR> Your,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-2" target="_blank">Page1321-2</a>]<BR> yours; यौष्माकीणे समन्तात् प्रसरति नितरां दिक्षु कीर्तेर्विताने Sūkti. 5. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यौष्माकीणा
यौष्माक (-की <i>f.</i>), यौष्माकीण (णा <i>f.</i>) <i>a.</i><BR> Your,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-2" target="_blank">Page1321-2</a>]<BR> yours; यौष्माकीणे समन्तात् प्रसरति नितरां दिक्षु कीर्तेर्विताने Sūkti. 5. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

य्वागुली
य्वागुली Sour scum of boiled rice; cf. यवागू.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रः|र|रं
रः<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 Heat.<BR>—3 Love, desire.<BR>—4 Speed.<BR>—5 (In prosody) A syllabic foot (गण) consisting of a short syllable<BR> between two long syllables.<BR>—6 The number ‘forty’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रा
रः + .{@-रा@}<BR>—1 Giving.<BR>—2 Gold.<BR>—3 Amorous play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

री
रः + .{@-री@} Going, motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्
रः + .{@-रम्@} Brightness, lustre.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रविपुला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविपुला
रः + -विपुला N. of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंसु
रंसु <i>a.</i> Ved. Cheerful, delightful; स चित्रेण चिकिते रंसु<BR> भासा Rv. 2. 4. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंह्
रंह् €1 P. (रंहति)<BR>—1 To move or go with speed, hasten; न ररंहाश्वकुञ्जरम् Bk. 14. 98.<BR>—2 To flow. ━<i>Caus.</i> (रंहयतिते; according to some €10 U.)<BR>—1 To cause to move rapidly, urge on.<BR>—2 To cause to flow.<BR>—3 To go.<BR>—4 To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंहणम्
रंहणम् Going swiftly, hastening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंहतिः|रंहति
रंहतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Speed, velocity.<BR>—2 The speed of a chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंहस्
रंहस् <i>n.</i> [रंह्-असुन् हुक्च Uṇ. 4. 221]<BR>—1 Speed, velocity; न पादपोन्मूलनशक्ति रंहः शिलोच्चये मूर्च्छति<BR> मारुतस्य R. 2. 34; Śi. 12. 7; Ki. 2. 40.<BR>—2 Eagerness, violence, vehemence, impetuosity. यः परं रंहसः साक्षात्<BR> Bhāg. 4. 24. 28.<BR>—3 N. of Śiva.<BR>—4 Of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रंहिः|रंहि
रंहिः <i>f.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 A running stream, spring.<BR>—2 Running, flowing.<BR>—3 Hunting, pursuing.<BR>—4 Haste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्
रक् €10 U. (राकयति-ते)<BR>—1 To taste.<BR>—2 To get, obtain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रकः|रक
रकः<BR>—1 The sun-stone.<BR>—2 Crystal.<BR>—3 A hard shower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रकसा
रकसा A form of leprosy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्त|रक्तं|रक्तः
रक्त <i>p. p.</i> [रञ्ज्-करणे क्तः]<BR>—1 Coloured, dyed, tinged, painted; आभाति बालातपरक्तसानुः R. 6. 60.<BR>—2 Red, crimson, blood-red; सान्ध्यं तेजः प्रतिनवजपापुष्परक्तं दधानः<BR> Me. 36; so रक्ताशोक, रक्तांशुक &c.<BR>—3 Enamoured, impassioned, attached, affected with love; यावद् वित्तोपार्जनसक्तस्तावन्निजपरिवारो<BR> रक्तः Carpaṭa. S. 3; अयमैन्द्रीमुखं पश्य रक्तश्चुम्बति<BR> चन्द्रमाः Candr. 5. 58 (where it has sense 2 also).<BR>—4 Dear, liked, beloved.<BR>—4 Lovely, charming, sweet, pleasant; श्रोत्रेषु संमूर्छति रक्तमासां<BR> गीतानुगं वारिमृदङ्गवाद्यम् R. 16. 64; रक्तं च नाम मधुरं च समं<BR> स्फुटं च Mk. 3. 4.<BR>—6 Fond of play, sporting, playful.<BR>—7 Nasalized (said of a vowel).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तः|रक्त|रक्तं
रक्त + .{@-क्तः@}<BR>—1 Red colour.<BR>—2 Safflower.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a2" target="_blank">Page1321-a2</a>]<BR>—3 N. of Śiva.<BR>—4 N. of a tree (हिज्जल).<BR>—5 The planet Mars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्ता
रक्त + .{@-क्ता@}<BR>—1 Lac.<BR>—2 The plant गुञ्जा.<BR>—3 One of the 7 tongues of fire.<BR>—4 (In music) N. of a श्रुति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तम्
