रक्त + -नाडी a fistulous ulcer on the gum caused by a bad state of blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तनासिकः|रक्तनासिक
रक्त + -नासिकः an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपः|रक्तप
रक्त + -पः a demon, an evil spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपा
रक्त + -पः + .({@-पा@})<BR>—1 a leech.<BR>—2 a Dākiṇī.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">Page1322-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1321-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपक्षः|रक्तपक्ष
रक्त + -पक्षः N. of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपटः|रक्तपट
रक्त + -पटः a kind of mendicant; केचिद् रक्तपटीकृताश्च जटिलाः कापालिकाश्चापरे<BR> Pt. 4. 34 (esp. Jains); धर्म इत्युपधर्मेषु नग्नरक्तपटादिषु । प्रायेण<BR> सज्जते भ्रान्त्या पेशलेषु च वाग्मिषु ॥ Bhāg. 4. 19. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपद्मम्
रक्त + -पद्मम् A red lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपल्लवः|रक्तपल्लव
रक्त + -पल्लवः the Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपातः|रक्तपात
रक्त + -पातः blood-shed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपाता
रक्त + -पाता a leech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपाद|रक्तपादः
रक्त + -पाद <i>a.</i> red-footed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपादः|रक्तपाद
रक्त + -पाद + .({@-दः@})<BR>—1 a bird with red feet, a parrot.<BR>—2 a war-chariot.<BR>—3 an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपायिन्
रक्त + -पायिन् <i>m.</i> a bug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपायिनी
रक्त + -पायिनी a leech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपारदः|रक्तपारद|रक्तपारदं
रक्त + -पारदः, -पारदम् cinnabar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपारदम्
रक्त + -पारदः, -पारदम् cinnabar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपिण्डम्
रक्त + -पिण्डम्<BR>—1 a red pimple.<BR>—2 a spontaneous discharge of blood from the nose and mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपित्तम्
रक्त + -पित्तम् derangement of the blood produced by bile; संयोगाद्<BR> दूषणात् तत् तु सामान्याद् गन्धवर्णयोः । रक्तं च पित्तमाख्यातं रक्तपित्तं<BR> मनीषिभिः Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपुष्पः|रक्तपुष्प
रक्त + -पुष्पः N. of several plants:− करवीर, रोहितक, दाडिम,<BR> बन्धूक, पुन्नाग &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपुष्पा
रक्त + -पुष्पा N. of the plant Punarnavā; पुनर्नवा परारक्ता रक्तपुष्पा<BR> परारिका Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तपूयम्
रक्त + -पूयम् N. of a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

