रक्त + -मञ्जरः the Nichula tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तमण्डलम्
रक्त + -मण्डलम् a red lotus-flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तमेहः|रक्तमेह
रक्त + -मेहः the voiding of blood with urine; विस्रमुष्णं सलवणं<BR> रक्ताभं रक्तमेहतः Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तमोक्षः|रक्तमोक्ष
रक्त + -मोक्षः, -मोक्षणम् bleeding, letting out blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तमोक्षणम्
रक्त + -मोक्षः, -मोक्षणम् bleeding, letting out blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तराजिः|रक्तराजि
रक्त + -राजिः a particular disease of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तरेणुः|रक्तरेणु
रक्त + -रेणुः<BR>—1 vermilion.<BR>—2 the Punnāga tree.<BR>—3 an angry man.<BR>—4 a bud of the Palāśa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तलोचनः|रक्तलोचन
रक्त + -लोचनः a pigeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

