रक्तवर्गः|रक्तवर्ग
रक्त + -वर्गः<BR>—1 lac.<BR>—2 the pomegranate tree.<BR>—3 safflower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तवर्ण|रक्तवर्णः
रक्त + -वर्ण <i>a.</i> red-coloured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तवर्णः|रक्तवर्ण
रक्त + -वर्ण + .({@-र्णः@})<BR>—1 red colour.<BR>—2 cochineal insect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तवर्णम्
रक्त + -वर्ण + .({@-र्णम्@}) gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तवर्धनः|रक्तवर्धन|रक्तवर्द्धनः
