रक्तवासस्
रक्त + -वसन, -वासस् <i>a.</i> clothed in red; Ms. 8. 256. ━(<i>m.</i>) a<BR> Brāhmaṇa in the fourth order of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

