रक्तशासनम्
रक्त + -शासनम् vermilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तशीर्षकः|रक्तशीर्षक
रक्त + -शीर्षकः a kind of heron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तशृङ्गिकम्
रक्त + -शृङ्गिकम् a kind of poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तष्ठीवी
रक्त + -ष्ठीवी the spitting of blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तसंकोचः|रक्तसङ्कोच
रक्त + -संकोचः safflower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तसंकोचकम्
रक्त + -संकोचकम् a red lotus-flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तसंज्ञम्
रक्त + -संज्ञम् saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

