रक्तसारम्
रक्त + -सारम् red sandal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तस्रावः|रक्तस्राव
रक्त + -स्रावः hemorrhage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तक|रक्तकः
रक्तक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Red.<BR>—2 Impassioned, enamoured, fond of.<BR>—3 Pleasing, amusing.<BR>—4 Bloody.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तकः|रक्तक
रक्तक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A red garment.<BR>—2 An impassioned man, amorous person.<BR>—3 A sporter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तकम्
