रक्तिका The <i>Guñjā</i> plant or its seed used as a weight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तिमन्
रक्तिमन् <i>m.</i> Redness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्तृ
रक्तृ <i>m.</i> A painter, dyer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्ष्
रक्ष् €1 P. (रक्षति, रक्षित)<BR>—1 To protect; guard, take care of, watch, tend (as cattle); rule, govern<BR> (as earth); भवानिमां प्रतिकृतिं रक्षतु Ś. 6; ज्ञास्यसि कियद् भुजो<BR> मे रक्षति मौर्वीकिणाङ्क इति Ś. 1. 13; अरक्षितं तिष्ठति दैवरक्षितं<BR> सुरक्षितं तद्विहतं विनश्यति । Bh.<BR>—2 To keep, not to divulge; रहस्यं रक्षति.<BR>—3 To preserve, save, keep away from, spare (often with abl.); सखीजनादुपहसनीयतां<BR> रक्षामि Mk. 4; दर्शनपथाद्रक्ष्यते Ratn. 1; अलब्धं चैव लिप्सेत<BR> लब्धं रक्षेदवक्षयात् H. 2. 8; आपदर्थे धनं रक्षेत् H. 1. 42;<BR> R. 2. 50, 11. 87.<BR>—4 To avoid; रक्षन्ती बाष्पमोक्षम् K.; Mu. 1. 2.<BR>—5 To observe (as a law, duty).<BR>—6 To beware of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षः|रक्ष
रक्षः [रक्षन्त्यस्मात् इत्यर्थे असुन् Uṇ. 4. 196]<BR>—1 A guard, protector.<BR>—2 Preserving, guarding, watching.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रक्षपालः, रक्षपालकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षपालः|रक्षपाल
रक्षः + -पालः, -पालकः a guard, protector.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षपालकः|रक्षपालक
रक्षः + -पालः, -पालकः a guard, protector.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षक|रक्षकः
रक्षक <i>a.</i> (-क्षिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [रक्ष्-ण्वुल्] Guarding, protecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षकः|रक्षक
रक्षक + .{@-कः@} A protector, guardian, guard, watchman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षणम्
रक्षणम् [रक्ष्-ल्युट्] Protecting, protection, preservation, watching,<BR> guarding &c. (Also रक्ष्णम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षणी
रक्षणम् + .{@-णी@} A rein, bridle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षणः|रक्षण|रक्षणं
रक्षणम् + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 A protector.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षणा
रक्षणम् + .{@-णा@} Protecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षणारकः|रक्षणारक
रक्षणा(णी)रकः Morbid retention of urine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षणीरकः|रक्षणीरक
रक्षणा(णी)रकः Morbid retention of urine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षस्
रक्षस् <i>n.</i> [रक्ष्यते हविरस्मात्, रक्ष्-असुन्]<BR>—1 An evil spirit, a demon, an imp, a goblin; चतुर्दशसहस्राणि रक्षसां<BR> भीमकर्मणाम् । त्रयश्च दूषणखरत्रिमूर्धानो रणे हताः ॥ U. 2. 15.<BR>—2 Ved. Hurt, injury.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रक्षईशः, रक्षोनाथः, रक्षोघ्नः, रक्षोजननी, रक्षःपाशः, रक्षःप्रकाण्डकः, रक्षःसभम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षईशः|रक्षईश
रक्षस् + -ईशः, -नाथः an epithet of Rāvaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षोनाथः|रक्षोनाथ
रक्षस् + -ईशः, -नाथः an epithet of Rāvaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षोघ्नः|रक्षोघ्न|रक्षोघ्नं
रक्षस् + -घ्नः white mustard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षोघ्नम्
रक्षस् + -घ्नः + .({@-घ्नम्@}) sour rice-gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षोजननी
रक्षस् + -जननी night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षःपाशः
रक्षस् + -पाशः a contemptible demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षःप्रकाण्डकः
रक्षस् + -प्रकाण्डकः the best of the demons (प्रशस्तः राक्षसः);<BR> दण्डकानध्यवात्तां यौ वीर रक्षःप्रकाण्डकौ Bk. 5. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षःसभम्
रक्षस् + -सभम् an assembly of demons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षस्त्वम्
रक्षस्त्वम् Demoniacal nature, fiendish cruelty, malignity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षा
रक्षा [रक्ष्-भावे अ टाप्]<BR>—1 Protection, preservation; guarding; मयि सृष्टिर्हि लोकानां रक्षा युष्मास्ववस्थिता<BR> Ku. 2. 28; Ś. 2. 15; R. 2. 4, 8; Me. 45.<BR>—2 Care, security.<BR>—3 A guard, watch.<BR>—4 An amulet or mystical object used as a charm, any preservative; as<BR> in रक्षाकरण्ड q. v. below.<BR>—4 A tutelary deity.<BR>—5 Ashes.<BR>—6 A piece of silk or thread fastened round the wrist on particular occasions,<BR> especially on the full-moon day of Śrāvaṇa, as an amulet or preservative;<BR> (रक्षी also in this sense).<BR>—7 Lac.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रक्षाधिकृतः, रक्षापेक्षकः, रक्षाकरण्डः, रक्षाकरण्डकम्, रक्षागृहम्, रक्षापट्टोलिका, रक्षापत्रः, रक्षापरिघः, रक्षापालः, रक्षापुरुषः, रक्षाप्रतिसरः, रक्षाप्रदीपः, रक्षाभूषणम्, रक्षामणिः, रक्षारत्नम्, रक्षामङ्गलम्, रक्षामहौषधिः, रक्षासूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षाधिकृतः|रक्षाधिकृत
रक्षा + -अधिकृतः<BR>—1 one who is entrusted with protection or superintendence, a superintendent<BR> or governor; Ms. 7. 123, 9. 272.<BR>—2 a magistrate.<BR>—3 the chief police-officer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षापेक्षकः|रक्षापेक्षक
रक्षा + -अपेक्षकः<BR>—1 a porter; doorkeeper.<BR>—2 a guard of the womenʼs apartments.<BR>—3 a catamite.<BR>—4 an actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षाकरण्डः
रक्षा + -करण्डः, -करण्डकम् a preservative casket, an amulet, a magical<BR> or charmed casket; अहो रक्षाकरण्डकमस्य मणिबन्धे न दृश्यते Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षाकरण्डकम्
रक्षा + -करण्डः, -करण्डकम् a preservative casket, an amulet, a magical<BR> or charmed casket; अहो रक्षाकरण्डकमस्य मणिबन्धे न दृश्यते Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षागृहम्
रक्षा + -गृहम् a lying-in chamber; रक्षागृहगता दीपाः प्रत्यादिष्टा इवाभवन् R. 10. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षापट्टोलिका
रक्षा + -पट्टोलिका a cluster of amulets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षापत्रः|रक्षापत्र
रक्षा + -पत्रः a species of birch<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">Page1323-1</a>]<BR> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1322-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षापरिघः|रक्षापरिघ
रक्षा + -परिघः a protective bar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षापालः
रक्षा + -पालः, -पुरुषः a watchman, guard, police.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षापुरुषः|रक्षापुरुष
रक्षा + -पालः, -पुरुषः a watchman, guard, police.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षाप्रतिसरः|रक्षाप्रतिसर
रक्षा + -प्रतिसरः an amulet; दत्तरक्षाप्रतिसरामन्वालम्भनशोभनाम् Mb. 3. 39. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षाप्रदीपः|रक्षाप्रदीप
रक्षा + -प्रदीपः a lamp kept burning as a sort of protection against evil spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षाभूषणम्
