रक्षामणिः|रक्षामणि
रक्षा + -भूषणम्, -मणिः, -रत्नम् an ornament or jewel worn as an amulet<BR> or preservative against evil spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षारत्नम्
रक्षा + -भूषणम्, -मणिः, -रत्नम् an ornament or jewel worn as an amulet<BR> or preservative against evil spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षामङ्गलम्
रक्षा + -मङ्गलम् a ceremony performed for protection (against evil spirits &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षामहौषधिः|रक्षामहौषधि
रक्षा + -महौषधिः a sovereign preservative remedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षासूत्रम्
रक्षा + -सूत्रम् a carrying-girth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षिकः|रक्षिक
रक्षिकः<BR>—1 A protector, guard.<BR>—2 A policeman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षिका
रक्षिका<BR>—1 A female guardian.<BR>—2 An amulet, charm &c. (worn as a preservative).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रक्षिजनः|रक्षिजन
