रघुवंशम्
रघु + -वंशः + .({@-शम्@}) N. of a celebrated classical poem by Kālidāsa decribing<BR> the family of the Raghus in nineteen cantos. ˚तिलकः N. of Rāma;<BR> जयति रघुवंशतिलकः कौसल्यानन्दवर्धनो रामः Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्क|रंक|रङ्कः
