रङ्कः|रङ्क|रंक
रङ्क + .{@-कः@} A beggar, wretch, any hungry or half-starved being; प्रेतरङ्कः<BR> Māl. 5. 16 ‘the famished or half-starved spirit’; रङ्कस्य नृपतेर्वापि<BR> जिह्वासौख्यं समं स्मृतम् Pt. 1. 254.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्कुः|रङ्कु|रंकु|रंकुः
रङ्कुः [रमते वने Uṇ. 3. 86] A deer, an antelope; मुखचन्द्रेषु<BR> कलङ्करङ्कवः N. 2. 83; श्रयत्ययं च श्रवणावतंसश्यामारविन्दश्रियमङ्करङ्कुः<BR> Rām. Ch. 6. 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्ख्
