रङ्गः + -बीजम्, -वीजम् silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गभूतिः|रङ्गभूति|रंगभूति
रङ्गः + -भूतिः <i>f.</i> the night of full moon in the month of <i>Aśvina</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गभूमिः|रङ्गभूमि|रंगभूमि
रङ्गः + -भूमिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a stage, theatre.<BR>—2 an arena, battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गमङ्गलम्
रङ्गः + -मङ्गलम् a festive ceremony on the stage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गमण्डपः|रङ्गमण्डप|रंगमंडप
रङ्गः + -मण्डपः a theatre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गमल्ली
रङ्गः + -मल्ली a lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गमातृ|रंगमातृ
रङ्गः + -मातृ <i>f.</i><BR>—1 lac, red-dye, or the insect which produces it.<BR>—2 a bawd, procuress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गवस्तु
रङ्गः + -वस्तु <i>n.</i> a paint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गवाटः|रङ्गवाट|रंगवाट
रङ्गः + -वाटः an arena, a place enclosed for plays, dancing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गविद्या
रङ्गः + -विद्या the art of dancing and acting, theatrical profession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गशाला|रंगशाला
रङ्गः + -शाला a dancing-hall, theatre, play-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गसंगरः|रङ्गसङ्गर
रङ्गः + -संगरः a contest on the stage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गणम्
रङ्गणम् Dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1323-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्गिन्|रंगिन्
रङ्गिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Colouring, dyeing.<BR>—2 Attached or devoted to, fond of.<BR>—3 Passionate, impassioned.<BR>—4 Acting on a stage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्घ्|रंघ्
रङ्घ् I. €1 U. (रङ्घति-ते)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To go quickly, hasten; द्वारं ररङ्घतुर्याम्यम् Bk. 14. 15.<BR>━II. €10 U. (रङ्घयति-ते)<BR>—1 To shine.<BR>—2 To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रङ्घस्|रंघस्
रङ्घस् <i>f.</i> Speed, haste; cf. रंहस्; रङ्घः सङ्घोऽसुराणां जगदुपकृतये<BR> नित्यमुक्तस्य यस्य Sūryaśataka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रच्
रच् €10 U. (रचयति-ते, रचित)<BR>—1 To arrange, prepare, make ready, contrive, plan; पुष्पाणां प्रकरः<BR> स्मितेन रचितो नो कुन्दजात्यादिभिः Amaru. 45; रचयति शयनं सचकितनयनम् Gīt. 5.<BR>—2 To make, form, effect, create, produce; मायाविकल्परचितैः स्यन्दनैः<BR> R. 13. 75; माधुर्यं मधुबिन्दुना रचयितुं क्षाराम्बुधेरीहते Bh. 2. 6;<BR> मौलौ वा रचयाञ्जलिम् Ve. 3. 40.<BR>—3 To write, compose, put together (as a work); अश्वधाटीं जगन्नाथो<BR> विश्वहृद्यामरीरचत् Aśvad. 26; Ś. 3. 14.<BR>—4 To place in or upon, fix on; रचयति चिकुरे कुरबककुसुमम् Gīt. 7;<BR> Ku. 4. 18, 34; Ś. 6. 17.<BR>—5 To adorn, decorate; Me. 68.<BR>—6 To direct (the mind &c.) towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रचनम्
रचनम्, -ना<BR> [रच्-युच्]<BR>—1 Arrangement, preparation, disposition; अभिषेक˚, संगीत˚ &c.<BR>—2 Formation, creation, production; अन्यैव कापि रचना वचनावलीनाम्<BR> Bv. 1. 69; so भ्रुकुटिरचना Me. 52; शृङ्गारोत्तरसत्प्रमेयरचनैराचार्यगोवर्धनः Gīt.<BR>—3 Performance, completion, accomplishment, effecting; कुरु मम वचनं<BR> सत्वरर चनम् Gīt. 5; R. 10. 77.<BR>—4 A literary work or production, work, composition; संक्षिप्ता वस्तुरचना S. D. 422.<BR>—5 Dressing the hair.<BR>—6 An array or arrangement of troops.<BR>—7 A creation of the mind, an artificial fancy.<BR>—8 Stringing together (flowers &c.).<BR>—9 Contrivance, invention.<BR>—10 Fixing the feathers on an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रचना
रचनम्, -ना<BR> [रच्-युच्]<BR>—1 Arrangement, preparation, disposition; अभिषेक˚, संगीत˚ &c.<BR>—2 Formation, creation, production; अन्यैव कापि रचना वचनावलीनाम्<BR> Bv. 1. 69; so भ्रुकुटिरचना Me. 52; शृङ्गारोत्तरसत्प्रमेयरचनैराचार्यगोवर्धनः Gīt.<BR>—3 Performance, completion, accomplishment, effecting; कुरु मम वचनं<BR> सत्वरर चनम् Gīt. 5; R. 10. 77.<BR>—4 A literary work or production, work, composition; संक्षिप्ता वस्तुरचना S. D. 422.<BR>—5 Dressing the hair.<BR>—6 An array or arrangement of troops.<BR>—7 A creation of the mind, an artificial fancy.<BR>—8 Stringing together (flowers &c.).<BR>—9 Contrivance, invention.<BR>—10 Fixing the feathers on an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रचयितृ
रचयितृ <i>m. f.</i> A composer, author.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रचित|रचितः
रचित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Arranged.<BR>—2 Prepared.<BR>—3 Made, formed.<BR>—4 Strong together.<BR>—5 Composed, written.<BR>—6 Adorned.<BR>—7 Furnished with.<BR>—8 Directed towards (as the mind).<BR>—9 Invented.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रचितार्थ, रचितधी, रचितपूर्व<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रचितार्थ
रचित + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> one who has obtained his object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रचितधी
रचित + -धी <i>a.</i> one whose mind is intent upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रचितपूर्व
रचित + -पूर्व <i>a.</i> what has been performed before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजः|रज|रजं
रजः See रजस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजकः|रजक
रजकः [रञ्ज्-ण्वुल् नलोपः]<BR>—1 A washerman.<BR>—2 A parrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजकी
रजकः + .{@-की@}<BR>—1 A washerwoman; also रजिका in this sense.<BR>—2 The wife of a washerman.<BR>—3 An epithet of a woman on the third day of her courses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजत|रजतं
रजत <i>a.</i> [रञ्ज् अतच् नलोपः Uṇ. 3. 110]<BR>—1 Silvery, made of silver.<BR>—2 Whitish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजतम्
रजत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Silver; शुक्तौ रजतमिदमिति ज्ञानं भ्रमः; Ki. 5. 41; N. 22. 52.<BR>—2 Gold.<BR>—3 A pearl-ornament or necklace.<BR>—4 Blood.<BR>—5 Ivory.<BR>—6 An asterism, a constellation.<BR>—7 A mountain.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रजताद्रिः, रजतकूटः, रजतद्युतिः, रजतप्रस्थः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजताद्रिः|रजताद्रि
रजत + -अद्रिः N. of Kailāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजतकूटः|रजतकूट
रजत + -कूटः N. of a peak of the Malaya<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">Page1324-2</a>]<BR> mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

