रजतप्रस्थः|रजतप्रस्थ
रजत + -प्रस्थः N. of Kailāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनः|रजन|रजनं
