रजनम्
रजनः + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Colouring, dyeing.<BR>—2 Safflower (also रजनी in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिः|रजनि
रजनिः, -नी <i>f.</i><BR> [रज्यतेऽत्र, रञ्ज्-कनि वा ङीप् Uṇ. 2. 101]<BR>—1 Night; हरिरभिमानी रजनिरिदानीमियमपि याति विरामम् Gīt. 5;<BR> रतिश्रान्ता शेते रजनिरमणी गाढमुरसि K. P.<BR>—2 Turmeric.<BR>—3 Red lac; यथा रजनी मे कण्डूयति, तिलको मे स्पन्दते इति । रागाभावे<BR> तिलकाभावे च तद्देशलक्षणया भवन्ति वक्तार इति ŚB. on MS. 8. 4. 28.<BR>—4 N. of Durgā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रजनिकरः, रजनिचरः, रजनिजलम्, रजनिनाथः, रजनिपतिः, रजनिरमणः, रजनिपुरन्ध्री, रजनिमुखम्, रजनिहंसा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनी
रजनिः, -नी <i>f.</i><BR> [रज्यतेऽत्र, रञ्ज्-कनि वा ङीप् Uṇ. 2. 101]<BR>—1 Night; हरिरभिमानी रजनिरिदानीमियमपि याति विरामम् Gīt. 5;<BR> रतिश्रान्ता शेते रजनिरमणी गाढमुरसि K. P.<BR>—2 Turmeric.<BR>—3 Red lac; यथा रजनी मे कण्डूयति, तिलको मे स्पन्दते इति । रागाभावे<BR> तिलकाभावे च तद्देशलक्षणया भवन्ति वक्तार इति ŚB. on MS. 8. 4. 28.<BR>—4 N. of Durgā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रजनिकरः, रजनिचरः, रजनिजलम्, रजनिनाथः, रजनिपतिः, रजनिरमणः, रजनिपुरन्ध्री, रजनिमुखम्, रजनिहंसा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिकरः|रजनिकर
रजनिः + -करः<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिचरः|रजनिचर
रजनिः + -चरः<BR>—1 a night-stalker, demon, goblin.<BR>—2 a thief.<BR>—3 a night-watcher. —4 N. of the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिजलम्
रजनिः + -जलम् night-dew, hoar-frost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिनाथः|रजनिनाथ
रजनिः + -नाथः, -पतिः, -रमणः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिपतिः|रजनिपति
रजनिः + -नाथः, -पतिः, -रमणः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिरमणः|रजनिरमण
रजनिः + -नाथः, -पतिः, -रमणः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिपुरन्ध्री
रजनिः + -पुरन्ध्री a form of the upamā (उपमारूपक); Kāvyāl. 4. 3. 32 (com.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिमुखम्
रजनिः + -मुखम् nightfall, evening; प्रदोषो रजनीमुखम् Ak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिहंसा
रजनिः + -हंसा a Śephālī flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजनिंमन्य
रजनिंमन्य <i>a.</i> Passing for or looking like night (as a day);<BR> निन्दको रजनिंमन्यं दिवसं क्लेशको निशाम् Bk. 7. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजयित्री
रजयित्री A female painter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्
रजस् <i>n.</i> [रञ्ज्-असुन् नलोपः Uṇ. 4. 224]<BR>—1 Dust, powder, dirt; धन्यास्तदङ्गरजसा मलिनीभवन्ति Ś. 7. 17;<BR> आत्मोद्धतैरपि रजोभिरलङ्घनीयाः 1. 8; R. 1. 42, 6. 33.<BR>—2 The dust or pollen of flowers; भूयात् कुशेशयरजोमृदुरेणुरस्याः<BR> (पन्थाः) Ś. 4. 11; Me. 35, 67; Śi. 7. 42.<BR>—3 A mote in a sun-beam, any small particle (of matter); cf. Ms. 8. 132;<BR> जालसूर्यमरीचिस्थं त्रसरेणू रजः स्मृतम् Y. 1. 362.<BR>—4 A ploughed or cultivated land, arable field.<BR>—5 Gloom, darkness.<BR>—6 Foulness, passion, emotion, moral or mental darkness; अपथे पदमर्पयन्ति<BR> हि श्रुतवन्तोऽपि रजोनिमीलिताः R. 9. 74.<BR>—7 The second of the three Guṇas or constituent qualities of all material<BR> substances (the other two being सत्त्व and तमस्; रजस् is supposed<BR> to be the cause of the great activity seen in creatures; it predominates<BR> in men, as <i>Sattva</i> and <i>Tamas</i> predominate in gods and demons);<BR> अन्तर्गतमपास्तं मे रजसोऽपि परं तमः Ku. 6. 60; Bg. 6. 27; रजोजुषे<BR> जन्मनि K.; Māl. 1. 20.<BR>—8 Menstrual discharge, menses; रजसाभिप्लुतां नारीं नरस्य ह्युपगच्छतः ।<BR> प्रज्ञा तेजो बलं चक्षुरायुश्चैव प्रहीयते ॥ Ms. 4. 41, 5. 66.<BR>—9 Safflower.<BR>—10 Tin.<BR>—11 Ved. Air, atmosphere.<BR>—12 A division of the world.<BR>—13 Vapour.<BR>—14 Cloud or rain-water.<BR>—15 Sin (पाप); प्रायश्चित्तं च कुर्वान्ते तेन तच्छाम्यते रजः<BR> Rām. 4. 18. 34.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रजोगुणः, रजोजुष्, रजस्तमस्क, रजस्तोकः, रजस्तोकम्, रजःपुत्रः, रजोदर्शनम्, रजोनिमीलित, रजःपटलम्, रजोबन्धः, रजोमूर्तिः, रजोमेघः, रजोरसः, रजोवलम्, रजोबलम्, रजःशयः, रजःशुद्धिः, रजःसारथिः, रजोहरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोगुणः|रजोगुण
रजस् + -गुणः see (7) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोजुष्
रजस् + -जुष् <i>a.</i> one who is addicted to Rajoguṇa; रजोजुषे जन्मनि<BR> सत्त्ववृत्तये K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्तमस्क
रजस् + -तमस्क <i>a.</i> being under the influence of both <i>rajas</i><BR> and <i>tamas</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्तोकः|रजस्तोक
रजस् + -तोकः, -तोकम्, -पुत्रः<BR>—1 greediness, avarice; मुनये प्रेषयामास रजस्तोकमदौ तथा Bhāg. 12. 8. 16.<BR>—2 ‘the child of passion’, a term applied to a person to show that he<BR> is quite insignificant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्तोकम्
रजस् + -तोकः, -तोकम्, -पुत्रः<BR>—1 greediness, avarice; मुनये प्रेषयामास रजस्तोकमदौ तथा Bhāg. 12. 8. 16.<BR>—2 ‘the child of passion’, a term applied to a person to show that he<BR> is quite insignificant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजःपुत्रः|रजःपुत्र
रजस् + -तोकः, -तोकम्, -पुत्रः<BR>—1 greediness, avarice; मुनये प्रेषयामास रजस्तोकमदौ तथा Bhāg. 12. 8. 16.<BR>—2 ‘the child of passion’, a term applied to a person to show that he<BR> is quite insignificant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोदर्शनम्
रजस् + -दर्शनम् the first appearance of the menstrual excretion, first<BR> menstrual flow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोनिमीलित
रजस् + -निमीलित <i>a.</i> blinded by passion; अपथे पदमर्पयन्ति हि<BR> श्रुतवन्तोऽपि रजोनिमीलिताः R. 9. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजःपटलम्
रजस् + -पटलम् a coating of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">Page1325-1</a>]<BR> dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1324-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोबन्धः|रजोबन्ध|रजोबंध
रजस् + -बन्धः suppression of menstruation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोमूर्तिः|रजोमूर्ति
रजस् + -मूर्तिः the god Brahmā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोमेघः|रजोमेघ
रजस् + -मेघः a cloud of dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोरसः|रजोरस|रजोरसं
रजस् + -रसः, -वलम्, -बलम् darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोवलम्
रजस् + -रसः, -वलम्, -बलम् darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोबलम्
रजस् + -रसः, -वलम्, -बलम् darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजःशयः|रजःशय
रजस् + -शयः a dog; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजःशुद्धिः|रजःशुद्धि
रजस् + -शुद्धिः <i>f.</i> pure condition of the menses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजःसारथिः|रजःसारथि
रजस् + -सारथिः wind; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजोहरः|रजोहर
रजस् + -हरः ‘dirt-remover’, a washerman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजसानुः|रजसानु
रजसानुः<BR>—1 A cloud.<BR>—2 Soul, heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्यति
रजस्यति Den. P. To be scattered as dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्वल|रजस्वलः
रजस्वल <i>a.</i> [रजस्-वलच्]<BR>—1 Dusty, covered with dust; अङ्गना इव रजस्वला दिशो नो बभूवुरवलोकनक्षमाः<BR> R. 11. 60; Śi. 17. 61 (where it also means ‘being in menses’).<BR>—2 Full of passion (रजस्) or emotion; रजस्वलमनित्यं च भूतावासमिमं<BR> त्यजेत् Ms. 6. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्वलः|रजस्वल
रजस्वल + .{@-लः@} A buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रजस्वला
रजस्वल + .{@-ला@}<BR>—1 A woman during the menses; रजस्वलाः परिमलिनाम्बरश्रियः Śi. 17. 61;<BR> Y. 3. 229; R. 11. 60.<BR>—2 A marriageable girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रज्जुः|रज्जु
रज्जुः (Uṇ. 1. 15) <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A rope, cord, string.<BR>—2 N. of a sinew proceeding from the vertebral column.<BR>—3 A lock of braided hair.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रज्जुदालकः, रज्जुपेडा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रज्जुदालकः|रज्जुदालक
रज्जुः + -दालकः a kind of wild fowl; so रज्जुवालः; Ms. 5. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रज्जुपेडा
रज्जुः + -पेडा a rope-basket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रज्जुकः|रज्जुक
रज्जुकः See रज्जु; व्याकुलमुक्तरज्जुके Śi. 12. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रज्जूकृ
रज्जूकृ €8 U. To use as a rope; in सर्पं रज्जूकरोति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रञ्ज्|रंज्
रञ्ज् €1. €4 U. (रजति-ते, रज्यति-ते, रक्त; <i>pass.</i> रज्यते;<BR> <i>desid.</i> रिरंक्षति)<BR>—1 To be dyed or coloured, to redden, become red, glow; कोपरज्यन्मुखश्रीः<BR> U. 5. 3; नेत्रे स्वयं रज्यतः 5. 36; N. 3. 120, 7. 60, 22. 52.<BR>—2 To dye, tinge, colour, paint.<BR>—3 To be attached or devoted to (with loc.). देवानियं निषधराजरुचस्त्यजन्ती<BR> रूपादरज्यत नले न विदर्भसुभ्रूः N. 13. 38; S. D. 111.<BR>—4 To be enamoured of, fall in love with, feel passion or affection for.<BR>—5 To be pleased, satisfied, or delighted. ━<i>Caus.</i> (रञ्जयतिते)<BR>—1 To dye, tinge, colour, redden, paint; सा रञ्जयित्वा चरणौ कृताशीः<BR> Ku. 7. 19, 6. 81; Ki. 1. 40, 4. 14.<BR>—2 To please, gratify, propitiate, satisfy; ज्ञानलवदुर्विदग्धं ब्रह्मापि<BR> नरं न रञ्जयति Bh. 2. 3; (रजयति also in this sense; see Ki. 6. 25);<BR> स्फुरतु कुचकुम्भयोरुपरि मणिमञ्जरी रञ्जयतु तव हृदयदेशम् Gīt. 10.<BR>—3 To conciliate, win over, keep contented; समीक्ष्य स धृतः सम्यक्<BR> सर्वा रञ्जयति प्रजाः Ms. 7. 19.<BR>—4 To hunt deer (रजयति only in this sense).<BR>—5 Ved. To worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रञ्जक|रंजक|रञ्जकं|रञ्जकः
रञ्जक <i>a.</i> [रञ्जयति रञ्ज्-णिच् ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Colouring, painting, dyeing.<BR>—2 Exciting love or passion.<BR>—3 Pleasing, amusing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रञ्जकः|रञ्जक|रंजक|रञ्जकं
रञ्जक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A painter, dyer; Ms. 4. 216.<BR>—2 An exciter, a stimulus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रञ्जकम्
रञ्जक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Red sandal.<BR>—2 Vermilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रञ्जन|रंजन|रञ्जनं|रञ्जनः
रञ्जन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Colouring, dyeing.<BR>—2 Pleasing, gratifying, delighting.<BR>—3 Exciting passion.<BR>—4 Conciliating, keeping contented.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रञ्जनम्
रञ्जन + .{@-नम्@} [रज्यतेऽनेन रञ्ज्-करणे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Colouring, dyeing, painting.<BR>—2 Colour, dye.<BR>—3 Pleasing, delighting, keeping contented, gratifying, giving pleasure;<BR> राजा प्रजारञ्जनलब्धवर्णः R. 6. 21; तथैव सोऽभूदन्वर्थो राजा<BR> प्रकृतिरञ्जनात् 4. 12.<BR>—4 Red sandal-wood.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">Page1325-2</a>]<BR>—5 The Munja grass.<BR>—6 (In gram.) Nasalizing (a sound.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रञ्जनी
रञ्जनी<BR>—1 The Indigo plant.<BR>—2 Turmeric.<BR>—3 Red arsenic.<BR>—4 Saffron.<BR>—5 (In music) A particular Śruti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रञ्जित|रंजित
रञ्जित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Coloured, dyed.<BR>—2 Moved, excited.<BR>—3 Delighted, pleased, amused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रट्
रट् €1 P. (रटति, रटित)<BR>—1 To shout, scream, yell, cry, roar, howl; घोराश्चाराटिषुः शिवाः Bk. 15. 27;<BR> पपात राक्षसो भूमौ रराट च भयंकरम् 14. 81.<BR>—2 To call out, proclaim loudly.<BR>—3 To shout with joy, applaud.<BR>—4 To ring, sound; कर्णे रटन् कटु कथं न बटुर्विषह्यः Mv. 3. 31.<BR>—5 To lament, wail.<BR>—6 To crash (as an axe).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रटनम्
रटनम् [रट्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 The act of crying, screaming or shouting.<BR>—2 A shout of applause, approbation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रटन्ती|रटंती
रटन्ती N. of the fourteenth day in the dark half of Māgha; माघे<BR> मास्यसिते पक्षे रटन्त्याख्या चतुर्दशी । तस्यां प्रदोषसमये पूजयेन्<BR> मुण्डमालिनीम् ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रटितम्
रटितम् A scream, shout, yell, cry; Mu. 1. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रठ्
रठ् €1 P. (रठति) To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रण्
रण् €1 P. (रणति, रणित)<BR>—1 To sound, ring, tinkle, jingle (as anklets &c.); रणद्भिराघट्टनया<BR> नभस्वतः पृथग्वभिन्नश्रुतिमण्डलैः स्वरैः Śi. 1. 10; चरणरणितमाणिनूपुरया<BR> परिपूरितसुरतवितानम् Gīt. 2.<BR>—2 To go.<BR>—3 Ved. To rejoice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणः|रण|रणं
रणः, -णम्<BR> [रण्-अप्]<BR>—1 War, combat, fight; रणः प्रववृते तत्र भीमः प्लवगरक्षसाम्<BR> R. 12. 72; वचोजीवितयोरासीद्बहिर्निःसरणे रणः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 A battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणम्
रणः, -णम्<BR> [रण्-अप्]<BR>—1 War, combat, fight; रणः प्रववृते तत्र भीमः प्लवगरक्षसाम्<BR> R. 12. 72; वचोजीवितयोरासीद्बहिर्निःसरणे रणः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 A battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणः|रण|रणं
रणः, -णम् + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 Sound, noise.<BR>—2 The quill or bow of a lute.<BR>—3 Motion, going.<BR>—4 Delight, joy (Ved.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रणाग्रम्, रणाङ्गम्, रणाङ्गणम्, रणाङ्गनम्, रणाजिरम्, रणातिथिः, रणान्तकृत्, रणापेत, रणाभियोगः, रणालंकरणः, रणातोद्यम्, रणतूर्यम्, रणदुन्दुभिः, रणायुधः, रणोत्साहः, रणकर्मन्, रणक्षितिः, रणगोचर, रणधुरा, रणपण्डितः, रणप्रिय, रणमत्तः, रणमार्गकोविद, रणमुखम्, रणमूर्धन्, रणरङ्कः, रणरङ्गः, रणरणः, रणरणकः, रणकम्, रणरणायित, रणरसिक, रणलक्ष्मीः, रणवाद्यम्, रणवृत्ति, रणशिक्षा, रणशूरः, रणशौण्ड, रणसंरम्भः, रणसंकुलम्, रणसज्जा, रणसहायः, रणस्तम्भः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणाग्रम्
रणः + -अग्रम् the front or van of a battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणाङ्गम्
रणः + -अङ्गम् any weapon of war, a weapon, sword; सस्यन्दे शोणितं<BR> व्योम रणाङ्गानि प्रजज्वलुः Bk. 14. 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणाङ्गणम्
रणः + -अङ्गणम्, -अङ्गनम् a battle field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणाङ्गनम्
रणः + -अङ्गणम्, -अङ्गनम् a battle field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणाजिरम्
रणः + -अजिरम् a battle-field, arena.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणातिथिः
रणः + -अतिथिः a battle-guest; श्लाघ्यः प्राप्तो रणातिथिः Pañc. 2. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणान्तकृत्
रणः + -अन्तकृत् <i>m.</i> N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणापेत
रणः + -अपेत <i>a.</i> flying away from battle, a fugitive; स बभार<BR> रणापेतां चमूं पश्चादवस्थिताम् Ki. 15. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणाभियोगः|रणाभियोग
रणः + -अभियोगः engaging in battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणालंकरणः|रणालङ्करण|रणालङ्करणः
रणः + -अलंकरणः a heron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणातोद्यम्
रणः + -आतोद्यम्, -तूर्यम्, -दुन्दुभिः a military drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणतूर्यम्
रणः + -आतोद्यम्, -तूर्यम्, -दुन्दुभिः a military drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणदुन्दुभिः|रणदुन्दुभि|रणदुंदुभि
रणः + -आतोद्यम्, -तूर्यम्, -दुन्दुभिः a military drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणायुधः|रणायुध
रणः + -आयुधः a cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणोत्साहः|रणोत्साह
रणः + -उत्साहः prowess in battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणकर्मन्
रणः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> fighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणक्षितिः|रणक्षिति
रणः + -क्षितिः <i>f.</i>, {@-क्षेत्रम्, -भुः@} <i>f.</i>, {@-भूमिः@} <i>f.</i>, {@-स्थानम्@}<BR> a battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणगोचर
रणः + -गोचर <i>a.</i> engaged in battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणधुरा
रणः + -धुरा the front or van of battle, the brunt of battle; ताते<BR> चापद्वितीये वहति रणधुरां को भयस्यावकाशः Ve. 3. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणपण्डितः|रणपण्डित
रणः + -पण्डितः<BR>—1 a warrior.<BR>—2 <i>a.</i> skilled in warfare; अभीषयन्त ये शक्रं राक्षसा रणपण्डिताः Bk. 8. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणप्रिय|रणप्रियं|रणप्रियः
रणः + -प्रिय <i>a.</i> fond of war, warlike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणप्रियः|रणप्रिय|रणप्रियं
रणः + -प्रिय + .({@-यः@}) a falcon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणमत्तः|रणमत्त
रणः + -मत्तः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणमार्गकोविद
रणः + -मार्गकोविद <i>a.</i> experienced in the art of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणमुखम्
रणः + -मुखम्, -मूर्धन् <i>m.</i>, {@-शिरस्@} <i>n.</i><BR>—1 the front of battle, the head or van of fight; पुत्रस्य ते रणशिरस्ययमग्रयायी<BR> Ś. 7. 26, 6. 29.<BR>—2 the van of an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणमूर्धन्
रणः + -मुखम्, -मूर्धन् <i>m.</i>, {@-शिरस्@} <i>n.</i><BR>—1 the front of battle, the head or van of fight; पुत्रस्य ते रणशिरस्ययमग्रयायी<BR> Ś. 7. 26, 6. 29.<BR>—2 the van of an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरङ्कः|रणरङ्क|रणरंक
रणः + -रङ्कः<BR>—1 the space between the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">Page1326-1</a>]<BR> tusks of an elephant.<BR>—2 an elephant cowardly in battle; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1325-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरङ्गः|रणरङ्ग|रणरंग
रणः + -रङ्गः a battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरणः|रणरण|रणरणं
रणः + -रणः<BR>—1 a gnat, mosquito.<BR>—2 a warrior who gives out a loud cry in a war; अव्याद्वः करणो रणो<BR> रणरणो राणो रणो रावणः Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरणम्
रणः + -रणः + .({@-णम्@})<BR>—1 longing, anxious desire.<BR>—2 regret for a lost object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरणकः|रणरणक
रणः + -रणकः, -कम्<BR>—1 anxiety, uneasiness, regret (for a beloved object), affliction or torment<BR> (as caused by love); रणरणकविवृद्धिं बिभ्रदवर्तमानम् Māl. 1. 41;<BR> अतिभूमिं गतेन रणरणकेनार्यपुत्रशून्यमिवात्मानं पश्यामि U. 1.<BR>—2 love, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरणकः|रणरणक
रणः + -रणकः, -कम् + .({@-कः@}) the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणकम्
रणः + -रणकः, -कम्<BR>—1 anxiety, uneasiness, regret (for a beloved object), affliction or torment<BR> (as caused by love); रणरणकविवृद्धिं बिभ्रदवर्तमानम् Māl. 1. 41;<BR> अतिभूमिं गतेन रणरणकेनार्यपुत्रशून्यमिवात्मानं पश्यामि U. 1.<BR>—2 love, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरणायित
रणः + -रणायित <i>a.</i> rattling or sounding aloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणरसिक
रणः + -रसिक <i>a.</i> fond of fighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणलक्ष्मीः
रणः + -लक्ष्मीः<BR>—1 The goddess of war.<BR>—2 The fortune of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणवाद्यम्
रणः + -वाद्यम् a military instrument of music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणवृत्ति
रणः + -वृत्ति <i>a.</i> having war for a profession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणशिक्षा
रणः + -शिक्षा military science, the art or science of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणशूरः|रणशूर
रणः + -शूरः a hero in war, warrior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणशौण्ड
रणः + -शौण्ड <i>a.</i> skilled in war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणसंरम्भः|रणसंरम्भ
रणः + -संरम्भः the fury of battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणसंकुलम्
रणः + -संकुलम् the confusion of battle, a tumultuous fight, melee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणसज्जा
रणः + -सज्जा military accoutrement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणसहायः|रणसहाय
रणः + -सहायः an ally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणस्तम्भः|रणस्तम्भ|रणस्तंभ
रणः + -स्तम्भः a monument of war, trophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणत्कारः|रणत्कार
रणत्कारः<BR>—1 A rattling, clanking, or jingling sound; उत्तालः किङ्किणीनामनवरतरणत्कारहेतुः<BR> पताकाः Māl. 5. 4.<BR>—2 A sound in general.<BR>—3 Humming (as of bees).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणितम्
रणितम् Rattling, ringing, a rattling or jingling sound; पृष्ठे<BR> लीलावलयरणितं चामरग्राहिणीनाम् Bh. 3. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रणेस्वच्छः|रणेस्वच्छ
रणेस्वच्छः A cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रण्ड|रंड|रण्डः
रण्ड <i>a.</i> [रम्-ड तस्य नेत्वम् Uṇ. 1. 107]<BR>—1 Maimed, Mutilated.<BR>—2 Faithless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रण्डः|रण्ड|रंड
रण्ड + .{@-ण्डः@}<BR>—1 A man who dies without male issue.<BR>—2 A barren tree. —3 Cunning; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रण्डा
