रतिः + -रहस्यम् N. of an erotic work by Kokkoka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रतिलक्षम्
रतिः + -लक्षम् sexual union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रतिलम्पट|रतिलंपट
रतिः + -लम्पट <i>a.</i> lustful, libidinous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रतिशक्तिः|रतिशक्ति
रतिः + -शक्तिः <i>f.</i> manly or virile power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रतिशूरः|रतिशूर
रतिः + -शूरः a man of great procreative power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रतिसर्वस्वम्
रतिः + -सर्वस्वम् the all-in-all or highest essence of sexual pleasure;<BR> करं व्याधुन्वत्याः पिबसि रतिसर्वस्वमधरम् Ś. 1. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रतिसुन्दरः|रतिसुन्दर
रतिः + -सुन्दरः a mode of coitus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रतूः
रतूः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A celestial river.<BR>—2 Truthful words or speech; रतूः पान्थे सत्यवाचि देवनद्यां च कथ्यते<BR> Uṇādikośa. But according to कोशकल्पतरु of विश्वनाथकवि<BR> (अमुद्रित) ‘रतू स्यात् सत्यभाषकः’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नम्
रत्नम् [रमतेऽत्र रम्-न तान्तादेशः Uṇ. 3. 14]<BR>—1 A gem, jewel, a precious stone; किं रत्नमच्छा मतिः Bv. 1. 86;<BR> न रत्नमन्विष्यति मृग्यते हि तत् Ku. 5. 45. (The <i>ratnas</i> are<BR> said to be either five, nine or fourteen; see the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">Page1327-1</a>]<BR> words पञ्चरत्न, नवरत्न, and चतुर्दशरत्न respectively.)<BR>—2 Anything valuable or precious, any dear treasure.<BR>—3 Anything best or excellent of its kind; (mostly at the end of comp.);<BR> जातौ जातौ यदुत्कृष्टं तद् रत्नमभिधीयते Malli.; कन्यारत्नमयोनिजन्म<BR> भवतामास्ते वयं चार्थिनः Mv. 1. 30; अग्रेसरीभवतु काञ्चनचक्ररत्नम्<BR> Nāg. 5. 37; so पुत्र˚, स्त्री˚ V. 4. 25; अपत्य˚ &c.<BR>—4 A magnet.<BR>—5 Water.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रत्नाङ्कः, रत्नाङ्गः, रत्नाचलः, रत्नरोहणः, रत्नाधिपतिः, रत्नातुविद्ध, रत्नाकरः, रत्नाभरणम्, रत्नालोकः, रत्नावली, रत्नकन्दलः, रत्नकरः, रत्नकर्णिका, रत्नकुम्भः, रत्नकूटः, रत्नखचित, रत्नगर्भः, रत्नच्छाया, रत्नत्रयम्, रत्नदर्पणः, रत्नदीपः, रत्नप्रदीपः, रत्नधेनुः, रत्ननखः, रत्ननाभः, रत्ननायकः, रत्ननिधिः, रत्नपञ्चकम्, रत्नपारायणम्, रत्नप्रभा, रत्नमाला, रत्नमुख्यम्, रत्नराज्, रत्नराशिः, रत्नवरम्, रत्नवर्षुकम्, रत्नषष्ठी, रत्नसानुः, रत्नसू, रत्नसूः, रत्नसूतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1326-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नाङ्कः|रत्नाङ्क
रत्नम् + -अङ्कः N. of Viṣṇuʼs car.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नाङ्गः|रत्नाङ्ग
रत्नम् + -अङ्गः coral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नाचलः|रत्नाचल
रत्नम् + -अचलः, -रोहणः legendary mountain located in Ceylon and supposed<BR> to produce jewels at the rumbling of clouds for the benefit of all comers;<BR> श्रेणीवर्जनदुर्यशोनिबिडितव्रीडस्तु रत्नाचलः N. 12. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नरोहणः
रत्नम् + -अचलः, -रोहणः legendary mountain located in Ceylon and supposed<BR> to produce jewels at the rumbling of clouds for the benefit of all comers;<BR> श्रेणीवर्जनदुर्यशोनिबिडितव्रीडस्तु रत्नाचलः N. 12. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नाधिपतिः|रत्नाधिपति
रत्नम् + -अधिपतिः a superintendent of precious stones.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नातुविद्ध
रत्नम् + -अतुविद्ध <i>a.</i> set or studded with jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नाकरः|रत्नाकर
रत्नम् + -आकरः<BR>—1 a mine of jewels.<BR>—2 the ocean; रत्नेषु लुप्तेषु बहुष्वमर्त्यैरद्यापि रत्नाकर एव सिन्धुः<BR> Vikr. 1. 12; रत्नाकरं वीक्ष्य R. 13. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नाभरणम्
रत्नम् + -आभरणम् an ornament of jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नालोकः|रत्नालोक
रत्नम् + -आलोकः the lustre of a gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नावली
रत्नम् + -आवली<BR>—1 a necklace of jewels.<BR>—2 N. of a Nāṭikā attributed to Śrīharṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नकन्दलः|रत्नकन्दल|रत्नकंदल
रत्नम् + -कन्दलः coral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नकरः|रत्नकर
रत्नम् + -करः N. of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नकर्णिका
रत्नम् + -कर्णिका an ear-ring with jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नकुम्भः|रत्नकुम्भ
रत्नम् + -कुम्भः a jar set with jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नकूटः|रत्नकूट
रत्नम् + -कूटः N. of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नखचित
रत्नम् + -खचित <i>a.</i> set or studded with gems.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नगर्भः|रत्नगर्भ
रत्नम् + -गर्भः<BR>—1 Kubera.<BR>—2 the sea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नगर्भा
रत्नम् + -गर्भः + .({@-र्भा@}) the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नच्छाया
रत्नम् + -च्छाया splendour of jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नत्रयम्
रत्नम् + -त्रयम्<BR>—1 (with Buddhists) बुद्ध, धर्म and संघ.<BR>—2 (with Jainas) सम्यग् दर्शन, सम्यग् ज्ञान and सम्यक् चारित्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नदर्पणः|रत्नदर्पण
रत्नम् + -दर्पणः a mirror studded with jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नदीपः|रत्नदीप
रत्नम् + -दीपः, -प्रदीपः<BR>—1 a jewel-lamp.<BR>—2 a gem serving as a lamp; अर्चिस्तुङ्गानभिमुखमपि प्राप्य रत्नप्रदीपान् Me. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नप्रदीपः|रत्नप्रदीप
रत्नम् + -दीपः, -प्रदीपः<BR>—1 a jewel-lamp.<BR>—2 a gem serving as a lamp; अर्चिस्तुङ्गानभिमुखमपि प्राप्य रत्नप्रदीपान् Me. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नधेनुः|रत्नधेनु
रत्नम् + -धेनुः a cow symbolically represented by jewels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्ननखः
रत्नम् + -नखः a poniard with its hilt set with jewels; कटितटनिविष्टरत्ननखः Dk. 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्ननाभः|रत्ननाभ
रत्नम् + -नाभः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्ननायकः|रत्ननायक
रत्नम् + -नायकः a ruby.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्ननिधिः|रत्ननिधि
रत्नम् + -निधिः<BR>—1 the ocean.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 of Meru.<BR>—4 a wag-tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नपञ्चकम्
रत्नम् + -पञ्चकम् the 5 jewels (viz. gold, silver, pearls, the राजावर्त<BR> diamond and coral).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नपारायणम्
रत्नम् + -पारायणम् the sheet-anchor of all jewels; रत्नपारायणं नाम्ना<BR> लङ्केति मम मैथिलि Bk. 5. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नप्रभा
रत्नम् + -प्रभा the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नमाला
रत्नम् + -माला a jewel-necklace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नमुख्यम्
रत्नम् + -मुख्यम् a diamond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नराज्
रत्नम् + -राज् <i>m.</i> a ruby.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नराशिः|रत्नराशि
रत्नम् + -राशिः<BR>—1 a heap of gems.<BR>—2 the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नवरम्
रत्नम् + -वरम् gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नवर्षुकम्
रत्नम् + -वर्षुकम् the Puṣpaka car.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नषष्ठी
रत्नम् + -षष्ठी a vow or fast to be observed on the 6th day of a particular<BR> fortnight; it is a ग्रीष्मव्रत; अहं खलु रत्नषष्ठीमुपोषितासम् Mk. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नसानुः|रत्नसानु
रत्नम् + -सानुः N. of the mountain Meru.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नसू
रत्नम् + -सू <i>a.</i> producing jewels; न मामवति सद्वीपा रत्नसूरपि<BR> मेदिनी R. 1. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नसूः
रत्नम् + -सूः, -सूतिः <i>f.</i> the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नसूतिः|रत्नसूति
रत्नम् + -सूः, -सूतिः <i>f.</i> the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नवत्|रत्नवन्त्
रत्नवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Abounding in, or full of, precious stones.<BR>—2 Decorated with jewels; आसेदिवान् रत्नवदासनं सः R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्नवती
रत्नवत् + .{@-ती@} The earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रत्निः|रत्नि
रत्निः <i>m. f.</i><BR>—1 The elbow.<BR>—2 The distance from the elbow to the end of the closed fist, a cubit;<BR> अष्टरत्निर्महाबाहुः Mb. 8. 72. 30. ━<i>m.</i> The closed fist. (This<BR> word appears to be a corruption of अरत्नि q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथः|रथ
रथः [रम्यतेऽनेन अत्र वा, रम्-कथन्; cf. Uṇ. 2. 2]<BR>—1 A carriage, chariot, car, vehicle; especially, a war-chariot.<BR>—2 A hero (for रथिन्); अपयातेषु पार्थेषु त्रयस्तेऽभ्याययू रथाः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">Page1327-2</a>]<BR> Mb. 1. 2. 92.<BR>—3 A foot.<BR>—4 A limb, part, member.<BR>—5 The body; cf. आत्मानं रथिनं विद्धि शरीरं रथमेव तु Kaṭh. 1. 3. 3.<BR>—6 A reed.<BR>—7 Pleasure, delight.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रथाक्षः, रथाङ्गम्, रथाभ्रः, रथार्थकः, रथाश्वः, रथायुधकः, रथारोहः, रथेशः, रथेषा, रथेशा, रथोडुपः, रथोडुपम्, रथोद्वहः, रथोपस्थः, रथकट्या, रथकड्या, रथकल्पकः, रथकरः, रथकारः, रथकुटुम्बिकः, रथकुटुम्बिन्, रथकुबरः, रथकुबरम्, रथकेतुः, रथक्षोभः, रथगणकः, रथगर्भकः, रथगुप्तिः, रथघोषः, रथचरणः, रथपादः, रथचर्या, रथजङ्घा, रथज्वरः, रथदुर्गम्, रथधुर्, रथनाभिः, रथनीडः, रथपुंगवः, रथबन्धः, रथमहोत्सवः, रथयात्रा, रथमुखम्, रथयुद्धम्, रथयोगः, रथयोजकः, रथवंशः, रथवर्त्मन्, रथवारकः, रथवाहः, रथविज्ञानम्, रथविद्या, रथशक्तिः, रथशाला, रथशास्त्रम्, रथशिक्षा, रथसप्तमी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथाक्षः|रथाक्ष
रथः + -अक्षः<BR>—1 a carriage-axle.<BR>—2 a measure of length (= 104 <i>aṅgulas</i>).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथाङ्गम्
रथः + -अङ्गम्<BR>—1 any part of a carriage.<BR>—2 particularly, the wheels of a carriage; रथो रथाङ्गध्वनिना विजज्ञे<BR> R. 7. 41; Ś. 7. 10.<BR>—3 a discus, especially of Viṣṇu; चक्रधर इति रथाङ्गमदः सततं<BR> बिभर्षि भुवनेषु रूढये Śi. 15. 26.<BR>—4 a potterʼs wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथाङ्गः|रथाङ्ग|रथांग|रथाङ्गं
रथः + -अङ्गम् + .({@-ङ्गः@}) the ruddy goose. ˚आह्वयः, ˚आह्वानः, ˚नामकः, ˚नामन्<BR> <i>m.</i> the ruddy goose (चक्रवाक); रथाङ्गनामन् वियुतो रथाङ्गश्रोणिबिम्बया ।<BR> अयं त्वां पृच्छति रथी मनोरथशतैर्वृतः ॥ V. 4. 18; Ku. 3. 37;<BR> R. 3. 24; रथाङ्गाह्वानानां भवति विधुरम् Udb.; (the male bird is said<BR> by poets to be separated from the female at night, and to be united at<BR> sun-rise). ˚पाणिः N. of Viṣṇu; रथाङ्गपाणेः पटलेन रोचिषा<BR> Śi. 1. 21; दुरन्तवीर्यस्य रथाङ्गपाणेः Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथाभ्रः|रथाभ्र
रथः + -अभ्रः a reed cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथार्थकः
रथः + -अर्थकः a small carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथाश्वः|रथाश्व
रथः + -अश्वः a carriage-horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथायुधकः|रथायुधक
रथः + -आयुधकः a kind of bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथारोहः|रथारोह
रथः + -आरोहः one who fights from a chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथेशः|रथेश
रथः + -ईशः a warrior fighting from a chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथेषा
रथः + -ईषा, -ईशा the pole of a carriage; रथेषाश्च रथेषाभिः … संगतैः<BR> सहिताः Mb. 6. 46. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथेशा
रथः + -ईषा, -ईशा the pole of a carriage; रथेषाश्च रथेषाभिः … संगतैः<BR> सहिताः Mb. 6. 46. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथोडुपः|रथोडुप
रथः + -उडुपः, -उडुपम् the body of a chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथोडुपम्
रथः + -उडुपः, -उडुपम् the body of a chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथोद्वहः|रथोद्वह
रथः + -उद्वहः, -उपस्थः the seat of a chariot, the driving-box; रथोपस्थ<BR> उपाविशत् Bg. 1. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथोपस्थः|रथोपस्थ
