रथकट्या
रथः + -कट्या, -कड्या an assemblage of chariots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथकड्या
