रथकुबरम्
रथः + -कुबरः, -कुबरम् the pole or shaft of a carriage; कूबरा रथकूबरैः … संगतैः सहिताः<BR> Mb. 6. 46. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथकेतुः|रथकेतु
रथः + -केतुः the flag of a chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथक्षोभः|रथक्षोभ
रथः + -क्षोभः the jolting of a chariot; रथक्षोभपरिश्रमम् R. 1. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथगणकः|रथगणक
रथः + -गणकः an officer who counts chariots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथगर्भकः|रथगर्भक
रथः + -गर्भकः a litter, palanquin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथगुप्तिः|रथगुप्ति
