रथचरणः|रथचरण
रथः + -चरणः, -पादः<BR>—1 a chariot-wheel; धृतरथचरणोऽभ्ययाच्चलद्गुः Bhāg. 1. 9. 37; Dk. 2. 7.<BR>—2 the सुदर्शन wheel; रथाङ्गे चन्द्रार्कौ रथचरणपाणिः शर इति<BR> Śivamahimna 18.<BR>—2 the ruddy goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1327-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

