रथः + -मुखम् the forepart of a carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथयुद्धम्
रथः + -युद्धम् ‘a chariot-fight’, a fight between combatants mounted on chariots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथयोगः|रथयोग
रथः + -योगः a team (of horses etc.) on a chariot; Bṛ. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथयोजकः|रथयोजक
रथः + -योजकः a charioteer, harnesser of a chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथवंशः|रथवंश
रथः + -वंशः a number of chariots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथवर्त्मन्
रथः + -वर्त्मन् <i>n.</i>, {@-वीथिः@} <i>f.</i><BR> highway, main road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथवारकः|रथवारक
रथः + -वारकः son of a Śūdra and a Sairandhrī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथवाहः|रथवाह
रथः + -वाहः<BR>—1 a carriage-horse.<BR>—2 charioteer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथविज्ञानम्
रथः + -विज्ञानम्, -विद्या the art of driving chariots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथविद्या
रथः + -विज्ञानम्, -विद्या the art of driving chariots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथशक्तिः|रथशक्ति
रथः + -शक्तिः <i>f.</i> the staff which supports the banner of a war-chariot;<BR> रथशक्तिं मुमोचासौ दीप्तामग्निशिखामिव Mb. 10. 6. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथशाला
रथः + -शाला a coach-house, carriage-shed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथशास्त्रम्
रथः + -शास्त्रम्, -शिक्षा the art of driving a chariot, coachmanship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथशिक्षा
रथः + -शास्त्रम्, -शिक्षा the art of driving a chariot, coachmanship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथसप्तमी
रथः + -सप्तमी the seventh day in the bright half of Māgha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथन्तरम्
रथन्तरम् A Vedic Sāma; स्वरादिविशेषानुपूर्वीमात्रस्वरूपे ऋगक्षरव्यतिरिक्तं<BR> यद् गानं तद् रथन्तरम् । (सामर्चिकभाष्यम्); एतद्रथन्तरमग्नौ<BR> प्रोतम् Ch. Up. 2. 12. 1; रथन्तरेण तं तात वसिष्ठः प्रत्यबोधयत्<BR> Mb. 14. 11. 19 (com. रथो मायारूपो विग्रहः तं तरत्यनेन तद्रथन्तरम् ।<BR> ‘अहं ब्रह्मास्मि’ इति वाक्यं तेन वसिष्ठो गुरुस्तं प्रत्यबोधयत्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथारथि
रथारथि <i>ind.</i> ‘Chariot against chariot’, in closest fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथिक|रथिकः
रथिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [रथ-ठन्]<BR>—1 Riding in a carriage.<BR>—2 The owner of a carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथिकः|रथिक
रथिक + .{@-कः@} A cartwright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथिन्
रथिन् <i>a.</i> [रथ-इनि]<BR>—1 Riding or driving in a carriage.<BR>—2 Possessing or owning a carriage. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 An owner of a carriage.<BR>—2 A warrior who fights from a chariot; आत्मानं रथिनं विद्धि शरीरं<BR> रथमेव तु । बुद्धिं तु सारथिं विद्धि मनः प्रग्रहमेव च ॥ Kaṭh. 1. 3. 3;<BR> R. 7. 37.<BR>—3 A man of क्षत्रिय caste.<BR>—4 A driver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथिनी
रथिन् + .{@-नी@} A number of carriages or chariots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथिन|रथिनः
रथिन <i>a.</i> See रथिन् above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथिर|रथिरः
रथिर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Possessing a carriage.<BR>—2 Riding in a carriage.<BR>—3 Quick, speedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथिरः|रथिर
रथिर + .{@-रः@} = रथिन् <i>m.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथी
रथी Ved.<BR>—1 Riding in a chariot.<BR>—2 Furnished with a carriage.<BR>—3 A coachman.<BR>—4 A guide, leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथ्यः|रथ्य
रथ्यः [रथं वहति यत्]<BR>—1 A chariot-horse; धावन्त्यमी मृगजवाक्षमयेव रथ्याः Ś. 1. 8; Śi. 4. 14.<BR>—2 A part of a chariot.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रथ्यचयः, रथ्यविरथ्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथ्यचयः|रथ्यचय
रथ्यः + -चयः a team of horses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथ्यविरथ्यः|रथ्यविरथ्य
रथ्यः + -विरथ्यः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथ्या
रथ्या<BR>—1 A road for carriages; (hence) a high-way, main road; भूयो भूयः सविधनगरीरथ्यया<BR> पर्यटन्तम् Māl. 1. 15.<BR>—2 A place where many roads meet.<BR>—3 A number of carriages or chariots; रथ्याघोषैर्बृंहणैर्वारणानाम्<BR> Śi. 18. 3; अश्वीयैरौक्षकैर्मानुष्यकै रथ्याभिरौष्ट्रकैः Dharmābhyudayamahākāvya 2. 26.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रथ्यापङ्क्तिः, रथ्यामुखम्, रथ्यामृगः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथ्यापङ्क्तिः|रथ्यापङ्क्ति
रथ्या + -पङ्क्तिः a row of streets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथ्यामुखम्
रथ्या + -मुखम् entrance to a road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रथ्यामृगः|रथ्यामृग
रथ्या + -मृगः a dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रद्
रद् €1 P. (रदति)<BR>—1 To split, rend.<BR>—2 To scratch.<BR>—3 To gnaw.<BR>—4 To dig.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रदः|रद
रदः [रद्-अच्]<BR>—1 Splitting, scratching.<BR>—2 A tooth; tusk (of an elephant); याताश्चेन्न पराञ्चन्ति द्विरदानां<BR> रदा इव Bv. 1. 65.<BR>—3 A symbolical expression for the number ‘thirty-two’.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रदायुधः, रदखण्डनम्, रदच्छदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रदायुधः|रदायुध
रदः + -आयुधः a wild boar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रदखण्डनम्
रदः + -खण्डनम् tooth-bite; जनय रदखण्डनम् Gīt. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रदच्छदः|रदच्छद|रदछद
रदः + -छदः A lip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रदनः|रदन
रदनः A tooth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रदनम्
रदनः + .{@-नम्@} The act of splitting, gnawing, scratching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रदनिन्
रदनिन्, -रदिन् <i>m.</i><BR> An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रदिन्
रदनिन्, -रदिन् <i>m.</i><BR> An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रद्दः|रद्द
रद्दः (In astrol.) N. of the eleventh Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रध्
रध्, -रन्ध् €4 P.<BR> (रध्यति, रद्ध; <i>caus.</i> रन्धयति; <i>desid.</i><BR> रिरधिषति or रिरत्सति)<BR>—1 To hurt, injure, torment, kill, destroy; अक्षं रधितुमारेभे Bk. 9. 29.<BR>—2 To subdue.<BR>—3 To become subject to (any one).<BR>—4 (Ved.) To die.<BR>—5 (Ved.) To be completed. ━<i>Caus.</i> (रन्धयति)<BR>—1 To hurt, injure; भरतं शोकसंतप्तं भूयः शोकैररन्धयत् Rām. 2. 81. 3.<BR>—2 To oppress, torment.<BR>—3 To dress, cook or prepare (as food).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्ध्|रंध्
रध्, -रन्ध् €4 P.<BR> (रध्यति, रद्ध; <i>caus.</i> रन्धयति; <i>desid.</i><BR> रिरधिषति or रिरत्सति)<BR>—1 To hurt, injure, torment, kill, destroy; अक्षं रधितुमारेभे Bk. 9. 29.<BR>—2 To subdue.<BR>—3 To become subject to (any one).<BR>—4 (Ved.) To die.<BR>—5 (Ved.) To be completed. ━<i>Caus.</i> (रन्धयति)<BR>—1 To hurt, injure; भरतं शोकसंतप्तं भूयः शोकैररन्धयत् Rām. 2. 81. 3.<BR>—2 To oppress, torment.<BR>—3 To dress, cook or prepare (as food).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रद्ध
रद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Hurt.<BR>—2 Subdued, conquered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रद्धृ
रद्धृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A conqueror.<BR>—2 An oppressor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रधसः
रधसः [Uṇ. 3. 116] A kind of demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रध्र
रध्र <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Rich, liberal.<BR>—2 Happy.<BR>—3 Worshipping.<BR>—4 Injuring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्धनम्
रन्धनम्, -रन्धिः <i>f.</i><BR> [रध्-पाके ल्युट् नुमागमः]<BR>—1 Injuring, tormenting, destroying; यदनुस्मर्यते काले स्वबुद्ध्याऽभद्ररन्धन<BR> Bhāg. 4. 30. 28.<BR>—2 Cooking; रन्धनाय स्थाली Sk.; स्थाल्यग्नितापात् पयसोऽभितापस्तत्तापतस्तण्डुलगर्भरन्धिः<BR> Bhāg. 5. 10. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्धिः|रन्धि|रंधि|रंधिः
रन्धनम्, -रन्धिः <i>f.</i><BR> [रध्-पाके ल्युट् नुमागमः]<BR>—1 Injuring, tormenting, destroying; यदनुस्मर्यते काले स्वबुद्ध्याऽभद्ररन्धन<BR> Bhāg. 4. 30. 28.<BR>—2 Cooking; रन्धनाय स्थाली Sk.; स्थाल्यग्नितापात् पयसोऽभितापस्तत्तापतस्तण्डुलगर्भरन्धिः<BR> Bhāg. 5. 10. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्धित|रंधित|रन्धितं
रन्धित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Dressed, cooked.<BR>—2 Destroyed; योगरन्धितकर्माणो हृदि योगविभाविते Bhāg. 8. 3. 27.<BR>—3 Subdued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्तव्य
रन्तव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be enjoyed.<BR>—2 To be toyed with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्तव्यम्
रन्तव्य + .{@-व्यम्@} Pleasure, play; मा विहासिष्ट समरं समरन्तव्यसंयतः Ki. 15. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्ता
रन्ता <i>f.</i> A cow; इडे रन्ते etc; ŚB. on MS. 10. 3. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्तिदेवः|रन्तिदेव|रंतिदेव|रंतिदेवः
रन्तिदेवः<BR>—1 N. of a king of the lunar race, sixth in descent from Bharata. [He<BR> was very pious and benevolent. He possessed enormous riches, but he spent<BR> them in performing grand sacrifices. So great was the number of animals<BR> slaughtered during his reign both in sacrifices as well as for use in<BR> his kitchen that a river of blood is supposed to have issued from their<BR> hides which was afterwards appropriately called चर्मण्वती; स्रोतोमूर्त्या<BR> भुवि परिणतां रन्तिदेवस्य कीर्तिम् Me. 47 and Malli. thereon.]<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 A dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्तुः|रन्तु|रंतुः
रन्तुः<BR>—1 A way, road.<BR>—2 A river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1328-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्ध्रम्
रन्ध्रम् [Uṇ. 2. 28]<BR>—1 A hole, an aperture, a cavity, an opening, a chasm, fissure; रन्ध्रष्विवालक्ष्यनभःप्रदेशा<BR> R. 13. 56, 15. 82; नासाग्ररन्ध्रम् Māl. 1. 1; क्रौञ्चरन्ध्रम् Me. 59.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) A weak or vulnerable point, assailable point; रन्ध्रोपनिपातिनोऽनर्थाः<BR> Ś. 6; रन्ध्रान्वेषणदक्षाणां द्विषामामिषतां ययौ R. 12. 11, 15. 17, 17. 61;<BR> रन्ध्रं च प्रकृतीनाम् Kau. A. 1. 16.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) A defect, fault, an imperfection.<BR>—3 A symbolical expression for the number ‘nine’, (there being nine openings<BR> in the human body).<BR>—4 The vulva.<BR>—5 N. of the 8th astrological mansion; Bṛ. S.<BR>—6 A mischief; रन्ध्रदर्शनासहैः Dk. 2. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रन्ध्रान्वेषिन्, रन्ध्रानुसारिन्, रन्ध्रागतम्, रन्ध्रगुप्तिः, रन्ध्रप्रहारिन्, रन्ध्रबभ्रुः, रन्ध्रवंशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्ध्रान्वेषिन्
रन्ध्रम् + -अन्वेषिन्, -अनुसारिन् <i>a.</i> searching or watching for weak points;<BR> रन्ध्रानुसारी विषमः कृतान्तः Mk. 8. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्ध्रानुसारिन्
रन्ध्रम् + -अन्वेषिन्, -अनुसारिन् <i>a.</i> searching or watching for weak points;<BR> रन्ध्रानुसारी विषमः कृतान्तः Mk. 8. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्ध्रागतम्
रन्ध्रम् + -आगतम् a disease which attacks the throat of horses; रन्ध्रागतमथाश्वानां<BR> शिखोद्भेदश्च बर्हिणाम् Mb. 12. 283. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्ध्रगुप्तिः|रन्ध्रगुप्ति
रन्ध्रम् + -गुप्तिः concealing oneʼs weak points.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्ध्रप्रहारिन्
रन्ध्रम् + -प्रहारिन् <i>a.</i> attacking (one) in his weak points.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्ध्रबभ्रुः|रन्ध्रबभ्रु|रंध्रबभ्रु
रन्ध्रम् + -बभ्रुः a rat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रन्ध्रवंशः|रन्ध्रवंश|रंध्रवंश
रन्ध्रम् + -वंशः a hollow bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रप्
रप् €1 P. (रपति)<BR>—1 To speak distinctly.<BR>—2 Ved. To praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रपस्
रपस् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Defect, fault.<BR>—2 Sin.<BR>—3 Injury, harm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रफ्
रफ्, -रम्फ् €1 P. (र-रम्फति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To hurt, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्फ्|रंफ्
रफ्, -रम्फ् €1 P. (र-रम्फति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To hurt, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रभ्
रभ् €1 Ā. (रभते, रब्ध; <i>caus.</i> रम्भयति-ते; <i>desid.</i> रिप्सते)<BR>—1 To begin.<BR>—2 To clasp, embrace.<BR>—3 To long for, be eager.<BR>—4 To act rashly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रभस्
रभस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 Violence, zeal, vehemence.<BR>—2 Rashness, precipitation.<BR>—3 Force, strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रभस|रभसः
रभस <i>a.</i> [रभ्-असच् Uṇ. 3. 116]<BR>—1 Violent, impetuous, fierce, wild.<BR>—2 Strong, intense, vehement, powerful, ardent, eager (as desire &c.);<BR> रभसया नु दिगन्तदिदृक्षया Ki. 5. 1; R. 9. 61; Mu. 5. 24.<BR>—3 Rash, precipitate.<BR>—4 Joyful, glad.<BR>—5 Ved. Strengthening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रभसः|रभस
रभस + .{@-सः@}<BR>—1 Violence, force, impetuosity, haste, speed, hurry, vehemence, आलीषु<BR> केलीरभसेन बाला मुहुर्ममालापमुपालपन्ती Bv. 2. 12; त्वभिसरणरभसेन<BR> वलन्ती Gīt. 6; Śi. 6. 13, 11. 23; Ki. 9. 47; Bhāg. 7. 9. 15.<BR>—2 Rashness, precipitateness, headlong haste; अतिरभसकृतानां कर्मणामाविपत्तेर्भवति<BR> हृदयदाही शल्यतुल्यो विपाकः Bh. 2. 99; त्यजति न मृगव्याधरभसः<BR> Śivamahimna 22.<BR>—3 Anger, passion, rage, fury; रक्तेक्षणेन च मनाग्रभसं दधानौ<BR> Bhāg. 3. 15. 28.<BR>—4 Regret, sorrow.<BR>—5 Joy, pleasure, delight; मनसि रभसविभवे हरिरुदयतु सुकृतेन Gīt. 5.<BR>—6 Ardent desire, eagerness.<BR>—7 Poison.<BR>—8 N. of a magical incantation recited over weapons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रभूः
रभूः A messenger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्
रम् €1 Ā. (रमते, but Paras. when preceded by वि, आ, परि<BR> and उप; रेमे, अरंस्त, अरंसीत् P. रंस्यते, रन्तुम्, रत)<BR>—1 To be pleased or delighted, rejoice, be gratified; रहसि रमते<BR> Māl. 3. 2; Ms. 2. 223; U. 2. 18.<BR>—2 To rejoice at, be pleased with, take delight in, be fond of (with instr.<BR> or loc.); लोलापाङ्गैर्यदि न रमसे लोचनैर्वञ्चितोऽसि<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">Page1329-2</a>]<BR> Me. 27; व्यजेष्ट षड्वर्गमरंस्त नीतौ Bk. 1. 2.<BR>—3 To play, sport, dally, amuse oneself with; राजप्रियाः कैरविण्यो रमन्ते<BR> मधुपैः सह Bv. 1. 126 (where the next meaning is also hinted); Bk. 6. 15, 67;<BR> रंरम्यते (अतिशयेन रमते) सरसनागरिकण नाभ्ना<BR> श्रीबिल्हणेन कविना क्षितिपालपुत्री Bil. C. 48.<BR>—4 To have sexual intercourse with; सा तत्पुत्रेण सह रमते H. 3;<BR> विशङ्कमाना रमितं कयापि जनार्दनम् Gīt. 7.<BR>—5 To remain, stay, pause.<BR>—6 To take rest, remain quiet.<BR>—7 To gladden, delight. ━<i>Caus.</i> (रमयति-ते) To please, delight,<BR> satisfy. ━<i>Desid.</i> (रिरंसते) To wish to sport &c.; Śi. 15. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम|रमः
रम <i>a.</i> [रम्-अच्]<BR>—1 Pleasing, delightful, gratifying.<BR>—2 Dear, beloved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमः|रम
रम + .{@-मः@}<BR>—1 Joy, delight.<BR>—2 A lover, husband.<BR>—3 The god of love.<BR>—4 The Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमक|रमकः
रमक <i>a.</i> Sporting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमकः|रमक
रमक + .{@-कः@} A lover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमठम्
रमठम् [रमेः अठः Uṇ. 1. 97] Asa Foetida (हिङ्गु).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रमठध्वनिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमठध्वनिः|रमठध्वनि
रमठम् + -ध्वनिः Asa Foetida.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमण|रमणं|रमणः
रमण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [रमयति-रम्-णिच् ल्यु ल्युट् वा] Pleasing, gratifying,<BR> delightful, charming; नन्दनानि मुनीन्द्राणां रमणानि वनौकसाम् Bk. 6. 72;<BR> Bhāg. 5. 7. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणः|रमण|रमणं
रमण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 A lover, husband; प्रायेणैते रमणविरहेष्वङ्गनानां विनोदाः Me. 89, 39;<BR> पप्रच्छ रामां रमणोऽभिलाषम् R. 14. 27; Ku. 4. 21; Śi. 9. 60.<BR>—2 The god of love.<BR>—3 N. of Aruṇa.<BR>—4 An ass.<BR>—5 A testicle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणम्
रमण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Sporting.<BR>—2 Dalliance, pastime, amorous sport.<BR>—3 Love, sexual union.<BR>—4 Joy or pleasure in general.<BR>—5 The hip and the loins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणा
रमणा<BR>—1 A wife, mistress.<BR>—2 A lovely woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणी
रमणी<BR>—1 A lovely young woman; लता रम्या सेयं भ्रमरकुलरम्या न रमणी Bv. 2. 90.<BR>—2 A wife, mistress; भोगः को रमणीं विना Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 A woman in general.<BR>—4 The aloe tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणीय|रमणीयं
रमणीय <i>a.</i> [रम्यतेऽत्र रम्-आधारे अनीयर्]<BR>—1 Pleasant, delightful, enjoyable.<BR>—2 Lovely, charming, handsome; स्मितं नैतत्किंतु प्रकृतिरमणीयं विकसितम्<BR> Bv. 2. 90; क्षणे क्षणे यन्नवतामुपैति तदेव रूपं रमणीयतायाः Śi. 4. 17.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रमणीयचरण, रमणीयजन्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणीयचरण
रमणीय + -चरण of pleasant conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणीयजन्मन्
रमणीय + -जन्मन् of auspicious birth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमणीयते
रमणीयते Den. Ā. To represent a wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमण्या
रमण्या <i>f.</i> A female.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमतिः|रमति
रमतिः [रम्-अतिच् Uṇ. 4. 65]<BR>—1 The god of love.<BR>—2 A lover.<BR>—3 Heaven.<BR>—4 Time.<BR>—5 A crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमा
रमा [रमयति रम्-अच्]<BR>—1 A wife, mistress.<BR>—2 N. of Lakṣmī, wife of Viṣṇu and Goddess of wealth; रमा यत्र<BR> न वाक् तत्र यत्र वाक् तत्र नी रमा Udb.<BR>—3 Good luck, fortune.<BR>—4 Riches.<BR>—5 Splendour.<BR>—6 N. of the eleventh day in the dark half of Kārtika.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रमास्पदः, रमाकान्तः, रमानाथः, रमापतिः, रमाप्रियः, रमावेष्टः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमास्पदः
रमा + -आस्पदः, -कान्तः, -नाथः, -पतिः epithets of Viṣṇu; Bhāg. 10. 55. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमाकान्तः|रमाकान्त
रमा + -आस्पदः, -कान्तः, -नाथः, -पतिः epithets of Viṣṇu; Bhāg. 10. 55. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमानाथः|रमानाथ
रमा + -आस्पदः, -कान्तः, -नाथः, -पतिः epithets of Viṣṇu; Bhāg. 10. 55. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमापतिः|रमापति
रमा + -आस्पदः, -कान्तः, -नाथः, -पतिः epithets of Viṣṇu; Bhāg. 10. 55. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमाप्रियः|रमाप्रिय|रमाप्रियं
रमा + -प्रियः Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमाप्रियम्
रमा + -प्रियः + .({@-यम्@}) a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रमावेष्टः|रमावेष्ट
रमा + -वेष्टः turpentine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1329-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्भ्|रंभ्
रम्भ् €1 Ā. (रम्भते) To sound, bellow; to low (as cows).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्भः|रम्भ|रंभः
रम्भः<BR>—1 Sounding, roaring &c.<BR>—2 A support, prop.<BR>—3 A stick.<BR>—4 A bamboo.<BR>—5 Dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्भा
रम्भा<BR>—1 A plantain tree; विजितरम्भमूरुद्वयम् Gīt. 10; पिबोरु रम्भातरुपीवरोरु<BR> N. 22. 43, 2. 37.<BR>—2 N. of Gaurī.<BR>—3 N. of an <i>apsaras</i>, wife of Nalakūbara and considered as the<BR> most beautiful woman in the paradise of Indra; तरुमूरुयुगेन सुन्दरी<BR> किमु रम्भां परिणाहिना परम् । तरुणीमपि जिष्णुरेव तां धनदापत्यतपःफलस्तनीम् ॥ N. 2. 37.<BR>—4 A harlot.<BR>—5 Sounding, roaring.<BR>—6 The lowing of cows.<BR>—7 A kind of rice.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रम्भोरु, रम्भातृतीया<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्भोरु
रम्भा + -ऊरु <i>a.</i> (-रु or -रू <i>f.</i>)<BR> having thighs like the interior of a plantain tree,<BR> <i>i. e.</i> full, round, and hence lovely; रम्भोरूरवतरितुं सरस्यनिच्छुः<BR> Śi. 8. 19; R. 6. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्भातृतीया
रम्भा + -तृतीया N. of the 3rd day of the bright half of मार्गशीर्ष<BR> (ज्येष्ठ ?) and the observance of the day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्य|रम्यः
रम्य <i>a.</i> [रम्यतेऽत्र यत्]<BR>—1 Pleasing, pleasant, delightful, agreeable; रम्यास्तपोधनानां क्रियाः<BR> समवलोक्य Ś. 1. 13 (v. l.).<BR>—2 Beautiful, lovely, handsome; सरसिजमनुविद्धं शैवलेनापि रम्यम्<BR> Ś. 1. 20, 5. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्यः|रम्य
रम्य + .{@-म्यः@} The tree called चम्पक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्या
रम्य + .{@-म्या@}<BR>—1 Night.<BR>—2 A land-growing lotus; L. D. B.<BR>—3 (In music) A kind of Śruti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्यम्
रम्य + .{@-म्यम्@} Semen virile.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रम्यान्तर, रम्यपुष्पः, रम्यश्रीः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्यान्तर
रम्य + -अन्तर <i>a.</i> having the intervening spaces made pleasant; रम्यान्तरः<BR> कमलिनीहरितैः सरोभिः Ś. 4. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्यपुष्पः|रम्यपुष्प
रम्य + -पुष्पः the Śālmalī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्यश्रीः
रम्य + -श्रीः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रम्रः|रम्र
रम्रः<BR>—1 Tawny colour.<BR>—2 Beauty; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रय्
रय् €1 Ā. (रयते, रयित) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रयः|रय
रयः [रय्-अच्]<BR>—1 The stream of a river, current; जम्बूकुञ्जप्रतिहतरयं तोयमादाय<BR> गच्छेः Me. 20.<BR>—2 Force, speed, velocity; तोयस्येवाप्रतिहतरयः सैकतं सेतुमोघः<BR> U. 3. 36; Bhāg. 5. 3. 14.<BR>—3 Zeal, ardour, vehemence, impetuosity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रयि
रयि <i>m., n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Water.<BR>—2 Wealth; एष वै रयिरात्मा वैश्वानरः Ch. Up. 5. 16. 1.<BR>—3 Stuff, material, food; रयिं च प्राणं चेत्येतौ Praśna. Up. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रयिष्ठः|रयिष्ठ
रयिष्ठः<BR>—1 N. of Kubera.<BR>—2 Agni.<BR>—3 Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रयिष्ठम्
रयिष्ठः + .{@-ष्ठम्@} N. of various Sāmans.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रर्फ्
रर्फ् €1 P. (रर्फति) To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रराटम्
रराटम्, -रराटी<BR> = ललाट q. v.; तपो रराटीं विदुरादिपुंसः Bhāg. 2. 1. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रराटी
रराटम्, -रराटी<BR> = ललाट q. v.; तपो रराटीं विदुरादिपुंसः Bhāg. 2. 1. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रल्लकः|रल्लक
रल्लकः<BR>—1 A woollen cloth, blanket.<BR>—2 An eye-lash; युवतिरल्लकभल्लसमाहतो भवति को न युवा गतचेतनः;<BR> सीतारल्लकभल्लभग्नहृदयः स्वस्थो न लङ्केश्वरः Hanumannāṭakam.<BR>—3 A kind of deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रवः|रव
रवः [रु-अप्]<BR>—1 A cry, shriek, scream, yell, roar (of animals &c.); नरवरो रवरोषितकेसरी<BR> R.; रवः श्रवणभैरवः Ve. 3. 4.<BR>—2 Singing, humming sound (of birds); R. 9. 29.<BR>—3 Clamour.<BR>—4 Noise or sound in general; घण्टा˚, भूषण˚, चाप˚ &c. —5 Thunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रवण|रवणं|रवणः
रवण <i>a.</i> [रु-युच् Uṇ. 2. 71] Crying, roaring, screaming.<BR>—2 Sonorous, sounding; उत्कण्ठावर्धनैः शुभ्रं रवणैरम्बरं ततम् Bk. 7. 14.<BR>—3 Sharp, hot.<BR>—4 Fickle, unsteady.<BR>—5 Jesting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रवणः|रवण|रवणं
रवण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 a camel; स्वनाम निन्ये रवणः स्फुटार्थताम् Śi. 12. 2.<BR>—2 The cuckoo.<BR>—3 A bee.<BR>—4 Sound.<BR>—5 A big cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रवणम्
रवण + .{@-णम्@} Brass, bell-metal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रवणकः|रवणक
रवणकः A filter of bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रवथः|रवथ
रवथः (रु-अथः Uṇ. 3. 112) The Indian cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविः|रवि
रविः [cf. Uṇ. 4. 150]<BR>—1 The sun; सहस्रगुणमुत्स्रष्टुमादत्ते हि रसं रविः R. 1. 18.<BR>—2 A mountain.<BR>—3 The Arka plant.<BR>—4 The number ‘twelve’.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रवीष्टः, रविकान्तः, रविग्रावन्, रविचक्रम्, रविजः, रवितनयः, रविपुत्रः, रविसूनुः, रविदिनम्, रविवारः, रविवासरः, रविवासरम्, रविदीप्त, रविध्वजः, रविनेत्रः, रविप्रियम्, रविबिम्बः, रविमासकः, रविरत्नम्, रविलोचनः, रविलोहम्, रविसंज्ञकम्, रविवंशः, रविसंक्रान्तिः, रविसारथिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रवीष्टः|रवीष्ट
रविः + -इष्टः an orange.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविकान्तः|रविकान्त|रविकांत
रविः + -कान्तः, -ग्रावन् the sun-stone (सूर्यकान्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविग्रावन्
रविः + -कान्तः, -ग्रावन् the sun-stone (सूर्यकान्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविचक्रम्
रविः + -चक्रम् a particular astronomical diagram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविजः|रविज
रविः + -जः, -तनयः, -पुत्रः, -सूनुः<BR>—1 the planet Saturn.<BR>—2 epithets of Karṇa; रवितनयोऽभ्यहनच्छिनिप्रवीरम् Mb. 8. 30. 9.<BR>—3 of Vāli.<BR>—4 of Manu Vaivasvata.<BR>—5 of Yama.<BR>—6 of Sugrīva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रवितनयः|रवितनय
रविः + -जः, -तनयः, -पुत्रः, -सूनुः<BR>—1 the planet Saturn.<BR>—2 epithets of Karṇa; रवितनयोऽभ्यहनच्छिनिप्रवीरम् Mb. 8. 30. 9.<BR>—3 of Vāli.<BR>—4 of Manu Vaivasvata.<BR>—5 of Yama.<BR>—6 of Sugrīva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविपुत्रः|रविपुत्र
रविः + -जः, -तनयः, -पुत्रः, -सूनुः<BR>—1 the planet Saturn.<BR>—2 epithets of Karṇa; रवितनयोऽभ्यहनच्छिनिप्रवीरम् Mb. 8. 30. 9.<BR>—3 of Vāli.<BR>—4 of Manu Vaivasvata.<BR>—5 of Yama.<BR>—6 of Sugrīva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविसूनुः|रविसूनु
रविः + -जः, -तनयः, -पुत्रः, -सूनुः<BR>—1 the planet Saturn.<BR>—2 epithets of Karṇa; रवितनयोऽभ्यहनच्छिनिप्रवीरम् Mb. 8. 30. 9.<BR>—3 of Vāli.<BR>—4 of Manu Vaivasvata.<BR>—5 of Yama.<BR>—6 of Sugrīva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

