रविवासरम्
रविः + -दिनम्, -वारः, -वासरः, -वासरम् Sunday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविदीप्त
रविः + -दीप्त <i>a.</i> lighted by the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

