रविरत्नम्
रविः + -रत्नम् a ruby.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविलोचनः|रविलोचन
रविः + -लोचनः N. of<BR>—1 Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रविलोहम्
रविः + -लोहम्, -संज्ञकम् copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

