रविः + -संक्रान्तिः <i>f.</i> the sunʼs entrance into any zodiacal sign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

