रवीषुः The god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रशना
रशना, -रसना<BR> [अश्-युच् रशादेशः cf. अश्नुते जघनम् Uṇ. 2. 75]<BR>—1 A rope, cord.<BR>—2 A rein, bridle.<BR>—3 A zone, girdle, womanʼs girdle; तान् वीक्ष्य वातरशनांश्चतुरः कुमारान्<BR> Bhāg. 3. 15. 30; रसतु रसनापि तव घनजघनमण्डले घोषयतु मन्मथनिदेशम्<BR> Gīt. 10; R. 7. 10, 8. 58; Me. 37.<BR>—4 The tongue; वदने विनिवेशिता भुजङ्गी पिशुनानां रसनामिषेण धात्रा<BR> Bv. 1. 111; tongue as an organ of taste; रसनया भाव्यमाना मधुराम्लतिक्तकटुकषायलवणभेदाः<BR> षड्रसाः Bhāvanopaniṣad 2.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रशनोपमा, रशनागुणः, रशनापदम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसना
रशना, -रसना<BR> [अश्-युच् रशादेशः cf. अश्नुते जघनम् Uṇ. 2. 75]<BR>—1 A rope, cord.<BR>—2 A rein, bridle.<BR>—3 A zone, girdle, womanʼs girdle; तान् वीक्ष्य वातरशनांश्चतुरः कुमारान्<BR> Bhāg. 3. 15. 30; रसतु रसनापि तव घनजघनमण्डले घोषयतु मन्मथनिदेशम्<BR> Gīt. 10; R. 7. 10, 8. 58; Me. 37.<BR>—4 The tongue; वदने विनिवेशिता भुजङ्गी पिशुनानां रसनामिषेण धात्रा<BR> Bv. 1. 111; tongue as an organ of taste; रसनया भाव्यमाना मधुराम्लतिक्तकटुकषायलवणभेदाः<BR> षड्रसाः Bhāvanopaniṣad 2.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रशनोपमा, रशनागुणः, रशनापदम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रशनोपमा
रशना + -उपमा a variety of the figure उपमा; it is ‘a string or series’<BR> of comparisons, which consists in making the <i>Upameya</i> in the first<BR> comparison the <i>Upamāna</i> in the second, and so forth; see S. D. 664.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रशनागुणः|रशनागुण
रशना + -गुणः the cord of a girdle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रशनापदम्
रशना + -पदम् the hip.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रश्मिः|रश्मि
रश्मिः [अश्-मि धातो रुट्, रश्-मि वा; cf. Uṇ. 4. 46]<BR>—1 A string, cord, rope; अपतद्देवराजस्य मुक्तरश्मिरिव ध्वजः Rām. 4. 17. 2.<BR>—2 A bridle, rein; मुक्तेषु रश्मिषु निरायतपूर्वकायाः Ś. 1. 8; रश्मिसंयमनात्<BR> Ś. 1; Ki. 7. 19.<BR>—3 A goad, whip.<BR>—4 A beam, ray of light; ज्योतींषि वर्तयति च प्रविभक्तरश्मिः Ś. 7. 6;<BR> N. 22. 56; so हिमरश्मि &c.<BR>—5 An eyelash.<BR>—6 A measuring cord; परि यो रश्मिना दिवो Rv. 8. 25. 18.<BR>—7 A finger (Ved.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रश्मिकलापः, रश्मिकेतुः, रश्मिग्राहः, रश्मिमालिन्, रश्मिमुचः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रश्मिकलापः|रश्मिकलाप
रश्मिः + -कलापः a pearl-necklace of 54 threads.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रश्मिकेतुः|रश्मिकेतु
रश्मिः + -केतुः a particular comet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रश्मिग्राहः
रश्मिः + -ग्राहः a charioteer (सारथि); रश्मिग्राहश्च दाशार्हः सर्वलोकनमस्कृतः Mb. 8. 31. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रश्मिमालिन्
रश्मिः + -मालिन्, -मुचः the sun; अभिरश्मिमालि विमलस्य धृतजयधृतेरनाशुषः<BR> Ki. 12. 2; चण्डवातोद्धुतान् मेघान् निध्नन् रश्मिमुचो यथा Mb. 7. 153. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रश्मिमुचः|रश्मिमुच
रश्मिः + -मालिन्, -मुचः the sun; अभिरश्मिमालि विमलस्य धृतजयधृतेरनाशुषः<BR> Ki. 12. 2; चण्डवातोद्धुतान् मेघान् निध्नन् रश्मिमुचो यथा Mb. 7. 153. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1330-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रश्मिमत्|रश्मिमन्त्
रश्मिम(व)त् <i>m.</i> The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रश्मिवत्|रश्मिवन्त्
रश्मिम(व)त् <i>m.</i> The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रस्
रस् I. €1 P. (रसति, रसित)<BR>—1 To roar, yell, cry out, scream; करीव वन्यः परुषं ररास R. 16. 78;<BR> Śi. 3. 41.<BR>—2 To sound, make a noise, tinkle, jingle &c.; राजन्योपनिमन्त्रणाय<BR> रसति स्फीतं यशोदुन्दुभिः Ve. 1. 25; रसतां निर्भरं नूपुराणाम्<BR> Ratn. 1. 19; रसतु रसनापि तव घनजघनमण्डले Gīt. 10.<BR>—3 To resound, reverberate<BR>—4 To sing.<BR>—5 Ved. To praise. ━II. €10 U. (रसयति-ते, रसित)<BR>—1 To taste, relish; रसती रसना रसान् Mb. 12. 285. 19; मृद्वीका<BR> रसिता Bv. 4. 13; Śi. 10. 27; Mv. 7. 30.<BR>—2 To feel, perceive.<BR>—3 To love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसः|रस|रसं
रसः [रस्-अच्]<BR>—1 Sap, juice (of trees); इक्षुरसः, कुसुमरसः &c.<BR>—2 A liquid, fluid; यष्टव्यं पशुभिर्मुख्यैरथो बीजै रसैरिति Mb. 14. 91. 21;<BR> न्यस्ताक्षरा धातुरसेन यत्र Ku. 1. 7.<BR>—3 Water; सहस्रगुणमुत्स्रष्टुमादत्ते हि रसं रविः R. 1. 18; Bv. 2. 144.<BR>—4 Liquor, drink; Ms. 2. 177.<BR>—5 A draught, potion.<BR>—6 Taste, flavour, relish (fig. also) (considered in Vaiś. phil. as one<BR> of the 24 <i>gunas</i>; the <i>rasas</i> are six; कटु, अम्ल, मधुर,<BR> लवण, तिक्त and कषाय); परायत्तः प्रीतेः कथमिव रसं वेत्तु<BR> पुरुषः Mu. 3. 4; U. 2. 2.<BR>—7 A sauce, condiment.<BR>—8 An object of taste; मनो बबन्धान्यरसान् विलङ्घ्य सा R. 3. 4.<BR>—9 Taste or inclination for a thing, liking, desire; रसवर्जं रसोऽप्यस्य<BR> परं दृष्ट्वा निवर्तते Bg. 2. 59; इष्टे वस्तुन्युपचितरसाः प्रेमराशीभवन्ति Me. 114.<BR>—10 Love, affection; जरसा यस्मिन्नहार्यो रसः U. 1. 39; प्रसरति<BR> रसो निर्वृतिघनः 6. 11 ‘feeling of love’; रसादृते V. 2. 21; Ku. 3. 37.<BR>—11 Pleasure, delight, happiness; चिरात्सुतस्पर्शरसज्ञतां ययौ R. 3. 26.<BR>—12 Charm, interest, elegance, beauty.<BR>—13 Pathos, emotion, feeling.<BR>—14 (In poetic compositions) A sentiment; नवरसरुचिरां निर्मितिमादधती<BR> भारती कवेर्जयति K. P. 1. (The <i>rasas</i> are usually eight:−<BR> शृङ्गारहास्यकरुणरौद्रवीरभयानकाः । बीभत्साद्भुतसंज्ञौ चेत्यष्टौ नाट्ये<BR> रसाः स्मृताः ॥ but sometimes शान्तरस is added; thus making the<BR> total number 9; निर्वेदस्थायिभावोऽस्ति शान्तोऽपि नवमो रसः K. P. 4;<BR> sometimes a tenth, वात्सल्यरस, is also added. <i>Rasas</i> are<BR> more or less a necessary factor of every poetic composition, but, according<BR> to Viśvanātha, they constitute the very essence of poetry; वाक्यं<BR> रसात्मकं काव्यम् S. D. 3.).<BR>—15 Essence, pith, best part; ब्रह्म तेजोमयं शुक्रं यस्य सर्वमिदं रसः Mb. 12. 240. 9.<BR>—16 A constituent fluid of the body.<BR>—17 Semen virile.<BR>—18 Mercury.<BR>—19 A poison, poisonous drink; as in तीक्ष्णरसदायिनः; रसविधानकौशलैः Dk. 2. 8.<BR>—20 Any mineral metallic salt.<BR>—21 Juice of the sugar-cane.<BR>—22 Milk.<BR>—23 Melted butter.<BR>—24 Nectar; मयः कूपरसेऽक्षिपत् Bhāg. 7. 10. 59-60.<BR>—25 Soup, broth.<BR>—26 A symbolical expression for the number ‘six’.<BR>—27 Green onion.<BR>—28 Myrrh.<BR>—29 Gold.<BR>—30 A metal in a state of fusion.<BR>—31 See रसातल; अनेन नूनं वेदानां कूतमाहरणं रसात् Mb. 12. 347. 67.<BR>—32 The tongue (as the organ of taste); वाण्यां च छन्दांसि रसे जलेशम्<BR> Bhāg. 8. 20. 27; जितं सर्वं जिते रसे 11. 8. 21.<BR>—33 (With Vaiṣṇavas) Disposition of the heart or mind (the five Rasas<BR> are शान्ति,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">Page1331-2</a>]<BR> दास्य, साख्य, वात्सल्य and माधुर्य).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रसाग्रजम्, रसाञ्जनम्, रसाधिक, रसान्तरम्, रसाभिनिवेशः, रसाम्लः, रसायनम्, रसात्मक, रसादानम्, रसाधारः, रसाभासः, रसाश्रय, रसास्वादः, रसास्वादिन्, रसाह्वः, रसेक्षुः, रसेन्द्रः, रसोत्तमम्, रसोत्पत्तिः, रसोद्भवम्, रसोपलम्, रसोनम्, रसौदनम्, रसकर्पूरम्, रसकमन्, रसकेसरम्, रसक्रिया, रसगन्धः, रसगन्धम्, रसगन्धकः, रसगर्भम्, रसगुण, रसग्रह, रसघन, रसघ्नः, रसजः, रसजम्, रसजातम्, रसज्ञ, रसज्ञानम्, रसज्येष्ठः, रसतन्मात्रम्, रसतेजस्, रसदः, रसद्राविन्, रसधातु, रसधेनुः, रसनाथः, रसनायकः, रसनिवृत्तिः, रसनेत्रिका, रसपाकजः, रसपाचकः, रसप्रबन्धः, रसफलः, रसभङ्गः, रसभवम्, रसभस्मन्, रसभेदः, रसमलम्, रसमातृका, रसयोगः, रसराजः, रसलोहः, रसवादः, रसविक्रयः, रसविद्धम्, रसशास्त्रम्, रसशोधनः, रससरोरुहम्, रससिद्ध, रससिद्धिः, रससिन्दूरम्, रसस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसाग्रजम्
रसः + -अग्रजम् an ointment prepared from the calx of brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसाञ्जनम्
रसः + -अञ्जनम् vitriol of copper, a sort of collyrium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसाधिक|रसाधिकः
रसः + -अधिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 tasty.<BR>—2 abounding in pleasures, splendid; Ś. 7. 20 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसाधिकः|रसाधिक
रसः + -अधिक + .({@-कः@}) borax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसान्तरम्
रसः + -अन्तरम्<BR>—1 a different taste.<BR>—2 different feelings or sentiments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसाभिनिवेशः|रसाभिनिवेश
रसः + -अभिनिवेशः intentness of affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसाम्लः|रसाम्ल|रसाम्लं
रसः + -अम्लः<BR>—1 a kind of sorrel.<BR>—2 sour sauce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसायनम्
रसः + -अयनम्<BR>—1 an elixir of life (elixir vitae), any medicine supposed to prolong<BR> life and prevent old age; निखिलरसायनमहितो गन्धेनोग्रेण लशुन इव R. G.<BR>—2 (fig.) serving as an elixir vitae, <i>i. e.</i> that which gratifies or<BR> regales; आनन्दनानि हृदयैकरसायनानि Māl. 6. 8; मनसश्च रसायनानि<BR> U. 1. 37; श्रोत्र˚, कर्ण˚ &c.<BR>—3 alchemy or chemistry.<BR>—4 any medicinal compound.<BR>—5 butter-milk.<BR>—6 poison.<BR>—7 long pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसायनः|रसायन|रसायनं
रसः + -अयनम् + .({@-नः@})<BR>—1 an alchemist.<BR>—2 N. of Garuḍa. ˚श्रेष्ठः mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसायनी
रसः + -अयनम् + .({@-नी@} <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 a channel for the fluids of the body.<BR>—2 N. of several plants:− गुडूची, काकमाची, महाकरञ्ज, गोरक्षदुग्धा<BR> and मांसच्छदा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसात्मक
रसः + -आत्मक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 consisting of juice or sentiment.<BR>—2 elegant, beautiful.<BR>—3 having taste or flavour.<BR>—4 ambrosial; रसात्मकस्योडुपतेश्च रश्मयः Ku. 5. 22.<BR>—5 fluid, liquid, watery; सोमो भूत्वा रसात्मकः Bg. 15. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसादानम्
रसः + -आदानम् absorption of fluid, suction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसाधारः|रसाधार
रसः + -आधारः the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसाभासः|रसाभास
रसः + -आभासः<BR>—1 the semblance or mere appearance of a sentiment; अनौचित्यप्रवृत्तत्वे<BR> आभासो रसभावयोः S. D.<BR>—2 an improper manifestation of a sentiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसाश्रय
रसः + -आश्रय <i>a.</i> embodying or representing sentiments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसास्वादः|रसास्वाद
रसः + -आस्वादः<BR>—1 tasting juices or flavours.<BR>—2 perception or appreciation of poetic sentiments, a perception of poetical<BR> charm; as in काव्यामृतरसास्वादः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसास्वादिन्
रसः + -आस्वादिन् <i>m.</i> a bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसाह्वः|रसाह्व
रसः + -आह्वः turpentine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसेक्षुः|रसेक्षु
रसः + -इक्षुः sugar-cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसेन्द्रः|रसेन्द्र|रसेंद्र
रसः + -इन्द्रः<BR>—1 mercury.<BR>—2 the philosopherʼs stone (the touch of which is said to turn iron into<BR> gold); ˚वेधजम्, ˚संजातम् the gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसोत्तमम्
रसः + -उत्तमम् milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसोत्तमः|रसोत्तम
रसः + -उत्तमम् + .({@-मः@})<BR>—1 quicksilver. —2 quicksilver.<BR>—2 Phaseolus Mungo (Mar. मूग).<BR>—3 milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसोत्पत्तिः|रसोत्पत्ति
रसः + -उत्पत्तिः<BR>—1 production of taste.<BR>—2 development of passion or sentiment.<BR>—3 generation of the vital fluids.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसोद्भवम्
रसः + -उद्भवम्<BR>—1 a pearl.<BR>—2 vermilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसोपलम्
रसः + -उपलम् a pearl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसोनम्
रसः + -ऊनम् garlic; also ऊनकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसौदनम्
रसः + -ओदनम् rice boiled in meat-broth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसकर्पूरम्
रसः + -कर्पूरम् sublimate of mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसकमन्
रसः + -कमन् <i>n.</i> preparation of quicksilver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसकेसरम्
रसः + -केसरम् camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसक्रिया
रसः + -क्रिया the inspissation and application of fluid remedies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसगन्धः|रसगन्ध|रसगन्धं
रसः + -गन्धः, -गन्धम् gum-myrrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसगन्धम्
रसः + -गन्धः, -गन्धम् gum-myrrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसगन्धकः|रसगन्धक
रसः + -गन्धकः<BR>—1 myrrh.<BR>—2 sulphur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसगर्भम्
रसः + -गर्भम्<BR>—1 = रसाञ्जन.<BR>—2 vermilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसगुण
रसः + -गुण <i>a.</i> possessing the quality of taste; ज्योतिषश्च विकुर्वाणादापो<BR> रसगुणाः स्मृताः Ms. 1. 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसग्रह|रसग्रहः
रसः + -ग्रह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 perceiving flavours.<BR>—2 appreciating or enjoying pleasures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसग्रहः|रसग्रह
रसः + -ग्रह + .({@-हः@}) the organ of taste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसघन
रसः + -घन <i>a.</i> full of juice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसघ्नः|रसघ्न
रसः + -घ्नः borax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसजः|रसज|रसजं
रसः + -जः<BR>—1 sugar, molasses.<BR>—2 an insect produced by the fermentation of liquids.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसजम्
रसः + -जम् blood. ━<i>a.</i> bred in fluids; Ms. 11. 143.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसजातम्
रसः + -जातम् an ointment prepared from the calx of brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसज्ञ|रसज्ञः
रसः + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one who appreciates the flavour or excellence of, one who knows the<BR> taste of; सांसारिकेषु च सुखेषु वयं रसज्ञाः U. 2. 22.<BR>—2 capable of discerning the beauty of things.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसज्ञता
रसः + -ज्ञ + .({@रसज्ञता, -त्वम्@} means<BR>—1 poetical skill.<BR>—2 alchemy.<BR>—3 knowledge of flavours.<BR>—4 discrimination.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसज्ञत्वम्
{{27329.096}}<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसज्ञः|रसज्ञ
रसः + -ज्ञ + .({@-ज्ञः@})<BR>—1 a man of taste or feeling,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">Page1332-1</a>]<BR> a critic, an appreciative person, a poet.<BR>—2 an alchemist.<BR>—3 a physician, or one who prepares mercurial or other chemical compounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसज्ञा
रसः + -ज्ञ + .({@-ज्ञा@}) the tongue; साखि मा जल्प तवायसी रसज्ञा Bv. 2. 59;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1331-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसज्ञानम्
रसः + -ज्ञानम् a branch of medical science.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसज्येष्ठः|रसज्येष्ठ
रसः + -ज्येष्ठः<BR>—1 the sweet taste.<BR>—2 the love sentiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसतन्मात्रम्
रसः + -तन्मात्रम् the subtle element of taste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसतेजस्
रसः + -तेजस् <i>n.</i> blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसदः|रसद
रसः + -दः<BR>—1 a physician; Mb. 12. 121. 45.<BR>—2 a spy who administers poison; Kau. A. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसद्राविन्
रसः + -द्राविन् a kind of citron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसधातु|रसधातुः
रसः + -धातु <i>n.</i> quicksilver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसधेनुः|रसधेनु
रसः + -धेनुः a cow consisting of fruit-juice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसनाथः|रसनाथ
रसः + -नाथः mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसनायकः|रसनायक
रसः + -नायकः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसनिवृत्तिः|रसनिवृत्ति
रसः + -निवृत्तिः loss of taste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसनेत्रिका
रसः + -नेत्रिका red arsenic<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसपाकजः|रसपाकज
रसः + -पाकजः molasses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसपाचकः|रसपाचक
रसः + -पाचकः a cook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसप्रबन्धः|रसप्रबन्ध
रसः + -प्रबन्धः any poetical composition, particularly a drama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसफलः|रसफल
