रसवादः|रसवाद
रसः + -वादः alchemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसविक्रयः|रसविक्रय
रसः + -विक्रयः sale of liquors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसविद्धम्
रसः + -विद्धम् artificial gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसशास्त्रम्
रसः + -शास्त्रम् the science of alchemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1332-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रसशोधनः|रसशोधन|रसशोधनं
