राहुः + -ग्रसनम्, -ग्रासः, -दर्शनम्, -पीडा, -संस्पर्शः an eclipse (of<BR> the sun or moon).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">Page1341-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुच्छत्रम्
राहुः + -छत्रम् green ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुपीडा
राहुः + -पीडा an eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुभेदिन्
राहुः + -भेदिन् <i>m.</i> N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुरत्नम्
राहुः + -रत्नम् a kind of gem (= गोमेद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुशत्रुः|राहुशत्रु
राहुः + -शत्रुः the moon; राहुशत्रोः प्रियां पत्नीं … … ग्रहेणाभ्युदितेनैकां<BR> रोहिणीमिव पीडिताम् Rām. 2. 114. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुसूतकम्
राहुः + -सूतकम् ‘the birth of Rāhu’, <i>i. e.</i> an eclipse (of the sun<BR> or moon); Y. 1. 146; cf. Ms. 4. 110.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

राहुहन्
राहुः + -हन् <i>m.</i> N. of Kṛṣṇa; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रि
रि (for ऋषभ) The second note of the Indian Gamut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रि
रि I. €6 P. (रियति, रीण) To go, move. ━II. €5 P. (रिणोति)<BR> To hurt. ━III. €9 U. (रिणाति-ते)<BR>—1 To drive out, expel.<BR>—2 Ved. To separate.<BR>—3 To emit.<BR>—4 To give, grant.<BR>—5 To go, move.<BR>—6 To hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्त|रिक्तं
रिक्त <i>p. p.</i> [रिच्-क्त]<BR>—1 Emptied, cleared, evacuated; रिक्तः सर्वो भवति हि लघुः पूर्णता<BR> गौरवाय Me. 20.<BR>—2 Empty, void; devoid or deprived of, without; रिक्तभाण्डानि यत् किंचित्<BR> पुमांसश्चापरिच्छदाः Ms. 8. 405.<BR>—4 Hollowed (as hands).<BR>—5 Indigent, poor; हाहेति जल्पति जने सुकृतीव रिक्तः Bhāg. 9. 10. 23.<BR>—6 Divided, separated.<BR>—7 Worthless, useless.<BR>—8 Unloaded; see रिच्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्तम्
रिक्त + .{@-क्तम्@}<BR>—1 An empty space, vacuum.<BR>—2 A forest, desert, wilderness.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रिक्तार्कः, रिक्तपाणि, रिक्तहस्त, रिक्तमति<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्तार्कः|रिक्तार्क
रिक्त + -अर्कः a Sunday falling on one of the रिक्ता days.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्तपाणि
रिक्त + -पाणि, -हस्त <i>a.</i> empty-handed, bringing no present (of flowers<BR> &c.); रिक्तपाणिर्न पश्येत राजानं देवतां गुरुम् Subhāṣ.; अहमपि<BR> देवीं प्रेक्षितुमरिक्तपाणिर्भवामि M. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्तहस्त
रिक्त + -पाणि, -हस्त <i>a.</i> empty-handed, bringing no present (of flowers<BR> &c.); रिक्तपाणिर्न पश्येत राजानं देवतां गुरुम् Subhāṣ.; अहमपि<BR> देवीं प्रेक्षितुमरिक्तपाणिर्भवामि M. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्तमति
रिक्त + -मति <i>a.</i> empty-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्तक|रिक्तकं
रिक्तक <i>a.</i> See रिक्त; Ms. 8. 404.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्ता
रिक्ता N. of the fourth, ninth, and fourteenth days of a lunar fortnight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्तीकृ
रिक्तीकृ<BR>—1 To make empty.<BR>—2 To leave.<BR>—3 To take away; steal.<BR>—4 To recover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थम्
रिक्थम् [रिच्-थक् Uṇ. 2. 7]<BR>—1 Inheritance, bequest, property left at death; (in law) unobstructed<BR> property; विभजेरन् सुताः पित्रोरूर्ध्वं रिक्थमृणं समम् Y. 1. 117;<BR> Ms. 9. 104; ननु गर्भः पित्र्यं रिक्थमर्हति Ś. 6.<BR>—2 Property in general, wealth, possessions; बालदायादिकं रिक्थं तावद्<BR> राजानुपालयेत् Ms. 8. 27.<BR>—3 Gold.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रिक्थाद, रिक्थग्राह, रिक्थभागिन्, रिक्थहर, रिक्थजातम्, रिक्थविभागः, रिक्थहारिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थाद
रिक्थम् + -आद, -ग्राह, -भागिन्, -हर <i>a.</i> receiving an inheritance, inheriting<BR> property. ━(<i>m.</i>) an heir, a son; तं नारदः प्रियतमो रिक्थादानामनुव्रतः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 9. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थग्राह
रिक्थम् + -आद, -ग्राह, -भागिन्, -हर <i>a.</i> receiving an inheritance, inheriting<BR> property. ━(<i>m.</i>) an heir, a son; तं नारदः प्रियतमो रिक्थादानामनुव्रतः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 9. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थभागिन्
रिक्थम् + -आद, -ग्राह, -भागिन्, -हर <i>a.</i> receiving an inheritance, inheriting<BR> property. ━(<i>m.</i>) an heir, a son; तं नारदः प्रियतमो रिक्थादानामनुव्रतः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 9. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थहर
रिक्थम् + -आद, -ग्राह, -भागिन्, -हर <i>a.</i> receiving an inheritance, inheriting<BR> property. ━(<i>m.</i>) an heir, a son; तं नारदः प्रियतमो रिक्थादानामनुव्रतः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 9. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थजातम्
रिक्थम् + -जातम् the aggregate estate (of a deceased person).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थविभागः|रिक्थविभाग
रिक्थम् + -विभागः partition of property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थहारिन्
रिक्थम् + -हारिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an heir; किं रिक्थहारैः स्वजनाख्यदस्युभिः Bhāg. 8. 22. 9.<BR>—2 a maternal uncle.<BR>—3 the seed of the fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्थिन्
रिक्थिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Inheriting property.<BR>—2 Wealthy, rich. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 An heir.<BR>—2 A testator; Y.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्वन्
रिक्वन् <i>m.</i> Ved. A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिक्षा
रिक्षा<BR>—1 A nit (लिक्षा).<BR>—2 The mote in a sun-beam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिङ्ख्|रिंख्
रिङ्ख्, -रिङ्ग् (रिङ्खति, रिङ्गति)<BR>—1 To crawl, creep; यद्रिङ्गतान्तरगतेन दिविस्पृशोर्वा Bhāg. 2. 7. 27;<BR> जानुभ्यां सह<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">Page1342-1</a>]<BR> पाणिभ्यां रिङ्गमाणौ विजह्नतुः 10. 8. 21; जानुभ्यां रिङ्गतस्तस्य Śiva B. 7. 7.<BR>—2 To go slowly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिङ्ग्|रिंग्
रिङ्ख्, -रिङ्ग् (रिङ्खति, रिङ्गति)<BR>—1 To crawl, creep; यद्रिङ्गतान्तरगतेन दिविस्पृशोर्वा Bhāg. 2. 7. 27;<BR> जानुभ्यां सह<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">Page1342-1</a>]<BR> पाणिभ्यां रिङ्गमाणौ विजह्नतुः 10. 8. 21; जानुभ्यां रिङ्गतस्तस्य Śiva B. 7. 7.<BR>—2 To go slowly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1341-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिङ्खः|रिङ्ख
रिङ्खः, -रिङ्खा<BR>—1 Creeping, sliding.<BR>—2 Dancing.<BR>—3 One of a horseʼs paces.<BR>—4 A horseʼs hoof.<BR>—5 Deceiving, disappointing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिङ्खा|रिंखा
रिङ्खः, -रिङ्खा<BR>—1 Creeping, sliding.<BR>—2 Dancing.<BR>—3 One of a horseʼs paces.<BR>—4 A horseʼs hoof.<BR>—5 Deceiving, disappointing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिङ्खणम्
रिङ्खणम्, -रिङ्गणम्<BR>—1 Crawling, creeping (of children who creep on all fours).<BR>—2 Deviating (from rectitude), swerving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिङ्गणम्
रिङ्खणम्, -रिङ्गणम्<BR>—1 Crawling, creeping (of children who creep on all fours).<BR>—2 Deviating (from rectitude), swerving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिङ्गिः|रिङ्गि|रिंगिः
रिङ्गिः <i>f.</i> Going, moving, creeping; सुरेतसादः पुनराविश्य<BR> चष्टे हंसं गृध्राणं नृषद्रिंगिरामिमः Bhāg. 5. 7. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिङ्गितम्
रिङ्गितम् Motion, surging (of waves).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिच्
रिच् I. €7 U. (रिणाक्ति, रिङ्क्ते, रिक्त)<BR>—1 To empty, evacuate, clear, purge; रिणच्मि जलधेस्तोयम् Bk. 6. 36;<BR> आविर्भूते शशिनि तमसा रिच्यमानेव रात्रिः V. 1. 8; तिमिररिच्यमानं<BR> पूर्वदिङ्मुखमालोकसुभगं दृश्यते V. 3.<BR>—2 To deprive of, make destitute of.<BR>—3 To separate, divide.<BR>—4 To give or deliver up, part with.<BR>—5 To bequeath (usually in <i>p. p.</i>, see रिक्त). ━II. €1. €10 P. (रेचति,<BR> रेचयति, रेचित)<BR>—1 To divide, separate, disjoin.<BR>—2 To abandon, leave.<BR>—3 To join, mix. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To evacuate, make empty.<BR>—2 To discharge, emit (as breath).<BR>—3 To leave, abandon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिज्
रिज् €1 Ā. (रेजते) To fry, parch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिटिः|रिटि
रिटिः<BR>—1 The crackling of flames.<BR>—2 Black salt.<BR>—3 A musical instrument.<BR>—4 N. of an attendant of Śiva; cf. भृङ्ग(गे)रिटिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिण्व्
रिण्व् €1 P. (रिण्वति) To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिधमः|रिधम
रिधमः<BR>—1 Spring.<BR>—2 Love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिपुः|रिपु
रिपुः [रप् उन् पृषो˚ Uṇ. 1. 26]<BR>—1 An enemy, a foe, an opponent.<BR>—2 A hostile planet.<BR>—3 N. of the sixth astrological house.<BR>—4 Ved. A cheat, rogue.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रिपुकालः, रिपुघातिन्, रिपुघ्न, रिपुजय, रिपुनिपातिन्, रिपुसूदन, रिपुभवनम्, रिपुस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

