रिपुभवनम्
रिपुः + -भवनम्, -स्थानम् N. of the 6th astrological house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

