रिप्रम्
रिप्र + .{@-प्रम्@}<BR>—1 Sin.<BR>—2 Dirt, impurity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिफ्
रिफ् €6 P. (रिफति, रिफित)<BR>—1 To utter a rough grating sound.<BR>—2 To revile, blame.<BR>—3 To speak, say.<BR>—4 To boast.<BR>—5 To give.<BR>—6 To fight.<BR>—7 To hurt, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिभ्
रिभ् €1 Ā. (रेभते)<BR>—1 To crackle, creak.<BR>—2 To murmur (as a stream &c.).<BR>—3 To sound in general.<BR>—4 To chatter.<BR>—5 Ved. To praise, worship.<BR>—6 To shout with joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिभ्वन्
रिभ्वन् <i>m.</i> Ved. A thief; Naigh. 3. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिम्फ्|रिंफ्
