रिरंसा<BR>—1 Desire to be pleased or to sport.<BR>—2 Desire of pleasure or sexual union, lustfulness, libidinousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

