रिशः A foe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिश्यः|रिश्य
रिश्यः (-ष्यः)<BR> A kind of antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्यः|रिष्य
रिश्यः (-ष्यः)<BR> A kind of antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्
रिष् €1. €4 P. (रेषति, रिष्यति, रिष्ट)<BR>—1 To injure, hurt, harm; तस्येहार्थो न रिष्यते Mb.; तेन यायात्<BR> सतां मार्गं तेन गच्छन् न रिष्यते Ms. 4. 178.<BR>—2 To kill or destroy; रेष्टारं रेषितं व्यास्यत् Bk. 9. 31.<BR>—3 To give offence.<BR>—4 To perish, be injured (€4 P.).<BR>—5 To meet with a reverse or misfortune.<BR>—6 To fail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्
रिष् <i>f.</i> An injury, hurt, harm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष
रिष <i>a.</i> Injuring, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिषण्यति
रिषण्यति Den. P. Ved.<BR>—1 To injure, harm.<BR>—2 To reject.<BR>—3 To fail, miscarry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्ट|रिष्टं|रिष्टः
रिष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Injured, hurt.<BR>—2 Unlucky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्टम्
रिष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@}<BR>—1 Mischief, injury, harm.<BR>—2 Misfortune, ill-luck.<BR>—3 Destruction, loss.<BR>—4 Sin.<BR>—5 Good luck, prosperity.<BR>—6 Welfare (क्षेम); शान्तिरिष्टेन पोषयेत् Mb. 13. 9. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्टः|रिष्ट|रिष्टं
रिष्ट + .{@-ष्टः@}<BR>—1 A sword.<BR>—2 The soap plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्टिः|रिष्टि
रिष्टिः <i>f.</i> [रिषेः तिः Uṇ. 4. 191] See रिष्टम् above; Bṛ. Up. 1. 4. 16.<BR>━<i>m.</i> A sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिष्व|रिष्वः
रिष्व <i>a.</i> Injurious, hurtful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिषिः|रिषि
रिषिः <i>m.</i> (= ऋषिः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिह्
रिह् €1 P. (रेहति)<BR>—1 To hurt, kill; see रिफ्.<BR>—2 Ved. A form of लिह् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिहायस्
रिहायस्, -रिह्वन् <i>m.</i> Ved.<BR> A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रिह्वन्
रिहायस्, -रिह्वन् <i>m.</i> Ved.<BR> A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

री
री I. €4 Ā. (रीयते) To trickle, drip, distil, ooze, flow.<BR>━II. €9 U. (रिणाति, रिणीते, रीण; <i>caus.</i> रेपयति-ते)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To hurt, injure, kill.<BR>—3 To howl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीण|रीणं
रीण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Oozed, flowed, dripped &c.<BR>—2 Vanished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीज्या
रीज्या<BR>—1 Censure, reproach, blame.<BR>—2 Shame, modesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीठा
रीठा A species of करञ्ज.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीढकः|रीढक
रीढकः The back-bone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीढा
रीढा Disrespect, contempt, irreverence; गुरुरीढावलीढः प्रागभूत्<BR> N. 17. 111, 128.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीतिः|रीति
रीतिः <i>f.</i> [री-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Moving, flowing.<BR>—2 Motion, course.<BR>—3 A stream, river.<BR>—4 A line, boundary.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">Page1343-1</a>]<BR>—5 A method, mode, manner, way, fashion, course, general way; रीतिं गिराममृतवृष्टिकरीं<BR> तदीयाम् Bv. 3. 19; पुत्रादपि धनभाजां भीतिः सर्वत्रैषा विहिता रीतिः<BR> Moha M. 2; उक्तरीत्या, अनयैव रीत्या &c.<BR>—6 Usage, custom, practice.<BR>—7 Style, diction; पदसंघटना रीतिरङ्गसंस्थाविशेषवत् । उपकत्रीं<BR> रसादीनां सा पुनः स्याच्चतुर्विधा ॥ वैदभीं चाथ गौडी च पाञ्चाली लाटिका<BR> तथा । S. D. 624-5.<BR>—8 Brass, bell-metal; (रीती also in this sense).<BR>—9 Rust of iron.<BR>—10 The oxide formed on the surface of metals.<BR>—11 Calx of brass.<BR>—12 Natural property or disposition.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रीतिकुसुमम्, रीतिजम्, रीतिपुष्पम्, रीतिबद्ध<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1342-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीतिकुसुमम्
रीतिः + -कुसुमम्, -जम्, -पुष्पम् calx of brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीतिजम्
रीतिः + -कुसुमम्, -जम्, -पुष्पम् calx of brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

