रीतिबद्ध
रीतिः + -बद्ध <i>a.</i> inlaid with brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीतिकम्
रीतिकम् Calx of brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीतिका
रीतिकम् + .{@-का@} Brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीतीभूत
रीतीभूत <i>a.</i> Being or standing in a line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रीव्
रीव् €1 U. (रीवति-ते)<BR>—1 To take.<BR>—2 To cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रु|रुः
रु I. €2 P. (रौति, रवीति, रुत) —1 To cry, howl, scream, yell,<BR> shout, roar; to hum (as bees); to sound in general; कर्णे कलं किमपि<BR> रौति शनैर्विचित्रम् H. 1. 81; Bk. 3. 17, 12. 72, 14. 21. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> To make sound; यस्माल्लोकत्रयं चैतद् रावितं भयमागतम् Rām. 7. 16. 37.<BR>━II. €1 Ā. (रवते)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To hurt, kill.<BR>—3 Ved. To break to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुः|रु
रुः<BR>—1 Sound, noise.<BR>—2 Fear, alarm.<BR>—3 War, battle.<BR>—4 Cutting, dividing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुत|रुतं
रुत <i>p. p.</i> [रु-क्त]<BR>—1 Sounded.<BR>—2 Broken to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुतम्
रुत + .{@-तम्@} A cry, yell, roar, sound or noise in general; neigh (of horses),<BR> note (of birds), humming (of bees); पक्षि˚, हंस˚, कोकिल˚, अलि˚; समदशिखिरुतानि<BR> Ki. 10. 25; आमत्तकोकिलरुतव्यथिता Māl. 8. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रुतज्ञः, रुतव्याजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुतज्ञः|रुतज्ञ
रुत + -ज्ञः an augur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुतव्याजः|रुतव्याज
रुत + -व्याजः<BR>—1 simulated cry.<BR>—2 mimicry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक|रुकः
रुक <i>a.</i> Liberal, bountiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्म|रुक्मं|रुक्मः
रुक्म <i>a.</i> [रुच्-मन् नि˚ कुत्वम् Uṇ. 1. 135]<BR>—1 Bright, radiant.<BR>—2 Golden; गरुडो रुक्मपक्षो वै Rām. 1. 14. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्मः|रुक्म|रुक्मं
रुक्म + .{@-क्मः@}<BR>—1 A golden ornament; परितश्च धौतमुखरुक्मविलसत् Śi. 15. 78.<BR>—2 A thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्मम्
रुक्म + .{@-क्मम्@}<BR>—1 Gold; निक्षेपस्यापहरणं … … रुक्मस्तेयसमं स्मृतम् Ms. 11. 57.<BR>—2 Iron.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रुक्माङ्गद, रुक्माभ, रुक्मकारकः, रुक्मपात्री, रुक्मपुङ्ख, रुक्मपृष्ठक, रुक्मरथः, रुक्मवाहनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्माङ्गद|रुक्माङ्गदः
रुक्म + -अङ्गद <i>a.</i> wearing golden armlets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्माभ
रुक्म + -आभ <i>a.</i> shining like gold, bright; Ms. 12. 122.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्मकारकः|रुक्मकारक
रुक्म + -कारकः a goldsmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्मपात्री
रुक्म + -पात्री a golden dish; भुञ्जते रुक्मपात्रीषु युधिष्ठिरनिवेशने<BR> Mb. 3. 233. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्मपुङ्ख
रुक्म + -पुङ्ख <i>a.</i> gold-shafted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्मपृष्ठक
रुक्म + -पृष्ठक <i>a.</i> gilded, coated with gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्मरथः|रुक्मरथ
रुक्म + -रथः, -वाहनः N. of Droṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्मवाहनः|रुक्मवाहन
रुक्म + -रथः, -वाहनः N. of Droṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्मिन्
रुक्मिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wearing golden ornaments.<BR>—2 Gilded. ━<i>m.</i> N. of the eldest son of Bhīṣmaka and brother of Rukmiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्मिणी
रुक्मिणी The daughter of Bhīṣmaka of Vidarbha. [She was betrothed<BR> by her father to Śiśupāla, but she secretly loved Kṛṣṇa and sent<BR> him a letter praying him to take her away. Kṛṣṇa with Balarāma came<BR> and snatched her off after having defeated her<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">Page1343-2</a>]<BR> brother in battle. She bore to Kṛṣṇa a son named Pradyumna.].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्ष|रुक्षः
रुक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Ved. Shining, brilliant.<BR>—2 = रूक्ष q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुग्ण
रुग्ण <i>p. p.</i> [रुज्-क्त]<BR>—1 Broken, shattered; करिरुग्णचन्दनरसारुणं पयः Ki. 12. 49.<BR>—2 Thwarted.<BR>—3 Bent, curved.<BR>—4 Injured, hurt; पदं विष्णोर्भ्राम्यद् भुजपरिघरुग्णग्रहगणम् Śivamahimna 16.<BR>—5 Diseased, sick; (see रुज्).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रुग्णरय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुग्णरय
रुग्ण + -रय <i>a.</i> checked in an onset, foiled in an attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुच्
रुच् €1 Ā. (रोचते, रुरुचे, अरुचत्-अरोचिष्ट, रोचिष्यते, रुचित)<BR>—1 To shine, look splendid or beautiful, be resplendent; रुरुचिरे रुचिरेक्षणविभ्रमाः<BR> Śi. 6. 46; Ms. 3. 62.<BR>—2 To like, be pleased with (said of persons), be agreeable to, please<BR> (of things); used with dat. of the person who is pleased and nom. of the<BR> thing; न स्रजो रुरुचिरे रमणीभ्यः Ki. 9. 35; यदेव रोचते यस्मै<BR> भवेत् तत् तस्य सुन्दरम् H. 2. 53; sometimes with gen. of person; दारिद्यान्मरणाद्<BR> वा मरणं मम रोचते न दारिद्र्यम् Mk. 1. 11. ━<i>Caus.</i> (रोचयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to like, make pleasant or agreeable; यतात्मने रोचयितुं<BR> यतस्व Ku. 3. 16.<BR>—2 To illuminate, irradiate.<BR>—3 To like, find pleasure in.<BR>—4 To resolve. ━<i>Desid.</i> (रुरु(रो)चिषते) To wish to like &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुच्
रुच्, रुचा <i>f.</i> [रुच्-क्विप् वा टाप्]<BR>—1 Light, lustre, brightness; क्षणदासु यत्र च रुचैकतां गताः Śi. 13. 53, 9. 23, 25;<BR> शिखरमणिरुचः Ki. 5. 43; Me. 46.<BR>—2 Splendour, loveliness, beauty.<BR>—3 Colour, appearance (at the end of comp.); चलयन्मृङ्गरुचस्तवालकान्<BR> R. 8. 53; Ku. 3. 65; Ś. 1. 15; Ki. 5. 45.<BR>—4 Liking, desire.<BR>—5 Lightning.<BR>—6 The note of the parrot or Mainā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचा
रुच्, रुचा <i>f.</i> [रुच्-क्विप् वा टाप्]<BR>—1 Light, lustre, brightness; क्षणदासु यत्र च रुचैकतां गताः Śi. 13. 53, 9. 23, 25;<BR> शिखरमणिरुचः Ki. 5. 43; Me. 46.<BR>—2 Splendour, loveliness, beauty.<BR>—3 Colour, appearance (at the end of comp.); चलयन्मृङ्गरुचस्तवालकान्<BR> R. 8. 53; Ku. 3. 65; Ś. 1. 15; Ki. 5. 45.<BR>—4 Liking, desire.<BR>—5 Lightning.<BR>—6 The note of the parrot or Mainā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचक|रुचकं|रुचकः
रुचक <i>a.</i> [रुच्-क्वुन् Uṇ. 2. 36]<BR>—1 Agreeable, pleasing.<BR>—2 Stomachic.<BR>—3 Sharp, acrid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचकः|रुचक|रुचकं
रुचक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 The citron; पूर्णान्यक्षतपात्राणि रुचकं रोचनास्तथा Mb. 7. 82. 21.<BR>—2 A pigeon.<BR>—3 A type of column with four rectangular sides; समचतुरस्रो रुचकः<BR> Bṛ. S. 5. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचकम्
रुचक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A tooth.<BR>—2 A golden ornament especially for the neck.<BR>—3 A tonic, stomachic.<BR>—4 A wreath, garland.<BR>—5 Sochal salt.<BR>—6 A curl on a horseʼs neck.<BR>—7 A lucky object.<BR>—8 A building having terraces on three sides and closed on the north only.<BR>—9 Alkali.<BR>—10 A stone for grinding sandalwood; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचा
रुचा See रुच्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिः|रुचि
रुचिः (-ची <i>f.</i>)<BR> [रुच्-कि वा ङीप्]<BR>—1 Light, lustre, splendour, brightness; वियद्व्यापी तारागणगुणितफेनोद्गमरुचिः<BR> Śivamahimna 17; रुचिमिन्दुदले करोत्यजः परिपूर्णेन्दुरुचिर्महीपतिः<BR> Śi. 16. 71; R. 5. 67; Me. 15.<BR>—2 A ray of light; as in रुचिभर्तृ q. v.<BR>—3 Appearance, colour, beauty (usually at the end of comp.); पटलं<BR> बहिर्बहलपङ्करुचि Śi. 9. 19; सिन्दूरैः कृतरुचयः सहेमकक्ष्याः Ki. 7. 8.<BR>—4 Taste, relish; as in रुचिकर.<BR>—5 Zest, hunger, appetite.<BR>—6 Wish, desire, pleasure; स्वरुच्या ‘at will or pleasure’.<BR>—7 Liking, taste; विमार्गगायाश्च रुचिः स्वकान्ते Bv. 1. 125 ‘liking or love’;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">Page1344-1</a>]<BR> न स क्षितीशो रुचये बभूव; R. 6. 44; भिन्नरुचिर्हि लोकः 30;<BR> नाठ्यं भिन्नरुचेर्जनस्य बहुधाप्येकं समाराधनम् M. 1. 4; oft. in<BR> comp. in the sense of ‘indulging in’, ‘devoted or addicted to’; हिंसारुचेः<BR> Māl. 5. 29; अर्थरुचेः Mu. 1.<BR>—8 Passion, close application to any object.<BR>—9 A kind of yellow pigment (गोरोचना).<BR>—10 A kind of coitus. ━<i>m.</i> N. of a प्रजापति; जातो रुचेरजनयतसुयमान्<BR> सुयज्ञः Bhāg. 2. 7. 2.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रुचिकर, रुचिधामन्, रुचिप्रद, रुचिफलम्, रुचिभर्तृ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1343-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिकर
रुचिः + -कर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 tasteful, savoury, palatable.<BR>—2 exciting desire; रुचिकरमपि नार्थवद् बभूव Ki. 10. 62.<BR>—3 stomachic, tonic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिधामन्
रुचिः + -धामन् <i>m.</i> the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिप्रद
रुचिः + -प्रद <i>a.</i> appetizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिफलम्
रुचिः + -फलम् a pear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिभर्तृ
रुचिः + -भर्तृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 the sun; रुचिभर्तुरस्य विरहाधिगमात् Śi. 9. 17.<BR>—2 a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचित|रुचितं
रुचित [रुच्-कितच् Uṇ. 4. 193] <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Bright, shining.<BR>—2 Sweet, dainty.<BR>—3 Pleased, delighted.<BR>—4 Digested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचितम्
रुचित + .{@-तम्@} an exclamation of satisfaction (used at a श्राद्ध); दैवे<BR> रुचितमित्यपि (वाच्यम्) Ms. 3. 254.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिर|रुचिरं
रुचिर <i>a.</i> [रुचिं राति ददाति रुच्-किरच् Uṇ. 1. 50]<BR>—1 Bright, shining, brilliant, radiant; हेमरुचिराम्बर C. P. 14; कनकरुचिरम्,<BR> रत्नरुचिरम् &c.<BR>—2 Tasteful, palatable.<BR>—3 Sweet, dainty.<BR>—4 Stomachic, exciting appetite.<BR>—5 Cordial, restorative.<BR>—6 Pleasant, pleased (प्रसन्न); अथ वासवस्य वचनेन रुचिरवदनस्त्रिलोचनम् Ki. 12. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिरा
रुचिर + .{@-रा@}<BR>—1 A kind of yellow pigment.<BR>—2 N. of a metre; see App.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिरम्
रुचिर + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Saffron.<BR>—2 Cloves.<BR>—3 A radish.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रुचिराङ्गदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिराङ्गदः|रुचिराङ्गद
रुचिर + -अङ्गदः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिष्य|रुचिष्यं
रुचिष्य [रुच्-किष्यन् Uṇ. 4. 186] <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Pleasing, agreeable.<BR>—2 Tonic.<BR>—3 Sweet, dainty.<BR>—4 Appetizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुचिष्यम्
रुचिष्य + .{@-ष्यम्@} White salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुच्य|रुच्यं|रुच्यः
रुच्य <i>a.</i> Bright, lovely &c.; see रुचिर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुच्यः|रुच्य|रुच्यं
रुच्य + .{@-च्यः@}<BR>—1 A lover, husband.<BR>—2 Rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुच्यम्
रुच्य + .{@-च्यम्@}<BR>—1 A tonic.<BR>—2 Sochal salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुज्
रुज् I. €6 P. (रुजति, रुग्ण)<BR>—1 To break to pieces, destroy; वायुरुग्णान् R. 9. 63; शैलरुग्णमतङ्गजः 12. 73;<BR> Bk. 4. 42.<BR>—2 To pain, injure, disorder, afflict with disease, (sometimes with gen.);<BR> रावणस्येह रोक्ष्यन्ति कपयो भीमविक्रमाः Bk. 8. 120.<BR>—3 To bend. ━II. €10 U. (रोजयति-ते) To hurt, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुज्
रुज्, रुजा <i>f.</i> [रुज्-क्विप् वा टाप्]<BR>—1 Breaking, fracture.<BR>—2 Pain, torment, pang, anguish; अनिशमपि मकरकेतुर्मनसो रुजमावहन्नभिमतो<BR> मे Ś. 3. 4; क्व रुजा हृदयप्रमाथिनी M. 3. 2; चरणं रुजापरीतम् 4. 3.<BR>—3 Sickness, malady, disease; इत्यदर्शितरुजोऽस्य मन्त्रिणः R. 19. 52.<BR>—4 Fatigue, toil, effort, trouble.<BR>—5 A ewe.<BR>—6 Leprosy.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रुक्कर, रुक्प्रतिक्रिया, रुग्भेषजम्, रुक्सद्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुजा
रुज्, रुजा <i>f.</i> [रुज्-क्विप् वा टाप्]<BR>—1 Breaking, fracture.<BR>—2 Pain, torment, pang, anguish; अनिशमपि मकरकेतुर्मनसो रुजमावहन्नभिमतो<BR> मे Ś. 3. 4; क्व रुजा हृदयप्रमाथिनी M. 3. 2; चरणं रुजापरीतम् 4. 3.<BR>—3 Sickness, malady, disease; इत्यदर्शितरुजोऽस्य मन्त्रिणः R. 19. 52.<BR>—4 Fatigue, toil, effort, trouble.<BR>—5 A ewe.<BR>—6 Leprosy.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रुक्कर, रुक्प्रतिक्रिया, रुग्भेषजम्, रुक्सद्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्कर|रुक्करः
रुज् + -कर <i>a.</i> causing pain, sickening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्करः|रुक्कर
रुज् + -कर + .({@-रः@}) a disease, sickness, illness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुजःकृत्या
रुज् + -कर + .({@-रः@}) + ({@-जः कृत्या@}<BR> trouble; ब्राह्मणस्य रुजःकृत्या घ्रातिरघ्रेयमद्ययोः Ms. 11. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्प्रतिक्रिया
रुज् + -प्रतिक्रिया counteraction or treatment of disease, curing, practice of medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुग्भेषजम्
रुज् + -भेषजम् a medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्सद्मन्
रुज् + -सद्मन् <i>n.</i> feces, excrement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुजायते
रुजायते Den. Ā.<BR>—1 To be sick or ill.<BR>—2 To ache, be pained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुट्
रुट् I. €1 Ā. (रोटते)<BR>—1 To strike against, resist.<BR>—2 To shine.<BR>—3 To suffer pain. ━II. €10 U. (रोटयति-ते)<BR>—1 To obstruct, resist.<BR>—2 To shine.<BR>—3 To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुठ्
रुठ् I. €1 P. (रोठति) To strike, strike down. ━II. €1 Ā. (रोठते)<BR>—1 To resist, oppose.<BR>—2 To torment, pain.<BR>—3 To suffer pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुणस्करा
रुणस्करा A cow easily milked, a gentle cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुण्ट्|रुंट्
रुण्ट् €1 P. (रुण्टति) To rob, steal; cf. लुण्ट्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुण्ठ्|रुंठ्
रुण्ठ् €1 P. (रुण्ठति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To steal.<BR>—3 To be lame.<BR>—4 To be idle.<BR>—5 To oppose, resist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुण्ड|रुंड|रुण्डः
रुण्ड [Uṇ. 1. 108] <i>a.</i> Maimed, mutilated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुण्डः|रुण्ड|रुंड
रुण्ड + .{@-ण्डः, -ण्डम्@} A headless body, trunk; वेल्लद्भैरवरुण्डमुण्डनिकरैर्वीरो<BR> विधत्ते भुवम् U. 5. 6; Māl. 3. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुण्डम्
रुण्ड + .{@-ण्डः, -ण्डम्@} A headless body, trunk; वेल्लद्भैरवरुण्डमुण्डनिकरैर्वीरो<BR> विधत्ते भुवम् U. 5. 6; Māl. 3. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुण्डः|रुण्ड|रुंड
रुण्ड + .{@-ण्डः@} the offspring of a mule and a mare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुण्डिका|रुंडिका
रुण्डिका<BR>—1 A field of battle.<BR>—2 A female messenger or go-between.<BR>—3 The threshold of a door.<BR>—4 Superhuman power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्
रुद् €2 P. (रोदिति, रुदित; <i>desid.</i> रुरुदिषति)<BR>—1 To cry, weep, lament, mourn, shed tears; निराधारो हा रोदिमि कथय<BR> केषामिह पुरः G. L. 4; अपि ग्रावा रोदित्यपि दलति वज्रस्य हृदयम् U. 1. 28.<BR>—2 To howl, roar, scream. ━<i>With</i> {@प्र@} to weep bitterly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्
रुद् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A cry, wail.<BR>—2 Sound, noise.<BR>—3 Grief, pain, affliction.<BR>—4 Disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुदथः|रुदथ
रुदथः<BR>—1 A child.<BR>—2 A dog.<BR>—3 A cock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुदनम्
रुदनम्, रुदितम् Weeping, crying, wailing, lamentation; अत्यन्तमासीद्<BR> रुदितं वनेऽपि R. 14. 69, 70; Me. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुदितम्
रुदनम्, रुदितम् Weeping, crying, wailing, lamentation; अत्यन्तमासीद्<BR> रुदितं वनेऽपि R. 14. 69, 70; Me. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्र|रुद्रः
रुद्र <i>a.</i> [रोदिति रुद्-रक् Uṇ. 2. 22]<BR>—1 Dreadful, terrific, frightful, formidable.<BR>—2 Great, large.<BR>—3 Driving away evil.<BR>—4 Praiseworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रः|रुद्र
रुद्र + .{@-द्रः@}<BR>—1 N. of a group of gods, eleven in number, supposed to be inferior manifestations<BR> of Śiva or Śaṃkara, who is said to be the head of the group; रुद्राणां<BR> शंकरश्चास्मि Bg. 10. 23; रुद्राणामपि मूर्धानः क्षतहुंकारशंसिनः Ku. 2. 26.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR>—3 Fire.<BR>—4 The number ‘eleven’.<BR>—5 (pl.) प्राणs and इन्द्रियs; Mb. 12. 316. 5 (com.).<BR>—6 N. for the hymns addressed to Rudra.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रुद्राक्षः, रुद्रारिः, रुद्राक्रीडः, रुद्रावासः, रुद्रगर्भः, रुद्रजः, रुद्रदर्शन, रुद्रपत्नी, रुद्रप्रयागः, रुद्रप्रिया, रुद्रभूः, रुद्रयामलम्, रुद्ररोदनम्, रुद्रवीणा, रुद्रसखः, रुद्रसंमित, रुद्रसावर्णिः, रुद्रसूः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्राक्षः|रुद्राक्ष|रुद्राक्षं
रुद्र + -अक्षः a kind of tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्राक्षम्
रुद्र + -अक्षः + .({@-क्षम्@})<BR>—1 a rosary.<BR>—2 the berry of this tree, used for rosaries; भस्मोद्धूलन भद्रमस्तु<BR> भवते रुद्राक्षमाले शुभम् K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रारिः|रुद्रारि
रुद्र + -अरिः the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्राक्रीडः|रुद्राक्रीड
रुद्र + -आक्रीडः a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रावासः|रुद्रावास
रुद्र + -आवासः<BR>—1 ‘the abode of Rudra’, the mountain Kailāsa.<BR>—2 N. of Benares.<BR>—3 a cemetery; cf. पितृसद्मगोचरः Ku. 5. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रगर्भः|रुद्रगर्भ
रुद्र + -गर्भः N. of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रजः|रुद्रज
रुद्र + -जः quicksilver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रदर्शन
रुद्र + -दर्शन <i>a.</i> terrific.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रपत्नी
रुद्र + -पत्नी<BR>—1 the goddess Durgā.<BR>—2 linseed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रप्रयागः|रुद्रप्रयाग
रुद्र + -प्रयागः the sacred place where the मन्दाकिनी joins the गङ्गा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रप्रिया
रुद्र + -प्रिया<BR>—1 Pārvatī.<BR>—2 The yellow myrobalan tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रभूः
रुद्र + -भूः <i>f.</i> a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रयामलम्
रुद्र + -यामलम् N. of a Tantra (a dialogue between भैरव and भैरवी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्ररोदनम्
रुद्र + -रोदनम् gold; यत्सेवयाग्नेरिव रुद्ररोदनम् Bhāg. 8. 24. 48.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">Page1345-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1344-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रवीणा
रुद्र + -वीणा a kind of lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रसखः|रुद्रसख
रुद्र + -सखः N. of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रसंमित|रुद्रसम्मित
रुद्र + -संमित <i>a.</i> equal to eleven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रसावर्णिः|रुद्रसावर्णि
रुद्र + -सावर्णिः N. of the 12th Manu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रसूः
रुद्र + -सूः <i>f.</i> a mother giving birth to eleven children.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रटः|रुद्रट
रुद्रटः N. of a writer on rhetoric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्राणी
रुद्राणी<BR>—1 ‘The wife of Rudra’, N. of Pārvatī; रुद्राण्या भगवान् रुद्रो ददर्श<BR> स्वगणैर्वृतः Bhāg. 12. 10. 3.<BR>—2 Epithet of a girl 11 years old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रिय
रुद्रिय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Belonging to or coming from Rudra.<BR>—2 Fearful, dreadful.<BR>—3 Ved. Uttering praise or giving pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्रियम्
रुद्रिय + .{@-यम्@} Pleasure, delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्री
रुद्री (= रुद्रवीणा above); L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुध्
रुध् I. €7 U. (रुणद्धि, रुन्द्धे, रुरोध, रुरुधे, अरुधत्-अरौत्सीत्-अरुद्ध,<BR> रोत्स्यति-ते, रोद्धुम्, रुद्ध; <i>desid.</i> रुरुत्सति-ते)<BR>—1 To obstruct, stop, arrest, check, oppose, hinder; impede, prevent;<BR> इदं रुणद्धि मां पद्ममन्तःकूजितषट्पदम् V. 4. 21; रुद्धालोके नरपतिपथे<BR> Me. 39; प्राणापानगती रुद्ध्वा Bg. 4. 29.<BR>—2 To hold up, preserve, sustain (from falling); आशाबन्धः कुसुमसदृशं<BR> प्रायशो ह्यङ्गनानां सद्यःपाति प्रणयि हृदयं विप्रयोगे रुणद्धि Me. 10.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To shut up, lock or block up, close up, shut or close; (with<BR> loc., but sometimes with two acc.); Bk. 6. 35; व्रजं रुणद्धि गाम् Sk.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To surround, fence or hem in.<BR>—4 To bind, confine; व्यालं बालमृणालतन्तुभिरसौ रोद्धुं समुज्जृम्भते Bh. 2. 6.<BR>—5 To besiege, invest, blockade; रुन्धन्तु वारणधटा नगरं मदीयाः<BR> Mu. 4. 17; अरुणद् यवनः साकेतं or माध्यमिकान् Mbh.; Bk. 14. 29.<BR>—6 To hide, cover, obscure, conceal.<BR>—7 To oppress, torment, afflict excessively. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to stop, detain, impede, obstruct.<BR>—2 To fetter, confine, chain.<BR>—3 To oppress, torment, harass. ━II. €1 P. (रोधति) To grow, germinate; cf. रुह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्ध|रुद्धं
रुद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Obstructed, impeded, opposed.<BR>—2 Besieged, enclosed, hemmed.<BR>—3 Shut up.<BR>—4 Kept, detained.<BR>—5 Held, withheld.<BR>—6 Covered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्धा
रुद्ध + .{@-द्धा@} A siege.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रुद्धमूत्र, रुद्धवक्त्र<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्धमूत्र
रुद्ध + -मूत्र <i>a.</i> suffering from retention of urine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुद्धवक्त्र
रुद्ध + -वक्त्र <i>a.</i> having the face covered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिर|रुधिरं|रुधिरः
रुधिर <i>a.</i> [रुध्-किरच् Uṇ. 1. 50] Red, red-coloured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरम्
रुधिर + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Blood.<BR>—2 Saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरः|रुधिर|रुधिरं
रुधिर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 The red colour.<BR>—2 The planet Mars; रोहिणीशकटमर्कनन्दनश्चेद् भिनत्ति रुधिरोऽथवा<BR> शशी Pt. 1. 213.<BR>—3 A kind of precious stone.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रुधिरान्धः, रुधिराशनः, रुधिराख्यः, रुधिराननम्, रुधिरामयः, रुधिरोद्गारिन्, रुधिरपायिन्, रुधिरप्लावित, रुधिरलालस, रुधिरलेपः, रुधिरसार<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरान्धः|रुधिरान्ध
रुधिर + -अन्धः N. of a hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिराशनः|रुधिराशन
रुधिर + -अशनः ‘a blood-eater’, a demon, an evil spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिराख्यः|रुधिराख्य|रुधिराख्यं
रुधिर + -आख्यः a kind of precious stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिराननम्
रुधिर + -आननम् one of the five retrograding motions of Mars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरामयः|रुधिरामय
रुधिर + -आमयः hemorrhage, piles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरोद्गारिन्
रुधिर + -उद्गारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 emitting blood.<BR>—2 N. of a संवत्सर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरपायिन्
रुधिर + -पायिन् <i>m.</i> a demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरप्लावित
रुधिर + -प्लावित <i>a.</i> soaked in blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरलालस
रुधिर + -लालस <i>a.</i> sanguinary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरलेपः|रुधिरलेप
रुधिर + -लेपः a spot of blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुधिरसार
रुधिर + -सार <i>a.</i> sanguine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुप्
रुप् €4 P. (रुप्यति)<BR>—1 To confound, disturb.<BR>—2 Ved. To suffer violent pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुमा
रुमा [Uṇ. 1. 137]<BR>—1 N. of the wife of Sugrīva.<BR>—2 A salt mine or salt lake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुम्र|रुम्रः
रुम्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tawny.<BR>—2 Bright.<BR>—3 Beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुरुः|रुरु
रुरुः [रौति रु-क्रुन् Uṇ. 4. 113]<BR>—1 A kind of deer; विरुरुचे रुरुचेष्टितभूमिषु R. 9. 51, 72.<BR>—2 A dog.<BR>—3 A kind of savage animal; क्रव्यादा नाम रुरवः Bhāg. 5. 26. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुरुत्सा
रुरुत्सा The wish to obstruct, check.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुवथः|रुवथ
रुवथः (रु-अथः कित् Uṇ. 1. 115) A dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुवुः|रुवु
रुवुः, रुबु(बू)कः<BR> The castor-oil tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुबुकः
रुवुः, रुबु(बू)कः<BR> The castor-oil tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुबूकः
रुवुः, रुबु(बू)कः<BR> The castor-oil tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुश्
रुश् €6 P. (रुशति)<BR>—1 To hurt, kill, destroy; वारितो मदयन्त्याऽपो रुशतीः पादयोर्जहौ<BR> Bhāg. 9. 9. 24.<BR>—2 To tease, vex.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुशत्|रुशन्त्
रुशत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Hurting, disagreeable, displeasing (as words); छिन्द्यात् प्रसह्य रुशतीमसतीं<BR> प्रभुश्चेत् Bhāg. 4. 4. 17, 6. 10. 28.<BR>—2 Ved. Bright, white.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुष्
रुष् I. €4 P. (रुष्यति; rarely रुष्यते; रुषित, रुष्ट) To be<BR> angry, to be vexed or annoyed, be offended; ततोऽरुष्यदनर्दच्च<BR> Bk. 17. 40; मा मुहो मा रुषोऽधुना 15. 16, 9. 20. ━II. €1 P. (रोषति)<BR>—1 To hurt, injure, kill.<BR>—2 To vex, annoy.<BR>—3 Ved. To be offended. ━<i>Caus.</i> To provoke, engage, exasperate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुष्
रुष्, रुषा <i>f.</i> Anger, wrath, rage; निर्बन्धसंजातरुषा<BR> R. 5. 21; प्रह्वेष्वनिर्बन्धरुषो हि सन्तः 16. 80, 19. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुषा
रुष्, रुषा <i>f.</i> Anger, wrath, rage; निर्बन्धसंजातरुषा<BR> R. 5. 21; प्रह्वेष्वनिर्बन्धरुषो हि सन्तः 16. 80, 19. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुषित|रुषितः
रुषित, रुष्ट <i>p. p.</i> Angry, enraged, provoked; स्वसैन्यं<BR> रुषितो बबन्ध ह Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुष्ट|रुष्टः
रुषित, रुष्ट <i>p. p.</i> Angry, enraged, provoked; स्वसैन्यं<BR> रुषितो बबन्ध ह Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुष्टिः|रुष्टि
रुष्टिः <i>f.</i> Anger, wrath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुह्
रुह् €1 P. (रोहति, रुरोह, अरुक्षत्, रोक्ष्यति, रोढुम्, रूढ)<BR>—1 To grow, spring up, shoot forth, germinate; रूढरागप्रवालः M. 4. 1;<BR> केसरैरर्धरूढैः Me. 21; छिन्नोऽपि रोहति तरुः Bh. 2. 87.<BR>—2 To grow up, be developed, increase; रूढं क्षुधार्दिताः वत्साः …<BR> चरन्तु … तृणम् Bhāg. 10. 13. 6.<BR>—3 To rise, mount upwards, ascend.<BR>—4 To grow over, heal up (as a wound); रोहते सायकैर्विद्धं न सं रोहति<BR> वाक्क्षतम् Pt. 3. 111.<BR>—5 To reach to, attain. ━<i>Caus.</i> (रोपयति-ते, रोहयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to grow, plant, put in the ground; तारयेद् वृक्षरोपी च<BR> तस्माद् वृक्षांश्च रोपयेत् Mb. 13. 58. 26.<BR>—2 To raise up, elevate.<BR>—3 To entrust, devolve upon, commit to the care of; गुणवत्सुतरोपितश्रियः R. 8. 11.<BR>—4 To fix upon, direct towards, cast at; R. 9. 22.<BR>—5 To fix, fasten. ━<i>Desid.</i> (रुरुक्षति) To wish to grow &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुह्
रुह्, रुह <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Growing or produced<BR> in; as महीरुह्, पङ्केरुह &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुह|रुहः
रुह्, रुह <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Growing or produced<BR> in; as महीरुह्, पङ्केरुह &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुहकम्
रुहकम् A hole, cave, chasm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुहा
रुहा The Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुह्वन्
रुह्वन् <i>m.</i> [रुह्-क्वनिप् Uṇ. 4. 124] A plant, tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढ|रूढं|रूढः
रूढ <i>p. p.</i> [रुह्-क्त]<BR>—1 Grown, sprung up, shot forth, germinated.<BR>—2 Born, produced; विषयव्यासंगरूढात्मना<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">Page1346-1</a>]<BR> Mu. 2. 5.<BR>—3 Grown up, increased, developed; जनस्य रूढप्रणयस्य चेतसः Ki. 8. 54.<BR>—4 Risen, ascended.<BR>—5 Large, great, grown, strong.<BR>—6 Diffused, spread about.<BR>—7 Commonly known, become current or widely known; क्षतात् किल त्रायत<BR> इत्युदग्रः क्षत्त्रस्य शब्दो भुवनेषु रूढः R. 2. 53; (here क्षत्त्र<BR> has a sense which is योगरूढ q. v.).<BR>—8 Popularly accepted, traditional, conventional, popular (as the meaning<BR> of a word, or the word itself; as opposed to यौगिक or etymological<BR> sense); व्युत्पत्तिरहिताः शब्दा रूढा आखण्डलादयः; नाम रूढमपि च<BR> व्युदपादि Śi. 10. 23.<BR>—9 Certain, ascertained.<BR>—10 Obscure.<BR>—11 Mounted; laden; व्रजान् स्वान् स्वान् समायुज्य ययू रूढपरिच्छदाः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 11. 30.<BR>—12 Famous, widely known; आसक्ता धूरियं रूढा Ki. 11. 77.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रूढग्रन्थि, रूढयौवन, रूढवंश, रूढव्रण, रूढसौहृद<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1345-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढग्रन्थि
रूढ + -ग्रन्थि <i>a.</i> having formed a knot; व्रणो रूढग्रन्थिः स्फुटित<BR> इव हृन्मर्मणि पुनः U. 2. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढयौवन
रूढ + -यौवन <i>a.</i> one who has attained to youth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढवंश
रूढ + -वंश <i>a.</i> of a high family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढव्रण
रूढ + -व्रण <i>a.</i> one whose wounds are healed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढसौहृद
रूढ + -सौहृद <i>a.</i> firm in friendship, of deep-rooted friendship;<BR> सखीजनस्ते किमु रूढसौहृदः V. 1. 10 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढिः|रूढि
रूढिः <i>f.</i> [रुह्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Growth, germination.<BR>—2 Birth, production.<BR>—3 Increase, development, growth, spread.<BR>—4 Rise, ascent.<BR>—5 Fame, celebrity, notoriety; चक्रधर इति रथाङ्गमदः सततं बिभर्षि<BR> भुवनेषु रूढये Śi. 15. 26.<BR>—6 A tradition, custom, customary or traditional usage; शास्त्राद् रूढिर्बलीयसी<BR> ‘custom prevails over precept’.<BR>—7 General prevalence, common currency.<BR>—8 Popular meaning, conventional acceptation of a word; मुख्यार्थबाधे<BR> तद्योगे रूढितोऽथ प्रयोजनात् K. P. 2; समुदायशक्तिः रूढिः.<BR>—9 Decision.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रूढिशब्दः, रूढिशब्दता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढिशब्दः|रूढिशब्द
रूढिः + -शब्दः a word which conveys its sense by रूढि (usage) as<BR> opposed to योग (etymology); बहुषु कुशानां लातुः गुणेषु सत्सु निपुणतायामेव<BR> कुशलशब्दो रोहाद् रूढिशब्द एव भवति ŚB. on MS. 6. 7. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूढिशब्दता
रूढिः + -शब्दता the state of being used in a conventional sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुहरुहिका
रुहरुहिका, रुहिरुहिका Longing, anxiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुहिरुहिका
रुहरुहिका, रुहिरुहिका Longing, anxiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्ष्
रूक्ष् €10 U. (रूक्षयति-ते)<BR>—1 To be rough or harsh.<BR>—2 To be unkind.<BR>—3 Ved. To make dry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्ष|रूक्षं|रूक्षः
रूक्ष <i>a.</i> (written as रुक्ष also)<BR>—1 Rough, harsh, not smooth or soft (as touch, sound &c.); पुंस्कोकिलगिरं<BR> श्रुत्वा रूक्षा ध्वाङ्क्षस्य वागिव Mb. 1. 2. 384; रूक्षस्वरं वाशति वायसोऽयम्<BR> Mk. 9. 10; Ku. 7. 17.<BR>—2 Astringent (taste).<BR>—3 Rough, uneven, difficult, austere.<BR>—4 Sullied, soiled, dirtied; रथतुरगरजोभिस्तस्य रूक्षालकाग्रा R. 7. 70;<BR> Mu. 4. 5.<BR>—5 Cruel, unkind, harsh; नितान्तरूक्षाभिनिवेशमीशम् R. 14. 43; संरम्भरूक्षमिव<BR> सुन्दरि यद् यदासीत् V. 3. 20; Ś. 7. 32; Pt. 4. 91.<BR>—6 Arid, parched up, dry, dreary; स्निग्धश्यामाः क्वचिदपरतो भीषणाभोगरूक्षाः U. 2. 14.<BR>—7 Not oily (as food); Bg. 17. 9. (रूक्षीकृ means ‘to make rough’,<BR> ‘soil’, ‘besmear’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुक्ष|रुक्षः
रूक्ष <i>a.</i> (written as रुक्ष also)<BR>—1 Rough, harsh, not smooth or soft (as touch, sound &c.); पुंस्कोकिलगिरं<BR> श्रुत्वा रूक्षा ध्वाङ्क्षस्य वागिव Mb. 1. 2. 384; रूक्षस्वरं वाशति वायसोऽयम्<BR> Mk. 9. 10; Ku. 7. 17.<BR>—2 Astringent (taste).<BR>—3 Rough, uneven, difficult, austere.<BR>—4 Sullied, soiled, dirtied; रथतुरगरजोभिस्तस्य रूक्षालकाग्रा R. 7. 70;<BR> Mu. 4. 5.<BR>—5 Cruel, unkind, harsh; नितान्तरूक्षाभिनिवेशमीशम् R. 14. 43; संरम्भरूक्षमिव<BR> सुन्दरि यद् यदासीत् V. 3. 20; Ś. 7. 32; Pt. 4. 91.<BR>—6 Arid, parched up, dry, dreary; स्निग्धश्यामाः क्वचिदपरतो भीषणाभोगरूक्षाः U. 2. 14.<BR>—7 Not oily (as food); Bg. 17. 9. (रूक्षीकृ means ‘to make rough’,<BR> ‘soil’, ‘besmear’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षः|रूक्ष|रूक्षं
रूक्ष <i>a.</i> (written as रुक्ष also) + .{@-क्षः@}<BR>—1 A tree.<BR>—2 Harshness, hardness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षा
रूक्ष <i>a.</i> (written as रुक्ष also) + .{@-क्षा@}<BR>—1 Croton Polyandrum (Mar. दन्ती).<BR>—2 Honey sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षम्
रूक्ष <i>a.</i> (written as रुक्ष also) + .{@-क्षम्@}<BR>—1 The thick part of curds.<BR>—2 A good kind of iron.<BR>—3 Black pepper.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रूक्षगन्धः, रूक्षगन्धकः, रूक्षपत्रः, रूक्षपेषम्, रूक्षभावः, रूक्षवर्ण, रूक्षवालुकम्, रूक्षस्वरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षगन्धः|रूक्षगन्ध
रूक्ष + -गन्धः, -गन्धकः bdellium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षगन्धकः|रूक्षगन्धक
रूक्ष + -गन्धः, -गन्धकः bdellium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षपत्रः|रूक्षपत्र
रूक्ष + -पत्रः the Śākhoṭa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षपेषम्
रूक्ष + -पेषम् <i>ind.</i><BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">Page1346-2</a>]<BR> without the addition of any liquid; as in रूक्षपेषं पिनष्टि; P. III. 4. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षभावः|रूक्षभाव
रूक्ष + -भावः unfriendly behaviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षवर्ण
रूक्ष + -वर्ण <i>a.</i> dark-coloured (as clouds).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षवालुकम्
रूक्ष + -वालुकम् honey of a small bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षस्वरः|रूक्षस्वर
रूक्ष + -स्वरः an ass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षणम्
रूक्षणम्<BR>—1 Making dry or thin.<BR>—2 (In Medic.) A treatment for reducing fat (of the body).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षणीयः|रूक्षणीय
रूक्षणीयः Spirit distilled from molasses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूक्षित
रूक्षित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Made rough.<BR>—2 Soiled, covered with dirt.<BR>—3 Offended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्
रूप् €10 U. (रूपयति-ते, रूपित)<BR>—1 To form, fashion.<BR>—2 To represent on the stage, act, gesticulate; रथवेगं निरूप्य Ś. 1.<BR>—3 To mark, observe carefully, behold, look at; सर्वेषामपि वस्तूनां<BR> भावार्थो भवति स्थितः । तस्यापि भगवान् कृष्णः किमतद्वस्तु रूप्यताम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 14. 57.<BR>—4 To find out, seek.<BR>—5 To consider, ponder over.<BR>—6 To settle, fix upon.<BR>—7 To examine, investigate.<BR>—8 To feign.<BR>—9 To appoint.<BR>—10 To describe; सविस्मयं रूपयतो नभश्चरान् Ki. 8. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप|रूपं
रूप <i>a.</i> = अनुरूप q. v. (शक्तीश्च … करवालांश्च … स्वदेहरूपाण्यादाय<BR> गदाश्चोग्रप्रदर्शनाः) Mb. 1. 30. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपम्
रूपम् [रूप् क भावे अच् वा Uṇ. 3. 28]<BR>—1 Form, figure, appearance; विरूपं रूपवन्तं वा पुमानित्येव भुञ्जते<BR> Pt. 1. 143; so सुरूप, कुरूप &c.<BR>—2 Form or the quality of colour (one of the 24 guṇas of the Vaiśeṣikas);<BR> चक्षुर्मात्रग्राह्मजातिमान् गुणो रूपम् Tarka K.; (it is of six kinds:− शुक्ल,<BR> कृष्ण, पीत, रक्त, हरित, कपिल, or of seven, if चित्र be added).<BR>—3 Any visible object or thing.<BR>—4 A handsome form or figure, beautiful form, beauty, elegance, grace;<BR> मानुषीषु कथं वा स्यादस्य रूपस्य संभवः Ś. 1. 25; विद्या नाम<BR> नरस्य रूपमधिकम् Bh. 2. 20; रूपं जरा हन्ति &c.<BR>—5 Natural state or condition, nature, property, characteristic, essence;<BR> circumstances (opp. to ‘time’ and ‘place’); देशं रूपं च कालं च<BR> व्यवहारविधौ स्थितः Ms. 8. 45.<BR>—6 Mode, manner.<BR>—7 A sign, feature.<BR>—8 Kind, sort, species.<BR>—9 An image, a reflected image.<BR>—10 Similitude, resemblance.<BR>—11 Specimen, type, pattern.<BR>—12 An inflected form, the form of a noun or a verb derived from inflection<BR> (declension or conjugation).<BR>—13 The number one, an arithmetical unit.<BR>—14 An integer.<BR>—15 A drama, play; see रूपक.<BR>—16 Acquiring familiarity with any book by learning it by heart or by<BR> frequent recitation.<BR>—17 Cattle.<BR>—18 A sound, a word.<BR>—19 A known quantity.<BR>—20 A beast.<BR>—21 A verse.<BR>—22 A name.<BR>—23 The white colour.<BR>—24 A particular coin (as a rupee); कस्यचिद् गृहे चोरयित्वा रूपाभिग्राहितो<BR> बद्धः Dk. 2. 4.<BR>—25 Silver; मसारगल्वर्कसुवर्णरूपैः Mb. 7. 16. 54. (रूप is<BR> frequently used at the end of comp. in the sense of ‘formed or composed of’<BR>, ‘consisting of’, ‘in the form of’, ‘namely’; ‘having the appearance or colour of’<BR>, तपोरूपं धनम्; धर्मरूपः सखा &c.). ━<i>m.</i> {@-पः@} a deer.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रूपाधिबोधः, रूपाभिग्राहित, रूपास्त्रः, रूपाजीवा, रूपजीवना, रूपावली, रूपाश्रय, रूपेन्द्रियम्, रूपोच्चयः, रूपोपजीवनम्, रूपकारः, रूपकृत्, रूपगुणः, रूपग्रहः, रूपज्ञ, रूपतत्त्वम्, रूपतर्कः, रूपधर, रूपधारिन्, रूपध्येयम्, रूपनाशनः, रूपपरिकल्पना, रूपभागानुबन्धः, रूपभागापवादः, रूपभेदः, रूपलावण्यम्, रूपविपर्ययः, रूपविभागः, रूपशालिन्, रूपसंपद्, रूपसंपत्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपाधिबोधः|रूपाधिबोध
रूपम् + -अधिबोधः the perception of form or colour of any object by the senses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपाभिग्राहित
रूपम् + -अभिग्राहित <i>a.</i> caught in the act, caught red-handed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपास्त्रः|रूपास्त्र
रूपम् + -अस्त्रः Cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपाजीवा
रूपम् + -आजीवा, -जीवना a harlot, prostitute, courtezan; रूपाजीवाश्च<BR> वादिन्यो वणिजश्च महाधनाः Rām.; रूपाजीवाः स्नानप्रघर्षशुद्धशरीराः Kau. A. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपजीवना
रूपम् + -आजीवा, -जीवना a harlot, prostitute, courtezan; रूपाजीवाश्च<BR> वादिन्यो वणिजश्च महाधनाः Rām.; रूपाजीवाः स्नानप्रघर्षशुद्धशरीराः Kau. A. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपावली
रूपम् + -आवली a list or series of variations of grammatical forms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपाश्रय
रूपम् + -आश्रय <i>a.</i> exceedingly beautiful; त्वष्टा रूपाश्रयं रथम्<BR> Bhāg. 4. 15. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपेन्द्रियम्
रूपम् + -इन्द्रियम् the organ which perceives form and colour, the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपोच्चयः|रूपोच्चय
रूपम् + -उच्चयः a collection of lovely forms; रूपोच्चयेन मनसा विधिना<BR> कृता नु Ś. 2. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपोपजीवनम्
रूपम् + -उपजीवनम् the gaining a livelihood by a beautiful form; रङ्गावतरणं<BR> चैव तथा रूपोपजीवनम् Mb. 12. 294. 5 (com. रूपोपजीवनं जलमण्डपिकेति<BR> दाक्षिणात्येषु प्रसिद्धम् । यत्र सूक्ष्मवस्त्रं व्यवधाय चर्ममयैराकारै<BR> राजामात्यादीनां चर्या प्रदर्श्यते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपकारः|रूपकार
रूपम् + -कारः, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a sculptor; रूपकारोऽपि शस्त्रेण क्रीडयैवोल्लिलेख<BR> ताम् Ks. 37. 8. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपकृत्
रूपम् + -कारः, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a sculptor; रूपकारोऽपि शस्त्रेण क्रीडयैवोल्लिलेख<BR> ताम् Ks. 37. 8. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपगुणः|रूपगुण
रूपम् + -गुणः the quality of colour; वायोरपि विकुर्वाणाद्विरोचिष्णु तमोनुदम् ।<BR> ज्योतिरुत्पद्यते भास्वत्तद्रूपगुणमुच्यते Ms. 1. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपग्रहः|रूपग्रह
रूपम् + -ग्रहः the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपज्ञ
रूपम् + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> perceiving forms, distinguishing visible objects;<BR> त्वं तु प्रत्यक्षदर्शी च रूपज्ञश्च महाभुजः Mb. 14. 60. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपतत्त्वम्
रूपम् + -तत्त्वम् inherent property, essence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपतर्कः|रूपतर्क
रूपम् + -तर्कः an assay-master or inspector of mint (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपधर
रूपम् + -धर <i>a.</i> of the form of, disguised as; जुगोप गोरूपधरामिवोर्वीम् R. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपधारिन्
रूपम् + -धारिन्<BR>—1 having a form or shape. —2 Possessed of beauty, lovely. ━(<i>m.</i>) an actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपध्येयम्
रूपम् + -ध्येयम् beauty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपनाशनः|रूपनाशन
रूपम् + -नाशनः an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपपरिकल्पना
रूपम् + -परिकल्पना the assuming of a shape; Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपभागानुबन्धः|रूपभागानुबन्ध
रूपम् + -भागानुबन्धः the addition of a fraction to a unit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपभागापवादः
रूपम् + -भागापवादः the subtraction of a fraction from a unit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपभेदः|रूपभेद
रूपम् + -भेदः (in gram.) diversity of phonetic form or sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपलावण्यम्
रूपम् + -लावण्यम् exquisiteness of form, elegance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपविपर्ययः|रूपविपर्यय
रूपम् + -विपर्ययः disfigurement, morbid change of bodily form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपविभागः|रूपविभाग
रूपम् + -विभागः the dividing of an integer number into fractions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपशालिन्
रूपम् + -शालिन् <i>a.</i> beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपसंपद्|रूपसम्पद्
रूपम् + -संपद्, -संपत्तिः <i>f.</i> perfection or excellence of form, richness<BR> of beauty, superb beauty; उदपादि चास्या रूपसंपदा आविर्भूतविस्मयस्य<BR> तस्य मनसि K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपसंपत्तिः|रूपसम्पत्ति
रूपम् + -संपद्, -संपत्तिः <i>f.</i> perfection or excellence of form, richness<BR> of beauty, superb beauty; उदपादि चास्या रूपसंपदा आविर्भूतविस्मयस्य<BR> तस्य मनसि K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपक|रूपकं|रूपकः
रूपक <i>a.</i> [रूप्-ण्वुल्] Bodily, corporeal.<BR>—2 Figurative (as words &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपकः|रूपक|रूपकं
रूपक + .{@-कः@} A particular coin, a <i>rupee</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपकम्
रूपक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Form, figure, shape (at the end of comp.).<BR>—2 Any manifestation or representation.<BR>—3 A sign, feature.<BR>—4 A kind, species.<BR>—5 A statue; चित्रतत्तदनुकार्यविभ्रमाधाग्यनेकविधिरूपरूपकम् N. 18. 12;<BR> द्वारशाखोपशोभारूपकमात्रम् Ks.<BR>—6 A drama, play, a dramatic composition; (one of the two main subdivisions<BR> of dramatic compositions; it is divided into ten classes; there are eighteen<BR> minor divisions of it called उपरूपक); दृश्यं तत्राभिनेयं तद्रूपारोपात्तु<BR> रूपकम् S. D. 272-3; also नाटकमथ प्रकरणं भाणव्यायोगसमवकारडिमाः ।<BR> ईहामृगाङ्कवीथ्यः प्रहसनमिति रूपकाणि दश S. D.; उच्चैरुच्चरितपदां<BR> पपाठ नान्दीं प्रारम्भे द्रुतमपयानरूपकस्य Śiva B. 24. 68.<BR>—7 (In Rhet.) A figure of speech corresponding to the English <i>metaphor</i>,<BR> in which the <i>upameya</i> is represented as being identical with the<BR> <i>upamāna</i>; तद्रूपकमभेदो य उपमानोपमेययोः K. P. 10 (see<BR> <i>ad loc.</i> for details).<BR>—8 A kind of weight (= three <i>gunjas</i>).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रूपकतालः, रूपकनृत्यम्, रूपकरूपकम्, रूपकशब्दः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपकतालः|रूपकताल
रूपक + -तालः a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">Page1347-2</a>]<BR> particular time in music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपकनृत्यम्
रूपक + -नृत्यम् a kind of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपकरूपकम्
रूपक + -रूपकम् a particular kind of रूपक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपकशब्दः|रूपकशब्द
रूपक + -शब्दः a figurative or metaphorical expression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपणम्
रूपणम् [रूप्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Metaphorical or figurative description.<BR>—2 Investigation, examination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपवत्|रूपवन्त्
रूपवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having form or colour.<BR>—2 Bodily, corporeal.<BR>—3 Embodied.<BR>—4 Handsome, beautiful.<BR>—5 (Mīmāṃsā) Possessed of रूप <i>i. e.</i> where are mentioned द्रव्य,<BR> देवता etc. which form the रूप of a sacrificial act; स एष रूपवतां<BR> संनिधावरूपः शब्दः श्रूयमाणः समुदायवाचकः समधिगतः ŚB. on MS. 4. 4. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपवती
रूपवत् + .{@-ती@} A beautiful woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपिकः|रूपिक
रूपिकः Coin, money.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपिन्
रूपिन् <i>a.</i> [रूप-इनि]<BR>—1 Appearing like.<BR>—2 Embodied, incarnate; सिन्धुः शिरस्यर्हणं परिगृह्य रूपी Bhāg. 9. 10. 13;<BR> रूपी कोप इव व्याघ्रः Dk.<BR>—3 Beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपीकृ
रूपीकृ To make rough, to soil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्य|रूप्यं
रूप्य <i>a.</i> [रूप-यत्]<BR>—1 Beautiful, lovely; P. V. 2. 120.<BR>—2 Stamped; impressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्यम्
रूप्य + .{@-प्यम्@}<BR>—1 Silver.<BR>—2 Silver (or gold) bearing stamp, a stamped coin, a rupee.<BR>—3 Wrought gold; यथा हिरण्यकर्ता वै रूप्यमग्नौ विशोधयेत् Mb. 12. 280. 11.<BR>—4 Collyrium.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रूप्याचलः, रूप्याध्यक्षः, रूप्यद, रूप्यधौतम्, रूप्यशतमानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्याचलः|रूप्याचल
रूप्य + -अचलः N. of the mountain Kailāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्याध्यक्षः|रूप्याध्यक्ष
रूप्य + -अध्यक्षः a master of the mint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्यद
रूप्य + -द <i>a.</i> one who gives silver; रूप्यदो रूपमुत्तमम् (आप्नोति) Ms. 4. 230.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्यधौतम्
रूप्य + -धौतम् silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूप्यशतमानम्
रूप्य + -शतमानम् a particular weight (= 3½ palas).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूवुकः|रूवुक
रूवुकः The castor-oil tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूष्
रूष् I. €1 P. (रूषति, रूषित)<BR>—1 To adorn, decorate.<BR>—2 To smear, anoint, cover, overlay (as with dust). ━II. €10 U. (रूषयति-ते)<BR>—1 To tremble.<BR>—2 To burst. ━III. €10 P. To hurt, to kill; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूष
रूष <i>a.</i> Bitter and sour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूषणम्
रूषणम्<BR>—1 Decoration.<BR>—2 Smearing, soiling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूषित|रूषितं
रूषित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Adorned.<BR>—2 Smeared, covered, overspread; बाहून् प्रगृह्य रुचिरान् रक्तचन्दनरूषितान्<BR> Mb. 5. 162. 16.<BR>—3 Soiled.<BR>—4 Made rough or rugged.<BR>—5 Pounded.<BR>—6 Perfumed; सरोऽनिलं पङ्कजरेणुरूषितम् Bhāg. 8. 2. 24.<BR>—7 Inlaid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूस्तम्
रूस्तम् [Uṇ. 3. 93 com.] Skirts of cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रे
रे <i>ind.</i> A vocative particle; रे रे शंकरगृहाधिवासिनो जानपदाः<BR> Māl. 3; रे रे चातक सावधानमनसा मित्र क्षणं श्रूयताम् Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेक्
रेक् €1 Ā. (रेकते) To doubt, suspect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेकः|रेक
रेकः<BR>—1 Suspicion, doubt.<BR>—2 A low man, an outcast; कृता भिक्षा रेकैः Pt. 1. 11.<BR>—3 Emptying, loosening, purging.<BR>—4 A frog.<BR>—5 A kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेकणस्
रेकणस् <i>n.</i> Gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1347-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेक्णस्
रेक्णस् <i>n.</i> [रिचेः असुन्, नुट् च Uṇ. 4. 206] Ved. Property<BR> left by a deceased person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखा
रेखा [लिख्-अच् लस्य रः]<BR>—1 A line, streak; मदरेखा, दानरेखा, रागरेखा &c.<BR>—2 The measure of a line, small portion, as much as a line; न रेखामात्रमपि<BR> व्यतीयुः R. 1. 17.<BR>—3 A row, range, line, series; मुदाश्रु मोक्ष्यसे क्षिप्रं मेघरेखेव वार्षिकी<BR> Rām. 2. 44. 27.<BR>—4 Delineation, sketch, drawing; लावण्यरेखया किंचिदन्वितम् Ś. 6. 13.<BR>—5 The first or prime meridian of the Indian astronomers drawn from Laṅkā<BR> to Meru and passing through Ujjayinī.<BR>—6 Fulness, satisfaction.<BR>—7 Deceit, fraud.<BR>—8 A straight position of all limbs in dancing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रेखांशः, रेखान्तरम्, रेखाकार, रेखागणितम्, रेखान्यासः, रेखामात्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखांशः|रेखांश
रेखा + -अंशः a degree of longitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखान्तरम्
रेखा + -अन्तरम् distance east or west from the first meridian, longitude of a place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखाकार
रेखा + -आकार <i>a.</i> lineal, formed in lines, striped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखागणितम्
रेखा + -गणितम् geometry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखान्यासः|रेखान्यास
रेखा + -न्यासः the marking down of lines.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखामात्रम्
रेखा + -मात्रम् <i>ind.</i> even by a line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेखायते
रेखायते Den. Ā.<BR>—1 To praise, flatter.<BR>—2 To vex, annoy, exasperate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेच
रेच See रेचक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेचक|रेचकं|रेचकः
रेचक <i>a.</i> (-चिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [रेचयति रिच्-णिच् ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Emptying, purging.<BR>—2 Purgative, aperient.<BR>—3 Emptying the lungs, emitting the breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेचकः|रेचक|रेचकं
रेचक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 Emission of breath, breathing out; exhalation, especially through one<BR> of the nostrils (opp. पूरक which means ‘inhaling breath’, and कुम्भक<BR> ‘suspending breath’); प्राणापानौ संनिरुन्ध्यात् पूरकुम्भकरेचकैः Bhāg. 7. 15. 32.<BR>—2 A syringe; सिच्यमानोऽच्युतस्ताभिर्हसन्तीभिः स्म रेचकैः Bhāg. 10. 90. 9.<BR>—3 Nitre, salt-petre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेचकम्
रेचक + .{@-कम्@} A purgative, cathartic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेचनम्
रेचनम्, -ना<BR> [रिच्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Emptying.<BR>—2 Loosening, diminishing.<BR>—3 Emitting the breath.<BR>—4 Purging.<BR>—5 Evacuation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेचना
रेचनम्, -ना<BR> [रिच्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Emptying.<BR>—2 Loosening, diminishing.<BR>—3 Emitting the breath.<BR>—4 Purging.<BR>—5 Evacuation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेचनी
रेचनम्, -ना + .{@-नी@} N. of various plants (such as Ipomoea Turpethus, Mar. तेंडू;<BR> Croton Polyandrum, Mar. दंती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेचित
रेचित <i>a.</i> Emptied, cleared; किरातसैन्यैरपिधाय रेचिताः Ki. 14. 33;<BR> ववलिरे वलिरेचितमध्यमाः Śi. 6. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेचितम्
रेचित + .{@-तम्@} horseʼs gallop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेज्
रेज् €1 Ā. (रेजते)<BR>—1 To shine.<BR>—2 To shake, tremble (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेज्
रेज् <i>m.</i> N. of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेट्
रेट् €1 U. (रेटति-ते)<BR>—1 To speak.<BR>—2 To ask, request.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुः|रेणु
रेणुः <i>m., f.</i> [रीयतेः णुः नित् Uṇ. 3. 38]<BR>—1 Dust, an atom of dust, sand &c.; तुरगखुरहतस्तथा हि रेणुः Ś. 1. 32.<BR>—2 The pollen of flowers.<BR>—3 A particular measure.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रेणूत्पातः, रेणुगर्भः, रेणुपदवी, रेणुरूषित, रेणुवासः, रेणुसारः, रेणुसारकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणूत्पातः|रेणूत्पात
रेणुः + -उत्पातः rising of dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुगर्भः|रेणुगर्भ
रेणुः + -गर्भः an hour-glass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुपदवी
रेणुः + -पदवी a path of dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुरूषित|रेणुरूषितः
रेणुः + -रूषित <i>a.</i> soiled with dust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुरूषितः|रेणुरूषित
रेणुः + -रूषित + .({@-तः@}) an ass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुवासः|रेणुवास
रेणुः + -वासः a bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुसारः|रेणुसार
रेणुः + -सारः, -सारकः camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुसारकः|रेणुसारक
रेणुः + -सारः, -सारकः camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुकः|रेणुक
रेणुकः A particular mantra (formula) recited over weapons; Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुका
रेणुका<BR>—1 The wife of Jamadagni and mother of Paraśurāma; see जमदग्नि.<BR>—2 A kind of medicinal substance.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रेणुकातनयः, रेणुकासुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुकातनयः|रेणुकातनय
रेणुका + -तनयः, -सुतः an epithet of Paraśurāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेणुकासुतः|रेणुकासुत
रेणुका + -तनयः, -सुतः an epithet of Paraśurāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेतस्
रेतस् [री-असुन् तुट् च Uṇ. 4. 209]<BR>—1 Semen virile, seed.<BR>—2 Ved. A flow, current.<BR>—3 Progeny, offspring.<BR>—4 Quicksilver.<BR>—5 Sin (mostly Ved. in the last sense.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रेतोधाः, रेतोमार्गः, रेतःसेकः, रेतःस्खलनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेतोधाः
रेतस् + -धाः [Uṇ. 4. 238] <i>m.</i> a father; रेतोधाः पुत्रो नयति नरदेव<BR> यमक्षयात् Bhāg. 9. 20. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेतोमार्गः|रेतोमार्ग
रेतस् + -मार्गः the seminal duct or canal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेतःसेकः|रेतःसेक
रेतस् + -सेकः sexual intercourse; रेतःसेकः स्वयोनीषु … … गुरुतल्पसमं<BR> विदुः Ms. 11. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेतःस्खलनम्
रेतस् + -स्खलनम् effusion of semen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेतम्
रेतम् Semen virile.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रेतजम्, रेतजा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेतजम्
रेतम् + -जम् an offspring or child; रेतजो वा भवेत् पुत्रस्त्यक्तो वा<BR> क्षेत्रजो भवेत् Mb. 13. 49. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेतजा
रेतम् + -जा sand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेतनम्
रेतनम् Semen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेत्यम्
रेत्यम् Bell-metal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेत्रम्
रेत्रम् [री-त्र]<BR>—1 Semen, sperm.<BR>—2 Quicksilver.<BR>—3 Nectar.<BR>—4 Perfumed powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेप्
रेप् €1 Ā. (रेपते)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेप|रेपः
रेप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Contemptible, low, vile.<BR>—2 Cruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेपस्
रेपस् <i>a.</i> [Uṇ. 4. 244]<BR>—1 Low, vile.<BR>—2 Wicked, a wretch.<BR>—3 Miserly.<BR>—4 Cruel, savage. ━<i>n.</i><BR>—1 A spot, stain.<BR>—2 Fault, sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेफ|रेफः
रेफ <i>a.</i> Low, vile, contemptible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेफः|रेफ
रेफ + .{@-फः@}<BR>—1 A burr, grating sound.<BR>—2 The letter र्.<BR>—3 Passion, affection.<BR>—4 A word; कण्ठे च सामानि समस्तरेफान् Bhāg. 8. 20. 25.<BR>—5 (In prosody) A cretic (– ⏑ –).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रेफविपुला, रेफसंधिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेफविपुला
रेफ + -विपुला a kind of metre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेफसंधिः|रेफसन्धि
रेफ + -संधिः the euphonic junction of र्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेफस्
रेफस् = रेपस्, Uṇ. 5. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेब्
रेब्(व्) €1 Ā. (रेब(व)ते)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To jump, leap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेव्
रेब्(व्) €1 Ā. (रेब(व)ते)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To jump, leap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेभ्
रेभ् €1 Ā. (रेभते)<BR>—1 To sound, make a noise.<BR>—2 To low (as cows).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेभ|रेभः
रेभ <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Crackling.<BR>—2 Sounding loudly; cf. Ki. 15. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेभः|रेभ
रेभ + .{@-भः@}<BR>—1 A praiser.<BR>—2 A talker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेभणम्
रेभणम् The lowing of kine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेरिवन्
रेरिवन् = प्रेरयितृ q. v.; अहं वृक्षस्य रेरिवा T. Up. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेरिहाणः|रेरिहाण
रेरिहाणः<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 A thief.<BR>—3 A demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेव्
रेव् €1 Ā. (रेवते)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To leap, jump.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेवटः|रेवट|रेवटं
रेवटः<BR>—1 A boar.<BR>—2 A bamboo cane.<BR>—3 A whirlwind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेवटम्
रेवटः + .{@-टम्@} A kind of conch-shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेवतः|रेवत
रेवतः The citron tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेवती
रेवती<BR>—1 N. of the 27th constellation which contains thirty-two stars.<BR>—2 N. of the wife of Balarāma; Śi. 2. 16.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-1" target="_blank">Page1349-1</a>]<BR>—3 A cow.<BR>—4 N. of the Sāman formed from the Rig. verse रेवतीर्नः सधमाद …<BR> Rv. 1. 30. 13; एता रेवत्यः पशुषु प्रोताः Ch. Up. 2. 18. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रेवतीभवः, रेवतीरमणः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1348-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रेवतीभवः|रेवतीभव
