रोचनकः The citron tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोचना
रोचना<BR>—1 The bright sky, firmament.<BR>—2 A handsome woman.<BR>—3 A kind of yellow pigment (= गोरोचना q. v.); त्वं रोचनागौरशरीरयष्टिः<BR> R. 6. 65, 17. 24; कनकचषकमेतद्रोचनालोहितेन Śi. 11. 51.<BR>—4 A red lotus-flower.<BR>—5 Dark Śālmali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोचनी
रोचनी Red arsenic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोचमान|रोचमानः
रोचमान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shining, bright.<BR>—2 Lovely, beautiful, charming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोचमानः|रोचमान
रोचमान + .{@-नः@} A tuft of hair on a horseʼs neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोचिष्णु|रोचिष्णुः
रोचिष्णु <i>a.</i> [रुच्-इष्णुच्]<BR>—1 Bright, resplendent, shining, brilliant; रोचिष्णुरिति वा अहमेतमुपास<BR> Bṛ. Up. 2. 1. 9.<BR>—2 Gay, gaily or elegantly dressed, blooming.<BR>—3 Exciting appetite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोचिस्
रोचिस् <i>n.</i> [रुचेः इसिः Uṇ. 2. 107] Light, splendour, brightness,<BR> flame; शरच्चन्द्रमरीचिरोचिषम् Śi. 1. 5; तत्संघट्टाद्विघटितबृहत्खण्डमुच्चण्डरोचिः Mv. 1. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोटिका
रोटिका, रोटी Bread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोटी
रोटिका, रोटी Bread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोड्
रोड् €1 P. (रोडति) To despise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोड|रोडः
रोड <i>a.</i> Satisfied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोडः|रोड
रोड + .{@-डः@} Crushing, grinding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोढृ
रोढृ <i>a.</i> One who grows or ascends.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोदनम्
रोदनम् [रुद्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Weeping; see रुदन.<BR>—2 A tear or tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1349-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोदनिका
रोदनिका, रोदनी Alhagi Maurorum (Mar. धमासा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोदनी
रोदनिका, रोदनी Alhagi Maurorum (Mar. धमासा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोदस्
रोदस् <i>n.</i> [रुद्-असुन्] (in dual), रोदसी <i>f.</i> Heaven<BR> and earth; एते पृष्ठानि रोदसोर्विप्रयन्तो व्यानशुः Rv. 9. 22. 5; रवः<BR> श्रवणभैरवः स्थगितरोदसीकन्दरः Ve. 3. 2; वेदान्तेषु यमाहुरेकपुरुषं<BR> व्याप्य स्थितं रोदसी V. 1. 1; Śi. 18. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोदसी
रोदस् <i>n.</i> [रुद्-असुन्] (in dual), रोदसी <i>f.</i> Heaven<BR> and earth; एते पृष्ठानि रोदसोर्विप्रयन्तो व्यानशुः Rv. 9. 22. 5; रवः<BR> श्रवणभैरवः स्थगितरोदसीकन्दरः Ve. 3. 2; वेदान्तेषु यमाहुरेकपुरुषं<BR> व्याप्य स्थितं रोदसी V. 1. 1; Śi. 18. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधः|रोध
रोधः [रुध्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Stopping, arresting, hindering; Śi. 10. 89; मरुद्रोधाद्विनिर्मुक्तास्ताः<BR> प्रजा मुदिताभवन् Rām. 7. 36. 6.<BR>—2 Obstruction, stoppage, hindrance, prevention, prohibition, suppression;<BR> शापादसि प्रतिहता स्मृतिरोधरूक्षे Ś. 7. 32; उपलरोध Ki. 5. 15; Y. 2. 220.<BR>—3 Closing, shutting up, blocking up, blockade, siege; चैत्यद्रुमावमर्दश्च<BR> रोधः कर्मानुशासनम् Mb. 12. 59. 63; प्रीतिरोधमसहिष्ट सा पुरी R. 11. 52.<BR>—4 A dam, bank; नर्मदां रोधवद्रुद्ध्वा क्रीडापयति योषितः Rām. 7. 32. 18.<BR>—5 Sprouting, growing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रोधकृत्, रोधवक्रा, रोधवेदी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधकृत्
रोधः + -कृत् N. of a संवत्सर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधवक्रा
रोधः + -वक्रा, -वेदी a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधवेदी
रोधः + -वक्रा, -वेदी a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधक
रोधक <i>a.</i> Stopping, checking &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधनः|रोधन
रोधनः [रुध्-ल्यु ल्युट् वा] The planet Mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधनम्
रोधनः + .{@-नम्@} Stopping, checking, confining, restraint, check &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधस्
रोधस् <i>n.</i> [रुध्-असुन्]<BR>—1 A bank, an embankment, a dam; गङ्गा रोधःपतनकलुषा गृह्णतीव प्रसादम्<BR> V. 1. 8; R. 5. 42; Me. 43.<BR>—2 A shore, high bank; अथ रोधसि दक्षिणोदधेः R. 8. 33.<BR>—3 A mountain slope; स दण्डस्तत्र राजाभूद्रम्ये पर्वतरोधसि Rām. 7. 79. 17;<BR> Ki. 16. 55.<BR>—4 The brink of a well; Bhāg.<BR>—5 A womanʼs hips; cf. तट.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रोधोवक्रा, रोधोवती, रोधोवप्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधोवक्रा
रोधस् + -वक्रा, -वती<BR>—1 a river.<BR>—2 a rapid river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधोवती
रोधस् + -वक्रा, -वती<BR>—1 a river.<BR>—2 a rapid river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधोवप्रः|रोधोवप्र
रोधस् + -वप्रः a rapid river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोधिन्
रोधिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Stopping, blocking up, obstructing.<BR>—2 Filling, covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोध्रः|रोध्र|रोध्रं
रोध्रः A kind of tree (= लोध्र q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोध्रः|रोध्र|रोध्रं
रोध्रः + .{@-ध्रः, -ध्रम्@} Sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोध्रम्
रोध्रः + .{@-ध्रः, -ध्रम्@} Sin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोध्रम्
रोध्रः + .{@-ध्रम्@} Offence, injury.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रोध्रपुष्पः, रोध्रपुष्पकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोध्रपुष्पः|रोध्रपुष्प
रोध्रः + -पुष्पः<BR>—1 Bassia Latifolia (Mar. मोह).<BR>—2 a kind of ringed snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोध्रपुष्पकः|रोध्रपुष्पक
रोध्रः + -पुष्पकः a kind of grain (Mar. साळीची जात); also पुष्कशूकः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोपः|रोप
रोपः [रुह्-णिच् हस्य पः कर्मणि अच्]<BR>—1 The act of raising or setting up.<BR>—2 Planting; एता जात्यस्तु वृक्षाणां तेषां रोपे गुणास्त्विमे Mb. 13. 58. 24.<BR>—3 An arrow; एकौघैः समकालमभ्रमुदयी रोपैस्तदा तस्तरे Śi. 19. 120.<BR>—4 A hole, cavity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रोपशिखी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोपशिखी
रोपः + -शिखी fire produced from arrows; स्मररिपोरिव रोपशिखी पुरां<BR> दहतु ते जगतामपि मा त्रयम् N. 4. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोपकः|रोपक
रोपकः<BR>—1 A planter; वृक्षारोपकः Ms. 3. 163.<BR>—2 A weight, a coin (= ¹⁄₇₀ of a Suvarṇa).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोपणम्
रोपणम् [रुह् णिच् हस्य पः ल्युट्]<BR>—1 The act of erecting, setting up or raising.<BR>—2 Planting.<BR>—3 Healing.<BR>—4 A healing application (used for sores).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोपणः|रोपण|रोपणं
रोपणम् + .{@-णः@} An arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोपित
रोपित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Planted, set up.<BR>—2 Erected, raised.<BR>—3 Aimed at (as an arrow).<BR>—4 Set (as a jewel).<BR>—5 Entrusted, devolved on; see रुह् caus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमः|रोम|रोमं
रोमः A hole, cavity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रोमनिलयः, रोमरोमम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमनिलयः
रोमः + -निलयः the skin; Mātaṅga L. 4. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमरोमम्
रोमः + -रोमम् Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमकः|रोमक|रोमकं
रोमकः<BR>—1 The city of Rome.<BR>—2 A Roman, an inhabitant of Rome (usually in pl.); Mb. 2. 51. 17.<BR>—3 N. of an astronomer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमकम्
रोमकः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A kind of salt (पांशुलवण).<BR>—2 A kind of magnet.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रोमकपत्तनम्, रोमकसिद्धान्तः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमकपत्तनम्
रोमकः + -पत्तनम् the city of Rome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमकसिद्धान्तः|रोमकसिद्धान्त
रोमकः + -सिद्धान्तः one of the five chief Siddhāntas (so called because<BR> it was probably derived from the <i>Romans</i>).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमन्
रोमन् <i>n.</i> [रु-मनिन् Uṇ. 4. 150]<BR>—1 The hair on the body of men and animals; especially, short hair, bristles<BR> or down; रोमाणि च रहस्यानि सर्वाण्येव विवर्जयेत् Ms. 4. 144, 8. 116;<BR> Bhāg. 11. 18. 3.<BR>—2 The feathers of birds.<BR>—3 The scales of a fish.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रोमाङ्कः, रोमाङ्कुरः, रोमाञ्चः, रोमाञ्चित, रोमान्तः, रोमाली, रोमावलिः, रोमावली, रोमोद्गमः, रोमोद्भेदः, रोमकर्णकः, रोमकूपः, रोमकूपम्, रोमगर्तः, रोमकेशरम्, रोमकेसरम्, रोमगुच्छम्, रोमपुलकः, रोमभूमिः, रोमरन्ध्रम्, रोमराजिः, रोमराजी, रोमलता, रोमवाहिन्, रोमविकारः, रोमविक्रिया, रोमविभेदः, रोमविध्वंसः, रोमशातनम्, रोमसूची, रोमहर्षः, रोमहर्षण, रोमहृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमाङ्कः|रोमाङ्क
रोमन् + -अङ्कः a mark of hair; बिभ्रती श्वेतरोमाङ्कम् R. 1. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमाङ्कुरः|रोमाङ्कुर
रोमन् + -अङ्कुरः, -अञ्चः a thrill (of rapture, horror, surprise &c.),<BR> horripilation; हर्षाद्भुतभयादिभ्यो रोमाञ्चो रोमविक्रिया S. D. 167.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1350-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोमाञ्चः|रोमाञ्च|रोमांच
