रोहणः + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 The act of mounting, riding, ascending.<BR>—2 Growing over, healing.<BR>—3 Proceeding or arising from; consisting of.<BR>—4 Semen virile.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रोहणगिरिः, रोहणनगेन्द्रः, रोहणद्रुमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहणगिरिः
रोहणः + -गिरिः, -नगेन्द्रः The Rohaṇa mountain; रोहणगिरिः सकलगुणरत्नसमूहस्य Vās.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहणनगेन्द्रः
रोहणः + -गिरिः, -नगेन्द्रः The Rohaṇa mountain; रोहणगिरिः सकलगुणरत्नसमूहस्य Vās.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहणद्रुमः|रोहणद्रुम
रोहणः + -द्रुमः the sandal tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहन्तः|रोहन्त|रोहंतः
रोहन्तः [रुहेः झच् Uṇ. 3. 127] A tree in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहन्ती
रोहन्तः + .{@-न्ती@} A creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिः|रोहि
रोहिः [रुह्-इन् Uṇ. 4. 130]<BR>—1 A kind of deer.<BR>—2 A religious man.<BR>—3 A tree.<BR>—4 A seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिण|रोहिणं|रोहिणः
रोहिण <i>a.</i> Born under the asterism Rohiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणः|रोहिण|रोहिणं
रोहिण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 N. of several plants:− वट, रोहितक, भूतृण; नगराद्बहिरतिमहतो<BR> रोहिणद्रुमस्य Dk. 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणम्
रोहिण + .{@-णम्@} N. of the 9th muhūrta (in which श्राद्धs are performed).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणिः|रोहिणि
रोहिणिः = रोहिणी q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणिका
रोहिणिका<BR>—1 A woman with a red face.<BR>—2 Inflammation of the throat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणी
रोहिणी<BR>—1 A red cow.<BR>—2 A cow in general; वर्धिष्णुधाराध्वनि रोहिणीः पयः Śi. 12. 40.<BR>—3 N. of the fourth lunar mansion (containing five stars) figured by a<BR> cart; she was one of the several daughters of Dakṣa and is regarded as<BR> the most favourite consort of the moon; उपरागान्ते शशिनः समुपगता<BR> रोहिणी योगम् Ś. 7. 22.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">Page1351-2</a>]<BR>—4 N. of a wife of Vasudeva and mother of Balarāma.<BR>—5 A young girl in whom menstruation has just commenced; नववर्षा च रोहिणी.<BR>—6 Lightning.<BR>—7 Inflammation of the throat.<BR>—8 A kind of steel.<BR>—9 A particular श्रुति or मूर्च्छना (in music).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रोहिण्यष्टमी, रोहिणीतनयः, रोहिणीपतिः, रोहिणीप्रियः, रोहिणीवल्लभः, रोहिणीयोगः, रोहिणीरमणः, रोहिणीशकटः, रोहिणीसुतः, रोहिणीभवः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिण्यष्टमी
रोहिणी + -अष्टमी the eighth day in the month of Bhādrapada (when the moon<BR> is in conjunction with Rohiṇī).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणीतनयः|रोहिणीतनय
रोहिणी + -तनयः Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणीपतिः|रोहिणीपति
रोहिणी + -पतिः, -प्रियः, -वल्लभः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणीप्रियः|रोहिणीप्रिय
रोहिणी + -पतिः, -प्रियः, -वल्लभः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणीवल्लभः|रोहिणीवल्लभ
रोहिणी + -पतिः, -प्रियः, -वल्लभः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणीयोगः|रोहिणीयोग
रोहिणी + -योगः the conjunction of the moon with the Nakṣatra रोहिणी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणीरमणः|रोहिणीरमण
रोहिणी + -रमणः<BR>—1 a bull.<BR>—2 the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणीशकटः|रोहिणीशकट
रोहिणी + -शकटः the constellation Rohiṇī figured by a cart; रोहिणीशकटमर्कनन्दनश्चेद्भिनत्ति<BR> रुधिरोऽथवा शशी Pt. 1. 23 (= Bṛ. S. 47. 14).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिणीसुतः|रोहिणीसुत
