रोहिणीभवः|रोहिणीभव
रोहिणी + -सुतः, -भवः Mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहित्
रोहित् <i>m.</i> [रुह्-इतिः Uṇ. 1. 94]<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 A kind of fish. ━<i>f.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 A red mare.<BR>—2 A doe, a deer; रोहिद्भूतां सोऽन्वधावदृक्षरूपी हतत्रपः Bhāg. 3. 31. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहित|रोहितं|रोहितः
रोहित <i>a.</i> (-रोहिता or -रोहिणी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [रुहेः इतन्, रश्च लो वा Uṇ. 3. 95] Red,<BR> red-coloured; विदर्भसुभ्रूपयोधरे रोहति रोहितश्रीः N. 7. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहितः|रोहित|रोहितं
रोहित + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 Red colour.<BR>—2 A fox.<BR>—3 A kind of deer.<BR>—4 A red horse.<BR>—5 N. of Hariśchandraʼs son.<BR>—6 A kind of fish; पाठीनरोहितावाद्यौ नियुक्तौ हव्यकव्ययोः Ms. 5. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहितम्
रोहित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Blood.<BR>—2 Saffron.<BR>—3 A straight rain-bow; विद्युतोऽशनिमेघांश्च रोहितेन्द्रधनूंषि च Ms. 1. 38.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रोहिताश्वः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिताश्वः|रोहिताश्व
रोहित + -अश्वः fire; लोकं विलोलार्चिषि रोहिताश्वे Ki. 16. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिन्
रोहिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Rising, growing.<BR>—2 Long, tall. ━<i>m.</i> N. of several trees:− रोहितक, वट, अश्वत्थ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रोहिषः|रोहिष
रोहिषः<BR>—1 A kind of fish.<BR>—2 A kind of deer.<BR>—3 A kind of fragrant grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौक्म
रौक्म <i>a.</i> (-क्मी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Golden; रश्मीन् हयानां जग्राह रौक्मै रथशतैर्वृतः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 1. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौक्मिणेयः|रौक्मिणेय
रौक्मिणेयः N. of Pradyumna, son of Rukmiṇī; नान्यं हि प्रतियोद्धारं<BR> रौक्मिणेयादृते प्रभो Mb. 7. 111. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौक्ष्यम्
रौक्ष्यम्<BR>—1 Hardness, dryness, aridity.<BR>—2 Roughness, harshness, cruelty; प्रतिषेधरौक्ष्यम् R. 5. 58; निदेश˚ 14. 58.<BR>—3 Poverty; अकल्ककस्य विप्रस्य रौक्ष्यात् करकृतात्मनः Mb. 13. 23. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौचनिक
रौचनिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Yellowish; बृहतिकामिव रौचनिकीं रुचम् Ki. 5. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौचनिकम्
रौचनिक + .{@-कम्@} The tartar of the teeth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौच्यः|रौच्य
रौच्यः<BR>—1 A staff of Bilva wood.<BR>—2 An ascetic with a Bilva staff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौट्
रौट्(ड्) €1 P. (रौट(ड)ति) To despise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौड्
रौट्(ड्) €1 P. (रौट(ड)ति) To despise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौद्र|रौद्रं|रौद्रः
रौद्र <i>a.</i> (-द्रा, -द्री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [रुद्र-अण्]<BR>—1 ‘Rudra-like’, violent, irascible, wrathful.<BR>—2 Fierce, savage, terrible, wild.<BR>—3 Addressed to Rudra (as a hymn).<BR>—4 Bringing misfortune, calamitous.<BR>—5 Relating to Rudra; रौद्रं व्रतं समास्थाय नियतो नियतेन्द्रियः<BR> Rām. 7. 13. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौद्रः|रौद्र|रौद्रं
रौद्र + .{@-द्रः@}<BR>—1 A worshipper of Rudra.<BR>—2 Heat, ardour, warmth, passion, wrath.<BR>—3 The sentiment of wrath or furiousness; रौद्रः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">Page1352-1</a>]<BR> क्रोधस्थायिभावो रक्तो रुद्राधिदैवतः S. D. 232 or K. P. 4.<BR>—4 N. of Yama.<BR>—5 Winter.<BR>—6 N. of a संवत्सर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौद्रम्
रौद्र + .{@-द्रम्@}<BR>—1 Wrath, rage.<BR>—2 Formidableness, fierceness, savageness.<BR>—3 Heat, warmth; solar heat.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रौद्रकर्मन्, रौद्रदर्शन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1351-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौद्रकर्मन्
रौद्र + -कर्मन् <i>a.</i> doing dreadful acts. ━(<i>n.</i>) a terrible magic rite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौद्रदर्शन
रौद्र + -दर्शन <i>a.</i> frightful-looking, terrific.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौद्रता
रौद्रता Wild state, dreadfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौधिर
रौधिर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [रुधिर-अण्]<BR>—1 Bloody; समन्तपञ्चके पञ्च चकार रौधिरान् ह्रदान् Mb. 1. 2. 4.<BR>—2 Caused by blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौप्य|रौप्यं
रौप्य <i>a.</i> Made of silver, silver, like silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौप्यम्
रौप्य + .{@-प्यम्@} Silver.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: रौप्यमाषकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौप्यमाषकः|रौप्यमाषक
रौप्य + -माषकः a particular weight; द्वे कृष्णले समधृते विज्ञेयो रौप्यमाषकः Ms. 8. 135.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौमम्
रौमम् A kind of salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौमक|रौमकं
रौमक <i>a.</i> Roman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौमकम्
रौमक + .{@-कम्@} A kind of salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौरव|रौरवः
रौरव <i>a.</i> (-वी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Made of the hide of <i>Ruru</i>; त्वचं स मेध्यां परिधाय रौरवीम् R. 3. 31.<BR>—2 Dreadful, terrible.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-2" target="_blank">Page1352-2</a>]<BR>—3 Fraudulent, dishonest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौरवः|रौरव
रौरव + .{@-वः@}<BR>—1 A savage.<BR>—2 N. of one of the hells; Ms. 4. 88; रौरवे कूटसाक्षी तु याति यश्चानृतो<BR> नरः Mārk. P.; यदा रौरवादीन् स्मरन्नेव भीत्या Śaṅkara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौहिण|रौहिणं|रौहिणः
रौहिण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Born under the Nakṣatra Rohiṇī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौहिणः|रौहिण|रौहिणं
रौहिण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 The sandal tree.<BR>—2 The fig-tree; तमुवाच खगश्रेष्ठं तत्र रौहिणपादपः Mb. 1. 29. 42.<BR>—3 N. of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौहिणिकम्
रौहिणिकम् A jewel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौहिणेयः|रौहिणेय|रौहिणेयं
रौहिणेयः<BR>—1 A calf.<BR>—2 N. of Balarāma; अभिवाद्य स्थिता राजन् रौहिणेयं महाबलम् Mb. 9. 34. 11.<BR>—3 The planet Mercury.<BR>—4 The planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौहिणेयम्
रौहिणेयः + .{@-यम्@} An emerald.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौहिषः|रौहिष|रौहिषं
रौहिषः See रोहिष. [रोहति गिरिशृङ्गम् Uṇ. 1. 46]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौहिषम्
रौहिषः + .{@-षम्@} A kind of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौहिषी
रौहिषः + .{@-षी@}<BR>—1 A doe of the Rohīṣa kind.<BR>—2 A creeper.<BR>—3 A kind of Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रौही
रौही The female of रोही kind of deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लः|ल|लं
लः<BR>—1 An epithet of Indra.<BR>—2 A short syllable (in prosody).<BR>—3 A technical term used by Pāṇini for the ten tenses and moods (there<BR> being ten lakāras).<BR>—4 (In astr.) The number ‘50’; Gīrvāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्
लक् €10 U. (लाकयति-ते)<BR>—1 To taste.<BR>—2 To obtain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लकः|लक
लकः<BR>—1 The forehead.<BR>—2 An ear of wild rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लकचः|लकच
लकचः, लकुचः A kind of bread-fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लकुचः|लकुच
लकचः, लकुचः A kind of bread-fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लकचम्
लकचः, लकुचः + .{@-चम्@} The fruit of this tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लकुटः|लकुट
लकुटः A club, cudgel; cf. लगुड.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्तकः|लक्तक
लक्तकः<BR>—1 Lac.<BR>—2 A tattered cloth, a rag.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्तिका
लक्तिका A lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्
लक्ष् I. €1 Ā.<BR> (लक्षते, लक्षित) To perceive, apprehend, observe, see.<BR>━II. €10 U. (लक्षयति-ते, लक्षित) —1 To notice, observe, see, find, perceive;<BR> आर्यपुत्रः शून्यहृदय इव लक्ष्यते V. 2; R. 9. 72, 16. 7.<BR>—2 To mark, denote, characterize, indicate; सर्वभूतप्रसूतिर्हि बीजलक्षणलक्षिता Ms. 9. 35.<BR>—3 To define; इदानीं कारणं लक्षयति &c.<BR>—4 To indicate secondarily, mean or signify in a secondary sense; यथा<BR> गङ्गाशब्दः स्रोतसि सबाध इति तटं लक्षयति तद्वत् यदि तटेऽपि सबाधः<BR> स्यात्तत् प्रयोजनं लक्षयेत् K. P. 2; अत्र गोशब्दो वाहीकार्थं लक्षयति S. D. 2.<BR>—5 To aim at.<BR>—6 To consider, regard, think.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षम्
लक्षम् [लक्ष्-अच्]<BR>—1 One hundred thousand. (<i>m.</i> also in this sense); इच्छति शती सहस्रं<BR> सहस्री लक्षमीहते Subhāṣ.; त्रयो लक्षास्तु विज्ञेयाः Y. 3. 102.<BR>—2 A mark, butt,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a2" target="_blank">Page1352-a2</a>]<BR> aim, target; प्राप्नोत्याशु परं स्थानं लक्षं मुक्त इवाशुगः Mb. 12. 300. 37;<BR> प्रत्यक्षवदाकाशे लक्षं बद्ध्वा Mu. 1.<BR>—3 A sign, token, mark.<BR>—4 Show, pretence, fraud, disguise; लक्षसुप्तः स्थितोऽस्मि Dk. ‘feigning sleep’.<BR>—4 A pearl.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लक्षाधीशः, लक्षहोमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षाधीशः|लक्षाधीश
लक्षम् + -अधीशः a person possessing a <i>lac</i> or <i>lacs</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षहोमः|लक्षहोम
लक्षम् + -होमः a particular sacrifice offered to the planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षक|लक्षकं
लक्षक <i>a.</i> [लक्ष्-ण्वुल्] Indicating indirectly, expressing secondarily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षकम्
लक्षक + .{@-कम्@} One hundred thousand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणम्
लक्षणम् [लक्ष्यतेऽनेन लक्ष्-करणे ल्युट् Uṇ. 3. 8]<BR>—1 A mark, token, sign, indication, characteristic, distinctive mark;<BR> वधूदुकूलं कलहंसलक्षणम् Ku. 5. 67; अनारम्भो हि कार्याणां प्रथमं<BR> बुद्धिलक्षणम् Subhāṣ.; उपकारापकारौ हि लक्ष्यं लक्षणमेतयोः<BR> H. 4. 15; अव्याक्षेपो भविष्यन्त्याः कार्यसिद्धेर्हि लक्षणम् R. 10. 6, 19. 47;<BR> गर्भलक्षण Ś. 5; पुरुषलक्षणम् ‘the sign or organ of virility’.<BR>—2 A symptom (of a disease).<BR>—3 An attribute, a quality.<BR>—4 A definition, accurate description; असाधारणधर्मो लक्षणम्; नामधेयेन<BR> पदार्थमात्रस्याभिधानमुद्देशः, तत्रोद्दिष्टस्यातत्त्वव्यवच्छेदको धर्मो<BR> लक्षणम् Vātsyāyana Bhāṣya 1. 1. 2.<BR>—5 A lucky or auspicious mark on the body (these are considered to be 32);<BR> द्वात्रिंशल्लक्षणोपेतः; लक्षणसंपन्नान्नां गवामधः सस्नौ K. 64.<BR>—6 Any mark or features of the body (indicative of good or bad luck);<BR> क्व तद्विधस्त्वं क्व च पुण्यलक्षणा Ku. 5. 73; क्लेशावहा भर्तुरलक्षणाहम् R. 14. 5.<BR>—7 A name, designation, appellation (oft. at the end of comp.); विदिशालक्षणां<BR> राजधानीम् Me. 24.<BR>—8 Excellence, merit, good quality; as in आहितलक्षण R. 6. 71 (where<BR> Malli. renders it by प्रख्यातगुण and quotes<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">Page1353-1</a>]<BR> Ak.:− गुणैः प्रतीते तु कृतलक्षणाहितलक्षणौ).<BR>—9 An aim, a scope, an object.<BR>—10 A fixed rate (as of duties); नदीतीरेषु तद्विद्यात् समुद्रे नास्ति<BR> लक्षणम् Ms. 8. 406.<BR>—11 Form, kind, nature.<BR>—12 Effect, operation.<BR>—13 Cause, occasion.<BR>—14 Head, topic, subject.<BR>—15 Pretence, disguise (= लक्ष); प्रसुप्तलक्षणः Māl. 7.<BR>—16 A line, spot.<BR>—17 Observation, seeing.<BR>—18 Indicatory characteristic; लक्ष्यते येन तल्लक्षणम्, धूमो लक्षणमग्नेरिति<BR> हि वदन्ति ŚB. on MS. 1. 1. 2.<BR>—19 A chapter; धर्मो द्वादशलक्षण्या व्युत्पाद्यः.<BR>—20 A sexual organ; लक्षणं लक्षणेनैव वदनं वदनेन च Mb. 13. 40. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणः|लक्षण|लक्षणं
लक्षणम् + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 N. of Lakṣmaṇa.<BR>—2 The crane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणा
लक्षणम् + .{@-णा@}<BR>—1 An aim, object.<BR>—2 (In Rhet.) An indirect application or secondary signification of a<BR> word, one of the three powers of a word; it is thus defined:− मुख्यार्थबाधे<BR> तद्योगे रूढितोऽथ प्रयोजनात् । अन्योऽर्थो लक्ष्यते यत् सा लक्षणारोपिता<BR> क्रिया K. P. 2; लक्षणा शक्यसंबन्धस्तात्पर्यानुपपत्तितः Bhāṣā P.;<BR> see S. D. 13; also श्रुतिलक्षणाविषये च श्रुतिर्न्याथ्या न लक्षणा<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 2. 20; A. Rām. 7. 5. 26-27.<BR>—3 A goose.<BR>—4 N. of Duryodhanaʼs daughter.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लक्षणान्वित, लक्षणकर्मन्, लक्षणज्ञ, लक्षणभ्रष्ट, लक्षणलक्षणा, लक्षणसंनिपातः, लक्षणसंपद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1352-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणान्वित
लक्षणम् + -अन्वित <i>a.</i> possessed of auspicious marks; उद्वहेत द्विजो<BR> भार्यां सवर्णां लक्षणान्विताम् Ms. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणकर्मन्
लक्षणम् + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> definition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणज्ञ
लक्षणम् + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> able to interpret or explain marks (as on the body).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणभ्रष्ट
लक्षणम् + -भ्रष्ट <i>a.</i> deprived of good qualities, ill-fated, unlucky;<BR> जायन्ते लक्षणभ्रष्टा दरिद्राः पुरुषाधमाः Y. 3. 217.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणलक्षणा
लक्षणम् + -लक्षणा = जहल्लक्षणा q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणसंनिपातः|लक्षणसन्निपात
लक्षणम् + -संनिपातः branding, stigmatizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणसंपद्|लक्षणसम्पद्
लक्षणम् + -संपद् <i>f.</i> a multitude of marks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षणिन्
लक्षणिन् <i>a.</i> Possessing marks &c.; लक्षणिभ्यो द्विजातिभ्यः श्रुत्वाहं<BR> वचनं गृहे Rām. 2. 29. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षण्य|लक्षण्यः
लक्षण्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Serving as a mark.<BR>—2 Having good marks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षण्यः|लक्षण्य
लक्षण्य + .{@-ण्यः@} A diviner; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षशस्
लक्षशस् <i>ind.</i> By hundreds of thousands, <i>i. e.</i> in large numbers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षित|लक्षितः
लक्षित <i>p. p.</i> [लक्ष्-क्त]<BR>—1 Seen, observed, marked, beheld; यैः सादिता लक्षितपूर्वकेतून् R.<BR>—2 Denoted, indicated.<BR>—3 Characterized, marked, distinguished.<BR>—4 Defined.<BR>—5 Aimed at.<BR>—6 Indirectly expressed, indicated, hinted at.<BR>—7 Inquired into, examined.<BR>—8 Considered, regarded.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लक्षितलक्षणा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षितलक्षणा
लक्षित + -लक्षणा indication based on indication, indicative indication,<BR> a secondary indication; इतरथा रथन्तरसामनि अध्यवसीयमाने ऋचा पदं<BR> लक्ष्यते पदेन साम सैषा लक्षितलक्षणा स्यात् ŚB. on MS. 10. 5. 58.<BR> It should be observed that लक्षितलक्षणा is a दोष and hence inadmissible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षिन्
लक्षिन् <i>a.</i> (लक्षिणी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Having good marks or signs; लक्षिण्यो रत्नभूताश्च<BR> देवदानवरक्षसाम् Rām. 7. 25. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्षीकृ
लक्षीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To aim at, direct.<BR>—2 To point to, refer or allude to; इयं कथा मामेव लक्षीकरोति Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मण|लक्ष्मणं|लक्ष्मणः
लक्ष्मण <i>a.</i> [लक्ष्मन्-अण् न वृद्धिः]<BR>—1 Having marks.<BR>—2 Possessed of good or auspicious marks, fortunate, lucky.<BR>—3 Prosperous, thriving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मणः|लक्ष्मण|लक्ष्मणं
लक्ष्मण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 The crane.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-2" target="_blank">Page1353-2</a>]<BR>—2 N. of a son of Daśaratha by his wife Sumitrā. [He was so much attached<BR> to Rāma from his very childhood that he became ready to accompany him<BR> during his travels, and took no small part in the several events that<BR> took place during the fourteen years of Rāmaʼs exile. In the war of Laṅkā<BR> he killed several powerful demons, but particularly Meghanāda, the most<BR> heroic of the sons of Rāvaṇa. He was at first mortally wounded by Meghanāda<BR> by means of a magical weapon, but was restored to life by Suṣeṇa by<BR> means of the medicinal drugs fetched by Māruti. One day, Time in the disguise<BR> of a hermit came to Rāma and said that he who should happen to see them<BR> converse in private should be immediately abandoned, which was agreed<BR> to. Lakṣmaṇa on one occasion intruded on their privacy and made the word<BR> of his brother true by throwing himself into the Śarayū; (see R. 15. 92-95.).<BR> He married Ūrmilā by whom he had two sons, Aṅgada and Chandraketu.];<BR> अथ लक्ष्मणानुगतकान्तवपुः Śi. 9. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मणा
लक्ष्मण + .{@-णा@}<BR>—1 A goose (सारसा); ‘हंसस्य योषिद्वरटा सारसस्य तु लक्ष्मणा ।’<BR> Śi. 4. 59.<BR>—2 A kind of pot-herb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मणम्
लक्ष्मण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 A name, an appellation.<BR>—2 A mark, sign, token.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लक्ष्मणप्रसूः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मणप्रसूः
लक्ष्मण + -प्रसूः N. of Sumitrā, mother of Lakṣmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मन्
लक्ष्मन् <i>n.</i> [लक्ष्-मनिन्]<BR>—1 A mark, sign, token, characteristic; प्रकटमलिनलक्ष्मा मुष्टपत्रावलीकैः<BR> Śi. 11. 30, 8. 41; Ki. 11. 18, 14. 64; R. 19. 30; Ku. 7. 43.<BR>—2 A speck, spot; मलिनमपि हिमांशोर्लक्ष्म लक्ष्मीं तनोति Ś. 1. 20;<BR> Māl. 9. 25.<BR>—3 Definition.<BR>—4 The chief, principal (प्रधान); ‘लक्ष्म चिह्ने प्रधाने च’ इति<BR> विश्वः; शोकं दैन्यं च दुःखं च प्राजहात् पुत्रलक्ष्मणि Mb. 6. 14. 43.<BR>—5 A good or bad mark.<BR>—6 A pearl. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 The crane or Sārasa bird.<BR>—2 N. of Lakṣmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मी
लक्ष्मी <i>f.</i> [लक्ष्-ई मुट् च Uṇ. 3. 158, 160]<BR>—1 Fortune, prosperity, wealth; सा लक्ष्मीरुपकुरुते यया परेषाम् Ki. 8. 13;<BR> मातर्लक्ष्मि तव प्रसादवशतो दोषा अमी स्युर्गुणाः Subhāṣ.;<BR> Bh. 3. 64; तृणमिव लघुलक्ष्मीर्नैव तान् संरुणद्धि Bh. 2. 17.<BR>—2 Good fortune, good luck.<BR>—3 Success, accomplishment; U. 4. 10.<BR>—4 Beauty, loveliness, grace, charm, splendour; lustre; श्यामं सदापीच्यवयोऽङ्गलक्ष्म्या<BR> स्त्रीणां मनोज्ञं रुचिरस्मितेन Bhāg. 1. 19. 28; मलिनमपि हिमांशोर्लक्ष्म<BR> लक्ष्मीं तनोति Ś. 1. 20; U. 6. 24; Māl. 9. 25; लक्ष्मीमुवाह सकलस्य<BR> शशाङ्कमूर्तेः Ki. 2. 59, 5. 39, 52, 9. 2; Ku. 3. 49.<BR>—5 The goddess of fortune, prosperity and beauty, regarded as the wife<BR> of Viṣṇu. (She is said to have sprung from the ocean along with the<BR> other precious things or ‘jewels’ when it was churned for nectar by the<BR> gods and demons.); इयं गेहे लक्ष्मीः U. 1. 39; प्रत्यब्दं पूजयेल्लक्ष्मीं<BR> शुक्लपक्षे गुरोर्दिने । नापराह्णे न रात्रौ च नासिते न त्र्यहस्पृशि ॥ Skanda P.<BR>—6 Royal or sovereign power, dominion; (oft. personified as a wife of<BR> the king and regarded as a rival of the queen); तामेकभार्यां परिवादभीरोः<BR> साध्वीमपि त्यक्तवतो नृपस्य । वक्षस्यसंघट्टसुखं<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">Page1354-1</a>]<BR> वसन्ती रेजे सपत्नीरहितेव लक्ष्मीः ॥ R. 14. 86, 12. 26.<BR>—7 The wife of a hero.<BR>—8 A pearl.<BR>—9 N. of turmeric.<BR>—10 Superhuman power.<BR>—11 N. of the eleventh digit of the moon.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लक्ष्मीशः, लक्ष्मीकल्पः, लक्ष्मीकान्तः, लक्ष्मीगृहम्, लक्ष्मीतालः, लक्ष्मीनाथः, लक्ष्मीनिकेतनम्, लक्ष्मीनिरीक्षित, लक्ष्मीपतिः, लक्ष्मीपुत्रः, लक्ष्मीपुष्पः, लक्ष्मीपूजनम्, लक्ष्मीपूजा, लक्ष्मीफलः, लक्ष्मीरमणः, लक्ष्मीवसतिः, लक्ष्मीवारः, लक्ष्मीविवर्तः, लक्ष्मीवेष्टः, लक्ष्मीसखः, लक्ष्मीसनाथ, लक्ष्मीसहजः, लक्ष्मीसहोदरः, लक्ष्मीसमाह्वया<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1353-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीशः|लक्ष्मीश
लक्ष्मी + -ईशः<BR>—1 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 the mango tree.<BR>—3 a prosperous or fortunate man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीकल्पः|लक्ष्मीकल्प
लक्ष्मी + -कल्पः a particular period of time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीकान्तः|लक्ष्मीकान्त|लक्ष्मीकांत
लक्ष्मी + -कान्तः<BR>—1 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीगृहम्
लक्ष्मी + -गृहम् the red lotus-flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीतालः|लक्ष्मीताल
लक्ष्मी + -तालः<BR>—1 a kind of palm.<BR>—2 (in music) a kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीनाथः|लक्ष्मीनाथ
लक्ष्मी + -नाथः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीनिकेतनम्
लक्ष्मी + -निकेतनम् the bathing with fragrant myrobalan powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीनिरीक्षित
लक्ष्मी + -निरीक्षित <i>a.</i> favoured by Lakṣmī, rich; लक्ष्मीनिरीक्षिताः<BR> क्षिप्रं भजन्ते चक्रवर्तिताम् Bm. 1. 676.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीपतिः|लक्ष्मीपति
लक्ष्मी + -पतिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 a king; विहाय लक्ष्मीपतिलक्ष्म कार्मुकम् Ki. 1. 44.<BR>—3 the betel-nut tree.<BR>—4 the clove tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीपुत्रः|लक्ष्मीपुत्र|लक्ष्मीपुत्त्रः
लक्ष्मी + -पुत्रः<BR>—1 a horse.<BR>—2 N. of Kuśa and Lava.<BR>—3 N. of Cupid or Kāma.<BR>—4 a wealthy man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीपुष्पः|लक्ष्मीपुष्प
लक्ष्मी + -पुष्पः a ruby.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीपूजनम्
लक्ष्मी + -पूजनम् the ceremony of worshipping Lakṣmī (performed by the<BR> bridegroom in company with his bride after she has been brought home).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीपूजा
लक्ष्मी + -पूजा the worship of Lakṣmī performed on the day of newmoon<BR> in the month of Āśvina (chiefly by bankers and traders whose commercial<BR> or official year closes on that day).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीफलः|लक्ष्मीफल
लक्ष्मी + -फलः the <i>Bilva</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीरमणः|लक्ष्मीरमण
लक्ष्मी + -रमणः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीवसतिः|लक्ष्मीवसति
लक्ष्मी + -वसतिः <i>f.</i> ‘Lakṣmīʼs abode’, the red lotus-flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीवारः|लक्ष्मीवार
लक्ष्मी + -वारः Thursday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीविवर्तः|लक्ष्मीविवर्त
लक्ष्मी + -विवर्तः change of fortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीवेष्टः|लक्ष्मीवेष्ट
लक्ष्मी + -वेष्टः turpentine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीसखः|लक्ष्मीसख
लक्ष्मी + -सखः a favourite of Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीसनाथ
लक्ष्मी + -सनाथ <i>a.</i> endowed with beauty or fortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीसहजः|लक्ष्मीसहज
लक्ष्मी + -सहजः, -सहोदरः<BR>—1 epithets of the moon.<BR>—2 camphor.<BR>—3 N. of the horse of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीसहोदरः|लक्ष्मीसहोदर
लक्ष्मी + -सहजः, -सहोदरः<BR>—1 epithets of the moon.<BR>—2 camphor.<BR>—3 N. of the horse of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीसमाह्वया
लक्ष्मी + -समाह्वया N. of Sītā; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्मीवत्|लक्ष्मीवन्त्
लक्ष्मीवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Possessed of good fortune, fortunate, lucky.<BR>—2 Wealthy, rich, thriving; लक्ष्मीवन्तो न जानन्ति प्रायेण परवेदनाम् Udb.<BR>—3 Handsome, lovely, beautiful. ━<i>m.</i> The bread-fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्य|लक्ष्यं|लक्ष्यः
लक्ष्य <i>pot. p.</i> [लक्ष्-यत्]<BR>—1 To be looked at or observed, visible, observable, perceptible; बभ्रमुस्तदविज्ञाय<BR> लक्ष्यं पतनकारणम् Bhāg. 10. 11. 2; दुर्लक्ष्यचिह्ना महतां हि<BR> वृत्तिः Ki. 17. 23.<BR>—2 Indicated or recognizable by (with instr. or in comp.); दूराल्लक्ष्यं<BR> सुरपतिधनुश्चारुणा तोरणेन Me. 77; प्रवेपमानाधरलक्ष्यकोपया<BR> Ku. 5. 74; R. 4. 5, 7. 60.<BR>—3 To be known or found out, traceable; यमामनन्त्यात्मभुवोऽपि कारणं<BR> कथं स लक्ष्यप्रभवो भविष्यति Ku. 5. 81; cf. अलक्ष्य also.<BR>—4 To be marked or characterized.<BR>—5 To be defined.<BR>—6 To be aimed at.<BR>—7 To be expressed or denoted indirectly.<BR>—8 To be regarded or considered as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्यः|लक्ष्य|लक्ष्यं
लक्ष्य + .{@-क्ष्यः@} N. of a magical formula recited over weapons; Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्यम्
लक्ष्य + .{@-क्ष्यम्@}<BR>—1 An aim, a butt, mark, target, mark aimed at (fig. also); उत्कर्षः<BR> स च धन्विनां यदिषवः सिध्यन्ति लक्ष्ये चले Ś. 2. 5; दृष्टिं लक्ष्येषु<BR> बध्नन् Mu. 1. 2; दर्पेण कौतुकवता मयि बद्धलक्ष्यः U. 5. 11;<BR> R. 1. 61, 6. 11, 9. 67; Ku. 3. 47, 64, 5. 49; लक्ष्यं चतुर्विधं ज्ञेयं<BR> स्थिरं चैव चलं तथा । चलाचलं द्वयचलं वेधनीयं क्रमेण तु ॥ Dhanur. 94.<BR>—2 A sign, token.<BR>—3 The thing defined (opp. लक्षण); लक्ष्यैकदेशे लक्षणस्यावर्तनमव्याप्तिः Tarka K.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-2" target="_blank">Page1354-2</a>]<BR>—4 An indirect or secondary meaning, that derived from लक्षणा q. v.;<BR> वाच्यलक्ष्यव्यङ्ग्या अर्थाः K. P. 2.<BR>—5 A pretence, sham, disguise; इदानीं परीक्षे किं लक्ष्यसुप्तमुत परमार्थसुप्तमिदं<BR> द्वयम् Mk. 3, 3. 18; कन्दर्पप्रवणमनाः सखीसिसिक्षालक्ष्येण प्रतियुवमञ्जलिं<BR> चकार Śi. 8. 35; R. 6. 81.<BR>—6 A lac, one hundred thousand.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लक्ष्याभिहरणम्, लक्ष्यालक्ष्य, लक्ष्यक्रम,^1 लक्ष्यग्रहः, लक्ष्यभेदः, लक्ष्यवेधः, लक्ष्यवीथिः, लक्ष्यसिद्धिः, लक्ष्यसुप्त, लक्ष्यहन्<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्याभिहरणम्
लक्ष्य + -अभिहरणम् the carrying off of a prize.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्यालक्ष्य
लक्ष्य + -अलक्ष्य <i>a.</i> scarcely visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लक्ष्यक्रम
लक्ष्य + -क्रम^1 <i>a.</i> the method or order of which is (indirectly) preceptible,<BR> as a <i>dhvani</i>.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

