लग्नकालः|लग्नकाल
लग्न + -कालः, -मुहूर्तः, -वेला, -समयः auspicious time,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1355-1" target="_blank">Page1355-1</a>]<BR> the time fixed upon (by astrologers &c.) as auspicious for the performance<BR> of any work (marriage &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1354-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

