लघु + -सत्त्व <i>a.</i> weak or fickle-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1355-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघुसमुत्थान
लघु + -समुत्थान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 rising quickly.<BR>—2 swift of foot; अलघुना लघुसमुत्थानेन सैन्यचक्रेणाभ्यसरम् Dk. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1355-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघुसार
लघु + -सार <i>a.</i> worthless, insignificant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1355-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघुहस्त|लघुहस्तः
लघु + -हस्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 light-handed, clever, dexterous, expert; शिक्षाविशेषलघुहस्ततया<BR> निमेषात् तूणीचकार शरपूरितवक्त्ररन्ध्रान् R. 9. 63.<BR>—2 active, agile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1355-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघुहस्तः|लघुहस्त
लघु + -हस्त + .({@-स्तः@}) an expert or skilful archer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1355-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघयति
लघयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To make light, lighten (lit.); नितान्तगुर्वीं लघयिष्यता धुरम् R. 3. 35.<BR>—2 To alleviate, lighten, lessen, mitigate; रहसि लघयेदारब्धा वा<BR> तदाश्रयिणी कथा V. 3. 10; R. 11. 62.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To make light of, slight, despise; लघयन् खलु तेजसा जगत् Ki. 2. 18.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To make inferior or insignificant; लघयता शरदम्बुदसंहतिम्<BR> Ki. 5. 4, 13. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1355-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघिमन्
लघिमन् <i>m.</i> [लघोर्भावः इमनिच् डिच्च]<BR>—1 Lightness, absence of weight.<BR>—2 Littleness, smallness, insignificance.<BR>—3 Lightness, levity, lowness or meanness of spirit; मानुषतासुलभो<BR> लघिमा प्रश्नकर्मणि मां नियोजयति K.<BR>—4 Thoughtlessness, frivolity.<BR>—5 The supernatural power of assuming excessive lightness at will, one<BR> of the eight <i>Siddhis</i> q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1355-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघिष्ठ|लघिष्ठः
लघिष्ठ <i>a.</i> Lightest, lowest, very light &c. (superl. of लघु q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1355-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघीयस्
लघीयस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Lighter, lower, very light &c.; (compar. of लघु q. v.).<BR>—2 Involving less labour, less laborious; अदृष्टार्थच्छन्दवृत्तिर्लघीयसी<BR> ŚB. on MS. 11. 1. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघुता
लघुता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Lightness, levity.<BR>—2 Smallness, littleness.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Insignificance, unimportance, contempt, absence of dignity; इन्द्रोऽपि<BR> लघुतां याति स्वयं प्रख्यापितैर्गुणैः<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Obscurity of birth, humbleness of origin.<BR>—4 Dishonour, disrespect; लघुत्वं याति सर्वतः Pt. 1. 140; येन<BR> स्याल्लघुता … … तत्कर्म न कुर्यात् कुलसेवकः 353.<BR>—5 Activity, quickness.<BR>—6 Shortness, brevity.<BR>—7 Ease, facility.<BR>—8 Thoughtlessness, frivolity.<BR>—9 Wantonness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघुत्वम्
लघुता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Lightness, levity.<BR>—2 Smallness, littleness.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Insignificance, unimportance, contempt, absence of dignity; इन्द्रोऽपि<BR> लघुतां याति स्वयं प्रख्यापितैर्गुणैः<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Obscurity of birth, humbleness of origin.<BR>—4 Dishonour, disrespect; लघुत्वं याति सर्वतः Pt. 1. 140; येन<BR> स्याल्लघुता … … तत्कर्म न कुर्यात् कुलसेवकः 353.<BR>—5 Activity, quickness.<BR>—6 Shortness, brevity.<BR>—7 Ease, facility.<BR>—8 Thoughtlessness, frivolity.<BR>—9 Wantonness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघूकृ
लघूकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To despise, think meanly of, slight.<BR>—2 To make light, reduce in weight.<BR>—3 To lessen, shorten (days).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघूकृत
लघूकृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Despised, condemned, slighted.<BR>—2 Lessened, abbreviated, shortened.<BR>—3 Reduced in weight or importance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लघ्वी
लघ्वी<BR>—1 A delicate woman,<BR>—2 A light carriage; ‘लघ्वी लाघवयुक्तानां प्रभेदे स्यन्दनस्य च’ इति<BR> हैमः; लघ्वीं करभौ बभञ्जतुः. ━<i>a.</i> short; लघ्वी पुरा वृद्धिमती<BR> च पश्चात् Bh.; Śi. 12. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्
लङ् A technical term used by Pāṇini to denote the Imperfect tense<BR> or its terminations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्का|लंका
लङ्का [लक्-अच् मुम् च]<BR>—1 N. of the capital and residence of Rāvaṇa and identified with the<BR> island of Ceylon or the chief town in it; according to some Laṅkā was<BR> much larger than the present island of Ceylon. It was originally built<BR> for Mālyavat q. v.; विजेतव्या लङ्का चरणतरणीयो जलनिधिः Udb.<BR>—2 An unchaste woman, a prostitute, harlot.<BR>—3 A branch.<BR>—4 A kind of grain. (Mar. लांक).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लङ्काधिपः, लङ्काधिपतिः, लङ्केशः, लङ्केश्वरः, लङ्कानाथः, लङ्कापतिः, लङ्कारिः, लङ्कोदयः, लङ्कादाहिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्काधिपः|लङ्काधिप
लङ्का + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः, -नाथः, -पतिः ‘lord of Laṅkā’;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> Rāvaṇa or Bibhīṣaṇa लङ्कानाथं पवनतनयं चोभयं<BR> स्थापयित्वा कीर्तिस्तम्भद्वयमिव गिरौ दक्षिणे चोत्तरे च R. 15. 103; लङ्केशसंपूजितपादपद्मः<BR> पायादनादिः परमेश्वरो नः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्काधिपतिः|लङ्काधिपति|लंकाधिपति
लङ्का + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः, -नाथः, -पतिः ‘lord of Laṅkā’;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> Rāvaṇa or Bibhīṣaṇa लङ्कानाथं पवनतनयं चोभयं<BR> स्थापयित्वा कीर्तिस्तम्भद्वयमिव गिरौ दक्षिणे चोत्तरे च R. 15. 103; लङ्केशसंपूजितपादपद्मः<BR> पायादनादिः परमेश्वरो नः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्केशः|लङ्केश|लंकेश
लङ्का + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः, -नाथः, -पतिः ‘lord of Laṅkā’;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> Rāvaṇa or Bibhīṣaṇa लङ्कानाथं पवनतनयं चोभयं<BR> स्थापयित्वा कीर्तिस्तम्भद्वयमिव गिरौ दक्षिणे चोत्तरे च R. 15. 103; लङ्केशसंपूजितपादपद्मः<BR> पायादनादिः परमेश्वरो नः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्केश्वरः|लङ्केश्वर|लंकेश्वर
लङ्का + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः, -नाथः, -पतिः ‘lord of Laṅkā’;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> Rāvaṇa or Bibhīṣaṇa लङ्कानाथं पवनतनयं चोभयं<BR> स्थापयित्वा कीर्तिस्तम्भद्वयमिव गिरौ दक्षिणे चोत्तरे च R. 15. 103; लङ्केशसंपूजितपादपद्मः<BR> पायादनादिः परमेश्वरो नः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्कानाथः|लङ्कानाथ|लंकानाथ
लङ्का + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः, -नाथः, -पतिः ‘lord of Laṅkā’;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> Rāvaṇa or Bibhīṣaṇa लङ्कानाथं पवनतनयं चोभयं<BR> स्थापयित्वा कीर्तिस्तम्भद्वयमिव गिरौ दक्षिणे चोत्तरे च R. 15. 103; लङ्केशसंपूजितपादपद्मः<BR> पायादनादिः परमेश्वरो नः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्कापतिः|लङ्कापति|लंकापति
लङ्का + -अधिपः, -अधिपतिः, -ईशः, -ईश्वरः, -नाथः, -पतिः ‘lord of Laṅkā’;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> Rāvaṇa or Bibhīṣaṇa लङ्कानाथं पवनतनयं चोभयं<BR> स्थापयित्वा कीर्तिस्तम्भद्वयमिव गिरौ दक्षिणे चोत्तरे च R. 15. 103; लङ्केशसंपूजितपादपद्मः<BR> पायादनादिः परमेश्वरो नः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्कारिः|लङ्कारि|लंकारि
लङ्का + -अरिः an epithet of Rāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्कोदयः|लङ्कोदय
लङ्का + -उदयः the equivalents of the signs in right ascension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्कादाहिन्|लंकादाहिन्
लङ्का + -दाहिन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Hanumat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्खनी|लंखनी
लङ्खनी The bit of a bridle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्ग्|लंग्
लङ्ग् €1 P. (लङ्गति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To go lame, limp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्गः|लङ्ग|लंग|लंगः
लङ्गः<BR>—1 Lameness.<BR>—2 Union, association.<BR>—3 A lover, paramour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्गकः|लङ्गक|लंगक|लंगकः
लङ्गकः A lover, paramour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्गनी
लङ्गनी A stick or rope on which to hang clothes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्गलम्
लङ्गलम् A plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्गिमन्
लङ्गिमन् <i>m.</i> [लगेः इमनिच्]<BR>—1 Beauty; कियदवयवैरेषामालिङ्गिताङ्गुलिलङ्गिमा N. 19. 53.<BR>—2 Union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्गूलम्
लङ्गूलम् The tail of an animal; cf. लाङ्गूल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्घ्|लंघ्
लङ्घ् €1 U. (लङ्घति-ते, लङ्घित; <i>desid.</i> लिलङ्घिषति-ते)<BR>—1 To spring, leap, go by leaps.<BR>—2 To mount upon, ascend; अन्ये चालङ्घिषुः शैलान् Bk. 15. 32.<BR>—3 To go beyond, transgress; लङ्घते स्म मुनिरेष विमानान् N. 5. 4.<BR>—4 To fast, abstain from food.<BR>—5 To dry, dry up (P.).<BR>—6 To diminish, lessen.<BR>—7 To seize upon, attack, eat up, injure; पल्लवान् हरिणो लङ्घितुमागच्छति<BR> M. 4. ━<i>Caus.</i> or €10 U. (लङ्घयति-ते)<BR>—1 To leap or spring over, go beyond; सागरः प्लवगेन्द्रेण क्रमेणैकेन<BR> लङ्घितः Mb.; Ms. 4. 38.<BR>—2 To pass over, traverse (as distance); अपि लङ्घितमध्वानं बुबुधे<BR> न बुधोपमः R. 1. 47.<BR>—3 To mount upon, ascend; नितम्बमिव मेदिन्याः स्रस्तांशुकमलङ्घयत् R. 4. 52.<BR>—4 To violate, transgress, disobey; स हि निदेशमलङ्घयतामभूत् सुहृदयोहृदयः<BR> प्रतिगर्जताम् R. 9. 9; Y. 2. 187.<BR>—5 To offend, insult, disrespect, disregard; हस्त इव भूतिमलिनो यथा<BR> यथा लङ्घयति खलः सुजनम् । दर्पणमिव तं कुरुते तथा तथा निर्मलच्छायम् ॥ Vās.<BR>—6 To prevent, oppose, stop, avoid, avert; भाग्यं न लङ्घयति कोऽपि<BR> विधिप्रणीतम् Subhāṣ.; Mk. 6. 2.<BR>—7 To attack, seize upon, injure, hurt; एषा खलु केसरिणी त्वां लङ्घयति<BR> Ś. 7; नास्ति खलु विधेरलङ्घनीयम् V. 4; R. 11. 92.<BR>—8 To eat, browse.<BR>—9 To excel, surpass, outshine, eclipse; (यशः) जगत्प्रकाशं तदशेषमिज्यया<BR> भवद्गुरुर्लङ्घयितुं ममोद्यतः R. 3. 48.<BR>—10 To cause to fast.<BR>—11 To shine.<BR>—12 To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्घक|लंघक
लङ्घक <i>a.</i> Ved. A transgressor, violator, offender &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्घनम्
लङ्घनम् [लङ्घ्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Leaping, jumping.<BR>—2 Going by leaps, traversing, passing over, going, motion in general;<BR> यूयमेव पथि शीघ्रलङ्घनाः Ghaṭ. 8.<BR>—3 Mounting, ascending, rising up to (fig. also); नभोलङ्घन R. 16. 33;<BR> जनोऽयमुच्चैःपदलङ्घनोत्सुकः Ku. 5. 64 ‘wishing to attain or aspire to a high position’<BR>.<BR>—4 Assaulting, storming, capturing; as in दुर्गलङ्घनम्.<BR>—5 Exceeding, going beyond, overstepping, violating, transgression; आज्ञालङ्घनम्,<BR> नियमलङ्घनम् &c.<BR>—6 Disregarding, despising, treating with contempt, slighting; प्रणिपातलङ्घनं<BR> प्रमार्ष्टुकामा V. 3; M. 3. 22.<BR>—7 An offence, affront, insult.<BR>—8 A harm, an injury; as in आतपलङ्घनम् q. v.<BR>—9 Fasting, abstinence; प्रचक्रमे लङ्घनपूर्वकं क्रमः Śi. 12. 25<BR> (where it menans ‘leaping’ also).<BR>—10 One of the paces of a horse.<BR>—11 Sexual union, impregnating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्घनीय|लंघनीय
लङ्घनीय, लङ्घ्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be traversed or passed over, passable.<BR>—2 To be violated.<BR>—3 To be overtaken; आत्मोद्धतैरपि रजोभिरलङ्घनीयाः Ś. 1. 8.<BR>—4 To be neglected, or disregarded; मृदुर्हि राजा सततं लङ्घ्यो भवति<BR> सर्वशः Mb. 12. 56. 21.<BR>—5 To be fasted; see लङ्घ्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्घ्य|लंघ्य
लङ्घनीय, लङ्घ्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be traversed or passed over, passable.<BR>—2 To be violated.<BR>—3 To be overtaken; आत्मोद्धतैरपि रजोभिरलङ्घनीयाः Ś. 1. 8.<BR>—4 To be neglected, or disregarded; मृदुर्हि राजा सततं लङ्घ्यो भवति<BR> सर्वशः Mb. 12. 56. 21.<BR>—5 To be fasted; see लङ्घ्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लङ्घित|लंघित
लङ्घित <i>p. p.</i> [लङ्घ्-क्त]<BR>—1 Lept over, passed over.<BR>—2 Traversed.<BR>—3 Transgressed, violated.<BR>—4 Disregarded, insulted, disrespected.<BR>—5 Attacked, seized, afflicted; लङ्घित एष भूयोऽपि शकुन्तलाव्याधिना Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लछ्|लच्छ्
लछ् €1 P. (लच्छति) To mark, see; cf. लक्ष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्
लज् €1. €6. Ā. (लजते) To be ashamed. ━II. €1 P. (लजति)<BR> To blame &c.; see लञ्ज् I. ━III. €10 P. (लजयति)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">Page1357-1</a>]<BR>—1 To seem, appear, shine.<BR>—2 To cover, conceal; (according to some लाजयति also in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1356-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्ज्
लज्ज् €6 Ā. (लज्जते, लज्जित) To be ashamed, to blush; cf. लस्ज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जका
लज्जका The wild cotton-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जरी
लज्जरी A white sensitive plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जा
लज्जा [लज्ज् भावे अ]<BR>—1 Shame; कामातुराणां न भयं न लज्जा Subhāṣ.; विहाय लज्जाम्<BR> R. 2. 40; Ku. 1. 48.<BR>—2 Bashfulness, modesty; शृङ्गारलज्जां निरूपयति Ś. 1; Ku. 3. 7;<BR> R. 7. 35; लज्जे त्वं मज्ज सिन्धौ Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 N. of the sensitive plant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लज्जान्वित, लज्जावह, लज्जाकर, लज्जाकृतिः, लज्जाशील, लज्जारहित, लज्जाशून्य, लज्जाहीन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जान्वित
लज्जा + -अन्वित <i>a.</i> modest, bashful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जावह
लज्जा + -आवह, -कर <i>a.</i> (-रा or री <i>f.</i>)<BR> causing shame, shameful, digraceful,<BR> ignominious; सर्वमलज्जाकरमिह यत् कुर्वन्तीह परिपूर्णाः Pt. 5. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जाकर
लज्जा + -आवह, -कर <i>a.</i> (-रा or री <i>f.</i>)<BR> causing shame, shameful, digraceful,<BR> ignominious; सर्वमलज्जाकरमिह यत् कुर्वन्तीह परिपूर्णाः Pt. 5. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जाकृतिः|लज्जाकृति
लज्जा + -कृतिः feigning modesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जाशील|लज्जाशीलः
लज्जा + -शील <i>a.</i> bashful, modest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जारहित
लज्जा + -रहित, -शून्य, -हीन <i>a.</i> shameless, impudent, immodest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जाशून्य
लज्जा + -रहित, -शून्य, -हीन <i>a.</i> shameless, impudent, immodest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जाहीन
लज्जा + -रहित, -शून्य, -हीन <i>a.</i> shameless, impudent, immodest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जालु|लज्जालुः
लज्जालु <i>a.</i> Modest, bashful. ━<i>m., f.</i> N. of the sensitive plant<BR> (also लज्जिरी); लज्जालुः स्यात् शमीपत्रा समङ्गाञ्जलिकारिका । रक्तपादी<BR> नमस्कारी नाम्ना खादरकेत्यपि ॥ लज्जालुः शीतला तिक्ता कषाया कफपित्तजित् ।<BR> रक्तपित्तमतीसारं योनिरोगं विनाशयेत् ॥ Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जावत्|लज्जावन्त्
लज्जावत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Bashful, modest.<BR>—2 Embarrassed, perplexed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जित|लज्जितः
लज्जित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Modest, bashful.<BR>—2 Ashamed, abashed<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्जितम्
लज्जित + .{@-तम्@} A bashful act; इत्युपालभत संभुजिक्रियारम्भविघ्नघनलज्जितैर्जितम् N. 18. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लज्या
लज्या = लज्जा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लञ्चा|लंचा
लञ्चा A present, bribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लञ्ज्|लंज्
लञ्ज् I. €1 P. (लञ्जति)<BR>—1 To blame, censure, traduce.<BR>—2 To roast, fry. ━II. €10 U. (लञ्जयति-ते)<BR>—1 To injure, strike, kill.<BR>—2 To give.<BR>—3 To speak.<BR>—4 To be strong or powerful.<BR>—5 To dwell.<BR>—6 To shine.<BR>—7 To be manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लञ्जः|लञ्ज|लंज|लंजः
लञ्जः [लञ्ज्-अच्]<BR>—1 A foot.<BR>—2 The end of a lower garment tucked into the waist-band; cf. कक्षा.<BR>—3 A tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लञ्जा
लञ्जा<BR>—1 A current.<BR>—2 An adulteress.<BR>—3 N. of Lakṣmī.<BR>—4 Sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लञ्जिका|लंजिका
लञ्जिका A prostitute, harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्
लट् P.<BR>—1 (लटति) To be a child,<BR>—2 To act like a child.<BR>—3 To talk like a child, prattle.<BR>—4 To cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्
लट् A technical term used by Pāṇini to denote the Present tense<BR> or its terminations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लटः|लट
लटः<BR>—1 A fool, blockhead.<BR>—2 A fault, defect.<BR>—3 A robber.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लटपर्णम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लटपर्णम्
लटः + -पर्णम् large cinnamon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लटकः|लटक
लटकः A cheat, rogue, rascal, villain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लटभ
लटभ <i>a.</i> (Connected with the Prākṛta लडह which appears<BR> to be derived from it) Charming, handsome, beautiful, attractive, lovely;<BR> अतिक्रान्तः कालो लटभललनाभोगसुलभः Bh. 3. 32 (where commentators<BR> render लटभ by सलावण्य); तस्याः पादनखश्रेणिः शोभते लटभभ्रुवः<BR> Vikr. 8. 6. Bilhaṇa has used this word in three more places of the same<BR> book, where it appears to mean ‘a young pretty woman’, ‘a handsome woman’;<BR> <i>e. g.</i> किं वा वर्णनया समस्तलटभालंकारतामेष्यति 8. 86; अनर्ध्यलावण्यनिधानभूमिर्न<BR> कस्य लोभं लटभा तनोति 9. 68; केशबन्धविभवैर्लटभानां पिण्डतामिव<BR> जगाम तमिस्रम् 11. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लटह
लटह, लडह <i>a.</i> Beautiful, handsome (a Prākṛta word);<BR> see लटभ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लडह|लडहः
लटह, लडह <i>a.</i> Beautiful, handsome (a Prākṛta word);<BR> see लटभ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्टः|लट्ट
लट्टः A rogue, rascal; see लटक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्वः|लट्व
लट्वः [लटेः क्वन् Uṇ. 1. 140]<BR>—1 A horse.<BR>—2 A dancing boy.<BR>—3 N. of a Rāga in music.<BR>—4 N. of a caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्वा
लट्वः + .{@-ट्वा@}<BR>—1 A kind of bird.<BR>—2 A curl on the forehead.<BR>—3 A sparrow.<BR>—4 A kind of musical instrument.<BR>—5 A game.<BR>—6 Safflower.<BR>—7 An unchaste woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लट्वाका
लट्वाका A kind of bird; न त्वं स्मरसि वारुण्या लट्वाकानां च पक्षिणाम्<BR> Mb. 12. 180. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लड्
लड् I. €1 P. (लडति) To play, sport, dally.<BR>━II. €1 P., €10 P. (लडति, लडयति)<BR>—1 To throw, toss.<BR>—2 To blame.<BR>—3 To loll the tongue.<BR>—4 To harass, annoy.<BR>━III. €10 U. (लाडयति-ते) —1 To fondle, caress.<BR>—2 To annoy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लड्ड|लड्डः
लड्ड = लटक q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लड्डुः|लड्डु
लड्डुः, लड्डुकः A kind of sweetmeat (a round ball of sugar,<BR> wheat or rice-flour, ghee, and spices).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लड्डुकः|लड्डुक
लड्डुः, लड्डुकः A kind of sweetmeat (a round ball of sugar,<BR> wheat or rice-flour, ghee, and spices).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लण्ड्|लंड्
लण्ड् €1 P., €10 U. (लण्डति, लण्डयति-ते)<BR>—1 To toss upwards, throw up.<BR>—2 To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लण्डम्
लण्डम् Excrement, ordure. See लेण्ड.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लण्ड्रः|लण्ड्र|लंड्र|लंड्रः
लण्ड्रः London (a modern formation, probably from French <i>Londres</i>).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लता
लता [लत्-अच्]<BR>—1 A creeper, creeping plant; लताभावेन परिणतमस्या रूपम् V. 4;<BR> लतेव संनद्धमनोज्ञपल्लवा R. 3. 7 (often used as the last member<BR> of compounds, especially with words meaning ‘arm’, ‘eyebrow’, ‘lightning’,<BR> to denote beauty, tenderness, thinness &c.; भुजलता, बाहुलता, भ्रूलता,<BR> विद्युल्लता); so खड्ग˚, अलक˚, &c.; cf. Ku. 2. 64; Me. 49; Ś. 3. 14;<BR> R. 9. 46.<BR>—2 A branch; मधुसुरभिणि षट्पदेन पुष्पे मुख इव शाललतावधूश्चुचुम्बे<BR> Ki. 10. 34; Rām. 2. 80. 6.<BR>—3 The creeper called <i>Priyaṅgu</i>.<BR>—4 The Mādhavī creeper.<BR>—5 Musk-creeper.<BR>—6 A whip or the lash of a whip.<BR>—7 A string of pearls.<BR>—8 A slender woman.<BR>—9 A woman in general.<BR>—10 The Dūrvā grass.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लताङ्गुलिः, लतान्तम्, लताम्बुजम्, लतार्कः, लतालकः, लताननः, लतोद्गमः, लताकरः, लताकस्तूरिका, लताकस्तूरी, लतागृहः, लतागृहम्, लताजिह्वः, लतारसनः, लतातरुः, लताद्रुमः, लतापनसः, लतापर्णः, लताप्रतानः, लताभवनम्, लतामणिः, लतामण्डपः, लतामृगः, लतायष्टिः, लतायावकम्, लतारदः, लतावलयः, लतायम्, लतावृक्षः, लतावेष्टः, लतावेष्टनम्, लतावेष्टितकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लताङ्गुलिः|लताङ्गुलि
लता + -अङ्गुलिः <i>f.</i> a branch serving as a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">Page1358-1</a>]<BR> finger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1357-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतान्तम्
लता + -अन्तम् a flower. ˚बाणः the god of love; लतान्तबाणबाणलक्ष्यतामयासिषम् Dk. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लताम्बुजम्
लता + -अम्बुजम् a kind of cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतार्कः|लतार्क
लता + -अर्कः a green onion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतालकः|लतालक
लता + -अलकः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लताननः|लतानन
लता + -आननः a particular position of the hands in dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतोद्गमः|लतोद्गम
लता + -उद्गमः the upward winding or climbing of a creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लताकरः|लताकर
लता + -करः a particular position of the hands in dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लताकस्तूरिका
लता + -कस्तूरिका, -कस्तूरी musk-creeper; लताकस्तूरिका तिक्ता हृद्या<BR> शीतास्यरोगहृत् Rājavallabha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लताकस्तूरी
लता + -कस्तूरिका, -कस्तूरी musk-creeper; लताकस्तूरिका तिक्ता हृद्या<BR> शीतास्यरोगहृत् Rājavallabha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतागृहः|लतागृह
लता + -गृहः, -गृहम् a bower surrounded with creepers, an arbour; लतागृहद्वारगतो<BR> ऽथ नन्दी Ku. 3. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतागृहम्
लता + -गृहः, -गृहम् a bower surrounded with creepers, an arbour; लतागृहद्वारगतो<BR> ऽथ नन्दी Ku. 3. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लताजिह्वः|लताजिह्व
लता + -जिह्वः, -रसनः a snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतारसनः|लतारसन
लता + -जिह्वः, -रसनः a snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतातरुः|लतातरु
लता + -तरुः, -द्रुमः<BR>—1 the Sāla tree.<BR>—2 the Tāla tree.<BR>—3 the orange tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लताद्रुमः|लताद्रुम
लता + -तरुः, -द्रुमः<BR>—1 the Sāla tree.<BR>—2 the Tāla tree.<BR>—3 the orange tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतापनसः|लतापनस
लता + -पनसः the water-melon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतापर्णः|लतापर्ण
लता + -पर्णः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लताप्रतानः|लताप्रतान
लता + -प्रतानः the tendril of a creeper; लताप्रतानोद्ग्रथितैः स<BR> केशैरधिज्यधन्वा विचचार दावम् R. 2. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लताभवनम्
लता + -भवनम् an arbour, a bower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतामणिः|लतामणि
लता + -मणिः coral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतामण्डपः|लतामण्डप|लतामंडप
लता + -मण्डपः a bower, an arbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतामृगः|लतामृग
लता + -मृगः a monkey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतायष्टिः|लतायष्टि
लता + -यष्टिः <i>f.</i> Bengal madder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतायावकम्
लता + -यावकम् a shoot, sprout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतारदः|लतारद
लता + -रदः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतावलयः|लतावलय
लता + -वलयः, -यम् an arbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतायम्
लता + -वलयः, -यम् an arbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतावृक्षः|लतावृक्ष
लता + -वृक्षः<BR>—1 the cocoa-nut tree.<BR>—2 the Sāla tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतावेष्टः|लतावेष्ट
लता + -वेष्टः a kind of coitus or mode of sexual enjoyment; बाहुभ्यां<BR> पादयुग्माभ्यां वेष्टयित्वा स्त्रियं रमेत् । लघुलिङ्गताडनं योनौ तल्लतावेष्टमुच्यते ॥<BR> Ras. M..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतावेष्टनम्
लता + -वेष्टनम्, -वेष्टितकम् a kind of embrace; अपि भ्रमी भङ्गिभिरावृताङ्गं<BR> वासो लतावेष्टितकप्रवीणम् N. 7. 97 (‘उपविष्टं प्रियं कान्ता सुप्ता वेष्टयते यदि । तल्लतावेष्टितं ज्ञेयं कामानुभववेदिभिः’ Narāyaṇaʼs com.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतावेष्टितकम्
लता + -वेष्टनम्, -वेष्टितकम् a kind of embrace; अपि भ्रमी भङ्गिभिरावृताङ्गं<BR> वासो लतावेष्टितकप्रवीणम् N. 7. 97 (‘उपविष्टं प्रियं कान्ता सुप्ता वेष्टयते यदि । तल्लतावेष्टितं ज्ञेयं कामानुभववेदिभिः’ Narāyaṇaʼs com.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लतिका
लतिका<BR>—1 A small creeper; हा कष्टं ललिता लवङ्गलतिका दावाग्निना दह्यते Bv. 1. 56.<BR>—2 A string of pearls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लत्तिका
लत्तिका [लतेः तिकन् कित् Uṇ. 3. 147] A kind of lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लदूषकः|लदूषक
लदूषकः A kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लप्
लप् €1 P. (लपति)<BR>—1 To speak, talk in general.<BR>—2 To prate, chatter.<BR>—3 To whisper; कपोलतले मिलिता लपितुं किमपि श्रुतिमूले Gīt. 1.<BR>—4 To wail, lament. ━<i>Caus.</i> (लापयति-ते) To cause to talk<BR> &c. ━<i>With</i> {@उद्@} to call out loudly to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लपनम्
लपनम् [लप्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Talking, speaking.<BR>—2 The mouth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लपित|लपितं
लपित <i>p. p.</i> Spoken, said, chattered &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लपितम्
लपित + .{@-तम्@} Speech, voice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लप्सिका
लप्सिका A kind of prepared food (Mar. लापशी); लप्सिका बृंहणी<BR> वृष्या बल्या पित्तानिलापहा Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लबः|लब
लबः Ved. A quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लभ्
लभ् €1 Ā. (लभते, लेभे, अलब्ध, लप्स्यते, लब्धुम्, लब्ध)<BR>—1 To get, obtain, gain, acquire; लभेत सिकतासु तैलमपि यत्नतः<BR> पीडयन् Bh. 2. 5; चिराय याथार्थ्यमलम्भि दिग्गजैः Śi. 1. 64.<BR>—2 To have, possess, be in possession of.<BR>—3 To take, receive.<BR>—4 To catch, take or catch hold of; प्रांशुलभ्ये फले लोभादुद्बाहुरिव<BR> वामनः R. 1. 3.<BR>—5 To find, meet with; यत्किंचिल्लभते पथि.<BR>—6 To recover, regain.<BR>—7 To know, learn, perceive, understand; भ्रमणं … गमनादेव<BR> लभ्यते Bhāṣā P. 6; सत्यमलभमानः Kull. on Ms. 8. 109.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">Page1358-2</a>]<BR>—8 To be able or be permitted (to do a thing) (with inf.); मर्तुमपि<BR> न लभ्यते; नाधर्मो लभ्यते कर्तुं लोके वैद्याधरे. (The senses of लभ्<BR> are modified according to the noun with which it is used; <i>i. e.</i> गर्भ<BR> लभ् to conceive, become pregnant; पदं or आस्पदं लभ् to gain<BR> a footing, take a hold on; see under पद; अन्तरं लभ् to get a footing,<BR> enter into; लेभेऽन्तरं चेतसि नोपदेशः R. 6. 66 ‘was not impressed on the mind’<BR>; चेतनां-संज्ञां लभ् to regain oneʼs consciousness; जन्म<BR> लभ् to be born; Ki. 5. 43; स्वास्थ्यं लभ् to enjoy ease, be at ease;<BR> दर्शनं लभ् to get an audience of &c.). ━<i>Caus.</i> (लम्भयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to get or receive, cause to take; मधुरैरवशानि लम्भयन्नपि<BR> तिर्यञ्चि शमं निरीक्षितैः Ki. 2. 55.<BR>—2 To give, confer or bestow upon; मोदकशरावं माणवकं लम्भय V. 3.<BR>—3 To cause to suffer.<BR>—4 To obtain, receive.<BR>—5 To find out, discover. ━<i>Desid.</i> (लिप्सते) To wish to get,<BR> long for; अलब्धं चैव लिप्सेत H. 2. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्ध|लब्धः
लब्ध <i>p. p.</i> [लभ्-कर्मणि-क्त]<BR>—1 Got, obtained, acquired.<BR>—2 Taken, received.<BR>—3 Perceived, apprehended.<BR>—4 Obtained, (as by division &c.); see लभ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धा
लब्ध + .{@-ब्धा@} A woman whose husband or lover is faithless (perhaps for<BR> विप्रलब्धा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धम्
लब्ध + .{@-ब्धम्@}<BR>—1 That which is secured or got; लब्धं रक्षेदवक्षयात् H. 2. 8; R. 19. 3.<BR>—2 A profit, gain; लब्धाच्च सप्तमं भागं तथा शृङ्गे कला खुरे Mb. 12. 60. 25.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लब्धानुज्ञ, लब्धान्तर, लब्धावकाश, लब्धावसर, लब्धास्पद, लब्धोदय, लब्धकाम, लब्धकीर्ति, लब्धचेतस्, लब्धसंज्ञ, लब्धजन्मन्, लब्धतीर्थ, लब्धधन, लब्धनामन्, लब्धशब्द, लब्धनाशः, लब्धप्रतिष्ठ, लब्धप्रत्यय, लब्धप्रशमनम्, लब्धप्रसर, लब्धप्रसाद, लब्धलक्ष, लब्धलक्ष्य, लब्धलक्षण, लब्धवर्ण, लब्धविद्य, लब्धश्रुत्, लब्धश्रुत, लब्धसंज्ञ, लब्धसिद्धि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धानुज्ञ
लब्ध + -अनुज्ञ<BR>—1 one who has obtained leave of absence.<BR>—2 one who is free from ब्रह्मचारी duties of उपनयन; Gīrvāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धान्तर|लब्धांतर
लब्ध + -अन्तर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one who has found an opportunity.<BR>—2 one who has got access or admission; लब्धान्तरा सावरणेऽपि गेहे R. 16. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धावकाश
लब्ध + -अवकाश, -अवसर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one who has found an opportunity.<BR>—2 (anything) that has gained a scope (for work); लब्धावकाशा मे प्रार्थना<BR> Ś. 1. 3 one who has obtained leisure, being at leisure; so लब्धलक्षण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धावसर
लब्ध + -अवकाश, -अवसर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one who has found an opportunity.<BR>—2 (anything) that has gained a scope (for work); लब्धावकाशा मे प्रार्थना<BR> Ś. 1. 3 one who has obtained leisure, being at leisure; so लब्धलक्षण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धास्पद
लब्ध + -आस्पद <i>a.</i> one who has gained a footing or secured a position;<BR> लब्धास्पदोऽस्मीति विवादभीरोः M. 1. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धोदय
लब्ध + -उदय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 born, produced, sprung; लब्धोदया चान्द्रमसीइअ लेखा Ku. 1. 25.<BR>—2 one who has got prosperity or elevation; स त्वत्तो लब्धोदयः ‘he owes his rise or elevation to you’<BR>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धकाम
लब्ध + -काम <i>a.</i> one who has got his desired object; याच्ञा मोघा<BR> वरमधिगुणे नाधमे लब्धकामा Me. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धकीर्ति
लब्ध + -कीर्ति <i>a.</i> become widely known, famous, celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धचेतस्
लब्ध + -चेतस्, -संज्ञ <i>a.</i> one who has come to his senses, restored<BR> to consciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धसंज्ञ
लब्ध + -चेतस्, -संज्ञ <i>a.</i> one who has come to his senses, restored<BR> to consciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धजन्मन्
लब्ध + -जन्मन् <i>a.</i> born, produced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धतीर्थ
लब्ध + -तीर्थ <i>a.</i> one who has gained an opportunity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धधन
लब्ध + -धन <i>a.</i> wealthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धनामन्
लब्ध + -नामन्, -शब्द <i>a.</i> renowned, celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धशब्द
लब्ध + -नामन्, -शब्द <i>a.</i> renowned, celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धनाशः|लब्धनाश
लब्ध + -नाशः the loss of what has been acquired; लब्धनाशो यथा मृत्युः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धप्रतिष्ठ
लब्ध + -प्रतिष्ठ <i>a.</i> one who has acquired fame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धप्रत्यय
लब्ध + -प्रत्यय <i>a.</i> one who has won confidence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धप्रशमनम्
लब्ध + -प्रशमनम्<BR>—1 securing or keeping safe what has been acquired.<BR>—2 bestowing on a worthy recipient; Kull. on Ms. 7. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धप्रसर
लब्ध + -प्रसर <i>a.</i> moving at liberty, unimpeded; श्रीर्लब्धप्रसरेव<BR> वेशवनिता दुःखोपचर्या भृशम् Mu. 3. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धप्रसाद
लब्ध + -प्रसाद <i>a.</i> favourite; अन्येभ्यश्च वसन्ति येऽस्य भवने<BR> लब्धप्रसादा विटाः Mu. 3. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धलक्ष
लब्ध + -लक्ष, -लक्ष्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one who has hit the mark.<BR>—2 skilled in the use of missiles; अन्ये च बहवः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">Page1359-1</a>]<BR> शूरा लब्धलक्षा निशाचराः Rām. 3. 36. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धलक्ष्य
लब्ध + -लक्ष, -लक्ष्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one who has hit the mark.<BR>—2 skilled in the use of missiles; अन्ये च बहवः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">Page1359-1</a>]<BR> शूरा लब्धलक्षा निशाचराः Rām. 3. 36. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1358-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धलक्षण
लब्ध + -लक्षण <i>a.</i> one who has gained an opportunity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धवर्ण|लब्धवर्णः
लब्ध + -वर्ण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 learned, wise; चित्रं त्वदीये विषये समन्तात् सर्वेऽपि लोकाः किल<BR> लब्धवर्णाः Rāj. P.; यत्राहुः स्थितममृतं च लब्धवर्णाः Rām. Ch. 7. 17.<BR>—2 famous, renowned, celebrated; Mk. 4. 26. ˚भाज् <i>a.</i> respecting<BR> the learned; कृच्छ्रलब्धमपि लब्धवर्णभाक् तं दिदेश मुनये सलक्ष्मणम् R. 11. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धविद्य
लब्ध + -विद्य <i>a.</i> learned, educated, wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धश्रुत्
लब्ध + -श्रुत्, -श्रुत <i>a.</i> well-versed, learned, (बहुश्रुत); लब्धश्रुतां<BR> धर्मभृतां वरिष्ठः Mb. 12. 167. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धश्रुत
लब्ध + -श्रुत्, -श्रुत <i>a.</i> well-versed, learned, (बहुश्रुत); लब्धश्रुतां<BR> धर्मभृतां वरिष्ठः Mb. 12. 167. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धसंज्ञ
लब्ध + -संज्ञ <i>a.</i> restored to consciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धसिद्धि
लब्ध + -सिद्धि <i>a.</i> one who has attained perfection or his desired object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्धिः|लब्धि
लब्धिः <i>f.</i> [लभ्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Acquisition, gaining, acquirement; समाश्रयेत् सद्गुरुमात्मलब्धये<BR> A. Rām. 7. 5. 7.<BR>—2 Profit, gain.<BR>—3 (In Arith.) The quotient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लब्ध्रिम
लब्ध्रिम <i>a.</i> Obtained, acquired, received.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लभनम्
लभनम् [लभ्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 The act of getting, obtaining &c.<BR>—2 Act of conceiving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लभसः|लभस
लभसः<BR>—1 Wealth, riches.<BR>—2 One who solicits, a solicitor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लभसम्
लभसः + .{@-सम्@} A rope for tying a horse. ━(<i>m.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लभ्य|लभ्यं
लभ्य <i>a.</i> [लभ्-कर्मणि यत्]<BR>—1 Capable of being acquired or obtained, attainable, obtainable, to be<BR> reached; प्रांशुलभ्ये फले लोभादुद्बाहुरिव वामनः R. 1. 3, 4. 88; Ku. 5. 18.<BR>—2 To be found; मृणालसूत्रान्तरमप्यलभ्यम् Ku. 1. 40.<BR>—3 Fit, suitable, proper.<BR>—4 Intelligible.<BR>—5 To be furnished or provided with; Mb. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लमकः|लमक
लमकः A lover, paramour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्पट|लंपट|लम्पटः
लम्पट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Greedy, covetous, hankering after; दधिभक्तलम्पट इव Ratn. 2.<BR>—2 Lustful, libidinous, dissolute, addicted to licentious pleasures; देशे<BR> देशे लम्पटाः पर्यटन्तः Viś. Guṇā. 143.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्पटः|लम्पट|लंपट
लम्पट + .{@-टः@} A libertine, profligate, rake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्पाकः|लम्पाक|लंपाक
लम्पाकः<BR>—1 A libertine.<BR>—2 (pl.) N. of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्पापटहः|लम्पापटह
लम्पापटहः A kind of drum; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्फः|लम्फ|लंफ|लंफः
लम्फः A leap, jump, spring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्फनम्
लम्फनम् Leaping, jumping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्ब्|लंब्
लम्ब् €1 Ā. (लम्बते, लम्बित)<BR>—1 To hang down, hang from, dangle; ऋषयो ह्यत्र लम्बते Mb.<BR>—2 To be attached to, stick to, hold on to, rest on; ललम्बिरे सदसिलताः<BR> प्रिया इव Śi. 7. 25; प्रस्थानं ते कथमपि सखे लम्बमानस्य भावि<BR> Me. 43. (where लम्ब˚ means ‘hanging down towards’ or ‘resting upon’<BR> the back or hips).<BR>—3 To go down, sink, decline or hang down (as the sun), fall down; लम्बमाने<BR> दिवाकरे; Śi. 9. 20; Ki. 9. 1; त्वदधरचुम्बनलम्बितकज्जलमुज्ज्वलय<BR> प्रिय लोचने Gīt. 12 (= गलित).<BR>—4 To fall or lag behind.<BR>—5 To delay, tarry.<BR>—5 To sound. ━<i>Caus.</i> (लम्बयति-ते)<BR>—1 To let down, cause to hang down.<BR>—2 To hang up, suspend.<BR>—3 To stretch out, extend (as the hand); करेण वातायनलम्बितेन<BR> R. 13. 21; को लम्बयेदाहरणाय हस्तम् 6. 75.<BR>—4 To<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">Page1359-2</a>]<BR> cause to be attached, join.<BR>—5 To depress. ━<i>With</i> {@उद्@} to stand up, stand erect; पादेनैकेन<BR> गगने द्वितीयेन च भूतले । तिष्ठाम्युल्लम्बितस्तावद्यावत्तिष्ठति भास्करः Mk. 2. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्ब|लंब|लम्बः
लम्ब <i>a.</i> [लम्ब्-अच्]<BR>—1 Hanging down, hanging from, pendent, dangling; पाण्डपोऽयमंसार्पितलम्बहारः<BR> R. 6. 60, 84; शतबुद्धिः कृतोन्नामः सलम्बश्च सहस्रधीः Pt. 5. 45; Me. 86.<BR>—2 Hanging upon, attached to.<BR>—3 Great, large.<BR>—4 Spacious.<BR>—5 Long, tall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बः|लम्ब|लंब
लम्ब + .{@-म्बः@}<BR>—1 A perpendicular.<BR>—2 Colatitude, the arc between the pole of any place and the zenith, complement of latitude.<BR>—3 A bribe.<BR>—4 N. of a particular throw or move (at a kind of chess).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बी
लम्ब + .{@-म्बी@}<BR>—1 A kind of food prepared from grain.<BR>—2 A flowering branch.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लम्बोदर, लम्बौष्ठः, लम्बकर्णः, लम्बगुणः, लम्बज्या, लम्बरेखा, लम्बजठर, लम्बदन्ता, लम्बबीजा, लम्बपयोधरा, लम्बस्फिच्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बोदर|लंबोदर|लम्बोदरः
लम्ब + -उदर <i>a.</i> big-bellied, pot-bellied, portly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बोदरः|लम्बोदर|लंबोदर
लम्ब + -उदर + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 N. of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—2 a glutton. ˚जननी N. of Pārvatī; निरालम्बो लम्बोदरजननि<BR> कं यामि शरणम् Ā. L. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बोदरी
लम्ब + -उदर + .({@-री@}) N. of the goddess Tārā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बौष्ठः|लम्बौष्ठ|लंबौष्ठ
लम्ब + -ओष्ठः (लम्बो(म्बौ)ष्ठः) a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बकर्णः|लम्बकर्ण|लंबकर्ण
लम्ब + -कर्णः<BR>—1 an ass.<BR>—2 a goat.<BR>—3 an elephant.<BR>—4 a falcon.<BR>—5 a demon or Rākṣasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बगुणः|लम्बगुण
लम्ब + -गुणः, -ज्या, -रेखा the sine of the co-latitude; स्वाबाधाभुजकृत्योरन्तरमूलं<BR> प्रजायते लम्बः । लम्बगुणं भूम्यर्धं स्पष्टं त्रिभुजं फलं भवति Līlā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बज्या
लम्ब + -गुणः, -ज्या, -रेखा the sine of the co-latitude; स्वाबाधाभुजकृत्योरन्तरमूलं<BR> प्रजायते लम्बः । लम्बगुणं भूम्यर्धं स्पष्टं त्रिभुजं फलं भवति Līlā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बरेखा
लम्ब + -गुणः, -ज्या, -रेखा the sine of the co-latitude; स्वाबाधाभुजकृत्योरन्तरमूलं<BR> प्रजायते लम्बः । लम्बगुणं भूम्यर्धं स्पष्टं त्रिभुजं फलं भवति Līlā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बजठर|लंबजठर
लम्ब + -जठर <i>a.</i> pot-bellied, portly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बदन्ता
लम्ब + -दन्ता, -बीजा a kind of pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बबीजा
लम्ब + -दन्ता, -बीजा a kind of pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बपयोधरा
लम्ब + -पयोधरा a woman with large pendent breasts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बस्फिच्|लंबस्फिच्
लम्ब + -स्फिच् <i>a.</i> having fat or protuberant buttocks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बकः|लम्बक|लंबक|लंबकः
लम्बकः<BR>—1 A perpendicular (in geom.).<BR>—2 The complement of latitude, colatitude (in astr.).<BR>—3 A particular implement or vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बनः|लम्बन|लंबन|लम्बनं|लंबनः
लम्बनः [लम्ब्-ल्यु ल्युट् वा]<BR>—1 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 The phlegmatic humour.<BR>—3 A camp-follower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बनम्
लम्बनः + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Hanging down, depending, descending &c.<BR>—2 Fringe.<BR>—3 The parallax in longitude (of the moon).<BR>—4 A sort of long necklace; also लम्बमाना.<BR>—5 A mode of fighting.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लम्बनविधिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बनविधिः|लम्बनविधि
लम्बनः + -विधिः (in astr.) the rule for calculating the moonʼs parallax in longitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बरा
लम्बरा A variety of blanket; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बरः|लम्बर
लम्बरः A kind of drum; Bṛ. Up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बा
लम्बा<BR>—1 An epithet of Durgā.<BR>—2 Of Lakṣmī.<BR>—3 A present; bribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बिका|लंबिका
लम्बिका The soft palate or uvula.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बित|लंबित|लम्बितः
लम्बित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Hanging down, pendent.<BR>—2 Suspended.<BR>—3 Sunk, gone down.<BR>—4 Resting on, attached to (see लम्ब); अन्योन्यं लम्बितकरौ ततस्तौ<BR> हरिराक्षसौ Rām. 7. 34. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्बुषा|लंबुषा
लम्बुषा A necklace of seven strings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्भः|लम्भ|लंभ|लंभः
लम्भः<BR>—1 Attainment, acquirement; अपि त्वां न लभेत् कर्ण राज्यलम्भोपपादनम् Mb. 5. 142. 2.<BR>—2 Meeting with.<BR>—3 Recovery.<BR>—4 Gain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्भा
लम्भः + .{@-म्भा@} A sort of enclosure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्भनम्
लम्भनम्<BR>—1 Attainment, acquirement.<BR>—2 Recovery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्भनीय
लम्भनीय <i>a.</i> To be obtained, attainable; इमा रामाः सरथाः<BR> सतूर्या न हीदृशा लम्भनीया मनुष्यैः Kaṭh. 1. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1359-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्भित|लंभित
लम्भित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Procured, got, obtained.<BR>—2 Given; विपक्षगोत्रं दयितेन लम्भिता Ki. 8. 14.<BR>—3 Improved.<BR>—4 Employed, applied.<BR>—5 Cherished.<BR>—6 Spoken to, addressed.<BR>—7 Born; विप्रां स्वभार्यामप्रौढां कुले महति लम्भिताम् Bhāg. 6. 1. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लम्भुक
लम्भुक <i>a.</i> One who is accustomed to receive; लम्भुको ह वासो<BR> भवति Ch. Up. 5. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लय्
लय् €1 Ā. (लयते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयः|लय
लयः [ली-अच्]<BR>—1 Sticking, union, adherence.<BR>—2 Lurking, hiding.<BR>—3 Fusion, melting, solution.<BR>—4 Disappearance, dissolution, extinction, destruction; universal destruction<BR> (प्रलय); लयं या ‘to be dissolved or destroyed’.<BR>—5 Absorption of the mind, deep concentration, exclusive devotion (to<BR> any one object); पश्यन्ती शिवरूपिणं लयवशादात्मानमभ्यागता Māl. 5. 2, 7;<BR> ध्यानलयेन Gīt. 4.<BR>—6 Time in music (of three kinds━ द्रुत, मध्य, and विलम्बित);<BR> किसलयैः सलयैरिव पाणिभिः R. 9. 35; पादन्यासो लयमनुगतः<BR> M. 2. 9; मध्यलम्बितपरिच्छिन्नस्त्रिधायं लयः Nāg. 1. 14.<BR>—7 A pause in music.<BR>—8 Rest, repose.<BR>—9 A place of rest, abode, habitation; अलया Śi. 4. 57 ‘having no fixed abode, wandering’<BR>.<BR>—10 Slackness of mind, mental inactivity; (also used in adjectival sense;<BR> यदा जयेद्रजः सत्त्वं तमो मूढं लयं जडम् Bhāg. 11. 25. 15.).<BR>—11 An embrace.<BR>—12 The Supreme Being.<BR>—13 The union of song, dance, and instrumental music; गायतं मधुरं<BR> गेयं तन्त्रीलयसमन्वितम् Rām. 7. 93. 15.<BR>—14 A swoon.<BR>—15 The quick (downward) movement of an arrow.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लयार्कः, लयारम्भः, लयालम्भः, लयकालः, लयगत, लयनालिकः, लयपुत्री, लयमध्य, लयशुद्ध, लयस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयार्कः|लयार्क
लयः + -अर्कः the sun at the destruction of the universe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयारम्भः|लयारम्भ|लयारंभ
लयः + -आरम्भः, -आलम्भः an actor, a dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयालम्भः|लयालम्भ
लयः + -आरम्भः, -आलम्भः an actor, a dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयकालः|लयकाल
लयः + -कालः the time of destruction (of the world.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयगत
लयः + -गत <i>a.</i> dissolved, melted away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयनालिकः|लयनालिक
लयः + -नालिकः a Buddhist or Jain temple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयपुत्री
लयः + -पुत्री an actress, a female dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयमध्य
लयः + -मध्य <i>a.</i> to be performed in moderate time (a piece of music).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयशुद्ध
लयः + -शुद्ध <i>a.</i> to be performed in right time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयस्थानम्
लयः + -स्थानम् a place of dissolution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लयनम्
लयनम् [ली-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Adhering, clinging, sticking.<BR>—2 Rest, repose.<BR>—3 A place of rest, house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लर्व्|लर्व्व्
लर्व् €1 P. (लर्वति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लल्
लल् I. €1 U. (ललति-ते) To play, move about, sport, dally, frolic;<BR> पनसफलानीव वानरा ललन्ति Mk. 8. 8; गजकलभा इव बन्धुला ललामः 4. 28;<BR> ललदजगरघोरकोटराणाम् Māl. 5. 15; युधि ललितमनायुधेन<BR> तेन Avimāraka 6. 9. ━II. €10 U. or <i>Caus.</i> (लालयति-ते, लालित)<BR>—1 To cause to sport or play, caress, fondle, coax, dandle; लालने बहवो<BR> दोषास्ताडने बहवो गुणाः । तस्मात्पुत्रं च शिष्यं च ताडयेन्न तु लालयेत् ॥<BR> Subhāṣ.; Ku. 5. 15.<BR>—2 To desire. ━III. €10 U. (ललयति-ते)<BR>—1 To fondle; परगृहललिताः परान्नपुष्टाः Mk. 4. 28.<BR>—2 To loll the tongue.<BR>—3 To desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लल
लल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Playful, sportive.<BR>—2 Lolling.<BR>—3 Wishing, desirous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललम्
लल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 A shoot, sprout.<BR>—2 A garden.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ललजिह्व<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललजिह्व
लल + -जिह्व = ललज्जिह्व q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललत्
ललत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Playing, sporting.<BR>—2 Shaking, flashing, moving about; ललन्नरजाङ्गलः Māl. 5. 5.<BR>—3 Lolling.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ललदम्बुः, ललज्जिह्व, ललड्डिम्बम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललदम्बुः|ललदम्बु
ललत् + -अम्बुः the citron tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललज्जिह्व|ललज्जिह्वः
ललत् + -जिह्व <i>a.</i> (ललज्जिह्व)<BR>—1 lolling the tongue.<BR>—2 savage, fierce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललज्जिह्वः|ललज्जिह्व
ललत् + -जिह्व + .({@-ह्वः@})<BR>—1 a dog.<BR>—2 a camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललड्डिम्बम्
ललत् + -डिम्बम् a top (भवरा in Mar.) बालेन नक्तंसमयेन मुक्तं<BR> रौप्यं ललड्डिम्बमिवेन्दुबिम्बम् (लसड्डिम्बम् v. l.) N. 22. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललनम्
ललनम् [लल्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Sport, play, pleasure, dalliance.<BR>—2 Lolling the tongue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललनः|ललन|ललनं
ललनम् + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 A child.<BR>—2 The Sāla and Piyāla trees.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललना
ललना<BR>—1 A woman (in general); शठ नाकलोकललनाभिरविरतरतं रिरंससे Śi. 15. 88.<BR>—2 A wanton woman.<BR>—3 The tongue.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ललनाप्रियः, ललनावरूथिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललनाप्रियः|ललनाप्रिय|ललनाप्रियं
ललना + -प्रियः the <i>Kadamba</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललनावरूथिन्
ललना + -वरूथिन् <i>a.</i> surrounded by a troop of women.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललनिका
ललनिका A little or miserable woman; Kāv. 3. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललन्तिका|ललंतिका
ललन्तिका<BR>—1 A long necklace; कण्ठसंसक्तगुच्छार्धगुच्छरत्नललन्तिकाम् Śiva B. 20. 7.<BR>—2 A lizard or chameleon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाकः|ललाक
ललाकः The penis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटम्
ललाटम् [लड्-अच् डस्य लः, ललमटति अट्-अण् वा Tv.] The forehead;<BR> लिखितमपि ललाटे प्रोज्झितुं कः समर्थः H. 1. 19; N. 1. 15.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ललाटाक्षः, ललाटतटम्, ललाटपट्टः, ललाटपट्टिका, ललाटरेखा, ललाटलेखा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटाक्षः|ललाटाक्ष
ललाटम् + -अक्षः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटतटम्
ललाटम् + -तटम् the slope of the forehead, the forehead itself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटपट्टः|ललाटपट्ट
ललाटम् + -पट्टः, -पट्टिका<BR>—1 the flat surface of the forehead.<BR>—2 a tiara, fillet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटपट्टिका
ललाटम् + -पट्टः, -पट्टिका<BR>—1 the flat surface of the forehead.<BR>—2 a tiara, fillet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटरेखा
ललाटम् + -रेखा<BR>—1 a line on the forehead.<BR>—2 a wrinkled brow.<BR>—3 a coloured sectarial mark on the forehead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटलेखा
ललाटम् + -लेखा the line on the forehead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटकम्
ललाटकम्<BR>—1 The forehead.<BR>—2 A beautiful forehead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटंतप|ललाटन्तप|ललाटंतपः|ललाटन्तपः
ललाटंतप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Burning or scorching the (fore) head; ललाटंतपस्तपति तपनः<BR> Māl. 1; U. 6 ‘the sun is shining right overhead’; ललाटंतपसप्तसप्तिः R. 13. 41.<BR>—2 (Hence) Very painful; लिपिर्ललाटंतपनिष्ठुराक्षरा N. 1. 138.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटंतपः|ललाटन्तप|ललाटंतप|ललाटन्तपः
ललाटंतप + .{@-पः@} The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटिका
ललाटिका<BR>—1 A gold chain ornament worn on the forehead (Mar. बिंदी); सुतनु<BR> ललाटनिवेशितललाटिके Āryā. S. 529.<BR>—2 A mark made with sandal or any other fragrant powder on the forehead;<BR> ललाटिकाचन्दनधूसरालका Ku. 5. 55; भस्मललाटिका K. 139; तेन<BR> रसेन ललाटिकामकल्पयम् 157; ललाटिकासीमनि चूर्णकुन्तला बभुः N. 15. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाटूल
ललाटूल <i>a.</i> Having a high or handsome forehead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललाम|ललामं|ललामः
ललाम <i>a.</i> (-मी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Beautiful, lovely, charming.<BR>—2 Having a mark on the forehead marked with a blaze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललामम्
ललाम + .{@-मम्@}<BR>—1 An ornament for the forehead, an ornament or decoration in general;<BR> (<i>m.</i> also in this sense); सद्यः पुनाति सहचन्द्रललामलोकान् Bhāg. 3. 16. 9;<BR> अहं तु तामाश्रमललामभूतां शकुन्तलामधिकृत्य ब्रवीमि<BR> Ś. 2; Śi. 4. 28.<BR>—2 Anything the best of its kind.<BR>—3 A mark on the forehead.<BR>—4 A sign, symbol, mark in general.<BR>—5 A banner, flag.<BR>—6 A row, series, line.<BR>—7 A tail.<BR>—8 A mane.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">Page1361-1</a>]<BR>—9 Eminence, dignity, beauty.<BR>—10 A horn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललामः|ललाम|ललामं
ललाम + .{@-मः@} A horse; Mb. 7. 23. 13 (com. ‘श्वेतं ललाटमध्यस्थं तारारूपं हयस्य यत् । ललामं चापि तत्प्राहुर्ललामाश्वस्तदन्वितः ॥’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1360-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललामकम्
ललामकम् A chaplet of flowers worn on the forehead.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ललामकरूपकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललामकरूपकम्
ललामकम् + -रूपकम् (in Rhet.) a flowery metaphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललामन्
ललामन् <i>a.</i> [लल्-इमनिन् Uṇ. 4. 162, 164]<BR>—1 An ornament, a decoration.<BR>—2 (Hence) Anything the best of its kind; कन्याललाम कमनीयमजस्य<BR> लिप्सोः R. 5. 64 ‘the best or ornament of girls’.<BR>—3 A banner, flag.<BR>—4 A sectarial mark, token, sign, symbol.<BR>—5 A tail.<BR>—6 A species of stanza (having 10 syllables in the first two Pādas, 11<BR> in the third and 13 in the fourth); see ललाम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललित|ललितं|ललितः
ललित <i>a.</i> [लल्-क्त]<BR>—1 Playing, sporting, dallying.<BR>—2 Amorous, sportive, wanton, voluptuous; ललितं गीतमन्वर्थं काचित्<BR> साभिनयं जगौ Bu. C. 4. 37.<BR>—3 Lovely, beautiful, handsome, elegant, graceful; ललितललितैर्ज्योत्स्नाप्रायैरकृत्रिमविभ्रमैः<BR> (अङ्गकैः) U. 1. 20; विधाय सृष्टिं ललितां विधातुः R. 6. 37, 19. 39, 8. 1;<BR> Māl. 1. 15; Ku. 3. 75, 6. 45; Me. 34, 66.<BR>—4 Pleasing, charming, agreeable, fine; प्रियशिष्या ललिते कलाविधौ<BR> R. 8. 6; संदर्शितेव ललिताभिनयस्य शिक्षा M. 4. 9; V. 2. 18.<BR>—5 Desired.<BR>—6 Soft, gentle; अवसितललितक्रियेण बाह्वोर्ललिततरेण तनीयसा युगेन Śi. 7. 64.<BR>—7 Tremulous, trembling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितः|ललित|ललितं
ललित + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 N. of a musical scale.<BR>—2 A particular position of hands in dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितम्
ललित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Sport, dalliance, play.<BR>—2 Amorous pastime, gracefulness of gait; any languid or amorous gesture<BR> in a woman; सुकुमारतयाङ्गानां विन्यासो ललितं भवेत् S. D.; Śi. 9. 79;<BR> Ki. 10. 52; ता भ्रूभिः प्रेक्षितैर्भावैर्हसितैर्ललितैर्गतैः Bu. C. 4. 25.<BR>—3 Beauty, grace, charm.<BR>—4 Any natural or artless act; स्मितललितवता दिव्यनारीजनेन Nāg. 1. 1-2.<BR>—5 Simplicity, innocence.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ललिताभिनय, ललितार्थ, ललितपद, ललितप्रहारः, ललितप्रियः, ललितललित, ललितलुलित, ललितवनिता, ललितविस्तरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललिताभिनय
ललित + -अभिनय <i>a.</i> consisting of graceful gesticulations or acting;<BR> ललिताभिनयं तमद्य भर्ता मरुतां द्रष्टुमनाः सलोकपालः V. 2. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितार्थ
ललित + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> having a pretty or amorous meaning; तुल्यानुरागपिशुनं<BR> ललितार्थबन्धं पत्रे निवेशितमुदाहरणं प्रियायाः V. 2. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितपद
ललित + -पद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 elegantly composed; Ś. 3.<BR>—2 consisting of amorous words. ˚बन्धनम् an amorous composition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितप्रहारः|ललितप्रहार
ललित + -प्रहारः a soft or gentle blow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितप्रियः|ललितप्रिय
ललित + -प्रियः (in music) a kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितललित
ललित + -ललित <i>a.</i> excessively beautiful; ललितललितैर्ज्योत्स्नाप्रायैरकृत्रिमविभ्रमैः U. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितलुलित
ललित + -लुलित <i>a.</i> unnerved yet charming; गाढोत्कण्ठा ललितलुलितैरङ्गकैस्ताम्यतीति<BR> Māl. 1. 15 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितवनिता
ललित + -वनिता a lovely woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितविस्तरः|ललितविस्तर
ललित + -विस्तरः N. of a work on Buddhaʼs life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललिता
ललिता<BR>—1 A woman (in general).<BR>—2 A wanton woman.<BR>—3 Musk.<BR>—4 A form of Durgā.<BR>—5 N. of various metres.<BR>—6 A kind of मूर्च्छना, also राग.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ललितापञ्चमी, ललितासप्तमी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितापञ्चमी|ललितापंचमी
ललिता + -पञ्चमी the fifth day in the bright half of Āśvina.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ललितासप्तमी
ललिता + -सप्तमी the seventh day in the bright half of Bhādrapada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लवः|लव|लवं
लवः [लू-अप्]<BR>—1 Plucking, mowing.<BR>—2 Reaping, gathering (of corn).<BR>—3 A section, piece, fragment, bit; कुशमुष्टिमुपादाय लवं चैव तु<BR> स द्विजः Rām. 7. 66. 6.<BR>—4 A<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-2" target="_blank">Page1361-2</a>]<BR> particle, drop, small quantity; a little; oft. at the end of comp. in this<BR> sense; जललवमुचः Me. 21, 72; आचामति स्वेदलवान् मुखे ते R. 13. 20, 6. 57, 16. 66;<BR> अश्रु˚ 15. 97; अमृत˚ Ki. 5. 44; भ्रक्षेपलक्ष्मीलवक्रीते<BR> दास इव Gīt. 11; so तृण˚, अपराध˚, ज्ञान˚, सुख˚, धन˚ &c. &c.<BR>—5 Wool, hair; धान्ये सदे लवे वाह्ये नातिक्रामति पञ्चताम् Ms. 8. 151.<BR>—6 Sport.<BR>—7 A minute division of time (= the sixth part of a twinkling); त्वं<BR> मुहूर्तस्तिथिस्त्वं च त्वं लवस्त्वं पुनः क्षणः Mb. 1. 25. 14.<BR>—8 The numerator of a fraction.<BR>—9 A degree (in astr.).<BR>—10 Loss, destruction.<BR>—11 N. of a son of Rāma, one of the twins, the other being Kuśa q. v.<BR> He with his brother was brought up by the sage Vālmīki, and they were<BR> taught by the poet to repeat his Rāmāyaṇa at assemblies &c.; (the derivation<BR> of his name, is given as━ स तौ कुशलवोन्मृष्टगर्भक्लेदौ तदाख्यया ।<BR> कविः कुशलवावेव चकार किल नामतः ॥ R. 15. 32).<BR>—12 A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1361-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लवम्
