लष्वः [लष्-वन् Uṇ. 1. 142] An actor, a dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लस्
लस् I. €1 P. (लसति, लसित)<BR>—1 To shine, glitter, flash; मुक्ताहारेण लसता हसतीव स्तनद्वयम्<BR> K. P. 10; करवाणि चरणद्वयं सरसलसदलक्तकरागम् Gīt. 10;<BR> Amaru. 19; बालेन नक्तंसमयेन मुक्तं रौप्यं लसड्डिम्बमिवेन्दुबिम्बम्<BR> N. 22. 53 (v. l.).<BR>—2 To appear, arise, come to light.<BR>—3 To embrace.<BR>—4 To play, frolic about, skip about, dance.<BR>—4 To sound, resound. ━<i>Caus.</i> (लासयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to shine, grace, adorn.<BR>—2 To cause to dance.<BR>—3 To exercise an art.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लसकः|लसक
लसकः = लासक q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लसदंशु
लसदंशु <i>a.</i> Having flashing rays (as the sun); मध्यमोपलनिभे<BR> लसदंशौ Ki. 9. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लसा
लसा [लसति लस्-अच्]<BR>—1 Saffron.<BR>—2 Turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लसिका
लसिका Spittle, saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लसित
लसित <i>p. p.</i> [लस्-क्त] Played, sported, appeared, manifested,<BR> skipping about &c.; see लस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लसीका
लसीका<BR>—1 Saliva.<BR>—2 Pus, matter.<BR>—3 The juice of the sugar-cane.<BR>—4 Lymph.<BR>—5 A tendon, muscle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लसुष
लसुष <i>a.</i> [लस्-उषच् Uṇ. 4. 79] Shining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लस्त|लस्तः
लस्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Embraced, clasped.<BR>—2 Skilful, skilled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लस्ज्
लस्ज् €1 Ā.<BR> (लज्जते, लज्जित) —1 To be ashamed, feel shame (oft. with instr.<BR> or inf.); स्रीजनं प्रहरन् कथं न लज्जसे Ratn. 2; Bk. 15. 33.<BR>—2 To blush. ━<i>Caus.</i> (लज्जयति-ते) To put to shame; नर्तकीरभिनयातिलङ्घिनीः<BR> पार्श्ववर्तिषु गुरूष्वलज्जयत् R. 19. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लस्तकः|लस्तक
लस्तकः The middle of a bow, that part which is grasped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लस्तकिन्
लस्तकिन् <i>m.</i> A bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लहरिः|लहरि
लहरिः, -री <i>f.</i><BR> A wave, a large wave or billow; करेणोत्क्षिप्तास्ते<BR> जननि विजयन्तां लहरयः G. L. 40; इमां पीयूषलहरीं जगन्नाथेन<BR> निर्मिताम् 53; so आनन्द˚, करुणा˚, सुधा˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लहरी
लहरिः, -री <i>f.</i><BR> A wave, a large wave or billow; करेणोत्क्षिप्तास्ते<BR> जननि विजयन्तां लहरयः G. L. 40; इमां पीयूषलहरीं जगन्नाथेन<BR> निर्मिताम् 53; so आनन्द˚, करुणा˚, सुधा˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लह्वा
लह्वा A kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ला
ला €2 P. (लाति) To take, receive, obtain, take up; ललुः खड्गान्<BR> Bk. 14. 92, 15. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ला
ला <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Taking, receiving.<BR>—2 Giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाकुटिक|लाकुटिकः
लाकुटिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [लकुटः प्रहरणमस्य ठक्] Armed with a club or cudgel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाकुटिकः|लाकुटिक
लाकुटिक + .{@-कः@} A sentinel, watchman; Pt. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षकी
लाक्षकी N. of Sītā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षणिक|लाक्षणिकः
लाक्षणिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [लक्षणया बोधयति ठक्]<BR>—1 One who is acquainted with marks or signs.<BR>—2 Characteristic, indicatory.<BR>—3 Having a secondary sense, used in a secondary sense (as a word, as<BR> distinguished from वाच्य and व्यञ्जक qq. vv.); स्याद्वाचको<BR> लाक्षणिकः शब्दोऽत्र व्यञ्जकस्त्रिधा K. P. 2.<BR>—4 Expressing indirectly or figuratively.<BR>—5 Secondary, inferior; साक्षात् सुधांशुर्मुखमेव भैम्या दिवः स्फुटं लाक्षणिकः शशाङ्कः N. 10. 115.<BR>—6 Technical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षणिकः|लाक्षणिक
लाक्षणिक + .{@-कः@} A technical term.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षण्य
लाक्षण्य <i>a.</i> [लक्षणं वेत्ति ञ्य]<BR>—1 Relating to signs, indicative.<BR>—2 Conversant with, or able to explain or interpret signs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षा
लाक्षा [लक्ष्यतेऽनया लक्ष् अच् पृषो˚ वृद्धिः]<BR>—1 A kind of red dye, lac; (largely used by women in ancient times as<BR> an article of decoration, especially for the soles of the feet and lips;<BR> cf. अलक्त; it is said to be obtained from the cochineal insect and<BR> from the resin of a particular tree); निष्ठपूतश्चरणोपभोगसुलभो लाक्षारसः<BR> केनचित् (तरुणा) Ś. 4. 5; Ṛs. 6. 14; लाक्षागृहानलविषान्नसभाप्रवेशैः<BR> Ve. 1. 8; Ki. 5. 23.<BR>—2 The insect which produces the red dye.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लाक्षातरुः, लाक्षावृक्षः, लाक्षाप्रसादः, लाक्षाप्रसादनः, लाक्षारक्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षातरुः|लाक्षातरु
लाक्षा + -तरुः, -वृक्षः N. of a tree, <i>Butea Frondosa</i>.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">Page1363-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षावृक्षः|लाक्षावृक्ष
लाक्षा + -तरुः, -वृक्षः N. of a tree, <i>Butea Frondosa</i>.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">Page1363-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1362-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षाप्रसादः|लाक्षाप्रसाद
लाक्षा + -प्रसादः, -प्रसादनः the red <i>Lodhra</i> tree (the infusion<BR> of its bark is used to fix colour).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षाप्रसादनः|लाक्षाप्रसादन
लाक्षा + -प्रसादः, -प्रसादनः the red <i>Lodhra</i> tree (the infusion<BR> of its bark is used to fix colour).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षारक्त
लाक्षा + -रक्त <i>a.</i> dyed with lac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाक्षिक
लाक्षिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Relating to, made of, or dyed with lac.<BR>—2 Relating to a <i>lac</i> (लक्ष).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाख्
लाख् €1 P. (लाखति)<BR>—1 To be dry or arid.<BR>—2 To adorn.<BR>—3 To suffice, be competent.<BR>—4 To give.<BR>—5 To prevent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लागुडिक
लागुडिक See लाकुटिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाघ्
लाघ् €1 Ā. (लाघते) To be equal to, to suffice or be competent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाघरकोलसः|लाघरकोलस
लाघरकोलसः A particular form of jaundice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाघवम्
लाघवम् [लघोर्भावः अण्]<BR>—1 Smallness, littleness.<BR>—2 Levity, lightness; अलसग्रहणं प्राप्तो दुर्मेधावी तथोच्यते । बुद्धिलाघवयुक्तेन<BR> जनेनादीर्घदर्शिना ॥ Mb. 12. 166. 6 (com. लापवं नीचता); cf.<BR> बुद्धिलाघव.<BR>—3 Thoughtlessness, frivolity.<BR>—4 Insignificance.<BR>—5 Disrespect, contempt, dishonour, degradation; सेवां लाघवकारिणीं<BR> कृतधियः स्थाने श्ववृत्तिं विदुः Mu. 3. 14; यास्यसि लाघवम् Bg. 2. 35.<BR>—6 Quickness, speed, rapidity; गतिर्वेगश्च तेजश्च लाघवं च महाकपे ।<BR> पितुस्ते सदृशं वीर मारुतस्य महौजसः ॥ Rām. 4. 44. 5.<BR>—7 Ease, facility.<BR>—8 Health, soundness of constitution.<BR>—9 Activity, dexterity; readiness; वियदभिपातलाघवेन Ki. 7. 21;<BR> हस्तलाघवम्.<BR>—10 Versatility; बुद्धिलाघवम्.<BR>—11 Brevity, conciseness (of expression); प्रसादरम्यमोजस्वि गरीयो<BR> लाघवान्वितम् Ki. 11. 38.<BR>—12 An explanation which is in consonance with the principle of economy<BR> of nature and involves simplicity of reasoning; (अल्पोपस्थितिसापेक्षत्वं<BR> लाघवम्); आकाशो लाघवादेकः Tarka K.<BR>—13 Shortness of a syllable (in prosody).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लाघवकारिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाघवकारिन्
लाघवम् + -कारिन् disgraceful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाघविन्
लाघविन् <i>n.</i> A juggler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलम्
लाङ्गलम् [लङ्ग् कलच् पृषो˚ वृद्धिः भुवि गच्छति Uṇ. 1. 105]<BR>—1 A plough; लाङ्गलग्लपितग्रीवा मुसलैर्भिन्नमस्तकाः Rām. 7. 7. 47.<BR>—2 A plough-shaped beam or timber.<BR>—3 The palm tree.<BR>—4 The membrum virile.<BR>—5 A kind of flower.<BR>—6 A particular appearance of the moon.<BR>—7 A kind of timber (used in building houses).<BR>—8 A pole for gathering fruit from a tree; Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलः|लाङ्गल|लांगल|लांगलं|लाङ्गलं
लाङ्गलम् + .{@-लः@} A kind of rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गला
लाङ्गलम् + .{@-ला@} The cocoa-nut tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लाङ्गलग्रहः, लाङ्गलदण्डः, लाङ्गलध्वजः, लाङ्गलपद्धतिः, लाङ्गलफालः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलग्रहः|लाङ्गलग्रह|लांगलग्रह
लाङ्गलम् + -ग्रहः a ploughman, peasant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलदण्डः|लाङ्गलदण्ड|लांगलदंड
लाङ्गलम् + -दण्डः the pole of a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलध्वजः|लाङ्गलध्वज|लांगलध्वज
लाङ्गलम् + -ध्वजः N. of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलपद्धतिः|लाङ्गलपद्धति|लांगलपद्धति
लाङ्गलम् + -पद्धतिः <i>f.</i> a furrow; also लाङ्गलकमार्ग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलफालः|लाङ्गलफाल|लांगलफाल
लाङ्गलम् + -फालः a ploughshare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलिक|लांगलिक|लाङ्गलिकः
लाङ्गलिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Belonging to a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलिकः|लाङ्गलिक|लांगलिक
लाङ्गलिक + .{@-कः@} A kind of poison; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलिन्|लांगलिन्
लाङ्गलिन् <i>m.</i> [लाङ्गलमस्यास्ति इनि]<BR>—1 N. of Balarāma; बन्धुप्रीत्या समरविमुखो लाङ्गली याः सिषेवे Me. 51.<BR>—2 The cocoa-nut tree.<BR>—3 A snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गली
लाङ्गली The cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गलीषा
लाङ्गलीषा [for लाङ्गल-ईषा] The pole of a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गुलम्
लाङ्गुलम्<BR>—1 A tail.<BR>—2 Membrum virile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गूलम्
लाङ्गूलम् [लङ्ग्-ऊलच् पृषो˚ Uṇ. 4. 96]<BR>—1 A tail; लाङ्गूलचालनमधश्चरणावपातं … श्वा पिण्डदस्य कुरुते<BR> Bh. 2. 31 ‘wags his tail’.<BR>—2 The membrum virile.<BR>—3 A granary.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लाङ्गूलचालनम्, लाङ्गूलविक्षेपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गूलचालनम्
लाङ्गूलम् + -चालनम्, -विक्षेपः wagging or waving the tail; Bh. 2. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गूलविक्षेपः|लाङ्गूलविक्षेप
लाङ्गूलम् + -चालनम्, -विक्षेपः wagging or waving the tail; Bh. 2. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाङ्गूलिन्|लांगूलिन्
लाङ्गूलिन् <i>m.</i> A monkey, an ape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाज्
लाज्, लाञ्ज् €1 P. (लाजति, लाञ्जति)<BR>—1 To blame, censure.<BR>—2 To roast, fry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाञ्ज्|लांज्
लाज्, लाञ्ज् €1 P. (लाजति, लाञ्जति)<BR>—1 To blame, censure.<BR>—2 To roast, fry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाजः|लाज|लाजं
लाजः [लाज्-अच्] Wetted grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाजाः
लाजः + .{@-जाः@} (pl.) Parched or fried grain (<i>f.</i> also); (तम्) अवाकिरन्<BR> बाललताः प्रसूनैराचारलाजैरिव पौरकन्याः R. 2. 10, 4. 27, 7. 25; Ku. 7. 69, 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाजम्
लाजः + .{@-जम्@} = उशीर q. v.; लाजोल्लापिकघूमाढ्यमुच्चप्राकारतोरणम्<BR> Mb. 5. 191. 21.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लाजपेयाः, लाजमण्डः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाजपेयाः
लाजः + -पेयाः rice-gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाजमण्डः|लाजमण्ड
लाजः + -मण्डः the scum of parched grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाञ्छ्|लांछ्
लाञ्छ् €1 P. (लाञ्छति)<BR>—1 To distinguish, mark, characterize.<BR>—2 To deck, decorate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाञ्छनम्
लाञ्छनम् [लाञ्छ्-कर्मणि ल्युट्] —1 A sign, mark, token, characteristic<BR> mark; नवाम्बुदानीकमुहूर्तलाञ्छने (धनुषि) R. 3. 53; U. 4. 20;<BR> Mv. 1. 18; oft. at the end of comp. in the sense of ‘marked with’, ‘characterized by’<BR> &c.; जातेऽथ देवस्य तया विवाहमहोत्सवे साहसलाञ्छनस्य Vikr. 10. 1;<BR> R. 6. 18, 16. 84; so श्रीकण्ठपदलाञ्छनः Māl.<BR>—1 ‘bearing the characteristic epithet श्रीकण्ठ’.<BR>—2 A name, an appellation.<BR>—3 A stain, stigma, a mark of ignominy.<BR>—4 The spot on the moon; दिवापि निष्ठपूतमरीचिभासा बाल्यादनाविष्कृतलाञ्छनेन Ku. 7. 35.<BR>—5 A landmark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाञ्छित|लांछित
लाञ्छित <i>p. p.</i> [लाञ्छ्-क्त]<BR>—1 Marked, distinguished, characterized.<BR>—2 Named, called.<BR>—3 Decorated.<BR>—4 Furnished with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाटः|लाट
लाटः^1 <i>m.</i> <i>pl.</i> N. of a country and its inhabitants; एष च (लाटानुप्रासः)<BR> प्रायेण लाटजनप्रियत्वाल्लाटानुप्रासः S. D. 10.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाटः|लाट
लाट + .{@-टः@}<BR>—1 A king of the Lāṭas.<BR>—2 Old, worn out, or shabby clothes, ornaments &c.<BR>—3 Clothes in general.<BR>—4 Childish language.<BR>—5 A learned man.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लाटानुप्रासः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाटानुप्रासः|लाटानुप्रास
लाट + -अनुप्रासः one of the five kinds of अनुप्रास or alliteration,<BR> the repetition of a word or words in the same sense but in a different<BR> application; it is thus defined and illustrated by Mammaṭa:− शाब्दस्तु<BR> लाटानुप्रासो भेदे तात्पर्यमात्रतः, <i>e. g.</i> वदनं वरवर्णिन्यास्तस्याः<BR> सत्यं सुधाकरः । सुधाकरः क्व नु पुनः कलङ्कविकलो भवेत्; or यस्य<BR> न सविधे दयिता दवदहनस्तुहिनदीधितिस्तस्य । यस्य च सविधे दयिता<BR> दवदहनस्तुहिनदीधितिस्तस्य ॥ K. P. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाटक
लाटक <i>a.</i> (-टिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to the Lāṭas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाटिका
लाटिका, लाटी<BR>—1 A particular style of composition; see S. D. 629.<BR>—2 N. of a Prākṛta dialect; see Kāv. 1. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाटी
लाटिका, लाटी<BR>—1 A particular style of composition; see S. D. 629.<BR>—2 N. of a Prākṛta dialect; see Kāv. 1. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाड्
लाड् €10 U. (लाडयति-ते)<BR>—1 To fondle, caress.<BR>—2 To blame, censure.<BR>—3 To throw, toss; cf. लड्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1363-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाण्ठनी|लांठनी
