लात
लात <i>p. p.</i> Taken, received.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लातिः|लाति
लातिः <i>f.</i> Taking, receiving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लापः|लाप
लापः<BR>—1 Speaking, talking.<BR>—2 Chattering, prating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लापिका
लापिका A sort of enigma or riddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाबः|लाब
लाबः, लाबकः A sort of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाबकः|लाबक
लाबः, लाबकः A sort of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाबुः|लाबु
लाबुः(बूः) A kind of gourd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाबूः
लाबुः(बूः) A kind of gourd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाबुकायनः|लाबुकायन
लाबुकायनः N. of an old authority on philosophy quoted by Jaimini; MS. 6. 7. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाबुकी
लाबुकी A kind of lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाभ्
लाभ् €10 P. To send; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाभः|लाभ
लाभः [लभ्-भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Gaining, obtaining, acquirement, acquisition; शरीरत्यागमात्रेण<BR> शुद्धिलाभममन्यत R. 12. 10; स्त्रीरत्नलाभम् 7. 34, 11. 92; क्षणमप्यवतिष्ठते<BR> श्वसन् यदि जन्तुर्ननु लाभवानसौ R. 8. 87.<BR>—2 Gain, profit, advantage; सुखदुःखे समे कृत्वा लाभालाभौ जयाजयौ<BR> Bg. 2. 38; Y. 2. 259.<BR>—3 Enjoyment.<BR>—4 Capture, conquest.<BR>—5 Perception, knowledge, apprehension.<BR>—6 Treasure-trove; सप्त वित्तागमा धर्म्या दायो लाभः … … Ms. 10. 115.<BR>—7 Wealth, riches; मित्रलाभमनु लाभसंपदः Ki. 13. 52.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लाभकर, लाभकृत्, लाभलिप्सा, लाभलिप्सु<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाभकर
लाभः + -कर, -कृत् <i>a.</i> profitable, advantageous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाभकृत्
लाभः + -कर, -कृत् <i>a.</i> profitable, advantageous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाभलिप्सा
लाभः + -लिप्सा desire of gain, avarice, covetousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाभलिप्सु
लाभः + -लिप्सु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 greedy, covetous.<BR>—2 desirous of gain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाभ्य|लाभ्यं
लाभ्य <i>a.</i> = लाभार्ह; लभ्यो लाभ्यः स्याद्वलिभ्यः प्रशस्तः Mb. 13. 1. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाभकः|लाभक
लाभकः Gain, profit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लामज्जकम्
लामज्जकम् The root of a particular fragrant grass (वीरणमूल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाम्पट्यम्
लाम्पट्यम् Lasciviousness, lustfulness, lewdness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालम्
लालम्<BR>—1 Persuasion.<BR>—2 A secret matter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालक|लालकः
लालक <i>a.</i> (-लिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> Fondling, coaxing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालकः|लालक
लालक + .{@-कः@} A kingʼs jester.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालन|लालनं|लालनः
लालन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Fondling, coaxing, caressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालनः|लालन|लालनं
लालन + .{@-नः@} A sort of poisonous mouse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालनम्
लालन + .{@-नम्@} [लल्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Caressing, fondling, coaxing; सुतलालनम् &c.<BR>—2 Indulging, over-indulgence, fondling too much; लालने बहवो दोषास्ताडने<BR> बहवो गुणाः; Pt. 1. 169; Bh. 2. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालस|लालसः
लालस <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Ardently longing for, eagerly desirous of, hankering after; प्रणामलालसाः<BR> K. 14; ईशानसंदर्शनलालसानाम् Ku. 7. 56; Śi. 4. 6.<BR>—2 Taking pleasure in, devoted to, fond of, absorbed in; विलासलालसम्<BR> Gīt. 1; रुदती शोकलालसा Rām. 2. 21. 20; Mb. 1. 2. 229; मृगया˚ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालसः|लालस
लालस + .{@-सः@} = लालसा q. v. below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालसा
लालसा [लस् स्पृहायां यङ् लुक् भावे अ]<BR>—1 Longing or ardent desire, extreme desire, eagerness.<BR>—2 Asking, solicitation, entreaty.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">Page1364-2</a>]<BR>—3 Regret, sorrow.<BR>—4 The longing of a pregnant woman (दोहद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालसीकम्
लालसीकम् Sauce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाला
लाला [लल्-णिच् अच् टाप्] Saliva, spittle; कृमिकुलचितं लालाक्लिन्नम् Bh. 2. 9.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लालाभक्षः, लालामेहः, लालाविषः, लालास्रवः, लालास्रावः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालाभक्षः|लालाभक्ष
लाला + -भक्षः N. of a hell<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालामेहः|लालामेह
लाला + -मेहः passing mucous urine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालाविषः|लालाविष
लाला + -विषः a spider and other insects having a poisonous saliva; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालास्रवः|लालास्रव
लाला + -स्रवः a spider.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालास्रावः|लालास्राव
लाला + -स्रावः<BR>—1 a flow of saliva.<BR>—2 a spider.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालायते
लालायते Den. Ā. To emit saliva; वक्त्रं च लालायते Pt. 4. 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालाटिक|लालाटिकः
लालाटिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [ललाटं प्रभोर्भालं पश्यति ठञ्]<BR>—1 Being on or relating to the forehead.<BR>—2 Arising from or dependent on fate; प्राप्तिस्तु लालाटिकी Udb.<BR>—3 Useless, low, vile.<BR>—4 Attentive, vigilant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालाटिकः|लालाटिक
लालाटिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 An attentive servant (lit. one who watches his masterʼs countenance<BR> and learns by it what is necessary to be done).<BR>—2 An idler, a careless or useless person.<BR>—3 A kind of embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालाटी
लालाटी The forehead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालाधः|लालाध
लालाधः Epilepsy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालिकः|लालिक
लालिकः A buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालिका
लालिकः + .{@-का@} A jesting reply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालित
लालित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Caressed, fondled, coaxed, indulged.<BR>—2 Seduced.<BR>—3 Loved, desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालितम्
लालित + .{@-तम्@} Pleasure, love, joy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालितकः|लालितक
लालितकः A fondling or darling, pet, little favourite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालित्यम्
लालित्यम् [ललितस्य भावः वञ्]<BR>—1 Loveliness, charm, beauty, grace, sweetness; दण्डिनः पदलालित्यम्<BR> Udb.; लीलामन्दिरद्वारकदलीलालित्येन Dk. 1. 5.<BR>—2 Amorous gestures.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालिन्
लालिन् <i>m.</i> A seducer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालिनी
लालिनी A wanton woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लालुका
लालुका A kind of necklace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाव|लावः
लाव <i>a.</i> (-वी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [लू कर्तरि घञ् Uṇ. 1. 141]<BR>—1 Cutting, lopping, cutting off; कुशसूचिलावम् R. 13. 43.<BR>—2 Plucking, gathering.<BR>—3 Cutting down, killing, destroying; स शत्रुलावौ मन्वानः Bk. 6. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावः|लाव
लाव + .{@-वः@}<BR>—1 Cutting.<BR>—2 A quail.<BR>—3 A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावकः|लावक
लावकः<BR>—1 A cutter, divider.<BR>—2 A reaper, gatherer.<BR>—3 A quail; योध्यन्ते लावकाः Mk. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावण|लावणं
लावण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [लवण संस्कृतम् अण्]<BR>—1 Salt.<BR>—2 Salted, dressed with salt; लावणस्य समुद्रस्य विष्कम्भो द्विगुणः<BR> स्मृतः Mb. 6. 11. 6.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लावणसैन्धव<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावणसैन्धव
लावण + -सैन्धव <i>a.</i> situated on the sea-coast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावणिक|लावणिकं|लावणिकः
लावणिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [लवणे संस्कृतं ठण्]<BR>—1 Salted, dressed with salt.<BR>—2 Dealing in salt.<BR>—3 Lovely, beautiful, charming; लीलयैव सुतनोस्तुलयित्वा गौरवाढ्यमपि<BR> लावणिकेन Śi. 10. 38 (where it means ‘a salt-merchant’ also)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावणिकः|लावणिक|लावणिकं
लावणिक + .{@-कः@} A salt-merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावणिकम्
लावणिक + .{@-कम्@} A salt-vessel, salt-cellar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1364-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावण्यम्
लावण्यम् [लवणस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Saltness.<BR>—2 Beauty, loveliness, charm; तथापि तस्या लावण्यं रेखया किंचिदन्वितम्<BR> Ś. 6. 13, 7. 18; (लावण्य is thus defined in Śabdak.:− मुक्ताफलेषु<BR> छायायास्तरलत्वमिवान्तरा । प्रतिभाति यदङ्गेषु तल्लावण्यमिहोच्यते ॥).<BR> Shri Kshitishachandra points out in his Mañjūṣā that the word does<BR> not seem to have any connection with लवण (salt). The word रामण्यक<BR> (= beauty) occurs in the Rāmāyaṇa (वनरामण्यकं यत्र जलरामण्यकं<BR> तथा Araṇyakāṇḍa 25. 5). ‘रलयोरभेद इति न्यायेन सन्निहितयोरनुनासिकयोरेकस्य विषमीकरणप्रक्रियया चाननुनासिकीकरणेन लावण्यमिति निष्पन्नमिति प्रतिभाति’ ।<BR> Amaruśataka gives a verse containing a pun on the word लावण्य<BR> (saltness, loveliness):− पीता यतःप्रभृति कामपिपासितेन तस्या मयाधररसः<BR> प्रचुरः प्रियायाः । तृष्णा तदा प्रभृति मे द्विगुणत्वमेति लावण्यमस्ति<BR> बहु तत्र किमत्र चित्रम् ॥<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लावण्यार्जितम्, लावण्यकलित, लावण्यलक्ष्मीः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावण्यार्जितम्
लावण्यम् + -अर्जितम् the private property of a married woman given to her<BR> at her marriage by her father or mother-in-law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावण्यकलित
लावण्यम् + -कलित <i>a.</i> endowed with beauty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावण्यलक्ष्मीः
लावण्यम् + -लक्ष्मीः great beauty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावण्यमय
लावण्यमय, लावण्यवत् <i>a.</i> Lovely, handsome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावण्यवत्|लावण्यवन्त्
लावण्यमय, लावण्यवत् <i>a.</i> Lovely, handsome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावाणकः|लावाणक
लावाणकः, लवानकः [लू-आनकः Uṇ. 3. 84] N. of a district near Magadha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लवानकः|लवानक
लावाणकः, लवानकः [लू-आनकः Uṇ. 3. 84] N. of a district near Magadha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाविकः|लाविक
लाविकः A buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लावु|लावुः
लावु See लाबु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लाषुक
लाषुक <i>a.</i> (-का or -की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Covetous, greedy, avaricious; P. III. 2. 154.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासः|लास
लासः [लस्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Jumping, sporting, skipping about, dancing; मदनजनितलासैः Ṛs. 6. 30.<BR>—2 Dalliance, wanton sport.<BR>—3 Dancing as practised by women.<BR>—4 Soup, broth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासक|लासकं|लासकः
लासक <i>a.</i> (-सिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [लस्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Playing, frolicking, sporting.<BR>—2 Moving hither and thither.<BR>—3 Causing to dance; लासकः पादपानां … नभस्वान् Ṛs. 2. 26<BR> (the commentator Amarakīrti, however, says, “लासकः संसर्गवान्”).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासकः|लासक|लासकं
लासक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A dancer.<BR>—2 A peacock.<BR>—3 Embracing.<BR>—4 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासकम्
लासक + .{@-कम्@} A room on the top of a building, turret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासकी
लासकी A female dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासनम्
लासनम् Moving hither and thither; तोमराङ्कुशलासनैः Mb. 7. 142. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासिक
लासिक <i>a.</i> Dancing; सविलासलासिकविलासिनीजनः Śi. 13. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लासिका
लासिका<BR>—1 A female dancer.<BR>—2 A harlot, wanton or unchaste woman.<BR>—3 A kind of dramatic performance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लास्यम्
लास्यम् [लस्-ण्यत्]<BR>—1 Dancing; a dance; आस्ये धास्यति कस्य लास्यमधुना … वाचां विपाको<BR> मम Bv. 4. 42; R. 16. 14.<BR>—2 A dance accompanied with singing and instrumental music.<BR>—3 A dance in which the emotions of love<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">Page1365-2</a>]<BR> are represented by means of various gesticulations and attitudes; अरुणाधरकिरणबालकिसलयलास्यहेतुभिः Dk. 2. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लास्यः|लास्य|लास्यं
लास्यम् + .{@-स्यः@} A dancer, an actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लास्या
लास्यम् + .{@-स्या@} A dancing girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लास्फोटनी
लास्फोटनी A gimlet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिः|लि
लिः<BR>—1 Fatigue.<BR>—2 Destruction, loss.<BR>—3 End.<BR>—4 Equality.<BR>—5 A bracelet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिकुचः|लिकुच|लिकुचं
लिकुचः See लकुच.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिक्षा
लिक्षा, -लिख्या<BR> [रिषेः सः कित् Uṇ. 3. 66]<BR>—1 A nit, the egg of a louse.<BR>—2 A very minute measure of weight (said to be equal to 4 or 8 <i>trasareṇus</i>);<BR> जालान्तरगते भानौ यच्चाणुर्दृश्यते रजः । तैश्चतुर्भिर्भवेल्लिक्षा;<BR> or त्रसरेणवोऽष्टौ विज्ञेया लिक्षैका परिमाणतः Ms. 8. 133; see Y. 1. 362 also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिख्या
लिक्षा, -लिख्या<BR> [रिषेः सः कित् Uṇ. 3. 66]<BR>—1 A nit, the egg of a louse.<BR>—2 A very minute measure of weight (said to be equal to 4 or 8 <i>trasareṇus</i>);<BR> जालान्तरगते भानौ यच्चाणुर्दृश्यते रजः । तैश्चतुर्भिर्भवेल्लिक्षा;<BR> or त्रसरेणवोऽष्टौ विज्ञेया लिक्षैका परिमाणतः Ms. 8. 133; see Y. 1. 362 also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिक्षिका
लिक्षिका A nit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिख्
लिख् €6 P. (लिखति, लिखित)<BR>—1 To write, write down, inscribe, draw a line, engrave; अरसिकेषु कवित्वनिवेदनं<BR> शिरसि मा लिख मा लिख मा लिख Udb.; ताराक्षरैर्यामसिते कठिन्या निशालिखद्<BR> व्योम्नि तमःप्रशस्तिम् N. 22. 54; Y. 2. 87; Ś. 7. 5; लीनेव प्रतिबिम्बितेव<BR> लिखितेव Māl. 5. 10.<BR>—2 To sketch, draw, portray, delineate, paint; मृगमदतिलकं लिखति<BR> सपुलकं मृगमिव रजनीकरे Gīt. 7; मत्सादृश्यं विरहतनु वा<BR> भावगम्यं लिखन्ती Me. 87, 82; Ku. 6. 48; स्मित्वा पाणौ खड्गलेखां लिलेख<BR> K. P. 10; केशग्रहः खलु तदा द्रुपदात्मजाया द्रोणस्य चाद्य लिखितैरिव<BR> वीक्षितो यैः Ve. 3. 11.<BR>—3 To scratch, rub, scrape, tear up; न किंचिदूचे चरणेन केवलं लिलेख<BR> बाष्पाकुललोचना भुवम् Ki. 8. 14; मूर्ध्ना दिवमिवालेखीत् Bk. 15. 22.<BR>—4 To lance, scarify.<BR>—5 To touch, graze.<BR>—6 To peck (as a bird).<BR>—7 To make smooth.<BR>—8 To unite sexually with a female.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखकः|लिखक
लिखकः [लिख्-क्वुन् Uṇ. 2. 32] A writer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखनम्
लिखनम् [लिख्-भावादौ ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Writing, inscribing.<BR>—2 Drawing, painting.<BR>—3 Scratching.<BR>—4 A written document, a writing or manuscript.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखित|लिखितं|लिखितः
लिखित <i>p. p.</i> [लिख्-क्त] Written, painted, scratched &c.; see लिख्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखितः|लिखित|लिखितं
लिखित + .{@-तः@} N. of a writer on law (mentioned along with शङ्ख).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखितम्
लिखित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 A writing, document.<BR>—2 A picture; द्रोणस्य चाद्य लिखितैरिव वीक्षितो यैः Ve. 3. 13.<BR>—3 Any book or composition.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लिखितपठित, लिखितपाठः, लिखितस्मृतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखितपठित
लिखित + -पठित <i>a.</i> written and read about; described; लिखितपठिता<BR> राज्ञो दाराः कविप्रतिभासु ये शृणुत शृणुतासूर्यंपश्या न सा किल भाविनी<BR> N. 19. 36; इक्ष्वाकूणां लिखितपठिता स्वर्वधूगण्डपीठक्रीडापत्रप्रकरमकरीपाशुपाल्यं<BR> हि वृत्तिः A. R. 1. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखितपाठः|लिखितपाठ
लिखित + -पाठः learning from books.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखितस्मृतिः|लिखितस्मृति
लिखित + -स्मृतिः N. of a law-book.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिखितृ
लिखितृ <i>m.</i> A painter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिख्यः|लिख्य
लिख्यः A nit, the egg of a louse; cf. लिक्षा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्ख्|लिंख्
लिङ्ख् €1 P. (लिङ्खति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिगुः|लिगु
लिगुः [लिग्-कुः Uṇ. 1. 36]<BR>—1 A deer.<BR>—2 A fool, blockhead.<BR>—3 A sage. ━<i>n.</i> The heart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1365-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्
लिङ् A technical term used by Pāṇini to denote the Potential and<BR> Benedictive moods or their terminations (the two moods being distinguished<BR> as विधिलिङ् and आशीर्लिङ्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्ग्|लिंग्
लिङ्ग् I. €1 P. (लिङ्गति, लिङ्गित) To go, move. ━II. €10 U. (लिङ्गयति-ते)<BR>—1 To paint, variegate.<BR>—2 To inflect (a noun) according to its gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गम्|लिंगम्
लिङ्गम् [लिङ्ग्-अच्]<BR>—1 A mark, sign, token, an emblem, a badge, symbol, distinguishing mark,<BR> characteristic; यतिपार्थिवलिङ्गधारिणौ R. 8. 16; अथवा प्रावृषेण्यैरेव<BR> लिङ्गैर्मम राजोपचारः संप्रति V. 4; मुनिर्दोहदलिङ्गदर्शी 14. 71;<BR> Ms. 1. 30, 8. 25, 252.<BR>—2 A false or unreal mark, a guise, disguise, a deceptive badge; लिङ्गैर्मुदः<BR> संवृतविक्रियास्ते R. 7. 30; क्षपणकलिङ्गधारी Mu. 1; न लिङ्गं<BR> धर्मकारणम् H. 4. 85. See लिङ्गिन् below.<BR>—3 A symptom, mark of disease.<BR>—4 A means of proof, a proof, evidence.<BR>—5 (In logic) The <i>hetu</i> or middle term in a syllogism; particularly<BR> the assertion of the <i>hetuʼs</i> being found in the पक्ष or minor<BR> term coupled with the statement of the invariable concomitance between<BR> this <i>hetu</i> and the major term; it is thus defined:− व्याप्तिपक्षधर्मतावल्लिङ्गम् Tarka K.<BR>—6 The sign of gender or sex.<BR>—7 Sex; गुणाः पूजास्थानं गुणिषु न च लिङ्गं न च वयः U. 4. 11.<BR>—8 The male organ of generation.<BR>—9 Gender (in gram.)<BR>—10 The genital organ of Śiva worshipped in the form of a Phallus.<BR>—11 The image of a god, an idol; धत्तेऽसावात्मनो लिङ्गं मायया विसृजन्<BR> गुणान् Bhāg. 7. 2. 22.<BR>—12 One of the relations or indications (such as संयोग, वियोग, साहचर्य<BR> &c.) which serve to fix the meaning of a word in any particular passage;<BR> <i>e. g.</i> in कुपितो मकरध्वजः the word कुपित restricts the<BR> meaning of मकरध्वज to ‘Kāma’; see K. P. 2 and commentary <i>ad loc.</i>;<BR> तदेव सक्तः सह कर्मणैति लिङ्गं मनो यत्र निषक्तमस्य<BR> Bṛ. Up. 4. 4. 6.<BR>—13 (In Vedānta phil.). The subtle frame or body, the indestructible<BR> original of the gross or visible body; cf. पञ्चकोष; यं योगिनो योगसमाधिना<BR> रहो ध्यायन्ति लिङ्गादसुतो मुमुक्षया Bhāg. 3. 19. 28.<BR>—14 A spot, stain.<BR>—15 The nominal base, the crude form of a noun (प्रातिपदिक).<BR>—16 (In Sāṅ. phil.) Pradhāna or Prakṛti; q. v.<BR>—17 The effect or product (that which is evolved out of a primary cause<BR> and itself becomes a producer).<BR>—18 Inference, conclusion; अव्यक्तमिति विज्ञेयं लिङ्गग्राह्यमतीन्द्रियम्<BR> Mb. 12. 189. 15.<BR>—19 = उपाधि; योगेन धृत्युद्यमसत्त्वयुक्तो लिङ्गं व्यपोहेत् कुशलोऽहमाख्यम्<BR> Bhāg. 5. 5. 13.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लिङ्गाग्रम्, लिङ्गानुशासनम्, लिङ्गार्चनम्, लिङ्गार्शस्, लिङ्गाख्यः, लिङ्गदेहः, लिङ्गशरीरम्, लिङ्गघारिन्, लिङ्गनाशः, लिङ्गपरामर्शः, लिङ्गपीठम्, लिङ्गपुराणम्, लिङ्गप्रतिष्ठा, लिङ्गवर्धन, लिङ्गविपर्ययः, लिङ्गवृत्ति, लिङ्गवृत्तिः, लिङ्गवेदी, लिङ्गशास्त्रम्, लिङ्गशोफः, लिङ्गस्थः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गाग्रम्
लिङ्गम् + -अग्रम् the glans penis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गानुशासनम्
लिङ्गम् + -अनुशासनम् the laws of grammatical gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गार्चनम्
लिङ्गम् + -अर्चनम् the worship of Śiva as a <i>liṅga</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गार्शस्
लिङ्गम् + -अर्शस् <i>n.</i> a particular disease of the genital organs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गाख्यः
लिङ्गम् + -आख्यः Name of one of the sub-divisions of the production according<BR> to Sāṅkhya; लिङ्गाख्यो भावाख्यः Sāṅ. K. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गदेहः|लिङ्गदेह|लिंगदेह
लिङ्गम् + -देहः, -शरीरम् the subtle frame or body; see लिङ्ग (13) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गशरीरम्
लिङ्गम् + -देहः, -शरीरम् the subtle frame or body; see लिङ्ग (13) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गघारिन्
लिङ्गम् + -घारिन् <i>a.</i> wearing a badge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गनाशः|लिङ्गनाश|लिंगनाश
लिङ्गम् + -नाशः<BR>—1 loss of the characteristic marks.<BR>—2 loss of penis.<BR>—3 loss of vision, a particular<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">Page1366-2</a>]<BR> disease of the eye.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गपरामर्शः|लिङ्गपरामर्श|लिंगपरामर्श
लिङ्गम् + -परामर्शः the finding out or consideration of a sign or characteristic<BR> (in logic); (<i>e. g.</i> that smoke is a sign of fire); as वह्निव्याप्यधूमवानयं<BR> पर्वतः इति लिङ्गपरामर्शः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गपीठम्
लिङ्गम् + -पीठम् the pedestal of a शिवलिङ्ग.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गपुराणम्
लिङ्गम् + -पुराणम् N. of one of the 18 Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गप्रतिष्ठा|लिंगप्रतिष्ठा
लिङ्गम् + -प्रतिष्ठा the establishment or consecration of a <i>liṅga</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गवर्धन
लिङ्गम् + -वर्धन <i>a.</i> causing erection of the male organ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गविपर्ययः|लिङ्गविपर्यय|लिंगविपर्यय
लिङ्गम् + -विपर्ययः change of gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गवृत्ति|लिंगवृत्ति|लिङ्गवृत्तिः
लिङ्गम् + -वृत्ति <i>a.</i> hypocritical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गवृत्तिः|लिङ्गवृत्ति|लिंगवृत्ति
लिङ्गम् + -वृत्तिः a religious hypocrite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गवेदी|लिंगवेदी
लिङ्गम् + -वेदी the base or pedestal of a <i>liṅga</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गशास्त्रम्
लिङ्गम् + -शास्त्रम् a grammatical treatise on gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गशोफः|लिङ्गशोफ
लिङ्गम् + -शोफः swelling on the penis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गस्थः|लिङ्गस्थ
लिङ्गम् + -स्थः a religious student; न श्रोत्रियो न लिङ्गस्थः (साक्षी<BR> कार्यः) Ms. 8. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गकः|लिङ्गक|लिंगक|लिंगकः
लिङ्गकः The <i>Kapittha</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गनम्
लिङ्गनम् Embracing; an embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गवत्|लिंगवत्|लिङ्गवन्त्
लिङ्गवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having marks.<BR>—2 Having various sexes or genders.<BR>—3 Wearing a <i>Liṅga</i> (as a Jaṅgama).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गालिका
लिङ्गालिका A kind of small mouse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गिन्|लिंगिन्
लिङ्गिन् <i>a.</i> [लिङ्गमस्त्यस्य इनि]<BR>—1 Having a mark or sign.<BR>—2 Characterized by.<BR>—3 Wearing the maks or badges of, having the appearance of, disguised<BR> as, hypocritical, wearing false badges (at the end of comp.); स वर्णिलिङ्गी<BR> विदितः समाययौ युधिष्ठिरं द्वैतवने वनेचरः Ki. 1. 1; so आर्यलिङ्गिन्.<BR>—4 Furnished with a <i>liṅga</i>.<BR>—5 Having a right to wear signs or badges.<BR>—6 One whose outward form corresponds with his inward character.<BR>—7 Having a subtle body. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A religious student, Brāhmaṇa ascetic; अलिङ्गी लिङ्गिवेषेण यो वृत्तिमुपजीवति ।<BR> स लिङ्गिनां हरत्येनस्तिर्यग्यौनौ च जायते ॥ Ms. 4. 200; स्त्रीलिङ्गिविप्रबालानां<BR> प्रहर्तव्यं न कर्हिचित् Pt. 4. 39.<BR>—2 A worshipper of Śivaʼs <i>liṅga</i>.<BR>—3 A hypocrite, pretending devotee, pseudoascetic.<BR>—4 An elephant.<BR>—5 (In logic) That which possesses the <i>liṅga</i> or middle term;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> वह्नि is the लिङ्गिन् in the familiar instance पर्वतो<BR> वह्निमान् धूमात्.<BR>—6 (Hence) The subject of a proposition.<BR>—7 The Supreme Being (as the sustainer of <i>liṅga</i>).<BR>—8 The cause or source. —9 N. of a Śaiva sect.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लिङ्गिवेषः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिङ्गिवेषः|लिङ्गिवेष
लिङ्गिन् + -वेषः the dress of a religious student.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिच्छविः|लिच्छवि
लिच्छ(च्छि)विः N. of a regal race.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिच्छिविः|लिच्छिवि
लिच्छ(च्छि)विः N. of a regal race.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिट्
लिट् A technical term in grammar used by Pāṇini to denote the Perfect<BR> tense or its terminations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिधु
लिधु A technical term in grammar used by Pāṇini for nominal verbs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिन्दु|लिंदु
लिन्दु <i>a.</i> Ved. Slimy, slippery (पिच्छिल); लिन्दु माभिगाम्<BR> Ch. Up. 8. 14. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्
लिप् €6 U. (लिम्पति-ते, लिप्त)<BR>—1 To anoint, smear, besmear; लिम्पतीव तमोऽङ्गानि Mk. 1. 34.<BR>—2 To cover, overspread; plaster; लिप्तेषु भासा गृहदेहलीनाम् Śi. 3. 48.<BR>—3 To<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">Page1367-1</a>]<BR> stain, pollute, defile, taint, contaminate; यः करोति स लिप्यते<BR> Pt. 4. 64; न मां कर्माणि लिम्पन्ति Bg. 4. 14, 18. 17; Ms. 10. 106.<BR>—4 To inflame, kindle; तस्यालिपत शोकाग्निः स्वान्तं काष्ठमिव ज्वलन्<BR> Bk. 6. 22. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cast blame on anyone.<BR>—2 To smear anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपः|लिप
लिपः Smearing, anointing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिः|लिपि
लिपिः, -पी <i>f.</i><BR> [लिप् इक् वा ङीप्]<BR>—1 Anointing, smearing.<BR>—2 Writing, hand-writing.<BR>—3 The written characters, letters, alphabet; यवनाल्लिप्याम् Vārt.;<BR> लिपेर्यथावद्ग्रहणेन वाङ्मयं नदीमुखेनेव समुद्रमाविशत् R. 3. 28, 18. 46.<BR>—4 The art of writing.<BR>—5 A writing (as a letter, document, manuscript &c.); अयं दरिद्रो भवितेति<BR> वैधसीं लिपिं ललाटेऽर्थिजनस्य जाग्रतीम् N. 1. 15, 138.<BR>—6 Painting, drawing.<BR>—7 Outward appearance.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लिपिकरः, लिपिकर्मन्, लिपिज्ञानम्, लिपिकारः, लिपिज्ञ, लिपिन्यासः, लिपिफलकम्, लिपिशाला, लिपिसज्जा, लिपिसंनाहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपी
लिपिः, -पी <i>f.</i><BR> [लिप् इक् वा ङीप्]<BR>—1 Anointing, smearing.<BR>—2 Writing, hand-writing.<BR>—3 The written characters, letters, alphabet; यवनाल्लिप्याम् Vārt.;<BR> लिपेर्यथावद्ग्रहणेन वाङ्मयं नदीमुखेनेव समुद्रमाविशत् R. 3. 28, 18. 46.<BR>—4 The art of writing.<BR>—5 A writing (as a letter, document, manuscript &c.); अयं दरिद्रो भवितेति<BR> वैधसीं लिपिं ललाटेऽर्थिजनस्य जाग्रतीम् N. 1. 15, 138.<BR>—6 Painting, drawing.<BR>—7 Outward appearance.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लिपिकरः, लिपिकर्मन्, लिपिज्ञानम्, लिपिकारः, लिपिज्ञ, लिपिन्यासः, लिपिफलकम्, लिपिशाला, लिपिसज्जा, लिपिसंनाहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिकरः|लिपिकर
लिपिः + -करः<BR>—1 a plasterer, white-washer, mason.<BR>—2 a writer, scribe.<BR>—3 an engraver (also लिपिंकर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिकर्मन्
लिपिः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> drawing, painting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिज्ञानम्
लिपिः + -ज्ञानम् the art of writing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिकारः|लिपिकार
लिपिः + -कारः a writer, scribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिज्ञ
लिपिः + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> one who can write.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिन्यासः|लिपिन्यास
लिपिः + -न्यासः the art of writing or transcribing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिफलकम्
लिपिः + -फलकम् a writing tablet or board.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिशाला
लिपिः + -शाला a writing school.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिसज्जा
लिपिः + -सज्जा writing materials or apparatus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिसंनाहः|लिपिसन्नाह
लिपिः + -संनाहः a belt worn on the fore-arm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिकः|लिपिक
लिपिकः A scribe, clerk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिपिका
लिपिका See लिपी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्त|लिप्तं
लिप्त <i>p. p.</i> [लिप्-क्त]<BR>—1 Anointed, smeared, besmeared, covered.<BR>—2 Stained, soiled, polluted, defiled.<BR>—3 Poisoned, envenomed (as an arrow).<BR>—4 Eaten.<BR>—5 United, joined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्तम्
लिप्त + .{@-प्तम्@} <i>n.</i> Phlegm; the phlegmatic humour of the body.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लिप्तवासित, लिप्तहस्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्तवासित
लिप्त + -वासित <i>a.</i> anointed and perfumed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्तहस्त
लिप्त + -हस्त <i>a.</i> having the hands smeared or stained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्तकः|लिप्तक
लिप्तकः A poisoned arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्ता
लिप्ता, -लिप्तिका<BR> A minute, the sixtieth part of a degree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्तिका
लिप्ता, -लिप्तिका<BR> A minute, the sixtieth part of a degree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्सा
लिप्सा [लभ्-सन्-भावे अ]<BR>—1 Desire of getting or regaining; मृतस्य लिप्सा कृपणस्य दित्सा … … न<BR> हि दृष्टपूर्वा Bv. 1. 125.<BR>—2 Desire in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिप्सु|लिप्सुः
लिप्सु <i>a.</i> Desirous of getting &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिबिः|लिबि
लिबिः, -बी <i>f.</i><BR> = लिपि q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिबी
लिबिः, -बी <i>f.</i><BR> = लिपि q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिबिंकरः|लिबिङ्कर|लिबिङ्करः
लिबिंकरः A scribe, writer, copyist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिम्पः|लिम्प|लिंप|लिंपः
लिम्पः Smearing, anointing, covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिम्पट|लिंपट|लिम्पटः
लिम्पट <i>a.</i> Libidinous, lustful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिम्पटः|लिम्पट|लिंपट
लिम्पट + .{@-टः@} A libertine, lecher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिम्पाकः|लिम्पाक|लिंपाक|लिम्पाकं|लिंपाकः
लिम्पाकः [लिप् आकन् पृषो˚]<BR>—1 The citron or lime tree.<BR>—2 An ass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिम्पाकम्
लिम्पाकः + .{@-कम्@} A citron or lime.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिम्पिः|लिम्पि|लिंपिः
लिम्पिः, -लिविः <i>f.</i><BR> = लिपि q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिविः|लिवि
लिम्पिः, -लिविः <i>f.</i><BR> = लिपि q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिलक्षयिषित
लिलक्षयिषित (<i>desid.</i> of लक्ष्, <i>p. p.</i>) Had in view, meant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिश्
लिश् I. €6 P. (लिशति)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To hurt; see रिश्. ━II. €4 U. (लिश्यति-ते) To become small, be decreased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिष्ट
लिष्ट <i>p. p.</i> Become small, lessened, decreased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिष्वः|लिष्व
लिष्वः [लिष्-वन् Uṇ. 1. 142] An actor, a dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिह्
लिह् €2 U. (लेढि, लीढे, लिलेह-लिलिहे, अलिक्षत्-त, अलीढ, लेक्ष्यति-ते,<BR> लेढुम्, लीढ, <i>desid.</i> लिलिक्षति-ते)<BR>—1 To lick; कपाले मार्जारः पय इति कराँल्लेढि शशिनः K. P. 19;<BR> Bv. 1. 99; Ki. 5. 38; Śi. 12. 40.<BR>—2 To lick up, taste, sip, lap; लिलिहुर्वहुधा सुधाकरम् N. 2. 99;<BR> लिलिहे स्वरुचा पताकया निशि जिह्वानिभया सुधाकरम् 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लिहः|लिह
लिहः, -लेढृ <i>m.</i><BR> Mild wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेढृ
लिहः, -लेढृ <i>m.</i><BR> Mild wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीढ|लीढः
लीढ <i>p. p.</i> [लिह्-आस्वादे-क्त] Licked, sapped, tasted, eaten<BR> &c.; see लिह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ली
ली I. €1 P. (लयति) To melt, dissolve. ━II. €9 P. (लिनाति)<BR>—1 To adhere.<BR>—2 To melt, usually with वि. ━III. €4 Ā. (लीयते, लीन)<BR>—1 To stick or adhere firmly to, cling to.<BR>—2 To clasp, embrace.<BR>—3 To lie or rest on, recline, stay or dwell in, lurk, hide, cower down;<BR> (भृङ्गाङ्गनाः) लीयन्ते मुकुलान्तरेषु शनकैः संजातलज्जा इव Ratn. 1. 26;<BR> हरिशिशुरुत्पतितुं द्रागङ्गान्याकुञ्च्य लीयते निमृतम् Bv. 1. 106;<BR> R. 3. 9; Ś. 6. 16; Ku. 1. 12, 7. 21; Bk. 18. 13; Ki. 5. 26.<BR>—4 To be dissolved, melt away.<BR>—5 To be sticky or viscous.<BR>—6 To be absorbed in, be devoted or attached to; माधव मनसिजविशिखभयादिव<BR> भावनया त्वयि लीना Gīt. 4.<BR>—7 To vanish, disappear. ━<i>Caus.</i> (लापयति-ते, लाययति-ते, लीनयति-ते,<BR> लालयति-ते) To melt, dissolve, liquefy. (The form लापयते is used<BR> in the sense of ‘to honour’, ‘cause to be honoured’; जटाभिर्लापयते<BR> = पूजामधिगच्छति; cf. P. I. 3. 70.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीः
लीः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Adhering, clinging to.<BR>—2 Embracing.<BR>—3 Melting, dissolving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीन|लीनः
लीन <i>p. p.</i> [ली-क्त]<BR>—1 Clung or adhered to, stuck to.<BR>—2 Lurking, hid, concealed.<BR>—3 Resting or reclining on; कार्या सैकतलीनहंसमिथुना स्रोतोवहा मालिनी Ś. 6. 17.<BR>—4 Melted, dissolved; लीनेव प्रतिबिम्बितेव … … सा नश्चेतसि कीलितेव Māl. 5. 10.<BR>—5 Completely absorbed or swallowed up in, intimately united with; नद्यः<BR> सागरे लीना भवन्ति.<BR>—6 Devoted or given up to.<BR>—7 Disappeared, vanished; (see ली).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीक्का
लीक्का A nit; see लिक्षा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीला
लीला [ली-क्विप् लियं लाति ला-क वा Tv.]<BR>—1 Play, sport, pastime, diversion, pleasure, amusement; क्लमं ययौ<BR> कन्दुकलीलयापि या Ku. 5. 19; oft. used as the first member of comp.;<BR> लीलाकमलम्, लीलाशुकः &c.<BR>—2 Amorous pastime, wanton, amorous or playful sport; उत्सृष्टलीलागतिः<BR> R. 7. 7, 4. 22, 5. 70; क्षुभ्यन्ति प्रसभमहो विनापि हेतोलींलाभिः किमु<BR> सति कारणे रमण्यः Śi. 8. 24; Me. 37; (लीला in this sense is<BR> thus explained by उज्ज्वलमणिः━ अप्राप्तवल्लभसमागमनायिकायाः सख्याः<BR> पुरोऽत्र निजचित्तविनोदबुद्धपा । आलापवेशगातिहास्यविलोकनाद्यैः प्राणेश्वरानुकृतिमाकलयन्ति लीलाम् ॥).<BR>—3 Ease, facility, mere sport, childʼs play; लीलया जवान ‘killed with ease’.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">Page1368-1</a>]<BR>—4 Appearance, semblance, air, mien; यः संयति प्राप्तपिनाकिलीलः R. 6. 72<BR> ‘appearing like Pinākin’.<BR>—5 Beauty, charm, grace; मुहुरवलोकितमण्डनलीला Gīt. 6; R. 6. 1, 16. 71.<BR>—6 Pretence, disguise, dissimulation, sham; as, लीलामनुष्यः, लीलानटः &c.<BR>—7 Frivolity, disrespect; दातव्यमन्नं विधिवत् सत्कृत्य न तु लीलया<BR> Rām. 1. 13. 14.<BR>—8 Action.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लीलागारः, लीलागारः, लीलागारम्, लीलागृहम्, लीलावेश्मन्, लीलाङ्ग, लीलाञ्चित, लीलाब्जम्, लीलाम्बुजम्, लीलारविन्दम्, लीलाकमलम्, लीलातामरसम्, लीलापद्मम्, लीलावतारः, लीलाभरणम्, लीलोद्यानम्, लीलाकलहः, लीलाचतुर, लीलातनुः, लीलादग्ध, लीलानटनम्, लीलानृत्यम्, लीलामनुष्यः, लीलामात्रम्, लीलारतिः, लीलावज्रम्, लीलावापी, लीलाशुकः, लीलासाध्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलागारः|लीलागार
लीला + -अगारः, -आगारः, -आगारम्, -गृहम्, -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i> a pleasure-house;<BR> लीलागारेष्वरमत पुनर्नन्दनाभ्यन्तरेषु R. 8. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलागारः|लीलागार
लीला + -अगारः, -आगारः, -आगारम्, -गृहम्, -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i> a pleasure-house;<BR> लीलागारेष्वरमत पुनर्नन्दनाभ्यन्तरेषु R. 8. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

