लीलापद्मम्
लीला + -अब्जम्, -अम्बुजम्, -अरविन्दम्, -कमलम्, -तामरसम्, -पद्मम् &c.<BR> ‘toy-lotus’, a lotus-flower held in the hand as a play-thing; लीलारविन्दं<BR> भ्रमयाञ्चकार R. 6. 13; हस्ते लीलाकमलमलके बालकुन्दानुविद्धम्<BR> Me. 67; Ku. 6. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलावतारः|लीलावतार
लीला + -अवतारः the descent (of Viṣṇu) on the earth for amusement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलाभरणम्
लीला + -आभरणम् an ornament worn for mere pleasure (of no value).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलोद्यानम्
लीला + -उद्यानम्<BR>—1 a pleasure-garden.<BR>—2 the garden of gods, Indraʼs paradise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलाकलहः|लीलाकलह
लीला + -कलहः ‘sportive quarrel’, a sham or feigned quarrel; cf. प्रणयकलह.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलाचतुर
लीला + -चतुर <i>a.</i> sportively charming; तां वीक्ष्य लीलाचतुरामनङ्गः<BR> स्वचापसौन्दर्यमदं मुमोच Ku. 1. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलातनुः|लीलातनु
लीला + -तनुः a form assumed for mere sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलादग्ध
लीला + -दग्ध <i>a.</i> burnt without effort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलानटनम्
लीला + -नटनम्, -नृत्यम् a sportive dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलानृत्यम्
लीला + -नटनम्, -नृत्यम् a sportive dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलामनुष्यः|लीलामनुष्य
लीला + -मनुष्यः a sham man, a man in disguise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलामात्रम्
लीला + -मात्रम् mere sport or play, childʼs play, absence of the least effort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलारतिः|लीलारति
लीला + -रतिः <i>f.</i> diversion, sport.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलावज्रम्
लीला + -वज्रम् an instrument like Indraʼs thunderbolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलावापी
लीला + -वापी a pleasure-tank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलाशुकः|लीलाशुक
लीला + -शुकः a parrot kept for pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलासाध्य
लीला + -साध्य <i>a.</i> to be effected with ease, easy of accomplishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलायति
लीलायति, -ते Den. U.<BR> To sport, play, divert oneself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलायते
लीलायति, -ते Den. U.<BR> To sport, play, divert oneself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलायितम्
लीलायितम् Play, sport, amusement, pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलावत्|लीलावन्त्
लीलावत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sportive, playful.<BR>—2 Beautiful, graceful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लीलावती
लीलावत् + .{@-ती@}<BR>—1 A charming or handsome woman.<BR>—2 An amorous or wanton woman.<BR>—3 N. of Durgā.<BR>—4 N. of a well-known mathematical work by Bhāskarācārya.<BR>—5 N. of the wife of the demon Maya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुक्
लुक् <i>ind.</i> A technical term used by Pāṇini to express the dropping<BR> or disappearance of affixes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुङ्
लुङ् A technical term used by Pāṇini to denote the Aorist or its terminations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुञ्च्|लुंच्
लुञ्च् €1 P. (लुञ्चति, लुञ्चित)<BR>—1 To pluck, pull, peel, pare.<BR>—2 To tear off, pluck or pull out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुञ्च्|लुंच्
लुञ्च् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Plucking out.<BR>—2 Dropping out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुञ्चः|लुञ्च|लुंचः
लुञ्चः, -लुञ्चनम्<BR> Peeling, plucking out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुञ्चनम्
लुञ्चः, -लुञ्चनम्<BR> Peeling, plucking out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुञ्चना
लुञ्चना Concise speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुञ्चित|लुंचित
लुञ्चित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Peeled.<BR>—2 Plucked, plucked out, torn off.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लुञ्चितकेशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुञ्चितकेशः|लुञ्चितकेश
लुञ्चित + -केशः one having the hair torn out; जटिलो मुण्डी लुञ्चितकेज्ञः<BR> Carpaṭa. S. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुञ्ज्
लुञ्ज् €10 U.<BR>—1 To speak.<BR>—2 To shine; see लञ्ज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुट्
लुट् I. €1 Ā. (लोटते)<BR>—1 To resist, repel, oppose.<BR>—2 To shine.<BR>—3 To suffer pain. ━II. €10 U. (लोटयति-ते)<BR>—1 To speak.<BR>—2 To shine. ━III. €1. €4 P. (लोटति-लुट्यति)<BR>—1 To roll, wallow on the ground; cf. लुठ्.<BR>—2 To take away, rob, plunder (perhaps for लुण्ठ् or लुण्ट्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुट्
लुट् A technical term used by Pāṇini to denote the First or Periphrastic<BR> Future or its terminations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठ्
लुठ् I. €1 P. (लोठति) To strike, knock down. ━II. €1 Ā. (लोठते)<BR>—1 To roll on the ground.<BR>—2 To go, move.<BR>—3 To resist, oppose. ━III. €10 U. (लोठयति-ते) To rob, plunder.<BR>━IV. €6 P. (लुठति)<BR>—1 To roll about, roll on the ground, wallow, welter, move to and fro;<BR> मणिर्लुठति पादेषु काचः शिरसि धार्यते H. 2. 67; लुठति न सा हिमकरकिरणेन<BR> Gīt. 7; हारोऽयं हरिणाक्षीणां लुठति स्तनमण्डले Amaru. 100; गृहे<BR> गृहे पश्य तवाङ्गवर्णा मुग्धे सुवर्णावलयो लुठन्ति Bv. 2. 176; Bk. 14. 54.<BR>—2 To agitate, move, stir.<BR>—3 To touch; पृषदपरुषविषाणाग्रेण लुठति Bhāg. 5. 8. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठनम्
लुठनम् [लुठ्-ल्युट्] Rolling, wallowing, moving to and fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठित|लुठितः
लुठित <i>p. p.</i> Rolled down, rolling or wallowing on the ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुठितम्
लुठित + .{@-तम्@} The rolling on the ground (of a horse).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुड्
लुड् I. €1 P. (लोडति) To stir, agitate, churn, disturb. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> (लोडयति-ते) To stir, churn, agitate. (used with वि in the same<BR> sense); कलशिमुदधिगुर्वी बल्लवा लोडयन्ति Śi. 11. 8; गजः पृथुकराकृष्टशतपत्रमलोडयत् 19. 69.<BR>━II. €6 P. (लुडति)<BR>—1 To adhere.<BR>—2 To cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्ट्|लुंट्
लुण्ट् I. €1 P. (लुण्टति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To steal, rob, plunder.<BR>—3 To be lame or crippled.<BR>—4 To be idle or lazy. ━II. €1 P., €10 U. (लुण्टयति-ते)<BR>—1 To rob, plunder, steal; कटकं लुण्टयामास स कृष्णो भास्करात्मजः<BR> Parṇāl. 5. 106.<BR>—2 To disregard, despise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्टा|लुंटा
लुण्टा<BR>—1 Robbing.<BR>—2 Rolling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्टाक|लुंटाक|लुण्टाकः
लुण्टाक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Stealing (fig. also), robbing, plundering; तरुणानां<BR> हृदयलुण्टाकीं परिष्वक्कमाणां निवारयति K. P. 10-569; आः सितशकुनयः<BR> केयं लुण्टाकता B. R. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्टाकः|लुण्टाक|लुंटाक
लुण्टाक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A thief; इतो लुण्टाकानां समुदय इतः कण्टकचयः Viś. Guṇā. 208.<BR>—2 A crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्ठ्|लुंठ्
लुण्ठ् €1 P. (लुण्ठति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To stir up, agitate, set in motion.<BR>—3 To be idle.<BR>—4 To be lame.<BR>—5 To rob, plunder; युध्यन्तः शिवसैन्येन लुण्ठिताश्चावकुण्ठिताः Śiva B. 29. 44.<BR>—6 To resist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्ठकः|लुण्ठक|लुंठक|लुंठकः
लुण्ठकः [लुण्ठ्-ण्वुल्] A robber, plunderer, thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्ठनम्
लुण्ठनम् [लुण्ठ्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Plundering, robbing, stealing; यदस्य दैत्या इव लुण्ठनाय काव्यार्थचौराः<BR> प्रगुणीभवन्ति Vikr. 1. 11.<BR>—2 Opposing, obstructing; भक्तप्रियेति भवलुण्ठनकोविदेति Mukunda-mālā 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1368-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्ठा|लुंठा
लुण्ठा<BR>—1 Robbing, plundering.<BR>—2 Rolling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्ठाकः|लुण्ठाक|लुंठाक|लुंठाकः
लुण्ठाकः<BR>—1 A robber.<BR>—2 A crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्ठिः|लुण्ठि|लुंठि|लुंठिः
लुण्ठिः, -टिः <i>f.</i><BR> Plundering, robbing, pillaging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्टिः
लुण्ठिः, -टिः <i>f.</i><BR> Plundering, robbing, pillaging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्ड्|लुंड्
लुण्ड् €10 U. (लुण्डयति-ते) To plunder, rob, pillage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्डिका|लुंडिका
लुण्डिका<BR>—1 A round mass or ball.<BR>—2 Proper conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्डी|लुंडी
लुण्डी Proper or becoming conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुण्डीकृत
लुण्डीकृत <i>a.</i> Rolled up together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुन्थ्|लुंथ्
लुन्थ् €1 P. (लुन्थति)<BR>—1 To strike, hurt, kill.<BR>—2 To suffer pain, be afflicted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्
लुप् I. €4 P. (लुप्यति)<BR>—1 To confound, perplex.<BR>—2 To be perplexed or confounded.<BR>—3 To be suppressed or destroyed. ━II. €6 U. (लुम्पति-ते, लुप्त)<BR>—1 To break, violate, cut off, destroy, injure; अनुभवं वचसा सखि<BR> लुम्पसि N. 4. 105.<BR>—2 To take away, deprive of, rob, plunder.<BR>—3 To seize, pounce upon.<BR>—4 To elide, suppress, cause to disappear. ━<i>Pass.</i> (लुप्यते)<BR>—1 To be broken or violated; be lost; तस्य भागो न लुप्यते Ms. 9. 211.<BR>—2 To be elided or lost, to disappear (in gram.). ━<i>Caus.</i> (लोपयति-ते)<BR>—1 To break, violate, infringe, offend against.<BR>—2 To omit, neglect.<BR>—3 To cause to swerve from; सत्याद् गुरुमलोपयन् R. 12. 9. ━<i>Desid.</i><BR> (लुलुप्सति, लुलोपिषति); <i>freq.</i> लोलुप्यते or लोलोप्ति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्
लुप् (in gram.) Falling out, suppression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्त|लुप्तं
लुप्त <i>p. p.</i> [लुप्-क्त]<BR>—1 Broken, violated, injured, destroyed.<BR>—2 Lost, deprived of; सा लुप्तसंज्ञा न विवेद दुःखम् R. 14. 56; परिवृतनाभि<BR> लुप्तत्रिवलि श्यामस्तनाग्रमलसाक्षि Govardhanācārya.<BR>—3 Robbed, plundered.<BR>—4 Dropped, elided, disappeared (in gram.).<BR>—5 Omitted, neglected.<BR>—6 Obsolete, disused, out of use; see लुप्.<BR>—7 Elliptical (as opp. to पूर्ण, in Rhet.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्तम्
लुप्त + .{@-प्तम्@} Stolen property, booty.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लुप्तोपमा, लुप्तधर्मक्रिय, लुप्तपद, लुप्तपिण्डोदकक्रिय, लुप्तप्रतिज्ञ, लुप्तप्रतिभ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्तोपमा
लुप्त + -उपमा a mutilated or elliptical simile, <i>i. e.</i> an <i>upamā</i><BR> in which one, two, or even three of the four requisities of a simile are<BR> omitted; see K. P. 10 under उपमा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्तधर्मक्रिय
लुप्त + -धर्मक्रिय <i>a.</i> excluded or deprived of religious ordinances;<BR> नाकन्यासु क्वचिन्नॄणां लुप्तधर्मक्रिया हि ताः Ms. 8. 226.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्तपद
लुप्त + -पद <i>a.</i> wanting in words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्तपिण्डोदकक्रिय
लुप्त + -पिण्डोदकक्रिय <i>a.</i> deprived of the funeral rites.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्तप्रतिज्ञ
लुप्त + -प्रतिज्ञ <i>a.</i> one who has broken his promise, faithless, perfidious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुप्तप्रतिभ
लुप्त + -प्रतिभ <i>a.</i> deprived of reason.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुभ्
लुभ् I. €6 P. To bewilder, confound, perplex. ━II. €4 P. (लुभ्यति, लुब्ध)<BR>—1 To covet, long for, desire eagerly (with dat. or loc.); तथापि रामो<BR> लुलुभे मृगाय.<BR>—2 To allure, entice.<BR>—3 To be bewidered or perplexed, go astray. ━<i>Caus.</i> (लोभयति-ते)<BR>—1 To make greedy, cause to long for, produce or excite desire for; पुप्लुवे<BR> बहु लोभयन् Bk. 5. 48.<BR>—2 To excite lust.<BR>—3 To entice, seduce, allure,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">Page1369-2</a>]<BR> attract; लोभ्यमाननयनः श्लथांशुकैर्मेखलागुणपदैर्नितम्बिभिः R. 19. 26.<BR>—4 To derange, disorder, disturb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुब्ध|लुब्धः
लुब्ध <i>p. p.</i> [लुभ्-क्त]<BR>—1 Greedy, covetous, avaricious.<BR>—2 Desirous of, longing for, greedy of; as in धनलुब्ध, मांसलुब्ध,<BR> गुणलुब्ध &c.; वृणते हि विमृश्यकारिणं गुणलुब्धाः स्वयमेव संपदः Ki. 2. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुब्धः|लुब्ध
लुब्ध + .{@-ब्धः@}<BR>—1 A hunter.<BR>—2 A libertine, lecher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुब्धकः|लुब्धक
लुब्धकः<BR>—1 A hunter, fowler; मृगमीनसज्जनानां तृणजलसंतोषविहितवृत्तीनाम् ।<BR> लुब्धकधीवरपिशुना निष्कारणवैरिणो जगति ॥ Bh. 2. 61.<BR>—2 A covetous or greedy man.<BR>—3 A libertine.<BR>—4 The star Sirius.<BR>—5 The hinder part; वैशसं नाम विषयं लुब्धकेन समन्वितः Bhāg. 4. 25. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुभित|लुभितः
लुभित <i>p. p.</i> Perplexed, disturbed; P. VII. 2. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुम्ब्|लुंब्
लुम्ब् €1 P., €10 U. (लुम्बति, लुम्बयति-ते) To torment, harass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुम्बिका|लुंबिका
लुम्बिका A kind of musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुम्बिनी
लुम्बिनी N. of a grove and the birthplace of Gautama Buddha; सान्तःपुरजना<BR> देवी कदाचिदथ लुम्बिनीं (जगाम) Bu. C. 1. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुल्
लुल् €1 P. (लोलति, लुलित)<BR>—1 To roll, roll about, move to and fro, toss about; लुलितदृष्टि मदादिव<BR> चस्खले Ki. 18. 6; Śi. 3. 72, 10. 36.<BR>—2 To shake, stir, agitate, make tremulous, disturb.<BR>—3 To press down, crush; see लुलित below. ━<i>Caus.</i> (लोलयति-ते)<BR> To shake, stir up; अनिलेन लोलितलताङ्गुलये Śi. 9. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुलापः|लुलाप
लुलापः, लुलायः [लुल् घञर्थे क, तमाप्नोति अण्] A buffalo;<BR> खुरविधुतधरित्रीचित्रकायो लुलायः; कंचित् पश्वधमं लुलायहतकं<BR> व्याजं वितन्वन् Māhiṣaśataka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुलायः|लुलाय
लुलापः, लुलायः [लुल् घञर्थे क, तमाप्नोति अण्] A buffalo;<BR> खुरविधुतधरित्रीचित्रकायो लुलायः; कंचित् पश्वधमं लुलायहतकं<BR> व्याजं वितन्वन् Māhiṣaśataka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुलित|लुलितः
लुलित <i>p. p.</i> [लुल् क्त]<BR>—1 Shaken, tossed about, moved to and fro, tremulous, waving; सुरालयप्राप्तिनिमित्तमंभस्त्रैस्रोतसं<BR> नौलुलितं ववन्दे R. 16. 34, 59.<BR>—2 Disturbed, touched; लुलितमकरन्दो मधुकरैः Ve. 1. 1.<BR>—3 Disarranged, dishevelled (as hair); शष्यान्तदेशलुलिताकुलकेशपाशा Ṛs. 4. 14.<BR>—4 Pressed down, crushed, injured; तस्याः पुष्पमयी शरीरलुलिता शय्या<BR> शिलायामियम् Ś. 3. 25.<BR>—5 Pressing on, touching; अनतिलुलितज्याघाताङ्कम् (कनकवलयम्) Ś. 3. 12.<BR>—6 Fatigued, drooping, unnerved; अलसलुलितमुग्धान्यध्वसंजातखेदात्<BR> (अङ्गकानि) U. 1. 24; गाढोत्कण्ठा ललितलुलितैरङ्गकैस्ताम्यतीति<BR> Māl. 1. 15, 3. 6, 4. 2.<BR>—7 Elegant, beautiful; वनं लुलितपल्लवम् Bk. 9. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुष्
लुष् €1 P. (लोषति) See लूष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुषः|लुष
लुषः The son of a निषाद and a चाणकी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुषभः|लुषभ
लुषभः also लुशभः [रुषेः अभच् नित् लुश्च Uṇ. 3. 123] An<BR> elephant in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुशभः
लुषभः also लुशभः [रुषेः अभच् नित् लुश्च Uṇ. 3. 123] An<BR> elephant in rut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुस्तम्
लुस्तम् The end of a bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लुह्
लुह् €1 P. (लोहति) To covet, desire or long for; cf. लुभ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1369-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लू
लू €9 U. (लुनाति, लुनीते, लून; <i>caus.</i> लावयति-ते;<BR> <i>desid.</i> लुलूषति-ते)<BR>—1 To cut, lop, clip, sever, divide, pluck, reap, gather (flowers &c.);<BR> शरासनज्यामलुनाद् बिडौजसः R. 3. 59, 7. 5, 12. 43; पुरीमवस्कन्द<BR> लुनीहि नन्दनम् Śi. 1. 51; क्रीडन्ति काकैरिव लूनपक्षैः Pt. 1. 187;<BR> Ku. 3. 61; Bk. 9. 80.<BR>—2 To cut off, destroy completely, annihilate; लोकानलावीद्विजितांश्च<BR> तस्य Bk. 2. 53. ━<i>With</i> {@आ@} to pluck (gently); तेनामरवधूहस्तैः<BR> सदयालूनपल्लवाः Ku. 2. 41.<BR> ━{@विप्र@} to cut, lop or pluck off; किसलयमिव मुग्धं बन्धनाद्विप्रलूनम् U. 3. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूता
लूता [लू-तक् Uṇ. 3. 90]<BR>—1 A spider.<BR>—2 An ant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लूतातन्तुः, लूतापट्टः, लूतामर्कटकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूतातन्तुः|लूतातन्तु|लूतातंतु
लूता + -तन्तुः a cobweb; लूतातन्तुवितानसंवृतमुखी झिल्ली चिरं रोदिति Sūkti. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूतापट्टः|लूतापट्ट
लूता + -पट्टः a spiderʼs egg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूतामर्कटकः|लूतामर्कटक
लूता + -मर्कटकः<BR>—1 an ape.<BR>—2 a kind of jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूतातः|लूतात
लूतातः An ant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूतिका
लूतिका A spider.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लून|लूनः
लून <i>p. p.</i> [लू-क्त]<BR>—1 Cut, lopped, severed, cut off.<BR>—2 Plucked, gathered (flowers &c.).<BR>—3 Destroyed.<BR>—4 Bitten, nibbled at.<BR>—5 Wounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूनम्
लून + .{@-नम्@} A tail.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लूनदुष्कृत, लूनयवम्, लूनविष<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूनदुष्कृत
लून + -दुष्कृत <i>a.</i> one who has destroyed his sins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूनयवम्
लून + -यवम् <i>ind.</i> after barley-harvest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूनविष
लून + -विष <i>a.</i> having poison in the tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूनक|लूनकः
लूनक <i>a.</i> Cut, divided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूनकः|लूनक
लूनक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A cut, division; wound.<BR>—2 Sort, species.<BR>—3 An animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूमम्
लूमम् [लू-मक्] A tail.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लूमविषः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूमविषः|लूमविष
लूमम् + -विषः ‘having poison in the tail’, an animal that stings with its tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूलुकः|लूलुक
लूलुकः A frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लूष्
लूष् I. €1 P. (लूषति) To adorn, decorate. ━II. €10 U. (लूषयति-ते)<BR>—1 To hurt, injure.<BR>—2 To rob, plunder, steal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऌङ्
ऌङ् A technical term used by Pāṇini to denote the Conditional Mood<BR> or its terminations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऌट्
ऌट् A technical term used by Pāṇini to denote the Second or Simple<BR> Future or its terminations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखः|लेख
लेखः [लिख्-भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 A writing, document, written document (of any kind), a letter; लेखोऽयं<BR> न ममेति नोत्तरमिदं मुद्रा मदीया यतः Mu. 5. 18; निर्धारितेऽर्थे<BR> लेखेन खलूक्त्वा खलु वाचिकम् Śi. 2. 70; अनङ्गलेख Ku. 1. 7; मन्मथलेख Ś. 3. 26.<BR>—2 A god, deity; ईशा दिशां नलभुवं प्रतिपद्य लेखाः N. 13. 49; रेखा<BR> लेखाभिवन्द्याः Viṣṇupāda. S. 11.<BR>—3 A scratch; cf. लेखाकीर्ण (a gem covered with scratches) Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लेखाक्षरम्, लेखाधिकारिन्, लेखानुजीविन्, लेखार्हः, लेखर्षभः, लेखपट्टम्, लेखपत्रम्, लेखपत्रिका, लेखप्रभुः, लेखसंदेशः, लेखहारः, लेखहारिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखाक्षरम्
लेखः + -अक्षरम् writing (opp. आलेख्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखाधिकारिन्
लेखः + -अधिकारिन् <i>m.</i> one in charge of writing letters, the secretary<BR> (of a king &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखानुजीविन्
लेखः + -अनुजीविन् the servant god; रत्नाकरादिव तुषारमयूखलेखां लेखानुजीविपुरुषा<BR> गिरिशोत्तमाङ्गम् (निन्यिरे) N. 11. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखार्हः|लेखार्ह
लेखः + -अर्हः a kind of palm tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखर्षभः|लेखर्षभ
लेखः + -ऋषभः N. of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखपट्टम्
लेखः + -पट्टम्, -पत्रम्, -पत्रिका<BR>—1 an epistle, a letter, writing in general.<BR>—2 a deed, document (legal); कृष्णानिकारगणनालेख्यपट्टं स्तनस्थलम् Bm. 2. 457.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखपत्रम्
लेखः + -पट्टम्, -पत्रम्, -पत्रिका<BR>—1 an epistle, a letter, writing in general.<BR>—2 a deed, document (legal); कृष्णानिकारगणनालेख्यपट्टं स्तनस्थलम् Bm. 2. 457.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखपत्रिका
लेखः + -पट्टम्, -पत्रम्, -पत्रिका<BR>—1 an epistle, a letter, writing in general.<BR>—2 a deed, document (legal); कृष्णानिकारगणनालेख्यपट्टं स्तनस्थलम् Bm. 2. 457.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखप्रभुः
लेखः + -प्रभुः Indra; लब्धं न लेखप्रभुणापि पातुं पीत्वा मुखेन्दोरधरामृतं<BR> ते N. 22. 118.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">Page1370-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखसंदेशः
लेखः + -संदेशः a written message.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखहारः|लेखहार
लेखः + -हारः, -हारिन् <i>m.</i> a letter-carrier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखहारिन्
लेखः + -हारः, -हारिन् <i>m.</i> a letter-carrier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखकः|लेखक
लेखकः [लिख्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A writer, scribe, copyist.<BR>—2 A painter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखकम्
लेखकः + .{@-कम्@} Writing down, transcribing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लेखकदोषः, लेखकप्रमादः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखकदोषः
लेखकः + -दोषः, -प्रमादः a slip of the scribe, copyistʼs mistake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखकप्रमादः|लेखकप्रमाद
लेखकः + -दोषः, -प्रमादः a slip of the scribe, copyistʼs mistake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखन|लेखनं|लेखनः
लेखन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [लिख्-ल्यु ल्युट् वा]<BR>—1 Writing, painting, scratching &c.<BR>—2 Exciting, stimulating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखनः|लेखन|लेखनं
लेखन + .{@-नः@} A kind of reed of which pens are made.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखनम्
लेखन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Writing, transcribing.<BR>—2 Scratching, scraping.<BR>—3 Grazing, touching.<BR>—4 Attenuating, making thin or emaciated.<BR>—5 Cutting or making incisions (in surgery).<BR>—6 Scripture.<BR>—7 An instrument for scraping.<BR>—8 A kind of birch-tree.<BR>—9 A palm-leaf (for writing upon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखनी
लेखन + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 A pen, writing-reed, reed-pen; सुरतरुवरशाखा लेखनी पत्रमुर्वी<BR> Śivamahimna 32.<BR>—2 A spoon.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लेखनवस्तिः, लेखनसाधनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखनवस्तिः|लेखनवस्ति
लेखन + -वस्तिः a kind of enema for reducing corpulency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखनसाधनम्
लेखन + -साधनम् writing materials or apparatus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखनिकः|लेखनिक
लेखनिकः<BR>—1 A letter-carrier.<BR>—2 One who makes another sign for himself, signing by proxy (being unable to write).<BR>—3 A writer, scribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखनीय|लेखनीयः
लेखनीय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be written, drawn or painted.<BR>—2 useful for reducing corpulency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखनीयम्
लेखनीय + .{@-यम्@} An accusation or defence (required to be made in writing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखा
लेखा [लिख्-अ टाप्]<BR>—1 A line, streak; कान्तिर्भ्रुवोरायतलेखयोर्या Ku. 1. 47, 7. 16; Ki. 16. 2;<BR> Me. 46; विद्युल्लेखा, फेनलेखा, मदलेखा &c.<BR>—2 A stroke, furrow, row, stripe.<BR>—3 Writing, drawing lines, delineation, painting; पाणिर्लेखाविधिषु नितरां<BR> वर्तते किं करोमि Māl. 1. 35.<BR>—4 The moonʼs crescent, a streak of the moon; लब्धोदया चान्द्रमसीव<BR> लेखा Ku. 1. 25, 2. 34; Ki. 5. 44.<BR>—5 A figure, likeness, an impression, a mark; उषसि सयावकसव्यपादलेखा Ki. 5. 40.<BR>—6 Hem, border, edge, skirt.<BR>—7 The crest.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लेखावलयः, लेखायम्, लेखासंधिः, लेखास्थवृत्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखावलयः|लेखावलय
लेखा + -वलयः, -यम् an encircling line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखायम्
लेखा + -वलयः, -यम् an encircling line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखासंधिः|लेखासन्धि
लेखा + -संधिः the point where the eyebrows meet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखास्थवृत्त
लेखा + -स्थवृत्त <i>a.</i> conforming to prescription; Caraka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखायति
लेखायति Den. P.<BR>—1 To sport or dally wantonly.<BR>—2 To waver, totter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखिका
लेखिका A little stroke; K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखिन्
लेखिन् <i>a.</i> Scratching, touching; एतद्गिरेर्माल्यवतः पुरस्तादाविर्भवत्यम्बरलेखि<BR> शृङ्गम् R. 13. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखित|लेखितं
लेखित <i>a.</i> Caused to be written; बलाद्यच्चापि लेखितम् Ms. 8. 168;<BR> Y. 2. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखिनी
लेखिनी<BR>—1 A pen.<BR>—2 A spoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेखीलकः|लेखीलक
लेखीलकः A letter-carrier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्य|लेख्यं
लेख्य <i>a.</i> [लिख्-ण्यत्] To be drawn, written, painted, scratched<BR> &c.; शैली दारुमयी लौही लेप्या लेख्या च सैकती । मनोमयी मणिमयी प्रतिमाष्टविधा<BR> स्मृता ॥ Bhāg. 11. 27. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्यम्
लेख्य + .{@-ख्यम्@}<BR>—1 The art of writing.<BR>—2 Writing, transcribing; चकार<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">Page1371-1</a>]<BR> यत्नं द्रुपदः सुतायाः सर्वकर्मसु । ततो लेख्यादिषु तथा शिल्पेषु च<BR> परंतप ॥ Mb. 5. 189. 1.<BR>—3 A writing, a letter, document, manuscript.<BR>—5 An inscription.<BR>—6 Painting, drawing.<BR>—7 A painted figure.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लेख्यारूढ, लेख्यकृत, लेख्यगत, लेख्यचूर्णिका, लेख्यपत्रम्, लेख्यपत्रकम्, लेख्यप्रसंगः, लेख्यस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1370-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्यारूढ
लेख्य + -आरूढ, -कृत <i>a.</i> committed to writing, done in writing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्यकृत
लेख्य + -आरूढ, -कृत <i>a.</i> committed to writing, done in writing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्यगत
लेख्य + -गत <i>a.</i> painted, drawn in picture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्यचूर्णिका
लेख्य + -चूर्णिका a paint-brush, writing-pencil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्यपत्रम्
लेख्य + -पत्रम्, -पत्रकम्<BR>—1 a writing, letter, document.<BR>—2 a palm-leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्यपत्रकम्
लेख्य + -पत्रम्, -पत्रकम्<BR>—1 a writing, letter, document.<BR>—2 a palm-leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्यप्रसंगः|लेख्यप्रसङ्ग
लेख्य + -प्रसंगः a document.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्यस्थानम्
लेख्य + -स्थानम् a writing place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेख्यक
लेख्यक <i>a.</i> Written, epistolary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेट्
लेट् A technical term used by Pāṇini to denote the Vedic Subjunctive<BR> Mood or its terminations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेट्यति
लेट्यति Den. P.<BR>—1 To deceive, cheat.<BR>—2 To be first.<BR>—3 To sleep.<BR>—4 To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेण्डम्
लेण्डम् Excrement, faeces; पपात लेण्डं विसृजन् क्षितौ व्यसुः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 37. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेतः|लेत|लेतं
लेतः, -तम्<BR> Tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेतम्
लेतः, -तम्<BR> Tears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेप्
लेप् €1 P. (लेपते)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेपः|लेप
लेपः [लिप्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Smearing, plastering, anointing; भूशुद्धिर्मार्जनात् … … … सेकादुल्लेखनाल्लेपात् Y. 1. 188.<BR>—2 An unguent, ointment, salve.<BR>—3 A plaster in general (such as white-wash, mortar &c.).<BR>—4 The wipings of the hand (or the remnants of the food sticking to the<BR> hand), after offering funeral oblations to the first three ancestors (पितृ,<BR> पितामह and प्रपितामह), (these wipings being offered to the three<BR> ancestors after the great-grand-father; <i>i. e.</i> to paternal ancestors<BR> in the 4th, 5th and 6th degrees); लेपभाजश्चतुर्थाद्याः पित्राद्याः पिण्डभागिनः.<BR>—5 A spot, stain, defilement, pollution.<BR>—6 Moral impurity, sin.<BR>—7 Food.<BR>—8 Smearing with clay; L. D. B.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लेपकरः, लेपभागिन्, लेपभुज्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेपकरः|लेपकर
लेपः + -करः a plaster-maker, white-washer, brick-layer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेपभागिन्
लेपः + -भागिन्, -भुज् <i>m.</i> a paternal ancestor in the 4th, 5th and 6th<BR> degree; तेषु दर्भेषु तं हस्तं निमृज्याल्लेपभागिनाम् Ms. 3. 216.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेपभुज्
लेपः + -भागिन्, -भुज् <i>m.</i> a paternal ancestor in the 4th, 5th and 6th<BR> degree; तेषु दर्भेषु तं हस्तं निमृज्याल्लेपभागिनाम् Ms. 3. 216.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेपकः|लेपक
लेपकः<BR>—1 A plasterer, mason, white-washer.<BR>—2 One who moulds or models.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेपनः|लेपन|लेपनं
लेपनः [लिप्-ल्युट्] Incense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेपनम्
लेपनः + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Anointing, smearing, plastering; भूशुद्धिः … … गृहं मार्जनलेपनात् Y. 1. 188.<BR>—2 A plaster, an ointment.<BR>—3 Mortar, white-wash.<BR>—4 Flesh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेपिन्
लेपिन् <i>a.</i> Smearing or covering with. ━<i>m.</i> A plasterer, brick-layer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेप्य|लेप्यं
लेप्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be plastered, smeared &c.<BR>—2 Moulded, modelled; शैली दारुमयी लौही लेप्या लेख्या च सैकती (प्रतिमाष्टविधा)<BR> Bhāg. 11. 27. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेप्यम्
लेप्य + .{@-प्यम्@}<BR>—1 Plastering, smearing.<BR>—2 Moulding, modelling, making models.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लेप्यकृत्, लेप्यनारी, लेप्यस्त्री<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेप्यकृत्
लेप्य + -कृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a model-maker.<BR>—2 a brick-layer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेप्यनारी
लेप्य + -नारी a moulded figure of a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेप्यस्त्री
लेप्य + -स्त्री a woman covered with unguents or perfumed ointments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेप्यमयी
लेप्यमयी A doll, puppet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेयः|लेय
लेयः The sign <i>Leo</i> of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेला
लेला (used only in instr. लेलया) Quivering, shaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेलायति
लेलायति, -ते Den.<BR> To quiver, tremble; यदा लेलायते ह्यर्चिः समिद्धे हव्यवाहने<BR> Muṇḍ. 1. 2. 2; उभौ लोकावनुसंचरति ध्यायतीव लेलायतीव Bṛ. Up. 4. 3. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेलायते
लेलायति, -ते Den.<BR> To quiver, tremble; यदा लेलायते ह्यर्चिः समिद्धे हव्यवाहने<BR> Muṇḍ. 1. 2. 2; उभौ लोकावनुसंचरति ध्यायतीव लेलायतीव Bṛ. Up. 4. 3. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेलायमाना
लेलायमाना One of the seven tongues of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेलितकः|लेलितक
लेलि(ली)तकः Sulphur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेलीतकः|लेलीतक
लेलि(ली)तकः Sulphur.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेलिहः|लेलिह
लेलिहः<BR>—1 A snake or serpent; दास्याद्वो विप्रमुच्येयं तथ्यं वदत लेलिहाः Mb. 1. 27. 15.<BR>—2 A kind of worm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेलिहा
लेलिहः + .{@-हा@} A certain position of the fingers (मुद्रा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेलिहानः|लेलिहान
लेलिहानः<BR>—1 A snake or serpent.<BR>—2 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—3 = लेलिहा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेशः|लेश
लेशः [लिश्-घञ्]<BR>—1 A small bit or portion, a particle, an atom, a very small quantity;<BR> क्लेश (v. l. स्वेद) -लेशैरभिन्नम् Ś. 2. 4; श्रमवारिलेशैः<BR> Ku. 3. 38; so भक्ति˚, गुण˚ &c.<BR>—2 Smallness, littleness.<BR>—3 A measure of time (equal to two <i>kalās</i>).<BR>—4 (In Rhet.) A figure of speech which consists in representing what is<BR> usually considered as an advantage to be a disadvantage and <i>vice versa</i>.<BR> It is thus defined in R. G.:− गुणस्यानिष्टसाधनतया दोषत्वेन दोषस्येष्टसाधनतया<BR> गुणत्वेन च वर्णनं लेशः; for examples see <i>ad loc.</i> (Mammaṭa<BR> appears to include this figure under विशेष. See K. P. 10 under विशेष<BR> and commentary.) cf. Ve. 2. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लेशोक्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेशोक्त
लेशः + -उक्त <i>a.</i> only suggested, or hinted at, insinuated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेश्या
लेश्या Light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेष्टः
लेष्टः [लिष्-तुन्] A clod, lump of earth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लेष्टभेदनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेष्टभेदनः
लेष्टः + -भेदनः an instrument for breaking clods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेसकः|लेसक
लेसकः, लेसिकः A rider of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेसिकः|लेसिक
लेसकः, लेसिकः A rider of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेहः|लेह
लेहः [लिह्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Licking, sipper; as in मधुनो लेहः Bk. 6. 82.<BR>—2 Tasting.<BR>—3 A lambative, an electuary.<BR>—4 Food.<BR>—5 One of the ten ways in which an eclipse occurs; Bṛ. S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेही
लेहः + .{@-ही@} A disease of the tips of the ears.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेहनम्
लेहनम् Licking, sipping with the tongue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेहिनः|लेहिन
लेहिनः Borax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेह्य|लेह्यं
लेह्य <i>a.</i> To be licked, to be eaten by licking, to be lapped up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लेह्यम्
लेह्य + .{@-ह्यम्@}<BR>—1 Anything to be eaten by licking (as an article of food), a lambative; nectar.<BR>—2 Food in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लैकुची
लैकुची A variety of fibrous garment; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लैङ्ग|लैंग|लैंगं|लैङ्गं
लैङ्ग <i>a.</i> Relating to gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लैङ्गम्|लैंगम्
लैङ्गम् N. of one of the eighteen Purāṇas.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लैङ्गोद्भवम्, लैङ्गधूमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लैङ्गोद्भवम्
लैङ्गम् + -उद्भवम् (the tale of) the origin of Liṅga<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लैङ्गधूमः|लैङ्गधूम
लैङ्गम् + -धूमः an ignorant priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1371-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लैङ्गिक|लैंगिक|लैङ्गिकः
लैङ्गिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [लिङ्ग-ठण्]<BR>—1 Depending on or relating to a sign or mark.<BR>—2 Inferred (अनुमित).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1372-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लैङ्गिकः|लैङ्गिक|लैंगिक
लैङ्गिक + .{@-कः@} A maker of images, statuary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1372-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लैण्
लैण् €1 P. (लैणति)<BR>—1 To go, approach.<BR>—2 To send.<BR>—3 To embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1372-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लैशिकम्
लैशिकम् (With Buddhists) A particular offence of a monk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1372-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोक्
लोक् I. €1 Ā. (लोकते, लोकित) To see, view, perceive.<BR>━II. €10 U. or <i>Caus.</i> (लोकयति-ते, लोकित)<BR>—1 To look at, behold, view, perceive.<BR>—2 To know, be aware of.<BR>—3 To shine.<BR>—4 To seek.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1372-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोकः|लोक
लोकः [लोक्यतेऽसौ लोक्-घञ्]<BR>—1 The world, a division of the universe; (roughly speaking there are<BR> three <i>lokas</i> स्वर्ग, पृथ्वी and पाताल, but according to<BR> fuller classification the <i>lokas</i> are fourteen, seven higher regions<BR> rising from the earth one above the other; <i>i. e.</i> भूर्लोक, भुवर्लोक,<BR> स्वर्लोक, महर्लोक, जनर्लोक, तपर्लोक, and सत्यलोक or ब्रह्मलोक;<BR> and seven lower regions, descending from the earth one below the other;<BR> <i>i. e.</i> अतल, वितल, सुतल, रसातल, तलातल, महातल, and पाताल).<BR>—2 The earth, terrestrial world (भूलोक); इहलोके in this world<BR> (opp. परत्र).<BR>—3 The human race, mankind, men, as in लोकातिग, लोकोत्तर &c. q. v.<BR>—4 The people or subjects (opp. the king); स्वसुखनिरभिलाषः खिद्यसे<BR> लोकहेतोः Ś. 5. 7; R. 4. 8.<BR>—5 A collection, group, class, company; आकृष्टलीलान् नरलोकपालान्<BR> R. 6. 1; or शशाम तेन क्षितिपाललोकः 7. 3.<BR>—6 A region, tract, district, province.<BR>—7 Common life, ordinary practice (of the world); लोकवत्तु लीलाकैवल्यम्<BR> Br. Sūt. II. 1. 33; यथा लोके कस्यचिदाप्तैषणस्य राज्ञः &c. Ś. B.<BR> (and diverse other places of the same work).<BR>—8 Common or worldly usage (opp. Vedic usage or idiom); वेदोक्ता वैदिकाः<BR> शब्दाः सिद्धा लोकाच्च लौकिकाः, प्रियतद्धिता दाक्षिणात्या यथा लोके वेदे चेति<BR> प्रयोक्तव्ये यथा लौकिकवैदिकेष्विति प्रयुञ्जते Mbh. (and in diverse<BR> other places); अतोऽस्मि लोके वेदे च प्रथितः पुरुषोत्तमः Bg. 15. 18.<BR>—9 Sight, looking.<BR>—10 The number ‘seven’, or ‘fourteen’.<BR>—11 Ved. Open space; space, room.<BR>—12 Oneʼs own nature (निजस्वरूप); नष्टस्मृतिः पुनरयं प्रवृणीत<BR> लोकम् Bhāg. 3. 31. 15.<BR>—13 Enlightenment (प्रकाश); इच्छामि कालेन न यस्य विप्लवस्तस्यात्मलोकावरणस्य<BR> मोक्षम् Bhāg. 8. 3. 25.<BR>—14 Recompense (फल); अग्नावेव देवेषु लोकमिच्छन्ते Bṛ. Up. 1. 4. 15.<BR>—15 An object of enjoyment (भोग्यवस्तु); अथो अयं वा आत्मा सर्वेषां<BR> भूतानां लोकः Bṛ. Up. 1. 4. 16.<BR>—16 Sight, the faculty of seeing (चक्षुरिन्द्रिय); अग्निर्लोकः Bṛ. Up. 3. 9. 10.<BR>—17 An object of sense (विषय); उपपत्त्योपलब्धेषु लोकेषु च संमो<BR> भव Mb. 12. 288. 11. (In compounds लोक is often translated by<BR> ‘universally’, ‘generally’, ‘popularly’; as लोकविज्ञात; so ˚विद्विष्ट).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लोकाक्षः, लोकातिग, लोकातिशय, लोकाधिक, लोकाधिपः, लोकाधिपतिः, लोकानुग्रहः, लोकानुरागः, लोकानुवृत्तम्, लोकान्तरम्, लोकान्तरित, लोकापवादः, लोकाभिभाविन्, लोकाभिलक्षित, लोकाभ्युदयः, लोकायनः, लोकालोकः, लोकाकाशः, लोकाचारः, लोकात्मन्, लोकादिः, लोकायत, लोकायतिकः, लोकेशः, लोकोक्तिः, लोकोत्तर, लोकोपक्रोशनम्, लोकैकबन्धुः, लोकैषणा, लोककण्टकः, लोककथा, लोककर्तृ, लोककृत्, लोककल्प, लोककान्त, लोककारणकारणः, लोकक्षित्, लोकगतिः, लोकगाथा, लोकचक्षुस्, लोकचारित्रम्, लोकजननी, लोकजित्, लोकज्ञ, लोकज्येष्ठः, लोकतत्त्वम्, लोकतन्त्रम्, लोकतुषारः, लोकत्रयम्, लोकत्रयी, लोकदम्भक, लोकद्वारम्, लोकधर्मः, लोकधातुः, लोकधातृ, लोकधारिणी, लोकनाथः, लोकनेतृ, लोकपः, लोकपालः, लोकपक्तिः, लोकपतिः, लोकपथः, लोकपद्धतिः, लोकपरोक्ष, लोकपितामहः, लोकप्रकाशनः, लोकप्रत्ययः, लोकप्रवादः, लोकप्रसिद्ध, लोकबन्धुः, लोकबान्धवः, लोकबाह्य, लोकवाह्य, लोकभर्तृ, लोकभावन, लोकभाविन्, लोकमर्यादा, लोकमातृ, लोकमार्गः, लोकयज्ञः, लोकयात्रा, लोकरक्षः, लोकरञ्जनम्, लोकरवः, लोकरावण, लोकलेखः, लोकलोचनम्, लोकवचनम्, लोकवर्तनम्, लोकवादः, लोकवार्ता, लोकविद्विष्ट, लोकविधिः, लोकविनायकाः, लोकविभ्रमः, लोकविरुद्ध, लोकविश्रुत, लोकविश्रुतिः, लोकविसर्गः, लोकवृत्तम्, लोकवृत्तान्तः, लोकव्यवहारः, लोकव्यवहार, लोकव्रतम्, लोकश्रुतिः, लोकसंसृतिः, लोकसंकरः, लोकसंग्रहः, लोकसंपन्न, लोकसंबाधः, लोकसाक्षिक, लोकसाक्षिन्, लोकसाधक, लोकसाधारण, लोकसिद्ध, लोकसीमातिवर्तिन्, लोकसुन्दर, लोकस्थलम्, लोकस्थितिः, लोकहास्य, लोकहित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1372-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोकाक्षः|लोकाक्ष
लोकः + -अक्षः space, sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1372-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोकातिग
लोकः + -अतिग <i>a.</i> extraordinary, supernatural.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1372-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोकातिशय
लोकः + -अतिशय <i>a.</i> superior to the world, extraordinary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1372-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोकाधिक
