लोचकः|लोचक
लोचकः [लोच्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A stupid person.<BR>—2 The pupil of the eye.<BR>—3 Lamp-black, collyrium; ‘लोचको मांसपिण्डे स्यादक्षितारे च कज्जले’<BR> इति विश्वः; Śi. 4. 35.<BR>—4 A kind of ear-ring.<BR>—5 A dark or blue garment.<BR>—6 A bow string.<BR>—7 A particular ornament worn by women on the forehead.<BR>—8 A lump of flesh.<BR>—9 The slough of a snake.<BR>—10 A wrinkled skin.<BR>—11 The wrinkled brow.<BR>—12 A plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1374-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोचन|लोचनं
लोचन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Illuminating, brightening.<BR>—2 Visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1374-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोचनम्
लोचन + .{@-नम्@} [लोच्यतेऽनेन लोच्-करणे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Seeing, sight, viewing.<BR>—2 The eye; शेषान् मासान् गमय चतुरो लोचने मीलयित्वा Me. 112.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लोचनाञ्चलः, लोचनापातः, लोचनावरणम्, लोचनगोचरः, लोचनपथः, लोचनमार्गः, लोचनपरुष, लोचनहिता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1374-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

