लोभात्मन्
लोभः + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> greedy-minded, avaricious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1375-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

