लोलजिह्व
लोल + -जिह्व <i>a.</i> with a rolling or restless tongue, greedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1375-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोललोल
लोल + -लोल <i>a.</i> excessively tremulous, ever restless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1375-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

