लोलम्बः|लोलम्ब
लोलम्बः A large black bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1375-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोलिका
लोलिका A kind of sorrel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1375-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लोलित|लोलितः
