लोहिनी
लोहिनी A woman with a red-coloured skin; मुहुश्चलत्पल्लवलोहिनीभिः Ki. 16. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1376-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

