लौकिकन्यायः|लौकिकन्याय
लौकिक + -न्यायः a general rule or maxim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1376-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौक्य
लौक्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Worldly, terrestrial, mundane, human.<BR>—2 Common, ordinary, usual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1376-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौड्
लौड् €1 P. (लौडति) To be foolish or mad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1376-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौल्यम्
लौल्यम् [लोलस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Fickleness, unsteadiness, inconstancy.<BR>—2 Eagerness, eager desire, greediness; lustfulness, excessive passion<BR> or desire; प्रीतस्तेऽहमलौल्येन भक्त्या तव च सत्तम Mb. 3. 201. 26;<BR> जिह्वालौल्यात् Pt. 1; R. 7. 61, 16. 76, 18. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1376-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौह|लौहः
लौह <i>a.</i> (-ही <i>f.</i>)<BR> [लोहमेव लोहस्य विकारः अण्]<BR>—1 Made of iron, iron.<BR>—2 Coppery.<BR>—3 Metallic.<BR>—4 Copper-coloured, red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौहम्
लौह + .{@-हम्@}<BR>—1 Iron; लौहभारसहस्रेण निर्मिता निरकारि मे Bk. 15. 54.<BR>—2 Meat of a red goat; कालशाकं च लौहं चाप्यानन्त्यं छाग उच्यते<BR> Mb. 13. 88. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौही
लौह + .{@-ही@} A kettle; ददृशुर्विस्मितास्तत्र नरा लौहीः सहस्त्रशः<BR> Rām. 2. 91. 68.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: लौहात्मन्, लौहकारः, लौहजम्, लौहबन्धः, लौहबन्धम्, लौहभाण्डम्, लौहमलम्, लौहशास्त्रम्, लौहशङ्कुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

