लौहबन्धः|लौहबन्ध|लौहबंध
लौह + -बन्धः, -बन्धम् an iron fetter, irons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौहबन्धम्
लौह + -बन्धः, -बन्धम् an iron fetter, irons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौहभाण्डम्
लौह + -भाण्डम् an iron vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौहमलम्
लौह + -मलम् rust of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौहशास्त्रम्
लौह + -शास्त्रम् the science of treating metals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौहशङ्कुः|लौहशङ्कु|लौहशंकु
लौह + -शङ्कुः an iron spike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौहितः|लौहित
लौहितः The trident of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौहितिक
लौहितिक <i>a.</i> Reddish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौहित्यः|लौहित्य|लौहित्यं
लौहित्यः [लोहितस्य भावः ष्यञ् स्वार्थे ष्यञ् वा] N. of a river,<BR> the Brahmaputra; चकम्पे तीर्णलौहित्ये तस्मिन् प्राग्ज्योतिषेश्वरः R. 4. 81<BR> (where Malli. says:− तीर्णा लौहित्या नाम नदी येन but quotes no authority).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

लौहित्यम्
लौहित्यः + .{@-त्यम्@} Redness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ल्पी
ल्पी, ल्यी €9 P. (ल्पिनाति, ल्यिनाति) To join, unite, be mixed with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ल्यी
ल्पी, ल्यी €9 P. (ल्पिनाति, ल्यिनाति) To join, unite, be mixed with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ल्युट्
ल्युट् (In gram.) N. of the Kṛt affix अन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ल्वी
ल्वी €9 P. (ल्विनाति) To go, move, approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ल्वीन
ल्वीन <i>a.</i> Gone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व|वं|वः
व <i>a.</i> Powerful, strong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वः|व|वं
व + .{@-वः@}<BR>—1 Air, wind.<BR>—2 The arm.<BR>—3 N. of Varuṇa.<BR>—4 Conciliation.<BR>—5 Addressing.<BR>—6 Auspiciousness.<BR>—7 Residence, dwelling.<BR>—8 The ocean.<BR>—9 A tiger.<BR>—10 Cloth.<BR>—11 Reverence.<BR>—12 N. of Rāhu.<BR>—13 The residence of Varuṇa. 14 the esculent root of the water-lily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वम्
व + .{@-वम्@} N. of Varuṇa (Med.). ━<i>ind.</i> Like, as; as in मणी<BR> वोष्ट्रस्य लम्बेते प्रियौ वत्सतरौ मम Sk. (where the word may be व<BR> or वा); Mb. 12. 177. 12 (com. वाशब्द इवार्थे).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशः|वंश
वंशः [वमति उद्गिरति वम्-श तस्य नेत्वम् Uṇ. 4. 116]<BR>—1 A bamboo; धनुर्वंशविशुद्धोऽपि निर्गुणः किं करिष्यति H. Pr. 23;<BR> वंशभवो गुणवानपि संगविशेषेण पूज्यते पुरुषः Bv. 1. 80 (where<BR> वंश has sense 2 also); Me. 81.<BR>—2 A race, family, dynasty, lineage; स जातो येन जातेन याति वंशः<BR> समुन्नतिम् H. 2; सूर्यप्रभवो वंशः R. 1. 2 &c.; see वंशकर,<BR> वंशस्थिति &c.<BR>—3 A shaft.<BR>—4 A flute, pipe, reed-pipe; कूजद्भिरापादितवंशकृत्यम् R. 2. 12.<BR>—5 A collection, assemblage, multitude (usually of similar things); सान्द्रीकृतः<BR> स्यन्दनवंशचक्रैः R. 7. 39.<BR>—6 A cross-beam; यदस्थिभिर्निर्मितवंशवंश्यस्थूणं त्वचा रोमनखैः<BR> पिनद्धम् Bhāg. 11. 8. 33.<BR>—7 A joint (in a bamboo).<BR>—8 A sort of sugar-cane.<BR>—9 The back-bone.<BR>—10 The Śāla tree.<BR>—11 A particular measure of length (equal to ten <i>hastas</i>).<BR>—12 The central projecting part of a sabre.<BR>—13 Bamboo-manna.<BR>—14 Offspring.<BR>—16 A son.<BR>—16 A particular musical note.<BR>—17 Pride, arrogance.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वंशाग्रम्, वंशाङ्कुरः, वंशानुकीर्तनम्, वंशानुक्रमः, वंशानुचरितम्, वंशागत, वंशावली, वंशाह्वः, वंशकठिनः, वंशकफम्, वंशकर, वंशकर्पूररोचना, वंशरोचना, वंशलोचना, वंशकर्मन्, वंशकीर्ति, वंशकृत्, वंशकृत्यम्, वंशक्रमः, वंशक्षयः, वंशक्षीरी, वंशघटिका, वंशचरितम्, वंशचर्मकृत्, वंशचिन्तकः, वंशच्छेत्तृ, वंशज, वंशतण्डुलः, वंशधर, वंशधान्यम्, वंशनर्तिन्, वंशनाडिका, वंशनालीका, वंशनाथः, वंशनेत्रम्, वंशपत्रम्, वंशपत्रकः, वंशपरंपरा, वंशपात्रम्, वंशपूरकम्, वंशबाह्य, वंशब्राह्मणम्, वंशभृत्, वंशभोज्य, वंशराजः, वंशलक्ष्मीः, वंशलून, वंशवनम्, वंशवर्धनः, वंशविततिः, वंशविस्तरः, वंशशर्करा, वंशशलाका, वंशसंपत्, वंशस्तनितम्, वंशस्थविलम्, वंशस्थितिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशाग्रम्
वंशः + -अग्रम्, -अङ्कुरः<BR>—1 the tip or end of a bamboo-cane.<BR>—2 the shoot of a bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशाङ्कुरः|वंशाङ्कुर|वंशांकुर
