वंशानुक्रमः|वंशानुक्रम
वंशः + -अनुक्रमः genealogy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

