वंशकफम्
वंशः + -कफम् cottony seeds floating in the air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशकर|वंशकरः
वंशः + -कर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 founding a family.<BR>—2 perpetuating a race; वंशस्थितिं<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">Page1377-a2</a>]<BR> वंशकरेण तेन R. 18. 31; न चक्रतुर्वंशकरावृषी तौ Bu. C. 1. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशकरः|वंशकर
वंशः + -कर + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a son; त्वयि समुत्पन्नस्य वंशकरस्य मुखं प्रेक्षिष्यते V. 5.<BR>—2 an ancestor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

