वंशरोचना
वंशः + -कर्पूररोचना, -रोचना, -लोचना bamboo-manna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

