वंशकीर्ति|वंशकीर्त्ति
वंशः + -कीर्ति <i>a.</i> celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशकृत्
