वंशकृत्यम्
वंशः + -कृत्यम् flute-playing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशक्रमः
वंशः + -क्रमः family succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशक्षयः|वंशक्षय
वंशः + -क्षयः family decay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशक्षीरी
वंशः + -क्षीरी bamboo-manna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशघटिका
वंशः + -घटिका a kind of childrenʼs game; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशचरितम्
वंशः + -चरितम् the history of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशचर्मकृत्
वंशः + -चर्मकृत् a worker in bamboo and leather; Rām. 2. 80. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशचिन्तकः|वंशचिन्तक|वंशचिंतक
वंशः + -चिन्तकः a genealogist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशच्छेत्तृ
वंशः + -छेत्तृ <i>a.</i> the last of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशज|वंशजः
वंशः + -ज <i>a.</i><BR>—1 born in the family of; तस्य दाक्षिण्यरूढेन नाम्ना मगधवंशजा R. 1. 31.<BR>—2 made of bamboos.<BR>—3 sprung from a good family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशजः|वंशज
वंशः + -ज + .({@-जः@})<BR>—1 progeny, issue, lineal descendant.<BR>—2 the seed of the bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशजम्
वंशः + -ज + .({@-जम्@}) bamboo-manna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशजा
वंशः + -ज + .({@-जा@}) bamboo-manna; वंशजा बृंहणी बृष्या बल्या स्वाद्वी च शीतला Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशतण्डुलः|वंशतण्डुल
वंशः + -तण्डुलः the seed of the bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशधर|वंशधरः
वंशः + -धर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 perpetuating a family; अन्तर्जले प्रसूतासि रघुवंशधरौ सुतौ U. 7. 3.<BR>—2 supporting a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशधरः|वंशधर
वंशः + -धर + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 the continuer of a family.<BR>—2 a descendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशधान्यम्
वंशः + -धान्यम् = वंशतण्डुल q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशनर्तिन्
वंशः + -नर्तिन् <i>m.</i> a buffoon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशनाडिका
वंशः + -नाडिका, -नालीका a pipe made of bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशनालीका
वंशः + -नाडिका, -नालीका a pipe made of bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशनाथः|वंशनाथ
वंशः + -नाथः the chief or head of a race.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशनेत्रम्
वंशः + -नेत्रम् the root of sugarcane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशपत्रम्
वंशः + -पत्रम् a bamboo-leaf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशपत्रः|वंशपत्र
वंशः + -पत्रम् + .({@-त्रः@}) a reed. ˚पतितम् N. of a kind of metre of seventeen<BR> syllables; दिङ्मुनिवंशपत्रपतितं भरनभनलगैः Chand. M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशपत्रकः|वंशपत्रक|वंशपत्रकं
वंशः + -पत्रकः<BR>—1 a reed.<BR>—2 a white kind of sugar-cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशपत्रकम्
वंशः + -पत्रकः + .({@-कम्@}) yellow orpiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशपरंपरा|वंशपरम्परा
वंशः + -परंपरा lineal descent, family succession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशपात्रम्
वंशः + -पात्रम् a bamboo-vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशपूरकम्
वंशः + -पूरकम् the root of sugarcane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशबाह्य
वंशः + -बाह्य <i>a.</i> repudiated by a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशब्राह्मणम्
वंशः + -ब्राह्मणम् N. of a Brāhmaṇa (belonging to the Sāma-veda.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशभृत्
वंशः + -भृत् <i>m.</i> the supporter or head of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशभोज्य
वंशः + -भोज्य <i>a.</i> hereditary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशभोज्यम्
वंशः + -भोज्य + .({@-ज्यम्@}) a hereditary estate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशराजः|वंशराज
वंशः + -राजः a very high bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशलक्ष्मीः
वंशः + -लक्ष्मीः <i>f.</i> the fortune of a family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशलून
वंशः + -लून <i>a.</i> alone in the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशवनम्
वंशः + -वनम् a bamboo-forest; रात्रा वंशवनस्येव दह्यमानस्य पर्वते<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">Page1378-1</a>]<BR> Mb. 7. 154. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1377-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशवर्धनः|वंशवर्धन
वंशः + -वर्धनः a son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशविततिः|वंशवितति
वंशः + -विततिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a family, descent.<BR>—2 a thicket of bamboos.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशविस्तरः|वंशविस्तर
वंशः + -विस्तरः a complete genealogy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशशर्करा
वंशः + -शर्करा bamboo-manna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशशलाका
वंशः + -शलाका a small bamboo peg at the lower end of a Vīṇā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशसंपत्
वंशः + -संपत् high birth and wealth, noble descent; Dk. 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशस्तनितम्
वंशः + -स्तनितम्, -स्थविलम् N. of a metre of twelve syllables; वदन्ति<BR> वंशस्थविलम् जतौ जरौ Chand. M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशस्थविलम्
वंशः + -स्तनितम्, -स्थविलम् N. of a metre of twelve syllables; वदन्ति<BR> वंशस्थविलम् जतौ जरौ Chand. M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशस्थितिः|वंशस्थिति
वंशः + -स्थितिः <i>f.</i> the perpetuation of a family; वंशस्थितिं वंशकरेण<BR> तेन संभाव्य भावी स सखा मघोनः R. 18. 31; किं सुन्दरि प्ररुदितासि<BR> ममोपपन्ने वंशस्थितेरधिगमान्महति प्रमोदे V. 5. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशकः|वंशक|वंशकं
वंशकः<BR>—1 A kind of sugarcane.<BR>—2 The joint in a bamboo.<BR>—3 A kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशकम्
वंशकः + .{@-कम्@} Aloe-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशिक|वंशिकं
वंशिक <i>a.</i> Lineal, genealogical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशिकम्
वंशिक + .{@-कम्@} Aloe-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशिका
वंशिका<BR>—1 A kind of flute.<BR>—2 Aloe-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशी
वंशी —1 A flute, pipe; न वंशीमज्ञासीद् भुवि करसरोजाद्विगलिताम्<BR> H. D. 108; कंसरिपोर्व्यपोहतु स वोऽश्रेयांसि वंशीरवः Gīt. 9.<BR>—2 A vein or artery.<BR>—3 Bamboo-manna.<BR>—4 A particular weight.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वंशीधरः, वंशीधारिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशीधरः|वंशीधर
वंशी + -धरः, -धारिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—2 any flute-player or piper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंशीधारिन्
वंशी + -धरः, -धारिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—2 any flute-player or piper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंश्य|वंश्यः
वंश्य <i>a.</i> [वंशे भवः यत्]<BR>—1 Relating to the main beam.<BR>—2 Connected with the spine.<BR>—3 Belonging to a family.<BR>—4 Of a good family, born in a good family.<BR>—5 Lineal, genealogical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंश्यः|वंश्य
वंश्य + .{@-श्यः@}<BR>—1 A descendant, posterity (pl.); इतरेऽपि रघोर्वंश्याः R. 15. 35.<BR>—2 A forefather, an ancestor; नूनं मत्तः परं वंश्याः पिण्डविच्छेददर्शिनः R. 1. 66.<BR>—3 Any member of a family.<BR>—4 A cross-beam, joist; यदस्थिभिर्निर्मितवंशवंश्यस्थूणं त्वचा रोमनखैः<BR> पिनद्धम् Bhāg. 11. 8. 33.<BR>—5 A bone in the arm or leg.<BR>—6 A pupil.<BR>—7 A kinsman from seven generations above and seven below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंसगः|वंसग
वंसगः Ved. A bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंह्
वंह् See बंह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक
वक See बक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वकुल|वकुलः
वकुल See बकुल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्क्
वक्क् €1 Ā. (वक्कते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्तव्य|वक्तव्यः
वक्तव्य <i>pot. p.</i> [वच्-तव्य]<BR>—1 Fit to be said, told, spoken or declared; तत्तर्हि वक्तव्यं न वक्तव्यम्<BR> (frequently occurring in Mbh.)<BR>—2 To be spoken about.<BR>—3 Reprehensible, blamable, censurable.<BR>—4 Low, vile, base.<BR>—5 Accountable, responsible.<BR>—6 Dependent; कामवक्तव्यहृदया भर्तृनाथाश्चरन्ति याः Rām. 2. 117. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्तव्यम्
वक्तव्य + .{@-व्यम्@}<BR>—1 Speaking, speech.<BR>—2 A precept, rule, dictum.<BR>—3 Blame, censure, reproach; एवमेतत् । वक्तव्यं परिहर्तव्यं च<BR> Pañc. 2; वक्तव्यं किञ्चिदस्मासु Pratimā 3. 6.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वक्तव्यहृदय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्तव्यहृदय
वक्तव्य + -हृदय <i>a.</i> one whose heart is dependent on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्तव्यता
वक्तव्यता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Censure, reproach; वक्तव्यतां च राजानो वने राज्ये व्रजन्ति च<BR> Rām. 7. 43. 6.<BR>—2 Subjection, dependence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्तव्यत्वम्
वक्तव्यता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Censure, reproach; वक्तव्यतां च राजानो वने राज्ये व्रजन्ति च<BR> Rām. 7. 43. 6.<BR>—2 Subjection, dependence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्तुकाम
वक्तुकाम <i>a.</i> Desirous of speaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्तुमनस्
वक्तुमनस् <i>a.</i> Being about to speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्तृ
वक्तृ <i>a.</i> or <i>m.</i> [उचितं बहु वक्ति, वच्-तृच्]<BR>—1 Speaking, talking, a speaker.<BR>—2 Eloquent, an orator; अप्रियस्य च पथ्यस्य वक्ता श्रोता च दुर्लभः<BR> Rām.; किं करिष्यन्ति वक्तारः श्रोता यत्र न विद्यते; दर्दुरा यत्र<BR> वक्तारस्तत्र मौनं हि शोभनम् Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 A teacher, an expounder.<BR>—4 A learned or wise man in general.<BR>—5 Honest, sincere.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वक्तृप्रयोक्तृ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्तृप्रयोक्तृ
वक्तृ + -प्रयोक्तृ theoretical and practical (politicians); दण्डनीतिं<BR> वक्तृप्रयोक्तृभ्यः Kau. A. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्त्रम्
वक्त्रम् [वक्ति अनेन वच्-करणे ष्ट्रन् Uṇ. 4. 177]<BR>—1 The mouth.<BR>—2 The face; यद्वक्त्रं मुहुरीक्षसे न धनिनां ब्रूषे न चाटून् मृषा Bh. 3. 147.<BR>—3 Snout, muzzle, beak.<BR>—4 Beginning.<BR>—5 The point (of an arrow), the spout of a vessel.<BR>—6 A sort of garment.<BR>—7 N. of a metre similar to <i>anuṣṭubh</i>; see S. D. 567; Kāv. 1. 26.<BR>—8 The first term of a progression.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वक्त्रासवः, वक्त्रखुरः, वक्त्रजः, वक्त्रतालम्, वक्त्रतुण्डः, वक्त्रदलम्, वक्त्रपटः, वक्त्रपट्टः, वक्त्रपरिस्पन्दः, वक्त्रभेदिन्, वक्त्ररन्ध्रम्, वक्त्रवासः, वक्त्रशोधनम्, वक्त्रशोधिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

