वक्रोक्तिः|वक्रोक्ति
वक्र + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i> a figure of speech consisting in the use of evasive<BR> speech or reply, either by means of a pun, or by an affected change of<BR> tone; Mammaṭa thus defines it:− यदुक्तमन्यथा वाक्यमन्यथान्येन योज्यते ।<BR> श्लेषेण काक्वा वा ज्ञेया सा वक्रोक्तिस्तथा द्विधा K. P. 9; for example<BR> see the opening stanza in Mu. (धन्या केयं स्थिता ते &c.).<BR>—2 equivocation, insinuation, innuendo; सुबन्धुर्बाणभट्टश्च कविराज<BR> इति त्रयः । वक्रोक्तिमार्गनिपुणाश्चतुर्थो विद्यते न वा ॥.<BR>—3 sarcasm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्रकण्टः|वक्रकण्ट|वक्रकंट
वक्र + -कण्टः the jujube tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1378-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

