वक्रिन्
वक्रिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Crooked.<BR>—2 Retrograde. ━<i>m.</i> A Jaina or Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1379-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्रिमन्
