वङ्घ्|वंघ्
वङ्घ् €1 Ā. (वङ्घते)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To go swiftly.<BR>—3 To begin.<BR>—4 To censure, blame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1379-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वच्
वच् I. €2 P. (Ā. also in non-conjugational tenses; in conjugational<BR> tenses it is said to be defective in the third person plural by some authorities,<BR> or in the whole plural by others; वक्ति, उवाच, अवोचत्, वक्ष्यति, वक्तुम्, उक्त)<BR>—1 To say, speak; वैराग्यादिव वक्षि K. P. 10; (oft. with two. acc.);<BR> तामूचतुस्ते प्रियमप्यमिथ्या R. 14. 6; sometimes with accusative of<BR> words meaning ‘speech’;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">Page1380-1</a>]<BR> उवाच धात्र्या प्रथमोदितं वचः R. 3. 25, 2. 59; क एवं वक्ष्यते वाक्यम् Rām.<BR>—2 To relate, describe; रघूणामन्वयं वक्ष्ये R. 1. 9.<BR>—3 To tell, communicate, announce, declare; उच्यतां मद्वचनात्सारथिः<BR> Ś. 2; Me. 100.<BR>—4 To name, call; तदेकसप्ततिगुणं मन्वन्तरमिहोच्यते Ms. 1. 79.<BR>—5 To signify, denote (as sense).<BR>—6 To recite, repeat.<BR>—7 To censure; reproach; वृत्तिविज्ञानवान् धीरः कस्तं वा वक्तुमर्हति<BR> Mb. 12. 132. 6. ━II. €10 P. To inform, to tell; L. D. B. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> (वाचयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to speak.<BR>—2 To go over, read, peruse; वाचयति नान्यलिखितं लिखितमनेन वाचयति<BR> नान्यः । अयमपरोऽस्य विशेषः स्वयमपि लिखितं स्वयं न वाचयति ॥ Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 To say, tell, declare.<BR>—4 To promise. ━<i>Desid.</i> (विवक्षति) To wish to speak, intend<BR> to say (something); विवक्षता दोषमपि च्युतात्मना त्वयैकमीशं प्रति<BR> साधु भाषितम् Ku. 5. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1379-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्मन्
वक्मन् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 A path, road.<BR>—2 A hymn of praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वक्वन्
वक्वन् <i>m.</i> A speaker, chanter, singer of hymns of praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वग्नु|वग्नुः
वग्नु <i>a.</i> Talkative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वग्नुः|वग्नु
वग्नु + .{@-ग्नुः@} [वच्-नुः गश्च Uṇ. 3. 33]<BR>—1 A speaker.<BR>—2 A sound.<BR>—3 A cry (of an animal &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वग्वनुः|वग्वनु
वग्वनुः Ved. A sound, noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचः|वच
वचः [वच्-असुन् Uṇ. 4. 196]<BR>—1 A parrot.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचा
वचः + .{@-चा@}<BR>—1 A kind of talking bird.<BR>—2 A kind of aromatic root (Mar. वेखंड); Mb. 13. 131. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचम्
वचः + .{@-चम्@} Speaking, talk.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वचार्चः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचार्चः|वचार्च
वचः + -अर्चः a sun-worshipper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचक्नु|वचक्नुः
वचक्नु <i>a.</i> [वच् अक्नुच् Uṇ. 3. 83] Talkative, eloquent. ━<i>m.</i> A Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचन्दा
वचन्दा<BR>—1 A kind of talking-bird.<BR>—2 The wick of a lamp.<BR>—3 A dagger, knife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनम्
वचनम् [वच्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 The act of speaking, uttering. saying.<BR>—2 Speech, an utterance, words (spoken), sentence; ननु वक्तृविशेषनिःस्पृहा<BR> गुणगृह्या वचने विपश्चितः Ki. 2. 5; प्रीतः प्रीतिप्रमुखवचनं स्वागतं<BR> व्याजहार Me. 4.<BR>—3 Repeating, recitation.<BR>—4 A text, dictum, rule, precept, a passage of a sacred book; शास्त्रवचनम्,<BR> श्रुतिवचनम्, स्मृतिवचनम् &c.<BR>—5 An order, a command, direction; शुश्रूषां गौरवं चैव प्रमाणं वचनक्रियाम्<BR> (कुर्यात्) Rām. 2. 12. 26; मद्वचनात् ‘in my name’, ‘by my order’.<BR>—6 Advice, counsel, instruction.<BR>—7 Declaration, affirmation.<BR>—8 Pronunciation (of a letter) (in gram.).<BR>—9 The signification or meaning of a word; अत्र पयोधरशब्दः मेघवचनः.<BR>—10 Number (in gram.); (there are three numbers, singular, dual and plural). —11 Dry ginger.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वचनावक्षेपः, वचनोपक्रमः, वचनोपन्यासः, वचनकर, वचनकारिन्, वचनक्रमः, वचनक्रिया, वचनगोचर, वचनगौरवम्, वचनग्राहिन्, वचनपटु, वचनमात्रम्, वचनविरोधः, वचनव्यक्तिः, वचनशतम्, वचनसहायः, वचनस्थित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनावक्षेपः|वचनावक्षेप
वचनम् + -अवक्षेपः abusive speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनोपक्रमः|वचनोपक्रम
वचनम् + -उपक्रमः introduction, exordium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनोपन्यासः|वचनोपन्यास
वचनम् + -उपन्यासः suggestive speech, insinuation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनकर|वचनकरः
वचनम् + -कर <i>a.</i> obedient, doing what is ordered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनकरः|वचनकर
वचनम् + -कर + .({@-रः@}) the author or enunciator of a rule or precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनकारिन्
वचनम् + -कारिन् <i>a.</i> obeying orders, obedient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनक्रमः|वचनक्रम
वचनम् + -क्रमः discourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनक्रिया
वचनम् + -क्रिया obedience; यथा पितरि शुश्रूषा तस्य वा वचनक्रिया<BR> Rām. 2. 19. 22, 2. 12. 26.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">Page1380-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनगोचर
वचनम् + -गोचर <i>a.</i> forming a subject of conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनगौरवम्
वचनम् + -गौरवम् deference to a command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनग्राहिन्
वचनम् + -ग्राहिन् <i>a.</i> obedient, compliant, submissive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनपटु
वचनम् + -पटु <i>a.</i> eloquent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनमात्रम्
वचनम् + -मात्रम् mere words, unsupported assertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनविरोधः|वचनविरोध
वचनम् + -विरोधः inconsistency of precepts, contradiction or incongruity of texts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनव्यक्तिः|वचनव्यक्ति
वचनम् + -व्यक्तिः <i>f.</i> —1 The exact implication of a statement (<i>i. e.</i><BR> the exact specification of its उद्देशपद and विधेयपद); अन्या<BR> हि वचनव्यक्तिर्विधीयमानस्य, अन्या गुणेन संबध्यमानस्य ŚB. on MS. 3. 1. 12.<BR> ˚भेदः divergence in the implication of the statement; न<BR> च विधेर्विधिनैकवाक्यभावो भवति । वचनव्यक्तिभेदात् ŚB. on MS. 6. 1. 5.<BR>—2 interpretation; यदा अनुवादपक्षस्तदा आहिताग्नेः । यदा विधिपक्षः<BR> तदा अनाहिताग्नेः । उभयथा वचनव्यक्तिः प्रतीयते ŚB. on MS. 6. 8. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनशतम्
वचनम् + -शतम् a hundred speeches, <i>i. e.</i> repeated declaration, reiterated assertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनसहायः|वचनसहाय
वचनम् + -सहायः a companion in conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनस्थित
वचनम् + -स्थित <i>a.</i> (वचनेस्थित also) obedient, compliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनीय|वचनीयः
वचनीय <i>a.</i> [वच्-अनीयर्]<BR>—1 To be said, spoken, or related.<BR>—2 Censurable, blamable; वचनीयस्य यो भुङ्क्ते तमाहुः शोणितं ह्रदम्<BR> Mb. 13. 135. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचनीयम्
वचनीय + .{@-यम्@} Blame, censure, reproach; न कामवृत्तिर्वचनीयमीक्षते<BR> Ku. 5. 82; वचनीयमिदं व्यवस्थितं रमण त्वामनुयामि यद्यपि 4. 21;<BR> भवति योजयितुर्वचनीयता Pt. 1. 75; Ki. 9. 39, 65; Mk. 4. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचरः|वचर
वचरः<BR>—1 A cock.<BR>—2 A rogue, low or wicked person (शठ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचलुः|वचलु
वचलुः A wicked or malevolent person, an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचस्
वचस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 A speech, word, sentence; उवाच धात्र्या प्रथमोदितं वचः R. 3. 25, 47;<BR> इत्यव्यभिचारि तद्वचः Ku. 5. 36; वचस्तत्र प्रयोक्तव्यं<BR> यत्रोक्तं लभते फलम् Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 A command, order, precept, injunction.<BR>—3 A dvice, counsel.<BR>—4 A hymn.<BR>—5 Singing, a song of birds.<BR>—7 (In gram.) Number.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वचःकर, वचःक्रमः, वचोग्रहः, वचःप्रवृत्तिः, वचोमार्गातीत, वचोहरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचःकर
वचस् + -कर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 obedient, compliant.<BR>—2 executing the orders of another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचःक्रमः|वचःक्रम
वचस् + -क्रमः discourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचोग्रहः|वचोग्रह
वचस् + -ग्रहः the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचःप्रवृत्तिः
वचस् + -प्रवृत्तिः <i>f.</i> an attempt at speaking; अव्यक्तवर्णरमणीयवचःप्रवृत्तीन् Ś. 7. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचोमार्गातीत
वचस् + -मार्गातीत <i>a.</i> greater than words can tell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचोहरः|वचोहर
वचस् + -हरः an emissary, a messenger; अभिधत्ते स्म वचो वचोहरः Śi. 16. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचस
वचस <i>a.</i> Talkative, eloquent, wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचसांपतिः|वचसाम्पति
वचसांपतिः An epithet of Bṛhaspati, or the planet Jupiter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचस्विन्
वचस्विन् <i>a.</i> Eloquent; इतीरिते वचसि वचस्विनामुना Śi. 17. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वचुष्यः
वचुष्यः [वच्-उष्यन् Uṇ. 4. 18] An ichneumon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्त|उक्तं|उक्तः
उक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Said, spoken.<BR>—2 Uttered, spoken (opp. to अनुमित or संभावित).<BR>—3 Told, addressed; असावनुक्तो ऽपि सहाय एव Ku. 3. 21.<BR>—4 Indicated; असता छाययोक्ताय सदाभासाय ते नमः Bhāg. 8. 3. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तम्
उक्त + .{@-क्तम्@} A speech, words collectively; a sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तम्
उक्त + .{@-क्तम्, -क्ता@} A stanza of four lines with one syllabic instant,<BR> (there being one long or two short syllables in each).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उक्तानुक्त, उक्तोपसंहारः, उक्तनिर्वाहः, उक्तपुंस्कः, उक्तप्रत्युक्तम्, उक्तवर्जम्, उक्तवाक्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्ता
उक्त + .{@-क्तम्, -क्ता@} A stanza of four lines with one syllabic instant,<BR> (there being one long or two short syllables in each).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: उक्तानुक्त, उक्तोपसंहारः, उक्तनिर्वाहः, उक्तपुंस्कः, उक्तप्रत्युक्तम्, उक्तवर्जम्, उक्तवाक्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तानुक्त
उक्त + -अनुक्त <i>a.</i> spoken<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">Page1381-1</a>]<BR> and not spoken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1380-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तोपसंहारः|उक्तोपसंहार
उक्त + -उपसंहारः a brief description, resume, peroration, recapitulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तनिर्वाहः|उक्तनिर्वाह
उक्त + -निर्वाहः defending an assertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तपुंस्कः|उक्तपुंस्क
उक्त + -पुंस्कः a word (feminine or neuter) of which also a masculine<BR> exists, and the meaning of which differs from that of the masculine only<BR> by the notion of gender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तप्रत्युक्तम्
उक्त + -प्रत्युक्तम् speech and reply, discourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तवर्जम्
उक्त + -वर्जम् <i>ind.</i> except the case mentioned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तवाक्यम्
उक्त + -वाक्यम् a dictum, decree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

उक्तिः|उक्ति
उक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Speech, expression, statement; उक्तिरर्थान्तरन्यासः स्यात् सामान्यविशेषयोः<BR> Candr. 5. 120; शूद्रविट्क्षत्रविप्राणां यत्रर्तोक्तौ भवेद्वधः Ms. 8. 104.<BR>—2 A sentence.<BR>—3 The power of expression, the expressive power of a word; as in एकयोक्त्या<BR> पुष्पवन्तौ दिवाकरनिशाकरौ Ak.<BR>—4 A worthy speech or word, maxim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वच्छः|वच्छ
वच्छः = वत्सः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्
वज् I. €1 P. (वजति) To go, move, roam about. ━II. €10 U. (वाजयति-ते)<BR>—1 To trim, prepare.<BR>—2 To feather an arrow.<BR>—3 To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्र|वज्रं|वज्रः
वज्र <i>a.</i> [वज्-रन् Uṇ. 2. 28]<BR>—1 Hard, adamantine.<BR>—2 Severe.<BR>—3 Forked, zigzag.<BR>—4 Cross.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रः|वज्र|वज्रं
वज्र + .{@-ज्रः, -ज्रम्@}<BR>—1 A thunderbolt, the weapon of Indra (said to have been formed out of<BR> the bones of the sage Dadhīchi q. v.); आशंसन्ते समितिषु सुराः सक्तवैरा<BR> हि दैत्यैरस्याधिज्ये धनुषि विजयं पौरुहूते च वज्रे Ś. 2. 16.<BR>—2 Any destructive weapon like the thunderbolt.<BR>—3 A diamond-pin, an instrument for perforating jewels; मणौ वज्रसमुत्कीर्णे<BR> सूत्रस्येवास्ति मे गतिः R. 1. 4.<BR>—4 A diamond in general, an adamant; वज्रादपि कठोराणि मृदूनि कुसुमादपि<BR> U. 2. 7; R. 6. 19; मुक्तां मरकतं पद्मरागं वज्रं च विद्रुमम्<BR> Śiva B. 30. 12.<BR>—5 Sour gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रम्
वज्र + .{@-ज्रः, -ज्रम्@}<BR>—1 A thunderbolt, the weapon of Indra (said to have been formed out of<BR> the bones of the sage Dadhīchi q. v.); आशंसन्ते समितिषु सुराः सक्तवैरा<BR> हि दैत्यैरस्याधिज्ये धनुषि विजयं पौरुहूते च वज्रे Ś. 2. 16.<BR>—2 Any destructive weapon like the thunderbolt.<BR>—3 A diamond-pin, an instrument for perforating jewels; मणौ वज्रसमुत्कीर्णे<BR> सूत्रस्येवास्ति मे गतिः R. 1. 4.<BR>—4 A diamond in general, an adamant; वज्रादपि कठोराणि मृदूनि कुसुमादपि<BR> U. 2. 7; R. 6. 19; मुक्तां मरकतं पद्मरागं वज्रं च विद्रुमम्<BR> Śiva B. 30. 12.<BR>—5 Sour gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रः|वज्र|वज्रं
वज्र + .{@-ज्रः@}<BR>—1 A form of military array.<BR>—2 A kind of Kuśa grass.<BR>—3 N. of various plants.<BR>—4 A kind of pillar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रम्
वज्र + .{@-ज्रम्@}<BR>—1 Steel.<BR>—2 A kind of talc.<BR>—3 Thunderlike or severe language.<BR>—4 A child.<BR>—5 Emblic myrobalan.<BR>—6 The blossom of the sesamum or <i>Vajra</i> plant.<BR>—7 Denunciation in strong language.<BR>—8 A particular posture in sitting.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वज्रांशुकम्, वज्राङ्क, वज्राङ्कित, वज्राङ्गः, वज्राभ्यासः, वज्राशनिः, वज्रास्थिः, वज्राकरः, वज्राकार, वज्राकृति, वज्राख्यः, वज्राघातः, वज्राभः, वज्रायुधः, वज्रासनम्, वज्रकङ्कटः, वज्रकवचः, वज्रकवचम्, वज्रकालिका, वज्रकीटः, वज्रकीलः, वज्रकूटः, वज्रकेतुः, वज्रक्षारम्, वज्रगोपः, वज्रघोष, वज्रचञ्चुः, वज्रचर्मन्, वज्रजित्, वज्रज्वलनम्, वज्रज्वाला, वज्रतरः, वज्रतुण्डः, वज्रतुल्यः, वज्रदंष्ट्रः, वज्रदक्षिणः, वज्रदण्ड, वज्रदन्तः, वज्रदंशनः, वज्रदेह, वज्रदेहिन्, वज्रधरः, वज्रधारणम्, वज्रनाभ, वज्रनाभः, वज्रनिर्घोषः, वज्रनिष्पेषः, वज्रपञ्जरः, वज्रपाणिः, वज्रपातः, वज्रपतनम्, वज्रपुष्पम्, वज्रभृत्, वज्रमणिः, वज्रमय, वज्रमुखः, वज्रमुष्टिः, वज्ररदः, वज्रलिपिः, वज्रलेपः, वज्रलोहकः, वज्रवधः, वज्रवारकः, वज्रव्यूहः, वज्रशल्यः, वज्रसंघातः, वज्रसार, वज्रसूचिः, वज्रसूची, वज्रहृदयम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रांशुकम्
वज्र + -अंशुकम् cloth marked with various patterns.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राङ्क
वज्र + -अङ्क <i>a.</i> studded with diamonds (Mar. हिरेजडित); ततो<BR> जाम्बूनदीः पात्रीर्वज्राङ्का विमलाः शुभाः Mb. 12. 171. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राङ्कित
वज्र + -अङ्कित <i>a.</i> marked with Vajra-like symbol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राङ्गः|वज्राङ्ग|वज्रांग
वज्र + -अङ्गः a snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राभ्यासः|वज्राभ्यास
वज्र + -अभ्यासः cross-multiplication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राशनिः|वज्राशनि
वज्र + -अशनिः the thunderbolt of Indra; वज्राशनिसमस्पर्शा अर्जुनेन<BR> शरा युधि Mb. 6. 119. 60<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रास्थिः|वज्रास्थि
वज्र + -अस्थिः <i>f.</i> Asteracantha Longifolia (Mar. तालिमखाना).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राकरः|वज्राकर
वज्र + -आकरः a diamond mine; बभूव वज्राकरभूषणायाः (पतिः) R. 18. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राकार
वज्र + -आकार, -आकृति <i>a.</i><BR>—1 shaped like वज्र.<BR>—2 a cross-shaped symbol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राकृति
वज्र + -आकार, -आकृति <i>a.</i><BR>—1 shaped like वज्र.<BR>—2 a cross-shaped symbol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राख्यः|वज्राख्य
वज्र + -आख्यः a kind of mineral spar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राघातः|वज्राघात
वज्र + -आघातः<BR>—1 a stroke of thunder or lightning.<BR>—2 (hence fig.) any sudden shock or calamity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्राभः|वज्राभ
वज्र + -आभः a kind of spar or valuable stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रायुधः|वज्रायुध
वज्र + -आयुधः an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रासनम्
वज्र + -आसनम्<BR>—1 a diamond-seat.<BR>—2 a particular posture in sitting (the hands being placed in the hollow<BR> between the body and the crossed feet).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रकङ्कटः|वज्रकङ्कट|वज्रकंकट
वज्र + -कङ्कटः an epithet of Hanumat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रकवचः|वज्रकवच
वज्र + -कवचः, -कवचम्<BR>—1 adamantine<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">Page1381-2</a>]<BR> mail.<BR>—2 a particular Samādhi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रकवचम्
वज्र + -कवचः, -कवचम्<BR>—1 adamantine<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">Page1381-2</a>]<BR> mail.<BR>—2 a particular Samādhi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रकालिका
वज्र + -कालिका N. of the mother of Śākyamuni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रकीटः|वज्रकीट
वज्र + -कीटः a kind of insect (boring holes in wood and stone).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रकीलः|वज्रकील
वज्र + -कीलः a thunderbolt, an admantine shaft; जीवितं वज्रकीलम्<BR> Māl. 9. 37; cf. U. 1. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रकूटः|वज्रकूट
वज्र + -कूटः a mountain consisting of diamonds; स वज्रकूटाङ्गनिपातवगविशीर्णकुक्षिः<BR> स्तनयन्नुदन्वान् Bhāg. 3. 13. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रकेतुः|वज्रकेतु
वज्र + -केतुः N. of the demon Naraka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रक्षारम्
वज्र + -क्षारम् an alkaline earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रगोपः|वज्रगोप
वज्र + -गोपः = इन्द्रगोपः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रघोष
वज्र + -घोष <i>a.</i> sounding like a thunderbolt; R. 18. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रचञ्चुः|वज्रचञ्चु|वज्रचंचु
वज्र + -चञ्चुः a vulture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रचर्मन्
वज्र + -चर्मन् <i>m.</i> a rhinoceros.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रजित्
वज्र + -जित् <i>m.</i> N. of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रज्वलनम्
वज्र + -ज्वलनम्, -ज्वाला lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रज्वाला
