वज्रलेपः|वज्रलेप
वज्र + -लेपः<BR>—1 a kind of very hard cement; वज्रलेपघटितेव Māl. 5. 10; U. 4<BR> (for its preparation see Bṛ. S., Chapter 57 ‘वज्रलेपलक्षणः’).<BR>—2 The being ineffaceable, permanent one; अन्यक्षेत्रे कृतं पापं पुण्यक्षेत्रे<BR> विनश्यति । पुण्यक्षेत्रे कृतं पापं वज्रलेपो भविष्यति ॥ Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1381-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

