वञ्च्|वंच्
वञ्च् €1 P. (वञ्चति)<BR>—1 To go, to arrive at; ववञ्चुश्चाहवक्षितिम् Bk. 14. 74, 7. 106.<BR>—2 To wander over.<BR>—3 To go slyly or secretly, sneak.<BR>—4 To go crookedly.<BR>—5 Ved. To shake, totter, tremble. ━<i>Caus.</i> (वञ्चयति-ते)<BR>—1 To avoid, escape from, evade, shun; अहिं वञ्चयति; अवञ्चयत मायाश्च<BR> स्वमायाभिर्नरद्विषाम् Bk. 8. 43; आधावमानं मुसलं कार्तवीर्यस्तदार्जुनः ।<BR> निपुणं वञ्चयामास गदया गतविक्लवः ॥ Rām. 7. 32. 45.<BR>—2 To cheat, deceive, defraud (said to be Ā. only, but often P. also);<BR> मूर्खास्त्वामववञ्चन्त Bk. 15. 15; कथमथ वञ्चयसे जनमनुगतमसमशरज्वरदूनम्<BR> Gīt. 8; (बन्धनम्) वञ्चयन् प्रणयिनीरवाप सः R. 19. 17; Ku. 4. 10, 5. 49;<BR> R. 12. 53.<BR>—3 To deprive of, leave (one) destitute of; विलोचनं दक्षिणमञ्जनेन<BR> संभाव्य तद्वञ्चितवामनेत्रा R. 7. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वञ्चक|वंचक|वञ्चकः
वञ्चक <i>a.</i> [वञ्च्-णिच्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Fraudulent, deceitful, crafty.<BR>—2 Cheating, deceiving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वञ्चकः|वञ्चक|वंचक
वञ्चक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A rogue, cheat, swindler.<BR>—2 A jackal.<BR>—3 Musk-rat.<BR>—4 A tame ichneumon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वञ्चतिः|वञ्चति|वंचति|वंचतिः
वञ्चतिः Fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वञ्चथः|वञ्चथ|वंचथ|वंचथः
वञ्चथः [वञ्च्-अथः Uṇ. 3. 112]<BR>—1 Cheating, roguery, deceit, trickery.<BR>—2 A cheat, rogue, swindler.<BR>—3 The cuckoo.<BR>—4 Death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वञ्चनम्
वञ्चनम्, -ना<BR> [वञ्च्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Cheating.<BR>—2 A trick, deceit, fraud, deception, trickery; वञ्चना परिहर्तव्या<BR> बहुदोषा हि शर्वरी Mk. 1. 5; स्वर्गाभिसन्धिसुकृतं वञ्चनामिव मेनिरे Ku 6. 47.<BR>—3 An illusion, delusion.<BR>—4 Loss, deprivation, hindrance; दृष्टिपातवञ्चना Māl. 3; R. 11. 36.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वञ्चनचञ्चुता, वञ्चनयोगः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वञ्चना
वञ्चनम्, -ना<BR> [वञ्च्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Cheating.<BR>—2 A trick, deceit, fraud, deception, trickery; वञ्चना परिहर्तव्या<BR> बहुदोषा हि शर्वरी Mk. 1. 5; स्वर्गाभिसन्धिसुकृतं वञ्चनामिव मेनिरे Ku 6. 47.<BR>—3 An illusion, delusion.<BR>—4 Loss, deprivation, hindrance; दृष्टिपातवञ्चना Māl. 3; R. 11. 36.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वञ्चनचञ्चुता, वञ्चनयोगः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वञ्चनचञ्चुता
वञ्चनम् + -चञ्चुता skill in fraud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

