वट्
वट् I. €1 P. (वटति) To surround. ━II. €10 U. (वटयति-ते)<BR>—1 To tell.<BR>—2 To divide, partition.<BR>—3 To surround, encompass.<BR>—4 To tie, string, connect. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 (वटयति) To speak.<BR>—2 (वाटयति) To surround; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वटः|वट
वटः [वट्-अच् Uṇ. 4. 116]<BR>—1 The fig-tree; अयं च चित्रकूटयायिनि वर्त्मनि वटः श्यामो नाम<BR> U. 1; R. 13. 53.<BR>—2 A small shell or <i>cowrie</i>.<BR>—3 A small ball, globule, pill.<BR>—4 A round figure, a cipher.<BR>—5 A kind of cake; पयःस्मिता मण्डकमण्डनाम्बरा वटाननेन्दुः पृथुलड्डुकस्तनी N. 16. 107.<BR>—6 A string, rope; (<i>n.</i> also in this sense).<BR>—7 Equality in shape.<BR>—8 A sort of bird, flying fox ? (Mar. वटवाघुळ); कङ्कगृध्रवटश्येनभासभल्लकबर्हिणः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 10. 24.<BR>—9 A pawn (in chess).<BR>—10 Sulphur.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वटपत्रम्, वटवासिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वटपत्रम्
वटः + -पत्रम् a variety of the white basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

