वटकः|वटक
वटकः<BR>—1 A kind of cake.<BR>—2 A small lump, ball, globule, pill.<BR>—3 A particular weight of 8 māṣas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1382-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

