वणिज् + -वीथी a market street, bazaar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिग्वृत्तिः|वणिग्वृत्ति
वणिज् + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> trade, traffic; business; (fig.) mercenary doing;<BR> मुक्त्वैकं भवबन्धदुःखरचनाविध्वंसकालानलं स्वात्मानन्दपदप्रवेशकलनं<BR> शेषा वणिग्वृत्तयः Bh. 3. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिक्सार्थः|वणिक्सार्थ
वणिज् + -सार्थः a caravan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिजः|वणिज
वणिजः<BR>—1 A merchant, trader.<BR>—2 The sign <i>Libra</i> of the zodiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिजकः|वणिजक
वणिजकः A merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिज्यम्
वणिज्यम्, वणिज्या Trade, traffic; कृषिर्वणिज्या पशुपालनं<BR> च Mb. 12. 63. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वणिज्या
वणिज्यम्, वणिज्या Trade, traffic; कृषिर्वणिज्या पशुपालनं<BR> च Mb. 12. 63. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्ट्|वंट्
वण्ट् €1 P., €10 U. (वण्टति, वण्टयति-ते) To divide, apportion,<BR> partition, share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्ट|वंट|वण्टः
वण्ट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tailless.<BR>—2 Unmarried.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्टः|वण्ट|वंट
वण्ट + .{@-ण्टः@}<BR>—1 A part, portion, share.<BR>—2 The handle of a sickle.<BR>—3 An unmarried man, a bachelor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्टकः|वण्टक|वंटक|वंटकः
वण्टकः [वण्ट्-घञ् स्वार्थे क]<BR>—1 Dividing, distributing.<BR>—2 A distributor.<BR>—3 A part, portion, share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्टनम्
वण्टनम् [वण्ट्-ल्युट्] Partitioning, apportioning, dividing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्टालः|वण्टाल|वंटाल|वंटालः
वण्टालः, वण्डालः<BR>—1 A contest of heroes.<BR>—2 A shovel, hoe.<BR>—3 A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्डालः|वण्डाल|वंडाल|वंडालः
वण्टालः, वण्डालः<BR>—1 A contest of heroes.<BR>—2 A shovel, hoe.<BR>—3 A boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्ठ्|वंठ्
वण्ठ् €1 Ā. (वण्ठते) To go alone or unaccompanied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्ठ|वंठ|वण्ठः
वण्ठ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unmarried.<BR>—2 Dwarfish.<BR>—3 Crippled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्ठः|वण्ठ|वंठ
वण्ठ + .{@-ण्ठः@}<BR>—1 An unmarried man, a bachelor.<BR>—2 A servant.<BR>—3 A dwarf.<BR>—4 A javelin, dart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्ठरः|वण्ठर|वंठर|वंठरः
वण्ठरः<BR>—1 The sheath that envelops the young bamboo.<BR>—2 The new shoot of the palm tree.<BR>—3 A rope for tying (a goat &c.).<BR>—4 A dog.<BR>—5 The tail of a dog.<BR>—6 A cloud.<BR>—7 The female breast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्ड्|वंड्
वण्ड् I. €1 Ā. (वण्डते)<BR>—1 To divide, share, apportion.<BR>—2 To surround, encompass. ━II. €10 U. (वण्डयति-ते) To share, divide, apportion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्ड|वंड|वण्डः
वण्ड <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Maimed, crippled.<BR>—2 Unmarried.<BR>—3 Emasculated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्डः|वण्ड|वंड
वण्ड + .{@-ण्डः@}<BR>—1 A man who is circumcised or has no prepuce.<BR>—2 An ox without a tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्डा|वंडा
वण्ड + .{@-ण्डा@} An unchaste woman; cf. रण्डा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्डरः|वण्डर|वंडर|वंडरः
वण्डरः<BR>—1 A miser, stingy person.<BR>—2 A eunuch; an attendant on the womenʼs apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वण्डाल|वंडाल|वंडालः|वण्डालः
वण्डाल See वण्टाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्
वत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 An affix added to nouns to show ‘possession’; धनवत् possessed<BR> of wealth; रूपवत् beautiful; so भगवत्, भास्वत् &c.; (the words<BR> so formed being adjectives).<BR>—2 Added to the base of the past passive participle वत् turns it into<BR> a past active participle; इत्युक्तवन्तं जनकात्मजायाम् R. 14. 43.<BR>—3 Added to substantives in the sense of the locative; सूक्तवाके इति<BR> सूत्रयितव्ये सूक्तवाकवत् इति सूत्रितम् ŚB. on MS. 10. 2. 51.<BR>—4 Added to substantives in the sense of अर्ह ‘worthy of’, ‘deserving’;<BR> ईहार्था सूक्तवाकार्हाः । अर्हे वतिर्द्रष्टव्यः ŚB. on MS. 10. 2. 51.<BR>━<i>ind.</i> An affix added to nouns or adjectives to denote ‘likeness’ or<BR> ‘resemblance’ and may be translated by ‘like’, ‘as’; आत्मवत् सर्वभूतानि<BR> यः पश्यति स पण्डितः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत
वत See बत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत
वत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sounded, spoken, uttered.<BR>—2 Asked, begged.<BR>—3 Hurt, killed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वतण्डः|वतण्ड
वतण्डः [Uṇ. 1. 120] A sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वतंसः|वतंस
वतंसः See अवतंस; कपोलविलोलवतंसम् Gīt. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वतिः|वति
वतिः (वा-ऽतिः नित् Uṇ. 5. 6) The wind. ━<i>f.</i> (वनन्त्यलोपः<BR> झलादौ क्ङिति P. VI. 4. 37) Asking, begging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वतु
वतु <i>ind.</i> (an interjection) Hush! Silence!; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वतूः
वतूः <i>f.</i> A river of heaven. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A road.<BR>—2 A disease of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वतोका
वतोका A barren or childless woman; a woman or cow miscarrying from accident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सः|वत्स|वत्सं
वत्सः [वद्-सः Uṇ. 3. 61]<BR>—1 A calf, the young of an animal; तेनाद्य वत्समिव लोकममुं पुषाण<BR> Bh. 2. 46; यं सर्वशैलाः परिकल्प्य वत्सम् Ku. 1. 2.<BR>—2 A boy, son; in this sense often used in the voc. as a term of endearment<BR> and translatable by ‘my dear’, ‘my darling’, ‘my dear child’; अयि वत्स<BR> कृतं कृतमतिविनयेन, किमपराद्धं वत्सेन U. 6.<BR>—3 Offspring or children in general; जीवद्वत्सा ‘one whose children are living’.<BR>—4 A year.<BR>—5 N. of a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">Page1384-1</a>]<BR> country; (its chief town was कौशाम्बी and ruled over by Udayana), or<BR> the inhabitants of that country (pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सा
वत्सः + .{@-त्सा@}<BR>—1 A female calf.<BR>—2 A little girl; वत्से सीते ‘dear Sītā’ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सम्
वत्सः + .{@-त्सम्@} The breast.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वत्साक्षी, वत्सादनः, वत्सानुसारिणी, वत्सेशः, वत्सराजः, वत्सकाम, वत्सतन्त्री, वत्सदन्तः, वत्सनाभः, वत्सपत्तनम्, वत्सपदम्, वत्सपालः, वत्सबन्धा, वत्सरूपः, वत्सशाला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1383-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्साक्षी
वत्सः + -अक्षी a kind of cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सादनः|वत्सादन
वत्सः + -अदनः a wolf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सादनी
वत्सः + -अदनः + .({@-नी@}) Cocculus Cordifolius (Mar. गुळवेल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सानुसारिणी
वत्सः + -अनुसारिणी a hiatus between a long and a short syllable; also<BR> वत्सानुसृता-तिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सेशः|वत्सेश
वत्सः + -ईशः, -राजः a king of the <i>Vatsas</i>; लोके हारि च वत्सराजचरितं<BR> नाट्ये च दक्षा वयम् Ratn. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सराजः|वत्सराज
वत्सः + -ईशः, -राजः a king of the <i>Vatsas</i>; लोके हारि च वत्सराजचरितं<BR> नाट्ये च दक्षा वयम् Ratn. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सकाम
वत्सः + -काम <i>a.</i> fond of children.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सकामा
वत्सः + -काम + .({@-मा@}) a cow longing for her calf or a mother for her child.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सतन्त्री
वत्सः + -तन्त्री a rope for tying calves; न लङ्घयेद्वत्सतन्त्रीं न<BR> प्रधावेच्च वर्षति Ms. 4. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सदन्तः|वत्सदन्त
वत्सः + -दन्तः a kind of arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सनाभः|वत्सनाभ
वत्सः + -नाभः<BR>—1 N. of a tree.<BR>—2 a kind of very strong poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सपत्तनम्
वत्सः + -पत्तनम् N. of the town Kauśāmbī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सपदम्
वत्सः + -पदम् a ford (Mar. उतार); भवाम्बुधिर्वत्सपदं परं पदम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 14. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सपालः|वत्सपाल
वत्सः + -पालः ‘a keeper of calves’, N. of Kṛṣṇa or Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सबन्धा
वत्सः + -बन्धा a cow longing for her calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सरूपः|वत्सरूप
वत्सः + -रूपः a small calf; Hc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सशाला
वत्सः + -शाला a cow-shed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सकः|वत्सक|वत्सकं
वत्सकः<BR>—1 A little calf, calf in general; भक्षयन्तीं न कथयेत् पिबन्तं चैव<BR> वत्सकम् Ms. 11. 114.<BR>—2 A child.<BR>—3 N. of a plant (कुटज).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सकम्
वत्सकः + .{@-कम्@} Green or black sulphate of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सतरः|वत्सतर
वत्सतरः A weaned calf, a steer, a young ox; महोक्षता वत्सतरः<BR> स्पृशन्निव R. 3. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सतरी
वत्सतरः + .{@-री@} A heifer; श्रोत्रयायाभ्यागताय वत्सतरीं वा महोक्षं वा<BR> निर्वपन्ति गृहमेधिनः U. 4; Ms. 11. 137; गावो वृषा वत्सतर्यः क्रन्दमानाः<BR> सुदुःखिताः Bhāg. 10. 16. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सिका
वत्सिका A heifer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सरः|वत्सर
वत्सरः [वस्-सरन् Uṇ. 3. 71]<BR>—1 A year; दातास्याः स्वर्गमाप्नोति वत्सरान् रोमसंमितान् Y. 1. 205.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वत्सरान्तकः, वत्सरादिः, वत्सरर्णम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सरान्तकः|वत्सरान्तक|वत्सरांतक
वत्सरः + -अन्तकः the month, <i>Phālguna</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सरादिः|वत्सरादि
वत्सरः + -आदिः the month of Mārgaśīrṣa; cf. मासानां मार्गशीर्षोऽहम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सरर्णम्
वत्सरः + -ऋणम् a debt to be paid by the end of a year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सल|वत्सलः
वत्सल <i>a.</i> [वत्सं लाति ला-क Uṇ. 3. 74]<BR>—1 Child-loving, affectionate towards children or offspring; as वत्सला<BR> धेनुः, माता &c.<BR>—2 Affectionate towards, fondly loving, devoted to, fond of, kind or compassionate<BR> towards; त्वद्वत्सलः क्व स तपस्विजनस्य हन्ता Māl. 8. 8, 6. 14;<BR> R. 2. 69, 8. 41; so शरणागतवत्सल, दीनवत्सल &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सलः|वत्सल
वत्सल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A fire fed with grass.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu. —3 The sentiment of affection (वात्सल्यरस).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सला
वत्सल + .{@-ला@} A cow fond of her calf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सलम्
वत्सल + .{@-लम्@} Affection, fondness; Pt. 2. 9.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वत्सलरसः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सलरसः
वत्सल + -रसः the tender sentiment in a poem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सलयति
वत्सलयति Den. P. To cause to yearn, cause to feel yearning affection<BR> for; नूनमनपत्यता मां वत्सलयति Ś. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सिन्
वत्सिन्, वत्सिमन् <i>m.</i> Childhood, youth, early youth; धिक्<BR> चापले वत्सिमवत्सलत्वम् N. 3. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सिमन्
वत्सिन्, वत्सिमन् <i>m.</i> Childhood, youth, early youth; धिक्<BR> चापले वत्सिमवत्सलत्वम् N. 3. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत्सीयः|वत्सीय
वत्सीयः A cowherd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वद्
वद् €1 P. (वदति, but Ātm. in certain senses and with certain<BR> prepositions; see below; उवाद, अवादीत्, वदिष्यति, व दितुम्, उदित;<BR> <i>pass.</i> उद्यते <i>desid.</i> विवदिषति)<BR>—1 To say, speak<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">Page1384-2</a>]<BR> utter, address, speak to; वद प्रदोषे स्फुटचन्द्रतारका विभावरी यद्यरुणाय<BR> कल्पते Ku. 5. 44; वदतां वरः R. 1. 59 ‘the foremost of the eloquent’.<BR>—2 To announce, tell, communicate, inform; यो गोत्रादि वदति स्वयम्.<BR>—3 To speak of, describe; आश्चर्यवद्वदति तथैव चान्यः Bg. 2. 29.<BR>—4 To lay down, state; श्रुतिस्मृत्युदितं धर्ममनुतिष्ठन् हि मानवः<BR> Ms. 2. 9, 4. 14.<BR>—5 To name, call; वदन्ति वर्ण्यावर्ण्यानां धर्मैक्यं दीपकं बुधाः<BR> Candr. 5. 45; तदप्यपाकीर्णमतः प्रियवदां वदन्त्यपर्णेति च तां<BR> पुराविदः Ku. 5. 28.<BR>—6 To indicate, bespeak; कृतज्ञतामस्य वदन्ति संपदः Ki. 1. 14.<BR>—7 To raise the voice, utter a cry, sing; कोकिलः पञ्चमेन वदति;<BR> वदन्ति मधुरा वाचः &c.<BR>—8 To show brilliance or proficiency in, be an authority on (Ātm.); शास्त्रे<BR> वदते Sk., पाणिनिर्वदते Vop.<BR>—9 To shine, look splendid or bright (Ātm.); लङ्कां समाविशद् रात्रौ<BR> वदमानोऽरिदुर्गमाम् Bk. 8. 27.<BR>—10 To maintain, affirm.<BR>—11 To toil, exert, labour (Ātm.); क्षेत्रे वदते Sk. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> (वादयति, ते)<BR>—1 To cause to speak or say.<BR>—2 To cause to sound, play on a musical instrument; वीणामिव वादयन्ती<BR> Vikr. 1. 10; वादयते मृदु वेणुम् Gīt. 5.<BR>—3 To speak, recite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वद|वदः
वद <i>a.</i> Speaking, talking, speaking well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदनम्
वदनम् [उद्यतेऽनेन वद् करणे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 The face; आसीद्विवृत्तवदना च विमोचयन्ती Ś. 2. 13; so सुवदना,<BR> कमलवदना &c.<BR>—2 The mouth; वदने विनिवेशिता भुजङ्गी पिशुनानां रसनामिषेण धात्रा Bv. 1. 111.<BR>—3 Aspect, look, appearance.<BR>—4 The front point.<BR>—5 First term (in a series).<BR>—6 The summit or apex of a triangle.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वदनासवः, वदनोदरम्, वदनकञ्जम्, वदनपङ्कजम्, वदनपवनः, वदनमालिन्यम्, वदनश्यामिका<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदनासवः|वदनासव
वदनम् + -आसवः saliva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदनोदरम्
वदनम् + -उदरम् the jaws.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदनकञ्जम्
वदनम् + -कञ्जम्, -पङ्कजम् a lotus-face.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदनपङ्कजम्
वदनम् + -कञ्जम्, -पङ्कजम् a lotus-face.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदनपवनः|वदनपवन
वदनम् + -पवनः breath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदनमालिन्यम्
वदनम् + -मालिन्यम्<BR>—1 a troubled face.<BR>—2 shame-faced appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदनश्यामिका
वदनम् + -श्यामिका<BR>—1 blackness of the face.<BR>—2 a kind of disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदन्तिः|वदन्ति
वदन्तिः <i>f.</i>, वदन्ती<BR>—1 Speech, discourse.<BR>—2 A story; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदन्ती
वदन्तिः <i>f.</i>, वदन्ती<BR>—1 Speech, discourse.<BR>—2 A story; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदनुः
वदनुः [वद्-चनुङ् Uṇ. 3. 51] An orator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदन्य|वदन्यः
वदन्य <i>a.</i> See वदान्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदर|वदरं|वदरः
वदर See बदर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदामः|वदाम|वदामं
वदामः An almond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदालः|वदाल
वदालः<BR>—1 A whirlpool.<BR>—2 A kind of sheat-fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदावद|वदावदः
वदावद <i>a.</i> [अत्यन्तं वदति वद्-अच् नि˚]<BR>—1 A speaker, eloquent; सुभगमभिधास्यत्युद्दामा पराङ्कवदावदः N. 19. 24.<BR>—2 Talkative, garrulous; यत्र यद् व्यञ्जयामास महमूदो वदावदः<BR> Śiva B. 15. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदान्य|वदान्यः
वदान्य <i>a.</i> [वद्-आन्यः Uṇ. 3. 103]<BR>—1 Speaking fluently, eloquent.<BR>—2 Speaking kindly or affably.<BR>—3 Liberal, munificent, generous; श्रोत्रियस्य कदर्यस्य वदान्यस्य<BR> च वार्धुषेः Ms. 4. 224.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदान्यः|वदान्य
वदान्य + .{@-न्यः@} A liberal or generous person, munificent or bountiful man;<BR> शिरसा वदान्यगुरवः सादरमेनं वहन्ति सुरतरवः Bv. 1. 19; or<BR> तस्मै वदान्यगुरवे तरवे नमोऽस्तु 1. 94; N. 5. 11; R. 5. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1384-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वदि
वदि <i>ind.</i> In the dark half (of a lunar month); as in ज्येष्ठवदि<BR> (opp. सुदि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वद्य
वद्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Fit to be spoken, not blamable; cf. अवद्य.<BR>—2 Dark or second (said of the fortnight of a lunar month; वद्यपक्षः<BR> the dark fortnight).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वद्यम्
वद्य + .{@-द्यम्@} Speech, speaking about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्
वध् €1 P. (वधति) To slay, kill (not used in classical Sanskrit<BR> except as a substitute for हन् in the Aorist and Benedictive).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधः|वध
वधः<BR>—1 Killing, murder, slaughter, destruction; आत्मनो वधमाहर्ता क्वासौ<BR> विहगतस्करः V. 5. 1; मनुष्यवधः homicide; पशुवधः &c.<BR>—2 A blow, stroke; पुनरज्ञातचर्यायां कीचकेन पदा वधम् Mb. 12. 16. 21;<BR> Ms. 8. 267.<BR>—3 Paralysis.<BR>—4 Disappearance.<BR>—5 Multiplication (in math.).<BR>—6 A killer, slayer.<BR>—7 A vanquisher, victor.<BR>—8 Ved. A deadly weapon, such as Indraʼs thunderbolt.<BR>—9 (In law) A capital or corporal punishment.<BR>—10 Frustration.<BR>—11 Defect, imperfection.<BR>—12 (In alg.) A product.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वधाङ्गकम्, वधार्थीय, वधार्ह, वधार्हण, वधोदर्क, वधोद्यत, वधोपायः, वधकर्माधिकारिन्, वधजीविन्, वधदण्डः, वधनिग्रहः, वधनिर्णेकः, वधभूमिः, वधस्तम्भः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधाङ्गकम्
वधः + -अङ्गकम् a prison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधार्थीय
वधः + -अर्थीय <i>a.</i> = वध्य q. v.; वधक q. v.; वधार्थायं<BR> क्षत्रिया राजपुत्री (गर्भं धत्ते) Mb. 11. 26. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधार्ह|वधार्हः
वधः + -अर्ह, -अर्हण <i>a.</i> deserving capital punishment; ब्रह्मबन्धुर्न<BR> हन्तव्य आततायी वधार्हणः Bhāg. 1. 7. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधार्हण
वधः + -अर्ह, -अर्हण <i>a.</i> deserving capital punishment; ब्रह्मबन्धुर्न<BR> हन्तव्य आततायी वधार्हणः Bhāg. 1. 7. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधोदर्क
वधः + -उदर्क <i>a.</i> resulting in death, proving fatal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधोद्यत|वधोद्यतः
वधः + -उद्यत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 murderous.<BR>—2 an assassin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधोपायः|वधोपाय
वधः + -उपायः a means of killing; हन्याच्चित्रैर्वधोपायैः Ms. 9. 248.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधकर्माधिकारिन्
वधः + -कर्माधिकारिन् <i>m.</i> a hangman, an executioner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधजीविन्
वधः + -जीविन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a hunter.<BR>—2 a butcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधदण्डः|वधदण्ड|वधदंड
वधः + -दण्डः<BR>—1 corporeal punishment (as whipping &c.).<BR>—2 capital punishment; वधदण्डमतः परम् Ms. 8. 129.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधनिग्रहः|वधनिग्रह
वधः + -निग्रहः capital punishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधनिर्णेकः|वधनिर्णेक
वधः + -निर्णेकः atonement for murder; दानेन वधनिर्णेकम् Ms. 11. 139.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधभूमिः|वधभूमि
वधः + -भूमिः <i>f.</i>, {@-स्थली@} <i>f.</i>, {@-स्थानम्@}<BR>—1 a place of execution.<BR>—2 a slaughter-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधस्तम्भः|वधस्तम्भ
वधः + -स्तम्भः the gallows; Mk. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधक|वधकः
वधक <i>a.</i> (-धका, -धिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [हनः क्वुन्, वध च Uṇ. 2. 35] Killing,<BR> destructive, injurious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधकः|वधक
वधक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 An executioner, a hangman.<BR>—2 A murderer, an assassin.<BR>—3 A kind of reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधत्रम्
वधत्रम् [वध्-अत्रन् Uṇ. 3. 104] A deadly weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधना
वधना Ved. A deadly weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधर्
वधर् <i>n.</i> A destructiue weapon; अव रुद्रा अशसो हन्तना वधः Rv. 2. 34. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधिकः|वधिक
वधिकः, -कम्<BR> musk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधिकम्
वधिकः, -कम्<BR> musk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधित्रम्
वधित्रम्<BR>—1 The god of love.<BR>—2 Sexual passion, lust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधुः|वधु
वधुः <i>f.</i>, वधुका<BR>—1 A daughter-in-law.<BR>—2 A young woman in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधुका
वधुः <i>f.</i>, वधुका<BR>—1 A daughter-in-law.<BR>—2 A young woman in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूः
वधूः <i>f.</i> [उह्यते पितृगेहात् पतिगृहं वह्-ऊधुक् च; cf. Uṇ. 1. 83]<BR>—1 A bride; वरः स वध्वा सह राजमार्गं प्राप ध्वजच्छायनिवारितोष्णम्<BR> R. 7. 4, 19; समानयंस्तुल्यगुणं वधूवरं चिरस्य वाच्यं न गतः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">Page1385-2</a>]<BR> प्रजापतिः Ś. 5. 15; Ku. 6. 82.<BR>—2 A wife, spouse; इय नमति वः सर्वांस्त्रिलोचनवधूरिति Ku. 6. 89; R. 1. 90.<BR>—3 A daughter-in-law; एषा च रघुकुलमहत्तराणां वधूः U. 4, 4. 16;<BR> तेषां वधूस्त्वमसि नन्दिनि पार्थिवानाम् 1. 9.<BR>—4 A female, maiden, woman in general; हरिरिह मुग्धवधूनिकरे विलासिनि<BR> विलसति केलिपरे Gīt. 1; स्वयशांसि विक्रमवतामवतां न वधूष्वघानि<BR> विमृशान्ति धियः Ki. 6. 45; N. 22. 47; Me. 16, 49, 67.<BR>—5 The wife of a younger relation, a younger female relation.<BR>—6 The female of any animal; मृगवधूः a doe; व्याघ्रवधूः, गजवधूः &c.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वधूकालः, वधूगृहप्रवेशः, वधूप्रवेशः, वधूजनः, वधूपक्षः, वधूवरम्, वधूवस्त्रम्, वधूवासस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूकालः|वधूकाल
वधूः + -कालः The time during which a woman is held to be a bride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूगृहप्रवेशः|वधूगृहप्रवेश
वधूः + -गृहप्रवेशः, -प्रवेशः the ceremony of a brideʼs entrance into<BR> her husbandʼs house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूप्रवेशः|वधूप्रवेश
वधूः + -गृहप्रवेशः, -प्रवेशः the ceremony of a brideʼs entrance into<BR> her husbandʼs house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूजनः|वधूजन
वधूः + -जनः a wife; female, woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूपक्षः|वधूपक्ष
वधूः + -पक्षः the party of the bride (at a wedding).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूवरम्
वधूः + -वरम् a newly married couple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूवस्त्रम्
वधूः + -वस्त्रम् bridal apparel, nuptial attire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूवासस्
वधूः + -वासस् <i>n.</i> a brideʼs undergarment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूटशयनः|वधूटशयन
वधूटशयनः A lattice, window.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूटी
वधू(धु)टी<BR>—1 A young woman or female; रथं वधूटीमारोप्य पापः क्वाप्येष गच्छति<BR> Mv. 5. 17; गोपवधूटीदुकूलचौराय (कृष्णाय) Bhāṣā P. 1.<BR>—2 A daughter-in-law.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वधूटीशयनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधुटी
वधू(धु)टी<BR>—1 A young woman or female; रथं वधूटीमारोप्य पापः क्वाप्येष गच्छति<BR> Mv. 5. 17; गोपवधूटीदुकूलचौराय (कृष्णाय) Bhāṣā P. 1.<BR>—2 A daughter-in-law.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वधूटीशयनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूटीशयनम्
वधूटी + -शयनम् a lattice, window.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वधूसरा
वधूसरा N. of a river; वितस्ता सरयूश्चापि तमसा च वधूसरा<BR> Śiva B. 6. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्य|वध्यः
वध्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be killed or slain.<BR>—2 Sentenced to be killed.<BR>—3 Vulnerable. —4 To be subjected to corporeal punishment, to be corporeally punished<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्यः|वध्य
वध्य + .{@-ध्यः@}<BR>—1 A victim, one seeking his doom; अद्यापि बध्यमानां वध्यः को नेच्छति<BR> शिखां मे Mu. 1. 9.<BR>—2 An enemy.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वध्यदिण्डिमः, वध्यपटहः, वध्यपालः, वध्यभूः, वध्यभूमिः, वध्यमाला, वध्यवासस्, वध्यशिला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्यदिण्डिमः|वध्यदिण्डिम
वध्य + -दिण्डिमः, -पटहः a drum beaten at the time of execution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्यपटहः|वध्यपटह
वध्य + -दिण्डिमः, -पटहः a drum beaten at the time of execution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्यपालः|वध्यपाल
वध्य + -पालः a jailer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्यभूः
वध्य + -भूः, -भूमिः <i>f.</i>, {@-स्थलम्, -स्थानम्@}<BR> a place of execution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्यभूमिः|वध्यभूमि
वध्य + -भूः, -भूमिः <i>f.</i>, {@-स्थलम्, -स्थानम्@}<BR> a place of execution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्यमाला
वध्य + -माला a garland of flowers placed on a person who is about to be executed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्यवासस्
वध्य + -वासस् the clothes of a criminal who has been executed; वध्यांश्च<BR> हन्युः सततं यथाशास्त्रं नृपाज्ञया । वध्यवासांसि गृह्णीयुः शय्याश्चाभरणानि<BR> च ॥ Ms. 10. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्यशिला
वध्य + -शिला<BR>—1 an executionerʼs block, scaffold.<BR>—2 a slaughter-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्या
वध्या Killing, slaughter, murder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्रम्
वध्रम्<BR>—1 A leathern strap or thong; see वर्ध्रम्.<BR>—2 Lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्री
वध्रम् + .{@-ध्री@} A leathern thong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्रि
वध्रि <i>a.</i> Castrated, emasculated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्रिका
वध्रिका <i>m.</i> A castrated person, eunuch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वध्र्यः|वध्र्य
वध्र्यः A shoe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वन्
वन् I. €1 P. (वनति)<BR>—1 To honour, worship.<BR>—2 To aid.<BR>—3 To sound.<BR>—4 To be occupied or engaged. ━II. €8 U. (वनोति, वनुते, usually<BR> वनुते only)<BR>—1 To beg, ask, request (said to govern two acc.); तोयदादितरं नैव<BR> चातको वनुते जलम्.<BR>—2 To seek for, seek to obtain.<BR>—3 To conquer, possess.<BR>—4 Ved. To like, love.<BR>—5 To wish, desire.<BR>—6 To make ready, prepare for.<BR>—7 To hurt, injure.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">Page1386-1</a>]<BR>━III. €1 P., €10 U. (वनति, वानयति-ते)<BR>—1 To favour, aid.<BR>—2 To hurt, injure.<BR>—3 To sound.<BR>—4 To confide in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1385-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वत
वत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Uttered, sounded.<BR>—2 Killed, hurt.<BR>—3 Asked, begged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनम्
वनम् [वन्-अच्]<BR>—1 A forest, wood, thicket of trees; एको वासः पत्तने वा वने वा<BR> Bh. 3. 120; वनेऽपि दोषाः प्रभवन्ति रागिणाम्.<BR>—2 A cluster, group, a quantity of lotuses or other plants growing in<BR> a thick bed; चित्रद्विपाः पद्मवनावतीर्णाः R. 16. 16, 6. 86.<BR>—3 A place of abode, residence, house.<BR>—4 A fountain, spring (of water).<BR>—5 Water in general; गगनं … वनौघनमदभ्रम् Śi. 6. 73.<BR>—6 A wooden vessel.<BR>—7 Wood, timber.<BR>—8 Dwelling in a forest, living abroad.<BR>—9 Ved. A cloud.<BR>—10 Light, a ray of light.<BR>—11 Worshipping.<BR>—12 A mountain; L. D. B.<BR>—13 Plenty, abundance. (As the first member of comp. वन may be translated<BR> by ‘wild’, ‘forest’; वनवराहः, वनकदली, वनपुष्पम् &c.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वनाग्निः, वनाजः, वनान्तः, वनान्तरम्, वनाब्जिनी, वनारिष्टा, वनार्चकः, वनालक्तम्, वनालिका, वनाखुः, वनाखुकः, वनापगा, वनार्द्रकम्, वनाश, वनाश्रमः, वनाश्रमिन्, वनाश्रयः, वनोत्साहः, वनोद्धवा, वनोपप्लवः, वनोपलः, वनौकस्, वनौषधिः, वनकणा, वनकदली, वनकरिन्, वनकाम, वनकार्पासी, वनकुक्कुटः, वनकोलिः, वनखण्डम्, वनग, वनगवः, वनगहनम्, वनगुप्तः, वनगुल्मः, वनगोचर, वनग्रहणम्, वनग्राहिन्, वनग्रामकः, वनचन्दनम्, वनचन्द्रिका, वनज्योत्स्ना, वनचम्पकः, वनचर, वनचर्या, वनच्छागः, वनच्छिद्, वनजः, वनजा, वनजीविन्, वनतिक्तः, वनदः, वनदाहः, वनदीपः, वनदेवता, वनद्रुमः, वनधारा, वनधितिः, वनधेनुः, वनपः, वनपल्लवः, वनपांसुलः, वनपार्श्वम्, वनपुष्पम्, वनपूरकः, वनप्रवेशः, वनप्रस्थ, वनप्रियः, वनबर्हिणः, वनवर्हिणः, वनभूः, वनभूषणी, वनमक्षिका, वनमल्ली, वनमाला, वनमालिन्, वनमालिनी, वनमुच्, वनमूतः, वनमुद्गः, वनमोचा, वनरक्षकः, वनराजः, वनराजिः, वनराजी, वनरुहम्, वनलक्ष्मी, वनलता, वनवर्तिका, वनवह्निः, वनहुताशनः, वनवासः, वनवासनः, वनवासिन्, वनवीजः, वनवीजकः, वनवृन्ताकी, वनव्रीहिः, वनशृङ्गाटः, वनशोभनम्, वनश्वन्, वनसङ्कटः, वनसद्, वनसंवासिन्, वनसमूहः, वनसंप्रवेशः, वनसरोजिनी, वनस्थः, वनस्था, वनस्थी, वनस्थली, वनस्रज्, वनहासः, वनहासकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाग्निः|वनाग्नि
वनम् + -अग्निः a forest conflagration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाजः|वनाज
वनम् + -अजः the wild goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनान्तः|वनान्त|वनांत
वनम् + -अन्तः<BR>—1 the skirts or borders of a forest; वृत्तः स नौ संगतयोर्वनान्ते R. 2. 58.<BR>—2 the forest region itself, wood; वनान्तशय्याकठिनीकृताकृती Ki. 1. 36;<BR> अन्तःकूजन् मुखरशकुनो यत्र रम्यो वनान्तः U. 2. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनान्तरम्
वनम् + -अन्तरम्<BR>—1 another wood. —2 the interior of a forest; अपि वनान्तरमल्पकुचान्तरा<BR> श्रयति पर्वत पर्वसु संनता V. 4. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाब्जिनी
वनम् + -अब्जिनी a lotus-plant growing in water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनारिष्टा
वनम् + -अरिष्टा wild turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनार्चकः|वनार्चक|वनार्च्चक|वनार्च्चकः
वनम् + -अर्चकः a florist, maker of garlands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनालक्तम्
वनम् + -अलक्तम् red earth or ruddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनालिका
वनम् + -अलिका a sun-flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाखुः|वनाखु
वनम् + -आखुः a hare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाखुकः|वनाखुक
वनम् + -आखुकः a kind of bean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनापगा
वनम् + -आपगा ‘wood-river’, a forest-stream; महार्णवं समासाद्य वनापगशतं<BR> यथा Rām. 7. 19. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनार्द्रकम्
वनम् + -आर्द्रकम् the root of wild ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनार्द्रका
वनम् + -आर्द्रकम् + .({@-का@}) wild ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाश|वनाशः
वनम् + -आश <i>a.</i> living on water; कुतः क्षीरं … वनाशानां<BR> वनाश्रमनिवासिनाम् Mb. 13. 14. 124.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाशः|वनाश
वनम् + -आश + .({@-शः@}) —1 dining in a wood, a picnic; क्वचिद्वनाशाय मनो दधद्<BR> व्रजात् प्रातः समुत्थाय वयस्यवत्सपान् Bhāg. 10. 12. 1.<BR>—2 a kind of small barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाश्रमः|वनाश्रम
वनम् + -आश्रमः abode in the woods, the third stage in the religious<BR> life of a Brāhmaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाश्रमिन्
वनम् + -आश्रमिन् <i>m.</i> an anchorite, a hermit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनाश्रयः|वनाश्रय
वनम् + -आश्रयः<BR>—1 an inhabitant of the wood.<BR>—2 a sort of crow or raven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनोत्साहः|वनोत्साह
वनम् + -उत्साहः a rhinoceros.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनोद्धवा
वनम् + -उद्धवा the wild cotton plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनोपप्लवः|वनोपप्लव
वनम् + -उपप्लवः a forest conflagration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनोपलः|वनोपल
वनम् + -उपलः shaped and dried cow dung (Mar. गोवरी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनौकस्
वनम् + -ओकस् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an inhabitant of a wood, a forester.<BR>—2 an anchorite, a hermit.<BR>—3 a wild animal such as a monkey, boar &c.; तस्य त्यक्तस्वभावस्य<BR> घृणेर्मायावनौकसः Bhāg. 7. 2. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनौषधिः|वनौषधि
वनम् + -ओषधिः a medicinal herb growing in a forest or growing wild.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनकणा
वनम् + -कणा wild pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनकदली
वनम् + -कदली wild plantain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनकरिन्
