वनचरः|वनचर
वनम् + -चर + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a forester, forest-dweller, woodman; उपतस्थुरास्थितविषादधियः शतयज्वनो<BR> वनचरा वसतिम् Ki. 6. 29; Me. 12.<BR>—2 a wild animal.<BR>—3 the fabulous eight-legged animal called Śarabha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1386-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वनचर्या
