वर्णान्तरम्
वर्णः + -अन्तरम्<BR>—1 another caste. ˚गमनम् the passing into another<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">Page1394-2</a>]<BR> caste.<BR>—2 change of sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

