वर्णापेत
वर्णः + -अपेत <i>a.</i> devoid of any cast, outcast, degraded; वर्णापेतमविज्ञातं … …<BR> कर्मभिः स्वैर्विभावयेत् Ms. 10. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

