वर्णः + -प्रसादनम् aloe-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णबुद्धिः|वर्णबुद्धि
वर्णः + -बुद्धिः the notion connected with particular letters or sounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णभेदिनी
वर्णः + -भेदिनी millet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णमातृ
वर्णः + -मातृ <i>f.</i> a pen, pencil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णमातृका
वर्णः + -मातृका N. of Sarasvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णमाला
वर्णः + -माला, -राशिः the alphabet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णराशिः|वर्णराशि
वर्णः + -माला, -राशिः the alphabet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णरेखा
वर्णः + -रेखा, -लेखा, -लेखिका chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णलेखा
वर्णः + -रेखा, -लेखा, -लेखिका chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णलेखिका
वर्णः + -रेखा, -लेखा, -लेखिका chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णवर्तिः|वर्णवर्ति
वर्णः + -वर्तिः, -वर्तिका <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a paint-brush; फलकमादाय मणिसमुद्गकाद्वर्णवर्तिकामुद्धृत्य Dk. 2. 2.<BR>—2 a pencil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णवर्तिका
वर्णः + -वर्तिः, -वर्तिका <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a paint-brush; फलकमादाय मणिसमुद्गकाद्वर्णवर्तिकामुद्धृत्य Dk. 2. 2.<BR>—2 a pencil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णवादिन्
वर्णः + -वादिन् <i>m.</i> a panegyrist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णविक्रिया
वर्णः + -विक्रिया enmity against the castes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णविपर्ययः|वर्णविपर्यय
वर्णः + -विपर्ययः the substitution or change of letters; (भवेत्)<BR> सिंहो वर्णविपर्ययात् Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णविलासिनी
वर्णः + -विलासिनी turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णविलोडकः|वर्णविलोडक
वर्णः + -विलोडकः<BR>—1 a house-breaker. —2 a plagiarist (lit. word-stealer).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णवृत्तम्
वर्णः + -वृत्तम् a metre regulated by the number of syllables it contains<BR> (opp. मात्रावृत्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णव्यवस्थितिः|वर्णव्यवस्थिति
वर्णः + -व्यवस्थितिः <i>f.</i> the institution of caste, caste-system.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णशिक्षा
वर्णः + -शिक्षा instruction in letters.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णश्रेष्ठः|वर्णश्रेष्ठ
वर्णः + -श्रेष्ठः a Brāhmaṇa; वर्णश्रेष्ठो द्विजः पूज्यः H. 4. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णसंयोगः|वर्णसंयोग
वर्णः + -संयोगः marriage between persons of the same caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णसंसर्गः|वर्णसंसर्ग
वर्णः + -संसर्गः confusion of castes, marriage with members of other<BR> castes; Ms. 8. 172.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णसंहारः|वर्णसंहार
वर्णः + -संहारः an assemblage of different castes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णसंकरः|वर्णसङ्कर|वर्णसंकर|वर्णसङ्करः
वर्णः + -संकरः —1 confusion of castes through intermarriage; स्त्रीषु<BR> दुष्टासु वार्ष्णेय जायते वर्णसंकरः Bg. 1. 41.<BR>—2 mixture or blending of colours; चित्रेषु वर्णसंकरः K. (where<BR> both senses are intended); Śi. 14. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णसंघातः|वर्णसङ्घात|वर्णसंघात
वर्णः + -संघातः, -समाम्नायः the alphabet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णसमाम्नायः|वर्णसमाम्नाय
वर्णः + -संघातः, -समाम्नायः the alphabet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णस्थानम्
वर्णः + -स्थानम् an organ of utterance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णहीन
वर्णः + -हीन <i>a.</i> outcast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णकः|वर्णक|वर्णकं|वर्ण्णक
वर्णकः [वर्णयति, वर्ण्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A mask, the dress of an actor.<BR>—2 A paint, colour for painting; नृपमौलिमरीचिवर्णकैः खलु यस्याङ्घ्रियुगं<BR> विलिप्यते Śi. 16. 62; मया पुनरिह पर्वते सुलभाः पञ्चजातीया वर्णका<BR> आनीताः Nāg. 2. 24.<BR>—3 A paint,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">Page1395-1</a>]<BR> or anything used as an unguent or pigment; कुचतटे वैवर्ण्यमुपैति वर्णकम्<BR> Dk. 2. 5; एतैः पिष्टतमालवर्णकनिभैरालिप्तमम्भोधरैः Mk. 5. 46;<BR> Bk. 19. 11; a fragrant ointment; Śi. 11. 29.<BR>—4 A bard, panegyrist.<BR>—5 Vermilion.<BR>—6 Sandal (the tree).<BR>—7 A letter, syllable.<BR>—8 A speaker; narrator (वक्ता); अपि रहसि कृतानां वाग्विहीनोऽपि<BR> जातः सुरतविलसितानां वर्णको वर्णकोऽसौ Śi. 11. 29.<BR>—9 A model or specimen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णका
वर्णकः + .{@-का@} (also वर्णिका)<BR>—1 A mask.<BR>—2 A paint, colour for painting.<BR>—3 Fine gold.<BR>—4 Vermilion.<BR>—5 A cloak, mantle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णकम्
वर्णकः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A paint, colour, pigment.<BR>—2 Sandal.<BR>—3 A chapter, division.<BR>—4 A circle, orb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1394-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णनम्
वर्णनम्, -ना<BR> [वर्ण्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Painting.<BR>—2 Description, delineation, representation; स्वभावोक्तिस्तु डिम्भादेः<BR> स्वक्रियारूपवर्णनम् K. P. 10.<BR>—3 Writing.<BR>—4 A statement, an assertion.<BR>—5 Praise, commendation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णना
वर्णनम्, -ना + .({@-ना@} only in this sense.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णना
वर्णनम्, -ना<BR> [वर्ण्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Painting.<BR>—2 Description, delineation, representation; स्वभावोक्तिस्तु डिम्भादेः<BR> स्वक्रियारूपवर्णनम् K. P. 10.<BR>—3 Writing.<BR>—4 A statement, an assertion.<BR>—5 Praise, commendation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णनीय
वर्णनीय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be painted or coloured.<BR>—2 To be delineated, described.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णवती
वर्णवती Turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णसिः|वर्णसि
वर्णसिः [Uṇ. 4. 118]<BR>—1 Water.<BR>—2 A lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णाटः|वर्णाट
वर्णाटः<BR>—1 A painter.<BR>—2 A singer.<BR>—3 One who maintains himself by his wife (स्त्रीकृताजीव).<BR>—4 A lover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णिः|वर्णि
वर्णिः<BR>—1 Gold.<BR>—2 Fragrant ointment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णिकः|वर्णिक
वर्णिकः = वार्णिकः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णिका
वर्णिका [वर्णा अक्षराणि लेख्यत्वेन सन्त्यस्याः ठन्]<BR>—1 The mask or dress of an actor.<BR>—2 A colour, paint.<BR>—3 Ink.<BR>—4 A pen, pencil.<BR>—5 Chalk.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्णिकापरिग्रहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णिकापरिग्रहः|वर्णिकापरिग्रह
वर्णिका + -परिग्रहः the assumption of a character or mask; ततः प्रकरणनायकस्य<BR> मालतीवल्लभस्य माधवस्य वर्णिकापरिग्रहः कथम् Māl. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णित|वर्णितः
वर्णित <i>p. p.</i> [वर्ण्-क्त]<BR>—1 Painted.<BR>—2 Described, represented.<BR>—3 Extolled, praised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णिन्
वर्णिन् <i>a.</i> [वर्णोऽस्त्यस्य इनि] (at the end of comp.)<BR>—1 Having the colour or appearance of; एतस्यास्तौ सुतौ देव्याः कुमारौ<BR> देववर्णिनौ Rām. 2. 92. 24.<BR>—2 Belonging to the caste of. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A painter.<BR>—2 A scribe, writer; ‘वर्णी स्याल्लेखके चित्रकारेऽपि ब्रह्मचारिणि’ इति<BR> मेदिनी; Mb. 12. 69. 57.<BR>—3 A religious student, a Brahmachārin q. v.; अथाह वर्णी Ku. 5. 65, 52;<BR> वर्णाश्रमाणां गुरवे स वर्णी विचक्षणः प्रस्तुतमाचचक्षे R. 5. 19.<BR>—4 A person of any one of the four principal castes.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्णिलिङ्गिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णिलिङ्गिन्|वर्णिलिंगिन्
वर्णिन् + -लिङ्गिन् <i>a.</i> disguised as, or wearing the marks of, a religious<BR> student; स वर्णिलिङ्गी विदितः समाययौ युधिष्ठिरं द्वैतवने वनेचरः Ki. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णिनी
वर्णिनी<BR>—1 A woman (in general).<BR>—2 A woman belonging to any one of the four principal castes.<BR>—3 Turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्णुः|वर्णु
वर्णुः [वृ-णुः नित् Uṇ. 3. 37]<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 A river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ण्य
वर्ण्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be described; (often used in rhetorical works like प्रकृत or<BR> प्रस्तुत q. v.).<BR>—2 Relating to colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ण्यम्
वर्ण्य + .{@-र्ण्यम्@} Saffron.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्ण्यसमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ण्यसमः|वर्ण्यसम
वर्ण्य + -समः a kind of sophism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तः|वर्त|वर्त्त
वर्तः (Usually at the end of comp.) Living, livelihood; as in कल्यवर्त q. v.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्तजन्मन्, वर्ततीक्ष्णम्, वर्तलोहम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तजन्मन्|वर्त्तजन्मन्
वर्तः + -जन्मन् <i>m.</i> a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ततीक्ष्णम्
वर्तः + -तीक्ष्णम्, -लोहम् bell-metal, a kind of brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तलोहम्
वर्तः + -तीक्ष्णम्, -लोहम् bell-metal, a kind of brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तक|वर्तकः|वर्त्तक|वर्त्तकं|वर्त्तकः
वर्तक <i>a.</i> [वृत्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Living, being, existing.<BR>—2 Devoted to; अभिगन्तुं स काकुत्स्थमियेष गुरुवर्तकम् Rām. 2. 98. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तकः|वर्तक|वर्त्तक|वर्त्तकं|वर्त्तकः
वर्तक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A quail; कौशिकं तु ततो हृत्वा नरो जायति वर्तकः Mb. 13. 111. 104.<BR>—2 A horseʼs hoof; कर्तयन्त इवाश्वीयवर्तकैर्ञ्योममण्डलम् Śiva B. 13. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तकम्
वर्तक + .{@-कम्@} A sort of brass or bell-metal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तका|वर्त्तका
वर्तका, -की<BR> A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तकी
वर्तका, -की<BR> A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तन|वर्तनः|वर्त्तन|वर्त्तनं|वर्त्तनः
वर्तन <i>a.</i> [वृत्-ल्यु ल्युट् वा]<BR>—1 Abiding, living, staying, being &c.<BR>—2 Stationary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तनः|वर्तन|वर्त्तन|वर्त्तनं|वर्त्तनः
वर्तन + .{@-नः@} A dwarf.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तनी|वर्त्तनी
वर्तन + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 A road, way.<BR>—2 Living, life.<BR>—3 Pounding, grinding.<BR>—4 Sending off, despatching.<BR>—5 A spindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तनम्
वर्तन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Living, being.<BR>—2 Staying, abiding, residing.<BR>—3 Action, movement, mode or manner of living; स्मरसि च तदुपान्तेष्वावयोर्वर्तनानि<BR> U. 1. 26; (the word may here mean ‘abode or residence’, also).<BR>—4 Living on, subsisting (at the end of comp.).<BR>—5 Livelihood, maintenance, subsistence; तैरेवास्य कलेः कलेवरपुषो<BR> दैनंदिनं वर्तनम् Bv. 1. 103.<BR>—6 Turning round, revolving.<BR>—7 Rolling on, moving about.<BR>—8 Appointing.<BR>—9 A means of subsistence, profession, occupation.<BR>—10 Conduct, behaviour, proceeding.<BR>—11 Wages, salary, hire.<BR>—12 Commerce, traffic.<BR>—13 A spindle.<BR>—14 A globe, ball.<BR>—15 Application of; colouring; निहितमलक्तवर्तनाभिताम्रम् Ki. 10. 42.<BR>—16 An often-told word.<BR>—17 Decoction.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्तनविनियोगः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तनविनियोगः|वर्तनविनियोग|वर्त्तनविनियोग
वर्तन + -विनियोगः salary, wages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तनिः|वर्तनि|वर्त्तनि|वर्त्तनिः
वर्तनिः [वर्तन्तेऽस्यां जनाः वृत्-निः Uṇ. 2. 105]<BR>—1 The eastern part of India, the eastern country. —2 A hymn, praise, eulogium (स्तोत्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तनिः|वर्तनि|वर्त्तनि|वर्त्तनिः
वर्तनिः + .{@-निः@} <i>f.</i> —1 A way, road; तस्मादेष एव यज्ञस्तस्य मनश्च<BR> वाक्च वर्तनी Ch. Up. 4. 16. 1.<BR>—2 The eyelashes; अधरयैनं वर्तन्या पृथिव्यन्वायत्ता द्यौः Bṛ. Up. 2. 2. 2.<BR>—3 Ved. A wheel.<BR>—4 The track of a wheel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तमान|वर्तमानः|वर्त्तमान|वर्त्तमानः
वर्तमान <i>a.</i> [वृत्-शानच्]<BR>—1 Being, existing.<BR>—2 Living, being alive, contemporary; प्रथितयशसां भासकविसौमिल्लकवि-मिश्रादीनां<BR> प्रबन्धानतिक्रम्य वर्तमानकवेः कालिदासस्य क्रियायां कथं परिषदो<BR> बहुमानः M. 1.<BR>—3 Turning or moving round, revolving.<BR>—4 Dwelling in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तमानः|वर्तमान|वर्त्तमान|वर्त्तमानः
वर्तमान + .{@-नः@} The present tense (in gram.); वर्तमानसामीप्ये वर्तमानवद्वा<BR> P. III. 3. 131.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तमानम्
वर्तमान + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Presence.<BR>—2 The present time.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्तमानाक्षेपः, वर्तमानकालः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तमानाक्षेपः|वर्तमानाक्षेप
वर्तमान + -आक्षेपः not agreeing with the present.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तमानकालः|वर्तमानकाल
वर्तमान + -कालः<BR>—1 the present tense.<BR>—2 the present time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तरूकः|वर्तरूक|वर्त्तरूक|वर्त्तरूकः
वर्तरूकः<BR>—1 A pool, puddle.<BR>—2 An eddy, a whirlpool.<BR>—3 A crowʼs nest.<BR>—4 A door-keeper.<BR>—5 N. of a river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तस्
वर्तस् <i>n.</i> Ved. The eyelashes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिः|वर्ति|वर्त्ति|वर्त्तिः
वर्तिः, -र्ती <i>f.</i><BR> [वृत्-इन् वा डीप् Uṇ. 4. 130, 135]<BR>—1 Anything wrapped round, a pad, roll.<BR>—2 An unguent, ointment, eye-salve, collyrium or any cosmetic (in the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">Page1396-1</a>]<BR> form of a ball or pill); सा पुनर्मम प्रथमदर्शनात्प्रभृत्यमृतवर्तिरिव<BR> चक्षुषोरानन्दमुत्पादयन्ती Māl. 1; इयगमृतवर्तिर्नयनयोः U. 1. 38;<BR> कर्पूरवर्तिरिव लोचनतापहन्त्री Bv. 3. 16; Vb. 1.<BR>—3 The wick of a lamp; उज्ज्वलालोकया स्निग्धा त्वया त्यक्ता न राजते ।<BR> मलीमसमुखी वर्तिः प्रदीपशिखया यथा ॥ Māl. 10. 4; a lamp.<BR>—4 The projecting threads or unwoven ends (of a cloth), the fringe.<BR>—5 A magical lamp.<BR>—6 The protuberance round a vessel.<BR>—7 A surgical instrument (such as a bougie).<BR>—8 A streak, line.<BR>—9 Swelling in the throat.<BR>—10 A swelling formed by internal rupture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ती|वर्त्ती
वर्तिः, -र्ती <i>f.</i><BR> [वृत्-इन् वा डीप् Uṇ. 4. 130, 135]<BR>—1 Anything wrapped round, a pad, roll.<BR>—2 An unguent, ointment, eye-salve, collyrium or any cosmetic (in the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">Page1396-1</a>]<BR> form of a ball or pill); सा पुनर्मम प्रथमदर्शनात्प्रभृत्यमृतवर्तिरिव<BR> चक्षुषोरानन्दमुत्पादयन्ती Māl. 1; इयगमृतवर्तिर्नयनयोः U. 1. 38;<BR> कर्पूरवर्तिरिव लोचनतापहन्त्री Bv. 3. 16; Vb. 1.<BR>—3 The wick of a lamp; उज्ज्वलालोकया स्निग्धा त्वया त्यक्ता न राजते ।<BR> मलीमसमुखी वर्तिः प्रदीपशिखया यथा ॥ Māl. 10. 4; a lamp.<BR>—4 The projecting threads or unwoven ends (of a cloth), the fringe.<BR>—5 A magical lamp.<BR>—6 The protuberance round a vessel.<BR>—7 A surgical instrument (such as a bougie).<BR>—8 A streak, line.<BR>—9 Swelling in the throat.<BR>—10 A swelling formed by internal rupture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1395-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिकः|वर्तिक|वर्त्तिक|वर्त्तिकः
वर्तिकः A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिका|वर्त्तिका
वर्तिका [वृतेः तिकन् Uṇ. 3. 146]<BR>—1 A paint-brush; तदुपनय चिन्रफलकं चित्रवर्तिकाश्च Māl. 1;<BR> अङ्गुलीक्षरणसन्नवर्तिकः R. 19. 19.<BR>—2 The wick of a lamp, a torch; तिलस्नेहसिक्तयष्टपग्रग्रथितवर्तिका Dk. 2. 7.<BR>—3 Colour, paint.<BR>—4 A quail; एकपक्षाक्षिचरणा वर्तिका घोरदर्शना Mb. 3. 180. 42;<BR> श्येनावपातचकिता वनवर्तिकेव Māl. 8. 8.<BR>—5 A stick (यष्टि); पलाशवर्तिकामेकां वहतः संहतान् पथि<BR> (अपश्यत्) Mb. 1. 31. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तित|वर्त्तित
वर्तित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Turned, rolled.<BR>—2 Caused to be or exist.<BR>—3 Brought about, accomplished.<BR>—4 Spent, passed (as time or life).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्तितजन्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तितजन्मन्
वर्तित + -जन्मन् begotten, procreated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिन्|वर्त्तिन्
वर्तिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वृत्-णिनि] (Usually at the end of comp.)<BR>—1 Abiding, being, resting, staying, situated.<BR>—2 Going, moving, turning.<BR>—3 Acting, behaving.<BR>—4 Performing, practising.<BR>—5 Obeying, executing (an order). ━<i>m.</i> The meaning of an affix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिष्णु|वर्त्तिष्णु|वर्त्तिष्णुः
वर्तिष्णु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Revolving.<BR>—2 Being, abiding.<BR>—3 Circular.<BR>—4 Stationary, fixed.<BR>—5 Firm in battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिस्
वर्तिस् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Circuit, orbit.<BR>—2 A way, path.<BR>—3 Abode, residence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तीरः|वर्तीर
वर्ती(र्ति)रः A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तिरः|वर्तिर
वर्ती(र्ति)रः A kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तुल|वर्तुलः|वर्त्तुल|वर्त्तुलं|वर्त्तुलः
वर्तुल <i>a.</i> [वृत्-उलच् Uṇ. 1. 93] Round, circular, globular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तुलः|वर्तुल|वर्त्तुल|वर्त्तुलं|वर्त्तुलः
वर्तुल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A kind of pulse, a pea.<BR>—2 A ball.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तुलम्
वर्तुल + .{@-लम्@} A circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्तुला|वर्त्तुला
वर्तुल + .{@-ला@} <i>f.</i> The end-ball of a spindle (to assist its rotation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्मन्
वर्त्मन् <i>n.</i> [वृत्-मनिन्]<BR>—1 A way, road, path, passage, track; वर्त्म भानोस्त्यजाशु Me. 41;<BR> पारसीकांस्ततो जेतुं प्रतस्थे स्थलवर्त्मना ‘by land’; आकाशवर्त्मना<BR> ‘through the air’.<BR>—2 (Fig.) A way, course, an established or prescribed usage, the usual<BR> manner or course of conduct; मम वर्त्मानुवर्तन्ते मनुष्याः पार्थ सर्वशः<BR> Bg. 3. 23; रेखामात्रमपि क्षुण्णादा मनोर्वत्मनः परम् । न व्यतीयुः<BR> प्रजास्तस्य नियन्तुर्नेमिवृत्तयः R. 1. 17 (where the literal sense is<BR> also intended); अहमेत्य पतङ्गवर्त्मना पुनरङ्काश्रयिणी भवामि ते<BR> Ku. 4. 20 ‘after the manner of a moth’.<BR>—4 Room, scope for action; न वर्त्म कस्मैचिदपि प्रदीयताम् Ki. 14. 14.<BR>—5 An eye-lid; अस्मिन् सर्पिर्वोदकं वा सिञ्चन्ति वर्त्मनी एव गच्छति<BR> Ch. Up. 4. 15. 1.<BR>—6 An edge, a border.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्त्मायासः, वर्त्मकर्मन्, वर्त्मपातः, वर्त्मपातनम्, वर्त्मबन्धः, वर्त्मबन्धकः, वर्त्मरोगः, वर्त्मशर्करा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्मायासः|वर्त्मायास
वर्त्मन् + -आयासः fatigue of the journey; वर्त्मायासविनिर्मुक्तं वसन्तं<BR> सुस्थिरासने Brav. P.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">Page1396-2</a>]<BR> ब्रह्मखण्ड 1. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्मकर्मन्
वर्त्मन् + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> ‘roadwork’, engineering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्मपातः|वर्त्मपात
वर्त्मन् + -पातः<BR>—1 deviation from the road.<BR>—2 coming into the way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्मपातनम्
वर्त्मन् + -पातनम् waylaying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्मबन्धः|वर्त्मबन्ध|वर्त्मबंध
वर्त्मन् + -बन्धः, -बन्धकः an affection of the eye-lids.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्त्मबन्धकः
