वर्ध्
वर्ध् €10 U. (वर्धयति-ते, also वर्धापयति)<BR>—1 To cut, divide, shear.<BR>—2 To fill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

