वर्धनः|वर्धन|वर्द्धनं|वर्द्धनः
वर्धन + .{@-नः@} A bestower of prosperity.<BR>—2 A tooth growing over another tooth.<BR>—3 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धनी
वर्धन + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 A broom.<BR>—2 A bier.<BR>—3 A water-jar of a particular shape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धनम्
वर्धन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Growing, thriving.<BR>—2 Growth, increase, prosperity, magnifying, enlargement.<BR>—4 Elevation.<BR>—5 Exhilaration (of spirits), animation.<BR>—6 Educating, rearing.<BR>—7 Cutting, dividing; as in नाभिवर्धनम्; प्राङ्नाभिवर्धनात् पुंसो जातकर्म<BR> विधीयते Mb. 3. 180. 34; annihilation; ततो राजन् महानासीत् संग्रामो<BR> भूरिवर्धनः Mb. 7. 153. 44.<BR>—8 A means of strengthening, restorative.<BR>—9 Filling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धनक
वर्धनक <i>a.</i> Exhilarating, gladdening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धनिका
वर्धनिका A small vessel in which sacred water is kept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1396-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धमान|वर्द्धमानः|वर्धमानः
