वर्धमानकः|वर्धमानक|वर्द्धमानकः
वर्धमानकः<BR>—1 A kind of dish or pot, lid or cover; भ्रमयत्युचितं विदर्भजानननीराजनवर्धमानकम्<BR> N. 2. 20; Mb. 14. 65. 15.<BR>—2 N. of a class of persons who dance with lamps on their heads, hands<BR> etc.; नट-नर्तक-गन्धर्वैः पूर्णकैर्वर्धमानकैः Mb. 7. 57. 4 (com.<BR> वर्धमानकैः आरात्रिकहस्तैः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धापनम्
वर्धापनम् [वर्धं छेदं करोति, वृध् णिच्-आप् च ततो भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Cutting, dividing.<BR>—2 Cutting the umbilical cord, or the ceremony connected with this act.<BR>—3 A festival on a birth-day.<BR>—4 A ny festival in general when wishes for prosperity and other congratulatory<BR> expressions are offered; cf. पूर्णपात्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्धापनिकम्
