वर्ध्री
वर्ध्रिका, वर्ध्री A leather strap or thong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्पः
वर्पः [वृ-पुट् Uṇ. 4. 208] Form, figure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्पन्
वर्पन् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 Form, figure.<BR>—2 Praise.<BR>—3 A plot, trick, artifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्फ्
वर्फ् €1 P. (वर्फति)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्मन्|वर्म्मन्
वर्मन् <i>n.</i> [आवृणोति अङ्गम् वृ-मनिन् Uṇ. 4. 157]<BR>—1 An armour, a coat of mail; स्वहृदयमर्मणि वर्म करोति सजलनलिनीदलजालम्<BR> Gīt. 4; R. 4. 56; Mu. 2. 8; Śi. 15. 76.<BR>—2 (Hence) Shelter, protection.<BR>—3 Bark, rind.<BR>—4 N. of preservative mantras (esp. of हुम्). ━<i>m.</i> An affix added<BR> to the names of Kṣatriyas; as चण्डवर्मन्, प्रहारवर्मन्; cf. दास.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्महर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्महर|वर्म्महर
वर्मन् + -हर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 wearing armour.<BR>—2 old enough to wear armour (<i>i. e.</i> to take part in battle); सम्यग्विनीतमथ<BR> वर्महरं कुमारम् R. 8. 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्मिक
वर्मिक, वर्मिन् <i>a.</i> Mailed, furnished with armour; also वर्मिन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्मिन्
वर्मिक, वर्मिन् <i>a.</i> Mailed, furnished with armour; also वर्मिन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्मणः|वर्मण
वर्मणः The orange tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्मिः|वर्मि|वर्म्मि|वर्म्मिः
