वर्वरः|वर्वर|वर्व्वर|वर्व्वरं|वर्व्वरः
वर्वर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A barbarian.<BR>—2 A blockhead, babbling fool.<BR>—3 An outcast.<BR>—4 Curly hair.<BR>—5 The clash of weapons.<BR>—6 A mode of dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्वरा|वर्व्वरा
वर्वर + .{@-रा, -री@}<BR>—1 A kind of fly.<BR>—2 A kind of basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्वरी|वर्व्वरी
वर्वर + .{@-रा, -री@}<BR>—1 A kind of fly.<BR>—2 A kind of basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

