वर्वरकम्
वर्वरकम् A variety of sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्वरीकः|वर्वरीक|वर्व्वरीक|वर्व्वरीकः
वर्वरीकः [वृ-ईकन्, द्वे रुक् अभ्यासस्य Uṇ. 4. 19]<BR>—1 Curly hair.<BR>—2 A kind of basil.<BR>—3 A kind of shrub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

