वर्षावसानम्
वर्षः + -अवसानम् the autumn or Śarat season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षाघोषः|वर्षाघोष
वर्षः + -आघोषः a frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षामदः|वर्षामद
वर्षः + -आमदः a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षोपलः|वर्षोपल
वर्षः + -उपलः<BR>—1 hail stone.<BR>—2 a kind of sweetmeat ball; घनैरमीषां परिवेषकैर्जनैरवर्षि वर्षोपलगोलकावली N. 16. 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षकरः|वर्षकर
वर्षः + -करः a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षकरी
वर्षः + -करः + .({@-री@}) a cricket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षकालः
वर्षः + -कालः the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षकेतुः|वर्षकेतु
वर्षः + -केतुः a red-flowering Punar-navā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षकोशः|वर्षकोश
वर्षः + -कोशः, -कोषः<BR>—1 a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">Page1398-1</a>]<BR> month.<BR>—2 an astrologer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षकोषः|वर्षकोष
वर्षः + -कोशः, -कोषः<BR>—1 a<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">Page1398-1</a>]<BR> month.<BR>—2 an astrologer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1397-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षगणः|वर्षगण
वर्षः + -गणः (pl.) a long series of years; बहून् वर्षगणान् घोरान् Ms. 12. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षगिरिः|वर्षगिरि
वर्षः + -गिरिः, -पर्वतः ‘a Varṣa mountain’, <i>i. e.</i> one of the mountain-ranges<BR> supposed to separate the different divisions of the world from one another;<BR> (they are seven:− हिमवान् हेमकूटश्च निषधो मेरुरेव च । चैत्रः कर्णी<BR> च शृङ्गी च सप्तैते वर्षपर्वताः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षपर्वतः|वर्षपर्वत|वर्षपर्व्वत|वर्षपर्व्वतः
वर्षः + -गिरिः, -पर्वतः ‘a Varṣa mountain’, <i>i. e.</i> one of the mountain-ranges<BR> supposed to separate the different divisions of the world from one another;<BR> (they are seven:− हिमवान् हेमकूटश्च निषधो मेरुरेव च । चैत्रः कर्णी<BR> च शृङ्गी च सप्तैते वर्षपर्वताः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षघ्न
वर्षः + -घ्न <i>a.</i> protecting from rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षज|वर्षजं
वर्षः + -ज <i>a.</i> (वर्षेज also)<BR>—1 produced in the rainy season.<BR>—2 one year old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षत्रम्
वर्षः + -त्रम् an umbrella; छायां ते दिनकरभाः प्रबाधमानं वर्षत्रं<BR> भरत करोतु मूर्ध्नि शीताम् Rām. 2. 107. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षधरः|वर्षधर
वर्षः + -धरः<BR>—1 a cloud.<BR>—2 a eunuch, an attendant on the womenʼs apartments; (वर्षधर्ष in<BR> the same sense). See वर्षवर.<BR>—3 the ruler of a Varṣa; वर्षधराभिवादिताभिवन्दितचरणः Bhāg. 5. 3. 16;<BR> also वर्षप-पति.<BR>—4 a mountain bounding a Varṣa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षपदम्
वर्षः + -पदम् a calendar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षपाकिन्
वर्षः + -पाकिन् <i>m.</i> the hog-plum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षपूगः|वर्षपूग
वर्षः + -पूगः a series or collection of years.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षप्रतिबन्धः|वर्षप्रतिबन्ध|वर्षप्रतिबंध
वर्षः + -प्रतिबन्धः a drought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षप्रवेगः
वर्षः + -प्रवेगः a heavy shower of rain; वर्षप्रवेगा विपुलाः पतन्ति<BR> Rām. 4. 28. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षप्रियः|वर्षप्रिय
वर्षः + -प्रियः the Chātaka bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षरात्रः|वर्षरात्र
वर्षः + -रात्रः the rainy season; वर्षरात्रे स्थितो रामः Rām. 4. 30. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षवरः|वर्षवर
वर्षः + -वरः a eunuch, an attendant on the womenʼs apartments; वर्षवराभ्यागारिकैः<BR> Kau. A. 1. 21; ये स्वल्पसत्त्वाः प्रथममात्मीयाः स्त्रीस्वभाविनः । जात्या<BR> न दुष्टाः कार्येषु ते वै वर्षवराः स्मृताः ॥ Ak.; M. 4. 4/5; Rām. 2. 65. 7;<BR> Mb. 9. 62. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षवृद्धिः|वर्षवृद्धि
वर्षः + -वृद्धिः <i>f.</i> birth-day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षशतम्
वर्षः + -शतम् a century, one hundred years.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षसहस्रम्
वर्षः + -सहस्रम् a thousand years.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षक
वर्षक <i>a.</i> Raining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षणम्
वर्षणम् [वृष्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Raining, rain.<BR>—2 Sprinking, showering down (fig. also); द्रव्यवर्षणम् ‘showering or bestowing wealth’<BR>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षणिः|वर्षणि
वर्षणिः <i>f.</i> [वृष्-अनिः]<BR>—1 Raining.<BR>—2 A sacrifice, sacrificial rite.<BR>—3 An act, action. —4 Staying, living, abiding (वर्तन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षा
वर्षा (Usually <i>f.</i> pl.)<BR>—1 The rainy season, the rains, the monsoon; ग्रीष्मे पञ्चाग्निमध्यस्थो<BR> वर्षासु स्थण्डिलेशयः Y. 3. 52; Bk. 7. 1.<BR>—2 Rain (sing. in this sense).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्षावसायः, वर्षाघोषः, वर्षाकालः, वर्षाकालीन, वर्षाप्रभञ्जनः, वर्षाभवः, वर्षाभू, वर्षाभूः, वर्षाभ्वी, वर्षामदः, वर्षारात्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षावसायः|वर्षावसाय
वर्षा + -अवसायः the Śarad season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षाघोषः|वर्षाघोष
वर्षा + -आघोषः a large frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षाकालः|वर्षाकाल
वर्षा + -कालः the rains, the rainy season; so वर्षासमयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षाकालीन
वर्षा + -कालीन <i>a.</i> belonging to or produced in the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षाप्रभञ्जनः|वर्षाप्रभञ्जन
वर्षा + -प्रभञ्जनः a high wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षाभवः|वर्षाभव
वर्षा + -भवः a red flowering Punar-navā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षाभू
वर्षा + -भू <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a frog.<BR>—2 a kind of insect (इन्द्रगोप).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षाभूः
वर्षा + -भूः, -भ्वी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a female frog or a little frog.<BR>—2 hogweed.<BR>—3 an earth-worm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षाभ्वी
वर्षा + -भूः, -भ्वी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a female frog or a little frog.<BR>—2 hogweed.<BR>—3 an earth-worm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षामदः|वर्षामद
वर्षा + -मदः a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षारात्रः|वर्षारात्र
वर्षा + -रात्रः<BR>—1 a night in the rainy season.<BR>—2 the rainy season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षिक
वर्षिक <i>a.</i> Raining, showering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षिकम्
वर्षिक + .{@-कम्@} Aloe-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षितम्
वर्षितम् Rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षीयस्
वर्षीयस् <i>a.</i> (from वृष्) Showering; तपःकृशा देवमीढा आसीद्<BR> वर्षीयसी मही Bhāg. 10. 20. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षुक|वर्षुकः
वर्षुक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वृष्-उकञ्] Raining, watery, pouring down water;<BR> वर्षुकस्य किमपः कृतोन्नतेरम्बुदस्य परिहार्यमूषरम् Śi. 14. 46; Bk. 2. 37.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्षुकाब्दः, वर्षुकाम्बुदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षुकाब्दः|वर्षुकाब्द
वर्षुक + -अब्दः, -अम्बुदः a rain-cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षुकाम्बुदः|वर्षुकाम्बुद|वर्षुकांबुद
वर्षुक + -अब्दः, -अम्बुदः a rain-cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षिष्ठ|वर्षिष्ठः
वर्षिष्ठ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 newest, very new; नमो वर्षिष्ठाय त्रिनयन यविष्ठाय च नमो Śivamahimna 29.<BR>—2 Strongest.<BR>—3 Largest.<BR>—4 Most thriving, prosperous; एकं वनं तद्वर्षिष्ठं पक्वखर्जूरजम्बूमत्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 20. 25 (superl. of वृद्ध q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्षीयस्
वर्षीयस् <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Older, very old.<BR>—2 Stronger.<BR>—3 Very great, important; नात्मावसीदत्यस्मिंस्ते वर्षीयान्मदनुग्रहः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 9. 34 (compar. of वृद्ध q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ष्मम्
वर्ष्मम् The body; see below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ष्मन्
वर्ष्मन् <i>n.</i> [वृष्-मनिन् Uṇ. 4. 164]<BR>—1 Body, form; पृथुवर्ष्मभिरश्मभिः Śiva B. 23. 64.<BR>—2 A measure, height; वर्ष्म द्विपानां विरुवन्त उच्चकैर्वनेचरेभ्यश्चिरमाचचक्षिरे<BR> Śi. 12. 64; गजवर्ष्म किरातेभ्यः शशंसुर्देवदारवः R. 4. 76.<BR>—3 A handsome or lovely form.<BR>—4 Surface (as of a mountain); शकुनिशबलनीडानोकहस्निग्धवर्ष्मा Māl. 9. 5.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वर्ष्माभ, वर्ष्मवीर्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ष्माभ
वर्ष्मन् + -आभ <i>a.</i> resembling the form (of anything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ष्मवीर्यम्
वर्ष्मन् + -वीर्यम् vigour of body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ष्मवत्|वर्ष्मवन्त्
वर्ष्मवत् <i>a.</i> Having a body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ह्
वर्ह्, वर्ह, वर्हण, वर्हिण, वर्हिन्, वर्हिस् See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण, बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्ह|वर्हं
वर्ह्, वर्ह, वर्हण, वर्हिण, वर्हिन्, वर्हिस् See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण, बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्हण|वर्हणं
वर्ह्, वर्ह, वर्हण, वर्हिण, वर्हिन्, वर्हिस् See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण, बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्हिण|वर्हिणः
वर्ह्, वर्ह, वर्हण, वर्हिण, वर्हिन्, वर्हिस् See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण, बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्हिन्
वर्ह्, वर्ह, वर्हण, वर्हिण, वर्हिन्, वर्हिस् See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण, बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वर्हिस्
वर्ह्, वर्ह, वर्हण, वर्हिण, वर्हिन्, वर्हिस् See बर्ह्, बर्ह, बर्हण, बर्हिण, बर्हिन्, बर्हिस्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्
वल् €1 Ā. (वलते; but sometimes वलति also; वलित)<BR>—1 To go, approach, hasten; अन्योन्यं शरवृष्टिरेव वलते Mv. 6. 41;<BR> प्रणयिनः परिरब्धुमथाङ्गना ववलिरे वलिरेचितमध्यमाः Śi. 6. 38, 6. 11, 19. 42;<BR> त्वदभिसरणरभसेन वलन्ती पतति पदानि क्रियन्ति<BR> चलन्ती Gīt. 6.<BR>—2 To move, turn, move or turn round; वलितकन्धर Māl. 1. 29; Mv. 6. 41;<BR> दृष्टिरन्यतो न वलति K.<BR>—3 To turn to, be drawn or attracted towards, be attached to; हृदयमदये<BR> तस्मिन्नेवं पुनर्वलते बलात् Gīt. 7; Nalod. 3. 5.<BR>—4 To increase; वलन्नूपुरनिस्वना S. D. 116; अमन्दं कन्दर्पज्वरजनितचिन्ताकुलतया<BR> वलद्बाधां राधां सरसमिदमूचे सहचरी Gīt. 1.<BR>—5 To cover, enclose.<BR>—6 To be covered, enclosed or surrounded.<BR>—7 To return. ━<i>With</i> {@वि@} to move to and fro, roll about; स्विद्यति<BR> कूणति वेल्लति विवलति निमिषति विलोकयति तिर्यक् K. P. 10.<BR>━{@सम्@}<BR>—1 to mix, blend.<BR>—2 to connect, unite with (mostly in <i>p. p.</i>; see संवलित).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलतम्
वलतम् [वल-अतच् Uṇ. 3. 109] A granary, storeroom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलनम्
वलनम् [वल्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Moving, turning towards.<BR>—2 Moving round in a circle.<BR>—3 (In astr.) Deflection.<BR>—4 Agitation, excitement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलना
वलनम् + .{@-ना@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Moving, turning.<BR>—2 Making of pictorial designs; अनल्पवैदग्ध्यविवर्धिनीनां पत्रावलीनां<BR> वलनां समाप्तिम् । N. 3. 118.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलित|वलितः
वलित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Moving.<BR>—2 Moved, turned round, bent round.<BR>—3 Surrounded, enclosed; समवलोक्य तमोवलितं जनम् Veda-Vyāsāṣṭaka 1.<BR>—4 Wrinkled; विशदभ्रूयुगच्छन्नवलितापाङ्गलोचनः Ki. 11. 4.<BR>—5 Cast, darted; वलितलोलकटाक्षपराहतम् Māl. 8. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलितः|वलित
वलित + .{@-तः@} A particular position of the hands in dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1398-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलितम्
