वलजः + .{@-जम्@}<BR>—1 A field.<BR>—2 Grain.<BR>—3 War.<BR>—4 A surrounding wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

