वलिः|वलि
वलिः, -ली <i>f.</i> (Also written बलिः, -ली)<BR>—1 A fold or wrinkle (on the skin); बलिभिर्मुखमाक्रान्तम्.<BR>—2 A fold of skin on the upper part of the belly (especially of females,<BR> regarded as a mark of beauty); मध्येन सा वेदिविलग्नमध्या वलित्रयं<BR> चारु बभार बाला Ku. 1. 39.<BR>—3 The ridge<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">Page1399-2</a>]<BR> of a thatched roof.<BR>—4 A line made on the body with fragrant unguents.<BR>—5 A handle of the Chāmara; रत्नच्छायाखचितवलिभिश्चामरैः क्लान्तहस्ताः Me. 37.<BR>—6 Sulphur.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वलिपलितम्, वलिभृत्, वलिमुखः, वलिवदनः, वलिमुखम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वली
वलिः, -ली <i>f.</i> (Also written बलिः, -ली)<BR>—1 A fold or wrinkle (on the skin); बलिभिर्मुखमाक्रान्तम्.<BR>—2 A fold of skin on the upper part of the belly (especially of females,<BR> regarded as a mark of beauty); मध्येन सा वेदिविलग्नमध्या वलित्रयं<BR> चारु बभार बाला Ku. 1. 39.<BR>—3 The ridge<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">Page1399-2</a>]<BR> of a thatched roof.<BR>—4 A line made on the body with fragrant unguents.<BR>—5 A handle of the Chāmara; रत्नच्छायाखचितवलिभिश्चामरैः क्लान्तहस्ताः Me. 37.<BR>—6 Sulphur.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वलिपलितम्, वलिभृत्, वलिमुखः, वलिवदनः, वलिमुखम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिपलितम्
वलिः + -पलितम् Wrinkles and grey hair; गृहस्थस्तु यदा पश्येद् वलीपलितमात्मनः Ms. 6. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिभृत्
वलिः + -भृत् <i>a.</i> curled, having curls (as hair); कुसुमोत्खचितान् वलीभृतश्चलयन्<BR> भृङ्गरुचस्तवालकान् R. 8. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिमुखः|वलिमुख
वलिः + -मुखः, -वदनः a monkey; (वक्त्रम्) उन्नम्य चुम्बति बलीवदनः<BR> प्रियायाः Māl. 9. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिवदनः
वलिः + -मुखः, -वदनः a monkey; (वक्त्रम्) उन्नम्य चुम्बति बलीवदनः<BR> प्रियायाः Māl. 9. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिमुखम्
वलिः + -मुखम् the sixth change which takes place in warm milk when mixed<BR> with butter-milk (तक्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिकः|वलिक|वलिकं
वलिकः, -कम्<BR> The edge of a thatched roof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिकम्
वलिकः, -कम्<BR> The edge of a thatched roof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिन|वलिनः
वलिन, वलिभ <i>a.</i> [वलि-न भ वा] Wrinkled, shrivelled,<BR> contracted into wrinkles, flaccid; प्रणयिनं रभसादुदरश्रिया वलिभयालिभयादिव<BR> सस्वजे Śi. 6. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिभ|वलिभः
वलिन, वलिभ <i>a.</i> [वलि-न भ वा] Wrinkled, shrivelled,<BR> contracted into wrinkles, flaccid; प्रणयिनं रभसादुदरश्रिया वलिभयालिभयादिव<BR> सस्वजे Śi. 6. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिमत्|वलिमन्त्
वलिमत् <i>a.</i> Wrinkled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिर|वलिरः
वलिर <i>a.</i> Squint-eyed, squinting, oggling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलिशम्
