वलूकः|वलूक|वलूकं
वलूकः [वल्-ऊकः Uṇ. 4. 42] A kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वलूकम्
