वल्कलः|वल्कल|वल्कलं
वल्कलः, -लम्<BR> [वल्-कलच् कस्य नेत्वम् Uṇ. 4. 5]<BR>—1 The bark of a tree.<BR>—2 A garment made of bark, bark-garment; इयमधिकमनोज्ञा वल्कलेनापि<BR> तन्वी Ś. 1. 20, 19; R. 12. 8; Ku. 5. 8; हैमवल्कलाः 6. 6 ‘wearing golden bark-dresses’<BR>; (cf. चीरपरिग्रहाः in Ku. 6. 93).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वल्कलसंवीत<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1399-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

