वल्यूल्
वल्यू(ल्यु)ल् €1 P. (वल्यू(ल्यु)लयति)<BR>—1 To cut off.<BR>—2 To purify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1400-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वल्युल्
