वस्तम्
वस्तम्<BR>—1 An abode.<BR>—2 A house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तः|वस्त|वस्तं
वस्तम् + .{@-स्तः@} A goat; see बस्त.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वस्तान्त्री<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तान्त्री
वस्तम् + -अन्त्री benzoin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तकम्
