वस्तिशिरस्
वस्तिः + -शिरस् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 the pipe of a clyster.<BR>—2 the neck of the bladder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तिशोधनम्
वस्तिः + -शोधनम् a diuretic (which clears the bladder).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1403-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तु
वस्तु <i>n.</i> [वस्-तुन् Uṇ. 1. 71]<BR>—1 A really existing thing, the real, a reality; वस्तुन्यवस्त्वारोपोऽज्ञानम्.<BR>—2 A thing in general, an object, article, substance, matter; अथवा<BR> मृदु वस्तु हिंसितुं मृदुनैवारभते कृतान्तकः R. 8. 45; किं वस्तु विद्वन्<BR> गुरवे प्रदेयम् 5. 18, 3. 5; वस्तुनीष्टेऽप्यनादरः S. D.<BR>—3 Wealth, property, possessions.<BR>—4 Essence, nature, natural or essential property.<BR>—5 Stuff (of which a thing in made), materials, ingredients (fig. also);<BR> आकृतिप्रत्ययादेवैनामनूनवस्तुकां संभावयामि M. 1.<BR>—6 The plot (of a drama), the subject-matter of any poetic composition;<BR> कालिदासग्रथितवस्तुना नवेनाभिज्ञानशकुन्तलाख्येन नाटकेनोपस्थातव्यमस्माभिः<BR> Ś. 1; अथवा सद्वस्तुपुरुषबहुमानात् V. 1. 2; आशीर्नमास्क्रियावस्तुनिर्देशो<BR> वापि तन्मुखम् S. D. 6; Ve. 1; Rām. 1. 3. 1.<BR>—7 The pith of a thing.<BR>—8 A plan, design.<BR>—9 (In music) A kind of composition. ━<i>f.</i> Ved. A day (?).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वस्त्वभावः, वस्तूत्थापनम्, वस्तूपमा, वस्तूपहित, वस्तुकृत, वस्तुकोशः, वस्तुक्षणात्, वस्तुजातम्, वस्तुतन्त्र, वस्तुनिर्देशः, वस्तुपतित, वस्तुपुरुषः, वस्तुबलम्, वस्तुभावः, वस्तुभूत, वस्तुमात्रम्, वस्तुरचना, वस्तुविनिमयः, वस्तुविवर्तः, वस्तुवृत्तम्, वस्तुशक्तितस्, वस्तुशासनम्, वस्तुशून्य, वस्तुस्थितिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्वभावः|वस्त्वभाव
वस्तु + -अभावः<BR>—1 absence of reality.<BR>—2 loss of property or possessions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तूत्थापनम्
वस्तु + -उत्थापनम् the production of any incident in a drama by means<BR> of magic, conjuration; see S. D. 420.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तूपमा
वस्तु + -उपमा a variety of Upamā according to Daṇḍin who thus illustrates<BR> it:− राजीवमिव ते वक्त्रं नेत्रे नीलोत्पले इव । इयं प्रतीयमानैकधर्मा<BR> वस्तूपमैव सा ॥ Kāv. 2. 16; (it is a case of Upamā where the साधारणधर्म<BR> or common quality is omitted).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तूपहित
वस्तु + -उपहित <i>a.</i> applied to a proper object, bestowed on a proper<BR> material; क्रिया हि वस्तूपहिता प्रसीदति R. 3. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुकृत
वस्तु + -कृत <i>a.</i> practised, cherished; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुकोशः|वस्तुकोश
वस्तु + -कोशः N. of a dictionary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुक्षणात्
वस्तु + -क्षणात् <i>ind.</i> at the right moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुजातम्
वस्तु + -जातम् the aggregate of things.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुतन्त्र
वस्तु + -तन्त्र <i>a.</i> objective.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुनिर्देशः|वस्तुनिर्देश
वस्तु + -निर्देशः table of contents, register.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुपतित
वस्तु + -पतित <i>a.</i> being real.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुपुरुषः
वस्तु + -पुरुषः the hero (नायक); सद्वस्तुपुरुषबहुमानात् V. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुबलम्
वस्तु + -बलम् the power of things.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुभावः|वस्तुभाव
वस्तु + -भावः reality, truth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुभूत
वस्तु + -भूत <i>a.</i> substantial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुमात्रम्
वस्तु + -मात्रम् the mere outline or skeleton of any subject (to be afterwards developed).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुरचना
वस्तु + -रचना style, arrangement of matter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुविनिमयः|वस्तुविनिमय
वस्तु + -विनिमयः barter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुविवर्तः|वस्तुविवर्त
वस्तु + -विवर्तः (in phil.) the developing of the one real essence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुवृत्तम्
वस्तु + -वृत्तम्<BR>—1 the real matter, fact.<BR>—2 a beautiful creature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुशक्तितस्
वस्तु + -शक्तितस् <i>ind.</i> through the force of circumstances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुशासनम्
वस्तु + -शासनम् a genuine edict.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुशून्य
वस्तु + -शून्य <i>a.</i> unreal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुस्थितिः|वस्तुस्थिति
वस्तु + -स्थितिः reality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुतस्
वस्तुतस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 In fact; in reality, really, actually.<BR>—2 Essentially, virtually, substantially.<BR>—3 As a natural consequence, as a matter of course, indeed.<BR>—4 In fine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्तुकम्
वस्तुकम् Chenopodium Album (Mar. चाकवत, चन्दनबटवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्यम्
वस्त्यम् [= पस्त्यम् q. v.] A house, an abode, a residence; ददर्श<BR> सः क्षितिपस्य वस्त्यमथ तत्र संसदि Śi. 13. 63; वस्त्यम् v. l.<BR> for पस्त्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रम्
वस्त्रम् [वस्-ष्ट्रन् Uṇ. 4. 172]<BR>—1 A garment, cloth, clothes, raiment; स्नातस्यानन्तरं सम्यग् वस्त्रेण<BR> तनुमार्जनम् । कान्तिप्रदं शरीरस्य कण्डूयादोषनाशनम् ॥ कौषेयं चित्रवस्त्रं<BR> च रक्तवस्त्रं तथैव च । वातश्लेष्महरं तत्तु शीतकाले विधारयेत् ॥<BR> मेध्यं सुशीतं पित्तघ्नं काषायं वस्त्रमुच्यते । तद्धारयेदुष्णकाले तच्चापि<BR> लघु शस्यते ॥ शुक्लं तु शुभदं वस्त्रं शीतातपनिवारणम् । न चोष्णं<BR> न च वा शीतं तत्तु वर्षासु धारयेत् ॥<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">Page1404-2</a>]<BR> Bhāva P.<BR>—2 Dress, apparel.<BR>—3 A leaf of the cinnamon tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वस्त्रागारः, वस्त्रागारम्, वस्त्रगृहम्, वस्त्राञ्चलः, वस्त्रान्तः, वस्त्रागारम्, वस्त्राधारकः, वस्त्रोत्कर्षणम्, वस्त्रकुट्टिमम्, वस्त्रग्रन्थिः, वस्त्रघर्घरी, वस्त्रधारणी, वस्त्रधाविन्, वस्त्रनिर्णेजकः, वस्त्रपरिधानम्, वस्त्रपुत्रिका, वस्त्रपूत, वस्त्रपेशी, वस्त्रभेदकः, वस्त्रभेदिन्, वस्त्रयोनिः, वस्त्ररजकम्, वस्त्ररञ्जनम्, वस्त्रविलासः, वस्त्रवेशः, वस्त्रवेश्मन्, वस्त्रवेष्टित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रागारः|वस्त्रागार
वस्त्रम् + -अगारः, -अगारम्, -गृहम् a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रागारम्
वस्त्रम् + -अगारः, -अगारम्, -गृहम् a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रगृहम्
वस्त्रम् + -अगारः, -अगारम्, -गृहम् a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्राञ्चलः|वस्त्राञ्चल|वस्त्रांचल
वस्त्रम् + -अञ्चलः, -अन्तः the hem of a garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रान्तः|वस्त्रान्त
वस्त्रम् + -अञ्चलः, -अन्तः the hem of a garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रागारम्
वस्त्रम् + -आगारम्<BR>—1 a clothierʼs shop.<BR>—2 a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्राधारकः|वस्त्राधारक
वस्त्रम् + -आधारकः a layer of cloth (placed underneath); Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रोत्कर्षणम्
वस्त्रम् + -उत्कर्षणम् the act of taking off clothes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रकुट्टिमम्
वस्त्रम् + -कुट्टिमम्<BR>—1 a tent.<BR>—2 an umbrella.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रग्रन्थिः|वस्त्रग्रन्थि|वस्त्रग्रंथि
वस्त्रम् + -ग्रन्थिः the knot of the lower garment (which fastens it near<BR> the navel); cf. नीवि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रघर्घरी
वस्त्रम् + -घर्घरी a cloth for straining, sieve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रधारणी
वस्त्रम् + -धारणी a thing to hang clothes upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रधाविन्
वस्त्रम् + -धाविन् <i>a.</i> washing clothes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रनिर्णेजकः|वस्त्रनिर्णेजक
वस्त्रम् + -निर्णेजकः a washerman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रपरिधानम्
वस्त्रम् + -परिधानम् putting on garments, dressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रपुत्रिका
वस्त्रम् + -पुत्रिका a doll, puppet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रपूत
वस्त्रम् + -पूत <i>a.</i> filtered through a cloth; वस्त्रपूतं पिबेज्जलम् Ms. 6. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रपेशी
वस्त्रम् + -पेशी a fringe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रभेदकः|वस्त्रभेदक
वस्त्रम् + -भेदकः, -भेदिन् <i>m.</i> a tailor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रभेदिन्
वस्त्रम् + -भेदकः, -भेदिन् <i>m.</i> a tailor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रयोनिः|वस्त्रयोनि
वस्त्रम् + -योनिः the material of cloth (as cotton).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्ररजकम्
वस्त्रम् + -रजकम्, -रञ्जनम् safflower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्ररञ्जनम्
वस्त्रम् + -रजकम्, -रञ्जनम् safflower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रविलासः|वस्त्रविलास
वस्त्रम् + -विलासः foppery in dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रवेशः|वस्त्रवेश
वस्त्रम् + -वेशः, -वेश्मन् a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रवेश्मन्
वस्त्रम् + -वेशः, -वेश्मन् a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रवेष्टित
वस्त्रम् + -वेष्टित <i>a.</i> well-clad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्त्रयति
वस्त्रयति Den. P. To dress or clothe oneself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्थः
वस्थः A house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्था
वस्था = अवस्था q. v.; कुम्भोऽप्येतां पितुरुपनतां वीक्ष्य वस्थां<BR> वपुष्मान् Mv. 6. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्नम्
वस्नम् [वस्-मन् Uṇ. 3. 6]<BR>—1 Hire, wages (in this sense <i>m.</i> also).<BR>—2 Dwelling, abiding.<BR>—3 Wealth, substance.<BR>—4 A cloth, clothes.<BR>—5 A skin.<BR>—6 Price.<BR>—7 Death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्ननम्
वस्ननम् A girdle, zone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्नसा
वस्नसा A tendon, nerve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्निक
वस्निक <i>a.</i> Mercenary, hireling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्निका
वस्निक + .{@-का@} A valuable deposit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्मन्
वस्मन् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 A garment.<BR>—2 An abode.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वस्यस्
वस्यस्<BR>—1 Better.<BR>—2 Wealthier, richer; श्रेयान् वस्यसोऽसानि स्वाहा T. Up. 1. 4. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वंह्
वंह् €10 U. (वंहयति-ते) To make bright, illuminate, cause to shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वह्
वह् €1 U. (वहति-ते, उवाह, ऊहे, अवाक्षीत्, अवोढ, वक्ष्यति-ते, वोढुम्,<BR> ऊढ; <i>pass.</i> उह्यते)<BR>—1 To carry, lead, bear, convey, transport (oft. with two acc.); अजां<BR> ग्रामं वहति; वहति विधिहुतं या हविः Ś. 1. 1; न च हव्यं वहत्यग्निः Ms. 4. 249.<BR>—2 To bear along, cause to move onward, waft, propel; जलनि या तीरनिखातयूपा<BR> वहत्ययोध्यामनु राजधानीम् R. 13. 61; त्रिस्रोतसं वहति यो गननप्रतिष्ठाम्<BR> Ś. 7. 6; R. 11. 10.<BR>—3 To fetch, bring; वहति जलमियम् Mu. 1. 4.<BR>—4 To bear, support, hold up, sustain; न गर्दभा वाजिधुरं वहन्ति<BR> Mk. 4. 17; ताते चापद्वितीये वहति रणधुरां को भयस्यावकाशः Ve. 3. 5<BR> ‘when my father is leading the van &c.’; वहति भुवनश्रेणीं शेषः<BR> फणाफलकस्थिताम् Bh. 2. 35; Ś. 7. 17; Me. 17.<BR>—5 To carry off; take away; अद्रेः शृङ्गं वहति (v. l. for हरति)<BR> पवनः किंस्विद् Me. 14.<BR>—6 To marry; यदूढया वारणराजहार्यया Ku. 5. 70; Ms. 3. 38.<BR>—7 To have, possess, bear; वहसि हि<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">Page1405-1</a>]<BR> धनहार्यं पण्यभूतं शरीरम् Mk. 1. 31; वहति विषधरान् पटीरजन्मा Bv. 1. 74.<BR>—8 To assume, exhibit, show; लक्ष्मीमुवाह सकलस्य शशाङ्कमूर्तेः<BR> Ki. 2. 59, 9. 2.<BR>—9 To look to, attend to, take care of; मुग्धाया मे जनन्या योगक्षेमं<BR> वहस्व M. 4; तेषां नित्याभियुक्तानां योगक्षेमं वहाम्यहम् Bg. 9. 22.<BR>—10 To suffer, feel, experience; घर्मव्यथां वहति शीतभवां रुजं<BR> च Bv. 1. 94; so दुःखं, हर्षं, शोकं, तोषं &c.<BR>—11 (Intransitive in this and the following senses) To be borne or carried<BR> on, move or walk on; वहतं बलीवर्दौ वहतम् Mk. 6; उत्थाय पुनरवहत्<BR> K.; Pt. 1. 43, 291.<BR>—12 To flow (as rivers); प्रत्यगूहुर्महानद्यः Mb.; परोपकाराय<BR> वहन्ति नद्यः Subhāṣ.<BR>—13 To blow (as wind); मन्दं वहति मारुतः Rām.; वहति मलयसमीरे<BR> मदनमुपनिधाय Gīt. 5.<BR>—15 To breathe. ━<i>Caus.</i> (वाहयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to bear or carry, cause to be brought or led.<BR>—2 To drive, impel, direct.<BR>—3 To traverse, pass or go over; स वाह्यते राजपथः शिवाभिः R. 16. 12;<BR> भवान् वाहयेदध्वशेषम् Me. 40.<BR>—4 To use, carry; असींश्च वाहयांचक्रुः Bk. 14. 23.<BR>—5 To place in a boat.<BR>—6 To proceed, go.<BR>—7 To carry out, complete, finish.<BR>—8 To go to, visit. ━<i>Desid.</i> (विवक्षति-ते) To wish to carry &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1404-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढ|ऊढः
ऊढ <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Borne, carried, as a burden.<BR>—2 Taken<BR>—3 Married; इयं च तेऽन्या पुरतो विडम्बना यदूढया वारणराजहार्यया Ku. 5. 70.<BR>—4 Stolen, robbed; सहोढं सोपकरणं घातयेदविचारयन् Ms. 9. 270.<BR>—5 Washed away (by water); चौरैर्हृतं जलेनोढम् Ms. 8. 189.<BR>—6 Exhibited, betrayed; Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढः|ऊढ
ऊढ + .{@-ढः@} A married man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढा
ऊढ + .{@-ढा@} A girl who is married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढम्
ऊढ + .{@-ढम्@} marriage; ऊढात् प्रभृति दुःखानि श्वशुराणामरिन्दम Mb. 5. 83. 42.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ऊढकङ्कट, ऊढभार्य, ऊढवयसः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढकङ्कट|ऊढकंकट|ऊढकङ्कटः
ऊढ + -कङ्कट <i>a.</i> mailed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढभार्य
ऊढ + -भार्य <i>a.</i> one who has married a wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढवयसः
ऊढ + -वयसः a young man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ऊढिः|ऊढि
ऊढिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Marriage.<BR>—2 Carrying, bearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहः|वह
वहः [वह्-कर्तरि अच्]<BR>—1 Bearing, carrying, supporting &c.<BR>—2 The shoulder of an ox.<BR>—3 A vehicle or conveyance in general.<BR>—4 Particularly, a horse; दर्शनस्पर्शनवहो घ्राणश्रवणवाहनः<BR> Mb. 12. 236. 10.<BR>—5 Air, wind.<BR>—6 A way, road.<BR>—7 A male river (नद).<BR>—8 A measure of four <i>Droṇas</i>.<BR>—9 A current, stream.<BR>—10 The breathing of a cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहा
वहः + .{@-हा@} a river, stream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहतः|वहत
वहतः [वह्-अतच्]<BR>—1 A traveller.<BR>—2 An ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहतिः|वहति
वहतिः [वह्-अतिः Uṇ. 4. 62]<BR>—1 An ox.<BR>—2 Air, wind.<BR>—3 A friend, counsellor, adviser.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहती
वहती A river, stream in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहतुः|वहतु
वहतुः<BR>—1 An ox.<BR>—2 Ved. A traveller.<BR>—3 A marriage (Ved.).<BR>—4 A brideʼs dowry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहनम्
वहनम् [वह्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Carrying, bearing, conveying.<BR>—2 Supporting.<BR>—3 Flowing.<BR>—4 A vehicle, conveyance.<BR>—5 A boat, raft.<BR>—6 The undermost part of a column.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वहनभङ्गः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहनभङ्गः|वहनभङ्ग
वहनम् + -भङ्गः shipwreck; Ratn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहनीकृ
वहनीकृ To turn into a vehicle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहित|वहितः
वहित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Carried, conveyed.<BR>—2 Known, celebrated.<BR>—3 Obtained, got.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहन्तः|वहन्त|वहंत|वहंतः
वहन्तः [वह्-झच् Uṇ. 3. 128]<BR>—1 Wind.<BR>—2 An infant.<BR>—3 A chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहल|वहलः
वहल <i>a.</i> See बहल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहलः|वहल
वहल + .{@-लः@} A raft, boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

