वहेटकः
वहेटकः, वहेडुकः, वहैडुकः<BR> The Bibhītaka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहेडुकः|वहेडुक
वहेटकः, वहेडुकः, वहैडुकः<BR> The Bibhītaka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वहैडुकः
वहेटकः, वहेडुकः, वहैडुकः<BR> The Bibhītaka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वह्निः|वह्नि
वह्निः [वह्-निः Uṇ. 4. 53]<BR>—1 Fire; अतृणे पतितो वह्निः स्वयमेवोपशाम्यति Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 The digestive faculty, gastric fluid.<BR>—3 Digestion, appetite.<BR>—4 A vehicle.<BR>—5 The marking-nut plant.<BR>—6 Lead-wort.<BR>—7 A sacrificer, priest.<BR>—8 A god in general.<BR>—9 An epithet of the Maruts.<BR>—10 Of Soma.<BR>—11 A horse.<BR>—12 A draught animal.<BR>—13 The number ‘three’.<BR>—14 The mystical N. of the letter र्; रकार.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वह्न्युत्पातः, वह्निकर, वह्निकरी, वह्निकाष्ठम्, वह्निकोणः, वह्निकोपः, वह्निगन्धः, वह्निगर्भः, वह्निदीपकः, वह्निधौत, वह्निनामन्, वह्निपतनम्, वह्निबीजम्, वह्निभोग्यम्, वह्निमन्थः, वह्निमन्थनः, वह्निमारकम्, वह्निमित्रः, वह्निरेतस्, वह्निलोह, वह्निलोहक, वह्निवधू, वह्निवर्णम्, वह्निवल्लभः, वह्निवीजम्, वह्निशिखम्, वह्निशेखरम्, वह्निसंस्कारः, वह्निसखः, वह्निसंज्ञकः, वह्निसाक्षिकम्, वह्निसुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वह्न्युत्पातः|वह्न्युत्पात
वह्निः + -उत्पातः an igneous meteor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वह्निकर
वह्निः + -कर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 igniting.<BR>—2 stimulating digestion, stomachic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

