वह्निकाष्ठम्
वह्निः + -काष्ठम् a kind of agallochum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वह्निकोणः|वह्निकोण
वह्निः + -कोणः the south-east quarter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वह्निकोपः|वह्निकोप
वह्निः + -कोपः a conflagration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वह्निगन्धः|वह्निगन्ध|वह्निगंध
वह्निः + -गन्धः<BR>—1 incense.<BR>—2 resin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वह्निगर्भः|वह्निगर्भ
वह्निः + -गर्भः<BR>—1 a bamboo.<BR>—2 the Śamī tree; cf. अग्निगर्भ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1405-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

