वाततूलम्
वात + -तूलम् cottony seeds floating in the air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातथुडा
वात + -थुडा (also वातखुडा, वातहुडा)<BR>—1 a high wind.<BR>—2 acute gout.<BR>—3 a kind of smallpox.<BR>—4 a lovely woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

