वात + -प्रमी <i>m., f.</i> a swift antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातप्रमेहः|वातप्रमेह
वात + -प्रमेहः a kind of urinary disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातप्रवाहिका
वात + -प्रवाहिका a kind of अतिसार disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

