वातरथः|वातरथ
वात + -रथः a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातरूषः|वातरूष
वात + -रूषः<BR>—1 a storm, violent wind, tempest.<BR>—2 the rainbow.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">Page1411-2</a>]<BR>—3 a bribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातरेचकः|वातरेचक
वात + -रेचकः<BR>—1 a gust of wind.<BR>—2 a braggart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातरोगः|वातरोग
