वातवस्तिः|वातवस्ति
वात + -वस्तिः <i>f.</i> suppression of urine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातवृद्धिः|वातवृद्धि
वात + -वृद्धिः <i>f.</i> swelled testicle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातवैरिन्
