वातस्कन्धः|वातस्कन्ध
वात + -स्कन्धः the quarter from which the wind blows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातंधम
