वातकः|वातक
वातकः<BR>—1 A paramour (जार).<BR>—2 N. of a plant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वातकपिण्डकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातकपिण्डकः|वातकपिण्डक
वातकः + -पिण्डकः an impotent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातकिन्
वातकिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Gouty; जिन त्वदाज्ञामवमन्यते यः स वातकी नाथ<BR> पिशाचकी वा Mahāvīrswāmistotra; धुवञ्शिरो जरावातकी N. 18. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातमजः|वातमज
वातमजः A swift antelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातयति
वातयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To blow gently, fan.<BR>—2 To serve.<BR>—3 To make happy.<BR>—4 To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातर
वातर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Stormy, windy.<BR>—2 Swift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातरायणः|वातरायण
वातरायणः<BR>—1 An arrow.<BR>—2 An arrowʼs flight, bowshot.<BR>—3 A peak, summit.<BR>—4 A saw.<BR>—5 A mad or intoxicated man.<BR>—6 An idler.<BR>—7 The Sarala or pine tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातल|वातलः
वातल <i>a.</i> (-ली <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वातं रोगभेदं लाति ला-क]<BR>—1 Stormy, windy.<BR>—2 Flatulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातलः|वातल
वातल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 Wind.<BR>—2 The chick-pea (चणक).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वातलमण्डली, वातलयोनिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातलमण्डली
वातल + -मण्डली A whirl-wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातलयोनिः
वातल + -योनिः (वातलायोनिः) a morbid state of the uterus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातापिः|वातापि
वातापिः N. of a demon said to have been eaten up and digested by Agastya.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वातापिद्विष्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातापिद्विष्
वातापिः + -द्विष् <i>m.</i>, {@-सूदनः, -हन्@} <i>m.</i><BR> epithets of Agastya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातायमान
वातायमान <i>a.</i> Running like wind; वातायमानैस्तैरश्वैर्नीतो वृष्णिशरार्दितैः<BR> Mb. 7. 117. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातासह|वातासहः
वातासह <i>a.</i> Rheumatic, gouty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातिः|वाति
वातिः [वा-क्तिच्]<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 Wind, air.<BR>—3 The moon.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वातिगः, वातिगमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातिगः|वातिग
वातिः + -गः, -गमः<BR>—1 a mineralogist.<BR>—2 the egg-plant; (वातिंगणः in the same sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातिगमः|वातिगम
वातिः + -गः, -गमः<BR>—1 a mineralogist.<BR>—2 the egg-plant; (वातिंगणः in the same sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातिक|वातिकः
वातिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वातादागतः ठक्]<BR>—1 Stormy, windy.<BR>—2 Gouty, rheumatic.<BR>—3 Mad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातिकः|वातिक
वातिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 Fever caused by a vitiated state of the wind.<BR>—2 A person affected by flatulence.<BR>—3 A flatterer; एवं तत्राब्रुवन् केचिद्वातिकास्तं जनेश्वरम् Mb. 3. 257. 4.<BR>—4 A class of deities (देवयोनिविशेष); वातिकाश्चारणा ये तु दृष्ट्वा ते<BR> हर्षमागताः Mb. 9. 55. 14 (com. वातिकाः वातेन सह गच्छन्ति आकाशचारिणः).<BR>—5 A juggler.<BR>—6 A dealer in antidotes.<BR>—7 The Chātaka bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातीय|वातीयं
वातीय <i>a.</i> Windy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातीयम्
वातीय + .{@-यम्@} Rice-gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातुल|वातुलः
वातुल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Affected by wind-disease, gouty.<BR>—2 Mad, crazy-headed; मौनान्मूर्खः प्रवचनपटुर्वातुलो जल्पको वा<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">Page1412-1</a>]<BR> H. 2. 26.<BR>—3 Babbler; see द्वादशपञ्जरिकास्तोत्रम् 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातुलः|वातुल
वातुल + .{@-लः@} A whirl-wind. See वातलः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1411-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातुलिः|वातुलि
वातुलिः A large bat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातूल|वातूलः
वातूल <i>a.</i> See वातुल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातूलीभ्रमः|वातूलीभ्रम
वातूली-भ्रमः<BR> A whirl-wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वातृ
वातृ <i>m.</i> Air, wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वात्या
वात्या [वातानां समूहः यत्] A storm, hurricane, whirlwind, stormy<BR> or tempestuous wind; वात्याभिः परुषीकृता दश दिशश्चण्डातपो दुःसहः<BR> Bv. 1. 31; R. 11. 16; Ki. 5. 39; Ve. 2. 21; Māl. 5. 6, 10. 3; (वात्याचक्रम्<BR> in the same sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वात्सकम्
वात्सकम् A herd of calves; P. IV. 2. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वात्सल्यम्
वात्सल्यम् [वत्सलस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Affection (towards oneʼs offspring), affection or tenderness in general;<BR> न पुत्रवात्सल्यमपाकरिष्यति Ku. 5. 14; पतिवात्सल्यात् R. 15. 98;<BR> so भार्या˚, प्रजा˚, शरणागत˚, etc.<BR>—2 Fond affection or partiality.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वात्सल्यबन्धिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वात्सल्यबन्धिन्
वात्सल्यम् + -बन्धिन् <i>a.</i> displaying affection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वात्सशाल
वात्सशाल <i>a.</i> Born in a cow-shed; P. IV. 3. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वात्सिः|वात्सि
वात्सिः, -त्सी <i>f.</i><BR> The daughter of a Śūdra woman by a Brāhmaṇa.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वात्सिपुत्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वात्सी
वात्सिः, -त्सी <i>f.</i><BR> The daughter of a Śūdra woman by a Brāhmaṇa.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वात्सिपुत्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वात्सिपुत्रः
वात्सिः + -पुत्रः a barber; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वात्स्यायनः|वात्स्यायन
वात्स्यायनः<BR>—1 N. of the author of the Kāmasūtras (a work on erotic subjects).<BR>—2 N. of the author of a commentary on the Nyāya Sūtras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादः|वाद
वादः [वद्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Talking, speaking.<BR>—2 Speech, words, talk; वेदवादररताः पार्थ नान्यदस्तीति वादिनः<BR> Bg. 2. 42; सामवादाः सकोपस्य तस्य प्रत्युत दीपकाः Śi. 2. 55;<BR> so कैतववादः Gīt. 8; सान्त्ववादः &c.<BR>—3 A statement, an assertion, allegation; अवाच्यवादांश्च बहून् वदिष्यन्ति<BR> तबाहिताः Bg. 2. 36.<BR>—4 Narration, account; शाकुन्तलादीनितिहासवादान् Māl. 3. 3.<BR>—5 Discussion, dispute, controversy; वादयुद्धप्रधानाश्च मध्यमा राजसी<BR> गतिः Ms. 12. 46; वादे वादे जायते तत्त्वबोधः Sūbhāṣ; सीमा˚.<BR>—6 A reply.<BR>—7 An exposition, explanation; अध्यात्मविद्या विद्यानां वादः प्रवदतामहम् Bg. 10. 32.<BR>—8 A demonstrated conclusion, theory, doctrine; इदानीं परमाणुकारणवादं<BR> निराकरोति Ś. B. (and in diverse other places of the work); परिणामवाद<BR> ‘the theory of evolution’; so नास्तिक˚.<BR>—9 Sounding, sound.<BR>—10 Report, rumour.<BR>—11 A plaint (in law).<BR>—12 Advice, counsel.<BR>—13 Agreement.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वादानुवादौ, वादकर, वादकृत्, वादकर्तृ, वादग्रस्त, वादचञ्चु, वादद, वादनक्षत्रमाला, वादप्रतिवादः, वादयुद्धम्, वादरत, वादवादिन्, वादविवादः, वादसाधनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादानुवादौ
वादः + -अनुवादौ (<i>m.</i> du.)<BR>—1 assertion and reply, plaint and reply, accusation and defence.<BR>—2 dispute, controversy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादकर
वादः + -कर, -कृत् <i>a.</i> causing a dispute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादकृत्
वादः + -कर, -कृत् <i>a.</i> causing a dispute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादकर्तृ
वादः + -कर्तृ a player on a musical instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादग्रस्त
वादः + -ग्रस्त <i>a.</i> disputed, in dispute; वादग्रस्तोऽयं विषयः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादचञ्चु|वादचंचु
वादः + -चञ्चु <i>a.</i> clever in repartees or witty replies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादद
वादः + -द <i>a.</i> emulating, vying with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादनक्षत्रमाला
वादः + -नक्षत्रमाला ({@मालिका@}) a defence of the Vedānta against<BR> the Mīmāṃsā doctrine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादप्रतिवादः|वादप्रतिवाद
वादः + -प्रतिवादः controversy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादयुद्धम्
वादः + -युद्धम् a dispute, controversy; Ms. 12. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादरत
वादः + -रत <i>a.</i> disputatious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादवादिन्
वादः + -वादिन् <i>m.</i> a Jaina.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादविवादः|वादविवाद
वादः + -विवादः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">Page1412-2</a>]<BR> disputation, discussion, debate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादसाधनम्
वादः + -साधनम् establishing an assertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादकः|वादक
वादकः<BR>—1 A musician; वादयामासुरव्यग्रा वादका राजशासनात् Mb. 5. 156. 27.<BR>—2 A speaker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादनम्
वादनम् [वद्-णिच् कर्मणि ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Sounding.<BR>—2 Instrumental music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादनः|वादन|वादनं
वादनम् + .{@-नः@} A player on a musical instrument; गायनैश्च विराविण्यो वादनैश्च<BR> तथापरैः विरेजुर्विपुलास्तत्र Rām. 1. 18. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादनीयः|वादनीय
वादनीयः A sounding reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादि|वादिः
वादि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wise, learned, skilful.<BR>—2 Speaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादिक|वादिकः
वादिक <i>a.</i> Talking, asserting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादिकः|वादिक
वादिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A magician.<BR>—2 A bard; प्रहीयमानः प्रवरैश्च वादिकैरभिष्टुतो वैश्रवणो यथा ययौ<BR> Rām. 2. 16. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादित
वादित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Caused to be uttered, made to speak.<BR>—2 Played, sounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादितम्
वादित + .{@-तम्@} An instrumental music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादित्रम्
वादित्रम् [वद् णित्रन् Uṇ. 4. 179]<BR>—1 A musical instrument; वादित्रशक्तिर्घटते भटस्य N. 22. 22.<BR>—2 Instrumental music; काण्डवीणादिभिर्वादित्रमुपगानं भवति, भवति<BR> च तन्त्रीगाने गानशब्दः । तस्माद् वादित्रमुपगानम् ŚB. on MS. 10. 4. 9.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वादित्रगणः, वादित्रलगुडः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादित्रगणः|वादित्रगण
वादित्रम् + -गणः a band of music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादित्रलगुडः|वादित्रलगुड
वादित्रम् + -लगुडः a drum stick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादिन्
वादिन् <i>a.</i> [वद्-णिनि]<BR>—1 Speaking, talking, discoursing.<BR>—2 Asserting.<BR>—3 Disputing.<BR>—4 Designating, designated as; यत्र यत्र वनोद्देशे सत्त्वाः पुरुषवादिनः ।<BR> वृक्षाः पुरुषनामानस्ते सर्वे स्त्रीजनाभवन् ॥ Rām. 7. 87. 13.<BR>—5 Talking pleasantly; Rām. 2. 36. 3 (com. वादिन्यः परचित्ताकर्षकवचनचतुराः). ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A speaker.<BR>—2 A disputant, an antagonist; तस्याङ्गीकरणेन वादिन इव स्यात् स्वामिनो<BR> निग्रहः Mu. 5. 10; R. 12. 92.<BR>—3 An accuser, a plaintiff.<BR>—4 An expounder, a teacher.<BR>—5 (In music) The leading or key-note.<BR>—6 An alchemist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वादिशः|वादिश
वादिशः A learned man, sage, scholar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाद्यम्
वाद्यम् [वद्-णिच् यत्]<BR>—1 A musical instrument; ततं वाद्यं तु देवानां गन्धर्वाणां च शौषिरम् ।<BR> आनद्धं राक्षसानां तु किंनराणां घनं विदुः ॥ Saṅgītadāmodara.<BR>—2 The sound of a musical instrument; श्रोत्रेषु संमूर्च्छति रक्तमासां<BR> गीतानुगं वारिमृदङ्गवाद्यम् R. 16. 64 (वाद्यध्वनिः Malli.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1412-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाद्यः|वाद्य|वाद्यं
