वानम्
वान + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Dry or dried fruit (<i>m.</i> also).<BR>—2 Blowing.<BR>—3 Living.<BR>—4 Rolling, moving, (as of waters &c.).<BR>—5 A perfume, fragrance.<BR>—6 A number of groves or thickets.<BR>—7 Weaving.<BR>—8 A mat of straw.<BR>—9 A hole in the wall of a house.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वानचित्रम्, वानदण्डः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1413-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

