वायकः|वायक
वायकः<BR>—1 A weaver; धर्मराजपुरुषा वायका इव सर्वतोऽङ्गेषु सूत्रैः परिवयन्ति<BR> Bhāg. 5. 26. 36.<BR>—2 A heap, multitude, collection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1414-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायनम्
वायनम्, -वायनकम्<BR>—1 A present of sweetmeats made to a deity, particularly to a Brāhmaṇa,<BR> on festive occasions; observance of fasts &c.<BR>—2 A kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1414-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायनकम्
वायनम्, -वायनकम्<BR>—1 A present of sweetmeats made to a deity, particularly to a Brāhmaṇa,<BR> on festive occasions; observance of fasts &c.<BR>—2 A kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1414-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायव
वायव <i>a.</i>^1 .<BR>—1 Relating to or given by the wind or Vāyu.<BR>—2 Aerial.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174. note: content of 28989.001 (vAyavI) merged into vAyava.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1414-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायवी
वायव <i>a.</i>^1 .<BR>—1 Relating to or given by the wind or Vāyu.<BR>—2 Aerial.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174. note: content of 28989.001 (vAyavI) merged into vAyava.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1414-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायवी
