वायसः|वायस
वायसः [वयोऽसच् णित् Uṇ. 3. 118]<BR>—1 A crow; बलिमिव परिभोक्तुं वायसास्तर्कयन्ति Mk. 10. 3.<BR>—2 Fragrant aloe-wood, agallochum.<BR>—3 Turpentine. —4 A house facing the north-east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायसम्
वायसः + .{@-सम्@} a multitude of crows.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वायसारातिः, वायसारिः, वायसाह्वा, वायसेक्षुः, वायसविद्या<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायसारातिः|वायसाराति
वायसः + -अरातिः, -अरिः an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायसारिः|वायसारि
वायसः + -अरातिः, -अरिः an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वायसाह्वा
वायसः + -आह्वा A kind of esculent vegetable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

