वार् + -स्थ <i>a.</i> (वाःस्थ) being in water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारः|वार|वारं
वारः [वृ-घञ्]<BR>—1 That which covers, a cover.<BR>—2 A multitude, large number; as in वारयुवति; ते स्ववारं समास्थाय<BR> वर्त्मकर्मणि कोविदाः Rām. 2. 80. 5.<BR>—3 A heap, quantity.<BR>—4 A herd, flock; वारी वारैः सस्मरे वारणानाम् Śi. 18. 56.<BR>—5 A day of the week; as in बुधवार, शनिवार.<BR>—6 Time, turn; शशकस्य वारः समायातः Pt. 1; अप्सरावारपर्यायेण<BR> V. 5; R. 19. 18; often used in pl. like the English ‘times’; बहुवारान्<BR> ‘many times’, कतिवारान् ‘how many times’.<BR>—7 An occasion, opportunity.<BR>—8 A door, gate.<BR>—9 The opposite bank of a river.<BR>—10 N. of Śiva.<BR>—11 Ved. A tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारम्
वारः + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 A vessel for holding spirituous liquor.<BR>—2 A mass of water (जलसंघ).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वाराङ्गना, वारनारी, वारयुवति, वारकीरः, वारबुषा, वारबूषा, वारमुख्या, वारबाणः, वारवाणः, वारवाणम्, वारयोगः, वारवाणिः, वारवाणी, वारवृषा, वारवेला, वारसेवा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाराङ्गना|वारांगना
वारः + -अङ्गना, -नारी, -युवति <i>f.</i>, {@योषित्@} <i>f.</i>, {@-वधू, -वनिता, -विलासिनी, -सुन्दरी, -स्त्री@}<BR> ‘a woman of the multitude’,<BR> a common woman, harlot, courtezan, prostitute; Ratn. 1. 26; Ś. Til. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारनारी
वारः + -अङ्गना, -नारी, -युवति <i>f.</i>, {@योषित्@} <i>f.</i>, {@-वधू, -वनिता, -विलासिनी, -सुन्दरी, -स्त्री@}<BR> ‘a woman of the multitude’,<BR> a common woman, harlot, courtezan, prostitute; Ratn. 1. 26; Ś. Til. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारयुवति
वारः + -अङ्गना, -नारी, -युवति <i>f.</i>, {@योषित्@} <i>f.</i>, {@-वधू, -वनिता, -विलासिनी, -सुन्दरी, -स्त्री@}<BR> ‘a woman of the multitude’,<BR> a common woman, harlot, courtezan, prostitute; Ratn. 1. 26; Ś. Til. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारकीरः|वारकीर
वारः + -कीरः<BR>—1 a wifeʼs brother (according to Trik., Med. spells with ब).<BR>—2 the submarine fire.<BR>—3 a hair-dresser or comb.<BR>—4 a louse.<BR>—5 a courser.<BR>—6 a carrier, porter; (these meanings are given in Med.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारबुषा
वारः + -बुषा, -बूषा the plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारबूषा
वारः + -बुषा, -बूषा the plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारमुख्या
वारः + -मुख्या the chief of a number of harlots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारबाणः|वारबाण
वारः + -बाणः, -वाणः, -वाणम्<BR>—1 Armour, a coat of mail; अगमत् कैतकं रजः । तद्योधवास्वाणानामयत्नपटवासताम्<BR> R. 4. 55; Śi. 15. 118; धुन्वाना जगृहुर्बाणान् वारबाणविदारणान् Parṇāl. 5. 68.<BR>—2 a variety of blanket; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारवाणः|वारवाण
वारः + -बाणः, -वाणः, -वाणम्<BR>—1 Armour, a coat of mail; अगमत् कैतकं रजः । तद्योधवास्वाणानामयत्नपटवासताम्<BR> R. 4. 55; Śi. 15. 118; धुन्वाना जगृहुर्बाणान् वारबाणविदारणान् Parṇāl. 5. 68.<BR>—2 a variety of blanket; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारवाणम्
वारः + -बाणः, -वाणः, -वाणम्<BR>—1 Armour, a coat of mail; अगमत् कैतकं रजः । तद्योधवास्वाणानामयत्नपटवासताम्<BR> R. 4. 55; Śi. 15. 118; धुन्वाना जगृहुर्बाणान् वारबाणविदारणान् Parṇāl. 5. 68.<BR>—2 a variety of blanket; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारयोगः|वारयोग
वारः + -योगः powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारवाणिः|वारवाणि
वारः + -वाणिः<BR>—1 a piper, player on a flute.<BR>—2 a musician.<BR>—3 a year.<BR>—4 a judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारवाणिः|वारवाणि
वारः + -वाणिः + .({@-णिः@} <i>f.</i>) a harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारवाणी
वारः + -वाणी a harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारवृषा
वारः + -वृषा<BR>—1 corn.<BR>—2 the plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारवेला
वारः + -वेला a time or period of the day when no act is performed; कृतमुनियमशरमङ्गलरामर्तुषु<BR> भास्करादियामार्धे । प्रभवति हि वारवेला न शुभा शुभकार्यचरणाय ॥ Jyotistattvam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारसेवा
वारः + -सेवा<BR>—1 harlotry, prostitution.<BR>—2 a number of harlots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारक|वारकं|वारकः
वारक <i>a.</i> [वृ-णिच् ण्वुल्] Obstructing, opposing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारकः|वारक|वारकं
वारक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A kind of horse.<BR>—2 A horse in general.<BR>—3 One of the paces of a horse.<BR>—4 A kind of vessel; Hc.<BR>—5 A personʼs turn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारकम्
वारक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 The seat of pain.<BR>—2 A kind of perfume (बाल or ह्रीबेर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारकिन्
वारकिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 An opposer, enemy.<BR>—2 The ocean.<BR>—3 A kind of horse, one with good marks.<BR>—4 An ascetic living on leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारङ्कः|वारङ्क|वारंक|वारंकः
वारङ्कः A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1415-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारङ्गः|वारङ्ग|वारंग|वारंगः
वारङ्गः [वॄ-अङ्गच् णित् Uṇ. 1. 114]<BR>—1 The handle of a sword, knife &c.<BR>—2 The narrow end to which the handle is fastened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारटम्
वारटम्<BR>—1 A field.<BR>—2 A number of fields.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारटा
वारटम् + .{@-टा@} A goose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारण|वारणं|वारणः
वारण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वृ-ल्यु ल्युट् वा] Warding off, resisting, opposing;<BR> मत्तवारणताम्राक्षो मत्तवारणवारणः Mb. 3. 146. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणम्
वारण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Warding off, restraining, obstructing; न भवति बिसतन्तुर्वारणं<BR> वारणानाम् Bh. 2. 17.<BR>—2 An obstacle, impediment.<BR>—3 Resistance, opposition; अलं युद्धेन राजेन्द्र सुहृदां शृणु वारणम्<BR> Mb. 5. 138. 20.<BR>—4 A door, gate (कवाट); बिडालोलूकचरितामालीननरवारणाम् । तिमिराभ्याहतां<BR> कालीमप्रकाशां निशामिव ॥ Rām. 2. 114. 2.<BR>—5 Defending, guarding, protecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणः|वारण|वारणं
वारण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 An elephant; न भवति बिसन्ततुर्वारणं वारणानाम् Bh. 2. 17; Ku. 5. 70;<BR> R. 12. 93; वारी वारैः सस्मरे वारणानाम् Śi. 18. 56.<BR>—2 An armour, mail-coat.<BR>—3 The trunk of an elephant; बाहूत्तमैर्वारणवारणाभैर्निवारयन्तौ परवारणाभौ<BR> Rām. 6. 40. 21.<BR>—4 An elephant-hook; निशितेन वारणेन वारणं मुहुर्मुहुरभिघ्नन् Dk. 2. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वारणकृच्छ्रः, वारणकेसरः, वारणपुष्पः, वारणबुषा, वारणबुसा, वारणवल्लभा, वारणसाह्वयम्, वारणहस्तः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणकृच्छ्रः|वारणकृच्छ्र
वारण + -कृच्छ्रः a penance consisting in drinking only rice-water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणकेसरः|वारणकेसर
वारण + -केसरः see नागकेसर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणपुष्पः|वारणपुष्प
वारण + -पुष्पः a species of plant; श्यामान् वारणपुष्पांश्च तथाऽष्टपदिका<BR> लताः Mb. 13. 54. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणबुषा
वारण + -बुषा, -बुसा, -वल्लभा the plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणबुसा
वारण + -बुषा, -बुसा, -वल्लभा the plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणवल्लभा
वारण + -बुषा, -बुसा, -वल्लभा the plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणसाह्वयम्
वारण + -साह्वयम् N. of Hastināpura.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणहस्तः|वारणहस्त
वारण + -हस्तः a particular stringed instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1416-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वारणसी
