वासवेश्मन्
वासः + -अगारः, -आगारः, -आगारम्, -गृहम्, -वेश्मन् <i>n.</i> the inner apartments<BR> of a house; particularly bed-chamber; धर्मासनाद्विशति वासगृहं नरेन्द्रः<BR> U. 1. 7; समयः खलु ते वासगृहप्रवेशस्य V. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासकर्णी
वासः + -कर्णी<BR>—1 a hall where public exhibitions (such as dancing, wrestling matches &c.) are held.<BR>—2 a sacrificial hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासगृहम्
वासः + -गृहम्<BR>—1 the inner part of a house.<BR>—2 bed-chamber; धर्मासनाद्विशति वासगृहं नरेन्द्रः U. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासताम्बूलम्
वासः + -ताम्बूलम् betel mixed with other fragrant spices; वासताम्बूलवीटिकां …<BR> उपयुज्य Dk. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासपर्ययः|वासपर्यय
वासः + -पर्ययः a change of residence; नोत्सीदेम महाराज क्रियतां<BR> वासपर्ययः Mb. 3. 258. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासप्रासादः|वासप्रासाद
वासः + -प्रासादः a palace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासभवनम्
वासः + -भवनम्, -मन्दिरम्, -सदनम् a dwelling-place, house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासमन्दिरम्
वासः + -भवनम्, -मन्दिरम्, -सदनम् a dwelling-place, house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाससदनम्
वासः + -भवनम्, -मन्दिरम्, -सदनम् a dwelling-place, house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासयष्टिः|वासयष्टि
वासः + -यष्टिः <i>f.</i> a roosting perch, a rod for a bird to perch on;<BR> उत्कीर्णा इव वासयष्टिषु निशानिद्रालसा बर्हिणः V. 3. 2; Me. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासयोगः|वासयोग
वासः + -योगः a kind of fragrant powder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाससज्जा
वासः + -सज्जा = वासकसज्जा q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासक|वासकः
वासक <i>a.</i> (-का or -सिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वास्-वस्-णिच् वा ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Scenting, perfuming, infusing, fumigating &c.<BR>—2 Causing to dwell, populating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासकः|वासक
वासक + .{@-कः@} Scent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासका
वासक + .{@-का@} (also वासिका)<BR>—1 An abode, habitation.<BR>—2 A bed-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासकम्
वासक + .{@-कम्@} Clothes.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वासकसज्जा, वासकसज्जिका<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासकसज्जा
वासक + -सज्जा, -सज्जिका a woman who dresses herself in all her ornaments<BR> and keeps herself (and her house) ready to receive her lover, especially<BR> when he has made an appointment with her; an expectant heroine, one of<BR> the several classes of a Nāyikā; S. D. thus defines her:− कुरुते<BR> मण्डनं यस्याः (या तु) सज्जिते वासवेश्मनि । सा तु वासकसज्जा स्याद्विदितप्रियसंगमा ॥ 120;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">Page1420-1</a>]<BR> भवति विलम्बिनि विगलितलज्जा विलपति रोदिति वासकसज्जा Gīt. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासकसज्जिका
वासक + -सज्जा, -सज्जिका a woman who dresses herself in all her ornaments<BR> and keeps herself (and her house) ready to receive her lover, especially<BR> when he has made an appointment with her; an expectant heroine, one of<BR> the several classes of a Nāyikā; S. D. thus defines her:− कुरुते<BR> मण्डनं यस्याः (या तु) सज्जिते वासवेश्मनि । सा तु वासकसज्जा स्याद्विदितप्रियसंगमा ॥ 120;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">Page1420-1</a>]<BR> भवति विलम्बिनि विगलितलज्जा विलपति रोदिति वासकसज्जा Gīt. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1419-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासनम्
वासनम् [वास्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Perfuming, scenting.<BR>—2 Infusing.<BR>—3 Dwelling, abiding<BR>—4 An abode, a dwelling.<BR>—5 Any receptacle, a basket, box, vessel &c.; वासनस्थमनाख्याय हस्तेऽन्यस्य<BR> यदर्प्यते Y. 2. 65 (वासनं निक्षेपाधारभूतं संपुटादिकं समुद्रं<BR> ग्रन्थ्यादियुतम्).<BR>—6 Knowledge.<BR>—7 Clothes, dress.<BR>—8 A cover, an envelope.<BR>—9 A kind of posture practised by ascetics in abstract meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासना
वासना<BR>—1 Knowledge derived from memory; cf. भावना.<BR>—2 Particularly, the impression unconsciously left on the mind by past<BR> good or bad actions, which therefore produces pleasure or pain.<BR>—3 Fancy, imagination, idea.<BR>—4 False idea, ignorance.<BR>—5 A wish, desire, expectation, inclination; संसारवासनाबद्धशृङ्खला Gīt. 3.<BR>—6 Regard, liking, respectful regard; तेषां (पक्षिणां) मध्ये मम तु<BR> महती वासना चातकेषु Bv. 4. 17.<BR>—7 Perfuming, scenting.<BR>—8 (In math.) Proof, demonstration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासनामय
वासनामय <i>a.</i> Consisting in notions, ideas or impressions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासनीय
वासनीय <i>a.</i> Intelligible only by much reflection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासित|वासितं|वासितः
वासित <i>p. p.</i> [वास्-क्त]<BR>—1 Perfumed, scented; चन्दनवासिता दिक् N. 8. 77.<BR>—2 Steeped, infused.<BR>—3 Seasoned, spiced.<BR>—4 Dressed, clothed.<BR>—5 Peopled, populous.<BR>—6 Possessing, having.<BR>—7 Famous, celebrated.<BR>—8 Purified, edified; इत्युदीर्य स हरिं प्रति संप्रज्ञातवासिततमः<BR> समपादि N. 21. 119.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासितम्
वासित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 The cry or hum of birds.<BR>—2 Knowledge; cf. वासना (2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासिता
वासिता See वाशिता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासतः|वासत
वासतः An ass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासतेय
वासतेय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वसतये हितं साधु वा ढञ्] Habitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासतेयी
वासतेय + .{@-यी@}<BR>—1 Night.<BR>—2 A house; याते तस्मिन्नथ नरपतौ वासतेयीं स्वकीयाम् Rām. Ch. 5. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासन्त|वासंत|वासन्तः
वासन्त <i>a.</i> (-न्ती <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Vernal, suitable to or produced in spring.<BR>—2 In the spring or prime of life, youthful.<BR>—3 Diligent, attentive (in the performance of duties).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासन्तः|वासन्त|वासंत
वासन्त + .{@-न्तः@}<BR>—1 A camel.<BR>—2 A young elephant.<BR>—3 Any young animal.<BR>—4 A cuckoo.<BR>—5 The south wind, the breeze blowing from the Malaya mountain; cf. मलयसमीर.<BR>—6 A kind of bean. —7 A dissolute man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासन्ती|वासंती
वासन्त + .{@-न्ती@}<BR>—1 A kind of jasmine (with fragrant flowers); वसन्ते वासन्तीकुसुमसुकुमारैरवयवैः Gīt. 1.<BR>—2 Long pepper.<BR>—3 The trumpet-flower.<BR>—4 N. of a festival held in honour of Cupid; cf. वसन्तोत्सव.<BR>—5 The spring creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासन्तिक|वासंतिक|वासन्तिकः
वासन्तिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Vernal; द्रुमान् वासन्तिकान् दृष्ट्वा बभूवुर्भयशङ्किताः<BR> Rām. 4. 53. 4; वासन्तिकैस्तरुभिः Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासन्तिकः|वासन्तिक|वासंतिक
वासन्तिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 The Vidūṣaka or buffoon in a drama.<BR>—2 An actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासर|वासरं|वासरः
वासर <i>a.</i> Matutinal, early.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासरः|वासर|वासरं
वासरः, -रम्<BR> [सुखं वासयति जनान्, वासरः Uṇ. 3. 133] A day (of the week).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासरम्
वासरः, -रम्<BR> [सुखं वासयति जनान्, वासरः Uṇ. 3. 133] A day (of the week).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासरः|वासर|वासरं
वासरः, -रम् + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 Time, turn.<BR>—2 N. of a Nāga.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वासरकन्यका, वासरकृत्, वासरमणिः, वासरसङ्गः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासरकन्यका
वासरः + -कन्यका night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासरकृत्
वासरः + -कृत् <i>m.</i> the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासरमणिः|वासरमणि
वासरः + -मणिः the sun; वासरमणिरिव तमसां राशिं नाशयति विध्नानाम्<BR> Maṅgal. S. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासरसङ्गः|वासरसङ्ग|वासरसंग
वासरः + -सङ्गः morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासव|वासवः
वासव <i>a.</i> (-वी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वसुरेव स्वार्थे अण् वसूनि सन्त्यस्य अण् वा]<BR>—1 Relating to the Vasus.<BR>—2 Belonging to Indra; पाण्डुतां वासवी दिगयासीत् K.; वासवीनां चमूनाम् Me. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासवः|वासव
वासव + .{@-वः@} N. of Indra; स वासवेनासनसंनिकृष्टमितो निषीदेति विसृष्टभूमिः<BR> Ku. 3. 2; R. 5. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासवम्
वासव + .{@-वम्@} The constellation Dhaniṣṭhā.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वासवानुजः, वासवचापः, वासवदत्ता, वासवदिश्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासवानुजः
वासव + -अनुजः Viṣṇu or Kṛṣṇa; स्मितपूर्वमुवाचेदं भगवान् वासवानुजः<BR> Mb. 12. 46. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासवचापः|वासवचाप
वासव + -चापः a rainbow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासवदत्ता
वासव + -दत्ता<BR>—1 N. of a work by Subandhu.<BR>—2 N. of a heroine of several stories. [Different writers give different<BR> accounts of this lady. According to Kathāsaritsāgara she was the daughter<BR> of king Chaṇḍamahāsena of Ujjayinī and was carried off by Udayana,<BR> king of Vatsa. Śrīharṣa represents her to be the daughter of king Pradyota<BR> (see Ratn. 1. 10.), and, according to Mallināthaʼs comment on the line<BR> प्रद्योतस्य प्रियदुहितरं वत्सराजोऽत्र जह्रे she was the daughter<BR> of Pradyota, king of Ujjayinī. Bhavabhūti says that she was betrothed<BR> by her father to king Sañjaya, but that she offered herself to Udayana;<BR> (see Māl. 2). But the Vāsavadattā of Subandhu has nothing in common<BR> with the story of Vatsa, except the name of the heroine, as she is represented<BR> to have been betrothed by her father to Puṣpaketu, but carried off by<BR> Kandarpaketu. It is probable that there were several heroines bearing<BR> the name Vāsavadattā.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासवदिश्
वासव + -दिश् <i>f.</i> the east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासविः|वासवि
वासविः<BR>—1 Indraʼs son Jayanta.<BR>—2 N. of Arjuna; ददर्श वासविर्धीमान् विहीनां वृष्णिपुङ्गवैः (द्वारकां) Mb. 16. 5. 11.<BR>—3 N. of the monkey बालि; तत्रापि संध्यामन्वास्य वासविः स हरीश्वरः<BR> Rām. 7. 34. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासवी
वासवी N. of the mother of Vyāsa; जातः पराशराद्योगी वासव्यां<BR> कलया हरेः Bhāg. 1. 4. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासवेयः|वासवेय
वासवेयः N. of Vyāsa; परिवृत्यासनाभ्याशे वासवेयः स्थितोऽभवत् Mb. 1. 1. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासस्
वासस् [वस्-आछादने असि णिच्च]<BR>—1 A cloth, garment, clothes; वासांसि जीर्णानि यथा विहाय नवानि गृह्णाति<BR> नरोऽपराणि Bg. 2. 22; Ku. 7. 9; Me. 61.<BR>—2 A pall.<BR>—3 A curtain.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वासःकुटी, वासःखण्डः, वासोवृक्षः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासःकुटी
वासस् + -कुटी (वासःकुटी) a tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासःखण्डः|वासःखण्ड
वासस् + -खण्डः ‘a piece of cloth’, a rag, tatter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासोवृक्षः
वासस् + -वृक्षः a shelter-tree; वयांसि वासोवृक्षं संप्रतिष्ठन्ते<BR> Praśna. Up. 4. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासिः|वासि
वासिः <i>m., f.</i> [वस्-इञ् Uṇ. 4. 136] An adze, a small hatchet,<BR> chisel; जीवितं मरणं चैव नाभिनन्दन्न च द्विषन् । वास्यैकं तक्षतो<BR> बाहुं चन्दनेनैकमुक्षतः ॥ Mb. 12. 9. 25, 1. 119. 15. ━<i>m.</i> Dwelling, abiding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासिष्टम्
वासिष्टम् Blood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1420-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासिष्ठ|वासिष्ठं|वासिष्ठः
वासि(शि)ष्ठ <i>a.</i> (-ष्ठी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वसि(शि)ष्ठ-अण्] Belonging to or composed by<BR> (rather revealed to) Vasiṣṭha, as a Maṇḍala of the Ṛgveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाशिष्ठ|वाशिष्ठः
वासि(शि)ष्ठ <i>a.</i> (-ष्ठी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वसि(शि)ष्ठ-अण्] Belonging to or composed by<BR> (rather revealed to) Vasiṣṭha, as a Maṇḍala of the Ṛgveda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासिष्ठः|वासिष्ठ|वासिष्ठं
वासि(शि)ष्ठ + .{@-ष्ठः@} A descendant of Vasiṣṭha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासिष्ठी
वासि(शि)ष्ठ + .{@-ष्ठी@}<BR>—1 The Gomatī river.<BR>—2 The north; काष्ठां चासाद्य वासिष्ठीम् Mb. 5. 109. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासी
वासी <i>f.</i> See वाशी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासुः|वासु
वासुः<BR>—1 The soul.<BR>—2 The soul of the universe, Supreme Being.<BR>—3 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—4 The constellation पुनर्वसु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासुकिः|वासुकि
वासुकिः, वासुकेयः N. of a celebrated serpent, king of snakes<BR> (said to be a son of Kaśyapa); सर्पाणामस्मि वासुकिः Bg. 10. 28; Ku. 2. 38;<BR> (hence वासुकेयस्वसा means ‘the sister of the snake-god’, an<BR> epithet of the deity Manasā; L. D. B.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासुकेयः|वासुकेय
वासुकिः, वासुकेयः N. of a celebrated serpent, king of snakes<BR> (said to be a son of Kaśyapa); सर्पाणामस्मि वासुकिः Bg. 10. 28; Ku. 2. 38;<BR> (hence वासुकेयस्वसा means ‘the sister of the snake-god’, an<BR> epithet of the deity Manasā; L. D. B.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासुदेवः|वासुदेव
वासुदेवः [वसुदेवस्यापत्यम् अण्]<BR>—1 Any descendant of Vasudeva.<BR>—2 Particularly, Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—3 The sage Kapila; वासुदेवेति यं प्राहुः कपिलं मुनिपुङ्गवम् Mb. 3. 107. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासुदेवी
वासुदेवः + .{@-वी@} Asparagus Racemosus (Mar. शतावरी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासुभद्रः|वासुभद्र
वासुभद्रः Name of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासुरा
वासुरा also वाशुरा [वस्-उरण्]<BR>—1 The earth.<BR>—2 Night.<BR>—3 A woman.<BR>—4 A female elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाशुरा
वासुरा also वाशुरा [वस्-उरण्]<BR>—1 The earth.<BR>—2 Night.<BR>—3 A woman.<BR>—4 A female elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वासूः
वासूः <i>f.</i> A young girl, maiden (used chiefly in dramas); एषासि<BR> वासु शिरसि गृहीता Mk. 1. 41; वासु प्रसीद Mk. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्त
वास्त See बास्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तव|वास्तवं
वास्तव <i>a.</i> (-वी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वस्त्वेव-अण्]<BR>—1 Real, true, substantial; वेद्यं वास्तवमत्र वस्तु शिवदं तापत्रयोन्मूलनम्<BR> Bhāg. 1. 1. 2.<BR>—2 Determined, fixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तवम्
वास्तव + .{@-वम्@} Anything fixed or determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तवा
वास्तवा Dawn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तविक|वास्तविकं|वास्तविकः
वास्तविक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वस्तुतो निर्वृत्तं ठक्]<BR>—1 True, real, substantial, genuine.<BR>—2 Demonstrated, established.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तविकः|वास्तविक|वास्तविकं
वास्तविक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A realist.<BR>—2 A gardener.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तव्य|वास्तव्यः
वास्तव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Dwelling, inhabiting, resident; पुरेऽस्य वास्तव्यकुटुम्बितां ययुः<BR> Śi. 1. 66; इहैवास्मि महाराज वास्तव्यो नगरे द्विजः Ks.<BR>—2 Fit to be inhabited, habitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तव्यः|वास्तव्य
वास्तव्य + .{@-व्यः@} —1 A dweller, resident, an inhabitant; वास्तव्यैराक्रान्ते<BR> देशे आगन्तुर्जनोऽसम्भवादन्ते निविशते ŚB. on MS. 10. 5. 4; नानादिगन्तवास्तव्यो<BR> महाजनसमाजः Māl. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तव्यम्
वास्तव्य + .{@-व्यम्@}<BR>—1 A habitable place, house.<BR>—2 Habitation, residence (वसति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तिकम्
वास्तिकम् A collection of goats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तु
वास्तु <i>m., n.</i> [वस्-तुण् Uṇ. 1. 77]<BR>—1 The site of a house, building ground, site.<BR>—2 A house, an abode, a dwelling-place; रवेरविषये वास्तु किं न दीपः<BR> प्रकाशयेत् Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 A chamber.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वास्तुकर्मन्, वास्तुकालः, वास्तुज्ञानम्, वास्तुदेवता, वास्तुपालः, वास्तुयागः, वास्तुविद्या, वास्तुविधानम्, वास्तुशमनम्, वास्तुसंशमनम्, वास्तुशान्तिः, वास्तुसंपादनम्, वास्तुस्थापनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुकर्मन्
वास्तु + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> house-building, architecture; वास्तुकर्मनिवेशम्<BR> Rām. 1. 3. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुकालः|वास्तुकाल
वास्तु + -कालः the time suited for building a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुज्ञानम्
वास्तु + -ज्ञानम् architecture.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">Page1421-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुदेवता
वास्तु + -देवता, -पालः the tutelary deity of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुपालः|वास्तुपाल
वास्तु + -देवता, -पालः the tutelary deity of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुयागः|वास्तुयाग
वास्तु + -यागः a sacrifice performed on the occasion of laying the foundation of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुविद्या
वास्तु + -विद्या architecture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुविधानम्
वास्तु + -विधानम् house-building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुशमनम्
वास्तु + -शमनम्, -संशमनम्, -शान्तिः <i>f.</i> a religious rite performed<BR> on the occasion of laying the foundation of a new house, particularly<BR> on the occasion of entering it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुसंशमनम्
वास्तु + -शमनम्, -संशमनम्, -शान्तिः <i>f.</i> a religious rite performed<BR> on the occasion of laying the foundation of a new house, particularly<BR> on the occasion of entering it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुशान्तिः|वास्तुशान्ति
वास्तु + -शमनम्, -संशमनम्, -शान्तिः <i>f.</i> a religious rite performed<BR> on the occasion of laying the foundation of a new house, particularly<BR> on the occasion of entering it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुसंपादनम्
वास्तु + -संपादनम् the preparation of a house; Ms. 3. 255.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुस्थापनम्
वास्तु + -स्थापनम् the erection of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्तुक|वास्तुकं
वास्तुक <i>a.</i> Left remaining on the sacrificial ground; उवाचोत्तरतोऽभ्येत्य<BR> ममेदं वास्तुकं वसु Bhāg. 9. 4. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

