वास्त्र|वास्त्रः
वास्त्र <i>a.</i> [वस्त्र-अण्] Made of cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्त्रः|वास्त्र
वास्त्र + .{@-स्त्रः@} A carriage covered with cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्प|वास्पः
वास्प See बाष्प.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्पेयः|वास्पेय
वास्पेयः The tree called नागकेशर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्य|वास्यः
वास्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be covered.<BR>—2 To be caused to dwell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्यः|वास्य
