वास्रः|वास्र
वास्रः A day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वास्रा
वास्रः + .{@-स्रा@} a cow. See वाश्र-श्रा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्
वाह् €1 Ā. (वाहते) To try, exert oneself, endeavour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह|वाहः
वाह <i>a.</i> [वह्-घञ्] Bearing, carrying &c. (at the end of comp.);<BR> as in अम्बुवाह, तोयवाह &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहः|वाह
वाह + .{@-हः@}<BR>—1 Carrying, bearing.<BR>—2 A porter.<BR>—3 A draught-animal, a beast of burden.<BR>—4 A horse; अभ्यभूयत वाहानां चरतां गात्रशिञ्जितैः R. 4. 56, 5. 73, 14. 52.<BR>—5 A bull; शतं वाहसहस्राणां तण्डुलानां वपुष्मताम् Rām. 7. 91. 19;<BR> खे खेलगामी तमुवाह वाहः Ku. 7. 49.<BR>—6 A buffalo.<BR>—7 A carriage, conveyance in general.<BR>—8 The arm.<BR>—9 Air, wind.<BR>—10 Obtainment (प्रापण); बहुकारं च सस्यानां वाह्ये वाहो गवां तथा<BR> Mb. 12. 193. 21.<BR>—11 A measure equal to ten Kumbhas or four Bhāras; वाहो भारचतुष्टयम्.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वाहद्विषत्, वाहवारः, वाहरिपुः, वाहवारणः, वाहवाहः, वाहश्रेष्ठः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहद्विषत्|वाहद्विषन्त्
वाह + -द्विषत् <i>m.</i> a buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहवारः
वाह + -वारः a horse-rider; बहूनां वाहवाराणां व्यूहाभ्यन्तरवर्तिनम्<BR> Śiva B. 29. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहरिपुः|वाहरिपु
वाह + -रिपुः a buffalo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहवारणः|वाहवारण
वाह + -वारणः Bos Gavaeus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहवाहः
वाह + -वाहः riding; चलन्नलङ्कृत्य महारयं हयं स्ववाहवाहोचितवेषपेशलः N. 1. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहश्रेष्ठः|वाहश्रेष्ठ
वाह + -श्रेष्ठः a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहकः|वाहक
वाहकः [वह्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A porter.<BR>—2 A coach-driver.<BR>—3 A horseman.<BR>—4 A water-channel, a vehicle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहनम्
वाहनम् [वाहयति वह्-णिच् ल्यु ल्युट् वा]<BR>—1 Bearing, carrying, conveying.<BR>—2 Driving (as a horse).<BR>—3 A vehicle, conveyance of any kind; Ms. 7. 75; निजानुजेनातिथितामुपेतः<BR> प्राचीपतेर्वाहनवारणेन N. 22. 45.<BR>—4 An animal used in riding or draught, as a horse; स दुष्प्रापयशाः<BR> प्रापदाश्रमं श्रान्त-वाहनः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">Page1422-1</a>]<BR> R. 1. 48, 9. 25, 60.<BR>—5 An elephant.<BR>—6 An oar; अस्य वाहनसंयुक्तां … नावमुपाहर Rām. 2. 52. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहना
वाहनम् + .{@-ना@} An army; वाहनाजनि Śi. 19. 33.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वाहनपः, वाहनश्रेष्ठः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1421-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहनपः|वाहनप
