वाहिन्
वाहिन् <i>a.</i> [वह्-णिनि] Bearing, carrying; स्पर्शं वेत्ति च<BR> वाहिना Mb. 12. 184. 26. ━<i>m.</i> A chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहिनी
वाहिनी [वाहो अस्त्यस्याः इनि ङीप्]<BR>—1 An army; आशिषं प्रयुयुजे न वाहिनीम् R. 11. 6, 13. 66.<BR>—2 A division of an army consisting of 81 elephants, as many chariots, 243<BR> horse, and 405 foot; वाहिनी तु गणास्त्रयः Mb. 1. 2. 21. See अक्षौहिणी.<BR>—3 A river; नावः समुपकर्षध्वं तारयिष्यामि वाहिनीम् Rām. 2. 89. 9.<BR>—4 A body of escorts, a convoy; त्वदर्थं प्रेषयिष्यामि वाहिनीमित्यभाषत Bm. 1. 256.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वाहिनीनिवेशः, वाहिनीपतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहिनीनिवेशः|वाहिनीनिवेश
वाहिनी + -निवेशः the camp of an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहिनीपतिः|वाहिनीपति
वाहिनी + -पतिः<BR>—1 a general, a commanding officer.<BR>—2 the ocean (lord of rivers).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहसः|वाहस
वाहसः [न वहति न गच्छति; वह्-असच् Uṇ. 3. 119]<BR>—1 A water-course.<BR>—2 A large serpent, the boa.<BR>—3 Fire.<BR>—4 A species of plant (Mar. करडू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहिकः|वाहिक
वाहिकः<BR>—1 A large drum.<BR>—2 A car drawn by oxen.<BR>—3 A carrier of loads.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहितम्
वाहितम् A heavy burden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहित्त्थम्
वाहित्त्थम् The part of an elephantʼs forehead below the frontal globes;<BR> Mātaṅga L. 6. 7, 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहीक|वाहीकः
वाहीक See बाहीक. One behaving irreligiously; मलं पृथिव्या<BR> बाहीकाः Mb. 12. 328. 20, 8. 44. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहुक
वाहुक See बाहुक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाहेयिक
वाहेयिक<BR>—1 Connected with वाहीक people.<BR>—2 Relating to the bull (वहः); कदा वाहेयिका गाथाः पुनर्गास्यामि शाकले<BR> Mb. 8. 44. 26 (com. वहो वृषभः तस्येदं वधपर्व वाहं तत्रोचिताः<BR> वाहेयिकाः गाथाः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्य|वाह्यं|वाह्यः
वाह्य<BR>—1 See बाह्य.<BR>—2 <i>a.</i> Drawn, driven, conveyed; Mb. 12. 193. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्यः|वाह्य|वाह्यं
वाह्य + .{@-ह्यः@} A beast of burden, an ox &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्यम्
वाह्य + .{@-ह्यम्@} A carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्लिः|वाह्लि
वाह्लिः N. of a country (the modern Balkh).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वाह्लिजः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्लिजः|वाह्लिज
वाह्लिः + -जः a Balkh-bred horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्लिकः|वाह्लिक|वाह्लिकं
वाह्लि(ह्ली)कः<BR>—1 N. of a country (the modern Balkh).<BR>—2 A horse from this country, a Balkh-bred horse.<BR>—3 N. of one of the principal Gandharvas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्लीकः|वाह्लीक|वाह्लीकं
वाह्लि(ह्ली)कः<BR>—1 N. of a country (the modern Balkh).<BR>—2 A horse from this country, a Balkh-bred horse.<BR>—3 N. of one of the principal Gandharvas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वाह्लिकम्
वाह्लि(ह्ली)कः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Saffron.<BR>—2 Asa Foetida.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वि|विः
वि <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 As a prefix to verbs and nouns it expresses:<BR>——(<i>a</i>) separation, disjunction (apart, asunder, away, off<BR> &c.), as वियुज्, विहृ, विचल् &c.;<BR>——(<i>b</i>) the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">Page1422-2</a>]<BR> reverse of an action; as क्री ‘to buy’; विक्री, ‘to sell’; स्मृ<BR> ‘to remember’; विस्मृ ‘to forget’;<BR>——(<i>c</i>) division; as विभज्, विभाग;<BR>——(<i>d</i>) distinction; as विशिष्, विशेष, विविच्, विवेक;<BR>——(<i>e</i>) discrimination; व्यवच्छेद;<BR>——(<i>f</i>) order, arrangement; as विधा, विरच्;<BR>——(<i>g</i>) opposition; as विरुध्, विरोध;<BR>——(<i>h</i>) privation; as विनी, विनयन;<BR>——(<i>i</i>) deliberation, as विचर्, विचार;<BR>——(<i>j</i>) intensity; विध्वंस.<BR>—2 As a prefix to nouns or adjectives not immediately connected with roots,<BR> वि expresses<BR>——(<i>a</i>) negation or privation, in which case it is used much in the same<BR> way as अ or निर्, <i>i. e.</i> it forms Bah. comp.; विधवा, व्यसुः &c.;<BR>——(<i>b</i>) intensity, greatness; as विकराल;<BR>——(<i>c</i>) variety, as विचित्र;<BR>——(<i>d</i>) difference; as विलक्षण;<BR>——(<i>e</i>) manifoldness, as विविध;<BR>——(<i>f</i>) contrariety, opposition, as विलोम;<BR>——(<i>g</i>) change, as विकार;<BR>——(<i>h</i>) impropriety, as विजन्मन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विः|वि
विः <i>m., f.</i> [वे-डित् Uṇ. 4. 145]<BR>—1 A bird; विकुल- (= पक्षिकुल) माकुलमायत-लीनताम् Rām. Ch. 4. 43;<BR> आपततो विरलं (विः + अलम्) घनतोऽयात् ibid. 4. 97.<BR>—2 A horse.<BR>—3 A goer.<BR>—4 A rein.<BR>—5 An epithet of the Soma.<BR>—6 A sacrificer (mostly Ved. in the last four senses).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विराज्, विव<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विराज्
विः + -राज् king of birds, eagle; अथ तार्क्ष्यसुतो ज्ञात्वा विराट्प्रभुचिकीर्षितम्<BR> Bhāg. 8. 21. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विव
विः + -व <i>a.</i> riding on a bird; Śi. 19. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंश|विंशः
विंश <i>a.</i> (-शी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Twentieth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशः|विंश
विंश + .{@-शः@} A twentieth part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशक|विंशकः
विंशक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Twenty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशतिः|विंशति
विंशतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Twenty, a score.<BR>—2 A particular form of military array (व्यूह); ते विंशतिपदे यत्ताः<BR> संप्रहारं प्रचक्रिरे Mb. 7. 36. 13.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विंशतीशः, विंशतीशिन्, विंशतिपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशतीशः|विंशतीश
विंशतिः + -ईशः, -ईशिन्, -पः <i>m.</i> a ruler of twenty villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशतीशिन्
विंशतिः + -ईशः, -ईशिन्, -पः <i>m.</i> a ruler of twenty villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशतिपः|विंशतिप
विंशतिः + -ईशः, -ईशिन्, -पः <i>m.</i> a ruler of twenty villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशतिक|विंशतिकः
विंशतिक <i>a.</i> Worth twenty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशतितम|विंशतितमः
विंशतितम <i>a.</i> (-मी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Twentieth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विंशिन्
विंशिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 Twenty, a score.<BR>—2 A lord or ruler of twenty villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विक|विकं
विक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Waterless.<BR>—2 Unhappy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकम्
विकम् The milk of a cow that has recently calved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकङ्कटः|विकङ्कट|विकंकट|विकंकटः
विकङ्कटः, -तः<BR> A kind of tree (of the wood of which ladles were made, Mar.<BR> वेहेकळ); संभ्रमोऽभवदपोढकर्मणामृत्विजां च्युतविकङ्कतस्रुचाम् R. 11. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकङ्कतः|विकङ्कत|विकंकत|विकंकतः
विकङ्कटः, -तः<BR> A kind of tree (of the wood of which ladles were made, Mar.<BR> वेहेकळ); संभ्रमोऽभवदपोढकर्मणामृत्विजां च्युतविकङ्कतस्रुचाम् R. 11. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकच|विकचः
विकच <i>a.</i> [विकच्-अच्]<BR>—1 Blown, expanded, opened (as a lotus-flower &c.); विकचकिंशुकसंहतिरुच्चकैः<BR> Śi. 6. 21; R. 9. 37; हैमैः स्फीता विकचकमलैर्दीर्घवैडूर्यनालैः Me. 78.<BR>—2 Spread about, scattered over; पुरा सरसि मानसे विकचसारसालिस्खलत् Bv. 1. 3.<BR>—3 Destitute of hair.<BR>—4 Manifested, distinctly apparent; U. 5. 26; विकचनक्षत्रकुमुदैः Mu. 3. 7.<BR>—5 Brilliant, radiant; चन्द्रांशुविकचप्रख्यम् Rām. 2. 15. 9; मरीचिविकचः<BR> श्रीमान्नारायण उरोगतः Mb. 1. 18. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकचः|विकच
विकच + .{@-चः@}<BR>—1 A Buddhist mendicant.<BR>—2 N. of Ketu.<BR>—3 A flag, banner.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विकचश्री<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकचश्री
विकच + -श्री <i>a.</i> having radiant beauty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1422-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकचित
विकचित <i>a.</i> Opened, bloomed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकचीकृ
विकचीकृ €8 U. To open, cause to expand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकट|विकटः
विकट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Hideous, ugly.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Formidable, frightful, horrible, dreadful; पृथुललाटतटघटितविकटभ्रूकुटिना<BR> Ve. 1; विधुमिव विकटविधुन्तुददन्तदलनगलितामृतधारम् Gīt. 4.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Fierce, savage.<BR>—3 Great, large, broad, spacious, wide; जृम्भाविडम्बि विकटोदरमस्तु<BR> चापम् U. 4. 30; आवरिष्ट विकटेन विवोढुर्वक्षसैव कुचमण्डलमन्या<BR> Śi. 10. 42, 13. 10; Māl. 7.<BR>—4 Proud, haughty; विकटं परिक्रामति U. 6; Mv. 6. 32.<BR>—5 Beautiful; Mk. 2; किन्नरीविकटगीतिझङ्कृतिः N. 18. 19; cf. ‘विकटः सुन्दरे प्रोक्तो विशालविकरालयोः’ -Viśwakośa.<BR>—6 Frowning.<BR>—7 Obscure.<BR>—8 Changed in appearance.<BR>—9 Large-toothed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकटः|विकट
विकट + .{@-टः@} N. of Gaṇeśa; लम्बोदरश्च विकटो विघ्ननाशो विनायकः Gaṇeśa S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकटम्
विकट + .{@-टम्@}<BR>—1 A boil, tumour.<BR>—2 Sandal.<BR>—3 White arsenic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकटायितम्
विकटायितम् A flash, a charming display; कटाक्षरुचिच्छटानामन्वेतु<BR> तत्र विकटायितमायताक्षि N. 11. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकत्थ्
विकत्थ् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To boast, vaunt; का खल्वनेन प्रार्थ्यमाना विकत्थते V. 2.<BR>—2 To depreciate, speak ill of, disparage; सदा भवान् फाल्गुनस्य गुणैरस्मान्<BR> विकत्थते Mb.<BR>—3 To humiliate.<BR>—4 To proclaim loudly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकत्थन|विकत्थनं
विकत्थन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Boasting, swaggering, vaunting, bragging; विद्वांसोऽप्यविकत्थना भवन्ति<BR> Mu. 3; R. 14. 73.<BR>—2 Praising ironically.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकत्थनम्
विकत्थन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Vaunting, boasting.<BR>—2 Irony, false praise.<BR>—3 Praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकत्था
विकत्था<BR>—1 Boasting, vaunt, brag, boast; Mb. 12. 158. 10.<BR>—2 Praise.<BR>—3 False praise, irony.<BR>—4 Proclaiming loudly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकथा
विकथा Useless or irrelevant talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकम्प्|विकंप्
विकम्प् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To shake, tremble; किं यासि बालकदलीव विकम्पमाना Mk. 1. 20;<BR> स्फुरति नयनं वामो बाहुर्मुहुश्च विकम्पते 9. 13; स्वधर्ममपि<BR> चावेक्ष्य न विकम्पितुमर्हसि Bg. 2. 31.<BR>—2 To become changed or deformed.<BR>—3 To shrink or retreat from. ━<i>Caus.</i> To shake; रावणश्रियमपि<BR> व्यकम्पयत् R. 11. 19; Ṛs. 2. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकम्प|विकंप
विकम्प <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Heaving.<BR>—2 Unsteady, fickle, inconstant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकम्पनम्
विकम्पनम्<BR>—1 Motion (of the sun).<BR>—2 Trembling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकम्पित|विकंपित|विकम्पितः
