विकर्मन्|विकर्म्मन्
विकर्मन् <i>a.</i> Acting wrongly. ━<i>n.</i><BR>—1 An unlawful or prohibited act, an impious act; कर्मणो ह्यपि बोद्धव्यं<BR> बोद्धव्यं च विकर्मणः Bg. 4. 17; Ms. 9. 226; Bhāg. 11. 3. 43.<BR>—2 Various or divergent duty.<BR>—3 Retiring from business.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विकर्मकृत्, विकर्मक्रिया, विकर्मस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

