विकलकरण
विकल + -करण <i>a.</i> with drooping limbs, languid; U. 3. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकलकरुण
विकल + -करुण <i>a.</i> helpless, piteous; विकलकरुणैर्मर्मच्छेदव्यथाविधुरैरिव<BR> (v. l. विकलकरणैः) Māl. 9. 11; U. 1. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकलपाणिकः|विकलपाणिक
विकल + -पाणिकः a cripple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकलयति
विकलयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To unnerve, overpower; घनीभूतः शोको विकलयति मां मूर्छयति च U. 2. 26.<BR>—2 To injure, ill-treat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकलीकृ
विकलीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To maim, mutilate.<BR>—2 To impair, harm, injure.<BR>—3 To agitate, perplex, confound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

