विकला
विकला The sixtieth part of a <i>Kalā</i>, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1423-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

