विकसित|विकसितं
विकसित <i>p. p.</i> Blown, fully opened or expanded; विकसितवदनामनल्पजल्पेऽपि Bv. 1. 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1424-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विकासः|विकास
