विघ्ननायकः|विघ्ननायक
विघ्नः + -नायकः, -नाशकः, -नाशनः epithets of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्ननाशकः|विघ्ननाशक
विघ्नः + -नायकः, -नाशकः, -नाशनः epithets of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्ननाशनः|विघ्ननाशन
विघ्नः + -नायकः, -नाशकः, -नाशनः epithets of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नप्रतिक्रिया
विघ्नः + -प्रतिक्रिया removal of impediments; प्रतिशुश्राव काकुत्स्थस्तेभ्यो<BR> विघ्नप्रतिक्रियाम् R. 15. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

