विघ्नविनायकः|विघ्नविनायक
विघ्नः + -राजः, -विनायकः, -हारिन् <i>m.</i> epithets of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नहारिन्
विघ्नः + -राजः, -विनायकः, -हारिन् <i>m.</i> epithets of Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नसिद्धिः|विघ्नसिद्धि
विघ्नः + -सिद्धिः <i>f.</i> removal of obstacles.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नयति
विघ्नयति Den. P. To obstruct, hinder, impede, oppose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विघ्नित|विघ्नितः
विघ्नित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Impeded, hindered, obstructed, opposed; मुहुर्विघ्नितकर्माणम् (नालापयेत्) Pt. 1. 387.<BR>—2 Obscured, blinded; रजःकणैर्विघ्नितदृष्टिपाताः Ku. 3. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विङ्खः|विङ्ख|विंख|विंखः
विङ्खः A horseʼs hoof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्
विच् €3. €7 U. (वेवेक्ति, वेविक्ते, विनक्ति, विङ्क्ते, विक्त)<BR>—1 To separate, divide, sever.<BR>—2 To discriminate, distinguish, discern; प्र मे विविकाँ अविदन् मनीषाम् Rv. 3. 57. 1.<BR>—3 To deprive of, remove from (with instr.); शशास स बहून् योधान् जीवितेन<BR> विवेच च Bk. 14. 103.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचकिलः|विचकिल
विचकिलः [विशेषेण तर्पयति गन्धैः Uṇ. 1. 56]<BR>—1 A kind of jasmine.<BR>—2 N. of the tree called <i>Madana</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्ष्
विचक्ष् €2 Ā.<BR>—1 To tell, announce.<BR>—2 To show. —3 To perceive, conjecture; परावरे ब्रह्मणि धर्मतो व्रतैः<BR> स्नातस्य मे न्यूनमलं विचक्ष्व Bhāg. 1. 5. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्षण|विचक्षणः
विचक्षण <i>a.</i> [Uṇ. 2. 120 com.]<BR>—1 Clear-sighted, far-seeing, circumspect; सुविचक्षणः सुतः H. 1. 20.<BR>—2 Wise, clever, learned; विचक्षणः प्रस्तुतमाचचक्षे R. 5. 19.<BR>—3 Expert, skilful, able; सेवाविचक्षणहरीश्वरदत्तहस्तः R. 13. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्षणः|विचक्षण
विचक्षण + .{@-णः@} A learned man, wise man; न दत्वा कस्यचित् कन्यां पुनर्दद्याद्विचक्षणः Ms. 9. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्षस्
विचक्षस् <i>m.</i> A spiritual teacher, preceptor; cf. Uṇ. 4. 240 com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचक्षुस्
विचक्षुस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Blind, sightless.<BR>—2 Perplexed, sad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचट्
विचट् €1 P. To break (intr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचटनम्
विचटनम् Breaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचन्द्र
विचन्द्र <i>a.</i> Moonless (as a night).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर्
विचर् €1 P. To wander about, roam over (oft. with acc.); इष्टान् देशान्<BR> विचर जलद Me. 117; विचचार दावम् R. 2. 8; Ku. 3. 31.<BR>—2 To do, perform, practise.<BR>—3 To act, deal, behave.<BR>—4 To deviate from the right path, go about wantonly; यन्मे माता प्रलुलुभे<BR> विचरन्त्यपतिव्रता Ms. 9. 20.<BR>—5 To pass through, pervade.<BR>—6 To attack, march against.<BR>—7 To associate or have intercourse with.<BR>—8 To go badly, fail.<BR>—9 To commit a mistake; हविषि व्यचरत्तेन वषट्कारं गृणन् द्विजः<BR> Bhāg. 9. 1. 15.<BR>—10 To graze or feed upon. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To think, reflect or meditate upon; विचारमाणस्य विशुद्धभावना<BR> A. Rām. 7. 5. 45.<BR>—2 To discuss, call in question, debate; आज्ञा गुरूणां ह्यविचारणीया R. 14. 46.<BR>—3 To calculate, estimate, take into account, consider; परेषामात्मनश्चैव<BR> यो विचार्य बलाबलम् Pt. 3; सुविचार्य यत्कृतम् H. 1. 20.<BR>—4 To hesitate, doubt.<BR>—5 To examine, investigate.<BR>—6 To seduce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर
विचर <i>a.</i> Wandered, swerved from; न त्वं धर्मं विचरं सञ्जयेह<BR> मत्तश्च जानासि युधिष्ठिराच्च Mb. 5. 29. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचरणम्
विचरणम्<BR>—1 Wandering.<BR>—2 Motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचरितम्
विचरितम् Wandering, roaming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारः|विचार
विचारः<BR>—1 Reflection, deliberation, thought, consideration; विचारमार्गप्रहितेन<BR> चक्षुषा Ku. 5. 42.<BR>—2 Examination, discussion, investigation; तत्त्वार्थविचार.<BR>—3 Trial (of a case); विषसलिलतुलाग्निप्रार्थिते मे विचारे Mk. 9. 43.<BR>—4 Judgment, discrimination, discernment, exercise of reason; विचारमूढः<BR> प्रतिभासि मे त्वम् R. 2. 47.<BR>—5 Decision, determination.<BR>—6 Selection.<BR>—7 Doubt, hesitation.<BR>—8 Prudence, circumspection.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विचारज्ञ, विचारभूः, विचारमूढ, विचारशील, विचारस्थलम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारज्ञ
विचारः + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> able to decide, a judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारभूः
विचारः + -भूः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a tribunal, seat of justice.<BR>—2 particularly, the judgment-seat of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारमूढ
विचारः + -मूढ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Mistaken in judgment.<BR>—2 Foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारशील
विचारः + -शील <i>a.</i> thoughtful, considerate, prudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारस्थलम्
विचारः + -स्थलम्<BR>—1 a tribunal.<BR>—2 logical discussion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारक|विचारकः
विचारक <i>a.</i> Investigating, judging; परामृशन्तो लिङ्गानि व्यभिचारविचारकाः Udb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारकः|विचारक
विचारक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 An investigator; a judge, an examiner.<BR>—2 A leader, guide.<BR>—3 A spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारणम्
विचारणम्<BR>—1 Discussion, consideration, examination, deliberation, investigation;<BR> तच्छृण्वन् विपठन् विचारणपरो भक्त्या विमुच्येन्नरः Bhāg. 12. 13. 18.<BR>—2 Doubt, hesitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारणा
विचारणा<BR>—1 Examination, discussion, investigation.<BR>—2 Reflection, consideration, thought.<BR>—3 Hesitation, doubt; भवित्री तत्र वैदेहि न मेऽस्त्यत्र विचारणा<BR> Mb. 3. 282. 57, 14. 53. 21.<BR>—4 The Mīmāṃsā system of philosophy.<BR>—5 Distinction, kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारिका
विचारिका A household female servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारित|विचारितः
विचारित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Considered, inquired into, examined, discussed.<BR>—2 Decided, determined; परत्रेति विचारितम् Ms. 11. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारितम्
विचारित + .{@-तम्@} Deliberation, thought.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचारिन्
विचारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Roaming, wandering; लोकालोकविचारिचारणगणैरुद्गीयमानं यशः Nāg. 5. 18.<BR>—2 Dissolute, wanton.<BR>—3 Deliberating, judging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर्चिका|विचर्च्चिका
विचर्चिका, विचर्ची Itch, scab; एकं कुष्ठं स्मृतं पूर्वं<BR> गजचर्म ततः स्मृतम् । ततश्चर्मदलं प्रोक्तं ततश्चापि विचर्चिका ॥ Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर्ची
विचर्चिका, विचर्ची Itch, scab; एकं कुष्ठं स्मृतं पूर्वं<BR> गजचर्म ततः स्मृतम् । ततश्चर्मदलं प्रोक्तं ततश्चापि विचर्चिका ॥ Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर्चित
विचर्चित <i>a.</i> Anointed, smeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर्मन्
विचर्मन् Shieldless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचर्षण
विचर्षण <i>a.</i> Very active; शरीरं मे विचर्षणम् T. Up. 1. 4. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचल्
विचल् €1 P.<BR>—1 To shake, tremble, move; पतति पतत्रे विचलति पत्रे शङ्कितभवदुपयानम् Gīt. 5.<BR>—2 To go, proceed, set out.<BR>—3 To be agitated or disturbed, be rough; (as the sea); व्यचालीदम्भसां<BR> पतिः Bk. 15. 70.<BR>—4 To deviate, swerve; नादण्ड्यो नाम राज्ञोऽस्ति धर्माद्विचलितः स्वकात् Y. 1. 358.<BR>—5 To fall off or down. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To shake, move, wave.<BR>—2 To cause to swerve, lead away from.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">Page1431-1</a>]<BR>—3 To excite, agitate, stir up.<BR>—4 To destroy, rescind, annul.<BR>—5 To transgress, violate; अनिष्टं चाप्यनिष्टेषु तं धर्मं न विचालयेत् Ms. 7. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1430-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचल|विचलः
विचल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Moving about, shaking, wavering, tottering, unsteady (fig. also).<BR>—2 Conceited, proud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचलनम्
विचलनम्<BR>—1 Moving; wandering from place to place; महद्विचलनं नॄणां गृहिणां<BR> दीनचेतसां (निःश्रेयसाय कल्पते) Bhāg. 10. 8. 4.<BR>—2 Deviation.<BR>—3 Unsteadiness, fickleness.<BR>—4 Conceit, pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचलित|विचलितः
विचलित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Deviated, departed; Māl. 5. 1.<BR>—2 Obscured, blinded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचाल|विचालं|विचालः
विचाल <i>a.</i> Intervening, intermediate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचालः|विचाल|विचालं
विचाल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 Separating, putting apart; P. V. 3. 43.<BR>—2 Interval.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचालित्वम्
विचालित्वम् Indefiniteness, unsteadiness, variability; संवत्सरो<BR> विचालित्वात् MS. 6. 7. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचालिन्
विचालिन् <i>a.</i> Unsteady, indefinite (in signification), variable;<BR> विचाली हि संवत्सरशब्दः सावनोऽपि गणितदिवसकः शीतोष्णवर्षलक्षणोऽपि<BR> चान्द्रमसोऽपि ŚB. on MS. 6. 7. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचि|विचिः
विचि €5 U.<BR>—1 To collect, gather, bring together, store up; सुवर्णपुष्पितां पृथ्वीं<BR> विचिन्वन्ति त्रयो जनाः । शूरश्च कृतविद्यश्च यश्च जानाति सेवितुम् ॥<BR> Pt. 1. 45, 36.<BR>—2 To search for, look out for; विचितश्चैष समन्तात् श्मशानवाटः<BR> Māl. 5; R. 12. 61, 13. 23; प्रियतमां विचिन्वन् V. 4.<BR>—3 To seek, investigate, examine, reflect upon; नालेन सलिले मूलं<BR> पुष्करस्य विचिन्वतः Bhāg. 3. 9. 37; ज्योतिर्मयं विचिन्वन्ति योगिनस्त्वां<BR> विमुक्तये R. 10. 23; Ki. 16. 1.<BR>—4 To separate, discern, distinguish.<BR>—5 To disarrange.<BR>—6 To select, choose.<BR>—7 To destroy, efface.<BR>—8 Ved. To clear, prepare (as a way).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचयः|विचय
विचयः<BR>—1 Search, seeking, looking out for; तुरगविचयव्यग्रान् U. 1. 23.<BR>—2 Investigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचयनम्
विचयनम् Searching, seeking &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित
विचित <i>p. p.</i> Searched, searched through.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचितिः|विचिति
विचितिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Searching, search, seeking for.<BR>—2 Inquiry, investigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिः|विचि
विचिः <i>m., f.</i>, विची <i>f.</i> A wave; cf. वीचि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विची
विचिः <i>m., f.</i>, विची <i>f.</i> A wave; cf. वीचि.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिकित्सा
विचिकित्सा<BR>—1 Doubt, hesitation, uncertainty; येयं प्रेते विचिकित्सा मनुष्ये अस्तीत्येके<BR> नायमस्तीति चैके Kaṭh. 1. 1. 20; Bṛ. Up. 1. 5. 3; तुभ्यं मद्विचिकित्सायामात्मा<BR> मे दर्शितो बहिः Bhāg. 3. 9. 37.<BR>—2 Mistake, error. —3 Finding out the real state (तत्त्वनिर्णय); द्रव्यस्य<BR> विचिकित्सार्थं गुणदोषौ शुभाशुभौ Bhāg. 11. 21. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिकित्सित
विचिकित्सित Doubtful; विचिकित्सितमेतन्मे ब्रवीतु भगवान् यथा<BR> Bhāg. 2. 4. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्र|विचित्रं|विचित्रः
विचित्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Diversified, variegated, spotted, speckled; इयमुद्ग्रथते स्रजो विचित्राः Mu. 1. 4.<BR>—2 Various, varied.<BR>—3 Painted.<BR>—4 Beautiful, lovely; क्वचिद्विचित्रं<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">Page1431-2</a>]<BR> जलयन्त्रमन्दिरम् Ṛs. 1. 2.<BR>—5 Wonderful, surprising, strange; हतविधिलसिंतानां ही विचित्रो विपाकः Śi. 11. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रः|विचित्र|विचित्रं
विचित्र + .{@-त्रः@} The Aśoka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रा
विचित्र + .{@-त्रा@} A white deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रम्
विचित्र + .{@-त्रम्@}<BR>—1 Variegated colour.<BR>—2 Surprise.<BR>—3 A figure of speech (implying apparently the reverse of the meaning intended).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विचित्राङ्ग, विचित्रान्नम्, विचित्रदेह, विचित्ररूप, विचित्रवर्षिन्, विचित्रवीर्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

