विचित्रान्नम्
विचित्र + -अन्नम् a kind of rice food (Mar. खिचडी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रदेह|विचित्रदेहः
विचित्र + -देह <i>a.</i> having a lovely body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रदेहः|विचित्रदेह
विचित्र + -देह + .({@-हः@}) a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्ररूप
विचित्र + -रूप <i>a.</i> diverse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रवर्षिन्
विचित्र + -वर्षिन् raining here and there.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रवीर्यः|विचित्रवीर्य|विचित्रवीर्य्य|विचित्रवीर्य्यः
विचित्र + -वीर्यः N. of a king of the lunar race. [He was a son of Śantanu<BR> by his wife Śatyavatī and so half-brother of Bhīṣma. When he died<BR> childless, his mother called Vyāsa (her own son before her marriage),<BR> and requested him to raise up issue to Vicitravīrya in accordance with<BR> the practice of <i>Niyoga</i>. He complied with the request, and begot on<BR> Ambikā and Ambālikā, the two widows of his brother, two sons Dhṛtarāṣṭra<BR> and Paṇḍu respcctively.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रकः|विचित्रक
विचित्रकः The birch tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रकम्
विचित्रकः + .{@-कम्@} Wonder, astonishment, surprise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचित्रित|विचित्रितः
विचित्रित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Coloured, painted.<BR>—2 Adorned, decorated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्त्|विचिंत्
विचिन्त् €10 U.<BR>—1 To think, consider.<BR>—2 To think of, ponder over, call to mind; विचिन्तयन्ती यमनन्यमानसा Ś. 4. 1.<BR>—3 To take into consideration, have regard to, regard; अस्मान् साधु विचिन्त्य<BR> संयमधनानुच्चैः कुलं चात्मनः Ś. 4. 17.<BR>—4 To intend, fix upon, determine.<BR>—5 To devise, find out, discover.<BR>—6 To imagine.<BR>—7 To perceive, observe (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्तनम्
विचिन्तनम्, विचिन्ता<BR>—1 Thought, thinking.<BR>—2 Care for anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्ता
विचिन्तनम्, विचिन्ता<BR>—1 Thought, thinking.<BR>—2 Care for anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचिन्वत्कः|विचिन्वत्क
विचिन्वत्कः<BR>—1 Search.<BR>—2 Investigation.<BR>—3 A hero.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचीर्ण
विचीर्ण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Occupied by, wandered through; देवैः पूर्वं विचीर्णानि मुनिभिश्च महात्मभिः Mb. 3. 156. 3.<BR>—2 Entered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेतन
विचेतन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Senseless, lifeless, unconscious, dead.<BR>—2 Inanimate; प्रमदाः पतिवर्त्मगा इति प्रतिपन्नं हि विचेतनैरपि Ku. 4. 33.<BR>—3 Perplexed, confounded; एवमुक्तः स मुनिना महीपालो विचेतनः प्रत्याख्यानाय<BR> चाशक्तः Mb. 3. 97. 3.<BR>—4 Ignorant, foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेतस्
विचेतस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Senseless, stupid, ignorant; Bg. 9. 12.<BR>—2 Perplexed, confounded, sad; सर्वे च ते बाष्पकलाः साश्रुनेत्रा विचेतसः<BR> Rām. 7. 40. 29.<BR>—3 Malevolent, wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेयम्
विचेयम् Investigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेष्ट्
विचेष्ट् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To stir, move, be in motion, move about.<BR>—2 To act, behave.<BR>—3 To exert oneself, strive, try.<BR>—4 To roll, wallow, struggle, writhe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेष्ट
विचेष्ट <i>a.</i> Motionless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1431-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेष्टनम्
विचेष्टनम्<BR>—1 Moving the limbs.<BR>—2 Kicking; rolling (said of horses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1432-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेष्टा
विचेष्टा<BR>—1 Effort, exertion.<BR>—2 Movement.<BR>—3 Conduct, behaviour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1432-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेष्टित|विचेष्टितः
विचेष्टित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Striven, tried, struggled.<BR>—2 Examined, investigated.<BR>—3 Misdone, done foolishly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1432-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विचेष्टितम्
विचेष्टित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 An act, a deed; न हि मे शृण्वतस्तृप्तिरस्ति तेषां विचेष्टितम् Mb. 3. 160. 6.<BR>—2 Effort, movement, undertaking, enterprise.<BR>—3 Gesture.<BR>—4 Working, sensation, play; किमपि चेदमनङ्गविचेष्टितम् V. 2. 9.<BR>—5 Machination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1432-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विच्छ्|विछ्
विच्छ् I. €6 P. (विच्छति, also विच्छायति-ते) To go, move.<BR>━II. €10 U. (विच्छयति-ते)<BR>—1 To shine.<BR>—2 To speak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1432-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

