विद्ध|विद्धः
विद्ध <i>p. p.</i> [व्यध्-क्त]<BR>—1 Pierced, penetrated; wounded, stabbed.<BR>—2 Beaten, whipped, lashed.<BR>—3 Thrown, directed, sent.<BR>—4 Opposed.<BR>—5 Resembling.<BR>—6 Wise, learned; L. D. B.<BR>—7 Mutually clung; मेघवृन्दमिवाकाशे विद्धं विद्युत्समावृतम् Mb. 1. 207. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1440-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

