विद्योतनम्
विद्योतन + .{@-नम्@} Lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1440-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रः|विद्र|विद्रं
