विद्राण
विद्राण <i>a.</i> Roused from sleep, awakened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रु
विद्रु €1 P.<BR>—1 To run, run away, retreat; जलसंघात इवासि विद्रुतः Ku. 4. 6.<BR>—2 To melt, dissolve.<BR>—3 To become divided, burst asunder. ━<i>Caus.</i> To put to flight,<BR> rout, scare away, disperse, scatter; प्रतिरवाभोगभीषितनष्टविद्राविताशेषजननिवहः<BR> Māl. 3; असौ कुम्भिभ्रान्त्या खरनखरविद्रावितमहागुरुग्रावग्रामः स्वपिति<BR> गिरिगर्भे हरिपतिः Bv. 1. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रवः|विद्रव
विद्रवः<BR>—1 Running away, flight, retreat; तैः शरैस्तव सैन्यस्य विद्रवः सुमहानभूत्<BR> Bhāg. 7. 108. 40.<BR>—2 Panic.<BR>—3 Flowing out.<BR>—4 Melting, liquefaction.<BR>—5 Censure, abuse.<BR>—6 Intellect, understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रावः|विद्राव
विद्रावः = विद्रवः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रावणम्
विद्रावणम्<BR>—1 Driving or scaring away, putting to flight, defeating.<BR>—2 Liquefying.<BR>—3 Destruction (विनाशन); विराधाख्यदुरातङ्कविद्रावणमहौषधम्<BR> Viś. Guṇā. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रावित|विद्रावितं
विद्रावित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Put to flight, routed, chased away.<BR>—2 Scattered, dispersed, torn asunder; कालेन दैवयुक्तेन जानन् विद्रावितं<BR> जगत् Bhāg. 10. 54. 14.<BR>—3 Liquefied, fused, melted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रुत|विद्रुतः
विद्रुत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Flown, fled away, (in panic).<BR>—2 Agitated, frightened, alarmed; नेच्छन्ति सेवया पूर्णाः कुतोऽन्यत्<BR> कालविद्रुतम् Bhāg. 9. 4. 67.<BR>—3 Liquid, fluid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रुतम्
विद्रुत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Flight.<BR>—2 A particular manner of fighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रुतिः|विद्रुति
विद्रुतिः Running, flight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्राण
विद्राण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Kept awake, sleepless; विद्राणविपश्चिति Hc. 5.<BR>—2 Despaired, sad; कलकलोपद्रवद्रवद्रविणबलीवर्दविद्राणवणिजि Hc. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रुमः|विद्रुम
