विद्रुमलता
विद्रुमः + -लता<BR>—1 a branch of coral.<BR>—2 a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विद्रुमलतिका
