विद्वेषणः + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Causing hatred or enmity; a kind of Tāntric rite.<BR>—2 Enmity, hatred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

