विद्वेष्टृ
विद्वेषिन्, विद्वेष्टृ <i>a.</i> Hating, inimical. ━<i>m.</i> A hater, an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विध्
विध् I. €6 P. (विधति)<BR>—1 To pierce, cut.<BR>—2 To honour, worship.<BR>—3 To rule, govern, administer. ━II. €1 Ā. (वेधते) To ask, beg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1441-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विधः|विध
