विपक्षत्वम्
विपक्षता, -त्वम्<BR> Hostility, enmity, opposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1448-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपच्
विपच् €1 P.<BR>—1 To mature, develop, ripen; bear fruit; (समारंभाः) गर्भशालिसधर्माणस्तस्य<BR> गूढं विपेचिरे R. 17. 53.<BR>—2 To digest.<BR>—3 To cook thoroughly.<BR>—4 To melt, dissolve, liquefy.<BR>—5 To roast. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cook thoroughly.<BR>—2 To melt, liquefy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1448-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपक्त्रिम
विपक्त्रिम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Fully ripened or matured.<BR>—2 Developed, fulfilled (as the consequences of former acts).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1448-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपक्व
विपक्व <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Fully ripened or matured.<BR>—2 Developed, fulfilled; यच्च तप्तं तपस्तस्य विपक्वं फलमद्य नः Ku. 6. 6.<BR>—3 Cooked.<BR>—4 Thoroughly burnt, destroyed.<BR>—5 Not burnt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1449-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

