विपट्
विपट् €10 U.<BR>—1 To tear up or out; (केतकबर्ह) विपाटयामास युवा नखाग्रैः R. 6. 17.<BR>—2 To pull or draw out, extract.<BR>—3 To root up, eradicate.<BR>—4 To open, unfold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1449-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

