विपदुद्धारः|विपदुद्धार
विपद् + -उद्धरणम्, -उद्धारः relieving or extricating (one) from misfortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1449-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विपत्कालः|विपत्काल
