विश्वक
विश्वक <i>a.</i> All-pervading, all-containing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1475-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विश्वका
विश्वका The Gangetic kite; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1475-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

