विश्वंभरः|विश्वम्भर|विश्वंभर|विश्वम्भरः
विश्वंभर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 The all-pervading being, the Supreme Spirit.<BR>—2 An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 Of Indra.<BR>—4 Fire; विश्वंभरो वा विश्वंभरकुलाये तं न पश्यति Bṛ. Up. 1. 4. 7.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1475-2" target="_blank">Page1475-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1475-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

