विश्वासघातिन्
विश्वासः + -घातकः, -घातिन् <i>m.</i> a treacherous fellow, traitor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1475-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

