विश्वासः + -पात्रम्, -भूमिः, -स्थानम् an object of confidence, a reliable or<BR> trusty person, a confidant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1475-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

