विष्
विष् I. €3 U. (वेवेष्टि, वेविष्टे, विष्ट)<BR>—1 To surround.<BR>—2 To spread through, extend, pervade.<BR>—3 To embrace.<BR>—4 To accomplish, effect, perform.<BR>—5 To eat.<BR>—6 To go to, go against, encounter; (not generally used in classical literature).<BR>━II. €9 P. (विष्णाति) To separate, disjoin. ━III. €1 P. (वेषति)<BR> To sprinkle, pour out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1476-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

