विषसूचकः|विषसूचक
विषम् + -सूचकः the Chakora bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषहरा
विषम् + -हरा, -हरी An epithet of the goddess Manasā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

