विषम् + -हरा, -हरी An epithet of the goddess Manasā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषहृदय
विषम् + -हृदय <i>a.</i> ‘poison-hearted’, malicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषहेतिः|विषहेति
विषम् + -हेतिः a serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषञ्ज्|विषंज्
विषञ्ज् €1 P. To attach or stick to, to hang or suspend upon, (usually in <i>p. p.</i>).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषक्त
विषक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Fixed firmly or closely.<BR>—2 Adhering or clinging closely to.<BR>—3 Hung or suspended on; विटपविषक्तजलार्द्रवल्कलेषु Ś. 1. 32.<BR>—4 Caused, produced; विषक्तस्तीव्रेण व्रणितहृदयेन व्यथयता U. 4. 3.<BR>—5 Occupied, engaged; विषक्ते त्वयि दुर्धर्ष हतः शूरसुतो बलात् Mb. 3. 21. 13.<BR>—6 Spread, extended over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषण्डम्
विषण्डम् The fibres of the lotus-stalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1476-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषद्
विषद् P.<BR>—1 To sink down, be exhausted.<BR>—2 To be dispirited or cast down, be afflicted or sorrowful, despond,<BR> despair; विलपति हसति विषीदति रोदिति चञ्चति मुञ्चति तापम् Gīt. 4;<BR> बालसूनुरवलोक्य भार्गवं स्वां दशां च विषसाद पार्थिवः R. 11. 67, 9. 75;<BR> (तं) विषीदन्तमिदं वाक्यमुवाच मधुसूदनः Bg. 2. 1; Bk. 7. 89.<BR>—3 To be afraid. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to despond or despair, discourage.<BR>—2 To make afflicted, pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषण्ण|विषण्णः
विषण्ण <i>p. p.</i> Dejected, cast down, sad, sorrowful, spiritless,<BR> despondent; हा तातेति क्रन्दितमाकर्ण्य विषण्णः R. 9. 75.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विषण्णचेतस्, विषण्णभावः, विषण्णमनस्, विषण्णमुख, विषण्णवदन, विषण्णरूप<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषण्णचेतस्
विषण्ण + -चेतस्, -भावः, -मनस् <i>a.</i> dejected in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषण्णभावः|विषण्णभाव
विषण्ण + -चेतस्, -भावः, -मनस् <i>a.</i> dejected in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषण्णमनस्
विषण्ण + -चेतस्, -भावः, -मनस् <i>a.</i> dejected in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषण्णमुख
विषण्ण + -मुख, -वदन <i>a.</i> looking sad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषण्णवदन
विषण्ण + -मुख, -वदन <i>a.</i> looking sad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषण्णरूप
विषण्ण + -रूप <i>a.</i> in a sad mood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषादः|विषाद
विषादः<BR>—1 Dejection, sadness, depression of spirits, grief, sorrow; मद्वाणि<BR> मा कुरु विषादम् Bv. 4. 41; विषादे कर्तव्ये विदधति जडाः प्रत्युत<BR> मुदम् Bh. 3. 25; R. 8. 54; Ś. 4. 16.<BR>—2 Disappointment, despondency, despair; विषादलुप्तप्रतिपत्ति सैन्यम्<BR> R. 3. 40; (विषादश्चेतसो भङ्ग उपायाभावनाशयोः).<BR>—3 Languor, drooping state; दोर्विषादः Māl. 2. 5.<BR>—4 Dulness, stupidity, insensibility; शास्त्रविददृष्टकर्माकर्मसु विषादं<BR> गच्छेत् Kau. A.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषादनम्
विषादनम् Affliction, despair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषादिन्
विषादिन् <i>a.</i> Dejected, dismayed, sad, disconsolate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषम|विषमं|विषमः
विषम <i>a.</i> [विगतो विरुद्धो वा समः]<BR>—1 Uneven, rough, rugged; पथिषु विषमेष्वप्यचलता Mu. 3. 3; व्यालकीर्णाः<BR> सुविषमाः Pt. 1. 64; Me. 19.<BR>—2 Irregular, unequal; तोषं ततान विषमग्रथितोऽपि भागः Māl. 9. 44.<BR>—3 Odd, not even.<BR>—4 Difficult, hard to understand, mysterious; विषमोऽपि विगाह्यते नयः<BR> Ki. 2. 3; विषमाः कर्मगतयः Pt. 4. 50.<BR>—5 Impassable, inaccessible; Ki. 2. 3; भ्रान्तं देशमनेकदुर्गविषमम् Bh. 3. 5.<BR>—6 Coarse, rough.<BR>—7 Oblique; ईषत्तिर्यग्वलनविषमम् Māl. 4. 2.<BR>—8 Painful, troublesome; कान्ताविश्लेषदुःखव्यतिकरविषमे यौवने विप्रयोगः<BR> Bh. 3. 106; H. 4. 3.<BR>—9 Very strong, vehement; व्यनक्त्यन्तस्तापं तदयमतिधीरोऽपि विषमम् Māl. 3. 9.<BR>—10 Dangerous, fearful; सर्वकषः कषति हा विषमः कृतान्तः Mv. 5. 56;<BR> Mk. 8. 1, 27; Mu. 1. 18, 2. 20.<BR>—11 Bad, adverse, unfavourable; येन च हसितं दशासु विषमासु Pt. 4. 16.<BR>—12 Odd, unusual, unparalleled.<BR>—13 Dishonest, artful.<BR>—14 Intermittent (as fever).<BR>—15 Wicked.<BR>—16 Different.<BR>—17 That which cannot be equally divided; अजाविकं सैकशफं न जातु<BR> विषमं भजेत् Ms. 9. 119.<BR>—18 Unsuitable, wrong; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषमः|विषम|विषमं
विषम + .{@-मः@}<BR>—1 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 (In music) A kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषमम्
विषम + .{@-मम्@}<BR>—1 Unevenness.<BR>—2 Oddness.<BR>—3 An inaccessible place, precipice, pit &c.<BR>—4 A difficult or dangerous position, difficulty, misfortune; सुप्तं<BR> प्रमत्तं विषमस्थितं वा रक्षन्ति पुण्यानि पुरा कृतानि Bh. 2. 97; कुतस्त्वा<BR> कश्मलमिदं विषमे समुपस्थितम् Bg. 2. 2.<BR>—5 Rough or uneven ground.<BR>—6 N. of a figure of speech in which some unusual or incompatible relation<BR> between cause and effect is described; (said to be of four kinds; see<BR> K. P. Kārikās 126 and 127).<BR>—7 A kind of stanza or verse; भिन्नचिह्नचतुष्पादं विषमं परिकीर्तितम्.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-2" target="_blank">Page1477-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषमम्
विषम + .{@-मम्@} <i>ind.</i> Unequally, unevenly, unfairly, dangerously &c.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विषमाक्षः, विषमेक्षणः, विषमनयनः, विषमनेत्रः, विषमलोचनः, विषमान्नम्, विषमावतारः, विषमायुधः, विषमेषुः, विषमशरः, विषमकर्णः, विषमकर्मन्, विषमकालः, विषमचक्रवालम्, विषमचतुरस्रः, विषमचतुर्भुजः, विषमच्छदः, विषमच्छाया, विषमज्वरः, विषमत्रिभुजः, विषमपत्रः, विषमबाणः, विषमलक्ष्मी, विषमविभागः, विषमवृत्तम्, विषमशील, विषमस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

