विषम + -अक्षः, -ईक्षणः, -नयनः, -नेत्रः, -लोचनः epithets of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

