विषम + -आयुधः, -इषुः, -शरः epithets of the god of love; उन्मिमील<BR> विशदं विषमेषुः Śi. 10. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषमशरः|विषमशर
विषम + -आयुधः, -इषुः, -शरः epithets of the god of love; उन्मिमील<BR> विशदं विषमेषुः Śi. 10. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषमकर्णः|विषमकर्ण
विषम + -कर्णः<BR>—1 a quadrangle or tetragon with unequal diagonals.<BR>—2 the hypotenuse of a right-angled triangle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषमकर्मन्|विषमकर्म्मन्
विषम + -कर्मन् (in math.) the finding of two quantities when the difference<BR> of their squares is given and either the sum or the difference of the<BR> quantities (Colebrooke).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विषमकालः|विषमकाल
विषम + -कालः an unfavourable season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1477-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

