विष्णुः + -धर्मः<BR>—1 Dharma enjoining the proper worship of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 a kind of श्राद्ध.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

