विष्णुपदम्
विष्णुः + -पदम्<BR>—1 the sky, atmosphere.<BR>—2 the sea of milk.<BR>—3 the foot of Viṣṇu (worshipped at Gayā).<BR>—4 a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्णुपदी
विष्णुः + -पदी<BR>—1 an epithet of the Ganges; निर्गता विष्णुपादाब्जात् तेन विष्णुपदी स्मृता<BR> Brav. P.; Bhāg. 1. 19. 7.<BR>—2 the sunʼs passage (into the zodiacal signs वृषभ, सिंह, वृश्चिक<BR> and कुम्भ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

