विष्णुप्रिया
विष्णुः + -प्रिया<BR>—1 basil.<BR>—2 Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

