विष्णुमित्रः|विष्णुमित्र
विष्णुः + -मित्रः a common name (like अमुक); तस्मादपि विष्णुमित्र<BR> इत्यनवस्थितिः Bhāg. 5. 14. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्णुरथः|विष्णुरथ
विष्णुः + -रथः an epithet of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्णुरातः|विष्णुरात
विष्णुः + -रातः N. of king Parīkṣita; स विष्णुरातोऽतिथय आगताय तस्मै<BR> सपर्यां शिरसा जहार Bhāg. 1. 19. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्णुलिङ्गी
विष्णुः + -लिङ्गी a quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्णुलोकः|विष्णुलोक
विष्णुः + -लोकः Viṣṇuʼs world; मुच्यते सर्वपापेभ्यो विष्णुलोकं स गच्छति Stotra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

