विष्णुहिता
विष्णुः + -हिता basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विष्पन्द्|विष्पंद्
