विसंवद्
विसंवद् €1 P.<BR>—1 To be inconsistent, be at variance; कमलानां मनोहराणामपि रूपाद्विसंवदति<BR> शीलम् Mu. 1. 19; शकटदासस्तु मित्रमिति विसंवदन्त्यक्षराणि Mu. 5.<BR>—2 To break oneʼs word or promise.<BR>—3 To disappoint, deceive.<BR>—4 To fail.<BR>—5 To assert falsely.<BR>—6 To contradict. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To make inconsistent.<BR>—2 To disappoint, to cause to fail; रमणीयोऽवधिर्विधिना विसंवादितः Ś. 6.<BR>—3 To fail to prove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंवादः|विसंवाद
विसंवादः<BR>—1 Deception, breaking oneʼs promise, disappointment.<BR>—2 Inconsistency, incongruity, disagreement.<BR>—3 Contradiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंवादनम्
विसंवादनम् The breaking oneʼs word or promise; अविसंवादनं<BR> दानं समयस्याव्यतिक्रमः आवर्तयन्ति भूतानि Mb. 5. 38. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंवादिन्
विसंवादिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Disappointing, deceiving.<BR>—2 Inconsistent, contradictory.<BR>—3 Differing, disagreeing; वयोवेषविसंवादि रामस्य च तयोस्तदा R. 15. 67.<BR>—4 Disputing, contesting.<BR>—5 False, untrue.<BR>—6 Fraudulent, crafty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंष्ठुल
विसंष्ठु(स्थु)ल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unsteady, agitated; Māl. 7.<BR>—2 Uneven; ततोऽभवज्जरासन्धः किंचित्क्रमविसंस्थुलः Bm. 2. 101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंस्थुल
विसंष्ठु(स्थु)ल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unsteady, agitated; Māl. 7.<BR>—2 Uneven; ततोऽभवज्जरासन्धः किंचित्क्रमविसंस्थुलः Bm. 2. 101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंहत
विसंहत <i>a.</i> Disjoined, loosened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1480-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंकट|विसङ्कट|विसंकटः|विसङ्कटः
विसंकट <i>a.</i> Frightful; dreadful; दंष्ट्राकोटिविसङ्कटैरित<BR> इतो धावद्भिराकीर्यते Māl. 5. 13; cf. विशंकट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंकटः|विसङ्कट|विसंकट|विसङ्कटः
विसंकट + .{@-टः@}<BR>—1 A lion.<BR>—2 The Ingudī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंकुल
विसंकुल <i>a.</i> Self-possessed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंकुलम्
विसंकुल + .{@-लम्@} Composure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंगत|विसङ्गत
विसंगत <i>a.</i> Ill-fitted, incongruous, unharmonious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसंज्ञ
विसंज्ञ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Insensible, unconscious.<BR>—2 Confused (भ्रान्त); आख्यातु नो भवाञ्शीघ्रं विसंज्ञाः स्मेह सर्वशः<BR> Mb. 3. 142. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसदृश
विसदृश <i>a.</i> Unlike, dissimilar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

