विसंधिः Bad or disagreeable <i>Sandhi</i> (euphony) or absence of Sandhi,<BR> regarded as a fault in composition; see K. P. 7. <i>ad loc.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

