विसिल See बिसिल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूचिका
विसूचिका, -विसूची<BR> Cholera; सूचीभिरिव गात्राणि तुदन् संतिष्ठतेऽनिलः ।<BR> यस्याजीर्णेन सा वैद्यैर्विसूचीति निगद्यते Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूची
विसूचिका, -विसूची<BR> Cholera; सूचीभिरिव गात्राणि तुदन् संतिष्ठतेऽनिलः ।<BR> यस्याजीर्णेन सा वैद्यैर्विसूचीति निगद्यते Bhāva P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूत्र
विसूत्र <i>a.</i> Confused, disordered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूरणम्
विसूरणम्, -णा<BR> Distress, sorrow; संप्राप्तविसूरणस्त्वरितं परवारणः V. 4. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूरणा
विसूरणम्, -णा<BR> Distress, sorrow; संप्राप्तविसूरणस्त्वरितं परवारणः V. 4. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूरितम्
विसूरितम् Repentance, distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसूरिता
विसूरितम् + .{@-ता@} Fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृ
विसृ €1 P.<BR>—1 To spread, be extended or diffused; चक्रीवदङ्गरुहधूम्ररुचो बिसस्रुः<BR> Śi. 5. 8, 9. 19, 37; विभिद्यमाना बिससार सारसान् Ki. 8. 31, 10. 53, 16. 35.<BR>—2 To return. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To spread, stretch.<BR>—2 To cause to prevail or spread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसरः|विसर
विसरः<BR>—1 Going forth.<BR>—2 Spreading, extending.<BR>—3 Crowd, multitude, herd, flock.<BR>—4 A large quantity, heap; घर्माम्भोविसरविवर्तनैरिदानीम् Māl. 1. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसारः|विसार
विसारः<BR>—1 Spreading out, expansion, diffusion.<BR>—2 Creeping, gliding.<BR>—3 A fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसारम्
विसारः + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Wood.<BR>—2 Timber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसारी
विसारः + .{@-री@} The region of the winds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसारिन्
विसारिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Spreading, diffusing.<BR>—2 Creeping, gliding.<BR>—3 Expanded (विस्तृत); विसारिभिः पुष्पविलोचनैर्लताः Ki. 8. 11.<BR>━<i>m.</i> A fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसारिणी
विसारिणी Glycine Debilis (Mar. रानौडीद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृत|विसृतं
विसृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Spread out, extended, diffused.<BR>—2 Extended, stretched.<BR>—3 Uttered, spoken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृत्वर|विसृत्वरः
विसृत्वर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Spreading about, being diffused; विसृत्वरैरम्बुरुहां<BR> रजोभिः Śi. 3. 11; विमलचन्द्रविसृत्वरचन्द्रिका Rām. Ch. 4. 58;<BR> विसृत्वरेण यशःसमुदायेन Cola-Campū. p. 15.<BR>—2 Creeping, gliding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृमर|विसृमरः
विसृमर <i>a.</i> Creeping along, gliding, moving gently; विसृमरह्रेषितहयः Ve. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृज्
विसृज् €6 P. (also Ā.)<BR>—1 To abandon, leave, give up; विसृज सुन्दरि संगमसाध्वसम् M. 4. 13;<BR> पूर्वार्धविसृष्टतल्पः R. 16. 6; Bv. 1. 78.<BR>—2 To let go, let loose.<BR>—3 To shed, pour down; त्वद्विप्रयोगाश्रु समं विसृष्टम् R. 13. 26.<BR>—4 To send, despatch; भोजेन दूतो रघवे विसृष्टः R. 5. 39.<BR>—5 To dismiss, allow to go, send away; प्रतिगृह्य वचो विससर्ज मुनिम्<BR> R. 8. 91, 14. 19.<BR>—6 To give; पित्रा विसृष्टां मदपेक्षया यः श्रियं युवाप्यङ्कगतामभोक्ता<BR> R. 13. 67, 18. 7.<BR>—7 To send or cast forth, emit, dart; विसृजति हिमगर्भैरग्निमिन्दुर्मयूखैः Ś. 3. 4.<BR>—8 To drop, let fall, strike; विसृज शूद्रमुनौ कृपाणम् U. 2. 10.<BR>—9 To utter; फणवानिवैष विससर्ज चेदिपः Śi. 15. 62.<BR>—10 To cast off, repudiate.<BR>—11 To create, produce; कल्पक्षये पुनस्तानि कल्पादौ विसृजाम्यहम् Bg. 9. 7.<BR>—12 To deliver, hand over to.<BR>—13 To evacuate the bowels.<BR>—14 To release (oneʼs self) from. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To emit, pour forth, shed.<BR>—2 To send away, dismiss.<BR>—3 To spare.<BR>—4 To cast off, repel, repudiate.<BR>—5 To lose.<BR>—6 To divulge, publish (news).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृज्यम्
विसृज्यम् Creation of the world; कालो वशीकृतविसृज्यविसर्गशक्तिः<BR> Bhāg. 7. 9. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्गः|विसर्ग
विसर्गः<BR>—1 Sending forth, emission.<BR>—2 Shedding, pouring down, dropping; पुरं नवीचक्रुरपां विसर्गान् मेघा<BR> निदाघग्लपितामिवोर्वीम् R. 16. 38.<BR>—3 Casting, discharge; सरहस्यो धनुर्वेदः सविसर्गोपसंयमः Bhāg. 1. 7. 44.<BR>—4 Giving away, a gift, donation; आदानं हि विसर्गाय सतां वारिमुचामिव<BR> R. 4. 86 (where the word means ‘pouring down’ also).<BR>—5 Sending away, dismissal; हरणं च विसर्ग च शाल्वेन च विसर्जनम्<BR> Mb. 5. 175. 37.<BR>—6 Creation, creating; नियमे च विसर्गे च भूतात्मा मानसस्तथा Mb. 12. 239. 12;<BR> secondary creation; ब्रह्मणो गुणवैषम्याद्विसर्गः पौरुषः<BR> स्मृतः Bhāg. 2. 10. 3.<BR>—7 Abandonment, relinquishment; न निष्क्रयविसर्गाभ्यां भर्तुर्भार्या विमुच्यते Ms. 9. 46.<BR>—8 Voiding, evacuation; as in पुरीषविसर्ग.<BR>—9 Departure, separation.<BR>—10 Final beatitude.<BR>—11 Light, splendour.<BR>—12 A symbol in writing, representing a distinct hard aspiration and marked<BR> by two perpendicular dots (:).<BR>—13 The southern course of the sun. —14 The penis.<BR>—15 Destruction of the world; कालो वशीकृतविसृज्यविसर्गशक्तिः Bhāg. 7. 9. 22.<BR>—16 The function of the world (सृष्टिव्यापार); भूतभावोद्भवकरो<BR> विसर्गः कर्मसंज्ञितः Bg. 8. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्जनम्
विसर्जनम्<BR>—1 Emitting, sending forth, pouring down; समतया वसुवृष्टिविसर्जनैः R. 9. 6.<BR>—2 Giving away, a gift, donation; R. 9. 6.<BR>—3 Voiding; वाय्वग्निविप्रमादित्यमपः पश्यंस्तथैव गाः । न कदाचन<BR> कुर्वीत विण्मूत्रस्य विसर्जनम् ॥ Ms. 4. 48.<BR>—4 Casting off, quitting, abandoning; श्रुतदेहविसर्जनः पितुः R. 8. 25.<BR>—5 Sending away, dismissal.<BR>—6 Allowing (the deity invoked) to go (opp. आवाहन).<BR>—7 Setting a bull at liberty on certain occasions.<BR>—8 Driving out (cows to pasture).<BR>—9 Product, creation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्जनीय|विसर्जनीयः|विसर्ज्जनीय
विसर्जनीय <i>a.</i> To be abandoned &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्जनीयः|विसर्जनीय|विसर्ज्जनीय
विसर्जनीय + .{@-यः@} = विसर्ग (12) q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1481-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्जित|विसर्ज्जित
विसर्जित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Emitted, sent forth.<BR>—2 Given away.<BR>—3 Left, quitted, abandoned.<BR>—4 Sent, despatched.<BR>—5 Dismissed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृष्ट|विसृष्टः
विसृष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Emitted, sent forth.<BR>—2 Created, emanated.<BR>—3 Shed, cast.<BR>—4 Sent, despatched; भोजेन दूतो रघवे विसृष्टः R. 5. 39.<BR>—5 Dismissed, let go, discharged; विसृष्टपार्श्वानुचरस्य तस्य R. 2. 9.<BR>—6 Discharged, hurled.<BR>—7 Given, bestowed, granted; ग्रामेष्वात्मविसृष्टेषु R. 1. 44.<BR>—8 Abandoned, quitted, removed.<BR>—9 Cast out, expelled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृष्टिः|विसृष्टि
विसृष्टिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Emitting, sending forth.<BR>—2 Abandoning.<BR>—3 Giving.<BR>—4 Emission (of semen).<BR>—5 Secondary creation.<BR>—6 Offspring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसृप्
विसृप् €1 P.<BR>—1 To move, march, proceed; यः सुबाहुरिति राक्षसोऽपरस्तत्र तत्र<BR> विससर्प मायया R. 11. 29, 4. 53.<BR>—2 To fly or roam about.<BR>—3 To spread; मनोरागस्तीव्रं विषमिव विसर्पत्यविरतम् Māl. 2. 1.<BR>—4 To flow along, fall down; (बाष्पः) विसर्पन् धाराभिर्लुठति धरणीं<BR> जर्जरकणः U. 1. 29.<BR>—5 To escape, run away.<BR>—6 To hover about.<BR>—7 To wind, meander.<BR>—8 To spread, diffuse; विस्रप्स्यन्ति च ते यशः Bhāg. 4. 1. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्पः|विसर्प
विसर्पः<BR>—1 Creeping about, gliding.<BR>—2 Moving to and fro.<BR>—3 Spread, circulation; किमु विषविसर्पः किमु मदः U. 1. 36.<BR>—4 An unexpected or unwished-for consequence of an act.<BR>—5 A sort of disease, dry spreading itch; लवणाम्लकटूष्णादिसेवनाद्दोषकोपतः ।<BR> विसर्पः सप्तधा ज्ञेयः सर्वतः परिसर्पणात् ॥<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विसर्पघ्नम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्पघ्नम्
विसर्पः + -घ्नम् wax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्पणम्
विसर्पणम्<BR>—1 Creeping along, gliding, going gently.<BR>—2 Diffusion, spreading, extending.<BR>—3 Increase, growth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्पिः|विसर्पि
विसर्पिः, -विसर्पिका<BR> See विसर्प (5) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्पिका
विसर्पिः, -विसर्पिका<BR> See विसर्प (5) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विसर्पिन्
विसर्पिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Creeping, shooting forth.<BR>—2 Gliding, roaming; नलिनमुखान्तविसर्पि पङ्कजिन्याः Ki. 10. 33.<BR>—3 Spreading, increasing.<BR>—4 Suffering from the disease विसर्प.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तः|विस्त
विस्तः A particular weight of gold (= 80 रक्तिकाs).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तृ
विस्तृ €5 U., विस्तॄ €9 U.<BR>—1 To spread, diffuse.<BR>—2 To cover, fill.<BR>—3 To extend, expand.<BR>—4 To strew or scatter about. —5 To speak diffusively about. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to spread or expand; as in पयोधरविस्तारयितृकं यौवनम् Ś. 1.<BR>—2 To increase; विस्तारितः कुञ्जरकर्णतालैः (रेणुः) R. 7. 39.<BR>—3 To stretch, extend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तरः|विस्तर
विस्तरः<BR>—1 Extension, expansion.<BR>—2 Minute details, detailed description, minute particulars; संक्षिप्तस्याप्यतोऽस्यैव<BR> वाक्यस्यार्थगरीयसः । सुविस्तरतरा वाचो भाष्यभूता भवन्तु मे Śi. 2. 24;<BR> (विस्तरेण, विस्तरतः, विस्तरशः ‘in detail, at length, fully, with minute details, with full particulars’<BR>; अङ्गुलिमुद्राधिगमं विस्तरेण<BR> श्रोतुमिच्छामि Mu. 1; विस्तरेणात्मनो योगं विभूतिं च जनार्दन (भूयः<BR> कथय) Bg. 10. 18).<BR>—3 Prolixity, diffuseness; अलं विस्तरेण.<BR>—4 Abundance, quantity,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">Page1482-2</a>]<BR> multitude, number; उभे पुरवरे रम्ये विस्तरैरुपशोभिते Rām. 7. 101. 14.<BR>—5 A bed, layer.<BR>—6 A seat, stool.<BR>—7 Affectionate solicitation.<BR>—8 High degree, intensity.<BR>—9 Great wealth, riches.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तारः|विस्तार
विस्तारः<BR>—1 Spreading, extension, expansion; प्रान्तविस्तारभाजाम् Māl. 1. 27.<BR>—2 Amplitude, breadth; पञ्चयोजनविस्तारम् Mb. 14. 58. 39; विलोकयन्त्यो<BR> वपुरापुरक्ष्णां प्रकामविस्तारफलं हरिण्यः R. 2. 11; तत एव च<BR> विस्तारम् Bg. 13. 30.<BR>—3 Expanse, vastness, magnitude; मध्ये श्यामः स्तन इव भुवः शेषविस्तारपाण्डुः Me. 18.<BR>—4 Details, full particulars; कण्वोऽपि तावच्छ्रुतविस्तारः क्रियताम् Ś. 7.<BR>—5 The diameter of a circle.<BR>—6 A shrub.<BR>—7 The branch of a tree with new shoots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तीर्ण|विस्तीर्णः
विस्तीर्ण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Spread out, expanded, extended.<BR>—2 Wide, broad; विस्तीर्णं योजनं स्निग्धं ततो द्विगुणमायतम् Rām. 7. 13. 3.<BR>—3 Large, great, extensive.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विस्तीर्णजानु, विस्तीर्णपर्णम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तीर्णजानु
विस्तीर्ण + -जानु <i>a.</i> bandy-legged (as a girl, hence unfit for marriage).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तीर्णपर्णम्
विस्तीर्ण + -पर्णम् a kind of root (मानक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तृत|विस्तृतः
विस्तृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Diffused, spread, extended.<BR>—2 Broad, expanded.<BR>—3 Ample.<BR>—4 Diffuse, prolix.<BR>—5 Developed.<BR>—6 Far-sounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्तृतिः|विस्तृति
विस्तृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Extension, expansion.<BR>—2 Breadth, width, magnitude.<BR>—3 The diameter of a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्था
विस्था €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To stand apart.<BR>—2 To remain, stay, dwell, remain fixed or stationary; पदैर्भुवं व्याप्य<BR> वितिष्ठमानम् Śi. 4. 4.<BR>—3 To spread, be diffused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्थान
विस्थान <i>a.</i> Belonging to another place or organ (as a sound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्पन्दः|विस्पन्द
विस्पन्दः<BR>—1 See विष्यन्दः.<BR>—2 A drop (कण); तस्य शुक्रस्य विस्पन्दान् पांसून् संगृह्य भूमितः<BR> Mb. 13. 85. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्पष्ट|विस्पष्टः
विस्पष्ट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Plain, clear, intelligible.<BR>—2 Manifest, evident, obvious, open, apparent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फर्
विस्फर्, -विस्फुर् €6 P.<BR>—1 To quiver, palpitate, tremble; Mb. 1. 52. 5.<BR>—2 To move about, struggle; विस्फुरन्तीं यथाकामं मैथुनायोपचक्रमे<BR> Rām. 7. 80. 16; Mb. 1. 125. 8.<BR>—3 To shine, gleam; किं नाम विस्फुरन्ति शस्त्राणि U. 4.<BR>—4 To draw or twang (as a bow, used in <i>Caus.</i> in the same sense);<BR> एकोऽपि विस्फुरितमण्डलचापचकं कः सिन्धुराजमभिषेणयितुं समर्थः Ve. 2. 26.<BR>—5 (esp. विस्फर्) To open wide (eyes). ━<i>Caus.</i> To draw (a bow);<BR> विस्फार्यमाणस्य ततो भुजाभ्यां भूतानि भर्त्रा धनुरन्तकस्य Ki. 17. 24;<BR> Rām. 7. 28. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फुर्
विस्फर्, -विस्फुर् €6 P.<BR>—1 To quiver, palpitate, tremble; Mb. 1. 52. 5.<BR>—2 To move about, struggle; विस्फुरन्तीं यथाकामं मैथुनायोपचक्रमे<BR> Rām. 7. 80. 16; Mb. 1. 125. 8.<BR>—3 To shine, gleam; किं नाम विस्फुरन्ति शस्त्राणि U. 4.<BR>—4 To draw or twang (as a bow, used in <i>Caus.</i> in the same sense);<BR> एकोऽपि विस्फुरितमण्डलचापचकं कः सिन्धुराजमभिषेणयितुं समर्थः Ve. 2. 26.<BR>—5 (esp. विस्फर्) To open wide (eyes). ━<i>Caus.</i> To draw (a bow);<BR> विस्फार्यमाणस्य ततो भुजाभ्यां भूतानि भर्त्रा धनुरन्तकस्य Ki. 17. 24;<BR> Rām. 7. 28. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फारः|विस्फार
विस्फारः<BR>—1 Vibration, trembling, throbbing.<BR>—2 The twang of a bow; यस्य विस्फारनिर्घोषैः स्तनन्ति स्म दिशो दश<BR> Rām. 7. 28. 45.<BR>—3 Opening wide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फारकः|विस्फारक
विस्फारकः A kind of dangerous fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फारित|विस्फारितः
विस्फारित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Made to vibrate.<BR>—2 Trembling, tremulous.<BR>—3 Twanged; विकृष्टविस्फारितचापमण्डलः Ki. 14. 31.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">Page1483-1</a>]<BR>—4 Dilated, expanded.<BR>—5 Manifested, displayed.<BR>—6 Evident, apparent, manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1482-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फुरित|विस्फुरितः
विस्फुरित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Tremulous, quivering.<BR>—2 Swollen, enlarged.<BR>—3 Flashing, glittering; एकोऽपि विस्फुरितमण्डलचापचक्रम् Ve. 2. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फुर्ज्
विस्फु(स्फू)र्ज् €1 P.<BR>—1 To roar, thunder.<BR>—2 To resound.<BR>—3 To increase.<BR>—4 To shine, appear; अस्त्येवं जडधामता तु भवतो यद् व्योम्नि विस्फूर्जसे K. P. 10. 444.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फूर्ज्
विस्फु(स्फू)र्ज् €1 P.<BR>—1 To roar, thunder.<BR>—2 To resound.<BR>—3 To increase.<BR>—4 To shine, appear; अस्त्येवं जडधामता तु भवतो यद् व्योम्नि विस्फूर्जसे K. P. 10. 444.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फूर्जः|विस्फूर्ज
विस्फूर्जः Roaring, thundering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फूर्जथुः|विस्फूर्जथु
विस्फूर्जथुः<BR>—1 Roaring, thundering, rumbling.<BR>—2 A clap or peal of thunder.<BR>—3 (Hence) A thunderlike manifestation or rise, any sudden appearance<BR> or stroke; ममैव जन्मान्तरपातकानां विपाकविस्फूर्जथुरप्रसह्यः R. 14. 62.<BR>—4 Rolling. (as of waves); swell, surging appearance; महोर्मिविस्फूर्जथुनिर्विशेषाः R. 13. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फूर्जितम्
विस्फूर्जितम्<BR>—1 Roar, shout; क्व च विक्रान्तता याता क्व च विस्फूर्जितं महत् Mb. 9. 31. 33.<BR>—2 Rolling.<BR>—3 Fruit, result; तत् सर्व सुरलोकदेवसदृशं धर्मस्य विस्फूर्जितम्<BR> Bh. 2. 125, 3. 143; त्वद्भक्तेस्त्रिपुरहर विस्फूर्जितमिदम् Śivamahimna 11.<BR>—4 The impetuous motion (of wind); धाराणां च निपातेन वायोर्विस्फूर्जितेन<BR> च Mb. 3. 171. 6.<BR>—5 Knitting, contraction (of the brows); विश्वं विध्वंसयन् वीर्यशौर्यविस्फूर्जितभ्रुवा<BR> Bhāg. 4. 24. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फुलिङ्गः|विस्फुलिङ्ग|विस्फुलिंग|विस्फुलिंगः
विस्फुलिङ्गः<BR>—1 A spark of fire; यथाग्नेः क्षुद्रा विस्फुलिङ्गा व्युच्चरन्ति Bṛ. Up. 2. 1. 20;<BR> अग्नेर्ज्वलतो विस्फुलिङ्गा विप्रतिष्ठेरन् Ś. B.<BR>—2 A kind of poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फोटः|विस्फोट
विस्फोटः, -टा<BR>—1 A boil, pimple, tumour.<BR>—2 Smallpox.<BR>—3 Cracking, crashing; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फोटा
विस्फोटः, -टा<BR>—1 A boil, pimple, tumour.<BR>—2 Smallpox.<BR>—3 Cracking, crashing; Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फोटकः|विस्फोटक
विस्फोटकः<BR>—1 A blister, boil; (also विस्फोटिका).<BR>—2 A kind of leprosy.<BR>—3 Small-pox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्फोटनम्
विस्फोटनम्<BR>—1 The appearance of blisters.<BR>—2 Loud roaring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मि
विस्मि €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To wonder or be surprised at; उभयोर्न तथा लोकः प्रावीण्येन<BR> विसिष्मिये R. 15. 68; उद्वीक्ष्य को भुवि न विस्मयते नगेशम् Śi. 4. 19;<BR> Bk. 5. 51.<BR>—2 To admire.<BR>—3 To be proud or conceited; न विस्मयेत तपसा Ms. 4. 236. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> To cause to smile, cause to be surprised, fill with wonder or astonishment;<BR> विस्मापयन् विस्मितमात्मवृत्तौ R. 2. 33; Bk. 5. 58, 8. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मयः|विस्मय
विस्मयः<BR>—1 Wonder, surprise, astonishment, amazement; पुरुषः प्रबभूवाग्नेर्विस्मयेन<BR> सहर्त्विजाम् R. 10. 50.<BR>—2 Astonishment or wonder, being the feeling which produces the <i>adbhuta</i><BR> sentiment; S. D. thus defines it:− विविधेषु पदार्थेषु लोकसीमातिवर्तिषु ।<BR> विस्फारश्चेतसो यस्तु स विस्मय उदाहृतः ॥ 207.<BR>—3 Pride, arrogance; तपः क्षरति विस्मयात् Ms. 4. 237.<BR>—4 Uncertainty, doubt.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: विस्मयाकुल, विस्मयाविष्ट, विस्मयपदम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मयाकुल
विस्मयः + -आकुल, -आविष्ट <i>a.</i> astonished, struck with wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मयाविष्ट
विस्मयः + -आकुल, -आविष्ट <i>a.</i> astonished, struck with wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मयपदम्
विस्मयः + -पदम् a matter of astonishment; मधुस्फीता वाचः परमममृतं<BR> निर्मितवतस्तव ब्रह्मन् किं वागपि सुरगुरोर्विस्मयपदम् Śivamahimna 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मयंकर
विस्मयंकर, -विस्मयंगम <i>a.</i><BR> Astonishing, producing wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मयंगम
विस्मयंकर, -विस्मयंगम <i>a.</i><BR> Astonishing, producing wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मयनम्
विस्मयनम् Astonishment, wonder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मापन|विस्मापनः
विस्मापन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Astonishing; येन मेऽपहृतं तेजो देवविस्मापनं<BR> महत् Bhāg. 1. 15. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मापनः|विस्मापन
विस्मापन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 The god of love.<BR>—2 Trick, deceit, illusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मापनम्
विस्मापन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Causing wonder.<BR>—2 Anything causing wonder.<BR>—3 A city of the Gandharvas (said to be <i>m.</i> also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मित|विस्मितः
विस्मित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Astonished, surprised, amazed, wonder-struck.<BR>—2 Disconcerted.<BR>—3 Proud; दृप्तं संख्ये द्विपबलाद्वयसा चापि विस्मितम् Mb. 7. 27. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मितिः|विस्मिति
विस्मितिः <i>f.</i> Astonishment, wonder, surprise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मेर
विस्मेर <i>a.</i> Surprised, struck with wonder, astonished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मृ
विस्मृ €1 P. To forget; मधुकर विस्मृतोऽस्येनां कथम् Ś. 5. 1;<BR> यदा तु अन्यसङ्गात् पूर्ववृत्तं विस्मृतो भवान् Ś. 6. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> To cause to forget; अनिर्देश्यसुखः स्वर्गः कस्तं विस्मारयिष्यति V. 3. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्मरणम्
