विस्रंस्
विस्रंस् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To slip down, become loosened.<BR>—2 To fall down, drop, slip. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to fall down, let fall; विस्रंसयन्ती नवकर्णिकारम् Ku. 3. 62.<BR>—2 To loosen, relax, slacken.<BR>—3 To betray.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

