विस्रंसा
विस्रंसः, -सा<BR>—1 Falling down.<BR>—2 Decay, laxness, weakness, debility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1483-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

विस्रंसन
