वृकः|वृक
वृकः [Uṇ. 3. 41]<BR>—1 A wolf; पापारम्भकयोर्मृगीव वृकयोर्भीरुर्गता गोचरम् Māl. 5. 24.<BR>—2 A hyena.<BR>—3 A jackal.<BR>—4 A crow.<BR>—5 An owl.<BR>—6 A robber.<BR>—7 A Kṣatriya.<BR>—8 Turpentine.<BR>—9 A compound perfume, a mixture of various fragrant articles.<BR>—10 N. of a demon.<BR>—11 N. of a tree (बकवृक्ष).<BR>—12 N. of a fire in the stomach.<BR>—13 a plough.<BR>—14 The moon; Nir. 5. 20.<BR>—15 The sun; Nir. 5. 21.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वृकारातिः, वृकारिः, वृकोदरः, वृककर्मन्, वृकदंशः, वृकधूपः, वृकधूर्तः, वृकधूर्तकः, वृकवाला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

