वृकारिः|वृकारि
वृकः + -अरातिः, -अरिः a dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृकोदरः|वृकोदर
वृकः + -उदरः<BR>—1 an epithet of Brahman.<BR>—2 of Bhīma, the second Pāṇḍava prince; पौण्ड्रं दध्मौ महाशङ्खं<BR> भीमकर्मा वृकोदरः Bg. 1. 15; Ki. 2. 1; Ve. 1. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1488-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

