वृक्षभेदिन्
वृक्षः + -भेदिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a hatchet.<BR>—2 a carpenterʼs chisel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1489-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृक्षमर्कटिका
