वृद्धाचारः|वृद्धाचार
वृद्ध + -आचारः an ancient or long-standing custom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धोक्षः|वृद्धोक्ष
वृद्ध + -उक्षः an old bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धोपसेविन्
वृद्ध + -उपसेविन् <i>a.</i> honouring the aged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धकाकः|वृद्धकाक
वृद्ध + -काकः a raven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धगर्भा
वृद्ध + -गर्भा <i>a.</i> far advanced in pregnancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धनाभि|वृद्धनाभिः
वृद्ध + -नाभि <i>a.</i> corpulent, pot-bellied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धप्रमातामहः|वृद्धप्रमातामह
वृद्ध + -प्रमातामहः a maternal great-grand-father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धभावः|वृद्धभाव
वृद्ध + -भावः old age. यश्चाफलस्तस्य न वृद्धभावः Mb. 3. 133. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धमतम्
वृद्ध + -मतम् the precept of ancient sages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धयुवतिः|वृद्धयुवति
वृद्ध + -युवतिः<BR>—1 a procuress.<BR>—2 a midwife; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धराजः|वृद्धराज
वृद्ध + -राजः a kind of sorrel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धवयस्
वृद्ध + -वयस् <i>a.</i> older in age; वृद्धवयाः प्रत्युत्थेयः ŚB. on MS. 6. 2. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धवाहनः|वृद्धवाहन
वृद्ध + -वाहनः the mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धश्रवस्
वृद्ध + -श्रवस् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Indra; वृद्धश्रवाः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">Page1492-1</a>]<BR> समभिनन्दति साधु साध्वीम् Mv. 7. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1491-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धसंघः|वृद्धसङ्घ
वृद्ध + -संघः a council of elders.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धसंयोगः
वृद्ध + -संयोगः association with the aged; Kau. A. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धसूत्रकम्
वृद्ध + -सूत्रकम् a flock of cotton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धा
वृद्धा<BR>—1 An old woman.<BR>—2 A female descendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धिः|वृद्धि
वृद्धिः [वृध्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Growth, increase, augmentation, development; पुपोष वृद्धिं हरिदश्वदीधितेरनुप्रवेशादिव<BR> बालचन्द्रमाः R. 3. 22; तपोवृद्धि, ज्ञानवृद्धि &c.<BR>—2 Waxing, increase of the digits of the moon; पर्यायपीतस्य सुरैर्हिमांशोः<BR> कलाक्षयः श्लाघ्यतरो हि वृद्धेः R. 5. 16; Ku. 7. 1.<BR>—3 Increase in wealth, prosperity, affluence; वृद्धिकाले तु संप्राप्ते<BR> दुर्जनोऽपि सुहृद्भवेत् Pt. 2. 112.<BR>—4 Success, advancement, rise, progress; परवृद्धिमत्सरि मनो हि मानिनाम् Śi. 15. 1.<BR>—5 Wealth, property.<BR>—6 A heap, quantity, multitude.<BR>—7 Interest; as in सरलवृद्धि, चक्रवृद्धि &c.; वसिष्ठविहितां वृद्धिं<BR> सृजेद्वित्तविवर्धिनीम् Ms. 8. 140.<BR>—8 Usury; वृद्धपा कृषिवणिक्त्वेन … स्वाध्यायगणितं महत् Mb. 12. 62. 9.<BR>—9 Profit, gain.<BR>—10 Enlargement of the scrotum.<BR>—11 Extension of power or revenue.<BR>—12 (In gram.) The increase or lengthening of vowels, the change of अ,<BR> इ, उ, ऋ, short or long, and ऌ to आ, ऐ, औ, आर्, and आल् respectively.<BR>—13 The impurity caused by child-birth in a family (called जननाशौच q. v.).<BR>—14 Cutting off.<BR>—15 (In law) Forfeiture (as of property).<BR>—16 (वृधु हिंसायाम्) Injury (पीडा); नुदेद्वृद्धिसमृद्धी स प्रतिकूले<BR> नृपात्मज Mb. 5. 135. 29.<BR>—17 Elevation (of ground).<BR>—18 Prolongation (of life).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वृद्ध्याजीवः, वृद्ध्याजीविन्, वृद्धिपत्रम्, वृद्धिश्राद्धम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्ध्याजीवः|वृद्ध्याजीव
वृद्धिः + -आजीवः, -आजीविन् <i>m.</i> a usurer, money {@-द@} <i>a.</i> promoting prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्ध्याजीविन्
वृद्धिः + -आजीवः, -आजीविन् <i>m.</i> a usurer, money {@-द@} <i>a.</i> promoting prosperity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धिपत्रम्
वृद्धिः + -पत्रम् a kind of razor; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धिश्राद्धम्
वृद्धिः + -श्राद्धम् an offering made to the Manes on prosperous occasions,<BR> such as the birth of a son (नान्दीश्राद्ध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृद्धिमत्|वृद्धिमन्त्
वृद्धिमत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Increased, increasing.<BR>—2 Rich, wealthy.<BR>—3 Prosperous, thriving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृधसानः|वृधसान
वृधसानः [वृधेः छन्दसि असानच्-कित् Uṇ. 2. 83-84] A man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृधसानुः|वृधसानु
वृधसानुः<BR>—1 A man.<BR>—2 A leaf.<BR>—3 An act or action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृन्तम्
