वृन्दा + -वनी the holy basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृन्दार|वृंदार|वृन्दारः
