वृश्चिकः|वृश्चिक
वृश्चिकः [व्रश्च् किकन्]<BR>—1 A scorpion.<BR>—2 The sign <i>Scorpio</i> of the zodiac.<BR>—3 A crab.<BR>—4 A centipede.<BR>—5 A kind of beetle.<BR>—6 A hairy caterpillar.<BR>—7 The month when the sun is in <i>Scorpio</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1492-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृश्चिका
