वृषान्तकः|वृषान्तक
वृषः + -अन्तकः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

