वृषपतिः|वृषपति
वृषः + -पतिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 a bull set at liberty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषपर्वन्|वृषपर्व्वन्
