वृषः + -सेनः N. of Karṇa; Mb. 12. 27. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषस्कन्ध
वृषः + -स्कन्ध <i>a.</i> having shoulders as lusty as those of a bull; वपुर्वृषस्कन्धसुबन्धुरांसकम्<BR> U. 6. 25; R. 12. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषण्वसु
वृषण्वसु <i>n.</i> The treasure of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषण|वृषणः
वृषण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sprinkling, fertilizing.<BR>—2 Strong, stout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषणः|वृषण
वृषण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 The scrotum, the bag containing the testicles;<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR>—3 Of Viṣṇu; देवैः सानुचरैः साकं गीर्भिर्वृषणमैडयन् Bhāg. 10. 2. 25.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वृषणकच्छूः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषणकच्छूः
वृषण + -कच्छूः <i>f.</i> ulceration of the scrotum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषणश्वः|वृषणश्व
वृषणश्वः A horse of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषणी
वृषणी A mare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषन्
वृषन् <i>m.</i> [वृष्-कनिन्]<BR>—1 A bull.<BR>—2 The sign <i>Taurus</i> of the zodiac.<BR>—3 The chief of a class; प्राचेतसो मुनिवृषा प्रथमः कवीनाम् Mv. 1. 7.<BR>—4 A stallion, horse.<BR>—5 Pain, sorrow.<BR>—6 Insensibility to pain.<BR>—7 N. of Indra; वृषेव सीतां तदवग्रहक्षताम् Ku. 5. 61, 80; R. 10. 52, 17. 77;<BR> न ववर्ष वृषा तदा Śiva B. 8. 53.<BR>—8 N. of Karṇa.<BR>—9 Of Agni.<BR>—10 Of Soma.<BR>—11 A male, any male animal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषभः|वृषभ
वृषभः [वृष्-अभच् किच्च Uṇ. 3. 122]<BR>—1 A bull.<BR>—2 Any male animal.<BR>—3 Anything best or eminent of its class (at the end of comp.); द्विजवृषभः<BR> Ratn. 1. 5; किं नास्ति त्वयि सत्यमात्यवृषभे यस्मिन् करोमि स्पृहाम् 4. 20.<BR>—4 The sign <i>Taurus</i> of the zodiac.<BR>—5 A kind of drug; cf. ऋषभ.<BR>—6 An elephantʼs ear.<BR>—7 The orifice or hollow of the ear.<BR>—8 Justice (धर्म personified); Mb. 12. 43. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषभा
वृषभः + .{@-भा@} N. of the three lunar mansions (viz. of मघा, पूर्व-फल्गुनी,<BR> and उत्तर-फल्गुनी).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वृषभेक्षणः, वृषभकेतुः, वृषभगतिः, वृषभध्वजः, वृषभयानम्, वृषभषोडशा, वृषभस्कन्ध<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1493-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वृषभेक्षणः|वृषभेक्षण
