वेतसवृत्ति
वेतसः + -वृत्ति <i>a.</i> pliant like a reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेतसी
