वेतालः|वेताल
वेतालः<BR>—1 A kind of ghost, a goblin, vampire; particularly a ghost occupying<BR> a dead body; नाहमात्मनाशाय वेतालोत्थापनं करिष्यामि ‘I shall not raise a devil for my own destruction’<BR>; Māl. 5. 23; Śi. 20. 60.<BR>—2 A doorkeeper.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वेतालपञ्चविंशतिः, वेतालपञ्चविंशतिका, वेतालसाधनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1495-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

