वेशधारिन्
वेशः + -धारिन् <i>a.</i> disguised. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a hypocrite, false ascetic.<BR>—2 an actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेशनारी
