वेशवत्|वेशवन्त्
वेशवत्<BR>—1 Living on the wages of prostitutes; see वेशः (9); Ms. 4. 84 (com.).<BR>—2 The keeper of a brothel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1498-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

