वेश्यम् + -कामिनी, -स्त्री a prostitute, harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेश्या
वेश्या A harlot, prostitute, courtezan, concubine; त्वं वापीव लतेव<BR> नौरिव जनं वेश्यासि सर्वं भज Mk. 1. 32; Me. 37; Y. 1. 141; पतिव्रता<BR> चैकपत्नी द्वितीये कुलटा स्मृता । तृतीये वृषली ज्ञेया चतुर्थे पुंश्चली<BR> स्मृता । वेश्या च पञ्चमे षष्ठे जुङ्गी च सप्तमेऽष्टमे । Brav. P.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वेश्याचार्यः, वेश्याश्रयः, वेश्यागमनम्, वेश्यागृहम्, वेश्याजनः, वेश्यापणः, वेश्यापतिः, वेश्यापुत्रः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेश्याचार्यः|वेश्याचार्य|वेश्याचार्य्य|वेश्याचार्य्यः
वेश्या + -आचार्यः<BR>—1 the master or keeper of prostitutes.<BR>—2 a pimp.<BR>—3 a catamite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेश्याश्रयः|वेश्याश्रय
वेश्या + -आश्रयः habitation of harlots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेश्यागमनम्
वेश्या + -गमनम् debauchery, whoring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेश्यागृहम्
वेश्या + -गृहम् a brothel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेश्याजनः|वेश्याजन
वेश्या + -जनः a harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेश्यापणः|वेश्यापण
वेश्या + -पणः the wages given to a prostitute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेश्यापतिः|वेश्यापति
वेश्या + -पतिः a paramour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेश्यापुत्रः|वेश्यापुत्र
वेश्या + -पुत्रः a bastard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेश्वरः|वेश्वर
वेश्वरः A mule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष|वेषः
वेष See वेश.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेषवारः|वेषवार
वेषवारः See वेशवारः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेषणम्
वेषणम् Occupation, possession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्ट्
वेष्ट् €1 Ā. (वेष्टते)<BR>—1 To surround, enclose, encompass, envelop.<BR>—2 To wind or twist round.<BR>—3 To dress. ━<i>Caus.</i> (वेष्टयति-ते)<BR>—1 To surround &c.<BR>—2 To blockade. ━<i>With</i> {@आ@} to fold, tie, bind; तृणैरावेष्टपते<BR> रज्जुर्यया नागोऽपि वध्यते Pt. 1. 331.<BR>━{@परि, सम्@} to fold together, clasp or wind round; प्रायेण भूमिपतयः<BR> प्रमदा लताश्च यत् पार्श्वतो भवति तत् परिवेष्टयन्ति Pt. 1. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टः|वेष्ट
वेष्टः [वेष्ट्-घञ् अच् वा]<BR>—1 Surrounding, enclosing.<BR>—2 An enclosure, a fence.<BR>—3 A turban.<BR>—4 Gum, resin, exudation.<BR>—5 Turpentine.<BR>—6 A tooth-hole.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टम्
वेष्टः + .{@-ष्टम्@} the sky.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वेष्टवंशः, वेष्टसारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टवंशः|वेष्टवंश
वेष्टः + -वंशः a kind of bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टसारः|वेष्टसार
वेष्टः + -सारः turpentine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टकः|वेष्टक|वेष्टकं
वेष्टकः [वेष्ट्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 An enclosure, a fence.<BR>—2 A pumpkin-gourd.<BR>—3 (In gram.) Putting a word before and after इति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टकम्
वेष्टकः + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A turban.<BR>—2 A wrapper, mantle.<BR>—3 Gum, exudation.<BR>—4 Turpentine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टनम्
वेष्टनम् [वेष्ट्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Encompassing, encircling, surrounding; अङ्गुलिवेष्टनम् ‘a finger-ring’.<BR>—2 Coiling round, twisting round; भोगिवेष्टनमार्गेषु चन्दनानां समर्पितम् R. 4. 48.<BR>—3 An envelope, a wrapper, cover, covering, case; औशीरम् वेष्टनम् Mb. 12. 60. 32.<BR>—4 A turban, tiara; अस्पृष्टालकवेष्टनौ R. 1. 42; शिरसा वेष्टनशोभिना 8. 12.<BR>—5 An enclosure, a fence; क्रीडाशैलः कनककदलीवेष्टनप्रेक्षणीयः Me. 79.<BR>—6 A girdle, zone.<BR>—7 A bandage.<BR>—8 The outer ear.<BR>—9 Bdellium.<BR>—10 A particular attitude in dancing.<BR>—11 Grasping, seizing.<BR>—12 A span.<BR>—13 A kind of weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टकः|वेष्टक|वेष्टकं
वेष्टकः, वेष्टनकः A particular position in copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टनकः|वेष्टनक
वेष्टकः, वेष्टनकः A particular position in copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टित|वेष्टितं|वेष्टितः
वेष्टित <i>p. p.</i> [वेष्ट्-क्त]<BR>—1 Surrounded, enclosed, encircled, enveloped.<BR>—2 Wrapped up, dressed.<BR>—3 Stopped, blocked, impeded.<BR>—4 Blockaded, invested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्टितम्
वेष्टित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Encircling, surrounding.<BR>—2 One of the attitudes of dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वेष्पः|वेष्प
