वेष्यः|वेष्य
वेष्पः, वेष्यः [विषेः पः Uṇ. 3. 23] Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

