वेहत्
वेहत् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A barren cow; उक्षाणं वेहतमनूनं नयन्तु Mb. 3. 197. 17.<BR>—2 (गर्भघातिनी) A cow that miscarries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

