वेह्ल्
वेह्ल् €1 P. (वेह्लते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वै
वै €1 P. (वायति)<BR>—1 To dry, be dried.<BR>—2 To be languid or weary, be exhausted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वै
वै <i>ind.</i> A particle of affirmation or certainty (indeed, truly,<BR> forsooth), but it is generally used as an expletive; आपो वै नरसूनवः<BR> Ms. 1. 10, 2. 231, 9. 49, 11. 78 &c. It is also said to be a vocative<BR> particle, and sometimes shows entreaty or persuasion (अनुनय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैंशतिक|वैंशतिकः
वैंशतिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Bought for twenty; P. V. 1. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकक्षम्
वैकक्षम् [विशेषेण कक्षति व्याप्नोति अण्]<BR>—1 A garland worn over one shoulder and under the other like the यज्ञोपवीत.<BR>—2 An upper garment, a mantle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

