वैकर्तनकुलम्
वैकर्तनः + -कुलम् the solar race.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकल्पम्
वैकल्पम्<BR>—1 Optionality.<BR>—2 Dubiousness, ambiguity.<BR>—3 Uncertainty, indecision.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकल्पिक|वैकल्पिकः
वैकल्पिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [विकल्पेन प्राप्तः तत्र भवो वा ठक्]<BR>—1 Optional.<BR>—2 Dubious, doubtful, uncertain, undecided.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकल्यम्
वैकल्यम् [विकलस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Defect, deficiency, imperfection; इदं तु वृत्तिवैकल्यात्त्यजतो धर्मनैपुणम् Ms. 10. 85.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">Page1500-1</a>]<BR>—2 Mutilation, being crippled or lame.<BR>—3 Incompetency.<BR>—4 Agitation, flurry, excitement.<BR>—5 Non-existence.<BR>—6 Weakness, imbecility; शक्तिवैकल्यनम्रस्य … तृणस्य च समा<BR> गतिः Ki. 11. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1499-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकारिक|वैकारिकः
वैकारिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Relating to modification.<BR>—2 Modifying, changing; सत्त्वेन चित्तं क्षेत्रज्ञे गुणैर्वैकारिकं परे<BR> Bhāg. 7. 12. 30.<BR>—3 Modified.<BR>—4 Changeable; एवं वैकारिकीं मायामयुक्ता वस्तु चक्षते Bhāg. 10. 73. 11.<BR>—5 Relating to Sattva (सात्त्विक); वैकारिकस्तैजसश्च तामसश्चेत्यहं<BR> त्रिधा Bhāg. 3. 5. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकारिकः|वैकारिक
वैकारिक + .{@-कः@} A class of deities; इन्द्रियाणि मनो बुद्धिः सह वैकारिकैर्नृप<BR> Bhāg. 11. 3. 15.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैकारिककालः, वैकारिकबन्धः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकारिककालः
वैकारिक + -कालः the time necessary for the formation of the foetus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकारिकबन्धः|वैकारिकबन्ध
वैकारिक + -बन्धः (in Sāṅkhya phil.) one of the three-fold forms of bondage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकार्यम्
वैकार्यम् Change, modification.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

