वैकालिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>{@वैकालीन@} <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to or occurring in the evening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

