वैकालिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>{@वैकालीन@} <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to or occurring in the evening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकालीन
वैकालिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>{@वैकालीन@} <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to or occurring in the evening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकालीनी
वैकालिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>{@वैकालीन@} <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to or occurring in the evening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकिङ्करः
वैकिङ्करः = विकिङ्करः = कालः Death; Mb. 13. 62. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकिर
वैकिर <i>a.</i> Percolated, trickled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकुण्ठ|वैकुंठ|वैकुंठः|वैकुण्ठः
वैकुण्ठ <i>a.</i> Unassailable (दुर्धर्ष); इन्द्रो वैकुण्ठोऽपराजिता<BR> सेनेति वा अहमेतमुपास Bṛ. Up. 2. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकुण्ठः|वैकुण्ठ|वैकुंठ|वैकुंठः
वैकुण्ठः<BR>—1 An epithet of Viṣṇu; मन्दं जहास वैकुण्ठो मोहयन्निव मायया<BR> Bhāg. 1. 8. 44.<BR>—2 Of Indra.<BR>—3 Holy basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकुण्ठम्
वैकुण्ठः + .{@-ण्ठम्@}<BR>—1 The heaven of Viṣṇu; ततो वैकुण्ठमगमद्भास्वरं तमसः परम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 88. 25.<BR>—2 Talc.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैकुण्ठचनुर्दशी, वैकुण्ठलोकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकुण्ठचनुर्दशी
वैकुण्ठः + -चनुर्दशी the fourteenth day of the bright half of Kārtika.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकुण्ठलोकः|वैकुण्ठलोक|वैकुंठलोक
वैकुण्ठः + -लोकः the world of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकुण्ठीय
वैकुण्ठीय Relating to वैकुण्ठ (Viṣṇu or his heaven); वैकुण्ठीयेऽत्र<BR> कण्ठे वसतु मम मतिः कुण्ठभावं विहाय Viṣṇupāda. S. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकृत|वैकृतं|वैकृतः
वैकृत <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Changed.<BR>—2 Modified.<BR>—3 Relating to Sattva (सात्त्विक); Bhāg. 11. 24. 8.<BR>—4 Disfigured; यदि मन्त्राङ्गहीनोऽयं यज्ञो भवति वैकृतः Mb. 12. 272. 10.<BR>—5 Not natural.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकृतम्
वैकृत + .{@-तम्@} [विकृतस्य भावः अण्]<BR>—1 Change, alteration, modification.<BR>—2 Aversion, disgust, loathing.<BR>—3 Change in state, appearance &c., disfigurement; उदडीयत वैकृतात्<BR> करग्रहजादस्य विकस्वरस्वरैः N. 2. 5; वैकृतं त्वग्निहोत्रे स लक्षयित्वा<BR> महातपाः Mb. 3. 137. 3.<BR>—4 A portent, any event foreboding evil; तत् प्रतीपपवनादि वैकृतं<BR> प्रेक्ष्य R. 11. 62.<BR>—5 Fraud, cheating (कपट); Mb. 3. 149. 15.<BR>—6 Agitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकृतः|वैकृत|वैकृतं
वैकृत + .{@-तः@} = अहंकारः q. v.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैकृतविवर्तः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकृतविवर्तः|वैकृतविवर्त
वैकृत + -विवर्तः a woeful plight, miserable condition, suffering; वैकृतविवर्तदारुणः Māl. 1. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकृतिक
वैकृतिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Changed, modified.<BR>—2 Belonging to a Vikṛti q. v. (in Sāṅkhya phil.); ततः प्राकृतिकः<BR> सर्गः सप्त वैकृतिकाश्च ये Bhāg. 12. 12. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैकृत्यम्
वैकृत्यम्<BR>—1 Change, alteration.<BR>—2 Woeful state, miserable plight.<BR>—3 Disgust.<BR>—4 An unnatural phenomenon.<BR>—5 Deterioration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैक्रान्तम्
वैक्रान्तम् A kind of gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैक्लवम्
वैक्लवम्, -वैक्लव्यम्<BR>—1 Confusion, agitation, bewilderment; despondency; Mb. 3. 160. 34.<BR>—2 Commotion, tumult.<BR>—3 Affliction, distress, grief; वैक्लव्यं मम तावदीदृशमिदं स्नेहादरण्यौकसः<BR> Ś. 4. 6; Ve. 5; Mk. 3; Māl. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैक्लव्यम्
वैक्लवम्, -वैक्लव्यम्<BR>—1 Confusion, agitation, bewilderment; despondency; Mb. 3. 160. 34.<BR>—2 Commotion, tumult.<BR>—3 Affliction, distress, grief; वैक्लव्यं मम तावदीदृशमिदं स्नेहादरण्यौकसः<BR> Ś. 4. 6; Ve. 5; Mk. 3; Māl. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैखरी
वैखरी<BR>—1 Articulate utterance, production of sound; see Malli. on Ku. 2. 17.<BR>—2 The faculty of speech; वैखरी सर्वविद्यासु प्रशस्ता Nārāyaṇapūrvatāp. Up. 5. 8.<BR>—3 Speech in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैखानस|वैखानसः
वैखानस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to a hermit, ascetic, monastic; वैखानसं<BR> किमनया व्रतमा प्रदानाद् व्यापाररोधि मदनस्य निषेवितव्यम् Ś. 1. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैखानसः|वैखानस
वैखानस + .{@-सः@}<BR>—1 An anchorite, a hermit (वानप्रस्थ);<BR>—2 a Brāhmaṇa in the third order of his religious life; संबद्धवैखानसकन्यकानि<BR> (तपोवनानि) R. 14. 28; वैखानसेभ्यः श्रुतरामवार्ताः Bk. 3. 46;<BR> Ms. 6. 21; Mb. 3. 114. 15.<BR>—3 A hermit born from the nails and hair of the god Brahman; Rām. 3. 6. 2<BR> (com. प्रजापतेर्नखलोमजाः वैखानसाः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैखारक
वैखारक <i>a.</i> Pungent and salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैगुण्यम्
वैगुण्यम् [विगुणस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Absence of qualities or attributes.<BR>—2 Absence of good qualities, a defect, fault, an imperfection.<BR>—3 Difference of properties, diversity, contrariety.<BR>—4 Inferiority, lowness.<BR>—5 Unskilfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैग्रहिक
वैग्रहिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Corporeal, bodily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैघटिकः|वैघटिक
वैघटिकः A jeweller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैघसिक
वैघसिक <i>a.</i> Feeding on the residue of food (a class of hermits); Mb. 14. 92. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैचक्षण्यम्
वैचक्षण्यम् Skill, cleverness, proficiency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैचित्त्यम्
वैचित्त्यम् Grief, mental distraction, sorrow; व्रजति विरहे वैचित्त्यं<BR> नः प्रसीदति संनिधौ Māl. 3. 1; केचित् प्रपद्य वैचित्त्यम् Śiva B. 14. 30;<BR> वैचित्त्योपचयादुच्चैरौचित्यमपचीयते 16. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैचित्रम्
वैचित्रम्, वैचित्र्यम् [विचित्रस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Variety, diversity.<BR>—2 Manifoldness.<BR>—3 Strangeness.<BR>—4 Strikingness; as in वाच्यवैचित्र्य K. P. 10.<BR>—5 Surprise.<BR>—6 Sorrow, despair.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैचित्रवीर्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैचित्र्यम्
वैचित्रम्, वैचित्र्यम् [विचित्रस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Variety, diversity.<BR>—2 Manifoldness.<BR>—3 Strangeness.<BR>—4 Strikingness; as in वाच्यवैचित्र्य K. P. 10.<BR>—5 Surprise.<BR>—6 Sorrow, despair.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैचित्रवीर्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैचित्रवीर्यः|वैचित्रवीर्य
वैचित्रम् + -वीर्यः N. of Dhṛtarāṣṭra; भो भो वैचित्रवीर्य त्वं कुरूणां<BR> कीर्तिवर्धन Bhāg. 10. 49. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैजननम्
वैजननम् The last month of pregnancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैजन्यम्
वैजन्यम् Solitude; परीक्ष्य वैजन्यं जनेषु निर्गतेषु Dk. 2. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैजयन्तः|वैजयन्त|वैजयंत|वैजयंतः
वैजयन्तः<BR>—1 The palace of Indra.<BR>—2 The banner of Indra.<BR>—3 A banner or flag in general; सवैजयन्तास्तु गजा गजारोहैः प्रचोदिताः<BR> Rām. 2. 89. 19.<BR>—4 A house.<BR>—5 N. of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैजयन्तिकः|वैजयन्तिक|वैजयंतिक|वैजयंतिकः
वैजयन्तिकः A standard bearer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैजयन्तिका
वैजयन्तिका<BR>—1 A banner, flag (fig. also); संचारिणीव देवस्य मकरकेतोर्जगाद्विजयवैजयन्तिका<BR> काप्यागतवती Māl. 1.<BR>—2 A kind of necklace of pearls.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1500-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैजयन्ती
वैजयन्ती<BR>—1 A banner, flag; स्तनपरिणाहविलासवैजयन्ती Māl. 3. 15; Śi. 18. 4;<BR> न ह्यनारुह्य नागेन्द्रं वैजयन्ती निपात्यते Śiva B. 4. 19.<BR>—2 An ensign.<BR>—3 A garland, necklace.<BR>—4 The necklace of Viṣṇu.<BR>—5 N. of a lexicon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैजात्यम्
वैजात्यम् [विजात-ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Difference of kind or species.<BR>—2 Difference of caste.<BR>—3 Strangeness.<BR>—4 Exclusion from caste.<BR>—5 Looseness, wantonness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैजिक|वैजिकं|वैजिकः
वैजिक <i>a.</i> See बैजिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैज्ञानिक|वैज्ञानिकः
वैज्ञानिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Clever, skilful, proficient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैडाल
वैडाल See बैडाल; यस्य धर्मध्वजो नित्यं शक्रध्वज इवोच्छ्रितः ।<BR> प्रच्छन्नानि च पापानि वैडालं नाम तद् व्रतम् ॥ वैडालव्रतिनः पापाः<BR> सर्वधर्मविनाशकाः । सद्यः पतन्ति पापेषु कर्मणस्तस्य तत् फलम् ॥ Kūrma P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैडूर्यम्
वैडूर्यम् A catʼs-eye gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैणः|वैण
वैणः A maker of bamboo-work; Y. 1. 162.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैणव|वैणवं|वैणवः
वैणव <i>a.</i> (-वी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वेणु-अण्] Made of or produced from a bamboo;<BR> वैणवीं धारयेद्यष्टिं सोदकं च कमण्डलुम् Ms. 4. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैणवः|वैणव|वैणवं
वैणव + .{@-वः@}<BR>—1 A bamboo-staff.<BR>—2 A worker in bamboo or wicker-work.<BR>—3 A flute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैणवी
वैणव + .{@-वी@} Bamboo-manna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैणवम्
वैणव + .{@-वम्@} The seed or fruit of the bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैणविकः|वैणविक
वैणविकः A piper, flute-player.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैणविन्
वैणविन् <i>m.</i> An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैणुकः|वैणुक|वैणुकं
