वैणुकम्
वैणुकः + .{@-कम्@} A goad; see वेणुक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैणिकः|वैणिक
वैणिकः<BR>—1 A lutanist; Śi. 10. 64.<BR>—2 The smell of faeces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतंसिकः|वैतंसिक
वैतंसिकः<BR>—1 A vendor of flesh.<BR>—2 A bird-catcher; यथा वैतंसिको युक्तो द्विजानां सदृशस्वनः Mb. 12. 103. 10, 3. 33. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतंसिकम्
