वैतत्यम्
वैतत्यम् Great extension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतथ्यम्
