वैतनिक|वैतनिकः
वैतनिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वेतनेन जीवति ठक्] Living on wages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतनिकः|वैतनिक
वैतनिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A hired labourer, labourer; P. IV. 4. 12.<BR>—2 A stipendiary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतरणिः|वैतरणि
वैतरणिः, -णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 N. of the river of hell; पश्यञ्जनं पतितं वैतरण्याम् Bhāg. 2. 2. 7.<BR>—2 N. of a river in the country of the Kaliṅgas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतरणी
वैतरणिः, -णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 N. of the river of hell; पश्यञ्जनं पतितं वैतरण्याम् Bhāg. 2. 2. 7.<BR>—2 N. of a river in the country of the Kaliṅgas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतस|वैतसः
वैतस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Pertaining to a cane.<BR>—2 Reedlike, <i>i. e.</i> yielding to a superior foe, bowing down to a stronger<BR> enemy; आत्मा संरक्षितः सुह्मैर्वृत्तिमाश्रित्य वैतसीम् R. 4. 35; बलीयसा<BR> समाक्रान्तो वैतसीं वृत्तिमाश्रयेत् Pt. 3. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतस्तिक
वैतस्तिक <i>a.</i> Span-long (an arrow); शरैर्वैतस्तिकै राजन् विव्याधासन्नवेधिभिः<BR> Mb. 7. 122. 60-61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतान
वैतान <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वितान-अण्] Sacrificial, sacred; वैतानास्त्वां<BR> वह्नयः पावयन्तु Ś. 4. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतानम्
वैतान + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 A sacrificial rite; तस्माद्वैतानकुशलो होता स्याद्वेदपारगः Ms. 11. 37;<BR> Mb. 12. 165. 22.<BR>—2 A sacrificial oblation.<BR>—3 A canopy; a number of canopies; Bhāg. 3. 23. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतानिक|वैतानिकः
