वैतानिकम्
वैतानिक + .{@-कम्@} A burnt offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतान्यम्
वैतान्यम् Despondency; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतालिकः|वैतालिक
वैतालिकः [विविधस्तालस्तेन व्यवहरति ठक्]<BR>—1 A bard, minstrel.<BR>—2 A magician, conjurer; especially, one who is a votary of Vetāla q. v.<BR>—3 The servant of a Vetāla.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतालिकम्
