वैतालिकव्रतम्
वैतालिकः + -व्रतम् the duty of a bard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैतृष्ण्यम्
वैतृष्ण्यम्<BR>—1 Quenching of thirst; आपः शुद्धा भूमिगता वैतृष्ण्यं यासु गोर्भवेत् Ms. 5. 128.<BR>—2 Freedom from desire, indiference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैत्तपाल्य
वैत्तपाल्य <i>a.</i> Relating to Kubera; Mb. 7. 201. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैत्रक|वैत्रकः
वैत्रक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), वैत्रकीय <i>a.</i><BR> Cany, reedy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

