वैदः|वैद
वैदः A wise man, learned man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदी
वैदः + .{@-दी@} The wife of a wise man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदग्धम्
वैदग्धम्, वैदग्धी, वैदग्ध्यम्<BR>—1 Skill, dexterity, proficiency, cleverness; अहो वैदग्ध्यम् Māl. 1;<BR> प्रबन्धविन्यासवैदग्ध्यनिधिः Vās.; Śi. 4. 16; Bh. 2. 18.<BR>—2 Skill in arrangement, beauty; वैदग्ध्यं जहति कपोलकुङ्कुमानि Māl. 1. 37.<BR>—3 Shrewdness, smartness, cunningness; Ratn. 2.<BR>—4 Wit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदग्धी
वैदग्धम्, वैदग्धी, वैदग्ध्यम्<BR>—1 Skill, dexterity, proficiency, cleverness; अहो वैदग्ध्यम् Māl. 1;<BR> प्रबन्धविन्यासवैदग्ध्यनिधिः Vās.; Śi. 4. 16; Bh. 2. 18.<BR>—2 Skill in arrangement, beauty; वैदग्ध्यं जहति कपोलकुङ्कुमानि Māl. 1. 37.<BR>—3 Shrewdness, smartness, cunningness; Ratn. 2.<BR>—4 Wit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदग्ध्यम्
वैदग्धम्, वैदग्धी, वैदग्ध्यम्<BR>—1 Skill, dexterity, proficiency, cleverness; अहो वैदग्ध्यम् Māl. 1;<BR> प्रबन्धविन्यासवैदग्ध्यनिधिः Vās.; Śi. 4. 16; Bh. 2. 18.<BR>—2 Skill in arrangement, beauty; वैदग्ध्यं जहति कपोलकुङ्कुमानि Māl. 1. 37.<BR>—3 Shrewdness, smartness, cunningness; Ratn. 2.<BR>—4 Wit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदर्भः|वैदर्भ|वैदर्भं
वैदर्भः [विदर्भ-अण्]<BR>—1 A king of Vidarbha.<BR>—2 A gum-boil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदर्भम्
वैदर्भः + .{@-र्भम्@} Crafty, ambiguous speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदर्भी
वैदर्भः + .{@-र्भी@}<BR>—1 N. of Damayantī; धन्यासि वैदर्भि गुणैरुदारैः N. 3. 116.<BR>—2 Of Rukmiṇī.<BR>—3 A particular style of composition; thus defined in S. D.:− माधुर्यव्यञ्जकैर्वर्णै<BR> रचना ललितात्मिका । अवृत्तिरल्पवृत्तिर्वा वैदर्भी रीतिरिष्यते ॥ 626.<BR> Daṇḍin very minutely distinguishes this style from the <i>Gaudiya</i>;<BR> see Kāv. 1. 41-53. Alaṃkāraśekhara quotes Ku. 5. 4 as an illustration.<BR>—4 N. of the wife of Agastya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदल|वैदलं|वैदलः
वैदल (-ली <i>f.</i>)<BR> [विदलस्य विकारः अण्] Made of wicker or cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदलः|वैदल|वैदलं
वैदल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A kind of cake.<BR>—2 Any leguminous vegetable or grain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदलम्
वैदल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 A shallow cup of a religious mendicant.<BR>—2 Any seat or vessel of wickerwork; चेलवच्चर्मणां शुद्धिर्वैदलानां<BR> तथैव च Ms. 5. 119, 6. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदिक|वैदिकः
वैदिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [वेदं-वेत्त्यधीते वा ठञ् वेदेषु विहितः ठक् वा]<BR>—1 Derived from or conformable to the Vedas, Vedic.<BR>—2 Sacred, scriptural, holy; अपेक्ष्यते साधुजनेन वैदिकी श्मशानशूलस्य<BR> न यूपसत्क्रिया Ku. 5. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदिकः|वैदिक
वैदिक + .{@-कः@} A Brāhmaṇa well-versed in the Vedas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदिकम्
वैदिक + .{@-कम्@} A Vedic passage; अमेध्ये वा पतेन्मत्तो वैदिकं वाप्युदाहरेत् Ms. 11. 96.<BR>—2 A Vedic precept; Mb.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैदिकपाशः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदिकपाशः|वैदिकपाश
वैदिक + -पाशः a smatterer in Veda, one possessing an imperfect knowledge<BR> of the Vedas; P. V. 3. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1501-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदुरिकम्
वैदुरिकम् A maxim of Vidura (विदुरनीति); अथाह तन्मन्त्रदृशां<BR> वरीयान् यन्मन्त्रिणो वैदुरिकं वदन्ति Bhāg. 3. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदुषी
वैदुषी, वैदुष्यम् Learning, wisdom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदुष्यम्
वैदुषी, वैदुष्यम् Learning, wisdom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदूर्य|वैदूर्य्य|वैदूर्य्यं
वैदूर्य <i>a.</i> (-री or -र्यी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Brought from, or produced in, Vidūra.<BR>—2 Eminent (श्रेष्ठ); को न्वयं नरवैदूर्यः Bhāg. 10. 55. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदूर्यम्
वैदूर्य + .{@-र्यम्@} [विदूरे गिरौ भवं श्यञ्] <i>Lapis lazuli</i>; Ku. 7. 10;<BR> Śi. 3. 45; भुवि वैदूर्यनिकाशशाद्वलायाम् Bu. C. 5. 9; (the catʼs-eye<BR> gem; cf. मार्जारेक्षणपिङ्गलच्छविजुष् Rājanighaṇṭu); स्थाल्यां वैदूर्यमय्यां<BR> पचति तिलकणानिन्धनैश्चन्दनाद्यैः Bh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेशिक|वैदेशिकः
वैदेशिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [विदेश-ठञ्] Belonging to another country, foreign, exotic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेशिकः|वैदेशिक
वैदेशिक + .{@-कः@} A stranger, foreigner; वैदेशिकोऽस्मीति पृच्छामि कः पुनरसौ जामाता U. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेश्यम्
वैदेश्यम् Foreignness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेहः|वैदेह
वैदेहः [विदेह अण्]<BR>—1 A king of Videha; जनको ह वैदेहो बहुदक्षिणेन यज्ञेनेजे Bṛ. Up. 3. 1. 1.<BR>—2 An inhabitant of Videha.<BR>—3 A trader by caste.<BR>—4 The son of a Vaiśya by a Brāhmaṇa woman; Ms. 10 11.<BR>—5 An attendant on the womenʼs apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेहाः
वैदेहः + .{@-हाः@} (<i>m.</i> pl.) The people of Videha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेही
वैदेहः + .{@-ही@}<BR>—1 N. of Sītā; वैदेहिबन्धोर्हृदयं विदद्रे R. 14. 33 (the final<BR> vowel in वैदेही being shortened.)<BR>—2 The wife of a merchant.<BR>—3 A sort of pigment (रोचना)<BR>—4 Turmeric.<BR>—5 A cow.<BR>—6 Long pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेहकः|वैदेहक
वैदेहकः<BR>—1 A trader; गृहपतिवैदेहकतापसव्यञ्जनाः Kau. A. 2.<BR>—2 = वैदेह (4) q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैदेहिकः|वैदेहिक
वैदेहिकः<BR>—1 A merchant.<BR>—2 A man of the Vaideha caste; Ms. 10. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्य|वैद्यः
वैद्य <i>a.</i> (-द्यी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Relating to the Vedas, spiritual.<BR>—2 Relating to medicine, medical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्यः|वैद्य
वैद्य + .{@-द्यः@} [विद्या अस्त्यस्य अण्]<BR>—1 A learned man, scholar, doctor.<BR>—2 A medical man, physician; वैद्ययत्नपरिभाविनं गदं न प्रदीप<BR> इव वायुमत्यगात् R. 19. 53; वैद्यानामातुरः श्रेयान् Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 A man of the medical caste, supposed to be one of the mixed classes;<BR> (the offspring of a Brāhmaṇa by a Vaiśya woman). Cf. Mb. 13. 49. 9.<BR>—4 A man of a lower mixed tribe (the offspring of a Śūdra father by<BR> Vaiśya mother).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैद्यक्रिया, वैद्यनाथः, वैद्यबन्धुः, वैद्यमातृ, वैद्यसिंहा, वैद्यविद्या<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्यक्रिया
वैद्य + -क्रिया a doctorʼs profession, practice of medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्यनाथः|वैद्यनाथ
वैद्य + -नाथः<BR>—1 N. of Dhanvantari.<BR>—2 of Śiva.<BR>—3 N. of a country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्यबन्धुः|वैद्यबन्धु
वैद्य + -बन्धुः Cassia Fistula (Mar. बाहवा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्यमातृ
वैद्य + -मातृ, -सिंहा Gendarussa Vulgaris (Mar. अडूळसा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्यसिंहा
वैद्य + -मातृ, -सिंहा Gendarussa Vulgaris (Mar. अडूळसा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्यविद्या
वैद्य + -विद्या the science of medicine; also वैद्यशास्त्रम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्यकः|वैद्यक|वैद्यकं
वैद्यकः A doctor, physician.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्यकम्
वैद्यकः + .{@-कम्@} The science of medicine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्युत
वैद्युत <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> [विद्युत इदम् अण्] Belonging to or proceeding<BR> from lightning, electric; वृक्षस्य वैद्युत इवाग्निरुपस्थितोऽयम् V. 5. 16; U. 5. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्युतम्
वैद्युत + .{@-तम्@} The fire or lustre of lightning; पिशङ्गवासा वनमालया<BR> बभौ घनो यथार्कोडुपचापवैद्युतैः Bhāg. 1. 11. 27, 10. 36. 33.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैद्युताग्निः, वैद्युतानलः, वैद्युतवह्निः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्युताग्निः|वैद्युताग्नि
वैद्युत + -अग्निः, -अनलः, -वह्निः the fire of lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्युतानलः|वैद्युतानल
वैद्युत + -अग्निः, -अनलः, -वह्निः the fire of lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्युतवह्निः
वैद्युत + -अग्निः, -अनलः, -वह्निः the fire of lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैद्योत
वैद्योत <i>a.</i> Angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैध|वैधः
वैध <i>a.</i> (-धी <i>f.</i>), वैधिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [विधित आगतः अण् ठक् वा]<BR>—1 Conformable to rule, settled, fixed, ritual; वैधी विचित्रा भवति<BR> प्रवृत्तिः Rām. Ch. 6. 57.<BR>—2 Legal, lawful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधी
वैध <i>a.</i> (-धी <i>f.</i>), वैधिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [विधित आगतः अण् ठक् वा]<BR>—1 Conformable to rule, settled, fixed, ritual; वैधी विचित्रा भवति<BR> प्रवृत्तिः Rām. Ch. 6. 57.<BR>—2 Legal, lawful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधिक
वैध <i>a.</i> (-धी <i>f.</i>), वैधिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [विधित आगतः अण् ठक् वा]<BR>—1 Conformable to rule, settled, fixed, ritual; वैधी विचित्रा भवति<BR> प्रवृत्तिः Rām. Ch. 6. 57.<BR>—2 Legal, lawful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधिकी
वैध <i>a.</i> (-धी <i>f.</i>), वैधिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [विधित आगतः अण् ठक् वा]<BR>—1 Conformable to rule, settled, fixed, ritual; वैधी विचित्रा भवति<BR> प्रवृत्तिः Rām. Ch. 6. 57.<BR>—2 Legal, lawful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधर्म्यम्
वैधर्म्यम्<BR>—1 Dissimilarity, difference.<BR>—2 Difference of characteristic qualities.<BR>—3 Difference of duty or obligation.<BR>—4 Contrariety.<BR>—5 Unlawfulness, impropriety, injustice.<BR>—6 Heterodoxy; शप्तो ब्रह्मर्षिणा तेन वैधर्म्ये सहिते कृते Rām. 7. 81. 19.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैधर्म्यसमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधर्म्यसमः|वैधर्म्यसम
वैधर्म्यम् + -समः (in logic) a fallacy based on dissimilarity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधवः|वैधव
वैधवः N. of Budha. ━<i>a.</i> Relating to the moon; कलाकलापं<BR> किल वैधवं वमन् N. 1. 96.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधवेयः|वैधवेय
