वैधव्यम्
वैधव्यम् Widowhood; नववैधव्यमसह्यवेदनम् Ku. 4. 1; M. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधस
वैधस <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Composed by Brahmā.<BR>—2 Derived from fate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधात्रः|वैधात्र
