वैधुरी
वैधुरी Adversity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधुर्यम्
वैधुर्यम्<BR>—1 Bereavement.<BR>—2 Agitation, tremor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधृतम्
वैधृतम्, वैधृति <i>f.</i> N. of a particular position of the<BR> sun and moon (योग), considered as very inauspicious and malignant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधृति|वैधृतिः
वैधृतम्, वैधृति <i>f.</i> N. of a particular position of the<BR> sun and moon (योग), considered as very inauspicious and malignant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधृतिः|वैधृति
वैधृतिः<BR>—1 See वैधृतम्.<BR>—2 The Yoga star of the 27th lunar mansion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधेय|वैधेयः
वैधेय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 According to rule, prescribed.<BR>—2 Foolish, silly, stupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैधेयः|वैधेय
