वैनत्यम्
वैनत्यम् Humble demeanour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैनयिक|वैनयिकः
वैनयिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Pertaining to modesty, decorum, moral conduct, or discipline; आगता<BR> त्वामियं बुद्धिः स्वजा वैनयिकी च या Rām. 2. 112. 16.<BR>—2 Enforcing proper conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैनयिकः|वैनयिक
वैनयिक + .{@-कः@} A war-carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैनायक
वैनायक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Belonging to Gaṇeśa; वैनायक्यश्चिरं वो वदनविधुतयः<BR> पान्तु चीत्कारबत्यः Māl. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैनायिकः|वैनायिक
वैनायिकः<BR>—1 The doctrines of a Buddhist school of philosophy.<BR>—2 A follower of that school.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैनाशिकः|वैनाशिक|वैनाशिकं
वैनाशिकः<BR>—1 A slave.<BR>—2 A spider.<BR>—3 An astrologer.<BR>—4 The doctrines of the Buddhists.<BR>—5 A follower of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">Page1503-1</a>]<BR> those doctrines.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैनाशिकम्
वैनाशिकः + .{@-कम्@} The twenty-third asterism from that under which any one is born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1502-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैनीतक|वैनीतकः
वैनीतक See विनीतक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैपरीत्यम्
वैपरीत्यम्<BR>—1 Contrariety, opposition.<BR>—2 Inconsistency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैपादिकम्
वैपादिकम् A kind of leprosy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैपुल्यम्
वैपुल्यम्<BR>—1 Spaciousness, largeness.<BR>—2 Plenty, abundance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैप्रतिसम
वैप्रतिसम <i>a.</i> Unmatched; not equalled; Mb. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैफल्यम्
वैफल्यम् Uselessness, fruitlessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैबोधिकः|वैबोधिक
वैबोधिकः<BR>—1 A watchman.<BR>—2 Especially, one who awakens sleepers by announcing the time; वैबोधिकध्वनिविभावितपश्चिमार्धा<BR> (रात्रिः) Ki. 9. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैभवम्
वैभवम्<BR>—1 Greatness, glory, grandeur, magnificence, splendour, wealth.<BR>—2 Power, might; महतां हि धैर्यमविचिन्त्यवैभवम् Ki. 12. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैभाजिकम्
वैभाजिकम् Dividing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैभातिक
वैभातिक <i>a.</i> Matutinal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैभावर
वैभावर <i>a.</i> Nocturnal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैभाषिक
वैभाषिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Optional.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैभ्रम्
वैभ्रम् The heaven of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैभ्राजम्
वैभ्राजम् N. of a celestial grove or garden; आक्रीड इव वैभ्राजे<BR> विवस्वानप्सरोवृतः Bu. C. 4. 28 (cf. देवोद्यानानि वैभ्राजम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैमत्यम्
वैमत्यम्<BR>—1 Dissension, dissent; वैमत्यं परिहर्तव्यं कर्तव्यं मदुदीरितम्<BR> Śiva B. 29. 84.<BR>—2 Dislike, aversion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैमनस्यम्
वैमनस्यम्<BR>—1 Distraction of mind, mental depression, sorrow, sadness; Ś. 6.<BR>—2 Sickness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

