वैमुक्तम्
वैमुक्तम् Liberation, emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैमुख्यम्
वैमुख्यम्<BR>—1 Turning away the face, flight, retreat; वैमुख्यं चकृमेत्युच्चैरूचुर्दशमुखान्तिके Bk. 9. 15.<BR>—2 Aversion, disgust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

