वैमेयः Exchange, barter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैयग्रम्
वैयग्रम्, वैयग्रव्यम्<BR>—1 Distraction, perplexity, bewilderment.<BR>—2 Exclusive devotion, complete absorption in any object; तदनुगुणविधौ<BR> यच्च वैयग्र्यमासीत् Mv. 7. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैयग्रव्यम्
वैयग्रम्, वैयग्रव्यम्<BR>—1 Distraction, perplexity, bewilderment.<BR>—2 Exclusive devotion, complete absorption in any object; तदनुगुणविधौ<BR> यच्च वैयग्र्यमासीत् Mv. 7. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैयर्थ्यम्
वैयर्थ्यम् Uselessness, unproductiveness; सखे वैयर्थ्यमिव चक्षुषः U. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैयधिकरण्यम्
वैयधिकरण्यम् The state of being in different case-relations or<BR> positions; see व्यधिकरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैयवहारिक
वैयवहारिक <i>a.</i> Conventional, usual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैयाकरण|वैयाकरणः
वैयाकरण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [व्याकरणं वेत्त्यधीते वा अण्] Grammatical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैयाकरणः|वैयाकरण
वैयाकरण + .{@-णः@} A grammarian; वैयाकरणकिरातादपशब्दमृगाः क्व यान्तु<BR> संत्रस्ताः Subhāṣ.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैयाकरणखसूचिः, वैयाकरणपाशः, वैयाकरणभार्यः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

