वैयाकरण + -खसूचिः (a grammarian who merely pierces the air with a needle)<BR> a poor grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैयाकरणपाशः|वैयाकरणपाश
वैयाकरण + -पाशः a bad grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

