वैरम् + -आनृण्यम्, -उद्धारः, -निर्यातनम्, -प्रतिक्रिया, -प्रतीकारः, -यातना, -शुद्धिः <i>f.</i>, {@-साधनम्@}<BR> requital of enmity, taking revenge, retaliation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

