वैरायते
वैरायते Den. Ā. To act inimically, become hostile towards, contend with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1503-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैरायितम्
वैरायितम् Hostility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैरक्तम्
वैरक्तम्, -क्त्यम्<BR> [विरक्तस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Indifference to worldly attachments, absence of desire.<BR>—2 Displeasure, dislike, aversion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैरक्त्यम्
वैरक्तम्, -क्त्यम्<BR> [विरक्तस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Indifference to worldly attachments, absence of desire.<BR>—2 Displeasure, dislike, aversion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैरङ्गिकः|वैरङ्गिक|वैरंगिकः
वैरङ्गिकः [विरङ्गं विरागं नित्यमर्हति ठक्] One who has subdued<BR> all his passions and desires, an ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैरल्यम्
वैरल्यम्<BR>—1 Scarceness, rareness.<BR>—2 Looseness.<BR>—3 Fineness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैरागम्
