वैरागिकः|वैरागिक
वैरागिकः, -वैरागिन् <i>m.</i><BR> An ascetic who has subdued all his passions and desires.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैरागिन्
वैरागिकः, -वैरागिन् <i>m.</i><BR> An ascetic who has subdued all his passions and desires.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैराग्यम्
वैराग्यम् [विरागस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Absence of wordly desires or passions, indifference to the world, asceticism;<BR> अभ्यासेन च कौन्तेय वैराग्येण च गृह्यते Bg. 6. 35, 13. 8.<BR>—2 Dissatisfaction, displeasure, discontent; कामं प्रकृतिवैराग्यं<BR> सद्यः शमयितुं क्षमः R. 17. 55.<BR>—3 Aversion, dislike.<BR>—4 Grief, sorrow.<BR>—5 Change or loss of colour.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: वैराग्यशतकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैराग्यशतकम्
वैराग्यम् + -शतकम् N. of a Bhartṛhariʼs work (one among the शतकत्रयी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैराज|वैराजः
वैराज <i>a.</i> (-जी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Belonging to Brahman; वैराजा नाम ते लोकास्तैजसाः<BR> सन्तु ते शिवाः U. 2. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैराजः|वैराज
वैराज + .{@-जः@} Patronymic of Puruṣa; वैराजः पुरुषो योऽसौ भगवान् धारणाश्रयः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 1. 25, 11. 3. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैराजम्
वैराज + .{@-जम्@} N. of a Sāman; वैराजमृतुषु प्रोतम् Ch. Up. 2. 16. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैराज्यम्
वैराज्यम् Extended sovereignty; Ait. Br.; Bhāg. 10. 83. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैराट|वैराटः
वैराट <i>a.</i> (-टी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [विराटस्येदम् अण्]<BR>—1 Belonging to Virāṭa.<BR>—2 Woundless; वैराटपृष्ठमुक्षाणम् Mb. 13. 79. 21 (com. राटं क्षतं<BR> विगतं राटं यस्मात्तद्विराटं स्वार्थे तद्धितः); (fig.) old (वृद्ध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैराटः|वैराट
वैराट + .{@-टः@} A kind of earth-worm (इन्द्रगोप).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1504-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वैरिञ्च्यः|वैरिञ्च्य
