वैषम्यम्
वैषम्यम् [विषमस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Unevenness.<BR>—2 Roughness, harshness.<BR>—3 Inequality.<BR>—4 Injustice.<BR>—5 Difficulty, misery, calamity.<BR>—6 Solitariness.<BR>—7 An error, mistake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1506-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

