वोलः|वोल|वोलं
वोलः Gum-myrrh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1506-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वोलकः|वोलक
वोलकः A whirlpool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1506-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वोल्लाहः|वोल्लाह
