वोहित्थः|वोहित्थ|वोहित्थं
वोहित्थः A raft, boat; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1506-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वौद्ध|वौद्धं
