वौषट्
वौषट् <i>ind.</i> An exclamation or formula used in offering an oblation<BR> to the gods or Manes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1506-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्य|व्यः
व्य A technical term for indeclinables such as नि, चित् &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यः|व्य
व्यः A cover, veil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यंशकः|व्यंशक
व्यंशकः A mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यंशुक|व्यंशुकः
व्यंशुक <i>a.</i> Undressed, naked; व्यंशुकस्फुटमुखीमतिजिह्मां व्रीडया<BR> नववधूमिव लोकः (पश्यति) Ki. 9. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यंस्
व्यंस् €10 U.<BR>—1 To divide, distribute.<BR>—2 To foil, ward off.<BR>—3 To deceive, cheat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यंस
व्यंस <i>a.</i> Broad-shouldered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यंसकः|व्यंसक
व्यंसकः A rogue, cheat; as in मयूरव्यंसकः ‘a roguish peacock’,<BR> ‘a rogue of a peacock’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यंसनम्
व्यंसनम्<BR>—1 Cheating, deceiving.<BR>—2 Distributing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यंसित|व्यंसितः
व्यंसित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Cheated.<BR>—2 Defeated; व्यंसितो व्रीडितो राजन्नाजगाम स कुण्डिनम् Mb. 5. 158. 14.<BR>—3 Made ineffective; व्यंसिता चाप्युपायेन शक्रदत्ता मयाऽनघ Mb. 7. 181. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्षः|व्यक्ष
व्यक्षः The equator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्कुश
व्यङ्कुश <i>a.</i> Unrestrained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यग्र|व्यग्रः
व्यग्र <i>a.</i> [विगतमग्रं यस्य]<BR>—1 Bewildered, perplexed, distracted; तं व्यग्रचक्रं दितिपुत्राधमेन<BR> Bhāg. 3. 19. 6.<BR>—2 Alarmed, frightened.<BR>—3 Eagerly or intently occupied (with loc., instr. or in comp.); स<BR> राजककुदव्यग्रपाणिभिः पार्श्ववर्तिभिः R. 17. 27; Mv. 1. 13, 4. 28; Ku. 7. 2;<BR> U. 1. 23; Bv. 1. 123; आरभन्तेऽल्पमेवाज्ञाः कामं व्यग्रा भवन्ति<BR> च Śi. 2. 79.<BR>—4 Being in motion (as a wheel).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यग्रः|व्यग्र
व्यग्र + .{@-ग्रः@} N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्ग|व्यंग|व्यङ्गः
व्यङ्ग <i>a.</i> [विगतमङ्गं यस्य]<BR>—1 Bodiless.<BR>—2 Wanting a limb, deformed, mutilated, maimed, crippled.<BR>—3 Ill-arranged.<BR>—4 Lame.<BR>—5 Having no wheels.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्गः|व्यङ्ग|व्यंग
व्यङ्ग + .{@-ङ्गः@}<BR>—1 A cripple.<BR>—2 A frog.<BR>—3 Dark spots on the cheek; क्रोधायासप्रकुपितो वायुः पित्तेन संयुतः ।<BR> मुखमागत्य सहसा मण्डलं विसृजत्यतः । नीरूजं तनुकं श्यावं मुखे<BR> व्यङ्गं तमादिशेत् Mādh. N.<BR>—4 Steel.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यङ्गार्थः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्गार्थः|व्यङ्गार्थ
व्यङ्ग + -अर्थः suggested or implied sense; cf. व्यङ्गय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्गयति
व्यङ्गयति Den. P. To mutilate, cripple, maim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्गिता
व्यङ्गिता Mutilation; विहिता व्यङ्गिता तेषामपराधे महत्यपि Pt. 1. 201.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्गुलम्
व्यङ्गुलम् An extremely small measure of length equal to one-sixtieth<BR> part of an <i>aṅgula</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्गार
व्यङ्गार <i>a.</i> Having no fire; विधूमे न्यस्तमुसले व्यङ्गारे भुक्तवज्जने ।<BR> अतीतपात्रसंचारे भिक्षां लिप्सेत वै मुनिः ॥ Mb. 12. 278. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्ग्य|व्यंग्य|व्यङ्ग्यः
व्यङ्ग्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Indicated by implication, indicated by covert or indirect allusion.<BR>—2 Suggested (as sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्ग्यम्
व्यङ्ग्य + .{@-ङ्ग्यम्@} Suggested sense, insinuation, the meaning hinted at (opp.<BR> वाच्य ‘the primary or expressed meaning’, and लक्ष्य ‘the secondary or indicated meaning’<BR>);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">Page1507-2</a>]<BR> इदमुत्तममतिशयिनि व्यङ्गपे वाच्याद् ध्वनिर्बुधैः कथितः K. P. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यङ्ग्योक्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यङ्ग्योक्तिः|व्यङ्ग्योक्ति
व्यङ्ग्य + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i> covert expression, insinuation, innuendo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यच्
व्यच् €6 P. (विचति, <i>pass.</i> विच्यते)<BR>—1 To cheat, deceive, trick.<BR>—2 To surround, encompass, pervade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यचस्
व्यचस् <i>n.</i> Ved. Expanse, vastness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यजः|व्यज
व्यजः A fan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यजनम्
व्यजनम् A fan; निर्वाते व्यजनम् H. 2. 165; R. 8. 40, 10. 62;<BR> cf. बालव्यजन.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यजनक्रिया, व्यजनचामरम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यजनक्रिया
व्यजनम् + -क्रिया the act of fanning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यजनचामरम्
व्यजनम् + -चामरम् a <i>chowrie</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्ज्|व्यंज्
व्यञ्ज् €7 P.<BR>—1 To reveal, manifest, show; अकिंचनत्वं मखजं व्यनक्ति R. 5. 16;<BR> Śi. 1. 26.<BR>—2 To indicate, denote.<BR>—3 Ved. To anoint thoroughly.<BR>—4 Ved. To decorate, adorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्त|व्यक्तः
व्यक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Manifested, displayed.<BR>—2 Developed, created; व्यक्तो व्यक्तेतरश्चासि प्राकाम्यं ते विभूतिषु Ku. 2. 11.<BR>—3 Evident, manifest, clear, plain, distinct, clearly visible; व्यक्तेऽपि<BR> वासरे नित्यं दौर्गत्यतमसावृतः Pt. 2. 96.<BR>—4 Specified, known, distinguished.<BR>—5 Individual.<BR>—6 Wise, learned.<BR>—7 Ved. Adorned, decorated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तः|व्यक्त
व्यक्त + .{@-क्तः@}<BR>—1 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 Heat.<BR>—3 A learned man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तम्
व्यक्त + .{@-क्तम्@}<BR>—1 That which is developed as the product of अव्यक्त q. v.<BR>—2 Manifestation; कार्यव्यक्तेन करणे कालो भवति हेतुमान् Mb. 12. 211. 11.<BR>—3 A तत्त्व; पुरुषः प्रकृतिर्व्यक्तमहङ्कारो नभोऽनिलः । ज्योतिरापः<BR> क्षितिरिति तत्त्वान्युक्तानि मे नव ॥ Bhāg. 11. 22. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तम्
व्यक्त + .{@-क्तम्@} <i>ind.</i> Clearly, evidently, certainly.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यक्तकृत्यम्, व्यक्तगणितम्, व्यक्तगन्धा, व्यक्तदृष्टार्थः, व्यक्तमारिचिक, व्यक्तराशिः, व्यक्तरूपः, व्यक्तलवण, व्यक्तवाच्, व्यक्तविक्रम<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तकृत्यम्
व्यक्त + -कृत्यम् a public action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तगणितम्
व्यक्त + -गणितम् arithmetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तगन्धा
व्यक्त + -गन्धा jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तदृष्टार्थः|व्यक्तदृष्टार्थ
व्यक्त + -दृष्टार्थः an eye-witness, a witness in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तमारिचिक
व्यक्त + -मारिचिक <i>a.</i> much peppered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तराशिः|व्यक्तराशि
व्यक्त + -राशिः a known quantity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तरूपः|व्यक्तरूप
व्यक्त + -रूपः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तलवण
व्यक्त + -लवण <i>a.</i> much salted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तवाच्
व्यक्त + -वाच् distinct speech; P. I. 3. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तविक्रम
व्यक्त + -विक्रम <i>a.</i> displaying valour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तिः|व्यक्ति
व्यक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Manifestation, visibility; clear perception; राज्ञः समक्षमेवाधरोत्तरव्यक्तिर्भविष्यति<BR> M. 1; स्नेहव्यक्तिः Me. 12.<BR>—2 Visible appearance, clearness, distinctness; अव्यक्तं व्यक्तिमापन्नं<BR> मन्यन्ते मामबुद्धयः Bg. 7. 24; Dk. 2. 6; व्यक्तिं भजन्त्यापगाः<BR> Ś. 7. 8 (v. l.).<BR>—3 Distinction, discrimination; दैवमानुषयोरद्य व्यक्ता व्यक्तिर्भविष्यति<BR> Rām. 2. 23. 18; तं सन्तः श्रोतुमर्हन्ति सदसद्व्यक्तिहेतवः R. 1. 10.<BR>—4 Real form or nature, true character; न हि ते भगवन् व्यक्तिं विदुर्देवा<BR> न दानवाः Bg. 10. 14.<BR>—5 An individual (opp. जाति), as in जातिव्यक्ती; अव्यक्ताद् व्यक्तयः<BR> सर्वाः प्रभवन्त्यहरागमे Bg. 8. 18.<BR>—6 Gender (in gram.).<BR>—7 Inflection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तीकृ
व्यक्तीकृ €8 U. To make clear, show, manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यक्तीभू
व्यक्तीभू €1 P. To become distinct or clear, become clearly visible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जक|व्यंजक|व्यञ्जकः
व्यञ्जक <i>a.</i> (-ञ्जिका <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Making clear, indicating, showing, manifesting.<BR>—2 Suggesting or insinuating a meaning (as a word, opp. वाचक and<BR> लाक्षणिक qq. vv.).<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">Page1508-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जकः|व्यञ्जक|व्यंजक
व्यञ्जक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 Dramatic action or gesture, external indication of an internal feeling<BR> by suitable gesticulation.<BR>—2 A sign, symbol.<BR>—3 Figurative expression or insinuation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यञ्जकार्थः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1507-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जकार्थः|व्यञ्जकार्थ
व्यञ्जक + -अर्थः (in Rhet.) suggested or implied sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जनम्
व्यञ्जनम्<BR>—1 Making clear, indicating, manifesting.<BR>—2 A mark, token, sign; सुकुमारं महासत्त्वं पार्थिवव्यञ्जनान्वितम्<BR> (रामम्) Rām. 3. 17. 8.<BR>—3 A reminder; Māl. 9.<BR>—4 Disguise, garb; नानाव्यञ्जनाः प्रणिधयः Mu. 1; Śi. 2. 56; तपस्विव्यञ्जनोपेताः;<BR> गृहपतिवैदेहकतापसव्यञ्जनाः प्रणिधयः Kau. A. 2 &c.<BR>—5 A consonant.<BR>—6 A mark of the sex, <i>i. e.</i> the male or female organ.<BR>—7 Insignia.<BR>—8 A mark or sign of puberty; अजातव्यञ्जनः श्रीमान् बालः श्यामः शुभेक्षणः<BR> Rām. 3. 38. 14; बालमप्राप्तवयसमजातव्यञ्जनाकृतिम् Mb. 1. 157. 35.<BR>—9 The beard.<BR>—10 A limb, member.<BR>—11<BR>——(<i>a</i>) A condiment, sauce, a seasoned article; व्यञ्जनानि ओदनार्थानि<BR> ŚB. on MS. 10. 8. 29; अशक्नुवद्भिर्बहुभुक्तवत्तया यदुज्झिता व्यञ्जनपुञ्जराशयः N. 16. 104.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) An article used in seasoning food, spices &c.<BR>—12 The last of the three powers of a word by virtue of which it suggests<BR> or insinuates a sense; see अञ्जन-ना (9) (written व्यञ्जना also<BR> in this sense); विरतास्वभिधाद्यासु यथार्थो बोध्यतेऽपरः । सा वृत्तिर्व्यञ्जना<BR> नाम शब्दस्यार्थदिकस्य च । S. D.<BR>—13 The letter (as opp. to अर्थ ‘meaning’).<BR>—14 A day.<BR>—15 A privy part.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यञ्जनोदय, व्यञ्जनकारः, व्यञ्जनधातुः, व्यञ्जनसंधिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जनोदय
व्यञ्जनम् + -उदय <i>a.</i> followed by a consonant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जनकारः|व्यञ्जनकार
व्यञ्जनम् + -कारः the preparer of a sauce or condiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जनधातुः
व्यञ्जनम् + -धातुः (वाद्यवादनविधिः) playing on the lute; व्यक्तिर्व्यञ्जनधातुना<BR> दशविधेनाप्यत्र लब्धामुना Nāg. 1. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जनसंधिः|व्यञ्जनसन्धि|व्यंजनसंधि
व्यञ्जनम् + -संधिः the junction or coalition of consonants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जना
व्यञ्जना<BR>—1 See व्यञ्जन (12) above.<BR>—2 Irony, sarcasm.<BR>—3 Insinuation.<BR>—4 Articulation, utterance of words; हीनव्यञ्जनया प्रेक्ष्य भीतचित्त<BR> इवाब्रुवम् Rām. 2. 64. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यञ्जनावृत्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जनावृत्तिः|व्यञ्जनावृत्ति
व्यञ्जना + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> insinuation, figurative or elliptical mode of expression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यञ्जित|व्यंजित
व्यञ्जित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Made clear, manifested, indicated.<BR>—2 Marked, distinguished, characterized.<BR>—3 Suggested, insinuated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यडम्बकः|व्यडम्बक|व्यडंबक|व्यडंबकः
व्यडम्बकः, -व्यडम्बनः<BR> The castor-oil plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यडम्बनः|व्यडम्बन|व्यडंबन|व्यडंबनः
व्यडम्बकः, -व्यडम्बनः<BR> The castor-oil plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिकॄ
व्यतिकॄ €6 P. To mix, blend, scatter (usually in <i>pass.</i>).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिकर|व्यतिकरः
व्यतिकर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Reciprocal.<BR>—2 Spreading, pervading.<BR>—3 Contiguous, near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिकरः|व्यतिकर
व्यतिकर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 Mixture, intermixture, mixing, blending together; तीर्थे तोयव्यतिकरभवे<BR> जह्नुकन्यासरग्वोः R. 8. 95; व्यतिकर इव भीमस्तामसो वैद्युतश्च<BR> U. 5. 13; Māl. 9. 52; Bhāg. 11. 10. 34.<BR>—2 Contact, union, combination; रुद्रेणेदमुमाकृतव्यतिकरे स्वाङ्गे विभक्तं<BR> द्विधा M. 1. 4; Māl. 7; Śi. 4. 53, 7. 28.<BR>—3 Striking against; कठोरास्थिग्रन्थिव्यतिकररणत्कारमुखरः Māl. 5. 34.<BR>—4 Obstruction; मार्गाचलव्यतिकराकुलितेव सिन्धुः Ku. 5. 85.<BR>—5 An incident, occurrence, affair, a thing, matter; एवंविधे व्यतिकरे<BR> ‘such being the case’.<BR>—6 An opportunity.<BR>—7 Misfortune, calamity.<BR>—8 Mutual relation, reciprocity.<BR>—9 Exchange, interchange; सोऽयं स्थितिव्यतिकरोपशमाय सृष्टान् Bhāg. 4. 1. 57.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">Page1508-2</a>]<BR>—10 Alternation.<BR>—11 Provocation (क्षोभ); कालाद्गुणव्यतिकरः परिणामः स्वभावतः<BR> Bhāg. 2. 5. 22.<BR>—12 Destruction; प्रजोपप्लवमालक्ष्य लोकव्यतिकरं च तम् Bhāg. 1. 7. 32.<BR>—13 Spreading, pervading; Bhāg. 5. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिकरित
व्यतिकरित <i>a.</i> Pervaded, filled; व्यतिकरितदिगन्ताः श्वेतमानैर्यशोभिः Māl. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिकीर्ण
व्यतिकीर्ण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Mixed or blended together.<BR>—2 United.<BR>—3 Shaken about; पर्यायव्यतिकीर्णकर्णपवनैराह्लादिभिर्वीजयन् Māl. 9. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिक्रम्
व्यतिक्रम्<BR>—1 U. 1 To transgress, violate, offend against; संमतोऽहं प्रभोर्नित्यमिति<BR> मत्वा व्यतिक्रमेत् Pt. 1. 56.<BR>—2 To neglect, omit.<BR>—3 To pass, spend (time).<BR>—4 To pass over or beyond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिक्रमः|व्यतिक्रम
व्यतिक्रमः<BR>—1 Transgressing, deviating, swerving; divergence; ‘belonging to two different Vedas’<BR> as in गुणमुख्यव्यतिक्रमे तदर्थत्वान्मुख्येन वेदसंयोगः MS. 3. 3. 9.<BR>—2 Violation, breach, non-performance; as in संविद्व्यतिक्रमः; तस्य<BR> व्यतिक्रमाद्राज्ञो भविष्यति सुदारुणा Rām. 1. 9. 8; प्रतिबध्नाति हि<BR> श्रेयः पूज्यपूजाव्यतिक्रमः R. 1. 79.<BR>—3 Disregard, neglect, omission.<BR>—4 Contrariety, inversion, reverse.<BR>—5 Sin, vice, crime; अत्र ब्रूहि यथातत्त्वं को रामस्य व्यतिक्रमः<BR> Rām. 3. 39. 24; व्यतिक्रमं मे भगवन् क्षन्तुमर्हसि शंकर Mb. 3. 39. 80;<BR> Ms. 8. 355.<BR>—6 Adversity, misfortune.<BR>—7 Violating, transgression; तयोर्व्यतिक्रमं दृष्ट्वा क्रुद्धस्य भवतो<BR> हरेः Mb. 3. 12. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिक्रान्त|व्यतिक्रांत
व्यतिक्रान्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Passed over, transgressed, violated, neglected.<BR>—2 Inverted, reversed.<BR>—3 Elapsed, passed away (as time).<BR>—4 One who has wrongly taken to; Mb. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिक्षेपः|व्यतिक्षेप
व्यतिक्षेपः Mutual altercation, contest; नानादिग्भ्यः समाहूताः<BR> सहयाः सरथद्विपाः । तेषामासीद्व्यतिक्षेपः Mb. 7. 105. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिचुम्बित
व्यतिचुम्बित <i>a.</i> In immediate contact with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिपातः|व्यतिपात
व्यतिपातः = व्यतीपातः q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतियु
व्यतियु €2 P. To mix; अन्योन्यं स्म व्यतियुतः शब्दाञ् शब्दैस्तु भीषणान् Bk. 8. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिरिच्
व्यतिरिच् <i>pass.</i><BR>—1 To differ or be separate from.<BR>—2 To surpass, excel; lie beyond; स्तुतिभ्यो व्यतिरिच्यन्ते दूराणि चरितानि<BR> ते R. 10. 30. See व्यतिरिक्त below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिरिक्त|व्यतिरिक्तः
व्यतिरिक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Separated or distinct from; अव्यतिरिक्तेयमस्मच्छरीरात् K.; कामस्य<BR> पुष्पव्यतिरिक्तमस्त्रम् Ku. 1. 31, 5. 22.<BR>—2 Surpassing, excelling, going beyond.<BR>—3 Withdrawn, withheld.<BR>—4 Excepted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिरिक्तम्
व्यतिरिक्त + .{@-क्तम्@} <i>ind.</i> With the exception of, except, without.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिरिक्तकम्
व्यतिरिक्तकम् A particular manner of flying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिरेकः|व्यतिरेक
व्यतिरेकः<BR>—1 Distinction, difference; यथा गन्धस्य भूमंश्च न भावो व्यतिरेकतः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 27. 18.<BR>—2 Separation from.<BR>—3 Exclusion, exception.<BR>—4 Excellence, surpassing,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">Page1509-1</a>]<BR> excelling.<BR>—5 Contrast, dissimilarity.<BR>—6 (In logic) Logical discontinuance (opp. अन्वय q. v.); यत्र<BR> साध्याभावस्तत्र हेत्वभाव इति व्यतिरेकव्याप्तिः (<i>e. g.</i> यत्र वह्निर्नास्ति<BR> तत्र धूमो नास्ति is an instance of व्यतिरेकव्याप्ति).<BR>—7 (In Rhet.) A figure of speech which consists in representing the <i>Upameya</i><BR> as superior to the <i>Upamāna</i> in some particular respects; उपमानाद्यदन्यस्य<BR> व्यतिरेकः स एव सः K. P. 10. (व्यतिरेकेण means ‘except, without’;<BR> व्यतिरेके ‘on the contrary supposition’.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यतिरेकव्याप्ति<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1508-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिरेकव्याप्ति
व्यतिरेकः + -व्याप्ति see व्यतिरेक (6) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिरेकिन्
व्यतिरेकिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Different.<BR>—2 Surpassing, excelling; कालाग्निव्यतिरेकिणां भगवताम् Mv. 1. 46.<BR>—3 Excluding, excepting.<BR>—4 Showing negation or non-existence; as in व्यतिरेकिलिङ्गम्; see<BR> व्यतिरेक (6) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिरेचनम्
व्यतिरेचनम् Contrasting, pointing out difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिरोपित
व्यतिरोपित <i>p. p.</i> Ejected, dispossessed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिविद्ध
व्यतिविद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Entwined.<BR>—2 Pierced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिषञ्ज्|व्यतिषंज्
व्यतिषञ्ज् €1 P.<BR>—1 To link together, connect mutually; व्यतिषजति पदार्थानान्तरः कोऽपि<BR> हेतुः U. 6. 12.<BR>—2 To change (Ātm.).<BR>—3 To involve (in a game); Dk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिषक्त
व्यतिषक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Mutually connected or related, linked or joined together; संकीर्णयोनयो<BR> ये तु प्रतिलोमानुलोमजाः । अन्योन्यव्यतिषक्ताः Ms. 10. 25.<BR>—2 Intermixed.<BR>—3 Intermarrying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिषङ्गः|व्यतिषङ्ग|व्यतिषंग|व्यतिषंगः
व्यतिषङ्गः<BR>—1 Mutual relation, reciprocal connection.<BR>—2 Intermixture, entanglement; त्रुट्यद्वितानतनिकाव्यतिषङ्गभाजः Śi. 5. 61.<BR>—3 Union, junction in general.<BR>—4 Fastening or tying together; तन्तुव्यतिषङ्गजनितोऽयं तन्तुव्यतिषङ्गविनाशात्<BR> तन्तुविनाशाद्वा विनश्यतीत्यवगच्छति ŚB. on MS. 1. 1. 21.<BR>—5 Hostile encounter; सेनयोर्व्यतिषङ्गेण जयः साधारणो भवेत् Mb. 12. 103. 5.<BR>—6 Barter, exchange; अन्योन्यवित्तव्यतिषङ्गवृद्धवैरानुबन्धः Bhāg. 5. 13. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिषञ्जनम्
व्यतिषञ्जनम् Joining together; uniting; स्त्रीपुंसव्यतिषञ्जनं<BR> जनयतः पत्युः प्रजानामभूदभ्यासः N. 15. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिहारः|व्यतिहार
व्यति(ती)हारः<BR>—1 Exchange, barter.<BR>—2 Reciprocity, interchange; विक्रमव्यतिहारेण सामान्याभूद् द्वयोरपि R. 12. 93.<BR>—3 Exchange of blows, abuse, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतीहारः|व्यतीहार
व्यति(ती)हारः<BR>—1 Exchange, barter.<BR>—2 Reciprocity, interchange; विक्रमव्यतिहारेण सामान्याभूद् द्वयोरपि R. 12. 93.<BR>—3 Exchange of blows, abuse, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतिहृत
व्यतिहृत <i>a.</i> = विरहित q. v.; शून्यं प्रियव्यतिहृतं ददृशुस्त्रिलोकम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 16. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यती
व्यती €2 P. (व्यति-इ)<BR>—1 To go out of, swerve from, transgress; रेखामात्रमपि क्षुण्णादा मनोर्वर्त्मनः<BR> परम् । न व्यतीयुः प्रजास्तस्य नियन्तुर्नेमिवृत्तयः ॥ R. 1. 17.<BR>—2 To pass, elapse (as time); सप्त व्यतीयुस्त्रिगुणानि तस्य (दिनानि)<BR> R. 2. 25; व्यतीते कले &c.<BR>—3 To pass beyond, leave behind; यं यं व्यतीयाय पतिंवरा सा R. 6. 67.<BR>—4 To surpass, excel.<BR>—5 To neglect, omit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतीत|व्यतीतः
व्यतीत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Passed, gone, elapsed, passed over; बहूनि मे व्यतीतानि जन्मानि तव<BR> चार्जुन Bg. 4. 5; व्यतीतकालस्त्वहमभ्युपेतः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-2" target="_blank">Page1509-2</a>]<BR> R. 5. 14.<BR>—2 Dead.<BR>—3 Left, abandoned, departed from.<BR>—4 Disregarded, omitted.<BR>—5 Tardy, negligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यत्ययः|व्यत्यय
व्यत्ययः<BR>—1 Passing over.<BR>—2 Opposition, contrariety.<BR>—3 Inverted order, inversion; वेणुसंघर्षजो वह्निर्दग्ध्वा शाम्यति तद्वनम् ।<BR> एवं गुणव्यत्ययजो देहः शाम्यति तत्क्रियः ॥ Bhāg. 11. 13. 7.<BR>—4 Interchange, transmutation.<BR>—5 Obstruction, hindrance; अभक्ष्ये बहुदोषः स्यात्तस्मात् कार्यो न व्यत्ययः Pt. 4. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यत्ययम्
व्यत्ययः + .{@-यम्@} <i>ind.</i> Alternately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यतीपातः|व्यतीपात
व्यतीपातः<BR>—1 Total departure, complete deviation.<BR>—2 Any great portentous calamity, or a portent foreboding a great calamity.<BR>—3 Disrespect, contempt.<BR>—4 The seventeenth of the astronomical Yogas.<BR>—5 The day of full-moon (when it falls on a Monday.)<BR>—6 A malignant or evil aspect of the sun and moon (considered to be inauspicious<BR> for the performance of any action).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यत्यस्
व्यत्यस् I. €2 Ā. (व्यतिहे, व्यतिसे, व्यतिस्ते) To excel, surpass,<BR> be above or superior to, outweigh; अन्यो व्यतिस्ते तु ममापि धर्मः<BR> Bk. 2. 35. ━II. €4 P. To invert, reverse, change upside down; व्यत्यास्य<BR> सूतं च रथं च राजा Bu. C. 3. 53; व्यत्यस्यतां यथाकामं वयसा<BR> योऽभिधास्यति Bhāg. 9. 18. 37. See व्यत्यस्त below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यत्यस्त
व्यत्यस्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Reversed, inverted.<BR>—2 Contrary, opposite.<BR>—3 Incoherent; व्यत्यस्तं लपति Bv. 2. 84.<BR>—4 Crossed, placed cross-wise; व्यत्यस्तपादः, व्यत्यस्तभुजः &c.;<BR> व्यत्यस्तपाणिना कार्यमुपसंग्रहणं गुरोः Ms. 2. 72.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यत्यासः|व्यत्यास
व्यत्यासः<BR>—1 Inverted position or order; कृतव्यत्यासनामकाः Parṇāl. 3. 31.<BR>—2 Opposition, contrariety.<BR>—3 Change; रागान्धीकृतनयनेन नामधेयव्यत्यासादभिमुखमीरितः प्रियेण Śi. 4. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यथ्
व्यथ् €1 Ā. (व्यथते, व्यथित)<BR>—1 To be sorry, to be pained, vexed or afflicted,<BR> be agitated or disquieted; विश्वंभरापि नाम व्यथते इति जितमपत्यस्नेहेन<BR> U. 7; न विव्यथे तस्य मनः Ki. 1. 2, 24.<BR>—2 To be disturbed, be ruffled or agitated; व्यथितसिन्धुमनीरशनैः<BR> शनैः Ki. 5. 11.<BR>—3 To tremble; येषां न वृत्तं व्यथते न योनिश्चित्तप्रसादेन चरन्ति<BR> धर्मम् Mb. 5. 36. 24.<BR>—4 To be afraid. —5 To dry, become dry. ━<i>Caus.</i> (व्यथयति-ते)<BR>—1 To pain, distress, vex, annoy; तथा वृत्तं पापैर्व्यथयति यथा क्षालितमपि U. 1. 28.<BR>—2 To frustrate, mar.<BR>—3 To frighten, terrify.<BR>—4 To lead or turn away. ━<i>With</i> {@प्र@} to be excessively vexed; दृष्ट्वाद्भुतं<BR> रूपमिदं तवोग्रं लोकत्रयं प्रव्यथितं महात्मन् Bg. 11. 20, 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यथक|व्यथकः
व्यथक <i>a.</i> (-थिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> Painful, distressing; परिणामसुखे गरीयसि<BR> व्यथकेऽस्मिन् वचसि क्षतौजसाम् Ki. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यथनम्
व्यथनम्<BR>—1 Giving pain, tormenting.<BR>—2 (In Ved. gram.) Change, variation.<BR>—3 Piercing, perforating.<BR>—4 Tottering, wavering; P. V. 4. 46. ━<i>a.</i> Greatly disturbing, perplexing;<BR> तद् दृष्ट्वा व्यथनं कर्म कुम्भकर्णस्य रक्षसः Mb. 3. 287. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1509-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यथा
व्यथा [व्यथ्-भावे-अङ्]<BR>—1 Pain, agony, anguish; तां च व्यथां प्रसवकालकृतामवाप्य U. 4. 23, 1. 12.<BR>—2 Fear, alarm, anxiety; स्वन्त्मित्यलघयत् स तद्व्यथाम् R. 11. 62.<BR>—3 Agitation, disquietude<BR>—4 Disease.<BR>—5 Loss, damage.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यथाकर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यथाकर
व्यथा + -कर <i>a.</i> painful, troublesome, hurtful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यथित|व्यथितः
व्यथित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Afflicted, distressed, pained.<BR>—2 Alarmed.<BR>—3 Agitated, disquieted, troubled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यध्
व्यध् €4 P. (विध्यति, विद्ध)<BR>—1 To pierce, hurt, strike, stab, kill; तमभिद्रुत्य पाप्मनाबिध्यन् स<BR> यः स पाप्मा Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 2; यूनां मनांसि विव्याध दृष्ट्वा दृष्ट्वा<BR> मनोभवः H. 2. 111; अक्षितारासु विव्याध द्विषतः स तनुत्रिणः Śi. 19. 99;<BR> विद्धमात्रः R. 5. 51, 9. 60, 14. 70; Bk. 5. 52, 9. 66, 15. 69.<BR>—2 To bore, perforate, pierce through.<BR>—3 To pick.<BR>—4 To wave or brandish in triumph (as the tail &c.); चैलनि विव्यधुस्तत्र<BR> ब्राह्मणाश्च सहस्रशः Mb. 1. 188. 23.<BR>—5 (In astr.) To fix the position of a heavenly body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यधः|व्यध
व्यधः [व्यध्-अच्]<BR>—1 Piercing, splitting, hitting; विदधति जनतामनः शरव्यव्यधपटुमन्मथचापनादशङ्काम् Śi. 7. 24.<BR>—2 Smiting, wounding, striking.<BR>—3 Perforating.<BR>—4 A stroke, wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यधा
व्यधः + .{@-धा@} Bleeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यधिकरणम्
व्यधिकरणम् Subsisting in different receptacles or substrata; (as<BR> in व्यधिकरणबहुव्रीहि which means ‘a Bahuvrīhi compound, the first member of which is not in apposition, or stands in a different case-relation, to the second, in the dissolution of the compound’<BR>; <i>e. g.</i> चक्रपाणिः,<BR> चन्द्रमौलिः &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यधिक्षेपः|व्यधिक्षेप
व्यधिक्षेपः Invective, harsh language.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यध्यः|व्यध्य
व्यध्यः<BR>—1 A butt, target, a mark to aim at.<BR>—2 A bow-string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यध्वः|व्यध्व
व्यध्वः A bad or wrong road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यनुनादः|व्यनुनाद
व्यनुनादः Reverberation, loud echo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यन्तरः|व्यन्तर|व्यंतरः
व्यन्तरः A spirit, a kind of supernatural being; अस्माकं कश्चिद्<BR> व्यन्तरः सिद्धिः Pt. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यप्
व्यप् €10 U. (व्यापयति-ते)<BR>—1 To throw.<BR>—2 To diminish, waste, decrease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपकृष्
व्यपकृष् €1 P.<BR>—1 To draw away.<BR>—2 To lead astray, seduce.<BR>—3 To remove, take away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपकृष्ट
व्यपकृष्ट <i>p. p.</i> Drawn aside, taken away, removed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपगम्
व्यपगम् €1 P.<BR>—1 To go away, retire, retreat.<BR>—2 To disappear, vanish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपगत
व्यपगत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Gone away, departed, disappeared; मदो मे व्यपगतः Bh. 2. 8;<BR> नाध्यास्यन्ति व्यपगतशुचस्त्वामपि प्राप्य हंसाः Me. 78.<BR>—2 Removed.<BR>—3 Fallen away from, deprived of, free from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपगमः|व्यपगम
व्यपगमः Departure, disappearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपत्रप्
व्यपत्रप् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To turn away through shame.<BR>—2 To be ashamed, feel ashamed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपत्रप
व्यपत्रप <i>a.</i> Shameless, impudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपदिश्
व्यपदिश् €6 P.<BR>—1 To name, call; व्यपदिश्यसे जगति विक्रमीत्यतः Śi. 15. 28.<BR>—2 To name or call falsely; मित्रं च मां व्यपदिशस्यपरं च यासि Mk. 4. 9.<BR>—3 To speak of, profess; जन्मेन्दोर्विमले कुले व्यपदिशसि Ve. 6. 7.<BR>—4 To pretend, feign; व्यपदिशति नः शैवप्रीत्या कथंचिदनास्थया Mv. 2. 11.<BR>—5 To indicate, show.<BR>—6 To signify, mean, denote.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपदिष्ट
व्यपदिष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Named.<BR>—2 Shown, represented, signified.<BR>—3 Pleaded as a pretext or excuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपदेशः|व्यपदेश
व्यपदेशः<BR>—1 Representation, information, notice; अलं वै व्यपदेशेन धनुरायच्छ<BR> राघव Mb. 3. 99. 49.<BR>—2 Designation by name, naming.<BR>—3 A name, an appellation, a title; एवं व्यपदेशभाजः U. 6.<BR>—4 A family, race; अथ कोऽस्य व्यपदेशः Ś. 7; व्यपदेशमाविलयितुं<BR> किमीहसे जनमिमं च पातयितुम् Ś. 5. 21.<BR>—5 Fame, reputation, renown; also in adjectival sense; व्यपदेशकुले<BR> जाताः पूजिताश्चाप्यभीक्ष्णशः Rām. 4. 64. 21; Ms. 7 168.<BR>—6 A trick, pretext, excuse, device; भारतव्यपदेशेन ह्याम्नायार्थश्च<BR> दर्शितः Bhāg. 1. 4. 29.<BR>—7 Fraud, craft.<BR>—8 Concealment, dissimulation; Māl. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपदेशिन्
व्यपदेशिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 (In comp.) Conforming to, following the advice of; महावंशप्रसूतस्य<BR> वसिष्ठव्यपदेशिनः (तवैव भुवि नान्यतः) Rām. 1. 19. 2.<BR>—2 Having a designation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपदेष्टृ
व्यपदेष्टृ <i>m.</i> A cheat, an impostor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपनयः|व्यपनय
व्यपनयः<BR>—1 Taking away, removal; तस्याः पिण्डव्यपनयं कुर्यादस्मद्विधः कथम् Mb. 5. 141. 7.<BR>—2 Misbehaviour; कुरुराज नरश्रेष्ठ तव व्यपनयो महान् Mb. 7. 144. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपयानम्
व्यपयानम् Retreat, flight; Mb. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपरुह्
व्यपरुह् <i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To eradicate, extirpate.<BR>—2 To remove.<BR>—3 To deprive of; प्रीतिपूर्वं महाबाहुः प्राणैर्न व्यपरोपयत् Mb. 14. 74. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपरोपणम्
व्यपरोपणम्<BR>—1 Extirpating, uprooting.<BR>—2 Expelling, removing, driving away.<BR>—3 Cutting off, tearing out, plucking; चुकोप तस्मै स भृशं सुरस्त्रियः<BR> प्रसह्य केशव्यपरोपणादिव R. 3. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपवर्गः|व्यपवर्ग
व्यपवर्गः<BR>—1 Division, difference.<BR>—2 Cessation, termination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपवृत्
व्यपवृत् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To return, turn back; चतः कथं कथमपि व्यपवर्तते मे Māl. 1. 18.<BR>—2 To desist from, leave; व्यपवर्तत एष धीरपोतः U. 5. 8 (v. l.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपवर्तनम्
व्यपवर्तनम् Return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपश्रि
व्यपश्रि To request; भवतु पुत्र व्यपश्रयिष्ये तावदेनम् Madhyamavyāyoga 1;<BR> कथमाचार्योऽपि व्यपश्रयिष्यते Pañc. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपाकृतिः|व्यपाकृति
व्यपाकृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Expelling, driving away.<BR>—2 Denial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपायः|व्यपाय
व्यपायः<BR>—1 Absence, want.<BR>—2 End, disappearance, close; हिमव्यपायाद्विशदाधराणाम् Ku. 3. 33; R. 3. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1510-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपाश्रयः|व्यपाश्रय
व्यपाश्रयः<BR>—1 Succession.<BR>—2 Taking refuge with, having recourse to, trusting to; न चास्य सर्वभूतेषु<BR> कश्चिदर्थव्यपाश्रयः Bg. 3. 18.<BR>—3 Depending on; धर्मो रामव्यपाश्रयः Rām.<BR>—4 Expectation.<BR>—5 Place of refuge, shelter; ज्ञानवैराग्यवीर्याणां नेह कश्चिद् व्यपाश्रयः<BR> Bhāg. 6. 17. 37. ━<i>a.</i> Self-dependent, self-centred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपाश्रयणा
व्यपाश्रयणा A request; भवति! महती खल्वस्य व्यपाश्रयणा Svapna. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपास्त
व्यपास्त <i>p. p.</i> Expelled, turned out; कश्चिद् व्यपास्तानहितान् … अनवज्ञाय<BR> वर्तसे Rām. 2. 100. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपे
व्यपे €2 P.<BR>—1 To depart or deviate from, be free from; व्यपेतमदमत्सरः Y. 1. 268;<BR> स्मृत्याचारव्यपेतेन मार्गेण 2. 5.<BR>—2 To go away, separate, part asunder; समेत्य च व्यपेयाताम् H. 4. 69;<BR> Ms. 9. 142, 11. 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपेत
व्यपेत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Separated, severed.<BR>—2 Gone away, departed; oft. in comp.; व्यपेतकल्मष, व्यपेतभी, व्यपेतहर्ष<BR> &c.; व्यपेतभीः प्रीतमनाः पुनस्त्वं तदेव मे रूपमिदं प्रपश्य Bg. 11. 49.<BR>—3 Contrary, opposed to.<BR>—4 Immoral; मत्त्या विश्लथन्नीव्या व्यपेतं निरपत्रपम् Bhāg. 6. 2. 60.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यपेतकल्मष<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपेतकल्मष
व्यपेत + -कल्मष <i>a.</i> free from sin; व्यपेतकल्मषो नित्यं ब्रह्मलोके<BR> महीयते Ms. 4. 260.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपेक्ष्
व्यपेक्ष् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To mind, care for, regard; न व्यपैक्षत समुत्सुकाः प्रजाः R. 19. 6.<BR>—2 To expect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपेक्ष
व्यपेक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Expecting, expectant.<BR>—2 Eager, attentive.<BR>—3 Regarding, minding.<BR>—4 Disregarding, indifferent (निरपेक्ष); त्वयि धर्मव्यपेक्षे तु<BR> किं स्याद्धर्मपथे स्थितम् Rām. 2. 45. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपेक्षक
व्यपेक्षक <i>a.</i> Mindful; वैराग्यबुद्धिः सततमात्मदोषव्यपेक्षकः Mb. 14. 19. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपेक्षा
व्यपेक्षा<BR>—1 Expectation, hope.<BR>—2 Regard, consideration; अथ काश्चिदजव्यपेक्षया गमयित्वा समदर्शनः<BR> समाः R. 8. 24.<BR>—3 Mutual relation, inter-dependence.<BR>—4 Mutual regard.<BR>—5 Application.<BR>—6 (In gram.) The mutual application of two rules.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपेक्षणम्
व्यपेक्षणम् Expecting, expectation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपेक्षित
व्यपेक्षित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Hoped, expected.<BR>—2 Regarded, minded.<BR>—3 Mutually connected.<BR>—4 Employed, applied, used.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपोढ
व्यपोढ <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Expelled, removed.<BR>—2 Contrary, opposite; व्यपोढपार्श्वैरपवर्तितत्रिकाः Ki. 4. 15.<BR>—3 Manifested, displayed, shown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपोह्
व्यपोह् €1 P.<BR>—1 To atone for, expiate.<BR>—2 To heal, cure.<BR>—3 To drive away, remove, keep off; व्यपोह्य शीर्षकपाले T. Up. 1. 6. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यपोहः|व्यपोह
व्यपोहः<BR>—1 Expelling, driving away, keeping off.<BR>—2 Heap (समूह); अत्रैवात्रेति च विभो जातमत्रिं वदन्त्यपि । तथा<BR> भस्मव्यपोहेभ्यो ब्रह्मर्षिगणसंमताः ॥ Mb. 13. 85. 8.<BR>—3 Denial, negation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभिचर्
व्यभिचर् €1 P.<BR>—1 To go astray, deviate from; as in अव्यभिचरितं साध्यसामान्याधिकरण्यं<BR> व्याप्तिः Tarka K.<BR>—2 To transgress against, be faithless to; तस्मात् खधर्मं भूतानां राजा<BR> न व्यभिचारयेत् Kau. A. 1. 3.<BR>—3 To act crookedly.<BR>—4 To offend, injure.<BR>—5 To fail, miscarry.<BR>—6 To practise sorcery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभिचरणम्
व्यभिचरणम् Uncertainty, doubt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभिचारः|व्यभिचार
व्यभि(भी)चारः<BR>—1 Going away from, deviation, leaving the right course, following improper<BR> courses; मन्त्रज्ञमव्यसनिनं व्यभिचारविवर्जितम् H. 3. 16; मां<BR> च योऽव्यभिचारेण भक्तियोगेन सेवते Bg. 14. 26;<BR>—2 Transgression, violation; व्यभिचारेण वर्णानाम् (… जायन्ते वर्णसंकराः) Ms. 10. 24.<BR>—3 Error, crime, sin.<BR>—4 Separableness.<BR>—5 Infidelity, faithlessness (of a wife or husband), unchastity; व्यभिचारात्तु<BR> भर्तुः स्त्री लोके प्राप्नोति गर्ह्यताम् Ms. 5. 164; बाङ्मनःकर्मभिः पत्यौ<BR> व्यभिचारो यथा न मे R. 15. 81; Y. 1. 72.<BR>—6 An anomaly, irregularity, exception (to a rule).<BR>—7 (In logic) A fallacious <i>hetu</i>, the presence of the <i>hetu</i> without<BR> the <i>sādhya</i>; हेतोः साध्याभाववद्वृत्तित्वं व्यभिचारः Tarka K.<BR>—8 Absence (अभाव); अन्योऽन्यतोऽस्मिन् व्यभिचारतो मृषा नित्ये परे<BR> ब्रह्मणि केवले शिवे A. Rām. 7. 5. 32.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यभिचारकृत्, व्यभिचारविवर्जित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभीचारः|व्यभीचार
व्यभि(भी)चारः<BR>—1 Going away from, deviation, leaving the right course, following improper<BR> courses; मन्त्रज्ञमव्यसनिनं व्यभिचारविवर्जितम् H. 3. 16; मां<BR> च योऽव्यभिचारेण भक्तियोगेन सेवते Bg. 14. 26;<BR>—2 Transgression, violation; व्यभिचारेण वर्णानाम् (… जायन्ते वर्णसंकराः) Ms. 10. 24.<BR>—3 Error, crime, sin.<BR>—4 Separableness.<BR>—5 Infidelity, faithlessness (of a wife or husband), unchastity; व्यभिचारात्तु<BR> भर्तुः स्त्री लोके प्राप्नोति गर्ह्यताम् Ms. 5. 164; बाङ्मनःकर्मभिः पत्यौ<BR> व्यभिचारो यथा न मे R. 15. 81; Y. 1. 72.<BR>—6 An anomaly, irregularity, exception (to a rule).<BR>—7 (In logic) A fallacious <i>hetu</i>, the presence of the <i>hetu</i> without<BR> the <i>sādhya</i>; हेतोः साध्याभाववद्वृत्तित्वं व्यभिचारः Tarka K.<BR>—8 Absence (अभाव); अन्योऽन्यतोऽस्मिन् व्यभिचारतो मृषा नित्ये परे<BR> ब्रह्मणि केवले शिवे A. Rām. 7. 5. 32.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यभिचारकृत्, व्यभिचारविवर्जित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभिचारकृत्
व्यभिचारः + -कृत् <i>a.</i> committing adultery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभिचारविवर्जित
व्यभिचारः + -विवर्जित <i>a.</i> free from extravagance or debauchery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभिचारिणी
व्यभिचारिणी An unchaste wife, adulteress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभिचारिन्
व्यभिचारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Straying or deviating from, going astray, erring, trespassing; निगृह्य<BR> दापयेच्चैनं समयव्यभिचारिणम् Ms. 8. 220.<BR>—2 Irregular, anomalous.<BR>—3 Untrue, false; see अव्यभिचारिन्.<BR>—4 Faithless, unchaste, adulterous.<BR>—5 Profligate, wanton.<BR>—6 Departing from its usual meaning, having several secondary meanings (as a word).<BR>—7 Changeable, inconstant; नात्मा जजान न मरिष्यति नैधतेऽसौ न क्षीयते<BR> सवनविद्व्यभिचारिणां हि Bhāg. 11. 3. 38. ━<i>m.</i>, व्यमिचारिभावः<BR> A transitory feeling, an accessory (opp. स्थायिन् or स्थायिभाव q. v.).<BR> (Though like the Sthāyibhāvas these accessories do not form a necessary<BR> substratum of any <i>rasa</i>, still they act as <i>feeders</i> to the prevailing<BR> sentiment, and strengthen it in various ways, whether openly or covertly.<BR> They are said to be 33 or 34 in number; for an enumeration of these, see<BR> K. P. Kārikās. 31-34, S. D. 169 or R. G. first Ānana; cf. विभाव<BR> and स्थायिभाव also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभीचारः|व्यभीचार
व्यभीचारः<BR>—1 Transgression, offence.<BR>—2 Change, alteration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यभीमानः|व्यभीमान
व्यभीमानः False notion, erroneous view.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यय्
व्यय् I. €10 U. (व्यययति-ते)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To expend, give away, bestow. ━II. €1 U. (व्ययति-ते) To go, move<BR>━III. €10 U. (व्याययति-ते, also व्यापयति-ते)<BR>—1 To throw, cast.<BR>—2 To drive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यय|व्ययं|व्ययः
व्यय <i>a.</i> Liable to change, mutable, perishable; cf. अव्यय;<BR> सूक्ष्माभ्यो मूर्तिमात्राभ्यः संभवत्यव्ययाद् व्ययम् Ms. 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययः|व्यय|व्ययं
व्यय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Loss, disappearance, destruction; आपाद्यते न<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">Page1512-1</a>]<BR> व्ययमन्तरायैः कच्चिन्महर्षेस्रिविधं तपस्तत् R. 5. 5, 12. 23.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Cost, sacrifice; प्राणव्ययेनापि मया विधेयः Māl. 4. 5; Ku. 3. 23.<BR>—2 Hindrance, obstacle; भूयस्तपोव्ययो मा भूत् R. 15. 37.<BR>—3 Decay, decline, overthrow, downfall.<BR>—4 Expenditure, expense, outlay, spending, applying to use (opp. आय);<BR> आये दुःखं व्यये दुःखं धिगर्थाः कष्टसंश्रयाः Pt. 1. 163; आयाधिकं<BR> व्ययं करोति ‘he lives beyond his means’; R. 5. 12, 15. 3; Ms. 9. 11.<BR>—5 Extravagance, prodigality.<BR>—6 wealth, money; भक्तावकाशाग्न्युदकमन्त्रोपकरणव्ययान् Y. 2. 276.<BR>—7 (In gram.) Inflection, declension.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्ययकरणः, व्ययकरणकः, व्ययगुण, व्ययपर, व्ययपराङ्मुख, व्ययशील, व्ययशुद्धिः, व्ययशेषः, व्ययसह<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1511-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययकरणः|व्ययकरण
व्यय + -करणः, -करणकः a paymaster.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययकरणकः|व्ययकरणक
व्यय + -करणः, -करणकः a paymaster.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययगुण
व्यय + -गुण <i>a.</i> prodigal, spendthrift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययपर
व्यय + -पर <i>a.</i> lavish in expenditure; राजा व्ययपरो नित्यम् Pt. 5. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययपराङ्मुख
व्यय + -पराङ्मुख <i>a.</i> stingy, niggardly; Y. 1. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययशील
व्यय + -शील <i>a.</i> spendthrift, prodigal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययशुद्धिः|व्ययशुद्धि
व्यय + -शुद्धिः <i>f.</i> defraying of expenses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययशेषः
व्यय + -शेषः net balance that remains after expenditure; बाह्यं चाभ्यन्तरं<BR> चायं विद्याद् वर्षशतादपि । यथा पृष्टो न सज्येत व्ययशेषे च दर्शयेत् Kau. A. 2. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययसह
व्यय + -सह <i>a.</i> inexhaustible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययनम्
व्ययनम्<BR>—1 Spending.<BR>—2 Wasting, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ययित|व्ययितः
व्ययित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Expended, spent.<BR>—2 Wasted, fallen into decay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यर्थ|व्यर्थं
व्यर्थ <i>a.</i> [विगतोऽर्थः प्रयोजनं वाऽस्य]<BR>—1 Useless, vain, fruitless, unprofitable; व्यर्थ यत्र कपीन्द्रसख्यमपि मे U. 3. 45.<BR>—2 Meaningless, unmeaning, idle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यर्थक
व्यर्थक = व्यर्थ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यलीक|व्यलीकं|व्यलीकः
व्यलीक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 False, untrue; ताश्च व्यलीकं रुरुदुः कृतागसः Bhāg. 6. 14. 48.<BR>—2 Offensive, disagreeable, displeasing; न च व्यलीकमासीद्राज्ञ एतद्वृत्तान्तं<BR> दृष्ट्वा त्रात इत्युक्त्वा Mb. 3. 197. 23.<BR>—3 Not false; इत्थं गिरः प्रियतमा इव सोऽव्यलीकाः शुश्राव सूततनयस्य<BR> तदा व्यलीकाः Śi. 5. 1.<BR>—4 Unfit to be done.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यलीकः|व्यलीक|व्यलीकं
व्यलीक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A libertine.<BR>—2 A catamite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यलीकम्
व्यलीक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Anything disagreeable or displeasing, disagreeableness; ननु जनविदितैर्भवद्व्यलीकैश्चिरपरिपूरितमेव<BR> कर्णयुग्मम् Śi. 7. 54.<BR>—2 Any cause of grief or uneasiness, pain, sorrow, grief; सुतनु हृदयात्<BR> प्रत्यादेशव्यलीकमपैतु ते Ś. 7. 24; यस्मिन्ननैश्वर्यकृतव्यलीकः<BR> पराभवं प्राप्त इवान्तकोऽपि Ki. 3. 19; Ku. 3. 25; R. 4. 87.<BR>—3 A fault, an offence, a transgression, any improper act; सव्यलीकमवधीरितखिन्नं<BR> प्रस्थितं सपदि कोपपदेन Ki. 9. 45; Śi. 9. 85; एवं प्रत्यक्षदृष्टव्यलीकः<BR> किं ब्रवीमि Ratn. 3, 3. 15.<BR>—4 Fraud, trick, deception; तस्मात् तमेव सेवेत न व्यलीकेन कर्हिचित्<BR> Pt. 1. 120, 242.<BR>—5 Falsehood.<BR>—6 Inversion, contrariety.<BR>—7 Sin, demerit; न सूक्ष्ममपि मे किंचिद् व्यलीकमिह विद्यते Mb. 14. 14. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवकलनम्
व्यवकलनम्<BR>—1 Separation.<BR>—2 (In math.) Subtraction, deduction (व्यवकलितम् also in this sense);<BR> व्यवकलनमार्गेऽसि कुशला Līlā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवक्रोशनम्
व्यवक्रोशनम्<BR>—1 Wrangling, mutual abuse.<BR>—2 Abuse in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवच्छिद्
व्यवच्छिद् €7 U.<BR>—1 To cut off, separate, detach from.<BR>—2 To interrupt.<BR>—3 To particularize, specify, distinguish.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">Page1512-2</a>]<BR>—4 To settle, ascertain; इति व्यवाच्छिद्य स पाण्डवेयः Bhāg. 1. 19. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवच्छिन्न|व्यवच्छिन्नं|व्यवछिन्न
व्यवच्छिन्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Cut off, rent asunder, torn off.<BR>—2 Separated, divided.<BR>—3 Particularized, specified.<BR>—4 Marked, distinguished; शरीरं तावदिष्टार्थव्यवच्छिन्ना पदावली Kāv. 1 10.<BR>—4 Interrupted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवच्छेदः|व्यवच्छेद|व्यवछेद
व्यवच्छेदः<BR>—1 Cutting off, rending asunder.<BR>—2 Dividing, separating.<BR>—3 Dissection.<BR>—4 Particularizing.<BR>—5 Distinguishing.<BR>—6 Contrast, distinction.<BR>—7 Determination.<BR>—8 Shooting, letting fly (as an arrow).<BR>—9 A chapter or section of a work.<BR>—10 Destruction (नाश); दुःखेष्वेकतरेणापि दैवभूतात्महेतुषु । जीवस्य<BR> न व्यवच्छेदः स्याच्चेत्तत्तत्प्रतिक्रिया ॥ Bhāg. 4. 29. 33.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यवच्छेदविद्या<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवच्छेदविद्या
व्यवच्छेदः + -विद्या the science of anatomy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवदात
व्यवदात <i>a.</i> Clear, clean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवदानम्
व्यवदानम् Purification; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवदीर्ण
व्यवदीर्ण <i>p. p.</i> Distracted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवधा
व्यवधा €3 U.<BR>—1 To place between, interpose, intervene; प्रेक्ष्य स्थितां सहचरीं<BR> व्यवधाय देहम् R. 9. 57.<BR>—2 To hide, conceal, screen; शापव्यवहितस्मृतिः Ś. 5.<BR>—3 To separate, divide.<BR>—4 To obstruct, interrupt.<BR>—5 To neglect, omit, pass over; see व्यवहित also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवधा
व्यवधा<BR>—1 That which intervenes.<BR>—2 A cover, screen, partition.<BR>—3 Concealment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवधानम्
व्यवधानम्<BR>—1 Intervention, interposition, separation; इह समाप्तस्य सामिधेनीवाक्यस्य<BR> अस्य चोपव्ययते इति वचनस्य निविदां विधायकेन … ग्रन्थेन व्यवधानं<BR> भवति ŚB. on MS. 3. 1. 21.<BR>—2 Obstruction, hiding from view; दृष्टिं विमानव्यवधानमुक्तां पुनः<BR> सहस्रार्चिषि संनिधत्ते R. 13. 44.<BR>—3 Concealment, disappearance.<BR>—4 A screen, partition.<BR>—5 A cover, covering; शार्दूलचर्मव्यवधानवत्याम् Ku. 3. 44.<BR>—6 Interval, space.<BR>—7 (In gram.) The intervention of a syllable or letter.<BR>—8 (In Mīmāṃsā) Remote construction, remoteness; see व्यवहितकल्पना;<BR> व्यवधानाल्लक्षणापि ज्यायसी ŚB. on MS. 10. 2. 69; व्यवधानादर्थो<BR> बलीयान् ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवधायक|व्यवधायकः
व्यवधायक <i>a.</i> (-यिका <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Intervening, screening, covering.<BR>—2 Obstructing, hiding.<BR>—3 Intermediate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवधिः|व्यवधि
व्यवधिः Covering, intervention &c.; दिशमुदधिव्यवधिं समेतसीताम्<BR> Bk. 10. 51; अवनतवदनेन्दुरिच्छतीव व्यवधिमधीरतया यदस्थितास्मै<BR> Śi. 7. 38. See व्यवधान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहित|व्यवहितः
व्यवहित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Placed apart.<BR>—2 Separated by anything intervening; मृदुव्यवहितं तेजो भोक्तुमर्थान्<BR> प्रकल्पते Śi. 2. 85.<BR>—3 Interrupted, stopped, obstructed, impeded.<BR>—4 Screened from view, hidden, concealed.<BR>—5 Not immediately connected.<BR>—6 Done, performed.<BR>—7 Passed over, omitted.<BR>—8 Surpassed, excelled.<BR>—9 Hostile; opposed.<BR>—10 Remote, distant.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यवहितकल्पना<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहितकल्पना
व्यवहित + -कल्पना A mode of construction in which words or phrases which<BR> are separated from one another by some other<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">Page1513-1</a>]<BR> intervening words, phrases or sentences are construed together as forming<BR> a sentence. This mode is as a general rule not admissible and is worse<BR> than even लक्षणा (see व्यवधान); सत्रविश्वजित्सम्बन्धे व्यवहितकल्पना<BR> स्यात् ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 33, 7. 4. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1512-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवधारणकल्पना
व्यवधारणकल्पना <i>f.</i> A mode of interpreting a sentence where<BR> words or expressions connected with one another are treated as being not<BR> so connected, disconnecting what is connected; ŚB. on MS. 1. 2. 1; सैषा<BR> व्यवधारणकल्पना । तमस्मै भक्षं प्रयच्छेत् तमस्मै भक्षं कुर्यादित्यर्थः<BR> ŚB. on MS. 3. 5. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवसर्गः|व्यवसर्ग
व्यवसर्गः Renunciation, resignation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवसो
व्यवसो €4 P.<BR>—1 To strive, endeavour, try, seek, attempt, set about; यथा मे गौतमः<BR> प्राह ततो न व्यवसाम्यहम् Mb. 3. 185. 9; ध्रुवं स नीलोत्पलपत्रधारयां<BR> शमीलतां छेत्तुमृषिर्व्यवस्यति Ś. 1. 18; V. 4.<BR>—2 To think of, wish, desire; पातुं न प्रथमं व्यवस्यति जलं युष्माखपीतेषु या Ś. 4. 9.<BR>—3 To exert strenuously, be industrious or diligent.<BR>—4 To resolve, determine, settle, decide; य आत्मनो दृश्यगुणेषु सन्निति<BR> व्यवस्यते स्वव्यतिरेकतोऽबुधः Bhāg. 10. 3. 18; प्रथमपरिगृहीतं<BR> स्यान्न वेत्यव्यवस्यन् Ś. 5. 19.<BR>—5 To accept, undertake; कच्चित् सौम्य व्यवसितमिदं बन्धुकृत्यं त्वया मे Me. 116.<BR>—6 To be convinced or persuaded.<BR>—7 To reflect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवसायः|व्यवसाय
व्यवसायः<BR>—1 Effort, exertion, energy, industry, perseverance; करोतु नाम नीतिज्ञो<BR> व्यवसायमितस्ततः H. 2. 14.<BR>—2 Resolve, resolution, determination; मन्दीचकार मरणव्यवसायबुद्धिम्<BR> Ku. 4. 45 ‘the thought of resolving to die’; व्यवसायात्मिका बुद्धिः<BR> Bg. 2. 41; व्यवसायोऽस्मि 10. 36.<BR>—3 An act, action, performance; व्यवसायः प्रतिपत्तिनिष्ठुरः R. 8. 65.<BR>—4<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Business, employment, trade.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Following a particular profession or trade.<BR>—5 Conduct, behaviour.<BR>—6 Device, stratagem, artifice.<BR>—7 Boasting.<BR>—8 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—9 Of Śiva.<BR>—10 State, condition.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यवसायात्मक, व्यवसायबुद्धि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवसायात्मक
व्यवसायः + -आत्मक <i>a.</i> energetic, laborious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवसायबुद्धि
व्यवसायः + -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> having a resolute mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवसायिन्
व्यवसायिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Energetic, industrious, diligent; किं दूरं व्यवसायिनाम् Pt. 2. 51.<BR>—2 Resolute, persevering; बहुशाखा ह्यनन्ताश्च बुद्धयोऽव्यवसायिनाम्<BR> Bg. 2. 41; Pt. 1. 248.<BR>—3 Performing, doing, undertaking; (श्रेष्ठाः) ज्ञानिभ्यो व्यवसायिनः Ms. 12. 103.<BR>—4 Engaged in any business or profession. ━<i>m.</i> A tradesman, merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवसित|व्यवसितः
व्यवसित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Endeavoured, attempted; स्वजनमनुगन्तुं व्यवसिता Ś. 6. 9.<BR>—2 Undertaken.<BR>—3 Resolved, determined, settled.<BR>—4 Devised, planned.<BR>—5 Endeavouring, resolving.<BR>—6 Persevering, energetic.<BR>—7 Cheated, deceived.<BR>—8 Convinced, sure (of anything); सम्यग्व्यवसिता बुद्धिस्तव राजर्षिसत्तम<BR> Bhāg. 10. 1. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवसितम्
व्यवसित + .{@-तम्@} Ascertainment, determination; यत्ते व्यवसितं तात तदस्माकमपि<BR> प्रियम् Mb. 6. 119. 37.<BR>—2 An artifice, contrivance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवसितिः|व्यवसिति
व्यवसितिः<BR>—1 Determination.<BR>—2 Endeavour; भूम्नौत्सुक्यानुरूपव्यवसितिरधिकं पर्यवप्लुत्य गत्वा Mv. 6. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्था
व्यवस्था €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To be placed asunder.<BR>—2 To be arranged in due order.<BR>—3 To be settled or fixed, become permanent; वचनीयमिदं व्यवस्थितम्<BR> Ku. 4. 21; नटवद् व्यवतिष्ठते लिङ्गम् Sāṅ. K. 42.<BR>—4 To rest or depend upon. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To place or rest upon, direct towards; तयोः समापत्तिषु कातराणि<BR> किंचिद्व्यवस्थापितसंहृतानि Ku. 7. 75.<BR>—2 To arrange, manage, adjust.<BR>—3 To settle, resolve, decree.<BR>—4 To separate, place apart.<BR>—5 To do, perform.<BR>—6 To lay down a rule or law, enact a law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्था
व्यवस्था<BR>—1 Adjustment, arrangement, settlement; as in वर्णाश्रमव्यवस्था.<BR>—2 Fixity, definiteness; भङ्गं जयं चापतुरव्यवस्थम् R. 7. 54.<BR>—3 Fixity, firm basis; आजह्रतुस्तच्चरणौ पृथिव्यां स्थलारविन्दश्रियमव्यवस्थाम् Ku. 1. 33.<BR>—4 Relative position.<BR>—5 A settled rule, law, statute, decree, decision, legal opinion, written<BR> declaration of the law (especially on doubtful points or where contradictory<BR> texts have to be properly adjusted).<BR>—6 An agreement, a contract.<BR>—7 State, condition.<BR>—8 State or order of things.<BR>—9 Separation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यवस्थातिक्रमः, व्यवस्थापत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थातिक्रमः|व्यवस्थातिक्रम
व्यवस्था + -अतिक्रमः violation of the law, breaking a contract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थापत्रम्
व्यवस्था + -पत्रम् a written deed, document.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थानम्
व्यवस्थानम्, व्यवस्थितिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Arrangement, settlement, determination, decision; बीजक्षेत्रे तथैवान्ये<BR> तत्रेयं तु व्यवस्थितिः Ms. 10. 70.<BR>—2 A rule, statute, decision.<BR>—3 Steadiness, constancy.<BR>—4 Firmness, perseverance; साधु धर्मे व्यवस्थानं क्रियतां यदि शक्यते<BR> Rām. 7. 13. 18.<BR>—5 A fixed limit; न विद्यते व्यवस्थानं क्रुद्धयोः कृष्णयोः क्वचित् Mb. 8. 87. 78.<BR>—6 Separation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थितिः|व्यवस्थिति
व्यवस्थानम्, व्यवस्थितिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Arrangement, settlement, determination, decision; बीजक्षेत्रे तथैवान्ये<BR> तत्रेयं तु व्यवस्थितिः Ms. 10. 70.<BR>—2 A rule, statute, decision.<BR>—3 Steadiness, constancy.<BR>—4 Firmness, perseverance; साधु धर्मे व्यवस्थानं क्रियतां यदि शक्यते<BR> Rām. 7. 13. 18.<BR>—5 A fixed limit; न विद्यते व्यवस्थानं क्रुद्धयोः कृष्णयोः क्वचित् Mb. 8. 87. 78.<BR>—6 Separation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थानः|व्यवस्थान|व्यवस्थानं
व्यवस्थानम्, व्यवस्थितिः + .{@-नः@} N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थापक
व्यवस्थापक <i>a.</i> (-पिका <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Arranging, putting in proper order, adjusting, settling, establishing, deciding.<BR>—2 One who gives a legal opinion.<BR>—3 A manager (modern use).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थापनम्
व्यवस्थापनम्<BR>—1 Arranging, proper adjustment.<BR>—2 Fixing, determining, settling, deciding.<BR>—3 Fixing, placing (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थापित
व्यवस्थापित <i>p. p.</i> Arranged, settled &c.; कर्थचिदद्रेस्तनया<BR> मिताक्षरं चिरव्यवस्थापितवागभाषत Ku. 5. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थित|व्यवस्थितः
व्यवस्थित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Placed in order, adjusted, arranged.<BR>—2 Settled, fixed; किं व्यवस्थितविषयाः क्षात्रधर्माः U. 5.<BR>—3 Decided, determined, declared by law; धर्म एव परः कामादर्थाच्चेति<BR> (नराः) व्यवस्थिताः Mb. 1. 100. 5.<BR>—4 Stood aside, separated.<BR>—5 Extracted.<BR>—6 Based on, resting on.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यवस्थितार्यमर्याद, व्यवस्थितविकल्पः, व्यवस्थितविभाषा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थितार्यमर्याद
व्यवस्थित + -आर्यमर्याद <i>a.</i> adhering to the customs of the Āryas; Kau. A. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थितविकल्पः|व्यवस्थितविकल्प
व्यवस्थित + -विकल्पः, -विभाषा a fixed option; व्यवस्थितविभाषया साधुः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थितविभाषा
व्यवस्थित + -विकल्पः, -विभाषा a fixed option; व्यवस्थितविभाषया साधुः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवस्थिति|व्यवस्थितिः
व्यवस्थिति See व्यवस्थान.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहित|व्यवहितः
व्यवहित See under व्यवधा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1513-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहृ
व्यवहृ €1 P.<BR>—1 To deal in any transaction or business.<BR>—2 To act, behave, deal with (with loc. or by itself); कथं कार्यविनिमयेन<BR> व्यवहरति मय्यनात्मज्ञः M. 1; बहिः सर्वाकारप्रगुणरमणीयं<BR> व्यवहरन् Māl. 1. 14.<BR>—3 To go to law, sue (one) in a court of law; अर्थपतिर्व्यवहर्तुमर्थगौरवादभियोक्ष्यते Dk. 2. 2.<BR>—4 To manage, transact business; सर्वथा व्यवहर्तव्यं कुतो ह्यवचनीयता U. 1. 5.<BR>—5 To regain, recover.<BR>—6 To distinguish.<BR>—7 To roam, stroll about.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहरणम्
व्यवहरणम् Litigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहर्तृ|व्यवहर्त्तृ
व्यवहर्तृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 The manager of a business.<BR>—2 A suer, litigant, plaintiff.<BR>—3 A judge.<BR>—4 An associate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारः|व्यवहार
व्यवहारः<BR>—1 Conduct, behaviour, action.<BR>—2 Affair, business, work; कुटुम्बार्थेऽध्यधीनोऽपि व्यवहारं यमाचरेत् Ms. 8. 167.<BR>—3 Profession, occupation.<BR>—4 Dealing, transaction.<BR>—5 Commerce, trade, traffic.<BR>—6 Dealing in money, usury.<BR>—7 Usage, custom, an established rule or practice.<BR>—8 Relation, connection; तेषां च व्यवहारोऽयं परस्परनिबन्धनः Pt. 1. 79.<BR>—9 Judicial procedure, trial or investigation of a case, administration<BR> of justice; व्यवहारस्तमाह्वयति; अलं लज्जया व्यवहारस्त्वां पृच्छति<BR> Mk. 9; व्यवहारस्थापना Kau. A. 3; Ms. 8. 1; शिवं सिषेवे व्यवहारलब्धम् Bu. C. 2. 40.<BR>—10 A legal dispute, complaint, suit, law-suit, litigation; व्यवहारोऽयं<BR> चारुदत्तमवलम्बते, इति लिख्यतां व्यवहारस्य प्रथमः पादः, केन सह<BR> मम व्यवहारः Mk. 9; ददर्श संशयच्छेद्यान् व्यवहारानतन्द्रितः R. 17. 39.<BR>—11 A title of legal procedure, any occasion of litigation.<BR>—12 A contract; असंबद्धकृतश्चैव व्यवहारो न सिद्धति Ms. 8. 163.<BR>—13 Mathematical process.<BR>—14 Competency to manage oneʼs own affairs; majority.<BR>—15 A sword.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यवहाराङ्गम्, व्यवहाराभिशस्त, व्यवहारायोग्यः, व्यवहारार्थिन्, व्यवहारासनम्, व्यवहारज्ञः, व्यवहारतन्त्रम्, व्यवहारदर्शनम्, व्यवहारपदम्, व्यवहारपादः, व्यवहारमातृका, व्यवहारवादिन्, व्यवहारविधिः, व्यवहारविषयः, व्यवहारस्थितिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहाराङ्गम्
व्यवहारः + -अङ्गम् the body of civil and criminal law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहाराभिशस्त
व्यवहारः + -अभिशस्त <i>a.</i> prosecuted, charged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारायोग्यः|व्यवहारायोग्य
व्यवहारः + -अयोग्यः a minor (in law).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारार्थिन्
व्यवहारः + -अर्थिन् a plaintiff, accuser; अहो स्थिरसंस्कारता व्यवहारार्थिनः Mk. 9. 5/6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारासनम्
व्यवहारः + -आसनम् the tribunal of justice, judgment-seat; व्यवहारासनमाददे<BR> युवा R. 8. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारज्ञः|व्यवहारज्ञ
व्यवहारः + -ज्ञः<BR>—1 one who understands business.<BR>—2 a youth come of age, one who is no longer a minor.<BR>—3 one who is acquainted with judicial procedure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारतन्त्रम्
व्यवहारः + -तन्त्रम् course of conduct; वाक्प्रतिष्टानिबन्धनानि देहिनां<BR> व्यवहारतन्त्राणि Māl. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारदर्शनम्
व्यवहारः + -दर्शनम् trial, judicial investigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारपदम्
व्यवहारः + -पदम् = व्यवहारविषय q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारपादः|व्यवहारपाद
व्यवहारः + -पादः<BR>—1 any one of the four stages of a legal proceeding; these are four:− (1)<BR> पूर्वपक्ष, the plaint; (2) उत्तरपक्ष, the defence; (3) क्रियापाद,<BR> adducing evidence, oral or written; (4) निर्णयपाद, the decision or verdict.<BR>—2 the fourth stage; <i>i. e.</i> निर्णयपाद, that part which concerns<BR> the verdict or decision.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारमातृका
व्यवहारः + -मातृका<BR>—1 a legal process in general.<BR>—2 any act or subject relating to the administration of justice or formation<BR> of courts (of which thirty heads are enumerated).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारवादिन्
व्यवहारः + -वादिन् <i>m.</i> upholder of the usage theory <i>i. e.</i> one who holds<BR> that transactions of old persons (वृद्धव्यवहार) can explain the<BR> knowledge of the connection between शब्द and its अर्थ by the younger<BR> ones; अपि च व्यवहारवादिनः प्रत्यक्षमुपदिशन्ति कल्पयन्ति<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">Page1514-2</a>]<BR> इतरे सम्बन्धारम् ŚB. on MS. 1. 1. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारविधिः|व्यवहारविधि
व्यवहारः + -विधिः a rule of law, any code of law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारविषयः|व्यवहारविषय
व्यवहारः + -विषयः (so {@-पदम्, -मार्गः, -स्थानम्@})<BR> a subject or head of legal procedure,<BR> an actionable business, a matter which may be made the subject of litigation<BR> (these are eighteen; for an enumeration of their names, see Ms. 8. 4-7).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारस्थितिः|व्यवहारस्थिति
व्यवहारः + -स्थितिः <i>f.</i> judicial procedure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारकः|व्यवहारक
व्यवहारकः A dealer, trader, merchant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारिक|व्यवहारिकः
व्यवहारिक <i>a.</i> (-का or -की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Relating to business.<BR>—2 Engaged in business, practical.<BR>—3 Judicial, legal.<BR>—4 Litigant.<BR>—5 Usual, customary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारिका
व्यवहारिका<BR>—1 Usage, custom.<BR>—2 A broom.<BR>—3 The <i>Iṅgudee</i> plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहारिन्
व्यवहारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Transacting business, acting, practising.<BR>—2 Engaged in a law-suit, litigant; नाराजके जनपदे सिद्धार्था व्यवहारिणः<BR> (कथाभिरभिरज्यन्ते) Rām. 2. 67. 16.<BR>—3 Usual, customary. ━<i>m.</i> A man of business; मनोहारी व्यवहार्युपयम्य Dk. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहार्य|व्यवहार्य्य|व्यवहार्य्यः
व्यवहार्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Usual, customary.<BR>—2 Liable to be sued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहार्यम्
व्यवहार्य + .{@-र्यम्@} A treasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहृतम्
व्यवहृतम् Commerce, intercourse; जिह्मप्रायं व्यवहृतं शाठ्यमिश्रं<BR> च सौहृदम् Bhāg. 1. 14. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवहृतिः|व्यवहृति
व्यवहृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Practice, process.<BR>—2 Action, performance; निवासे विद्यानामुपहितकुटुम्बव्यवहृतिः Mv. 1. 11.<BR>—3 Speech, talk, rumour.<BR>—4 Business, trade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवे
व्यवे €2 P.<BR>—1 To divide, separate.<BR>—2 To dissolve, decompose.<BR>—3 (In gram.) To separate by inserting a vowel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवायः|व्यवाय|व्यवायं
व्यवायः<BR>—1 Separation, decomposition, resolution, (into components).<BR>—2 Dissolution.<BR>—3 Covering, concealment; गुणव्यवायेऽप्यगुणं विपश्चितः Bhāg. 8. 6. 11.<BR>—4 Intervention, interval; अट्कुप्वाङ्नुम्व्यवायेऽपि; व्यवायान्नानुषज्येत MS. 1.<BR>—5 An impediment, obstacle.<BR>—6 Copulation, sexual intercourse; व्यवायकाले ददृशे वनौकोदम्पती<BR> द्विजौ Bhāg. 9. 9. 25.<BR>—7 Purity.<BR>—8 Separation, remoteness, interception; संदिग्धे तु व्यवायाद्वाक्यभेदः<BR> स्यात् MS. 3. 1. 21.<BR>—9 Entering, penetration; व्यवायं कुरुते नित्यं धीरो भूतानि धारयन्<BR> Mb. 14. 20. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवायम्
व्यवायः + .{@-यम्@} Light, lustre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवायिन्
व्यवायिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Resolving, decomposing.<BR>—2 Lustful, dissolute. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A sensualist, libertine.<BR>—2 An aphrodisiac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यवेत
व्यवेत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Separated, decomposed.<BR>—2 Different.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यश्
व्यश् €5 Ā.<BR>—1 To fill completely, pervade, occupy; प्रतापस्तस्य भानोश्च युगपद्<BR> व्यानशे दिशः R. 4. 15; Bk. 9. 4, 14. 96.<BR>—2 To obtain, attain to, reach.<BR>—3 To possess, gain.<BR>—4 To fall to oneʼs share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यष्टकम्
व्यष्टकम् Black mustard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1514-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यष्टि
व्यष्टि <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Individuality, singleness.<BR>—2 Distributive pervasion.<BR>—3 (In Vedānta phil.) An aggregate or whole viewed as made up of many<BR> separate bodies (opp. समष्टि q. v.); समष्टिरीशः सर्वेषां स्वात्मतादात्म्यवेदनात् ।<BR> तदभावात्ततोऽन्ये तु कथ्यन्ते व्यष्टिसंज्ञया ॥ Pañcadaśī 1. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यष्ठम्
व्यष्ठम् Copper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्
व्यस् €4 P.<BR>—1 To toss about, scatter, cast or throw asunder; dispel, destroy; प्राप्तो<BR> व्यालतमान् व्यस्यन् भुजङ्गेभ्योऽपि राक्षसान् Bk. 8. 116, 9. 31.<BR>—2 To divide into parts, separate, arrange; स्वयं वेदान् व्यस्यन् Pt. 4. 50;<BR> विव्यास वेदान् यस्मात् स तस्माद् व्यास इति स्मृतः Mb.; R. 10. 84.<BR>—3 To take separately or singly; see व्यस्त below.<BR>—4 To throw over, overturn, upset.<BR>—5 To expel, remove, drive away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनम्
व्यसनम्<BR>—1 Casting away, dispelling.<BR>—2 Separating, dividing.<BR>—3 Violation, infraction; शीलव्यसनमेतत्ते नाभिजानाम्यहं पुरा<BR> Rām. 2. 12. 57; Ki. 3. 45.<BR>—4 Loss, destruction, defeat, fall; defection, weak point; अमात्यव्यसनम्<BR> Pt. 3; स्वबलव्यसने Ki. 13. 15; Śi. 2. 57.<BR>—5<BR>——(<i>a</i>) A calamity, misfortune, distress, evil, disaster, ill-luck; अज्ञातभर्तृव्यसना<BR> मुहूर्तं कृतोपकारेव रतिर्बभूव Ku. 3. 73, 4. 30; R. 12. 57.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Adversity, need; स सुहृद् व्यसने यः स्यात् Pt. 1. 327 ‘a friend in need is a friend indeed’<BR>.<BR>—6 Setting (as of the sun &c.); तेजोद्वयस्य युगपद् व्यसनोदयाभ्याम्<BR> Ś. 4. 1 (where व्यसन means ‘a fall’ also).<BR>—7 Vice, bad practice, evil habit; मिथ्यैव व्यसनं वदन्ति मृगयामीदृग्<BR> विनोदः कुतः Ś. 2. 5; R. 18. 14; Y. 1. 310; (these vices are usually<BR> said to be ten; see Ms. 7. 47-48); समानशीलव्यसनेषु सख्यम् Subhāṣ.<BR>—8 Close or intent application, assiduous devotion; विद्यायां व्यसनम् Bh. 2. 62, 63.<BR>—9 Inordinate addiction.<BR>—10 Crime, sin.<BR>—11 Punishment.<BR>—12 Inability, incompetency.<BR>—13 Fruitless effort.<BR>—14 Air, wind.<BR>—15 Individuality.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यसनातिभारः, व्यसनान्वित, व्यसनार्त, व्यसनपीडित, व्यसनावापः, व्यसनकालः, व्यसनप्रहारिन्, व्यसनब्रह्मचारिन्, व्यसनवर्गः, व्यसनसंस्थित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनातिभारः|व्यसनातिभार
व्यसनम् + -अतिभारः heavy calamity or distress; सा मुक्तकण्ठं व्यसनातिभारात्<BR> (चक्रन्द) R. 14. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनान्वित
व्यसनम् + -अन्वित, -आर्त, -पीडित <i>a.</i> overtaken by calamity, involved in distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनार्त|व्यसनार्त्त|व्यसनार्त्तं|व्यसनार्त्तः
व्यसनम् + -अन्वित, -आर्त, -पीडित <i>a.</i> overtaken by calamity, involved in distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनपीडित
व्यसनम् + -अन्वित, -आर्त, -पीडित <i>a.</i> overtaken by calamity, involved in distress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनावापः|व्यसनावाप
व्यसनम् + -आवापः an abode of calamity; व्यसनावाप एतस्मिन् पतितानां<BR> स्वकर्मभिः Bhāg. 4. 22. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनकालः|व्यसनकाल
व्यसनम् + -कालः time of need.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनप्रहारिन्
व्यसनम् + -प्रहारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 hurting, attacking, giving trouble.<BR>—2 striking (an enemy) in his weak point.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनब्रह्मचारिन्
व्यसनम् + -ब्रह्मचारिन् a fellow-sufferer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनवर्गः
व्यसनम् + -वर्गः an aggregate of calamities; प्रकृतिव्यसनवर्गः Kau. A. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनसंस्थित
व्यसनम् + -संस्थित <i>a.</i> one who indulges in any whim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसनिन्
व्यसनिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Addicted to any vice, vicious.<BR>—2 Unlucky, unfortunate.<BR>—3 Intently attached or excessively devoted to anything, fond of (usually<BR> in comp.); किं भूभृत्कटकस्थितिव्यसनिना व्यर्थं खुराः शातिताः Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्त|व्यस्तः
व्यस्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Cast or thrown asunder, tossed about; विषज्योतिरुज्जृम्भणोड्डामरव्यस्ताविस्तारिदोःखण्डपर्यासितक्ष्माधरम् Māl. 5. 23.<BR>—2 Dispersed, scattered; कल्पाक्षेपकठोरभैरवमरुद्व्यस्तैरवस्तीर्यते U. 5. 14.<BR>—3 Dispelled, cast away.<BR>—4 Separated, divided, severed; ते युष्मासु समस्ताश्च व्यस्ताश्चैवेह<BR> सद्गुणाः Mb. 3. 1. 32; चतुर्युगेष्वथ व्यस्ता द्वापरादौ महर्षिभिः Bhāg. 12. 6. 46;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">Page1515-2</a>]<BR> Śivamahimna 4; हिमवति जलधौ च व्यस्ततोयेव गङ्गा V. 5. 22.<BR>—5 Taken or considered separately, taken singly (opp. समस्त); एभिः<BR> समस्तैरपि किमस्य किं पुनर्व्यस्तैः U. 5; तदस्ति किं व्यस्तमपि<BR> त्रिलोचने Ku. 5. 72.<BR>—6 Simple, uncompounded (as a word).<BR>—7 Manifold, different.<BR>—8 Removed, expelled; शस्त्रव्यस्तसमुद्रदत्तविषयं लब्ध्वा तपस्तप्यते Mv. 2. 19.<BR>—9 Agitated, troubled, confused.<BR>—10 Disordered, out of order, disarranged.<BR>—11 Reversed, upset<BR>—12 Inverse (as ratio); ह्रदाम्भसि व्यस्तवधूकराहते रवं मृदङ्गध्वनिधीरमुज्झति Ki. 8. 43.<BR>—13 Pervading, inherent in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तम्
व्यस्त + .{@-स्तम्@} <i>n.</i> Rotation, turning; अयनपरिवृत्तिर्व्यस्तशब्देनोच्यते<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 5. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तम्
व्यस्त + .{@-स्तम्@} <i>ind.</i> Severally, separately, singly.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यस्तकेश, व्यस्तत्रैराशिकम्, व्यस्तन्यास, व्यस्तपदम्, व्यस्तपुच्छ, व्यस्तविधिः, व्यस्तवृत्ति<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तकेश
व्यस्त + -केश <i>a.</i> with disordered or dishevelled hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तत्रैराशिकम्
व्यस्त + -त्रैराशिकम् the rule of three inverted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तन्यास
व्यस्त + -न्यास <i>a.</i> rumpled (as a couch).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तपदम्
व्यस्त + -पदम्<BR>—1 (in law) a confused statement (of a case).<BR>—2 an uncompounded or simple word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तपुच्छ
व्यस्त + -पुच्छ <i>a.</i> having an extended tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तविधिः|व्यस्तविधि
व्यस्त + -विधिः inverted rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तवृत्ति
व्यस्त + -वृत्ति <i>a.</i> the meaning of which is changed, which has lost<BR> its force (as a word); व्रीडमावहति मे स संप्रति व्यस्तवृत्तिरुदयोन्मुखे<BR> त्वयि R. 11. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यसु
व्यसु <i>a.</i> Lifeless, dead; तैः स्पृष्टा व्यसवः सर्वे निपेतुः<BR> स्म पुरौकसः Bhāg. 7. 10. 59; व्यसुदेहस्रुतशोणितैर्विलिम्पन् Śi. 20. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तारः|व्यस्तार|व्यस्तारं
व्यस्तारः The issue of rut or ichor from the temples of an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यस्तिका
व्यस्तिका <i>ind.</i> With arms or legs spread asunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकीर्ण
व्याकीर्ण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Scattered or thrown about.<BR>—2 Disordered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकुल|व्याकुलः
व्याकुल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Agitated, perplexed, bewildered, dis tracted; शोकव्याकुल, बाष्प˚.<BR>—2 Alarmed, troubled, frightened; वृष्टिव्याकुलगोकुल Gīt. 4.<BR>—3 Full of, overtaken by.<BR>—4 Intently engaged in, busy with; आलोके ते निपतति पुरा सा बलिव्याकुला वा Me. 87.<BR>—5 Flashing, moving about; अन्तर्व्याकुलविद्युदम्बुद इव द्यामभ्युदस्थादरिः U. 3. 43.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याकुलात्मन्, व्याकुलचित्त, व्याकुलचेतस्, व्याकुलमनस्, व्याकुललोचन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकुलात्मन्
व्याकुल + -आत्मन्, -चित्त, -चेतस्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> bewildered in mind, having<BR> a perplexed or distracted mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकुलचित्त
व्याकुल + -आत्मन्, -चित्त, -चेतस्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> bewildered in mind, having<BR> a perplexed or distracted mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकुलचेतस्
व्याकुल + -आत्मन्, -चित्त, -चेतस्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> bewildered in mind, having<BR> a perplexed or distracted mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकुलमनस्
व्याकुल + -आत्मन्, -चित्त, -चेतस्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> bewildered in mind, having<BR> a perplexed or distracted mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकुललोचन
व्याकुल + -लोचन <i>a.</i> having the eyes dimmed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकुलयति
व्याकुलयति Den. P. To agitate, confuse, frighten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकुलित
व्याकुलित <i>a.</i> Agitated, distracted, confounded, perplexed &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकुलीकृ
व्याकुलीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To confound, bewilder, perplex.<BR>—2 To alarm, trouble.<BR>—3 To agitate, perturb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकुलीभू
व्याकुलीभू €1 P. To become perplexed or confused.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकूतिः|व्याकूति
व्याकूतिः <i>f.</i> Fraud, disguise, deception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकृ
व्याकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To make manifest, clear up; नामरूपे व्याकरवाणि Ch. Up.<BR>—2 To propound, explain.<BR>—3 To tell, narrate; तन्मे सर्वं भगवान् व्याकरोतु Mb. 3. 310. 41;<BR> व्याकुर्यात् कः प्रियं वाक्यं यो वक्ता नेदृगाशयः Ki. 11. 41.<BR>—4 To separate, divide, decompose.<BR>—5 To analyse in general.<BR>—6 (With Buddh.) To predict (esp. future birth).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1515-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकरणम्
व्याकरणम्<BR>—1 Analysis, decomposition.<BR>—2 Grammatical analysis, grammar, one of the six <i>Vedāṅgas</i> q. v.;<BR> सिंहो व्याकरणस्य कर्तुरहरत् प्राणान् प्रियान् पाणिनेः Pt. 2. 33.<BR>—3 Explaining, expounding.<BR>—4 Discrimination.<BR>—5 Manifestation.<BR>—6 Prediction.<BR>—7 The sound of a bow-string.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याकरणप्रक्रिया<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकरणप्रक्रिया
व्याकरणम् + -प्रक्रिया etymology, derivation (of a word).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकारः|व्याकार
व्याकारः<BR>—1 Transformation, change of form.<BR>—2 Deformity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकृत
व्याकृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Analysed, separated.<BR>—2 Explained, expounded.<BR>—3 Disfigured, distorted, deformed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकृतिः|व्याकृति
व्याकृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Analysis.<BR>—2 Exposition, explanation.<BR>—3 Change of form, development.<BR>—4 Grammar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकोच
व्याकोच <i>a.</i> Fully expanded, blown (as a flower).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकोपः|व्याकोप
व्याकोपः Opposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकोश|व्याकोशः
व्याकोश(ष) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Expanded, blown, blossomed; व्याकोशकोकनदतां दधते नलिन्यः Śi. 4. 46.<BR>—2 Developed; विवेकव्याकोशे विकसति शमे शाम्यति तृषा Bh. 3. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याकोष|व्याकोषः
व्याकोश(ष) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Expanded, blown, blossomed; व्याकोशकोकनदतां दधते नलिन्यः Śi. 4. 46.<BR>—2 Developed; विवेकव्याकोशे विकसति शमे शाम्यति तृषा Bh. 3. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याक्रोशः|व्याक्रोश
व्याक्रोशः, व्याक्रोशी Abusing, reviling; विहन्तुं व्याक्रोशीं<BR> विदधत इहैके जडधियः Śivamahimna 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याक्रोशी
व्याक्रोशः, व्याक्रोशी Abusing, reviling; विहन्तुं व्याक्रोशीं<BR> विदधत इहैके जडधियः Śivamahimna 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याक्षिप्
व्याक्षिप् €6 P.<BR>—1 To toss or throw about.<BR>—2 To stretch out or forth, open.<BR>—3 Captivate (the mind).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याक्षिप्त
व्याक्षिप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Tossed about.<BR>—2 Torn asunder, distracted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याक्षेपः|व्याक्षेप
व्याक्षेपः<BR>—1 Tossing about.<BR>—2 Obstruction, hindrance.<BR>—3 Delay; अव्याक्षेपो भविष्यन्त्याः कार्यसिद्धेर्हि लक्षणम् R. 10. 6.<BR>—4 Distraction.<BR>—5 Invective, abuse.<BR>—6 Throwing, casting (as a glance); (हेरम्बजननी) कटाक्षव्याक्षेपक्षणजनितसंक्षोभनिवहाः G. L. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याक्षेपिन्
व्याक्षेपिन् <i>a.</i> Driving, removing, one who drives; पाट्यन्तां परितो<BR> रणानि च परव्याक्षेपिभी राक्षसैः Mv. 6. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याक्षोभः|व्याक्षोभ
व्याक्षोभः Agitation, perturbation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याख्या
व्याख्या €2 P.<BR>—1 To tell, communicate, declare; व्याचख्युरुच्चैश्च हतं प्रहस्तम् Bk. 14. 113.<BR>—2 To explain, relate; रावणस्यापि ते जन्म व्याख्यास्यामि Mb.<BR>—3 To name, call; विद्वद्वृन्दैवीणावाणि व्याख्याता सा विद्युन्माला Śrut. 13.<BR>—4 To dwell at large, dilate or enlarge upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याख्या
व्याख्या<BR>—1 Relation, narration.<BR>—2 Explanation, exposition, comment, gloss.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याख्यागम्यम्, व्याख्यास्थानम्, व्याख्यास्वरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याख्यागम्यम्
व्याख्या + -गम्यम् any obscure statement or passage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याख्यास्थानम्
व्याख्या + -स्थानम् lecture-room, school-room.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याख्यास्वरः|व्याख्यास्वर
व्याख्या + -स्वरः the middle tone (in speech).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याख्यात|व्याख्यातः
व्याख्यात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Related, narrated.<BR>—2 Explained, expounded, commented upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याख्यातृ
व्याख्यातृ <i>m.</i> An expounder, a commentator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याख्यानम्
व्याख्यानम्<BR>—1 Communication, narration.<BR>—2 Speech, lecture.<BR>—3 Explanation, exposition, interpretation, comment.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याख्यानशाला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याख्यानशाला
व्याख्यानम् + -शाला a school; Inscr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघट्टनम्
व्याघट्टनम्<BR>—1 Churning.<BR>—2 Rubbing together, friction; तमङ्गदे मन्दरकूटकोटिव्याघट्टनोत्तेजनया<BR> मणीनाम् Śi. 3. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघातः|व्याघात
व्याघातः<BR>—1 Striking against.<BR>—2 A blow, stroke.<BR>—3 An impediment, obstacle.<BR>—4 Contradiction.<BR>—5 Disobedience; प्रथमं तावन्ममाज्ञाव्याघातः Mu. 3.<BR>—6 A figure of speech in which opposite effects are shown to be produced<BR> from the same cause or by the same agency; it is thus defined by Mammaṭa:<BR> -तद्यथा साधितं केनाप्यपरेण तदन्यथा । तथैव यद्विधीयेत स व्याघात<BR> इति स्मृतः ॥ K. P. 10; <i>e. g.</i> see Vb. 1. 2, or the quotation under विरूपाक्ष.<BR>—7 Decline, defeat; कामः स्त्रीरनुशयवानिव स्वपक्षव्याघातादिति Śi. 8. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघातक
व्याघातक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Striking against.<BR>—2 Opposing, resisting, thwarting, hindering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघारित
व्याघारित <i>p. p.</i> Sprinkled with oil or ghee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघूर्णित
व्याघूर्णित <i>p. p.</i> Tottering, reeling; येनाहं भृशमुद्विग्नो व्याघूर्णित<BR> इव द्रुमः Mb. 5. 180. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रः|व्याघ्र
व्याघ्रः [व्याजिघ्रति, व्याघ्रा-क]<BR>—1 A tiger.<BR>—2 (At the end of comp.) Best, pre-eminent, chief; as in नरव्याघ्र,<BR> पुरुषव्याघ्र.<BR>—3 The red variety of the castor-oil plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्री
व्याघ्रः + .{@-घ्री@} A tigress; व्याघ्रीव तिष्ठति जरा परितर्जयन्ति Bh. 3. 109.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याघ्राटः, व्याघ्रास्यः, व्याघ्रदलः, व्याघ्रपुच्छः, व्याघ्रनखः, व्याघ्रनखम्, व्याघ्रनायकः, व्याघ्रपाद, व्याघ्रश्वन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्राटः|व्याघ्राट
व्याघ्रः + -अटः a sky-lark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रास्यः|व्याघ्रास्य
व्याघ्रः + -आस्यः a cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रदलः|व्याघ्रदल
व्याघ्रः + -दलः, -पुच्छः the castor-oil plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रपुच्छः|व्याघ्रपुच्छ
व्याघ्रः + -दलः, -पुच्छः the castor-oil plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रनखः|व्याघ्रनख|व्याघ्रनखं
व्याघ्रः + -नखः, -नखम्<BR>—1 a tigerʼs claw.<BR>—2 a kind of perfume.<BR>—3 a scratch, the impression of a finger-nail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रनखम्
व्याघ्रः + -नखः, -नखम्<BR>—1 a tigerʼs claw.<BR>—2 a kind of perfume.<BR>—3 a scratch, the impression of a finger-nail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रनायकः|व्याघ्रनायक
व्याघ्रः + -नायकः a jackal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रपाद|व्याघ्रपादः
व्याघ्रः + -पाद + ({@-द्@}) <i>a.</i> tiger-footed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रपाद्
व्याघ्रः + -पाद + ({@-द्@}) <i>a.</i> tiger-footed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्रश्वन्
व्याघ्रः + -श्वन् <i>m.</i> a tiger-like dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याघ्राणम्
व्याघ्राणम् The act of smelling at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजः|व्याज
व्याजः<BR>—1 Deceit, trick, deception, fraud.<BR>—2 Art, cunning; अव्याजमनोहरं वपुः Ś. 1. 18 ‘artlessly lovely’; Māl. 5. 12.<BR>—3 A pretext, pretence, semblance; ध्यानव्याजमुपेत्य Nāg. 1. 1;<BR> R. 4. 25, 58, 10. 76, 11. 66.<BR>—4 An artifice, a device, contrivance; व्याजार्धसंदर्शितमेखलानि R. 13. 42.<BR>—5 Wickedness, depravity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याजाह्वयः, व्याजोक्तिः, व्याजगुरुः, व्याजनिद्रित, व्याजनिन्दा, व्याजपूर्व, व्याजव्यवहारः, व्याजसुप्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजाह्वयः|व्याजाह्वय
व्याजः + -आह्वयः a false name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजोक्तिः|व्याजोक्ति
व्याजः + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a figure of speech in which what is apparently the effect of one cause<BR> is intentionally ascribed to another; in other words, where a feeling<BR> is dissembled by being attributed to a different cause; see K. P. 10 under व्याजोक्ति.<BR>—2 covert allusion, insinuation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजगुरुः|व्याजगुरु
व्याजः + -गुरुः a teacher, only in appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजनिद्रित
व्याजः + -निद्रित <i>a.</i> feigning sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजनिन्दा
व्याजः + -निन्दा artful censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजपूर्व
व्याजः + -पूर्व <i>a.</i> having only the appearance of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजव्यवहारः|व्याजव्यवहार
व्याजः + -व्यवहारः artful conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजसुप्त
व्याजः + -सुप्त <i>a.</i> feigning to be asleep. {@स्तुतिः@} <i>f.</i> a figure<BR> of speech resembling the English ‘irony’, wherein censure is implied by<BR> apparent praise; or praise by apparent censure; व्याजस्तुतिर्मुखे निन्दा<BR> स्तुतिर्वा रूढिरन्यथा K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजिह्म
व्याजिह्म <i>a.</i> Crooked, distorted, soiled; धूमपटलव्याजिह्मरत्नत्विषः Nāg. 5. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याजीकरणम्
व्याजीकरणम् Fraud, deception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1516-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याडः|व्याड
व्याडः<BR>—1 A carnivorous animal, such as a tiger.<BR>—2 A villain, rogue.<BR>—3 A snake.<BR>—4 N. of Indra; cf. व्याल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याडिः|व्याडि
व्याडिः N. of a celebrated grammarian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यात्युक्षी
व्यात्युक्षी Mutual splashing and sporting in water; ताः कान्तैः सह<BR> करपुष्करेरिताम्बुव्यात्युक्षीमभिसरणग्लहामदीव्यन् Śi. 8. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यादा
व्यादा €3 U.<BR>—1 To open, break open; न व्याददात्याननमत्र मृत्युः Ki. 16. 16;<BR> नदी कूलं व्याददाति, or व्याददते पिपीलिकाः पतङ्गस्य मुखम् Mbh.<BR>—2 To make large, broaden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यात्त|व्यात्तं
व्यात्त <i>p. p.</i> Opened, spread, expanded; व्यात्ताननं दीप्तविशालनेत्रम् Bg. 11. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यात्तम्
व्यात्त + .{@-त्तम्@} The open mouth; व्यात्तमग्निर्वैश्वानरः Bṛ. Up. 1. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यादानम्
व्यादानम् Opening; कर्णाभ्यर्णविदीर्णसृक्कविकटव्यादानदीप्ताग्निभिः Māl. 5. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यादिश्
व्यादिश् €6 P.<BR>—1 To order, command; समीरणो नोदयिता भवेति व्यादिश्यते केन हुताशनस्य Ku. 3. 21, 13.<BR>—2 To assign or appoint to (a duty).<BR>—3 To divide, distribute.<BR>—4 To point, indicate, show.<BR>—5 To teach, instruct.<BR>—6 To foretell, declare beforehand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यादिशः|व्यादिश
व्यादिशः An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यादेशः|व्यादेश
व्यादेशः Order, command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधः|व्याध|व्याधं
व्याधः [व्यध्-ण]<BR>—1 A hunter, fowler (by caste or profession).<BR>—2 A wicked or low man.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याधभीतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधभीतः|व्याधभीत
व्याधः + -भीतः a deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधं|व्याध|व्याधः
व्याधं, व्याधम् <i>ind.</i> (= विद्ध्वा विद्ध्वा; आभीक्ष्णे णमुल्)<BR> Inflicting wounds again and again; व्याधं व्याधममूढौ तौ यमसाच्चक्रतुर्द्विषौ Bk. 5. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधम्
व्याधं, व्याधम् <i>ind.</i> (= विद्ध्वा विद्ध्वा; आभीक्ष्णे णमुल्)<BR> Inflicting wounds again and again; व्याधं व्याधममूढौ तौ यमसाच्चक्रतुर्द्विषौ Bk. 5. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधिन्
व्याधिन् <i>a.</i> Piercing, wounding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधामः|व्याधाम
व्याधामः, व्याधावः Indraʼs thunderbolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधावः|व्याधाव
व्याधामः, व्याधावः Indraʼs thunderbolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधिः|व्याधि
व्याधिः<BR>—1 Sickness, ailment, disease, illness (usually physical, and opp. आधि<BR> which means ‘mental distress or anxiety’); रिपुरुन्नतधीरचेतसः सततव्याधिरनीतिरस्तु<BR> ते Śi. 16. 11 (where व्याधि means ‘free from आधि’ also); cf. आधि.<BR>—2 Leprosy.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याधिकर, व्याधिग्रस्त, व्याधिघातः, व्याधिघ्नः, व्याधिहन्तृ, व्याधिनिग्रहः, व्याधिबहुल, व्याधिस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधिकर
व्याधिः + -कर <i>a.</i> unwholesome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधिग्रस्त
व्याधिः + -ग्रस्त <i>a.</i> seized with disease, diseased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधिघातः|व्याधिघात
व्याधिः + -घातः, -घ्नः, -हन्तृ<BR>—1 Calamus Rotung (वेतस्).<BR>—2 Cathartocarpus Fistula (Mar. बाहवा, डुक्करकंद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधिघ्नः|व्याधिघ्न
व्याधिः + -घातः, -घ्नः, -हन्तृ<BR>—1 Calamus Rotung (वेतस्).<BR>—2 Cathartocarpus Fistula (Mar. बाहवा, डुक्करकंद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधिहन्तृ
व्याधिः + -घातः, -घ्नः, -हन्तृ<BR>—1 Calamus Rotung (वेतस्).<BR>—2 Cathartocarpus Fistula (Mar. बाहवा, डुक्करकंद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधिनिग्रहः|व्याधिनिग्रह
व्याधिः + -निग्रहः suppression of disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधिबहुल
व्याधिः + -बहुल <i>a.</i> frequently visited with disease (as a village);<BR> नाधार्मिके वसेद् ग्रामे न व्याधिवहुले भृशम् Ms. 4. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधिस्थानम्
व्याधिः + -स्थानम् the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधित|व्याधितः
व्याधित <i>a.</i> Diseased, sick; व्याधितस्यौषधं पथ्यं नीरुजस्य किमौषधैः H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याधूत|व्याधूतः
व्याधूत <i>p. p.</i> Shaken about, trembling, tremulous; मल्लिकाक्षपक्षव्याधूताः<BR> (दण्डाः) U. 1. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याध्मातकम्
व्याध्मातकम् A swollen corpse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यानः|व्यान
व्यानः One of the five life-winds or vital airs in the body, that<BR> which is diffused through the whole body; व्याने तृप्यति श्रोत्रं तृप्यति<BR> Ch. Up. 5. 20. 2; व्यानः सर्वशरीरगः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यानतम्
व्यानतम् A particular kind of coitus or mode of sexual enjoyment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्
व्याप् €5 P.<BR>—1 To fill completely, pervade; श्रुतिविषयगुणा या स्थिता व्याप्य विश्वम्<BR> Ś. 1. 1; V. 1. 1; स्वेदापूरो युवतिसरितां व्याप गण्डस्थलानि Śi. 7. 74;<BR> इमांस्त्वं व्याप्य तिष्ठसि Bg. 10. 16; R. 13. 5, 18. 40; Bk. 7. 56.<BR>—2 To reach as far, extend to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापक|व्यापकः
व्यापक <i>a.</i> (-पिका <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Pervading, comprehensive, diffusive, widely spread, extending over<BR> the whole of anything; तिर्यगूर्ध्वमधस्ताच्च व्यापको महिमा हरेः Ku. 6. 71.<BR>—2 (In law) Comprehending all the points of an argument.<BR>—3 Invariably concomitant.<BR>—4 That which is more extensive than the व्याप्य; <i>e. g.</i> in the<BR> instance मनुष्यो मर्त्यः; मर्त्य is व्यापक as it includes मनुष्य,<BR> and is more extensive than it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापकः|व्यापक
व्यापक + .{@-कः@} An attribute which is invariably concomitant or inherent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापकम्
व्यापक + .{@-कम्@} An invariably concomitant or inherent property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापनम्
व्यापनम्<BR>—1 Pervading, comprehending, penetrating.<BR>—2 Covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापिन्
व्यापिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Pervading, filling, occupying (at the end of comp.).<BR>—2 All-pervading, co-extensive, invariably concomitant.<BR>—3 Covering. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 A pervading property.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्त|व्याप्तं
व्याप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Spread through, penetrated, pervaded, extended over, permeated, covered.<BR>—2 Pervading, extending over all.<BR>—3 Filled with, full of.<BR>—4 Encompassed, surrounded.<BR>—5 Placed, fixed.<BR>—6 Obtained, possessed.<BR>—7 Comprehended, included.<BR>—8 Invariably accompanied (in logic); as in धूमो वह्निना व्याप्तः.<BR>—9 Famous, celebrated.<BR>—10 Expanded, stretched out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्तिः|व्याप्ति
व्याप्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Pervasion, permeation.<BR>—2 (In logic) Universal pervasion, invariable concomitance, universal<BR> accompaniment of the middle term by the major; यत्र यत्र धूमस्तत्र<BR> तत्राग्निरिति साहचर्यनियमो व्याप्तिः T. S.; अव्यभिचरितसाध्यसामानाधिकरण्यं<BR> व्याप्तिः Tarka K.; व्याप्तिः साध्यवदन्यस्मिन्नसंबन्ध उदाहृतः । अथवा<BR> हेतुमन्निष्ठविरहाप्रतियोगिना । साध्येन हेतोरैकाधिकरण्यं व्याप्तिरुच्यते<BR> Bhāṣā P. 67-68.<BR>—3 A universal rule, universality.<BR>—4 Fulness.<BR>—5 Obtaining.<BR>—6 Omnipresence, ubiquity (as a divine attribute).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याप्तिग्रहः, व्याप्तिज्ञानम्, व्याप्तिवादः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्तिग्रहः|व्याप्तिग्रह
व्याप्तिः + -ग्रहः apprehension of universal concomitance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्तिज्ञानम्
व्याप्तिः + -ज्ञानम् knowledge of invariable or universal concomitance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्तिवादः|व्याप्तिवाद
व्याप्तिः + -वादः statement or assertion of universal pervasion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्य|व्याप्यं|व्याप्यः
व्याप्य <i>a.</i> To be pervaded, filled, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्यम्
व्याप्य + .{@-प्यम्@} The sign or middle term of a syllogism (= हेतु, साधन<BR> q. v.) (in logic).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्यत्वम्
व्याप्यत्वम् Invariableness; व्याप्यत्वादपराऽपि च Bhāṣā P.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याप्यत्वासिद्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याप्यत्वासिद्धिः|व्याप्यत्वासिद्धि
व्याप्यत्वम् + -असिद्धिः <i>f.</i> imperfect inference, where the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">Page1518-1</a>]<BR> हेतु itself is false or non-existent; as in the argument पर्वतो<BR> वह्निमान् काञ्चनमयधूमात्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1517-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापद्
व्यापद् €4 Ā.<BR>—1 To die, perish.<BR>—2 (To come down to the earth), fall down.<BR>—3 To be inaudible (as a sound). ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To kill, slay.<BR>—2 To hurt, injure, spoil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापत्तिः|व्यापत्ति
व्यापत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Ruin, calamity, misfortune; व्यापत्तिं कर्मणां दृष्ट्वा जुगुप्सन्ति<BR> जनाः सदा Mb. 12. 265. 34; औदासीन्यं न युक्तं प्रियसुहृदि गते मत्कृते<BR> चातिघोरां । व्यापत्तिम् Mu. 6. 20; Mk. 6. 1.<BR>—2 Substitution of one thing for another.<BR>—3 Death; तयोस्तस्मिन्नवीभूतपितृव्यापत्तिशोकयोः R. 12. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापद्
व्यापद् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Calamity, misfortune, affliction; त्वद्व्यापदो गणयता भयमन्वभावि<BR> तत् सर्वमेकपद एव मम प्रशान्तम् Māl. 9. 36; Bh. 3. 105.<BR>—2 Disease.<BR>—3 Derangement.<BR>—4 Death, decease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापन्न|व्यापन्नः
व्यापन्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Fallen into misfortune, ruined.<BR>—2 Failed, miscarried.<BR>—3 Hurt, injured.<BR>—4 Dead, expired, deceased; as in अव्यापन्न q. v.<BR>—5 Deranged, disordered.<BR>—6 Substituted, changed.<BR>—7 Spoilt, that which is unfit to be consumed by the Āryas; यदभोज्यमार्याणां<BR> केशकीटावपन्नमन्येन वोपघातेनोपहतं तद् व्यापन्नमिति ŚB. on MS. 6. 5. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापादः|व्यापाद
व्यापादः, व्यापादनम्<BR>—1 Killing, slaying.<BR>—2 Ruin, destruction.<BR>—3 Evil design, malice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापादनम्
व्यापादः, व्यापादनम्<BR>—1 Killing, slaying.<BR>—2 Ruin, destruction.<BR>—3 Evil design, malice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापादक
व्यापादक <i>a.</i> Destructive, murderous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापादित|व्यापादितः
व्यापादित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Killed, slain, destroyed.<BR>—2 Ruined, injured, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापृ
व्यापृ €6 Ā.<BR>—1 To be engaged in or occupied with, be busy about (with loc.). —2 To<BR> be employed or placed (in any office). ━<i>Caus.</i> —1 To cause to work,<BR> engage upon, entrust with, appoint to (usually with loc.); व्यापारितः<BR> शूलभृता विधाय सिंहत्वमङ्कागतसत्त्ववृत्तिः R. 2. 38; आत्मजनानुष्ठेये<BR> कर्मणि त्वां व्यापारयितुमिच्छामि Mu. 1.<BR>—2 To place, set, fix, direct, cast; व्यापारयामास करं किरीटे R. 6. 19;<BR> उमामुखे … … व्यापारयामास विलोचनानि Ku. 3. 67; व्यापारितं<BR> शिरसि शस्त्रमशस्त्रपाणेः Ve. 3. 19; R. 13. 25; M. 3. 4.<BR>—3 To use, employ; शस्त्रं मित्रशरीररक्षणकृते व्यापारणीयं मया Mu. 7. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापारः|व्यापार
व्यापारः<BR>—1 Employment, engagement, business, occupation; ततः प्रविशति यथोक्तव्यापारा<BR> शकुन्तला Ś. 1; Ku. 2. 54.<BR>—2 Application, employment; वृष्णीनामिव नीतिविक्रमगुणव्यापारशान्तद्विषाम् Mu. 2. 4.<BR>—3 Profession, trade, practice, exercise; as in शस्त्रव्यापार.<BR>—4 An act, doing, performance.<BR>—6 Working, operation, action, influence; (व्रतं) व्यापाररोधि मदनस्य<BR> निषेवितव्यम् Ś. 1. 26; तस्यानुमेने भगवान् विमन्युर्व्यापारमात्मन्यपि<BR> सायकानाम् Ku. 7. 93; V. 3. 17.<BR>—6 Being placed on; हस्तं कम्पवती रुणद्धि रशनाव्यापारलोलाङ्गुलिम् M. 4. 15.<BR>—7 Exertion, effort; आर्याप्यरुन्धती तत्र व्यापारं कर्तुमर्हति Ku. 6. 32<BR> ‘will be pleased to exert herself in that behalf’;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">Page1518-2</a>]<BR> न व्यापारशतेनापि शुकवत् पाठ्यते बकः<BR> H. Pr. 43. (व्यापारं कृ<BR>—1 to take part in.<BR>—2 to have effect on.<BR>—3 to meddle; as in अव्यापारेषु व्यापारं यो नरः कर्तुमिच्छति Pt. 1. 21.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापारक
व्यापारक <i>a.</i> Having an occupation or function.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापारित
व्यापारित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Engaged, occupied, employed; appointed; अस्मिन्नहमद्रिकुक्षौ व्यापारितः R. 2. 38.<BR>—2 Placed, fixed, set.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापारिन्
व्यापारिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A dealer, trader.<BR>—2 One who exercises or practises anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापृत|व्यापृतः
व्यापृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Engaged in, occupied or busy with, employed in (with loc.); अन्यस्मिन्<BR> कर्मणि व्यापृतं धनुः Ś. 6. 31.<BR>—2 Placed, fixed. ━<i>m.</i> An employee, a minister.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यापृतिः|व्यापृति
व्यापृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Employment, engagement, business; स्वस्वव्यापृतिमग्नमानसतया Bv. 1. 58.<BR>—2 Operation, action.<BR>—3 Exertion.<BR>—4 Profession, practice; see व्यापार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याबाधः|व्याबाध
व्याबाधः Disease, illness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याभाषणम्
व्याभाषणम् Way or manner of speaking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याभ्युक्षी
व्याभ्युक्षी = व्यात्युक्षी q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यामः|व्याम
व्यामः, व्यामनम् A measure of length equal to the space between<BR> the tips of the fingers of either hand when the arms are extended; a fathom;<BR> (द्रुमं) दशव्याममथोद्विद्धं निष्पत्रमकरोत्तदा Mb. 3. 11. 39; Dk. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यामनम्
व्यामः, व्यामनम् A measure of length equal to the space between<BR> the tips of the fingers of either hand when the arms are extended; a fathom;<BR> (द्रुमं) दशव्याममथोद्विद्धं निष्पत्रमकरोत्तदा Mb. 3. 11. 39; Dk. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यामर्षः|व्यामर्ष
व्यामर्षः<BR>—1 Impatience.<BR>—2 Erasure, wiping out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यामिश्र|व्यामिश्रं
व्यामिश्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Mingled, intermixed.<BR>—2 Manifold, of various kinds.<BR>—3 Dubious, doubtful; व्यामिश्रेणेव वाक्येन बुद्धिं मोहयसीव मे Bg. 3. 2.<BR>—4 Troubled, distracted; नैतत् पार्थ सुविज्ञेयं व्यामिश्रेणेति मे मतिः<BR> Mb. 14. 19. 56.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यामिश्रवानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यामिश्रवानम्
व्यामिश्र + -वानम् a blanket of mixed texture; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यामिश्रकम्
व्यामिश्रकम् Various works of mixed languages as Prākṛtas; श्रैष्ठयं<BR> चास्त्रसमूहेषु प्राप्तो व्यामिश्रकेषु च Rām. 2. 1. 27 (com. व्यामिश्रकेषु<BR> प्राकृतादिभाषामिश्रितनाटकादिषु श्रैष्ठयं निपुणताम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यामोकः|व्यामोक
व्यामोकः Release, freedom (from), getting rid of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यामोहः|व्यामोह
व्यामोहः<BR>—1 Infatuation.<BR>—2 Bewilderment, embarrassment, perplexity; कंसस्यालमभूज्जितं जितमिति<BR> व्यामोहकोलाहलः Gīt. 10; Kāv. 3. 101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यायः
व्यायः The way of stretching the bow before shooting the arrow; कैशिकः<BR> केशमूले वै शरशृङ्गे च सात्त्विकः । श्रवणे वत्सकर्णश्च ग्रीवायां भरतो<BR> भवेत् । अंसके स्कन्धनामा च व्यायाः पञ्च प्रकीर्तिताः ॥ Dhanur. 92-93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यायम्
व्यायम् €1 P.<BR>—1 To stretch out, extend.<BR>—2 To struggle, contend, fight.<BR>—3 To try, strive, endeavour.<BR>—4 To sport, dally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यायत|व्यायतं
व्यायत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Long, extended; युवा युगव्यायतबाहुरंसलः R. 3. 34.<BR>—2 Expanded, wide open.<BR>—3 Exercised,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">Page1519-1</a>]<BR> disciplined.<BR>—4 Busy, engaged, occupied.<BR>—5 Hard, firm.<BR>—6 Strong, intense, excessive.<BR>—7 Mighty, powerful.<BR>—8 Deep; व्यायतपातमक्षिणोत् Ku. 5. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1518-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यायतत्वम्
व्यायतत्वम् Muscular development; अपचितमपि गात्रं व्यायतत्वादलक्ष्यम् Ś. 2. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यायामः|व्यायाम
व्यायामः<BR>—1 Extending, stretching out; व्यायामसहमत्यर्थं तृणराजसमं महत् Mb. 4. 40. 6.<BR>—2 Exercise, gymnastic or athletic exercise; व्यायामयोगः Mb. 12. 59. 53<BR> (com. व्यायामयोगः आयुधप्रयोगाभ्यासः); स्थाने शमवतां शक्त्या<BR> व्यायामे वृद्धिरङ्गिनाम् Śi. 2. 94.<BR>—3 Fatigue, labour; व्यायामेन च तेनास्य जज्ञे शिरसि वेदना Mb. 3. 297. 2.<BR>—4 Effort, exertion.<BR>—5 Contention, struggle; व्यायामं मुष्टिभिः कृत्वा तलैरपि समागतैः<BR> Mb. 3. 167. 40, 5. 138. 25.<BR>—6 Business, occupation.<BR>—7 A difficulty.<BR>—8 A measure of distance (= व्याम q. v.).<BR>—9 Training of the army; व्यायामः स्वसैन्यानाम् Kau. A. 1. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यायामिक
व्यायामिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), व्यायामिन् <i>a.</i><BR> Athletic, gymnastic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यायामिकी
व्यायामिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), व्यायामिन् <i>a.</i><BR> Athletic, gymnastic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यायामिन्
व्यायामिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), व्यायामिन् <i>a.</i><BR> Athletic, gymnastic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यायोगः|व्यायोग
व्यायोगः A kind of dramatic composition in one act; it is thus described<BR> by S. D.:− ख्यातेतिवृत्तो व्यायोगः स्वल्पस्त्रीजनसंयुतः । हीनो गर्भविमर्षाभ्यां<BR> नरैर्बहुभिराश्रितः । एकाङ्कश्च भवेदस्त्रीनिमित्तसमरोदयः । कैशिकीवृत्तिरहितः<BR> प्रख्यातस्तत्र नायकः । राजर्षिरथ दिव्यो वा भवेद्धीरोद्धतश्च सः ।<BR> हास्यशृङ्गारशान्तेभ्य इतरेऽत्राङ्गिनो रसाः ॥ 514; cf. मध्यमव्यायोग of Bhāsa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याल|व्यालः
व्याल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wicked, vicious; व्यालद्विपा यन्तृभिरुन्मदिष्णवः Śi. 12. 28; यन्ता<BR> गजं व्यालमिवापराद्धः Ki. 17. 25.<BR>—2 Bad, villainous.<BR>—3 Cruel, fierce, savage; जहति व्यालमृगाः परेषु वृत्तिम् Ki. 13. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालः|व्याल
व्याल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A vicious elephant; व्यालं बालमृणालतन्तुभिरसौ रोद्धुं समुज्जृम्भते Bh. 2. 6.<BR>—2 A beast of prey; वसन्त्यस्मिन् महारण्ये व्यालाश्च रुधिराशनाः Rām. 2. 119. 19;<BR> वनं व्यालनिषेवितम् Rām.<BR>—3 A snake; H. 3. 29.<BR>—4 A tiger; Māl. 3.<BR>—5 A leopard.<BR>—6 A king.<BR>—7 A cheat, rogue.<BR>—8 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यालखड्गः, व्यालनखः, व्यालग्राहः, व्यालग्राहिन्, व्यालमृगः, व्यालरूपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालखड्गः|व्यालखड्ग
व्याल + -खड्गः, -नखः a kind of herb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालनखः|व्यालनख
व्याल + -खड्गः, -नखः a kind of herb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालग्राहः|व्यालग्राह
व्याल + -ग्राहः, -ग्राहिन् <i>m.</i> a snake-catcher; Ms. 8. 260; व्यालग्राही<BR> यथा व्यालं बलादुद्धरते बिलात् Kāśīkhaṇḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालग्राहिन्
व्याल + -ग्राहः, -ग्राहिन् <i>m.</i> a snake-catcher; Ms. 8. 260; व्यालग्राही<BR> यथा व्यालं बलादुद्धरते बिलात् Kāśīkhaṇḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालमृगः|व्यालमृग
व्याल + -मृगः<BR>—1 a wild animal.<BR>—2 a hunting leopard; Mb. 12. 15. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालरूपः|व्यालरूप
व्याल + -रूपः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालकः|व्यालक
व्यालकः A vicious or wicked elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालम्बः|व्यालम्ब|व्यालंब|व्यालंबः
व्यालम्बः A kind of castor-oil plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालीन
व्यालीन <i>a.</i> Thick, dense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालोल
व्यालोल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shaking about, tremulous.<BR>—2 Disordered, dishevelled; एतत्तालतमालसालसरलव्यालोलवल्लीलताच्छन्नम् …<BR> Vālmīkiʼs Gaṅgāṣṭaka 6; व्यालोलः केशपाशः Gīt. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यालोलनम्
व्यालोलनम् Moving to and fro.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावकलनम्
व्यावकलनम् Subtraction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावक्रोशी
व्यावक्रोशी, व्यावभाषी Mutual abuse, reciprocal imprecation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावभाषी
व्यावक्रोशी, व्यावभाषी Mutual abuse, reciprocal imprecation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावर्गः|व्यावर्ग
व्यावर्गः Division, section.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावर्जित
व्यावर्जित <i>p. p.</i> Bent; ऊरुवातविनिर्भग्ना द्रुमा व्यावर्जिताः<BR> पथि Mb. 3. 179. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावल्गित
व्यावल्गित <i>p. p.</i> Moved, agitated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावहारिक|व्यावहारिकः
व्यावहारिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Relating to business, practical.<BR>—2 Legal, judicial; स्वभावेनैव यद्ब्रूयुस्तद्ग्राह्यं व्यावहारिकम् Ms. 8. 78.<BR>—3 Customary, usual.<BR>—4 Relating to the world of illusion; cf. प्रातिभासिक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावहारिकः|व्यावहारिक
व्यावहारिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A counsellor, minister; व्यपनिन्युः सुदुःखार्तां कौसल्यां व्यावहारिकाः<BR> Rām. 2. 66. 13.<BR>—2 Superintendent of Transactions; Kau. A. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावहारिकम्
व्यावहारिक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Use.<BR>—2 Business, trade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावहारी
व्यावहारी Mutual seizing, taking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावहासी
व्यावहासी Mutual derision or laughter; मृग्या शत्रुनिकायानां व्यावहासीमनाश्रितैः Bk. 7. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याविद्ध
व्याविद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Bound; Dk. 2. 2.<BR>—2 Contradictory to one another; क्व च शस्त्रं क्व च वनं क्व च<BR> क्षात्रं तपः क्व च । व्याविद्धमिदमस्माभिः Rām. 3. 9. 27.<BR>—3 Whirled round, tossed about.<BR>—4 Displaced; अथ जर्जरसर्वाङ्गं व्याविद्धनयनाम्बरम् Mb. 3. 11. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावृ
व्यावृ €5 U.<BR>—1 To select, choose.<BR>—2 To hide, conceal.<BR>—3 To obstruct, impede.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावृत
व्यावृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Covered, hid, screened.<BR>—2 Impeded, obstructed.<BR>—3 Opened.<BR>—4 Excepted, excluded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावृतिः|व्यावृति
व्यावृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Covering, screening.<BR>—2 Exclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावृत्
व्यावृत् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To turn away from, turn back; सहभुवा व्यावर्तमाना ह्रिया Ratn. 1. 2.<BR>—2 To be turned or withdrawn from, to be averse to; विषयव्यावृत्तकौतूहलः V. 1. 8.<BR>—3 To become separate or distinct from, to get rid of; न स पाम्मनो<BR> व्यावर्तते Bṛ. Up. 1. 5. 2.<BR>—4 To turn round, revolve.<BR>—5 To go down, set (as the sun).<BR>—6 To cease to exist, perish.<BR>—7 To be opened or split asunder.<BR>—8 To recur, to be repeated again; देशपृथक्त्वात् मन्त्रो व्यावर्तते<BR> Ms. 12. 1. 42. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To restrict, limit, exclude, arrest; overrule, annul (as a rule &c.);<BR> तु शब्दः पूर्वपक्षं व्यावर्तयति Ś. B.; अपवाद इवोत्सर्गं व्यावर्तयितुमीश्वरः R. 15. 7.<BR>—2 To dissuade from, cause to turn away from; नेयमस्माद्व्यवसायात् कथंचिदपि<BR> शक्यते व्यावर्तयितुम् K. 172.<BR>—3 To destroy, remove; व्यावर्तितातपरुजः प्रथमाभ्रवृष्टपा V. 5. 16.<BR>—4 To turn round, cause to revolve.<BR>—5 To separate from.<BR>—6 To scatter, strew.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावर्तः|व्यावर्त|व्यावर्त्त|व्यावर्त्तः
व्यावर्तः<BR>—1 Surrounding, encompassing.<BR>—2 Revolution, going round.<BR>—3 Ruptured navel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावर्तक|व्यावर्त्तक
व्यावर्तक <i>a.</i> (-र्तिका <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Encompassing, surrounding.<BR>—2 Excluding, separating, restricting.<BR>—3 Turning away from.<BR>—4 Turning round.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावर्तनम्
व्यावर्तनम्<BR>—1 Surrounding, encompassing.<BR>—2 Revolving, turning round; व्यावर्तनैरहिपतेरयमाहिताङ्कः Ki. 5. 30.<BR>—3 A fold, band.<BR>—4 Coil (of a snake).<BR>—5 A turn (of a road).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावृत्त|व्यावृत्तः
व्यावृत्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Turned away from, withdrawn from; व्यावृत्ता यत्परस्वेभ्यः श्रुतौ तस्करता<BR> स्थिता R. 1. 27; V. 1. 8.<BR>—2 Separated from, singled out.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Excluded, set aside; different from; अयमर्थोऽस्माद् व्यावृत्तः Tarka K.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Not being found or existing in, absent from (frequently used<BR> in phil. in this sense); धूमो जलह्रदादेर्व्यावृत्तः Tarka K.; Mu. 5. 10.<BR>—4 Revolved, turned round.<BR>—5 Encompassed, surrounded.<BR>—6 Desisting, ceased from; व्यावृत्तगतिरुद्याने कुसुमस्तेयसाध्वसात् Ku. 2. 35.<BR>—7 Split asunder.<BR>—8 Changed; जगाम दक्षिणं मार्गं सोमो व्यावृत्तलक्षणः Mb. 12. 141. 15.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यावृत्तगति<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावृत्तगति
व्यावृत्त + -गति <i>a.</i> desisting from any course of action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावृत्तिः|व्यावृत्ति
व्यावृत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Covering, screening.<BR>—2 Exclusion, separation.<BR>—3 Not being found in, absence from; विपक्षाद्व्यावृत्तिः Tarka K.<BR>—4 Surrounding.<BR>—5 Rolling backwards.<BR>—6 Praise, eulogium.<BR>—7 Recurrence, repetition; मन्त्रस्य व्यावृत्तिर्न्याय्या ŚB. on MS. 12. 1. 42.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यावृत्तिबुद्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यावृत्तिबुद्धिः
व्यावृत्तिः + -बुद्धिः <i>f.</i> the notion of exclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यासः|व्यास
व्यासः<BR>—1 Distribution, separation into parts.<BR>—2 Dissolution or analysis of a compound.<BR>—3 Severalty, distinction.<BR>—4 Diffusion, extension; तस्यैव व्यासमिच्छामि ज्ञातुं ते भगवन् यथा<BR> Bhāg. 6. 4. 2.<BR>—5 Width, breadth.<BR>—6 The diameter of a circle.<BR>—7 A fault in pronunciation.<BR>—8 Arrangement, compilation.<BR>—9 An arranger, a compiler; द्वैपायनोऽस्मि व्यासानां कवीनां काव्य आत्मवान्<BR> Bhāg. 11. 16. 28.<BR>—10 N. of a celebrated sage. [He was the son of the sage Parāśara by<BR> Satyavatī (born before her marriage with Śantanu q. v.); but he retired<BR> to the wilderness as soon as he was born, and there led the life of a<BR> hermit, practising the most rigid austerities until he was called by his<BR> mother Satyavatī to beget sons on the widows of her son Vicitravīrya.<BR> He was thus the father of Pāṇḍu and Dhṛtarāṣṭra and also of Vidura;<BR> qq. vv. He was at first called ‘Kṛṣṇadvaipāyana’ from his dark<BR> complexion and from his having been brought forth by Satyavatī on a Dvīpa<BR> or island; but he afterwards came to be called Vyāsa or ‘the <i>arranger</i>’,<BR> as he was supposed to have arranged the Vedas in their present form; विव्यास<BR> वेदान् यस्मात् स तस्माद् व्यास इति स्मृतः; cf. also जातः स यमुनाद्वीपे<BR> द्वैपायन इति स्मृतः । व्यस्य वेदान् समस्तांश्च व्यासतामगमद्विभुः ॥<BR> Bm. 1. 214. He is believed to be the author of the great epic, the Mahābhārata,<BR> which he is said to have composed with Gaṇapati for his scribe. The eighteen<BR> Purāṇas, as also the Brahma-sūtras and several other works are also<BR> ascribed to him. He is one of the seven <i>chirajeevins</i> or deathless<BR> persons; cf. चिरजीविन्.].<BR>—11 A Brāhmaṇa who recites or expounds the Purāṇas in public.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यासपीठम्, व्यासपूजा, व्याससमास<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यासपीठम्
व्यासः + -पीठम् the seat of the an expounder of the Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यासपूजा
व्यासः + -पूजा N. of the observance of honouring oneʼs preceptor, performed<BR> on the 15th of the bright half of Āṣāḍha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याससमास
व्यासः + -समास (dual) details and the aggregate; आयव्ययौ च व्याससमासाभ्यामाचक्षीत Kau. A. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यासञ्ज्|व्यासंज्
व्यासञ्ज् €1 P. To attach firmly to, fasten on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यासक्त|व्यासक्तः
व्यासक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Closely adhering to; व्यासक्तः सहसा द्विजोपहसितः नग्नो हरः पातु वः Udb.<BR>—2 Attached or devoted to, intent on, occupied or busy with (with loc.).<BR>—3 Separated, detached, disjoined.<BR>—4 Confused, bewildered.<BR>—5 Clasped, embraced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यासङ्गः|व्यासङ्ग|व्यासंग|व्यासंगः
व्यासङ्गः<BR>—1 Close adherence, intent attachment or application.<BR>—2 Intentness, devotion; परार्थव्यासङ्गादुपजहदथ स्वार्थपरताम् Bv. 1. 79.<BR>—3 Diligent study.<BR>—4 Attention; दानज्यानिविषादमूकमधुपव्यासङ्गदीनाननः Māl. 9. 33.<BR>—5 Detachment, separation.<BR>—6 Perplexity, confusion.<BR>—7 Addition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यासिद्ध|व्यासिद्धः
व्यासिद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Prohibited, forbidden.<BR>—2 Contraband (said of goods &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यासेधः|व्यासेध
व्यासेधः Restraint, prohibition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहन्
व्याहन् €2 P.<BR>—1 To obstruct, thwart, oppose, impede.<BR>—2 To repel, drive back.<BR>—3 To strike excessively.<BR>—4 To violate, transgress, disobey; राज्ञी राज्यं विधिवदशिषद्भर्तुरव्याहताज्ञा R. 19. 57.<BR>—5 To foil, frustrate, disappoint.<BR>—6 To trouble, vex, annoy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहत|व्याहतः
व्याहत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Obstructed, impeded.<BR>—2 Repelled, repulsed.<BR>—3 Foiled, disappointed; Śi. 3. 40.<BR>—4 Confused, bewildered, alarmed.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्याहतार्थता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहतार्थता
व्याहत + -अर्थता one of the faults of composition; see K. P. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहतिः|व्याहति
व्याहतिः (In logic) Contradiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहावः|व्याहाव
व्याहावः A distinct call.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहित
व्याहित <i>a.</i> Diseased (व्याधिग्रस्त); एतद्वै परमं तपो<BR> तद् व्याहितस्तप्यते Bṛ. Up. 5. 11. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहृ
व्याहृ €1 P.<BR>—1 To speak, say, utter, tell, narrate, declare; व्याजहार हरसूनुसंनिभः<BR> R. 11. 83; Ku. 2. 62, 6. 2.<BR>—2 To explain.<BR>—3 To cry, scream, shout.<BR>—4 To answer.<BR>—5 To sport; enjoy.<BR>—6 To cut off, sever; Mb. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहरणम्
व्याहरणम्<BR>—1 Utterance, pronunciation; भविष्यति महातेजाः पुत्रस्तव यशस्विनि ।<BR> प्रभावाद्वासुदेवस्य मम व्याहरणादपि ॥ Mb. 14. 62. 12.<BR>—2 Speech, narration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहारः|व्याहार
व्याहारः<BR>—1 Speech, utterance, words; आविर्भूतज्योतिषां ब्राह्मणानां ये व्याहारास्तेषु<BR> मा संशयोऽभूत् U. 4. 18, 5. 29.<BR>—2 Voice, note, sound; परभृतकलव्याहारेषु त्वमात्तरतिर्मधुम् M. 5. 1.<BR>—3 Jest, joke, humorous speech.<BR>—4 Song (of birds).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहृत
व्याहृत <i>p. p.</i> Said, spoken, uttered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहृतम्
व्याहृत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Speaking, talking.<BR>—2 Inarticulate speech or song; रसज्ञाने तु जिव्हेयं व्याहृते वाक् तथोच्यते<BR> Mb. 12. 210. 32.<BR>—3 Information, instruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्याहृतिः|व्याहृति
व्याहृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Utterance, speech, words; न हीश्वरव्याहृतयः कदाचित् पुष्णन्ति<BR> लोके विपरीतमर्थम् Ku. 3. 63.<BR>—2 Statement, expression; भूतार्थव्याहृतिः सा हि न स्तुतिः परमेष्ठिनः R. 10. 33.<BR>—3 A mystic word uttered by every Brāhmaṇa<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">Page1521-1</a>]<BR> in performing his daily Sandhyā adoration; (these Vyāhṛtis are three:<BR> भूर्, भुवस् and स्वस् or स्वर् usually repeated after <i>om</i>;<BR> cf. भूर्भुवः सुवरिति वा एतास्तिस्रो व्याहृतयः T. Up. 1. 5. 1; वेदत्रयान्निरदुहद्भूर्भुवःखरितीति<BR> च) Ms. 2. 76; according to some they are seven in number as भूः,<BR> भुवः, स्वः, महः, जनः, तपः, and सत्यम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1520-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युच्चर्
व्युच्चर् €1 P.<BR>—1 To transgress, offend against, violate.<BR>—2 To be faithless to.<BR>—3 To commit adultery with; विपरीतास्तदा नार्यो वञ्चयित्वार्हतः पतीन् ।<BR> व्युच्चरन्त्यपि दुःशीला दासैः पशुभिरेव च ॥ Mb. 3. 188. 63.<BR>—4 To deviate from the right path.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युच्चरणम्
व्युच्चरणम् Transgression, deviation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युच्छित्तिः|व्युच्छित्ति
व्युच्छित्तिः <i>f.</i>, व्युच्छेदः Cutting off, extermination,<BR> complete destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युच्छेदः|व्युच्छेद
व्युच्छित्तिः <i>f.</i>, व्युच्छेदः Cutting off, extermination,<BR> complete destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युतः|व्युत
व्युतः, -तिः<BR> See व्यूतः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युतिः|व्युति
व्युतः, -तिः<BR> See व्यूतः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्क्रम्
व्युत्क्रम् See उत्क्रम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्क्रमः|व्युत्क्रम|व्युत्क्रमं
व्युत्क्रमः<BR>—1 Transgression, going astray; श्लाघा साऽस्मद्वपुषि विनयव्युत्क्रमेऽप्येष<BR> रागः Ve. 2. 11.<BR>—2 Inverted order, contrariety.<BR>—3 Confusion, disorder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्क्रमणम्
व्युत्क्रमणम् Going apart, separation; P. VIII. 1. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्क्रान्त|व्युत्क्रांत
व्युत्क्रान्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Transgressed, overstepped.<BR>—2 Departed, left, gone forth.<BR>—3 Neglected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्क्रान्ता|व्युत्क्रांता
व्युत्क्रान्त + .{@-ता@} A kind of riddle.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्युत्क्रान्तजीवित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्क्रान्तजीवित
व्युत्क्रान्त + -जीवित <i>a.</i> dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्था
व्युत्था €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To get up, rise.<BR>—2 To increase in strength or power, grow strong.<BR>—3 To oppose, resist, say something in opposition; इति व्युत्तिष्ठमानायां<BR> तस्यामूचे नलः प्रियाम् N. 20. 124. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To excite, instigate, rouse.<BR>—2 To disagree about.<BR>—3 To win over.<BR>—4 To remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्थानम्
व्युत्थानम्, व्युत्थितिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Great activity.<BR>—2 Rising up against, opposition, obstruction.<BR>—3 Independent action, following oneʼs own bent of mind; व्युत्थानं च<BR> विकाङ्क्षाद्भिः कथाभिः प्रतिलोभ्यते Mb. 12. 111. 43.<BR>—4 The completion of religious abstraction or abstract meditation (in Yoga phil.).<BR>—5 A kind of dance.<BR>—6 Causing (an elephant) to rise; यावच्चक्रे नाञ्जनं बोधनाय व्युत्थानज्ञो<BR> हस्तिचारी मदस्य Śi. 18. 26.<BR>—7 Contradicting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्थितिः
व्युत्थानम्, व्युत्थितिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Great activity.<BR>—2 Rising up against, opposition, obstruction.<BR>—3 Independent action, following oneʼs own bent of mind; व्युत्थानं च<BR> विकाङ्क्षाद्भिः कथाभिः प्रतिलोभ्यते Mb. 12. 111. 43.<BR>—4 The completion of religious abstraction or abstract meditation (in Yoga phil.).<BR>—5 A kind of dance.<BR>—6 Causing (an elephant) to rise; यावच्चक्रे नाञ्जनं बोधनाय व्युत्थानज्ञो<BR> हस्तिचारी मदस्य Śi. 18. 26.<BR>—7 Contradicting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्थित
व्युत्थित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Greatly divergent in opinion.<BR>—2 Swerving from duty (उच्छास्त्रवर्तिन्); व्युत्थितोत्पत्तिविज्ञानमाकाशे<BR> च गतिः शुभा Mb. 6. 15. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्पद्
व्युत्पद् €4 Ā.<BR>—1 To be produced from, originate in.<BR>—2 To be derived from (a root &c.); नाम रूढमपि च व्युदपादि Śi. 10. 23.<BR>—3 To become proficient in or conversant with. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To produce, cause.<BR>—2 To derive, trace to a root (as a word); ब्रह्मशब्दस्य व्युत्पाद्यमानस्य Ś. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्पत्तिः|व्युत्पत्ति
व्युत्पत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Origin, production.<BR>—2 Derivation, etymology.<BR>—3 Perfect proficiency, conversancy.<BR>—4 Scholarship, learning; व्युत्पत्तिरावर्जितकोविदापि न रञ्जनाय<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">Page1521-2</a>]<BR> क्रमते जडानाम् Vikr. 1. 16, 18. 108.<BR>—5 Difference of tone or sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्पन्न|व्युत्पन्नः
व्युत्पन्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Produced, begotten.<BR>—2 Formed by derivation.<BR>—3 Derived, traced to its etymology, as a word (opp. अव्युत्पन्न or ‘primitive’).<BR>—4 Completed, perfected; Mv. 4. 57.<BR>—5 Thoroughly proficient in, learned, erudite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्पादनम्
व्युत्पादनम्<BR>—1 Derivation from.<BR>—2 Teaching, instruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युत्त
व्युत्त <i>p. p.</i> Wetted, drenched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युद
व्युद, व्युदक <i>a.</i> Waterless; उपारतं वातवर्षं व्युदप्रायाश्च<BR> निम्नगाः Bhāg. 10. 25. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युदक
व्युद, व्युदक <i>a.</i> Waterless; उपारतं वातवर्षं व्युदप्रायाश्च<BR> निम्नगाः Bhāg. 10. 25. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युदस्
व्युदस् €4 P.<BR>—1 To throw or scatter about.<BR>—2 To throw off, cast away.<BR>—3 To set or lay aside.<BR>—4 To give up, abandon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युदस्त
व्युदस्त <i>p. p.</i> Thrown aside, rejected, cast off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युदासः|व्युदास
व्युदासः<BR>—1 Throwing aside, rejection; अथैकान्तव्युदासेन शरीरे पाञ्चभौतिके<BR> Mb. 12. 19. 18.<BR>—2 Exclusion (in gram.).<BR>—3 Prohibition.<BR>—4 Disregard, indifference.<BR>—5 Killing, destruction; Śi. 15. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युदित
व्युदित <i>a.</i> Disputed, discussed, debated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युपदेशः|व्युपदेश
व्युपदेशः Pretext, pretence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युपरमः|व्युपरम
व्युपरमः Cessation, stop, close; खरस्नायुच्छेदक्षणविहितवेगव्युपरमः<BR> (v. l. व्युपशमः) Māl. 5. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युपरत
व्युपरत <i>p. p.</i> Rested, stopped; अन्तःप्राणावरोधव्युपरतसकलज्ञानरुद्धेन्द्रियस्य Mk. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युपशमः|व्युपशम
व्युपशमः<BR>—1 Non-cessation.<BR>—2 Inquietude.<BR>—3 Complete cessation (where वि shows intensity).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युप्त
व्युप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Shorn, shaved.<BR>—2 Scattered, disordered.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्युप्तकेश<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युप्तकेश
व्युप्त + -केश <i>a.</i> having dishevelled hair; अटत्युन्मत्तवन्नग्नो व्युप्तकेशो<BR> हसन् रुदन् Bhāg. 4. 2. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युष्
व्युष् = प्युष् €10 P.<BR>—1 To void, emit.<BR>—2 To reject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

प्युष्
व्युष् = प्युष् €10 P.<BR>—1 To void, emit.<BR>—2 To reject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युषित
व्युषित <i>p. p.</i> See व्युष्ट; व्युषितायां रजन्यां तु कर्णो राजानमभ्यगात्<BR> Mb. 3. 238. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युष्ट|व्युष्टं|व्युष्टः
व्युष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Burnt.<BR>—2 Dawned, become day-light.<BR>—3 Become bright or clear; ततो रजन्यां व्युष्टायां प्रभातेऽभ्युदिते रवौ Mb. 1. 21. 1.<BR>—4 Dwelt; सा व्युष्टा रजनीं तत्र पितुर्वेश्मनि भाविनी Mb. 3. 69. 28.<BR>—5 Passed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युष्टम्
व्युष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@}<BR>—1 Day-break, dawn; व्युष्टं प्रयाणम् Śi. 12. 4.<BR>—2 Day.<BR>—3 Fruit, result.<BR>—4 The new yearʼs day on श्रावण; Kau. A. 2. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्युष्टिः|व्युष्टि
व्युष्टिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Dawn.<BR>—2 Prosperity; व्युष्टिरेषा परा स्त्रीणाम् Mb. 1. 158. 22, 13. 61. 14.<BR>—3 Grace, beauty; तदेतत् कीर्तिश्च व्युष्टिश्चेत्युपासीत कीर्तिमान् व्युष्टिमान्<BR> भवति य एवं वेद Ch. Up. 3. 14. 4.<BR>—4 Praise.<BR>—5 Fruit, consequence; यत्तत्तस्य त्वया व्युष्टिः प्राप्तेयं प्लवगाधिप<BR> Rām. 4. 20. 11; Mb. 13. 26. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1521-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूत|व्यूतं
व्यूत <i>a.</i> Interwoven, sewn, interlaced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूतिः|व्यूति
व्यूतिः<BR>—1 Weaving, sewing.<BR>—2 The wages of weaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूह्
व्यूह् €1 P.<BR>—1 To arrange troops in battle array; सूच्या वज्रेण चैवैतान् व्यूहेन<BR> व्यूह्य योधयेत् Ms. 7. 191.<BR>—2 To arrange, put or place in order, dispose.<BR>—3 To separate, divide.<BR>—4 To alter, transpose, disarrange.<BR>—5 To resolve (vowels, syllables &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूढ|व्यूढः
व्यूढ <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Expanded, developed, broad, wide; व्यूढोरस्को वृषस्कन्धः R. 1. 13.<BR>—2 Firm, compact.<BR>—3 Placed in order, arranged, marshalled (as an army); तेन व्यूढेन<BR> सैन्येन लोकानुद्वर्तयन्निव Mb. 3. 283. 15; दृष्ट्वा तु पाण्डवानीकं<BR> व्यूढं दुर्योधनस्तदा Bg. 1. 3.<BR>—4 Disarranged, placed out of order; दिक्षु व्यूढाङ्घ्रिपाङ्गस्तृणजटिलचलत्पांशुदण्डोऽन्तरिक्षे Ve. 2. 19.<BR>—5 Married; व्यूढायाश्चापि पुंश्चल्या मनोऽभ्येति नवं नवम् Bhāg. 10. 60. 48.<BR>—6 Large, great.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यूढकङ्कट<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूढकङ्कट|व्यूढकंकट|व्यूढकङ्कटः
व्यूढ + -कङ्कट <i>a.</i> mailed, clad in armour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूढिः|व्यूढि
व्यूढिः <i>f.</i> Orderly arrangement, array.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूहः|व्यूह
व्यूहः<BR>—1 A military array; दण्डव्यूहेन तन्मार्गं यायात्तु शकटेन वा । वराहमकराभ्यां<BR> वा सूच्या वा गरुडेन वा ॥ Ms. 7. 187; cf. दण्डव्यूहः, शकट˚, वराह˚,<BR> सर्वतोभद्र˚ etc. mentioned in Dhanur.<BR>—2 An army, a host, squadron; व्यूहावुभौ तावितरेतरस्मात् भङ्गं जयं<BR> चापतुरव्यवस्थम् R. 7. 54.<BR>—3 A large quantity, an assemblage, a multitude, collection; विमिश्रा<BR> विहगाः पुंभिरात्मव्यूहाभिनन्दिताः Rām. 4. 1. 27; गुणव्यूहः Bhāg. 4. 29. 71.<BR>—4 A part, portion, subhead.<BR>—5 The body.<BR>—6 Structure, formation.<BR>—7 Reasoning, logic.<BR>—8 Separation, distribution.<BR>—9 (In phil.) A peculiar arrangement of the senses.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्यूहपार्ष्णिः, व्यूहभङ्गः, व्यूहभेदः, व्यूहरचना, व्यूहविभागः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूहपार्ष्णिः|व्यूहपार्ष्णि
व्यूहः + -पार्ष्णिः <i>f.</i> the rear of an army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूहभङ्गः|व्यूहभङ्ग
व्यूहः + -भङ्गः, -भेदः breaking an array.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूहभेदः|व्यूहभेद
व्यूहः + -भङ्गः, -भेदः breaking an array.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूहरचना
व्यूहः + -रचना arrangement of troops.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूहविभागः
व्यूहः + -विभागः a distinctive array of army; पक्षकक्षा-उरस्यानां बलाग्रतो<BR> व्यूहविभागाः Kau. A. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यूहनम्
व्यूहनम्<BR>—1 Arraying of troops, marshalling.<BR>—2 Structure of the members of the body.<BR>—3 Development (of the foetus).<BR>—4 Displacement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यृद्ध
व्यृद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Deprived of prosperity, unlucky, unfortunate.<BR>—2 Deprived of or excluded from.<BR>—3 Nullified.<BR>—4 Imperfect, deficient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्यृद्धिः|व्यृद्धि
व्यृद्धिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Non-prosperity, ill-luck, misfortune (विगता ऋद्धिर्व्यृद्धिः); as<BR> in यवनानां व्यृद्धिर्दुर्यवनम् Sk.<BR>—2 Scarcity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्ये
व्ये €1 U. (व्ययति-ते, ऊत; <i>Caus.</i> व्याययति-ते; <i>desid.</i> विव्यासति)<BR>—1 To cover.<BR>—2 To sew.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्येक
व्येक <i>a.</i> Deficient by one.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योकारः|व्योकार
व्योकारः A blacksmith; व्योकाराः शौल्बिकास्तथा Śiva B. 31. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमन्
व्योमन् <i>n.</i> [व्ये-मनिन् पृषो˚ Uṇ. 4. 150]<BR>—1 The sky, atmosphere; अस्त्वेवं जडधामता तु भवतो यद् व्योम्नि विस्फूर्जसे<BR> K. P. 10; Me. 53; R. 12. 67; N. 22. 54.<BR>—2 Water.<BR>—3 A temple sacred to the sun.<BR>—4 Talc.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्योमाख्यम्, व्योमोदकम्, व्योमकेशः, व्योमकोशन्, व्योमगः, व्योमगङ्गा, व्योमगमनीविद्या, व्योमचरः, व्योमचारिन्, व्योमधारणः, व्योमधूमः, व्योमदेवः, व्योमनाशिका, व्योमपुष्पम्, व्योममञ्जरम्, व्योममण्डलम्, व्योममाय, व्योममुद्गरः, व्योमयानम्, व्योमरत्नम्, व्योमसद्, व्योमसंभवा, व्योमस्थली, व्योमस्पृश्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमाख्यम्
व्योमन् + -आख्यम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">Page1522-2</a>]<BR> talc, mica.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमोदकम्
व्योमन् + -उदकम् rain-water, dew.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमकेशः|व्योमकेश
व्योमन् + -केशः, -कोशन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमकोशन्
