व्योमगः|व्योमग
व्योमन् + -गः a divine being.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमगङ्गा|व्योमगंगा
व्योमन् + -गङ्गा the heavenly Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमगमनीविद्या
व्योमन् + -गमनीविद्या the magic art of flying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमचरः|व्योमचर
व्योमन् + -चरः a planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमचारिन्
व्योमन् + -चारिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a god.<BR>—2 a bird.<BR>—3 a saint.<BR>—4 a Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—5 a heavenly body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमधारणः|व्योमधारण
व्योमन् + -धारणः mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमधूमः|व्योमधूम
व्योमन् + -धूमः a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमदेवः|व्योमदेव
व्योमन् + -देवः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमनाशिका
व्योमन् + -नाशिका a kind of quail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमपुष्पम्
व्योमन् + -पुष्पम् an impossibility, absurdity (as a flower in the air).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योममञ्जरम्
व्योमन् + -मञ्जरम्, -मण्डलम् a flag, banner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योममण्डलम्
व्योमन् + -मञ्जरम्, -मण्डलम् a flag, banner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योममाय
व्योमन् + -माय <i>a.</i> reaching to the sky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योममुद्गरः|व्योममुद्गर
व्योमन् + -मुद्गरः a gust of wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमयानम्
व्योमन् + -यानम् a celestial car.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमरत्नम्
व्योमन् + -रत्नम् the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमसद्
व्योमन् + -सद् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a deity, god.<BR>—2 a <i>Gandharva</i>; ज्वलन्मणि व्योमसदां सनातनम् Ki. 8. 1.<BR>—3 a spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमसंभवा|व्योमसम्भवा
व्योमन् + -संभवा a spotted cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमस्थली
व्योमन् + -स्थली the earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योमस्पृश्
व्योमन् + -स्पृश् <i>a.</i> ‘sky-touching’, very lofty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्योषम्
व्योषम् An aggregate of three spices (black and long pepper, and dry ginger.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रज्
व्रज् I. €1 P. (व्रजति)<BR>—1 To go, walk, proceed; नाविनीतैर्व्रजेद् धुर्यैः Ms. 4. 67.<BR>—2 To go to, approach, visit; मामेकं शरणं व्रज Bg. 18. 66.<BR>—3 To depart, retire, withdraw.<BR>—4 To pass away (as time); इयं व्रजति यामिनी त्यज नरेन्द्र निद्रारसम् Vikr. 11. 74.<BR>—5 To attain to, go to the state of.<BR>—6 To obtain, gain. ━II. €10 U. (व्राजयति-ते)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To prepare, decorate. (This root is used much in the same way as गम्<BR> or या q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रजः|व्रज|व्रजं
व्रजः [व्रज्-घञर्थे क]<BR>—1 A multitude, collection, flock, group; सगोव्रजोऽत्यात्मपदुर्गमार्गः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 13. 30; नेत्रव्रजाः पौरजनस्य तस्मिन् विहाय सर्वान्नृपतीन्निपेतुः<BR> R. 6. 7, 7. 60; Śi. 6. 6, 14. 33.<BR>—2 A station of cowherds; Bhāg. 12. 9. 28.<BR>—3 A cow-pen, cow-shed; ‘व्रजः स्याद्गोकुलं गोष्टम्’ इति वैजयन्ती; निरुद्धवीवधासारप्रसारा<BR> गा इव व्रजम् Śi. 2. 64; Ki. 4. 16.<BR>—4 An abode, a resting-place.<BR>—5 A road.<BR>—6 A cloud.<BR>—7 N. of a district near Mathurā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रजम्
व्रजः + .{@-जम्@} Wandering, going.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: व्रजाङ्गना, व्रजयुवतिः, व्रजाजिरम्, व्रजकिशोरः, व्रजनाथः, व्रजमोहनः, व्रजवरः, व्रजवल्लभः, व्रजभाषा, व्रजसानः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रजाङ्गना|व्रजांगना
व्रजः + -अङ्गना, -युवतिः <i>f.</i> a woman of Vraja, a cowherdess; मथुरागमनोन्मुखे<BR> मुरारावसुभारार्तिमृतां व्रजाङ्गनानाम् Bv. 2. 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रजयुवतिः|व्रजयुवति
व्रजः + -अङ्गना, -युवतिः <i>f.</i> a woman of Vraja, a cowherdess; मथुरागमनोन्मुखे<BR> मुरारावसुभारार्तिमृतां व्रजाङ्गनानाम् Bv. 2. 165.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

व्रजाजिरम्
व्रजः + -अजिरम् a cow-pen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1522-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

