शकुलः + -अक्षका, -अक्षी white bent grass, Panicum Dactylon (Mar. शुक्लदूर्वा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकुलादनी
