शकुलः + -अर्भकः, -गण्डः a kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकुलगण्डः|शकुलगण्ड
शकुलः + -अर्भकः, -गण्डः a kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकृत्
शकृत् <i>n.</i> [शक्-ऋतन् Uṇ. 4. 58] Ordure, excrement, especially of animals.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शकृत्करिः, शकृत्कीटः, शकृद्द्वारम्, शकृत्पिण्डः, शकृत्पिण्डकः, शकृद्भेदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकृत्करिः|शकृत्करि
शकृत् + -करिः <i>m., f.</i>, {@-करी@}<BR> a calf; शकृत्करिर्वत्सः Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकृत्कीटः|शकृत्कीट
शकृत् + -कीटः a dung-beetle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकृद्द्वारम्
शकृत् + -द्वारम् the anus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकृत्पिण्डः|शकृत्पिण्ड|शकृत्पिंड
शकृत् + -पिण्डः, -पिण्डकः a ball or lump of dung; शष्पाण्यत्ति प्रकिरति<BR> शकृत्पिण्डकानाम्रमात्रान् U. 4. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकृत्पिण्डकः|शकृत्पिण्डक
शकृत् + -पिण्डः, -पिण्डकः a ball or lump of dung; शष्पाण्यत्ति प्रकिरति<BR> शकृत्पिण्डकानाम्रमात्रान् U. 4. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शकृद्भेदः|शकृद्भेद
शकृत् + -भेदः diarrhoea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्करः|शक्कर
शक्करः, -शक्करिः<BR> A bull; Hc. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्करिः|शक्करि
शक्करः, -शक्करिः<BR> A bull; Hc. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्करी
शक्करी<BR>—1 A river.<BR>—2 A girdle, zone.<BR>—3 A woman of impure caste.<BR>—4 A finger.<BR>—5 N. of a metre; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्त|शक्तः
शक्त <i>p. p.</i> [शक्-क्त]<BR>—1 Able, capable, competent (with gen. or loc. or inf.); बहवोऽस्य<BR> कर्मणः शक्ताः Ve. 3; तस्योपकारे शक्तस्त्वं किं जीवन् किमुतान्यथा<BR> <i>ibid.</i>; शक्तस्य शक्यकारणात् Sāṅ. K. 9.<BR>—2 Strong, mighty, powerful.<BR>—3 Rich,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">Page1526-2</a>]<BR> opulent; शक्तः परजने दाता स्वजने दुःखजीविनि Ms. 11. 9.<BR>—4 Significant, expressive, conveying a meaning by denotation (अभिधा<BR> or शक्ति) and not by indication (लक्षणा) (as a word).<BR>—5 Clever, intelligent. —6 Speaking kindly or agreeably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिः|शक्ति
शक्तिः <i>f.</i> [शक्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Power, ability, capacity, strength, energy, prowess; दैवं<BR> निहत्य कुरु पौरुषमात्मशक्त्या Pt. 1. 361; ज्ञाने मौनं क्षमा शक्तौ<BR> R. 1. 22; so यथाशक्ति, स्वशक्ति &c.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Faculty, capacity; स्मरणशक्ति ‘retentive faculty or memory’.<BR>—2 Regal power; (it has three parts or elements; 1 प्रभुशक्ति or प्रभावशक्ति<BR> ‘the majesty or pre-eminent position of the king himself’; 2 मंत्रशक्ति<BR> ‘the power of good counsel’; and 3 उत्साहशक्ति ‘the power of energy’);<BR> राज्यं नाम शक्तित्रयायत्तम् Dk.; त्रिसाधना शक्तिरिवार्थसंचयम्<BR> R. 3. 13, 6. 33, 17. 63; Śi. 2. 26.<BR>—3 The power of composition, poetic power or genius; शक्तिर्निपुणता<BR> लोकशास्त्रकाव्याद्यवेक्षणात् K. P. 1; see explanation <i>ad loc.</i><BR>—4 The active power of a deity, regarded as his wife, female divinity;<BR> (these are variously enumerated, 8, 9 or even 50 being mentioned); स<BR> जयति परिणद्धः शक्तिभिः शक्तिनाथः Māl. 5. 1; Ś. 7. 35.<BR>—5 A kind of missile; शक्तिखण्डामर्षितेन गाण्डीविनोक्तम् Ve. 3; ततो<BR> बिभेद पौलस्त्यः शक्त्या वक्षसि लक्ष्मणम् R. 12. 77.<BR>—6 A spear, dart, pike, lance.<BR>—7 (In phil.) The relation of a term to the thing designated.<BR>—8 The power inherent in cause to produce its necessary effect.<BR>—9 (In Rhet.) The power or signification of a word; (these are three अभिधा,<BR> लक्षणा and व्यञ्जना); तिस्रः शब्दस्य शक्तयः S. D. 11.<BR>—10 The expressive power or denotation of a word (opp. लक्षणा and<BR> व्यञ्जना); it is thus defined:− अस्माच्छब्दादयमर्थो बोद्धव्य इत्याकारकोऽनादिसंकेतः<BR> शक्तिः Tarka K.<BR>—11 The female organ, the counterpart of the Phallus of Śiva worshipped<BR> by a sect of people called Śāktas.<BR>—12 A sword.<BR>—13 An implement in gambling.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शक्त्यर्धः, शक्त्यपेक्ष, शक्त्यपेक्षिन्, शक्तिकुण्ठनम्, शक्तिग्रह, शक्तिग्राहक, शक्तित्रयम्, शक्तिधर, शक्तिध्वजः, शक्तिनाथः, शक्तिपर्णः, शक्तिपाणिः, शक्तिभृत्, शक्तिपातः, शक्तिपूजकः, शक्तिपूजा, शक्तिपूर्वः, शक्तिवैकल्यम्, शक्तिहीन, शक्तिहेतिकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्त्यर्धः|शक्त्यर्ध
शक्तिः + -अर्धः perspiring and panting through fatigue or exertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्त्यपेक्ष
शक्तिः + -अपेक्ष, -अपेक्षिन् <i>a.</i> having regard to strength; षाड्गुण्यमुपयुञ्जीत<BR> शक्त्यपेक्षो रसायनम् Śi. 2. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्त्यपेक्षिन्
शक्तिः + -अपेक्ष, -अपेक्षिन् <i>a.</i> having regard to strength; षाड्गुण्यमुपयुञ्जीत<BR> शक्त्यपेक्षो रसायनम् Śi. 2. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिकुण्ठनम्
शक्तिः + -कुण्ठनम् the deadening of a power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिग्रह|शक्तिग्रहः
शक्तिः + -ग्रह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 apprehending the force or meaning.<BR>—2 armed with a spear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिग्रहः|शक्तिग्रह
शक्तिः + -ग्रह + .({@-हः@})<BR>—1 apprehension of the force, meaning, or acceptation of a word.<BR>—2 a spearman, lancer.<BR>—3 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—4 of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिग्राहक|शक्तिग्राहकः
शक्तिः + -ग्राहक <i>a.</i> determining or establishing the meaning of a word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिग्राहकः|शक्तिग्राहक
शक्तिः + -ग्राहक + .({@-कः@}) epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तित्रयम्
शक्तिः + -त्रयम् the three constituent elements of regal power; see शक्ति (2) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिधर|शक्तिधरः
शक्तिः + -धर <i>a.</i> strong, powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिधरः|शक्तिधर
शक्तिः + -धर + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a spearman.<BR>—2 an epithet of Kārtikeya; ततस्तामेव चोत्कृष्य शक्तिं शक्तिधरप्रियः<BR> Rām. 7. 8. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिध्वजः|शक्तिध्वज
शक्तिः + -ध्वजः N. of Kārtikeya; शक्तिध्वजशिखरशूलोत्सेधं सौधमागतम् Dk. 2. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिनाथः|शक्तिनाथ
शक्तिः + -नाथः N. of Śiva; स जयति परिणद्धः शक्तिभिः शक्तिनाथः Māl. 5. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिपर्णः|शक्तिपर्ण
शक्तिः + -पर्णः Alstonia Scholaris (Mar. सातवीण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिपाणिः|शक्तिपाणि
शक्तिः + -पाणिः, -भृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a spearman.<BR>—2 an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिभृत्
शक्तिः + -पाणिः, -भृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a spearman.<BR>—2 an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिपातः|शक्तिपात
शक्तिः + -पातः<BR>—1 prostration of strength.<BR>—2 In Yoga philosophy, a spiritual procedure,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">Page1527-1</a>]<BR> by which the preceptor puts his strength (spiritual power) in his pupil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1526-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिपूजकः|शक्तिपूजक
शक्तिः + -पूजकः a Śākta q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिपूजा
शक्तिः + -पूजा the worship of Śakti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिपूर्वः|शक्तिपूर्व
शक्तिः + -पूर्वः an epithet of Parāśara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिवैकल्यम्
शक्तिः + -वैकल्यम् loss of strength, debility, incapacity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिहीन
शक्तिः + -हीन <i>a.</i> powerless, weak, impotent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिहेतिकः|शक्तिहेतिक
शक्तिः + -हेतिकः a lancer, spearman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तितस्
शक्तितस् <i>ind.</i> According to power, to the best of oneʼs power or ability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तिमत्|शक्तिमन्त्
शक्तिमत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Strong, able, powerful, mighty.<BR>—2 Possessing a competence.<BR>—3 Armed with a weapon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्मन्
शक्मन् <i>n.</i> [शक् मनिन् Uṇ. 4. 160] Ved. Power, strength, energy.<BR>━<i>m.</i> N. of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्य|शक्यः
शक्य <i>pot. p.</i><BR>—1 Possible, practicable, capable of being done or effected (usually with<BR> an inf.); शक्यो वारयितुं जलेन हुतभुक् Bh. 2. 11; R. 2. 49, 54.<BR>—2 Fit to be effected.<BR>—3 Easy to be effected.<BR>—4 Directly conveyed or expressed (as the meaning of a word); शक्योऽर्थोऽभिधया<BR> ज्ञेयः S. D. 10.<BR>—5 Potential.<BR>—6 Of agreeable or sweet address; ‘शक्यः प्रियंवदः प्रोक्तः’ इति<BR> हलायुधः; शक्यः संविभागशीलः Dk. 2. 5. (The form शक्यम् is sometimes<BR> used as a predicative word with an inf. in a passive sense, the real object<BR> of the infinitive being in the nom. case; एवं हि प्रणयवती सा शक्यमुपेक्षितुं<BR> कुपिता M. 3. 22; शक्यं … अविरलमालिङ्गितुं पवनः Ś. 3. 6;<BR> विभूतयः शक्यमवाप्तुमूर्जिताः Subhāṣ.; न हि देहमृता शक्यं<BR> त्यक्तुं कर्माण्यशेषतः Bg. 18. 11.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शक्यार्थः, शक्यप्रतीकार, शक्यसामन्तता<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्यार्थः|शक्यार्थ
शक्य + -अर्थः the meaning directly expressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्यप्रतीकार
शक्य + -प्रतीकार <i>a.</i> remediable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्यसामन्तता
शक्य + -सामन्तता the state of being able to conquer the neighbouring kings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्यता
शक्यता, -शक्यत्वम्<BR>—1 Possibility, practicability.<BR>—2 Capacity, capability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्यत्वम्
शक्यता, -शक्यत्वम्<BR>—1 Possibility, practicability.<BR>—2 Capacity, capability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्तु|शक्तुः
शक्तु <i>m., n.</i> The flour or meal of barley, barley-meal; see सक्तु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्न|शक्नः
शक्न, -शक्ल <i>a.</i><BR> Speaking kindly or agreeably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्ल|शक्लः
शक्न, -शक्ल <i>a.</i><BR> Speaking kindly or agreeably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रः|शक्र
शक्रः [शक्-रक्]<BR>—1 N. of Indra; एकः कृती शकुन्तेषु योऽन्यं शकान्न याचते Kuval.<BR>—2 The Arjuna tree.<BR>—3 The Kuṭaja tree.<BR>—4 An owl.<BR>—5 The asterism ज्येष्ठा.<BR>—6 The number ‘fourteen’.<BR>—7 N. of Śiva.<BR>—8 Lord; शक्रप्रस्थस्य शक्रेण विरुद्धोऽयमभूत् सदा Śiva B. 9. 5.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शक्राशनः, शक्राख्यः, शक्रात्मजः, शक्रोत्थानम्, शक्रोत्सवः, शक्रकाष्ठा, शक्रगोपः, शक्रजः, शक्रजातः, शक्रजालम्, शक्रजित्, शक्रभिद्, शक्रद्रुमः, शक्रधनुस्, शक्रध्वजः, शक्रपर्यायः, शक्रपादपः, शक्रप्रस्थम्, शक्रभवनम्, शक्रभुवनम्, शक्रवासः, शक्रभूभवा, शक्रमातृका, शक्रमूर्धन्, शक्रलोकः, शक्रवल्ली, शक्रवाहनम्, शक्रशाखिन्, शक्रशाला, शक्रसारथिः, शक्रसुत, शक्रसृष्टा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्राशनः|शक्राशन|शक्राशनं
शक्रः + -अशनः the Kuṭaja tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्राशनम्
शक्रः + -अशनः + .({@-नम्@}) an intoxicating drink prepared from hemp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्राख्यः|शक्राख्य
शक्रः + -आख्यः an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रात्मजः|शक्रात्मज
शक्रः + -आत्मजः<BR>—1 Jayanta, son of Indra.<BR>—2 Arjuna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रोत्थानम्
शक्रः + -उत्थानम्, -उत्सवः a festival in honour of Indra on the 12th day<BR> of the bright half of Bhādrapada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रोत्सवः|शक्रोत्सव
शक्रः + -उत्थानम्, -उत्सवः a festival in honour of Indra on the 12th day<BR> of the bright half of Bhādrapada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रकाष्ठा
शक्रः + -काष्ठा the east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रगोपः|शक्रगोप
शक्रः + -गोपः a kind of red insect; cf. इन्द्रगोप; अविरलविततेव<BR> शक्रगोपैररुणितनीलतृणोलपा धरित्री Ki. 10. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रजः|शक्रज
शक्रः + -जः, -जातः a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रजातः|शक्रजात
शक्रः + -जः, -जातः a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रजालम्
शक्रः + -जालम् magic, sorcery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रजित्
शक्रः + -जित्, -भिद् <i>m.</i> epithets of Meghanāda, son of Rāvaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रभिद्
शक्रः + -जित्, -भिद् <i>m.</i> epithets of Meghanāda, son of Rāvaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रद्रुमः|शक्रद्रुम
शक्रः + -द्रुमः the Devadāru tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रधनुस्
शक्रः + -धनुस् <i>n.</i>, {@-शरासनम्@}<BR> the rain-bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रध्वजः|शक्रध्वज
शक्रः + -ध्वजः a flag set up in honour of Indra; जृम्भमाणः सुविपुलं<BR> शक्रध्वजमिवोच्छ्रितम् Mb. 3. 146. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रपर्यायः|शक्रपर्याय|शक्रपर्य्याय|शक्रपर्य्यायः
शक्रः + -पर्यायः the Kuṭaja tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रपादपः|शक्रपादप
शक्रः + -पादपः<BR>—1 the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">Page1527-2</a>]<BR> Kuṭaja tree.<BR>—2 the Devadāru tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रप्रस्थम्
शक्रः + -प्रस्थम् = इन्द्रप्रस्थ q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रभवनम्
शक्रः + -भवनम्, -भुवनम्, -वासः heaven, paradise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रभुवनम्
शक्रः + -भवनम्, -भुवनम्, -वासः heaven, paradise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रवासः|शक्रवास
शक्रः + -भवनम्, -भुवनम्, -वासः heaven, paradise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रभूभवा
शक्रः + -भूभवा colocynth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रमातृका
शक्रः + -मातृका a wooden post for supporting Indraʼs banner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रमूर्धन्
शक्रः + -मूर्धन् <i>m.</i>, {@-शिरस्@} <i>n.</i><BR> an ant hill, a hillock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रलोकः|शक्रलोक
शक्रः + -लोकः the world of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रवल्ली
शक्रः + -वल्ली colocynth (इन्द्रवारुणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रवाहनम्
शक्रः + -वाहनम् a cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रशाखिन्
शक्रः + -शाखिन् <i>m.</i> the Kuṭaja tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रशाला
शक्रः + -शाला a sacrificial ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रसारथिः|शक्रसारथि
शक्रः + -सारथिः ‘the charioteer of Indra’, an epithet of Mātali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रसुत|शक्रसुतः
शक्रः + -सुत<BR>—1 an epithet of Jayanta.<BR>—2 of Arjuna.<BR>—3 of Vāli.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रसृष्टा
शक्रः + -सृष्टा yellow myrobalan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्राणी
शक्राणी N. of Śachī, wife of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रिः|शक्रि
शक्रिः<BR>—1 A cloud.<BR>—2 The thunderbolt of Indra.<BR>—3 A mountain.<BR>—4 An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्रुकः
शक्रुकः A kind of poison (cf. सक्रुकः); L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्वः|शक्व
शक्वः An elephant; भिन्नः स्वदेशोदिततालपक्वभ्रमन्द्रेशक्वक्ष्णुतदन्तकुन्तैः<BR> Rām. Ch. 6. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्वन्
शक्वन् <i>a.</i> [शक्-वनिप् Uṇ. 4. 123] Ved. Strong, powerful. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 An elephant.<BR>—2 An artificer; Ś. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्वरः|शक्वर
शक्वरः A bull, an ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शक्वरी
शक्वरः + .{@-री@}<BR>—1 A finger.<BR>—2 A finger-ring.<BR>—3 A girdle, zone.<BR>—4 A cow.<BR>—5 N. of a Sāman; एताः शक्वर्यो लोकेषु प्रोताः Ch. Up. 2. 17. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्क्|शंक्
शङ्क् €1 Ā. (शङ्कते, शङ्कित)<BR>—1 To doubt, be uncertain, hesitate, be doubtful; शङ्के जीवति वा न वा Rām.<BR>—2 To dread, fear, be afraid (with abl.); नाशङ्किष्ट विवस्वतः Bk. 15. 39;<BR> अशङ्कितेभ्यः शङ्केत शङ्कितेभ्यश्च सर्वतः Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 To suspect, mistrust, distrust; स्वैर्दोषैर्भवति हि शङ्कितो मनुष्यः Mk. 4. 2.<BR>—4 To think, believe, fancy, imagine, think probable, suspect, fear; त्वय्यासन्ने<BR> नयनमुपरिस्पन्दि शङ्के मृगाक्ष्याः Me. 97; नाहं पुनस्तथा त्वयि<BR> यथा हि मां शङ्कसे भीरु V. 3. 14; Bk. 3. 26; N. 22. 42.<BR>—5 To start an objection, raise a doubt or objection (about); अत्रेदं<BR> शङ्क्यते (often used in controversial language); न च ब्रह्मणः प्रमाणान्तरगम्यत्वं<BR> शङ्कितुं शक्यम् Sarva. S. ━<i>Caus.</i> To frighten, terrify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कनीय|शंकनीय
शङ्कनीय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Doubtful, questionable.<BR>—2 Fit to be suspected; शङ्कनीया हि लोकेऽस्मिन्निष्प्रतापा दरिद्रता Mk. 3. 24.<BR>—3 To be supposed or imagined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्का|शंका
शङ्का [शङ्क्-अ]<BR>—1 Doubt, uncertainty.<BR>—2 Hesitation, scruple.<BR>—3 Suspicion, distrust, misgiving; अपायशङ्का; अरिष्टशङ्का &c.<BR>—4 Fear, apprehension, dread, alarm; जातशङ्कैर्देवैर्मेनका नामाप्सराः<BR> प्रेषिता Ś. 1; कैकेयीशङ्कयेवाह R. 12. 2, 13. 42; Me. 71.<BR>—5 Hope, expectation.<BR>—6 (Mistaken) belief, suspicion, (wrong) impression; स्रजमपि शिरस्यन्धः<BR> क्षिप्तां धुनोत्यहिशङ्कया Ś. 7. 24; कुर्वन् वधूजनमनःसु शशाङ्कशङ्काम्<BR> Ki. 5. 42; हरिततृणोद्गमशङ्कया 5. 38.<BR>—7 An objection started in disputation.<BR>—8 Presumption.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शङ्कान्वित, शङ्काकुल, शङ्काभियोगः, शङ्कास्पदम्, शङ्कानिवृत्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कान्वित
शङ्का + -अन्वित, -आकुल <i>a.</i> filled with fear or doubt, doubtful, afraid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्काकुल
शङ्का + -अन्वित, -आकुल <i>a.</i> filled with fear or doubt, doubtful, afraid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्काभियोगः|शङ्काभियोग
शङ्का + -अभियोगः a charge on suspicion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कास्पदम्
शङ्का + -आस्पदम् a matter of doubt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कानिवृत्तिः
शङ्का + -निवृत्तिः <i>f.</i> solving or clearing a doubt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1527-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कित|शंकित|शङ्कितः
शङ्कित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Doubted, suspected, feared.<BR>—2 Suspicious, suspecting, distrustful.<BR>—3 Uncertain, doubtful.<BR>—4 Fearful, apprehensive, alarmed; शङ्कितदृष्टिः Pt. 1. 197.<BR>—5 Weak, unsteady; (see शङ्क्).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शङ्कितचित्त, शङ्कितमनस्, शङ्कितवर्णः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कितचित्त
शङ्कित + -चित्त, -मनस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 timid, faint-hearted.<BR>—2 suspicious, distrustful.<BR>—3 doubtful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कितमनस्|शंकितमनस्
शङ्कित + -चित्त, -मनस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 timid, faint-hearted.<BR>—2 suspicious, distrustful.<BR>—3 doubtful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कितवर्णः|शङ्कितवर्ण
शङ्कित + -वर्णः a thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्किन्|शंकिन्
शङ्किन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Doubting, suspecting, fearing, believing (at the end of comp.); त्वदुपावर्तनशङ्कि<BR> मे मनः R. 8. 53; अतिस्नेहः पापशङ्की Ś. 4.<BR>—2 Full of danger; तस्मादम्बुपतेरिवावनिपतेः सेवा सदा शङ्किनी Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुर|शंकुर|शङ्कुरः
शङ्कुर <i>a.</i> Fearful, frightful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कः|शङ्क|शंक|शंकः
शङ्कः A draught-ox.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकर|शङ्कर|शंकरः|शङ्करः
शंकर <i>a.</i> (-रा, -री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शं सुखं करोति कृ-अच्] Conferring happiness<BR> or prosperity, auspicious, propitious; भीताः शितशराभीताः शंकरं<BR> तत्र शंकरम् (मेनिरे) Ki. 15. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकरः|शङ्कर|शंकर|शङ्करः
शंकर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 N. of a celebrated teacher and author (शंकराचार्य).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकरी
शंकर + .{@-री@}<BR>—1 N. of Pārvatī, wife of Śiva.<BR>—2 Bengal madder.<BR>—3 The Śamī tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शंकराचार्यः, शंकरावासः, शंकरप्रियः, शंकरशुक्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकराचार्यः|शङ्कराचार्य|शङ्कराचार्य्यः
शंकर + -आचार्यः N. of a celebrated teacher of Vedānta philosophy and<BR> reviver of Brāhmanism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकरावासः|शङ्करावास|शङ्करावासः
शंकर + -आवासः<BR>—1 the Kailāsa.<BR>—2 camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकरप्रियः|शङ्करप्रिय|शंकरप्रिय|शङ्करप्रियः
शंकर + -प्रियः the francoline partridge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंकरशुक्रम्
शंकर + -शुक्रम् quick-silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुः|शङ्कु|शंकु|शंकुः
शङ्कुः [शङ्क्-उण् Uṇ. 1. 36]<BR>—1 A dart, spear, spike, javelin, dagger; oft. at the end of comp.; शोकशङ्कुः<BR> ‘the dart of grief’, i. e. sharp or poignant grief; तथैव तीव्रो हृदि<BR> शोकशङ्कुर्मर्माणि कृन्तन्नपि किं न सोढः U. 3. 35; R. 8. 93; Ki. 16. 15.<BR>—2 A stake, pillar, post, pale; महासुहयः सैन्धवः पड्वीशशङ्कून् संवृहेत्<BR> Bṛ. Up. 6. 1. 13; निखातशङ्कुसंबद्धसैन्धवश्रेणिसंयुतम् Śiva B. 20. 53.<BR>—3 A nail, pin, peg; बभूवुः सप्त दुर्धर्षाः खादिरैः शङ्कुभिश्चिताः<BR> Mb. 3. 284. 3; अयःशङ्कुचितां रक्षः शतघ्नीमथ शत्रवे (अक्षिपत्) R. 12. 95.<BR>—4 The sharp head or point of an arrow, barb; Dk. 1. 1.<BR>—5 The trunk (of a lopped tree), stump, pollard.<BR>—6 The pin of a dial.<BR>—7 A measure of twelve fingers.<BR>—8 A measuring-rod.<BR>—9 The sine of altitude (in astr.).<BR>—10 Ten trillions.<BR>—11 The fibres of a leaf; यथा शङ्कुना सर्वाणि पर्णानि संतृण्णानि<BR> Ch. Up. 2. 23. 3.<BR>—12 An ant-hill.<BR>—13 The penis.<BR>—14 The skate-fish.<BR>—15 A demon.<BR>—16 Poison.<BR>—17 Sin; crime.<BR>—18 An aquatic animal, particularly, a goose.<BR>—19 N. of Śiva.<BR>—20 The Sāla tree.<BR>—21 A kind of perfume (नखी).<BR>—22 N. of Kāma, the god of love.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शङ्कुकर्ण, शङ्कुच्छाया, शङ्कुजीवा, शङ्कुतरुः, शङ्कुवृक्षः, शङ्कुधानम्, शङ्कुपुच्छम्, शङ्कुफला, शङ्कुफलिका, शङ्कुमुखः, शङ्कुमूली<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुकर्ण|शंकुकर्ण|शङ्कुकर्णः
शङ्कुः + -कर्ण <i>a.</i> spike-eared; महावृक्षगलस्कन्धः शङ्कुकर्णो विभीषणः Mb. 1. 152. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुकर्णः|शङ्कुकर्ण|शंकुकर्ण
शङ्कुः + -कर्ण + .({@-र्णः@}) an ass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुच्छाया
शङ्कुः + -च्छाया the shadow of a gnomon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुजीवा
शङ्कुः + -जीवा (in astr.) the gnomon sine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुतरुः|शङ्कुतरु|शंकुतरु
शङ्कुः + -तरुः, -वृक्षः the Sāla tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुवृक्षः|शङ्कुवृक्ष|शंकुवृक्ष
शङ्कुः + -तरुः, -वृक्षः the Sāla tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुधानम्
शङ्कुः + -धानम् a hole for a pin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुपुच्छम्
शङ्कुः + -पुच्छम् the sting (of a bee etc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुफला
शङ्कुः + -फला, -फलिका the Śamī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुफलिका
शङ्कुः + -फला, -फलिका the Śamī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुमुखः|शङ्कुमुख
शङ्कुः + -मुखः<BR>—1 a crocodile.<BR>—2 a kind of leech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

