शङ्कुचिः|शङ्कुचि|शंकुचिः
शङ्कुचिः, शङ्कोचः, (-चिः)<BR> A skate-fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कोचः|शङ्कोच|शंकोचः
शङ्कुचिः, शङ्कोचः, (-चिः)<BR> A skate-fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कोचिः|शङ्कोचि|शंकोचिः
शङ्कुचिः, शङ्कोचः, (-चिः)<BR> A skate-fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुला|शंकुला
शङ्कुला [शङ्क्-उलच् Uṇ. 1. 93]<BR>—1 A kind of knife or lancet.<BR>—2 A pair of scissors.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शङ्कुलाखण्डः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्कुलाखण्डः|शङ्कुलाखण्ड|शंकुलाखंड
शङ्कुला + -खण्डः a piece cut off with a pair of scissors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्खः|शङ्ख|शंख|शंखं|शंखः
शङ्खः, -ङ्खम्<BR> [शम्-ख Uṇ. 1. 102]<BR>—1 The conch-shell, a shell; न श्वेतभावमुज्झति शङ्खः शिखिमुक्तमुक्तोऽपि<BR> Pt. 4. 110; शङ्खान् दध्मुः पृथक् पृथक् Bg. 1. 18.<BR>—2 The bone on the forehead; शङ्खान्तरद्योति विलोचनं यत् Ku. 7. 33;<BR> Rām. 6. 48. 10.<BR>—3 The temporal bone.<BR>—4 The part between the tusks of an elephant.<BR>—5 A hundred trillions.<BR>—6 A military drum or other martial instrument.<BR>—7 A kind of perfume (नखी).<BR>—8 One of the nine treasures of Kubera.<BR>—9 N. of a demon slain by Viṣṇu.<BR>—10 N. of the author of a Smṛti (mentioned in conjunction with लिखित q. v.).<BR>—11 A bracelet (made of conchshell); अवघ्रन्त्याः प्रकोष्ठस्थाश्चक्रुः<BR> शङ्खाः स्वनं महत् Bhāg. 11. 9. 6.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शङ्खान्तरम्, शङ्खावर्तः, शङ्खोदकम्, शङ्खकारः, शङ्खकारकः, शङ्खक्षीरम्, शङ्खचरी, शङ्खचर्ची, शङ्खचूर्णम्, शङ्खजः, शङ्खद्रावः, शङ्खद्रावकः, शङ्खद्राविन्, शङ्खध्मः, शङ्खध्मा, शङ्खध्वनिः, शङ्खनखः, शङ्खपालः, शङ्खप्रस्थः, शङ्खभृत्, शङ्खमुखः, शङ्खमुक्ता, शङ्खलिखितः, शङ्खवलयः, शङ्खवेला, शङ्खस्वनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

