शङ्खचरी|शंखचरी
शङ्खः + -चरी, -चर्ची a mark made with sandal (on the forehead).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्खचर्ची|शङ्खचर्च्ची
शङ्खः + -चरी, -चर्ची a mark made with sandal (on the forehead).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्खचूर्णम्
शङ्खः + -चूर्णम् powder produced from shells.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्खजः|शङ्खज
शङ्खः + -जः a large pearl (of the shape of a pigeonʼs egg).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

