शङ्खद्रावकः|शङ्खद्रावक
शङ्खः + -द्रावः, -द्रावकः a solvent for dissolving shells.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

