शङ्खः + -ध्मः, -ध्मा <i>m.</i> a shell-blower, conch-blower; शङ्खस्य तु<BR> ग्रहणेन शङ्खध्मस्य वा शब्दो गृहीतः Bṛ. Up. 2. 4. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

