शङ्खः + -नखः a kind of aquatic animal, snail; लग्नैः शङ्खनखैः Mb. 13. 50. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

