शङ्खः + -पालः<BR>—1 an epithet of the sun.<BR>—2 a kind of sweetmeat (Mar. शंकरपाळे).<BR>—3 a kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्खप्रस्थः|शङ्खप्रस्थ
शङ्खः + -प्रस्थः a spot on the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्खभृत्|शंखभृत्
शङ्खः + -भृत् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्खमुखः|शङ्खमुख|शंखमुख
शङ्खः + -मुखः an alligator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

