शङ्खवलयः|शङ्खवलय
शङ्खः + -वलयः a shell-bracelet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्खवेला
