शङ्खिन्|शंखिन्
शङ्खिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 The ocean.<BR>—2 An epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 A conch-blower.<BR>—4 A worker in shells.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्खिनी
शङ्खिनी<BR>—1 A woman of one of the four classes into which writers on erotic science<BR> divide women; the Ratimañjarī thus describes her:− दीर्घातिदीर्घनयना<BR> वरसुन्दरी या कामोपभोगरसिका गुणशीलयुक्ता । रेखात्रयेण च विभूषितकण्ठदेशा<BR> सम्भोगकेलिरसिका किल शङ्खिनी सा ॥ cf. चित्रिणी, हस्तिनी,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">Page1529-1</a>]<BR> and पद्मिनी also.<BR>—2 A female spirit, or a kind of fairy.<BR>—3 Mother of pearl.<BR>—4 A particular vein.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शङ्खिनीफलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1528-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शङ्खिनीफलः|शङ्खिनीफल
शङ्खिनी + -फलः the Śirīṣa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शच्
शच् €1 Ā. (शचते) To speak, say, tell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शचिः|शचि
शचिः, -ची <i>f.</i><BR> N. of the wife of Indra; असूत पुत्रं समये शचीसमा R. 3. 13, 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शची
