शची
शचिः, -ची + .{@-ची@} Ved.<BR>—1 Speech, eloquence.<BR>—2 Activity, energy.<BR>—3 Power, strength.<BR>—4 A holy or pious act; devotion.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शचिपतिः, शचिभर्तृ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शचिपतिः|शचिपति
शचिः + -पतिः, -भर्तृ <i>m.</i> epithets of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शचिभर्तृ
शचिः + -पतिः, -भर्तृ <i>m.</i> epithets of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शञ्च्|शंच्
शञ्च् €1 Ā. (शञ्चते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शट्
शट् I. €1 P. (शटति)<BR>—1 To be sick.<BR>—2 To divide, separate.<BR>—3 To be dissolved.<BR>—4 To be weary or dejected.<BR>—5 To go. ━II. €10 Ā. (शाटयते) To praise, flatter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शट|शटः
शट <i>a.</i> Sour, acid, astringent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शटा
शटा The matted hair of an ascetic; cf. जटा, सिंहकेशर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शटिः|शटि
शटिः, -टी <i>f.</i><BR> The plant called Zedoary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शटी
शटिः, -टी <i>f.</i><BR> The plant called Zedoary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शट्टकम्
शट्टकम् Flour of rice mixed with water and ghee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शठ्
शठ् I. €1 P. (शठति)<BR>—1 To deceive, cheat, defraud.<BR>—2 To hurt, kill.<BR>—3 To suffer pain. ━II. €10 P. (शाठयति)<BR>—1 To finish.<BR>—2 To leave unfinished.<BR>—3 To go, move.<BR>—4 To be idle or lazy (शठयति).<BR>—5 To deceive, cheat.<BR>—6 To speak ill of.<BR>—7 To speak well or elegantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शठ|शठं|शठः
शठ <i>a.</i> [शठ्-अच्]<BR>—1 Crafty, deceitful, fraudulent, dishonest, perfidious.<BR>—2 Wicked, depraved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शठः|शठ|शठं
शठ + .{@-ठः@}<BR>—1 A rogue, cheat, knave, swindler; Ms. 4. 30; Bg. 18. 28.<BR>—2 A false or deceitful lover (who pretends to love one woman while his<BR> heart is fixed on another); ध्रुवमस्मि शठः शुचिस्मिते विदितः कैतववत्सलस्तव<BR> R. 8. 49, 19. 31; शठ इति मयि तावदस्तु ते परिचयवत्यवधीरणा प्रिये<BR> M. 3. 19; (the S. D. thus defines a शठः-शठोऽयमेकत्र बद्धभावो<BR> यः । दर्शितबहिरनुरागो विप्रियमन्यत्र गूढमाचरति ॥ 74).<BR>—3 A fool, blockhead.<BR>—4 A mediator, arbitrator.<BR>—5 The Dhattūra plant.<BR>—6 An idler, a lazy fellow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शठम्
शठ + .{@-ठम्@}<BR>—1 Iron.<BR>—2 Saffron.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शठोदर्क<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शठोदर्क
शठ + -उदर्क <i>a.</i> deceitful in the end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शण्
शण् €1 P. (शणति) To give.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शणम्
शणम् Hemp.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शणतान्तव, शणपट्टः, शणसूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शणतान्तव
शणम् + -तान्तव <i>a.</i> made of hempen string; वैश्यस्य शणतान्तवी<BR> (मेखला) Ms. 2. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शणपट्टः|शणपट्ट
शणम् + -पट्टः hempen bandage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शणसूत्रम्
शणम् + -सूत्रम्<BR>—1 a hempen cord or string; शणसूत्रमयं राज्ञः (उपवीतम्) Ms. 2. 44.<BR>—2 a net made of hemp.<BR>—3 cordage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शणीरम्
शणीरम् A bank or alluvial island in the middle of the river Śoṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शण्डः|शण्ड|शंड|शण्डं|शंडः
शण्डः A eunuch (= शण्ढ q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शण्ड्|शंड्
शण्ड् €1 P. (शण्डति)<BR>—1 To heap, collect.<BR>—2 To hurt, wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शण्डः|शण्ड|शंड|शण्डं|शंडः
शण्डः [शण्ड् अच् Uṇ. 1. 113]<BR>—1 An impotent man, a eunuch.<BR>—2 A bull.<BR>—3 A bull at liberty to move.<BR>—4 Curds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शण्डम्
शण्डः + .{@-ण्डम्@} A collection, multitude; cf. षण्ड or खण्ड.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शण्डिलः|शण्डिल
शण्डिलः [शण्ड्-इलच् Uṇ. 1. 53] A sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शण्ढः|शण्ढ|शंढ|शंढः
शण्ढः<BR>—1 A eunuch, an impotent man.<BR>—2 A male attendant in the womenʼs apartments (chosen from the class of<BR> eunuchs or emasculated persons).<BR>—3 A bull.<BR>—4 A bull at liberty to move. —5 A mad-man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतम्
शतम् —1 A hundred; निःस्वो वष्टि शतम् Śānti. 2. 6; शतमेकोऽपि<BR> संधत्ते प्राकारस्थो धनुर्धरः Pt. 1. 229; (शत is used in the<BR> singular with a plural noun of any gender; शतं नराः; शतं गावः;<BR> or शतं गृहाणि, in which case it is treated as a numeral adjective;<BR> but sometimes in dual and plural also; द्वे शते, दश शतानि &c. It<BR> is also used with a noun in the genitive; गवां शतम्, वर्षाणां शतम्<BR> ‘a century of cows, years’ &c. At the end of comp., it may remain unchanged;<BR> भव भर्ता शरच्छतम् or may be changed into शती; as in आर्यासप्तशती<BR> a work of Govardhanācārya.).<BR>—2 Any large number; as in शतपत्र q. v.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शताक्षी, शताङ्गः, शतानीकः, शताब्दम्, शतारम्, शतारम्, शतारुस्, शतावरः, शतानकम्, शतानन्दः, शतायुस्, शतावर्तः, शतावर्तिन्, शतेशः, शतकर्मन्, शतकुम्भः, शतकृत्वस्, शतकोटि, शतक्रतुः, शतखण्डम्, शतगु, शतगुण, शतगुणित, शतग्रन्थिः, शतघ्नः, शतघ्नी, शतचन्द्रः, शतचरणा, शतच्छदः, शतजिह्वः, शततारका, शतभिषज्, शतभिषा, शतदलम्, शतदला, शतद्रुः, शतधामन्, शतधार, शतधृतिः, शतधौत, शतपत्रः, शतपत्रकः, शतपत्री, शतपत्रिकः, शतपथब्राह्मणम्, शतपद्, शतपाद्, शतपदी, शतपाद्, शतपद्मम्, शतपर्वन्, शतपर्विका, शतपाक, शतपाकम्, शतपादः, शतपाद्, शतपालः, शतपुष्पः, शतपुष्पा, शतप्रसूना, शतपोनः, शतप्रासः, शतफलिन्, शतभिषज्, शतभीरुः, शतमखः, शतमन्युः, शतमयूखः, शतमानः, शतनम्, शतमार्जः, शतमुख, शतमूर्धन्, शतमूला, शतयज्वन्, शतयष्टिकः, शतरुद्रियम्, शतरूपा, शतलुपः, शतलुम्पकः, शतलोचनः, शतवर्ष, शतवीर्या, शतवेधिन्, शतशाख, शतसंधान, शतसहस्रम्, शतसुखम्, शतसाहस्र, शतह्रदा, शतह्रादा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शताक्षी
शतम् + -अक्षी<BR>—1 night.<BR>—2 the goddess Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शताङ्गः|शताङ्ग|शतांग
शतम् + -अङ्गः<BR>—1 a car, carriage; especially, a war chariot.<BR>—2 N. of a tree (तिनिश).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतानीकः|शतानीक
शतम् + -अनीकः<BR>—1 an old man.<BR>—2 an army officer possessing a hundred footmen; शतानां तु शतानीकः<BR> Śukra. 2. 140.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शताब्दम्
शतम् + -अब्दम् a century.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतारम्
शतम् + -अरम्, -आरम् the thunderbolt of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतारम्
शतम् + -अरम्, -आरम् the thunderbolt of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतारुस्
शतम् + -अरुस् <i>n.</i>, {@-अरुषी@}<BR> a leprous disease of the skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतावरः|शतावर
शतम् + -अवरः a fine of a hundred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतावरी
शतम् + -अवरः + .({@-री@})<BR>—1 N. of a plant.<BR>—2 N. of the wife of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतानकम्
शतम् + -आनकम् a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतानन्दः|शतानन्द|शतानंद
शतम् + -आनन्दः<BR>—1 N. of Brahman.<BR>—2 of Viṣṇu or Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—3 of the car of Viṣṇu.<BR>—4 of a son of Gautama and Ahalyā, the family-priest of Janaka; गौतमश्च<BR> शतानन्दो जनकानां पुरोहितः U. 1. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतायुस्
शतम् + -आयुस् <i>a.</i> lasting or living for a hundred years.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतावर्तः|शतावर्त|शतावर्त्त|शतावर्त्तः
शतम् + -आवर्तः, -आवर्तिन् <i>m.</i> N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतावर्तिन्|शतावर्त्तिन्
शतम् + -आवर्तः, -आवर्तिन् <i>m.</i> N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतेशः|शतेश
शतम् + -ईशः<BR>—1 the ruler of a hundred.<BR>—2 the ruler of a hundred villages; Ms. 7. 115.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतकर्मन्
शतम् + -कर्मन् the planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतकुम्भः|शतकुम्भ|शतकुंभ
शतम् + -कुम्भः<BR>—1 N. of a mountain (where gold is said to be found).<BR>—2 N. of a sacrifice; शतकुम्भं नाम यज्ञमनुभवितुं महर्षेर्धौम्यस्य<BR> आश्रमं गता इति Madhyamavyāyoga 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतकुम्भम्
शतम् + -कुम्भः + .({@-म्भम्@}) gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतकृत्वस्
शतम् + -कृत्वस् <i>ind.</i> a hundred times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतकोटि|शतकोटिः
शतम् + -कोटि <i>a.</i> hundred-edged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतकोटिः|शतकोटि
शतम् + -कोटि + .({@-टिः@}) Indraʼs thunderbolt; कराग्रजाग्रच्छतकोटिः N. 7. 79.<BR>━(<i>f.</i>) a hundred crores; चरितं रघुनाथस्य शतकोटिप्राविस्तरम्<BR> Rāmarakṣā 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतक्रतुः|शतक्रतु
शतम् + -क्रतुः an epithet of Indra; अपूर्णमेकेन शतक्रतूपमः शतं<BR> क्रतूनामपविघ्नमाप सः R. 3. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतखण्डम्
शतम् + -खण्डम् gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतगु
शतम् + -गु <i>a.</i> possessed of a hundred cows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतगुण
शतम् + -गुण, -गुणित <i>a.</i> a hundred-fold, increased a hundred times;<BR> अनुपनतमनोरथस्य पूर्वं शतगुणितेव गता मम त्रियामा V. 3. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतगुणित
शतम् + -गुण, -गुणित <i>a.</i> a hundred-fold, increased a hundred times;<BR> अनुपनतमनोरथस्य पूर्वं शतगुणितेव गता मम त्रियामा V. 3. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतग्रन्थिः|शतग्रन्थि
शतम् + -ग्रन्थिः <i>f.</i> the Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतघ्नः|शतघ्न
शतम् + -घ्नः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतघ्नी
शतम् + -घ्नी<BR>—1 a kind of weapon used as a missile (supposed by some to be a sort of<BR> rocket, but described by others as a huge stone studded with iron spikes<BR> and four <i>tālas</i> in length; शतघ्नी च चतुस्ताला लोहकण्टकसंचिता;<BR> or अयःकण्टकसंच्छन्ना शतघ्नी महती शिला); अयःशङ्कुचितां रक्षः<BR> शतघ्नीमथ शत्रवे (अक्षिपत्)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">Page1530-1</a>]<BR> R. 12. 95; Bhāg. 9. 15. 30.<BR>—2 a female scorpion.<BR>—3 a disease of the throat.<BR>—4 N. of a plant (करञ्ज).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1529-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतचन्द्रः|शतचन्द्र
शतम् + -चन्द्रः a sword or shield adorned with a hundred moons (moon-like<BR> spots); ततः शरशतेनास्य शतचन्द्रं समाक्षिपत् Mb. 7. 97. 29.<BR> ˚वर्त्मन् a manner of brandishing the sword; तं श्येनवेगं शतचन्द्रवर्त्मभिश्चरन्तमच्छिद्रमुपर्यधो<BR> हरिः Bhāg. 8. 7. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतचरणा
शतम् + -चरणा a centipede.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतच्छदः|शतच्छद
शतम् + -छदः a kind of wood-pecker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतजिह्वः|शतजिह्व
शतम् + -जिह्वः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शततारका
शतम् + -तारका, -भिषज्, -भिषा <i>f.</i> N. of the 24th lunar mansion containing<BR> one hundred stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतभिषज्
शतम् + -तारका, -भिषज्, -भिषा <i>f.</i> N. of the 24th lunar mansion containing<BR> one hundred stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतभिषा
शतम् + -तारका, -भिषज्, -भिषा <i>f.</i> N. of the 24th lunar mansion containing<BR> one hundred stars.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतदलम्
शतम् + -दलम् a lotus-flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतदला
शतम् + -दला the white rose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतद्रुः|शतद्रु
शतम् + -द्रुः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 N. of a river in the Punjab now called Sutlej.<BR>—2 N. of the Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतधामन्
शतम् + -धामन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतधार|शतधारं
शतम् + -धार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 flowing in a hundred streams.<BR>—2 having a hundred edges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतधारम्
शतम् + -धार + .({@-रम्@}) the thunderbolt of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतधृतिः|शतधृति
शतम् + -धृतिः<BR>—1 an epithet of Indra.<BR>—2 of Brahman; गते शतधृतौ क्षत्तः कर्दमस्तेन चोदितः Bhāg. 3. 24. 21.<BR>—3 heaven or <i>Svarga</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतधौत
शतम् + -धौत <i>a.</i> perfectly clean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपत्रः|शतपत्र|शतपत्रं
शतम् + -पत्रः<BR>—1 a peacock.<BR>—2 the (Indian) crane.<BR>—3 a wood-pecker.<BR>—4 a parrot or a species of it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपत्रा
शतम् + -पत्रः + .({@-त्रा@}) a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपत्रम्
शतम् + -पत्रः + .({@-त्रम्@}) a lotus; आवृत्तवृन्तशतपत्रनिभम् (आननं) वहन्त्या<BR> Māl. 1. 22. ˚योनि an epithet of Brahman; कम्पेन मूर्ध्नः शतपत्रयोनिं<BR> (संभावयामास) Ku. 7. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपत्रकः|शतपत्रक
शतम् + -पत्रकः the wood-pecker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपत्री
शतम् + -पत्री, -पत्रिकः the white rose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपत्रिकः
शतम् + -पत्री, -पत्रिकः the white rose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपथब्राह्मणम्
शतम् + -पथब्राह्मणम् N. of a well-known Brāhmaṇa attached to the Śukla<BR> Yajurveda; कृत्स्नं शतपथं चैव प्रणेष्यसि द्विजर्षभ Mb. 12. 318. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपद्
शतम् + -पद्, -पाद् <i>a.</i> having a hundred feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपाद्
शतम् + -पद्, -पाद् <i>a.</i> having a hundred feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपदी
