शतपद्मम्
शतम् + -पद्मम्<BR>—1 a lotus with a hundred petals.<BR>—2 the white lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपर्वन्|शतपर्व्वन्
शतम् + -पर्वन् ━<i>m.</i> a bamboo. ━(<i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 the full-moon day in the month of Āśvina.<BR>—2 Dūrvā grass.<BR>—3 the plant Kaṭukā.<BR>—4 orris root.<BR>—5 the wife of Bhārgava or Śukra. ˚ईशः the planet Venus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपर्विका|शतपर्व्विका
