शतपाक
शतम् + -पाक <i>a.</i> boiled a hundred times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपाकम्
शतम् + -पाकम् a particular unguent; शतपाकेन तैलेन महार्हेणोपतस्थतुः Mb. 13. 53. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपादः
शतम् + -पादः, -पाद् <i>m.</i>, {@-पादी, -पादिका@}<BR> a centipede.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपाद्
शतम् + -पादः, -पाद् <i>m.</i>, {@-पादी, -पादिका@}<BR> a centipede.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपालः|शतपाल
शतम् + -पालः an overseer (of a hundred villages).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपुष्पः|शतपुष्प
