शतफलिन्
शतम् + -फलिन् <i>m.</i> a bamboo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

