शतमखः|शतमख
शतम् + -मखः, -मन्युः<BR>—1 epithets of Indra; प्रसहेत रणे तबानुजान् द्विषतां कः शतमन्युतेजसः<BR> Ki. 2. 23; Bk. 1. 5; शतमखमुपतस्थे प्राञ्जलिः पुष्पधन्वा Ku. 2. 64; R. 9. 13.<BR>—2 an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतमन्युः|शतमन्यु
शतम् + -मखः, -मन्युः<BR>—1 epithets of Indra; प्रसहेत रणे तबानुजान् द्विषतां कः शतमन्युतेजसः<BR> Ki. 2. 23; Bk. 1. 5; शतमखमुपतस्थे प्राञ्जलिः पुष्पधन्वा Ku. 2. 64; R. 9. 13.<BR>—2 an owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतमयूखः|शतमयूख
शतम् + -मयूखः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतमानः|शतमान
शतम् + -मानः, -नम्<BR>—1 a <i>Pala</i> of silver; धरणानि दश ज्ञेयः शतमानस्तु राजतः<BR> Ms. 8. 137; अष्टौ शाणाः शतमानं वहन्ति Mb. 3. 134. 15.<BR>—2 an Āḍhaka q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतनम्
शतम् + -मानः, -नम्<BR>—1 a <i>Pala</i> of silver; धरणानि दश ज्ञेयः शतमानस्तु राजतः<BR> Ms. 8. 137; अष्टौ शाणाः शतमानं वहन्ति Mb. 3. 134. 15.<BR>—2 an Āḍhaka q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतमार्जः|शतमार्ज
शतम् + -मार्जः an armourer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतमुख
शतम् + -मुख <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having a hundred ways.<BR>—2 having a hundred outlets, mouths, or openings; विवेकभ्रष्टानां भवति<BR> विनिपातः शतमुखः Bh. 2. 10 (where the word has sense 1 also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतमुखम्
शतम् + -मुख + .({@-खम्@}) a hundred ways or openings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतमुखी
शतम् + -मुख + .({@-खी@}) a brush, broom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतमूर्धन्
