शतयष्टिकः|शतयष्टिक
शतम् + -यष्टिकः a necklace of one hundred strings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतरुद्रियम्
शतम् + -रुद्रियम्<BR>—1 a Vedic text (रुद्राध्यायः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">Page1530-2</a>]<BR> -‘नमस्ते रुद्रमन्यवे’ इति याजुषः प्रपाठकः); गृणन्तौ वेदविद्वांसौ<BR> तद्ब्रह्म शतरुद्रियम् Mb. 7. 81. 13, 7. 202. 120.<BR>—2 a particular Śiva-stotra in the Mahābhārata; देवदेवस्य ते पार्थ<BR> व्याख्यातं शतरुद्रियम् Mb. 7. 202. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतरूपा
शतम् + -रूपा N. of a daughter of Brahman (who is supposed to be also<BR> his wife, from whose incestuous connection with her father is said to have<BR> sprung Manu Svāyambhuva).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतलुपः
शतम् + -लुपः, -लुम्पकः an epithet of the poet Bhāravi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतलुम्पकः|शतलुम्पक
शतम् + -लुपः, -लुम्पकः an epithet of the poet Bhāravi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतलोचनः|शतलोचन
शतम् + -लोचनः an epithet of Indra; कथं वा तस्य न जयो जायते<BR> शतलोचन Mb. 8. 87. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतवर्ष
शतम् + -वर्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 a century old.<BR>—2 lasting for a hundred years.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतवर्षम्
शतम् + -वर्ष + .({@-र्षम्@}) one hundred years, a century.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतवीर्या|शतवीर्य्या
शतम् + -वीर्या<BR>—1 white-flowering Dūrvā.<BR>—2 the plant Śatāvarī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतवेधिन्
शतम् + -वेधिन् <i>m.</i> a kind of sorrel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतशाख
शतम् + -शाख <i>a.</i><BR>—1 various, multiform.<BR>—2 having hundred, <i>i. e.</i> many branches.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतसंधान
शतम् + -संधान <i>a.</i> fixing an arrow a hundred times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतसहस्रम्
शतम् + -सहस्रम्<BR>—1 a hundred thousand.<BR>—2 several hundreds, <i>i. e.</i> a large number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतसुखम्
शतम् + -सुखम् endless delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतसाहस्र
शतम् + -साहस्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 consisting of or containing a hundred thousand.<BR>—2 bought with a hundred thousand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतह्रदा
शतम् + -ह्रदा<BR>—1 lightning; दूरं पुरःक्षिप्तशतह्रदेव Ku. 7. 39; Mk. 5. 48; V. 4;<BR> प्रपतेदपि चाकाशं निपतेयुः शतह्रदाः Śiva B. 19. 20.<BR>—2 the thunderbolt of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतह्रादा
शतम् + -ह्रादा the thunderbolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतक|शतकः
शतक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 A hundred.<BR>—2 Containing a hundred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतकम्
शतक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 A century.<BR>—2 A collection of one hundred stanzas; as in नीति˚, वैराग्य˚, शृङ्गार˚<BR> ‘a collection of one hundred stanzas on Nīti’ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शततम|शततमः
शततम <i>a.</i> (-मी <i>f.</i>)<BR> One-hundredth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतधा
शतधा <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 In a hundred ways.<BR>—2 Into a hundred parts or pieces.<BR>—3 A hundred-fold. ━<i>f.</i> The Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतशस्
शतशस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 By hundreds.<BR>—2 A hundred times; शतशः शपे Prab. 3; Ms. 12. 58.<BR>—3 A hundred-fold, variously, multifariously; पश्य मे पार्थ रूपाणि<BR> शतशोऽथ सहस्रशः Bg. 11. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतिक|शतिकः
शतिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), शत्य <i>a.</i><BR> [शतेन क्रीतः शतस्य विकारः तस्यायं वा इति ठन् यत् वा]<BR>—1 Containing or consisting of a hundred; ग्लहे शतिकवृद्धेस्तु सभिकः<BR> पञ्चकं शतम् Y. 2. 199.<BR>—2 Relating to a hundred.<BR>—3 Effected with a hundred.<BR>—4 Bought with a hundred.<BR>—5 Changed with or for a hundred.<BR>—6 Bearing tax or interest per hundred.<BR>—7 Indicative of (the acquisition of) a hundred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतिकी
शतिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), शत्य <i>a.</i><BR> [शतेन क्रीतः शतस्य विकारः तस्यायं वा इति ठन् यत् वा]<BR>—1 Containing or consisting of a hundred; ग्लहे शतिकवृद्धेस्तु सभिकः<BR> पञ्चकं शतम् Y. 2. 199.<BR>—2 Relating to a hundred.<BR>—3 Effected with a hundred.<BR>—4 Bought with a hundred.<BR>—5 Changed with or for a hundred.<BR>—6 Bearing tax or interest per hundred.<BR>—7 Indicative of (the acquisition of) a hundred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्य|शत्यः
शतिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), शत्य <i>a.</i><BR> [शतेन क्रीतः शतस्य विकारः तस्यायं वा इति ठन् यत् वा]<BR>—1 Containing or consisting of a hundred; ग्लहे शतिकवृद्धेस्तु सभिकः<BR> पञ्चकं शतम् Y. 2. 199.<BR>—2 Relating to a hundred.<BR>—3 Effected with a hundred.<BR>—4 Bought with a hundred.<BR>—5 Changed with or for a hundred.<BR>—6 Bearing tax or interest per hundred.<BR>—7 Indicative of (the acquisition of) a hundred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतिन्
शतिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 A hundred-fold.<BR>—2 Numerous. ━<i>m.</i> The owner of a hundred; निस्वो वष्टि शतं शती<BR> दशशतम् Śānti. 2. 6; इच्छति शती सहस्रं सहस्री लक्षमीहते Pt. 5. 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपोनः|शतपोन
शतपोनः A sieve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतपोनकः|शतपोनक
शतपोनकः Fistula in the anus (with many external openings).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतनम्
शतनम् Cutting down, felling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1530-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतृ
शतृ A technical term used by Pāṇini to denote the Kṛt affix<BR> अत् used in forming present participles of the Parasmaipada.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शतेरः|शतेर
शतेरः (शदेः एरच् त च Uṇ. 1. 59)<BR>—1 An enemy.<BR>—2 Injury, hurt.<BR>—3 A river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्त्रिः|शत्रि
शत्त्रिः [शद्-त्रिप् Uṇ. 4. 69] An elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुः|शत्रु
शत्रुः [शद्-त्रुन् Uṇ. 4. 103]<BR>—1 An overthrower, a destroyer, conqueror.<BR>—2 An enemy, a foe, an adversary; क्षमा शत्रौ च मित्रे च यतीनामेव<BR> भूषणम् Subhāṣ.; ऋणकर्ता पिता शत्रुर्माता च व्यभिचारिणी । भार्या<BR> रूपवती शत्रुः पुत्रः शत्रुरपण्डितः ॥ Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 A political rival, a rival neighbouring king.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शत्रूपजापः, शत्रुकर्षण, शत्रुदमन, शत्रुनिवर्हण, शत्रुकुलम्, शत्रुगृहम्, शत्रुघ्नः, शत्रुनिबर्हण, शत्रुपक्षः, शत्रुमर्दनः, शत्रुलाव, शत्रुविग्रहः, शत्रुविनाशनः, शत्रुसह, शत्रुसाह, शत्रुसोविन्, शत्रुहत्या, शत्रुहन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रूपजापः|शत्रूपजाप
शत्रुः + -उपजापः the secret whisperings of a foe, treacherous overtures of an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुकर्षण
शत्रुः + -कर्षण, -दमन, -निवर्हण <i>a.</i> subduing, overpowering, or<BR> destroying enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुदमन
शत्रुः + -कर्षण, -दमन, -निवर्हण <i>a.</i> subduing, overpowering, or<BR> destroying enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुनिवर्हण
शत्रुः + -कर्षण, -दमन, -निवर्हण <i>a.</i> subduing, overpowering, or<BR> destroying enemies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुकुलम्
शत्रुः + -कुलम् the house of an enemy; शत्रुकुलं गच्छेत् Ms. 8. 93.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुगृहम्
शत्रुः + -गृहम् N. of the 6th astrological mansion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुघ्नः|शत्रुघ्न
शत्रुः + -घ्नः ‘destroyer of enemies’, an epithet of a brother of Rāma<BR> and twin brother of Lakṣmaṇa, being a son of Sumitrā. He killed the<BR> demon Lavaṇa and colonized Mathurā. He had two sons named Subāhu and<BR> Bahuśruta; see R. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुनिबर्हण
शत्रुः + -निबर्हण <i>a.</i> foe-destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुपक्षः|शत्रुपक्ष
शत्रुः + -पक्षः<BR>—1 the party or side of an enemy.<BR>—2 an opponent, antagonist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुमर्दनः|शत्रुमर्दन|शत्रुमर्द्दन|शत्रुमर्द्दनः
शत्रुः + -मर्दनः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śatrughna.<BR>—2 a kind of pavilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुलाव
शत्रुः + -लाव <i>a.</i> killing foes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुविग्रहः|शत्रुविग्रह
शत्रुः + -विग्रहः a hostile invasion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुविनाशनः|शत्रुविनाशन
शत्रुः + -विनाशनः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुसह
शत्रुः + -सह, -साह <i>a.</i> withstanding an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुसाह
शत्रुः + -सह, -साह <i>a.</i> withstanding an enemy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुसोविन्
शत्रुः + -सोविन् <i>a.</i> serving a hostile prince; शत्रुसेविनि मित्रे च<BR> गूढे युक्ततरो भवेत् Ms. 7. 186.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुहत्या
शत्रुः + -हत्या foe-slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुहन्
शत्रुः + -हन् <i>a.</i> foe-slayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शत्रुंजयः|शत्रुञ्जय|शत्रुंजय|शत्रुञ्जयः
शत्रुंजयः<BR>—1 An elephant.<BR>—2 N. of a mountain in Gujrat (गिरनार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1531-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

