शम्बर + -अरिः, -सूदनः epithets of Pradyumna or the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्बरसूदनः|शम्बरसूदन|शंबरसूदन
शम्बर + -अरिः, -सूदनः epithets of Pradyumna or the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्बरासुरः|शम्बरासुर|शंबरासुर
शम्बर + -असुरः the demon Śambara.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्बरी
शम्बरी<BR>—1 Illusion, jugglery.<BR>—2 A female juggler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्बलः|शम्बल|शंबल|शंबलं|शंबलः
शम्बलः, -लम्<BR> [शम्ब्-कलच् Uṇ. 1. 105]<BR>—1 A bank, shore.<BR>—2 Provisions for a journey, viaticum.<BR>—3 Envy, jealousy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्बलम्
शम्बलः, -लम्<BR> [शम्ब्-कलच् Uṇ. 1. 105]<BR>—1 A bank, shore.<BR>—2 Provisions for a journey, viaticum.<BR>—3 Envy, jealousy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्बली
शम्बली A procuress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्बुः|शम्बु|शंबु|शंबुः
शम्बुः, शम्बुकः, शम्बुक्कः<BR> A bivalve shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्बुकः|शम्बुक|शंबुक|शंबुकः
