शम्बुक्कः|शम्बुक्क|शंबुक्क|शंबुक्कः
शम्बुः, शम्बुकः, शम्बुक्कः<BR> A bivalve shell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्बूकः|शम्बूक|शंबूक|शंबूकः
शम्बूकः [शम्ब्-ऊकः Uṇ. 4. 43]<BR>—1 A bivalve shell. (शम्बूका also in this sense).<BR>—2 A small conch-shell.<BR>—3 A snail.<BR>—4 The edge of the frontal protuberance of an elephant.<BR>—5 N. of a Śūdra (who practised penance though forbidden to his caste<BR> and was in consequence slain by Rāma; see <i>inter alia</i> U. 2 and R. 15).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंभु|शम्भु|शंभुः|शम्भुः
