शंभुः|शम्भु|शंभु|शम्भुः
शंभु + .{@-भुः@}<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 Brahmaṇ.<BR>—3 A sage, venerable man.<BR>—4 A kind of Siddha. —5 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शंभुतनयः, शंभुनन्दनः, शंभुसुतः, शंभुप्रिया, शंभुवल्लभम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंभुतनयः|शम्भुतनय|शंभुतनय|शम्भुतनयः
शंभु + -तनयः, -नन्दनः, -सुतः epithets of Kārtikeya or Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंभुनन्दनः|शम्भुनन्दन|शंभुनंदन|शंभुनन्दन|शम्भुनन्दनः
शंभु + -तनयः, -नन्दनः, -सुतः epithets of Kārtikeya or Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंभुसुतः
शंभु + -तनयः, -नन्दनः, -सुतः epithets of Kārtikeya or Gaṇeśa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंभुप्रिया|शम्भुप्रिया
शंभु + -प्रिया N. of Durgā.<BR>—2 emblic myrobalan (आमलकी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शंभुवल्लभम्
शंभु + -वल्लभम् the white lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्या
शम्या [शम्-यत् टाप्]<BR>—1 A wooden stick or post.<BR>—2 A staff, a measure of length (= 36 Aṅgulas).<BR>—3 The pin of a yoke.<BR>—4 A kind of cymbal; वीणा नैवाद्य वाद्यन्ते शम्यातालस्वनैः सह Mb. 7. 72. 12.<BR>—5 A sacrificial vessel.<BR>—6 A kind of medical instrument.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शम्याक्षेपः, शम्यापातः, शम्याग्राहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्याक्षेपः|शम्याक्षेप
शम्या + -क्षेपः, -पातः the distance that a staff can be thrown; the cast<BR> of a staff; शम्यापातेनाभ्यतीयाद्वेदीभिश्चित्रयन् महीम् Mb. 12. 29. 95; Ms. 8. 237.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्यापातः|शम्यापात
शम्या + -क्षेपः, -पातः the distance that a staff can be thrown; the cast<BR> of a staff; शम्यापातेनाभ्यतीयाद्वेदीभिश्चित्रयन् महीम् Mb. 12. 29. 95; Ms. 8. 237.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शम्याग्राहः|शम्याग्राह
शम्या + -ग्राहः one who plays the cymbal; Rām. 2. 91. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शय|शयः
शय <i>a.</i> (-या, -यी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शी-अच्] Lying down, sleep ing (usually at<BR> the end of comp.); रात्रिजागरपरो दिवाशयः R. 19. 34; so उत्तानशय,<BR> पार्श्वशय, वृक्षेशय, बिलेशय &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयः|शय
शय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 Sleep.<BR>—2 A bed, couch; मायाशये शयाना मे नाद्यापि पुनरुत्थिताः Bhāg. 10. 13. 41.<BR>—3 A hand; सुन्दरीभिः शयाम्भोजसंवाहितपदं पुनः Śiva B. 2. 91;<BR> तदूरुकाण्डे सविलासमर्पितः शयः शयानेन सहानयामुना Rām. Ch. 2. 49;<BR> also used as a measure of length.<BR>—4 A snake, especially the boa.<BR>—5 Abuse, imprecation, curse.<BR>—6 A stake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयण्ड|शयंड|शयण्डः
शयण्ड <i>a.</i> Sleepy, sleeping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयतः|शयत
शयतः<BR>—1 One who sleeps much.<BR>—2 The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयथ|शयथः
शयथ <i>a.</i> [शी-अथच् Uṇ. 3. 112] Sleepy, asleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयथः|शयथ
शयथ + .{@-थः@}<BR>—1 Death.<BR>—2 A kind of snake, the boa-constrictor.<BR>—3 A boar.<BR>—4 A fish.<BR>—5 (Ved.) A lair, abode.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनम्
शयनम् [शी-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Sleeping, sleep, lying down.<BR>—2 A bed, couch; शयनस्थो न भुञ्जीत Ms. 4. 74; R. 1. 95; V. 3. 10.<BR>—3 Copulation, sexual union.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शयनागारः, शयनागारः, शयनागारम्, शयनगृहम्, शयनैकादशी, शयनतलगत, शयनपालिका, शयनभूमिः, शयनरचनम्, शयनवासस्, शयनसखी, शयनस्थ, शयनस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनागारः|शयनागार
शयनम् + -अगारः, -आगारः, -आगारम्, -गृहम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">Page1535-2</a>]<BR> a bed-chamber, sleeping apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनागारः|शयनागार
शयनम् + -अगारः, -आगारः, -आगारम्, -गृहम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">Page1535-2</a>]<BR> a bed-chamber, sleeping apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनागारम्
शयनम् + -अगारः, -आगारः, -आगारम्, -गृहम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">Page1535-2</a>]<BR> a bed-chamber, sleeping apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनगृहम्
शयनम् + -अगारः, -आगारः, -आगारम्, -गृहम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">Page1535-2</a>]<BR> a bed-chamber, sleeping apartments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनैकादशी
शयनम् + -एकादशी the eleventh day of the bright half of Āṣāḍha when<BR> Viṣṇu lies down to enjoy his four monthsʼ repose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनतलगत
शयनम् + -तलगत <i>a.</i> gone to bed, lying in bed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनपालिका
शयनम् + -पालिका the (female) keeper of a (royal) bed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनभूमिः|शयनभूमि
शयनम् + -भूमिः a bed-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनरचनम्
शयनम् + -रचनम् the preparation of a bed (one of the 64 arts).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनवासस्
शयनम् + -वासस् <i>n.</i> sleeping garment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनसखी
शयनम् + -सखी a bed-fellow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनस्थ
शयनम् + -स्थ <i>a.</i> being on a couch; शयनस्थो न भुञ्जीत Ms. 4. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनस्थानम्
शयनम् + -स्थानम् a sleeping apartment, bed-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयनीयम्
शयनीयम् [शी-आधारे अनीयर्]<BR>—1 A bed, couch; परिशून्यं शयनीयमद्य मे R. 8. 66; कान्तासखस्य<BR> शयनीयशिलातलं ते U. 3. 21; (शयनीयकम् in the same sense).<BR>—2 A bedchamber; शयनीयं नरेन्द्रस्य तदासाद्य व्यतिष्ठत Rām. 2. 15. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयानः|शयान
शयानः, -शयानकः<BR>—1 A chameleon.<BR>—2 A kind of snake, the boa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयानकः|शयानक
शयानः, -शयानकः<BR>—1 A chameleon.<BR>—2 A kind of snake, the boa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयालु|शयालुः
शयालु <i>a.</i> [शी-आलुच्] Sleepy, slothful; हन्ति नोपशयस्थोऽपि<BR> शयालुर्मृगयुर्मृगान् Śi. 2. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयालुः|शयालु
शयालु + .{@-लुः@}<BR>—1 A kind of snake, the boa-constrictor.<BR>—2 A dog.<BR>—3 A jackal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयित|शयितः
शयित <i>p. p.</i> [शी कर्तरि क्त]<BR>—1 Sleeping, reposed, asleep.<BR>—2 Lying down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयितम्
शयित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Sleep, sleeping.<BR>—2 The place where one has slept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयुः|शयु
शयुः, शयुनः [शी-उः उनन् Uṇ. 1. 7, 3. 60] A large snake, the boa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शयुनः|शयुन
शयुः, शयुनः [शी-उः उनन् Uṇ. 1. 7, 3. 60] A large snake, the boa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शय्या
शय्या [शी आधारे क्यप्]<BR>—1 A bed, couch; शय्या भूमितलम् Śānti. 4. 9; मही रम्या शय्या<BR> Bh. 3. 79; R. 5. 66.<BR>—2 Sleeping.<BR>—3 Tying, stringing together.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शय्याध्यक्षः, शय्यापालः, शय्यान्तः, शय्योत्थायम्, शय्योत्सङ्गः, शय्यागत, शय्यागृहम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शय्याध्यक्षः|शय्याध्यक्ष
शय्या + -अध्यक्षः, -पालः the superintendent or guardian of a kingʼs bed-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शय्यापालः|शय्यापाल
शय्या + -अध्यक्षः, -पालः the superintendent or guardian of a kingʼs bed-chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शय्यान्तः
शय्या + -अन्तः a sleeping place; शय्यान्ते कुलमलिनां क्षणं विलीनम् Ki. 7. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शय्योत्थायम्
शय्या + -उत्थायम् <i>ind.</i> early in the morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शय्योत्सङ्गः|शय्योत्सङ्ग|शय्योत्संग
शय्या + -उत्सङ्गः the side of a bed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शय्यागत
शय्या + -गत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 lying in a bed.<BR>—2 confined to a bed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शय्यागृहम्
शय्या + -गृहम् a bedchamber; अथार्धरात्रे स्तिमितप्रदीपे शय्यागृहे सुप्तजने<BR> प्रबुद्धः R. 16. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरः|शर|शरं
शरः [शॄ-अच्]<BR>—1 An arrow, a shaft; क्व च निशितनिपाता वज्रसाराः शरास्ते Ś. 1. 10;<BR> शरश्च त्रिविधो ज्ञेयः स्त्री पुमाँश्च नपुंसकः । अग्रस्थूलो भवेन्नारी<BR> पश्चात्स्थूलो भवेत् पुमान् । समो नपुंसको ज्ञेयः Dhanur. 62-63.<BR>—2 A kind of white reed or grass (Mar. देवनळ, बोरू); कुशकाशशरैः<BR> पर्णैः सुपरिच्छादितां तथा Rām. 3. 15. 22; शरकाण्डपाण्डुगण्डस्थला<BR> M. 3. 8; मुखेन सीता शरपाण्डुरेण R. 14. 26; Śi. 11. 30.<BR>—3 The cream of slightly curdled milk, cream; आपो वा अर्कस्तद्यदपां<BR> शर आसीत् समहन्यत सा पृथिवी Bṛ. Up. 1. 2. 2.<BR>—4 Hurt, injury, wound.<BR>—5 The number ‘five’; cf. शराग्नि q. v.<BR>—6 (In astr.) The versed sine of an arc.<BR>—7 Kuśa grass; तथा शरेष्वपि MS. 8. 3. 33 (शरशब्दस्यापि कुशेषु<BR> प्रयोगो दृशयते ŚB. on MS. on ibid.); भृशरसं शरसंहितकान्तिके<BR> Rām. Ch. 4. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरम्
शरः + .{@-रम्@} Water.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शराग्निः, शराग्न्यः, शराभ्यासः, शराघातः, शरासनम्, शरास्यम्, शराक्षेपः, शरारोपः, शरावापः, शरावरः, शरावरणम्, शराश्रयः, शरासः, शराहत, शरेषीका, शरेष्टः, शरोपासनम्, शरौघः, शरकाण्डः, शरक्षेपः, शरघातः, शरजम्, शरजः, शरजन्मन्, शरजालम्, शरदुर्दिनम्, शरधिः, शरपातः, शरपुङ्खः, शरपुङ्खा, शरप्रवेगः, शरफलम्, शरभङ्गः, शरभूः, शरभृष्टिः, शरमल्लः, शरयन्त्रकम्, शरवनम्, शरवर्षः, शरवाणिः, शरवृष्टिः, शरव्रातः, शरसंधानम्, शरसंबाध, शरस्तम्बः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

