शरः + -अग्निः the number ‘thirty-five’; शराग्निपरिमाणं च तत्रासौ<BR> वसते सुखम् Mb. 13. 107. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1535-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराग्न्यः
