शरण <i>a.</i> See शरण्य; शरणान्यशरण्यानि आश्रमाणि कृतानि नः Rām. 7. 6. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणम्
शरणम् [शॄ-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Protection, help, succour, defence; भूत्वा शरण्या शरणार्थमन्यं<BR> कथं प्रपत्स्ये त्वयि दीप्यमाने R. 14. 64; V. 1. 3; U. 4. 23.<BR>—2 Refuge, shelter; तस्याः करिष्यामि दृढानुतापं प्रवालशय्याशरणं<BR> शरीरम् Ku. 3. 8; Pt. 2.<BR>—3 A place of refuge, resort, asylum (applied to persons also); सुरासुरस्य<BR> जगतः शरणम् Ki. 18. 22; संतप्तानां त्वमसि शरणम् Me. 7; शरणं<BR> गम्-इ-या &c. ‘to go to for protection, take shelter with, to submit to’<BR>; यामि हे कमिह शरणं Gīt. 7.<BR>—4 A sanctuary, closet, an apartment; अग्निशरणमार्गमादेशय Ś. 5;<BR> अतोऽग्निहोत्रशरणादग्निमाधायात्मानमुद्दीपयामः Nāg. 5;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">Page1536-2</a>]<BR> Bhāg. 7. 12. 20.<BR>—5 An abode, a house, habitation; शरणमपि समिद्भिः शुष्यमाणाभिराभिः<BR> Mu. 3. 15; Bk. 6. 9; Ve. 5. 26.<BR>—6 Lair, resting-place.<BR>—7 Injuring, killing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शरणार्थिन्, शरणागत, शरणापन्न, शरणागतिः, शरणालयः, शरणोन्मुख, शरणद, शरणप्रद<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणार्थिन्
शरणम् + -अर्थिन् <i>a.</i><BR> {@-एषिन्@} <i>a.</i><BR>—1 seeking refuge or protection; इतश्च शरणार्थिनः शिखरिणां गणाः<BR> शेरते Bh. 2. 76.<BR>—2 unfortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणागत|शरणागतः
शरणम् + -आगत, -आपन्न <i>a.</i> gone to for refuge or protection, taking<BR> shelter with, fugitive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणापन्न
शरणम् + -आगत, -आपन्न <i>a.</i> gone to for refuge or protection, taking<BR> shelter with, fugitive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणागतिः|शरणागति
शरणम् + -आगतिः approach for protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणालयः|शरणालय
शरणम् + -आलयः a place of refuge, asylum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणोन्मुख
शरणम् + -उन्मुख <i>a.</i> looking up to for protection; असौ शरण्यः शरणोन्मुखानाम् R. 6. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणद
शरणम् + -द, -प्रद <i>a.</i> affording protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणप्रद
शरणम् + -द, -प्रद <i>a.</i> affording protection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरण्य|शरण्यः
शरण्य <i>a.</i> [शरणे साधुः यत्]<BR>—1 Fit to protect, yielding protection, a protector, refuge; असौ शरण्यः<BR> शरणोन्मुखानाम् R. 6. 21; शरण्यो लोकानाम् Mv. 4. 1; R. 2. 30, 14. 64, 15. 2;<BR> Ku. 5. 76.<BR>—2 Needing protection, poor, miserable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरण्यः|शरण्य
शरण्य + .{@-ण्यः@} An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरण्यम्
शरण्य + .{@-ण्यम्@}<BR>—1 A place of refuge, shelter.<BR>—2 A protector, who or what affords protection; लवणत्रासितः स्तोमः<BR> शरण्यं त्वामुपस्थितः U. 1. 50.<BR>—3 Protection, defence; शरण्यौ सर्वसत्त्वानाम् Rāmarakṣā 19.<BR>—4 Injury, hurt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरणी
शरणी (-णिः <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 A road, path.<BR>—2 The earth.<BR>—3 A row, line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरण्युः|शरण्यु
शरण्युः<BR>—1 A protector.<BR>—2 A cloud.<BR>—3 Wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरण्डः|शरण्ड|शरंड|शरंडः
शरण्डः<BR>—1 A bird.<BR>—2 A chameleon.<BR>—3 A cheat, rogue.<BR>—4 A lecher, libertine.<BR>—5 A kind of ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरद्
शरद् <i>f.</i> [शॄ-अदि Uṇ. 1. 129]<BR>—1 The autumn, autumnal season (comprising the two months आश्विन and<BR> कार्तिक); यात्रायै चोदयामास तं शक्तेः प्रथमं शरद् R. 4. 24.<BR>—2 A year; त्वं जीव शरदः शतम्; शरदामयुतं ययौ R. 10. 1; U. 1. 15;<BR> धारिणीभूतधारिण्योर्भव भर्ता शरच्छतम् M. 1. 15.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शरदन्तः, शरदम्बुधरः, शरदुदाशयः, शरत्कामिन्, शरत्कालः, शरद्घनः, शरन्मेघः, शरच्चन्द्रः, शरज्ज्योत्स्ना, शरत्त्रियामा, शरत्पद्मः, शरत्पद्मम्, शरत्पर्वन्, शरन्मुखम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरदन्तः|शरदन्त|शरदंत
शरद् + -अन्तः The end of autumn, winter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरदम्बुधरः|शरदम्बुधर|शरदंबुधर
शरद् + -अम्बुधरः an autumnal cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरदुदाशयः|शरदुदाशय|शरदुदाशयं
शरद् + -उदाशयः an autumnal lake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरत्कामिन्
शरद् + -कामिन् <i>m.</i> a dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरत्कालः|शरत्काल
शरद् + -कालः the autumnal season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरद्घनः|शरद्घन
शरद् + -घनः, -मेघः an autumnal cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरन्मेघः|शरन्मेघ
शरद् + -घनः, -मेघः an autumnal cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरच्चन्द्रः|शरच्चन्द्र|शरच्चंद्र
शरद् + -चन्द्रः (शरच्चन्द्रः) the autumnal moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरज्ज्योत्स्ना
शरद् + -ज्योत्स्ना (शरज्ज्योत्स्ना) autumnal moon-shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरत्त्रियामा
शरद् + -त्रियामा an autumnal night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरत्पद्मः|शरत्पद्म|शरत्पद्मं
शरद् + -पद्मः, -पद्मम् the white lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरत्पद्मम्
शरद् + -पद्मः, -पद्मम् the white lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरत्पर्वन्|शरत्पर्व्वन्
शरद् + -पर्वन् <i>n.</i> the festival called <i>Kojāgara</i>; q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरन्मुखम्
शरद् + -मुखम् the commencement of autumn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरदा
शरदा<BR>—1 Autumn.<BR>—2 A year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरदिज|शरदिजं
शरदिज <i>a.</i> Autumnal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरभः|शरभ
शरभः [शॄ-अभच् Uṇ. 3. 122]<BR>—1 A young elephant.<BR>—2 A fabulous animal said to have 8 legs and to be stronger than a lion;<BR> शरभकुलमजिह्मं प्रोद्धरत्यम्बु कूपात् Ṛs. 1. 23; अष्टपादः शरभः<BR> सिंहघाती Mb.<BR>—3 A camel.<BR>—4 A grass-hopper.<BR>—5 A locust.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शरभलीलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरभलीलः|शरभलील
शरभः + -लीलः (in music) a kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरयुः|शरयु
शरयुः(यूः) <i>f.</i> N. of a river; see सरयु(यू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरयूः
शरयुः(यूः) <i>f.</i> N. of a river; see सरयु(यू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरल|शरलः
शरल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 See सरल.<BR>—2 Crooked; fraudulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरलकम्
शरलकम् Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1536-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरव्यम्
शरव्यम् [शरवे शरशिक्षायै हितं शरु-यत्] A butt or mark (for<BR> arrows), target (fig. also); तौ शरव्यमकरोत् स नेतरान् R. 11. 27;<BR> कृताः शरव्यं हरिणा तवासुराः Ś. 6. 28; R. 7. 45; Śi. 7. 24; व्यसनशतशरव्यतां गताः K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरव्यीकरणम्
शरव्यीकरणम् The act of taking aim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराटिः|शराटि
शराटिः [-डिः, -तिः, -रिः, -लिः, -लिका, -ली] A kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरारु|शरारुः
शरारु <i>a.</i> Noxious, hurtful, injurious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरारुः|शरारु
शरारु + .{@-रुः@} A mischievous animal; शरारुचक्रचारभीषणायां महाटव्याम् Dk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरावः|शराव|शरावं
शरावः, -वम्<BR> [शरं दध्यादिसारमवति अव्-अण् Tv.]<BR>—1 A shallow dish, platter, an earthen-ware vessel, tray; मोदकशरावं<BR> गृहीत्वा V. 3; Ms. 6. 56.<BR>—2 A cover, lid.<BR>—3 A measure equal to 2 <i>Kudavas</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरावम्
शरावः, -वम्<BR> [शरं दध्यादिसारमवति अव्-अण् Tv.]<BR>—1 A shallow dish, platter, an earthen-ware vessel, tray; मोदकशरावं<BR> गृहीत्वा V. 3; Ms. 6. 56.<BR>—2 A cover, lid.<BR>—3 A measure equal to 2 <i>Kudavas</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरावती
शरावती N. of a town of which Lava was made ruler by Rāma; (स<BR> निवेश्य) शरावत्यां सतां सूक्तैर्जनिताश्रुलवं लवम् R. 15. 97.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शराविका
शराविका A particular abscess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरिमन्
शरिमन् <i>m.</i> Bearing, bringing forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरम्
शरीरम् [शॄ-ईरन् Uṇ. 4. 31]<BR>—1 The body (of animate or inanimate objects); शरीरमाद्यं खलु धर्मसाधनम् Ku. 5. 33.<BR>—2 The constituent element; शरीरं तावदिष्टार्थव्यवच्छिन्ना पदावली<BR> Kāv. 1. 10; शरीरमसि संसारस्य U. 7.<BR>—3 Bodily strength.<BR>—4 A dead body.<BR>—5 Oneʼs own person, individual soul (जीवात्मा); यथा यथा मनस्तस्य<BR> दुष्कृतं कर्म गर्हति । तथा तथा शरीरं तत्तेनाधर्मेण मुच्यते ॥ Ms. 11. 229.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शरीरान्तः, शरीरान्तरम्, शरीराकारः, शरीराकृतिः, शरीरावरणम्, शरीरकर्तृ, शरीरकर्षणम्, शरीरग्रहणम्, शरीरचिन्ता, शरीरजः, शरीरतुल्य, शरीरत्याग, शरीरदण्डः, शरीरदेशः, शरीरधातुः, शरीरधृक्, शरीरपक्तिः, शरीरपतनम्, शरीरपातः, शरीरपाकः, शरीरप्रभवः, शरीरबद्ध, शरीरबन्धः, शरीरबन्धकः, शरीरभाज्, शरीरभेदः, शरीरयष्टिः, शरीरयात्रा, शरीररक्षकः, शरीररत्नम्, शरीरविमोक्षणम्, शरीरवृत्तिः, शरीरवैकल्यम्, शरीरशुश्रूषा, शरीरसंस्कारः, शरीरसंपत्तिः, शरीरसंबन्धः, शरीरसादः, शरीरस्थानम्, शरीरस्थितिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरान्तः|शरीरान्त
शरीरम् + -अन्तः the hairs on the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरान्तरम्
शरीरम् + -अन्तरम्<BR>—1 the interior of the body.<BR>—2 another body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीराकारः|शरीराकार
शरीरम् + -आकारः, -आकृतिः bodily gesture or mien.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीराकृतिः|शरीराकृति
शरीरम् + -आकारः, -आकृतिः bodily gesture or mien.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरावरणम्
शरीरम् + -आवरणम्<BR>—1 the skin.<BR>—2 a shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरकर्तृ
शरीरम् + -कर्तृ <i>m.</i> a father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरकर्षणम्
शरीरम् + -कर्षणम् emaciation of the body; शरीरकर्षणात् प्राणाः क्षीयन्ते<BR> प्राणिनां यथा Ms. 7. 112.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरग्रहणम्
शरीरम् + -ग्रहणम् assumption of a bodily form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरचिन्ता
शरीरम् + -चिन्ता care of the body (like washing etc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरजः|शरीरज
शरीरम् + -जः<BR>—1 sickness.<BR>—2 lust, passion.<BR>—3 the god of love; शरीरजसमाविष्टा राक्षसी राममब्रवीत् Rām. 3. 17. 12.<BR>—4 a son, offspring; शरीरजेभ्यशच्युतयूथपङ्क्तयः Ki. 4. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरतुल्य
शरीरम् + -तुल्य <i>a.</i> equal to, <i>i. e.</i> as dear as, oneʼs own person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरत्याग
शरीरम् + -त्याग renunciation of life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरदण्डः|शरीरदण्ड|शरीरदंड
शरीरम् + -दण्डः<BR>—1 corporal punishment.<BR>—2 mortification of the body (as in penance).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरदेशः|शरीरदेश
शरीरम् + -देशः a part the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरधातुः|शरीरधातु
शरीरम् + -धातुः<BR>—1 a chief constituent of the body.<BR>—2 a relic of Buddhaʼs body (as bone, tooth, hair etc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरधृक्
शरीरम् + -धृक् <i>a.</i> having a body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरपक्तिः|शरीरपक्ति
शरीरम् + -पक्तिः purification of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरपतनम्
शरीरम् + -पतनम्, -पातः shuffling off the mortal coil, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरपातः|शरीरपात
शरीरम् + -पतनम्, -पातः shuffling off the mortal coil, death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरपाकः|शरीरपाक
शरीरम् + -पाकः emaciation (of the body).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरप्रभवः|शरीरप्रभव
शरीरम् + -प्रभवः a begetter, father.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरबद्ध
शरीरम् + -बद्ध <i>a.</i> endowed with a body, embodied, incarnate; शरीरबद्धः<BR> प्रथमाश्रमो यथा Ku. 5. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरबन्धः|शरीरबन्ध
शरीरम् + -बन्धः<BR>—1 the bodily frame; शरीरबन्धेन तिरोबभूव R. 16. 23.<BR>—2 being endowed with a body; <i>i. e.</i> birth as an embodied being; तनुत्यजां<BR> नास्ति शरीरबन्धः R. 13. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरबन्धकः|शरीरबन्धक|शरीरबंधक
शरीरम् + -बन्धकः a hostage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरभाज्
शरीरम् + -भाज् <i>a.</i> embodied, incarnate. ━(<i>m.</i>) a creature, an embodied being;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">Page1537-2</a>]<BR> शरीरभाजां भवदीयदर्शनं व्यनक्ति कालत्रितयेऽपि योग्यताम् Śi. 1. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरभेदः|शरीरभेद
शरीरम् + -भेदः separation of the body (from the soul), death; प्राप्ते<BR> शरीरभेदे Sāṅ. K. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरयष्टिः|शरीरयष्टि
शरीरम् + -यष्टिः <i>f.</i> a slender body, slim or delicate figure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरयात्रा
शरीरम् + -यात्रा means of bodily sustenance; नियतं कुरु कर्म त्वं कर्म<BR> ज्यायो ह्यकर्मणः । शरीरयात्रापि च ते न प्रसिद्धपेदकर्मणः ॥ Bg. 3. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीररक्षकः|शरीररक्षक
शरीरम् + -रक्षकः a body-guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीररत्नम्
शरीरम् + -रत्नम् an excellent body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरविमोक्षणम्
शरीरम् + -विमोक्षणम् the emancipation of the soul from the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरवृत्तिः|शरीरवृत्ति
शरीरम् + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> maintenance or support of the body; स त्वं मदीयेन<BR> शरीरवृत्तिं देहन निर्वर्तयितुं प्रसीद R. 2. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरवैकल्यम्
शरीरम् + -वैकल्यम् bodily ailment, sickness, disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरशुश्रूषा
शरीरम् + -शुश्रूषा personal attendance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरसंस्कारः|शरीरसंस्कार
शरीरम् + -संस्कारः<BR>—1 decoration of the person.<BR>—2 purification of the body by the performance of the several purificatory<BR> <i>samskāras</i>; कार्यः शरीरसंस्कारः Ms. 2. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरसंपत्तिः|शरीरसम्पत्ति|शरीरसंपत्ति
शरीरम् + -संपत्तिः <i>f.</i> the prosperity of body, (good) health.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरसंबन्धः|शरीरसम्बन्ध
शरीरम् + -संबन्धः relation by marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरसादः|शरीरसाद
शरीरम् + -सादः leanness of body, emaciation; शरीरसादादसमग्रभूषणा R. 3. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरस्थानम्
शरीरम् + -स्थानम् the doctrine about the human body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरस्थितिः|शरीरस्थिति
शरीरम् + -स्थितिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 the maintenance or support of the body; वन्यं शरीरस्थितिसाधनं वः R. 5. 9.<BR>—2 taking oneʼs meals, eating (frequently used in Kādambarī).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरकम्
शरीरकम्<BR>—1 The body.<BR>—2 A small body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरकः|शरीरक|शरीरकं
शरीरकम् + .{@-कः@} The soul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरीरिन्
शरीरिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Embodied, corporeal, incarnate; परलोकं<BR> नयत्याशु भास्वन्तं खशरीरिणम् Ms. 4. 243; करुणस्य मूर्तिरथवा<BR> शरीरिणी विरहव्यथैव वनमेति जानकी U. 3. 4; भावाविव शरीरिणौ M. 1. 10. 2<BR> Living. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 Anything endowed with a body (whether animate or inanimate); शरीरिणां<BR> स्थावरजङ्गमानां सुखाय तज्जन्मदिनं बभूव Ku. 1. 23; मरणं<BR> प्रकृतिः शरीरिणाम् R. 8. 87, 43.<BR>—2 A sentient being.<BR>—3 A man.<BR>—4 The soul (clad with the body); स्वशरीरशरीरिणावपि श्रुतसंयोगविपर्ययौ<BR> यदा R. 8. 89; अन्तवन्त इमे देहा नित्यस्योक्ताः शरीरिणः Bg. 2. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शरुः|शरु
शरुः<BR>—1 An arrow.<BR>—2 A weapon.<BR>—3 The thunderbolt of Indra.<BR>—4 Anger, passion.<BR>—5 Practice of archery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करा
शर्करा [शॄ-करन् कस्य नेत्वम् Uṇ. 4. 3]<BR>—1 Candied sugar; द्राक्षा म्लानमुखी जाता शर्करा चाश्मतां गता । सुभाषितरसस्याग्रे<BR> सुधा भीता दिवं गता ॥ Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 A pebble, gravel, small stone; पादुकान्तरप्रविष्टेव शर्करा Mk. 5.<BR>—3 Gravelly mould; Mb. 12. 192. 1 (com. शर्कराः कर्करसहिता मृत्).<BR>—4 Soil abounding in stony fragments, sand; अशर्करामविभ्रंशां समतीर्थामशैवलाम्<BR> (पुष्करिणीम्) Rām. 3. 73. 11; सूपतीर्थां शुचिजलां शर्करापङ्कवर्जिताम्<BR> Mb. 5. 152. 7; Bhāg. 7. 15. 17.<BR>—5 A piece, fragment; कठिनकुचतटाग्रपाति पश्चादथ शतशर्करतां<BR> जगाम तासाम् Śi. 7. 69.<BR>—6 A potsherd.<BR>—7 A ny hard particle, as in जलशर्करा a nodule of water, <i>i. e.</i> hail.<BR>—8 The disease called gravel.<BR>—9 Golden earth; ह्रद इव तिमिनागसंवृतः स्तिमितजलो मणिशङ्खशर्करः<BR> Rām. 2. 81. 16 (com. शर्कराः सुवर्णखनिमृत्तिकाः)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शर्कराचलः, शर्करोदक, शर्कराधेनुः, शर्करासप्तमी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्कराचलः|शर्कराचल
शर्करा + -अचलः<BR>—1 the ceremonial ‘mountain of sugar’ (a heap measuring eight Bhāras)<BR> given away by pious donors together with four smaller<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">Page1538-1</a>]<BR> mountains called Viṣkambhaparvata. Three golden trees are planted on<BR> the mountain, while on the smaller mountains are placed idols of Cupid,<BR> Kubera and Brahmā as well as a golden image of the Surabhi cow. It was<BR> customary to give away similar mountains of butter, salt, paddy, cotton<BR> and sesamum seeds; दानान्तःश्रुतशर्कराचलमथः खेनामृतान्धाः स्मरः N. 21. 154.<BR>—2 a sugar-loaf (conical).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1537-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करोदक|शर्करोदकं
शर्करा + -उदक sugar-water, water sweetened with sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्कराधेनुः|शर्कराधेनु
शर्करा + -धेनुः a gift of sugar moulded in the shape of a cow; see शर्कराचल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करासप्तमी
शर्करा + -सप्तमी N. of an observance on the 7th day in the bright half of Vaiśākha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करकः|शर्करक
शर्करकः A kind of citron or lime.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करजा
शर्करजा Candied sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्कराल
शर्कराल <i>a.</i> Impregnated with gravelly particles (as wind). See<BR> next word; झाङ्कारी शर्करालः पथिषु विटपिनां स्कन्धकाषैः सधूमः Ve. 2. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करिक|शर्करिकः
शर्करिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), शर्करिल, शर्करावत <i>a.</i><BR> Stony, gravelly, gritty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करिकी
शर्करिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), शर्करिल, शर्करावत <i>a.</i><BR> Stony, gravelly, gritty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करिल|शर्करिलः
शर्करिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), शर्करिल, शर्करावत <i>a.</i><BR> Stony, gravelly, gritty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करावत
शर्करिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), शर्करिल, शर्करावत <i>a.</i><BR> Stony, gravelly, gritty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करिन्
शर्करिन् <i>a.</i> Suffering from the disease called ‘gravel’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्करी
शर्करी<BR>—1 A river.<BR>—2 A girdle.<BR>—3 A pen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्कुर
शर्कुर <i>a.</i> Young, tender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्धः|शर्ध|शर्द्धः
शर्धः [शृध्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Breaking wind, flatulence (said to be <i>n.</i> also in this sense).<BR>—2 A troop, multitude.<BR>—3 Strength, power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्धंजह|शर्धञ्जह|शर्द्धंजहः|शर्धंजहः
शर्धंजह <i>a.</i> Causing flatulence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्धंजहः|शर्धञ्जह|शर्द्धंजहः|शर्धंजह
शर्धंजह + .{@-हः@} A kind of pulse or bean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्धनम्
शर्धनम् The act of breaking wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्धस्
शर्धस् <i>n.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 A troop, host (particularly of Maruts).<BR>—2 Strength, power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्ब्|शर्ब्ब्
शर्ब् €1 P. (शर्बति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To injure, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्मन्|शर्म्मन्
शर्मन् <i>a.</i> [शॄ-मनिन् Uṇ. 4. 144] Happy, prosperous. ━<i>m.</i><BR> An affix added to the name of a Brāhmaṇa; as विष्णुशर्मन्; cf. वर्मन्,<BR> दास, गुप्त; शर्मवद्ब्राह्मणस्य स्याद्राज्ञो रक्षासमन्वितम् Ms. 2. 32. ━<i>n.</i><BR>—1 Pleasure, happiness, delight; त्यजन्त्यसून् शर्म च मानिनो वरं<BR> त्यजन्ति न त्वेकमयाचितं व्रतम् N. 1. 50; R. 1. 69; Bh. 3. 97.<BR>—2 A blessing.<BR>—3 Protection.<BR>—4 A house, receptacle (mostly Vedic in this sense).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शर्मद, शर्मप्रद<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्मद|शर्मदः|शर्म्मद
शर्मन् + -द, -प्रद <i>a.</i> conferring happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्मदः|शर्मद|शर्म्मद
शर्मन् + -द, -प्रद + .({@-दः@}) an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्मप्रद
शर्मन् + -द, -प्रद <i>a.</i> conferring happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्मरः|शर्मर|शर्म्मर|शर्म्मरः
शर्मरः<BR>—1 A sort of garment.<BR>—2 Curcuma Aromatica (Mar. दारूहळद).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्मण्य
शर्मण्य <i>a.</i> Sheltering, protecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्मिष्ठा
शर्मिष्ठा N. of one of the wives of Yayāti and daughter of Vṛṣaparvan,<BR> the king of the Daityas; cf. देवयानी and ययाति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्य|शर्यः
शर्य <i>a.</i> Ved. Hurtful, injurious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्यः|शर्य
शर्य + .{@-र्यः@}<BR>—1 An enemy.<BR>—2 An arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्या|शर्य्या
शर्या<BR>—1 Night.<BR>—2 A finger.<BR>—3 An arrow (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्व्|शर्व्व्
शर्व् €1 P. (शर्वति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To hurt, injure, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्वः|शर्व|शर्व्व|शर्व्वः
शर्वः<BR>—1 N. of Śiva; कतिचिदवनिपालः शर्वरीः शर्वकल्पः पुरमविशदयोध्याम्<BR> R. 11. 93; Ku. 6. 14.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्वरः|शर्वर|शर्व्वर|शर्व्वरं
शर्वरः [शॄ-ष्वरच् Uṇ. 2. 122] N. of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्वरम्
शर्वरः + .{@-रम्@} Darkness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्वरी|शर्व्वरी
शर्वरी [शॄ-वनिप् ङीप् वनो र च]<BR>—1 A night; शशिनं पुनरेति शर्वरी R. 8. 56, 3. 2, 11. 93; Śi. 11. 5.<BR>—2 Evening, twilight.<BR>—3 Turmeric.<BR>—4 A woman.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शर्वरीशः, शर्वरीपतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्वरीशः|शर्वरीश
शर्वरी + -ईशः, -पतिः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्वरीपतिः|शर्वरीपति
शर्वरी + -ईशः, -पतिः the moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्वला|शर्व्वला
शर्वला, -ली<BR> An iron crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्वली
शर्वला, -ली<BR> An iron crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्वाणी|शर्व्वाणी
शर्वाणी N. of Pārvatī or Durgā, wife of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्शरीक|शर्शरीकः
शर्शरीक <i>a.</i> [शॄ-रुक् Uṇ. 4. 19] Mischievous, cruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शर्शरीकः|शर्शरीक
शर्शरीक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A rogue, wretch, mischievous man.<BR>—2 A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शल्
शल् I. €1 Ā. (शलते)<BR>—1 To shake, stir, agitate.<BR>—2 To tremble.<BR>—3 To cover. ━II. €1 P. (शलति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To run fast. ━III. €10 Ā. (शालयते) To praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलः|शल|शलं
शलः [शल्-घञ्]<BR>—1 A dart, spear.<BR>—2 A stake.<BR>—3 N. of शृङ्गि, an attendant of Śiva.<BR>—4 N. of Brahman.<BR>—5 A camel.<BR>—6 N. of a king (शल्य); Bhāg. 1. 15. 16, 10. 68. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलम्
शलः + .{@-लम्@} The quill of a porcupine. ━(<i>m.</i> also according to some).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलकः|शलक
शलकः<BR>—1 A spider.<BR>—2 A bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलङ्गः|शलङ्ग|शलंग|शलंगः
शलङ्गः<BR>—1 A king, sovereign.<BR>—2 A kind of salt; Rām. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलभः|शलभ
शलभः [शल्-अभच् Uṇ. 3. 122]<BR>—1 A grass-hopper, locust; पतति परिणतारुणप्रकाशः शलभसमूह<BR> इवाश्रमद्रुमेषु Ś. 1. 31.<BR>—2 A moth; कौरव्यवंशदावेऽस्मिन् क एष शलभायते Ve. 1. 19; Śi. 2. 117;<BR> Ku. 4. 40.<BR>—3 N. of an Asura.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शललम्
शललम् [शल्-अलच् Uṇ. 1. 98] The quill of a porcupine; Mb. 7. 45. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलली
शललम् + .{@-ली@}<BR>—1 The quill of a porcupine.<BR>—2 A small porcupine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलाका
शलाका [शल्-आकः Uṇ. 4. 15]<BR>—1 A small stick, peg, rod, pin, piece, thin bar (of anything); अयस्कान्तमणिशलाका Māl. 1.<BR>—2 A pencil, small stick (used in painting the eyes with collyrium); अज्ञानान्धस्य<BR> लोकस्य ज्ञानाञ्जनशलाकया । चक्षुरुन्मीलितं येन तस्मै पाणिनये नमः ॥<BR> Śik. 58; Ku. 1. 47; ययौ शलाकामपरा वहन्ती R. 7. 8.<BR>—3 An arrow.<BR>—4 A dart, javelin.<BR>—5 A probe or a kind of pointed surgical instrument.<BR>—6 A rib (as of an umbrella); न ते शतशलाकेन … छत्रेणाभिविराजते<BR> Rām. 2. 26. 10.<BR>—7 A bone (forming the root of the fingers and toes); पाणिपादशलाकाश्च<BR> तेषां स्थानचतुष्टयम् Y. 3. 85.<BR>—8 A sprout, spring, shoot; उद्भिन्नया रत्नशलाकयेव Ku. 1. 24.<BR>—9 A paint-brush.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">Page1539-1</a>]<BR>—10 A tooth-brush, tooth-pick.<BR>—11 A porcupine.<BR>—12 An oblong piece of ivory or bone used in gambling.<BR>—13 A ruler.<BR>—14 The Sārikā bird.<BR>—15 A peg, pin; ततोऽम्बष्ठोऽस्थिभेदिन्या निरभिद्यच्छलाकया Mb. 7. 25. 50.<BR>—16 Bar (of a cage or window).<BR>—17 A finger; शलाकानखपातैश्च (युद्धमभवत्) Mb. 4. 13. 29.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शलाकाधूर्तः, शलाकापरि, शलाकापरीक्षा, शलाकापुरुषाः, शलाकायन्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1538-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलाकाधूर्तः
शलाका + -धूर्तः (forming शलाकधूर्तः) a swindler, sharper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलाकापरि
शलाका + -परि <i>ind.</i> an unlucky throw or movement of one of the pieces<BR> at a game played with Śalākās; cf. परि or अक्षपरि; P. II. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलाकापरीक्षा
शलाका + -परीक्षा the method of examining a student from a page whichever<BR> opened by a Śalākā inserted into a book.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलाकापुरुषाः
शलाका + -पुरुषाः N. of 63 divine personages among Jainas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलाकायन्त्रम्
शलाका + -यन्त्रम् (in surgery) a pointed instrument, probe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलाटः|शलाट
शलाटः A cart-load (= 20 times 100 palas).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलाटु|शलाटुः
शलाटु <i>a.</i> Unripe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलाटुः|शलाटु
शलाटु + .{@-टुः@}<BR>—1 A kind of root.<BR>—2 The Bilva tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलाभोलिः|शलाभोलि
शलाभोलिः A camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शलालुः|शलालु
शलालुः A kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शली
शली <i>f.</i> A small porcupine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शल्कम्
शल्कम्, शल्कलम् [शल्-क कस्य नेत्वम् Uṇ. 3. 43]<BR>—1 The scale of a fish; ‘सशल्कान् मत्स्यान् न्यायोपपन्नान् भक्षयेत्’<BR> इति हारीतः; सशल्कांश्चैव सर्वशः Ms. 5. 16; Y. 1. 178.<BR>—2 Bark, rind (of trees).<BR>—3 A part, portion, fragment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शल्कलम्
शल्कम्, शल्कलम् [शल्-क कस्य नेत्वम् Uṇ. 3. 43]<BR>—1 The scale of a fish; ‘सशल्कान् मत्स्यान् न्यायोपपन्नान् भक्षयेत्’<BR> इति हारीतः; सशल्कांश्चैव सर्वशः Ms. 5. 16; Y. 1. 178.<BR>—2 Bark, rind (of trees).<BR>—3 A part, portion, fragment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शल्कलिन्
