शल्योद्धारः|शल्योद्धार
शल्यम् + -आहरणम्, -उद्धरणम्, -उद्धारः, -क्रिया, -शास्त्रम् extraction of<BR> thorns or splinters, or that part of surgery which relates to the extraction<BR> of extraneous matter from the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शल्यक्रिया
शल्यम् + -आहरणम्, -उद्धरणम्, -उद्धारः, -क्रिया, -शास्त्रम् extraction of<BR> thorns or splinters, or that part of surgery which relates to the extraction<BR> of extraneous matter from the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शल्यशास्त्रम्
शल्यम् + -आहरणम्, -उद्धरणम्, -उद्धारः, -क्रिया, -शास्त्रम् extraction of<BR> thorns or splinters, or that part of surgery which relates to the extraction<BR> of extraneous matter from the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शल्यकण्ठः|शल्यकण्ठ|शल्यकंठ
शल्यम् + -कण्ठः a porcupine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शल्यकर्त्तृ|शल्यकर्तृ
शल्यम् + -कर्त्तृ a surgeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

