शल्यपर्वन्
शल्यम् + -पर्वन् N. of the 9th book of the Mahābhārata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

