शल्यहर्तृ
शल्यम् + -हर्तृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 a weeder.<BR>—2 a surgeon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शल्यकः|शल्यक
शल्यकः<BR>—1 A dart, javelin, spike.<BR>—2 A splinter, thorn.<BR>—3 A porcupine; Ms. 5. 18; Rām. 4. 17. 39; Mb. 13. 111. 63.<BR>—4 A hunter (व्याध); जिह्वां दत्त्वा बहूनां हि क्षुद्राणां लुब्धचेतसाम् ।<BR> निकृत्या लभते राज्यमाहारमिव शल्यकः ॥ Mb. 3. 33. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शल्यकवत्|शल्यकवन्त्
