शवयानम्
शवः + -यानम्, -रथः a hearse, bier, a sort of litter for carrying a corpse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शवरथः|शवरथ
शवः + -यानम्, -रथः a hearse, bier, a sort of litter for carrying a corpse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शवशयम्
शवः + -शयम् lotus. ˚नाथः the epithet of Viṣṇu; Bhāg. 4. 7. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शवशयनम्
शवः + -शयनम् a cemetery, cremation ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1539-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

