शशोर्णम्
शशः + -ऊर्णम्, -लोमन् <i>n.</i> the hair of a rabbit, hair-skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1540-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शशलोमन्
शशः + -ऊर्णम्, -लोमन् <i>n.</i> the hair of a rabbit, hair-skin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1540-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शशधरः|शशधर
शशः + -धरः<BR>—1 the moon; उत्पातधूमलेखाक्रान्तेव कला शशधरस्य Māl. 9. 49;<BR> प्रसरति शशधरबिम्बे Gīt. 7.<BR>—2 camphor. ˚मौलिः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1540-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शशपदम्
शशः + -पदम् a hareʼs track (easily got over).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1540-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शशप्लुतकम्
