शशविषाणम्
शशः + -विषाणम्, -शृङ्गम् a hareʼs horn; used to denote anything impossible,<BR> an utter impossibility; कदाचिदपि पर्यटञ् शशविषाणमासादयेत् Bh. 2. 5;<BR> शशशृङ्गधनुर्धरः; see खपुष्प.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1540-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शशशृङ्गम्
शशः + -विषाणम्, -शृङ्गम् a hareʼs horn; used to denote anything impossible,<BR> an utter impossibility; कदाचिदपि पर्यटञ् शशविषाणमासादयेत् Bh. 2. 5;<BR> शशशृङ्गधनुर्धरः; see खपुष्प.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1540-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

