शशितनयः|शशितनय
शशिन् + -जः, -तनयः an epithet of Budha or Mercury (son of the moon);<BR> भृगुसूनुधरापुत्रौ शशिजेन समन्वितौ Mb. 9. 11. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1540-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

