शार्कः|शार्क
शार्कः Candied sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्ककः|शार्कक
शार्ककः<BR>—1 Candied sugar.<BR>—2 A lump of sugar.<BR>—3 The froth of milk.<BR>—4 Cream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्कर|शार्करः
