शार्करः|शार्कर
शार्कर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A gravelly place.<BR>—2 The froth or scum of milk.<BR>—3 Cream.<BR>—4 Molasses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्करक|शार्करकः
शार्करक, -रिक, -रीय <i>a.</i><BR> Gravelly, stony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

