शार्करक, -रिक, -रीय <i>a.</i><BR> Gravelly, stony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्करीय|शार्करीयः
शार्करक, -रिक, -रीय <i>a.</i><BR> Gravelly, stony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्करिन्
शार्करिन् Suffering from gravel or stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्गाल
शार्गाल <i>a.</i> Belonging or relating to a jackal; मध्ये वै पापयोनीनां<BR> शार्गालीं यामहं गतः Mb. 12. 180. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्ङ्ग|शार्ंग|शार्ङ्गं|शार्ङ्गः
