शार्व
शार्व <i>a.</i> Belonging or relating to Śiva.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शार्वदिश्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्वदिश्
शार्व + -दिश् the east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्वर|शार्व्वरं
शार्वर <i>a.</i> (-री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शर्वर्यां भवम् अण्]<BR>—1 Nocturnal; शार्वरान्धकारपूर &c. Dk.; नूनमुन्नमति यज्वनां<BR> पतिः शार्वरस्य तमसो निषिद्धये Ku. 8. 58.<BR>—2 Mischievous, pernicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1546-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शार्वरम्
