शाल्
शाल् €1 Ā. (शालते)<BR>—1 To praise, flatter.<BR>—2 To shine.<BR>—3 To be endowed with; Malli. on Ki. 5. 44.<BR>—4 To tell.<BR>—5 To boast, vaunt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शाल|शालः
