शालः|शाल
शालः<BR>—1 N. of a tree (very tall and stately), Shorea Robusta; ‘शालः सर्जतरुः स्मृतः’ इति शाश्वतः;<BR> शालनिर्यासगन्धिभिः R. 1. 38; Śi. 3. 40; Ki. 10. 34.<BR>—2 A tree in general; शालप्रांशुर्महाभुजः R. 1. 13; Ve. 4. 3; घनपोत्रविदीर्णशालमूलः Ki. 13. 3.<BR>—3 An enclosure, a fence.<BR>—4 A kind of fish.<BR>—5 N. of king Śālivāhana.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शालग्रामः, शालजः, शालनिर्यासः, शालपोतः, शालभञ्जिका, शालभञ्जी, शालवेष्टः, शालसारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालग्रामः|शालग्राम
शालः + -ग्रामः a kind of sacred stone said to be typical of Viṣṇu,<BR> as the Phallus is of Śiva. ˚गिरि N. of a mountain. ˚शिला the <i>Śālāgrāma</i> stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालजः|शालज
शालः + -जः, -निर्यासः exudation of the Śāla tree, resin; R. 1. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालनिर्यासः|शालनिर्यास|शालनिर्य्यास
शालः + -जः, -निर्यासः exudation of the Śāla tree, resin; R. 1. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालपोतः|शालपोत
शालः + -पोतः a young Śāla tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालभञ्जिका|शालभंजिका
शालः + -भञ्जिका<BR>—1 a doll, puppet, statue; Vb. 1; N. 2. 83; रचिता तोरणशालभञ्जिकेव Bu. C. 5. 52.<BR>—2 a courtezan, harlot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालभञ्जी|शालभंजी
शालः + -भञ्जी a doll, puppet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालवेष्टः|शालवेष्ट
शालः + -वेष्टः the resin of the Śāla tree; cf. सालः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1547-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शालसारः|शालसार
