शिञ्जञ्जिका|शिंजंजिका
शिञ्जञ्जिका A chain worn round the loins.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिञ्जा
शिञ्जा<BR>—1 Tinkle, jingle &c.<BR>—2 A bow-string; also शिञ्जालता.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1551-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

