शिरस् + -क्रिया presentation of the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोगृहम्
शिरस् + -गृहम् (शिरोगृहम्) a room on the top of a house, turret, garret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

