शिरस् + -ग्रहः (शिरोग्रहः) affection of the head, headache.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरश्छेदः|शिरश्छेद
शिरस् + -छेदः, -छेदनम् (शिरश्छेदः &c.) beheading, decapitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरश्छेदनम्
शिरस् + -छेदः, -छेदनम् (शिरश्छेदः &c.) beheading, decapitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरस्तापिन्
शिरस् + -तापिन् <i>m.</i> an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरस्त्रम्
शिरस् + -त्रम्, -त्राणम्<BR>—1 a helmet; च्युतैः शिरस्रैश्चषकोत्तरेव R. 7. 49, 66; अपनीतशिरस्त्राणाः 4. 64.<BR>—2 a head-dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरस्त्राणम्
शिरस् + -त्रम्, -त्राणम्<BR>—1 a helmet; च्युतैः शिरस्रैश्चषकोत्तरेव R. 7. 49, 66; अपनीतशिरस्त्राणाः 4. 64.<BR>—2 a head-dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोधरा
शिरस् + -धरा, -धिः, -ध्रः (शिरोधरा, -धिः, -ध्रः) the neck; तेषां<BR> शिरोधरान् धूताञ्छरध्वजधनूंषि च Rām. 7. 7. 17; निकृत्तबाहूरुशिरोध्रविग्रहम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 59. 16; Śi. 4. 52, 5. 65; cf. कम्बुशिरोधिः Caitanyacandrodaya 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोधिः|शिरोधि
शिरस् + -धरा, -धिः, -ध्रः (शिरोधरा, -धिः, -ध्रः) the neck; तेषां<BR> शिरोधरान् धूताञ्छरध्वजधनूंषि च Rām. 7. 7. 17; निकृत्तबाहूरुशिरोध्रविग्रहम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 59. 16; Śi. 4. 52, 5. 65; cf. कम्बुशिरोधिः Caitanyacandrodaya 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोध्रः|शिरोध्र
शिरस् + -धरा, -धिः, -ध्रः (शिरोधरा, -धिः, -ध्रः) the neck; तेषां<BR> शिरोधरान् धूताञ्छरध्वजधनूंषि च Rām. 7. 7. 17; निकृत्तबाहूरुशिरोध्रविग्रहम्<BR> Bhāg. 10. 59. 16; Śi. 4. 52, 5. 65; cf. कम्बुशिरोधिः Caitanyacandrodaya 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरःपीठम्
शिरस् + -पीठम् the back of the neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरःपीडा
शिरस् + -पीडा headache.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरःपुष्पम्
शिरस् + -पुष्पम् an ornament for the head; स्फुरितारुणवर्णेन शिरष्पुष्पेण<BR> शोभिताम् Śiva B. 2. 53<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरःप्रणामः|शिरःप्रणाम
शिरस् + -प्रणामः bending the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरःप्रदानम्
शिरस् + -प्रदानम् giving up the head or life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरःप्रावरणम्
शिरस् + -प्रावरणम् a turban.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरःफलः|शिरःफल
शिरस् + -फलः the cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोभूषणम्
शिरस् + -भूषणम् (शिरोभूषणम्)<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">Page1553-1</a>]<BR> an ornament for the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1552-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोमणिः|शिरोमणि
शिरस् + -मणिः (शिरोमणिः)<BR>—1 a jewel worn on the head.<BR>—2 a crest-jewel.<BR>—3 a title of respect conferred on learned men.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोमर्मन्|शिरोमर्म्मन्
शिरस् + -मर्मन् <i>m.</i> (शिरोमर्भन्) a hog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोमालिन्
शिरस् + -मालिन् <i>m.</i> (शिरोमालिन्) an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोरत्नम्
शिरस् + -रत्नम् (शिरोरत्नम्) a jewel worn on the head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोरुजा
