शिरोरुह्
शिरस् + -रुह् <i>m.</i>, {@-रुहः@} (शिरोरुह्, -रुहः) (also {@शिरसिरुह्, -हः@})<BR> the hair of the head; शिरोरुहैः स्नानकषायवासितैः स्त्रियो निदाघं शमयन्ति<BR> कामिनाम् Ṛs. 1. 4; Ku. 5. 9; R. 15. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोरोगः|शिरोरोग
शिरस् + -रोगः a disease of the head; अथातः शिरोरोगविज्ञानीयमध्यायं<BR> व्याख्यास्यामः Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोवर्तिन्|शिरोवर्त्तिन्
शिरस् + -वर्तिन् <i>a.</i> (शिरोवर्तिन्) being at the head. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR> a chief, any one at the head of affairs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोवल्ली
शिरस् + -वल्ली (शिरोवल्ली) the crest of a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोवृत्तम्
शिरस् + -वृत्तम् (शिरोवृत्तम्) pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरोवेष्टः|शिरोवेष्ट
शिरस् + -वेष्टः, -वेष्टनम् (शिरोवेष्टः, -ष्टनम्) a head-dress,<BR> turban; शिरोवेष्टनव्याजतस्ते मुखेन्दोः Sūkti. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

