शिरस् + -शूलम् head-ache.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरःस्थः|शिरःस्थ
शिरस् + -स्थः<BR>—1 leader, chief.<BR>—2 a plaintiff. ━<i>a.</i> imminent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरःस्थानम्
शिरस् + -स्थानम् main apartment; गतेष्वस्मासु राजा नः शिरःस्थानानि पश्यतु<BR> Pratimā 1. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

