शिरस् + -हारिन् <i>m.</i> ({@शिरोहारिन्@}) an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरसिजः|शिरसिज
