शिरामोक्षः
शिरा + -मोक्षः bleeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिरावृत्तम्
