शिलिन्दः A kind of fish; शिलिन्दः श्लेष्मलो बल्यो विपाके मधुरो<BR> गुरुः Rājavallabha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिली
शिली<BR>—1 The lower timber of a door.<BR>—2 A kind of earth-worm.<BR>—3 The top of a pillar.<BR>—4 A dart.<BR>—5 An arrow<BR>—6 A female frog.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शिलीमुखः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलीमुखः|शिलीमुख
शिली + -मुखः<BR>—1 a bee; मिलितशिलीमुखपाटलिपटलकृतस्मरतूणविलासे Gīt. 1; R. 4. 57.<BR>—2 an arrow; सा कुसुमघटितशिलीमुखमनोहरान्मदनचापादिव प्रमदवनात्<BR> त्रस्यति K. 225; or युगपद्विकाशमुदयाद्गमिते शशिनः शिलीमुखगणोऽलभत<BR> Śi. 9. 41 (in both passages the word is used in senses 1 and 2).<BR>—3 a fool.<BR>—4 war, fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलीभूत
शिलीभूत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Turned to stone.<BR>—2 Become as hard as stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलीन्ध्रः|शिलीन्ध्र|शिलींध्र|शिलीन्ध्रं|शिलींध्रः
शिलीन्ध्रः [शिलीं धरति धृ-क पृषो˚ मुम्]<BR>—1 A kind of fish.<BR>—2 A kind of tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलीन्ध्रम्
शिलीन्ध्रः + .{@-न्ध्रम्@}<BR>—1 A mushroom, fungus,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">Page1554-1</a>]<BR> as in उच्छिलीन्ध्र q. v.; Me. 11.<BR>—2 The flower of the plantain tree; अधिपुरन्ध्रि शिलीन्ध्रसुगन्धिभिः<BR> Śi. 6. 32; or अलिनारमतालिनी शिलीन्ध्रे 72.<BR>—3 Hail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1553-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलीन्ध्रकम्
शिलीन्ध्रकम् A mushroom, fungus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलीन्ध्री
शिलीन्ध्री<BR>—1 Earth, clay.<BR>—2 A small earth-worm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलीपदः|शिलीपद
शिलीपदः Elephantiasis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलूष
शिलूष Aegle Marmelos (बिल्व).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलेय|शिलेयं
शिलेय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Rocky, stony.<BR>—2 Hard as rock or stone; P. V. 3. 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिलेयम्
शिलेय + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 Benzoin.<BR>—2 Bitumen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पम्
शिल्पम् [शिल्-पक् Uṇ. 3. 28]<BR>—1 An art, a fine or mechanical art; (64 such arts are enumerated).<BR>—2 Skill (in any art); craft; शिल्पोपचारयुक्ताश्च निपुणाः पण्ययोषितः<BR> Ms. 9. 259; पात्रविशेषे न्यस्तं गुणान्तरं व्रजति शिल्पमाधातुः M. 1. 6.<BR>—3 Ingenuity, cleverness.<BR>—4 Work, manual work or labour; विसर्गरत्यर्त्यभिजल्पशिल्पाः Bhāg. 5. 11. 10.<BR>—5 A rite, ceremony.<BR>—6 A kind of ladle or spoon used at sacrifices.<BR>—7 Form, shape.<BR>—8 Creation, procreation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शिल्पकर्मन्, शिल्पकारः, शिल्पकारकः, शिल्पकारिका, शिल्पकारिन्, शिल्पगृहम्, शिल्पगेहम्, शिल्पजीविन्, शिल्पविद्या, शिल्पशालम्, शिल्पशाला, शिल्पशास्त्रम्, शिल्पस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पकर्मन्|शिल्पकर्म्मन्
शिल्पम् + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i>, {@-क्रिया@}<BR> any manual labour, handicraft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पकारः|शिल्पकार
शिल्पम् + -कारः, -कारकः, -कारिका, -कारिन् <i>m.</i> an artisan, a mechanic; Kau. A. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पकारकः|शिल्पकारक
शिल्पम् + -कारः, -कारकः, -कारिका, -कारिन् <i>m.</i> an artisan, a mechanic; Kau. A. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पकारिका
शिल्पम् + -कारः, -कारकः, -कारिका, -कारिन् <i>m.</i> an artisan, a mechanic; Kau. A. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पकारिन्
शिल्पम् + -कारः, -कारकः, -कारिका, -कारिन् <i>m.</i> an artisan, a mechanic; Kau. A. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पगृहम्
शिल्पम् + -गृहम्, -गेहम् a workshop, manufactory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पगेहम्
शिल्पम् + -गृहम्, -गेहम् a workshop, manufactory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पजीविन्
शिल्पम् + -जीविन् an artisan, a mechanic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पविद्या
शिल्पम् + -विद्या<BR>—1 mechanical science.<BR>—2 any manual skill, handicraft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पशालम्
शिल्पम् + -शालम्, -शाला a workshop, manufactory (a technical school).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पशाला
शिल्पम् + -शालम्, -शाला a workshop, manufactory (a technical school).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पशास्त्रम्
शिल्पम् + -शास्त्रम्<BR>—1 a book on any art, fine or mechanical.<BR>—2 mechanics.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पस्थानम्
शिल्पम् + -स्थानम् skill in art; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पकम्
शिल्पकम् A kind of drama (exhibiting magical and mystical rites).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पा
शिल्पा A barberʼs shop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पिक
शिल्पिक <i>a.</i> Manual, mechanical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पिकम्
शिल्पिक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Any handicraft or mechanical art.<BR>—2 = शिल्पकम् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिल्पिन्
शिल्पिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Relating to a fine or mechanical art.<BR>—2 Mechanical. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 An artisan, artist, a mechanic; Ms. 10. 120.<BR>—2 One who is skilled in any art.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिव|शिवं|शिवः
शिव <i>a.</i> [श्यति पापं शो-वन् पृषो˚]<BR>—1 Auspicious, propitious, lucky; इयं शिवाया नियतेरिवायतिः Ki. 4. 21, 1. 38;<BR> R. 11. 33.<BR>—2 In good health or condition, happy, prosperous, fortunate; तीर्थेन<BR> मूर्ध्न्यधिकृतेन शिवः शिवोऽभूत् Bhāg. 3. 28. 22; शिवानि वस्तीर्थजलानि<BR> कच्चित् R. 5. 8 (= अनुपप्लवानि, ‘undisturbed’); शिवास्ते पन्थानः<BR> सन्तु ‘a happy journey to you’, ‘God bless (or speed) you on your journey’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवः|शिव|शिवं
शिव + .{@-वः@}<BR>—1 N. of the third god of the sacred Hindu Trinity, who is entrusted with<BR> the work of destruction, as Brahman and Viṣṇu are with the creation<BR> and preservation, of the world; एको देवः केशवो वा शिवो वा Bh. 2. 115.<BR>—2 The male organ of generation, penis.<BR>—3 An auspicious planetary conjunction.<BR>—4 The Veda; अट्टशूलाः जनपदाः शिवशूलाश्चतुष्पथाः Mb. 3. 188. 42.<BR>—5 Final beatitude.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">Page1554-2</a>]<BR>—6 A post to which cattle are tied.<BR>—7 A god, deity.<BR>—8 Quick-silver.<BR>—9 Bdellium.<BR>—10 The black variety of thorn-apple.<BR>—11 Rum, spirit.<BR>—12 Buttermilk.<BR>—13 A ruby. —14 Time (काल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवौ
शिव + .{@-वौ@} (<i>m.</i> dual) Śiva and Pārvatī; कथयति शिवयोः शरीरयोगं<BR> विषमपदा पदवी विवर्तनेषु Ki. 5. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवम्
शिव + .{@-वम्@}<BR>—1 Prosperity, welfare, well-being, happiness; तं धर्मेऽग्निषु पुत्रेषु<BR> शिवं पृष्ट्वा Rām. 7. 33. 13; तव वर्त्मनि वर्ततां शिवम् N. 2. 62;<BR> Ratn. 1. 2; R. 1. 60.<BR>—2 Bliss, auspiciousness.<BR>—3 Final beatitude.<BR>—4 Water.<BR>—5 Seasalt.<BR>—6 Rock-salt.<BR>—7 Refined borax.<BR>—8 Iron.<BR>—9 Myrobalan.<BR>—10 Sandal.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शिवाक्षम्, शिवापर, शिवारातिः, शिवात्मकम्, शिवादेशकः, शिवालयः, शिवेतर, शिवेष्टा, शिवकर, शिवकीर्तनः, शिवकेसरः, शिवगति, शिवघर्मजः, शिवचतुर्दशी, शिवज्ञा, शिवताति, शिवतालः, शिवदत्तम्, शिवदारु, शिवदिश्, शिवदूती, शिवद्रुमः, शिवद्विष्टा, शिवधातुः, शिवपदम्, शिवपुरम्, शिवपुरी, शिवपुराण, शिवप्रियः, शिवबीजम्, शिववीजम्, शिवभारतम्, शिवमल्लकः, शिवमार्गः, शिवरसः, शिवराजधानी, शिवरात्रिः, शिवलिङ्गम्, शिवलोकः, शिववल्लभः, शिववल्ली, शिववाहनः, शिवव्रतिन्, शिवशेखरः, शिवसायुज्यम्, शिवसुन्दरी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवाक्षम्
शिव + -अक्षम् = रुद्राक्ष q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवापर
शिव + -अपर <i>a.</i> cruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवारातिः|शिवाराति
शिव + -अरातिः a heretic (lit. a disbeliever in Śiva).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवात्मकम्
शिव + -आत्मकम् rock-salt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवादेशकः|शिवादेशक
शिव + -आदेशकः<BR>—1 the bearer of auspicious news.<BR>—2 a fortune-teller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवालयः|शिवालय|शिवालयं
शिव + -आलयः<BR>—1 Śivaʼs abode.<BR>—2 the red basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवालयम्
शिव + -आलयः + .({@-यम्@})<BR>—1 a temple of Śiva.<BR>—2 a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवेतर
शिव + -इतर <i>a.</i> inauspicious, unlucky; शिवेतरक्षतये K. P. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवेष्टा
शिव + -इष्टा Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवकर|शिवकरः
शिव + -कर (शिवंकर also) <i>a.</i> conferring happiness, auspicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवकीर्तनः|शिवकीर्तन|शिवकीर्त्तन|शिवकीर्त्तनः
शिव + -कीर्तनः N. of Bhṛṅgi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवकेसरः|शिवकेसर
शिव + -केसरः Mimusops Elengi (बकुल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवगति|शिवगतिः
शिव + -गति <i>a.</i> prosperous, happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवघर्मजः|शिवघर्मज|शिवघर्म्मज|शिवघर्म्मजः
शिव + -घर्मजः the planet Mars; cf. पुरा दक्षविनाशाय कुपितस्य<BR> त्रिशूलिनः । अपतद् भीमवक्त्रस्य स्वेदबिन्दुर्ललाटजः ॥ शान्तिप्रदानात्<BR> सर्वेषां ग्रहाणां प्रथमो भव । अङ्गारक इति ख्यातिं गमिष्यसि धरात्मज ॥ Matsya P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवचतुर्दशी
शिव + -चतुर्दशी the fourteenth day of the dark half of Māgha; see शिवरात्र.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवज्ञा
शिव + -ज्ञा a female devotee of the Śaiva sect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवताति|शिवतातिः
शिव + -ताति <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having an auspicious end, conferring or conducive to happiness, propitious;<BR> प्रयत्नः कृत्स्नोऽयं फलतु शिवतातिश्च भवतु Māl. 6. 7; न्यषेवेतां<BR> विशेषेण शिवतातिममुं शिवम् Śiva B. 23. 56.<BR>—2 tender, merciful, not demoniacal; मा पूतनात्वमुपगाः शिवतातिरेधि 9. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवतातिः|शिवताति
शिव + -ताति + .({@-तिः@}) auspiciousness, happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवतालः|शिवताल
शिव + -तालः (in music) a kind of measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवदत्तम्
शिव + -दत्तम् the discus of Viṣṇu (सुदर्शन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवदारु
शिव + -दारु <i>n.</i> the Devadāru tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवदिश्
शिव + -दिश् the north-east.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

