शिव + -दूती epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवद्रुमः|शिवद्रुम
शिव + -द्रुमः the Bilva tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवद्विष्टा
शिव + -द्विष्टा the Ketaka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवधातुः|शिवधातु
शिव + -धातुः<BR>—1 quicksilver.<BR>—2 milk stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवपदम्
शिव + -पदम् final liberation, emancipation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवपुरम्
शिव + -पुरम्, -पुरी N. of Vārāṇasī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवपुरी
शिव + -पुरम्, -पुरी N. of Vārāṇasī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवपुराण
शिव + -पुराण N. of one of the eighteen Purāṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवप्रियः|शिवप्रिय|शिवप्रियं
शिव + -प्रियः<BR>—1 a crystal.<BR>—2 the Baka tree.<BR>—3 the thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवप्रियम्
शिव + -प्रियः + .({@-यम्@}) = रुद्राक्ष q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवप्रिया
शिव + -प्रियः + .({@-या@}) the goddess Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवबीजम्
शिव + -बीजम्, -वीजम् quick-silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिववीजम्
शिव + -बीजम्, -वीजम् quick-silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवभारतम्
शिव + -भारतम् the historic poem on the life of Shivājī the great<BR> (1630-1680) by his contemporary poet Paramānanda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवमल्लकः|शिवमल्लक
शिव + -मल्लकः the Arjuna tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवमार्गः|शिवमार्ग
शिव + -मार्गः final liberation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवरसः|शिवरस
शिव + -रसः the water of boiled rice (three days old, hence fermented).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवराजधानी
शिव + -राजधानी N. of Benares.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवरात्रिः|शिवरात्रि
शिव + -रात्रिः <i>f.</i> the fourteenth day of the dark half of Māgha on<BR> which a rigorous fast is observed in honour of Śiva; शैवो वा वैष्णवो<BR> वापि यो वा स्यादन्यपूजकः । सर्वं पूजाफलं हन्ति शिवरात्रिबहिर्मुखः ॥<BR> Īśvarasaṃhitā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवलिङ्गम्
शिव + -लिङ्गम्<BR>—1 Śiva worshipped in the form of a Phallus.<BR>—2 a temple dedicated to the worship of the <i>Liṅga</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवलोकः|शिवलोक
शिव + -लोकः the world of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिववल्लभः|शिववल्लभ
शिव + -वल्लभः the mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिववल्लभा
शिव + -वल्लभः + .({@-भा@})<BR>—1 white rose.<BR>—2 Pārvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिववल्ली
शिव + -वल्ली Acacia Concinna (Mar. शिकेकाई).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिववाहनः|शिववाहन
शिव + -वाहनः a bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवव्रतिन्
शिव + -व्रतिन् one engaged in a vow of standing on one foot.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">Page1555-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1554-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवशेखरः|शिवशेखर
शिव + -शेखरः<BR>—1 the moon.<BR>—2 the thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवसायुज्यम्
शिव + -सायुज्यम् final emancipation (<i>lit.</i> unification with Śiva).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवसुन्दरी|शिवसुंदरी
शिव + -सुन्दरी an epithet of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवकः|शिवक
शिवकः<BR>—1 A post to which cows or cattle in general are tied.<BR>—2 A post for cattle to rub against, scratching-post.<BR>—3 An image of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवा
शिवा<BR>—1 N. of Pārvatī.<BR>—2 A jackal (in general); जहासि निद्रामशिवैः शिवारुतैः Ki. 1. 38;<BR> हरेरद्य द्वारे शिव शिव शिवानां कलकलः Bv. 1. 32; R. 7. 50, 11. 61, 12. 39.<BR>—3 A fortunate woman.<BR>—4 Final beatitude.<BR>—5 The Śamī tree.<BR>—6 The yellow myrobalan.<BR>—7 Dūrvā grass.<BR>—8 A kind of yellow pigment.<BR>—9 Turmeric.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शिवारातिः, शिवाप्रियः, शिवाफला, शिवारुतम्, शिवाविद्या<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवारातिः|शिवाराति
शिवा + -अरातिः a dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवाप्रियः|शिवाप्रिय
शिवा + -प्रियः a goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवाफला
शिवा + -फला the Śamī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवारुतम्
शिवा + -रुतम् the howling of a jackal (a bad omen).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवाविद्या
शिवा + -विद्या divination by the cries of jackals; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवाकुः|शिवाकु
शिवाकुः [शिव्-आकुः Uṇ. 3. 79] A sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवानी
शिवानी Pārvatī, wife of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिवालुः|शिवालु
शिवालुः A jackal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिविः|शिवि
शिविः<BR>—1 A beast of prey.<BR>—2 The birch tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिविका
शिविका, शिविर See शिबिका, शिबिर; शिविरं परिखायुक्तमुच्चैः<BR> प्राकारवेष्टितम् Brav. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिविर|शिविरं
शिविका, शिविर See शिबिका, शिबिर; शिविरं परिखायुक्तमुच्चैः<BR> प्राकारवेष्टितम् Brav. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिशयिषा
शिशयिषा (<i>Desid.</i> from शी) Desire to sleep, sleepiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिशिर|शिशिरः
शिशिर <i>a.</i> [शश्-किरच् नि. Uṇ. 1. 52]<BR>—1 Cool, cold, chill, frigid; कुरु यदुनन्दनचन्दनशिशिरतरेण करेण<BR> पयोधरे Gīt. 12; R. 14. 3, 16. 49.<BR>—2 Cooling, removing heat; नवनलिनदलायमानशिशिरतारारुणायतनयनरुचिरः<BR> Bhāg. 5. 5. 31.<BR>—3 Relating or belonging to शिशिर; एवं तेषां ययौ मासो द्वितीयः शिशिरः<BR> सुखम् Rām. 7. 39. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिशिरः|शिशिर
शिशिर + .{@-रः, -रम्@}<BR>—1 Dew, hoar-frost; पद्मानां शिशिराद्भयम्; जातां मन्ये शिशिरमथितां<BR> पद्मिनीं वान्यरूपाम् Me. 85.<BR>—2 The cold season (comprising the two months Māgha and Phālguna); कण्ठेषु<BR> स्खलितं गतेऽपि शिशिरे पुंस्कोकिलानां रुतम् Ś. 6. 3; अमृतं शिशिरे<BR> वह्निः Pt. 1. 128.<BR>—3 Coldness, frigidity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शिशिरांशुः, शिशिरकरः, शिशिरकिरणः, शिशिरदीधितिः, शिशिररश्मिः, शिशिरात्ययः, शिशिरापगमः, शिशिरोपचारः, शिशिरकालः, शिशिरसमयः, शिशिरघ्नः, शिशिरमथित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिशिरम्
शिशिर + .{@-रः, -रम्@}<BR>—1 Dew, hoar-frost; पद्मानां शिशिराद्भयम्; जातां मन्ये शिशिरमथितां<BR> पद्मिनीं वान्यरूपाम् Me. 85.<BR>—2 The cold season (comprising the two months Māgha and Phālguna); कण्ठेषु<BR> स्खलितं गतेऽपि शिशिरे पुंस्कोकिलानां रुतम् Ś. 6. 3; अमृतं शिशिरे<BR> वह्निः Pt. 1. 128.<BR>—3 Coldness, frigidity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शिशिरांशुः, शिशिरकरः, शिशिरकिरणः, शिशिरदीधितिः, शिशिररश्मिः, शिशिरात्ययः, शिशिरापगमः, शिशिरोपचारः, शिशिरकालः, शिशिरसमयः, शिशिरघ्नः, शिशिरमथित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिशिरांशुः|शिशिरांशु
शिशिर + -अंशुः, -करः, -किरणः, -दीधितिः, -रश्मिः the moon; बुध<BR> इव शिशिरांशोः V. 5. 21; शिशिरकिरणकान्तं वासरान्तेऽभिसार्य Śi. 11. 21;<BR> शिशिरदीधितिना रजन्यः Ṛs. 3. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

