शिशुपालः|शिशुपाल
शिशुः + -पालः N. of of a king of the Chedis and son of Damaghoṣa. [According<BR> to the Viṣṇu Purāṇa this monarch was, in a previous existence, the<BR> unrighteous Hiraṇyakaśipu, king of the Asuras who was killed by Viṣṇu<BR> in the form of Narasiṃha. He was next born as the ten-headed Rāvaṇa<BR> who was killed by Rāma. Then he was born as the son of Damaghoṣa, and<BR> continued his enmity to Kṛṣṇa, the eighth incarnation of Viṣṇu,<BR> with even greater implacability; see Śi. 1. He denounced Kṛṣṇa when<BR> they met at the Rājasūya sacrifice of Yudhiṣṭhira, but his head was<BR> cut off by Kṛṣṇa with his discus. His death forms the subject of a<BR> celebrated poem by Māgha.] ˚हन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिशुप्रियः|शिशुप्रिय
शिशुः + -प्रियः treacle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

