शिष्
शिष् I. €1 P. (शेषति) To hurt, kill. ━II. €1 P., €10 U. (शेषति,<BR> शेषयति-ते) To leave as a remainder, spare. ━III. €7 P. (शिनष्टि, शिष्ट)<BR>—1 To leave as a reminder, leave, leave remaining.<BR>—2 To distinguish or discriminate from others. ━<i>Caus.</i> (शेषयति-ते) To leave &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

