शिष्ट|शिष्टः
शिष्ट <i>p. p.</i> [शास्-क्त शिष्-क्त वा]<BR>—1 Left, remaining, residual, rest; यज्ञशिष्टाशिनः सन्तो मुच्यन्ते सर्वकिल्बिषैः Bg. 3. 13.<BR>—2 Ordered, commanded.<BR>—3 Trained, educated, disciplined.<BR>—4 Tamed, docile, tractable.<BR>—5 Wise, learned;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">Page1556-1</a>]<BR> ते शिष्टा ब्राह्मणा ज्ञेयाः श्रुतिप्रत्यक्षहेतवः Ms. 12. 109; समौ<BR> हि शिष्टैराम्नातौ वर्त्स्यन्तावामयः स च Śi. 2. 10; Pt. 1. 234.<BR>—6 Virtuous, respectable.<BR>—7 Civil, polite.<BR>—8 Chief, principal, superior, excellent, distinguished, eminent; शिष्टा<BR> क्रिया कस्यचिदात्मसंस्था M. 1. 16 (v. l. for श्लिष्टा); द्वेष्योऽपि<BR> संमतः शिष्टस्तस्यार्तस्य यथौषधम् R. 1. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्टः|शिष्ट
शिष्ट + .{@-ष्टः@}<BR>—1 An eminent or distinguished person.<BR>—2 A wise man.<BR>—3 A counsellor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्टम्
शिष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@}<BR>—1 Remains, remnant.<BR>—2 Precept, rule.<BR>—3 Instruction.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शिष्टाचारः, शिष्टप्रयोगः, शिष्टविगर्हणम्, शिष्टसभा, शिष्टसंमत<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1555-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्टाचारः|शिष्टाचार
शिष्ट + -आचारः<BR>—1 the practice of wise men.<BR>—2 good manners, good breeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्टप्रयोगः|शिष्टप्रयोग
शिष्ट + -प्रयोगः the practice of the learned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्टविगर्हणम्
शिष्ट + -विगर्हणम् + ({@-णा@})<BR> censure by the learned; यदि शास्त्रकृते देवताव्यापारे<BR> उपक्रम्यापरिसमाप्यमाने शिष्टविगर्हणम्, एवमिहापि भवितुमर्हति Ś. B. on MS. 6. 2. 16;<BR> शिष्टविगर्हणा च दोषः <i>ibid.</i> 6. 2. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्टविगर्हणा
शिष्ट + -विगर्हणम् + ({@-णा@})<BR> censure by the learned; यदि शास्त्रकृते देवताव्यापारे<BR> उपक्रम्यापरिसमाप्यमाने शिष्टविगर्हणम्, एवमिहापि भवितुमर्हति Ś. B. on MS. 6. 2. 16;<BR> शिष्टविगर्हणा च दोषः <i>ibid.</i> 6. 2. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्टसभा
शिष्ट + -सभा an assembly of chief or learned men, a council of state;<BR> ˚आचारः tradition of eminent persons; also शिष्टागमः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्टसंमत|शिष्टसम्मत
शिष्ट + -संमत <i>a.</i> approved by the learned; ब्राह्मादिषु विवाहेषु<BR> चतुर्ष्वेवानुपूर्वशः । ब्रह्मवर्चस्विनः पुत्रा जायन्ते शिष्टसंमताः ॥ Ms. 3. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्टिः|शिष्टि
शिष्टिः <i>f.</i> [शास्-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Rule, government.<BR>—2 Order, command.<BR>—3 Chastisement, punishment;<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शिष्ट्यर्थम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्ट्यर्थम्
शिष्टिः + -अर्थम् <i>ind.</i> for instruction; अन्यत्र पुत्राच्छिष्याद्वा शिष्टयर्थं<BR> ताडयेत्तु तौ Ms. 4. 164; शिष्टयर्थ विहितो दण्डः Mb. 12. 135. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्यः|शिष्य
शिष्यः [शास्-क्यप्]<BR>—1 A pupil, disciple, scholar; शिष्यस्तेऽहं शाधि मां त्वां प्रपन्नम् Bg. 2. 7.<BR>—2 Anger, passion.<BR>—3 Violence, force.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शिष्यपरंपरा, शिष्यपुत्रः, शिष्यशिष्टिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्यपरंपरा|शिष्यपरम्परा
शिष्यः + -परंपरा a succession of pupils.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्यपुत्रः|शिष्यपुत्र
शिष्यः + -पुत्रः a pupil regarded as a son.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्यशिष्टिः|शिष्यशिष्टि
शिष्यः + -शिष्टिः <i>f.</i> the correction of a pupil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्यकः|शिष्यक
शिष्यकः A pupil, scholar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्यत्वम्
शिष्यत्वम्, शिष्यता<BR>—1 Pupilage.<BR>—2 Instruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिष्यता
शिष्यत्वम्, शिष्यता<BR>—1 Pupilage.<BR>—2 Instruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिह्लः|शिह्ल
शिह्लः, शिह्लकः Benzoin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शिह्लकः|शिह्लक
शिह्लः, शिह्लकः Benzoin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शी
शी €2 Ā. (शेते, शयित; <i>pass.</i> शय्यते; <i>desid.</i><BR> शिशयिषते)<BR>—1 To lie, lie down, recline, rest; इतश्च शरणार्थिनः शिखरिणां गणाः<BR> शेरते Bh. 2. 76.<BR>—2 To sleep (fig. also); किं निःशङ्कं शेषे शेषे वयसः समागतो मृत्युः ।<BR> अथवा सुखं शयीथा निकटे जागर्ति जाह्नवी जननी Bv. 4. 30; Bh. 3. 79; Ku. 5. 12.<BR>—3 To rest, repose. ━<i>Caus.</i> (शाययति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to sleep or lie down; पार्श्वे शायय रावणम् Bk. 8. 83.<BR>—2 To allow to rest or repose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शी
शी<BR>—1 Sleep, repose.<BR>—2 Tranquillity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीक्
शीक् I. €1 Ā. (शीकते)<BR>—1 To wet, sprinkle; शिशीके शोणितं व्योम Bk. 14. 76.<BR>—2 To go or move gently. ━II. €1 P., €10 U. (शीकति, शीकयति-ते)<BR>—1 To be angry.<BR>—2 To moisten, wet.<BR>—3 To be patient.<BR>—4 To speak.<BR>—5 To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीकरः|शीकर|शीकरं
शीकरः [शीक्-अरन्]<BR>—1 Spray, thin rain, drizzle, mist; (सीकर is seen used for शीकर);<BR> भागिरथीनिर्झरसीकराणां Ku. 1. 15, 2. 42; R. 5. 42; आचचाम स<BR> तुषारशीकरो भिन्नपल्लवपुरो वनानिलः 9. 68; Ki. 5. 15.<BR>—2 A drop of water or rain; गतमुपरि घनानां वारिगर्भोदराणां पिशुनयति रथस्ते<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">Page1556-2</a>]<BR> शीकरक्लिन्ननेमिः Ś. 7. 7; R. 16. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीकरम्
शीकरः + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 The <i>Saralā</i> tree.<BR>—2 The resin of this tree.<BR>—3 Wind.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शीकरकणः, शीकरवर्षिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीकरकणः|शीकरकण
शीकरः + -कणः a drop of rain or water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीकरवर्षिन्
शीकरः + -वर्षिन् <i>a.</i> drizzling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीकरिन्
शीकरिन् <i>a.</i> Sprinkling, drizzling, pouring forth a spray of water;<BR> सेकः शीकरिणा करेण विहितः U. 3. 16; Māl. 9. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्र|शीघ्रं
शीघ्र <i>a.</i> Quick, rapid, speedy; व्रिभ्रन्मणिं मण्डलचारशीघ्रः<BR> V. 5. 2; शीघ्रकृत्यम् ‘urgent business’; Pt. 3. 170.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रम्
शीघ्र + .{@-घ्रम्@} Conjunction or parallax (in astr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रम्
शीघ्र + .{@-घ्रम्@} <i>ind.</i> Quickly, swiftly, rapidly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रा
शीघ्र + .{@-घ्रा@} Croton polyandrum (दन्ती).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शीघ्रोच्चः, शीघ्रकर्मन्, शीघ्रकारिन्, शीघ्रकेन्द्रम्, शीघ्रकोपिन्, शीघ्रचेतनः, शीघ्रचेतना, शीघ्रपरिधिः, शीघ्रपुष्पः, शीघ्रफलम्, शीघ्रबुद्धि, शीघ्रलङ्घन, शीघ्रवेधिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रोच्चः|शीघ्रोच्च
शीघ्र + -उच्चः conjunction (in astr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रकर्मन्
शीघ्र + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> the calculation of the conjunction of a planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रकारिन्
शीघ्र + -कारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 expeditious, quick.<BR>—2 acute (as a disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रकेन्द्रम्
शीघ्र + -केन्द्रम् the distance from the conjunction (of a planet).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रकोपिन्
शीघ्र + -कोपिन् <i>a.</i> choleric, irascible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रचेतनः|शीघ्रचेतन
शीघ्र + -चेतनः a dog (being sagacious); बह्वाशी स्वल्पसंतुष्टः सुनिद्रः<BR> शीघ्रचेतनः Cāṇakyanīti.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रचेतना
शीघ्र + -चेतना <i>f.</i> N. of the medicinal herb (अतिबला).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रपरिधिः|शीघ्रपरिधि
शीघ्र + -परिधिः <i>m.</i> the epicycle of the conjunction of a planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रपुष्पः|शीघ्रपुष्प
शीघ्र + -पुष्पः Agati Grandiflora (अगस्ति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रफलम्
शीघ्र + -फलम् the equation of the conjunction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रबुद्धि
शीघ्र + -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> acute, sharp-witted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रलङ्घन
शीघ्र + -लङ्घन <i>a.</i> going rapidly, swift of foot; Ghaṭ. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रवेधिन्
शीघ्र + -वेधिन् <i>m.</i> a good archer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रायते
शीघ्रायते Den. Ā.<BR>—1 To become quick or rapid.<BR>—2 To hasten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रिन्
शीघ्रिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Speedy, expeditious.<BR>—2 Making haste in pronunciation, pronouncing very rapidly; Śik. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रिय|शीघ्रियः
शीघ्रिय <i>a.</i> Quick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रियः|शीघ्रिय
शीघ्रिय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 Of Śiva.<BR>—3 The fighting of cats.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्रीय|शीघ्रीयं
शीघ्रीय <i>a.</i> Quick, swift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीघ्र्यम्
शीघ्र्यम् Quickness, rapidity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीत्
शीत् <i>ind.</i> A sound made to express a sudden thrill of pleasure<BR> or pain (particularly applied to the sound of pleasure during sexual enjoyment).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शीत्कारः, शीत्कृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीत्कारः|शीत्कार
शीत् + -कारः, -कृत् <i>m.</i> the above sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीत्कृत्
शीत् + -कारः, -कृत् <i>m.</i> the above sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीत|शीतं|शीतः
शीत <i>a.</i> [श्यै-क्त]<BR>—1 Cool, cold, frigid; तव कुसुमशरत्वं शीतरश्मित्वमिन्दोः Ś. 3. 2.<BR>—2 Dull, sluggish, apathetic, sleepy.<BR>—3 Dull, lazy, stupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीतः|शीत|शीतं
शीत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 A kind of reed.<BR>—2 The Nimba tree.<BR>—3 The cold season (<i>n.</i> also).<BR>—4 Camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1556-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शीतम्
