शुद्धात्मन्
शुद्ध + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> pure-minded, honest. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 the pure spirit.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धाभ
शुद्ध + -आभ <i>a.</i> consisting of pure light; प्रशान्तमिव शुद्धाभं<BR> सत्त्वं तदुपधारयेत् Ms. 12. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

