शुद्ध + -ओदनः (शुद्धोदनः) N. of the father of the celebrated<BR> Buddha. ˚सुतः N. of the celebrated Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धकर्मन्
शुद्ध + -कर्मन् <i>a.</i> pure in deeds, holy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धकोटिः|शुद्धकोटि
शुद्ध + -कोटिः <i>f.</i> one of the sides of a right-angled triangle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धचैतन्यम्
शुद्ध + -चैतन्यम् pure intelligence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

