शुद्धभाव
शुद्ध + -धी, -भाव, -मति <i>a.</i> pure-minded, guileless, honest. नेरिः<BR> a kind of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धमति|शुद्धमतिः
शुद्ध + -धी, -भाव, -मति <i>a.</i> pure-minded, guileless, honest. नेरिः<BR> a kind of dance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धपक्षः|शुद्धपक्ष
शुद्ध + -पक्षः the light half of a month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धबटुकः|शुद्धबटुक
शुद्ध + -बटुकः (in music) a kind of drummer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धबोध
शुद्ध + -बोध <i>a.</i> (in Vedānta) possessed of pure intelligence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धभाव
शुद्ध + -भाव <i>a.</i> pure-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धवधः|शुद्धवध
शुद्ध + -वधः killing in a simple or ordinary way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुद्धवंश्य
शुद्ध + -वंश्य <i>a.</i> born of a pure family; संततिः शुद्धवंश्या हि<BR> परत्रेह च शर्मणे R. 1. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

