शुन्
शुन् €6 P. (शुनति) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुनः|शुन
शुनः A dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुनःशेपः|शुनःशेप
शुनःशेपः(फः) N. of a Vedic sage, son of Ajīgarta. [In<BR> the Aitareya Brāhmaṇa it is related that king Hariśchandra, being childless,<BR> made a vow that on obtaining a son he would sacrifice him to the god Varuṇa.<BR> A son was born who was named Rohita, but the king put off the fulfilment<BR> of the vow under various pretexts. At last Rohita purchased for one hundred<BR> cows Śunahśepa, the middle son of Ajīgarta as a substitute for himself to be<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-2" target="_blank">Page1561-2</a>]<BR> offered to Varuṇa. But the boy praised Viṣṇu, Indra, and other deities,<BR> and escaped death. He was then adopted by Viśvāmitra in his own family<BR> and called by the name Devarāta.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुनःशेफः|शुनःशेफ
शुनःशेपः(फः) N. of a Vedic sage, son of Ajīgarta. [In<BR> the Aitareya Brāhmaṇa it is related that king Hariśchandra, being childless,<BR> made a vow that on obtaining a son he would sacrifice him to the god Varuṇa.<BR> A son was born who was named Rohita, but the king put off the fulfilment<BR> of the vow under various pretexts. At last Rohita purchased for one hundred<BR> cows Śunahśepa, the middle son of Ajīgarta as a substitute for himself to be<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-2" target="_blank">Page1561-2</a>]<BR> offered to Varuṇa. But the boy praised Viṣṇu, Indra, and other deities,<BR> and escaped death. He was then adopted by Viśvāmitra in his own family<BR> and called by the name Devarāta.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुनकः|शुनक
शुनकः<BR>—1 N. of a sage, descendant of Bhṛgu.<BR>—2 A dog.<BR>—3 A young dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1561-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शुनाशीरः|शुनाशीर
