शुष्क|शुष्कः
शुष्क <i>p. p.</i> [शुष्-क्त]<BR>—1 Dry, dried up; शाखायां शुष्कं करिष्यामि Mk. 8.<BR>—2 Parched up, sear.<BR>—3 Shrivelled, shrunk up, emaciated.<BR>—4 Feigned, pretended, mock; कामिनः स्म कुरुते करभोरूर्हारि शुष्करुदितं<BR> च सुखेऽपि Śi. 10. 69.<BR>—5 Empty, vain, useless, unproductive; M. 2.<BR>—6 Groundless, causeless.<BR>—7 Offensive, harsh; तस्मै नाकुशलं ब्रूयान्न शुष्कां गिरमीरयेत् Ms. 11. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1563-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

