शूद्रः + -भूयिष्ठ <i>a.</i> consisting mostly of Śūdras; यद्राष्ट्रं शूद्रभूयिष्ठम्<BR> (विनश्यति) Ms. 8. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1563-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रयाजकः|शूद्रयाजक
शूद्रः + -याजकः one who conducts a sacrifice for a Śūdra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1563-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रराज्यम्
शूद्रः + -राज्यम् a country of which a Śūdra is a king; न शूद्रराज्ये<BR> निवसेत् Ms. 4. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1563-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रवर्गः|शूद्रवर्ग
शूद्रः + -वर्गः the Śūdra or servile class.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1563-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रवृत्तिः|शूद्रवृत्ति
शूद्रः + -वृत्तिः the occupation of a Śūdra; वैश्योऽजीवन् स्वधर्मेण<BR> शूद्रवृत्यापि वर्तयेत् Ms. 10. 98.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">Page1564-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1563-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रशासनम्
शूद्रः + -शासनम्<BR>—1 dominion of a Śūdra.<BR>—2 a written bond of a Śūdra; L. D. B.<BR>—3 an edict addressed to Śūdras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रसंस्पर्शः|शूद्रसंस्पर्श
शूद्रः + -संस्पर्शः the touch of a Śūdra; अस्वर्ग्या ह्याहुतिः सा स्याच्छूद्रसंस्पर्शदूषिता Ms. 5. 104.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रसेवनम्
शूद्रः + -सेवनम् serving a Śūdra, being the servant of a Śūdra; Ms. 11. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रा
शूद्रा A woman of the Śūdra tribe.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शूद्राभार्यः, शूद्रावेदनम्, शूद्रावेदिन्, शूद्रासुतः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्राभार्यः|शूद्राभार्य|शूद्राभार्य्य|शूद्राभार्य्यः
शूद्रा + -भार्यः one who has a Śūdra woman for his wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रावेदनम्
शूद्रा + -वेदनम् marrying a Śūdra woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रावेदिन्
शूद्रा + -वेदिन् <i>a.</i> marrying a Śūdra woman; शूद्रावेदी पतति Ms. 3. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रासुतः|शूद्रासुत
शूद्रा + -सुतः the son of a Śūdra woman (the father being of any caste);<BR> Ms. 9. 151, 153.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्राणी
शूद्राणी, शूद्री The wife of a Śūdra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्री
शूद्राणी, शूद्री The wife of a Śūdra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूद्रकः|शूद्रक
शूद्रकः N. of a king, the reputed author of the Mṛcchakaṭika.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून|शूनः
शून <i>p. p.</i> [श्वि-क्त]<BR>—1 Swollen.<BR>—2 Increased, grown, prospered.<BR>—3 Morbidly swollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूना
शूना [श्वि-अधिकरणे -क्त संप्र˚ दीर्घ Tv.]<BR>—1 The soft palate, uvula.<BR>—2 A slaughter house in general.<BR>—3 Anything (such as a piece of household furniture), whereby life is<BR> likely to be destroyed; (these are five:− a fireplace, a grind-stone, a<BR> broom, a mortar, and a waterpot; पञ्च शूना गृहस्थस्य चुल्ली पेषण्युपस्करः ।<BR> कण्डनी चोदकुम्भश्च वध्यते यास्तु वाहयन् Ms. 3. 68.). See सूना.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्य|शून्यं|शून्यः
शून्य <i>a.</i> [शूनायै प्राणिवधाय हितं रहस्यस्थानत्वात् यत् Tv.]<BR>—1 Empty, void.<BR>—2 Vacant (applied also to the heart, glances &c.), absent, listless;<BR> गमनमलसं शून्या दृष्टिः Māl. 1. 17; see शून्यहृदय below.<BR>—3 Non-existent.<BR>—4 Lonely, desolate, secluded, deserted; शून्येषु शूरा न के K. P. 7; Bk. 6. 9;<BR> शून्यं मन्ये जगदविरतज्वालमन्तर्ज्वलामि U. 3. 38; Māl. 9. 20.<BR>—5 Dejected, downcast, dispirited; शून्या जगाम भवनाभिमुखी कथंचित्<BR> Ku. 3. 75; Ki. 17. 39.<BR>—6 Utterly devoid or deprived of, without, wanting in (with instr. or<BR> in comp.); अङ्गुलीयकशून्या मे अङ्गुलिः Ś. 5; दया˚, ज्ञान˚, &c.<BR>—7 Indifferent.<BR>—8 Guileless.<BR>—9 Nonsensical, unmeaning; मुहुरविशदवर्णां निद्रया शून्यशून्याम् Śi. 11. 4.<BR>—10 Bare, naked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यम्
शून्य + .{@-न्यम्@}<BR>—1 A vacuum, void, blank.<BR>—2 The sky, space, atmosphere.<BR>—3 A cipher, dot.<BR>—4 Non-entity, (absolute) non-existence; दूषणशून्यबिन्दवः N. 1. 21.<BR>—5 N. of Brahman.<BR>—6 An earring; शून्यकर्णः Amaru.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शून्याशून्यम्, शून्यपदवी, शून्यपालः, शून्यमध्यः, शून्यमनस्, शून्यमनस्क, शून्यमुख, शून्यवदन, शून्यवादः, शून्यवादिन्, शून्यव्यापार, शून्यहृदय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्याशून्यम्
शून्य + -अशून्यम् emancipation of the spirit even during a personʼs life<BR> (जीवन्मुक्ति).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यपदवी
शून्य + -पदवी the passage of the soul (ब्रह्मरन्ध्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यपालः|शून्यपाल
शून्य + -पालः a substitute; त्वां हि मत्स्यो महीपालः शून्यपालमिहाकरोत्<BR> Mb. 4. 35. 11 (com. राज्ञोऽसन्निधाने पालकम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यमध्यः|शून्यमध्य
शून्य + -मध्यः a hollow reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यमनस्
शून्य + -मनस्, -मनस्क <i>a.</i> absent-minded, listless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यमनस्क
शून्य + -मनस्, -मनस्क <i>a.</i> absent-minded, listless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यमुख
शून्य + -मुख, -वदन <i>a.</i> with a blank face, with a downcast countenance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यवदन
शून्य + -मुख, -वदन <i>a.</i> with a blank face, with a downcast countenance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यवादः|शून्यवाद
शून्य + -वादः the doctrine of the non-existence of anything, the doctrine<BR> of a Buddhist sect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यवादिन्
शून्य + -वादिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an atheist.<BR>—2 a Buddhist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यव्यापार
शून्य + -व्यापार <i>a.</i> unoccupied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यहृदय
शून्य + -हृदय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 absent-minded; V. 2; कस्मिन्नपि पूजार्हेऽपराद्धा शून्यहृदया शकुन्तला Ś. 4.<BR>—2 open-hearted, unsuspecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्यमय
शून्यमय <i>a.</i> Fruitless, ineffective; इमाः शून्यमया वाचः शुष्यमाणेन<BR> भाषिताः Rām. 3. 55. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शून्या
शून्या<BR>—1 A hollow reed.<BR>—2 A barren woman.<BR>—3 The prickly pear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्
शूर् I. €4 Ā. To hurt, injure, kill; शुशूरेऽरिशिरः शरैः Śi. 19. 108.<BR>━II. €10 U. (शूरयति-ते)<BR>—1 To act the hero, be powerful.<BR>—2 To make vigorous extertions; see शुर् also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर|शूरः
शूर <i>a.</i> [शूर्-अच्] Brave, heroic, valiant, mighty; शून्येषु<BR> शूरा न के K. P. 7; स्वाध्यायशूरैर्मुखैः Pañc. 1. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूरः|शूर
शूर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A hero, warrior, valiant man.<BR>—2 A lion.<BR>—3 A boar.<BR>—4 The sun.<BR>—5 The Śāla tree.<BR>—6 N. of a Yādava, the grandfather of Kṛṣṇa; (hence the descendants<BR> of Śūra i. e. Yādavas also; cf. शूरः स्याद् यादवे भटे Med.;<BR> ख्यातानि कर्माणि च यानि शौरेः शूरादयस्तेष्वबला बभूवुः Bu. C. 1. 51).<BR>—7 The Arka plant.<BR>—8 The Chitraka tree.<BR>—9 A dog.<BR>—10 A cock.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शूरकीटः, शूरमानम्, शूरमानिन्, शूरवादः, शूरवादिन्, शूरसेनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूरकीटः|शूरकीट
शूर + -कीटः a contemptible warrior; लीयन्ते यत्र शत्रुप्रपतनविवशाः<BR> कोटिशः शूरकीटाः Mv. 6. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूरमानम्
शूर + -मानम् arrogance, vaunting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूरमानिन्
शूर + -मानिन् <i>m.</i> a boaster, braggart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूरवादः
शूर + -वादः the Buddhist doctrine of non-existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूरवादिन्
शूर + -वादिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 a Buddhist.<BR>—2 an atheist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूरसेनः|शूरसेन
शूर + -सेनः <i>m.</i> pl. N. of the country about Mathurā or the inhabitants<BR> of that country; सा शूरसेनाधिपतिं सुषेणम् (उद्दिश्य) R. 6. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूरणः|शूरण
शूरणः [शूर्-ल्यु] A kind of esculent root (Mar. सुरण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूरंमन्य|शूरम्मन्य
शूरंमन्य <i>a.</i> One who fancies himself to be a hero.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्प्
शूर्प् €10 U. (शूर्पयति-ते) To measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पः|शूर्प|शूर्पं|शूर्प्प
शूर्पः, -र्पम् (शॄ-पः ऊश्च नित् Uṇ. 3. 26)<BR> A winnowing-basket; Ms. 5. 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पम्
शूर्पः, -र्पम् (शॄ-पः ऊश्च नित् Uṇ. 3. 26)<BR> A winnowing-basket; Ms. 5. 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पः|शूर्प|शूर्पं|शूर्प्प
शूर्पः, -र्पम् + .{@-र्पः@} A measure of two Droṇas.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शूर्पकर्णः, शूर्पखारी, शूर्पणखा, शूर्पवातः, शूर्पश्रुतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पकर्णः|शूर्पकर्ण|शूर्प्पकर्ण
शूर्पः + -कर्णः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पखारी
शूर्पः + -खारी a kind of measure (= 16 द्रोणs).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पणखा|शूर्प्पणखा
शूर्पः + -णखा (for नखा) ‘having finger-nails like winnowing-baskets’,<BR> N. of a sister of Rāvaṇa. [She was attracted by the beauty of Rāma<BR> and solicited him to marry her. But he said that as he had already got<BR> a wife she had better go to Lakṣmaṇa and try him. But he too rejected<BR> her, and back she came to Rāma. This circumstance excited Sītāʼs laughter,<BR> and the revengeful demoness, feeling herself grossly insulted, assumed<BR> a hideous form and threatened to eat her up. But Lakṣmaṇa cut off her<BR> ears and nose, and thus doubly deformed her; see R. 12. 32-40.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पवातः|शूर्पवात|शूर्प्पवात
शूर्पः + -वातः wind produced by shaking a winnowing-basket.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पश्रुतिः|शूर्पश्रुति|शूर्प्पश्रुति
शूर्पः + -श्रुतिः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पकः|शूर्पक|शूर्प्पक
शूर्पकः N. of a demon, enemy of Cupid.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शूर्पकारातिः, शूर्पकारिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पकारातिः|शूर्पकाराति|शूर्प्पकाराति
शूर्पकः + -अरातिः, -अरिः Cupid; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पकारिः|शूर्पकारि
शूर्पकः + -अरातिः, -अरिः Cupid; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1564-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शूर्पी
