शृङ्गम् + -कन्दः, -कन्दकः Trapa Bispinosa (Mar. शिंगाडा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1565-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्गकन्दकः
शृङ्गम् + -कन्दः, -कन्दकः Trapa Bispinosa (Mar. शिंगाडा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1565-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्गग्राहिका
शृङ्गम् + -ग्राहिका<BR>—1 direct manner.<BR>—2 (in logic) taking singly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1565-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्गजः|शृङ्गज|शृंगज|शृङ्गजं
शृङ्गम् + -जः an arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1565-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

