शृङ्गम् + -प्रहारिन् <i>a.</i> butting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1565-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्गप्रियः|शृङ्गप्रिय|शृंगप्रिय
शृङ्गम् + -प्रियः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1565-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्गमोहिन्|शृंगमोहिन्
शृङ्गम् + -मोहिन् <i>m.</i> the Champaka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1565-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्गवेरम्
शृङ्गम् + -वेरम्<BR>—1 N. of a town on the Ganges near the modern Mirzāpura; आससाद महाबाहुः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1566-1" target="_blank">Page1566-1</a>]<BR> शृङ्गवेरपुरं प्रति Rām. 2. 50. 26; U. 1. 21 (v. l.).<BR>—2 ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1565-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

