शृङ्गम् + -वेरकम् ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्गकः|शृङ्गक|शृंगक|शृंगकं|शृंगकः
शृङ्गकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A horn.<BR>—2 A horn of the moon.<BR>—3 Any pointed thing.<BR>—4 A syringe; Ratn. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शृङ्गकम्
शृङ्गकः, -कम्<BR>—1 A horn.<BR>—2 A horn of the moon.<BR>—3 Any pointed thing.<BR>—4 A syringe; Ratn. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

