शृङ्गाटः|शृङ्गाट|शृंगाट|शृङ्गाटं|शृंगाटः
शृङ्गाटः<BR>—1 N. of a mountain.<BR>—2 N. of a plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1566-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

