शैलभित्तिः|शैलभित्ति
शैल + -भित्तिः <i>f.</i> an instrument for cutting stones, a stone-cutterʼs chisel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1568-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैलरन्ध्रम्
शैल + -रन्ध्रम् a cave, cavern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1568-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैलशिविरम्
शैल + -शिविरम् the ocean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1568-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैलसंभूतम्
