शैलसार
शैल + -सार <i>a.</i> as strong as a mountain, firm as a rock; चिरनियमकृशोऽपि<BR> शैलसारः Ki. 10. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1568-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

