शैव|शैवं|शैवः
शैव <i>a.</i> (-वी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शिवो देवताऽस्य अण्] Relating to the god Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1568-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैवः|शैव|शैवं
शैव + .{@-वः@}<BR>—1 N. of one of the three principal Hindu sects.<BR>—2 A member of the Śaiva sect.<BR>—3 The thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1568-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैवम्
शैव + .{@-वम्@} N. of one of the eighteen Purāṇas, of a Śāstra or Tantra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1568-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शैवलः|शैवल|शैवलं
