शो
शो €4 P. (श्यति, शात or शित, <i>pass.</i> शायते; <i>Caus.</i><BR> शाययति; <i>desid.</i> शिशासति)<BR>—1 To sharpen, whet.<BR>—2 To make thin, attenuate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

