शोणः|शोण|शोणं
शोण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 Crimson, the red colour; उरुक्रमस्याधरशोणशोणिमा Bhāg. 1. 11. 2.<BR>—2 Fire.<BR>—3 A kind of red sugar-cane.<BR>—4 A bay horse; शोण इति वर्णवचनोऽश्वजातिगतं वर्णं वदति नान्यम्<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 8. 41.<BR>—5 N. of a male river, rising in Gonḍavana and falling into the Ganges<BR> near Pāṭaliputra q. v.; प्रत्यग्रहीत् पार्थिववाहिनीं तां भागीरथीं<BR> शोण इवोत्तरङ्गः R. 7. 36.<BR>—6 The planet Mars; cf. लोहित.<BR>—7 A ruby; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

