शोधः|शोध
शोधः [शुध्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Purification.<BR>—2 Correction, rectification.<BR>—3 Acquittance, paying off (as of debts).<BR>—4 Retaliation, requital.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोधक|शोधकः
शोधक <i>a.</i> (-का or -धिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शुध्-णिच् ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Purificatory.<BR>—2 Purgative.<BR>—3 Corrective.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोधकः|शोधक
शोधक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A purifier.<BR>—2 (In arith. and alg.) The subtrahend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोधकम्
शोधक + .{@-कम्@} A kind of earth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोधन|शोधनं|शोधनः
शोधन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शुध्-णिच्-ल्यु ल्युट् वा] Purifying, cleansing &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोधनम्
शोधन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Purifying, cleansing.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Cleansing or washing of a wound.<BR>—2 Correction, clearing away errors; (शपथं) करोतु परिषन्मध्ये<BR> शोधनार्थं ममैव च Rām. 7. 95. 6.<BR>—3 Exact determination.<BR>—4 Payment, discharge, acquittance.<BR>—5 Expiation, atonement; अज्ञानभुक्तं तूत्तार्यं शोध्यं वाप्याशु शोधनैः Ms. 11. 160.<BR>—6 Refining of metals.<BR>—7 Retaliation, requital, punishment.<BR>—8 Subtraction (in math.).<BR>—9 Green vitriol.<BR>—10 Feces, ordure.<BR>—11 Removal, eradication; कण्टकानां च शोधनम् Ms. 1. 115.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोधनः|शोधन|शोधनं
शोधन + .{@-नः@} The lime.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोधनकः|शोधनक
शोधनकः An officer in a criminal court; Mk. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोधनी
शोधनी A broom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोधित|शोधितं
शोधित <i>p. p.</i> [शुध्-णिच्-क्त]<BR>—1 Purified, cleansed.<BR>—2 Refined.<BR>—3 Filtered.<BR>—4 Corrected, rectified.<BR>—5 Paid off, discharged.<BR>—6 Requited, retaliated.<BR>—7 Acquitted, absolved, exculpated; अथ मूलमनाहार्यं प्रकाशक्रयशोधितः Ms. 8. 202.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोध्य|शोध्यः
