शोध्यः|शोध्य
शोध्य + .{@-ध्यः@} An accused person, one who has to clear himself of the charge<BR> brought against him.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1569-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोफः|शोफ
