शोफघ्नी
शोफः + -घ्नी a पुनर्नवा with red flowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोफजित्
शोफः + -जित्, -हृत् <i>m.</i> the marking-nut plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोफहृत्
शोफः + -जित्, -हृत् <i>m.</i> the marking-nut plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभन|शोभनं|शोभनः
शोभन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शोभते शुभ्-ल्यु]<BR>—1 Shining, splendid; Mb. 4. 42. 12 (com. सुफलः शोभनभल्लिकः).<BR>—2 Handsome, beautiful, lovely.<BR>—3 Good, auspicious, fortunate.<BR>—4 Richly decorated.<BR>—5 Moral, virtuous.<BR>—6 Correct, right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभनः|शोभन|शोभनं
शोभन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 A planet.<BR>—3 A burnt offering for the production of happy results.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभना
शोभन + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 Turmeric.<BR>—2 A beautiful or virtuous woman; तदिदं परिरक्ष शोभने भवितव्यप्रियसंगमं<BR> वपुः Ku. 4. 44.<BR>—3 A sort of yellow pigment (= गोरोचना q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभनम्
शोभन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Beauty, lustre, brilliance.<BR>—2 A lotus.<BR>—3 An ornament.<BR>—4 Virtue.<BR>—5 Tin.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शोभनाचरितम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभनाचरितम्
शोभन + -आचरितम् virtuous practice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभनकः|शोभनक
शोभनकः The Sobhāñjana tree (Mar. शेवगा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभनिकः|शोभनिक
शोभनिकः A kind of actor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभनीय
शोभनीय <i>a.</i> Handsome, lovely; भट्टिनि, सर्वशोभनीयं सुरूपं<BR> नाम Pratimā 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभा
शोभा [शुभ्-अ]<BR>—1 Light, lustre, brilliance, radiance.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Splendour, beauty, elegance, grace, loveliness; वपुरभिनवमस्याः<BR> पुष्यति स्वां न शोभाम् Ś. 1. 19; Me. 54, 61 (v. l.).<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Natural beauty, grandeur (as of a mountain); अद्रिशोभा R. 2. 27.<BR>—3 An ornament, graceful expression; शोभैव मन्दरक्षुब्धक्षुभिताम्भोधिवर्णना Śi. 2. 107.<BR>—4 Turmeric.<BR>—5 A kind of pigment (= गोरोचना q. v.).<BR>—6 Distinguished merit.<BR>—7 Colour, hue.<BR>—8 Wish, desire.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शोभाञ्जनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभाञ्जनः|शोभाञ्जन|शोभांजन
शोभा + -अञ्जनः N. of a very useful tree (Mar. शेवगा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभित
शोभित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Adorned, graced, decorated.<BR>—2 Beautiful, lovely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोभिन्
शोभिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shining, becoming; धृतं त्वया वार्धकशोभि वल्कलम् Ku. 5. 44; R. 8. 12.<BR>—2 Beautiful, lovely, handsome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोली
शोली Yellow turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोषः|शोष
शोषः [शुष्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Drying up, dryness; ह्रदशोषविक्लवाम् Ku. 4. 39; so आस्यशोषः,<BR> कण्ठशोषः &c.<BR>—2 Emaciation, withering up; शरीरशोषः, कुसुमशोषः &c.; पुनः<BR> शोषं गमिष्यामि निरम्बुर्निरवग्रहः Mb. 3. 7. 5.<BR>—3 Pulmonary consumption or consumption in general; संशोषणाद् रसादीनां<BR> शोष इत्यभिधीयते Suśr.; शोषोत्सर्गे कर्मभिर्देहमोक्षे सरस्वत्यः<BR> श्रेयसे संप्रवृत्ताः Mb. 13. 76. 12.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शोषसंभवम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोषसंभवम्
शोषः + -संभवम् the root of long pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोषण|शोषणं|शोषणः
शोषण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शुष्-ल्यु ल्युट् वा]<BR>—1 Drying up, desiccating.<BR>—2 Causing to wither up, emaciating; पत्राणामिव शोषणेन मरुता स्पृष्टा<BR> लता माधवी Ś. 3. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोषणः|शोषण|शोषणं
शोषण + .{@-णः@} N. of one of the arrows of Cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोषणम्
शोषण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Drying up, desiccation.<BR>—2 Suction, sucking up, absorption.<BR>—3 Exhaustion.<BR>—4 Emaciation, withering up.<BR>—5 Dry ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोषयित्नुः
शोषयित्नुः [शुष्-इत्नुच् Uṇ. 3. 29] The sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोषित|शोषितः
शोषित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Dried up; शोषितसरसि निदाघे नितरामेवोद्धतः सिन्धुः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 Emaciated, withered up.<BR>—3 Exhausted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोषिन्
शोषिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Drying up, withering, emaciating; हृदयकुसुमशोषी<BR> दारुणो दीर्घशोकः U. 3. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शोषिणी
शोषिणी Ether.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौकम्
शौकम्<BR>—1 A flock of parrots.<BR>—2 A kind of coitus.<BR>—3 Sorrowfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्त|शौक्तं
शौक्त^1 <i>a.</i> (-क्ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> Acid, acetic.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260429. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/187.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्तिक
शौक्तिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Relating to a pearl.<BR>—2 Acid, acetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्तिकेयम्
शौक्तिकेयम्, -शौक्तेयम्<BR> A pearl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्तेयम्
शौक्तिकेयम्, -शौक्तेयम्<BR> A pearl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्र
शौक्र <i>a.</i> (-क्री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शुक्र-अण्]<BR>—1 Seminal.<BR>—2 Relating to the planet Śukra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्ल
शौक्ल <i>a.</i> Relating to what is pure, clean, or undefiled; किं<BR> जन्मभिस्त्रिभिर्वेह शौक्लसावित्रयाज्ञिकैः Bhāg. 4. 31. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्लिकेयः|शौक्लिकेय
शौक्लिकेयः A sort of poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौक्ल्यम्
शौक्ल्यम् Whiteness, clearness; शौक्ल्यं गताः कुन्तलाः Sūkti. 5. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौङ्गेयः|शौङ्गेय
शौङ्गेयः<BR>—1 N. of Garuḍa.<BR>—2 A falcon, hawk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचम्
शौचम् [शुचेर्भावः अण्]<BR>—1 Purity, clearness; काके शौचं द्यूतकारे च सत्यम् Pt. 1. 147.<BR>—2 Purification from personal defilement caused by voiding excrement,<BR> but particularly by the death of a relative; अपि यत्र त्वया राम कृतं<BR> शौचं पुरा पितुः । तत्राहमपि हत्वा त्वां शौचं कर्ताऽस्मि भार्गव ॥<BR> Mb. 5. 178. 60.<BR>—3 Cleansing, purifying.<BR>—4 Voiding of excrement.<BR>—5 Uprightness, honesty.<BR>—6 Water (of libation); पुनीहि पादरजसा गृहान्नो गृहमेधिनाम् । यच्छौचेनानुतृप्यन्ति<BR> पितरः साग्नयः सुराः ॥ Bhāg. 10. 41. 13.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शौचाचारः, शौचकर्मन्, शौचकूपः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचाचारः|शौचाचार
शौचम् + -आचारः, -कर्मन् <i>n.</i>, {@-कल्पः@} a purificatory rite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचकर्मन्
शौचम् + -आचारः, -कर्मन् <i>n.</i>, {@-कल्पः@} a purificatory rite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचकूपः|शौचकूप
शौचम् + -कूपः A privy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचिकः|शौचिक
शौचिकः<BR>—1 A cleanser.<BR>—2 N. of a mixed tribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौचेयः|शौचेय
शौचेयः A washerman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौट्
शौट् €1 P. (शौटति) To be proud or haughty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौटीर|शौटीरः
शौटीर <i>a.</i> [शौटेः ईरन् Uṇ. 4. 31]<BR>—1 Liberal, munificent.<BR>—2 Proud, haughty, proud of (in comp.); शौटीरशूरसदृशमनीकजनसंसदि<BR> Mb. 5. 162. 31; विक्रमशौटीरः 3. 252. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौटीरः|शौटीर
शौटीर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 A hero, champion.<BR>—2 A proud man.<BR>—3 An ascetic, one who has given up worldly pursuits; Mb. 12. 83. 44 (com.<BR> शौटीरः प्रगल्भः).<BR>—4 An upstart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौटीरम्
शौटीर + .{@-रम्@} manliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौटीर्यम्
शौटीर्यम्<BR>—1 Pride, arrogance, haughtiness; अद्य चारित्रशौटीर्यं त्वां प्राप्य<BR> विनिवर्तितम् Rām. 2. 73. 23; Mb. 1. 2. 236.<BR>—2 Prowess, heroism; एतच्छौटीर्ययुक्तं ते मच्छन्दवशवर्तिनः Rām. 3. 42. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौड्
शौड् €1 P. (शौडति) See शौट्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1570-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्ड|शौंड|शौण्डः
शौण्ड <i>a.</i> (-ण्डी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शुण्डायां सुरायाम् अभिरतः अण्]<BR>—1 Addicted to drinking, fond of liquor.<BR>—2 Excited, intoxicated, drunk &c. (fig.); अनिकृतिनिपुणं ते चेष्टितं<BR> मानशौण्ड Ve. 5. 21 ‘drunk with pride or very proud’.<BR>—3 Skilled in (with loc. or in comp.); अक्षशौण्ड, दानशौण्ड &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डि
शौण्डि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Skilled in; शरासनं संयुगशौण्डिराददे Bhāg. 1. 16. 11.<BR>—2 Fond of, devoted to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डिकः|शौण्डिक|शौंडिक|शौंडिकः
शौण्डिकः, शौण्डिन् <i>m.</i> [शुण्डा सुरा पण्यमस्य ठक् इनि<BR> वा] A distiller and seller of spirituous liquors, a vintner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डिन्|शौंडिन्
शौण्डिकः, शौण्डिन् <i>m.</i> [शुण्डा सुरा पण्यमस्य ठक् इनि<BR> वा] A distiller and seller of spirituous liquors, a vintner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डिकी
शौण्डिकः, शौण्डिन् + .{@-की, -नी@} A female vintner; पयोऽपि शौण्डिकीहस्ते वारुणीत्यभिधीयते H. 3. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शौण्डिकागारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डिनी
शौण्डिकः, शौण्डिन् + .{@-की, -नी@} A female vintner; पयोऽपि शौण्डिकीहस्ते वारुणीत्यभिधीयते H. 3. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शौण्डिकागारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डिकागारः|शौण्डिकागार
शौण्डिकः + -आगारः a liquor-shop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डिकेयः|शौण्डिकेय|शौंडिकेय|शौंडिकेयः
शौण्डिकेयः A demon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डी
शौण्डी Long pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डिर
शौण्डिर, शौण्डीर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Proud, haughty.<BR>—2 Elevated, raised up.<BR>—3 Capable, competent (ससर्थ); यथा ह्येवमशौण्डीरं शौण्डीरः क्षत्रियर्षभः<BR> Rām. 2. 23. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डीर|शौंडीर|शौण्डीरः
शौण्डिर, शौण्डीर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Proud, haughty.<BR>—2 Elevated, raised up.<BR>—3 Capable, competent (ससर्थ); यथा ह्येवमशौण्डीरं शौण्डीरः क्षत्रियर्षभः<BR> Rām. 2. 23. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डिरम्
शौण्डिर, शौण्डीर + .{@-रम्@} Haughtiness, pride; आसन्नशौण्डीरमपेतसाध्वसम् Bhāg. 3. 18. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौण्डीर्यम्
शौण्डीर्यम्<BR>—1 Heroism; शौण्डीर्यं धृतिविनयं दयां स्वपक्षे Pañc. 2. 54.<BR>—2 Pride, haughtiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौद्धोदनिः|शौद्धोदनि
शौद्धोदनिः An epithet of Buddha, son of शुद्धोदन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौद्र|शौद्रः
शौद्र <i>a.</i> (-द्री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [शूद्र-अण्] Relating to a Śūdra or his tribe;<BR> शौद्राणि कर्माणि च ब्राह्मणः सन् Mb. 12. 62. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौद्रः|शौद्र
शौद्र + .{@-द्रः@} The son of a man of any of the first three castes by a Śūdra<BR> woman; see Ms. 9. 160.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौनम्
शौनम् Meat kept at a slaughter-house; निमज्जतश्च मत्स्यादाञ्शौनं<BR> वल्लूरमेव च Ms. 5. 13. ━<i>a.</i> Relating or belonging to a dog; जानेऽहं<BR> धर्मतोऽऽत्मानं शौनीमुत्सृज जाघनीम् Mb. 12. 141: 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौनकः|शौनक
शौनकः N. of a great sage, the reputed author of the Ṛgveda Prātiśākhya<BR> and various other Vedic compositions.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौनिकः|शौनिक
शौनिकः [शूना प्राणिवधस्थानं प्रयोजनमस्य ठक्]<BR>—1 A butcher; छद्मना परिददामि मृत्यवे शौनिको गृहशकुन्तिकामिव U. 1. 45.<BR>—2 A bird catcher, hunter.<BR>—3 Hunting, chase.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौभः|शौभ|शौभं
शौभः<BR>—1 God, divinity.<BR>—2 The betel-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौभम्
शौभः + .{@-भम्@} The city of Hariśchandra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौभाञ्जनः|शौभाञ्जन|शौभांजन|शौभांजनः
शौभाञ्जनः N. of a tree; see शोभाञ्जन.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौभिकः|शौभिक
शौभिकः<BR>—1 A juggler, conjurer.<BR>—2 A hunter, fowler; इति चिन्तयतो हृदये पिकस्य समधायि शौभिकेन<BR> शरः Bv. 1. 114.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौरसेनी
शौरसेनी N. of a Prākṛta dialect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौरिः|शौरि
शौरिः<BR>—1 N. of Viṣṇu or Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—2 Of Balarāma.<BR>—3 Of Vasudeva; स संस्कृत्य नरश्रेष्ठं मातुलं शौरिमात्मनः Mb. 1. 2. 58;<BR> Bhāg. 3. 1. 27.<BR>—4 The planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौर्प|शौर्पः|शौर्प्प
शौर्प <i>a.</i> (-र्पी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Measured by or belonging to a शूर्प or winnowing<BR> basket; P. V. 1. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौर्यम्
शौर्यम् [शूरस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Prowess, heroism, valour; शौर्ये वैरिणि वज्रमाशु निपतत्वर्थोऽस्तु<BR> नः केवलम् Bh. 2. 39; नये च शौर्ये च वसन्ति संपदः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 Strength, power, might.<BR>—3 Representation of war and supernatural events on the stage; cf. आरभटी.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: शौर्यकरणम्, शौर्यकर्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौर्यकरणम्
शौर्यम् + -करणम् prowess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौर्यकर्मन्
शौर्यम् + -कर्मन् heroic deed; शौर्यकर्मापदेशैश्च कुर्युस्तेषां समागमम् Ms. 9. 268.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौलः|शौल
शौलः A particular part of a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौल्कः|शौल्क|शौल्कं
शौल्कः, शौल्किकः [शुल्के तदादानेऽधिकृतः अण् ठक् वा] A<BR> superintendent of tolls, custom-officer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौल्किकः|शौल्किक
शौल्कः, शौल्किकः [शुल्के तदादानेऽधिकृतः अण् ठक् वा] A<BR> superintendent of tolls, custom-officer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौल्फम्
शौल्फम् Anethum Sowa (Mar. शोपा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौल्विकः|शौल्विक
शौल्वि(ल्बि)कः A coppersmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौल्बिकः|शौल्बिक
शौल्वि(ल्बि)कः A coppersmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौव|शौवं
शौव <i>a.</i> (-वी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [श्वन्-अण् टिलोपः] Relating to dogs, canine; अथातः<BR> शौव उद्गीथः Ch. Up. 1. 12. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौवम्
शौव + .{@-वम्@}<BR>—1 A pack of dogs.<BR>—2 The state or nature of a dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौवन|शौवनं
शौवन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Canine.<BR>—2 Having the qualities of a dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौवनम्
शौवन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 The nature of a dog.<BR>—2 The progeny of a dog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौव|शौवं
शौव <i>a.</i> Relating to the morrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौवस्तिक|शौवस्तिकं
शौवस्तिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [श्वस्-ठक् तुट् च] Belonging to or lasting till<BR> tomorrow, ephemeral; P. IV. 3. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौवापद|शौवापदं
शौवापद <i>a.</i> (-दी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [श्वापद-अण्]<BR>—1 Relating to a wild beast; A. Rām.<BR>—2 Savage, fierce, wild.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौष्कलः|शौष्कल
शौष्कलः<BR>—1 A vendor of flesh.<BR>—2 A habitual eater of flesh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

शौष्कलम्
शौष्कलः + .{@-लम्@} The price of dried meat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्चुत्
श्चुत् See शच्युत् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्च्युत्
श्च्युत् €1 P. [श्च्योतति]<BR>—1 To trickle, ooze, flow, exude; एतास्ता मधुनो धाराः श्च्योतन्ति सविषास्त्वयि<BR> U. 3. 34; Śi. 8. 63; Ki. 5. 29.<BR>—2 To shed, pour out, diffuse, scatter. ━<i>With</i> {@नि@} to flow, ooze, trickle;<BR> निश्च्योन्तते सुतनु कबरीबिन्दवो यावदेते Māl. 8. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्चोतः|श्चोत
श्चो(श्च्यो)तः, श्चो(श्च्यो)तनम् Oozing, flowing,<BR> exuding; भिन्नेन्दुनिष्यन्दमानामृतश्च्योत … Māl. 5. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्च्योतः|श्च्योत
श्चो(श्च्यो)तः, श्चो(श्च्यो)तनम् Oozing, flowing,<BR> exuding; भिन्नेन्दुनिष्यन्दमानामृतश्च्योत … Māl. 5. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्चोतनम्
श्चो(श्च्यो)तः, श्चो(श्च्यो)तनम् Oozing, flowing,<BR> exuding; भिन्नेन्दुनिष्यन्दमानामृतश्च्योत … Māl. 5. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्च्योतनम्
श्चो(श्च्यो)तः, श्चो(श्च्यो)तनम् Oozing, flowing,<BR> exuding; भिन्नेन्दुनिष्यन्दमानामृतश्च्योत … Māl. 5. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्नम्
श्नम् A technical term used by Pāṇini for न, the sign of the<BR> 7th class of roots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्ना
श्ना A technical term used by Pāṇini for ना, the sign of the<BR> 9th class of roots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्नु
श्नु A technical term used by Pāṇini for नु, the sign of the<BR> 5th class of roots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मन्
श्मन् <i>n.</i><BR>—1 The mouth, face.<BR>—2 The body.<BR>—3 A dead body (<i>m.</i> also in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानम्
श्मशानम् [श्मानः शवाः शेरतेऽत्र शी-आनच् डिच्च Tv.]<BR>—1 A cemetery, a burial or burning ground; राजद्वारे श्मशाने च यस्तिष्ठति<BR> स बान्धवः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 An oblation to deceased ancestors.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: श्मशानाग्निः, श्मशानालयः, श्मशानगोचर, श्मशाननिवासिन्, श्मशानवर्तिन्, श्मशानवासिन्, श्मशानभाज्, श्मशानवासिन्, श्मशानवाटः, श्मशानवेश्मन्, श्मशानवैराग्यम्, श्मशानशूलः, श्मशानशूलम्, श्मशानसाधनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानाग्निः|श्मशानाग्नि
श्मशानम् + -अग्निः the fire of a burning ground.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानालयः|श्मशानालय
श्मशानम् + -आलयः a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानगोचर
श्मशानम् + -गोचर <i>a.</i> frequenting<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">Page1572-1</a>]<BR> burning grounds; श्मशानगोचरं सूते बाह्यानामपि गर्हितम् Ms. 10. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1571-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशाननिवासिन्
श्मशानम् + -निवासिन्, -वर्तिन्, -वासिन् <i>m.</i> a ghost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानवर्तिन्
श्मशानम् + -निवासिन्, -वर्तिन्, -वासिन् <i>m.</i> a ghost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानवासिन्
श्मशानम् + -निवासिन्, -वर्तिन्, -वासिन् <i>m.</i> a ghost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानभाज्
श्मशानम् + -भाज्, -वासिन् <i>m.</i> epithets of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानवासिन्
श्मशानम् + -भाज्, -वासिन् <i>m.</i> epithets of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानवाटः|श्मशानवाट
श्मशानम् + -वाटः an enclosure of the cemetery; Kau. A. 2. 4; Māl. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानवेश्मन्
श्मशानम् + -वेश्मन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 a spirit, ghost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानवैराग्यम्
श्मशानम् + -वैराग्यम् temporary despondency, momentary renunciation of the<BR> world as at the sight of a cemetery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानशूलः|श्मशानशूल
श्मशानम् + -शूलः, -शूलम् an impaling stake in a cemetery; श्मशानशूलस्य<BR> न यूपसत्क्रिया Ku. 5. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानशूलम्
श्मशानम् + -शूलः, -शूलम् an impaling stake in a cemetery; श्मशानशूलस्य<BR> न यूपसत्क्रिया Ku. 5. 73.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मशानसाधनम्
श्मशानम् + -साधनम् performance of magical rites in a cemetery to acquire<BR> control over ghosts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मश्रु
श्मश्रु <i>n.</i> [श्म मुखं श्रूयते लक्ष्यतेऽनेन श्रु-ङु; Uṇ. 5. 28]<BR> The beard, moustache; हिरण्यश्मश्रुर्हिरण्यकेशः Ch. Up. 1. 6. 6;<BR> ज्योतिष्कणाहतश्मश्रु कण्ठनालादपातयत् R. 15. 52.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: श्मश्रुकरः, श्मश्रुकर्मन्, श्मश्रुधर, श्मश्रुप्रवृद्धिः, श्मश्रुमुखी, श्मश्रुवर्धकः, श्मश्रुशेखरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मश्रुकरः|श्मश्रुकर
श्मश्रु + -करः a barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मश्रुकर्मन्
श्मश्रु + -कर्मन् shaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मश्रुधर
श्मश्रु + -धर bearded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मश्रुप्रवृद्धिः|श्मश्रुप्रवृद्धि
श्मश्रु + -प्रवृद्धिः <i>f.</i> the growth of a beard; R. 13. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मश्रुमुखी
श्मश्रु + -मुखी a woman with a beard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मश्रुवर्धकः|श्मश्रुवर्धक
श्मश्रु + -वर्धकः a barber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मश्रुशेखरः|श्मश्रुशेखर
श्मश्रु + -शेखरः the cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मश्रुल
श्मश्रुल <i>a.</i> [श्मश्रु विद्यतेऽस्य लच्] Having a beard, bearded;<BR> भल्लापवर्जितैस्तेषां शिरोभिः श्मश्रुलैर्महीं (तस्तार) R. 4. 63; Ms. 11. 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मील्
श्मील् €1 P. (श्मीलति) To wink, contract the eyelids, twinkle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मीलनम्
श्मीलनम् Winking, twinkling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्मीलितम्
श्मीलितम् A wink, blink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यान|श्यानः
श्यान <i>p. p.</i> [श्यै-क्त]<BR>—1 Gone.<BR>—2 Coagulated, congealed.<BR>—3 Thick, sticky, viscous.<BR>—4 Shrunk, dry; slim; शनैः श्यानीभूताः सितजलधरच्छेदपुलिनैः (सरितः)<BR> Mu. 3. 7 (v. l.); शरदि सरितः श्यानपुलिनाः Bh. 2. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यानम्
श्यान + .{@-नम्@} Smoke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्याम|श्यामः
श्याम <i>a.</i> [श्यै-मक Uṇ. 1. 134] Black, dark-blue, dark coloured;<BR> प्रत्याख्यातविशेषकं कुरबकं श्यामावदातारुणम् M. 3. 5; श्यामं<BR> द्वयोर्भागयोः V. 2. 7; कुवलयदलश्यामस्निग्धः U. 4. 19; Me. 15, 23.<BR>—2 Brown.<BR>—3 Shady, dusky.<BR>—4 Darkgreen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामः|श्याम
श्याम + .{@-मः@}<BR>—1 The black colour.<BR>—2 The green colour.<BR>—3 A cloud.<BR>—4 The cuckoo.<BR>—5 N. of a sacred fig-tree at Allahabad on the bank of the Yamunā; अयं<BR> च कालिन्दीतटे वटः श्यामो नाम U. 1; सोयं वटः श्याम इति प्रतीतः R. 13. 53.<BR>—6 The thorn-apple.<BR>—7 The Tamāla tree; दृश्यन्ते बन्धुजीवाश्च श्यामाश्च गिरिसानुषु Rām. 4. 30. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामम्
श्याम + .{@-मम्@}<BR>—1 Sea-salt.<BR>—2 Black pepper.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: श्यामाङ्ग, श्यामानन, श्यामकण्ठः, श्यामकर्णः, श्यामकाण्डा, श्यामग्रन्थिः, श्यामपत्रः, श्यामभास्, श्यामरुचि, श्यामवल्ली, श्यामशबलौ, श्यामसुन्दरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

