श्यामकण्ठः|श्यामकण्ठ|श्यामकंठ
श्याम + -कण्ठः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva (नीलकण्ठ).<BR>—2 a peacock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामकर्णः|श्यामकर्ण
श्याम + -कर्णः a horse suitable for a horse-sacrifice (अश्वमेध).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामकाण्डा
श्याम + -काण्डा, -ग्रन्थिः a kind of Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामग्रन्थिः|श्यामग्रन्थि
श्याम + -काण्डा, -ग्रन्थिः a kind of Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामपत्रः|श्यामपत्र
श्याम + -पत्रः the <i>tamāla</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

