श्याम + -भास्, -रुचि <i>a.</i> glossy-black.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामरुचि
श्याम + -भास्, -रुचि <i>a.</i> glossy-black.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

