श्याम + -वल्ली black pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामशबलौ
श्याम + -शबलौ the two four-eyed watch-dogs of Yama; cf. (श्वानौ)<BR> चतुरक्षौ शबलौ साधुना पथा Rv. 10. 14. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

