श्यामकः|श्यामक|श्यामकं
श्यामकः<BR>—1 A kind of edible grain (कङ्गु).<BR>—2 A gramineous plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामकम्
श्यामकः + .{@-कम्@} A kind of grass; cf. श्यामाक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामल|श्यामलः
श्यामल <i>a.</i> Black, dark-blue, blackish; दशरथतनयं श्यामलं<BR> शान्तमूर्तिम् Rāmarakṣā 26; निशितश्यामलस्निग्धमुखी शक्तिः Ve. 4;<BR> Śi. 18. 36; श्यामलानोकहश्रीः U. 2. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामलः|श्यामल
श्यामल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 Black colour.<BR>—2 Black pepper.<BR>—3 A large bee. —4 The sacred fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामला
श्यामल + .{@-ला@} N. of Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामलिका
श्यामलिका The indigo plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामलिमन्
श्यामलिमन् <i>m.</i> Blackness, darkness; श्यामां श्यामलिमानमानयत<BR> भोः सान्द्रैर्मषीकूर्चकैः Vb. 3. 1; तदीयधूमैरिव धूसराङ्गाः क्षोणीभुजः<BR> श्यामलिमानमापुः Vikr. 10. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामा
श्यामा<BR>—1 Night, particularly a dark night; श्यामां श्यामलिमनमानयत भोः<BR> सान्द्रैर्मषीकूर्चकैः Vb. 3. 1.<BR>—2 Shade, shadow.<BR>—3 A dark woman.<BR>—4 A kind of woman (यौवनमध्यस्था according to Malli. on N. 3. 8;<BR> Śi. 8. 36; Me. 84; or शीते सुखोष्णसर्वाङ्गी ग्रीष्मे या सुखशीतला । तप्तकाञ्चनवर्णाभा<BR> सा स्त्री श्यामेति कथ्यते according to one commentator on Bk. 5. 18 and 8. 100).<BR>—5 A woman who has borne no children.<BR>—6 A cow.<BR>—7 Turmeric.<BR>—8 The female cuckoo.<BR>—9 The Priyaṅgu creeper; कृत्वा श्यामाविटपसदृशं स्रस्तमुक्तं द्वितीयम्<BR> M. 2. 7; Me. 106.<BR>—10 The indigo plant.<BR>—11 The holy basil.<BR>—12 The seed of the lotus.<BR>—13 N. of the Yamunā.<BR>—14 N. of several plants.<BR>—15 A name or form of Durgā (worshipped by the Tāntrikas).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: श्यामाचरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामाचरः|श्यामाचर
श्यामा + -चरः a demon, Rākṣasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामाकः|श्यामाक
श्यामाकः A kind of grain or corn; (न) श्यामाकमुष्टिपरिवर्धितको<BR> जहाति Ś. 4. 13 (also श्यामक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामायते
श्यामायते Den. Ā. To become black, to prove impure (as gold &c.);<BR> श्यामायते न युष्मासु यः काञ्चनमिवाग्निषु M. 2. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामिका
श्यामिका<BR>—1 Blackness, darkness; अपाङ्गयोः केवलमस्य दीर्घयोः शनैः शनैः श्यामिकया<BR> कृतं पदम् Ku. 5. 21.<BR>—2 Impurity, alloy, (of metals &c.); हेम्नः संलक्ष्यते ह्यग्नौ विशुद्धिः<BR> श्यामिकापि वा R. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यामित
श्यामित <i>a.</i> Blackened, darkened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यालः|श्याल
श्यालः [श्यै-कालन्] A wifeʼs brother, brother-in-law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्यालकः|श्यालक
श्यालकः<BR>—1 A wifeʼs brother.<BR>—2 A wretched brother-in-law.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1572-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

