श्रवणपथः|श्रवणपथ
श्रवणः + -पथः, -विषयः the reach or range of the ear; वृत्तान्तेन श्रवणविषयप्रापिणा R. 14. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1574-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रवणविषयः|श्रवणविषय
श्रवणः + -पथः, -विषयः the reach or range of the ear; वृत्तान्तेन श्रवणविषयप्रापिणा R. 14. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1574-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रवणपरुष
श्रवणः + -परुष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 hard to be listened to.<BR>—2 hard to the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1574-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रवणपालिः|श्रवणपालि
श्रवणः + -पालिः, -पाली <i>f.</i> the tip of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1574-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रवणपाली
श्रवणः + -पालिः, -पाली <i>f.</i> the tip of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1574-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रवणपाशः|श्रवणपाश
श्रवणः + -पाशः a beautiful ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1574-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रवणपुटकः|श्रवणपुटक
श्रवणः + -पुटकः the auditory passage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1574-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रवणपूरकः|श्रवणपूरक
श्रवणः + -पूरकः an ear-ring or any such ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1574-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

