श्रवाप्यः, -य्यः<BR> [श्रु-आय्यः Uṇ. 3. 96] An animal fit for sacrifice.<BR>━<i>a.</i> fit to be celebrated, praised.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1574-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

