श्रव्य|श्रव्यः
श्रव्य <i>a.</i> Worth-hearing, praiseworthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1574-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रा
