श्रेणिबद्ध
श्रेणिः + -बद्ध, -बन्ध <i>a.</i> forming a row, being in a line; श्रेणीबन्धाद्वितन्वद्भिरस्तम्भां<BR> तोरणस्रजम् R. 1. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1577-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेणिबन्ध
श्रेणिः + -बद्ध, -बन्ध <i>a.</i> forming a row, being in a line; श्रेणीबन्धाद्वितन्वद्भिरस्तम्भां<BR> तोरणस्रजम् R. 1. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1577-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेणिकः|श्रेणिक
श्रेणिकः A front-tooth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1577-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्रेणिका
