श्रेणी
श्रेणी<BR>—1 A succession of distinct things.<BR>—2 (In math.) Progression.<BR>—3 Sequence.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: श्रेणीफलम्, श्रेणीव्यवहारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1578-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

