श्रेष्ठ + -अम्लम् the fruit of the tamarind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1578-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

