श्रेष्ठ + -काष्ठः + .({@-ष्ठम्@}) the main pillar of a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1578-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

