श्वासहिक्का
श्वासः + -हिक्का a kind of hiccough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वासहेतिः|श्वासहेति
