श्वासिन्
श्वासिन् <i>a.</i> [श्वासयति श्वस्-णिच् णिनि]<BR>—1 Breathing.<BR>—2 Asthmatic.<BR>—3 Aspirated (as a sound or letter). ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 Air, wind.<BR>—2 A breathing animal, living being.<BR>—3 One who pronounces (letters) with a hissing sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वस्
श्वस् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Tomorrow; श्वःकार्यमद्य कुर्वीत पूर्वाह्णे चापराह्णिकम् । नहि प्रतीक्षते<BR> मृत्युः कृतमस्य न वा कृतम् ॥ Subhāṣ.; वरमद्य कपोतो न श्वो<BR> मयूरः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 Future (at the beginning of comp.); पृथूदके जप्यपरो नैनं श्वोमरणं<BR> तपेत् Mb. 9. 39. 34.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-2" target="_blank">Page1581-2</a>]<BR>—3 A particle implying auspiciousness.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: श्वःप्रभृति, श्वोभूत, श्वोवसीय, श्वोवसीयस्, श्वःश्रेयस<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

