श्वस् + -प्रभृति <i>ind.</i> from tomorrow onwards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वोभूत
श्वस् + -भूत <i>a.</i> (श्वोभूत) being tomorrow; यौवराज्येऽभिषेक्ष्यामि<BR> श्वोभूते रघुनन्दनम् A. Rām. 2. 2. 7; श्वोभूते स्वपुरं यातः Bhāg. 9. 20. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

