श्वस् + -श्रेयस + .({@-सम्@})<BR>—1 happiness, prosperity.<BR>—2 an epithet of Brahman or the Supreme Spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वस्तन|श्वस्तनं
श्वस्तन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>), श्वस्त्य <i>a.</i><BR> Relating to the morrow, future.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

