श्वस्तन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>), श्वस्त्य <i>a.</i><BR> Relating to the morrow, future.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वस्तनम्
श्वस्तन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>), श्वस्त्य <i>a.</i> + .{@-नम्@} The future.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

श्वि
श्वि €1 P. (श्वयति, शिश्वाय-शुशाव, अश्वत्-अश्वयीत्-अशिश्वियत्, श्वयिष्यति,<BR> श्वयितुम्, शून) —1 To grow, increase (fig. also), to swell (as the eye);<BR> रुदतोऽशिश्वियच्चक्षुरास्यं हेतोस्तवाश्वयीत् Bk. 6. 19, 31, 14. 79, 15. 30.<BR>—2 To thrive, prosper.<BR>—3 To go, approach, move towards. ━<i>With</i> {@उद्@}<BR>—1 to swell, increase, grow; प्रबलरुदितोच्छूननेत्रम् (मुखम्) Me. 86.<BR>—2 to be proud, be puffed up with pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1581-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

