श्वैत्रम्, श्वैत्र्यम् White leprosy; वस्त्रापहारकः श्वैत्र्यम् Ms. 11. 51.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1582-a1" target="_blank">Page1582-a1</a>]<BR> (Many roots which begin with स् are written in the Dhātupāṭha. with<BR> ष् to show that the स् is changed to ष् after certain prepositions.<BR> Such roots will be found under स in their proper places.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1582-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

