ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Best, excellent.<BR>—2 Wise, learned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1582-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षः|ष
ष + .{@-षः@}<BR>—1 Loss, destruction.<BR>—2 End.<BR>—3 Rest, remainder.<BR>—4 Final emancipation.<BR>—5 Loss of knowledge.<BR>—6 Heaven.<BR>—7 Sleep.<BR>—8 A learned man.<BR>—9 A teat or nipple.<BR>—10 Hair.<BR>—11 Delivery (गर्भविमोचन).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1582-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षडः|षड
षडः<BR>—1 A kind of drink.<BR>—2 Splitting, rending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1582-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षण्डः|षण्ड|षंड|षंडः
षण्डः<BR>—1 A bull.<BR>—2 A bull set at liberty; a breeding bull; नीलषण्डप्रमोक्षेण अमावास्यां<BR> तिलोदकैः Mb. 13. 125. 73.<BR>—3 A eunuch; (14 or 20 classes of eunuchs are mentioned by different writers);<BR> कुब्जवामनषण्डकाः Kau. A. 1. 12.<BR>—4 A group, multitude; collection, heap, quantity (<i>n.</i> also in this<BR> sense); तस्मिन् स्व आश्रमे व्यासो बदरीषण्डमण्डिते Bhāg. 1. 7. 3;<BR> कलरवमुपगीते षट्पदौघेन<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1583-1" target="_blank">Page1583-1</a>]<BR> धत्तः कुमुदकमलषण्डे तुल्यरूपामवस्थाम् Śi. 11. 15; cf. खण्ड also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1582-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

