षष् + -अभिज्ञः (षडभिज्ञः) a Buddhist deified saint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1583-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षडशीत
षष् + -अशीत (षडशीत) eighty-sixth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1583-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षडशीतिः|षडशीति
षष् + -अशीतिः <i>f.</i> (षडशीतिः)<BR>—1 eighty-six.<BR>—2 N. of the four passages of the sun from one zodiacal sign to the other; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1583-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षडष्टकम्
षष् + -अष्टकम् (in astr.) a particular Yoga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1583-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षडहः|षडह
षष् + -अहः (षडहः) a period of six days.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1583-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षडाननः|षडानन
