षोडशन्
षोडशन् <i>num. a.</i> (pl.) Sixteen.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: षोडशांशुः, षोडशाङ्ग, षोडशाङ्गुलक, षोडशाङ्घ्रिः, षोडशार्चिस्, षोडशावर्तः, षोडशोपचारः,^1 षोडशकलाः, षोडशभुजा, षोडशमातृका<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

