षोडशाङ्गुलक|षोडशांगुलक
षोडशन् + -अङ्गुलक <i>a.</i> having the breadth of 16 fingers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

