षोडशिक
षोडश(शि)क <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> Consisting of sixteen parts, sixteenfold; षोडशिको<BR> देवतोपचारः; षोडशकस्तु विकारः Sāṅ. K. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोडशिन्
षोडशिन् <i>m.</i> A modification of the Agniṣṭoma sacrifice.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: षोडशिग्रहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोडशिग्रहः|षोडशिग्रह
षोडशिन् + -ग्रहः a libation made at the above sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोढा
षोढा <i>ind.</i> In six ways.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: षोढान्यासः, षोढामुखः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोढान्यासः|षोढान्यास
षोढा + -न्यासः the six ways of touching the body with mystical texts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोढामुखः|षोढामुख
षोढा + -मुखः ‘six-faced’, N. of Kārtikeya; द्रोढा जनोर्जनितषोढामुखः<BR> समिति वोढा स हाटकगिरेः Aśvad. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

षोदत्
षोदत् <i>m.</i> A young ox with six teeth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ट्युमः|ष्ट्युम
ष्ट्युमः<BR>—1 The moon.<BR>—2 Light.<BR>—3 Water.<BR>—4 Thread.<BR>—5 Auspiciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठिव्
ष्ठिव् €1. €4 P. (ष्ठीवति, ष्ठीव्यति, ष्ठपूत)<BR>—1 To spit, eject saliva from the mouth.<BR>—2 To sputter; Bk. 12. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठीवनम्
ष्ठीवनम्, ष्ठेवनम्<BR>—1 Spitting out; Bhāg. 5. 5. 30.<BR>—2 Saliva, spittle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठेवनम्
ष्ठीवनम्, ष्ठेवनम्<BR>—1 Spitting out; Bhāg. 5. 5. 30.<BR>—2 Saliva, spittle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्ठ्यूत
ष्ठ्यूत <i>p. p.</i> Spit, ejected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्वक्क्
ष्वक्क्^1, ष्वस्क्-ष्क् €1 Ā. (ष्वक्क्ते, ष्वस्क-ष्कते) To go, move.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170209. note: it's a verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्वस्क्
ष्वक्क्^1, ष्वस्क्-ष्क् €1 Ā. (ष्वक्क्ते, ष्वस्क-ष्कते) To go, move.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170209. note: it's a verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ष्वष्क्
ष्वक्क्^1, ष्वस्क्-ष्क् €1 Ā. (ष्वक्क्ते, ष्वस्क-ष्कते) To go, move.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170209. note: it's a verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स|सं|सः
स <i>ind.</i> A prefix substituted for सह or सम्, सम, तुल्य,<BR> or सदृश and एक or समान, and compounded with nouns to<BR> form adjectives and adverbs in the sense of<BR>——(<i>a</i>) with, together with, along with, accompanied by, having, possessed<BR> of; सपुत्र, सभार्य, सतृष्ण, सधन, सरोषम्, सकोपम्, सहरि &c.;<BR>——(<i>b</i>) similar, like; सधर्मन् ‘of a similar nature’; so सजाति, सवर्ण;<BR>——(<i>c</i>) same; सोदर, सपक्ष, सपिण्ड, सनाभि &c. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A snake.<BR>—2 Air, wind.<BR>—3 A bird.<BR>—4 Short name for the musical note षड्ज q. v.<BR>—5 N. of Śiva.<BR>—6 Of Viṣṇu.<BR>—7 (In prosody) A foot consisting of two short syllables followed by a long one.<BR>—8 God; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सा
स + .{@-सा@} The goddess Lakṣmī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्
स + .{@-सम्@}<BR>—1 Knowledge.<BR>—2 Meditation.<BR>—3 A carriage-road.<BR>—4 A fence, an enclosure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयः|संय
संयः A skeleton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयज्
संयज् €1 U.<BR>—1 To adore, worship; समयष्टास्त्रमण्डलम् Bk. 15. 96.<BR>—2 To consecrate, dedicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत्|संयन्त्
संयत् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To struggle, contend; देवासुरा ह वै यत्र सयेतिरे Ch. Up. 1. 2. 1.<BR>—2 To form or be formed in rows.<BR>—3 To agree, coincide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत्|संयन्त्
संयत् <i>f.</i> A battle, war, fight; यः संयति प्राप्तपिनाकिलीलः<BR> R. 6. 72, 7. 39, 18. 21; Ki. 1. 19; Śi. 16. 15.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संयद्वरः, संयद्वाम<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयद्वरः|संयद्वर
संयत् + -वरः a king, prince.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयद्वाम
संयत् + -वाम <i>a.</i> uniting all that is pleasant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत्त
संयत्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Ready, prepared; संयत्तो भव सत्यमस्ति भवतः सत्यं मनुष्यो<BR> भवान् Mv. 5. 51.<BR>—2 Being on guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयन्त्रित
संयन्त्रित <i>a.</i> Held in, stopped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयम्
संयम् €1 P.<BR>—1 To restrain, curb, check, control, govern, subdue (Ātm.) (as passions<BR> &c.); असंयतात्मनो योगो दुष्प्राप इति मे मतिः Bg. 6. 36; Ms. 2. 100.<BR>—2 To bind, imprison, fasten, confine; वानरं मा न संयसीः Bk. 9. 50;<BR> M. 1. 7; R. 3. 20, 42.<BR>—3 To gather (Ātm.); व्रीहीन् संयच्छते Sk.<BR>—4 To shut, close; सर्वद्वाराणि संयम्य मनो हृदि निरुध्य च Bg. 8. 12.<BR>—5 To hold together, hold fast.<BR>—6 To guide or<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">Page1586-1</a>]<BR> drive (as horses).<BR>—7<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To collect.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To bind or tie into a knot (as hair); संयम्यमानशिखण्डः V. 5.<BR>—8 To keep in order.<BR>—9 To present with, give to.<BR>—10 To press close to or against; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1585-a2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत|संयतः
संयत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Restrained, curbed, subdued.<BR>—2 Tied up, bound together.<BR>—3 Fettered.<BR>—4 Captive, imprisoned, a prisoner; न संयतस्तस्य बभूव रक्षितुः R. 3. 20.<BR>—4 Ready.<BR>—5 Arranged; see यम् with सम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतः|संयत
संयत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 One who has restrained his passions, an ascetic.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संयताक्ष, संयताञ्जलि, संयतात्मन्, संयताहार,^1 संयतोपस्कर, संयतचेतस्, संयतमनस्, संयतप्राण, संयतमैथुन, संयतवस्त्र, संयतवाच्<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयताक्ष
संयत + -अक्ष <i>a.</i> one whose eyes are closed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयताञ्जलि|संयतांजलि
संयत + -अञ्जलि <i>a.</i> one who has folded his hands in supplication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतात्मन्
संयत + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> self-subdued, self-controlled; ऋषयः संयतात्मानः<BR> फलमूलानिलाशनाः Ms. 11. 236.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयताहार
संयत + -आहार^1 <i>a.</i> temperate in eating.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतोपस्कर
संयत + -उपस्कर <i>a.</i> one who has a well-regulated house, whose house-furniture<BR> is kept in good order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतचेतस्
संयत + -चेतस्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> controlled in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतमनस्
संयत + -चेतस्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> controlled in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतप्राण
संयत + -प्राण <i>a.</i> one whose breath is suppressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतमैथुन
संयत + -मैथुन <i>a.</i> one who abstains from sexual intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतवस्त्र
संयत + -वस्त्र <i>a.</i> having the clothes fastened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतवाच्
संयत + -वाच् <i>a.</i> silent, taciturn, one who has held his tongue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयतिः|संयति
संयतिः Penance, self-castigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयत्वर|संयत्वरः
संयत्वर <i>a.</i> Silent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयन्तृ|संयंतृ
संयन्तृ <i>m.</i> One who restrains, a restrainer, curber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमः|संयम
संयमः<BR>—1 Restraint, check, control; श्रोत्रादीनीन्द्रियाण्यन्ये संयमाग्निषु जुह्वति<BR> Bg. 4. 26, 27; so संयमधनः &c.<BR>—2 Concentration of mind, a term applied to the last three stages of <i>Yoga</i>;<BR> संयमाश्चानृशंस्यं च परस्वादानवर्जनम् Mb. 14. 18. 16; धारणाध्यानसमाधित्रयमन्तरङ्गं<BR> संयमपदवाच्यम् Sarva. S.; Ku. 2. 59.<BR>—3 A religious vow.<BR>—4 Religious devotion, practice of penance; अस्मान् साधु विचिन्त्य संयमधनान् Ś. 4. 17.<BR>—5 Humanity, feeling of compassion.<BR>—6 Any religious act on the day preceding a vow or course of penance.<BR>—7 Destruction of the world; यच्चेदं प्रभवः स्थानं भूतानां संयमो<BR> यमः Mb. 12. 238. 20; पुरा स्वयंभूरपि संयमाम्भस्युदीर्णवातोर्मिरवैः<BR> कराले Bhāg. 6. 9. 24.<BR>—8 Closing (of the eyes).<BR>—9 Effort, exertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमनम्
संयमनम्<BR>—1 Restraining, checking.<BR>—2 Drawing in; Ś. 1.<BR>—3 Binding, tying up; U. 1; अलकसंयमनादिव लोचने हरति मे हरिवाहनदिङ्मुखम् V. 3. 6.<BR>—4 Confinement.<BR>—5 Self-denial, control.<BR>—6 A religious vow or obligation.<BR>—7 A square of four houses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमनः|संयमन|संयमनं
संयमनम् + .{@-नः@} One who restrains or regulates, a ruler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमनी
संयमनम् + .{@-नी@} N. of the city of Yama. सा च संयमनी नूनं सदा सुकृतिनां<BR> गतिः Mb. 7. 72. 44; Bhāg. 10. 89. 42; खण्डिताः खड्गधाराभिर्ययुः<BR> संयमिनीं पुरीम् Śiva B. 27. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमित|संयमितः
संयमित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Restrained.<BR>—2 Bound, fettered.<BR>—3 Detained.<BR>—4 Assembled, collected.<BR>—5 Clasped (in the arms).<BR>—6 Piously disposed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमितम्
संयमित + .{@-तम्@} Subduing (the voice).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयमिन्
संयमिन् <i>a.</i> One who curbs or restrains, controlling. ━<i>m.</i><BR> One who controls or subdues his passions, a sage,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">Page1586-2</a>]<BR> an ascetic; या निशा सर्वभूतानां तस्यां जागर्ति संयमी Bg. 2. 69; R. 8. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संया
संया €2 P.<BR>—1 To go or proceed together; यथा प्रयान्ति संयान्ति स्रोतोवेगेन वालुकाः<BR> Bhāg. 6. 15. 3.<BR>—2 To go away, depart, walk away; गृहीत्वैतानि संयाति वायुर्गन्धानिवाशयात् Bg. 15. 8.<BR>—3 To go to, go or enter into; तथा शरीराणि विहाय जीर्णान्यन्यानि संयाति<BR> नवानि देही Bg. 2. 22.<BR>—4 To reach or attain to.<BR>—5 To assemble, meet.<BR>—6 To fight.<BR>—7 To be directed towards, aim at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयात्रा
संयात्रा<BR>—1 Voyage by sea.<BR>—2 Travelling together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयानः|संयान|संयानं
संयानः A mould.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयानम्
संयानः + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Going along with, accompanying.<BR>—2 Travelling, proceeding.<BR>—3 Carrying out a dead body; प्राप्तकालं नरपतेः कुरु संयानमुत्तमम्<BR> Rām. 2. 76. 2.<BR>—4 A vehicle, waggon, car; वहेर्लोकस्य संयानं गच्छस्व विगतज्वरः<BR> Rām. 7. 41. 8.<BR>—5 Keeping in action, driving (a horse); पश्य मे हयसंयाने शिक्षां<BR> केशवनन्दन Mb. 3. 19. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयाम|संयामः
संयाम See संयम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयावः|संयाव
संयावः A kind of cake of wheaten flour; वृथा कृसरसंयावं<BR> पायसापूपमेव च Ms. 5. 7; Bhāg. 11. 27. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुज्
संयुज् I. €7 U.<BR>—1 To join together, connect, unite.<BR>—2 To endow or furnish with.<BR>—3 To form an alliance.<BR>—4 To place or fix in, set in. ━II. €4 Ā. To unite; संयुज्यन्ते वियुज्यन्ते<BR> तथा कालेन देहिनः Bhāg. 6. 15. 3. ━<i>pass.</i><BR>—1 To be united with; संयोक्ष्यसे स्वेन वपुर्महिम्ना R. 5. 55.<BR>—2 To be married to; यादृग्गुणेन भर्त्रा स्त्री संयुज्येत यथाविधि Ms. 9. 22.<BR>—3 To have sexual intercourse. —4 To be supplied or furnished with. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To unite, join; संयोजयति विद्यैव नीचगापि नरं सरित् H. 1.<BR>—2 To harness, yoke.<BR>—3 To prepare, equip (an army).<BR>—4 To furnish, endow or supply with, provide with; बुद्ध्या संयोजयन्ति तम् Pt. 2.<BR>—5 To fasten or fix on.<BR>—6 To throw, discharge, shoot (a missile).<BR>—7 To use, employ.<BR>—8 To appoint (to an office), entrust with.<BR>—9 To perform, accomplish.<BR>—10 To be absorbed in, meditate upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुक्त|संयुक्तः
संयुक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Joined, connected, united.<BR>—2 Blended, mixed, mingled.<BR>—3 Accompanied by.<BR>—4 Possessed of, endowed with.<BR>—5 Consisting of.<BR>—6 Devoted, attached to; प्रजापालनसंयुक्तो न रागोपहितेन्द्रियः Rām. 2. 2. 44.<BR>—7 Related (संबन्धिन्); संयुक्त एकदुःखश्च वीर्यवांश्च महीपतिः Mb. 5. 151. 9.<BR>—8 Married to; अक्षमाला वसिष्ठेन संयुक्ताऽधमयोनिजा Ms. 9. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुक्तम्
संयुक्त + .{@-तम्@} ━<i>ind.</i> Jointly, together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुगः|संयुग
संयुगः<BR>—1 Conjunction, union, mixture.<BR>—2 Fight, war, battle, contest; संयुगे सांयुगीनं तमुद्यतं प्रसहेत<BR> कः Ku. 2. 57; R. 9. 19.<BR>—3 Contact, nearness; आगमिष्यति नो नूनं धार्तराष्ट्रस्य संयुगे Mb. 7. 16. 41.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संयुगगोष्पदम्, संयुगमूर्धन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुगगोष्पदम्
संयुगः + -गोष्पदम् ‘a contest in a cowʼs footstep’ <i>i. e.</i> an insignificant<BR> or trifling quarrel; cf. the English phrase ‘a storm in a tea-pot’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुगमूर्धन्
संयुगः + -मूर्धन् <i>m.</i> the front of the battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1586-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुज्
संयुज् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Connected, relating to; संयुजा च सह मेदिनीपतिम् Śi. 14. 55.<BR>—2 Possessed of or endowed with good qualities.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुजा
संयुज् + .{@-जा@} Union, connection; न पारयेऽहं निरवद्यसंयुजाम् Bhāg. 10. 33. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोगः|संयोग
संयोगः<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Conjunction, union, combination, junction, association, intimate<BR> union; संयोगो हि वियोगस्य संसूचयति संभवम् Subhāṣ.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Endowment with, possession of.<BR>—2 Conjunction (as one of the 24 guṇas of the Vaiśeṣikas).<BR>—3 Addition, annexation.<BR>—4 A set; आभरणसंयोगाः Māl. 6.<BR>—5 Alliance between two kings for a common object.<BR>—6 (In gram.) A conjunct consonant; हलोऽनन्तराः संयोगः P. I. 1. 7.<BR>—7 (In astr.) The conjunction of two heavenly bodies.<BR>—8 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—9 (In phil.) Contact (direct material).<BR>—10 Carnal contact.<BR>—11 Matrimonial relation.<BR>—12 Agreement of opinion.<BR>—13 Sum, total amount.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संयोगपृथक्त्वम्, संयोगविधिः, संयोगविभागाः, संयोगविरुद्धम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोगपृथक्त्वम्
संयोगः + -पृथक्त्वम् severalty of conjunction. This circumstance accounts<BR> for one and the same thing being नित्य as well as नैमित्तिक. In<BR> one case it would be नित्य, in the other it would be नैमित्तिक;<BR> (एकस्य तूभयत्वे संयोगपृथक्त्वम् MS. 4. 3. 5; न संयोगपृथक्त्वात्<BR> Ms. 12. 1. 24.); e. g. दधि is नित्य in दध्ना जुहोति, but<BR> नैमित्तिक in दध्ना इन्द्रियकामस्य जुहुयात्. This न्याय is discussed<BR> and established in Ms. 4. 3. 5-7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोगविधिः
संयोगः + -विधिः the Vedānta, propounding the union of जीव and ब्रह्म;<BR> Mb. 12. 200. 11 (com.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोगविभागाः
संयोगः + -विभागाः (<i>m.</i> pl.) conjunctions and disjunctions; यदि शब्दं<BR> संयोगविभागा एवाभिव्यञ्जन्ति न कुर्वन्ति etc.; ŚB. on MS. 1. 1. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोगविरुद्धम्
संयोगः + -विरुद्धम् any eatables causing disease by being mixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोगिन्
संयोगिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 United, conjoined.<BR>—2 Joining.<BR>—3 Married.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोजनम्
संयोजनम्<BR>—1 Union, conjunction.<BR>—2 Copulation, sexual union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुत|संयुतः
संयुत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Joined, united together, connected.<BR>—2 Endowed or furnished with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयुतिः|संयुति
संयुतिः<BR>—1 (In math.) The total of two numbers or quantities.<BR>—2 The conjunction of planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संयोधः|संयोध
संयोधः Fight, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्ष्
संरक्ष् €1 P.<BR>—1 To protect.<BR>—2 To ward off, prevent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्षः|संरक्ष
संरक्षः, संरक्षा Protection, care, preservation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्षा
संरक्षः, संरक्षा Protection, care, preservation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्षकः|संरक्षक
संरक्षकः A keeper, guardian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्षणम्
संरक्षणम्<BR>—1 Protection, preservation.<BR>—2 Charge, custody.<BR>—3 Prevention; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरञ्ज्|संरंज्
संरञ्ज् €4 U.<BR>—1 To be dyed or coloured, to redden.<BR>—2 To be affected with any passion. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To dye, colour.<BR>—2 To please, satisfy, gratify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरक्त
संरक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Coloured, red.<BR>—2 Impassioned, fired with passion; कामभोगाभिसंरक्तो मैथुनायोपचक्रमे<BR> Rām. 7. 26. 41.<BR>—3 Angry, irritated, inflamed with anger.<BR>—4 Enamoured, charmed.<BR>—5 Charming, beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरागः|संराग
संरागः<BR>—1 Colouring.<BR>—2 Passion, affection; पश्य लक्ष्मण संरागस्तिर्यग्योनिगतेष्वपि<BR> Rām. 4. 2. 42; स्त्रीणामपि शक्ताः स्थ संरागे किं पुनर्नृणाम् Bu. C. 4. 12.<BR>—3 Rage, anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरभ्
संरभ् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To become agitated, be overwhelmed or affected.<BR>—2 To be exasperated or furious, be enraged or irritated (mostly in <i>p. p.</i>);<BR> संरब्धसिंहप्रहृतं वहन्ति R. 16. 16.<BR>—3 To seize, catch hold of (Ved.).<BR>—4 To fear; प्रवृत्तं रज इत्येव तन्न संरभ्य चिन्तयेत् Mb. 12. 194. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरब्ध
संरब्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Excited, agitated; कुरवोऽपि सुसंरब्धाः शस्त्रविद्यामंदर्शयन् Bm. 1. 662.<BR>—2 Inflamed, exasperated, enraged, furious; संरब्धेन शिवेन ते प्रतिभटाः<BR> केचिच्च बन्दीकृताः Śiva B. 22. 72.<BR>—3 Augmented.<BR>—4 Swelled.<BR>—5 Overwhelmed.<BR>—6 Closely joined, hand in hand; पवमानेन स्तोष्यमाणाः संरब्धाः सर्पन्ति<BR> Ch. Up. 1. 12. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संरब्धनेत्र, संरब्धमान<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरब्धनेत्र
संरब्ध + -नेत्र <i>a.</i> having swollen eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरब्धमान
संरब्ध + -मान <i>a.</i> one whose pride is excited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भः|संरम्भ|संरंभ|संरंभः
संरम्भः<BR>—1 Beginning.<BR>—2 Turbulence, impetuosity, violence; न संरम्भेण सिध्यन्ति सर्वेऽर्थाः<BR> सान्त्वया यथा Bhāg. 8. 6. 24; हन्त वर्धते ते संरम्भः Ś. 7.<BR>—3 Agitation, excitement, flurry; अवृष्टिसंरम्भमिवाम्बुवाहम् Ku. 3. 48;<BR> Māl. 6. 10.<BR>—4 Energy, zeal, ardent desire; अन्योन्यजयसंरम्भो ववृधे वादिनोरिव R. 12. 92.<BR>—5 Anger, rage, wrath; प्रणिपातप्रतीकारः संरम्भो हि महात्मनाम्<BR> R. 4. 64, 12. 36; V. 2. 21, 4. 28; Ku. 3. 76.<BR>—6 Pride, arrogance; संरम्भो हि सपत्नीत्वाद्वक्तुं कुन्तिसुतां प्रति Mb. 1. 124. 6.<BR>—7 Swelling with heat and inflammation.<BR>—8 Hatred; संरम्भभययोगेन बिन्दते तत्सरूपताम् Bhāg. 7. 1. 28.<BR>—9 Adopting hostile measures; त्वयाऽपि तस्मिन् संरम्भो न कार्यः Dk. 2. 3.<BR>—10 Intensity, high degree; निनादस्य च संरम्भो नैतदल्पं हि कारणम्<BR> Rām. 4. 15. 12.<BR>—11 The brunt (of battle); Rāj. T.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संरम्भताम्र, संरम्भदृश्, संरम्भपरुष, संरम्भरस, संरम्भरूक्ष, संरम्भवेगः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भताम्र
संरम्भः + -ताम्र <i>a.</i> red with fury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भदृश्
संरम्भः + -दृश् <i>a.</i> having angry eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भपरुष
संरम्भः + -परुष <i>a.</i> harsh through rage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भरस
संरम्भः + -रस <i>a.</i> excessively enraged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भरूक्ष
संरम्भः + -रूक्ष <i>a.</i> exceedingly harsh; संरम्भरूक्षमिव सुन्दरि यद्यदासीत् V. 3. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भवेगः|संरम्भवेग|संरंभवेग
संरम्भः + -वेगः the impetuosity of anger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्भिन्|संरंभिन्
संरम्भिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Excited, agitated, flurried; इति संरम्भिणो वाणीर्बलस्यालेख्यदेवताः Śi. 2. 67.<BR>—2 Angry, furious, enraged.<BR>—3 Proud, arrogant.<BR>—4 Ardently devoted, diligent; अमर्षी बलवान् पार्थः संरम्भी दृढविक्रमः Mb. 3. 48. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरम्
संरम् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To be delighted; भक्तस्य तत्र समरन्त ममापि वाचः Mv. 1. 7.<BR>—2 To have carnal pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराध्
संराध् €4 P.<BR>—1 To be accomplished or perfected.<BR>—2 To be acquired. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To bring into harmony.<BR>—2 To agree about or upon (with acc.).<BR>—3 To propitiate, satisfy, conciliate; स्वयं संराध्यैवं शतमखमखण्डेन<BR> तपसा Ki. 10. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराधनम्
संराधनम्<BR>—1 Propitiation, conciliation, pleasing by worship.<BR>—2 Accomplishing.<BR>—3 Profound or deep meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संराद्धिः|संराद्धि
संराद्धिः Accomplishment, success.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1587-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरावः|संराव
संरावः, संरावणम्<BR>—1 Clamour, tumult, uproar.<BR>—2 Sound or noise in general; द्युवियद्गामिनी तारसंरावविहतश्रुतिः Ki. 15. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरावणम्
संरावः, संरावणम्<BR>—1 Clamour, tumult, uproar.<BR>—2 Sound or noise in general; द्युवियद्गामिनी तारसंरावविहतश्रुतिः Ki. 15. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरिहाणम्
संरिहाणम् Affectionately licking (as a cow licking her calf); वत्समिव<BR> मातरा संरिहाणे Rv. 3. 33. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुग्ण
संरुग्ण <i>p. p.</i> Shattered, broken to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुजनम्
संरुजनम् Pain, ache.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुध्
संरुध् €7 U.<BR>—1 To obstruct, detain, stop; स चेत्तु पथि संरुद्धः पशुभिर्वा रथेन<BR> वा Ms. 8. 295.<BR>—2 To impede, obstruct, prevent; संरुद्धचेष्टस्य R. 2. 43.<BR>—3 To hold fast, enchain; तृणमिव लघु लक्ष्मीर्नैव तान् संरुणद्धि Bh. 2. 17.<BR>—4 To seize upon, grasp, catch hold of; अजाविके तु संरुद्धे वृकैः पाले<BR> त्वनायति Ms. 8. 235.<BR>—5 To besiege, blockade, invest.<BR>—6 To cover up, conceal.<BR>—7 To withhold, refuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुद्ध
संरुद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Checked, impeded, opposed.<BR>—2 Blocked up, filled up.<BR>—3 Blockaded, invested, besieged.<BR>—4 Covered over, concealed.<BR>—5 Refused, withheld.<BR>—6 Hindered, stopped (movement); फाल्गुनो गात्रसंरुद्धो देवदेवेन भारत Mb. 3. 39. 62.<BR>—7 Imprisoned; मोचयामास राजन्यान् संरुद्धा मागधेन ये Bhāg. 10. 72. 49.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संरुद्धचेष्ट<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुद्धचेष्ट
संरुद्ध + -चेष्ट <i>a.</i> one whose motion is impeded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरोधः|संरोध
संरोधः<BR>—1 Complete obstruction or impediment, hindrance, prevention, check; पयःसंरोधकूलंकषः Māl. 5. 19.<BR>—2 Blockade, siege.<BR>—3 Bond, fetter.<BR>—4 Imprisonment; क्षुत्क्षामाः शुष्कवदनाः संरोधपरिकशिंताः Bhāg. 10. 73. 2.<BR>—5 Decrease, lessening; संरोधादायुषस्त्वेते व्यस्यन्ते द्वापरे युगे<BR> Mb. 12. 238. 14.<BR>—6 Suppression, destruction.<BR>—7 Throwing, sending forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरोधनम्
संरोधनम्<BR>—1 Obstructing, stopping.<BR>—2 Fettering, confining.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरुह्
संरुह् €1 P.<BR>—1 To grow, increase.<BR>—2 To grow over, heal; see रुह्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरूढ|संरूढः
संरूढ <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Grown together.<BR>—2 Cicatrized, healed; as in संरूढव्रण.<BR>—3 Shot forth, sprouted, budded, germinated; हर्म्याग्रसंरूढतृणाङ्कुरेषु R. 6. 47.<BR>—4 Firmly grown, striking firm root.<BR>—5 Bold, confident.<BR>—6 Crowdy; संरूढकक्ष्यां बहुलां स्वमन्तःपुरमाविशत् Rām. 3. 54. 13.<BR>—7 Deeply set, sunk; ततो मामतिविश्वस्तं संरूढशरविक्षतम् Mb. 3. 174. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरोहणम्
संरोहणम्<BR>—1 Growing over.<BR>—2 Healing.<BR>—3 Sowing, planting; नवसंरोहणशिथिलस्तरुरिव सुकरः समुद्धर्तुम् M. 1. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संरोषित
संरोषित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Spread over.<BR>—2 Besmeared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलक्ष्
संलक्ष् €10 U.<BR>—1 To observe, perceive, see, notice; आश्चर्यदर्शनः संलक्ष्यते मनुष्यलोकः<BR> Ś. 7; संलक्ष्यते न च्छिदुरोऽपि हारः R. 16. 62 ‘is not noticed or known’; 8. 42.<BR>—2 To test, prove, determine; हेम्नः संलक्ष्यते ह्यग्नौ विशुद्धिः श्यामिकापि वा R. 1. 10.<BR>—3 To hear, learn, understand.<BR>—4 To characterize, distinguish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलक्षणम्
संलक्षणम् Marking, distinguishing or characterizing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलग्न|संलग्नः
संलग्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Closely attached, stuck together, united with, adhering to.<BR>—2 Come to blows or close contest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलप्
संलप् €1 P.<BR>—1 To talk, converse; संलपतो जनसमाजात् Dk.<BR>—2 To name, call.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलापः|संलाप
संलापः<BR>—1 Conversation, chat, discourse.<BR>—2 Especially familiar or confidential talk, secret conversation.<BR>—3 (In dramas) A kind of dialogue; संलापः स्याद्गभीरोक्तिर्नानाभावसमाश्रया S. D. 6. 131.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलापकः|संलापक
संलापकः^1 <i>m.</i>^2 A kind of minor drama, said to be of a controversial<BR> kind; see S. D. 6-291.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संललित
संललित <i>p. p.</i> Fondled, caressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलिख्
संलिख् €6 P.<BR>—1 To scratch, scrape.<BR>—2 To write, inscribe.<BR>—3 To play upon (a musical instrument).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलीढ
संलीढ <i>p. p.</i> Licked up; enjoyed, tasted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संली
संली €4 Ā.<BR>—1 To cling, adhere or stick to.<BR>—2 To lie down or settle upon, alight.<BR>—3 To lurk.<BR>—4 To melt away.<BR>—5 To go or enter into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलयः|संलय
संलयः<BR>—1 Lying down, sleep.<BR>—2 Dissolution.<BR>—3 Universal destruction (प्रलय).<BR>—4 A nest; विश्रान्तः संहत्य पक्षौ संलयायैव ध्रियते Bṛ. Up. 4. 3. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलयनम्
संलयनम्<BR>—1 Adhering or clinging to.<BR>—2 Dissolution.<BR>—3 Lying down, sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलीन
संलीन <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Clung, adhered to.<BR>—2 Joined together.<BR>—3 Hidden, concealed.<BR>—4 Cowering down.<BR>—5 Contracted, shrunk.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संलीनकर्ण, संलीनमानस<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलीनकर्ण
संलीन + -कर्ण <i>a.</i> with the ears hanging down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलीनमानस
संलीन + -मानस <i>a.</i> depressed in mind, in drooping spirits.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलुड्
संलुड् €1 P. To stir, agitate.<BR>—10 U. or <i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To shake, stir about, move to and fro; यत्र संलोडिता लुब्धैः प्रायशो<BR> धर्मसेतवः Mb. 12. 287. 44.<BR>—2 To confound, disturb, perplex.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलोडनम्
संलोडनम् Disturbing, confusing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलुलित
संलुलित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Agitated, confused; Rām.<BR>—2 Come into contact with; C. P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संलेपः|संलेप
संलेपः Mud, dirt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवत्|संवन्त्
संवत् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 A year.<BR>—2 Especially a year of the Vikramāditya era (commencing 56 years before<BR> the Christian era).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवत्सरः|संवत्सर
संवत्सरः [संवसन्ति ऋतवोऽत्र संवस्-सरन् Tv.]<BR>—1 A year; न ह पुरा ततः संवत्सर आस Bṛ. Up. 1. 2. 4.<BR>—2 A year of Vikramādityaʼs era.<BR>—3 N. of Śiva. —4 The first year in the cycle of five years.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संवत्सरकरः, संवत्सरनिरोधः, संवत्सरभ्रमि, संवत्सरमुखी, संवत्सररयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवत्सरकरः|संवत्सरकर
संवत्सरः + -करः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवत्सरनिरोधः|संवत्सरनिरोध
संवत्सरः + -निरोधः Imprisonment for a year; वैश्यः सर्वस्वदण्डः स्यात्<BR> संवत्सरनिरोधतः Ms. 8. 375.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवत्सरभ्रमि
संवत्सरः + -भ्रमि <i>a.</i> revolving<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">Page1589-1</a>]<BR> in a year, completing one revolution in a year (said of the sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1588-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवत्सरमुखी
संवत्सरः + -मुखी the tenth day in the light half of the month ज्यैष्ठ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवत्सररयः|संवत्सररय
संवत्सरः + -रयः a yearʼs course.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवद्
संवद् €1 P.<BR>—1 To talk to, address; मैतस्मिन् संवदिष्टा अतिष्ठाः Bṛ. Up. 2. 1. 2.<BR>—2 To speak together, converse, discourse.<BR>—3 To resemble, tally with, correspond to, be like (with instr.); अस्य<BR> मुखं सीताया मुखचन्द्रेण संवदत्येव U. 4; अहो संवदन्त्यक्षराणि Mu. 5.<BR>—4 To name, call.<BR>—5 To agree, accord, consent.<BR>—6 To coincide, fit together (so as to give one sense). ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To consult, hold consultation (with instr.); as in मौहूर्तिकैः सह संवाद्यताम्.<BR>—2 To cause to sound, play upon (a musical instrument).<BR>—3 To declare (truly or sincerely); संवाद्य रूपसंख्यादीन् स्वामी तद्द्रव्यमर्हति Ms. 8. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवदनम्
संवदनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Conversing, talking together.<BR>—2 Communication of tidings.<BR>—3 Examination, consideration.<BR>—4 Subduing or overpowering by magic or charms.<BR>—5 A charm, an amulet.<BR>—6 A message.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवदना
संवदनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Conversing, talking together.<BR>—2 Communication of tidings.<BR>—3 Examination, consideration.<BR>—4 Subduing or overpowering by magic or charms.<BR>—5 A charm, an amulet.<BR>—6 A message.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवादः|संवाद
संवादः<BR>—1 Speaking together, conversation, dialogue, colloquy; सकृत्संवादेऽपि<BR> प्रथत इह चामुत्र च शुभम् Mv. 1. 12.<BR>—2 Discussion, debate.<BR>—3 Communication of tidings.<BR>—4 Information, news.<BR>—5 Assent, concurrence.<BR>—6 Likeness, agreement, similarity, correspondence; तद्धित्वाऽमृतसंवादं<BR> तस्मादेतौ मताविह Mb. 12. 167. 24; रूपसंवादाच्च संशयादनया पृष्टः<BR> Dk.; (नादः) चित्ताकर्षी परिचित इव श्रोत्रसंवादमेति Māl. 5. 20.<BR>—7 Meeting, encounter; यदृच्छासंवादः किमु किमु गुणानामतिशयः U. 5. 16.<BR>—8 A cause, law-suit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवादिन्
संवादिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Speaking, conversing.<BR>—2 Like, similar, resembling, corresponding to; षड्जसंवादिनीः केकाः<BR> R. 1. 39; अस्मदङ्गसंवादिन्याकृतिः U. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाच्यम्
संवाच्यम् The art of conversation (one of the 64 Kalās).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवावदूक
संवावदूक <i>a.</i> Extremely similar, having a close resemblance;<BR> अचुम्बदस्याः स मुखेन्दुबिम्बं संवावदूकश्रियमम्बुजानाम् N. 22. 104.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवननम्
संवननम्<BR>—1 Subduing or overpowering by magical rites or drugs.<BR>—2 A charm, an amulet (for propitiating god); न हीदृशं संवननं<BR> त्रिषु लोकेषु विद्यते । दया मैत्री च भूतेषु दानं च मुधुरा च वाक् ॥ Mb. 1. 87. 12.<BR>—3 Gaining, acquiring; कोशसंवनने दाने … Mb. 5. 148. 9.<BR>—4 Fondness, love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्गः|संवर्ग
संवर्गः Ved.<BR>—1 Plunder, spoil.<BR>—2 An epithet of Agni. ━<i>a.</i> Gathering, collecting; वायुर्वाव संवर्गः<BR> Ch. Up. 4. 3. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संवर्गविद्या<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्गविद्या
संवर्गः + -विद्या (in phil.) the science of resolution or absorption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्गणम्
संवर्गणम् Attracting, winning (friends); Dk. 2. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्जनम्
संवर्जनम्<BR>—1 Appropriating to oneself.<BR>—2 Consuming, devouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्मय्
संवर्मय् To shield; तत्तादृशेन वपुषाङ्ग मदङ्गमेतत् संवर्मय<BR> स्मरशराः प्रतियान्तु मोघाः । Rām. Ch. 5. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवलनम्
संवलनम्<BR>—1 Combination, junction, union.<BR>—2 Being mixed or charged with; अद्य विधिरशनिशशधरमयूखसंवलनमनुकुरुते<BR> Māl. 10. 11, 9. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवलित|संवलितः
संवलित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Met together, mingled, mixed; (चाषच्छद) च्छायासंवलितैर्विवर्तिभिरिव<BR> प्रान्तेषु पर्यावृताः Māl. 6. 5.<BR>—2 Sprinkled with; आश्लिष्टवत्यमृतसंवलितैरिवाङ्गैः Māl. 4. 8.<BR>—3 Connected, associated.<BR>—4 Broken; उदितोपलस्खलनसंवलिताः (ध्वनयः) Ki. 6. 4.<BR>—5 Surrounded, encompassed.<BR>—6 Possessed of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवल्गित
संवल्गित <i>a.</i> Overrun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवल्गितम्
संवल्गित + .{@-तम्@} A sound; घूत्कारसंवल्गितम् Māl. 5. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवस्
संवस् €1 P.<BR>—1 To live, dwell.<BR>—2 To live with, associate; न संवसेच्च पतितैर्न चाण्डालैर्न पुल्कसैः<BR> Ms. 4. 79; Y. 3. 15.<BR>—3 To spend, pass (time). ━<i>Caus.</i> To accommodate, lodge, furnish with lodging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवासः|संवास
संवासः<BR>—1 Dwelling together.<BR>—2 Association, company; प्रायेणाधममध्यमोत्तमगुणः संवासतो जायते Pt. 1. 250.<BR>—3 Domestic intercourse.<BR>—4 A house, dwelling.<BR>—5 An open space (for meeting or recreation); शृण्वन् वाचो मनुष्याणां<BR> ग्रामसंवासवासिनाम् Rām. 2. 49. 4.<BR>—6 Cohabitation, sexual intercourse; व्रात्यया सह संवासे Ms. 8. 373.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवसथः|संवसथ
संवसथः A place where people live together, a village, an inhabited place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवह्
संवह् €1 P.<BR>—1 To carry or bear along, drag.<BR>—2 To carry together.<BR>—3 To rub, press.<BR>—4 To show, display.<BR>—5 To take a wife, marry.<BR>—6 To soothe. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To rub or press together, shampoo; संवाहयामि चरणावुत पद्मताम्रौ Ś. 3. 20.<BR>—2 To assemble, collect.<BR>—3 To drive (a carriage).<BR>—4 To marry, take a wife.<BR>—5 To carry away, drive along, impel; सोऽपि संवाह्यते लोके तृष्णया<BR> पश्य कौतुकम् Pt. 5. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवहः|संवह
संवहः N. of the third of the seven courses or Mārgas of the wind; see वायु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवहनम्
संवहनम्<BR>—1 Guiding, conducting.<BR>—2 Showing, displaying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाहः|संवाह
संवाहः<BR>—1 Bearing or carrying along.<BR>—2 Pressing together.<BR>—3 Shampooing, stroking gently.<BR>—4 A servant employed to rub and shampoo the body.<BR>—5 A market-place.<BR>—6 A park for recreation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाहकः|संवाहक
संवाहकः A shampooer; see संवाह (4) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाहनम्
संवाहनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Carrying or bearing a burden.<BR>—2 Shampooing; gentle rubbing; अशिथिलपरिरम्भैर्दत्तसंवाहनानि U. 1. 24.<BR>—3 Bearing along, propelling; पौरस्त्यो वा सुखयति मरुत् साधुसंवाहनाभिः Māl. 9. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाहना
संवाहनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Carrying or bearing a burden.<BR>—2 Shampooing; gentle rubbing; अशिथिलपरिरम्भैर्दत्तसंवाहनानि U. 1. 24.<BR>—3 Bearing along, propelling; पौरस्त्यो वा सुखयति मरुत् साधुसंवाहनाभिः Māl. 9. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवाहित
संवाहित <i>p. p.</i> Moved; प्रयत्नसंवाहितपीवरोरुभिः Ki. 8. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवासित
संवासित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Made fragrant, scented, perfumed.<BR>—2 Made fetid, having an offensive or foul smell (as a breath).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1589-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविक्तम्
संविक्तम् What is separated or individualized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविज्
संविज् €7 P., €6 Ā.<BR>—1 To shake.<BR>—2 To be agitated, tremble with fear; श्रुत्वा जरां संविविजे महात्मा Bu. C. 3. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविग्न
संविग्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Agitated, excited, disturbed, distracted, flurried; as in संविग्नमानस;<BR> विसृज्य सशरं चापं शोकसंविग्नमानसः Bg. 1. 47; किर्मीरवधसंविग्नो<BR> बहिर्दुर्योधनो ययौ Mb. 3. 10. 39.<BR>—2 Terrified, frightened.<BR>—3 Moving to and fro; पूररेचकसंविग्नवलिवल्गुदलोदरम् Bhāg. 4. 24. 51, 12. 9. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविज्ञात
संविज्ञात <i>p. p.</i> Universally known, generally recognised or allowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविज्ञानम्
संविज्ञानम्<BR>—1 Agreement, consent.<BR>—2 Thorough understanding.<BR>—3 Perception, knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविद्
संविद् I. €2 P.<BR>—1 To know, be aware of; संवित्तः सहयुध्वानौ तच्छक्तिं खरदूषणौ<BR> Bk. 5. 37, 8. 17.<BR>—2 To recognize.<BR>—3 to investigate, examine.<BR>—4 To perceive, feel, experience.<BR>—5 To advise.<BR>—6 To come to an understanding, agree upon<BR>—7 To think over, meditate. ━II. €6 U.<BR>—1 To get, obtain.<BR>—2 To meet together. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To make known, inform, announce.<BR>—2 To know, perceive, observe<BR>—3 To cause to know or perceive; समवेद्यन्त च द्विषः Bk. 17. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवित्तिः|संवित्ति
संवित्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Knowledge, perception, consciousness, feeling; श्वस्त्वया सुखसंवित्तिः<BR> स्मरणीयाऽधुनातनी Ki. 11. 34, 16. 32.<BR>—2 Understanding, intellect.<BR>—3 Recognition, recollection.<BR>—4 Harmony (of feeling), mental reconciliation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविद्
संविद् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Knowledge, understanding, intellect; यत्रेमे सदसद्रूपे प्रतिषिद्धे<BR> स्वसंविदा Bhāg. 1. 3. 33; असंविदानस्य ममेश संविदाम् Ki. 18. 42.<BR>—2 Consciousness, perception; त्वत्स्नेहसंविदवलम्बितजीवितानि Māl. 6. 13.<BR>—3 An agreement, engagement, contract, covenant, promise; स राजलोकः<BR> कृतपूर्वसंवित् R. 7. 31; ततो देवासुराः कृत्वा संविदं कृतसौहृदाः<BR> Bhāg. 8. 6. 32; Ms. 8. 5.<BR>—4 Assent, consent.<BR>—5 An established usage, a prescribed custom; रथस्थाः संविदं कृत्वा<BR> सुखां पृष्ट्वा च शर्वरीम् Mb. 12. 53. 20; प्रसादिनोऽनुज्झितगोत्रसंविदः Śi. 12. 35.<BR>—6 War, battle, fight.<BR>—7 A war-cry, watch-word.<BR>—8 A name, an appellation.<BR>—9 A sign, signal.<BR>—10 Pleasing, delighting, gratification; अबुधैः कृतमानसंविदः Śi. 16. 47.<BR>—11 Sympathy, participation.<BR>—12 Meditation.<BR>—13 Conversation; रहसि संविदो या हृदिस्पृशः Bhāg. 10. 31. 10.<BR>—14 Hemp.<BR>—15 Agreement of opinion; स्तुतीरलभमानानां संविदं वेदनिश्चितान्<BR> Mb. 12. 151. 6.<BR>—16 Acquaintance, friendship; संविदा देयम् T. Up. 1. 11. 3.<BR>—17 A plan, scheme.<BR>—18 News, tidings.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संविद्व्यतिक्रमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविद्व्यतिक्रमः|संविद्व्यतिक्रम
संविद् + -व्यतिक्रमः breach of promise, violation of a contract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविदा
संविदा An agreement or promise, covenant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविदात
संविदात <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Knowing, intelligent.<BR>—2 Harmonious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविदान
संविदान <i>a.</i> Conversing; वागष्टमी ब्रह्मणा संविदानेति Bṛ. Up. 2. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविदित|संविदितः
संविदित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Known, understood.<BR>—2 Recognised.<BR>—3 Well-known, renowned.<BR>—4 Explored.<BR>—5 Agreed upon.<BR>—6 Advised, admonished; see विद् with सम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविदितम्
संविदित + .{@-तम्@} An agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेदः|संवेद
संवेदः —1 Perception, knowledge, consciousness, feeling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेदनम्
संवेदनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Perception, knowledge.<BR>—2 Sensation, feeling, experiencing, suffering; दुःखसंवेदनायैव रामे<BR> चैतन्यमर्पितम् U. 1. 48.<BR>—3 Giving, surrendering; सुलभेष्वर्थलाभेषु परसंवेदने जनः Mu. 1. 25.<BR>—4 Betrayal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेदना
संवेदनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Perception, knowledge.<BR>—2 Sensation, feeling, experiencing, suffering; दुःखसंवेदनायैव रामे<BR> चैतन्यमर्पितम् U. 1. 48.<BR>—3 Giving, surrendering; सुलभेष्वर्थलाभेषु परसंवेदने जनः Mu. 1. 25.<BR>—4 Betrayal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविध्
संविध् <i>f.</i> Arrangement, plan; रावणः संविधं चक्रे लङ्कायां<BR> शास्त्रनिर्मिताम् Mb. 3. 284. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविधा
संविधा €3 U.<BR>—1 To do, act, perform, manage, make.<BR>—2 To dispose, arrange.<BR>—3 To set, place, put, lay.<BR>—4 To appoint.<BR>—5 To direct, order.<BR>—6 To attend to, mind.<BR>—7 To use, employ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविधा
संविधा<BR>—1 Arrangement, preparation, plan; उद्भासितं मङ्गलसंविधाभिः संबन्धिनः<BR> सद्म समाससाद R. 7. 16, 14. 17; किं नु खलु संविधा विहिता न वेति<BR> Cārudatta 1.<BR>—2 Mode of life, means of leading life; कल्पवित् कल्पयामास वन्यामेवास्य<BR> संविधाम् R. 1. 94.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविधानम्
संविधानम्<BR>—1 Arrangement, disposition; Māl. 6.<BR>—2 Performance.<BR>—3 Plan, mode.<BR>—4 A rite.<BR>—5 Arrangement of incidents (in a plot); Māl. 6.<BR>—6 Management; संविधानं च विहितं रथाश्च किल सज्जिताः Mb. 7. 75. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविधानकम्
संविधानकम्<BR>—1 Arrangement of incidents (in a plot), the plot of a drama &c.; अहो<BR> संविधानकम् U. 3.<BR>—2 A strange act, an unusual occurrence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविधिः|संविधि
संविधिः Disposition, arrangement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविभज्
संविभज् €1 U.<BR>—1 To separate, divide.<BR>—2 To distribute, share with; स्निग्धजनसंविभक्तं हि दुःखं सह्यवेदनं<BR> भवति Ś. 4.<BR>—3 To share in common, admit (one) to a share; वित्तं यदा यस्य च<BR> संविभक्तम् Subhāṣ; भेजे दमं संविवभाज साधून् Bu. C. 2. 33.<BR>—4 To bestow upon, give to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविभक्त
संविभक्त <i>p. p.</i> Divided, separated; संविभक्ताश्च तुष्टाश्च<BR> गुरुवत्तेषु वर्तते Mb. 3. 37. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविभागः|संविभाग
संविभागः<BR>—1 Partition, dividing.<BR>—2 A part, portion, share.<BR>—3 Bestowal; सत्यमार्जवमक्रोधः संविभागो दमः शमः Mb. 3. 259. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविभागिन्
संविभागिन् <i>m.</i> A partner, sharer, participator; असंविभागी<BR> दुष्टात्मा … … वर्जनीयो नराधिप Mb. 5. 38. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविभा
संविभा €2 P. To meditate; Muṇḍ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविश्
संविश् €6 P.<BR>—1 To enter.<BR>—2 To sleep, lie down to rest; संविष्टः कुशशयने निशां निनाय R. 1. 95;<BR> क्रमेण सुप्तामनु<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">Page1591-1</a>]<BR> संविवेश 2. 24; Ms. 4. 55, 7. 225.<BR>—3 To cohabit, have sexual intercourse with; षोडशर्तुनिशाः स्त्रीणां<BR> तस्मिन् युग्मासु संविशेत् Y. 1. 79; Ms. 3. 48.<BR>—4 To enjoy.<BR>—5 To engage oneself in; मनःसंस्पर्शजान् दृष्ट्वा भोगान् स्वप्स्यामि संविशन्<BR> Bhāg. 7. 13. 26, 9. 19. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1590-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संविष्ट
संविष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Sleeping, lying down; R. 1. 95.<BR>—2 Entered together.<BR>—3 Seated together.<BR>—4 Dressed, clothed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेशः|संवेश
संवेशः<BR>—1 Sleep, retiring to rest; अथ प्रदोषे दोषज्ञः संवेशाय विशांपतिम् R. 1. 93.<BR>—2 A dream.<BR>—3 Cohabitation, copulation or a particular mode thereof.<BR>—4 A bedchamber.<BR>—5 A chair, seat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेशनम्
संवेशनम्<BR>—1 Coition, sexual union.<BR>—2 Going to bed; संवेशनोत्थापनयोः Pratimā<BR>—3 A seat, bench.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवीक्षणम्
संवीक्षणम्<BR>—1 Looking about in all directions, search, looking for anything lost.<BR>—2 Looking or gazing attentively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवीज्
संवीज् €10 P.<BR>—1 To fan; दिव्यस्त्रीकरचारुचामरमरुत्संवीज्यमानः कदा Gaṅgāṣṭaka 4.<BR>—2 To cause to stand erect (the hair of the body).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवीत|संवीतं
संवीत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Clothed, dressed; पाण्डरांशुकसंवीतां शयानां प्रमदामिव Bu. C. 4. 49.<BR>—2 Covered over, coated, overlaid; येनैवाम्बरखण्डेन संवीतो निशि चन्द्रमाः Bh. 3. 15.<BR>—3 Adorned.<BR>—4 Invested, surrounded, shut in, hemmed; स्वर्णप्राकारसंवीता (लङ्का)<BR> Rām. 7. 5. 25. 5 Overwhelmed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृ
संवृ €1. €5. €9 U.<BR>—1 To hide, cover, conceal; मुहुरङ्गुलिसंवृताधरोष्ठम् Ś. 3. 24;<BR> R. 1. 20, 7. 30.<BR>—2 To suppress, restrain, oppose; ऊचे संवरिषीष्ठास्त्वं गच्छ शत्रोः<BR> पराक्रमम् Bk. 9. 27.<BR>—3 To shut up, close.<BR>—4 To contract, compress.<BR>—5 To secure.<BR>—6 To arrange, put in order.<BR>—7 To refuse, reject.<BR>—8 To select, choose. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cover.<BR>—2 To restrain.<BR>—3 To ward off, prevent, avert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवरः|संवर|संवरं
संवरः<BR>—1 Covering.<BR>—2 Comprehension.<BR>—3 Compression, contraction.<BR>—4 A dam, bridge, causeway.<BR>—5 A kind of deer.<BR>—6 N. of a demon; see शंबर.<BR>—7 (With Jainas) Shutting out the external world.<BR>—8 Provision; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवरम्
संवरः + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Concealment.<BR>—2 Forbearance, self-control.<BR>—3 Water.<BR>—4 A particular religious observance (practised by Buddhists).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवरणम्
संवरणम्<BR>—1 Covering, screening.<BR>—2 Hiding, concealment; संवरणं हि तत् Māl. 1.<BR>—3 A pretext, disguise; see संवर also.<BR>—4 A secret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवारः|संवार
संवारः<BR>—1 Covering, closing up.<BR>—2 Contraction of the throat &c. in the pronunciation of letters, obtuse<BR> articulation (opp. विवार q. v.).<BR>—3 Diminution.<BR>—4 Protecting, securing.<BR>—5 Arranging.<BR>—6 An obstacle, impediment; प्रत्यग्रापनीतसंयमनस्य भवतोऽलघुसंवारा<BR> गतिः Mk. 7. 6, 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृत|संवृतः
संवृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Covered, covered up; रजसा संवृतं तेन नष्टज्योतिरभून्नभः<BR> Mb. 3. 11. 13; मुहुरङ्गुलिसंवृताधरोष्ठम् (मुखम्) Ś. 3. 24.<BR>—2 Hidden, concealed; न मदनो विवृतो न च संवृतः Ś. 2. 12; संवृते<BR> नरके घोरे पतितो नात्र संशयः Rām. 7. 53. 6.<BR>—3 Secret.<BR>—4 Closed, shut up, secured.<BR>—5 Retired, secluded.<BR>—6 Contracted, compressed.<BR>—7 Confiscated, sequestered.<BR>—8 Encompassed, surrounded; तथा स संवृतो धीमान् मृत्पिण्ड इव सर्वशः Mb. 3. 122. 4.<BR>—9 Filled with, full of.<BR>—10 Accompanied by; see वृ with सम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृतम्
संवृत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 A secret or retired place, secrecy.<BR>—2 A mode of pronunciation.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संवृताकार, संवृतमन्त्र, संवृतसंवार्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृताकार
संवृत + -आकार <i>a.</i> one who conceals all outward manifestation of internal<BR> feeling, one who gives no clue to his internal thoughts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृतमन्त्र
संवृत + -मन्त्र <i>a.</i> one who keeps his plans secret; तस्य संवृतमन्त्रस्य R. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृतसंवार्य|संवृतसंवार्य्य
संवृत + -संवार्य <i>a.</i> one who conceals what ought to be concealed;<BR> नित्यं संवृतसंवार्यः Ms. 7. 102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृतिः|संवृति
संवृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Covering, covering up.<BR>—2 Concealment, suppression, hiding; वदति हि संवृतिरेव कामितानि Ki. 10. 44.<BR>—3 Secret purpose, covert design.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृक्त
संवृक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Devoured, consumed.<BR>—2 Destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृत्
संवृत् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To turn or go towards, approach.<BR>—2 To attack, assault (with acc.).<BR>—3 To be or become; ते यथोक्ताः संवृत्ताः Pt. 1.<BR>—4 To happen, take place, occur.<BR>—5 To be produced, arise, spring.<BR>—6 To be accomplished.<BR>—7 To be united, meet together.<BR>—8 To fall to the lot of.<BR>—9 To be fulfilled (as time); वसाचलेऽस्मिन् मृगराजसेविते संवर्तयञ्शत्रुवधे<BR> समर्थः Rām. 4. 27. 48. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cast, throw.<BR>—2 To accomplish, fulfil; पश्येयमिति तस्याश्च कामः संवर्त्यतामयम्<BR> Rām. 7. 46. 23.<BR>—3 To wrap up, envelop.<BR>—4 To crumble up.<BR>—5 To destroy, crush.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्तः|संवर्त|संवर्त्त|संवर्त्तः
संवर्तः<BR>—1 Turning towards.<BR>—2 Dissolution, destruction; संवर्ताग्निः संदिधुक्षुर्यथैव Abhiṣeka. 1. 13.<BR>—3 The periodical destruction of the world; संवर्तप्रकटविवर्तसप्तपाथोनाथोर्मिव्यतिकरविभ्रमप्रचण्डः Mv. 6. 26.<BR>—4 A cloud.<BR>—5 A cloud of a particular class (abounding in water).<BR>—6 N. of one of the seven clouds that rise at the dissolution of the world;<BR> तुल्याः संवर्तकाभ्रैः पिदधति गगनं पङ्क्तयः पक्षतीनाम् Nāg. 4. 22.<BR>—7 A year.<BR>—8 A collection, multitude.<BR>—9 Contraction; पर्यायात् क्षणदृष्टनष्टककुभः संवर्तविस्तारयोः Mv. 5. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्तकः|संवर्तक|संवर्त्तक|संवर्त्तकः
संवर्तकः<BR>—1 A kind of cloud.<BR>—2 The fire of destruction, the fire that is to destroy the world at the<BR> period of universal destruction; इतोऽपि वडवानलः सह समस्तसंवर्तकैः Bh. 2. 76.<BR>—3 Sub-marine fire.<BR>—4 N. of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्तकम्
संवर्तकः + .{@-कम्@} The plough of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्तकिन्|संवर्त्तकिन्
संवर्तकिन् <i>m.</i> N. of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्तिः|संवर्ति|संवर्त्ति|संवर्त्तिः
संवर्तिः, संवर्तिका<BR>—1 The new leaf of a water-lily; स्मरेन्धने वक्षसि तेन दत्ता संवर्तिका<BR> शैवलवल्लिचित्रा N. 8. 76. cf. कमलिनीसंवर्तिका, अम्भोजसंवर्तिका<BR> A. R. 2. 4, 5; राजीवसंवर्तिका A. R. 2. 70.<BR>—2 The petal near the filament.<BR>—3 The flame of a lamp &c.; (दीपादेः शिखा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्तिका|संवर्त्तिका
संवर्तिः, संवर्तिका<BR>—1 The new leaf of a water-lily; स्मरेन्धने वक्षसि तेन दत्ता संवर्तिका<BR> शैवलवल्लिचित्रा N. 8. 76. cf. कमलिनीसंवर्तिका, अम्भोजसंवर्तिका<BR> A. R. 2. 4, 5; राजीवसंवर्तिका A. R. 2. 70.<BR>—2 The petal near the filament.<BR>—3 The flame of a lamp &c.; (दीपादेः शिखा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1591-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्तित
संवर्तित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Rolled up, enveloped.<BR>—2 Similar to the period of कल्पान्त; संवर्तितमिवाकाशं जलदैः सुमहाद्भुतैः Mb. 1. 26. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृत्त|संवृत्तः
संवृत्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Become, happened, occurred; इदानीमस्मि संवृत्तः सचेताः प्रकृतिं<BR> गतः Bg. 11. 51.<BR>—2 Fulfilled, accomplished.<BR>—3 Collected, heaped together.<BR>—4 Past, gone.<BR>—5 Covered.<BR>—6 Furnished with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृत्तः|संवृत्त
संवृत्त + .{@-त्तः@} N. of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृत्तिः|संवृत्ति
संवृत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Becoming, happening, occurrence.<BR>—2 Accomplishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृध्
संवृध् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To grow up, increase, be developed.<BR>—2 To fulfil, satisfy. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To rear, nourish, cherish, bring up, foster; संवर्धितानां सुतनिर्विशेषम् R. 5. 6.<BR>—2 To plant.<BR>—3 To enlarge, augment.<BR>—4 To fulfil, satisfy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्धक|संवर्द्धकः
संवर्धक <i>a.</i> (-र्धिका <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Causing complete growth or prosperity, augmenting.<BR>—2 Greeting, welcoming (guests &c.), hospitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्धनम्
संवर्धनम्<BR>—1 Bringing up, rearing, fostering.<BR>—2 Complete growth, thriving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवर्धित|संवर्द्धितः
संवर्धित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Brought up, bred, reared; संवर्धितानां सुतनिर्विशेषम् R. 5. 6.<BR>—2 Increased.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृद्ध
संवृद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Full-grown, increased, augmented.<BR>—2 Grown tall or high, big, large.<BR>—3 Prospering, blooming, flourishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवृद्धिः|संवृद्धि
संवृद्धिः<BR>—1 Full growth.<BR>—2 Might, power.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेगः|संवेग
संवेगः<BR>—1 Agitation, flurry, excitement; हृन्मर्मभेदिपतदुत्कटकङ्कपत्त्रसंवेगतत्क्षणकृतस्फुटदङ्गभङ्गा Mv. 1. 39.<BR>—2 Voilent speed, impetuosity, vehemence; कुतश्चित् संवेगात् प्रचल<BR> इव शल्यस्य शकलः U. 2. 26; Māl. 5. 6.<BR>—3 Haste, speed.<BR>—4 Agonising pain, poignancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संवेल्लित
संवेल्लित = संवर्धित; Māl. 5. 19 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संव्यस्
संव्यस् (सं + वि + अस् €4 P.) To compose, bring together; व्यासः<BR> पुराणसूत्रं तत् संव्यस्य विपुलं महत् Brav. P. (ब्रह्मखण्ड) 1. 62;<BR> सर्वं कथय संव्यस्य ब्रह्मखण्डमनुत्तमम् <i>ibid.</i> 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संव्यवहारः|संव्यवहार
संव्यवहारः<BR>—1 Duty, business; संव्यवहारात् शौचं मैत्रतां दृढभक्तिं च परीक्षेत Kau. A. 1. 9.<BR>—2 Mercantile transaction, calling, trade; अपि प्रचीयन्ते संव्यवहाराणां<BR> वृद्धिलाभाः Mu. 1; see व्यवहार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संव्यूहः|संव्यूह
संव्यूहः Combination, arrangement; वद नः सर्गसंव्यूहं गार्भस्वेदद्विजोद्भिदाम्<BR> Bhāg. 3. 7. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संव्ये
संव्ये €1 U.<BR>—1 To clothe, put on clothes.<BR>—2 To surround, enclose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संव्यानम्
संव्यानम्<BR>—1 Covering, wrapping.<BR>—2 Cloth, vesture, garment.<BR>—3 An upper garment; संव्यानानामन्तकान्तःपुरस्य Śi. 18. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशप्तकः|संशप्तक
संशप्तकः [सम्यक् शप्तमङ्गीकारो यस्य कप् Tv.]<BR>—1 A warrior sworn never to recede from a contest and kept to<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">Page1592-2</a>]<BR> prevent the flight of others; संशप्तकान्निहतानर्जुनेन तदा नाशंसे<BR> विजयाय संजय Mb. 1. 1. 189.<BR>—2 A picked warrior.<BR>—3 A brother in arms.<BR>—4 A conspirator who has taken an oath to kill another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशब्दः|संशब्द
संशब्दः Mention, reference; परिजनानुरागविरचितशबलसंशब्द …<BR> Bhāg. 5. 3. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशब्दनम्
संशब्दनम्<BR>—1 Making a sound.<BR>—2 Praising.<BR>—3 Calling out to.<BR>—4 Referring to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशम्
संशम् €4 P.<BR>—1 To be calm.<BR>—2 To be allayed or extinguished, disappear; सत्त्वं संशाम्यतीव मे Bk. 18. 28.<BR>—3 To be removed. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To mitigate.<BR>—2 To settle, decide; बुद्ध्या संशमयन्ति नीतिकुशलाः साम्नैव ते मन्त्रिणः Pt. 1. 376.<BR>—3 To end, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशमः|संशम
संशमः Complete ease, comfort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशमनम्
संशमनम्<BR>—1 Pacification.<BR>—2 A sedative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशरणम्
संशरणम्<BR>—1 Commencement of a combat, attack, charge.<BR>—2 Seeking refuge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशित|संशितं
संशित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Sharpened, aroused; ततस्ते सूदिताः सर्वे मम बाणाः सुसंशिताः<BR> Mb. 5. 180. 22.<BR>—2 Sharp, acute.<BR>—3 Thoroughly completed, effected, accomplished.<BR>—4 Decided, well-ascertained, determined, certain.<BR>—5 Effecting, diligent in performing.<BR>—6 Firmly adhering to (a vow); उपोष्य संशितो भूत्वा हित्वा वेदकृताः<BR> श्रुतीः Mb. 12. 265. 7.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संशितात्मन्, संशितव्रत<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशितात्मन्
संशित + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> one whose mind is thoroughly matured or disciplined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशितव्रत
संशित + -व्रत <i>a.</i> one who has fulfilled his vow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशी
संशी €2 Ā.<BR>—1 To waver, be in doubt or suspense, be uncertain or irresolute; संशय्य<BR> कर्णादिषु तिष्ठते यः Ki. 3. 14, 42; Bv. 2. 115.<BR>—2 To lie down for rest, sleep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयः|संशय
संशयः<BR>—1 Doubt, uncertainty, irresolution, hesitation; मनस्तु मे संशयमेव<BR> गाहते Ku. 5. 46; त्वदन्यः संशयस्यास्य छेत्ता न ह्युपपद्यते Bg. 6. 36.<BR>—2 Misgiving, suspicion.<BR>—3 Doubt or indecision (in Nyāya), one of the 16 categories mentioned<BR> in the Nyāya philosophy; एकधर्मिकविरुद्धभावाभावप्रकारकं ज्ञानं<BR> संशयः; it is also regarded as one of the two kinds of अयथार्थज्ञान.<BR>—4 Danger, peril, risk; न संशयमनारुह्य नरो भद्राणि पश्यति H. 1. 7;<BR> याता पुनः संशयमन्यथैव Māl. 10. 13; Ki. 13. 16; Ve. 6. 1.<BR>—5 Possibility.<BR>—6 A subject of dispute or controversy; अग्निहोत्रादहमभ्यागताऽस्मि विप्रर्षभाणां<BR> संशयच्छेदनाय Mb. 3. 186. 22.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संशयाक्षेपः, संशयात्मन्, संशयापन्न, संशयोपेत, संशयस्थ, संशयोपमा, संशयगत, संशयच्छेदः, संशयच्छेदिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयाक्षेपः|संशयाक्षेप
संशयः + -आक्षेपः a particular figure of speech (‘removal of doubt’); किमयं<BR> शरदम्भोदः किंवा हंसकदम्बकम् । रुतं नूपुरसंवादि श्रूयते तन्न<BR> तोयदः ॥ इत्ययं संशयाक्षेपः संशयो यन्निवार्यते । Kāv. 2. 163-4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयात्मन्
संशयः + -आत्मन् <i>a.</i> doubting, sceptical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयापन्न
संशयः + -आपन्न, -उपेत, -स्थ <i>a.</i> doubtful, uncertain, irresolute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयोपेत
संशयः + -आपन्न, -उपेत, -स्थ <i>a.</i> doubtful, uncertain, irresolute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयस्थ
संशयः + -आपन्न, -उपेत, -स्थ <i>a.</i> doubtful, uncertain, irresolute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयोपमा
संशयः + -उपमा a comparison expressed in the form of a doubt; किं पद्ममन्तर्भ्रान्तालि<BR> किं ते लोलेक्षणं मुखम् । मम दोलायते चित्तमितीयं संशयोपमा ॥ Kāv. 2. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयगत
संशयः + -गत <i>a.</i> fallen into danger; Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयच्छेदः|संशयच्छेद
संशयः + -छेदः solution of a doubt, decision.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयच्छेदिन्
संशयः + -छेदिन् <i>a.</i> clearing all doubt, decisive; Ś. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1592-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयान|संशयानः
संशयान, संशयालु, संशयितृ <i>a.</i> Doubtful, irresolute,<BR> uncertain, wavering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयालु|संशयालुः
संशयान, संशयालु, संशयितृ <i>a.</i> Doubtful, irresolute,<BR> uncertain, wavering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयितृ
संशयान, संशयालु, संशयितृ <i>a.</i> Doubtful, irresolute,<BR> uncertain, wavering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयित
संशयित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Doubtful, uncertain.<BR>—2 Doubted, questioned.<BR>—3 Risked, hazarded, endangered, exposed to peril or danger; संशयितजीविता<BR> ते शरीरावस्था Māl. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशयितम्
संशयित + .{@-तम्@} Doubt, uncertainty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशीतिः|संशीति
संशीतिः <i>f.</i> Doubt; न हि मे संशीतिरस्या दिव्यतां प्रति K. 132.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशीलनम्
संशीलनम्<BR>—1 Regular practice.<BR>—2 Frequent intercourse with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशुध्
संशुध् €4 P. To be completely purified. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To purify completely.<BR>—2 To clear, pay off (expenses).<BR>—3 To correct, rectify.<BR>—4 To examine, inquire into, investigate.<BR>—5 To clear, secure (a road against attack); संशोध्य त्रिविधं मार्गम् Ms. 7. 185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशुद्ध
संशुद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Completely purified, pure; त्रिवर्गभयसंशुद्धान् (अमात्यान्)<BR> Kau. A. 1. 10; प्रयत्नाद्यतमानस्तु योगी संशुद्धकिल्बिषः Bg. 6. 45.<BR>—2 Polished, refined.<BR>—3 Expiated.<BR>—4 Acquitted (of crime or debt).<BR>—5 Searched, tried, examined; वेषाभरणसंशुद्धाः स्पृशेयुः सुसमाहिताः Ms. 7. 219.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशुद्धिः|संशुद्धि
संशुद्धिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Complete purification; अभयं सत्त्वसंशुद्धिर्ज्ञानयोगव्यवस्थितिः Bg. 16. 1.<BR>—2 Cleansing or purifying in general.<BR>—3 Correction, rectification.<BR>—4 Clearance.<BR>—5 Acquittance (of debt).<BR>—6 Purity, cleanness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशोधनम्
संशोधनम् Purification, cleanness &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशून
संशून <i>p. p.</i> Much swelled, swollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्चत्
संश्चत् <i>n.</i> Trick, jugglery, illusion. ━<i>m.</i> A juggler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्यान|संश्यानः
संश्यान <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Contracted, shrunk up.<BR>—2 Frozen, congealed.<BR>—3 Rolled up.<BR>—4 Collapsed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रि
संश्रि €1 U.<BR>—1 To have recourse to, resort, fly to for refuge or shelter.<BR>—2 To lean or rest on, depend on; न खलु बहिरुपाधीन् प्रीतयः संश्रयन्ते<BR> U. 6. 12; Māl. 1. 24.<BR>—3 To attain to, approach.<BR>—4 To obtain; संश्रयत्येव तच्छीलं नरोऽल्पमपि वा बहु Ms. 10. 60.<BR>—5 To serve, wait upon.<BR>—6 To join, unite with.<BR>—7 To approach for sexual union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रयः|संश्रय
संश्रयः<BR>—1 A resting or dwelling place, residence, habitation; त्वं सदा संश्रयः<BR> शैल स्वर्गमार्गाभिकाङ्क्षिणाम् Mb. 3. 42. 22; परस्परविरोधिन्योरेकसंश्रयदुर्लभम्<BR> V. 5. 24; R. 6. 41; oft. at the end of comp. in this sense and translated<BR> by ‘residing with’, ‘relating or pertaining to’, ‘with reference to’;<BR> ज्ञातिकुलैकसंश्रयाम् Ś. 5. 17; नौसंश्रयः R. 16. 57; U. 3. 17;<BR> मनोरथोऽस्याः शशिमौलिसंश्रयः Ku. 5. 60; द्विसंश्रयां प्रीतिमवाप<BR> लक्ष्मीः 1. 43; एकार्थसंश्रयमुभयोः प्रयोगम् M. 1.<BR>—2 Seeking protection or shelter with, fleeing for refuge, forming or<BR> seeking alliance, leaguing together for mutual protection; one of the 6<BR> guṇas or expedients in politics; see under गुण also; संश्रयवृत्तिः<BR> Kau. A. 7; Ms. 7. 160.<BR>—3 Resort, refuge, asylum, protection, shelter;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">Page1593-2</a>]<BR> अनपायिनि संश्रयद्रुमे गजभग्ने पतनाय वल्लरी Ku. 4. 31; Me. 17; Pt. 1. 22.<BR>—4 Attachment (for home, relatives &c.); तथा प्रयत्नं कुर्वीत यथा<BR> मुच्येत संश्रयात् Mb. 12. 293. 20.<BR>—5 A piece or portion belonging to anything.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संश्रयकृत, संश्रयकारित<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रयकृत
संश्रयः + -कृत, -कारित <i>p. p.</i> caused by alliance; यदि तत्रापि संपश्येद्दोषं<BR> संश्रयकारितम् Ms. 7. 176.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रयकारित
संश्रयः + -कृत, -कारित <i>p. p.</i> caused by alliance; यदि तत्रापि संपश्येद्दोषं<BR> संश्रयकारितम् Ms. 7. 176.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रयणम्
संश्रयणम् Attachment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रित|संश्रितः
संश्रित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Gone to for refuge.<BR>—2 Supported, sheltered.<BR>—3 United, joined; चूतेन संश्रितवती नवमालिकेयम् Ś. 4. 13.<BR>—4 Clung to, embraced.<BR>—5 Inherent in, peculiar to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रितः|संश्रित
संश्रित + .{@-तः@} A dependent, follower, servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रु
संश्रु €5 U.<BR>—1 To listen to; संशृणोति न चोक्तानि Bk. 5. 19, 6. 5; (but Ātm.<BR> when used intransitively); हितान्न यः संशृणुते स किंप्रभुः Ki. 1. 5.<BR>—2 To promise. ━<i>Caus.</i> To tell, narrate, report.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रवः|संश्रव
संश्रवः<BR>—1 Hearing attentively; असंश्रवे चैव गुरोर्न किंचिदपि कीर्तयेत् Ms. 2. 203.<BR>—2 A promise, an agreement, engagement; पापं कृत्वेव किमिदं मम संश्रुत्य<BR> संश्रवम् Rām. 2. 14. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रवणम्
संश्रवणम्<BR>—1 Hearing.<BR>—2 The ear.<BR>—3 The range of hearing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रवस्
संश्रवस् <i>n.</i> Perfect glory or renown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्रुत|संश्रुतः
संश्रुत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Promised, agreed to; देवानां समयस्त्वेष वसूनां संश्रुतो मया<BR> Mb. 1. 98. 22; द्विजस्य संश्रुतोऽर्थो मे जीवयिष्यामि ते सुतम् Rām. 7. 76. 12.<BR>—2 Well-heard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्लिष्
संश्लिष् €4 P.<BR>—1 To clasp or press together.<BR>—2 To adhere or cling to.<BR>—3 To join, unite. ━<i>Caus.</i> To unite, join, connect together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्लिष्ट|संश्लिष्टः
संश्लिष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Clasped or pressed together, joined, united.<BR>—2 Embraced.<BR>—3 Adjoining, lying close or contiguous to.<BR>—4 Furnished or endowed with, having.<BR>—5 Related, connected together; यथा छायातपौ नित्यं सुसंबद्धौ परस्परम् ।<BR> एवं कर्म च कर्ता च संश्लिष्टावितरेतरम् ॥ Pt. 2. 127.<BR>—6 Confused, indeterminate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्लिष्टः|संश्लिष्ट
संश्लिष्ट + .{@-ष्टः@} A kind of pavilion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्लिष्टम्
संश्लिष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@} A heap, mass, multitude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्लेषः|संश्लेष
संश्लेषः<BR>—1 Embracing; an embrace; वशिनां हि परपरिग्रहसंश्लेषपराङ्मुखी<BR> वृत्तिः Ś. 5. 28.<BR>—2 Union, connection, contact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्लेषणम्
संश्लेषणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Pressing together.<BR>—2 Means of binding together.<BR>—3 Connection, tie, bond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्लेषणा
संश्लेषणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Pressing together.<BR>—2 Means of binding together.<BR>—3 Connection, tie, bond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संश्वत्
संश्वत् See संश्चत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसञ्ज्|संसंज्
संसञ्ज् <i>Pass.</i> To be attached or connected together, be joined<BR> or linked together; see संसक्त below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसक्त|संसक्तः
संसक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Adhered or stuck together.<BR>—2 Adhering or clinging to, attached to, sticking close to.<BR>—3 Joined or linked together, closely connected; प्रान्तेषु संसक्तनमेरुशाखम्<BR> Ku. 3. 43; R. 7. 24.<BR>—4 Near, contiguous, adjoining.<BR>—5 Confused, mixed, mingled, blended;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">Page1594-1</a>]<BR> मदमुखरमयूरीमुक्तसंसक्तकेकः Māl. 9. 5; कलिन्दकन्या मथुरां<BR> गताऽपि गङ्गोर्मिसंसक्तजलेव भाति R. 6. 48; Māl. 5. 11.<BR>—6 Intent on.<BR>—7 Endowed with, possessed of.<BR>—8 Fastened, restrained.<BR>—9 Given to the mundane pleasures.<BR>—10 Enamoured.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संसक्तचेतस्, संसक्तमनस्, संसक्तयुग<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1593-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसक्तचेतस्
संसक्त + -चेतस्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> having the mind fixed or attached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसक्तमनस्
संसक्त + -चेतस्, -मनस् <i>a.</i> having the mind fixed or attached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसक्तयुग
संसक्त + -युग <i>a.</i> yoked, harnessed; ग्रीवाग्रसंसक्तयुगैस्तुरङ्गैः Śi. 3. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसज्जमान
संसज्जमान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Adhering, sticking close together.<BR>—2 Hesitating, stammering (through sorrow); (उवाच) वाङ्मात्रेण न<BR> भावेन वाचा संसज्जमानया Rām. 2. 25. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसक्तिः|संसक्ति
संसक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Close adherence, intimate union or junction; संसक्तौ किमसुलभं<BR> महोदयानाम् Ki. 7. 27.<BR>—2 Close contact, proximity.<BR>—3 Intercourse, intimacy, intimate acquaintance; संसक्तिं मृशमपि<BR> भूरिशोऽवधूतैः Śi. 8. 67.<BR>—4 Tying, fastening together.<BR>—5 Devotion, addiction (to anything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसद्
संसद् €1. €6 P.<BR>—1 To sit down; sit down together.<BR>—2 To be afflicted, be in distress.<BR>—3 To pine away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसद्
संसद् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 An assembly, meeting, circle; संसत्सु जाते पुरुषाधिकारे Ki. 3. 51;<BR> छात्रसंसदि लब्धकीर्तिः Pt. 1; R. 16. 24.<BR>—2 A court of justice; अपह्नवेऽधमर्णस्य देहीत्युक्तस्य संसदि Ms. 8. 52.<BR>—3 A multitude, number; विविक्तदेशसेवित्वमरतिर्जनसंसदि Bg. 13. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसदनम्
संसदनम् Dejection, depression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसादः|संसाद
संसादः An assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसह
संसह <i>a.</i> Equal to, match for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसाध्
संसाध् <i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To be successful.<BR>—2 To accomplish, complete; सर्वान् संसाधयेदर्थानक्षिण्वन् योगतस्तनुम् Ms. 2. 100.<BR>—3 To secure, get, obtain.<BR>—4 To settle.<BR>—5 To regain; यः स्वयं साधयेदर्थमुत्तमर्णोऽधमर्णिकात् Ms. 8. 50.<BR>—6 To cause to be settled or paid; यदि संसाधयेत्तत्तु दर्पाल्लोभेन<BR> वा पुनः Ms. 8. 213.<BR>—7 To destroy, kill.<BR>—8 To extinguish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसाधनम्
संसाधनम्<BR>—1 Performance, accomplishment; संसाधनार्थं प्रययुः क्षत्रियाः क्षत्रियर्षभम् Mb. 5. 83. 32.<BR>—2 Preparation; Kull. on Ms. 11. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसिध्
संसिध् €4 P.<BR>—1 To be made perfect.<BR>—2 To be fully accomplished or effected, to be well-performed.<BR>—3 To attain supreme felicity, to become happy; जप्येनैव तु संसिध्येत्<BR> ब्राह्मणो नात्र संशयः Ms. 2. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसिद्ध
संसिद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Fully accomplished, perfected.<BR>—2 One who has secured final emancipation.<BR>—3 Dressed, prepared (as food).<BR>—4 Healed, cured.<BR>—5 Clever, skilled.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संसिद्धार्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसिद्धार्थ
संसिद्ध + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> one who has attained his goal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसिद्धिः|संसिद्धि
संसिद्धिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Completion, complete accomplishment or attainment; स्वनुष्ठितस्य<BR> धर्मस्य संसिद्धिर्हरितोषणम् Bhāg. 1. 2. 13; Ku. 2. 63; Ms. 6. 29.<BR>—2 Absolution, final beatitude; संसिद्धिं परमां गताः Bg. 8. 15, 3. 20.<BR>—3 Nature, natural disposition, state or quality.<BR>—4 A passionate<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">Page1594-2</a>]<BR> or intoxicated woman.<BR>—5 The last consequence, result.<BR>—6 The last decisive word.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसुखित
संसुखित <i>p. p.</i> Perfectly delighted or gratified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसूच्
संसूच् €10 U.<BR>—1 To indicate, forebode; संयोगो हि वियोगस्य संसूचयति संभवम् Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 To inform, tell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसूचनम्
संसूचनम्<BR>—1 Showing plainly, proving.<BR>—2 Informing, telling.<BR>—3 Hinting, intimating; अर्थस्य संसूचनम्.<BR>—4 Reproaching, accusing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृ
संसृ €1 P.<BR>—1 To go towards, approach.<BR>—2 To revolve, turn round.<BR>—3 To spread.<BR>—4 To move.<BR>—5 To go or flow together.<BR>—6 To go to, obtain; पापान् संसृत्य संसारान् प्रेष्यतां यान्ति शत्रुषु Ms. 12. 70.<BR>—7 To come forth. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To spread over, cause to move over.<BR>—2 To revolve or turn round; जन्मवृद्धिक्षयैर्नित्यं संसारयति चक्रवत् Ms. 12. 124.<BR>—3 To put off, defer.<BR>—4 To use, employ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसरणम्
संसरणम्<BR>—1 Going, proceeding, revolution.<BR>—2 The world, worldly life, mundane existence; पुंसो भवेद्यर्हि संसरणापवर्गः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 40. 28; ग्रीष्मचण्डकरमण्डलभीष्मज्वालसंसरणतापितमूर्तेः Bv. 4. 6.<BR>—3 Birth and re-birth.<BR>—4 The unresisted march of troops.<BR>—5 The commencement of battle.<BR>—6 A highway.<BR>—7 A resting-place for passengers near the gates of a city.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारः|संसार
संसारः<BR>—1 Course, passage.<BR>—2 The course or circuit of worldly life, secular life, mundane existence,<BR> the world; न स तत् पदमाप्नोति संसारं चाधिगच्छति Kaṭh. 3. 7;<BR> असारः संसारः U. 1; Māl. 5. 30; संसारधन्वभुवि किं सारमामृशसि<BR> शंसाधुना शुभमते Aśvad. 22; or परिवर्तिनि संसारे मृतः को वा<BR> न जायते Pt. 1. 27.<BR>—3 Transmigration, metempsychosis, succession of births.<BR>—4 Worldly illusion.<BR>—5 The state (future) of life (गति); येन यस्तु गुणेनैषां संसारान्<BR> प्रतिपद्यते Ms. 12. 39.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संसारगमनम्, संसारगुरुः, संसारचक्रम्, संसारपथः, संसारमार्गः, संसारमोक्षः, संसारमोक्षणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारगमनम्
संसारः + -गमनम् transmigration; संसारगमनं चैव त्रिविधं कर्मसंभवम् Ms. 1. 117.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारगुरुः|संसारगुरु
संसारः + -गुरुः<BR>—1 an epithet of the god of love.<BR>—2 the preceptor of the world.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारचक्रम्
संसारः + -चक्रम् succession of births and deaths, metempsychosis.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारपथः|संसारपथ
संसारः + -पथः, -मार्गः<BR>—1 the course of worldly affairs, worldly life.<BR>—2 the vulva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारमार्गः|संसारमार्ग
संसारः + -पथः, -मार्गः<BR>—1 the course of worldly affairs, worldly life.<BR>—2 the vulva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारमोक्षः|संसारमोक्ष
संसारः + -मोक्षः, -मोक्षणम् final liberation or emancipation from worldly life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारमोक्षणम्
संसारः + -मोक्षः, -मोक्षणम् final liberation or emancipation from worldly life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसारिन्
संसारिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Mundane, worldly, transmigratory. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A sentient being, creature.<BR>—2 The embodied spirit, individual soul (जीवात्मन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृतिः|संसृति
संसृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Course, current, flow.<BR>—2 The worldly life, course of the world; यर्हि संसृतिबन्धोऽयमात्मनो<BR> गुणवृत्तिदः Bhāg. 11. 13. 28.<BR>—3 Metempsychosis, transmigration; किं मां निपातयसि संसृतिगर्तमध्ये<BR> Bv. 4. 32; Śi. 14. 63; cf. संसार.<BR>—4 The state or course (गति); एताः संसृतयः पुंसो गुणकर्मनिबन्धनाः<BR> Bhāg. 11. 25. 32.^1<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20251211. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/102.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृज्
संसृज् €6 P.<BR>—1 To mix, mingle, unite with, bring in contact with; संसृज्यते सरसिजैररुणांशुभिन्नैः<BR> R. 5. 69; अस्ना रक्षः संसृजतात् Ait. Br.<BR>—2 To join, meet; सौमित्रिणा तदनु<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">Page1595-1</a>]<BR> संससृजे R. 13. 73; Ku. 7. 74.<BR>—3 To create, form.<BR>—4 To endow or furnish with.<BR>—5 To embrace; स्वेदः स्वदेहस्य वियोगतापं निर्वापयिष्यन्निव संसिसृक्षोः N. 14. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1594-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्गः|संसर्ग
संसर्गः<BR>—1 Commixture, junction, union.<BR>—2 Contact, company, association, society; न संसर्गं व्रजेत् सद्भिः<BR> प्रायश्चित्तेऽकृते द्विजः Ms. 11. 47; संसर्गमुक्तिः खलेषु Bh. 2. 62; Ś. 1. 3.<BR>—3 Proximity, touch.<BR>—4 Intercourse, familiarity.<BR>—5 Copulation, sexual union; नानागन्धर्वमिथुनैः पानसंसर्गकर्कशैः<BR> Rām. 4. 67. 45; प्रत्याहारेण संसर्गान् ध्यानेनानीश्वरान् गुणान् Ms. 6. 72.<BR>—6 Co-existence, intimate relation.<BR>—7 Confusion.<BR>—8 A particular conjunction of celestial bodies.<BR>—9 A particular combination of two humours which produces diseases.<BR>—10 Point of intersection.<BR>—11 Duration; Mb. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संसर्गाभावः, संसर्गदोषः, संसर्गविद्या<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्गाभावः|संसर्गाभाव
संसर्गः + -अभावः one of the two main kinds of non-existence, relative non-existence,<BR> which is of three kinds: प्रागभाव antecedent, प्रध्वंसाभाव emergent,<BR> and अत्यन्ताभाव absolute, non-existence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्गदोषः|संसर्गदोष
संसर्गः + -दोषः the fault or evil consequences resulting from association,<BR> especially with bad people.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्गविद्या
संसर्गः + -विद्या<BR>—1 learning by social intercourse; Kau. A. 1. 12.<BR>—2 Social science.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्गिन्
संसर्गिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 United, associated with.<BR>—2 Keeping company with, familiar. ━<i>m.</i> An associate, a companion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्गी
संसर्गी (In medic.) Purification, purging.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्जनम्
संसर्जनम्<BR>—1 Commingling.<BR>—2 Leaving, abandoning.<BR>—3 Discharging, voiding.<BR>—4 Attracting, winning over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्ट|संसृष्टः
संसृष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Commingled, mixed or united together, conjoined.<BR>—2 Associated or connected together as partners.<BR>—3 Composed.<BR>—4 Reunited.<BR>—5 Involved in.<BR>—6 Created.<BR>—7 Cleanly dressed.<BR>—8 Accomplished, performed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टम्
संसृष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@} Intimacy, friendship.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संसृष्टभावः, संसृष्टरूप<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टभावः|संसृष्टभाव
संसृष्ट + -भावः near relationship, friendship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टरूप
संसृष्ट + -रूप <i>a.</i> adulterated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टता
संसृष्टता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Association, union.<BR>—2 (In law) Voluntary reunion in pecuniary interest of kinsmen (as of<BR> father and son or of brothers after the partition of property).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टत्वम्
संसृष्टता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Association, union.<BR>—2 (In law) Voluntary reunion in pecuniary interest of kinsmen (as of<BR> father and son or of brothers after the partition of property).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टिः|संसृष्टि
संसृष्टिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Combination, union.<BR>—2 Association, intercourse, co-partnership.<BR>—3 Living in one family; see संसृष्टता (2) above.<BR>—4 A collection.<BR>—5 Collecting, assembling.<BR>—6 (In Rhet.) The combination or co-existence of two or more independent<BR> figures of speech in one passage; मिथोऽनपेक्षयैतेषां (शब्दार्थालंकाराणां)<BR> स्थितिः संसृष्टिरुच्यते S. D. 756.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृष्टिन्
संसृष्टिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A reunited kinsman.<BR>—2 A co-partner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसृप्
संसृप् €1 P.<BR>—1 To move; संसर्पन्त्या सपदि भवतः स्रोतसि च्छाययासौ Me. 53.<BR>—2 To move along, flow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्पः|संसर्प
संसर्पः<BR>—1 Creeping along, gliding or gentle motion.<BR>—2 The intercalary month occurring in a year in which there occurs a <i>Kṣaya-māsa</i><BR> (क्षयमास).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्पणम्
संसर्पणम्<BR>—1 Creeping along.<BR>—2 Surprise, unexpected attack, sally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसर्पिन्
संसर्पिन् <i>a.</i> Creeping along, moving or winding near; कपोलसंसर्पिशिखः<BR> स तस्या मुहूर्तकर्णोत्पलतां प्रपेदे Ku. 7. 81.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसेकः|संसेक
संसेकः Sprinkling, watering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसेव्
संसेव् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To be associated with.<BR>—2 To wait upon, attend.<BR>—3 To refresh, fan.<BR>—4 To court, fondle (carnally).<BR>—5 To be addicted or devoted to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संसेवा
संसेवा<BR>—1 Visiting, frequenting.<BR>—2 Use, employment.<BR>—3 Reverence, worship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृ
संस्कृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To adorn, grace, decorate; ककुभं समस्कुरुत माघवनीम् Śi. 9. 25.<BR>—2 To refine, polish; वाण्येका समलंकरोति पुरुषं या संस्कृता धार्यते<BR> Bh. 2. 19; Śi. 14. 50.<BR>—3 To consecrate by repeating Mantras; मन्त्रैस्तु संस्कृतानद्याच्छाश्वतं<BR> विधिमास्थितः Ms. 5. 36.<BR>—4 To purify (a person) by scriptural ceremonies, perform purificatory<BR> ceremonies over (a person); संचस्कारोभयप्रीत्या मैथिलेयौ यथाविधि<BR> R. 15. 31; Y. 2. 124.<BR>—5 To cultivate, educate, train; आर्योपदेशसंस्क्रियमाणमतयः Mu. 3.<BR>—6 To make ready, prepare, equip, fit out; जीवां भूयो रघुपतिवृषा स्पर्शतः<BR> संस्करोति Mv. 6. 37; Ms. 9. 279; Mu. 3.<BR>—7 To cook, dress (food).<BR>—8 To purify, cleanse.<BR>—9 To collect, heap together.<BR>—10 To construct, form well or thoroughly.<BR>—11 To accumulate; ये पक्षापरपक्षदोषसहिताः पापानि संस्कुर्वते<BR> Mk. 9. 4 (v. l.).<BR>—12 To correct (astronomically).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्करणम्
संस्करणम्<BR>—1 Preparing, putting together.<BR>—2 Cremating (a corpse).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कर्तृ|संस्कर्त्तृ
संस्कर्तृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 One who dresses, cooks, prepares &c.; Ms. 5. 51.<BR>—2 One who consecrates, initiates &c.; कष्टं सीतापि सुतयोः संस्कर्तारं<BR> न विन्दति U. 7. 13.<BR>—3 One who produces impression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कारः|संस्कार
संस्कारः<BR>—1 Making perfect, refining, polishing; (मणिः) प्रयुक्तसंस्कार इवाधिकं<BR> बभौ R. 3. 18.<BR>—2 Refinement, perfection, grammatical purity (as of words); संस्कारवत्येव<BR> गिरा मनीषी Ku. 1. 28 (where Malli. renders the word by व्याकरणजन्या<BR> शुद्धिः); R. 15. 76.<BR>—3 Education, cultivation, training (as of the mind); निसर्गसंस्कारविनीत<BR> इत्यसौ नृपेण चक्रे युवराजशब्दभाक् R. 3. 35; Ku. 7. 10.<BR>—4 Making ready, preparation.<BR>—5 Cooking, dressing (as of food &c.).<BR>—6 Embellishment, decoration, ornament; स्वभावसुन्दरं वस्तु न संस्कारमपेक्षते<BR> Dṛ. Ś. 49; Ś. 7. 23; Mu. 2. 10.<BR>—7 Consecration, sanctification, hallowing; संस्कारो नाम स भवति<BR> यस्मिञ्जाते पदार्थो भवति योग्यः कस्यचिदर्थस्य ŚB. on MS. 3. 1. 3.<BR>—8 Impression, form, mould, operation, influence; यन्नवे भाजने लग्नः<BR> संस्कारो नान्यथा भवेत् H. Pr. 8; Bh. 3. 84.<BR>—9 Idea, notion, conception.<BR>—10 Any faculty or capacity.<BR>—11 Effect of work, merit of action; फलानुमेयाः प्रारम्भाः संस्काराः<BR> प्राक्तना इव R. 1. 20.<BR>—12 The self-reproductive quality, faculty of impression; one of the 24 qualities<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">Page1596-1</a>]<BR> or guṇas recognised by the Vaiśeṣikas; it is of three kinds: भावना,<BR> वेग, and स्थितिस्थापकता qq. vv.<BR>—13 The faculty of recollection, impression on the memory; संस्कारमात्रजन्यं<BR> ज्ञानं स्मृतिः T. S.<BR>—14 A purificatory rite, a sacred rite or ceremony; संस्कारार्थं शरीरस्य<BR> Ms. 2. 66; R. 10. 78; (Manu mentions 12 such Saṃskāras viz. 1 गर्भाधान,<BR> 2 पुंसवन, 3 सीमन्तोन्नयन, 4 जातकर्मन्, 5 नामकर्मन्,<BR> 6 निष्क्रमण, 7 अन्नप्राशन, 8 चूडाकर्मन्, 9 उपनयन,<BR> 10 केशान्त, 11 समावर्तन, and 12 विवाह; see Ms. 2. 26<BR> &c.; some writers increase the number to sixteen).<BR>—15 Purification, purity.<BR>—16 A rite or ceremony in general.<BR>—17 Investiture with the sacred thread; मांसं मूत्रं पुरीषं च प्राश्य<BR> संस्कारमर्हति Mb. 12. 165. 76.<BR>—18 Obsequial ceremonies.<BR>—19 A polishing stone; संस्कारोल्लिखितो महामणिरिव क्षीणोऽपि नालक्ष्यते<BR> Ś. 6. 5 (where संस्कार may mean ‘polishing’ also).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संस्कारपूत, संस्कारभूषणम्, संस्काररहित, संस्कारवर्जित, संस्कारहीन, संस्कारशब्दः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1595-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कारपूत
संस्कारः + -पूत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 purified by sacred rites.<BR>—2 purified by refinement or education.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कारभूषणम्
संस्कारः + -भूषणम् (speech) adorned by correctness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्काररहित
संस्कारः + -रहित, -वर्जित, -हीन <i>a.</i> (a person of one of the three<BR> higher castes) over whom the purificatory ceremonies, particularly the<BR> thread-ceremony, have not been performed and who therefore becomes a Vrātya<BR> or outcast; cf. व्रात्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कारवर्जित|संस्कारवर्ज्जितः
संस्कारः + -रहित, -वर्जित, -हीन <i>a.</i> (a person of one of the three<BR> higher castes) over whom the purificatory ceremonies, particularly the<BR> thread-ceremony, have not been performed and who therefore becomes a Vrātya<BR> or outcast; cf. व्रात्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कारहीन|संस्कारहीनः
संस्कारः + -रहित, -वर्जित, -हीन <i>a.</i> (a person of one of the three<BR> higher castes) over whom the purificatory ceremonies, particularly the<BR> thread-ceremony, have not been performed and who therefore becomes a Vrātya<BR> or outcast; cf. व्रात्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कारशब्दः
संस्कारः + -शब्दः a word which gains its currency owing to संस्कार; संस्कारशब्दा<BR> एते आहवनीयादयः ŚB. on MS. 5. 3. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कारक
संस्कारक <i>a.</i> Consecrating, purifying, refining &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कारवत्त्वम्
संस्कारवत्त्वम् Refinement, elegance (of behaviour); संस्कारवत्त्वाद्रमयत्सु<BR> चेतः Ki. 17. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृत|संस्कृतं|संस्कृतः
संस्कृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Made perfect, refined, polished, cultivated.<BR>—2 Artificially made, highly wrought, carefully or accurately formed, elaborated.<BR>—3 Made ready, dressed, prepared; cooked.<BR>—4 Consecrated, hallowed; संस्कृतश्चापि रामेण जगाम गतिमुत्तमाम्<BR> Rām. 4. 57. 11.<BR>—5 Initiated into worldly life, married.<BR>—6 Cleansed, purified.<BR>—7 Adorned, decorated.<BR>—8 Excellent, best.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृतः|संस्कृत|संस्कृतं
संस्कृत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 A word formed regularly according to the rules of grammar, a regular derivative.<BR>—2 A man of any one of the first three castes over whom all the purificatory<BR> rites have been performed. —3 A learned man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृतम्
संस्कृत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Refined or highly polished speech, the Sanskṛt language; संस्कृतं<BR> नाम दैवी वागन्वाख्याता महर्षिभिः Kāv. 1. 33.<BR>—2 A sacred usage.<BR>—3 An offering, oblation (mostly Vedic).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संस्कृतात्मन्, संस्कृतोक्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृतात्मन्
संस्कृत + -आत्मन्<BR>—1 one who has received purificatory rites; याजनाध्यापने नित्यं क्रियेते<BR> संस्कृतात्मनाम् Ms. 10. 110.<BR>—2 a sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृतोक्तिः|संस्कृतोक्ति
संस्कृत + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a polished word or language.<BR>—2 a Sanskṛt word or expression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्कृतिः|संस्कृति
संस्कृतिः<BR>—1 = संस्कार.<BR>—2 Preparation.<BR>—3 Perfection.<BR>—4 Determination.<BR>—5 (Modern usage) Civilization, culture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्क्रिया
संस्क्रिया<BR>—1 A purificatory rite.<BR>—2 Consecration.<BR>—3 Obsequies, a funeral ceremony.<BR>—4 Preparation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तम्भ्|संस्तंभ्
संस्तम्भ् €5. €9 P. (<i>caus.</i> also)<BR>—1 To stop, restrain, control; प्रयत्नसंस्तम्भितविक्रियाणां कथंचिदीशा<BR> मनसां बभूवुः Ku. 3. 34.<BR>—2 To paralyze, benumb; वृत्तिं मोहेन संस्तम्भयतेन्द्रियाणाम् Ku. 3. 73.<BR>—3 To take heart or courage, cheer up, compose, collect (oneself); संस्तम्भ<BR> राम भद्रं ते मा शुचः पुरुषोत्तम Rām. 4. 1. 115; देवि संस्तम्भयात्मानम् U. 4.<BR>—4 To make firm or immoveable; एवं बुद्धेः परं बुद्ध्वा संस्तभ्यात्मानमात्मना Bg. 3. 43.<BR>—5 To support, prop up.<BR>—6 To confirm, establish, corroborate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तब्ध
संस्तब्ध <i>p. p.</i> Supported, confirmed &c.; see संस्तम्भ्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तम्भः|संस्तम्भ|संस्तंभ|संस्तंभः
संस्तम्भः<BR>—1 Support, prop.<BR>—2 Confirming, strengthening, fixing.<BR>—3 Stop, stay.<BR>—4 Stupefaction, paralysis.<BR>—5 Obstinacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तम्भनम्
संस्तम्भनम्<BR>—1 An obstructive remedy.<BR>—2 Stopping, arresting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तु
संस्तु €2 P.<BR>—1 To praise.<BR>—2 To extol, celebrate.<BR>—3 To praise in chorus.<BR>—4 To be acquainted with, be familiar or intimate with (chiefly in <i>p. p.</i><BR> in this sense); अनेकशः संस्तुतमप्यनल्पा नवं नवं प्रीतिरहो<BR> करोति Śi. 3. 31; Ki. 3. 2; see संस्तुत.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तवः|संस्तव
संस्तवः<BR>—1 Praise, eulogium; न वशं योषितो यान्ति न दानैर्न च संस्तवैः Pt. 4. 89.<BR>—2 Acquaintance, intimacy, familiarity; गुणाः प्रियत्वेऽधिकृता न संस्तवः<BR> Ki. 4. 25; नवैर्गुणैः संप्रति संस्तवस्थिरं तिरोहितं प्रेम घनागमश्रियः 4. 22;<BR> Śi. 7. 31.<BR>—3 Agreeing together, harmony.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संस्तवप्रीतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तवप्रीतिः|संस्तवप्रीति
संस्तवः + -प्रीतिः love through acquaintance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तवान|संस्तवानः
संस्तवान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Praising properly.<BR>—2 Eloquent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तवानः|संस्तवान
संस्तवान + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 A singer (उद्गातृ).<BR>—2 Joy, delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तावः|संस्ताव
संस्तावः<BR>—1 Praise, celebration; स्वर्गसंस्तावं हि सामेति Ch. Up. 1. 8. 5.<BR>—2 Hymning in chorus.<BR>—3 The place which Brāhmaṇas repeating hymns and prayers occupy at a<BR> sacrifice; तयोरेष संस्तावो य एषोऽन्तर्हृदय आकाशः Bṛ. Up. 4. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तुत|संस्तुतः
संस्तुत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Praised, eulogized.<BR>—2 Praised together.<BR>—3 Agreeing together, harmonious.<BR>—4 Intimate, familiar; संकल्पनिर्वृतिषु संस्तुत एष दासः Māl. 7. 2.<BR>—5 Intended, aimed at; जयन्ति महतां संस्तुतापलापिन्यः कल्याणिन्यो<BR> नीतयः Māl. 10. 23/24.<BR>—6 Equal to; श्वविड्वराहोष्ट्रखरैः संस्तुतः पुरुषः पशुः Bhāg. 2. 3. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तुतिः|संस्तुति
संस्तुतिः <i>f.</i> Praise, eulogy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तृ
संस्तृ, -स्तॄ €5. €9 U.<BR>—1 To spread, strew; प्रान्तसंस्तीर्णदर्भाः Ś. 4. 8.<BR>—2 To overspread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तॄ
संस्तृ, -स्तॄ €5. €9 U.<BR>—1 To spread, strew; प्रान्तसंस्तीर्णदर्भाः Ś. 4. 8.<BR>—2 To overspread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तरः|संस्तर
संस्तरः<BR>—1 A bed, couch, layer; a bed of leaves &c.; नवपल्लवसंस्तरेऽपि<BR> ते R. 8. 57; नवपल्लवसंस्तरे यथा रचयिष्यामि तनुं विभावसौ Ku. 4. 34.<BR>—2 A sacrifice.<BR>—3 Propagation (of laws or customs).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तारः|संस्तार
संस्तारः<BR>—1 Spreading out, extension.<BR>—2 A bed, couch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1596-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्तीर्ण
संस्तीर्ण <i>a.</i> Strewn, scattered; समिद्वन्तः प्रान्तसंस्तीर्णदर्भाः Ś. 4. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्त्यायः|संस्त्याय
संस्त्यायः<BR>—1 A collection, heap, an assemblage.<BR>—2 Vicinity.<BR>—3 Spreading, diffusion, expansion.<BR>—4 A house, residence, habitation; संस्त्यायमेव गच्छावः Māl. 1, 9.<BR>—5 Familiarity, familiar talk; Mv. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्था
संस्था €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To dwell or live in, stand close together; तीक्ष्णादुद्विजते मृदौ परिभवत्रासान्न<BR> संतिष्ठते Mu. 3. 5.<BR>—2 To stand on.<BR>—3 To be, exist, live.<BR>—4 To abide by, obey, act up to; दारिद्र्यात् पुरुषस्य बान्धवजनो वाक्ये<BR> न संतिष्ठते Mk. 1. 36.<BR>—5 To be completed; सद्यः संतिष्ठते यज्ञस्तथाशौचमिति स्थितिः Ms. 5. 98<BR> (= यज्ञपुण्येन युज्यते Kull.).<BR>—6 To come to an end, be interrupted; न तत् संस्थास्यते कार्यं दक्षेणोरीकृतं<BR> त्वया Bk. 8. 11.<BR>—7 To stand, still, come to a stand (Paras.); क्षणं न संतिष्टति जीवलोकः<BR> क्षयोदयाभ्यां परिवर्तमानः Hariv.<BR>—7 To die, perish.<BR>—8 To agree, conform to.<BR>—9 To stand firmly.<BR>—10 To prosper, succeed. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To establish, settle.<BR>—2 To place.<BR>—3 To compose, collect (oneself).<BR>—4 To subject, keep under control; विषयेषु च सज्जन्त्यः संस्थाप्या<BR> आत्मनो वशे (स्त्रियः) Ms. 9. 2.<BR>—5 To stop, restrain.<BR>—6 To kill.<BR>—7 To build (a town).<BR>—8 To restore.<BR>—9 To heap, store up.<BR>—10 To cremate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थ|संस्थः
संस्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Staying, abiding, lasting.<BR>—2 Dwelling, being, existing, situated (at the end of comp.); जवेनात्मनि<BR> संस्थेन सोऽसौ पूर्ण इवार्णवः Rām. 7. 36. 27; शिष्टा क्रिया कस्यचिदात्मसंस्था<BR> M. 1. 16; Ku. 6. 60; निसर्गभिन्नास्पदमेकसंस्थम् R. 6. 29; Māl. 5. 16.<BR>—3 Tame, domesticated.<BR>—4 Fixed, stationary.<BR>—5 Ended, perished, dead.<BR>—6 Come to an end, completed.<BR>—7 Manifested (व्यक्त).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थः|संस्थ
संस्थ + .{@-स्थः@}<BR>—1 A dweller, an inhabitant.<BR>—2 A neighbour, countryman.<BR>—3 A spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्था
संस्था<BR>—1 An assemblage, assembly.<BR>—2 Situation, state or condition of being; सुखं पृष्ट्वा प्रतिवेद्यात्मसंस्थाम्<BR> Mb. 5. 38. 2; विशुद्धविज्ञानघनं स्वसंस्थया Bhāg. 10. 37. 22.<BR>—3 Form, nature; तेषां संस्थां प्रमाणं च भूलोकस्य च वर्णय Bhāg. 3. 7. 27;<BR> पीडितो दुहितृशुल्कसंस्थया R. 11. 38.<BR>—4 Occupation, business, settled mode of life; लोकस्य संस्था न भवेत्<BR> सर्वं च व्याकुलीभवेत् Mb. 12. 56. 6; Bhāg. 10. 44. 48; पृथक्संस्थाश्च<BR> निर्ममे Ms. 1. 21.<BR>—5 Correct or proper conduct.<BR>—6 End, completion; संस्था हि क्रियां प्रति औदासीन्यं, व्यापारान्तरकरणं<BR> वा पूर्वस्मात् कर्मणः ŚB. on MS. 10. 6. 30.<BR>—7 Stop, stay.<BR>—8 Loss, destruction.<BR>—9 Destruction of the world.<BR>—10 Resemblance.<BR>—11 A royal decree or ordinance.<BR>—12 A form of Soma sacrifice; सोमस्तु रेतः सवनान्यवस्थितिः संस्थाविभेदास्तव<BR> देव धातवः Bhāg. 3. 13. 38.<BR>—13 Death, dying; फलसंस्था भविष्यामि कृत्वा कर्म सुदुष्करम् Mb. 3. 159. 13;<BR> संस्थां च पाण्डुपुत्राणां वक्ष्ये कृष्णकथोदयम् Bhāg. 1. 7. 12.<BR>—14 Manifestation, appearance.<BR>—15 Obligation or agreement (समय); कृतां संस्थामतिक्रान्ता भयात् प्रायमुपासिताः<BR> Rām. 4. 57. 18.<BR>—16 Cremation.<BR>—17 A spy.<BR>—18 Resembling.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संस्थावृक्षः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थावृक्षः
संस्था + -वृक्षः a pot-herb; Kau. A. 1. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थानम्
संस्थानम्<BR>—1 A collection, heap, quantity.<BR>—2 The aggregation of primary atoms.<BR>—3 Configuration, position; आकृतिरवयवसंस्थानविशेषः.<BR>—4 Form, figure, appearance, shape; स्त्रीसंस्थानं चाप्सरस्तीर्थमारादुत्क्षिप्यैनां<BR> ज्योतिरेकं जगाम Ś. 5. 30; Ms. 9. 261; काचित् पुरुषवत् कृत्वा गतिं<BR> संस्थानमेव च Bu. C. 4. 42; Dk. 2. 3.<BR>—5 Construction, formation; यस्यावयवसंस्थानैः कल्पितो लोकविस्तरः<BR> Bhāg. 1. 3. 3.<BR>—6 Vicinity.<BR>—7 Common place of abode.<BR>—8 Situation, position.<BR>—9 Any place or station.<BR>—10 A place where four roads meet; संस्थानेषु च सर्वेषु पुरेषु नगरेषु<BR> च Mb. 12. 69. 7.<BR>—11 A mark, sign, characteristic sign.<BR>—12 Death.<BR>—13 The business of upkeeping the Government; व्यवहारसंस्थानम् Kau. A. 2. 7.<BR>—14 A part, division; षट्पदं नवसंस्थानं निवेशं चक्रिरे द्विजाः<BR> Mb. 14. 64. 10 (v. l.).<BR>—15 Beauty, splendour.<BR>—16 The system of disease. ━<i>a.</i> Immovable (स्थावर); विज्ञातश्चासि<BR> लोकेषु त्रिषु संस्थानचारिषु Mb. 3. 217. 13 (com. संस्थानचारिषु स्थावरजङ्गमेषु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थापक
संस्थापक <i>a.</i> Settling, establishing, arranging &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थापनम्
संस्थापनम्<BR>—1 Placing or keeping together, collecting.<BR>—2 Fixing, determining, regulating; कुर्वीत चैषां प्रत्यक्षमर्घसंस्थापनं<BR> नृपः Ms. 8. 402.<BR>—3 Establishment, confirmation; धर्मसंस्थापनार्थाय संभवामि युगे<BR> युगे Bg. 4. 8.<BR>—5 Restraining, curbing.<BR>—6 A statute, regulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थापना
संस्थापनम् + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 Restraining, curbing.<BR>—2 A means of calming or composing; संस्थापना प्रियतरा विरहातुराणाम् Mk. 3. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थापित
संस्थापित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Collected.<BR>—2 Established, fixed.<BR>—3 Restrained, curbed, checked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थित|संस्थितः
संस्थित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Being or standing together.<BR>—2 Being, staying; नियोगसंस्थित Pt. 1. 92.<BR>—3 Adjacent, contiguous.<BR>—4 Resembling, like.<BR>—5 Collected, heaped.<BR>—6 Settled, fixed, established.<BR>—7 Placed in or on, being in.<BR>—8 Stationary.<BR>—9 Stopped, completed, ended, finished; क्व न खलु संस्थिते कर्मणि<BR> आत्मानं विनोदयामि Ś. 3.<BR>—10 Dead, deceased; प्रमदामनु संस्थितः शुचा R. 1. 72; Ms. 3. 247.<BR>—11 Shaped, formed well; संस्थितदोर्विषाणः Rām. 3. 31. 46.<BR>—12 Frequented (as a place); तां श्वभिः खादयेद्राजा संस्थाने बहुसंस्थिते Ms. 8. 371.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थितम्
संस्थित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 State; एष योत्स्यति संग्रामे नाशयन् पूर्वसंस्थितम् Mb. 5. 171. 2.<BR>—2 Form, shape; वराहसंस्थितं भूतं मत्समीपं समागतम् Mb. 3. 167. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्थितिः|संस्थिति
संस्थितिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Being together, staying with; यस्य मित्रेण संभाषा यस्य मित्रेण<BR> संस्थितिः H. 1. 36.<BR>—2 Contiguity, nearness, vicinity.<BR>—3 Residence, abode, resting-place; यथा नदीनदाः सर्वे सागरे यान्ति<BR> संस्थितिम् । तथैवाश्रमिणः सर्वे गृहस्थे यान्ति संस्थितिम् ॥ Ms. 6. 90.<BR>—4 Accumulation, heap.<BR>—5 Duration, continuance; धर्मार्थकाममोक्षाणां प्राणाः संस्थितिहेतवः H. 1. 40.<BR>—6 Station, state, condition of life.<BR>—7 Restraint.<BR>—8 Death; अहो इमां को नु लभेत संस्थितिम् Bhāg. 3. 19. 27.<BR>—9 Destruction of the world.<BR>—10 Living in the same state; पुराणसंहिताप्रश्नो महापुरुषसंस्थितिः<BR> Bhāg. 12. 12. 8.<BR>—11 Attaching importance to; नैता रूपं परीक्षन्ते नासां वयसि संस्थितिः Ms. 9. 14.<BR>—12 Form, shape (स्वरूप); उत्सृज्य<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">Page1598-1</a>]<BR> सर्वतः सङ्गं विज्ञाताजितसंस्थितिः Bhāg. 1. 18. 3.<BR>—13 Constancy; वैन्यस्तु धुर्यो महतां संस्थित्याध्यात्मशिक्षया Bhāg. 4. 22. 49.<BR>—14 Standing or sitting on; केशभस्मतुषाङ्गारकपालेषु च संस्थितिम् Y. 1. 139.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1597-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्पृश्
संस्पृश् €6 P.<BR>—1 To touch.<BR>—2 To sprinkle with water; अद्भिः खानि च संस्पृशेत् Ms. 2. 53.<BR>—3 To bring in contact with.<BR>—4 To rinse the mouth; अवतीर्य सरः स्वर्गी संस्प्रष्टुमुपचक्रमे<BR> Rām. 7. 77. 16.<BR>—5 To visit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्पर्शः|संस्पर्श
संस्पर्शः<BR>—1 Contact, touch, conjunction, mixture; ये हि संस्पर्शजा भोगा दुःखयोनय<BR> एव ते Bg. 5. 22.<BR>—2 Being touched or affected.<BR>—3 Perception, sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्पर्शी
संस्पर्शी A kind of fragrant plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्पृष्ट
संस्पृष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Touched, brought into contact;<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Affected, smit; यास्यत्यद्य शकुन्तलेति हृदयं संस्पृष्टमुत्कण्ठया Ś. 4. 5.<BR>—2 Mixed, mingled.<BR>—3 Defiled.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संस्पृष्टमैथुना<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्पृष्टमैथुना
संस्पृष्ट + -मैथुना a seduced girl (unfit for marriage).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्फालः|संस्फाल
संस्फालः<BR>—1 A ram.<BR>—2 A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्फुट|संस्फुटः
संस्फुट <i>a.</i> Blossomed, blown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्फेटः|संस्फेट
संस्फेटः, संस्फोटः, संस्फोटिः War, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्फोटः|संस्फोट
संस्फेटः, संस्फोटः, संस्फोटिः War, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्फोटिः|संस्फोटि
संस्फेटः, संस्फोटः, संस्फोटिः War, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्मृ
संस्मृ €1 P.<BR>—1 To remember, think of, call to mind; स्मर संस्मृत्य न शान्तिरस्ति<BR> मे Ku. 4. 17; राजन् संस्मृत्य संस्मृत्य संवादमिममद्भुतम् Bg. 18. 76-77;<BR> Ms. 4. 149.<BR>—2 To recollect fully. ━<i>Caus.</i> To remind, put in mind of; (पातालं)<BR> मामद्य संस्मरयतीव भुजङ्गलोकः Ratn. 1. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्मरणम्
संस्मरणम् Remembering, calling to mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्मारणम्
संस्मारणम् Counting over (cattle).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्मृतिः|संस्मृति
संस्मृतिः <i>f.</i> Remembrance, recollection; संस्मृतिर्भव भवत्यभवाय Ki. 18. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्रवः|संस्रव
संस्रवः, संस्रावः<BR>—1 Flowing, trickling, oozing; खड्गशक्तिधनुर्ग्राहा नद्यः शोणितसंस्रवाः<BR> Rām. 7. 101. 6.<BR>—2 A stream.<BR>—3 The remains of a libation; हुत्वा मन्थे संस्रवमवनयति Bṛ. Up. 6. 3. 2.<BR>—4 A kind of offering or libation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संस्रावः|संस्राव
संस्रवः, संस्रावः<BR>—1 Flowing, trickling, oozing; खड्गशक्तिधनुर्ग्राहा नद्यः शोणितसंस्रवाः<BR> Rām. 7. 101. 6.<BR>—2 A stream.<BR>—3 The remains of a libation; हुत्वा मन्थे संस्रवमवनयति Bṛ. Up. 6. 3. 2.<BR>—4 A kind of offering or libation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहतलः|संहतल
संहतलः The two hands with extended fingers joined together (<BR> = संघतलः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहन्
संहन् €2 P.<BR>—1 To unite closely together, join together; हस्तौ संहत्य Ms. 2. 71;<BR> दूत एव हि संधत्ते भिनत्त्येव च संहतान् 7. 66; see संहत.<BR>—2 To heap, collect, accumulate; तद्यदपांशर आसीत् समहन्यत Bṛ. Up. 1. 2. 2.<BR>—3 To contract, diminish.<BR>—4 To strike, kill, destroy.<BR>—5 To strike against each other, clash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहत|संहतः
संहत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Struck together, wounded.<BR>—2 Closed, shut; मैथिलः श्रुतदेवश्च युगपत् संहताञ्जली Bhāg. 10. 86. 25.<BR>—3 Well-knit, firmly united.<BR>—4 Closely joined or allied; नसंहतास्तस्य नभिन्नवृत्तयः Ki. 1. 19.<BR>—5 Compact, firm, solid; ततो जज्ञे मांसपेशी लोहाष्टीलेव संहता Mb. 1. 115. 12.<BR>—6 Combined, joined, keeping together, being in a body, being very close;<BR> जालमादाय गच्छन्ति संहताः पक्षिणोऽप्यमी Pt. 2. 8, 5. 101;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">Page1598-2</a>]<BR> H. 1. 34.<BR>—7 Of one accord.<BR>—8 Assembled, collected.<BR>—9 Composite, compound (said of a kind of odour); इष्टश्चानिष्टगन्धश्च<BR> … … संहतः स्निग्धः Mb. 12. 184. 28 (com. संहतश्चित्रगन्धोऽनेकद्रव्यकल्कगतः).<BR>—10 Strong-limbed, athletic.<BR>—11 Killed.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संहतजानु, संहतभ्रू, संहतस्तनी, संहतहस्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहतजानु|संहतजानुः
संहत + -जानु <i>a.</i> knock-kneed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहतभ्रू
संहत + -भ्रू <i>a.</i> knitting the eyebrows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहतस्तनी
संहत + -स्तनी a woman whose breasts are very close to each other.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहतहस्त
संहत + -हस्त <i>a.</i> holding each other by the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहतता
संहतता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Close contact, conjunction.<BR>—2 Compactness.<BR>—3 Agreement, union.<BR>—4 Harmony, concord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहतत्वम्
संहतता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Close contact, conjunction.<BR>—2 Compactness.<BR>—3 Agreement, union.<BR>—4 Harmony, concord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहतिः|संहति
संहतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Firm or close contact, close union; पयोधरोत्सेधविशीर्णसंहतिः Ku. 5. 8.<BR>—2 Union, combination; संहतिः कार्यसाधिका; संहतिःश्रेयसी पुंसाम्<BR> H. 1. 32-33; cf. ‘Union is strength’.<BR>—3 Compactness, firmness, solidity.<BR>—4 Bulk, mass; गुरुतां नयन्ति हि गुणा न संहतिः Ki. 12. 10.<BR>—5 Agreement, harmony.<BR>—6 A collection, heap, assemblage, multitude; वनान्यवाञ्चीव चकार<BR> संहतिः Ki. 14. 34, 27, 3. 20, 5. 4; Mu. 3. 2.<BR>—7 Strength.<BR>—8 The body.<BR>—9 A seam.<BR>—10 Thickening, swelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहत्य
संहत्य (Abs. of सं + हन् €2 P.) Together, simultaneously, all<BR> at a time; प्रधानभूते आख्यातार्थे संहत्य विशेषणं भवति परार्थे पुनर्वियुज्येति<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहननम्
संहननम्<BR>—1 Compactness, firmness; तत्कार्मुकं संहननोपपन्नम् Mb. 1. 187. 18;<BR> Bhāg. 5. 2. 21.<BR>—2 The body, person; न चाद्भुतमहावीर्यो वज्रसंहननो युवा Mb. 1. 68. 11;<BR> अमृताध्मातजीमूतस्निग्धसंहननस्य ते U. 6. 21; Mv. 2. 46;<BR> घनसंहननो युवा Śiva B. 22. 48.<BR>—3 Strength; see संहति also.<BR>—4 Rubbing the limbs.<BR>—5 Killing.<BR>—6 Agreement.<BR>—7 Connection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहननीय
संहननीय <i>a.</i> Compact, solid; तथापरेणास्य जहार यन्तुः<BR> कायाच्छिरः संहननीयमध्यात् Mb. 9. 17. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहवनम्
संहवनम्<BR>—1 The act of sacrificing together.<BR>—2 Sacrificing in a proper manner.<BR>—3 A quadrangular group of four houses.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संशून
संशून <i>a.</i> Fatty; मांसोपभोगसंशूनान् Bk. 9. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहातः|संहात
संहातः One of the 21 hells; Ms. 4. 89 (v. l. for संघात).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहित|संहितः
संहित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Placed together, joined, united; संहितप्रयाणम् Kau. A. 7; उक्ताः<BR> स्मो यद्भगवता तदात्वायतिसंहितम् Mb. 12. 328. 2.<BR>—2 Agreeing with, conformable to, in accordance with.<BR>—3 Relating to, proceeding from; पश्य लक्ष्मण शीतेषुं मानवं मनुसंहितम्<BR> Rām. 1. 30. 20.<BR>—4 Collected.<BR>—5 Provided, furnished, endowed, accompanied, conformable to; अब्रवीत्त्रिदशान्<BR> सर्वान् समेतान् धर्मसंहितान् Rām. 1. 15. 27; Mb. 1. 1. 16.<BR>—6 Caused by.<BR>—7 Placed, fixed.<BR>—8 Compiled.<BR>—9 Coming close or near; तदभ्यासादुपावर्त संहितानां च सेवनात् Mb. 12. 90. 29.<BR>—10 Placed on (the bow); विचकर्ष च संहितेषुरुच्चैश्चरणास्कन्दननामिताचलेन्द्रः<BR> Ki. 13. 18. See संधा.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संहितपुष्पिका<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहितपुष्पिका
संहित + -पुष्पिका Dill (Mar. बाळंतशोपा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1598-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहिता
संहिता<BR>—1 Combination, union, conjunction.<BR>—2 A collection, compilation, compendium.<BR>—3 A ny systematically arranged collection of texts or verses.<BR>—4 A compendium or compilation of laws, code, digest; मनुसंहिता.<BR>—5 The continuous hymnical text of the Veda as formed out of the Padas<BR> or individual words by proper phonetic changes according to different<BR> Śākhās or schools; पदप्रकृतिः संहिता Nir.<BR>—6 (In gram.) Combination or junction of letters according to the rules<BR> of Saṃdhi or euphony; परः संनिकर्षः संहिता P. I. 4. 109; वर्णानामतिशयितः<BR> संनिधिः संहितासंज्ञः स्यात् Sk.; or वर्णानामेकप्राणयोगः संहिता.<BR>—7 The Supreme Being who holds and supports the universe.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संहितापाठः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहितापाठः|संहितापाठ
संहिता + -पाठः the continuous text of the Veda (opp. पदपाठ q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहूतिः|संहूति
संहूतिः <i>f.</i> General shout, loud uproar, tumultuous exultation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहृ
संहृ €1 P. (sometimes Ā. also)<BR>—1 To bring or draw together.<BR>—2 To draw out, suck; नृपदीपो धनस्नेहं प्रजाभ्यः संहरन्नपि Pt. 1. 221.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To contract, abridge, compress; महिमानं यदुत्कीर्त्य तव<BR> संह्रियते वचः R. 10. 32.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To drop; संह्रियतामियम् K.<BR>—4 To bring together, collect, accumulate.<BR>—5 To destroy, annihilate (opp. सृज्); अमुं युगान्तोचितकालनिद्रः संहृत्य<BR> लोकान् पुरुषोऽधिशेते R. 13. 6.<BR>—6 To withdraw, withhold, draw or take back; यदा संहरते चायं कूर्मोऽङ्गानीव<BR> सर्वशः Bg. 2. 58; अभिमुखे मयि संहृतमीक्षितम् Ś. 2. 11, 6. 3;<BR> न हि संहरते ज्योत्स्नां चन्द्रश्चाण्डालवेश्मनि H. 1. 58; R. 4. 16, 12. 103.<BR>—7 To curb, restrain, suppress; क्रोधं प्रभो संहर संहरेति यावद्गिरः<BR> खे मरुतां चरन्ति Ku. 3. 72.<BR>—8 To wind up, close; अभिषेकविधानं तु तस्मात् संहृत्य लक्ष्मण Rām. 2. 22. 11.<BR>—9 To seize, take.<BR>—10 To unite, bind by obligations.<BR>—11 To lead astray, corrupt; शूरान् भक्तानसंहार्यान् कुले जातानरोगिणः<BR> Mb. 12. 57. 23 (com. असंहार्यान् परैरप्रतार्यान्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहरणम्
संहरणम्<BR>—1 Gathering, bringing together, collecting.<BR>—2 Taking, seizing.<BR>—3 Contracting.<BR>—4 Restraining.<BR>—5 Destroying, ruining.<BR>—6 Withdrawing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहर्तृ
संहर्तृ <i>m.</i> A destroyer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहारः|संहार
संहारः<BR>—1 Drawing or bringing together, collecting; अनुभवतु वेणीसंहारमहोत्सवम्<BR> Ve. 6; कृत्स्नं च धनसंहारं कुर्वन्ति विधिकारणात् Mb. 12. 20. 8.<BR>—2 Contraction, compression, abridgment.<BR>—3 Withholding, drawing back, withdrawal (opp. प्रयोग or विक्षेप);<BR> समर्थो धारणे मोक्षे संहारे चासि पाण्डव Mb. 3. 40. 15; Bhāg. 1. 7. 27;<BR> प्रयोगसंहारविभक्तमन्त्रम् R. 5. 57, 45.<BR>—4 Restraining, holding back.<BR>—5 Destruction, especially of the universe, universal destruction; संहारे<BR> समनुप्राप्ते व्यादितास्य इवान्तकः Rām. 7. 62. 5.<BR>—6 Close, end, conclusion.<BR>—7 An assemblage, a group.<BR>—8 A fault in pronunciation.<BR>—9 A charm or spell for withdrawing magical weapons.<BR>—10 Practice, skill.<BR>—11 A division of hell.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संहारभैरवः, संहारमुद्रा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहारभैरवः|संहारभैरव
संहारः + -भैरवः one of the forms of Bhairava.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहारमुद्रा
संहारः + -मुद्रा N. of a particular posture in the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">Page1599-2</a>]<BR> <i>Tantra</i> worship; it is thus defined:− अधोमुखे वामहस्ते ऊर्ध्वास्यं<BR> दक्षहस्तकम् । क्षिप्ताङ्गुलीरङ्गुलीभिः संगृह्य परिवर्तयेत् ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहारक
संहारक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Destructive.<BR>—2 Compressing, contracting, closing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहृत|संहृतः
संहृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Drawn together.<BR>—2 Contracted, abridged.<BR>—3 Withdrawn, drawn back.<BR>—4 Collected, assembled.<BR>—5 Seized, laid hold of.<BR>—6 Curbed, restrained.<BR>—7 Destroyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहृतिः|संहृति
संहृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Contraction, compression.<BR>—2 Destruction, loss.<BR>—3 Taking, seizure.<BR>—4 Restraint.<BR>—5 Collection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहृष्
संहृष् €4 P.<BR>—1 To be glad, rejoice, thrill with delight.<BR>—2 To bristle, stand on end (as hair).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहर्षः|संहर्ष
संहर्षः<BR>—1 Horripilation, a thrill of joy or fear.<BR>—2 Pleasure, joy, delight.<BR>—3 Emulation, rivalry.<BR>—4 Wind.<BR>—5 Rubbing together.<BR>—6 Sexual excitement; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहर्षणम्
संहर्षणम् Emulation, rivalry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहृष्ट
संहृष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Thrilled or horripilated with joy, delighted.<BR>—2 Bristling, shuddering.<BR>—3 Fired with emulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संहृष्टिन्
संहृष्टिन् <i>a.</i> Erect (as the male organ); Caraka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संह्रादः|संह्राद
संह्रादः<BR>—1 A loud noise, an uproar.<BR>—2 Noise in general; संह्रादिकण्ठाभरणाः पतन्तः Ki. 18. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संह्रीण
संह्रीण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Modest, bashful.<BR>—2 Completely abashed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकट|सकटः
सकट <i>a.</i> Bad, vile; सकटान्नं च नाश्नीयात् Y. 3. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकटः|सकट
सकट + .{@-टः@} Trophis Aspera (शाखोट).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकण्टक|सकंटक|सकण्टकः
सकण्टक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Thorny, prickly.<BR>—2 Troublesome, dangerous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकण्टकः|सकण्टक|सकंटक
सकण्टक + .{@-कः@} The aquatic plant शैवल q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकम्प|सकंप
सकम्प, सकम्पन <i>a.</i> Trembling, tremulous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकम्पन|सकंपन
सकम्प, सकम्पन <i>a.</i> Trembling, tremulous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकर
सकर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having hands.<BR>—2 Bearing taxes.<BR>—3 Having tusks or a trunk.<BR>—4 Full of rays; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकरुण|सकरुणः
सकरुण <i>a.</i> Tender, compassionate, merciful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकर्ण|सकर्णः
सकर्ण <i>a.</i> (-र्णा or -र्णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Having ears.<BR>—2 Hearing, listening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकर्तृक
सकर्तृक <i>a.</i> Having an agent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकर्मक|सकर्म्मक|सकर्म्मकः
सकर्मक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having or performing any act; तद्वर्षपुरुषा भगवन्तं ब्रह्मरूपिणं<BR> सकर्मकेण कर्मणाराधयन्तीदं चोदाहरन्ति Bhāg. 5. 20. 32.<BR>—2 (In gram.) Having an object, transitive (as a verb).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकल|सकलं
सकल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Together with the parts.<BR>—2 All, whole, entire, complete.<BR>—3 Having all the digits, full (as the moon); as in सकलेन्दुमुखी.<BR>—4 Having a soft or low sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकलम्
सकल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 Everything.<BR>—2 The whole.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सकलवर्ण, सकलजनः, सकललोकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकलवर्ण
सकल + -वर्ण <i>a.</i> (<i>i. e.</i> पद or वाक्य) having the letters<BR> क & ल; (+ ह = quarrelling);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">Page1600-1</a>]<BR> सहकारवृते समये सहका रहणस्य के न सस्मार पदम् । सहकारमुपरि<BR> कान्तैः सह का रमणी पुरः सकलवर्णमपि ॥ Nalod. 2. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1599-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकलजनः|सकलजन
सकल + -जनः, -लोकः everybody.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकललोकः|सकललोक
सकल + -जनः, -लोकः everybody.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकल्प|सकल्पः
सकल्प <i>a.</i> Attended with the ritual or ceremonial part of the<BR> Veda; उपनीय तु यः शिष्यं वेदमध्यापयेद्द्विजः । सकल्पं सरहस्यं<BR> च तमाचार्यं प्रचक्षते ॥ Ms. 2. 140.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकल्पः|सकल्प
सकल्प + .{@-ल्पः@} N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकाकोलः|सकाकोल
सकाकोलः N. of one of the 21 hells; see Ms. 4. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकाम|सकामः
सकाम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Full of love, impassioned, loving.<BR>—2 Lustful, amorous.<BR>—3 One who has got his desired object satisfied, contented; काम इदानीं<BR> सकामो भवतु Ś. 4; किमन्यत् सकामा कपालकुण्डला Māl. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकामम्
सकाम + .{@-मम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 With pleasure.<BR>—2 Contentedly.<BR>—3 Assuredly, indeed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकार
सकार <i>a.</i> Active, energetic; Śi. 19. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकाल
सकाल <i>a.</i> Seasonable, opportune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकालम्
सकाल + .{@-लम्@} <i>ind.</i> Seasonably, betimes, early in the morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकाश|सकाशः
सकाश <i>a.</i> Having appearance, visible, present, near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकाशः|सकाश
सकाश + .{@-शः@} Presence, vicinity, nearness. (सकाशम् and सकाशात्<BR> are used adverbially in the sense of<BR>—1 near.<BR>—2 from near, from, from the presence of.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकीलः|सकील
सकीलः One who from sexual weakness causes his wife to have intercourse<BR> with another man before cohabiting with her himself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकुक्षि
सकुक्षि <i>a.</i> Having the same womb, born of the same mother, uterine<BR> (as a brother &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकुल|सकुलः
सकुल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Belonging to a noble family.<BR>—2 Belonging to the same family.<BR>—3 Having a family.<BR>—4 Along with the family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकुलः|सकुल
सकुल + .{@-लः@}<BR>—1 A kinsman.<BR>—2 A kind of fish (सकुली also).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकुल्यः|सकुल्य
सकुल्यः<BR>—1 One of the same family.<BR>—2 A distant relation; such as a descendant in the 4th, 5th, or 6th, or<BR> even in the 7th, 8th, or 9th degree; अत ऊर्ध्वं सकुल्यः स्यादाचार्यः<BR> शिष्य एव वा Ms. 9. 187.<BR>—3 A distant relation in general. ━<i>a.</i> Akin, similar; अथ पथि पथि<BR> लाजैरात्मनो बाहुवल्लीमुकुलकुलसकुल्यैः पूजयन्त्यो जयेति N. 16. 126.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृत्
सकृत् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Once; सकृदंशो निपतति सकृत् कन्या प्रदीयते । सकृदाह ददानीति<BR> त्रीण्येतानि सतां सकृत् Ms. 9. 47.<BR>—2 At one time, on one occasion, formerly, once; सकृत् कृतप्रणयोऽयं जनः Ś. 5.<BR>—3 At once.<BR>—4 Always.<BR>—5 Together with. ━<i>m., f.</i> Feces, excrement (usually written शकृत् q. v.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सकृदाहृत, सकृद्गतिः, सकृद्गर्भा, सकृत्प्रजः, सकृत्प्रसूता, सकृत्प्रसूतिका, सकृत्फला, सकृद्विभात, सकृत्स्नायिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृदाहृत
सकृत् + -आहृत (सकृदाहृत) <i>a.</i> (interest) paid at one time<BR> (not by instalments); कुसीदवृद्धिर्द्वैगुण्यं नात्येति सकृदाहृता Ms. 8. 151.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृद्गतिः|सकृद्गति
सकृत् + -गतिः (सकृद्गतिः) only a possibility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृद्गर्भा
सकृत् + -गर्भा<BR>—1 a mule.<BR>—2 a woman who is pregnant only once.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृत्प्रजः|सकृत्प्रज
सकृत् + -प्रजः a crow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृत्प्रसूता
सकृत् + -प्रसूता, -प्रसूतिका<BR>—1 a woman who has borne only one child.<BR>—2 a cow that has calved once.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृत्प्रसूतिका
सकृत् + -प्रसूता, -प्रसूतिका<BR>—1 a woman who has borne only one child.<BR>—2 a cow that has calved once.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृत्फला
सकृत् + -फला the plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृद्विभात
सकृत् + -विभात (सकृद्विभात) appeared at once.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृत्स्नायिन्
सकृत् + -स्नायिन् bathing once; Ms. 11. 214.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकृपण
सकृपण <i>a.</i> Miserable, wretched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकेश
सकेश <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having hair.<BR>—2 Hairy, shaggy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकैतव|सकैतवः
सकैतव <i>a.</i> Deceitful, fraudulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकैतवः|सकैतव
सकैतव + .{@-वः@} A cheat, rogue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकोप
सकोप <i>a.</i> Angry, enraged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सकोपम्
सकोप + .{@-पम्@} <i>ind.</i> Angrily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्त|सक्तः
सक्त <i>p. p.</i> [सञ्ज्-क्त]<BR>—1 Stuck or attached to, in contact with.<BR>—2 Addicted, devoted or attached to; fond of; सक्तासि किं कथय वैरिणि<BR> मौर्यपुत्रे Mu. 2. 6.<BR>—3 Fixed or rivetted on; नगेन्द्रसक्तां परिवर्त्य दृष्टिम् R. 2. 28.<BR>—4 Relating to.<BR>—5 Diligent, attentive.<BR>—6 Obstructed, hindered; सदा सक्तं च तद्वेश्म सुमन्त्रः प्रविवेश<BR> ह Rām. 2. 15. 19.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सक्तमूत्र, सक्तवैर<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्तमूत्र
सक्त + -मूत्र <i>a.</i> making water with difficulty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्तवैर
सक्त + -वैर <i>a.</i> engaged in hostilities, constant in enmity; Ś. 2. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्तता
सक्तता, -त्वम्<BR> Attachment, addiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्तत्वम्
सक्तता, -त्वम्<BR> Attachment, addiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्तिः|सक्ति
सक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Contact, touch.<BR>—2 Union, junction; सक्तिं जवादपनयत्यनिले लतानाम् Ki. 5. 46.<BR>—3 Attachment, addiction, devotion (to anything).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्तु|सक्तुः
सक्तु <i>m.</i> pl. [सञ्ज्-तुन् किच्च] The flour of barley first fried<BR> and then ground, barley-meal; भिक्षासक्तुभिरेव संप्रति वयं वृत्तिं<BR> समीहामहे Bh. 3. 64.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सक्तुफला, सक्तुफली<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्तुफला
सक्तु + -फला, -फली the Śamī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्तुफली
सक्तु + -फला, -फली the Śamī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्तुकः|सक्तुक
सक्तुकः<BR>—1 = सक्तु.<BR>—2 A kind of poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्तुल
सक्तुल <i>a.</i> Containing barley flour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्थन्
सक्थन् A substitute for सक्थि after acc. dual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्थि
सक्थि <i>n.</i> [सञ्ज्-किथन् Uṇ. 3. 154]<BR>—1 The thigh; (changed in comp. to सक्थ after उत्तर, पूर्व and<BR> मृग or when the compound implies comparison; see P. V. 4. 98); असौ<BR> चासौ च सक्थ्यौ Bṛ. Up. 1. 2. 3; सुग्रीवेशः कटी पातु सक्थिनी हनुमत्प्रभुः<BR> Rāmarakṣā 8.<BR>—2 A thigh bone.<BR>—3 The pole or shafts of a carriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्रिय
सक्रिय <i>a.</i> Active, moveable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सक्षण
सक्षण <i>a.</i> Being at leisure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सखि
सखि <i>m.</i> [सह समानं ख्यायते नि Uṇ. 1. 136] (nom. सखा,<BR> सखायौ, सखायः; acc. सखायम्, सखायौ; सख्युः gen. sing.; सख्यौ<BR> loc. sing.) A friend, companion, an associate; तस्मात् सखा त्वमसि यन्मम<BR> तत्तवैव U. 5. 10; सखीनिव प्रीतियुजोऽनुजीविनः Ki. 1. 10. (At<BR> the end of comp. सखि is changed to सख; वनितासखानाम् Ku. 1. 10;<BR> सचिवसखः R. 4. 87, 1. 48, 12. 9; Bk. 1. 1.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सखी
सखी A female friend or companion, a ladyʼs maid; नृत्यति युवतिजनेन<BR> समं सखि विरहिजनस्य दुरन्ते Gīt. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सखीयति
सखीयति Den. P. To wish for a friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सख्यम्
सख्यम् [सख्युर्भावः यत्]<BR>—1 Friendship, intimacy, alliance; मुमूर्च्छ सख्यं रामस्य समानव्यसने<BR> हरौ R. 12. 57; तस्यैव मे सौहृदसख्यमैत्री Bhāg. 10. 81. 36; समानशीलव्यसनेषु<BR> सख्यम् Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 Equality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सख्यः|सख्य|सख्यं
सख्यम् + .{@-सख्यः@} A friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1600-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सग्
सग् €1 P. (सगति) To cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगण|सगणः
सगण <i>a.</i> Attended by troops or flocks.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगणः|सगण
सगण + .{@-णः@} An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगतिक
सगतिक <i>a.</i> Connected with a preposition &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगन्ध|सगंध|सगन्धः
सगन्ध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Fragrant.<BR>—2 Related.<BR>—3 Proud, arrogant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगन्धः|सगन्ध|सगंध
सगन्ध + .{@-न्धः@} A kinsman, relation, kindred; सर्वः सगन्धेषु विश्वसिति Ś. 5; Me. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगर|सगरः
सगर <i>a.</i> [गरेण विषेण सहितः] Poisonous, having poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगरः|सगर
सगर + .{@-रः@} N. of a king of the Solar race. [He was a son of Bāhu and<BR> was called Sagara because he was born together with gara or poison given<BR> to his mother by the other wife of his father. By his wife Sumati he had 60000<BR> sons. He successfully performed 99 sacrifices but when he commenced<BR> the hundredth, his sacrificial horse was stolen by Indra and carried down<BR> to the Pātāla. Sagara thereupon commanded his 60000 sons to search it<BR> out. Finding no trace of the animal on earth they began to dig down towards<BR> the Pātāla, and in doing this they naturally increased the boundaries<BR> of the ocean which was therefore called <i>Sāgara</i>; cf. R. 13. 3. Meeting<BR> with the sage Kapila they rashly accused him of having stolen their horse,<BR> as a punishment for which they were instantly reduced to ashes by that<BR> sage. It was after several thousands of years that Bhagīratha (q. v.)<BR> succeeded in bringing down to the Pātāla the celestial river Ganges<BR> to water and purify their ashes and thus to convey their souls to heaven.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगर्भः|सगर्भ
सगर्भः, -र्भ्यः<BR>—1 A brother of whole blood; सह तनुजसगर्भप्रेष्यरक्षःसहस्रैः Mv. 6. 27.<BR>—2 Similar to; रत्नावलीश्चौषधिभिः सगर्भाः Bu. C. 2. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगर्भ्यः|सगर्भ्य
सगर्भः, -र्भ्यः<BR>—1 A brother of whole blood; सह तनुजसगर्भप्रेष्यरक्षःसहस्रैः Mv. 6. 27.<BR>—2 Similar to; रत्नावलीश्चौषधिभिः सगर्भाः Bu. C. 2. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगुण
सगुण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Possessed of qualities or attributes.<BR>—2 Possessed of good qualities, virtuous.<BR>—3 Worldly.<BR>—4 Furnished with a string (as a bow).<BR>—5 Possessed of the qualities in rhetoric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगोत्र|सगोत्रं|सगोत्रः
सगोत्र <i>a.</i> Being of the same family or kin, related.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगोत्रः|सगोत्र|सगोत्रं
सगोत्र + .{@-त्रः@}<BR>—1 A kinsman sprung from a common ancestor; तत्रभवतो युष्मत्सगोत्रस्य<BR> कण्वस्यापराद्धोऽस्मि Ś. 7.<BR>—2 A kinsman of the same family, one connected by funeral oblations of<BR> food and water.<BR>—3 A distant kinsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगोत्रम्
सगोत्र + .{@-तम्@} Family, race, lineage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सगोष्ठी
सगोष्ठी Fellowship with; अथेन्द्रियारामसगोष्ठपतृष्णया Bhāg. 4. 22. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सग्धिः|सग्धि
सग्धिः <i>f.</i> Eating together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सघ्
सघ् €5 P. (सघ्नोति)<BR>—1 To hurt, injure, kill.<BR>—2 To receive, accept.<BR>—3 To support, bear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकट|सङ्कट|सङ्कटः
संकट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Contracted, narrow, strait; संकटद्वारकाणि स्युरुच्छ्वासार्थं पुरस्य<BR> च Mb. 12. 69. 44.<BR>—2 Impervious,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">Page1601-2</a>]<BR> impassable.<BR>—3 Full of, crowded with, beset with, hemmed in; संकटा ह्याहिताग्नीनां<BR> प्रत्यवायैर्गृहस्थता Mv. 4. 33; विषमशिलासंकटस्खलितवेगः V. 2. 8; U. 1. 8.<BR>—4 Pressed, made thin (कृशीकृत); कृतप्रतिकृतैश्चित्रैबाहुभिश्च सुसंकटैः Mb. 4. 13. 27.<BR>—5 Dangerous, critical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकटम्
संकट + .{@-टम्@}<BR>—1 A narrow passage, defile, pass.<BR>—2 A difficulty, strait, risk, peril, danger; संकटेष्वविषण्णधीः<BR> K.; संकटे हि परीक्ष्यन्ते प्राज्ञाः शूराश्च संगरे Ks. 31. 93.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संकटचतुर्थी, संकटमुख<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकटचतुर्थी
संकट + -चतुर्थी N. of the fourth day in the dark half of श्रावण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकटमुख
संकट + -मुख <i>a.</i> narrow-mouthed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकथ्|सङ्कथ्
संकथ् €10 U.<BR>—1 To talk together, converse.<BR>—2 To narrate, relate.<BR>—3 To explain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकथनम्
संकथनम् Narration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकथा|सङ्कथा
संकथा<BR>—1 Conversation, talk.<BR>—2 Accordance, agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकरी
संकरी See संकारी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकर्षम्
संकर्षम् N. given to Adhyāyas 13-16 of जैमिनिʼs पूर्वमीमांसासूत्र.<BR> It is also called the संकर्षकाण्ड; स्विष्टकृद्विकारश्च वनस्पतिरिति<BR> संकर्षे वक्ष्यते ŚB. on MS. 10. 4. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्|सङ्कल्
संकल् €10 U.<BR>—1 To add or sum up.<BR>—2 To heap, accumulate, collect.<BR>—3 To deem, regard; तरुच्छिद्रप्रोतान् विसमिति करी संकलयति K. P. 10.<BR>—4 To grasp, seize, lay hold of.<BR>—5 To drive away, put to flight, rout.<BR>—6 To perform the funeral honours to a dead person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकलः|सङ्कल|संकल|सङ्कलः
संकलः<BR>—1 Accumulation, collection.<BR>—2 Addition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकलनम्
संकलनम्, -ना<BR>—1 The act of heaping together.<BR>—2 Contact, junction.<BR>—3 Collision.<BR>—4 Blending, twining.<BR>—5 Addition (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकलना
संकलनम्, -ना<BR>—1 The act of heaping together.<BR>—2 Contact, junction.<BR>—3 Collision.<BR>—4 Blending, twining.<BR>—5 Addition (in math.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकलित|सङ्कलित|सङ्कलितः
संकलित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Heaped up, piled up, collected.<BR>—2 Blended together, intermixed.<BR>—3 Seized, laid hold of.<BR>—4 Added.<BR>—5 Resumed, regained; Māl. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकलिता
संकलित + .{@-ता@} (In arith.) The first sum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकलितम्
संकलित + .{@-तम्@} Addition.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संकलितैक्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकलितैक्यम्
संकलित + -ऐक्यम् the sum of the terms of an arithmetical progression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकलितिन्
संकलितिन् <i>a.</i> One who has made an addition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकालनम्
संकालनम् Burning a corpse, funeral ceremony; न तु संकालनं<BR> राज्ञो विना पुत्रेण मन्त्रिणः Rām. 2. 66. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकष्टम्
संकष्टम् Distress, trouble (used in comp.); see संकट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकसुक|सङ्कसुक
संकसुक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Unsteady, fickle, changeable, inconstant.<BR>—2 Uncertain, doubtful.<BR>—3 Bad, wicked.<BR>—4 Weak, feeble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकारः|सङ्कार|संकार|सङ्कारः
संकारः<BR>—1 Dust, sweepings.<BR>—2 The crackling of flames.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकारी
संकारी A girl recently deflowered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकाश|सङ्काश|संकाशः|सङ्काशः
संकाश <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Like, similar, resembling (at the end of comp.); अग्नि˚, हिरण्य˚;<BR> विपत्तिं घोरसंकाशां क्रुद्धादग्निशिखामिव<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">Page1602-1</a>]<BR> Rām. 7. 81. 4.<BR>—2 Near, close, at hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकाशः|सङ्काश|संकाश|सङ्काशः
संकाश + .{@-शः@}<BR>—1 Appearance, presence.<BR>—2 Vicinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1601-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकिलः|सङ्किल|संकिल|सङ्किलः
संकिलः A fire-brand, burning torch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकुच्|सङ्कुच्
संकुच् €1. €6 P.<BR>—1 To become contracted, shrink.<BR>—2 To close, shut (as a flower).<BR>—3 To contract, compress. ━<i>Caus.</i> To contract, narrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकुचित|सङ्कुचित|सङ्कुचितं
संकुचित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Contracted, abridged; लङ्कापतेः संकुचितं यशो यत् Vikr. 1. 27.<BR>—2 Shrunk, wrinkled; गात्रं संकुचितं गतिर्विगलिता दन्ताश्च नाशं<BR> गताः Pt. 4. 78.<BR>—3 Closed, shut.<BR>—4 Covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकोचः|सङ्कोच|संकोच|सङ्कोचं|सङ्कोचः
संकोचः<BR>—1 Contraction, shrinking up.<BR>—2 Abridgment, diminution, compression.<BR>—3 Terror, fear.<BR>—4 Shutting up, closing.<BR>—5 Binding.<BR>—6 Crouching down, humbling oneʼs self; त्वयेयं पृथिवी लब्धा न संकोचेन<BR> चाप्युत Mb. 12. 14. 18.<BR>—7 A kind of skate-fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकोचम्
संकोचः + .{@-चम्@} Saffron.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संकोचपिशुनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकोचपिशुनम्
संकोचः + -पिशुनम् saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकोचनम्
संकोचनम् Contraction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकोचनी
संकोचनम् + .{@-नी@} The sensitive plant (Mar. लाजाळू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकुल|सङ्कुल|सङ्कुलं
संकुल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Confused.<BR>—2 Thronged with, crowded or filled with, full of; नक्षत्रताराग्रहसंकुलापि<BR> ज्योतिष्मती चन्द्रमसैव रात्रिः R. 6. 22; Māl. 1. 2.<BR>—3 Disordered, perplexed; अन्योन्यप्रतिघातसंकुलचलत्कल्लोलकोलाहलैः U. 2. 30.<BR>—4 Inconsistent.<BR>—5 Thick, dense (as smoke). —6 Violent, intense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकुलम्
संकुल + .{@-लम्@}<BR>—1 A crowd, mob, throng, collection, swarm, flock; महतः पौरजनस्य<BR> संकुलेन विघटितायां तस्यामागतोऽस्मि Māl. 1; Pt. 1. 7.<BR>—2 A confused fight, melee; तस्मिंस्तथा संकुले वर्तमाने Mb. 3. 134. 22.<BR>—3 An inconsistent or contradictory speech; <i>e. g.</i> यावज्जीवमहं<BR> मौनी ब्रह्मचारी च मे पिता । माता तु मम वन्ध्यैव पुत्रहीनः पितामहः ॥.<BR>—4 Distress, destruction (नाश); प्राविशत् संकुलं तत्र शलभा<BR> इव पावकम् Rām. 7. 19. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकूजितम्
संकूजितम् The cry of the Cakravāka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकृ|सङ्कृ
संकृ €8 U. (संकरोति-संकुरुते)<BR>—1 To commit; ये पक्षापरपक्षदोषसहिताः पापानि संकुर्वते Mk. 9. 4.<BR>—2 To manufacture, prepare.<BR>—3 To do, perform in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकृष्|सङ्कृष्
संकृष् €1 P.<BR>—1 To drag along or away.<BR>—2 To contract. —3 To tighten, tie fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकर्षणम्
संकर्षणम्<BR>—1 The act of drawing together, contracting; (सात्वती) या द्रष्टृदृश्ययोः<BR> संकर्षणम् Bhāg. 5. 25. 1.<BR>—2 Attracting.<BR>—3 Ploughing, furrowing.<BR>—4 Shortening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकर्षणः|सङ्कर्षण|संकर्षण|संकर्षणं|सङ्कर्षणं|सङ्कर्षणः
संकर्षणम् + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 N. of Balarāma; असियुद्धे गदायुद्धे रथयुद्धे च पाण्डवः । संकर्षणादशिक्षद्वै<BR> शश्वच्छिक्षां वृकोदरः ॥ Mb. 1. 139. 4; संकर्षणात्तु गर्भस्य स<BR> हि संकर्षणो युवा Hariv.<BR>—2 N. of the great serpent Śeṣa; पातालतलमारभ्य संकर्षणमुखानलः<BR> Bhāg. 11. 3. 10.<BR>—3 The destructor of the world; क्षये संकर्षणं प्रोक्तं तमुपास्यमुपास्महे<BR> Mb. 12. 47. 32.<BR>—4 Egotism (अहंकार); सोऽग्रजं सर्वभूतानां संकर्षणमकल्पयत्<BR> Mb. 12. 207. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकॄ|सङ्कॄ
संकॄ €6 P.<BR>—1 To mix, commingle or mix together; न संकिरेत्तदन्नं च ततः पूयेत<BR> ब्राह्मणः Mb. 13. 136. 13.<BR>—2 To scatter about, diffuse.<BR>—3 To fill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकरः|सङ्कर|संकर|सङ्करः
संकरः<BR>—1 Commingling, mixture, intermixture; पत्रसंकर Ś. 2.<BR>—2 Blending together, union.<BR>—3 Confusion or mixture (of castes), unlawful intermarriage resulting<BR> in mixed castes; चित्रेषु वर्णसंकरः K.; संकरो नरकायैव कुलध्नानां<BR> कुलस्य च Bg. 1. 42; Ms. 10. 40.<BR>—4 (In Rhet.) The combination of two or more <i>dependent</i> figures of<BR> speech in one and the same passage (opp. संसृष्टि where the figures<BR> are <i>independent</i>); अविश्रान्तिजुषामात्मन्यङ्गाङ्गित्वे तु संकरः K. P. 10;<BR> or अङ्गाङ्गित्वेऽलंकृतीनां तद्वदेकाश्रयस्थितौ । संदिग्धत्वे च<BR> भवति संकरस्त्रिविधः पुनः S. D. 757.<BR>—5 The crackling of flames; जागर्त्येव हि दुष्टात्मा संकरेऽग्निरिवोत्थितः<BR> Mb. 12. 103. 12.<BR>—6 Dust, sweepings.<BR>—7 Dung.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संकरज, संकरजात, संकरस्वेदः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकरज
संकरः + -ज, -जात <i>a.</i> born from a mixed caste; वृथासंकरजातानां<BR> … … निवर्तेतोदकक्रिया Ms. 5. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकरजात
संकरः + -ज, -जात <i>a.</i> born from a mixed caste; वृथासंकरजातानां<BR> … … निवर्तेतोदकक्रिया Ms. 5. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकरस्वेदः|सङ्करस्वेद
संकरः + -स्वेदः a particular sudorific treatment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकरीकरणम्
संकरीकरणम् Illegality, sin; खराश्वोष्ट्रमृगेभानामजाविकवधस्तथा ।<BR> संकरीकरणं ज्ञेयं मीनाहिमहिषस्य च ॥ Ms. 11. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकारः|सङ्कार|संकार|सङ्कारः
संकारः<BR>—1 Dust, sweepings.<BR>—2 Crackling of flames.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकारिन्
संकारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Confused, intermixed.<BR>—2 Arising from intermixture of castes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्ण|सङ्कीर्ण|सङ्कीर्णं|संकीर्णः|सङ्कीर्णः
संकीर्ण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Mixed together, intermingled.<BR>—2 Confused, miscellaneous.<BR>—3 Shattered, spread, crowded.<BR>—4 Indistinct.<BR>—5 In rut, intoxicated; मदोद्धतस्य नृपतेः संकीर्णस्येव दन्तिनः …<BR> नेतारः खलु वाच्यताम् H. 4. 17.<BR>—6 Of mixed caste, of impure origin.<BR>—7 Impure, adulterated; तस्मात् संकीर्णवृत्तेषु वासो मम न रोचते Mb. 1. 79. 9.<BR>—8 Narrow, contracted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्णः|सङ्कीर्ण|संकीर्ण|सङ्कीर्णं|सङ्कीर्णः
संकीर्ण + .{@-र्णः@}<BR>—1 A man of a mixed caste.<BR>—2 A mixed note or mode.<BR>—3 An elephant in rut, an intoxicated elephant; name of the fourth caste<BR> of elephants; Mātaṅga L. 1. 26, 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्णम्
संकीर्ण + .{@-र्णम्@} A difficulty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्णा
संकीर्ण + .{@-र्णा@} A kind of riddle; सा भवेदुभयच्छन्ना यस्यामुभयगोपनम् ।<BR> संकीर्णा नाम सा यस्यां नानालक्षणसंकरः ॥ Kāv. 3. 105.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संकीर्णजाति, संकीर्णयोनि, संकीर्णयुद्धम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्णजाति
संकीर्ण + -जाति, -योनि <i>a.</i> of mixed birth, of a mongrel breed (as a mule);<BR> impure through illegal intermarriage; संकीर्णयोनयो ये तु प्रतिलोमानुलोमजाः Ms. 10. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्णयोनि|सङ्कीर्णयोनि
संकीर्ण + -जाति, -योनि <i>a.</i> of mixed birth, of a mongrel breed (as a mule);<BR> impure through illegal intermarriage; संकीर्णयोनयो ये तु प्रतिलोमानुलोमजाः Ms. 10. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्णयुद्धम्
संकीर्ण + -युद्धम् a confused fight, melee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकॄत्
संकॄत् €10 U.<BR>—1 To recite.<BR>—2 To praise, celebrate, glorify.<BR>—3 To tell, mention.<BR>—4 To proclaim, announce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्तनम्
संकीर्तनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Praising, applauding, extolling.<BR>—2 Glorification (of a deity).<BR>—3 Repeating the name of a deity as a pious or devotional act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकीर्तना
संकीर्तनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Praising, applauding, extolling.<BR>—2 Glorification (of a deity).<BR>—3 Repeating the name of a deity as a pious or devotional act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकॢप्|सङ्कॢप्
संकॢप् €1 Ā. To wish or long for. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To resolve, determine, settle.<BR>—2 To intend, aim at, purpose; संकल्पितार्थे विवृतात्मशक्तिमाखण्डलः<BR> काममिदं बभाषे Ku. 3. 11.<BR>—3 To arrange or connect together.<BR>—4 To fix, assign, allot.<BR>—5 To consecrate, dedicate.<BR>—6 To imagine, fancy.<BR>—7 To think about, ponder, reflect; देवेभ्य आगायद्यत् कल्याणं संकल्पयति तदात्मने Bṛ. Up. 1. 3. 6.<BR>—8 To perform obsequies.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1602-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्पः|सङ्कल्प|संकल्प|सङ्कल्पः
संकल्पः<BR>—1 Will, volition, mental resolve; कामः संकल्पो विचिकित्सा … Bṛ. Up. 1. 5. 3;<BR> कः कामः संकल्पः Dk.<BR>—2 Purpose, aim, intention, determination.<BR>—3 Wish, desire; संकल्पमात्रोदितसिद्धयस्ते R. 14. 17.<BR>—4 Thought, idea, reflection, fancy, imagination; तत्संकल्पोपहितजडिम<BR> स्तम्भमभ्येति गात्रम् Māl. 1. 35; वृथैव संकल्पशतैरजस्रमनङ्ग<BR> नीतोऽसि मया विवृद्धिम् Ś. 3. 5 (v. l.); प्रियासंनिहितैवेयं संकल्पस्थापिता<BR> पुरः Nāg. 2. 9.<BR>—5 The mind, heart; शान्तसंकल्पः सुमना यथा स्यात् Kaṭh. 1. 10;<BR> संकल्पनिर्वृतिषु संस्तुत एष दासः Māl. 7. 2.<BR>—6 A solemn vow to perform an observance.<BR>—7 Expectation of advantage from a holy voluntary act.<BR>—8 Consideration, reflection.<BR>—9 A declaration made by a widow at the time of burning herself with her husband.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संकल्पात्मक, संकल्पज, संकल्पजः, संकल्पजन्मन्, संकल्पप्रभव, संकल्पमूल, संकल्पसंभव, संकल्परूप<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्पात्मक|सङ्कल्पात्मक
संकल्पः + -आत्मक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 willing, resolving.<BR>—2 consisting of thought only, imaginary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्पज|सङ्कल्पज|संकल्पजः
संकल्पः + -ज <i>a.</i> produced from self-will, desire or idea of advantage;<BR> व्रतानि यमधर्माश्च सर्वे संकल्पजाः स्मृताः Ms. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्पजः|सङ्कल्पज|संकल्पज
संकल्पः + -जः, -जन्मन् <i>m.</i>, {@-योनिः@}<BR>—1 wish, desire.<BR>—2 epithets of the god of love; भगवन् संकल्पयोने M. 4; Ku. 3. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्पजन्मन्|सङ्कल्पजन्मन्
संकल्पः + -जः, -जन्मन् <i>m.</i>, {@-योनिः@}<BR>—1 wish, desire.<BR>—2 epithets of the god of love; भगवन् संकल्पयोने M. 4; Ku. 3. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्पप्रभव|सङ्कल्पप्रभव
संकल्पः + -प्रभव <i>a.</i> born from desire (an epithet of Madana); कामिनां<BR> बहुमन्तव्यं संकल्पप्रभवोदयम् Bhāg. 8. 12. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्पमूल
संकल्पः + -मूल, -संभव <i>a.</i> based on some idea or desire; संकल्पमूलः<BR> कामो वै यज्ञाः संकल्पसंभवाः Ms. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्पसंभव|सङ्कल्पसम्भव|संकल्पसम्भव
संकल्पः + -मूल, -संभव <i>a.</i> based on some idea or desire; संकल्पमूलः<BR> कामो वै यज्ञाः संकल्पसंभवाः Ms. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्परूप|सङ्कल्परूप
संकल्पः + -रूप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 volitional.<BR>—2 conformable to will.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्पनम्
संकल्पनम् Purpose, wish, desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकल्पित|सङ्कल्पित
संकल्पित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Wished for, intended, aimed at.<BR>—2 Determined, resolved upon; संकल्पितं प्रथममेव मया तवार्थे भर्तारमात्मसदृशं<BR> सुकृतैर्गता त्वम् Ś. 4. 13.<BR>—3 Imagined, fancied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकॢप्त|सङ्कॢप्त
संकॢप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Contrived, prepared.<BR>—2 Desired, wished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकॢप्तिः|सङ्कॢप्ति|संकॢप्ति
संकॢप्तिः<BR>—1 Will, volition.<BR>—2 Thought, fancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतः|सङ्केत|संकेत|सङ्केतः
संकेतः<BR>—1 An intimation, allusion.<BR>—2 A sign, gesture, hint; Mu. 1.<BR>—3 An indicatory sign, mark, token.<BR>—4 Agreement, convention; संकेतो गृह्यते जातौ गुणद्रव्यक्रियासु च S. D. 12.<BR>—5 Engagement, appointment, assignation (made by a mistress or lover);<BR> नामसमेतं कृतसंकेतं वादयते मृदु वेणुम् Gīt. 5.<BR>—6 A place of meeting (for lovers), rendezvous; सा स्वैरिण्येकदा कान्तं<BR> संकेतम् उपनेष्यति Bhāg. 11. 8. 23; कान्तार्थिनी तु या याति संकेतं<BR> साभिसारिका Ak.<BR>—7 Condition, provision.<BR>—8 A short explanatory rule (in gram.).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संकेतगृहम्, संकेतनिकेतनम्, संकेतस्थानम्, संकेतवाक्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतगृहम्
संकेतः + -गृहम्, -निकेतनम्, -स्थानम् a place of appointment or assignation, rendezvous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतनिकेतनम्
संकेतः + -गृहम्, -निकेतनम्, -स्थानम् a place of appointment or assignation, rendezvous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतस्थानम्
संकेतः + -गृहम्, -निकेतनम्, -स्थानम् a place of appointment or assignation, rendezvous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतवाक्यम्
संकेतः + -वाक्यम् watchword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतकः|सङ्केतक
संकेतकः<BR>—1 Agreement, convention.<BR>—2 Appointment, assignation.<BR>—3 Rendezvous.<BR>—4 A lover or mistress who makes an appointment; संकेतके चिरयति<BR> प्रवरो विनोदः Mk. 3. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतनम्
संकेतनम्<BR>—1 Appointment, agreement.<BR>—2 A rendezvous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतयति
संकेतयति Den. P.<BR>—1 To agree upon, appoint.<BR>—2 To fix by convention, lay down conventionally.<BR>—3 To invite, call.<BR>—4 To give a hint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संकेतित|सङ्केतित
संकेतित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Agreed upon, fixed by convention; साक्षात् संकेतितं योऽर्थमभिधत्ते<BR> स वाचकः K. P. 2.<BR>—2 Invited, called.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रन्दः|सङ्क्रन्द
संक्रन्दः<BR>—1 War, battle; एते कौरव संक्रन्दे शैनेयं पर्यवाकिरन् Mb. 7. 172. 13.<BR>—2 Sounding together (कोलाहल); तस्मिन् महति संक्रन्दे राजा दुर्योधनस्तदा ।<BR> गाङ्गेयमुपसङ्गम्य Mb. 6. 95. 1.<BR>—3 Wailing, lamentation.<BR>—4 Means of extracting Soma (अभिषवण); तस्मिञ्जातः सोमसंक्रन्दमध्ये Mb. 7. 23. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रन्दनः|सङ्क्रन्दन|संक्रन्दन|संक्रंदन|संक्रंदनः|सङ्क्रन्दनः
संक्रन्दनः —1 N. of Indra; अपि संक्रन्दनस्य स्यात् क्रुद्धः किमुत<BR> वालिनः Bk. 6. 109; Mv. 5. 39; संक्रन्दनप्रतिमबाहुपराक्रमाभ्याम्<BR> Rām. Ch. 2. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रन्दनम्
संक्रन्दनः + .{@-नम्@} War, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रम्|सङ्क्रम्
संक्रम् €1 U.<BR>—1 To come or meet together.<BR>—2 To traverse, cross, go or pass through.<BR>—3 To approach, go.<BR>—4 To go over or be transferred (to another).<BR>—5 To enter on or in; कालो ह्ययं संक्रमितुं द्वितीयं सर्वोपकारक्षममाश्रमं ते R. 5. 10.<BR>—6 To be present at, attend.<BR>—7 To surmount. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To transfer.<BR>—2 To devolve, consign, entrust; ब्राह्मणसंक्रमिताक्षरेण पितामहेन<BR> V. 3; Ku. 6. 78.<BR>—3 To deliver, hand over.<BR>—4 To convey, lead towards.<BR>—5 To take possession of.<BR>—6 To promise mutual assistance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रमः|सङ्क्रम|संक्रम|सङ्क्रमः
संक्रमः<BR>—1 Concurrence, going together.<BR>—2 Transition, traversing, transfer, progress.<BR>—3 The passage of a planetary body through the zodiacal signs; दिनक्षये<BR> व्यतीपाते संक्रमेऽर्कदिनेऽपि वा Bhāg. 4. 12. 49.<BR>—4 Moving, travelling.<BR>—5 The falling or shooting of stars.<BR>—6 The meeting of two words in Krama text.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रमः|सङ्क्रम|संक्रम|सङ्क्रमः
संक्रमः + .{@-मः, -मम्@}<BR>—1 A difficult or narrow passage.<BR>—2 A causeway, bridge; नदीमार्गेषु च तथा संक्रमानवसादयेत् Mb.<BR>—3 A medium or means of attaining any object; तामेव संक्रमीकृत्य<BR> Dk.; सोऽतिथिः स्वर्गसंक्रमः Pt. 4. 2; वैदूर्यसंक्रम इवाम्बरसागरस्य<BR> Madhyamavyāyoga 1. 1.<BR>—4 A stair-case, ladder (सोपान); भवनानि तुङ्गतपनीयसंक्रमक्रमणक्वणत्कनकनूपुराः<BR> स्त्रियः (व्यचलन्) Śi. 13. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रमम्
संक्रमः + .{@-मः, -मम्@}<BR>—1 A difficult or narrow passage.<BR>—2 A causeway, bridge; नदीमार्गेषु च तथा संक्रमानवसादयेत् Mb.<BR>—3 A medium or means of attaining any object; तामेव संक्रमीकृत्य<BR> Dk.; सोऽतिथिः स्वर्गसंक्रमः Pt. 4. 2; वैदूर्यसंक्रम इवाम्बरसागरस्य<BR> Madhyamavyāyoga 1. 1.<BR>—4 A stair-case, ladder (सोपान); भवनानि तुङ्गतपनीयसंक्रमक्रमणक्वणत्कनकनूपुराः<BR> स्त्रियः (व्यचलन्) Śi. 13. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रमणम्
संक्रमणम्<BR>—1 Concurrence.<BR>—2 Transition, progress, passing from one point to another.<BR>—3 Passage.<BR>—4 The sunʼs passage from one zodiacal sign to another.<BR>—5 The day on which the summer solstice begins.<BR>—6 Decease, death; यदि दुःखमकृत्वा तु मम संक्रमणं भवेत् Rām. 2. 13. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रमणिका
संक्रमणम् + .{@-का@} A gallery; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रान्त|सङ्क्रान्त|संक्रांत|सङ्क्रान्तः
संक्रान्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Passed through or into, entered into; संक्रान्तचन्दनरसाहितवर्णभेदम् Ki. 8. 57.<BR>—2 Transferred, devolved, entrusted; पुत्रसंक्रान्तलक्ष्मीकैर्यद्वृद्धेक्ष्वाकुभिर्धृतम् U. 1. 22.<BR>—3 Seized, affected.<BR>—4 Reflected, imaged; संक्रान्तमूर्तिर्मणिमेदिनीषु Śi. 3. 23.<BR>—5 Depicted.<BR>—6 Having Saṃkrānti (in astr.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रान्तम्
संक्रान्त + .{@-तम्@} Property got by a woman from her husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रान्तिः|सङ्क्रान्ति|संक्रान्ति|संक्रांति|संक्रांतिः|सङ्क्रान्तिः
संक्रान्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Going together, union.<BR>—2 Passage from one point to another, transition.<BR>—3 The passage of the sun or any planetary body from one zodiacal<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">Page1604-1</a>]<BR> sign into another.<BR>—4 Transference, giving over (to another); संपातिताः … पयसो<BR> गण्डूषसंक्रान्तयः U. 3. 16.<BR>—5 Transferring or communicating (oneʼs knowledge to another), power of<BR> imparting (instruction to another); विवादे दर्शयिष्यन्तं क्रियासंक्रान्तिमात्मनः<BR> M. 1. 19; शिष्टा क्रिया कस्यचिदात्मसंस्था संक्रान्तिरन्यस्य विशेषयुक्ता 1. 16.<BR>—6 Image, reflection.<BR>—7 Depicting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1603-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रामः|सङ्क्राम|संक्राम|सङ्क्रामः
संक्रामः Difficult progress; see संक्रम.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रीड्|सङ्क्रीड्
संक्रीड् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To play or sport together; संक्रीडन्ते मणिभिरमरप्रार्थिता यत्र<BR> कन्याः Me. 69.<BR>—2 To creak, rattle (as wheels); संक्रीडन्ति शकटानि Mbh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रीडनम्
संक्रीडनम् Sporting together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रीडितम्
संक्रीडितम् Rattle of chariots.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्रोशः|सङ्क्रोश
संक्रोशः Lamentation; Kau. A. 1. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्लिष्ट|सङ्क्लिष्ट
संक्लिष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Bruised, contused.<BR>—2 Tarnished (as a mirror).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संक्लिष्टकर्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्लिष्टकर्मन्
संक्लिष्ट + -कर्मन् <i>a.</i> one who does everything with difficulty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्लेदः|सङ्क्लेद|संक्लेद|सङ्क्लेदः
संक्लेदः<BR>—1 Dampness, moisture.<BR>—2 The fluid secretion supposed to form in the first month after conception<BR> and which constitutes the rudiment of the foetus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षालनम्
संक्षालनम् Washing, ablution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षि|सङ्क्षि
संक्षि €1. €5. €9 P.<BR>—1 To decay, wane.<BR>—2 To be emaciated or lean.<BR>—3 To destroy completely, annihilate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षयः|सङ्क्षय|संक्षय
संक्षयः<BR>—1 Destruction.<BR>—2 Complete destruction or consumption.<BR>—3 Loss, ruin.<BR>—4 End, termination.<BR>—5 Destruction of the world.<BR>—6 Shelter, home; अहो निश्चेतनो राजा जीवलोकस्य संक्षयम् । धर्म्यं<BR> सत्यव्रतं रामं वनवासे प्रवत्स्यति ॥ Rām. 2. 41. 6.<BR>—7 Death; शृणु राजन् यथाकाले प्राप्तो बालस्य संक्षयः Rām. 7. 74. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षिप्|सङ्क्षिप्
संक्षिप् €6 P.<BR>—1 To collect or heap together; आतपात्ययसंक्षिप्तनीवारासु निषादिभिः<BR> R. 1. 52; Bk. 5. 86.<BR>—2 To withdraw, destroy.<BR>—3 To shorten, curtail; abridge; संक्षिप्येत क्षण इव कथं दीर्घयामा<BR> त्रियामा Me. 110; Ms. 7. 34.<BR>—4 To contract, compress.<BR>—5 To diminish, lessen.<BR>—6 To confine, shut in.<BR>—7 To constrain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षिप्त|सङ्क्षिप्त|संक्षिप्तः
संक्षिप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Heaped together.<BR>—2 Compressed, contracted; एकप्रकारसंक्षिप्तं कोसलराज्यम् Pratimā 1;<BR> एकशरीरसंक्षिप्ता पृथिवी रक्षितव्या.<BR>—3 Abridged, curtailed, shortened.<BR>—4 Diminished, lessened.<BR>—5 Brief, concise, short.<BR>—6 Restrained.<BR>—7 Thrown, despatched<BR>—8 Seized, grasped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षिप्तिः|सङ्क्षिप्ति|संक्षिप्ति
संक्षिप्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Throwing together.<BR>—2 Compressing, abridging.<BR>—3 Throwing, sending.<BR>—4 Ambuscade.<BR>—5 Transition (from one feeling to another).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षेपः|सङ्क्षेप|संक्षेप
संक्षेपः<BR>—1 Throwing together.<BR>—2 Compression, abridgment.<BR>—3 Brevity, conciseness.<BR>—4 An epitome, a brief exposition.<BR>—5 Throwing, sending.<BR>—6 Taking away.<BR>—7 Assisting in anotherʼs duty.<BR>—8 Destruction (संहार);<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">Page1604-2</a>]<BR> प्रजासंक्षेपसमये दण्डहस्तामिवान्तकम् Mb. 3. 155. 27.<BR>—9 Total, aggregate. (संक्षेपेण, संक्षेपतस् are used adverbially<BR> in the sense of briefly, concisely, shortly; Kull. on Ms. 1. 68.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षेपणम्
संक्षेपणम्<BR>—1 Heaping together.<BR>—2 Abridgment, abbreviation.<BR>—3 Sending.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षुभ्|सङ्क्षुभ्
संक्षुभ् €1 Ā., €4. €9 P. To tremble, be agitated or disturbed. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> To agitate, excite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षोभः|सङ्क्षोभ|संक्षोभ
संक्षोभः<BR>—1 Agitation, trembling.<BR>—2 Disturbance, commotion; Mk. 2.<BR>—3 Upsetting, overturning.<BR>—4 Pride, haughtiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संक्षोभणम्
संक्षोभणम् Violent shock; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यम्
संख्यम् War, battle, fight; एवमुक्त्वार्जुनः संख्ये रथोपस्थ उपाविशत्<BR> Bg. 1. 47; संख्ये द्विषां वीररसं चकार Vikr. 1. 68, 70; Ve. 3. 25;<BR> Śi. 18. 70; Māl. 8. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्या|सङ्ख्या
संख्या €2 P.<BR>—1 To count, enumerate, calculate, sum up; तावन्त्येव च तत्त्वानि सांख्यैः<BR> संख्यायन्ते Ś. B.<BR>—2 Ved. To appear along with, be connected with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यक|सङ्ख्यक
संख्यक <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Numbering, amounting to; शतसंख्यका नराः &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्या|सङ्ख्या
संख्या<BR>—1 Enumeration, reckoning, calculation; संख्यामिवैषां भ्रमरश्चकार R. 16. 47.<BR>—2 A number.<BR>—3 A numeral.<BR>—4 Sum.<BR>—5 Reason, understanding, intellect; उदारसंख्यैः सचिवैरसंख्यैः Bu. C. 1. 14.<BR>—6 Deliberation, reflection, exposition; धर्मसंख्या महाराज व्यवहार<BR> इतीष्यते Mb. 12. 121. 9.<BR>—7 Manner.<BR>—8 War, battle; संख्यासमयविस्तीर्णमभिजातोद्भवं बहु Mb. 12. 98. 21.<BR>—9 Appellation, name; ततो द्वापरसंख्या सा युगस्य समजायत Rām. 7. 74. 22<BR> (com. द्वापरसंख्या द्वापर इति नाम । पृषोदरादित्वात् साधुः ।).<BR>—10 (In geom.). A gnomon.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संख्यातिग, संख्यातीत, संख्यापदम्, संख्यापरित्यक्त, संख्यामात्रम्, संख्यावाचक, संख्याविधानम्, संख्याशब्दः, संख्यासमापनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यातिग
संख्या + -अतिग, -अतीत <i>a.</i> beyond number, innumerable, countless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यातीत
संख्या + -अतिग, -अतीत <i>a.</i> beyond number, innumerable, countless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यापदम्
संख्या + -पदम् a numeral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यापरित्यक्त
संख्या + -परित्यक्त <i>a.</i> innumerable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यामात्रम्
संख्या + -मात्रम् mere numeration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यावाचक
संख्या + -वाचक <i>a.</i> expressive of number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यावाचकः|सङ्ख्यावाचक
संख्या + -वाचक + .({@-कः@}) a numeral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्याविधानम्
संख्या + -विधानम् the making of a calculation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्याशब्दः|सङ्ख्याशब्द
संख्या + -शब्दः a numeral.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यासमापनः|सङ्ख्यासमापन
संख्या + -समापनः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यात|सङ्ख्यात|सङ्ख्यातं
संख्यात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Enumerated.<BR>—2 Calculated, reckoned up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यातम्
संख्यात + .{@-तम्@} A number.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्याता
संख्यात + .{@-ता@} A kind of riddle; संख्याता नाम संख्यानं यत्र व्यामोहकारणम् Kāv. 3. 101.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यातृ
संख्यातृ <i>a.</i> Examiner; गोसंख्याता भविष्यामि विराटस्य महीपतेः Mb. 4. 3. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यानम्
संख्यानम्<BR>—1 Numbering, calculation; प्रतिषेद्धा च दोग्धा च संख्याने कुशलो गवाम्<BR> Mb. 4. 3. 8; मिथ्यावादी च संख्याने Ms. 8. 400.<BR>—2 Becoming seen, appearance; ॐ नमो भगवते महापुरुषाय सर्वगुणसंख्यानाय<BR> Bhāg. 5. 17. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संख्यावत्|सङ्ख्यावत्|संख्यावन्त्
संख्यावत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Numbered.<BR>—2 Possessed of reason. ━<i>m.</i> A learned man; संख्यावन्तोऽपि भूम्ना<BR> परकृतिषु मुदं संप्रधार्य प्रयान्तु Mv. 7. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगः|सङ्ग|संग|सङ्गः
संगः [सञ्ज् भावे घञ्]<BR>—1 Coming together, joining.<BR>—2 Meeting, union, confluence (as of rivers); विभाति संगात्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-1" target="_blank">Page1605-1</a>]<BR> स्फटिकोपलो यथा A. Rām. 7. 5. 31.<BR>—3 Touch, contact.<BR>—4 Company, association, friendship, friendly intercourse; सतां सद्भिः<BR> संगः कथमपि हि पुण्येन भवति U. 2. 1; संगमनुव्रज् ‘to keep company with, herd with’<BR>; मृगाः मृगैः संगमनुव्रजन्ति Subhāṣ.<BR>—5 Attachment, fondness, desire; ध्यायतो विषयान् पुंसः संगस्तेषूपजायते Bg. 2. 62.<BR>—6 (a) Attachment to worldly ties, association with men; दौर्मन्त्र्यान्नृपतिर्विनश्यति<BR> यतिः संगात् Bh. 2. 42; विमुक्त˚ Ku. 1. 53; Pt. 1. 169. (b) The<BR> subject or cause (हेतु) of attachment; अजितं जेतुकामेन भाव्यं संगेष्वसंगिना<BR> Mb. 12. 189. 14.<BR>—7 Encounter, fight.<BR>—8 Hindrance, obstruction; नाप्सु वा गतिसंगं ते पश्यामि हरिपुंगव<BR> Rām. 4. 44. 3; तत्पूर्वसंगे वितथप्रयत्नः R. 2. 42, 3. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1604-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगिन्|सङ्गिन्
संगिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 United with, meeting.<BR>—2 Attached or devoted to, fond of; बद्धमिव स्वैरगतिर्जनमिह सुखसंगिनमवैमि<BR> Ś. 5. 11; R. 19. 16; M. 4. 2; बुद्धिभेदं न जनयेदज्ञानां कर्मसंगिनाम्<BR> Bg. 3. 26, 14. 15.<BR>—3 Full of affection, desirous.<BR>—4 Libidinous, lustful.<BR>—5 Continuous, uninterrupted; विधूनितं भ्रान्तिमियाय संगिनीम् Ki. 14. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगणिका|सङ्गणिका
संगणिका An excellent or incomparable discourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगम्|सङ्गम्
संगम् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To come or join together, meet, encounter; अक्षधूर्तैः समगंसि<BR> Dk.; एते भगवत्यौ कलिन्दकन्यामन्दाकिन्यौ संगच्छेते A. R. 7.<BR>—2 To cohabit, have sexual intercourse with; भार्या च परसंगता<BR> Pt. 1. 238; Ms. 8. 378.<BR>—3 To keep company or intercourse with, associate with.<BR>—4 To agree, harmonize, be suitable.<BR>—5 To become contracted, shrink up.<BR>—6 To die, depart.<BR>—7 To go to, attain (with acc.). ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To bring together, join, unite; वधूवरौ संगमयांचकार R. 7. 20.<BR>—2 To endow or present with, unite with, bestow on, give to; प्रियसुहृदि<BR> विभीषणे संगमय्य श्रियं वैरिणः R. 12. 104.<BR>—3 To deliver, hand over.<BR>—4 To kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगत|सङ्गत|सङ्गतं
संगत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Joined or united with, come together, associated with; तदा गन्तव्यमनिशं<BR> भवद्भिरिह संगतैः Rām. 7. 36. 58.<BR>—2 Assembled, collected, convened, met together.<BR>—3 Joined in wedlock, married.<BR>—4 Sexually united.<BR>—5 Fitted together, appropriate, harmonious; शृणुतमिदानीं संगतार्था<BR> न वेति Ś. 3.<BR>—6 In conjunction with (as planets).<BR>—7 Shrunk up, contracted; see गम् with सम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगतम्
संगत + .{@-तम्@} Union, meeting, alliance; संगतं श्रीसरस्वत्योर्भूतयेऽस्तु<BR> सदा सताम् V. 5. 24; Ś. 5. 24; Ki. 14. 22.<BR>—2 Association, company.<BR>—3 Acquaintance, friendship, intimacy; यतः सतां संनतगात्रि संगतं<BR> मनीषिभिः साप्तपदीनमुच्यते Ku. 5. 39.<BR>—4 A harmonious or consistent speech, well-reasoned remarks.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संगतगात्र, संगतसन्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगतगात्र
संगत + -गात्र <i>a.</i> having shrivelled limbs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगतसन्धिः|सङ्गतसन्धि
संगत + -सन्धिः a peace concluded after friendship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगतिः|सङ्गति|संगति|सङ्गतिः
संगतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Union, meeting, conjunction; भवत्याः संगत्याः फलमिति च कल्याणि<BR> कलये Ā. L. 17.<BR>—2 Company, society, association, intercourse; मनो हि जन्मान्तरसंगतिज्ञम्<BR> R. 7. 15; क्षणमिह सज्जनसंगतिरेका भवति भवार्णवतरणे नौका Moha M. 6.<BR>—3 Sexual union.<BR>—4 Visiting, frequenting.<BR>—5 Fitness, appropriateness, applicability, consistent relation.<BR>—6 Accident, chance, accidental occurrence.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">Page1605-2</a>]<BR>—7 Knowledge.<BR>—8 Questioning for further knowledge.<BR>—9 (In पूर्वमीमांसा) One of the five members of an अधिकरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगमः|सङ्गम|संगम|सङ्गमः
संगमः<BR>—1 Meeting, union; आवहति धार्यमाणः संगममचिरात् प्रियजनेन V. 4. 65;<BR> R. 12. 66, 90.<BR>—2 Association, company, society, intercourse; as in सद्भिः संगमः.<BR>—3 Contact, touch; गात्रसंगमात् R. 8. 44.<BR>—4 Sexual union or intercourse; अयं स ते तिष्ठति संगमोत्सुकः Ś. 3. 13;<BR> R. 19. 33.<BR>—5 Confluence (of rivers); गंगायमुनयोः संगमे V. 5.<BR>—6 Fitness, adaptation.<BR>—7 Encounter, fight.<BR>—8 Conjunction (of planets).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगमक
संगमक <i>a.</i> Leading to, showing the way.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगमनम्
संगमनम् Meeting, union; see संगम; शमिनोऽपि तस्य नवसंगमने Ki. 6. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगमनः|सङ्गमन|संगमनं
संगमनम् + .{@-नः@} N. of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगरः|सङ्गर|संगर|सङ्गरं|सङ्गरः
संगरः<BR>—1 A promise, an agreement; तथेति तस्या वितथं प्रतीतः प्रत्यग्रहीत्<BR> संगरमग्रजन्मा R. 5. 26, 11. 48; पालितसंगराय 13. 65.<BR>—2 Accepting, undertaking.<BR>—3 A bargain.<BR>—4 War, battle, fight; छलबहुलमरीणां संगरं हा हतोऽस्मि Ve. 5. 21;<BR> अतरत् स्वभुजौजसा मुहुर्महतः संगरसागरानसौ Śi. 16. 67.<BR>—5 Knowledge.<BR>—6 Devouring.<BR>—7 Misfortune, calamity.<BR>—8 Poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगरम्
संगरः + .{@-रम्@} The fruit of the Śamī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगवः|सङ्गव|संगव|सङ्गवः
संगवः N. of a particular part of the day, said to be three Muhūrtas<BR> after Prātastana or early dawn and to form the second of the five divisions<BR> of the day; अथ यत् संगववेलायां स आदिः Ch. Up. 2. 9. 4; मां<BR> केशवो गदया प्रातरव्याद्गोविन्द आसंगवमात्तवेणुः Bhāg. 6. 8. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगावः
संगावः Discourse, conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगुप्त|सङ्गुप्त|सङ्गुप्तः
संगुप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Well protected or preserved.<BR>—2 Well concealed, kept secret.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगुप्तिः|सङ्गुप्ति
संगुप्तिः<BR>—1 Guarding, protection.<BR>—2 Concealment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगूढ|सङ्गूढ|सङ्गूढः
संगूढ <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Completely concealed or hidden.<BR>—2 Contracted, abridged.<BR>—3 Joined, united.<BR>—4 Collected, heaped together, piled up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगृभित|सङ्गृभित
संगृभित <i>p. p.</i> Concentrated; भवद्विधेष्वतितरां मयि संगृभितात्मनाम्<BR> Bhāg. 3. 21. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगॄ|सङ्गॄ
संगॄ €9 U., €6 Ā.<BR>—1 To promise, make a vow (Ātm.); राज्ञे समगिरेताम् Dk.; वसूनि<BR> देशांश्च निवर्तयिष्यन् रामं नृपः संगिरमाण एव Bk. 3. 8.<BR>—2 To recognise, acknowledge.<BR>—3 To agree in calling.<BR>—4 To swallow, devour.<BR>—5 To praise unanimously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीर्ण|सङ्गीर्ण|सङ्गीर्णं
संगीर्ण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Agreed or assented to.<BR>—2 Promised, vowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगै|सङ्गै
संगै €1 P.<BR>—1 To chant, sing in chorus.<BR>—2 To celebrate by singing together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीत|सङ्गीत|सङ्गीतं
संगीत <i>p. p.</i> Sung together, sung in chorus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीतम्
संगीत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Chorus, a song sung by many voices; जगुः सुकण्ठपो गन्धर्व्यः संगीतं<BR> सहभर्तृकाः Bhāg.<BR>—2 Music, harmonious singing,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">Page1606-1</a>]<BR> especially singing accompanied by instrumental music and dancing, triple<BR> symphony; गीतं वाद्यं नर्तनं च त्रयं संगीतमुच्यते; किमन्यदस्याः<BR> परिषदः श्रुतिप्रसादनतः संगीतात् Ś. 1; Mk. 1.<BR>—3 A concert.<BR>—4 The art of singing with music and dancing; साहित्यसंगीतकलाविहीनः<BR> साक्षात् पशुः पुच्छविषाणहीनः Bh. 2. 12.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संगीतार्थः, संगीतशाला, संगीतशास्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1605-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीतार्थः|सङ्गीतार्थ
संगीत + -अर्थः<BR>—1 the subject of a musical performance.<BR>—2 the materials or necessary apparatus for a musical concert; संगीतार्थो<BR> ननु पशुपतेस्तत्र भावी समस्तः Me. 58.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीतशाला
संगीत + -शाला a concert-hall; Māl. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीतशास्त्रम्
संगीत + -शास्त्रम् the science of music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीतकम्
संगीतकम्<BR>—1 Concert, symphony.<BR>—2 A public entertainment consisting of songs attended with music and dancing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगीतिः|सङ्गीति|संगीति|सङ्गीतिः
संगीतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Concert, symphony, harmony.<BR>—2 Conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगोपनम्
संगोपनम् Complete concealment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रह्|सङ्ग्रह्
संग्रह् €9 U.<BR>—1 To collect, gather, accumulate, hoard; संगृह्य धनम्, पाशान् &c.<BR>—2 To receive kindly.<BR>—3 To curb, restrain, check, control, rein in (as horses).<BR>—4 To unstring (as a bow).<BR>—5 To grasp, lay hold of.<BR>—6 To take, receive, accept.<BR>—7 To conceive, understand.<BR>—8 To contract, abridge, narrow.<BR>—9 To encourage, support, favour.<BR>—10 To seize upon, attack (as an illness).<BR>—11 To include, comprise, contain.<BR>—12 To close, shut (as the mouth).<BR>—13 To concentrate.<BR>—14 To constrain, force; तैस्तैरुपायैः संगृह्य दापयेदधमर्णिकम् Ms. 8. 48.<BR>—15 To marry.<BR>—16 To mention, name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगृहीत|सङ्गृहीत
संगृहीत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Gathered, collected, stored.<BR>—2 Grasped, seized.<BR>—3 Restrained, governed.<BR>—4 Received, accepted.<BR>—5 A bridged; see संग्रह् above.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संगृहीतराष्ट्र<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संगृहीतराष्ट्र
संगृहीत + -राष्ट्र <i>a.</i> (a king) who has a well-governed kingdom; सुसंगृहीतराष्ट्रो<BR> हि पार्थिवः सुखमेधते Ms. 7. 113.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रहः|सङ्ग्रह|संग्रह|सङ्ग्रहः
संग्रहः<BR>—1 Seizing, grasping; taking; प्रज्वाल्य तत्र चैवाग्निमकरोत् पाणिसंग्रहम्<BR> Rām. 7. 12. 20.<BR>—2 Clenching the fist, grasp, grip.<BR>—3 Reception, admission.<BR>—4 Guarding, protection; तथा ग्रामशतानां च कुर्याद्राष्ट्रस्य संग्रहम् Ms. 7. 114.<BR>—5 Favouring, propitiating, entertaining, supporting; धनैः कार्योऽस्य<BR> संग्रहः Ms. 3. 138, 8. 311.<BR>—6 Storing, accumulation, gathering, collecting; स्वधासंग्रहतत्पराः<BR> R. 1. 66; तैः कृतप्रकृतिसग्रहैः 19. 55, 17. 60.<BR>—7 Governing, restraining, controlling; एष वै परमो योगो मनसः संग्रहः<BR> स्मृतः Bhāg. 11. 20. 21.<BR>—8 Conglomeration.<BR>—9 Conjunction.<BR>—10 Agglomeration (a kind of संयोग).<BR>—11 Inclusion, comprehension.<BR>—12 Compilation.<BR>—13 Epitome, summary, abridgment, compendium; संग्रहेण प्रवक्ष्यते<BR> Bg. 8. 11; so तकंसंग्रहः; मय्यावेशितया युक्त एतावान् योगसंग्रहः<BR> Bhāg. 11. 23. 61.<BR>—14 Sum, amount, totality; करणं कर्म कर्तेति त्रिविधः कर्मसंग्रहः Bg. 18. 18.<BR>—15 A catalogue, list.<BR>—16 A store-room.<BR>—17 An effort, exertion.<BR>—18 Mention, reference.<BR>—19 Greatness, elevation.<BR>—20 Velocity.<BR>—21 N. of Śiva.<BR>—22 A guardian, ruler, manager; ततो निक्षिप्य काकुत्स्थो<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">Page1606-2</a>]<BR> लक्ष्मणं द्वारि संग्रहम् Rām. 7. 103. 15.<BR>—23 The fetching back of discharged weapons by magical means; Mb.<BR>—24 Taking to wife, marriage.<BR>—25 Perception, notion.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संग्रहश्लोकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रहश्लोकः|सङ्ग्रहश्लोक
संग्रहः + -श्लोकः a verse summarizing what has been mentioned before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रहणम्
संग्रहणम्<BR>—1 Seizing, grasping.<BR>—2 Supporting, encouraging.<BR>—3 Compiling, collecting.<BR>—4 Blending.<BR>—5 Incasing, setting; कनकभूषणसंग्रहणोचितः (मणिः) Pt. 1. 75.<BR>—6 Sexual union, intercourse with a female.<BR>—7 Adultery; Ms. 8. 6, 72; सर्वसाक्षी संग्रहणे चौर्यपारुष्यसाहसे Y. 2. 72.<BR>—8 Hoping.<BR>—9 Accepting, receiving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रहणी|सङ्ग्रहणी
संग्रहणम् + .{@-णी@} Dysentery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रहीतृ|सङ्ग्रहीतृ
संग्रहीतृ <i>m.</i> A charioteer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्राहः|सङ्ग्राह|संग्राह|सङ्ग्राहः
संग्राहः<BR>—1 Laying hold of, grasping.<BR>—2 Forcible seizure.<BR>—3 Clenching the fist.<BR>—4 The fist.<BR>—5 The handle of a shield.<BR>—6 A particular jumping of the horse; Mb. 5. 155. 20 (com. संग्राहः<BR> बृहदुद्रङ्गः हेषणपूर्वकमग्रपादाभ्यामुत्प्लवनमिति; ‘संग्राहो बृहदुद्रङ्गे’ इति विश्वः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्राहकः|सङ्ग्राहक|संग्राहक
संग्राहकः<BR>—1 A collector, compiler.<BR>—2 A charioteer (संगृह्णाति नियच्छति रथ्यान्); उवाच संग्राहकमागतास्थस्तत्रैव<BR> निष्कम्पनिविष्टदृष्टिः Bu. C. 3. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्राहिन्|सङ्ग्राहिन्
संग्राहिन् <i>m.</i> The Kuṭaja tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्राम्
संग्राम् €10 Ā. (P. according to some) To fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रामः|सङ्ग्राम|संग्राम|सङ्ग्रामः
संग्रामः War, battle, fight; संग्रामाङ्गणमागतेन भवता चापे<BR> समारोपिते K. P. 10.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संग्रामकर्मन्, संग्रामजित्, संग्रामतुला, संग्रामतूर्यम्, संग्रामपटहः, संग्रामभूमिः, संग्राममूर्धन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रामकर्मन्
संग्रामः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> the turmoil of battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रामजित्
संग्रामः + -जित् <i>a.</i> conquering in battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रामतुला
संग्रामः + -तुला the ordeal of battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रामतूर्यम्
संग्रामः + -तूर्यम्, -पटहः a large military drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रामपटहः|सङ्ग्रामपटह|संग्रामपटह|सङ्ग्रामपटहः
संग्रामः + -तूर्यम्, -पटहः a large military drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्रामभूमिः|सङ्ग्रामभूमि
संग्रामः + -भूमिः a field of battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संग्राममूर्धन्
संग्रामः + -मूर्धन् <i>m.</i> the front of battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघः|सङ्घ|संघ|सङ्घः
संघः<BR>—1 A group, collection, multitude, flock; as महर्षिसंघ, मनुष्यसंघ<BR> &c.; सिद्धचारणसंघानां बभूव प्रियदर्शनः Mb. 1. 120. 1.<BR>—2 A number of people living together.<BR>—3 Close contact or combination.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संघारामः, संघचारिन्, संघजीविन्, संघतलः, संघवृत्तम्, संघवृत्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघारामः|सङ्घाराम
संघः + -आरामः a Buddhist convent, monastery (विहार).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघचारिन्|सङ्घचारिन्
संघः + -चारिन् <i>a.</i> wandering or moving in numbers; सत्यः खलु लोकप्रवादः<BR> सङ्घचारिणोऽनर्था इति Avimāraka 2; सङ्घचारिणोऽनर्था इतीदृशमेव<BR> Pratijñā. 3. ━<i>m.</i> a fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघजीविन्|सङ्घजीविन्
संघः + -जीविन् <i>m.</i> a hired labourer, <i>coolie</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघतलः|सङ्घतल|सङ्घतलः
संघः + -तलः the two hands with the open palms brought together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघवृत्तम्
संघः + -वृत्तम् the conduct of corporations; Kau. A. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघवृत्तिः|सङ्घवृत्ति
संघः + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> close combination, league.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघट्|सङ्घट्
संघट् €1 Ā. To meet, assemble together. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To join or fasten together, bring together.<BR>—2 To strike (a musical instrument), sound, play upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघटना
संघटना<BR>—1 Joining together, union, combination; देवस्यान्यकलत्रसंघटनया<BR> दुःखं परं स्थापिता Ratn. 4. 19.<BR>—2 Combination of words or sounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघट्ट्|सङ्घट्ट्
संघट्ट् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To strike.<BR>—2 To bring together, unite.<BR>—3 To gather, collect.<BR>—4 To rub, rub against or press against; संघट्टयन्नङ्गदमङ्गदेन R. 6. 73.<BR>—5 To strike against, touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1606-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघट्टः|सङ्घट्ट|संघट्ट|सङ्घट्टः
संघट्टः<BR>—1 Friction, rubbing together; सरलस्कन्धसंघट्टजन्मा (दवाग्निः)<BR> Me. 55; Māl. 5. 3, 9. 1; संघट्टैर्वल्गुभिः स्तनैः Bu. C. 4. 29; Ve. 1. 22.<BR>—2 Collision, clashing together, encounter; फलसंघट्टविकीर्णविस्फुलिङ्गः Śi. 20. 26.<BR>—3 Encounter, conflict.<BR>—4 Meeting, joining, collision or rivalry (as of wives); वक्षस्यसंघट्टसुखं<BR> वसन्ती रेजे सपत्नीरहितेव लक्ष्मीः R. 14. 86.<BR>—5 Embracing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघट्टा|सङ्घट्टा
संघट्टः + .{@-ट्टा@} A large creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघट्टनम्
संघट्टनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Rubbing together, friction.<BR>—2 Collision, clash.<BR>—3 Close contact, adherence to.<BR>—4 Contact, union, cohesion.<BR>—5 The intertwining of wrestlers.<BR>—6 Meeting, encounter in general.<BR>—7 The embrace of lovers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघट्टना
संघट्टनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Rubbing together, friction.<BR>—2 Collision, clash.<BR>—3 Close contact, adherence to.<BR>—4 Contact, union, cohesion.<BR>—5 The intertwining of wrestlers.<BR>—6 Meeting, encounter in general.<BR>—7 The embrace of lovers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघट्टिन्|सङ्घट्टिन्
संघट्टिन् <i>m.</i> An adherent, follower; कृष्णसंघट्टिनः केचिदासन्रामस्य<BR> चापरे Bhāg. 10. 18. 20, 5. 10. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघाटः|सङ्घाट
संघाटः Fitting and joining of timbers, joinery, carpentry; तौ<BR> काष्ठसंघाटमथो चक्रतुः सुमहाप्लवम् Rām. 2. 55. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघाटिका|सङ्घाटिका
संघाटिका<BR>—1 A pair, couple.<BR>—2 A bawd, procuress.<BR>—3 Smell. —4 The nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघाणकः|सङ्घाणक|संघाणकं
संघाणकः, -कम्<BR> The mucus of the nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघाणकम्
संघाणकः, -कम्<BR> The mucus of the nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघातः|सङ्घात|संघात|सङ्घातः
संघातः<BR>—1 Union, combination, an association; त्वक् च मांसं तथाऽस्थीनि मज्जा<BR> स्नायुश्च पञ्चमम् । इत्येतदिह संघातम् Mb. 12. 184. 20.<BR>—2 A multitude, an assemblage, a collection; उपायसंघात इव प्रवृद्धः<BR> R. 14. 11; जलसंघात इवासि विद्रुतः Ku. 4. 6; Bg. 13. 6.<BR>—3 Killing, slaughter.<BR>—4 Phlegm.<BR>—5 Formation of compounds.<BR>—6 N. of a division of hell.<BR>—7 A particular mode of walking (in dramas).<BR>—8 Flow; यस्य शोणितसंघाता भेरी मण्डूककच्छपा Mb. 12. 98. 31 (com.<BR> शोणितसंघाता शोणितौघमयी).<BR>—9 A hard part (कठिनांश); आकाशात् खलु यो घोषः संघातस्तु महीगुणः<BR> Mb. 12. 285. 7.<BR>—10 Combat, war.<BR>—11 A caravan.<BR>—12 A bone.<BR>—13 Intensity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संघातकठिन, संघातचारिन्, संघातज, संघातमृत्युः, संघातशिला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघातकठिन
संघातः + -कठिन <i>a.</i> hard like a solid, solid; द्रवः संघातकठिनः Ku. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघातचारिन्
संघातः + -चारिन् <i>a.</i> gregarious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघातज
संघातः + -ज <i>a.</i> produced by a complicated derangement of the three<BR> humours (सान्निपातिक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघातमृत्युः
संघातः + -मृत्युः wholesale death; कष्टं किनिमित्तममी संघातमृत्यवो<BR> जाताः Nāg. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघातशिला
संघातः + -शिला a stone-like block or hard mass, solid stone; Ku. 1. 56, 5. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघातकः|सङ्घातक
संघातकः, संघात्यः A kind of dramatic performance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघात्यः|सङ्घात्य|संघात्य
संघातकः, संघात्यः A kind of dramatic performance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघुष्|सङ्घुष्
संघुष् €1 P.<BR>—1 To resound.<BR>—2 To proclaim loudly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघुष्ट|सङ्घुष्ट|सङ्घुष्टं|संघुष्टः
संघुष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Resonant, resounding; नानाविहगसंघुष्टम् Mb. 1. 18. 2.<BR>—2 Sounded, proclaimed.<BR>—3 Offered for sale; उदक्यास्पृष्टसंघुष्टं पर्यायान्नं च वर्जयेत् Y. 1. 168.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघुष्टः|सङ्घुष्ट|संघुष्ट|सङ्घुष्टं
संघुष्ट + .{@-ष्टः@} A sound, noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघृष्|सङ्घृष्
संघृष् €1 P.<BR>—1 To rub or grind together.<BR>—2 To rival, emulate, compete or vie with; स प्रयोगनिपुणैः प्रयोक्तृभिः<BR> संजघर्ष सह मित्रसंनिधौ R. 19. 36.<BR>—3 To rub, scratch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघर्षः|सङ्घर्ष|संघर्ष|सङ्घर्षः
संघर्षः<BR>—1 Rubbing together, friction; तयोर्भुजविनिष्पेषात् संघर्षेणोरसोस्तथा Mb. 3. 39. 60.<BR>—2 Grinding, trituration.<BR>—3 Collision, clash; कृष्णमायाविमूढानां संघर्षः सुमहानभूत् Bhāg. 11. 30. 13.<BR>—4 Emulation, rivalry, contest for superiority; पुष्पमासे हि तरवः<BR> संघर्षादिव पुष्पिताः Rām. 4. 1. 91; तस्याश्च मम च कस्मिंश्चित्<BR> संघर्षे Dk.; नाट्याचार्ययोर्महान् ज्ञानसंघर्षो जातः M. 1.<BR>—5 Envy, jealousy.<BR>—6 Gliding, gently flowing.<BR>—7 Enmity, hostility; क्षत्रं स्वर्गं कथं गच्छेच्छस्त्रपूतमिति प्रभो ।<BR> संघर्षजननस्तस्मात् कन्यागर्भो विनिर्भितः ॥ Mb. 12. 2. 4.<BR>—8 Sexual excitement; Mb. 15. 30. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघर्षा
संघर्षः + .{@-र्षा@} Liquid lac.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संघर्षणम्
संघर्षणम् Ointment, unguent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सच्
सच् €1 Ā., €3 P. (सचते, सिषक्ति) Ved.<BR>—1 To follow, pursue.<BR>—2 To go to.<BR>—3 To love, like.<BR>—4 To be obedient.<BR>—5 To honour, serve.<BR>—6 To assist, aid.<BR>—7 To be associated with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचनम्
सचनम्<BR>—1 Honouring.<BR>—2 Service, attendance.<BR>—3 Assisting, helping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचकित
सचकित <i>a.</i> Startled, timid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचकितम्
सचकित + .{@-तम्@} <i>ind.</i> Tremblingly, in an alarmed or startled manner; सचकितमिव<BR> विस्मयाकुलाभिः Ki. 10. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचराचर
सचराचर <i>a.</i> Comprehending everything; ततो दुर्गं च राष्ट्रं<BR> च लोकं च सचराचरम् Ms. 7. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचराचरम्
सचराचर + .{@-रम्@} The universe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचिः|सचि
सचिः<BR>—1 A friend.<BR>—2 Friendship, intimacy. ━<i>f.</i> The wife of Indra; see शची.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचित्र
सचित्र <i>a.</i> Painted, variegated (with pictures); विद्युत्वन्तं<BR> ललितवनिताः सेन्द्रचापं सचित्राः Me. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचिल्लक|सचिल्लकः
सचिल्लक <i>a.</i> Blear-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचिवः|सचिव
सचिवः<BR>—1 A friend, companion; छायेव कर्मसचिवाः साधवो दीनवत्सलाः Bhāg. 11. 2. 6;<BR> Ki. 6. 43.<BR>—2 A minister, counsellor; सचिवान् सप्त चाष्टौ वा प्रकुर्वीत परीक्षितान्<BR> Ms. 7. 54; R. 1. 34, 4. 87, 8. 67; कार्यान्तरसचिवः M. 1.<BR>—3 The dark thorn-apple.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सचिवामयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचिवामयः|सचिवामय
सचिवः + -आमयः a kind of disease (Mar. धांवरें).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सची
सची See शची.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचेतन
सचेतन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sentient, animate, rational.<BR>—2 Conscious, sensible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचेतस्
सचेतस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Intelligent; व्रीडितव्यमपि ते सचेतसः Ki. 13. 46.<BR>—2 Possessed of feeling; सचेतसः कस्य मनो न दूयते Ku. 5. 48.<BR>—3 Unanimous.<BR>—4 Conscious; इदानीमस्मि संवृत्तः सचेताः प्रकृतिं गतः Bg. 11. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचेल
सचेल <i>a.</i> Dressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सचेष्टः|सचेष्ट
सचेष्टः The mango tree. ━<i>a.</i> Making efforts, active.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सच्छाय
सच्छाय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Shady.<BR>—2 Glittering.<BR>—3 Having the same colour as.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सच्छिद्र
सच्छिद्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having holes.<BR>—2 Defective, faulty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1607-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजन|सजनः
सजन <i>a.</i> Having men or living beings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजनः|सजन
सजन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 A man of the same family, a kinsman.<BR>—2 Public, people; एतस्य वेदिष्यावो न नावेतत् सजन इति Bṛ. Up. 3. 2. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजम्बाल|सजंबाल|सजम्बालः
