सजल
सजल <i>a.</i> Watery, wet, humid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजागर
सजागर <i>a.</i> Waking, awake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजात|सजातः
सजात <i>a.</i> Born together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजातः|सजात
सजात + .{@-तः@} A brother (Ved.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजाति|सजातिः
सजाति, -सजातीय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Of the same kind, tribe, class, or species.<BR>—2 Like, similar. ━<i>m.</i> A son of a man and woman of the same caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजातीय|सजातीयः
सजाति, -सजातीय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Of the same kind, tribe, class, or species.<BR>—2 Like, similar. ━<i>m.</i> A son of a man and woman of the same caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजात्यम्
सजात्यम् Brotherhood, relationship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजानि
सजानि <i>a.</i> Together with wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजुष्
सजुष्(स्) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Loving, attached to.<BR>—2 Associated together. ━<i>m.</i> (Nom. सजूः सजुषौ सजुषः; instr.<BR> dual सजूर्भ्याम्) A friend, companion; खेलायन्ननिशं नापि सजूःकृत्य<BR> रतिं वसेत् Bk. 5. 72. ━<i>ind.</i> With, together with; सजूरिन्द्रेण<BR> पञ्चाशद्देवास्ते मरुतोऽभवन् Bhāg. 6. 18. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सजुस्
सजुष्(स्) <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Loving, attached to.<BR>—2 Associated together. ━<i>m.</i> (Nom. सजूः सजुषौ सजुषः; instr.<BR> dual सजूर्भ्याम्) A friend, companion; खेलायन्ननिशं नापि सजूःकृत्य<BR> रतिं वसेत् Bk. 5. 72. ━<i>ind.</i> With, together with; सजूरिन्द्रेण<BR> पञ्चाशद्देवास्ते मरुतोऽभवन् Bhāg. 6. 18. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्ज्
सज्ज् €1 P. To go, move. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cling, adhere.<BR>—2 To fix (the mind) upon.<BR>—3 To cause oneʼs self to be embraced; सज्जयन्ति हि ते नारीर्निगूढाश्चारयन्ति<BR> च Ms. 8. 362.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्ज|सज्जः
सज्ज <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Ready, made or got ready, prepared; सज्जं क्रतुवरं राजन् कालप्राप्तं<BR> च भारत Mb. 3. 256. 2; सज्जो रथः U. 1.<BR>—2 Dressed, clothed.<BR>—3 Accoutred, trimmed.<BR>—4 Fully equipped, armed.<BR>—5 Fortified.<BR>—6 Strung, placed on a bow-string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जनम्
सज्जनम्<BR>—1 Fastening, tying on.<BR>—2 Dressing.<BR>—3 Preparing, arming, equipping.<BR>—4 A guard, sentry.<BR>—5 A ferry, <i>ghāt</i>. ━<i>a.</i> Hanging round; निवीती कण्ठसज्जने Ms. 2. 63.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जनः|सज्जन|सज्जनं
सज्जनम् + .{@-नः@} A good man; see under सत्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जना
सज्जनम् + .{@-ना@}<BR>—1 Decoration, accoutrement, equipment.<BR>—2 Dressing, ornamenting.<BR>—3 Decorating an elephant before riding; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जा
सज्जा<BR>—1 Dress, decoration.<BR>—2 Equipment, apparatus.<BR>—3 Military accoutrement, armour, mail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जित|सज्जितः
सज्जित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Dressed.<BR>—2 Decorated.<BR>—3 Made ready, equipped; सामादिसज्जितैः पाशैः प्रतीक्षन्ते दिवानिशम् Pt. 1. 157.<BR>—4 Accoutred, armed.<BR>—5 Fastened, attached to; परिधाय स्ववासांसि प्रेष्ठसंगमसज्जिताः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 22. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जीकृ
सज्जीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To make ready, prepare, equip.<BR>—2 To decorate.<BR>—3 To string (a bow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्जीभू
सज्जीभू €1 P. To be ready, to be equipped, accoutred, or decorated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्य
सज्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Furnished with a bow-string; शरासनानां सज्यानां टङ्कारेण महीयसा<BR> Śiva B. 4. 39.<BR>—2 Strung (as a bow); न तेन सज्यं क्वचिदुद्यतं धनुः Ki. 1. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्योतिस्
सज्योतिस् <i>ind.</i> According to the light; सज्योतिः स्यादनध्यायः<BR> शेषे रात्रौ यथा दिवा Ms. 4. 106, 5. 82.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सज्योत्स्ना
सज्योत्स्ना A moonlight night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचः|सञ्च|संच|सञ्चः
संचः A collection of leaves for writing upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचकः|सञ्चक
संचकः A mould; an impression in which the outlines of the thing<BR> to be reproduced are inscribed in an inverted fashion (Marāṭhī ठसा);<BR> विधिर्विधत्ते विधुना वधूनां किमाननं काञ्चनसंचकेन N. 22. 47, 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्चत्|संचत्
सञ्चत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A cheat, rogue, juggler.<BR>—2 Cheating, deceit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचर्|सञ्चर्
संचर् €1 P. (but Ātm. when used with the instrumental of a conveyance)<BR>—1 To move, walk, go, pass, walk about; यानैः समचरन्तान्ये Bk. 8. 32;<BR> क्वचित् पथा संचरते सुराणाम् R. 13. 19; N. 6. 57.<BR>—2 To practise, perform.<BR>—3 To pass over, be transferred to.<BR>—4 To act, behave; भो राजानश्चरमवयसामाज्ञया संचरध्वम् Māl. 6. 2.<BR>—5 To join, meet.<BR>—6 To pass or roam through, travel over.<BR>—7 To arrive at, reach, attain. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to go about, lead, conduct; यूथानि संचार्य Ś. 5. 5.<BR>—2 To cause to spread, circulate.<BR>—3 To transmit, communicate, pass over, deliver over to (as a disease &c.).<BR>—4 To turn out (as cattle &c.) to graze.<BR>—5 To impel, instigate, incite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचरः|सञ्चर|संचर|सञ्चरः
संचरः<BR>—1 Passage, transit from one zodiacal sign to another.<BR>—2 A way, path; यत्रौषधिप्रकाशेन नक्तं दर्शितसंचराः Ku. 6. 43; R. 16. 12.<BR>—3 A narrow road, defile, difficult passage.<BR>—4 Entrance, gate.<BR>—5 The body.<BR>—6 Killing.<BR>—7 Development. ━<i>a.</i> Going about, moving everywhere; अनिरुक्तस्त्रयोदशः<BR> स्तोभः संचरो हुंकारः Ch. Up. 1. 13. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचरणम्
संचरणम्<BR>—1 Going, motion, travelling.<BR>—2 Setting in motion, use.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचरणी
संचरणम् + .{@-णी@} Passage, way; संचरणी यैषा हृदयादूर्ध्वा नाडपुच्चरति<BR> Bṛ. Up. 4. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारः|सञ्चार|संचार|सञ्चारः
संचारः<BR>—1 Going, movement, travelling or roaming through; स पुनः पार्थसंचारं<BR> संचरत्यवनीपतिः K. P. 10; सुलभपुरुषसंचारेऽस्मिन् प्रदेशे<BR> Mk. 7; R. 2. 15.<BR>—2 Passing through, passage, transit.<BR>—3 A course, way, road, pass.<BR>—4 A difficult progress or journey.<BR>—5 Difficulty, distress.<BR>—6 Inciting.<BR>—7 Leading, guiding.<BR>—8 Transmission, contagion.<BR>—9 A gem said to be found in the hood of serpents.<BR>—10 The entrance of the sun into a new sign.<BR>—11 Infatuating; तथाख्यातविधानं च योगः संचार एव च Mb. 12. 59. 48<BR> (com. संचारः श्रवणदर्शनाभ्यां परमोहनम्).<BR>—12 Track (of wild animals).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संचारजीविन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारजीविन्|सञ्चारजीविन्
संचारः + -जीविन् <i>a.</i> seeking a living by roaming; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारक|सञ्चारक|संचारकः
संचारक <i>a.</i> Conveying, transmitting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारकः|सञ्चारक|संचारक
संचारक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A leader, guide.<BR>—2 An instigator.<BR>—3 An orator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारणम्
संचारणम् Moving, impelling, conveying, leading &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1608-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारिका|सञ्चारिका
संचारिका<BR>—1 A female messenger, go-between.<BR>—2 A bawd, procuress.<BR>—3 A pair, couple.<BR>—4 Smell, odour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारित|सञ्चारित
संचारित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Moved, set in motion.<BR>—2 Impelled, driven onward, incited.<BR>—3 Conveyed; see संचर्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचारिन्|सञ्चारिन्
संचारिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Moving, moveable; संचारिणी नगरदेवतेव Māl. 1; Ku. 3. 54;<BR> संचारिणी दीपशिखेव रात्रौ R. 6. 67.<BR>—2 Roaming, wandering.<BR>—3 Changing, unsteady, fickle.<BR>—4 Difficult to be passed, inaccessible.<BR>—5 Evanescent, as a Bhāva; see below.<BR>—6 Influencing.<BR>—7 Hereditary, successively communicated (as a disease).<BR>—8 Contagious.<BR>—9 Impelling. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 Wind, air.<BR>—2 Incense.<BR>—3 A transient or evanescent feeling which serves to strengthen the prevailing<BR> sentiment; see व्यभिचारिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचल्|सञ्चल्
संचल् €1 P.<BR>—1 To move about, move to and fro, waver, oscillate.<BR>—2 To quiver, tremble.<BR>—3 To start or jump up.<BR>—4 To depart, go away. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To shake, agitate.<BR>—2 To expel, remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचल|सञ्चल
संचल <i>a.</i> Trembling, quivering.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संचलनाडिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचलनाडिः|सञ्चलनाडि
संचल + -नाडिः an artery, vein.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचलनम्
संचलनम् Agitation, trembling, shaking; अचलसंचलनाहरणो<BR> रणः Ki. 18. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचाली|सञ्चाली
संचाली The Guñjā shrub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचस्कारयिषु
संचस्कारयिषु <i>a.</i> Wishing anyone to perform a purificatory rite;<BR> धर्मराजश्च तत्रैव संचस्कारयिषुस्तदा Mb. 15. 26. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचानः|सञ्चान|सञ्चानः
संचानः A falcon; a kind of bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचाय्यः|सञ्चाय्य|संचाय्य|सञ्चाय्यः
संचाय्यः N. of a particular sacrifice; P. III. 1. 130.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचि|सञ्चि
संचि €5 U.<BR>—1 To gather, collect, hoard; रक्षायोगादयमपि तपः प्रत्यहं संचिनोति<BR> Ś. 2. 14; R. 19. 2; Ms. 6. 15.<BR>—2 To arrange, put in order, put or place; संचित्य पात्राणि यथाविधानम् Bk. 3. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचयः|सञ्चय|संचय|सञ्चयः
संचयः<BR>—1 Heaping up, gathering.<BR>—2 Hoard, heap, accumulation, stock, store; कर्तव्यः संचयो नित्यं<BR> कर्तव्यो नातिसंचयः Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 A large quantity, collection.<BR>—4 Joint; दोर्निष्पेषविशीर्णसंचयदलत्कङ्कालमुन्मथ्नतः Māl. 8. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचयनम्
संचयनम्<BR>—1 Gathering, collecting.<BR>—2 Collecting the ashes and bones of a body after it has been burnt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचयिन्|सञ्चयिन्
संचयिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Collecting, gathering, hoarding &c.<BR>—2 Possessed of riches.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचित|सञ्चित
संचित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Heaped up, accumulated, hoarded, collected.<BR>—2 Laid by, stored.<BR>—3 Enumerated, reckoned.<BR>—4 Full of, furnished or provided with.<BR>—5 Impeded, obstructed.<BR>—6 Dense, thick (as a wood).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचितिः|सञ्चिति|संचिति
संचितिः <i>f.</i> A collection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचिन्त्|सञ्चिन्त्|संचिंत्
संचिन्त् €10 U.<BR>—1 To think, consider, reflect, think over; इति संचिन्त्य नृपतिः क्रतुतुल्यफलं<BR> पृथक् Y. 1. 360; अद्यापि तामवहितां मनसाचलेन संचिन्तयामि युवतीं<BR> मम जीविताशाम् C. P. 32.<BR>—2 To weigh (in the mind), discriminate.<BR>—3 To design, intend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचिन्तनम्
संचिन्तनम् Consideration, reflection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचिन्तित|सञ्चिन्तित|संचिंतित
संचिन्तित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Considered, thought about.<BR>—2 Designed, intended.<BR>—3 Settled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचूर्ण्
संचूर्ण् €10 U.<BR>—1 To pulverize.<BR>—2 To bruise, crush; संचूर्णयामि गदया न सुयोधनोरू Ve. 1. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचूर्णनम्
संचूर्णनम् Crushing to pieces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संचोदना
संचोदना<BR>—1 Urging, exciting.<BR>—2 A stimulant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संछद्|सञ्छद्
संछद् €10 U.<BR>—1 To hide, conceal.<BR>—2 To envelop, cover, wrap up.<BR>—3 To put on (as clothes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संछन्न|सञ्छन्न
संछन्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Enveloped, concealed, hidden.<BR>—2 Clothed.<BR>—3 Surrounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संछर्दनम्
संछर्दनम् Spitting out, ejecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संछादनम्
संछादनम् Obscuring, hiding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संछिद्|सञ्छिद्
संछिद् €7 U.<BR>—1 To cut, cut off, divide.<BR>—2 To penetrate, pierce.<BR>—3 To remove, clear, solve (as a doubt &c.).<BR>—4 To settle, decide (a question).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संछिदा
संछिदा Destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संच्छेदः
संच्छेदः<BR>—1 Cutting, dividing.<BR>—2 Removal, solution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्ज्|संज्
सञ्ज् €1 P. (सजति, सक्त; the स् of the root being changed<BR> to ष् after a preposition ending in इ or उ)<BR>—1 To stick or adhere to, cling to; तुल्यगन्धिषु मत्तेभकटेषु फलरेणवः<BR> (ससञ्जुः) R. 4. 47.<BR>—2 To go, move.<BR>—3 To fasten. ━<i>Pass.</i> (सज्यते)<BR>—1 To be attached to, cling or adhere to.<BR>—2 To linger, hesitate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जनम्
सञ्जनम्<BR>—1 The act of attaching, fastening.<BR>—2 Joining, folding (the hands).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजन्|सञ्जन्
संजन् €4 Ā.<BR>—1 To be born or produced.<BR>—2 To grow, arise, spring.<BR>—3 To be or become.<BR>—4 To elapse, pass (time). ━<i>Caus.</i> To beget, produce, generate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जः|सञ्ज|संज|संजः
सञ्जः<BR>—1 N. of Brahman.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजनन|सञ्जनन
संजनन <i>a.</i> Producing, causing, effecting; प्रीतिसंजननैः<BR> पितुः गुणैर्विरुरुचे रामः Rām. 2. 1. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजननम्
संजनन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Production, creation.<BR>—2 Growth, development.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजात|सञ्जात
संजात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Born, produced, grown, arisen (oft. in comp. in the sense of ‘growing, becoming, possessing’<BR>; संजातकोप ‘being angry’); so संजातपक्ष ‘winged’, &c.<BR>—2 Passed (as time.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संजातनिर्वेद, संजातविश्रम्भ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजातनिर्वेद
संजात + -निर्वेद <i>a.</i> grown despondent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजातविश्रम्भ
संजात + -विश्रम्भ <i>a.</i> becoming confident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजप्|सञ्जप्
संजप् €1 P. To report, communicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1609-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजयः|सञ्जय|संजय
संजयः<BR>—1 Conquest, victory.<BR>—2 A kind of military array.<BR>—3 N. of the charioteer of king Dhṛtarāṣṭra. He tried to bring about<BR> a peaceful settlement of the dispute between the Kauravas and Pāṇḍavas,<BR> but failed. It was he who narrated the events of the great Bhāratī war<BR> to the blind king Dhṛtarāṣṭra; cf. धर्मक्षेत्रे कुरुक्षेत्रे समवेता<BR> युयुत्सवः । मामकाः पाण्डवाश्चैव किमकुर्वत संजय ॥ Bg. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजल्प्|सञ्जल्प्
संजल्प् €1 P. To talk, converse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजल्पः|सञ्जल्प|संजल्प
संजल्पः<BR>—1 Conversation; असतां दर्शनात् स्पर्शात् संजल्पाच्च सहासनात् Mb. 3. 1. 29.<BR>—2 Confused talk, chattering, confusion.<BR>—3 An uproar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजवनम्
संजवनम्<BR>—1 A quadrangle; a group of four houses forming a court.<BR>—2 A way-mark, sign-post.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सञ्जा
सञ्जा A she-goat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजावनम्
संजावनम् Pouring a little butter-milk into warm milk (Mar. दूध विरजणें).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजिहान|सञ्जिहान
संजिहान <i>a.</i> Giving up, leaving (the bed); संजिहानस्तु द्वापरः<BR> Ait. Br. 7. 15. 15; स ह प्रातः संजिहान उवाच Ch. Up. 1. 10. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजीव्|सञ्जीव्
संजीव् €1 P.<BR>—1 To live together.<BR>—2 To live, exist (by any profession). —3 To be restored to life. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To revive, restore or bring to life, reanimate; (इदं सर्वं चराचरम्)<BR> संजीवयति चाजस्रं प्रमापयति चाव्ययः Ms. 1. 57.<BR>—2 To maintain, nourish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजीवनम्
संजीवनम्<BR>—1 Living together.<BR>—2 Bringing to life, life-restoring, reanimation, resuscitation.<BR>—3 N. of one of the 21 hells; see Ms. 4. 89.<BR>—4 A group of four houses, quadrangle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजीवनी
संजीवनम् + .{@-नी@}<BR>—1 A kind of elixir (said to restore the dead to life).<BR>—2 Making alive, restoring life.<BR>—3 Food.<BR>—4 N. of Mallināthaʼs commentaries on Ku.; R. and Me.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संजीवनौषधिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संजीवनौषधिः
संजीवनम् + -ओषधिः <i>f.</i> a reviving or life-restoring plant; संजीवनौषधिरसो<BR> नु हृदि प्रसिक्तः U. 3. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञा
संज्ञा €9 Ā.<BR>—1 To know, understand, be aware of.<BR>—2 To recognize.<BR>—3 To live in harmony, agree together (with acc. or instr.); पित्रा पितरं<BR> वा संजानीते Sk.<BR>—4 To watch, be on the alert; संजानानान् परिहरन् रावणानुचरान् बहून् Bk. 8. 27.<BR>—5 To accede or agree to.<BR>—6 To remember, think of (Paras.); मातुः मातरं वा संजानाति Sk.<BR>—7 To direct, appoint. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To inform.<BR>—2 To appease, gratify, console.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To quiet, pacify (a sacrificial animal).<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To kill.<BR>—4 To command, enjoin.<BR>—5 To animate.<BR>—6 To make intelligible, cause to be understood, inform.<BR>—7 To make a sign to (any one), communicate by signs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञ
संज्ञ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Knock-kneed.<BR>—2 Being conscious.<BR>—3 Named, called; see संज्ञा below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञम्
संज्ञ + .{@-ज्ञम्@} A yellow fragrant wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञक
संज्ञक <i>a.</i> Killing, destroying (नाशक); कदा वयं करिष्यामः<BR> संन्यासं दुःखसंज्ञकम् Mb. 12. 279. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञपनम्
संज्ञपनम्<BR>—1 Killing; दृष्ट्वा संज्ञपनं योगं पशूनां स पतिर्मखे Bhāg. 4. 5. 24.<BR>—2 Deception, defrauding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञपित|सञ्ज्ञपित
संज्ञपित, संज्ञप्त <i>p. p.</i> Sacrificed, killed; तं<BR> यज्ञपशवोऽनेन संज्ञप्ता ये दयालुना Bhāg. 4. 28. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञप्त
संज्ञपित, संज्ञप्त <i>p. p.</i> Sacrificed, killed; तं<BR> यज्ञपशवोऽनेन संज्ञप्ता ये दयालुना Bhāg. 4. 28. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञप्तिः|सञ्ज्ञप्ति|सञ्ज्ञप्तिः
संज्ञप्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Apprising, informing.<BR>—2 Killing, sacrificing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञा
संज्ञा<BR>—1 Consciousness; अकरुण पुनः संज्ञाव्याधिं विधाय किमीहसे Māl. 9. 42;<BR> रतिखेदसमुत्पन्ना निद्रा संज्ञाविपर्ययः Ku. 6. 44. संज्ञां<BR> लभ्, आपद् or प्रतिपद् ‘to regain or recover oneʼs consciousness, come to oneʼs senses’<BR>.<BR>—2 Knowledge, understanding; नायका मम सैन्यस्य संज्ञार्थं तान् ब्रवीमि<BR> ते Bg. 1. 7; Mb. 12. 153. 63.<BR>—3 Intellect, mind; लोकतन्त्रं हि संज्ञाश्च सर्वमन्ने प्रतिष्ठितम् Mb. 13. 63. 5.<BR>—4 A hint, sign, token, gesture; मुखार्पितैकाङ्गुलिसंज्ञयैव मा चापलायेति<BR> गणान् व्यनैषीत् Ku. 3. 41; उपलभ्य ततश्च धर्मसंज्ञाम् Bu. C. 5. 21;<BR> Bhāg. 6. 7. 17.<BR>—5 A name, designation, an appellation; oft. at the end of comp. in this<BR> sense; द्वन्द्वैर्विमुक्ताः सुखदुःखसंज्ञैः Bg. 15. 5.<BR>—6 (In gram.) Any name or noun having a special meaning, a proper name.<BR>—7 The technical name for an affix.<BR>—8 The Gāyatrī Mantra; see गायत्री.<BR>—9 A track, footstep.<BR>—10 Direction.<BR>—11 A technical term.<BR>—12 N. of the daughter of Viśvakarman and wife of the sun, and mother<BR> of Yama, Yamī, and the two Aśvins. [A legend relates that संज्ञा<BR> on one occasion wished to go to her fatherʼs house and asked her husbandʼs<BR> permission, which was not granted. Resolved to carry out her purpose,<BR> she created, by means of her superhuman power, a woman exactly like herself<BR> −who was, as it were, her own shadow (and was therefore called Chāyā),<BR> −and putting her in her own place, went away without the knowledge of<BR> the sun. Chāyā bore to the sun three children (see छाया), and lived<BR> quite happily with him, so that when Saṃjñā returned, he would not<BR> admit her. Thus repudiated and disappointed, she assumed the form of a<BR> mare and roamed over the earth. The sun, however, in course of time, came<BR> to know the real state of things, and discovered that his wife had assumed<BR> the form of a mare. He accordingly assumed the form of a horse, and was<BR> united with his wife, who bore to him, two sons━ the Aśvinīkumāras<BR> or Aśvins q. v.]<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संज्ञाधिकारः, संज्ञाविपर्ययः, संज्ञाविषयः, संज्ञासुतः, संज्ञासूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञाधिकारः|सञ्ज्ञाधिकार
संज्ञा + -अधिकारः a leading rule which gives a particular name to the<BR> rules falling under it, and which exercises influence over them.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञाविपर्ययः
संज्ञा + -विपर्ययः loss of consciousness; रतिखेदसमुत्पन्ना निद्रा<BR> संज्ञाविपर्ययः Ku. 6. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञाविषयः|सञ्ज्ञाविषय
संज्ञा + -विषयः an epithet, an attribute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञासुतः|सञ्ज्ञासुत
संज्ञा + -सुतः an epithet of Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञासूत्रम्
संज्ञा + -सूत्रम् any Sūtra which teaches the meaning of a technical term.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञानम्
संज्ञानम् Knowledge, understanding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञापनम्
संज्ञापनम्<BR>—1 Informing.<BR>—2 Teaching.<BR>—3 Killing, slaughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1610-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञावत्
संज्ञावत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having consciousness, become sensible, revived.<BR>—2 Having a name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1611-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञिका
संज्ञिका A name, appellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1611-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञिन्|सञ्ज्ञिन्
संज्ञिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Named.<BR>—2 That which receives a name. ━(<i>m.</i> also in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1611-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संज्ञित
