संज्वरः|सञ्ज्वर|संज्वर|सञ्ज्वरः
संज्वरः<BR>—1 Great heat, fever; यत्स्नेहसंज्वरवता हृदयेन नित्यम् Māl. 9. 36;<BR> Ms. 4. 185.<BR>—2 Heat.<BR>—3 Indignation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1611-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

