संदेशकम्
संदेशकम् News, tidings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदिह्|सन्दिह्
संदिह् €2 U.<BR>—1 To smear, cover over, anoint.<BR>—2 To heap together.<BR>—3 To doubt, be uncertain about; Y. 2. 16; संदिग्धो विजयो युधि Pt. 3. 12.<BR>—4 To mistake for, to confound with (in <i>pass.</i>); पान्तु त्वामकठोरकेतकशिखासंदिग्धमुग्धेन्दवः<BR> (जटाः) Māl. 1. 2; धूपैर्जालविनिःसृतैर्वलभयः संदिग्धपारावताः<BR> V. 3. 2; Ku. 6. 40.<BR>—5 To start an objection. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To confuse, perplex.<BR>—2 To be doubtful or uncertain (Ātm.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1619-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदिग्ध|सन्दिग्ध|सन्दिग्धः
संदिग्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Besmeared, covered.<BR>—2 Dubious, doubtful, uncertain; as in संदिग्धमति-बुद्धि &c.<BR>—3 Mistaken for or confounded with.<BR>—4 Doubted, questioned.<BR>—5 Confused, obscure, unintelligible (as a sentence).<BR>—6 Dangerous, risky, unsafe.<BR>—7 Envenomed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदिग्धम्
संदिग्ध + .{@-ग्धम्@}<BR>—1 A doubt, uncertainty.<BR>—2 Besmearing.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संदिग्धार्थ, संदिग्धपुनरुक्तत्वम्, संदिग्धफल, संदिग्धमति, संदिग्धबुद्धि<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदिग्धार्थ|सन्दिग्धार्थ|संदिग्धार्थः|सन्दिग्धार्थः
