संदिग्धार्थः|सन्दिग्धार्थ|संदिग्धार्थ|सन्दिग्धार्थः
संदिग्ध + -अर्थ + .({@-र्थः@})<BR>—1 an ambiguous or doubtful meaning.<BR>—2 a disputed matter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदिग्धपुनरुक्तत्वम्
संदिग्ध + -पुनरुक्तत्वम् (Rhet.) uncertainty and tautology.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदिग्धफल
संदिग्ध + -फल <i>a.</i> having arrows with poisoned tips; Dk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदिग्धमति|सन्दिग्धमति|सन्दिग्धमतिः
संदिग्ध + -मति, -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> sceptical, doubtful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदिग्धबुद्धि
संदिग्ध + -मति, -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> sceptical, doubtful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदिग्धीकृत
संदिग्धीकृत <i>p. p.</i> Made to present a doubtful resemblance; संदिग्धीकृतबाष्पबिन्दुरुदितं<BR> पौराङ्गनाभिस्तथा B. R. 6. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदेहः|सन्देह|संदेह|सन्देहः
संदेहः<BR>—1 Doubt, uncertainty, suspense; अत्र कः संदेहः.<BR>—2 Risk, danger, peril; जीवितसंदेहदोलामारोपितः K.; अर्थार्जने<BR> प्रवृत्तिः ससंदेहा H. 1; Pt. 1. 176.<BR>—3 (In Rhet.) Doubt regarded as a figure of speech, in which the close<BR> resemblance between two objects leads to one of them being mistaken for<BR> the other (this figure is also called ससंदेह by Mammaṭa and others);<BR> ससंदेहस्तु भेदोक्तौ तदनुक्तौ च संशयः K. P. 10; <i>e. g.</i> see<BR> Māl. 1. 2 (1. 3); V. 3. 2.<BR>—4 Conglomeration of material elements (of the body).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संदेहालंकारः, संदेहदोला, संदेहपद<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदेहालंकारः|सन्देहालङ्कार
संदेहः + -अलंकारः a particular figure of speech.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदेहदोला
संदेहः + -दोला the swing of uncertainty, a state of suspense, dilemma, fix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदेहपद
संदेहः + -पद <i>a.</i> doubtful; सतां हि संदेहपदेषु वस्तुषु प्रमाणमन्तःकरणप्रवृत्तयः Ś. 1. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदेहिन्|सन्देहिन्
संदेहिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Doubtful.<BR>—2 Doubting, uncertain, diffident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदेह्य
संदेह्य <i>a.</i> Doubtful; यस्यानुवित्तः प्रतिबुद्ध आत्माऽस्मिन् संदेह्ये<BR> गहने प्रविष्टः Bṛ. Up. 4. 4. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदेह्यः|सन्देह्य
संदेह्य + .{@-ह्यः@} The body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदी|सन्दी
संदी (wrong for आसन्दी) A small bed-stead, cot, couch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदीप्|सन्दीप्
संदीप् €4 Ā. To burn or shine very brightly, glow. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To light, kindle, inflame.<BR>—2 To excite, incite, arouse, stimulate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदीपन
संदीपन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Kindling, inflaming, exciting; संदीपना एव दुःखस्य प्रियसखीविनोदनोपायाः U. 3.<BR>—2 Provoking; U. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदीपनः|सन्दीपन
संदीपन + .{@-नः@} One of the five arrows of Cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदीपनम्
संदीपन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Kindling, inflaming.<BR>—2 Exciting, stimulating; अनङ्गसंदीपनमाशु कुर्वते Ṛs. 1. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदीपनी
संदीपन + .{@-नी@} (in music) A particular श्रुति.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदीप्त|सन्दीप्त
संदीप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Kindled or inflamed.<BR>—2 Excited, stimulated.<BR>—3 Instigated, stirred up, prompted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदुष्|सन्दुष्
संदुष् €4 P. To be defiled or stained. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To defile, pollute, corrupt, soil, taint.<BR>—2 To violate.<BR>—3 To accuse, censure, find fault with, condemn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदुष्ट|सन्दुष्ट
संदुष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Polluted, defiled; नारीसंदूषणानि Ms. 9. 13.<BR>—2 Wicked, depraved.<BR>—3 Ill-disposed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदूषणम्
संदूषणम् Defiling, corrupting, vitiating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदूषित|सन्दूषित
संदूषित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Violated, defiled, stained, polluted.<BR>—2 Grown worse (as a disease).<BR>—3 Abused, censured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदुह्|सन्दुह्
संदुह् €1 P., €2 U. To assemble; संदोह्यान्यांश्च सैनिकान् Śiva B. 24. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदृभ्|सन्दृभ्
संदृभ् €6 P.<BR>—1 To string or bind together.<BR>—2 To weave together, weave into a bunch or garland.<BR>—3 To arrange, connect, compose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदर्भः|सन्दर्भ|संदर्भ|सन्दर्भः
संदर्भः<BR>—1 Stringing together, weaving, arranging.<BR>—2 Collection, uniting, mixture; विस्मयानन्दसन्दर्भजर्जराः करुणोर्मयः U. 7. 12.<BR>—3 Consistency, continuity, regular connection, coherence; संदर्भशुद्धिं<BR> गिराम् Gīt. 1.<BR>—4 Construction.<BR>—5 A composition, literary work; रसगङ्गाधरनामा संदर्भोऽयं चिरं<BR> जयतु R. G.; U. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संदर्भविरुद्ध, संदर्भशुद्ध, संदर्भशुद्धिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदर्भविरुद्ध
संदर्भः + -विरुद्ध <i>a.</i> irrelevant, incoherent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदर्भशुद्ध
संदर्भः + -शुद्ध <i>a.</i> connected, coherent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदर्भशुद्धिः|सन्दर्भशुद्धि
संदर्भः + -शुद्धिः <i>f.</i> clearness of arrangement (as of a composition).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदृब्ध|सन्दृब्ध
संदृब्ध <i>p. p.</i> Strung together, interwoven; वेत्थ नु त्वं काप्य<BR> तत् सूत्रं येनायं च लोकः परश्च लोकः सर्वाणि च भूतानि संदृब्धानि<BR> भवन्तीति Bṛ. Up. 3. 7. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदृश्|सन्दृश्
संदृश् €1 P.<BR>—1 To see, behold; धिङ्मां त्रिशिरसा नाऽहं संदर्शिष्येऽद्य यत् पुनः Bk. 16. 9.<BR>—2 To see well or perfectly.<BR>—3 To consider, reflect upon.<BR>—4 To calculate, enumerate.<BR>—5 To overlook, wink at. ━<i>Pass.</i><BR>—1 To look like, resemble, be similar.<BR>—2 To become visible, appear. ━<i>Caus.</i> To show, exhibit, discover;<BR> आत्मानं मृतवत् संदर्श्य स्थितः H. 1; Bk. 4. 33; M. 4. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदर्शः|सन्दर्श
संदर्शः Appearance, sight; हीनाः पिशाचसंदर्शा भविष्यन्ति कलौ<BR> प्रजाः Bhāg. 12. 3. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदर्शनम्
संदर्शनम्<BR>—1 Seeing, beholding, viewing.<BR>—2 Gazing, looking steadfastly.<BR>—3 Meeting, seeing one another.<BR>—4 Sight, appearance, vision.<BR>—5 Regard, consideration.<BR>—6 Showing, displaying.<BR>—7 Employment, use; अपायसंदर्शनजां विपत्तिमुपायसंदर्शनजां च<BR> सिद्धिम् Pt. 1. 61.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदृष्ट|सन्दृष्ट
संदृष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Seen, beheld.<BR>—2 Ordained, prescribed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संदोहः|सन्दोह|संदोह|सन्दोहः
संदोहः<BR>—1 Milking.<BR>—2 The whole quantity of anything, a multitude, heap, mass, assemblage;<BR> कुन्दमाकन्दमधुबिन्दुसंदोहवाहिना मारुतेनोत्ताम्यति Māl. 3; Bv. 4. 9;<BR> Bhāg. 10. 14. 37; ननु सर्वाक्षौहिणीसंदोहेन छादयिष्ये जयद्रथम्<BR> Dūtavākyam 1; (शिलीमुखानां) संदोहं द्रुतमुदपादयन् परेषु Śiva B. 24. 62.<BR>—3 The whole milk (of a herd).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संद्रावः|सन्द्राव|संद्राव|सन्द्रावः
संद्रावः<BR>—1 Flight, retreat.<BR>—2 Speed, gait; जाम्बवं नीलसहितं चारुसंद्रावमब्रवीत् Bk. 7. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधा
संधा €3 U.<BR>—1 To join, bring together, unite, combine, put together, compound, mix;<BR> यानि उदकेन संधीयन्ते तानि भक्षणीयानि Kull.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To treat with, form friendship or alliance with, make peace with;<BR> शत्रुणा न हि संदध्यात् सुश्लिष्टेनापि संधिना H. 1. 88; Cāṇ. 19; Kām. 9. 41.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To unite in friendship, reconcile,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-1" target="_blank">Page1621-1</a>]<BR> make a friend of; सकृद्दुष्टमपीष्टं यः पुनः संधातुमिच्छति Pt. 2. 33.<BR>—3 To fix upon, direct towards; संदधे दृशमुदग्रतारकाम् R. 11. 69.<BR>—4 To fit to or place upon the bow (as a missile, arrow &c.); धनुष्यमोघं<BR> समधत्त बाणम् Ku. 3. 66; R. 3. 53, 12. 97.<BR>—5 To produce, cause; पर्याप्तं मयि रमणीयडामरत्वं संधत्ते गगनतलप्रयाणवेगः<BR> Māl. 5. 3; संधत्ते भृशमरतिं हि सद्वियोगः Ki. 5. 51.<BR>—6 To hold out against, be a match for; शतमेकोऽपि संधत्ते प्राकारस्थो<BR> धनुर्धरः Pt. 1. 229.<BR>—7 To mend, repair, heal.<BR>—8 To inflict upon.<BR>—9 To grasp, support, take hold of.<BR>—10 To grant, yield.<BR>—11 To make good, atone for.<BR>—12 To contract, close up.<BR>—13 To approach, come near.<BR>—14 To prepare, make, compose.<BR>—15 To assist, aid.<BR>—16 To comprehend, conceive.<BR>—17 To possess, have.<BR>—18 To perform, do; स्वलीलया संदधतेऽव्ययात्मने Bhāg. 7. 8. 41;<BR> वाङ्मात्रेणापि साहाय्यं मित्रादन्यो न संदधे Pt. 2. 12.<BR>—19 To employ, make use of, apply to use.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1620-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधा
संधा<BR>—1 Union, association.<BR>—2 Intimate union, close connection.<BR>—3 State, condition.<BR>—4 An agreement, a promise, stipulation, compact; ततार संधामिव सत्यसंधः<BR> R. 14. 52; Mv. 7. 8.<BR>—5 Limit, boundary; यन्नस्त्वं कर्मसंधानां साधूनां गृहमेधिनाम् Bhāg. 6. 5. 42.<BR>—6 Fixity, steadiness.<BR>—7 Twilight.<BR>—8 Distillation (for संधान q. v.). —9 Steady continuance in any state.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधातृ|सन्धातृ
संधातृ <i>m.</i> N. of Śiva and Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधानम्
संधानम्<BR>—1 Joining, uniting; वायुः संधानम् T. Up. 1. 3. 2.<BR>—2 Union, junction, combination; यदर्धे विच्छिन्नं भवति कृतसंधानमिव<BR> तत् Ś. 1. 9; Ku. 5. 27; R. 12. 101.<BR>—3 Mixing, compounding (of medicines &c.).<BR>—4 Restoration, repairing.<BR>—5 Fitting, taking an aim, fixing (as an arrow to the bow-string); तत्<BR> साधुकृतसंधानं प्रतिसंहर सायकम् Ś. 1. 11; अथाग्नियन्त्रसंधानविशेषोदग्रविक्रमान्<BR> Śiva B. 30. 1; Śi. 20. 8.<BR>—6 Alliance, league, friendship, peace; मृद्घटवत् सुखभेद्यो दुःसंधानश्च<BR> दुर्जनो भवति H. 1. 88 (where it has sense 1 also).<BR>—7 A joint; पादजङ्घयोः संधाने गुल्फः Suśr.<BR>—8 Attention.<BR>—9 Direction.<BR>—10 Supporting.<BR>—11 Distillation (of liquors).<BR>—12 Spirituous liquor or a kind of it.<BR>—13 A kind of relish eaten to excite thirst.<BR>—14 Preparation of pickles.<BR>—15 Contraction of the skin by means of astringents.<BR>—16 Sour rice-gruel.<BR>—17 Bellmetal (सौराष्ट्र).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधानिका|सन्धानिका
संधानिका A kind of pickle or sauce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधानित|सन्धानित|सन्धानितः
संधानित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 United, strung together.<BR>—2 Bound, tied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधानिन्|सन्धानिन्
संधानिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tying or binding together.<BR>—2 Clever in taking aim.<BR>—3 Distilling liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधानिनी|सन्धानिनी
संधानिनी A cow-house, cow-pen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधानी|सन्धानी
संधानी<BR>—1 Distillation.<BR>—2 Braziery, foundry.<BR>—3 The manufacture of spirituous liquors.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधालिका
संधालिका A kind of food; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिः|सन्धि|संधि|सन्धिः
संधिः<BR>—1 Union, junction, combination, connection; संधये सरला सूची वक्रा<BR> छेदाय कर्तरी Subhāṣ.; Me. 60.<BR>—2 A compact, an agreement.<BR>—3 Alliance, league, friendship, peace, treaty of peace (one of the six<BR> expedients to be used in foreign politics); कति प्रकाराः संधीनां भवन्ति<BR> H. 4; (the several kinds are described in H. 4. 106-125); शत्रुणा न<BR> हि संदध्यात् सुश्लिष्टेनापि संधिना H. 1. 85.<BR>—4 A joint, articulation (of the body); तुरगानुधावनकाण्डितसंधेः Ś. 2.<BR>—5 A fold (of a garment).<BR>—6 A breach, hole, chasm.<BR>—7 Especially a mine, chasm or opening made by thieves in a wall or underneath<BR> a building; संधिं छित्त्वा तु ये चौर्यं रात्रौ कुर्वन्ति तस्कराः Ms. 9. 276;<BR> वृक्षवाटिकापरिसरे संधिं कृत्वा प्रविष्टोऽस्मि मध्यमकम् Mk. 3.<BR>—8 Separation, division.<BR>—9 Euphony, euphonic junction or coalition (in gram.)<BR>—10 An interval, a pause.<BR>—11 A critical juncture.<BR>—12 An opportune moment.<BR>—13 A period at the expiration of each <i>Yuga</i> or age; त्रेताद्वापरयोः<BR> संधौ Mb. 1. 2. 3.<BR>—14 A division or joint (in a drama); (they are five; see S. D. 330-332);<BR> तौ संधिषु व्यञ्जितवृत्तिभेदम् Ku. 7. 91.<BR>—15 The vulva.<BR>—16 Distillation.<BR>—17 Land etc. donated for the worship of temple-deities etc. (cf. Dr. ▪ Raghavanʼs note on<BR> वृत्तिसन्धिप्रतिपादकः Cola-Campū. p. 1 “संधिः<BR> देवपूजार्थमतिसृष्टं तादृशं भूम्यादिकं संधिपदस्य द्रविडदेवालयशिलाशासनेषु<BR> तादृशेऽर्थे व्यवहारदर्शनात् ।”).<BR>—18 Contrivance, management; तस्य सावरणदृष्टसंधयः काम्यवस्तुषु<BR> नवेषु संगिनः R. 19. 16.<BR>—19 Twilight.<BR>—20 A seam.<BR>—21 The connecting link of a perpendicular (in mensuration).<BR>—22 The common side of double triangle.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संध्यक्षरम्, संधिकाष्ठम्, संधिगृहः, संधिचोरः, संधिच्छेदः, संधिच्छेदनम्, संधिजम्, संधिजीवकः, संधिदूषणम्, संधिनालः, संधिनालम्, संधिपालत्वम्, संधिप्रबन्धनम्, संधिबन्ध, संधिबन्धनम्, संधिभङ्गः, संधिमुक्तिः, संधिमोक्षः, संधिरन्ध्रका, संधिविग्रहः,^1 संधिविग्रहकः, संधिविचक्षणः, संधिविद्, संधिविपर्ययौ, संधिवेला, संधिशूलम्, संधिसंभवः, संधिहारकः<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यक्षरम्
संधिः + -अक्षरम् a diphthong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिकाष्ठम्
संधिः + -काष्ठम् the wood below the top of a gable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिगृहः|सन्धिगृह
संधिः + -गृहः a bee-hive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिचोरः|सन्धिचोर
संधिः + -चोरः a house-breaker, a thief who breaks into a house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिच्छेदः|सन्धिच्छेद
संधिः + -छेदः making holes or breaches (in a wall &c.); as in संधिच्छेदशिक्षकः M. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिच्छेदनम्
संधिः + -छेदनम् burglary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिजम्
संधिः + -जम् spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिजीवकः|सन्धिजीवक|संधिजीवक|सन्धिजीवकः
संधिः + -जीवकः one who lives by dishonest means (particularly as a go-between).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिदूषणम्
संधिः + -दूषणम् violation of a treaty; अरिषु हि विजयार्थिनः क्षितीशा<BR> विदधति सोपधि संधिदूषणानि Ki. 1. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिनालः|सन्धिनाल
संधिः + -नालः, -नालम् Unguis Odoratus (नख, क्षुर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिनालम्
संधिः + -नालः, -नालम् Unguis Odoratus (नख, क्षुर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिपालत्वम्
संधिः + -पालत्वम् maintenance of treaties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिप्रबन्धनम्
संधिः + -प्रबन्धनम् the ligament of a joint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिबन्ध|सन्धिबन्ध|सन्धिबन्धः
संधिः + -बन्ध<BR>—1 the tissues of joints; Ś. 2.<BR>—2 the cement or lime.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिबन्धनम्
संधिः + -बन्धनम् a ligament, tendon, nerve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिभङ्गः|सन्धिभङ्ग|संधिभंग
संधिः + -भङ्गः, -मुक्तिः <i>f.</i> dislocation of a joint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिमुक्तिः|सन्धिमुक्ति
संधिः + -भङ्गः, -मुक्तिः <i>f.</i> dislocation of a joint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिमोक्षः
संधिः + -मोक्षः the breaking of peace; Kau. A. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिरन्ध्रका|सन्धिरन्ध्रका
संधिः + -रन्ध्रका a hole in a wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिविग्रहः|सन्धिविग्रह
संधिः + -विग्रहः^1 <i>m.</i> du. peace and war. ˚अधिकारः the office of<BR> the minister for foreign affairs.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिविग्रहकः|सन्धिविग्रहक
संधिः + -विग्रहकः a minister presiding over the above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिविचक्षणः|सन्धिविचक्षण|संधिविचक्षण
संधिः + -विचक्षणः one skilled in negotiating treaties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिविद्|सन्धिविद्
संधिः + -विद् <i>m.</i> a negotiator of treaties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिविपर्ययौ
संधिः + -विपर्ययौ peace and war; दूते संधिविपर्ययौ Ms. 7. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिवेला|सन्धिवेला
संधिः + -वेला<BR>—1 the time of twilight.<BR>—2 any connecting period.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिशूलम्
संधिः + -शूलम् a kind of painful indigestion (आमवात).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिसंभवः|सन्धिसम्भव|संधिसंभव
संधिः + -संभवः a diphthong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिहारकः|सन्धिहारक|संधिहारक|सन्धिहारकः
संधिः + -हारकः a house-breaker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिकः|सन्धिक|संधिक
संधिकः A kind of fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिका|सन्धिका
संधिका Distillation (of liquors).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1621-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधित|सन्धित|सन्धितः
संधित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 United, joined; शपथैः संधितस्यापि न विश्वासं व्रजेद्रिपोः Pt. 2. 39.<BR>—2 Bound, tied.<BR>—3 Reconciled, allied.<BR>—4 Fixed, fitted.<BR>—5 Mixed together.<BR>—6 Pickled, preserved (wrong for संदित; cf. Ms. 8. 342).<BR>—7 Concluded (as an alliance).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधितम्
संधित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Pickles.<BR>—2 Spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिन्
संधिन् <i>m.</i> A minister of alliances.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिनी|सन्धिनी
संधिनी<BR>—1 A cow in heat (united with the bull or impregnated by him).<BR>—2 A cow milked unseasonably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधिला|सन्धिला
संधिला<BR>—1 A hole or breach made in a wall, pit, chasm.<BR>—2 A river.<BR>—3 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—4 Loud orchestral sound of a band of musicians; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधेय|सन्धेय
संधेय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 To be united or joined.<BR>—2 Capable of being reconciled; सुजनस्तु कनकघटवद् दुर्भेद्यश्चाशुसंधेयः H. 1. 88.<BR>—3 To be made peace with.<BR>—4 To be aimed at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधुक्ष्|सन्धुक्ष्
संधुक्ष् €1 Ā. To be kindled or excited (fig. also); संदुधुक्षे<BR> तयोः कोपः Bk. 14. 109. ━<i>Caus.</i> To kindle, inflame, excite; निर्वाणभूयिष्ठमथास्य<BR> वीर्यं संधुक्षयन्तीव वपुर्गुणेन Ku. 3. 52; आतपान्तसंधुक्षितमदा V. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधुक्षणम्
संधुक्षणम्<BR>—1 Kindling, inflaming; इतश्चेतश्च गच्छन्ती वैरसंधुक्षणे रता Mb. 3. 276. 16.<BR>—2 Exciting, stimulating; रागिणस्त्यागशक्तिसंधुक्षणम् Dk. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधुक्षित|सन्धुक्षित
संधुक्षित <i>p. p.</i> Kindled, inflamed, excited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधृ|सन्धृ
संधृ €10 U.<BR>—1 To hold, bear, carry.<BR>—2 To hold up, support, prop, sustain; अरैः संधार्यते नाभिः Pt. 1. 81.<BR>—3 To curb, restrain, check.<BR>—4 To keep in mind, retain in memory; यः सततं परिपृच्छति शृणोति<BR> संधारयत्यनिशम् Pt. 5. 92.<BR>—5 To hold, have, possess; retain, keep; भृत्यः न स संधार्यो भूभुजा<BR> भूतिमिच्छता Pt. 1. 112.<BR>—6 To observe, follow.<BR>—7 To bear, suffer, endure.<BR>—8 To survive, remain alive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधारणम्
संधारणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Restraining, checking.<BR>—2 Observing, following.<BR>—3 Suffering, enduring.<BR>—4 Refusal (of a request).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संधारणा
संधारणम्, -णा<BR>—1 Restraining, checking.<BR>—2 Observing, following.<BR>—3 Suffering, enduring.<BR>—4 Refusal (of a request).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्य|सन्ध्य
संध्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Being on the point of junction; संध्यं तृतीयं स्वप्नस्थानं तस्मिन्<BR> संध्ये स्थाने तिष्ठन् Bṛ. Up. 4. 3. 9.<BR>—2 Based on संधि, euphonic combination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्या|सन्ध्या
संध्या<BR>—1 Union.<BR>—2 Joint, division.<BR>—3 Morning or evening twilight; अनुरागवती संध्या दिवसस्तत्पुरस्सरः ।<BR> अहो दैवगतिश्चित्रा तथापि न समागमः ॥ K. P. 7.<BR>—4 Early morning.<BR>—5 Evening, dusk; संध्यामङ्गलदीपिका विभजते शुद्धान्तवृद्धाजनः<BR> V. 3. 2; संध्याभ्ररेखेव मुहूर्तरागाः Pt. 1. 194.<BR>—6 The period which precedes a <i>Yuga</i>, the time intervening between<BR> the expiration of one <i>Yuga</i> and the commencement of another; चत्वार्याहुः<BR> सहस्राणि वर्षाणां तत्कृतं युगम् । तस्य तावच्छती संध्या संध्यांशश्च<BR> तथाविधः ॥ Ms. 1. 69; अथासौ युगसंध्यायां दस्युप्रायेषु राजसु<BR> Bhāg. 1. 3. 25.<BR>—7 The morning, noon, and evening prayers of a Brāhmaṇa;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">Page1622-2</a>]<BR> उत्थायावश्यकं कृत्वा कृतशौचः समाहितः । पूर्वं संध्यां जपंस्तिष्ठेत्<BR> स्वकाले चापरां चिरम् ॥ Ms. 4. 93, 2. 69.<BR>—8 A promise, an agreement.<BR>—9 A boundary, limit.<BR>—10 Thinking, meditation.<BR>—11 A kind of flower.<BR>—12 N. of a river.<BR>—13 N. of the wife of Brahman.<BR>—14 Any one of the divisions of the day (पूर्वाह्ण, मध्याह्न, अपराह्ण).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संध्यांशः, संध्यांशुः, संध्याभ्रम्, संध्योपासनम्, संध्योपासना, संध्याकालः, संध्यात्रयम्, संध्यानाटिन्, संध्यापयोदः, संध्यापुष्पी, संध्याबलः, संध्याबलिः, संध्यामङ्गलम्, संध्यारागः, संध्यारामः, संध्यावन्दनम्, संध्यासमयः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यांशः|सन्ध्यांश|संध्यांश|सन्ध्यांशः
संध्या + -अंशः the period at the end of each Yuga; Ms. 1. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यांशुः|सन्ध्यांशु|संध्यांशु
संध्या + -अंशुः twilight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्याभ्रम्
संध्या + -अभ्रम्<BR>—1 an evening cloud (tinged with the sunʼs rays); संध्याभ्ररेखेव मुहूर्तरागाः Pt. 1. 194.<BR>—2 a kind of red-chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्योपासनम्
संध्या + -उपासनम्, -उपासना Saṃdhyā adoration; Ms. 2. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्योपासना
संध्या + -उपासनम्, -उपासना Saṃdhyā adoration; Ms. 2. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्याकालः|सन्ध्याकाल|संध्याकाल
संध्या + -कालः<BR>—1 the period of twilight.<BR>—2 evening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यात्रयम्
संध्या + -त्रयम् the three divisions of the day (forenoon, noon and afternoon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यानाटिन्|सन्ध्यानाटिन्
संध्या + -नाटिन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यापयोदः|सन्ध्यापयोद
संध्या + -पयोदः a twilight rain-cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यापुष्पी
संध्या + -पुष्पी<BR>—1 a kind of jasmine.<BR>—2 a nutmeg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्याबलः|सन्ध्याबल|संध्याबल|सन्ध्याबलः
संध्या + -बलः a demon (राक्षस).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्याबलिः|सन्ध्याबलि|संध्याबलि|सन्ध्याबलिः
संध्या + -बलिः<BR>—1 an image of bull in a temple of Śiva.<BR>—2 the evening oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यामङ्गलम्
संध्या + -मङ्गलम् an evening religious rite. ˚दीपिका an auspicious<BR> evening lamp; V. 3. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यारागः|सन्ध्याराग|संध्याराग|सन्ध्यारागं
संध्या + -रागः red-lead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यारामः|सन्ध्याराम|संध्याराम|सन्ध्यारामः
संध्या + -रामः (some take आराम as the word here) an epithet of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यावन्दनम्
संध्या + -वन्दनम् the morning and evening prayers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संध्यासमयः|सन्ध्यासमय|संध्यासमय
संध्या + -समयः<BR>—1 evening-time.<BR>—2 a portion of each Yuga.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्न|सन्नः
सन्न <i>p. p.</i> [सद्-क्त]<BR>—1 Sitting down, settling down, lying.<BR>—2 Dejected, sunk down, downcast.<BR>—3 Drooping, relaxed; नालक्षयत् साध्वससन्नहस्तः Ku. 3. 51.<BR>—4 Weak, low, feeble.<BR>—5 Wasted away, decayed.<BR>—6 Perished, destroyed.<BR>—7 Still, motionless.<BR>—8 Shrunk.<BR>—9 Adjacent, near.<BR>—10 Gone, departed.<BR>—11 Sunk, low (in tone &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नः|सन्न
सन्न + .{@-न्नः@} The tree called पियाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नम्|संनम्
सन्न + .{@-न्नम्@}<BR>—1 A little, a small quantity.<BR>—2 Destruction, loss.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सन्नकण्ठ, सन्नजिह्व, सन्नधी, सन्नभाव, सन्नमुसलम्, सन्नवाच्, सन्नहर्ष<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नकण्ठ
सन्न + -कण्ठ <i>a.</i> choked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नजिह्व
सन्न + -जिह्व <i>a.</i> one whose tongue is silent; तत्तेजसा हतरुचः<BR> सन्नजिह्वाः ससाध्वसाः Bhāg. 4. 7. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नधी
सन्न + -धी <i>a.</i> dispirited; यादोगणाः सन्नधियः ससाध्वसाः Bhāg. 3. 17. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नभाव
सन्न + -भाव <i>a.</i> despondent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नमुसलम्
सन्न + -मुसलम् a motionless pestle; विधूमे सन्नमुसले Ms. 6. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नवाच्
सन्न + -वाच् <i>a.</i> speaking with low tone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नहर्ष
सन्न + -हर्ष <i>a.</i> desponding, cheerless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नक|सन्नकः
सन्नक <i>a.</i> Low, dwarfish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नकः|सन्नक
सन्नक + .{@-कः@} The Piyāla tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सन्नकद्रुः, सन्नकद्रुमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नकद्रुः|सन्नकद्रु
सन्नक + -द्रुः, -द्रुमः the Piyāla tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नकद्रुमः|सन्नकद्रुम
सन्नक + -द्रुः, -द्रुमः the Piyāla tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सन्नतर
सन्नतर <i>a.</i> Lower, more depressed (as a tone); P. I. 2. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनादः|सन्नाद|संनाद
संनादः Uproar, din, clamour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनम्|सन्नम्
संनम् €1 P.<BR>—1 To bend, stoop, incline; संनताङ्गी Ku. 1. 34; Bk. 2. 31; पर्वसु<BR> संनता V. 4. 26.<BR>—2 To submit or subject oneself to, obey; संनमतामरीणाम् R. 18. 34.<BR>—3 To bend down, bow down to.<BR>—4 To make ready, prepare.<BR>—5 To be accomplished. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To contract, bend together.<BR>—2 To cause to bend or stoop.<BR>—3 To make ready, prepare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनत|सन्नत
संनत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Bent down, stooping.<BR>—2 Down-cast.<BR>—3 Contracted.<BR>—4 Filled with; परमानन्दसंनतो मन्त्री ममानेकविधां संभावनामकार्षीत् Dk. 1. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संनताङ्ग, संनतभ्रू<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनताङ्ग
संनत + -अङ्ग <i>a.</i> having<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">Page1623-1</a>]<BR> rounded limbs; सा राजहंसैरिव संनताङ्गी Ku. 1. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1622-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनतभ्रू
संनत + -भ्रू <i>a.</i> frowning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनतिः|सन्नति|संनति|सन्नतिः
संनतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Obeisance, respectful salutation, reverence; ये च दिग्विजये तस्य<BR> संनतिं न ययुर्नृपाः Bhāg. 10. 70. 24.<BR>—2 Stooping posture, crouching.<BR>—3 Humility.<BR>—4 A kind of sacrifice.<BR>—5 A sound, noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनयः|सन्नय|संनय|सन्नयः
संनयः<BR>—1 A collection, multitude, quantity, number; अस्मिन् राजसमावाये देवानामिव<BR> संनये Mb. 1. 189. 6.<BR>—2 Rear, rear-guard (of an army).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनह्|सन्नह्
संनह् €4 U.<BR>—1 To tie, bind, fasten.<BR>—2 To wear, put on, dress.<BR>—3 To put on (as armour), arm oneself, be accoutred; समनात्सीत्ततो<BR> सैन्यम् Bk. 15. 111, 112, 14. 7, 16. 4.<BR>—4 To make oneself ready, prepare oneself (for any action) (Ātm. in this sense); युद्धाय संनह्यते<BR> Mbh.; छेत्तुं वज्रमणीञ् शिरीषकुसुमप्रान्तेन संनह्यते Bh. 2. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनद्ध|सन्नद्ध|सन्नद्धः
संनद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Tied or bound together, girded or put on; सर्वं पर्वतसंनद्धं<BR> सौवर्णमभवद्वनम् Rām. 1. 37. 21.<BR>—2 Clad or dressed in armour, accoutred, mailed.<BR>—3 Arranged, ready, or prepared, for battle; armed, fully equipped; नवजलधरः<BR> संनद्धोऽयं न दृप्तनिशाचरः V. 4. 1; कः संनद्धे विरहविधुरां<BR> त्वग्युपेक्षेत जायाम् Me. 8; संनद्धः कवची खडगी चापवाणधरो युवा<BR> Rāmarakṣā 21.<BR>—4 Ready, prepared, formed, arranged in general; लतेव संनद्धमनोज्ञपल्लवा R. 3. 7.<BR>—5 Pervading; कुसुममिव लोभनीयं यौवनमङ्गेषु संनद्धम् Ś. 1. 21.<BR>—6 Well-provided with anything.<BR>—7 Murderous.<BR>—8 Closely attached, bordering, near.<BR>—9 Ready to burst or blossom.<BR>—10 Provided with charms.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संनद्धकवच, संनद्धयोध<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनद्धकवच
संनद्ध + -कवच <i>a.</i> clad in mail, accoutred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनद्धयोध
संनद्ध + -योध <i>a.</i> with a force fully equipped; मानी मानपालः संनद्धयोधो<BR> युद्धकामो भूत्वा Dk. 1. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनहनम्
संनहनम्<BR>—1 Preparing, equipping, arming oneself.<BR>—2 Preparation.<BR>—3 Fastening tightly.<BR>—4 Industry, effort.<BR>—5 Tightness; यज्ञाङ्गानि च चत्वारि तस्य संनहनेऽभवन् Mb. 10. 18. 7.<BR>—6 A band, rope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनाहः|सन्नाह|संनाह|सन्नाहः
संनाहः<BR>—1 Arming (oneself) or preparation for battle, putting on armour.<BR>—2 Warlike preparation, equipment; संनाहगुणाः Kau. A. 9; संनाहोऽयं<BR> साहसमवगमयति Dk. 2. 4.<BR>—3 Armour, mail; अस्मिन् कलौ खलोत्सृष्टदुष्टवाग्बाणदारुणे कथं जीवेज्जगन्न<BR> स्युः संनाहाः सज्जना यदि Kīr. K. 1. 36; Ki. 16. 12.<BR>—4 Materials, accoutrements; सदश्वै रुक्मसन्नाहैर्भटैः पुरटवर्मभिः<BR> Bhāg. 9. 10. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनाह्यः|सन्नाह्य|संनाह्य|सन्नाह्यः
संनाह्यः A war-elephant; Mātaṅga L. 8. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिकर्षः|सन्निकर्ष|संनिकर्ष|सन्निकर्षः
संनिकर्षः<BR>—1 Drawing near, bringing near.<BR>—2 Vicinity, proximity; presence; उत्कण्ठते च युष्मत्संनिकर्षस्य<BR> U. 6; Ku. 3. 74; R. 7. 8, 6. 20.<BR>—3 Connection, relation.<BR>—4 (In Nyāya phil.) Connection of an organ of sense (इन्द्रिय) with<BR> its object (विषय); this is of six kinds; स भूतसूक्ष्मेन्द्रियसंनिकर्षम्<BR> Bhāg. 2. 2. 30.<BR>—5 A modern object or idea; वेदांश्चैके संनिकर्षं पुरुषाख्या Ms. 1. 1. 27<BR> (Śabara explains संनिकर्षम् as संनिकृष्टकालाः कृतका वेदा<BR> इदानींतनाः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिकर्षणम्
संनिकर्षणम्<BR>—1 Bringing near.<BR>—2 Approaching, approximating.<BR>—3 Proximity, vicinity.<BR>—4 Relation, connection.<BR>—5 Connection of an organ of sense with its object; see संनिकर्ष (4) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिकृष्ट|सन्निकृष्ट|सन्निकृष्टः
संनिकृष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Approximate.<BR>—2 Proximate, adjacent, near.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिकृष्टम्
संनिकृष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@} Proximity, vicinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिचयः|सन्निचय|संनिचय
संनिचयः A collection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिचित|सन्निचित
संनिचित <i>a.</i> Constipated, stagnated; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिधा|सन्निधा
संनिधा €3 U.<BR>—1 To place, put, or keep together; दूरादाहृत्य समिधः संनिदध्याद्विहायसि Ms. 2. 186.<BR>—2 To place near; इदमनन्यपरायणमन्यथा हृदयसंनिहिते हृदयं<BR> मम Ś. 3. 19.<BR>—3 To fix upon, direct towards; (दृष्टिं) पुनः सहस्रार्चिषि संनिधत्ते R. 13. 44.<BR>—4 To draw near, approach; ध्यातैर्ध्यातैः संनिधेयं भवद्भिः Mv. 1. 50.<BR>—5 To collect, pile up.<BR>—6 To observe, inspect. ━<i>Pass.</i> To be near, be present. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> To collect, bring together, assemble; U. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिधम्
संनिधम् Vicinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिधातृ|सन्निधातृ
संनिधातृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 One who brings near.<BR>—2 One who deposits.<BR>—3 A receiver of stolen goods; संनिधातॄंश्च मोषस्य हन्याच्चौरमिवेश्वरः Ms. 9. 278.<BR>—4 An officer who introduces people at court; संनिधातृचेयकर्म Kau. A. 1 also 2, 5.<BR>—5 One who receives in charge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिधानम्
संनिधानम्, संनिधिः<BR>—1 Putting down together, juxtaposition.<BR>—2 Proximity, vicinity, presence; असत्यामाकाङ्क्षायां संनिधानमकारणम्<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 23; N. 2. 53.<BR>—3 Perceptibility, appearance.<BR>—4 A receptacle.<BR>—5 Receiving, taking charge of.<BR>—6 Combination, aggregate; दोषाणां संनिधानम् (स्त्रीयन्त्रम्) Pt. 1. 191.<BR>—7 Depositing.<BR>—8 The object of an organ of sense (इन्द्रियविषय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिधिः|सन्निधि|संनिधि|सन्निधिः
संनिधानम्, संनिधिः<BR>—1 Putting down together, juxtaposition.<BR>—2 Proximity, vicinity, presence; असत्यामाकाङ्क्षायां संनिधानमकारणम्<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 4. 23; N. 2. 53.<BR>—3 Perceptibility, appearance.<BR>—4 A receptacle.<BR>—5 Receiving, taking charge of.<BR>—6 Combination, aggregate; दोषाणां संनिधानम् (स्त्रीयन्त्रम्) Pt. 1. 191.<BR>—7 Depositing.<BR>—8 The object of an organ of sense (इन्द्रियविषय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपत्|सन्निपत्
संनिपत् €1 P.<BR>—1 To alight, descend.<BR>—2 To come together, assemble, meet together.<BR>—3 To fall upon, attack; उद्दामेन द्विरदपतिना संनिपत्याभियुक्तः U. 3. 6.<BR>—4 To arrive, appear.<BR>—5 To perish, be destroyed. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To throw or shoot down, discharge.<BR>—2 To convoke, convene, assemble, collect together.<BR>—3 To stretch out (a cord).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपत्य|सन्निपत्य
संनिपत्य <i>ind.</i> Immediately, directly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपत्योपकारिन्
संनिपत्योपकारिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 That अङ्ग which serves the purpose of its प्रधान directly.<BR> See सामवायिक <i>a.</i>; संनिपत्योपकारिण एते मन्त्रा उपस्थितं<BR> कर्माभिदधति ŚB. on MS. 12. 1. 19.<BR>—2 Acting immediately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपातः|सन्निपात|संनिपात|सन्निपातः
संनिपातः<BR>—1 Falling down, alighting, descent.<BR>—2 Falling together, meeting; confluence; समुद्रपत्न्योर्जलसंनिपाते R. 13. 58.<BR>—3 Collision, contact; संनिपातावधूतैश्च Mb. 4. 13. 27 (com. संनिपातोऽङ्गसंघट्टनम्);<BR> प्रतिपदमविहस्ताः संनिपाते रिपूणाम् Śiva B. 30. 47.<BR>—4 Union, conjunction, combination, mixture, miscellaneous collection;<BR> तथा तयोः संनिपातः शरयोरभवत्तदा Mb. 3. 39. 15; Bhāg. 11. 25. 6;<BR> धूमज्योतिःसलिलमरुतां संनिपातः क्व मेथः Me. 5.<BR>—5 An assemblage,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">Page1624-1</a>]<BR> a collection, multitude, number; नानारत्नज्योतिषां संनिपातैः Ki. 5. 36;<BR> एको हि दोषो गुणसंनिपाते निमज्जति Ku. 1. 3.<BR>—6 Arrival.<BR>—7 A combined derangement of the three humours of the body causing fever<BR> which is of a dangerous kind.<BR>—8 A kind of musical time or measure.<BR>—9 Sexual intercourse; Mb. 5.<BR>—10 Battle, war.<BR>—11 (In astr.) A particular conjunction of planets.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संनिपातज्वरः, संनिपातनिद्रा, संनिपातनुद्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1623-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपातज्वरः|सन्निपातज्वर|सन्निपातज्वरः
संनिपातः + -ज्वरः fever arising from a vitiated state of the three humours of the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपातनिद्रा
संनिपातः + -निद्रा swoon, trance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपातनुद्
संनिपातः + -नुद् <i>m.</i> a species of Nimba tree (Mar. नेपाळनिंब).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपातकः|सन्निपातक|संनिपातक
संनिपातकः = संनिपातः (7) above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपातित|सन्निपातित
संनिपातित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Discharged.<BR>—2 Assembled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपातिन्
संनिपातिन् <i>a.</i> A subsidiary that serves the purpose of the प्रधानकर्म<BR> by being closely connected with it or directly related (see सामवायिक<BR> <i>a.</i>); मन्त्राश्च संनिपातित्वात् MS. 12. 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिपात्य|सन्निपात्य
संनिपात्य <i>a.</i> To be hurled upon; न खलु न खलु बाणः संनिपात्योऽयमस्मिन् Ś. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिबद्ध|सन्निबद्ध|सन्निबद्धः
संनिबद्ध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Connected; attached.<BR>—2 Arranged, prepared for; संसिद्धावितिकरणीयसंनिबद्धैः (आलापैः) Ki. 7. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिबन्धः|सन्निबन्ध|संनिबन्ध|सन्निबंध|संनिबंधः
संनिबन्धः<BR>—1 Binding firmly.<BR>—2 Connection, attachment.<BR>—3 Effectiveness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिबर्हणम्
संनिबर्हणम् The act of subduing, restraint; एकस्येव हि योऽशक्तो<BR> मनसः संनिबर्हणे Śukra. 1. 99.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिभ|सन्निभ|सन्निभः
संनिभ <i>a.</i> Like, similar (at the end of comp.); वनान्तरे तोयमिति<BR> प्रधाविता निरीक्ष्य भिन्नाञ्जनसंनिभं नभः Ṛs. 1. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिभृत|सन्निभृत
संनिभृत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Hidden.<BR>—2 Discreet, modest; Bhāg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनियुज्|सन्नियुज्
संनियुज् See नियुज्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनियोगः|सन्नियोग|संनियोग
संनियोगः<BR>—1 Union, attachment.<BR>—2 Appointment.<BR>—3 Precept.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिरुध्|सन्निरुध्
संनिरुध् See निरुध्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिरुद्ध|सन्निरुद्ध
संनिरुद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Restrained, suppressed.<BR>—2 Raked together (as fire).<BR>—3 Covered, filled; महारथौघेन न संनिरुद्धा Ki. 16. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिरोधः|सन्निरोध|संनिरोध
संनिरोधः<BR>—1 Obstruction, hindrance; संसाद्य गत्या सह तेन याति विज्ञानतत्त्वं<BR> गुणसंनिरोधम् Bhāg. 2. 2. 30.<BR>—2 Confinement.<BR>—3 Narrowness; a narrow pass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिवायः|सन्निवाय
संनिवायः Combination, multitude; अष्टाधिपत्यं गुणसंनिवाये<BR> सहैव गच्छेन्मनसेन्द्रियैश्च Bhāg. 2. 2. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिविश्|सन्निविश्
संनिविश् €6 Ā.<BR>—1 To enter into, enter deeply.<BR>—2 To encamp, sit down.<BR>—3 To have intercourse or intimate connection with. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To place, put.<BR>—2 To install or place on; धातोः स्थान इवादेशं सुग्रीवं संन्यवेशयत् R. 12. 58.<BR>—3 To unite, join, collect.<BR>—4 To introduce, insert, put in.<BR>—5 To lodge, locate, station, encamp.<BR>—6 To devolve upon, commit to, consign.<BR>—7 To found (a town &c.).<BR>—8 To fix the mind on.<BR>—9 To contemplate, reflect upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिविष्ट|सन्निविष्ट|सन्निविष्टः
संनिविष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Entered into.<BR>—2 Collected, met together, assembled.<BR>—3 Absorbed or engrossed in.<BR>—4 Abiding or resting in.<BR>—5 Contiguous, near, neighbouring.<BR>—6 Encamped; see संनिविश् above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिवेशः|सन्निवेश|संनिवेश|सन्निवेशः
संनिवेशः<BR>—1 Deep entrance into, ardent devotion or attachment, close application.<BR>—2 A collection, multitude, assemblage; अहं तु मन्ये तव नास्ति कश्चिदेतादृशे<BR> क्षत्रियसंनिवेशे Mb. 3. 268. 4.<BR>—3 Union, combination, arrangement; विभ्रद्वपुः सकलसुन्दरसंनिवेशम्<BR> Bhāg. 11. 1. 10; रमणीय एष वः सुमनसां संनिवेशः Māl. 1. 9.<BR>—4 Site, place, situation, position; स्थानान्तरे कल्पितसंनिवेशाम्<BR> Ku. 7. 25; R. 6. 19.<BR>—5 Vicinity, proximity.<BR>—6 Form, figure; उद्दामशरीरसंनिवेशः Māl. 3; निर्माणसंनिवेशः K.<BR>—7 A hut, dwelling-place; अशून्यतीरा मुनिसंनिवेशैः R. 14. 76.<BR>—8 Seating in the proper places, giving seats to; क्रियतां समाजसंनिवेशः U. 7.<BR>—9 Insertion.<BR>—10 An open space near a town where people assemble for amusement, exercise &c.<BR>—11 The collective position of an asterism.<BR>—12 Encampment; संनिवेशं ततश्चक्रुर्हरिवीरा महाबलाः Rām. 4. 64. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिवेशनम्
संनिवेशनम्<BR>—1 Settlement, abode.<BR>—2 Erection (of a statue).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिवृत्|सन्निवृत्
संनिवृत् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To return, retire.<BR>—2 To leave off, cease, stop.<BR>—3 To pass away. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 to cause to return, send back.<BR>—2 To suppress, stop.<BR>—3 To prevent, hinder.<BR>—4 To divert, turn away from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिवृत्त|सन्निवृत्त
संनिवृत्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Returned.<BR>—2 Stopped, ceased.<BR>—3 Withdrawing, shrinking from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिवृत्तिः|सन्निवृत्ति|संनिवृत्ति|सन्निवृत्तिः
संनिवृत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Return; असंनिवृत्त्यै तदतीतमेव Ś. 6. 9; परलोकमसंनिवृत्तये<BR> यदनापृच्छय गतासि मामितः R. 8. 49, 10. 27.<BR>—2 Desisting from.<BR>—3 Restraint, check, forbearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिसर्गः|सन्निसर्ग|संनिसर्ग
संनिसर्गः Good-naturedness, gentleness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिहित|सन्निहित|सन्निहितं
संनिहित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Placed near, lying close, near, contiguous, neighbouring; Ś. 4.<BR>—2 Close, proximate, at hand; न पपात संनिहितपक्तिसुरभिषु फलेषु<BR> मानसम् Ki. 12. 4.<BR>—3 Present; अपि संनिहितोऽत्र कुलपतिः Ś. 1; हृदयसंनिहिते 3. 19.<BR>—4 Fixed, placed, deposited.<BR>—5 Prepared, ready; Mu. 1.<BR>—6 Staying or being in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिहितम्
संनिहित + .{@-तम्@} Proximity, vicinity.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संनिहितापाय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनिहितापाय|सन्निहितापाय
संनिहित + -अपाय <i>a.</i> having destruction close at hand, frail, perishable,<BR> transitory; कायः संनिहितापायः Pt. 2. 177.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनी|सन्नी
संनी €1 P.<BR>—1 To bring together.<BR>—2 To rule, govern, guide.<BR>—3 To restore, give back.<BR>—4 To lead towards, lead, or bring near to.<BR>—5 To connect, unite.<BR>—6 To mingle, mix.<BR>—7 To arrange.<BR>—8 To obtain, procure.<BR>—9 To fulfill; यं यं वाञ्छति सा राजन् … तं तं समनयत् कामम्<BR> Bhāg. 11. 7. 56, 4. 7. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संनयनम्
संनयनम्<BR>—1 Bringing together or near.<BR>—2 Connecting, uniting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1624-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संन्यस्|सन्न्यस्
संन्यस् €4 P.<BR>—1 To place or put down, deposit.<BR>—2 To lay down or aside, give up, abandon, quit; तेन त्वया शस्त्रं<BR> न संन्यस्तव्यम् V. 5; संन्यस्तशस्त्र R. 2. 59; संन्यस्ताभरणं<BR> गात्रम् Me. 95; Ku. 7. 67.<BR>—3 To make or deliver over, entrust, commit to the care of; मयि सर्वाणि<BR> कर्माणि संन्यस्याध्यात्मचेतसा Bg. 3. 30.<BR>—4 To put together.<BR>—5 (Used intransitively) To resign the world, discard all worldly ties<BR> and attachments and become an anchorite; वेदान्तं विधिवच्छ्रुत्वा संन्यसेदनृणो<BR> द्विजः Ms. 7. 94; संदृश्य क्षणभङ्गुरं तदखिलं धन्यस्तु संन्यस्यति Bh. 3. 132.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संन्यसनम्
संन्यसनम्<BR>—1 Resignation, laying down.<BR>—2 Complete renunciation of the world and its attachments; न च संन्यसनादेव<BR> सिद्धिं समधिगच्छति Bg. 3. 4.<BR>—3 Consigning, entrusting to the care of.<BR>—4 Depositing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संन्यस्त|सन्न्यस्त|सन्न्यस्तः
संन्यस्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Laid or placed down.<BR>—2 Deposited.<BR>—3 Entrusted, consigned.<BR>—4 Laid aside, relinquished, renounced; न ह्यसंन्यस्तसंकल्पो योगी<BR> भवति कश्चन Bg. 6. 2.<BR>—5 Encamped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संन्यासः|सन्न्यास|संन्यास|सन्न्यासः
संन्यासः<BR>—1 Leaving, abandonment.<BR>—2 Complete renunciation of the world and its possessions and attachments,<BR> abandonment of temporal concerns; काम्यानां कर्मणां न्यासं संन्यासं<BR> कवयो विदुः Bg. 18. 2; Ms. 1. 114, 5. 108.<BR>—3 A deposit, trust; एतद्राज्यं मम भ्रात्रा दत्तं संन्यासमुत्तमम्<BR> Rām. 2. 115. 14.<BR>—4 A stake or wager in a game.<BR>—5 Giving up the body, death.<BR>—6 Indian spikenard.<BR>—7 Compact, agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संन्यासिन्|सन्न्यासिन्
संन्यासिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 One who lays down or deposits.<BR>—2 One who abandons, gives up; सर्वसंकल्पसंन्यासी योगारूढस्तदोच्यते Bg. 6. 4.<BR>—3 One who completely renounces the world and its attachments, an ascetic,<BR> a Brāhmaṇa in the fourth order of his religious life; ज्ञेयः स नित्यसंन्यासी<BR> यो न द्वेष्टि न काङ्क्षति Bg. 5. 3.<BR>—4 One who abstains from food (त्यक्ताहार); उवाच मारुतिर्वृद्धे संन्यासिन्यत्र<BR> वानरान् Bk. 7. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्
सप् €1 P. (सपति)<BR>—1 To honour, worship.<BR>—2 To connect.<BR>—3 To obey, conform to.<BR>—4 To obtain.<BR>—5 To touch, sip.<BR>—6 To do, perform.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपक्ष|सपक्षः
सपक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Winged, having wings.<BR>—2 Having a side or party; भूभृत् परार्ध्योऽपि सपक्ष एव Bu. C. 1. 10.<BR>—3 Belonging to the same side or party.<BR>—4 (Hence) Kindred, like, similar (fig.); दलद्द्राक्षानिर्यद्रसभरसपक्षा<BR> भणितयः Bv. 2. 77.<BR>—5 Containing the पक्ष or subject of an inference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपक्षः|सपक्ष
सपक्ष + .{@-क्षः@}<BR>—1 An adherent, a follower, partisan.<BR>—2 A kindred, a kinsman; परित्रातस्त्वया सपक्षः M. 4.<BR>—3 (In logic) An instance on the same side, a similar instance; निश्चितसाध्यवान्<BR> सपक्षः T. S.; साध्ये निश्चितमन्वयेन घटितं विभ्रत् सपक्षे स्थितिम् Mu. 5. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपक्षपातम्
सपक्षपातम् <i>ind.</i> Devotedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपत्न|सपत्नः
सपत्न <i>a.</i> Hostile, inimical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपत्नः|सपत्न
सपत्न + .{@-त्नः@} An enemy, adversary, a rival; अवाप्य भूमावसपत्नमृद्धम्<BR> Bg. 2. 8; मा वा सपत्नेष्वपि नाम तद् भूत् पापं यदस्यां त्वयि वा विशङ्क्यम्<BR> Māl. 4. 5; R. 9. 8.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सपत्नारिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपत्नारिः|सपत्नारि
सपत्न + -अरिः Bambusa Spinosa (Mar. एक प्रकारचा बांव्रू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपत्नी
सपत्नी [समानः पतिर्यस्याः सा] A rival or fellow wife, rival<BR> mistress, co-wife (having the same husband with another); दिशः सपत्नी<BR> भव दक्षिणस्याः R. 6. 63, 14. 86; कुरु प्रियसखीवृत्तिं सपत्नीजने Ś. 4. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपत्नीक
सपत्नीक <i>a.</i> Attended by a wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपत्राकृ
सपत्राकृ €8 U. To wound very severely; सपत्राकरोति मृगम् Sk.;<BR> सपत्राकृतशत्रूणां संपराये Kīr. K. 2. 4; निष्पत्राकुरुतासुरानपि<BR> सुरान् मारः सपत्राकरोत् Śāṅkaradigvijaya 5. 84. See below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपत्राकरणम्
सपत्राकरणम्<BR>—1 Wounding in such a manner that the feathered part of the arrow enters the body.<BR>—2 Causing excessive pain; cf. निष्पत्राकरण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपत्राकृत|सपत्त्राकृतः
सपत्राकृत <i>a.</i> Severely wounded (as described in सपत्राकरण);<BR> धनुष्पाणेर्यातं दिवमपि सपत्राकृतममुं त्रसन्तं तेऽद्यापि त्यजति न<BR> मृगव्याधरभसः Śivamahimna 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपत्राकृतिः|सपत्राकृति|सपत्त्राकृतिः
सपत्राकृतिः <i>f.</i> Great agony or pain, excessive affliction or torment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपदि
सपदि <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Instantly, in a moment, immediately; सपदि मदनानलो दहति मम<BR> मानसम् Gīt. 10; Ku. 3. 76, 6. 2.<BR>—2 Quickly, swiftly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपरिच्छद
सपरिच्छद <i>a.</i> Provided with necessaries.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपरिबृंहण
सपरिबृंहण <i>a.</i> Together with supplements (the Vedas); वेदः<BR> सपरिबृहणः Ms. 12. 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपरिवाह
सपरिवाह <i>a.</i> Brimful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपरिव्यय
सपरिव्यय <i>a.</i> With condiments (as food); Ms. 7. 127.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपरिहारम्
सपरिहारम् <i>ind.</i> With reserve or shyness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपर्या|सपर्य्या
सपर्या<BR>—1 Worship, honouring; सोऽहं सपर्याविधिभाजनेन R. 5. 22, 2. 22, 11. 35, 13. 46;<BR> Śi. 1. 14; Ku. 5. 31.<BR>—2 Service, attendance; प्रतिविहितसपर्यासुस्थयोस्तान्यहानि (स्मरसि) U. 1. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपाद|सपादः
सपाद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having feet.<BR>—2 Increased by a fourth part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपाल
सपाल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Attended by a herdsman; सपालः शतदण्डार्हो विपालान् वारयेत् पशून् Ms. 8. 240.<BR>—2 Together with a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपिण्डः|सपिण्ड|सपिंड|सपिंडः
सपिण्डः ‘Having the same पिण्ड or funeral rice-ball offering’,<BR> a kinsman connected by the offering of the funeral rice-ball to the Manes<BR> of certain relations; गुरुदारे सपिण्डे वा गुरुवद्वृत्तिमाचरेत् Ms. 2. 247, 5. 59;<BR> Y. 1. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1625-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपिण्डनम्
सपिण्डनम्, सपिण्डीकरणम्<BR>—1 The performance of a particular Śrāddha in honour of deceased relatives<BR> called सपिण्ड q. v., to be performed at the end of one full year<BR> after the death of a relative, but now usually performed on the 12th day<BR> after death as part of the funeral obsequies.<BR>—2 Giving a person the rights of a Sapiṇḍa or kinsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपिण्डीकरणम्
सपिण्डनम्, सपिण्डीकरणम्<BR>—1 The performance of a particular Śrāddha in honour of deceased relatives<BR> called सपिण्ड q. v., to be performed at the end of one full year<BR> after the death of a relative, but now usually performed on the 12th day<BR> after death as part of the funeral obsequies.<BR>—2 Giving a person the rights of a Sapiṇḍa or kinsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपीतिः|सपीति
सपीतिः <i>f.</i> Drinking together or in company, compotation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपोत
सपोत <i>a.</i> Having a boat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सपौष्णमैत्र
सपौष्णमैत्र <i>a.</i> Together with रेवती and अनुराधा Nakṣatras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तकी
सप्तकी A womanʼs girdle or zone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तन्
सप्तन् <i>num. a.</i> (always pl.; सप्त nom. and acc.) Seven.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सप्तांशुः, सप्तांशुपुङ्गवः, सप्ताङ्ग, सप्तार्चिस्, सप्ताशीतिः, सप्ताश्रम्, सप्ताश्वः, सप्तास्र, सप्ताहः, सप्तात्मन्, सप्तर्षि, सप्तकोण, सप्तगङ्गम्, सप्तगुण, सप्तचत्वारिंशत्, सप्तच्छदः, सप्तजिह्वः, सप्तज्वालः, सप्ततन्तुः, सप्तत्रिंशत्, सप्तदशन्, सप्तदीधितिः, सप्तद्वारावकीर्ण, सप्तद्वीपा, सप्तधातु, सप्तनली, सप्तनवतिः, सप्तनाडीचक्रम्, सप्तपदी, सप्तपर्णः, सप्तपातालम्, सप्तप्रकृतिः, सप्तभद्रः, सप्तभूमिक, सप्तभौम, सप्तमन्त्रः, सप्तमातृ, सप्तमुष्टिकः, सप्तरक्तः, सप्तरात्रम्, सप्तरुचिः, सप्तलोकाः, सप्तविंशतिः, सप्तशतम्, सप्तशलाकः, सप्तशिरा, सप्तसप्तिः, सप्तस्वरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तांशुः|सप्तांशु
सप्तन् + -अंशुः N. of Agni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तांशुपुङ्गवः|सप्तांशुपुङ्गव|सप्तांशुपुंगव
सप्तन् + -अंशुपुङ्गवः the planet Saturn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्ताङ्ग
सप्तन् + -अङ्ग <i>a.</i> see सप्तप्रकृति below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तार्चिस्|सप्तार्च्चिस्
सप्तन् + -अर्चिस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having seven tongues or flames.<BR>—2 evil-eyed, of inauspicious look. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 N. of fire.<BR>—2 of Saturn.<BR>—3 the Chitraka plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्ताशीतिः|सप्ताशीति
सप्तन् + -अशीतिः <i>f.</i> eighty-seven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्ताश्रम्
सप्तन् + -अश्रम् a heptagon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्ताश्वः|सप्ताश्व
सप्तन् + -अश्वः the sun; नप्ता सप्ताश्वसंनिभः Śiva B. 25. 45. ˚वाहनः the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तास्र
सप्तन् + -अस्र <i>a.</i> septangular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्ताहः|सप्ताह
सप्तन् + -अहः seven days, <i>i. e.</i> a week.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तात्मन्
सप्तन् + -आत्मन् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Brahman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तर्षि
सप्तन् + -ऋषि (सप्तर्षि) <i>m.</i> pl.<BR>—1 the seven sages; <i>i. e.</i> मरीचि, अन्नि, अङ्गिरस्, पुलस्त्य, पुलह,<BR> क्रतु, and वसिष्ठ.<BR>—2 the constellation called Ursa Major (the seven stars of which are said<BR> to be the seven sages mentioned above).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तकोण
सप्तन् + -कोण <i>a.</i> septangular.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तगङ्गम्
सप्तन् + -गङ्गम् <i>ind.</i> in the place of the seven streams of the Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तगुण
सप्तन् + -गुण <i>a.</i> seven-fold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तचत्वारिंशत्
सप्तन् + -चत्वारिंशत् <i>f.</i> forty-seven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तच्छदः|सप्तच्छद|सप्तछद
सप्तन् + -च्छदः N. of a tree (Mar. सातवीण); गजाश्च सप्तच्छददानगन्धिनः<BR> Karṇabhāra 1. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तजिह्वः|सप्तजिह्व
सप्तन् + -जिह्वः, -ज्वालः fire. (the seven tongues are काली, कराली,<BR> मनोजवा, सुलोहिता, सुधूम्रवर्णा, उग्रा and प्रदीप्ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तज्वालः|सप्तज्वाल
सप्तन् + -जिह्वः, -ज्वालः fire. (the seven tongues are काली, कराली,<BR> मनोजवा, सुलोहिता, सुधूम्रवर्णा, उग्रा and प्रदीप्ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्ततन्तुः|सप्ततन्तु
सप्तन् + -तन्तुः a sacrifice; सप्ततन्तुमधिगन्तुमिच्छतः Śi. 14. 6;<BR> पुनः प्रवर्तयिष्यामि सप्ततन्त्वादिकाः क्रियाः Śiva B. 5. 56; विधये<BR> सप्ततन्तूनाम् ibid. 18. 23. cf. note on N. 11. 100.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तत्रिंशत्
सप्तन् + -त्रिंशत् <i>f.</i> thirty-seven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तदशन्
सप्तन् + -दशन् <i>a.</i> seventeen. ˚अरत्निन्यायः A rule of interpretation<BR> according to which an expression, if it is found to be inapplicable to<BR> the matter or thing with reference to which it is used, should be taken<BR> as being connected with or applying to a part or subsidiary thereof. This<BR> mode of construing an expression (in its literal sense) is preferable<BR> to लक्षणा. This rule is discussed and established by जैमिनि and<BR> शबर in the सूत्र ‘आनर्थक्यात् तदङ्गेषु’ MS. 3. 1. 18 and भाष्य thereon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तदीधितिः|सप्तदीधिति
सप्तन् + -दीधितिः N. of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तद्वारावकीर्ण
सप्तन् + -द्वारावकीर्ण <i>a.</i> dominated or affected by the seven gates<BR> (5 organs, mind and intellect); सप्तद्वारावकीर्णां च न वाचमनृतां<BR> वदेत् Ms. 6. 48 (see Kull.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तद्वीपा
सप्तन् + -द्वीपा an epithet of the earth; पुरा सप्तद्वीपां जयति वसुधामप्रतिरथः Ś. 7. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तधातु
सप्तन् + -धातु <i>m.</i> pl. the seven constituent elements of the body; <i>i. e.</i><BR> chyle, blood, flesh, fat, bone, marrow, and semen;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">Page1626-2</a>]<BR> (रसास्रमांसमेदोऽस्थिमज्जानः शुक्रसंयुताः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तनली
सप्तन् + -नली bird-lime.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तनवतिः|सप्तनवति
सप्तन् + -नवतिः <i>f.</i> ninety-seven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तनाडीचक्रम्
सप्तन् + -नाडीचक्रम् a kind of astrological diagram used as a means of<BR> foretelling rain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तपदी
सप्तन् + -पदी the seven steps at a marriage (the bride and bridegroom<BR> walk together seven steps, after which the marriage becomes irrevocable).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तपर्णः|सप्तपर्ण|सप्तपर्णं
सप्तन् + -पर्णः (so सप्तच्छदः, सप्तपत्रः) N. of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तपर्णी
सप्तन् + -पर्णः + .({@-र्णी@}) the sensitive plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तपातालम्
सप्तन् + -पातालम् the seven regions of the earth (<i>i. e.</i> अतल, वितल,<BR> सुतल, महातल, रसातल, तलातल and पाताल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तप्रकृतिः|सप्तप्रकृति
सप्तन् + -प्रकृतिः <i>f.</i> pl. the seven constituent parts of a kingdom;<BR> स्वाम्यमात्यसुहृत्कोशराष्ट्रदुर्गबलानि च Ak.; see प्रकृति also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तभद्रः|सप्तभद्र
सप्तन् + -भद्रः the Śirīṣa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तभूमिक
सप्तन् + -भूमिक, -भौम <i>a.</i> seven stories high (as a palace).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तभौम
सप्तन् + -भूमिक, -भौम <i>a.</i> seven stories high (as a palace).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तमन्त्रः|सप्तमन्त्र
सप्तन् + -मन्त्रः fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तमातृ
सप्तन् + -मातृ <i>f.</i> collective N. of seven mothers (i. e. ब्राह्मी, माहेश्वरी,<BR> कौमारी, वैष्णवी, वाराही, इन्द्राणी, and चामुण्डा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तमुष्टिकः|सप्तमुष्टिक
सप्तन् + -मुष्टिकः a particular mixture used as a remedy for fever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तरक्तः|सप्तरक्त|सप्तरक्तं
सप्तन् + -रक्तः one who has got the seven parts of the body red; (पाणिपादतले<BR> रक्ते नेत्रान्तरनखानि च । तालुकाधरजिह्वाश्च प्रशस्ता सप्तरक्तता ॥).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तरात्रम्
सप्तन् + -रात्रम् a period of seven nights.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तरुचिः|सप्तरुचि
सप्तन् + -रुचिः fire; सप्तरुचेरिव स्फुलिङ्गाः Śi. 20. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तलोकाः
सप्तन् + -लोकाः the seven worlds (<i>i. e.</i> भूर्, भुवर्, स्वर्, महर्,<BR> जनस्, तपस्, and सत्यम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तविंशतिः|सप्तविंशति
सप्तन् + -विंशतिः <i>f.</i> twenty-seven. {@विध@} <i>a.</i> seven-fold,<BR> of seven sorts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तशतम्
सप्तन् + -शतम्<BR>—1 700.<BR>—2 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तशती
सप्तन् + -शतम् + .({@-ती@}) an aggregate or collection of 700 verses or stanzas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तशलाकः|सप्तशलाक
सप्तन् + -शलाकः a kind of astronomical diagram used for indicating auspicious<BR> days for marriages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तशिरा
सप्तन् + -शिरा betel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तसप्तिः|सप्तसप्ति
सप्तन् + -सप्तिः an epithet of the sun; सर्वैरुस्रैः समग्रैस्त्वमिव नृपगुणैर्दीप्यते<BR> सप्तसप्तिः M. 2. 12; Ś. 6. 29; Ki. 5. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तस्वरः
सप्तन् + -स्वरः the seven musical notes (<i>i. e.</i> सा, रि, ग, म, प, ध, नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तक|सप्तकः
सप्तक <i>a.</i> (-का or -की <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Containing seven.<BR>—2 Seven.<BR>—3 Seventh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तकम्
सप्तक + .{@-कम्@} A collection of seven things (verses &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तकी
सप्तक + .{@-की@} A womanʼs girdle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्ततिः|सप्तति
सप्ततिः <i>f.</i> Seventy. ˚तम <i>a.</i> 70th.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तधा
सप्तधा <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Seven-fold.<BR>—2 In seven parts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तम|सप्तमः
सप्तम <i>a.</i> (-मी <i>f.</i>)<BR> The seventh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तमी
सप्तम + .{@-मी@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 The seventh or locative case (in gram.).<BR>—2 The seventh day of a lunar fortnight. ˚समासः a तत्पुरुष<BR> compound of which the first member is supposed to be in the locative case.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तला
सप्तला A kind of jasmine (double jasmine).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्तिः|सप्ति
सप्तिः<BR>—1 A yoke.<BR>—2 A horse; जवो हि सप्तेः परमं विभूषणम् Subhāṣ.; see सप्तसप्ति also.<BR>—3 A yoke-fellow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रज्ञातम्
सप्रज्ञातम् A specific type of Samādhi; Pātañjala Yogadarśana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रणय
सप्रणय <i>a.</i> Affectionate, friendly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रतिभ
सप्रतिभ <i>a.</i> Possessed of quick discernment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रतिभय
सप्रतिभय Uncertain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रतीक्षम्
सप्रतीक्षम् <i>ind.</i> Expectantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रतीवाप
सप्रतीवाप <i>a.</i> With an admixture; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1626-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रतीश
सप्रतीश <i>a.</i> Respectful; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रत्यय
सप्रत्यय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Placing confidence in.<BR>—2 Certain, sure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रत्याशम्
सप्रत्याशम् <i>ind.</i> Hopefully, expectantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रपञ्च
सप्रपञ्च <i>a.</i> With all belonging thereto or connected therewith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रभ
सप्रभ <i>a.</i> Having the same appearance; इतस्ततः परिचरन्<BR> दीप्तपावकसप्रभः Mb. 1. 13. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रमाण
सप्रमाण<BR>—1 Authentic.<BR>—2 Entitled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रमाद
सप्रमाद <i>a.</i> Heedless, inattentive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रवाद
सप्रवाद <i>a.</i> Together with the derivative case-forms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रश्रयम्
सप्रश्रयम् <i>ind.</i> Respectfully, with great courtesy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रसव
सप्रसव <i>a.</i> Derived from a common source; गुणा गुणानुबन्धित्वात्तस्य<BR> सप्रसवा इव R. 1. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सप्रेष्य
सप्रेष्य <i>a.</i> Attended by servants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सफरः|सफर
सफरः, -री<BR> A small glittering fish; cf. शफर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सफरी
सफरः, -री<BR> A small glittering fish; cf. शफर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सफल|सफलं
सफल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Fruitful, bearing or yielding fruit, productive (fig. also).<BR>—2 Accomplished, fulfilled, successful.<BR>—3 Not emasculated; Rām.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सफलोदर्क<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सफलोदर्क
सफल + -उदर्क <i>a.</i> promising success.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सफलक
सफलक <i>a.</i> Furnished with a shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सबन्ध
सबन्ध <i>a.</i> Secured by a pledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सबन्धु|सबंधु|सबन्धुः
सबन्धु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Closely connected.<BR>—2 Having a friend, befriended.<BR>—3 Of the same family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सबन्धुः|सबन्धु|सबंधु
सबन्धु + .{@-न्धुः@} A relation, kinsman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सबल|सबलः
सबल <i>a.</i> Accompanied by a force or army.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सबलिः|सबलि
सबलिः Evening twilight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सबाध|सबाधः
सबाध <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Hurtful.<BR>—2 Oppressive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सबीजयोगः
सबीजयोगः A kind of yogic meditation or Samādhi. This is referred<BR> to as संप्रज्ञातसमाधिः in N. 21. 119; मैत्र्यादिचित्तपरिकर्मविदो<BR> विधाय क्लेशप्रहाणमिह लब्धसबीजयोगाः Śi. 4. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सब्रह्मचर्यम्
सब्रह्मचर्यम् Fellow-studentship (being disciples of the same teacher).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सब्रह्मचारिन्
सब्रह्मचारिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A fellow-student, one going through the same studies and observing<BR> the same austerities; सब्रह्मचारिण्येकाहमतीते क्षपणं स्मृतम् Ms. 5. 71.<BR>—2 A fellow-sufferer, sympathiser; दुःखसब्रह्मचारिणी तरलिका क्व<BR> गता K.; हे व्यसनसब्रह्मचारिन् यदि न गुह्यं ततः श्रोतुमिच्छामि<BR> Mu. 6. 3 (Hence) An equal, of the same kind; Vb. 1. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभक्षः|सभक्ष
सभक्षः A mess-mate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभर्तृका|सभर्त्तृका
सभर्तृका A woman whose husband is living.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभा
सभा [सह भान्ति अभीष्टनिश्चयार्थमेकत्र यत्र गृहे Tv.]<BR>—1 An assembly, a council, conclave; पण्डितसभां कारितवान् Pt. 1;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">Page1627-2</a>]<BR> न सा सभा यत्र न सन्ति वृद्धाः H. 1.<BR>—2 Company, society, meeting, large number.<BR>—3 Council-chamber or hall; ततः सभां करिष्यामि पाण्डवस्य यशस्विनीम्<BR> Mb. 2. 3. 4, 12. 47. 7.<BR>—4 A court of justice.<BR>—5 A public audience (modern <i>levee</i>).<BR>—6 A gambling-house.<BR>—7 Any room or place much frequented.<BR>—8 A house for lodging travellers (धर्मशाला).<BR>—9 An eating house.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सभाचारः, सभास्तारः, सभोचितः, सभोद्देशः, सभाकारः, सभागृहम्, सभापतिः, सभानायकः, सभापरिषद्, सभापालः, सभापूजा, सभामण्डपः, सभामध्ये, सभायोग्य, सभासद्, सभासाहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभाचारः|सभाचार
सभा + -आचारः<BR>—1 the customs of society.<BR>—2 court-manners.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभास्तारः|सभास्तार
सभा + -आस्तारः<BR>—1 an assistant at an assembly.<BR>—2 a member of a society.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभोचितः|सभोचित
सभा + -उचितः a learned Brāhmaṇa, an educated person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभोद्देशः|सभोद्देश
सभा + -उद्देशः the neighbourhood of any place of meeting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभाकारः|सभाकार
सभा + -कारः the builder of a hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभागृहम्
सभा + -गृहम् an assembly-hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभापतिः|सभापति
सभा + -पतिः, -नायकः<BR>—1 the president of a society, chairman.<BR>—2 the keeper of a gaming-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभानायकः|सभानायक
सभा + -पतिः, -नायकः<BR>—1 the president of a society, chairman.<BR>—2 the keeper of a gaming-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभापरिषद्
सभा + -परिषद् the session of an assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभापालः|सभापाल
सभा + -पालः the keeper of a public building or assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभापूजा
सभा + -पूजा worship or reverence paid to the audience.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभामण्डपः|सभामण्डप
सभा + -मण्डपः an assembly hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभामध्ये
सभा + -मध्ये <i>ind.</i> in society.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभायोग्य
सभा + -योग्य <i>a.</i> suitable for society.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभासद्
सभा + -सद् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an assistant at an assembly or meeting.<BR>—2 a member of an assembly or meeting.<BR>—3 an assessor, a juror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभासाहः|सभासाह
सभा + -साहः a victor in a debating hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभाज्
सभाज् €10 U. (सभाजयति-ते)<BR>—1 To salute, pay respects, greet, render homage to, congratulate; स्नेहात्<BR> सभाजयितुमेत्य U. 1. 7; Śi. 13. 14; Ś. 5.<BR>—2 To honour, worship, respect.<BR>—3 To please, gratify.<BR>—4 To beautify, adorn, grace; बटुपरिषदं पुण्यश्रीकः श्रियेव सभाजयन् U. 4. 19.<BR>—5 To show.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभाजनम्
सभाजनम् [सभाज्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Paying respects to, salutation, honouring, worshiping; स यथोचितं<BR> जनसभाजनोचितः Śi. 13. 14.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Welcoming, congratulation; सभाजने मे भुजमूर्ध्वबाहुः R. 13. 43, 14. 18.<BR>—2 Civility, courtesy, politeness.<BR>—3 Service.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभाजित
सभाजित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Honoured, gratified.<BR>—2 Praised, celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभावनः|सभावन
सभावनः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभिकः|सभिक
सभि(भी)कः [सभा द्यूतं प्रयोजनमस्य ईक्] The keeper of a<BR> gaming-house; अयमस्माकं पूर्वसभिको माथुर इत एवागच्छति Mk. 3;<BR> ग्लहे शतिकवृद्धेस्तु सभिकः पञ्चकं शतम् Y. 2. 199.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभीकः|सभीक
सभि(भी)कः [सभा द्यूतं प्रयोजनमस्य ईक्] The keeper of a<BR> gaming-house; अयमस्माकं पूर्वसभिको माथुर इत एवागच्छति Mk. 3;<BR> ग्लहे शतिकवृद्धेस्तु सभिकः पञ्चकं शतम् Y. 2. 199.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभ्य|सभ्यः
सभ्य <i>a.</i> [सभायां साधु यत्]<BR>—1 Belonging to an assembly.<BR>—2 Fit for society.<BR>—3 Refined, polished, civilized.<BR>—4 Well-bred, polite, civil, courteous; तस्मै सभ्याः सभार्याय गोप्त्रे<BR> गुप्ततमेन्द्रियाः R. 1. 55; Ku. 7. 29.<BR>—5 Confidential, trusty, faithful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभ्यः|सभ्य
सभ्य + .{@-भ्यः@}<BR>—1 An assessor.<BR>—2 An assistant at an assembly.<BR>—3 A person of honourable parentage; प्रायेणाल्पायुषः सभ्य कलावस्मिन्<BR> युगे जनाः Bhāg. 1. 1. 10.<BR>—4 The keeper of a gaming-house.<BR>—5 The servant of the keeper of a gaming-house.<BR>—6 N. of one of the five sacred fires; सभ्यावसथ्यं चितयोऽसवो हि<BR> ते Bhāg. 3. 13. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभ्यता
सभ्यता, -त्वम्<BR> Politeness, good manners or breeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सभ्यत्वम्
सभ्यता, -त्वम्<BR> Politeness, good manners or breeding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1627-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्
सम् I. €1 P. (समति)<BR>—1 To be confused or agitated.<BR>—2 Not to be confused or agitated. ━II. €10 U. (समयतिते) To be agitated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्
सम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 (As a prefix to verbs and verbal derivatives it means<BR>——(<i>a</i>) with, together with, together; as in संगम्, संभाषण, संधा, संयुज् &c.).<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Sometimes it intensifies the meaning of the simple root, and<BR> may be translated by ‘very, quite, greatly, thoroughly, very much’; संतुष्,<BR> संतोष, संन्यस्, संन्यास, संताप &c.; तस्यामात्मानुरूपायामात्मजन्मसमुत्सुकः R. 1. 33.<BR>——(<i>c</i>) It also expresses completeness, perfection, or beauty.<BR>—2 As prefixed to nouns to form comp. it means ‘like, same, similar’,<BR> as in समर्थ.<BR>—3 Sometimes it means ‘near’, ‘before’, as in समक्ष.<BR>—4 In the Vedas it is sometimes used as a separable preposition (with instr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम|समः
सम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Same, identical.<BR>—2 Equal, as in समलोष्टकाञ्चनः R. 8. 21; Pt. 2. 7; सुखदुःखे<BR> समे कृत्वा लाभालाभौ जयाजयौ Bg. 2. 38; समः शत्रौ च मित्रे च तथा<BR> मानापमानयोः । शीतोष्णसुखदुःखेषु समः संगविवर्जितः ॥ 12. 18.<BR>—3 Like, similar, resembling; with instr. or gen. or in comp.; गुणयुक्तो<BR> दरिद्रोऽपि नेश्वरैरगुणैः समः Subhāṣ.; Ku. 3. 13.<BR>—4 Even, level, plain; समदेशवर्तिनस्ते न दुरासदो भविष्यति Ś. 1.<BR>—5 Even (as number).<BR>—6 Impartial, fair; शुनि चैव श्वपाके च पण्डिताः समदर्शिनः Bg. 5. 18.<BR>—7 Just, honest, upright.<BR>—8 Good, virtuous.<BR>—9 Ordinary, common.<BR>—10 Mean, middling.<BR>—11 Straight.<BR>—12 Suitable, convenient.<BR>—13 Indifferent, unmoved, unaffected by passion.<BR>—14 All, every one.<BR>—15 All, whole, entire, complete.<BR>—16 Being a pair.<BR>—17 Regular, normal.<BR>—18 Middling.<BR>—19 Easy, convenient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समः|सम
सम + .{@-मः@}<BR>—1 N. of certain zodiacal signs (वृष, कर्कट, कन्या, वृश्चिक, मकर, and मीन).<BR>—2 A mode of measuring time in music.<BR>—3 The point of intersection of the horizon and the meridian line.<BR>—4 A kind of straight line placed over a numerical figure to mark the<BR> process of extracting the square root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समम्
सम + .{@-मम्@}<BR>—1 A level plain, flat country; संनिपत्य शनकैरिव निम्नादन्धकारमुदवाप<BR> समानि Ki. 9. 11.<BR>—2 (In rhet.) N. of a figure of speech.<BR>—3 (In geometry) A mean proportional segment.<BR>—4 Equanimity.<BR>—5 Similarity.<BR>—6 Settlement; compensation; कर्मणापि समं कुर्याद्धनिकायाधमर्णिकः Ms. 8. 177.<BR>—7 Good circumstances; Mk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समम्
सम + .{@-मम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 With, together with, in company with, accompanied by; (with instr.);<BR> आहो निवत्स्यति समं हरिणाङ्गनाभिः Ś. 1. 26; R. 2. 25, 8. 63, 16. 72.<BR>—2 Equally; समं सर्वेषु भूतेषु Bg. 13. 27-28; यथा सर्वाणि भूतानि<BR> धरा धारयते समम् Ms. 9. 311.<BR>—3 Like, similarly, in the same manner; यत्र स्वामी निर्विशेषं समं<BR> भृत्येषु वर्तते Pt. 1. 78.<BR>—4 Entirely.<BR>—5 Simultaneously, all at once, at the same time, together; नवं पयो<BR> यत्र घनैर्मया च त्वद्विप्रयोगाश्रु समं विसृष्टम् R. 13. 26, 4. 4, 10. 59, 14. 1.<BR>—6 Honestly, fairly.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समांशः, समाङ्घ्रिक, समान्तः, समान्तर, समार्थिन्, समाकार, समाचारः, समात्मक, समोदकम्, समोपमा, समकक्ष, समकन्या, समकर्णः, समकालः, समकालीन, समकोलः, समकोटिक, समक्षेत्रम्, समखातः, समगतिः, समगन्धकः, समगन्धिकम्, समचक्रवालम्, समचतुरस्र, समचतुर्भुजः, समजम्, समचित्त, समच्छेद, समच्छेदन, समजाति, समज्ञा, समत्रिभुजः, समजम्, समदर्शन, समदर्शिन्, समदुःख, समदृश्, समदृष्टि, समद्वादशास्रः, समद्वादशास्रम्, समद्विभुजः, समधर्म, समधृत, समपदम्, समप्रभ, समबुद्धि, समभाव, सममण्डलम्, सममय, सममात्र, सममितिः, समरञ्जित, समरतः, समरभः, समरेख, समलम्बः, समलम्बम्, समलेपनी, समवर्ण, समवर्णः, समवर्तिन्, समविभक्त, समविषमम्, समवृत्तम्, समवृत्ति, समवेधः, समवैषम्यतः, समशोधनम्, समश्रुति, समश्रेणिः, समसंधिः, समसुप्तिः, समसूत्र, समसूत्रस्थ, समस्थ, समस्थलम्, समस्थली, समस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समांशः|समांश
सम + -अंशः an equal share. ˚हारिन् <i>m.</i> a co-heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाङ्घ्रिक
सम + -अङ्घ्रिक <i>a.</i> standing evenly on feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समान्तः|समान्त
सम + -अन्तः a borderer, neighbour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समान्तर
सम + -अन्तर <i>a.</i> parallel.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">Page1628-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समार्थिन्
सम + -अर्थिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 desiring equality.<BR>—2 seeking peace with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाकार
सम + -आकार <i>a.</i> similar, like.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाचारः|समाचार
सम + -आचारः<BR>—1 equal or similar conduct.<BR>—2 proper practice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समात्मक
सम + -आत्मक <i>a.</i> possessing equanimity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समोदकम्
सम + -उदकम् a mixture of half butter-milk and half water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समोपमा
सम + -उपमा a kind of Upamā or simile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकक्ष
सम + -कक्ष <i>a.</i> having equal weight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकक्षा
सम + -कक्ष + .({@-क्षा@}) equilibrium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकन्या
सम + -कन्या a fit or suitable girl (fit to be married).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकर्णः|समकर्ण
सम + -कर्णः an equi-diagonal tetragon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकालः|समकाल
सम + -कालः the same time or moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकालम्
सम + -कालः + .({@-लम्@}) <i>ind.</i> at the same time, simultaneously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकालीन
सम + -कालीन <i>a.</i> contemporary, coeval.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकोलः|समकोल
सम + -कोलः a serpent, snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समकोटिक
सम + -कोटिक <i>a.</i> of regular size (said of diamonds); Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समक्षेत्रम्
सम + -क्षेत्रम् (in astr.) an epithet of a particular arrangement of the Nakṣatras.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समखातः|समखात
सम + -खातः an equal excavation, a parallelopipedon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समगतिः|समगति
सम + -गतिः wind; मृत्युश्चापरिहारवान् समगतिः कालेन विच्छेदिना<BR> Mb. 12. 298. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समगन्धकः|समगन्धक
सम + -गन्धकः incense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समगन्धिकम्
सम + -गन्धिकम् the fragrant root of the Uśīra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समचक्रवालम्
सम + -चक्रवालम् a circle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समचतुरस्र
सम + -चतुरस्र <i>a.</i> square.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समचतुरस्रम्
सम + -चतुरस्र + .({@-स्रम्@}) an equilateral tetragon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समचतुर्भुजः|समचतुर्भुज
सम + -चतुर्भुजः, -जम् a rhombus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1628-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समजम्
