समता
समता, त्वम्<BR>—1 Sameness, identity; समेत्य ते मन्त्रयितुं समतागतबुद्धयः Rām. 2. 2. 20.<BR>—2 Likeness, similarity.<BR>—3 Equality; स्वजातेः समतां गतम् Pt. 2. 87.<BR>—4 Impartiality, fairness. समतां नी ‘to treat as equal’; पश्चाद्दृश्येत<BR> यत्किंचित्तत्सर्वं समतां नयेत् Ms. 9. 218.<BR>—5 Equanimity.<BR>—5 Perfectness.<BR>—7 Commonness.<BR>—8 Evenness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

त्वम्
समता, त्वम्<BR>—1 Sameness, identity; समेत्य ते मन्त्रयितुं समतागतबुद्धयः Rām. 2. 2. 20.<BR>—2 Likeness, similarity.<BR>—3 Equality; स्वजातेः समतां गतम् Pt. 2. 87.<BR>—4 Impartiality, fairness. समतां नी ‘to treat as equal’; पश्चाद्दृश्येत<BR> यत्किंचित्तत्सर्वं समतां नयेत् Ms. 9. 218.<BR>—5 Equanimity.<BR>—5 Perfectness.<BR>—7 Commonness.<BR>—8 Evenness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

