समङ्गा Bengal madder (मञ्जिष्ठा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समज्
समज् €1 P.<BR>—1 To bring or collect together, unite.<BR>—2 To bring into conflict.<BR>—3 To subdue, overpower.<BR>—4 To animate, incite, excite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समजः|समज|समजं
समजः<BR>—1 A multitude of beasts, animals or birds, a herd, flock; आविश्चकार<BR> समजोऽपि तदा पशूनां भावं मनोभवकृतं दयितानुवर्ती Rām. Ch. 5. 12;<BR> (cf. पशूनां समजोऽन्येषां समाजोऽथ सधर्मिणाम्).<BR>—2 A number of fools.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समजम्
समजः + .{@-जम्@} A wood, forest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समज्या
समज्या<BR>—1 A meeting, an assembly.<BR>—2 Fame, renown, celebrity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समञ्जस|समंजस|समञ्जसं|समञ्जसः
समञ्जस <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Proper, reasonable, right, fit; सभा वा न प्रवेष्टव्या वक्तव्यं<BR> वा समञ्जसम् Śukra. 4. 549.<BR>—2 Correct, true, accurate; समञ्जसदर्शन उदास्त इति ह वाव न विदामः<BR> Bhāg. 6. 9. 35.<BR>—3 Clear, intelligible; as in असमञ्जस, q. v.<BR>—4 Virtuous, good, just; समञ्जस त्वा विरहय्य काङ्क्षे 6. 11. 25;<BR> भृशाधिरूढस्य समञ्जसं जनम् Ki. 14. 12.<BR>—5 Practised, experienced; स्खलदसमञ्जसमुग्धजल्पितं ते Māl. 10. 2.<BR>—6 Healthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समञ्जसम्
समञ्जस + .{@-सम्@}<BR>—1 Propriety, fitness.<BR>—2 Accuracy.<BR>—3 Correct evidence.<BR>—4 Equality; सप्ताङ्गस्य च राज्यस्य ह्रासवृद्धिसमञ्जसम् Mb. 12. 59. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समतिक्रम्
समतिक्रम् €1 U.<BR>—1 To go completely beyond, cross or step over.<BR>—2 To neglect, disregard, violate.<BR>—3 To surpass, excel.<BR>—4 To elapse, pass by (as time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समतिक्रमः|समतिक्रम
समतिक्रमः Transgression, omission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समतिक्रान्त
समतिक्रान्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Gone through, fulfilled (as a promise).<BR>—2 Passed away, elapsed.<BR>—3 Transgressed, neglected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समतिक्रान्तम्
समतिक्रान्त + .{@-न्तम्@} Omission, transgression.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समती
समती €2 P.<BR>—1 To go completely beyond.<BR>—2 To go through, cross over.<BR>—3 To surpass, excel.<BR>—4 To avoid.<BR>—5 To pass, elapse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समतीत
समतीत <i>p. p.</i> Gone, passed by, past (as time), समतीतं च<BR> भवच्च भावि च R. 8. 78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समद
समद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Intoxicated, furious.<BR>—2 Mad with rut.<BR>—3 Drunk with passion; इह समदशकुन्ताक्रान्तवानीरवीरुत् U. 2. 20; Mv. 5. 40.<BR>—4 Delighted, glad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समधिक|समधिकः
समधिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Exceeding.<BR>—2 Excessive, abundant, plentiful; U. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समधिकम्
समधिक + .{@-कम्@} <i>ind.</i> Very much, exceedingly;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समधिगम्
समधिगम् €1 P.<BR>—1 To approach.<BR>—2 To study, यथा यथा हि पुरुषः शास्त्रं समधिगच्छति Ms. 4. 20.<BR>—3 To get, acquire; यत्ते समधिगच्छन्ति यस्यैते तस्य तद्धनम् Ms. 8. 416.<BR>—4 To excel, surpass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समधिगमः|समधिगम
समधिगमः Thorough understanding; कल्पितविषयो नाञ्जसाऽव्युत्पन्नलोकसमधिगमः<BR> Bhāg. 5. 13. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समधिगमनम्
समधिगमनम् Surpassing, overcoming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समध्व
समध्व <i>a.</i> Travelling in company.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समनीकम्
समनीकम् Battle, war; अमुं वीरं वव्रे बहुषु समनीकेषु मघवा<BR> Mv. 4. 18; B. R. 7. 60/61.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समनीकमूर्धन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समनीकमूर्धन्
समनीकम् + -मूर्धन् the front of battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समनुज्ञा
समनुज्ञा €9 U.<BR>—1 To consent, give full consent.<BR>—2 To approve, permit, allow.<BR>—3 To dismiss, give leave, allow to go.<BR>—4 To forgive, pardon.<BR>—5 To favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समनुज्ञा
समनुज्ञा, समनुज्ञानम्<BR>—1 Assent, consent.<BR>—2 Entire approval, full concurrence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समनुज्ञानम्
समनुज्ञा, समनुज्ञानम्<BR>—1 Assent, consent.<BR>—2 Entire approval, full concurrence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समनुवर्तिन्
समनुवर्तिन् <i>a.</i> Obedient, devoted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समनुव्रत
समनुव्रत <i>a.</i> Entirely devoted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्त|समंत|समन्तः
समन्त <i>a.</i> [सम्यक् अन्तः, स यत्र वा]<BR>—1 Being on every side, universal.<BR>—2 Complete, entire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्तः|समन्त|समंत
समन्त + .{@-न्तः@} Limit, boundary, term. (समन्तः, समन्तम्, समन्ततः,<BR> समन्तात् are used adverbially in the sense of ‘from every side’, ‘all around’<BR>, ‘on all sides’, ‘wholly’, ‘completely’; ततोऽश्मसहिता धाराः<BR> संवृण्वन्त्यः समन्ततः Mb. 3. 143. 19; लेलिह्यसे ग्रसमानः समन्तात् Bg. 11. 30).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समन्तदुग्धा, समन्तपञ्चकम्, समन्तपर्यायिन्, समन्तप्रासादिक, समन्तभद्रः, समन्तभद्रकः, समन्तभुज्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्तदुग्धा
समन्त + -दुग्धा the plant called स्नुही q. v. (Mar. निवडुंग).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्तपञ्चकम्
समन्त + -पञ्चकम् N. of the district called Kurukṣetra or of a place near it; Ve. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्तपर्यायिन्
समन्त + -पर्यायिन् <i>a.</i> all-embracing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्तप्रासादिक
समन्त + -प्रासादिक <i>a.</i> affording help on all sides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्तभद्रः|समन्तभद्र|समंतभद्र
समन्त + -भद्रः a Buddha or the Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्तभद्रकः|समन्तभद्रक
समन्त + -भद्रकः a variety of a long blanket; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्तभुज्|समंतभुज्
समन्त + -भुज् <i>m.</i> fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1629-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्यु|समन्युः
समन्यु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sorrowful.<BR>—2 Enraged, angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्युः|समन्यु
समन्यु + .{@-न्युः@} An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्वि
समन्वि €2 P.<BR>—1 To follow, accompany.<BR>—2 To follow or infer as a consequence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्वयः|समन्वय
समन्वयः<BR>—1 Regular succession or order; अग्निः सूर्यो दिवा प्राह्णः शुक्लो राकोत्तरं<BR> स्वराट् । विश्वश्च तैजसः प्राज्ञस्तुर्य आत्मा समन्वयात् ॥ Bhāg. 7. 15. 54.<BR>—2 Connected sequence, mutual connection, applicability (तात्पर्य);<BR> तत्तु समन्वयात् Br. Sūt. I. 1. 4; न च तद्गतानां पदानां ब्रह्मस्वरूपविषये<BR> निश्चिते समन्वयेऽर्थान्तरकल्पना युक्ता Ś. B.<BR>—3 Conjunction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समन्वित|समन्वितः
समन्वित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Connected with, connected in natural order.<BR>—2 Followed.<BR>—3 Endowed with, possessing, full of.<BR>—4 Affected by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिद्रुत
समभिद्रुत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Rushing upon.<BR>—2 Attacked, infested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिद्रुतम्
समभिद्रुत + .{@-तम्@} <i>ind.</i> Hurriedly, quickly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिधा
समभिधा Name, appellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिप्लुत
समभिप्लुत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Inundated.<BR>—2 Eclipsed.<BR>—3 (With रजसा) Covered with menstrual excretions; तां विवर्जयतस्तस्य<BR> रजसा समभिप्लुताम् Ms. 4. 42.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिव्याहारः|समभिव्याहार
समभिव्याहारः<BR>—1 Mentioning together; प्रतिष्ठया ब्रह्मवर्चससत्तया च समभिव्याहार<BR> आसां प्रत्यक्षः ŚB. on MS. 4. 3. 18.<BR>—2 Association, company.<BR>—3 Proximity to or association with a word, the meaning of which is clearly<BR> ascertained or understood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिसरणम्
समभिसरणम्<BR>—1 Approaching.<BR>—2 Seeking, wishing for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभिहारः|समभिहार
समभिहारः<BR>—1 Taking together.<BR>—2 Repetition; क्रियासमभिहारेण विराध्यन्तं क्षमेत कः Śi. 2. 43.<BR>—3 Surplus, excess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यर्चनम्
समभ्यर्चनम् Worshipping, reverencing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्याशः|समभ्याश
समभ्याशः Nearness, presence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्यासः|समभ्यास
समभ्यासः Practice, exercise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समभ्याहारः|समभ्याहार
समभ्याहारः Accompaniment, association.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयः|समय
समयः<BR>—1 Time in general.<BR>—2 Occassion, opportunity; न तैः समयमन्विच्छेत् पुरुषो धर्ममाचरन् Ms. 10. 53.<BR>—3 Fit time, proper time or season, right moment; गन्तुं प्रवृत्ते समयं<BR> विलङ्घ्य Ku. 3. 35.<BR>—4 An agreement, a compact, contract, an engagement; मिथःसमयात् Ś. 5.<BR>—5 A convention, conventional usage.<BR>—6 An established rule of conduct, a ceremonial custom, usual practice,<BR> observance; निह्नवन्ति च ये तेषां समयं सुकृतं च यत् Mb. 12. 229. 8;<BR> निरस्तनारीसमया दुराधयः Ki. 1. 28; U. 1.<BR>—7 The convention of poets; (<i>e. g.</i> that persons separated from their<BR> beloveds are affected at the sight of clouds.).<BR>—8 An appointment, assignation.<BR>—9 A condition, stipulation; V. 5.<BR>—10 A law, rule, regulation; वीराणां समयो हि दारुणरसः स्नेहक्रमं<BR> बाधते U. 5. 19.<BR>—11 Direction, order, instruction, precept.<BR>—12 Emergency,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">Page1630-2</a>]<BR> exigency.<BR>—13 An oath; कामं तथा तिष्ठ नरेन्द्र तस्मिन् यथा कृतस्ते समयः सभायाम्<BR> Mb. 3. 183. 35.<BR>—14 A sign, hint, indication; शौरिसमयनिगृहीतधियः Śi. 15. 41.<BR>—15 Limit, boundary.<BR>—16 A demonstrated conclusion, doctrine, tenet; बौद्ध˚, वैशेषिक˚ &c.<BR>—17 End, conclusion, termination.<BR>—18 Success, prosperity.<BR>—19 End of trouble. (समयेन ‘on condition, conditionally’.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समयाध्युषितम्, समयानुवर्तिन्, समयानुसारेण, समयोचितम्, समयाचारः, समयक्रिया, समयच्युतिः, समयज्ञ, समयधर्मः, समयपरिरक्षणम्, समयबन्धन, समयभेदः, समयविद्या, समयव्यभिचारः, समयव्यभिचारिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयाध्युषितम्
समयः + -अध्युषितम् a time at which neither the stars nor the sun is visible;<BR> उदितेऽनुदिते चैव समयाध्युषिते तथा Ms. 2. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयानुवर्तिन्
समयः + -अनुवर्तिन् <i>a.</i> following established customs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयानुसारेण
समयः + -अनुसारेण, -उचितम् <i>ind.</i> suitably to the occasion, as the<BR> occasion demands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयोचितम्
समयः + -अनुसारेण, -उचितम् <i>ind.</i> suitably to the occasion, as the<BR> occasion demands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयाचारः|समयाचार
समयः + -आचारः conventional practice, established usage; अतश्च प्रव्रज्यासुलभसमयाचारविमुखः Māl. 4. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयक्रिया
समयः + -क्रिया<BR>—1 making an agreement; नारदस्याज्ञया चैव द्रौपद्याः समयक्रिया<BR> Mb. 1. 2. 119 ‘the time-arrangement of Draupadiʼs conjugal-life’.<BR>—2 enjoining certain duties; स्थापयेत्तत्र तद्वंश्यं कुर्याच्च समयक्रियाम् Ms. 7. 202.<BR>—3 preparation of an ordeal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयच्युतिः|समयच्युति
समयः + -च्युतिः neglect of the right time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयज्ञ
समयः + -ज्ञ <i>a.</i> knowing the right time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयधर्मः|समयधर्म
समयः + -धर्मः covenant, stipulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयपरिरक्षणम्
समयः + -परिरक्षणम् observance of a compact, treaty, or agreement;<BR> न समयपरिरक्षणं क्षमं ते Ki. 1. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयबन्धन
समयः + -बन्धन <i>a.</i> bound by an agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयभेदः|समयभेद
समयः + -भेदः breaking an agreement or engagement, breach of contract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयविद्या
समयः + -विद्या astrology; Dk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयव्यभिचारः|समयव्यभिचार
समयः + -व्यभिचारः breaking an agreement, violation or breach of contract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समयव्यभिचारिन्
समयः + -व्यभिचारिन् <i>a.</i> breaking an agreement; निगृह्य दापयेच्चैनं<BR> समयव्यभिचारिणम् Ms. 8. 220-221.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समया
समया <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Duly, seasonably, in due time.<BR>—2 At a fixed or appointed time.<BR>—3 In the midst, within, between.<BR>—4 Near (with acc.); समया सौधभित्तिम् Dk.; Śi. 6. 73, 15. 9; सचिवसमेतं<BR> समया गिरोत्तरं नाजनिष्ट मेतं समया Nalod. 4. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समरः|समर|समरं
समरः, -रम्<BR> War, battle, fight; रजांसि समरोत्थानि तच्छोणितनदीष्विव<BR> R. 12. 82; कर्णादयोऽपि समरात् पराङ्मुखीभवन्ति Ve. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समरागमः, समरोद्देशः, समरभूमि, समरमूर्धन्, समरसीमन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समरम्
समरः, -रम्<BR> War, battle, fight; रजांसि समरोत्थानि तच्छोणितनदीष्विव<BR> R. 12. 82; कर्णादयोऽपि समरात् पराङ्मुखीभवन्ति Ve. 3.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समरागमः, समरोद्देशः, समरभूमि, समरमूर्धन्, समरसीमन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समरागमः|समरागम
समरः + -आगमः outbreak of war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समरोद्देशः|समरोद्देश
समरः + -उद्देशः, -भूमि <i>f.</i> battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समरभूमि
समरः + -उद्देशः, -भूमि <i>f.</i> battle-field.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समरमूर्धन्
समरः + -मूर्धन् <i>m.</i>,<BR> {@-शिरस्@} <i>n.</i> the front or van of battle; समरशिरसि चञ्चत्पञ्चचूडश्चमूनाम् U. 5. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समरसीमन्
समरः + -सीमन् battlefield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्चनम्
समर्चनम् Worshipping, honouring, adoration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्ण|समर्ण्ण
समर्ण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Afflicted, pained, wounded.<BR>—2 Asked, solicited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थ्
समर्थ् €10 U.<BR>—1 To believe, consider, regard, think; समर्थये यत् प्रयमं प्रियां<BR> प्रति V. 4. 39; मया न साधु समर्थितम् V. 2; अनुपयुक्तमिव आत्मानं<BR> समर्थये Ś. 7, 3. 18; R. 11. 72.<BR>—2 To corroborate, support, substantiate by proof; उक्तमेवार्थमुदाहरणेन समर्थयति.<BR>—3 To deliberate, think or reflect about.<BR>—4 To make ready, prepare.<BR>—5 To maintain, assert, enforce.<BR>—6 To imply, suggest.<BR>—7 To approve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थ|समर्थः
समर्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Strong, powerful.<BR>—2 Competent, capable of, qualified; प्रतिग्रहसमर्थोऽपि Ms. 4. 186; Y. 1. 213.<BR>—3 Fit, suitable, proper; किं समर्थं जनस्यास्य किं प्रियं किं<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">Page1631-1</a>]<BR> सुखावहम् Rām. 2. 57. 14; तद्धनुर्ग्रहणमेव राघवः प्रत्यपद्यत<BR> समर्थमुत्तरम् R. 11. 79.<BR>—4 Made fit or proper, prepared.<BR>—5 Having the same meaning.<BR>—6 Significant.<BR>—7 Having proper aim or force, very forcible.<BR>—8 Being in apposition.<BR>—9 Connected in sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थः|समर्थ
समर्थ + .{@-र्थः@}<BR>—1 A significant word (in gram.); अव्ययं समर्थेन सह समस्यते सोऽव्ययीभावः Sk.<BR>—2 The coherence of words together in a significant sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थम्
समर्थ + .{@-र्थम्@}<BR>—1 Ability, competence.<BR>—2 Intelligibility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1630-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थकम्
समर्थकम् Aloe-wood. ━<i>a.</i><BR>—1 Capable.<BR>—2 Proving, corroborating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थता
समर्थता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Strength, power.<BR>—2 Force, forcibleness.<BR>—3 Sameness of meaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थत्वम्
समर्थता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Strength, power.<BR>—2 Force, forcibleness.<BR>—3 Sameness of meaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थनम्
समर्थनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Establishing, supporting, corroborating.<BR>—2 Defending, vindicating, justifying; स्थितेष्वेतत् समर्थनम् K. P. 7.<BR>—3 Pleading, advocating.<BR>—4 Judging, considering; imagining.<BR>—5 Deliberation, determination, deciding on the propriety or otherwise of anything.<BR>—6 Adequacy, efficacy, force, capability; स तु ज्ञानगरीयस्त्वात्तपसश्च<BR> समर्थनात् Mb. 1. 130. 10.<BR>—7 Energy, perseverance.<BR>—8 Reconciling differences, allaying disputes.<BR>—9 Objection.<BR>—10 Compensation for an offence; नो तदागसि परं समर्थना N. 18. 136.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थना
समर्थनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Establishing, supporting, corroborating.<BR>—2 Defending, vindicating, justifying; स्थितेष्वेतत् समर्थनम् K. P. 7.<BR>—3 Pleading, advocating.<BR>—4 Judging, considering; imagining.<BR>—5 Deliberation, determination, deciding on the propriety or otherwise of anything.<BR>—6 Adequacy, efficacy, force, capability; स तु ज्ञानगरीयस्त्वात्तपसश्च<BR> समर्थनात् Mb. 1. 130. 10.<BR>—7 Energy, perseverance.<BR>—8 Reconciling differences, allaying disputes.<BR>—9 Objection.<BR>—10 Compensation for an offence; नो तदागसि परं समर्थना N. 18. 136.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्थित
समर्थित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Maintained, established.<BR>—2 Thought, imagined, considered, judged.<BR>—3 Determined; see समर्थ् above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्धक|समर्द्धकः
समर्धक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Granting a boon.<BR>—2 Causing to prosper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्पणम्
समर्पणम् Giving or handing over to, delivering, consigning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्पित|समर्प्पित
समर्पित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Made over, delivered, consigned, committed.<BR>—2 Restored, given back.<BR>—3 Appointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्याद|समर्यादः|समर्य्याद|समर्य्यादः
समर्याद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Limited, bounded.<BR>—2 Near, proximate.<BR>—3 Correct in conduct, keeping within bounds of propriety.<BR>—4 Respectful, courteous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्यादः|समर्याद|समर्य्याद|समर्य्यादः
समर्याद + .{@-दः@} Contiguity, vicinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्यादम्
समर्याद + .{@-दम्@} <i>ind.</i> Decisively, exactly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समर्हणम्
समर्हणम् Eulogy, eulogistic mention; द्यावापृथिव्योरन्तराले समर्हणात् Ms. 5. 3. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समल|समलं
समल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Dirty, foul, filthy, impure.<BR>—2 Sinful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समलम्
समल + .{@-लम्@} Excrement, ordure, feces.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवकारः|समवकार
समवकारः A kind of drama; (thus described in S. D.:− वृत्तं<BR> समवकारे तु ख्यातं देवासुराश्रयम् । संधयो निर्विमर्शास्तु त्रयोऽङ्काः &c. 515.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवतारः|समवतार
समवतारः<BR>—1 A descent.<BR>—2 A descent into a river or sacred bathing place; समवतारसमैरसमैस्तटैः Ki. 5. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवधानम्
समवधानम्<BR>—1 Great attention.<BR>—2 Preparation.<BR>—3 meeting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवनम्
समवनम् Protection; प्रजा ब्राह्मणा देवताश्चावनितलसमवनायातितरां<BR> जगृधुः Bhāg. 5. 4. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवबोधनम्
समवबोधनम् Thorough knowledge, perception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवसरणम्
समवसरणम्<BR>—1 Descent (of a deity from heaven).<BR>—2 Aim, goal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवस्कन्दः|समवस्कन्द
समवस्कन्दः Bulwark, rampart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवस्था
समवस्था €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To remain fixed, stand immoveable; stand still.<BR>—2 To stand ready. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To establish, found.<BR>—2 To stop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवस्था
समवस्था<BR>—1 Fixed condition.<BR>—2 Similar condition or state; Ś. 4.<BR>—3 State or condition in general; कामयानसमवस्थया तुलाम् (ययौ)<BR> R. 19. 50; M. 4. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवस्थित
समवस्थित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Remaining fixed.<BR>—2 Steady.<BR>—3 Ready.<BR>—4 Being in any place or position.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवहारः|समवहार
समवहारः<BR>—1 Mixture; कुशलाकुशलसमवहारविनिर्मित Bhāg. 5. 14. 1.<BR>—2 Collection; प्रज्ञासमवहारोऽयं कविभिः संभृतं मधु Mb. 12. 142. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवाप्तिः|समवाप्ति
समवाप्तिः <i>f.</i> Obtaining, acquisition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवे
समवे €2 P.<BR>—1 To assemble, come together; समवेता युयुत्सवः Bg. 1. 1.<BR>—2 To be related or connected in an intimate relation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवायः|समवाय
समवायः<BR>—1 Combination, union, conjunction, aggregate, collection; तेषां समवाये<BR> एकदेशकालकर्तृत्वे … एकतन्त्रत्वं भवति ŚB. on MS. 12. 1. 1;<BR> सर्वाविनयानामेकैकमप्येषामायतनं किमुत समवायः K.; बहूनामप्यसाराणां<BR> समवायो हि दुर्जयः Pt. 1. 331; Bhāg. 6. 9. 34.<BR>—2 A number, multitude, heap.<BR>—3 Close connection, cohesion; कर्तृदेशकालानामचोदनं प्रयोगे नित्यसमवायात् MS. 4. 2. 23.<BR>—4 (In Vaiś. phil.) Intimate union, constant and inseparable connection,<BR> inseparable inherence or existence of one thing in another, one of the<BR> seven categories of the Vaiśeṣikas; उक्तं समवाये पारदौर्बल्यम्<BR> MS. 8. 4. 17; नित्यसंबन्धः समवायः Tarka K.<BR>—5 Conjunction of heavenly bodies; समालोक्यैकतामेव शशिनो भास्करस्य<BR> च । समवायं तु तं रौद्रं दृष्ट्वा शक्रोऽन्वचिन्तयत् ॥ Mb. 3. 224. 16.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समवायसंबन्धः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवायसंबन्धः|समवायसम्बन्ध
समवायः + -संबन्धः intimate and inseparable relation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवायिन्
समवायिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Closely or intimately connected.<BR>—2 Multitudinous. ━<i>m.</i> (with पुरुष) the individual soul; अनादिरात्मा<BR> संभूतिर्विद्यते नान्तरात्मनः । समवायी तु पुरुषो मोहेच्छाद्वेषकर्मजः ॥<BR> Y. 3. 125.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समवायिकारणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवायिकारणम्
समवायिन् + -कारणम् inseparable cause, the material cause (one of the three<BR> kinds of कारण mentioned in Vaiśeṣika phil.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवेक्षणम्
समवेक्षणम् Inspection; मृगया शोभना तात गवां हि समवेक्षणम् Mb. 3. 239. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवेत|समवेतः
समवेत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Come together, met, united, joined; धर्मक्षेत्रे कुरुक्षेत्रे समवेता<BR> युयुत्सवः Bg. 1. 1.<BR>—2 Intimately united, or inherent, inseparably connected.<BR>—3 Comprised or contained in a larger number.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समवेतार्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समवेतार्थ
समवेत + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> significant, instructive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1631-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समश्
समश् I. €5 U.<BR>—1 To pervade thoroughly.<BR>—2 To obtain, attain to.<BR>—3 To meet. ━II. €9 P.<BR>—1 To eat; नक्तं चान्नं समश्नीयात् Ms. 6. 19, 11. 219.<BR>—2 To taste, experience, enjoy; यथा फलं समश्नाति Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समष्टिः|समष्टि
समष्टिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Collective pervasion or aggregate, an aggregate which is considered<BR> as made up of parts each of which is consubstantially the same with the<BR> whole (opp. व्यष्टि q. v.); समष्टिरीशः सर्वेषां स्वात्मतादात्म्यवेदनात् ।<BR> तदभावात्तदन्ये तु ज्ञायन्ते व्यष्टिसंज्ञया ॥ Pañcadaśī 1. 25.<BR>—2 Totality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समष्ठिलः|समष्ठिल
समष्ठिलः A kind of cucumber (Mar. कडू सुरण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समस्
समस् €4 P.<BR>—1 To throw or bring together, put together, unite, combine; अग्ने सोमस्य<BR> चैवादौ तयोश्चैव समस्तयोः Ms. 3. 85; समस्तानां च कार्येषु विदध्याद्धितमात्मनः 7. 57.<BR>—2 To join in a compound, compound.<BR>—3 To take collectively or jointly; समस्तैरथ वा पृथक् Ms. 7. 198<BR> ‘jointly or severally’. ━<i>Pass.</i> To be compounded, form or enter into<BR> a compound; अव्ययं समर्थेन सह समस्यते सोऽव्ययीभावः Sk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समसनम्
समसनम्<BR>—1 Joining together, combination.<BR>—2 Compounding, formation of compound words.<BR>—3 Contraction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समस्त|समस्तं
समस्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Thrown together, combined; समस्तं व्यस्तं त्वां शरणद गृणात्योमिति<BR> पदम् Śivamahimna 27; विशन्त्यतो दुर्गममार्गनिर्गमं समस्तसंबाधमनर्थपञ्जरम् Pt. 1. 383.<BR>—2 Compounded.<BR>—3 Pervading the whole of anything.<BR>—4 Abridged, contracted, condensed.<BR>—5 All, whole, entire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समस्या
समस्या<BR>—1 Proposing part of a stanza to another to be completed, the part of<BR> a stanza so given to be completed; कः श्रीपतिः का विषमा समस्या Subhāṣ.;<BR> (thus the lines वागर्थाविव संपृक्तौ; शतकोटिप्रविस्तरम्; तुरासाहं<BR> पुरोधाय are completed by नेमुः सर्वे सुराः शिवौ).<BR>—2 (Hence) Completing or filling up what is incomplete; गौरीव पत्या<BR> सुभगा कदाचित् कर्तेयमप्यर्धतनूसमस्याम् N. 7. 83 (समस्या = संघटनम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समह्या
समह्या Fame, reputation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समा
समा (generally in pl., but used by Pāṇini in sing. also, <i>e. g.</i><BR> समां समाम् P. V. 2. 12.) A year; तेनाष्टौ परिगमिताः समाः<BR> कथंचित् R. 8. 92; तयोश्चतुर्दशैकेन रामं प्राव्राजयत् समाः 12. 6, 19. 4;<BR> Mv. 4. 41. ━<i>ind.</i> With, together with.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समातीत, समानिचय<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समातीत
समा + -अतीत <i>a.</i> more than one year old.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानिचय
समा + -निचय <i>a.</i> one who has provision sufficient for a year; Ms. 6. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समांसमीना
समांसमीना A cow bearing a calf every year.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाकर्णितकम्
समाकर्णितकम् Any gesture which expresses the act of listening.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाकरणम्
समाकरणम् Calling, summoning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाकुल
समाकुल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Full of, thronged, crowded; चमूं विगाह्य शत्रूणां परशक्तिसमाकुलम्<BR> Mb. 3. 151. 16.<BR>—2 Greatly agitated, bewildered, confused, flurried; समाकुलेषु धर्मेषु<BR> किं तु शेषं भविष्यति Mb. 3. 190. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाकृष्
समाकृष् P.<BR>—1 To draw out, extract.<BR>—2 To attract.<BR>—3 To censure; इति लोकसमाकृष्टः पादेष्वद्य प्रसादयन् Rām. 2. 99. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाकर्षिन्
समाकर्षिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Attracting.<BR>—2 Spreading far, diffusing fragrance. ━<i>m.</i> Diffused odour, a scent<BR> spreading afar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाक्रम्
समाक्रम् €1 U.<BR>—1 To take possession of, occupy, fill; सममेव समाक्रान्तं द्वयं<BR> द्विरदगामिना । तेन सिंहासनं पित्र्यमखिलं चारिमण्डलम् R. 4. 4.<BR>—2 To assail, conquer, subdue.<BR>—3 To tread or step upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाक्रमणम्
समाक्रमणम्<BR>—1 Treading.<BR>—2 Assailing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाक्रान्त
समाक्रान्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Trod upon.<BR>—2 Attacked, assailed.<BR>—3 Kept (as a promise); Rām.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाक्षिक
समाक्षिक <i>a.</i> Together with honey; Suśr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाक्षेपणम्
समाक्षेपणम् Hinting at, suggestion of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाख्या
समाख्या €2 P.<BR>—1 To count, reckon.<BR>—2 To relate, tell.<BR>—3 To declare, proclaim.<BR>—4 To sum up, add together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाख्या
समाख्या<BR>—1 Fame, reputation, celebrity.<BR>—2 A name, appellation; दीक्षणीया इति च तादर्थ्यकरी समाख्या भवति ।<BR> ŚB. on MS. 5. 3. 31.<BR>—3 Explanation, interpretation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाख्यात
समाख्यात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Reckoned up, counted, summed up; अष्टाउ चान्याः समाख्याताः Ms. 7. 156.<BR>—2 Fully related, declared, proclaimed.<BR>—3 Celebrated, famous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाख्यानम्
समाख्यानम्<BR>—1 A name; समाख्यानं च तद्वत् MS. 5. 3. 31.<BR>—2 Report, narrative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समागम्
समागम्<BR>—1 To come or meet together, assemble.<BR>—2 To become joined or united, to associate, keep company with.<BR>—3 To have sexual intercourse with.<BR>—4 To come together, be in conjunction (as planets).<BR>—5 To come near, approach.<BR>—6 To return.<BR>—7 To find, meet with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समागत|समागतः
समागत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Come together, met, joined, united; इदं वचनमक्लीबं त्वया धर्मसमागतम्<BR> Rām. 7. 83. 18.<BR>—2 Arrived.<BR>—3 Being in conjunction.<BR>—4 Approached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समागता
समागत + .{@-ता@} A kind of riddle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समागतम्
समागत + .{@-तम्@} meeting, company; समागतं द्विजेन्द्रस्य पन्नगेन्द्रस्य<BR> चाध्वनि Mb. 1. 50. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समागतिः|समागति
समागतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Coming together, union, meeting.<BR>—2 Arrival, approach.<BR>—3 Similar condition or progress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समागमः|समागम
समागमः<BR>—1 Union, meeting, encountering, combination; अहो दैवगतिश्चित्रा तथापि<BR> न समागमः K. P. 7; R. 8. 4, 92, 19. 16.<BR>—2 Intercourse, association, society; as in सत्समागमः.<BR>—3 Approach, arrival.<BR>—4 Conjunction (in astr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाघातः|समाघात
समाघातः<BR>—1 Killing, slaughter.<BR>—2 War, battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाचयनम्
समाचयनम् Accumulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1632-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाचर्
समाचर् €1 P.<BR>—1 To do, perform, practise; एहि गच्छ पतोत्तिष्ठ वद मौनं समाचर K. P. 10.<BR>—2 To behave.<BR>—3 To remove; उच्छिष्टान्नं निषेकं च दूरादेव समाचरेत् Ms. 4. 151.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाचरणम्
समाचरणम्<BR>—1 Practising, observing, behaving.<BR>—2 Performance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाचारः|समाचार
समाचारः<BR>—1 Proceeding, going.<BR>—2 Practice, conduct, behaviour.<BR>—3 Proper conduct or behaviour; यथाशक्ति समाचाराः संप्रतुष्यन्ति हि<BR> प्रभो Mb. 12. 168. 20.<BR>—4 News, information, report, tidings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाचेष्टितम्
समाचेष्टितम्<BR>—1 Behaviour, conduct.<BR>—2 Procedure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाजः|समाज
समाजः<BR>—1 An assembly, a meeting; अयं समाजः सुमहान् रमणीयतमो भुवि<BR> Mb. 1. 143. 3; विशेषतः सर्वविदां समाजे विभूषणं मौनमपण्डितानाम् Bh. 2. 7.<BR>—2 A society, club, an association; … समाजानुरतो जनः Bk. 8. 39.<BR> (cf. पशूनां समजोऽन्येषां समाजोऽथ सधर्मिणाम्); Ms. 9. 264.<BR>—3 A number, multitude, collection.<BR>—4 A party, convivial meeting.<BR>—5 An elephant.<BR>—6 Meeting with, falling in with; तेषां विभो समुचितो भवतः समाजः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 60. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाजिकः|समाजिक
समाजिकः<BR>—1 A member of an assembly; see सोमाजिक.<BR>—2 A spectator in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाज्ञा
समाज्ञा €9 U.<BR>—1 To know or understand thoroughly, learn or ascertain fully.<BR>—2 To recognize, acknowledge. ━<i>Caus.</i> To order, command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाज्ञा
समाज्ञा<BR>—1 Fame, reputation.<BR>—2 Appellation, name; इति मानुषीः समाज्ञाः T. Up. 3. 10. 2 (some give<BR> its meaning as उपासना).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समातत
समातत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Extended, stretched.<BR>—2 Continuous, uninterrupted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समातृ
समातृ A step-mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समादा
समादा €3 U.<BR>—1 To take, receive, accept.<BR>—2 To take hold of, seize, grasp.<BR>—3 To bestow, give, present.<BR>—4 To restore, return.<BR>—5 To take off or away.<BR>—6 To apprehend, comprehend.<BR>—7 To undertake, begin.<BR>—8 To collect.<BR>—9 To think about, reflect on.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समादानम्
समादानम्<BR>—1 Receiving fully.<BR>—2 Receiving suitable gifts.<BR>—3 The daily observances of the Jaina sect.<BR>—4 Resolve, determination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समादापक
समादापक <i>a.</i> Exciting, instigating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समादिश्
समादिश् €6 P.<BR>—1 To point out, indicate.<BR>—2 To inform, tell, communicate.<BR>—3 To proclaim, announce.<BR>—4 To foretell.<BR>—5 To order, command, direct.<BR>—6 To appoint, depute, entrust with.<BR>—7 To assign, allot.<BR>—8 To determine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समादिष्ट
समादिष्ट <i>p. p.</i> Assigned, enjoined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समादेशः|समादेश
समादेशः Command, order, direction, instruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधा
समाधा €3 U.<BR>—1 To place or put together, join, unite; राक्षसाः सत्त्वसंपन्नाः पुनर्धैर्यं<BR> समादधुः Rām. 7. 7. 26; मूर्तीः सर्वाः समाधाय त्रैलोक्यस्य ततस्ततः Mb. 8. 34. 16.<BR>—2 To place, put, put or place upon, apply to; पदं मूर्ध्नि समाधत्ते<BR> केसरी मत्तदन्तिनः Pt. 1. 327.<BR>—3 To install, place on the throne; तदात्मसंभवं राज्ये मन्त्रिवृद्धाः<BR> समादधुः R. 17. 8.<BR>—4 To compose, collect (as the mind); मनः समाधाय निवृत्तशोकः<BR> Rām.; न शशाक समाधातुं मनो मदनवेपितम् Bhāg.<BR>—5 To concentrate, fix or apply intently upon (as the eye, mind &c.);<BR> समाधाय मतिं राम निशामय वदाम्यहम् Rām. 7. 35. 18; अथ चित्तं<BR> समाधातुं न शक्नोषि मयि स्थिरम् Bg. 12. 9; Bh. 3. 48.<BR>—6 To satisfy, clear or solve (a doubt), answer an objection; इति समाधत्ते<BR> (in commentaries); ततो दुहितरं वेश्यां समाधायेतिकार्यताम् Mb. 3. 111. 5.<BR>—7 To repair, redress, set right, remove; न ते शक्याः समाधातुम् H. 3. 37;<BR> उत्पन्नामापदं यस्तु समाधत्ते स बुद्धिमान् 4. 7.<BR>—8 To think over; चिरं सुधीरभ्यधिकं समाधात् Bk. 12. 6.<BR>—6 To entrust, commit to, deliver over.<BR>—10 To produce, effect, accomplish.<BR>—11 To place a burden, load.<BR>—12 To assume, take upon oneself.<BR>—13 To conceive (in the womb).<BR>—14 To establish.<BR>—15 To put on (a garment or dress).<BR>—16 To assume (a shape).<BR>—17 To show, exhibit.<BR>—18 To admit, grant; Kull. on Ms. 8. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधा
समाधा See समाधान below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधानम्
समाधानम्<BR>—1 Putting together, uniting.<BR>—2 Fixing the mind in abstract contemplation on the true nature of spirit;<BR> बिभ्रत्यात्मसमाधानतपःस्वाध्यायसंयमैः Bhāg. 12. 11. 24.<BR>—3 Profound or abstract meditation, deep contemplation.<BR>—4 Intentness.<BR>—5 Steadiness, composure, peace (as of mind), satisfaction; चित्तस्य<BR> समाधानम्; समाधानं बुद्धेः G. L. 18.<BR>—6 Clearing up a doubt, replying to the Pūrvapakṣa; answering an objection.<BR>—7 Agreeing, promising.<BR>—8 (In drama) A leading incident which unexpectedly gives rise to the whole plot.<BR>—9 Justification of a statement, proof.<BR>—10 Reconciliation.<BR>—11 Eagerness.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समाधानरूपकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधानरूपकम्
समाधानम् + -रूपकम् a kind of metaphor (used for the justification of a bold assertion).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधिः|समाधि
समाधिः<BR>—1 Collecting, composing, concentrating (as mind).<BR>—2 Profound or abstract meditation, concentration of mind on one object,<BR> perfect absorption of thought into the one object of meditation, <i>i. e.</i><BR> the Supreme Spirit, (the 8th and last stage of Yoga); व्यवसायात्मिका<BR> बुद्धिः समाधौ न विधीयते Bg. 2. 44; आत्मेश्वराणां न हि जातु विघ्नाः<BR> समाधिभेदप्रभवो भवन्ति Ku. 3. 40, 50; Mk. 1. 1; Bh. 3. 54; R. 8. 79; Śi. 4. 55.<BR>—3 Intentness, concentration (in general), fixing of thoughts; यथा<BR> भानुगतं तेजो मणिः शुद्धः समाधिना । आदत्ते राजशार्दूल तथा योगः प्रवर्तते ॥<BR> Mb. 12. 298. 12; तस्यां लग्नसमाधि (मानसम्) Gīt. 3; अहःसु<BR> तस्या हृदि ये समाधयः Rām. Ch. 2. 41.<BR>—4 Penance, religious obligation, devotion (to penance); अस्त्येतदन्यसमाधिभीरुत्वं<BR> देवानाम् Ś. 1; तपःसमाधि Ku. 3. 24; अथोपयन्तारमलं समाधिना 5. 24, 5. 6, 1. 59;<BR> सर्वथा दृढसमाधिर्भव Nāg. 5.<BR>—5 Bringing together, concentration,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">Page1634-1</a>]<BR> combination, collection; union, a set; सा तस्य धर्मार्थसमाधियुक्तं<BR> निशम्य वाक्यम् Rām. 4. 33. 50; तं वेधा विदधे नूनं महाभूतसमाधिना R. 1. 29.<BR>—6 Reconciliation, settling or composing differences.<BR>—7 Silence.<BR>—8 Agreement, assent, promise.<BR>—9 Requital.<BR>—10 Completion, accomplishment.<BR>—11 Perseverance in extreme difficulties.<BR>—12 Attempting impossibilities.<BR>—13 Laying up corn (in times of famine), storing grain.<BR>—14 A tomb.<BR>—15 The joint of the neck; a particular position of the neck; अंसाववष्टब्धनतौ<BR> समाधिः Ki. 16. 21.<BR>—16 (In Rhet.) A figure of speech thus defined by Mammaṭa; समाधिः<BR> सुकरं कार्यं कारणान्तरयोगतः K. P. 10; see S. D. 614.<BR>—17 One of the ten Guṇas or merits of style; अन्यधर्मस्ततोऽन्यत्र<BR> लोकसीमानुरोधिना । सम्यगाधीयते यत्र स समाधिः स्मृतो यथा ॥ Kāv. 1. 93.<BR>—18 A religious vow or self-imposed restraint.<BR>—19 Support, upholding.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समाधिभङ्गः, समाधिभृत्, समाधियोगः, समाधिविग्रहः, समाधिस्थ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1633-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधिभङ्गः|समाधिभङ्ग
समाधिः + -भङ्गः interruption of meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधिभृत्
समाधिः + -भृत् <i>a.</i> absorbed in meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधियोगः|समाधियोग
समाधिः + -योगः<BR>—1 employment of meditation.<BR>—2 the efficacy of contemplation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधिविग्रहः|समाधिविग्रह
समाधिः + -विग्रहः embodiment of meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधिस्थ|समाधिस्थः
समाधिः + -स्थ <i>a.</i> absorbed in meditation or contemplation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधित|समाधितं
समाधित <i>p. p.</i> Propitiated, reconciled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधिन्
समाधिन्, समाधिमत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Meditating.<BR>—2 Devout, pious; सा भूधराणामधिपेन तस्यां समाधिमत्यामुदपादि भव्या Ku. 1. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधिमत्|समाधिमन्त्
समाधिन्, समाधिमत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Meditating.<BR>—2 Devout, pious; सा भूधराणामधिपेन तस्यां समाधिमत्यामुदपादि भव्या Ku. 1. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाधूत
समाधूत <i>p. p.</i> Scattered, dispersed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाध्मात
समाध्मात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Blown into.<BR>—2 Elated, puffed up, inflated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समान|समानं|समानः
समान <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Same, one, equal, like, similar; नोपगच्छेत् प्रमत्तोऽपि स्त्रियमार्तवदर्शने ।<BR> समानशयने चैव न शयीत तया सह ॥ Ms. 4. 40; भुजे भुजंगेन्द्रसमानसारे<BR> R. 2. 74; समानशीलव्यसनेषु सख्यम् Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 One, uniform.<BR>—3 Good, virtuous, just.<BR>—4 Common, general.<BR>—5 Honoured.<BR>—6 Middling, moderate.<BR>—7 Whole (as a number).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानः|समान|समानं
समान + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 A friend, an equal.<BR>—2 One of five life-winds or vital airs, which has its seat in the cavity<BR> of the navel and is essential to digestion.<BR>—3 A letter having the same organ of utterance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानम्
समान + .{@-नम्@} <i>ind.</i> Equally with, like (with instr.); जलधरेण समानमुमापतिः Ki. 18. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समानाक्षरम्, समानाधिकरण, समानाधिकारः, समानाभिहारः, समानार्थ, समानोदकः, समानोदर्यः, समानोपमा, समानकरण, समानकर्तृक, समानकर्मक, समानकाल, समानकालीन, समानक्षेम, समानगति, समानगोत्र, समानजन्मन्, समानदुःख, समानधर्मन्, समानप्रतिपत्ति, समानमान, समानयमः, समानयोगित्वम्, समानरूपा, समानवयस्, समानरुचि, समानशब्दत्वम्, समानशील, समानसूत्रनिपाते, समानस्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानाक्षरम्
समान + -अक्षरम् N. of the vowels अ, आ, इ, ई, उ, ऊ, ऋ, ॠ, and ऌ<BR> (opp. संध्यक्षर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानाधिकरण
समान + -अधिकरण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having a common substratum.<BR>—2 being in the same category or predicament.<BR>—3 being in the same case-relation or government (in gram.); तत्पुरुषः<BR> समानाधिकरणः कर्मधारयः P. I. 2. 42. ˚समास The कर्मधारय<BR> compound where the expressions are in apposition to one another; समानाधिकरणसमासस्तु<BR> बलीयान् । तत्र हि स्वार्थे शब्दौ वृत्तौ भवतः । ŚB. on MS. 6. 1. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानाधिकरणम्
समान + -अधिकरण + .({@-णम्@})<BR>—1 same location or predicament.<BR>—2 agreement in case, apposition.<BR>—3 a predicament including several things, a generic property.<BR>—4 common government.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानाधिकारः|समानाधिकार
समान + -अधिकारः generic characteristic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानाभिहारः|समानाभिहार
समान + -अभिहारः A mixture of objects of the same kind; व्यवधानात्<BR> समानाभिहाराच्च Sāṅ. K. 7.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">Page1634-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानार्थ
समान + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> having the same meaning, synonymous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानोदकः|समानोदक
समान + -उदकः a relative connected by the libations of water to the<BR> Manes of common ancestors; this relationship extends from the seventh (or<BR> eleventh) to the thirteenth (or fourteenth according to some) degree;<BR> समानोदकभावस्तु निवर्तेताचतुर्दशात्; see Ms. 5. 60 also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानोदर्यः|समानोदर्य|समानोदर्य्य|समानोदर्य्यः
समान + -उदर्यः a brother of whole blood, uterine brother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानोपमा
समान + -उपमा a kind of Upamā; सरूपशब्दवाच्यत्वात् सा समानोपमा<BR> यथा । बालेवोद्यानमालेयं सालकाननशोभिनी ॥ Kāv. 2. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानकरण
समान + -करण <i>a.</i> having the same organ of utterance (said of a sound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानकर्तृक
समान + -कर्तृक <i>a.</i> (in gram.) having the same subject in a sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानकर्मक
समान + -कर्मक <i>a.</i> (in gram.) having the same object; P. III. 4. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानकाल
समान + -काल, -कालीन <i>a.</i> synchronous, simultaneous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानकालीन|समानकालीनः
समान + -काल, -कालीन <i>a.</i> synchronous, simultaneous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानक्षेम
समान + -क्षेम <i>a.</i> balancing each other.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानगति
समान + -गति <i>a.</i> agreeing together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानगोत्र
समान + -गोत्र = सगोत्र q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानजन्मन्
समान + -जन्मन् <i>a.</i> of equal age; Ms. 2. 208.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानदुःख
समान + -दुःख <i>a.</i> sympathiser.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानधर्मन्
समान + -धर्मन् <i>a.</i> possessed of the same qualities, sympathising,<BR> appreciator of merits; उत्पत्स्यतेऽस्ति मम कोऽपि समानधर्मा Māl. 1. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानप्रतिपत्ति
समान + -प्रतिपत्ति <i>a.</i> of equal intelligence, judicious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानमान
समान + -मान <i>a.</i> equally honoured with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानयमः|समानयम
समान + -यमः the same pitch of voice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानयोगित्वम्
समान + -योगित्वम् being on a par with, being connected in the same way<BR> as; एवं द्रव्यैः समानयोगित्वं स्त्रीणाम् ŚB. on MS. 6. 1. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानरूपा
समान + -रूपा a kind of riddle in which the same words are to be understood<BR> in a literal and figurative sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानवयस्
समान + -वयस् <i>a.</i> of the same age.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानरुचि
समान + -रुचि <i>a.</i> agreeing in tastes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानशब्दत्वम्
समान + -शब्दत्वम् the state of being expressed or referred to by the<BR> same term; ऐकशब्द्यात् समानशब्दत्वादित्यर्थः ŚB. on MS. 7. 1. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानशील
समान + -शील <i>a.</i> of a similar disposition; समानशीलव्यसनेषु सख्यम् H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानसूत्रनिपाते
समान + -सूत्रनिपाते <i>ind.</i> on the diametrically opposite side.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानस्थानम्
समान + -स्थानम् interposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानयति
समानयति Den. P. To make equal, equalise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानी
समानी €1 P.<BR>—1 To join, unite, bring together; हस्तौ समानीय R. 2. 64; Ś. 5. 15.<BR>—2 To fetch, bring; स मारुतिसमानीतमहौषधिहृतव्यथः R. 12. 78.<BR>—3 To collect, assemble.<BR>—4 To bring or offer an oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानयनम्
समानयनम् Bringing together, collecting, conducting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समानीत
समानीत <i>p. p.</i> Assembled, brought together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्
समाप् €5 P.<BR>—1 To obtain, get.<BR>—2 To accomplish, fulfil.<BR>—3 To finish, complete; यावतैषां समाप्येरन् यज्ञाः पर्याप्तदक्षिणाः<BR> R. 17. 17, 24; समाप्य सान्ध्यं च विधिम् 2. 23. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to gain completely.<BR>—2 To finish, complete.<BR>—3 To put to death; तलैश्च पादैश्च समापयन्तः Rām. 5. 61. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापः|समाप
समापः Offering sacrifices or oblations to the gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापक|समापकः
समापक <i>a.</i> (-पिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> Finishing, accomplishing, fulfilling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापिका
समापिका A verb completing a sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापनम्
समापनम्<BR>—1 Completion, conclusion, bringing to an end; आदिष्टी नोदकं कुर्यादा<BR> व्रतस्य समापनात् Ms. 5. 88.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">Page1635-1</a>]<BR>—2 Acquisition.<BR>—3 Killing, destroying.<BR>—4 A section, chapter.<BR>—5 Profound meditation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1634-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापना
समापना Highest degree, perfection; द्रव्यत्यागे तु कर्माणि भोगत्यागे<BR> व्रतान्यपि । सुखत्यागे तपोयोगं सर्वत्यागे समापना ॥ Mb. 12. 219. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्त|समाप्तः
समाप्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Finished, concluded, completed.<BR>—2 Clever.<BR>—3 Ample, full; स्वयं यज्ञैर्यजमानाः समाप्तवरदक्षिणैः Mb. 12. 340. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्तिः|समाप्ति
समाप्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 End, conclusion, completion, termination.<BR>—2 Accomplishment, fulfilment, perfection.<BR>—3 Reconciling or settling differences, making up quarrels.<BR>—4 Perfection, development; नीते समाप्तिं नवचूतबाणे Ku. 3. 27.<BR>—5 Dissolution (of the body); आ समाप्तेः शरीरस्य यस्तु शुश्रूषते गुरुम् Ms. 2. 244.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्तिक|समाप्तिकः
समाप्तिक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Final, concluding.<BR>—2 Finite.<BR>—3 One who has finished the whole of anything.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्तिकः|समाप्तिक
समाप्तिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A finisher.<BR>—2 One who has completed the whole course of holy studies; Ms. 3. 145.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापित|समापितं
समापित <i>p. p.</i> Accomplished, finished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापद्
समापद् €4 Ā.<BR>—1 To get, obtain, attain to.<BR>—2 To take place, happen, occur.<BR>—3 To fall upon, attack.<BR>—4 To undergo.<BR>—5 To begin.<BR>—6 To be finished or ended. ━<i>Caus.</i> To complete, accomplish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापत्तिः|समापत्ति
समापत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Meeting, encountering.<BR>—2 Accident, chance, accidental encounter; समापत्तिदृष्टेन केशिना दानवेन<BR> V. 1; M. 4; क्रियासमापत्तिनिवर्तितानि R. 7. 23; Ku. 7. 75.<BR>—3 Assuming an original form.<BR>—4 Completion, conclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापन्न|समापन्नं
समापन्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Attained, obtained.<BR>—2 Occurred, happened.<BR>—3 Come, arrived.<BR>—4 Finished, completed, accomplished.<BR>—5 Proficient.<BR>—6 Endowed with.<BR>—7 Distressed, afflicted.<BR>—8 Killed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापन्नम्
समापन्न + .{@-न्नम्@}<BR>—1 End, completion.<BR>—2 Death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापादनम्
समापादनम् Accomplishing, restoring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समापाद्यम्
समापाद्यम् The change of a Visarga to स् or ष्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्तालः|समाप्ताल
समाप्तालः A lord, husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्यायित
समाप्यायित <i>p. p.</i> Nourished, refreshed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्लवः|समाप्लव
समाप्ल(प्ला)वः Bathing, bath; नदीशतानां पञ्चानां मध्ये चक्रे<BR> समाप्लवम् Mb. 3. 114. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्लावः|समाप्लाव
समाप्ल(प्ला)वः Bathing, bath; नदीशतानां पञ्चानां मध्ये चक्रे<BR> समाप्लवम् Mb. 3. 114. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाप्लुत
समाप्लुत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Flooded, inundated.<BR>—2 Filled with.<BR>—3 Bathed in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाभाषणम्
समाभाषणम् Conversation, talking with; सुहृत्समाभाषणतत्परोऽभूत् R. 6. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाम्ना
समाम्ना €1 P.<BR>—1 To repeat, recite.<BR>—2 To lay down, prescribe; तं हि धर्मं सूत्रकाराः समामनन्ति U. 4.<BR>—3 To repeat or hand down traditionally.<BR>—4 To enumerate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाम्नात
समाम्नात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Repeated, mentioned together.<BR>—2 Handed down by tradition or memory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाम्नातृ
समाम्नातृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A repeater memoriter.<BR>—2 A collector or editor of texts.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाम्नानम्
समाम्नानम्<BR>—1 Repetition, mention.<BR>—2 Enumeration.<BR>—3 Traditional repetition or mention.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाम्नायः|समाम्नाय
समाम्नायः<BR>—1 Traditional repetition or mention, handing down traditionally.<BR>—2 A traditional collection (of words &c.); अश्व इति पशुसमाम्नाये पठ्यते U. 4.<BR>—3 Tradition, repetition (in general).<BR>—4 Reading, recitation, enumeration.<BR>—5 Totality, an aggregate, a collection; अक्षरसमाम्नायम् Śik. 57<BR> (<i>i. e.</i> the letters from अ to ह which are said to have been<BR> revealed by Śiva to Pāṇini); वाचं वर्णसमाम्राये तमोङ्कारे स्वरे<BR> न्यसेत् Bhāg. 7. 15. 53.<BR>—6 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—7 The sacred text (like Veda) in general; पुत्र्याः समाम्नायविधौ प्रतीतः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 22. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समायः|समाय
समायः<BR>—1 Arrival, coming.<BR>—2 A visit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समायत
समायत <i>p. p.</i> Drawn out, extended, lengthened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समायस्त
समायस्त <i>p. p.</i> Distressed, oppressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समायात
समायात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Come together.<BR>—2 Returned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समायुज्
समायुज् €7 U.<BR>—1 To join together, unite, connect.<BR>—2 To provide with, furnish, supply.<BR>—3 To make ready, prepare; see समायुक्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समायुक्त
समायुक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Joined, connected, united.<BR>—2 Intent on, devoted to.<BR>—3 Made ready, prepared; अथ नावं सुविस्तीर्णां … आरुरोह समायुक्तां<BR> पूर्वमारोप्य मैथिलीम् Rām. 7. 47. 1.<BR>—4 Endowed or furnished with, filled with, provided, supplied.<BR>—5 Charged, appointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समायोगः|समायोग
समायोगः<BR>—1 Union, connection, conjunction; क्षेत्रबीजसमायोगात् संभवः सर्वदेहिनाम्<BR> Ms. 9. 33; तामन्यया समायोगे वीटायां ग्रहणं मम Mb. 1. 31. 29.<BR>—2 Preparation.<BR>—3 Fitting (an arrow).<BR>—4 A collection, heap, multitude.<BR>—5 A cause, motive, object.<BR>—6 Association.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समायुत
समायुत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Connected or united together, joined.<BR>—2 Collected, brought together.<BR>—3 Endowed or furnished with, having, possessed of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारत
समारत <i>p. p.</i> Ceased from, desisted; ते ह समारतास्तूष्णीमासांचक्रिरे<BR> Ch. Up. 1. 10. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारभ्
समारभ् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To begin, undertake.<BR>—2 To try to propitiate, win over; अहं त्विमं जलनिधिं समारप्स्याम्युपायतः<BR> Mb. 3. 283. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारम्भः|समारम्भ|समारंभ|समारंभः
समारम्भः<BR>—1 Beginning, commencement.<BR>—2 An enterprise, undertaking, a work, an action; यस्य सर्वे समारम्भाः<BR> कामसंकल्पवर्जिताः Bg. 4. 19; Mb. 3. 125. 4; भव्यमुख्याः समारम्भाः … … तस्य<BR> गूढं विपेचिरे R. 17. 53.<BR>—3 An unguent; see समालम्भ.<BR>—4 Spirit of enterprise; व्यूहानां च समारम्भान् दैवगान्धर्वमानुषान्<BR> Mb. 5. 165. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1635-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाराधनम्
समाराधनम्<BR>—1 A means of satisfying, gratification, delight; नाठ्यं भिन्नरुचेर्जनस्य<BR> बहुधाप्येकं समाराधनम् M. 1. 4.<BR>—2 Attendance, service; सम्राट् समाराधनतत्परोऽभूत् R. 2. 5, 18. 11.<BR>—3 Gratification, propitiation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारुह्
समारुह् €1 P.<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To ascend or mount on; ride.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To ascend, rise.<BR>—2 To undertake, engage in. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to rise or mount, raise, lift up.<BR>—2 To string (as a bow).<BR>—3 To plant.<BR>—4 To ascribe, attribute.<BR>—5 To hand or deliver over to.<BR>—6 To display, exhibit, show forth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारूढ
समारूढ<BR>—1 Mounted.<BR>—2 Fallen upon.<BR>—3 One who has agreed upon; चक्रवृद्धिं समारूढो देशकालव्यवस्थितः Ms. 8. 156.<BR>—4 Grown, increased.<BR>—5 Healed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारोपः|समारोप
समारोपः<BR>—1 Stringing (a bow).<BR>—2 Transference.<BR>—3 Attribution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारोपणम्
समारोपणम्<BR>—1 Depositing, placing in or upon.<BR>—2 Delivering over, consigning.<BR>—3 Stringing (a bow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारोपित
समारोपित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Caused to mount or ascend.<BR>—2 Strung (as a bow); भवता चापे समारोपिते K. P. 10.<BR>—3 Deposited, planted, lodged.<BR>—4 Consigned, delivered over.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समारोपितकार्मुक, समारोपितभार, समारोपितविक्रम<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारोपितकार्मुक
समारोपित + -कार्मुक <i>a.</i> one who has strung a bow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारोपितभार
समारोपित + -भार <i>a.</i> one on whom a burden has been placed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारोपितविक्रम
समारोपित + -विक्रम <i>a.</i> one who has displayed valour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारोहः|समारोह
समारोहः<BR>—1 Ascending, mounting.<BR>—2 Riding upon.<BR>—3 Agreeing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समारोहणम्
समारोहणम्<BR>—1 Growing (of the hair).<BR>—2 Ascent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समार्ष
समार्ष <i>a.</i> Belonging to the same Pravara; वर्जयेद्वपङ्गिनीं<BR> नारीं तथा कन्यां नरोत्तम । समार्षां व्यङ्गितां चैव तथैव च पतिव्रताम् ॥<BR> Mb. 13. 104. 131.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालभ्
समालभ् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To take hold of, seize.<BR>—2 To anoint, smear over.<BR>—3 To handle, touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालब्ध
समालब्ध <i>p. p.</i> Come into contact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालभनम्
समालभनम् Unguent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालम्भः|समालम्भ|समालंभ|समालंभः
समालम्भः, समालम्भनम्<BR>—1 Taking hold of, seizing.<BR>—2 Seizing a victim for sacrifice.<BR>—3 Smearing the body with unguents or coloured cosmetics; गोरोचनासमालम्भो<BR> वचाहस्तश्च यो भवेत् Mb. 13. 131. 8; मङ्गलसमालम्भनं विरचयावः Ś. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालम्भनम्
समालम्भः, समालम्भनम्<BR>—1 Taking hold of, seizing.<BR>—2 Seizing a victim for sacrifice.<BR>—3 Smearing the body with unguents or coloured cosmetics; गोरोचनासमालम्भो<BR> वचाहस्तश्च यो भवेत् Mb. 13. 131. 8; मङ्गलसमालम्भनं विरचयावः Ś. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालम्ब्|समालंब्
समालम्ब् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To lay or catch hold of, seize; स्वरूपमास्थाय च तां कृतस्मितः<BR> समाललम्बे वृषराजकेतनः Ku. 5. 84.<BR>—2 To rest or depend on, be supported by; to cling or adhere to.<BR>—3 To devote or give oneself up to.<BR>—4 To assume, maintain.<BR>—5 To settle down or a bide in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालम्बनम्
समालम्बनम् Resting on, clinging to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालम्बिन्|समालंबिन्
समालम्बिन् <i>a.</i> Clinging to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालम्बिनी
समालम्बिन् + .{@-नी@} A kind of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालापः|समालाप
समालापः Conversation, talking with; समालापेन यो युङ्क्ते स गच्छति<BR> पराभवम् Pt. 1. 388.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाली
समाली <i>f.</i> A collection or bed of flowers, nosegay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाल्य
समाल्य <i>a.</i> Garlanded, crowned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालोकनम्
समालोकनम्<BR>—1 Contemplation.<BR>—2 Inspection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समालोचः|समालोच
समालोचः Colloquy, conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावस्
समावस् €1 P.<BR>—1 To dwell, live.<BR>—2 To lodge, encamp, halt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावासः|समावास
समावासः<BR>—1 A residence, habitation, dwelling place.<BR>—2 Halting-place, encampment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावासित
समावासित <i>p. p.</i> Encamped.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समावासितकटक<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावासितकटक
समावासित + -कटक <i>a.</i> one who has encamped or pitched a camp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावायः|समावाय
समावायः<BR>—1 Association, connection.<BR>—2 Inseparable connection; see समवाय.<BR>—3 Aggregation.<BR>—4 A multitude, number, heap.<BR>—5 Conjunction (of heavenly bodies).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाविद्ध
समाविद्ध <i>p. p.</i> Shaken, agitated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाविश्
समाविश् €6 P.<BR>—1 To enter; लङ्कां समाविशद्रात्रौ वदमानोऽरिदुर्गमाम् Bk. 8. 27.<BR>—2 To go to, approach.<BR>—3 To be devoted to, be intent on; तांस्तान् धर्मविधींस्तत्र भ्रातरस्ते<BR> समाविशन् Rām. 7. 10. 2.<BR>—4 To pervade, occupy, fill.<BR>—5 To sit down, settle down.<BR>—6 To overcome. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to enter in, insert.<BR>—2 To contain, comprise, hold.<BR>—3 To place or fix in or upon.<BR>—4 To entrust, assign; यस्मिन् कृत्यं समावेश्य निर्विशङ्केन चेतसा Pt. 1. 85.<BR>—5 To conduct, lead into.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाविष्ट
समाविष्ट <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Entered thoroughly, completely occupied, pervaded.<BR>—2 Seized, overcome, engrossed.<BR>—3 Possessed by an evil spirit.<BR>—4 Endowed with.<BR>—5 Settled, fixed, seated.<BR>—6 Well-instructed.<BR>—7 Filled with; कौतूहलसमाविष्टाः सर्व एव समागताः Rām. 7. 96. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावेशः|समावेश
समावेशः<BR>—1 Entering or abiding together.<BR>—2 Meeting, association.<BR>—3 Inclusion, comprehension.<BR>—4 Penetration.<BR>—5 Possession by an evil spirit.<BR>—6 Passion, emotion.<BR>—7 (In gram.) Common applicability of a term.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावेशनम्
समावेशनम् Consummation of marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावृ
समावृ €5 U.<BR>—1 To cover all over or completly.<BR>—2 To surround, envelop.<BR>—3 To conceal, hide.<BR>—4 To shut, close.<BR>—5 To obstruct, hinder; ततः शर्यातिसैन्यस्य शकृन्मूत्रे समावृणोत्<BR> Mb. 3. 122. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावृत|समावृतः
समावृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Encompassed, surrounded, enclosed, beset.<BR>—2 Screened, veiled.<BR>—3 Hidden, concealed.<BR>—4 Protected; तस्मादद्यैव सहिताः सर्वेऽन्योन्यसमावृताः Rām. 7. 6. 44.<BR>—5 Shut out, excluded.<BR>—6 Stopped; समावृतव्रतं तं तु विसृष्टं गुरुणा तदा Mb. 1. 77. 1.<BR>—7 See समावृत्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावृत्
समावृत् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To approach.<BR>—2 To return (as a Brāhmaṇa after completing his ब्रह्मचर्यव्रत<BR> or course of religious studies).<BR>—3 To come together, assemble.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">Page1637-1</a>]<BR>—4 To turn out well, succeed.<BR>—5 To come to an end, be completed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1636-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावर्तनम्
समावर्तनम्<BR>—1 Return.<BR>—2 Especially, a pupilʼs return home after finishing his course of holy study.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावृत्त|समावृत्तः
समावृत्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Completed, finished.<BR>—2 Returned,<BR>—3 See उपनीत; स उपाध्यायेनानुज्ञातः समावृत्तस्तस्माद्गुरुकुलवासाद्<BR> गृहाश्रमं प्रत्यपद्यत Mb. 1. 3. 81 (com. समावृत्तो मेखलाजिनादि<BR> ब्रह्मचर्याश्रमलिङ्गं त्यक्त्वा स्नातकत्वं प्राप्तः)<BR>—4 Assembled; ततस्तेषु हरीन्द्रेषु समावृत्तेषु सर्वशः Mb. 3. 283. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावृत्तः|समावृत्त
समावृत्तः, -समावृत्तकः<BR> A pupil who has returned home after finishing his<BR> course of holy study.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावृत्तकः|समावृत्तक
समावृत्तः, -समावृत्तकः<BR> A pupil who has returned home after finishing his<BR> course of holy study.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समावृत्तिः|समावृत्ति
समावृत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Return.<BR>—2 Completion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाश्रि
समाश्रि €1 U.<BR>—1 To go to for protection, fly for refuge.<BR>—2 To suffer, experience, or enjoy; लोकेऽथवा तनुभृतां निजकर्मपाकं<BR> नित्यं समाश्रितवतां सुहितक्रियाणाम् Pt. 1. 372.<BR>—3 To observe, practise, follow.<BR>—4 To rest or depend on.<BR>—5 To confide in.<BR>—6 To attain to, obtain, assume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाश्रयः|समाश्रय
समाश्रयः<BR>—1 Seeking protection or shelter.<BR>—2 Refuge, shelter, protection.<BR>—3 A place of refuge, asylum, resting or dwelling place.<BR>—4 Dwelling, residence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाश्रयणम्
समाश्रयणम् Choosing, selecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाश्रित|समाश्रितः
समाश्रित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Assembled.<BR>—2 Taking refuge.<BR>—3 Dependent on.<BR>—4 Relating to.<BR>—5 Furnished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाश्रितः|समाश्रित
समाश्रित + .{@-तः@} A servant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाश्लेषः|समाश्लेष
समाश्लेषः A close embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाश्वस्
समाश्वस् €2 P.<BR>—1 To take courage, take heart, calm or compose oneself; समाश्वसिमि<BR> केनाहं कथं प्राणिमि दुर्गतः । लोकत्रयपतिर्म्राता यस्य मे स्वपिति<BR> क्षितौ ॥ Bk. 18. 10.<BR>—2 To regain confidence.<BR>—3 To believe in. ━<i>Caus.</i> To console, encourage, cheer up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाश्वस्त
समाश्वस्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Comforted, consoled.<BR>—2 Trusting, confiding; नित्यं तस्मिन् समाश्वस्तः सर्वकार्याणि निःक्षिपेत् Ms. 7. 59.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाश्वासः|समाश्वास
समाश्वासः<BR>—1 Recovering breath, breathing a sigh of relief.<BR>—2 Relief, encouragement, consolation.<BR>—3 Trust, confidence, belief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाश्वासनम्
समाश्वासनम्<BR>—1 Reviving, encouraging, comforting.<BR>—2 Consolation; V. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासः|समास
समासः<BR>—1 Aggregation, union, composition.<BR>—2 Composition of words, a compound; (the principal kinds of compounds<BR> are four:− द्वन्द्व, तत्पुरुष, बहुव्रीहि, and अव्ययीभाव qq. vv.).<BR>—3 Reconciliation, composition of differences.<BR>—4 A collection, an assemblage; यद्वविज्ञातमिवाभूदित्येतासामेव देवतानां<BR> समासः Ch. Up. 6. 4. 7.<BR>—5 Whole, totality.<BR>—6 Contraction, conciseness, brevity; एष समासः । सर्वथा प्रवेष्टव्यं<BR> कुन्तिभोजस्य कन्यापुरम् Avimārakam 2; एष समासः, अद्यास्मि महासेनः Pratijñā. 2.<BR>—7 Euphonic<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">Page1637-2</a>]<BR> combination (संधि).<BR>—8 Completion, end; L. D. B. (समासेन, समासतः means ‘in short’,<BR> ‘briefly’, ‘succinctly’; एषा धर्मस्य वो योनिः समासेन प्रकीर्तिता<BR> Ms. 2. 25, 3. 20; इति क्षेत्रं तथा ज्ञानं ज्ञेयं चोक्तं समासतः<BR> Bg. 13. 18; समासतः श्रूयताम् V. 2.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समासाध्याहारः, समासार्था, समासोक्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासाध्याहारः|समासाध्याहार
समासः + -अध्याहारः supplying an ellipsis in a compound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासार्था
समासः + -अर्था a part of a stanza proposed to be completed (= समस्या q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासोक्तिः|समासोक्ति
समासः + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i> a figure of speech thus defined by Mammaṭa:− परोक्तिर्भेदकैः<BR> श्लिष्टैः समासोक्तिः K. P. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासनम्
समासनम् Sitting together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समास्या
समास्या<BR>—1 Session.<BR>—2 Interview.<BR>—3 Sitting together; अनसूयासमास्यां च Rām. 1. 3. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासञ्ज्|समासंज्
समासञ्ज् €1 P.<BR>—1 To join, attach or fix to; प्रसह्य चेतःसु समासजन्तम् Ki. 3. 2.<BR>—2 To fix or place on, impose upon; मयि सर्वं समासज्य कुटुम्बं भरतर्षभाः<BR> Mb. 2. 233. 54.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासक्त|समासक्तः
समासक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Attached to; fixed or placed in.<BR>—2 United, combined.<BR>—3 Reached, attained.<BR>—4 Affected by.<BR>—5 Stopped (in its effect, as poison).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासक्तिः|समासक्ति
समासक्तिः <i>f.</i>, समासंगः<BR>—1 Union, adhering together, attachment.<BR>—2 Comprehension, inclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासंगः|समासङ्ग
समासक्तिः <i>f.</i>, समासंगः<BR>—1 Union, adhering together, attachment.<BR>—2 Comprehension, inclusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासञ्जनम्
समासञ्जनम्<BR>—1 Joining, uniting.<BR>—2 Fixing or placing on.<BR>—3 Contact, combination, connection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासर्जनम्
समासर्जनम्<BR>—1 Abandoning complely.<BR>—2 Consigning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासद्
समासद् €10 U.<BR>—1 To get, obtain, find, meet with.<BR>—2 To overtake; वीराः समासदन् वीरान् कुर्वन्तो भैरवं रवम् Mb. 7. 31. 9; V. 1.<BR>—3 To assail, attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासत्तिः|समासत्ति
समासत्तिः Nearness, vicinity; P. III. 4. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासन्न|समासन्नं
समासन्न <i>a.</i> Near, close.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समासादनम्
समासादनम्<BR>—1 Approaching.<BR>—2 Finding, meeting with, obtaining.<BR>—3 Accomplishing, effecting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहृ
समाहृ €1 P.<BR>—1 To bring, convey, carry; सर्व एव समाहारि तदा शैलः सहौषधिः Bk. 15. 107.<BR>—2 To collect, bring together, convene; तत्र स्वयंवरसमाहृतराजलोकम्<BR> R. 5. 64; Bk. 8. 63.<BR>—3 To draw, attract.<BR>—4 To destroy, annihilate; लोकान् समाहर्तुमिह प्रवृत्तः Bg. 11. 32.<BR>—5 To complete (as a sacrifice).<BR>—6 To return, restore to oneʼs proper place; स दण्डं प्राप्नुयान्माषं<BR> तच्च तस्मिन् समाहरेत् Ms. 8. 319.<BR>—7 To curb, restrain.<BR>—8 To offer.<BR>—9 To contract, abridge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहर
समाहर <i>a.</i> Destroying; कालः सर्वसमाहरः Rām. 7. 104. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहरणम्
समाहरणम् Uniting, collecting, combining, accumulating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहर्तृ
समाहर्तृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 One who is accustomed to collect or get together.<BR>—2 A collector (as of taxes); Kau. A. 1. 12, 2. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1637-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहारः|समाहार
समाहारः<BR>—1 A collection, an aggregate, assemblage; Māl. 9; ततः कपिसमाहारमेकनिश्चायमागतम् Bk. 7. 34.<BR>—2 Composition of words.<BR>—3 Conjunction of words or sentences.<BR>—4 A subdivision of <i>Dvandva</i> and <i>Dvigu</i> compounds expressing an<BR> aggregate (as त्रिभुवनम्).<BR>—5 Abridgment, contraction, conciseness.<BR>—6 Combination of two letters of the alphabet into a syllable (= प्रत्याहार q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहृत|समाहृतः
समाहृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Brought together, collected, accumulated.<BR>—2 Abundant, excessive, much.<BR>—3 Received, accepted, taken.<BR>—4 Abridged, curtailed.<BR>—5 Drawn (as a bow-string).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहृतिः|समाहृति
समाहृतिः <i>f.</i> Compilation, abridgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहृत्य
समाहृत्य <i>ind.</i> All at once.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहित|समाहितः
समाहित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Brought together, assembled.<BR>—2 Adjusted, settled.<BR>—3 Composed, collected, calm (as mind).<BR>—4 Intent on, absorbed in, concentrated.<BR>—5 Finished.<BR>—6 Agreed upon.<BR>—7 Arranged, disposed; जापकानां विशिष्टं तु प्रत्युत्थानं समाहितम्<BR> Mb. 12. 200. 27.<BR>—8 Inferred.<BR>—9 Accomplished, finished; कण्ठस्थितेन पठितेन समाहितेन (स्तोत्रेण)<BR> Śivamahimna 39.<BR>—10 Deposited, entrusted; समाहितं हि मे श्वश्र्वा हृदये यत् स्थिरं<BR> मम Rām. 2. 118. 7; see समाधा also.<BR>—11 Equable, temperate; मृदुसूर्याः सुनीहाराः पटुशीताः समाहिताः (दिवसाः)<BR> Rām. 3. 16. 11.<BR>—12 Like, resembling; देशान्तरगता ये च द्विजा धर्मसमाहिताः Rām. 7. 91. 13.<BR>—13 Despatched; तत्ते मनीषितं वाक्यं येन वासि समाहितः Rām. 7. 103. 16.<BR>—14 Harmonious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहितः|समाहित
समाहित + .{@-तः@} A holy man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाहितम्
समाहित + .{@-तम्@} Intentness, intent devotion (to any object).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाह्वे
समाह्वे €1 P.<BR>—1 To call together, convoke.<BR>—2 To challenge, provoke to battle.<BR>—3 To invite.<BR>—4 To call, name.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाह्वः|समाह्व
समाह्वः Challenge, defiance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाह्वयः|समाह्वय
समाह्वयः<BR>—1 Calling out, challenging.<BR>—2 War, battle.<BR>—3 A single combat.<BR>—4 Setting animals to fight for sport, betting with living creatures;<BR> एष एव विधिर्ज्ञेयः प्राणिद्यूते समाह्वये Y. 2. 203; Ms. 9. 221.<BR>—5 A name, an appellation; तस्मात्ते वर्तयिष्यामि तयोरेव समाह्वयम्<BR> Mb. 14. 21. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाह्वा
समाह्वा<BR>—1 A name, an appellation; रथचरणसमाह्वस्तावदौत्सुक्यनुन्ना Śi. 11. 26.<BR>—2 The गोजिह्वा plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाह्वातृ
समाह्वातृ <i>m.</i> One who summons or challenges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समाह्वानम्
समाह्वानम्<BR>—1 Calling together, convocation.<BR>—2 Challenge.<BR>—3 Betting on the battles of animals.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समि
समि €2 P.<BR>—1 To come or meet together, be united or joined with.<BR>—2 To go or come to, arrive at, approach, reach, visit, attain.<BR>—3 To encounter, meet in a hostile manner.<BR>—4 To cohabit, have sexual intercourse.<BR>—5 To enter upon, commence.<BR>—6 To agree with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समित्
समित् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 War, battle; समिति पतिनिपाताकर्णन &c. N. 12. 75.<BR>—2 Association; L. D. B.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समित्सज्ज<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समित्सज्ज
समित् + -सज्ज <i>a.</i> ready for war.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समित
समित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Come together, met.<BR>—2 Collected, assembled.<BR>—3 Connected, united with; इदं हि वैदैः समितं पवित्रमपि चोत्तमम्<BR> Mb. 1. 62. 16, 14. 88. 27.<BR>—4 Contiguous.<BR>—5 Parallel.<BR>—6 Promised, agreed to.<BR>—7 Completed, finished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समितिः|समिति
समितिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Meeting, union, association; स्वधर्मे चानुतिष्ठेत गुणानां समितिर्हि<BR> सा Bhāg. 11. 25. 8.<BR>—2 An assembly.<BR>—3 Flock, herd; द्युतिं समग्रां समितिर्गवामसौ Ki. 4. 32.<BR>—4 War, battle; आशंसन्ते समितिषु सुराः Ś. 2. 15 (v. l.); Ki. 3. 15;<BR> समितौ रभसादुपागतः Śi. 16. 13.<BR>—5 Likeness, equality.<BR>—6 Moderation.<BR>—7 (With Jainas) Rule of conduct.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समितिमर्दन, समितिशालिन्, समितिशोभन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समितिमर्दन
समितिः + -मर्दन <i>a.</i> harassing in battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समितिशालिन्
समितिः + -शालिन् brave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समितिशोभन
समितिः + -शोभन <i>a.</i> conspicuous in battle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समितिंजय
समितिंजय <i>a.</i> Victorious in battle; भवान् भीष्मश्च कर्णश्च<BR> कृपश्च समितिजयः Bg. 1. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समिथः|समिथ
समिथः<BR>—1 War, battle.<BR>—2 Fire.<BR>—3 An offering, oblation.<BR>—4 Union; Uṇ. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समिकम्
समिकम् A javelin, dart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समिता
