समिन्ध्|समिंध्
समिन्ध् €7 Ā.<BR>—1 To kindle, light up, ignite.<BR>—2 To excite, inflame, kindle (anger &c.)<BR>—3 To glorify.<BR>—4 To exhibit (skill). ━<i>Pass.</i> To catch or take fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समिद्ध|समिद्धः
