समिधः|समिध
समिधः<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 Fuel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समिन्धनम्
समिन्धनम्<BR>—1 Kindling.<BR>—2 Fuel; संधुक्ष्यतां नोऽरिसमिन्धनेषु Bk. 2. 28.<BR>—3 A means of swelling; Mb. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

