समीकृ
समीकृ €8 U.<BR>—1 To make even or equal.<BR>—2 To equalize, level.<BR>—3 To put on the same level or on equal terms with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1638-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीकरणम्
समीकरणम्, -क्रिया<BR>—1 Equalizing, levelling; Kull. on Ms. 7. 184.<BR>—2 Assimilation.<BR>—3 An equation.<BR>—4 (In arith.) Reduction of fractions to a common denominator.<BR>—5 (समीकरणम्) A roller (to level a sown field).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीक्रिया
समीकरणम्, -क्रिया<BR>—1 Equalizing, levelling; Kull. on Ms. 7. 184.<BR>—2 Assimilation.<BR>—3 An equation.<BR>—4 (In arith.) Reduction of fractions to a common denominator.<BR>—5 (समीकरणम्) A roller (to level a sown field).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

