समीयते
समीयते Den. Ā. To be treated equally or in the same manner or<BR> with equal respect, be placed on a level with, be placed on a footing of<BR> equality; असमैः समीयमानः (अर्थपतिं त्यजति भृत्यः) Pt. 1. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीक्ष्
समीक्ष् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To see, behold.<BR>—2 To think of, consider, take into account; तेजसां हि न वयः समीक्ष्यते<BR> R. 11. 1; Ku. 5. 16.<BR>—3 to examine carefully; as in असमीक्ष्यकारिन्.<BR>—4 To look about for, search for.<BR>—5 To investigate, examine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीक्षः|समीक्ष|समीक्षं
समीक्षः<BR>—1 Deliberation, mature reflection.<BR>—2 Full knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीक्षम्
समीक्षः + .{@-क्षम्@}<BR>—1 Complete investigation.<BR>—2 The Sāṃkhya system of philosophy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीक्षा
समीक्षा<BR>—1 Investigation, search.<BR>—2 Consideration.<BR>—3 Close or thorough inspection.<BR>—4 Understanding, intellect.<BR>—5 Essential nature of truth.<BR>—6 An essential principle.<BR>—7 The Mimāṃsā system of philosophy.<BR>—8 Effort.<BR>—9 The Sāṃkhya system of philosophy; ‘सांख्यं समीक्ष्यम्’ इति त्रिकाण्डः;<BR> फलभाजि समीक्ष्योक्ते Śi. 2. 59; also समीक्ष्यम्<BR>—10 Complete or thorough investigation.<BR>—11 Desire to see; मनसा तानि गच्छेत सर्वतीर्थसमीक्षया Mb. 3. 85. 105.<BR>—12 Spiritual knowledge (आत्मविद्या); एवं समीक्षा निपुणा सती मे<BR> हन्यात्तमिस्रं पुरुषस्य बुद्धेः Bhāg. 11. 28. 34.<BR>—13 A glance; आशृण्वतो मामनुरागहाससमीक्षया विश्रमयन्नुवाच Bhāg. 3. 4. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीक्षणम्
समीक्षणम् Search, close investigation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीक्षित
समीक्षित <i>p. p.</i> Well looked, considered; एतदेव हि कार्पण्यं<BR> समग्रमसमीक्षितम् Mb. 12. 152. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीक्ष्यकारिन्
