समीपम्
समीप + .{@-पम्@} Proximity, vicinity (समीपम्, समीपतस् and समीपे<BR> are used adverbially in the sense of ‘near, before, in the presence of’);<BR> अतः समीपे परिणेतुरिष्यते Ś. 5. 17.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समीपवर्तिन्, समीपस्थ, समीपसप्तमी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

