समीर्
समीर् <i>caus.</i><BR>—1 To shake, move, agitate, stir up, set in motion.<BR>—2 To excite, rouse.<BR>—3<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To send forth, emit.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To speak, utter; पुराणस्य कवेस्तस्य चतुर्मुखसमीरिता Ku. 2. 17.<BR>—4 To cast, throw, toss.<BR>—5 To raise or lift up.<BR>—6 To accomplish, bring about.<BR>—7 To bestow on, endow with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीरः|समीर
समीरः<BR>—1 Air, wind; धीरसमीरे यमुनातीरे Gīt. 5.<BR>—2 The Śamī tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समीरलक्ष्मन्, समीरसारः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समीरलक्ष्मन्
