समीह्
समीह् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To wish, desire.<BR>—2 To strive to do or perform, strive for; प्रियाणि वाञ्छन्त्यसुभिः समीहितुम् Ki. 1. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

