समीहित
समीहित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Longed for, desired, wished.<BR>—2 Undertaken; स त्वं समीहितमदः स्थितिजन्मनाशम् Bhāg. 8. 12. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1639-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

