समुज्जृम्भ्|समुज्जृंभ्
समुज्जृम्भ् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To yawn, gape.<BR>—2 To extend, spread out.<BR>—3 To appear, rise, become visible.<BR>—4 To attempt, strive, endeavour; व्यालं बालमृणालतन्तुभिरसौ रोध्दुं<BR> समुज्जृम्भते Bh. 2. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

