समुत्कट
समुत्कट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 High, elevated.<BR>—2 Excessive; Dk. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्कर्षः|समुत्कर्ष
