समुत्क्रमः|समुत्क्रम
समुत्क्रमः<BR>—1 Rising upwards, ascent.<BR>—2 Transgression of proper bounds.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्क्रोशः|समुत्क्रोश
समुत्क्रोशः<BR>—1 Crying aloud.<BR>—2 A loud uproar.<BR>—3 An osprey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्क्षेपः|समुत्क्षेप
