समुत्पिञ्ज, -समुत्पिञ्जल <i>a.</i><BR> Excessively confused or bewildered, disorganized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पिञ्जल|समुत्पिंजल|समुत्पिञ्जलः
