समुत्पिञ्ज, -समुत्पिञ्जल + .{@-जः, -लः, -लकः@}<BR>—1 An army in great disorder; यथा सूर्योदये राजन् समुत्पिञ्जोऽभवन्महान्<BR> Mb. 7. 186. 58.<BR>—2 Great confusion; ततः सर्वस्य रङ्गस्य समुत्पिञ्जलकोऽभवत् Mb. 1. 135. 10<BR> (com. gives another meaning as उत्फुल्लता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पिञ्जलः|समुत्पिञ्जल|समुत्पिंजल
समुत्पिञ्ज, -समुत्पिञ्जल + .{@-जः, -लः, -लकः@}<BR>—1 An army in great disorder; यथा सूर्योदये राजन् समुत्पिञ्जोऽभवन्महान्<BR> Mb. 7. 186. 58.<BR>—2 Great confusion; ततः सर्वस्य रङ्गस्य समुत्पिञ्जलकोऽभवत् Mb. 1. 135. 10<BR> (com. gives another meaning as उत्फुल्लता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पिञ्जलकः|समुत्पिञ्जलक
समुत्पिञ्ज, -समुत्पिञ्जल + .{@-जः, -लः, -लकः@}<BR>—1 An army in great disorder; यथा सूर्योदये राजन् समुत्पिञ्जोऽभवन्महान्<BR> Mb. 7. 186. 58.<BR>—2 Great confusion; ततः सर्वस्य रङ्गस्य समुत्पिञ्जलकोऽभवत् Mb. 1. 135. 10<BR> (com. gives another meaning as उत्फुल्लता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्पुंसनम्
समुत्पुंसनम् Removing, destroying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्सवः|समुत्सव
समुत्सवः A great festival.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्सर्गः|समुत्सर्ग
समुत्सर्गः<BR>—1 Abandoning, leaving.<BR>—2 Shedding or casting forth, giving away.<BR>—3 Discharge of feces,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">Page1641-1</a>]<BR> voiding of excrement; मूत्रोच्चारसमुत्सर्गं दिवा कुर्यादुदङ्मुखः Ms. 4. 50.<BR>—4 Emission (of semen).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1640-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्सर्पणम्
समुत्सर्पणम् Proceeding, being accomplished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्सारणम्
समुत्सारणम्<BR>—1 Driving away.<BR>—2 Pursuing, hunting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्साहः|समुत्साह
समुत्साहः Energy, force of will.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्सुक|समुत्सुकः
समुत्सुक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Very uneasy or anxious, impatient; विरौषि समुत्सुकः V. 4. 20;<BR> R. 1. 33; Ku. 5. 76.<BR>—2 Longing or eager for, fond of.<BR>—3 Sorrowful, regretting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुत्सेधः|समुत्सेध
समुत्सेधः<BR>—1 Height, elevation.<BR>—2 Fatness, thickness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदक्त|समुदक्तं
समुदक्त <i>p. p.</i> Raised or drawn up (as water from a well).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदयः|समुदय|समुदयं
समुदयः<BR>—1 Ascent, rising up (of the sun).<BR>—2 Rise (in general).<BR>—3 A collection, multitude, number, heap; सामर्थ्यानामिव समुदयः संचयो<BR> वा गुणानाम् U. 6. 9.<BR>—4 Combination.<BR>—5 The whole.<BR>—6 Revenue; Ms. 7. 56 (com. समुदयन्त्युत्पद्यन्तेऽस्मादर्था इति समुदयः).<BR>—7 Effort, exertion.<BR>—8 War, battle; महासमुदयं चक्रे शरैः सन्नतपर्वभिः Mb. 6. 116. 45.<BR>—9 Day.<BR>—10 The rear of an army.<BR>—11 Finance, account; सर्व राज्ञः समुदयमायं च व्ययमेव च । एकाऽहं<BR> वेद्मि कल्याणि पाण्डवानां यशस्विनि ॥ Mb. 2. 233. 53.<BR>—11 A producing cause; आश्रमेषु चतुर्ष्वाहुर्दममेवोत्तमं व्रतम् । तस्य<BR> लिङ्गं प्रवक्ष्यामि येषां समुदयो दमः ॥ Mb. 5. 63. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदयम्
समुदयः + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 The rising of a planet &c.<BR>—2 An auspicious moment (लग्न).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदागमः|समुदागम
समुदागमः Full knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदाचारः|समुदाचार
समुदाचारः<BR>—1 Proper practice or usage.<BR>—2 Proper mode of address; etiquette; salutation; Buddh.; Ś. 5; चक्रिरे<BR> समुदाचारं पद्मकोशनिभैः करैः Bu. C. 4. 2.<BR>—3 Purpose, intention, design.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदानयः|समुदानय
समुदानयः Bringing together; महानयं कृष्ण कृतः क्षत्रस्य<BR> समुदानयः Mb. 5. 141. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदायः|समुदाय
समुदायः<BR>—1 A collection, multitude &c.<BR>—2 A word of more than one syllable; see समुदय.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समुदायानुसमयः, समुदायप्रसिद्धिः, समुदायशब्दः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदायानुसमयः
समुदायः + -अनुसमयः doing a group of details as a composite whole with<BR> reference to one thing, then with another and so on, (see अनुसमय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदायप्रसिद्धिः
समुदायः + -प्रसिद्धिः denotation of an expression or word as a whole; न<BR> चावयवप्रसिद्ध्या समुदायप्रसिद्धिर्बाध्यते इत्युक्तम् ŚB. on MS. 6. 8. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदायशब्दः
समुदायः + -शब्दः a collective expression; नायमेकान्तः यत् समुदायशब्देन<BR> संयोज्योच्यते तत् समुदितानामेव भवतीति ŚB. on MS. 11. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदाहरणम्
समुदाहरणम्<BR>—1 Declaring, pronouncing.<BR>—2 Illustration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदाहारः|समुदाहार
समुदाहारः Conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदि
समुदि €2 P.<BR>—1 To go up, ascend, rise.<BR>—2 To prepare for battle.<BR>—3 To collect together, assemble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदित|समुदितः
समुदित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Gone up, risen, ascended.<BR>—2 Lofty, elevated; prospered; कञ्चित् समुदितां स्फीतामयोध्यां परिरक्षसे<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">Page1641-2</a>]<BR> Rām. 2. 100. 42.<BR>—3 Produced, arisen, occasioned.<BR>—4 Assembled, collected, united; मद्भाग्योपचयादयं समुदितः सर्वो<BR> गुणानां गणः Ratn. 1. 6.<BR>—5 Possessed of, furnished with; सर्वैः समुदितो गुणैः Rām. 1. 18. 13.<BR>—6 Conversed.<BR>—7 Spoken to, addressed.<BR>—8 Agreed upon.<BR>—9 Customary, usual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदीर्
समुदीर् <i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To utter, pronounce.<BR>—2 To rouse, agitate, excite, stimulate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदीरणम्
समुदीरणम्<BR>—1 Uttering, speaking, pronouncing.<BR>—2 Repeating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुदीर्ण
समुदीर्ण <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Greatly excited; (fig.) very luminous; शारदः समुदीर्णांशुश्चन्द्रस्तेज<BR> इवात्मजम् Rām. 2. 19. 37.<BR>—2 Increased; Mb. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्गम्
समुद्गम् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To rise, ascend.<BR>—2 To rise together.<BR>—3 To come forth, issue, exude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्ग|समुद्गः
समुद्ग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Rising, ascending.<BR>—2 Completely pervading.<BR>—3 Having a covering or lid.<BR>—4 Having beans.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्गः|समुद्ग
समुद्ग + .{@-द्गः@}<BR>—1 A covered box or casket; शुक्लांश्चन्दनकल्कांश्च समुद्गेष्ववतिष्टतः<BR> Rām. 2. 91. 75; चित्तादर्शं निधातुं महितमिव सतां ते समुद्गायमाने ।<BR> वृत्ताकारे विधत्तां हृदि मुदमजितस्यानिशं जानुनी नः ॥ Viṣṇupāda. S. 19.<BR>—2 A round form of a temple.<BR>—3 A kind of artificial stanza; Kāv. 3. 54-56; see समुद्गक below.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: समुद्गयमकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्गयमकम्
समुद्ग + -यमकम् (in Rhet.) making an artificial arrangement of words<BR> in such a manner as to make different parts of a stanza correspond in sound<BR> though they differ in meaning; see यमक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्गकः|समुद्गक
समुद्गकः<BR>—1 A covered box or casket; तेन च कुपितेन हृतं तच्चर्मरत्नमाभरणसमुद्गकश्च<BR> तस्याः Dk. 2. 2, 2. 3; Ś. 4.<BR>—2 A kind of artificial stanza, the two halves of which exactly correspond<BR> in sound, though different in meaning; <i>e. g.</i> स्यन्दना नो चतुरगाः<BR> सुरेभा वाविपत्तयः । स्यन्दना नो च तुरगाः सुरेभावा विपत्तयः ॥ Ki. 15. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्गमः|समुद्गम
समुद्गमः<BR>—1 Rising, ascent.<BR>—2 Arising, issuing.<BR>—3 Birth, production.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्गिरणम्
समुद्गिरणम्<BR>—1 Vomiting, ejecting.<BR>—2 That which is vomited.<BR>—3 Raising, lifting up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्गीतम्
समुद्गीतम् A loud song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्दण्ड
समुद्दण्ड <i>a.</i> Uplifted (as an arm); (fig.) fierce, terrible;<BR> रिपुगणकटकजलनिधिमथनमन्दरायमाणसमुद्दण्डभुजदण्डः Dk. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्देशः|समुद्देश
समुद्देशः<BR>—1 Fully pointing out.<BR>—2 Full description.<BR>—3 Particularising, enumeration; तस्यायं प्रकरणाधिकरणसमुद्देशः Kau. A. 1.<BR>—4 Doctrine; इति गुह्यसमुद्देशस्तव नारद कीर्तितः Mb. 12. 334. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्धत|समुद्धतः
समुद्धत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Upraised, uplifted, elevated.<BR>—2 Excited, drawn up.<BR>—3 Puffed up with pride, proud, arrogant; ततस्तपोवीर्यसमुद्धतस्य<BR> पारं यियासोः समरार्णवस्य Ki. 17. 35.<BR>—4 Ill-mannered, ill-behaved.<BR>—5 Impudent, rude.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">Page1642-1</a>]<BR>—6 Intense, violent; अशक्ता धारणे देव तेजस्तव समुद्धतम् Rām. 1. 37. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1641-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्धृ
समुद्धृ €1 U.<BR>—1 To raise or lift up.<BR>—2 To save, extricate, deliver, rescue.<BR>—3 To extract, take or draw out.<BR>—4 To pull up by the roots, root out, extirpate.<BR>—5 To extol, praise, honour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्धरणम्
समुद्धरणम्<BR>—1 Upraising, lifting up.<BR>—2 Picking up.<BR>—3 Drawing or lifting out.<BR>—4 Extrication, deliverance.<BR>—5 Eradication, extirpation.<BR>—6 Taking out from (a share).<BR>—7 Food thrown up or vomited.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्धर्तृ|समुद्धर्त्तृ
समुद्धर्तृ <i>m.</i> A deliverer, redeemer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्धृत|समुद्धृतं
समुद्धृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Lifted up.<BR>—2 Delivered, saved, rescued.<BR>—3 Vomited.<BR>—4 Removed.<BR>—5 Set apart, divided.<BR>—6 Seized; possessed.<BR>—7 Ill-behaved, rude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्भवः|समुद्भव
समुद्भवः<BR>—1 Origin, production; अनुजीवी स्वजातिभ्यो गुणेभ्यश्च समुद्भवः Mb. 12. 59. 69.<BR>—2 Revival.<BR>—3 N. of Agni at the व्रतादेश.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्भेदः|समुद्भेद
समुद्भेदः<BR>—1 Appearance.<BR>—2 Development, growth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्यत
समुद्यत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Raised, lifted up; सोऽहं कथमिमं भारं महाधुर्यसमुद्यतम्<BR> Rām. 2. 73. 16.<BR>—2 Offered, presented.<BR>—3 Ready, prepared; अक्षौहिण्यो हि तत्रासन् राघवार्थे समुद्यताः Rām. 7. 39. 2.<BR>—4 Accomplished; यस्य प्रसादसुमुखेन समुद्यतेयम् Māl. 7. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्यमः|समुद्यम
समुद्यमः<BR>—1 Lifting up.<BR>—2 Great effort or exertion; कैर्मया सह योद्धव्यमस्मिन्रणसमुद्यमे<BR> Bg. 1. 22; समुद्यमः कार्यः &c.<BR>—3 An undertaking, commencement.<BR>—4 An onset.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्योगः|समुद्योग
समुद्योगः<BR>—1 Active exertion, energy.<BR>—2 Employment; use.<BR>—3 Concurrence (of many causes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्र|समुद्रः
समुद्र <i>a.</i> Sealed, bearing a seal, stamped; समुद्रो लेखः;<BR> समुद्रे नाप्नुयात् किंचिद्यदि तस्मान्न संहरेत् Ms. 8. 188.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्रः|समुद्र
समुद्र + .{@-द्रः@}<BR>—1 The sea, ocean.<BR>—2 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—3 The number ‘four’.<BR>—4 N. of an immensely high number; शतं खर्वसहस्राणां समुद्रमभिधीयते ।<BR> शतं समुद्रसाहस्रं महौघमिति विश्रुतम् ॥ Rām. 6. 28. 37.<BR>—5 A particular configuration of stars and planets.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

