समुद्वह्
समुद्वह् €1 P.<BR>—1 To raise or lift up.<BR>—2 To bear or carry out.<BR>—3 To bear, carry.<BR>—4 To display, exhibit.<BR>—5 To marry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्वहः|समुद्वह
समुद्वहः<BR>—1 Bearing up.<BR>—2 Moving up and down.<BR>—3 One who lifts up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्वाहः|समुद्वाह
समुद्वाहः<BR>—1 Bearing up.<BR>—2 Marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्वाहित
समुद्वाहित <i>p. p.</i> Bearing up, lifted; नद्यः समुद्वाहितचक्रवाकाः<BR> Rām. 4. 28. 39.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1642-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समुद्वेगः|समुद्वेग
