समुन्नी
समुन्नी €1 U.<BR>—1 To raise completely up, elevate.<BR>—2 To bring out, deduce.<BR>—3 To discharge, pay off (as a debt &c.); ‘ऋणमस्मिन् समुन्नयत्यमृतत्वं च गच्छति । पिता पुत्रस्य जातस्य पश्येच्चेज्जीवतो मुखम् ॥’ इति श्रुतिः Kull. on Ms. 9. 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1643-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

