संपाक|सम्पाक|संपाकः|सम्पाकः
संपाक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Reasoning well, a reasoner.<BR>—2 Cunning, subtle.<BR>—3 Lustful, lewd.<BR>—4 Small, little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपाकः|सम्पाक|संपाक|सम्पाकः
