संपाटः|सम्पाट|संपाट|सम्पाटः
संपाटः<BR>—1 Intersection (as of a prolonged side of a triangle by a perpendicular).<BR>—2 A spindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपिण्डित|सम्पिण्डित|संपिंडित
