संपिष्|सम्पिष्
संपिष् €7 P.<BR>—1 To pound to pieces, bruise, crush.<BR>—2 To destroy, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपेषणम्
