संपीड्|सम्पीड्
संपीड् €10 U.<BR>—1 To compress, press or squeeze together.<BR>—2 To torture, harass, oppress, pinch, pain; कण्ठे जीर्णलताप्रतानवलयेनात्यर्थसंपीडितः<BR> Ś. 7. 11; C. P. 3.<BR>—3 To compute, reckon.<BR>—4 To obscure, eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

