संपीडनम्
संपीडनम्<BR>—1 Squeezing, pressing together.<BR>—2 Sending.<BR>—3 Punishment, castigation.<BR>—4 Stirring up, agitating.<BR>—5 Paining, torturing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपीतिः|सम्पीति|संपीति|सम्पीतिः
संपीतिः <i>f.</i> Drinking together, compotation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपुटः|सम्पुट|संपुट|सम्पुटः
संपुटः<BR>—1 A cavity; स्वात्यां सागरशुक्तिसंपुटगतं (पयः) सन्मौक्तिकं<BR> जायते Bh. 2. 67 v. l.; Kāv. 2. 288; Mv. 1. 54; Ṛs. 1. 21.<BR>—2 A casket, covered box.<BR>—3 A hemispherical bowl.<BR>—4 The space between two bowls; Bhāva P.<BR>—5 A hemisphere.<BR>—6 A kind of coitus.<BR>—7 Credit, balance.<BR>—8 The Kurabaka flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपुटका
संपुटका, -संपुटिका<BR>—1 A box, casket; यस्य संपुटिका नास्ति कुतस्तस्य सुभाषितम् (a collection<BR> or collected verses); Pt. 2. 165.<BR>—2 A variety of blanket; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR>—3 A wrapper, envelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपुटिका
संपुटका, -संपुटिका<BR>—1 A box, casket; यस्य संपुटिका नास्ति कुतस्तस्य सुभाषितम् (a collection<BR> or collected verses); Pt. 2. 165.<BR>—2 A variety of blanket; Kau. A. 2. 11.<BR>—3 A wrapper, envelope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपुटीकरणम्
संपुटीकरणम् the furnishing with a cover or lid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूज्|सम्पूज्
संपूज् €10 U.<BR>—1 To worship, revere, honour.<BR>—2 To present or honour with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूजन|सम्पूजन|संपूजनं
संपूजन <i>a.</i> Praising, honouring; (कथाः) आत्मसंपूजनीः<BR> शृण्वन् ययौ रामो महापथम् Rām. 2. 17. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूजनम्
संपूजनम्<BR>—1 Honouring, reverence; मन्त्रसंपूजनार्थं तु सत्कारमितरोऽर्हति Ms. 3. 137.<BR>—2 Presenting with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूर्ण|सम्पूर्ण|सम्पूर्णं|सम्पूर्णः
संपूर्ण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Filled &c.<BR>—2 All, whole; see पूर्ण.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संपूर्णकाम, संपूर्णकालीन, संपूर्णफलभाज्, संपूर्णमूर्च्छा, सम्पूर्णः, संपूर्णसम्पूर्णम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूर्णकाम|सम्पूर्णकाम
संपूर्ण + -काम <i>a.</i> filled with desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूर्णकालीन|सम्पूर्णकालीन
संपूर्ण + -कालीन <i>a.</i> occurring at the right time.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूर्णफलभाज्|सम्पूर्णफलभाज्
संपूर्ण + -फलभाज् <i>a.</i> obtaining a full reward; आचारेण तु संयुक्तः<BR> संपूर्णफलभाग्भवेत् Ms. 1. 109.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूर्णमूर्च्छा
संपूर्ण + -मूर्च्छा a particular mode of fighting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्पूर्णः|सम्पूर्ण|संपूर्ण|सम्पूर्णं
संपूर्ण + सम्पूर्णः A mode of music in which all the notes of the gamut are used.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूर्णसम्पूर्णम्
संपूर्ण + -सम्पूर्णम् Ether.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपूर्तिः|सम्पूर्ति|संपूर्ति
संपूर्तिः Fulfilment, completion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपृच्|सम्पृच्
संपृच् €7 P., €2 Ā.<BR>—1 To mix, bring in contact, with, join, unite; स्यन्दनौ समपृच्येतामुभयोर्दीप्तवाजिनौ Bk. 17. 106.<BR>—2 To be united or mixed together, be in contact.<BR>—3 To fill up, complete.<BR>—4 To present with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपर्कः|सम्पर्क|संपर्क|सम्पर्कं|सम्पर्कः
संपर्कः<BR>—1 Mixture.<BR>—2 Union, contact, touch; पादेन नापैक्षत सुंदरीणां संपर्कमाशिञ्जितनूपुरेण<BR> Ku. 3. 26; Me. 25; V. 1. 12.<BR>—3 Society, association, company; न मूर्खजनसंपर्कः सुरेन्द्रभवनेष्वपि Bh. 2. 14.<BR>—4 Sexual union, copulation.<BR>—5 Addition, sum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संपृक्त|सम्पृक्त|सम्पृक्तः
संपृक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Blended, mixed.<BR>—2 Connected together, related, in close relation; वागर्थाविव संपृक्तौ R. 1. 1.<BR>—3 Touching.<BR>—4 Interspersed, inlaid.<BR>—5 Befriended; एवमेकान्तसंपृक्तौ ततस्तौ नरवानरौ । उभावन्योन्यसदृशौ<BR> सुखं दुःखमभाषताम् ॥ Rām. 4. 7. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रक्षालनम्
संप्रक्षालनम्<BR>—1 Complete ablution.<BR>—2 Bathing.<BR>—3 Inundation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रज्ञातः|सम्प्रज्ञात
संप्रज्ञातः A kind of yogic meditation or samādhi in which the<BR> object of meditation remains distinct, though the mind is absorbed in its<BR> contemplation; as opposed to the असंप्रज्ञात variety in which the<BR> distinction between knowledge and its object is completely obliterated;<BR> (ध्येयध्यातृभावयुक्तसाकारध्यानसमाधिः संप्रज्ञातः संवित्संवेद्यविलोपेन<BR> निराकारस्वप्रकाशपरमानन्दलक्षणात्मसाम्राज्यध्यानसमाधिरसंप्रज्ञातः इति<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">Page1646-1</a>]<BR> योगशास्त्रम्); इत्युदीर्य स हरिं प्रति संप्रज्ञातवासिततमः समपादि N. 21. 119.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1645-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रणीत|सम्प्रणीत
संप्रणीत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Brought together.<BR>—2 Composed (as poetry).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रणेतृ|सम्प्रणेतृ
संप्रणेतृ <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A ruler, judge.<BR>—2 A leader, chief (of an army).<BR>—3 (With दण्डस्य) An inflicter of punishment; तस्याहुः संप्रणेतारं<BR> राजानं सत्यवादिनम् Ms. 7. 26.<BR>—4 A maintainer, sustainer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतापनम्
संप्रतापनम्<BR>—1 Heating, burning.<BR>—2 Afflicting, torturing, tormenting.<BR>—3 N. of a hell; Ms. 4. 89.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रति|सम्प्रति|सम्प्रतिः
संप्रति <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Now, at present, at this time; अयि संप्रति देहि दर्शनम् Ku. 4. 28.<BR>—2 Rightly, exactly.<BR>—3 Immediately, at once; संप्रत्यगस्त्याश्रमस्य पन्थानं ब्रूहि U. 2. 5/6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतिपद्|सम्प्रतिपद्
संप्रतिपद् €4 Ā.<BR>—1 To go towards, approach.<BR>—2 To deem, consider, regard; न मां परं संप्रतिपत्तुमर्हसि Ku. 5. 39.<BR>—3 To assent to, agree upon, concur in.<BR>—4 To admit, acknowledge.<BR>—5 To attain to, reach.<BR>—6 To obtain, receive.<BR>—7 To regain, recover.<BR>—8 To perform, accomplish. ━<i>Caus.</i> To grant, bestow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतिपत्तिः|सम्प्रतिपत्ति|संप्रतिपत्ति|सम्प्रतिपत्तिः
संप्रतिपत्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Approach, arrival.<BR>—2 Presence.<BR>—3 Gain, obtaining, acquiring.<BR>—4 An agreement.<BR>—5 Admission, confession; तस्मात् संप्रतिपत्तिरेव हि वरं न ग्राम्यमत्रोत्तरम् Mu. 5. 18.<BR>—6 Admission of a fact, a particular kind of reply in law.<BR>—7 Assault, attack.<BR>—8 Occurrence.<BR>—9 Co-operation.<BR>—10 Doing, performing.<BR>—11 Presence of mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतिपन्न|सम्प्रतिपन्न
संप्रतिपन्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Approached, arrived.<BR>—2 Agreed, assented to.<BR>—3 Performed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतिपादनम्
संप्रतिपादनम्<BR>—1 Delivering over.<BR>—2 Granting, giving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतिरोधकः|सम्प्रतिरोधक|संप्रतिरोधक|संप्रतिरोधकं|सम्प्रतिरोधकं
संप्रतिरोधकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Complete obstruction.<BR>—2 Confinement, imprisonment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतिरोधकम्
संप्रतिरोधकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Complete obstruction.<BR>—2 Confinement, imprisonment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतिभासः|सम्प्रतिभास|संप्रतिभास
संप्रतिभासः Perception which tends to combine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतिष्ठा|सम्प्रतिष्ठा
संप्रतिष्ठा<BR>—1 Perseverance.<BR>—2 Continuance.<BR>—3 High rank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रती|सम्प्रती
संप्रती €2 P.<BR>—1 To trust in, believe firmly in.<BR>—2 To decide, settle, determine; judge; किं तत् कथं वेत्युपलब्धसंज्ञा<BR> विकल्पयन्तोऽपि न संप्रतीयुः Bk. 11. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतीत|सम्प्रतीत
संप्रतीत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Returned.<BR>—2 Fully convinced, firmly believing; इदं श्रेयः परमं मन्यमाना<BR> व्यायच्छन्ते मुनयः संप्रतीताः Mb. 3. 186. 26.<BR>—3 Proved, admitted.<BR>—4 Renowned.<BR>—5 Respectful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतीतिः|सम्प्रतीति|संप्रतीति|सम्प्रतीतिः
संप्रतीतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Full ascertainment.<BR>—2 Compliance.<BR>—3 Fame, celebrity, notoriety; वीर्यावदानेषु कृतावमर्षस्तन्वन्नभूतामिव<BR> संप्रतीतिम् Ki. 3. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रत्ययः|सम्प्रत्यय|संप्रत्यय
संप्रत्ययः<BR>—1 Firm conviction.<BR>—2 Agreement; त्रयाणामेकवाक्ये संप्रत्ययः Kau. A. 1. 12; एतस्मिन्नेव<BR> काले तु यथासंप्रत्ययं कविः Mb. 1. 149. 1.<BR>—3 Notion, idea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रतीक्षा|सम्प्रतीक्षा
संप्रतीक्षा Expectation; hope.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रदा|सम्प्रदा
संप्रदा €1 P., €3 U.<BR>—1 To give, grant, bestow or confer on; तं तेऽहं संप्रदास्यामि.<BR>—2 To hand down by tradition; see संप्रदाय.<BR>—3 To bequeath.<BR>—4 To give completely up or deliver over.<BR>—5 To give in marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रत्तिः|सम्प्रत्ति|संप्रत्ति
संप्रत्तिः <i>f.</i> Giving completely up, delivering over; अथातः<BR> संप्रत्तिर्यदा प्रैष्यन् मन्यते Bṛ. Up. 1. 5. 17.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संप्रत्तिकर्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रत्तिकर्मन्|सम्प्रत्तिकर्मन्
संप्रत्तिः + -कर्मन् the act of delivering over.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रदानम्
संप्रदानम्<BR>—1 Giving or handing over completely.<BR>—2 Bestowal, gift, donation; दीयतां संप्रदानं च परिष्यज्य च वानरान्<BR> Rām. 4. 11. 34.<BR>—3 Giving in marriage.<BR>—4 The sense expressed by the dative case; कर्मणा यमभिप्रैति स संप्रदानम् P. I. 4. 32.<BR>—5 The recipient of a gift; स्तुत्यस्तु कल्पविटपी फलसंप्रदानं कुर्वन्<BR> स एष विवुधान् N. 11. 125.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रदानीयम्
संप्रदानीयम् A gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रदायः|सम्प्रदाय|संप्रदाय|सम्प्रदायः
संप्रदायः<BR>—1 Tradition, traditional doctrine or knowledge, traditional handing down<BR> of instruction; चन्द्रकेतुरवाप्तदिव्यास्त्रसंप्रदायः U. 2. 7/8; अथ<BR> तत् संप्रदायेन रामभद्रे स्थिता अपि 5. 15.<BR>—2 A peculiar system of religious teaching, a religious doctrine inculcating<BR> the worship of one peculiar deity.<BR>—3 An established custom, usage.<BR>—4 Gift (संप्रदान); दिव्यास्त्रसंप्रदायोऽयं लक्ष्मणेन सहास्तु<BR> मे Mv. 1. 47. (Also cf. U. 2. 7/8.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संप्रदायप्रद्योतकः, संप्रदायविगमः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रदायप्रद्योतकः|सम्प्रदायप्रद्योतक
संप्रदायः + -प्रद्योतकः a revealer of the tradition of the Veda.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रदायविगमः|सम्प्रदायविगम
संप्रदायः + -विगमः loss of tradition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रधानम्
संप्रधानम् Ascertainment, consideration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1646-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्रधृ|सम्प्रधृ
