संप्लु €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To fluctuate, float about; दृष्टे जने प्रेयसि दुःसहानि स्रोतःसहस्रैरिव<BR> संप्लवन्ते U. 4. 8.<BR>—2 To flow together, meet (as waters); यावानर्य उदपाने सर्वतः संप्लुतोदके<BR> Bg. 2. 46. ━<i>Caus.</i> To inundate, flood over, submerge, deluge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्लवः|सम्प्लव|संप्लव
संप्लवः<BR>—1 Submersion, inundation.<BR>—2 Surge.<BR>—3 Flood; संपूर्णं योजनशतं क्षिप्तः सागरसंप्लवे Rām. 1. 30. 18;<BR> रूपं च जगृहे मात्स्यं चाक्षुषोदधिसंप्लवे Bhāg. 1. 3. 15.<BR>—4 Falling into ruin; नूनमेता न पश्यन्ति कस्यचिद्रोगसंप्लवम् Bu. C. 4. 57;<BR> विदधे निदाध इव सत्त्वसंप्लवः Ki. 12. 51.<BR>—5 Subversion.<BR>—6 Misarrangement; Kau. A. 2. 10.<BR>—7 Heap, multitude; शारदाभ्रैरिवाकीर्णं गगनं हंससंप्लवैः Rām. 1. 43. 23.<BR>—8 Falling down, shower; विद्युत्स्तनितवर्षेषु महोल्कानां च संप्लवे Ms. 4. 103.<BR>—9 Tumult; चित्रकर्म इवाभाति सर्वेषां रणसंप्लवः Rām. 7. 28. 41.<BR>—10 End, close of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संप्लुतिः
संप्लुतिः <i>f.</i> Jumping up on an elephant from behind; Mātaṅga L. 12. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संफालः|सम्फाल|संफाल|सम्फालः
संफालः A ram, sheep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संफुल्ल|सम्फुल्ल|सम्फुल्लः
संफुल्ल <i>a.</i> Full-blown, blossomed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संफेटः|सम्फेट|संफेट
संफेटः An angry or tumultuous conflict, an incident describing<BR> the mutual encounter of angry persons; see S. D. 379, 420; <i>e. g.</i> the<BR> encounter between माधव and अघोरघण्ट in Māl. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संब्|सम्ब्
संब् I. €1 P. (संबति) To go, move. ━II. €10 U. (संबयतिते)<BR> To collect, accumulate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबम्
संबम्<BR>—1 The second ploughing of a field; (संबाकृ to plough twice); see<BR> शंब also.<BR>—2 Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबन्ध्|सम्बन्ध्|संबंध्
संबन्ध् €9 P.<BR>—1 To bind or tie together, unite, join, connect, attach.<BR>—2 To make, construct, form. ━<i>Pass.</i><BR>—1 To be connected with, go with, belong to.<BR>—2 To be furnished or supplied with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबद्ध|सम्बद्ध|सम्बद्धः
संबद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Bound or fastened together.<BR>—2 Attached to.<BR>—3 Connected with, related to, belonging to.<BR>—4 Endowed with.<BR>—5 Connected in sense.<BR>—6 Closed, shut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबद्धम्
संबद्ध + .{@-द्धम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Jointly; जगुश्चाप्सरसो राज्ञः यशः संबद्धमेव च Mb. 9. 61. 56.<BR>—2 Moreover.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संबद्धदर्प<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबद्धदर्प|सम्बद्धदर्प
संबद्ध + -दर्प <i>a.</i> one who has feelings of pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबन्ध|सम्बन्ध|संबंध|संबन्धः|सम्बन्धः
संबन्ध <i>a.</i> Able, capable.<BR>—2 Fit, proper, right.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबन्धः|सम्बन्ध|संबन्ध|संबंध|सम्बन्धः
संबन्ध + .{@-न्धः@}<BR>—1 Connection, union, association.<BR>—2 Relation, relationship.<BR>—3 Relation, as the meaning of the genitive case.<BR>—4 Matrimonial alliance; विक्रियायै न कल्पन्ते संबन्धाः सदनुष्ठिताः<BR> Ku. 6. 29, 30; जनकानां रधूणां च संबन्धः कस्य न प्रियः U. 1. 17.<BR>—5 Friendly connection, friendship; संबन्धमाभाषणपूर्वमाहुः R. 2. 58.<BR>—6 Fitness, propriety.<BR>—7 Prosperity, success.<BR>—8 A relation, kinsman.<BR>—9 A collection, volume, book.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबन्धक|सम्बन्धक|संबंधक|संबन्धकः
संबन्धक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Relating, concerning.<BR>—2 Fit, suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबन्धकः|सम्बन्धक|संबन्धक|संबंधक
संबन्धक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A friend.<BR>—2 A relation by birth or marriage; संबन्धकेन राजेन्द्र तौ तु वीर्यबलान्वयात्<BR> Mb. 5. 170. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबन्धकम्
संबन्धक + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Relation, connection; सख्यं संबन्धकं चैव तदा तं प्रत्यपूजयत्<BR> Rām. 1. 11. 18.<BR>—2 A kind of peace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबन्धिन्|सम्बन्धिन्|संबंधिन्
संबन्धिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Relating or belonging to.<BR>—2 Connected with, serving as an adjunct, inherent.<BR>—3 Possessing good qualities. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A relation by marriage; एष वः श्लाघ्यसंबन्धी जनकानां कुलोद्वहः U. 4. 9.<BR>—2 A relation, kinsman (in general); संबन्धिनो वसिष्टादीनेष तातस्तवार्चति<BR> U. 1. 16; R. 2. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबन्धिशब्दः|सम्बन्धिशब्द|संबन्धिशब्द
संबन्धिन् + .{@-शब्दः@} an expression which gains its currency owing to the relationship<BR> existing between two persons or things; पत्नीति संबन्धिशब्दोऽयम्<BR> ŚB. on MS. 6. 1. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबरः|सम्बर|संबर|सम्बरं|सम्बरः
संबरः<BR>—1 A dam, bridge.<BR>—2 A kind of deer.<BR>—3 N. of a demon slain by Pradyumna; see शंबर and प्रद्युम्न.<BR>—4 N. of a mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबरम्
संबरः + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 Restraint.<BR>—2 Water.<BR>—3 A kind of religious observance (with the Buddhists).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संबरारिः, संबररिपुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबरारिः|सम्बरारि
संबरः + -अरिः, -रिपुः Cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबररिपुः
संबरः + -अरिः, -रिपुः Cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबलः|सम्बल|संबल|संबलं
संबलः, -लम्<BR> Provision for a journey, viaticum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबलम्
संबलः, -लम्<BR> Provision for a journey, viaticum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबलम्
संबलः, -लम् + .{@-लम्@} Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबाध्|सम्बाध्
संबाध् €1 Ā.<BR>—1 To press heavily, to oppress, afflict, torment; injure, hurt.<BR>—2 To compress, contract.<BR>—3 To block up, throng, crowd.<BR>—4 To bind firmly together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबाध|सम्बाध|संबाधः|सम्बाधः
संबाध <i>a.</i> Thronged or crowded with, blocked up, narrow; निगाढे<BR> युधि संबाधे वेत्स्यसे मां जनार्दन Mb. 5. 76. 14; संबाधं बृहदपि<BR> तद्बभूव वर्त्म Śi. 8. 2; व्योम्नि संबाधवर्त्मभिः R. 12. 67; अनेकसिद्धसाध्यसंबाधम् K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबाधः|सम्बाध|संबाध|सम्बाधः
संबाध + .{@-धः@}<BR>—1 Being thronged with.<BR>—2 Pressing on, striking, hurting; स्तनसंबाधमुरो जघान च Ku. 4. 26.<BR>—3 Obstruction, difficulty, danger, impediment; मा गाश्चिरायैकचरः<BR> प्रमादं वसन्नसंबाधशिवेऽपि देशे Ki. 3. 53.<BR>—4 The road to hell.<BR>—5 Fear, dread.<BR>—6 The vulva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबाधक|सम्बाधक
संबाधक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Pressing together, contracting.<BR>—2 Thronging, crowding.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबाधनम्
संबाधनम्<BR>—1 Blocking up, obstructing.<BR>—2 Compressing.<BR>—3 A barrier, gate.<BR>—4 The vulva.<BR>—5 The point of a stake.<BR>—6 A door-keeper (<i>m.</i> ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबाधना|सम्बाधना
संबाधनम् + .{@-ना@} Rubbing, chafing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबुध्|सम्बुध्
संबुध् €1 U., €4 Ā.<BR>—1 To know, understand, learn; become aware of; संभुत्सीष्टाः सुनयनयनैर्विद्विषामीहितानि Bk. 19. 30.<BR>—2 To perceive, observe, notice.<BR>—3 To wake up, rise from sleep. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To inform, acquaint with, give information about; तवागतिज्ञं समबोधयन्<BR> माम् R. 13. 25.<BR>—2 To address, call out to.<BR>—3 To instruct.<BR>—4 To admonish, advise.<BR>—5 To wake up, rouse.<BR>—6 To explain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबुद्ध|सम्बुद्ध|संबुद्धः|सम्बुद्धः
संबुद्ध <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Well-understood.<BR>—2 Very wise or prudent.<BR>—3 Wide awake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबुद्धः|सम्बुद्ध|संबुद्ध|सम्बुद्धः
संबुद्ध + .{@-द्धः@} A Buddha or Jaina deified saint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1648-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबुद्धिः|सम्बुद्धि|संबुद्धि|सम्बुद्धिः
संबुद्धिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Perfect knowledge or perception; ततः पश्यन्त्यसंबुध्या वातपित्तकफोत्तरान्<BR> Mb. 12. 216. 11.<BR>—2 Full consciousness.<BR>—3 Calling to, addressing.<BR>—4 (In gram.) The vocative case; एङ् ह्रस्वात् संबुद्धेः P. VI. 1. 69.<BR>—5 An epithet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबोधः|सम्बोध|संबोध|सम्बोधः
संबोधः<BR>—1 Explaining, instructing, informing.<BR>—2 Full or correct perception.<BR>—3 Sending, throwing.<BR>—4 Loss, destruction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबोधनम्
संबोधनम्<BR>—1 Explaining.<BR>—2 Addressing.<BR>—3 The vocative case.<BR>—4 An epithet (used in calling a person); भूमौ स्थिता रमण नाथ मनोहरेति<BR> संबोधनैर्यमधिरोपितवत्यसि द्याम् Bv. 3. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संबृंहणम्
संबृंहणम् Strengthening, refreshing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभक्षः|सम्भक्ष|संभक्ष
संभक्षः<BR>—1 Eating together, feeding upon (also <i>a.</i>).<BR>—2 Food in common.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभज्|सम्भज्
संभज् €1 U.<BR>—1 To divide, distribute, allot, apportion.<BR>—2 To possess, enjoy.<BR>—3 To bestow, grant.<BR>—4 To favour, serve, help.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभक्त|सम्भक्त
संभक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Divided, shared.<BR>—2 Possessing, enjoying.<BR>—3 Faithful or attached to, devoted to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभक्तिः|सम्भक्ति|संभक्ति
संभक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Sharing in, possessing.<BR>—2 Distributing.<BR>—3 Favouring, honouring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभग्न|सम्भग्न|संभग्नः
संभग्न <i>p. p.</i> Shattered, dispersed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभग्नः|सम्भग्न|संभग्न
संभग्न + .{@-ग्नः@} An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभली|सम्भली
संभली A procuress; see शंभली.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभव्यः|सम्भव्य|संभव्य|सम्भव्यः
संभव्यः The wood-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभालयति
संभालयति Den. To hear; विज्ञप्तिमन्तःसभयः स भैम्या मध्येसभं<BR> वासवसम्भलीयां (संभालयामास) N. 6. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभाष्|सम्भाष्
संभाष् €1 Ā.<BR>—1<BR>——(<i>a</i>) To speak together, converse; असंभाष्ये साक्षिभिश्च देशे संभाषते<BR> मिथः Ms. 8. 55.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) To say or speak in general.<BR>—2 To speak to, address.<BR>—3 To greet, salute.<BR>—4 To agree together, consent. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To converse with.<BR>—2 To persuade, prevail upon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभाषः|सम्भाष
संभाषः Conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभाषा|सम्भाषा
संभाषा, संभाषणम्<BR>—1 Discourse, conversation; प्रतिश्रवणसंभाषे शयानो न समाचेरत्<BR> Ms. 2. 195, 8. 354.<BR>—2 Greeting.<BR>—3 Criminal connection.<BR>—4 An agreement, a contract.<BR>—5 A watch-word, war-cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभाषणम्
संभाषा, संभाषणम्<BR>—1 Discourse, conversation; प्रतिश्रवणसंभाषे शयानो न समाचेरत्<BR> Ms. 2. 195, 8. 354.<BR>—2 Greeting.<BR>—3 Criminal connection.<BR>—4 An agreement, a contract.<BR>—5 A watch-word, war-cry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभाषित|सम्भाषित
संभाषित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Addressed.<BR>—2 Said, spoken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभाषितम्
संभाषित + .{@-तम्@} Conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभिद्|सम्भिद्
संभिद् €7 U.<BR>—1 To break or tear asunder, break to pieces.<BR>—2 To mingle, meet, combine, mix, join, bring together; अन्योन्नसंभिन्नदृशां<BR> सखीनाम् Māl. 1. 33; Bk. 7. 5.<BR>—3 To contract, compress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभिन्न|सम्भिन्न|संभिन्नः|सम्भिन्नः
संभिन्न <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Completely broken.<BR>—2 Shattered, shaken, agitated; संभिन्नैरिभतुरगावगाहनेन Ki. 7. 11.<BR>—3 Combined or united with; यस्तु संभिन्नवृत्तः स्याद्वीतशोकभयो नरः<BR> Mb. 12. 26. 21; संभिन्नामविरलपातिभिर्मयूखैः Ki. 7. 23.<BR>—4 Fully blown or opened; करैरिन्दोरन्तश्छुरित इव संभिन्नमुकुलः Ve. 1. 1.<BR>—5 Close, tight.<BR>—6 Solid, compact.<BR>—7 Revolted, treacherous; बलं यस्य तु संभिन्नं मनागपि जयः कुतः<BR> Śukra. 4. 1016.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभिन्नः|सम्भिन्न|संभिन्न|सम्भिन्नः
संभिन्न + .{@-न्नः@} An epithet of Śiva.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संभिन्नप्रलापः, संभिन्नवृत्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभिन्नप्रलापः|सम्भिन्नप्रलाप|संभिन्नप्रलाप
संभिन्न + -प्रलापः idle talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभिन्नवृत्त|सम्भिन्नवृत्त
संभिन्न + -वृत्त <i>a.</i> one who has abandoned good conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभेदः|सम्भेद|संभेद|सम्भेदः
संभेदः<BR>—1 Breaking, splitting; becoming loose, falling off; एष सेतुविधरण<BR> एषां लोकानामसंभेदाय Bṛ. Up. 4. 4. 22.<BR>—2 Union, mixture, combination; आलोकतिमिरसंभेदः Māl. 10. 11;<BR> हर्षोद्वेगसंभेद उपनतः Māl. 8.<BR>—3 Meeting (as of glances).<BR>—4 Confluence, junction (of two rivers); नूनं प्राप्ताः स्म संभेदं<BR> गङ्गायमुनयोर्वयम् Rām. 2. 54. 6; तदुत्तिष्ठ पारासिन्धुसंभेदमवगाह्य<BR> नगरीमेव प्रविशावः; अयमसौ महानद्योः संभेदः Māl. 4; मधुमतीसिन्धुसंभेदपावनः 9; Ms. 8. 356.<BR>—5 Blossoming, opening.<BR>—6 Uniformity.<BR>—7 Clenching (the fist); मुष्टेरसंभेद इवापवर्गे Ki. 16. 20.<BR>—8 Revolt, treachery; रिपोः प्रजानां संभेदपीडनं स्वजयाय वै Śukra. 4. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभुज्|सम्भुज्
संभुज् €7 U.<BR>—1 To eat.<BR>—2 To enjoy.<BR>—3 To enjoy carnally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभुक्त|सम्भुक्त
संभुक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Eaten.<BR>—2 Well enjoyed.<BR>—3 Made use of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभोगः|सम्भोग|संभोग|सम्भोगः
संभोगः<BR>—1 Enjoyment (in general), pleasure, delight; सत्संभोगफलाः श्रियः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 Possession, use, occupation; संभोगो दृश्यते यत्र न दृश्येतागमः<BR> क्वचित् Ms. 8. 200.<BR>—3 Carnal enjoyment, sexual union, copulation; संभोगान्ते मम समुचितो<BR> हस्तसंवाहनानाम् Me. 98.<BR>—4 A lecher, catamite.<BR>—5 A sub-division of the sentiment of love; see under शृङ्गार.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संभोगवेश्मन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभोगवेश्मन्|सम्भोगवेश्मन्
संभोगः + -वेश्मन् the chamber of a concubine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभोगिन्|सम्भोगिन्
संभोगिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sensual.<BR>—2 Employing, using. ━<i>m.</i> A sensualist, libertine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभोजः|सम्भोज
संभोजः Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभोजकः|सम्भोजक|संभोजक
संभोजकः An eater, a taster.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभोजनम्
संभोजनम् Eating in company, a dinner-party.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभोजनी|सम्भोजनी
संभोजनी<BR>—1 Eating together; संभोजनी साभिहिता पैशाची दक्षिणा द्विजैः Ms. 3. 141.<BR>—2 The gift (दक्षिणा) given at a dinner-party; संभोजनी नाम पिशाचदक्षिणा<BR> Mb. 13. 90. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभोजनीय|सम्भोजनीय
संभोजनीय <i>a.</i> One to be fed (a dependant, son etc.); संभोजनीयापदेशैर्जलानीव<BR> जलौकसः Bhāg. 10. 49. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभू|सम्भू
संभू €1 P.<BR>—1 To arise, to be born or produced, spring up; कथमपि भुवनेऽस्मिस्तादृशाः<BR> संभवन्ति Māl. 2. 9; धर्मसंस्थापनार्थाय संभवामि युगे युगे<BR> Bg. 4. 8; Ki. 5. 22; Bk. 6. 138; Ms. 8. 155.<BR>—2 To be, become, exist.<BR>—3 To happen, occur, take place.<BR>—4 To be possible.<BR>—5 To be adequate for, be competent for (with inf.); न यन्नियन्तुं<BR> समभावि भानुना<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-1" target="_blank">Page1650-1</a>]<BR> Śi. 1. 27.<BR>—6 To meet, be united or joined with; संभूयाम्भोधिमभ्येति महानद्या<BR> नगापगा Śi. 2. 100; संभूयेव सुखानि चेतसि Māl. 5. 9, 18.<BR>—7 To be consistent.<BR>—8 To have sexual intercourse with; तां समभवत्ततो मनुष्या अजायन्त<BR> Bṛ. Up. 1. 4. 3; महर्षिः संविदं कृत्वा संबभूव तया सह Mb. 1. 178. 44.<BR>—9 To be capable of existing in, be contained in.<BR>—10 To attain to.<BR>—11 To partake of. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To produce, effect, make.<BR>—2 To imagine, conceive, fancy, think.<BR>—3 To guess or conjecture; Ś. 2.<BR>—4 To consider, regard.<BR>—5 To honour, respect, esteem, show respect to; प्राप्तोऽसि संभावयितुं<BR> वनान्माम् R. 5. 11, 7. 8.<BR>—9 To honour or present with, treat with; अर्धोपभुक्तेन बिसेन जायां<BR> संभावयामास रथाङ्गनामा Ku. 3. 37.<BR>—7 To ascribe or impute to; पापं कर्म च यत् परैरपि कृतं तत्तस्य<BR> संभाव्यते Mk. 1. 36.<BR>—8 To come or go to, approach.<BR>—9 To take part in, enjoy; U. 4.<BR>—10 To greet, salute.<BR>—11 To manifest, exhibit. —12 To expect. ━<i>Pass.</i> of <i>Caus.</i> To<BR> be possible; कथमेतद्भवति संभाव्यते Ś. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1649-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभवः|सम्भव|संभव|सम्भवः
संभवः<BR>—1 Birth, production, springing up, arising, existence; प्रियस्य सुहृदो<BR> यत्र मम तत्रैव संभवो भूयात् Māl. 9; मानुषीषु कथं वा स्यादस्य<BR> रूपस्य संभवः Ś. 1. 26; अन्नाद्भवन्ति भूतानि पर्जन्यादन्नसंभवः<BR> Bg. 3. 14; oft. at the end of comp. in this sense; अप्सरःसंभवैषा Ś. 1.<BR>—2 Production and bringing up; यं मातापितरौ क्लेशं सहेते संभवे<BR> नृणाम् Ms. 2. 227; (see Kull. thereon).<BR>—3 Cause, origin, motive.<BR>—4 Mixing, union, combination.<BR>—5 Possibility; संयोगो हि वियोगस्य संसूचयति संभवम् Subhāṣ.<BR>—6 Compatibility, consistency.<BR>—7 Adaptation, appropriateness.<BR>—8 Agreement, conformity.<BR>—9 Capacity.<BR>—10 Equivalence (one of the Pramāṇas).<BR>—11 Acquaintance.<BR>—12 Loss, destruction.<BR>—13 (In rhet.) A possible case.<BR>—14 Cohabitation.<BR>—15 (pl.) Wealth, prosperity; स सर्वभयनिर्मुक्तः संभवानधितिष्ठति<BR> Mb. 13. 64. 11.<BR>—16 Knowledge (विद्या); अन्यदेवाहुः संभवादन्यदाहुरसंभवात् Īśop. 13.<BR>—17 Occurrence, appearance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभविष्णु|सम्भविष्णु
संभविष्णु <i>a.</i> Producer, creator; त्वं वै प्रजानां स्थिरजङ्गमानां<BR> प्रजापतीनामसि संभविष्णुः Bhāg. 8. 17. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभव्यः|सम्भव्य|संभव्य|सम्भव्यः
संभव्यः Feronia Elephantam (Mar. कबठ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभावनम्
संभावनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Considering, reflecting; सामन्तसंभावनयैव धीरः कैलासनाथं<BR> तरसा जिगीषुः R. 5. 28.<BR>—2 Fancying, supposition; संभावनमथोत्प्रेक्षा प्रकृतस्य समेन यत्<BR> K. P. 10; सुखसंभावनं कृत्वा धारयित्वा सुखं स्वयम् Mb. 12. 153. 92;<BR> भ्रमादुपेतान् वहदम्बुवाहान् संभावनां वा सफलीचकार Bu. C. 1. 3.<BR>—3 An idea, fancy, thought.<BR>—4 Respect, honour, esteem, regard; संभावनागुणमवेहि तमीश्वराणाम् Ś. 7. 4.<BR>—5 Possibility.<BR>—6 Fitness, adequancy; संभावनां भूतिमिवोद्धरिष्यन् Ki. 3. 39.<BR>—7 Competency, ability.<BR>—8 Doubt.<BR>—9 Affection, love.<BR>—10 Celebrity.<BR>—11 Obtaining, getting; क्षीरसंभावनार्थाय कृत्तिकाः समयोजयन् Rām. 1. 37. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभावना
संभावनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Considering, reflecting; सामन्तसंभावनयैव धीरः कैलासनाथं<BR> तरसा जिगीषुः R. 5. 28.<BR>—2 Fancying, supposition; संभावनमथोत्प्रेक्षा प्रकृतस्य समेन यत्<BR> K. P. 10; सुखसंभावनं कृत्वा धारयित्वा सुखं स्वयम् Mb. 12. 153. 92;<BR> भ्रमादुपेतान् वहदम्बुवाहान् संभावनां वा सफलीचकार Bu. C. 1. 3.<BR>—3 An idea, fancy, thought.<BR>—4 Respect, honour, esteem, regard; संभावनागुणमवेहि तमीश्वराणाम् Ś. 7. 4.<BR>—5 Possibility.<BR>—6 Fitness, adequancy; संभावनां भूतिमिवोद्धरिष्यन् Ki. 3. 39.<BR>—7 Competency, ability.<BR>—8 Doubt.<BR>—9 Affection, love.<BR>—10 Celebrity.<BR>—11 Obtaining, getting; क्षीरसंभावनार्थाय कृत्तिकाः समयोजयन् Rām. 1. 37. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभावित|सम्भावित|सम्भावितः
संभावित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Considered, supposed, imagined; पित्राहं दोषेषु संभावितः K.<BR>—2 Esteemed, honoured, respected; सन्त्यन्येऽपि बृहस्पतिप्रभृतयः संभाविताः<BR> पञ्चषाः Bh. 2. 34; Ku. 3. 11;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">Page1650-2</a>]<BR> विस्तारिस्तनकुम्भकुड्मलभरोत्संगेन संभाविता Māl. 8. 6.<BR>—3 Respectable, honourable; संभावितस्य चाकीर्तिमरणादतिरिच्यते Bg. 2. 34.<BR>—4 Suited, fitted, adequate, fit.<BR>—5 Possible.<BR>—6 Derived, produced, got; Māl. 5.<BR>—7 Satisfied.<BR>—8 Expected; अवसीदति यत्सुरैरपि त्वयि संभावितवृत्ति पौरुषम् Ki. 2. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभावितम्
संभावित + .{@-तम्@} Conjecture, supposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभाव्य|सम्भाव्य
संभाव्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Probable, likely, possible.<BR>—2 To be expected or deemed probable; संभाव्यसप्तभुवनाभयदानपुण्यसंभारमस्य<BR> वपुरत्र हि विस्फुरन्ति Mv. 2. 40.<BR>—3 Capable, suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभाव्यम्
संभाव्य + .{@-व्यम्@} Adequacy, fitness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभूत|सम्भूत|सम्भूतः
संभूत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Born, produced.<BR>—2 Formed or composed of.<BR>—3 Combined or united with.<BR>—4 Adequate, equal.<BR>—5 Provided with, possessed of; एकाङ्गेनापि संभूतः शत्रुर्दुर्गमुपाश्रितः<BR> Mb. 12. 58. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभूतिः|सम्भूति|संभूति
संभूतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Birth, origin, production; संभूतिं तस्य तां विद्याद्यद्योनावभिजायते Ms. 2. 147.<BR>—2 Combination, union.<BR>—3 Fitness, suitability.<BR>—4 Power.<BR>—5 Knowledge; see संभव (16); संभूतिं च विनाशं च यस्तद्वेदोभयं<BR> सह । विनाशेन मृत्युं तीर्त्वा संभूत्यामृतमश्नुते ॥ Īśop. 14, 12.<BR>—6 Manifestation of might, superhuman power (विभूति); गोविप्रदेवतावृद्धगुरून्<BR> भूतानि सर्वशः । नमस्कृत्यात्मसंभूतीर्मङ्गलानि समस्पृशत् ॥ Bhāg. 10. 70. 10.<BR>—7 A part, incarnation; इयं च लक्ष्म्याः संभूतिः पुरुषस्यानपायिनी<BR> Bhāg. 4. 15. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभूय|सम्भूय
संभूय <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Coming or meeting together.<BR>—2 Being united or combined, in company or concert.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संभूयकारिन्, संभूयगमनम्, संभूययानम्, संभूयसमुत्थानम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभूयकारिन्|सम्भूयकारिन्
संभूय + -कारिन् <i>a.</i> a coadjutor or colleague; संभूयकारीण्येतानीत्युक्तम्<BR> ŚB. on MS. 11. 1. 55; अङ्गानामपि हि संभूयकारित्वमुक्तम् ibid. 11. 1. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभूयगमनम्
संभूय + -गमनम्, -यानम् going in company.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभूययानम्
संभूय + -गमनम्, -यानम् going in company.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभूयसमुत्थानम्
संभूय + -समुत्थानम् partnership in trade; cooperative undertaking; Kau. A. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभृ|सम्भृ
संभृ €3 U.<BR>—1 To collect, hoard, place or bring together; त्यागाय संभृतार्थानाम्<BR> R. 1. 7, 5. 5, 8. 3; Bk. 6. 80.<BR>—2 To effect, produce, bring on, accomplish; सुरतश्रमसंभृतो मुखे<BR> (स्वेदलवः) R. 8. 51; Ki. 9. 49; संभृतश्रीः Me. 117.<BR>—3 To maintain, cherish, foster.<BR>—4 To make ready, prepare; तस्मिन् संभ्रियमाणे तु राघवस्याभिषेचने<BR> Rām. 5. 33. 19; संभृते शिखिनि गूढमादधुः R. 19. 54.<BR>—5 To give, offer, present.<BR>—6 To lift up; दक्षिणं दक्षिणः काले संभृत्य स्वभुजं तदा Mb. 6. 97. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभारः|सम्भार|संभार|सम्भारः
संभारः<BR>—1 Bringing together, collecting; पर्यायसेवामुत्सृज्य पुष्पसंभारतत्पराः Ku. 2. 36.<BR>—2 Preparation, provisions, necessaries, requisites, apparatus, things<BR> requisite for any act; बहूपकरणा यज्ञा नानासंभारविस्तराः Mb. 3. 82. 14;<BR> सविशेषमद्य पूजासंभारो मया संनिधापनीयः Māl. 5; R. 12. 4; V. 2.<BR>—3 An ingredient, a constituent part,<BR>—4 Multitude, heap, quantity, assemblage; as in शस्त्रास्त्रसंभार.<BR>—5 Fulness.<BR>—6 Wealth, affluence.<BR>—7 Maintenance, support.<BR>—8 High degree, excess of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभृत|सम्भृत|सम्भृतः
संभृत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Brought together, collected, concentrated.<BR>—2 Got ready, prepared, provided, equipped;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">Page1651-1</a>]<BR> संभृतया सपर्यया किल परम परितुष्यसि Bhāg. 5. 3. 6.<BR>—3 Furnished or endowed with, possessed of.<BR>—4 Placed, deposited.<BR>—5 Full, complete, entire.<BR>—6 Gained, obtained.<BR>—7 Carried, borne.<BR>—8 Nourished.<BR>—9 Produced, caused.<BR>—10 Honoured, respected.<BR>—11 Loud, shrill (as a sound).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संभृतश्रुत, संभृतसंभार, संभृतस्नेह<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1650-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभृतश्रुत|सम्भृतश्रुत
संभृत + -श्रुत <i>a.</i> learned, wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभृतसंभार|सम्भृतसम्भार
संभृत + -संभार <i>a.</i> quite ready, all prepared.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभृतस्नेह|सम्भृतस्नेह
