संभ्रान्त|सम्भ्रान्त|संभ्रांत
संभ्रान्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Whirled about.<BR>—2 Flurried, agitated, perplexed, bewildered; दृष्ट्वा हनूमतो वर्ष्म<BR> संभ्रान्तः पवनात्मजः Mb. 3. 150. 10.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संभ्रान्तमनस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभ्रान्तमनस्|सम्भ्रान्तमनस्
संभ्रान्त + -मनस् <i>a.</i> bewildered in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संभ्रान्तिः|सम्भ्रान्ति
संभ्रान्तिः Agitation, bewilderment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संमद्|सम्मद्
संमद् €4 P.<BR>—1 To be intoxicated.<BR>—2 To rejoice, be glad. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To exhilarate, rejoice, put in good spirits.<BR>—2 To be completely intoxicated (Ātm.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संमत्त|सम्मत्त
संमत्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Completely drunk.<BR>—2 Overjoyed, enraptured; प्रमत्तमत्तसंमत्तक्ष्वेडितोत्कृष्टसंकुलः<BR> Mb. 14. 59. 10.<BR>—3 Rutting, being in rut, furious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संमद|सम्मद|संमदः|सम्मदः
संमद <i>a.</i> Greatly delighted, happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संमदः|सम्मद|संमद|सम्मदः
संमद + .{@-दः@} Great joy, delight, happiness; रणसंमदोदयविकासिबल …<BR> Śi. 15. 77; Māl. 5. 11; बत मे संमदः सोऽभूदस्तु वा मास्तु वा तव<BR> Śiva B. 15. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संमादः|सम्माद|संमाद|सम्मादः
