संमन्|सम्मन्
संमन् €4 Ā.<BR>—1 To agree, concur, be of the same opinion.<BR>—2 To assent or consent to, approve of, like.<BR>—3 To think, suppose, regard.<BR>—4 To sanction, authorize.<BR>—5 To esteem, honour, value highly; कच्चिदग्निमिवानाय्यं काले संमन्यसेऽतिथिम्<BR> Bk. 6. 65; सममंस्त बन्धून् 1. 2.<BR>—6 To allow, permit. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To honour, respect, value highly.<BR>—2 To consider, regard.<BR>—3 To instruct, teach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संमत|सम्मत
संमत <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Agreed or consented to, approved of; बाह्लीकः सोमदत्तिश्च ये चान्ये<BR> वृद्धसंमताः Mb. 3. 249. 15.<BR>—2 Liked, dear, beloved; द्वेष्योऽपि संमतः शिष्टस्तस्यार्तस्य यथौषधम् R. 1. 28.<BR>—3 Like, resembling.<BR>—4 Regarded, considered, thought.<BR>—5 Highly respected, honoured, esteemed; संमतोऽहं प्रभोर्नित्यमिति<BR> मत्वा Pt. 1. 56.<BR>—6 Full of (युक्त, सहित); वाक्यं शौटीर्यसंमतम् Mb. 9. 55. 44.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संमतम्
संमत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Agreement.<BR>—2 Consent, approval; see संमति.<BR>—3 Impression, opinion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संमतिः|सम्मति|संमति|सम्मतिः
संमतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Agreement.<BR>—2 Concurrence, assent, approbation, approval.<BR>—3 Wish, desire.<BR>—4 Knowledge of self, knowledge of the soul, true knowledge.<BR>—5 Regard, respect, esteem; कथमिव तव संमतिर्भवित्री सममृतुभिर्मुनिनावधीरितस्य Ki. 10. 36.<BR>—6 Love, affection.<BR>—7 Command, order.<BR>—8 Honouring (संमानन); लोकानां स्वस्ति चैवं स्याद्भवेदस्य च<BR> संमतिः Rām. 7. 10. 40.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: संमतिपत्रकम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1651-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

