संमोदः<BR>—1 Great joy, delight.<BR>—2 Odour, fragrance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1652-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

संमोदिकः|सम्मोदिक|संमोदिक
संमोदिकः Comrade, companion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1652-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्यच्
सम्यच्, समञ्च् <i>a.</i> (समीची <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Going with, accompanying; यजन्ते याजकाः सम्यक्परिवारं शुभार्थिनः<BR> Mb. 3. 130. 16.<BR>—2 Right, fit, proper, due; अपि चेत् सुदुराचारो भजते मामनन्यभाक् ।<BR> साधुरेव स मन्तव्यः सम्यग्व्यवसितो हि सः ॥ Bg. 9. 30.<BR>—3 Correct, true, accurate.<BR>—4 Pleasant, agreeable; किं च कुलनि कवीनां निसर्गसम्यञ्चि रञ्जयतु R. G.<BR>—5 Same, uniform.<BR>—6 All, whole, entire. ━<i>ind.</i> (सम्यक्)<BR>—1 With, together with.<BR>—2 Well, properly, rightly, correctly, truly; सम्यगियमाह Ś. 1;<BR> तेषु सम्यग्वर्तमानो गच्छत्यमरलोकताम् Ms. 2. 5, 14.<BR>—3 Duly, suitably, correctly, truly.<BR>—4 Honourably.<BR>—5 Completely, thoroughly.<BR>—6 Distinctly.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सम्यग्ज्ञानम्, सम्यग्दर्शनम्, सम्यग्दृष्टिः, सम्यक्पाठः, सम्यक्प्रयोगः, सम्यक्प्रवृत्तिः, सम्यक्प्रहाणम्, सम्यग्वृत्तिः, सम्यक्स्थितिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1652-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

समञ्च्
सम्यच्, समञ्च् <i>a.</i> (समीची <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Going with, accompanying; यजन्ते याजकाः सम्यक्परिवारं शुभार्थिनः<BR> Mb. 3. 130. 16.<BR>—2 Right, fit, proper, due; अपि चेत् सुदुराचारो भजते मामनन्यभाक् ।<BR> साधुरेव स मन्तव्यः सम्यग्व्यवसितो हि सः ॥ Bg. 9. 30.<BR>—3 Correct, true, accurate.<BR>—4 Pleasant, agreeable; किं च कुलनि कवीनां निसर्गसम्यञ्चि रञ्जयतु R. G.<BR>—5 Same, uniform.<BR>—6 All, whole, entire. ━<i>ind.</i> (सम्यक्)<BR>—1 With, together with.<BR>—2 Well, properly, rightly, correctly, truly; सम्यगियमाह Ś. 1;<BR> तेषु सम्यग्वर्तमानो गच्छत्यमरलोकताम् Ms. 2. 5, 14.<BR>—3 Duly, suitably, correctly, truly.<BR>—4 Honourably.<BR>—5 Completely, thoroughly.<BR>—6 Distinctly.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सम्यग्ज्ञानम्, सम्यग्दर्शनम्, सम्यग्दृष्टिः, सम्यक्पाठः, सम्यक्प्रयोगः, सम्यक्प्रवृत्तिः, सम्यक्प्रहाणम्, सम्यग्वृत्तिः, सम्यक्स्थितिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1652-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्यग्ज्ञानम्
सम्यच् + -ज्ञानम् right knowledge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1652-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्यग्दर्शनम्
सम्यच् + -दर्शनम्, -दृष्टिः insight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1652-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्यग्दृष्टिः|सम्यग्दृष्टि
सम्यच् + -दर्शनम्, -दृष्टिः insight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1652-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्यक्पाठः|सम्यक्पाठ
सम्यच् + -पाठः a correct reading or recitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1652-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्यक्प्रयोगः|सम्यक्प्रयोग
सम्यच् + -प्रयोगः proper use,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">Page1653-1</a>]<BR> due application.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1652-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्यक्प्रवृत्तिः|सम्यक्प्रवृत्ति
सम्यच् + -प्रवृत्तिः <i>f.</i> the right direction (of the organ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्यक्प्रहाणम्
सम्यच् + -प्रहाणम् right effort or exertion; Buddh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्यग्वृत्तिः|सम्यग्वृत्ति
सम्यच् + -वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> steady practice, regular discharge of duties.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्यक्स्थितिः|सम्यक्स्थिति
सम्यच् + -स्थितिः remaining together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सम्राज्
सम्राज् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A paramount sovereign, universal lord; especially one who rules over<BR> other princes and has performed the Rājasūya sacrifice; येनेष्टं राजसूयेन<BR> मण्डलस्येश्वरश्च यः । शास्ति यश्चाज्ञया राज्ञः स सम्राट् Ak.; R. 2. 5.<BR>—2 A ruler having a revenue to the extent of one to ten crores of Karṣa;<BR> ततस्तु कोटिपर्यन्तः स्वराट् सम्राट् ततः परम् । दशकोटिमितो यावद्<BR> विराट् तु तदनन्तरम् ॥ Śukra. 1. 185.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सय्
सय् €1 Ā. (सयते) To go, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सयावक
सयावक <i>a.</i> Dyed with lac; Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सयुज्
सयुज् <i>a.</i> A companion, comrade; द्वा सुपर्णा सयुजा सखाया समानं<BR> वृक्षं परिषस्वजाते Muṇḍ. 3. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सयूथ्यः|सयूथ्य
सयूथ्यः One of the same flock or tribe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सयोगः|सयोग
सयोगः Junction, union; यस्मात् प्रियाप्रियवियोगसयोगजन्मशोकाग्निना<BR> सकलयोनिषु दह्यमानः । Bhāg. 7. 9. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सयोनि|सयोनिः
सयोनि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having the same womb, uterine.<BR>—2 Closely related to.<BR>—3 Closely united with the womb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सयोनिः|सयोनि
सयोनि + .{@-निः@}<BR>—1 A whole or uterine brother.<BR>—2 A pair of nippers for cutting betel-nut.<BR>—3 N. of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सयोषण
सयोषण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Attended by women.<BR>—2 Along with the women.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर|सरं|सरः
सर <i>a.</i> [सरति सृ-अच्]<BR>—1 Going or moving.<BR>—2 Cathartic, purgative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरः|सर|सरं
सर + .{@-रः@}<BR>—1 Going, motion.<BR>—2 An arrow.<BR>—3 The coagulum of curds or milk, cream.<BR>—4 Salt.<BR>—5 A string, necklace; अयं कण्ठे बाहुः शिशिरमसृणो मौक्तिकसरः U. 1. 39, 29.<BR>—6 A water-fall.<BR>—7 A short vowel (in prosody).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरम्
सर + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 water.<BR>—2 A lake, pool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरा
सर + .{@-रा@}<BR>—1 Motion, movement.<BR>—2 A cascade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरी
सर + .{@-री@} A water-fall.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सरोत्सवः, सरोदकम्, सरजम्, सरपत्रिका<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरोत्सवः|सरोत्सव
सर + -उत्सवः a crane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरोदकम्
सर + -उदकम् the water of a pond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरजम्
सर + -जम् fresh butter; cf. शरज.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरपत्रिका
सर + -पत्रिका<BR>—1 the new leaf of a lotus.<BR>—2 a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरकः|सरक|सरकं
सरकः, -कम्<BR> [सृ-वुन्]<BR>—1 A continuous line of road.<BR>—2 Spirituous liquor, spirits; ‘सरकं शीधुपात्रे स्याच्छीधुपाने च शीधुनि’ इति विश्वः.<BR>—3 Drinking spirits; चक्रुरथ सह पुरन्ध्रिजनैरयथार्थसिद्धि सरकं<BR> महीभृतः Śi. 15. 80, 10. 12.<BR>—4 A drinking-vessel, wine-glass, goblet; प्रापि चेतसि सविप्रतिसारे<BR> सुभ्रूवामवसरः सरकेण Śi. 10. 20.<BR>—5 Distribution of spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरकम्
सरकः, -कम्<BR> [सृ-वुन्]<BR>—1 A continuous line of road.<BR>—2 Spirituous liquor, spirits; ‘सरकं शीधुपात्रे स्याच्छीधुपाने च शीधुनि’ इति विश्वः.<BR>—3 Drinking spirits; चक्रुरथ सह पुरन्ध्रिजनैरयथार्थसिद्धि सरकं<BR> महीभृतः Śi. 15. 80, 10. 12.<BR>—4 A drinking-vessel, wine-glass, goblet; प्रापि चेतसि सविप्रतिसारे<BR> सुभ्रूवामवसरः सरकेण Śi. 10. 20.<BR>—5 Distribution of spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरकम्
सरकः, -कम् + .{@-कम्@}<BR>—1 Going.<BR>—2 A pond, lake.<BR>—3 Heaven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरघा
सरघा A bee; तस्तार सरघाव्याप्तैः स क्षौद्रपटलैरिव R. 4. 63;<BR> Śi. 15. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

