सरजस्
सरजस्, -सा <i>f.</i>, सरजस्का<BR> A woman during menstruation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरजसा
सरजस्, -सा <i>f.</i>, सरजस्का<BR> A woman during menstruation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरजस्का
सरजस्, -सा <i>f.</i>, सरजस्का<BR> A woman during menstruation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरट्
सरट् <i>m.</i> [सृ-अटिः Uṇ. 1. 126]<BR>—1 Air, wind.<BR>—2 A cloud.<BR>—3 A lizard.<BR>—4 A bee.<BR>—5 A thread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरटः|सरट
सरटः [सृ-अटच् Uṇ. 4. 89]<BR>—1 Wind.<BR>—2 A lizard; लूताहिसरटानां च तिरश्चां चाम्बुचारिणाम् Ms. 12. 57;<BR> अहासि लोकैः सरटात् पटोज्झिनी N. 16. 52, 18. 148.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरटिः|सरटि
सरटिः<BR>—1 Wind<BR>—2 A cloud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरटुः|सरटु
सरटुः A lizard, chameleon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरण|सरणं
सरण <i>a.</i> [सृ-ल्युट्] Going, moving; flowing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरणम्
सरण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 Proceeding, going or flowing.<BR>—2 Running, quick motion; आजेः सरणम् Ch. Up. 1. 3. 5; आरोहे पर्यवस्कन्दे<BR> सरणे सान्तरप्लुते Mb. 6. 76. 8, 7. 114. 5.<BR>—3 Locomotion.<BR>—4 Iron rust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1653-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सरणा
