सर्पिन्
सर्पिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Creeping, gliding, winding, going tortuously.<BR>—2 Moving, going (in general); यूका मन्दविसर्पिणी Pt. 1. 252.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1655-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

