सहस्राक्ष|सहस्राक्षः
सहस्रम् + -अक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 thousand-eyed.<BR>—2 vigilant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्राक्षः|सहस्राक्ष
सहस्रम् + -अक्ष + .({@-क्षः@})<BR>—1 an epithet of Indra.<BR>—2 of Puruṣa; सहस्रशीर्षा पुरुषः सहस्राक्षः सहस्रपात् Rv. 10. 90 1.<BR>—3 of Śiva.<BR>—4 of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्रारः|सहस्रार
सहस्रम् + -अरः, -अरम् a kind of cavity in the top of the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-2" target="_blank">Page1661-2</a>]<BR> head, resembling a lotus reversed (said to be the seat of the soul).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्रारम्
सहस्रम् + -अरः, -अरम् a kind of cavity in the top of the<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-2" target="_blank">Page1661-2</a>]<BR> head, resembling a lotus reversed (said to be the seat of the soul).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्राननः|सहस्रानन
सहस्रम् + -आननः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्राधिपतिः|सहस्राधिपति
सहस्रम् + -अधिपतिः a governor of one thousand villages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्रावरः|सहस्रावर
सहस्रम् + -अवरः a fine below a thousand, or from five hundred to a thousand Paṇas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्रकाण्डा|सहस्रकांडा
सहस्रम् + -काण्डा white Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्रकृत्वस्
सहस्रम् + -कृत्वस् <i>ind.</i> a thousand times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्रगु
सहस्रम् + -गु <i>a.</i> possessing a thousand cows (epithet of the sun, also of Indra).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1661-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सहस्रगुण
