सारजम्
सार + -जम् fresh butter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1673-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारतरुः|सारतरु
