सारद्रुमः|सारद्रुम
सार + -द्रुमः the Khadira tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1673-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारफल्गु
सार + -फल्गु <i>a.</i> superior and inferior; Kau. A. 2. 7. ˚त्वम् goodness<BR> and badness; comparative importance; एतद्वः सारफल्गुत्वं बीजयोन्योः<BR> प्रकीर्तितम् Ms. 9. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1673-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

