सारण|सारणं|सारणः
सारण <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Causing to go or flow.<BR>—2 Cracked, split.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारणः|सारण|सारणं
सारण + .{@-णः@}<BR>—1 Dysentery.<BR>—2 The hog-plum.<BR>—3 Wind during the autumn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारणम्
सारण + .{@-णम्@}<BR>—1 A kind of perfume.<BR>—2 Leading home.<BR>—3 Butter-milk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारणा
सारणा<BR>—1 A kind of process to which metals, particularly mercury, are subjected.<BR>—2 Stretching out, extension.<BR>—3 Producing a sound or note.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारणिः|सारणि
सारणिः, -णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A canal, drain, water-course, channel.<BR>—2 A small river; पदे पदे मौनमयान्तरीपिणी प्रवर्तिता सारघसारसारणी N. 9. 155.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारणी
सारणिः, -णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A canal, drain, water-course, channel.<BR>—2 A small river; पदे पदे मौनमयान्तरीपिणी प्रवर्तिता सारघसारसारणी N. 9. 155.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारणिक|सारणिकः
सारणिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>) Travelling, journeying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारणिकः|सारणिक
