सारणिकघ्नः|सारणिकघ्न
सारणिक + -घ्नः a highwayman, robber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारण्डः|सारण्ड|सारंड|सारंडः
सारण्डः The egg of a serpent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारथिः|सारथि
सारथिः [सृ-अथिण् सह रथेन सरथः घोटकः तत्र नियुक्तः इञ्<BR> वा Tv.; cf. Uṇ. 4. 89]<BR>—1 A charioteer; स शापो न त्वया राजन् न च सारथिना श्रुतः R. 1. 78;<BR> मातलिसारथिर्ययौ 3. 67.<BR>—2 A companion, helper; R. 3. 37.<BR>—3 The ocean.<BR>—4 A leader, guide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

