सारव|सारवः
सारव <i>a.</i> Belonging to the river Sarayu; (P. VI. 4. 174); कठोरपीनोच्चकुचद्वयीतटत्रुट्यत्तरः<BR> सारवसारवोर्मिजः N. 12. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारस|सारसं|सारसः
सारस <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>) [सरस इदम् अण्]<BR>—1 Belonging to a lake; विशदा विशदामत्तसारसे सारसे जले Kāv. 3. 14;<BR> Nalod. 2. 40.<BR>—2 Belonging to or proceeding from a Sārasa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारसः|सारस|सारसं
सारस + .{@-सः@}<BR>—1 The (Indian) crane, or swan (according to some); विभिद्यमाना विससार<BR> सारसानुदस्य तीरेषु तरङ्गसंहतिः Ki. 8. 31; Śi. 6. 75, 12. 44;<BR> Me. 31; R. 1. 41.<BR>—2 A bird in general. —3 The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारसम्
सारस + .{@-सम्@}<BR>—1 A lotus; पुरा सरसि मानसे विकचसारसालिस्खलत् Bv. 1. 3.<BR>—2 The zone or girdle of a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारसी
