सारसाक्षम्
सारस + -अक्षम् a kind of ruby.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारसाक्षी
सारस + -अक्षी a lotus-eyed woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारस|सारसं|सारसः
सारस <i>a.</i> Crying, calling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारस्यम्
सारस + .{@-सारस्यम्@} a cry, shout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारसनम्
सारस(श)नम्<BR>—1 A girdle or zone; सारशनं महानहिः Ki. 18. 32.<BR>—2 A military girdle; स्वर्णसारसनालम्बि-कौक्षेयककृतश्रियम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">Page1674-2</a>]<BR> Śiva B. 29. 19 (क्लीबे सारशनं चाथ पुंस्कट्यां शृङ्खलं त्रिषु Ak.).<BR>—3 A breast-plate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारशनम्
सारस(श)नम्<BR>—1 A girdle or zone; सारशनं महानहिः Ki. 18. 32.<BR>—2 A military girdle; स्वर्णसारसनालम्बि-कौक्षेयककृतश्रियम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">Page1674-2</a>]<BR> Śiva B. 29. 19 (क्लीबे सारशनं चाथ पुंस्कट्यां शृङ्खलं त्रिषु Ak.).<BR>—3 A breast-plate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारसिका
सारसिका A female (Indian) crane; कामे कान्ते सारसिकाकाकुरुतेन Śi. 6. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारस्यम्
सारस्यम् Abundance of water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारस्वत|सारस्वतः
सारस्वत <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> [सरस्वती देवतास्य, सरस्वत्या इदं वा अण्]<BR>—1 Relating to the goddess Sarasvatī.<BR>—2 Belonging to the river Sarasvatī; कृत्वा तासामभिगममपां सौम्य<BR> सारस्वतीनाम् Me. 51.<BR>—3 Eloquent.<BR>—4 Belonging to the Sāravata country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारस्वतः|सारस्वत
सारस्वत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 N. of a country about the river Sarasvatī.<BR>—2 N. of a particular class of Brāhmaṇas.<BR>—3 A particular ceremonial used in the worship of Sarasvatī.<BR>—4 A staff of the Bilva tree.<BR>—5 N. of a certain sage; सारस्वतश्चापि जगाद नष्टम् (वेदम्) Bu. C. 1. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारस्वताः
सारस्वत + .{@-ताः@} (<i>m.</i> pl.) The people of the Sārasvata country.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारस्वतम्
सारस्वत + .{@-तम्@} Speech, eloquence; शृङ्गारसारस्वतम् Gīt. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारामुखः|सारामुख
सारामुखः A kind of rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारालः|साराल
सारालः Sesamum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारिः|सारि
सारिः, -री <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A man at chess, chessman.<BR>—2 A kind of bird.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सारिक्रीडा, सारिफलकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारी
सारिः, -री <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A man at chess, chessman.<BR>—2 A kind of bird.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सारिक्रीडा, सारिफलकः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारिक्रीडा
सारिः + -क्रीडा a kind of game similar to chess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारिफलकः|सारिफलक
सारिः + -फलकः a chess-board.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारिका
सारिका [सरति गच्छति सृ-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 A kind of bird; आत्मनो मुखदोषेण बध्यन्ते शुकसारिकाः Pt. 4. 44;<BR> सारिकां पञ्जरस्थाम् Me. 87; Mb. 13. 54. 10.<BR>—2 A confidante.<BR>—3 The bridge of a stringed instrument.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारिन्
सारिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Going, resorting to.<BR>—2 Having the essence or substance of.<BR>—3 A river.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारिष्ट
सारिष्ट <i>a.</i> Having the symptoms of approaching death.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारिष्ठ
सारिष्ठ <i>a.</i> The very best.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारूप्यम्
सारूप्यम्<BR>—1 Sameness of form, similarity, likeness, conformity, resemblance; अन्तर्वृत्तिसारूप्यतः Māl. 5.<BR>—2 Assimilation to the deity (one of the four states of <i>Mukti</i>).<BR>—3 (In dramas) An angry treatment of one mistaken for another through<BR> resemblance; सारूप्यमभिभूतस्य सारूप्यात् क्षोभवर्तनम् S. D. 464.<BR>—4 Surprise at seeing an object or its likeness seen elsewhere. ━<i>a.</i><BR> Fit, proper, suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारोपा
सारोपा An ellipsis containing an attribute to be supplied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारोष्ट्रिकः|सारोष्ट्रिक
सारोष्ट्रिकः A kind of poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सारोह
सारोह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Elevated.<BR>—2 Together with a horseman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्क
सार्क <i>a.</i> Sunny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्गल
सार्गल <i>a.</i> Barred, obstructed, impeded; ईप्सितं तदवज्ञानाद्<BR> विद्धि सार्गलमात्मनः R. 1. 79.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्त्रम्
सार्त्रम् A house, dwelling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1674-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्थ|सार्थः
सार्थ <i>a.</i> [अर्थेन सहितः; सृ-स्थन्-स्वार्थे अण् वा Uṇ. 2. 5]<BR>—1 Having meaning, significant.<BR>—2 Having an aim or object.<BR>—3 Of like meaning or import.<BR>—4 Useful, serviceable.<BR>—5 Wealthy, rich, opulent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्थः|सार्थ
सार्थ + .{@-र्थः@}<BR>—1 A rich man.<BR>—2 A company of merchants, caravan (of traders); सार्थाः स्वैरं स्वकीयेषु<BR> चेरुर्वेश्मस्विवाद्रिषु R. 17. 64; see सार्थवाह.<BR>—3 A troop, collection of men; सार्थः प्रवसतो मित्रम् Mb.<BR>—4 A herd, flock, (of animals of the same species); अथ कदाचित् तैरितस्ततो<BR> भ्रमद्भिः सार्थाद् भ्रष्टः कथनको नामोष्ट्रो दृष्टः Pt. 1.<BR>—5 A collection or multitude in general; अर्थिसार्थः Pt. 1; त्वया<BR> चन्द्रमसा चातिसंधीयते कामिजनसार्थः Ś. 3.<BR>—6 One of a company of pilgrims.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सार्थज, सार्थवाहः, सार्थवाहनः, सार्थहीन<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्थज
सार्थ + -ज <i>a.</i> bred in a caravan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्थवाहः|सार्थवाह
सार्थ + -वाहः, -वाहनः the leader of a caravan, a merchant, trader; Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्थवाहनः|सार्थवाहन
सार्थ + -वाहः, -वाहनः the leader of a caravan, a merchant, trader; Ś. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्थहीन
सार्थ + -हीन <i>a.</i> left behind by a caravan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्थक|सार्थकः
सार्थक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having sense, significant.<BR>—2 Useful, serviceable, advantageous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्थवत्|सार्थवन्त्
सार्थवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Having meaning, significant.<BR>—2 Having a large company.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्थिक|सार्थिकः
सार्थिक <i>a.</i> Travelling with; यदेव कर्म केवलं पुरा कृतं<BR> शुभाशुभम् । तदेव पुत्र सार्थिकं भवत्यमुत्र गच्छतः ॥ Mb. 12. 321. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्थिकः|सार्थिक
सार्थिक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A merchant, trader; हाहाकारं प्रमुञ्चन्तः सार्थिकाः शरणार्थिनः<BR> Mb. 3. 65. 11; Bhāg. 5. 13. 2.<BR>—2 A companion on a journey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्द्र|सार्द्रं
सार्द्र <i>a.</i> Wet, moist, humid, damp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्ध|सार्द्धं
सार्ध <i>a.</i> Increased by half, plus one-half, having a half over;<BR> as in सार्धशतम् (= 150), द्वे शते सार्धे (250) &c.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सार्धवार्षिक, सार्धसंवत्सरम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्धवार्षिक
सार्ध + -वार्षिक <i>a.</i> lasting a year and a half; Kull. on Ms. 11. 126.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्धसंवत्सरम्
सार्ध + -संवत्सरम् a year and a half.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सार्धम्
सार्धम् <i>ind.</i> Together with, with, in company with (with instr.);<BR> वनं मया सार्धमसि प्रपन्नः R. 14. 63; Ms. 4. 43; Bk. 6. 26; Me. 91.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1675-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

