सासूयम्
सासूय + .{@-यम्@} <i>ind.</i> Jealously, angrily, disdainfully; मा गा इत्युपरुद्धया<BR> यदपि सा सासूयमुक्ता सखी Ś. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1678-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सास्थि
