सिंहदर्प
सिंहः + -दर्प <i>a.</i> as proud as a lion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिंहद्वार्
सिंहः + -द्वार् <i>f.</i>, {@-द्वारम्@}<BR> the main or principal gate (of a palace &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

