सिंहनादः|सिंहनाद
सिंहः + -नादः<BR>—1 a lionʼs roar.<BR>—2 a war-cry.<BR>—3 a confident assertion.<BR>—4 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिंहमलम्
