सिंहविक्रमः|सिंहविक्रम
सिंहः + -विक्रमः, -विक्रान्तः a horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

