सिंहाणकम्
सिंहाणम्, -नम्, सिंहाणकः, -कम्<BR>—1 Rust of iron.<BR>—2 The mucus of the nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिंहिका
सिंहिका<BR>—1 The mother of Rāhu.<BR>—2 N. of a form of दाक्षायणी.<BR>—3 A knock-kneed girl unfit for marriage.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सिंहिकातनयः, सिंहिकापुत्रः, सिंहिकासुतः, सिंहिकासूनुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

