सिंही
सिंही<BR>—1 A lioness.<BR>—2 N. of various plants (Mar. अडूळसा, डोरली, रानमूग, बकुळ &c.)<BR>—3 A vein.<BR>—4 N. of the mother of Rāhu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिकता
सिकता (सिक्-अतच् Uṇ. 3. 110)<BR>—1 Sandy soil.<BR>—2 Sand (generally in pl.); लभेत सिकतासु तैलमपि यत्नतः पीडयन् Bh. 2. 5.<BR>—3 Gravel or stone (the disease).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सिकताप्रायम्, सिकतासेतुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिकताप्रायम्
सिकता + -प्रायम् a sand bank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिकतासेतुः|सिकतासेतु
सिकता + -सेतुः a bank of sand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिकतामय|सिकतामयं
सिकतामय, सिकतावत् <i>a.</i> Sandy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिकतावत्|सिकतावन्त्
सिकतामय, सिकतावत् <i>a.</i> Sandy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिकतामयम्
सिकतामय, सिकतावत् + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 A sand bank.<BR>—2 An island with sandy shores.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिकतिल|सिकतिलः
सिकतिल <i>a.</i> [सिकताः सन्त्यत्र इलच्] Sandy; गतास्तुल्यावस्थां<BR> सिकतिलनदीतीरतरुभिः Bh. 3. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिक्थः|सिक्थ|सिक्थं
सिक्थः [सिच्-थक् Uṇ. 2. 7]<BR>—1 Boiled rice.<BR>—2 A ball or lump of boiled rice; ग्रासोद्रलितसिक्थेन का हानिः करिणो<BR> भवेत् Subhāṣ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिक्थम्
सिक्थः + .{@-क्थम्@}<BR>—1 Beesʼ-wax; गन्धोलिपालीगृहसिक्थकुम्भात् Rām. Ch. 6. 89.<BR>—2 Indigo; see शिक्थम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिक्थकम्
सिक्थकम् Beesʼ-wax; वृकधूपं सर्जरसं शिलाजतु च सिक्थकम्<BR> Śiva B. 30. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिक्यम्
सिक्यम् See शिक्य.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिक्ष्यः|सिक्ष्य
