सिङ्घणम्
सिङ्घ(ङ्घा)णम्, सिङ्घाणकम्<BR>—1 The mucus of the nose.<BR>—2 Rust of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिङ्घाणम्
सिङ्घ(ङ्घा)णम्, सिङ्घाणकम्<BR>—1 The mucus of the nose.<BR>—2 Rust of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिङ्घाणकम्
सिङ्घ(ङ्घा)णम्, सिङ्घाणकम्<BR>—1 The mucus of the nose.<BR>—2 Rust of iron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिङ्घिणी|सिंघिणी
सिङ्घिणी The nose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिच्
सिच् €6 U. (सिञ्चति-ते, सिषेच-सिषिचे, असिचत्-त, असिक्त, सेक्ष्यति-ते,<BR> सेक्तुम्, सिक्त; स् of सिच् is generally changed to ष् after a preposition<BR> ending in इ or उ)<BR>—1 To sprinkle, scatter in small drops; अम्भांसि रुक्मकुम्भेन सिञ्चन्<BR> मूर्ध्नि समाधिमान् Bk. 19. 23.<BR>—2 To water, moisten; soak, wet;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1680-1" target="_blank">Page1680-1</a>]<BR> विश्रान्तः सन् व्रज वननदीतीरजातानि सिञ्चन् Me. 26; Ms. 9. 255.<BR>—3 To pour out, emit, discharge, shed; एताः करोत्पीडितवारिधारा दर्पात्<BR> सखीभिर्वदनेषु सिक्ताः R. 16. 66.<BR>—4 To infuse, instil, pour in; जाड्यं धियो हरति सिञ्चति वाचि सत्यम् Bh. 2. 23.<BR>—5 To pour out for, offer to; अन्यथा तिलोदकं मे सिञ्चतम् Ś. 3.<BR>—6 To impregnate.<BR>—7 To dip, soak, steep. ━<i>Caus.</i> (सेचयति-ते) To cause to sprinkle.<BR>━<i>Desid.</i> (सिसिक्षति-ते) To wish to sprinkle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1679-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिक्त|सिक्तः
सिक्त <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Sprinkled, watered.<BR>—2 Wetted, moistened, soaked.<BR>—3 Impregnated; see सिच्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिक्तिः|सिक्ति
सिक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Sprinkling.<BR>—2 Effusion.<BR>—3 Emission.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिच्
सिच् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Cloth; L. D. B.<BR>—2 The border or hem of a dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिचयः|सिचय
सिचयः [सिच्-अयच् किच्च]<BR>—1 Cloth, garment; स्पृशति नखैर्न च विलिखति सिचयं गृह्णाति न च<BR> विमोचयति Āryā. S. 126; N. 7. 84.<BR>—2 Old or ragged raiment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिञ्चनम्
सिञ्चनम् Sprinkling, watering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1680-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सिञ्चता
