सीरभृत्
सीरः + -पाणिः, -भृत् <i>m.</i> epithets of Balarāma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1684-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीरयोगः|सीरयोग
