सीरवाहकः|सीरवाहक
सीरः + -वाहकः a ploughman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1684-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीरकः|सीरक
सीरकः<BR>—1 A plough.<BR>—2 The sun.<BR>—3 A porpoise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1684-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीरिन्
सीरिन् <i>m.</i> An epithet of Balarāma; सार्धमुद्धवसीरिभ्यामथासावासदत्<BR> सदः Śi. 2. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1684-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीलम्
सीलम् A plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1684-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीलन्धः|सीलन्ध|सीलंध
सीलन्धः A kind of fish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1684-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सीव्
सीव् See सिव्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1684-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

