स्वक्ष
सु + -अक्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having good eyes.<BR>—2 having keen organs, acute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

