सु + -अङ्ग <i>a.</i> well-shaped, handsome, lovely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

