स्वल्पक
सु + -अल्प, -अल्पक <i>a.</i> see s. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

