स्वस्तिक|स्वस्तिकः
सु + -अस्ति, -अस्तिक see s. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वाकार
सु + -आकार, -आकृति <i>a.</i> well-formed, handsome, beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वाकृति
सु + -आकार, -आकृति <i>a.</i> well-formed, handsome, beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वागत|स्वागतं
सु + -आगत see s. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वादानम्
सु + -आदानम् taking justly or properly; स्वादानाद्वर्णसंसर्गात्त्वबलानां<BR> च रक्षणात् । बलं संजायते राज्ञः स प्रेत्येह च वर्धते ॥ Ms. 8. 172.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्वाभास
सु + -आभास <i>a.</i> very splendid or illustrious; सारतो न विरोधी<BR> नः स्वाभासो भरवानुत Ki. 15. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्विष्ट
सु + -इष्ट <i>a.</i> properly sacrificed; स्विष्टं यजुर्भिः प्रणतोऽस्मि<BR> यज्ञम् Bhāg. 4. 7. 41. ˚कृत् <i>m.</i> a form of fire; धर्मादिभ्यो<BR> यथान्यायं मन्त्रैः स्विष्टकृतं बुधः Bhāg. 11. 27. 41.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्त|सूक्तं
सु + -उक्त <i>a.</i> well-spoken, well-said; अथवा सूक्तं खलु केनापि Ve. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ता
सु + -उक्त + .({@-क्ता@}) a kind of bird (सारिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्तम्
सु + -उक्त + .({@-क्तम्@})<BR>—1 a good or wise saying; नेतुं वाञ्छति यः खलान् पथि सतां सूक्तैः<BR> सुधास्यन्दिभिः Bh. 2. 6; R. 15. 97.<BR>—2 a Vedic hymn, as in पुरुषसूक्त &c. ˚दर्शिन् <i>m.</i> a hymn-seer,<BR> Vedic sage. ˚वाकन्यायः A rule of interpretation according to which<BR> some thing that is declared as being subordinate to something else should<BR> be understood to signify a part or whole on the basis of expediency or<BR> utility. This is discussed by जैमिनि and शबर at MS. 3. 2. 15-18.<BR> ˚वाच् <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a hymn.<BR>—2 praise, a word of praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्तिः|सूक्ति
सु + -उक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a good or friendly speech.<BR>—2 a good or clever saying.<BR>—3 a correct sentence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्तर
सु + -उत्तर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very superior.<BR>—2 well towards the north.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्थान|सूत्थानः
सु + -उत्थान <i>a.</i> making good efforts, vigorous, active.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्थानम्
सु + -उत्थान + .({@-नम्@}) vigorous effort or exertion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सून्मद|सून्मदः
सु + -उन्मद, -उन्माद <i>a.</i> quite mad or frantic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सून्माद|सून्मादः
सु + -उन्मद, -उन्माद <i>a.</i> quite mad or frantic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूपसदन
सु + -उपसदन <i>a.</i> easy to be approached.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूपस्कर
सु + -उपस्कर <i>a.</i> furnished with good instruments.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकण्टका
सु + -कण्टका the aloe plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकण्ठ
सु + -कण्ठ <i>a.</i> sweet-voiced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकण्ठी
सु + -कण्ठ + .({@-ण्ठी@}) the female cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकण्डुः|सुकण्डु|सुकंडु
सु + -कण्डुः itch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकन्दः|सुकन्द|सुकंद
सु + -कन्दः<BR>—1 an onion.<BR>—2 a yam.<BR>—3 a sort of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकन्दकः|सुकन्दक|सुकंदक
सु + -कन्दकः onion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकर|सुकरः
सु + -कर <i>a.</i> (-रा or -री <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 easy to be done, practicable, feasible; वक्तुं सुकरं कर्तुं (अध्यवसातुं)<BR> दुष्करम् Ve. 3 ‘sooner said than done’.<BR>—2 easy to be managed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकरः|सुकर
सु + -कर + .({@-रः@}) a good-natured horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकरा
सु + -कर + .({@-रा@}) a tractable cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकरम्
सु + -कर + .({@-रम्@}) charity, benevolence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकर्मन्|सुकर्म्मन्
सु + -कर्मन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one whose deeds are righteous, virtuous, good.<BR>—2 active, diligent. ━(<i>m.</i>) N. of Visvakarman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकल|सुकलः
सु + -कल <i>a.</i> one who has acquired a great reputation for liberality<BR> in giving and using (money &c.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकलिल
सु + -कलिल <i>a.</i> well filled with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकल्प
सु + -कल्प <i>a.</i> very qualified or skilled; कालेन यैर्वा विमिताः<BR> सुकल्पैर्भूपांसवः खे<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">Page1685-2</a>]<BR> मिहिका द्युभासः Bhāg. 10. 14. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकल्पित
सु + -कल्पित <i>a.</i> well equipped or armed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकल्य
सु + -कल्य <i>a.</i> perfectly sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकाण्डः|सुकाण्ड
सु + -काण्डः the Kāravella plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकाण्डिका
सु + -काण्डिका the Kāṇḍīra creeper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकाण्डिन्|सुकांडिन्
सु + -काण्डिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having beautiful stems.<BR>—2 beautifully joined. ━(<i>m.</i>) a bee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकाष्ठम्
सु + -काष्ठम् fire-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकुन्दकः|सुकुन्दक|सुकुंदक
सु + -कुन्दकः an onion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकुमार|सुकुमारः
सु + -कुमार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very delicate or soft, smooth.<BR>—2 beautifully young or youthful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकुमारः|सुकुमार
सु + -कुमार + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 a beautiful youth.<BR>—2 a kind of sugar-cane.<BR>—3 a kind of grain (श्यामाक).<BR>—4 a kind of mustard.<BR>—5 the wild Champaka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकुमारा
सु + -कुमार + .({@-रा@})<BR>—1 the double jasmine.<BR>—2 the plantain.<BR>—3 the great-flowered jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकुमारकः|सुकुमारक
सु + -कुमारकः<BR>—1 a beautiful youth.<BR>—2 rice (शालि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकुमारकम्
सु + -कुमारकः + .({@-कम्@})<BR>—1 the Tamālapatra.<BR>—2 a particular part of the ear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकुमारी
सु + -कुमारी the Navamallikā jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकृत्
सु + -कृत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 doing good, benevolent.<BR>—2 pious, virtuous, righteous.<BR>—3 wise, learned.<BR>—4 fortunate, lucky.<BR>—5 making good sacrifices or offerings. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a skilful worker.<BR>—2 N. of Tvaṣṭṛ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकृत|सुकृतं
सु + -कृत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 done well or properly.<BR>—2 thoroughly done; कच्चिन्नु सुकृतान्येव कृतरूपाणि वा पुनः । विदुस्ते<BR> सर्वकार्याणि Rām. 2. 100. 20.<BR>—3 well made or constructed.<BR>—4 treated with kindness, assisted, befriended.<BR>—5 virtuous, righteous, pious.<BR>—6 lucky, fortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकृतम्
सु + -कृत + .({@-तम्@})<BR>—1 any good or virtuous act, kindness, favour, service; नादत्ते कस्यचित्<BR> पापं न चैव सुकृतं विभुः Bg. 5. 15; Me. 17.<BR>—2 virtue, moral or religious merit; स्वर्गभिसंधिसुकृतं वञ्चनामिव<BR> मेनिरे Ku. 6. 47; तच्चिन्त्यमानं सुकृतं तवेति R. 14. 16.<BR>—3 fortune, auspiciousness.<BR>—4 recompense, reward.<BR>—5 Penance; तदभूरिवासरकृतं सुकृतैरुपलभ्य वैभवमनन्यभवम् Ki. 6. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकृतिः|सुकृति
सु + -कृतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 well-doing, a good act.<BR>—2 kindness, virtue.<BR>—3 practice of penance.<BR>—4 auspiciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकृतिन्
सु + -कृतिन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 acting well or kindly.<BR>—2 virtuous, pious, good, righteous; सन्तः सन्तु निरापदः सुकृतिनां<BR> कीर्तिश्चिरं वर्धताम् H. 4. 132; चतुर्विधा भजन्ते मां जनाः सुकृतिनोऽर्जुन Bg. 7. 16.<BR>—3 wise, learned.<BR>—4 benevolent.<BR>—5 fortunate, lucky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकृत्यम्
सु + -कृत्यम् a good action; सुकृत्यं विष्णुगुप्तस्य मित्राप्तिर्भार्गवस्य<BR> च Pt. 2. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकेशरः
सु + -केशरः, -केसरः the citron tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुकेसरः|सुकेसर
सु + -केशरः, -केसरः the citron tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुक्रतुः|सुक्रतु
सु + -क्रतुः<BR>—1 N. of Agni.<BR>—2 of Śiva.<BR>—3 of Indra.<BR>—4 of Mitra and Varuṇa.<BR>—5 of the sun.<BR>—6 of Soma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुक्रयः|सुक्रय
सु + -क्रयः a fair bargain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुक्षेत्र
सु + -क्षेत्र <i>a.</i> sprung from a good womb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखल्लिका
सु + -खल्लिका luxurious life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुग|सुगं|सुगः
सु + -ग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 going gracefully or well.<BR>—2 graceful, elegant.<BR>—3 easy of access; अकृत्यं मन्यते कृत्यमगम्यं मन्यते सुगम् । अभक्ष्यं<BR> मन्यते भक्ष्यं स्त्रीवाक्यप्रेरितो नरः ॥ Pt. 2. 148.<BR>—4 intelligible, easy to be understood (opp. दुर्ग).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगः|सुग|सुगं
सु + -ग + .({@-गः@}) a Gandharva; गीतैः सुगा वाद्यधराश्च वाद्यकैः Bhāg. 10. 12. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगम्
सु + -ग + .({@-गम्@})<BR>—1 ordure, feces.<BR>—2 happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगण्
सु + -गण् <i>m.</i> a good calculator; L. D. B. ━<i>a.</i> counting well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगणकः|सुगणक
सु + -गणकः a good calculator or astronomer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगत|सुगतः
सु + -गत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-gone or passed.<BR>—2 well-bestowed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगतः|सुगत
सु + -गत + .({@-तः@}) an epithet of Buddha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगतिः|सुगति
सु + -गतिः<BR>—1 Welfare, happiness.<BR>—2 a secure refuge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धः|सुगन्ध|सुगंध|सुगन्धं
सु + -गन्धः<BR>—1 fragrance, odour, perfume.<BR>—2 sulphur.<BR>—3 a trader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धम्
सु + -गन्धः + .({@-न्धम्@})<BR>—1 sandal.<BR>—2 small cumin seed.<BR>—3 a blue lotus.<BR>—4 a kind of fragrant grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धा
सु + -गन्धः + .({@-न्धा@}) sacred basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धकः|सुगन्धक|सुगंधक
सु + -गन्धकः<BR>—1 sulphur.<BR>—2 the red <i>Tulasee</i>.<BR>—3 the orange.<BR>—4 a kind of gourd.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">Page1686-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1685-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धमूला
सु + -गन्धमूला a land-growing lotus-plant; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धारः|सुगन्धार
सु + -गन्धारः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धि|सुगंधि|सुगन्धिः
सु + -गन्धि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 sweet-smelling, fragrant, redolent with perfumes.<BR>—2 virtuous, pious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धिः|सुगन्धि|सुगंधि
सु + -गन्धि + .({@-न्धिः@})<BR>—1 perfume, fragrance.<BR>—2 the Supreme Being.<BR>—3 a kind of sweet-smelling mango.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धि|सुगंधि|सुगन्धिः
सु + -गन्धि + .({@-न्धि@} <i>n.</i>)<BR>—1 the root of long pepper.<BR>—2 a kind of fragrant grass.<BR>—3 coriander seed. ˚त्रिफला<BR>—1 nutmeg.<BR>—2 areca nut.<BR>—3 cloves. ˚मूलम् the root Uśīra. ˚मूषिका the musk-rat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धिकः|सुगन्धिक|सुगंधिक|सुगन्धिकं
सु + -गन्धिकः<BR>—1 incense.<BR>—2 sulphur.<BR>—3 a kind of rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगन्धिकम्
सु + -गन्धिकः + .({@-कम्@}) the white lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगम|सुगमः
सु + -गम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 easy of access, accessible.<BR>—2 easy.<BR>—3 plain, intelligible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगरम्
सु + -गरम् cinnabar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगहना
सु + -गहना an enclosure round a place of sacrifice to exclude profane<BR> access. ˚वृत्तिः <i>f.</i> the same as above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगात्री
सु + -गात्री a beautiful woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगृद्ध
सु + -गृद्ध <i>a.</i> intensely longing for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगृह|सुगृहः
सु + -गृह <i>a.</i> (-ही <i>f.</i>)<BR> having a beautiful house or abode, well-lodged; सुगृही<BR> निर्गृहीकृता Pt. 1. 390.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुगृहीत|सुगृहीतः
सु + -गृहीत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 held well or firmly, grasped.<BR>—2 used or applied properly or auspiciously. ˚नामन् <i>a.</i> —1 one whose<BR> name is auspiciously invoked, one whose name it is auspicious to utter<BR> (as Bali, Yudhiṣṭhira), a term used as a respectful mode of speaking;<BR> सुगृहीतनाम्नः भट्टगोपालस्य पौत्रः Māl. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुग्रासः|सुग्रास
सु + -ग्रासः a dainty morsel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुग्रीव|सुग्रीवः
सु + -ग्रीव <i>a.</i> having a beautiful neck.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुग्रीवः|सुग्रीव
सु + -ग्रीव + .({@-वः@})<BR>—1 a hero.<BR>—2 a swan.<BR>—3 a kind of weapon.<BR>—4 N. of one of the four horses of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—5 of Śiva.<BR>—6 of Indra.<BR>—7 N. of a monkey-chief and brother of Vāli. [By the advice of Kabandha,<BR> Rāma went to Sugrīva who told him how his brother had treated him and<BR> besought his assistance in recovering his wife, promising at the same<BR> time that he would assist Rāma in recovering his wife Sīta. Rāma, therefore,<BR> killed Vāli, and installed Sugrīva on the throne. He then assisted Rāma<BR> with his hosts of monkeys in conquering Rāvaṇa, and recovering Sīta.]<BR> ˚ईशः N. of Rāma; सुग्रीवेशः कटी पातु Rāmarakṣā 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुग्ल|सुग्लः
सु + -ग्ल <i>a.</i> very weary or fatigued.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुघोष|सुघोषः
सु + -घोष <i>a.</i> having a pleasant sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुघोषः|सुघोष
सु + -घोष + .({@-षः@}) N. of the conch of Nakula; नकुलः सहदेवश्च सुघोषमणिपुष्पकौ Bg. 1. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचक्षुस्
सु + -चक्षुस् <i>a.</i> having good eyes, seeing well. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a discerning or wise man, learned man.<BR>—2 the glomerous fig-tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचरित
सु + -चरित, -चरित्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-conducted, well-behaved; वृषभैकादशा गाश्च दद्यात् सुचरितव्रतः Ms. 11. 116.<BR>—2 moral, virtuous; तान् विदित्वा सुचरितैर्गूढैस्तत्कर्मकारिभिः Ms. 9. 261.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचरित्र
सु + -चरित, -चरित्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-conducted, well-behaved; वृषभैकादशा गाश्च दद्यात् सुचरितव्रतः Ms. 11. 116.<BR>—2 moral, virtuous; तान् विदित्वा सुचरितैर्गूढैस्तत्कर्मकारिभिः Ms. 9. 261.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचरितम्
सु + -चरित, -चरित्र + .({@-तम्, -त्रम्@})<BR>—1 good conduct, virtuous deeds.<BR>—2 merit; तव सुचरितमङ्गुलीय नूनं प्रतनु Ś. 6. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचरित्रम्
सु + -चरित, -चरित्र + .({@-तम्, -त्रम्@})<BR>—1 good conduct, virtuous deeds.<BR>—2 merit; तव सुचरितमङ्गुलीय नूनं प्रतनु Ś. 6. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचरिता
सु + -चरित, -चरित्र + .({@-ता, -त्रा@}) a well-conducted, devoted, and virtuous wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचरित्रा
सु + -चरित, -चरित्र + .({@-ता, -त्रा@}) a well-conducted, devoted, and virtuous wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचर्मन्|सुचर्म्मन्
सु + -चर्मन् <i>m.</i> the Bhūrja tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचित्रकः|सुचित्रक
सु + -चित्रकः<BR>—1 a king-fisher.<BR>—2 a kind of speckled snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचित्रा
सु + -चित्रा a kind of gourd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचिन्ता|सुचिंता
सु + -चिन्ता, -चिन्तनम् deep thought, deep reflection or consideration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचिन्तनम्
सु + -चिन्ता, -चिन्तनम् deep thought, deep reflection or consideration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचिरम्
सु + -चिरम् <i>ind.</i> for a very long time, very long.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचिरायुस्
सु + -चिरायुस् <i>m.</i> a god, deity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचुटी
सु + -चुटी a pair of nippers or tongs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचेतस्
सु + -चेतस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-minded.<BR>—2 wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचेतीकृत
सु + -चेतीकृत <i>a.</i> with the heart satiated; well-disposed; ततः<BR> सुचेतीकृतपौरभृत्यः Bk. 3. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुचेलकः|सुचेलक
सु + -चेलकः a fine cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुच्छद
सु + -च्छद <i>a.</i> having beautiful leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुच्छत्रः|सुच्छत्र|सुछत्त्र
सु + -छत्रः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुच्छत्रा
सु + -छत्रः + .({@-त्रा@}) the river Sutlej.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुजन|सुजनः
सु + -जन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 good, virtuous,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">Page1686-2</a>]<BR> respectable.<BR>—2 kind, benevolent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुजनः|सुजन
सु + -जन + .({@-नः@})<BR>—1 a good or virtuous man, benevolent man.<BR>—2 a gentleman.<BR>—3 N. of Indraʼs charioteer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुजनता
सु + -जनता<BR>—1 goodness, kindness, benevolence, virtue; ऐश्वर्यस्य विभूषणं सुजनता Bh. 2. 82.<BR>—2 a number of good men. —3 bravery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुजन्मन्
सु + -जन्मन् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 of noble or respectable birth; या कौमुदी नयनयोर्भवतः सुजन्मा Māl. 1. 34.<BR>—2 legitimate, lawfully born.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुजलम्
सु + -जलम् a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुजल्पः|सुजल्प
सु + -जल्पः<BR>—1 a good speech.<BR>—2 a kind of speech thus described by Ujjvalamaṇi; यत्रार्जवात् सगाम्भीर्यं<BR> सदैन्यं सहचापलम् । सोत्कण्ठं च हरिः स्पृष्टः स सुजल्पो निगद्यते ॥<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुजात
सु + -जात <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-grown, tall.<BR>—2 well made or produced.<BR>—3 of high birth.<BR>—4 beautiful, lovely; सुजातं कल्याणी भवतु कृतकृत्यः स च युवा<BR> Māl. 1. 16; R. 3. 8.<BR>—5 very delicate; खिद्यत् सुजाताङ्घ्रितलामुन्निन्ये प्रेयसीं प्रियः Bhāg. 10. 30. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुडीनकम्
सु + -डीनकम् a kind of flight of birds; Mb. 8. 41. 27 (com. पश्चाद्<BR> गतिः पराडीनं स्वर्गगं सुडीनकम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतनु|सुतनुः
सु + -तनु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having a beautiful body.<BR>—2 extremely delicate or slender, very thin.<BR>—3 emaciated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतनुः|सुतनु
सु + -तनु + .({@-नुः, -नूः@} <i>f.</i>) a lovely lady; एताः सुतनु मुखं ते सख्यः<BR> पश्यन्ति हेमकूटगताः V. 1. 10; Ś. 7. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतनूः
सु + -तनु + .({@-नुः, -नूः@} <i>f.</i>) a lovely lady; एताः सुतनु मुखं ते सख्यः<BR> पश्यन्ति हेमकूटगताः V. 1. 10; Ś. 7. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतन्त्री
सु + -तन्त्री <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-stringed.<BR>—2 (hence) melodious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतपस्
सु + -तपस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 one who practises austere penance; a वानप्रस्थ; स्विष्टिः स्वधीतिः<BR> सुतपा लोकाञ्जयति यावतः Mb. 12. 71. 30.<BR>—2 having great heat. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 an ascetic, a devotee, hermit, an anchorite.<BR>—2 the sun. ━(<i>n.</i>) an austere penance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतप्त
सु + -तप्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 greatly harassed, afflicted.<BR>—2 very severe (as a penance); तपसैव सुतप्तेन मुच्यन्ते किल्बिषात्ततः Ms. 11. 239.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतमाम्
सु + -तमाम् <i>ind.</i> most excellently, best.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतराम्
सु + -तराम् <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 better, more excellently.<BR>—2 execedingly, very, very much, excessively; तया दुहित्रा सुतरां सवित्री<BR> स्फुरत्प्रभामण्डलया चकाशे Ku. 1. 24; सुतरां दयालुः R. 2. 53, 7. 21, 14. 9, 18. 24.<BR>—3 more so, much more so; मय्यप्यास्था न ते चेत्त्वयि मम सुतरामेष<BR> राजन् गतोऽस्मि Bh. 3. 30.<BR>—4 consequently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतर्दनः|सुतर्दन|सुतर्द्दन|सुतर्द्दनः
सु + -तर्दनः the (Indian) cuckoo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतर्मन्
सु + -तर्मन् <i>a.</i> good for crossing over; सुतर्माणमधिनावं रुहेम<BR> Ait. Br. 1. 13; (cf. also यज्ञो वै सुतर्मा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतलम्
सु + -तलम्<BR>—1 ‘immense depth’, N. of one of the seven regions below the earth; see<BR> पाताल; (याहि) सुतलं स्वर्गिभिः प्रार्थ्यं ज्ञातिभिः परिवारितः<BR> Bhāg. 8. 22. 33.<BR>—2 the foundation of a large building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतान
सु + -तान <i>a.</i> melodious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतार|सुतारः
सु + -तार <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very bright.<BR>—2 very loud; सुतारैः फूत्कारैः शिव शिव शिवेति प्रतनुमः Bh. 3. 2.<BR>—3 having a beautiful pupil (as an eye).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतारः|सुतार
सु + -तार + .({@-रः@}) a kind of perfume.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतारा
सु + -तार + .({@-रा@}) (in Sāṃkhya) one of the nine kinds of acquiescence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतिक्तकः|सुतिक्तक
सु + -तिक्तकः the coral tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतीक्ष्ण|सुतीक्ष्णः
सु + -तीक्ष्ण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very sharp.<BR>—2 very pungent.<BR>—3 acutely painful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतीक्ष्णः|सुतीक्ष्ण
सु + -तीक्ष्ण + .({@-क्ष्णः@})<BR>—1 the Śigru tree.<BR>—2 N. of a sage; नाम्ना सुतीक्ष्णश्चरितेन दान्तः R. 13. 41. ˚दशनः<BR> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतीर्थः|सुतीर्थ
सु + -तीर्थः<BR>—1 a good preceptor.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva. ━<i>a.</i> easily crossed or traversed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतुङ्ग|सुतुंग|सुतुङ्गः
सु + -तुङ्ग <i>a.</i> very lofty or tall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतुङ्गः|सुतुङ्ग|सुतुंग
सु + -तुङ्ग + .({@-ङ्गः@})<BR>—1 the cocoa-nut tree.<BR>—2 the culminating point of a planet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतुमुल
सु + -तुमुल <i>a.</i> very loud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतेजन|सुतेजनः
सु + -तेजन <i>a.</i> well-pointed, sharpened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतेजनः|सुतेजन
सु + -तेजन + .({@-नः@}) a well-pointed arrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुतेजस्
सु + -तेजस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very sharp.<BR>—2 very bright, or splendid.<BR>—3 very mighty. ━(<i>m.</i>) a worshipper of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदक्षिण
सु + -दक्षिण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very sincere or upright.<BR>—2 liberal or rich in sacrificial<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">Page1687-1</a>]<BR> gifts; यज्ञैर्भूरिसुदक्षिणैः मुविहितैः संप्राप्यते यत् फलम् Pt. 1. 310.<BR>—3 very skilful.<BR>—4 very polite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदक्षिणा
सु + -दक्षिण + .({@-णा@}) N. of the wife of Dilīpa; तस्य दाक्षिण्यरूढेन नाम्ना<BR> मगधवंशजा पत्नी सुदक्षिणेत्यासीत् R. 1. 31, 3. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1686-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदण्डः|सुदण्ड|सुदंड
सु + -दण्डः a cane, ratan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदत्|सुदन्त्
सु + -दत् <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> having handsome teeth; जगाद भूयः सुदतीं सुनन्दा R. 6. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदन्तः|सुदन्त|सुदंत
सु + -दन्तः<BR>—1 a good tooth.<BR>—2 an actor, a dancer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदन्ती|सुदंती
सु + -दन्तः + .({@-न्ती@}) the female elephant of the north-west quarter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदर्श
सु + -दर्श <i>a.</i> lovely, gracious-looking; सुदर्शः स्थूललक्ष्यश्च<BR> न भ्रश्येत सदा श्रियः Mb. 12. 56. 19 (com. सुदर्शः प्रसन्नवक्त्रः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदर्शन|सुदर्शनं|सुदर्शनः
सु + -दर्शन <i>a.</i> (-ना or -नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 good-looking, beautiful, handsome. —2 easily seen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदर्शनः|सुदर्शन|सुदर्शनं
सु + -दर्शन + .({@-नः@}) the discus of Viṣṇu; as in कृष्णोऽप्यसुदर्शनः K.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR>—3 of mount Meru.<BR>—4 a vulture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदर्शनी
सु + -दर्शन + .({@-नी, -नम्@}) N. of Amarāvatī, Indraʼs capital.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदर्शनम्
सु + -दर्शन + .({@-नी, -नम्@}) N. of Amarāvatī, Indraʼs capital.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदर्शनम्
सु + -दर्शन + .({@-नम्@}) N. of Jambudvīpa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदर्शना
सु + -दर्शना<BR>—1 a handsome woman.<BR>—2 a woman.<BR>—3 an order, a command.<BR>—4 a kind of drug.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदास्
सु + -दास् <i>a.</i> very bountiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदान्तः|सुदान्त
सु + -दान्तः a Buddhist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदामन्
सु + -दामन् <i>a.</i> one who gives liberally. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a cloud.<BR>—2 a mountain.<BR>—3 the sea.<BR>—4 N. of Indraʼs elephant.<BR>—5 N. of a very poor Brāhmaṇa who came to Dvārakā with only a small<BR> quantity of parched rice as a present to his friend Kṛṣṇa, and was<BR> raised by him to wealth and glory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदायः|सुदाय
सु + -दायः<BR>—1 a good or auspicious gift.<BR>—2 a special gift given on particular solemn occasions.<BR>—3 one who offers such a gift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदिनम्
सु + -दिनम्<BR>—1 a happy or auspicious day.<BR>—2 a fine day or weather (opp. दुर्दिनम्); so सुदिनाहम् in the same sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदिह्
सु + -दिह् <i>a.</i> well-polished, bright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदीर्घ|सुदीर्घः
सु + -दीर्घ <i>a.</i> very long or extended.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदीर्घा
सु + -दीर्घ + .({@-र्घा@}) a kind of cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदुराधर्ष
सु + -दुराधर्ष <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very hard to get.<BR>—2 quite, intolerable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदुरावर्त
सु + -दुरावर्त <i>a.</i> very hard to be convinced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदुरासद
सु + -दुरासद <i>a.</i> unapproachable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदुर्जर
सु + -दुर्जर <i>a.</i> very difficult to be digested.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदुर्मनस्
सु + -दुर्मनस् <i>a.</i> very troubled in mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदुर्मर्ष
सु + -दुर्मर्ष <i>a.</i> quite intolerable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदुर्लभ|सुदुर्ल्लभः
सु + -दुर्लभ <i>a.</i> very scarce or rare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदुश्चर|सुदुश्चरः
सु + -दुश्चर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 inaccessible.<BR>—2 very painful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदुश्चिकित्स
सु + -दुश्चिकित्स <i>a.</i> very difficult to be cured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदुष्प्रभः|सुदुष्प्रभ
सु + -दुष्प्रभः a chameleon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदूर
सु + -दूर <i>a.</i> very distant or remote. ({@सुदूरम्@} means<BR>—1 to a great distance.<BR>—2 to a very high degree, very much; सुदूरं पीडयेत् कामः शरद्गुणनिरन्तरः<BR> Rām. 4. 30. 12. {@सुदूरात्@} ‘from afar, from a distance’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदृढ|सुदृढं
सु + -दृढ <i>a.</i> very firm or hard, compact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदृश्
सु + -दृश् <i>a.</i> having beautiful eyes. ━(<i>f.</i>) a pretty woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुदेशिकः|सुदेशिक
सु + -देशिकः a good guide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधन्वन्
सु + -धन्वन् <i>a.</i> having an excellent bow. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a good archer or bowman.<BR>—2 Ananta, the great serpent.<BR>—3 N. of Viśvakarman. ˚आचार्यः a mixed caste; वैश्यात्तु जायते व्रात्यात्<BR> सुधन्वाचार्य एव च Ms. 10. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधर्मन्|सुधर्म्मन्
सु + -धर्मन् <i>a.</i> attentive to duties. ━(<i>f.</i>) the council or assembly<BR> of gods. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 the hall or palace of Indra.<BR>—2 one diligent in properly maintaining his family.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधर्मा|सुधर्म्मा
सु + -धर्मा, -धर्मी<BR>—1 the council or assembly of gods (देवसभा); ययावुदीरितालोकः<BR> सुधर्मानवमां सभाम् R. 17. 27.<BR>—2 (सुधर्मा) N. of Dvārakā; दिवि भुव्यन्तरिक्षे च महोत्पातान् समुत्थितान् ।<BR> दृष्ट्वासीनान् सुधर्मायां कृष्णः प्राह यदूनिदम् ॥ Bhāg. 11. 30. 4, 1. 14. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधर्मी|सुधर्म्मी
सु + -धर्मा, -धर्मी<BR>—1 the council or assembly of gods (देवसभा); ययावुदीरितालोकः<BR> सुधर्मानवमां सभाम् R. 17. 27.<BR>—2 (सुधर्मा) N. of Dvārakā; दिवि भुव्यन्तरिक्षे च महोत्पातान् समुत्थितान् ।<BR> दृष्ट्वासीनान् सुधर्मायां कृष्णः प्राह यदूनिदम् ॥ Bhāg. 11. 30. 4, 1. 14. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधात
सु + -धात <i>a.</i> well cleaned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधार
सु + -धार <i>a.</i> well-pointed (as an arrow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधित
सु + -धित <i>a.</i> Ved.<BR>—1 perfect, secure.<BR>—2 kind, good.<BR>—3 happy, prosperous.<BR>—4 well-aimed or directed<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">Page1687-2</a>]<BR> (as a weapon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधी
सु + -धी <i>a.</i> having a good understanding, wise, clever, intelligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधीः
सु + -धी + .({@-धीः@}) a wise or intelligent man, learned man or <i>pandit</i>.<BR>━(<i>f.</i>) a good understanding, good sense, intelligence. ˚उपास्यः<BR>—1 a particular kind of royal palace.<BR>—2 N. of an attendant on Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुध्युपास्यम्
सु + -धी + .({@-स्यम्@}) the club of Balarāma. ˚उपास्या<BR>—1 a woman.<BR>—2 N. of Umā, or of one of her female companions.<BR>—3 a sort of pigment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुधूम्रवर्णा
सु + -धूम्रवर्णा one of the seven tongues of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनन्दम्
सु + -नन्दम् N. of Balarāmaʼs club; प्रतिजग्राह बलवान् सुनन्देनाहनच्च<BR> तम् Bhāg. 10. 67. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनन्दः|सुनन्द|सुनन्दं
सु + -नन्दः a kind of royal palace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनन्दा|सुनंदा
सु + -नन्दा<BR>—1 N. of a woman.<BR>—2 N. of Pārvatī; L. D. B.<BR>—3 yellow pigment; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनयः|सुनय
सु + -नयः<BR>—1 good conduct.<BR>—2 good policy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनयन|सुनयनः
सु + -नयन <i>a.</i> having beautiful eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनयनः|सुनयन
सु + -नयन + .({@-नः@}) a deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनयना
सु + -नयन + .({@-ना@})<BR>—1 a woman having beautiful eyes.<BR>—2 a woman in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनाभ|सुनाभः
सु + -नाभ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having a beautiful navel.<BR>—2 having a good nave or centre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनाभः|सुनाभ
सु + -नाभ + .({@-भः@})<BR>—1 a mountain.<BR>—2 the Maināka mountain, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनाभम्
सु + -नाभ + .({@-भम्@}) a wheel, discus (सुदर्शन); ये संयुगेऽचक्षत तार्क्ष्यपुत्रमंसे<BR> सुनाभायुधमापतन्तम् Bhāg. 3. 2. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनालम्
सु + -नालम् a red water-lily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनिःष्ठित
सु + -निःष्ठित <i>a.</i> quite ready.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनिभृत
सु + -निभृत <i>a.</i> very lonely or private.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनिभृतम्
सु + -निभृत + .({@-तम्@}) <i>ind.</i> very secretly or closely, very narrowly, privately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनिरूढ
सु + -निरूढ <i>a.</i> well-purged by an injection; Caraka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनिरूहणम्
सु + -निरूहणम् a good purgative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनिर्णिक्त
सु + -निर्णिक्त <i>a.</i> well polished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनिश्चलः|सुनिश्चल
सु + -निश्चलः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनिषण्णः|सुनिषण्ण|सुनिषण्णं
सु + -निषण्णः + ({@-कः@}) the herb Marsilea Quadrifolia (Mar. कुरडू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनिषण्णकः|सुनिषण्णक|सुनिषण्णकं
सु + -निषण्णः + ({@-कः@}) the herb Marsilea Quadrifolia (Mar. कुरडू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनिहित
सु + -निहित <i>a.</i> well-established.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनीत
सु + -नीत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-conducted, well-behaved.<BR>—2 polite, civil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनीतम्
सु + -नीत + .({@-तम्@})<BR>—1 good conduct or behaviour.<BR>—2 good policy or prudence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनीतिः|सुनीति
सु + -नीतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 good conduct, good manners, propriety.<BR>—2 good policy.<BR>—3 N. of the mother of Dhruva, q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनीथ|सुनीथः
सु + -नीथ <i>a.</i> well-disposed, well-conducted, righteous, virtuous, good.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनीथः|सुनीथ
सु + -नीथ + .({@-थः@})<BR>—1 a Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—2 N. of Śiśupāla, q. v.; तस्मिन्नभ्यर्चिते कृष्णे सुनीथः शत्रुकर्षणः Mb. 1. 39. 11.<BR>—3 Ved. a good leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनील|सुनीलं|सुनीलः
सु + -नील <i>a.</i> very black or blue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनीलः|सुनील|सुनीलं
सु + -नील + .({@-लः@}) the pomegranate tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनीला
सु + -नील + .({@-ला@}) common flax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनीलम्
सु + -नील + .({@-लम्@}), {@-नीलकः@}<BR> a blue gem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनु
सु + -नु <i>n.</i> water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुनेत्र
सु + -नेत्र <i>a.</i> having good or beautiful eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपक्व|सुपक्वः
सु + -पक्व <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-cooked.<BR>—2 thoroughly matured or ripe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपक्वः|सुपक्व
सु + -पक्व + .({@-क्वः@}) a sort of fragrant mango.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपठ
सु + -पठ <i>a.</i> legible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपत्नी
सु + -पत्नी a woman having a good husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपत्र|सुपत्रं|सुपत्रः
सु + -पत्र <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having beautiful wings.<BR>—2 well-feathered (an arrow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपथः|सुपथ
सु + -पथः<BR>—1 a good road.<BR>—2 a good course.<BR>—3 good conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपथिन्
सु + -पथिन् <i>m.</i> (nom. sing. सुपन्थाः) a good road.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपद्मा
सु + -पद्मा orris root.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपरीक्षित
सु + -परीक्षित <i>a.</i> well-examined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपर्ण|सुपर्णः
सु + -पर्ण <i>a.</i> (-र्णा or -र्णी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 well-winged; तं भूतनिलयं देवं सुपर्णमुपधावत Bhāg. 8. 1. 11.<BR>—2 having good or beautiful leaves.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपर्णः|सुपर्ण
सु + -पर्ण + .({@-र्णः@})<BR>—1 a ray of the sun.<BR>—2 a class of bird-like beings of a semi-divine character.<BR>—3 any supernatural bird.<BR>—4 an epithet of Garuḍa; ततः सुपर्णव्रजपक्षजन्मा नानागतिर्मण्डलयन्<BR> जवेन Ki. 16. 44.<BR>—5 a cock.<BR>—6 the knowing (ज्ञानरूप); देहस्त्वचित्पुरुषोऽयं सुपर्णः क्रुध्येत<BR> कस्मै नहि कर्ममूलम् Bhāg. 11. 23. 55.<BR>—7 Any bird; द्वा सुपर्णा सयुजा सखाया समानं वृक्षं परिषस्वजाते<BR> Muṇḍ. 3. 1. 1. ˚केतुः N. of Viṣṇu; तमकुण्ठमुखाः सुपर्णकेतोरिषवः<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">Page1688-1</a>]<BR> क्षिप्तमिषुव्रजं परेण Śi. 20. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1687-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपर्णकः|सुपर्णक
सु + -पर्णकः = सुपर्ण.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपर्णा
सु + -पर्णा, -पर्णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a number of lotuses.<BR>—2 a pool abounding in lotuses.<BR>—3 N. of the mother of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपर्णी
सु + -पर्णा, -पर्णी <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a number of lotuses.<BR>—2 a pool abounding in lotuses.<BR>—3 N. of the mother of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपर्यवदात
सु + -पर्यवदात <i>a.</i> very clean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपर्याप्त|सुपर्य्याप्त
सु + -पर्याप्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very spacious; तस्य मध्ये सुपर्याप्तं कारयेद् गृहमात्मनः Ms. 7. 76.<BR>—2 well-fitted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपर्वन्|सुपर्व्वन्
सु + -पर्वन् <i>a.</i> well-jointed, having many joints or knots. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a bamboo.<BR>—2 an arrow.<BR>—3 a god, deity; विहाय हा सर्वसुपर्वनायकम् N. 4. 90, 14. 41, 76.<BR>—4 a special lunar day (as the day of full or new moon, and the 8th and 14th<BR> day of each fortnight).<BR>—5 smoke. ━(<i>f.</i>) white Dūrvā grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपलायित
सु + -पलायित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 completely fled or run away.<BR>—2 skilfully retreated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपाक्यम्
सु + -पाक्यम् a kind of medicinal salt (Mar. बिडलोण).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपात्रम्
सु + -पात्रम्<BR>—1 a good or suitable vessel, worthy receptacle.<BR>—2 a fit or competent person, any one well-fitted for an office, an able person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपाद्
सु + -पाद् (-पाद् or -पदी <i>f.</i>)<BR> having good or handsome feet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपार्श्वः|सुपार्श्व
सु + -पार्श्वः<BR>—1 the waved-leaf fig-tree (प्लक्ष).<BR>—2 N. of the son of Sampāti, elder brother of Jaṭāyu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपालि
सु + -पालि <i>a.</i> distinguished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपीतम्
सु + -पीतम्<BR>—1 a carrot.<BR>—2 yellow sandal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपीतः|सुपीत|सुपीतं
सु + -पीतम् + .({@-तः@}) the fifth Muhūrta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपुंसी
सु + -पुंसी a woman having a good husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपुरम्
सु + -पुरम् a strong fortress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपुष्प|सुपुष्पं|सुपुष्पः
सु + -पुष्प <i>a.</i> (-ष्पा or -ष्पी <i>f.</i>)<BR> having beautiful flowers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपुष्पः|सुपुष्प|सुपुष्पं
सु + -पुष्प + .({@-ष्पः@})<BR>—1 the coral tree.<BR>—2 the Śirīṣa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपुष्पी
सु + -पुष्प + .({@-ष्पी@}) the plantain tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपुष्पम्
सु + -पुष्प + .({@-ष्पम्@})<BR>—1 cloves.<BR>—2 the menstrual excretion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपुष्पित
सु + -पुष्पित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well blossomed, being in full flower. —2 having the hair thrilling or bristling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपूर|सुपूरः
सु + -पूर <i>a.</i> —1 easy to be filled; सुपूरा स्यात् कुनदिका सुपूरो<BR> मूषिकाञ्जलिः Pt. 1. 25.<BR>—2 well-filling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपूरः|सुपूर
सु + -पूर + .({@-रः@}) a kind of citron (बीजपूर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपूरकः|सुपूरक
सु + -पूरकः the Baka-puṣpa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुपेशस्
सु + -पेशस् <i>a.</i> beautiful, tender; रत्नानां पद्मरागोऽस्मि पद्मकोशः<BR> सुपेशसाम् Bhāg. 11. 16. 30. ˚कृत् <i>m.</i> a kind of fly; Bhāg. 11. 7. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रकाश
सु + -प्रकाश <i>a.</i><BR>—1 manifest, apparent; ज्येष्ठे मासि नयेत् सीमां सुप्रकाशेषु सेतुषु Ms. 8. 245.<BR>—2 public, notorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रतर्कः|सुप्रतर्क
सु + -प्रतर्कः a sound judgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रतिभा
सु + -प्रतिभा spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रतिष्ठ
सु + -प्रतिष्ठ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 standing well.<BR>—2 very celebrated, renowned, glorious, famous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रतिष्ठा
सु + -प्रतिष्ठ + .({@-ष्ठा@})<BR>—1 good position.<BR>—2 good reputation, fame, celebrity.<BR>—3 establishment, erection.<BR>—4 installation, consecration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रतिष्ठित|सुप्रतिष्ठितः
सु + -प्रतिष्ठित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-established.<BR>—2 consecrated.<BR>—3 celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रतिष्ठितः|सुप्रतिष्ठित
सु + -प्रतिष्ठित + .({@-तः@}) the Udumbara tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रतिष्णात
सु + -प्रतिष्णात <i>a.</i><BR>—1 thoroughly purified.<BR>—2 well-versed in.<BR>—3 well-investigated, clearly ascertained or determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रतीक|सुप्रतीकः
सु + -प्रतीक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having a beautiful shape, lovely, handsome; भगवान् भागवतवात्सल्यतया<BR> सुप्रतीकः Bhāg. 5. 3. 2.<BR>—2 having a beautiful trunk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रतीकः|सुप्रतीक
सु + -प्रतीक + .({@-कः@})<BR>—1 an epithet of Kāmadeva.<BR>—2 of Śiva.<BR>—3 of the elephant of the north-east quarter.<BR>—4 An honest man; स्तेयोपायैर्विरचितकृतिः सुप्रतीको यथास्ते Bhāg. 10. 8. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रपाणम्
सु + -प्रपाणम् a good tank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रभ|सुप्रभः
सु + -प्रभ <i>a.</i> very brilliant, glorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रभा
सु + -प्रभ + .({@-भा@}) one of the seven tongues of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रभातम्
सु + -प्रभातम्<BR>—1 an auspicious dawn or day-break; दिष्टपा सुप्रभातमद्य यदयं देवो दृष्टः U. 6.<BR>—2 the earliest dawn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रभावः|सुप्रभाव
सु + -प्रभावः omnipotence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रमाण
सु + -प्रमाण <i>a.</i> large-sized.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रयुक्तशरः|सुप्रयुक्तशर
सु + -प्रयुक्तशरः a skilful archer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रयोगः|सुप्रयोग
सु + -प्रयोगः<BR>—1 good management or application.<BR>—2 close contact.<BR>—3 dexterity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रलापः|सुप्रलाप
सु + -प्रलापः good<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">Page1688-2</a>]<BR> speech, eloquence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रसन्नः|सुप्रसन्न
सु + -प्रसन्नः N. of Kubera.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रसाद|सुप्रसादः
सु + -प्रसाद <i>a.</i> very gracious or propitious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रसादः|सुप्रसाद
सु + -प्रसाद + .({@-दः@}) N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रातम्
सु + -प्रातम् a fine morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रिय|सुप्रियः
सु + -प्रिय <i>a.</i> very much liked, agreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रियः|सुप्रिय
सु + -प्रिय + .({@-यः@}) (in prosody) a foot of two short syllables.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रिया
सु + -प्रिय + .({@-या@})<BR>—1 a charming woman.<BR>—2 a beloved mistress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुप्रौढा
सु + -प्रौढा a marriageable girl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुफल|सुफलः
सु + -फल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very fruitful, very productive.<BR>—2 very fertile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुफलः|सुफल
सु + -फल + .({@-लः@})<BR>—1 the pomegranate tree.<BR>—2 the jujube.<BR>—3 the Karṇikāra tree.<BR>—4 a kind of bean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुफला
सु + -फल + .({@-ला@})<BR>—1 a pumpkin, gourd.<BR>—2 the plantain tree.<BR>—3 a variety of brown grape.<BR>—4 colocynth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुफेनः|सुफेन
सु + -फेनः a cuttle-fish bone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबन्धः|सुबन्ध|सुबंध
सु + -बन्धः sesamum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबभ्रु
सु + -बभ्रु <i>a.</i> dark-brown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबल|सुबलः
सु + -बल <i>a.</i> very powerful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबलः|सुबल
सु + -बल + .({@-लः@})<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 N. of the father of Śakuni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबान्धवः|सुबान्धव
सु + -बान्धवः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबाल
सु + -बाल <i>a.</i> very childish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबाहु|सुबाहुः
सु + -बाहु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 handsome-armed.<BR>—2 strong-armed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबाहुः|सुबाहु
सु + -बाहु + .({@-हुः@}) N. of a demon, brother of Mārīcha, who had become a demon<BR> by the curse of Agastya. He with Mārīcha began to disturb the sacrifice<BR> of Viśvāmitra, but was defeated by Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa; यः सुबाहुरिति<BR> राक्षसोऽपरस्तत्र तत्र विससर्प मायया R. 11. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबीजम्
सु + -बीजम् good seed; सुबीजं चैव सुक्षेत्रे जातं संपद्यते तथा Ms. 10. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबीजः|सुबीज
सु + -बीजम् + .({@-जः@})<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 the poppy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबोध|सुबोधः
सु + -बोध <i>a.</i> —1 easily apprehended or understood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबोधः|सुबोध
सु + -बोध + .({@-धः@}) good information or advice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुब्रह्मण्यः|सुब्रह्मण्य
सु + -ब्रह्मण्यः<BR>—1 an epithet of Kārtikeya.<BR>—2 N. of one of the sixteen priests employed at a sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभग|सुभगः
सु + -भग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very fortunate or prosperous, happy, blessed, highly favoured.<BR>—2 lovely, charming, beautiful, pretty; न तु ग्रीष्मस्यैवं सुभगमपराद्धं<BR> युवतिषु Ś. 3. 9; Ku. 4. 34; R. 11. 80; Māl. 9.<BR>—3 pleasant, grateful, agreeable, sweet; दिवसाः सुभगादित्याश्छायासलिलदुर्भगाः<BR> Rām. 3. 16. 10; श्रवणसुभग M. 3. 4; Ś. 1. 3.<BR>—4 beloved, liked, amiable, dear; सुमुखि सुभगः पश्यन् स त्वामुपैतु<BR> कृतार्थताम् Gīt. 5.<BR>—5 illustrious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभगः|सुभग
सु + -भग + .({@-गः@})<BR>—1 borax.<BR>—2 the Aśoka tree.<BR>—3 the Champaka tree.<BR>—4 red amaranth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभगम्
सु + -भग + .({@-गम्@}) good fortune. ˚मानिन्, सुभगंमन्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 considering oneself fortunate, amiable, pleasing; वाचालं मां न<BR> खलु सुभगंमन्यभावः करोति Me. 96.<BR>—2 vain, flattering oneself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभगा
सु + -भगा<BR>—1 a woman beloved by her husband, a favourite wife.<BR>—2 an honoured mother.<BR>—3 a kind of wild jasmine.<BR>—4 turmeric.<BR>—5 the Priyaṅgu creeper.<BR>—6 the holy basil.<BR>—7 a woman having her husband alive (सौभाग्यवती); जयशब्दैर्द्विजाग्र्याणां<BR> सुभगानर्तितैस्तथा Mb. 7. 7. 9.<BR>—8 a five-year old girl representing Durgā at festivals.<BR>—9 musk. ˚सुत the son of a favourite wife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभङ्गः|सुभङ्ग|सुभंग
सु + -भङ्गः the cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभटः|सुभट
सु + -भटः a great warrior, champion, soldier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभट्टः|सुभट्ट
सु + -भट्टः a learned man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभद्र|सुभद्रः
सु + -भद्र <i>a.</i> very happy or fortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभद्रः|सुभद्र
सु + -भद्र + .({@-द्रः@}) N. of Viṣṇu; साकं साकम्पमंसे वसति विदधती वासुभद्रं<BR> सुभद्रम् Viṣṇupāda. S. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभद्रा
सु + -भद्र + .({@-द्रा@}) N. of the sister of Balarāma and Kṛṣṇa, married to<BR> Arjuna q. v. She bore to him a son named Abhimanyu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभद्रकः|सुभद्रक
सु + -भद्रकः<BR>—1 a car for carrying the image of a god.<BR>—2 the Bilva tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभाषित|सुभाषितः
सु + -भाषित <i>a.</i> —1 spoken well or eloquent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभाषितम्
सु + -भाषित + .({@-तम्@})<BR>—1 fine speech, eloquence, learning; जीर्णमङ्गे सुभाषितम् Bh. 3. 2.<BR>—2 a witty saying, an apophthegm,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">Page1689-1</a>]<BR> an apposite saying; सुभाषितेन गीतेन युवतीनां च लीलया । मनो न<BR> भिद्यते यस्य स वै मुक्तोऽथवा पशुः Subhāṣ.<BR>—3 a good remark; बालादपि सुभाषितम् (ग्राह्यम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1688-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभिक्षम्
सु + -भिक्षम्<BR>—1 good alms, successful begging.<BR>—2 abundance of food, an abundant supply of provisions, plenty of corn &c.//<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभीरकः|सुभीरक
सु + -भीरकः the Palāśa tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभीरुकम्
सु + -भीरुकम् silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभूतिः|सुभूति
सु + -भूतिः<BR>—1 well-being, welfare.<BR>—2 the Tittira bird; Gīrvāṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभूतिकः|सुभूतिक
सु + -भूतिकः the Bilva tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभूषणम्
सु + -भूषणम् a type of pavilion where a ceremony is performed on a<BR> wifeʼs perceiving the first signs of conception; सुभूषणाख्यं विप्राणां<BR> योग्यं पुंसवनार्थकम् Māna. 34. 354.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभृत
सु + -भृत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-paid.<BR>—2 heavily laden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभ्रू
सु + -भ्रू <i>a.</i> having beautiful eyebrows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुभ्रूः
सु + -भ्रू + .({@-भ्रूः@} <i>f.</i>) a lovely woman. (<i>N. B.</i> The vocative singular<BR> of this word is strictly सुभ्रूः; but सुभ्रु is used by writers<BR> like Bhaṭṭi, Kālidāsa, and Bhavabhūti; हा पितः क्वासि हे सुभ्रु<BR> Bk. 6. 17; so V. 3. 22; Ku. 5. 43; Māl. 3. 8.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमङ्गल
सु + -मङ्गल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very auspicious.<BR>—2 abounding in sacrifices.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमति|सुमतिः
सु + -मति <i>a.</i> very wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमतिः|सुमति
सु + -मति + .({@-तिः@} <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 a good mind or disposition, kindness, benevolence, friendship.<BR>—2 a favour of the gods.<BR>—3 a gift, blessing.<BR>—4 a prayer, hymn.<BR>—5 a wish or desire.<BR>—6 N. of the wife of Sagara and mother of 60,000 sons.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमदनः|सुमदन
सु + -मदनः the mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमदात्मजा
सु + -मदात्मजा a celestial damsel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमधुरम्
सु + -मधुरम् a very sweet or gentle speech, agreeable words.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमध्य
सु + -मध्य, -मध्यम <i>a.</i> slender-waisted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमध्यम
सु + -मध्य, -मध्यम <i>a.</i> slender-waisted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमध्या
सु + -मध्या, -मध्यमा a graceful woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमध्यमा
सु + -मध्या, -मध्यमा a graceful woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमन|सुमनः
सु + -मन <i>a.</i> very charming, lovely, beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमनः|सुमन
सु + -मन + .({@-नः@})<BR>—1 wheat.<BR>—2 the thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमना
सु + -मन + .({@-ना@}) the great-flowered jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमनस्
सु + -मनस् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 good-minded, of a good disposition, benevolent; शान्तसंकल्पः सुमना<BR> यथा स्याद्वीतमन्युर्गौतमो माभिमृत्यो Kaṭh. 1. 10.<BR>—2 well-pleased, satisfied; (hence सुमनीभू = to be at ease; जिते<BR> नृपारौ सुमनीभवन्ति शब्दायमानान्यशनैरशङ्कम् Bk. 2. 54.). ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a god, divinity.<BR>—2 a learned man.<BR>—3 a student of the Vedas.<BR>—4 wheat.<BR>—5 the Nimba tree. ━(<i>f., n.</i>; said to be pl. only by some) a flower;<BR> मुमुचुर्मुनयो देवाः सुमनांसि मुदान्विताः Bhāg. 10. 3. 7; रमणीय<BR> एष वः सुमनसां संनिवेशः Māl. 1 (where the adjectival sense in 1<BR> is also intended); किं सेव्यते सुमनसां मनसापि गन्धः कस्तूरिकाजननशक्तिभृता<BR> मृगेण R. G.; Śi. 6. 66. ˚वर्णकम् flowers, unguent or perfume<BR> etc. for the body; सा तदाप्रभृति सुमनोवर्णकं नेच्छति Avimārakam 2. ━(<i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 the great-flowered jasmine.<BR>—2 the Mālatī creeper. ˚फलः the wood-apple. ˚फलम् nutmeg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमनस्क
सु + -मनस्क <i>a.</i> cheerful, happy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमन्तु|सुमन्तुः
सु + -मन्तु <i>a.</i><BR>—1 advising well.<BR>—2 very faulty or blameable. ━(<i>m.</i>) a good adviser.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमन्त्रः|सुमन्त्र
सु + -मन्त्रः N. of the charioteer of Daśāratha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमन्दभाज्
सु + -मन्दभाज् <i>a.</i> very unfortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमर्दित
सु + -मर्दित <i>a.</i> much harassed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमर्षण
सु + -मर्षण <i>a.</i> easy to be borne.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमित्रा
सु + -मित्रा N. of one of the wives of Daśāratha and mother of Lakṣmaṇa<BR> and Śatrughna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमुख|सुमुखं|सुमुखः
सु + -मुख <i>a.</i> (-खा or -खी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 having a beautiful face, lovely.<BR>—2 pleasing.<BR>—3 disposed to, eager for; सुरसद्मयानसुमुखी जनता Ki. 6. 42.<BR>—4 favourable, kind.<BR>—5 well-pointed (as an arrow).<BR>—6 ({@सुमुखा@}) having a good entrance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमुखः|सुमुख|सुमुखं
सु + -मुख + .({@-खः@})<BR>—1 a learned man.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">Page1689-2</a>]<BR>—2 an epithet of Garuḍa.<BR>—3 of Gaṇeśa; सुमुखश्चैकदन्तश्च कपिलो गजकर्णकः Maṅgal. S. 1.<BR>—4 of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमुखम्
सु + -मुख + .({@-खम्@})<BR>—1 the scratch of a finger-nail.<BR>—2 a kind of building.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमुखा
सु + -मुख + .({@-खा, -खी@})<BR>—1 a handsome woman.<BR>—2 a mirror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमुखी
सु + -मुख + .({@-खा, -खी@})<BR>—1 a handsome woman.<BR>—2 a mirror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमूलकम्
सु + -मूलकम् a carrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमृत
सु + -मृत <i>a.</i> stone-dead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमेखलः|सुमेखल
सु + -मेखलः the Muñja grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमेधस्
सु + -मेधस् <i>a.</i> having a good understanding, wise, intelligent;<BR> इमे अङ्गिरसः सत्रमासतेऽद्य सुमेधसः Bhāg. 9. 4. 3. ━(<i>m.</i>) a<BR> wise man. ━(<i>f.</i>) heart-pea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुमेरुः|सुमेरु
सु + -मेरुः<BR>—1 the sacred mountain Meru, q. v.<BR>—2 N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुयन्त्रित
सु + -यन्त्रित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-governed.<BR>—2 self-controlled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुयमाः
सु + -यमाः a particular class of gods; जातो रुचेरजनयत् सुयमान्<BR> सुयज्ञ आकूतिसूनुरमरानथ दक्षिणायाम् Bhāg. 2. 7. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुयवसम्
सु + -यवसम् beautiful grass, good pasturage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुयामुनः|सुयामुन
सु + -यामुनः<BR>—1 a palace.<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुयुक्तः|सुयुक्त
सु + -युक्तः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुयोगः|सुयोग
सु + -योगः<BR>—1 a favourable juncture.<BR>—2 good opportunity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुयोधनः|सुयोधन
सु + -योधनः an epithet of Duryodhana q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरक्त|सुरक्तः
सु + -रक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well coloured.<BR>—2 impassioned.<BR>—3 very lovely.<BR>—4 sweet-voiced; सुरक्तगोपीजनगीतनिःस्वने Ki. 4. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरक्तकः|सुरक्तक
सु + -रक्तकः<BR>—1 a kind of red chalk.<BR>—2 a kind of mango tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरङ्गः|सुरङ्ग|सुरंग|सुरङ्गं|सुरंगः
सु + -रङ्गः<BR>—1 good colour.<BR>—2 the orange.<BR>—3 a hole cut in a house (सुरङ्गा also in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरङ्गम्
सु + -रङ्गः + .({@-ङ्गम्@})<BR>—1 red sanders.<BR>—2 vermilion. ˚धातुः red chalk. ˚युज् <i>m.</i> a house-breaker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरङ्गिका
सु + -रङ्गिका the Mūrvā plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरजःफलः|सुरजःफल
सु + -रजःफलः the jack-fruit tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरञ्जनः|सुरञ्जन|सुरंजन
सु + -रञ्जनः the betel-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरत|सुरतं
सु + -रत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 much sported.<BR>—2 playful.<BR>—3 much enjoyed.<BR>—4 compassionate, tender.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरतम्
सु + -रत + .({@-तम्@})<BR>—1 great delight or enjoyment.<BR>—2 copulation, sexual union or intercourse, coition; सुरतमृदिता बालवनिता<BR> Bh. 2. 44. ˚गुरुः the husband; पर्यच्छे सरसि हृतेंऽशुके पयोभिर्लोलाक्षे<BR> सुरतगुरावपत्रपिष्णोः Śi. 8. 46. ˚ताण्डवम् vigorous sexual movements;<BR> अद्यापि तां सुरतताण्डवसूत्रधारीं (स्मरामि) Bil. C. Uttara. 28. ˚ताली<BR>—1 a female messenger, a go-between.<BR>—2 a chaplet, garland for the head. ˚प्रसंगः addiction to amorous<BR> pleasures; कालक्रमेणाथ तयोः प्रवृत्ते स्वरूपयोग्ये सुरतप्रसंगे Ku. 1. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरतिः|सुरति
सु + -रतिः <i>f.</i> great enjoyment or satisfaction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरस|सुरसं|सुरसः
सु + -रस <i>a.</i> well-flavoured, juicy, savoury.<BR>—2 sweet.<BR>—3 elegant (as a composition).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरसः|सुरस|सुरसं
सु + -रस + .({@-सः, -सा@}) the plant सिन्धुवार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरसा
सु + -रस + .({@-सः, -सा@}) the plant सिन्धुवार.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरसा
सु + -रस + .({@-सा@}) N. of Durgā. ({@सा, -सम्@}) the sacred basil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरसम्
सु + -रस + .({@-सम्@})<BR>—1 gum-myrrh.<BR>—2 fragrant grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराजन्
सु + -राजन् <i>a.</i> governed by a good king; सुराज्ञि देशे राजन्वान् Ak. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a good king. —2 a divinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराजिका
सु + -राजिका a small house-lizard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराष्ट्रम्
सु + -राष्ट्रम् N. of a country on the western side of India (Surat).<BR> ˚जम् a kind of poison.<BR>—2 a sort of black bean (Mar. तूर). ˚ब्रह्मः a Brāhmaṇa of Surāṣṭra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरूप|सुरूपं|सुरूपः
सु + -रूप <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-formed, handsome, lovely; सुरूपा कन्या.<BR>—2 wise, learned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरूपः|सुरूप|सुरूपं
सु + -रूप + .({@-पः@}) an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरूहकः|सुरूहक
सु + -रूहकः a horse resembling an ass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरेतस्
सु + -रेतस् <i>n.</i> mental power (चिच्छक्ति); सुरेतसादः पुनराविश्य<BR> चष्टे Bhāg. 5. 7. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरेभ|सुरेभं|सुरेभः
सु + -रेभ <i>a.</i> fine-voiced; स्यन्दना नो चतुरगाः सुरेभा वाविपत्तयः ।<BR> स्यन्दना नो च तुरगाः सुरेभा वा विपत्तयः ॥ Ki. 15. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरेभम्
सु + -रेभ + .({@-भम्@}) tin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलक्षण
सु + -लक्षण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having auspicious or beautiful marks.<BR>—2 fortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलक्षणम्
सु + -लक्षण + .({@-णम्@})<BR>—1 observing, examining carefully, determining, ascertaining.<BR>—2 a good or auspicious mark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलक्षित
सु + -लक्षित <i>a.</i> well determined or ascertained;<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">Page1690-1</a>]<BR> तुलामानं प्रतीमानं सर्वं च स्यात् सुलक्षितम् Ms. 8. 403.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1689-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलग्नः|सुलग्न
सु + -लग्नः, -लग्नम् an auspicious moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलग्नम्
सु + -लग्नः, -लग्नम् an auspicious moment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलभ|सुलभः
सु + -लभ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 easy to be obtained, easy of attainment, attainable, feasible; न<BR> सुलभा सकलेन्दुमुखी च सा V. 2. 9; इदमसुलभवस्तुप्रार्थनादुर्निवारम् 2. 6.<BR>—2 ready for, adapted to, fit, suitable; निष्ठपूतश्चरणोपभोगसुलभो<BR> लाक्षारसः केनचित् Ś. 4. 4.<BR>—3 natural to, proper for; मानुषतासुलभो लघिमा K. ˚कोप <i>a.</i><BR> easily provoked, irascible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलिखित
सु + -लिखित <i>a.</i> well registered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलुलित
सु + -लुलित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 moving playfully.<BR>—2 greatly hurt, injured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलोचन|सुलोचनः
सु + -लोचन <i>a.</i> fine-eyed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलोचनः|सुलोचन
सु + -लोचन + .({@-नः@}) a deer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलोचना
सु + -लोचन + .({@-ना@})<BR>—1 a beautiful woman.<BR>—2 N. of the wife of Indrajit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलोहकम्
सु + -लोहकम् brass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलोहित
सु + -लोहित <i>a.</i> very red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुलोहिता
सु + -लोहित + .({@-ता@}) one of the seven tongues of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवक्त्रम्
सु + -वक्त्रम्<BR>—1 a good face or mouth.<BR>—2 correct utterance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवक्त्रः|सुवक्त्र
सु + -वक्त्रम् + .({@-क्त्रः@}) N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवचनम्
सु + -वचनम्, -वचस् <i>n.</i> eloquence. ━<i>a.</i> eloquent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवचस्
सु + -वचनम्, -वचस् <i>n.</i> eloquence. ━<i>a.</i> eloquent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवयस्
सु + -वयस् <i>f.</i> a hermaphrodite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

