सु + -वर्चकः, -वर्चिकः, -वर्चिका, -वर्चिन् <i>m.</i> natron, alkali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्चिकः|सुवर्चिक|सुवर्च्चिकः
सु + -वर्चकः, -वर्चिकः, -वर्चिका, -वर्चिन् <i>m.</i> natron, alkali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्चिका|सुवर्च्चिका
सु + -वर्चकः, -वर्चिकः, -वर्चिका, -वर्चिन् <i>m.</i> natron, alkali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्चिन्
सु + -वर्चकः, -वर्चिकः, -वर्चिका, -वर्चिन् <i>m.</i> natron, alkali.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्चला|सुवर्च्चला
सु + -वर्चला<BR>—1 N. of the wife of the sun; तं चाहमनुवर्तिष्ये यथा सूर्यं सुवर्चला<BR> Rām. 2. 30. 30.<BR>—2 linseed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्चसः|सुवर्चस
सु + -वर्चसः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्चस्क
सु + -वर्चस्क <i>a.</i> splendid, brilliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्ण|सुवर्णं|सुवर्णः|सुवर्ण्ण
सु + -वर्ण see s. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्तित
सु + -वर्तित<BR>—1 well rounded.<BR>—2 well arranged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्तुलः|सुवर्तुल
सु + -वर्तुलः a water-melon<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवसन्तः|सुवसन्त
सु + -वसन्तः<BR>—1 an agreeable vernal season.<BR>—2 the day of full moon in the month of Chaitra, or a festival celebrated<BR> in honour of Kāmadeva in that month (also सुवसन्तकः in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवह|सुवहः
सु + -वह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 bearing well, patient.<BR>—2 patient, enduring.<BR>—3 easy to be borne<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवहा
सु + -वह + .({@-हा@})<BR>—1 a lute.<BR>—2 N. of several plants like रास्ना, निर्गुण्डी &c.; Mātaṅga L. 10. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवासः|सुवास
सु + -वासः<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 a pleasant dwelling.<BR>—3 an agreeable perfume or odour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवासकः|सुवासक
सु + -वासकः a water-melon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवासरा
सु + -वासरा cress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवासिनी
सु + -वासिनी<BR>—1 a woman married or single who resides in her fatherʼs house.<BR>—2 a married woman whose husband is alive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविक्रान्त|सुविक्रांत|सुविक्रान्तः
सु + -विक्रान्त <i>a.</i> very valiant or bold, chivalrous; सुविक्रान्तस्य<BR> नृपतेः सर्वमेव महीतलम् Śiva B. 16. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविक्रान्तः|सुविक्रान्त|सुविक्रांत
सु + -विक्रान्त + .({@-न्तः@}) a hero.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविक्रान्तम्
सु + -विक्रान्त + .({@-न्तम्@}) heroism.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविग्रह
सु + -विग्रह <i>a.</i> having a beautiful figure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविचक्षण
सु + -विचक्षण <i>a.</i> very clever, wise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविद्
सु + -विद् <i>m.</i> a learned man, shrewd person. ━(<i>f.</i>) a shrewd or clever woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविदः|सुविद
सु + -विदः<BR>—1 an attendant on the womenʼs apartments.<BR>—2 a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविदग्ध
सु + -विदग्ध <i>a.</i> very cunning, astute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविदत्
सु + -विदत् <i>m.</i> a king.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविदत्रम्
सु + -विदत्रम्<BR>—1 a household, family.<BR>—2 wealth.<BR>—3 grace, favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविदल्लः|सुविदल्ल|सुविदल्लं
सु + -विदल्लः an attendant on the womenʼs apartments (wrongly for<BR> सौविदल्ल q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविदल्लम्
सु + -विदल्लः + .({@-ल्लम्@}) the womenʼs apartments, harem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविदल्ला
सु + -विदल्ला a married woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविध
सु + -विध <i>a.</i> of a good kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविधम्
सु + -विधम् <i>ind.</i> easily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविधिः|सुविधि
सु + -विधिः a good rule, ordinance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविनीत
सु + -विनीत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well trained, modest.<BR>—2 well executed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविनीता
सु + -विनीत + .({@-ता@}) a tractable cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविनेय
सु + -विनेय <i>a.</i> easy to be trained or educated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविभक्त
सु + -विभक्त <i>a.</i> well proportioned, symmetrical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविरूढ
सु + -विरूढ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 fully grown up or developed.<BR>—2 well ridden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविविक्त
सु + -विविक्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 solitary (as a wood).<BR>—2 well decided (as a question).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविहित
सु + -विहित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-placed, well-deposited.<BR>—2 well-furnished, well-supplied, well-provided, well-arranged; सुविहितप्रयोगतया<BR> आर्यस्य न किमपि परिहास्यते Ś. 1; कलहंसमकरन्दप्रवेशावसरे<BR> तत् सुविहितम् Māl. 1.<BR>—3 well done or performed.<BR>—4 well<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">Page1690-2</a>]<BR> satisfied (by hospitality); अन्नपानैः सुविहितास्तस्मिन् यज्ञे महात्मनः<BR> Rām. 1. 14. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवीज|सुवीजः
सु + -वीज, -बीज <i>a.</i><BR> having good seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुबीज|सुबीजः
सु + -वीज, -बीज <i>a.</i><BR> having good seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवीजः|सुवीज
सु + -वीज, -बीज + .({@-जः@})<BR>—1 N. of Śiva.<BR>—2 the poppy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवीजम्
सु + -वीज, -बीज + .({@-जम्@}) good seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवीरकम्
सु + -वीरकम्<BR>—1 a kind of collyrium.<BR>—2 sour gruel (काञ्जिक); सुवीरकं याच्यमाना मद्रिका कर्षति स्फिचौ Mb. 8. 40. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवीराम्लम्
सु + -वीराम्लम् sour rice-gruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवीर्य|सुवीर्य्य|सुवीर्य्यं
सु + -वीर्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having great vigour.<BR>—2 of heroic strength, heroic, chivalrous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवीर्यम्
सु + -वीर्य + .({@-र्यम्@})<BR>—1 great heroism.<BR>—2 abundance of heroes.<BR>—3 the fruit of the jujube.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवीर्या|सुवीर्य्या
सु + -वीर्य + .({@-र्या@}) wild cotton.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवृक्तिः|सुवृक्ति
सु + -वृक्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 a pure offering.<BR>—2 a hymn of praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवृत्त|सुवृत्तः
सु + -वृत्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-behaved, virtuous, good; मयि तस्य सुवृत्त वर्तते लघुसंदेशपदा<BR> सरस्वती R. 8. 77.<BR>—2 well-rounded, beautifully globular or round; मृदुनातिसुवृत्तेन सुमृष्टेनातिहारिणा ।<BR> मोदकेनापि किं तेन निष्पत्तिर्यस्य सेवया ॥ or सुमुखोऽपि सुवृत्तोऽपि<BR> सन्मार्गपतितोऽपि च । महतां पादलग्नोऽपि व्यथयत्येव कण्टकः ॥<BR> (where all the adjectives are used in a double sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवृत्तम्
सु + -वृत्त + .({@-त्तम्@}) a good or virtuous conduct; भर्तुश्चिन्तानुवर्तित्वं सुवृत्तं<BR> चानुजीविनाम् Pt. 1. 69.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवृत्ता
सु + -वृत्त + .({@-त्ता@}) a sort of grape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवेल|सुवेलः
सु + -वेल <i>a.</i><BR>—1 tranquil, still.<BR>—2 humble, quiet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवेलः|सुवेल
सु + -वेल + .({@-लः@}) N. of the Trikūṭa mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुव्रत|सुव्रतः
सु + -व्रत <i>a.</i> strict in the observance of religious vows, strictly<BR> virtuous or religious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुव्रतः|सुव्रत
सु + -व्रत + .({@-तः@}) a religious student.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुव्रता
सु + -व्रत + .({@-ता@})<BR>—1 a virtuous wife.<BR>—2 a tractable cow, one easily milked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशंस
सु + -शंस <i>a.</i> well spoken of, famous, glorious, commendable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशक
सु + -शक <i>a.</i> capable of being easily done.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशर्मन्|सुशर्म्मन्
सु + -शर्मन् (<i>m., f.</i>) a person desiring intercourse [Uṇ. 4. 165].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशल्यः|सुशल्य
सु + -शल्यः the Khadira tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशाकम्
सु + -शाकम् undried ginger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशारदः|सुशारद
सु + -शारदः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशासित
सु + -शासित <i>a.</i> kept under control, well-controlled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशिक्षित
सु + -शिक्षित <i>a.</i> well-taught, trained, well-disciplined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशिखः|सुशिख
सु + -शिखः fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशिखा
सु + -शिखः + .({@-खा@})<BR>—1 a peacockʼs crest.<BR>—2 a cockʼs comb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशीतम्
सु + -शीतम् yellow sandal-wood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशीम|सुशीमः
सु + -शीम <i>a.</i> cold, frigid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशीमः|सुशीम
सु + -शीम + .({@-मः@}) coldness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशील|सुशीलः
सु + -शील <i>a.</i> good-tempered, amiable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशीला
सु + -शील + .({@-ला@})<BR>—1 N. of the wife of Yama.<BR>—2 N. of one of the eight favourite wives of Kṛṣṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशेव
सु + -शेव <i>a.</i> full of happiness; pleasant to be resorted; एष<BR> पन्था उरुगायः सुशेवः Ait. Br. 7. 13. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुशोण
सु + -शोण <i>a.</i> dark-red.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुश्रीका
सु + -श्रीका the gum olibanum tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुश्रुत|सुश्रुतः
सु + -श्रुत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well heard.<BR>—2 versed in the Vedas.<BR>—3 gladly heard (also an exclamation at a श्राद्ध); पित्रे स्वदितमित्येव<BR> वाच्यं गोष्ठे तु सुश्रुतम् Ms. 3. 254.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुश्रुतः|सुश्रुत
सु + -श्रुत + .({@-तः@}) N. of the author of a system of medicine, whose work, together<BR> with that of Caraka, is regarded as the oldest medical authority, and<BR> held in great esteem in India even to this day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुश्लिष्ट
सु + -श्लिष्ट <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-arranged or united.<BR>—2 well-fitted; Māl. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुश्लेषः|सुश्लेष
सु + -श्लेषः close union or embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुश्लोक्य
सु + -श्लोक्य <i>a.</i> very famous; तेजीयसामपि ह्येतन्न सुश्लोक्यं<BR> जगद्गुरो Bhāg. 3. 12. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसंवीत
सु + -संवीत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-girt; स ददर्श ततः श्रीमान् सुग्रीवं हेमपिङ्गलम् । सुसंवीतम् …<BR> Rām. 4. 16. 15.<BR>—2 well-dressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसंवृतिः|सुसंवृति
सु + -संवृतिः good concealment. ━<i>a.</i> well-concealed; परितप्तोऽप्यपरः<BR> सुसंवृतिः Śi. 16. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसंस्कृत|सुसंस्कृतं
सु + -संस्कृत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well cooked or prepared.<BR>—2 kept in good order; सुसंस्कृतोपस्करया व्यये चामुक्तहस्तया Ms. 5. 150.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसंगृहीत|सुसङ्गृहीत
सु + -संगृहीत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well controlled or governed; सुसंगृहीतराष्ट्रो हि पार्थिवः सुखमेधते Ms. 7. 113.<BR>—2 well received.<BR>—3 well kept.<BR>—4 well abridged.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">Page1691-1</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1690-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसंध
सु + -संध <i>a.</i> true to a promise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसंनत
सु + -संनत <i>a.</i> well-directed (as an arrow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसत्या
सु + -सत्या N. of the wife of Janaka.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसदृश्
सु + -सदृश् <i>a.</i> agreeable to look at.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसमाहित
सु + -समाहित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well arranged, beautifully adorned; very beautiful; ऋतुकालं प्रतीक्षन्ते<BR> नार्थिनः सुसमाहिते । संगमं त्वहमिच्छामि त्वया सह सुमध्यमे ॥<BR> Rām. 1. 48. 18.<BR>—2 completely loaded; तद्यथानः सुसमाहितमुत्सर्जद्यायात् Bṛ. Up. 4. 3. 35.<BR>—3 Very intent, attentive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसमीहित
सु + -समीहित <i>a.</i> much desired.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसरण
सु + -सरण N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसह|सुसहः
सु + -सह <i>a.</i><BR>—1 easy to be borne.<BR>—2 bearing or enduring well.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसहः|सुसह
सु + -सह + .({@-हः@}) an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसहाय
सु + -सहाय <i>a.</i> having a good companion; प्रणेतुं शक्यते दण्डः<BR> सुसहायेन धीमता Ms. 7. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसाधित
सु + -साधित <i>a.</i> well trained or educated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसार|सुसारः
सु + -सार <i>a.</i> having good sap or essence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसारः|सुसार
सु + -सार + .({@-रः@})<BR>—1 good sap, essence, or substance.<BR>—2 competence.<BR>—3 the red-flowering Khadira tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसारवत्|सुसारवन्त्
सु + -सारवत् <i>n.</i> crystal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसिकता
सु + -सिकता<BR>—1 good sand.<BR>—2 gravel.<BR>—3 sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसुरप्रिया
सु + -सुरप्रिया jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसेव्य
सु + -सेव्य <i>a.</i> to be well or easily followed (as a road).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसौभगम्
सु + -सौभगम् conjugal felicity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्थ|सुस्थः
सु + -स्थ <i>a.</i><BR>—1 well-suited, being in a good sense.<BR>—2 in health, healthy, faring well.<BR>—3 in good or prosperous circumstances, prosperous.<BR>—4 happy, fortunate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्थम्
सु + -स्थ + .({@-स्थम्@}) a happy state, well-being; प्रह्राद सुस्थरूपोऽसि पश्यन्<BR> व्यसनमात्मनः Mb. 12. 222. 12; सुस्थे को वा न पण्डितः H. 3. 114.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्थित
सु + -स्थित <i>a.</i> in the same sense as सुस्थ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्थितम्
सु + -स्थित + .({@-तम्@}) a house with a gallery on all sides.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्थितिः|सुस्थिति
सु + -स्थितिः (also सुस्थता) <i>f.</i><BR>—1 good condition, well-being, welfare, happiness.<BR>—2 health, convalescence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्थिर|सुस्थिरः
सु + -स्थिर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 stable.<BR>—2 resolute, cool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्नातः|सुस्नात
सु + -स्नातः<BR>—1 one who bathes at the end of a sacrifice; L. D. B.<BR>—2 well purified by bathing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्मित
सु + -स्मित <i>a.</i> pleasantly smiling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्मिता
सु + -स्मित + .({@-ता@}) a woman with a pleased or smiling countenance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्वपनः
सु + -स्वपनः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुस्वर
सु + -स्वर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 melodious, harmonious.<BR>—2 loud. ˚यन्त्रकम् a kind of musical instrument; युता सुस्वरयन्त्रकैः Śukra. 1. 247.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहित|सुहितः
सु + -हित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 very fit or suitable, appropriate.<BR>—2 beneficial, salutary.<BR>—3 friendly, affectionate.<BR>—4 satisfied; सहस्रनेत्रः सुहितत्वमाप न Rām. Ch. 2. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहिता
सु + -हित + .({@-ता@}) one of the seven tongues of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहृद्
सु + -हृद् <i>a.</i> having a kind heart, cordial, friendly, loving, affectionate;<BR> सुहृदः सुहृदोऽन्यांश्च दुर्हृदश्चापि दुर्हृदः । सम्यक्प्रवृत्तान् पुरुषान्नसम्यगनुपश्यतः ॥<BR> Mb. 3. 208. 36. ━(<i>m.</i>)<BR>—1 a friend; सुहृदः पश्य वसन्त किं स्थितम् Ku. 4. 27; मन्दायन्ते<BR> न खलु सुहृदामभ्युपेतार्थकृत्याः Me. 40.<BR>—2 an ally. ˚भेदः<BR>—1 the separation of friends.<BR>—2 N. of the 2nd book of the हितोपदेश; मित्रलाभः सुहृद्भेदो विग्रहः<BR> संधिरेव च । पञ्चतन्त्रात्तथान्यस्माद् ग्रन्थादाकृष्य लिख्यते ॥ H. Pr. 9.<BR> ˚वाक्यम् the counsel of a friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहृदः|सुहृद
सु + -हृदः a friend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुहृदय|सुहृदयः
सु + -हृदय <i>a.</i><BR>—1 good-hearted.<BR>—2 dear, affectionate, loving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुख्
सुख् €10 P. (सुखयति) To make happy, please, delight; (properly<BR> a denom. of सुख).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुख|सुखं
सुख <i>a.</i> [सुख्-अच्]<BR>—1 Happy, delighted, joyful, pleased.<BR>—2 Agreeable, sweet, charming, pleasant; विविक्तवर्णाभरणा सुखश्रुतिः<BR> Ki. 14. 3; दिशः प्रसेदुर्मरुतो ववुः सुखाः R. 3. 14; so सुखश्रवा<BR> निस्वनाः 3. 19.<BR>—3 Virtuous, pious.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">Page1691-2</a>]<BR>—4 Taking delight in, favourable to; Ś. 7. 18.<BR>—5 Easy, practicable; श्रेयांसि लब्धुमसुखानि विनान्तरायैः Ki. 5. 49.<BR>—6 Fit, suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखा
सुख + .{@-खा@}<BR>—1 The capital of Varuṇa.<BR>—2 (In phil.) The effort to win future beatitude.<BR>—3 Piety, virtue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखम्
सुख + .{@-खम्@}<BR>—1 Happiness, joy, delight, pleasure, comfort; यदेवोपनतं दुःखात्<BR> सुखं तद्रसवत्तरम् V. 3. 21.<BR>—2 Prosperity; अद्वैतं सुखदुःखयोरनुगुणं सर्वास्ववस्थासु यत् U. 1. 39.<BR>—3 Well-being, welfare, health; देवीं सुखं प्रष्टुं गता M. 4.<BR>—4 Ease, comfort, alleviation (of sorrow &c.); oft. in comp.; as in सुखशयित,<BR> सुखोपविष्ट, सुखाश्रय &c.<BR>—5 Facility, easiness, ease.<BR>—6 Heaven, paradise. —7 Water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखम्
सुख + .{@-खम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Happily, joyfully; भ्रातृभिः सहितो रामः प्रमुमोद सुखं सुखी Rām. 7. 41. 1.<BR>—2 Well; सुखमास्तां भवान् ‘may you fare well’.<BR>—3 At ease, comfortably; असंजातकिणस्कन्धः सुखं स्वपिति गौर्गडिः K. P. 10.<BR>—4 Easily, with ease; अज्ञः सुखमाराध्यः सुखतरमाराध्यते विशेषज्ञः<BR> Bh. 2. 3; सुखमुपदिश्यते परस्य K.<BR>—4 Rather, willingly.<BR>—5 Quietly, placidly; सुखं रात्रीः शयिता वीतमन्युः Kaṭh. 1. 11.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सुखान्त, सुखाधिष्ठानम्, सुखाभियोज्य, सुखाभ्युदयिक, सुखार्थः, सुखागतम्, सुखाजातः, सुखात्मक, सुखात्मन्, सुखाधारः, सुखाप, सुखाप्लव, सुखायतः, सुखायनः, सुखाराध्य, सुखारोह, सुखालोक, सुखावह, सुखाशः, सुखाशकः, सुखासक्तः, सुखासनम्, सुखासीन, सुखास्वाद, सुखोचित, सुखोत्सवः, सुखोदकम्, सुखोष्णम्, सुखोदयः, सुखोदर्क, सुखोद्भवा, सुखोद्य, सुखोपविष्ट, सुखैषिन्, सुखोर्जिकः, सुखकर, सुखकार, सुखदायक, सुखचारः, सुखजात, सुखतन्त्र, सुखद, सुखदोह्या, सुखप्रविचार, सुखप्रश्नः, सुखबद्ध, सुखबोधः, सुखभागिन्, सुखभाज्, सुखभेद्य, सुखमानिन्, सुखमोदा, सुखरात्रिः, सुखरात्रिः, सुखरात्रिका, सुखरूप, सुखवर्चकः, सुखवर्चस्, सुखवह, सुखवासः, सुखवेदनम्, सुखश्रव, सुखश्रुति, सुखसंगिन्, सुखसंदुह्या, सुखसंदोह्या, सुखसयोगः, सुखसाध्य, सुखसुखेन, सुखसेव्य, सुखस्पर्श, सुखहस्त<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखान्त
सुख + -अन्त <i>a.</i><BR>—1 ending in happiness.<BR>—2 friendly.<BR>—3 destroying happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाधिष्ठानम्
सुख + -अधिष्ठानम् a happy state.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाभियोज्य
सुख + -अभियोज्य <i>a.</i> easily assailable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाभ्युदयिक
सुख + -अभ्युदयिक <i>a.</i> causing joy or pleasure; सुखाभ्युदयिकं चैव<BR> नैःश्रेयसिकमेव च Ms. 12. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखार्थः|सुखार्थ
सुख + -अर्थः anything that gives pleasure; Ms. 6. 26.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखागतम्
सुख + -आगतम् welcome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाजातः|सुखाजात
सुख + -आजातः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखात्मक
सुख + -आत्मक <i>a.</i> consisting of pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखात्मन्
सुख + -आत्मन् the Supreme Spirit, Brahma; पृथगाचरतस्तात पृथगात्मसुखात्मनोः<BR> Mb. 13. 120. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाधारः|सुखाधार
सुख + -आधारः paradise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाप
सुख + -आप <i>a.</i> easily won or attained.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाप्लव
सुख + -आप्लव <i>a.</i> suitable for bathing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखायतः|सुखायत|सुखायतं
सुख + -आयतः, -आयनः a good or well-trained horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखायनः|सुखायन
सुख + -आयतः, -आयनः a good or well-trained horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाराध्य
सुख + -आराध्य <i>a.</i> easy to be conciliated or propitiated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखारोह
सुख + -आरोह <i>a.</i> of easy ascent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखालोक
सुख + -आलोक <i>a.</i> good-looking, lovely, charming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखावह|सुखावहः
सुख + -आवह <i>a.</i> conducing to happiness, pleasant, comfortable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाशः|सुखाश
सुख + -आशः<BR>—1 eating at ease.<BR>—2 pleasant food.<BR>—3 N. of Varuṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखाशकः|सुखाशक
सुख + -आशकः a cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखासक्तः|सुखासक्त
सुख + -आसक्तः an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखासनम्
सुख + -आसनम् a comfortable seat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखासीन
सुख + -आसीन <i>a.</i> comfortably seated; also सुखनिविष्ट.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखास्वाद|सुखास्वादः
सुख + -आस्वाद <i>a.</i><BR>—1 having a sweet taste, sweet-flavoured.<BR>—2 agreeable, delightful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखास्वादः|सुखास्वाद
सुख + -आस्वाद + .({@-दः@})<BR>—1 a pleasant flavour.<BR>—2 enjoyment (of pleasure).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखोचित
सुख + -उचित <i>a.</i> accustomed to comfort or happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखोत्सवः|सुखोत्सव
सुख + -उत्सवः<BR>—1 merry-making, pleasure, festival, jubilee.<BR>—2 a husband.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखोदकम्
सुख + -उदकम्, -उष्णम् warm water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखोष्णम्
सुख + -उदकम्, -उष्णम् warm water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखोदयः|सुखोदय
सुख + -उदयः<BR>—1 dawn or realization of happiness.<BR>—2 an intoxicating drink.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखोदर्क
सुख + -उदर्क <i>a.</i> resulting in happiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखोद्भवा
सुख + -उद्भवा yellow myrobalan; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखोद्य
सुख + -उद्य <i>a.</i> to be spoken easily or agreeably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1691-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुखोपविष्ट
