सुरेश्वरी
सुरः + -ईशः, -ईश्वरः + .({@-री@})<BR>—1 the celestial Ganges.<BR>—2 Durgā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1693-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरेश्वरः|सुरेश्वर
