सुरङ्गः, -ङ्गा<BR>—1 A hole cut in a wall for the purpose of breaking into a house.<BR>—2 A subterranean passage, a mine dug underneath a building; अनेकसुरङ्गासंचारम्<BR> Kau. A. 1. 20; ऐकागारिकेण तावतीं सुरङ्गां कारयित्वा Dk.; सुरङ्गया<BR> बहिरपगतेषु युष्मासु Mu. 2; वकानुवक्रसोपानसुरङ्गादीर्घनिर्गमम्<BR> (बिलं व्यधात्) Bm. 1. 747 (written also<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">Page1694-2</a>]<BR> सुरुङ्गा).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सुरङ्गधातुः, सुरङ्गयुज्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

