सुरङ्गः + -धातुः red chalk; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरङ्गयुज्
सुरङ्गः + -युज् <i>m.</i> a burglar, a house-breaker; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभि|सुरभिः
सुरभि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Sweet-smelling, fragrant, odorous; पाटलसंसर्गसुरभिवनवाताः<BR> Ś. 1. 3; Me. 16, 21, 34.<BR>—2 Pleasing, agreeable.<BR>—3 Shining, handsome; तां सौरभेयीं सुराभिर्यशोभिः R. 2. 3; Mv. 6. 63.<BR>—4 Beloved, friendly.<BR>—5 Celebrated, famous.<BR>—6 Wise, learned.<BR>—7 Good, virtuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिः|सुरभि
सुरभि + .{@-भिः@}<BR>—1 Fragrance, odour, perfume; यः पुरीषसुरभिसौगन्ध्यवायुस्तं देशं<BR> दशयोजनं समन्तात् सुरभिं चकार Bhāg. 5. 5. 33.<BR>—2 Nutmeg.<BR>—3 Resin of Sāla, or resin in general.<BR>—4 The Champaka tree.<BR>—5 The Śamī tree.<BR>—6 The Kadamba tree.<BR>—7 A kind of fragrant grass.<BR>—8 The season of spring; वासार्थं हर संभृतं सुरभिणा पौष्पं रजो<BR> वीरुधाम् V. 2. 20.<BR>—9 The month of Chaitra.<BR>—10 The Bakula tree. ━<i>f.</i><BR>—1 The gum olibanum tree.<BR>—2 The sacred basil.<BR>—3 Jasmine.<BR>—4 A sort of perfume or fragrant plant.<BR>—5 Spirituous liquor.<BR>—6 The earth.<BR>—7 A cow; ऊर्जस्वलेन सुरभीरनु निःसपत्नं जग्मे जयोद्धुरविशालविषाणमुक्ष्णा Śi. 5. 64.<BR>—8 N. of the fabulous cow of plenty; सुतां तदीयां सुरभेः कृत्वा प्रतिनिधिम्<BR> R. 1. 81, 75; व्यालम्बेथाः सुरभितनयालम्भजां मानयिष्यन् Me. 47.<BR>—9 N. of one of the Mātṛs.<BR>—10 The east. ━<i>n.</i><BR>—1 A fragrant smell, perfume, fragrance.<BR>—2 Sulphur.<BR>—3 Gold.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सुरभिगन्धम्, सुरभिगोत्रम्, सुरभिघृतम्, सुरभित्रिफला, सुरभित्वच्, सुरभिदारुः, सुरभिपत्रा, सुरभिबाणः, सुरभिमासः, सुरभिमुखम्, सुरभिवल्कलम्, सुरभिस्रवा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिगन्धम्
सुरभि + -गन्धम् see सुरभिवल्कल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिगोत्रम्
सुरभि + -गोत्रम् oxen, cattle, kine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिघृतम्
सुरभि + -घृतम् fragrant butter, well-seasoned ghee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभित्रिफला
सुरभि + -त्रिफला<BR>—1 nutmeg.<BR>—2 cloves.<BR>—3 areca nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभित्वच्
सुरभि + -त्वच् <i>f.</i> large cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिदारुः|सुरभिदारु
सुरभि + -दारुः the Sarala tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिपत्रा
सुरभि + -पत्रा the rose-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिबाणः|सुरभिबाण
सुरभि + -बाणः an epithet of Cupid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिमासः|सुरभिमास
सुरभि + -मासः the spring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिमुखम्
सुरभि + -मुखम् the commencement of spring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिवल्कलम्
सुरभि + -वल्कलम् the bark of Laurus Cassia (Mar. दालचिनी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिस्रवा
सुरभि + -स्रवा the gum olibanum tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिका
सुरभिका A kind of plantain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभिमत्|सुरभिमन्त्
सुरभिमत् <i>m.</i> N. of fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभित
सुरभित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Perfumed, scented.<BR>—2 Pleasing, beautiful; कीर्त्याऽभितः सुरभितः Dk. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरभी
सुरभी<BR>—1 Gum olibanum.<BR>—2 N. of the cow of plenty. See सुरभिः.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरला
सुरला<BR>—1 N. of Gaṅgā; L. D. B.<BR>—2 N. of a river; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरा
सुरा (सु-क्रन् Uṇ. 2. 24)<BR>—1 A spirituous liquor, wine; सुरा वै मलमन्नानाम् Ms. 11. 93; गौडी<BR> पैष्टी च माध्वी च विज्ञेया त्रिविधा सुरा 94.<BR>—2 Water.<BR>—3 A drinking vessel.<BR>—4 A snake.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सुराकरः, सुराजीवः, सुराजीविन्, सुरालयः, सुरासवः, सुरोदः, सुराकारः, सुरागृहम्, सुराग्रहः, सुराजीविन्, सुराध्वजः, सुराप, सुरापाणम्, सुरापानम्, सुरापात्रम्, सुराभाजनम्, सुराभाण्डम्, सुरापीत, सुराबीजम्, सुराभागः, सुरामण्डः, सुरामूल्यम्, सुरासंधानम्, सुरासुः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराकरः|सुराकर
सुरा + -आकरः<BR>—1 a distillery.<BR>—2 the cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराजीवः|सुराजीव
सुरा + -आजीवः, -आजीविन् <i>m.</i> a distiller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराजीविन्
सुरा + -आजीवः, -आजीविन् <i>m.</i> a distiller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरालयः|सुरालय
सुरा + -आलयः a tavern, dram-shop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरासवः|सुरासव
सुरा + -आसवः spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरोदः|सुरोद
सुरा + -उदः the sea of spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराकारः|सुराकार
सुरा + -कारः a distiller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरागृहम्
सुरा + -गृहम् a tavern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराग्रहः|सुराग्रह
सुरा + -ग्रहः a vessel for holding liquor; व्यवस्थितिस्तेषु विवाहयज्ञसुराग्रहैरासु<BR> निवृत्तिरिष्टा Bhāg. 11. 5. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराजीविन्
सुरा + -जीविन् a tavern-keeper, a vintner<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराध्वजः|सुराध्वज
सुरा + -ध्वजः a flag or sign hung outside a tavern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराप|सुरापः
सुरा + -प <i>a.</i><BR>—1 a drinker of spirituous liquor; Ms. 11. 49.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">Page1695-1</a>]<BR>—2 pleasant, agreeable.<BR>—3 wise, sage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1694-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरापाणम्
सुरा + -पाणम्, -पानम् the drinking of wine or liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरापानम्
सुरा + -पाणम्, -पानम् the drinking of wine or liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरापात्रम्
सुरा + -पात्रम्, -भाजनम्, -भाण्डम् a wine glass or cup; अपः सुराभाजनस्था<BR> मद्यभाण्डस्थितास्तथा Ms. 11. 147.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराभाजनम्
सुरा + -पात्रम्, -भाजनम्, -भाण्डम् a wine glass or cup; अपः सुराभाजनस्था<BR> मद्यभाण्डस्थितास्तथा Ms. 11. 147.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराभाण्डम्
सुरा + -पात्रम्, -भाजनम्, -भाण्डम् a wine glass or cup; अपः सुराभाजनस्था<BR> मद्यभाण्डस्थितास्तथा Ms. 11. 147.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरापीत
सुरा + -पीत <i>a.</i> one who has drunk wine; सुखजातः सुरापीतः … Bk. 5. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराबीजम्
सुरा + -बीजम् a substance serving for the preparation of beer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुराभागः|सुराभाग
सुरा + -भागः yeast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरामण्डः|सुरामण्ड|सुरामंड
सुरा + -मण्डः the froth or scum of spirituous liquor during fermentation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरामूल्यम्
सुरा + -मूल्यम् drink-money.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरासंधानम्
सुरा + -संधानम् distillation of spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरासुः
सुरा + -सुः<BR>—1 a drunkard.<BR>—2 a heretic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरुङ्गा|सुरुंगा
सुरुङ्गा See सुरङ्गा. A hole made underground, subterranean passage;<BR> सुरुङ्गां कारयित्वा तु Mb. 1. 61. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरुङ्गाहिः|सुरुङ्गाहि
सुरुङ्गाहिः A burglar, house-breaker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुरेभम्
सुरेभम् Tin; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवनः|सुवन
सुवनः<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 Fire.<BR>—3 The moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवनम्
सुवनः + .{@-नम्@} The moonlight; Uṇ. 2. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्ण|सुवर्णं|सुवर्णः|सुवर्ण्ण
सुवर्ण <i>a.</i> [शोभनो वर्णोऽस्य]<BR>—1 Of good or beautiful colour, brilliant in hue, bright, yellow, golden.<BR>—2 Of a good tribe or caste.<BR>—3 Of good fame, glorious, celebrated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णः|सुवर्ण|सुवर्णं|सुवर्ण्ण
सुवर्ण + .{@-र्णः@}<BR>—1 A good colour.<BR>—2 A good tribe or caste.<BR>—3 A sort of sacrifice.<BR>—4 An epithet of Śiva.<BR>—5 The thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णा
सुवर्ण + .{@-र्णा@}<BR>—1 One of the seven tongues of fire.<BR>—2 Black aloe-wood.<BR>—3 Turmeric.<BR>—4 Colocynth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णम्
सुवर्ण + .{@-र्णम्@}<BR>—1 Gold.<BR>—2 A golden coin. (<i>m.</i> also); नन्वहं दशसुवर्णान् प्रयच्छामि Mk. 2.<BR>—3 A weight of gold equal to 16 Māṣas or about 175 grains Troy (<i>m.</i> also).<BR>—4 Money, wealth, riches.<BR>—5 A sort of yellow sandalwood.<BR>—6 A kind of red chalk.<BR>—7 N. of a tree (नागकेशर).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सुवर्णाक्षः, सुवर्णाख्यः, सुवर्णाभिषेकः, सुवर्णकदली, सुवर्णकर्तृ, सुवर्णकार, सुवर्णकृत्, सुवर्णगणितम्, सुवर्णगैरिकम्, सुवर्णचौरिका, सुवर्णजीविकः, सुवर्णधेनुः, सुवर्णपालिका, सुवर्णपुष्पः, सुवर्णपुष्पित, सुवर्णपृष्ठ, सुवर्णबिन्दुः, सुवर्णभाण्डम्, सुवर्णभाण्डकम्, सुवर्णमाक्षिकम्, सुवर्णयूथी, सुवर्णरूप्यक, सुवर्णरेतस्, सुवर्णरोमन्, सुवर्णवणिज्, सुवर्णवर्णः, सुवर्णवर्णा, सुवर्णसानुः, सुवर्णसिद्धः, सुवर्णस्तेयम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णाक्षः|सुवर्णाक्ष
सुवर्ण + -अक्षः N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णाख्यः|सुवर्णाख्य
सुवर्ण + -आख्यः<BR>—1 N. of a tree (नागकेशर).<BR>—2 the thorn-apple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णाभिषेकः|सुवर्णाभिषेक
सुवर्ण + -अभिषेकः sprinkling the bride and bridegroom with water into<BR> which a piece of gold has been dropped.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णकदली
सुवर्ण + -कदली a variety of plantain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णकर्तृ|सुवर्णकर्त्तृ
सुवर्ण + -कर्तृ, -कार, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a goldsmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णकार|सुवर्णकारः
सुवर्ण + -कर्तृ, -कार, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a goldsmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णकृत्
सुवर्ण + -कर्तृ, -कार, -कृत् <i>m.</i> a goldsmith.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णगणितम्
सुवर्ण + -गणितम् a particular method of calculation in arithmetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णगैरिकम्
सुवर्ण + -गैरिकम् a kind of red-chalk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णचौरिका
सुवर्ण + -चौरिका gold-stealing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णजीविकः|सुवर्णजीविक
सुवर्ण + -जीविकः N. of a tribe; (गान्धिकः शाङ्खिकश्चैव कांस्यको मणिकारकः ।<BR> सुवर्णजीविकश्चैव पञ्चैते वणिजः स्मृताः ॥).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णधेनुः|सुवर्णधेनु
सुवर्ण + -धेनुः a golden offering in the shape of a cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णपालिका
सुवर्ण + -पालिका a kind of vessel made of gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णपुष्पः|सुवर्णपुष्प
सुवर्ण + -पुष्पः the globe-amaranth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णपुष्पित
सुवर्ण + -पुष्पित <i>a.</i> abounding in gold; <i>e. g.</i> सुवर्णपुष्पितां<BR> पृथ्वीं विचिन्वान्ति त्रयो जनाः । शूरश्च कृतविद्यश्च यश्च जानाति सेवितुम् ॥<BR> Pt. 1. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णपृष्ठ
सुवर्ण + -पृष्ठ <i>a.</i> coated with gold, gilded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णबिन्दुः|सुवर्णबिन्दु|सुवर्ण्णबिन्दु
सुवर्ण + -बिन्दुः<BR>—1 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—2 a form of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णभाण्डम्
सुवर्ण + -भाण्डम्, -भाण्डकम् a jewel-box.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णभाण्डकम्
सुवर्ण + -भाण्डम्, -भाण्डकम् a jewel-box.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णमाक्षिकम्
सुवर्ण + -माक्षिकम् a kind of mineral substance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णयूथी
सुवर्ण + -यूथी yellow jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णरूप्यक
सुवर्ण + -रूप्यक <i>a.</i> abounding in gold and silver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णरेतस्
सुवर्ण + -रेतस् <i>m.</i> an epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णरोमन्
सुवर्ण + -रोमन् <i>m.</i> a ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णवणिज्
सुवर्ण + -वणिज् <i>m.</i> N. of a mixed caste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णवर्णः|सुवर्णवर्ण
सुवर्ण + -वर्णः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णवर्णा
सुवर्ण + -वर्णा turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णसानुः|सुवर्णसानु
सुवर्ण + -सानुः the Meru mountain having golden peaks; सुवर्णसानुप्रतिमान्<BR> प्रासादानुच्चतोरणान् Śiva B. 1. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णसिद्धः|सुवर्णसिद्ध
सुवर्ण + -सिद्धः an adept who has acquired gold by magical means.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णस्तेयम्
सुवर्ण + -स्तेयम् stealing of gold (one<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">Page1695-2</a>]<BR> of the five Mahāpātakas q. v.); अत ऊर्ध्वं प्रवक्ष्यामि सुवर्णस्तेयनिष्कृतिम् Ms. 11. 98.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णकम्
सुवर्णकम्<BR>—1 Brass, bell-metal.<BR>—2 Lead.<BR>—3 Gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुवर्णवत्|सुवर्णवन्त्
सुवर्णवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Golden.<BR>—2 Having a golden colour, beautiful, handsome.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविदत्र
सुविदत्र <i>a.</i> (Ved.) Very mindful, benevolent, propitious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुविदत्रम्
सुविदत्र + .{@-त्रम्@}<BR>—1 Grace, favour.<BR>—2 Wealth, property.<BR>—3 Household; Uṇ. 3. 107.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषम|सुषमः
सुषम <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Very lovely or beautiful, very pleasing.<BR>—2 Same; all.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषमा
सुषम + .{@-मा@} Exquisite beauty, great lustre or splendour; कुरबककुसुमं<BR> चपलासुषमम् Gīt. 7; सुषमाविषये परीक्षणे निखिलं पद्ममभाजि<BR> तन्मुखात् N. 2. 27; Bv. 1. 26, 2. 12, 74, 82, 3. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषवी
सुषवी<BR>—1 A sort of gourd.<BR>—2 Black cumin.<BR>—3 Cumin-seed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषाढः|सुषाढ
सुषाढः An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषिः|सुषि
सुषिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 A hole; cf. शुषि; एतस्य हृदयस्य पञ्च देवसुषयः स योऽस्य प्राड्सुषिः<BR> स प्राणः Ch. Up. 3. 13. 1.<BR>—2 A tube, pipe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषिम|सुषिमः
सुषि(षी)म <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Cold, frigid.<BR>—2 Pleasant, agreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषीम|सुषीमः
सुषि(षी)म <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Cold, frigid.<BR>—2 Pleasant, agreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषिमः|सुषिम
सुषि(षी)म + .{@-मः@}<BR>—1 Cold.<BR>—2 A kind of snake.<BR>—3 The moon-stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषिर|सुषिरं
सुषिर <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Full of holes, hollow, perforated; चेतनावान्नरो हन्याद्यस्य नासुषिरं<BR> शिरः Mb. 12. 266. 33.<BR>—2 Slow in articulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषिरम्
सुषिर + .{@-रम्@}<BR>—1 A hole, an aperture, a cavity; सुषिराणि प्रवक्रिरे Śiva B. 13. 92.<BR>—2 Any wind-instrument (flutes and similar instruments); अवापुरुच्चैः<BR> सुषिराणि राणिताम् N. 15. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषुप्तम्
सुषुप्तम् See सुषुप्तिः next; जाग्रत्स्वप्नः सुषुप्तं च गुणतो<BR> बुद्धिवृत्तयः Bhāg. 11. 13. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषुप्तिः|सुषुप्ति
सुषुप्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Deep or profound sleep, profound repose.<BR>—2 Great insensibility, spiritual ignorance; अविद्यात्मिका हि बीजशक्तिरव्यक्तशब्दनिर्देश्या<BR> परमेश्वराश्रया मायामयी महासुषुप्तिर्यस्यां स्वरूपप्रतिबोधरहिताः शेरते<BR> संसारिणो जीवाः Ś. B. on Br. Sūt. 1. 4. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषुम्णः|सुषुम्ण
सुषुम्णः, -म्नः<BR> N. of one of the principal rays of the sun; Hc. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषुम्नः|सुषुम्न
सुषुम्णः, -म्नः<BR> N. of one of the principal rays of the sun; Hc. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषुम्णा
सुषुम्णः, -म्नः + .{@-म्णा, -म्ना@} A particular artery of the human body, said to lie<BR> between इडा and पिङ्गला, two of the vessels of the body; वैश्वानरं<BR> याति विहायसा गतः सुषुम्नया ब्रह्मपथेन शोचिषा Bhāg. 2. 2. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषुम्ना
सुषुम्णः, -म्नः + .{@-म्णा, -म्ना@} A particular artery of the human body, said to lie<BR> between इडा and पिङ्गला, two of the vessels of the body; वैश्वानरं<BR> याति विहायसा गतः सुषुम्नया ब्रह्मपथेन शोचिषा Bhāg. 2. 2. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषुप्सा
सुषुप्सा<BR>—1 Desire of sleeping.<BR>—2 Sleepiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुषेणः|सुषेण
सुषेणः<BR>—1 N. of a tree (करमर्द).<BR>—2 N. of Viṣṇu.<BR>—3 A cane or ratan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुष्ठु
सुष्ठु <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Well, excellently, beautifully.<BR>—2 Very much, exceedingly; सुष्ठु शोभसे आर्यपुत्र एतेन विनयमाहात्म्येन U. 1.<BR>—3 Truly, rightly; शब्दः सुष्ठु प्रयुक्तः Sarva. S.; अथवा सुष्ठु<BR> खल्विदमुत्त्यते.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1695-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुष्मम्
सुष्मम् A rope, cord, string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुसवी
सुसवी See सुषवी above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुह्
सुह् €4 P. To endure, to bear; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सुह्माः
सुह्माः (<i>m.</i> pl.) N. of a people; आत्मा संरक्षितः सुह्मैर्वृत्तिमाश्रित्य<BR> वैतसीम् R. 4. 35.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सू
सू I. €2. €4 Ā. (सूते, सूयते, सूत) To bring forth, produce,<BR> beget, yield (fig. also); मयाध्यक्षेण प्रकृतिः सूयते सचराचरम्<BR> Bg. 9. 10; असूत सा नागवधूपभोग्यम् Ku. 1. 20; कीर्तिं सूते दुष्कृतं<BR> या हिनस्ति U. 5. 31. ━<i>With</i> {@प्र@} to bring forth, beget, produce.<BR>━II. €6 P. (सुवति)<BR>—1 To excite, incite, impel.<BR>—2 To remit (as debt).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सू
सू <i>a.</i> (At the end of comp.) Bringing forth, producing, yielding &c. ━<i>f.</i><BR>—1 Birth.<BR>—2 A mother; अलब्धनिद्रोऽनुपलक्षितो नृभिर्हित्वा गतो वेनसुवं प्रसुप्ताम्<BR> Bhāg. 4. 13. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूकः|सूक
सूकः<BR>—1 An arrow.<BR>—2 Air, wind.<BR>—3 A lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूकरः|सूकर
सूकरः [सू-करन् कित् Uṇ. 4. 5]<BR>—1 A hog, pig; see शूकर.<BR>—2 A sort of deer.<BR>—3 A potter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूकरी
सूकरः + .{@-री@}<BR>—1 A sow; पतिलोकं न सा याति ब्राह्मणी या सुरां पिबेत् । इहैव सा शुनी<BR> गृध्री सूकरी चोपजायते ॥ Y. 3. 256.<BR>—2 A sort of moss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्म|सूक्ष्मं|सूक्ष्मः
सूक्ष्म <i>a.</i> [सूच्-मन् सुक् च नेट्; Uṇ. 4. 184]<BR>—1 Subtle, minute, atomic; जालान्तरस्थसूर्यांशौ यत् सूक्ष्मं दृश्यते<BR> रजः; मुख्यक्रमेण प्रयोगवचनैकवाक्यता सूक्ष्मा ŚB. on MS. 5. 1. 15.<BR>—2 Little, small; इदमुपहितसूक्ष्मग्रन्थिना स्कन्धदेशे Ś. 1. 19; R. 18. 49.<BR>—3 Fine, thin, delicate, exquisite.<BR>—4 Nice.<BR>—5 Sharp, acute, penetrating.<BR>—6 Crafty, artful, subtle, ingenious.<BR>—7 Exact, precise, accurate, correct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मः|सूक्ष्म|सूक्ष्मं
सूक्ष्म + .{@-क्ष्मः@}<BR>—1 An atom.<BR>—2 The clearing-nut plant.<BR>—3 An epithet of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मा
सूक्ष्म + .{@-क्ष्मा@}<BR>—1 Sand.<BR>—2 Small cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मम्
सूक्ष्म + .{@-क्ष्मम्@}<BR>—1 The subtle all-pervading spirit, the Supreme Soul.<BR>—2 Minuteness.<BR>—3 One of the three kinds of power attainable by an ascetic; cf. सावद्य.<BR>—4 Craft, ingenuity.<BR>—5 Fraud, cheating.<BR>—6 Fine thread &c.<BR>—7 N. of a figure of speech, thus defined by Mammaṭa:− कुतोऽपि लक्षितः<BR> सूक्ष्मोप्यर्थोऽन्यस्मै प्रकाश्यते । धर्मेण केनचिद्यत्र तत्सूक्ष्मं परिचक्षते ॥ K. P. 10.<BR>—8 The cavity of a tooth.<BR>—9 Marrow.<BR>—10 The Vedānta philosophy.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूक्ष्मात्मन्, सूक्ष्मैला, सूक्ष्मतण्डुलः, सूक्ष्मतण्डुला, सूक्ष्मदर्शिता, सूक्ष्मदर्शिन्, सूक्ष्मदृष्टि, सूक्ष्मदलः, सूक्ष्मदारु, सूक्ष्मदेहः, सूक्ष्मशरीरम्, सूक्ष्मपत्रः, सूक्ष्मपर्णी, सूक्ष्मपिप्पली, सूक्ष्मबीजः, सूक्ष्मबुद्धि, सूक्ष्मभूतम्, सूक्ष्ममक्षिकम्, सूक्ष्ममक्षिका, सूक्ष्ममति, सूक्ष्ममतिमत्, सूक्ष्ममानम्, सूक्ष्मशरीरम्, सूक्ष्मशर्करा, सूक्ष्मशालिः, सूक्ष्मषट्चरणः, सूक्ष्मस्फोटः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मात्मन्
सूक्ष्म + -आत्मन् <i>m.</i> N. of Śiva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मैला
सूक्ष्म + -एला small cardamoms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मतण्डुलः|सूक्ष्मतण्डुल|सूक्ष्मतंडुल
सूक्ष्म + -तण्डुलः the poppy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मतण्डुला|सूक्ष्मतंडुला
सूक्ष्म + -तण्डुला<BR>—1 long pepper.<BR>—2 a kind of grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मदर्शिता
सूक्ष्म + -दर्शिता quick-sightedness, acuteness, foresight, wisdom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मदर्शिन्
सूक्ष्म + -दर्शिन्, -दृष्टि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 sharp-sighted, eagle-eyed.<BR>—2 of acute discernment.<BR>—3 acute, sharp-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मदृष्टि
सूक्ष्म + -दर्शिन्, -दृष्टि <i>a.</i><BR>—1 sharp-sighted, eagle-eyed.<BR>—2 of acute discernment.<BR>—3 acute, sharp-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

