सूक्ष्मदारु
सूक्ष्म + -दारु <i>n.</i> a thin plank of wood, a board.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मदेहः|सूक्ष्मदेह
सूक्ष्म + -देहः, -शरीरम् the subtile body which is invested by the grosser<BR> material frame (= लिङ्गशरीर q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मशरीरम्
सूक्ष्म + -देहः, -शरीरम् the subtile body which is invested by the grosser<BR> material frame (= लिङ्गशरीर q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मपत्रः|सूक्ष्मपत्र
