सूक्ष्म + -पिप्पली wild pepper.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मबीजः|सूक्ष्मबीज
सूक्ष्म + -बीजः the poppy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मबुद्धि|सूक्ष्मबुद्धिः
सूक्ष्म + -बुद्धि <i>a.</i> sharp-witted, acute, shrewd, intelligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मबुद्धिः|सूक्ष्मबुद्धि
सूक्ष्म + -बुद्धि + .({@-द्धिः@} <i>f.</i>) sharp wit, acute intellect, mental acumen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मभूतम्
सूक्ष्म + -भूतम् a subtle element.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्ममक्षिकम्
सूक्ष्म + -मक्षिकम्, -मक्षिका a mosquito, gnat.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">Page1696-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्ममक्षिका
सूक्ष्म + -मक्षिकम्, -मक्षिका a mosquito, gnat.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">Page1696-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्ममति
सूक्ष्म + -मति, -मतिमत् <i>a.</i> acute-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्ममतिमत्|सूक्ष्ममतिमन्त्
सूक्ष्म + -मति, -मतिमत् <i>a.</i> acute-minded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्ममानम्
सूक्ष्म + -मानम् a nice or exact measurement, precise computation (opp.<BR> स्थूलमान which means ‘broad measurement’, ‘rough calculation’).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मशरीरम्
सूक्ष्म + -शरीरम् (in phil.) a subtle body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मशर्करा
