सूक्ष्मशालिः|सूक्ष्मशालि
सूक्ष्म + -शालिः a kind of fine rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मषट्चरणः|सूक्ष्मषट्चरण
सूक्ष्म + -षट्चरणः a sort of louse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मस्फोटः|सूक्ष्मस्फोट
सूक्ष्म + -स्फोटः a kind of leprosy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूक्ष्मता
सूक्ष्मता minuteness, subtlety, fineness; सूक्ष्मतां चान्ववेक्षेत<BR> योगेन परमात्मनः Ms. 6. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूच्
सूच् €10 U. (सूचयति-ते, सूचित)<BR>—1 To pierce.<BR>—2 To point out, indicate, show, manifest, prove; त्वां सूचयिष्यति तु<BR> माल्यसमुद्भवोऽयं (गन्धः) Mk. 1. 35; Me. 21; प्रस्निग्धाः क्वचिदिङ्गुदीफलभिदः<BR> सूच्यन्त एवोपलाः Ś. 1. 14.<BR>—3 To betray, divulge, reveal; स जातु सेव्यमानोऽपि गुप्तद्वारो न सूच्यते R. 17. 50.<BR>—4 To hint, intimate, suggest.<BR>—5 To gesticulate, act, indicate by gestures or signs; वामाक्षिस्पन्दनं<BR> सूचयति; रथवेगं सूचयति &c.<BR>—6 To trace out, spy, ascertain. ━<i>With</i> {@अभि@} to show, indicate; अमन्यत<BR> नलं प्राप्तं कर्मचेष्टाभिसूचितम् Mb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचः|सूच
सूचः A pointed shoot or blade of Kuśa grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचक|सूचकः
सूचक <i>a.</i> (-चिका <i>f.</i>)<BR> [सूच्-ण्वुल्]<BR>—1 Indicative, indicating, proving, showing.<BR>—2 Betraying, informing; स विनाशं व्रजत्याशु सूचकोऽशुचिरेव च<BR> Ms. 4. 71, 11. 50.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचकः|सूचक
सूचक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A piercer.<BR>—2 A needle, any instrument for perforating or sewing.<BR>—3 An informer, a tale-bearer, traducer, spy; नृपं संसूचयेत् ज्ञात्वा<BR> सूचकः स उदाहृतः Śukra. 4. 589.<BR>—4 A narrator, teacher, an instructor.<BR>—5 The manager or chief actor of a company.<BR>—6 A Buddha.<BR>—7 A <i>Siddha</i>.<BR>—8 A villain, scoundrel.<BR>—9 A demon, goblin.<BR>—10 A dog.<BR>—11 A crow.<BR>—12 A cat.<BR>—13 A kind of fine rice.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूचकवाक्यम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचकवाक्यम्
सूचक + -वाक्यम् the information given by an informer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचनम्
सूचनम्, -ना<BR> [सूच्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 The act of piercing or perforating, boring, perforation.<BR>—2 Pointing out, indication, intimation.<BR>—3 Informing against, betraying, calumniating, traducing.<BR>—4 Gesticulation, indicating by proper signs or gestures.<BR>—5 Hinting, hint.<BR>—6 Information.<BR>—7 Teaching, showing, describing.<BR>—8 Spying out, spying, seeing, ascertaining.<BR>—9 Villainy, wickedness.<BR>—10 Hurting, killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचना
सूचनम्, -ना<BR> [सूच्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 The act of piercing or perforating, boring, perforation.<BR>—2 Pointing out, indication, intimation.<BR>—3 Informing against, betraying, calumniating, traducing.<BR>—4 Gesticulation, indicating by proper signs or gestures.<BR>—5 Hinting, hint.<BR>—6 Information.<BR>—7 Teaching, showing, describing.<BR>—8 Spying out, spying, seeing, ascertaining.<BR>—9 Villainy, wickedness.<BR>—10 Hurting, killing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचनी
सूचनी A short index or table of contents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचा
सूचा<BR>—1 Piercing.<BR>—2 Gesticulation.<BR>—3 Spying out, seeing, sight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिः|सूचि
सूचिः, -ची <i>f.</i><BR> [सूच्-इन् वा ङीप्]<BR>—1 Piercing, perforating.<BR>—2 A needle; निमेषादपि कौन्तेय यस्यायुरपचीयते । सूच्येबाञ्जनचूर्णस्य<BR> किमिति प्रतिपालयेत् ॥ Mb. 3. 35. 3.<BR>—3 Sharp point or pointed blade (as of Kuśa grass); अभिनवकुशसूच्या<BR> परिक्षतं मे चरणम् Ś. 1; so मुखे कुशसूचिविद्धे Ś. 4. 13.<BR>—4 The sharp point or tip of anything; कः करं प्रसारयेत् पन्नगरत्नसूचये Ku. 5. 43.<BR>—5 The point of a bud.<BR>—6 A kind of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">Page1697-1</a>]<BR> military array, a sharp column or file; दण्डव्यहेन तन्मार्गं यायात्<BR> तु शकटेन वा । वराहमकराभ्यां वा सूच्या वा गरुडेन वा Ms. 7. 187.<BR>—7 A triangle formed by the sides of a trapezium produced till they meet.<BR>—8 A cone, pyramid.<BR>—9 Indication by gesture, communicating by signs, gesticulation.<BR>—10 A particular mode of dancing.<BR>—11 Dramatic action.<BR>—12 An index, a table of contents.<BR>—13 A list, catalogue.<BR>—14 The earthʼs disc in computing eclipses (in astr.).<BR>—15 A rail or balustrade.<BR>—16 A small door-bolt.<BR>—17 A kind of coitus.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूच्यग्र, सूच्यास्यः, सूचिकटाहन्यायः, सूचिकर्मन्, सूचिखातः, सूचिगृहकम्, सूचिपत्रकम्, सूचिपुष्पः, सूचिभिन्न, सूचिभेद्य, सूचिमुख, सूचिरदनः, सूचिरोमन्, सूचिवदन, सूचिशालिः, सूचिशिखा, सूचिसूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूची
सूचिः, -ची <i>f.</i><BR> [सूच्-इन् वा ङीप्]<BR>—1 Piercing, perforating.<BR>—2 A needle; निमेषादपि कौन्तेय यस्यायुरपचीयते । सूच्येबाञ्जनचूर्णस्य<BR> किमिति प्रतिपालयेत् ॥ Mb. 3. 35. 3.<BR>—3 Sharp point or pointed blade (as of Kuśa grass); अभिनवकुशसूच्या<BR> परिक्षतं मे चरणम् Ś. 1; so मुखे कुशसूचिविद्धे Ś. 4. 13.<BR>—4 The sharp point or tip of anything; कः करं प्रसारयेत् पन्नगरत्नसूचये Ku. 5. 43.<BR>—5 The point of a bud.<BR>—6 A kind of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">Page1697-1</a>]<BR> military array, a sharp column or file; दण्डव्यहेन तन्मार्गं यायात्<BR> तु शकटेन वा । वराहमकराभ्यां वा सूच्या वा गरुडेन वा Ms. 7. 187.<BR>—7 A triangle formed by the sides of a trapezium produced till they meet.<BR>—8 A cone, pyramid.<BR>—9 Indication by gesture, communicating by signs, gesticulation.<BR>—10 A particular mode of dancing.<BR>—11 Dramatic action.<BR>—12 An index, a table of contents.<BR>—13 A list, catalogue.<BR>—14 The earthʼs disc in computing eclipses (in astr.).<BR>—15 A rail or balustrade.<BR>—16 A small door-bolt.<BR>—17 A kind of coitus.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूच्यग्र, सूच्यास्यः, सूचिकटाहन्यायः, सूचिकर्मन्, सूचिखातः, सूचिगृहकम्, सूचिपत्रकम्, सूचिपुष्पः, सूचिभिन्न, सूचिभेद्य, सूचिमुख, सूचिरदनः, सूचिरोमन्, सूचिवदन, सूचिशालिः, सूचिशिखा, सूचिसूत्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1696-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूच्यग्र
सूचिः + -अग्र <i>a.</i> needle-pointed, having a sharp needle-like point, acuminated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूच्यग्रम्
सूचिः + -अग्र + .({@-ग्रम्@}) the point of a needle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूच्यास्यः|सूच्यास्य
सूचिः + -आस्यः a rat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिकटाहन्यायः|सूचिकटाहन्याय
सूचिः + -कटाहन्यायः see under न्याय.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिकर्मन्
सूचिः + -कर्मन् needle-work.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिखातः|सूचिखात
सूचिः + -खातः a sharp pyramid or pyramidal excavation, a cone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिगृहकम्
सूचिः + -गृहकम् a needle-case.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिपत्रकम्
सूचिः + -पत्रकम् an index, a table of contents.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिपत्रकः|सूचिपत्रक
सूचिः + -पत्रकम् + .({@-कः@}) a kind of pot-herb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिपुष्पः|सूचिपुष्प
सूचिः + -पुष्पः the Ketaka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिभिन्न
सूचिः + -भिन्न <i>a.</i> bursting open at the point of the buds; पाण्डुच्छायोपवनवृतयः<BR> केतकैः सूचिभिन्नैः Me. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिभेद्य
सूचिः + -भेद्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 to be pierced or penetrated by a needle.<BR>—2 thick, dense, pitchy, gross, utter; रुद्धालोके नरपतिपथे सूचिभेद्यैस्तमोभिः Me. 39.<BR>—3 palpable, tangible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिमुख|सूचिमुखः
सूचिः + -मुख <i>a.</i><BR>—1 needle-mouthed, having a pointed beak.<BR>—2 pointed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिमुखः|सूचिमुख
सूचिः + -मुख + .({@-खः@})<BR>—1 a bird.<BR>—2 white Kuśa grass.<BR>—3 a particular position of the hands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिमुखम्
सूचिः + -मुख + .({@-खम्@}) a diamond.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिरदनः|सूचिरदन
सूचिः + -रदनः a mungoose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिरोमन्
सूचिः + -रोमन् <i>m.</i> a hog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिवदन|सूचिवदनः
सूचिः + -वदन <i>a.</i> needle-faced, having a pointed beak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिवदनः|सूचिवदन
सूचिः + -वदन + .({@-नः@})<BR>—1 a gnat, mosquito.<BR>—2 a mungoose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिशालिः|सूचिशालि
सूचिः + -शालिः a kind of fine rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिशिखा
सूचिः + -शिखा the point of a needle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिसूत्रम्
सूचिः + -सूत्रम् a thread for a needle (for sewing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिः|सूचि
सूचिः <i>m.</i><BR>—1 The son of निषाद and a वैश्या.<BR>—2 A maker of winnowing baskets &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिकः|सूचिक
सूचिकः A tailor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिका
सूचिका [सूचि स्वार्थे क]<BR>—1 A needle.<BR>—2 An elephantʼs trunk.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूचिकाधरः, सूचिकामुख<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिकाधरः|सूचिकाधर
सूचिका + -धरः an elephant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिकामुख|सूचिकामुखं
सूचिका + -मुख <i>a.</i> having a pointed mouth or head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिकामुखम्
सूचिका + -मुख + .({@-खम्@}) a shell, the conchshell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचित|सूचितः
सूचित <i>p. p.</i> [सूच्-क्त]<BR>—1 Pierced, bored, perforated.<BR>—2 Pointed out, shown, intimated, indicated, hinted.<BR>—3 Made known or indicated by signs or gestures.<BR>—4 Communicated, told, revealed.<BR>—5 Ascertained, known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिन्
सूचिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Piercing, perforating.<BR>—2 Pointing out, intimating, indicating.<BR>—3 Informing against.<BR>—4 Spying out. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A spy, an informer; Mb. 13. 90. 9.<BR>—2 A kind of an arrow; न सूची कपिशो नैव न गवास्थिर्गजास्थिजः Mb. 7. 189. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिनी
सूचिनी<BR>—1 A needle.<BR>—2 A night.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूचिवत्|सूचिवन्त्
सूचिवत् <i>a.</i> Pointed. ━<i>m.</i> N. of Garuḍa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूची
सूची See सूचि above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूच्य
सूच्य <i>a.</i> Communicable, fit to be made known.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्
सूत् <i>ind.</i> An imitative sound (snorting, snoring &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत|सूतः
सूत <i>p. p.</i> [सू-क्त]<BR>—1 Born, begotten, engendered, produced.<BR>—2 Impelled, emitted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूतः|सूत
सूत + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 A charioteer; सूत, चोदयाश्वान् पुण्याश्रमदर्शनेन तावदात्मानं पुनीमहे<BR> Ś. 1; पुनः पुनः सूतनिषिद्धचापलं हरन्तमश्वं रथरश्मिसंयतम् R. 3. 42.<BR>—2 The son of a Kṣatriya by a woman of the Brāhmaṇa caste (his business<BR> being that of a charioteer); क्षत्रियाद् विप्रकन्यायां सूतो भवति जातितः<BR> Ms. 10. 11; सूतो वा सूतपुत्रो वा यो वा को वा भवाम्यहम् Ve. 3. 33.<BR>—3 The son of a Vaiśya by a Kṣatriya wife (his business being that of a bard).<BR>—4 A bard; पुरःसरैः स्वस्तिकसूतमागधैः Rām. 2. 17. 46; Bhāg. 1. 11. 20.<BR>—5 A carpenter.<BR>—6 The sun.<BR>—7 N. of a pupil of Vyāsa.<BR>—8 N. of Sañjaya (a pupil of Vyāsa); समरवृत्तविबोधसमीहया कुरुवरेण<BR> मुदा कृतयाचनः । सपदि सूतमदादमलेक्षणं मुनिवरं तमहं सततं<BR> भजे ॥ Veda-Vyāsāṣṭaka 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूतः|सूत
सूत + .{@-तः, -तम्@} Quick-silver.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूतजः, सूततनयः, सूतपुत्रः, सूतराज्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूतम्
सूत + .{@-तः, -तम्@} Quick-silver.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूतजः, सूततनयः, सूतपुत्रः, सूतराज्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूतजः|सूतज
सूत + -जः, -तनयः, -पुत्रः<BR>—1 an epithet of Sañjaya; तमेवंवादिनं राजा सूतपुत्रं कृताञ्जलिम्<BR> (अब्रवीत्) Mb. 8. 2. 9.<BR>—2 an epithet of Karṇa; कथयामास तत् सर्वं यथा शप्तः स सूतजः Mb. 12. 2. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

