सूतिः|सूति
सूतिः, सूती <i>f.</i> [सू-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Birth, production, parturition, delivery, child-bearing.<BR>—2 Offspring, progeny.<BR>—3 Source, fountain-head; तपसां सूतिरसूतिरापदाम् Ki. 2. 56.<BR>—4 A place where Soma juice is extracted.<BR>—5 Yielding fruit, production of crops; न कल्पते पुनः सूत्या उप्तं<BR> बीजं च नश्यति Bhāg. 7. 11. 33.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूत्यशौचम्, सूतिगृहम्, सूतिमारुतः, सूतिमासः, सूतिरोगः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूती
सूतिः, सूती <i>f.</i> [सू-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Birth, production, parturition, delivery, child-bearing.<BR>—2 Offspring, progeny.<BR>—3 Source, fountain-head; तपसां सूतिरसूतिरापदाम् Ki. 2. 56.<BR>—4 A place where Soma juice is extracted.<BR>—5 Yielding fruit, production of crops; न कल्पते पुनः सूत्या उप्तं<BR> बीजं च नश्यति Bhāg. 7. 11. 33.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूत्यशौचम्, सूतिगृहम्, सूतिमारुतः, सूतिमासः, सूतिरोगः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1697-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

