सूत्रम् + -कण्ठः<BR>—1 a Brāhmaṇa.<BR>—2 a pigeon, dove.<BR>—3 a wag-tail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रकर्मन्
सूत्रम् + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> carpentry; अथ भूमिप्रदेशज्ञाः सूत्रकर्मविशारदाः<BR> Rām. 2. 80. 1. ˚विशेषज्ञः a weaver; Rām. 2. 83. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रकारः|सूत्रकार
