सूत्रकृत्
सूत्रम् + -कारः, -कृत् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an author or composer of Sūtras.<BR>—2 a carpenter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

