सूत्रकोणकः|सूत्रकोणक
सूत्रम् + -कोणः, -कोणकः a small drum shaped like an hour-glass (डमरु).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रकोशः|सूत्रकोश
