सूत्रतन्तुः|सूत्रतन्तु
सूत्रम् + -तन्तुः<BR>—1 a thread, string.<BR>—2 perseverance, energy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रतर्कुटी
सूत्रम् + -तर्कुटी a distaff, spindle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रदरिद्र
सूत्रम् + -दरिद्र <i>a.</i> ‘poor in threads’, having a small number of threads,<BR> thread-bare; अयं पटः सूत्रदरिद्रतां गतः Mk. 2. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रधरः|सूत्रधर
सूत्रम् + -धरः, -धारः<BR>—1 ‘the thread-holder’, a stage-manager, the principal actor who arranges<BR> the cast of characters and instructs them, and takes a prominent part<BR> in the Prastāvanā or prelude; he is thus defined:− नाट्यस्य यदनुष्ठानं<BR> तत् सूत्रं स्यात् सबीजकम् । रङ्गदैवतपूजाकृत् सूत्रधार इति स्मृतः ॥<BR>—2 a carpenter, an artisan.<BR>—3 the author of a set of aphorisms.<BR>—4 an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रधारः|सूत्रधार
सूत्रम् + -धरः, -धारः<BR>—1 ‘the thread-holder’, a stage-manager, the principal actor who arranges<BR> the cast of characters and instructs them, and takes a prominent part<BR> in the Prastāvanā or prelude; he is thus defined:− नाट्यस्य यदनुष्ठानं<BR> तत् सूत्रं स्यात् सबीजकम् । रङ्गदैवतपूजाकृत् सूत्रधार इति स्मृतः ॥<BR>—2 a carpenter, an artisan.<BR>—3 the author of a set of aphorisms.<BR>—4 an epithet of Indra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रधृक्
सूत्रम् + -धृक् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 an architect.<BR>—2 a stage-manager.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रपातः|सूत्रपात
सूत्रम् + -पातः applying the measuring line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रपिटकः|सूत्रपिटक
सूत्रम् + -पिटकः N. of one of the three collections of Buddhistic writings.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रपुष्पः|सूत्रपुष्प
सूत्रम् + -पुष्पः the cotton plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रप्रोत
सूत्रम् + -प्रोत <i>a.</i> fastened<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">Page1698-2</a>]<BR> with wires (as puppets).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रभिद्
सूत्रम् + -भिद् <i>m.</i> a tailor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रभृत्
सूत्रम् + -भृत् <i>m.</i> = सूत्रधार q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रयन्त्रम्
सूत्रम् + -यन्त्रम्<BR>—1 ‘a thread-machine’, shuttle.<BR>—2 a weaverʼs loom; सूत्रयन्त्रजविशिष्टचेष्टयाश्चर्यसञ्जिबहुशालभञ्जिकः N. 18. 13.<BR>—3 a shuttle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रवापः|सूत्रवाप
सूत्रम् + -वापः weaving (threads).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रवीणा
सूत्रम् + -वीणा a kind of lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रवेष्टनम्
सूत्रम् + -वेष्टनम्<BR>—1 a weaverʼs shuttle.<BR>—2 the act of weaving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रशाखम्
सूत्रम् + -शाखम् the body.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रस्थानम्
सूत्रम् + -स्थानम् (in medic. works) the first general section (treating<BR> of the physician, disease, remedies &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रणम्
सूत्रणम्<BR>—1 The act of stringing together, putting in order, arranging.<BR>—2 Arranging in aphorisms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रला
सूत्रला A spindle or distaff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रामन्
सूत्रामन् = सुत्रामन् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रिका
सूत्रिका A kind of dish (Mar. शेवया).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रित
सूत्रित <i>p. p.</i> [सूत्र्-क्त]<BR>—1 Strung, arranged, methodised, systematized.<BR>—2 Prescribed in Sūtras, delivered in aphorisms.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूत्रिन्
सूत्रिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [सूत्र अस्त्यर्थे इनि]<BR>—1 Having threads.<BR>—2 Having rules. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A crow.<BR>—2 A stage-manager.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूद्
सूद् I. €1 Ā. (सूदते)<BR>—1 To strike, hurt, wound, kill, destroy.<BR>—2 To effuse, pour out.<BR>—3 To deposit.<BR>—4 To distil, flow.<BR>—5 To eject, throw away. ━II. €10 U. (सूदयति-ते)<BR>—1 To incite, prompt, excite, urge on, animate.<BR>—2 To strike, hurt, kill; मुष्टिभिर्बाहुभिः पद्भिः सूदयन्तौ तु राक्षसम् Rām. 3. 4. 7.<BR>—3 To cook, dress, season, prepare.<BR>—4 To pour out, effuse.<BR>—5 To assent, agree, promise.<BR>—6 To eject, throw away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदः|सूद
सूदः [सूद्-अच्]<BR>—1 Destroying, destruction, massacre.<BR>—2 Pouring out, distilling.<BR>—3 A well, spring.<BR>—4 A cook.<BR>—5 Sauce, soup.<BR>—6 Anything seasoned, a prepared dish.<BR>—7 Split pease.<BR>—8 Mud, mire.<BR>—9 Sin, fault.<BR>—10 The office of a charioteer.<BR>—11 The Lodhra tree.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूदाध्यक्षः, सूदकर्मन्, सूदशाला, सूदशास्त्रम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदाध्यक्षः|सूदाध्यक्ष
सूदः + -अध्यक्षः a superintendent of the kitchen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदकर्मन्
सूदः + -कर्मन् <i>n.</i> cookery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदशाला
सूदः + -शाला a kitchen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदशास्त्रम्
सूदः + -शास्त्रम् the science of cooking.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदन|सूदनं
सूदन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [सूद्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Destroying, killing, destructive; दानवसूदन, अरिगणसूदन &c.;<BR> विषीदन्तमिदं वाक्यमुवाच मधुसूदनः Bg. 2. 1, 4.<BR>—2 Dear, beloved.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूदनम्
सूदन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Destroying, destruction, massacre.<BR>—2 Assenting to, promising.<BR>—3 Ejecting, throwing away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सून|सूनं|सूनः
सून <i>p. p.</i> [सू-क्त क्तस्य नः]<BR>—1 Born, produced.<BR>—2 Blown, blossomed, opened, budded.<BR>—3 Empty, vacant (perhaps for शून or शून्य in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनम्
सून + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Bringing forth, parturition.<BR>—2 A bud, blossom.<BR>—3 A flower; दत्तां केनापि सूनावलिमधिमुकुटं भृन्मयीमेव दध्रे Viś. Guṇā. 197.<BR>—4 Fruit.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूननायकः, सूनशरः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूननायकः
सून + -नायकः, -शरः the god of love; सूननायकनिदेशविभ्रमैरप्रतीतचरवेदनोदयम् N. 18. 129.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनशरः|सूनशर
सून + -नायकः, -शरः the god of love; सूननायकनिदेशविभ्रमैरप्रतीतचरवेदनोदयम् N. 18. 129.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनरी
सूनरी A happy woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1698-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूना
सूना [सुञः नः दीर्घश्च Uṇ. 3. 13]<BR>—1 A slaughter-house, butcherʼs house; भवानपि सूनोपरिचर इव गृध्र<BR> आमिषलोलुपो भीरुकश्च M. 2.<BR>—2 The sale of meat.<BR>—3 Hurting, killing, destroying; सूनायामप्यननुमतमालम्भनं तदुपलभ्य<BR> Bhāg. 5. 9. 17.<BR>—4 The soft palate, uvula.<BR>—5 A girdle, zone.<BR>—6 Inflammation of the gland of the neck called mumps.<BR>—7 A ray of light.<BR>—8 A river.<BR>—9 A daughter.<BR>—10 An elephantʼs trunk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनाः
सूना + .{@-नाः@} (<i>f.</i> pl.) The five things in a house by which animal life<BR> is likely to be destroyed; see under शूना or पञ्चशूना.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूनाध्यक्षः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनाध्यक्षः
सूना + -अध्यक्षः a superintendent of the slaughter-house.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनावत्|सूनावन्त्
सूनावत् A keeper of a slaughter-house; Ms. 4. 84.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनिकः|सूनिक
सूनिकः, सूनिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A butcher, flesh-seller; Y. 1. 141.<BR>—2 A hunter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनिन्
सूनिकः, सूनिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A butcher, flesh-seller; Y. 1. 141.<BR>—2 A hunter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनुः|सूनु
सूनुः [सू नुक्]<BR>—1 A son; पितुरहमेवैको सूनुरभवम् K.; सूनुः सूनृतवाक् स्रष्टुः R. 1. 93.<BR>—2 A child, an offspring.<BR>—3 A grandson (daughterʼs son).<BR>—4 A younger brother; अनुस्मृताखण्डलसूनुविक्रमः Ki. 1. 24.<BR>—5 The sun; सूनुः पुत्रेऽनुजे रवौ इति विश्वः. —6 The Arka plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनू
सूनू <i>f.</i> A daughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनृत|सूनृतं
सूनृत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 True and pleasant, kind and sincere; तत्र सूनृतगिरश्च सूरयः<BR> पुण्यमृग्यजुषमध्यगीषत Śi. 14. 21; R. 1. 93.<BR>—2 Kind, affable, gentle, courteous; तां चाप्येतां मातरं मङ्गलानां<BR> धेनुं धीराः सूनृतां वाचमाहुः U. 5. 31; तृणानि भूमिरुदकं वाक् चतुर्थी<BR> च सूनृता । एतान्यपि सतां गेहे नोच्छिद्यन्ते कदाचन ॥ Ms. 3. 101; R. 6. 29.<BR>—3 Auspicious, fortunate.<BR>—4 Beloved, dear.<BR>—5 Ved. Quick, active.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनृता
सूनृत + .{@-ता@}<BR>—1 The goddess of true speech.<BR>—2 An excellent song.<BR>—3 N. of Uṣas.<BR>—4 Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूनृतम्
सूनृत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 True and agreeable speech.<BR>—2 Kind and pleasant discourse, courteous language; तेनाष्टौ परिगमिताः<BR> समाः कथंचिद् बालत्वादवितथसूनृतेन सूनोः R. 8. 92.<BR>—3 Auspiciousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूपः|सूप
सूपः [सुखेन पीयते, सु-पा घञर्थे क पृषो˚ Tv.]<BR>—1 Broth, soup; सूपं भूयिष्ठमश्नीध्वं नाद्य मांसं यथा पुरा Mb. 12. 29. 128;<BR> न स जानाति शास्त्रार्थं दर्वी सूपरसानिव Subhāṣ.; Ms. 3. 226.<BR>—2 A sauce, condiment; पच्यन्तां विविधाः पाकाः सूपान्ताः पायसादयः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 24. 26, 11. 27. 34.<BR>—3 A cook.<BR>—4 A pan, vessel.<BR>—5 An arrow.<BR>—6 Split pease.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: सूपाङ्गम्, सूपकारः, सूपधूपनम्, सूपधूपकम्, सूपश्रेष्ठः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूपाङ्गम्
सूपः + -अङ्गम् Asa-foetida.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूपकारः|सूपकार
सूपः + -कारः a cook.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूपधूपनम्
