सूरता
सूरत + .{@-ता@} A tractable cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूरिः|सूरि
सूरिः [सू-क्रिन्]<BR>—1 The sun.<BR>—2 A learned or wise man, a sage; अथवा कृतवाग्द्वारे वंशेऽस्मिन् पूर्वसूरिभिः<BR> R. 1. 4; Śi. 14. 21; Bhāg. 1. 1. 1.<BR>—3 A priest.<BR>—4 A worshipper.<BR>—5 A title of respect given to Jaina teachers; <i>e. g.</i> मल्लिनाथसूरि.<BR>—6 N. of Kṛṣṇa.<BR>—7 N. of Bṛhaspati.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

