सूरिन् <i>a.</i> (-णी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Wise, learned. ━<i>m.</i> A wise or learned man, scholar, <i>pandit</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1699-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूरी
