सूर्यः + -कान्तिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 sun-light.<BR>—2 a particular flower.<BR>—3 the flower of sesamum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यकालः|सूर्यकाल|सूर्य्यकाल|सूर्य्यकालः
सूर्यः + -कालः day-time, day. ˚अनलचक्रम् a particular astrological<BR> diagram for indicating good and bad fortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यग्रहः|सूर्यग्रह|सूर्य्यग्रह|सूर्य्यग्रहः
सूर्यः + -ग्रहः<BR>—1 the sun.<BR>—2 an eclipse of the sun.<BR>—3 an epithet of Rāhu and Ketu.<BR>—4 the bottom of a water-jar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यग्रहणम्
सूर्यः + -ग्रहणम् a solar eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यचन्द्रौ
सूर्यः + -चन्द्रौ (also सूर्याचन्द्रमसौ) <i>m.</i> du. the sun and moon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यजः|सूर्यज|सूर्य्यज|सूर्य्यजः
सूर्यः + -जः, -तनयः, -पुत्रः<BR>—1 epithets of Sugrīva; योऽहं सूर्यसुतः स एष भवतां योऽयं स<BR> वत्सोऽङ्गदः Mv. 5. 55.<BR>—2 of Karṇa.<BR>—3 of the planet Saturn.<BR>—4 of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यतनयः|सूर्यतनय|सूर्य्यतनय|सूर्य्यतनयः
सूर्यः + -जः, -तनयः, -पुत्रः<BR>—1 epithets of Sugrīva; योऽहं सूर्यसुतः स एष भवतां योऽयं स<BR> वत्सोऽङ्गदः Mv. 5. 55.<BR>—2 of Karṇa.<BR>—3 of the planet Saturn.<BR>—4 of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यपुत्रः|सूर्यपुत्र|सूर्य्यपुत्त्र|सूर्य्यपुत्त्रः|सूर्य्यपुत्र
सूर्यः + -जः, -तनयः, -पुत्रः<BR>—1 epithets of Sugrīva; योऽहं सूर्यसुतः स एष भवतां योऽयं स<BR> वत्सोऽङ्गदः Mv. 5. 55.<BR>—2 of Karṇa.<BR>—3 of the planet Saturn.<BR>—4 of Yama.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यजा|सूर्य्यजा
सूर्यः + -जा, -तनया the river Yamunā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यतनया|सूर्य्यतनया
सूर्यः + -जा, -तनया the river Yamunā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यतेजस्|सूर्य्यतेजस्
सूर्यः + -तेजस् <i>n.</i> the radiance or heat of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यद्वारम्
सूर्यः + -द्वारम् the way of the sun; उत्तरायण q. v.; सूर्यद्वारेण<BR> ते विरजाः प्रयान्ति यत्रामृतः स पुरुषो ह्यव्ययात्मा Muṇḍ. 1. 2. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यनक्षत्रम्
सूर्यः + -नक्षत्रम् that constellation (out of the 27) in which the sun happens to be.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यपर्वन्|सूर्य्यपर्वन्
सूर्यः + -पर्वन् <i>n.</i> a solar festival, (on the days of the solstices,<BR> equinoxes, eclipses &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यपादः|सूर्यपाद
सूर्यः + -पादः a sun-beam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यपुत्री|सूर्य्यपुत्री
सूर्यः + -पुत्री<BR>—1 lightning.<BR>—2 the river Yamunā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यप्रभव|सूर्य्यप्रभव
सूर्यः + -प्रभव <i>a.</i> sprung or descended from the sun; क्व सूर्यप्रभवो<BR> वंशः क्व चाल्पविषया मतिः R. 1. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यफणिचक्रम्
सूर्यः + -फणिचक्रम् = सूर्यकालानलचक्रम् q. v. above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यबिम्बः|सूर्यबिम्ब
सूर्यः + -बिम्बः the disc of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यभक्त|सूर्यभक्तः|सूर्य्यभक्त|सूर्य्यभक्तः
सूर्यः + -भक्त <i>a.</i> one who worships the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यभक्तः|सूर्यभक्त|सूर्य्यभक्त|सूर्य्यभक्तः
सूर्यः + -भक्त + .({@-क्तः@}) the tree Bandhūka or its flower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यमणिः|सूर्यमणि|सूर्य्यमणि|सूर्य्यमणिः
सूर्यः + -मणिः the sun-stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यमण्डलम्
सूर्यः + -मण्डलम् the orb of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यमासः|सूर्यमास
सूर्यः + -मासः the solar month.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्ययन्त्रम्
सूर्यः + -यन्त्रम्<BR>—1 a representation of the sun (used in worshipping him).<BR>—2 an instrument used in taking solar observations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यरश्मिः|सूर्यरश्मि|सूर्य्यरश्मि
सूर्यः + -रश्मिः a ray of the sun, sun-beam; Ms. 5. 133.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यलोकः|सूर्यलोक|सूर्य्यलोक|सूर्य्यलोकः
सूर्यः + -लोकः the heaven of the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यवंशः|सूर्यवंश|सूर्य्यवंशः
सूर्यः + -वंशः the solar race of kings (who ruled at Ayodhyā).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यवर्चस्|सूर्य्यवर्च्चस्
सूर्यः + -वर्चस् <i>a.</i> resplendent as the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यवारः|सूर्यवार
सूर्यः + -वारः Sunday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यविलोकनम्
सूर्यः + -विलोकनम् the ceremony of taking a child out to see the sun when<BR> four months old; cf. उपनिष्क्रमणम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यसंक्रमः|सूर्यसङ्क्रम|सूर्य्यसङ्क्रम
सूर्यः + -संक्रमः, -संक्रातिः <i>f.</i> the sunʼs passage from one zodiacal<BR> sign to another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यसंक्रातिः
सूर्यः + -संक्रमः, -संक्रातिः <i>f.</i> the sunʼs passage from one zodiacal<BR> sign to another.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यसंज्ञम्
सूर्यः + -संज्ञम् saffron.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यसारथिः|सूर्यसारथि|सूर्य्यसारथि|सूर्य्यसारथिः
सूर्यः + -सारथिः an epithet of Aruṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यसिद्धान्तः|सूर्यसिद्धान्त
सूर्यः + -सिद्धान्तः a celebrated astronomical work (supposed to have been<BR> revealed by the god Sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यस्तुतिः|सूर्यस्तुति
सूर्यः + -स्तुतिः <i>f.</i>, {@-स्तोत्रम्@}<BR> a hymn addressed to the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्यहृदयम्
सूर्यः + -हृदयम् N. of a hymn to the sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्या|सूर्य्या
सूर्या<BR>—1 The wife of the sun.<BR>—2 The daughter of the sun.<BR>—3 The hymn about the marriage of Śūryā.<BR>—4 A new bride.<BR>—5 A drug.<BR>—6 The colocynth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्याणी
सूर्याणी The wife of the god Sun.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्याय्
सूर्याय् (Den.) To act like the sun; सूर्यायते पावकः Pañc. 1. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूरत|सूरतः
सूरत <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Compassionate, tender.<BR>—2 Tranquil, calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूरता
सूरत + .{@-ता@} A tractable cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्क्ष्
सूर्क्ष् €1 P. To respect, regard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूर्क्षणम्
सूर्क्षणम् Disrespect (probably, respect); MW.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूष्
सूष् €1 P. [सूषति] To bring forth, bear, produce, beget.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूषणा
सूषणा A mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूषा
सूषा A parturient woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सूष्यती
सूष्यती A woman about to be confined, one who is parturient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सृ
सृ €1. €3 P. (सरति, ससर्ति, also धावति; ससार, असार्षीत्,<BR> असरत्, सरिष्यति, सर्तुम्, सृत)<BR>—1 To go, move, proceed; मृगाः प्रदक्षिणं सस्रुः Bk. 14. 14.<BR>—2 To go towards, approach; निष्पाद्य हरयः सेतुं प्रतीताः सस्रुरर्णवम् Rām.<BR>—3 To rush upon, assail; ब्राह्मणार्थे समुत्पन्ने योऽरिभिः सृत्य युध्यति<BR> Mb. 12. 97. 10; (तं) ससाराभिमुखः शूरः शार्दूल इव कुञ्जरम् Mb.<BR>—4 To run, go fast, slip away from; सरति सहसा बाह्वोर्मध्यं गताप्यबला<BR> सती M. 4. 11.<BR>—5 To blow (as wind); तं चेद्वायौ सरति सरलस्कन्धसंघट्टजन्मा Me. 55.<BR>—6 To flow.<BR>—7 To cross, traverse. ━<i>Caus.</i> (सारयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to go or move.<BR>—2 To extend.<BR>—3 To rub, touch gently (with the fingers); तन्त्रीमार्द्रां नयनसलिलैः<BR> सारयित्वा कथंचित् Me. 88.<BR>—4 To push back or away, remove; सारयन्तीं गण्डाभोगात् कठिनविषमामेकवेणीं<BR> करेण Me. 93.<BR>—5 To put in array, arrange.<BR>—6 To show, manifest. ━<i>Desid.</i> (सिसीर्षति) To wish to go &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सृकः|सृक
सृकः [सृ-कक्]<BR>—1 Air, wind.<BR>—2 An arrow.<BR>—3 A thunder-bolt.<BR>—4 A lotus (कैरव).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सृका
सृकः + .{@-का@}<BR>—1 A jackal.<BR>—2 A crane.<BR>—3 A hell.<BR>—4 A kind of weapon; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सृकण्डु|सृकंडु|सृकण्डुः
सृकण्डु <i>f.</i> Itch, scab.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सृकालः|सृकाल
सृकालः A jackal; see शृगाल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1700-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सृक्कम्
