सृप्
सृप् €1 P. (सर्पति, सृप्त; <i>desid.</i> सिसृप्सति)<BR>—1 To creep, crawl, glide gently; सर्पन्तीत्येवमाससृपुस्ते ह Ch. Up. 1. 12. 4.<BR>—2 To go, move; हृदयादिव सृप्तो हृदयादिव निर्मितः Bṛ. Up. 3. 9. 22.<BR>—3 To spread; सर्पन्महाधूम इवाद्रिवह्निः Ki. 17. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

