सृपाटिका
सृपाटिका The beak of a bird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सृपाटी
सृपाटी<BR>—1 A kind of measure.<BR>—2 A shoe.<BR>—3 Base metal.<BR>—4 A small book.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सृप्मन्
सृप्मन् [सृप्-मनिन् Uṇ. 4. 159]<BR>—1 A goer.<BR>—2 A serpent.<BR>—3 A child.<BR>—4 An ascetic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1701-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

