सो
सो €4 P. (स्यति, ससौ, असात्-असासीत्, सास्यति, सातुम्, सित; <i>caus.</i><BR> साययति-ते; <i>desid.</i> सिषासति; <i>pass.</i> सीयते;<BR> the स् of सो is changed to ष् after prepositions ending in इ or उ)<BR>—1 To kill, destroy.<BR>—2 To finish, complete, bring to an end; भ्रान्तिमसाद्दमस्वसुः N. 9. 140.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

