सोत्प्रेक्षम् <i>ind.</i> Carelessly, with indifference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1704-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्सङ्ग
