सोत्सुक
सोत्सुक <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Regretful, repining, anxious, sorrowful.<BR>—2 Yearning, longing for.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोत्सेक
