सोत्सेध
सोत्सेध <i>a.</i> Raised, elevated, high, lofty; सोत्सेधैः स्कन्धदेशैः Mu. 4. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोदय|सोदयं
