सोद्वेग
सोद्वेग <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Anxious, apprehensive.<BR>—2 Sorrowful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोद्वेगम्
