सोपचय
सोपचय <i>a.</i> Profitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोपचार
सोपचार <i>a.</i> Acting politely, civil, courteous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1705-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोपद्रव
