सोमः + -शकला a kind of cucumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमसंस्था
सोमः + -संस्था a form of the Soma-sacrifice; (these are seven:− अग्निष्टोम,<BR> अत्यग्निष्टोम, उक्थ, षोडशी, अतिरात्र, आप्तोर्याम and वाजपेय).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमसंज्ञम्
सोमः + -संज्ञम् camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमसद्
सोमः + -सद् <i>m.</i> a particular class of Manes or Pitṛs; विराट्सुताः<BR> सोमसदः साध्यानां पितरः स्मृताः Ms. 3. 195.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमसिद्धान्तः|सोमसिद्धान्त
सोमः + -सिद्धान्तः the doctrine of Kāpālikas; या सोमसिद्धान्तमयाननेव N. 10. 87.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमसिन्धुः|सोमसिन्धु|सोमसिंधु
सोमः + -सिन्धुः an epithet of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमसुत्
सोमः + -सुत् <i>m.</i> a Soma distiller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमसुत्वत्
सोमः + -सुत्वत् <i>a.</i> pressing Soma-plant for juice; अध्वरेष्वग्निचित्वत्सु<BR> सोमसुत्वत आश्रमान् Bk. 5. 11.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमसुता
सोमः + -सुता the river Narmadā; cf. सोमोद्भवा above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमसूत्रम्
सोमः + -सूत्रम् a channel for conveying water from a <i>Śiva-liṅga</i>.<BR> ˚प्रदक्षिणा circumambulation around a <i>Siva-liṅga</i> so as not<BR> to cross the <i>Soma-sūtra</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमन्
सोमन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 The moon.<BR>—2 Ved. A Soma sacrificer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमिन्
सोमिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Performing the Soma sacrifice. ━<i>m.</i> A performer<BR> of a Soma sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमल
सोमल <i>a.</i> Soft, bland, placid (MW. gives सोमाल in this sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोमालकः|सोमालक
सोमालकः Topaz.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोम्य
सोम्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Worthy of Soma.<BR>—2 Offering Soma.<BR>—3 Resembling or shaped like Soma.<BR>—4 Soft, good, amiable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोरः|सोर
सोरः A crooked movement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोरण
सोरण <i>a.</i> Astringent; sour (taste); also सोल.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोर्णभ्रू
सोर्णभ्रू <i>a.</i> Having a circle of hair between the eyebrows; सोर्णभ्रुवं<BR> वारणबस्तिकोशं सविस्मयं राजसुतं ददर्श Bu. C. 1. 66.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोलः|सोल
सोलः, -सोलिकः<BR> Coldness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सोलिकः|सोलिक
सोलः, -सोलिकः<BR> Coldness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1706-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

