सौखिकी
सौखिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), सौखीय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to pleasure, pleasureable, delightful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1707-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौखीय
सौखिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), सौखीय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to pleasure, pleasureable, delightful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1707-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौखीयी
सौखिक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>), सौखीय <i>a.</i> (-यी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Relating to pleasure, pleasureable, delightful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1707-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौख्यम्
