सौमेरव, -रुक <i>a.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1709-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सौमेरवी
सौमेरव, -रुक + .({@-रवी, -रुकी@} <i>f.</i>) Relating to or coming from Sumeru.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1709-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

