स्कन्धजः|स्कन्धज
स्कन्धः + -जः a tree growing from a principal stem.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1712-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्कन्धतरुः|स्कन्धतरु|स्कंधतरु
स्कन्धः + -तरुः the cocoa-nut tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1712-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्कन्धदेशः|स्कन्धदेश|स्कंधदेश
स्कन्धः + -देशः<BR>—1 the shoulder; इदमुपहितसूक्ष्मग्रन्थिना स्कन्धदेशे Ś. 1. 19.<BR>—2 that part of the elephantʼs body, where the driver sits.<BR>—3 the stem of a tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1712-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्कन्धपरिनिर्वाणम्
स्कन्धः + -परिनिर्वाणम् the annihilation of the elements of being (with Buddhists).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1712-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्कन्धपीठम्
