स्थिरता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Firmness, steadiness, stability.<BR>—2 Firm or vigorous effort, fortitude; उत्पक्ष्मणोर्नयनयोरुपरुद्धवृत्तिं<BR> बाष्पं कुरु स्थिरतया विरतानुबन्धम् Ś. 4. 14.<BR>—3 Constancy, firmness of mind.<BR>—4 Fixity.<BR>—5 Fearlessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थिरत्वम्
स्थिरता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Firmness, steadiness, stability.<BR>—2 Firm or vigorous effort, fortitude; उत्पक्ष्मणोर्नयनयोरुपरुद्धवृत्तिं<BR> बाष्पं कुरु स्थिरतया विरतानुबन्धम् Ś. 4. 14.<BR>—3 Constancy, firmness of mind.<BR>—4 Fixity.<BR>—5 Fearlessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

