स्थूल + -भूतम्^1 <i>n.</i> pl. the five grosser elements (according to Sāṃkhya phil.).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260501. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/174. note: k2 and body updated (k1 unchanged).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलमध्य
स्थूल + -मध्य <i>a.</i> thick in the middle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलमरिचम्
स्थूल + -मरिचम् a kind of berry (कक्कोल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलमानम्
स्थूल + -मानम् rough or inexact calculation, gross or rough computation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलमूलम्
स्थूल + -मूलम् a kind of radish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूललक्ष|स्थूललक्षः
स्थूल + -लक्ष, -लक्ष्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 munificent, liberal, generous; अकत्थनो मानयिता स्थूललक्ष्यः प्रियंवदः Mb. 3. 45. 10.<BR>—2 wise, learned.<BR>—3 inclined to recollect both benefits and injuries.<BR>—4 taking careless aim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूललक्ष्य|स्थूललक्ष्यः
स्थूल + -लक्ष, -लक्ष्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 munificent, liberal, generous; अकत्थनो मानयिता स्थूललक्ष्यः प्रियंवदः Mb. 3. 45. 10.<BR>—2 wise, learned.<BR>—3 inclined to recollect both benefits and injuries.<BR>—4 taking careless aim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूललक्षिता
स्थूल + -लक्षिता munificence, liberality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलवल्कलः|स्थूलवल्कल
स्थूल + -वल्कलः the red Lodhra tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलविषयः|स्थूलविषय
स्थूल + -विषयः a gross or material object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलशङ्खा|स्थूलशंखा
स्थूल + -शङ्खा a woman having a large vulva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलशरीरम्
स्थूल + -शरीरम् the grosser or material and perishable body (opp. सूक्ष्म<BR> or लिङ्ग-शरीर q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलशाटकः|स्थूलशाटक
स्थूल + -शाटकः + ({@-कम्@}), {@शाट(टि)का, -शाटिः@}<BR> a thick or coarse cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलशाटकम्
स्थूल + -शाटकः + ({@-कम्@}), {@शाट(टि)का, -शाटिः@}<BR> a thick or coarse cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलशाटिका
स्थूल + -शाटकः + ({@-कम्@}), {@शाट(टि)का, -शाटिः@}<BR> a thick or coarse cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलशाटिः|स्थूलशाटि
स्थूल + -शाटकः + ({@-कम्@}), {@शाट(टि)का, -शाटिः@}<BR> a thick or coarse cloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलशीर्षिका
स्थूल + -शीर्षिका a small ant having a large head in proportion to its size.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलशोफ
स्थूल + -शोफ <i>a.</i> greatly swollen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलषट्पदः|स्थूलषट्पद
स्थूल + -षट्पदः<BR>—1 a large bee.<BR>—2 a wasp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलसूक्ष्म
स्थूल + -सूक्ष्म <i>a.</i> mighty and subtle (as the god).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलस्कन्धः|स्थूलस्कन्ध|स्थूलस्कंध
स्थूल + -स्कन्धः the <i>lakucha</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलस्थूल
स्थूल + -स्थूल <i>a.</i> excessively thick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलहस्तः|स्थूलहस्त
स्थूल + -हस्तः<BR>—1 an elephantʼs trunk; दिड्नागानां पथि परिहरन् स्थूलहस्तावलेपान् Me. 14.<BR>—2 a large or coarse hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलक|स्थूलकः
स्थूलक <i>a.</i> Large, big, huge, bulky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलकः|स्थूलक
स्थूलक + .{@-कः@} A sort of grass or reed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलता
स्थूलता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Largeness, bulkiness, bigness; कौटिल्यं कचसंचये प्रवचने मान्द्यं<BR> त्रिके स्थूलता (दृश्यते) Pt. 1. 190.<BR>—2 Dulness, stupidity.<BR>—3 (In phil.) Grossness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलत्वम्
स्थूलता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Largeness, bulkiness, bigness; कौटिल्यं कचसंचये प्रवचने मान्द्यं<BR> त्रिके स्थूलता (दृश्यते) Pt. 1. 190.<BR>—2 Dulness, stupidity.<BR>—3 (In phil.) Grossness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलंभविष्णु|स्थूलम्भविष्णु
स्थूलंभविष्णु, स्थूलंभावुक <i>a.</i> Liable to become large<BR> or stout; P. III. 2. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलंभावुक|स्थूलम्भावुक
स्थूलंभविष्णु, स्थूलंभावुक <i>a.</i> Liable to become large<BR> or stout; P. III. 2. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलयति
स्थूलयति Den. P. To become big or stout, grow bulky or fat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थूलिन्
स्थूलिन् <i>m.</i> A camel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1724-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थेमन्
स्थेमन् <i>m.</i> Firmness, stability, fixity, fixedness; द्राघीयांसः<BR> संहताः स्थेमभाजः Śi. 18. 33; न यत्र स्थेमानं दधुरतिभयभ्रान्तनयनाः Bv. 1. 32.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थेय|स्थेयः
स्थेय <i>a.</i> [स्था-कर्मणि यत्] To be fixed or placed, to be settled or determined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थेयः|स्थेय
स्थेय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 A person chosen to settle a dispute (between two parties), an arbitrator,<BR> umpire, a judge; स्थेयाभ्यां गृध्रचक्राभ्यां वाचा संधिः कृतः क्षणात् H. 4. 1.<BR>—2 A domestic priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थेयस्
स्थेयस् <i>a.</i> (-सी <i>f.</i>)<BR> More firm, stronger; (compar. of स्थिर q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थेष्ठ|स्थेष्ठः
स्थेष्ठ <i>a.</i> Very firm, strongest; (superl. of स्थिर q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थैर्यम्
स्थैर्यम् [स्थिरस्य भावः ष्यञ्]<BR>—1 Firmness, stability, fixity, steadiness.<BR>—2 Continuance.<BR>—3 Firmness of mind, resolution, constancy; अमानित्वं … … स्थैर्यमात्मविनिग्रहः Bg. 13. 7.<BR>—4 Patience.<BR>—5 Hardness, solidity.<BR>—6 Subduing the senses (जितेन्द्रियत्व); ततस्तस्य परिज्ञाय महास्थैर्यं<BR> महामुनेः Rām. 7. 30. 27.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: स्थैर्यज<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थैर्यज
स्थैर्यम् + -ज <i>a.</i> see स्थावर; मानुषाः स्थैर्यजाश्चैव पृथग्भोगा विशेषतः<BR> Mb. 13. 117. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थोरिन्
स्थोरिन् = स्थौरिन्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थौणेयः|स्थौणेय|स्थौणेयं
स्थौणेयः, -स्थौणेयकः<BR>—1 A kind of perfume.<BR>—2 A carrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थौणेयकः|स्थौणेयक|स्थौणेयकं
स्थौणेयः, -स्थौणेयकः<BR>—1 A kind of perfume.<BR>—2 A carrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थौरम्
स्थौरम्<BR>—1 Firmness, strength, power.<BR>—2 A load sufficient for a horse or ass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थौरिन्
स्थौरिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A horse carrying burdens on his back, pack-horse.<BR>—2 A strong horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थौलक्ष्यम्
स्थौलक्ष्यम् Munificence, liberality; Ms. 7. 211.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्थौल्यम्
स्थौल्यम्<BR>—1 Bigness, bulkiness, stoutness.<BR>—2 Dulness or density of intellect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नवः|स्नव
स्नवः Trickling, oozing, dripping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नस्
स्नस् €1. €4 P. (स्नसति, स्नस्यति)<BR>—1 To inhabit.<BR>—2 To eject (as from the mouth), reject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नसा
स्नसा A tendon, muscle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्ना
स्ना €2 P. (स्नाति, स्नात)<BR>—1 To bathe, perform ablution; सस्नुः पयः पपुरनेनिजुरम्बराणि<BR> Śi. 5. 28; मृगतृष्णाम्भसि स्नातः.<BR>—2 To perform the ceremony of bathing at the time of leaving the house<BR> of oneʼs spiritual preceptor.<BR>—3 To smear oneself with. ━<i>Caus.</i> (स्नापयति-ते, स्नपयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to bathe, wet, moisten, sprinkle; (तोयैः) सतूर्यमेनां<BR> स्नपयाम्बभूवुः Ku. 7. 10; स्मितस्नपिताधरा Gīt. 12; U. 3. 23;<BR> Ki. 5. 44, 47; Śi. 2. 7; Me. 45.<BR>—2 To steep or soak in.<BR>—3 To weep for. ━<i>Desid.</i> (सिस्नासति) To wish to bathe. ━<i>With</i> {@अप@}<BR> to bathe after mourning. ━{@नि@} to plunge deep into; <i>i. e.</i><BR> to be perfect or thoroughly versed in; see निष्णात; कुतोऽपत्यस्नेहः<BR> कुटिलनयनिष्णातमनसाम् Māl. 2. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नपन|स्नपनं
स्नपन <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Causing to bathe.<BR>—2 Used for bathing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नपनम्
स्नपन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Sprinkling, washing.<BR>—2 Bathing, ablution; रेजे जनैः स्नपनसान्द्रतरार्द्रमूर्तिः Śi. 5. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नपित|स्नपितः
स्नपित <i>a.</i> Bathed, washed, sprinkled &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नयः|स्नय
स्नयः<BR>—1 Bathing, ablution.<BR>—2 Lustration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नात|स्नातः
स्नात <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Bathed, washed, purified by ablution; ततः शुक्लाम्बराः स्नातास्तरुणाः<BR> शतमष्ट च Mb. 7. 82. 8.<BR>—2 Versed in; मन्ये त्वां विषये वाचां स्नातमन्यत्र छान्दसात् Bhāg. 1. 4. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नातः|स्नात
स्नात + .{@-तः@}<BR>—1 One whose course of holy study is over; वणिङ्मुनिनृपस्नाता निर्गम्यार्थान्<BR> प्रपेदिरे Bhāg. 10. 21. 49.<BR>—2 An initiated householder; cf. स्नातक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नाता
स्नात + .{@-ता@} = ऋतुस्नाता; तपसा द्योतितां स्नातां ददर्श भगवानृषिः Mb. 3. 97. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नातकः|स्नातक
स्नातकः<BR>—1 A Brāhmaṇa who has performed the ceremony of ablution which has to<BR> be performed on his finishing his first Āśrama (that of a Brahmachārin);<BR> राजस्नातकयोश्चैव स्नातको नृपमानभाक् Ms. 2. 139.<BR>—2 A Brāhmaṇa just returned from the house of his preceptor and become<BR> an initiated householder (गृहस्थ).<BR>—3 A Brāhmaṇa who is a <i>Bhikṣu</i> (beggar of alms) for any religious<BR> object; नवैतान् स्नातकान् विद्याद् ब्राह्मणान् धर्मभिक्षुकान् Ms. 11. 2.<BR>—4 Any man of the first three classes who is an initiated householder.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: स्नातकव्रतम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नातकव्रतम्
स्नातकः + -व्रतम् the vows and duties of a स्नातक.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नात्रम्
स्नात्रम् Bath, ablution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानम्
स्नानम् [स्ना-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Bathing, washing, ablution, immersion in water; ततः प्रविशति स्नानोत्तीर्णः<BR> काश्यपः Ś. 4; न स्नानं न विलेपनं न कुसुमं नालंकृता मूर्धजाः<BR> (विभूषयन्ति पुरुषं) Bh. 2. 19.<BR>—2 Purification by bathing, any religious or ceremonial ablution.<BR>—3 The ceremony of bathing or anointing an idol.<BR>—4 Anything used in ablution. तोयक्रीडानिरतयुवतिस्नानतिक्तैर्मरुद्भिः Me. 35.<BR>—5 Cleansing, washing off.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: स्नानागारम्, स्नानकलशः, स्नानकुम्भः, स्नानगृहम्, स्नानतीर्थम्, स्नानतृणम्, स्नानद्रोणी, स्नानयात्रा, स्नानवस्त्रम्, स्नानविधिः, स्नानशाटी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानागारम्
स्नानम् + -अगारम् a bath-room.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानकलशः|स्नानकलश
स्नानम् + -कलशः, -कुम्भः a jar containing lustral water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानकुम्भः|स्नानकुम्भ
स्नानम् + -कलशः, -कुम्भः a jar containing lustral water.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानगृहम्
स्नानम् + -गृहम् a bathroom; उत्थायावश्यकार्यार्थं ययौ स्नानगृहं नृपः Mb. 7. 82. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानतीर्थम्
स्नानम् + -तीर्थम् a sacred bathing place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानतृणम्
स्नानम् + -तृणम् Kuśa-grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानद्रोणी
स्नानम् + -द्रोणी a bathing tub.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानयात्रा
स्नानम् + -यात्रा the festival held on the full-moon day in the month of Jyeṣṭha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानवस्त्रम्
स्नानम् + -वस्त्रम् a bathing-garment; सकृत् किं पीडितं स्नानवस्त्रं मुञ्चेत्<BR> द्रुतं पयः H. 2. 104.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानविधिः|स्नानविधि
स्नानम् + -विधिः<BR>—1 the act of ablution.<BR>—2 the proper manner or rules of ablution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानशाटी
स्नानम् + -शाटी bathing drawers.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानीय|स्नानीयं
स्नानीय^1 <i>a.</i> [स्नानाय हितं छ] Fit or suitable for bathing<BR> or ablution, worn during bathing; स्नानीयवस्त्रक्रियया पत्रोर्णं वोपयुज्यते M. 5. 12.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124. note: from snAna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नानीयम्
स्नानीय + .{@-यम्@} Water or any other article (such as unguents, perfumed powders<BR> &c.) proper for bathing; बलिक्रियावर्जितसैकतानि स्नानीयसंसर्गमनाप्नुवन्ति R. 16. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नापकः|स्नापक
स्नापकः A servant who bathes his master, or brings bathing-water<BR> for him; स्नापकाः काञ्चनैः कुम्भैः पूर्णैः समुपतस्थिरे Mb. 7. 82. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नापनम्
स्नापनम् The act of causing to bathe, or attending a person while<BR> bathing; Ms. 2. 209.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1725-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नापित
स्नापित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Caused to bathe, attended on while bathed.<BR>—2 Immersed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नास्यत्|स्नास्यन्त्
स्नास्यत् <i>m.</i> A student about to become a स्नातक; स्नास्यंस्तु<BR> गुरुणाज्ञप्तः शक्त्या गुर्वर्थमाहरेत् Ms. 2. 245.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नायुः|स्नायु
स्नायुः [स्नाति शुध्यति दोषोऽनया स्ना-उण् Tv.]<BR>—1 A tendon, muscle, sinew; स्वल्पं स्नायुवसावशेषमलिनं निर्मांसमप्यस्थि<BR> गोः Bh. 2. 30.<BR>—2 The string of a bow.<BR>—3 An eruption on the skin of the extremities; also स्नायुक.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: स्नाय्वर्मन्, स्नायुबन्धः, स्नायुमर्मन्, स्नायुस्पन्दः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नाय्वर्मन्|स्नाय्वर्म्मन्
स्नायुः + -अर्मन् <i>n.</i> a kind of disease of the eyes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नायुबन्धः|स्नायुबन्ध
स्नायुः + -बन्धः a bow-string.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नायुमर्मन्
स्नायुः + -मर्मन् the joint of a sinew.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नायुस्पन्दः|स्नायुस्पन्द
स्नायुः + -स्पन्दः pulse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नायुकः|स्नायुक
स्नायुकः See स्नायु.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नावः|स्नाव
स्नावः, -स्नावन् <i>m.</i><BR> A tendon, muscle; मांसान्यस्य शकराणि किनाटं<BR> स्नाव तस्थिरम् Bṛ. Up. 3. 9. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नावन्
स्नावः, -स्नावन् <i>m.</i><BR> A tendon, muscle; मांसान्यस्य शकराणि किनाटं<BR> स्नाव तस्थिरम् Bṛ. Up. 3. 9. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नाविर
स्नाविर <i>a.</i> With sinews; see अस्नाविर.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निट्
स्निट् €10 U. (स्नेटयति-ते)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To love, be in love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निह्
स्निह् €4 P. (स्निह्यति, स्निग्ध)<BR>—1 To feel or have affection for, love, be fond of (with loc. of the person<BR> or thing that is loved or liked); किं नु खलु बालेऽस्मिन्नौरस इव पुत्रे<BR> स्निह्यति मे मनः Ś. 7; स च स्निह्यत्यावयोः U. 6 (where आवयोः<BR> may be genitive also).<BR>—2 To be easily attached.<BR>—3 To be pleased with, be kind to.<BR>—4 To be sticky, viscid, or adhesive.<BR>—5 To be smooth or bland. ━<i>Caus.</i> (स्नेहयति-ते)<BR>—1 To make unctuous, anoint, besmear, lubricate.<BR>—2 To cause to love.<BR>—3 To dissolve, destroy, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्ध|स्निग्धं|स्निग्धः
स्निग्ध <i>a.</i> [स्निह्-क्त]<BR>—1 Loving, affectionate, friendly, attached, tender; नादस्तावद्विकलकुररीकूजितस्निग्धतारः Māl. 5. 20.<BR>—2 Oily, unctuous, greasy, wetted with oil; उत्पश्यामि त्वयि तटगते<BR> स्निग्धभिन्नाञ्जनाभे Me. 61; स्निग्धवेणीसवर्णे 18; Śi. 12. 62; Māl. 10. 4.<BR>—3 Sticky, viscid, adhesive, cohesive.<BR>—4 Glistening, shining, glassy, resplendent; कनकनिकषस्निग्धा विद्युत्<BR> प्रिया न ममोर्वशी V. 4. 1; Me. 39; U. 1. 33, 6. 21.<BR>—5 Smooth, emollient.<BR>—6 Moist, wet.<BR>—7 Cooling.<BR>—8 Kind, soft, bland, amiable; प्रीतिस्निग्धैर्जनपदवधूलोचनैः पीयमानः Me. 16.<BR>—9 Lovely, agreeable, charming; स्निग्धगम्भीरनिर्घोषम् R. 1. 36; Me. 66;<BR> U. 2. 14, 3. 22.<BR>—10 Thick, dense, compact; स्निग्धच्छायातरुषु वसतिं रामगिर्याश्रमेषु<BR> (चक्रे) Me. 1.<BR>—11 Intent, fixed, steadfast (as a gaze or look).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धः|स्निग्ध|स्निग्धं
स्निग्ध + .{@-ग्धः@}<BR>—1 A friend, a affectionate or friendly person; विज्ञैः स्निग्धैरुपकृतमपि<BR> द्वेष्यतामेति कैश्चित् H. 2. 149; or स स्निधो ऽकुशलान्निवारयति यः<BR> Subhāṣ.; Pt. 2. 171.<BR>—2 The red castor-oil plant.<BR>—3 A kind of pine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धम्
स्निग्ध + .{@-ग्धम्@}<BR>—1 Oil.<BR>—2 Beesʼ-wax.<BR>—3 Light, lustre.<BR>—4 Thickness, coarseness.<BR>—5 Civet.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: स्निग्धजनः, स्निग्धतण्डुलः, स्निग्धदृष्टि, स्निग्धपत्रः, स्निग्धपत्रा, स्निग्धफला, स्निग्धराजिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धजनः|स्निग्धजन
स्निग्ध + -जनः an affectionate or friendly person, a friend; स्निग्धजनसंविभक्तं<BR> हि दुःखं सह्यवेदनं भवति Ś. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धतण्डुलः|स्निग्धतण्डुल|स्निग्धतंडुल
स्निग्ध + -तण्डुलः a kind of rice of quick growth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धदृष्टि
स्निग्ध + -दृष्टि <i>a.</i> looking intently or with a fixed gaze.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">Page1726-2</a>]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धपत्रः|स्निग्धपत्र
स्निग्ध + -पत्रः, -पत्रा the jujube.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धपत्रा
स्निग्ध + -पत्रः, -पत्रा the jujube.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धफला
स्निग्ध + -फला the ichneumon plant (Mar. मुंगूसवेल).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धराजिः|स्निग्धराजि
स्निग्ध + -राजिः a kind of snake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धता
स्निग्धता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Oiliness.<BR>—2 Blandness.<BR>—3 Tenderness, affection, love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धत्वम्
स्निग्धता, -त्वम्<BR>—1 Oiliness.<BR>—2 Blandness.<BR>—3 Tenderness, affection, love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्निग्धा
स्निग्धा Marrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नु|स्नुः
स्नु €2 P. (स्नौति, स्नुत)<BR>—1 To drip, trickle, fall in drops, distil, drop, ooze or run out, leak out,<BR>—2 To flow, stream.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नुत|स्नुतः
स्नुत <i>a.</i> Oozed, dropped, flowed &c.; त्रिष्टुम्मांसात् स्नुतोऽनुष्टुब्जगत्यस्थ्नः<BR> प्रजापतेः Bhāg. 3. 12. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नु|स्नुः
स्नु <i>m., n.</i><BR>—1 Table-land.<BR>—2 Top, surface (in general). (This word has no forms for the first five<BR> inflections and is optionally substituted for सानु after acc. dual).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्नु|स्नुः
स्नु <i>f.</i> A sinew, tendon, muscle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1726-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

