स्पन्द्|स्पंद्
स्पन्द् €1 Ā. (स्पन्दते, स्पन्दित)<BR>—1 To throb, palpitate; अस्पन्दिष्टाक्षि वामं च Bk. 15. 27, 14. 83.<BR>—2 To shake, tremble, quiver.<BR>—3 To go, move; स्पन्दन्ति वै तनुभृतामजशर्वयोश्च Bhāg. 12. 8. 40.<BR>—4 To come suddenly to life.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पन्दः|स्पन्द|स्पंद|स्पंदः
स्पन्दः [स्पन्द्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Throbbing, palpitation.<BR>—2 Vibration, tremor, motion; मनो मन्दस्पन्दं बहिरपि चिरस्यापि विमृशन् Bh. 3. 51.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पन्दनम्
स्पन्दनम् [स्पन्द्-ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Throbbing, pulsation, palpitation, quivering; वामाक्षिस्पन्दनं सूचयित्वा<BR> Māl. 1; so अधर˚, बाहु˚, शरीर˚ &c.<BR>—2 Tremor, vibration.<BR>—3 The quickening of a child in the womb.<BR>—4 Rapid motion, going.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पन्दित|स्पंदित
स्पन्दित <i>p. p.</i> [स्पन्द्-क्त]<BR>—1 Throbbed, quivered. —2 Gone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पन्दितम्
स्पन्दित + .{@-तम्@} A pulsation, throb, palpitation.<BR>—2 Activity (of the mind).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पन्दोलिका
स्पन्दोलिका Swinging backwards and forwards, rocking on a swing (a<BR> kind of game); Bhāg. 10. 18. 15 (v. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्ध्
स्पर्ध् €1 Ā. (स्पर्धते)<BR>—1 To contend or vie with, emulate, rival, compete, be equal with; अस्पर्धिष्ट<BR> च रामेण Bk. 15. 65; कस्तैस्सह स्पर्धते Bh. 2. 16.<BR>—2 To challenge, defy, bid defiance to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्ध
स्पर्ध <i>a.</i> Emulous, envious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्धनम्
स्पर्धनम्<BR>—1 Competition, emulation.<BR>—2 Envy, jealousy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्धा
स्पर्धा [स्पर्ध्-अ]<BR>—1 Emulation, rivalry, competition; आत्मनस्तु वुधैः स्पर्धां शुद्धधीर्बह्वमन्यत.<BR>—2 Jealousy, envy.<BR>—3 Defiance.<BR>—4 Equality with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्धित
स्पर्धित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Emulating, contending.<BR>—2 Challenged, defied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्धिन्
स्पर्धिन् <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR>—1 Rivalling, emulating, competing, vying with; तवाधरस्पर्धिषु विद्रुमेषु<BR> R. 13. 13, 16. 62.<BR>—2 Emulous, envious.<BR>—3 Proud. ━<i>m.</i> A competitor, an equal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्ध्य
स्पर्ध्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Desirable.<BR>—2 Valuable; शयनं तत्र संकॢप्तं स्पर्ध्यास्तरणसंवृतम् Mb. 1. 47. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्श्
स्पर्श् €10 Ā. (स्पर्शयते)<BR>—1 To take, take hold of, touch.<BR>—2 To unite, join. —3 To embrace, clasp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शः|स्पर्श
स्पर्शः<BR>—1 [स्पर्श्, स्पृश् वा-घञ्] Touch, contact (in all senses); स्पर्शान्<BR> कृत्वा बहिर्बाह्यांश्चक्षुश्चैवान्तरे भ्रुवोः Bg. 5. 27; तदिदं स्पर्शक्षमं<BR> रत्नम् Ś. 1. 28, 2. 7.<BR>—2 Contact (in astr.).<BR>—3 Conflict, encounter.<BR>—4 Feeling, sensation, the sense of touch.<BR>—5 The quality of touch or tangibility, touch, the object or विषय<BR> of skin (त्वच्); स्पर्शगुणो वायुः T. S.; स्पर्शनं स्पर्शती स्पर्शान्<BR> बुद्धिर्विक्रियतेऽसकृत् Mb. 12. 285. 20.<BR>—6 That which affects or influences, affection, seizure.<BR>—7 Disease, illness, disorder, distemper.<BR>—8 A consonant of any of the five classes of letters (from क् to म्);<BR> कादयो मान्ताः स्पर्शाः; स्पर्शस्तस्याभवज्जीवः स्वरो देह उदाहृतः<BR> Bhāg. 3. 12. 46.<BR>—9 A gift, donation, presentation.<BR>—10 Air, wind.<BR>—11 The sky.<BR>—12 Sexual union; स्त्रीपुंसयोः संप्रयोगे स्पर्शः कस्याधिको भवेत् Mb. 13. 12. 1.<BR>—13 A secret spy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शा
स्पर्शः + .{@-र्शा@} An unchaste woman.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: स्पर्शाज्ञ, स्पर्शानुकूल, स्पर्शानन्दा, स्पर्शेन्द्रियम्, स्पर्शोदय, स्पर्शोपलः, स्पर्शमणिः, स्पर्शक्लिष्ट, स्पर्शक्षम, स्पर्शगुण, स्पर्शतन्मात्रम्, स्पर्शद्वेषः, स्पर्शयज्ञः, स्पर्शरसिक, स्पर्शलज्जा, स्पर्शसंकोचपर्णिका, स्पर्शवेद्य, स्पर्शसंचारिन्, स्पर्शस्नानम्, स्पर्शस्पन्दः, स्पर्शस्यन्दः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शाज्ञ
स्पर्शः + -अज्ञ <i>a.</i> senseless, insensible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शानुकूल
स्पर्शः + -अनुकूल <i>a.</i> pleasant to the touch, cooling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शानन्दा
स्पर्शः + -आनन्दा an <i>apsaras</i>.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शेन्द्रियम्
स्पर्शः + -इन्द्रियम् the organ or sense of touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शोदय
स्पर्शः + -उदय <i>a.</i> followed by a consonant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शोपलः|स्पर्शोपल
स्पर्शः + -उपलः, -मणिः a kind of jewel considered to be the same as ‘philosopherʼs stone’<BR>. ˚मणिप्रभवम् gold; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शमणिः|स्पर्शमणि
स्पर्शः + -उपलः, -मणिः a kind of jewel considered to be the same as ‘philosopherʼs stone’<BR>. ˚मणिप्रभवम् gold; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शक्लिष्ट
स्पर्शः + -क्लिष्ट <i>a.</i> painful to the touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शक्षम
स्पर्शः + -क्षम <i>a.</i> capable of touch, tangible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शगुण
स्पर्शः + -गुण <i>a.</i> having the quality of tangibility (as air); बलवाञ्जायते<BR> वायुः स वै स्पर्शगुणो मतः Ms. 1. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शतन्मात्रम्
स्पर्शः + -तन्मात्रम् the subtile element of tangibility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शद्वेषः|स्पर्शद्वेष
स्पर्शः + -द्वेषः sensitiveness to touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शयज्ञः|स्पर्शयज्ञ
स्पर्शः + -यज्ञः an offering consisting in the mere touch of the things<BR> offered; स्पर्शयज्ञं करिष्यामि विधिरेष सनातनः Mb. 14. 92. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शरसिक
स्पर्शः + -रसिक <i>a.</i> sensual, lustful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शलज्जा
स्पर्शः + -लज्जा, -संकोचपर्णिका the sensitive plant (Mar. लाजाळू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शसंकोचपर्णिका
स्पर्शः + -लज्जा, -संकोचपर्णिका the sensitive plant (Mar. लाजाळू).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शवेद्य
स्पर्शः + -वेद्य <i>a.</i> to be apprehended by the sense of<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">Page1728-1</a>]<BR> touch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1727-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शसंचारिन्
स्पर्शः + -संचारिन् <i>a.</i> contagious, infections.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शस्नानम्
स्पर्शः + -स्नानम् ablution at the entrance of the sun or moon into an eclipse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शस्पन्दः|स्पर्शस्पन्द|स्पर्शस्पंद
स्पर्शः + -स्पन्दः, -स्यन्दः a frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शस्यन्दः|स्पर्शस्यन्द|स्पर्शस्यंद
स्पर्शः + -स्पन्दः, -स्यन्दः a frog.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शन|स्पर्शनं|स्पर्शनः
स्पर्शन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [स्पर्श्-स्पृश्-वा ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Touching, handling.<BR>—2 Affecting, influencing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शनः|स्पर्शन|स्पर्शनं
स्पर्शन + .{@-नः@} Air, wind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शनम्
स्पर्शन + .{@-नम्@}<BR>—1 Touching, touch, contact.<BR>—2 Sensation, feeling.<BR>—3 Sense or organ of touch; Bg. 15. 9.<BR>—4 A gift, donation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शनकम्
स्पर्शनकम् A term used in Sāṃkhya philosophy for the ‘skin’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शवत्|स्पर्शवन्त्
स्पर्शवत् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tangible.<BR>—2 Soft, soft or agreeable to the touch; भूर्जत्वचः स्पर्शवतीर्दधानाः Ku. 1. 55.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शिक
स्पर्शिक <i>a.</i> Tangible, perceptible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्शित
स्पर्शित <i>a.</i> Given, donated; ज्ञात्वा तपसि सिद्धिं च पत्न्यर्थं<BR> स्पर्शिता तदा Rām. 7. 30. 27 (com. स्पर्शिता भार्यात्वेन दत्ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्ष्टृ
स्पर्ष्टृ <i>m.</i> A distemper, disorder of the body, disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पर्ष्
स्पर्ष् €1 Ā. (स्पर्षते) To become wet or moist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पश्
स्पश् €1 U. (स्पशति-ते)<BR>—1 To obstruct.<BR>—2 To undertake, perform.<BR>—3 To string together.<BR>—4 To touch.<BR>—5 To see, behold, perceive clearly, spy out, espy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पशः|स्पश
स्पशः [स्पश्-अच्]<BR>—1 A spy, a secret emissary or agent; स्पशे शनैर्गतवति तत्र विद्विषाम्<BR> Śi. 17. 20; Mu. 3. 13; see अपस्पश also.<BR>—2 Fight, war, battle.<BR>—3 One who fights with savage animals (for reward), or the fight itself.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्ट|स्पष्टं
स्पष्ट <i>a.</i> [स्पश्-क्त नि˚ इडभावः]<BR>—1 Distinctly visible, evident, clearly perceived, clear, plain, manifest;<BR> स्थष्टे जाते प्रत्यूषे K. ‘when it was broad day-break’; स्पष्टाकृतिः<BR> R. 18. 30; स्पष्टार्थः &c.<BR>—2 Real, true.<BR>—3 Full-blown. expanded.<BR>—4 One who sees clearly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्टम्
स्पष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@} <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 Clearly, distinctly, plainly.<BR>—2 Openly, boldly. (स्पष्टीकृ means ‘to make clear or distinct’, explain, elucidate.)<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: स्पष्टाक्षर, स्पष्टार्थ, स्पष्टगर्भा, स्पष्टप्रतिपत्तिः, स्पष्टभाषिन्, स्पष्टवक्तृ<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्टाक्षर
स्पष्ट + -अक्षर <i>a.</i> distinctly spoken.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्टार्थ
स्पष्ट + -अर्थ <i>a.</i> intelligible, clear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्टगर्भा
स्पष्ट + -गर्भा a woman who shows evident signs of pregnancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्टप्रतिपत्तिः|स्पष्टप्रतिपत्ति
स्पष्ट + -प्रतिपत्तिः <i>f.</i> distinct notion, clear perception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्टभाषिन्
स्पष्ट + -भाषिन्, -वक्तृ <i>a.</i> plain-spoken, outspoken, candid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्टवक्तृ
स्पष्ट + -भाषिन्, -वक्तृ <i>a.</i> plain-spoken, outspoken, candid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्टयति
स्पष्टयति Den. P. To make clear, explain, elucidate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्टीकरणम्
स्पष्टीकरणम् Making clear or intelligible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पष्टीकृतिः|स्पष्टीकृति
स्पष्टीकृतिः Rectification, correction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृ
स्पृ €5 P. (स्पृणोति)<BR>—1 To deliver or extricate from.<BR>—2 To gratify.<BR>—3 To grant, bestow; स मेन्द्रो मेधया स्पृणोतु T. Up. 1. 4. 1.<BR>—4 To protect. —5 To live.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृक्का
स्पृक्का Trigonella Corniculata (पिण्डका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृध्
स्पृध् <i>m.</i> A rival, enemy; तयोः स्पृधोस्तिग्मगदाहताङ्गयोः Bhāg. 3. 18. 19.<BR>━<i>f.</i> Contest, fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृश्
स्पृश् €6 P. (स्पृशति, पस्पर्श, अस्पृक्षत्-अस्पार्क्षीत्-अस्प्राक्षीत्, स्प्रक्ष्यति-स्पर्क्ष्यति,<BR> स्पर्ष्टुं-स्प्रष्टुम्, स्पृष्ट) —1 To touch; स्पृशन्नपि गजो हन्ति H. 3. 14;<BR> कर्णे परं स्पृशति हन्ति परं समूलम् Pt. 1. 304.<BR>—2 To lay the hand on, stroke gently with, touch; हस्तेन पस्पर्श तदङ्गमिन्द्रः Ku. 3. 22.<BR>—3 To adhere or cling to, come in contact with.<BR>—4 To wash or sprinkle with water; खानि चैव स्पृशेदद्भिरात्मानं शिर<BR> एव च Ms. 2. 60.<BR>—5 To go to, reach; अस्यापि द्यां स्पृशति वशिनश्चारणद्वन्द्वगीतः<BR> Ś. 2 15; R. 3. 43.<BR>—6 To attain to, obtain, reach a particular state; महोक्षतां वत्सतरः<BR> स्पृशन्निव R. 3. 32; विनाप्यर्थैर्वीरः स्पृशति बहुमानोन्नतिपदम् H. 1. 175.<BR>—7 To act upon, influence, affect, move, touch; नन्दस्नेहगुणाः स्पृशन्ति<BR> हृदयं भृत्योऽस्मि तद्विद्विषाम् Mu. 7. 16; Ku. 6. 95.<BR>—8 To refer or allude to.<BR>—9 To take, receive, accept (as a sacrificial offering).<BR>—10 To injure, harm.<BR>—11 To come into contact (in astr.).<BR>—12 To equal with. ━<i>Pass.</i> To be polluted, defiled, or tainted;<BR> मया गृहीतनामानः स्पृश्यन्त इव पाप्मना U. 1. 48. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR> (स्पर्शयति-ते)<BR>—1 To cause to touch.<BR>—2 To give, present; गाः कोटिशः स्पर्शयता घटोध्नीः R. 2. 49.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृश्
स्पृश् <i>a.</i><BR>—1 (At the end of comp.) Who or what touches, touching, affecting, piercing;<BR> मर्मस्पृश्, हृदिस्पृश् &c.<BR>—2 Experiencing, betraying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृशः|स्पृश
स्पृशः Touch, contact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृशी
स्पृशी The prickly night-shade (Mar. कांटेरिंगणी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृश्य
स्पृश्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Tangible.<BR>—2 To be taken in possession.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृष्ट|स्पृष्टः
स्पृष्ट <i>p. p.</i> [स्पृश्-क्त]<BR>—1 Touched, felt with the hand.<BR>—2 Come in contact with, touching.<BR>—3 Reaching, applying or extending to; अस्पृष्टपुरुषान्तरम् Ku. 6. 75.<BR>—4 Affected, seized; शङ्कास्पृष्टा Me. 71; अनघस्पृष्टम् R. 10. 19.<BR>—5 Tainted, defiled; न च या स्पृष्टमैथुना Ms. 8. 205.<BR>—6 Formed by the complete contact of the organs of speech (the letters<BR> of the five classes); अचोऽस्पृष्टा यणस्त्वीषन्नेमस्पृष्टाः शलः स्मृताः ।<BR> शेषाः स्पृष्टा हलः प्रोक्ता निबोधानुप्रदानतः Śik. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृष्टम्
स्पृष्ट + .{@-ष्टम्@} Touch.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: स्पृष्टपूर्व, स्पृष्टमात्र<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृष्टपूर्व
स्पृष्ट + -पूर्व <i>a.</i> experienced before.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृष्टमात्र
स्पृष्ट + -मात्र <i>a.</i> merely touched.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्पृष्टकम्
स्पृष्टकम् A kind of light embrace; नलस्पृष्टकमेत्य हृष्टा N. 6. 35<BR> (यद् योषितः संमुखमागताया अन्यापदेशाद् व्रजतो नरस्य । गात्रेण<BR> गात्रं घटते यदेतदालिङ्गनं स्पृष्टकमाहुरार्याः ॥ Com. by Nārāyaṇa.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1728-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

