स्फट्
स्फट् €1 P. (स्फटति) To burst, expand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1729-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

