स्फरकः|स्फरक
स्फरः, -स्फरकः<BR> A shield.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1729-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

