स्फूर्जः|स्फूर्ज|स्फूर्ज्ज
स्फूर्जः<BR>—1 The crashing sound of a thunder-clap.<BR>—2 Indraʼs thunder-bolt.<BR>—3 Sudden burst or rise, as in नर्मस्फूर्ज.<BR>—4 First union of lovers characterized by joy in the beginning and some<BR> expectation of fear in the end.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1731-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फूर्जथुः|स्फूर्जथु|स्फूर्ज्जथु
स्फूर्जथुः A clap or peal of thunder; गर्जाजर्जरितासु दिक्षु बधिरे<BR> तत्स्फूर्जथुस्फूर्जितैः Mv. 7. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1731-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

