स्फूर्जितम्
स्फूर्जितम् A thunder, crash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1731-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्फुल्
स्फुल् €6 P. (स्फुलति)<BR>—1 To tremble, throb, vibrate.<BR>—2 To dart forth, appear.<BR>—3 To collect.<BR>—4 To kill, destroy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1731-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

