स्वरुः|स्वरु
स्वरुः [स्वृ-उ]<BR>—1 Sunshine.<BR>—2 A part of a sacrificial post.<BR>—3 A sacrifice.<BR>—4 A thunderbolt; स्वरुणा विहतं सद्यो गिरेः शृङ्गमिवापतत् Śiva B. 21. 51.<BR>—5 An arrow.<BR>—6 A kind of scorpion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1740-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

