हठबुद्धिः
हठः + -बुद्धिः the belief in the unexpected gain (without doing any effort);<BR> तथैव हठदुर्बुद्धिः शक्तः कर्मण्यकर्मकृत् Mb. 3. 32. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1746-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हठयोगः|हठयोग
हठः + -योगः a particular mode of Yoga or practising abstract meditation,<BR> (so called, as distinguished from राजयोग q. v., because it is very<BR> difficult to practise; it may be performed in various ways, such as by<BR> standing on one leg, holding up the arms, inhaling smoke with the head inverted &c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1746-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हठवादिन्
