हढक्कम्
हढक्कः, -क्कम्<BR> A small hand-drum; cf. ढक्का.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हण्डा|हंडा
हण्डा <i>ind.</i> A vocative particle used in addressing a female of<BR> inferior rank, or by equals of the lowest caste in addressing each other;<BR> हण्डे हञ्जे हलाह्वाने नीचां चेटीं सखीं प्रति Ak. ━<i>f.</i><BR>—1 A large earthen vessel (?).<BR>—2 A low caste female; cf. हञ्जा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हण्डिका|हंडिका
हण्डिका, हण्डी An earthen pot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हण्डी|हंडी
