हद्
हद् €1 Ā. (हदते, हन्न) To void excrement, evacuate or discharge<BR> feces. ━<i>Desid.</i> (जिहत्सते).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हदनम्
हदनम् Voiding excrement, evacuation of ordure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हन्नम्
हन्नम् Excrement, ordure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हन्
हन् €2 P. (हन्ति, जघान, अवधीत्, अवधिष्ट-अहत; हनिष्यति, हन्तुम्;<BR> हत; <i>pass.</i> हन्यते; <i>caus.</i> घातयति-ते; <i>desid.</i> जिघांसति)<BR>—1 To kill, slay, destroy, strike down; त्रयश्च दूषणखरत्रिमूर्धानो<BR> रणे हताः U. 2. 15; हतमपि च हन्त्येव मदनः Bh. 3. 18.<BR>—2 To strike, beat; चण्डी चण्डं हन्तुमभ्युद्यता मां विद्युद्दाम्ना मेघराजीव<BR> विन्ध्यम् M. 3. 21; Śi. 7. 56.<BR>—3 To hurt, injure, afflict, torment; as in कामहत.<BR>—4 To put down, abandon; तृष्णां छिन्द्धि भज क्षमां जहि मदम् Bh. 2. 77.<BR>—5 To remove, take away, destroy; अम्भोजिनीवननिवासविलासमेव हंसस्य<BR> हन्ति नितरां कुपितो विधाता Bh. 2. 18.<BR>—6 To conquer, overthrow, defeat, overcome; विध्नैः सहस्रगुणितैरपि<BR> हन्यमानाः प्रारब्धमुत्तमजना न परित्यजन्ति Subhāṣ.<BR>—7 To hinder, obstruct.<BR>—8 To mar, spoil; सकला हन्ति स शक्तिसंपदः Ki. 2. 37.<BR>—9 To raise; तुरगखुरहतस्तथा हि रेणुः Ś. 1. 31.<BR>—10 To multiply (in math.).<BR>—11 To go (rarely used in classical literature in this sense; and when<BR> used it is regarded as a fault of composition); <i>e. g.</i> कुञ्जं हन्ति<BR> कृशोदरी S. D. 7; or तीर्थान्तरेषु स्नानेन समुपार्जितसत्कृतिः । सुरस्रोतस्विनीमेष<BR> हन्ति संप्रति सादरम् K. P. 7 (given as an instance of the दोष<BR> called असमर्थत्व).<BR>—12 (In astr.) To touch, come into contact.<BR>—13 To ward off, avert. ━<i>Caus.</i><BR>—1 To cause to be killed, kill, slay.<BR>—2 To destroy, ruin, mar, spoil; घातायीतुमेव नीचः परकार्यं वेत्ति<BR> न प्रसाधयितुम् Pt. 1. 363. ━<i>With</i> {@अति@} to injure excessively. ━{@अन्तर्@}<BR> to strike in the middle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1746-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हत|हतः
हत <i>p. p.</i> [हन्-क्त]<BR>—1 Killed, slain; सुषेणं च हतोऽसीति ब्रुवन्नादत्त सायकम् Mb. 8. 48. 31.<BR>—2 Hurt, struck, injured; चक्षुरादिषु हताः स्वार्थावबोधक्रियाः Mu. 3. 1.<BR>—3 Lost, perished; शमं न लेभे हृदयज्वरार्दितो नरर्षभो यूथहतो<BR> यथर्षभः Rām. 2. 85. 21.<BR>—4 Deprived or bereft of.<BR>—5 Disappointed, frustrated; वयं तत्त्वान्वेषात् हताः Ś. 1. 23.<BR>—6 Impeded, obstructed.<BR>—7 Utterly ruined, extinguished, destroyed.<BR>—8 Multiplied.<BR>—9 Whirled up, raised.<BR>—10 Suffering from.<BR>—11 Violated (sexually).<BR>—12 Miserable, wretched.<BR>—13 Defective. See हन्. It is often used as the first member of comp.<BR> in the sense of ‘wretched’, ‘miserable’, ‘accursed’, ‘worthless’; अनुशयदुःखायेदं<BR> हतहृदयं संप्रति विवुद्धम् Ś. 6. 6; Māl. 9. 28; कुर्यामुपेक्षां<BR> हतजीवितेऽस्मिन् R. 14. 65; हतविधिलसितानां ही विचित्रो विपाकः Śi. 11. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतम्
हत + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Killing, striking.<BR>—2 Multiplication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हता
हत + .{@-ता@}<BR>—1 A violated woman.<BR>—2 A despised girl (unfit for marriage).<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हताश, हताश्रय, हतेक्षण, हतोत्तर, हतोद्यम, हतकण्टक, हतकिल्बिष, हतचित्त, हतच्छाया, हतजल्पितानि, हतत्रप, हतत्विष्, हतदैव, हतप्रभाव, हतवीर्य, हतप्रमाद, हतबुद्धि,^1 हतभग, हतभाग्य,^2 हतमूर्खः, हतयुद्ध, हतरथः, हतलक्षण, हतविनय, हतशेष, हतश्री, हतसंपद्, हतसाध्वस, हतस्त्रीक<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8089dd2.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हताश|हताशः
हत + -आश <i>a.</i><BR>—1 bereft of hope, hopeless, desponding.<BR>—2 weak, powerless.<BR>—3 cruel, merciless.<BR>—4 barren.<BR>—5 low, vile, wretched, accursed, villainous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हताश्रय
हत + -आश्रय <i>a.</i> one whose refuge is destroyed; Bu. C. 13. 70.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतेक्षण
हत + -ईक्षण <i>a.</i> blind; Bu. C. 8. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतोत्तर
हत + -उत्तर <i>a.</i> giving no answer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतोद्यम
हत + -उद्यम <i>a.</i> broken in purpose; Bu. C. 13. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतकण्टक|हतकंटक
हत + -कण्टक <i>a.</i> freed from thorns or foes.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतकिल्बिष
हत + -किल्बिष <i>a.</i> freed from sins; धर्मप्रधानं पुरुषं तपसा<BR> हतकिल्बिषम् । परलोकं नयत्याशु भास्वन्तं स्वशरीरिणम् ॥ Ms. 4. 243.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतचित्त
हत + -चित्त <i>a.</i> bewildered, confounded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतच्छाय
हत + -च्छाय^1 <i>a.</i> bereft of beauty.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by . Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/6b5cd78.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतजल्पितानि
हत + -जल्पितानि useless talk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतत्रप
हत + -त्रप <i>a.</i> shameless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतत्विष्
हत + -त्विष् <i>a.</i> dimmed in lustre; निशीथदीपाः सहसा हतत्विषो<BR> बभूवुरालेख्यसमर्पिता इव R. 3. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतदैव
हत + -दैव <i>a.</i> ill-fated, luckless, ill-started.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतप्रभाव
हत + -प्रभाव, -वीर्य <i>a.</i> bereft of power or vigour; मन्त्रेण<BR> हतवीर्यस्य फणिनो दैन्यमाश्रितः Ku. 2. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतवीर्य
हत + -प्रभाव, -वीर्य <i>a.</i> bereft of power or vigour; मन्त्रेण<BR> हतवीर्यस्य फणिनो दैन्यमाश्रितः Ku. 2. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतप्रमाद
हत + -प्रमाद <i>a.</i> freed from carelessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतबुद्धि
हत + -बुद्धि^1 <i>a.</i> deprived of sense, senseless.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8089dd2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतभग
हत + -भग, -भाग्य^1 <i>a.</i> ill-fated, unfortunate.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतभाग्य
हत + -भग, -भाग्य^1 <i>a.</i> ill-fated, unfortunate.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/5f7cee5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतमूर्खः|हतमूर्ख
हत + -मूर्खः a dolt, blockhead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतयुद्ध
हत + -युद्ध <i>a.</i> destitute of martial spirit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतरथः|हतरथ
हत + -रथः a chariot of which the horses and the charioteer are slain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतलक्षण
हत + -लक्षण <i>a.</i> devoid of auspicious marks, unlucky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतविनय
हत + -विनय <i>a.</i> lost to a sense of propriety, wicked; सेव्यानां<BR> हतविनयैरिवावृतानां संपर्कं परिहरति स्म चन्दनानाम् Ki. 7. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतशेष
हत + -शेष <i>a.</i> surviving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतश्री
हत + -श्री, -संपद् <i>a.</i> reduced to indigence, impoverished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतसंपद्
हत + -श्री, -संपद् <i>a.</i> reduced to indigence, impoverished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतसाध्वस
हत + -साध्वस <i>a.</i> freed from fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतस्त्रीक
हत + -स्त्रीक <i>a.</i> one who has killed a woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतक|हतकः
हतक <i>a.</i> [हत इव नष्टप्रायत्वात् कन्] Miserable, ill-bred,<BR> wretched, low, vile; (mostly at the end of comp.); न खलु विदितास्ते<BR> तत्र निवसन्तश्चाणक्यहतकेन Mu. 2; दूषिताः स्थ परिभूताः स्थ रामहतकेन U. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतकः|हतक
हतक + .{@-कः@} A low person, coward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतिः|हति
हतिः <i>f.</i> [हन-भावे-क्तिन्]<BR>—1 Killing, destruction; वृत्रहत्यै यथा देवाः परिवव्रुः पुरंदरम्<BR> Mb. 7. 153. 37.<BR>—2 Striking, wounding.<BR>—3 A blow, stroke.<BR>—4 Loss, failure.<BR>—5 A defect.<BR>—6 Multiplication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हतुः|हतु
हतुः Winter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हत्नुः|हत्नु
हत्नुः [हन् क्त्नुः Uṇ. 3. 30]<BR>—1 A weapon.<BR>—2 A disease or sickness.<BR>—3 A killer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हत्या
हत्या [हन्-भावे क्यप्] Killing, slaying, slaughter, murder, particularly<BR> criminal killing; as in भ्रूणहत्या, गोहत्या &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हत्वन्
हत्वन् A killer (निघ्नन्); ते सदोषा हतास्माभी राज्यस्य परिपन्थिनः ।<BR> तान् हत्वा भुङ्क्ष्व धर्मेंण युधिष्ठिर महीमिमाम् ॥ Mb. 12. 10. 8 (see com.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हन्
हन् <i>a.</i> Killing, slaying, destroying (at the end of comp.); as<BR> in वृत्रहन्, पितृहन्, मातृहन्, ब्रह्महन् &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हनः|हन
हनः Killing, slaying.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हननम्
हननम् [हन्-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Killing, slaying, striking.<BR>—2 Hurting, injuring.<BR>—3 Multiplication.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हननः|हनन|हननं
हननम् + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 A drum-stick.<BR>—2 A kind of worm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हन्तुः|हन्तु|हंतुः
हन्तुः<BR>—1 Killing, death; वधान्निवृत्तं तं भूयो हन्तवेऽत्रिरचोदयत् Bhāg. 4. 19. 15, 11. 5. 50.<BR>—2 A bull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हन्तृ|हंतृ
हन्तृ <i>a.</i> (-न्त्री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [हन-तृच्]<BR>—1 One who strikes or kills, striking, killer; न तादृशं भवत्येनो<BR> मृगहन्तुर्धनार्थिनः Ms. 5. 34; Ku. 2. 20.<BR>—2 One who removes, destroys, counteracts &c. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A slayer, killer.<BR>—2 A thief, robber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हथः|हथ
हथः<BR>—1 A stroke, blow.<BR>—2 Killing.<BR>—3 Death.<BR>—4 A man who is sad or depressed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हनीलः|हनील
हनीलः Pandanus Odoratissimus (केतकी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हनु|हनुः
हनु, -नू <i>m., f.</i><BR> [हन्-उन्-स्त्रीत्वे वा उञ्] The chin, jaw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हनू
हनु, -नू <i>m., f.</i><BR> [हन्-उन्-स्त्रीत्वे वा उञ्] The chin, jaw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हनु|हनुः
हनु, -नू + .{@-नु@} <i>f.</i><BR>—1 That which injures life.<BR>—2 A weapon.<BR>—3 A disease, sickness.<BR>—4 Death.<BR>—5 A kind of drug.<BR>—6 A wanton woman, prostitute.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हनुग्रहः, हनुभेदः, हनुमूलम्, हनुमोक्षः, हनुस्तम्भः, हनुस्वनः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हनुग्रहः|हनुग्रह
हनु + -ग्रहः locked jaw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हनुभेदः|हनुभेद
