हनुमोक्षः|हनुमोक्ष
हनु + -मोक्षः relaxation of the jaws.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1747-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हनुस्तम्भः|हनुस्तम्भ
