हलद्दी
हलदी, हलदीका, हलद्दी <i>f.</i> Turmeric.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलहल
हलहल <i>a.</i> Ploughing, making furrows.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलहलकः|हलहलक
हलहलकः Eagerness; Hc. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलहला
हलहला An exclamation of applause or approbation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हला
हला<BR>—1 A female friend.<BR>—2 The earth.<BR>—3 Water.<BR>—4 Spirituous liquor. ━<i>ind.</i> A vocative particle used in addressing<BR> a female friend; (only in theatrical language); हला शकुन्तले अत्रैव<BR> तावन्मुहूर्तं तिष्ठ Ś. 1; cf. हण्डा also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलिः|हलि
हलिः<BR>—1 A large plough.<BR>—2 A furrow.<BR>—3 Agriculture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलिकः|हलिक
हलिकः A ploughman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलिन्
हलिन् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 A ploughman, an agriculturist.<BR>—2 Balarāma.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हलिप्रियः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलिप्रियः|हलिप्रिय
हलिन् + -प्रियः the <i>Kadamba</i> tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलिप्रिया
हलिन् + -प्रियः + .({@-या@}) spirituous liquor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलिनी
हलिनी A number of ploughs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलीनः|हलीन
हलीनः^1 The teak tree.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170124. note: long I diacritic misplaced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलीषा
हलीषा, हलेषा The handle of a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलेषा
हलीषा, हलेषा The handle of a plough.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1751-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्य|हल्यं
हल्य <i>a.</i><BR>—1 Arable, to be ploughed.<BR>—2 Ugly, deformed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्यम्
हल्य + .{@-ल्यम्@}<BR>—1 A ploughed field.<BR>—2 Deformity, ugliness; Rām. 7. 30. 22; see हलम् (2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्या
हल्या A number of ploughs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलाहः|हलाह
हलाहः A spotted or variegated horse, a piebald horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलाहलः|हलाहल|हलाहलं
हलाहलः, हलाहलम्<BR>—1 = हाल(ला)हल.<BR>—2 A kind of snake.<BR>—3 A sort of lizard.<BR>—4 A kind of deadly poison; see हाल(ला)हलम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलाहलम्
हलाहलः, हलाहलम्<BR>—1 = हाल(ला)हल.<BR>—2 A kind of snake.<BR>—3 A sort of lizard.<BR>—4 A kind of deadly poison; see हाल(ला)हलम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हलुहारः|हलुहार
हलुहारः A kind of horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्लकम्
हल्लकम् The red lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्लनम्
हल्लनम् Rolling or tossing about (as in sleep).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्लीशम्
हल्लीशम् (-षम्)<BR>—1 One of the 18 Uparūpakas or minor dramatic compositions; (described<BR> as a piece in one act and consisting mainly of singing and dancing by<BR> one male and seven, eight or ten female performers; see S. D. 555.<BR>—2 A kind of circular dance).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्लीषम्
हल्लीशम् (-षम्)<BR>—1 One of the 18 Uparūpakas or minor dramatic compositions; (described<BR> as a piece in one act and consisting mainly of singing and dancing by<BR> one male and seven, eight or ten female performers; see S. D. 555.<BR>—2 A kind of circular dance).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्लीशकः|हल्लीशक
हल्लीश(स)कः Dancing in a ring; घोषवासस्यानुरूपोऽयं हल्लीसकनृत्तबन्धम्<BR> उपयुज्यताम् Bālacharitam 3; हल्लसिकं सललितं रुचिरं वहामि ibid. 4. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हल्लीसकः|हल्लीसक
हल्लीश(स)कः Dancing in a ring; घोषवासस्यानुरूपोऽयं हल्लीसकनृत्तबन्धम्<BR> उपयुज्यताम् Bālacharitam 3; हल्लसिकं सललितं रुचिरं वहामि ibid. 4. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हवः|हव
हवः [हु-अ, ह्वे-अप् संप्र˚ पृषो˚ वा]<BR>—1 An oblation, a sacrifice; भीमतामपरोऽम्भोधिसमेऽधित महाहवे Śi. 19. 54.<BR>—2 Invocation, prayer.<BR>—3 Calling, a call.<BR>—4 Order, command.<BR>—5 Challenge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हवनम्
हवनम् [हु-भावे ल्युट्]<BR>—1 Offering an oblation with fire.<BR>—2 A sacrifice, an oblation.<BR>—3 A sacrificial ladle.<BR>—4 Calling, summoning, invocation.<BR>—5 Challenging to fight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हवनः|हवन|हवनं
हवनम् + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 Fire.<BR>—2 A fire-receptacle.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हवनायुस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हवनायुस्
हवनम् + -आयुस् <i>m.</i> fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हवनी
हवनी = हवित्री q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हवनीय|हवनीयं
हवनीय <i>a.</i> [हु कर्मणि अनीयर्] Sacrificial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हवनीयम्
हवनीय + .{@-यम्@}<BR>—1 Anything fit for an oblation.<BR>—2 Clarified butter or ghee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हवित्री
हवित्री A hole made in the ground for holding the sacred fire (to<BR> which oblations are offered).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविष्मत्|हविष्मन्त्
हविष्मत् <i>a.</i> Possessed of oblations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविष्मती
हविष्मती N. of the mythical cow Kāmadhenu; तस्मै स नरदेवाय<BR> मुनिरर्हणामाहरत् । ससैन्यामात्यवाहाय हविष्मत्या तपोधनः ॥ Bhāg. 9. 15. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविष्यम्
हविष्यम् [हविषे हितं यत्]<BR>—1 Anything fit for an oblation; दर्भाः पवित्रं पूर्वाह्णो हविष्याणि<BR> च सर्वशः Ms. 3. 256, 11. 77, 106; Y. 1. 239; (नन्दव्रजकुमारिकाः)<BR> चेरुर्हविष्यं भुञ्जानाः कात्यायन्यर्चनव्रतम् Bhāg. 10. 22. 1.<BR>—2 Clarified butter.<BR>—3 Wild rice.<BR>—4 Rice mixed with ghee.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हविष्यान्नम्, हविष्याशिन्, हविष्यभुज्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविष्यान्नम्
हविष्यम् + -अन्नम्<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">Page1752-2</a>]<BR> food fit to be eaten during certain holidays or days of fast.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविष्याशिन्
हविष्यम् + -आशिन्, -भुज् <i>m.</i> fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविष्यभुज्
हविष्यम् + -आशिन्, -भुज् <i>m.</i> fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविस्
हविस् <i>n.</i> [हूयते हु-कर्मणि असुन्]<BR>—1 An oblation or burnt offering in general; वहति विधिहुतं या हविः<BR> Ś. 1. 1; Ms. 3. 87, 132, 5. 7, 6. 12.<BR>—2 Clarified butter; न जातु कामः कामानामुपभोगेन शाम्यति । हविषा<BR> कृष्णवर्त्मेव भूय एवाभिवर्धते Bhāg. 9. 19. 14.<BR>—3 Water.<BR>—4 N. of Śiva.<BR>—5 A sacrifice; स्यादन्यायत्वादिज्यागामी हविःशब्दः MS. 6. 4. 21; यदीमानि<BR> हवींषीह विमथिष्यन्त्यसाधवः Mb. 12. 8. 10.<BR>—6 Food (अन्न); ब्राह्मणेभ्यो हविर्दत्वा मुच्यते तेन पाप्मना Mb. 13. 136. 16.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हविरशनम्, हविर्गन्धा, हविर्गेहम्, हविर्भुज्, हविर्यज्ञः, हविर्याजिन्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविरशनम्
हविस् + -अशनम् (हविरशनम्) devouring clarified butter or oblations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविरशनः|हविरशन
हविस् + -अशनम् + .({@-नः@}) fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविर्गन्धा|हविर्गंधा
हविस् + -गन्धा (हविर्गन्धा) the Śamī tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविर्गेहम्
हविस् + -गेहम् (हविर्गेहम्) a house in which sacrificial oblations are offered.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविर्भुज्
हविस् + -भुज् <i>m.</i> (हविर्भुज्) fire; अन्वासितमरुन्धत्या स्वाहयेव<BR> हविर्भुजम् R. 1. 56, 10. 69, 13. 41; Ku. 5. 20; Śi. 1. 2; Kāv. 2. 168.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविर्यज्ञः|हविर्यज्ञ
हविस् + -यज्ञः (हविर्यज्ञः) a kind of sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हविर्याजिन्
हविस् + -याजिन् (हविर्याजिन्) <i>m.</i> a priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्य|हव्यं
हव्य <i>a.</i> [ह-कर्मणि यत्] To be offered in oblations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्यम्
हव्य + .{@-व्यम्@}<BR>—1 Clarified butter.<BR>—2 An oblation or offering to the gods (opp. कव्य q. v.).<BR>—3 An oblation in general; ममेष्टं नित्यशो हव्यैर्मन्त्रैः संपूज्य पावकम्<BR> Rām. 7. 30. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्या
हव्य + .{@-व्या@} A cow; इडे रन्ते हव्ये etc. ŚB. on MS. 3. 10. 49.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हव्याशः, हव्यकव्यम्, हव्यपाकः, हव्यलेहिन्, हव्यवाह्, हव्यवाहः, हव्यवाहनः^1<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्याशः|हव्याश
हव्य + -आशः fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्यकव्यम्
हव्य + -कव्यम् oblations to the gods and to the Manes, or spirits of<BR> deceased ancestors; हव्यकव्याभिवाह्याय सर्वस्यास्य च गुप्तये Ms. 1. 94, 3. 97, 128;<BR> <i>et seq.</i><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्यपाकः|हव्यपाक
हव्य + -पाकः an oblation cooked with butter and milk, or the pot in<BR> which it is cooked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्यलेहिन्
हव्य + -लेहिन्, -वाह्, -वाह, -वाहनः^1 <i>m.</i> ‘the bearer of oblations’,<BR> fire; तथा हि तोयौघविभिन्नसंहतिः स हव्यवाहः प्रययौ पराभवम्<BR> Ki. 16. 61; अथ संचिन्तयामास भगवान् हव्यवाहनः Mb. 3. 217. 10.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्यवाह्
हव्य + -लेहिन्, -वाह्, -वाह, -वाहनः^1 <i>m.</i> ‘the bearer of oblations’,<BR> fire; तथा हि तोयौघविभिन्नसंहतिः स हव्यवाहः प्रययौ पराभवम्<BR> Ki. 16. 61; अथ संचिन्तयामास भगवान् हव्यवाहनः Mb. 3. 217. 10.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्यवाहः|हव्यवाह
हव्य + -लेहिन्, -वाह्, -वाह, -वाहनः^1 <i>m.</i> ‘the bearer of oblations’,<BR> fire; तथा हि तोयौघविभिन्नसंहतिः स हव्यवाहः प्रययौ पराभवम्<BR> Ki. 16. 61; अथ संचिन्तयामास भगवान् हव्यवाहनः Mb. 3. 217. 10.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हव्यवाहनः|हव्यवाहन
हव्य + -लेहिन्, -वाह्, -वाह, -वाहनः^1 <i>m.</i> ‘the bearer of oblations’,<BR> fire; तथा हि तोयौघविभिन्नसंहतिः स हव्यवाहः प्रययौ पराभवम्<BR> Ki. 16. 61; अथ संचिन्तयामास भगवान् हव्यवाहनः Mb. 3. 217. 10.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्
हस् €1 P. (हसति, हसित)<BR>—1 To smile, laugh (gently); हससि यदि किंचिदपि दन्तरुचिकौमुदी हरति<BR> दरतिमिरमतिघोरम् Gīt. 10; Bk. 7. 63, 14. 93.<BR>—2 To laugh at, mock, ridicule (with acc.); यमवाप्य विदर्भभूः प्रभुं<BR> हसति द्यामपि शक्रभर्तृकाम् N. 2. 16.<BR>—3 (Hence) To surpass, excel, throw into the back-ground; यो जहासेव<BR> वासुदेवम् K.; Śi. 1. 71.<BR>—4 To resemble; श्रिया हसद्भिः कमलानि सस्मितैः Ki. 8. 44.<BR>—5 To jest, joke.<BR>—6 To open, bloom, blow; हसद्बन्धुजीवप्रसूनैः.<BR>—7 To brighten up, or to clear up; भास्वानुदेष्यति हसिष्यति चक्रवालम्<BR> Subhāṣ. ━<i>Caus.</i> (हासयति-ते) To cause to smile; प्रमथमुखविकारैर्हासयामास<BR> गूढम् Ku. 7. 95.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसः|हस
हसः<BR>—1 Laugh, laughter.<BR>—2 Derision.<BR>—3 Merriment, mirth.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हसकृत्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसकृत्
हसः + -कृत् <i>a.</i> causing laughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसत्
हसत् <i>pres. p.</i> Mocking, excelling; मृत्पिण्डशेखरितकोटिभिरर्धचन्द्रं<BR> शृङ्गैः शिखाग्रगतलक्ष्ममलं हसद्भिः Śi. 5. 63. ━<i>f.</i> A portable<BR> fire-vessel (Mar. शेगडी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसनम्
हसनम् Laughing, laughter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसनी
हसनी A portable fire-place.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हसनीभणिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसनीभणिः
हसनी + -भणिः fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1752-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसन्तिका|हसंतिका
हसन्तिका A portable fire-vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसन्ती|हसंती
हसन्ती<BR>—1 A portable fire-vessel.<BR>—2 A lamp-stand.<BR>—3 A kind of Mallikā.<BR>—4 A kind of fairy (= शाकिनी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसिका
हसिका Laughter, derision.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसित|हसितं|हसितः
हसित <i>p. p.</i> [हस्-कर्तरि क्त]<BR>—1 Laughed, laughing.<BR>—2 Blown, expanded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हसितम्
हसित + .{@-तम्@}<BR>—1 Laughter.<BR>—2 Joke, jesting; कीर्तितानि हसितेऽपि तानि यं व्रीडयन्ति चरितानि मानिनम् Ki. 13. 47.<BR>—3 The bow of the god of love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तः|हस्त|हस्तं
हस्तः [हस्-तन् न इट् Uṇ. 3. 86]<BR>—1 The hand; हस्तं गत ‘fallen in the hand or possession of’; गौतमीहस्ते<BR> विसर्जयिष्यामि Ś. 3 ‘I shall send it by Gautamī’; so हस्ते पतिता;<BR> हस्तसंनिहितां कुरु &c.; शंभुना दत्तहस्ता Me. 62 ‘leaning on Śambhuʼs hand’<BR>; हस्ते-कृ —1 (हस्तेकृत्य-कृत्वा) ‘to take or seize the hand, take hold of the hand, take in hand, take possession of’<BR>;<BR> Prov.:− हस्तकङ्कणं किं दर्पणे प्रेक्ष्यते Karpūr. ‘sight requires no mirror’.<BR>—2 The trunk of an elephant; Ku. 1. 36; अथवा हस्तिहस्तचञ्चलानि पुरुषभाग्यानि<BR> भवन्ति Avimārakam 2.<BR>—3 N. of the 13th lunar mansion consisting of five stars.<BR>—4 The fore-arm, cubit, a measure of length (equal to 24 <i>aṅgulas</i><BR> or about 18 inches, being the distance between the elbow and the tip of<BR> the middle finger).<BR>—5 Hand-writing, signature; धनी वोपगतं दद्यात् स्वहस्तपरिचिह्नितम्<BR> Y. 1. 319; स्वहस्तकालसंपन्नं शासनम् 1. 320 ‘bearing date and signature’<BR>; धार्यतामयं प्रियायाः स्वहस्तः V. 2 ‘the autograph of my beloved’<BR>; 2. 20.<BR>—6 (Hence fig.) Proof, indication; Mu. 3.<BR>—7 Help, assistance, support; वात्या खेदं कृशाङ्ग्याः सुचिरमवयवैर्दत्तहस्ता<BR> करोति Ve. 2. 21.<BR>—8 A mass, quantity, abundance (of hair), in comp. with केश, कच<BR> &c.; पाशः पक्षश्च हस्तश्च कलापार्थाः कचात् परे Ak.; रतिविगलितंबन्धे<BR> केशहस्ते सुकेश्याः सति कुसुमसनाथे किं करोत्येष बर्ही V. 4. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तम्
हस्तः + .{@-स्तम्@}<BR>—1 A pair of leather-bellows.<BR>—2 Skill (in using the hand); कलासु कौशलमक्षभूमिहस्तादिषु Dk. 2. 2.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हस्ताक्षरम्, हस्ताग्रम्, हस्ताङ्गुलिः, हस्ताभ्यासः, हस्तावलम्बः, हस्तालम्बनम्, हस्तामलकम्, हस्तावापः, हस्तकमलम्, हस्तकौशलम्, हस्तक्रिया, हस्तगत, हस्तगामिन्, हस्तग्राहः, हस्तचापल्यम्, हस्ततलम्, हस्ततालः, हस्ततुला, हस्तदक्षिण, हस्तदोषः, हस्तधारणम्, हस्तवारणम्, हस्तपादम्, हस्तपुच्छम्, हस्तपृष्ठम्, हस्तप्रद, हस्तप्राप्त, हस्तवर्तिन्, हस्तस्थ, हस्तस्थित, हस्तप्राप्य, हस्तबिम्बम्, हस्तभ्रष्ट, हस्तमणिः, हस्तरोधम्, हस्तलाघवम्, हस्तलेखः, हस्तवापः, हस्तवाम, हस्तविन्यासः, हस्तसंवाहनम्, हस्तसिद्धिः, हस्तसूत्रम्, हस्तस्वस्तिकः, हस्तहार्य<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्ताक्षरम्
हस्तः + -अक्षरम् oneʼs own hand or signature, oneʼs own sign-manual.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्ताग्रम्
हस्तः + -अग्रम् the finger (being the extremity of the hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्ताङ्गुलिः|हस्ताङ्गुलि|हस्तांगुलि
हस्तः + -अङ्गुलिः <i>f.</i> any finger of the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्ताभ्यासः
हस्तः + -अभ्यासः contact with the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तावलम्बः|हस्तावलम्ब
हस्तः + -अवलम्बः, -आलम्बनम् support of the hand; दत्तहस्तावलम्बे<BR> प्रारम्भे Ratn. 1. 8 ‘being aided or helped on’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तालम्बनम्
हस्तः + -अवलम्बः, -आलम्बनम् support of the hand; दत्तहस्तावलम्बे<BR> प्रारम्भे Ratn. 1. 8 ‘being aided or helped on’.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तामलकम्
हस्तः + -आमलकम् ‘the fruit of the myrobalan held in the hand’ a phrase<BR> used to denote that which can be clearly and easily seen or understood;<BR> cf. करतलामलकफलवदखिलं जगदालोकयताम् K. 43.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तावापः|हस्तावाप
हस्तः + -आवापः<BR>—1 a finger-guard (ज्याघातवारणम्); V. 5; Ś. 6.<BR>—2 a hand-fetter; व्यालकुञ्जरदुर्गेषु सर्पचोरभयेषु च । हस्तावापेन<BR> गच्छन्ति नास्तिकाः किमतः परम् ॥ Mb. 12. 181. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तकमलम्
हस्तः + -कमलम्<BR>—1 a lotus carried in the hand.<BR>—2 a lotus-like hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तकौशलम्
हस्तः + -कौशलम् manual dexterity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तक्रिया
हस्तः + -क्रिया manual work or performance, handicraft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तगत
हस्तः + -गत, -गामिन् <i>a.</i> come to hand, fallen into oneʼs possession, obtained,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">Page1753-2</a>]<BR> secured; त्वं प्रार्थ्यसे हस्तगता ममैभिः R. 7. 67, 8. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तगामिन्
हस्तः + -गत, -गामिन् <i>a.</i> come to hand, fallen into oneʼs possession, obtained,<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">Page1753-2</a>]<BR> secured; त्वं प्रार्थ्यसे हस्तगता ममैभिः R. 7. 67, 8. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तग्राहः|हस्तग्राह
हस्तः + -ग्राहः taking by the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तचापल्यम्
हस्तः + -चापल्यम् = हस्तकौशलम् q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्ततलम्
हस्तः + -तलम्<BR>—1 the palm of the hand.<BR>—2 the tip of an elephantʼs trunk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्ततालः|हस्तताल
हस्तः + -तालः striking the palms together, clapping the hands.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्ततुला
हस्तः + -तुला ‘hand-balance’, weighing in the hand; हस्ततुलयापि निपुणाः<BR> पलप्रमाणं विजानन्ति Pt. 2. 83.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तदक्षिण
हस्तः + -दक्षिण <i>a.</i><BR>—1 situated on the right hand.<BR>—2 Right, correct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तदोषः|हस्तदोष
हस्तः + -दोषः a slip of the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तधारणम्
हस्तः + -धारणम्, -वारणम् warding off a blow (with the hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तवारणम्
हस्तः + -धारणम्, -वारणम् warding off a blow (with the hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तपादम्
हस्तः + -पादम् the hands and feet; न मे हस्तपादं प्रसरति Ś. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तपुच्छम्
हस्तः + -पुच्छम् the hand below the wrist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तपृष्ठम्
हस्तः + -पृष्ठम् the back of the hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तप्रद
हस्तः + -प्रद <i>a.</i> supporting, helping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तप्राप्त
हस्तः + -प्राप्त, -वर्तिन्, -स्थ, -स्थित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 held in the hand.<BR>—2 gained, secured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तवर्तिन्|हस्तवर्त्तिन्
हस्तः + -प्राप्त, -वर्तिन्, -स्थ, -स्थित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 held in the hand.<BR>—2 gained, secured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तस्थ
हस्तः + -प्राप्त, -वर्तिन्, -स्थ, -स्थित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 held in the hand.<BR>—2 gained, secured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तस्थित
हस्तः + -प्राप्त, -वर्तिन्, -स्थ, -स्थित <i>a.</i><BR>—1 held in the hand.<BR>—2 gained, secured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तप्राप्य
