हस्तलाघवम्
हस्तः + -लाघवम्<BR>—1 manual readiness or skill.<BR>—2 a sleight of the hand, legerdemain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तलेखः|हस्तलेख
