हस्तवापः|हस्तवाप
हस्तः + -वापः = हस्तक्षेपः shooting (arrows) with the hand; यस्यैकषष्टिर्निशितास्तीक्ष्णधाराः<BR> सुवाससः संमतो हस्तवापः Mb. 5. 23. 22.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तवाम
हस्तः + -वाम <i>a.</i> situated on the left (or wrong) hand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तविन्यासः|हस्तविन्यास
