हस्तसूत्रम्
हस्तः + -सूत्रम् a bracelet or thread-string worn on the wrist; धात्र्यङ्गुलीभिः<BR> प्रतिसार्यमाणमूर्णामयं कौतुकहस्तसूत्रम् Ku. 7. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तस्वस्तिकः|हस्तस्वस्तिक
हस्तः + -स्वस्तिकः crossing the hands; स्तनविनिहितहस्तस्वस्तिकाभिर्वधूभिः Māl. 4. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तहार्य
हस्तः + -हार्य <i>a.</i> manifest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तकः|हस्तक
हस्तकः<BR>—1 A hand.<BR>—2 The position of the hand.<BR>—3 A measure of length.<BR>—4 A turn-spit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तवत्|हस्तवन्त्
