हस्ता
हस्ता The thirteenth lunar mansion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्ताहस्ति
हस्ताहस्ति <i>ind.</i> Hand to hand; हस्ताहस्ति जन्यमजनि Dk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिकम्
हस्तिकम् A multitude of elephants; Mb. 9.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1753-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिका
