हस्तिघ्नः|हस्तिघ्न
हस्तिन् + -घ्नः<BR>—1 an elephant-killer.<BR>—2 a man.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

