हस्तिजागरिकः|हस्तिजागरिक
हस्तिन् + -जागरिकः a keeper of elephants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिजिह्वा
हस्तिन् + -जिह्वा a particular vein.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

