हस्तिन् + -दन्तः<BR>—1 the tusk of an elephant.<BR>—2 a peg projecting from a wall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिदन्तम्
हस्तिन् + -दन्तः + .({@-न्तम्@})<BR>—1 ivory.<BR>—2 a radish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिदन्तकम्
हस्तिन् + -दन्तकम् a radish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिनखम्
हस्तिन् + -नखम् a sort of turret protecting the approach to the gate of<BR> a city or fort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिनासा
हस्तिन् + -नासा an elephantʼs trunk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिपः|हस्तिप
हस्तिन् + -पः, -पकः an elephant driver or rider; जज्ञे जनैर्मुकुलिताक्षमनाददाने<BR> संरब्धहस्तिपकनिष्ठुरचोदनाभिः Śi. 5. 49; इति घोषयतीव डिण्डिमः<BR> करिणो हस्तिपकाहतः क्वणन् H. 2. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिपकः|हस्तिपक
हस्तिन् + -पः, -पकः an elephant driver or rider; जज्ञे जनैर्मुकुलिताक्षमनाददाने<BR> संरब्धहस्तिपकनिष्ठुरचोदनाभिः Śi. 5. 49; इति घोषयतीव डिण्डिमः<BR> करिणो हस्तिपकाहतः क्वणन् H. 2. 86.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

