हस्तिमयूरकः
हस्तिन् + -मयूरकः N. of a plant (Mar. आजमोदा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिमल्लः|हस्तिमल्ल
हस्तिन् + -मल्लः<BR>—1 N. of <i>Airāvata</i>; सुराधिपाधिष्ठितहस्तिमल्ललीलां दधौ राजतगण्डशैलः Śi. 4. 13.<BR>—2 of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—3 of Śaṅkha, the eighth of the chief Nāgas.<BR>—4 a heap of ashes.<BR>—5 a shower of dust.<BR>—6 frost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तियूथः|हस्तियूथ
हस्तिन् + -यूथः, -यूथम् a herd of elephants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तियूथम्
हस्तिन् + -यूथः, -यूथम् a herd of elephants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिवक्त्रः|हस्तिवक्त्र
हस्तिन् + -वक्त्रः N. of Gaṇeśa; Dk. 2. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1754-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हस्तिवर्चसम्
