हिंस्रा
हिंस्रा<BR>—1 A vein, nerve.<BR>—2 Spikenard (जटामांसि).<BR>—3 The Guñjā plant; L. D. B.<BR>—4 A kind of grain (गवेधु); L. D. B.<BR>—5 Fat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1757-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिक्क्
हिक्क् I. €1 U. (हिक्कति-ते, हिक्कित)<BR>—1 To make an indistinct or inarticulate sound.<BR>—2 To hiccough. ━II. €10 Ā. (हिक्कयते) To hurt, injure, kill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1757-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिक्किका
हिक्किका, हिक्कितम्, हिक्का<BR>—1 An indistinct sound.<BR>—2 Hiccough; शुकानामपि सर्वेषां हिक्किका प्रोच्यते ज्वरः Mb. 12. 283. 55.<BR>—3 (हिक्का) An owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1757-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिक्कितम्
हिक्किका, हिक्कितम्, हिक्का<BR>—1 An indistinct sound.<BR>—2 Hiccough; शुकानामपि सर्वेषां हिक्किका प्रोच्यते ज्वरः Mb. 12. 283. 55.<BR>—3 (हिक्का) An owl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1757-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिक्का
