हिमाब्जम्
हिम + -अब्जम् a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमाभ्रः|हिमाभ्र
हिम + -अभ्रः camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमारातिः|हिमाराति
हिम + -अरातिः<BR>—1 fire.<BR>—2 the sun. —3 the <i>arka</i> and <i>chitraka</i> plants.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमारिः|हिमारि
हिम + -अरिः fire. ˚शत्रुः water; Bu. C. 11. 71.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमागमः|हिमागम
हिम + -आगमः the cold or winter-season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमानद्ध
हिम + -आनद्ध <i>a.</i> frozen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमार्त|हिमार्त्त
हिम + -आर्त <i>a.</i> pinched or shivering with cold, chilled.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमालयः|हिमालय
हिम + -आलयः<BR>—1 the Himālaya mountain; अस्त्युत्तरस्यां दिशि देवतात्मा हिमालयो नाम<BR> नगाधिराजः Ku. 1. 1.<BR>—2 the white Khadira tree. ˚सुता an epithet of Pārvatī.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

