हिमाह्वयः|हिमाह्वय
हिम + -आह्वः, -आह्वयः camphor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

