हिम + -आह्वः, -आह्वयः + ({@-यम्@}) a lotus.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

