हिम + -उत्तरा the tawny grape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमोत्पन्ना
हिम + -उत्पन्ना a kind of sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमोद्भवा
हिम + -उद्भवा the plant called Zedoary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमोस्रः|हिमोस्र
हिम + -उस्रः the moon; यदाप्यानं हिमोस्रेण भनक्त्युपवनं कपिः Bk. 9. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमर्तुः|हिमर्तु
हिम + -ऋतुः the winter season.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमकरः|हिमकर
