हिमकूटः|हिमकूट
हिम + -कूटः<BR>—1 the winter season.<BR>—2 the Himālaya mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमखण्डम्
हिम + -खण्डम् a hail stone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

