हिमशौलः
हिम + -शौलः the Himālaya mountain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमश्रथः|हिमश्रथ
