हिम + -सरस् <i>n.</i> ‘a lake of snow’, cold water; न संतापच्छेदो<BR> हिमसरसि वा चन्द्रमसि वा Māl. 1. 31.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमस्रुतः
हिम + -स्रुतः^1 <i>m.</i> the moon.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

