हिमवत्सुता
हिमवत् + -सुता<BR>—1 Pārvatī.<BR>—2 the Ganges.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमवलम्
हिमवलम् A pearl.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमा
हिमा<BR>—1 The cold season, winter.<BR>—2 Small cardamoms.<BR>—3 A kind of grass.<BR>—4 The fragrant drug and perfume called Reṇukā.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिमानी
हिमानी<BR>—1 [महद् हिमम्, आनुक्] A mass or collection of snow, snow-drift; नगमुपरि<BR> हिमानीगौरमासाद्य जिष्णुः Ki. 4. 38; Bv. 1. 26.<BR>—2 A kind of sugar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

