हिरणम्
हिरणम् [हृ-ल्युट् नि˚]<BR>—1 Gold.<BR>—2 Semen.<BR>—3 A cowrie.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1759-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिरण्मय|हिरण्मयं|हिरण्मयः
