हिरण्यम् + -नाभः + .({@-भम्@}) a building having three halls (towards east, west and south).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1760-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिरण्यबाहुः|हिरण्यबाहु
हिरण्यम् + -बाहुः<BR>—1 an epithet of Śiva.<BR>—2 the river Śoṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1760-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिरण्यबिन्दुः|हिरण्यबिन्दु
हिरण्यम् + -बिन्दुः fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1760-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिरण्यरेतस्
हिरण्यम् + -रेतस् <i>m.</i><BR>—1 fire; द्विषामसह्यः सुतरां तरूणां हिरण्यरेता इव सानिलोऽभूत् R. 18. 25.<BR>—2 the sun.<BR>—3 N. of Śiva.<BR>—4 the <i>Chitraka</i> or <i>Arka</i> plant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1760-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

