हिल्
हिल् €6 P. (हिलति) To sport amorously, wanton, dally, express amorous desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1760-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हिलिहिल
