हृष्
हृष् €1. €4 P. (हर्षति, हृष्यति, हृष्ट or हृषित)<BR>—1 To be delighted or rejoiced, be pleased or glad, to exult, rejoice;<BR> अद्वितीयं रुचात्मानं मत्वा किं चन्द्र हृष्यसि Bv. 2. 54; Mv. 7. 13.<BR>—2 To bristle or stand erect, stand on end (as the hair of the body);<BR> सुखवेदनाहृषितरोमकूपया Śi. 13. 13; हृषितास्तनूरुहाः Dk.; हृष्यन्ति<BR> रोमकूपानि Mb.<BR>—3 To become erect (said of other things, <i>e. g.</i> the penis).<BR>—4 To lie, tell a lie. ━<i>Caus.</i> (हर्षयति-ते) To please, delight,<BR> fill with pleasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1763-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हृषिः|हृषि
