हेमशङ्खः|हेमशङ्ख|हेमशंख
हेमन् + -शङ्खः N. of Viṣṇu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमशृङ्गम्
हेमन् + -शृङ्गम्<BR>—1 a golden horn.<BR>—2 a golden summit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमसारम्
हेमन् + -सारम् blue vitriol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमसूत्रम्
हेमन् + -सूत्रम्, -सूत्रकम् a kind of necklace (Mar. गोफ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमसूत्रकम्
हेमन् + -सूत्रम्, -सूत्रकम् a kind of necklace (Mar. गोफ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमकम्
हेमकम् Gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमलः|हेमल
हेमलः<BR>—1 A goldsmith.<BR>—2 A touchstone.<BR>—3 A chameleon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेम्य
हेम्य <i>a.</i> Golden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमन्तः|हेमन्त|हेमंत|हेमंतं|हेमंतः
हेमन्तः, -न्तम्<BR> One of the six seasons, cold or winter season (comprising<BR> the months मार्गशीर्ष and पौष); नवप्रवालोद्गमसस्यरम्यः<BR> प्रफुल्ललोध्रः परिपक्वशालिः । विलीनपद्मः प्रपतत्तुषारो हेमन्तकालः<BR> समुपागतः प्रिये ॥ Ṛs. 4. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हेमन्तनाथः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमन्तम्
हेमन्तः, -न्तम्<BR> One of the six seasons, cold or winter season (comprising<BR> the months मार्गशीर्ष and पौष); नवप्रवालोद्गमसस्यरम्यः<BR> प्रफुल्ललोध्रः परिपक्वशालिः । विलीनपद्मः प्रपतत्तुषारो हेमन्तकालः<BR> समुपागतः प्रिये ॥ Ṛs. 4. 1.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हेमन्तनाथः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमन्तनाथः|हेमन्तनाथ
हेमन्तः + -नाथः the wood-apple tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेमन्ती|हेमंती
हेमन्ती Winter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेम्नः|हेम्न
हेम्नः The planet Mercury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेय|हेयः
हेय <i>a.</i> Fit to be left or abandoned; स्वप्ने निरुक्त्या गृहमेधिसौख्यं<BR> न यस्य हेयानुमितं स्वयं स्यात् Bhāg. 5. 11. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेरम्
हेरम् [हि-रन्]<BR>—1 A kind of crown or diadem.<BR>—2 Turmeric.<BR>—3 Demoniacal illusion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेरकः|हेरक
हेरकः, हेरिकः A spy, secret emissary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेरिकः|हेरिक
हेरकः, हेरिकः A spy, secret emissary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेरम्बः|हेरम्ब|हेरंब|हेरंबः
हेरम्बः [हे शिवे रम्बति रम्ब्-अच् अलुक् समा˚ Tv.]<BR>—1 N. of Gaṇeśa; जेता हेरम्बभृङ्गिप्रमुखगणचमूचक्रिणस्तारकारेः<BR> Mv. 2. 17; हे हेरम्ब, किमम्ब, रोदिषि कथं, कर्णौ लुठत्यग्निभूः Subhāṣ.<BR>—2 A buffalo.<BR>—3 A boastful hero.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हेरम्बजननी<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेरम्बजननी|हेरंबजननी
हेरम्बः + -जननी N. of Pārvatī (mother of Gaṇeśa).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेरुकः|हेरुक
हेरुकः<BR>—1 An attendant on Śiva.<BR>—2 N. of Gaṇeśa.<BR>—3 N. of a Buddha (= चक्रसम्बर).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेल्
हेल् €1 Ā. (हेलते) To disregard; see हेड्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेलञ्ची
हेलञ्ची A common herb; L. D. B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेलनम्
हेलनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Disregarding, slighting, contempt, insulting.<BR>—2 Sporting amorously, wanton dalliance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेलना
हेलनम्, -ना<BR>—1 Disregarding, slighting, contempt, insulting.<BR>—2 Sporting amorously, wanton dalliance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेला
हेला [हेड्-भावे-डस्य लः]<BR>—1 Contempt, disrespect, insult; तत्पूर्वमंसद्वयसं द्विपाधिपाः क्षणं<BR> सहेलाः परितो जगाहिरे Śi. 12. 72.<BR>—2<BR>——(<i>a</i>) Amorous sport or dalliance, wanton sport; हेलात्यन्तं समालक्ष्य<BR> विकारः स्यात् स एव च S. D. 128; भावो हावश्च हेला च त्रयस्तत्र<BR> शरीरजाः D. R. 2. 32.<BR>——(<i>b</i>) Pleasure, delight, pastime; मुग्धेन्दुसुन्दरतदीयमुखावलोकहेलाविशृङ्खलकुतूहलनिह्नवाय Māl. 9. 43.<BR>—3 Strong sexual desire; प्रौढेच्छयाऽतिरूढानां नारीणां सुरतोत्सवे ।<BR> शृङ्गारशास्त्रतत्त्वज्ञैर्हेला सा परिकीर्तिता ॥<BR>—4 Ease, facility; निवेशयामासिथ हेलयोद्धृतम् Śi. 1. 34; हेलया<BR> ‘easily’, without any difficulty or trouble.<BR>—5 Moonlight.<BR>—6 A pause in a note or shaking (as in music).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेलावत्|हेलावन्त्
हेलावत् <i>a.</i> Careless, taking things easily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेलावुक्कः|हेलावुक्क
हेलावुक्कः A horse-dealer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेलिः|हेलि
हेलिः [हिल्-इन्] The sun; व्यतरन्नरुणाय विश्रमं सृजते हेलिहयालिकालनाम्<BR> N. 2. 80, 3. 80; विक्रीय तं हेलिहिरण्यपिण्डं तारावराटानियमादित<BR> द्यौः N. 22. 13; हेलिः केलिसरोजबन्धुः Yaśastilaka 3. 403; also<BR> हेलिकः in this sense. ━<i>f.</i><BR>—1 Wanton or amorous sport, dalliance.<BR>—2 An embrace.<BR>—3 A marriage procession in the street.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेलिहिल
हे(है)लिहिल <i>a.</i> Of a sportive or wanton nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैलिहिल
हे(है)लिहिल <i>a.</i> Of a sportive or wanton nature.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेवाकः|हेवाक
हेवाकः Ardent or intense desire, eagerness; (this word, like the<BR> word लटभ q. v., is used only by later writers like Kalhaṇa, Bilhaṇa,<BR> and is probably derived from Persian or Arabic, cf. Mar. हेवा); अस्मिन्नासीत्तदनु<BR> निबिडाश्लेषहेवाकलीलविल्लद्बाहुक्वणितबलया संततं राजलक्ष्मीः Vikr. 18. 101;<BR> cf. हेवाकिन् below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेवाकस
हेवाकस <i>a.</i> High, intense, ardent; हेवाकसस्तु शृङ्गारो हावोक्षिभ्रूविकारकृत्<BR> D. R. 2. 31; (might the word here not be derived from हेवाक ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेवाकिन्
हेवाकिन् <i>a.</i> Ardently desirous of, eager for, (in comp.); जायन्ते<BR> महतामहो निरुपमप्रस्थानहेवाकिनां निःसामान्यमहत्त्वयोगपिशुना वार्ता<BR> विपत्तावपि Kalhaṇa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेष्
हेष् €1 Ā. (हेषते, हेषित) To neigh (as a horse); to bray, roar (in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेषः|हेष
हेषः, हेषा, हेषितम् Neighing, braying; रथाङ्गसंक्रीडितमश्वहेषः<BR> Ki. 16. 8; सरावधूताभ्रविमानसंकुलं कुर्वन्नभो हेषितभीषिताखिलः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 37. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेषा
हेषः, हेषा, हेषितम् Neighing, braying; रथाङ्गसंक्रीडितमश्वहेषः<BR> Ki. 16. 8; सरावधूताभ्रविमानसंकुलं कुर्वन्नभो हेषितभीषिताखिलः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 37. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेषितम्
हेषः, हेषा, हेषितम् Neighing, braying; रथाङ्गसंक्रीडितमश्वहेषः<BR> Ki. 16. 8; सरावधूताभ्रविमानसंकुलं कुर्वन्नभो हेषितभीषिताखिलः<BR> Bhāg. 10. 37. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेषिन्
हेषिन् <i>m.</i> A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हेहे
हेहे <i>ind.</i> A vocative particle used in addressing or calling out loudly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

है
है <i>ind.</i> A vocative particle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैडिम्बः|हैडिम्ब
हैडिम्बः, -म्बिः<BR> Ghaṭotkacha (son of Hidimbā); तत्राद्भुतमपश्याम हैडिम्बस्य<BR> पराक्रमम् Mb. 6. 58. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैडिम्बिः|हैडिम्बि
हैडिम्बः, -म्बिः<BR> Ghaṭotkacha (son of Hidimbā); तत्राद्भुतमपश्याम हैडिम्बस्य<BR> पराक्रमम् Mb. 6. 58. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैतुक|हैतुकः
हैतुक <i>a.</i> (-की <i>f.</i>)<BR> [हेतौ प्रसृतः ठण्]<BR>—1 Causal, causative.<BR>—2 Argumentative, rationalistic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैतुकः|हैतुक
हैतुक + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A logical reasoner, an arguer.<BR>—2 A follower of the Mīmāṃsā<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">Page1766-1</a>]<BR> doctrines.<BR>—3 A rationalist, sceptic; वेदवादरतो न स्यान्न पाखण्डी न हैतुकः ।<BR> शुष्कवादविवादे न कंचित् पक्षं समाश्रयेत् ॥ Bhāg. 11. 18. 30.<BR>—4 A heretic; हैतुकान् बकवृत्तींश्च वाङ्मात्रेणापि नार्चयेत् Ms. 4. 30.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1765-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैम|हैमं|हैमः
हैम <i>a.</i> (-मी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [हिम-हेमन्-अण्]<BR>—1 Cold, wintry, frigid.<BR>—2 Caused by frost; मृणालिनी हैममिवोपरागम् R. 16. 7.<BR>—2 Golden, made of gold; पादेन हैमं विलिलेख पीठम् R. 6. 15; Bk. 5. 89;<BR> Ku. 6. 6.<BR>—3 Of a golden yellow colour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमा
हैम + .{@-मा, -मी@} Yellow jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमी
हैम + .{@-मा, -मी@} Yellow jasmine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमम्
हैम + .{@-मम्@} Hoar-frost, dew.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमः|हैम|हैमं
हैम + .{@-मः@} An epithet of Śiva.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हैममुद्रा, हैममुद्रिका<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैममुद्रा
हैम + -मुद्रा, -मुद्रिका a golden coin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैममुद्रिका
हैम + -मुद्रा, -मुद्रिका a golden coin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमन|हैमनं|हैमनः
हैमन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> [हेमन्त एव हेमन्ते भवो वा अण् तलोपः]<BR>—1 Wintry, cold; गजपतिद्वयसीरपि हैमनस्तुहिनयन् सरितः पृषतां<BR> पतिः Śi. 6. 55; Ki. 17. 12.<BR>—2 Pertaining to winter, <i>i. e.</i> long (as nights); प्रेम्णा मनःसु<BR> रजनीष्वपि हैमनीषु Śi. 6. 77.<BR>—3 Growing in or suitable for winter; हैमनैर्निवसनैः सुमध्यमाः R. 19. 41.<BR>—4 Golden, made of gold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमनः|हैमन|हैमनं
हैमन + .{@-नः@}<BR>—1 The month Mārgaśīrṣa.<BR>—2 The winter season (= हेमन्त q. v.).<BR>—3 A kind of rice which grows in winter (षष्टिक).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमन्तिक|हैमंतिक|हैमन्तिकं
हैमन्तिक <i>a.</i> [हेमन्ते काले भवः ठञ्]<BR>—1 Wintry, cold.<BR>—2 Growing in winter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमन्तिकम्
हैमन्तिक + .{@-कम्@} A kind of rice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमल|हैमलः
हैमल See हेमन्त.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमवत|हैमवतं|हैमवतः
हैमवत <i>a.</i> (-ती <i>f.</i>)<BR> [हिमवतो अदूरभवो देशः तस्येदं वा अण्]<BR>—1 Snowy.<BR>—2 Flowing from the snowy, <i>i. e.</i> Himālaya mountain; आनन्दशीतामिव<BR> बाष्पवृष्टिं हिमस्रुतिं हैमवतीं ससर्ज R. 16. 44.<BR>—3 Bred in, belonging to, or situated on, the Himālaya mountain; यद्यच्चक्रे<BR> महाबाहुस्तस्मिन् हैमवते गिरौ Mb. 3. 160. 4; स्थाण्वाश्रमं हैमवतं<BR> जगाम Ku. 3. 23, 2. 67.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमवतः|हैमवत|हैमवतं
हैमवत + .{@-तः@} A kind of poison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमवतम्
हैमवत + .{@-तम्@} Bhāratavarṣa or India.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमवतिक
हैमवतिक <i>a.</i> Living in the Himālaya mountain; स हैमवतिकान्<BR> जित्वा करं सर्वानदापयत् Mb. 3. 254. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैमवती
हैमवती<BR>—1 N. of Pārvatī.<BR>—2 Of the river Ganges; एवमुक्तः प्रत्युवाच राजा हैमवतीं तदा Mb. 3. 108. 16.<BR>—3 A kind of myrobalan.<BR>—4 A kind of drug.<BR>—5 Common flax.<BR>—6 A tawny grape.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैयंगवम्
हैयंगवम्, हैयंगवीनम् [ह्यो गोदोहात् भवं ह्यस् गो ख नि˚]<BR>—1 Clarified butter prepared from the preceding dayʼs milk, fresh ghee;<BR> हैयंगवीनमादाय घोषवृद्धानुपस्थितान् R. 1. 45; Bk. 5. 12.<BR>—2 Butter prepared a day before it is used, fresh butter; भित्त्वा मृषाश्रुर्दृषदश्मना<BR> रहो जघास हैयंगवमन्तरं गतः Bhāg. 10. 9. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैयंगवीनम्
हैयंगवम्, हैयंगवीनम् [ह्यो गोदोहात् भवं ह्यस् गो ख नि˚]<BR>—1 Clarified butter prepared from the preceding dayʼs milk, fresh ghee;<BR> हैयंगवीनमादाय घोषवृद्धानुपस्थितान् R. 1. 45; Bk. 5. 12.<BR>—2 Butter prepared a day before it is used, fresh butter; भित्त्वा मृषाश्रुर्दृषदश्मना<BR> रहो जघास हैयंगवमन्तरं गतः Bhāg. 10. 9. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैरण्य
हैरण्य <i>a.</i> Golden, made of gold.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: हैरण्यवासस्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैरण्यवासस्
हैरण्य + -वासस् <i>a.</i> clothed in golden feathers (as an arrow).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैरण्यकः|हैरण्यक
हैरण्यकः<BR>—1 Goldsmith.<BR>—2 A guardian of golden treasure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैरिकः|हैरिक
हैरिकः A thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैहयः|हैहय
हैहयः^1 <i>m.</i> pl. N. of a people and their country.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20260502. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-orig/commit/8ab1240.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैहयः|हैहय
हैहय + .{@-यः@}<BR>—1 N. of the great-grandson of Yadu.<BR>—2 N. of Arjuna Kārtavīrya (who had a thousand arms and was slain by<BR> Paraśurāma q. v.); धेनुवत्सहरणाच्च हैहयस्त्वं च कीर्तिमपहर्तुमुद्यतः R. 11. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हैहेयः|हैहेय
हैहेयः Arjuna Kārtavīrya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हो
हो <i>ind.</i><BR>—1 A vocative particle used in calling to a person or in challenging.<BR>—2 Of surprise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होड्
होड् I. €1 Ā. (होडते) To disregard, disrespect. ━II. €1 P. (होडति) To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होडः|होड
होडः A raft, float.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होडृ
होडृ <i>m.</i> A robber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होढम्
होढम् Stolen goods; न होढेन विना चौरं घातयेद्धार्मिको नृपः Ms. 9. 270.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होतृ
होतृ <i>a.</i> (-त्री <i>f.</i>)<BR> [हु-तृच्] Sacrificing, offering oblations with<BR> fire; वहति विधिहुतं या हविर्या च होत्री Ś. 1. 1. ━<i>m.</i><BR>—1 A sacrificial priest, especially one who recites the prayers of the<BR> Ṛgveda at a sacrifice; जनकस्य वैदेहस्य होताश्वलो बभूव.<BR>—2 A sacrificer; इति वादिन एवास्य होतुराहुतिसाधनम् R. 1. 82; Ms. 11. 36.<BR>—3 An epithet of Agni.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: होतृकर्मन्, होतृप्रवरः, होतृषदनम्, होतृसदनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होतृकर्मन्
होतृ + -कर्मन् <i>a.</i> the function of the होतृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होतृप्रवरः|होतृप्रवर
होतृ + -प्रवरः the election of a होतृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होतृषदनम्
होतृ + -षदनम्, -सदनम् the होतृʼs seat; होतृषदनाद्धैवापि<BR> दुरुद्गीथमनुसमाहरति Ch. Up. 1. 5. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होतृसदनम्
होतृ + -षदनम्, -सदनम् the होतृʼs seat; होतृषदनाद्धैवापि<BR> दुरुद्गीथमनुसमाहरति Ch. Up. 1. 5. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होतृकः|होतृक
होतृकः, होत्रकः An assistant of the Hotṛ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होत्रकः|होत्रक
होतृकः, होत्रकः An assistant of the Hotṛ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होत्रम्
होत्रम् [हु-ष्ट्रन्]<BR>—1 Anything fit to be offered as an oblation (as ghee).<BR>—2 A burnt offering.<BR>—3 A sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होत्रा
होत्रा<BR>—1 A sacrifice.<BR>—2 Praise; सत्त्वेन कुरुते युद्धे राजन् सुबलवानपि । नोद्यमेन न होत्राभिः<BR> सर्वाः स्वीकुरुते प्रजाः ॥ Mb. 3. 33. 69.<BR>—3 Ved. Speech.<BR>—4 The office of होतृक priest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होत्रिन्
होत्रिन् <i>m.</i> A sacrificing priest who offers the oblations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होत्री
होत्री The offerer of oblations, one of the eight forms of Śiva;<BR> या हविर्या च होत्री Ś. 1. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होत्रीय|होत्रीयं|होत्रीयः
होत्रीय^1 <i>a.</i> [होत्राय हितं होतुरिदं वा छ] Belonging to an oblation.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170209. note: Long 'i' by alph. order; meaning of hotriya and hotrIya similar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होत्रीयः|होत्रीय|होत्रीयं
होत्रीय + .{@-यः@} The priest who offers oblations to gods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होत्रीयम्
होत्रीय + .{@-यम्@} The sacrificial hall.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होत्वन्
होत्वन् A sacrificer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमः|होम
होमः [हु-मन्]<BR>—1 Offering oblations to gods by throwing ghee into the consecrated fire,<BR> (one of the five daily Yajñas, to be performed by a Brāhmaṇa, called<BR> देवयज्ञ q. v.); इष्टिर्यागः । स एवासेचनाधिको होमः ŚB. on MS. 6. 8. 7.<BR>—2 A burnt offering.<BR>—3 A sacrifice; R. 3. 38; Mb. 12. 165. 26.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: होमाग्निः, होमकर्मन्, होमकल्पः, होमकुण्डम्, होमतुरङ्गः, होमधानम्, होमधान्यम्, होमधूमः, होमधेनुः, होमभस्मन्, होमभाण्डम्, होमवेला, होमशाला<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमाग्निः|होमाग्नि
होमः + -अग्निः the sacrificial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमकर्मन्
होमः + -कर्मन् sacrificial act.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमकल्पः|होमकल्प
होमः + -कल्पः mode of sacrificing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमकुण्डम्
होमः + -कुण्डम् a hole in the ground for receiving the consecrated fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमतुरङ्गः|होमतुरङ्ग
होमः + -तुरङ्गः a sacrificial horse; नियुज्य तं होमतुरङ्गरक्षणे R. 3. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमधानम्
होमः + -धानम् a sacrificial chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमधान्यम्
होमः + -धान्यम्<BR>—1 sesamum.<BR>—2 barley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमधूमः|होमधूम
होमः + -धूमः the smoke of a burnt offering or sacrificial fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमधेनुः|होमधेनु
होमः + -धेनुः a cow yielding milk for an oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमभस्मन्
होमः + -भस्मन् <i>n.</i> the ashes of a burnt offering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमभाण्डम्
होमः + -भाण्डम् a sacrificial implement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमवेला
होमः + -वेला the time for offering oblations.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमशाला
होमः + -शाला a sacrificial hall or chamber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमकः|होमक
होमकः See होतृ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमिः|होमि
होमिः [हु-इन् मुट् च]<BR>—1 Clarified butter.<BR>—2 Water.<BR>—3 Fire.<BR>—4 The Chitraka tree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1766-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमिन्
होमिन् <i>m.</i> [होमोऽस्त्यस्य इनि] The offerer of an oblation, a<BR> sacrificer in general.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होमीय
होमीय, -होम्य <i>a.</i><BR> Belonging to or fit for an oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होम्य|होम्यं
होमीय, -होम्य <i>a.</i><BR> Belonging to or fit for an oblation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होम्यम्
होमीय, -होम्य + .{@-म्यम्@} (also हौम्यम्)<BR>—1 Ghee.<BR>—2 Anything for an oblation (होमद्रव्य); अग्नीनामव्ययं ह्येतद्धौम्यं<BR> वेदविदो विदुः । तस्माद्ददाति यो धेनुं स हौम्यं संप्रयच्छति ॥ Mb. 13. 66. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होरा
होरा [हु-रन्]<BR>—1 The rising of a zodiacal sign; होरासु गणितेष्वपि Śiva B. 10. 35.<BR>—2 Part of the duration of a sign.<BR>—3 An hour.<BR>—4 A mark, line.<BR>—5 Horoscope; horoscopy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होलकः|होलक
होलकः Chick-pea or pulse half parched in the pod (Mar. हुळा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होला
होला The Holi festival.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होलाकः|होलाक
होलाकः A kind of vapour-bath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होलाकम्
होलाकम् A religious act performed by those that hail from east India;<BR> ये प्राच्या इति (समाख्याताः) ते होलाकादीन् (करिष्यन्ति)<BR> ŚB. on MS. 1. 3. 19.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: होलाकाधिकरणन्यायः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होलाकाधिकरणन्यायः
होलाकम् + -अधिकरणन्यायः A rule of interpretation according to which in<BR> the absence of a श्रुति text supporting what is stated in स्मृतिs<BR> and कल्पसूत्रs, the existence of a general श्रुति text in its<BR> support may be assumed on the strength of inference. It is not, however,<BR> admissible to assume the existence of restricted श्रुति texts (<i>i. e.</i><BR> texts restricting a particular act to a particular class or land);<BR> सामान्यश्रुतिकल्पनायामस्ति प्रमाणं न विशेषश्रुतिकल्पनायाम् । This<BR> rule is discussed by जैमिनि and शबर at MS. 1. 3. 15-23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होलाका
होलाका<BR>—1 The spring-festival celebrated at the approach of the spring season,<BR> during the ten - but particularly three or four - days preceding the full-moon<BR> day in the month of Phālguna (commonly called <i>Holi</i>).<BR>—2 The full-moon day in the month of Phālguna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होलिका
होलिका, होली The festival called होलाका q. v. above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होली
होलिका, होली The festival called होलाका q. v. above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

होहौ
होहौ, हौ <i>ind.</i> A vocative particle (ho! holla!).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हौ
होहौ, हौ <i>ind.</i> A vocative particle (ho! holla!).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हौड्
हौड् €1 P. (हौडति)<BR>—1 To disregard, disrespect.<BR>—2 To go.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हौतभुजम्
हौतभुजम् The कृत्तिका constellation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हौतृक|हौतृकः
हौतृक <i>a.</i> Belonging to the Hotṛ priest, sacerdotal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हौत्रम्
हौत्रम् [होतुरिदम् अण्] The office of the priest called Hotṛ q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

हौम्यम्
हौम्यम् Clarified butter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्नु
ह्नु €2 Ā. (ह्नुते-ह्नुत)<BR>—1 To take away, rob, abstract, deprive (one) of; अध्यगीष्टार्थशास्त्राणि<BR> यमस्याह्नोष्ट विक्रमम् Bk. 15. 88.<BR>—2 To conceal, hide, withhold; Māl. 1.<BR>—3 To hide from any one (with dat.); गोपी कृष्णाय ह्नुते Sk.; P. I. 4. 34.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्नवः|ह्नव
ह्नवः, -वनम्<BR> Hiding, concealment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्नवनम्
ह्नवः, -वनम्<BR> Hiding, concealment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्नुतिः|ह्नुति
ह्नुतिः <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Abstraction, concealment.<BR>—2 Denial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्मल्
ह्मल् €1 P. (ह्मलति)<BR>—1 To go.<BR>—2 To shake, move.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्यस्
ह्यस् <i>ind.</i> [गते अहनि नि˚] Yesterday.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ह्योभव<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्योभव
ह्यस् + -भव <i>a.</i> what occurred yesterday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्यस्तन|ह्यस्तनं
ह्यस्तन <i>a.</i> (-नी <i>f.</i>)<BR> Belonging to yesterday; as in ह्यस्तनी वृत्तिः,<BR> ह्यस्तनेन च कोपेन शक्तिं वै प्राहिणोन्मयि Mb. 5. 184. 4.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ह्यस्तनदिनम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्यस्तनदिनम्
ह्यस्तन + -दिनम् yesterday, the previous day.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्यस्त्य|ह्यस्त्यः
ह्यस्त्य <i>a.</i> Belonging to yesterday, hesternal; P. IV. 2. 105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रग्
ह्रग् €1 P. (ह्रगति) To hide, cover, conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रणीया
ह्रणीया Censure, reproach, shame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रदः|ह्रद
ह्रदः [ह्राद्-अच् नि˚]<BR>—1 A deep lake, a large and deep pool of water; आपगा गरुडेनेव ह्रदादुद्धृतपन्नगा<BR> Rām. 2. 47. 17; Ki. 15. 17; ह्रदे गभीरे हृदि चावगाढे शंसन्ति कार्यावतरं<BR> हि सन्तः N. 3. 53.<BR>—2 A deep hole or cavity; नाभिह्रदैः परिगृहीतरयाणि निम्नैः Śi. 5. 29.<BR>—3 A ray of light.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ह्रदग्रहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रदग्रहः|ह्रदग्रह
ह्रदः + -ग्रहः a crocodile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रदिनी
ह्रदिनी<BR>—1 A river; सुशीततोयां विस्तीर्णां ह्रदिनीं वेतसैर्वृताम् Mb. 3. 64. 12;<BR> Bhāg. 2. 7. 28, 10. 21. 9.<BR>—2 A lightning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रद्रोगः|ह्रद्रोग
ह्रद्रोगः The sign <i>Aquarius</i> of the zodiac (derived from Greek).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रप्
ह्रप् €10 P. (ह्रापयति)<BR>—1 To speak.<BR>—2 To sound, creak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्
ह्रस् €1 P. (ह्रसति, ह्रसित)<BR>—1 To sound.<BR>—2 To become small or diminished or lessened, wane, disappear; चक्षुर्भ्राम्यति<BR> रूपमेव ह्रसते वक्त्रं च लालायते Pt. 4. 78. ━<i>Caus.</i> To shorten,<BR> lessen, diminish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रसित
ह्रसित <i>p. p.</i><BR>—1 Sounded.<BR>—2 Shortened, curtailed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रसिमन्
ह्रसिमन् <i>m.</i> Smallness, shortness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रसिष्ठ|ह्रसिष्ठः
ह्रसिष्ठ <i>a.</i> (Superl. of ह्रस्व) Shortest, smallest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रसीयस्
ह्रसीयस् <i>a.</i> (Compar. of ह्रस्व) Shorter, smaller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्व|ह्रस्वं|ह्रस्वः
ह्रस्व <i>a.</i> [ह्रस्-वन्] (compar. ह्रसीयस्; superl. ह्रसिष्ठ)<BR>—1 Short, small, little.<BR>—2 Dwarfish, low or short in stature.<BR>—3 Short (opp. to दीर्घ in prosody).<BR>—4 Minor, very young in age; जाता ह्रस्वा प्रजा प्रमीयते Mb. 3. 197. 13.<BR>—5 Unimportant, insignificant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वः|ह्रस्व|ह्रस्वं
ह्रस्व + .{@-स्वः@}<BR>—1 A dwarf.<BR>—2 A short vowel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वम्
ह्रस्व + .{@-स्वम्@} Green or black sulphate of iron.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ह्रस्वाग्निः, ह्रस्वाङ्ग, ह्रस्वगर्भः, ह्रस्वगवेधुका, ह्रस्वजात्य, ह्रस्वदर्भः, ह्रस्वकुशः, ह्रस्वदा, ह्रस्वनिर्वंशकः, ह्रस्वपर्णः, ह्रस्वफलः, ह्रस्वबाहुक, ह्रस्वमूर्ति, ह्रस्वमूलः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वाग्निः|ह्रस्वाग्नि
ह्रस्व + -अग्निः Calotropis Gigantea = wort (Arka).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वाङ्ग|ह्रस्वांग|ह्रस्वाङ्गः
