ह्रस्वदर्भः|ह्रस्वदर्भ
ह्रस्व + -दर्भः, -कुशः the short or white Kuśa grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वकुशः|ह्रस्वकुश
ह्रस्व + -दर्भः, -कुशः the short or white Kuśa grass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

