ह्रस्व + -निर्वंशकः a small sword.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वपर्णः|ह्रस्वपर्ण
