ह्रस्वमूलः|ह्रस्वमूल
ह्रस्व + -मूलः the short red cane.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रस्वक
ह्रस्वक <i>a.</i> See ह्रस्व.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रासः|ह्रास
ह्रासः [ह्रस्-घञ्]<BR>—1 Sound, noise.<BR>—2 Decrease, diminution, decline, deterioration, decay; अन्ये कलियुगे<BR> नॄणां युगह्नासानुरूपतः Ms. 1. 85; Y. 2. 249.<BR>—3 Small number.<BR>—4 Paucity, scarcity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रासक
