ह्रासनम्
ह्रासनम्<BR>—1 N. of the seventh <i>i. e.</i> the last stage of must of an elephant;<BR> Mātaṅga L. 9. 18.<BR>—2 Diminution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1767-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्राद्
ह्राद् €1 Ā. (ह्रादते)<BR>—1 To sound.<BR>—2 To roar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

