ह्रादिन्
ह्रादिन् <i>a.</i> Sounding, roaring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रादिनी
ह्रादिनी<BR>—1 The thunderbolt of Indra.<BR>—2 Lightning.<BR>—3 A river.<BR>—4 The tree called शल्लकी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रादुनिः|ह्रादुनि
ह्रादुनिः, -नी<BR> Hail; ह्रादुनयो विस्फुलिङ्गाः Bṛ. Up. 6. 2. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रादुनी
ह्रादुनिः, -नी<BR> Hail; ह्रादुनयो विस्फुलिङ्गाः Bṛ. Up. 6. 2. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्राम्
ह्राम्, ह्रीम्, ह्रूम् &c. An exclamation of sacred mantras; ॐ<BR> ह्रां ह्रीं ह्रूम् ॐ नमो भगवते हृषीकेशाय Bhāg. 5. 18. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीम्
ह्राम्, ह्रीम्, ह्रूम् &c. An exclamation of sacred mantras; ॐ<BR> ह्रां ह्रीं ह्रूम् ॐ नमो भगवते हृषीकेशाय Bhāg. 5. 18. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रूम्
ह्राम्, ह्रीम्, ह्रूम् &c. An exclamation of sacred mantras; ॐ<BR> ह्रां ह्रीं ह्रूम् ॐ नमो भगवते हृषीकेशाय Bhāg. 5. 18. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

