ह्रिणीया
ह्रिणीया<BR>—1 Reproach, censure.<BR>—2 Shame, bashfulness.<BR>—3 Pity; cf. ह्रणीया.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्री
ह्री €3 P. (जिह्रेति, ह्रीण-ह्रीत)<BR>—1 To blush, be modest.<BR>—2 To be ashamed (used by itself or with abl. or gen.); जिह्रेम्यार्यपुत्रेण<BR> सह गुरुसमीपं गन्तुम् Ś. 7. 6; अन्योन्यस्यापि जिह्रीमः किं पुनः<BR> सहवासिनाम् Ki. 11. 58; R. 15. 44, 17. 73; Bk. 3. 53, 5. 102, 6. 132.<BR>━<i>Caus.</i> (ह्रेपयति-ते) To put to shame (fig. also); cause to<BR> blush, make ashamed; सकौस्तुभं ह्रेपयतीव कृष्णम् R. 6. 49; ह्रेपिता<BR> हि बहवो नरेश्वराः 11. 40; किं वा जात्या स्वामिनो ह्रेपयन्ति Śi. 18. 23;<BR> Ki. 11. 64, 13. 41; Ve. 1. 17.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्री
ह्री <i>f.</i><BR>—1 Shame; रतेरपि ह्रीपदमादधाना Ku. 3. 57; दारिद्र्याद् ह्रियमेति<BR> ह्रीपरिगतः प्रभ्रश्यते तेजसः Mk. 1. 14; R. 4. 80.<BR>—2 Bashfulness, modesty; ह्रीसन्नकण्ठी कथमप्युवाच Ku. 7. 85.<BR>.━{@Comp.@}: ह्रीजित, ह्रीमूढ, ह्रीधारिन्, ह्रीनिरासः, ह्रीनिषेव, ह्रीपदम्, ह्रीबल, ह्रीयन्त्रणा<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीजित|ह्रीजितः
ह्री + -जित, -मूढ <i>a.</i> overcome or confounded by shame; ह्रीमूढानां<BR> भवति विफलप्रेरणा चूर्णमुष्टिः Me. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीमूढ
ह्री + -जित, -मूढ <i>a.</i> overcome or confounded by shame; ह्रीमूढानां<BR> भवति विफलप्रेरणा चूर्णमुष्टिः Me. 68.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीधारिन्
ह्री + -धारिन् <i>a.</i> bashful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीनिरासः|ह्रीनिरास
ह्री + -निरासः shamelessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीनिषेव
ह्री + -निषेव <i>a.</i> modest, shy; जाताः कुले ह्यनृशंसा वदान्या ह्रीनिषेवाः<BR> कर्मणा निश्चयज्ञाः Mb. 5. 25. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीपदम्
ह्री + -पदम् cause of shame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीबल
ह्री + -बल <i>a.</i> extremely modest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीयन्त्रणा|ह्रीयंत्रणा
ह्री + -यन्त्रणा the constraint of bashfulness; ह्रीयन्त्रणामानशिरे<BR> मनोज्ञाम् R. 7. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीका
ह्रीका [ह्री-कक्]<BR>—1 Bashfulness, coyness, shyness.<BR>—2 Timidity, fear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्रीकः|ह्रीक
ह्रीका + .{@-कः@}<BR>—1 A father; Uṇ. 3. 47.<BR>—2 A mongoose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

