ह्लादिनी See ह्रादिनी.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लीक
ह्लीक, ह्लीकु See ह्रीक, ह्रीकु; [Uṇ. 3. 47] (ह्रीकः<BR> = लज्जावान्); Uṇ. 3. 86; (ह्रीकुः ह्लीकुश्च लज्जावान्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लीकु|ह्लीकुः
ह्लीक, ह्लीकु See ह्रीक, ह्रीकु; [Uṇ. 3. 47] (ह्रीकः<BR> = लज्जावान्); Uṇ. 3. 86; (ह्रीकुः ह्लीकुश्च लज्जावान्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्लेषा
ह्लेषा See ह्रेषा.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वल्
ह्वल् €1 P. (ह्वलति)<BR>—1 To go, move.<BR>—2 To shake, tremble.<BR>—3 To go astray, stumble. ━<i>Caus.</i> (ह्व(ह्वा)लयति-ते but ह्वलयति<BR> only with prepositions) To shake, move, cause to tremble; स छिन्नबाहुरपतद्<BR> विह्वलो ह्वलयन् भुवम् Bk. 6. 45; (especially with वि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वला
ह्वला Going astray, failure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वालः|ह्वाल
ह्वालः Failure, cessation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वृ
ह्वृ €1 P. (ह्वरति)<BR>—1 To be crooked.<BR>—2 To be crooked in conduct, cheat, deceive.<BR>—3 To be afflicted or injured.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वरस्
ह्वरस् <i>n.</i> pl. Crookedness, deceit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वार्यः|ह्वार्य
ह्वार्यः<BR>—1 A serpent.<BR>—2 A horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वे
ह्वे €1 U. (ह्वयति-ते, जुहाव, जुहुवे, अह्वत्-त, अह्वास्त, ह्वास्यति-ते,<BR> ह्वातुम्, हूत; <i>Pass.</i> हूयते; <i>caus.</i> ह्वाययति-ते;<BR> <i>desid.</i> जुहूषति-ते)<BR>—1 To call by name; तां पार्वतीत्याभिजनेन नाम्ना बन्धुप्रियां बन्धुजनो<BR> जुहाव Ku. 1. 26.<BR>—2 To call out, invoke, call upon.<BR>—3 To call, name.<BR>—4 To challenge.<BR>—5 To vie with, emulate.<BR>—6 To ask, beg.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वा
ह्वा A name, appellation. [Saubhariʼs Dvyākṣaranāmāmalā gives<BR> other meanings:− ह्वा जिह्वा तरुणी सरित् 42.]<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वातव्य
ह्वातव्य <i>a.</i> To be called.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वानम्
ह्वानम्<BR>—1 Calling.<BR>—2 A cry, sound.<BR>—3 A challenge (for fight); सुग्रीवोऽप्पनदद्घोरं वालिनो ह्वानकारणात्<BR> Rām. 4. 12. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ह्वायक
ह्वायक <i>a.</i> Calling, summoning, challenging, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AP&page=1768-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ap" target="_blank">Correction</a>

